  ('6aadc6e593d811290fd4a426', '2026-09-18T23:19:01.716Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:01.716Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 5, 29, 'Dia nataony hoe Noa ny anarany, satria hoy izy: “Izy no hanamaivana antsika. Miasa mafy mantsy isika ka reraka be ny tanantsika satria nozonin’i Jehovah ny tany.”', 'dia nataony hoe noa ny anarany, satria hoy izy: “izy no hanamaivana antsika. miasa mafy mantsy isika ka reraka be ny tanantsika satria nozonin’i jehovah ny tany.”'),
