  ('6aadc6e61119775976d237e3', '2026-09-18T23:19:02.922Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:02.922Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 6, 5, 'Ary hitan’i Jehovah fa be dia be ny zava-dratsy nataon’ny olona teto an-tany, sady ratsy foana ny zavatra noeritreretiny sy nirin’ny fony.', 'ary hitan’i jehovah fa be dia be ny zava-dratsy nataon’ny olona teto an-tany, sady ratsy foana ny zavatra noeritreretiny sy nirin’ny fony.'),
  ('6aadc6e61119775976d237ea', '2026-09-18T23:19:02.922Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:02.922Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 6, 12, 'Rehefa nojeren’Andriamanitra ny tany, dia hitany fa simba. Nanao ratsy mantsy ny olona rehetra teto an-tany.', 'rehefa nojeren’andriamanitra ny tany, dia hitany fa simba. nanao ratsy mantsy ny olona rehetra teto an-tany.'),
  ('6aadc6e61119775976d237f3', '2026-09-18T23:19:02.922Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:02.922Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 6, 21, 'Ary angony ny karazan-tsakafo rehetra, mba hataonao sakafo sy sakafon’ireo biby ireo.”', 'ary angony ny karazan-tsakafo rehetra, mba hataonao sakafo sy sakafon’ireo biby ireo.”'),
  ('6aadc6e61119775976d237f0', '2026-09-18T23:19:02.922Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:02.922Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 6, 18, 'Ary manao fifanekena aminao aho, ka midira ao anatin’ny sambofiara ianao sy ireo zanakao lahy sy ny vadinao ary ireo vadin’ny zanakao.', 'ary manao fifanekena aminao aho, ka midira ao anatin’ny sambofiara ianao sy ireo zanakao lahy sy ny vadinao ary ireo vadin’ny zanakao.'),
  ('6aadc6e61119775976d237ee', '2026-09-18T23:19:02.922Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:02.922Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 6, 16, 'Asio varavarankely hidiran’ny hazavana ilay sambofiara, eo amin’ny iray hakiho eo ambanin’ny tampony, dia ataovy eo amin’ny ilany iray ny fidirana. Asio rihana ilay sambofiara, izany hoe misy farany ambany sy rihana voalohany ary rihana faharoa.', 'asio varavarankely hidiran’ny hazavana ilay sambofiara, eo amin’ny iray hakiho eo ambanin’ny tampony, dia ataovy eo amin’ny ilany iray ny fidirana. asio rihana ilay sambofiara, izany hoe misy farany ambany sy rihana voalohany ary rihana faharoa.'),
  ('6aadc6e61119775976d237ed', '2026-09-18T23:19:02.922Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:02.922Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 6, 15, 'Hoatr’izao no hanaovanao an’ilay sambofiara: Tokony ho 300 hakiho ny lavany, 50 hakiho ny sakany, ary 30 hakiho ny haavony.', 'hoatr’izao no hanaovanao an’ilay sambofiara: tokony ho 300 hakiho ny lavany, 50 hakiho ny sakany, ary 30 hakiho ny haavony.'),
  ('6aadc6e61119775976d237e6', '2026-09-18T23:19:02.922Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:02.922Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 6, 8, 'I Noa anefa nankasitrahan’i Jehovah.', 'i noa anefa nankasitrahan’i jehovah.'),
  ('6aadc6e61119775976d237e8', '2026-09-18T23:19:02.922Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:02.922Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 6, 10, 'Niteraka telo mirahalahy i Noa tatỳ aoriana, dia i Sema sy Hama ary Jafeta.', 'niteraka telo mirahalahy i noa tatỳ aoriana, dia i sema sy hama ary jafeta.'),
  ('6aadc6e61119775976d237f1', '2026-09-18T23:19:02.922Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:02.922Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 6, 19, 'Akao roa avy ny karazan-javamananaina rehetra, dia ampidiro ao anatin’ny sambofiara, mba ho voaro miaraka aminao. Lahy sy vavy no halainao.', 'akao roa avy ny karazan-javamananaina rehetra, dia ampidiro ao anatin’ny sambofiara, mba ho voaro miaraka aminao. lahy sy vavy no halainao.'),
  ('6aadc6e61119775976d237f4', '2026-09-18T23:19:02.922Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:02.922Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 6, 22, 'Dia nanaraka ny didy rehetra nomen’Andriamanitra azy i Noa. Izany mihitsy no nataony.', 'dia nanaraka ny didy rehetra nomen’andriamanitra azy i noa. izany mihitsy no nataony.'),
  ('6aadc6e61119775976d237e5', '2026-09-18T23:19:02.922Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:02.922Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 6, 7, 'Hoy àry i Jehovah: “Haringako tsy hisy eny ambonin’ny tany ny olona noforoniko. Haringako miaraka amin’ny biby fiompy sy ny biby mandady ary ny biby manidina eny amin’ny lanitra ny olona. Fa manenina aho nanao an’ireo.”', 'hoy àry i jehovah: “haringako tsy hisy eny ambonin’ny tany ny olona noforoniko. haringako miaraka amin’ny biby fiompy sy ny biby mandady ary ny biby manidina eny amin’ny lanitra ny olona. fa manenina aho nanao an’ireo.”'),
  ('6aadc6e61119775976d237df', '2026-09-18T23:19:02.922Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:02.922Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 6, 1, 'Rehefa nanomboka nihamaro ny olombelona teto ambonin’ny tany ka niteraka zazavavy,', 'rehefa nanomboka nihamaro ny olombelona teto ambonin’ny tany ka niteraka zazavavy,'),
  ('6aadc6e61119775976d237ef', '2026-09-18T23:19:02.922Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:02.922Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 6, 17, '“Ary hampisy safodrano eny ambonin’ny tany aho, ka handringana ny nofo rehetra manam-pofonaina eny ambanin’ny lanitra. Dia ho faty ny zava-drehetra eny ambonin’ny tany.', '“ary hampisy safodrano eny ambonin’ny tany aho, ka handringana ny nofo rehetra manam-pofonaina eny ambanin’ny lanitra. dia ho faty ny zava-drehetra eny ambonin’ny tany.'),
  ('6aadc6e61119775976d237e7', '2026-09-18T23:19:02.922Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:02.922Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 6, 9, 'Ary izao no tantaran’i Noa: Olo-marina i Noa. Tsy nisy tsiny izy, tsy mba hoatran’ny mpiara-belona taminy. Niara-nandeha tamin’Andriamanitra izy.', 'ary izao no tantaran’i noa: olo-marina i noa. tsy nisy tsiny izy, tsy mba hoatran’ny mpiara-belona taminy. niara-nandeha tamin’andriamanitra izy.'),
  ('6aadc6e61119775976d237e1', '2026-09-18T23:19:02.922Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:02.922Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 6, 3, 'Ary hoy i Jehovah: “Tsy handefitra tsy misy farany amin’ny olona aho, satria nofo ihany izy. Dia mbola ho velona 120 taona izy.”', 'ary hoy i jehovah: “tsy handefitra tsy misy farany amin’ny olona aho, satria nofo ihany izy. dia mbola ho velona 120 taona izy.”'),
  ('6aadc6e61119775976d237f2', '2026-09-18T23:19:02.922Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:02.922Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 6, 20, 'Amin’ny biby manidina araka ny karazany avy, sy ny biby fiompy araka ny karazany avy, ary ny biby mandady rehetra amin’ny tany araka ny karazany avy, dia roa avy no hiditra ao mba ho voaro miaraka aminao.', 'amin’ny biby manidina araka ny karazany avy, sy ny biby fiompy araka ny karazany avy, ary ny biby mandady rehetra amin’ny tany araka ny karazany avy, dia roa avy no hiditra ao mba ho voaro miaraka aminao.'),
  ('6aadc6e61119775976d237ec', '2026-09-18T23:19:02.922Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:02.922Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 6, 14, 'Manaova àry sambofiara amin’ny hazo misy ditiny, ka asio efitrefitra ao anatiny. Ary hosory godorao ny anatiny sy ivelany.', 'manaova àry sambofiara amin’ny hazo misy ditiny, ka asio efitrefitra ao anatiny. ary hosory godorao ny anatiny sy ivelany.'),
  ('6aadc6e61119775976d237e4', '2026-09-18T23:19:02.922Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:02.922Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 6, 6, 'Dia nanenina i Jehovah nanao ny olona teto ambonin’ny tany, ka nalahelo ny fony.', 'dia nanenina i jehovah nanao ny olona teto ambonin’ny tany, ka nalahelo ny fony.'),
  ('6aadc6e61119775976d237eb', '2026-09-18T23:19:02.922Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:02.922Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 6, 13, 'Dia hoy Andriamanitra tamin’i Noa: “Tapa-kevitra aho fa handringana ny nofo rehetra, satria feno herisetra ny tany. Dia haringako izy ireo, ary hosimbako koa ny tany.', 'dia hoy andriamanitra tamin’i noa: “tapa-kevitra aho fa handringana ny nofo rehetra, satria feno herisetra ny tany. dia haringako izy ireo, ary hosimbako koa ny tany.'),
  ('6aadc6e61119775976d237e0', '2026-09-18T23:19:02.922Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:02.922Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 6, 2, 'dia voamarik’ireo zanak’Andriamanitra fa tsara tarehy ny zanakavavin’ny olombelona. Nalain’izy ireo ho vady àry izay rehetra nofidiny.', 'dia voamarik’ireo zanak’andriamanitra fa tsara tarehy ny zanakavavin’ny olombelona. nalain’izy ireo ho vady àry izay rehetra nofidiny.'),
  ('6aadc6e61119775976d237e9', '2026-09-18T23:19:02.922Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:02.922Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 6, 11, 'Lasa simba anefa ny tany teo imason’Andriamanitra, sady feno herisetra.', 'lasa simba anefa ny tany teo imason’andriamanitra, sady feno herisetra.'),
  ('6aadc6e61119775976d237e2', '2026-09-18T23:19:02.922Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:02.922Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 6, 4, 'Nisy Nefilima teto an-tany tamin’izany andro izany sy taorian’izany. Nandritra an’izany fotoana izany, dia nanao firaisana tamin’ny zanakavavin’ny olombelona ireo zanak’Andriamanitra. Dia niteraka zazalahy tamin’izy ireo ny zanakavavin’ny olombelona. Ireny zanany ireny no olona natanjaka sy nalaza tamin’ny andro fahiny.', 'nisy nefilima teto an-tany tamin’izany andro izany sy taorian’izany. nandritra an’izany fotoana izany, dia nanao firaisana tamin’ny zanakavavin’ny olombelona ireo zanak’andriamanitra. dia niteraka zazalahy tamin’izy ireo ny zanakavavin’ny olombelona. ireny zanany ireny no olona natanjaka sy nalaza tamin’ny andro fahiny.'),
  ('6aadc6e79fa6fb312004e159', '2026-09-18T23:19:03.298Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:03.298Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 7, 22, 'Maty daholo izay nanam-pofonaina, dia izay rehetra teo amin’ny tany maina.', 'maty daholo izay nanam-pofonaina, dia izay rehetra teo amin’ny tany maina.'),
  ('6aadc6e79fa6fb312004e158', '2026-09-18T23:19:03.298Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:03.298Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 7, 21, 'Koa maty ny zavamananaina rehetra nihetsiketsika teto ambonin’ny tany: Ny biby manidina, ny biby fiompy, ny bibidia, ny zavamananaina hafa mifanaretsaka, ary ny olombelona rehetra.', 'koa maty ny zavamananaina rehetra nihetsiketsika teto ambonin’ny tany: ny biby manidina, ny biby fiompy, ny bibidia, ny zavamananaina hafa mifanaretsaka, ary ny olombelona rehetra.'),
  ('6aadc6e79fa6fb312004e147', '2026-09-18T23:19:03.298Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:03.298Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 7, 4, 'Fa fito andro sisa dia hampilatsaka orana eny ambonin’ny tany aho, mandritra ny 40 andro sy 40 alina. Ary haringako tsy hisy eny ambonin’ny tany ny zavamananaina rehetra nataoko.”', 'fa fito andro sisa dia hampilatsaka orana eny ambonin’ny tany aho, mandritra ny 40 andro sy 40 alina. ary haringako tsy hisy eny ambonin’ny tany ny zavamananaina rehetra nataoko.”'),
  ('6aadc6e79fa6fb312004e149', '2026-09-18T23:19:03.298Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:03.298Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 7, 6, 'Ary 600 taona i Noa rehefa nisy safodrano teto ambonin’ny tany.', 'ary 600 taona i noa rehefa nisy safodrano teto ambonin’ny tany.'),
  ('6aadc6e79fa6fb312004e148', '2026-09-18T23:19:03.298Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:03.298Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 7, 5, 'Dia nataon’i Noa izay rehetra nandidian’i Jehovah azy.', 'dia nataon’i noa izay rehetra nandidian’i jehovah azy.'),
  ('6aadc6e79fa6fb312004e145', '2026-09-18T23:19:03.298Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:03.298Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 7, 2, 'Akao fito avy ny karazam-biby madio rehetra, dia lahy sy vavy, ary ento miditra miaraka aminao. Fa amin’ny biby tsy madio rehetra kosa, dia roa avy fotsiny no halainao, izany hoe lahy sy vavy.', 'akao fito avy ny karazam-biby madio rehetra, dia lahy sy vavy, ary ento miditra miaraka aminao. fa amin’ny biby tsy madio rehetra kosa, dia roa avy fotsiny no halainao, izany hoe lahy sy vavy.'),
  ('6aadc6e79fa6fb312004e15a', '2026-09-18T23:19:03.298Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:03.298Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 7, 23, 'Naringan’Andriamanitra tsy hisy tetỳ ambonin’ny tany ny zavamananaina rehetra, anisan’izany ny olona, ny biby, ny biby mandady, ary ny biby manidina teny amin’ny lanitra. Ringana tsy nisy teto ambonin’ny tany daholo ireny, fa i Noa sy izay niaraka taminy tao anatin’ny sambofiara ihany sisa no velona.', 'naringan’andriamanitra tsy hisy tetỳ ambonin’ny tany ny zavamananaina rehetra, anisan’izany ny olona, ny biby, ny biby mandady, ary ny biby manidina teny amin’ny lanitra. ringana tsy nisy teto ambonin’ny tany daholo ireny, fa i noa sy izay niaraka taminy tao anatin’ny sambofiara ihany sisa no velona.'),
  ('6aadc6e79fa6fb312004e157', '2026-09-18T23:19:03.298Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:03.298Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 7, 20, 'Dia niakatra 15 hakiho nihoatra ny tendrombohitra ny rano.', 'dia niakatra 15 hakiho nihoatra ny tendrombohitra ny rano.'),
  ('6aadc6e79fa6fb312004e156', '2026-09-18T23:19:03.298Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:03.298Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 7, 19, 'Ary difotry ny rano ny tany, ka sarona tao koa ny tendrombohitra avo rehetra teny ambanin’ny lanitra manontolo.', 'ary difotry ny rano ny tany, ka sarona tao koa ny tendrombohitra avo rehetra teny ambanin’ny lanitra manontolo.'),
  ('6aadc6e79fa6fb312004e153', '2026-09-18T23:19:03.298Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:03.298Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 7, 16, 'Dia niditra ny karazana biby rehetra, dia lahy sy vavy, araka ny didy nomen’Andriamanitra an’i Noa. Avy eo dia nohidian’i Jehovah ny varavarana.', 'dia niditra ny karazana biby rehetra, dia lahy sy vavy, araka ny didy nomen’andriamanitra an’i noa. avy eo dia nohidian’i jehovah ny varavarana.'),
  ('6aadc6e79fa6fb312004e151', '2026-09-18T23:19:03.298Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:03.298Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 7, 14, 'Niditra tao anatin’ny sambofiara izy ireo sy ny bibidia rehetra araka ny karazany avy, ny biby fiompy rehetra araka ny karazany avy, ny biby mandady rehetra etỳ ambonin’ny tany araka ny karazany avy, ary ny biby manidina rehetra araka ny karazany avy, izany hoe ny vorona rehetra sy izay rehetra manana elatra.', 'niditra tao anatin’ny sambofiara izy ireo sy ny bibidia rehetra araka ny karazany avy, ny biby fiompy rehetra araka ny karazany avy, ny biby mandady rehetra etỳ ambonin’ny tany araka ny karazany avy, ary ny biby manidina rehetra araka ny karazany avy, izany hoe ny vorona rehetra sy izay rehetra manana elatra.'),
  ('6aadc6e79fa6fb312004e14a', '2026-09-18T23:19:03.298Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:03.298Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 7, 7, 'Dia niditra tao anatin’ilay sambofiara i Noa sy ny vady aman-janany ary ireo vadin’ny zanany lahy, talohan’ny safodrano.', 'dia niditra tao anatin’ilay sambofiara i noa sy ny vady aman-janany ary ireo vadin’ny zanany lahy, talohan’ny safodrano.'),
  ('6aadc6e79fa6fb312004e14b', '2026-09-18T23:19:03.298Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:03.298Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 7, 8, 'Nisy tamin’ny biby madio sy ny biby tsy madio sy ny biby manidina ary izay rehetra mifamezivezy eny ambonin’ny tany koa niditra tao anatin’ilay sambofiara.', 'nisy tamin’ny biby madio sy ny biby tsy madio sy ny biby manidina ary izay rehetra mifamezivezy eny ambonin’ny tany koa niditra tao anatin’ilay sambofiara.'),
  ('6aadc6e79fa6fb312004e146', '2026-09-18T23:19:03.298Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:03.298Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 7, 3, 'Akao fito avy koa ny biby manidina eny amin’ny lanitra, dia lahy sy vavy, mba tsy ho lany taranaka eny ambonin’ny tany manontolo ireny.', 'akao fito avy koa ny biby manidina eny amin’ny lanitra, dia lahy sy vavy, mba tsy ho lany taranaka eny ambonin’ny tany manontolo ireny.'),
  ('6aadc6e79fa6fb312004e15b', '2026-09-18T23:19:03.298Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:03.298Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 7, 24, 'Ary mbola nahery be ny rano teto ambonin’ny tany, nandritra ny 150 andro.', 'ary mbola nahery be ny rano teto ambonin’ny tany, nandritra ny 150 andro.'),
  ('6aadc6e79fa6fb312004e14d', '2026-09-18T23:19:03.298Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:03.298Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 7, 10, 'Fito andro taorian’izay, dia tonga teto ambonin’ny tany ny safodrano.', 'fito andro taorian’izay, dia tonga teto ambonin’ny tany ny safodrano.'),
  ('6aadc6e79fa6fb312004e14f', '2026-09-18T23:19:03.298Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:03.298Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 7, 12, 'Dia avy be ny orana teto ambonin’ny tany nandritra ny 40 andro sy 40 alina.', 'dia avy be ny orana teto ambonin’ny tany nandritra ny 40 andro sy 40 alina.'),
  ('6aadc6e79fa6fb312004e155', '2026-09-18T23:19:03.298Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:03.298Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 7, 18, 'Nahery be ny rano sady nisondrotra be foana teto ambonin’ny tany, fa ilay sambofiara kosa nitsinkafona teny ambonin’ny rano.', 'nahery be ny rano sady nisondrotra be foana teto ambonin’ny tany, fa ilay sambofiara kosa nitsinkafona teny ambonin’ny rano.'),
  ('6aadc6e79fa6fb312004e154', '2026-09-18T23:19:03.298Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:03.298Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 7, 17, 'Ary avy be nandritra ny 40 andro teto ambonin’ny tany ny orana. Dia niakatra foana ny rano ka nanainga an’ilay sambofiara. Ary nitsinkafona ambony be niala tamin’ny tany ilay sambofiara.', 'ary avy be nandritra ny 40 andro teto ambonin’ny tany ny orana. dia niakatra foana ny rano ka nanainga an’ilay sambofiara. ary nitsinkafona ambony be niala tamin’ny tany ilay sambofiara.'),
  ('6aadc6e79fa6fb312004e152', '2026-09-18T23:19:03.298Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:03.298Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 7, 15, 'Niditra tsiroaroa nankao amin’i Noa tao anatin’ny sambofiara ny karazana biby manam-pofonaina rehetra.', 'niditra tsiroaroa nankao amin’i noa tao anatin’ny sambofiara ny karazana biby manam-pofonaina rehetra.'),
  ('6aadc6e79fa6fb312004e14e', '2026-09-18T23:19:03.298Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:03.298Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 7, 11, 'Tamin’ny andro faha-17 amin’ny volana faharoa, rehefa 600 taona i Noa, dia vaky ny loharano rehetra teny ambony, tamin’io andro io, ary nisokatra ny vavahadin-dranon’ny lanitra.', 'tamin’ny andro faha-17 amin’ny volana faharoa, rehefa 600 taona i noa, dia vaky ny loharano rehetra teny ambony, tamin’io andro io, ary nisokatra ny vavahadin-dranon’ny lanitra.'),
  ('6aadc6e79fa6fb312004e14c', '2026-09-18T23:19:03.298Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:03.298Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 7, 9, 'Niditra tsiroaroa, izany hoe lahy sy vavy, tao anatin’ny sambofiara niaraka tamin’i Noa ireny, araka ny didy nomen’Andriamanitra azy.', 'niditra tsiroaroa, izany hoe lahy sy vavy, tao anatin’ny sambofiara niaraka tamin’i noa ireny, araka ny didy nomen’andriamanitra azy.'),
  ('6aadc6e79fa6fb312004e150', '2026-09-18T23:19:03.298Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:03.298Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 7, 13, 'Ary niditra tao anatin’ny sambofiara i Noa tamin’io andro io, niaraka tamin’i Sema sy Hama ary Jafeta zanany lahy. Niaraka taminy koa ny vadiny sy izy telo vavy vadin’ny zanany.', 'ary niditra tao anatin’ny sambofiara i noa tamin’io andro io, niaraka tamin’i sema sy hama ary jafeta zanany lahy. niaraka taminy koa ny vadiny sy izy telo vavy vadin’ny zanany.'),
  ('6aadc6e79fa6fb312004e144', '2026-09-18T23:19:03.298Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:03.298Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 7, 1, 'Taorian’izany, dia hoy i Jehovah tamin’i Noa: “Midira ao anatin’ny sambofiara ianao sy ny ankohonanao manontolo. Amin’izao taranaka misy anao izao mantsy, dia ianao no hitako hoe olo-marina.', 'taorian’izany, dia hoy i jehovah tamin’i noa: “midira ao anatin’ny sambofiara ianao sy ny ankohonanao manontolo. amin’izao taranaka misy anao izao mantsy, dia ianao no hitako hoe olo-marina.'),
  ('6aadc6e7b7eb0bb5096f5560', '2026-09-18T23:19:03.681Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:03.681Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 8, 10, 'Mbola niandry fito andro indray izy vao namoaka an’ilay voromailala avy tao amin’ny sambofiara.', 'mbola niandry fito andro indray izy vao namoaka an’ilay voromailala avy tao amin’ny sambofiara.'),
  ('6aadc6e7b7eb0bb5096f5558', '2026-09-18T23:19:03.681Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:03.681Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 8, 2, 'Dia tampina ny loharano rehetra teny ambony sy ny vavahadin-dranon’ny lanitra, ka nitsahatra ilay orana avy any an-danitra.', 'dia tampina ny loharano rehetra teny ambony sy ny vavahadin-dranon’ny lanitra, ka nitsahatra ilay orana avy any an-danitra.'),
  ('6aadc6e7b7eb0bb5096f5565', '2026-09-18T23:19:03.681Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:03.681Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 8, 15, 'Dia hoy Andriamanitra tamin’i Noa:', 'dia hoy andriamanitra tamin’i noa:'),
  ('6aadc6e7b7eb0bb5096f555d', '2026-09-18T23:19:03.681Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:03.681Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 8, 7, 'dia namoaka goaika izy. Nanidina teny ivelany ilay goaika dia niverina, ary toy izany foana mandra-pahamainan’ny rano teto ambonin’ny tany.', 'dia namoaka goaika izy. nanidina teny ivelany ilay goaika dia niverina, ary toy izany foana mandra-pahamainan’ny rano teto ambonin’ny tany.'),
  ('6aadc6e7b7eb0bb5096f555b', '2026-09-18T23:19:03.681Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:03.681Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 8, 5, 'Ary mbola nihena tsikelikely ihany ny rano hatramin’ny volana fahafolo. Dia niseho ny tampon’ny tendrombohitra, tamin’ny andro voalohan’ny volana fahafolo.', 'ary mbola nihena tsikelikely ihany ny rano hatramin’ny volana fahafolo. dia niseho ny tampon’ny tendrombohitra, tamin’ny andro voalohan’ny volana fahafolo.'),
  ('6aadc6e7b7eb0bb5096f5557', '2026-09-18T23:19:03.681Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:03.681Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 8, 1, 'Tsy hadinon’Andriamanitra anefa i Noa sy ny bibidia rehetra ary ny biby fiompy rehetra niaraka taminy tao anatin’ny sambofiara. Dia nasian’Andriamanitra rivotra nitsoka teto ambonin’ny tany, ka nanomboka nihena ny rano.', 'tsy hadinon’andriamanitra anefa i noa sy ny bibidia rehetra ary ny biby fiompy rehetra niaraka taminy tao anatin’ny sambofiara. dia nasian’andriamanitra rivotra nitsoka teto ambonin’ny tany, ka nanomboka nihena ny rano.'),
  ('6aadc6e7b7eb0bb5096f5559', '2026-09-18T23:19:03.681Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:03.681Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 8, 3, 'Ary nihanidina ny rano teto ambonin’ny tany. Efa nihena ny rano rehefa afaka 150 andro.', 'ary nihanidina ny rano teto ambonin’ny tany. efa nihena ny rano rehefa afaka 150 andro.'),
  ('6aadc6e7b7eb0bb5096f555f', '2026-09-18T23:19:03.681Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:03.681Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 8, 9, 'Tsy nahita toerana hipetrahana anefa ilay voromailala, ka niverina nankao amin’i Noa tao anatin’ny sambofiara, satria mbola difotry ny rano ny tany manontolo. Dia navoakan’i Noa ny tanany, dia nalainy ilay voromailala ka nampidiriny tao anatin’ny sambofiara.', 'tsy nahita toerana hipetrahana anefa ilay voromailala, ka niverina nankao amin’i noa tao anatin’ny sambofiara, satria mbola difotry ny rano ny tany manontolo. dia navoakan’i noa ny tanany, dia nalainy ilay voromailala ka nampidiriny tao anatin’ny sambofiara.'),
  ('6aadc6e7b7eb0bb5096f555e', '2026-09-18T23:19:03.681Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:03.681Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 8, 8, 'Tatỳ aoriana dia namoaka voromailala izy, mba hahitana raha efa nihena ny rano teto ambonin’ny tany na tsia.', 'tatỳ aoriana dia namoaka voromailala izy, mba hahitana raha efa nihena ny rano teto ambonin’ny tany na tsia.'),
  ('6aadc6e7b7eb0bb5096f5561', '2026-09-18T23:19:03.681Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:03.681Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 8, 11, 'Ary tonga teo aminy ilay voromailala rehefa harivariva. Hitan’i Noa hoe io fa nisy ravin’oliva mbola maitso teny am-bavany! Dia fantatr’i Noa fa efa nihena ny rano teto ambonin’ny tany.', 'ary tonga teo aminy ilay voromailala rehefa harivariva. hitan’i noa hoe io fa nisy ravin’oliva mbola maitso teny am-bavany! dia fantatr’i noa fa efa nihena ny rano teto ambonin’ny tany.'),
  ('6aadc6e7b7eb0bb5096f5563', '2026-09-18T23:19:03.681Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:03.681Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 8, 13, 'Tamin’ny andro voalohan’ny volana voalohany, tamin’ny taona faha-601, dia ritra ny rano teto ambonin’ny tany. Dia nesorin’i Noa ny saron’ny sambofiara, ka hitany fa efa nihamaina ny tany.', 'tamin’ny andro voalohan’ny volana voalohany, tamin’ny taona faha-601, dia ritra ny rano teto ambonin’ny tany. dia nesorin’i noa ny saron’ny sambofiara, ka hitany fa efa nihamaina ny tany.'),
  ('6aadc6e7b7eb0bb5096f5564', '2026-09-18T23:19:03.681Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:03.681Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 8, 14, 'Ary efa maina tanteraka ny tany tamin’ny andro faha-27 amin’ny volana faharoa.', 'ary efa maina tanteraka ny tany tamin’ny andro faha-27 amin’ny volana faharoa.'),
  ('6aadc6e7b7eb0bb5096f5562', '2026-09-18T23:19:03.681Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:03.681Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 8, 12, 'Ary mbola niandry fito andro indray izy, dia navoakany ilay voromailala, nefa tsy niverina teo aminy intsony.', 'ary mbola niandry fito andro indray izy, dia navoakany ilay voromailala, nefa tsy niverina teo aminy intsony.'),
  ('6aadc6e7b7eb0bb5096f555c', '2026-09-18T23:19:03.681Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:03.681Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 8, 6, 'Rehefa afaka 40 andro àry, dia nosokafan’i Noa ny varavarankelin’ny sambofiara,', 'rehefa afaka 40 andro àry, dia nosokafan’i noa ny varavarankelin’ny sambofiara,'),
  ('6aadc6e7b7eb0bb5096f555a', '2026-09-18T23:19:03.681Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:03.681Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 8, 4, 'Tamin’ny andro faha-17 amin’ny volana fahafito, dia tafapetraka teo ambonin’ny tendrombohitra Ararata ilay sambofiara.', 'tamin’ny andro faha-17 amin’ny volana fahafito, dia tafapetraka teo ambonin’ny tendrombohitra ararata ilay sambofiara.'),
  ('6aadc6e7b7eb0bb5096f556c', '2026-09-18T23:19:03.682Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:03.682Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 8, 22, 'Manomboka izao, dia tsy hitsahatra eny ambonin’ny tany mihitsy ny famafazam-boa sy ny fijinjana, ny hatsiaka sy ny hafanana, ny fahavaratra sy ny ririnina, ary ny andro sy ny alina.”', 'manomboka izao, dia tsy hitsahatra eny ambonin’ny tany mihitsy ny famafazam-boa sy ny fijinjana, ny hatsiaka sy ny hafanana, ny fahavaratra sy ny ririnina, ary ny andro sy ny alina.”'),
  ('6aadc6e7b7eb0bb5096f5568', '2026-09-18T23:19:03.682Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:03.682Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 8, 18, 'Dia nivoaka i Noa sy ny vadiny, ary ny zanany lahy sy ny vadin’izy ireo.', 'dia nivoaka i noa sy ny vadiny, ary ny zanany lahy sy ny vadin’izy ireo.'),
  ('6aadc6e7b7eb0bb5096f5567', '2026-09-18T23:19:03.682Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:03.682Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 8, 17, 'Ento mivoaka miaraka aminao ny zavamananaina rehetra, araka ny karazany avy: Ny biby manidina sy ny biby fiompy ary ny biby mandady rehetra eny ambonin’ny tany. Amin’izay izy ireny ho lasa be dia be eny ambonin’ny tany, dia hanan-taranaka sy hihabetsaka eny ambonin’ny tany.”', 'ento mivoaka miaraka aminao ny zavamananaina rehetra, araka ny karazany avy: ny biby manidina sy ny biby fiompy ary ny biby mandady rehetra eny ambonin’ny tany. amin’izay izy ireny ho lasa be dia be eny ambonin’ny tany, dia hanan-taranaka sy hihabetsaka eny ambonin’ny tany.”'),
  ('6aadc6e7b7eb0bb5096f556b', '2026-09-18T23:19:03.682Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:03.682Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 8, 21, 'Ary nahafinaritra an’i Jehovah ny hanitr’ilay izy, ka hoy i Jehovah anakampo: “Tsy hanozona ny tany noho ny ataon’ny olona intsony aho, satria mitarika azy hanao ratsy foana ny fony, efa hatramin’ny fahazazany. Dia tsy horinganiko hoatran’iny nataoko iny intsony ny zavamananaina rehetra.', 'ary nahafinaritra an’i jehovah ny hanitr’ilay izy, ka hoy i jehovah anakampo: “tsy hanozona ny tany noho ny ataon’ny olona intsony aho, satria mitarika azy hanao ratsy foana ny fony, efa hatramin’ny fahazazany. dia tsy horinganiko hoatran’iny nataoko iny intsony ny zavamananaina rehetra.'),
  ('6aadc6e7b7eb0bb5096f5566', '2026-09-18T23:19:03.682Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:03.682Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 8, 16, '“Mivoaha avy ao anatin’ny sambofiara ianao sy ny vady aman-janakao ary ny vadin’ny zanakao.', '“mivoaha avy ao anatin’ny sambofiara ianao sy ny vady aman-janakao ary ny vadin’ny zanakao.'),
  ('6aadc6e7b7eb0bb5096f5569', '2026-09-18T23:19:03.682Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:03.682Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 8, 19, 'Nivoaka avy tao amin’ny sambofiara koa ny bibidia rehetra, ny biby mandady rehetra, ny biby manidina rehetra, ary izay rehetra mifamezivezy eny ambonin’ny tany, araka ny sokajiny avy.', 'nivoaka avy tao amin’ny sambofiara koa ny bibidia rehetra, ny biby mandady rehetra, ny biby manidina rehetra, ary izay rehetra mifamezivezy eny ambonin’ny tany, araka ny sokajiny avy.'),
  ('6aadc6e7b7eb0bb5096f556a', '2026-09-18T23:19:03.682Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:03.682Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 8, 20, 'Dia nanorina alitara ho an’i Jehovah i Noa. Naka tamin’ny biby madio sy ny biby manidina madio izy, ka nanolotra fanatitra dorana teo ambonin’ilay alitara.', 'dia nanorina alitara ho an’i jehovah i noa. naka tamin’ny biby madio sy ny biby manidina madio izy, ka nanolotra fanatitra dorana teo ambonin’ilay alitara.'),
  ('6aadc6e8110783725fe4792e', '2026-09-18T23:19:04.112Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:04.113Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 9, 1, 'Nitso-drano an’i Noa sy ny zanany Andriamanitra, ka niteny taminy hoe: “Miteraha maro, dia mihabetsaha ka mamenoa ny tany.', 'nitso-drano an’i noa sy ny zanany andriamanitra, ka niteny taminy hoe: “miteraha maro, dia mihabetsaha ka mamenoa ny tany.'),
  ('6aadc6e8110783725fe47942', '2026-09-18T23:19:04.113Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:04.113Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 9, 21, 'Rehefa nisotro divay izy dia mamo ka nanary lamba, tamin’izy tao anatin’ny tranolainy.', 'rehefa nisotro divay izy dia mamo ka nanary lamba, tamin’izy tao anatin’ny tranolainy.'),
  ('6aadc6e8110783725fe4794a', '2026-09-18T23:19:04.113Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:04.113Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 9, 29, 'Ary nahatratra 950 taona ny andro rehetra niainan’i Noa, dia maty izy.', 'ary nahatratra 950 taona ny andro rehetra niainan’i noa, dia maty izy.'),
  ('6aadc6e8110783725fe4793e', '2026-09-18T23:19:04.113Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:04.113Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 9, 17, 'Ary hoy indray Andriamanitra tamin’i Noa: “Izany no famantarana an’ilay fifanekena ataoko amin’ny zavamananaina rehetra eny ambonin’ny tany.”', 'ary hoy indray andriamanitra tamin’i noa: “izany no famantarana an’ilay fifanekena ataoko amin’ny zavamananaina rehetra eny ambonin’ny tany.”'),
  ('6aadc6e8110783725fe47939', '2026-09-18T23:19:04.113Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:04.113Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 9, 12, 'Hoy koa Andriamanitra: “Izao no famantarana an’ilay fifanekena ataoko aminareo sy ny zavamananaina rehetra eo aminareo, ho an’ny taranaka rehetra mbola ho avy:', 'hoy koa andriamanitra: “izao no famantarana an’ilay fifanekena ataoko aminareo sy ny zavamananaina rehetra eo aminareo, ho an’ny taranaka rehetra mbola ho avy:'),
  ('6aadc6e8110783725fe47934', '2026-09-18T23:19:04.113Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:04.113Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 9, 7, 'Fa ianareo indray, miteraha maro dia mihabetsaha, ary aoka ho maro be eny ambonin’ny tany ianareo sady ho lasa be dia be.”', 'fa ianareo indray, miteraha maro dia mihabetsaha, ary aoka ho maro be eny ambonin’ny tany ianareo sady ho lasa be dia be.”'),
  ('6aadc6e8110783725fe47947', '2026-09-18T23:19:04.113Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:04.113Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 9, 26, 'Hoy koa izy: “Hoderaina anie i Jehovah, Andriamanitr’i Sema! Ary ho lasa andevon’i Sema anie i Kanana!', 'hoy koa izy: “hoderaina anie i jehovah, andriamanitr’i sema! ary ho lasa andevon’i sema anie i kanana!'),
  ('6aadc6e8110783725fe47944', '2026-09-18T23:19:04.113Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:04.113Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 9, 23, 'Naka lamba àry i Sema sy Jafeta. Nataony teo an-tsoroka ilay izy, ka nanao dia nihemotra izy roa lahy dia nandrakotra ny fitanjahan’ny rainy. Nitodi-damosina izy ireo tamin’izay, ka tsy nahita ny fitanjahan’ny rainy.', 'naka lamba àry i sema sy jafeta. nataony teo an-tsoroka ilay izy, ka nanao dia nihemotra izy roa lahy dia nandrakotra ny fitanjahan’ny rainy. nitodi-damosina izy ireo tamin’izay, ka tsy nahita ny fitanjahan’ny rainy.'),
  ('6aadc6e8110783725fe47933', '2026-09-18T23:19:04.113Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:04.113Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 9, 6, 'Izay mandatsaka ran’olona, dia mba halatsak’olona koa ny rany, satria nataon’Andriamanitra mitovy endrika aminy ny olona.', 'izay mandatsaka ran’olona, dia mba halatsak’olona koa ny rany, satria nataon’andriamanitra mitovy endrika aminy ny olona.'),
  ('6aadc6e8110783725fe47932', '2026-09-18T23:19:04.113Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:04.113Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 9, 5, 'Ankoatra izany, dia hataoko ampamoaka izay mandatsaka ny ranareo na ny ainareo. Hataoko ampamoaka ny zavamananaina rehetra mandatsaka ny ranareo. Ary hataoko ampamoaka izay olona mandatsaka ny ain’ny rahalahiny.', 'ankoatra izany, dia hataoko ampamoaka izay mandatsaka ny ranareo na ny ainareo. hataoko ampamoaka ny zavamananaina rehetra mandatsaka ny ranareo. ary hataoko ampamoaka izay olona mandatsaka ny ain’ny rahalahiny.'),
  ('6aadc6e8110783725fe4793f', '2026-09-18T23:19:04.113Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:04.113Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 9, 18, 'Ireto avy ny zanakalahin’i Noa nivoaka avy tao anatin’ny sambofiara: Sema sy Hama ary Jafeta. Ary i Hama no lasa rain’i Kanana.', 'ireto avy ny zanakalahin’i noa nivoaka avy tao anatin’ny sambofiara: sema sy hama ary jafeta. ary i hama no lasa rain’i kanana.'),
  ('6aadc6e8110783725fe47935', '2026-09-18T23:19:04.113Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:04.113Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 9, 8, 'Hoy Andriamanitra avy eo tamin’i Noa sy ny zanany lahy:', 'hoy andriamanitra avy eo tamin’i noa sy ny zanany lahy:'),
  ('6aadc6e8110783725fe4793d', '2026-09-18T23:19:04.113Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:04.113Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 9, 16, 'Hiseho eny amin’ny rahona ny avana. Rehefa hitako ilay izy, dia hotsaroako ilay fifanekena mandrakizay nataon’Andriamanitra tamin’ny zavamananaina rehetra isan-karazany eny ambonin’ny tany.”', 'hiseho eny amin’ny rahona ny avana. rehefa hitako ilay izy, dia hotsaroako ilay fifanekena mandrakizay nataon’andriamanitra tamin’ny zavamananaina rehetra isan-karazany eny ambonin’ny tany.”'),
  ('6aadc6e8110783725fe4792f', '2026-09-18T23:19:04.113Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:04.113Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 9, 2, 'Mbola hatahotra anareo foana ny bibidia rehetra eny ambonin’ny tany, sy ny biby manidina rehetra eny amin’ny lanitra, sy izay rehetra mifamezivezy eny ambonin’ny tany, ary ny trondro rehetra any an-dranomasina. Dia hanjaka amin’ireny ianareo.', 'mbola hatahotra anareo foana ny bibidia rehetra eny ambonin’ny tany, sy ny biby manidina rehetra eny amin’ny lanitra, sy izay rehetra mifamezivezy eny ambonin’ny tany, ary ny trondro rehetra any an-dranomasina. dia hanjaka amin’ireny ianareo.'),
  ('6aadc6e8110783725fe47949', '2026-09-18T23:19:04.113Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:04.113Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 9, 28, 'Mbola velona 350 taona i Noa, taorian’ny Safodrano.', 'mbola velona 350 taona i noa, taorian’ny safodrano.'),
  ('6aadc6e8110783725fe47946', '2026-09-18T23:19:04.113Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:04.113Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 9, 25, 'Dia hoy izy: “Ho voaozona anie i Kanana! Ho lasa ambany indrindra amin’ny andevon’ny rahalahiny anie izy!”', 'dia hoy izy: “ho voaozona anie i kanana! ho lasa ambany indrindra amin’ny andevon’ny rahalahiny anie izy!”'),
  ('6aadc6e8110783725fe47941', '2026-09-18T23:19:04.113Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:04.113Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 9, 20, 'Ary lasa mpamboly i Noa ka namboly voaloboka.', 'ary lasa mpamboly i noa ka namboly voaloboka.'),
  ('6aadc6e8110783725fe4793a', '2026-09-18T23:19:04.113Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:04.113Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 9, 13, 'Asiako avana eny amin’ny rahona, ka izy io no ho famantarana an’ilay fifanekena ataoko amin’izay rehetra velona eny ambonin’ny tany.', 'asiako avana eny amin’ny rahona, ka izy io no ho famantarana an’ilay fifanekena ataoko amin’izay rehetra velona eny ambonin’ny tany.'),
  ('6aadc6e8110783725fe47938', '2026-09-18T23:19:04.113Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:04.113Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 9, 11, 'Izao àry no fifanekena ataoko aminareo: Tsy ho ripaky ny safodrano intsony ny zavamananaina rehetra, ary tsy hisy safodrano hanimba ny tany intsony.”', 'izao àry no fifanekena ataoko aminareo: tsy ho ripaky ny safodrano intsony ny zavamananaina rehetra, ary tsy hisy safodrano hanimba ny tany intsony.”'),
  ('6aadc6e8110783725fe4793c', '2026-09-18T23:19:04.113Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:04.113Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 9, 15, 'Dia hotsaroako ilay fifanekena nataoko taminareo sy tamin’ny zavamananaina rehetra isan-karazany. Ary tsy ho lasa safodrano handringana ny zavamananaina rehetra intsony ny rano.', 'dia hotsaroako ilay fifanekena nataoko taminareo sy tamin’ny zavamananaina rehetra isan-karazany. ary tsy ho lasa safodrano handringana ny zavamananaina rehetra intsony ny rano.'),
  ('6aadc6e8110783725fe47940', '2026-09-18T23:19:04.113Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:04.113Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 9, 19, 'Izy telo ireo no zanakalahin’i Noa, ary ireo no niavian’ny mponina rehetra niparitaka eran-tany.', 'izy telo ireo no zanakalahin’i noa, ary ireo no niavian’ny mponina rehetra niparitaka eran-tany.'),
  ('6aadc6e8110783725fe47930', '2026-09-18T23:19:04.113Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:04.113Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 9, 3, 'Azonareo atao sakafo ny biby velona mihetsiketsika rehetra. Omeko anareo daholo izy rehetra, toy ny nanomezako anareo ny zava-maitso.', 'azonareo atao sakafo ny biby velona mihetsiketsika rehetra. omeko anareo daholo izy rehetra, toy ny nanomezako anareo ny zava-maitso.'),
  ('6aadc6e8110783725fe47945', '2026-09-18T23:19:04.113Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:04.113Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 9, 24, 'Ary nifoha i Noa rehefa nisava ny hamamoany, ka lasa fantany ny zavatra efa nataon’ny faralahiny taminy.', 'ary nifoha i noa rehefa nisava ny hamamoany, ka lasa fantany ny zavatra efa nataon’ny faralahiny taminy.'),
  ('6aadc6e8110783725fe47931', '2026-09-18T23:19:04.113Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:04.113Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 9, 4, 'Fa izao ihany no tsy azonareo hanina: Ny nofo misy aina, izany hoe mbola misy ra.', 'fa izao ihany no tsy azonareo hanina: ny nofo misy aina, izany hoe mbola misy ra.'),
  ('6aadc6e8110783725fe47948', '2026-09-18T23:19:04.113Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:04.113Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 9, 27, 'Enga anie homen’Andriamanitra toerana midadasika i Jafeta! Dia hipetraka ao an-tranolain’i Sema anie izy! Fa i Kanana kosa anie ho andevon’i Jafeta!”', 'enga anie homen’andriamanitra toerana midadasika i jafeta! dia hipetraka ao an-tranolain’i sema anie izy! fa i kanana kosa anie ho andevon’i jafeta!”'),
  ('6aadc6e8110783725fe47943', '2026-09-18T23:19:04.113Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:04.113Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 9, 22, 'Dia nahita ny fitanjahan’ny rainy i Hama, rain’i Kanana, ka notantarainy tamin’izy roa lahy rahalahiny teo ivelany izany.', 'dia nahita ny fitanjahan’ny rainy i hama, rain’i kanana, ka notantarainy tamin’izy roa lahy rahalahiny teo ivelany izany.'),
  ('6aadc6e8110783725fe47937', '2026-09-18T23:19:04.113Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:04.113Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 9, 10, 'sy amin’ny zavamananaina rehetra eo aminareo, ny vorona sy ny biby ary ny bibidia rehetra eny ambonin’ny tany, izany hoe izay rehetra nivoaka avy tao anatin’ny sambofiara—ny zavamananaina rehetra eny ambonin’ny tany.', 'sy amin’ny zavamananaina rehetra eo aminareo, ny vorona sy ny biby ary ny bibidia rehetra eny ambonin’ny tany, izany hoe izay rehetra nivoaka avy tao anatin’ny sambofiara—ny zavamananaina rehetra eny ambonin’ny tany.'),
  ('6aadc6e8110783725fe47936', '2026-09-18T23:19:04.113Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:04.113Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 9, 9, '“Hanao fifanekena aminareo sy ny taranakareo handimby anareo aho,', '“hanao fifanekena aminareo sy ny taranakareo handimby anareo aho,'),
  ('6aadc6e8110783725fe4793b', '2026-09-18T23:19:04.113Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:04.113Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 9, 14, 'Koa isaky ny manisy rahona eny ambonin’ny tany aho, dia tsy maintsy hiseho eny amin’ny rahona ny avana.', 'koa isaky ny manisy rahona eny ambonin’ny tany aho, dia tsy maintsy hiseho eny amin’ny rahona ny avana.'),
  ('6aadc6e808ab09b02e6b6c85', '2026-09-18T23:19:04.516Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:04.516Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 10, 27, 'Hadorama, Ozala, Dikla,', 'hadorama, ozala, dikla,'),
  ('6aadc6e808ab09b02e6b6c76', '2026-09-18T23:19:04.516Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:04.516Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 10, 12, 'ary Resena izay teo anelanelan’i Ninive sy Kala: Izany no tanàna lehibe.', 'ary resena izay teo anelanelan’i ninive sy kala: izany no tanàna lehibe.'),
  ('6aadc6e808ab09b02e6b6c83', '2026-09-18T23:19:04.516Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:04.516Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 10, 25, 'Niteraka roa lahy i Ebera: Palega no anaran’ny iray, satria tamin’ny androny no voazarazara ny tany. Ary Joktana no anaran’ny rahalahiny.', 'niteraka roa lahy i ebera: palega no anaran’ny iray, satria tamin’ny androny no voazarazara ny tany. ary joktana no anaran’ny rahalahiny.'),
  ('6aadc6e808ab09b02e6b6c81', '2026-09-18T23:19:04.516Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:04.516Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 10, 23, 'Ny zanakalahin’i Arama dia i Oza, Hola, Gatera, ary Masy.', 'ny zanakalahin’i arama dia i oza, hola, gatera, ary masy.'),
  ('6aadc6e808ab09b02e6b6c7d', '2026-09-18T23:19:04.516Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:04.516Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 10, 19, 'Ny sisin-tanin’ny Kananita àry dia nanomboka tany Sidona ka hatrany Gerara, tany akaikin’i Gaza, ary hatrany Sodoma sy Gomora sy Adma ary Zeboima, tany akaikin’i Lesa.', 'ny sisin-tanin’ny kananita àry dia nanomboka tany sidona ka hatrany gerara, tany akaikin’i gaza, ary hatrany sodoma sy gomora sy adma ary zeboima, tany akaikin’i lesa.'),
  ('6aadc6e808ab09b02e6b6c7b', '2026-09-18T23:19:04.516Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:04.516Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 10, 17, 'ny Hivita, ny Arkita, ny Sinita,', 'ny hivita, ny arkita, ny sinita,'),
  ('6aadc6e808ab09b02e6b6c86', '2026-09-18T23:19:04.516Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:04.516Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 10, 28, 'Obala, Abimaela, Sheba,', 'obala, abimaela, sheba,'),
  ('6aadc6e808ab09b02e6b6c72', '2026-09-18T23:19:04.516Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:04.516Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 10, 8, 'I Kosy niteraka an’i Nimroda. Io Nimroda io no lasa mpiady mahery voalohany teto an-tany.', 'i kosy niteraka an’i nimroda. io nimroda io no lasa mpiady mahery voalohany teto an-tany.'),
  ('6aadc6e808ab09b02e6b6c70', '2026-09-18T23:19:04.516Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:04.516Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 10, 6, 'Ny zanakalahin’i Hama dia i Kosy, Mizraima, Pota, ary Kanana.', 'ny zanakalahin’i hama dia i kosy, mizraima, pota, ary kanana.'),
  ('6aadc6e808ab09b02e6b6c6f', '2026-09-18T23:19:04.516Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:04.516Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 10, 5, 'Ireo no niavian’ny mponina niparitaka tany amin’ireo nosy sy tany amin’ny taniny avy, araka ny fiteniny avy, sy araka ny fianakaviany avy, ary araka ny fireneny avy.', 'ireo no niavian’ny mponina niparitaka tany amin’ireo nosy sy tany amin’ny taniny avy, araka ny fiteniny avy, sy araka ny fianakaviany avy, ary araka ny fireneny avy.'),
  ('6aadc6e808ab09b02e6b6c88', '2026-09-18T23:19:04.516Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:04.516Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 10, 30, 'Ny faritra nipetrahan’izy ireo dia nitatra hatrany Mesa ka hatrany Sefara, ilay faritra be tendrombohitra tany Atsinanana.', 'ny faritra nipetrahan’izy ireo dia nitatra hatrany mesa ka hatrany sefara, ilay faritra be tendrombohitra tany atsinanana.'),
  ('6aadc6e808ab09b02e6b6c6b', '2026-09-18T23:19:04.516Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:04.516Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 10, 1, 'Izao no tantaran’i Sema sy Hama ary Jafeta, zanakalahin’i Noa: Niteraka zazalahy izy ireo taorian’ny Safodrano.', 'izao no tantaran’i sema sy hama ary jafeta, zanakalahin’i noa: niteraka zazalahy izy ireo taorian’ny safodrano.'),
  ('6aadc6e808ab09b02e6b6c80', '2026-09-18T23:19:04.516Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:04.516Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 10, 22, 'Ny zanakalahin’i Sema dia i Elama, Asyra, Arpaksada, Loda, ary Arama.', 'ny zanakalahin’i sema dia i elama, asyra, arpaksada, loda, ary arama.'),
  ('6aadc6e808ab09b02e6b6c7c', '2026-09-18T23:19:04.516Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:04.516Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 10, 18, 'ny Arvadita, ny Zemarita, ary ny Hamatita. Niparitaka ireo fianakavian’ny Kananita, tatỳ aoriana.', 'ny arvadita, ny zemarita, ary ny hamatita. niparitaka ireo fianakavian’ny kananita, tatỳ aoriana.'),
  ('6aadc6e808ab09b02e6b6c89', '2026-09-18T23:19:04.516Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:04.516Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 10, 31, 'Ireo no zanakalahin’i Sema araka ny fianakaviany sy ny fiteniny, tany amin’ny taniny sy ny fireneny avy.', 'ireo no zanakalahin’i sema araka ny fianakaviany sy ny fiteniny, tany amin’ny taniny sy ny fireneny avy.'),
  ('6aadc6e808ab09b02e6b6c7f', '2026-09-18T23:19:04.516Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:04.516Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 10, 21, 'Nanan-janaka koa i Sema, ilay razamben’ny zanakalahin’i Ebera rehetra, sady rahalahin’i Jafeta izay zokiny indrindra.', 'nanan-janaka koa i sema, ilay razamben’ny zanakalahin’i ebera rehetra, sady rahalahin’i jafeta izay zokiny indrindra.'),
  ('6aadc6e808ab09b02e6b6c6e', '2026-09-18T23:19:04.516Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:04.516Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 10, 4, 'Ny zanakalahin’i Javana dia i Elisaha, Tarsisy, Kitima, ary Dodanima.', 'ny zanakalahin’i javana dia i elisaha, tarsisy, kitima, ary dodanima.'),
  ('6aadc6e808ab09b02e6b6c8a', '2026-09-18T23:19:04.516Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:04.516Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 10, 32, 'Ireo no fianakavian’ny zanakalahin’i Noa, araka ny taranany sy ny fireneny. Avy tamin’ireo ny firenena teto ambonin’ny tany no niparitaka, taorian’ny Safodrano.', 'ireo no fianakavian’ny zanakalahin’i noa, araka ny taranany sy ny fireneny. avy tamin’ireo ny firenena teto ambonin’ny tany no niparitaka, taorian’ny safodrano.'),
  ('6aadc6e808ab09b02e6b6c7e', '2026-09-18T23:19:04.516Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:04.516Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 10, 20, 'Ireo no zanakalahin’i Hama araka ny fianakaviany sy ny fiteniny, tany amin’ny taniny sy ny fireneny avy.', 'ireo no zanakalahin’i hama araka ny fianakaviany sy ny fiteniny, tany amin’ny taniny sy ny fireneny avy.'),
  ('6aadc6e808ab09b02e6b6c73', '2026-09-18T23:19:04.516Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:04.516Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 10, 9, 'Lasa mpihaza mahery nanohitra an’i Jehovah izy, ka izany no nahatonga an’ilay fitenenana hoe: “Tahaka an’i Nimroda, ilay mpihaza mahery nanohitra an’i Jehovah.”', 'lasa mpihaza mahery nanohitra an’i jehovah izy, ka izany no nahatonga an’ilay fitenenana hoe: “tahaka an’i nimroda, ilay mpihaza mahery nanohitra an’i jehovah.”'),
  ('6aadc6e808ab09b02e6b6c82', '2026-09-18T23:19:04.516Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:04.516Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 10, 24, 'I Arpaksada niteraka an’i Sela, ary Sela niteraka an’i Ebera.', 'i arpaksada niteraka an’i sela, ary sela niteraka an’i ebera.'),
  ('6aadc6e808ab09b02e6b6c7a', '2026-09-18T23:19:04.516Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:04.516Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 10, 16, 'ary ny Jebosita, ny Amorita, ny Girgasita,', 'ary ny jebosita, ny amorita, ny girgasita,'),
  ('6aadc6e808ab09b02e6b6c75', '2026-09-18T23:19:04.516Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:04.516Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 10, 11, 'Niainga tao amin’izany tany izany izy ka nankany Asyria, dia nanorina an’i Ninive, Rehobota-ira, Kala,', 'niainga tao amin’izany tany izany izy ka nankany asyria, dia nanorina an’i ninive, rehobota-ira, kala,'),
  ('6aadc6e808ab09b02e6b6c87', '2026-09-18T23:19:04.516Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:04.516Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 10, 29, 'Ofira, Havila, ary Jobaba. Ireo rehetra ireo no zanakalahin’i Joktana.', 'ofira, havila, ary jobaba. ireo rehetra ireo no zanakalahin’i joktana.'),
  ('6aadc6e808ab09b02e6b6c71', '2026-09-18T23:19:04.516Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:04.516Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 10, 7, 'Ny zanakalahin’i Kosy dia i Seba, Havila, Sabta, Rama, ary Sabteka. Ny zanakalahin’i Rama dia i Sheba sy Dedana.', 'ny zanakalahin’i kosy dia i seba, havila, sabta, rama, ary sabteka. ny zanakalahin’i rama dia i sheba sy dedana.'),
  ('6aadc6e808ab09b02e6b6c6d', '2026-09-18T23:19:04.516Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:04.516Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 10, 3, 'Ny zanakalahin’i Gomera dia i Askenaza sy Rifata ary Togarma.', 'ny zanakalahin’i gomera dia i askenaza sy rifata ary togarma.'),
  ('6aadc6e808ab09b02e6b6c79', '2026-09-18T23:19:04.516Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:04.516Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 10, 15, 'I Kanana niteraka an’i Sidona lahimatoany, sy Heta,', 'i kanana niteraka an’i sidona lahimatoany, sy heta,'),
  ('6aadc6e808ab09b02e6b6c78', '2026-09-18T23:19:04.516Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:04.516Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 10, 14, 'Patrosima, Kaslohima izay niavian’ny Filistinina, ary Kaftorima.', 'patrosima, kaslohima izay niavian’ny filistinina, ary kaftorima.'),
  ('6aadc6e808ab09b02e6b6c74', '2026-09-18T23:19:04.516Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:04.516Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 10, 10, 'Ny niandohan’ny fanjakany dia i Babela, Ereka, Akada, ary Kalne, tany amin’ny tany Sinara.', 'ny niandohan’ny fanjakany dia i babela, ereka, akada, ary kalne, tany amin’ny tany sinara.'),
  ('6aadc6e808ab09b02e6b6c6c', '2026-09-18T23:19:04.516Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:04.516Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 10, 2, 'Ny zanakalahin’i Jafeta dia i Gomera, Magoga, Maday, Javana, Tobala, Meseka, ary Tirasa.', 'ny zanakalahin’i jafeta dia i gomera, magoga, maday, javana, tobala, meseka, ary tirasa.'),
  ('6aadc6e808ab09b02e6b6c84', '2026-09-18T23:19:04.516Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:04.516Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 10, 26, 'I Joktana niteraka an’i Almodada, Salefa, Hazarmaveta, Jera,', 'i joktana niteraka an’i almodada, salefa, hazarmaveta, jera,'),
  ('6aadc6e808ab09b02e6b6c77', '2026-09-18T23:19:04.516Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:04.516Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 10, 13, 'I Mizraima niteraka an’i Lodima, Anamima, Lehabima, Naftohima,', 'i mizraima niteraka an’i lodima, anamima, lehabima, naftohima,'),
  ('6aadc6e99615bc2eb9f1559f', '2026-09-18T23:19:05.104Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:05.104Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 11, 25, 'Ary mbola velona 119 taona i Nahora, taorian’ny niterahany an’i Tera. Niteraka zazalahy sy zazavavy hafa koa izy.', 'ary mbola velona 119 taona i nahora, taorian’ny niterahany an’i tera. niteraka zazalahy sy zazavavy hafa koa izy.'),
  ('6aadc6e99615bc2eb9f15599', '2026-09-18T23:19:05.104Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:05.104Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 11, 19, 'Ary mbola velona 209 taona i Palega, taorian’ny niterahany an’i Reo. Niteraka zazalahy sy zazavavy hafa koa izy.', 'ary mbola velona 209 taona i palega, taorian’ny niterahany an’i reo. niteraka zazalahy sy zazavavy hafa koa izy.'),
  ('6aadc6e99615bc2eb9f15594', '2026-09-18T23:19:05.104Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:05.104Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 11, 14, 'Rehefa 30 taona i Sela, dia niteraka an’i Ebera.', 'rehefa 30 taona i sela, dia niteraka an’i ebera.'),
  ('6aadc6e99615bc2eb9f1558f', '2026-09-18T23:19:05.104Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:05.104Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 11, 9, 'Izany no antony nanaovana ny anaran’ilay tanàna hoe Babela, satria tao no nataon’i Jehovah nisafotofoto ny fitenin’ny tany rehetra. Ary naparitak’i Jehovah avy tao izy ireo ka niely nanerana ny tany.', 'izany no antony nanaovana ny anaran’ilay tanàna hoe babela, satria tao no nataon’i jehovah nisafotofoto ny fitenin’ny tany rehetra. ary naparitak’i jehovah avy tao izy ireo ka niely nanerana ny tany.'),
  ('6aadc6e99615bc2eb9f1559e', '2026-09-18T23:19:05.104Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:05.104Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 11, 24, 'Rehefa 29 taona i Nahora, dia niteraka an’i Tera.', 'rehefa 29 taona i nahora, dia niteraka an’i tera.'),
  ('6aadc6e99615bc2eb9f15588', '2026-09-18T23:19:05.104Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:05.104Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 11, 2, 'Ary rehefa niantsinanana ny olona, dia nahita tany lemaka tany amin’ny faritr’i Sinara, dia nipetraka tao.', 'ary rehefa niantsinanana ny olona, dia nahita tany lemaka tany amin’ny faritr’i sinara, dia nipetraka tao.'),
  ('6aadc6e99615bc2eb9f15596', '2026-09-18T23:19:05.104Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:05.104Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 11, 16, 'Rehefa 34 taona i Ebera, dia niteraka an’i Palega.', 'rehefa 34 taona i ebera, dia niteraka an’i palega.'),
  ('6aadc6e99615bc2eb9f155a3', '2026-09-18T23:19:05.104Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:05.104Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 11, 29, 'Samy naka vady i Abrama sy Nahora: Saray no anaran’ny vadin’i Abrama, ary Milka, zanakavavin’i Harana, no anaran’ny vadin’i Nahora. Rain’i Milka sy Iska io Harana io.', 'samy naka vady i abrama sy nahora: saray no anaran’ny vadin’i abrama, ary milka, zanakavavin’i harana, no anaran’ny vadin’i nahora. rain’i milka sy iska io harana io.'),
  ('6aadc6e99615bc2eb9f1558a', '2026-09-18T23:19:05.104Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:05.104Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 11, 4, 'Dia hoy izy ireo: “Andao isika hanorina tanàna sy hanangana tilikambo, dia hataontsika manakatra ny lanitra ny tampony. Dia andao hataontsika izay hampahalaza ny anarantsika, amin’izay isika tsy hiparitaka manerana ny tany.”', 'dia hoy izy ireo: “andao isika hanorina tanàna sy hanangana tilikambo, dia hataontsika manakatra ny lanitra ny tampony. dia andao hataontsika izay hampahalaza ny anarantsika, amin’izay isika tsy hiparitaka manerana ny tany.”'),
  ('6aadc6e99615bc2eb9f1559b', '2026-09-18T23:19:05.104Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:05.104Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 11, 21, 'Ary mbola velona 207 taona i Reo, taorian’ny niterahany an’i Seroga. Niteraka zazalahy sy zazavavy hafa koa izy.', 'ary mbola velona 207 taona i reo, taorian’ny niterahany an’i seroga. niteraka zazalahy sy zazavavy hafa koa izy.'),
  ('6aadc6e99615bc2eb9f155a6', '2026-09-18T23:19:05.104Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:05.104Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 11, 32, 'Rehefa 205 taona ny andro niainan’i Tera, dia maty tao Harana izy.', 'rehefa 205 taona ny andro niainan’i tera, dia maty tao harana izy.'),
  ('6aadc6e99615bc2eb9f15591', '2026-09-18T23:19:05.104Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:05.104Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 11, 11, 'Mbola velona 500 taona i Sema, taorian’ny niterahany an’i Arpaksada. Niteraka zazalahy sy zazavavy hafa koa izy.', 'mbola velona 500 taona i sema, taorian’ny niterahany an’i arpaksada. niteraka zazalahy sy zazavavy hafa koa izy.'),
  ('6aadc6e99615bc2eb9f155a2', '2026-09-18T23:19:05.104Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:05.104Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 11, 28, 'Maty tany Oran’ny Kaldeanina, tany amin’ny tany nahaterahany, i Harana tamin’i Tera rainy mbola velona.', 'maty tany oran’ny kaldeanina, tany amin’ny tany nahaterahany, i harana tamin’i tera rainy mbola velona.'),
  ('6aadc6e99615bc2eb9f15597', '2026-09-18T23:19:05.104Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:05.104Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 11, 17, 'Ary mbola velona 430 taona i Ebera, taorian’ny niterahany an’i Palega. Niteraka zazalahy sy zazavavy hafa koa izy.', 'ary mbola velona 430 taona i ebera, taorian’ny niterahany an’i palega. niteraka zazalahy sy zazavavy hafa koa izy.'),
  ('6aadc6e99615bc2eb9f15593', '2026-09-18T23:19:05.104Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:05.104Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 11, 13, 'Ary mbola velona 403 taona i Arpaksada, taorian’ny niterahany an’i Sela. Niteraka zazalahy sy zazavavy hafa koa izy.', 'ary mbola velona 403 taona i arpaksada, taorian’ny niterahany an’i sela. niteraka zazalahy sy zazavavy hafa koa izy.'),
  ('6aadc6e99615bc2eb9f155a4', '2026-09-18T23:19:05.104Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:05.104Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 11, 30, 'Ary tsy nanan-janaka i Saray fa momba.', 'ary tsy nanan-janaka i saray fa momba.'),
  ('6aadc6e99615bc2eb9f1558e', '2026-09-18T23:19:05.104Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:05.104Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 11, 8, 'Koa naparitak’i Jehovah avy tao izy ireo ka niely nanerana ny tany. Dia najanon’izy ireo tsikelikely ny fanorenana an’ilay tanàna.', 'koa naparitak’i jehovah avy tao izy ireo ka niely nanerana ny tany. dia najanon’izy ireo tsikelikely ny fanorenana an’ilay tanàna.'),
  ('6aadc6e99615bc2eb9f155a5', '2026-09-18T23:19:05.104Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:05.104Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 11, 31, 'Taorian’izay dia nentin’i Tera i Abrama zanany lahy sy Lota zafikeliny, zanakalahin’i Harana, ary Saray vinantovaviny, vadin’i Abrama zanany, ka niara-niala tao Oran’ny Kaldeanina izy ireo mba ho any Kanana. Dia tonga tao Harana izy ireo tamin’ny farany, ka nipetraka tao.', 'taorian’izay dia nentin’i tera i abrama zanany lahy sy lota zafikeliny, zanakalahin’i harana, ary saray vinantovaviny, vadin’i abrama zanany, ka niara-niala tao oran’ny kaldeanina izy ireo mba ho any kanana. dia tonga tao harana izy ireo tamin’ny farany, ka nipetraka tao.'),
  ('6aadc6e99615bc2eb9f155a1', '2026-09-18T23:19:05.104Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:05.104Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 11, 27, 'Izao no tantaran’i Tera: I Tera niteraka an’i Abrama sy Nahora ary Harana, ary Harana niteraka an’i Lota.', 'izao no tantaran’i tera: i tera niteraka an’i abrama sy nahora ary harana, ary harana niteraka an’i lota.'),
  ('6aadc6e99615bc2eb9f155a0', '2026-09-18T23:19:05.104Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:05.104Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 11, 26, 'Ary feno 70 taona i Tera. Dia niteraka an’i Abrama sy Nahora ary Harana izy taorian’izay.', 'ary feno 70 taona i tera. dia niteraka an’i abrama sy nahora ary harana izy taorian’izay.'),
  ('6aadc6e99615bc2eb9f1558d', '2026-09-18T23:19:05.104Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:05.104Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 11, 7, 'Andao isika hidina eny, dia hataontsika misafotofoto ny fitenin’izy ireo, amin’izay ry zareo tsy mifankahazo resaka.”', 'andao isika hidina eny, dia hataontsika misafotofoto ny fitenin’izy ireo, amin’izay ry zareo tsy mifankahazo resaka.”'),
  ('6aadc6e99615bc2eb9f1558b', '2026-09-18T23:19:05.104Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:05.104Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 11, 5, 'Dia nidina i Jehovah mba hijery an’ilay tanàna sy ilay tilikambo naorin’ny zanak’olombelona.', 'dia nidina i jehovah mba hijery an’ilay tanàna sy ilay tilikambo naorin’ny zanak’olombelona.'),
  ('6aadc6e99615bc2eb9f15589', '2026-09-18T23:19:05.104Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:05.104Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 11, 3, 'Ary nifampiresaka izy ireo hoe: “Andao isika hanao biriky dia hodorantsika ilay izy.” Biriky àry no nampiasainy fa tsy vato, ary godorao no nataony rihitra.', 'ary nifampiresaka izy ireo hoe: “andao isika hanao biriky dia hodorantsika ilay izy.” biriky àry no nampiasainy fa tsy vato, ary godorao no nataony rihitra.'),
  ('6aadc6e99615bc2eb9f15587', '2026-09-18T23:19:05.104Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:05.104Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 11, 1, 'Mbola nampiasa fiteny iray ihany ny tany manontolo, sady nitovy ny teny nampiasainy.', 'mbola nampiasa fiteny iray ihany ny tany manontolo, sady nitovy ny teny nampiasainy.'),
  ('6aadc6e99615bc2eb9f1559d', '2026-09-18T23:19:05.104Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:05.104Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 11, 23, 'Ary mbola velona 200 taona i Seroga, taorian’ny niterahany an’i Nahora. Niteraka zazalahy sy zazavavy hafa koa izy.', 'ary mbola velona 200 taona i seroga, taorian’ny niterahany an’i nahora. niteraka zazalahy sy zazavavy hafa koa izy.'),
  ('6aadc6e99615bc2eb9f1559a', '2026-09-18T23:19:05.104Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:05.104Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 11, 20, 'Rehefa 32 taona i Reo, dia niteraka an’i Seroga.', 'rehefa 32 taona i reo, dia niteraka an’i seroga.'),
  ('6aadc6e99615bc2eb9f15590', '2026-09-18T23:19:05.104Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:05.104Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 11, 10, 'Izao no tantaran’i Sema: Roa taona taorian’ny Safodrano, rehefa 100 taona i Sema, dia niteraka an’i Arpaksada izy.', 'izao no tantaran’i sema: roa taona taorian’ny safodrano, rehefa 100 taona i sema, dia niteraka an’i arpaksada izy.'),
  ('6aadc6e99615bc2eb9f15592', '2026-09-18T23:19:05.104Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:05.104Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 11, 12, 'Rehefa 35 taona i Arpaksada, dia niteraka an’i Sela.', 'rehefa 35 taona i arpaksada, dia niteraka an’i sela.'),
  ('6aadc6e99615bc2eb9f1559c', '2026-09-18T23:19:05.104Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:05.104Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 11, 22, 'Rehefa 30 taona i Seroga, dia niteraka an’i Nahora.', 'rehefa 30 taona i seroga, dia niteraka an’i nahora.'),
  ('6aadc6e99615bc2eb9f1558c', '2026-09-18T23:19:05.104Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:05.104Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 11, 6, 'Ary hoy i Jehovah: “Jereo ange e! Vahoaka iray ihany izy ireo ary fiteny iray ihany no ampiasainy, dia efa izao no ataony! Dia ho vitany daholo izay eritreretiny hatao.', 'ary hoy i jehovah: “jereo ange e! vahoaka iray ihany izy ireo ary fiteny iray ihany no ampiasainy, dia efa izao no ataony! dia ho vitany daholo izay eritreretiny hatao.'),
  ('6aadc6e99615bc2eb9f15598', '2026-09-18T23:19:05.104Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:05.104Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 11, 18, 'Rehefa 30 taona i Palega, dia niteraka an’i Reo.', 'rehefa 30 taona i palega, dia niteraka an’i reo.'),
  ('6aadc6e99615bc2eb9f15595', '2026-09-18T23:19:05.104Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:05.104Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 11, 15, 'Ary mbola velona 403 taona i Sela, taorian’ny niterahany an’i Ebera. Niteraka zazalahy sy zazavavy hafa koa izy.', 'ary mbola velona 403 taona i sela, taorian’ny niterahany an’i ebera. niteraka zazalahy sy zazavavy hafa koa izy.'),
  ('6aadc6e984be1105905e71f9', '2026-09-18T23:19:05.499Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:05.499Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 12, 19, 'Fa maninona ianao no niteny hoe: ‘Anabaviko izy’? Izaho anefa efa saika haka azy ho vady. Io ny vadinao! Ento izy dia mandehana mandeha!”', 'fa maninona ianao no niteny hoe: ‘anabaviko izy’? izaho anefa efa saika haka azy ho vady. io ny vadinao! ento izy dia mandehana mandeha!”'),
  ('6aadc6e984be1105905e71f1', '2026-09-18T23:19:05.499Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:05.499Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 12, 11, 'Rehefa iny hiditra an’i Ejipta iny izy, dia hoy izy tamin’i Saray vadiny: “Mba henoy ange aho azafady e! Fantatro fa vehivavy tsara tarehy be ianao.', 'rehefa iny hiditra an’i ejipta iny izy, dia hoy izy tamin’i saray vadiny: “mba henoy ange aho azafady e! fantatro fa vehivavy tsara tarehy be ianao.'),
  ('6aadc6e984be1105905e71f7', '2026-09-18T23:19:05.499Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:05.499Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 12, 17, 'Namely an’i Farao sy ny ankohonany tamin’ny loza lehibe anefa i Jehovah, noho i Saray, vadin’i Abrama.', 'namely an’i farao sy ny ankohonany tamin’ny loza lehibe anefa i jehovah, noho i saray, vadin’i abrama.'),
  ('6aadc6e984be1105905e71e8', '2026-09-18T23:19:05.499Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:05.499Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 12, 2, 'Hataoko lasa firenena lehibe ianao. Hitahy anao aho, dia hataoko malaza ny anaranao. Ho lasa fitahiana ho an’ny olona koa ianao.', 'hataoko lasa firenena lehibe ianao. hitahy anao aho, dia hataoko malaza ny anaranao. ho lasa fitahiana ho an’ny olona koa ianao.'),
  ('6aadc6e984be1105905e71f8', '2026-09-18T23:19:05.499Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:05.499Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 12, 18, 'Nantsoin’i Farao àry i Abrama, ka hoy izy: “Fa inona ity nataonao tamiko? Maninona no tsy nolazainao tamiko hoe vadinao izy?', 'nantsoin’i farao àry i abrama, ka hoy izy: “fa inona ity nataonao tamiko? maninona no tsy nolazainao tamiko hoe vadinao izy?'),
  ('6aadc6e984be1105905e71ee', '2026-09-18T23:19:05.499Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:05.499Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 12, 8, 'Niala teo izy, tatỳ aoriana, ka nifindra nankany amin’ny faritra be tendrombohitra any atsinanan’i Betela. Dia nanangana ny tranolainy teo izy, ka i Betela no teo andrefany, ary Ay no teo atsinanany. Ary nanorina alitara ho an’i Jehovah teo izy, ka niantso ny anaran’i Jehovah.', 'niala teo izy, tatỳ aoriana, ka nifindra nankany amin’ny faritra be tendrombohitra any atsinanan’i betela. dia nanangana ny tranolainy teo izy, ka i betela no teo andrefany, ary ay no teo atsinanany. ary nanorina alitara ho an’i jehovah teo izy, ka niantso ny anaran’i jehovah.'),
  ('6aadc6e984be1105905e71e7', '2026-09-18T23:19:05.499Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:05.499Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 12, 1, 'Ary hoy i Jehovah tamin’i Abrama: “Mialà amin’ny taninao sy ny havanao ary ny ankohonan-drainao, ka mankanesa any amin’ny tany hasehoko anao.', 'ary hoy i jehovah tamin’i abrama: “mialà amin’ny taninao sy ny havanao ary ny ankohonan-drainao, ka mankanesa any amin’ny tany hasehoko anao.'),
  ('6aadc6e984be1105905e71ea', '2026-09-18T23:19:05.499Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:05.499Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 12, 4, 'Nandeha àry i Abrama, araka izay efa nolazain’i Jehovah taminy, ary niaraka taminy koa i Lota. Ary 75 taona i Abrama tamin’izy niala tao Harana.', 'nandeha àry i abrama, araka izay efa nolazain’i jehovah taminy, ary niaraka taminy koa i lota. ary 75 taona i abrama tamin’izy niala tao harana.'),
  ('6aadc6e984be1105905e71ec', '2026-09-18T23:19:05.499Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:05.499Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 12, 6, 'dia namakivaky an’ilay tany i Abrama, ka tonga hatrany amin’ilay toerana atao hoe Sekema, teny akaikin’ireo hazobe tao More. Ny Kananita no nipetraka tao amin’ilay tany, tamin’izany fotoana izany.', 'dia namakivaky an’ilay tany i abrama, ka tonga hatrany amin’ilay toerana atao hoe sekema, teny akaikin’ireo hazobe tao more. ny kananita no nipetraka tao amin’ilay tany, tamin’izany fotoana izany.'),
  ('6aadc6e984be1105905e71f6', '2026-09-18T23:19:05.499Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:05.499Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 12, 16, 'Tsara fanahy tamin’i Abrama i Farao satria tiany i Saray. Koa nahazo ondry, omby, ampondralahy sy ampondravavy, mpanompolahy sy mpanompovavy, ary rameva i Abrama.', 'tsara fanahy tamin’i abrama i farao satria tiany i saray. koa nahazo ondry, omby, ampondralahy sy ampondravavy, mpanompolahy sy mpanompovavy, ary rameva i abrama.'),
  ('6aadc6e984be1105905e71eb', '2026-09-18T23:19:05.499Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:05.499Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 12, 5, 'Dia nentin’i Abrama i Saray vadiny sy Lota zana-drahalahiny ary ny fananana rehetra efa nangonin’izy ireo. Nentiny koa ny mpanompo rehetra azony tao Harana. Ary niainga izy ireo ka nankany Kanana. Rehefa tonga tany Kanana izy ireo,', 'dia nentin’i abrama i saray vadiny sy lota zana-drahalahiny ary ny fananana rehetra efa nangonin’izy ireo. nentiny koa ny mpanompo rehetra azony tao harana. ary niainga izy ireo ka nankany kanana. rehefa tonga tany kanana izy ireo,'),
  ('6aadc6e984be1105905e71f0', '2026-09-18T23:19:05.499Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:05.499Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 12, 10, 'Ary nisy mosary tao amin’ilay tany, ka nidina nankany Ejipta i Abrama mba hipetraka elaela tany. Mafy be mantsy ny mosary tao amin’ilay tany nisy azy.', 'ary nisy mosary tao amin’ilay tany, ka nidina nankany ejipta i abrama mba hipetraka elaela tany. mafy be mantsy ny mosary tao amin’ilay tany nisy azy.'),
  ('6aadc6e984be1105905e71ef', '2026-09-18T23:19:05.499Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:05.499Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 12, 9, 'Tatỳ aoriana, dia nifindra lasy i Abrama ka nankany Negeba. Nifindrafindra toby foana izy tamin’izany.', 'tatỳ aoriana, dia nifindra lasy i abrama ka nankany negeba. nifindrafindra toby foana izy tamin’izany.'),
  ('6aadc6e984be1105905e71f4', '2026-09-18T23:19:05.499Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:05.499Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 12, 14, 'Raha vao niditra tao Ejipta i Abrama, dia hitan’ny Ejipsianina fa tena tsara tarehy i Saray.', 'raha vao niditra tao ejipta i abrama, dia hitan’ny ejipsianina fa tena tsara tarehy i saray.'),
  ('6aadc6e984be1105905e71f5', '2026-09-18T23:19:05.499Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:05.499Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 12, 15, 'Nahita azy koa ireo olona ambony tao an-dapan’i Farao, ka niteny tamin’i Farao hoe tsara tarehy be ilay vehivavy. Nentina nankao an-tranon’i Farao àry izy.', 'nahita azy koa ireo olona ambony tao an-dapan’i farao, ka niteny tamin’i farao hoe tsara tarehy be ilay vehivavy. nentina nankao an-tranon’i farao àry izy.'),
  ('6aadc6e984be1105905e71fa', '2026-09-18T23:19:05.499Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:05.499Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 12, 20, 'Koa nomen’i Farao baiko ny mpanompony, dia nalefan’izy ireo i Abrama sy ny vadiny ary izay rehetra nananany.', 'koa nomen’i farao baiko ny mpanompony, dia nalefan’izy ireo i abrama sy ny vadiny ary izay rehetra nananany.'),
  ('6aadc6e984be1105905e71f2', '2026-09-18T23:19:05.499Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:05.499Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 12, 12, 'Rehefa mahita anao izao ny Ejipsianina, dia tsy maintsy hiteny hoe: ‘Io ny vadiny.’ Dia hovonoin-dry zareo aho, fa ianao kosa tsy hovonoiny.', 'rehefa mahita anao izao ny ejipsianina, dia tsy maintsy hiteny hoe: ‘io ny vadiny.’ dia hovonoin-dry zareo aho, fa ianao kosa tsy hovonoiny.'),
  ('6aadc6e984be1105905e71f3', '2026-09-18T23:19:05.499Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:05.499Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 12, 13, 'Mba teneno ange azafady hoe anabaviko ianao e! Amin’izay aho tsy hataon-dry zareo na inona na inona noho ny aminao, dia tsy hovonoiny.”', 'mba teneno ange azafady hoe anabaviko ianao e! amin’izay aho tsy hataon-dry zareo na inona na inona noho ny aminao, dia tsy hovonoiny.”'),
  ('6aadc6e984be1105905e71e9', '2026-09-18T23:19:05.499Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:05.499Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 12, 3, 'Hitahy an’izay mitso-drano anao aho, fa hanozona an’izay manozona anao. Ary amin’ny alalanao no tena hitahiana ny firenena rehetra eny ambonin’ny tany.”', 'hitahy an’izay mitso-drano anao aho, fa hanozona an’izay manozona anao. ary amin’ny alalanao no tena hitahiana ny firenena rehetra eny ambonin’ny tany.”'),
  ('6aadc6e984be1105905e71ed', '2026-09-18T23:19:05.499Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:05.499Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 12, 7, 'Ary niseho tamin’i Abrama i Jehovah, ka niteny hoe: “Ny taranakao no homeko an’ity tany ity.” Dia nanorina alitara teo i Abrama, ho an’i Jehovah, ilay niseho taminy.', 'ary niseho tamin’i abrama i jehovah, ka niteny hoe: “ny taranakao no homeko an’ity tany ity.” dia nanorina alitara teo i abrama, ho an’i jehovah, ilay niseho taminy.'),
  ('6aadc6eac6b26b2a845864c2', '2026-09-18T23:19:06.527Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:06.527Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 13, 16, 'Ary hataoko be dia be tahaka ny vovoka amin’ny tany ny taranakao. Raha misy mahavita manisa ny vovoka amin’ny tany, dia ho voaisa koa ny taranakao.', 'ary hataoko be dia be tahaka ny vovoka amin’ny tany ny taranakao. raha misy mahavita manisa ny vovoka amin’ny tany, dia ho voaisa koa ny taranakao.'),
  ('6aadc6eac6b26b2a845864be', '2026-09-18T23:19:06.527Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:06.527Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 13, 12, 'Ary nijanona tany Kanana i Abrama, fa i Lota kosa nipetraka teny amin’ireo tanànan’ny faritr’i Jordana. Tamin’ny farany, dia nanangana ny tranolainy teo akaikin’i Sodoma i Lota.', 'ary nijanona tany kanana i abrama, fa i lota kosa nipetraka teny amin’ireo tanànan’ny faritr’i jordana. tamin’ny farany, dia nanangana ny tranolainy teo akaikin’i sodoma i lota.'),
  ('6aadc6eac6b26b2a845864bb', '2026-09-18T23:19:06.527Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:06.527Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 13, 9, 'Afaka mifidy an’izay tianao hipetrahana eto amin’ity tany ity ianao. Fa aleo isika misaraka e! Raha miankavia ianao, dia izaho hiankavanana. Fa raha miankavanana kosa ianao, dia izaho hiankavia.”', 'afaka mifidy an’izay tianao hipetrahana eto amin’ity tany ity ianao. fa aleo isika misaraka e! raha miankavia ianao, dia izaho hiankavanana. fa raha miankavanana kosa ianao, dia izaho hiankavia.”'),
  ('6aadc6eac6b26b2a845864b4', '2026-09-18T23:19:06.527Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:06.527Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 13, 2, 'Nanana biby fiompy sy volafotsy ary volamena be dia be i Abrama tamin’izay.', 'nanana biby fiompy sy volafotsy ary volamena be dia be i abrama tamin’izay.'),
  ('6aadc6eac6b26b2a845864bd', '2026-09-18T23:19:06.527Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:06.527Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 13, 11, 'Nifidy ny faritr’i Jordana manontolo àry i Lota, ka nafindrany niantsinanana ny tobiny. Dia nisaraka izy mianaka.', 'nifidy ny faritr’i jordana manontolo àry i lota, ka nafindrany niantsinanana ny tobiny. dia nisaraka izy mianaka.'),
  ('6aadc6eac6b26b2a845864b7', '2026-09-18T23:19:06.527Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:06.527Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 13, 5, 'Nanana ondry sy omby ary tranolay koa i Lota, ilay niaraka tamin’i Abrama.', 'nanana ondry sy omby ary tranolay koa i lota, ilay niaraka tamin’i abrama.'),
  ('6aadc6eac6b26b2a845864c0', '2026-09-18T23:19:06.527Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:06.527Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 13, 14, 'Hoy i Jehovah tamin’i Abrama, rehefa nisaraka izy sy Lota: “Azafady ange e! Jereo avy eo amin’ny toerana misy anao eo ny manodidina, dia mijere mianavaratra sy mianatsimo sy miantsinanana ary miankandrefana.', 'hoy i jehovah tamin’i abrama, rehefa nisaraka izy sy lota: “azafady ange e! jereo avy eo amin’ny toerana misy anao eo ny manodidina, dia mijere mianavaratra sy mianatsimo sy miantsinanana ary miankandrefana.'),
  ('6aadc6eac6b26b2a845864bf', '2026-09-18T23:19:06.527Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:06.527Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 13, 13, 'Ratsy fanahy anefa ny olona tao Sodoma sady mpanota be teo imason’i Jehovah.', 'ratsy fanahy anefa ny olona tao sodoma sady mpanota be teo imason’i jehovah.'),
  ('6aadc6eac6b26b2a845864b6', '2026-09-18T23:19:06.527Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:06.527Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 13, 4, 'teo amin’ilay toerana nanorenany alitara. Ary niantso ny anaran’i Jehovah teo i Abrama.', 'teo amin’ilay toerana nanorenany alitara. ary niantso ny anaran’i jehovah teo i abrama.'),
  ('6aadc6eac6b26b2a845864b8', '2026-09-18T23:19:06.527Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:06.527Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 13, 6, 'Lasa tsy antonona azy rehetra àry ilay tany, satria lasa be dia be ny fananan’izy ireo, ka tsy afaka niara-nipetraka intsony izy ireo.', 'lasa tsy antonona azy rehetra àry ilay tany, satria lasa be dia be ny fananan’izy ireo, ka tsy afaka niara-nipetraka intsony izy ireo.'),
  ('6aadc6eac6b26b2a845864c3', '2026-09-18T23:19:06.527Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:06.527Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 13, 17, 'Mandehana àry mitety an’ilay tany amin’ny lavany sy ny sakany, satria ianao no homeko azy io.”', 'mandehana àry mitety an’ilay tany amin’ny lavany sy ny sakany, satria ianao no homeko azy io.”');
INSERT INTO "bible_verses" ("id", "created_date", "updated_date", "created_by_id", "created_by", "translation", "book", "bookOrder", "chapter", "verse", "text", "normalizedText") VALUES
  ('6aadc6eac6b26b2a845864b9', '2026-09-18T23:19:06.527Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:06.527Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 13, 7, 'Dia nifamaly be ny mpiandry ny biby fiompin’i Abrama sy ny an’i Lota.—Ny Kananita sy ny Perizita no nipetraka tao amin’ilay tany, tamin’izany fotoana izany.—', 'dia nifamaly be ny mpiandry ny biby fiompin’i abrama sy ny an’i lota.—ny kananita sy ny perizita no nipetraka tao amin’ilay tany, tamin’izany fotoana izany.—'),
  ('6aadc6eac6b26b2a845864c4', '2026-09-18T23:19:06.527Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:06.527Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 13, 18, 'Ary nipetraka tao anaty tranolay foana i Abrama. Tatỳ aoriana, dia tonga teo amin’ireo hazobe tao Mamre tany Hebrona izy, ka nonina teo. Ary nanorina alitara ho an’i Jehovah teo izy.', 'ary nipetraka tao anaty tranolay foana i abrama. tatỳ aoriana, dia tonga teo amin’ireo hazobe tao mamre tany hebrona izy, ka nonina teo. ary nanorina alitara ho an’i jehovah teo izy.'),
  ('6aadc6eac6b26b2a845864c1', '2026-09-18T23:19:06.527Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:06.527Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 13, 15, 'Fa homeko ho fanananao sy ny taranakao mandrakizay ireo tany rehetra tazanao ireo.', 'fa homeko ho fanananao sy ny taranakao mandrakizay ireo tany rehetra tazanao ireo.'),
  ('6aadc6eac6b26b2a845864b5', '2026-09-18T23:19:06.527Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:06.527Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 13, 3, 'Nifindrafindra toby izy teny an-dalana avy any Negeba nankany Betela, mandra-pahatongany teo amin’ilay toerana nasiany ny tranolainy taloha, teo anelanelan’i Betela sy Ay,', 'nifindrafindra toby izy teny an-dalana avy any negeba nankany betela, mandra-pahatongany teo amin’ilay toerana nasiany ny tranolainy taloha, teo anelanelan’i betela sy ay,'),
  ('6aadc6eac6b26b2a845864b3', '2026-09-18T23:19:06.527Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:06.527Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 13, 1, 'Niala tany Ejipta avy eo i Abrama sy ny vadiny, dia nentiny izay rehetra nananany. Niakatra nankany Negeba izy ireo, niaraka tamin’i Lota.', 'niala tany ejipta avy eo i abrama sy ny vadiny, dia nentiny izay rehetra nananany. niakatra nankany negeba izy ireo, niaraka tamin’i lota.'),
  ('6aadc6eac6b26b2a845864ba', '2026-09-18T23:19:06.527Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:06.527Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 13, 8, 'Dia hoy i Abrama tamin’i Lota: “Azafady re e! Tsy tokony hifamaly izaho sy ianao, na ny mpiandry ny biby fiompiko sy ny anao, fa mpirahalahy isika.', 'dia hoy i abrama tamin’i lota: “azafady re e! tsy tokony hifamaly izaho sy ianao, na ny mpiandry ny biby fiompiko sy ny anao, fa mpirahalahy isika.'),
  ('6aadc6eac6b26b2a845864bc', '2026-09-18T23:19:06.527Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:06.527Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 13, 10, 'Dia nitazana i Lota, ka hitany fa azon-drano tsara ny faritr’i Jordana manontolo hatrany Zoara, toy ilay zaridainan’i Jehovah, hoatran’i Ejipta. Azon-drano tsara ilay faritra talohan’ny nandravan’i Jehovah an’i Sodoma sy Gomora.', 'dia nitazana i lota, ka hitany fa azon-drano tsara ny faritr’i jordana manontolo hatrany zoara, toy ilay zaridainan’i jehovah, hoatran’i ejipta. azon-drano tsara ilay faritra talohan’ny nandravan’i jehovah an’i sodoma sy gomora.'),
  ('6aadc6ebb5eec3102394a984', '2026-09-18T23:19:07.012Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:07.012Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 14, 7, 'Dia niverina izy ireo ka tonga tao Ena-mispata, izany hoe Kadesy. Lasan’izy ireo ny faritra rehetra nisy ny Amalekita, ary resiny koa ny Amorita nipetraka tao Hazazona-tamara.', 'dia niverina izy ireo ka tonga tao ena-mispata, izany hoe kadesy. lasan’izy ireo ny faritra rehetra nisy ny amalekita, ary resiny koa ny amorita nipetraka tao hazazona-tamara.'),
  ('6aadc6ebb5eec3102394a993', '2026-09-18T23:19:07.012Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:07.012Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 14, 22, 'Hoy anefa i Abrama tamin’ny mpanjakan’i Sodoma: “Manangan-tanana aho sady mianiana amin’i Jehovah, ilay Andriamanitra Avo Indrindra, Mpanao ny lanitra sy ny tany,', 'hoy anefa i abrama tamin’ny mpanjakan’i sodoma: “manangan-tanana aho sady mianiana amin’i jehovah, ilay andriamanitra avo indrindra, mpanao ny lanitra sy ny tany,'),
  ('6aadc6ebb5eec3102394a98d', '2026-09-18T23:19:07.012Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:07.012Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 14, 16, 'Dia azony indray i Lota havany, ny fananan’i Lota, ny vehivavy, ary ny olon-kafa.', 'dia azony indray i lota havany, ny fananan’i lota, ny vehivavy, ary ny olon-kafa.'),
  ('6aadc6ebb5eec3102394a995', '2026-09-18T23:19:07.012Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:07.012Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 14, 24, 'Tsy mila na inona na inona aho, afa-tsy izay efa nohanin’ireo tovolahy niaraka tamiko ireo ihany. Fa ny anjaran’izay niaraka tamiko,—i Anera sy Eskola ary Mamre—dia aleo izy ireo ihany no haka azy.”', 'tsy mila na inona na inona aho, afa-tsy izay efa nohanin’ireo tovolahy niaraka tamiko ireo ihany. fa ny anjaran’izay niaraka tamiko,—i anera sy eskola ary mamre—dia aleo izy ireo ihany no haka azy.”'),
  ('6aadc6ebb5eec3102394a986', '2026-09-18T23:19:07.012Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:07.012Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 14, 9, 'izany hoe hiady tamin’i Kedorlaomera mpanjakan’i Elama, sy Tidala mpanjakan’i Goima, sy Amrafela mpanjakan’i Sinara, ary Arioka mpanjakan’i Elasara. Mpanjaka efatra no niady tamin’ny mpanjaka dimy.', 'izany hoe hiady tamin’i kedorlaomera mpanjakan’i elama, sy tidala mpanjakan’i goima, sy amrafela mpanjakan’i sinara, ary arioka mpanjakan’i elasara. mpanjaka efatra no niady tamin’ny mpanjaka dimy.'),
  ('6aadc6ebb5eec3102394a97f', '2026-09-18T23:19:07.012Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:07.012Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 14, 2, 'Niaraka ireo mpanjaka ireo ka niady tamin’i Bera mpanjakan’i Sodoma, Birsa mpanjakan’i Gomora, Sinaba mpanjakan’i Adma, Semebera mpanjakan’i Zeboima, ary ny mpanjakan’i Bela, izany hoe Zoara.', 'niaraka ireo mpanjaka ireo ka niady tamin’i bera mpanjakan’i sodoma, birsa mpanjakan’i gomora, sinaba mpanjakan’i adma, semebera mpanjakan’i zeboima, ary ny mpanjakan’i bela, izany hoe zoara.'),
  ('6aadc6ebb5eec3102394a991', '2026-09-18T23:19:07.012Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:07.012Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 14, 20, 'Ary hoderaina anie ilay Andriamanitra Avo Indrindra, Ilay nanolotra ny mpampijaly anao teo am-pelatananao!” Dia nomen’i Abrama azy ny ampahafolon’ny zava-drehetra azony.', 'ary hoderaina anie ilay andriamanitra avo indrindra, ilay nanolotra ny mpampijaly anao teo am-pelatananao!” dia nomen’i abrama azy ny ampahafolon’ny zava-drehetra azony.'),
  ('6aadc6ebb5eec3102394a98b', '2026-09-18T23:19:07.012Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:07.012Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 14, 14, 'Dia henon’i Abrama hoe lasa babo ilay havany. Nangoniny àry ireo lehilahy voaofana hiady, dia ny mpanompony 318 izay teraka tao aminy. Dia nenjehin’izy ireo hatrany Dana ireny mpanjaka ireny.', 'dia henon’i abrama hoe lasa babo ilay havany. nangoniny àry ireo lehilahy voaofana hiady, dia ny mpanompony 318 izay teraka tao aminy. dia nenjehin’izy ireo hatrany dana ireny mpanjaka ireny.'),
  ('6aadc6ebb5eec3102394a992', '2026-09-18T23:19:07.012Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:07.012Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 14, 21, 'Hoy ny mpanjakan’i Sodoma tamin’i Abrama, taorian’izay: “Omeo ahy ny olona, fa ny fananana alaivo ho anao.”', 'hoy ny mpanjakan’i sodoma tamin’i abrama, taorian’izay: “omeo ahy ny olona, fa ny fananana alaivo ho anao.”'),
  ('6aadc6ebb5eec3102394a981', '2026-09-18T23:19:07.012Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:07.012Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 14, 4, 'Nanompo an’i Kedorlaomera nandritra ny 12 taona mantsy ireo mpanjaka dimy ireo, saingy nikomy tamin’ny taona faha-13.', 'nanompo an’i kedorlaomera nandritra ny 12 taona mantsy ireo mpanjaka dimy ireo, saingy nikomy tamin’ny taona faha-13.'),
  ('6aadc6ebb5eec3102394a989', '2026-09-18T23:19:07.012Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:07.012Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 14, 12, 'Nentiny koa i Lota, ilay zana-drahalahin’i Abrama nipetraka tao Sodoma, niaraka tamin’ny fananany, ka nanohy ny diany izy ireo.', 'nentiny koa i lota, ilay zana-drahalahin’i abrama nipetraka tao sodoma, niaraka tamin’ny fananany, ka nanohy ny diany izy ireo.'),
  ('6aadc6ebb5eec3102394a983', '2026-09-18T23:19:07.012Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:07.012Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 14, 6, 'ary teny amin’ny tendrombohitr’i Seira hatrany Ela-parana, any an-tany efitra, ny Horita.', 'ary teny amin’ny tendrombohitr’i seira hatrany ela-parana, any an-tany efitra, ny horita.'),
  ('6aadc6ebb5eec3102394a98c', '2026-09-18T23:19:07.012Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:07.012Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 14, 15, 'Nozarazarainy ny mpanompony nandritra ny alina, dia nanafika izy ireo ka nandresy. Dia nenjehiny hatrany Hoba, tany avaratr’i Damaskosy, ny fahavalony.', 'nozarazarainy ny mpanompony nandritra ny alina, dia nanafika izy ireo ka nandresy. dia nenjehiny hatrany hoba, tany avaratr’i damaskosy, ny fahavalony.'),
  ('6aadc6ebb5eec3102394a987', '2026-09-18T23:19:07.012Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:07.012Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 14, 10, 'Ary feno lavaka godorao ny Lohasahan’i Sidima. Niezaka nandositra ny mpanjakan’i Sodoma sy ny mpanjakan’i Gomora, nefa latsaka tao anatin’ireny lavaka ireny. Ny mpanjaka sasany koa nandositra nankeny amin’ny faritra be tendrombohitra.', 'ary feno lavaka godorao ny lohasahan’i sidima. niezaka nandositra ny mpanjakan’i sodoma sy ny mpanjakan’i gomora, nefa latsaka tao anatin’ireny lavaka ireny. ny mpanjaka sasany koa nandositra nankeny amin’ny faritra be tendrombohitra.'),
  ('6aadc6ebb5eec3102394a990', '2026-09-18T23:19:07.012Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:07.012Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 14, 19, 'Dia nitso-drano azy izy hoe: “Enga anie i Abrama hotahin’ilay Andriamanitra Avo Indrindra, Dia ilay Mpanao ny lanitra sy ny tany!', 'dia nitso-drano azy izy hoe: “enga anie i abrama hotahin’ilay andriamanitra avo indrindra, dia ilay mpanao ny lanitra sy ny tany!'),
  ('6aadc6ebb5eec3102394a988', '2026-09-18T23:19:07.012Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:07.012Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 14, 11, 'Dia nalain’ireo mpanjaka nandresy ireo daholo ny fananan’i Sodoma sy Gomora sy ny sakafo rehetra tao, ka lasa izy ireo.', 'dia nalain’ireo mpanjaka nandresy ireo daholo ny fananan’i sodoma sy gomora sy ny sakafo rehetra tao, ka lasa izy ireo.'),
  ('6aadc6ebb5eec3102394a982', '2026-09-18T23:19:07.012Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:07.012Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 14, 5, 'Tamin’ny taona faha-14 àry, dia tonga i Kedorlaomera sy ny mpanjaka niaraka taminy, ka resin’izy ireo tao Asterota-karnaima ny Refaima, tao Hama ny Zozima, tao Save-kiriataima ny Emima,', 'tamin’ny taona faha-14 àry, dia tonga i kedorlaomera sy ny mpanjaka niaraka taminy, ka resin’izy ireo tao asterota-karnaima ny refaima, tao hama ny zozima, tao save-kiriataima ny emima,'),
  ('6aadc6ebb5eec3102394a98e', '2026-09-18T23:19:07.012Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:07.012Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 14, 17, 'Dia niverina i Abrama rehefa avy nandresy an’i Kedorlaomera sy ireo mpanjaka niaraka taminy. Tamin’izay ny mpanjakan’i Sodoma dia nivoaka hitsena an’i Abrama teo amin’ny Lohasahan’i Save, izany hoe ny Lohasahan’ny Mpanjaka.', 'dia niverina i abrama rehefa avy nandresy an’i kedorlaomera sy ireo mpanjaka niaraka taminy. tamin’izay ny mpanjakan’i sodoma dia nivoaka hitsena an’i abrama teo amin’ny lohasahan’i save, izany hoe ny lohasahan’ny mpanjaka.'),
  ('6aadc6ebb5eec3102394a985', '2026-09-18T23:19:07.012Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:07.012Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 14, 8, 'Tamin’izay dia niainga ny mpanjakan’i Sodoma, ny mpanjakan’i Gomora, ny mpanjakan’i Adma, ny mpanjakan’i Zeboima, ary ny mpanjakan’i Bela na Zoara, ka nilahatra hiady tamin’ireo teo amin’ny Lohasahan’i Sidima,', 'tamin’izay dia niainga ny mpanjakan’i sodoma, ny mpanjakan’i gomora, ny mpanjakan’i adma, ny mpanjakan’i zeboima, ary ny mpanjakan’i bela na zoara, ka nilahatra hiady tamin’ireo teo amin’ny lohasahan’i sidima,'),
  ('6aadc6ebb5eec3102394a980', '2026-09-18T23:19:07.012Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:07.012Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 14, 3, 'Nivondrona ny miaramilan’izy rehetra ireo teo amin’ny Lohasahan’i Sidima, izany hoe teo amin’ny Ranomasin-tsira.', 'nivondrona ny miaramilan’izy rehetra ireo teo amin’ny lohasahan’i sidima, izany hoe teo amin’ny ranomasin-tsira.'),
  ('6aadc6ebb5eec3102394a97e', '2026-09-18T23:19:07.012Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:07.012Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 14, 1, 'Izao no nitranga tamin’ny andron’i Amrafela mpanjakan’i Sinara, sy Arioka mpanjakan’i Elasara, sy Kedorlaomera mpanjakan’i Elama, ary Tidala mpanjakan’i Goima:', 'izao no nitranga tamin’ny andron’i amrafela mpanjakan’i sinara, sy arioka mpanjakan’i elasara, sy kedorlaomera mpanjakan’i elama, ary tidala mpanjakan’i goima:'),
  ('6aadc6ebb5eec3102394a98f', '2026-09-18T23:19:07.012Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:07.012Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 14, 18, 'Nitsena azy koa i Melkizedeka, mpanjakan’i Salema, sady nitondra mofo sy divay. Mpisoron’ilay Andriamanitra Avo Indrindra io Melkizedeka io.', 'nitsena azy koa i melkizedeka, mpanjakan’i salema, sady nitondra mofo sy divay. mpisoron’ilay andriamanitra avo indrindra io melkizedeka io.'),
  ('6aadc6ebb5eec3102394a98a', '2026-09-18T23:19:07.012Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:07.012Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 14, 13, 'Tafatsoaka anefa ny lehilahy iray, ka tonga nilaza an’izany tamin’i Abrama Hebreo. Nitoby tao amin’ilay faritra nisy an’ireo hazoben’i Mamre Amorita i Abrama tamin’izay. Rahalahin’i Eskola sy Anera io Mamre io, ary efa nifanaraka ireo lehilahy ireo sy Abrama hoe hifanampy.', 'tafatsoaka anefa ny lehilahy iray, ka tonga nilaza an’izany tamin’i abrama hebreo. nitoby tao amin’ilay faritra nisy an’ireo hazoben’i mamre amorita i abrama tamin’izay. rahalahin’i eskola sy anera io mamre io, ary efa nifanaraka ireo lehilahy ireo sy abrama hoe hifanampy.'),
  ('6aadc6ebb5eec3102394a994', '2026-09-18T23:19:07.012Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:07.012Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 14, 23, 'fa tsy haka na inona na inona amin’ny fanananao aho na dia kofehy iray na tadin-kapa iray aza. Sao mantsy ianao hilaza hoe: ‘Izaho no nampanan-karena an’i Abrama.’', 'fa tsy haka na inona na inona amin’ny fanananao aho na dia kofehy iray na tadin-kapa iray aza. sao mantsy ianao hilaza hoe: ‘izaho no nampanan-karena an’i abrama.’'),
  ('6aadc6ebf5cf5c4d93989cd5', '2026-09-18T23:19:07.371Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:07.371Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 15, 18, 'Dia nanao fifanekena tamin’i Abrama i Jehovah tamin’io andro io, hoe: “Ny taranakao no homeko an’ity tany ity, hatrany amin’ny reniranon’i Ejipta ka hatrany amin’ny reniranon’i Eofrata, ilay renirano lehibe.', 'dia nanao fifanekena tamin’i abrama i jehovah tamin’io andro io, hoe: “ny taranakao no homeko an’ity tany ity, hatrany amin’ny reniranon’i ejipta ka hatrany amin’ny reniranon’i eofrata, ilay renirano lehibe.'),
  ('6aadc6ebf5cf5c4d93989ccf', '2026-09-18T23:19:07.371Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:07.371Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 15, 12, 'Rehefa hilentika ny masoandro, dia renoky ny torimaso i Abrama. Dia nisy haizina nampahatahotra be nanarona azy.', 'rehefa hilentika ny masoandro, dia renoky ny torimaso i abrama. dia nisy haizina nampahatahotra be nanarona azy.'),
  ('6aadc6ebf5cf5c4d93989cd3', '2026-09-18T23:19:07.371Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:07.371Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 15, 16, 'Hiverina eto anefa ny taranakao amin’ny andron’ny zafiafiny, satria mbola tsy tafahoatra ny fahadisoan’ny Amorita.”', 'hiverina eto anefa ny taranakao amin’ny andron’ny zafiafiny, satria mbola tsy tafahoatra ny fahadisoan’ny amorita.”'),
  ('6aadc6ebf5cf5c4d93989cce', '2026-09-18T23:19:07.371Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:07.371Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 15, 11, 'Ary nidina nankeo amin’ny fatin’ireo biby ireo ny vorona mpihaza, nefa noroahin’i Abrama foana.', 'ary nidina nankeo amin’ny fatin’ireo biby ireo ny vorona mpihaza, nefa noroahin’i abrama foana.'),
  ('6aadc6ebf5cf5c4d93989ccb', '2026-09-18T23:19:07.371Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:07.371Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 15, 8, 'Dia hoy i Abrama: “Ry Jehovah Tompo Fara Tampony ô, ahoana no hahafantarako fa ho lasako ity tany ity?”', 'dia hoy i abrama: “ry jehovah tompo fara tampony ô, ahoana no hahafantarako fa ho lasako ity tany ity?”'),
  ('6aadc6ebf5cf5c4d93989cc6', '2026-09-18T23:19:07.371Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:07.371Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 15, 3, 'Hoy koa i Abrama: “Tsy nomenao taranaka aho, ka ny iray amin’ny mpanompoko no handova sy handimby ahy.”', 'hoy koa i abrama: “tsy nomenao taranaka aho, ka ny iray amin’ny mpanompoko no handova sy handimby ahy.”'),
  ('6aadc6ebf5cf5c4d93989cd1', '2026-09-18T23:19:07.371Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:07.371Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 15, 14, 'Hotsaraiko anefa ilay firenena hotompoin’izy ireo. Aorian’izay izy ireo dia hivoaka hitondra zava-tsoa be dia be.', 'hotsaraiko anefa ilay firenena hotompoin’izy ireo. aorian’izay izy ireo dia hivoaka hitondra zava-tsoa be dia be.'),
  ('6aadc6ebf5cf5c4d93989cca', '2026-09-18T23:19:07.371Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:07.371Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 15, 7, 'Hoy ihany izy taminy: “Izaho no Jehovah, ilay nitondra anao nivoaka avy tany Oran’ny Kaldeanina, mba hanome anao an’ity tany ity. Dia ho lasanao izy ity.”', 'hoy ihany izy taminy: “izaho no jehovah, ilay nitondra anao nivoaka avy tany oran’ny kaldeanina, mba hanome anao an’ity tany ity. dia ho lasanao izy ity.”'),
  ('6aadc6ebf5cf5c4d93989cc4', '2026-09-18T23:19:07.371Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:07.371Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 15, 1, 'Taorian’izany, dia niteny tamin’i Abrama tao amin’ny fahitana i Jehovah hoe: “Aza matahotra, ry Abrama. Izaho no ampinganao, ary hahazo valisoa lehibe ianao.”', 'taorian’izany, dia niteny tamin’i abrama tao amin’ny fahitana i jehovah hoe: “aza matahotra, ry abrama. izaho no ampinganao, ary hahazo valisoa lehibe ianao.”'),
  ('6aadc6ebf5cf5c4d93989cd4', '2026-09-18T23:19:07.371Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:07.371Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 15, 17, 'Rehefa nilentika ny masoandro ka lasa maizina be ny andro, dia nisy lafaoro midona-tsetroka nipoitra. Nisy fanilo mirehitra koa nandalo teo anelanelan’ireo biby nozaraina roa.', 'rehefa nilentika ny masoandro ka lasa maizina be ny andro, dia nisy lafaoro midona-tsetroka nipoitra. nisy fanilo mirehitra koa nandalo teo anelanelan’ireo biby nozaraina roa.'),
  ('6aadc6ebf5cf5c4d93989ccc', '2026-09-18T23:19:07.371Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:07.371Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 15, 9, 'Dia hoy izy taminy: “Itondray vantotr’ombivavy telo taona aho, dia osivavy telo taona, sy ondrilahy telo taona, sy domohina, ary zana-boromailala.”', 'dia hoy izy taminy: “itondray vantotr’ombivavy telo taona aho, dia osivavy telo taona, sy ondrilahy telo taona, sy domohina, ary zana-boromailala.”'),
  ('6aadc6ebf5cf5c4d93989cd6', '2026-09-18T23:19:07.371Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:07.371Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 15, 19, 'Ny tany homeko azy ireo dia ny tanin’ny Kenita sy ny Kenizita sy ny Kadmonita', 'ny tany homeko azy ireo dia ny tanin’ny kenita sy ny kenizita sy ny kadmonita'),
  ('6aadc6ebf5cf5c4d93989cd2', '2026-09-18T23:19:07.371Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:07.371Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 15, 15, 'Ianao kosa handeha amim-piadanana any amin’ny razambenao, ary ho tratrantitra ianao vao halevina.', 'ianao kosa handeha amim-piadanana any amin’ny razambenao, ary ho tratrantitra ianao vao halevina.'),
  ('6aadc6ebf5cf5c4d93989ccd', '2026-09-18T23:19:07.371Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:07.371Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 15, 10, 'Ary nalain’i Abrama daholo izany, dia nozarainy roa avy, ka ny ilany nataony teo amin’ny andaniny, ary ny ilany teo amin’ny ankilany. Ny vorona kosa tsy notetehiny.', 'ary nalain’i abrama daholo izany, dia nozarainy roa avy, ka ny ilany nataony teo amin’ny andaniny, ary ny ilany teo amin’ny ankilany. ny vorona kosa tsy notetehiny.'),
  ('6aadc6ebf5cf5c4d93989cc9', '2026-09-18T23:19:07.371Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:07.371Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 15, 6, 'Ary naneho finoana an’i Jehovah izy, ka nekeny hoe olo-marina.', 'ary naneho finoana an’i jehovah izy, ka nekeny hoe olo-marina.'),
  ('6aadc6ebf5cf5c4d93989cc8', '2026-09-18T23:19:07.371Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:07.371Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 15, 5, 'Dia nitondra azy nankeo ivelany izy, ka niteny hoe: “Mba jereo ange ny lanitra, azafady e! Dia isao ny kintana raha mahavita manisa azy ianao.” Hoy koa izy taminy: “Ho tahaka an’ireo ny taranakao.”', 'dia nitondra azy nankeo ivelany izy, ka niteny hoe: “mba jereo ange ny lanitra, azafady e! dia isao ny kintana raha mahavita manisa azy ianao.” hoy koa izy taminy: “ho tahaka an’ireo ny taranakao.”'),
  ('6aadc6ebf5cf5c4d93989cc7', '2026-09-18T23:19:07.371Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:07.371Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 15, 4, 'Hoy anefa i Jehovah taminy: “Tsy handova na handimby anao izany lehilahy izany, fa ny zanakao lahy mihitsy no handova sy handimby anao.”', 'hoy anefa i jehovah taminy: “tsy handova na handimby anao izany lehilahy izany, fa ny zanakao lahy mihitsy no handova sy handimby anao.”'),
  ('6aadc6ebf5cf5c4d93989cd8', '2026-09-18T23:19:07.371Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:07.371Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 15, 21, 'sy ny Amorita sy ny Kananita sy ny Girgasita ary ny Jebosita.”', 'sy ny amorita sy ny kananita sy ny girgasita ary ny jebosita.”'),
  ('6aadc6ebf5cf5c4d93989cd0', '2026-09-18T23:19:07.371Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:07.371Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 15, 13, 'Ary hoy Andriamanitra tamin’i Abrama: “Fantaro tsara fa ho vahiny any an-tanin’olona ny taranakao. Ary hataon’ny mponina any andevo ry zareo, ka hampijaliny 400 taona.', 'ary hoy andriamanitra tamin’i abrama: “fantaro tsara fa ho vahiny any an-tanin’olona ny taranakao. ary hataon’ny mponina any andevo ry zareo, ka hampijaliny 400 taona.'),
  ('6aadc6ebf5cf5c4d93989cd7', '2026-09-18T23:19:07.371Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:07.371Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 15, 20, 'sy ny Hetita sy ny Perizita sy ny Refaima', 'sy ny hetita sy ny perizita sy ny refaima'),
  ('6aadc6ebf5cf5c4d93989cc5', '2026-09-18T23:19:07.371Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:07.371Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 15, 2, 'Dia hoy i Abrama: “Ry Jehovah Tompo Fara Tampony ô, inona no homenao ahy? Izaho ity mbola tsy manan-janaka ihany, ka i Eliezera avy any Damaskosy no handova ny fananako.”', 'dia hoy i abrama: “ry jehovah tompo fara tampony ô, inona no homenao ahy? izaho ity mbola tsy manan-janaka ihany, ka i eliezera avy any damaskosy no handova ny fananako.”'),
  ('6aadc6ebab08c8304a5b277e', '2026-09-18T23:19:07.894Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:07.894Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 16, 6, 'Dia hoy i Abrama tamin’i Saray: “Ianao ange manam-pahefana amin’ny mpanompovavinao e! Ataovy aminy izay hitanao fa mety.” Dia nataon’i Saray afa-baraka i Hagara, ka lasa nandositra.', 'dia hoy i abrama tamin’i saray: “ianao ange manam-pahefana amin’ny mpanompovavinao e! ataovy aminy izay hitanao fa mety.” dia nataon’i saray afa-baraka i hagara, ka lasa nandositra.'),
  ('6aadc6ebab08c8304a5b2780', '2026-09-18T23:19:07.894Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:07.894Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 16, 8, 'Dia hoy ilay anjely: “Ry Hagara mpanompovavin’i Saray, avy taiza ianao, dia ho aiza?” Dia hoy izy: “Mitsoaka an’i Saray tompovaviko aho.”', 'dia hoy ilay anjely: “ry hagara mpanompovavin’i saray, avy taiza ianao, dia ho aiza?” dia hoy izy: “mitsoaka an’i saray tompovaviko aho.”'),
  ('6aadc6ebab08c8304a5b277c', '2026-09-18T23:19:07.894Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:07.894Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 16, 4, 'Dia nanao firaisana tamin’i Hagara i Abrama, ka bevohoka i Hagara. Rehefa fantatr’i Hagara anefa hoe bevohoka izy, dia nambanimbaniny ny tompovaviny.', 'dia nanao firaisana tamin’i hagara i abrama, ka bevohoka i hagara. rehefa fantatr’i hagara anefa hoe bevohoka izy, dia nambanimbaniny ny tompovaviny.'),
  ('6aadc6ebab08c8304a5b277a', '2026-09-18T23:19:07.894Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:07.894Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 16, 2, 'Dia hoy i Saray tamin’i Abrama: “Azafady ange ianao e! Tsy navelan’i Jehovah hanan-janaka aho. Koa mba manaova firaisana amin’ny mpanompovaviko, fa angamba hahazo zanaka avy aminy aho.” Dia nihaino an’i Saray i Abrama.', 'dia hoy i saray tamin’i abrama: “azafady ange ianao e! tsy navelan’i jehovah hanan-janaka aho. koa mba manaova firaisana amin’ny mpanompovaviko, fa angamba hahazo zanaka avy aminy aho.” dia nihaino an’i saray i abrama.'),
  ('6aadc6ebab08c8304a5b2779', '2026-09-18T23:19:07.894Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:07.894Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 16, 1, 'Ary tsy nanan-janaka i Saray vadin’i Abrama. Nanana mpanompovavy ejipsianina atao hoe Hagara anefa izy.', 'ary tsy nanan-janaka i saray vadin’i abrama. nanana mpanompovavy ejipsianina atao hoe hagara anefa izy.'),
  ('6aadc6ebab08c8304a5b277f', '2026-09-18T23:19:07.894Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:07.894Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 16, 7, 'Rehefa nandeha ny fotoana, dia hitan’ny anjelin’i Jehovah teo akaikin’ny loharano iray tany an-tany efitra i Hagara. Teo amin’ny lalana mankany Sora io loharano io.', 'rehefa nandeha ny fotoana, dia hitan’ny anjelin’i jehovah teo akaikin’ny loharano iray tany an-tany efitra i hagara. teo amin’ny lalana mankany sora io loharano io.'),
  ('6aadc6ebab08c8304a5b277d', '2026-09-18T23:19:07.894Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:07.894Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 16, 5, 'Dia hoy i Saray tamin’i Abrama: “Ianao ihany no nahatonga an’izao fijaliako izao! Izaho no nanome ny mpanompovaviko ho eo an-tratranao, nefa rehefa fantany fa bevohoka izy, dia nambanimbaniny aho. Aleo i Jehovah no hitsara hoe iza no diso, izaho sa ianao!”', 'dia hoy i saray tamin’i abrama: “ianao ihany no nahatonga an’izao fijaliako izao! izaho no nanome ny mpanompovaviko ho eo an-tratranao, nefa rehefa fantany fa bevohoka izy, dia nambanimbaniny aho. aleo i jehovah no hitsara hoe iza no diso, izaho sa ianao!”'),
  ('6aadc6ebab08c8304a5b277b', '2026-09-18T23:19:07.894Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:07.894Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 16, 3, 'Efa nipetraka folo taona tany Kanana i Abrama tamin’izay. Ary nalain’i Saray vadin’i Abrama i Hagara mpanompovaviny ejipsianina, ka nomeny ho vadin’i Abrama.', 'efa nipetraka folo taona tany kanana i abrama tamin’izay. ary nalain’i saray vadin’i abrama i hagara mpanompovaviny ejipsianina, ka nomeny ho vadin’i abrama.'),
  ('6aadc6ebab08c8304a5b2787', '2026-09-18T23:19:07.895Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:07.895Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 16, 15, 'Dia nitera-dahy tamin’i Abrama i Hagara, ka nataon’i Abrama hoe Ismaela ny anaran’ilay zanany naterak’i Hagara.', 'dia nitera-dahy tamin’i abrama i hagara, ka nataon’i abrama hoe ismaela ny anaran’ilay zanany naterak’i hagara.'),
  ('6aadc6ebab08c8304a5b2785', '2026-09-18T23:19:07.895Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:07.895Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 16, 13, 'Ary nantsoin’i Hagara ny anaran’i Jehovah, ilay niresaka taminy, dia hoy izy: “Andriamanitra mahita tokoa ianao!” Fa hoy izy: “Izaho ve dia tena nahita an’ilay mahita ahy tokoa, teto amin’ity toerana ity?”', 'ary nantsoin’i hagara ny anaran’i jehovah, ilay niresaka taminy, dia hoy izy: “andriamanitra mahita tokoa ianao!” fa hoy izy: “izaho ve dia tena nahita an’ilay mahita ahy tokoa, teto amin’ity toerana ity?”'),
  ('6aadc6ebab08c8304a5b2784', '2026-09-18T23:19:07.895Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:07.895Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 16, 12, 'Ho lasa hoatran’ny ampondradia izy. Hanohitra ny olona rehetra izy, ary ny olona rehetra kosa hanohitra azy. Hipetraka eny ampitan’ny rahalahiny rehetra izy.”', 'ho lasa hoatran’ny ampondradia izy. hanohitra ny olona rehetra izy, ary ny olona rehetra kosa hanohitra azy. hipetraka eny ampitan’ny rahalahiny rehetra izy.”'),
  ('6aadc6ebab08c8304a5b2782', '2026-09-18T23:19:07.895Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:07.895Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 16, 10, 'Hoy koa ilay anjelin’i Jehovah: “Hataoko lasa be dia be ny taranakao, ka tsy ho voaisa satria be loatra.”', 'hoy koa ilay anjelin’i jehovah: “hataoko lasa be dia be ny taranakao, ka tsy ho voaisa satria be loatra.”'),
  ('6aadc6ebab08c8304a5b2781', '2026-09-18T23:19:07.895Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:07.895Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 16, 9, 'Ary hoy ilay anjelin’i Jehovah taminy: “Miverena any amin’ny tompovavinao, dia manetre tena eo anatrehany.”', 'ary hoy ilay anjelin’i jehovah taminy: “miverena any amin’ny tompovavinao, dia manetre tena eo anatrehany.”'),
  ('6aadc6ebab08c8304a5b2783', '2026-09-18T23:19:07.895Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:07.895Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 16, 11, 'Hoy ihany ilay anjelin’i Jehovah: “Bevohoka ianao izao, dia ho tera-dahy. Ataovy hoe Ismaela ny anarany, fa efa henon’i Jehovah ny fahorianao.', 'hoy ihany ilay anjelin’i jehovah: “bevohoka ianao izao, dia ho tera-dahy. ataovy hoe ismaela ny anarany, fa efa henon’i jehovah ny fahorianao.'),
  ('6aadc6ebab08c8304a5b2786', '2026-09-18T23:19:07.895Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:07.895Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 16, 14, 'Izany no nahatonga an’ilay lavadrano hantsoina hoe Bera-lahai-roy. Eo anelanelan’i Kadesy sy Bareda izy io.', 'izany no nahatonga an’ilay lavadrano hantsoina hoe bera-lahai-roy. eo anelanelan’i kadesy sy bareda izy io.'),
  ('6aadc6ebab08c8304a5b2788', '2026-09-18T23:19:07.895Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:07.895Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 16, 16, 'Ary 86 taona i Abrama, tamin’i Hagara niteraka an’i Ismaela.', 'ary 86 taona i abrama, tamin’i hagara niteraka an’i ismaela.'),
  ('6aadc6ec64c668c1df51b840', '2026-09-18T23:19:08.464Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:08.464Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 17, 27, 'Noforana niaraka taminy koa ny lehilahy rehetra tao amin’ny ankohonany, dia izay teraka tao an-tranony sy izay novidim-bola tany amin’ny firenen-kafa.', 'noforana niaraka taminy koa ny lehilahy rehetra tao amin’ny ankohonany, dia izay teraka tao an-tranony sy izay novidim-bola tany amin’ny firenen-kafa.'),
  ('6aadc6ec64c668c1df51b83f', '2026-09-18T23:19:08.464Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:08.464Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 17, 26, 'Tamin’iny andro iny ihany i Abrahama sy Ismaela zanany dia noforana.', 'tamin’iny andro iny ihany i abrahama sy ismaela zanany dia noforana.'),
  ('6aadc6ec64c668c1df51b827', '2026-09-18T23:19:08.464Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:08.464Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 17, 2, 'Hanao fifanekena aminao aho, ka hataoko lasa be dia be mihitsy ny taranakao.”', 'hanao fifanekena aminao aho, ka hataoko lasa be dia be mihitsy ny taranakao.”'),
  ('6aadc6ec64c668c1df51b834', '2026-09-18T23:19:08.464Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:08.464Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 17, 15, 'Avy eo dia hoy Andriamanitra tamin’i Abrahama: “Aza atao hoe Saray intsony ny anaran’ i Saray vadinao, satria hatao hoe Saraha ny anarany.', 'avy eo dia hoy andriamanitra tamin’i abrahama: “aza atao hoe saray intsony ny anaran’ i saray vadinao, satria hatao hoe saraha ny anarany.'),
  ('6aadc6ec64c668c1df51b82b', '2026-09-18T23:19:08.464Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:08.464Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 17, 6, 'Hataoko be dia be mihitsy ny taranakao ka hataoko lasa firenena maro. Dia hisy mpanjaka maro hipoitra avy aminao.', 'hataoko be dia be mihitsy ny taranakao ka hataoko lasa firenena maro. dia hisy mpanjaka maro hipoitra avy aminao.'),
  ('6aadc6ec64c668c1df51b829', '2026-09-18T23:19:08.464Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:08.464Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 17, 4, '“Manao fifanekena aminao aho izao, dia tena ho lasa rain’ny firenena maro ianao.', '“manao fifanekena aminao aho izao, dia tena ho lasa rain’ny firenena maro ianao.'),
  ('6aadc6ec64c668c1df51b826', '2026-09-18T23:19:08.464Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:08.464Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 17, 1, 'Rehefa feno 99 taona i Abrama, dia niseho taminy i Jehovah ka niteny hoe: “Izaho no Andriamanitra Mahery Indrindra. Araho foana izay lazaiko aminao, dia asehoy hoe tsy misy tsiny ianao.', 'rehefa feno 99 taona i abrama, dia niseho taminy i jehovah ka niteny hoe: “izaho no andriamanitra mahery indrindra. araho foana izay lazaiko aminao, dia asehoy hoe tsy misy tsiny ianao.'),
  ('6aadc6ec64c668c1df51b839', '2026-09-18T23:19:08.464Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:08.464Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 17, 20, 'Efa henoko anefa izany teninao momba an’i Ismaela izany. Hotahiko koa izy, ka hataoko manan-taranaka sady hataoko lasa be dia be mihitsy ny taranany. Hiteraka mpiadidy 12 izy, ka hataoko lasa firenena lehibe.', 'efa henoko anefa izany teninao momba an’i ismaela izany. hotahiko koa izy, ka hataoko manan-taranaka sady hataoko lasa be dia be mihitsy ny taranany. hiteraka mpiadidy 12 izy, ka hataoko lasa firenena lehibe.'),
  ('6aadc6ec64c668c1df51b836', '2026-09-18T23:19:08.464Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:08.464Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 17, 17, 'Dia niankohoka i Abrahama, dia nihomehy sady niteny anakampo hoe: “Lehilahy efa 100 taona ve dia mbola hiteraka ihany? I Saraha koa izao vehivavy efa 90 taona, dia mbola hiteraka ihany ve?”', 'dia niankohoka i abrahama, dia nihomehy sady niteny anakampo hoe: “lehilahy efa 100 taona ve dia mbola hiteraka ihany? i saraha koa izao vehivavy efa 90 taona, dia mbola hiteraka ihany ve?”'),
  ('6aadc6ec64c668c1df51b828', '2026-09-18T23:19:08.464Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:08.464Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 17, 3, 'Dia niankohoka i Abrama, ary mbola niteny taminy Andriamanitra hoe:', 'dia niankohoka i abrama, ary mbola niteny taminy andriamanitra hoe:'),
  ('6aadc6ec64c668c1df51b838', '2026-09-18T23:19:08.464Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:08.464Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 17, 19, 'Dia hoy Andriamanitra: “Tena hitera-dahy ho anao tokoa i Saraha vadinao. Dia ataovy hoe Isaka ny anarany. Amin’i Isaka aho no hanao an’ilay fifanekena, dia ilay fifanekena mandrakizay hahasoa azy sy ny taranany handimby azy.', 'dia hoy andriamanitra: “tena hitera-dahy ho anao tokoa i saraha vadinao. dia ataovy hoe isaka ny anarany. amin’i isaka aho no hanao an’ilay fifanekena, dia ilay fifanekena mandrakizay hahasoa azy sy ny taranany handimby azy.'),
  ('6aadc6ec64c668c1df51b83c', '2026-09-18T23:19:08.464Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:08.464Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 17, 23, 'Ary nalain’i Abrahama i Ismaela zanany lahy sy ny lehilahy rehetra teraka tao an-tranony ary izay rehetra novidiny tamin’ny volany, izany hoe ny lehilahy rehetra tao amin’ny ankohonany, ka noforany tamin’iny andro iny ihany, araka izay nolazain’Andriamanitra taminy.', 'ary nalain’i abrahama i ismaela zanany lahy sy ny lehilahy rehetra teraka tao an-tranony ary izay rehetra novidiny tamin’ny volany, izany hoe ny lehilahy rehetra tao amin’ny ankohonany, ka noforany tamin’iny andro iny ihany, araka izay nolazain’andriamanitra taminy.'),
  ('6aadc6ec64c668c1df51b831', '2026-09-18T23:19:08.464Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:08.464Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 17, 12, 'Ary tsy maintsy forana ny zazalahy rehetra feno valo andro eo aminareo, hatramin’ny taranakareo fara aman-dimby, na teraka tao an-tranonao izy, na novidim-bola tany amin’ny firenen-kafa fa tsy anisan’ny taranakao.', 'ary tsy maintsy forana ny zazalahy rehetra feno valo andro eo aminareo, hatramin’ny taranakareo fara aman-dimby, na teraka tao an-tranonao izy, na novidim-bola tany amin’ny firenen-kafa fa tsy anisan’ny taranakao.'),
  ('6aadc6ec64c668c1df51b830', '2026-09-18T23:19:08.464Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:08.464Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 17, 11, 'Tsy maintsy forana ianareo. Izany no ho famantarana an’ilay fifanekena ataoko aminareo.', 'tsy maintsy forana ianareo. izany no ho famantarana an’ilay fifanekena ataoko aminareo.'),
  ('6aadc6ec64c668c1df51b82f', '2026-09-18T23:19:08.464Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:08.464Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 17, 10, 'Izao no fifanekena ataoko aminao, ka tokony hohajainao sy ny taranakao handimby anao: Tsy maintsy forana ny lahy rehetra eo aminareo.', 'izao no fifanekena ataoko aminao, ka tokony hohajainao sy ny taranakao handimby anao: tsy maintsy forana ny lahy rehetra eo aminareo.'),
  ('6aadc6ec64c668c1df51b82d', '2026-09-18T23:19:08.464Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:08.464Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 17, 8, 'Homeko anao sy ny taranakao handimby anao koa ilay tany ivahinianao, i Kanana manontolo, mba ho fanananareo mandrakizay. Dia ho Andriamanitr’izy ireo aho.”', 'homeko anao sy ny taranakao handimby anao koa ilay tany ivahinianao, i kanana manontolo, mba ho fanananareo mandrakizay. dia ho andriamanitr’izy ireo aho.”'),
  ('6aadc6ec64c668c1df51b837', '2026-09-18T23:19:08.464Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:08.464Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 17, 18, 'Hoy àry i Abrahama tamin’Andriamanitra: “Enga anie ka hotahinao i Ismaela!”', 'hoy àry i abrahama tamin’andriamanitra: “enga anie ka hotahinao i ismaela!”'),
  ('6aadc6ec64c668c1df51b833', '2026-09-18T23:19:08.464Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:08.464Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 17, 14, 'Raha misy lehilahy tsy noforana, dia tsy maintsy haringana tsy ho anisan’ny fireneny izy. Efa nivadika tamin’ny fifanekena nataoko mantsy izy.”', 'raha misy lehilahy tsy noforana, dia tsy maintsy haringana tsy ho anisan’ny fireneny izy. efa nivadika tamin’ny fifanekena nataoko mantsy izy.”'),
  ('6aadc6ec64c668c1df51b82c', '2026-09-18T23:19:08.464Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:08.464Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 17, 7, '“Hotanterahiko ny fifanekena ataoko aminao sy ny taranakao, izany hoe ny taranakao sy ny taranany rehetra mifandimby. Fifanekena mandrakizay izany, mba ho Andriamanitrao sy ny taranakao handimby anao aho.', '“hotanterahiko ny fifanekena ataoko aminao sy ny taranakao, izany hoe ny taranakao sy ny taranany rehetra mifandimby. fifanekena mandrakizay izany, mba ho andriamanitrao sy ny taranakao handimby anao aho.'),
  ('6aadc6ec64c668c1df51b835', '2026-09-18T23:19:08.464Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:08.464Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 17, 16, 'Hotahiko izy dia hiteraka zazalahy ho anao. Hotahiko izy ka hisy firenena be dia be sy mpanjakan’ny firenena maro hipoitra avy aminy.”', 'hotahiko izy dia hiteraka zazalahy ho anao. hotahiko izy ka hisy firenena be dia be sy mpanjakan’ny firenena maro hipoitra avy aminy.”'),
  ('6aadc6ec64c668c1df51b82a', '2026-09-18T23:19:08.464Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:08.464Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 17, 5, 'Tsy hatao hoe Abrama intsony ny anaranao, fa hovana hoe Abrahama, satria hataoko rain’ny firenena maro ianao.', 'tsy hatao hoe abrama intsony ny anaranao, fa hovana hoe abrahama, satria hataoko rain’ny firenena maro ianao.'),
  ('6aadc6ec64c668c1df51b83d', '2026-09-18T23:19:08.464Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:08.464Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 17, 24, 'Ary 99 taona i Abrahama tamin’izy noforana.', 'ary 99 taona i abrahama tamin’izy noforana.'),
  ('6aadc6ec64c668c1df51b83b', '2026-09-18T23:19:08.464Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:08.464Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 17, 22, 'Rehefa avy niresaka tamin’i Abrahama Andriamanitra, dia niala teo amin’i Abrahama.', 'rehefa avy niresaka tamin’i abrahama andriamanitra, dia niala teo amin’i abrahama.'),
  ('6aadc6ec64c668c1df51b83a', '2026-09-18T23:19:08.464Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:08.464Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 17, 21, 'Amin’i Isaka anefa aho no hanao an’ilay fifanekena, dia amin’ilay haterak’i Saraha aminao amin’ny herintaona hoatr’izao.”', 'amin’i isaka anefa aho no hanao an’ilay fifanekena, dia amin’ilay haterak’i saraha aminao amin’ny herintaona hoatr’izao.”'),
  ('6aadc6ec64c668c1df51b83e', '2026-09-18T23:19:08.464Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:08.464Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 17, 25, 'I Ismaela zanany kosa 13 taona tamin’izy noforana.', 'i ismaela zanany kosa 13 taona tamin’izy noforana.'),
  ('6aadc6ec64c668c1df51b832', '2026-09-18T23:19:08.464Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:08.464Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 17, 13, 'Tsy maintsy forana ny lehilahy rehetra teraka ao an-tranonao sy ny lehilahy rehetra novidinao tamin’ny volanao. Ho fifanekena maharitra ela be izany fifanekena ataoko momba ny famorana izany.', 'tsy maintsy forana ny lehilahy rehetra teraka ao an-tranonao sy ny lehilahy rehetra novidinao tamin’ny volanao. ho fifanekena maharitra ela be izany fifanekena ataoko momba ny famorana izany.'),
  ('6aadc6ec64c668c1df51b82e', '2026-09-18T23:19:08.464Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:08.464Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 17, 9, 'Hoy koa Andriamanitra tamin’i Abrahama: “Fa ianao indray, tokony hanaja ny fifanekena ataoko aminao ianao sy ny taranakao ary ny taranany rehetra mifandimby.', 'hoy koa andriamanitra tamin’i abrahama: “fa ianao indray, tokony hanaja ny fifanekena ataoko aminao ianao sy ny taranakao ary ny taranany rehetra mifandimby.'),
  ('6aadc6ecee477e29013d91c4', '2026-09-18T23:19:08.933Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:08.933Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 18, 28, 'Ary ahoana raha tsy ampy 50 ny olo-marina ao, fa latsaka dimy? Horavanao ve ilay tanàna manontolo, noho ireo olona dimy ireo?” Dia hoy izy: “Tsy horavako ilay izy, raha mahita 45 ao aho.”', 'ary ahoana raha tsy ampy 50 ny olo-marina ao, fa latsaka dimy? horavanao ve ilay tanàna manontolo, noho ireo olona dimy ireo?” dia hoy izy: “tsy horavako ilay izy, raha mahita 45 ao aho.”'),
  ('6aadc6ecee477e29013d91b1', '2026-09-18T23:19:08.933Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:08.933Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 18, 9, 'Hoy izy ireo taminy: “Fa aiza i Saraha vadinao?” Dia hoy izy: “Ao an-tranolay ao.”', 'hoy izy ireo taminy: “fa aiza i saraha vadinao?” dia hoy izy: “ao an-tranolay ao.”'),
  ('6aadc6ecee477e29013d91c8', '2026-09-18T23:19:08.933Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:08.933Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 18, 32, 'Farany, dia hoy i Abrahama: “Aza tezitra re, Jehovah ô, fa mba avelao aho hiteny farany. Ahoana raha folo fotsiny no hita ao?” Dia hoy izy: “Tsy handrava an’ilay tanàna aho raha mahita folo ao.”', 'farany, dia hoy i abrahama: “aza tezitra re, jehovah ô, fa mba avelao aho hiteny farany. ahoana raha folo fotsiny no hita ao?” dia hoy izy: “tsy handrava an’ilay tanàna aho raha mahita folo ao.”'),
  ('6aadc6ecee477e29013d91b5', '2026-09-18T23:19:08.933Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:08.933Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 18, 13, 'Dia hoy i Jehovah tamin’i Abrahama: “Fa maninona i Saraha no nihomehy sady niteny hoe: ‘Tena hiteraka tokoa ve aho, nefa izaho efa antitra?’', 'dia hoy i jehovah tamin’i abrahama: “fa maninona i saraha no nihomehy sady niteny hoe: ‘tena hiteraka tokoa ve aho, nefa izaho efa antitra?’'),
  ('6aadc6ecee477e29013d91c2', '2026-09-18T23:19:08.933Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:08.933Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 18, 26, 'Dia hoy i Jehovah: “Raha mahita olo-marina 50 ao amin’ny tanànan’i Sodoma aho, dia havelako daholo ny helok’ilay tanàna manontolo, noho ireo olo-marina ireo.”', 'dia hoy i jehovah: “raha mahita olo-marina 50 ao amin’ny tanànan’i sodoma aho, dia havelako daholo ny helok’ilay tanàna manontolo, noho ireo olo-marina ireo.”'),
  ('6aadc6ecee477e29013d91af', '2026-09-18T23:19:08.933Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:08.933Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 18, 7, 'Avy eo dia nihazakazaka nankany amin’ny andian’omby i Abrahama, ka nifidy omby mbola vantony sady tsara. Dia nomeny ny mpanompo ilay izy, ka lasa haingana ilay mpanompo nikarakara an’ilay izy.', 'avy eo dia nihazakazaka nankany amin’ny andian’omby i abrahama, ka nifidy omby mbola vantony sady tsara. dia nomeny ny mpanompo ilay izy, ka lasa haingana ilay mpanompo nikarakara an’ilay izy.'),
  ('6aadc6ecee477e29013d91c9', '2026-09-18T23:19:08.933Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:08.933Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 18, 33, 'Rehefa avy niresaka tamin’i Abrahama i Jehovah dia lasa, fa i Abrahama kosa nandeha nody.', 'rehefa avy niresaka tamin’i abrahama i jehovah dia lasa, fa i abrahama kosa nandeha nody.'),
  ('6aadc6ecee477e29013d91c7', '2026-09-18T23:19:08.933Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:08.933Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 18, 31, 'Fa mbola hoy ihany i Abrahama: “Efa sahy niresaka tamin’i Jehovah ihany aho. Ary raha 20 fotsiny no hita ao?” Dia hoy izy: “Tsy handrava an’ilay tanàna aho raha mahita 20 ao.”', 'fa mbola hoy ihany i abrahama: “efa sahy niresaka tamin’i jehovah ihany aho. ary raha 20 fotsiny no hita ao?” dia hoy izy: “tsy handrava an’ilay tanàna aho raha mahita 20 ao.”'),
  ('6aadc6ecee477e29013d91ae', '2026-09-18T23:19:08.933Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:08.933Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 18, 6, 'Dia lasa haingana i Abrahama nankao an-tranolay tao amin’i Saraha, ka niteny hoe: “Makà haingana lafarinina tsara toto intelon’ny famarana, dia volavolao ho koba, dia ataovy mofo.”', 'dia lasa haingana i abrahama nankao an-tranolay tao amin’i saraha, ka niteny hoe: “makà haingana lafarinina tsara toto intelon’ny famarana, dia volavolao ho koba, dia ataovy mofo.”'),
  ('6aadc6ecee477e29013d91ad', '2026-09-18T23:19:08.933Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:08.933Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 18, 5, 'Ianareo efa mba mankatỳ amin’ny mpanomponareo ihany, ka aleo aho mba haka mofo hohaninareo, mba hampody aina anareo. Dia mahazo mandeha ianareo avy eo.” Dia hoy izy ireo: “Hay! Ataovy àry e!”', 'ianareo efa mba mankatỳ amin’ny mpanomponareo ihany, ka aleo aho mba haka mofo hohaninareo, mba hampody aina anareo. dia mahazo mandeha ianareo avy eo.” dia hoy izy ireo: “hay! ataovy àry e!”'),
  ('6aadc6ecee477e29013d91c1', '2026-09-18T23:19:08.933Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:08.933Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 18, 25, 'Sanatria anao ny hamono ny olo-marina miaraka amin’ny ratsy fanahy, ka hoe hitovy ihany ny hiafaran’ny olo-marina sy ny ratsy fanahy! Sanatria anao ny hanao an’izany! Dia tsy hanao ny rariny ve ny Mpitsara ny tany manontolo?”', 'sanatria anao ny hamono ny olo-marina miaraka amin’ny ratsy fanahy, ka hoe hitovy ihany ny hiafaran’ny olo-marina sy ny ratsy fanahy! sanatria anao ny hanao an’izany! dia tsy hanao ny rariny ve ny mpitsara ny tany manontolo?”'),
  ('6aadc6ecee477e29013d91b2', '2026-09-18T23:19:08.933Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:08.933Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 18, 10, 'Ary niteny koa ny iray tamin’izy ireo hoe: “Hiverina atỳ aminao tokoa aho amin’ny herintaona hoatr’izao, ka hanan-janakalahy i Saraha vadinao.” I Saraha kosa tamin’izay nihaino teo amin’ny fidirana amin’ny tranolay, izay tao andamosin’ilay lehilahy.', 'ary niteny koa ny iray tamin’izy ireo hoe: “hiverina atỳ aminao tokoa aho amin’ny herintaona hoatr’izao, ka hanan-janakalahy i saraha vadinao.” i saraha kosa tamin’izay nihaino teo amin’ny fidirana amin’ny tranolay, izay tao andamosin’ilay lehilahy.'),
  ('6aadc6ecee477e29013d91bd', '2026-09-18T23:19:08.933Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:08.933Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 18, 21, 'Hidina mihitsy aho hijery raha tena hoatr’izany tokoa ny ataon’izy ireo, hoe marina na tsia ny fitarainana tonga atỳ amiko. Tiako ho fantatra mantsy izany.”', 'hidina mihitsy aho hijery raha tena hoatr’izany tokoa ny ataon’izy ireo, hoe marina na tsia ny fitarainana tonga atỳ amiko. tiako ho fantatra mantsy izany.”'),
  ('6aadc6ecee477e29013d91bb', '2026-09-18T23:19:08.933Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:08.933Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 18, 19, 'Efa fantatro tsara izy izao. Koa azoko antoka hoe hasainy manaraka ny lalan’i Jehovah ny ankohonany sy ny zanany handimby azy, ka hanao ny tsara sy hanao ny rariny. Amin’izay dia hotanterahin’i Jehovah amin’i Abrahama izay efa nampanantenainy momba azy.”', 'efa fantatro tsara izy izao. koa azoko antoka hoe hasainy manaraka ny lalan’i jehovah ny ankohonany sy ny zanany handimby azy, ka hanao ny tsara sy hanao ny rariny. amin’izay dia hotanterahin’i jehovah amin’i abrahama izay efa nampanantenainy momba azy.”'),
  ('6aadc6ecee477e29013d91b0', '2026-09-18T23:19:08.933Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:08.933Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 18, 8, 'Naka dibera sy ronono i Abrahama avy eo, ary nalainy koa ilay vantotr’omby efa nokarakarainy, ka narosony teo amin’izy telo lahy. Dia nijoro teo akaikin’izy ireo teo ambanin’ilay hazo izy, tamin’izy ireo nihinana.', 'naka dibera sy ronono i abrahama avy eo, ary nalainy koa ilay vantotr’omby efa nokarakarainy, ka narosony teo amin’izy telo lahy. dia nijoro teo akaikin’izy ireo teo ambanin’ilay hazo izy, tamin’izy ireo nihinana.'),
  ('6aadc6ecee477e29013d91ba', '2026-09-18T23:19:08.933Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:08.933Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 18, 18, 'Ho lasa firenena lehibe sy mahery mantsy i Abrahama, ary amin’ny alalany no hitahiana ny firenena rehetra eny ambonin’ny tany.', 'ho lasa firenena lehibe sy mahery mantsy i abrahama, ary amin’ny alalany no hitahiana ny firenena rehetra eny ambonin’ny tany.'),
  ('6aadc6ecee477e29013d91a9', '2026-09-18T23:19:08.933Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:08.933Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 18, 1, 'Taorian’izay, dia niseho tamin’i Abrahama teo amin’ireo hazobe tao Mamre i Jehovah. Nipetraka teo amin’ny fidirana amin’ny tranolainy i Abrahama tamin’izay, rehefa tena nahamay be iny ny andro.', 'taorian’izay, dia niseho tamin’i abrahama teo amin’ireo hazobe tao mamre i jehovah. nipetraka teo amin’ny fidirana amin’ny tranolainy i abrahama tamin’izay, rehefa tena nahamay be iny ny andro.'),
  ('6aadc6ecee477e29013d91b9', '2026-09-18T23:19:08.933Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:08.933Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 18, 17, 'Ary hoy i Jehovah: “Dia hafeniko amin’i Abrahama ve ny zavatra hataoko?', 'ary hoy i jehovah: “dia hafeniko amin’i abrahama ve ny zavatra hataoko?'),
  ('6aadc6ecee477e29013d91bf', '2026-09-18T23:19:08.933Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:08.933Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 18, 23, 'Ary nanatona i Abrahama ka niteny hoe: “Dia haringanao miaraka amin’ny ratsy fanahy tokoa ve ny olo-marina?', 'ary nanatona i abrahama ka niteny hoe: “dia haringanao miaraka amin’ny ratsy fanahy tokoa ve ny olo-marina?'),
  ('6aadc6ecee477e29013d91ab', '2026-09-18T23:19:08.933Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:08.933Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 18, 3, 'Dia hoy izy: “Raha ankasitrahanao aho, Jehovah ô, dia aza andalovana fotsiny re ny mpanomponao e!', 'dia hoy izy: “raha ankasitrahanao aho, jehovah ô, dia aza andalovana fotsiny re ny mpanomponao e!'),
  ('6aadc6ecee477e29013d91b8', '2026-09-18T23:19:08.933Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:08.933Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 18, 16, 'Dia nitsangana ireo lehilahy ireo avy eo ka niala teo, dia nitazana an’i Sodoma. Niaraka taminy koa i Abrahama mba hanatitra azy.', 'dia nitsangana ireo lehilahy ireo avy eo ka niala teo, dia nitazana an’i sodoma. niaraka taminy koa i abrahama mba hanatitra azy.'),
  ('6aadc6ecee477e29013d91b4', '2026-09-18T23:19:08.933Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:08.933Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 18, 12, 'Koa nihomehy anakampo i Saraha nanao hoe: “Izaho efa antitra ity ve dia mbola ho faly ihany fa hiteraka? Sady ny tompoko koa aza efa antitra!”', 'koa nihomehy anakampo i saraha nanao hoe: “izaho efa antitra ity ve dia mbola ho faly ihany fa hiteraka? sady ny tompoko koa aza efa antitra!”'),
  ('6aadc6ecee477e29013d91c3', '2026-09-18T23:19:08.933Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:08.933Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 18, 27, 'Hoy indray anefa i Abrahama: “Azafady re e! Efa sahy niresaka tamin’i Jehovah ihany aho, na dia vovoka sy lavenona aza.', 'hoy indray anefa i abrahama: “azafady re e! efa sahy niresaka tamin’i jehovah ihany aho, na dia vovoka sy lavenona aza.'),
  ('6aadc6ecee477e29013d91ac', '2026-09-18T23:19:08.933Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:08.933Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 18, 4, 'Ao re mba hitondrana rano kely ianareo, dia hosasana ny tongotrareo e! Dia eo ambanin’ny hazo eo ianareo mitsotsotra rehefa avy eo.', 'ao re mba hitondrana rano kely ianareo, dia hosasana ny tongotrareo e! dia eo ambanin’ny hazo eo ianareo mitsotsotra rehefa avy eo.'),
  ('6aadc6ecee477e29013d91bc', '2026-09-18T23:19:08.933Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:08.933Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 18, 20, 'Hoy ihany i Jehovah: “Tena be loatra ny fitarainana henoko momba an’i Sodoma sy Gomora, ary tafahoatra loatra ny fahotan’izy ireo.', 'hoy ihany i jehovah: “tena be loatra ny fitarainana henoko momba an’i sodoma sy gomora, ary tafahoatra loatra ny fahotan’izy ireo.'),
  ('6aadc6ecee477e29013d91c5', '2026-09-18T23:19:08.933Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:08.933Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 18, 29, 'Hoy indray anefa i Abrahama: “Ary raha 40 no hita ao?” Dia hoy izy: “Tsy hanao an’izany aho raha mahita 40 ao.”', 'hoy indray anefa i abrahama: “ary raha 40 no hita ao?” dia hoy izy: “tsy hanao an’izany aho raha mahita 40 ao.”'),
  ('6aadc6ecee477e29013d91be', '2026-09-18T23:19:08.933Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:08.933Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 18, 22, 'Dia niala teo ireo lehilahy ireo ka lasa nankany Sodoma. Fa i Jehovah kosa mbola nijanona niaraka tamin’i Abrahama.', 'dia niala teo ireo lehilahy ireo ka lasa nankany sodoma. fa i jehovah kosa mbola nijanona niaraka tamin’i abrahama.'),
  ('6aadc6ecee477e29013d91aa', '2026-09-18T23:19:08.933Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:08.933Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 18, 2, 'Dia nitraka izy ka nahita lehilahy telo nijoro terỳ lavidavitra terỳ. Rehefa nahita azy ireo izy, dia nihazakazaka avy teo amin’ny fidirana amin’ny tranolainy mba hitsena azy, ka niankohoka tamin’ny tany.', 'dia nitraka izy ka nahita lehilahy telo nijoro terỳ lavidavitra terỳ. rehefa nahita azy ireo izy, dia nihazakazaka avy teo amin’ny fidirana amin’ny tranolainy mba hitsena azy, ka niankohoka tamin’ny tany.'),
  ('6aadc6ecee477e29013d91c6', '2026-09-18T23:19:08.933Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:08.933Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 18, 30, 'Mbola niteny ihany i Abrahama hoe: “Aza tezitra re, Jehovah ô, fa mba avelao aho hiteny ihany. Ahoana raha 30 fotsiny no hita ao?” Dia hoy izy: “Tsy hanao an’izany aho raha mahita 30 ao.”', 'mbola niteny ihany i abrahama hoe: “aza tezitra re, jehovah ô, fa mba avelao aho hiteny ihany. ahoana raha 30 fotsiny no hita ao?” dia hoy izy: “tsy hanao an’izany aho raha mahita 30 ao.”'),
  ('6aadc6ecee477e29013d91c0', '2026-09-18T23:19:08.933Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:08.933Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 18, 24, 'Ahoana raha misy olo-marina 50 ao amin’io tanàna io? Dia haringanao daholo ve izy ireo ka tsy havelanao ny helok’ilay tanàna, nefa misy an’ireo olo-marina 50 ireo ao?', 'ahoana raha misy olo-marina 50 ao amin’io tanàna io? dia haringanao daholo ve izy ireo ka tsy havelanao ny helok’ilay tanàna, nefa misy an’ireo olo-marina 50 ireo ao?'),
  ('6aadc6ecee477e29013d91b7', '2026-09-18T23:19:08.933Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:08.933Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 18, 15, 'Nanda anefa i Saraha hoe: “Tsy nihomehy izany aho!” Natahotra mantsy izy. Dia hoy ilay anjely: “Tena nihomehy ianao ka!”', 'nanda anefa i saraha hoe: “tsy nihomehy izany aho!” natahotra mantsy izy. dia hoy ilay anjely: “tena nihomehy ianao ka!”'),
  ('6aadc6ecee477e29013d91b6', '2026-09-18T23:19:08.933Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:08.933Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 18, 14, 'Angaha misy zava-mahagaga tsy vitan’i Jehovah? Hiverina atỳ aminao aho amin’ny herintaona hoatr’izao, ka hanan-janakalahy i Saraha.”', 'angaha misy zava-mahagaga tsy vitan’i jehovah? hiverina atỳ aminao aho amin’ny herintaona hoatr’izao, ka hanan-janakalahy i saraha.”'),
  ('6aadc6ecee477e29013d91b3', '2026-09-18T23:19:08.933Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:08.933Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 18, 11, 'Ary efa antitra sady be taona i Abrahama sy Saraha. Efa antitra i Saraha ka tsy afaka niteraka intsony.', 'ary efa antitra sady be taona i abrahama sy saraha. efa antitra i saraha ka tsy afaka niteraka intsony.'),
  ('6aadc6ed3d9a0dd2422fde8c', '2026-09-18T23:19:09.616Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:09.616Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 19, 13, 'Fa handeha handrava an’ity toerana ity izahay, satria efa be loatra ny fitarainana momba azy tonga eo anatrehan’i Jehovah. Dia nirahin’i Jehovah handrava an’ity tanàna ity izahay.”', 'fa handeha handrava an’ity toerana ity izahay, satria efa be loatra ny fitarainana momba azy tonga eo anatrehan’i jehovah. dia nirahin’i jehovah handrava an’ity tanàna ity izahay.”'),
  ('6aadc6ed3d9a0dd2422fde97', '2026-09-18T23:19:09.616Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:09.616Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 19, 24, 'Avy eo dia nandefa solifara sy afo i Jehovah, ka nalatsany toy ny orana teo amin’i Sodoma sy Gomora ilay izy. Avy tamin’i Jehovah avy any an-danitra izany.', 'avy eo dia nandefa solifara sy afo i jehovah, ka nalatsany toy ny orana teo amin’i sodoma sy gomora ilay izy. avy tamin’i jehovah avy any an-danitra izany.'),
  ('6aadc6ed3d9a0dd2422fdea4', '2026-09-18T23:19:09.616Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:09.617Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 19, 37, 'Tera-dahy ilay vavimatoa, ka nataony hoe Moaba ny anarany. Izy io no rain’ireo Moabita amin’izao andro izao ireo.', 'tera-dahy ilay vavimatoa, ka nataony hoe moaba ny anarany. izy io no rain’ireo moabita amin’izao andro izao ireo.'),
  ('6aadc6ed3d9a0dd2422fdea1', '2026-09-18T23:19:09.616Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:09.616Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 19, 34, 'Ny ampitson’iny indray, dia hoy ny vavimatoa tamin’ny zandriny: “Efa nanao firaisana tamin’i Dada aho halina. Andao hampisotrointsika divay indray izy androany alina. Dia midira ianao ka manaova firaisana aminy, mba tsy ho lany taranaka ny raintsika.”', 'ny ampitson’iny indray, dia hoy ny vavimatoa tamin’ny zandriny: “efa nanao firaisana tamin’i dada aho halina. andao hampisotrointsika divay indray izy androany alina. dia midira ianao ka manaova firaisana aminy, mba tsy ho lany taranaka ny raintsika.”'),
  ('6aadc6ed3d9a0dd2422fde90', '2026-09-18T23:19:09.616Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:09.616Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 19, 17, 'Vao tongan’izy roa lahy teo an-tsisin’ny tanàna izy ireo, dia hoy ny iray tamin’izy roa lahy: “Mandosira, dia amin’izay ho voavonjy ny ainao! Aza mitodika any aoriana, ary aza mijanona na aiza na aiza etỳ amin’ny faritr’i Jordana! Mandosira any amin’ny faritra be tendrombohitra, sao ho faty ianao!”', 'vao tongan’izy roa lahy teo an-tsisin’ny tanàna izy ireo, dia hoy ny iray tamin’izy roa lahy: “mandosira, dia amin’izay ho voavonjy ny ainao! aza mitodika any aoriana, ary aza mijanona na aiza na aiza etỳ amin’ny faritr’i jordana! mandosira any amin’ny faritra be tendrombohitra, sao ho faty ianao!”'),
  ('6aadc6ed3d9a0dd2422fde8d', '2026-09-18T23:19:09.616Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:09.616Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 19, 14, 'Dia lasa i Lota niresaka tamin’ireo vinantolahiny izay efa hanambady ny zanany vavy. Dia hoy foana izy hoe: “Andao haingana hiala eto amin’ity toerana ity, fa horavan’i Jehovah ity tanàna ity!” Noheverin’ny vinantolahiny fa nivazivazy anefa izy.', 'dia lasa i lota niresaka tamin’ireo vinantolahiny izay efa hanambady ny zanany vavy. dia hoy foana izy hoe: “andao haingana hiala eto amin’ity toerana ity, fa horavan’i jehovah ity tanàna ity!” noheverin’ny vinantolahiny fa nivazivazy anefa izy.'),
  ('6aadc6ed3d9a0dd2422fde88', '2026-09-18T23:19:09.616Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:09.616Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 19, 9, 'Dia hoy ireo: “Mialà teo ialahy e!” Hoy koa ireo: “Vahiny manirery atỳ an-tanin’olona atỳ ilay rangahy io, nefa miseho mitsaratsara antsika! Mbola ho ratsy kokoa noho ny hataonay amin-dry zareo no hataonay amin’ialahy!” Dia nanosika mafy an’i Lota izy ireo ka nisesika hamaky ny varavarana.', 'dia hoy ireo: “mialà teo ialahy e!” hoy koa ireo: “vahiny manirery atỳ an-tanin’olona atỳ ilay rangahy io, nefa miseho mitsaratsara antsika! mbola ho ratsy kokoa noho ny hataonay amin-dry zareo no hataonay amin’ialahy!” dia nanosika mafy an’i lota izy ireo ka nisesika hamaky ny varavarana.'),
  ('6aadc6ed3d9a0dd2422fde95', '2026-09-18T23:19:09.616Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:09.616Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 19, 22, 'Mandehana haingana mandositra ao, fa tsy afaka manao na inona na inona aho mandra-pahatonganao ao!” Izany no nahatonga azy hiantso an’ilay tanàna hoe Zoara.', 'mandehana haingana mandositra ao, fa tsy afaka manao na inona na inona aho mandra-pahatonganao ao!” izany no nahatonga azy hiantso an’ilay tanàna hoe zoara.'),
  ('6aadc6ed3d9a0dd2422fde94', '2026-09-18T23:19:09.616Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:09.616Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 19, 21, 'Dia hoy izy taminy: “Eny àry! Noho ianao dia tsy horavako io tanàna resahinao io.', 'dia hoy izy taminy: “eny àry! noho ianao dia tsy horavako io tanàna resahinao io.'),
  ('6aadc6ed3d9a0dd2422fde8f', '2026-09-18T23:19:09.616Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:09.616Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 19, 16, 'Mbola nitaraikiraiky teo anefa i Lota, ka nosintonin’izy roa lahy tamin’ny tanany izy sy ny vadiny ary ny zanany roa vavy. Nangoraka azy mantsy i Jehovah. Dia naterin’izy roa lahy teo ivelan’ny tanàna izy.', 'mbola nitaraikiraiky teo anefa i lota, ka nosintonin’izy roa lahy tamin’ny tanany izy sy ny vadiny ary ny zanany roa vavy. nangoraka azy mantsy i jehovah. dia naterin’izy roa lahy teo ivelan’ny tanàna izy.'),
  ('6aadc6ed3d9a0dd2422fde86', '2026-09-18T23:19:09.616Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:09.616Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 19, 7, 'Ary hoy izy: “Miangavy anareo re aho, ry rahalahiko, mba aza manao ratsy re e!', 'ary hoy izy: “miangavy anareo re aho, ry rahalahiko, mba aza manao ratsy re e!'),
  ('6aadc6ed3d9a0dd2422fde8e', '2026-09-18T23:19:09.616Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:09.616Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 19, 15, 'Rehefa nazava ratsy ny andro, dia nododosin’ireo anjely i Lota, ka hoy izy ireo: “Ento haingana ny vadinao sy ireo zanakao roa vavy ireo, sao ho faty ianao rehefa ravana ity tanàna ity noho ny fahadisoany!”', 'rehefa nazava ratsy ny andro, dia nododosin’ireo anjely i lota, ka hoy izy ireo: “ento haingana ny vadinao sy ireo zanakao roa vavy ireo, sao ho faty ianao rehefa ravana ity tanàna ity noho ny fahadisoany!”'),
  ('6aadc6ed3d9a0dd2422fde84', '2026-09-18T23:19:09.616Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:09.616Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 19, 5, 'Ary nitabataba tamin’i Lota foana izy ireo hoe: “Aiza ireny lehilahy tonga tato aminao androany alina ireny? Avoahy atỳ aminay ireny hanaovanay firaisana.”', 'ary nitabataba tamin’i lota foana izy ireo hoe: “aiza ireny lehilahy tonga tato aminao androany alina ireny? avoahy atỳ aminay ireny hanaovanay firaisana.”'),
  ('6aadc6ed3d9a0dd2422fde82', '2026-09-18T23:19:09.616Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:09.616Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 19, 3, 'Nisisika ihany anefa i Lota, ka niaraka taminy nankany an-tranony izy ireo. Ary nanao sakafo be ho azy ireo izy, sady nanao mofo tsy misy lalivay. Dia nihinana izy ireo.', 'nisisika ihany anefa i lota, ka niaraka taminy nankany an-tranony izy ireo. ary nanao sakafo be ho azy ireo izy, sady nanao mofo tsy misy lalivay. dia nihinana izy ireo.'),
  ('6aadc6ed3d9a0dd2422fde99', '2026-09-18T23:19:09.616Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:09.616Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 19, 26, 'Niherika anefa ny vadin’i Lota tao aorianany, ka lasa vongan-tsira mitsangana.', 'niherika anefa ny vadin’i lota tao aorianany, ka lasa vongan-tsira mitsangana.'),
  ('6aadc6ed3d9a0dd2422fde91', '2026-09-18T23:19:09.616Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:09.616Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 19, 18, 'Dia hoy i Lota tamin’izy ireo: “Aleo re izaho tsy ho any, Jehovah ô!', 'dia hoy i lota tamin’izy ireo: “aleo re izaho tsy ho any, jehovah ô!'),
  ('6aadc6ed3d9a0dd2422fde8a', '2026-09-18T23:19:09.616Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:09.616Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 19, 11, 'Ireo lehilahy teo am-baravarana kosa nataony jamba, hatramin’ny kely indrindra ka hatramin’ny lehibe indrindra, ka reraka fotsiny izy ireo nitady fa tsy hitany mihitsy ny varavarana.', 'ireo lehilahy teo am-baravarana kosa nataony jamba, hatramin’ny kely indrindra ka hatramin’ny lehibe indrindra, ka reraka fotsiny izy ireo nitady fa tsy hitany mihitsy ny varavarana.'),
  ('6aadc6ed3d9a0dd2422fde85', '2026-09-18T23:19:09.616Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:09.616Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 19, 6, 'Dia nivoaka nankeo amin’izy ireo teo am-baravarana i Lota sady nohidiany ny varavarana.', 'dia nivoaka nankeo amin’izy ireo teo am-baravarana i lota sady nohidiany ny varavarana.'),
  ('6aadc6ed3d9a0dd2422fde83', '2026-09-18T23:19:09.616Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:09.616Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 19, 4, 'Raha mbola tsy natory anefa izy ireo, dia nitangorona nanodidina an’ilay trano ny lehilahy rehetra tao an-tanànan’i Sodoma, hatramin’ny ankizilahikely ka hatramin’ny lahiantitra, ka nila ady tamin’izy ireo.', 'raha mbola tsy natory anefa izy ireo, dia nitangorona nanodidina an’ilay trano ny lehilahy rehetra tao an-tanànan’i sodoma, hatramin’ny ankizilahikely ka hatramin’ny lahiantitra, ka nila ady tamin’izy ireo.'),
  ('6aadc6ed3d9a0dd2422fde9b', '2026-09-18T23:19:09.616Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:09.616Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 19, 28, 'Dia nitazana an’i Sodoma sy Gomora ary ilay faritr’i Jordana manontolo izy, ka nahita setroka be niakatra avy teo amin’ilay tany, toy ny setroky ny lafaoro fandoroana biriky.', 'dia nitazana an’i sodoma sy gomora ary ilay faritr’i jordana manontolo izy, ka nahita setroka be niakatra avy teo amin’ilay tany, toy ny setroky ny lafaoro fandoroana biriky.'),
  ('6aadc6ed3d9a0dd2422fde96', '2026-09-18T23:19:09.616Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:09.616Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 19, 23, 'Efa niposaka teo amin’ilay faritra ny masoandro, rehefa tonga tao Zoara i Lota.', 'efa niposaka teo amin’ilay faritra ny masoandro, rehefa tonga tao zoara i lota.'),
  ('6aadc6ed3d9a0dd2422fde92', '2026-09-18T23:19:09.616Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:09.616Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 19, 19, 'Azafady re e! Efa mba nankasitrahanao ihany ny mpanomponao, sady tena tsara fanahy amiko ianao ka namonjy ny aiko. Tsy vitako anefa ny mandositra mankeny amin’ny faritra be tendrombohitra, satria matahotra aho sao ho tratran’ny loza dia ho faty.', 'azafady re e! efa mba nankasitrahanao ihany ny mpanomponao, sady tena tsara fanahy amiko ianao ka namonjy ny aiko. tsy vitako anefa ny mandositra mankeny amin’ny faritra be tendrombohitra, satria matahotra aho sao ho tratran’ny loza dia ho faty.'),
  ('6aadc6ed3d9a0dd2422fdea3', '2026-09-18T23:19:09.616Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:09.616Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 19, 36, 'Dia samy bevohokan’i Lota ny zanany roa vavy.', 'dia samy bevohokan’i lota ny zanany roa vavy.'),
  ('6aadc6ed3d9a0dd2422fde93', '2026-09-18T23:19:09.616Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:09.616Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 19, 20, 'Azafady re e! Mba akaikikaiky irỳ tanàna irỳ, ka vitako ny mandositra mankeny. Toerana kely koa io. Mahazo mandositra eny ve aho, azafady? Tanàna kely ange io e! Dia amin’izay aho tsy ho faty.”', 'azafady re e! mba akaikikaiky irỳ tanàna irỳ, ka vitako ny mandositra mankeny. toerana kely koa io. mahazo mandositra eny ve aho, azafady? tanàna kely ange io e! dia amin’izay aho tsy ho faty.”'),
  ('6aadc6ed3d9a0dd2422fde81', '2026-09-18T23:19:09.616Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:09.616Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 19, 2, 'Hoy izy: “Azafady, tompoko! Mba mivilia re any an-tranon’ny mpanomponareo e! Mijanòna any androany alina, dia hosasana koa ny tongotrareo. Afaka mifoha maraina ianareo rahampitso dia manohy ny dianareo.” Hoy anefa izy ireo: “Aoka izao fa hatory eo amin’ny tany malalaky ny tanàna izahay.”', 'hoy izy: “azafady, tompoko! mba mivilia re any an-tranon’ny mpanomponareo e! mijanòna any androany alina, dia hosasana koa ny tongotrareo. afaka mifoha maraina ianareo rahampitso dia manohy ny dianareo.” hoy anefa izy ireo: “aoka izao fa hatory eo amin’ny tany malalaky ny tanàna izahay.”'),
  ('6aadc6ed3d9a0dd2422fde87', '2026-09-18T23:19:09.616Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:09.616Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 19, 8, 'Manan-janaka roa vavy aho ato. Mbola tsy nanao firaisana tamin’ny lehilahy mihitsy izy roa vavy. Aleo re izy mirahavavy no havoakako eto aminareo e! Dia ataovy aminy izay hitanareo fa mety. Fa aza atao na inona na inona ireo lehilahy ireo, satria vahiny ato an-tranoko.”', 'manan-janaka roa vavy aho ato. mbola tsy nanao firaisana tamin’ny lehilahy mihitsy izy roa vavy. aleo re izy mirahavavy no havoakako eto aminareo e! dia ataovy aminy izay hitanareo fa mety. fa aza atao na inona na inona ireo lehilahy ireo, satria vahiny ato an-tranoko.”'),
  ('6aadc6ed3d9a0dd2422fde80', '2026-09-18T23:19:09.616Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:09.616Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 19, 1, 'Tonga tao Sodoma ireo anjely roa rehefa harivariva. Nipetraka teo am-bavahadin’i Sodoma i Lota tamin’izay. Rehefa nahita azy roa lahy i Lota, dia nitsangana hitsena azy ka niankohoka tamin’ny tany.', 'tonga tao sodoma ireo anjely roa rehefa harivariva. nipetraka teo am-bavahadin’i sodoma i lota tamin’izay. rehefa nahita azy roa lahy i lota, dia nitsangana hitsena azy ka niankohoka tamin’ny tany.'),
  ('6aadc6ed3d9a0dd2422fdea2', '2026-09-18T23:19:09.616Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:09.616Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 19, 35, 'Koa nampisotroin’izy mirahavavy divay imbetsaka indray ny rainy, tamin’iny alina iny. Dia lasa ilay zandriny nanao firaisana tamin’ny rainy, nefa tsy fantatry ny rainy akory hoe natory teo aminy ilay zanany dia niala teo rehefa nifoha.', 'koa nampisotroin’izy mirahavavy divay imbetsaka indray ny rainy, tamin’iny alina iny. dia lasa ilay zandriny nanao firaisana tamin’ny rainy, nefa tsy fantatry ny rainy akory hoe natory teo aminy ilay zanany dia niala teo rehefa nifoha.'),
  ('6aadc6ed3d9a0dd2422fde9f', '2026-09-18T23:19:09.616Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:09.616Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 19, 32, 'Andao hampisotrointsika divay ny raintsika, dia andao isika hanao firaisana aminy, mba tsy ho lany taranaka izy.”', 'andao hampisotrointsika divay ny raintsika, dia andao isika hanao firaisana aminy, mba tsy ho lany taranaka izy.”'),
  ('6aadc6ed3d9a0dd2422fde9c', '2026-09-18T23:19:09.616Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:09.616Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 19, 29, 'Rehefa nandrava an’ireo tanàna teo amin’ny faritr’i Jordana ireo àry Andriamanitra, dia tsy hadinony i Abrahama, ka nentiny nivoaka avy tao amin’ireo tanàna noravany i Lota, tao amin’ny tanàna nipetrahany.', 'rehefa nandrava an’ireo tanàna teo amin’ny faritr’i jordana ireo àry andriamanitra, dia tsy hadinony i abrahama, ka nentiny nivoaka avy tao amin’ireo tanàna noravany i lota, tao amin’ny tanàna nipetrahany.'),
  ('6aadc6ed3d9a0dd2422fde9a', '2026-09-18T23:19:09.616Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:09.616Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 19, 27, 'Ary nifoha maraina i Abrahama, ka nankeny amin’ilay toerana nijoroany teo anatrehan’i Jehovah.', 'ary nifoha maraina i abrahama, ka nankeny amin’ilay toerana nijoroany teo anatrehan’i jehovah.'),
  ('6aadc6ed3d9a0dd2422fde8b', '2026-09-18T23:19:09.616Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:09.616Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 19, 12, 'Dia hoy izy roa lahy tamin’i Lota: “Mbola misy havanao ve eto? Ento miala eto amin’ity tanàna ity izay havanao eto, na ny vinantolahinao izany na ny zanakao lahy na ny zanakao vavy!', 'dia hoy izy roa lahy tamin’i lota: “mbola misy havanao ve eto? ento miala eto amin’ity tanàna ity izay havanao eto, na ny vinantolahinao izany na ny zanakao lahy na ny zanakao vavy!'),
  ('6aadc6ed3d9a0dd2422fde9e', '2026-09-18T23:19:09.616Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:09.616Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 19, 31, 'Ary hoy ny vavimatoa tamin’ny zandriny: “Efa antitra ity i Dada, nefa tsy misy lehilahy hanao firaisana amintsika hoatran’ny fanaon’ny olona, eto amin’ity faritra ity.', 'ary hoy ny vavimatoa tamin’ny zandriny: “efa antitra ity i dada, nefa tsy misy lehilahy hanao firaisana amintsika hoatran’ny fanaon’ny olona, eto amin’ity faritra ity.'),
  ('6aadc6ed3d9a0dd2422fde98', '2026-09-18T23:19:09.616Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:09.616Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 19, 25, 'Dia noravany ireo tanàna ireo, izany hoe ny faritr’i Jordana manontolo. Naripany koa ny mponina rehetra tao amin’ireo tanàna ireo sy ny zavamaniry tao.', 'dia noravany ireo tanàna ireo, izany hoe ny faritr’i jordana manontolo. naripany koa ny mponina rehetra tao amin’ireo tanàna ireo sy ny zavamaniry tao.'),
  ('6aadc6ed3d9a0dd2422fde89', '2026-09-18T23:19:09.616Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:09.616Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 19, 10, 'Navoakan’izy roa lahy àry ny tanany ka nosintoniny hankao aminy tao an-trano i Lota, dia nohidiany ny varavarana.', 'navoakan’izy roa lahy àry ny tanany ka nosintoniny hankao aminy tao an-trano i lota, dia nohidiany ny varavarana.'),
  ('6aadc6ed3d9a0dd2422fdea0', '2026-09-18T23:19:09.616Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:09.616Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 19, 33, 'Koa nampisotroin’izy mirahavavy divay ny rainy, tamin’iny alina iny. Dia niditra ny vavimatoa ka nanao firaisana tamin’ny rainy, nefa tsy fantatry ny rainy akory hoe natory teo aminy ilay zanany dia avy eo lasa.', 'koa nampisotroin’izy mirahavavy divay ny rainy, tamin’iny alina iny. dia niditra ny vavimatoa ka nanao firaisana tamin’ny rainy, nefa tsy fantatry ny rainy akory hoe natory teo aminy ilay zanany dia avy eo lasa.'),
  ('6aadc6ed3d9a0dd2422fde9d', '2026-09-18T23:19:09.616Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:09.616Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 19, 30, 'Taorian’izany dia niakatra avy tao Zoara i Lota, niaraka tamin’ny zanany roa vavy, dia nipetraka teny amin’ny faritra be tendrombohitra. Natahotra ny hipetraka tao Zoara mantsy izy. Koa nipetraka tao anaty lava-bato izy sy ny zanany roa vavy.', 'taorian’izany dia niakatra avy tao zoara i lota, niaraka tamin’ny zanany roa vavy, dia nipetraka teny amin’ny faritra be tendrombohitra. natahotra ny hipetraka tao zoara mantsy izy. koa nipetraka tao anaty lava-bato izy sy ny zanany roa vavy.'),
  ('6aadc6ed3d9a0dd2422fdea5', '2026-09-18T23:19:09.617Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:09.617Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 19, 38, 'Tera-dahy koa ilay zandriny, ka nataony hoe Ben-amy ny anarany. Izy io no rain’ireo Amonita amin’izao andro izao ireo.', 'tera-dahy koa ilay zandriny, ka nataony hoe ben-amy ny anarany. izy io no rain’ireo amonita amin’izao andro izao ireo.'),
  ('6aadc6ee76faefbcc581438a', '2026-09-18T23:19:10.533Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:10.533Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 20, 16, 'Hoy koa izy tamin’i Saraha: “Omeko volafotsy 1 000 sekely ny anadahinao. Iny no porofo hoe tsy manan-tsiny ianao eo anatrehan’ireo olona rehetra miaraka aminao ireo sy eo imason’ny olona rehetra. Dia tsy hisy ho afaka hanome tsiny anao.”', 'hoy koa izy tamin’i saraha: “omeko volafotsy 1 000 sekely ny anadahinao. iny no porofo hoe tsy manan-tsiny ianao eo anatrehan’ireo olona rehetra miaraka aminao ireo sy eo imason’ny olona rehetra. dia tsy hisy ho afaka hanome tsiny anao.”'),
  ('6aadc6ee76faefbcc5814386', '2026-09-18T23:19:10.533Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:10.533Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 20, 12, 'Fa izy aloha tena anabaviko e! Zanaky ny raiko mantsy izy fa tsy zanaky ny reniko, ary lasa vadiko.', 'fa izy aloha tena anabaviko e! zanaky ny raiko mantsy izy fa tsy zanaky ny reniko, ary lasa vadiko.'),
  ('6aadc6ee76faefbcc5814388', '2026-09-18T23:19:10.533Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:10.533Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 20, 14, 'Dia naka ondry sy omby sy mpanompolahy ary mpanompovavy i Abimeleka, ka nomeny an’i Abrahama. Naveriny taminy koa i Saraha vadiny.', 'dia naka ondry sy omby sy mpanompolahy ary mpanompovavy i abimeleka, ka nomeny an’i abrahama. naveriny taminy koa i saraha vadiny.'),
  ('6aadc6ee76faefbcc5814387', '2026-09-18T23:19:10.533Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:10.533Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 20, 13, 'Dia rehefa nasain’Andriamanitra niala tao amin’ny ankohonan-draiko aho ka nifindrafindra teny, dia hoy aho tamin’ny vadiko: ‘Mba ataovy izao raha tena tia ahy ianao: Any amin’izay toerana rehetra halehantsika, dia lazao hoe anadahinao aho.’”', 'dia rehefa nasain’andriamanitra niala tao amin’ny ankohonan-draiko aho ka nifindrafindra teny, dia hoy aho tamin’ny vadiko: ‘mba ataovy izao raha tena tia ahy ianao: any amin’izay toerana rehetra halehantsika, dia lazao hoe anadahinao aho.’”'),
  ('6aadc6ee76faefbcc581437c', '2026-09-18T23:19:10.533Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:10.533Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 20, 2, 'dia niteny foana i Abrahama hoe anabaviny i Saraha vadiny. Naniraka olona haka an’i Saraha àry i Abimeleka mpanjakan’i Gerara.', 'dia niteny foana i abrahama hoe anabaviny i saraha vadiny. naniraka olona haka an’i saraha àry i abimeleka mpanjakan’i gerara.'),
  ('6aadc6ee76faefbcc5814389', '2026-09-18T23:19:10.533Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:10.533Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 20, 15, 'Hoy koa i Abimeleka: “Taniko daholo ireo hitanao ireo. Afaka mipetraka any amin’izay tianao hipetrahana ianao.”', 'hoy koa i abimeleka: “taniko daholo ireo hitanao ireo. afaka mipetraka any amin’izay tianao hipetrahana ianao.”'),
  ('6aadc6ee76faefbcc5814382', '2026-09-18T23:19:10.533Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:10.533Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 20, 8, 'Ary nifoha maraina i Abimeleka ka niantso ny mpanompony rehetra, dia nitantara an’izany rehetra izany tamin’izy ireo. Dia natahotra be izy ireo.', 'ary nifoha maraina i abimeleka ka niantso ny mpanompony rehetra, dia nitantara an’izany rehetra izany tamin’izy ireo. dia natahotra be izy ireo.'),
  ('6aadc6ee76faefbcc5814380', '2026-09-18T23:19:10.533Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:10.533Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 20, 6, 'Dia niteny taminy tao amin’ny nofy Andriamanitra hoe: “Fantatro fa tamin’ny fo madio no nanaovanao an’izao, ka nosakanako tsy hanota amiko ianao. Izany no antony tsy namelako anao hikasika azy.', 'dia niteny taminy tao amin’ny nofy andriamanitra hoe: “fantatro fa tamin’ny fo madio no nanaovanao an’izao, ka nosakanako tsy hanota amiko ianao. izany no antony tsy namelako anao hikasika azy.'),
  ('6aadc6ee76faefbcc5814384', '2026-09-18T23:19:10.533Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:10.533Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 20, 10, 'Hoy koa i Abimeleka tamin’i Abrahama: “Fa inona no antony nanaovanao an’izao zavatra izao?”', 'hoy koa i abimeleka tamin’i abrahama: “fa inona no antony nanaovanao an’izao zavatra izao?”'),
  ('6aadc6ee76faefbcc5814383', '2026-09-18T23:19:10.533Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:10.533Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 20, 9, 'Niantso an’i Abrahama i Abimeleka avy eo, ka niteny taminy hoe: “Fa inona ity nataonao taminay? Ary inona no fahotana nataoko taminao no dia nahatonga an’izao loza lehibe izao tamiko sy ny fanjakako ianao? Tsy mety mihitsy izao nataonao tamiko izao.”', 'niantso an’i abrahama i abimeleka avy eo, ka niteny taminy hoe: “fa inona ity nataonao taminay? ary inona no fahotana nataoko taminao no dia nahatonga an’izao loza lehibe izao tamiko sy ny fanjakako ianao? tsy mety mihitsy izao nataonao tamiko izao.”'),
  ('6aadc6ee76faefbcc581438b', '2026-09-18T23:19:10.533Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:10.533Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 20, 17, 'Dia nitalaho tamin’Andriamanitra i Abrahama, ka nositranin’Andriamanitra i Abimeleka sy ny vadiny ary ny mpanompovaviny, dia afaka niteraka indray izy ireo.', 'dia nitalaho tamin’andriamanitra i abrahama, ka nositranin’andriamanitra i abimeleka sy ny vadiny ary ny mpanompovaviny, dia afaka niteraka indray izy ireo.'),
  ('6aadc6ee76faefbcc5814381', '2026-09-18T23:19:10.533Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:10.533Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 20, 7, 'Avereno àry ny vadin’io lehilahy io, satria mpaminany izy. Dia hitalaho ho anao izy mba tsy ho faty ianao. Fa raha tsy averinao ilay vehivavy, dia fantaro fa tena ho faty ianao sy ny ankohonanao manontolo.”', 'avereno àry ny vadin’io lehilahy io, satria mpaminany izy. dia hitalaho ho anao izy mba tsy ho faty ianao. fa raha tsy averinao ilay vehivavy, dia fantaro fa tena ho faty ianao sy ny ankohonanao manontolo.”'),
  ('6aadc6ee76faefbcc5814385', '2026-09-18T23:19:10.533Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:10.533Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 20, 11, 'Dia hoy i Abrahama: “Nieritreritra aho hoe: ‘Tena tsy matahotra an’Andriamanitra ny olona eto amin’ity toerana ity, ka hovonoiny ho faty aho dia halainy ny vadiko.’', 'dia hoy i abrahama: “nieritreritra aho hoe: ‘tena tsy matahotra an’andriamanitra ny olona eto amin’ity toerana ity, ka hovonoiny ho faty aho dia halainy ny vadiko.’'),
  ('6aadc6ee76faefbcc581437b', '2026-09-18T23:19:10.533Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:10.533Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 20, 1, 'Ary niala teo i Abrahama ka nifindra toby nankany amin’ny faritr’i Negeba. Dia nipetraka teo anelanelan’i Kadesy sy Sora izy. Tamin’izy nipetraka tao Gerara,', 'ary niala teo i abrahama ka nifindra toby nankany amin’ny faritr’i negeba. dia nipetraka teo anelanelan’i kadesy sy sora izy. tamin’izy nipetraka tao gerara,'),
  ('6aadc6ee76faefbcc581437f', '2026-09-18T23:19:10.533Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:10.533Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 20, 5, 'Angaha moa tsy ilay lehilahy ihany no niteny tamiko hoe: ‘Anabaviko izy’? Ary angaha tsy ilay vehivavy koa no niteny hoe: ‘Anadahiko izy’? Tamin’ny fo madio no nanaovako an’izao, sady tsy fantatro hoe tsy nety ny nataoko.”', 'angaha moa tsy ilay lehilahy ihany no niteny tamiko hoe: ‘anabaviko izy’? ary angaha tsy ilay vehivavy koa no niteny hoe: ‘anadahiko izy’? tamin’ny fo madio no nanaovako an’izao, sady tsy fantatro hoe tsy nety ny nataoko.”'),
  ('6aadc6ee76faefbcc581437e', '2026-09-18T23:19:10.533Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:10.533Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 20, 4, 'Mbola tsy nanao firaisana tamin’i Saraha anefa i Abimeleka. Dia hoy izy: “Jehovah ô, firenena tsy manan-tsiny ve dia hovonoinao?', 'mbola tsy nanao firaisana tamin’i saraha anefa i abimeleka. dia hoy izy: “jehovah ô, firenena tsy manan-tsiny ve dia hovonoinao?'),
  ('6aadc6ee76faefbcc581437d', '2026-09-18T23:19:10.533Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:10.533Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 20, 3, 'Indray alina dia niteny tamin’i Abimeleka tao amin’ny nofy Andriamanitra hoe: “Ho faty ianao fa naka an’io vehivavy io. Vadin’olona mantsy izy.”', 'indray alina dia niteny tamin’i abimeleka tao amin’ny nofy andriamanitra hoe: “ho faty ianao fa naka an’io vehivavy io. vadin’olona mantsy izy.”'),
  ('6aadc6ee76faefbcc581438c', '2026-09-18T23:19:10.534Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:10.534Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 20, 18, 'Efa nataon’i Jehovah tsy niteraka mantsy ny vehivavy rehetra tao an-tranon’i Abimeleka, satria nalain’i Abimeleka i Saraha vadin’i Abrahama.', 'efa nataon’i jehovah tsy niteraka mantsy ny vehivavy rehetra tao an-tranon’i abimeleka, satria nalain’i abimeleka i saraha vadin’i abrahama.'),
  ('6aadc6ef82c5775ddd2a96f3', '2026-09-18T23:19:11.770Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:11.770Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 21, 11, 'Tena nahasosotra an’i Abrahama anefa izany teniny momba an’i Ismaela zanany izany.', 'tena nahasosotra an’i abrahama anefa izany teniny momba an’i ismaela zanany izany.'),
  ('6aadc6ef82c5775ddd2a96ec', '2026-09-18T23:19:11.770Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:11.770Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 21, 4, 'Ary noforan’i Abrahama i Isaka zanany rehefa feno valo andro, araka izay efa nandidian’Andriamanitra azy.', 'ary noforan’i abrahama i isaka zanany rehefa feno valo andro, araka izay efa nandidian’andriamanitra azy.'),
  ('6aadc6ef82c5775ddd2a96f2', '2026-09-18T23:19:11.770Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:11.770Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 21, 10, 'Hoy àry i Saraha tamin’i Abrahama: “Roahy any io mpanompovavy io sy ny zanany! Fa tsy hiray lova amin’i Isaka zanako ny zanak’io mpanompovavy io!”', 'hoy àry i saraha tamin’i abrahama: “roahy any io mpanompovavy io sy ny zanany! fa tsy hiray lova amin’i isaka zanako ny zanak’io mpanompovavy io!”'),
  ('6aadc6ef82c5775ddd2a96f0', '2026-09-18T23:19:11.770Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:11.770Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 21, 8, 'Ary nihalehibe ilay zaza ka nosarahi-nono. Dia nanomana fety be i Abrahama tamin’ny andro nampisaraha-nono an’i Isaka.', 'ary nihalehibe ilay zaza ka nosarahi-nono. dia nanomana fety be i abrahama tamin’ny andro nampisaraha-nono an’i isaka.'),
  ('6aadc6ef82c5775ddd2a96eb', '2026-09-18T23:19:11.770Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:11.770Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 21, 3, 'Dia nataon’i Abrahama hoe Isaka ny anaran’ilay zanany naterak’i Saraha taminy.', 'dia nataon’i abrahama hoe isaka ny anaran’ilay zanany naterak’i saraha taminy.'),
  ('6aadc6ef82c5775ddd2a96ee', '2026-09-18T23:19:11.770Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:11.770Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 21, 6, 'Dia hoy i Saraha: “Nataon’Andriamanitra nihomehy aho, ka hiara-mihomehy amiko izay rehetra maheno an’izany.”', 'dia hoy i saraha: “nataon’andriamanitra nihomehy aho, ka hiara-mihomehy amiko izay rehetra maheno an’izany.”'),
  ('6aadc6ef82c5775ddd2a96ea', '2026-09-18T23:19:11.770Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:11.770Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 21, 2, 'Dia bevohoka i Saraha ka nitera-dahy tamin’i Abrahama, tamin’ilay fotoana nampanantenain’Andriamanitra azy mihitsy. Efa antitra i Abrahama tamin’izay.', 'dia bevohoka i saraha ka nitera-dahy tamin’i abrahama, tamin’ilay fotoana nampanantenain’andriamanitra azy mihitsy. efa antitra i abrahama tamin’izay.'),
  ('6aadc6ef82c5775ddd2a96ef', '2026-09-18T23:19:11.770Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:11.770Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 21, 7, 'Hoy koa izy: “Iza moa no nanampo fa hisy hiteny amin’i Abrahama hoe: ‘Hitaiza zaza i Saraha’? Nitera-dahy taminy ihany anefa aho, amin’izao izy efa antitra izao.”', 'hoy koa izy: “iza moa no nanampo fa hisy hiteny amin’i abrahama hoe: ‘hitaiza zaza i saraha’? nitera-dahy taminy ihany anefa aho, amin’izao izy efa antitra izao.”'),
  ('6aadc6ef82c5775ddd2a96f1', '2026-09-18T23:19:11.770Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:11.770Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 21, 9, 'Tsikaritr’i Saraha anefa fa naneso an’i Isaka foana ny zanakalahin’i Hagara Ejipsianina, ilay naterany tamin’i Abrahama.', 'tsikaritr’i saraha anefa fa naneso an’i isaka foana ny zanakalahin’i hagara ejipsianina, ilay naterany tamin’i abrahama.'),
  ('6aadc6ef82c5775ddd2a96e9', '2026-09-18T23:19:11.770Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:11.770Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 21, 1, 'Ary nahatsiaro an’i Saraha i Jehovah, araka izay efa nolazainy, ka notanterahin’i Jehovah taminy izay nampanantenainy.', 'ary nahatsiaro an’i saraha i jehovah, araka izay efa nolazainy, ka notanterahin’i jehovah taminy izay nampanantenainy.'),
  ('6aadc6ef82c5775ddd2a96f5', '2026-09-18T23:19:11.770Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:11.770Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 21, 13, 'Fa ilay zanaky ny mpanompovavinao indray hataoko lasa firenena. Zanakao mantsy izy.”', 'fa ilay zanaky ny mpanompovavinao indray hataoko lasa firenena. zanakao mantsy izy.”'),
  ('6aadc6ef82c5775ddd2a96f4', '2026-09-18T23:19:11.770Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:11.770Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 21, 12, 'Dia hoy Andriamanitra tamin’i Abrahama: “Aza atao mahasosotra anao ny tenin’i Saraha taminao momba an’ilay zanakao sy ny mpanompovavinao. Henoy izy, satria ho avy amin’i Isaka ilay hantsoina hoe taranakao.', 'dia hoy andriamanitra tamin’i abrahama: “aza atao mahasosotra anao ny tenin’i saraha taminao momba an’ilay zanakao sy ny mpanompovavinao. henoy izy, satria ho avy amin’i isaka ilay hantsoina hoe taranakao.'),
  ('6aadc6ef82c5775ddd2a96ed', '2026-09-18T23:19:11.770Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:11.770Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 21, 5, 'Efa 100 taona i Abrahama rehefa teraka i Isaka zanany.', 'efa 100 taona i abrahama rehefa teraka i isaka zanany.'),
  ('6aadc6ef82c5775ddd2a9705', '2026-09-18T23:19:11.771Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:11.771Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 21, 29, 'Dia hoy i Abimeleka taminy: “Fa maninona no natokanao eto ireo ondrivavy kely fito ireo?”', 'dia hoy i abimeleka taminy: “fa maninona no natokanao eto ireo ondrivavy kely fito ireo?”'),
  ('6aadc6ef82c5775ddd2a96fe', '2026-09-18T23:19:11.771Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:11.771Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 21, 22, 'Tamin’izany fotoana izany, dia hoy i Abimeleka sy Pikola lehiben’ny tafiny tamin’i Abrahama: “Hitanay fa tahin’ Andriamanitra ianao amin’izay rehetra ataonao.', 'tamin’izany fotoana izany, dia hoy i abimeleka sy pikola lehiben’ny tafiny tamin’i abrahama: “hitanay fa tahin’ andriamanitra ianao amin’izay rehetra ataonao.'),
  ('6aadc6ef82c5775ddd2a96f8', '2026-09-18T23:19:11.771Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:11.771Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 21, 16, 'Ary lasa izy nipetraka irery terỳ lavidavitra terỳ, teny amin’ny toerana tokony ho tratran’ny zana-tsipìka. Hoy mantsy izy: “Tsy te hahita ny hahafatesan’ny zanako aho.” Koa nipetraka teny lavidavitra izy, dia nigogogogo nitomany.', 'ary lasa izy nipetraka irery terỳ lavidavitra terỳ, teny amin’ny toerana tokony ho tratran’ny zana-tsipìka. hoy mantsy izy: “tsy te hahita ny hahafatesan’ny zanako aho.” koa nipetraka teny lavidavitra izy, dia nigogogogo nitomany.'),
  ('6aadc6ef82c5775ddd2a9702', '2026-09-18T23:19:11.771Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:11.771Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 21, 26, 'Dia hoy i Abimeleka: “Tsy fantatro izay nanao an’izany, sady ianao koa mbola tsy niteny an’izany tamiko. Androany mihitsy aho vao naheno an’izany.”', 'dia hoy i abimeleka: “tsy fantatro izay nanao an’izany, sady ianao koa mbola tsy niteny an’izany tamiko. androany mihitsy aho vao naheno an’izany.”'),
  ('6aadc6ef82c5775ddd2a96f9', '2026-09-18T23:19:11.771Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:11.771Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 21, 17, 'Ary henon’Andriamanitra ny feon’ilay ankizilahy. Dia niantso an’i Hagara avy any an-danitra ny anjelin’Andriamanitra, ka niteny taminy hoe: “Fa maninona ianao, ry Hagara? Aza matahotra fa efa henon’Andriamanitra ny feon’ny zanakao.', 'ary henon’andriamanitra ny feon’ilay ankizilahy. dia niantso an’i hagara avy any an-danitra ny anjelin’andriamanitra, ka niteny taminy hoe: “fa maninona ianao, ry hagara? aza matahotra fa efa henon’andriamanitra ny feon’ny zanakao.'),
  ('6aadc6ef82c5775ddd2a9700', '2026-09-18T23:19:11.771Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:11.771Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 21, 24, 'Dia hoy i Abrahama: “Mianiana aho fa hanao an’izany.”', 'dia hoy i abrahama: “mianiana aho fa hanao an’izany.”'),
  ('6aadc6ef82c5775ddd2a9706', '2026-09-18T23:19:11.771Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:11.771Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 21, 30, 'Dia hoy izy: “Avy amiko ireo ondrivavy kely fito ireo, ka mba raiso ho vavolombelona fa izaho no nandavaka an’ity lavadrano ity.”', 'dia hoy izy: “avy amiko ireo ondrivavy kely fito ireo, ka mba raiso ho vavolombelona fa izaho no nandavaka an’ity lavadrano ity.”'),
  ('6aadc6ef82c5775ddd2a96fa', '2026-09-18T23:19:11.771Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:11.771Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 21, 18, 'Mitsangàna dia areno ny zanakao ka tazòny, fa hataoko lasa firenena lehibe izy.”', 'mitsangàna dia areno ny zanakao ka tazòny, fa hataoko lasa firenena lehibe izy.”'),
  ('6aadc6ef82c5775ddd2a96f7', '2026-09-18T23:19:11.771Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:11.771Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 21, 15, 'Tamin’ny farany, dia lany ny rano tao amin’ilay siny hoditra. Dia navelany teo ambanin’ny hazo ivaiva iray ilay zanany.', 'tamin’ny farany, dia lany ny rano tao amin’ilay siny hoditra. dia navelany teo ambanin’ny hazo ivaiva iray ilay zanany.'),
  ('6aadc6ef82c5775ddd2a970a', '2026-09-18T23:19:11.771Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:11.771Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 21, 34, 'Ary mbola nijanona ela be tany amin’ny tanin’ny Filistinina i Abrahama.', 'ary mbola nijanona ela be tany amin’ny tanin’ny filistinina i abrahama.'),
  ('6aadc6ef82c5775ddd2a9708', '2026-09-18T23:19:11.771Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:11.771Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 21, 32, 'Nanao fifanekena tao Beri-sheba àry izy ireo. Dia niainga i Abimeleka sy Pikola lehiben’ny tafiny, ka niverina tany amin’ny tanin’ny Filistinina.', 'nanao fifanekena tao beri-sheba àry izy ireo. dia niainga i abimeleka sy pikola lehiben’ny tafiny, ka niverina tany amin’ny tanin’ny filistinina.'),
  ('6aadc6ef82c5775ddd2a9707', '2026-09-18T23:19:11.771Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:11.771Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 21, 31, 'Izany no nahatonga azy hiantso an’ilay toerana hoe Beri-sheba, satria teo izy roa lahy no nanao fianianana.', 'izany no nahatonga azy hiantso an’ilay toerana hoe beri-sheba, satria teo izy roa lahy no nanao fianianana.'),
  ('6aadc6ef82c5775ddd2a96fc', '2026-09-18T23:19:11.771Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:11.771Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 21, 20, 'Ary nokarakarain’Andriamanitra ilay ankizilahy mandra-pahalehibeny. Dia nipetraka tany an-tany efitra izy, ary lasa mpandefa zana-tsipìka.', 'ary nokarakarain’andriamanitra ilay ankizilahy mandra-pahalehibeny. dia nipetraka tany an-tany efitra izy, ary lasa mpandefa zana-tsipìka.'),
  ('6aadc6ef82c5775ddd2a9703', '2026-09-18T23:19:11.771Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:11.771Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 21, 27, 'Ary naka ondry sy omby i Abrahama ka nomeny an’i Abimeleka. Dia nanao fifanekena izy roa lahy.', 'ary naka ondry sy omby i abrahama ka nomeny an’i abimeleka. dia nanao fifanekena izy roa lahy.'),
  ('6aadc6ef82c5775ddd2a9701', '2026-09-18T23:19:11.771Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:11.771Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 21, 25, 'Nitaraina tamin’i Abimeleka anefa i Abrahama, satria nisy lavadrano nalain’ny mpanompon’i Abimeleka an-keriny.', 'nitaraina tamin’i abimeleka anefa i abrahama, satria nisy lavadrano nalain’ny mpanompon’i abimeleka an-keriny.'),
  ('6aadc6ef82c5775ddd2a96ff', '2026-09-18T23:19:11.771Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:11.771Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 21, 23, 'Koa manaova fianianana amiko eto anatrehan’Andriamanitra hoe tsy hanisy ratsy ahy sy ny zanako ary ny taranako ianao. Manaova koa fianianana hoe ho tsara fanahy amiko sy amin’ny mponin’ity tany ipetrahanao ity ianao, hoatran’ny nataoko taminao.”', 'koa manaova fianianana amiko eto anatrehan’andriamanitra hoe tsy hanisy ratsy ahy sy ny zanako ary ny taranako ianao. manaova koa fianianana hoe ho tsara fanahy amiko sy amin’ny mponin’ity tany ipetrahanao ity ianao, hoatran’ny nataoko taminao.”'),
  ('6aadc6ef82c5775ddd2a96fd', '2026-09-18T23:19:11.771Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:11.771Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 21, 21, 'Nipetraka tany an-tany efitr’i Parana izy, ary nakan’ny reniny vady avy any Ejipta.', 'nipetraka tany an-tany efitr’i parana izy, ary nakan’ny reniny vady avy any ejipta.'),
  ('6aadc6ef82c5775ddd2a96fb', '2026-09-18T23:19:11.771Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:11.771Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 21, 19, 'Dia nataon’Andriamanitra nahita lavadrano i Hagara. Ary lasa nankeny izy ka nofenoiny rano ilay siny hoditra. Dia nampisotroiny rano ilay zanany.', 'dia nataon’andriamanitra nahita lavadrano i hagara. ary lasa nankeny izy ka nofenoiny rano ilay siny hoditra. dia nampisotroiny rano ilay zanany.'),
  ('6aadc6ef82c5775ddd2a9709', '2026-09-18T23:19:11.771Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:11.771Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 21, 33, 'Taorian’izay dia namboly hazo tamariska tao Beri-sheba i Abrahama, ary tao izy no niantso ny anaran’i Jehovah, ilay Andriamanitra mandrakizay.', 'taorian’izay dia namboly hazo tamariska tao beri-sheba i abrahama, ary tao izy no niantso ny anaran’i jehovah, ilay andriamanitra mandrakizay.'),
  ('6aadc6ef82c5775ddd2a96f6', '2026-09-18T23:19:11.771Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:11.771Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 21, 14, 'Nifoha maraina àry i Abrahama, ka naka mofo sy siny hoditra feno rano. Dia nomeny an’i Hagara izany, ka napetrany teo an-tsorony. Ary nalefany nandeha izy sy ilay zanany. Dia lasa i Hagara, ka nirenireny tany an-tany efitr’i Beri-sheba.', 'nifoha maraina àry i abrahama, ka naka mofo sy siny hoditra feno rano. dia nomeny an’i hagara izany, ka napetrany teo an-tsorony. ary nalefany nandeha izy sy ilay zanany. dia lasa i hagara, ka nirenireny tany an-tany efitr’i beri-sheba.'),
  ('6aadc6ef82c5775ddd2a9704', '2026-09-18T23:19:11.771Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:11.771Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 21, 28, 'Ary nanokana ondrivavy kely fito avy tamin’ny andian’ondry i Abrahama.', 'ary nanokana ondrivavy kely fito avy tamin’ny andian’ondry i abrahama.'),
  ('6aadc6f0548626b99966513e', '2026-09-18T23:19:12.358Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:12.358Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 22, 22, 'Kaseda, Hazo, Pildasy, Jidlafa, ary Betoela.”', 'kaseda, hazo, pildasy, jidlafa, ary betoela.”'),
  ('6aadc6f0548626b99966513c', '2026-09-18T23:19:12.358Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:12.358Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 22, 20, 'Taorian’izany, dia nisy nilaza tamin’i Abrahama hoe: “I Milka koa efa nitera-dahy tamin’i Nahora rahalahinao,', 'taorian’izany, dia nisy nilaza tamin’i abrahama hoe: “i milka koa efa nitera-dahy tamin’i nahora rahalahinao,'),
  ('6aadc6f0548626b999665133', '2026-09-18T23:19:12.358Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:12.358Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 22, 11, 'Nisy anjelin’i Jehovah anefa niantso azy avy any an-danitra, hoe: “Abrahama! Abrahama!” Dia hoy izy: “Intỳ aho, tompoko!”', 'nisy anjelin’i jehovah anefa niantso azy avy any an-danitra, hoe: “abrahama! abrahama!” dia hoy izy: “intỳ aho, tompoko!”'),
  ('6aadc6f0548626b99966512d', '2026-09-18T23:19:12.358Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:12.358Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 22, 5, 'Dia hoy i Abrahama tamin’ny mpanompony: “Mijanòna eto ianareo sy ny ampondra, fa izahay mianaka handeha ho erỳ, mba hiankohoka eo anatrehan’ Andriamanitra. Hiverina eto aminareo ihany izahay avy eo.”', 'dia hoy i abrahama tamin’ny mpanompony: “mijanòna eto ianareo sy ny ampondra, fa izahay mianaka handeha ho erỳ, mba hiankohoka eo anatrehan’ andriamanitra. hiverina eto aminareo ihany izahay avy eo.”'),
  ('6aadc6f0548626b999665137', '2026-09-18T23:19:12.358Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:12.358Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 22, 15, 'Ary niantso an’i Abrahama fanindroany avy any an-danitra ilay anjelin’i Jehovah,', 'ary niantso an’i abrahama fanindroany avy any an-danitra ilay anjelin’i jehovah,'),
  ('6aadc6f0548626b99966513d', '2026-09-18T23:19:12.358Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:12.358Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 22, 21, 'dia i Oza lahimatoa, Boza rahalahiny, Kemoela rain’i Arama,', 'dia i oza lahimatoa, boza rahalahiny, kemoela rain’i arama,'),
  ('6aadc6f0548626b99966513a', '2026-09-18T23:19:12.358Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:12.358Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 22, 18, 'Ary hahazo fitahiana amin’ny alalan’ny taranakao ny firenena rehetra eny ambonin’ny tany, satria nihaino ny teniko ianao.’”', 'ary hahazo fitahiana amin’ny alalan’ny taranakao ny firenena rehetra eny ambonin’ny tany, satria nihaino ny teniko ianao.’”'),
  ('6aadc6f0548626b99966512c', '2026-09-18T23:19:12.358Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:12.358Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 22, 4, 'Tamin’ny andro fahatelo, dia nitazana i Abrahama ka nahita an’ilay toerana avy lavitra.', 'tamin’ny andro fahatelo, dia nitazana i abrahama ka nahita an’ilay toerana avy lavitra.'),
  ('6aadc6f0548626b99966512a', '2026-09-18T23:19:12.358Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:12.358Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 22, 2, 'Ary hoy Andriamanitra: “Ento, azafady, i Isaka zanakao, ilay lahitokanao tena tianao, ka mankanesa any amin’ny tany Moria. Dia atolory ho fanatitra dorana izy rehefa any, eo amin’ny tendrombohitra iray holazaiko anao.”', 'ary hoy andriamanitra: “ento, azafady, i isaka zanakao, ilay lahitokanao tena tianao, ka mankanesa any amin’ny tany moria. dia atolory ho fanatitra dorana izy rehefa any, eo amin’ny tendrombohitra iray holazaiko anao.”'),
  ('6aadc6f0548626b999665140', '2026-09-18T23:19:12.358Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:12.358Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 22, 24, 'Ary nanana vadikely i Nahora: Reoma no anarany. Nitera-dahy koa i Reoma, dia i Teba, Gahama, Tahasy, ary Maka.', 'ary nanana vadikely i nahora: reoma no anarany. nitera-dahy koa i reoma, dia i teba, gahama, tahasy, ary maka.'),
  ('6aadc6f0548626b999665138', '2026-09-18T23:19:12.358Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:12.358Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 22, 16, 'hoe: “‘Mianiana amin’ny tenako aho’, hoy i Jehovah, ‘fa noho ianao nanao an’izao ka nahafoy ny zanakao, ilay lahitokanao,', 'hoe: “‘mianiana amin’ny tenako aho’, hoy i jehovah, ‘fa noho ianao nanao an’izao ka nahafoy ny zanakao, ilay lahitokanao,'),
  ('6aadc6f0548626b999665136', '2026-09-18T23:19:12.358Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:12.358Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 22, 14, 'Koa nataon’i Abrahama hoe Jehovah-jire ny anaran’ilay toerana. Izany no nahatonga an’ilay fitenin’ny olona hatramin’izao hoe: “Any an-tendrombohitr’i Jehovah no hanomezana an’izany.”', 'koa nataon’i abrahama hoe jehovah-jire ny anaran’ilay toerana. izany no nahatonga an’ilay fitenin’ny olona hatramin’izao hoe: “any an-tendrombohitr’i jehovah no hanomezana an’izany.”'),
  ('6aadc6f0548626b999665139', '2026-09-18T23:19:12.358Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:12.358Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 22, 17, 'dia tena hotahiko ianao ka tena hataoko lasa be dia be ny taranakao, hoatran’ny kintana eny amin’ny lanitra sy ny fasika eny amoron-dranomasina. Ho lasan’ny taranakao koa ny vavahadin’ny fahavalony.', 'dia tena hotahiko ianao ka tena hataoko lasa be dia be ny taranakao, hoatran’ny kintana eny amin’ny lanitra sy ny fasika eny amoron-dranomasina. ho lasan’ny taranakao koa ny vavahadin’ny fahavalony.'),
  ('6aadc6f0548626b99966512f', '2026-09-18T23:19:12.358Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:12.358Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 22, 7, 'Ary hoy i Isaka tamin’i Abrahama rainy: “Dada ô!” Dia hoy izy: “Ahoana, anaka?” Ary hoy i Isaka: “Efa ireto ny afo sy ny kitay, fa aiza izay ondry hatao fanatitra dorana?”', 'ary hoy i isaka tamin’i abrahama rainy: “dada ô!” dia hoy izy: “ahoana, anaka?” ary hoy i isaka: “efa ireto ny afo sy ny kitay, fa aiza izay ondry hatao fanatitra dorana?”'),
  ('6aadc6f0548626b99966512b', '2026-09-18T23:19:12.358Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:12.358Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 22, 3, 'Dia nifoha maraina i Abrahama ka nasiany lasely ny ampondrany. Dia nentiny niaraka taminy ny mpanompony roa lahy sy Isaka zanany. Namaky kitay ho an’ny fanatitra dorana izy, dia lasa nankany amin’ilay toerana natoron’Andriamanitra azy.', 'dia nifoha maraina i abrahama ka nasiany lasely ny ampondrany. dia nentiny niaraka taminy ny mpanompony roa lahy sy isaka zanany. namaky kitay ho an’ny fanatitra dorana izy, dia lasa nankany amin’ilay toerana natoron’andriamanitra azy.'),
  ('6aadc6f0548626b999665129', '2026-09-18T23:19:12.358Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:12.358Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 22, 1, 'Taorian’izay, dia nizaha toetra an’i Abrahama Andriamanitra, ka niteny hoe: “Abrahama!” Dia hoy izy: “Intỳ aho, tompoko!”', 'taorian’izay, dia nizaha toetra an’i abrahama andriamanitra, ka niteny hoe: “abrahama!” dia hoy izy: “intỳ aho, tompoko!”'),
  ('6aadc6f0548626b999665134', '2026-09-18T23:19:12.358Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:12.358Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 22, 12, 'Ary hoy ilay anjely: “Aza vonoina ny zanakao, ary aza atao na inona na inona mihitsy. Fa fantatro amin’izay izao fa matahotra an’Andriamanitra ianao, satria nafoinao ho ahy ny zanakao, ilay lahitokanao.”', 'ary hoy ilay anjely: “aza vonoina ny zanakao, ary aza atao na inona na inona mihitsy. fa fantatro amin’izay izao fa matahotra an’andriamanitra ianao, satria nafoinao ho ahy ny zanakao, ilay lahitokanao.”'),
  ('6aadc6f0548626b99966513b', '2026-09-18T23:19:12.358Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:12.358Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 22, 19, 'Taorian’izay dia niverina nankeny amin’ny mpanompony i Abrahama. Dia lasa izy ireo niara-niverina tany Beri-sheba. Ary tsy niala tao Beri-sheba i Abrahama fa mbola nipetraka tao.', 'taorian’izay dia niverina nankeny amin’ny mpanompony i abrahama. dia lasa izy ireo niara-niverina tany beri-sheba. ary tsy niala tao beri-sheba i abrahama fa mbola nipetraka tao.'),
  ('6aadc6f0548626b999665135', '2026-09-18T23:19:12.358Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:12.358Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 22, 13, 'Tamin’izay dia nijery i Abrahama ka nahita ondrilahy tsy dia lavitra teo. Voasaringotry ny kirihitrala ny tandrok’ilay ondry. Dia nalain’i Abrahama ilay ondry, ka natolony ho fanatitra dorana ho solon’ilay zanany.', 'tamin’izay dia nijery i abrahama ka nahita ondrilahy tsy dia lavitra teo. voasaringotry ny kirihitrala ny tandrok’ilay ondry. dia nalain’i abrahama ilay ondry, ka natolony ho fanatitra dorana ho solon’ilay zanany.'),
  ('6aadc6f0548626b999665130', '2026-09-18T23:19:12.358Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:12.358Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 22, 8, 'Dia hoy i Abrahama: “Andriamanitra ihany, anaka, no hanome ny ondry hatao fanatitra dorana.” Ary nanohy ny diany izy mianaka.', 'dia hoy i abrahama: “andriamanitra ihany, anaka, no hanome ny ondry hatao fanatitra dorana.” ary nanohy ny diany izy mianaka.'),
  ('6aadc6f0548626b99966512e', '2026-09-18T23:19:12.358Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:12.358Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 22, 6, 'Dia nalain’i Abrahama ny kitay ho an’ny fanatitra dorana, ka nataony teo amin’ny sorok’i Isaka zanany. Ary nentin’i Abrahama ny afo sy ny antsibe, ka niara-nandeha izy mianaka.', 'dia nalain’i abrahama ny kitay ho an’ny fanatitra dorana, ka nataony teo amin’ny sorok’i isaka zanany. ary nentin’i abrahama ny afo sy ny antsibe, ka niara-nandeha izy mianaka.'),
  ('6aadc6f0548626b99966513f', '2026-09-18T23:19:12.358Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:12.358Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 22, 23, 'I Betoela niteraka an’i Rebeka. Naterak’i Milka tamin’i Nahora, rahalahin’i Abrahama, izy valo ireo.', 'i betoela niteraka an’i rebeka. naterak’i milka tamin’i nahora, rahalahin’i abrahama, izy valo ireo.'),
  ('6aadc6f0548626b999665132', '2026-09-18T23:19:12.358Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:12.358Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 22, 10, 'Ary nalain’i Abrahama ilay antsibe, ka handeha hovonoiny ilay zanany.', 'ary nalain’i abrahama ilay antsibe, ka handeha hovonoiny ilay zanany.'),
  ('6aadc6f0548626b999665131', '2026-09-18T23:19:12.358Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:12.358Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 22, 9, 'Farany dia tonga teo amin’ilay toerana natoron’Andriamanitra an’i Abrahama izy mianaka. Dia nanorina alitara teo i Abrahama ka nandahatra ny kitay teo ambonin’ilay izy. Avy eo dia nofatorany ny tongotra aman-tanan’i Isaka zanany. Dia nataony teo ambonin’ilay alitara izy, teo ambonin’ny kitay.', 'farany dia tonga teo amin’ilay toerana natoron’andriamanitra an’i abrahama izy mianaka. dia nanorina alitara teo i abrahama ka nandahatra ny kitay teo ambonin’ilay izy. avy eo dia nofatorany ny tongotra aman-tanan’i isaka zanany. dia nataony teo ambonin’ilay alitara izy, teo ambonin’ny kitay.'),
  ('6aadc6f1119e47fb4757c3d4', '2026-09-18T23:19:13.186Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:13.186Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 23, 7, 'Dia niankohoka teo anatrehan’ny tompon-tany i Abrahama, izany hoe teo anatrehan’ny taranak’i Heta,', 'dia niankohoka teo anatrehan’ny tompon-tany i abrahama, izany hoe teo anatrehan’ny taranak’i heta,'),
  ('6aadc6f1119e47fb4757c3df', '2026-09-18T23:19:13.186Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:13.186Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 23, 18, 'ho fananan’i Abrahama, dia fananana novidiny teo imason’ny taranak’i Heta, teo imason’izay rehetra niditra teo am-bavahadin’ny tanàna.', 'ho fananan’i abrahama, dia fananana novidiny teo imason’ny taranak’i heta, teo imason’izay rehetra niditra teo am-bavahadin’ny tanàna.'),
  ('6aadc6f1119e47fb4757c3d9', '2026-09-18T23:19:13.186Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:13.186Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 23, 12, 'Dia niankohoka teo anatrehan’ny tompon-tany i Abrahama,', 'dia niankohoka teo anatrehan’ny tompon-tany i abrahama,'),
  ('6aadc6f1119e47fb4757c3d6', '2026-09-18T23:19:13.186Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:13.186Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 23, 9, 'mba hivarotra amiko an’ilay lava-batony ao Makpela, eo amin’ny sisin’ny sahany. Asaivo amidiny amiko eto anatrehanareo araka izay tena vidiny ilay izy, amin’izay aho mba manana tany hataoko toeram-pandevenana.”', 'mba hivarotra amiko an’ilay lava-batony ao makpela, eo amin’ny sisin’ny sahany. asaivo amidiny amiko eto anatrehanareo araka izay tena vidiny ilay izy, amin’izay aho mba manana tany hataoko toeram-pandevenana.”'),
  ('6aadc6f1119e47fb4757c3cf', '2026-09-18T23:19:13.186Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:13.186Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 23, 2, 'Dia maty tao Kiriata-arba i Saraha, izany hoe tao Hebrona, any Kanana. Ary nanomboka nisaona sy nitomany an’i Saraha i Abrahama.', 'dia maty tao kiriata-arba i saraha, izany hoe tao hebrona, any kanana. ary nanomboka nisaona sy nitomany an’i saraha i abrahama.'),
  ('6aadc6f1119e47fb4757c3db', '2026-09-18T23:19:13.186Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:13.186Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 23, 14, 'Dia namaly an’i Abrahama i Efrona hoe:', 'dia namaly an’i abrahama i efrona hoe:'),
  ('6aadc6f1119e47fb4757c3d7', '2026-09-18T23:19:13.186Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:13.186Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 23, 10, 'Ary nipetraka teo niaraka tamin’ny taranak’i Heta i Efrona tamin’izay. Dia hoy i Efrona Hetita tamin’i Abrahama, teo imason’ny taranak’i Heta sy izay rehetra niditra teo am-bavahadin’ny tanàna:', 'ary nipetraka teo niaraka tamin’ny taranak’i heta i efrona tamin’izay. dia hoy i efrona hetita tamin’i abrahama, teo imason’ny taranak’i heta sy izay rehetra niditra teo am-bavahadin’ny tanàna:'),
  ('6aadc6f1119e47fb4757c3e0', '2026-09-18T23:19:13.186Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:13.186Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 23, 19, 'Avy eo dia nandevina an’i Saraha vadiny tao amin’ilay lava-bato i Abrahama, teo amin’ilay saha tao Makpela tandrifin’i Mamre, izany hoe tao Hebrona, any Kanana.', 'avy eo dia nandevina an’i saraha vadiny tao amin’ilay lava-bato i abrahama, teo amin’ilay saha tao makpela tandrifin’i mamre, izany hoe tao hebrona, any kanana.');
INSERT INTO "bible_verses" ("id", "created_date", "updated_date", "created_by_id", "created_by", "translation", "book", "bookOrder", "chapter", "verse", "text", "normalizedText") VALUES
  ('6aadc6f1119e47fb4757c3d5', '2026-09-18T23:19:13.186Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:13.186Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 23, 8, 'ka niteny hoe: “Raha manaiky ianareo ka avelanareo handevina ny vadiko aho, dia mba henoy aho. Reseo lahatra i Efrona zanak’i Zohara', 'ka niteny hoe: “raha manaiky ianareo ka avelanareo handevina ny vadiko aho, dia mba henoy aho. reseo lahatra i efrona zanak’i zohara'),
  ('6aadc6f1119e47fb4757c3ce', '2026-09-18T23:19:13.186Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:13.186Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 23, 1, 'Ary 127 taona ny andro niainan’i Saraha. Izany no taona niainany.', 'ary 127 taona ny andro niainan’i saraha. izany no taona niainany.'),
  ('6aadc6f1119e47fb4757c3d2', '2026-09-18T23:19:13.186Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:13.186Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 23, 5, 'Dia namaly an’i Abrahama ny taranak’i Heta hoe:', 'dia namaly an’i abrahama ny taranak’i heta hoe:'),
  ('6aadc6f1119e47fb4757c3d3', '2026-09-18T23:19:13.186Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:13.186Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 23, 6, '“Henoy izahay, tompoko. Voatendrin’Andriamanitra ho mpiadidy eto aminay ianao, ka azonao alevina ao amin’izay toeram-pandevenana tsara indrindra eto aminay ny vadinao. Samy vonona hanome anao ny toeram-pandevenanay daholo izahay, mba handevenanao ny vadinao.”', '“henoy izahay, tompoko. voatendrin’andriamanitra ho mpiadidy eto aminay ianao, ka azonao alevina ao amin’izay toeram-pandevenana tsara indrindra eto aminay ny vadinao. samy vonona hanome anao ny toeram-pandevenanay daholo izahay, mba handevenanao ny vadinao.”'),
  ('6aadc6f1119e47fb4757c3d8', '2026-09-18T23:19:13.186Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:13.186Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 23, 11, '“Sao dia mba tsy mety izany, tompoko! Mba henoy aho. Omeko anao daholo na ilay saha na ilay lava-bato ao. Eto imason’ny zanaky ny fireneko no anomezako an’izany anao. Aleveno ao ny vadinao.”', '“sao dia mba tsy mety izany, tompoko! mba henoy aho. omeko anao daholo na ilay saha na ilay lava-bato ao. eto imason’ny zanaky ny fireneko no anomezako an’izany anao. aleveno ao ny vadinao.”'),
  ('6aadc6f1119e47fb4757c3dd', '2026-09-18T23:19:13.186Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:13.186Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 23, 16, 'Dia neken’i Abrahama ihany ny tenin’i Efrona, ka nolanjainy ho an’i Efrona ilay volafotsy efa nolazainy teo anatrehan’ny taranak’i Heta, dia volafotsy 400 sekely, araka ny lanja fampiasan’ny mpivarotra.', 'dia neken’i abrahama ihany ny tenin’i efrona, ka nolanjainy ho an’i efrona ilay volafotsy efa nolazainy teo anatrehan’ny taranak’i heta, dia volafotsy 400 sekely, araka ny lanja fampiasan’ny mpivarotra.'),
  ('6aadc6f1119e47fb4757c3da', '2026-09-18T23:19:13.186Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:13.186Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 23, 13, 'ka niteny tamin’i Efrona teo anatrehan’ny olona hoe: “Mba henoy aho azafady! Homeko anao daholo ny volafotsy vidin’ilay saha. Dia raiso ilay vola omeko mba hahafahako handevina ny vadiko ao.”', 'ka niteny tamin’i efrona teo anatrehan’ny olona hoe: “mba henoy aho azafady! homeko anao daholo ny volafotsy vidin’ilay saha. dia raiso ilay vola omeko mba hahafahako handevina ny vadiko ao.”'),
  ('6aadc6f1119e47fb4757c3d0', '2026-09-18T23:19:13.186Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:13.186Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 23, 3, 'Niala teo amin’ilay vadiny efa maty izy avy eo, ka niteny tamin’ny taranak’i Heta hoe:', 'niala teo amin’ilay vadiny efa maty izy avy eo, ka niteny tamin’ny taranak’i heta hoe:'),
  ('6aadc6f1119e47fb4757c3e1', '2026-09-18T23:19:13.186Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:13.186Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 23, 20, 'Nafindran’ny taranak’i Heta tamin’i Abrahama àry ilay saha sy ilay lava-bato tao, ka lasa fananany mba hataony toeram-pandevenana.', 'nafindran’ny taranak’i heta tamin’i abrahama àry ilay saha sy ilay lava-bato tao, ka lasa fananany mba hataony toeram-pandevenana.'),
  ('6aadc6f1119e47fb4757c3de', '2026-09-18T23:19:13.186Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:13.186Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 23, 17, 'Koa ny sahan’i Efrona tao Makpela tandrifin’i Mamre, izany hoe ilay saha sy ilay lava-bato tao ary ny hazo rehetra tao anatin’ny faritr’ilay saha, dia nekena ara-dalàna', 'koa ny sahan’i efrona tao makpela tandrifin’i mamre, izany hoe ilay saha sy ilay lava-bato tao ary ny hazo rehetra tao anatin’ny faritr’ilay saha, dia nekena ara-dalàna'),
  ('6aadc6f1119e47fb4757c3dc', '2026-09-18T23:19:13.186Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:13.186Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 23, 15, '“Mba henoy aho, tompoko. Volafotsy 400 sekely no vidin’io tany io, nefa tsy misy dikany izany fa aleveno ao fotsiny ny vadinao.”', '“mba henoy aho, tompoko. volafotsy 400 sekely no vidin’io tany io, nefa tsy misy dikany izany fa aleveno ao fotsiny ny vadinao.”'),
  ('6aadc6f1119e47fb4757c3d1', '2026-09-18T23:19:13.186Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:13.186Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 23, 4, '“Vahiny sy mpiavy eto aminareo aho, ka mba omeo tany eto aminareo hataoko toeram-pandevenana. Dia ao no handevenako ny vadiko.”', '“vahiny sy mpiavy eto aminareo aho, ka mba omeo tany eto aminareo hataoko toeram-pandevenana. dia ao no handevenako ny vadiko.”'),
  ('6aadc6f101b60bc91bf2f252', '2026-09-18T23:19:13.606Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:13.606Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 24, 31, 'Tonga dia niteny i Labana hoe: “Tena notahin’i Jehovah ianao. Andao hiaraka amiko, fa maninona ianao no mijanona etỳ ivelany etỳ? Izaho efa nanomana ny trano sady efa nanomana toerana hatorian’ny rameva.”', 'tonga dia niteny i labana hoe: “tena notahin’i jehovah ianao. andao hiaraka amiko, fa maninona ianao no mijanona etỳ ivelany etỳ? izaho efa nanomana ny trano sady efa nanomana toerana hatorian’ny rameva.”'),
  ('6aadc6f101b60bc91bf2f250', '2026-09-18T23:19:13.606Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:13.606Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 24, 29, 'Ary nanana anadahy atao hoe Labana i Rebeka. Dia nihazakazaka nankeny amin’ilay lehilahy teny ivelany, teo an-doharano, i Labana.', 'ary nanana anadahy atao hoe labana i rebeka. dia nihazakazaka nankeny amin’ilay lehilahy teny ivelany, teo an-doharano, i labana.'),
  ('6aadc6f101b60bc91bf2f245', '2026-09-18T23:19:13.606Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:13.606Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 24, 18, 'Dia hoy ilay tovovavy: “Misotroa àry, tompoko.” Dia nampidininy haingana nankeo an-tanany ny sininy, ka nomeny rano hosotroina ilay lehilahy.', 'dia hoy ilay tovovavy: “misotroa àry, tompoko.” dia nampidininy haingana nankeo an-tanany ny sininy, ka nomeny rano hosotroina ilay lehilahy.'),
  ('6aadc6f101b60bc91bf2f247', '2026-09-18T23:19:13.606Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:13.606Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 24, 20, 'Koa nararany haingana tao anaty tavin-drano fisotroan’ny biby ny rano rehetra tao anaty sininy. Dia niverimberina nihazakazaka nankeo amin’ilay lavadrano izy, ka nantsaka tsy an-kijanona ho an’ny rameva rehetra.', 'koa nararany haingana tao anaty tavin-drano fisotroan’ny biby ny rano rehetra tao anaty sininy. dia niverimberina nihazakazaka nankeo amin’ilay lavadrano izy, ka nantsaka tsy an-kijanona ho an’ny rameva rehetra.'),
  ('6aadc6f101b60bc91bf2f249', '2026-09-18T23:19:13.606Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:13.606Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 24, 22, 'Rehefa avy nisotro rano ny rameva, dia namoaka kavin’orona volamena iray nilanja antsasaka sekely ilay lehilahy, sady namoaka brasele volamena roa nilanja folo sekely. Dia nomeny an’ilay tovovavy ireo.', 'rehefa avy nisotro rano ny rameva, dia namoaka kavin’orona volamena iray nilanja antsasaka sekely ilay lehilahy, sady namoaka brasele volamena roa nilanja folo sekely. dia nomeny an’ilay tovovavy ireo.'),
  ('6aadc6f101b60bc91bf2f244', '2026-09-18T23:19:13.606Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:13.606Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 24, 17, 'Tonga dia nihazakazaka nitsena azy ilay mpanompo, ka niteny hoe: “Mba omeo rano kely avy ao anatin’iny sininao iny ange aho hosotroiko e!”', 'tonga dia nihazakazaka nitsena azy ilay mpanompo, ka niteny hoe: “mba omeo rano kely avy ao anatin’iny sininao iny ange aho hosotroiko e!”'),
  ('6aadc6f101b60bc91bf2f240', '2026-09-18T23:19:13.606Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:13.606Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 24, 13, 'Eto akaikin’ity loharano ity aho izao, ary mivoaka hantsaka ny zanakavavin’ny olona ao an-tanàna.', 'eto akaikin’ity loharano ity aho izao, ary mivoaka hantsaka ny zanakavavin’ny olona ao an-tanàna.'),
  ('6aadc6f101b60bc91bf2f23b', '2026-09-18T23:19:13.606Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:13.606Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 24, 8, 'Raha tsy te hiaraka aminao kosa ilay vehivavy, dia ho afaka amin’izao fianianana izao ianao. Fa aza entina miverina any ny zanako.”', 'raha tsy te hiaraka aminao kosa ilay vehivavy, dia ho afaka amin’izao fianianana izao ianao. fa aza entina miverina any ny zanako.”'),
  ('6aadc6f101b60bc91bf2f243', '2026-09-18T23:19:13.606Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:13.606Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 24, 16, 'Tena tsara tarehy ilay tovovavy sady virjiny, ary mbola tsy nisy lehilahy nanao firaisana taminy. Nidina nankeo amin’ilay loharano izy dia nofenoiny rano ny sininy, ary niverina niakatra izy.', 'tena tsara tarehy ilay tovovavy sady virjiny, ary mbola tsy nisy lehilahy nanao firaisana taminy. nidina nankeo amin’ilay loharano izy dia nofenoiny rano ny sininy, ary niverina niakatra izy.'),
  ('6aadc6f101b60bc91bf2f239', '2026-09-18T23:19:13.606Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:13.606Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 24, 6, 'Dia hoy i Abrahama taminy: “Tandremo sao dia entinao miverina any ny zanako.', 'dia hoy i abrahama taminy: “tandremo sao dia entinao miverina any ny zanako.'),
  ('6aadc6f101b60bc91bf2f257', '2026-09-18T23:19:13.606Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:13.606Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 24, 36, 'I Saraha vadiny koa efa nitera-dahy tamin’ny tompoko, na efa antitra aza. Dia homen’ny tompoko an’io zanany io izay rehetra ananany.', 'i saraha vadiny koa efa nitera-dahy tamin’ny tompoko, na efa antitra aza. dia homen’ny tompoko an’io zanany io izay rehetra ananany.'),
  ('6aadc6f101b60bc91bf2f251', '2026-09-18T23:19:13.606Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:13.606Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 24, 30, 'Hitany mantsy ny kavina teny amin’ny oron’ny anabaviny sy ny brasele teny an-tanany, sady efa henony ilay notantarain’i Rebeka anabaviny hoe: “Izany no nolazain’ilay lehilahy tamiko.” Dia nandeha nitsena an’ilay lehilahy izy, ka io fa mbola nijoro teo akaikin’ny rameva, teo an-doharano, ilay lehilahy.', 'hitany mantsy ny kavina teny amin’ny oron’ny anabaviny sy ny brasele teny an-tanany, sady efa henony ilay notantarain’i rebeka anabaviny hoe: “izany no nolazain’ilay lehilahy tamiko.” dia nandeha nitsena an’ilay lehilahy izy, ka io fa mbola nijoro teo akaikin’ny rameva, teo an-doharano, ilay lehilahy.'),
  ('6aadc6f101b60bc91bf2f24a', '2026-09-18T23:19:13.606Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:13.606Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 24, 23, 'Ary hoy izy: “Fa hono ho’aho, zanak’iza moa ianao? Ary misy azonay atoriana ve ao an-tranon’ny rainao?”', 'ary hoy izy: “fa hono ho’aho, zanak’iza moa ianao? ary misy azonay atoriana ve ao an-tranon’ny rainao?”'),
  ('6aadc6f101b60bc91bf2f246', '2026-09-18T23:19:13.606Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:13.606Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 24, 19, 'Dia hoy ilay tovovavy rehefa avy nanome rano azy: “Ao fa hantsaka ho an’ny ramevanao koa aho, mandra-pisotron’izy rehetra.”', 'dia hoy ilay tovovavy rehefa avy nanome rano azy: “ao fa hantsaka ho an’ny ramevanao koa aho, mandra-pisotron’izy rehetra.”'),
  ('6aadc6f101b60bc91bf2f242', '2026-09-18T23:19:13.606Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:13.606Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 24, 15, 'Mbola tsy tapitra akory anefa ny tenin’ilay mpanompo, dia iny fa nivoaka ny tanàna i Rebeka, zanakavavin’i Betoela zanakalahin’i Milka, vadin’i Nahora rahalahin’i Abrahama. Nitondra ny sininy teny an-tsorony i Rebeka.', 'mbola tsy tapitra akory anefa ny tenin’ilay mpanompo, dia iny fa nivoaka ny tanàna i rebeka, zanakavavin’i betoela zanakalahin’i milka, vadin’i nahora rahalahin’i abrahama. nitondra ny sininy teny an-tsorony i rebeka.'),
  ('6aadc6f101b60bc91bf2f248', '2026-09-18T23:19:13.606Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:13.606Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 24, 21, 'Dia variana nandinika azy teo foana ilay lehilahy sady tsy nahateny. Gaga be izy sady lasa saina raha notahin’i Jehovah ny diany na tsia.', 'dia variana nandinika azy teo foana ilay lehilahy sady tsy nahateny. gaga be izy sady lasa saina raha notahin’i jehovah ny diany na tsia.'),
  ('6aadc6f101b60bc91bf2f241', '2026-09-18T23:19:13.606Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:13.606Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 24, 14, 'Koa aleo re mba izao no hitranga e: Izay tovovavy teneniko hoe: ‘Mba ampidino kely ny sininao hisotroako rano’, ka mamaly hoe: ‘Misotroa àry! Ao fa homeko rano koa ny ramevanao’, dia enga anie mba ho izy ilay fidinao ho an’i Isaka mpanomponao. Dia izany no hahafantarako fa tianao ny tompoko sady tsy mivadika aminy ianao.”', 'koa aleo re mba izao no hitranga e: izay tovovavy teneniko hoe: ‘mba ampidino kely ny sininao hisotroako rano’, ka mamaly hoe: ‘misotroa àry! ao fa homeko rano koa ny ramevanao’, dia enga anie mba ho izy ilay fidinao ho an’i isaka mpanomponao. dia izany no hahafantarako fa tianao ny tompoko sady tsy mivadika aminy ianao.”'),
  ('6aadc6f101b60bc91bf2f23c', '2026-09-18T23:19:13.606Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:13.606Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 24, 9, 'Dia nataon’ilay mpanompo tao ambany fen’i Abrahama tompony ny tanany, ka nianiana an’izany taminy izy.', 'dia nataon’ilay mpanompo tao ambany fen’i abrahama tompony ny tanany, ka nianiana an’izany taminy izy.'),
  ('6aadc6f101b60bc91bf2f254', '2026-09-18T23:19:13.606Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:13.606Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 24, 33, 'Dia naroso teo amin’ilay lehilahy ny sakafo, nefa hoy izy: “Tsy hihinana aho aloha raha tsy efa voalazako ny anton-diako.” Dia hoy i Labana: “Lazao àry!”', 'dia naroso teo amin’ilay lehilahy ny sakafo, nefa hoy izy: “tsy hihinana aho aloha raha tsy efa voalazako ny anton-diako.” dia hoy i labana: “lazao àry!”'),
  ('6aadc6f101b60bc91bf2f24f', '2026-09-18T23:19:13.606Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:13.606Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 24, 28, 'Dia nihazakazaka nilaza an’izany tamin’ny ankohonan-dreniny ilay tovovavy.', 'dia nihazakazaka nilaza an’izany tamin’ny ankohonan-dreniny ilay tovovavy.'),
  ('6aadc6f101b60bc91bf2f23e', '2026-09-18T23:19:13.606Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:13.606Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 24, 11, 'Rehefa tonga teo amin’ny lavadrano iray teo ivelan’ny tanàna izy, dia najanony ny rameva ka nampandohalehiny teo. Efa harivariva tamin’izay, tamin’ny fotoana fandehanan’ny vehivavy hantsaka rano.', 'rehefa tonga teo amin’ny lavadrano iray teo ivelan’ny tanàna izy, dia najanony ny rameva ka nampandohalehiny teo. efa harivariva tamin’izay, tamin’ny fotoana fandehanan’ny vehivavy hantsaka rano.'),
  ('6aadc6f101b60bc91bf2f238', '2026-09-18T23:19:13.606Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:13.606Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 24, 5, 'Hoy anefa ilay mpanompo taminy: “Ahoana raha tsy te hiaraka amiko ho atỳ amin’ity tany ity ilay vehivavy? Tokony hoentiko miverina any amin’ilay tany niavianao ve ny zanakao?”', 'hoy anefa ilay mpanompo taminy: “ahoana raha tsy te hiaraka amiko ho atỳ amin’ity tany ity ilay vehivavy? tokony hoentiko miverina any amin’ilay tany niavianao ve ny zanakao?”'),
  ('6aadc6f101b60bc91bf2f258', '2026-09-18T23:19:13.606Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:13.606Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 24, 37, 'Nasain’ny tompoko nianiana àry aho. Dia hoy izy: ‘Aza maka vady ho an’ny zanako avy amin’ny zanakavavin’ny Kananita tompon’ity tany ipetrahako ity.', 'nasain’ny tompoko nianiana àry aho. dia hoy izy: ‘aza maka vady ho an’ny zanako avy amin’ny zanakavavin’ny kananita tompon’ity tany ipetrahako ity.'),
  ('6aadc6f101b60bc91bf2f237', '2026-09-18T23:19:13.606Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:13.606Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 24, 4, 'Fa mandehana any amin’ny taniko sy ny havako, dia any ianao no haka vady ho an’i Isaka zanako.”', 'fa mandehana any amin’ny taniko sy ny havako, dia any ianao no haka vady ho an’i isaka zanako.”'),
  ('6aadc6f101b60bc91bf2f23f', '2026-09-18T23:19:13.606Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:13.606Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 24, 12, 'Dia hoy izy: “Ry Jehovah, Andriamanitr’i Abrahama tompoko ô! Mba tahio re ny zavatra ataoko amin’ity andro anio ity e! Dia mba asehoy hoe tia an’i Abrahama tompoko ianao sady tsy mivadika aminy.', 'dia hoy izy: “ry jehovah, andriamanitr’i abrahama tompoko ô! mba tahio re ny zavatra ataoko amin’ity andro anio ity e! dia mba asehoy hoe tia an’i abrahama tompoko ianao sady tsy mivadika aminy.'),
  ('6aadc6f101b60bc91bf2f235', '2026-09-18T23:19:13.606Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:13.606Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 24, 2, 'Dia hoy i Abrahama tamin’ny mpanompony, ilay zokiny indrindra tao amin’ny ankohonany sady niandraikitra ny fananany rehetra: “Mba ataovy ato ambany feko ny tananao, azafady!', 'dia hoy i abrahama tamin’ny mpanompony, ilay zokiny indrindra tao amin’ny ankohonany sady niandraikitra ny fananany rehetra: “mba ataovy ato ambany feko ny tananao, azafady!'),
  ('6aadc6f101b60bc91bf2f234', '2026-09-18T23:19:13.606Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:13.606Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 24, 1, 'Efa antitra sady efa be taona i Abrahama. Ary efa nitahy azy tamin’ny zava-drehetra i Jehovah.', 'efa antitra sady efa be taona i abrahama. ary efa nitahy azy tamin’ny zava-drehetra i jehovah.'),
  ('6aadc6f101b60bc91bf2f255', '2026-09-18T23:19:13.606Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:13.606Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 24, 34, 'Ary hoy ilay lehilahy: “Mpanompon’i Abrahama aho.', 'ary hoy ilay lehilahy: “mpanompon’i abrahama aho.'),
  ('6aadc6f101b60bc91bf2f23d', '2026-09-18T23:19:13.606Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:13.606Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 24, 10, 'Koa naka rameva folo tamin’ny ramevan’ny tompony ilay mpanompo, dia niainga. Ary nitondra fanomezana isan-karazany avy amin’ny tompony izy. Dia lasa izy nankany Mezopotamia, ho any amin’ny tanànan’i Nahora.', 'koa naka rameva folo tamin’ny ramevan’ny tompony ilay mpanompo, dia niainga. ary nitondra fanomezana isan-karazany avy amin’ny tompony izy. dia lasa izy nankany mezopotamia, ho any amin’ny tanànan’i nahora.'),
  ('6aadc6f101b60bc91bf2f256', '2026-09-18T23:19:13.606Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:13.606Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 24, 35, 'Efa nomen’i Jehovah fitahiana be dia be ny tompoko, ary efa nataony nanan-karena be, ka nomeny ondry sy omby, volafotsy sy volamena, mpanompolahy sy mpanompovavy, ary rameva sy ampondra.', 'efa nomen’i jehovah fitahiana be dia be ny tompoko, ary efa nataony nanan-karena be, ka nomeny ondry sy omby, volafotsy sy volamena, mpanompolahy sy mpanompovavy, ary rameva sy ampondra.'),
  ('6aadc6f101b60bc91bf2f24e', '2026-09-18T23:19:13.606Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:13.606Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 24, 27, 'ka niteny hoe: “Hoderaina anie i Jehovah, Andriamanitr’i Abrahama tompoko! Fa tsy nivadika tamin’ny tompoko mihitsy izy sady tia azy foana. Nitana ny teniny tamin’ny tompoko foana koa i Jehovah, dia nitarika ahy ho atỳ an-tranon’ny rahalahin’ny tompoko.”', 'ka niteny hoe: “hoderaina anie i jehovah, andriamanitr’i abrahama tompoko! fa tsy nivadika tamin’ny tompoko mihitsy izy sady tia azy foana. nitana ny teniny tamin’ny tompoko foana koa i jehovah, dia nitarika ahy ho atỳ an-tranon’ny rahalahin’ny tompoko.”'),
  ('6aadc6f101b60bc91bf2f24c', '2026-09-18T23:19:13.606Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:13.606Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 24, 25, 'Hoy koa izy: “Manana mololo izahay, dia misy sakafom-biby betsaka sy toerana hatoriana koa ao aminay.”', 'hoy koa izy: “manana mololo izahay, dia misy sakafom-biby betsaka sy toerana hatoriana koa ao aminay.”'),
  ('6aadc6f101b60bc91bf2f24b', '2026-09-18T23:19:13.606Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:13.606Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 24, 24, 'Dia hoy ilay tovovavy: “Zanak’i Betoela aho, dia i Betoela zanakalahin’i Milka sy Nahora.”', 'dia hoy ilay tovovavy: “zanak’i betoela aho, dia i betoela zanakalahin’i milka sy nahora.”'),
  ('6aadc6f101b60bc91bf2f253', '2026-09-18T23:19:13.606Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:13.606Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 24, 32, 'Koa niditra tao an-trano ilay lehilahy. Dia novahany ny entana teo amin’ny rameva, ka nomeny mololo sy sakafo ny rameva. Nomeny rano koa ilay lehilahy sy ny olona niaraka taminy mba hanasany tongotra.', 'koa niditra tao an-trano ilay lehilahy. dia novahany ny entana teo amin’ny rameva, ka nomeny mololo sy sakafo ny rameva. nomeny rano koa ilay lehilahy sy ny olona niaraka taminy mba hanasany tongotra.'),
  ('6aadc6f101b60bc91bf2f24d', '2026-09-18T23:19:13.606Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:13.606Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 24, 26, 'Dia niondrika sy niankohoka teo anatrehan’i Jehovah ilay lehilahy,', 'dia niondrika sy niankohoka teo anatrehan’i jehovah ilay lehilahy,'),
  ('6aadc6f101b60bc91bf2f23a', '2026-09-18T23:19:13.606Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:13.606Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 24, 7, 'Efa nalain’i Jehovah Andriamanitry ny lanitra avy tany amin’ny ankohonan-draiko sy ny tanin’ny havako mantsy aho. Izy koa efa nianiana tamiko hoe: ‘Ny taranakao no homeko an’ity tany ity.’ Koa haniraka ny anjeliny eo alohanao izy, ka any ianao no haka vady ho an’ny zanako.', 'efa nalain’i jehovah andriamanitry ny lanitra avy tany amin’ny ankohonan-draiko sy ny tanin’ny havako mantsy aho. izy koa efa nianiana tamiko hoe: ‘ny taranakao no homeko an’ity tany ity.’ koa haniraka ny anjeliny eo alohanao izy, ka any ianao no haka vady ho an’ny zanako.'),
  ('6aadc6f101b60bc91bf2f236', '2026-09-18T23:19:13.606Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:13.606Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 24, 3, 'Dia hasaiko hianiana amin’ny anaran’i Jehovah Andriamanitry ny lanitra sy ny tany ianao hoe tsy haka vady ho an’ny zanako avy amin’ny zanakavavin’ny Kananita eto amin’ity tany ipetrahako ity.', 'dia hasaiko hianiana amin’ny anaran’i jehovah andriamanitry ny lanitra sy ny tany ianao hoe tsy haka vady ho an’ny zanako avy amin’ny zanakavavin’ny kananita eto amin’ity tany ipetrahako ity.'),
  ('6aadc6f101b60bc91bf2f25a', '2026-09-18T23:19:13.607Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:13.607Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 24, 39, 'Hoy anefa aho tamin’ny tompoko: ‘Dia ahoana raha tsy te hiaraka amiko ilay vehivavy?’', 'hoy anefa aho tamin’ny tompoko: ‘dia ahoana raha tsy te hiaraka amiko ilay vehivavy?’'),
  ('6aadc6f101b60bc91bf2f272', '2026-09-18T23:19:13.607Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:13.607Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 24, 63, 'Dia nivoaka nandehandeha tany an-tsaha izy mba hisaintsaina, rehefa ho alina ny andro. Rehefa nitazana izy, dia hitany hoe ireny nisy rameva nanatona!', 'dia nivoaka nandehandeha tany an-tsaha izy mba hisaintsaina, rehefa ho alina ny andro. rehefa nitazana izy, dia hitany hoe ireny nisy rameva nanatona!'),
  ('6aadc6f101b60bc91bf2f26c', '2026-09-18T23:19:13.607Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:13.607Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 24, 57, 'Hoy àry izy ireo: “Andao hantsoina i Rebeka dia hanontaniantsika ny heviny.”', 'hoy àry izy ireo: “andao hantsoina i rebeka dia hanontaniantsika ny heviny.”'),
  ('6aadc6f101b60bc91bf2f269', '2026-09-18T23:19:13.607Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:13.607Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 24, 54, 'Taorian’izay dia nihinana sy nisotro izy sy ny olona niaraka taminy. Dia natory tao izy ireo. Rehefa nifoha ilay lehilahy ny ampitson’iny, dia niteny hoe: “Avelao aho hiverina any amin’ny tompoko.”', 'taorian’izay dia nihinana sy nisotro izy sy ny olona niaraka taminy. dia natory tao izy ireo. rehefa nifoha ilay lehilahy ny ampitson’iny, dia niteny hoe: “avelao aho hiverina any amin’ny tompoko.”'),
  ('6aadc6f101b60bc91bf2f25b', '2026-09-18T23:19:13.607Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:13.607Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 24, 40, 'Dia hoy izy tamiko: ‘I Jehovah ilay tompoiko no haniraka ny anjeliny hanampy anao, ka hitahy ny dianao. Dia any amin’ny fianakaviako sy ny ankohonan-draiko ianao no haka vady ho an’ny zanako.', 'dia hoy izy tamiko: ‘i jehovah ilay tompoiko no haniraka ny anjeliny hanampy anao, ka hitahy ny dianao. dia any amin’ny fianakaviako sy ny ankohonan-draiko ianao no haka vady ho an’ny zanako.'),
  ('6aadc6f101b60bc91bf2f274', '2026-09-18T23:19:13.607Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:13.607Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 24, 65, 'Ary hoy izy tamin’ilay mpanompo: “Fa iza iny lehilahy mandeha eny an-tsaha mitsena antsika iny?” Dia hoy ilay mpanompo: “Ny tompoko iny.” Koa nalain’i Rebeka ny saron-dohany ka nosaronany ny lohany.', 'ary hoy izy tamin’ilay mpanompo: “fa iza iny lehilahy mandeha eny an-tsaha mitsena antsika iny?” dia hoy ilay mpanompo: “ny tompoko iny.” koa nalain’i rebeka ny saron-dohany ka nosaronany ny lohany.'),
  ('6aadc6f101b60bc91bf2f25f', '2026-09-18T23:19:13.607Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:13.607Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 24, 44, 'Dia hiteny amiko izy hoe: “Misotroa àry! Ao koa fa hantsaka ho an’ny ramevanao aho.” Dia enga anie ka izay vehivavy izay ilay nofidin’i Jehovah ho an’ny zanaky ny tompoko!’', 'dia hiteny amiko izy hoe: “misotroa àry! ao koa fa hantsaka ho an’ny ramevanao aho.” dia enga anie ka izay vehivavy izay ilay nofidin’i jehovah ho an’ny zanaky ny tompoko!’'),
  ('6aadc6f101b60bc91bf2f26e', '2026-09-18T23:19:13.607Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:13.607Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 24, 59, 'Koa nalefan’izy ireo i Rebeka anabaviny, sy ilay vehivavy nampinono azy taloha, ary ilay mpanompon’i Abrahama sy ny olona niaraka taminy.', 'koa nalefan’izy ireo i rebeka anabaviny, sy ilay vehivavy nampinono azy taloha, ary ilay mpanompon’i abrahama sy ny olona niaraka taminy.'),
  ('6aadc6f101b60bc91bf2f264', '2026-09-18T23:19:13.607Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:13.607Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 24, 49, 'Koa mba lazao ahy raha tianareo haseho amin’ny tompoko hoe tsy mivadika aminy ianareo sady tia azy foana, ary mitana ny teninareo aminy. Fa raha tsy izany kosa dia lazao ahy, mba hahafantarako an’izay tokony hataoko.”', 'koa mba lazao ahy raha tianareo haseho amin’ny tompoko hoe tsy mivadika aminy ianareo sady tia azy foana, ary mitana ny teninareo aminy. fa raha tsy izany kosa dia lazao ahy, mba hahafantarako an’izay tokony hataoko.”'),
  ('6aadc6f101b60bc91bf2f25e', '2026-09-18T23:19:13.607Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:13.607Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 24, 43, 'dia enga anie ka izao no hitranga: Mijoro eto an-doharano aho izao, ka rehefa misy tovovavy mivoaka hantsaka, dia hilazako hoe: “Mba avelao re aho hisotro rano kely avy amin’iny sininao iny e!”', 'dia enga anie ka izao no hitranga: mijoro eto an-doharano aho izao, ka rehefa misy tovovavy mivoaka hantsaka, dia hilazako hoe: “mba avelao re aho hisotro rano kely avy amin’iny sininao iny e!”'),
  ('6aadc6f101b60bc91bf2f270', '2026-09-18T23:19:13.607Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:13.607Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 24, 61, 'Dia niainga i Rebeka sy ireo mpanompovaviny, ka nitaingina rameva ary nanaraka an’ilay lehilahy. Nitondra an’i Rebeka àry ilay mpanompo dia lasa.', 'dia niainga i rebeka sy ireo mpanompovaviny, ka nitaingina rameva ary nanaraka an’ilay lehilahy. nitondra an’i rebeka àry ilay mpanompo dia lasa.'),
  ('6aadc6f101b60bc91bf2f268', '2026-09-18T23:19:13.607Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:13.607Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 24, 53, 'Dia namoaka zavatra vita tamin’ny volafotsy sy volamena ilay mpanompo sady namoaka akanjo, ka nomeny an’i Rebeka izany. Nomeny zava-tsarobidy koa ny anadahiny sy ny reniny.', 'dia namoaka zavatra vita tamin’ny volafotsy sy volamena ilay mpanompo sady namoaka akanjo, ka nomeny an’i rebeka izany. nomeny zava-tsarobidy koa ny anadahiny sy ny reniny.'),
  ('6aadc6f101b60bc91bf2f266', '2026-09-18T23:19:13.607Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:13.607Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 24, 51, 'Io eo anatrehanao io i Rebeka. Ento izy ka mandehana, dia ho lasa vadin’ny zanaky ny tomponao izy, araka izay nolazain’i Jehovah.”', 'io eo anatrehanao io i rebeka. ento izy ka mandehana, dia ho lasa vadin’ny zanaky ny tomponao izy, araka izay nolazain’i jehovah.”'),
  ('6aadc6f101b60bc91bf2f26d', '2026-09-18T23:19:13.607Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:13.607Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 24, 58, 'Dia nantsoin’izy ireo i Rebeka ka nanontaniany hoe: “Handeha hiaraka amin’io lehilahy io ve ianao?” Dia hoy izy: “Ie, vonona handeha aho!”', 'dia nantsoin’izy ireo i rebeka ka nanontaniany hoe: “handeha hiaraka amin’io lehilahy io ve ianao?” dia hoy izy: “ie, vonona handeha aho!”'),
  ('6aadc6f101b60bc91bf2f275', '2026-09-18T23:19:13.607Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:13.607Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 24, 66, 'Ary notantarain’ilay mpanompo tamin’i Isaka daholo ny zava-drehetra nataony.', 'ary notantarain’ilay mpanompo tamin’i isaka daholo ny zava-drehetra nataony.'),
  ('6aadc6f101b60bc91bf2f273', '2026-09-18T23:19:13.607Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:13.607Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 24, 64, 'Nitazana koa i Rebeka ka nahita an’i Isaka, dia nidina haingana avy teo amin’ny rameva.', 'nitazana koa i rebeka ka nahita an’i isaka, dia nidina haingana avy teo amin’ny rameva.'),
  ('6aadc6f101b60bc91bf2f265', '2026-09-18T23:19:13.607Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:13.607Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 24, 50, 'Dia hoy i Labana sy Betoela: “Avy amin’i Jehovah izao zavatra izao. Tsy afaka milaza aminao izahay hoe eny na tsia.', 'dia hoy i labana sy betoela: “avy amin’i jehovah izao zavatra izao. tsy afaka milaza aminao izahay hoe eny na tsia.'),
  ('6aadc6f101b60bc91bf2f262', '2026-09-18T23:19:13.607Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:13.607Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 24, 47, 'Nanontaniako izy avy eo hoe: ‘Fa zanak’iza moa ianao?’ Dia hoy izy: ‘Zanak’i Betoela aho, dia i Betoela zanakalahin’i Nahora sy Milka.’ Dia nataoko teo amin’ny orony ilay kavin’orona, ary teo amin’ny tanany ireo brasele.', 'nanontaniako izy avy eo hoe: ‘fa zanak’iza moa ianao?’ dia hoy izy: ‘zanak’i betoela aho, dia i betoela zanakalahin’i nahora sy milka.’ dia nataoko teo amin’ny orony ilay kavin’orona, ary teo amin’ny tanany ireo brasele.'),
  ('6aadc6f101b60bc91bf2f260', '2026-09-18T23:19:13.607Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:13.607Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 24, 45, '“Raha mbola niteny an’izany anakampo aho, dia iny fa nivoaka ny tanàna i Rebeka nitondra ny sininy teny an-tsorony. Nidina nankeo an-doharano izy ka nantsaka. Dia hoy aho taminy: ‘Mba omeo rano kely re aho hosotroiko e!’', '“raha mbola niteny an’izany anakampo aho, dia iny fa nivoaka ny tanàna i rebeka nitondra ny sininy teny an-tsorony. nidina nankeo an-doharano izy ka nantsaka. dia hoy aho taminy: ‘mba omeo rano kely re aho hosotroiko e!’'),
  ('6aadc6f101b60bc91bf2f25d', '2026-09-18T23:19:13.607Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:13.607Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 24, 42, '“Rehefa tonga teo an-doharano aho androany, dia hoy aho: ‘Ry Jehovah, Andriamanitr’i Abrahama tompoko ô, raha tahinao ny diako,', '“rehefa tonga teo an-doharano aho androany, dia hoy aho: ‘ry jehovah, andriamanitr’i abrahama tompoko ô, raha tahinao ny diako,'),
  ('6aadc6f101b60bc91bf2f25c', '2026-09-18T23:19:13.607Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:13.607Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 24, 41, 'Rehefa tonga any amin’ny fianakaviako anefa ianao ka tsy homeny anao ilay vehivavy, dia tsy ho voafatotr’ilay fianianana nataonao tamiko ianao. Tsy ho voafatotr’ilay fianianana nataonao intsony ianao amin’izay.’', 'rehefa tonga any amin’ny fianakaviako anefa ianao ka tsy homeny anao ilay vehivavy, dia tsy ho voafatotr’ilay fianianana nataonao tamiko ianao. tsy ho voafatotr’ilay fianianana nataonao intsony ianao amin’izay.’'),
  ('6aadc6f101b60bc91bf2f276', '2026-09-18T23:19:13.607Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:13.607Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 24, 67, 'Dia nentin’i Isaka nankao an-tranolain’i Saraha reniny i Rebeka, ka nalainy ho vady. Koa lasa tia an’i Rebeka i Isaka, ka nionona tamin’ny nahafatesan-dreniny.', 'dia nentin’i isaka nankao an-tranolain’i saraha reniny i rebeka, ka nalainy ho vady. koa lasa tia an’i rebeka i isaka, ka nionona tamin’ny nahafatesan-dreniny.'),
  ('6aadc6f101b60bc91bf2f271', '2026-09-18T23:19:13.607Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:13.607Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 24, 62, 'Ary avy tany amin’ny lalana mankany Bera-lahai-roy i Isaka, satria nipetraka tao amin’ny faritr’i Negeba izy.', 'ary avy tany amin’ny lalana mankany bera-lahai-roy i isaka, satria nipetraka tao amin’ny faritr’i negeba izy.'),
  ('6aadc6f101b60bc91bf2f261', '2026-09-18T23:19:13.607Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:13.607Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 24, 46, 'Dia nampidininy haingana avy teny an-tsorony ny sininy, ka hoy izy: ‘Misotroa àry! Dia ao koa homeko rano ny ramevanao.’ Koa nisotro aho, dia nomeny rano koa ny rameva.', 'dia nampidininy haingana avy teny an-tsorony ny sininy, ka hoy izy: ‘misotroa àry! dia ao koa homeko rano ny ramevanao.’ koa nisotro aho, dia nomeny rano koa ny rameva.'),
  ('6aadc6f101b60bc91bf2f26a', '2026-09-18T23:19:13.607Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:13.607Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 24, 55, 'Dia hoy ny anadahin’i Rebeka sy ny reniny: “Aleo i Rebeka mba hijanona eto aminay folo andro, fara fahakeliny, dia afaka mandeha izy avy eo.”', 'dia hoy ny anadahin’i rebeka sy ny reniny: “aleo i rebeka mba hijanona eto aminay folo andro, fara fahakeliny, dia afaka mandeha izy avy eo.”'),
  ('6aadc6f101b60bc91bf2f263', '2026-09-18T23:19:13.607Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:13.607Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 24, 48, 'Dia niondrika sy niankohoka teo anatrehan’i Jehovah aho, ka nidera an’i Jehovah, Andriamanitr’i Abrahama tompoko. Fa notarihiny tamin’ny lalana tokony halehako aho, mba hahita ny zanakavavin’ny rahalahin’ny tompoko ka haka azy ho an’ilay zanany.', 'dia niondrika sy niankohoka teo anatrehan’i jehovah aho, ka nidera an’i jehovah, andriamanitr’i abrahama tompoko. fa notarihiny tamin’ny lalana tokony halehako aho, mba hahita ny zanakavavin’ny rahalahin’ny tompoko ka haka azy ho an’ilay zanany.'),
  ('6aadc6f101b60bc91bf2f259', '2026-09-18T23:19:13.607Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:13.607Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 24, 38, 'Fa mandehana any amin’ny ankohonan-draiko sy ny fianakaviako, dia any ianao no haka vady ho an’ny zanako.’', 'fa mandehana any amin’ny ankohonan-draiko sy ny fianakaviako, dia any ianao no haka vady ho an’ny zanako.’'),
  ('6aadc6f101b60bc91bf2f26f', '2026-09-18T23:19:13.607Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:13.607Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 24, 60, 'Ary nitso-drano an’i Rebeka izy ireo hoe: “Ry anabavinay ô, enga anie ianao hanan-janaka be dia be, ary enga anie ho azon’ny taranakao ny vavahadin’izay mankahala azy!”', 'ary nitso-drano an’i rebeka izy ireo hoe: “ry anabavinay ô, enga anie ianao hanan-janaka be dia be, ary enga anie ho azon’ny taranakao ny vavahadin’izay mankahala azy!”'),
  ('6aadc6f101b60bc91bf2f26b', '2026-09-18T23:19:13.607Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:13.607Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 24, 56, 'Hoy anefa ilay lehilahy: “Aza sakananareo tsy handeha aho, fa efa notahin’i Jehovah ny diako. Alefaso ho any amin’ny tompoko aho.”', 'hoy anefa ilay lehilahy: “aza sakananareo tsy handeha aho, fa efa notahin’i jehovah ny diako. alefaso ho any amin’ny tompoko aho.”'),
  ('6aadc6f101b60bc91bf2f267', '2026-09-18T23:19:13.607Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:13.607Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 24, 52, 'Raha vao henon’ilay mpanompon’i Abrahama izany tenin’izy ireo izany, dia niankohoka tamin’ny tany teo anatrehan’i Jehovah izy.', 'raha vao henon’ilay mpanompon’i abrahama izany tenin’izy ireo izany, dia niankohoka tamin’ny tany teo anatrehan’i jehovah izy.'),
  ('6aadc6f20b4d1de6f8fb5e76', '2026-09-18T23:19:14.104Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:14.104Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 25, 33, 'Dia hoy i Jakoba: “Mila mianiana amiko aloha ianao e!” Dia nianiana tamin’i Jakoba i Esao, ka namidiny taminy ny zony amin’ny maha lahimatoa azy.', 'dia hoy i jakoba: “mila mianiana amiko aloha ianao e!” dia nianiana tamin’i jakoba i esao, ka namidiny taminy ny zony amin’ny maha lahimatoa azy.'),
  ('6aadc6f20b4d1de6f8fb5e71', '2026-09-18T23:19:14.104Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:14.104Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 25, 28, 'Ary tia an’i Esao i Isaka, satria izy nitondra haza hohaniny. Fa i Rebeka kosa tia an’i Jakoba.', 'ary tia an’i esao i isaka, satria izy nitondra haza hohaniny. fa i rebeka kosa tia an’i jakoba.'),
  ('6aadc6f20b4d1de6f8fb5e6f', '2026-09-18T23:19:14.104Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:14.104Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 25, 26, 'Avy eo dia nivoaka koa ny rahalahiny, ary nitazona ny voditongotr’i Esao ny tanany. Koa natao hoe Jakoba ny anarany. Ary 60 taona i Isaka tamin’i Rebeka niteraka azy mirahalahy.', 'avy eo dia nivoaka koa ny rahalahiny, ary nitazona ny voditongotr’i esao ny tanany. koa natao hoe jakoba ny anarany. ary 60 taona i isaka tamin’i rebeka niteraka azy mirahalahy.'),
  ('6aadc6f20b4d1de6f8fb5e64', '2026-09-18T23:19:14.104Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:14.104Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 25, 15, 'Hadada, Tema, Jetora, Nafisy, ary Kedema.', 'hadada, tema, jetora, nafisy, ary kedema.'),
  ('6aadc6f20b4d1de6f8fb5e75', '2026-09-18T23:19:14.104Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:14.104Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 25, 32, 'Ary hoy i Esao: “Efa ho faty ihany aho, ka hataoko inona koa izay zon’ny lahimatoa?”', 'ary hoy i esao: “efa ho faty ihany aho, ka hataoko inona koa izay zon’ny lahimatoa?”'),
  ('6aadc6f20b4d1de6f8fb5e60', '2026-09-18T23:19:14.104Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:14.104Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 25, 11, 'Taorian’ny nahafatesan’i Abrahama, dia mbola nitahy foana an’i Isaka zanany Andriamanitra. Ary nipetraka teny akaikin’i Bera-lahai-roy i Isaka.', 'taorian’ny nahafatesan’i abrahama, dia mbola nitahy foana an’i isaka zanany andriamanitra. ary nipetraka teny akaikin’i bera-lahai-roy i isaka.'),
  ('6aadc6f20b4d1de6f8fb5e59', '2026-09-18T23:19:14.104Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:14.104Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 25, 4, 'Ny zanakalahin’i Midianina dia i Efaha, Efera, Hanoka, Abida, ary Eldaha. Ireo rehetra ireo no taranak’i Ketora.', 'ny zanakalahin’i midianina dia i efaha, efera, hanoka, abida, ary eldaha. ireo rehetra ireo no taranak’i ketora.'),
  ('6aadc6f20b4d1de6f8fb5e69', '2026-09-18T23:19:14.104Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:14.104Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 25, 20, 'Ary 40 taona i Isaka tamin’izy nanambady an’i Rebeka, zanakavavin’i Betoela Aramianina avy any Padana-arama, sady anabavin’i Labana Aramianina.', 'ary 40 taona i isaka tamin’izy nanambady an’i rebeka, zanakavavin’i betoela aramianina avy any padana-arama, sady anabavin’i labana aramianina.'),
  ('6aadc6f20b4d1de6f8fb5e56', '2026-09-18T23:19:14.104Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:14.104Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 25, 1, 'Ary nanambady indray i Abrahama. Ketora no anaran’ilay vadiny.', 'ary nanambady indray i abrahama. ketora no anaran’ilay vadiny.'),
  ('6aadc6f20b4d1de6f8fb5e5a', '2026-09-18T23:19:14.104Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:14.104Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 25, 5, 'Tatỳ aoriana, dia nomen’i Abrahama an’i Isaka ny fananany rehetra.', 'tatỳ aoriana, dia nomen’i abrahama an’i isaka ny fananany rehetra.'),
  ('6aadc6f20b4d1de6f8fb5e6d', '2026-09-18T23:19:14.104Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:14.104Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 25, 24, 'Rehefa tonga ny fotoana tokony hiterahany, dia kambana tokoa no tao an-kibony!', 'rehefa tonga ny fotoana tokony hiterahany, dia kambana tokoa no tao an-kibony!'),
  ('6aadc6f20b4d1de6f8fb5e5e', '2026-09-18T23:19:14.104Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:14.104Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 25, 9, 'Dia nandevina azy tao amin’ny lava-bato tao Makpela ireo zanany roa lahy, Isaka sy Ismaela, tao amin’ny sahan’i Efrona zanak’i Zohara Hetita. Io ilay saha tandrifin’i Mamre,', 'dia nandevina azy tao amin’ny lava-bato tao makpela ireo zanany roa lahy, isaka sy ismaela, tao amin’ny sahan’i efrona zanak’i zohara hetita. io ilay saha tandrifin’i mamre,'),
  ('6aadc6f20b4d1de6f8fb5e72', '2026-09-18T23:19:14.104Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:14.104Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 25, 29, 'Nahandro lantihy i Jakoba, indray mandeha, dia iny fa tonga avy tany an-tsaha i Esao. Reraka be izy tamin’izay.', 'nahandro lantihy i jakoba, indray mandeha, dia iny fa tonga avy tany an-tsaha i esao. reraka be izy tamin’izay.'),
  ('6aadc6f20b4d1de6f8fb5e74', '2026-09-18T23:19:14.104Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:14.104Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 25, 31, 'Dia hoy i Jakoba: “Amidio amiko àry aloha ny zonao amin’ny maha lahimatoa anao!”', 'dia hoy i jakoba: “amidio amiko àry aloha ny zonao amin’ny maha lahimatoa anao!”'),
  ('6aadc6f20b4d1de6f8fb5e70', '2026-09-18T23:19:14.104Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:14.104Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 25, 27, 'Rehefa nihalehibe ireo zazalahy ireo, dia lasa mpihaza mahay i Esao, ka tia nandehandeha tany an-tsaha. I Jakoba indray lehilahy tsy nisy tsiny, sady nipetraka an-tranolay.', 'rehefa nihalehibe ireo zazalahy ireo, dia lasa mpihaza mahay i esao, ka tia nandehandeha tany an-tsaha. i jakoba indray lehilahy tsy nisy tsiny, sady nipetraka an-tranolay.'),
  ('6aadc6f20b4d1de6f8fb5e68', '2026-09-18T23:19:14.104Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:14.104Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 25, 19, 'Ary izao no tantaran’i Isaka zanakalahin’i Abrahama: I Abrahama niteraka an’i Isaka.', 'ary izao no tantaran’i isaka zanakalahin’i abrahama: i abrahama niteraka an’i isaka.'),
  ('6aadc6f20b4d1de6f8fb5e5f', '2026-09-18T23:19:14.104Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:14.104Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 25, 10, 'izay novidin’i Abrahama tamin’ny taranak’i Heta. Tao no nandevenana an’i Abrahama sy Saraha vadiny.', 'izay novidin’i abrahama tamin’ny taranak’i heta. tao no nandevenana an’i abrahama sy saraha vadiny.'),
  ('6aadc6f20b4d1de6f8fb5e58', '2026-09-18T23:19:14.104Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:14.104Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 25, 3, 'Ary niteraka an’i Sheba sy Dedana i Joksana. Ny zanakalahin’i Dedana dia i Asorima sy Letosima ary Leomima.', 'ary niteraka an’i sheba sy dedana i joksana. ny zanakalahin’i dedana dia i asorima sy letosima ary leomima.'),
  ('6aadc6f20b4d1de6f8fb5e6a', '2026-09-18T23:19:14.104Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:14.104Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 25, 21, 'Nitalaho foana tamin’i Jehovah ho an’ny vadiny i Isaka, satria momba ilay vadiny. Dia nohenoin’i Jehovah ny fitalahoany, ka bevohoka i Rebeka.', 'nitalaho foana tamin’i jehovah ho an’ny vadiny i isaka, satria momba ilay vadiny. dia nohenoin’i jehovah ny fitalahoany, ka bevohoka i rebeka.'),
  ('6aadc6f20b4d1de6f8fb5e67', '2026-09-18T23:19:14.104Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:14.104Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 25, 18, 'Nipetraka hatrany Havila teny akaikin’i Sora, tany akaikin’i Ejipta, ka hatrany Asyria ny taranany. Nipetraka teny akaikin’ny rahalahiny rehetra izy ireo.', 'nipetraka hatrany havila teny akaikin’i sora, tany akaikin’i ejipta, ka hatrany asyria ny taranany. nipetraka teny akaikin’ny rahalahiny rehetra izy ireo.'),
  ('6aadc6f20b4d1de6f8fb5e61', '2026-09-18T23:19:14.104Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:14.104Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 25, 12, 'Izao no tantaran’i Ismaela zanakalahin’i Abrahama, izay naterak’i Hagara Ejipsianina, mpanompovavin’i Saraha:', 'izao no tantaran’i ismaela zanakalahin’i abrahama, izay naterak’i hagara ejipsianina, mpanompovavin’i saraha:'),
  ('6aadc6f20b4d1de6f8fb5e5b', '2026-09-18T23:19:14.104Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:14.104Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 25, 6, 'Fanomezana kosa no nomeny an’ireo zanany lahy hafa naterak’ireo vadikeliny. Mbola velona koa izy, dia efa nasainy nankany Atsinanana ireo, mba hipetraka lavitra an’i Isaka zanany.', 'fanomezana kosa no nomeny an’ireo zanany lahy hafa naterak’ireo vadikeliny. mbola velona koa izy, dia efa nasainy nankany atsinanana ireo, mba hipetraka lavitra an’i isaka zanany.'),
  ('6aadc6f20b4d1de6f8fb5e77', '2026-09-18T23:19:14.104Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:14.104Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 25, 34, 'Koa nomen’i Jakoba mofo sy lantihy izy, ka nihinana sy nisotro. Ary nitsangana izy dia lasa. Toy izany no nanaovan’i Esao tsinontsinona ny zon’ny lahimatoa.', 'koa nomen’i jakoba mofo sy lantihy izy, ka nihinana sy nisotro. ary nitsangana izy dia lasa. toy izany no nanaovan’i esao tsinontsinona ny zon’ny lahimatoa.'),
  ('6aadc6f20b4d1de6f8fb5e6e', '2026-09-18T23:19:14.104Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:14.104Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 25, 25, 'Dia nivoaka ny voalohany, ka mena ny vatany manontolo sady voloina be. Koa natao hoe Esao ny anarany.', 'dia nivoaka ny voalohany, ka mena ny vatany manontolo sady voloina be. koa natao hoe esao ny anarany.'),
  ('6aadc6f20b4d1de6f8fb5e63', '2026-09-18T23:19:14.104Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:14.104Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 25, 14, 'Misma, Doma, Masa,', 'misma, doma, masa,'),
  ('6aadc6f20b4d1de6f8fb5e6c', '2026-09-18T23:19:14.104Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:14.104Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 25, 23, 'Dia hoy i Jehovah taminy: “Firenena roa no ao an-kibonao, ary vahoaka roa no hisaraka avy ao anatinao. Ny vahoaka iray dia hatanjaka noho ny iray, ary ny zokiny hanompo ny zandriny.”', 'dia hoy i jehovah taminy: “firenena roa no ao an-kibonao, ary vahoaka roa no hisaraka avy ao anatinao. ny vahoaka iray dia hatanjaka noho ny iray, ary ny zokiny hanompo ny zandriny.”'),
  ('6aadc6f20b4d1de6f8fb5e6b', '2026-09-18T23:19:14.104Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:14.104Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 25, 22, 'Ary niady ireo zaza tao an-kibony. Dia hoy i Rebeka: “Raha hijaly hoatr’izao aho, dia maninona àry aho no mbola velona ihany?” Koa nanontany an’i Jehovah izy.', 'ary niady ireo zaza tao an-kibony. dia hoy i rebeka: “raha hijaly hoatr’izao aho, dia maninona àry aho no mbola velona ihany?” koa nanontany an’i jehovah izy.'),
  ('6aadc6f20b4d1de6f8fb5e5c', '2026-09-18T23:19:14.104Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:14.104Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 25, 7, 'Ary 175 taona ny andro niainan’i Abrahama.', 'ary 175 taona ny andro niainan’i abrahama.'),
  ('6aadc6f20b4d1de6f8fb5e65', '2026-09-18T23:19:14.104Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:14.104Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 25, 16, 'Ireo no zanakalahin’i Ismaela, ary ireo no anarany araka ny tanànany avy sy ny tobiny, izany hoe mpiadidy 12, araka ny fokony avy.', 'ireo no zanakalahin’i ismaela, ary ireo no anarany araka ny tanànany avy sy ny tobiny, izany hoe mpiadidy 12, araka ny fokony avy.'),
  ('6aadc6f20b4d1de6f8fb5e57', '2026-09-18T23:19:14.104Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:14.104Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 25, 2, 'Ireto avy no naterany tamin’i Abrahama, rehefa nandeha ny fotoana: Zimrana, Joksana, Medana, Midianina, Jisbaka, ary Soaha.', 'ireto avy no naterany tamin’i abrahama, rehefa nandeha ny fotoana: zimrana, joksana, medana, midianina, jisbaka, ary soaha.'),
  ('6aadc6f20b4d1de6f8fb5e73', '2026-09-18T23:19:14.104Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:14.104Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 25, 30, 'Dia hoy i Esao tamin’i Jakoba: “Mba omeo amin’io lantihy mena io aho! Haingana fa reraka be aho!” Izany no nahatonga ny anarany hatao hoe Edoma.', 'dia hoy i esao tamin’i jakoba: “mba omeo amin’io lantihy mena io aho! haingana fa reraka be aho!” izany no nahatonga ny anarany hatao hoe edoma.'),
  ('6aadc6f20b4d1de6f8fb5e66', '2026-09-18T23:19:14.104Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:14.104Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 25, 17, 'Ary velona 137 taona i Ismaela, dia niala aina ka maty. Ary nangonina any amin’ny razambeny izy.', 'ary velona 137 taona i ismaela, dia niala aina ka maty. ary nangonina any amin’ny razambeny izy.'),
  ('6aadc6f20b4d1de6f8fb5e62', '2026-09-18T23:19:14.104Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:14.104Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 25, 13, 'Ireto avy ny anaran’ny zanakalahin’i Ismaela, araka ny anarany avy sy araka ny fianakaviana nipoirany: I Nebaiota no lahimatoan’i Ismaela, ary nanarakaraka azy i Kedara, Adbela, Mibsama,', 'ireto avy ny anaran’ny zanakalahin’i ismaela, araka ny anarany avy sy araka ny fianakaviana nipoirany: i nebaiota no lahimatoan’i ismaela, ary nanarakaraka azy i kedara, adbela, mibsama,'),
  ('6aadc6f20b4d1de6f8fb5e5d', '2026-09-18T23:19:14.104Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:14.104Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 25, 8, 'Dia niala aina izy ka maty, rehefa ela velona sady efa antitra sy afa-po tamin’ny fiainana. Ary nangonina any amin’ny razambeny izy.', 'dia niala aina izy ka maty, rehefa ela velona sady efa antitra sy afa-po tamin’ny fiainana. ary nangonina any amin’ny razambeny izy.'),
  ('6aadc6f45a11bb782cd8c140', '2026-09-18T23:19:16.911Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:16.911Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 26, 23, 'Ary niala teo izy ka niakatra nankany Beri-sheba.', 'ary niala teo izy ka niakatra nankany beri-sheba.'),
  ('6aadc6f45a11bb782cd8c136', '2026-09-18T23:19:16.911Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:16.911Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 26, 13, 'Dia lasa nanan-karena i Isaka, ary nitombo be ny fananany, ka vao mainka lasa mpanankarena be izy.', 'dia lasa nanan-karena i isaka, ary nitombo be ny fananany, ka vao mainka lasa mpanankarena be izy.'),
  ('6aadc6f45a11bb782cd8c135', '2026-09-18T23:19:16.911Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:16.911Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 26, 12, 'Dia nanomboka namafy voa tao amin’izany tany izany i Isaka. Ary nahatratra avo 100 heny ny vokatra azony tamin’io taona io, satria notahin’i Jehovah izy.', 'dia nanomboka namafy voa tao amin’izany tany izany i isaka. ary nahatratra avo 100 heny ny vokatra azony tamin’io taona io, satria notahin’i jehovah izy.'),
  ('6aadc6f45a11bb782cd8c149', '2026-09-18T23:19:16.911Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:16.911Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 26, 32, 'Tamin’io andro io, dia tonga ny mpanompon’i Isaka ka nitantara taminy momba an’ilay lavadrano nolavahan’izy ireo. Hoy izy ireo: “Nahita rano izahay!”', 'tamin’io andro io, dia tonga ny mpanompon’i isaka ka nitantara taminy momba an’ilay lavadrano nolavahan’izy ireo. hoy izy ireo: “nahita rano izahay!”'),
  ('6aadc6f45a11bb782cd8c13a', '2026-09-18T23:19:16.911Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:16.911Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 26, 17, 'Niala tao àry i Isaka, dia nitoby teo amin’ny lohasahan’i Gerara, ka nipetraka tao.', 'niala tao àry i isaka, dia nitoby teo amin’ny lohasahan’i gerara, ka nipetraka tao.'),
  ('6aadc6f45a11bb782cd8c12d', '2026-09-18T23:19:16.911Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:16.911Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 26, 4, '‘Hataoko lasa be dia be hoatran’ny kintana eny amin’ny lanitra ny taranakao, ary homeko ny taranakao ireo tany rehetra ireo. Dia hahazo fitahiana amin’ny alalan’ny taranakao ny firenena rehetra eny ambonin’ny tany.’', '‘hataoko lasa be dia be hoatran’ny kintana eny amin’ny lanitra ny taranakao, ary homeko ny taranakao ireo tany rehetra ireo. dia hahazo fitahiana amin’ny alalan’ny taranakao ny firenena rehetra eny ambonin’ny tany.’'),
  ('6aadc6f45a11bb782cd8c145', '2026-09-18T23:19:16.911Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:16.911Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 26, 28, 'Dia hoy ireo: “Satria tena hitanay fa manampy anao i Jehovah. Dia tapa-kevitra izahay fa hiteny aminao hoe: ‘Andao hanao fianianana isika, ary andao hanao fifanekena', 'dia hoy ireo: “satria tena hitanay fa manampy anao i jehovah. dia tapa-kevitra izahay fa hiteny aminao hoe: ‘andao hanao fianianana isika, ary andao hanao fifanekena'),
  ('6aadc6f45a11bb782cd8c13d', '2026-09-18T23:19:16.911Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:16.911Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 26, 20, 'Nifamaly tamin’ny mpiandry ondrin’i Isaka anefa ny mpiandry ondry tao Gerara, ka nilaza hoe: “Anay io rano io!” Dia nataon’i Isaka hoe Eseka ny anaran’ilay lavadrano, satria nifamaly taminy izy ireo.', 'nifamaly tamin’ny mpiandry ondrin’i isaka anefa ny mpiandry ondry tao gerara, ka nilaza hoe: “anay io rano io!” dia nataon’i isaka hoe eseka ny anaran’ilay lavadrano, satria nifamaly taminy izy ireo.'),
  ('6aadc6f45a11bb782cd8c13e', '2026-09-18T23:19:16.911Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:16.911Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 26, 21, 'Nandavaka lavadrano hafa indray ny mpanompon’i Isaka, nefa nampifamaly azy ireo koa ilay izy. Dia nataon’i Isaka hoe Sitna ny anaran’ilay izy.', 'nandavaka lavadrano hafa indray ny mpanompon’i isaka, nefa nampifamaly azy ireo koa ilay izy. dia nataon’i isaka hoe sitna ny anaran’ilay izy.'),
  ('6aadc6f45a11bb782cd8c133', '2026-09-18T23:19:16.911Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:16.911Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 26, 10, 'Hoy indray i Abimeleka: “Fa inona ity nataonao taminay? Raha sanatria nisy olona nanao firaisana tamin’ny vadinao mantsy, dia ho nanota izahay noho ianao!”', 'hoy indray i abimeleka: “fa inona ity nataonao taminay? raha sanatria nisy olona nanao firaisana tamin’ny vadinao mantsy, dia ho nanota izahay noho ianao!”'),
  ('6aadc6f45a11bb782cd8c142', '2026-09-18T23:19:16.911Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:16.911Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 26, 25, 'Koa nanorina alitara teo i Isaka ka niantso ny anaran’i Jehovah, sady nanangana tranolay teo. Ary nandavaka lavadrano teo ny mpanompony.', 'koa nanorina alitara teo i isaka ka niantso ny anaran’i jehovah, sady nanangana tranolay teo. ary nandavaka lavadrano teo ny mpanompony.'),
  ('6aadc6f45a11bb782cd8c13f', '2026-09-18T23:19:16.911Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:16.911Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 26, 22, 'Tatỳ aoriana, dia niala teo izy ka nandavaka lavadrano hafa indray. Tsy nampifamaly azy ireo intsony anefa ilay izy. Dia nataony hoe Rehobota ny anaran’ilay izy, fa hoy izy: “Satria i Jehovah efa nanome antsika toerana malalaka, ka nataony lasa be dia be eto amin’ity tany ity isika.”', 'tatỳ aoriana, dia niala teo izy ka nandavaka lavadrano hafa indray. tsy nampifamaly azy ireo intsony anefa ilay izy. dia nataony hoe rehobota ny anaran’ilay izy, fa hoy izy: “satria i jehovah efa nanome antsika toerana malalaka, ka nataony lasa be dia be eto amin’ity tany ity isika.”'),
  ('6aadc6f45a11bb782cd8c139', '2026-09-18T23:19:16.911Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:16.911Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 26, 16, 'Ary hoy i Abimeleka tamin’i Isaka: “Mialà eto aminay, fa lasa mahery lavitra noho izahay ianao.”', 'ary hoy i abimeleka tamin’i isaka: “mialà eto aminay, fa lasa mahery lavitra noho izahay ianao.”'),
  ('6aadc6f45a11bb782cd8c12f', '2026-09-18T23:19:16.911Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:16.911Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 26, 6, 'Dia mbola nipetraka tao Gerara i Isaka.', 'dia mbola nipetraka tao gerara i isaka.'),
  ('6aadc6f45a11bb782cd8c141', '2026-09-18T23:19:16.911Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:16.911Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 26, 24, 'Niseho taminy i Jehovah tamin’iny alina iny, ka niteny hoe: “Izaho no Andriamanitr’i Abrahama rainao. Aza matahotra fa hanampy anao aho. Noho i Abrahama mpanompoko, dia hitahy anao aho ka hataoko lasa be dia be ny taranakao.”', 'niseho taminy i jehovah tamin’iny alina iny, ka niteny hoe: “izaho no andriamanitr’i abrahama rainao. aza matahotra fa hanampy anao aho. noho i abrahama mpanompoko, dia hitahy anao aho ka hataoko lasa be dia be ny taranakao.”'),
  ('6aadc6f45a11bb782cd8c14b', '2026-09-18T23:19:16.911Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:16.911Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 26, 34, 'Rehefa 40 taona i Esao, dia nalainy ho vady i Jodita zanakavavin’i Bery Hetita. Nalainy ho vady koa i Basemata zanakavavin’i Elona Hetita.', 'rehefa 40 taona i esao, dia nalainy ho vady i jodita zanakavavin’i bery hetita. nalainy ho vady koa i basemata zanakavavin’i elona hetita.'),
  ('6aadc6f45a11bb782cd8c12e', '2026-09-18T23:19:16.911Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:16.911Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 26, 5, 'Nihaino ny teniko mantsy i Abrahama ka nataony foana izay nampanaoviko azy, sady nankatò foana ny didiko sy ny fitsipiko ary ny lalàko izy.”', 'nihaino ny teniko mantsy i abrahama ka nataony foana izay nampanaoviko azy, sady nankatò foana ny didiko sy ny fitsipiko ary ny lalàko izy.”'),
  ('6aadc6f45a11bb782cd8c12a', '2026-09-18T23:19:16.911Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:16.911Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 26, 1, 'Ary nisy mosary tao amin’ilay tany, ankoatra an’ilay mosary voalohany tamin’ny andron’i Abrahama. Dia lasa nankany amin’i Abimeleka mpanjakan’ny Filistinina, tany Gerara, i Isaka.', 'ary nisy mosary tao amin’ilay tany, ankoatra an’ilay mosary voalohany tamin’ny andron’i abrahama. dia lasa nankany amin’i abimeleka mpanjakan’ny filistinina, tany gerara, i isaka.'),
  ('6aadc6f45a11bb782cd8c14c', '2026-09-18T23:19:16.911Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:16.911Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 26, 35, 'Nahatonga an’i Isaka sy Rebeka halahelo be izy ireo.', 'nahatonga an’i isaka sy rebeka halahelo be izy ireo.'),
  ('6aadc6f45a11bb782cd8c137', '2026-09-18T23:19:16.911Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:16.911Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 26, 14, 'Nahazo andian’ondry sy andian’omby ary mpanompo maro be izy, ka lasa nialona azy ny Filistinina.', 'nahazo andian’ondry sy andian’omby ary mpanompo maro be izy, ka lasa nialona azy ny filistinina.'),
  ('6aadc6f45a11bb782cd8c148', '2026-09-18T23:19:16.911Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:16.911Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 26, 31, 'Ary nifoha maraina izy ireo ny ampitso, ka nianiana tamin’ny andaniny ny ankilany. Taorian’izay, dia navelan’i Isaka handeha izy ireo ka lasa soa aman-tsara.', 'ary nifoha maraina izy ireo ny ampitso, ka nianiana tamin’ny andaniny ny ankilany. taorian’izay, dia navelan’i isaka handeha izy ireo ka lasa soa aman-tsara.'),
  ('6aadc6f45a11bb782cd8c147', '2026-09-18T23:19:16.911Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:16.911Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 26, 30, 'Dia nanao fanasambe ho azy ireo i Isaka, ka nihinana sy nisotro izy ireo.', 'dia nanao fanasambe ho azy ireo i isaka, ka nihinana sy nisotro izy ireo.'),
  ('6aadc6f45a11bb782cd8c13c', '2026-09-18T23:19:16.911Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:16.911Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 26, 19, 'Ary nahita lavadrano nisy rano madio tsara ny mpanompon’i Isaka, rehefa nandavaka teo amin’ilay lohasaha.', 'ary nahita lavadrano nisy rano madio tsara ny mpanompon’i isaka, rehefa nandavaka teo amin’ilay lohasaha.'),
  ('6aadc6f45a11bb782cd8c132', '2026-09-18T23:19:16.911Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:16.911Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 26, 9, 'Tonga dia niantso an’i Isaka i Abimeleka ka niteny hoe: “Hay vadinao izy! Koa naninona ianao no niteny hoe: ‘Anabaviko izy’?” Dia hoy i Isaka taminy: “Nilaza an’izany aho, sao hisy hamono noho izy.”', 'tonga dia niantso an’i isaka i abimeleka ka niteny hoe: “hay vadinao izy! koa naninona ianao no niteny hoe: ‘anabaviko izy’?” dia hoy i isaka taminy: “nilaza an’izany aho, sao hisy hamono noho izy.”'),
  ('6aadc6f45a11bb782cd8c134', '2026-09-18T23:19:16.911Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:16.911Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 26, 11, 'Dia namoaka didy ho an’ny olona rehetra i Abimeleka hoe: “Hovonoina ho faty izay mikasika an’io lehilahy io sy ny vadiny!”', 'dia namoaka didy ho an’ny olona rehetra i abimeleka hoe: “hovonoina ho faty izay mikasika an’io lehilahy io sy ny vadiny!”'),
  ('6aadc6f45a11bb782cd8c130', '2026-09-18T23:19:16.911Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:16.911Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 26, 7, 'Ary nanontany momba ny vadiny foana ireo lehilahy teo an-toerana, nefa hoy izy: “Anabaviko izy.” Fa natahotra izy hilaza hoe: “Vadiko izy”, satria nieritreritra izy hoe hovonoin’ireo lehilahy ireo noho ny amin’i Rebeka. Tsara tarehy mantsy i Rebeka.', 'ary nanontany momba ny vadiny foana ireo lehilahy teo an-toerana, nefa hoy izy: “anabaviko izy.” fa natahotra izy hilaza hoe: “vadiko izy”, satria nieritreritra izy hoe hovonoin’ireo lehilahy ireo noho ny amin’i rebeka. tsara tarehy mantsy i rebeka.'),
  ('6aadc6f45a11bb782cd8c14a', '2026-09-18T23:19:16.911Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:16.911Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 26, 33, 'Dia nataon’i Isaka hoe Shiba ny anaran’izy io. Izany no nahatonga ny anaran’ilay tanàna hoe Beri-sheba hatramin’izao.', 'dia nataon’i isaka hoe shiba ny anaran’izy io. izany no nahatonga ny anaran’ilay tanàna hoe beri-sheba hatramin’izao.'),
  ('6aadc6f45a11bb782cd8c138', '2026-09-18T23:19:16.911Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:16.911Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 26, 15, 'Dia naka tany ny Filistinina ka nototofany ny lavadrano rehetra efa nolavahan’ny mpanompon’i Abrahama rain’i Isaka fony fahavelony.', 'dia naka tany ny filistinina ka nototofany ny lavadrano rehetra efa nolavahan’ny mpanompon’i abrahama rain’i isaka fony fahavelony.'),
  ('6aadc6f45a11bb782cd8c143', '2026-09-18T23:19:16.911Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:16.911Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 26, 26, 'Tatỳ aoriana, dia niainga avy any Gerara i Abimeleka, niaraka tamin’i Ahozata mpanolo-tsainy sy Pikola lehiben’ny tafiny, ka tonga teo amin’i Isaka.', 'tatỳ aoriana, dia niainga avy any gerara i abimeleka, niaraka tamin’i ahozata mpanolo-tsainy sy pikola lehiben’ny tafiny, ka tonga teo amin’i isaka.'),
  ('6aadc6f45a11bb782cd8c12c', '2026-09-18T23:19:16.911Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:16.911Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 26, 3, 'Ary aoka ianao hivahiny eto amin’ity tany ity, dia hanampy anao foana aho sady hitahy anao. Ianao sy ny taranakao mantsy no homeko an’ireo tany rehetra ireo. Dia hotanterahiko ilay fianianana nataoko tamin’i Abrahama rainao hoe:', 'ary aoka ianao hivahiny eto amin’ity tany ity, dia hanampy anao foana aho sady hitahy anao. ianao sy ny taranakao mantsy no homeko an’ireo tany rehetra ireo. dia hotanterahiko ilay fianianana nataoko tamin’i abrahama rainao hoe:'),
  ('6aadc6f45a11bb782cd8c146', '2026-09-18T23:19:16.911Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:16.911Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 26, 29, 'hoe tsy hanisy ratsy anay ianao, satria izahay mbola tsy nanao ratsy taminao, fa navelanay handeha soa aman-tsara ianao. Ianao mantsy izao no tahin’i Jehovah.’”', 'hoe tsy hanisy ratsy anay ianao, satria izahay mbola tsy nanao ratsy taminao, fa navelanay handeha soa aman-tsara ianao. ianao mantsy izao no tahin’i jehovah.’”'),
  ('6aadc6f45a11bb782cd8c144', '2026-09-18T23:19:16.911Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:16.911Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 26, 27, 'Ary hoy i Isaka tamin’izy ireo: “Fa maninona ianareo no mankatỳ amiko, nefa ianareo aza efa nankahala ahy sady nandroaka ahy niala tany aminareo?”', 'ary hoy i isaka tamin’izy ireo: “fa maninona ianareo no mankatỳ amiko, nefa ianareo aza efa nankahala ahy sady nandroaka ahy niala tany aminareo?”'),
  ('6aadc6f45a11bb782cd8c13b', '2026-09-18T23:19:16.911Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:16.911Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 26, 18, 'Dia nolavahan’i Isaka indray ireo lavadrano efa nolavahana tamin’ny andron’i Abrahama rainy, izay efa nototofan’ny Filistinina taorian’ny nahafatesan’i Abrahama. Efa nomen’ny rainy anarana avy izy ireny, dia izay ihany no niantsoany azy.', 'dia nolavahan’i isaka indray ireo lavadrano efa nolavahana tamin’ny andron’i abrahama rainy, izay efa nototofan’ny filistinina taorian’ny nahafatesan’i abrahama. efa nomen’ny rainy anarana avy izy ireny, dia izay ihany no niantsoany azy.'),
  ('6aadc6f45a11bb782cd8c131', '2026-09-18T23:19:16.911Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:16.911Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 26, 8, 'Rehefa afaka elaela, dia nitazantazana teo am-baravarankely i Abimeleka mpanjakan’ny Filistinina, ka nahita an’i Isaka naneho fitiavana tamin’i Rebeka vadiny.', 'rehefa afaka elaela, dia nitazantazana teo am-baravarankely i abimeleka mpanjakan’ny filistinina, ka nahita an’i isaka naneho fitiavana tamin’i rebeka vadiny.'),
  ('6aadc6f45a11bb782cd8c12b', '2026-09-18T23:19:16.911Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:16.911Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 26, 2, 'Ary niseho taminy i Jehovah ka niteny hoe: “Aza midina any Ejipta, fa mipetraha any amin’izay tany hasehoko anao.', 'ary niseho taminy i jehovah ka niteny hoe: “aza midina any ejipta, fa mipetraha any amin’izay tany hasehoko anao.'),
  ('6aadc6f6f53a64a47c564bed', '2026-09-18T23:19:18.097Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:18.097Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 27, 8, 'Henoy tsara aho, anaka, dia ataovy izao asaiko ataonao izao:', 'henoy tsara aho, anaka, dia ataovy izao asaiko ataonao izao:'),
  ('6aadc6f6f53a64a47c564beb', '2026-09-18T23:19:18.097Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:18.097Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 27, 6, 'Dia hoy i Rebeka tamin’i Jakoba zanany: “Vao henoko teo ny dadanao niteny tamin’i Esao rahalahinao hoe:', 'dia hoy i rebeka tamin’i jakoba zanany: “vao henoko teo ny dadanao niteny tamin’i esao rahalahinao hoe:'),
  ('6aadc6f6f53a64a47c564be9', '2026-09-18T23:19:18.097Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:18.097Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 27, 4, 'Ary anaovy an’ilay sakafo matsiro tena tiako iny aho, dia ento atỳ amiko ilay izy hohaniko. Dia hitso-drano anao aho, alohan’ny hahafatesako.”', 'ary anaovy an’ilay sakafo matsiro tena tiako iny aho, dia ento atỳ amiko ilay izy hohaniko. dia hitso-drano anao aho, alohan’ny hahafatesako.”'),
  ('6aadc6f6f53a64a47c564bee', '2026-09-18T23:19:18.097Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:18.097Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 27, 9, 'Mandehana any amin’ny ondry aman’osy, azafady, dia ento atỳ izay zanak’osy roa tsara indrindra mba hanaovako sakafo matsiro ho an’ny dadanao, araka ilay itiavany azy.', 'mandehana any amin’ny ondry aman’osy, azafady, dia ento atỳ izay zanak’osy roa tsara indrindra mba hanaovako sakafo matsiro ho an’ny dadanao, araka ilay itiavany azy.'),
  ('6aadc6f6f53a64a47c564bea', '2026-09-18T23:19:18.097Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:18.097Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 27, 5, 'Nihaino ny resak’i Isaka tamin’i Esao zanany anefa i Rebeka tamin’izay. Ary lasa nankany an-tsaha i Esao mba hitady haza ka hitondra an’izany mody.', 'nihaino ny resak’i isaka tamin’i esao zanany anefa i rebeka tamin’izay. ary lasa nankany an-tsaha i esao mba hitady haza ka hitondra an’izany mody.'),
  ('6aadc6f6f53a64a47c564be7', '2026-09-18T23:19:18.097Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:18.097Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 27, 2, 'Dia hoy i Isaka: “Efa antitra aho izao, nefa tsy fantatro hoe rahoviana aho no ho faty.', 'dia hoy i isaka: “efa antitra aho izao, nefa tsy fantatro hoe rahoviana aho no ho faty.'),
  ('6aadc6f6f53a64a47c564bf2', '2026-09-18T23:19:18.097Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:18.097Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 27, 13, 'Dia hoy ny reniny: “Aleo hihatra amiko izany ozona izany, anaka. Fa araho fotsiny ny teniko, dia mandehana ka itondray zanak’osy aho.”', 'dia hoy ny reniny: “aleo hihatra amiko izany ozona izany, anaka. fa araho fotsiny ny teniko, dia mandehana ka itondray zanak’osy aho.”'),
  ('6aadc6f6f53a64a47c564bec', '2026-09-18T23:19:18.097Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:18.097Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 27, 7, '‘Itondray haza aho, dia anaovy sakafo matsiro. Dia hohaniko ilay izy ka hitso-drano anao eo anatrehan’i Jehovah aho, alohan’ny hahafatesako.’', '‘itondray haza aho, dia anaovy sakafo matsiro. dia hohaniko ilay izy ka hitso-drano anao eo anatrehan’i jehovah aho, alohan’ny hahafatesako.’'),
  ('6aadc6f6f53a64a47c564bef', '2026-09-18T23:19:18.097Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:18.097Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 27, 10, 'Dia ento any amin’ny dadanao izany hohaniny, amin’izay izy hitso-drano anao alohan’ny hahafatesany.”', 'dia ento any amin’ny dadanao izany hohaniny, amin’izay izy hitso-drano anao alohan’ny hahafatesany.”'),
  ('6aadc6f6f53a64a47c564bf3', '2026-09-18T23:19:18.097Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:18.097Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 27, 14, 'Lasa naka zanak’osy àry izy ka nitondra an’izany tany amin’ny reniny. Dia nanao sakafo matsiro araka ilay itiavan’ny rainy azy ny reniny.', 'lasa naka zanak’osy àry izy ka nitondra an’izany tany amin’ny reniny. dia nanao sakafo matsiro araka ilay itiavan’ny rainy azy ny reniny.'),
  ('6aadc6f6f53a64a47c564bf0', '2026-09-18T23:19:18.097Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:18.097Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 27, 11, 'Dia hoy i Jakoba tamin’i Rebeka reniny: “I Esao rahalahiko ange voloina e, fa izaho malamalama hoditra.', 'dia hoy i jakoba tamin’i rebeka reniny: “i esao rahalahiko ange voloina e, fa izaho malamalama hoditra.'),
  ('6aadc6f6f53a64a47c564be8', '2026-09-18T23:19:18.097Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:18.097Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 27, 3, 'Koa mba alaivo ny fitaovana fitondranao mihaza, dia ny tranon-jana-tsipìkanao sy ny tsipìkanao. Mandehana mihaza any an-tsaha dia ento atỳ amiko izay azonao.', 'koa mba alaivo ny fitaovana fitondranao mihaza, dia ny tranon-jana-tsipìkanao sy ny tsipìkanao. mandehana mihaza any an-tsaha dia ento atỳ amiko izay azonao.'),
  ('6aadc6f6f53a64a47c564bf1', '2026-09-18T23:19:18.097Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:18.097Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 27, 12, 'Dia ahoana raha mitsapa ahy i Dada? Tena hoatran’ny hoe mananihany azy aho amin’izay, ka ozona no ho azoko, fa tsy tsodrano.”', 'dia ahoana raha mitsapa ahy i dada? tena hoatran’ny hoe mananihany azy aho amin’izay, ka ozona no ho azoko, fa tsy tsodrano.”'),
  ('6aadc6f6f53a64a47c564be6', '2026-09-18T23:19:18.097Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:18.097Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 27, 1, 'Rehefa antitra i Isaka ka efa tsy nahita intsony ny masony, dia niantso an’i Esao lahimatoany hankany aminy izy hoe: “Ry Esao zanako ô!” Dia hoy i Esao: “Ahoana izay?”', 'rehefa antitra i isaka ka efa tsy nahita intsony ny masony, dia niantso an’i esao lahimatoany hankany aminy izy hoe: “ry esao zanako ô!” dia hoy i esao: “ahoana izay?”'),
  ('6aadc6f6f53a64a47c564bff', '2026-09-18T23:19:18.098Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:18.098Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 27, 26, 'Ary hoy i Isaka rainy: “Mba manatòna kely, anaka, dia orohy aho.”', 'ary hoy i isaka rainy: “mba manatòna kely, anaka, dia orohy aho.”'),
  ('6aadc6f6f53a64a47c564c09', '2026-09-18T23:19:18.098Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:18.098Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 27, 36, 'Dia hoy i Esao: “Aiza moa no tsy natao hoe Jakoba ny anaran’iny? Efa fanindroany izao izy no naka ny toerako! Ny zoko amin’ny maha lahimatoa ahy efa nalainy, dia izao indray koa nalainy ny tsodrano tokony ho ahy!” Hoy koa izy: “Tsy mba nitahiry tsodrano ho ahy mihitsy ve ianao?”', 'dia hoy i esao: “aiza moa no tsy natao hoe jakoba ny anaran’iny? efa fanindroany izao izy no naka ny toerako! ny zoko amin’ny maha lahimatoa ahy efa nalainy, dia izao indray koa nalainy ny tsodrano tokony ho ahy!” hoy koa izy: “tsy mba nitahiry tsodrano ho ahy mihitsy ve ianao?”'),
  ('6aadc6f6f53a64a47c564c11', '2026-09-18T23:19:18.098Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:18.098Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 27, 44, 'Mijanòna kely aloha any aminy, mandra-pitonin’ny fahatezeran’ny rahalahinao.', 'mijanòna kely aloha any aminy, mandra-pitonin’ny fahatezeran’ny rahalahinao.'),
  ('6aadc6f6f53a64a47c564c0b', '2026-09-18T23:19:18.098Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:18.098Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 27, 38, 'Ary hoy i Esao tamin’ny rainy: “Dia tsodrano iray fotsiny ve no mba anananao, ry Dada? Mba omeo tsodrano koa re aho, ry Dada ô!” Dia nigogogogo nitomany i Esao.', 'ary hoy i esao tamin’ny rainy: “dia tsodrano iray fotsiny ve no mba anananao, ry dada? mba omeo tsodrano koa re aho, ry dada ô!” dia nigogogogo nitomany i esao.'),
  ('6aadc6f6f53a64a47c564c0e', '2026-09-18T23:19:18.098Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:18.098Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 27, 41, 'Taorian’izay, dia nitana lolompo tamin’i Jakoba i Esao noho ilay tsodrano nomen’ny rainy azy. Hoy foana izy anakampo: “Efa kely sisa izao dia ho tonga ny andro hisaonana an’i Dada. Dia hovonoiko i Jakoba rahalahiko aorian’izay.”', 'taorian’izay, dia nitana lolompo tamin’i jakoba i esao noho ilay tsodrano nomen’ny rainy azy. hoy foana izy anakampo: “efa kely sisa izao dia ho tonga ny andro hisaonana an’i dada. dia hovonoiko i jakoba rahalahiko aorian’izay.”'),
  ('6aadc6f6f53a64a47c564bf4', '2026-09-18T23:19:18.098Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:18.098Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 27, 15, 'Ary nalain’i Rebeka ny akanjon’i Esao lahimatoany, dia ny akanjony tsara indrindra tao an-trano, ka nampanaoviny an’i Jakoba faralahiny.', 'ary nalain’i rebeka ny akanjon’i esao lahimatoany, dia ny akanjony tsara indrindra tao an-trano, ka nampanaoviny an’i jakoba faralahiny.'),
  ('6aadc6f6f53a64a47c564c0f', '2026-09-18T23:19:18.098Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:18.098Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 27, 42, 'Rehefa notantarain’ny olona tamin’i Rebeka ny tenin’i Esao lahimatoany, dia tonga dia nampanantsoiny i Jakoba faralahiny, ka hoy izy taminy: “Izao anaka! Mitetika ny hamaly faty i Esao rahalahinao, dia tiany hovonoina ianao.', 'rehefa notantarain’ny olona tamin’i rebeka ny tenin’i esao lahimatoany, dia tonga dia nampanantsoiny i jakoba faralahiny, ka hoy izy taminy: “izao anaka! mitetika ny hamaly faty i esao rahalahinao, dia tiany hovonoina ianao.'),
  ('6aadc6f6f53a64a47c564c0d', '2026-09-18T23:19:18.098Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:18.098Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 27, 40, 'Ny sabatrao no hivelomanao, ary hanompo ny rahalahinao ianao. Rehefa tsy zakanao intsony anefa izany, dia hotapahinao hiala amin’ny vozonao ny ziogany.”', 'ny sabatrao no hivelomanao, ary hanompo ny rahalahinao ianao. rehefa tsy zakanao intsony anefa izany, dia hotapahinao hiala amin’ny vozonao ny ziogany.”'),
  ('6aadc6f6f53a64a47c564bf6', '2026-09-18T23:19:18.098Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:18.098Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 27, 17, 'Dia nomeny an’i Jakoba zanany ilay sakafo matsiro sy ny mofo namboariny.', 'dia nomeny an’i jakoba zanany ilay sakafo matsiro sy ny mofo namboariny.'),
  ('6aadc6f6f53a64a47c564c05', '2026-09-18T23:19:18.098Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:18.098Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 27, 32, 'Dia hoy i Isaka rainy taminy: “Fa iza moa ianao?” Ary hoy izy: “Esao lahimatoanao ihany!”', 'dia hoy i isaka rainy taminy: “fa iza moa ianao?” ary hoy izy: “esao lahimatoanao ihany!”'),
  ('6aadc6f6f53a64a47c564bf8', '2026-09-18T23:19:18.098Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:18.098Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 27, 19, 'Dia hoy i Jakoba tamin’ny rainy: “Esao lahimatoanao ihany. Efa vitako ilay nasainao nataoko. Mba miarena kely, dia mihinàna amin’ny haza nentiko, ka tsofy rano aho.”', 'dia hoy i jakoba tamin’ny rainy: “esao lahimatoanao ihany. efa vitako ilay nasainao nataoko. mba miarena kely, dia mihinàna amin’ny haza nentiko, ka tsofy rano aho.”'),
  ('6aadc6f6f53a64a47c564bf7', '2026-09-18T23:19:18.098Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:18.098Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 27, 18, 'Ary nankao amin’ny rainy i Jakoba, ka niteny hoe: “Dada ô!” Dia hoy i Isaka: “Ahoana izay, anaka? Iza moa ianao?”', 'ary nankao amin’ny rainy i jakoba, ka niteny hoe: “dada ô!” dia hoy i isaka: “ahoana izay, anaka? iza moa ianao?”'),
  ('6aadc6f6f53a64a47c564c12', '2026-09-18T23:19:18.098Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:18.098Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 27, 45, 'Rehefa afaka ny hatezeran’ny rahalahinao aminao, ka hadinony ny zavatra nataonao taminy, dia haniraka olona aho haka anao any. Fa ataoko ahoana ny hamoy anareo mirahalahy ao anatin’ny iray andro?”', 'rehefa afaka ny hatezeran’ny rahalahinao aminao, ka hadinony ny zavatra nataonao taminy, dia haniraka olona aho haka anao any. fa ataoko ahoana ny hamoy anareo mirahalahy ao anatin’ny iray andro?”'),
  ('6aadc6f6f53a64a47c564bfc', '2026-09-18T23:19:18.098Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:18.098Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 27, 23, 'Ary tsy fantany i Jakoba, satria voloina be hoatran’ny tanan’i Esao rahalahiny ny tanany. Dia nitso-drano azy izy.', 'ary tsy fantany i jakoba, satria voloina be hoatran’ny tanan’i esao rahalahiny ny tanany. dia nitso-drano azy izy.'),
  ('6aadc6f6f53a64a47c564c04', '2026-09-18T23:19:18.098Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:18.098Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 27, 31, 'Nanao sakafo matsiro koa izy, dia nitondra an’ilay izy teo amin’ny rainy, sady niteny hoe: “Miarena Dada a! Mihinàna amin’ity haza nentiko ity, mba hahazoako tsodrano aminao.”', 'nanao sakafo matsiro koa izy, dia nitondra an’ilay izy teo amin’ny rainy, sady niteny hoe: “miarena dada a! mihinàna amin’ity haza nentiko ity, mba hahazoako tsodrano aminao.”'),
  ('6aadc6f6f53a64a47c564c03', '2026-09-18T23:19:18.098Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:18.098Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 27, 30, 'Raha vao avy nitso-drano an’i Jakoba i Isaka rainy, ary vao niala kely teo aminy i Jakoba, dia iny fa tonga avy nihaza i Esao rahalahiny.', 'raha vao avy nitso-drano an’i jakoba i isaka rainy, ary vao niala kely teo aminy i jakoba, dia iny fa tonga avy nihaza i esao rahalahiny.'),
  ('6aadc6f6f53a64a47c564c0c', '2026-09-18T23:19:18.098Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:18.098Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 27, 39, 'Hoy àry i Isaka rainy: “Tsy hipetraka eny akaikin’ny tany lonaka ianao, sady tsy hahazo ny andon’ny lanitra ambony.', 'hoy àry i isaka rainy: “tsy hipetraka eny akaikin’ny tany lonaka ianao, sady tsy hahazo ny andon’ny lanitra ambony.'),
  ('6aadc6f6f53a64a47c564bfd', '2026-09-18T23:19:18.098Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:18.098Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 27, 24, 'Hoy indray izy: “Tena i Esao zanako tokoa ve ianao?” Dia hoy i Jakoba: “Izaho mihitsy ity!”', 'hoy indray izy: “tena i esao zanako tokoa ve ianao?” dia hoy i jakoba: “izaho mihitsy ity!”'),
  ('6aadc6f6f53a64a47c564bf9', '2026-09-18T23:19:18.098Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:18.098Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 27, 20, 'Dia hoy i Isaka tamin’ny zanany: “Fa ahoana no vetivety kely ianao, anaka, dia nahita haza?” Dia hoy i Jakoba: “Satria nataon’i Jehovah Andriamanitrao nanatona ahy ilay izy.”', 'dia hoy i isaka tamin’ny zanany: “fa ahoana no vetivety kely ianao, anaka, dia nahita haza?” dia hoy i jakoba: “satria nataon’i jehovah andriamanitrao nanatona ahy ilay izy.”'),
  ('6aadc6f6f53a64a47c564c08', '2026-09-18T23:19:18.098Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:18.098Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 27, 35, 'Hoy anefa ny rainy: “Tonga teto ny rahalahinao, dia nofitahiny aho mba hahazoany ny tsodrano tokony ho anao.”', 'hoy anefa ny rainy: “tonga teto ny rahalahinao, dia nofitahiny aho mba hahazoany ny tsodrano tokony ho anao.”'),
  ('6aadc6f6f53a64a47c564c02', '2026-09-18T23:19:18.098Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:18.098Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 27, 29, 'Enga anie hanompo anao ireo firenena, ary hiankohoka eo anatrehanao ny firenena samy hafa! Ary enga anie hanana fahefana amin’ny rahalahinao ianao, ka hiankohoka eo anatrehanao ny zanaky ny reninao! Ho voaozona anie izay manozona anao, fa hotahina kosa izay mitso-drano anao!”', 'enga anie hanompo anao ireo firenena, ary hiankohoka eo anatrehanao ny firenena samy hafa! ary enga anie hanana fahefana amin’ny rahalahinao ianao, ka hiankohoka eo anatrehanao ny zanaky ny reninao! ho voaozona anie izay manozona anao, fa hotahina kosa izay mitso-drano anao!”'),
  ('6aadc6f6f53a64a47c564c01', '2026-09-18T23:19:18.098Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:18.098Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 27, 28, 'Enga anie Andriamanitra hanome anao ny andon’ny lanitra, sy ny tany lonaka, ary varimbazaha sy divay vaovao be dia be!', 'enga anie andriamanitra hanome anao ny andon’ny lanitra, sy ny tany lonaka, ary varimbazaha sy divay vaovao be dia be!'),
  ('6aadc6f6f53a64a47c564bf5', '2026-09-18T23:19:18.098Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:18.098Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 27, 16, 'Nataony teo amin’ny tanan’i Jakoba sy teo amin’ny faritra tsy misy volo amin’ny vozony koa ny hoditr’ireo zanak’osy ireo.', 'nataony teo amin’ny tanan’i jakoba sy teo amin’ny faritra tsy misy volo amin’ny vozony koa ny hoditr’ireo zanak’osy ireo.'),
  ('6aadc6f6f53a64a47c564c06', '2026-09-18T23:19:18.098Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:18.098Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 27, 33, 'Tonga dia nangovitra be mihitsy i Isaka, ka niteny hoe: “Koa iza àry ilay nandeha nihaza dia nitondra an’ilay haza teto amiko teto? Efa nohaniko ilay izy talohan’ny nahatongavanao, dia nitso-drano azy aho. Ary hotahina tokoa izy!”', 'tonga dia nangovitra be mihitsy i isaka, ka niteny hoe: “koa iza àry ilay nandeha nihaza dia nitondra an’ilay haza teto amiko teto? efa nohaniko ilay izy talohan’ny nahatongavanao, dia nitso-drano azy aho. ary hotahina tokoa izy!”'),
  ('6aadc6f6f53a64a47c564c13', '2026-09-18T23:19:18.098Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:18.098Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 27, 46, 'Taorian’izany, dia hoy foana i Rebeka tamin’i Isaka: “Tena mankaleo ahy ny fiainako noho ireto zanakavavin’ny Hetita ireto! Raha sanatria i Jakoba ka manambady zanakavavin’ny Hetita hoatr’ireo zazavavy tompon-tany ireo, dia aleoko maty.”', 'taorian’izany, dia hoy foana i rebeka tamin’i isaka: “tena mankaleo ahy ny fiainako noho ireto zanakavavin’ny hetita ireto! raha sanatria i jakoba ka manambady zanakavavin’ny hetita hoatr’ireo zazavavy tompon-tany ireo, dia aleoko maty.”'),
  ('6aadc6f6f53a64a47c564c0a', '2026-09-18T23:19:18.098Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:18.098Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 27, 37, 'Hoy anefa i Isaka tamin’i Esao: “Efa notendreko hanana fahefana aminao izy, dia efa nomeko azy daholo ny rahalahiny rehetra mba ho mpanompony. Nomeko varimbazaha sy divay vaovao koa izy hivelomany. Koa inona intsony no azoko atao ho anao, anaka?”', 'hoy anefa i isaka tamin’i esao: “efa notendreko hanana fahefana aminao izy, dia efa nomeko azy daholo ny rahalahiny rehetra mba ho mpanompony. nomeko varimbazaha sy divay vaovao koa izy hivelomany. koa inona intsony no azoko atao ho anao, anaka?”'),
  ('6aadc6f6f53a64a47c564c00', '2026-09-18T23:19:18.098Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:18.098Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 27, 27, 'Nanatona àry izy dia nanoroka azy, ka henon’i Isaka ny hanitry ny akanjony. Dia nitso-drano azy izy hoe: “Ny hanitry ny zanako dia toy ny hanitry ny saha notahin’i Jehovah.', 'nanatona àry izy dia nanoroka azy, ka henon’i isaka ny hanitry ny akanjony. dia nitso-drano azy izy hoe: “ny hanitry ny zanako dia toy ny hanitry ny saha notahin’i jehovah.'),
  ('6aadc6f6f53a64a47c564bfb', '2026-09-18T23:19:18.098Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:18.098Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 27, 22, 'Dia nanatona an’i Isaka rainy i Jakoba. Ary nitsapa azy i Isaka, dia niteny hoe: “Ny feonao aloha dia feon’i Jakoba, fa ny tananao indray tanan’i Esao.”', 'dia nanatona an’i isaka rainy i jakoba. ary nitsapa azy i isaka, dia niteny hoe: “ny feonao aloha dia feon’i jakoba, fa ny tananao indray tanan’i esao.”'),
  ('6aadc6f6f53a64a47c564bfe', '2026-09-18T23:19:18.098Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:18.098Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 27, 25, 'Ary hoy i Isaka: “Mba omeo amin’ilay haza àry aho, anaka, hohaniko, dia hitso-drano anao aho.” Dia narosony teo aminy ilay izy ka nihinana izy. Nitondrany divay koa izy ka nisotro.', 'ary hoy i isaka: “mba omeo amin’ilay haza àry aho, anaka, hohaniko, dia hitso-drano anao aho.” dia narosony teo aminy ilay izy ka nihinana izy. nitondrany divay koa izy ka nisotro.'),
  ('6aadc6f6f53a64a47c564c10', '2026-09-18T23:19:18.098Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:18.098Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 27, 43, 'Koa araho ny teniko, anaka, ka mandehana mandositra any amin’i Labana anadahiko, any Harana.', 'koa araho ny teniko, anaka, ka mandehana mandositra any amin’i labana anadahiko, any harana.'),
  ('6aadc6f6f53a64a47c564c07', '2026-09-18T23:19:18.098Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:18.098Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 27, 34, 'Dia niantsoantso faran’izay mafy sady nalahelo be i Esao rehefa naheno an’izany tenin’ny rainy izany, ka niteny hoe: “Mba omeo tsodrano koa re aho, ry Dada ô!”', 'dia niantsoantso faran’izay mafy sady nalahelo be i esao rehefa naheno an’izany tenin’ny rainy izany, ka niteny hoe: “mba omeo tsodrano koa re aho, ry dada ô!”'),
  ('6aadc6f6f53a64a47c564bfa', '2026-09-18T23:19:18.098Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:18.098Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 27, 21, 'Ary hoy i Isaka taminy: “Mba manatòna kely, anaka, hitsapako anao, mba hahafantarako raha tena i Esao zanako ianao na tsia.”', 'ary hoy i isaka taminy: “mba manatòna kely, anaka, hitsapako anao, mba hahafantarako raha tena i esao zanako ianao na tsia.”'),
  ('6aadc6f6b8dab818842d6eb0', '2026-09-18T23:19:18.859Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:18.859Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 28, 21, 'ary tafaverina soa aman-tsara any an-tranon’ny raiko, dia ho hitako tokoa hoe Andriamanitro i Jehovah.', 'ary tafaverina soa aman-tsara any an-tranon’ny raiko, dia ho hitako tokoa hoe andriamanitro i jehovah.'),
  ('6aadc6f6b8dab818842d6ea5', '2026-09-18T23:19:18.859Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:18.859Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 28, 10, 'Ary niala tao Beri-sheba i Jakoba ka nankany Harana.', 'ary niala tao beri-sheba i jakoba ka nankany harana.'),
  ('6aadc6f6b8dab818842d6e9c', '2026-09-18T23:19:18.859Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:18.859Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 28, 1, 'Dia niantso an’i Jakoba i Isaka ka nitso-drano azy sady nanafatrafatra hoe: “Aza maka vady eto Kanana.', 'dia niantso an’i jakoba i isaka ka nitso-drano azy sady nanafatrafatra hoe: “aza maka vady eto kanana.'),
  ('6aadc6f6b8dab818842d6e9e', '2026-09-18T23:19:18.859Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:18.859Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 28, 3, 'Hitahy anao ilay Andriamanitra Mahery Indrindra ka hataony manan-taranaka ianao, sady hataony lasa be dia be ny taranakao. Dia ho lasa firenena lehibe ianao.', 'hitahy anao ilay andriamanitra mahery indrindra ka hataony manan-taranaka ianao, sady hataony lasa be dia be ny taranakao. dia ho lasa firenena lehibe ianao.'),
  ('6aadc6f6b8dab818842d6ea0', '2026-09-18T23:19:18.859Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:18.859Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 28, 5, 'Koa nalefan’i Isaka nandeha i Jakoba, ka lasa nankany Padana-arama, ho any amin’i Labana, zanak’i Betoela Aramianina sady anadahin’i Rebeka renin’i Jakoba sy Esao.', 'koa nalefan’i isaka nandeha i jakoba, ka lasa nankany padana-arama, ho any amin’i labana, zanak’i betoela aramianina sady anadahin’i rebeka renin’i jakoba sy esao.'),
  ('6aadc6f6b8dab818842d6ea6', '2026-09-18T23:19:18.859Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:18.859Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 28, 11, 'Tonga teo amin’ny toerana iray izy rehefa elaela, ka nanapa-kevitra hoe hatory eo, satria efa nilentika ny masoandro. Naka vato iray teo àry izy hataony ondana, dia natory teo.', 'tonga teo amin’ny toerana iray izy rehefa elaela, ka nanapa-kevitra hoe hatory eo, satria efa nilentika ny masoandro. naka vato iray teo àry izy hataony ondana, dia natory teo.'),
  ('6aadc6f6b8dab818842d6ea4', '2026-09-18T23:19:18.859Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:18.859Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 28, 9, 'Koa nankany amin’i Ismaela i Esao ka nanambady an’i Mahalota, ankoatra an’izay vady efa nalainy. Zanakavavin’i Ismaela zanak’i Abrahama i Mahalota, sady anabavin’i Nebaiota.', 'koa nankany amin’i ismaela i esao ka nanambady an’i mahalota, ankoatra an’izay vady efa nalainy. zanakavavin’i ismaela zanak’i abrahama i mahalota, sady anabavin’i nebaiota.'),
  ('6aadc6f6b8dab818842d6ea8', '2026-09-18T23:19:18.859Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:18.859Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 28, 13, 'Hitany koa fa io i Jehovah teo an-tampon’ilay tohatra, niteny hoe: “Izaho no Jehovah, ilay Andriamanitr’i Abrahama raibenao sy Andriamanitr’i Isaka. Homeko anao sy ny taranakao ity tany ity sy io toerana atorianao io.', 'hitany koa fa io i jehovah teo an-tampon’ilay tohatra, niteny hoe: “izaho no jehovah, ilay andriamanitr’i abrahama raibenao sy andriamanitr’i isaka. homeko anao sy ny taranakao ity tany ity sy io toerana atorianao io.'),
  ('6aadc6f6b8dab818842d6ead', '2026-09-18T23:19:18.859Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:18.859Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 28, 18, 'Ary nifoha maraina i Jakoba, dia nalainy ilay vato nataony ondana ka nataony tsangambato. Dia nandraraka menaka teo ambonin’ilay tsangambato izy.', 'ary nifoha maraina i jakoba, dia nalainy ilay vato nataony ondana ka nataony tsangambato. dia nandraraka menaka teo ambonin’ilay tsangambato izy.'),
  ('6aadc6f6b8dab818842d6ea9', '2026-09-18T23:19:18.859Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:18.859Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 28, 14, 'Dia ho lasa be dia be hoatran’ny vovoka amin’ny tany ny taranakao, ka hiparitaka any andrefana sy any atsinanana sy any avaratra ary any atsimo. Ary azo antoka fa amin’ny alalanao sy ny taranakao no hitahiana ny firenena rehetra eny ambonin’ny tany.', 'dia ho lasa be dia be hoatran’ny vovoka amin’ny tany ny taranakao, ka hiparitaka any andrefana sy any atsinanana sy any avaratra ary any atsimo. ary azo antoka fa amin’ny alalanao sy ny taranakao no hitahiana ny firenena rehetra eny ambonin’ny tany.'),
  ('6aadc6f6b8dab818842d6eae', '2026-09-18T23:19:18.859Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:18.859Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 28, 19, 'Koa nataony hoe Betela ny anaran’ilay toerana, nefa Lozy no anaran’ilay tanàna taloha.', 'koa nataony hoe betela ny anaran’ilay toerana, nefa lozy no anaran’ilay tanàna taloha.'),
  ('6aadc6f6b8dab818842d6ea7', '2026-09-18T23:19:18.859Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:18.859Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 28, 12, 'Dia nanonofy izy hoe nisy tohatra teo amin’ny tany ary tonga hatreny amin’ny lanitra ny tampony. Dia nisy anjelin’Andriamanitra niakatra sy nidina teo amin’ilay izy.', 'dia nanonofy izy hoe nisy tohatra teo amin’ny tany ary tonga hatreny amin’ny lanitra ny tampony. dia nisy anjelin’andriamanitra niakatra sy nidina teo amin’ilay izy.'),
  ('6aadc6f6b8dab818842d6ea2', '2026-09-18T23:19:18.859Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:18.859Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 28, 7, 'Dia hitany hoe nankatò ny rainy sy ny reniny i Jakoba ka lasa nankany Padana-arama.', 'dia hitany hoe nankatò ny rainy sy ny reniny i jakoba ka lasa nankany padana-arama.'),
  ('6aadc6f6b8dab818842d6e9f', '2026-09-18T23:19:18.859Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:18.859Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 28, 4, 'Hitahy anao sy ny taranakao koa izy, hoatran’ny nitahiany an’i Abrahama. Amin’izay ho lasanao ity tany ivahinianao ity, izay efa nomen’Andriamanitra an’i Abrahama.”', 'hitahy anao sy ny taranakao koa izy, hoatran’ny nitahiany an’i abrahama. amin’izay ho lasanao ity tany ivahinianao ity, izay efa nomen’andriamanitra an’i abrahama.”'),
  ('6aadc6f6b8dab818842d6eac', '2026-09-18T23:19:18.859Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:18.859Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 28, 17, 'Natahotra izy tamin’izay sady niteny hoe: “Hafakely mihitsy ity toerana ity fa masina! Tena tranon’Andriamanitra mihitsy ity, ary eto no vavahadin’ny lanitra!”', 'natahotra izy tamin’izay sady niteny hoe: “hafakely mihitsy ity toerana ity fa masina! tena tranon’andriamanitra mihitsy ity, ary eto no vavahadin’ny lanitra!”'),
  ('6aadc6f6b8dab818842d6ea3', '2026-09-18T23:19:18.859Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:18.859Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 28, 8, 'Fantatr’i Esao àry hoe tsy nahafaly an’i Isaka rainy ny vehivavy tao Kanana.', 'fantatr’i esao àry hoe tsy nahafaly an’i isaka rainy ny vehivavy tao kanana.'),
  ('6aadc6f6b8dab818842d6eaa', '2026-09-18T23:19:18.859Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:18.859Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 28, 15, 'Hanampy anao aho ka hiaro anao any amin’izay rehetra alehanao, dia haveriko eto amin’ity tany ity indray ianao. Tsy handao anao mihitsy aho raha tsy efa vitako izay nampanantenaiko anao.”', 'hanampy anao aho ka hiaro anao any amin’izay rehetra alehanao, dia haveriko eto amin’ity tany ity indray ianao. tsy handao anao mihitsy aho raha tsy efa vitako izay nampanantenaiko anao.”'),
  ('6aadc6f6b8dab818842d6e9d', '2026-09-18T23:19:18.859Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:18.859Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 28, 2, 'Fa mandehana any Padana-arama, any an-tranon’i Betoela rain’ny reninao, dia makà vady amin’ny zanakavavin’i Labana anadahin-dreninao.', 'fa mandehana any padana-arama, any an-tranon’i betoela rain’ny reninao, dia makà vady amin’ny zanakavavin’i labana anadahin-dreninao.'),
  ('6aadc6f6b8dab818842d6eaf', '2026-09-18T23:19:18.859Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:18.859Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 28, 20, 'Ary nivoady i Jakoba hoe: “Raha manampy ahy foana Andriamanitra ka arovany aho amin’izao diako izao, sady omeny sakafo hohaniko sy akanjo hanaovako,', 'ary nivoady i jakoba hoe: “raha manampy ahy foana andriamanitra ka arovany aho amin’izao diako izao, sady omeny sakafo hohaniko sy akanjo hanaovako,'),
  ('6aadc6f6b8dab818842d6eab', '2026-09-18T23:19:18.859Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:18.859Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 28, 16, 'Dia taitra tamin’ny torimasony i Jakoba, ka niteny hoe: “Tena eto amin’ity toerana ity i Jehovah, fa izaho no tsy nahafantatra.”', 'dia taitra tamin’ny torimasony i jakoba, ka niteny hoe: “tena eto amin’ity toerana ity i jehovah, fa izaho no tsy nahafantatra.”'),
  ('6aadc6f6b8dab818842d6ea1', '2026-09-18T23:19:18.859Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:18.859Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 28, 6, 'Ary fantatr’i Esao fa efa nitso-drano an’i Jakoba i Isaka, sady efa nandefa azy ho any Padana-arama mba haka vady any. Fantany koa fa tamin’i Isaka nitso-drano azy, dia nanafatrafatra izy hoe: “Aza maka vady eto Kanana.”', 'ary fantatr’i esao fa efa nitso-drano an’i jakoba i isaka, sady efa nandefa azy ho any padana-arama mba haka vady any. fantany koa fa tamin’i isaka nitso-drano azy, dia nanafatrafatra izy hoe: “aza maka vady eto kanana.”'),
  ('6aadc6f6b8dab818842d6eb1', '2026-09-18T23:19:18.859Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:18.859Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 28, 22, 'Ary ho lasa tranon’Andriamanitra ity vato naoriko ho tsangambato ity. Dia tsy maintsy homeko azy ny ampahafolon’izay rehetra homeny ahy.”', 'ary ho lasa tranon’andriamanitra ity vato naoriko ho tsangambato ity. dia tsy maintsy homeko azy ny ampahafolon’izay rehetra homeny ahy.”'),
  ('6aadc6f789e459a26d301640', '2026-09-18T23:19:19.226Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:19.226Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 29, 1, 'Taorian’izay, dia nanohy ny diany i Jakoba ka nankany amin’ny tanin’ny Tatsinanana.', 'taorian’izay, dia nanohy ny diany i jakoba ka nankany amin’ny tanin’ny tatsinanana.'),
  ('6aadc6f789e459a26d301641', '2026-09-18T23:19:19.226Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:19.226Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 29, 2, 'Dia nahita lavadrano iray tany an-tsaha izy, ary nisy andian’ondry telo natoritory teo akaikin’ilay izy. Nahazatra ny mpiandry ondry mantsy ny naka rano tao anaty lavadrano mba hampisotroina ny andian’ondry. Nisy vato ngezabe koa nanarona ny vavan’ilay lavadrano.', 'dia nahita lavadrano iray tany an-tsaha izy, ary nisy andian’ondry telo natoritory teo akaikin’ilay izy. nahazatra ny mpiandry ondry mantsy ny naka rano tao anaty lavadrano mba hampisotroina ny andian’ondry. nisy vato ngezabe koa nanarona ny vavan’ilay lavadrano.'),
  ('6aadc6f789e459a26d301642', '2026-09-18T23:19:19.226Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:19.226Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 29, 3, 'Rehefa tafangona teo daholo ny andian’ondry vao nakodian’ny mpiandry ondry hiala amin’ny vavan’ny lavadrano ilay vato, ka nampisotroiny rano ny ondry. Avy eo dia naveriny teo amin’ny toerany, teo am-bavan’ny lavadrano, ilay vato.', 'rehefa tafangona teo daholo ny andian’ondry vao nakodian’ny mpiandry ondry hiala amin’ny vavan’ny lavadrano ilay vato, ka nampisotroiny rano ny ondry. avy eo dia naveriny teo amin’ny toerany, teo am-bavan’ny lavadrano, ilay vato.'),
  ('6aadc6f789e459a26d301643', '2026-09-18T23:19:19.226Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:19.226Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 29, 4, 'Ary hoy i Jakoba tamin’izy ireo: “Fa avy aiza moa ianareo, ry rahalahiko?” Dia hoy izy ireo: “Avy any Harana izahay.”', 'ary hoy i jakoba tamin’izy ireo: “fa avy aiza moa ianareo, ry rahalahiko?” dia hoy izy ireo: “avy any harana izahay.”'),
  ('6aadc6f789e459a26d301644', '2026-09-18T23:19:19.226Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:19.226Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 29, 5, 'Ary hoy izy tamin’izy ireo: “Fantatrareo ve i Labana, zafikelin’i Nahora?” Dia hoy izy ireo: “Ie, fantatray izy.”', 'ary hoy izy tamin’izy ireo: “fantatrareo ve i labana, zafikelin’i nahora?” dia hoy izy ireo: “ie, fantatray izy.”'),
  ('6aadc6f789e459a26d301645', '2026-09-18T23:19:19.226Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:19.226Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 29, 6, 'Hoy àry izy: “Salama tsara ve izy any?” Dia hoy izy ireo: “Ie, salama tsara izy. Iny tonga miaraka amin’ny ondry iny izao i Rahely zanany vavy!”', 'hoy àry izy: “salama tsara ve izy any?” dia hoy izy ireo: “ie, salama tsara izy. iny tonga miaraka amin’ny ondry iny izao i rahely zanany vavy!”'),
  ('6aadc6f789e459a26d301646', '2026-09-18T23:19:19.226Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:19.226Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 29, 7, 'Ary hoy i Jakoba: “Mbola antoandrobe izao, ka tsy izao no fotoana fanangonana ny andian’ondry. Ampisotroy rano aloha ny ondry, dia avy eo ento hiraoka ahitra.”', 'ary hoy i jakoba: “mbola antoandrobe izao, ka tsy izao no fotoana fanangonana ny andian’ondry. ampisotroy rano aloha ny ondry, dia avy eo ento hiraoka ahitra.”'),
  ('6aadc6f789e459a26d301647', '2026-09-18T23:19:19.226Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:19.226Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 29, 8, 'Fa hoy izy ireo: “Tsy azonay atao izany! Rehefa tafangona daholo ny andian’ondry ary efa avy nakodia hiala amin’ny vavan’ny lavadrano ny vato, vao afaka mampisotro rano ny ondry izahay.”', 'fa hoy izy ireo: “tsy azonay atao izany! rehefa tafangona daholo ny andian’ondry ary efa avy nakodia hiala amin’ny vavan’ny lavadrano ny vato, vao afaka mampisotro rano ny ondry izahay.”'),
  ('6aadc6f789e459a26d301648', '2026-09-18T23:19:19.226Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:19.226Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 29, 9, 'Tamin’i Jakoba mbola niresaka tamin’izy ireo, dia iny fa tonga i Rahely nitondra ny ondrin’ny rainy. Mpiandry ondry mantsy ilay tovovavy.', 'tamin’i jakoba mbola niresaka tamin’izy ireo, dia iny fa tonga i rahely nitondra ny ondrin’ny rainy. mpiandry ondry mantsy ilay tovovavy.'),
  ('6aadc6f789e459a26d301649', '2026-09-18T23:19:19.226Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:19.226Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 29, 10, 'Rehefa hitan’i Jakoba i Rahely zanakavavin’i Labana anadahin-dreniny, sy ny ondrin’i Labana, dia tonga dia nanatona izy ka nanakodia an’ilay vato hiala amin’ny vavan’ny lavadrano. Dia nampisotroiny rano ny ondrin’i Labana anadahin-dreniny.', 'rehefa hitan’i jakoba i rahely zanakavavin’i labana anadahin-dreniny, sy ny ondrin’i labana, dia tonga dia nanatona izy ka nanakodia an’ilay vato hiala amin’ny vavan’ny lavadrano. dia nampisotroiny rano ny ondrin’i labana anadahin-dreniny.'),
  ('6aadc6f789e459a26d30164a', '2026-09-18T23:19:19.226Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:19.226Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 29, 11, 'Avy eo dia nanoroka an’i Rahely i Jakoba, dia nitomany be.', 'avy eo dia nanoroka an’i rahely i jakoba, dia nitomany be.'),
  ('6aadc6f789e459a26d30164b', '2026-09-18T23:19:19.226Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:19.226Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 29, 12, 'Ary notenenin’i Jakoba an’i Rahely hoe havan’ny rainy izy sady zanak’i Rebeka. Dia lasa nihazakazaka nitantara an’izany tamin’ny rainy i Rahely.', 'ary notenenin’i jakoba an’i rahely hoe havan’ny rainy izy sady zanak’i rebeka. dia lasa nihazakazaka nitantara an’izany tamin’ny rainy i rahely.'),
  ('6aadc6f789e459a26d30164c', '2026-09-18T23:19:19.226Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:19.226Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 29, 13, 'Vao henon’i Labana ny momba an’i Jakoba zanak’anabaviny, dia nihazakazaka nitsena azy izy. Dia namihina sy nanoroka azy izy, ka nitondra azy tany an-tranony. Ary notantarain’i Jakoba an’i Labana ny zava-drehetra.', 'vao henon’i labana ny momba an’i jakoba zanak’anabaviny, dia nihazakazaka nitsena azy izy. dia namihina sy nanoroka azy izy, ka nitondra azy tany an-tranony. ary notantarain’i jakoba an’i labana ny zava-drehetra.'),
  ('6aadc6f789e459a26d30164d', '2026-09-18T23:19:19.226Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:19.226Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 29, 14, 'Dia hoy i Labana taminy: “Taolako sy nofoko tokoa ianao.” Nipetraka tao aminy iray volana katroka àry i Jakoba.', 'dia hoy i labana taminy: “taolako sy nofoko tokoa ianao.” nipetraka tao aminy iray volana katroka àry i jakoba.'),
  ('6aadc6f789e459a26d30164e', '2026-09-18T23:19:19.226Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:19.226Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 29, 15, 'Dia hoy i Labana tamin’i Jakoba: “Ianao kosa ve dia hiasa maina ho ahy fotsiny na dia hoe havako aza? Teneno amiko hoe inona no tokony ho karamanao.”', 'dia hoy i labana tamin’i jakoba: “ianao kosa ve dia hiasa maina ho ahy fotsiny na dia hoe havako aza? teneno amiko hoe inona no tokony ho karamanao.”'),
  ('6aadc6f789e459a26d30164f', '2026-09-18T23:19:19.226Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:19.226Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 29, 16, 'Ary nanan-janaka roa vavy i Labana. Lea no anaran’ny zokiny, ary Rahely no anaran’ny zandriny.', 'ary nanan-janaka roa vavy i labana. lea no anaran’ny zokiny, ary rahely no anaran’ny zandriny.'),
  ('6aadc6f789e459a26d301650', '2026-09-18T23:19:19.226Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:19.226Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 29, 17, 'Tsy mba nahafinaritra anefa ny mason’i Lea, fa i Rahely indray sady tsara bika no tsara tarehy.', 'tsy mba nahafinaritra anefa ny mason’i lea, fa i rahely indray sady tsara bika no tsara tarehy.'),
  ('6aadc6f789e459a26d301651', '2026-09-18T23:19:19.226Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:19.226Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 29, 18, 'Efa raiki-pitia tamin’i Rahely koa i Jakoba, ka hoy izy: “Vonona hanompo anao fito taona aho mba hahazoako an’i Rahely faravavinao.”', 'efa raiki-pitia tamin’i rahely koa i jakoba, ka hoy izy: “vonona hanompo anao fito taona aho mba hahazoako an’i rahely faravavinao.”'),
  ('6aadc6f789e459a26d301652', '2026-09-18T23:19:19.226Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:19.226Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 29, 19, 'Dia hoy i Labana: “Aleoko homena anao izy, toy izay homena olon-kafa. Mipetraha ihany àry ato amiko.”', 'dia hoy i labana: “aleoko homena anao izy, toy izay homena olon-kafa. mipetraha ihany àry ato amiko.”'),
  ('6aadc6f789e459a26d301653', '2026-09-18T23:19:19.226Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:19.226Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 29, 20, 'Dia nanompo azy fito taona i Jakoba mba hahazoany an’i Rahely, nefa hoatran’ny hoe andro vitsivitsy fotsiny ilay izy taminy, satria izy tia azy.', 'dia nanompo azy fito taona i jakoba mba hahazoany an’i rahely, nefa hoatran’ny hoe andro vitsivitsy fotsiny ilay izy taminy, satria izy tia azy.'),
  ('6aadc6f789e459a26d301654', '2026-09-18T23:19:19.226Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:19.226Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 29, 21, 'Ary hoy i Jakoba tamin’i Labana: “Omeo ahy amin’izay ny vadiko, fa efa tapitra ny fotoana nifanarahantsika. Avelao amin’izay aho hanao firaisana aminy.”', 'ary hoy i jakoba tamin’i labana: “omeo ahy amin’izay ny vadiko, fa efa tapitra ny fotoana nifanarahantsika. avelao amin’izay aho hanao firaisana aminy.”'),
  ('6aadc6f789e459a26d301655', '2026-09-18T23:19:19.226Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:19.226Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 29, 22, 'Dia novorin’i Labana ny olona rehetra teo an-toerana, ka nanao fety be izy.', 'dia novorin’i labana ny olona rehetra teo an-toerana, ka nanao fety be izy.'),
  ('6aadc6f789e459a26d301656', '2026-09-18T23:19:19.226Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:19.226Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 29, 23, 'Rehefa hariva anefa ny andro, dia i Lea zanany vavy indray no nalainy, ka nentiny tany amin’i Jakoba mba hanaovany firaisana.', 'rehefa hariva anefa ny andro, dia i lea zanany vavy indray no nalainy, ka nentiny tany amin’i jakoba mba hanaovany firaisana.'),
  ('6aadc6f789e459a26d301657', '2026-09-18T23:19:19.226Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:19.226Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 29, 24, 'Nomen’i Labana ho mpanompon’i Lea zanany koa i Zilpa mpanompovaviny.', 'nomen’i labana ho mpanompon’i lea zanany koa i zilpa mpanompovaviny.'),
  ('6aadc6f789e459a26d301658', '2026-09-18T23:19:19.226Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:19.226Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 29, 25, 'Rehefa maraina ny andro, dia hitan’i Jakoba fa hay i Lea no tao! Dia hoy izy tamin’i Labana: “Fa inona ity nataonao? Mba hahazoako an’i Rahely ange no antony nanompoako anao e! Koa maninona aho no nofitahinao?”', 'rehefa maraina ny andro, dia hitan’i jakoba fa hay i lea no tao! dia hoy izy tamin’i labana: “fa inona ity nataonao? mba hahazoako an’i rahely ange no antony nanompoako anao e! koa maninona aho no nofitahinao?”'),
  ('6aadc6f789e459a26d301659', '2026-09-18T23:19:19.226Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:19.226Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 29, 26, 'Dia hoy i Labana: “Tsy fanao atỳ aminay mantsy ny mamoaka ny zandriny alohan’ny zokiny.', 'dia hoy i labana: “tsy fanao atỳ aminay mantsy ny mamoaka ny zandriny alohan’ny zokiny.'),
  ('6aadc6f789e459a26d30165a', '2026-09-18T23:19:19.226Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:19.226Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 29, 27, 'Manaova aloha fety miaraka amin’io zanako vavimatoa io mandritra ny herinandro, dia homena anao koa ny zandriny aorian’izay. Mila manompo ahy fito taona indray anefa ianao ho takalony.”', 'manaova aloha fety miaraka amin’io zanako vavimatoa io mandritra ny herinandro, dia homena anao koa ny zandriny aorian’izay. mila manompo ahy fito taona indray anefa ianao ho takalony.”'),
  ('6aadc6f789e459a26d30165b', '2026-09-18T23:19:19.226Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:19.226Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 29, 28, 'Dia nanao fety nandritra ny herinandro niaraka tamin’ilay vavimatoa i Jakoba, dia avy eo nomen’i Labana ho vadiny koa i Rahely zanany vavy.', 'dia nanao fety nandritra ny herinandro niaraka tamin’ilay vavimatoa i jakoba, dia avy eo nomen’i labana ho vadiny koa i rahely zanany vavy.'),
  ('6aadc6f789e459a26d30165c', '2026-09-18T23:19:19.226Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:19.226Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 29, 29, 'Nomen’i Labana ho mpanompon’i Rahely zanany koa i Bilaha mpanompovaviny.', 'nomen’i labana ho mpanompon’i rahely zanany koa i bilaha mpanompovaviny.'),
  ('6aadc6f789e459a26d30165d', '2026-09-18T23:19:19.226Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:19.226Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 29, 30, 'Dia nanao firaisana tamin’i Rahely koa i Jakoba. Ary i Rahely no tiany kokoa noho i Lea. Dia nanompo an’i Labana fito taona indray i Jakoba.', 'dia nanao firaisana tamin’i rahely koa i jakoba. ary i rahely no tiany kokoa noho i lea. dia nanompo an’i labana fito taona indray i jakoba.'),
  ('6aadc6f789e459a26d30165e', '2026-09-18T23:19:19.226Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:19.226Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 29, 31, 'Rehefa hitan’i Jehovah hoe tsy tian’ny vadiny i Lea, dia nataony izay hahatonga azy ho bevohoka, fa i Rahely kosa momba.', 'rehefa hitan’i jehovah hoe tsy tian’ny vadiny i lea, dia nataony izay hahatonga azy ho bevohoka, fa i rahely kosa momba.'),
  ('6aadc6f789e459a26d30165f', '2026-09-18T23:19:19.226Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:19.226Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 29, 32, 'Bevohoka àry i Lea ka tera-dahy. Dia nataony hoe Robena ny anarany, satria hoy izy: “Efa nijery ny fahoriako mantsy i Jehovah, ka ho tia ahy amin’izay izao ny vadiko.”', 'bevohoka àry i lea ka tera-dahy. dia nataony hoe robena ny anarany, satria hoy izy: “efa nijery ny fahoriako mantsy i jehovah, ka ho tia ahy amin’izay izao ny vadiko.”'),
  ('6aadc6f789e459a26d301660', '2026-09-18T23:19:19.226Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:19.226Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 29, 33, 'Ary bevohoka indray izy ka tera-dahy, dia hoy izy: “Satria tsy tian’ny vadiko aho, dia nohenoin’i Jehovah ny fitarainako ka nomeny an’ity iray ity koa aho.” Dia nataony hoe Simeona ny anarany.', 'ary bevohoka indray izy ka tera-dahy, dia hoy izy: “satria tsy tian’ny vadiko aho, dia nohenoin’i jehovah ny fitarainako ka nomeny an’ity iray ity koa aho.” dia nataony hoe simeona ny anarany.'),
  ('6aadc6f789e459a26d301661', '2026-09-18T23:19:19.226Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:19.226Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 29, 34, 'Ary mbola bevohoka indray izy ka tera-dahy, dia hoy izy: “Vao mainka hiraiki-po amiko izao ny vadiko, satria efa telo lahy no naterako taminy.” Natao hoe Levy àry ny anarany.', 'ary mbola bevohoka indray izy ka tera-dahy, dia hoy izy: “vao mainka hiraiki-po amiko izao ny vadiko, satria efa telo lahy no naterako taminy.” natao hoe levy àry ny anarany.');
INSERT INTO "bible_verses" ("id", "created_date", "updated_date", "created_by_id", "created_by", "translation", "book", "bookOrder", "chapter", "verse", "text", "normalizedText") VALUES
  ('6aadc6f789e459a26d301662', '2026-09-18T23:19:19.226Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:19.226Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 29, 35, 'Ary mbola bevohoka indray izy ka tera-dahy, dia hoy izy: “Hidera an’i Jehovah aho amin’ity indray mandeha ity.” Koa nataony hoe Joda ny anarany. Dia tsy niteraka intsony izy taorian’izay.', 'ary mbola bevohoka indray izy ka tera-dahy, dia hoy izy: “hidera an’i jehovah aho amin’ity indray mandeha ity.” koa nataony hoe joda ny anarany. dia tsy niteraka intsony izy taorian’izay.'),
  ('6aadc6f8f6687fc1d3ff0a17', '2026-09-18T23:19:20.333Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:20.333Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 30, 43, 'Ary lasa mpanankarena be i Jakoba, ka nanana ondry aman’osy maro be sy mpanompolahy sy mpanompovavy sy rameva ary ampondra.', 'ary lasa mpanankarena be i jakoba, ka nanana ondry aman’osy maro be sy mpanompolahy sy mpanompovavy sy rameva ary ampondra.'),
  ('6aadc6f8f6687fc1d3ff0a16', '2026-09-18T23:19:20.333Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:20.333Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 30, 42, 'Raha osaosa kosa ny ondry aman’osy, dia tsy napetrany teo ireo tsorakazo. Izay osaosa foana àry no lasan’i Labana, fa ny matanjaka kosa no an’i Jakoba.', 'raha osaosa kosa ny ondry aman’osy, dia tsy napetrany teo ireo tsorakazo. izay osaosa foana àry no lasan’i labana, fa ny matanjaka kosa no an’i jakoba.'),
  ('6aadc6f8f6687fc1d3ff0a15', '2026-09-18T23:19:20.333Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:20.333Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 30, 41, 'Ary isaky ny nitady lahy ny ondry aman’osy matanjaka, dia napetrak’i Jakoba tao anaty tavin-drano teo alohan’ny ondry aman’osy ireo tsorakazo, mba ho eo akaikin’ny tsorakazo ireny no hitady lahy.', 'ary isaky ny nitady lahy ny ondry aman’osy matanjaka, dia napetrak’i jakoba tao anaty tavin-drano teo alohan’ny ondry aman’osy ireo tsorakazo, mba ho eo akaikin’ny tsorakazo ireny no hitady lahy.'),
  ('6aadc6f8f6687fc1d3ff0a14', '2026-09-18T23:19:20.333Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:20.333Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 30, 40, 'Dia natokan’i Jakoba ny vantotr’ondrilahy. Ary ny ondry aman’osy dia natodiny tany amin’izay misoritsoritra sy izay mivolontsôkôlà rehetra mbola niaraka tamin’ny ondry aman’osin’i Labana. Avy eo dia natokan’i Jakoba ny ondry aman’osiny ka tsy nampiarahiny tamin’ny an’i Labana intsony.', 'dia natokan’i jakoba ny vantotr’ondrilahy. ary ny ondry aman’osy dia natodiny tany amin’izay misoritsoritra sy izay mivolontsôkôlà rehetra mbola niaraka tamin’ny ondry aman’osin’i labana. avy eo dia natokan’i jakoba ny ondry aman’osiny ka tsy nampiarahiny tamin’ny an’i labana intsony.'),
  ('6aadc6f8f6687fc1d3ff0a13', '2026-09-18T23:19:20.333Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:20.333Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 30, 39, 'Nitady lahy teo alohan’ireny tsorakazo ireny àry ny ondry aman’osy, ka niteraka misoritsoritra sy sada ary mara.', 'nitady lahy teo alohan’ireny tsorakazo ireny àry ny ondry aman’osy, ka niteraka misoritsoritra sy sada ary mara.'),
  ('6aadc6f8f6687fc1d3ff0a12', '2026-09-18T23:19:20.333Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:20.333Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 30, 38, 'Napetrany teo alohan’ny ondry aman’osy ireny tsorakazo ireny avy eo, ka nataony tao anaty tavin-drano fisotroan’ny biby, fa eo ny ondry aman’osy no misotro rano. Amin’izay dia hitady lahy eo alohan’ireny ny ondry aman’osy rehefa tonga hisotro rano.', 'napetrany teo alohan’ny ondry aman’osy ireny tsorakazo ireny avy eo, ka nataony tao anaty tavin-drano fisotroan’ny biby, fa eo ny ondry aman’osy no misotro rano. amin’izay dia hitady lahy eo alohan’ireny ny ondry aman’osy rehefa tonga hisotro rano.'),
  ('6aadc6f8f6687fc1d3ff0a11', '2026-09-18T23:19:20.333Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:20.333Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 30, 37, 'Ary naka tsorakazo mbola maitso tamin’ny hazo stiraksa sy hazo amandie ary hazo platana i Jakoba. Dia nanendahany ny hoditr’ireo tsorakazo mba hiseho ny fotsy ao anatiny, ka lasa maramara ireo tsorakazo.', 'ary naka tsorakazo mbola maitso tamin’ny hazo stiraksa sy hazo amandie ary hazo platana i jakoba. dia nanendahany ny hoditr’ireo tsorakazo mba hiseho ny fotsy ao anatiny, ka lasa maramara ireo tsorakazo.'),
  ('6aadc6f8f6687fc1d3ff0a10', '2026-09-18T23:19:20.333Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:20.333Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 30, 36, 'Taorian’izay dia lasa i Labana, ka lalana telo andro no nataony nanelanelana azy sy Jakoba. Dia niandry ny ondry aman’osin’i Labana sisa tavela i Jakoba.', 'taorian’izay dia lasa i labana, ka lalana telo andro no nataony nanelanelana azy sy jakoba. dia niandry ny ondry aman’osin’i labana sisa tavela i jakoba.'),
  ('6aadc6f8f6687fc1d3ff0a0f', '2026-09-18T23:19:20.333Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:20.333Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 30, 35, 'Tamin’iny andro iny ihany àry, dia natokan’i Labana ny osilahy misoritsoritra sy mara, sy ny osivavy sada sy mara rehetra, sy izay rehetra misy fotsy, ary izay vantotr’ondrilahy mivolontsôkôlà, ka nomeny hokarakarain’ny zanany lahy.', 'tamin’iny andro iny ihany àry, dia natokan’i labana ny osilahy misoritsoritra sy mara, sy ny osivavy sada sy mara rehetra, sy izay rehetra misy fotsy, ary izay vantotr’ondrilahy mivolontsôkôlà, ka nomeny hokarakarain’ny zanany lahy.'),
  ('6aadc6f8f6687fc1d3ff0a0e', '2026-09-18T23:19:20.333Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:20.333Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 30, 34, 'Dia hoy i Labana: “Mety izany. Andao hataontsika izany noteneninao izany.”', 'dia hoy i labana: “mety izany. andao hataontsika izany noteneninao izany.”'),
  ('6aadc6f8f6687fc1d3ff0a0d', '2026-09-18T23:19:20.333Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:20.333Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 30, 33, 'Ary ho hitanao fa manao ny marina aho, rehefa tonga hijery ny karamako ianao indray andro any. Izay osivavy rehetra tsy sada na mara sy izay vantotr’ondrilahy tsy mivolontsôkôlà, dia halatra raha hita atỳ amiko.”', 'ary ho hitanao fa manao ny marina aho, rehefa tonga hijery ny karamako ianao indray andro any. izay osivavy rehetra tsy sada na mara sy izay vantotr’ondrilahy tsy mivolontsôkôlà, dia halatra raha hita atỳ amiko.”'),
  ('6aadc6f8f6687fc1d3ff0a0c', '2026-09-18T23:19:20.333Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:20.333Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 30, 32, 'Hitety ny ondry aman’osinao rehetra aho anio, ka atokany ny ondry sada sy mara rehetra, sy ny vantotr’ondrilahy mivolontsôkôlà rehetra, ary ny osivavy mara sy sada rehetra. Dia izay hoatran’ireo no ho karamako manomboka izao.', 'hitety ny ondry aman’osinao rehetra aho anio, ka atokany ny ondry sada sy mara rehetra, sy ny vantotr’ondrilahy mivolontsôkôlà rehetra, ary ny osivavy mara sy sada rehetra. dia izay hoatran’ireo no ho karamako manomboka izao.'),
  ('6aadc6f8f6687fc1d3ff0a0b', '2026-09-18T23:19:20.333Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:20.333Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 30, 31, 'Ary hoy i Labana: “Inona àry no homeko anao?” Dia hoy i Jakoba: “Tsy mila manome ahy na inona na inona ianao! Fa izao fotsiny no ataovy ho ahy, dia mbola hiandry sy hiambina ny ondry aman’osinao aho:', 'ary hoy i labana: “inona àry no homeko anao?” dia hoy i jakoba: “tsy mila manome ahy na inona na inona ianao! fa izao fotsiny no ataovy ho ahy, dia mbola hiandry sy hiambina ny ondry aman’osinao aho:'),
  ('6aadc6f8f6687fc1d3ff0a0a', '2026-09-18T23:19:20.333Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:20.333Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 30, 30, 'Kely ny fanananao talohan’ny nahatongavako, nefa nihabetsaka ny biby fiompinao ka lasa be dia be. Notahin’i Jehovah mihitsy ianao hatramin’ny nahatongavako teto. Fa rahoviana kosa aho izany vao mba hanao zavatra ho an’ny ankohonako?”', 'kely ny fanananao talohan’ny nahatongavako, nefa nihabetsaka ny biby fiompinao ka lasa be dia be. notahin’i jehovah mihitsy ianao hatramin’ny nahatongavako teto. fa rahoviana kosa aho izany vao mba hanao zavatra ho an’ny ankohonako?”'),
  ('6aadc6f8f6687fc1d3ff0a09', '2026-09-18T23:19:20.333Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:20.333Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 30, 29, 'Dia hoy i Jakoba taminy: “Fantatrao tsara ny nanompoako anao sy ny nikarakarako tsara ny biby fiompinao.', 'dia hoy i jakoba taminy: “fantatrao tsara ny nanompoako anao sy ny nikarakarako tsara ny biby fiompinao.'),
  ('6aadc6f8f6687fc1d3ff0a08', '2026-09-18T23:19:20.333Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:20.333Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 30, 28, 'Hoy koa izy: “Lazao ahy izay tokony ho karamanao fa homeko.”', 'hoy koa izy: “lazao ahy izay tokony ho karamanao fa homeko.”'),
  ('6aadc6f8f6687fc1d3ff0a07', '2026-09-18T23:19:20.333Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:20.333Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 30, 27, 'Ary hoy i Labana taminy: “Raha ankasitrahanao aho, dia mijanòna re e! Fantatro tamin’ny fambara mantsy fa mitahy ahy i Jehovah noho ianao.”', 'ary hoy i labana taminy: “raha ankasitrahanao aho, dia mijanòna re e! fantatro tamin’ny fambara mantsy fa mitahy ahy i jehovah noho ianao.”'),
  ('6aadc6f8f6687fc1d3ff0a06', '2026-09-18T23:19:20.333Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:20.333Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 30, 26, 'Omeo ahy ny vady aman-janako dia handeha aho, fa ny hahazoako an’ireo no antony nanompoako anao. Fantatrao tsara ny fanompoana mafy nataoko ho anao.”', 'omeo ahy ny vady aman-janako dia handeha aho, fa ny hahazoako an’ireo no antony nanompoako anao. fantatrao tsara ny fanompoana mafy nataoko ho anao.”'),
  ('6aadc6f8f6687fc1d3ff0a05', '2026-09-18T23:19:20.333Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:20.333Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 30, 25, 'Rehefa avy niteraka an’i Josefa i Rahely, dia niteny tamin’i Labana avy hatrany i Jakoba hoe: “Alefaso ho any amin’ny toerana niaviako sy ny taniko aho.', 'rehefa avy niteraka an’i josefa i rahely, dia niteny tamin’i labana avy hatrany i jakoba hoe: “alefaso ho any amin’ny toerana niaviako sy ny taniko aho.'),
  ('6aadc6f8f6687fc1d3ff0a04', '2026-09-18T23:19:20.333Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:20.333Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 30, 24, 'Dia nataony hoe Josefa ny anarany, fa hoy izy: “Efa nampian’i Jehovah zazalahy iray ny zanako.”', 'dia nataony hoe josefa ny anarany, fa hoy izy: “efa nampian’i jehovah zazalahy iray ny zanako.”'),
  ('6aadc6f8f6687fc1d3ff0a03', '2026-09-18T23:19:20.333Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:20.333Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 30, 23, 'Bevohoka àry i Rahely ka tera-dahy. Dia hoy izy: “Efa nesorin’Andriamanitra ny fahafaham-barakako!”', 'bevohoka àry i rahely ka tera-dahy. dia hoy izy: “efa nesorin’andriamanitra ny fahafaham-barakako!”'),
  ('6aadc6f8f6687fc1d3ff0a02', '2026-09-18T23:19:20.333Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:20.333Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 30, 22, 'Farany, dia nahatsiaro an’i Rahely Andriamanitra ka nihaino ny vavaka nataony, dia nataony izay hahatonga azy ho bevohoka.', 'farany, dia nahatsiaro an’i rahely andriamanitra ka nihaino ny vavaka nataony, dia nataony izay hahatonga azy ho bevohoka.'),
  ('6aadc6f8f6687fc1d3ff0a01', '2026-09-18T23:19:20.333Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:20.333Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 30, 21, 'Ary niteraka zazavavy izy taorian’izay, ka nataony hoe Dina ny anarany.', 'ary niteraka zazavavy izy taorian’izay, ka nataony hoe dina ny anarany.'),
  ('6aadc6f8f6687fc1d3ff0a00', '2026-09-18T23:19:20.333Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:20.333Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 30, 20, 'Dia hoy i Lea: “Efa nomen’Andriamanitra fanomezana tsara be aho. Mba handefitra amiko amin’izay izao ny vadiko, satria niteraka zazalahy enina taminy aho.” Dia nataony hoe Zebolona ny anarany.', 'dia hoy i lea: “efa nomen’andriamanitra fanomezana tsara be aho. mba handefitra amiko amin’izay izao ny vadiko, satria niteraka zazalahy enina taminy aho.” dia nataony hoe zebolona ny anarany.'),
  ('6aadc6f8f6687fc1d3ff09ff', '2026-09-18T23:19:20.333Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:20.333Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 30, 19, 'Ary bevohoka indray i Lea ka niteraka zazalahy fahenina tamin’i Jakoba.', 'ary bevohoka indray i lea ka niteraka zazalahy fahenina tamin’i jakoba.'),
  ('6aadc6f8f6687fc1d3ff09fe', '2026-09-18T23:19:20.333Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:20.333Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 30, 18, 'Ary hoy i Lea: “Efa nomen’Andriamanitra ahy ny karamako, satria nomeko ho an’ny vadiko ny mpanompovaviko.” Dia nataony hoe Isakara ny anarany.', 'ary hoy i lea: “efa nomen’andriamanitra ahy ny karamako, satria nomeko ho an’ny vadiko ny mpanompovaviko.” dia nataony hoe isakara ny anarany.'),
  ('6aadc6f8f6687fc1d3ff09fd', '2026-09-18T23:19:20.333Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:20.333Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 30, 17, 'Ary nohenoin’Andriamanitra ny vavaka nataon’i Lea. Dia bevohoka izy ka niteraka zazalahy fahadimy tamin’i Jakoba.', 'ary nohenoin’andriamanitra ny vavaka nataon’i lea. dia bevohoka izy ka niteraka zazalahy fahadimy tamin’i jakoba.'),
  ('6aadc6f8f6687fc1d3ff09fc', '2026-09-18T23:19:20.333Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:20.333Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 30, 16, 'Rehefa tonga avy tany an-tsaha i Jakoba ny harivan’iny, dia nivoaka hitsena azy i Lea ka niteny hoe: “Izaho no hanaovanao firaisana rahalina, satria ny angividia hitan’ny zanako no karama naloako hahazoana anao.” Dia nanao firaisana taminy i Jakoba iny alina iny.', 'rehefa tonga avy tany an-tsaha i jakoba ny harivan’iny, dia nivoaka hitsena azy i lea ka niteny hoe: “izaho no hanaovanao firaisana rahalina, satria ny angividia hitan’ny zanako no karama naloako hahazoana anao.” dia nanao firaisana taminy i jakoba iny alina iny.'),
  ('6aadc6f8f6687fc1d3ff09fb', '2026-09-18T23:19:20.333Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:20.333Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 30, 15, 'Dia hoy i Lea: “Mbola tsy ampy anao angaha ny naka ny vadiko, no alainao koa ny angividia hitan’ny zanako?” Dia hoy i Rahely: “Ao àry fa hanao firaisana aminao izy rahalina ho takalon’ny angividia hitan’ny zanakao.”', 'dia hoy i lea: “mbola tsy ampy anao angaha ny naka ny vadiko, no alainao koa ny angividia hitan’ny zanako?” dia hoy i rahely: “ao àry fa hanao firaisana aminao izy rahalina ho takalon’ny angividia hitan’ny zanakao.”'),
  ('6aadc6f8f6687fc1d3ff09fa', '2026-09-18T23:19:20.333Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:20.333Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 30, 14, 'Ary nandehandeha i Robena tamin’ny fotoana fijinjana varimbazaha, ka nahita angividia naniry tany an-tsaha. Koa nentiny tany amin’i Lea reniny ilay angividia. Ary hoy i Rahely tamin’i Lea: “Mba omeo amin’ny angividia hitan’ny zanakao re aho e!”', 'ary nandehandeha i robena tamin’ny fotoana fijinjana varimbazaha, ka nahita angividia naniry tany an-tsaha. koa nentiny tany amin’i lea reniny ilay angividia. ary hoy i rahely tamin’i lea: “mba omeo amin’ny angividia hitan’ny zanakao re aho e!”'),
  ('6aadc6f8f6687fc1d3ff09f9', '2026-09-18T23:19:20.333Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:20.333Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 30, 13, 'Dia hoy i Lea: “Sambatra erỳ aho, fa tena hiantso ahy hoe sambatra izao ny zazavavy.” Koa nataony hoe Asera ny anarany.', 'dia hoy i lea: “sambatra erỳ aho, fa tena hiantso ahy hoe sambatra izao ny zazavavy.” koa nataony hoe asera ny anarany.'),
  ('6aadc6f8f6687fc1d3ff09f8', '2026-09-18T23:19:20.333Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:20.333Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 30, 12, 'Taorian’izay, dia niteraka zazalahy faharoa tamin’i Jakoba i Zilpa mpanompovavin’i Lea.', 'taorian’izay, dia niteraka zazalahy faharoa tamin’i jakoba i zilpa mpanompovavin’i lea.'),
  ('6aadc6f8f6687fc1d3ff09f7', '2026-09-18T23:19:20.333Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:20.333Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 30, 11, 'Ary hoy i Lea: “Tena nambinina aho!” Dia nataony hoe Gada ny anarany.', 'ary hoy i lea: “tena nambinina aho!” dia nataony hoe gada ny anarany.'),
  ('6aadc6f8f6687fc1d3ff09f6', '2026-09-18T23:19:20.333Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:20.333Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 30, 10, 'Dia nitera-dahy tamin’i Jakoba i Zilpa mpanompovavin’i Lea.', 'dia nitera-dahy tamin’i jakoba i zilpa mpanompovavin’i lea.'),
  ('6aadc6f8f6687fc1d3ff09f5', '2026-09-18T23:19:20.333Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:20.333Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 30, 9, 'Rehefa hitan’i Lea fa tsy niteraka intsony izy, dia nalainy i Zilpa mpanompovaviny ka nomeny ho vadin’i Jakoba.', 'rehefa hitan’i lea fa tsy niteraka intsony izy, dia nalainy i zilpa mpanompovaviny ka nomeny ho vadin’i jakoba.'),
  ('6aadc6f8f6687fc1d3ff09f4', '2026-09-18T23:19:20.333Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:20.333Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 30, 8, 'Dia hoy i Rahely: “Nifampitolona mafy tamin’ny rahavaviko aho, dia mbola nandresy koa!” Dia nataony hoe Naftaly ny anarany.', 'dia hoy i rahely: “nifampitolona mafy tamin’ny rahavaviko aho, dia mbola nandresy koa!” dia nataony hoe naftaly ny anarany.'),
  ('6aadc6f8f6687fc1d3ff09f3', '2026-09-18T23:19:20.333Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:20.333Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 30, 7, 'Ary bevohoka indray i Bilaha mpanompovavin’i Rahely, ka niteraka zazalahy faharoa tamin’i Jakoba.', 'ary bevohoka indray i bilaha mpanompovavin’i rahely, ka niteraka zazalahy faharoa tamin’i jakoba.'),
  ('6aadc6f8f6687fc1d3ff09f2', '2026-09-18T23:19:20.333Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:20.333Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 30, 6, 'Dia hoy i Rahely: “Andriamanitra no mpitsara ahy, dia nihaino ny fangatahako izy ka nanome ahy zazalahy.” Izany no nahatonga azy hiantso an’ilay zaza hoe Dana.', 'dia hoy i rahely: “andriamanitra no mpitsara ahy, dia nihaino ny fangatahako izy ka nanome ahy zazalahy.” izany no nahatonga azy hiantso an’ilay zaza hoe dana.'),
  ('6aadc6f8f6687fc1d3ff09f1', '2026-09-18T23:19:20.333Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:20.333Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 30, 5, 'Ary bevohoka i Bilaha ka nitera-dahy taminy.', 'ary bevohoka i bilaha ka nitera-dahy taminy.'),
  ('6aadc6f8f6687fc1d3ff09f0', '2026-09-18T23:19:20.333Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:20.333Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 30, 4, 'Dia nomeny ho vadin’i Jakoba i Bilaha mpanompovaviny, ka nanao firaisana taminy i Jakoba.', 'dia nomeny ho vadin’i jakoba i bilaha mpanompovaviny, ka nanao firaisana taminy i jakoba.'),
  ('6aadc6f8f6687fc1d3ff09ef', '2026-09-18T23:19:20.333Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:20.333Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 30, 3, 'Ary hoy i Rahely: “Io i Bilaha mpanompovaviko, dia manaova firaisana aminy. Dia amin’izay izy no hanan-janaka eo amin’ny toerako, dia ho lasa hoatran’ny hoe zanako ny zanany.”', 'ary hoy i rahely: “io i bilaha mpanompovaviko, dia manaova firaisana aminy. dia amin’izay izy no hanan-janaka eo amin’ny toerako, dia ho lasa hoatran’ny hoe zanako ny zanany.”'),
  ('6aadc6f8f6687fc1d3ff09ee', '2026-09-18T23:19:20.333Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:20.333Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 30, 2, 'Dia tezitra be tamin’i Rahely i Jakoba, ka hoy izy: “Izaho angaha solon’Andriamanitra? Izy ange no nisakana anao tsy hanan-janaka e!”', 'dia tezitra be tamin’i rahely i jakoba, ka hoy izy: “izaho angaha solon’andriamanitra? izy ange no nisakana anao tsy hanan-janaka e!”'),
  ('6aadc6f8f6687fc1d3ff09ed', '2026-09-18T23:19:20.333Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:20.333Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 30, 1, 'Rehefa hitan’i Rahely fa tsy niteraka tamin’i Jakoba izy, dia lasa nialona ny rahavaviny izy, ka niteny tamin’i Jakoba hoe: “Omeo zaza aho, fa raha tsy izany dia ho faty.”', 'rehefa hitan’i rahely fa tsy niteraka tamin’i jakoba izy, dia lasa nialona ny rahavaviny izy, ka niteny tamin’i jakoba hoe: “omeo zaza aho, fa raha tsy izany dia ho faty.”'),
  ('6aadc6f95397a351af90e003', '2026-09-18T23:19:21.314Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:21.314Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 31, 30, 'Nandeha ianao izao satria te hody mafy any amin’ny ankohonan-drainao. Fa maninona anefa no nangalarinao ireo andriamanitro?”', 'nandeha ianao izao satria te hody mafy any amin’ny ankohonan-drainao. fa maninona anefa no nangalarinao ireo andriamanitro?”'),
  ('6aadc6f95397a351af90e002', '2026-09-18T23:19:21.314Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:21.314Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 31, 29, 'Vitako ny manisy ratsy anareo, nefa efa notenenin’ilay Andriamanitry ny rainareo aho tamin’ny alina, hoe: ‘Tandremo tsara izay hoteneninao amin’i Jakoba, na tsara na ratsy.’', 'vitako ny manisy ratsy anareo, nefa efa notenenin’ilay andriamanitry ny rainareo aho tamin’ny alina, hoe: ‘tandremo tsara izay hoteneninao amin’i jakoba, na tsara na ratsy.’'),
  ('6aadc6f95397a351af90e001', '2026-09-18T23:19:21.314Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:21.314Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 31, 28, 'Tsy mba navelanao hanoroka ny zafikeliko sy ny zanako vavy akory aho. Hadalana mihitsy izao ataonao izao!', 'tsy mba navelanao hanoroka ny zafikeliko sy ny zanako vavy akory aho. hadalana mihitsy izao ataonao izao!'),
  ('6aadc6f95397a351af90e000', '2026-09-18T23:19:21.314Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:21.314Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 31, 27, 'Nahoana ianao no nandositra mangingina fa tsy niteny tamiko, ka nametsifetsy ahy? Raha mba niteny tamiko anefa ianao, dia ho faly aho nandefa anao, ka nihira sy nively ampongatapaka ary nitendry harpa ho anao izahay.', 'nahoana ianao no nandositra mangingina fa tsy niteny tamiko, ka nametsifetsy ahy? raha mba niteny tamiko anefa ianao, dia ho faly aho nandefa anao, ka nihira sy nively ampongatapaka ary nitendry harpa ho anao izahay.'),
  ('6aadc6f95397a351af90dfff', '2026-09-18T23:19:21.314Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:21.314Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 31, 26, 'Dia hoy i Labana tamin’i Jakoba: “Fa inona ity nataonao? Fa maninona ianao no nametsifetsy ahy, ka nentinao toy ny babo azo tany an’ady ny zanako vavy?', 'dia hoy i labana tamin’i jakoba: “fa inona ity nataonao? fa maninona ianao no nametsifetsy ahy, ka nentinao toy ny babo azo tany an’ady ny zanako vavy?'),
  ('6aadc6f95397a351af90dffe', '2026-09-18T23:19:21.314Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:21.314Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 31, 25, 'Efa nanangana ny tranolainy teo amin’ilay faritra be tendrombohitr’i Gileada i Jakoba, ary efa nasain’i Labana nitoby teo koa ny rahalahiny. Koa nanatona an’i Jakoba i Labana.', 'efa nanangana ny tranolainy teo amin’ilay faritra be tendrombohitr’i gileada i jakoba, ary efa nasain’i labana nitoby teo koa ny rahalahiny. koa nanatona an’i jakoba i labana.'),
  ('6aadc6f95397a351af90dffd', '2026-09-18T23:19:21.314Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:21.314Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 31, 24, 'Ary niteny tamin’i Labana Aramianina tao amin’ny nofy Andriamanitra ny alin’iny, hoe: “Tandremo tsara izay hoteneninao amin’i Jakoba, na tsara na ratsy.”', 'ary niteny tamin’i labana aramianina tao amin’ny nofy andriamanitra ny alin’iny, hoe: “tandremo tsara izay hoteneninao amin’i jakoba, na tsara na ratsy.”'),
  ('6aadc6f95397a351af90dffc', '2026-09-18T23:19:21.314Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:21.314Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 31, 23, 'Dia nentin’i Labana ny rahalahiny ka lasa nanenjika an’i Jakoba izy ireo. Efa nandeha lalana fito andro izy ireo vao nahatratra azy teo amin’ny faritra be tendrombohitr’i Gileada.', 'dia nentin’i labana ny rahalahiny ka lasa nanenjika an’i jakoba izy ireo. efa nandeha lalana fito andro izy ireo vao nahatratra azy teo amin’ny faritra be tendrombohitr’i gileada.'),
  ('6aadc6f95397a351af90dffb', '2026-09-18T23:19:21.314Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:21.314Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 31, 22, 'Tamin’ny andro fahatelo, dia nisy nilaza tamin’i Labana hoe lasa nandositra i Jakoba.', 'tamin’ny andro fahatelo, dia nisy nilaza tamin’i labana hoe lasa nandositra i jakoba.'),
  ('6aadc6f95397a351af90dffa', '2026-09-18T23:19:21.314Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:21.314Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 31, 21, 'Dia lasa nandositra izy ka niampita ny Renirano, niaraka tamin’ny fananany rehetra. Ary nizotra ho any amin’ny faritra be tendrombohitr’i Gileada izy.', 'dia lasa nandositra izy ka niampita ny renirano, niaraka tamin’ny fananany rehetra. ary nizotra ho any amin’ny faritra be tendrombohitr’i gileada izy.'),
  ('6aadc6f95397a351af90dff9', '2026-09-18T23:19:21.314Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:21.314Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 31, 20, 'Nofitahin’i Jakoba koa i Labana Aramianina, satria tsy noteniteneniny taminy hoe handeha izy.', 'nofitahin’i jakoba koa i labana aramianina, satria tsy noteniteneniny taminy hoe handeha izy.'),
  ('6aadc6f95397a351af90dff8', '2026-09-18T23:19:21.314Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:21.314Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 31, 19, 'Rehefa lasa nanety ny ondriny i Labana, dia nangalarin’i Rahely ny sarivongana terafima nivavahany.', 'rehefa lasa nanety ny ondriny i labana, dia nangalarin’i rahely ny sarivongana terafima nivavahany.'),
  ('6aadc6f95397a351af90dff7', '2026-09-18T23:19:21.314Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:21.314Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 31, 18, 'Ary nentiny ny biby fiompiny rehetra sy ny fananana rehetra voangony. Nentiny ny biby fiompy voangony tao Padana-arama, ka lasa nankany amin’i Isaka rainy tany Kanana izy.', 'ary nentiny ny biby fiompiny rehetra sy ny fananana rehetra voangony. nentiny ny biby fiompy voangony tao padana-arama, ka lasa nankany amin’i isaka rainy tany kanana izy.'),
  ('6aadc6f95397a351af90dff6', '2026-09-18T23:19:21.314Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:21.314Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 31, 17, 'Dia niainga i Jakoba ka nampitaingeniny rameva ny vady aman-janany.', 'dia niainga i jakoba ka nampitaingeniny rameva ny vady aman-janany.'),
  ('6aadc6f95397a351af90dff5', '2026-09-18T23:19:21.314Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:21.314Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 31, 16, 'Anay sy ny zanakay anefa ny harena rehetra nalain’Andriamanitra tamin’i Dada. Koa ataovy izay rehetra asain’Andriamanitra ataonao.”', 'anay sy ny zanakay anefa ny harena rehetra nalain’andriamanitra tamin’i dada. koa ataovy izay rehetra asain’andriamanitra ataonao.”'),
  ('6aadc6f95397a351af90dff4', '2026-09-18T23:19:21.314Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:21.314Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 31, 15, 'Angaha izahay tsy efa ataony hoatran’ny vahiny satria efa namidiny? Efa laniny koa ny vola nomena mba hahazoana anay.', 'angaha izahay tsy efa ataony hoatran’ny vahiny satria efa namidiny? efa laniny koa ny vola nomena mba hahazoana anay.'),
  ('6aadc6f95397a351af90dff3', '2026-09-18T23:19:21.314Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:21.314Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 31, 14, 'Dia hoy i Rahely sy Lea taminy: “Angaha mbola misy anjara lova tokony ho anay ao an-tranon’i Dada?', 'dia hoy i rahely sy lea taminy: “angaha mbola misy anjara lova tokony ho anay ao an-tranon’i dada?'),
  ('6aadc6f95397a351af90dff2', '2026-09-18T23:19:21.314Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:21.314Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 31, 13, 'Izaho ilay Andriamanitra niseho taminao tao Betela, teo amin’ilay toerana nasianao an’ilay tsangambato nohosoranao menaka sy ilay toerana nanaovanao voady tamiko. Mialà eto amin’ity tany ity, ka miverena any amin’ny tany nahaterahanao.’”', 'izaho ilay andriamanitra niseho taminao tao betela, teo amin’ilay toerana nasianao an’ilay tsangambato nohosoranao menaka sy ilay toerana nanaovanao voady tamiko. mialà eto amin’ity tany ity, ka miverena any amin’ny tany nahaterahanao.’”'),
  ('6aadc6f95397a351af90dff1', '2026-09-18T23:19:21.314Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:21.314Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 31, 12, 'Ary hoy izy: ‘Mba jereo ange e! Misoritsoritra sy sada ary misy pentimpentina daholo ny osilahy mitaingina ny vavy. Hitako daholo mantsy izay ataon’i Labana aminao.', 'ary hoy izy: ‘mba jereo ange e! misoritsoritra sy sada ary misy pentimpentina daholo ny osilahy mitaingina ny vavy. hitako daholo mantsy izay ataon’i labana aminao.'),
  ('6aadc6f95397a351af90dff0', '2026-09-18T23:19:21.314Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:21.314Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 31, 11, 'Ary hoy ny anjelin’Andriamanitra tamiko, tao amin’ilay nofy: ‘Jakoba!’ Dia hoy aho: ‘Ahoana izay?’', 'ary hoy ny anjelin’andriamanitra tamiko, tao amin’ilay nofy: ‘jakoba!’ dia hoy aho: ‘ahoana izay?’'),
  ('6aadc6f95397a351af90dfef', '2026-09-18T23:19:21.314Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:21.314Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 31, 10, 'Indray andro izay, rehefa nitady lahy ny ondry aman’osy, dia hitako tao amin’ny nofy fa misoritsoritra sy sada ary misy pentimpentina ny osilahy mitaingina ny vavy.', 'indray andro izay, rehefa nitady lahy ny ondry aman’osy, dia hitako tao amin’ny nofy fa misoritsoritra sy sada ary misy pentimpentina ny osilahy mitaingina ny vavy.'),
  ('6aadc6f95397a351af90dfee', '2026-09-18T23:19:21.314Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:21.314Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 31, 9, 'Dia nalain’Andriamanitra foana ny biby fiompin’ny rainareo ka nomeny ahy.', 'dia nalain’andriamanitra foana ny biby fiompin’ny rainareo ka nomeny ahy.'),
  ('6aadc6f95397a351af90dfed', '2026-09-18T23:19:21.314Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:21.314Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 31, 8, 'Rehefa niteny izy hoe: ‘Ny sada no ho karamanao’, dia niteraka sada daholo ny ondry aman’osy. Dia rehefa niteny indray izy hoe: ‘Ny misoritsoritra no ho karamanao’, dia niteraka misoritsoritra daholo ny ondry aman’osy.', 'rehefa niteny izy hoe: ‘ny sada no ho karamanao’, dia niteraka sada daholo ny ondry aman’osy. dia rehefa niteny indray izy hoe: ‘ny misoritsoritra no ho karamanao’, dia niteraka misoritsoritra daholo ny ondry aman’osy.'),
  ('6aadc6f95397a351af90dfec', '2026-09-18T23:19:21.314Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:21.314Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 31, 7, 'Nitady hametsifetsy ahy izy ka novany impolo be izao ny karamako. Tsy navelan’Andriamanitra hanisy ratsy ahy anefa izy.', 'nitady hametsifetsy ahy izy ka novany impolo be izao ny karamako. tsy navelan’andriamanitra hanisy ratsy ahy anefa izy.'),
  ('6aadc6f95397a351af90dfeb', '2026-09-18T23:19:21.314Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:21.314Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 31, 6, 'Fantatrareo tsara koa fa tamin’ny heriko rehetra no nanompoako ny rainareo.', 'fantatrareo tsara koa fa tamin’ny heriko rehetra no nanompoako ny rainareo.'),
  ('6aadc6f95397a351af90dfea', '2026-09-18T23:19:21.314Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:21.314Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 31, 5, 'Ary hoy izy tamin’izy ireo: “Hitako hoe niova be ny rainareo rehefa mahita ahy. Manampy ahy anefa ilay Andriamanitry ny raiko.', 'ary hoy izy tamin’izy ireo: “hitako hoe niova be ny rainareo rehefa mahita ahy. manampy ahy anefa ilay andriamanitry ny raiko.'),
  ('6aadc6f95397a351af90dfe9', '2026-09-18T23:19:21.314Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:21.314Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 31, 4, 'Dia nampiantso an’i Rahely sy Lea hankeny an-tsaha, hankeny amin’ny ondry aman’osiny, i Jakoba.', 'dia nampiantso an’i rahely sy lea hankeny an-tsaha, hankeny amin’ny ondry aman’osiny, i jakoba.'),
  ('6aadc6f95397a351af90dfe8', '2026-09-18T23:19:21.314Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:21.314Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 31, 3, 'Tamin’ny farany, dia hoy i Jehovah tamin’i Jakoba: “Miverena any amin’ny tanin’ny razambenao sy any amin’ny havanao, fa hanampy anao foana aho.”', 'tamin’ny farany, dia hoy i jehovah tamin’i jakoba: “miverena any amin’ny tanin’ny razambenao sy any amin’ny havanao, fa hanampy anao foana aho.”'),
  ('6aadc6f95397a351af90dfe7', '2026-09-18T23:19:21.314Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:21.314Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 31, 2, 'Ary hitan’i Jakoba tamin’ny endrik’i Labana fa tsy falifaly taminy hoatran’ny teo aloha intsony izy.', 'ary hitan’i jakoba tamin’ny endrik’i labana fa tsy falifaly taminy hoatran’ny teo aloha intsony izy.'),
  ('6aadc6f95397a351af90dfe6', '2026-09-18T23:19:21.314Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:21.314Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 31, 1, 'Tatỳ aoriana, dia henon’i Jakoba ny zanakalahin’i Labana nifampiresaka hoe: “Efa lasan’i Jakoba daholo ny fananan’i Dada. Tsy ho nahangona an’ireo harena rehetra ireo izy raha tsy avy tamin’ny fananan’i Dada.”', 'tatỳ aoriana, dia henon’i jakoba ny zanakalahin’i labana nifampiresaka hoe: “efa lasan’i jakoba daholo ny fananan’i dada. tsy ho nahangona an’ireo harena rehetra ireo izy raha tsy avy tamin’ny fananan’i dada.”'),
  ('6aadc6f95397a351af90e01c', '2026-09-18T23:19:21.315Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:21.315Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 31, 55, 'Ary nifoha maraina i Labana ka nanoroka an’ireo zafikeliny sy zanany vavy, dia nitso-drano azy. Dia lasa nody i Labana avy eo.', 'ary nifoha maraina i labana ka nanoroka an’ireo zafikeliny sy zanany vavy, dia nitso-drano azy. dia lasa nody i labana avy eo.'),
  ('6aadc6f95397a351af90e01b', '2026-09-18T23:19:21.315Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:21.315Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 31, 54, 'Taorian’izany, dia nanao sorona teo amin’ilay tendrombohitra i Jakoba, ary nasainy hisakafo ny rahalahiny. Dia nisakafo izy ireo, ary natory teo amin’ilay tendrombohitra.', 'taorian’izany, dia nanao sorona teo amin’ilay tendrombohitra i jakoba, ary nasainy hisakafo ny rahalahiny. dia nisakafo izy ireo, ary natory teo amin’ilay tendrombohitra.'),
  ('6aadc6f95397a351af90e01a', '2026-09-18T23:19:21.315Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:21.315Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 31, 53, 'Enga anie hitsara antsika ny Andriamanitr’i Abrahama sy ny Andriamanitr’i Nahora, ilay Andriamanitry ny rain’izy ireo!” Dia nanao fianianana tamin’ny anaran’ilay Andriamanitra atahoran’i Isaka rainy i Jakoba.', 'enga anie hitsara antsika ny andriamanitr’i abrahama sy ny andriamanitr’i nahora, ilay andriamanitry ny rain’izy ireo!” dia nanao fianianana tamin’ny anaran’ilay andriamanitra atahoran’i isaka rainy i jakoba.'),
  ('6aadc6f95397a351af90e019', '2026-09-18T23:19:21.315Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:21.315Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 31, 52, 'Ireto vato mivangongo sy tsangambato ireto no vavolombelona fa tsy hihoatra an’ireto vato ireto aho mba hanisy ratsy anao, ary ianao koa tsy hihoatra an’ireto vato mivangongo sy tsangambato ireto mba hanisy ratsy ahy.', 'ireto vato mivangongo sy tsangambato ireto no vavolombelona fa tsy hihoatra an’ireto vato ireto aho mba hanisy ratsy anao, ary ianao koa tsy hihoatra an’ireto vato mivangongo sy tsangambato ireto mba hanisy ratsy ahy.'),
  ('6aadc6f95397a351af90e018', '2026-09-18T23:19:21.315Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:21.315Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 31, 51, 'Hoy koa izy tamin’i Jakoba: “Ireto vato mivangongo sy tsangambato naorintsika ireto no mariky ny fifanekena nifanaovantsika.', 'hoy koa izy tamin’i jakoba: “ireto vato mivangongo sy tsangambato naorintsika ireto no mariky ny fifanekena nifanaovantsika.'),
  ('6aadc6f95397a351af90e017', '2026-09-18T23:19:21.315Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:21.315Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 31, 50, 'Raha mampijaly ny zanako vavy ianao na manambady hafa ankoatra an’ireo, dia tadidio fa na tsy misy mahita aza izany, dia Andriamanitra no ho vavolombelona amiko sy aminao.”', 'raha mampijaly ny zanako vavy ianao na manambady hafa ankoatra an’ireo, dia tadidio fa na tsy misy mahita aza izany, dia andriamanitra no ho vavolombelona amiko sy aminao.”'),
  ('6aadc6f95397a351af90e016', '2026-09-18T23:19:21.315Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:21.315Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 31, 49, 'sy hoe ny Tilikambo Fiambenana. Fa hoy izy: “Aleo i Jehovah hanara-maso ahy sy ianao rehefa tsy mifankahita isika.', 'sy hoe ny tilikambo fiambenana. fa hoy izy: “aleo i jehovah hanara-maso ahy sy ianao rehefa tsy mifankahita isika.'),
  ('6aadc6f95397a351af90e015', '2026-09-18T23:19:21.315Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:21.315Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 31, 48, 'Dia hoy i Labana: “Ireto vato mivangongo ireto no vavolombelona amiko sy aminao androany.” Izany no nahatonga azy hiantso an’ilay izy hoe Galeda', 'dia hoy i labana: “ireto vato mivangongo ireto no vavolombelona amiko sy aminao androany.” izany no nahatonga azy hiantso an’ilay izy hoe galeda'),
  ('6aadc6f95397a351af90e014', '2026-09-18T23:19:21.315Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:21.315Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 31, 47, 'Ary nantsoin’i Labana hoe Jegara-sahadota ilay izy, fa i Jakoba kosa niantso azy hoe Galeda.', 'ary nantsoin’i labana hoe jegara-sahadota ilay izy, fa i jakoba kosa niantso azy hoe galeda.'),
  ('6aadc6f95397a351af90e013', '2026-09-18T23:19:21.315Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:21.315Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 31, 46, 'Hoy koa i Jakoba tamin’ny rahalahiny: “Makà vato!” Dia naka vato izy ireo ka nataony nifanaingina. Nihinana teo ambonin’ilay vato be dia be mivangongo izy ireo taorian’izay.', 'hoy koa i jakoba tamin’ny rahalahiny: “makà vato!” dia naka vato izy ireo ka nataony nifanaingina. nihinana teo ambonin’ilay vato be dia be mivangongo izy ireo taorian’izay.'),
  ('6aadc6f95397a351af90e012', '2026-09-18T23:19:21.315Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:21.315Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 31, 45, 'Dia naka vato i Jakoba ka najorony ho tsangambato ilay izy.', 'dia naka vato i jakoba ka najorony ho tsangambato ilay izy.'),
  ('6aadc6f95397a351af90e011', '2026-09-18T23:19:21.315Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:21.315Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 31, 44, 'Andao hanao fifanekena izaho sy ianao, ka izany no ho vavolombelona amintsika.”', 'andao hanao fifanekena izaho sy ianao, ka izany no ho vavolombelona amintsika.”'),
  ('6aadc6f95397a351af90e010', '2026-09-18T23:19:21.315Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:21.315Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 31, 43, 'Ary hoy i Labana taminy: “Ireo vehivavy ireo dia zanako vavy, ireo ankizy ireo dia zanako, ny ondry aman’osy dia ondry aman’osiko, ary fananako sy fananan’ny zanako vavy izao rehetra hitanao izao. Koa inona moa no ratsy azoko atao amin’ireo, na amin’ny zanany naterany?', 'ary hoy i labana taminy: “ireo vehivavy ireo dia zanako vavy, ireo ankizy ireo dia zanako, ny ondry aman’osy dia ondry aman’osiko, ary fananako sy fananan’ny zanako vavy izao rehetra hitanao izao. koa inona moa no ratsy azoko atao amin’ireo, na amin’ny zanany naterany?'),
  ('6aadc6f95397a351af90e00f', '2026-09-18T23:19:21.315Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:21.315Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 31, 42, 'Raha tsy nanampy ahy ilay Andriamanitry ny raiko, ilay Andriamanitr’i Abrahama sy ilay Andriamanitra atahoran’i Isaka, dia ho efa nalefanao nody maina fotsiny aho. Efa hitan’Andriamanitra anefa ny fahoriako sy ny asa mafy nataoko, dia izany no nahatonga azy hampitandrina anao halina.”', 'raha tsy nanampy ahy ilay andriamanitry ny raiko, ilay andriamanitr’i abrahama sy ilay andriamanitra atahoran’i isaka, dia ho efa nalefanao nody maina fotsiny aho. efa hitan’andriamanitra anefa ny fahoriako sy ny asa mafy nataoko, dia izany no nahatonga azy hampitandrina anao halina.”'),
  ('6aadc6f95397a351af90e00e', '2026-09-18T23:19:21.315Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:21.315Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 31, 41, 'Efa 20 taona aho izao no nipetraka tao an-tranonao. Dia nanompo anao 14 taona aho mba hahazoako ny zanakao roa vavy, ary 6 taona kosa mba hahazoako anjara tamin’ny ondry aman’osinao. Efa novanao impolo anefa ny karamako.', 'efa 20 taona aho izao no nipetraka tao an-tranonao. dia nanompo anao 14 taona aho mba hahazoako ny zanakao roa vavy, ary 6 taona kosa mba hahazoako anjara tamin’ny ondry aman’osinao. efa novanao impolo anefa ny karamako.'),
  ('6aadc6f95397a351af90e00d', '2026-09-18T23:19:21.315Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:21.315Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 31, 40, 'Nodanihin’ny andro aho rehefa antoandro, ary matin’ny hatsiaka rehefa alina. Tsy nahita tory mihitsy koa aho.', 'nodanihin’ny andro aho rehefa antoandro, ary matin’ny hatsiaka rehefa alina. tsy nahita tory mihitsy koa aho.'),
  ('6aadc6f95397a351af90e00c', '2026-09-18T23:19:21.315Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:21.315Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 31, 39, 'Tsy nentiko tany aminao izay biby fiompinao noviravirain’ny bibidia, fa nosoloako. Nasainao nanonitra an’izay nangalarin’olona tamin’ny antoandro na tamin’ny alina koa aho.', 'tsy nentiko tany aminao izay biby fiompinao noviravirain’ny bibidia, fa nosoloako. nasainao nanonitra an’izay nangalarin’olona tamin’ny antoandro na tamin’ny alina koa aho.'),
  ('6aadc6f95397a351af90e00b', '2026-09-18T23:19:21.315Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:21.315Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 31, 38, 'Efa 20 taona aho izao no nipetraka tao aminao, nefa tsy mba nisy an’izany hoe tsy nahavanona anaka izany mihitsy ny ondry aman’osinao. Tsy mba nisy nohaniko mihitsy koa ny ondrilahinao.', 'efa 20 taona aho izao no nipetraka tao aminao, nefa tsy mba nisy an’izany hoe tsy nahavanona anaka izany mihitsy ny ondry aman’osinao. tsy mba nisy nohaniko mihitsy koa ny ondrilahinao.'),
  ('6aadc6f95397a351af90e00a', '2026-09-18T23:19:21.315Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:21.315Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 31, 37, 'Efa voasavanao daholo izao ny fananako, ka inona tamin’izay tao an-tranonao no hitanao? Avoahy eto imason’ny rahalahiko sy ny rahalahinao izany, dia avelao ry zareo no hitsara antsika mianaka.', 'efa voasavanao daholo izao ny fananako, ka inona tamin’izay tao an-tranonao no hitanao? avoahy eto imason’ny rahalahiko sy ny rahalahinao izany, dia avelao ry zareo no hitsara antsika mianaka.'),
  ('6aadc6f95397a351af90e009', '2026-09-18T23:19:21.315Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:21.315Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 31, 36, 'Ary tezitra i Jakoba ka nanome tsiny mafy an’i Labana. Dia hoy izy tamin’i Labana: “Fa inona no ratsy nataoko, ary inona no fahotana vitako no dia nanenjika ahy mafy avy tao aoriana tao ianao?', 'ary tezitra i jakoba ka nanome tsiny mafy an’i labana. dia hoy izy tamin’i labana: “fa inona no ratsy nataoko, ary inona no fahotana vitako no dia nanenjika ahy mafy avy tao aoriana tao ianao?'),
  ('6aadc6f95397a351af90e008', '2026-09-18T23:19:21.315Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:21.315Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 31, 35, 'Ary hoy i Rahely tamin-drainy: “Aza tezitra ianao, tompoko, fa tsy afaka mitsangana eo anatrehanao aho, satria tonga amiko ny zavatra mpahazo ny vehivavy.” Dia mbola nikaroka hatraiza hatraiza i Labana, nefa tsy hitany ireo sarivongana terafima.', 'ary hoy i rahely tamin-drainy: “aza tezitra ianao, tompoko, fa tsy afaka mitsangana eo anatrehanao aho, satria tonga amiko ny zavatra mpahazo ny vehivavy.” dia mbola nikaroka hatraiza hatraiza i labana, nefa tsy hitany ireo sarivongana terafima.'),
  ('6aadc6f95397a351af90e007', '2026-09-18T23:19:21.315Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:21.315Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 31, 34, 'Efa nalain’i Rahely talohan’izay anefa ireo sarivongana terafima, dia napetrany tao anatin’ny harom-behivavy teo amin’ny laselin-drameva, ka nipetrahany. Dia nisava eran’ilay tranolay i Labana, fa tsy nahita.', 'efa nalain’i rahely talohan’izay anefa ireo sarivongana terafima, dia napetrany tao anatin’ny harom-behivavy teo amin’ny laselin-drameva, ka nipetrahany. dia nisava eran’ilay tranolay i labana, fa tsy nahita.'),
  ('6aadc6f95397a351af90e006', '2026-09-18T23:19:21.315Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:21.315Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 31, 33, 'Koa niditra tao amin’ny tranolain’i Jakoba sy ny an’i Lea ary ny an’ireo mpanompovavy roa i Labana, saingy tsy nahita. Nivoaka avy tao amin’ny tranolain’i Lea izy avy eo, ka nankao amin’ny tranolain’ i Rahely.', 'koa niditra tao amin’ny tranolain’i jakoba sy ny an’i lea ary ny an’ireo mpanompovavy roa i labana, saingy tsy nahita. nivoaka avy tao amin’ny tranolain’i lea izy avy eo, ka nankao amin’ny tranolain’ i rahely.'),
  ('6aadc6f95397a351af90e005', '2026-09-18T23:19:21.315Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:21.315Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 31, 32, 'Fa aleo ho faty izay olona hahitanao ny andriamanitrao. Jereo tsara izay ato amiko, eto anatrehan’ny rahalahintsika, dia alaivo izay anao.” Tsy fantatr’i Jakoba anefa fa efa nangalarin’i Rahely izany.', 'fa aleo ho faty izay olona hahitanao ny andriamanitrao. jereo tsara izay ato amiko, eto anatrehan’ny rahalahintsika, dia alaivo izay anao.” tsy fantatr’i jakoba anefa fa efa nangalarin’i rahely izany.'),
  ('6aadc6f95397a351af90e004', '2026-09-18T23:19:21.315Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:21.315Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 31, 31, 'Ary hoy i Jakoba tamin’i Labana: “Koa izaho natahotra dia tsy niteniteny. Nieritreritra mantsy aho hoe mety halainao an-keriny amiko ny zanakao vavy.', 'ary hoy i jakoba tamin’i labana: “koa izaho natahotra dia tsy niteniteny. nieritreritra mantsy aho hoe mety halainao an-keriny amiko ny zanakao vavy.'),
  ('6aadc6fa67f5afe8584d7f54', '2026-09-18T23:19:22.301Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:22.301Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 32, 32, 'Izany no mahatonga ny zanak’Israely tsy hihinana hozatra eo amin’ny foto-pe hatramin’izao, satria nokasihin’ilay lehilahy ny hozatry ny foto-pen’i Jakoba.', 'izany no mahatonga ny zanak’israely tsy hihinana hozatra eo amin’ny foto-pe hatramin’izao, satria nokasihin’ilay lehilahy ny hozatry ny foto-pen’i jakoba.'),
  ('6aadc6fa67f5afe8584d7f53', '2026-09-18T23:19:22.301Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:22.301Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 32, 31, 'Vao nandalo an’i Penoela izy dia niposaka ny masoandro. Ary nikotringa izy noho ny foto-peny.', 'vao nandalo an’i penoela izy dia niposaka ny masoandro. ary nikotringa izy noho ny foto-peny.'),
  ('6aadc6fa67f5afe8584d7f52', '2026-09-18T23:19:22.301Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:22.301Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 32, 30, 'Dia nataon’i Jakoba hoe Peniela ny anaran’ilay toerana, satria hoy izy: “Efa nifanatrika tamin’Andriamanitra aho, nefa mbola velona ihany.”', 'dia nataon’i jakoba hoe peniela ny anaran’ilay toerana, satria hoy izy: “efa nifanatrika tamin’andriamanitra aho, nefa mbola velona ihany.”'),
  ('6aadc6fa67f5afe8584d7f51', '2026-09-18T23:19:22.301Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:22.301Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 32, 29, 'Dia nanontany i Jakoba hoe: “Mba lazao amiko koa ny anaranao.” Hoy anefa ilay lehilahy: “Fa maninona no anontanianao ny anarako?” Dia nitso-drano azy teo izy.', 'dia nanontany i jakoba hoe: “mba lazao amiko koa ny anaranao.” hoy anefa ilay lehilahy: “fa maninona no anontanianao ny anarako?” dia nitso-drano azy teo izy.'),
  ('6aadc6fa67f5afe8584d7f50', '2026-09-18T23:19:22.301Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:22.301Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 32, 28, 'Hoy indray ilay lehilahy: “Tsy hatao hoe Jakoba intsony ny anaranao fa Israely, satria efa nitolona tamin’Andriamanitra sy tamin’olona ianao, ka nandresy tamin’ny farany.”', 'hoy indray ilay lehilahy: “tsy hatao hoe jakoba intsony ny anaranao fa israely, satria efa nitolona tamin’andriamanitra sy tamin’olona ianao, ka nandresy tamin’ny farany.”'),
  ('6aadc6fa67f5afe8584d7f4f', '2026-09-18T23:19:22.301Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:22.301Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 32, 27, 'Hoy àry ilay lehilahy taminy: “Fa iza moa ny anaranao?” Dia hoy izy: “Jakoba.”', 'hoy àry ilay lehilahy taminy: “fa iza moa ny anaranao?” dia hoy izy: “jakoba.”'),
  ('6aadc6fa67f5afe8584d7f4e', '2026-09-18T23:19:22.301Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:22.301Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 32, 26, 'Ary hoy ilay lehilahy: “Avelao aho handeha, fa efa mazava ratsy ny andro.” Dia hoy i Jakoba: “Tsy havelako handeha ianao, raha tsy mitso-drano ahy aloha.”', 'ary hoy ilay lehilahy: “avelao aho handeha, fa efa mazava ratsy ny andro.” dia hoy i jakoba: “tsy havelako handeha ianao, raha tsy mitso-drano ahy aloha.”'),
  ('6aadc6fa67f5afe8584d7f4d', '2026-09-18T23:19:22.301Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:22.301Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 32, 25, 'Rehefa hitan’ilay lehilahy fa tsy resiny i Jakoba, dia nokasihiny ny foto-peny. Koa nipitsoka ny foto-pen’i Jakoba, tamin’izy nifampitolona taminy.', 'rehefa hitan’ilay lehilahy fa tsy resiny i jakoba, dia nokasihiny ny foto-peny. koa nipitsoka ny foto-pen’i jakoba, tamin’izy nifampitolona taminy.'),
  ('6aadc6fa67f5afe8584d7f4c', '2026-09-18T23:19:22.301Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:22.301Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 32, 24, 'Farany, dia i Jakoba irery no teo. Dia avy eo nisy lehilahy nifampitolona taminy, mandra-pahazava ratsin’ny andro.', 'farany, dia i jakoba irery no teo. dia avy eo nisy lehilahy nifampitolona taminy, mandra-pahazava ratsin’ny andro.'),
  ('6aadc6fa67f5afe8584d7f4b', '2026-09-18T23:19:22.301Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:22.301Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 32, 23, 'Nentiny teny ampitan’ilay renirano àry izy ireo, ary nentiny daholo koa izay nananany.', 'nentiny teny ampitan’ilay renirano àry izy ireo, ary nentiny daholo koa izay nananany.'),
  ('6aadc6fa67f5afe8584d7f4a', '2026-09-18T23:19:22.301Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:22.301Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 32, 22, 'Ary nitsangana izy tamin’iny alina iny, ka nalainy ny vadiny roa sy ny mpanompovaviny roa ary ny zanany 11 lahy, dia nentiny niampita teo amin’izay marivo teo Jaboka.', 'ary nitsangana izy tamin’iny alina iny, ka nalainy ny vadiny roa sy ny mpanompovaviny roa ary ny zanany 11 lahy, dia nentiny niampita teo amin’izay marivo teo jaboka.'),
  ('6aadc6fa67f5afe8584d7f49', '2026-09-18T23:19:22.301Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:22.301Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 32, 21, 'Nandeha niampita mialoha niaraka tamin’ny fanomezana àry ny mpanompony, fa izy kosa nijanona teo amin’ny toby tamin’iny alina iny.', 'nandeha niampita mialoha niaraka tamin’ny fanomezana àry ny mpanompony, fa izy kosa nijanona teo amin’ny toby tamin’iny alina iny.'),
  ('6aadc6fa67f5afe8584d7f48', '2026-09-18T23:19:22.301Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:22.301Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 32, 20, 'Dia lazao koa hoe: ‘Ao aoriananay ao i Jakoba mpanomponao.’” Nieritreritra mantsy izy hoe: ‘Raha andefasako fanomezana mialoha izy, dia hampitony azy izany, dia mety handray tsara ahy izy rehefa mihaona izahay.’', 'dia lazao koa hoe: ‘ao aoriananay ao i jakoba mpanomponao.’” nieritreritra mantsy izy hoe: ‘raha andefasako fanomezana mialoha izy, dia hampitony azy izany, dia mety handray tsara ahy izy rehefa mihaona izahay.’'),
  ('6aadc6fa67f5afe8584d7f47', '2026-09-18T23:19:22.301Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:22.301Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 32, 19, 'Nomeny baiko koa ny faharoa sy ny fahatelo, ary izay rehetra nanaraka ny andiam-biby, hoe: “Izany no holazainareo amin’i Esao, rehefa mifanena aminy ianareo.', 'nomeny baiko koa ny faharoa sy ny fahatelo, ary izay rehetra nanaraka ny andiam-biby, hoe: “izany no holazainareo amin’i esao, rehefa mifanena aminy ianareo.'),
  ('6aadc6fa67f5afe8584d7f46', '2026-09-18T23:19:22.301Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:22.301Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 32, 18, 'dia teneno hoe: ‘An’i Jakoba mpanomponao. Fanomezana nalefany ho an’i Esao tompoko mantsy ireo, ary efa ao aoriananay ao koa izy.’”', 'dia teneno hoe: ‘an’i jakoba mpanomponao. fanomezana nalefany ho an’i esao tompoko mantsy ireo, ary efa ao aoriananay ao koa izy.’”'),
  ('6aadc6fa67f5afe8584d7f45', '2026-09-18T23:19:22.301Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:22.301Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 32, 17, 'Nomeny baiko koa ilay mpanompony voalohany hoe: “Raha mifanena aminao i Esao rahalahiko ka manontany hoe: ‘Fa mpanompon’iza ianao, dia handeha ho aiza? Ary an’iza ireo biby eo alohanao ireo?’,', 'nomeny baiko koa ilay mpanompony voalohany hoe: “raha mifanena aminao i esao rahalahiko ka manontany hoe: ‘fa mpanompon’iza ianao, dia handeha ho aiza? ary an’iza ireo biby eo alohanao ireo?’,'),
  ('6aadc6fa67f5afe8584d7f44', '2026-09-18T23:19:22.301Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:22.301Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 32, 16, 'Dia nomeny ny mpanompony ny andiam-biby tsirairay, ka hoy izy tamin’izy ireo: “Mandehana miampita mialoha ahy, ary ataovy mifanelanelana ny andiam-biby.”', 'dia nomeny ny mpanompony ny andiam-biby tsirairay, ka hoy izy tamin’izy ireo: “mandehana miampita mialoha ahy, ary ataovy mifanelanelana ny andiam-biby.”'),
  ('6aadc6fa67f5afe8584d7f43', '2026-09-18T23:19:22.301Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:22.301Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 32, 15, 'rameva 30 mampinono miaraka amin’ny zanany, ombivavy 40, ombilahy 10, ampondravavy 20, ary ampondralahy 10.', 'rameva 30 mampinono miaraka amin’ny zanany, ombivavy 40, ombilahy 10, ampondravavy 20, ary ampondralahy 10.'),
  ('6aadc6fa67f5afe8584d7f42', '2026-09-18T23:19:22.301Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:22.301Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 32, 14, 'Osivavy 200, osilahy 20, ondrivavy 200, ondrilahy 20,', 'osivavy 200, osilahy 20, ondrivavy 200, ondrilahy 20,'),
  ('6aadc6fa67f5afe8584d7f41', '2026-09-18T23:19:22.301Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:22.301Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 32, 13, 'Dia natory teo izy tamin’iny alina iny. Ary izao avy no nalainy tamin’ny fananany mba hatao fanomezana ho an’i Esao rahalahiny:', 'dia natory teo izy tamin’iny alina iny. ary izao avy no nalainy tamin’ny fananany mba hatao fanomezana ho an’i esao rahalahiny:'),
  ('6aadc6fa67f5afe8584d7f40', '2026-09-18T23:19:22.301Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:22.301Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 32, 12, 'Ianao koa efa nilaza hoe: ‘Tena hanao soa aminao tokoa aho, ary hataoko be dia be hoatran’ny fasika any an-dranomasina ny taranakao, ka tsy ho voaisa satria be loatra.’”', 'ianao koa efa nilaza hoe: ‘tena hanao soa aminao tokoa aho, ary hataoko be dia be hoatran’ny fasika any an-dranomasina ny taranakao, ka tsy ho voaisa satria be loatra.’”'),
  ('6aadc6fa67f5afe8584d7f3f', '2026-09-18T23:19:22.301Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:22.301Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 32, 11, 'Mba vonjeo tsy ho azon’ny tanan’i Esao rahalahiko re aho e, fa matahotra azy aho! Sao mantsy izy ho tonga hanafika ahy sy ireto zaza ireto sy ny reniny.', 'mba vonjeo tsy ho azon’ny tanan’i esao rahalahiko re aho e, fa matahotra azy aho! sao mantsy izy ho tonga hanafika ahy sy ireto zaza ireto sy ny reniny.'),
  ('6aadc6fa67f5afe8584d7f3e', '2026-09-18T23:19:22.301Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:22.301Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 32, 10, 'Tena tia ahy sy tsy nivadika tamiko mihitsy ianao, sady nitana ny teninao tamiko foana, nefa izaho mpanomponao tsy mendrika an’izany. Fa tsy nanana afa-tsy tehina aho tamin’izaho niampita an’ity Reniranon’i Jordana ity, nefa izao aho lasa manana antokon’olona roa.', 'tena tia ahy sy tsy nivadika tamiko mihitsy ianao, sady nitana ny teninao tamiko foana, nefa izaho mpanomponao tsy mendrika an’izany. fa tsy nanana afa-tsy tehina aho tamin’izaho niampita an’ity reniranon’i jordana ity, nefa izao aho lasa manana antokon’olona roa.'),
  ('6aadc6fa67f5afe8584d7f3d', '2026-09-18T23:19:22.301Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:22.301Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 32, 9, 'Ary hoy i Jakoba: “Ry Andriamanitr’i Abrahama raiko sy Andriamanitr’i Isaka raiko ô! Jehovah ô! Ianao no niteny tamiko hoe: ‘Miverena any amin’ny taninao sy any amin’ny havanao, fa hanao soa aminao aho.’', 'ary hoy i jakoba: “ry andriamanitr’i abrahama raiko sy andriamanitr’i isaka raiko ô! jehovah ô! ianao no niteny tamiko hoe: ‘miverena any amin’ny taninao sy any amin’ny havanao, fa hanao soa aminao aho.’'),
  ('6aadc6fa67f5afe8584d7f3c', '2026-09-18T23:19:22.301Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:22.301Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 32, 8, 'Hoy mantsy izy: “Raha tafihin’i Esao ny antokony anankiray, dia mba ho afaka handositra ny antokony anankiray.”', 'hoy mantsy izy: “raha tafihin’i esao ny antokony anankiray, dia mba ho afaka handositra ny antokony anankiray.”'),
  ('6aadc6fa67f5afe8584d7f3b', '2026-09-18T23:19:22.301Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:22.301Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 32, 7, 'Dia natahotra be i Jakoba sady nitebiteby, ka nozarainy roa ny olona niaraka taminy. Nozarainy roa koa ny ondry aman’osy sy ny omby ary ny rameva.', 'dia natahotra be i jakoba sady nitebiteby, ka nozarainy roa ny olona niaraka taminy. nozarainy roa koa ny ondry aman’osy sy ny omby ary ny rameva.'),
  ('6aadc6fa67f5afe8584d7f3a', '2026-09-18T23:19:22.301Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:22.301Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 32, 6, 'Rehefa afaka elaela, dia niverina teo amin’i Jakoba ireo olona nirahiny ireo, ka niteny hoe: “Nihaona tamin’i Esao rahalahinao izahay. Efa tamy any izy izao hitsena anao, miaraka amin’ny 400 lahy.”', 'rehefa afaka elaela, dia niverina teo amin’i jakoba ireo olona nirahiny ireo, ka niteny hoe: “nihaona tamin’i esao rahalahinao izahay. efa tamy any izy izao hitsena anao, miaraka amin’ny 400 lahy.”'),
  ('6aadc6fa67f5afe8584d7f39', '2026-09-18T23:19:22.301Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:22.301Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 32, 5, 'dia lasa nanana omby sy ampondra sy ondry sy mpanompolahy ary mpanompovavy. Maniraka olona hampahafantatra an’izany aminao aho tompoko, amin’izay aho mba hankasitrahanao.”’”', 'dia lasa nanana omby sy ampondra sy ondry sy mpanompolahy ary mpanompovavy. maniraka olona hampahafantatra an’izany aminao aho tompoko, amin’izay aho mba hankasitrahanao.”’”'),
  ('6aadc6fa67f5afe8584d7f38', '2026-09-18T23:19:22.301Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:22.301Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 32, 4, 'Dia nomeny baiko izy ireo hoe: “Izao no hoteneninareo amin’i Esao tompoko: ‘Hoy i Jakoba mpanomponao: “Nipetraka ela be tany amin’i Labana aho,', 'dia nomeny baiko izy ireo hoe: “izao no hoteneninareo amin’i esao tompoko: ‘hoy i jakoba mpanomponao: “nipetraka ela be tany amin’i labana aho,'),
  ('6aadc6fa67f5afe8584d7f37', '2026-09-18T23:19:22.301Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:22.301Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 32, 3, 'Taorian’izay dia naniraka olona handeha mialoha i Jakoba, ho any amin’i Esao rahalahiny tany amin’ny tany Seira, any amin’ny faritr’i Edoma.', 'taorian’izay dia naniraka olona handeha mialoha i jakoba, ho any amin’i esao rahalahiny tany amin’ny tany seira, any amin’ny faritr’i edoma.'),
  ('6aadc6fa67f5afe8584d7f36', '2026-09-18T23:19:22.301Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:22.301Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 32, 2, 'Raha vao nahita azy ireo i Jakoba, dia hoy izy: “Tobin’Andriamanitra ity!” Koa nataony hoe Mahanaima ny anaran’ilay toerana.', 'raha vao nahita azy ireo i jakoba, dia hoy izy: “tobin’andriamanitra ity!” koa nataony hoe mahanaima ny anaran’ilay toerana.'),
  ('6aadc6fa67f5afe8584d7f35', '2026-09-18T23:19:22.301Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:22.301Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 32, 1, 'Dia nanohy ny diany i Jakoba, ary nisy anjelin’Andriamanitra nifanena taminy.', 'dia nanohy ny diany i jakoba, ary nisy anjelin’andriamanitra nifanena taminy.'),
  ('6aadc6fa94e3a3f2d0851dfb', '2026-09-18T23:19:22.661Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:22.661Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 33, 20, 'Dia nanorina alitara teo izy, ary nataony hoe Andriamanitra dia Andriamanitry ny Israely ny anaran’ilay alitara.', 'dia nanorina alitara teo izy, ary nataony hoe andriamanitra dia andriamanitry ny israely ny anaran’ilay alitara.'),
  ('6aadc6fa94e3a3f2d0851dfa', '2026-09-18T23:19:22.661Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:22.661Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 33, 19, 'Tatỳ aoriana, dia nividy tany izy, ka teo izy no nanangana ny tranolainy. Novidiny 100 kesita tamin’ny zanakalahin’i Hamora, rain’i Sekema, ilay izy.', 'tatỳ aoriana, dia nividy tany izy, ka teo izy no nanangana ny tranolainy. novidiny 100 kesita tamin’ny zanakalahin’i hamora, rain’i sekema, ilay izy.'),
  ('6aadc6fa94e3a3f2d0851df9', '2026-09-18T23:19:22.661Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:22.661Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 33, 18, 'Tonga soa aman-tsara tao amin’ny tanànan’i Sekema tany Kanana i Jakoba, rehefa avy tany Padana-arama. Dia nanangana ny tobiny teo akaikin’ilay tanàna izy.', 'tonga soa aman-tsara tao amin’ny tanànan’i sekema tany kanana i jakoba, rehefa avy tany padana-arama. dia nanangana ny tobiny teo akaikin’ilay tanàna izy.'),
  ('6aadc6fa94e3a3f2d0851df8', '2026-09-18T23:19:22.661Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:22.661Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 33, 17, 'Ary lasa nankany Sokota i Jakoba. Dia nanorina trano izy, sady nanao fialofana ho an’ny biby fiompiny. Izany no nahatonga azy hiantso an’ilay toerana hoe Sokota.', 'ary lasa nankany sokota i jakoba. dia nanorina trano izy, sady nanao fialofana ho an’ny biby fiompiny. izany no nahatonga azy hiantso an’ilay toerana hoe sokota.'),
  ('6aadc6fa94e3a3f2d0851df7', '2026-09-18T23:19:22.661Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:22.661Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 33, 16, 'Koa niverina nankany Seira i Esao tamin’iny andro iny.', 'koa niverina nankany seira i esao tamin’iny andro iny.'),
  ('6aadc6fa94e3a3f2d0851df6', '2026-09-18T23:19:22.661Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:22.661Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 33, 15, 'Dia hoy i Esao: “Aleo àry homeko olona ianao hiaraka aminao e!” Fa hoy i Jakoba: “Aoka izao ihany re e! Rehefa ankasitrahanao fotsiny aho, tompoko, dia ampy ahy izay.”', 'dia hoy i esao: “aleo àry homeko olona ianao hiaraka aminao e!” fa hoy i jakoba: “aoka izao ihany re e! rehefa ankasitrahanao fotsiny aho, tompoko, dia ampy ahy izay.”'),
  ('6aadc6fa94e3a3f2d0851df5', '2026-09-18T23:19:22.661Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:22.661Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 33, 14, 'Aleo re ianao, tompoko, mandeha mialoha ny mpanomponao e! Fa izaho handeha miadana manaraka ny dian’ny biby fiompy sy ny dian’ny ankizy, mandra-pahatongako any amin’ny tompoko any Seira.”', 'aleo re ianao, tompoko, mandeha mialoha ny mpanomponao e! fa izaho handeha miadana manaraka ny dian’ny biby fiompy sy ny dian’ny ankizy, mandra-pahatongako any amin’ny tompoko any seira.”'),
  ('6aadc6fa94e3a3f2d0851df4', '2026-09-18T23:19:22.661Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:22.661Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 33, 13, 'Hoy anefa i Jakoba: “Hitan’ny tompoko moa fa mbola kely ny ankizy, ary mampinono ny ondry sy omby entiko. Koa raha entina mandeha mafy loatra ao anatin’ny iray andro ireo biby fiompy ireo, dia ho faty daholo.', 'hoy anefa i jakoba: “hitan’ny tompoko moa fa mbola kely ny ankizy, ary mampinono ny ondry sy omby entiko. koa raha entina mandeha mafy loatra ao anatin’ny iray andro ireo biby fiompy ireo, dia ho faty daholo.'),
  ('6aadc6fa94e3a3f2d0851df3', '2026-09-18T23:19:22.661Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:22.661Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 33, 12, 'Dia hoy i Esao: “Andao isika hiala eto, ka aleo aho handeha eo alohanao.”', 'dia hoy i esao: “andao isika hiala eto, ka aleo aho handeha eo alohanao.”'),
  ('6aadc6fa94e3a3f2d0851df2', '2026-09-18T23:19:22.661Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:22.661Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 33, 11, 'Mba raiso re ny fanomezana nentina ho anao e, fa tsodrano avy amiko ireny! Efa nankasitrahan’Andriamanitra mantsy aho, ka manana an’izay rehetra ilaiko.” Dia mbola nisisika ihany izy, ka noraisin’i Esao izany.', 'mba raiso re ny fanomezana nentina ho anao e, fa tsodrano avy amiko ireny! efa nankasitrahan’andriamanitra mantsy aho, ka manana an’izay rehetra ilaiko.” dia mbola nisisika ihany izy, ka noraisin’i esao izany.'),
  ('6aadc6fa94e3a3f2d0851df1', '2026-09-18T23:19:22.661Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:22.661Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 33, 10, 'Hoy anefa i Jakoba: “Aza atao an’izany moa e! Raha ankasitrahanao aho, dia mba raiso ny fanomezana atolotro. Te hahita ny endrikao mantsy aho dia nitondra an’ireny. Dia nahita ny endrikao tokoa aho izao, ka hoatran’ny hoe nahita ny endrik’Andriamanitra satria noraisinao tsara aho.', 'hoy anefa i jakoba: “aza atao an’izany moa e! raha ankasitrahanao aho, dia mba raiso ny fanomezana atolotro. te hahita ny endrikao mantsy aho dia nitondra an’ireny. dia nahita ny endrikao tokoa aho izao, ka hoatran’ny hoe nahita ny endrik’andriamanitra satria noraisinao tsara aho.'),
  ('6aadc6fa94e3a3f2d0851df0', '2026-09-18T23:19:22.661Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:22.661Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 33, 9, 'Ary hoy i Esao: “Efa be dia be mihitsy ny fananako, ry rahalahiko, fa aleo ho anao ihany ny anao.”', 'ary hoy i esao: “efa be dia be mihitsy ny fananako, ry rahalahiko, fa aleo ho anao ihany ny anao.”'),
  ('6aadc6fa94e3a3f2d0851def', '2026-09-18T23:19:22.661Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:22.661Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 33, 8, 'Ary hoy i Esao: “Fa maninona ianao no nandefa an’ireny olona sy biby rehetra nifanena tamiko ireny?” Dia hoy i Jakoba: “Amin’izay aho hankasitrahan’ny tompoko.”', 'ary hoy i esao: “fa maninona ianao no nandefa an’ireny olona sy biby rehetra nifanena tamiko ireny?” dia hoy i jakoba: “amin’izay aho hankasitrahan’ny tompoko.”'),
  ('6aadc6fa94e3a3f2d0851dee', '2026-09-18T23:19:22.661Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:22.661Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 33, 7, 'Nanatona koa i Lea sy ny zanany ka niankohoka. Avy eo dia nanatona i Josefa sy Rahely ka niankohoka.', 'nanatona koa i lea sy ny zanany ka niankohoka. avy eo dia nanatona i josefa sy rahely ka niankohoka.'),
  ('6aadc6fa94e3a3f2d0851ded', '2026-09-18T23:19:22.661Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:22.661Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 33, 6, 'Dia nanatona ireo mpanompovavy sy ny zanany, ka niankohoka.', 'dia nanatona ireo mpanompovavy sy ny zanany, ka niankohoka.'),
  ('6aadc6fa94e3a3f2d0851dec', '2026-09-18T23:19:22.661Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:22.661Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 33, 5, 'Rehefa hitan’i Esao ny zaza amam-behivavy, dia hoy izy: “Iza ireo miaraka aminao ireo?” Ary hoy i Jakoba: “Zaza nomen’Andriamanitra ny mpanomponao ireo.”', 'rehefa hitan’i esao ny zaza amam-behivavy, dia hoy izy: “iza ireo miaraka aminao ireo?” ary hoy i jakoba: “zaza nomen’andriamanitra ny mpanomponao ireo.”'),
  ('6aadc6fa94e3a3f2d0851deb', '2026-09-18T23:19:22.661Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:22.661Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 33, 4, 'I Esao koa anefa nihazakazaka nitsena azy, ka namihina azy sady nanoroka azy. Dia nitomany teo izy mirahalahy.', 'i esao koa anefa nihazakazaka nitsena azy, ka namihina azy sady nanoroka azy. dia nitomany teo izy mirahalahy.'),
  ('6aadc6fa94e3a3f2d0851dea', '2026-09-18T23:19:22.661Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:22.661Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 33, 3, 'Dia nandeha mialoha azy ireo i Jakoba, ka niankohoka tamin’ny tany impito, mandra-pahatongany teo akaikin’ny rahalahiny.', 'dia nandeha mialoha azy ireo i jakoba, ka niankohoka tamin’ny tany impito, mandra-pahatongany teo akaikin’ny rahalahiny.'),
  ('6aadc6fa94e3a3f2d0851de9', '2026-09-18T23:19:22.661Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:22.661Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 33, 2, 'Nataony teny aloha ny mpanompovavy sy ny zanany, dia avy eo i Lea sy ny zanany, ary tao aorianan’izy ireo i Rahely sy Josefa.', 'nataony teny aloha ny mpanompovavy sy ny zanany, dia avy eo i lea sy ny zanany, ary tao aorianan’izy ireo i rahely sy josefa.'),
  ('6aadc6fa94e3a3f2d0851de8', '2026-09-18T23:19:22.661Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:22.661Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 33, 1, 'Ary nitazana i Jakoba ka hitany fa tamy i Esao, niaraka tamin’ny 400 lahy. Dia nozarazarain’i Jakoba tamin’i Lea sy Rahely ary ny mpanompovavy roa ny ankizy.', 'ary nitazana i jakoba ka hitany fa tamy i esao, niaraka tamin’ny 400 lahy. dia nozarazarain’i jakoba tamin’i lea sy rahely ary ny mpanompovavy roa ny ankizy.'),
  ('6aadc6fb07de28770b407c86', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.167Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.167Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 34, 25, 'Tamin’ny andro fahatelo anefa, raha iny mbola nanaintaina iny ireo lehilahy ireo, dia samy naka ny sabany ny zanak’i Jakoba roa lahy, dia i Simeona sy Levy, anadahin’i Dina. Dia niditra tao an-tanàna izy roa lahy, nefa tsy nisy niahiahy azy mihitsy, dia novonoiny daholo ny lehilahy rehetra tao.', 'tamin’ny andro fahatelo anefa, raha iny mbola nanaintaina iny ireo lehilahy ireo, dia samy naka ny sabany ny zanak’i jakoba roa lahy, dia i simeona sy levy, anadahin’i dina. dia niditra tao an-tanàna izy roa lahy, nefa tsy nisy niahiahy azy mihitsy, dia novonoiny daholo ny lehilahy rehetra tao.'),
  ('6aadc6fb07de28770b407c85', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.167Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.167Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 34, 24, 'Ary nanaiky ny tenin’i Hamora sy Sekema zanany ny olona rehetra nivoaka ny vavahadin’ny tanànany, ka noforana ny lahy rehetra, dia izay rehetra nivoaka ny vavahadin’ny tanàna.', 'ary nanaiky ny tenin’i hamora sy sekema zanany ny olona rehetra nivoaka ny vavahadin’ny tanànany, ka noforana ny lahy rehetra, dia izay rehetra nivoaka ny vavahadin’ny tanàna.'),
  ('6aadc6fb07de28770b407c84', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.167Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.167Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 34, 23, 'Dia tsy ho lasantsika ve amin’izay ny fananany sy ny harenany ary ny biby fiompiny rehetra? Aleo hekentsika izay lazainy, mba hiara-monina amintsika ry zareo.”', 'dia tsy ho lasantsika ve amin’izay ny fananany sy ny harenany ary ny biby fiompiny rehetra? aleo hekentsika izay lazainy, mba hiara-monina amintsika ry zareo.”'),
  ('6aadc6fb07de28770b407c83', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.167Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.167Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 34, 22, 'Fa raha izao no ataontsika vao hanaiky hiara-monina amintsika izy ireo mba ho lasa firenena iray isika sy ry zareo: Tsy maintsy forana hoatran-dry zareo koa ny lehilahy rehetra eto amintsika.', 'fa raha izao no ataontsika vao hanaiky hiara-monina amintsika izy ireo mba ho lasa firenena iray isika sy ry zareo: tsy maintsy forana hoatran-dry zareo koa ny lehilahy rehetra eto amintsika.'),
  ('6aadc6fb07de28770b407c82', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.167Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.167Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 34, 21, '“Te hihavana amintsika ireo olona ireo. Koa aleo izy hipetraka eto amin’ity tany ity sy hanao varotra eto, satria malalaka be ny tany ka mbola antonona azy. Azontsika alaina ho vady ny zanany vavy, ary azontsika omena azy koa ny zanatsika vavy.', '“te hihavana amintsika ireo olona ireo. koa aleo izy hipetraka eto amin’ity tany ity sy hanao varotra eto, satria malalaka be ny tany ka mbola antonona azy. azontsika alaina ho vady ny zanany vavy, ary azontsika omena azy koa ny zanatsika vavy.'),
  ('6aadc6fb07de28770b407c81', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.167Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.167Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 34, 20, 'Dia nankeo am-bavahadin’ny tanàna i Hamora sy Sekema zanany, ka niteny tamin’ny lehilahy tao an-tanàna hoe:', 'dia nankeo am-bavahadin’ny tanàna i hamora sy sekema zanany, ka niteny tamin’ny lehilahy tao an-tanàna hoe:'),
  ('6aadc6fb07de28770b407c80', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.167Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.167Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 34, 19, 'Dia tsy nangataka andro ilay tovolahy fa nanao an’izay nangatahin’izy ireo, satria nahafinaritra azy ny zanakavavin’i Jakoba. Izy koa no nohajaina indrindra tao amin’ny ankohonan-drainy manontolo.', 'dia tsy nangataka andro ilay tovolahy fa nanao an’izay nangatahin’izy ireo, satria nahafinaritra azy ny zanakavavin’i jakoba. izy koa no nohajaina indrindra tao amin’ny ankohonan-drainy manontolo.'),
  ('6aadc6fb07de28770b407c7f', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.167Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.167Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 34, 18, 'Ary tian’i Hamora sy Sekema zanany ny hevitr’izy ireo.', 'ary tian’i hamora sy sekema zanany ny hevitr’izy ireo.'),
  ('6aadc6fb07de28770b407c7e', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.167Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.167Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 34, 17, 'Fa raha tsy manaraka ny teninay ianareo ka tsy manaiky hoforana, dia halainay ny anabavinay dia handeha izahay.”', 'fa raha tsy manaraka ny teninay ianareo ka tsy manaiky hoforana, dia halainay ny anabavinay dia handeha izahay.”'),
  ('6aadc6fb07de28770b407c7d', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.167Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.167Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 34, 16, 'Dia homenay anareo ny zanakay vavy, ary halainay ho anay ny zanakareo vavy. Hiara-monina aminareo koa izahay, dia ho lasa firenena iray isika.', 'dia homenay anareo ny zanakay vavy, ary halainay ho anay ny zanakareo vavy. hiara-monina aminareo koa izahay, dia ho lasa firenena iray isika.'),
  ('6aadc6fb07de28770b407c7c', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.167Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.167Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 34, 15, 'Izao atao vao hanaiky izahay: Tsy maintsy manao hoatr’anay ianareo, ka hoforana ny lehilahy rehetra eo aminareo.', 'izao atao vao hanaiky izahay: tsy maintsy manao hoatr’anay ianareo, ka hoforana ny lehilahy rehetra eo aminareo.'),
  ('6aadc6fb07de28770b407c7b', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.167Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.167Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 34, 14, 'Dia namaly izy ireo hoe: “Tsy azonay atao ny manome ny anabavinay ho an’ny lehilahy tsy mifora, fa manala baraka anay izany.', 'dia namaly izy ireo hoe: “tsy azonay atao ny manome ny anabavinay ho an’ny lehilahy tsy mifora, fa manala baraka anay izany.'),
  ('6aadc6fb07de28770b407c7a', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.167Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.167Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 34, 13, 'Ary namitaka an’i Sekema sy Hamora rainy ny zanakalahin’i Jakoba, satria i Sekema nandoto an’i Dina anabavin’izy ireo.', 'ary namitaka an’i sekema sy hamora rainy ny zanakalahin’i jakoba, satria i sekema nandoto an’i dina anabavin’izy ireo.'),
  ('6aadc6fb07de28770b407c79', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.167Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.167Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 34, 12, 'Afaka mitaky vodiondry lafo be amiko ianareo, sady afaka mangataka fanomezana faran’izay lafo vidy, fa vonona aho hanome an’izay teneninareo. Fa mba omeo ho vadiko fotsiny ilay ankizivavy iny.”', 'afaka mitaky vodiondry lafo be amiko ianareo, sady afaka mangataka fanomezana faran’izay lafo vidy, fa vonona aho hanome an’izay teneninareo. fa mba omeo ho vadiko fotsiny ilay ankizivavy iny.”'),
  ('6aadc6fb07de28770b407c78', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.167Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.167Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 34, 11, 'Ary hoy i Sekema tamin’ny rain’ilay tovovavy sy ny anadahiny: “Mba tanteraho re ny faniriako e, fa homeko anareo izay angatahinareo amiko.', 'ary hoy i sekema tamin’ny rain’ilay tovovavy sy ny anadahiny: “mba tanteraho re ny faniriako e, fa homeko anareo izay angatahinareo amiko.'),
  ('6aadc6fb07de28770b407c77', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.167Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.167Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 34, 10, 'Mahazo miara-monina aminay ianareo, ka ho afaka hipetraka eny amin’izay tianareo hipetrahana eto amin’ity tany ity. Mipetraha eto dia manaova varotra eto, ary ataovy izay hahatamana anareo.”', 'mahazo miara-monina aminay ianareo, ka ho afaka hipetraka eny amin’izay tianareo hipetrahana eto amin’ity tany ity. mipetraha eto dia manaova varotra eto, ary ataovy izay hahatamana anareo.”'),
  ('6aadc6fb07de28770b407c76', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.167Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.167Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 34, 9, 'Andao isika hanao fifanarahana, ka omeo ho vadin’ny zanakay lahy ny zanakareo vavy, ary alaivo ho vadin’ny zanakareo lahy ny zanakay vavy.', 'andao isika hanao fifanarahana, ka omeo ho vadin’ny zanakay lahy ny zanakareo vavy, ary alaivo ho vadin’ny zanakareo lahy ny zanakay vavy.'),
  ('6aadc6fb07de28770b407c75', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.167Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.167Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 34, 8, 'Ary niresaka tamin’izy ireo i Hamora hoe: “Raiki-pitia amin’ny zanakareo vavy i Sekema zanako. Koa mba omeo azy re izy ho vadiny e!', 'ary niresaka tamin’izy ireo i hamora hoe: “raiki-pitia amin’ny zanakareo vavy i sekema zanako. koa mba omeo azy re izy ho vadiny e!'),
  ('6aadc6fb07de28770b407c74', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.167Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.167Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 34, 7, 'Henon’ny zanakalahin’i Jakoba anefa izay nitranga, ka tonga dia nody avy tany an-tsaha izy ireo. Tena sosotra izy ireo sady tezitra be, satria nanala baraka ny Israely i Sekema, rehefa nanao firaisana tamin’ny zanakavavin’i Jakoba, nefa zavatra tsy tokony hatao mihitsy izany.', 'henon’ny zanakalahin’i jakoba anefa izay nitranga, ka tonga dia nody avy tany an-tsaha izy ireo. tena sosotra izy ireo sady tezitra be, satria nanala baraka ny israely i sekema, rehefa nanao firaisana tamin’ny zanakavavin’i jakoba, nefa zavatra tsy tokony hatao mihitsy izany.'),
  ('6aadc6fb07de28770b407c73', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.167Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.167Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 34, 6, 'Avy eo dia nivoaka hiresaka tamin’i Jakoba i Hamora, rain’i Sekema.', 'avy eo dia nivoaka hiresaka tamin’i jakoba i hamora, rain’i sekema.'),
  ('6aadc6fb07de28770b407c72', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.167Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.167Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 34, 5, 'Ary henon’i Jakoba fa efa nandoto an’i Dina zanany vavy i Sekema. Ny zanany lahy anefa mbola niandry ny biby fiompiny tany an-tsaha tamin’izay. Nangina àry aloha i Jakoba mandra-piverin’izy ireo.', 'ary henon’i jakoba fa efa nandoto an’i dina zanany vavy i sekema. ny zanany lahy anefa mbola niandry ny biby fiompiny tany an-tsaha tamin’izay. nangina àry aloha i jakoba mandra-piverin’izy ireo.'),
  ('6aadc6fb07de28770b407c71', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.167Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.167Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 34, 4, 'Farany, dia hoy i Sekema tamin’i Hamora rainy: “Alaivo ho vadiko ilay ankizivavy iny.”', 'farany, dia hoy i sekema tamin’i hamora rainy: “alaivo ho vadiko ilay ankizivavy iny.”'),
  ('6aadc6fb07de28770b407c70', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.167Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.167Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 34, 3, 'Dia lasa raiki-pitia tamin’i Dina zanakavavin’i Jakoba i Sekema. Tena tia an’ilay tovovavy izy, ka nanao teny nambabo ny fony.', 'dia lasa raiki-pitia tamin’i dina zanakavavin’i jakoba i sekema. tena tia an’ilay tovovavy izy, ka nanao teny nambabo ny fony.'),
  ('6aadc6fb07de28770b407c6f', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.167Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.167Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 34, 2, 'Rehefa nahita azy i Sekema, zanakalahin’i Hamora Hivita, mpiadidy tao amin’ilay tany, dia naka azy ka nanolana azy.', 'rehefa nahita azy i sekema, zanakalahin’i hamora hivita, mpiadidy tao amin’ilay tany, dia naka azy ka nanolana azy.'),
  ('6aadc6fb07de28770b407c6e', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.167Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.167Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 34, 1, 'Ary zatra niarakaraka tamin’ny tovovavy tompon-tany i Dina zanakavavin’i Jakoba sy Lea.', 'ary zatra niarakaraka tamin’ny tovovavy tompon-tany i dina zanakavavin’i jakoba sy lea.'),
  ('6aadc6fb07de28770b407c8c', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.168Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.168Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 34, 31, 'Hoy anefa izy ireo: “Ny anabavinay kosa ve dia avelanay hataon’ny olona hoatran’ny mpivaro-tena?”', 'hoy anefa izy ireo: “ny anabavinay kosa ve dia avelanay hataon’ny olona hoatran’ny mpivaro-tena?”'),
  ('6aadc6fb07de28770b407c8b', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.168Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.168Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 34, 30, 'Dia hoy i Jakoba tamin’i Simeona sy Levy: “Efa nampidi-kizo ahy mihitsy ianareo, fa noho ny nataonareo, dia lasa maimbo amin’ny mponina eto amin’ity tany ity aho, dia amin’ny Kananita sy ny Perizita. Isika anefa vitsy kely, dia hitambatra hanafika antsika ry zareo, ka ho ripaka izaho sy ny ankohonako.”', 'dia hoy i jakoba tamin’i simeona sy levy: “efa nampidi-kizo ahy mihitsy ianareo, fa noho ny nataonareo, dia lasa maimbo amin’ny mponina eto amin’ity tany ity aho, dia amin’ny kananita sy ny perizita. isika anefa vitsy kely, dia hitambatra hanafika antsika ry zareo, ka ho ripaka izaho sy ny ankohonako.”'),
  ('6aadc6fb07de28770b407c8a', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.168Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.168Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 34, 29, 'Nalainy daholo koa ny fananan’izy ireo, sady nentiny ho babo daholo ny zanany kely sy ny vadiny, ary norobainy ny zava-drehetra tany anaty trano.', 'nalainy daholo koa ny fananan’izy ireo, sady nentiny ho babo daholo ny zanany kely sy ny vadiny, ary norobainy ny zava-drehetra tany anaty trano.'),
  ('6aadc6fb07de28770b407c89', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.168Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.168Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 34, 28, 'Dia nalain’ny zanak’i Jakoba ny ondrin’izy ireo, ny ombiny, ny ampondrany, sy izay tao an-tanàna, ary izay teny an-tsaha.', 'dia nalain’ny zanak’i jakoba ny ondrin’izy ireo, ny ombiny, ny ampondrany, sy izay tao an-tanàna, ary izay teny an-tsaha.'),
  ('6aadc6fb07de28770b407c88', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.168Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.168Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 34, 27, 'Tonga koa ny zanakalahin’i Jakoba hafa ka nandroba ny tanànan’ireo lehilahy novonoina ireo, satria nandoto ny anabaviny ireo.', 'tonga koa ny zanakalahin’i jakoba hafa ka nandroba ny tanànan’ireo lehilahy novonoina ireo, satria nandoto ny anabaviny ireo.'),
  ('6aadc6fb07de28770b407c87', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.168Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.168Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 34, 26, 'Dia novonoiny tamin’ny sabatra i Hamora sy Sekema zanany, dia avy eo nalainy tao an-tranon’i Sekema i Dina ka lasa izy ireo.', 'dia novonoiny tamin’ny sabatra i hamora sy sekema zanany, dia avy eo nalainy tao an-tranon’i sekema i dina ka lasa izy ireo.'),
  ('6aadc6fba8035caa3a51586c', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.544Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.544Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 35, 10, 'Dia hoy Andriamanitra taminy: “Jakoba no anaranao. Tsy hatao hoe Jakoba intsony anefa ny anaranao, fa hatao hoe Israely.” Dia nantsoiny hoe Israely izy.', 'dia hoy andriamanitra taminy: “jakoba no anaranao. tsy hatao hoe jakoba intsony anefa ny anaranao, fa hatao hoe israely.” dia nantsoiny hoe israely izy.'),
  ('6aadc6fba8035caa3a51586b', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.544Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.544Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 35, 9, 'Ary niseho tamin’i Jakoba indray Andriamanitra ka nitso-drano azy, tamin’izy avy tany Padana-arama.', 'ary niseho tamin’i jakoba indray andriamanitra ka nitso-drano azy, tamin’izy avy tany padana-arama.'),
  ('6aadc6fba8035caa3a51586a', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.544Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.544Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 35, 8, 'Tatỳ aoriana dia maty i Debora, ilay vehivavy nampinono an’i Rebeka taloha. Nalevina teo akaikin’i Betela izy, teo ambany hazo oaka. Koa nataon’i Jakoba hoe Alona-bakota ny anaran’ilay hazo.', 'tatỳ aoriana dia maty i debora, ilay vehivavy nampinono an’i rebeka taloha. nalevina teo akaikin’i betela izy, teo ambany hazo oaka. koa nataon’i jakoba hoe alona-bakota ny anaran’ilay hazo.'),
  ('6aadc6fba8035caa3a515869', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.544Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.544Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 35, 7, 'Dia nanorina alitara teo izy. Ary nataony hoe Ela-betela ny anaran’ilay toerana, satria teo Andriamanitra no niseho taminy, tamin’izy nandositra ny rahalahiny.', 'dia nanorina alitara teo izy. ary nataony hoe ela-betela ny anaran’ilay toerana, satria teo andriamanitra no niseho taminy, tamin’izy nandositra ny rahalahiny.'),
  ('6aadc6fba8035caa3a515868', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.544Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.544Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 35, 6, 'Farany, dia tonga tao Lozy, izany hoe Betela, tany Kanana i Jakoba sy ny olona rehetra niaraka taminy.', 'farany, dia tonga tao lozy, izany hoe betela, tany kanana i jakoba sy ny olona rehetra niaraka taminy.'),
  ('6aadc6fba8035caa3a515867', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.544Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.544Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 35, 5, 'Rehefa nandeha izy ireo, dia nataon’Andriamanitra nihorohoro ny tanàna nanodidina, ka tsy nenjehiny ny zanak’i Jakoba.', 'rehefa nandeha izy ireo, dia nataon’andriamanitra nihorohoro ny tanàna nanodidina, ka tsy nenjehiny ny zanak’i jakoba.'),
  ('6aadc6fba8035caa3a515866', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.544Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.544Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 35, 4, 'Koa nomen’izy ireo an’i Jakoba ny andriamani-kafa rehetra tany amin’izy ireo sy ny kavina teny an-tsofiny, ka nalevin’i Jakoba teo am-pototr’ilay hazobe tany akaikin’i Sekema.', 'koa nomen’izy ireo an’i jakoba ny andriamani-kafa rehetra tany amin’izy ireo sy ny kavina teny an-tsofiny, ka nalevin’i jakoba teo am-pototr’ilay hazobe tany akaikin’i sekema.'),
  ('6aadc6fba8035caa3a515865', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.544Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.544Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 35, 3, 'Dia andao isika hiakatra any Betela. Any aho no hanao alitara ho an’ilay tena Andriamanitra. Nihaino ahy tamin’ny andro fahoriako izy sady nanampy ahy foana na taiza na taiza nalehako.”', 'dia andao isika hiakatra any betela. any aho no hanao alitara ho an’ilay tena andriamanitra. nihaino ahy tamin’ny andro fahoriako izy sady nanampy ahy foana na taiza na taiza nalehako.”'),
  ('6aadc6fba8035caa3a515864', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.544Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.544Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 35, 2, 'Ary hoy i Jakoba tamin’ny ankohonany sy izay rehetra niaraka taminy: “Ario ny andriamani-kafa any aminareo, ary diovy ny tenanareo, dia soloy ny akanjonareo.', 'ary hoy i jakoba tamin’ny ankohonany sy izay rehetra niaraka taminy: “ario ny andriamani-kafa any aminareo, ary diovy ny tenanareo, dia soloy ny akanjonareo.'),
  ('6aadc6fba8035caa3a515863', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.544Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.544Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 35, 1, 'Taorian’izany, dia hoy Andriamanitra tamin’i Jakoba: “Mandehana miakatra any Betela, dia any mipetraka. Ary manaova alitara any, ho an’ilay Andriamanitra niseho taminao, tamin’ianao nandositra an’i Esao rahalahinao.”', 'taorian’izany, dia hoy andriamanitra tamin’i jakoba: “mandehana miakatra any betela, dia any mipetraka. ary manaova alitara any, ho an’ilay andriamanitra niseho taminao, tamin’ianao nandositra an’i esao rahalahinao.”'),
  ('6aadc6fba8035caa3a51587f', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.545Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.545Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 35, 29, 'Dia niala aina i Isaka ka maty. Ary nangonina any amin’ny razambeny izy, rehefa ela velona sy afa-po tamin’ny fiainana. Dia nandevina azy i Esao sy Jakoba zanany.', 'dia niala aina i isaka ka maty. ary nangonina any amin’ny razambeny izy, rehefa ela velona sy afa-po tamin’ny fiainana. dia nandevina azy i esao sy jakoba zanany.'),
  ('6aadc6fba8035caa3a51587e', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.545Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.545Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 35, 28, 'Ary velona 180 taona i Isaka.', 'ary velona 180 taona i isaka.'),
  ('6aadc6fba8035caa3a51587d', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.545Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.545Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 35, 27, 'Farany, dia tonga tany amin’i Isaka rainy tany Mamre i Jakoba, tao Kiriata-arba, izany hoe Hebrona. Tao i Abrahama sy Isaka no nivahiny.', 'farany, dia tonga tany amin’i isaka rainy tany mamre i jakoba, tao kiriata-arba, izany hoe hebrona. tao i abrahama sy isaka no nivahiny.'),
  ('6aadc6fba8035caa3a51587c', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.545Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.545Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 35, 26, 'Ary ny naterak’i Zilpa, mpanompovavin’i Lea, dia i Gada sy Asera. Ireo no zanakalahin’i Jakoba naterany tany Padana-arama.', 'ary ny naterak’i zilpa, mpanompovavin’i lea, dia i gada sy asera. ireo no zanakalahin’i jakoba naterany tany padana-arama.'),
  ('6aadc6fba8035caa3a51587b', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.545Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.545Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 35, 25, 'Ny naterak’i Bilaha, mpanompovavin’i Rahely, dia i Dana sy Naftaly.', 'ny naterak’i bilaha, mpanompovavin’i rahely, dia i dana sy naftaly.'),
  ('6aadc6fba8035caa3a51587a', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.545Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.545Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 35, 24, 'Ny naterak’i Rahely dia i Josefa sy Benjamina.', 'ny naterak’i rahely dia i josefa sy benjamina.'),
  ('6aadc6fba8035caa3a515879', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.545Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.545Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 35, 23, 'Ny naterak’i Lea dia i Robena, lahimatoan’i Jakoba, dia avy eo i Simeona, Levy, Joda, Isakara, ary Zebolona.', 'ny naterak’i lea dia i robena, lahimatoan’i jakoba, dia avy eo i simeona, levy, joda, isakara, ary zebolona.'),
  ('6aadc6fba8035caa3a515878', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.545Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.545Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 35, 22, 'Indray mandeha, dia nanao firaisana tamin’i Bilaha vadikelin-drainy i Robena, tamin’i Israely mbola nipetraka tao amin’ilay tany. Ary lasa fantatr’i Israely izany. Nisy 12 ny zanakalahin’i Jakoba.', 'indray mandeha, dia nanao firaisana tamin’i bilaha vadikelin-drainy i robena, tamin’i israely mbola nipetraka tao amin’ilay tany. ary lasa fantatr’i israely izany. nisy 12 ny zanakalahin’i jakoba.'),
  ('6aadc6fba8035caa3a515877', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.545Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.545Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 35, 21, 'Dia niainga i Israely taorian’izay, ka raha vao niala kely teo amin’ny tilikambo Edera izy dia nanorina ny tranolainy.', 'dia niainga i israely taorian’izay, ka raha vao niala kely teo amin’ny tilikambo edera izy dia nanorina ny tranolainy.'),
  ('6aadc6fba8035caa3a515876', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.545Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.545Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 35, 20, 'Ary nanorina tsangambato teo ambonin’ny fasany i Jakoba. Io no tsangambaton’ny fasan’i Rahely hatramin’izao.', 'ary nanorina tsangambato teo ambonin’ny fasany i jakoba. io no tsangambaton’ny fasan’i rahely hatramin’izao.'),
  ('6aadc6fba8035caa3a515875', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.545Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.545Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 35, 19, 'Dia maty i Rahely ka nalevina teny amoron’ny lalana mankany Efrata, izany hoe Betlehema.', 'dia maty i rahely ka nalevina teny amoron’ny lalana mankany efrata, izany hoe betlehema.'),
  ('6aadc6fba8035caa3a515874', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.545Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.545Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 35, 18, 'Rehefa hiala aina iny i Rahely,—fa efa ho faty—dia nataony hoe Ben-ony ny anaran’ilay zaza. Fa ny rainy kosa niantso azy hoe Benjamina.', 'rehefa hiala aina iny i rahely,—fa efa ho faty—dia nataony hoe ben-ony ny anaran’ilay zaza. fa ny rainy kosa niantso azy hoe benjamina.'),
  ('6aadc6fba8035caa3a515873', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.545Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.545Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 35, 17, 'Tamin’ilay izy nanaintaina mafy teo am-piterahana iny, dia hoy ny mpampivelona: “Aza matahotra fa mbola hahazo lahikely indray ianao.”', 'tamin’ilay izy nanaintaina mafy teo am-piterahana iny, dia hoy ny mpampivelona: “aza matahotra fa mbola hahazo lahikely indray ianao.”'),
  ('6aadc6fba8035caa3a515872', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.545Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.545Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 35, 16, 'Ary niainga izy ireo ka niala tao Betela. Raha mbola lavidavitra an’i Efrata izy ireo, dia nihetsi-jaza i Rahely sady saro-piterahana.', 'ary niainga izy ireo ka niala tao betela. raha mbola lavidavitra an’i efrata izy ireo, dia nihetsi-jaza i rahely sady saro-piterahana.'),
  ('6aadc6fba8035caa3a515871', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.545Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.545Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 35, 15, 'Ary mbola nataon’i Jakoba hoe Betela ihany ny anaran’ilay toerana niresahan’Andriamanitra taminy.', 'ary mbola nataon’i jakoba hoe betela ihany ny anaran’ilay toerana niresahan’andriamanitra taminy.'),
  ('6aadc6fba8035caa3a515870', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.545Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.545Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 35, 14, 'Dia nanorina tsangambato teo amin’ilay toerana niresahan’ Andriamanitra taminy i Jakoba, ka nandraraka fanatitra zava-pisotro sy menaka teo ambonin’ilay izy.', 'dia nanorina tsangambato teo amin’ilay toerana niresahan’ andriamanitra taminy i jakoba, ka nandraraka fanatitra zava-pisotro sy menaka teo ambonin’ilay izy.'),
  ('6aadc6fba8035caa3a51586f', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.545Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.545Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 35, 13, 'Avy eo dia niala teo aminy Andriamanitra, teo amin’ilay toerana niresahany taminy.', 'avy eo dia niala teo aminy andriamanitra, teo amin’ilay toerana niresahany taminy.'),
  ('6aadc6fba8035caa3a51586e', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.545Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.545Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 35, 12, 'Homeko anao ilay tany nomeko an’i Abrahama sy Isaka, ary homeko ny taranakao handimby anao koa izany.”', 'homeko anao ilay tany nomeko an’i abrahama sy isaka, ary homeko ny taranakao handimby anao koa izany.”'),
  ('6aadc6fba8035caa3a51586d', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.545Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.545Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 35, 11, 'Hoy koa Andriamanitra taminy: “Izaho no Andriamanitra Mahery Indrindra. Miteraha maro, dia mihabetsaha. Hisy firenena hipoitra avy aminao, dia firenena maromaro mihitsy, ary hisy mpanjaka maro avy amin’ny taranakao.', 'hoy koa andriamanitra taminy: “izaho no andriamanitra mahery indrindra. miteraha maro, dia mihabetsaha. hisy firenena hipoitra avy aminao, dia firenena maromaro mihitsy, ary hisy mpanjaka maro avy amin’ny taranakao.'),
  ('6aadc6fbc7d6423ed4799d95', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.922Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.922Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 36, 17, 'Ireto no zanakalahin’i Regoela zanak’i Esao: Nahata Lehibem-poko, Zera Lehibem-poko, Sama Lehibem-poko, ary Miza Lehibem-poko. Ireo no lehibem-poko avy tamin’i Regoela tany Edoma. Ireo no taranak’i Basemata vadin’i Esao.', 'ireto no zanakalahin’i regoela zanak’i esao: nahata lehibem-poko, zera lehibem-poko, sama lehibem-poko, ary miza lehibem-poko. ireo no lehibem-poko avy tamin’i regoela tany edoma. ireo no taranak’i basemata vadin’i esao.'),
  ('6aadc6fbc7d6423ed4799d94', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.922Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.922Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 36, 16, 'Kora Lehibem-poko, Gatama Lehibem-poko, ary Amaleka Lehibem-poko. Ireo no lehibem-poko avy tamin’i Elifaza tany Edoma. Ireo no taranak’i Ada.', 'kora lehibem-poko, gatama lehibem-poko, ary amaleka lehibem-poko. ireo no lehibem-poko avy tamin’i elifaza tany edoma. ireo no taranak’i ada.'),
  ('6aadc6fbc7d6423ed4799d93', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.922Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.922Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 36, 15, 'Ireto no lehibem-pokon’ny taranak’i Esao, izany hoe ny zanakalahin’i Elifaza lahimatoan’i Esao: Temana Lehibem-poko, Omara Lehibem-poko, Zefo Lehibem-poko, Kenaza Lehibem-poko,', 'ireto no lehibem-pokon’ny taranak’i esao, izany hoe ny zanakalahin’i elifaza lahimatoan’i esao: temana lehibem-poko, omara lehibem-poko, zefo lehibem-poko, kenaza lehibem-poko,'),
  ('6aadc6fbc7d6423ed4799d92', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.922Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.922Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 36, 14, 'Ireto no zanakalahin’i Oholibama naterany tamin’i Esao: Jeosy sy Jalama ary Kora, izay naterany tamin’i Esao. Vadin’i Esao i Oholibama ary zanakavavin’i Ana, sady zafikelin’i Zibona.', 'ireto no zanakalahin’i oholibama naterany tamin’i esao: jeosy sy jalama ary kora, izay naterany tamin’i esao. vadin’i esao i oholibama ary zanakavavin’i ana, sady zafikelin’i zibona.'),
  ('6aadc6fbc7d6423ed4799d91', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.922Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.922Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 36, 13, 'Ireto no zanakalahin’i Regoela: Nahata, Zera, Sama, ary Miza. Ireo no taranak’i Basemata vadin’i Esao.', 'ireto no zanakalahin’i regoela: nahata, zera, sama, ary miza. ireo no taranak’i basemata vadin’i esao.'),
  ('6aadc6fbc7d6423ed4799d90', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.922Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.922Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 36, 12, 'Ary lasa vadikelin’i Elifaza zanakalahin’i Esao i Timna. Dia niteraka an’i Amaleka tamin’i Elifaza izy. Ireo no taranak’i Ada vadin’i Esao.', 'ary lasa vadikelin’i elifaza zanakalahin’i esao i timna. dia niteraka an’i amaleka tamin’i elifaza izy. ireo no taranak’i ada vadin’i esao.'),
  ('6aadc6fbc7d6423ed4799d8f', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.922Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.922Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 36, 11, 'Ny zanakalahin’i Elifaza dia i Temana, Omara, Zefo, Gatama, ary Kenaza.', 'ny zanakalahin’i elifaza dia i temana, omara, zefo, gatama, ary kenaza.'),
  ('6aadc6fbc7d6423ed4799d8e', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.922Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.922Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 36, 10, 'Ireto no anaran’ny zanakalahin’i Esao: Elifaza zanak’i Ada vadin’i Esao, sy Regoela zanak’i Basemata vadin’i Esao.', 'ireto no anaran’ny zanakalahin’i esao: elifaza zanak’i ada vadin’i esao, sy regoela zanak’i basemata vadin’i esao.'),
  ('6aadc6fbc7d6423ed4799d8d', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.922Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.922Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 36, 9, 'Izao no tantaran’i Esao rain’ny Edomita, tany amin’ny faritra be tendrombohitr’i Seira:', 'izao no tantaran’i esao rain’ny edomita, tany amin’ny faritra be tendrombohitr’i seira:'),
  ('6aadc6fbc7d6423ed4799d8c', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.922Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.922Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 36, 8, 'Dia nipetraka tany amin’ny faritra be tendrombohitr’i Seira i Esao. I Esao no Edoma.', 'dia nipetraka tany amin’ny faritra be tendrombohitr’i seira i esao. i esao no edoma.'),
  ('6aadc6fbc7d6423ed4799d8b', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.922Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.922Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 36, 7, 'Lasa betsaka loatra mantsy ny fananan’izy mirahalahy, ka tsy afaka niara-nonina izy ireo. Tsy antonona azy ireo intsony ilay tany nipetrahany, satria be dia be ny biby fiompiny.', 'lasa betsaka loatra mantsy ny fananan’izy mirahalahy, ka tsy afaka niara-nonina izy ireo. tsy antonona azy ireo intsony ilay tany nipetrahany, satria be dia be ny biby fiompiny.'),
  ('6aadc6fbc7d6423ed4799d8a', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.922Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.922Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 36, 6, 'Tatỳ aoriana, dia nentin’i Esao ny vadiny, ny zanany lahy, ny zanany vavy, ny olona rehetra tao an-tranony, ny biby fiompiny, ny bibiny hafa rehetra, ary ny fananana rehetra voangony tany Kanana, ka lasa izy nankany an-tany hafa, niala lavitra an’i Jakoba rahalahiny.', 'tatỳ aoriana, dia nentin’i esao ny vadiny, ny zanany lahy, ny zanany vavy, ny olona rehetra tao an-tranony, ny biby fiompiny, ny bibiny hafa rehetra, ary ny fananana rehetra voangony tany kanana, ka lasa izy nankany an-tany hafa, niala lavitra an’i jakoba rahalahiny.'),
  ('6aadc6fbc7d6423ed4799d89', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.922Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.922Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 36, 5, 'ary i Oholibama niteraka an’i Jeosy sy Jalama ary Kora. Ireo no zanakalahin’i Esao naterany tany Kanana.', 'ary i oholibama niteraka an’i jeosy sy jalama ary kora. ireo no zanakalahin’i esao naterany tany kanana.'),
  ('6aadc6fbc7d6423ed4799d88', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.922Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.922Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 36, 4, 'Ary i Ada niteraka an’i Elifaza tamin’i Esao, i Basemata kosa niteraka an’i Regoela,', 'ary i ada niteraka an’i elifaza tamin’i esao, i basemata kosa niteraka an’i regoela,'),
  ('6aadc6fbc7d6423ed4799d87', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.922Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.922Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 36, 3, 'ary Basemata zanakavavin’i Ismaela sady anabavin’i Nebaiota.', 'ary basemata zanakavavin’i ismaela sady anabavin’i nebaiota.'),
  ('6aadc6fbc7d6423ed4799d86', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.922Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.922Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 36, 2, 'Naka vady tao Kanana i Esao. Ireto avy izy ireo: Ada zanakavavin’i Elona Hetita, sy Oholibama zanakavavin’i Ana sady zafikelin’i Zibona Hivita,', 'naka vady tao kanana i esao. ireto avy izy ireo: ada zanakavavin’i elona hetita, sy oholibama zanakavavin’i ana sady zafikelin’i zibona hivita,'),
  ('6aadc6fbc7d6423ed4799d85', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.922Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.922Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 36, 1, 'Izao no tantaran’i Esao, izany hoe i Edoma:', 'izao no tantaran’i esao, izany hoe i edoma:'),
  ('6aadc6fbc7d6423ed4799daf', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.923Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.923Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 36, 43, 'Magdiela Lehibem-poko, ary Irama Lehibem-poko. Ireo no lehibem-pokon’i Edoma sy ny tanànany tao amin’ny taniny. Ireo no taranak’i Esao, rain’ny Edomita.', 'magdiela lehibem-poko, ary irama lehibem-poko. ireo no lehibem-pokon’i edoma sy ny tanànany tao amin’ny taniny. ireo no taranak’i esao, rain’ny edomita.'),
  ('6aadc6fbc7d6423ed4799dae', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.923Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.923Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 36, 42, 'Kenaza Lehibem-poko, Temana Lehibem-poko, Mibzara Lehibem-poko,', 'kenaza lehibem-poko, temana lehibem-poko, mibzara lehibem-poko,'),
  ('6aadc6fbc7d6423ed4799dad', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.923Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.923Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 36, 41, 'Oholibama Lehibem-poko, Elaha Lehibem-poko, Pinona Lehibem-poko,', 'oholibama lehibem-poko, elaha lehibem-poko, pinona lehibem-poko,'),
  ('6aadc6fbc7d6423ed4799dac', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.923Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.923Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 36, 40, 'Ireto àry no anaran’ny lehibem-poko avy tamin’i Esao, araka ny fianakaviany sy ny toerana nisy azy ary ny anarany: Timna Lehibem-poko, Alva Lehibem-poko, Jeteta Lehibem-poko,', 'ireto àry no anaran’ny lehibem-poko avy tamin’i esao, araka ny fianakaviany sy ny toerana nisy azy ary ny anarany: timna lehibem-poko, alva lehibem-poko, jeteta lehibem-poko,'),
  ('6aadc6fbc7d6423ed4799dab', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.923Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.923Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 36, 39, 'Rehefa maty i Bala-hanana zanak’i Akbora, dia i Hadara no nanjaka nandimby azy, ary Pao no anaran’ny tanànan’i Hadara. Ary ny anaran’ny vadiny dia Mehetebela zanakavavin’i Matreda, izay zanakavavin’i Mezahaba.', 'rehefa maty i bala-hanana zanak’i akbora, dia i hadara no nanjaka nandimby azy, ary pao no anaran’ny tanànan’i hadara. ary ny anaran’ny vadiny dia mehetebela zanakavavin’i matreda, izay zanakavavin’i mezahaba.'),
  ('6aadc6fbc7d6423ed4799daa', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.923Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.923Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 36, 38, 'Rehefa maty i Saoly, dia i Bala-hanana zanakalahin’i Akbora no nanjaka nandimby azy.', 'rehefa maty i saoly, dia i bala-hanana zanakalahin’i akbora no nanjaka nandimby azy.'),
  ('6aadc6fbc7d6423ed4799da9', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.923Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.923Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 36, 37, 'Rehefa maty i Samla, dia i Saoly avy any Rehobota eo amoron’ny Renirano no nanjaka nandimby azy.', 'rehefa maty i samla, dia i saoly avy any rehobota eo amoron’ny renirano no nanjaka nandimby azy.'),
  ('6aadc6fbc7d6423ed4799da8', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.923Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.923Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 36, 36, 'Rehefa maty i Hadada, dia i Samla avy any Masreka no nanjaka nandimby azy.', 'rehefa maty i hadada, dia i samla avy any masreka no nanjaka nandimby azy.'),
  ('6aadc6fbc7d6423ed4799da7', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.923Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.923Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 36, 35, 'Rehefa maty i Hosama, dia i Hadada zanakalahin’i Bedada no nanjaka nandimby azy. Nandresy ny Midianita teo amin’ny faritr’ i Moaba i Hadada, ary Avita no anaran’ny tanànany.', 'rehefa maty i hosama, dia i hadada zanakalahin’i bedada no nanjaka nandimby azy. nandresy ny midianita teo amin’ny faritr’ i moaba i hadada, ary avita no anaran’ny tanànany.'),
  ('6aadc6fbc7d6423ed4799da6', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.923Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.923Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 36, 34, 'Rehefa maty i Jobaba, dia i Hosama avy any amin’ny tanin’ny Temanita no nanjaka nandimby azy.', 'rehefa maty i jobaba, dia i hosama avy any amin’ny tanin’ny temanita no nanjaka nandimby azy.'),
  ('6aadc6fbc7d6423ed4799da5', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.923Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.923Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 36, 33, 'Rehefa maty i Bela, dia i Jobaba zanakalahin’i Zera avy any Bozra no nanjaka nandimby azy.', 'rehefa maty i bela, dia i jobaba zanakalahin’i zera avy any bozra no nanjaka nandimby azy.'),
  ('6aadc6fbc7d6423ed4799da4', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.923Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.923Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 36, 32, 'I Bela zanakalahin’i Beora no nanjaka tany Edoma, ary Dinaba no anaran’ny tanànany.', 'i bela zanakalahin’i beora no nanjaka tany edoma, ary dinaba no anaran’ny tanànany.'),
  ('6aadc6fbc7d6423ed4799da3', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.923Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.923Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 36, 31, 'Ary ireto no mpanjaka nitondra tany Edoma, tamin’ny mbola tsy nisy mpanjaka teo amin’ny Israelita:', 'ary ireto no mpanjaka nitondra tany edoma, tamin’ny mbola tsy nisy mpanjaka teo amin’ny israelita:'),
  ('6aadc6fbc7d6423ed4799da2', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.923Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.923Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 36, 30, 'Disona Lehibem-poko, Ezera Lehibem-poko, ary Disana Lehibem-poko. Ireo no lehibem-pokon’ny Horita tany Seira.', 'disona lehibem-poko, ezera lehibem-poko, ary disana lehibem-poko. ireo no lehibem-pokon’ny horita tany seira.'),
  ('6aadc6fbc7d6423ed4799da1', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.923Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.923Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 36, 29, 'Ireto no lehibem-pokon’ny Horita: Lotana Lehibem-poko, Sobala Lehibem-poko, Zibona Lehibem-poko, Ana Lehibem-poko,', 'ireto no lehibem-pokon’ny horita: lotana lehibem-poko, sobala lehibem-poko, zibona lehibem-poko, ana lehibem-poko,'),
  ('6aadc6fbc7d6423ed4799da0', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.923Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.923Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 36, 28, 'Ireto no zanakalahin’i Disana: Oza sy Arana.', 'ireto no zanakalahin’i disana: oza sy arana.'),
  ('6aadc6fbc7d6423ed4799d9f', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.923Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.923Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 36, 27, 'Ireto no zanakalahin’i Ezera: Bilana sy Zavana ary Akana.', 'ireto no zanakalahin’i ezera: bilana sy zavana ary akana.'),
  ('6aadc6fbc7d6423ed4799d9e', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.923Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.923Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 36, 26, 'Ireto no zanakalahin’i Disona: Hemdana, Esbana, Jitrana, ary Kerana.', 'ireto no zanakalahin’i disona: hemdana, esbana, jitrana, ary kerana.'),
  ('6aadc6fbc7d6423ed4799d9d', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.923Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.923Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 36, 25, 'Ireto no zanak’i Ana: Disona sy Oholibama zanakavavin’i Ana.', 'ireto no zanak’i ana: disona sy oholibama zanakavavin’i ana.'),
  ('6aadc6fbc7d6423ed4799d9c', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.923Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.923Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 36, 24, 'Ireto no zanakalahin’i Zibona: Aia sy Ana. Io Ana io no nahita ny ranomafana tany an-tany efitra, tamin’izy niandry ny ampondran’i Zibona rainy.', 'ireto no zanakalahin’i zibona: aia sy ana. io ana io no nahita ny ranomafana tany an-tany efitra, tamin’izy niandry ny ampondran’i zibona rainy.'),
  ('6aadc6fbc7d6423ed4799d9b', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.923Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.923Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 36, 23, 'Ireto no zanakalahin’i Sobala: Alvana, Manahata, Ebala, Sefo, ary Onama.', 'ireto no zanakalahin’i sobala: alvana, manahata, ebala, sefo, ary onama.'),
  ('6aadc6fbc7d6423ed4799d9a', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.923Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.923Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 36, 22, 'Ny zanakalahin’i Lotana dia i Hory sy Hemama. Ary i Timna no anabavin’i Lotana.', 'ny zanakalahin’i lotana dia i hory sy hemama. ary i timna no anabavin’i lotana.');
INSERT INTO "bible_verses" ("id", "created_date", "updated_date", "created_by_id", "created_by", "translation", "book", "bookOrder", "chapter", "verse", "text", "normalizedText") VALUES
  ('6aadc6fbc7d6423ed4799d99', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.923Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.923Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 36, 21, 'Disona, Ezera ary Disana. Ireo no lehibem-pokon’ny Horita taranak’i Seira, tany Edoma.', 'disona, ezera ary disana. ireo no lehibem-pokon’ny horita taranak’i seira, tany edoma.'),
  ('6aadc6fbc7d6423ed4799d98', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.923Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.923Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 36, 20, 'Ireto no taranak’i Seira Horita, izay mponina teo amin’ilay tany: Lotana, Sobala, Zibona, Ana,', 'ireto no taranak’i seira horita, izay mponina teo amin’ilay tany: lotana, sobala, zibona, ana,'),
  ('6aadc6fbc7d6423ed4799d97', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.923Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.923Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 36, 19, 'Ireo no zanakalahin’i Esao, ary ireo no lehibem-pokony. I Esao no Edoma.', 'ireo no zanakalahin’i esao, ary ireo no lehibem-pokony. i esao no edoma.'),
  ('6aadc6fbc7d6423ed4799d96', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.923Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:23.923Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 36, 18, 'Ireto no zanakalahin’i Oholibama vadin’i Esao: Jeosy Lehibem-poko, Jalama Lehibem-poko, ary Kora Lehibem-poko. Ireo no lehibem-poko avy tamin’i Oholibama, zanakavavin’i Ana sady vadin’i Esao.', 'ireto no zanakalahin’i oholibama vadin’i esao: jeosy lehibem-poko, jalama lehibem-poko, ary kora lehibem-poko. ireo no lehibem-poko avy tamin’i oholibama, zanakavavin’i ana sady vadin’i esao.'),
  ('6aadc6fc885de748af36e55d', '2026-09-18T23:19:24.311Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:24.312Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 37, 13, 'Avy eo dia hoy i Israely tamin’i Josefa: “Miandry ondry any akaikin’i Sekema izao ny rahalahinao e? Avia ianao hirahiko ho any amin-dry zareo.” Dia hoy i Josefa: “Eny àry!”', 'avy eo dia hoy i israely tamin’i josefa: “miandry ondry any akaikin’i sekema izao ny rahalahinao e? avia ianao hirahiko ho any amin-dry zareo.” dia hoy i josefa: “eny àry!”'),
  ('6aadc6fc885de748af36e55c', '2026-09-18T23:19:24.311Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:24.311Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 37, 12, 'Ary lasa ny rahalahiny niandry ny andian’ondrin’ny rainy, tany akaikin’i Sekema.', 'ary lasa ny rahalahiny niandry ny andian’ondrin’ny rainy, tany akaikin’i sekema.'),
  ('6aadc6fc885de748af36e55b', '2026-09-18T23:19:24.311Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:24.311Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 37, 11, 'Dia nialona azy ny rahalahiny, fa ny rainy kosa nitadidy an’izany teniny izany foana.', 'dia nialona azy ny rahalahiny, fa ny rainy kosa nitadidy an’izany teniny izany foana.'),
  ('6aadc6fc885de748af36e55a', '2026-09-18T23:19:24.311Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:24.311Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 37, 10, 'Avy eo dia notantarainy tamin’ny rainy ilay izy, ary teo koa ny rahalahiny. Dia nobedesin’ny rainy izy hoe: “Fa inona no dikan’izany nofinao izany? Ho avy tokoa ve izaho sy ny reninao ary ny rahalahinao ka hiankohoka amin’ny tany eo anatrehanao?”', 'avy eo dia notantarainy tamin’ny rainy ilay izy, ary teo koa ny rahalahiny. dia nobedesin’ny rainy izy hoe: “fa inona no dikan’izany nofinao izany? ho avy tokoa ve izaho sy ny reninao ary ny rahalahinao ka hiankohoka amin’ny tany eo anatrehanao?”'),
  ('6aadc6fc885de748af36e559', '2026-09-18T23:19:24.311Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:24.311Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 37, 9, 'Nanonofy indray izy taorian’izay ka notantarainy tamin’ny rahalahiny ilay izy. Hoy izy: “Nanonofy indray aho hoe niankohoka teo anatrehako, hono, ny masoandro sy ny volana ary ny kintana 11.”', 'nanonofy indray izy taorian’izay ka notantarainy tamin’ny rahalahiny ilay izy. hoy izy: “nanonofy indray aho hoe niankohoka teo anatrehako, hono, ny masoandro sy ny volana ary ny kintana 11.”'),
  ('6aadc6fc885de748af36e558', '2026-09-18T23:19:24.311Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:24.311Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 37, 8, 'Dia hoy ny rahalahiny taminy: “Te hilaza ve ialahy hoe hanjaka aminay sy hifehy anay?” Vao mainka àry izy ireo nankahala azy, noho ilay nofiny sy ny teniny.', 'dia hoy ny rahalahiny taminy: “te hilaza ve ialahy hoe hanjaka aminay sy hifehy anay?” vao mainka àry izy ireo nankahala azy, noho ilay nofiny sy ny teniny.'),
  ('6aadc6fc885de748af36e557', '2026-09-18T23:19:24.311Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:24.311Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 37, 7, 'Samy namatotra amboara teny an-tsaha, hono, isika, dia iny fa niarina ny amboarako ka nijoro mahitsy. Ny amboaranareo indray nanodidina an’ilay amboarako, dia niankohoka teo amin’ilay izy.”', 'samy namatotra amboara teny an-tsaha, hono, isika, dia iny fa niarina ny amboarako ka nijoro mahitsy. ny amboaranareo indray nanodidina an’ilay amboarako, dia niankohoka teo amin’ilay izy.”'),
  ('6aadc6fc885de748af36e556', '2026-09-18T23:19:24.311Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:24.311Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 37, 6, 'Hoy mantsy izy: “Mba henoy ange ity nofiko ity e!', 'hoy mantsy izy: “mba henoy ange ity nofiko ity e!'),
  ('6aadc6fc885de748af36e555', '2026-09-18T23:19:24.311Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:24.311Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 37, 5, 'Indray mandeha, dia nanonofy i Josefa, ka notantarainy tamin’ny rahalahiny ilay nofiny. Dia vao mainka izy ireo nankahala azy.', 'indray mandeha, dia nanonofy i josefa, ka notantarainy tamin’ny rahalahiny ilay nofiny. dia vao mainka izy ireo nankahala azy.'),
  ('6aadc6fc885de748af36e554', '2026-09-18T23:19:24.311Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:24.311Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 37, 4, 'Rehefa hitan’ny rahalahiny hoe i Josefa no tian’ny rainy kokoa noho izy rehetra, dia nankahala azy izy ireo. Lasa nikitakita foana izy ireo rehefa niresaka tamin’i Josefa.', 'rehefa hitan’ny rahalahiny hoe i josefa no tian’ny rainy kokoa noho izy rehetra, dia nankahala azy izy ireo. lasa nikitakita foana izy ireo rehefa niresaka tamin’i josefa.'),
  ('6aadc6fc885de748af36e553', '2026-09-18T23:19:24.311Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:24.311Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 37, 3, 'Tian’i Israely noho ny zanany lahy hafa rehetra i Josefa, satria naterany tamin’izy efa antitra. Ary nampanamboatra akanjo manokana ho an’i Josefa izy.', 'tian’i israely noho ny zanany lahy hafa rehetra i josefa, satria naterany tamin’izy efa antitra. ary nampanamboatra akanjo manokana ho an’i josefa izy.'),
  ('6aadc6fc885de748af36e552', '2026-09-18T23:19:24.311Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:24.311Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 37, 2, 'Izao no tantaran’i Jakoba: Tamin’i Josefa zanany 17 taona, tamin’izy mbola tovolahy, dia niaraka niandry ondry tamin’ny zanakalahin’i Bilaha sy ny zanakalahin’i Zilpa vadin-drainy izy. Ary notantarainy tamin-drainy ny ratsy nataon’ireo rahalahiny ireo.', 'izao no tantaran’i jakoba: tamin’i josefa zanany 17 taona, tamin’izy mbola tovolahy, dia niaraka niandry ondry tamin’ny zanakalahin’i bilaha sy ny zanakalahin’i zilpa vadin-drainy izy. ary notantarainy tamin-drainy ny ratsy nataon’ireo rahalahiny ireo.'),
  ('6aadc6fc885de748af36e551', '2026-09-18T23:19:24.311Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:24.311Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 37, 1, 'Mbola nipetraka tany Kanana, tao amin’ilay tany nivahinian’ny rainy, i Jakoba.', 'mbola nipetraka tany kanana, tao amin’ilay tany nivahinian’ny rainy, i jakoba.'),
  ('6aadc6fc885de748af36e574', '2026-09-18T23:19:24.312Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:24.312Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 37, 36, 'Ary namidin’ny Midianita tamin’i Potifara i Josefa rehefa tany Ejipta. Tandapan’i Farao sady lehiben’ny mpiambina io Potifara io.', 'ary namidin’ny midianita tamin’i potifara i josefa rehefa tany ejipta. tandapan’i farao sady lehiben’ny mpiambina io potifara io.'),
  ('6aadc6fc885de748af36e573', '2026-09-18T23:19:24.312Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:24.312Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 37, 35, 'Niezaka nampionona azy foana ny zanany lahy rehetra sy ny zanany vavy rehetra, fa tsy nety nampiononina mihitsy izy. Fa hoy izy: “Hisaona ny zanako foana aho mandra-pahafatiko!” Dia nitomany an-janany foana izy.', 'niezaka nampionona azy foana ny zanany lahy rehetra sy ny zanany vavy rehetra, fa tsy nety nampiononina mihitsy izy. fa hoy izy: “hisaona ny zanako foana aho mandra-pahafatiko!” dia nitomany an-janany foana izy.'),
  ('6aadc6fc885de748af36e572', '2026-09-18T23:19:24.312Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:24.312Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 37, 34, 'Dia nandrovitra ny akanjony i Jakoba, ka nisikina lamba gony sady nisaona an’ilay zanany andro maro.', 'dia nandrovitra ny akanjony i jakoba, ka nisikina lamba gony sady nisaona an’ilay zanany andro maro.'),
  ('6aadc6fc885de748af36e571', '2026-09-18T23:19:24.312Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:24.312Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 37, 33, 'Dia nojeren’ny rainy tsara ilay izy, ka niantsoantso izy hoe: “Ilay akanjon’ny zanako mihitsy ity! Tena lanin’ny bibidia masiaka i Josefa! Tena noviravirain’ny bibidia izy!”', 'dia nojeren’ny rainy tsara ilay izy, ka niantsoantso izy hoe: “ilay akanjon’ny zanako mihitsy ity! tena lanin’ny bibidia masiaka i josefa! tena noviravirain’ny bibidia izy!”'),
  ('6aadc6fc885de748af36e570', '2026-09-18T23:19:24.312Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:24.312Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 37, 32, 'Avy eo dia nisy olona nirahiny hanatitra an’ilay akanjo tany amin’ny rainy, sady hiteny hoe: “Nahita an’ity izahay ka mba jereo hoe akanjon’ny zanakao ity sa tsia!”', 'avy eo dia nisy olona nirahiny hanatitra an’ilay akanjo tany amin’ny rainy, sady hiteny hoe: “nahita an’ity izahay ka mba jereo hoe akanjon’ny zanakao ity sa tsia!”'),
  ('6aadc6fc885de748af36e56f', '2026-09-18T23:19:24.312Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:24.312Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 37, 31, 'Ary nalain’ny rahalahiny ilay akanjon’i Josefa, dia namono osilahy izy ireo, ka natsobony tao anaty ra ilay akanjo.', 'ary nalain’ny rahalahiny ilay akanjon’i josefa, dia namono osilahy izy ireo, ka natsobony tao anaty ra ilay akanjo.'),
  ('6aadc6fc885de748af36e56e', '2026-09-18T23:19:24.312Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:24.312Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 37, 30, 'Niverina teo amin’ny rahalahiny izy, ka niantsoantso hoe: “Tsy ao intsony ilay zaza! Ahoana re no hataoko e?”', 'niverina teo amin’ny rahalahiny izy, ka niantsoantso hoe: “tsy ao intsony ilay zaza! ahoana re no hataoko e?”'),
  ('6aadc6fc885de748af36e56d', '2026-09-18T23:19:24.312Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:24.312Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 37, 29, 'Taorian’izay, dia niverina nankeo amin’ilay lavaka fanangonan-drano i Robena. Dia hitany hoe tsy tao intsony i Josefa, ka nandrovitra ny akanjony izy.', 'taorian’izay, dia niverina nankeo amin’ilay lavaka fanangonan-drano i robena. dia hitany hoe tsy tao intsony i josefa, ka nandrovitra ny akanjony izy.'),
  ('6aadc6fc885de748af36e56c', '2026-09-18T23:19:24.312Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:24.312Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 37, 28, 'Rehefa nandalo ny Ismaelita, izany hoe ny Midianita mpivarotra, dia nampiakarin’ny rahalahiny avy tao amin’ilay lavaka fanangonan-drano i Josefa. Dia namidin’izy ireo volafotsy 20 sekely tamin’ny Ismaelita izy, ka nentin’izy ireny nankany Ejipta.', 'rehefa nandalo ny ismaelita, izany hoe ny midianita mpivarotra, dia nampiakarin’ny rahalahiny avy tao amin’ilay lavaka fanangonan-drano i josefa. dia namidin’izy ireo volafotsy 20 sekely tamin’ny ismaelita izy, ka nentin’izy ireny nankany ejipta.'),
  ('6aadc6fc885de748af36e56b', '2026-09-18T23:19:24.312Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:24.312Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 37, 27, 'Andao hamidintsika amin’ireny Ismaelita ireny izy, fa tsy hovonointsika. Sady izy ange rahalahintsika sy nofontsika ihany e!” Dia nohenoin’izy ireo ny teniny.', 'andao hamidintsika amin’ireny ismaelita ireny izy, fa tsy hovonointsika. sady izy ange rahalahintsika sy nofontsika ihany e!” dia nohenoin’izy ireo ny teniny.'),
  ('6aadc6fc885de748af36e56a', '2026-09-18T23:19:24.312Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:24.312Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 37, 26, 'Dia hoy i Joda tamin’ny rahalahiny: “Inona moa ny soa ho azontsika, raha vonointsika ny rahalahintsika dia tsy miteniteny isika?', 'dia hoy i joda tamin’ny rahalahiny: “inona moa ny soa ho azontsika, raha vonointsika ny rahalahintsika dia tsy miteniteny isika?'),
  ('6aadc6fc885de748af36e569', '2026-09-18T23:19:24.312Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:24.312Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 37, 25, 'Dia nipetraka hisakafo izy ireo. Avy eo izy ireo nahatazana Ismaelita maromaro niaraka avy tany Gileada, handeha hidina ho any Ejipta. Nitondra ditin-kazo ladanoma sy balsama ary hodi-kazo misy ditiny ny ramevan’izy ireo.', 'dia nipetraka hisakafo izy ireo. avy eo izy ireo nahatazana ismaelita maromaro niaraka avy tany gileada, handeha hidina ho any ejipta. nitondra ditin-kazo ladanoma sy balsama ary hodi-kazo misy ditiny ny ramevan’izy ireo.'),
  ('6aadc6fc885de748af36e568', '2026-09-18T23:19:24.312Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:24.312Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 37, 24, 'Dia nobatainy izy ka natsipiny tao anatin’ilay lavaka fanangonan-drano. Maina ilay lavaka tamin’izay, fa tsy nisy rano.', 'dia nobatainy izy ka natsipiny tao anatin’ilay lavaka fanangonan-drano. maina ilay lavaka tamin’izay, fa tsy nisy rano.'),
  ('6aadc6fc885de748af36e567', '2026-09-18T23:19:24.312Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:24.312Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 37, 23, 'Vao tonga teo amin’ny rahalahiny àry i Josefa, dia nendahan’izy ireo ilay akanjo tsara tarehy nanaovany.', 'vao tonga teo amin’ny rahalahiny àry i josefa, dia nendahan’izy ireo ilay akanjo tsara tarehy nanaovany.'),
  ('6aadc6fc885de748af36e566', '2026-09-18T23:19:24.312Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:24.312Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 37, 22, 'Hoy koa i Robena: “Aza mandatsa-dra. Atsipazo ao anatin’io lavaka fanangonan-drano atỳ an-tany efitra io fotsiny izy, fa aza mamely azy.” Tiany hovonjena mantsy i Josefa, dia haverina any amin’ny rainy.', 'hoy koa i robena: “aza mandatsa-dra. atsipazo ao anatin’io lavaka fanangonan-drano atỳ an-tany efitra io fotsiny izy, fa aza mamely azy.” tiany hovonjena mantsy i josefa, dia haverina any amin’ny rainy.'),
  ('6aadc6fc885de748af36e565', '2026-09-18T23:19:24.312Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:24.312Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 37, 21, 'Rehefa naheno an’izany i Robena, dia nitady hevitra hamonjena azy ka niteny hoe: “Aleo izy tsy hovonointsika e!”', 'rehefa naheno an’izany i robena, dia nitady hevitra hamonjena azy ka niteny hoe: “aleo izy tsy hovonointsika e!”'),
  ('6aadc6fc885de748af36e564', '2026-09-18T23:19:24.312Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:24.312Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 37, 20, 'Andao hovonointsika ho faty izy dia hatsipintsika ao anatin’ny iray amin’iretsy lavaka fanangonan-drano iretsy, dia mody hataontsika hoe lanin’ny bibidia masiaka. Ho hitantsika eo hoe hanao ahoana ny nofiny.”', 'andao hovonointsika ho faty izy dia hatsipintsika ao anatin’ny iray amin’iretsy lavaka fanangonan-drano iretsy, dia mody hataontsika hoe lanin’ny bibidia masiaka. ho hitantsika eo hoe hanao ahoana ny nofiny.”'),
  ('6aadc6fc885de748af36e563', '2026-09-18T23:19:24.312Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:24.312Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 37, 19, 'Koa nifampiresaka izy ireo hoe: “Iny tamy iny ilay mpanonofy!', 'koa nifampiresaka izy ireo hoe: “iny tamy iny ilay mpanonofy!'),
  ('6aadc6fc885de748af36e562', '2026-09-18T23:19:24.312Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:24.312Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 37, 18, 'Vao teny lavidavitra izy dia tazan’ny rahalahiny. Mbola tsy tonga teny akaikiny akory izy, dia nanao tetika izy ireo hoe hamono azy ho faty.', 'vao teny lavidavitra izy dia tazan’ny rahalahiny. mbola tsy tonga teny akaikiny akory izy, dia nanao tetika izy ireo hoe hamono azy ho faty.'),
  ('6aadc6fc885de748af36e561', '2026-09-18T23:19:24.312Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:24.312Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 37, 17, 'Ary hoy ilay lehilahy: “Niala teto ry zareo fa henoko niresaka hoe: ‘Andao isika ho any Dotana.’” Narahin’i Josefa àry ny rahalahiny, ka hitany tany Dotana.', 'ary hoy ilay lehilahy: “niala teto ry zareo fa henoko niresaka hoe: ‘andao isika ho any dotana.’” narahin’i josefa àry ny rahalahiny, ka hitany tany dotana.'),
  ('6aadc6fc885de748af36e560', '2026-09-18T23:19:24.312Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:24.312Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 37, 16, 'Dia hoy izy: “Mitady ny rahalahiko aho. Sao dia mba fantatrao hoe aiza ry zareo no miandry ondry?”', 'dia hoy izy: “mitady ny rahalahiko aho. sao dia mba fantatrao hoe aiza ry zareo no miandry ondry?”'),
  ('6aadc6fc885de748af36e55f', '2026-09-18T23:19:24.312Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:24.312Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 37, 15, 'Ary nisy lehilahy nahita azy nandeha tany an-tsaha, ka nanontany azy hoe: “Fa inona no tadiavinao?”', 'ary nisy lehilahy nahita azy nandeha tany an-tsaha, ka nanontany azy hoe: “fa inona no tadiavinao?”'),
  ('6aadc6fc885de748af36e55e', '2026-09-18T23:19:24.312Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:24.312Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 37, 14, 'Dia hoy izy taminy: “Mba mandehana jereo raha tsy misy maninona ny rahalahinao sy ny andian’ondry. Tantarao amiko izay hitanao rehefa miverina ianao.” Dia nirahiny nankany Sekema i Josefa, ka avy teo amin’ny lohasaha any Hebrona izy no niainga.', 'dia hoy izy taminy: “mba mandehana jereo raha tsy misy maninona ny rahalahinao sy ny andian’ondry. tantarao amiko izay hitanao rehefa miverina ianao.” dia nirahiny nankany sekema i josefa, ka avy teo amin’ny lohasaha any hebrona izy no niainga.'),
  ('6aadc6fcfae3ea40e8a70f06', '2026-09-18T23:19:24.680Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:24.680Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 38, 30, 'Avy eo dia nivoaka ilay rahalahiny, ilay nisy kofehy mena midorehitra tamin’ny tanany. Ary natao hoe Zera ny anarany.', 'avy eo dia nivoaka ilay rahalahiny, ilay nisy kofehy mena midorehitra tamin’ny tanany. ary natao hoe zera ny anarany.'),
  ('6aadc6fcfae3ea40e8a70f05', '2026-09-18T23:19:24.680Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:24.680Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 38, 29, 'Vao nahemotr’ilay zaza anefa ny tanany, dia ny rahalahiny indray no nivoaka. Hoy àry ilay mpampivelona: “Jereo fa nataonao tataka mihitsy ny reninao!” Koa nataony hoe Pereza ny anaran’ilay zaza.', 'vao nahemotr’ilay zaza anefa ny tanany, dia ny rahalahiny indray no nivoaka. hoy àry ilay mpampivelona: “jereo fa nataonao tataka mihitsy ny reninao!” koa nataony hoe pereza ny anaran’ilay zaza.'),
  ('6aadc6fcfae3ea40e8a70f04', '2026-09-18T23:19:24.680Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:24.680Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 38, 28, 'Tamin’ilay izy teo am-piterahana iny, dia namoaka ny tanany ilay zaza iray. Tonga dia naka kofehy mena midorehitra ny mpampivelona, ka nafatony tamin’ny tanan’ilay zaza, sady hoy izy: “Ity no nivoaka voalohany.”', 'tamin’ilay izy teo am-piterahana iny, dia namoaka ny tanany ilay zaza iray. tonga dia naka kofehy mena midorehitra ny mpampivelona, ka nafatony tamin’ny tanan’ilay zaza, sady hoy izy: “ity no nivoaka voalohany.”'),
  ('6aadc6fcfae3ea40e8a70f03', '2026-09-18T23:19:24.680Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:24.680Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 38, 27, 'Rehefa tonga ny fotoana hiterahan’i Tamara, dia ireo fa kambana no tao an-kibony.', 'rehefa tonga ny fotoana hiterahan’i tamara, dia ireo fa kambana no tao an-kibony.'),
  ('6aadc6fcfae3ea40e8a70f02', '2026-09-18T23:19:24.680Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:24.680Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 38, 26, 'Dia nojeren’i Joda tsara ireo, ka hoy izy: “Marina ny azy fa izaho no diso. Tsy nomeko ho vadin’i Sela zanako lahy mantsy izy.” Taorian’izay, dia tsy nanao firaisana taminy intsony i Joda.', 'dia nojeren’i joda tsara ireo, ka hoy izy: “marina ny azy fa izaho no diso. tsy nomeko ho vadin’i sela zanako lahy mantsy izy.” taorian’izay, dia tsy nanao firaisana taminy intsony i joda.'),
  ('6aadc6fcfae3ea40e8a70f01', '2026-09-18T23:19:24.680Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:24.680Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 38, 25, 'Rehefa navoaka izy, dia naniraka olona hiteny tamin’ny rafozandahiny hoe: “Ilay lehilahy tompon’ireto zavatra ireto no nahabevohoka ahy.” Hoy koa izy: “Mba jereo tsara hoe an’iza ireto peratra fanombohan-kase sy tady ary tehina ireto.”', 'rehefa navoaka izy, dia naniraka olona hiteny tamin’ny rafozandahiny hoe: “ilay lehilahy tompon’ireto zavatra ireto no nahabevohoka ahy.” hoy koa izy: “mba jereo tsara hoe an’iza ireto peratra fanombohan-kase sy tady ary tehina ireto.”'),
  ('6aadc6fcfae3ea40e8a70f00', '2026-09-18T23:19:24.680Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:24.680Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 38, 24, 'Telo volana teo ho eo taorian’izay anefa, dia nisy nilaza tamin’i Joda hoe: “Nivaro-tena i Tamara vinantovavinao, dia izao izy izao bevohoka.” Dia hoy i Joda: “Avoahy izy hodorana.”', 'telo volana teo ho eo taorian’izay anefa, dia nisy nilaza tamin’i joda hoe: “nivaro-tena i tamara vinantovavinao, dia izao izy izao bevohoka.” dia hoy i joda: “avoahy izy hodorana.”'),
  ('6aadc6fcfae3ea40e8a70eff', '2026-09-18T23:19:24.680Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:24.680Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 38, 23, 'Hoy àry i Joda: “Avelao ireny ho lasany any, sao isika indray no ho afa-baraka eo. Sady izaho koa efa mba nampanatitra an’ity zanak’osy ity, saingy tsy hitanao mihitsy izy.”', 'hoy àry i joda: “avelao ireny ho lasany any, sao isika indray no ho afa-baraka eo. sady izaho koa efa mba nampanatitra an’ity zanak’osy ity, saingy tsy hitanao mihitsy izy.”'),
  ('6aadc6fcfae3ea40e8a70efe', '2026-09-18T23:19:24.680Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:24.680Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 38, 22, 'Farany, dia niverina tany amin’i Joda izy ka niteny hoe: “Tsy hitako mihitsy ilay vehivavy, sady nilaza koa ny olona tany hoe: ‘Tsy nisy mpivaro-tenan’ny tempoly mihitsy teto.’”', 'farany, dia niverina tany amin’i joda izy ka niteny hoe: “tsy hitako mihitsy ilay vehivavy, sady nilaza koa ny olona tany hoe: ‘tsy nisy mpivaro-tenan’ny tempoly mihitsy teto.’”'),
  ('6aadc6fcfae3ea40e8a70efd', '2026-09-18T23:19:24.680Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:24.680Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 38, 21, 'Dia nanontaniany ny olona teo an-toerana hoe: “Aiza ilay mpivaro-tenan’ny tempoly teto Enaima iny, ilay teo amoron-dalana iny?” Hoy anefa ny olona: “Tsy nisy mpivaro-tenan’ny tempoly mihitsy teto.”', 'dia nanontaniany ny olona teo an-toerana hoe: “aiza ilay mpivaro-tenan’ny tempoly teto enaima iny, ilay teo amoron-dalana iny?” hoy anefa ny olona: “tsy nisy mpivaro-tenan’ny tempoly mihitsy teto.”'),
  ('6aadc6fcfae3ea40e8a70efc', '2026-09-18T23:19:24.680Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:24.680Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 38, 20, 'Dia nampanaterin’i Joda an’ilay Adolamita namany ilay zanak’osy, mba hahazoana an’ilay antoka tany amin’ilay vehivavy. Tsy hitan’ilay namany mihitsy anefa ilay vehivavy.', 'dia nampanaterin’i joda an’ilay adolamita namany ilay zanak’osy, mba hahazoana an’ilay antoka tany amin’ilay vehivavy. tsy hitan’ilay namany mihitsy anefa ilay vehivavy.'),
  ('6aadc6fcfae3ea40e8a70efb', '2026-09-18T23:19:24.680Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:24.680Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 38, 19, 'Taorian’izay, dia lasa ilay vehivavy. Ary nesoriny ilay saly nanaovany, ka nanaovany indray ny akanjon’ny mpitondratena.', 'taorian’izay, dia lasa ilay vehivavy. ary nesoriny ilay saly nanaovany, ka nanaovany indray ny akanjon’ny mpitondratena.'),
  ('6aadc6fcfae3ea40e8a70efa', '2026-09-18T23:19:24.680Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:24.680Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 38, 18, 'Dia hoy izy: “Inona no antoka tokony homeko anao?” Ary hoy ilay vehivavy: “Iny peratra fanombohan-kasenao iny sy ny tadiny, ary iny tehina eny an-tananao iny.” Dia nomen’i Joda azy izany ka nanao firaisana taminy izy, dia bevohoka ilay vehivavy.', 'dia hoy izy: “inona no antoka tokony homeko anao?” ary hoy ilay vehivavy: “iny peratra fanombohan-kasenao iny sy ny tadiny, ary iny tehina eny an-tananao iny.” dia nomen’i joda azy izany ka nanao firaisana taminy izy, dia bevohoka ilay vehivavy.'),
  ('6aadc6fcfae3ea40e8a70ef9', '2026-09-18T23:19:24.680Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:24.680Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 38, 17, 'Dia hoy izy: “Handefasako zanak’osy avy amin’ny ondry aman’osiko ianao.” Fa hoy ilay vehivavy: “Homenao antoka ve aho mandra-panatitrao an’izany?”', 'dia hoy izy: “handefasako zanak’osy avy amin’ny ondry aman’osiko ianao.” fa hoy ilay vehivavy: “homenao antoka ve aho mandra-panatitrao an’izany?”'),
  ('6aadc6fcfae3ea40e8a70ef8', '2026-09-18T23:19:24.680Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:24.680Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 38, 16, 'Koa nivily nankeo aminy teo amoron-dalana i Joda, ka niteny hoe: “Mba avelao aho hanao firaisana aminao.” Tsy fantany mantsy hoe ny vinantovaviny io. Hoy anefa ilay vehivavy: “Inona àry no homenao ahy raha manaiky hanao firaisana aminao aho?”', 'koa nivily nankeo aminy teo amoron-dalana i joda, ka niteny hoe: “mba avelao aho hanao firaisana aminao.” tsy fantany mantsy hoe ny vinantovaviny io. hoy anefa ilay vehivavy: “inona àry no homenao ahy raha manaiky hanao firaisana aminao aho?”'),
  ('6aadc6fcfae3ea40e8a70ef7', '2026-09-18T23:19:24.680Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:24.680Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 38, 15, 'Vao nahita azy i Joda, dia nihevitra azy hoe mpivaro-tena, satria nosaronany ny tarehiny.', 'vao nahita azy i joda, dia nihevitra azy hoe mpivaro-tena, satria nosaronany ny tarehiny.'),
  ('6aadc6fcfae3ea40e8a70ef6', '2026-09-18T23:19:24.680Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:24.680Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 38, 14, 'Dia nesorin’i Tamara ny akanjo namantarana hoe maty vady izy. Avy eo dia nosaronany ny lohany sady nitafy saly izy. Dia nipetraka teo amin’ny fidirana ho ao Enaima izy, teo amin’ny lalana mankany Timna. Hitany mantsy fa efa lehibe i Sela, nefa mbola tsy nomena ho vadiny ihany.', 'dia nesorin’i tamara ny akanjo namantarana hoe maty vady izy. avy eo dia nosaronany ny lohany sady nitafy saly izy. dia nipetraka teo amin’ny fidirana ho ao enaima izy, teo amin’ny lalana mankany timna. hitany mantsy fa efa lehibe i sela, nefa mbola tsy nomena ho vadiny ihany.'),
  ('6aadc6fcfae3ea40e8a70ef5', '2026-09-18T23:19:24.680Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:24.680Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 38, 13, 'Ary nisy nilaza tamin’i Tamara hoe: “Miakatra ho any Timna ny rafozandahinao, hanety ny ondriny.”', 'ary nisy nilaza tamin’i tamara hoe: “miakatra ho any timna ny rafozandahinao, hanety ny ondriny.”'),
  ('6aadc6fcfae3ea40e8a70ef4', '2026-09-18T23:19:24.680Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:24.680Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 38, 12, 'Rehefa nandeha ny fotoana, dia maty ny vadin’i Joda, izany hoe ilay zanakavavin’i Soa. Nisaona azy elaela i Joda, dia avy eo nankany amin’ny mpanety ny ondriny tany Timna, niaraka tamin’i Hira Adolamita namany.', 'rehefa nandeha ny fotoana, dia maty ny vadin’i joda, izany hoe ilay zanakavavin’i soa. nisaona azy elaela i joda, dia avy eo nankany amin’ny mpanety ny ondriny tany timna, niaraka tamin’i hira adolamita namany.'),
  ('6aadc6fcfae3ea40e8a70ef3', '2026-09-18T23:19:24.680Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:24.680Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 38, 11, 'Ary hoy i Joda tamin’i Tamara vinantovaviny: “Mijanòna any an-tranon’ny rainao, dia aza manambady aloha fa andraso ho lehibe i Sela zanako lahy.” Niteny an’izany izy satria natahotra sao ho faty hoatran’ny rahalahiny koa i Sela. Dia lasa nipetraka tany an-tranon’ny rainy i Tamara.', 'ary hoy i joda tamin’i tamara vinantovaviny: “mijanòna any an-tranon’ny rainao, dia aza manambady aloha fa andraso ho lehibe i sela zanako lahy.” niteny an’izany izy satria natahotra sao ho faty hoatran’ny rahalahiny koa i sela. dia lasa nipetraka tany an-tranon’ny rainy i tamara.'),
  ('6aadc6fcfae3ea40e8a70ef2', '2026-09-18T23:19:24.680Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:24.680Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 38, 10, 'Ratsy teo imason’i Jehovah anefa ny zavatra nataony, ka novonoiny ho faty koa izy.', 'ratsy teo imason’i jehovah anefa ny zavatra nataony, ka novonoiny ho faty koa izy.'),
  ('6aadc6fcfae3ea40e8a70ef1', '2026-09-18T23:19:24.680Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:24.680Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 38, 9, 'Fantatr’i Onana anefa fa tsy hatao ho anisan’ny zanany ilay zaza, ka nariany tamin’ny tany ny tsirinainy rehefa nanao firaisana tamin’ilay vadin’ny rahalahiny izy, amin’izay tsy hahazo taranaka ilay rahalahiny.', 'fantatr’i onana anefa fa tsy hatao ho anisan’ny zanany ilay zaza, ka nariany tamin’ny tany ny tsirinainy rehefa nanao firaisana tamin’ilay vadin’ny rahalahiny izy, amin’izay tsy hahazo taranaka ilay rahalahiny.'),
  ('6aadc6fcfae3ea40e8a70ef0', '2026-09-18T23:19:24.680Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:24.680Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 38, 8, 'Hoy àry i Joda tamin’i Onana: “Alaivo ho vady ny vadin’ilay rahalahinao efa maty dia manaova firaisana aminy, mba hanomezana taranaka ho an’ilay rahalahinao.”', 'hoy àry i joda tamin’i onana: “alaivo ho vady ny vadin’ilay rahalahinao efa maty dia manaova firaisana aminy, mba hanomezana taranaka ho an’ilay rahalahinao.”'),
  ('6aadc6fcfae3ea40e8a70eef', '2026-09-18T23:19:24.680Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:24.680Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 38, 7, 'Nanao zavatra tsy nahafaly an’i Jehovah anefa i Era lahimatoan’i Joda, ka novonoin’i Jehovah ho faty.', 'nanao zavatra tsy nahafaly an’i jehovah anefa i era lahimatoan’i joda, ka novonoin’i jehovah ho faty.'),
  ('6aadc6fcfae3ea40e8a70eee', '2026-09-18T23:19:24.680Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:24.680Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 38, 6, 'Tatỳ aoriana, dia naka vady ho an’i Era lahimatoany i Joda. Tamara no anarany.', 'tatỳ aoriana, dia naka vady ho an’i era lahimatoany i joda. tamara no anarany.'),
  ('6aadc6fcfae3ea40e8a70eed', '2026-09-18T23:19:24.680Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:24.680Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 38, 5, 'Ary mbola tera-dahy ihany izy, ka nataony hoe Sela ny anarany. Tany Akziba izy tamin’ny fotoana niterahan’ilay vehivavy an’i Sela.', 'ary mbola tera-dahy ihany izy, ka nataony hoe sela ny anarany. tany akziba izy tamin’ny fotoana niterahan’ilay vehivavy an’i sela.'),
  ('6aadc6fcfae3ea40e8a70eec', '2026-09-18T23:19:24.680Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:24.680Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 38, 4, 'Dia bevohoka indray izy ka tera-dahy, dia nataony hoe Onana ny anarany.', 'dia bevohoka indray izy ka tera-dahy, dia nataony hoe onana ny anarany.'),
  ('6aadc6fcfae3ea40e8a70eeb', '2026-09-18T23:19:24.680Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:24.680Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 38, 3, 'Dia bevohoka ilay vehivavy ka tera-dahy. Ary nataony hoe Era ny anarany.', 'dia bevohoka ilay vehivavy ka tera-dahy. ary nataony hoe era ny anarany.'),
  ('6aadc6fcfae3ea40e8a70eea', '2026-09-18T23:19:24.680Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:24.680Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 38, 2, 'Tany no nahitan’i Joda ny zanakavavin’i Soa, lehilahy kananita. Dia nanambady an’ilay vehivavy i Joda ka nanao firaisana taminy.', 'tany no nahitan’i joda ny zanakavavin’i soa, lehilahy kananita. dia nanambady an’ilay vehivavy i joda ka nanao firaisana taminy.'),
  ('6aadc6fcfae3ea40e8a70ee9', '2026-09-18T23:19:24.680Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:24.680Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 38, 1, 'Ary nandao an’ireo rahalahiny i Joda tamin’izany fotoana izany, ka nanangana ny tranolainy teo akaikin’ny toerana nipetrahan’ilay lehilahy adolamita atao hoe Hira.', 'ary nandao an’ireo rahalahiny i joda tamin’izany fotoana izany, ka nanangana ny tranolainy teo akaikin’ny toerana nipetrahan’ilay lehilahy adolamita atao hoe hira.'),
  ('6aadc6fdb626238d820eca35', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.040Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.040Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 39, 23, 'Tsy nisy nampanahy an’ilay lehiben’ny fonja mihitsy ny zavatra niandraiketan’i Josefa. Notahin’i Jehovah mantsy i Josefa, sady nataon’i Jehovah nahomby daholo izay nataony.', 'tsy nisy nampanahy an’ilay lehiben’ny fonja mihitsy ny zavatra niandraiketan’i josefa. notahin’i jehovah mantsy i josefa, sady nataon’i jehovah nahomby daholo izay nataony.'),
  ('6aadc6fdb626238d820eca34', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.040Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.040Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 39, 22, 'Ary nasain’ny lehiben’ny fonja niandraikitra ny gadra rehetra tao am-ponja i Josefa. Zavatra nampanaovin’i Josefa daholo izay nataon’ireo gadra ireo tao.', 'ary nasain’ny lehiben’ny fonja niandraikitra ny gadra rehetra tao am-ponja i josefa. zavatra nampanaovin’i josefa daholo izay nataon’ireo gadra ireo tao.'),
  ('6aadc6fdb626238d820eca33', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.040Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.040Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 39, 21, 'Nitahy an’i Josefa foana anefa i Jehovah, sady tia azy foana sy tsy mba nivadika taminy mihitsy. Dia notahiny i Josefa ka lasa nankasitrahan’ny lehiben’ny fonja.', 'nitahy an’i josefa foana anefa i jehovah, sady tia azy foana sy tsy mba nivadika taminy mihitsy. dia notahiny i josefa ka lasa nankasitrahan’ny lehiben’ny fonja.'),
  ('6aadc6fdb626238d820eca32', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.040Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.040Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 39, 20, 'Nalain’ny tompony àry i Josefa ka nampidiriny tany am-ponja, tany amin’ilay toerana nasiana an’izay nogadrain’ny mpanjaka. Dia tao am-ponja tao foana izy.', 'nalain’ny tompony àry i josefa ka nampidiriny tany am-ponja, tany amin’ilay toerana nasiana an’izay nogadrain’ny mpanjaka. dia tao am-ponja tao foana izy.'),
  ('6aadc6fdb626238d820eca31', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.040Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.040Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 39, 19, 'Dia tezitra be ny tompon’i Josefa, raha vao naheno ny tenin’ny vadiny taminy hoe: “Izao sy izao no nataon’ilay mpanomponao tamiko.”', 'dia tezitra be ny tompon’i josefa, raha vao naheno ny tenin’ny vadiny taminy hoe: “izao sy izao no nataon’ilay mpanomponao tamiko.”'),
  ('6aadc6fdb626238d820eca30', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.040Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.040Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 39, 18, 'Vao nikiakiaka mafy be anefa aho, dia navelany teto amiko ny akanjony ka nandositra tany ivelany izy.”', 'vao nikiakiaka mafy be anefa aho, dia navelany teto amiko ny akanjony ka nandositra tany ivelany izy.”'),
  ('6aadc6fdb626238d820eca2f', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.040Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.040Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 39, 17, 'Avy eo dia naveriny tamin’i Potifara ilay zavatra efa noteneniny teo, ka hoy izy: “Nanketo amiko ilay mpanompo hebreo nentinao tato amintsika iny mba hihomehy haneso ahy.', 'avy eo dia naveriny tamin’i potifara ilay zavatra efa noteneniny teo, ka hoy izy: “nanketo amiko ilay mpanompo hebreo nentinao tato amintsika iny mba hihomehy haneso ahy.'),
  ('6aadc6fdb626238d820eca2e', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.040Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.040Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 39, 16, 'Dia napetrany teo akaikiny ilay akanjo, mandra-pahatongan’ny tompon’i Josefa tao an-trano.', 'dia napetrany teo akaikiny ilay akanjo, mandra-pahatongan’ny tompon’i josefa tao an-trano.'),
  ('6aadc6fdb626238d820eca2d', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.040Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.040Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 39, 15, 'Rehefa henony hoe nikiakiaka mafy aho, dia tonga dia navelany teto amiko ny akanjony, ka nandositra tany ivelany izy.”', 'rehefa henony hoe nikiakiaka mafy aho, dia tonga dia navelany teto amiko ny akanjony, ka nandositra tany ivelany izy.”'),
  ('6aadc6fdb626238d820eca2c', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.040Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.040Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 39, 14, 'dia niantsoantso mafy izy ka niteny tamin’ny mpanompony hoe: “Nentin’ny vadiko tatỳ amintsika iny lehilahy hebreo iny mba hihomehy haneso antsika. Dia nanketo amiko izy hanao firaisana amiko, nefa niantsoantso faran’izay mafy aho.', 'dia niantsoantso mafy izy ka niteny tamin’ny mpanompony hoe: “nentin’ny vadiko tatỳ amintsika iny lehilahy hebreo iny mba hihomehy haneso antsika. dia nanketo amiko izy hanao firaisana amiko, nefa niantsoantso faran’izay mafy aho.'),
  ('6aadc6fdb626238d820eca2b', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.040Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.040Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 39, 13, 'Raha vao hitan’ilay vehivavy fa navelan’i Josefa teny an-tanany ny akanjony ka nandositra tany ivelany izy,', 'raha vao hitan’ilay vehivavy fa navelan’i josefa teny an-tanany ny akanjony ka nandositra tany ivelany izy,'),
  ('6aadc6fdb626238d820eca2a', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.040Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.040Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 39, 12, 'Dia nisambotra azy tamin’ny akanjony ilay vehivavy sady niteny hoe: “Avia hanao firaisana amiko!” Navelany teny an-tanan’ilay vehivavy anefa ny akanjony, dia lasa izy nandositra tany ivelany.', 'dia nisambotra azy tamin’ny akanjony ilay vehivavy sady niteny hoe: “avia hanao firaisana amiko!” navelany teny an-tanan’ilay vehivavy anefa ny akanjony, dia lasa izy nandositra tany ivelany.'),
  ('6aadc6fdb626238d820eca29', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.040Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.040Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 39, 11, 'Indray andro anefa, rehefa niditra tao an-trano hanao ny raharahany i Josefa, dia tsy nisy mpanompo mihitsy tao.', 'indray andro anefa, rehefa niditra tao an-trano hanao ny raharahany i josefa, dia tsy nisy mpanompo mihitsy tao.'),
  ('6aadc6fdb626238d820eca28', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.040Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.040Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 39, 10, 'Isan’andro isan’andro mihitsy ilay vehivavy no niteny tamin’i Josefa, nefa tsy nanaiky hanao firaisana taminy mihitsy izy, na hiaraka irery taminy.', 'isan’andro isan’andro mihitsy ilay vehivavy no niteny tamin’i josefa, nefa tsy nanaiky hanao firaisana taminy mihitsy izy, na hiaraka irery taminy.'),
  ('6aadc6fdb626238d820eca27', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.040Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.040Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 39, 9, 'Tsy misy manana fahefana noho izaho ato amin’ity trano ity, ary tsy nisy na inona na inona nandrarany ahy afa-tsy ianao, satria vadiny ianao. Koa hataoko ahoana ny hanao an’izany ratsy lehibe izany ka hanota amin’Andriamanitra?”', 'tsy misy manana fahefana noho izaho ato amin’ity trano ity, ary tsy nisy na inona na inona nandrarany ahy afa-tsy ianao, satria vadiny ianao. koa hataoko ahoana ny hanao an’izany ratsy lehibe izany ka hanota amin’andriamanitra?”'),
  ('6aadc6fdb626238d820eca26', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.040Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.040Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 39, 8, 'Tsy nety anefa izy fa niteny tamin’ny vadin’ny tompony hoe: “Tsy mieritreritra intsony an’izay ato an-trano ny tompoko, fa efa nampiandraiketiny ahy daholo izay rehetra ananany.', 'tsy nety anefa izy fa niteny tamin’ny vadin’ny tompony hoe: “tsy mieritreritra intsony an’izay ato an-trano ny tompoko, fa efa nampiandraiketiny ahy daholo izay rehetra ananany.'),
  ('6aadc6fdb626238d820eca25', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.040Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.040Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 39, 7, 'Tatỳ aoriana, dia nanomboka nijerijery an’i Josefa ny vadin’ny tompony, ka niteny hoe: “Avia hanao firaisana amiko.”', 'tatỳ aoriana, dia nanomboka nijerijery an’i josefa ny vadin’ny tompony, ka niteny hoe: “avia hanao firaisana amiko.”'),
  ('6aadc6fdb626238d820eca24', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.040Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.040Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 39, 6, 'Dia nampiandraiketiny an’i Josefa daholo izay rehetra nananany. Tsy nieritreritra na inona na inona intsony mihitsy i Potifara, afa-tsy izay sakafo hohaniny ihany. Ary lasa tsara bika sy tsara tarehy i Josefa.', 'dia nampiandraiketiny an’i josefa daholo izay rehetra nananany. tsy nieritreritra na inona na inona intsony mihitsy i potifara, afa-tsy izay sakafo hohaniny ihany. ary lasa tsara bika sy tsara tarehy i josefa.'),
  ('6aadc6fdb626238d820eca23', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.040Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.040Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 39, 5, 'Taorian’ny nanendren’ilay Ejipsianina an’i Josefa hiandraikitra ny tao an-tranony sy ny fananany rehetra, dia notahin’i Jehovah foana ny tao an-tranony noho i Josefa. Notahin’i Jehovah tokoa izay rehetra nananany tao an-trano sy tany an-tsaha.', 'taorian’ny nanendren’ilay ejipsianina an’i josefa hiandraikitra ny tao an-tranony sy ny fananany rehetra, dia notahin’i jehovah foana ny tao an-tranony noho i josefa. notahin’i jehovah tokoa izay rehetra nananany tao an-trano sy tany an-tsaha.'),
  ('6aadc6fdb626238d820eca22', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.040Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.040Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 39, 4, 'Ary nankasitrahan’ny tompony i Josefa ka lasa mpanompo natokisany. Koa notendreny hiandraikitra ny tao an-tranony sy ny fananany rehetra izy.', 'ary nankasitrahan’ny tompony i josefa ka lasa mpanompo natokisany. koa notendreny hiandraikitra ny tao an-tranony sy ny fananany rehetra izy.'),
  ('6aadc6fdb626238d820eca21', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.040Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.040Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 39, 3, 'Dia hitan’ilay tompony fa notahin’i Jehovah i Josefa, sady nataon’i Jehovah nahomby daholo izay nataony.', 'dia hitan’ilay tompony fa notahin’i jehovah i josefa, sady nataon’i jehovah nahomby daholo izay nataony.'),
  ('6aadc6fdb626238d820eca20', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.040Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.040Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 39, 2, 'Notahin’i Jehovah foana anefa i Josefa ka nahomby daholo izay nataony. Nahazo andraikitra tao an-tranon’ilay Ejipsianina tompony koa izy.', 'notahin’i jehovah foana anefa i josefa ka nahomby daholo izay nataony. nahazo andraikitra tao an-tranon’ilay ejipsianina tompony koa izy.'),
  ('6aadc6fdb626238d820eca1f', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.040Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.040Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 39, 1, 'Ary nentin’ny Ismaelita nidina tany Ejipta i Josefa. Dia novidin’ilay Ejipsianina atao hoe Potifara tamin’izy ireo izy. Tandapan’i Farao sady lehiben’ny mpiambina i Potifara.', 'ary nentin’ny ismaelita nidina tany ejipta i josefa. dia novidin’ilay ejipsianina atao hoe potifara tamin’izy ireo izy. tandapan’i farao sady lehiben’ny mpiambina i potifara.'),
  ('6aadc6fd1e12d518d20125de', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.471Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.471Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 40, 23, 'Tsy nahatsiaro an’i Josefa anefa ilay lehiben’ny mpandroso zava-pisotro, fa nanadino azy.', 'tsy nahatsiaro an’i josefa anefa ilay lehiben’ny mpandroso zava-pisotro, fa nanadino azy.'),
  ('6aadc6fd1e12d518d20125dd', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.471Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.471Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 40, 22, 'Fa nahantony kosa ilay lehiben’ny mpanao mofo, araka ny dikan’ny nofy nohazavain’i Josefa tamin’izy ireo.', 'fa nahantony kosa ilay lehiben’ny mpanao mofo, araka ny dikan’ny nofy nohazavain’i josefa tamin’izy ireo.'),
  ('6aadc6fd1e12d518d20125dc', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.471Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.471Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 40, 21, 'Naveriny tamin’ny toerany ilay lehiben’ny mpandroso zava-pisotro, ka nanolotra zava-pisotro ho an’i Farao indray.', 'naveriny tamin’ny toerany ilay lehiben’ny mpandroso zava-pisotro, ka nanolotra zava-pisotro ho an’i farao indray.'),
  ('6aadc6fd1e12d518d20125db', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.471Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.471Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 40, 20, 'Tamin’ny andro fahatelo, dia nitsingerina ny andro nahaterahan’i Farao. Dia nanao fety ho an’ny mpanompony rehetra izy, ka navoakany ny lehiben’ny mpandroso zava-pisotro sy ny lehiben’ny mpanao mofo mba ho hitan’ny mpanompony.', 'tamin’ny andro fahatelo, dia nitsingerina ny andro nahaterahan’i farao. dia nanao fety ho an’ny mpanompony rehetra izy, ka navoakany ny lehiben’ny mpandroso zava-pisotro sy ny lehiben’ny mpanao mofo mba ho hitan’ny mpanompony.'),
  ('6aadc6fd1e12d518d20125da', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.471Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.471Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 40, 19, 'Rehefa afaka telo andro, dia hotapahin’i Farao ny lohanao, ary hahantony eo amin’ny tsato-kazo ianao, ka hohanin’ny vorona ny nofonao.”', 'rehefa afaka telo andro, dia hotapahin’i farao ny lohanao, ary hahantony eo amin’ny tsato-kazo ianao, ka hohanin’ny vorona ny nofonao.”'),
  ('6aadc6fd1e12d518d20125d9', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.471Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.471Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 40, 18, 'Dia hoy i Josefa: “Izao no dikan’izany: Ny harona telo dia telo andro.', 'dia hoy i josefa: “izao no dikan’izany: ny harona telo dia telo andro.'),
  ('6aadc6fd1e12d518d20125d8', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.471Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.471Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 40, 17, 'Ary nisy mofo isan-karazany ho an’i Farao tao anatin’ilay harona farany ambony. Nohanin’ny vorona anefa ny mofo tao anatin’ilay harona nololohaviko.”', 'ary nisy mofo isan-karazany ho an’i farao tao anatin’ilay harona farany ambony. nohanin’ny vorona anefa ny mofo tao anatin’ilay harona nololohaviko.”'),
  ('6aadc6fd1e12d518d20125d7', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.471Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.471Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 40, 16, 'Rehefa hitan’ilay lehiben’ny mpanao mofo hoe tsara ilay dikan’ny nofy nohazavain’i Josefa, dia hoy izy taminy: “Izaho indray nanonofy hoe niloloha harona telo, dia feno mofo fotsy tao anatiny.', 'rehefa hitan’ilay lehiben’ny mpanao mofo hoe tsara ilay dikan’ny nofy nohazavain’i josefa, dia hoy izy taminy: “izaho indray nanonofy hoe niloloha harona telo, dia feno mofo fotsy tao anatiny.'),
  ('6aadc6fd1e12d518d20125d6', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.471Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.471Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 40, 15, 'Nalaina an-keriny avy any amin’ny tanin’ny Hebreo mantsy aho. Sady izaho koa tatỳ tsy nanao na inona na inona tokony ho nampidirana ahy tato amin’ity fonja ity.”', 'nalaina an-keriny avy any amin’ny tanin’ny hebreo mantsy aho. sady izaho koa tatỳ tsy nanao na inona na inona tokony ho nampidirana ahy tato amin’ity fonja ity.”'),
  ('6aadc6fd1e12d518d20125d5', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.471Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.471Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 40, 14, 'Mba tsarovy anefa aho rehefa mandeha tsara ny fiainanao. Dia mba iantrao aho, ka resaho any amin’i Farao any ny momba ahy mba ho tafavoaka ato aho.', 'mba tsarovy anefa aho rehefa mandeha tsara ny fiainanao. dia mba iantrao aho, ka resaho any amin’i farao any ny momba ahy mba ho tafavoaka ato aho.'),
  ('6aadc6fd1e12d518d20125d4', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.471Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.471Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 40, 13, 'Rehefa afaka telo andro, dia havoakan’i Farao ianao, ka haveriny amin’ny toeranao. Ary hanolotra ny kaopin’i Farao ianao, hoatran’ny efa nataonao taloha tamin’ianao nandroso zava-pisotro ho azy.', 'rehefa afaka telo andro, dia havoakan’i farao ianao, ka haveriny amin’ny toeranao. ary hanolotra ny kaopin’i farao ianao, hoatran’ny efa nataonao taloha tamin’ianao nandroso zava-pisotro ho azy.'),
  ('6aadc6fd1e12d518d20125d3', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.471Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.471Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 40, 12, 'Ary hoy i Josefa taminy: “Izao no dikan’izany: Ny sampany telo dia telo andro.', 'ary hoy i josefa taminy: “izao no dikan’izany: ny sampany telo dia telo andro.'),
  ('6aadc6fd1e12d518d20125d2', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.471Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.471Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 40, 11, 'Teny an-tanako, hono, ny kaopin’i Farao, dia nalaiko ireo voaloboka ireo ka nofiazako hankao anatin’ilay kaopy. Dia natolotro an’i Farao ilay kaopy.”', 'teny an-tanako, hono, ny kaopin’i farao, dia nalaiko ireo voaloboka ireo ka nofiazako hankao anatin’ilay kaopy. dia natolotro an’i farao ilay kaopy.”'),
  ('6aadc6fd1e12d518d20125d1', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.471Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.471Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 40, 10, 'Ary nisy sampany telo tamin’ilay voaloboka. Nitsimoka ilay izy dia namelana, ary nisy voaloboka masaka.', 'ary nisy sampany telo tamin’ilay voaloboka. nitsimoka ilay izy dia namelana, ary nisy voaloboka masaka.'),
  ('6aadc6fd1e12d518d20125d0', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.471Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.471Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 40, 9, 'Dia nitantara ny nofiny tamin’i Josefa ilay lehiben’ny mpandroso zava-pisotro, hoe: “Nanonofy aho hoe nisy voaloboka naniry, hono, teo alohako teo.', 'dia nitantara ny nofiny tamin’i josefa ilay lehiben’ny mpandroso zava-pisotro, hoe: “nanonofy aho hoe nisy voaloboka naniry, hono, teo alohako teo.'),
  ('6aadc6fd1e12d518d20125cf', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.471Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.471Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 40, 8, 'Dia hoy izy ireo: “Samy nanonofy izahay, nefa tsy misy mahay manazava aminay ny dikan’ilay izy.” Ary hoy i Josefa: “Andriamanitra ihany no mahay manazava ny dikan’ny nofy. Mba tantarao amiko hoe ilay izy!”', 'dia hoy izy ireo: “samy nanonofy izahay, nefa tsy misy mahay manazava aminay ny dikan’ilay izy.” ary hoy i josefa: “andriamanitra ihany no mahay manazava ny dikan’ny nofy. mba tantarao amiko hoe ilay izy!”'),
  ('6aadc6fd1e12d518d20125ce', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.471Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.471Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 40, 7, 'Koa nanontanian’i Josefa ireo tandapan’i Farao ireo, izay niara-nigadra taminy tao an-tranon’ny tompony, hoe: “Fa maninona ianareo no maloka endrika androany?”', 'koa nanontanian’i josefa ireo tandapan’i farao ireo, izay niara-nigadra taminy tao an-tranon’ny tompony, hoe: “fa maninona ianareo no maloka endrika androany?”'),
  ('6aadc6fd1e12d518d20125cd', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.471Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.471Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 40, 6, 'Rehefa nankeo amin’izy ireo i Josefa ny ampitso maraina, dia hitany fa kivikivy izy ireo.', 'rehefa nankeo amin’izy ireo i josefa ny ampitso maraina, dia hitany fa kivikivy izy ireo.'),
  ('6aadc6fd1e12d518d20125cc', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.471Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.471Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 40, 5, 'Indray alina, dia samy nanonofy ilay mpandroso zava-pisotro sy ilay mpanao mofon’ny mpanjakan’i Ejipta, izay nigadra tao am-ponja. Samy nisy dikany ny nofiny.', 'indray alina, dia samy nanonofy ilay mpandroso zava-pisotro sy ilay mpanao mofon’ny mpanjakan’i ejipta, izay nigadra tao am-ponja. samy nisy dikany ny nofiny.'),
  ('6aadc6fd1e12d518d20125cb', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.471Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.471Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 40, 4, 'Ary notendren’ilay lehiben’ny mpiambina hiaraka tamin’izy roa lahy i Josefa, dia hikarakara an’izay ilain’izy ireo. Ary tao am-ponja elaela izy ireo.', 'ary notendren’ilay lehiben’ny mpiambina hiaraka tamin’izy roa lahy i josefa, dia hikarakara an’izay ilain’izy ireo. ary tao am-ponja elaela izy ireo.'),
  ('6aadc6fd1e12d518d20125ca', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.471Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.471Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 40, 3, 'Koa nampidiriny tao amin’ilay fonja tao an-tranon’ny lehiben’ny mpiambina izy ireo, tao amin’ilay nigadran’i Josefa.', 'koa nampidiriny tao amin’ilay fonja tao an-tranon’ny lehiben’ny mpiambina izy ireo, tao amin’ilay nigadran’i josefa.'),
  ('6aadc6fd1e12d518d20125c9', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.471Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.471Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 40, 2, 'Dia tezitra tamin’ireo tandapany roa ireo i Farao, izany hoe tamin’ilay lehiben’ny mpandroso zava-pisotro sy ilay lehiben’ny mpanao mofo.', 'dia tezitra tamin’ireo tandapany roa ireo i farao, izany hoe tamin’ilay lehiben’ny mpandroso zava-pisotro sy ilay lehiben’ny mpanao mofo.'),
  ('6aadc6fd1e12d518d20125c8', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.471Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.471Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 40, 1, 'Taorian’izany, dia nanao diso tamin’ny mpanjakan’i Ejipta tompony ny lehiben’ny mpandroso zava-pisotrony sy ny lehiben’ny mpanao mofo.', 'taorian’izany, dia nanao diso tamin’ny mpanjakan’i ejipta tompony ny lehiben’ny mpandroso zava-pisotrony sy ny lehiben’ny mpanao mofo.'),
  ('6aadc6fd82e8a67ddecf3712', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.883Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.883Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 41, 20, 'Dia nohanin’ireo ombivavy kaozatra sady ratsy tarehy ireo ny ombivavy fito matavy.', 'dia nohanin’ireo ombivavy kaozatra sady ratsy tarehy ireo ny ombivavy fito matavy.'),
  ('6aadc6fd82e8a67ddecf3711', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.883Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.883Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 41, 19, 'Ireny koa nisy ombivavy fito hafa, malemilemy sady ratsy tarehy ary mahia, niakatra taorianan’izy ireo. Mbola tsy nahita ombivavy ratsy tarehy hoatr’azy ireo mihitsy aho eran’i Ejipta.', 'ireny koa nisy ombivavy fito hafa, malemilemy sady ratsy tarehy ary mahia, niakatra taorianan’izy ireo. mbola tsy nahita ombivavy ratsy tarehy hoatr’azy ireo mihitsy aho eran’i ejipta.'),
  ('6aadc6fd82e8a67ddecf3710', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.883Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.883Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 41, 18, 'Ary ireny fa nisy ombivavy fito tsara tarehy sady matavy, niakatra avy tao Neily, dia niraoka ahitra teo amorony.', 'ary ireny fa nisy ombivavy fito tsara tarehy sady matavy, niakatra avy tao neily, dia niraoka ahitra teo amorony.'),
  ('6aadc6fd82e8a67ddecf370f', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.883Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.883Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 41, 17, 'Hoy ihany i Farao taminy: “Nanonofy aho hoe nijoro teo amoron’ny Reniranon’i Neily, hono, aho.', 'hoy ihany i farao taminy: “nanonofy aho hoe nijoro teo amoron’ny reniranon’i neily, hono, aho.'),
  ('6aadc6fd82e8a67ddecf370e', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.883Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.883Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 41, 16, 'Dia hoy i Josefa tamin’i Farao: “Fa inona moa izay izaho? Andriamanitra ihany no hilaza amin’i Farao an’izay mahasoa azy.”', 'dia hoy i josefa tamin’i farao: “fa inona moa izay izaho? andriamanitra ihany no hilaza amin’i farao an’izay mahasoa azy.”'),
  ('6aadc6fd82e8a67ddecf370d', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.883Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.883Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 41, 15, 'Ary hoy i Farao tamin’i Josefa: “Nanonofy aho, saingy tsy misy mahay manazava ny dikany. Henoko anefa hoe rehefa misy nofy lazaina aminao, dia hainao ny manazava ny dikany.”', 'ary hoy i farao tamin’i josefa: “nanonofy aho, saingy tsy misy mahay manazava ny dikany. henoko anefa hoe rehefa misy nofy lazaina aminao, dia hainao ny manazava ny dikany.”'),
  ('6aadc6fd82e8a67ddecf370c', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.883Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.883Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 41, 14, 'Dia nampanantsoin’i Farao i Josefa, ka navoaka haingana avy tao amin’ilay fonja. Niharatra sy nisolo akanjo izy, dia nankao amin’i Farao.', 'dia nampanantsoin’i farao i josefa, ka navoaka haingana avy tao amin’ilay fonja. niharatra sy nisolo akanjo izy, dia nankao amin’i farao.'),
  ('6aadc6fd82e8a67ddecf370b', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.883Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.883Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 41, 13, 'Dia nitranga tokoa ny zavatra nolazainy taminay, ka naverina tamin’ny toerako aho, fa nahantona kosa ilay iray.”', 'dia nitranga tokoa ny zavatra nolazainy taminay, ka naverina tamin’ny toerako aho, fa nahantona kosa ilay iray.”'),
  ('6aadc6fd82e8a67ddecf370a', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.883Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.883Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 41, 12, 'Ary niaraka taminay tao ny tovolahy hebreo iray, mpanompon’ny lehiben’ny mpiambina. Rehefa notantarainay taminy ny nofinay, dia nohazavainy taminay avy ny dikany.', 'ary niaraka taminay tao ny tovolahy hebreo iray, mpanompon’ny lehiben’ny mpiambina. rehefa notantarainay taminy ny nofinay, dia nohazavainy taminay avy ny dikany.'),
  ('6aadc6fd82e8a67ddecf3709', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.883Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.883Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 41, 11, 'Samy nanonofy izahay roa lahy indray alina, ary samy nisy dikany ny nofinay.', 'samy nanonofy izahay roa lahy indray alina, ary samy nisy dikany ny nofinay.'),
  ('6aadc6fd82e8a67ddecf3708', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.883Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.883Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 41, 10, 'Indray andro dia tezitra tamin’ny mpanompony i Farao, izany hoe tamiko sy tamin’ny lehiben’ny mpanao mofo. Dia nampidiriny tao amin’ilay fonja ao an-tranon’ny lehiben’ny mpiambina an’i Farao izahay.', 'indray andro dia tezitra tamin’ny mpanompony i farao, izany hoe tamiko sy tamin’ny lehiben’ny mpanao mofo. dia nampidiriny tao amin’ilay fonja ao an-tranon’ny lehiben’ny mpiambina an’i farao izahay.'),
  ('6aadc6fd82e8a67ddecf3707', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.883Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.883Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 41, 9, 'Dia niteny tamin’i Farao ny lehiben’ny mpandroso zava-pisotro hoe: “Miaiky aho hoe nanao diso.', 'dia niteny tamin’i farao ny lehiben’ny mpandroso zava-pisotro hoe: “miaiky aho hoe nanao diso.'),
  ('6aadc6fd82e8a67ddecf3706', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.883Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.883Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 41, 8, 'Nitebiteby anefa i Farao ny ampitso maraina, ka nampanantsoiny daholo ny mpisorona mpanao sikidy sy ny olon-kendry rehetra tao Ejipta. Dia notantarainy tamin’izy ireny ny nofiny, nefa tsy nisy nahavita nanazava ny dikan’ilay nofy ireny na iray aza.', 'nitebiteby anefa i farao ny ampitso maraina, ka nampanantsoiny daholo ny mpisorona mpanao sikidy sy ny olon-kendry rehetra tao ejipta. dia notantarainy tamin’izy ireny ny nofiny, nefa tsy nisy nahavita nanazava ny dikan’ilay nofy ireny na iray aza.'),
  ('6aadc6fd82e8a67ddecf3705', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.883Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.883Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 41, 7, 'Dia natelin’ireo salohim-bary mahia ireo ny salohy fito vaventy sady tsara. Dia taitra tamin’ny torimasony i Farao, ka fantany fa hay nofy ilay izy.', 'dia natelin’ireo salohim-bary mahia ireo ny salohy fito vaventy sady tsara. dia taitra tamin’ny torimasony i farao, ka fantany fa hay nofy ilay izy.'),
  ('6aadc6fd82e8a67ddecf3704', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.883Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.883Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 41, 6, 'Nisy salohim-barimbazaha fito hafa koa nipoitra, mahia sady mainan’ny rivotra avy any atsinanana.', 'nisy salohim-barimbazaha fito hafa koa nipoitra, mahia sady mainan’ny rivotra avy any atsinanana.'),
  ('6aadc6fd82e8a67ddecf3703', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.883Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.883Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 41, 5, 'Ary niverina natory indray izy ka nanonofy fanindroany. Dia ireo, hono, nisy salohim-barimbazaha fito vaventy sady tsara, nipoitra tamin’ny tahony iray.', 'ary niverina natory indray izy ka nanonofy fanindroany. dia ireo, hono, nisy salohim-barimbazaha fito vaventy sady tsara, nipoitra tamin’ny tahony iray.'),
  ('6aadc6fd82e8a67ddecf3702', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.883Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.883Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 41, 4, 'Avy eo dia nohanin’ireo ombivavy ratsy tarehy sady mahia ireo ny ombivavy fito tsara tarehy sady matavy. Dia taitra tamin’ny torimasony i Farao.', 'avy eo dia nohanin’ireo ombivavy ratsy tarehy sady mahia ireo ny ombivavy fito tsara tarehy sady matavy. dia taitra tamin’ny torimasony i farao.'),
  ('6aadc6fd82e8a67ddecf3701', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.883Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.883Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 41, 3, 'Ireny koa nisy ombivavy fito ratsy tarehy sady mahia, niakatra avy tao Neily taorianan’izy ireo, ka nijoro teo akaikiny teo amoron’ilay renirano.', 'ireny koa nisy ombivavy fito ratsy tarehy sady mahia, niakatra avy tao neily taorianan’izy ireo, ka nijoro teo akaikiny teo amoron’ilay renirano.'),
  ('6aadc6fd82e8a67ddecf3700', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.883Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.883Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 41, 2, 'Dia ireny, hono, nisy ombivavy fito tsara tarehy sady matavy, niakatra avy tao amin’ilay renirano ka niraoka ahitra teo amorony.', 'dia ireny, hono, nisy ombivavy fito tsara tarehy sady matavy, niakatra avy tao amin’ilay renirano ka niraoka ahitra teo amorony.'),
  ('6aadc6fd82e8a67ddecf36ff', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.883Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.883Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 41, 1, 'Rehefa afaka roa taona katroka, dia nanonofy i Farao hoe nijoro teo amoron’ny Reniranon’i Neily izy.', 'rehefa afaka roa taona katroka, dia nanonofy i farao hoe nijoro teo amoron’ny reniranon’i neily izy.'),
  ('6aadc6fd82e8a67ddecf3737', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.884Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.884Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 41, 57, 'Tonga tany Ejipta koa ny olona avy any amin’ny tany rehetra mba hividy sakafo tamin’i Josefa, satria mafy ny mosary tany amin’ny tany rehetra.', 'tonga tany ejipta koa ny olona avy any amin’ny tany rehetra mba hividy sakafo tamin’i josefa, satria mafy ny mosary tany amin’ny tany rehetra.'),
  ('6aadc6fd82e8a67ddecf3736', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.884Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.884Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 41, 56, 'Ary mbola nisy mosary ihany tany amin’ny tany rehetra. Dia nosokafan’i Josefa ny trano fitehirizam-bokatra rehetra teo amin’izy ireo, ka namidiny tamin’ny Ejipsianina ny vokatra notehirizina. Efa mafy mantsy ny mosary tao Ejipta.', 'ary mbola nisy mosary ihany tany amin’ny tany rehetra. dia nosokafan’i josefa ny trano fitehirizam-bokatra rehetra teo amin’izy ireo, ka namidiny tamin’ny ejipsianina ny vokatra notehirizina. efa mafy mantsy ny mosary tao ejipta.'),
  ('6aadc6fd82e8a67ddecf3735', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.884Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.884Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 41, 55, 'Tamin’ny farany, dia tratran’ny mosary koa i Ejipta manontolo, ka nitaraina tamin’i Farao ny olona mba hahazo sakafo. Dia hoy i Farao tamin’ny Ejipsianina rehetra: “Mankanesa any amin’i Josefa, dia ataovy izay ampanaoviny anareo.”', 'tamin’ny farany, dia tratran’ny mosary koa i ejipta manontolo, ka nitaraina tamin’i farao ny olona mba hahazo sakafo. dia hoy i farao tamin’ny ejipsianina rehetra: “mankanesa any amin’i josefa, dia ataovy izay ampanaoviny anareo.”'),
  ('6aadc6fd82e8a67ddecf3734', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.884Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.884Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 41, 54, 'Dia nanomboka ireo fito taona nisian’ny mosary, araka ny efa nolazain’i Josefa. Nisy mosary tany amin’ny tany rehetra, fa mbola nisy sakafo kosa eran’i Ejipta.', 'dia nanomboka ireo fito taona nisian’ny mosary, araka ny efa nolazain’i josefa. nisy mosary tany amin’ny tany rehetra, fa mbola nisy sakafo kosa eran’i ejipta.'),
  ('6aadc6fd82e8a67ddecf3733', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.884Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.884Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 41, 53, 'Ary tapitra ireo fito taona nahavokatra be tany Ejipta.', 'ary tapitra ireo fito taona nahavokatra be tany ejipta.'),
  ('6aadc6fd82e8a67ddecf3732', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.884Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.884Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 41, 52, 'Ary nataony hoe Efraima ny anaran’ilay faharoa. Hoy mantsy izy: “Efa nomen’Andriamanitra taranaka aho, eto amin’ity tany nahitako ny mangidy ity.”', 'ary nataony hoe efraima ny anaran’ilay faharoa. hoy mantsy izy: “efa nomen’andriamanitra taranaka aho, eto amin’ity tany nahitako ny mangidy ity.”'),
  ('6aadc6fd82e8a67ddecf3731', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.884Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.884Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 41, 51, 'Nataon’i Josefa hoe Manase ny anaran’ilay lahimatoa. Hoy mantsy izy: “Efa nataon’Andriamanitra izay hanadinoako ny fahoriako rehetra sy ny ankohonan-draiko manontolo.”', 'nataon’i josefa hoe manase ny anaran’ilay lahimatoa. hoy mantsy izy: “efa nataon’andriamanitra izay hanadinoako ny fahoriako rehetra sy ny ankohonan-draiko manontolo.”'),
  ('6aadc6fd82e8a67ddecf3730', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.884Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.884Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 41, 50, 'Talohan’ny nahatongavan’ny taona nisian’ny mosary, dia niteraka roa lahy tamin’i Josefa i Asenata, zanakavavin’i Potifera mpisorona tao Ona.', 'talohan’ny nahatongavan’ny taona nisian’ny mosary, dia niteraka roa lahy tamin’i josefa i asenata, zanakavavin’i potifera mpisorona tao ona.'),
  ('6aadc6fd82e8a67ddecf372f', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.884Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.884Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 41, 49, 'Tsy nitsahatra nanangona vokatra i Josefa ka lasa be dia be hoatran’ny fasika any an-dranomasina izany. Tsy nafatra intsony àry izany satria be loatra.', 'tsy nitsahatra nanangona vokatra i josefa ka lasa be dia be hoatran’ny fasika any an-dranomasina izany. tsy nafatra intsony àry izany satria be loatra.'),
  ('6aadc6fd82e8a67ddecf372e', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.884Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.884Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 41, 48, 'Ary nangoniny ny sakafo rehetra vokatra tamin’ireo fito taona nahavokatra be tany Ejipta, ka notehiriziny tao amin’ireo tanàna. Notehiriziny isaky ny tanàna ny vokatra avy teny amin’ny saha manodidina.', 'ary nangoniny ny sakafo rehetra vokatra tamin’ireo fito taona nahavokatra be tany ejipta, ka notehiriziny tao amin’ireo tanàna. notehiriziny isaky ny tanàna ny vokatra avy teny amin’ny saha manodidina.'),
  ('6aadc6fd82e8a67ddecf372d', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.884Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.884Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 41, 47, 'Be dia be ny vokatra tao amin’ilay tany, nandritra an’ireo fito taona nahavokatra be.', 'be dia be ny vokatra tao amin’ilay tany, nandritra an’ireo fito taona nahavokatra be.'),
  ('6aadc6fd82e8a67ddecf372c', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.884Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.884Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 41, 46, 'Ary 30 taona i Josefa tamin’izy nanomboka niasa ho an’i Farao mpanjakan’i Ejipta. Dia niala teo anatrehan’i Farao i Josefa ka nitety an’i Ejipta manontolo.', 'ary 30 taona i josefa tamin’izy nanomboka niasa ho an’i farao mpanjakan’i ejipta. dia niala teo anatrehan’i farao i josefa ka nitety an’i ejipta manontolo.'),
  ('6aadc6fd82e8a67ddecf372b', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.884Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.884Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 41, 45, 'Taorian’izay, dia nataon’i Farao hoe Zafenata-panea ny anaran’i Josefa, ary nomeny ho vadiny i Asenata, zanakavavin’i Potifera mpisorona tao Ona. Dia nanomboka nitantana an’i Ejipta i Josefa.', 'taorian’izay, dia nataon’i farao hoe zafenata-panea ny anaran’i josefa, ary nomeny ho vadiny i asenata, zanakavavin’i potifera mpisorona tao ona. dia nanomboka nitantana an’i ejipta i josefa.'),
  ('6aadc6fd82e8a67ddecf372a', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.884Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.884Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 41, 44, 'Hoy koa i Farao tamin’i Josefa: “Izaho no Farao, nefa tsy misy mahazo manao na inona na inona eran’i Ejipta, raha tsy omenao alalana.”', 'hoy koa i farao tamin’i josefa: “izaho no farao, nefa tsy misy mahazo manao na inona na inona eran’i ejipta, raha tsy omenao alalana.”'),
  ('6aadc6fd82e8a67ddecf3729', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.884Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.884Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 41, 43, 'Nasainy nitaingina teo amin’ny kalesy faharoan’i Farao koa izy, dia nisy olona niantsoantso teo alohany hoe: “Avreka!” Toy izany no nanendren’i Farao azy hanam-pahefana amin’i Ejipta manontolo.', 'nasainy nitaingina teo amin’ny kalesy faharoan’i farao koa izy, dia nisy olona niantsoantso teo alohany hoe: “avreka!” toy izany no nanendren’i farao azy hanam-pahefana amin’i ejipta manontolo.'),
  ('6aadc6fd82e8a67ddecf3728', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.884Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.884Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 41, 42, 'Dia nesorin’i Farao ny peratra fanombohan-kase teny amin’ny tanany ka nataony tamin’ny tanan’i Josefa. Ary nampitafiany lamba rongony tena tsara koa izy sady nasiany rojo volamena ny vozony.', 'dia nesorin’i farao ny peratra fanombohan-kase teny amin’ny tanany ka nataony tamin’ny tanan’i josefa. ary nampitafiany lamba rongony tena tsara koa izy sady nasiany rojo volamena ny vozony.'),
  ('6aadc6fd82e8a67ddecf3727', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.884Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.884Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 41, 41, 'Hoy koa i Farao: “Manendry anao hanam-pahefana amin’i Ejipta manontolo aho.”', 'hoy koa i farao: “manendry anao hanam-pahefana amin’i ejipta manontolo aho.”'),
  ('6aadc6fd82e8a67ddecf3726', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.884Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.884Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 41, 40, 'Ianao no hiandraikitra ny ankohonako, ary hankatò an’izay teneninao ny vahoakako rehetra. Zavatra iray fotsiny no mahatonga ahy ho ambony noho ianao, dia ny hoe izaho no mpanjaka.”', 'ianao no hiandraikitra ny ankohonako, ary hankatò an’izay teneninao ny vahoakako rehetra. zavatra iray fotsiny no mahatonga ahy ho ambony noho ianao, dia ny hoe izaho no mpanjaka.”'),
  ('6aadc6fd82e8a67ddecf3725', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.884Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.884Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 41, 39, 'Dia hoy i Farao tamin’i Josefa: “Satria nampahafantarin’Andriamanitra anao izany rehetra izany, dia tsy misy malina sy hendry tahaka anao.', 'dia hoy i farao tamin’i josefa: “satria nampahafantarin’andriamanitra anao izany rehetra izany, dia tsy misy malina sy hendry tahaka anao.'),
  ('6aadc6fd82e8a67ddecf3724', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.884Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.884Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 41, 38, 'Ary hoy i Farao tamin’ny mpanompony: “Aiza indray isika no hahita lehilahy manana ny fanahin’Andriamanitra tahaka an’io?”', 'ary hoy i farao tamin’ny mpanompony: “aiza indray isika no hahita lehilahy manana ny fanahin’andriamanitra tahaka an’io?”'),
  ('6aadc6fd82e8a67ddecf3723', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.884Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.884Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 41, 37, 'Dia hitan’i Farao sy ny mpanompony rehetra hoe tsara izany hevitra izany.', 'dia hitan’i farao sy ny mpanompony rehetra hoe tsara izany hevitra izany.'),
  ('6aadc6fd82e8a67ddecf3722', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.884Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.884Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 41, 36, 'Tokony hatao tahiry ho an’i Ejipta mandritra an’ilay fito taona hisian’ny mosary ireo sakafo ireo, mba tsy ho ripaky ny mosary ny tany.”', 'tokony hatao tahiry ho an’i ejipta mandritra an’ilay fito taona hisian’ny mosary ireo sakafo ireo, mba tsy ho ripaky ny mosary ny tany.”'),
  ('6aadc6fd82e8a67ddecf3721', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.884Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.884Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 41, 35, 'Asaivo manangona ny sakafo rehetra mandritra an’ireo taona mahavokatra ho avy ry zareo, dia asaivo tehiriziny ny vokatra voangony, mba hatao sakafo isan-tanàna. Dia i Farao no hitantana an’izany.', 'asaivo manangona ny sakafo rehetra mandritra an’ireo taona mahavokatra ho avy ry zareo, dia asaivo tehiriziny ny vokatra voangony, mba hatao sakafo isan-tanàna. dia i farao no hitantana an’izany.'),
  ('6aadc6fd82e8a67ddecf3720', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.884Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.884Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 41, 34, 'Tsara koa raha manendry mpiandraikitra maromaro eto Ejipta i Farao. Tokony hangonin’i Farao koa ny ampahadimin’ny vokatra eto Ejipta, mandritra an’ireo fito taona mahavokatra be.', 'tsara koa raha manendry mpiandraikitra maromaro eto ejipta i farao. tokony hangonin’i farao koa ny ampahadimin’ny vokatra eto ejipta, mandritra an’ireo fito taona mahavokatra be.'),
  ('6aadc6fd82e8a67ddecf371f', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.884Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.884Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 41, 33, '“Tsara raha mitady lehilahy malina sy hendry i Farao, ka manendry azy hanam-pahefana amin’i Ejipta.', '“tsara raha mitady lehilahy malina sy hendry i farao, ka manendry azy hanam-pahefana amin’i ejipta.'),
  ('6aadc6fd82e8a67ddecf371e', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.884Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.884Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 41, 32, 'Naverina indroa tamin’i Farao ilay nofy, satria tian’Andriamanitra hohamafisina tsara, sady tsy ho ela dia hotanterahiny.', 'naverina indroa tamin’i farao ilay nofy, satria tian’andriamanitra hohamafisina tsara, sady tsy ho ela dia hotanterahiny.'),
  ('6aadc6fd82e8a67ddecf371d', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.884Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.884Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 41, 31, 'Ary tsy hotsaroana intsony ilay hoe nahavokatra be teto noho ilay mosary aorian’izay, satria ho faran’izay mafy ilay mosary.', 'ary tsy hotsaroana intsony ilay hoe nahavokatra be teto noho ilay mosary aorian’izay, satria ho faran’izay mafy ilay mosary.'),
  ('6aadc6fd82e8a67ddecf371c', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.884Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.884Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 41, 30, 'Aorian’izay indray dia hisy fito taona hisian’ny mosary, ka ho hadino hoe nahavokatra be eran’i Ejipta, fa ho simban’ny mosary ny tany.', 'aorian’izay indray dia hisy fito taona hisian’ny mosary, ka ho hadino hoe nahavokatra be eran’i ejipta, fa ho simban’ny mosary ny tany.'),
  ('6aadc6fd82e8a67ddecf371b', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.884Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.884Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 41, 29, '“Hisy fito taona mahavokatra be eran’i Ejipta.', '“hisy fito taona mahavokatra be eran’i ejipta.'),
  ('6aadc6fd82e8a67ddecf371a', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.884Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.884Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 41, 28, 'Izay mihitsy ilay noresahiko tamin’i Farao teo hoe: Izay hataon’ilay tena Andriamanitra no nasehony an’i Farao.', 'izay mihitsy ilay noresahiko tamin’i farao teo hoe: izay hataon’ilay tena andriamanitra no nasehony an’i farao.'),
  ('6aadc6fd82e8a67ddecf3719', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.884Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.884Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 41, 27, 'Ny ombivavy fito kaozatra sady ratsy tarehy izay niakatra taorianan’izy ireo dia fito taona. Ary ny salohim-barimbazaha fito izay akofa fotsiny sady mainan’ny rivotra avy any atsinanana, dia fito taona hisian’ny mosary.', 'ny ombivavy fito kaozatra sady ratsy tarehy izay niakatra taorianan’izy ireo dia fito taona. ary ny salohim-barimbazaha fito izay akofa fotsiny sady mainan’ny rivotra avy any atsinanana, dia fito taona hisian’ny mosary.'),
  ('6aadc6fd82e8a67ddecf3718', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.884Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.884Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 41, 26, 'Ny ombivavy fito tsara tarehy dia fito taona. Ny salohim-barimbazaha fito tsara koa dia fito taona. Iray ihany ny dikan’ireo nofy ireo.', 'ny ombivavy fito tsara tarehy dia fito taona. ny salohim-barimbazaha fito tsara koa dia fito taona. iray ihany ny dikan’ireo nofy ireo.'),
  ('6aadc6fd82e8a67ddecf3717', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.884Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.884Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 41, 25, 'Ary hoy i Josefa tamin’i Farao: “Iray ihany ny dikan’ireo nofin’i Farao ireo. Izay hataon’ilay tena Andriamanitra no nolazainy tamin’i Farao.', 'ary hoy i josefa tamin’i farao: “iray ihany ny dikan’ireo nofin’i farao ireo. izay hataon’ilay tena andriamanitra no nolazainy tamin’i farao.'),
  ('6aadc6fd82e8a67ddecf3716', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.884Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.884Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 41, 24, 'Dia natelin’ireo salohim-bary mahia ireo ny salohy fito tsara. Dia notantaraiko tamin’ny mpisorona mpanao sikidy izany, nefa tsy nisy nahavita nilaza ny dikan’ilay nofy tamiko.”', 'dia natelin’ireo salohim-bary mahia ireo ny salohy fito tsara. dia notantaraiko tamin’ny mpisorona mpanao sikidy izany, nefa tsy nisy nahavita nilaza ny dikan’ilay nofy tamiko.”'),
  ('6aadc6fd82e8a67ddecf3715', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.884Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.884Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 41, 23, 'Ary nisy salohim-barimbazaha fito hafa koa nipoitra, malazo sady mahia ary mainan’ny rivotra avy any atsinanana.', 'ary nisy salohim-barimbazaha fito hafa koa nipoitra, malazo sady mahia ary mainan’ny rivotra avy any atsinanana.'),
  ('6aadc6fd82e8a67ddecf3714', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.884Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.884Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 41, 22, '“Avy eo dia hitako tao amin’ny nofiko indray, fa nisy salohim-barimbazaha fito vaventy sady tsara, nipoitra tamin’ny tahony iray.', '“avy eo dia hitako tao amin’ny nofiko indray, fa nisy salohim-barimbazaha fito vaventy sady tsara, nipoitra tamin’ny tahony iray.'),
  ('6aadc6fd82e8a67ddecf3713', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.884Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:25.884Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 41, 21, 'Rehefa lanin’izy ireo anefa ny ombivavy matavy, dia tsy nisy nahafantatra akory hoe efa laniny ilay izy. Mbola nahia sy ratsy tarehy hoatran’ny teo aloha ihany mantsy izy ireo. Dia taitra tamin’ny torimasoko aho.', 'rehefa lanin’izy ireo anefa ny ombivavy matavy, dia tsy nisy nahafantatra akory hoe efa laniny ilay izy. mbola nahia sy ratsy tarehy hoatran’ny teo aloha ihany mantsy izy ireo. dia taitra tamin’ny torimasoko aho.'),
  ('6aadc6febd4ee9004ff75c46', '2026-09-18T23:19:26.271Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:26.271Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 42, 24, 'Niala teo amin’izy ireo àry izy dia nitomany. Rehefa niverina teo indray izy ka niresaka tamin’izy ireo, dia i Simeona no nalainy ka nofatorany teo imason’izy ireo.', 'niala teo amin’izy ireo àry izy dia nitomany. rehefa niverina teo indray izy ka niresaka tamin’izy ireo, dia i simeona no nalainy ka nofatorany teo imason’izy ireo.'),
  ('6aadc6febd4ee9004ff75c45', '2026-09-18T23:19:26.271Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:26.271Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 42, 23, 'Tsy fantatr’izy ireo anefa hoe azon’i Josefa ny resak’izy ireo, satria nampiasa mpandika teny izy rehefa niresaka taminy.', 'tsy fantatr’izy ireo anefa hoe azon’i josefa ny resak’izy ireo, satria nampiasa mpandika teny izy rehefa niresaka taminy.'),
  ('6aadc6febd4ee9004ff75c44', '2026-09-18T23:19:26.271Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:26.271Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 42, 22, 'Dia hoy i Robena: “Tsy efa niteny taminareo moa aho tamin’iny hoe: ‘Aza manisy ratsy an’io zaza io’? Tsy nety nihaino anefa ianareo. Dia izao isika voasazy fa nandatsaka ny rany.”', 'dia hoy i robena: “tsy efa niteny taminareo moa aho tamin’iny hoe: ‘aza manisy ratsy an’io zaza io’? tsy nety nihaino anefa ianareo. dia izao isika voasazy fa nandatsaka ny rany.”'),
  ('6aadc6febd4ee9004ff75c43', '2026-09-18T23:19:26.271Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:26.271Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 42, 21, 'Ary nifampiresaka izy ireo hoe: “Tena voasazy isika noho ny nataontsika tamin’ny rahalahintsika. Efa hitantsika mantsy ny fahoriany tamin’izy nitalaho mafy tamintsika mba hangoraka azy, nefa tsy mba niantra azy isika. Izany no mahatonga an’izao fahoriana izao hitranga amintsika.”', 'ary nifampiresaka izy ireo hoe: “tena voasazy isika noho ny nataontsika tamin’ny rahalahintsika. efa hitantsika mantsy ny fahoriany tamin’izy nitalaho mafy tamintsika mba hangoraka azy, nefa tsy mba niantra azy isika. izany no mahatonga an’izao fahoriana izao hitranga amintsika.”'),
  ('6aadc6febd4ee9004ff75c42', '2026-09-18T23:19:26.271Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:26.271Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 42, 20, 'Ary ento atỳ amiko ilay zandrinareo faralahy, mba ho hita hoe azo itokisana ny teninareo, dia tsy ho faty ianareo.” Dia nataon’izy ireo izany.', 'ary ento atỳ amiko ilay zandrinareo faralahy, mba ho hita hoe azo itokisana ny teninareo, dia tsy ho faty ianareo.” dia nataon’izy ireo izany.'),
  ('6aadc6febd4ee9004ff75c41', '2026-09-18T23:19:26.271Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:26.271Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 42, 19, 'Raha olo-marina ianareo, dia aleo ny iray aminareo hafatotra ato amin’ity fonja ity. Fa ny sisa kosa afaka mandeha mitondra sakafo ho an’izay mosarena amin’ny fianakavianareo.', 'raha olo-marina ianareo, dia aleo ny iray aminareo hafatotra ato amin’ity fonja ity. fa ny sisa kosa afaka mandeha mitondra sakafo ho an’izay mosarena amin’ny fianakavianareo.'),
  ('6aadc6febd4ee9004ff75c40', '2026-09-18T23:19:26.271Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:26.271Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 42, 18, 'Tamin’ny andro fahatelo, dia hoy i Josefa: “Matahotra an’Andriamanitra aho, ka izao atao dia ho velona ianareo:', 'tamin’ny andro fahatelo, dia hoy i josefa: “matahotra an’andriamanitra aho, ka izao atao dia ho velona ianareo:'),
  ('6aadc6febd4ee9004ff75c3f', '2026-09-18T23:19:26.271Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:26.271Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 42, 17, 'Dia nataony tao am-ponja telo andro izy ireo.', 'dia nataony tao am-ponja telo andro izy ireo.'),
  ('6aadc6febd4ee9004ff75c3e', '2026-09-18T23:19:26.271Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:26.271Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 42, 16, 'Iraho haka an’ilay rahalahinareo ny iray aminareo, fa ianareo kosa hafatotra. Raha manao an’izany ianareo, dia izay no hahitako hoe tena marina ny teninareo. Fa raha tsy izany, ary raha mbola velona koa i Farao, dia ho hita hoe mpitsikilo tokoa ianareo.”', 'iraho haka an’ilay rahalahinareo ny iray aminareo, fa ianareo kosa hafatotra. raha manao an’izany ianareo, dia izay no hahitako hoe tena marina ny teninareo. fa raha tsy izany, ary raha mbola velona koa i farao, dia ho hita hoe mpitsikilo tokoa ianareo.”'),
  ('6aadc6febd4ee9004ff75c3d', '2026-09-18T23:19:26.271Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:26.271Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 42, 15, 'Koa izao no hitsapana anareo: Raha mbola velona koa i Farao, dia tsy mahazo miala eto ianareo raha tsy tonga eto ny zandrinareo faralahy.', 'koa izao no hitsapana anareo: raha mbola velona koa i farao, dia tsy mahazo miala eto ianareo raha tsy tonga eto ny zandrinareo faralahy.'),
  ('6aadc6febd4ee9004ff75c3c', '2026-09-18T23:19:26.271Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:26.271Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 42, 14, 'Hoy anefa i Josefa taminy: “Efa hoe mpitsikilo ianareo!', 'hoy anefa i josefa taminy: “efa hoe mpitsikilo ianareo!'),
  ('6aadc6febd4ee9004ff75c3b', '2026-09-18T23:19:26.271Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:26.271Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 42, 13, 'Dia hoy izy ireo: “Misy 12 mirahalahy izahay mpanomponao, ary zanaky ny lehilahy iray ihany. Mipetraka any Kanana ny rainay, ary any aminy izao ny faralahy, fa ny iray efa tsy eo intsony.”', 'dia hoy izy ireo: “misy 12 mirahalahy izahay mpanomponao, ary zanaky ny lehilahy iray ihany. mipetraka any kanana ny rainay, ary any aminy izao ny faralahy, fa ny iray efa tsy eo intsony.”'),
  ('6aadc6febd4ee9004ff75c3a', '2026-09-18T23:19:26.271Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:26.271Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 42, 12, 'Hoy anefa izy: “Hita fa tonga eto ianareo mba hijery an’izay faritra mora tafihina eto amin’ny taninay!”', 'hoy anefa izy: “hita fa tonga eto ianareo mba hijery an’izay faritra mora tafihina eto amin’ny taninay!”'),
  ('6aadc6febd4ee9004ff75c39', '2026-09-18T23:19:26.271Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:26.271Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 42, 11, 'Zanaky ny lehilahy iray ihany izahay rehetra, ary olo-marina. Tsy mpitsikilo mihitsy ny mpanomponao.”', 'zanaky ny lehilahy iray ihany izahay rehetra, ary olo-marina. tsy mpitsikilo mihitsy ny mpanomponao.”'),
  ('6aadc6febd4ee9004ff75c38', '2026-09-18T23:19:26.271Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:26.271Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 42, 10, 'Fa hoy izy ireo: “Tsy marina izany, tompoko, fa hividy sakafo no nahatongavanay mpanomponao.', 'fa hoy izy ireo: “tsy marina izany, tompoko, fa hividy sakafo no nahatongavanay mpanomponao.'),
  ('6aadc6febd4ee9004ff75c37', '2026-09-18T23:19:26.271Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:26.271Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 42, 9, 'Tonga dia tsaroan’i Josefa ny nofiny momba azy ireo, ka hoy izy taminy: “Mpitsikilo ianareo! Tonga eto ianareo mba hijery hoe aiza ho aiza ny faritra mora tafihina eto amin’ny taninay!”', 'tonga dia tsaroan’i josefa ny nofiny momba azy ireo, ka hoy izy taminy: “mpitsikilo ianareo! tonga eto ianareo mba hijery hoe aiza ho aiza ny faritra mora tafihina eto amin’ny taninay!”'),
  ('6aadc6febd4ee9004ff75c36', '2026-09-18T23:19:26.271Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:26.271Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 42, 8, 'Fantatr’i Josefa àry ny rahalahiny, fa izy ireo kosa tsy nahafantatra azy.', 'fantatr’i josefa àry ny rahalahiny, fa izy ireo kosa tsy nahafantatra azy.'),
  ('6aadc6febd4ee9004ff75c35', '2026-09-18T23:19:26.271Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:26.271Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 42, 7, 'Vao hitan’i Josefa ny rahalahiny dia fantany. Nataony anefa izay tsy hahafantaran’izy ireo azy. Dia nasiaka fiteny tamin’izy ireo izy, ka niteny hoe: “Avy aiza ianareo?” Dia hoy izy ireo: “Avy any Kanana izahay dia tonga mba hividy sakafo.”', 'vao hitan’i josefa ny rahalahiny dia fantany. nataony anefa izay tsy hahafantaran’izy ireo azy. dia nasiaka fiteny tamin’izy ireo izy, ka niteny hoe: “avy aiza ianareo?” dia hoy izy ireo: “avy any kanana izahay dia tonga mba hividy sakafo.”'),
  ('6aadc6febd4ee9004ff75c34', '2026-09-18T23:19:26.271Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:26.271Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 42, 6, 'I Josefa no nanam-pahefana tamin’i Ejipta manontolo, ary izy no nivarotra sakafo tamin’ny olona rehetra teto an-tany. Tonga àry ny rahalahin’i Josefa ka niankohoka tamin’ny tany teo anatrehany.', 'i josefa no nanam-pahefana tamin’i ejipta manontolo, ary izy no nivarotra sakafo tamin’ny olona rehetra teto an-tany. tonga àry ny rahalahin’i josefa ka niankohoka tamin’ny tany teo anatrehany.'),
  ('6aadc6febd4ee9004ff75c33', '2026-09-18T23:19:26.271Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:26.271Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 42, 5, 'Ary niaraka tamin’ny olon-kafa hividy sakafo ny zanakalahin’i Israely, satria nisy mosary koa tany Kanana.', 'ary niaraka tamin’ny olon-kafa hividy sakafo ny zanakalahin’i israely, satria nisy mosary koa tany kanana.'),
  ('6aadc6febd4ee9004ff75c32', '2026-09-18T23:19:26.271Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:26.271Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 42, 4, 'I Benjamina rahalahin’i Josefa anefa tsy nalefan’i Jakoba niaraka tamin’ireo rahalahiny ireo, satria hoy izy: “Sao dia ho tratran’ny loza any izy dia ho faty.”', 'i benjamina rahalahin’i josefa anefa tsy nalefan’i jakoba niaraka tamin’ireo rahalahiny ireo, satria hoy izy: “sao dia ho tratran’ny loza any izy dia ho faty.”'),
  ('6aadc6febd4ee9004ff75c31', '2026-09-18T23:19:26.271Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:26.271Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 42, 3, 'Koa nidina tany Ejipta ny rahalahin’i Josefa folo lahy mba hividy sakafo.', 'koa nidina tany ejipta ny rahalahin’i josefa folo lahy mba hividy sakafo.'),
  ('6aadc6febd4ee9004ff75c30', '2026-09-18T23:19:26.271Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:26.271Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 42, 2, 'Hoy koa izy: “Henoko hoe misy sakafo any Ejipta. Mandehana midina any hividy sakafo ho antsika, mba tsy ho faty isika.”', 'hoy koa izy: “henoko hoe misy sakafo any ejipta. mandehana midina any hividy sakafo ho antsika, mba tsy ho faty isika.”'),
  ('6aadc6febd4ee9004ff75c2f', '2026-09-18T23:19:26.271Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:26.271Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 42, 1, 'Rehefa fantatr’i Jakoba hoe nisy sakafo tany Ejipta, dia hoy izy tamin’ny zanany lahy: “Fa maninona ianareo no mifampijerijery eo fotsiny?”', 'rehefa fantatr’i jakoba hoe nisy sakafo tany ejipta, dia hoy izy tamin’ny zanany lahy: “fa maninona ianareo no mifampijerijery eo fotsiny?”'),
  ('6aadc6febd4ee9004ff75c54', '2026-09-18T23:19:26.272Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:26.272Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 42, 38, 'Fa hoy i Jakoba: “Tsy mahazo miara-midina aminareo any ny zanako, satria efa maty ny rahalahiny dia izy irery sisa no tavela. Raha tratran’ny loza any amin’izay halehanareo any izy ka maty, dia ahoana? Dia hataonareo mihitsy izay hidinako amin’alahelo any amin’ny Fasana, amin’izao izaho efa fotsy volo izao.”', 'fa hoy i jakoba: “tsy mahazo miara-midina aminareo any ny zanako, satria efa maty ny rahalahiny dia izy irery sisa no tavela. raha tratran’ny loza any amin’izay halehanareo any izy ka maty, dia ahoana? dia hataonareo mihitsy izay hidinako amin’alahelo any amin’ny fasana, amin’izao izaho efa fotsy volo izao.”'),
  ('6aadc6febd4ee9004ff75c53', '2026-09-18T23:19:26.272Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:26.272Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 42, 37, 'Hoy anefa i Robena tamin’ny rainy: “Raha tsy entiko miverina atỳ aminao izy, dia azonao vonoina ho faty ny zanako roa lahy. Ankino amiko izy, fa tsy maintsy hoentiko miverina atỳ aminao.”', 'hoy anefa i robena tamin’ny rainy: “raha tsy entiko miverina atỳ aminao izy, dia azonao vonoina ho faty ny zanako roa lahy. ankino amiko izy, fa tsy maintsy hoentiko miverina atỳ aminao.”'),
  ('6aadc6febd4ee9004ff75c52', '2026-09-18T23:19:26.272Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:26.272Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 42, 36, 'Dia niantsoantso i Jakoba rainy hoe: “Lasa tsy manan-janaka intsony aho, noho ny nataonareo! I Josefa efa tsy eo intsony, i Simeona koa efa tsy eo intsony, dia izao indray i Benjamina koa mbola halainareo! Dia izaho daholo no mizaka an’izany rehetra izany!”', 'dia niantsoantso i jakoba rainy hoe: “lasa tsy manan-janaka intsony aho, noho ny nataonareo! i josefa efa tsy eo intsony, i simeona koa efa tsy eo intsony, dia izao indray i benjamina koa mbola halainareo! dia izaho daholo no mizaka an’izany rehetra izany!”'),
  ('6aadc6febd4ee9004ff75c51', '2026-09-18T23:19:26.272Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:26.272Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 42, 35, 'Rehefa nararak’izy ireo ny tao anaty goniny, dia io fa tao anaty gonin’ny tsirairay ny kitapom-bolany. Rehefa nahita an’izany izy mirahalahy avy sy ny rainy, dia natahotra be daholo.', 'rehefa nararak’izy ireo ny tao anaty goniny, dia io fa tao anaty gonin’ny tsirairay ny kitapom-bolany. rehefa nahita an’izany izy mirahalahy avy sy ny rainy, dia natahotra be daholo.'),
  ('6aadc6febd4ee9004ff75c50', '2026-09-18T23:19:26.272Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:26.272Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 42, 34, 'Ento atỳ amiko ilay zandrinareo faralahy, mba hahafantarako hoe tsy mpitsikilo ianareo fa olo-marina. Dia haveriko aminareo ny rahalahinareo, ary mahazo mividy sakafo atỳ indray ianareo.’”', 'ento atỳ amiko ilay zandrinareo faralahy, mba hahafantarako hoe tsy mpitsikilo ianareo fa olo-marina. dia haveriko aminareo ny rahalahinareo, ary mahazo mividy sakafo atỳ indray ianareo.’”'),
  ('6aadc6febd4ee9004ff75c4f', '2026-09-18T23:19:26.272Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:26.272Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 42, 33, 'Hoy anefa ilay manam-pahefana ao amin’ilay tany: ‘Izao no hahafantarako hoe olo-marina ianareo: Avelao eto amiko ny iray amin’ny rahalahinareo, dia mandehana mitondra sakafo ho an’izay mosarena amin’ny fianakavianareo.', 'hoy anefa ilay manam-pahefana ao amin’ilay tany: ‘izao no hahafantarako hoe olo-marina ianareo: avelao eto amiko ny iray amin’ny rahalahinareo, dia mandehana mitondra sakafo ho an’izay mosarena amin’ny fianakavianareo.'),
  ('6aadc6febd4ee9004ff75c4e', '2026-09-18T23:19:26.272Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:26.272Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 42, 32, 'Misy 12 mirahalahy izahay no zanaky ny rainay. Ny iray efa tsy eo intsony, ary ny faralahy izao any amin’ny rainay any Kanana.’', 'misy 12 mirahalahy izahay no zanaky ny rainay. ny iray efa tsy eo intsony, ary ny faralahy izao any amin’ny rainay any kanana.’'),
  ('6aadc6febd4ee9004ff75c4d', '2026-09-18T23:19:26.272Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:26.272Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 42, 31, 'Novalianay anefa izy hoe: ‘Olo-marina izahay, fa tsy mpitsikilo izany!', 'novalianay anefa izy hoe: ‘olo-marina izahay, fa tsy mpitsikilo izany!'),
  ('6aadc6febd4ee9004ff75c4c', '2026-09-18T23:19:26.272Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:26.272Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 42, 30, '“Nasiaka fiteny taminay ilay manam-pahefana ao amin’ilay tany, dia nolazainy fa mpitsikilo izahay.', '“nasiaka fiteny taminay ilay manam-pahefana ao amin’ilay tany, dia nolazainy fa mpitsikilo izahay.'),
  ('6aadc6febd4ee9004ff75c4b', '2026-09-18T23:19:26.272Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:26.272Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 42, 29, 'Rehefa tonga tany amin’i Jakoba rainy tany Kanana izy ireo, dia notantarain’izy ireo taminy ny zava-drehetra nahazo azy. Hoy izy ireo:', 'rehefa tonga tany amin’i jakoba rainy tany kanana izy ireo, dia notantarain’izy ireo taminy ny zava-drehetra nahazo azy. hoy izy ireo:'),
  ('6aadc6febd4ee9004ff75c4a', '2026-09-18T23:19:26.272Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:26.272Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 42, 28, 'Dia hoy izy tamin’ny rahalahiny: “Nisy namerina ny volako! Io anaty goniko io ilay izy!” Dia natahotra be izy ireo sady nangovitra, ka nifampiresaka hoe: “Fa inona loatra re izao ataon’Andriamanitra amintsika izao e?”', 'dia hoy izy tamin’ny rahalahiny: “nisy namerina ny volako! io anaty goniko io ilay izy!” dia natahotra be izy ireo sady nangovitra, ka nifampiresaka hoe: “fa inona loatra re izao ataon’andriamanitra amintsika izao e?”'),
  ('6aadc6febd4ee9004ff75c49', '2026-09-18T23:19:26.272Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:26.272Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 42, 27, 'Rehefa nanokatra ny goniny ny iray tamin’izy ireo fa handeha hanome sakafo ny ampondrany teo amin’ny toeram-pilasiana, dia hitany teo am-bavan’ny goniny ny volany.', 'rehefa nanokatra ny goniny ny iray tamin’izy ireo fa handeha hanome sakafo ny ampondrany teo amin’ny toeram-pilasiana, dia hitany teo am-bavan’ny goniny ny volany.'),
  ('6aadc6febd4ee9004ff75c48', '2026-09-18T23:19:26.272Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:26.272Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 42, 26, 'Ary nataingin’izy ireo teo amin’ny ampondrany ny sakafo novidiny, dia lasa izy ireo.', 'ary nataingin’izy ireo teo amin’ny ampondrany ny sakafo novidiny, dia lasa izy ireo.'),
  ('6aadc6febd4ee9004ff75c47', '2026-09-18T23:19:26.272Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:26.272Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 42, 25, 'Avy eo dia nasain’i Josefa nofenoina varimbazaha ny gonin’izy ireo. Nasainy naverina tao anaty gonin’ny tsirairay koa ny volany, ary nasainy nomena vatsy hohaniny eny an-dalana izy ireo. Dia natao tamin’izy ireo izany.', 'avy eo dia nasain’i josefa nofenoina varimbazaha ny gonin’izy ireo. nasainy naverina tao anaty gonin’ny tsirairay koa ny volany, ary nasainy nomena vatsy hohaniny eny an-dalana izy ireo. dia natao tamin’izy ireo izany.'),
  ('6aadc6fec317b24ef46a3302', '2026-09-18T23:19:26.785Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:26.785Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 43, 34, 'Nomen’i Josefa sakafo avy teo amin’ny latabany foana izy ireo, ka naroso teo amin’ny latabatr’izy ireo ilay izy. Nataony avo dimy heny noho ny an’ny hafa rehetra anefa ny anjaran’i Benjamina. Dia nihinana sy nisotro niaraka taminy izy ireo, mandra-pahavokiny.', 'nomen’i josefa sakafo avy teo amin’ny latabany foana izy ireo, ka naroso teo amin’ny latabatr’izy ireo ilay izy. nataony avo dimy heny noho ny an’ny hafa rehetra anefa ny anjaran’i benjamina. dia nihinana sy nisotro niaraka taminy izy ireo, mandra-pahavokiny.'),
  ('6aadc6fec317b24ef46a3301', '2026-09-18T23:19:26.785Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:26.785Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 43, 33, 'Ary nasaina nipetraka nifanatrika tamin’i Josefa ireo rahalahiny ireo, arakaraka ny taonany, nanomboka tamin’ny lahimatoa, izay nanana ny zon’ny lahimatoa, ka hatramin’ny faralahy. Dia nifampijery izy ireo sady gagagaga.', 'ary nasaina nipetraka nifanatrika tamin’i josefa ireo rahalahiny ireo, arakaraka ny taonany, nanomboka tamin’ny lahimatoa, izay nanana ny zon’ny lahimatoa, ka hatramin’ny faralahy. dia nifampijery izy ireo sady gagagaga.'),
  ('6aadc6fec317b24ef46a3300', '2026-09-18T23:19:26.785Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:26.785Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 43, 32, 'Dia naroson’izy ireo ny sakafo, ka nataony mitokana ny an’i Josefa, mitokana ny an’ny rahalahiny, ary nihinana mitokana koa izay Ejipsianina niaraka tamin’i Josefa teo. Tsy nahazo niara-nisakafo tamin’ny Hebreo mantsy ny Ejipsianina, satria naharikoriko ny Ejipsianina izany.', 'dia naroson’izy ireo ny sakafo, ka nataony mitokana ny an’i josefa, mitokana ny an’ny rahalahiny, ary nihinana mitokana koa izay ejipsianina niaraka tamin’i josefa teo. tsy nahazo niara-nisakafo tamin’ny hebreo mantsy ny ejipsianina, satria naharikoriko ny ejipsianina izany.'),
  ('6aadc6fec317b24ef46a32ff', '2026-09-18T23:19:26.785Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:26.785Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 43, 31, 'Avy eo dia nosasany ny tarehiny, dia nivoaka avy tao izy. Efa nahafehy ny fihetseham-pony izy tamin’izay, ka niteny hoe: “Arosoy ny sakafo.”', 'avy eo dia nosasany ny tarehiny, dia nivoaka avy tao izy. efa nahafehy ny fihetseham-pony izy tamin’izay, ka niteny hoe: “arosoy ny sakafo.”'),
  ('6aadc6fec317b24ef46a32fe', '2026-09-18T23:19:26.785Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:26.785Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 43, 30, 'Ary niala teo haingana i Josefa, satria feno be ny fony noho izy nahita an’ilay rahalahiny. Koa nitady toerana hitomaniana izy, ka nankao amin’ny efitra iray mba ho irery, dia nitomany tao.', 'ary niala teo haingana i josefa, satria feno be ny fony noho izy nahita an’ilay rahalahiny. koa nitady toerana hitomaniana izy, ka nankao amin’ny efitra iray mba ho irery, dia nitomany tao.'),
  ('6aadc6fec317b24ef46a32fd', '2026-09-18T23:19:26.785Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:26.785Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 43, 29, 'Rehefa nahita an’i Benjamina rahalahiny, ilay iray tam-po taminy i Josefa, dia hoy izy: “Io ve ilay zandrinareo faralahy noresahinareo tamiko?” Hoy koa izy: “Hotahin’Andriamanitra anie ianao, anaka!”', 'rehefa nahita an’i benjamina rahalahiny, ilay iray tam-po taminy i josefa, dia hoy izy: “io ve ilay zandrinareo faralahy noresahinareo tamiko?” hoy koa izy: “hotahin’andriamanitra anie ianao, anaka!”'),
  ('6aadc6fec317b24ef46a32fc', '2026-09-18T23:19:26.785Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:26.785Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 43, 28, 'Dia hoy izy ireo: “Salama tsara ny rainay mpanomponao, ary mbola velona izy.” Dia niondrika izy ireo ka niankohoka teo anatrehany.', 'dia hoy izy ireo: “salama tsara ny rainay mpanomponao, ary mbola velona izy.” dia niondrika izy ireo ka niankohoka teo anatrehany.'),
  ('6aadc6fec317b24ef46a32fb', '2026-09-18T23:19:26.785Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:26.785Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 43, 27, 'Nanontany ny fahasalaman’izy ireo izy avy eo, sady niteny hoe: “Manao ahoana izay ilay rainareo be taona noresahinareo? Mbola velona ve izy?”', 'nanontany ny fahasalaman’izy ireo izy avy eo, sady niteny hoe: “manao ahoana izay ilay rainareo be taona noresahinareo? mbola velona ve izy?”'),
  ('6aadc6fec317b24ef46a32fa', '2026-09-18T23:19:26.785Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:26.785Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 43, 26, 'Rehefa tonga tao an-trano i Josefa, dia nentin’izy ireo tao aminy ilay fanomezana, ary niankohoka tamin’ny tany teo anatrehany izy ireo.', 'rehefa tonga tao an-trano i josefa, dia nentin’izy ireo tao aminy ilay fanomezana, ary niankohoka tamin’ny tany teo anatrehany izy ireo.'),
  ('6aadc6fec317b24ef46a32f9', '2026-09-18T23:19:26.785Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:26.785Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 43, 25, 'Fantatr’izy ireo fa ho avy i Josefa amin’ny mitataovovonana dia ao izy ireo no hisakafo, ka nomaniny ny fanomezana homena an’i Josefa.', 'fantatr’izy ireo fa ho avy i josefa amin’ny mitataovovonana dia ao izy ireo no hisakafo, ka nomaniny ny fanomezana homena an’i josefa.'),
  ('6aadc6fec317b24ef46a32f8', '2026-09-18T23:19:26.785Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:26.785Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 43, 24, 'Dia nampidirin’ilay lehilahy tao an-tranon’i Josefa izy ireo, ka nomeny rano hanasany tongotra. Nomeny sakafo koa ny ampondrany.', 'dia nampidirin’ilay lehilahy tao an-tranon’i josefa izy ireo, ka nomeny rano hanasany tongotra. nomeny sakafo koa ny ampondrany.'),
  ('6aadc6fec317b24ef46a32f7', '2026-09-18T23:19:26.785Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:26.785Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 43, 23, 'Dia hoy ilay lehilahy: “Tsy maninona izany, fa aza matahotra! Ilay Andriamanitrareo sy Andriamanitry ny rainareo no nametraka harena tao anaty goninareo. Fantatro hoe efa nandoa vola ianareo.” Taorian’izay dia navoakany teo amin’izy ireo i Simeona.', 'dia hoy ilay lehilahy: “tsy maninona izany, fa aza matahotra! ilay andriamanitrareo sy andriamanitry ny rainareo no nametraka harena tao anaty goninareo. fantatro hoe efa nandoa vola ianareo.” taorian’izay dia navoakany teo amin’izy ireo i simeona.'),
  ('6aadc6fec317b24ef46a32f6', '2026-09-18T23:19:26.785Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:26.785Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 43, 22, 'Dia nitondra vola hafa koa izahay izao hividianana sakafo. Tsy fantatray hoe iza no nametraka ny volanay tao anaty goninay.”', 'dia nitondra vola hafa koa izahay izao hividianana sakafo. tsy fantatray hoe iza no nametraka ny volanay tao anaty goninay.”'),
  ('6aadc6fec317b24ef46a32f5', '2026-09-18T23:19:26.785Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:26.785Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 43, 21, 'Rehefa tonga tany amin’ny toeram-pilasiana anefa izahay ka nosokafanay ny goninay, dia io fa teo am-bavan’ny goninay tsirairay ny volanay, sady ilay lanjany iny ihany fa tsy nisy banga. Dia tianay haverina ilay izy.', 'rehefa tonga tany amin’ny toeram-pilasiana anefa izahay ka nosokafanay ny goninay, dia io fa teo am-bavan’ny goninay tsirairay ny volanay, sady ilay lanjany iny ihany fa tsy nisy banga. dia tianay haverina ilay izy.'),
  ('6aadc6fec317b24ef46a32f4', '2026-09-18T23:19:26.785Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:26.785Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 43, 20, 'Hoy izy ireo: “Miala tsiny re, tompoko ô! Nidina hividy sakafo tatỳ izahay tamin’ny voalohany.', 'hoy izy ireo: “miala tsiny re, tompoko ô! nidina hividy sakafo tatỳ izahay tamin’ny voalohany.'),
  ('6aadc6fec317b24ef46a32f3', '2026-09-18T23:19:26.785Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:26.785Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 43, 19, 'Koa nanatona an’ilay lehilahy niandraikitra ny tao an-tranon’i Josefa izy ireo, ka niresaka taminy teo am-baravarana.', 'koa nanatona an’ilay lehilahy niandraikitra ny tao an-tranon’i josefa izy ireo, ka niresaka taminy teo am-baravarana.'),
  ('6aadc6fec317b24ef46a32f2', '2026-09-18T23:19:26.785Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:26.785Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 43, 18, 'Natahotra anefa izy ireo rehefa nentina tany, ka nifampiresaka hoe: “Ilay vola naverina tao anaty gonintsika tamin’ny farany iny izao no antony itondrana antsika eto. Hosamborin-dry zareo izao isika, dia hataony andevo, dia halainy koa ny ampondrantsika!”', 'natahotra anefa izy ireo rehefa nentina tany, ka nifampiresaka hoe: “ilay vola naverina tao anaty gonintsika tamin’ny farany iny izao no antony itondrana antsika eto. hosamborin-dry zareo izao isika, dia hataony andevo, dia halainy koa ny ampondrantsika!”'),
  ('6aadc6fec317b24ef46a32f1', '2026-09-18T23:19:26.785Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:26.785Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 43, 17, 'Tonga dia nataon’ilay lehilahy izay nolazain’i Josefa, ka nentiny ho any an-tranon’i Josefa izy ireo.', 'tonga dia nataon’ilay lehilahy izay nolazain’i josefa, ka nentiny ho any an-tranon’i josefa izy ireo.'),
  ('6aadc6fec317b24ef46a32f0', '2026-09-18T23:19:26.785Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:26.785Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 43, 16, 'Rehefa nahita an’i Benjamina niaraka tamin’izy ireo i Josefa, dia tonga dia niteny tamin’ilay lehilahy niandraikitra ny tao an-tranony hoe: “Ento any an-trano ireo lehilahy ireo. Ary makà biby, dia vonoy, dia karakarao hatao sakafo, fa hiara-misakafo amiko ry zareo rantoandro.”', 'rehefa nahita an’i benjamina niaraka tamin’izy ireo i josefa, dia tonga dia niteny tamin’ilay lehilahy niandraikitra ny tao an-tranony hoe: “ento any an-trano ireo lehilahy ireo. ary makà biby, dia vonoy, dia karakarao hatao sakafo, fa hiara-misakafo amiko ry zareo rantoandro.”'),
  ('6aadc6fec317b24ef46a32ef', '2026-09-18T23:19:26.785Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:26.785Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 43, 15, 'Dia nentin’izy ireo ilay fanomezana. Nitondra vola indroa henin’ilay teo koa izy ireo sady nitondra an’i Benjamina. Dia lasa nidina nankany Ejipta izy ireo, ary nankeo anatrehan’i Josefa indray.', 'dia nentin’izy ireo ilay fanomezana. nitondra vola indroa henin’ilay teo koa izy ireo sady nitondra an’i benjamina. dia lasa nidina nankany ejipta izy ireo, ary nankeo anatrehan’i josefa indray.'),
  ('6aadc6fec317b24ef46a32ee', '2026-09-18T23:19:26.785Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:26.785Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 43, 14, 'Enga anie mba hataon’ilay Andriamanitra Mahery Indrindra miantra anareo izy, dia mba hafahany ilay rahalahinareo iray ary tsy hotazoniny any i Benjamina. Raha tsy maintsy hafoiko anefa ny zanako, dia vonona hamoy ny zanako aho!”', 'enga anie mba hataon’ilay andriamanitra mahery indrindra miantra anareo izy, dia mba hafahany ilay rahalahinareo iray ary tsy hotazoniny any i benjamina. raha tsy maintsy hafoiko anefa ny zanako, dia vonona hamoy ny zanako aho!”'),
  ('6aadc6fec317b24ef46a32ed', '2026-09-18T23:19:26.785Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:26.785Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 43, 13, 'Ento koa ilay rahalahinareo, dia mandehana miverina any amin’ilay lehilahy.', 'ento koa ilay rahalahinareo, dia mandehana miverina any amin’ilay lehilahy.'),
  ('6aadc6fec317b24ef46a32ec', '2026-09-18T23:19:26.785Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:26.785Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 43, 12, 'Mitondrà vola indroa henin’ilay teo. Dia ento miverina koa ilay vola naverina teo am-bavan’ny goninareo, fa angamba sendra diso fotsiny ry zareo.', 'mitondrà vola indroa henin’ilay teo. dia ento miverina koa ilay vola naverina teo am-bavan’ny goninareo, fa angamba sendra diso fotsiny ry zareo.'),
  ('6aadc6fec317b24ef46a32eb', '2026-09-18T23:19:26.785Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:26.785Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 43, 11, 'Dia hoy i Israely rainy: “Raha tsy maintsy hoe izay àry, dia izao atao: Alaivo ny vokatra tsara indrindra amin’ny tany ka ataovy ao anaty goninareo, dia ento hatao fanomezana ho an’ilay lehilahy: Balsama kely, tantely kely, ditin-kazo ladanoma, hodi-kazo misy ditiny, voanjombazaha, ary amandy.', 'dia hoy i israely rainy: “raha tsy maintsy hoe izay àry, dia izao atao: alaivo ny vokatra tsara indrindra amin’ny tany ka ataovy ao anaty goninareo, dia ento hatao fanomezana ho an’ilay lehilahy: balsama kely, tantely kely, ditin-kazo ladanoma, hodi-kazo misy ditiny, voanjombazaha, ary amandy.'),
  ('6aadc6fec317b24ef46a32ea', '2026-09-18T23:19:26.785Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:26.785Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 43, 10, 'Fa hoatr’izay raha tsy niandriandry izahay, dia ho efa tonga tany ka efa tafaverina fanindroany.”', 'fa hoatr’izay raha tsy niandriandry izahay, dia ho efa tonga tany ka efa tafaverina fanindroany.”'),
  ('6aadc6fec317b24ef46a32e9', '2026-09-18T23:19:26.785Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:26.785Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 43, 9, 'Izaho mihitsy no hiantoka ny fiarovana azy. Aleo izaho no ho tompon’andraikitra raha maninomaninona izy. Koa raha tsy entiko miverina atỳ aminao izy, dia ho fahotako aminao mandrakizay izany.', 'izaho mihitsy no hiantoka ny fiarovana azy. aleo izaho no ho tompon’andraikitra raha maninomaninona izy. koa raha tsy entiko miverina atỳ aminao izy, dia ho fahotako aminao mandrakizay izany.'),
  ('6aadc6fec317b24ef46a32e8', '2026-09-18T23:19:26.785Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:26.785Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 43, 8, 'Hoy i Joda avy eo tamin’i Israely rainy: “Alefaso miaraka amiko izy, dia aleo izahay handeha mba tsy ho faty isika, na izahay na ianao na ny zanatsika.', 'hoy i joda avy eo tamin’i israely rainy: “alefaso miaraka amiko izy, dia aleo izahay handeha mba tsy ho faty isika, na izahay na ianao na ny zanatsika.'),
  ('6aadc6fec317b24ef46a32e7', '2026-09-18T23:19:26.785Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:26.785Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 43, 7, 'Dia hoy izy ireo: “Nivantana be mihitsy ange ny fanontanian’ilay lehilahy momba anay sy ny havanay e! Hoy izy: ‘Mbola velona any ve ny rainareo? Manana rahalahy hafa koa ve ianareo?’ Dia nolazainay taminy ny marina. Izahay ve moa nanampo fa hiteny izy hoe: ‘Ento midina atỳ ilay rahalahinareo’?”', 'dia hoy izy ireo: “nivantana be mihitsy ange ny fanontanian’ilay lehilahy momba anay sy ny havanay e! hoy izy: ‘mbola velona any ve ny rainareo? manana rahalahy hafa koa ve ianareo?’ dia nolazainay taminy ny marina. izahay ve moa nanampo fa hiteny izy hoe: ‘ento midina atỳ ilay rahalahinareo’?”'),
  ('6aadc6fec317b24ef46a32e6', '2026-09-18T23:19:26.785Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:26.785Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 43, 6, 'Dia hoy i Israely: “Fa maninona ianareo no nampidi-kizo ahy hoatr’izao? Fa maninona no noteneninareo tamin’ilay lehilahy hoe mbola manana rahalahy hafa ianareo?”', 'dia hoy i israely: “fa maninona ianareo no nampidi-kizo ahy hoatr’izao? fa maninona no noteneninareo tamin’ilay lehilahy hoe mbola manana rahalahy hafa ianareo?”'),
  ('6aadc6fec317b24ef46a32e5', '2026-09-18T23:19:26.785Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:26.785Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 43, 5, 'Fa raha tsy alefanao izy, dia tsy hidina izahay, satria efa niteny ilay lehilahy hoe: ‘Tsy mahazo mankatỳ amiko intsony ianareo, raha tsy miaraka aminareo ilay rahalahinareo.’”', 'fa raha tsy alefanao izy, dia tsy hidina izahay, satria efa niteny ilay lehilahy hoe: ‘tsy mahazo mankatỳ amiko intsony ianareo, raha tsy miaraka aminareo ilay rahalahinareo.’”'),
  ('6aadc6fec317b24ef46a32e4', '2026-09-18T23:19:26.785Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:26.785Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 43, 4, 'Koa raha alefanao miaraka aminay izy, dia handeha hidina hividy sakafo ho anao izahay.', 'koa raha alefanao miaraka aminay izy, dia handeha hidina hividy sakafo ho anao izahay.'),
  ('6aadc6fec317b24ef46a32e3', '2026-09-18T23:19:26.785Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:26.785Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 43, 3, 'Fa hoy i Joda taminy: “Efa niteny taminay tsara mihitsy ilay lehilahy hoe: ‘Tsy mahazo mankatỳ amiko intsony ianareo, raha tsy miaraka aminareo ilay rahalahinareo!’', 'fa hoy i joda taminy: “efa niteny taminay tsara mihitsy ilay lehilahy hoe: ‘tsy mahazo mankatỳ amiko intsony ianareo, raha tsy miaraka aminareo ilay rahalahinareo!’'),
  ('6aadc6fec317b24ef46a32e2', '2026-09-18T23:19:26.785Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:26.785Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 43, 2, 'Rehefa lany àry ny sakafo nentin’izy ireo avy tany Ejipta, dia hoy ny rainy: “Mandehana ianareo miverina mividy sakafo kely ho antsika.”', 'rehefa lany àry ny sakafo nentin’izy ireo avy tany ejipta, dia hoy ny rainy: “mandehana ianareo miverina mividy sakafo kely ho antsika.”'),
  ('6aadc6fec317b24ef46a32e1', '2026-09-18T23:19:26.785Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:26.785Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 43, 1, 'Ary mafy be ny mosary tao amin’ilay tany.', 'ary mafy be ny mosary tao amin’ilay tany.'),
  ('6aadc6ff04b3a8286b9f9be3', '2026-09-18T23:19:27.550Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:27.550Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 44, 26, 'Fa hoy izahay: ‘Tsy afaka mankany izahay. Raha miaraka aminay ny zandrinay faralahy, vao hidina izahay. Fa tsy mahazo mankany amin’ilay lehilahy intsony izahay, raha tsy miaraka aminay ny zandrinay faralahy.’', 'fa hoy izahay: ‘tsy afaka mankany izahay. raha miaraka aminay ny zandrinay faralahy, vao hidina izahay. fa tsy mahazo mankany amin’ilay lehilahy intsony izahay, raha tsy miaraka aminay ny zandrinay faralahy.’'),
  ('6aadc6ff04b3a8286b9f9be2', '2026-09-18T23:19:27.550Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:27.550Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 44, 25, 'Tatỳ aoriana, dia hoy ny rainay: ‘Mandehana ianareo miverina mividy sakafo kely ho antsika.’', 'tatỳ aoriana, dia hoy ny rainay: ‘mandehana ianareo miverina mividy sakafo kely ho antsika.’'),
  ('6aadc6ff04b3a8286b9f9be1', '2026-09-18T23:19:27.550Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:27.550Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 44, 24, '“Niakatra nankany amin’ny rainay mpanomponao àry izahay, dia nolazainay taminy ny teninao, tompoko.', '“niakatra nankany amin’ny rainay mpanomponao àry izahay, dia nolazainay taminy ny teninao, tompoko.'),
  ('6aadc6ff04b3a8286b9f9be0', '2026-09-18T23:19:27.550Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:27.550Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 44, 23, 'Hoy anefa ianao tamin’ny mpanomponao: ‘Raha tsy miara-midina aminareo ilay zandrinareo faralahy, dia tsy mahazo mankatỳ amiko intsony ianareo.’', 'hoy anefa ianao tamin’ny mpanomponao: ‘raha tsy miara-midina aminareo ilay zandrinareo faralahy, dia tsy mahazo mankatỳ amiko intsony ianareo.’'),
  ('6aadc6ff04b3a8286b9f9bdf', '2026-09-18T23:19:27.550Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:27.550Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 44, 22, 'Fa hoy izahay taminao, tompoko: ‘Tsy afaka mandao ny rainy izy, fa raha mandao azy izy, dia ho faty ny rainy.’', 'fa hoy izahay taminao, tompoko: ‘tsy afaka mandao ny rainy izy, fa raha mandao azy izy, dia ho faty ny rainy.’');
INSERT INTO "bible_verses" ("id", "created_date", "updated_date", "created_by_id", "created_by", "translation", "book", "bookOrder", "chapter", "verse", "text", "normalizedText") VALUES
  ('6aadc6ff04b3a8286b9f9bde', '2026-09-18T23:19:27.550Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:27.550Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 44, 21, 'Dia hoy ianao taminay mpanomponao: ‘Ento atỳ amiko izy mba ho hitako.’', 'dia hoy ianao taminay mpanomponao: ‘ento atỳ amiko izy mba ho hitako.’'),
  ('6aadc6ff04b3a8286b9f9bdd', '2026-09-18T23:19:27.550Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:27.550Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 44, 20, 'Dia izao no nolazainay taminao, tompoko: ‘Mbola any ny rainay, ary efa be taona izy. Manana rahalahy hafa koa izahay. Izy no zandriny indrindra, ary zanaky ny rainay tao anatin’ny fahanterany izy. Efa maty kosa ny rahalahiny, dia izy irery sisa no tavela amin’ny zanaky ny reniny, ary tena tia azy ny rainy.’', 'dia izao no nolazainay taminao, tompoko: ‘mbola any ny rainay, ary efa be taona izy. manana rahalahy hafa koa izahay. izy no zandriny indrindra, ary zanaky ny rainay tao anatin’ny fahanterany izy. efa maty kosa ny rahalahiny, dia izy irery sisa no tavela amin’ny zanaky ny reniny, ary tena tia azy ny rainy.’'),
  ('6aadc6ff04b3a8286b9f9bdc', '2026-09-18T23:19:27.550Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:27.550Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 44, 19, 'Nanontanianao, tompoko, izahay mpanomponao hoe: ‘Mbola velona any ve ny rainareo, ary manana rahalahy hafa koa ve ianareo?’', 'nanontanianao, tompoko, izahay mpanomponao hoe: ‘mbola velona any ve ny rainareo, ary manana rahalahy hafa koa ve ianareo?’'),
  ('6aadc6ff04b3a8286b9f9bdb', '2026-09-18T23:19:27.550Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:27.550Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 44, 18, 'Ary nanatona azy i Joda ka niteny hoe: “Mitalaho aminao aho, tompoko ô! Mba avelao, tompoko, hiteny kely eto anatrehanao izaho mpanomponao, ary aza tezitra amin’ny mpanomponao. Hoatran’i Farao ihany mantsy ianao.', 'ary nanatona azy i joda ka niteny hoe: “mitalaho aminao aho, tompoko ô! mba avelao, tompoko, hiteny kely eto anatrehanao izaho mpanomponao, ary aza tezitra amin’ny mpanomponao. hoatran’i farao ihany mantsy ianao.'),
  ('6aadc6ff04b3a8286b9f9bda', '2026-09-18T23:19:27.550Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:27.550Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 44, 17, 'Hoy anefa i Josefa: “Sanatria ahy ny hanao an’izany! Ilay nahitana ny kaopy ihany no ho mpanompoko. Fa ny sisa aminareo kosa, miakara soa aman-tsara any amin’ny rainareo.”', 'hoy anefa i josefa: “sanatria ahy ny hanao an’izany! ilay nahitana ny kaopy ihany no ho mpanompoko. fa ny sisa aminareo kosa, miakara soa aman-tsara any amin’ny rainareo.”'),
  ('6aadc6ff04b3a8286b9f9bd9', '2026-09-18T23:19:27.550Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:27.550Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 44, 16, 'Dia hoy i Joda: “Inona moa no holazainay aminao, tompoko? Inona intsony no hoteneninay? Dia ahoana no hanaporofoanay hoe tsy diso izahay? Efa nasehon’Andriamanitra hoe diso izahay mpanomponao. Mpanomponao àry izahay, tompoko, dia izahay sy ilay nahitana ny kaopy!”', 'dia hoy i joda: “inona moa no holazainay aminao, tompoko? inona intsony no hoteneninay? dia ahoana no hanaporofoanay hoe tsy diso izahay? efa nasehon’andriamanitra hoe diso izahay mpanomponao. mpanomponao àry izahay, tompoko, dia izahay sy ilay nahitana ny kaopy!”'),
  ('6aadc6ff04b3a8286b9f9bd8', '2026-09-18T23:19:27.550Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:27.550Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 44, 15, 'Ary hoy i Josefa: “Fa inona izao nataonareo izao? Tsy fantatrareo angaha fa mahay mamantatra ny hoavy aho?”', 'ary hoy i josefa: “fa inona izao nataonareo izao? tsy fantatrareo angaha fa mahay mamantatra ny hoavy aho?”'),
  ('6aadc6ff04b3a8286b9f9bd7', '2026-09-18T23:19:27.550Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:27.550Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 44, 14, 'Rehefa niditra tao an-tranon’i Josefa i Joda sy ny rahalahiny, dia io fa mbola tao izy. Dia niankohoka tamin’ny tany teo anatrehany izy ireo.', 'rehefa niditra tao an-tranon’i josefa i joda sy ny rahalahiny, dia io fa mbola tao izy. dia niankohoka tamin’ny tany teo anatrehany izy ireo.'),
  ('6aadc6ff04b3a8286b9f9bd6', '2026-09-18T23:19:27.550Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:27.550Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 44, 13, 'Dia nandrovitra ny akanjony izy ireo, ary samy namerina ny entany teo ambony ampondrany, dia niverina tany an-tanàna.', 'dia nandrovitra ny akanjony izy ireo, ary samy namerina ny entany teo ambony ampondrany, dia niverina tany an-tanàna.'),
  ('6aadc6ff04b3a8286b9f9bd5', '2026-09-18T23:19:27.550Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:27.550Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 44, 12, 'Nikaroka tsara ilay lehilahy, dia natombony tamin’ny zokiny indrindra izany ka hatramin’ny zandriny indrindra. Farany, dia hita tao anaty gonin’i Benjamina ilay kaopy.', 'nikaroka tsara ilay lehilahy, dia natombony tamin’ny zokiny indrindra izany ka hatramin’ny zandriny indrindra. farany, dia hita tao anaty gonin’i benjamina ilay kaopy.'),
  ('6aadc6ff04b3a8286b9f9bd4', '2026-09-18T23:19:27.550Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:27.550Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 44, 11, 'Dia samy nampidina haingana ny goniny tamin’ny tany izy ireo, ka nanokatra an’izany.', 'dia samy nampidina haingana ny goniny tamin’ny tany izy ireo, ka nanokatra an’izany.'),
  ('6aadc6ff04b3a8286b9f9bd3', '2026-09-18T23:19:27.550Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:27.550Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 44, 10, 'Dia hoy ilay lehilahy: “Andao àry harahina ny teninareo, ka izay hahitana an’ilay izy no ho mpanompoko, fa ny sisa kosa tsy hanan-tsiny.”', 'dia hoy ilay lehilahy: “andao àry harahina ny teninareo, ka izay hahitana an’ilay izy no ho mpanompoko, fa ny sisa kosa tsy hanan-tsiny.”'),
  ('6aadc6ff04b3a8286b9f9bd2', '2026-09-18T23:19:27.550Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:27.550Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 44, 9, 'Aleo ho faty izay mpanomponao hahitana an’ilay izy, fa izahay kosa ho mpanompon’ny tompoko.”', 'aleo ho faty izay mpanomponao hahitana an’ilay izy, fa izahay kosa ho mpanompon’ny tompoko.”'),
  ('6aadc6ff04b3a8286b9f9bd1', '2026-09-18T23:19:27.550Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:27.550Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 44, 8, 'Ilay vola hitanay teo am-bavan’ny goninay aza nentinay avy tany Kanana dia naverinay taminao. Dia izahay ve dia hangalatra volafotsy na volamena ao an-tranon’ny tomponao?', 'ilay vola hitanay teo am-bavan’ny goninay aza nentinay avy tany kanana dia naverinay taminao. dia izahay ve dia hangalatra volafotsy na volamena ao an-tranon’ny tomponao?'),
  ('6aadc6ff04b3a8286b9f9bd0', '2026-09-18T23:19:27.550Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:27.550Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 44, 7, 'Hoy anefa izy ireo: “Fa maninona ianao, tompoko, no miteny an’izany? Sanatria anay mpanomponao ny hanao hoatr’izany!', 'hoy anefa izy ireo: “fa maninona ianao, tompoko, no miteny an’izany? sanatria anay mpanomponao ny hanao hoatr’izany!'),
  ('6aadc6ff04b3a8286b9f9bcf', '2026-09-18T23:19:27.550Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:27.550Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 44, 6, 'Dia tratrany tokoa izy ireo ka nilazany an’ireo teny ireo.', 'dia tratrany tokoa izy ireo ka nilazany an’ireo teny ireo.'),
  ('6aadc6ff04b3a8286b9f9bce', '2026-09-18T23:19:27.550Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:27.550Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 44, 5, 'Ilay kaopy lasanareo iny ange no fisotroan’ny tompoko e! Dia iny koa no ijereny fambara rehefa mamantatra ny hoavy izy. Tena ratsy izao nataonareo izao.’”', 'ilay kaopy lasanareo iny ange no fisotroan’ny tompoko e! dia iny koa no ijereny fambara rehefa mamantatra ny hoavy izy. tena ratsy izao nataonareo izao.’”'),
  ('6aadc6ff04b3a8286b9f9bcd', '2026-09-18T23:19:27.550Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:27.550Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 44, 4, 'ka niala tao an-tanàna. Mbola tsy lasa lavitra akory anefa izy ireo, dia hoy i Josefa tamin’ilay lehilahy niandraikitra ny tao an-tranony: “Mandehana enjeho ireny lehilahy ireny! Rehefa tratranao ry zareo, dia lazao aminy hoe: ‘Fa maninona ianareo no mamaly ratsy ny soa natao taminareo?', 'ka niala tao an-tanàna. mbola tsy lasa lavitra akory anefa izy ireo, dia hoy i josefa tamin’ilay lehilahy niandraikitra ny tao an-tranony: “mandehana enjeho ireny lehilahy ireny! rehefa tratranao ry zareo, dia lazao aminy hoe: ‘fa maninona ianareo no mamaly ratsy ny soa natao taminareo?'),
  ('6aadc6ff04b3a8286b9f9bcc', '2026-09-18T23:19:27.550Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:27.550Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 44, 3, 'Rehefa nazava ny andro ny ampitso maraina, dia nasaina nandeha ireo lehilahy ireo, niaraka tamin’ny ampondrany,', 'rehefa nazava ny andro ny ampitso maraina, dia nasaina nandeha ireo lehilahy ireo, niaraka tamin’ny ampondrany,'),
  ('6aadc6ff04b3a8286b9f9bcb', '2026-09-18T23:19:27.550Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:27.550Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 44, 2, 'Ataovy eo am-bavan’ny gonin’ilay zandriny indrindra kosa ny kaopiko volafotsy, miaraka amin’ny vola nividianany sakafo.” Dia nanao araka izay nolazain’i Josefa ilay lehilahy.', 'ataovy eo am-bavan’ny gonin’ilay zandriny indrindra kosa ny kaopiko volafotsy, miaraka amin’ny vola nividianany sakafo.” dia nanao araka izay nolazain’i josefa ilay lehilahy.'),
  ('6aadc6ff04b3a8286b9f9bca', '2026-09-18T23:19:27.550Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:27.550Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 44, 1, 'Taorian’izay, dia nomen’i Josefa baiko ilay lehilahy niandraikitra ny tao an-tranony hoe: “Fenoy varimbazaha araka izay zakany ny gonin’ireo lehilahy ireo, ary ataovy eo am-bavan’ny gonin’ny tsirairay ny volany.', 'taorian’izay, dia nomen’i josefa baiko ilay lehilahy niandraikitra ny tao an-tranony hoe: “fenoy varimbazaha araka izay zakany ny gonin’ireo lehilahy ireo, ary ataovy eo am-bavan’ny gonin’ny tsirairay ny volany.'),
  ('6aadc6ff04b3a8286b9f9beb', '2026-09-18T23:19:27.551Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:27.551Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 44, 34, 'Fa tsy ho vitako ny hiverina any amin’ny rainay raha tsy miaraka amiko izy. Tsy te hahita ny fahorian’ny rainay aho!”', 'fa tsy ho vitako ny hiverina any amin’ny rainay raha tsy miaraka amiko izy. tsy te hahita ny fahorian’ny rainay aho!”'),
  ('6aadc6ff04b3a8286b9f9bea', '2026-09-18T23:19:27.551Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:27.551Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 44, 33, 'Koa avelao re ny mpanomponao no hijanona ho solon’ny zandrinay mba hanompo ny tompoko e! Dia amin’izay izy ho afaka hiverina miaraka amin’ny rahalahiny.', 'koa avelao re ny mpanomponao no hijanona ho solon’ny zandrinay mba hanompo ny tompoko e! dia amin’izay izy ho afaka hiverina miaraka amin’ny rahalahiny.'),
  ('6aadc6ff04b3a8286b9f9be9', '2026-09-18T23:19:27.551Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:27.551Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 44, 32, 'Fa izaho mpanomponao no niantoka an’io zandrinay io tamin’ny rainay, hoe: ‘Raha tsy entiko miverina atỳ aminao izy, dia ho fahotako aminao mandrakizay izany.’', 'fa izaho mpanomponao no niantoka an’io zandrinay io tamin’ny rainay, hoe: ‘raha tsy entiko miverina atỳ aminao izy, dia ho fahotako aminao mandrakizay izany.’'),
  ('6aadc6ff04b3a8286b9f9be8', '2026-09-18T23:19:27.551Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:27.551Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 44, 31, 'dia ho faty ny rainay raha vao hitany fa tsy eo io zandrinay io. Dia hidina amin’alahelo any amin’ny Fasana ny rainay mpanomponao noho ny ataonay mpanomponao, amin’izao izy efa fotsy volo izao.', 'dia ho faty ny rainay raha vao hitany fa tsy eo io zandrinay io. dia hidina amin’alahelo any amin’ny fasana ny rainay mpanomponao noho ny ataonay mpanomponao, amin’izao izy efa fotsy volo izao.'),
  ('6aadc6ff04b3a8286b9f9be7', '2026-09-18T23:19:27.551Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:27.551Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 44, 30, '“Koa raha miverina any amin’ny rainay mpanomponao aho ka tsy miaraka aminay io zandrinay io, nefa ny rainay tena miraiki-po be aminy,', '“koa raha miverina any amin’ny rainay mpanomponao aho ka tsy miaraka aminay io zandrinay io, nefa ny rainay tena miraiki-po be aminy,'),
  ('6aadc6ff04b3a8286b9f9be6', '2026-09-18T23:19:27.551Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:27.551Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 44, 29, 'Raha esorinareo amiko koa ity iray ity ka tratran’ny loza any dia maty, dia hidina amin’alahelo any amin’ny Fasana aho noho ny ataonareo, amin’izao izaho efa fotsy volo izao.’', 'raha esorinareo amiko koa ity iray ity ka tratran’ny loza any dia maty, dia hidina amin’alahelo any amin’ny fasana aho noho ny ataonareo, amin’izao izaho efa fotsy volo izao.’'),
  ('6aadc6ff04b3a8286b9f9be5', '2026-09-18T23:19:27.551Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:27.551Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 44, 28, 'Tafasaraka tamiko anefa ny iray, dia hoy aho: “Tena noviravirain’ny bibidia tokoa izy!” Ary tsy hitako izy hatramin’izao.', 'tafasaraka tamiko anefa ny iray, dia hoy aho: “tena noviravirain’ny bibidia tokoa izy!” ary tsy hitako izy hatramin’izao.'),
  ('6aadc6ff04b3a8286b9f9be4', '2026-09-18T23:19:27.551Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:27.551Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 44, 27, 'Dia hoy ny rainay mpanomponao taminay: ‘Fantatrareo tsara fa roa lahy fotsiny no nateraky ny vadiko tamiko.', 'dia hoy ny rainay mpanomponao taminay: ‘fantatrareo tsara fa roa lahy fotsiny no nateraky ny vadiko tamiko.'),
  ('6aadc6ff8e63a7c5cee762f0', '2026-09-18T23:19:27.924Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:27.924Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 45, 28, 'Dia hoy i Israely: “Aoka izay! Hay mbola velona any i Josefa zanako! Mila mankany aminy sy mahita azy aho alohan’ny hahafatesako!”', 'dia hoy i israely: “aoka izay! hay mbola velona any i josefa zanako! mila mankany aminy sy mahita azy aho alohan’ny hahafatesako!”'),
  ('6aadc6ff8e63a7c5cee762ef', '2026-09-18T23:19:27.924Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:27.924Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 45, 27, 'Dia notantarain’izy ireo tamin’i Jakoba rainy daholo ny tenin’i Josefa, ary hitany koa ny sarety nalefan’i Josefa hitondrana azy. Koa velombelona indray i Jakoba.', 'dia notantarain’izy ireo tamin’i jakoba rainy daholo ny tenin’i josefa, ary hitany koa ny sarety nalefan’i josefa hitondrana azy. koa velombelona indray i jakoba.'),
  ('6aadc6ff8e63a7c5cee762ee', '2026-09-18T23:19:27.924Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:27.924Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 45, 26, 'Ary hoy izy ireo taminy: “Mbola velona any i Josefa, sady izy no mpitondra an’i Ejipta manontolo!” Tsy nampihontsina an’i Jakoba anefa izany, satria tsy nino azy ireo izy.', 'ary hoy izy ireo taminy: “mbola velona any i josefa, sady izy no mpitondra an’i ejipta manontolo!” tsy nampihontsina an’i jakoba anefa izany, satria tsy nino azy ireo izy.'),
  ('6aadc6ff8e63a7c5cee762ed', '2026-09-18T23:19:27.924Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:27.924Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 45, 25, 'Dia niakatra avy tany Ejipta izy ireo, ka tonga tany amin’i Jakoba rainy tany Kanana.', 'dia niakatra avy tany ejipta izy ireo, ka tonga tany amin’i jakoba rainy tany kanana.'),
  ('6aadc6ff8e63a7c5cee762ec', '2026-09-18T23:19:27.924Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:27.924Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 45, 24, 'Dia nalefany nandeha ny rahalahiny, ka lasa. Hoy koa izy tamin’ireo: “Aza mifampila vaniny ianareo eny an-dalana eny.”', 'dia nalefany nandeha ny rahalahiny, ka lasa. hoy koa izy tamin’ireo: “aza mifampila vaniny ianareo eny an-dalana eny.”'),
  ('6aadc6ff8e63a7c5cee762eb', '2026-09-18T23:19:27.924Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:27.924Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 45, 23, 'Ireto kosa no nampitondrainy ho an’ny rainy: Ampondra folo nitondra zavatra tsara avy tany Ejipta, sy ampondravavy folo nitondra varimbazaha sy mofo ary sakafo ho vatsin’ny rainy eny an-dalana.', 'ireto kosa no nampitondrainy ho an’ny rainy: ampondra folo nitondra zavatra tsara avy tany ejipta, sy ampondravavy folo nitondra varimbazaha sy mofo ary sakafo ho vatsin’ny rainy eny an-dalana.'),
  ('6aadc6ff8e63a7c5cee762ea', '2026-09-18T23:19:27.924Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:27.924Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 45, 22, 'Ary samy nomeny akanjo vaovao iray avy izy ireo, fa i Benjamina kosa nomeny volafotsy 300 sekely sy akanjo vaovao dimy.', 'ary samy nomeny akanjo vaovao iray avy izy ireo, fa i benjamina kosa nomeny volafotsy 300 sekely sy akanjo vaovao dimy.'),
  ('6aadc6ff8e63a7c5cee762e9', '2026-09-18T23:19:27.924Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:27.924Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 45, 21, 'Dia nataon’ny zanak’i Israely izany. Ary nomen’i Josefa sarety izy ireo araka ny baikon’i Farao, sady nomeny vatsy hohaniny eny an-dalana.', 'dia nataon’ny zanak’i israely izany. ary nomen’i josefa sarety izy ireo araka ny baikon’i farao, sady nomeny vatsy hohaniny eny an-dalana.'),
  ('6aadc6ff8e63a7c5cee762e8', '2026-09-18T23:19:27.924Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:27.924Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 45, 20, 'Aza manahy momba ny fanananareo, satria anareo izay tsara indrindra eran’i Ejipta.’”', 'aza manahy momba ny fanananareo, satria anareo izay tsara indrindra eran’i ejipta.’”'),
  ('6aadc6ff8e63a7c5cee762e7', '2026-09-18T23:19:27.924Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:27.924Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 45, 19, 'Teneno koa ry zareo hoe: ‘Izao atao: Makà sarety avy eto Ejipta mba hitondrana ny vady aman-janakareo, ary ento amin’ny iray amin’ireny ny rainareo dia tongava atỳ.', 'teneno koa ry zareo hoe: ‘izao atao: makà sarety avy eto ejipta mba hitondrana ny vady aman-janakareo, ary ento amin’ny iray amin’ireny ny rainareo dia tongava atỳ.'),
  ('6aadc6ff8e63a7c5cee762e6', '2026-09-18T23:19:27.924Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:27.924Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 45, 18, 'Alaivo ny rainareo sy ny ankohonanareo ka tongava atỳ amiko, fa homeko anareo izay zavatra tsara eto Ejipta. Dia hihinana an’izay tsara indrindra eto ianareo.’', 'alaivo ny rainareo sy ny ankohonanareo ka tongava atỳ amiko, fa homeko anareo izay zavatra tsara eto ejipta. dia hihinana an’izay tsara indrindra eto ianareo.’'),
  ('6aadc6ff8e63a7c5cee762e5', '2026-09-18T23:19:27.924Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:27.924Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 45, 17, 'Hoy àry i Farao tamin’i Josefa: “Teneno ny rahalahinao hoe: ‘Izao atao: Makà biby mpitondra entana hitondra ny entanareo, dia mandehana any Kanana.', 'hoy àry i farao tamin’i josefa: “teneno ny rahalahinao hoe: ‘izao atao: makà biby mpitondra entana hitondra ny entanareo, dia mandehana any kanana.'),
  ('6aadc6ff8e63a7c5cee762e4', '2026-09-18T23:19:27.924Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:27.924Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 45, 16, 'Ary henon’ny tao an-tranon’i Farao ny vaovao hoe: “Tonga ao, hono, ny rahalahin’i Josefa!” Dia nahafaly an’i Farao sy ny mpanompony izany.', 'ary henon’ny tao an-tranon’i farao ny vaovao hoe: “tonga ao, hono, ny rahalahin’i josefa!” dia nahafaly an’i farao sy ny mpanompony izany.'),
  ('6aadc6ff8e63a7c5cee762e3', '2026-09-18T23:19:27.924Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:27.924Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 45, 15, 'Nanoroka ny rahalahiny rehetra koa izy ka nitomany sady namihina azy ireo. Dia izay ny rahalahiny vao niresaka taminy.', 'nanoroka ny rahalahiny rehetra koa izy ka nitomany sady namihina azy ireo. dia izay ny rahalahiny vao niresaka taminy.'),
  ('6aadc6ff8e63a7c5cee762e2', '2026-09-18T23:19:27.924Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:27.924Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 45, 14, 'Ary namihina an’i Benjamina rahalahiny izy ka nitomany. I Benjamina koa nitomany sady namihina ny vozony.', 'ary namihina an’i benjamina rahalahiny izy ka nitomany. i benjamina koa nitomany sady namihina ny vozony.'),
  ('6aadc6ff8e63a7c5cee762e1', '2026-09-18T23:19:27.924Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:27.924Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 45, 13, 'Tantarao amin’i Dada àry ny voninahitro rehetra atỳ Ejipta sy izay rehetra hitanareo. Ary ento midina atỳ haingana i Dada.”', 'tantarao amin’i dada àry ny voninahitro rehetra atỳ ejipta sy izay rehetra hitanareo. ary ento midina atỳ haingana i dada.”'),
  ('6aadc6ff8e63a7c5cee762e0', '2026-09-18T23:19:27.924Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:27.924Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 45, 12, 'Ny masonareo sy Benjamina rahalahiko mihitsy izao no mahita fa tena izaho ity miteny aminareo ity.', 'ny masonareo sy benjamina rahalahiko mihitsy izao no mahita fa tena izaho ity miteny aminareo ity.'),
  ('6aadc6ff8e63a7c5cee762df', '2026-09-18T23:19:27.924Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:27.924Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 45, 11, 'Izaho no hamatsy sakafo anao ao, dia ianao sy ny ao an-tranonao ary izay rehetra anananao. Sao ianareo tsy hanana na inona na inona intsony ary ho fatin’ny mosary. Mbola haharitra dimy taona mantsy ny mosary.”’', 'izaho no hamatsy sakafo anao ao, dia ianao sy ny ao an-tranonao ary izay rehetra anananao. sao ianareo tsy hanana na inona na inona intsony ary ho fatin’ny mosary. mbola haharitra dimy taona mantsy ny mosary.”’'),
  ('6aadc6ff8e63a7c5cee762de', '2026-09-18T23:19:27.924Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:27.924Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 45, 10, 'Mahazo mipetraka ao Gosena ianao, dia mba eo akaikiko eo foana ianao, sy ny zanaka aman-jafinao, sy ny ondrinao, sy ny ombinao, ary izay rehetra anananao.', 'mahazo mipetraka ao gosena ianao, dia mba eo akaikiko eo foana ianao, sy ny zanaka aman-jafinao, sy ny ondrinao, sy ny ombinao, ary izay rehetra anananao.'),
  ('6aadc6ff8e63a7c5cee762dd', '2026-09-18T23:19:27.924Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:27.924Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 45, 9, '“Miverena haingana any amin’i Dada, dia teneno izy hoe: ‘Izao no nolazain’i Josefa zanakao: “Efa notendren’Andriamanitra hanam-pahefana amin’i Ejipta manontolo aho. Koa midìna atỳ amiko, fa aza mangataka andro.', '“miverena haingana any amin’i dada, dia teneno izy hoe: ‘izao no nolazain’i josefa zanakao: “efa notendren’andriamanitra hanam-pahefana amin’i ejipta manontolo aho. koa midìna atỳ amiko, fa aza mangataka andro.'),
  ('6aadc6ff8e63a7c5cee762dc', '2026-09-18T23:19:27.924Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:27.924Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 45, 8, 'Tsy ianareo àry no nandefa ahy tatỳ fa Andriamanitra. Tiany hotendrena ho lehiben’ny mpanolo-tsain’i Farao mantsy aho, sady hanam-pahefana amin’ny ao an-tranony rehetra ary ho mpitondra an’i Ejipta manontolo.', 'tsy ianareo àry no nandefa ahy tatỳ fa andriamanitra. tiany hotendrena ho lehiben’ny mpanolo-tsain’i farao mantsy aho, sady hanam-pahefana amin’ny ao an-tranony rehetra ary ho mpitondra an’i ejipta manontolo.'),
  ('6aadc6ff8e63a7c5cee762db', '2026-09-18T23:19:27.924Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:27.924Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 45, 7, 'Nalefan’Andriamanitra hialoha anareo anefa aho, mba tsy ho lany taranaka eto ambonin’ny tany ianareo, ary mba hovonjeny amin’ny fomba mahagaga ka tsy ho faty.', 'nalefan’andriamanitra hialoha anareo anefa aho, mba tsy ho lany taranaka eto ambonin’ny tany ianareo, ary mba hovonjeny amin’ny fomba mahagaga ka tsy ho faty.'),
  ('6aadc6ff8e63a7c5cee762da', '2026-09-18T23:19:27.924Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:27.924Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 45, 6, 'Roa taona amin’ity izao no nisian’ny mosary, ary ao anatin’ny dimy taona koa mbola tsy hiasa tany na hijinja ny olona.', 'roa taona amin’ity izao no nisian’ny mosary, ary ao anatin’ny dimy taona koa mbola tsy hiasa tany na hijinja ny olona.'),
  ('6aadc6ff8e63a7c5cee762d9', '2026-09-18T23:19:27.924Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:27.924Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 45, 5, 'Aza matahotra anefa, ary aza mifanome tsiny satria hoe nivarotra ahy ianareo. Fa hamonjy aina no nandefasan’Andriamanitra ahy hialoha anareo atỳ.', 'aza matahotra anefa, ary aza mifanome tsiny satria hoe nivarotra ahy ianareo. fa hamonjy aina no nandefasan’andriamanitra ahy hialoha anareo atỳ.'),
  ('6aadc6ff8e63a7c5cee762d8', '2026-09-18T23:19:27.924Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:27.924Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 45, 4, 'Ary hoy i Josefa: “Avia eto akaikiko e!” Dia nankeo aminy izy ireo. Hoy izy avy eo: “Izaho ange ilay Josefa rahalahinareo e, ilay namidinareo ho atỳ Ejipta!', 'ary hoy i josefa: “avia eto akaikiko e!” dia nankeo aminy izy ireo. hoy izy avy eo: “izaho ange ilay josefa rahalahinareo e, ilay namidinareo ho atỳ ejipta!'),
  ('6aadc6ff8e63a7c5cee762d7', '2026-09-18T23:19:27.924Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:27.924Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 45, 3, 'Farany, dia hoy i Josefa tamin’ny rahalahiny: “Izaho ange no Josefa e! Mbola velona any ve i Dada?” Tsy nahateny mihitsy anefa ny rahalahiny, satria taitra be.', 'farany, dia hoy i josefa tamin’ny rahalahiny: “izaho ange no josefa e! mbola velona any ve i dada?” tsy nahateny mihitsy anefa ny rahalahiny, satria taitra be.'),
  ('6aadc6ff8e63a7c5cee762d6', '2026-09-18T23:19:27.924Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:27.924Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 45, 2, 'Ary nigogogogo nitomany izy ka henon’ny Ejipsianina, sady henon’ny tao an-tranon’i Farao.', 'ary nigogogogo nitomany izy ka henon’ny ejipsianina, sady henon’ny tao an-tranon’i farao.'),
  ('6aadc6ff8e63a7c5cee762d5', '2026-09-18T23:19:27.924Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:27.924Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 45, 1, 'Ary tsy nahafehy ny fihetseham-pony intsony i Josefa, teo anatrehan’ny mpanompony rehetra teo. Dia hoy izy: “Avoahy daholo ny olona rehetra!” Koa tsy nisy olon-kafa intsony teo, rehefa nampahafantatra ny tenany tamin’ny rahalahiny izy.', 'ary tsy nahafehy ny fihetseham-pony intsony i josefa, teo anatrehan’ny mpanompony rehetra teo. dia hoy izy: “avoahy daholo ny olona rehetra!” koa tsy nisy olon-kafa intsony teo, rehefa nampahafantatra ny tenany tamin’ny rahalahiny izy.'),
  ('6aadc700a12595f5fd5d930d', '2026-09-18T23:19:28.292Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:28.292Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 46, 34, 'dia lazao hoe: ‘Efa mpiompy foana izahay mpanomponao hatramin’ny fahazazanay ka hatramin’izao, na izahay na ny razambenay.’ Amin’izay ianareo ho afaka hipetraka eto Gosena, satria maharikoriko amin’ny Ejipsianina ny mpiandry ondry rehetra.”', 'dia lazao hoe: ‘efa mpiompy foana izahay mpanomponao hatramin’ny fahazazanay ka hatramin’izao, na izahay na ny razambenay.’ amin’izay ianareo ho afaka hipetraka eto gosena, satria maharikoriko amin’ny ejipsianina ny mpiandry ondry rehetra.”'),
  ('6aadc700a12595f5fd5d930c', '2026-09-18T23:19:28.292Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:28.292Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 46, 33, 'Rehefa mampiantso anareo àry i Farao ka manontany hoe: ‘Inona no asanareo?’,', 'rehefa mampiantso anareo àry i farao ka manontany hoe: ‘inona no asanareo?’,'),
  ('6aadc700a12595f5fd5d930b', '2026-09-18T23:19:28.292Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:28.292Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 46, 32, 'Mpiandry ondry ry zareo sady mpiompy. Ary nentiny atỳ ny ondriny sy ny ombiny ary ny fananany rehetra.’', 'mpiandry ondry ry zareo sady mpiompy. ary nentiny atỳ ny ondriny sy ny ombiny ary ny fananany rehetra.’'),
  ('6aadc700a12595f5fd5d930a', '2026-09-18T23:19:28.292Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:28.292Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 46, 31, 'Ary hoy i Josefa tamin’ny rahalahiny sy ny ankohonan-drainy: “Aleo aho hiakatra hilaza amin’i Farao hoe: ‘Efa tonga atỳ amiko ny rahalahiko sy ny ankohonan-draiko tany Kanana.', 'ary hoy i josefa tamin’ny rahalahiny sy ny ankohonan-drainy: “aleo aho hiakatra hilaza amin’i farao hoe: ‘efa tonga atỳ amiko ny rahalahiko sy ny ankohonan-draiko tany kanana.'),
  ('6aadc700a12595f5fd5d9309', '2026-09-18T23:19:28.292Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:28.292Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 46, 30, 'Dia hoy i Israely tamin’i Josefa: “Tsy maninona intsony na ho faty aza aho. Efa nahita anao mantsy aho, sady fantatro hoe mbola velona ihany ianao!”', 'dia hoy i israely tamin’i josefa: “tsy maninona intsony na ho faty aza aho. efa nahita anao mantsy aho, sady fantatro hoe mbola velona ihany ianao!”'),
  ('6aadc700a12595f5fd5d9308', '2026-09-18T23:19:28.292Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:28.292Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 46, 29, 'dia efa nasain’i Josefa nomanina ny kalesiny, ka niakatra hitsena an’i Israely rainy tany Gosena izy. Rehefa nampahafantatra ny tenany i Josefa, dia tonga dia namihina ny rainy izy, ka nitomany elaela teo.', 'dia efa nasain’i josefa nomanina ny kalesiny, ka niakatra hitsena an’i israely rainy tany gosena izy. rehefa nampahafantatra ny tenany i josefa, dia tonga dia namihina ny rainy izy, ka nitomany elaela teo.'),
  ('6aadc700a12595f5fd5d9307', '2026-09-18T23:19:28.292Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:28.292Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 46, 28, 'Ary nirahin’i Jakoba nandeha mialoha i Joda, dia nasainy nilaza tamin’i Josefa hoe efa eny an-dalana ho any Gosena izy. Tamin’izy ireo tonga tany Gosena àry,', 'ary nirahin’i jakoba nandeha mialoha i joda, dia nasainy nilaza tamin’i josefa hoe efa eny an-dalana ho any gosena izy. tamin’izy ireo tonga tany gosena àry,'),
  ('6aadc700a12595f5fd5d9306', '2026-09-18T23:19:28.292Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:28.292Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 46, 27, 'Ary roa lahy ny zanak’i Josefa naterany tany Ejipta. Nisy 70 àry ny olona rehetra tao amin’ny ankohonan’i Jakoba tonga tany Ejipta.', 'ary roa lahy ny zanak’i josefa naterany tany ejipta. nisy 70 àry ny olona rehetra tao amin’ny ankohonan’i jakoba tonga tany ejipta.'),
  ('6aadc700a12595f5fd5d9305', '2026-09-18T23:19:28.292Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:28.292Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 46, 26, 'Nisy 66 ny olona rehetra naterak’i Jakoba, izay niaraka taminy nankany Ejipta, ankoatra ny vadin’ireo zanany lahy.', 'nisy 66 ny olona rehetra naterak’i jakoba, izay niaraka taminy nankany ejipta, ankoatra ny vadin’ireo zanany lahy.'),
  ('6aadc700a12595f5fd5d9304', '2026-09-18T23:19:28.292Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:28.292Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 46, 25, 'Ireo no zanakalahin’i Bilaha, ilay mpanompovavy nomen’i Labana an’i Rahely zanany vavy. Ireo no naterany tamin’i Jakoba. Fito izy rehetra.', 'ireo no zanakalahin’i bilaha, ilay mpanompovavy nomen’i labana an’i rahely zanany vavy. ireo no naterany tamin’i jakoba. fito izy rehetra.'),
  ('6aadc700a12595f5fd5d9303', '2026-09-18T23:19:28.292Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:28.292Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 46, 24, 'Ny zanakalahin’i Naftaly dia i Jazila, Gony, Jezera, ary Silema.', 'ny zanakalahin’i naftaly dia i jazila, gony, jezera, ary silema.'),
  ('6aadc700a12595f5fd5d9302', '2026-09-18T23:19:28.292Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:28.292Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 46, 23, 'Ny zanakalahin’i Dana dia i Hosima.', 'ny zanakalahin’i dana dia i hosima.'),
  ('6aadc700a12595f5fd5d9301', '2026-09-18T23:19:28.292Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:28.292Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 46, 22, 'Ireo no zanakalahin’i Rahely naterany tamin’i Jakoba. Nisy 14 izy rehetra.', 'ireo no zanakalahin’i rahely naterany tamin’i jakoba. nisy 14 izy rehetra.'),
  ('6aadc700a12595f5fd5d9300', '2026-09-18T23:19:28.292Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:28.292Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 46, 21, 'Ny zanakalahin’i Benjamina dia i Bela, Bekera, Asbela, Gera, Namàna, Ehy, Rosy, Mopima, Hopima, ary Arda.', 'ny zanakalahin’i benjamina dia i bela, bekera, asbela, gera, namàna, ehy, rosy, mopima, hopima, ary arda.'),
  ('6aadc700a12595f5fd5d92ff', '2026-09-18T23:19:28.292Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:28.292Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 46, 20, 'Ny naterak’i Josefa tany Ejipta dia i Manase sy Efraima, izay naterak’i Asenata taminy. Zanakavavin’i Potifera mpisorona tao Ona io Asenata io.', 'ny naterak’i josefa tany ejipta dia i manase sy efraima, izay naterak’i asenata taminy. zanakavavin’i potifera mpisorona tao ona io asenata io.'),
  ('6aadc700a12595f5fd5d92fe', '2026-09-18T23:19:28.292Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:28.292Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 46, 19, 'Ny zanakalahin’i Rahely vadin’i Jakoba dia i Josefa sy Benjamina.', 'ny zanakalahin’i rahely vadin’i jakoba dia i josefa sy benjamina.'),
  ('6aadc700a12595f5fd5d92fd', '2026-09-18T23:19:28.292Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:28.292Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 46, 18, 'Ireo no zanakalahin’i Zilpa, ilay mpanompovavy nomen’i Labana an’i Lea zanany vavy. Ireo no naterany tamin’i Jakoba. Nisy 16 izy rehetra.', 'ireo no zanakalahin’i zilpa, ilay mpanompovavy nomen’i labana an’i lea zanany vavy. ireo no naterany tamin’i jakoba. nisy 16 izy rehetra.'),
  ('6aadc700a12595f5fd5d92fc', '2026-09-18T23:19:28.292Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:28.292Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 46, 17, 'Ny zanakalahin’i Asera dia i Jimna, Jisva, Jisvy, ary Beria. I Sera no anabavin’izy ireo. Ny zanakalahin’i Beria dia i Hebera sy Malkiela.', 'ny zanakalahin’i asera dia i jimna, jisva, jisvy, ary beria. i sera no anabavin’izy ireo. ny zanakalahin’i beria dia i hebera sy malkiela.'),
  ('6aadc700a12595f5fd5d92fb', '2026-09-18T23:19:28.292Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:28.292Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 46, 16, 'Ny zanakalahin’i Gada dia i Zifiona, Hagy, Sony, Ezbona, Ery, Aroda, ary Arely.', 'ny zanakalahin’i gada dia i zifiona, hagy, sony, ezbona, ery, aroda, ary arely.'),
  ('6aadc700a12595f5fd5d92fa', '2026-09-18T23:19:28.292Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:28.292Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 46, 15, 'Ireo no zanakalahin’i Lea naterany tamin’i Jakoba tany Padana-arama, ankoatra an’i Dina zanany vavy. Nisy 33 ny taranany rehetra avy amin’i Lea.', 'ireo no zanakalahin’i lea naterany tamin’i jakoba tany padana-arama, ankoatra an’i dina zanany vavy. nisy 33 ny taranany rehetra avy amin’i lea.'),
  ('6aadc700a12595f5fd5d92f9', '2026-09-18T23:19:28.292Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:28.292Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 46, 14, 'Ny zanakalahin’i Zebolona dia i Sereda sy Elona ary Jahalela.', 'ny zanakalahin’i zebolona dia i sereda sy elona ary jahalela.'),
  ('6aadc700a12595f5fd5d92f8', '2026-09-18T23:19:28.292Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:28.292Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 46, 13, 'Ny zanakalahin’i Isakara dia i Tola, Pova, Joba, ary Simrona.', 'ny zanakalahin’i isakara dia i tola, pova, joba, ary simrona.'),
  ('6aadc700a12595f5fd5d92f7', '2026-09-18T23:19:28.292Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:28.292Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 46, 12, 'Ny zanakalahin’i Joda dia i Era, Onana, Sela, Pereza, ary Zera. Maty tany Kanana anefa i Era sy Onana. Ny zanakalahin’i Pereza dia i Hezrona sy Hamola.', 'ny zanakalahin’i joda dia i era, onana, sela, pereza, ary zera. maty tany kanana anefa i era sy onana. ny zanakalahin’i pereza dia i hezrona sy hamola.'),
  ('6aadc700a12595f5fd5d92f6', '2026-09-18T23:19:28.292Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:28.292Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 46, 11, 'Ny zanakalahin’i Levy dia i Gersona sy Kehata ary Merary.', 'ny zanakalahin’i levy dia i gersona sy kehata ary merary.'),
  ('6aadc700a12595f5fd5d92f5', '2026-09-18T23:19:28.292Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:28.292Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 46, 10, 'Ny zanakalahin’i Simeona dia i Jemoela, Jamina, Ohada, Jakina, Zohara, ary Saoly zanakalahin’ny vehivavy kananita.', 'ny zanakalahin’i simeona dia i jemoela, jamina, ohada, jakina, zohara, ary saoly zanakalahin’ny vehivavy kananita.'),
  ('6aadc700a12595f5fd5d92f4', '2026-09-18T23:19:28.292Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:28.292Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 46, 9, 'Ny zanakalahin’i Robena dia i Hanoka, Palo, Hezrona, ary Karmy.', 'ny zanakalahin’i robena dia i hanoka, palo, hezrona, ary karmy.'),
  ('6aadc700a12595f5fd5d92f3', '2026-09-18T23:19:28.292Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:28.292Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 46, 8, 'Ireto avy ny anaran’ny zanak’i Israely tonga tany Ejipta, dia ny anaran’ny zanak’i Jakoba: I Robena no lahimatoan’i Jakoba.', 'ireto avy ny anaran’ny zanak’i israely tonga tany ejipta, dia ny anaran’ny zanak’i jakoba: i robena no lahimatoan’i jakoba.'),
  ('6aadc700a12595f5fd5d92f2', '2026-09-18T23:19:28.292Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:28.292Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 46, 7, 'Ary nentiny niaraka taminy nankany Ejipta ny zanany lahy sy ny zanany vavy ary ny zafikeliny rehetra, izany hoe ny fianakaviany rehetra.', 'ary nentiny niaraka taminy nankany ejipta ny zanany lahy sy ny zanany vavy ary ny zafikeliny rehetra, izany hoe ny fianakaviany rehetra.'),
  ('6aadc700a12595f5fd5d92f1', '2026-09-18T23:19:28.292Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:28.292Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 46, 6, 'Nentin’izy ireo koa ny biby fiompiny sy ny fananana voangony tany Kanana. Dia tonga tany Ejipta i Jakoba sy ny fianakaviany rehetra niaraka taminy.', 'nentin’izy ireo koa ny biby fiompiny sy ny fananana voangony tany kanana. dia tonga tany ejipta i jakoba sy ny fianakaviany rehetra niaraka taminy.'),
  ('6aadc700a12595f5fd5d92f0', '2026-09-18T23:19:28.292Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:28.292Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 46, 5, 'Taorian’izay, dia niala tao Beri-sheba i Jakoba. Ary nentin’ny zanak’i Israely tamin’ny sarety nalefan’i Farao hitondrana azy i Jakoba rainy sy ny zanak’izy ireo ary ny vadin’izy ireo.', 'taorian’izay, dia niala tao beri-sheba i jakoba. ary nentin’ny zanak’i israely tamin’ny sarety nalefan’i farao hitondrana azy i jakoba rainy sy ny zanak’izy ireo ary ny vadin’izy ireo.'),
  ('6aadc700a12595f5fd5d92ef', '2026-09-18T23:19:28.292Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:28.292Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 46, 4, 'Izaho mihitsy no hidina hiaraka aminao any Ejipta, ary izaho koa no hitondra anao hiverina avy any. Ny tanan’i Josefa no hanakimpy ny masonao rehefa maty ianao.”', 'izaho mihitsy no hidina hiaraka aminao any ejipta, ary izaho koa no hitondra anao hiverina avy any. ny tanan’i josefa no hanakimpy ny masonao rehefa maty ianao.”'),
  ('6aadc700a12595f5fd5d92ee', '2026-09-18T23:19:28.292Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:28.292Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 46, 3, 'Ary hoy Andriamanitra: “Izaho no tena Andriamanitra, ilay Andriamanitry ny rainao. Aza matahotra ny hidina any Ejipta, fa hataoko firenena lehibe ianao rehefa any.', 'ary hoy andriamanitra: “izaho no tena andriamanitra, ilay andriamanitry ny rainao. aza matahotra ny hidina any ejipta, fa hataoko firenena lehibe ianao rehefa any.'),
  ('6aadc700a12595f5fd5d92ed', '2026-09-18T23:19:28.292Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:28.292Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 46, 2, 'Dia niteny tamin’i Israely, tao amin’ny fahitana tamin’ny alina, Andriamanitra hoe: “Jakoba, Jakoba!” Dia hoy izy: “Intỳ aho, tompoko!”', 'dia niteny tamin’i israely, tao amin’ny fahitana tamin’ny alina, andriamanitra hoe: “jakoba, jakoba!” dia hoy izy: “intỳ aho, tompoko!”'),
  ('6aadc700a12595f5fd5d92ec', '2026-09-18T23:19:28.292Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:28.292Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 46, 1, 'Dia nentin’i Israely ny ankohonany sy ny fananany rehetra ka niainga izy. Ary nanao sorona ho an’ilay Andriamanitr’i Isaka rainy izy rehefa tonga tao Beri-sheba.', 'dia nentin’i israely ny ankohonany sy ny fananany rehetra ka niainga izy. ary nanao sorona ho an’ilay andriamanitr’i isaka rainy izy rehefa tonga tao beri-sheba.'),
  ('6aadc70066c1fe040997ef84', '2026-09-18T23:19:28.676Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:28.676Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 47, 31, 'Hoy izy avy eo: “Mianiàna amiko àry.” Dia nianiana taminy i Josefa. Ary niankohoka teo an-doham-pandrianany i Israely.', 'hoy izy avy eo: “mianiàna amiko àry.” dia nianiana taminy i josefa. ary niankohoka teo an-doham-pandrianany i israely.'),
  ('6aadc70066c1fe040997ef83', '2026-09-18T23:19:28.676Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:28.676Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 47, 30, 'Rehefa maty aho, dia ento hiala eto Ejipta, ary aleveno any amin’ny fasan’ny razambeko.” Dia hoy i Josefa: “Ao fa tena hotanterahiko tsara izany teninao izany.”', 'rehefa maty aho, dia ento hiala eto ejipta, ary aleveno any amin’ny fasan’ny razambeko.” dia hoy i josefa: “ao fa tena hotanterahiko tsara izany teninao izany.”'),
  ('6aadc70066c1fe040997ef82', '2026-09-18T23:19:28.676Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:28.676Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 47, 29, 'Rehefa akaiky ho faty i Israely, dia nantsoiny i Josefa zanany ka noteneniny hoe: “Raha mba mety aminao, dia ataovy ato ambany feko ny tananao. Dia asehoy hoe tena tia ahy ianao sady tsy mivadika amiko, ary hitana ny teninao amiko. Miangavy anao aho mba tsy handevina ahy eto Ejipta.', 'rehefa akaiky ho faty i israely, dia nantsoiny i josefa zanany ka noteneniny hoe: “raha mba mety aminao, dia ataovy ato ambany feko ny tananao. dia asehoy hoe tena tia ahy ianao sady tsy mivadika amiko, ary hitana ny teninao amiko. miangavy anao aho mba tsy handevina ahy eto ejipta.'),
  ('6aadc70066c1fe040997ef81', '2026-09-18T23:19:28.676Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:28.676Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 47, 28, 'Ary mbola velona 17 taona tany Ejipta i Jakoba, ka 147 taona ny andro niainany.', 'ary mbola velona 17 taona tany ejipta i jakoba, ka 147 taona ny andro niainany.'),
  ('6aadc70066c1fe040997ef80', '2026-09-18T23:19:28.676Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:28.676Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 47, 27, 'Ary nipetraka ela be tao Gosena, tany Ejipta, ny Israely. Nanangona fananana tao koa izy ireo, dia niteraka ka lasa be dia be mihitsy.', 'ary nipetraka ela be tao gosena, tany ejipta, ny israely. nanangona fananana tao koa izy ireo, dia niteraka ka lasa be dia be mihitsy.'),
  ('6aadc70066c1fe040997ef7f', '2026-09-18T23:19:28.676Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:28.676Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 47, 26, 'Dia namoaka didy i Josefa hoe ho lasan’i Farao ny ampahadimin’ny tany. Mbola manan-kery any Ejipta izany didy izany hatramin’izao. Ny tanin’ny mpisorona ihany no tsy mba lasan’i Farao.', 'dia namoaka didy i josefa hoe ho lasan’i farao ny ampahadimin’ny tany. mbola manan-kery any ejipta izany didy izany hatramin’izao. ny tanin’ny mpisorona ihany no tsy mba lasan’i farao.'),
  ('6aadc70066c1fe040997ef7e', '2026-09-18T23:19:28.676Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:28.676Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 47, 25, 'Dia hoy izy ireo: “Efa namonjy ny ainay ianao. Raha sitraky ny tompoko, dia aleo izahay ho mpanompon’i Farao.”', 'dia hoy izy ireo: “efa namonjy ny ainay ianao. raha sitraky ny tompoko, dia aleo izahay ho mpanompon’i farao.”'),
  ('6aadc70066c1fe040997ef7d', '2026-09-18T23:19:28.676Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:28.676Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 47, 24, 'Rehefa miakatra ny vokatra, dia omeo an’i Farao ny ampahadiminy. Ny ambiny kosa hataonareo masomboly eny an-tsaha, sy ho sakafonareo sy izay ao an-tranonareo ary ny zanakareo.”', 'rehefa miakatra ny vokatra, dia omeo an’i farao ny ampahadiminy. ny ambiny kosa hataonareo masomboly eny an-tsaha, sy ho sakafonareo sy izay ao an-tranonareo ary ny zanakareo.”'),
  ('6aadc70066c1fe040997ef7c', '2026-09-18T23:19:28.676Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:28.676Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 47, 23, 'Dia hoy i Josefa tamin’ny olona: “Efa novidiko ho an’i Farao ianareo sy ny taninareo androany. Ireo ny masomboly ho anareo, ka afafazo.', 'dia hoy i josefa tamin’ny olona: “efa novidiko ho an’i farao ianareo sy ny taninareo androany. ireo ny masomboly ho anareo, ka afafazo.'),
  ('6aadc70066c1fe040997ef7b', '2026-09-18T23:19:28.676Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:28.676Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 47, 22, 'Ny tanin’ny mpisorona ihany no tsy novidiny. Nahazo anjara sakafo avy tao an-tranon’i Farao mantsy ny mpisorona, dia ireny sakafo nomen’i Farao ireny no nivelomany. Izany no antony tsy nivarotan’izy ireo ny taniny.', 'ny tanin’ny mpisorona ihany no tsy novidiny. nahazo anjara sakafo avy tao an-tranon’i farao mantsy ny mpisorona, dia ireny sakafo nomen’i farao ireny no nivelomany. izany no antony tsy nivarotan’izy ireo ny taniny.'),
  ('6aadc70066c1fe040997ef7a', '2026-09-18T23:19:28.676Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:28.676Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 47, 21, 'Avy eo dia nafindran’i Josefa nankany an-tanàn-dehibe daholo ny Ejipsianina nipetraka tany ambanivohitra.', 'avy eo dia nafindran’i josefa nankany an-tanàn-dehibe daholo ny ejipsianina nipetraka tany ambanivohitra.'),
  ('6aadc70066c1fe040997ef79', '2026-09-18T23:19:28.676Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:28.676Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 47, 20, 'Dia novidin’i Josefa ho an’i Farao daholo ny tanin’ny Ejipsianina. Samy nivarotra ny sahany mantsy izy ireo fa mafy be ilay mosary. Koa lasan’i Farao i Ejipta manontolo.', 'dia novidin’i josefa ho an’i farao daholo ny tanin’ny ejipsianina. samy nivarotra ny sahany mantsy izy ireo fa mafy be ilay mosary. koa lasan’i farao i ejipta manontolo.'),
  ('6aadc70066c1fe040997ef78', '2026-09-18T23:19:28.676Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:28.676Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 47, 19, 'Izahay ve izany dia hojerenao fotsiny nefa izahay aza efa ho faty, ary ny taninay efa ho simba? Vidio izahay sy ny taninay dia atakalozy sakafo, dia hanompo an’i Farao izahay, ary ho lasany ny taninay. Omeo masomboly izahay mba tsy ho faty ary mba tsy ho lasa tsisy mponina ny taninay.”', 'izahay ve izany dia hojerenao fotsiny nefa izahay aza efa ho faty, ary ny taninay efa ho simba? vidio izahay sy ny taninay dia atakalozy sakafo, dia hanompo an’i farao izahay, ary ho lasany ny taninay. omeo masomboly izahay mba tsy ho faty ary mba tsy ho lasa tsisy mponina ny taninay.”'),
  ('6aadc70066c1fe040997ef77', '2026-09-18T23:19:28.676Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:28.676Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 47, 18, 'Rehefa tapitra iny taona iny, dia nankany amin’i Josefa indray izy ireo ny taona nanaraka. Hoy izy ireo: “Tsy hafeninay aminao, tompoko, fa efa nomena ny tompoko daholo ny vola sy ny biby fiompy. Tsy misy azonay omena anao intsony izao, tompoko, afa-tsy ny tenanay sy ny taninay.', 'rehefa tapitra iny taona iny, dia nankany amin’i josefa indray izy ireo ny taona nanaraka. hoy izy ireo: “tsy hafeninay aminao, tompoko, fa efa nomena ny tompoko daholo ny vola sy ny biby fiompy. tsy misy azonay omena anao intsony izao, tompoko, afa-tsy ny tenanay sy ny taninay.'),
  ('6aadc70066c1fe040997ef76', '2026-09-18T23:19:28.676Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:28.676Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 47, 17, 'Koa nentin’izy ireo tany amin’i Josefa ny biby fiompiny. Ary nomen’i Josefa sakafo izy ireo ho takalon’ny soavaliny sy ny ondriny sy ny ombiny ary ny ampondrany. Nomeny sakafo foana izy ireo nandritra an’iny taona iny, ho takalon’ny biby fiompiny rehetra.', 'koa nentin’izy ireo tany amin’i josefa ny biby fiompiny. ary nomen’i josefa sakafo izy ireo ho takalon’ny soavaliny sy ny ondriny sy ny ombiny ary ny ampondrany. nomeny sakafo foana izy ireo nandritra an’iny taona iny, ho takalon’ny biby fiompiny rehetra.'),
  ('6aadc70066c1fe040997ef75', '2026-09-18T23:19:28.676Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:28.676Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 47, 16, 'Dia hoy i Josefa: “Ento atỳ àry ny biby fiompinareo, raha efa lany ny volanareo. Dia homeko sakafo ianareo ho takalon’ny biby fiompinareo.”', 'dia hoy i josefa: “ento atỳ àry ny biby fiompinareo, raha efa lany ny volanareo. dia homeko sakafo ianareo ho takalon’ny biby fiompinareo.”'),
  ('6aadc70066c1fe040997ef74', '2026-09-18T23:19:28.676Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:28.676Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 47, 15, 'Farany, dia lany ny vola tao Ejipta sy tany Kanana, ka nankany amin’i Josefa ny Ejipsianina rehetra. Hoy izy ireo: “Omeo sakafo izahay! Izahay ve izany dia hojerenao fotsiny satria hoe efa lany ny volanay, nefa izahay aza efa ho faty?”', 'farany, dia lany ny vola tao ejipta sy tany kanana, ka nankany amin’i josefa ny ejipsianina rehetra. hoy izy ireo: “omeo sakafo izahay! izahay ve izany dia hojerenao fotsiny satria hoe efa lany ny volanay, nefa izahay aza efa ho faty?”'),
  ('6aadc70066c1fe040997ef73', '2026-09-18T23:19:28.676Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:28.676Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 47, 14, 'Dia nangonin’i Josefa daholo ny vola rehetra tao Ejipta sy tany Kanana, izany hoe ny vola nividianan’ny olona varimbazaha, ka nateriny tany an-tranon’i Farao.', 'dia nangonin’i josefa daholo ny vola rehetra tao ejipta sy tany kanana, izany hoe ny vola nividianan’ny olona varimbazaha, ka nateriny tany an-tranon’i farao.'),
  ('6aadc70066c1fe040997ef72', '2026-09-18T23:19:28.676Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:28.676Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 47, 13, 'Ary tsy nisy sakafo nanerana an’ilay tany, satria mafy be mihitsy ilay mosary. Lasa reraka be ny olona tao Ejipta sy Kanana noho ilay mosary.', 'ary tsy nisy sakafo nanerana an’ilay tany, satria mafy be mihitsy ilay mosary. lasa reraka be ny olona tao ejipta sy kanana noho ilay mosary.'),
  ('6aadc70066c1fe040997ef71', '2026-09-18T23:19:28.676Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:28.676Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 47, 12, 'Nandefasany sakafo tsy tapaka koa ny rainy sy ny rahalahiny ary ny ankohonan-drainy manontolo, ka nataony araka ny isan’ny zanak’izy ireo izany.', 'nandefasany sakafo tsy tapaka koa ny rainy sy ny rahalahiny ary ny ankohonan-drainy manontolo, ka nataony araka ny isan’ny zanak’izy ireo izany.'),
  ('6aadc70066c1fe040997ef70', '2026-09-18T23:19:28.676Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:28.676Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 47, 11, 'Nasain’i Josefa nipetraka tao Ejipta àry ny rainy sy ny rahalahiny. Dia nomeny tany tao amin’ny faritra tsara indrindra, tao Ramesesa, izy ireo, araka ny baikon’i Farao.', 'nasain’i josefa nipetraka tao ejipta àry ny rainy sy ny rahalahiny. dia nomeny tany tao amin’ny faritra tsara indrindra, tao ramesesa, izy ireo, araka ny baikon’i farao.'),
  ('6aadc70066c1fe040997ef6f', '2026-09-18T23:19:28.676Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:28.676Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 47, 10, 'Nitso-drano an’i Farao i Jakoba avy eo, dia lasa.', 'nitso-drano an’i farao i jakoba avy eo, dia lasa.'),
  ('6aadc70066c1fe040997ef6e', '2026-09-18T23:19:28.676Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:28.676Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 47, 9, 'Dia hoy i Jakoba tamin’i Farao: “Efa 130 taona aho izao, ary nifindrafindra monina teny foana aho. Nangidy ny fiainako, sady fohy raha oharina amin’ny andron’ny razambeko tamin’izy ireo nifindrafindra monina.”', 'dia hoy i jakoba tamin’i farao: “efa 130 taona aho izao, ary nifindrafindra monina teny foana aho. nangidy ny fiainako, sady fohy raha oharina amin’ny andron’ny razambeko tamin’izy ireo nifindrafindra monina.”'),
  ('6aadc70066c1fe040997ef6d', '2026-09-18T23:19:28.676Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:28.676Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 47, 8, 'Dia hoy i Farao tamin’i Jakoba: “Firy taona ianao?”', 'dia hoy i farao tamin’i jakoba: “firy taona ianao?”'),
  ('6aadc70066c1fe040997ef6c', '2026-09-18T23:19:28.676Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:28.676Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 47, 7, 'Dia nentin’i Josefa nankao amin’i Farao i Jakoba rainy ka nampahafantariny azy. Ary nitso-drano an’i Farao i Jakoba.', 'dia nentin’i josefa nankao amin’i farao i jakoba rainy ka nampahafantariny azy. ary nitso-drano an’i farao i jakoba.'),
  ('6aadc70066c1fe040997ef6b', '2026-09-18T23:19:28.676Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:28.676Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 47, 6, 'dia afaka mifidy an’izay faritra tianao eto Ejipta ianao. Omeo ho an’ny rainao sy ny rahalahinao izay faritra tsara indrindra eto Ejipta. Aleo ry zareo hipetraka ao Gosena. Raha misy lehilahy fantatrao hoe mahay koa amin-dry zareo, dia tendreo hikarakara ny biby fiompiko.”', 'dia afaka mifidy an’izay faritra tianao eto ejipta ianao. omeo ho an’ny rainao sy ny rahalahinao izay faritra tsara indrindra eto ejipta. aleo ry zareo hipetraka ao gosena. raha misy lehilahy fantatrao hoe mahay koa amin-dry zareo, dia tendreo hikarakara ny biby fiompiko.”'),
  ('6aadc70066c1fe040997ef6a', '2026-09-18T23:19:28.676Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:28.676Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 47, 5, 'Dia hoy i Farao tamin’i Josefa: “Efa tonga atỳ aminao izao ny rainao sy ny rahalahinao,', 'dia hoy i farao tamin’i josefa: “efa tonga atỳ aminao izao ny rainao sy ny rahalahinao,'),
  ('6aadc70066c1fe040997ef69', '2026-09-18T23:19:28.676Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:28.676Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 47, 4, 'Hoy koa izy ireo: “Tonga hivahiny eto izahay. Tsy misy ahitra hohanin’ny andian’ondrin’ny mpanomponao mantsy any Kanana, fa mafy be ny mosary any. Dia mba avelao hipetraka ao Gosena re ny mpanomponao e!”', 'hoy koa izy ireo: “tonga hivahiny eto izahay. tsy misy ahitra hohanin’ny andian’ondrin’ny mpanomponao mantsy any kanana, fa mafy be ny mosary any. dia mba avelao hipetraka ao gosena re ny mpanomponao e!”'),
  ('6aadc70066c1fe040997ef68', '2026-09-18T23:19:28.676Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:28.676Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 47, 3, 'Ary hoy i Farao tamin’ny rahalahin’i Josefa: “Inona no asanareo?” Dia hoy izy ireo tamin’i Farao: “Mpiandry ondry izahay mpanomponao, na izahay na ny razambenay.”', 'ary hoy i farao tamin’ny rahalahin’i josefa: “inona no asanareo?” dia hoy izy ireo tamin’i farao: “mpiandry ondry izahay mpanomponao, na izahay na ny razambenay.”'),
  ('6aadc70066c1fe040997ef67', '2026-09-18T23:19:28.676Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:28.676Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 47, 2, 'Ary nentiny tany amin’i Farao ny rahalahiny dimy, ka nampahafantariny azy.', 'ary nentiny tany amin’i farao ny rahalahiny dimy, ka nampahafantariny azy.'),
  ('6aadc70066c1fe040997ef66', '2026-09-18T23:19:28.676Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:28.676Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 47, 1, 'Dia lasa i Josefa ka nilaza tamin’i Farao hoe: “Tonga avy any Kanana ny raiko sy ny rahalahiko, miaraka amin’ny ondriny sy ny ombiny ary ny fananany rehetra. Ao Gosena ry zareo izao.”', 'dia lasa i josefa ka nilaza tamin’i farao hoe: “tonga avy any kanana ny raiko sy ny rahalahiko, miaraka amin’ny ondriny sy ny ombiny ary ny fananany rehetra. ao gosena ry zareo izao.”'),
  ('6aadc701c9aa1a2f764879bf', '2026-09-18T23:19:29.034Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:29.034Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 48, 2, 'Dia nisy niteny tamin’i Jakoba hoe: “Io tonga hamangy anao io i Josefa zanakao.” Dia nanangona ny heriny rehetra i Israely, ka nipetraka teo am-pandrianany.', 'dia nisy niteny tamin’i jakoba hoe: “io tonga hamangy anao io i josefa zanakao.” dia nanangona ny heriny rehetra i israely, ka nipetraka teo am-pandrianany.'),
  ('6aadc701c9aa1a2f764879be', '2026-09-18T23:19:29.034Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:29.034Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 48, 1, 'Taorian’izay, dia nisy niteny tamin’i Josefa hoe: “Efa mihareraka ny rainao.” Koa nentin’i Josefa tany i Manase sy Efraima, zanany mirahalahy.', 'taorian’izay, dia nisy niteny tamin’i josefa hoe: “efa mihareraka ny rainao.” koa nentin’i josefa tany i manase sy efraima, zanany mirahalahy.'),
  ('6aadc701c9aa1a2f764879d3', '2026-09-18T23:19:29.035Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:29.035Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 48, 22, 'Ary homeko tany iray fanampiny ianao, mihoatra noho ny an’ny rahalahinao. Nalaiko tamin’ny sabatro sy ny tsipìkako teo an-tanan’ny Amorita izany tany izany.”', 'ary homeko tany iray fanampiny ianao, mihoatra noho ny an’ny rahalahinao. nalaiko tamin’ny sabatro sy ny tsipìkako teo an-tanan’ny amorita izany tany izany.”'),
  ('6aadc701c9aa1a2f764879d2', '2026-09-18T23:19:29.035Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:29.035Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 48, 21, 'Hoy i Israely tamin’i Josefa avy eo: “Efa ho faty aho. Hitahy anareo foana anefa Andriamanitra, ka hamerina anareo any amin’ny tanin’ny razambenareo.', 'hoy i israely tamin’i josefa avy eo: “efa ho faty aho. hitahy anareo foana anefa andriamanitra, ka hamerina anareo any amin’ny tanin’ny razambenareo.'),
  ('6aadc701c9aa1a2f764879d1', '2026-09-18T23:19:29.035Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:29.035Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 48, 20, 'Mbola nitso-drano azy ireo ihany àry izy tamin’io andro io hoe: “Enga anie hanonona ny anaranao ny Israely rehefa mitso-drano, ka hilaza hoe: ‘Hataon’Andriamanitra ho tahaka an’i Efraima sy ho tahaka an’i Manase anie ianao!’” Koa i Efraima foana no nataony alohan’i Manase.', 'mbola nitso-drano azy ireo ihany àry izy tamin’io andro io hoe: “enga anie hanonona ny anaranao ny israely rehefa mitso-drano, ka hilaza hoe: ‘hataon’andriamanitra ho tahaka an’i efraima sy ho tahaka an’i manase anie ianao!’” koa i efraima foana no nataony alohan’i manase.'),
  ('6aadc701c9aa1a2f764879d0', '2026-09-18T23:19:29.035Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:29.035Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 48, 19, 'Tsy nety mihitsy anefa ny rainy, fa niteny hoe: “Fantatro izany, anaka, fantatro izany. Ho lasa firenena koa izy sady hahery. Ny zandriny anefa mbola hahery noho izy, ary ny taranany ho lasa be dia be ka ho lasa firenena maro.”', 'tsy nety mihitsy anefa ny rainy, fa niteny hoe: “fantatro izany, anaka, fantatro izany. ho lasa firenena koa izy sady hahery. ny zandriny anefa mbola hahery noho izy, ary ny taranany ho lasa be dia be ka ho lasa firenena maro.”'),
  ('6aadc701c9aa1a2f764879cf', '2026-09-18T23:19:29.035Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:29.035Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 48, 18, 'Hoy i Josefa tamin’ny rainy: “Tsy mety izao, ry Dada a! Fa ity no lahimatoa, dia apetraho eo amin’ny lohany ny tananao havanana.”', 'hoy i josefa tamin’ny rainy: “tsy mety izao, ry dada a! fa ity no lahimatoa, dia apetraho eo amin’ny lohany ny tananao havanana.”'),
  ('6aadc701c9aa1a2f764879ce', '2026-09-18T23:19:29.035Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:29.035Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 48, 17, 'Ary tsy faly i Josefa rehefa hitany hoe nataon’ny rainy teo amin’ny lohan’i Efraima ny tanany havanana. Notadiaviny hesorina teo amin’ny lohan’i Efraima àry ny tanan’ny rainy, dia hatao eo amin’ny lohan’i Manase.', 'ary tsy faly i josefa rehefa hitany hoe nataon’ny rainy teo amin’ny lohan’i efraima ny tanany havanana. notadiaviny hesorina teo amin’ny lohan’i efraima àry ny tanan’ny rainy, dia hatao eo amin’ny lohan’i manase.'),
  ('6aadc701c9aa1a2f764879cd', '2026-09-18T23:19:29.035Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:29.035Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 48, 16, 'Ilay nampiasa ny anjeliny hamonjena ahy tamin’ny loza rehetra, mba tahio ireto zaza ireto. Enga anie mba hantsoina eo amin’izy ireo ny anarako sy ny anaran’i Abrahama sy Isaka raiko, Ary enga anie ka ho lasa maro be eto ambonin’ny tany izy ireo!”', 'ilay nampiasa ny anjeliny hamonjena ahy tamin’ny loza rehetra, mba tahio ireto zaza ireto. enga anie mba hantsoina eo amin’izy ireo ny anarako sy ny anaran’i abrahama sy isaka raiko, ary enga anie ka ho lasa maro be eto ambonin’ny tany izy ireo!”'),
  ('6aadc701c9aa1a2f764879cc', '2026-09-18T23:19:29.035Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:29.035Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 48, 15, 'Dia nitso-drano an’i Josefa izy hoe: “Ry ilay tena Andriamanitra notompoin’i Abrahama sy Isaka raiko, Ry ilay tena Andriamanitra, izay mpiandry ahy hatramin’izay niainako ka mandraka androany,', 'dia nitso-drano an’i josefa izy hoe: “ry ilay tena andriamanitra notompoin’i abrahama sy isaka raiko, ry ilay tena andriamanitra, izay mpiandry ahy hatramin’izay niainako ka mandraka androany,'),
  ('6aadc701c9aa1a2f764879cb', '2026-09-18T23:19:29.035Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:29.035Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 48, 14, 'Nataon’i Israely teo amin’ny lohan’i Efraima anefa ny tanany havanana na dia izy aza no zandriny. Fa ny tanany havia kosa no nataony teo amin’ny lohan’i Manase. Nataony fanahy iniana mihitsy ilay izy na dia i Manase aza no lahimatoa.', 'nataon’i israely teo amin’ny lohan’i efraima anefa ny tanany havanana na dia izy aza no zandriny. fa ny tanany havia kosa no nataony teo amin’ny lohan’i manase. nataony fanahy iniana mihitsy ilay izy na dia i manase aza no lahimatoa.'),
  ('6aadc701c9aa1a2f764879ca', '2026-09-18T23:19:29.035Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:29.035Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 48, 13, 'Dia noraisin’i Josefa tamin’ny tanany havanana i Efraima ka nataony teo ankavian’i Israely. Fa i Manase indray noraisiny tamin’ny tanany havia ka nataony teo ankavanan’i Israely. Dia nampanatoniny azy izy mirahalahy.', 'dia noraisin’i josefa tamin’ny tanany havanana i efraima ka nataony teo ankavian’i israely. fa i manase indray noraisiny tamin’ny tanany havia ka nataony teo ankavanan’i israely. dia nampanatoniny azy izy mirahalahy.'),
  ('6aadc701c9aa1a2f764879c9', '2026-09-18T23:19:29.035Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:29.035Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 48, 12, 'Nesorin’i Josefa teo akaikin’ny lohaliky ny rainy izy mirahalahy avy eo, dia niankohoka tamin’ny tany izy.', 'nesorin’i josefa teo akaikin’ny lohaliky ny rainy izy mirahalahy avy eo, dia niankohoka tamin’ny tany izy.'),
  ('6aadc701c9aa1a2f764879c8', '2026-09-18T23:19:29.035Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:29.035Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 48, 11, 'Hoy koa izy tamin’i Josefa: “Tsy nieritreritra ny hahita anao intsony aho, nefa izao aho navelan’Andriamanitra hahita ny zanakao koa aza!”', 'hoy koa izy tamin’i josefa: “tsy nieritreritra ny hahita anao intsony aho, nefa izao aho navelan’andriamanitra hahita ny zanakao koa aza!”'),
  ('6aadc701c9aa1a2f764879c7', '2026-09-18T23:19:29.035Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:29.035Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 48, 10, 'Efa nanjavozavo ny mason’i Israely tamin’izay, satria izy efa antitra ka tsy nahita. Koa nentin’i Josefa nanatona azy izy mirahalahy. Dia nanoroka sy namihina azy roa lahy i Israely.', 'efa nanjavozavo ny mason’i israely tamin’izay, satria izy efa antitra ka tsy nahita. koa nentin’i josefa nanatona azy izy mirahalahy. dia nanoroka sy namihina azy roa lahy i israely.'),
  ('6aadc701c9aa1a2f764879c6', '2026-09-18T23:19:29.035Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:29.035Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 48, 9, 'Dia hoy i Josefa tamin’ny rainy: “Ny zanako nomen’Andriamanitra ahy tatỳ ireo.” Dia hoy izy: “Mba ento etỳ amiko ry zareo hotsofiko rano.”', 'dia hoy i josefa tamin’ny rainy: “ny zanako nomen’andriamanitra ahy tatỳ ireo.” dia hoy izy: “mba ento etỳ amiko ry zareo hotsofiko rano.”'),
  ('6aadc701c9aa1a2f764879c5', '2026-09-18T23:19:29.035Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:29.035Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 48, 8, 'Avy eo dia hitan’i Israely ny zanak’i Josefa, ka hoy izy: “Fa iza ireo?”', 'avy eo dia hitan’i israely ny zanak’i josefa, ka hoy izy: “fa iza ireo?”'),
  ('6aadc701c9aa1a2f764879c4', '2026-09-18T23:19:29.035Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:29.035Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 48, 7, 'Dia izao indray ny momba ahy: Tamin’izaho niala tany Padana, dia maty teo akaikiko i Rahely, tany Kanana. Teny an-dalana ho any Efrata izahay tamin’izay, ary mbola lavitra i Efrata, izany hoe Betlehema. Koa naleviko tamin’iny lalana mankany Efrata iny izy.”', 'dia izao indray ny momba ahy: tamin’izaho niala tany padana, dia maty teo akaikiko i rahely, tany kanana. teny an-dalana ho any efrata izahay tamin’izay, ary mbola lavitra i efrata, izany hoe betlehema. koa naleviko tamin’iny lalana mankany efrata iny izy.”'),
  ('6aadc701c9aa1a2f764879c3', '2026-09-18T23:19:29.035Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:29.035Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 48, 6, 'Ho anao kosa anefa izay zanaka haterakao aorian’izy mirahalahy. Dia hitondra ny anaran’izy mirahalahy ry zareo, sady hahazo lova amin’ny anjaran’izy ireo.', 'ho anao kosa anefa izay zanaka haterakao aorian’izy mirahalahy. dia hitondra ny anaran’izy mirahalahy ry zareo, sady hahazo lova amin’ny anjaran’izy ireo.'),
  ('6aadc701c9aa1a2f764879c2', '2026-09-18T23:19:29.035Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:29.035Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 48, 5, 'Fa izy roa lahy zanakao kosa, izay naterakao teto Ejipta talohan’ny nahatongavako teto aminao, dia ho lasa zanako. Ho lasa zanako tokoa i Efraima sy Manase, hoatran’i Robena sy Simeona.', 'fa izy roa lahy zanakao kosa, izay naterakao teto ejipta talohan’ny nahatongavako teto aminao, dia ho lasa zanako. ho lasa zanako tokoa i efraima sy manase, hoatran’i robena sy simeona.'),
  ('6aadc701c9aa1a2f764879c1', '2026-09-18T23:19:29.035Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:29.035Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 48, 4, 'Ary hoy izy tamiko: ‘Hataoko manan-taranaka ianao ka ho lasa be dia be ny taranakao, ary hataoko firenena lehibe ianao. Homeko ho an’ny taranakao handimby anao ity tany ity, ka ho lasa fananany mandrakizay.’', 'ary hoy izy tamiko: ‘hataoko manan-taranaka ianao ka ho lasa be dia be ny taranakao, ary hataoko firenena lehibe ianao. homeko ho an’ny taranakao handimby anao ity tany ity, ka ho lasa fananany mandrakizay.’'),
  ('6aadc701c9aa1a2f764879c0', '2026-09-18T23:19:29.035Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:29.035Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 48, 3, 'Ary hoy i Jakoba tamin’i Josefa: “Niseho tamiko tao Lozy tany Kanana ilay Andriamanitra Mahery Indrindra, dia nitso-drano ahy.', 'ary hoy i jakoba tamin’i josefa: “niseho tamiko tao lozy tany kanana ilay andriamanitra mahery indrindra, dia nitso-drano ahy.'),
  ('6aadc702ef8ceb382a356ede', '2026-09-18T23:19:30.201Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:30.201Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 49, 18, 'Hiandry ny famonjena avy aminao aho, Jehovah ô!', 'hiandry ny famonjena avy aminao aho, jehovah ô!'),
  ('6aadc702ef8ceb382a356edd', '2026-09-18T23:19:30.201Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:30.201Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 49, 17, 'Enga anie i Dana ho lasa bibilava eny amoron-dalana, ho bibilava misy tandroka eny an-tsisin-dalana! Hokaikeriny ny tongotry ny soavaly mba hianjera any aoriana ny mpitaingina azy.', 'enga anie i dana ho lasa bibilava eny amoron-dalana, ho bibilava misy tandroka eny an-tsisin-dalana! hokaikeriny ny tongotry ny soavaly mba hianjera any aoriana ny mpitaingina azy.'),
  ('6aadc702ef8ceb382a356edc', '2026-09-18T23:19:30.201Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:30.201Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 49, 16, '“Hitsara ny fireneny i Dana, izay anisan’ny fokon’ny Israely.', '“hitsara ny fireneny i dana, izay anisan’ny fokon’ny israely.'),
  ('6aadc702ef8ceb382a356edb', '2026-09-18T23:19:30.201Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:30.201Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 49, 15, 'Ho hitany fa tsara ny toerana ipetrahany sady mahafinaritra ilay tany. Hiondrika izy dia hitondra entana eo an-tsorony, sady hanaiky hanao asa an-terivozona.', 'ho hitany fa tsara ny toerana ipetrahany sady mahafinaritra ilay tany. hiondrika izy dia hitondra entana eo an-tsorony, sady hanaiky hanao asa an-terivozona.'),
  ('6aadc702ef8ceb382a356eda', '2026-09-18T23:19:30.201Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:30.201Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 49, 14, '“I Isakara indray dia ampondra mafy taolana, ka sady matory izy no mitondra kitapon-dasely roa.', '“i isakara indray dia ampondra mafy taolana, ka sady matory izy no mitondra kitapon-dasely roa.'),
  ('6aadc702ef8ceb382a356ed9', '2026-09-18T23:19:30.201Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:30.201Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 49, 13, '“I Zebolona kosa hipetraka eny amoron-tsiraka, eny amoron-drano fiantsonan’ny sambo. Ary ho tandrifin’i Sidona ny sisin-taniny farany lavitra.', '“i zebolona kosa hipetraka eny amoron-tsiraka, eny amoron-drano fiantsonan’ny sambo. ary ho tandrifin’i sidona ny sisin-taniny farany lavitra.'),
  ('6aadc702ef8ceb382a356ed8', '2026-09-18T23:19:30.201Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:30.201Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 49, 12, 'Mena be mihitsy ny masony satria izy misotro divay, ary fotsy ny nifiny satria izy misotro ronono.', 'mena be mihitsy ny masony satria izy misotro divay, ary fotsy ny nifiny satria izy misotro ronono.'),
  ('6aadc702ef8ceb382a356ed7', '2026-09-18T23:19:30.201Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:30.201Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 49, 11, 'Hofatorany eo amin’ny voaloboka ny ampondrany, ary hofatorany eo amin’ny voaloboka tena tsara ny zanak’ampondrany. Hosasany amin’ny divay ny fitafiany, ary hosasany amin’ny ranom-boaloboka ny akanjony.', 'hofatorany eo amin’ny voaloboka ny ampondrany, ary hofatorany eo amin’ny voaloboka tena tsara ny zanak’ampondrany. hosasany amin’ny divay ny fitafiany, ary hosasany amin’ny ranom-boaloboka ny akanjony.'),
  ('6aadc702ef8ceb382a356ed6', '2026-09-18T23:19:30.201Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:30.201Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 49, 10, 'Tsy hiala amin’i Joda mihitsy ny tehim-panjakana, ary tsy hiala eo anelanelan’ny tongony ny tehim-pahefana, mandra-pahatongan’i Silo. Dia hankatò an’i Silo ny firenena rehetra.', 'tsy hiala amin’i joda mihitsy ny tehim-panjakana, ary tsy hiala eo anelanelan’ny tongony ny tehim-pahefana, mandra-pahatongan’i silo. dia hankatò an’i silo ny firenena rehetra.'),
  ('6aadc702ef8ceb382a356ed5', '2026-09-18T23:19:30.201Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:30.201Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 49, 9, 'Zana-diona ianao, ry Joda. Hihinana remby ianao, anaka, dia avy eo handeha. Namitsaka izy dia nitsotsotra toy ny liona. Hoatran’ny liona izy, ka iza no ho sahy hanaitra azy?', 'zana-diona ianao, ry joda. hihinana remby ianao, anaka, dia avy eo handeha. namitsaka izy dia nitsotsotra toy ny liona. hoatran’ny liona izy, ka iza no ho sahy hanaitra azy?'),
  ('6aadc702ef8ceb382a356ed4', '2026-09-18T23:19:30.201Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:30.201Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 49, 8, '“Ary ianao, ry Joda, hoderain’ny rahalahinao ianao. Ho eo amin’ny hatoky ny fahavalonao ny tananao, ary hiankohoka eo anatrehanao ny zanaky ny rainao.', '“ary ianao, ry joda, hoderain’ny rahalahinao ianao. ho eo amin’ny hatoky ny fahavalonao ny tananao, ary hiankohoka eo anatrehanao ny zanaky ny rainao.'),
  ('6aadc702ef8ceb382a356ed3', '2026-09-18T23:19:30.201Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:30.201Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 49, 7, 'Ho voaozona anie ny hatezeran’izy ireo, satria nahatonga azy hasiaka sy ho tia mampijaly! Aleo izy ireo haparitako any amin’ny tanin’i Jakoba sy any amin’ny tanin’ny Israely.', 'ho voaozona anie ny hatezeran’izy ireo, satria nahatonga azy hasiaka sy ho tia mampijaly! aleo izy ireo haparitako any amin’ny tanin’i jakoba sy any amin’ny tanin’ny israely.'),
  ('6aadc702ef8ceb382a356ed2', '2026-09-18T23:19:30.201Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:30.201Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 49, 6, 'Enga anie aho tsy hinamana amin’izy ireo! Enga anie ianao tsy hivorivory miaraka amin’ireo, ry voninahitro! Fa tezitra be izy ireo ka namono olona, sady fahafinaretana ho azy ny nanapaka ny hoza-tongotry ny omby.', 'enga anie aho tsy hinamana amin’izy ireo! enga anie ianao tsy hivorivory miaraka amin’ireo, ry voninahitro! fa tezitra be izy ireo ka namono olona, sady fahafinaretana ho azy ny nanapaka ny hoza-tongotry ny omby.'),
  ('6aadc702ef8ceb382a356ed1', '2026-09-18T23:19:30.201Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:30.201Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 49, 5, '“Mpirahalahy i Simeona sy Levy, ary nentiny nisetrasetra ny fitaovam-piadiany.', '“mpirahalahy i simeona sy levy, ary nentiny nisetrasetra ny fitaovam-piadiany.'),
  ('6aadc702ef8ceb382a356ed0', '2026-09-18T23:19:30.201Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:30.201Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 49, 4, 'Tsy nifehy tena anefa ianao, fa hoatran’ny rano vaky tsy azo sakanana, ka tsy ho lasa ambony noho ny rahalahinao. Niakaranao mantsy ny fandrianan’ny rainao. Nolotoinao ny fandrianako tamin’izay. Dia tena niakarany tokoa ny farafarako!', 'tsy nifehy tena anefa ianao, fa hoatran’ny rano vaky tsy azo sakanana, ka tsy ho lasa ambony noho ny rahalahinao. niakaranao mantsy ny fandrianan’ny rainao. nolotoinao ny fandrianako tamin’izay. dia tena niakarany tokoa ny farafarako!'),
  ('6aadc702ef8ceb382a356ecf', '2026-09-18T23:19:30.201Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:30.201Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 49, 3, '“Robena! Ianao no lahimatoako sy tanjako, ary ianao no naterako voalohany. Be voninahitra ianao sady tena matanjaka.', '“robena! ianao no lahimatoako sy tanjako, ary ianao no naterako voalohany. be voninahitra ianao sady tena matanjaka.'),
  ('6aadc702ef8ceb382a356ece', '2026-09-18T23:19:30.201Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:30.201Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 49, 2, 'Avia daholo dia henoy ny teniko, ry zanak’i Jakoba. Henoy tsara izao lazain’i Israely rainareo izao:', 'avia daholo dia henoy ny teniko, ry zanak’i jakoba. henoy tsara izao lazain’i israely rainareo izao:'),
  ('6aadc702ef8ceb382a356ecd', '2026-09-18T23:19:30.201Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:30.201Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 49, 1, 'Ary nantsoin’i Jakoba ny zanany lahy, ka hoy izy: “Avia daholo ianareo fa holazaiko anareo izay hitranga aminareo any am-parany any.', 'ary nantsoin’i jakoba ny zanany lahy, ka hoy izy: “avia daholo ianareo fa holazaiko anareo izay hitranga aminareo any am-parany any.'),
  ('6aadc702ef8ceb382a356eed', '2026-09-18T23:19:30.202Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:30.202Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 49, 33, 'Rehefa avy namela an’izany hafatrafatra rehetra izany tamin’ny zanany lahy i Jakoba, dia nakariny teo am-pandriana ny tongony dia nitsotra izy. Ary niala aina izy dia nangonina any amin’ny razambeny.', 'rehefa avy namela an’izany hafatrafatra rehetra izany tamin’ny zanany lahy i jakoba, dia nakariny teo am-pandriana ny tongony dia nitsotra izy. ary niala aina izy dia nangonina any amin’ny razambeny.'),
  ('6aadc702ef8ceb382a356eec', '2026-09-18T23:19:30.202Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:30.202Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 49, 32, 'Novidina tamin’ny taranak’i Heta ilay saha sy ilay lava-bato ao.”', 'novidina tamin’ny taranak’i heta ilay saha sy ilay lava-bato ao.”'),
  ('6aadc702ef8ceb382a356eeb', '2026-09-18T23:19:30.202Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:30.202Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 49, 31, 'Tao no nandevenana an’i Abrahama sy Saraha vadiny. Tao koa no nandevenana an’i Isaka sy Rebeka vadiny, ary tao no nandevenako an’i Lea.', 'tao no nandevenana an’i abrahama sy saraha vadiny. tao koa no nandevenana an’i isaka sy rebeka vadiny, ary tao no nandevenako an’i lea.'),
  ('6aadc702ef8ceb382a356eea', '2026-09-18T23:19:30.202Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:30.202Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 49, 30, 'dia ilay lava-bato eo amin’ilay saha ao Makpela tandrifin’i Mamre, any Kanana. Io ilay saha novidin’i Abrahama tamin’i Efrona Hetita mba hataony toeram-pandevenana.', 'dia ilay lava-bato eo amin’ilay saha ao makpela tandrifin’i mamre, any kanana. io ilay saha novidin’i abrahama tamin’i efrona hetita mba hataony toeram-pandevenana.'),
  ('6aadc702ef8ceb382a356ee9', '2026-09-18T23:19:30.202Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:30.202Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 49, 29, 'Taorian’izay, dia namela hafatra tamin’izy ireo izy hoe: “Kely sisa aho dia hangonina any amin’ny razambeko. Aleveno miaraka amin’ny razambeko aho, ao amin’ilay lava-bato eo amin’ny sahan’i Efrona Hetita,', 'taorian’izay, dia namela hafatra tamin’izy ireo izy hoe: “kely sisa aho dia hangonina any amin’ny razambeko. aleveno miaraka amin’ny razambeko aho, ao amin’ilay lava-bato eo amin’ny sahan’i efrona hetita,'),
  ('6aadc702ef8ceb382a356ee8', '2026-09-18T23:19:30.202Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:30.202Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 49, 28, 'Avy amin’ireo rehetra ireo ny foko 12 teo amin’ny Israely, ary izany no nolazain’ny rainy tamin’izy ireo rehefa nitso-drano azy izy. Samy nomeny tsodrano mifanentana aminy avy izy ireo.', 'avy amin’ireo rehetra ireo ny foko 12 teo amin’ny israely, ary izany no nolazain’ny rainy tamin’izy ireo rehefa nitso-drano azy izy. samy nomeny tsodrano mifanentana aminy avy izy ireo.'),
  ('6aadc702ef8ceb382a356ee7', '2026-09-18T23:19:30.202Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:30.202Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 49, 27, '“I Benjamina kosa hamiravira ny fahavalony toy ny amboadia. Hihinana remby izy amin’ny maraina, ary hizara an’izay zavatra azony babo izy amin’ny hariva.”', '“i benjamina kosa hamiravira ny fahavalony toy ny amboadia. hihinana remby izy amin’ny maraina, ary hizara an’izay zavatra azony babo izy amin’ny hariva.”'),
  ('6aadc702ef8ceb382a356ee6', '2026-09-18T23:19:30.202Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:30.202Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 49, 26, 'Ny tsodranon’ny rainao dia ho tsara lavitra noho ireo zava-tsoa avy amin’ny tendrombohitra maharitra mandrakizay, sady ho tsara lavitra noho ny zavatra mahafinaritra eny amin’ny havoana maharitra ela. Ho eo an-dohan’i Josefa foana izany tsodrano izany, dia eo an-tampon-dohan’ilay nosinganina tamin’ny rahalahiny.', 'ny tsodranon’ny rainao dia ho tsara lavitra noho ireo zava-tsoa avy amin’ny tendrombohitra maharitra mandrakizay, sady ho tsara lavitra noho ny zavatra mahafinaritra eny amin’ny havoana maharitra ela. ho eo an-dohan’i josefa foana izany tsodrano izany, dia eo an-tampon-dohan’ilay nosinganina tamin’ny rahalahiny.'),
  ('6aadc702ef8ceb382a356ee5', '2026-09-18T23:19:30.202Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:30.202Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 49, 25, 'Avy amin’ilay Andriamanitry ny rainao izy, dia ilay Andriamanitra hanampy anao. Miaraka amin’ilay Mahery Indrindra koa izy, dia ilay hitahy anao ka hanome anao rano avy any amin’ny lanitra ambony sy avy any ambany, ary hanome anao zanaka sy biby fiompy maro be.', 'avy amin’ilay andriamanitry ny rainao izy, dia ilay andriamanitra hanampy anao. miaraka amin’ilay mahery indrindra koa izy, dia ilay hitahy anao ka hanome anao rano avy any amin’ny lanitra ambony sy avy any ambany, ary hanome anao zanaka sy biby fiompy maro be.'),
  ('6aadc702ef8ceb382a356ee4', '2026-09-18T23:19:30.202Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:30.202Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 49, 24, 'Na izany aza, dia mbola tao amin’ny toerany foana ny tsipìkany, ary natanjaka sady mailamailaka foana ny tanany. Avy amin’ny tanan’ilay maherin’i Jakoba izany, avy amin’ilay mpiandry, ilay vatolampin’i Israely.', 'na izany aza, dia mbola tao amin’ny toerany foana ny tsipìkany, ary natanjaka sady mailamailaka foana ny tanany. avy amin’ny tanan’ilay maherin’i jakoba izany, avy amin’ilay mpiandry, ilay vatolampin’i israely.'),
  ('6aadc702ef8ceb382a356ee3', '2026-09-18T23:19:30.202Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:30.202Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 49, 23, 'Nitana lolompo taminy anefa ny mpandefa zana-tsipìka, ka nanafika sy nitifitra azy tsy an-kijanona.', 'nitana lolompo taminy anefa ny mpandefa zana-tsipìka, ka nanafika sy nitifitra azy tsy an-kijanona.'),
  ('6aadc702ef8ceb382a356ee2', '2026-09-18T23:19:30.202Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:30.202Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 49, 22, '“I Josefa indray sampan’ny hazo mamoa, dia hazo mamoa eo akaikin’ny loharano, ary misandrahaka any ivelan’ny manda ny sampany.', '“i josefa indray sampan’ny hazo mamoa, dia hazo mamoa eo akaikin’ny loharano, ary misandrahaka any ivelan’ny manda ny sampany.'),
  ('6aadc702ef8ceb382a356ee1', '2026-09-18T23:19:30.202Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:30.202Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 49, 21, '“I Naftaly kosa serfa manifinify. Mahafinaritra erỳ ny teny lazainy!', '“i naftaly kosa serfa manifinify. mahafinaritra erỳ ny teny lazainy!'),
  ('6aadc702ef8ceb382a356ee0', '2026-09-18T23:19:30.202Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:30.202Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 49, 20, '“Hanana sakafo be dia be i Asera, ary hanome sakafo mendrika homena ny mpanjaka.', '“hanana sakafo be dia be i asera, ary hanome sakafo mendrika homena ny mpanjaka.'),
  ('6aadc702ef8ceb382a356edf', '2026-09-18T23:19:30.202Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:30.202Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 49, 19, '“I Gada indray hotafihin’ny mpandroba, fa izy kosa hanafika ny vodilaharan’ireny.', '“i gada indray hotafihin’ny mpandroba, fa izy kosa hanafika ny vodilaharan’ireny.'),
  ('6aadc70246255125aa527dfa', '2026-09-18T23:19:30.627Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:30.627Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 50, 26, 'Dia maty i Josefa tamin’izy 110 taona. Ary nohosorana zava-manitra ny fatiny, ka napetraka tao anaty vatam-paty tany Ejipta.', 'dia maty i josefa tamin’izy 110 taona. ary nohosorana zava-manitra ny fatiny, ka napetraka tao anaty vatam-paty tany ejipta.'),
  ('6aadc70246255125aa527df9', '2026-09-18T23:19:30.627Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:30.627Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 50, 25, 'Hoy koa i Josefa tamin’ny zanak’i Israely: “Tsy maintsy hitsinjo anareo Andriamanitra. Koa mianiàna amiko hoe hoentinareo hiakatra hiala atỳ ny taolambaloko.”', 'hoy koa i josefa tamin’ny zanak’i israely: “tsy maintsy hitsinjo anareo andriamanitra. koa mianiàna amiko hoe hoentinareo hiakatra hiala atỳ ny taolambaloko.”'),
  ('6aadc70246255125aa527df8', '2026-09-18T23:19:30.627Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:30.627Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 50, 24, 'Farany, dia hoy i Josefa tamin’ny rahalahiny: “Efa ho faty aho. Tsy maintsy hitsinjo anareo anefa Andriamanitra, ka hitondra anareo hiakatra hiala eto amin’ity tany ity, mba ho any amin’ilay tany efa nianianany tamin’i Abrahama sy Isaka ary Jakoba.”', 'farany, dia hoy i josefa tamin’ny rahalahiny: “efa ho faty aho. tsy maintsy hitsinjo anareo anefa andriamanitra, ka hitondra anareo hiakatra hiala eto amin’ity tany ity, mba ho any amin’ilay tany efa nianianany tamin’i abrahama sy isaka ary jakoba.”'),
  ('6aadc70246255125aa527df7', '2026-09-18T23:19:30.627Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:30.627Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 50, 23, 'Dia hitany hatramin’ny zafikelin’i Efraima, sy ny zanak’i Makira, zanakalahin’i Manase. Nentin’i Josefa toy ny zanany naterany izy ireny.', 'dia hitany hatramin’ny zafikelin’i efraima, sy ny zanak’i makira, zanakalahin’i manase. nentin’i josefa toy ny zanany naterany izy ireny.'),
  ('6aadc70246255125aa527df6', '2026-09-18T23:19:30.627Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:30.627Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 50, 22, 'Mbola nipetraka tany Ejipta foana i Josefa sy ny ankohonan-drainy. Ary velona 110 taona i Josefa.', 'mbola nipetraka tany ejipta foana i josefa sy ny ankohonan-drainy. ary velona 110 taona i josefa.'),
  ('6aadc70246255125aa527df5', '2026-09-18T23:19:30.627Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:30.627Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 50, 21, 'Koa aza matahotra, fa mbola hamatsy sakafo anareo sy ny zanakareo madinika foana aho.” Dia nampionona sy nanome toky azy ireo izy.', 'koa aza matahotra, fa mbola hamatsy sakafo anareo sy ny zanakareo madinika foana aho.” dia nampionona sy nanome toky azy ireo izy.'),
  ('6aadc70246255125aa527df4', '2026-09-18T23:19:30.627Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:30.627Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 50, 20, 'Nieritreritra ny hanisy ratsy ahy ianareo, saingy navadik’Andriamanitra ho zavatra tsara ilay izy mba hamonjena ain’olona maro, hoatr’izao ataony izao.', 'nieritreritra ny hanisy ratsy ahy ianareo, saingy navadik’andriamanitra ho zavatra tsara ilay izy mba hamonjena ain’olona maro, hoatr’izao ataony izao.'),
  ('6aadc70246255125aa527df3', '2026-09-18T23:19:30.627Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:30.627Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 50, 19, 'Fa hoy i Josefa taminy: “Aza matahotra fa izaho angaha Andriamanitra no hitsara anareo?', 'fa hoy i josefa taminy: “aza matahotra fa izaho angaha andriamanitra no hitsara anareo?'),
  ('6aadc70246255125aa527df2', '2026-09-18T23:19:30.627Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:30.627Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 50, 18, 'Dia tonga koa ireo rahalahiny ka niankohoka teo anatrehany, sady niteny hoe: “Ireto izahay mpanomponao!”', 'dia tonga koa ireo rahalahiny ka niankohoka teo anatrehany, sady niteny hoe: “ireto izahay mpanomponao!”'),
  ('6aadc70246255125aa527df1', '2026-09-18T23:19:30.627Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:30.627Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 50, 17, '‘Izao lazaina amin’i Josefa: “Mitalaho aminao re aho e! Mba avelao ny heloky ny rahalahinao sy ny fahotany, tamin’izy ireo nanisy ratsy anao.”’ Koa mba avelao re ny heloky ny mpanompon’ilay Andriamanitry ny rainao e!” Dia nitomany i Josefa rehefa naheno an’izany.', '‘izao lazaina amin’i josefa: “mitalaho aminao re aho e! mba avelao ny heloky ny rahalahinao sy ny fahotany, tamin’izy ireo nanisy ratsy anao.”’ koa mba avelao re ny heloky ny mpanompon’ilay andriamanitry ny rainao e!” dia nitomany i josefa rehefa naheno an’izany.'),
  ('6aadc70246255125aa527df0', '2026-09-18T23:19:30.627Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:30.627Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 50, 16, 'Dia nampitondra hafatra tany amin’i Josefa izy ireo hoe: “Talohan’ny hahafatesan’ny rainao, dia namela hafatra izy hoe:', 'dia nampitondra hafatra tany amin’i josefa izy ireo hoe: “talohan’ny hahafatesan’ny rainao, dia namela hafatra izy hoe:'),
  ('6aadc70246255125aa527def', '2026-09-18T23:19:30.627Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:30.627Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 50, 15, 'Rehefa maty ny rain’izy ireo, dia nifampiresaka ireo rahalahin’i Josefa hoe: “Mety hoe mbola mitana lolompo amintsika izao i Josefa, dia hovaliany amintsika ny ratsy rehetra nataontsika taminy.”', 'rehefa maty ny rain’izy ireo, dia nifampiresaka ireo rahalahin’i josefa hoe: “mety hoe mbola mitana lolompo amintsika izao i josefa, dia hovaliany amintsika ny ratsy rehetra nataontsika taminy.”'),
  ('6aadc70246255125aa527dee', '2026-09-18T23:19:30.627Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:30.627Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 50, 14, 'Rehefa avy nandevina ny rainy i Josefa, dia niverina nankany Ejipta izy sy ny rahalahiny ary izay rehetra niaraka taminy nandevina ny rainy.', 'rehefa avy nandevina ny rainy i josefa, dia niverina nankany ejipta izy sy ny rahalahiny ary izay rehetra niaraka taminy nandevina ny rainy.'),
  ('6aadc70246255125aa527ded', '2026-09-18T23:19:30.627Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:30.627Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 50, 13, 'Nentin’ny zanany nankany Kanana ny fatiny, dia naleviny tao amin’ilay lava-bato teo amin’ilay saha tao Makpela tandrifin’i Mamre. Io ilay saha novidin’i Abrahama tamin’i Efrona Hetita, mba hataony toeram-pandevenana.', 'nentin’ny zanany nankany kanana ny fatiny, dia naleviny tao amin’ilay lava-bato teo amin’ilay saha tao makpela tandrifin’i mamre. io ilay saha novidin’i abrahama tamin’i efrona hetita, mba hataony toeram-pandevenana.'),
  ('6aadc70246255125aa527dec', '2026-09-18T23:19:30.627Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:30.627Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 50, 12, 'Izay notenenin’i Jakoba mihitsy àry no nataon’ny zanany lahy taminy.', 'izay notenenin’i jakoba mihitsy àry no nataon’ny zanany lahy taminy.'),
  ('6aadc70246255125aa527deb', '2026-09-18T23:19:30.627Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:30.627Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 50, 11, 'Hitan’ny Kananita tompon-tany ny fisaonana natao teo amin’ilay famoloana tao Atada, ka hoy izy ireo: “Tena misaona be mihitsy ny Ejipsianina!” Izany no nanaovana ny anaran’ilay famoloana hoe Abela-mizraima, izay ao amin’ny faritr’i Jordana.', 'hitan’ny kananita tompon-tany ny fisaonana natao teo amin’ilay famoloana tao atada, ka hoy izy ireo: “tena misaona be mihitsy ny ejipsianina!” izany no nanaovana ny anaran’ilay famoloana hoe abela-mizraima, izay ao amin’ny faritr’i jordana.'),
  ('6aadc70246255125aa527dea', '2026-09-18T23:19:30.627Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:30.627Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 50, 10, 'Dia tonga teo amin’ny famoloana tao Atada ao amin’ny faritr’i Jordana izy ireo, ka nisaona tamin’alahelo be sady nitomany mafy be teo. Ary naharitra fito andro ny fisaonana ny rain’i Josefa.', 'dia tonga teo amin’ny famoloana tao atada ao amin’ny faritr’i jordana izy ireo, ka nisaona tamin’alahelo be sady nitomany mafy be teo. ary naharitra fito andro ny fisaonana ny rain’i josefa.'),
  ('6aadc70246255125aa527de9', '2026-09-18T23:19:30.627Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:30.627Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 50, 9, 'Nisy olona nitaingina kalesy sy soavaly koa niaraka taminy, ka be dia be mihitsy ny olona nandeha.', 'nisy olona nitaingina kalesy sy soavaly koa niaraka taminy, ka be dia be mihitsy ny olona nandeha.'),
  ('6aadc70246255125aa527de8', '2026-09-18T23:19:30.627Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:30.627Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 50, 8, 'ary ny ankohonan’i Josefa manontolo sy ny rahalahiny ary ny ankohonan-drainy. Ny zanak’izy ireo madinika sy ny ondriny ary ny ombiny ihany no navelany tao Gosena.', 'ary ny ankohonan’i josefa manontolo sy ny rahalahiny ary ny ankohonan-drainy. ny zanak’izy ireo madinika sy ny ondriny ary ny ombiny ihany no navelany tao gosena.'),
  ('6aadc70246255125aa527de7', '2026-09-18T23:19:30.627Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:30.627Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 50, 7, 'Dia lasa niakatra handevina ny rainy i Josefa. Niaraka taminy koa ny mpanompon’i Farao rehetra, izany hoe ny anti-panahy tao an-dapa sy ny anti-panahy rehetra tany Ejipta,', 'dia lasa niakatra handevina ny rainy i josefa. niaraka taminy koa ny mpanompon’i farao rehetra, izany hoe ny anti-panahy tao an-dapa sy ny anti-panahy rehetra tany ejipta,'),
  ('6aadc70246255125aa527de6', '2026-09-18T23:19:30.627Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:30.627Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 50, 6, 'Ary hoy i Farao: “Mandehana aleveno ny rainao, araka ny fianianana nasainy nataonao.”', 'ary hoy i farao: “mandehana aleveno ny rainao, araka ny fianianana nasainy nataonao.”'),
  ('6aadc70246255125aa527de5', '2026-09-18T23:19:30.627Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:30.627Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 50, 5, '‘Niteny tamiko ny raiko hoe: “Efa ho faty aho, ka mianiàna amiko fa halevinao ao amin’ny toeram-pandevenana efa nolavahako any Kanana aho.” Mba avelao re aho hiakatra handevina ny raiko e! Dia avy eo aho hiverina ihany.’”', '‘niteny tamiko ny raiko hoe: “efa ho faty aho, ka mianiàna amiko fa halevinao ao amin’ny toeram-pandevenana efa nolavahako any kanana aho.” mba avelao re aho hiakatra handevina ny raiko e! dia avy eo aho hiverina ihany.’”'),
  ('6aadc70246255125aa527de4', '2026-09-18T23:19:30.627Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:30.627Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 50, 4, 'Rehefa tapitra ny andro nisaonana azy, dia hoy i Josefa tamin’ny tandapan’i Farao: “Raha mahazo sitraka aminareo aho, dia izao lazaina amin’i Farao:', 'rehefa tapitra ny andro nisaonana azy, dia hoy i josefa tamin’ny tandapan’i farao: “raha mahazo sitraka aminareo aho, dia izao lazaina amin’i farao:'),
  ('6aadc70246255125aa527de3', '2026-09-18T23:19:30.627Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:30.627Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 50, 3, 'ka 40 andro katroka no nanaovany an’izany. Izany mantsy no faharetan’ny fotoana fanosorana zava-manitra amin’ny faty. Ary nitomany azy 70 andro ny Ejipsianina.', 'ka 40 andro katroka no nanaovany an’izany. izany mantsy no faharetan’ny fotoana fanosorana zava-manitra amin’ny faty. ary nitomany azy 70 andro ny ejipsianina.'),
  ('6aadc70246255125aa527de2', '2026-09-18T23:19:30.627Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:30.627Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 50, 2, 'Avy eo dia notenenin’i Josefa ireo mpitsabo anisan’ny mpanompony mba hanosotra zava-manitra amin’ny rainy. Nohosoran’izy ireo zava-manitra àry i Israely,', 'avy eo dia notenenin’i josefa ireo mpitsabo anisan’ny mpanompony mba hanosotra zava-manitra amin’ny rainy. nohosoran’izy ireo zava-manitra àry i israely,'),
  ('6aadc70246255125aa527de1', '2026-09-18T23:19:30.627Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:30.627Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Genesisy', 1, 50, 1, 'Dia nihohoka teo amin’ny rainy i Josefa, ka nitomany teo aminy sady nanoroka azy.', 'dia nihohoka teo amin’ny rainy i josefa, ka nitomany teo aminy sady nanoroka azy.'),
  ('6aadc71d8fc54b36fc9939bc', '2026-09-18T23:19:57.923Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:57.923Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 13, 14, 'Fa haloto kosa izy raha lasa misy fery eo amin’ilay faritra voa.', 'fa haloto kosa izy raha lasa misy fery eo amin’ilay faritra voa.'),
  ('6aadc71d8fc54b36fc9939bb', '2026-09-18T23:19:57.923Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:57.923Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 13, 13, 'ary zahan’ny mpisorona ilay marary ka hitany fa rakotry ny habokana ny hodiny, dia hambarany hoe madio izy. Efa lasa fotsy daholo ilay izy, ka madio ilay marary.', 'ary zahan’ny mpisorona ilay marary ka hitany fa rakotry ny habokana ny hodiny, dia hambarany hoe madio izy. efa lasa fotsy daholo ilay izy, ka madio ilay marary.'),
  ('6aadc71d8fc54b36fc9939ba', '2026-09-18T23:19:57.923Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:57.923Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 13, 12, 'Raha mipoipoitra eny amin’ny hoditra manontolo ilay habokana, ka hitan’ny mpisorona hoe rakotry ny habokana ilay olona, na aiza na aiza jereny, hatrany an-tampon-dohany ka hatrany am-paladiany,', 'raha mipoipoitra eny amin’ny hoditra manontolo ilay habokana, ka hitan’ny mpisorona hoe rakotry ny habokana ilay olona, na aiza na aiza jereny, hatrany an-tampon-dohany ka hatrany am-paladiany,'),
  ('6aadc71d8fc54b36fc9939b9', '2026-09-18T23:19:57.923Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:57.923Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 13, 11, 'dia habokana efa ela teo amin’ny hodiny izany. Hambaran’ny mpisorona hoe maloto àry ilay olona. Tsy hatokany toerana izy, satria efa maloto.', 'dia habokana efa ela teo amin’ny hodiny izany. hambaran’ny mpisorona hoe maloto àry ilay olona. tsy hatokany toerana izy, satria efa maloto.'),
  ('6aadc71d8fc54b36fc9939b8', '2026-09-18T23:19:57.923Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:57.923Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 13, 10, 'ka hozahan’ny mpisorona. Raha misy fotsifotsy mivonto eo amin’ny hodiny sady lasa fotsy ny volo eo amin’ilay izy, ary misy fery eo amin’ilay mivonto,', 'ka hozahan’ny mpisorona. raha misy fotsifotsy mivonto eo amin’ny hodiny sady lasa fotsy ny volo eo amin’ilay izy, ary misy fery eo amin’ilay mivonto,'),
  ('6aadc71d8fc54b36fc9939b7', '2026-09-18T23:19:57.923Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:57.923Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 13, 9, '“Raha misy habokana ny olona iray, dia tsy maintsy entina any amin’ny mpisorona izy,', '“raha misy habokana ny olona iray, dia tsy maintsy entina any amin’ny mpisorona izy,'),
  ('6aadc71d8fc54b36fc9939b6', '2026-09-18T23:19:57.923Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:57.923Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 13, 8, 'Hozahan’ny mpisorona ilay aretin-koditra manako-pery, ka raha hitany hoe mitatra, dia hambarany hoe maloto ilay olona. Habokana izany.', 'hozahan’ny mpisorona ilay aretin-koditra manako-pery, ka raha hitany hoe mitatra, dia hambarany hoe maloto ilay olona. habokana izany.'),
  ('6aadc71d8fc54b36fc9939b5', '2026-09-18T23:19:57.923Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:57.923Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 13, 7, 'Fa raha tena mitatra eo amin’ny hoditra kosa ilay manako-pery, taorian’ny nisehoan’ilay olona teo anatrehan’ny mpisorona mba hanekena azy ho madio, dia hiseho eo anatrehan’ilay mpisorona indray izy.', 'fa raha tena mitatra eo amin’ny hoditra kosa ilay manako-pery, taorian’ny nisehoan’ilay olona teo anatrehan’ny mpisorona mba hanekena azy ho madio, dia hiseho eo anatrehan’ilay mpisorona indray izy.'),
  ('6aadc71d8fc54b36fc9939b4', '2026-09-18T23:19:57.923Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:57.923Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 13, 6, '“Hizaha azy indray ny mpisorona amin’ny andro fahafito. Hojereny ny hoditr’ilay olona, ka raha mihavasoka ilay faritra voa ary tsy mitatra ilay izy, dia hambarany hoe madio ilay olona. Aretin-koditra manako-pery fotsiny ilay izy. Hanasa ny akanjony ilay olona avy eo, ka hadio.', '“hizaha azy indray ny mpisorona amin’ny andro fahafito. hojereny ny hoditr’ilay olona, ka raha mihavasoka ilay faritra voa ary tsy mitatra ilay izy, dia hambarany hoe madio ilay olona. aretin-koditra manako-pery fotsiny ilay izy. hanasa ny akanjony ilay olona avy eo, ka hadio.'),
  ('6aadc71d8fc54b36fc9939b3', '2026-09-18T23:19:57.923Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:57.923Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 13, 5, 'Hozahan’ny mpisorona izy amin’ny andro fahafito. Hojereny ny hoditr’ilay olona, ka raha hitany fa tsy mihombo ilay aretina sady tsy mitatra, dia hatokany toerana fito andro indray izy.', 'hozahan’ny mpisorona izy amin’ny andro fahafito. hojereny ny hoditr’ilay olona, ka raha hitany fa tsy mihombo ilay aretina sady tsy mitatra, dia hatokany toerana fito andro indray izy.'),
  ('6aadc71d8fc54b36fc9939b2', '2026-09-18T23:19:57.923Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:57.923Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 13, 4, 'Fa raha fotsy kosa ny tasy eo amin’ny hoditr’ilay olona, ary hoatran’ny hoe tsy mandoaka no fahitany an’ilay izy sady tsy lasa fotsy ny volo eo aminy, dia hatokany toerana fito andro ilay marary.', 'fa raha fotsy kosa ny tasy eo amin’ny hoditr’ilay olona, ary hoatran’ny hoe tsy mandoaka no fahitany an’ilay izy sady tsy lasa fotsy ny volo eo aminy, dia hatokany toerana fito andro ilay marary.'),
  ('6aadc71d8fc54b36fc9939b1', '2026-09-18T23:19:57.923Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:57.923Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 13, 3, 'Hozahan’ny mpisorona ilay aretin-koditra. Raha lasa fotsy ny volo eo amin’ilay izy, sady hoatran’ny hoe mandoaka no fahitany an’ilay izy, dia habokana izany. Hozahan’ny mpisorona izany, ka hambarany hoe maloto ilay olona.', 'hozahan’ny mpisorona ilay aretin-koditra. raha lasa fotsy ny volo eo amin’ilay izy, sady hoatran’ny hoe mandoaka no fahitany an’ilay izy, dia habokana izany. hozahan’ny mpisorona izany, ka hambarany hoe maloto ilay olona.'),
  ('6aadc71d8fc54b36fc9939b0', '2026-09-18T23:19:57.923Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:57.923Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 13, 2, '“Raha misy mivonto na misy tako-pery na misy tasy ny hoditry ny olona iray, ka mety ho lasa habokana eo amin’ny hodiny izany, dia tsy maintsy entina any amin’i Arona mpisorona izy, na any amin’ny iray amin’ireo mpisorona zanakalahin’i Arona.', '“raha misy mivonto na misy tako-pery na misy tasy ny hoditry ny olona iray, ka mety ho lasa habokana eo amin’ny hodiny izany, dia tsy maintsy entina any amin’i arona mpisorona izy, na any amin’ny iray amin’ireo mpisorona zanakalahin’i arona.'),
  ('6aadc71d8fc54b36fc9939af', '2026-09-18T23:19:57.923Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:57.923Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 13, 1, 'Niteny tamin’i Mosesy sy Arona koa i Jehovah hoe:', 'niteny tamin’i mosesy sy arona koa i jehovah hoe:'),
  ('6aadc71d8fc54b36fc9939e9', '2026-09-18T23:19:57.924Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:57.924Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 13, 59, '“Izany no lalàna momba ny habokana eo amin’ny akanjo volonondry na akanjo rongony, na eo amin’ny kofehy natao tenany na natao fahany, na eo amin’izay zavatra vita amin’ny hoditra, mba hanambarana azy hoe madio na maloto.”', '“izany no lalàna momba ny habokana eo amin’ny akanjo volonondry na akanjo rongony, na eo amin’ny kofehy natao tenany na natao fahany, na eo amin’izay zavatra vita amin’ny hoditra, mba hanambarana azy hoe madio na maloto.”'),
  ('6aadc71d8fc54b36fc9939e8', '2026-09-18T23:19:57.924Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:57.924Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 13, 58, 'Fa raha afaka kosa ilay aretina rehefa avy nosasana ilay akanjo, na ilay kofehy natao tenany na natao fahany, na izay zavatra vita amin’ny hoditra, dia tokony hosasana fanindroany ilay izy ka hadio.', 'fa raha afaka kosa ilay aretina rehefa avy nosasana ilay akanjo, na ilay kofehy natao tenany na natao fahany, na izay zavatra vita amin’ny hoditra, dia tokony hosasana fanindroany ilay izy ka hadio.'),
  ('6aadc71d8fc54b36fc9939e7', '2026-09-18T23:19:57.924Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:57.924Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 13, 57, 'Raha toa anefa ilay aretina ka mbola miseho any amin’ny faritra hafa amin’ilay akanjo, na amin’ilay kofehy natao tenany na natao fahany, na amin’izay zavatra vita amin’ny hoditra, dia midika izany fa mirongatra ilay izy. Tokony hodoranao amin’ny afo izay zavatra misy an’ilay aretina.', 'raha toa anefa ilay aretina ka mbola miseho any amin’ny faritra hafa amin’ilay akanjo, na amin’ilay kofehy natao tenany na natao fahany, na amin’izay zavatra vita amin’ny hoditra, dia midika izany fa mirongatra ilay izy. tokony hodoranao amin’ny afo izay zavatra misy an’ilay aretina.'),
  ('6aadc71d8fc54b36fc9939e6', '2026-09-18T23:19:57.924Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:57.924Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 13, 56, '“Fa raha zahan’ny mpisorona kosa ilay faritra voa, ka hitany fa vasoka rehefa avy nosasana tsara, dia ilay faritra voa amin’ilay akanjo na amin’ilay hoditra na amin’ilay kofehy natao tenany na natao fahany ihany no hesoriny.', '“fa raha zahan’ny mpisorona kosa ilay faritra voa, ka hitany fa vasoka rehefa avy nosasana tsara, dia ilay faritra voa amin’ilay akanjo na amin’ilay hoditra na amin’ilay kofehy natao tenany na natao fahany ihany no hesoriny.'),
  ('6aadc71d8fc54b36fc9939e5', '2026-09-18T23:19:57.924Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:57.924Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 13, 55, 'Hozahan’ny mpisorona avy eo ilay zavatra misy an’ilay aretina rehefa avy nosasana tsara. Raha tsy niova ny fahitany an’ilay aretina na dia tsy nitatra aza ilay izy, dia maloto ilay zavatra. Tokony hodoranao amin’ny afo izany, fa efa lanin’ny aretina ny lafy ratsiny na ny lafy tsarany.', 'hozahan’ny mpisorona avy eo ilay zavatra misy an’ilay aretina rehefa avy nosasana tsara. raha tsy niova ny fahitany an’ilay aretina na dia tsy nitatra aza ilay izy, dia maloto ilay zavatra. tokony hodoranao amin’ny afo izany, fa efa lanin’ny aretina ny lafy ratsiny na ny lafy tsarany.'),
  ('6aadc71d8fc54b36fc9939e4', '2026-09-18T23:19:57.924Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:57.924Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 13, 54, 'dia hasainy hosasana ny zavatra misy an’ilay aretina, ary hatokany toerana fito andro indray ilay izy.', 'dia hasainy hosasana ny zavatra misy an’ilay aretina, ary hatokany toerana fito andro indray ilay izy.'),
  ('6aadc71d8fc54b36fc9939e3', '2026-09-18T23:19:57.924Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:57.924Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 13, 53, '“Fa raha zahan’ny mpisorona kosa izany, ka hitany fa tsy mitatra ilay aretina eo amin’ilay akanjo, na eo amin’ilay kofehy natao tenany na natao fahany, na eo amin’izay zavatra vita amin’ny hoditra,', '“fa raha zahan’ny mpisorona kosa izany, ka hitany fa tsy mitatra ilay aretina eo amin’ilay akanjo, na eo amin’ilay kofehy natao tenany na natao fahany, na eo amin’izay zavatra vita amin’ny hoditra,'),
  ('6aadc71d8fc54b36fc9939e2', '2026-09-18T23:19:57.924Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:57.924Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 13, 52, 'Hodorany ilay akanjo, na ilay kofehy natao tenany na natao fahany tamin’ny lamba volonondry na lamba rongony, na izay zavatra vita amin’ny hoditra ka misy an’ilay aretina, satria habokana mampidi-doza izany. Hodorana amin’ny afo ilay izy.', 'hodorany ilay akanjo, na ilay kofehy natao tenany na natao fahany tamin’ny lamba volonondry na lamba rongony, na izay zavatra vita amin’ny hoditra ka misy an’ilay aretina, satria habokana mampidi-doza izany. hodorana amin’ny afo ilay izy.'),
  ('6aadc71d8fc54b36fc9939e1', '2026-09-18T23:19:57.924Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:57.924Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 13, 51, 'Rehefa mizaha an’ilay aretina izy amin’ny andro fahafito, ka hitany fa mitatra ilay aretina eo amin’ilay akanjo, na eo amin’ilay kofehy natao tenany na natao fahany, na eo amin’ilay hoditra—na inona na inona ampiasana an’ilay hoditra—dia habokana mampidi-doza izany, ka maloto.', 'rehefa mizaha an’ilay aretina izy amin’ny andro fahafito, ka hitany fa mitatra ilay aretina eo amin’ilay akanjo, na eo amin’ilay kofehy natao tenany na natao fahany, na eo amin’ilay hoditra—na inona na inona ampiasana an’ilay hoditra—dia habokana mampidi-doza izany, ka maloto.'),
  ('6aadc71d8fc54b36fc9939e0', '2026-09-18T23:19:57.924Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:57.924Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 13, 50, 'Hozahan’ny mpisorona ilay aretina, ka hatokany toerana fito andro ireo zavatra misy an’ilay aretina.', 'hozahan’ny mpisorona ilay aretina, ka hatokany toerana fito andro ireo zavatra misy an’ilay aretina.'),
  ('6aadc71d8fc54b36fc9939df', '2026-09-18T23:19:57.924Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:57.924Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 13, 49, 'ka misy mifaritra maitso somary mavo na somary mena eo amin’ilay akanjo, na ilay hoditra, na ilay tenany, na ilay fahany, na izay zavatra vita amin’ny hoditra, dia habokana izany ka tokony haseho amin’ny mpisorona.', 'ka misy mifaritra maitso somary mavo na somary mena eo amin’ilay akanjo, na ilay hoditra, na ilay tenany, na ilay fahany, na izay zavatra vita amin’ny hoditra, dia habokana izany ka tokony haseho amin’ny mpisorona.'),
  ('6aadc71d8fc54b36fc9939de', '2026-09-18T23:19:57.924Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:57.924Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 13, 48, 'na eo amin’ny kofehy natao tenany na natao fahany tamin’ilay lamba rongony na lamba volonondry, na eo amin’ny hoditra na zavatra vita amin’ny hoditra,', 'na eo amin’ny kofehy natao tenany na natao fahany tamin’ilay lamba rongony na lamba volonondry, na eo amin’ny hoditra na zavatra vita amin’ny hoditra,'),
  ('6aadc71d8fc54b36fc9939dd', '2026-09-18T23:19:57.924Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:57.924Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 13, 47, '“Raha misy habokana eo amin’ny akanjo, na akanjo volonondry izany na akanjo rongony,', '“raha misy habokana eo amin’ny akanjo, na akanjo volonondry izany na akanjo rongony,'),
  ('6aadc71d8fc54b36fc9939dc', '2026-09-18T23:19:57.924Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:57.924Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 13, 46, 'Haloto izy mandritra ny fotoana aharariany. Maloto izy ka tokony hitoka-monina. Any ivelan’ny toby izy no hipetraka.', 'haloto izy mandritra ny fotoana aharariany. maloto izy ka tokony hitoka-monina. any ivelan’ny toby izy no hipetraka.'),
  ('6aadc71d8fc54b36fc9939db', '2026-09-18T23:19:57.924Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:57.924Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 13, 45, 'Tokony horovitina ny akanjon’ilay olona boka, ary havela hisavoritaka ny volony. Hosaronany ny volombava eo ambonin’ny molony, ka hiantsoantso izy hoe: ‘Maloto e! Maloto e!’', 'tokony horovitina ny akanjon’ilay olona boka, ary havela hisavoritaka ny volony. hosaronany ny volombava eo ambonin’ny molony, ka hiantsoantso izy hoe: ‘maloto e! maloto e!’'),
  ('6aadc71d8fc54b36fc9939da', '2026-09-18T23:19:57.924Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:57.924Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 13, 44, 'dia boka ilay olona. Maloto izy, ary hambaran’ny mpisorona hoe maloto izy satria misy an’ilay aretina eo amin’ny lohany.', 'dia boka ilay olona. maloto izy, ary hambaran’ny mpisorona hoe maloto izy satria misy an’ilay aretina eo amin’ny lohany.'),
  ('6aadc71d8fc54b36fc9939d9', '2026-09-18T23:19:57.924Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:57.924Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 13, 43, 'Hozahan’ny mpisorona ilay olona, ka raha fotsy somary mena ilay mivonto eo amin’ilay fery, eo amin’ilay faritra sola eo an-tampon-dohany na eo amin’ny handriny, ary toy ny habokana no fahitana azy eo amin’ny hodiny,', 'hozahan’ny mpisorona ilay olona, ka raha fotsy somary mena ilay mivonto eo amin’ilay fery, eo amin’ilay faritra sola eo an-tampon-dohany na eo amin’ny handriny, ary toy ny habokana no fahitana azy eo amin’ny hodiny,'),
  ('6aadc71d8fc54b36fc9939d8', '2026-09-18T23:19:57.924Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:57.924Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 13, 42, 'Fa raha misy fery fotsy somary mena kosa eo amin’ilay faritra sola amin’ny hodi-dohany na eo amin’ny handriny, dia habokana mipoitra eo amin’ny hodi-dohany na eo amin’ny handriny izany.', 'fa raha misy fery fotsy somary mena kosa eo amin’ilay faritra sola amin’ny hodi-dohany na eo amin’ny handriny, dia habokana mipoitra eo amin’ny hodi-dohany na eo amin’ny handriny izany.'),
  ('6aadc71d8fc54b36fc9939d7', '2026-09-18T23:19:57.924Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:57.924Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 13, 41, 'Raha mihintsana ny volony eo anoloana ka lasa sola, dia madio izy.', 'raha mihintsana ny volony eo anoloana ka lasa sola, dia madio izy.'),
  ('6aadc71d8fc54b36fc9939d6', '2026-09-18T23:19:57.924Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:57.924Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 13, 40, '“Raha misy lehilahy mihintsam-bolo ka lasa sola, dia madio izy.', '“raha misy lehilahy mihintsam-bolo ka lasa sola, dia madio izy.'),
  ('6aadc71d8fc54b36fc9939d5', '2026-09-18T23:19:57.924Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:57.924Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 13, 39, 'dia hozahan’ny mpisorona ireo tasy. Raha fotsy vasobasoka ny tasy eo amin’ny hodiny, dia aretin-koditra nipoitra teo amin’ny hoditra izany ary tsy misy atahorana. Madio ilay olona.', 'dia hozahan’ny mpisorona ireo tasy. raha fotsy vasobasoka ny tasy eo amin’ny hodiny, dia aretin-koditra nipoitra teo amin’ny hoditra izany ary tsy misy atahorana. madio ilay olona.'),
  ('6aadc71d8fc54b36fc9939d4', '2026-09-18T23:19:57.924Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:57.924Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 13, 38, '“Raha misy lehilahy na vehivavy ahitana tasy fotsy maromaro ny hodiny,', '“raha misy lehilahy na vehivavy ahitana tasy fotsy maromaro ny hodiny,'),
  ('6aadc71d8fc54b36fc9939d3', '2026-09-18T23:19:57.924Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:57.924Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 13, 37, 'Raha hitany kosa fa tsy nitatra ilay aretina sady misy volo mainty maniry eo amin’ilay izy, dia sitrana ilay aretina. Madio ilay olona, ary hambaran’ny mpisorona hoe madio izy.', 'raha hitany kosa fa tsy nitatra ilay aretina sady misy volo mainty maniry eo amin’ilay izy, dia sitrana ilay aretina. madio ilay olona, ary hambaran’ny mpisorona hoe madio izy.'),
  ('6aadc71d8fc54b36fc9939d2', '2026-09-18T23:19:57.924Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:57.924Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 13, 36, 'dia hozahan’ny mpisorona izy. Raha mitatra eo amin’ny hoditra ilay aretina, dia tsy ilainy intsony ny mitady volo mavo. Efa maloto ilay olona.', 'dia hozahan’ny mpisorona izy. raha mitatra eo amin’ny hoditra ilay aretina, dia tsy ilainy intsony ny mitady volo mavo. efa maloto ilay olona.'),
  ('6aadc71d8fc54b36fc9939d1', '2026-09-18T23:19:57.924Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:57.924Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 13, 35, 'Fa raha mitatra tokoa ilay aretina eo amin’ny hoditra, taorian’ny nidiovan’ilay olona,', 'fa raha mitatra tokoa ilay aretina eo amin’ny hoditra, taorian’ny nidiovan’ilay olona,'),
  ('6aadc71d8fc54b36fc9939d0', '2026-09-18T23:19:57.924Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:57.924Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 13, 34, '“Hozahan’ny mpisorona indray ilay faritra misy aretina, amin’ny andro fahafito. Raha tsy mitatra eo amin’ny hoditra ilay aretina eo amin’ny hodi-doha sy volombava, sady hoatran’ny hoe tsy mandoaka no fahitany an’ilay izy, dia hambarany hoe madio ilay olona. Hanasa ny akanjony ilay olona avy eo, ka hadio.', '“hozahan’ny mpisorona indray ilay faritra misy aretina, amin’ny andro fahafito. raha tsy mitatra eo amin’ny hoditra ilay aretina eo amin’ny hodi-doha sy volombava, sady hoatran’ny hoe tsy mandoaka no fahitany an’ilay izy, dia hambarany hoe madio ilay olona. hanasa ny akanjony ilay olona avy eo, ka hadio.'),
  ('6aadc71d8fc54b36fc9939cf', '2026-09-18T23:19:57.924Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:57.924Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 13, 33, 'dia hiharatra ilay marary. Tsy hoharatany kosa ilay faritra misy aretina. Hanokan-toerana azy fito andro ny mpisorona avy eo.', 'dia hiharatra ilay marary. tsy hoharatany kosa ilay faritra misy aretina. hanokan-toerana azy fito andro ny mpisorona avy eo.'),
  ('6aadc71d8fc54b36fc9939ce', '2026-09-18T23:19:57.924Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:57.924Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 13, 32, 'Hozahan’ny mpisorona ilay aretina, amin’ny andro fahafito. Raha tsy mitatra ilay faritra misy aretina, ary tsy misy volo mavo maniry eo aminy sady hoatran’ny hoe tsy mandoaka no fahitany an’ilay izy,', 'hozahan’ny mpisorona ilay aretina, amin’ny andro fahafito. raha tsy mitatra ilay faritra misy aretina, ary tsy misy volo mavo maniry eo aminy sady hoatran’ny hoe tsy mandoaka no fahitany an’ilay izy,'),
  ('6aadc71d8fc54b36fc9939cd', '2026-09-18T23:19:57.924Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:57.924Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 13, 31, 'Raha hitan’ny mpisorona anefa fa hoatran’ny hoe tsy mandoaka ilay aretina, ary tsy misy mainty ny volo eo amin’ilay izy, dia hatokany toerana fito andro ilay marary.', 'raha hitan’ny mpisorona anefa fa hoatran’ny hoe tsy mandoaka ilay aretina, ary tsy misy mainty ny volo eo amin’ilay izy, dia hatokany toerana fito andro ilay marary.'),
  ('6aadc71d8fc54b36fc9939cc', '2026-09-18T23:19:57.924Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:57.924Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 13, 30, 'dia hozahan’ny mpisorona ilay aretina. Raha hoatran’ny hoe mandoaka no fahitany an’ilay izy ary mavo ny volo eo aminy sady manify, dia hambarany hoe maloto ilay olona. Aretin’ny hodi-doha na aretina mahazo ny volombava izany. Habokana eo amin’ny loha na saoka izany.', 'dia hozahan’ny mpisorona ilay aretina. raha hoatran’ny hoe mandoaka no fahitany an’ilay izy ary mavo ny volo eo aminy sady manify, dia hambarany hoe maloto ilay olona. aretin’ny hodi-doha na aretina mahazo ny volombava izany. habokana eo amin’ny loha na saoka izany.'),
  ('6aadc71d8fc54b36fc9939cb', '2026-09-18T23:19:57.924Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:57.924Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 13, 29, '“Raha misy lehilahy na vehivavy manana aretina eo amin’ny lohany na eo amin’ny saokany,', '“raha misy lehilahy na vehivavy manana aretina eo amin’ny lohany na eo amin’ny saokany,'),
  ('6aadc71d8fc54b36fc9939ca', '2026-09-18T23:19:57.924Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:57.924Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 13, 28, 'Fa raha mijanona eo amin’ny faritra iray ihany ilay tasy eo amin’ny hoditra fa tsy mitatra sady vasoka, dia fery mivonto fotsiny izany. Hambaran’ny mpisorona hoe madio ilay olona, satria ratra mivoaramena izany.', 'fa raha mijanona eo amin’ny faritra iray ihany ilay tasy eo amin’ny hoditra fa tsy mitatra sady vasoka, dia fery mivonto fotsiny izany. hambaran’ny mpisorona hoe madio ilay olona, satria ratra mivoaramena izany.'),
  ('6aadc71d8fc54b36fc9939c9', '2026-09-18T23:19:57.924Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:57.924Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 13, 27, 'Hozahan’ny mpisorona izy amin’ny andro fahafito. Hojereny ny hoditr’ilay olona, ka raha hitany hoe mitatra tokoa ilay izy, dia hambarany hoe maloto ilay olona. Habokana izany.', 'hozahan’ny mpisorona izy amin’ny andro fahafito. hojereny ny hoditr’ilay olona, ka raha hitany hoe mitatra tokoa ilay izy, dia hambarany hoe maloto ilay olona. habokana izany.');
INSERT INTO "bible_verses" ("id", "created_date", "updated_date", "created_by_id", "created_by", "translation", "book", "bookOrder", "chapter", "verse", "text", "normalizedText") VALUES
  ('6aadc71d8fc54b36fc9939c8', '2026-09-18T23:19:57.924Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:57.924Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 13, 26, 'Fa raha zahan’ny mpisorona kosa izany, ka hitany fa tsy misy fotsy ny volo eo amin’ilay tasy ary tsy mandoaka ilay izy sady vasoka, dia hatokany toerana fito andro ilay marary.', 'fa raha zahan’ny mpisorona kosa izany, ka hitany fa tsy misy fotsy ny volo eo amin’ilay tasy ary tsy mandoaka ilay izy sady vasoka, dia hatokany toerana fito andro ilay marary.'),
  ('6aadc71d8fc54b36fc9939c7', '2026-09-18T23:19:57.924Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:57.924Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 13, 25, 'dia hozahan’ny mpisorona izany. Raha lasa fotsy ny volo eo amin’ilay tasy sady hoatran’ny hoe mandoaka no fahitany an’ilay izy, dia habokana nipoitra teo amin’ilay fery izany. Hambarany hoe maloto ilay olona. Habokana izany.', 'dia hozahan’ny mpisorona izany. raha lasa fotsy ny volo eo amin’ilay tasy sady hoatran’ny hoe mandoaka no fahitany an’ilay izy, dia habokana nipoitra teo amin’ilay fery izany. hambarany hoe maloto ilay olona. habokana izany.'),
  ('6aadc71d8fc54b36fc9939c6', '2026-09-18T23:19:57.924Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:57.924Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 13, 24, '“Na raha misy olona main’ny afo ka misy fery eo amin’ilay hoditra may, ary lasa tasy fotsy somary mena na lasa tasy fotsy ilay izy,', '“na raha misy olona main’ny afo ka misy fery eo amin’ilay hoditra may, ary lasa tasy fotsy somary mena na lasa tasy fotsy ilay izy,'),
  ('6aadc71d8fc54b36fc9939c5', '2026-09-18T23:19:57.924Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:57.924Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 13, 23, 'Fa raha mijanona eo amin’ny faritra iray ihany ilay tasy fa tsy mitatra, dia vay masaka izany. Koa hambaran’ilay mpisorona hoe madio ilay olona.', 'fa raha mijanona eo amin’ny faritra iray ihany ilay tasy fa tsy mitatra, dia vay masaka izany. koa hambaran’ilay mpisorona hoe madio ilay olona.'),
  ('6aadc71d8fc54b36fc9939c4', '2026-09-18T23:19:57.924Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:57.924Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 13, 22, 'Ary raha mitatra tokoa ilay tasy eo amin’ny hoditra, dia hambarany hoe maloto ilay olona. Areti-mifindra izany.', 'ary raha mitatra tokoa ilay tasy eo amin’ny hoditra, dia hambarany hoe maloto ilay olona. areti-mifindra izany.'),
  ('6aadc71d8fc54b36fc9939c3', '2026-09-18T23:19:57.924Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:57.924Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 13, 21, 'Fa raha zahan’ny mpisorona kosa izany, ka hitany fa tsy misy fotsy ny volo eo amin’ilay izy, ary tsy mandoaka ilay izy sady hoatran’ny hoe vasoka no fahitany an’ilay izy, dia hatokany toerana fito andro ilay marary.', 'fa raha zahan’ny mpisorona kosa izany, ka hitany fa tsy misy fotsy ny volo eo amin’ilay izy, ary tsy mandoaka ilay izy sady hoatran’ny hoe vasoka no fahitany an’ilay izy, dia hatokany toerana fito andro ilay marary.'),
  ('6aadc71d8fc54b36fc9939c2', '2026-09-18T23:19:57.924Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:57.924Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 13, 20, 'Hozahan’ny mpisorona ilay aretina, ka raha hoatran’ny hoe mandoaka no fahitany an’ilay izy sady lasa fotsy ny volo eo aminy, dia hambarany hoe maloto ilay olona. Habokana nipoitra teo amin’ilay vay izany.', 'hozahan’ny mpisorona ilay aretina, ka raha hoatran’ny hoe mandoaka no fahitany an’ilay izy sady lasa fotsy ny volo eo aminy, dia hambarany hoe maloto ilay olona. habokana nipoitra teo amin’ilay vay izany.'),
  ('6aadc71d8fc54b36fc9939c1', '2026-09-18T23:19:57.924Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:57.924Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 13, 19, 'nefa lasa misy fotsifotsy mivonto na tasy fotsy somary mena eo amin’ilay nisy vay, dia tsy maintsy miseho any amin’ny mpisorona izy.', 'nefa lasa misy fotsifotsy mivonto na tasy fotsy somary mena eo amin’ilay nisy vay, dia tsy maintsy miseho any amin’ny mpisorona izy.'),
  ('6aadc71d8fc54b36fc9939c0', '2026-09-18T23:19:57.924Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:57.924Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 13, 18, '“Raha misy vay eo amin’ny hoditry ny olona iray ary efa sitrana ilay izy,', '“raha misy vay eo amin’ny hoditry ny olona iray ary efa sitrana ilay izy,'),
  ('6aadc71d8fc54b36fc9939bf', '2026-09-18T23:19:57.924Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:57.924Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 13, 17, 'Hozahan’ny mpisorona izy, ka raha lasa fotsy ilay faritra voa, dia hambarany hoe madio ilay marary. Madio izy.', 'hozahan’ny mpisorona izy, ka raha lasa fotsy ilay faritra voa, dia hambarany hoe madio ilay marary. madio izy.'),
  ('6aadc71d8fc54b36fc9939be', '2026-09-18T23:19:57.924Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:57.924Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 13, 16, 'Fa raha lasa fotsy indray ilay fery, dia hankany amin’ny mpisorona ilay olona.', 'fa raha lasa fotsy indray ilay fery, dia hankany amin’ny mpisorona ilay olona.'),
  ('6aadc71d8fc54b36fc9939bd', '2026-09-18T23:19:57.924Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:57.924Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 13, 15, 'Rehefa hitan’ny mpisorona ilay fery, dia hambarany hoe maloto ilay olona. Maloto ilay fery. Habokana izany.', 'rehefa hitan’ny mpisorona ilay fery, dia hambarany hoe maloto ilay olona. maloto ilay fery. habokana izany.'),
  ('6aadc71e2e5d64291e9044c3', '2026-09-18T23:19:58.354Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:58.354Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 14, 27, 'Dia hafafiny impito eo anatrehan’i Jehovah, amin’ny iray amin’ny rantsantanany ankavanana, ny menaka sasany eo amin’ny felatanany ankavia.', 'dia hafafiny impito eo anatrehan’i jehovah, amin’ny iray amin’ny rantsantanany ankavanana, ny menaka sasany eo amin’ny felatanany ankavia.'),
  ('6aadc71e2e5d64291e9044c2', '2026-09-18T23:19:58.354Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:58.354Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 14, 26, 'Hakan’ny mpisorona koa ny menaka ka hararany eo amin’ny felatanany ankavia.', 'hakan’ny mpisorona koa ny menaka ka hararany eo amin’ny felatanany ankavia.'),
  ('6aadc71e2e5d64291e9044c1', '2026-09-18T23:19:58.354Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:58.354Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 14, 25, 'Hovonoiny avy eo ilay ondrilahy kely atao fanatitra noho ny heloka. Dia hakany ny ran’ilay fanatitra noho ny heloka, ka hataony eo amin’ny ravintsofina ankavanan’ilay olona midio sy eo amin’ny ankiben-tanany ankavanana ary ny ankiben-tongony ankavanana.', 'hovonoiny avy eo ilay ondrilahy kely atao fanatitra noho ny heloka. dia hakany ny ran’ilay fanatitra noho ny heloka, ka hataony eo amin’ny ravintsofina ankavanan’ilay olona midio sy eo amin’ny ankiben-tanany ankavanana ary ny ankiben-tongony ankavanana.'),
  ('6aadc71e2e5d64291e9044c0', '2026-09-18T23:19:58.354Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:58.354Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 14, 24, '“Halain’ny mpisorona ilay ondrilahy kely atao fanatitra noho ny heloka sy ny menaka iray loga, ka hahetsiketsiny ho fanatitra ahetsiketsika eo anatrehan’i Jehovah.', '“halain’ny mpisorona ilay ondrilahy kely atao fanatitra noho ny heloka sy ny menaka iray loga, ka hahetsiketsiny ho fanatitra ahetsiketsika eo anatrehan’i jehovah.'),
  ('6aadc71e2e5d64291e9044bf', '2026-09-18T23:19:58.354Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:58.354Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 14, 23, 'Hoentiny any amin’ny mpisorona eo amin’ny fidirana amin’ny tranolay fihaonana, eo anatrehan’i Jehovah, ireo amin’ny andro fahavalo, mba hanekena azy ho madio.', 'hoentiny any amin’ny mpisorona eo amin’ny fidirana amin’ny tranolay fihaonana, eo anatrehan’i jehovah, ireo amin’ny andro fahavalo, mba hanekena azy ho madio.'),
  ('6aadc71e2e5d64291e9044be', '2026-09-18T23:19:58.354Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:58.354Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 14, 22, 'sy domohina roa na zana-boromailala roa koa izy, araka izay takatry ny volany. Ny vorona iray ho fanatitra noho ny ota, ary ny iray ho fanatitra dorana.', 'sy domohina roa na zana-boromailala roa koa izy, araka izay takatry ny volany. ny vorona iray ho fanatitra noho ny ota, ary ny iray ho fanatitra dorana.'),
  ('6aadc71e2e5d64291e9044bd', '2026-09-18T23:19:58.354Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:58.354Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 14, 21, '“Fa raha mahantra kosa ilay olona ka tsy mahatakatra an’izany, dia haka ondrilahy kely iray ho fanatitra noho ny heloka izy hatao fanatitra ahetsiketsika, mba handrakofana ny fahotany. Dia haka lafarinina tsara toto ampahafolon’ny efaha nafangaro menaka izy, ho fanatitra varimbazaha. Haka menaka iray loga,', '“fa raha mahantra kosa ilay olona ka tsy mahatakatra an’izany, dia haka ondrilahy kely iray ho fanatitra noho ny heloka izy hatao fanatitra ahetsiketsika, mba handrakofana ny fahotany. dia haka lafarinina tsara toto ampahafolon’ny efaha nafangaro menaka izy, ho fanatitra varimbazaha. haka menaka iray loga,'),
  ('6aadc71e2e5d64291e9044bc', '2026-09-18T23:19:58.354Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:58.354Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 14, 20, 'Ary hatolony eo ambony alitara ny fanatitra dorana sy ny fanatitra varimbazaha. Dia handrakotra ny fahotan’ilay olona izy, ka hadio ilay olona.', 'ary hatolony eo ambony alitara ny fanatitra dorana sy ny fanatitra varimbazaha. dia handrakotra ny fahotan’ilay olona izy, ka hadio ilay olona.'),
  ('6aadc71e2e5d64291e9044bb', '2026-09-18T23:19:58.354Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:58.354Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 14, 19, '“Hanolotra ny fanatitra noho ny ota ny mpisorona, ka handrakotra ny fahotan’ilay olona izay midio ho afaka amin’ny fahalotoany. Dia hovonoiny ny fanatitra dorana avy eo.', '“hanolotra ny fanatitra noho ny ota ny mpisorona, ka handrakotra ny fahotan’ilay olona izay midio ho afaka amin’ny fahalotoany. dia hovonoiny ny fanatitra dorana avy eo.'),
  ('6aadc71e2e5d64291e9044ba', '2026-09-18T23:19:58.354Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:58.354Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 14, 18, 'Ary hataon’ny mpisorona eo amin’ny lohan’ilay olona midio ny ambin’ilay menaka eo amin’ny felatanany. Ary handrakotra ny fahotan’ilay olona eo anatrehan’i Jehovah izy.', 'ary hataon’ny mpisorona eo amin’ny lohan’ilay olona midio ny ambin’ilay menaka eo amin’ny felatanany. ary handrakotra ny fahotan’ilay olona eo anatrehan’i jehovah izy.'),
  ('6aadc71e2e5d64291e9044b9', '2026-09-18T23:19:58.354Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:58.354Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 14, 17, 'Dia hakan’ilay mpisorona ny ambin’ilay menaka eo amin’ny felatanany, ka hataony eo amin’ny ravintsofina ankavanan’ilay olona midio, sy eo amin’ny ankiben-tanany ankavanana, ary ny ankiben-tongony ankavanana, eo amin’ilay nasiana ny ran’ny fanatitra noho ny heloka.', 'dia hakan’ilay mpisorona ny ambin’ilay menaka eo amin’ny felatanany, ka hataony eo amin’ny ravintsofina ankavanan’ilay olona midio, sy eo amin’ny ankiben-tanany ankavanana, ary ny ankiben-tongony ankavanana, eo amin’ilay nasiana ny ran’ny fanatitra noho ny heloka.'),
  ('6aadc71e2e5d64291e9044b8', '2026-09-18T23:19:58.354Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:58.354Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 14, 16, 'Ary hatsobony ao anatin’ilay menaka eo amin’ny felatanany ankavia ny iray amin’ny rantsantanany ankavanana, ka hafafiny impito eo anatrehan’i Jehovah amin’iny rantsantanany iny ny menaka sasany.', 'ary hatsobony ao anatin’ilay menaka eo amin’ny felatanany ankavia ny iray amin’ny rantsantanany ankavanana, ka hafafiny impito eo anatrehan’i jehovah amin’iny rantsantanany iny ny menaka sasany.'),
  ('6aadc71e2e5d64291e9044b7', '2026-09-18T23:19:58.354Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:58.354Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 14, 15, 'Dia hakan’ny mpisorona koa ilay menaka iray loga, ka hararany eo amin’ny felatanany ankavia.', 'dia hakan’ny mpisorona koa ilay menaka iray loga, ka hararany eo amin’ny felatanany ankavia.'),
  ('6aadc71e2e5d64291e9044b6', '2026-09-18T23:19:58.354Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:58.354Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 14, 14, '“Hakan’ny mpisorona avy eo ny ran’ilay fanatitra noho ny heloka, ka hataony eo amin’ny ravintsofina ankavanan’ilay olona midio, sy eo amin’ny ankiben-tanany ankavanana, ary ny ankiben-tongony ankavanana.', '“hakan’ny mpisorona avy eo ny ran’ilay fanatitra noho ny heloka, ka hataony eo amin’ny ravintsofina ankavanan’ilay olona midio, sy eo amin’ny ankiben-tanany ankavanana, ary ny ankiben-tongony ankavanana.'),
  ('6aadc71e2e5d64291e9044b5', '2026-09-18T23:19:58.354Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:58.354Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 14, 13, 'Dia hovonoiny ao amin’izay toerana masina, eo amin’ny toerana famonoana ny fanatitra noho ny ota sy ny fanatitra dorana, ilay ondrilahy kely. An’ny mpisorona mantsy ny fanatitra noho ny heloka, toy ny fanatitra noho ny ota ihany. Zavatra masina indrindra izany.', 'dia hovonoiny ao amin’izay toerana masina, eo amin’ny toerana famonoana ny fanatitra noho ny ota sy ny fanatitra dorana, ilay ondrilahy kely. an’ny mpisorona mantsy ny fanatitra noho ny heloka, toy ny fanatitra noho ny ota ihany. zavatra masina indrindra izany.'),
  ('6aadc71e2e5d64291e9044b4', '2026-09-18T23:19:58.354Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:58.354Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 14, 12, 'Halain’ny mpisorona ny ondrilahy kely iray, ka hatolony ho fanatitra noho ny heloka, miaraka amin’ilay menaka iray loga. Ary hahetsiketsiny ho fanatitra ahetsiketsika eo anatrehan’i Jehovah izany.', 'halain’ny mpisorona ny ondrilahy kely iray, ka hatolony ho fanatitra noho ny heloka, miaraka amin’ilay menaka iray loga. ary hahetsiketsiny ho fanatitra ahetsiketsika eo anatrehan’i jehovah izany.'),
  ('6aadc71e2e5d64291e9044b3', '2026-09-18T23:19:58.354Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:58.354Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 14, 11, 'Ary hitondra an’ilay olona midio sy ireo fanatitra ireo eo anatrehan’i Jehovah, eo amin’ny fidirana amin’ny tranolay fihaonana, ilay mpisorona manambara an’ilay olona ho madio.', 'ary hitondra an’ilay olona midio sy ireo fanatitra ireo eo anatrehan’i jehovah, eo amin’ny fidirana amin’ny tranolay fihaonana, ilay mpisorona manambara an’ilay olona ho madio.'),
  ('6aadc71e2e5d64291e9044b2', '2026-09-18T23:19:58.354Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:58.354Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 14, 10, '“Amin’ny andro fahavalo dia haka ondrilahy kely roa tsy misy kilema izy, ondrivavy kely iray tsy misy kilema sady tsy mihoatra ny herintaona, lafarinina tsara toto telo ampahafolon’ny efaha nafangaro menaka ho fanatitra varimbazaha, ary menaka iray loga.', '“amin’ny andro fahavalo dia haka ondrilahy kely roa tsy misy kilema izy, ondrivavy kely iray tsy misy kilema sady tsy mihoatra ny herintaona, lafarinina tsara toto telo ampahafolon’ny efaha nafangaro menaka ho fanatitra varimbazaha, ary menaka iray loga.'),
  ('6aadc71e2e5d64291e9044b1', '2026-09-18T23:19:58.354Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:58.354Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 14, 9, 'Hoharatany daholo ny volo eo amin’ny lohany sy ny saokany ary ny volomaso eo ambony masony, amin’ny andro fahafito. Rehefa avy noharatany daholo ny volo amin’ny tenany, dia hanasa ny akanjony izy sady handro amin’ny rano, ka hadio.', 'hoharatany daholo ny volo eo amin’ny lohany sy ny saokany ary ny volomaso eo ambony masony, amin’ny andro fahafito. rehefa avy noharatany daholo ny volo amin’ny tenany, dia hanasa ny akanjony izy sady handro amin’ny rano, ka hadio.'),
  ('6aadc71e2e5d64291e9044b0', '2026-09-18T23:19:58.354Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:58.354Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 14, 8, '“Hanasa ny akanjony ilay olona midio, ary hoharatany daholo ny volo amin’ny tenany. Dia handro amin’ny rano izy, ka hadio. Afaka miditra ao an-toby izy avy eo, nefa mbola hijanona fito andro eo ivelan’ny tranolainy.', '“hanasa ny akanjony ilay olona midio, ary hoharatany daholo ny volo amin’ny tenany. dia handro amin’ny rano izy, ka hadio. afaka miditra ao an-toby izy avy eo, nefa mbola hijanona fito andro eo ivelan’ny tranolainy.'),
  ('6aadc71e2e5d64291e9044af', '2026-09-18T23:19:58.354Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:58.354Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 14, 7, 'Ary hofafazany amin’ilay ra impito ilay olona manadio ny tenany ho afaka amin’ny habokany. Dia hambarany hoe madio izy. Avy eo, dia halefany hanidina any an-tsaha ilay vorona velona.', 'ary hofafazany amin’ilay ra impito ilay olona manadio ny tenany ho afaka amin’ny habokany. dia hambarany hoe madio izy. avy eo, dia halefany hanidina any an-tsaha ilay vorona velona.'),
  ('6aadc71e2e5d64291e9044ae', '2026-09-18T23:19:58.354Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:58.354Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 14, 6, 'Fa ilay vorona velona kosa halain’ny mpisorona dia hatsobony, miaraka amin’ilay rantsankazo sedera sy kofehy mena midorehitra ary hysopa, ao anatin’ny ran’ilay vorona novonoina teo ambony rano avy amin’ny rano mandeha.', 'fa ilay vorona velona kosa halain’ny mpisorona dia hatsobony, miaraka amin’ilay rantsankazo sedera sy kofehy mena midorehitra ary hysopa, ao anatin’ny ran’ilay vorona novonoina teo ambony rano avy amin’ny rano mandeha.'),
  ('6aadc71e2e5d64291e9044ad', '2026-09-18T23:19:58.354Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:58.354Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 14, 5, 'Ny vorona iray dia hasain’ny mpisorona hovonoina ao anaty vilany tany misy rano avy amin’ny rano mandeha.', 'ny vorona iray dia hasain’ny mpisorona hovonoina ao anaty vilany tany misy rano avy amin’ny rano mandeha.'),
  ('6aadc71e2e5d64291e9044ac', '2026-09-18T23:19:58.354Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:58.354Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 14, 4, 'dia hasain’ny mpisorona hitondra an’ireto mba hidiovany: Vorona roa madio sady velona, rantsankazo sedera, kofehy mena midorehitra, ary hysopa.', 'dia hasain’ny mpisorona hitondra an’ireto mba hidiovany: vorona roa madio sady velona, rantsankazo sedera, kofehy mena midorehitra, ary hysopa.'),
  ('6aadc71e2e5d64291e9044ab', '2026-09-18T23:19:58.354Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:58.354Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 14, 3, 'Hankany ivelan’ny toby ny mpisorona, ka hizaha azy. Raha sitrana amin’ny habokany ilay boka,', 'hankany ivelan’ny toby ny mpisorona, ka hizaha azy. raha sitrana amin’ny habokany ilay boka,'),
  ('6aadc71e2e5d64291e9044aa', '2026-09-18T23:19:58.354Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:58.354Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 14, 2, '“Izao no lalàna momba ny boka, amin’ny andro anekena azy ho madio, rehefa hoentina any amin’ny mpisorona izy:', '“izao no lalàna momba ny boka, amin’ny andro anekena azy ho madio, rehefa hoentina any amin’ny mpisorona izy:'),
  ('6aadc71e2e5d64291e9044a9', '2026-09-18T23:19:58.354Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:58.354Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 14, 1, 'Hoy koa i Jehovah tamin’i Mosesy:', 'hoy koa i jehovah tamin’i mosesy:'),
  ('6aadc71e2e5d64291e9044e1', '2026-09-18T23:19:58.355Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:58.355Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 14, 57, 'Nomena izany lalàna izany mba hampahafantarana hoe rahoviana ny zavatra iray no maloto ary rahoviana izany no madio. Izany no lalàna momba ny habokana.”', 'nomena izany lalàna izany mba hampahafantarana hoe rahoviana ny zavatra iray no maloto ary rahoviana izany no madio. izany no lalàna momba ny habokana.”'),
  ('6aadc71e2e5d64291e9044e0', '2026-09-18T23:19:58.355Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:58.355Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 14, 56, 'ny mivonto eo amin’ny hoditra, ny aretin-koditra manako-pery, ary ny tasy.', 'ny mivonto eo amin’ny hoditra, ny aretin-koditra manako-pery, ary ny tasy.'),
  ('6aadc71e2e5d64291e9044df', '2026-09-18T23:19:58.355Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:58.355Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 14, 55, 'ny habokana eo amin’ny akanjo na amin’ny trano,', 'ny habokana eo amin’ny akanjo na amin’ny trano,'),
  ('6aadc71e2e5d64291e9044de', '2026-09-18T23:19:58.355Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:58.355Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 14, 54, '“Izany no lalàna momba ny habokana, ny aretin’ny hodi-doha na aretina mahazo ny volombava,', '“izany no lalàna momba ny habokana, ny aretin’ny hodi-doha na aretina mahazo ny volombava,'),
  ('6aadc71e2e5d64291e9044dd', '2026-09-18T23:19:58.355Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:58.355Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 14, 53, 'Dia halefan’ny mpisorona any an-tsaha, any ivelan’ny tanàna, ilay vorona velona. Ary handrakotra ny fahotan’ilay trano izy, ka hadio izany.', 'dia halefan’ny mpisorona any an-tsaha, any ivelan’ny tanàna, ilay vorona velona. ary handrakotra ny fahotan’ilay trano izy, ka hadio izany.'),
  ('6aadc71e2e5d64291e9044dc', '2026-09-18T23:19:58.355Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:58.355Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 14, 52, 'Ary hodioviny ho afaka amin’ny fahalotoana ilay trano, ka ireto no hanadiovany azy: Ny ran’ilay vorona, ilay rano avy amin’ny rano mandeha, ilay vorona velona, ilay rantsankazo sedera, ilay hysopa, ary ilay kofehy mena midorehitra.', 'ary hodioviny ho afaka amin’ny fahalotoana ilay trano, ka ireto no hanadiovany azy: ny ran’ilay vorona, ilay rano avy amin’ny rano mandeha, ilay vorona velona, ilay rantsankazo sedera, ilay hysopa, ary ilay kofehy mena midorehitra.'),
  ('6aadc71e2e5d64291e9044db', '2026-09-18T23:19:58.355Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:58.355Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 14, 51, 'Dia halainy ny rantsankazo sedera, ny hysopa, ny kofehy mena midorehitra, ary ilay vorona velona, ka hatsobony ao anatin’ny ran’ilay vorona novonoina sy ao amin’ilay rano avy amin’ny rano mandeha. Ary hafafiny impito manandrify an’ilay trano izany.', 'dia halainy ny rantsankazo sedera, ny hysopa, ny kofehy mena midorehitra, ary ilay vorona velona, ka hatsobony ao anatin’ny ran’ilay vorona novonoina sy ao amin’ilay rano avy amin’ny rano mandeha. ary hafafiny impito manandrify an’ilay trano izany.'),
  ('6aadc71e2e5d64291e9044da', '2026-09-18T23:19:58.355Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:58.355Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 14, 50, 'Tokony hovonoiny ao anaty vilany tany misy rano avy amin’ny rano mandeha, ny vorona iray.', 'tokony hovonoiny ao anaty vilany tany misy rano avy amin’ny rano mandeha, ny vorona iray.'),
  ('6aadc71e2e5d64291e9044d9', '2026-09-18T23:19:58.355Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:58.355Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 14, 49, 'Dia haka vorona roa sy rantsankazo sedera sy kofehy mena midorehitra ary hysopa izy, mba hanadiovana an’ilay trano ho afaka amin’ny fahalotoana.', 'dia haka vorona roa sy rantsankazo sedera sy kofehy mena midorehitra ary hysopa izy, mba hanadiovana an’ilay trano ho afaka amin’ny fahalotoana.'),
  ('6aadc71e2e5d64291e9044d8', '2026-09-18T23:19:58.355Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:58.355Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 14, 48, '“Fa raha tonga kosa ny mpisorona ary hitany fa tsy mitatra ilay aretina ao amin’ilay trano avy nolalorina, dia hambarany hoe madio ilay trano, satria efa afaka ilay aretina.', '“fa raha tonga kosa ny mpisorona ary hitany fa tsy mitatra ilay aretina ao amin’ilay trano avy nolalorina, dia hambarany hoe madio ilay trano, satria efa afaka ilay aretina.'),
  ('6aadc71e2e5d64291e9044d7', '2026-09-18T23:19:58.355Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:58.355Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 14, 47, 'Ary hanasa ny akanjony izay olona matory ao amin’ilay trano, ary hanasa ny akanjony koa izay misakafo ao.', 'ary hanasa ny akanjony izay olona matory ao amin’ilay trano, ary hanasa ny akanjony koa izay misakafo ao.'),
  ('6aadc71e2e5d64291e9044d6', '2026-09-18T23:19:58.355Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:58.355Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 14, 46, 'Izay miditra ao amin’ilay trano mandritra ny fotoana ikatonany tanteraka, dia haloto mandra-paharivan’ny andro.', 'izay miditra ao amin’ilay trano mandritra ny fotoana ikatonany tanteraka, dia haloto mandra-paharivan’ny andro.'),
  ('6aadc71e2e5d64291e9044d5', '2026-09-18T23:19:58.355Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:58.355Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 14, 45, 'Dia hasainy horavana ilay trano. Ary hasainy hoentina any ivelan’ny tanàna, any amin’ny toerana maloto, ny vato sy ny hazo ary ny lalotra sy ny rihitra rehetra aminy.', 'dia hasainy horavana ilay trano. ary hasainy hoentina any ivelan’ny tanàna, any amin’ny toerana maloto, ny vato sy ny hazo ary ny lalotra sy ny rihitra rehetra aminy.'),
  ('6aadc71e2e5d64291e9044d4', '2026-09-18T23:19:58.355Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:58.355Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 14, 44, 'dia hiditra ao ny mpisorona mba hizaha an’ilay trano. Raha mitatra ilay aretina ao amin’ilay trano, dia habokana mampidi-doza izany. Maloto ilay trano.', 'dia hiditra ao ny mpisorona mba hizaha an’ilay trano. raha mitatra ilay aretina ao amin’ilay trano, dia habokana mampidi-doza izany. maloto ilay trano.'),
  ('6aadc71e2e5d64291e9044d3', '2026-09-18T23:19:58.355Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:58.355Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 14, 43, '“Raha miverina anefa ilay aretina ka mirongatra ao amin’ilay trano, rehefa avy nesorina ny vato ary nokikisana ny lalotra ka nolalorina indray ilay trano,', '“raha miverina anefa ilay aretina ka mirongatra ao amin’ilay trano, rehefa avy nesorina ny vato ary nokikisana ny lalotra ka nolalorina indray ilay trano,'),
  ('6aadc71e2e5d64291e9044d2', '2026-09-18T23:19:58.355Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:58.355Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 14, 42, 'Vato hafa no halaina ka hatsofoka ho solon’ireo nesorina. Ary tokony ho rihitra hafa no hampiasaina, dia holalorina ilay trano.', 'vato hafa no halaina ka hatsofoka ho solon’ireo nesorina. ary tokony ho rihitra hafa no hampiasaina, dia holalorina ilay trano.'),
  ('6aadc71e2e5d64291e9044d1', '2026-09-18T23:19:58.355Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:58.355Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 14, 41, 'Hasainy hokikisana tsara avy eo ny aty trano rehetra, ary tokony hariana any ivelan’ny tanàna, any amin’ny toerana maloto, ny lalotra sy ny rihitra nesorina.', 'hasainy hokikisana tsara avy eo ny aty trano rehetra, ary tokony hariana any ivelan’ny tanàna, any amin’ny toerana maloto, ny lalotra sy ny rihitra nesorina.'),
  ('6aadc71e2e5d64291e9044d0', '2026-09-18T23:19:58.355Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:58.355Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 14, 40, 'dia hasainy hesorina ny vato misy an’ilay aretina ary hariana any ivelan’ny tanàna, any amin’ny toerana maloto.', 'dia hasainy hesorina ny vato misy an’ilay aretina ary hariana any ivelan’ny tanàna, any amin’ny toerana maloto.'),
  ('6aadc71e2e5d64291e9044cf', '2026-09-18T23:19:58.355Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:58.355Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 14, 39, '“Dia hiverina izy amin’ny andro fahafito, ka hizaha an’ilay aretina. Raha vao mainka mitatra ilay aretina eo amin’ny rindrin’ilay trano,', '“dia hiverina izy amin’ny andro fahafito, ka hizaha an’ilay aretina. raha vao mainka mitatra ilay aretina eo amin’ny rindrin’ilay trano,'),
  ('6aadc71e2e5d64291e9044ce', '2026-09-18T23:19:58.355Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:58.355Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 14, 38, 'dia hivoaka hankeo amin’ny fidirana amin’ilay trano izy. Ary hakatony tanteraka mandritra ny fito andro ilay trano.', 'dia hivoaka hankeo amin’ny fidirana amin’ilay trano izy. ary hakatony tanteraka mandritra ny fito andro ilay trano.'),
  ('6aadc71e2e5d64291e9044cd', '2026-09-18T23:19:58.355Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:58.355Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 14, 37, 'Ary hozahany ilay faritra misy an’ilay aretina, ka raha misy lempona maitso somary mavo na lempona somary mena eo amin’ny rindrina, sady hoatran’ny hoe mandoaka rindrina no fahitana an’ireo lempona,', 'ary hozahany ilay faritra misy an’ilay aretina, ka raha misy lempona maitso somary mavo na lempona somary mena eo amin’ny rindrina, sady hoatran’ny hoe mandoaka rindrina no fahitana an’ireo lempona,'),
  ('6aadc71e2e5d64291e9044cc', '2026-09-18T23:19:58.355Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:58.355Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 14, 36, 'Ary hasain’ny mpisorona hesorina ny zava-drehetra ao amin’ilay trano, alohan’ny hahatongavany hizaha an’ilay aretina, sao hambarany ho maloto daholo ireny. Ho avy hizaha an’ilay trano izy avy eo.', 'ary hasain’ny mpisorona hesorina ny zava-drehetra ao amin’ilay trano, alohan’ny hahatongavany hizaha an’ilay aretina, sao hambarany ho maloto daholo ireny. ho avy hizaha an’ilay trano izy avy eo.'),
  ('6aadc71e2e5d64291e9044cb', '2026-09-18T23:19:58.355Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:58.355Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 14, 35, 'dia hankany amin’ny mpisorona ny tompon’izany trano izany, ka hanao aminy hoe: ‘Hoatran’ny misy aretina ny tranoko.’', 'dia hankany amin’ny mpisorona ny tompon’izany trano izany, ka hanao aminy hoe: ‘hoatran’ny misy aretina ny tranoko.’'),
  ('6aadc71e2e5d64291e9044ca', '2026-09-18T23:19:58.355Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:58.355Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 14, 34, '“Rehefa tafiditra ao amin’ny tany Kanana izay homeko ho fanananareo ianareo, ka misy trano asiako habokana ao amin’ilay taninareo,', '“rehefa tafiditra ao amin’ny tany kanana izay homeko ho fanananareo ianareo, ka misy trano asiako habokana ao amin’ilay taninareo,'),
  ('6aadc71e2e5d64291e9044c9', '2026-09-18T23:19:58.355Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:58.355Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 14, 33, 'Dia niteny tamin’i Mosesy sy Arona i Jehovah hoe:', 'dia niteny tamin’i mosesy sy arona i jehovah hoe:'),
  ('6aadc71e2e5d64291e9044c8', '2026-09-18T23:19:58.355Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:58.355Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 14, 32, '“Izany no lalàna momba ny boka sitrana, nefa tsy mahavidy an’izay zavatra ilaina mba hanekena azy ho madio.”', '“izany no lalàna momba ny boka sitrana, nefa tsy mahavidy an’izay zavatra ilaina mba hanekena azy ho madio.”'),
  ('6aadc71e2e5d64291e9044c7', '2026-09-18T23:19:58.355Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:58.355Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 14, 31, 'mba ho fanatitra noho ny ota, ary ny iray kosa ho fanatitra dorana ampiarahina amin’ny fanatitra varimbazaha. Ireo mantsy no takatry ny volany. Dia handrakotra ny fahotan’ilay olona midio eo anatrehan’i Jehovah ny mpisorona.', 'mba ho fanatitra noho ny ota, ary ny iray kosa ho fanatitra dorana ampiarahina amin’ny fanatitra varimbazaha. ireo mantsy no takatry ny volany. dia handrakotra ny fahotan’ilay olona midio eo anatrehan’i jehovah ny mpisorona.'),
  ('6aadc71e2e5d64291e9044c6', '2026-09-18T23:19:58.355Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:58.355Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 14, 30, '“Hatolony ny iray amin’ny domohina na ny iray amin’ny zana-boromailala, araka izay takatry ny volany,', '“hatolony ny iray amin’ny domohina na ny iray amin’ny zana-boromailala, araka izay takatry ny volany,'),
  ('6aadc71e2e5d64291e9044c5', '2026-09-18T23:19:58.355Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:58.355Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 14, 29, 'Ary hataony eo amin’ny lohan’ilay olona midio ny menaka sisa eo amin’ny felatanany, mba handrakofany ny fahotan’ ilay olona eo anatrehan’i Jehovah.', 'ary hataony eo amin’ny lohan’ilay olona midio ny menaka sisa eo amin’ny felatanany, mba handrakofany ny fahotan’ ilay olona eo anatrehan’i jehovah.'),
  ('6aadc71e2e5d64291e9044c4', '2026-09-18T23:19:58.355Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:58.355Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 14, 28, 'Hakany koa ilay menaka eo amin’ny felatanany, ka hataony eo amin’ny ravintsofina ankavanan’ilay olona midio, sy eo amin’ny ankiben-tanany ankavanana sy ny ankiben-tongony ankavanana, eo amin’ilay nasiana ny ran’ny fanatitra noho ny heloka.', 'hakany koa ilay menaka eo amin’ny felatanany, ka hataony eo amin’ny ravintsofina ankavanan’ilay olona midio, sy eo amin’ny ankiben-tanany ankavanana sy ny ankiben-tongony ankavanana, eo amin’ilay nasiana ny ran’ny fanatitra noho ny heloka.'),
  ('6aadc71f60cdd53bec43a46b', '2026-09-18T23:19:59.990Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:59.990Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 17, 16, 'Fa raha tsy manasa ny akanjony izy sady tsy mandro, dia hizaka ny vokatry ny fahadisoany.’”', 'fa raha tsy manasa ny akanjony izy sady tsy mandro, dia hizaka ny vokatry ny fahadisoany.’”'),
  ('6aadc71f60cdd53bec43a46a', '2026-09-18T23:19:59.990Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:59.990Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 17, 15, 'Raha misy olona mihinana biby maty ho azy na noviravirain’ny bibidia, na teratany izy na vahiny, dia hanasa ny akanjony izy ary handro amin’ny rano. Haloto mandra-paharivan’ny andro izy, ary hadio avy eo.', 'raha misy olona mihinana biby maty ho azy na noviravirain’ny bibidia, na teratany izy na vahiny, dia hanasa ny akanjony izy ary handro amin’ny rano. haloto mandra-paharivan’ny andro izy, ary hadio avy eo.'),
  ('6aadc71f60cdd53bec43a469', '2026-09-18T23:19:59.990Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:59.990Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 17, 14, 'Ny ain’ny karaza-nofo rehetra mantsy dia ny rany, satria ao amin’ny ra ny aina. Koa nilaza tamin’ny Israelita aho hoe: “Aza mihinana ny ran’ny nofo, na nofon’inona izany na nofon’inona, satria ny rany no ain’ny karaza-nofo rehetra, ka haringana izay mihinan-dra.”', 'ny ain’ny karaza-nofo rehetra mantsy dia ny rany, satria ao amin’ny ra ny aina. koa nilaza tamin’ny israelita aho hoe: “aza mihinana ny ran’ny nofo, na nofon’inona izany na nofon’inona, satria ny rany no ain’ny karaza-nofo rehetra, ka haringana izay mihinan-dra.”'),
  ('6aadc71f60cdd53bec43a468', '2026-09-18T23:19:59.990Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:59.990Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 17, 13, '“‘Raha misy amin’ny Israelita na ny hafa firenena monina eo aminareo mihaza ka mahazo bibidia na vorona azo hanina, dia hararany amin’ny tany ny rany, ka hototofany vovoka.', '“‘raha misy amin’ny israelita na ny hafa firenena monina eo aminareo mihaza ka mahazo bibidia na vorona azo hanina, dia hararany amin’ny tany ny rany, ka hototofany vovoka.'),
  ('6aadc71f60cdd53bec43a467', '2026-09-18T23:19:59.990Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:59.990Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 17, 12, 'Izany no antony nilazako tamin’ny Israelita hoe: “Tsy tokony hisy hihinan-dra ianareo, ary tsy tokony hisy hihinan-dra koa ny hafa firenena monina eo aminareo.”', 'izany no antony nilazako tamin’ny israelita hoe: “tsy tokony hisy hihinan-dra ianareo, ary tsy tokony hisy hihinan-dra koa ny hafa firenena monina eo aminareo.”'),
  ('6aadc71f60cdd53bec43a466', '2026-09-18T23:19:59.990Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:59.990Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 17, 11, 'Fa ao amin’ny ra ny ain’ny nofo. Ary nasaiko natao teo amin’ny alitara ny ra mba handrakofana ny fahotanareo. Ny ra mantsy no mandrakotra fahotana satria ao aminy ny aina.', 'fa ao amin’ny ra ny ain’ny nofo. ary nasaiko natao teo amin’ny alitara ny ra mba handrakofana ny fahotanareo. ny ra mantsy no mandrakotra fahotana satria ao aminy ny aina.'),
  ('6aadc71f60cdd53bec43a465', '2026-09-18T23:19:59.990Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:59.990Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 17, 10, '“‘Raha misy amin’ny taranak’Israely na ny hafa firenena monina eo aminareo, mihinana ra, na ran’inona izany na ran’inona, dia hanohitra an’ilay olona nihinan-dra aho, ka haringako tsy ho eo amin’ny fireneny izy.', '“‘raha misy amin’ny taranak’israely na ny hafa firenena monina eo aminareo, mihinana ra, na ran’inona izany na ran’inona, dia hanohitra an’ilay olona nihinan-dra aho, ka haringako tsy ho eo amin’ny fireneny izy.'),
  ('6aadc71f60cdd53bec43a464', '2026-09-18T23:19:59.990Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:59.990Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 17, 9, 'nefa tsy mitondra an’izany eo amin’ny fidirana amin’ny tranolay fihaonana mba hatolotra ho an’i Jehovah, dia haringana tsy ho anisan’ny fireneny izany olona izany.', 'nefa tsy mitondra an’izany eo amin’ny fidirana amin’ny tranolay fihaonana mba hatolotra ho an’i jehovah, dia haringana tsy ho anisan’ny fireneny izany olona izany.'),
  ('6aadc71f60cdd53bec43a463', '2026-09-18T23:19:59.990Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:59.990Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 17, 8, '“Izao no holazainao amin’izy ireo: ‘Raha misy amin’ny taranak’Israely na ny hafa firenena monina eo aminareo, manolotra fanatitra dorana na sorona,', '“izao no holazainao amin’izy ireo: ‘raha misy amin’ny taranak’israely na ny hafa firenena monina eo aminareo, manolotra fanatitra dorana na sorona,'),
  ('6aadc71f60cdd53bec43a462', '2026-09-18T23:19:59.990Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:59.990Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 17, 7, 'Amin’izay izy ireo dia tsy hanao sorona intsony ho an’ireo demonia miendrika osy, izay notompoiny. Fitsipika tokony harahinareo foana izany, hatramin’ny taranakareo fara aman-dimby.”’', 'amin’izay izy ireo dia tsy hanao sorona intsony ho an’ireo demonia miendrika osy, izay notompoiny. fitsipika tokony harahinareo foana izany, hatramin’ny taranakareo fara aman-dimby.”’'),
  ('6aadc71f60cdd53bec43a461', '2026-09-18T23:19:59.990Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:59.990Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 17, 6, 'Dia hafafin’ny mpisorona eo ambony alitaran’i Jehovah, eo amin’ny fidirana amin’ny tranolay fihaonana ny ran’ilay izy. Ary hodorany ny tavin-kena mba hidona-tsetroka, ho hanitra mahafinaritra an’i Jehovah.', 'dia hafafin’ny mpisorona eo ambony alitaran’i jehovah, eo amin’ny fidirana amin’ny tranolay fihaonana ny ran’ilay izy. ary hodorany ny tavin-kena mba hidona-tsetroka, ho hanitra mahafinaritra an’i jehovah.'),
  ('6aadc71f60cdd53bec43a460', '2026-09-18T23:19:59.990Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:59.990Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 17, 5, 'Amin’izay mantsy dia tsy ho eny an-tsaha intsony no hitondran’ny Israelita ny biby atao sorona, fa hoentiny any amin’i Jehovah, any amin’ny mpisorona, eo amin’ny fidirana amin’ny tranolay fihaonana. Hataony sorona iombonana ho an’i Jehovah izany.', 'amin’izay mantsy dia tsy ho eny an-tsaha intsony no hitondran’ny israelita ny biby atao sorona, fa hoentiny any amin’i jehovah, any amin’ny mpisorona, eo amin’ny fidirana amin’ny tranolay fihaonana. hataony sorona iombonana ho an’i jehovah izany.'),
  ('6aadc71f60cdd53bec43a45f', '2026-09-18T23:19:59.990Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:59.990Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 17, 4, 'fa tsy mitondra an’izany eo amin’ny fidirana amin’ny tranolay fihaonana mba hatolotra ho fanatitra ho an’i Jehovah, eo anoloan’ny tranolain’i Jehovah, dia meloka ho nandatsa-dra izy. Nandatsa-dra ilay olona, ka haringana tsy ho anisan’ny fireneny.', 'fa tsy mitondra an’izany eo amin’ny fidirana amin’ny tranolay fihaonana mba hatolotra ho fanatitra ho an’i jehovah, eo anoloan’ny tranolain’i jehovah, dia meloka ho nandatsa-dra izy. nandatsa-dra ilay olona, ka haringana tsy ho anisan’ny fireneny.'),
  ('6aadc71f60cdd53bec43a45e', '2026-09-18T23:19:59.990Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:59.990Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 17, 3, '“‘“Raha misy amin’ny taranak’Israely mamono omby, na ondrilahy kely, na osy, ao amin’ny toby na any ivelan’ny toby,', '“‘“raha misy amin’ny taranak’israely mamono omby, na ondrilahy kely, na osy, ao amin’ny toby na any ivelan’ny toby,'),
  ('6aadc71f60cdd53bec43a45d', '2026-09-18T23:19:59.990Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:59.990Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 17, 2, '“Mitenena amin’i Arona sy ny zanany lahy ary ny Israelita rehetra hoe: ‘Izao no didy nomen’i Jehovah:', '“mitenena amin’i arona sy ny zanany lahy ary ny israelita rehetra hoe: ‘izao no didy nomen’i jehovah:'),
  ('6aadc71f60cdd53bec43a45c', '2026-09-18T23:19:59.990Z', '2026-09-18T23:19:59.990Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 17, 1, 'Hoy koa i Jehovah tamin’i Mosesy:', 'hoy koa i jehovah tamin’i mosesy:'),
  ('6aadc721813f2828ebf296e3', '2026-09-18T23:20:01.054Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:01.054Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 18, 25, 'Koa maloto ilay tany, ka hosaziko noho ny fahadisoany, ary haloan’ilay tany ny mponina ao aminy.', 'koa maloto ilay tany, ka hosaziko noho ny fahadisoany, ary haloan’ilay tany ny mponina ao aminy.'),
  ('6aadc721813f2828ebf296e2', '2026-09-18T23:20:01.054Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:01.054Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 18, 24, '“‘Aza mandoto tena amin’izany zavatra izany mihitsy. Ireny zavatra rehetra ireny mantsy no nataon’ireo firenena ka lasa naloto izy ireo, dia ireo firenena izay horoahiko tsy ho eo anatrehanareo.', '“‘aza mandoto tena amin’izany zavatra izany mihitsy. ireny zavatra rehetra ireny mantsy no nataon’ireo firenena ka lasa naloto izy ireo, dia ireo firenena izay horoahiko tsy ho eo anatrehanareo.'),
  ('6aadc721813f2828ebf296e1', '2026-09-18T23:20:01.054Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:01.054Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 18, 23, '“‘Tsy tokony hisy lehilahy hanao firaisana amin’ny biby, ka handoto ny tenany amin’izany. Ary tsy tokony hisy vehivavy hanolo-tena hanao firaisana amin’ny biby. Tsy fanao voajanahary izany.', '“‘tsy tokony hisy lehilahy hanao firaisana amin’ny biby, ka handoto ny tenany amin’izany. ary tsy tokony hisy vehivavy hanolo-tena hanao firaisana amin’ny biby. tsy fanao voajanahary izany.'),
  ('6aadc721813f2828ebf296e0', '2026-09-18T23:20:01.054Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:01.054Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 18, 22, '“‘Aza manao firaisana amin’ny lehilahy toy ny fanaovana firaisana amin’ny vehivavy, fa zava-maharikoriko izany.', '“‘aza manao firaisana amin’ny lehilahy toy ny fanaovana firaisana amin’ny vehivavy, fa zava-maharikoriko izany.'),
  ('6aadc721813f2828ebf296df', '2026-09-18T23:20:01.054Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:01.054Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 18, 21, '“‘Aza misy atolotra ho an’i Moleka ny taranakao. Aza zimbazimbaina hoatr’izany ny anaran’Andriamanitrao. Izaho no Jehovah.', '“‘aza misy atolotra ho an’i moleka ny taranakao. aza zimbazimbaina hoatr’izany ny anaran’andriamanitrao. izaho no jehovah.'),
  ('6aadc721813f2828ebf296de', '2026-09-18T23:20:01.054Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:01.054Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 18, 20, '“‘Aza manao firaisana amin’ny vadin’olona, ka handoto ny tenanao.', '“‘aza manao firaisana amin’ny vadin’olona, ka handoto ny tenanao.'),
  ('6aadc721813f2828ebf296dd', '2026-09-18T23:20:01.054Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:01.054Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 18, 19, '“‘Aza manatona vehivavy mba hanao firaisana aminy, raha mbola maloto izy noho izy tonga fotoana.', '“‘aza manatona vehivavy mba hanao firaisana aminy, raha mbola maloto izy noho izy tonga fotoana.'),
  ('6aadc721813f2828ebf296dc', '2026-09-18T23:20:01.054Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:01.054Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 18, 18, '“‘Aza maka ny rahavavin’ny vadinao ho rafivaviny ka manao firaisana aminy, raha mbola velona ny vadinao.', '“‘aza maka ny rahavavin’ny vadinao ho rafivaviny ka manao firaisana aminy, raha mbola velona ny vadinao.'),
  ('6aadc721813f2828ebf296db', '2026-09-18T23:20:01.054Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:01.054Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 18, 17, '“‘Aza manao firaisana amin’ny vehivavy sy ny zanany vavy. Ary aza maka ny zanakavavin’ny zanany lahy na ny zanakavavin’ny zanany vavy, mba hanaovanao firaisana. Havan’ilay vehivavy akaiky ireo. Fanao mamoafady izany.', '“‘aza manao firaisana amin’ny vehivavy sy ny zanany vavy. ary aza maka ny zanakavavin’ny zanany lahy na ny zanakavavin’ny zanany vavy, mba hanaovanao firaisana. havan’ilay vehivavy akaiky ireo. fanao mamoafady izany.'),
  ('6aadc721813f2828ebf296da', '2026-09-18T23:20:01.054Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:01.054Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 18, 16, '“‘Aza manao firaisana amin’ny vadin’ny rahalahinao, fa manala baraka ny rahalahinao izany.', '“‘aza manao firaisana amin’ny vadin’ny rahalahinao, fa manala baraka ny rahalahinao izany.'),
  ('6aadc721813f2828ebf296d9', '2026-09-18T23:20:01.054Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:01.054Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 18, 15, '“‘Aza manao firaisana amin’ny vinantovavinao. Vadin’ny zanakao lahy izy, ka aza manao firaisana aminy.', '“‘aza manao firaisana amin’ny vinantovavinao. vadin’ny zanakao lahy izy, ka aza manao firaisana aminy.'),
  ('6aadc721813f2828ebf296d8', '2026-09-18T23:20:01.054Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:01.054Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 18, 14, '“‘Aza manala baraka ny rahalahin-drainao ka manao firaisana amin’ny vadiny, fa nenitoanao izy.', '“‘aza manala baraka ny rahalahin-drainao ka manao firaisana amin’ny vadiny, fa nenitoanao izy.'),
  ('6aadc721813f2828ebf296d7', '2026-09-18T23:20:01.054Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:01.054Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 18, 13, '“‘Aza manao firaisana amin’ny rahavavin-dreninao, fa iray ra amin-dreninao izy.', '“‘aza manao firaisana amin’ny rahavavin-dreninao, fa iray ra amin-dreninao izy.'),
  ('6aadc721813f2828ebf296d6', '2026-09-18T23:20:01.054Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:01.054Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 18, 12, '“‘Aza manao firaisana amin’ny anabavin-drainao, fa iray ra amin-drainao izy.', '“‘aza manao firaisana amin’ny anabavin-drainao, fa iray ra amin-drainao izy.'),
  ('6aadc721813f2828ebf296d5', '2026-09-18T23:20:01.054Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:01.054Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 18, 11, '“‘Aza manao firaisana amin’ny zanakavavin’ny vadin-drainao, izay taranaky ny rainao, satria anabavinao izy.', '“‘aza manao firaisana amin’ny zanakavavin’ny vadin-drainao, izay taranaky ny rainao, satria anabavinao izy.'),
  ('6aadc721813f2828ebf296d4', '2026-09-18T23:20:01.054Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:01.054Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 18, 10, '“‘Aza manao firaisana amin’ny zanakavavin’ny zanakao lahy na ny zanakavavin’ny zanakao vavy, fa manala baraka anao izany.', '“‘aza manao firaisana amin’ny zanakavavin’ny zanakao lahy na ny zanakavavin’ny zanakao vavy, fa manala baraka anao izany.'),
  ('6aadc721813f2828ebf296d3', '2026-09-18T23:20:01.054Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:01.054Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 18, 9, '“‘Aza manao firaisana amin’ny anabavinao, na zanaky ny rainao izy na zanaky ny reninao, na teraka tao an-trano izy na tsia.', '“‘aza manao firaisana amin’ny anabavinao, na zanaky ny rainao izy na zanaky ny reninao, na teraka tao an-trano izy na tsia.'),
  ('6aadc721813f2828ebf296d2', '2026-09-18T23:20:01.054Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:01.054Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 18, 8, '“‘Aza manao firaisana amin’ny vadin’ny rainao. Manala baraka ny rainao izany.', '“‘aza manao firaisana amin’ny vadin’ny rainao. manala baraka ny rainao izany.'),
  ('6aadc721813f2828ebf296d1', '2026-09-18T23:20:01.054Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:01.054Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 18, 7, 'Aza manao firaisana amin’ny rainao, ary aza manao firaisana amin’ny reninao. Reninao izy, ka aza manao firaisana aminy.', 'aza manao firaisana amin’ny rainao, ary aza manao firaisana amin’ny reninao. reninao izy, ka aza manao firaisana aminy.'),
  ('6aadc721813f2828ebf296d0', '2026-09-18T23:20:01.054Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:01.054Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 18, 6, '“‘Tsy tokony hisy aminareo hanatona ny havany akaiky mba hanao firaisana aminy. Izaho no Jehovah.', '“‘tsy tokony hisy aminareo hanatona ny havany akaiky mba hanao firaisana aminy. izaho no jehovah.'),
  ('6aadc721813f2828ebf296cf', '2026-09-18T23:20:01.054Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:01.054Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 18, 5, 'Ankatoavy ny fitsipiko sy ny didim-pitsarako. Izay olona mankatò an’ireny no ho velona amin’ny alalan’ireny. Izaho no Jehovah.', 'ankatoavy ny fitsipiko sy ny didim-pitsarako. izay olona mankatò an’ireny no ho velona amin’ny alalan’ireny. izaho no jehovah.'),
  ('6aadc721813f2828ebf296ce', '2026-09-18T23:20:01.054Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:01.054Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 18, 4, 'Ny didim-pitsarako no tokony hampiharinareo, ary ny fitsipiko no tokony hankatoavinareo sy harahinareo. Izaho no Jehovah Andriamanitrareo.', 'ny didim-pitsarako no tokony hampiharinareo, ary ny fitsipiko no tokony hankatoavinareo sy harahinareo. izaho no jehovah andriamanitrareo.'),
  ('6aadc721813f2828ebf296cd', '2026-09-18T23:20:01.054Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:01.054Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 18, 3, 'Aza manao toy ny ataon’ny olona any Ejipta, izay nipetrahanareo. Ary aza manao toy ny ataon’ny olona any amin’ny tany Kanana, izay hitondrako anareo. Aza manaraka ny fanaony.', 'aza manao toy ny ataon’ny olona any ejipta, izay nipetrahanareo. ary aza manao toy ny ataon’ny olona any amin’ny tany kanana, izay hitondrako anareo. aza manaraka ny fanaony.'),
  ('6aadc721813f2828ebf296cc', '2026-09-18T23:20:01.054Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:01.054Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 18, 2, '“Ilazao ny Israelita hoe: ‘Izaho no Jehovah Andriamanitrareo.', '“ilazao ny israelita hoe: ‘izaho no jehovah andriamanitrareo.'),
  ('6aadc721813f2828ebf296cb', '2026-09-18T23:20:01.054Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:01.054Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 18, 1, 'Ary mbola niteny tamin’i Mosesy i Jehovah hoe:', 'ary mbola niteny tamin’i mosesy i jehovah hoe:'),
  ('6aadc721813f2828ebf296e8', '2026-09-18T23:20:01.055Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:01.055Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 18, 30, 'Ary ataovy izay takiko aminareo, ka aza manao an’ireo fanao maharikoriko nataon’ny olona talohanareo, mba tsy handotoanareo tena amin’izany. Izaho no Jehovah Andriamanitrareo.’”', 'ary ataovy izay takiko aminareo, ka aza manao an’ireo fanao maharikoriko nataon’ny olona talohanareo, mba tsy handotoanareo tena amin’izany. izaho no jehovah andriamanitrareo.’”'),
  ('6aadc721813f2828ebf296e7', '2026-09-18T23:20:01.055Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:01.055Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 18, 29, 'Izay rehetra manao ny iray amin’ireo zava-maharikoriko ireo, dia haringana tsy ho anisan’ny fireneny.', 'izay rehetra manao ny iray amin’ireo zava-maharikoriko ireo, dia haringana tsy ho anisan’ny fireneny.'),
  ('6aadc721813f2828ebf296e6', '2026-09-18T23:20:01.055Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:01.055Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 18, 28, 'Fa raha tsy mandoto an’ilay tany ianareo, dia tsy voatery handoa anareo ilay tany, tahaka ny nandoavany an’ireo firenena talohanareo.', 'fa raha tsy mandoto an’ilay tany ianareo, dia tsy voatery handoa anareo ilay tany, tahaka ny nandoavany an’ireo firenena talohanareo.'),
  ('6aadc721813f2828ebf296e5', '2026-09-18T23:20:01.055Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:01.055Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 18, 27, 'Izany zava-maharikoriko rehetra izany mantsy no nataon’ireo nipetraka teo amin’ilay tany talohanareo, ka lasa maloto izao ilay tany.', 'izany zava-maharikoriko rehetra izany mantsy no nataon’ireo nipetraka teo amin’ilay tany talohanareo, ka lasa maloto izao ilay tany.'),
  ('6aadc721813f2828ebf296e4', '2026-09-18T23:20:01.055Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:01.055Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 18, 26, 'Fa ankatoavy kosa ny fitsipiko sy ny didim-pitsarako. Tsy misy mahazo manao an’izany zava-maharikoriko rehetra izany, na ny teratany na ny vahiny monina eo aminareo.', 'fa ankatoavy kosa ny fitsipiko sy ny didim-pitsarako. tsy misy mahazo manao an’izany zava-maharikoriko rehetra izany, na ny teratany na ny vahiny monina eo aminareo.'),
  ('6aadc72161618f21f6adc2ba', '2026-09-18T23:20:01.779Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:01.779Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 20, 27, '“‘Tsy maintsy vonoina ho faty izay lehilahy na vehivavy mpamoha angatra na mpilaza ny hoavy. Hitora-bato azy ho faty ny vahoaka, ary izy ihany no ho tompon’andraikitra amin’ny fahafatesany.’”', '“‘tsy maintsy vonoina ho faty izay lehilahy na vehivavy mpamoha angatra na mpilaza ny hoavy. hitora-bato azy ho faty ny vahoaka, ary izy ihany no ho tompon’andraikitra amin’ny fahafatesany.’”'),
  ('6aadc72161618f21f6adc2b9', '2026-09-18T23:20:01.779Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:01.779Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 20, 26, 'Tsy maintsy masina eo anatrehako ianareo, satria izaho Jehovah dia masina. Ary avahako amin’ireo firenena ianareo mba ho ahy.', 'tsy maintsy masina eo anatrehako ianareo, satria izaho jehovah dia masina. ary avahako amin’ireo firenena ianareo mba ho ahy.'),
  ('6aadc72161618f21f6adc2b8', '2026-09-18T23:20:01.779Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:01.779Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 20, 25, 'Avaho ny biby madio sy ny maloto, ary ny vorona maloto sy ny madio. Ary mitandrema sao haharikoriko ahy ianareo noho ny amin’ny biby sy vorona ary biby mandady amin’ny tany, izay efa navahako hoe maloto aminareo.', 'avaho ny biby madio sy ny maloto, ary ny vorona maloto sy ny madio. ary mitandrema sao haharikoriko ahy ianareo noho ny amin’ny biby sy vorona ary biby mandady amin’ny tany, izay efa navahako hoe maloto aminareo.'),
  ('6aadc72161618f21f6adc2b7', '2026-09-18T23:20:01.779Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:01.779Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 20, 24, 'Izany no antony nilazako taminareo hoe: “Halainareo ho anareo ny tanin’izy ireo, ary homeko anareo ho fanananareo izany. Tany tondra-dronono sy tantely ilay izy. Izaho no Jehovah Andriamanitrareo, izay nanavaka anareo tamin’ireo firenena.”', 'izany no antony nilazako taminareo hoe: “halainareo ho anareo ny tanin’izy ireo, ary homeko anareo ho fanananareo izany. tany tondra-dronono sy tantely ilay izy. izaho no jehovah andriamanitrareo, izay nanavaka anareo tamin’ireo firenena.”'),
  ('6aadc72161618f21f6adc2b6', '2026-09-18T23:20:01.779Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:01.779Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 20, 23, 'Aza manaraka ny fanaon’ireo firenena izay roahiko tsy ho eo anatrehanareo. Nanao an’izany rehetra izany mantsy izy ireo, ka halako.', 'aza manaraka ny fanaon’ireo firenena izay roahiko tsy ho eo anatrehanareo. nanao an’izany rehetra izany mantsy izy ireo, ka halako.'),
  ('6aadc72161618f21f6adc2b5', '2026-09-18T23:20:01.779Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:01.779Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 20, 22, '“‘Ankatoavy ny fitsipiko rehetra sy ny didim-pitsarako rehetra ka tanteraho, mba tsy handoa anareo ilay tany hitondrako anareo mba hipetrahanareo.', '“‘ankatoavy ny fitsipiko rehetra sy ny didim-pitsarako rehetra ka tanteraho, mba tsy handoa anareo ilay tany hitondrako anareo mba hipetrahanareo.'),
  ('6aadc72161618f21f6adc2b4', '2026-09-18T23:20:01.779Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:01.779Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 20, 21, 'Raha misy lehilahy maka ny vadin-drahalahiny, dia zava-maharikoriko izany. Manala baraka ny rahalahiny izy, ka ho faty tsy miteraka izy roa.', 'raha misy lehilahy maka ny vadin-drahalahiny, dia zava-maharikoriko izany. manala baraka ny rahalahiny izy, ka ho faty tsy miteraka izy roa.'),
  ('6aadc72161618f21f6adc2b3', '2026-09-18T23:20:01.779Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:01.779Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 20, 20, 'Ny lehilahy manao firaisana amin’ny vadin’ny rahalahin-drainy, dia manala baraka ny rahalahin-drainy. Hizaka ny vokatry ny fahadisoany izy mianaka, ary ho faty tsy miteraka.', 'ny lehilahy manao firaisana amin’ny vadin’ny rahalahin-drainy, dia manala baraka ny rahalahin-drainy. hizaka ny vokatry ny fahadisoany izy mianaka, ary ho faty tsy miteraka.'),
  ('6aadc72161618f21f6adc2b2', '2026-09-18T23:20:01.779Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:01.779Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 20, 19, '“‘Aza manao firaisana amin’ny rahavavin-dreninao na ny anabavin-drainao, satria manala baraka olona iray ra aminao izany. Hizaka ny vokatry ny fahadisoany izy ireo.', '“‘aza manao firaisana amin’ny rahavavin-dreninao na ny anabavin-drainao, satria manala baraka olona iray ra aminao izany. hizaka ny vokatry ny fahadisoany izy ireo.'),
  ('6aadc72161618f21f6adc2b1', '2026-09-18T23:20:01.779Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:01.779Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 20, 18, '“‘Raha misy lehilahy manao firaisana amin’ny vehivavy tonga fotoana, dia samy mampihanjahanja ny fivoahan’ny ran’ilay vehivavy izy roa. Koa tsy maintsy haringana tsy ho anisan’ny fireneny izy ireo.', '“‘raha misy lehilahy manao firaisana amin’ny vehivavy tonga fotoana, dia samy mampihanjahanja ny fivoahan’ny ran’ilay vehivavy izy roa. koa tsy maintsy haringana tsy ho anisan’ny fireneny izy ireo.'),
  ('6aadc72161618f21f6adc2b0', '2026-09-18T23:20:01.779Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:01.779Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 20, 17, '“‘Raha misy lehilahy manao firaisana amin’ny anabaviny, na amin’ny zanakavavin-drainy na ny zanakavavin-dreniny, ka hitany ny fitanjahan’ilay vehivavy ary ilay vehivavy koa mahita ny fitanjahany, dia manala baraka izany. Tsy maintsy haringana eo imason’ny zanaky ny fireneny izy mianadahy. Manala baraka an’ilay anabaviny izy, ka hizaka ny vokatry ny fahadisoany.', '“‘raha misy lehilahy manao firaisana amin’ny anabaviny, na amin’ny zanakavavin-drainy na ny zanakavavin-dreniny, ka hitany ny fitanjahan’ilay vehivavy ary ilay vehivavy koa mahita ny fitanjahany, dia manala baraka izany. tsy maintsy haringana eo imason’ny zanaky ny fireneny izy mianadahy. manala baraka an’ilay anabaviny izy, ka hizaka ny vokatry ny fahadisoany.'),
  ('6aadc72161618f21f6adc2af', '2026-09-18T23:20:01.779Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:01.779Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 20, 16, 'Raha misy vehivavy manatona biby mba hanao firaisana aminy, dia hovonoinao ho faty ilay vehivavy sy ilay biby. Tsy maintsy vonoina ho faty izy ireo. Izy ireo ihany no ho tompon’andraikitra amin’ny fahafatesany.', 'raha misy vehivavy manatona biby mba hanao firaisana aminy, dia hovonoinao ho faty ilay vehivavy sy ilay biby. tsy maintsy vonoina ho faty izy ireo. izy ireo ihany no ho tompon’andraikitra amin’ny fahafatesany.'),
  ('6aadc72161618f21f6adc2ae', '2026-09-18T23:20:01.779Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:01.779Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 20, 15, '“‘Raha misy lehilahy manao firaisana amin’ny biby, dia tsy maintsy vonoina ho faty izy, ary hovonoina koa ilay biby.', '“‘raha misy lehilahy manao firaisana amin’ny biby, dia tsy maintsy vonoina ho faty izy, ary hovonoina koa ilay biby.'),
  ('6aadc72161618f21f6adc2ad', '2026-09-18T23:20:01.779Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:01.779Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 20, 14, '“‘Raha misy lehilahy manambady vehivavy iray nefa koa manao firaisana amin’ny renin’ilay vehivavy, dia fanao mamoafady izany. Samy hodorana na ilay lehilahy na izy mianaka, mba tsy hitohy eo aminareo izany fitondran-tena mamoafady izany.', '“‘raha misy lehilahy manambady vehivavy iray nefa koa manao firaisana amin’ny renin’ilay vehivavy, dia fanao mamoafady izany. samy hodorana na ilay lehilahy na izy mianaka, mba tsy hitohy eo aminareo izany fitondran-tena mamoafady izany.'),
  ('6aadc72161618f21f6adc2ac', '2026-09-18T23:20:01.779Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:01.779Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 20, 13, '“‘Raha misy lehilahy manao firaisana amin’ny lehilahy toy ny fanaovana firaisana amin’ny vehivavy, dia samy nanao zava-maharikoriko izy roa lahy, ka tsy maintsy vonoina ho faty. Izy ireo ihany no ho tompon’andraikitra amin’ny fahafatesany.', '“‘raha misy lehilahy manao firaisana amin’ny lehilahy toy ny fanaovana firaisana amin’ny vehivavy, dia samy nanao zava-maharikoriko izy roa lahy, ka tsy maintsy vonoina ho faty. izy ireo ihany no ho tompon’andraikitra amin’ny fahafatesany.'),
  ('6aadc72161618f21f6adc2ab', '2026-09-18T23:20:01.779Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:01.779Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 20, 12, 'Raha misy lehilahy manao firaisana amin’ny vinantovaviny, dia tsy maintsy vonoina ho faty izy ireo. Tsy fanao voajanahary izany nataon’izy ireo izany. Izy ireo ihany no ho tompon’andraikitra amin’ny fahafatesany.', 'raha misy lehilahy manao firaisana amin’ny vinantovaviny, dia tsy maintsy vonoina ho faty izy ireo. tsy fanao voajanahary izany nataon’izy ireo izany. izy ireo ihany no ho tompon’andraikitra amin’ny fahafatesany.'),
  ('6aadc72161618f21f6adc2aa', '2026-09-18T23:20:01.779Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:01.779Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 20, 11, 'Ny lehilahy manao firaisana amin’ny vadin-drainy dia manala baraka an-drainy. Tsy maintsy vonoina ho faty izy ireo, ary izy ireo ihany no ho tompon’andraikitra amin’ny fahafatesany.', 'ny lehilahy manao firaisana amin’ny vadin-drainy dia manala baraka an-drainy. tsy maintsy vonoina ho faty izy ireo, ary izy ireo ihany no ho tompon’andraikitra amin’ny fahafatesany.'),
  ('6aadc72161618f21f6adc2a9', '2026-09-18T23:20:01.779Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:01.779Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 20, 10, '“‘Izao no atao amin’ny lehilahy manitsakitsa-bady ka maka vadin’olona: Tsy maintsy vonoina ho faty ilay lehilahy manitsakitsa-bady izay naka ny vadin’ny namany. Hovonoina ho faty na ilay lehilahy na ilay vehivavy satria samy nanitsakitsa-bady.', '“‘izao no atao amin’ny lehilahy manitsakitsa-bady ka maka vadin’olona: tsy maintsy vonoina ho faty ilay lehilahy manitsakitsa-bady izay naka ny vadin’ny namany. hovonoina ho faty na ilay lehilahy na ilay vehivavy satria samy nanitsakitsa-bady.'),
  ('6aadc72161618f21f6adc2a8', '2026-09-18T23:20:01.779Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:01.779Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 20, 9, '“‘Raha misy manozona ny rainy na ny reniny, dia tsy maintsy vonoina ho faty izy. Nozoniny ny rainy na ny reniny, ka izy ihany no ho tompon’andraikitra amin’ny fahafatesany.', '“‘raha misy manozona ny rainy na ny reniny, dia tsy maintsy vonoina ho faty izy. nozoniny ny rainy na ny reniny, ka izy ihany no ho tompon’andraikitra amin’ny fahafatesany.'),
  ('6aadc72161618f21f6adc2a7', '2026-09-18T23:20:01.779Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:01.779Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 20, 8, 'Ary ankatoavy ny fitsipiko ka tanteraho. Izaho no Jehovah izay manamasina anareo.', 'ary ankatoavy ny fitsipiko ka tanteraho. izaho no jehovah izay manamasina anareo.'),
  ('6aadc72161618f21f6adc2a6', '2026-09-18T23:20:01.779Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:01.779Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 20, 7, '“‘Hamasino ny tenanareo ary aoka ho masina ianareo, satria izaho no Jehovah Andriamanitrareo.', '“‘hamasino ny tenanareo ary aoka ho masina ianareo, satria izaho no jehovah andriamanitrareo.'),
  ('6aadc72161618f21f6adc2a5', '2026-09-18T23:20:01.779Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:01.779Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 20, 6, '“‘Raha misy olona mivadika amiko satria lasa maka hevitra any amin’ny mpamoha angatra na any amin’ny mpilaza ny hoavy, dia tena hanameloka an’izany olona izany aho ary haringako tsy ho eo amin’ny fireneny izy.', '“‘raha misy olona mivadika amiko satria lasa maka hevitra any amin’ny mpamoha angatra na any amin’ny mpilaza ny hoavy, dia tena hanameloka an’izany olona izany aho ary haringako tsy ho eo amin’ny fireneny izy.'),
  ('6aadc72161618f21f6adc2a4', '2026-09-18T23:20:01.779Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:01.779Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 20, 5, 'dia izaho mihitsy no hanohitra an’ilay olona sy ny fianakaviany. Haringako tsy ho eo amin’ny fireneny izy sy izay rehetra niaraka taminy nanompo an’i Moleka.', 'dia izaho mihitsy no hanohitra an’ilay olona sy ny fianakaviany. haringako tsy ho eo amin’ny fireneny izy sy izay rehetra niaraka taminy nanompo an’i moleka.'),
  ('6aadc72161618f21f6adc2a3', '2026-09-18T23:20:01.779Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:01.779Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 20, 4, 'Raha minia manakimpy ny masony amin’izay ataon’ilay olona ny vahoaka, ka tsy mamono azy ho faty, nefa izy manolotra ny taranany ho an’i Moleka,', 'raha minia manakimpy ny masony amin’izay ataon’ilay olona ny vahoaka, ka tsy mamono azy ho faty, nefa izy manolotra ny taranany ho an’i moleka,'),
  ('6aadc72161618f21f6adc2a2', '2026-09-18T23:20:01.779Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:01.779Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 20, 3, 'Izaho mihitsy no hanohitra azy ka handringana azy tsy ho eo amin’ny fireneny. Nisy natolony ho an’i Moleka mantsy ny taranany, ary nolotoiny ny toerako masina, dia nozimbazimbainy ny anarako masina.', 'izaho mihitsy no hanohitra azy ka handringana azy tsy ho eo amin’ny fireneny. nisy natolony ho an’i moleka mantsy ny taranany, ary nolotoiny ny toerako masina, dia nozimbazimbainy ny anarako masina.'),
  ('6aadc72161618f21f6adc2a1', '2026-09-18T23:20:01.779Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:01.779Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 20, 2, '“Izao no holazainao amin’ny Israelita: ‘Tsy maintsy vonoina ho faty na iza na iza manolotra ny taranany ho an’i Moleka, na Israelita izy na hafa firenena monina any Israely. Hitora-bato azy ho faty ny vahoaka.', '“izao no holazainao amin’ny israelita: ‘tsy maintsy vonoina ho faty na iza na iza manolotra ny taranany ho an’i moleka, na israelita izy na hafa firenena monina any israely. hitora-bato azy ho faty ny vahoaka.'),
  ('6aadc72161618f21f6adc2a0', '2026-09-18T23:20:01.779Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:01.779Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 20, 1, 'Niteny tamin’i Mosesy koa i Jehovah hoe:', 'niteny tamin’i mosesy koa i jehovah hoe:'),
  ('6aadc7238d83c11bb8b472bb', '2026-09-18T23:20:03.270Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:03.270Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 23, 44, 'Nolazain’i Mosesy tamin’ny Israelita àry ny momba an’ireo fety nasain’i Jehovah nankalazaina.', 'nolazain’i mosesy tamin’ny israelita àry ny momba an’ireo fety nasain’i jehovah nankalazaina.'),
  ('6aadc7238d83c11bb8b472ba', '2026-09-18T23:20:03.270Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:03.270Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 23, 43, 'mba hahafantaran’ny taranakareo ho avy fa tao anaty trano rantsankazo ny Israelita no nasaiko nipetraka, tamin’izaho nitondra azy nivoaka avy tany Ejipta. Izaho no Jehovah Andriamanitrareo.’”', 'mba hahafantaran’ny taranakareo ho avy fa tao anaty trano rantsankazo ny israelita no nasaiko nipetraka, tamin’izaho nitondra azy nivoaka avy tany ejipta. izaho no jehovah andriamanitrareo.’”'),
  ('6aadc7238d83c11bb8b472b9', '2026-09-18T23:20:03.270Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:03.270Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 23, 42, 'Tokony hipetraka ao anaty trano rantsankazo mandritra ny fito andro ianareo. Hipetraka ao anaty trano rantsankazo ny teratany israelita rehetra,', 'tokony hipetraka ao anaty trano rantsankazo mandritra ny fito andro ianareo. hipetraka ao anaty trano rantsankazo ny teratany israelita rehetra,'),
  ('6aadc7238d83c11bb8b472b8', '2026-09-18T23:20:03.270Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:03.270Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 23, 41, 'Ankalazao ho fety ho an’i Jehovah izany isan-taona, mandritra ny fito andro. Tokony hankalaza an’izany ianareo amin’ny volana fahafito, ary ho fitsipika tokony harahinareo sy ny taranakareo rehetra foana izany.', 'ankalazao ho fety ho an’i jehovah izany isan-taona, mandritra ny fito andro. tokony hankalaza an’izany ianareo amin’ny volana fahafito, ary ho fitsipika tokony harahinareo sy ny taranakareo rehetra foana izany.'),
  ('6aadc7238d83c11bb8b472b7', '2026-09-18T23:20:03.270Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:03.270Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 23, 40, 'Amin’ny andro voalohany, dia haka voan’ny hazo mijoalajoala tsara tarehy ianareo, ary haka ravina palmie sy sampana hazo be ravina ary sampana hazo aravaha any amin’ny lohasaha. Dia hifaly mandritra ny fito andro eo anatrehan’i Jehovah Andriamanitrareo ianareo.', 'amin’ny andro voalohany, dia haka voan’ny hazo mijoalajoala tsara tarehy ianareo, ary haka ravina palmie sy sampana hazo be ravina ary sampana hazo aravaha any amin’ny lohasaha. dia hifaly mandritra ny fito andro eo anatrehan’i jehovah andriamanitrareo ianareo.'),
  ('6aadc7238d83c11bb8b472b6', '2026-09-18T23:20:03.270Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:03.270Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 23, 39, 'Hankalaza ny fety ho an’i Jehovah mandritra ny fito andro kosa ianareo, manomboka amin’ny andro faha-15 amin’ny volana fahafito, rehefa voangonareo ny vokatry ny tany. Fitsaharana tanteraka ny andro voalohany, ary fitsaharana tanteraka koa ny andro fahavalo.', 'hankalaza ny fety ho an’i jehovah mandritra ny fito andro kosa ianareo, manomboka amin’ny andro faha-15 amin’ny volana fahafito, rehefa voangonareo ny vokatry ny tany. fitsaharana tanteraka ny andro voalohany, ary fitsaharana tanteraka koa ny andro fahavalo.'),
  ('6aadc7238d83c11bb8b472b5', '2026-09-18T23:20:03.270Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:03.270Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 23, 38, 'Ho fanampin’ny fanatitra atolotra rehefa sabatan’i Jehovah ireo rehetra ireo, ary ho fanampin’ny fanomezana sy ny fanatitra fanefana voady ary ny fanatitra an-tsitrapo, izay tokony homenareo an’i Jehovah.', 'ho fanampin’ny fanatitra atolotra rehefa sabatan’i jehovah ireo rehetra ireo, ary ho fanampin’ny fanomezana sy ny fanatitra fanefana voady ary ny fanatitra an-tsitrapo, izay tokony homenareo an’i jehovah.'),
  ('6aadc7238d83c11bb8b472b4', '2026-09-18T23:20:03.270Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:03.270Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 23, 37, '“‘Ireo no fety asain’i Jehovah anaovanareo antso avo. Fivoriambe masina hanolorana fanatitra atao anaty afo ho an’i Jehovah ireo, dia ny fanatitra dorana sy ny fanatitra varimbazaha ampiarahina amin’ny sorona ary ny fanatitra zava-pisotro, araka ny fandaharam-potoana isan’andro.', '“‘ireo no fety asain’i jehovah anaovanareo antso avo. fivoriambe masina hanolorana fanatitra atao anaty afo ho an’i jehovah ireo, dia ny fanatitra dorana sy ny fanatitra varimbazaha ampiarahina amin’ny sorona ary ny fanatitra zava-pisotro, araka ny fandaharam-potoana isan’andro.'),
  ('6aadc7238d83c11bb8b472b3', '2026-09-18T23:20:03.270Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:03.270Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 23, 36, 'Fito andro no hanoloranareo fanatitra atao anaty afo ho an’i Jehovah. Hanao fivoriambe masina ianareo amin’ny andro fahavalo, ary hanolotra fanatitra atao anaty afo ho an’i Jehovah. Fivoriambe makotrokotroka izany, ka aza manao asa mafy, na inona izany na inona.', 'fito andro no hanoloranareo fanatitra atao anaty afo ho an’i jehovah. hanao fivoriambe masina ianareo amin’ny andro fahavalo, ary hanolotra fanatitra atao anaty afo ho an’i jehovah. fivoriambe makotrokotroka izany, ka aza manao asa mafy, na inona izany na inona.'),
  ('6aadc7238d83c11bb8b472b2', '2026-09-18T23:20:03.270Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:03.270Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 23, 35, 'Hisy fivoriambe masina amin’ny andro voalohany, ka tsy tokony hanao asa mafy ianareo, na inona izany na inona.', 'hisy fivoriambe masina amin’ny andro voalohany, ka tsy tokony hanao asa mafy ianareo, na inona izany na inona.'),
  ('6aadc7238d83c11bb8b472b1', '2026-09-18T23:20:03.270Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:03.270Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 23, 34, '“Ilazao ny Israelita hoe: ‘Ny andro faha-15 amin’io volana fahafito io dia Fetin’ny Trano Rantsankazo. Fety ho an’i Jehovah izany, ary maharitra fito andro.', '“ilazao ny israelita hoe: ‘ny andro faha-15 amin’io volana fahafito io dia fetin’ny trano rantsankazo. fety ho an’i jehovah izany, ary maharitra fito andro.'),
  ('6aadc7238d83c11bb8b472b0', '2026-09-18T23:20:03.270Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:03.270Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 23, 33, 'Mbola niteny tamin’i Mosesy koa i Jehovah hoe:', 'mbola niteny tamin’i mosesy koa i jehovah hoe:'),
  ('6aadc7238d83c11bb8b472af', '2026-09-18T23:20:03.270Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:03.270Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 23, 32, 'Sabata fitsaharana tanteraka izany ho anareo, ary hampijaly tena ianareo amin’ny andro fahasivin’ny volana, amin’ny takariva. Hitandrina ny sabatanareo ianareo amin’io andro io, manomboka amin’ny takariva ka hatramin’ny ampitso takariva.”', 'sabata fitsaharana tanteraka izany ho anareo, ary hampijaly tena ianareo amin’ny andro fahasivin’ny volana, amin’ny takariva. hitandrina ny sabatanareo ianareo amin’io andro io, manomboka amin’ny takariva ka hatramin’ny ampitso takariva.”'),
  ('6aadc7238d83c11bb8b472ae', '2026-09-18T23:20:03.270Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:03.270Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 23, 31, 'Aza manao asa, na inona izany na inona. Fitsipika tokony harahinareo sy ny taranakareo foana izany, na aiza na aiza ipetrahanareo.', 'aza manao asa, na inona izany na inona. fitsipika tokony harahinareo sy ny taranakareo foana izany, na aiza na aiza ipetrahanareo.'),
  ('6aadc7238d83c11bb8b472ad', '2026-09-18T23:20:03.270Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:03.270Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 23, 30, 'Ary haringako tsy ho eo amin’ny fireneny izay rehetra manao asa amin’io andro io, na inona izany na inona.', 'ary haringako tsy ho eo amin’ny fireneny izay rehetra manao asa amin’io andro io, na inona izany na inona.'),
  ('6aadc7238d83c11bb8b472ac', '2026-09-18T23:20:03.270Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:03.270Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 23, 29, 'Haringana tsy ho anisan’ny fireneny izay tsy mampijaly tena amin’io andro io.', 'haringana tsy ho anisan’ny fireneny izay tsy mampijaly tena amin’io andro io.'),
  ('6aadc7238d83c11bb8b472ab', '2026-09-18T23:20:03.270Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:03.270Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 23, 28, 'Aza manao asa na inona na inona amin’io andro manokana io satria andro fandrakofam-pahotana izy io, handrakofana ny fahotanareo eo anatrehan’i Jehovah Andriamanitrareo.', 'aza manao asa na inona na inona amin’io andro manokana io satria andro fandrakofam-pahotana izy io, handrakofana ny fahotanareo eo anatrehan’i jehovah andriamanitrareo.'),
  ('6aadc7238d83c11bb8b472aa', '2026-09-18T23:20:03.270Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:03.270Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 23, 27, '“Andro Fandrakofam-pahotana kosa ny andro fahafolon’io volana fahafito io. Hanao fivoriambe masina ianareo, ary hampijaly tena sy hanolotra fanatitra atao anaty afo ho an’i Jehovah.', '“andro fandrakofam-pahotana kosa ny andro fahafolon’io volana fahafito io. hanao fivoriambe masina ianareo, ary hampijaly tena sy hanolotra fanatitra atao anaty afo ho an’i jehovah.'),
  ('6aadc7238d83c11bb8b472a9', '2026-09-18T23:20:03.270Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:03.270Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 23, 26, 'Niteny tamin’i Mosesy koa i Jehovah hoe:', 'niteny tamin’i mosesy koa i jehovah hoe:'),
  ('6aadc7238d83c11bb8b472a8', '2026-09-18T23:20:03.270Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:03.270Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 23, 25, 'Aza manao asa mafy, na inona izany na inona, ary manolora fanatitra atao anaty afo ho an’i Jehovah.’”', 'aza manao asa mafy, na inona izany na inona, ary manolora fanatitra atao anaty afo ho an’i jehovah.’”'),
  ('6aadc7238d83c11bb8b472a7', '2026-09-18T23:20:03.270Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:03.270Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 23, 24, '“Ilazao ny Israelita hoe: ‘Amin’ny andro voalohan’ny volana fahafito dia hitsahatra tanteraka ianareo. Hotsofina ny trompetra amin’io andro io mba hahatsiarovanareo fa fivoriambe masina izy io.', '“ilazao ny israelita hoe: ‘amin’ny andro voalohan’ny volana fahafito dia hitsahatra tanteraka ianareo. hotsofina ny trompetra amin’io andro io mba hahatsiarovanareo fa fivoriambe masina izy io.'),
  ('6aadc7238d83c11bb8b472a6', '2026-09-18T23:20:03.270Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:03.270Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 23, 23, 'Hoy koa i Jehovah tamin’i Mosesy:', 'hoy koa i jehovah tamin’i mosesy:'),
  ('6aadc7238d83c11bb8b472a5', '2026-09-18T23:20:03.270Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:03.270Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 23, 22, '“‘Rehefa mijinja ny vokatry ny taninareo ianareo, dia aza jinjaina tanteraka ny sisin’ny sahanareo, ary aza alaina ny vokatra navelan’ny mpijinja. Avelao ho an’ny mahantra sy ny hafa firenena monina eo aminareo izany. Izaho no Jehovah Andriamanitrareo.’”', '“‘rehefa mijinja ny vokatry ny taninareo ianareo, dia aza jinjaina tanteraka ny sisin’ny sahanareo, ary aza alaina ny vokatra navelan’ny mpijinja. avelao ho an’ny mahantra sy ny hafa firenena monina eo aminareo izany. izaho no jehovah andriamanitrareo.’”'),
  ('6aadc7238d83c11bb8b472a4', '2026-09-18T23:20:03.270Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:03.270Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 23, 21, 'Dia manaova antso avo amin’io andro io hoe hisy fivoriambe masina ho anareo. Aza manao asa mafy, na inona izany na inona. Fitsipika tokony harahinareo sy ny taranakareo foana izany, any amin’ny toerana rehetra ipetrahanareo.', 'dia manaova antso avo amin’io andro io hoe hisy fivoriambe masina ho anareo. aza manao asa mafy, na inona izany na inona. fitsipika tokony harahinareo sy ny taranakareo foana izany, any amin’ny toerana rehetra ipetrahanareo.'),
  ('6aadc7238d83c11bb8b472a3', '2026-09-18T23:20:03.270Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:03.270Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 23, 20, 'Dia hahetsiketsiky ny mpisorona, ho fanatitra ahetsiketsika eo anatrehan’i Jehovah, ireo ondrilahy kely roa sy ny mofo natao tamin’ny voaloham-bokatra. Ho zava-masina eo anatrehan’i Jehovah ireo, ary ho an’ilay mpisorona.', 'dia hahetsiketsiky ny mpisorona, ho fanatitra ahetsiketsika eo anatrehan’i jehovah, ireo ondrilahy kely roa sy ny mofo natao tamin’ny voaloham-bokatra. ho zava-masina eo anatrehan’i jehovah ireo, ary ho an’ilay mpisorona.'),
  ('6aadc7238d83c11bb8b472a2', '2026-09-18T23:20:03.270Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:03.270Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 23, 19, 'Ary manolora zanak’osy iray ho fanatitra noho ny ota, sy ondrilahy kely roa izay herintaona avy ho sorona iombonana.', 'ary manolora zanak’osy iray ho fanatitra noho ny ota, sy ondrilahy kely roa izay herintaona avy ho sorona iombonana.'),
  ('6aadc7238d83c11bb8b472a1', '2026-09-18T23:20:03.270Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:03.270Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 23, 18, 'Ary izao no atolory miaraka amin’ny mofo: Ondrilahy kely fito tsy misy kilema sady herintaona avy, sy vantotr’ombilahy iray, ary ondrilahy roa. Ho fanatitra dorana ho an’i Jehovah ireo, miaraka amin’ny fanatitra varimbazaha sy ny fanatitra zava-pisotro tokony hiaraka aminy. Ho fanatitra atao anaty afo ireo, mba ho hanitra mahafinaritra an’i Jehovah.', 'ary izao no atolory miaraka amin’ny mofo: ondrilahy kely fito tsy misy kilema sady herintaona avy, sy vantotr’ombilahy iray, ary ondrilahy roa. ho fanatitra dorana ho an’i jehovah ireo, miaraka amin’ny fanatitra varimbazaha sy ny fanatitra zava-pisotro tokony hiaraka aminy. ho fanatitra atao anaty afo ireo, mba ho hanitra mahafinaritra an’i jehovah.'),
  ('6aadc7238d83c11bb8b472a0', '2026-09-18T23:20:03.270Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:03.270Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 23, 17, 'Mitondrà mofo roa avy any amin’ny toerana ipetrahanareo, ho fanatitra ahetsiketsika. Tokony ho lafarinina tsara toto roa ampahafolon’ny efaha no hanaovana azy ireo, ary tokony hasiana lalivay sady hatao ao anaty lafaoro, ho voaloham-bokatra ho an’i Jehovah.', 'mitondrà mofo roa avy any amin’ny toerana ipetrahanareo, ho fanatitra ahetsiketsika. tokony ho lafarinina tsara toto roa ampahafolon’ny efaha no hanaovana azy ireo, ary tokony hasiana lalivay sady hatao ao anaty lafaoro, ho voaloham-bokatra ho an’i jehovah.'),
  ('6aadc7238d83c11bb8b4729f', '2026-09-18T23:20:03.270Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:03.270Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 23, 16, 'Hanisa 50 andro ianareo, mandra-pahatongan’ny ampitson’ny Sabata fahafito. Dia manolora fanatitra varimbazaha vaovao ho an’i Jehovah.', 'hanisa 50 andro ianareo, mandra-pahatongan’ny ampitson’ny sabata fahafito. dia manolora fanatitra varimbazaha vaovao ho an’i jehovah.'),
  ('6aadc7238d83c11bb8b4729e', '2026-09-18T23:20:03.270Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:03.270Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 23, 15, '“‘Manisà sabata fito manomboka ny ampitson’ny Sabata, manomboka amin’ilay andro itondranareo ny amboara atao fanatitra ahetsiketsika. Tokony ho fito herinandro katroka ireo.', '“‘manisà sabata fito manomboka ny ampitson’ny sabata, manomboka amin’ilay andro itondranareo ny amboara atao fanatitra ahetsiketsika. tokony ho fito herinandro katroka ireo.'),
  ('6aadc7238d83c11bb8b4729d', '2026-09-18T23:20:03.270Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:03.270Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 23, 14, 'Aza mihinana mofo, na voa natono, na voa vaovao, mandra-pahatongan’ilay andro hitondranareo ny fanatitra ho an’Andriamanitrareo. Fitsipika tokony harahinareo sy ny taranakareo foana izany, na aiza na aiza ipetrahanareo.', 'aza mihinana mofo, na voa natono, na voa vaovao, mandra-pahatongan’ilay andro hitondranareo ny fanatitra ho an’andriamanitrareo. fitsipika tokony harahinareo sy ny taranakareo foana izany, na aiza na aiza ipetrahanareo.'),
  ('6aadc7238d83c11bb8b4729c', '2026-09-18T23:20:03.270Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:03.270Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 23, 13, 'Ny fanatitra varimbazaha hampiarahina amin’izany, dia lafarinina tsara toto roa ampahafolon’ny efaha, nafangaro menaka, ho fanatitra atao anaty afo ho an’i Jehovah, mba ho hanitra mahafinaritra azy. Ampiaraho aminy koa ny divay ampahefatry ny hina mba ho fanatitra zava-pisotro.', 'ny fanatitra varimbazaha hampiarahina amin’izany, dia lafarinina tsara toto roa ampahafolon’ny efaha, nafangaro menaka, ho fanatitra atao anaty afo ho an’i jehovah, mba ho hanitra mahafinaritra azy. ampiaraho aminy koa ny divay ampahefatry ny hina mba ho fanatitra zava-pisotro.'),
  ('6aadc7238d83c11bb8b4729b', '2026-09-18T23:20:03.270Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:03.270Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 23, 12, 'Amin’ny andro hanetsiketsehana an’ilay amboara no hanoloranareo ondrilahy kely tsy misy kilema sady tsy mihoatra ny herintaona, ho fanatitra dorana ho an’i Jehovah.', 'amin’ny andro hanetsiketsehana an’ilay amboara no hanoloranareo ondrilahy kely tsy misy kilema sady tsy mihoatra ny herintaona, ho fanatitra dorana ho an’i jehovah.'),
  ('6aadc7238d83c11bb8b4729a', '2026-09-18T23:20:03.270Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:03.270Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 23, 11, 'Ary hahetsiketsiny eo anatrehan’i Jehovah ilay amboara, mba hahazoanareo sitraka aminy. Ny ampitson’ny Sabata ny mpisorona no tokony hanetsiketsika an’izany.', 'ary hahetsiketsiny eo anatrehan’i jehovah ilay amboara, mba hahazoanareo sitraka aminy. ny ampitson’ny sabata ny mpisorona no tokony hanetsiketsika an’izany.'),
  ('6aadc7238d83c11bb8b47299', '2026-09-18T23:20:03.270Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:03.270Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 23, 10, '“Ilazao ny Israelita hoe: ‘Rehefa tafiditra ao amin’ilay tany homeko anareo ianareo ka mijinja ny vokatra ao, dia mitondrà amboara iray avy amin’ny voaloham-bokatrareo ho any amin’ny mpisorona.', '“ilazao ny israelita hoe: ‘rehefa tafiditra ao amin’ilay tany homeko anareo ianareo ka mijinja ny vokatra ao, dia mitondrà amboara iray avy amin’ny voaloham-bokatrareo ho any amin’ny mpisorona.'),
  ('6aadc7238d83c11bb8b47298', '2026-09-18T23:20:03.270Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:03.270Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 23, 9, 'Niteny tamin’i Mosesy koa i Jehovah hoe:', 'niteny tamin’i mosesy koa i jehovah hoe:'),
  ('6aadc7238d83c11bb8b47297', '2026-09-18T23:20:03.270Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:03.270Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 23, 8, 'Hanolotra fanatitra atao anaty afo ho an’i Jehovah anefa ianareo mandritra ny fito andro. Ary hisy fivoriambe masina amin’ny andro fahafito. Tsy tokony hanao asa mafy ianareo, na inona izany na inona.’”', 'hanolotra fanatitra atao anaty afo ho an’i jehovah anefa ianareo mandritra ny fito andro. ary hisy fivoriambe masina amin’ny andro fahafito. tsy tokony hanao asa mafy ianareo, na inona izany na inona.’”'),
  ('6aadc7238d83c11bb8b47296', '2026-09-18T23:20:03.270Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:03.270Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 23, 7, 'Hanao fivoriambe masina ianareo amin’ny andro voalohany. Tsy tokony hanao asa mafy ianareo, na inona izany na inona.', 'hanao fivoriambe masina ianareo amin’ny andro voalohany. tsy tokony hanao asa mafy ianareo, na inona izany na inona.'),
  ('6aadc7238d83c11bb8b47295', '2026-09-18T23:20:03.270Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:03.270Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 23, 6, '“‘Ny andro faha-15 amin’io volana io dia Fetin’ny Mofo Tsy Misy Lalivay. Fety ho an’i Jehovah izany, ary mandritra ny fito andro ianareo no hihinana mofo tsy misy lalivay.', '“‘ny andro faha-15 amin’io volana io dia fetin’ny mofo tsy misy lalivay. fety ho an’i jehovah izany, ary mandritra ny fito andro ianareo no hihinana mofo tsy misy lalivay.'),
  ('6aadc7238d83c11bb8b47294', '2026-09-18T23:20:03.270Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:03.270Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 23, 5, 'Paska ho an’i Jehovah ny andro faha-14 amin’ny volana voalohany, amin’ny takariva.', 'paska ho an’i jehovah ny andro faha-14 amin’ny volana voalohany, amin’ny takariva.'),
  ('6aadc7238d83c11bb8b47293', '2026-09-18T23:20:03.270Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:03.270Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 23, 4, '“‘Ireto avy ny fety nandidian’i Jehovah, izany hoe ireo fivoriambe masina izay tokony hanaovanareo antso avo, amin’ny fotoana voatondro hankalazana azy:', '“‘ireto avy ny fety nandidian’i jehovah, izany hoe ireo fivoriambe masina izay tokony hanaovanareo antso avo, amin’ny fotoana voatondro hankalazana azy:'),
  ('6aadc7238d83c11bb8b47292', '2026-09-18T23:20:03.270Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:03.270Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 23, 3, '“‘Enina andro no azo iasana, fa sabata fitsaharana tanteraka kosa ny andro fahafito, sady fivoriambe masina. Aza manao asa na inona na inona, fa tokony ho sabata ho an’i Jehovah izany andro izany, na aiza na aiza ipetrahanareo.', '“‘enina andro no azo iasana, fa sabata fitsaharana tanteraka kosa ny andro fahafito, sady fivoriambe masina. aza manao asa na inona na inona, fa tokony ho sabata ho an’i jehovah izany andro izany, na aiza na aiza ipetrahanareo.'),
  ('6aadc7238d83c11bb8b47291', '2026-09-18T23:20:03.270Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:03.270Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 23, 2, '“Ilazao ny Israelita hoe: ‘Fivoriambe masina ireo fety asain’i Jehovah anaovanareo antso avo hoe hankalazaina. Ireto avy izany:', '“ilazao ny israelita hoe: ‘fivoriambe masina ireo fety asain’i jehovah anaovanareo antso avo hoe hankalazaina. ireto avy izany:'),
  ('6aadc7238d83c11bb8b47290', '2026-09-18T23:20:03.270Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:03.270Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 23, 1, 'Hoy koa i Jehovah tamin’i Mosesy:', 'hoy koa i jehovah tamin’i mosesy:'),
  ('6aadc7233386093aad41b3c1', '2026-09-18T23:20:03.927Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:03.927Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 24, 23, 'Dia nolazain’i Mosesy tamin’ny Israelita izany, ka nentina tany ivelan’ny toby ilay nanozona, ary notoraham-bato. Nataon’ny Israelita àry izay nandidian’i Jehovah an’i Mosesy.', 'dia nolazain’i mosesy tamin’ny israelita izany, ka nentina tany ivelan’ny toby ilay nanozona, ary notoraham-bato. nataon’ny israelita àry izay nandidian’i jehovah an’i mosesy.'),
  ('6aadc7233386093aad41b3c0', '2026-09-18T23:20:03.927Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:03.927Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 24, 22, '“‘Didim-pitsarana iray ihany no hampiharina aminareo, na vahiny na teratany. Izaho mantsy no Jehovah Andriamanitrareo.’”', '“‘didim-pitsarana iray ihany no hampiharina aminareo, na vahiny na teratany. izaho mantsy no jehovah andriamanitrareo.’”'),
  ('6aadc7233386093aad41b3bf', '2026-09-18T23:20:03.927Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:03.927Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 24, 21, 'Hanonitra ny biby novonoiny izay namono biby ka nahafaty azy. Fa hovonoina ho faty kosa izay namely olona ka nahafaty azy.', 'hanonitra ny biby novonoiny izay namono biby ka nahafaty azy. fa hovonoina ho faty kosa izay namely olona ka nahafaty azy.'),
  ('6aadc7233386093aad41b3be', '2026-09-18T23:20:03.927Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:03.927Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 24, 20, 'Tapaka ho solon’ny tapaka, maso ho solon’ny maso, nify ho solon’ny nify. Izay ratra nataony tamin’ilay olona no hatao aminy koa.', 'tapaka ho solon’ny tapaka, maso ho solon’ny maso, nify ho solon’ny nify. izay ratra nataony tamin’ilay olona no hatao aminy koa.'),
  ('6aadc7233386093aad41b3bd', '2026-09-18T23:20:03.927Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:03.927Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 24, 19, 'Raha misy olona mandratra olon-kafa, dia izay nataony tamin’ilay namany ihany no hatao aminy:', 'raha misy olona mandratra olon-kafa, dia izay nataony tamin’ilay namany ihany no hatao aminy:'),
  ('6aadc7233386093aad41b3bc', '2026-09-18T23:20:03.927Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:03.927Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 24, 18, 'Izay mamono biby fiompy ka mahafaty azy dia hanonitra an’izany, ka hanome biby ho solon’ny biby.', 'izay mamono biby fiompy ka mahafaty azy dia hanonitra an’izany, ka hanome biby ho solon’ny biby.'),
  ('6aadc7233386093aad41b3bb', '2026-09-18T23:20:03.927Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:03.927Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 24, 17, '“‘Raha misy manala ain’olona, dia tsy maintsy vonoina ho faty koa izy.', '“‘raha misy manala ain’olona, dia tsy maintsy vonoina ho faty koa izy.'),
  ('6aadc7233386093aad41b3ba', '2026-09-18T23:20:03.927Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:03.927Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 24, 16, 'Koa tsy maintsy vonoina ho faty izay miteny ratsy ny anaran’i Jehovah. Tsy maintsy mitora-bato azy ny vahoaka manontolo. Hovonoina ho faty izay miteny ratsy an’ilay Anarana, na hafa firenena izy na teratany.', 'koa tsy maintsy vonoina ho faty izay miteny ratsy ny anaran’i jehovah. tsy maintsy mitora-bato azy ny vahoaka manontolo. hovonoina ho faty izay miteny ratsy an’ilay anarana, na hafa firenena izy na teratany.'),
  ('6aadc7233386093aad41b3b9', '2026-09-18T23:20:03.927Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:03.927Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 24, 15, 'Ary izao no holazainao amin’ny Israelita: ‘Izay olona manozona ny Andriamaniny dia hizaka ny vokatry ny fahotany.', 'ary izao no holazainao amin’ny israelita: ‘izay olona manozona ny andriamaniny dia hizaka ny vokatry ny fahotany.'),
  ('6aadc7233386093aad41b3b8', '2026-09-18T23:20:03.927Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:03.927Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 24, 14, '“Ento mivoaka ny toby ilay nanozona. Ary hametraka ny tanany eo amin’ny lohan’ilay olona izay rehetra nandre ny zavatra nolazainy. Hitora-bato azy ny vahoaka manontolo avy eo.', '“ento mivoaka ny toby ilay nanozona. ary hametraka ny tanany eo amin’ny lohan’ilay olona izay rehetra nandre ny zavatra nolazainy. hitora-bato azy ny vahoaka manontolo avy eo.'),
  ('6aadc7233386093aad41b3b7', '2026-09-18T23:20:03.927Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:03.927Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 24, 13, 'Dia hoy i Jehovah tamin’i Mosesy:', 'dia hoy i jehovah tamin’i mosesy:'),
  ('6aadc7233386093aad41b3b6', '2026-09-18T23:20:03.927Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:03.927Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 24, 12, 'Nambenana ilay lehilahy, mandra-pahafantatra mazava tsara hoe inona ny fanapahan-kevitr’i Jehovah.', 'nambenana ilay lehilahy, mandra-pahafantatra mazava tsara hoe inona ny fanapahan-kevitr’i jehovah.'),
  ('6aadc7233386093aad41b3b5', '2026-09-18T23:20:03.927Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:03.927Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 24, 11, 'Niteny ratsy sy nanozona an’ilay Anarana io zanaka vehivavy israelita io. Koa nentina tany amin’i Mosesy izy. Selomita no anaran-dreniny, ary zanakavavin’i Dibry avy amin’ny fokon’i Dana izy io.', 'niteny ratsy sy nanozona an’ilay anarana io zanaka vehivavy israelita io. koa nentina tany amin’i mosesy izy. selomita no anaran-dreniny, ary zanakavavin’i dibry avy amin’ny fokon’i dana izy io.'),
  ('6aadc7233386093aad41b3b4', '2026-09-18T23:20:03.927Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:03.927Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 24, 10, 'Nisy lehilahy iray, zanaka vehivavy israelita sy lehilahy ejipsianina, teo amin’ny Israelita. Niady tao amin’ny toby io lehilahy io sy ny lehilahy israelita iray.', 'nisy lehilahy iray, zanaka vehivavy israelita sy lehilahy ejipsianina, teo amin’ny israelita. niady tao amin’ny toby io lehilahy io sy ny lehilahy israelita iray.'),
  ('6aadc7233386093aad41b3b3', '2026-09-18T23:20:03.927Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:03.927Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 24, 9, 'Ho lasan’i Arona sy ny zanany lahy izany, ka hohanin’izy ireo ao amin’izay toerana masina, satria zavatra masina indrindra ho an’ny mpisorona, avy amin’ny fanatitra atao anaty afo ho an’i Jehovah. Fitsipika tokony harahina foana izany.”', 'ho lasan’i arona sy ny zanany lahy izany, ka hohanin’izy ireo ao amin’izay toerana masina, satria zavatra masina indrindra ho an’ny mpisorona, avy amin’ny fanatitra atao anaty afo ho an’i jehovah. fitsipika tokony harahina foana izany.”'),
  ('6aadc7233386093aad41b3b2', '2026-09-18T23:20:03.927Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:03.927Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 24, 8, 'Isaky ny Sabata no halahatra tsy tapaka eo anatrehan’i Jehovah ireo mofo. Fifanekena maharitra ela be ataony amin’ny Israelita izany.', 'isaky ny sabata no halahatra tsy tapaka eo anatrehan’i jehovah ireo mofo. fifanekena maharitra ela be ataony amin’ny israelita izany.'),
  ('6aadc7233386093aad41b3b1', '2026-09-18T23:20:03.927Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:03.927Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 24, 7, 'Asio ditin-kazo manitra tsy misy fangarony eo ambonin’ny toko tsirairay. Dia ataovy fanatitra ho solon’ny mofo ilay ditin-kazo, ho santionany amin’ny fanatitra atao anaty afo ho an’i Jehovah.', 'asio ditin-kazo manitra tsy misy fangarony eo ambonin’ny toko tsirairay. dia ataovy fanatitra ho solon’ny mofo ilay ditin-kazo, ho santionany amin’ny fanatitra atao anaty afo ho an’i jehovah.'),
  ('6aadc7233386093aad41b3b0', '2026-09-18T23:20:03.927Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:03.927Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 24, 6, 'Zarao ho roa toko ireo mofo ireo ka ataovy mofo enina mifanaingina ny toko tsirairay, dia ataovy eo ambonin’ilay latabatra vita amin’ny volamena tsy misy fangarony, eo anatrehan’i Jehovah.', 'zarao ho roa toko ireo mofo ireo ka ataovy mofo enina mifanaingina ny toko tsirairay, dia ataovy eo ambonin’ilay latabatra vita amin’ny volamena tsy misy fangarony, eo anatrehan’i jehovah.'),
  ('6aadc7233386093aad41b3af', '2026-09-18T23:20:03.927Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:03.927Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 24, 5, '“Haka lafarinina tsara toto ianao ka hanao mofo boribory 12, dia hanao an’izany ao anaty lafaoro. Lafarinina roa ampahafolon’ny efaha no hanaovana ny mofo tsirairay.', '“haka lafarinina tsara toto ianao ka hanao mofo boribory 12, dia hanao an’izany ao anaty lafaoro. lafarinina roa ampahafolon’ny efaha no hanaovana ny mofo tsirairay.'),
  ('6aadc7233386093aad41b3ae', '2026-09-18T23:20:03.927Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:03.927Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 24, 4, 'Hataony vonona eo ambony fitoeran-jiro vita amin’ny volamena tsy misy fangarony ireo jiro, mba hirehitra foana eo anatrehan’i Jehovah.', 'hataony vonona eo ambony fitoeran-jiro vita amin’ny volamena tsy misy fangarony ireo jiro, mba hirehitra foana eo anatrehan’i jehovah.'),
  ('6aadc7233386093aad41b3ad', '2026-09-18T23:20:03.927Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:03.927Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 24, 3, 'Eo anoloan’ilay ridao eo akaikin’ny Tenin’ny Vavolombelona, ao amin’ny tranolay fihaonana, no hikarakaran’i Arona ny jiro, mba hirehitra foana eo anatrehan’i Jehovah ilay izy, manomboka amin’ny hariva mandra-paharainan’ny andro. Fitsipika manan-kery foana izany, ka tokony harahinareo sy ny taranakareo rehetra.', 'eo anoloan’ilay ridao eo akaikin’ny tenin’ny vavolombelona, ao amin’ny tranolay fihaonana, no hikarakaran’i arona ny jiro, mba hirehitra foana eo anatrehan’i jehovah ilay izy, manomboka amin’ny hariva mandra-paharainan’ny andro. fitsipika manan-kery foana izany, ka tokony harahinareo sy ny taranakareo rehetra.'),
  ('6aadc7233386093aad41b3ac', '2026-09-18T23:20:03.927Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:03.927Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 24, 2, '“Asaivo mitondra menak’oliva tsy misy fangarony avy amin’ny oliva voatoto ny Israelita, mba hatao amin’ny jiro. Amin’izay dia hirehitra foana ny jiro.', '“asaivo mitondra menak’oliva tsy misy fangarony avy amin’ny oliva voatoto ny israelita, mba hatao amin’ny jiro. amin’izay dia hirehitra foana ny jiro.'),
  ('6aadc7233386093aad41b3ab', '2026-09-18T23:20:03.927Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:03.927Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 24, 1, 'Hoy koa i Jehovah tamin’i Mosesy:', 'hoy koa i jehovah tamin’i mosesy:'),
  ('6aadc724e999585618c39323', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.337Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.337Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 25, 6, 'Azonareo hanina anefa izay maniry ao amin’ilay tany mandritra ny fotoana hitandremany an’ilay sabata. Mahazo mihinana an’izany ianao, ny mpanompolahinao sy ny mpanompovavinao, ny olona karamainao, ny mpiavy monina eo aminao,', 'azonareo hanina anefa izay maniry ao amin’ilay tany mandritra ny fotoana hitandremany an’ilay sabata. mahazo mihinana an’izany ianao, ny mpanompolahinao sy ny mpanompovavinao, ny olona karamainao, ny mpiavy monina eo aminao,'),
  ('6aadc724e999585618c39322', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.337Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.337Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 25, 5, 'Aza jinjaina izay naniry ho azy avy tamin’ny voa tavela taorian’ny fijinjana farany, ary aza otazana ny voan’ny voaloboka tsy norantsanana. Fa tokony hisy taona iray hamelana ny tany hiala sasatra tanteraka.', 'aza jinjaina izay naniry ho azy avy tamin’ny voa tavela taorian’ny fijinjana farany, ary aza otazana ny voan’ny voaloboka tsy norantsanana. fa tokony hisy taona iray hamelana ny tany hiala sasatra tanteraka.'),
  ('6aadc724e999585618c39321', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.337Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.337Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 25, 4, 'Fa hisy sabata fialan-tsasatra tanteraka ho an’ilay tany kosa amin’ny taona fahafito, ho sabata ho an’i Jehovah. Aza amafazana voa ny sahanao, ary aza rantsanana ny voalobokao.', 'fa hisy sabata fialan-tsasatra tanteraka ho an’ilay tany kosa amin’ny taona fahafito, ho sabata ho an’i jehovah. aza amafazana voa ny sahanao, ary aza rantsanana ny voalobokao.'),
  ('6aadc724e999585618c39320', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.337Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.337Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 25, 3, 'Enin-taona ianao no hamafy voa eo amin’ny sahanao, ary enin-taona ianao no handrantsana ny voalobokao, sy hanangona ny vokatry ny tany.', 'enin-taona ianao no hamafy voa eo amin’ny sahanao, ary enin-taona ianao no handrantsana ny voalobokao, sy hanangona ny vokatry ny tany.'),
  ('6aadc724e999585618c3931f', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.337Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.337Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 25, 2, '“Ilazao ny Israelita hoe: ‘Rehefa tafiditra ao amin’ilay tany homeko anareo ianareo, dia hitandrina sabata ho an’i Jehovah ilay tany.', '“ilazao ny israelita hoe: ‘rehefa tafiditra ao amin’ilay tany homeko anareo ianareo, dia hitandrina sabata ho an’i jehovah ilay tany.'),
  ('6aadc724e999585618c3931e', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.337Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.337Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 25, 1, 'Niteny tamin’i Mosesy koa i Jehovah teo amin’ny Tendrombohitra Sinay hoe:', 'niteny tamin’i mosesy koa i jehovah teo amin’ny tendrombohitra sinay hoe:'),
  ('6aadc724e999585618c39324', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.338Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.338Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 25, 7, 'ary ny biby fiompinao sy ny bibidia ao amin’ny taninao. Azo hanina daholo izay vokarin’ilay tany.', 'ary ny biby fiompinao sy ny bibidia ao amin’ny taninao. azo hanina daholo izay vokarin’ilay tany.'),
  ('6aadc724e999585618c39325', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.338Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.338Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 25, 8, '“‘Hanisa sabatan-taona fito ianao, izany hoe fito taona impito. Haharitra 49 taona àry ireo sabatan-taona fito ireo.', '“‘hanisa sabatan-taona fito ianao, izany hoe fito taona impito. haharitra 49 taona àry ireo sabatan-taona fito ireo.'),
  ('6aadc724e999585618c39326', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.338Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.338Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 25, 9, 'Dia tsofy mafy ny anjombona amin’ny andro fahafolon’ny volana fahafito. Amin’ny Andro Fandrakofam-pahotana no hotsofinareo ny anjombona, mba ho re eran’ny taninareo ny feony.', 'dia tsofy mafy ny anjombona amin’ny andro fahafolon’ny volana fahafito. amin’ny andro fandrakofam-pahotana no hotsofinareo ny anjombona, mba ho re eran’ny taninareo ny feony.'),
  ('6aadc724e999585618c39327', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.338Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.338Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 25, 10, 'Ary hamasino ny taona faha-50, ka ataovy antso avo amin’ny mponina rehetra ao amin’ilay tany fa tonga ny fahafahana. Ho Jobily ho anareo izany, ka samy hahazo ny lovanareo indray ianareo ary samy hiverina any amin’ny fianakavianareo avy.', 'ary hamasino ny taona faha-50, ka ataovy antso avo amin’ny mponina rehetra ao amin’ilay tany fa tonga ny fahafahana. ho jobily ho anareo izany, ka samy hahazo ny lovanareo indray ianareo ary samy hiverina any amin’ny fianakavianareo avy.'),
  ('6aadc724e999585618c39328', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.338Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.338Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 25, 11, 'Ho Jobily ho anareo ny taona faha-50. Aza mamafy voa na mijinja an’izay naniry ho azy avy tamin’ny voa tavela taorian’ny fijinjana farany. Ary aza otazana ny voan’ny voaloboka tsy norantsanana.', 'ho jobily ho anareo ny taona faha-50. aza mamafy voa na mijinja an’izay naniry ho azy avy tamin’ny voa tavela taorian’ny fijinjana farany. ary aza otazana ny voan’ny voaloboka tsy norantsanana.'),
  ('6aadc724e999585618c39329', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.338Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.338Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 25, 12, 'Fa Jobily izany, ka ho masina aminareo. Izay vokatra maniry ho azy ao amin’ilay tany ihany no azonareo hanina.', 'fa jobily izany, ka ho masina aminareo. izay vokatra maniry ho azy ao amin’ilay tany ihany no azonareo hanina.'),
  ('6aadc724e999585618c3932a', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.338Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.338Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 25, 13, '“‘Samy hahazo ny lovanareo indray ianareo, amin’io taon-jobily io.', '“‘samy hahazo ny lovanareo indray ianareo, amin’io taon-jobily io.'),
  ('6aadc724e999585618c3932b', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.338Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.338Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 25, 14, 'Aza mifanambaka raha mivarotra na mividy zavatra amin’ny namanareo.', 'aza mifanambaka raha mivarotra na mividy zavatra amin’ny namanareo.'),
  ('6aadc724e999585618c3932c', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.338Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.338Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 25, 15, 'Arakaraka ny isan’ny taona aorian’ny Jobily no hividiananao tany amin’ny namanao, ary arakaraka ny isan’ny taona iakaran’ny vokatra eo amin’ilay tany no hivarotany aminao.', 'arakaraka ny isan’ny taona aorian’ny jobily no hividiananao tany amin’ny namanao, ary arakaraka ny isan’ny taona iakaran’ny vokatra eo amin’ilay tany no hivarotany aminao.'),
  ('6aadc724e999585618c3932d', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.338Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.338Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 25, 16, 'Raha mbola betsaka ny taona sisa tavela, dia azony ampiakarina ny vidin’ilay izy. Fa rehefa vitsy kosa ny taona sisa tavela, dia tokony hahenany ny vidiny, satria ny isan’ny fiakaran’ny vokatra no amidiny aminao.', 'raha mbola betsaka ny taona sisa tavela, dia azony ampiakarina ny vidin’ilay izy. fa rehefa vitsy kosa ny taona sisa tavela, dia tokony hahenany ny vidiny, satria ny isan’ny fiakaran’ny vokatra no amidiny aminao.'),
  ('6aadc724e999585618c3932e', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.338Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.338Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 25, 17, 'Tsy misy aminareo tokony hanambaka ny namany, ary matahora an’Andriamanitrareo, satria izaho no Jehovah Andriamanitrareo.', 'tsy misy aminareo tokony hanambaka ny namany, ary matahora an’andriamanitrareo, satria izaho no jehovah andriamanitrareo.'),
  ('6aadc724e999585618c3932f', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.338Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.338Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 25, 18, 'Hiadana sy hilamina ianareo ao amin’ilay tany, rehefa mankatò ny fitsipiko sy mampihatra ny didim-pitsarako.', 'hiadana sy hilamina ianareo ao amin’ilay tany, rehefa mankatò ny fitsipiko sy mampihatra ny didim-pitsarako.'),
  ('6aadc724e999585618c39330', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.338Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.338Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 25, 19, 'Hahavokatra ilay tany, dia hihinana ianareo ka ho voky, ary hiadana sy hilamina.', 'hahavokatra ilay tany, dia hihinana ianareo ka ho voky, ary hiadana sy hilamina.'),
  ('6aadc724e999585618c39331', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.338Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.338Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 25, 20, '“‘Mety hilaza anefa ianareo hoe: “Inona no hohaninay amin’ny taona fahafito raha tsy mahazo mamafy voa na manangom-bokatra izahay?”', '“‘mety hilaza anefa ianareo hoe: “inona no hohaninay amin’ny taona fahafito raha tsy mahazo mamafy voa na manangom-bokatra izahay?”'),
  ('6aadc724e999585618c39332', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.338Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.338Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 25, 21, 'Aza manahy fa handrotsaka fitahiana aminareo aho amin’ny taona fahenina, ka hanome vokatra ampy anareo telo taona ilay tany.', 'aza manahy fa handrotsaka fitahiana aminareo aho amin’ny taona fahenina, ka hanome vokatra ampy anareo telo taona ilay tany.'),
  ('6aadc724e999585618c39333', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.338Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.338Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 25, 22, 'Dia hamafy voa ianareo ny taona fahavalo, ka ny vokatra teo aloha no hohaninareo mandra-pahatongan’ny taona fahasivy. Hihinana an’izany ianareo, mandra-piakatry ny vokatra.', 'dia hamafy voa ianareo ny taona fahavalo, ka ny vokatra teo aloha no hohaninareo mandra-pahatongan’ny taona fahasivy. hihinana an’izany ianareo, mandra-piakatry ny vokatra.'),
  ('6aadc724e999585618c39334', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.338Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.338Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 25, 23, '“‘Tsy tokony hatao varo-maty ny tany, satria ahy ny tany fa mpivahiny sy mpiavy kosa ianareo amiko.', '“‘tsy tokony hatao varo-maty ny tany, satria ahy ny tany fa mpivahiny sy mpiavy kosa ianareo amiko.'),
  ('6aadc724e999585618c39335', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.338Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.338Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 25, 24, 'Tokony ho azon’ny tompony vidina indray ny tany efa namidiny, na aiza na aiza misy anareo ao amin’ilay tany ho lasanareo.', 'tokony ho azon’ny tompony vidina indray ny tany efa namidiny, na aiza na aiza misy anareo ao amin’ilay tany ho lasanareo.'),
  ('6aadc724e999585618c39336', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.338Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.338Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 25, 25, '“‘Raha lasa mahantra ny rahalahinao ka voatery nivarotra ny ampahany amin’ny taniny, dia ny havany akaiky izay afaka manavotra azy no hividy an’izay namidiny.', '“‘raha lasa mahantra ny rahalahinao ka voatery nivarotra ny ampahany amin’ny taniny, dia ny havany akaiky izay afaka manavotra azy no hividy an’izay namidiny.'),
  ('6aadc724e999585618c39337', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.338Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.338Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 25, 26, 'Raha tsy manana mpanavotra kosa izy nefa lasa manankarena ka mahazo vola hanavotana an’ilay tany,', 'raha tsy manana mpanavotra kosa izy nefa lasa manankarena ka mahazo vola hanavotana an’ilay tany,'),
  ('6aadc724e999585618c39338', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.338Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.338Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 25, 27, 'dia hanisa an’ireo taona nanomboka tamin’ny nivarotany azy izy, mba hahafantarany hoe ohatrinona no tokony ho vidin’ilay tany. Dia hampifanalany amin’ny vidiny namarotany azy izany, ary haloany amin’ilay olona namarotany azy ny elanelany. Dia afaka mahazo ny lovany indray izy.', 'dia hanisa an’ireo taona nanomboka tamin’ny nivarotany azy izy, mba hahafantarany hoe ohatrinona no tokony ho vidin’ilay tany. dia hampifanalany amin’ny vidiny namarotany azy izany, ary haloany amin’ilay olona namarotany azy ny elanelany. dia afaka mahazo ny lovany indray izy.'),
  ('6aadc724e999585618c39339', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.338Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.338Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 25, 28, '“‘Fa raha tsy mahita vola hividianana indray an’ilay tany izy, dia mbola ho an’ilay nividy azy ihany ilay tany mandra-pahatongan’ny taon-jobily. Ary haverina aminy izany rehefa tonga ny Jobily, ka ho azony indray ny lovany.', '“‘fa raha tsy mahita vola hividianana indray an’ilay tany izy, dia mbola ho an’ilay nividy azy ihany ilay tany mandra-pahatongan’ny taon-jobily. ary haverina aminy izany rehefa tonga ny jobily, ka ho azony indray ny lovany.'),
  ('6aadc724e999585618c3933a', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.338Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.338Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 25, 29, '“‘Raha misy olona mivarotra trano ao anaty tanàna misy manda, dia hanan-jo hanavotra an’izany foana izy mandra-pahatapitry ny herintaona, manomboka amin’ny fotoana naharaikitra an’ilay varotra. Haharitra herintaona katroka ny zony hanavotra an’izany.', '“‘raha misy olona mivarotra trano ao anaty tanàna misy manda, dia hanan-jo hanavotra an’izany foana izy mandra-pahatapitry ny herintaona, manomboka amin’ny fotoana naharaikitra an’ilay varotra. haharitra herintaona katroka ny zony hanavotra an’izany.'),
  ('6aadc724e999585618c3933b', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.338Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.338Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 25, 30, 'Fa raha tapitra ny herintaona, nefa tsy nisy nanavotra ilay trano ao anaty tanàna misy manda, dia ho fananan’ilay olona nividy sy ny taranany fara aman-dimby ilay trano. Ho lasany izany, fa tsy haverina amin’ny tompony intsony rehefa tonga ny Jobily.', 'fa raha tapitra ny herintaona, nefa tsy nisy nanavotra ilay trano ao anaty tanàna misy manda, dia ho fananan’ilay olona nividy sy ny taranany fara aman-dimby ilay trano. ho lasany izany, fa tsy haverina amin’ny tompony intsony rehefa tonga ny jobily.'),
  ('6aadc724e999585618c3933c', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.338Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.338Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 25, 31, 'Ny trano ao anaty tanàna kely tsy misy manda kosa, dia hoheverina ho anisan’ny sahan’ilay faritra. Hanan-jo hanavotra an’ilay izy foana ny tompony, ary haverina aminy izany rehefa tonga ny Jobily.', 'ny trano ao anaty tanàna kely tsy misy manda kosa, dia hoheverina ho anisan’ny sahan’ilay faritra. hanan-jo hanavotra an’ilay izy foana ny tompony, ary haverina aminy izany rehefa tonga ny jobily.'),
  ('6aadc724e999585618c3933d', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.338Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.338Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 25, 32, '“‘Ny tranon’ny Levita ao amin’ny tanànany kosa, dia ho azon’ny Levita avotana raha namidy, ary hanan-jo hanao an’izany foana izy ireo.', '“‘ny tranon’ny levita ao amin’ny tanànany kosa, dia ho azon’ny levita avotana raha namidy, ary hanan-jo hanao an’izany foana izy ireo.'),
  ('6aadc724e999585618c3933e', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.338Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.338Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 25, 33, 'Raha tsy nisy nanavotra anefa ilay lovan’ny Levita, dia haverina aminy ihany ilay trano namidy tao amin’ny tanànan’izy ireo, rehefa tonga ny Jobily. Ny trano ao amin’ny tanànan’ny Levita mantsy no lovan’izy ireo eo amin’ny Israelita.', 'raha tsy nisy nanavotra anefa ilay lovan’ny levita, dia haverina aminy ihany ilay trano namidy tao amin’ny tanànan’izy ireo, rehefa tonga ny jobily. ny trano ao amin’ny tanànan’ny levita mantsy no lovan’izy ireo eo amin’ny israelita.'),
  ('6aadc724e999585618c3933f', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.338Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.338Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 25, 34, 'Tsy azo amidy kosa ny kijana manodidina ny tanànan’izy ireo, satria fananan’izy ireo mandrakizay izany.', 'tsy azo amidy kosa ny kijana manodidina ny tanànan’izy ireo, satria fananan’izy ireo mandrakizay izany.'),
  ('6aadc724e999585618c39340', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.338Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.338Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 25, 35, '“‘Raha lasa mahantra ny rahalahinao miara-monina aminao ka tsy mahavelon-tena, dia ampio izy, hoatran’ny hanampianao ny mpivahiny sy ny mpiavy, mba hahita fivelomana eo aminao foana.', '“‘raha lasa mahantra ny rahalahinao miara-monina aminao ka tsy mahavelon-tena, dia ampio izy, hoatran’ny hanampianao ny mpivahiny sy ny mpiavy, mba hahita fivelomana eo aminao foana.'),
  ('6aadc724e999585618c39341', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.338Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.338Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 25, 36, 'Aza maka zanabola na maka tombony aminy. Matahora an’Andriamanitrao, dia hahita fivelomana eo aminao foana ny rahalahinao.', 'aza maka zanabola na maka tombony aminy. matahora an’andriamanitrao, dia hahita fivelomana eo aminao foana ny rahalahinao.'),
  ('6aadc724e999585618c39342', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.338Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.338Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 25, 37, 'Aza maka zanabola rehefa mampisambotra, ary aza mampisambotra sakafo mba hahazoana tombony.', 'aza maka zanabola rehefa mampisambotra, ary aza mampisambotra sakafo mba hahazoana tombony.'),
  ('6aadc724e999585618c39343', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.338Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.338Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 25, 38, 'Izaho no Jehovah Andriamanitrareo izay nitondra anareo nivoaka avy tany Ejipta, mba hanome anareo ny tany Kanana sy hampiseho aminareo fa Andriamanitrareo aho.', 'izaho no jehovah andriamanitrareo izay nitondra anareo nivoaka avy tany ejipta, mba hanome anareo ny tany kanana sy hampiseho aminareo fa andriamanitrareo aho.'),
  ('6aadc724e999585618c39344', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.338Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.338Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 25, 39, '“‘Aza terena hiasa hoatran’ny andevo ny rahalahinao izay miara-monina aminao, raha lasa mahantra ka voatery mivarotra ny tenany aminao.', '“‘aza terena hiasa hoatran’ny andevo ny rahalahinao izay miara-monina aminao, raha lasa mahantra ka voatery mivarotra ny tenany aminao.'),
  ('6aadc724e999585618c39345', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.338Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.338Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 25, 40, 'Ataovy toy ny mpikarama na toy ny mpiavy izy. Hiasa ao aminao izy mandra-pahatongan’ny taon-jobily.', 'ataovy toy ny mpikarama na toy ny mpiavy izy. hiasa ao aminao izy mandra-pahatongan’ny taon-jobily.'),
  ('6aadc724e999585618c39346', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.338Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.338Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 25, 41, 'Dia hiala ao aminao izy sy ny zanany, ka hiverina any amin’ny fianakaviany. Hiverina any amin’ny lovan’ny razambeny izy.', 'dia hiala ao aminao izy sy ny zanany, ka hiverina any amin’ny fianakaviany. hiverina any amin’ny lovan’ny razambeny izy.');
INSERT INTO "bible_verses" ("id", "created_date", "updated_date", "created_by_id", "created_by", "translation", "book", "bookOrder", "chapter", "verse", "text", "normalizedText") VALUES
  ('6aadc724e999585618c39347', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.338Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.338Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 25, 42, 'Mpanompoko nentiko nivoaka avy tany Ejipta mantsy izy ireo. Tsy tokony hivarotra ny tenany hoatran’ny fivarotana andevo izy ireo.', 'mpanompoko nentiko nivoaka avy tany ejipta mantsy izy ireo. tsy tokony hivarotra ny tenany hoatran’ny fivarotana andevo izy ireo.'),
  ('6aadc724e999585618c39348', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.338Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.338Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 25, 43, 'Aza mampijaly ny rahalahinao, fa matahora an’Andriamanitrao.', 'aza mampijaly ny rahalahinao, fa matahora an’andriamanitrao.'),
  ('6aadc724e999585618c39349', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.338Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.338Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 25, 44, 'Tokony ho any amin’ireo firenena manodidina no hakanareo mpanompolahy sy mpanompovavy ho anareo. Amin’ireny no azonareo ividianana mpanompolahy na mpanompovavy.', 'tokony ho any amin’ireo firenena manodidina no hakanareo mpanompolahy sy mpanompovavy ho anareo. amin’ireny no azonareo ividianana mpanompolahy na mpanompovavy.'),
  ('6aadc724e999585618c3934a', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.338Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.338Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 25, 45, 'Azonareo atao koa ny mividy mpanompo avy amin’ny zanaky ny mpiavy monina eo aminareo, sy avy amin’ny fianakaviana izay naterany tao amin’ny taninareo. Dia ho lasa fanananareo izy ireny.', 'azonareo atao koa ny mividy mpanompo avy amin’ny zanaky ny mpiavy monina eo aminareo, sy avy amin’ny fianakaviana izay naterany tao amin’ny taninareo. dia ho lasa fanananareo izy ireny.'),
  ('6aadc724e999585618c3934b', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.338Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.338Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 25, 46, 'Azonareo omena ho lovan’ny taranakareo izy ireny mba ho fananany mandrakizay. Azonareo atao mpiasa izy ireny, fa ny Israelita rahalahinareo kosa aza ampijalina.', 'azonareo omena ho lovan’ny taranakareo izy ireny mba ho fananany mandrakizay. azonareo atao mpiasa izy ireny, fa ny israelita rahalahinareo kosa aza ampijalina.'),
  ('6aadc724e999585618c3934c', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.338Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.338Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 25, 47, '“‘Fa raha lasa manankarena ny mpivahiny na ny mpiavy monina eo aminao, nefa ny rahalahinao izay miara-monina aminy lasa mahantra ka voatery mivarotra ny tenany amin’ilay mpivahiny na ilay mpiavy, na amin’ny mpianakavin’ilay mpivahiny,', '“‘fa raha lasa manankarena ny mpivahiny na ny mpiavy monina eo aminao, nefa ny rahalahinao izay miara-monina aminy lasa mahantra ka voatery mivarotra ny tenany amin’ilay mpivahiny na ilay mpiavy, na amin’ny mpianakavin’ilay mpivahiny,'),
  ('6aadc724e999585618c3934d', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.338Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.338Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 25, 48, 'dia ho azo avotana foana izy rehefa avy nivarotra ny tenany, ary zony izany. Mahazo mividy azy indray ny iray amin’ireo rahalahiny,', 'dia ho azo avotana foana izy rehefa avy nivarotra ny tenany, ary zony izany. mahazo mividy azy indray ny iray amin’ireo rahalahiny,'),
  ('6aadc724e999585618c3934e', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.338Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.338Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 25, 49, 'na ny dadatoany, na ny zanaky ny dadatoany, na izay havany akaiky anisan’ny fianakaviany. “‘Na raha lasa manankarena izy, dia azony atao ny manavotra ny tenany.', 'na ny dadatoany, na ny zanaky ny dadatoany, na izay havany akaiky anisan’ny fianakaviany. “‘na raha lasa manankarena izy, dia azony atao ny manavotra ny tenany.'),
  ('6aadc724e999585618c3934f', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.338Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.338Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 25, 50, 'Tokony hisainy miaraka amin’ilay olona nividy azy ny taona nanomboka tamin’ny taona nivarotany ny tenany ka hatramin’ny taon-jobily, dia ho arakaraka ny isan’izany taona izany ny vidiny namarotany ny tenany. Hotombanana arakaraka ny vola azon’ny mpikarama ny isan’ny andro iasany mandritra an’izany fotoana izany.', 'tokony hisainy miaraka amin’ilay olona nividy azy ny taona nanomboka tamin’ny taona nivarotany ny tenany ka hatramin’ny taon-jobily, dia ho arakaraka ny isan’izany taona izany ny vidiny namarotany ny tenany. hotombanana arakaraka ny vola azon’ny mpikarama ny isan’ny andro iasany mandritra an’izany fotoana izany.'),
  ('6aadc724e999585618c39350', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.338Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.338Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 25, 51, 'Raha mbola misy taona maro vao tonga ny Jobily, dia ho arakaraka ny isan’izany taona tavela izany ny vola haloany ho vidin’ny fanavotana azy.', 'raha mbola misy taona maro vao tonga ny jobily, dia ho arakaraka ny isan’izany taona tavela izany ny vola haloany ho vidin’ny fanavotana azy.'),
  ('6aadc724e999585618c39351', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.338Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.338Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 25, 52, 'Fa raha taona vitsivitsy sisa dia tonga ny taon-jobily, dia hanisa an’izany izy, ka ho arakaraka ny isan’izany taona tavela izany ny vola haloany ho vidin’ny fanavotana azy.', 'fa raha taona vitsivitsy sisa dia tonga ny taon-jobily, dia hanisa an’izany izy, ka ho arakaraka ny isan’izany taona tavela izany ny vola haloany ho vidin’ny fanavotana azy.'),
  ('6aadc724e999585618c39352', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.338Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.338Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 25, 53, 'Hanompo an’ilay olona toy ny mpikarama izy mandritra ny taona iasany. Ary ataovy azo antoka hoe tsy mampijaly azy ilay olona.', 'hanompo an’ilay olona toy ny mpikarama izy mandritra ny taona iasany. ary ataovy azo antoka hoe tsy mampijaly azy ilay olona.'),
  ('6aadc724e999585618c39353', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.338Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.338Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 25, 54, 'Fa raha tsy afaka manavotra ny tenany araka ireo fepetra ireo izy, dia hafahana ihany izy sy ny zanany amin’ny taon-jobily.', 'fa raha tsy afaka manavotra ny tenany araka ireo fepetra ireo izy, dia hafahana ihany izy sy ny zanany amin’ny taon-jobily.'),
  ('6aadc724e999585618c39354', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.338Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.338Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 25, 55, '“‘Mpanompoko mantsy ny Israelita. Mpanompoko nentiko nivoaka avy tany Ejipta izy ireo. Izaho no Jehovah Andriamanitrareo.', '“‘mpanompoko mantsy ny israelita. mpanompoko nentiko nivoaka avy tany ejipta izy ireo. izaho no jehovah andriamanitrareo.'),
  ('6aadc7242698a2ebccfb01c8', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.830Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.830Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 26, 46, 'Ireo no fitsipika sy didim-pitsarana ary lalàna nomen’i Jehovah ny Israelita tamin’ny alalan’i Mosesy, teo amin’ny Tendrombohitra Sinay.', 'ireo no fitsipika sy didim-pitsarana ary lalàna nomen’i jehovah ny israelita tamin’ny alalan’i mosesy, teo amin’ny tendrombohitra sinay.'),
  ('6aadc7242698a2ebccfb01c7', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.830Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.830Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 26, 45, 'Hitsinjo azy ireo aho, ka hotsaroako ny fifanekena nataoko tamin’ny razambeny, izay nentiko nivoaka avy tany Ejipta teo imason’ireo firenena, mba hampisehoako fa Andriamaniny aho. Izaho no Jehovah.’”', 'hitsinjo azy ireo aho, ka hotsaroako ny fifanekena nataoko tamin’ny razambeny, izay nentiko nivoaka avy tany ejipta teo imason’ireo firenena, mba hampisehoako fa andriamaniny aho. izaho no jehovah.’”'),
  ('6aadc7242698a2ebccfb01c6', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.830Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.830Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 26, 44, 'Na eo aza anefa izany rehetra izany, ary na mbola any amin’ny tanin’ny fahavalony aza izy ireo, dia tsy handa na hanary azy ireo tanteraka aho ka hoe handripaka azy. Mivadika amin’ny fifanekena nataoko taminy mantsy aho raha manao an’izany. Fa izaho no Jehovah Andriamaniny.', 'na eo aza anefa izany rehetra izany, ary na mbola any amin’ny tanin’ny fahavalony aza izy ireo, dia tsy handa na hanary azy ireo tanteraka aho ka hoe handripaka azy. mivadika amin’ny fifanekena nataoko taminy mantsy aho raha manao an’izany. fa izaho no jehovah andriamaniny.'),
  ('6aadc7242698a2ebccfb01c5', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.830Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.830Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 26, 43, 'Hilaozan’izy ireo ilay tany ka hanonitra ny sabatany sady tsy hisy mponina. Ary hizaka ny vokatry ny fahadisoany izy ireo satria tsy nampihatra ny didim-pitsarako, sady nankahala ny fitsipiko.', 'hilaozan’izy ireo ilay tany ka hanonitra ny sabatany sady tsy hisy mponina. ary hizaka ny vokatry ny fahadisoany izy ireo satria tsy nampihatra ny didim-pitsarako, sady nankahala ny fitsipiko.'),
  ('6aadc7242698a2ebccfb01c4', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.830Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.830Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 26, 42, 'Dia hotsaroako ny fifanekena nataoko tamin’i Jakoba, sy ilay fifanekena nataoko tamin’i Isaka, ary ilay fifanekena nataoko tamin’i Abrahama, ary hotsaroako ilay tany.', 'dia hotsaroako ny fifanekena nataoko tamin’i jakoba, sy ilay fifanekena nataoko tamin’i isaka, ary ilay fifanekena nataoko tamin’i abrahama, ary hotsaroako ilay tany.'),
  ('6aadc7242698a2ebccfb01c3', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.830Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.830Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 26, 41, 'Dia nanohitra azy ireo koa aho, ka nitondra azy tany amin’ny tanin’ny fahavalony. “‘Angamba mba hanetry tena ihany ny fony tsy voafora amin’izay, ka hanonitra ny fahadisoany izy ireo.', 'dia nanohitra azy ireo koa aho, ka nitondra azy tany amin’ny tanin’ny fahavalony. “‘angamba mba hanetry tena ihany ny fony tsy voafora amin’izay, ka hanonitra ny fahadisoany izy ireo.'),
  ('6aadc7242698a2ebccfb01c2', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.830Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.830Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 26, 40, 'Dia hiaiky ny fahadisoany izy ireo ary hiaiky fa diso ny razambeny sady nivadika. Hiaiky koa izy ireo hoe nivadika satria nanohitra ahy.', 'dia hiaiky ny fahadisoany izy ireo ary hiaiky fa diso ny razambeny sady nivadika. hiaiky koa izy ireo hoe nivadika satria nanohitra ahy.'),
  ('6aadc7242698a2ebccfb01c1', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.830Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.830Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 26, 39, 'Izay sisa aminareo dia ho lo any amin’ny tanin’ny fahavalonareo noho ny fahadisoanareo. Ho lo tsikelikely tokoa izy ireo noho ny fahadisoan’ny razambeny.', 'izay sisa aminareo dia ho lo any amin’ny tanin’ny fahavalonareo noho ny fahadisoanareo. ho lo tsikelikely tokoa izy ireo noho ny fahadisoan’ny razambeny.'),
  ('6aadc7242698a2ebccfb01c0', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.830Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.830Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 26, 38, 'Dia ho faty any amin’ireo firenena ianareo, ary ho ripaka any amin’ny tanin’ny fahavalonareo.', 'dia ho faty any amin’ireo firenena ianareo, ary ho ripaka any amin’ny tanin’ny fahavalonareo.'),
  ('6aadc7242698a2ebccfb01bf', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.830Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.830Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 26, 37, 'Dia ho voafingana sy hianjera eo ambonin’ny namany izy ireo ka ho toy ny olona mandositra sabatra, na dia tsy misy manenjika aza. Tsy ho voatohitrareo ny fahavalonareo.', 'dia ho voafingana sy hianjera eo ambonin’ny namany izy ireo ka ho toy ny olona mandositra sabatra, na dia tsy misy manenjika aza. tsy ho voatohitrareo ny fahavalonareo.'),
  ('6aadc7242698a2ebccfb01be', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.830Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.830Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 26, 36, '“‘Ary ny amin’ireo sisa tsy maty, dia hataoko kivy be ny fon’izy ireo, any amin’ny tanin’ny fahavalony. Koa hampandositra azy na dia feona ravinkazo entin’ny rivotra aza. Ary hitsoaka hoatran’ny mandositra sabatra izy, ka hianjera nefa tsy misy manenjika.', '“‘ary ny amin’ireo sisa tsy maty, dia hataoko kivy be ny fon’izy ireo, any amin’ny tanin’ny fahavalony. koa hampandositra azy na dia feona ravinkazo entin’ny rivotra aza. ary hitsoaka hoatran’ny mandositra sabatra izy, ka hianjera nefa tsy misy manenjika.'),
  ('6aadc7242698a2ebccfb01bd', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.830Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.830Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 26, 35, 'Hiala sasatra ilay tany amin’ny andro rehetra tsy hisian’ny mponina ao, satria tsy niala sasatra izy nandritra ny sabatanareo, tamin’ianareo nonina tao.', 'hiala sasatra ilay tany amin’ny andro rehetra tsy hisian’ny mponina ao, satria tsy niala sasatra izy nandritra ny sabatanareo, tamin’ianareo nonina tao.'),
  ('6aadc7242698a2ebccfb01bc', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.830Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.830Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 26, 34, '“‘Hanonitra ny sabatany ny tany amin’izay, mandritra ny andro rehetra tsy hisian’ny mponina ao, raha mbola any amin’ny tanin’ny fahavalonareo ianareo. Dia hiala sasatra ilay tany, satria honerany ny sabatany.', '“‘hanonitra ny sabatany ny tany amin’izay, mandritra ny andro rehetra tsy hisian’ny mponina ao, raha mbola any amin’ny tanin’ny fahavalonareo ianareo. dia hiala sasatra ilay tany, satria honerany ny sabatany.'),
  ('6aadc7242698a2ebccfb01bb', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.830Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.830Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 26, 33, 'Haparitako any amin’ireo firenena ianareo, ary hanatsoaka sabatra hanenjehana anareo aho. Dia tsy hisy mponina ny taninareo, ary ho rava ny tanànanareo.', 'haparitako any amin’ireo firenena ianareo, ary hanatsoaka sabatra hanenjehana anareo aho. dia tsy hisy mponina ny taninareo, ary ho rava ny tanànanareo.'),
  ('6aadc7242698a2ebccfb01ba', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.830Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.830Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 26, 32, 'Hataoko tsy misy mponina ny taninareo, ka ho gaga ny fahavalonareo izay honina ao rehefa mahita an’izany.', 'hataoko tsy misy mponina ny taninareo, ka ho gaga ny fahavalonareo izay honina ao rehefa mahita an’izany.'),
  ('6aadc7242698a2ebccfb01b9', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.830Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.830Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 26, 31, 'Dia hasiako amin’ny sabatra ny tanànanareo, sady horavako ny toerana masinareo, ary tsy hahafinaritra ahy ny hanitry ny fanatitrareo.', 'dia hasiako amin’ny sabatra ny tanànanareo, sady horavako ny toerana masinareo, ary tsy hahafinaritra ahy ny hanitry ny fanatitrareo.'),
  ('6aadc7242698a2ebccfb01b8', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.830Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.830Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 26, 30, 'Hopotehiko ny toerana avo masina eo aminareo, horavako ny fandoroana emboka manitra, ary hataoko mivangongo eo ambonin’ny fatin’ny sampinareo maharikoriko ny fatinareo. Ary ho tofoka aminareo aho ka hiala aminareo.', 'hopotehiko ny toerana avo masina eo aminareo, horavako ny fandoroana emboka manitra, ary hataoko mivangongo eo ambonin’ny fatin’ny sampinareo maharikoriko ny fatinareo. ary ho tofoka aminareo aho ka hiala aminareo.'),
  ('6aadc7242698a2ebccfb01b7', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.830Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.830Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 26, 29, 'Koa ho voatery hihinana ny nofon’ny zanakareo lahy sy ny zanakareo vavy ianareo.', 'koa ho voatery hihinana ny nofon’ny zanakareo lahy sy ny zanakareo vavy ianareo.'),
  ('6aadc7242698a2ebccfb01b6', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.830Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.830Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 26, 28, 'dia hanohitra anareo mafimafy kokoa aho. Ary izaho mihitsy no hanasazy anareo impito noho ny fahotanareo.', 'dia hanohitra anareo mafimafy kokoa aho. ary izaho mihitsy no hanasazy anareo impito noho ny fahotanareo.'),
  ('6aadc7242698a2ebccfb01b5', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.830Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.830Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 26, 27, '“‘Raha mbola tsy mihaino ahy ihany ianareo na eo aza izany fa mbola mikiry manohitra ahy,', '“‘raha mbola tsy mihaino ahy ihany ianareo na eo aza izany fa mbola mikiry manohitra ahy,'),
  ('6aadc7242698a2ebccfb01b4', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.830Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.830Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 26, 26, 'Rehefa potehiko ny fitehirizana mofonareo, dia vehivavy folo no ho indray afaka hanao ny mofonareo ao anaty lafaoro iray ihany. Ary holanjainy izany rehefa hozarainy aminareo. Dia hihinana ianareo nefa tsy ho voky.', 'rehefa potehiko ny fitehirizana mofonareo, dia vehivavy folo no ho indray afaka hanao ny mofonareo ao anaty lafaoro iray ihany. ary holanjainy izany rehefa hozarainy aminareo. dia hihinana ianareo nefa tsy ho voky.'),
  ('6aadc7242698a2ebccfb01b3', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.830Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.830Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 26, 25, 'Hasiako amin’ny sabatra ianareo ho valin’ny nivadihanareo tamin’ny fifanekena. Raha mandositra ao an-tanànanareo ianareo, dia handefasako aretina. Ary hataoko resin’ny fahavalo ianareo.', 'hasiako amin’ny sabatra ianareo ho valin’ny nivadihanareo tamin’ny fifanekena. raha mandositra ao an-tanànanareo ianareo, dia handefasako aretina. ary hataoko resin’ny fahavalo ianareo.'),
  ('6aadc7242698a2ebccfb01b2', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.830Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.830Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 26, 24, 'dia hanohitra anareo koa aho. Izaho mihitsy no hamely anareo impito, noho ny fahotanareo.', 'dia hanohitra anareo koa aho. izaho mihitsy no hamely anareo impito, noho ny fahotanareo.'),
  ('6aadc7242698a2ebccfb01b1', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.830Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.830Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 26, 23, '“‘Raha mbola tsy manaiky hahitsiko ihany ianareo na eo aza izany fa mbola mikiry manohitra ahy foana,', '“‘raha mbola tsy manaiky hahitsiko ihany ianareo na eo aza izany fa mbola mikiry manohitra ahy foana,'),
  ('6aadc7242698a2ebccfb01b0', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.830Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.830Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 26, 22, 'Handefasako bibidia eo aminareo, ka hataony ripaka ny zanakareo ary hataony fongana ny biby fiompinareo. Ary hihena ny isanareo, ka tsy hisy olona ny lalanareo.', 'handefasako bibidia eo aminareo, ka hataony ripaka ny zanakareo ary hataony fongana ny biby fiompinareo. ary hihena ny isanareo, ka tsy hisy olona ny lalanareo.'),
  ('6aadc7242698a2ebccfb01af', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.830Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.830Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 26, 21, '“‘Fa raha mbola manohitra ahy foana ianareo ka tsy mety mihaino ahy, dia hampiako avo fito heny ny kapoka homeko anareo noho ny fahotanareo.', '“‘fa raha mbola manohitra ahy foana ianareo ka tsy mety mihaino ahy, dia hampiako avo fito heny ny kapoka homeko anareo noho ny fahotanareo.'),
  ('6aadc7242698a2ebccfb01ae', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.830Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.830Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 26, 20, 'Ho lany hery fotsiny ianareo, satria tsy hahavokatra ny taninareo ary tsy hamoa ny hazo ao amin’ilay tany.', 'ho lany hery fotsiny ianareo, satria tsy hahavokatra ny taninareo ary tsy hamoa ny hazo ao amin’ilay tany.'),
  ('6aadc7242698a2ebccfb01ad', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.830Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.830Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 26, 19, 'Hataoko izay hahatonga anareo tsy hirehareha sy tsy ho mafy loha intsony. Ary hataoko toy ny vy ny lanitrareo, ary toy ny varahina ny taninareo.', 'hataoko izay hahatonga anareo tsy hirehareha sy tsy ho mafy loha intsony. ary hataoko toy ny vy ny lanitrareo, ary toy ny varahina ny taninareo.'),
  ('6aadc7242698a2ebccfb01ac', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.830Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.830Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 26, 18, '“‘Raha mbola tsy mihaino ahy ihany ianareo na eo aza izany, dia hampiako avo fito heny ny sazinareo noho ny fahotanareo.', '“‘raha mbola tsy mihaino ahy ihany ianareo na eo aza izany, dia hampiako avo fito heny ny sazinareo noho ny fahotanareo.'),
  ('6aadc7242698a2ebccfb01ab', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.830Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.830Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 26, 17, 'Hanohitra anareo aho, ka ho resin’ny fahavalonareo ianareo. Ary hampijaly anareo ireo mankahala anareo. Dia handositra ianareo, na dia tsy misy manenjika aza.', 'hanohitra anareo aho, ka ho resin’ny fahavalonareo ianareo. ary hampijaly anareo ireo mankahala anareo. dia handositra ianareo, na dia tsy misy manenjika aza.'),
  ('6aadc7242698a2ebccfb01aa', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.830Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.830Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 26, 16, 'dia izao no hataoko aminareo: Hosaziko ianareo ka ho kivy sy ho voan’ny tioberkilaozy ary hanavy be, dia hanjavozavo ny masonareo ary ho kely ny ainareo. Ho very maina fotsiny ny namafazanareo voa, satria ny fahavalonareo no hihinana ny vokatra avy amin’izany.', 'dia izao no hataoko aminareo: hosaziko ianareo ka ho kivy sy ho voan’ny tioberkilaozy ary hanavy be, dia hanjavozavo ny masonareo ary ho kely ny ainareo. ho very maina fotsiny ny namafazanareo voa, satria ny fahavalonareo no hihinana ny vokatra avy amin’izany.'),
  ('6aadc7242698a2ebccfb01a9', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.830Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.830Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 26, 15, 'ary raha mandika ny fitsipiko sy mankahala ny didim-pitsarako ianareo ka tsy mankatò ny didiko rehetra, ary tsy hajainareo ny fifanekena nataoko,', 'ary raha mandika ny fitsipiko sy mankahala ny didim-pitsarako ianareo ka tsy mankatò ny didiko rehetra, ary tsy hajainareo ny fifanekena nataoko,'),
  ('6aadc7242698a2ebccfb01a8', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.830Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.830Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 26, 14, '“‘Fa raha tsy mihaino ahy kosa ianareo na tsy mankatò an’ireo didy rehetra ireo,', '“‘fa raha tsy mihaino ahy kosa ianareo na tsy mankatò an’ireo didy rehetra ireo,'),
  ('6aadc7242698a2ebccfb01a7', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.830Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.830Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 26, 13, 'Izaho no Jehovah Andriamanitrareo, izay nitondra anareo nivoaka avy tany Ejipta, mba tsy ho andevo intsony ianareo. Ary notapahiko ny baran’ny zioganareo, ka nataoko nitraka tsara ianareo rehefa nandeha.', 'izaho no jehovah andriamanitrareo, izay nitondra anareo nivoaka avy tany ejipta, mba tsy ho andevo intsony ianareo. ary notapahiko ny baran’ny zioganareo, ka nataoko nitraka tsara ianareo rehefa nandeha.'),
  ('6aadc7242698a2ebccfb01a6', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.830Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.830Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 26, 12, 'Ho eo aminareo aho ka ho Andriamanitrareo, ary ianareo ho vahoakako.', 'ho eo aminareo aho ka ho andriamanitrareo, ary ianareo ho vahoakako.'),
  ('6aadc7242698a2ebccfb01a5', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.830Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.830Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 26, 11, 'Dia hataoko eo aminareo ny tranolaiko, ary tsy hanary anareo aho.', 'dia hataoko eo aminareo ny tranolaiko, ary tsy hanary anareo aho.'),
  ('6aadc7242698a2ebccfb01a4', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.830Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.830Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 26, 10, 'Mbola tsy laninareo akory ny vokatra tamin’ny taon-dasa, dia efa tsy maintsy hesorinareo izany mba hisy toerana ho an’ny vaovao.', 'mbola tsy laninareo akory ny vokatra tamin’ny taon-dasa, dia efa tsy maintsy hesorinareo izany mba hisy toerana ho an’ny vaovao.'),
  ('6aadc7242698a2ebccfb01a3', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.830Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.830Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 26, 9, '“‘Hitahy anareo aho, ka hataoko manan-taranaka sy ho maro be ianareo, ary hohajaiko ny fifanekena nataoko taminareo.', '“‘hitahy anareo aho, ka hataoko manan-taranaka sy ho maro be ianareo, ary hohajaiko ny fifanekena nataoko taminareo.'),
  ('6aadc7242698a2ebccfb01a2', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.830Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.830Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 26, 8, 'Ny 5 aminareo hanenjika 100, ary ny 100 hanenjika 10 000, ary hovonoinareo amin’ny sabatra ny fahavalonareo.', 'ny 5 aminareo hanenjika 100, ary ny 100 hanenjika 10 000, ary hovonoinareo amin’ny sabatra ny fahavalonareo.'),
  ('6aadc7242698a2ebccfb01a1', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.830Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.830Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 26, 7, 'Hanenjika ny fahavalonareo ianareo, ary hovonoinareo amin’ny sabatra ireny.', 'hanenjika ny fahavalonareo ianareo, ary hovonoinareo amin’ny sabatra ireny.'),
  ('6aadc7242698a2ebccfb01a0', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.830Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.830Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 26, 6, 'Hataoko manjaka ao amin’ilay tany ny filaminana, ka tsy hisy hampatahotra anareo rehefa matory ianareo. Hesoriko tanteraka ao amin’ilay tany ny bibidia masiaka, ary tsy hisy mpanafika hamely ny taninareo amin’ny sabatra.', 'hataoko manjaka ao amin’ilay tany ny filaminana, ka tsy hisy hampatahotra anareo rehefa matory ianareo. hesoriko tanteraka ao amin’ilay tany ny bibidia masiaka, ary tsy hisy mpanafika hamely ny taninareo amin’ny sabatra.'),
  ('6aadc7242698a2ebccfb019f', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.830Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.830Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 26, 5, 'Ny fotoam-piasana eny am-pamoloana ho tratran’ny fiotazam-boaloboka, ary ny fiotazam-boaloboka ho tratran’ny famafazam-boa. Hihinana mofo ianareo ka ho voky, ary hiadana sy hilamina ao amin’ny taninareo.', 'ny fotoam-piasana eny am-pamoloana ho tratran’ny fiotazam-boaloboka, ary ny fiotazam-boaloboka ho tratran’ny famafazam-boa. hihinana mofo ianareo ka ho voky, ary hiadana sy hilamina ao amin’ny taninareo.'),
  ('6aadc7242698a2ebccfb019e', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.830Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.830Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 26, 4, 'dia homeko ranonorana amin’ny fotoanany, ka hahavokatra ny tany ary hamoa ny hazo eny an-tsaha.', 'dia homeko ranonorana amin’ny fotoanany, ka hahavokatra ny tany ary hamoa ny hazo eny an-tsaha.'),
  ('6aadc7242698a2ebccfb019d', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.830Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.830Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 26, 3, '“‘Raha manaraka ny fitsipiko sy mankatò foana ny didiko ianareo ka manatanteraka an’izany,', '“‘raha manaraka ny fitsipiko sy mankatò foana ny didiko ianareo ka manatanteraka an’izany,'),
  ('6aadc7242698a2ebccfb019c', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.830Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.830Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 26, 2, 'Tandremo ny sabatako, ary hajao ny toerako masina. Izaho no Jehovah.', 'tandremo ny sabatako, ary hajao ny toerako masina. izaho no jehovah.'),
  ('6aadc7242698a2ebccfb019b', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.830Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:04.830Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 26, 1, '“‘Aza manao andriamanitra tsy misy dikany, na sary sokitra na tsangambato masina ho anareo. Aza asiana vato voasokitra ao amin’ny taninareo mba hiankohofanareo aminy. Fa izaho no Jehovah Andriamanitrareo.', '“‘aza manao andriamanitra tsy misy dikany, na sary sokitra na tsangambato masina ho anareo. aza asiana vato voasokitra ao amin’ny taninareo mba hiankohofanareo aminy. fa izaho no jehovah andriamanitrareo.'),
  ('6aadc725b458a86a3e20157b', '2026-09-18T23:20:05.509Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:05.509Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 27, 34, 'Ireo no didy nomen’i Jehovah an’i Mosesy ho an’ny Israelita, teo amin’ny Tendrombohitra Sinay.', 'ireo no didy nomen’i jehovah an’i mosesy ho an’ny israelita, teo amin’ny tendrombohitra sinay.'),
  ('6aadc725b458a86a3e20157a', '2026-09-18T23:20:05.509Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:05.509Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 27, 33, 'Tsy tokony hojereny na tsara na ratsy ilay biby, ary tsy tokony hatakalony. Raha tadiaviny hatakalo ihany anefa ilay izy, dia ho lasa zava-masina ilay biby sy ilay takalony. Tsy azo avotana izany.’”', 'tsy tokony hojereny na tsara na ratsy ilay biby, ary tsy tokony hatakalony. raha tadiaviny hatakalo ihany anefa ilay izy, dia ho lasa zava-masina ilay biby sy ilay takalony. tsy azo avotana izany.’”'),
  ('6aadc725b458a86a3e201579', '2026-09-18T23:20:05.509Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:05.509Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 27, 32, 'Ary amin’ny ampahafolon’ny biby fiompy, na omby izany na ondry na osy, izay mandalo eo ambany tehin’ny mpiandry, dia ny biby fahafolo no tokony ho zava-masina ho an’i Jehovah.', 'ary amin’ny ampahafolon’ny biby fiompy, na omby izany na ondry na osy, izay mandalo eo ambany tehin’ny mpiandry, dia ny biby fahafolo no tokony ho zava-masina ho an’i jehovah.'),
  ('6aadc725b458a86a3e201578', '2026-09-18T23:20:05.509Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:05.509Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 27, 31, 'Raha sendra misy olona te hanavotra an’ilay ampahafolony, dia hanome an’izay tokony ho vidiny izy sady mbola hampiany ampahadiminy.', 'raha sendra misy olona te hanavotra an’ilay ampahafolony, dia hanome an’izay tokony ho vidiny izy sady mbola hampiany ampahadiminy.'),
  ('6aadc725b458a86a3e201577', '2026-09-18T23:20:05.509Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:05.509Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 27, 30, '“‘An’i Jehovah ny ampahafolony rehetra avy amin’ny tany, na avy amin’ny vokatry ny tany izany na avy amin’ny voan’ny hazo. Zava-masina ho an’i Jehovah izany.', '“‘an’i jehovah ny ampahafolony rehetra avy amin’ny tany, na avy amin’ny vokatry ny tany izany na avy amin’ny voan’ny hazo. zava-masina ho an’i jehovah izany.'),
  ('6aadc725b458a86a3e201576', '2026-09-18T23:20:05.509Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:05.509Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 27, 29, 'Tsy azo avotana koa ny olona efa voaheloka izay natokana haringana. Tsy maintsy vonoina ho faty izy.', 'tsy azo avotana koa ny olona efa voaheloka izay natokana haringana. tsy maintsy vonoina ho faty izy.'),
  ('6aadc725b458a86a3e201575', '2026-09-18T23:20:05.509Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:05.509Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 27, 28, '“‘Tsy azo amidy na avotana ny zavatra voatokana, izany hoe izay zavatra natokan’ny olona avy amin’ny fananany ka natokany tsy misy fepetra ho an’i Jehovah, na olona izany na biby na tany. Zavatra masina indrindra ho an’i Jehovah ny zava-drehetra voatokana.', '“‘tsy azo amidy na avotana ny zavatra voatokana, izany hoe izay zavatra natokan’ny olona avy amin’ny fananany ka natokany tsy misy fepetra ho an’i jehovah, na olona izany na biby na tany. zavatra masina indrindra ho an’i jehovah ny zava-drehetra voatokana.'),
  ('6aadc725b458a86a3e201574', '2026-09-18T23:20:05.509Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:05.509Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 27, 27, 'Raha biby maloto ilay izy ka manavotra azy araka ny vidiny anombanana azy ilay olona, dia hanome ny vidiny izy sady mbola hampiany ampahadiminy. Fa hamidy araka izay vidiny anombanana azy kosa ilay izy, raha tsy avotana.', 'raha biby maloto ilay izy ka manavotra azy araka ny vidiny anombanana azy ilay olona, dia hanome ny vidiny izy sady mbola hampiany ampahadiminy. fa hamidy araka izay vidiny anombanana azy kosa ilay izy, raha tsy avotana.'),
  ('6aadc725b458a86a3e201573', '2026-09-18T23:20:05.509Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:05.509Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 27, 26, '“‘Tsy tokony hisy hanamasina anefa ny voalohan-teraka amin’ny biby, satria voalohan-teraka ho an’i Jehovah izany. Efa an’i Jehovah izany, na omby na ondry na osy.', '“‘tsy tokony hisy hanamasina anefa ny voalohan-teraka amin’ny biby, satria voalohan-teraka ho an’i jehovah izany. efa an’i jehovah izany, na omby na ondry na osy.'),
  ('6aadc725b458a86a3e201572', '2026-09-18T23:20:05.509Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:05.509Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 27, 25, '“‘Hotombanana araka ny sekely fampiasa ao amin’ny toerana masina ny vidin-javatra rehetra. Ho 20 gera ny iray sekely.', '“‘hotombanana araka ny sekely fampiasa ao amin’ny toerana masina ny vidin-javatra rehetra. ho 20 gera ny iray sekely.'),
  ('6aadc725b458a86a3e201571', '2026-09-18T23:20:05.509Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:05.509Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 27, 24, 'Hiverina amin’ilay nividianany azy, izany hoe amin’ny tompony, ilay tany rehefa tonga ny taon-jobily.', 'hiverina amin’ilay nividianany azy, izany hoe amin’ny tompony, ilay tany rehefa tonga ny taon-jobily.'),
  ('6aadc725b458a86a3e201570', '2026-09-18T23:20:05.509Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:05.509Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 27, 23, 'dia hanao kajy ny mpisorona hahitana hoe ohatrinona no tokony ho vidin’ilay tany mandra-pahatongan’ny taon-jobily. Ary homen’ilay olona amin’iny andro iny ihany ny vidiny nanombanana an’ilay tany. Zava-masina ho an’i Jehovah izany.', 'dia hanao kajy ny mpisorona hahitana hoe ohatrinona no tokony ho vidin’ilay tany mandra-pahatongan’ny taon-jobily. ary homen’ilay olona amin’iny andro iny ihany ny vidiny nanombanana an’ilay tany. zava-masina ho an’i jehovah izany.'),
  ('6aadc725b458a86a3e20156f', '2026-09-18T23:20:05.509Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:05.509Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 27, 22, '“‘Raha hamasinin’ny olona iray ho an’i Jehovah ny tany novidiny, izay tsy anisan’ny lovany,', '“‘raha hamasinin’ny olona iray ho an’i jehovah ny tany novidiny, izay tsy anisan’ny lovany,'),
  ('6aadc725b458a86a3e20156e', '2026-09-18T23:20:05.509Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:05.509Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 27, 21, 'Rehefa tonga ny Jobily, dia tsy an’ilay olona nividy azy intsony ilay tany fa ho lasa zava-masina ho an’i Jehovah satria voatokana ho azy. Ho lasa fananan’ny mpisorona ilay tany.', 'rehefa tonga ny jobily, dia tsy an’ilay olona nividy azy intsony ilay tany fa ho lasa zava-masina ho an’i jehovah satria voatokana ho azy. ho lasa fananan’ny mpisorona ilay tany.'),
  ('6aadc725b458a86a3e20156d', '2026-09-18T23:20:05.509Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:05.509Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 27, 20, 'Fa raha tsy havotany kosa ilay tany ary efa namidy tamin’olona, dia tsy ho azo avotana intsony.', 'fa raha tsy havotany kosa ilay tany ary efa namidy tamin’olona, dia tsy ho azo avotana intsony.'),
  ('6aadc725b458a86a3e20156c', '2026-09-18T23:20:05.509Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:05.509Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 27, 19, 'Fa raha sendra hoe havotan’ilay nanamasina azy ilay tany, dia hanome ny vidiny nanombanana azy izy sady mbola hampiany ampahadiminy, ka ho azy ihany ilay tany.', 'fa raha sendra hoe havotan’ilay nanamasina azy ilay tany, dia hanome ny vidiny nanombanana azy izy sady mbola hampiany ampahadiminy, ka ho azy ihany ilay tany.'),
  ('6aadc725b458a86a3e20156b', '2026-09-18T23:20:05.509Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:05.509Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 27, 18, 'Fa raha hamasininy aorian’ny Jobily kosa ilay taniny, dia hanao kajy ny mpisorona hamantarana ny vidin’ilay tany. Ho arakaraka ny taona tavela mandra-pahatongan’ny taon-jobily manaraka ny vidiny. Dia hahenany ny vidiny nanombanana an’ilay tany.', 'fa raha hamasininy aorian’ny jobily kosa ilay taniny, dia hanao kajy ny mpisorona hamantarana ny vidin’ilay tany. ho arakaraka ny taona tavela mandra-pahatongan’ny taon-jobily manaraka ny vidiny. dia hahenany ny vidiny nanombanana an’ilay tany.'),
  ('6aadc725b458a86a3e20156a', '2026-09-18T23:20:05.509Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:05.509Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 27, 17, 'Raha hamasininy manomboka amin’ny taon-jobily ny taniny, dia ho araka izay vidiny anombanana azy ny vidiny.', 'raha hamasininy manomboka amin’ny taon-jobily ny taniny, dia ho araka izay vidiny anombanana azy ny vidiny.'),
  ('6aadc725b458a86a3e201569', '2026-09-18T23:20:05.509Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:05.509Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 27, 16, '“‘Raha misy olona manamasina ny ampahany amin’ny taniny ho an’i Jehovah, dia hotombanana arakaraka ny habetsahan’ny voa ilaina afafy eo amin’ilay tany ny vidiny: Ho volafotsy 50 sekely ny tany ampy hamafazana vary orza eran’ny homera.', '“‘raha misy olona manamasina ny ampahany amin’ny taniny ho an’i jehovah, dia hotombanana arakaraka ny habetsahan’ny voa ilaina afafy eo amin’ilay tany ny vidiny: ho volafotsy 50 sekely ny tany ampy hamafazana vary orza eran’ny homera.'),
  ('6aadc725b458a86a3e201568', '2026-09-18T23:20:05.509Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:05.509Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 27, 15, 'Fa raha te hanavotra an’ilay tranony ilay nanamasina azy, dia hanome ny vidiny nanombanana azy izy sady mbola hampiany ampahadiminy, ka ho lasany ilay trano.', 'fa raha te hanavotra an’ilay tranony ilay nanamasina azy, dia hanome ny vidiny nanombanana azy izy sady mbola hampiany ampahadiminy, ka ho lasany ilay trano.'),
  ('6aadc725b458a86a3e201567', '2026-09-18T23:20:05.509Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:05.509Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 27, 14, '“‘Raha misy olona manamasina ny tranony ho zava-masina ho an’i Jehovah, dia hanombana ny vidin’ilay trano ny mpisorona, na tsara ilay izy na ratsy. Ary araka izay vidiny anombanan’ny mpisorona azy no ho vidiny.', '“‘raha misy olona manamasina ny tranony ho zava-masina ho an’i jehovah, dia hanombana ny vidin’ilay trano ny mpisorona, na tsara ilay izy na ratsy. ary araka izay vidiny anombanan’ny mpisorona azy no ho vidiny.'),
  ('6aadc725b458a86a3e201566', '2026-09-18T23:20:05.509Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:05.509Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 27, 13, 'Raha sendra tian’ilay olona havotana anefa ilay biby, dia hanome ny vidiny nanombanana azy izy sady mbola hampiany ampahadiminy.', 'raha sendra tian’ilay olona havotana anefa ilay biby, dia hanome ny vidiny nanombanana azy izy sady mbola hampiany ampahadiminy.'),
  ('6aadc725b458a86a3e201565', '2026-09-18T23:20:05.509Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:05.509Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 27, 12, 'Ary hanombana ny vidiny ilay mpisorona, na tsara ilay biby na ratsy, ka izay vidiny anombanany azy no ho vidiny.', 'ary hanombana ny vidiny ilay mpisorona, na tsara ilay biby na ratsy, ka izay vidiny anombanany azy no ho vidiny.'),
  ('6aadc725b458a86a3e201564', '2026-09-18T23:20:05.509Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:05.509Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 27, 11, 'Raha biby maloto tsy azo atao fanatitra ho an’i Jehovah kosa ilay izy, dia hajorony eo anatrehan’ny mpisorona.', 'raha biby maloto tsy azo atao fanatitra ho an’i jehovah kosa ilay izy, dia hajorony eo anatrehan’ny mpisorona.'),
  ('6aadc725b458a86a3e201563', '2026-09-18T23:20:05.509Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:05.509Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 27, 10, 'Tsy azony soloana ilay izy, ary tsy azony atakalo tsara ny ratsy, na atakalo ratsy ny tsara. Raha atakalony biby hafa anefa ilay biby, dia ho lasa masina ilay biby sy ilay takalony.', 'tsy azony soloana ilay izy, ary tsy azony atakalo tsara ny ratsy, na atakalo ratsy ny tsara. raha atakalony biby hafa anefa ilay biby, dia ho lasa masina ilay biby sy ilay takalony.'),
  ('6aadc725b458a86a3e201562', '2026-09-18T23:20:05.509Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:05.509Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 27, 9, '“‘Raha mivoady izy fa hanome biby azo atao fanatitra ho an’i Jehovah, dia ho lasa zava-masina daholo izay hatolony ho an’i Jehovah.', '“‘raha mivoady izy fa hanome biby azo atao fanatitra ho an’i jehovah, dia ho lasa zava-masina daholo izay hatolony ho an’i jehovah.'),
  ('6aadc725b458a86a3e201561', '2026-09-18T23:20:05.509Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:05.509Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 27, 8, 'Fa raha mahantra loatra ilay mivoady ka tsy mahaloa an’izay vidiny anombanana an’ilay olona, dia hijoro eo anatrehan’ny mpisorona ilay olona, ka ny mpisorona no hanombana ny vidiny. Araka izay mety ho takatry ny volan’ilay mivoady no hanombanan’ilay mpisorona azy.', 'fa raha mahantra loatra ilay mivoady ka tsy mahaloa an’izay vidiny anombanana an’ilay olona, dia hijoro eo anatrehan’ny mpisorona ilay olona, ka ny mpisorona no hanombana ny vidiny. araka izay mety ho takatry ny volan’ilay mivoady no hanombanan’ilay mpisorona azy.'),
  ('6aadc725b458a86a3e201560', '2026-09-18T23:20:05.509Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:05.509Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 27, 7, '“‘Raha 60 taona no ho miakatra kosa ilay olona, dia ho 15 sekely no vidiny anombanana ny lehilahy, ary ho 10 sekely ny vehivavy.', '“‘raha 60 taona no ho miakatra kosa ilay olona, dia ho 15 sekely no vidiny anombanana ny lehilahy, ary ho 10 sekely ny vehivavy.'),
  ('6aadc725b458a86a3e20155f', '2026-09-18T23:20:05.509Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:05.509Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 27, 6, 'Raha zaza iray volana ka hatramin’ny dimy taona ilay izy, dia ho volafotsy dimy sekely no vidiny anombanana azy raha lahy, fa ho volafotsy telo sekely kosa raha vavy.', 'raha zaza iray volana ka hatramin’ny dimy taona ilay izy, dia ho volafotsy dimy sekely no vidiny anombanana azy raha lahy, fa ho volafotsy telo sekely kosa raha vavy.'),
  ('6aadc725b458a86a3e20155e', '2026-09-18T23:20:05.509Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:05.509Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 27, 5, 'Raha 5 taona ka hatramin’ny 20 taona ilay olona, dia ho 20 sekely no vidiny anombanana azy raha lehilahy izy, fa ho 10 sekely kosa raha vehivavy.', 'raha 5 taona ka hatramin’ny 20 taona ilay olona, dia ho 20 sekely no vidiny anombanana azy raha lehilahy izy, fa ho 10 sekely kosa raha vehivavy.'),
  ('6aadc725b458a86a3e20155d', '2026-09-18T23:20:05.509Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:05.509Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 27, 4, 'fa ho 30 sekely kosa raha vehivavy izy.', 'fa ho 30 sekely kosa raha vehivavy izy.'),
  ('6aadc725b458a86a3e20155c', '2026-09-18T23:20:05.509Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:05.509Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 27, 3, 'dia ho volafotsy 50 sekely, araka ny sekely fampiasa ao amin’ny toerana masina, no vidiny anombanana azy raha lehilahy 20 taona ka hatramin’ny 60 taona ilay olona,', 'dia ho volafotsy 50 sekely, araka ny sekely fampiasa ao amin’ny toerana masina, no vidiny anombanana azy raha lehilahy 20 taona ka hatramin’ny 60 taona ilay olona,'),
  ('6aadc725b458a86a3e20155b', '2026-09-18T23:20:05.509Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:05.509Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Levitikosy', 3, 27, 2, '“Ilazao ny Israelita hoe: ‘Raha misy manao voady manokana hoe hatolony ho an’i Jehovah ny vola tokony ho vidin’ny olona iray,', '“ilazao ny israelita hoe: ‘raha misy manao voady manokana hoe hatolony ho an’i jehovah ny vola tokony ho vidin’ny olona iray,'),
