  ('6aadc727e909470b8774e0b0', '2026-09-18T23:20:07.230Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:07.230Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 2, 2, '“Rehefa mitoby ny Israelita, dia tokony hitoby ao amin’ny fizarana anendrena azy avy izy ireo, ary tokony ho eo akaikin’ny famantarana ny fianakaviambeny ny tsirairay. Tokony hitoby manodidina ny tranolay fihaonana izy ireo, sady hanatrika azy io.', '“rehefa mitoby ny israelita, dia tokony hitoby ao amin’ny fizarana anendrena azy avy izy ireo, ary tokony ho eo akaikin’ny famantarana ny fianakaviambeny ny tsirairay. tokony hitoby manodidina ny tranolay fihaonana izy ireo, sady hanatrika azy io.'),
  ('6aadc727e909470b8774e0af', '2026-09-18T23:20:07.230Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:07.230Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 2, 1, 'Ary hoy i Jehovah tamin’i Mosesy sy Arona:', 'ary hoy i jehovah tamin’i mosesy sy arona:'),
  ('6aadc727e909470b8774e0d0', '2026-09-18T23:20:07.231Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:07.231Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 2, 34, 'Dia nanao araka ny didy rehetra nomen’i Jehovah an’i Mosesy ny Israelita. Izany no nataon’izy ireo rehefa nitoby, araka ny fizarana nisy azy avy. Izany koa no nataony rehefa nifindra lasy, araka ny fianakaviany avy, sy arakaraka ny fianakaviambeny avy.', 'dia nanao araka ny didy rehetra nomen’i jehovah an’i mosesy ny israelita. izany no nataon’izy ireo rehefa nitoby, araka ny fizarana nisy azy avy. izany koa no nataony rehefa nifindra lasy, araka ny fianakaviany avy, sy arakaraka ny fianakaviambeny avy.'),
