  ('6aadc728d5f81ea6cc3345f5', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.399Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.399Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 3, 21, 'Avy tamin’i Gersona ny fianakavian’ny Libnita sy ny fianakavian’ny Simeita. Ireo no fianakavian’ny Gersonita.', 'avy tamin’i gersona ny fianakavian’ny libnita sy ny fianakavian’ny simeita. ireo no fianakavian’ny gersonita.'),
  ('6aadc728d5f81ea6cc3345f4', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.399Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.399Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 3, 20, 'Ny zanakalahin’i Merary, araka ny fianakaviany avy, dia i Maly sy Mosy. Ireo no fianakavian’ny Levita, araka ny fianakaviambeny.', 'ny zanakalahin’i merary, araka ny fianakaviany avy, dia i maly sy mosy. ireo no fianakavian’ny levita, araka ny fianakaviambeny.'),
  ('6aadc728d5f81ea6cc3345f3', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.399Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.399Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 3, 19, 'Ny zanakalahin’i Kehata, araka ny fianakaviany avy, dia i Amrama, Jizara, Hebrona, ary Oziela.', 'ny zanakalahin’i kehata, araka ny fianakaviany avy, dia i amrama, jizara, hebrona, ary oziela.'),
  ('6aadc728d5f81ea6cc3345f2', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.399Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.399Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 3, 18, 'Ireto kosa no anaran’ny zanakalahin’i Gersona, araka ny fianakaviany avy: Libny sy Simey.', 'ireto kosa no anaran’ny zanakalahin’i gersona, araka ny fianakaviany avy: libny sy simey.'),
  ('6aadc728d5f81ea6cc3345f1', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.399Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.399Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 3, 17, 'Ireto avy ny anaran’ny zanakalahin’i Levy: Gersona sy Kehata ary Merary.', 'ireto avy ny anaran’ny zanakalahin’i levy: gersona sy kehata ary merary.'),
  ('6aadc728d5f81ea6cc3345f0', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.399Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.399Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 3, 16, 'Dia nosoratan’i Mosesy ny anaran’izy ireo, araka izay nandidian’i Jehovah azy.', 'dia nosoratan’i mosesy ny anaran’izy ireo, araka izay nandidian’i jehovah azy.'),
  ('6aadc728d5f81ea6cc3345ef', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.399Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.399Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 3, 15, '“Soraty ny anaran’ireo zanakalahin’i Levy, araka ny fianakaviambeny sy araka ny fianakaviany. Soraty ny anaran’izay lahy rehetra iray volana no ho miakatra.”', '“soraty ny anaran’ireo zanakalahin’i levy, araka ny fianakaviambeny sy araka ny fianakaviany. soraty ny anaran’izay lahy rehetra iray volana no ho miakatra.”'),
  ('6aadc728d5f81ea6cc3345ee', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.399Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.399Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 3, 14, 'Hoy ihany i Jehovah tamin’i Mosesy tany an-tany efitr’i Sinay:', 'hoy ihany i jehovah tamin’i mosesy tany an-tany efitr’i sinay:'),
  ('6aadc728d5f81ea6cc3345ed', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.399Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.399Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 3, 13, 'fa ahy ny lahimatoa rehetra. Tamin’ilay andro namonoako ny lahimatoa rehetra tany Ejipta, dia nohamasiniko ho ahy izay lahy teraka voalohany rehetra teo amin’ny Israely, na olona na biby. Dia ho ahy ireny. Izaho no Jehovah.”', 'fa ahy ny lahimatoa rehetra. tamin’ilay andro namonoako ny lahimatoa rehetra tany ejipta, dia nohamasiniko ho ahy izay lahy teraka voalohany rehetra teo amin’ny israely, na olona na biby. dia ho ahy ireny. izaho no jehovah.”'),
  ('6aadc728d5f81ea6cc3345ec', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.399Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.399Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 3, 12, '“Alaiko avy amin’ny Israelita ny Levita, mba ho solon’ny lahimatoa rehetra eo amin’ny Israelita. Dia ho ahy ny Levita,', '“alaiko avy amin’ny israelita ny levita, mba ho solon’ny lahimatoa rehetra eo amin’ny israelita. dia ho ahy ny levita,'),
  ('6aadc728d5f81ea6cc3345eb', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.399Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.399Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 3, 11, 'Hoy koa i Jehovah tamin’i Mosesy:', 'hoy koa i jehovah tamin’i mosesy:'),
  ('6aadc728d5f81ea6cc3345ea', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.399Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.399Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 3, 10, 'Ary tendreo hanao ny asan’ny mpisorona i Arona sy ny zanany lahy. Hovonoina ho faty izay olona tsy nahazo alalana nefa manakaiky ny toerana masina.”', 'ary tendreo hanao ny asan’ny mpisorona i arona sy ny zanany lahy. hovonoina ho faty izay olona tsy nahazo alalana nefa manakaiky ny toerana masina.”'),
  ('6aadc728d5f81ea6cc3345e9', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.399Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.399Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 3, 9, 'Omeo an’i Arona sy ny zanany lahy ny Levita. Fanomezana izy ireo ary omen’ny Israelita an’i Arona.', 'omeo an’i arona sy ny zanany lahy ny levita. fanomezana izy ireo ary omen’ny israelita an’i arona.'),
  ('6aadc728d5f81ea6cc3345e8', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.399Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.399Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 3, 8, 'Ary hikarakara ny fitaovana rehetra ao amin’ny tranolay fihaonana izy ireo, sady hanao ny andraikiny amin’ny Israelita, ka hanao fanompoana mifandray amin’ny tranolay masina.', 'ary hikarakara ny fitaovana rehetra ao amin’ny tranolay fihaonana izy ireo, sady hanao ny andraikiny amin’ny israelita, ka hanao fanompoana mifandray amin’ny tranolay masina.'),
  ('6aadc728d5f81ea6cc3345e7', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.399Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.399Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 3, 7, 'Hanao ny andraikiny aminy sy amin’ny vahoaka manontolo, eo anoloan’ny tranolay fihaonana, izy ireo ka hanao ny fanompoany mifandray amin’ny tranolay masina.', 'hanao ny andraikiny aminy sy amin’ny vahoaka manontolo, eo anoloan’ny tranolay fihaonana, izy ireo ka hanao ny fanompoany mifandray amin’ny tranolay masina.'),
  ('6aadc728d5f81ea6cc3345e6', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.399Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.399Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 3, 6, '“Asaivo manatona ny fokon’i Levy, dia asaivo mijoro eo anatrehan’i Arona mpisorona mba hanampy azy.', '“asaivo manatona ny fokon’i levy, dia asaivo mijoro eo anatrehan’i arona mpisorona mba hanampy azy.'),
  ('6aadc728d5f81ea6cc3345e5', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.399Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.399Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 3, 5, 'Dia hoy i Jehovah tamin’i Mosesy:', 'dia hoy i jehovah tamin’i mosesy:'),
  ('6aadc728d5f81ea6cc3345e4', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.399Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.399Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 3, 4, 'Maty teo anatrehan’i Jehovah anefa i Nadaba sy Abiho. Nanolotra afo teo anatrehan’i Jehovah mantsy izy ireo tany an-tany efitr’i Sinay, nefa afo tsy nahazoana alalana ilay izy. Ary tsy nanan-janaka izy roa lahy. I Eleazara sy Itamara kosa mbola nanao ny asan’ny mpisorona niaraka tamin’i Arona rainy.', 'maty teo anatrehan’i jehovah anefa i nadaba sy abiho. nanolotra afo teo anatrehan’i jehovah mantsy izy ireo tany an-tany efitr’i sinay, nefa afo tsy nahazoana alalana ilay izy. ary tsy nanan-janaka izy roa lahy. i eleazara sy itamara kosa mbola nanao ny asan’ny mpisorona niaraka tamin’i arona rainy.'),
  ('6aadc728d5f81ea6cc3345e3', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.399Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.399Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 3, 3, 'Ireo no anaran’ny zanak’i Arona, dia ny mpisorona voahosotra sy notendrena ho mpisorona.', 'ireo no anaran’ny zanak’i arona, dia ny mpisorona voahosotra sy notendrena ho mpisorona.'),
  ('6aadc728d5f81ea6cc3345e2', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.399Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.399Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 3, 2, 'Ireto avy ny anaran’ny zanakalahin’i Arona: I Nadaba no lahimatoa, dia nanarakaraka azy i Abiho sy Eleazara ary Itamara.', 'ireto avy ny anaran’ny zanakalahin’i arona: i nadaba no lahimatoa, dia nanarakaraka azy i abiho sy eleazara ary itamara.'),
  ('6aadc728d5f81ea6cc3345e1', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.399Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.399Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 3, 1, 'Ireto avy ny taranak’i Arona sy Mosesy, tamin’ilay andro niresahan’i Jehovah tamin’i Mosesy teo amin’ny Tendrombohitra Sinay.', 'ireto avy ny taranak’i arona sy mosesy, tamin’ilay andro niresahan’i jehovah tamin’i mosesy teo amin’ny tendrombohitra sinay.'),
  ('6aadc728d5f81ea6cc334613', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.401Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.401Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 3, 51, 'Dia nomen’i Mosesy an’i Arona sy ny zanany lahy ny vola vidim-panavotana, araka ny tenin’i Jehovah, dia araka ny didy nomen’i Jehovah an’i Mosesy.', 'dia nomen’i mosesy an’i arona sy ny zanany lahy ny vola vidim-panavotana, araka ny tenin’i jehovah, dia araka ny didy nomen’i jehovah an’i mosesy.'),
  ('6aadc728d5f81ea6cc334612', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.401Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.401Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 3, 50, 'Avy tamin’ny lahimatoan’ny Israelita no nakany an’ilay vola, dia 1 365 sekely, araka ny sekely fampiasa ao amin’ny toerana masina.', 'avy tamin’ny lahimatoan’ny israelita no nakany an’ilay vola, dia 1 365 sekely, araka ny sekely fampiasa ao amin’ny toerana masina.'),
  ('6aadc728d5f81ea6cc334611', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.401Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.401Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 3, 49, 'Koa nalain’i Mosesy ny vola hanavotana an’ireo Israelita nihoatra tamin’ny isan’ny Levita.', 'koa nalain’i mosesy ny vola hanavotana an’ireo israelita nihoatra tamin’ny isan’ny levita.'),
  ('6aadc728d5f81ea6cc334610', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.401Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.401Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 3, 48, 'Dia omeo an’i Arona sy ny zanany lahy ilay vola hatao vidim-panavotana an’ireo olona mihoatra ireo.”', 'dia omeo an’i arona sy ny zanany lahy ilay vola hatao vidim-panavotana an’ireo olona mihoatra ireo.”'),
  ('6aadc728d5f81ea6cc33460f', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.401Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.401Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 3, 47, 'dia makà dimy sekely ho takalon’ny lahimatoa tsirairay, araka ny sekely fampiasa ao amin’ny toerana masina. Ary 20 gera ny iray sekely.', 'dia makà dimy sekely ho takalon’ny lahimatoa tsirairay, araka ny sekely fampiasa ao amin’ny toerana masina. ary 20 gera ny iray sekely.'),
  ('6aadc728d5f81ea6cc33460e', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.401Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.401Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 3, 46, 'Mihoatra 273 amin’ny Levita anefa ny isan’ny lahimatoan’ny Israelita. Mba hanavotana an’ireo mihoatra ireo,', 'mihoatra 273 amin’ny levita anefa ny isan’ny lahimatoan’ny israelita. mba hanavotana an’ireo mihoatra ireo,'),
  ('6aadc728d5f81ea6cc33460d', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.401Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.401Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 3, 45, '“Alaivo ny Levita mba ho solon’ny lahimatoa rehetra amin’ny Israelita, ary ny biby fiompin’ny Levita ho solon’ny biby fiompin’izy ireo. Dia ho ahy ny Levita. Izaho no Jehovah.', '“alaivo ny levita mba ho solon’ny lahimatoa rehetra amin’ny israelita, ary ny biby fiompin’ny levita ho solon’ny biby fiompin’izy ireo. dia ho ahy ny levita. izaho no jehovah.'),
  ('6aadc728d5f81ea6cc33460c', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.401Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.401Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 3, 44, 'Hoy koa i Jehovah tamin’i Mosesy:', 'hoy koa i jehovah tamin’i mosesy:'),
  ('6aadc728d5f81ea6cc33460b', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.401Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.401Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 3, 43, 'Nisy 22 273 ny lahimatoa rehetra iray volana no ho miakatra voasoratra anarana.', 'nisy 22 273 ny lahimatoa rehetra iray volana no ho miakatra voasoratra anarana.'),
  ('6aadc728d5f81ea6cc33460a', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.401Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.401Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 3, 42, 'Dia nosoratan’i Mosesy ny anaran’ny lahimatoa rehetra tamin’ny Israelita, araka ny didy nomen’i Jehovah azy.', 'dia nosoratan’i mosesy ny anaran’ny lahimatoa rehetra tamin’ny israelita, araka ny didy nomen’i jehovah azy.'),
  ('6aadc728d5f81ea6cc334609', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.401Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.401Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 3, 41, 'Ary alaivo ho ahy ny Levita, ho solon’ny lahimatoa rehetra amin’ny Israelita. Alaivo ho ahy koa ny biby fiompin’ny Levita, ho solon’ny voalohan-teraka rehetra amin’ny biby fiompin’ny Israelita. Izaho no Jehovah.”', 'ary alaivo ho ahy ny levita, ho solon’ny lahimatoa rehetra amin’ny israelita. alaivo ho ahy koa ny biby fiompin’ny levita, ho solon’ny voalohan-teraka rehetra amin’ny biby fiompin’ny israelita. izaho no jehovah.”'),
  ('6aadc728d5f81ea6cc334608', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.401Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.401Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 3, 40, 'Dia hoy i Jehovah tamin’i Mosesy: “Soraty ny anaran’ny lahimatoa rehetra iray volana no ho miakatra, amin’ny Israelita. Isao izy ireo, dia ataovy lisitra ny anarany.', 'dia hoy i jehovah tamin’i mosesy: “soraty ny anaran’ny lahimatoa rehetra iray volana no ho miakatra, amin’ny israelita. isao izy ireo, dia ataovy lisitra ny anarany.'),
  ('6aadc728d5f81ea6cc334607', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.401Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.401Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 3, 39, 'Nisy 22 000 ny Levita rehetra voasoratra anarana, dia ny lahy rehetra iray volana no ho miakatra. I Mosesy sy Arona no nanoratra ny anaran’izy ireo, araka ny fianakaviany avy, araka ny baikon’i Jehovah.', 'nisy 22 000 ny levita rehetra voasoratra anarana, dia ny lahy rehetra iray volana no ho miakatra. i mosesy sy arona no nanoratra ny anaran’izy ireo, araka ny fianakaviany avy, araka ny baikon’i jehovah.'),
  ('6aadc728d5f81ea6cc334606', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.401Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.401Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 3, 38, 'I Mosesy, miaraka amin’i Arona sy ny zanany lahy, no nitoby teo alohan’ny tranolay, teo atsinanana, izany hoe teo anoloan’ny tranolay fihaonana, tandrifin’ ny fiposahan’ny masoandro. Andraikitr’izy ireo ny nikarakara ny toerana masina, ary nanao an’izany izy ireo ho solon’ny Israelita. Hovonoina ho faty izay olona tsy nahazo alalana nefa manakaiky ny toerana masina.', 'i mosesy, miaraka amin’i arona sy ny zanany lahy, no nitoby teo alohan’ny tranolay, teo atsinanana, izany hoe teo anoloan’ny tranolay fihaonana, tandrifin’ ny fiposahan’ny masoandro. andraikitr’izy ireo ny nikarakara ny toerana masina, ary nanao an’izany izy ireo ho solon’ny israelita. hovonoina ho faty izay olona tsy nahazo alalana nefa manakaiky ny toerana masina.'),
  ('6aadc728d5f81ea6cc334605', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.401Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.401Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 3, 37, 'Andraikiny koa ny andry manodidina ny tokotany, ny faladia itsatohany, ny fantsika be fanenjanan-day, ary ny tady fanenjanan-day.', 'andraikiny koa ny andry manodidina ny tokotany, ny faladia itsatohany, ny fantsika be fanenjanan-day, ary ny tady fanenjanan-day.'),
  ('6aadc728d5f81ea6cc334604', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.401Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.401Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 3, 36, 'Ny taranak’i Merary no niandraikitra sy nanara-maso ny rafitry ny tranolay, ny barany, ny andry, ny faladia itsatohany, ny fitaovany rehetra, ary izay rehetra ampiasaina amin’ny fanompoana mifandray amin’ireny.', 'ny taranak’i merary no niandraikitra sy nanara-maso ny rafitry ny tranolay, ny barany, ny andry, ny faladia itsatohany, ny fitaovany rehetra, ary izay rehetra ampiasaina amin’ny fanompoana mifandray amin’ireny.'),
  ('6aadc728d5f81ea6cc334603', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.401Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.401Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 3, 35, 'I Zoriela zanak’i Abihaila no mpiadidy teo amin’ny fianakaviamben’i Merary. Nitoby teo avaratry ny tranolay izy ireo.', 'i zoriela zanak’i abihaila no mpiadidy teo amin’ny fianakaviamben’i merary. nitoby teo avaratry ny tranolay izy ireo.'),
  ('6aadc728d5f81ea6cc334602', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.401Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.401Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 3, 34, 'Nisy 6 200 ny lahy rehetra iray volana no ho miakatra voasoratra anarana.', 'nisy 6 200 ny lahy rehetra iray volana no ho miakatra voasoratra anarana.'),
  ('6aadc728d5f81ea6cc334601', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.401Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.401Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 3, 33, 'Ary avy tamin’i Merary ny fianakavian’ny Malita sy ny fianakavian’ny Mosita. Ireo no fianakavian’i Merary.', 'ary avy tamin’i merary ny fianakavian’ny malita sy ny fianakavian’ny mosita. ireo no fianakavian’i merary.'),
  ('6aadc728d5f81ea6cc334600', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.401Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.401Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 3, 32, 'I Eleazara zanak’i Arona mpisorona no lehiben’ny mpiadidy teo amin’ny Levita. Izy no mpiandraikitra an’izay nanana andraikitra tao amin’ny toerana masina.', 'i eleazara zanak’i arona mpisorona no lehiben’ny mpiadidy teo amin’ny levita. izy no mpiandraikitra an’izay nanana andraikitra tao amin’ny toerana masina.'),
  ('6aadc728d5f81ea6cc3345ff', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.401Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.401Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 3, 31, 'Andraikitr’izy ireo ny nikarakara ny Vata, ny latabatra, ny fitoeran-jiro, ireo alitara, ny fitaovana ampiasaina rehefa manompo ao amin’ny toerana masina, ny lamba fanakonana, ary izay rehetra ampiasaina amin’ny fanompoana mifandray amin’ireny.', 'andraikitr’izy ireo ny nikarakara ny vata, ny latabatra, ny fitoeran-jiro, ireo alitara, ny fitaovana ampiasaina rehefa manompo ao amin’ny toerana masina, ny lamba fanakonana, ary izay rehetra ampiasaina amin’ny fanompoana mifandray amin’ireny.'),
  ('6aadc728b55acea8a63d4718', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.818Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.818Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 4, 49, 'Nosoratana ny anaran’izy ireo, araka ny baikon’i Jehovah nampitain’i Mosesy, ka samy nanana ny fanompoana nanendrena azy sy ny anjara entany avy ny tsirairay. Nosoratana ny anaran’izy ireo, araka ny didy nomen’i Jehovah an’i Mosesy.', 'nosoratana ny anaran’izy ireo, araka ny baikon’i jehovah nampitain’i mosesy, ka samy nanana ny fanompoana nanendrena azy sy ny anjara entany avy ny tsirairay. nosoratana ny anaran’izy ireo, araka ny didy nomen’i jehovah an’i mosesy.'),
  ('6aadc728b55acea8a63d4717', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.818Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.818Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 4, 48, 'Nisy 8 580 ireo voasoratra anarana rehetra.', 'nisy 8 580 ireo voasoratra anarana rehetra.'),
  ('6aadc728b55acea8a63d4716', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.818Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.818Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 4, 47, 'Ary 30 ka hatramin’ny 50 taona izy ireo. Voatendry hanompo sy hitondra an’ireo fitaovan’ny tranolay fihaonana izy rehetra.', 'ary 30 ka hatramin’ny 50 taona izy ireo. voatendry hanompo sy hitondra an’ireo fitaovan’ny tranolay fihaonana izy rehetra.'),
  ('6aadc728b55acea8a63d4715', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.818Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.818Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 4, 46, 'Nosoratan’i Mosesy sy Arona ary ny mpiadidy teo amin’ny Israely ny anaran’ireo Levita rehetra ireo, ka nataony araka ny fianakaviany sy araka ny fianakaviambeny izany.', 'nosoratan’i mosesy sy arona ary ny mpiadidy teo amin’ny israely ny anaran’ireo levita rehetra ireo, ka nataony araka ny fianakaviany sy araka ny fianakaviambeny izany.'),
  ('6aadc728b55acea8a63d4714', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.818Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.818Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 4, 45, 'Ireo no voasoratra anarana tamin’ny fianakavian’ny taranak’i Merary. I Mosesy sy Arona no nanoratra ny anarany, araka ny baikon’i Jehovah nampitaina tamin’i Mosesy.', 'ireo no voasoratra anarana tamin’ny fianakavian’ny taranak’i merary. i mosesy sy arona no nanoratra ny anarany, araka ny baikon’i jehovah nampitaina tamin’i mosesy.'),
  ('6aadc728b55acea8a63d4713', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.818Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.818Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 4, 44, 'Koa nisy 3 200 ireo voasoratra anarana rehetra araka ny fianakaviany avy.', 'koa nisy 3 200 ireo voasoratra anarana rehetra araka ny fianakaviany avy.'),
  ('6aadc728b55acea8a63d4712', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.818Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.818Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 4, 43, 'dia izay rehetra 30 ka hatramin’ny 50 taona anisan’ny antoko voatendry hanompo ao amin’ny tranolay fihaonana.', 'dia izay rehetra 30 ka hatramin’ny 50 taona anisan’ny antoko voatendry hanompo ao amin’ny tranolay fihaonana.'),
  ('6aadc728b55acea8a63d4711', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.818Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.818Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 4, 42, 'Nosoratana araka ny fianakaviany sy araka ny fianakaviambeny ny anaran’ny taranak’i Merary,', 'nosoratana araka ny fianakaviany sy araka ny fianakaviambeny ny anaran’ny taranak’i merary,'),
  ('6aadc728b55acea8a63d4710', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.818Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.818Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 4, 41, 'Ireo no voasoratra anarana tamin’ny fianakavian’ny taranak’i Gersona, dia izay rehetra nanompo tao amin’ny tranolay fihaonana. I Mosesy sy Arona no nanoratra ny anarany, araka ny baikon’i Jehovah.', 'ireo no voasoratra anarana tamin’ny fianakavian’ny taranak’i gersona, dia izay rehetra nanompo tao amin’ny tranolay fihaonana. i mosesy sy arona no nanoratra ny anarany, araka ny baikon’i jehovah.'),
  ('6aadc728b55acea8a63d470f', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.818Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.818Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 4, 40, 'Koa nisy 2 630 ireo voasoratra anarana rehetra araka ny fianakaviany sy araka ny fianakaviambeny.', 'koa nisy 2 630 ireo voasoratra anarana rehetra araka ny fianakaviany sy araka ny fianakaviambeny.'),
  ('6aadc728b55acea8a63d470e', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.818Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.818Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 4, 39, 'dia izay rehetra 30 ka hatramin’ny 50 taona anisan’ny antoko voatendry hanompo ao amin’ny tranolay fihaonana.', 'dia izay rehetra 30 ka hatramin’ny 50 taona anisan’ny antoko voatendry hanompo ao amin’ny tranolay fihaonana.'),
  ('6aadc728b55acea8a63d470d', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.818Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.818Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 4, 38, 'Nosoratana araka ny fianakaviany sy araka ny fianakaviambeny ny anaran’ny taranak’i Gersona,', 'nosoratana araka ny fianakaviany sy araka ny fianakaviambeny ny anaran’ny taranak’i gersona,'),
  ('6aadc728b55acea8a63d470c', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.818Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.818Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 4, 37, 'Ireo no voasoratra anarana tamin’ny fianakavian’ny Kehatita, dia izay rehetra nanompo tao amin’ny tranolay fihaonana. I Mosesy sy Arona no nanoratra ny anarany, araka ny baikon’i Jehovah nampitaina tamin’i Mosesy.', 'ireo no voasoratra anarana tamin’ny fianakavian’ny kehatita, dia izay rehetra nanompo tao amin’ny tranolay fihaonana. i mosesy sy arona no nanoratra ny anarany, araka ny baikon’i jehovah nampitaina tamin’i mosesy.'),
  ('6aadc728b55acea8a63d470b', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.818Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.818Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 4, 36, 'Koa nisy 2 750 ireo voasoratra anarana rehetra araka ny fianakaviany avy.', 'koa nisy 2 750 ireo voasoratra anarana rehetra araka ny fianakaviany avy.'),
  ('6aadc728b55acea8a63d470a', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.818Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.818Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 4, 35, 'dia izay rehetra 30 ka hatramin’ny 50 taona anisan’ny antoko voatendry hanompo ao amin’ny tranolay fihaonana.', 'dia izay rehetra 30 ka hatramin’ny 50 taona anisan’ny antoko voatendry hanompo ao amin’ny tranolay fihaonana.'),
  ('6aadc728b55acea8a63d4709', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.818Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.818Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 4, 34, 'Ary nosoratan’i Mosesy sy Arona ary ny mpiadidy vahoaka araka ny fianakaviany sy araka ny fianakaviambeny ny anaran’ireo taranaky ny Kehatita,', 'ary nosoratan’i mosesy sy arona ary ny mpiadidy vahoaka araka ny fianakaviany sy araka ny fianakaviambeny ny anaran’ireo taranaky ny kehatita,'),
  ('6aadc728b55acea8a63d4708', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.818Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.818Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 4, 33, 'Hoatr’izany no tokony hataon’ireo fianakavian’ny taranak’i Merary rehefa manompo ao amin’ny tranolay fihaonana, ka i Itamara zanak’i Arona mpisorona no hiandraikitra azy ireo.”', 'hoatr’izany no tokony hataon’ireo fianakavian’ny taranak’i merary rehefa manompo ao amin’ny tranolay fihaonana, ka i itamara zanak’i arona mpisorona no hiandraikitra azy ireo.”');
INSERT INTO "bible_verses" ("id", "created_date", "updated_date", "created_by_id", "created_by", "translation", "book", "bookOrder", "chapter", "verse", "text", "normalizedText") VALUES
  ('6aadc728b55acea8a63d4707', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.818Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.818Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 4, 32, 'Hoentiny koa ireo andrin’ny tokotany manodidina, ny faladia itsatohany, ny fantsika be fanenjanan-day, ny tady fanenjanan-day, ary ny fitaovana rehetra miaraka aminy sy izay rehetra ampiasaina amin’ny fanompoana mifandray amin’ireny. Holazainareo aminy ny anaran’ny fitaovana tokony hoentiny.', 'hoentiny koa ireo andrin’ny tokotany manodidina, ny faladia itsatohany, ny fantsika be fanenjanan-day, ny tady fanenjanan-day, ary ny fitaovana rehetra miaraka aminy sy izay rehetra ampiasaina amin’ny fanompoana mifandray amin’ireny. holazainareo aminy ny anaran’ny fitaovana tokony hoentiny.'),
  ('6aadc728b55acea8a63d4706', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.818Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.818Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 4, 31, 'Ireto avy ny andraikiny, dia izay tokony hoentiny mifandray amin’ny fanompoany ao amin’ny tranolay fihaonana: Ny rafitry ny tranolay, ny barany, ny andry, ary ny faladia itsatohany.', 'ireto avy ny andraikiny, dia izay tokony hoentiny mifandray amin’ny fanompoany ao amin’ny tranolay fihaonana: ny rafitry ny tranolay, ny barany, ny andry, ary ny faladia itsatohany.'),
  ('6aadc728b55acea8a63d4705', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.818Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.818Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 4, 30, 'Izay 30 ka hatramin’ny 50 taona no hosoratanao anarana, dia izay rehetra anisan’ny antoko voatendry hanao ny fanompoana ao amin’ny tranolay fihaonana.', 'izay 30 ka hatramin’ny 50 taona no hosoratanao anarana, dia izay rehetra anisan’ny antoko voatendry hanao ny fanompoana ao amin’ny tranolay fihaonana.'),
  ('6aadc728b55acea8a63d4704', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.818Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.818Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 4, 29, '“Ny taranak’i Merary kosa tokony hosoratanao anarana isam-pianakaviana sy isaky ny fianakaviambeny.', '“ny taranak’i merary kosa tokony hosoratanao anarana isam-pianakaviana sy isaky ny fianakaviambeny.'),
  ('6aadc728b55acea8a63d4703', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.818Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.818Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 4, 28, 'Izany no fanompoana tokony hataon’ireo fianakavian’ny Gersonita ao amin’ny tranolay fihaonana, ka i Itamara zanak’i Arona mpisorona no miandraikitra ny fanompoan’izy ireo.', 'izany no fanompoana tokony hataon’ireo fianakavian’ny gersonita ao amin’ny tranolay fihaonana, ka i itamara zanak’i arona mpisorona no miandraikitra ny fanompoan’izy ireo.'),
  ('6aadc728b55acea8a63d4702', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.818Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.818Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 4, 27, 'Tokony hanara-maso ny fanompoana rehetra ataon’ny Gersonita sy ny zavatra entiny i Arona sy ny zanany lahy. Asaivo entiny ireo entana rehetra ireo, fa ireo no andraikiny.', 'tokony hanara-maso ny fanompoana rehetra ataon’ny gersonita sy ny zavatra entiny i arona sy ny zanany lahy. asaivo entiny ireo entana rehetra ireo, fa ireo no andraikiny.'),
  ('6aadc728b55acea8a63d4701', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.818Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.818Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 4, 26, 'ny fefy lamban’ny tokotany, ny lamba fanakonana an’ilay fidirana amin’ny vavahadin’ny tokotany manodidina ny tranolay sy ny alitara, ny tady fanenjanan-day sy ny fitaovana rehetra miaraka aminy, ary ny zavatra rehetra ampiasaina rehefa manompo ao amin’ny tranolay masina. Izany no anendrena azy ireo.', 'ny fefy lamban’ny tokotany, ny lamba fanakonana an’ilay fidirana amin’ny vavahadin’ny tokotany manodidina ny tranolay sy ny alitara, ny tady fanenjanan-day sy ny fitaovana rehetra miaraka aminy, ary ny zavatra rehetra ampiasaina rehefa manompo ao amin’ny tranolay masina. izany no anendrena azy ireo.'),
  ('6aadc728b55acea8a63d4700', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.818Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.818Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 4, 25, 'Hoentin’izy ireo ny lamban’ny tranolay, ny tranolay fihaonana, ny rakotra, ilay rakotra vita amin’ny hoditra faoky eo amboniny, ny lamba fanakonana an’ilay fidirana amin’ny tranolay fihaonana,', 'hoentin’izy ireo ny lamban’ny tranolay, ny tranolay fihaonana, ny rakotra, ilay rakotra vita amin’ny hoditra faoky eo amboniny, ny lamba fanakonana an’ilay fidirana amin’ny tranolay fihaonana,'),
  ('6aadc728b55acea8a63d46ff', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.818Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.818Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 4, 24, 'Ireto avy no tokony hokarakarain’ny fianakavian’ny Gersonita sy hoentiny:', 'ireto avy no tokony hokarakarain’ny fianakavian’ny gersonita sy hoentiny:'),
  ('6aadc728b55acea8a63d46fe', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.818Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.818Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 4, 23, 'Soraty ny anaran’izay 30 ka hatramin’ny 50 taona anisan’ny antoko voatendry hanompo ao amin’ny tranolay fihaonana.', 'soraty ny anaran’izay 30 ka hatramin’ny 50 taona anisan’ny antoko voatendry hanompo ao amin’ny tranolay fihaonana.'),
  ('6aadc728b55acea8a63d46fd', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.818Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.818Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 4, 22, '“Tokony hisaina isaky ny fianakaviambe sy isam-pianakaviana ny taranak’i Gersona.', '“tokony hisaina isaky ny fianakaviambe sy isam-pianakaviana ny taranak’i gersona.'),
  ('6aadc728b55acea8a63d46fc', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.818Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.818Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 4, 21, 'Dia hoy i Jehovah tamin’i Mosesy:', 'dia hoy i jehovah tamin’i mosesy:'),
  ('6aadc728b55acea8a63d46fb', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.818Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.818Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 4, 20, 'Tsy tokony hiditra hijery an’ireo zava-masina ny Kehatita na dia indray mipy maso aza, sao ho faty.”', 'tsy tokony hiditra hijery an’ireo zava-masina ny kehatita na dia indray mipy maso aza, sao ho faty.”'),
  ('6aadc728b55acea8a63d46fa', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.818Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.818Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 4, 19, 'Ataovy tsara kosa ny andraikitrareo, mba ho velona foana izy ireo fa tsy ho faty rehefa manatona an’ireo zavatra masina indrindra. Hiditra i Arona sy ny zanany lahy, ka hilaza amin’ny tsirairay ny fanompoana hataony sy izay tokony holanjainy.', 'ataovy tsara kosa ny andraikitrareo, mba ho velona foana izy ireo fa tsy ho faty rehefa manatona an’ireo zavatra masina indrindra. hiditra i arona sy ny zanany lahy, ka hilaza amin’ny tsirairay ny fanompoana hataony sy izay tokony holanjainy.'),
  ('6aadc728b55acea8a63d46f9', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.818Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.818Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 4, 18, '“Tandremo sao ho ripaka ny taranak’i Kehata ka tsy hisy Kehatita intsony ao amin’ny fokon’i Levy.', '“tandremo sao ho ripaka ny taranak’i kehata ka tsy hisy kehatita intsony ao amin’ny fokon’i levy.'),
  ('6aadc728b55acea8a63d46f8', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.818Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.818Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 4, 17, 'Hoy koa i Jehovah tamin’i Mosesy sy Arona:', 'hoy koa i jehovah tamin’i mosesy sy arona:'),
  ('6aadc728b55acea8a63d46f7', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.818Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.818Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 4, 16, '“I Eleazara zanak’i Arona mpisorona no miandraikitra sy manara-maso ny menaky ny jiro, ny emboka manitra, ny fanatitra varimbazaha atolotra tsy tapaka, ary ny menaka masina fanosorana. Izy no miandraikitra ny tranolay masina, dia ilay izy manontolo sy ny ao anatiny rehetra, anisan’izany ny toerana masina sy ny fitaovana miaraka aminy.”', '“i eleazara zanak’i arona mpisorona no miandraikitra sy manara-maso ny menaky ny jiro, ny emboka manitra, ny fanatitra varimbazaha atolotra tsy tapaka, ary ny menaka masina fanosorana. izy no miandraikitra ny tranolay masina, dia ilay izy manontolo sy ny ao anatiny rehetra, anisan’izany ny toerana masina sy ny fitaovana miaraka aminy.”'),
  ('6aadc728b55acea8a63d46f6', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.818Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.818Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 4, 15, '“Rehefa hiainga ny toby, dia tokony ho efa norakofan’i Arona sy ny zanany lahy ny toerana masina sy ny fitaovana rehetra miaraka aminy. Dia hiditra ny taranak’i Kehata ka hilanja an’ireo, nefa tsy hikasika an’ilay toerana masina izy ireo sao ho faty. Ireo zavatra ireo no andraikitry ny taranak’i Kehata mifandray amin’ny tranolay fihaonana.', '“rehefa hiainga ny toby, dia tokony ho efa norakofan’i arona sy ny zanany lahy ny toerana masina sy ny fitaovana rehetra miaraka aminy. dia hiditra ny taranak’i kehata ka hilanja an’ireo, nefa tsy hikasika an’ilay toerana masina izy ireo sao ho faty. ireo zavatra ireo no andraikitry ny taranak’i kehata mifandray amin’ny tranolay fihaonana.'),
  ('6aadc728b55acea8a63d46f5', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.818Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.818Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 4, 14, 'Hataony eo ambonin’ilay alitara ny fitaovana rehetra ampiasainy rehefa manompo eo, dia ny fitondrana afo, ny fitrebika, ny lapelina, ary ny vilia baolina, izany hoe ny fitaovana rehetra ho an’ny alitara. Dia hamelatra hoditra faoky handrakofana ny alitara izy ireo, ary hanatsofoka ny bao filanjana azy.', 'hataony eo ambonin’ilay alitara ny fitaovana rehetra ampiasainy rehefa manompo eo, dia ny fitondrana afo, ny fitrebika, ny lapelina, ary ny vilia baolina, izany hoe ny fitaovana rehetra ho an’ny alitara. dia hamelatra hoditra faoky handrakofana ny alitara izy ireo, ary hanatsofoka ny bao filanjana azy.'),
  ('6aadc728b55acea8a63d46f4', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.818Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.818Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 4, 13, '“Tokony hanala ny lavenona eo amin’ny alitara izy ireo, dia hamelatra lamba volonondry volomparasy eo amboniny.', '“tokony hanala ny lavenona eo amin’ny alitara izy ireo, dia hamelatra lamba volonondry volomparasy eo amboniny.'),
  ('6aadc728b55acea8a63d46f3', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.818Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.818Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 4, 12, 'Halain’izy ireo ny fitaovana hafa rehetra ampiasainy hanompoana tsy tapaka ao amin’ny toerana masina, ka hataony ao anaty lamba manga. Dia hosaronany hoditra faoky ireo, ka hataony eo ambonin’ny bao filanjana.', 'halain’izy ireo ny fitaovana hafa rehetra ampiasainy hanompoana tsy tapaka ao amin’ny toerana masina, ka hataony ao anaty lamba manga. dia hosaronany hoditra faoky ireo, ka hataony eo ambonin’ny bao filanjana.'),
  ('6aadc728b55acea8a63d46f2', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.818Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.818Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 4, 11, 'Ary hamelatra lamba manga eo ambonin’ny alitara volamena izy ireo. Dia horakofany hoditra faoky ilay izy, ary hatsofony ny bao filanjana azy.', 'ary hamelatra lamba manga eo ambonin’ny alitara volamena izy ireo. dia horakofany hoditra faoky ilay izy, ary hatsofony ny bao filanjana azy.'),
  ('6aadc728b55acea8a63d46f1', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.818Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.818Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 4, 10, 'Hofonosiny ao anaty rakotra vita amin’ny hoditra faoky ilay fitoeran-jiro sy ny fitaovana rehetra miaraka aminy, ka hataony eo ambonin’ny bao filanjana.', 'hofonosiny ao anaty rakotra vita amin’ny hoditra faoky ilay fitoeran-jiro sy ny fitaovana rehetra miaraka aminy, ka hataony eo ambonin’ny bao filanjana.'),
  ('6aadc728b55acea8a63d46f0', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.818Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.818Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 4, 9, 'Haka lamba manga izy ireo avy eo hanaronany ny fitoeran-jiro sy ny kojakojany: Ny jiro, ny fitazonana lahin-jiro, ny fitondrana afo, ary ny fitoera-menaka rehetra ampiasaina mba hampirehitra foana ny jiro.', 'haka lamba manga izy ireo avy eo hanaronany ny fitoeran-jiro sy ny kojakojany: ny jiro, ny fitazonana lahin-jiro, ny fitondrana afo, ary ny fitoera-menaka rehetra ampiasaina mba hampirehitra foana ny jiro.'),
  ('6aadc728b55acea8a63d46ef', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.818Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.818Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 4, 8, 'Hamelatra lamba mena midorehitra eo ambonin’ireo izy. Dia horakofany hoditra faoky ilay latabatra, ary hatsofony ny bao filanjana azy.', 'hamelatra lamba mena midorehitra eo ambonin’ireo izy. dia horakofany hoditra faoky ilay latabatra, ary hatsofony ny bao filanjana azy.'),
  ('6aadc728b55acea8a63d46ee', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.818Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.818Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 4, 7, '“Hamelatra lamba manga eo ambonin’ny latabatry ny mofo aseho koa izy ireo, ka hataony eo ambonin’io ny vilia, ny kaopy, ny vilia baolina, ary ny zingan’ny fanatitra zava-pisotro. Tokony ho eo ambonin’ilay latabatra foana ny mofo, izay fanatitra atolotra tsy tapaka.', '“hamelatra lamba manga eo ambonin’ny latabatry ny mofo aseho koa izy ireo, ka hataony eo ambonin’io ny vilia, ny kaopy, ny vilia baolina, ary ny zingan’ny fanatitra zava-pisotro. tokony ho eo ambonin’ilay latabatra foana ny mofo, izay fanatitra atolotra tsy tapaka.'),
  ('6aadc728b55acea8a63d46ed', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.818Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.818Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 4, 6, 'Horakofany hoditra faoky eo amboniny, ary mbola hamelarany lamba manga eo ambonin’io. Dia hataony amin’ny toerany ireo bao filanjana ny Vata.', 'horakofany hoditra faoky eo amboniny, ary mbola hamelarany lamba manga eo ambonin’io. dia hataony amin’ny toerany ireo bao filanjana ny vata.'),
  ('6aadc728b55acea8a63d46ec', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.818Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.818Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 4, 5, 'Rehefa hiainga ny toby, dia hiditra i Arona sy ny zanany lahy ka hampidina ny ridao fanakonana, ary iny no handrakofany ny Vata Misy ny Tenin’ny Vavolombelona.', 'rehefa hiainga ny toby, dia hiditra i arona sy ny zanany lahy ka hampidina ny ridao fanakonana, ary iny no handrakofany ny vata misy ny tenin’ny vavolombelona.'),
  ('6aadc728b55acea8a63d46eb', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.818Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.818Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 4, 4, '“Izao no fanompoan’ny taranak’i Kehata ao amin’ny tranolay fihaonana, ary zavatra masina indrindra izany:', '“izao no fanompoan’ny taranak’i kehata ao amin’ny tranolay fihaonana, ary zavatra masina indrindra izany:'),
  ('6aadc728b55acea8a63d46ea', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.818Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.818Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 4, 3, 'dia izay rehetra 30 ka hatramin’ny 50 taona, anisan’ny antoko voatendry hiasa ao amin’ny tranolay fihaonana.', 'dia izay rehetra 30 ka hatramin’ny 50 taona, anisan’ny antoko voatendry hiasa ao amin’ny tranolay fihaonana.'),
  ('6aadc728b55acea8a63d46e9', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.818Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.818Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 4, 2, '“Tokony hisaina isam-pianakaviana sy isaky ny fianakaviambe ny taranak’i Kehata anisan’ny taranak’i Levy,', '“tokony hisaina isam-pianakaviana sy isaky ny fianakaviambe ny taranak’i kehata anisan’ny taranak’i levy,'),
  ('6aadc728b55acea8a63d46e8', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.818Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:08.818Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 4, 1, 'Ary hoy i Jehovah tamin’i Mosesy sy Arona:', 'ary hoy i jehovah tamin’i mosesy sy arona:'),
  ('6aadc729b5f8c18f07d1eb96', '2026-09-18T23:20:09.191Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:09.192Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 5, 18, 'Ary hasain’ny mpisorona mijoro eo anatrehan’i Jehovah ilay vehivavy, ka hovahany ny volony. Dia hataony eo am-pelatanan’ilay vehivavy ny fanatitra varimbazaha mampahatsiahy an’ilay fahadisoana, dia ilay fanatitra atolotra noho ny fahasarotam-piaro. Ary ho eny an-tanan’ny mpisorona kosa ny rano mangidy mitondra ozona.', 'ary hasain’ny mpisorona mijoro eo anatrehan’i jehovah ilay vehivavy, ka hovahany ny volony. dia hataony eo am-pelatanan’ilay vehivavy ny fanatitra varimbazaha mampahatsiahy an’ilay fahadisoana, dia ilay fanatitra atolotra noho ny fahasarotam-piaro. ary ho eny an-tanan’ny mpisorona kosa ny rano mangidy mitondra ozona.'),
  ('6aadc729b5f8c18f07d1eb95', '2026-09-18T23:20:09.191Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:09.191Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 5, 17, 'Haka rano madio amin’ny zinga tanimanga ilay mpisorona, ary haka vovoka eo amin’ny tany misy an’ilay tranolay masina, dia hataony ao anatin’ilay rano ilay izy.', 'haka rano madio amin’ny zinga tanimanga ilay mpisorona, ary haka vovoka eo amin’ny tany misy an’ilay tranolay masina, dia hataony ao anatin’ilay rano ilay izy.'),
  ('6aadc729b5f8c18f07d1eb94', '2026-09-18T23:20:09.191Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:09.191Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 5, 16, '“‘Dia hasain’ny mpisorona manatona ilay vehivavy, ka hasainy mijoro eo anatrehan’i Jehovah.', '“‘dia hasain’ny mpisorona manatona ilay vehivavy, ka hasainy mijoro eo anatrehan’i jehovah.'),
  ('6aadc729b5f8c18f07d1eb93', '2026-09-18T23:20:09.191Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:09.191Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 5, 15, 'dia hoentin’ilay lehilahy any amin’ny mpisorona ilay vehivavy, ary hoentiny miaraka aminy koa ny fanatitra aterin’ilay vehivavy, izany hoe lafarinina ampahafolon’ny efaha vita amin’ny vary orza. Tsy horarahany menaka eo ambonin’ilay izy sady tsy hasiany ditin-kazo manitra, satria fanatitra varimbazaha atolotra noho ny fahasarotam-piaro izany, dia fanatitra ahafantarana raha nisy fahadisoana tokoa na tsia.', 'dia hoentin’ilay lehilahy any amin’ny mpisorona ilay vehivavy, ary hoentiny miaraka aminy koa ny fanatitra aterin’ilay vehivavy, izany hoe lafarinina ampahafolon’ny efaha vita amin’ny vary orza. tsy horarahany menaka eo ambonin’ilay izy sady tsy hasiany ditin-kazo manitra, satria fanatitra varimbazaha atolotra noho ny fahasarotam-piaro izany, dia fanatitra ahafantarana raha nisy fahadisoana tokoa na tsia.'),
  ('6aadc729b5f8c18f07d1eb92', '2026-09-18T23:20:09.191Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:09.191Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 5, 14, 'Raha lasa saro-piaro ilay lehilahy vadiny ka ahiahiny hoe nivadika taminy ilay vehivavy, ary efa nandoto ny tenany tokoa, na raha lasa saro-piaro ilay lehilahy ka ahiahiny hoe nivadika taminy ilay vehivavy, nefa tsy nandoto ny tenany akory,', 'raha lasa saro-piaro ilay lehilahy vadiny ka ahiahiny hoe nivadika taminy ilay vehivavy, ary efa nandoto ny tenany tokoa, na raha lasa saro-piaro ilay lehilahy ka ahiahiny hoe nivadika taminy ilay vehivavy, nefa tsy nandoto ny tenany akory,'),
  ('6aadc729b5f8c18f07d1eb91', '2026-09-18T23:20:09.191Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:09.191Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 5, 13, 'ary misy lehilahy hafa manao firaisana aminy, nefa tsy fantatr’ilay vadiny izany sady tsy misy mahafantatra mihitsy, izany hoe mandoto ny tenany ilay vehivavy, nefa tsy misy vavolombelona miampanga azy ary tsy tratra izy, dia izao no tokony hatao:', 'ary misy lehilahy hafa manao firaisana aminy, nefa tsy fantatr’ilay vadiny izany sady tsy misy mahafantatra mihitsy, izany hoe mandoto ny tenany ilay vehivavy, nefa tsy misy vavolombelona miampanga azy ary tsy tratra izy, dia izao no tokony hatao:'),
  ('6aadc729b5f8c18f07d1eb90', '2026-09-18T23:20:09.191Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:09.191Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 5, 12, '“Teneno ny Israelita hoe: ‘Raha misy vehivavy manambady nefa manota ka mivadika amin’ny vadiny,', '“teneno ny israelita hoe: ‘raha misy vehivavy manambady nefa manota ka mivadika amin’ny vadiny,'),
  ('6aadc729b5f8c18f07d1eb8f', '2026-09-18T23:20:09.191Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:09.191Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 5, 11, 'Hoy koa i Jehovah tamin’i Mosesy:', 'hoy koa i jehovah tamin’i mosesy:'),
  ('6aadc729b5f8c18f07d1eb8e', '2026-09-18T23:20:09.191Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:09.191Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 5, 10, 'Ho azy foana ny zava-masina atolotry ny olona tsirairay. Izay omen’ny tsirairay ho an’ny mpisorona, dia ho lasan’ilay mpisorona.’”', 'ho azy foana ny zava-masina atolotry ny olona tsirairay. izay omen’ny tsirairay ho an’ny mpisorona, dia ho lasan’ilay mpisorona.’”'),
  ('6aadc729b5f8c18f07d1eb8d', '2026-09-18T23:20:09.191Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:09.191Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 5, 9, '“‘Ho an’ny mpisorona daholo izay fanomezana masina entin’ny Israelita any aminy.', '“‘ho an’ny mpisorona daholo izay fanomezana masina entin’ny israelita any aminy.'),
  ('6aadc729b5f8c18f07d1eb8c', '2026-09-18T23:20:09.191Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:09.191Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 5, 8, 'Raha tsy manana havana akaiky handray an’ilay onitra anefa ilay olona nanaovany fahadisoana, dia homena an’i Jehovah izany, ka ho lasan’ny mpisorona, afa-tsy ilay ondrilahy hatao fandrakofam-pahotana. Io mantsy no handrakofan’ilay mpisorona ny fahotan’ilay meloka.', 'raha tsy manana havana akaiky handray an’ilay onitra anefa ilay olona nanaovany fahadisoana, dia homena an’i jehovah izany, ka ho lasan’ny mpisorona, afa-tsy ilay ondrilahy hatao fandrakofam-pahotana. io mantsy no handrakofan’ilay mpisorona ny fahotan’ilay meloka.'),
  ('6aadc729b5f8c18f07d1eb8b', '2026-09-18T23:20:09.191Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:09.191Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 5, 7, 'Tsy maintsy miaiky ny fahotany izy, ary hanome onitra ka honerany manontolo izay nalainy tamin’ilay olona nanaovany fahadisoana, sady mbola hampiany ampahadiminy. Dia homeny an’ilay olona izany.', 'tsy maintsy miaiky ny fahotany izy, ary hanome onitra ka honerany manontolo izay nalainy tamin’ilay olona nanaovany fahadisoana, sady mbola hampiany ampahadiminy. dia homeny an’ilay olona izany.'),
  ('6aadc729b5f8c18f07d1eb8a', '2026-09-18T23:20:09.191Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:09.191Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 5, 6, '“Teneno ny Israelita hoe: ‘Raha misy lehilahy na vehivavy manota, na inona na inona fahotany, ary mivadika amin’i Jehovah izy, dia ho meloka.', '“teneno ny israelita hoe: ‘raha misy lehilahy na vehivavy manota, na inona na inona fahotany, ary mivadika amin’i jehovah izy, dia ho meloka.'),
  ('6aadc729b5f8c18f07d1eb89', '2026-09-18T23:20:09.191Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:09.191Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 5, 5, 'Hoy ihany i Jehovah tamin’i Mosesy:', 'hoy ihany i jehovah tamin’i mosesy:'),
  ('6aadc729b5f8c18f07d1eb88', '2026-09-18T23:20:09.191Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:09.191Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 5, 4, 'Dia nataon’ny Israelita izany, ka navoakany teny ivelan’ny toby ireny. Araka ny didy nomen’i Jehovah an’i Mosesy no nataon’izy ireo.', 'dia nataon’ny israelita izany, ka navoakany teny ivelan’ny toby ireny. araka ny didy nomen’i jehovah an’i mosesy no nataon’izy ireo.'),
  ('6aadc729b5f8c18f07d1eb87', '2026-09-18T23:20:09.191Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:09.191Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 5, 3, 'Avoahy izy ireny, na lahy na vavy. Avoahy eny ivelan’ny toby ireny mba tsy handotoany ny toby, satria mipetraka eo amin’ny vahoaka ao amin’ny toby aho.”', 'avoahy izy ireny, na lahy na vavy. avoahy eny ivelan’ny toby ireny mba tsy handotoany ny toby, satria mipetraka eo amin’ny vahoaka ao amin’ny toby aho.”'),
  ('6aadc729b5f8c18f07d1eb86', '2026-09-18T23:20:09.191Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:09.191Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 5, 2, '“Omeo baiko ny Israelita hoe avoahy eny ivelan’ny toby daholo izay olona boka, na misy tsiranoka mivoaka amin’ny taovam-pananahany, na maloto satria nikasika faty.', '“omeo baiko ny israelita hoe avoahy eny ivelan’ny toby daholo izay olona boka, na misy tsiranoka mivoaka amin’ny taovam-pananahany, na maloto satria nikasika faty.'),
  ('6aadc729b5f8c18f07d1eb85', '2026-09-18T23:20:09.191Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:09.191Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 5, 1, 'Hoy koa i Jehovah tamin’i Mosesy:', 'hoy koa i jehovah tamin’i mosesy:'),
  ('6aadc729b5f8c18f07d1eba3', '2026-09-18T23:20:09.192Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:09.192Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 5, 31, 'Tsy hanan-tsiny ilay lehilahy, fa ny vadiny kosa hizaka ny vokatry ny ratsy nataony.’”', 'tsy hanan-tsiny ilay lehilahy, fa ny vadiny kosa hizaka ny vokatry ny ratsy nataony.’”'),
  ('6aadc729b5f8c18f07d1eba2', '2026-09-18T23:20:09.192Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:09.192Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 5, 30, 'na koa rehefa misy lehilahy lasa saro-piaro, ka miahiahy hoe nivadika taminy ny vadiny. Tokony hasainy mijoro eo anatrehan’i Jehovah ilay vehivavy, ka hampiharin’ny mpisorona aminy izany lalàna rehetra izany.', 'na koa rehefa misy lehilahy lasa saro-piaro, ka miahiahy hoe nivadika taminy ny vadiny. tokony hasainy mijoro eo anatrehan’i jehovah ilay vehivavy, ka hampiharin’ny mpisorona aminy izany lalàna rehetra izany.'),
  ('6aadc729b5f8c18f07d1eba1', '2026-09-18T23:20:09.192Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:09.192Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 5, 29, '“‘Izany no lalàna momba ny fahasarotam-piaro, rehefa misy vehivavy manota ka mandoto ny tenany nefa mbola eo ambany fahefan’ny vadiny,', '“‘izany no lalàna momba ny fahasarotam-piaro, rehefa misy vehivavy manota ka mandoto ny tenany nefa mbola eo ambany fahefan’ny vadiny,'),
  ('6aadc729b5f8c18f07d1eba0', '2026-09-18T23:20:09.192Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:09.192Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 5, 28, 'Raha tsy nandoto ny tenany anefa ilay vehivavy fa madio, dia tsy hiharan’izany sazy izany izy. Dia ho afaka hiteraka izy ka hanan-janaka.', 'raha tsy nandoto ny tenany anefa ilay vehivavy fa madio, dia tsy hiharan’izany sazy izany izy. dia ho afaka hiteraka izy ka hanan-janaka.'),
  ('6aadc729b5f8c18f07d1eb9f', '2026-09-18T23:20:09.192Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:09.192Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 5, 27, 'Rehefa ampisotroiny an’ilay vehivavy ilay rano, ary raha nandoto ny tenany izy ka nivadika tamin’ny vadiny, dia hiditra ao anatiny ilay rano mitondra ozona, ka hijalijaly izy. Dia hibontsina ny kibony ka tsy ho afaka hiteraka izy, ary ny anarany no hampiasain’ny fireneny rehefa manozona.', 'rehefa ampisotroiny an’ilay vehivavy ilay rano, ary raha nandoto ny tenany izy ka nivadika tamin’ny vadiny, dia hiditra ao anatiny ilay rano mitondra ozona, ka hijalijaly izy. dia hibontsina ny kibony ka tsy ho afaka hiteraka izy, ary ny anarany no hampiasain’ny fireneny rehefa manozona.'),
  ('6aadc729b5f8c18f07d1eb9e', '2026-09-18T23:20:09.192Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:09.192Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 5, 26, 'Haka eran’ny tanan’ila amin’ilay fanatitra varimbazaha ny mpisorona mba hatao santionany amin’ilay fanatitra. Ary hodorany eo ambony alitara ilay izy mba hidona-tsetroka. Dia hampisotroiny an’ilay vehivavy ilay rano.', 'haka eran’ny tanan’ila amin’ilay fanatitra varimbazaha ny mpisorona mba hatao santionany amin’ilay fanatitra. ary hodorany eo ambony alitara ilay izy mba hidona-tsetroka. dia hampisotroiny an’ilay vehivavy ilay rano.'),
  ('6aadc729b5f8c18f07d1eb9d', '2026-09-18T23:20:09.192Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:09.192Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 5, 25, 'Ary halain’ny mpisorona eny an-tanan’ilay vehivavy ilay fanatitra varimbazaha atolotra noho ny fahasarotam-piaro, ka hahetsiketsiny eo anatrehan’i Jehovah, dia hoentiny eo akaikin’ny alitara.', 'ary halain’ny mpisorona eny an-tanan’ilay vehivavy ilay fanatitra varimbazaha atolotra noho ny fahasarotam-piaro, ka hahetsiketsiny eo anatrehan’i jehovah, dia hoentiny eo akaikin’ny alitara.'),
  ('6aadc729b5f8c18f07d1eb9c', '2026-09-18T23:20:09.192Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:09.192Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 5, 24, 'Avy eo dia hampisotroiny an’ilay vehivavy ilay rano mangidy mitondra ozona, dia hiditra ao anatiny ka hijalijaly izy.', 'avy eo dia hampisotroiny an’ilay vehivavy ilay rano mangidy mitondra ozona, dia hiditra ao anatiny ka hijalijaly izy.'),
  ('6aadc729b5f8c18f07d1eb9b', '2026-09-18T23:20:09.192Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:09.192Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 5, 23, '“‘Dia hosoratan’ny mpisorona ao anaty boky ireo ozona ireo ka hofafany ao anatin’ilay rano mangidy.', '“‘dia hosoratan’ny mpisorona ao anaty boky ireo ozona ireo ka hofafany ao anatin’ilay rano mangidy.'),
  ('6aadc729b5f8c18f07d1eb9a', '2026-09-18T23:20:09.192Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:09.192Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 5, 22, 'Hiditra ao amin’ny tsinainao ity rano mitondra ozona ity, ka hampibontsina ny kibonao dia tsy ho afaka hiteraka ianao.” Dia tokony hiteny ilay vehivavy hoe: “Amena! Amena!”', 'hiditra ao amin’ny tsinainao ity rano mitondra ozona ity, ka hampibontsina ny kibonao dia tsy ho afaka hiteraka ianao.” dia tokony hiteny ilay vehivavy hoe: “amena! amena!”'),
  ('6aadc729b5f8c18f07d1eb99', '2026-09-18T23:20:09.192Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:09.192Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 5, 21, 'Dia hasain’ny mpisorona mianiana sy miozona ilay vehivavy, sady hotenenin’ilay mpisorona hoe: “Enga anie ny anaranao ka hataon’i Jehovah fampiasan’ny firenenao rehefa manozona na mianiana, ary enga anie hataon’i Jehovah tsy miteraka ianao, dia hataony mibontsina ny kibonao!', 'dia hasain’ny mpisorona mianiana sy miozona ilay vehivavy, sady hotenenin’ilay mpisorona hoe: “enga anie ny anaranao ka hataon’i jehovah fampiasan’ny firenenao rehefa manozona na mianiana, ary enga anie hataon’i jehovah tsy miteraka ianao, dia hataony mibontsina ny kibonao!'),
  ('6aadc729b5f8c18f07d1eb98', '2026-09-18T23:20:09.192Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:09.192Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 5, 20, 'Fa raha nanota ianao ka nandoto tena nefa mbola eo ambany fahefan’ny vadinao, ary efa nanao firaisana tamin’ny lehilahy hafa ankoatra ny vadinao...”', 'fa raha nanota ianao ka nandoto tena nefa mbola eo ambany fahefan’ny vadinao, ary efa nanao firaisana tamin’ny lehilahy hafa ankoatra ny vadinao...”'),
  ('6aadc729b5f8c18f07d1eb97', '2026-09-18T23:20:09.192Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:09.192Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 5, 19, '“‘Dia hasain’ilay mpisorona mianiana ilay vehivavy, sady hoteneniny hoe: “Raha tsy nisy lehilahy nanao firaisana taminao, amin’izao ianao mbola eo ambany fahefan’ny vadinao izao, ary tsy hoe nanota ianao ka nandoto ny tenanao, dia enga anie tsy hampaninona anao ity rano mangidy mitondra ozona ity!', '“‘dia hasain’ilay mpisorona mianiana ilay vehivavy, sady hoteneniny hoe: “raha tsy nisy lehilahy nanao firaisana taminao, amin’izao ianao mbola eo ambany fahefan’ny vadinao izao, ary tsy hoe nanota ianao ka nandoto ny tenanao, dia enga anie tsy hampaninona anao ity rano mangidy mitondra ozona ity!'),
  ('6aadc7296b2bd32666afc051', '2026-09-18T23:20:09.688Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:09.688Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 6, 27, 'Ary hampiasa ny anarako eo amin’ny vahoakan’Israely izy ireo, mba hitahiako azy.”', 'ary hampiasa ny anarako eo amin’ny vahoakan’israely izy ireo, mba hitahiako azy.”'),
  ('6aadc7296b2bd32666afc050', '2026-09-18T23:20:09.688Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:09.688Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 6, 26, 'Ho tsara fanahy aminao anie i Jehovah ka hanome fiadanana anao!”’', 'ho tsara fanahy aminao anie i jehovah ka hanome fiadanana anao!”’'),
  ('6aadc7296b2bd32666afc04f', '2026-09-18T23:20:09.688Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:09.688Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 6, 25, 'Ho miramirana aminao anie i Jehovah ka hankasitraka anao!', 'ho miramirana aminao anie i jehovah ka hankasitraka anao!'),
  ('6aadc7296b2bd32666afc04e', '2026-09-18T23:20:09.688Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:09.688Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 6, 24, '“Enga anie i Jehovah hitahy anao sy hiaro anao!', '“enga anie i jehovah hitahy anao sy hiaro anao!'),
  ('6aadc7296b2bd32666afc04d', '2026-09-18T23:20:09.688Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:09.688Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 6, 23, '“Teneno i Arona sy ny zanany hoe: ‘Izao no tsodrano hataonareo amin’ny vahoakan’Israely:', '“teneno i arona sy ny zanany hoe: ‘izao no tsodrano hataonareo amin’ny vahoakan’israely:'),
  ('6aadc7296b2bd32666afc04c', '2026-09-18T23:20:09.688Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:09.688Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 6, 22, 'Ary hoy i Jehovah tamin’i Mosesy:', 'ary hoy i jehovah tamin’i mosesy:'),
  ('6aadc7296b2bd32666afc04b', '2026-09-18T23:20:09.688Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:09.688Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 6, 21, '“‘Izao no lalàna momba ny Nazirita manao voady: Raha mivoady izy ka afaka manao fanatitra ho an’i Jehovah ankoatra an’izay efa takina aminy, dia tsy maintsy manefa ny voadiny izy mba hanarahany an’ilay lalàna momba ny Nazirita.’”', '“‘izao no lalàna momba ny nazirita manao voady: raha mivoady izy ka afaka manao fanatitra ho an’i jehovah ankoatra an’izay efa takina aminy, dia tsy maintsy manefa ny voadiny izy mba hanarahany an’ilay lalàna momba ny nazirita.’”'),
  ('6aadc7296b2bd32666afc04a', '2026-09-18T23:20:09.688Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:09.688Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 6, 20, 'Dia hahetsiketsiky ny mpisorona ho fanatitra ahetsiketsika eo anatrehan’i Jehovah ireo. Zava-masina ho an’ny mpisorona ireo, ankoatra ny tratran’ilay ondrilahy atao fanatitra ahetsiketsika sy ny feny atao fanomezana. Aorian’izay dia mahazo misotro divay ilay Nazirita.', 'dia hahetsiketsiky ny mpisorona ho fanatitra ahetsiketsika eo anatrehan’i jehovah ireo. zava-masina ho an’ny mpisorona ireo, ankoatra ny tratran’ilay ondrilahy atao fanatitra ahetsiketsika sy ny feny atao fanomezana. aorian’izay dia mahazo misotro divay ilay nazirita.'),
  ('6aadc7296b2bd32666afc049', '2026-09-18T23:20:09.688Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:09.688Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 6, 19, 'Ary halain’ny mpisorona ny sorok’ilay ondrilahy, dia ny sorony iray efa nandrahoina, sy ny mofo boribory iray tsy misy lalivay avy ao anatin’ilay harona, ary ny mofo fisaka iray tsy misy lalivay. Dia hataony eo am-pelatanan’ilay Nazirita ireo, rehefa avy nasain’ilay Nazirita noharatana ilay famantarana ny maha Nazirita azy.', 'ary halain’ny mpisorona ny sorok’ilay ondrilahy, dia ny sorony iray efa nandrahoina, sy ny mofo boribory iray tsy misy lalivay avy ao anatin’ilay harona, ary ny mofo fisaka iray tsy misy lalivay. dia hataony eo am-pelatanan’ilay nazirita ireo, rehefa avy nasain’ilay nazirita noharatana ilay famantarana ny maha nazirita azy.'),
  ('6aadc7296b2bd32666afc048', '2026-09-18T23:20:09.688Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:09.688Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 6, 18, '“‘Ary hoharatan’ilay Nazirita eo amin’ny fidirana amin’ny tranolay fihaonana ny volon-dohany. Dia halainy ilay volony lava nandritra ny naha Nazirita azy ka hataony ao anaty afo, eo ambanin’ilay sorona iombonana.', '“‘ary hoharatan’ilay nazirita eo amin’ny fidirana amin’ny tranolay fihaonana ny volon-dohany. dia halainy ilay volony lava nandritra ny naha nazirita azy ka hataony ao anaty afo, eo ambanin’ilay sorona iombonana.'),
  ('6aadc7296b2bd32666afc047', '2026-09-18T23:20:09.688Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:09.688Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 6, 17, 'Hatolony ho an’i Jehovah mba ho sorona iombonana ilay ondrilahy, miaraka amin’ilay harona misy mofo tsy nasiana lalivay. Hatolony miaraka amin’ilay izy koa ny fanatitra varimbazaha sy ny fanatitra zava-pisotro.', 'hatolony ho an’i jehovah mba ho sorona iombonana ilay ondrilahy, miaraka amin’ilay harona misy mofo tsy nasiana lalivay. hatolony miaraka amin’ilay izy koa ny fanatitra varimbazaha sy ny fanatitra zava-pisotro.'),
  ('6aadc7296b2bd32666afc046', '2026-09-18T23:20:09.688Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:09.688Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 6, 16, 'Hoentin’ilay mpisorona eo anatrehan’i Jehovah daholo ireo. Dia hanolotra ny fanatitra noho ny ota sy ny fanatitra dorana aterin’ilay olona izy.', 'hoentin’ilay mpisorona eo anatrehan’i jehovah daholo ireo. dia hanolotra ny fanatitra noho ny ota sy ny fanatitra dorana aterin’ilay olona izy.'),
  ('6aadc7296b2bd32666afc045', '2026-09-18T23:20:09.688Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:09.688Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 6, 15, 'harona misy mofo boribory vita amin’ny lafarinina tsara toto tsy misy lalivay sady nafangaro menaka, mofo fisaka tsy misy lalivay sady nohosorana menaka, ary ny fanatitra varimbazaha sy ny fanatitra zava-pisotro.', 'harona misy mofo boribory vita amin’ny lafarinina tsara toto tsy misy lalivay sady nafangaro menaka, mofo fisaka tsy misy lalivay sady nohosorana menaka, ary ny fanatitra varimbazaha sy ny fanatitra zava-pisotro.'),
  ('6aadc7296b2bd32666afc044', '2026-09-18T23:20:09.688Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:09.688Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 6, 14, 'Dia hatolony ho fanatitra ho an’i Jehovah ireto: Ondrilahy kely iray tsy misy kilema sady tsy mihoatra ny herintaona ho fanatitra dorana, ondrivavy kely iray tsy misy kilema sady tsy mihoatra ny herintaona ho fanatitra noho ny ota, ondrilahy iray tsy misy kilema ho sorona iombonana,', 'dia hatolony ho fanatitra ho an’i jehovah ireto: ondrilahy kely iray tsy misy kilema sady tsy mihoatra ny herintaona ho fanatitra dorana, ondrivavy kely iray tsy misy kilema sady tsy mihoatra ny herintaona ho fanatitra noho ny ota, ondrilahy iray tsy misy kilema ho sorona iombonana,'),
  ('6aadc7296b2bd32666afc043', '2026-09-18T23:20:09.688Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:09.688Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 6, 13, '“‘Ary izao no lalàna momba ny Nazirita: Rehefa tapitra ny andro maha Nazirita azy, dia hoentina eo amin’ny fidirana amin’ny tranolay fihaonana izy.', '“‘ary izao no lalàna momba ny nazirita: rehefa tapitra ny andro maha nazirita azy, dia hoentina eo amin’ny fidirana amin’ny tranolay fihaonana izy.'),
  ('6aadc7296b2bd32666afc042', '2026-09-18T23:20:09.688Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:09.688Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 6, 12, 'Dia ho Nazirita eo anatrehan’i Jehovah indray izy mandritra an’ireo andro maha Nazirita azy. Hitondra ondrilahy kely tsy mihoatra ny herintaona koa izy ho fanatitra noho ny heloka. Tsy hisaina anefa ireo andro teo aloha, satria nolotoiny ny maha Nazirita azy.', 'dia ho nazirita eo anatrehan’i jehovah indray izy mandritra an’ireo andro maha nazirita azy. hitondra ondrilahy kely tsy mihoatra ny herintaona koa izy ho fanatitra noho ny heloka. tsy hisaina anefa ireo andro teo aloha, satria nolotoiny ny maha nazirita azy.'),
  ('6aadc7296b2bd32666afc041', '2026-09-18T23:20:09.688Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:09.688Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 6, 11, 'Dia hokarakarain’ny mpisorona mba ho fanatitra noho ny ota ny iray, fa ny iray kosa ho fanatitra dorana. Izany no handrakofana ny fahotan’ilay olona nanota noho izy nikasika faty. Dia hanamasina ny lohany ilay olona amin’io andro io.', 'dia hokarakarain’ny mpisorona mba ho fanatitra noho ny ota ny iray, fa ny iray kosa ho fanatitra dorana. izany no handrakofana ny fahotan’ilay olona nanota noho izy nikasika faty. dia hanamasina ny lohany ilay olona amin’io andro io.'),
  ('6aadc7296b2bd32666afc040', '2026-09-18T23:20:09.688Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:09.688Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 6, 10, 'Amin’ny andro fahavalo kosa izy hitondra domohina roa na zana-boromailala roa any amin’ny mpisorona, eo amin’ny fidirana amin’ny tranolay fihaonana.', 'amin’ny andro fahavalo kosa izy hitondra domohina roa na zana-boromailala roa any amin’ny mpisorona, eo amin’ny fidirana amin’ny tranolay fihaonana.'),
  ('6aadc7296b2bd32666afc03f', '2026-09-18T23:20:09.688Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:09.688Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 6, 9, 'Fa raha misy olona maty tampoka kosa eo akaikiny ka voaloto ilay volo famantarana hoe nanokan-tena ho an’Andriamanitra izy, dia hosolainy ny lohany amin’ny andro hanekena azy hoe madio. Tokony hosolaina izy amin’ny andro fahafito.', 'fa raha misy olona maty tampoka kosa eo akaikiny ka voaloto ilay volo famantarana hoe nanokan-tena ho an’andriamanitra izy, dia hosolainy ny lohany amin’ny andro hanekena azy hoe madio. tokony hosolaina izy amin’ny andro fahafito.'),
  ('6aadc7296b2bd32666afc03e', '2026-09-18T23:20:09.688Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:09.688Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 6, 8, '“‘Masina eo anatrehan’i Jehovah izy amin’ny andro rehetra maha Nazirita azy.', '“‘masina eo anatrehan’i jehovah izy amin’ny andro rehetra maha nazirita azy.'),
  ('6aadc7296b2bd32666afc03d', '2026-09-18T23:20:09.688Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:09.688Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 6, 7, 'Tsy mahazo mandoto ny tenany izy, na dia rehefa maty aza ny rainy na ny reniny na ny rahalahiny na ny anabaviny, satria ny volony lava no amantarana hoe Nazirita eo anatrehan’Andriamaniny izy.', 'tsy mahazo mandoto ny tenany izy, na dia rehefa maty aza ny rainy na ny reniny na ny rahalahiny na ny anabaviny, satria ny volony lava no amantarana hoe nazirita eo anatrehan’andriamaniny izy.'),
  ('6aadc7296b2bd32666afc03c', '2026-09-18T23:20:09.688Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:09.688Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 6, 6, 'Tsy tokony hanakaikikaiky faty izy mandritra ny andro rehetra anokanany tena ho an’i Jehovah.', 'tsy tokony hanakaikikaiky faty izy mandritra ny andro rehetra anokanany tena ho an’i jehovah.'),
  ('6aadc7296b2bd32666afc03b', '2026-09-18T23:20:09.688Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:09.688Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 6, 5, '“‘Tsy tokony hotapahina ny volony amin’ny andro rehetra anefany ny voadiny ho Nazirita. Tokony ho masina foana izy ka havelany ho lava ny volon-dohany, mandra-pahatapitr’ireo andro anokanany tena ho an’i Jehovah.', '“‘tsy tokony hotapahina ny volony amin’ny andro rehetra anefany ny voadiny ho nazirita. tokony ho masina foana izy ka havelany ho lava ny volon-dohany, mandra-pahatapitr’ireo andro anokanany tena ho an’i jehovah.'),
  ('6aadc7296b2bd32666afc03a', '2026-09-18T23:20:09.688Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:09.688Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 6, 4, 'Tsy hihinana na inona na inona avy amin’ny voaloboka izy, na voaloboka manta izany, na ny hoditry ny voaloboka aza, amin’ny andro rehetra maha Nazirita azy.', 'tsy hihinana na inona na inona avy amin’ny voaloboka izy, na voaloboka manta izany, na ny hoditry ny voaloboka aza, amin’ny andro rehetra maha nazirita azy.'),
  ('6aadc7296b2bd32666afc039', '2026-09-18T23:20:09.688Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:09.688Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 6, 3, 'dia tokony hifady divay sy toaka izy. Tsy hisotro vinaingitra vita amin’ny divay na vita amin’ny zava-pisotro misy alkaola izy. Tsy tokony hisotro ranon-javatra vita amin’ny voaloboka izy, na hihinana voaloboka lena na maina.', 'dia tokony hifady divay sy toaka izy. tsy hisotro vinaingitra vita amin’ny divay na vita amin’ny zava-pisotro misy alkaola izy. tsy tokony hisotro ranon-javatra vita amin’ny voaloboka izy, na hihinana voaloboka lena na maina.'),
  ('6aadc7296b2bd32666afc038', '2026-09-18T23:20:09.688Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:09.688Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 6, 2, '“Teneno ny Israelita hoe: ‘Raha misy lehilahy na vehivavy manao voady manokana ho Nazirita ho an’i Jehovah,', '“teneno ny israelita hoe: ‘raha misy lehilahy na vehivavy manao voady manokana ho nazirita ho an’i jehovah,'),
  ('6aadc7296b2bd32666afc037', '2026-09-18T23:20:09.688Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:09.688Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 6, 1, 'Hoy koa i Jehovah tamin’i Mosesy:', 'hoy koa i jehovah tamin’i mosesy:'),
  ('6aadc72af0d6fc751ec29ba7', '2026-09-18T23:20:10.671Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:10.671Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 7, 45, 'vantotr’ombilahy iray sy ondrilahy iray ary ondrilahy kely iray tsy mihoatra ny herintaona, hatao fanatitra dorana;', 'vantotr’ombilahy iray sy ondrilahy iray ary ondrilahy kely iray tsy mihoatra ny herintaona, hatao fanatitra dorana;'),
