  ('6aadc72af0d6fc751ec29b87', '2026-09-18T23:20:10.671Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:10.671Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 7, 13, 'Ny fanatitra nataony dia vilia volafotsy iray milanja 130 sekely, sy vilia baolina volafotsy iray milanja 70 sekely, araka ny sekely fampiasa ao amin’ny toerana masina, ary samy feno lafarinina tsara toto nafangaro menaka ireo vilia ireo, mba hatao fanatitra varimbazaha;', 'ny fanatitra nataony dia vilia volafotsy iray milanja 130 sekely, sy vilia baolina volafotsy iray milanja 70 sekely, araka ny sekely fampiasa ao amin’ny toerana masina, ary samy feno lafarinina tsara toto nafangaro menaka ireo vilia ireo, mba hatao fanatitra varimbazaha;'),
  ('6aadc72af0d6fc751ec29b86', '2026-09-18T23:20:10.671Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:10.671Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 7, 12, 'I Nasona zanak’i Aminadaba avy amin’ny fokon’i Joda no nanolotra ny fanatiny tamin’ny andro voalohany.', 'i nasona zanak’i aminadaba avy amin’ny fokon’i joda no nanolotra ny fanatiny tamin’ny andro voalohany.'),
  ('6aadc72af0d6fc751ec29b85', '2026-09-18T23:20:10.671Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:10.671Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 7, 11, 'dia hoy i Jehovah tamin’i Mosesy: “Mpiadidy iray isan’andro no hanolotra fanatitra hitokanana ny alitara.”', 'dia hoy i jehovah tamin’i mosesy: “mpiadidy iray isan’andro no hanolotra fanatitra hitokanana ny alitara.”'),
  ('6aadc72af0d6fc751ec29b84', '2026-09-18T23:20:10.671Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:10.671Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 7, 10, 'Dia nanao fanatitra indray ny mpiadidy rehefa notokanana ny alitara, tamin’ny andro nanosorana an’ilay izy. Rehefa nanolotra ny fanatiny teo anoloan’ny alitara izy ireo,', 'dia nanao fanatitra indray ny mpiadidy rehefa notokanana ny alitara, tamin’ny andro nanosorana an’ilay izy. rehefa nanolotra ny fanatiny teo anoloan’ny alitara izy ireo,'),
  ('6aadc72af0d6fc751ec29b83', '2026-09-18T23:20:10.671Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:10.671Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 7, 9, 'Tsy nomeny na inona na inona kosa ny taranak’i Kehata, satria nifandray tamin’ny toerana masina ny fanompoana nataon’izy ireo, ary nolanjainy teny an-tsorony ny zava-masina.', 'tsy nomeny na inona na inona kosa ny taranak’i kehata, satria nifandray tamin’ny toerana masina ny fanompoana nataon’izy ireo, ary nolanjainy teny an-tsorony ny zava-masina.'),
  ('6aadc72af0d6fc751ec29b82', '2026-09-18T23:20:10.671Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:10.671Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 7, 8, 'Ny taranak’i Merary indray nomeny sarety efatra sy omby valo, fa izany no nilainy mba hamitany ny andraikiny. Ary i Itamara zanak’i Arona mpisorona no niandraikitra azy ireo.', 'ny taranak’i merary indray nomeny sarety efatra sy omby valo, fa izany no nilainy mba hamitany ny andraikiny. ary i itamara zanak’i arona mpisorona no niandraikitra azy ireo.'),
  ('6aadc72af0d6fc751ec29b81', '2026-09-18T23:20:10.671Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:10.671Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 7, 7, 'Nomeny sarety roa sy omby efatra ny taranak’i Gersona, fa izany no nilainy mba hamitany ny andraikiny.', 'nomeny sarety roa sy omby efatra ny taranak’i gersona, fa izany no nilainy mba hamitany ny andraikiny.'),
  ('6aadc72af0d6fc751ec29b80', '2026-09-18T23:20:10.671Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:10.671Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 7, 6, 'Noraisin’i Mosesy àry ireo sarety sy omby ireo dia nomeny ny Levita.', 'noraisin’i mosesy àry ireo sarety sy omby ireo dia nomeny ny levita.'),
  ('6aadc72af0d6fc751ec29b7f', '2026-09-18T23:20:10.671Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:10.671Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 7, 5, '“Raiso ireo fanatitra nomeny ireo, satria ireo no hampiasaina amin’ny fanompoana ao amin’ny tranolay fihaonana. Tokony homenao ny Levita ireo, araka izay ilain’ny tsirairay amin’ny andraikiny.”', '“raiso ireo fanatitra nomeny ireo, satria ireo no hampiasaina amin’ny fanompoana ao amin’ny tranolay fihaonana. tokony homenao ny levita ireo, araka izay ilain’ny tsirairay amin’ny andraikiny.”'),
  ('6aadc72af0d6fc751ec29b7e', '2026-09-18T23:20:10.671Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:10.671Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 7, 4, 'Ary hoy i Jehovah tamin’i Mosesy:', 'ary hoy i jehovah tamin’i mosesy:'),
  ('6aadc72af0d6fc751ec29b7d', '2026-09-18T23:20:10.671Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:10.671Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 7, 3, 'ary nitondra ny fanatiny teo anatrehan’i Jehovah, dia sarety enina mitafo sy omby 12, ka sarety iray no nomen’ny mpiadidy roa, ary ombilahy iray no nomen’ny mpiadidy tsirairay. Dia nentin’izy ireo teo anoloan’ny tranolay masina ireny.', 'ary nitondra ny fanatiny teo anatrehan’i jehovah, dia sarety enina mitafo sy omby 12, ka sarety iray no nomen’ny mpiadidy roa, ary ombilahy iray no nomen’ny mpiadidy tsirairay. dia nentin’izy ireo teo anoloan’ny tranolay masina ireny.'),
  ('6aadc72af0d6fc751ec29b7c', '2026-09-18T23:20:10.671Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:10.671Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 7, 2, 'dia nanao fanatitra ny mpiadidy teo amin’ny Israely, izany hoe ireo lohan’ny fianakaviambe. Ireo mpiadidy teo amin’ny foko ireo no nanara-maso ny fanisam-bahoaka,', 'dia nanao fanatitra ny mpiadidy teo amin’ny israely, izany hoe ireo lohan’ny fianakaviambe. ireo mpiadidy teo amin’ny foko ireo no nanara-maso ny fanisam-bahoaka,'),
  ('6aadc72af0d6fc751ec29b7b', '2026-09-18T23:20:10.671Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:10.671Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 7, 1, 'Rehefa voatsangan’i Mosesy ny tranolay masina, dia nohosorany sy nohamasininy tamin’iny andro iny ihany ilay tranolay sy ny kojakojany rehetra, ary ny alitara sy ny fitaovany rehetra. Rehefa avy nohosorany sy nohamasininy ireny,', 'rehefa voatsangan’i mosesy ny tranolay masina, dia nohosorany sy nohamasininy tamin’iny andro iny ihany ilay tranolay sy ny kojakojany rehetra, ary ny alitara sy ny fitaovany rehetra. rehefa avy nohosorany sy nohamasininy ireny,'),
  ('6aadc72af0d6fc751ec29bd3', '2026-09-18T23:20:10.672Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:10.672Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 7, 89, 'Isaky ny niditra tao amin’ny tranolay fihaonana mba hiresaka tamin’Andriamanitra i Mosesy, dia naheno an’ilay feo niresaka taminy avy teo ambonin’ny saron’ilay Vata Misy ny Tenin’ny Vavolombelona, avy teo anelanelan’ny kerobima roa. Ary niresaka taminy Andriamanitra.', 'isaky ny niditra tao amin’ny tranolay fihaonana mba hiresaka tamin’andriamanitra i mosesy, dia naheno an’ilay feo niresaka taminy avy teo ambonin’ny saron’ilay vata misy ny tenin’ny vavolombelona, avy teo anelanelan’ny kerobima roa. ary niresaka taminy andriamanitra.'),
  ('6aadc72af0d6fc751ec29bd2', '2026-09-18T23:20:10.672Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:10.672Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 7, 88, 'Ny biby rehetra natao sorona iombonana kosa dia ombilahy 24, ondrilahy 60, osilahy 60, ary ondrilahy kely 60 izay herintaona avy. Ireo no fanatitra natao tamin’ny fitokanana ny alitara, rehefa avy nohosorana izy io.', 'ny biby rehetra natao sorona iombonana kosa dia ombilahy 24, ondrilahy 60, osilahy 60, ary ondrilahy kely 60 izay herintaona avy. ireo no fanatitra natao tamin’ny fitokanana ny alitara, rehefa avy nohosorana izy io.'),
  ('6aadc72af0d6fc751ec29bd1', '2026-09-18T23:20:10.672Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:10.672Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 7, 87, 'Ny biby rehetra natao fanatitra dorana dia ombilahy 12, ondrilahy 12, ondrilahy kely 12 izay herintaona avy, nampiarahina tamin’ny fanatitra varimbazaha, ary zanak’osy 12 natao fanatitra noho ny ota.', 'ny biby rehetra natao fanatitra dorana dia ombilahy 12, ondrilahy 12, ondrilahy kely 12 izay herintaona avy, nampiarahina tamin’ny fanatitra varimbazaha, ary zanak’osy 12 natao fanatitra noho ny ota.'),
  ('6aadc72af0d6fc751ec29bd0', '2026-09-18T23:20:10.672Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:10.672Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 7, 86, 'Ary milanja 10 sekely avy, araka ny sekely fampiasa ao amin’ny toerana masina, ireo kaopy volamena 12 feno emboka manitra, ka milanja 120 sekely ny volamena rehetra nanaovana an’ireo kaopy.', 'ary milanja 10 sekely avy, araka ny sekely fampiasa ao amin’ny toerana masina, ireo kaopy volamena 12 feno emboka manitra, ka milanja 120 sekely ny volamena rehetra nanaovana an’ireo kaopy.'),
  ('6aadc72af0d6fc751ec29bcf', '2026-09-18T23:20:10.672Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:10.672Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 7, 85, 'Milanja 130 sekely avy ny vilia volafotsy tsirairay, ary 70 sekely avy ny vilia baolina tsirairay, ka 2 400 sekely, araka ny sekely fampiasa ao amin’ny toerana masina, ny lanjan’ny volafotsy rehetra nanaovana an’ireo vilia.', 'milanja 130 sekely avy ny vilia volafotsy tsirairay, ary 70 sekely avy ny vilia baolina tsirairay, ka 2 400 sekely, araka ny sekely fampiasa ao amin’ny toerana masina, ny lanjan’ny volafotsy rehetra nanaovana an’ireo vilia.'),
  ('6aadc72af0d6fc751ec29bce', '2026-09-18T23:20:10.672Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:10.672Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 7, 84, 'Ireto no fanatitra avy tamin’ny mpiadidy teo amin’ny Israely rehefa notokanana sy nohosorana ny alitara: Vilia volafotsy 12, sy vilia baolina volafotsy 12, ary kaopy volamena 12.', 'ireto no fanatitra avy tamin’ny mpiadidy teo amin’ny israely rehefa notokanana sy nohosorana ny alitara: vilia volafotsy 12, sy vilia baolina volafotsy 12, ary kaopy volamena 12.'),
  ('6aadc72af0d6fc751ec29bcd', '2026-09-18T23:20:10.672Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:10.672Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 7, 83, 'ary omby roa sy ondrilahy dimy sy osilahy dimy ary ondrilahy kely dimy izay herintaona avy, hatao sorona iombonana. Ireo no fanatitr’i Ahira zanak’i Enana.', 'ary omby roa sy ondrilahy dimy sy osilahy dimy ary ondrilahy kely dimy izay herintaona avy, hatao sorona iombonana. ireo no fanatitr’i ahira zanak’i enana.'),
