  ('6aadc72b47af9571761e601e', '2026-09-18T23:20:11.670Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:11.670Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 8, 25, 'Hitsahatra tsy ho anisan’ireo manao fanompoana ireo anefa izy rehefa feno 50 taona, ka tsy hanompo intsony.', 'hitsahatra tsy ho anisan’ireo manao fanompoana ireo anefa izy rehefa feno 50 taona, ka tsy hanompo intsony.'),
  ('6aadc72b47af9571761e601d', '2026-09-18T23:20:11.670Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:11.670Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 8, 24, '“Izao no toromarika ho an’ny Levita: Izay lehilahy 25 taona no ho miakatra no hiditra ho anisan’ireo manao fanompoana ao amin’ny tranolay fihaonana.', '“izao no toromarika ho an’ny levita: izay lehilahy 25 taona no ho miakatra no hiditra ho anisan’ireo manao fanompoana ao amin’ny tranolay fihaonana.'),
  ('6aadc72b47af9571761e601c', '2026-09-18T23:20:11.670Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:11.670Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 8, 23, 'Ary hoy i Jehovah tamin’i Mosesy:', 'ary hoy i jehovah tamin’i mosesy:'),
  ('6aadc72b47af9571761e601b', '2026-09-18T23:20:11.670Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:11.670Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 8, 22, 'Taorian’izay dia niditra tao amin’ny tranolay fihaonana ny Levita mba hanao ny fanompoany teo anatrehan’i Arona sy ny zanany lahy. Araka ny didy nomen’i Jehovah an’i Mosesy momba ny Levita no natao tamin’izy ireo.', 'taorian’izay dia niditra tao amin’ny tranolay fihaonana ny levita mba hanao ny fanompoany teo anatrehan’i arona sy ny zanany lahy. araka ny didy nomen’i jehovah an’i mosesy momba ny levita no natao tamin’izy ireo.'),
  ('6aadc72b47af9571761e601a', '2026-09-18T23:20:11.670Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:11.670Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 8, 21, 'Nanadio ny tenany àry ny Levita, dia nanasa ny akanjony. Avy eo dia natolotr’i Arona ho fanatitra ahetsiketsika teo anatrehan’i Jehovah izy ireo. Dia nandrakotra ny fahotan’izy ireo i Arona mba hanadiovana azy.', 'nanadio ny tenany àry ny levita, dia nanasa ny akanjony. avy eo dia natolotr’i arona ho fanatitra ahetsiketsika teo anatrehan’i jehovah izy ireo. dia nandrakotra ny fahotan’izy ireo i arona mba hanadiovana azy.'),
  ('6aadc72b47af9571761e6019', '2026-09-18T23:20:11.670Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:11.670Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 8, 20, 'Izany no nataon’i Mosesy sy Arona ary ny vahoakan’Israely manontolo tamin’ny Levita. Araka ny didy rehetra nomen’i Jehovah an’i Mosesy momba ny Levita no nataon’ny Israelita tamin’izy ireo.', 'izany no nataon’i mosesy sy arona ary ny vahoakan’israely manontolo tamin’ny levita. araka ny didy rehetra nomen’i jehovah an’i mosesy momba ny levita no nataon’ny israelita tamin’izy ireo.'),
  ('6aadc72b47af9571761e6018', '2026-09-18T23:20:11.670Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:11.670Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 8, 19, 'Dia homeko an’i Arona sy ny zanany lahy ny Levita, izay nofidiko avy amin’ny Israelita, mba hanao ny fanompoana tokony hataon’ny Israelita ao amin’ny tranolay fihaonana, sady handrakotra ny fahotan’ny Israelita. Amin’izay dia tsy hisy loza hanjo ny vahoakan’Israely satria hoe nanakaiky ny toerana masina izy ireo.”', 'dia homeko an’i arona sy ny zanany lahy ny levita, izay nofidiko avy amin’ny israelita, mba hanao ny fanompoana tokony hataon’ny israelita ao amin’ny tranolay fihaonana, sady handrakotra ny fahotan’ny israelita. amin’izay dia tsy hisy loza hanjo ny vahoakan’israely satria hoe nanakaiky ny toerana masina izy ireo.”'),
  ('6aadc72b47af9571761e6017', '2026-09-18T23:20:11.670Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:11.670Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 8, 18, 'Halaiko ho solon’ny lahimatoa rehetra eo amin’ny Israelita ny Levita.', 'halaiko ho solon’ny lahimatoa rehetra eo amin’ny israelita ny levita.'),
  ('6aadc72b47af9571761e6016', '2026-09-18T23:20:11.670Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:11.670Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 8, 17, 'Fa ahy izay lahy teraka voalohany rehetra eo amin’ny Israelita, na olona na biby. Nohamasiniko ho ahy izy ireo tamin’ilay andro namonoako ny lahimatoa rehetra tany Ejipta.', 'fa ahy izay lahy teraka voalohany rehetra eo amin’ny israelita, na olona na biby. nohamasiniko ho ahy izy ireo tamin’ilay andro namonoako ny lahimatoa rehetra tany ejipta.'),
  ('6aadc72b47af9571761e6015', '2026-09-18T23:20:11.670Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:11.670Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 8, 16, 'Fanomezana mantsy izy ireo, dia fanomezana nomen’ny Israelita ahy. Halaiko ho ahy izy ireo, ho solon’ny lahimatoa rehetra eo amin’ny Israelita.', 'fanomezana mantsy izy ireo, dia fanomezana nomen’ny israelita ahy. halaiko ho ahy izy ireo, ho solon’ny lahimatoa rehetra eo amin’ny israelita.'),
  ('6aadc72b47af9571761e6014', '2026-09-18T23:20:11.670Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:11.670Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 8, 15, 'Hiditra hanompo ao amin’ny tranolay fihaonana ny Levita, aorian’izay. Hoatr’izany no hataonao rehefa manadio azy ireo sy manolotra azy ho fanatitra ahetsiketsika.', 'hiditra hanompo ao amin’ny tranolay fihaonana ny levita, aorian’izay. hoatr’izany no hataonao rehefa manadio azy ireo sy manolotra azy ho fanatitra ahetsiketsika.'),
  ('6aadc72b47af9571761e6013', '2026-09-18T23:20:11.670Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:11.670Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 8, 14, 'Ary saraho amin’ny Israelita ny Levita, dia ho ahy izy ireo.', 'ary saraho amin’ny israelita ny levita, dia ho ahy izy ireo.'),
  ('6aadc72b47af9571761e6012', '2026-09-18T23:20:11.670Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:11.670Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 8, 13, 'Asaivo mijoro eo anatrehan’i Arona sy ny zanany lahy ny Levita, ka atolory ho fanatitra ahetsiketsika ho an’i Jehovah.', 'asaivo mijoro eo anatrehan’i arona sy ny zanany lahy ny levita, ka atolory ho fanatitra ahetsiketsika ho an’i jehovah.'),
  ('6aadc72b47af9571761e6011', '2026-09-18T23:20:11.670Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:11.670Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 8, 12, '“Avy eo dia hametraka ny tanany eo amin’ny lohan’ireo ombilahy ireo ny Levita. Dia atolory ho fanatitra noho ny ota ny iray, fa ny iray kosa ho fanatitra dorana ho an’i Jehovah, mba handrakofana ny fahotan’ny Levita.', '“avy eo dia hametraka ny tanany eo amin’ny lohan’ireo ombilahy ireo ny levita. dia atolory ho fanatitra noho ny ota ny iray, fa ny iray kosa ho fanatitra dorana ho an’i jehovah, mba handrakofana ny fahotan’ny levita.'),
  ('6aadc72b47af9571761e6010', '2026-09-18T23:20:11.670Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:11.670Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 8, 11, 'Dia hatolotr’i Arona eo anatrehan’i Jehovah ny Levita, ho fanatitra ahetsiketsika avy amin’ny Israelita. Ary hanao ny fanompoana an’i Jehovah izy ireo.', 'dia hatolotr’i arona eo anatrehan’i jehovah ny levita, ho fanatitra ahetsiketsika avy amin’ny israelita. ary hanao ny fanompoana an’i jehovah izy ireo.'),
  ('6aadc72b47af9571761e600f', '2026-09-18T23:20:11.670Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:11.670Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 8, 10, 'Rehefa entinao eo anatrehan’i Jehovah ny Levita, dia hametra-tanana amin’izy ireo ny Israelita.', 'rehefa entinao eo anatrehan’i jehovah ny levita, dia hametra-tanana amin’izy ireo ny israelita.'),
  ('6aadc72b47af9571761e600e', '2026-09-18T23:20:11.670Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:11.670Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 8, 9, 'Dia ento eo anoloan’ny tranolay fihaonana ny Levita, ary vorio ny vahoakan’Israely manontolo.', 'dia ento eo anoloan’ny tranolay fihaonana ny levita, ary vorio ny vahoakan’israely manontolo.'),
  ('6aadc72b47af9571761e600d', '2026-09-18T23:20:11.670Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:11.670Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 8, 8, 'Haka vantotr’ombilahy izy ireo avy eo, dia hampiarahiny amin’ny fanatitra varimbazaha, izany hoe lafarinina tsara toto nafangaro menaka. Haka vantotr’ombilahy hafa iray koa ianao, ho fanatitra noho ny ota.', 'haka vantotr’ombilahy izy ireo avy eo, dia hampiarahiny amin’ny fanatitra varimbazaha, izany hoe lafarinina tsara toto nafangaro menaka. haka vantotr’ombilahy hafa iray koa ianao, ho fanatitra noho ny ota.'),
  ('6aadc72b47af9571761e600c', '2026-09-18T23:20:11.670Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:11.670Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 8, 7, 'Hoatr’izao no hataonao mba hanadiovana azy: Fafazo rano manadio amin’ny ota izy ireo. Dia hokakasany ny tenany manontolo, ka hosasany ny akanjony ary hodioviny ny tenany.', 'hoatr’izao no hataonao mba hanadiovana azy: fafazo rano manadio amin’ny ota izy ireo. dia hokakasany ny tenany manontolo, ka hosasany ny akanjony ary hodioviny ny tenany.'),
  ('6aadc72b47af9571761e600b', '2026-09-18T23:20:11.670Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:11.670Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 8, 6, '“Saraho amin’ny Israelita ny Levita ka diovy.', '“saraho amin’ny israelita ny levita ka diovy.'),
  ('6aadc72b47af9571761e600a', '2026-09-18T23:20:11.670Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:11.670Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 8, 5, 'Hoy koa i Jehovah tamin’i Mosesy:', 'hoy koa i jehovah tamin’i mosesy:'),
  ('6aadc72b47af9571761e6009', '2026-09-18T23:20:11.670Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:11.670Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 8, 4, 'Ary hoatr’izao no nanamboarana an’ilay fitoeran-jiro: Volamena notefena tamin’ny marotoa izy io. Notefena tamin’ny marotoa ilay izy, hatramin’ny sampany ka hatramin’ny felany. Araka ny fahitana nasehon’i Jehovah an’i Mosesy no nanamboarana an’ilay izy.', 'ary hoatr’izao no nanamboarana an’ilay fitoeran-jiro: volamena notefena tamin’ny marotoa izy io. notefena tamin’ny marotoa ilay izy, hatramin’ny sampany ka hatramin’ny felany. araka ny fahitana nasehon’i jehovah an’i mosesy no nanamboarana an’ilay izy.'),
  ('6aadc72b47af9571761e6008', '2026-09-18T23:20:11.670Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:11.670Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 8, 3, 'Izao àry no nataon’i Arona: Nampirehetiny ny jiro mba hanazava an’ilay faritra eo anoloan’ny fitoeran-jiro, araka ny didy nomen’i Jehovah an’i Mosesy.', 'izao àry no nataon’i arona: nampirehetiny ny jiro mba hanazava an’ilay faritra eo anoloan’ny fitoeran-jiro, araka ny didy nomen’i jehovah an’i mosesy.'),
  ('6aadc72b47af9571761e6007', '2026-09-18T23:20:11.670Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:11.670Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 8, 2, '“Teneno i Arona hoe: ‘Rehefa mandrehitra an’ireo jiro fito ianao, dia ataovy manazava ny faritra eo anoloan’ny fitoeran-jiro ilay izy.’”', '“teneno i arona hoe: ‘rehefa mandrehitra an’ireo jiro fito ianao, dia ataovy manazava ny faritra eo anoloan’ny fitoeran-jiro ilay izy.’”'),
  ('6aadc72b47af9571761e6006', '2026-09-18T23:20:11.670Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:11.670Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 8, 1, 'Ary hoy i Jehovah tamin’i Mosesy:', 'ary hoy i jehovah tamin’i mosesy:'),
  ('6aadc72dc04e13e40dc17d98', '2026-09-18T23:20:13.657Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:13.657Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 9, 3, 'Tokony hataonareo vonona ilay izy amin’ny andro faha-14 amin’ity volana ity, amin’ny takariva, amin’ny fotoana voatondro. Araka ny lalàna rehetra sy araka ny fanao rehetra momba azy io no tokony hikarakaranareo azy.”', 'tokony hataonareo vonona ilay izy amin’ny andro faha-14 amin’ity volana ity, amin’ny takariva, amin’ny fotoana voatondro. araka ny lalàna rehetra sy araka ny fanao rehetra momba azy io no tokony hikarakaranareo azy.”'),
  ('6aadc72dc04e13e40dc17d97', '2026-09-18T23:20:13.657Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:13.657Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 9, 2, '“Tokony hataon’ny Israelita vonona ny biby hatao sorona hankalazana ny Paska, amin’ny fotoana voatondro.', '“tokony hataon’ny israelita vonona ny biby hatao sorona hankalazana ny paska, amin’ny fotoana voatondro.'),
  ('6aadc72dc04e13e40dc17d96', '2026-09-18T23:20:13.657Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:13.657Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 9, 1, 'Ary hoy i Jehovah tamin’i Mosesy tany an-tany efitr’i Sinay tamin’ny volana voalohany tamin’ny taona faharoa, taorian’ny nivoahan’izy ireo avy tany Ejipta:', 'ary hoy i jehovah tamin’i mosesy tany an-tany efitr’i sinay tamin’ny volana voalohany tamin’ny taona faharoa, taorian’ny nivoahan’izy ireo avy tany ejipta:'),
  ('6aadc72dc04e13e40dc17dac', '2026-09-18T23:20:13.658Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:13.658Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 9, 23, 'Nijanona izy ireo ka nitoby rehefa nanome baiko i Jehovah, fa niainga kosa rehefa izay no baikon’i Jehovah. Nankatò ny didin’i Jehovah izy ireo, araka ny baikon’i Jehovah nampitaina tamin’i Mosesy.', 'nijanona izy ireo ka nitoby rehefa nanome baiko i jehovah, fa niainga kosa rehefa izay no baikon’i jehovah. nankatò ny didin’i jehovah izy ireo, araka ny baikon’i jehovah nampitaina tamin’i mosesy.'),
  ('6aadc72dc04e13e40dc17dab', '2026-09-18T23:20:13.658Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:13.658Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 9, 22, 'Na roa andro na iray volana na mihoatra an’izany no nijanonan’ilay rahona teo ambonin’ny tranolay, dia nitoby teo foana ny Israelita fa tsy niainga. Rehefa niakatra anefa ilay rahona, dia niainga izy ireo.', 'na roa andro na iray volana na mihoatra an’izany no nijanonan’ilay rahona teo ambonin’ny tranolay, dia nitoby teo foana ny israelita fa tsy niainga. rehefa niakatra anefa ilay rahona, dia niainga izy ireo.'),
  ('6aadc72dc04e13e40dc17daa', '2026-09-18T23:20:13.658Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:13.658Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 9, 21, 'Nijanona nanomboka tamin’ny takariva ka hatramin’ny maraina fotsiny ilay rahona indraindray. Rehefa niakatra ilay rahona ny maraina, dia niainga izy ireo. Koa niainga izy ireo, na andro na alina no niakaran’ilay rahona.', 'nijanona nanomboka tamin’ny takariva ka hatramin’ny maraina fotsiny ilay rahona indraindray. rehefa niakatra ilay rahona ny maraina, dia niainga izy ireo. koa niainga izy ireo, na andro na alina no niakaran’ilay rahona.'),
  ('6aadc72dc04e13e40dc17da9', '2026-09-18T23:20:13.658Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:13.658Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 9, 20, 'Nijanona andro vitsivitsy teo ambonin’ny tranolay ilay rahona indraindray. Nitoby teo foana izy ireo rehefa nanome baiko i Jehovah, ary niainga izy ireo rehefa izay no baikon’i Jehovah.', 'nijanona andro vitsivitsy teo ambonin’ny tranolay ilay rahona indraindray. nitoby teo foana izy ireo rehefa nanome baiko i jehovah, ary niainga izy ireo rehefa izay no baikon’i jehovah.'),
  ('6aadc72dc04e13e40dc17da8', '2026-09-18T23:20:13.658Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:13.658Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 9, 19, 'Rehefa nijanona andro maro teo ambonin’ny tranolay ilay rahona, dia nankatò an’i Jehovah ny Israelita ka tsy niainga.', 'rehefa nijanona andro maro teo ambonin’ny tranolay ilay rahona, dia nankatò an’i jehovah ny israelita ka tsy niainga.'),
  ('6aadc72dc04e13e40dc17da7', '2026-09-18T23:20:13.658Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:13.658Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 9, 18, 'Niainga ny Israelita rehefa nanome baiko i Jehovah, ary nitoby izy ireo rehefa izay no baikon’i Jehovah. Nitoby teo foana izy ireo, raha mbola nijanona teo ambonin’ny tranolay ilay rahona.', 'niainga ny israelita rehefa nanome baiko i jehovah, ary nitoby izy ireo rehefa izay no baikon’i jehovah. nitoby teo foana izy ireo, raha mbola nijanona teo ambonin’ny tranolay ilay rahona.'),
  ('6aadc72dc04e13e40dc17da6', '2026-09-18T23:20:13.658Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:13.658Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 9, 17, 'Isaky ny niakatra avy teo ambonin’ny tranolay ilay rahona, dia niainga avy hatrany ny Israelita. Teo amin’izay nijanonan’ny rahona kosa ny Israelita no nitoby.', 'isaky ny niakatra avy teo ambonin’ny tranolay ilay rahona, dia niainga avy hatrany ny israelita. teo amin’izay nijanonan’ny rahona kosa ny israelita no nitoby.'),
  ('6aadc72dc04e13e40dc17da5', '2026-09-18T23:20:13.658Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:13.658Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 9, 16, 'Dia izany foana no nitranga: Ilay rahona no nanarona an’ilay tranolay rehefa antoandro, fa zavatra hoatran’ny afo kosa rehefa alina.', 'dia izany foana no nitranga: ilay rahona no nanarona an’ilay tranolay rehefa antoandro, fa zavatra hoatran’ny afo kosa rehefa alina.'),
  ('6aadc72dc04e13e40dc17da4', '2026-09-18T23:20:13.658Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:13.658Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 9, 15, 'Tamin’ilay andro nananganana ny tranolay, dia nanarona an’ilay tranolay misy ny Tenin’ny Vavolombelona ny rahona. Fa zavatra hoatran’ny afo kosa no teo ambonin’ny tranolay tamin’ny takariva ka mandra-paharainan’ny andro.', 'tamin’ilay andro nananganana ny tranolay, dia nanarona an’ilay tranolay misy ny tenin’ny vavolombelona ny rahona. fa zavatra hoatran’ny afo kosa no teo ambonin’ny tranolay tamin’ny takariva ka mandra-paharainan’ny andro.'),
  ('6aadc72dc04e13e40dc17da3', '2026-09-18T23:20:13.658Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:13.658Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 9, 14, '“‘Ary raha misy olona hafa firenena mipetraka eo aminareo, dia tokony hikarakara ny biby hatao sorona hankalazana ny Paska ho an’i Jehovah koa izy. Araka ny lalàn’ny Paska sy araka izay efa fanao amin’izy io no hikarakarany azy. Tokony hitovy ihany ny lalàna ho an’ny vahiny sy ny teratany.’”', '“‘ary raha misy olona hafa firenena mipetraka eo aminareo, dia tokony hikarakara ny biby hatao sorona hankalazana ny paska ho an’i jehovah koa izy. araka ny lalàn’ny paska sy araka izay efa fanao amin’izy io no hikarakarany azy. tokony hitovy ihany ny lalàna ho an’ny vahiny sy ny teratany.’”'),
  ('6aadc72dc04e13e40dc17da2', '2026-09-18T23:20:13.658Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:13.658Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 9, 13, 'Fa raha madio kosa ilay olona na tsy nandeha lavitra nefa tsy nikarakara an’ilay biby hatao sorona hankalazana ny Paska, dia haringana tsy ho anisan’ny fireneny izany olona izany. Tsy nanolotra an’ilay fanatitra ho an’i Jehovah tamin’ny fotoana voatondro mantsy izy. Hizaka ny vokatry ny fahotany izy.', 'fa raha madio kosa ilay olona na tsy nandeha lavitra nefa tsy nikarakara an’ilay biby hatao sorona hankalazana ny paska, dia haringana tsy ho anisan’ny fireneny izany olona izany. tsy nanolotra an’ilay fanatitra ho an’i jehovah tamin’ny fotoana voatondro mantsy izy. hizaka ny vokatry ny fahotany izy.'),
  ('6aadc72dc04e13e40dc17da1', '2026-09-18T23:20:13.658Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:13.658Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 9, 12, 'Tsy havelany hisy ambiny tratra maraina ilay izy, sady tsy hisy hotapahiny ny taolany. Araka ny lalàna rehetra momba ny Paska no hikarakarany azy.', 'tsy havelany hisy ambiny tratra maraina ilay izy, sady tsy hisy hotapahiny ny taolany. araka ny lalàna rehetra momba ny paska no hikarakarany azy.'),
  ('6aadc72dc04e13e40dc17da0', '2026-09-18T23:20:13.658Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:13.658Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 9, 11, 'Ny andro faha-14 amin’ny volana faharoa, amin’ny takariva, no tokony hikarakarany an’ilay izy. Tokony hohaniny miaraka amin’ny mofo tsy misy lalivay sy ny anana mangidy izy io.', 'ny andro faha-14 amin’ny volana faharoa, amin’ny takariva, no tokony hikarakarany an’ilay izy. tokony hohaniny miaraka amin’ny mofo tsy misy lalivay sy ny anana mangidy izy io.'),
  ('6aadc72dc04e13e40dc17d9f', '2026-09-18T23:20:13.658Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:13.658Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 9, 10, '“Teneno ny Israelita hoe: ‘Raha misy aminareo na amin’ny taranakareo any aoriana any lasa maloto satria nikasika faty, na tsy maintsy nandeha lavitra, dia hikarakara an’ilay biby hatao sorona hankalazana ny Paska ho an’i Jehovah ihany izy.', '“teneno ny israelita hoe: ‘raha misy aminareo na amin’ny taranakareo any aoriana any lasa maloto satria nikasika faty, na tsy maintsy nandeha lavitra, dia hikarakara an’ilay biby hatao sorona hankalazana ny paska ho an’i jehovah ihany izy.'),
  ('6aadc72dc04e13e40dc17d9e', '2026-09-18T23:20:13.658Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:13.658Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 9, 9, 'Dia hoy i Jehovah tamin’i Mosesy:', 'dia hoy i jehovah tamin’i mosesy:'),
  ('6aadc72dc04e13e40dc17d9d', '2026-09-18T23:20:13.658Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:13.658Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 9, 8, 'Dia hoy i Mosesy tamin’ireo: “Andraso eto aloha, fa aleo hofantariko izay didin’i Jehovah momba anareo.”', 'dia hoy i mosesy tamin’ireo: “andraso eto aloha, fa aleo hofantariko izay didin’i jehovah momba anareo.”'),
  ('6aadc72dc04e13e40dc17d9c', '2026-09-18T23:20:13.658Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:13.658Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 9, 7, 'dia niteny hoe: “Marina fa maloto izahay satria nikasika faty. Maninona anefa izahay no sakanana tsy hanolotra fanatitra ho an’i Jehovah amin’ny fotoana voatondro, miaraka amin’ny Israelita hafa?”', 'dia niteny hoe: “marina fa maloto izahay satria nikasika faty. maninona anefa izahay no sakanana tsy hanolotra fanatitra ho an’i jehovah amin’ny fotoana voatondro, miaraka amin’ny israelita hafa?”'),
  ('6aadc72dc04e13e40dc17d9b', '2026-09-18T23:20:13.658Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:13.658Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 9, 6, 'Naloto anefa ny olona sasany satria nikasika faty, ka tsy afaka nikarakara ny biby hatao sorona hankalazana ny Paska, tamin’iny andro iny. Koa niseho teo anatrehan’i Mosesy sy Arona izy ireo tamin’izay,', 'naloto anefa ny olona sasany satria nikasika faty, ka tsy afaka nikarakara ny biby hatao sorona hankalazana ny paska, tamin’iny andro iny. koa niseho teo anatrehan’i mosesy sy arona izy ireo tamin’izay,'),
  ('6aadc72dc04e13e40dc17d9a', '2026-09-18T23:20:13.658Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:13.658Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 9, 5, 'Dia nokarakarain’izy ireo tamin’ny andro faha-14 tamin’ny volana voalohany, tamin’ny takariva, ny biby hatao sorona hankalazana ny Paska, tany an-tany efitr’i Sinay. Araka ny didy rehetra nomen’i Jehovah an’i Mosesy no nanaovan’ny Israelita an’izany.', 'dia nokarakarain’izy ireo tamin’ny andro faha-14 tamin’ny volana voalohany, tamin’ny takariva, ny biby hatao sorona hankalazana ny paska, tany an-tany efitr’i sinay. araka ny didy rehetra nomen’i jehovah an’i mosesy no nanaovan’ny israelita an’izany.'),
  ('6aadc72dc04e13e40dc17d99', '2026-09-18T23:20:13.658Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:13.658Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 9, 4, 'Koa nasain’i Mosesy nikarakara ny biby hatao sorona hankalazana ny Paska ny Israelita.', 'koa nasain’i mosesy nikarakara ny biby hatao sorona hankalazana ny paska ny israelita.'),
  ('6aadc72e7ae6bb07b84a72be', '2026-09-18T23:20:14.140Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:14.140Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 10, 36, 'Rehefa nijanona kosa ilay izy, dia hoy izy: “Miverena, Jehovah ô! Miverena eo amin’ny Israely tsy hita isa.”', 'rehefa nijanona kosa ilay izy, dia hoy izy: “miverena, jehovah ô! miverena eo amin’ny israely tsy hita isa.”'),
  ('6aadc72e7ae6bb07b84a72bd', '2026-09-18T23:20:14.140Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:14.140Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 10, 35, 'Isaky ny niainga ilay Vata, dia hoy i Mosesy: “Mitsangàna, Jehovah ô, ka ataovy miparitaka ny fahavalonao. Ataovy mandositra eo anatrehanao ireo mankahala anao.”', 'isaky ny niainga ilay vata, dia hoy i mosesy: “mitsangàna, jehovah ô, ka ataovy miparitaka ny fahavalonao. ataovy mandositra eo anatrehanao ireo mankahala anao.”'),
  ('6aadc72e7ae6bb07b84a72bc', '2026-09-18T23:20:14.140Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:14.140Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 10, 34, 'Ary teo ambonin’izy ireo ilay rahon’i Jehovah rehefa antoandro, rehefa niainga avy teo amin’izay nitobiany izy ireo.', 'ary teo ambonin’izy ireo ilay rahon’i jehovah rehefa antoandro, rehefa niainga avy teo amin’izay nitobiany izy ireo.'),
  ('6aadc72e7ae6bb07b84a72bb', '2026-09-18T23:20:14.140Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:14.140Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 10, 33, 'Dia niala teo amin’ilay tendrombohitr’i Jehovah izy ireo, ka nandeha lalana telo andro. Nentina teo alohan’izy ireo foana ny Vata misy ny fifanekena nataon’i Jehovah, tao anatin’ireo telo andro ireo, mba hitady toerana azon’izy ireo akana aina.', 'dia niala teo amin’ilay tendrombohitr’i jehovah izy ireo, ka nandeha lalana telo andro. nentina teo alohan’izy ireo foana ny vata misy ny fifanekena nataon’i jehovah, tao anatin’ireo telo andro ireo, mba hitady toerana azon’izy ireo akana aina.'),
  ('6aadc72e7ae6bb07b84a72ba', '2026-09-18T23:20:14.140Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:14.140Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 10, 32, 'Raha miaraka aminay ianao, dia tena homenay amin’izay soa rehetra hataon’i Jehovah aminay.”', 'raha miaraka aminay ianao, dia tena homenay amin’izay soa rehetra hataon’i jehovah aminay.”'),
  ('6aadc72e7ae6bb07b84a72b9', '2026-09-18T23:20:14.140Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:14.140Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 10, 31, 'Dia hoy i Mosesy: “Aza ilaozana re izahay e! Ianao mantsy no mahalala hoe aiza izahay no tokony hitoby atỳ an-tany efitra, dia ianao no afaka mitari-dalana anay.', 'dia hoy i mosesy: “aza ilaozana re izahay e! ianao mantsy no mahalala hoe aiza izahay no tokony hitoby atỳ an-tany efitra, dia ianao no afaka mitari-dalana anay.'),
  ('6aadc72e7ae6bb07b84a72b8', '2026-09-18T23:20:14.140Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:14.140Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 10, 30, 'Hoy anefa i Hobaba: “Tsy handeha aho fa hody any amin’ny taniko sy ny havako.”', 'hoy anefa i hobaba: “tsy handeha aho fa hody any amin’ny taniko sy ny havako.”'),
  ('6aadc72e7ae6bb07b84a72b7', '2026-09-18T23:20:14.140Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:14.140Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 10, 29, 'Ary hoy i Mosesy tamin’i Hobaba zanak’i Regoela Midianita, rafozandahin’i Mosesy: “Handeha izahay ka ho any amin’ilay toerana nolazain’i Jehovah hoe: ‘Homeko anareo io.’ Andao hiaraka aminay fa hokarakarainay tsara ianao, satria i Jehovah efa nampanantena zavatra tsara ho an’ny Israely.”', 'ary hoy i mosesy tamin’i hobaba zanak’i regoela midianita, rafozandahin’i mosesy: “handeha izahay ka ho any amin’ilay toerana nolazain’i jehovah hoe: ‘homeko anareo io.’ andao hiaraka aminay fa hokarakarainay tsara ianao, satria i jehovah efa nampanantena zavatra tsara ho an’ny israely.”'),
  ('6aadc72e7ae6bb07b84a72b6', '2026-09-18T23:20:14.140Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:14.140Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 10, 28, 'Izany no filaharan’ny Israelita sy ny antokony, rehefa niainga izy ireo.', 'izany no filaharan’ny israelita sy ny antokony, rehefa niainga izy ireo.'),
  ('6aadc72e7ae6bb07b84a72b5', '2026-09-18T23:20:14.140Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:14.140Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 10, 27, 'Ary i Ahira zanak’i Enana no mpifehy ny antoko misy ny fokon’ny taranak’i Naftaly.', 'ary i ahira zanak’i enana no mpifehy ny antoko misy ny fokon’ny taranak’i naftaly.'),
  ('6aadc72e7ae6bb07b84a72b4', '2026-09-18T23:20:14.140Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:14.140Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 10, 26, 'I Pagiela zanak’i Okrana kosa no mpifehy ny antoko misy ny fokon’ny taranak’i Asera.', 'i pagiela zanak’i okrana kosa no mpifehy ny antoko misy ny fokon’ny taranak’i asera.'),
  ('6aadc72e7ae6bb07b84a72b3', '2026-09-18T23:20:14.140Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:14.140Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 10, 25, 'Taorian’izay, dia niainga ny fizarana nisy ny tobin’ny taranak’i Dana, arakaraka ny antokony avy. Izy ireo no vodilaharana mpiaro ny toby rehetra. I Ahiezera zanak’i Amisaday no mpifehy ny antokon’ny taranak’i Dana.', 'taorian’izay, dia niainga ny fizarana nisy ny tobin’ny taranak’i dana, arakaraka ny antokony avy. izy ireo no vodilaharana mpiaro ny toby rehetra. i ahiezera zanak’i amisaday no mpifehy ny antokon’ny taranak’i dana.'),
  ('6aadc72e7ae6bb07b84a72b2', '2026-09-18T23:20:14.140Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:14.140Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 10, 24, 'Ary i Abidana zanak’i Gideony no mpifehy ny antoko misy ny fokon’ny taranak’i Benjamina.', 'ary i abidana zanak’i gideony no mpifehy ny antoko misy ny fokon’ny taranak’i benjamina.'),
  ('6aadc72e7ae6bb07b84a72b1', '2026-09-18T23:20:14.140Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:14.140Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 10, 23, 'I Gamaliela zanak’i Pedazora kosa no mpifehy ny antoko misy ny fokon’ny taranak’i Manase.', 'i gamaliela zanak’i pedazora kosa no mpifehy ny antoko misy ny fokon’ny taranak’i manase.'),
  ('6aadc72e7ae6bb07b84a72b0', '2026-09-18T23:20:14.140Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:14.140Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 10, 22, 'Taorian’izay, dia niainga ny fizarana nisy ny tobin’ny taranak’i Efraima, arakaraka ny antokony avy. I Elisama zanak’i Amihoda no mpifehy ny antokon’ny taranak’i Efraima.', 'taorian’izay, dia niainga ny fizarana nisy ny tobin’ny taranak’i efraima, arakaraka ny antokony avy. i elisama zanak’i amihoda no mpifehy ny antokon’ny taranak’i efraima.'),
  ('6aadc72e7ae6bb07b84a72af', '2026-09-18T23:20:14.140Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:14.140Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 10, 21, 'Avy eo dia niainga ny Kehatita, izay nilanja an’ireo fitaovan’ny toerana masina. Tokony ho efa voatsangana ny tranolay masina, rehefa tonga izy ireo.', 'avy eo dia niainga ny kehatita, izay nilanja an’ireo fitaovan’ny toerana masina. tokony ho efa voatsangana ny tranolay masina, rehefa tonga izy ireo.'),
  ('6aadc72e7ae6bb07b84a72ae', '2026-09-18T23:20:14.140Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:14.140Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 10, 20, 'Ary i Eliasafa zanak’i Doela no mpifehy ny antoko misy ny fokon’ny taranak’i Gada.', 'ary i eliasafa zanak’i doela no mpifehy ny antoko misy ny fokon’ny taranak’i gada.'),
  ('6aadc72e7ae6bb07b84a72ad', '2026-09-18T23:20:14.140Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:14.140Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 10, 19, 'I Selomiela zanak’i Zorisaday kosa no mpifehy ny antoko misy ny fokon’ny taranak’i Simeona.', 'i selomiela zanak’i zorisaday kosa no mpifehy ny antoko misy ny fokon’ny taranak’i simeona.'),
  ('6aadc72e7ae6bb07b84a72ac', '2026-09-18T23:20:14.140Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:14.140Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 10, 18, 'Taorian’izay, dia niainga ny fizarana nisy ny tobin’i Robena, arakaraka ny antokony avy. I Elizora zanak’i Sedeora no mpifehy ny antokon’ny taranak’i Robena.', 'taorian’izay, dia niainga ny fizarana nisy ny tobin’i robena, arakaraka ny antokony avy. i elizora zanak’i sedeora no mpifehy ny antokon’ny taranak’i robena.'),
  ('6aadc72e7ae6bb07b84a72ab', '2026-09-18T23:20:14.140Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:14.140Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 10, 17, 'Rehefa noravana ny tranolay, dia niainga ny taranak’i Gersona sy ny taranak’i Merary, izay nitondra ny tranolay.', 'rehefa noravana ny tranolay, dia niainga ny taranak’i gersona sy ny taranak’i merary, izay nitondra ny tranolay.'),
  ('6aadc72e7ae6bb07b84a72aa', '2026-09-18T23:20:14.140Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:14.140Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 10, 16, 'Ary i Eliaba zanak’i Helona no mpifehy ny antoko misy ny fokon’ny taranak’i Zebolona.', 'ary i eliaba zanak’i helona no mpifehy ny antoko misy ny fokon’ny taranak’i zebolona.'),
  ('6aadc72e7ae6bb07b84a72a9', '2026-09-18T23:20:14.140Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:14.140Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 10, 15, 'I Netanela zanak’i Zoara indray no mpifehy ny antoko misy ny fokon’ny taranak’i Isakara.', 'i netanela zanak’i zoara indray no mpifehy ny antoko misy ny fokon’ny taranak’i isakara.');
INSERT INTO "bible_verses" ("id", "created_date", "updated_date", "created_by_id", "created_by", "translation", "book", "bookOrder", "chapter", "verse", "text", "normalizedText") VALUES
  ('6aadc72e7ae6bb07b84a72a8', '2026-09-18T23:20:14.140Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:14.140Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 10, 14, 'Ny fizarana nisy ny tobin’ny taranak’i Joda àry no niainga voalohany, arakaraka ny antokony avy. I Nasona zanak’i Aminadaba no mpifehy ny antokon’ny taranak’i Joda.', 'ny fizarana nisy ny tobin’ny taranak’i joda àry no niainga voalohany, arakaraka ny antokony avy. i nasona zanak’i aminadaba no mpifehy ny antokon’ny taranak’i joda.'),
  ('6aadc72e7ae6bb07b84a72a7', '2026-09-18T23:20:14.140Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:14.140Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 10, 13, 'Tamin’izay izy ireo no niainga voalohany, satria izay no baiko nampitain’i Jehovah tamin’i Mosesy.', 'tamin’izay izy ireo no niainga voalohany, satria izay no baiko nampitain’i jehovah tamin’i mosesy.'),
  ('6aadc72e7ae6bb07b84a72a6', '2026-09-18T23:20:14.140Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:14.140Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 10, 12, 'Dia niainga ny Israelita ka niala tany an-tany efitr’i Sinay. Nanaraka tsara an’ilay filaharana efa napetraka izy ireo rehefa niainga. Ary nijanona tany an-tany efitr’i Parana ilay rahona.', 'dia niainga ny israelita ka niala tany an-tany efitr’i sinay. nanaraka tsara an’ilay filaharana efa napetraka izy ireo rehefa niainga. ary nijanona tany an-tany efitr’i parana ilay rahona.'),
  ('6aadc72e7ae6bb07b84a72a5', '2026-09-18T23:20:14.140Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:14.140Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 10, 11, 'Tamin’ny andro faha-20 tamin’ny volana faharoa, tamin’ny taona faharoa, dia niakatra ny rahona ka niala teo amin’ny tranolay misy ny Tenin’ny Vavolombelona.', 'tamin’ny andro faha-20 tamin’ny volana faharoa, tamin’ny taona faharoa, dia niakatra ny rahona ka niala teo amin’ny tranolay misy ny tenin’ny vavolombelona.'),
  ('6aadc72e7ae6bb07b84a72a4', '2026-09-18T23:20:14.140Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:14.140Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 10, 10, '“Rehefa tonga koa ny fotoana mahafaly anareo, izany hoe rehefa fety sy amin’ny fiandohan’ny volana, dia hitsoka trompetra ianareo rehefa manolotra fanatitra dorana sy sorona iombonana. Hotsaroan’Andriamanitra ianareo amin’izay, rehefa tsofina ny trompetra. Izaho no Jehovah Andriamanitrareo.”', '“rehefa tonga koa ny fotoana mahafaly anareo, izany hoe rehefa fety sy amin’ny fiandohan’ny volana, dia hitsoka trompetra ianareo rehefa manolotra fanatitra dorana sy sorona iombonana. hotsaroan’andriamanitra ianareo amin’izay, rehefa tsofina ny trompetra. izaho no jehovah andriamanitrareo.”'),
  ('6aadc72e7ae6bb07b84a72a3', '2026-09-18T23:20:14.140Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:14.140Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 10, 9, '“Rehefa any amin’ny taninareo ianareo ka misy fahavalo tonga manafika anareo, dia tsofy ny trompetra mba hilazana hoe handeha hiady ianareo. Dia hotsaroan’i Jehovah Andriamanitrareo ianareo, ka hovonjeny dia tsy ho resin’ny fahavalonareo.', '“rehefa any amin’ny taninareo ianareo ka misy fahavalo tonga manafika anareo, dia tsofy ny trompetra mba hilazana hoe handeha hiady ianareo. dia hotsaroan’i jehovah andriamanitrareo ianareo, ka hovonjeny dia tsy ho resin’ny fahavalonareo.'),
  ('6aadc72e7ae6bb07b84a72a2', '2026-09-18T23:20:14.140Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:14.140Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 10, 8, 'Ireo mpisorona zanakalahin’i Arona no hitsoka azy. Ho fitsipika harahinareo foana hatrany amin’ny taranakareo fara aman-dimby izany fomba ampiasana trompetra izany.', 'ireo mpisorona zanakalahin’i arona no hitsoka azy. ho fitsipika harahinareo foana hatrany amin’ny taranakareo fara aman-dimby izany fomba ampiasana trompetra izany.'),
  ('6aadc72e7ae6bb07b84a72a1', '2026-09-18T23:20:14.140Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:14.140Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 10, 7, '“Rehefa hamory ny fiangonana rehetra ianareo, dia tokony hitsoka trompetra, nefa aza ovaovana ny feony.', '“rehefa hamory ny fiangonana rehetra ianareo, dia tokony hitsoka trompetra, nefa aza ovaovana ny feony.'),
  ('6aadc72e7ae6bb07b84a72a0', '2026-09-18T23:20:14.140Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:14.140Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 10, 6, 'Rehefa tsofinareo fanindroany hamoaka feo miovaova ny trompetra, dia izay mitoby eny atsimo indray no tokony hiainga. Tokony ho hoatr’izany foana no hitsofana ny trompetra, isaky ny misy fizarana hiainga.', 'rehefa tsofinareo fanindroany hamoaka feo miovaova ny trompetra, dia izay mitoby eny atsimo indray no tokony hiainga. tokony ho hoatr’izany foana no hitsofana ny trompetra, isaky ny misy fizarana hiainga.'),
  ('6aadc72e7ae6bb07b84a729f', '2026-09-18T23:20:14.140Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:14.140Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 10, 5, '“Rehefa tsofinareo hamoaka feo miovaova ny trompetra, dia tokony hiainga izay mitoby eny atsinanana.', '“rehefa tsofinareo hamoaka feo miovaova ny trompetra, dia tokony hiainga izay mitoby eny atsinanana.'),
  ('6aadc72e7ae6bb07b84a729e', '2026-09-18T23:20:14.140Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:14.140Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 10, 4, 'Fa raha ny iray ihany no tsofina, dia ny mpiadidy, izany hoe ny mpifehy ny arivo eo amin’ny Israely, ihany no hantsoina hankeny aminao.', 'fa raha ny iray ihany no tsofina, dia ny mpiadidy, izany hoe ny mpifehy ny arivo eo amin’ny israely, ihany no hantsoina hankeny aminao.'),
  ('6aadc72e7ae6bb07b84a729d', '2026-09-18T23:20:14.140Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:14.140Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 10, 3, 'Rehefa miara-tsofina izy roa, dia ny vahoaka manontolo no hantsoina hankeny aminao eo amin’ny fidirana amin’ny tranolay fihaonana.', 'rehefa miara-tsofina izy roa, dia ny vahoaka manontolo no hantsoina hankeny aminao eo amin’ny fidirana amin’ny tranolay fihaonana.'),
  ('6aadc72e7ae6bb07b84a729c', '2026-09-18T23:20:14.140Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:14.140Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 10, 2, '“Manamboara trompetra volafotsy roa. Tefeo amin’ny marotoa ilay izy, dia ampiasao rehefa tokony hantsoina ny vahoaka, na rehefa tokony hifindra lasy.', '“manamboara trompetra volafotsy roa. tefeo amin’ny marotoa ilay izy, dia ampiasao rehefa tokony hantsoina ny vahoaka, na rehefa tokony hifindra lasy.'),
  ('6aadc72e7ae6bb07b84a729b', '2026-09-18T23:20:14.140Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:14.140Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 10, 1, 'Ary hoy i Jehovah tamin’i Mosesy:', 'ary hoy i jehovah tamin’i mosesy:'),
  ('6aadc72fdd16a6244f032129', '2026-09-18T23:20:15.091Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:15.091Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 11, 32, 'Dia nanangona papelika foana ny olona nandritra an’iny andro iny sy ny alina tontolo ary ny ampitson’iny tontolo, fa tsy natory. Tsy nisy nanangona latsaka ny folo homera izy ireo. Dia napetrapetrany nanodidina ny toby izy ireny, mba hotehiriziny.', 'dia nanangona papelika foana ny olona nandritra an’iny andro iny sy ny alina tontolo ary ny ampitson’iny tontolo, fa tsy natory. tsy nisy nanangona latsaka ny folo homera izy ireo. dia napetrapetrany nanodidina ny toby izy ireny, mba hotehiriziny.'),
  ('6aadc72fdd16a6244f032128', '2026-09-18T23:20:15.091Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:15.091Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 11, 31, 'Dia nisy rivotra nitsoka tampoka avy tamin’i Jehovah ka nitondra papelika avy tany an-dranomasina, ary nampilatsaka an’izany nanodidina ny toby. Niparitaka teny amin’ny manodidina rehetra teny ny papelika. Feno papelika daholo àry teo amin’ny ilany sy ilany amin’ny toby, hatrany amin’ny lalana iray andro teo ho eo, ary tokotokony ho roa hakiho avy eo amin’ny tany ny haavony.', 'dia nisy rivotra nitsoka tampoka avy tamin’i jehovah ka nitondra papelika avy tany an-dranomasina, ary nampilatsaka an’izany nanodidina ny toby. niparitaka teny amin’ny manodidina rehetra teny ny papelika. feno papelika daholo àry teo amin’ny ilany sy ilany amin’ny toby, hatrany amin’ny lalana iray andro teo ho eo, ary tokotokony ho roa hakiho avy eo amin’ny tany ny haavony.'),
  ('6aadc72fdd16a6244f032127', '2026-09-18T23:20:15.091Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:15.091Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 11, 30, 'Niverina tao an-toby i Mosesy avy eo, niaraka tamin’ny anti-panahin’ny Israely.', 'niverina tao an-toby i mosesy avy eo, niaraka tamin’ny anti-panahin’ny israely.'),
  ('6aadc72fdd16a6244f032126', '2026-09-18T23:20:15.091Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:15.091Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 11, 29, 'Hoy anefa i Mosesy taminy: “Saro-piaro amin’ny fahefako ve ianao? Tsy mety izany! Satriko aza raha mpaminany daholo ny vahoakan’i Jehovah rehetra, dia homen’i Jehovah ny fanahiny koa!”', 'hoy anefa i mosesy taminy: “saro-piaro amin’ny fahefako ve ianao? tsy mety izany! satriko aza raha mpaminany daholo ny vahoakan’i jehovah rehetra, dia homen’i jehovah ny fanahiny koa!”'),
  ('6aadc72fdd16a6244f032125', '2026-09-18T23:20:15.091Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:15.091Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 11, 28, 'Dia hoy i Josoa zanak’i Nona, mpanompon’i Mosesy efa hatramin’izy mbola tanora: “Ry Mosesy tompoko ô, sakano ry zareo!”', 'dia hoy i josoa zanak’i nona, mpanompon’i mosesy efa hatramin’izy mbola tanora: “ry mosesy tompoko ô, sakano ry zareo!”'),
  ('6aadc72fdd16a6244f032124', '2026-09-18T23:20:15.091Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:15.091Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 11, 27, 'Ary nisy tovolahy iray nihazakazaka niteny tamin’i Mosesy hoe: “Manao hoatran’ny mpaminany koa i Eldada sy Medada ao an-toby!”', 'ary nisy tovolahy iray nihazakazaka niteny tamin’i mosesy hoe: “manao hoatran’ny mpaminany koa i eldada sy medada ao an-toby!”'),
  ('6aadc72fdd16a6244f032123', '2026-09-18T23:20:15.091Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:15.091Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 11, 26, 'Mbola nisy roa lahy tamin’izy ireo nijanona tao an-toby. Eldada sy Medada no anaran’izy ireo. Dia niasa tamin’izy roa lahy ny fanahy, satria anisan’ny voasoratra anarana koa izy ireo, saingy tsy nankany amin’ny tranolay fihaonana. Nanao hoatran’ny mpaminany àry izy ireo tao an-toby.', 'mbola nisy roa lahy tamin’izy ireo nijanona tao an-toby. eldada sy medada no anaran’izy ireo. dia niasa tamin’izy roa lahy ny fanahy, satria anisan’ny voasoratra anarana koa izy ireo, saingy tsy nankany amin’ny tranolay fihaonana. nanao hoatran’ny mpaminany àry izy ireo tao an-toby.'),
  ('6aadc72fdd16a6244f032122', '2026-09-18T23:20:15.091Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:15.091Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 11, 25, 'Dia nidina tao anaty rahona i Jehovah, ka niresaka tamin’i Mosesy. Ary nakany ny fanahy tao amin’i Mosesy ka samy nomeny tamin’ilay fanahy ireo anti-panahy 70 ireo. Vao niasa tamin’izy ireo ny fanahy, dia nanao hoatran’ny mpaminany izy ireo. Tamin’io ihany anefa izy ireo no nanao an’izany.', 'dia nidina tao anaty rahona i jehovah, ka niresaka tamin’i mosesy. ary nakany ny fanahy tao amin’i mosesy ka samy nomeny tamin’ilay fanahy ireo anti-panahy 70 ireo. vao niasa tamin’izy ireo ny fanahy, dia nanao hoatran’ny mpaminany izy ireo. tamin’io ihany anefa izy ireo no nanao an’izany.'),
  ('6aadc72fdd16a6244f032121', '2026-09-18T23:20:15.091Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:15.091Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 11, 24, 'Dia nivoaka i Mosesy ka noteneniny tamin’ny vahoaka ny tenin’i Jehovah. Ary nanangona 70 lahy avy tamin’ny anti-panahy teo amin’ny vahoaka izy, ka nasainy nijoro nanodidina ny tranolay izy ireo.', 'dia nivoaka i mosesy ka noteneniny tamin’ny vahoaka ny tenin’i jehovah. ary nanangona 70 lahy avy tamin’ny anti-panahy teo amin’ny vahoaka izy, ka nasainy nijoro nanodidina ny tranolay izy ireo.'),
  ('6aadc72fdd16a6244f032120', '2026-09-18T23:20:15.091Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:15.091Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 11, 23, 'Dia hoy i Jehovah tamin’i Mosesy: “Angaha fohy loatra ny tanan’i Jehovah ka tsy mahavita an’izany? Ho hitanao tokoa raha ho tanteraka ny teniko na tsia.”', 'dia hoy i jehovah tamin’i mosesy: “angaha fohy loatra ny tanan’i jehovah ka tsy mahavita an’izany? ho hitanao tokoa raha ho tanteraka ny teniko na tsia.”'),
  ('6aadc72fdd16a6244f03211f', '2026-09-18T23:20:15.091Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:15.091Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 11, 22, 'Koa na hovonoina daholo aza ny ondry aman’osy sy omby rehetra, dia ho ampy an-dry zareo ve izany? Ary na ny trondro rehetra any an-dranomasina koa aza no halaina, dia ho ampy an-dry zareo ve izany?”', 'koa na hovonoina daholo aza ny ondry aman’osy sy omby rehetra, dia ho ampy an-dry zareo ve izany? ary na ny trondro rehetra any an-dranomasina koa aza no halaina, dia ho ampy an-dry zareo ve izany?”'),
  ('6aadc72fdd16a6244f03211e', '2026-09-18T23:20:15.091Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:15.091Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 11, 21, 'Ary hoy i Mosesy: “Misy lehilahy 600 000 mandeha an-tongotra miaraka amiko eto. Ianao anefa niteny hoe: ‘Homeko hena izy ireo, dia tena hihinan-kena foana mandritra ny iray volana be izao’!', 'ary hoy i mosesy: “misy lehilahy 600 000 mandeha an-tongotra miaraka amiko eto. ianao anefa niteny hoe: ‘homeko hena izy ireo, dia tena hihinan-kena foana mandritra ny iray volana be izao’!'),
  ('6aadc72fdd16a6244f03211d', '2026-09-18T23:20:15.091Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:15.091Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 11, 20, 'fa iray volana be izao, mandra-pivoakan’izany eo am-bavoronareo, ka ho rikoriko ianareo. Fa nanda an’i Jehovah, izay eo aminareo, ianareo ary nitomany teo anatrehany hoe: “Maninona loatra re izahay no nivoaka avy tany Ejipta e?”’”', 'fa iray volana be izao, mandra-pivoakan’izany eo am-bavoronareo, ka ho rikoriko ianareo. fa nanda an’i jehovah, izay eo aminareo, ianareo ary nitomany teo anatrehany hoe: “maninona loatra re izahay no nivoaka avy tany ejipta e?”’”'),
  ('6aadc72fdd16a6244f03211c', '2026-09-18T23:20:15.091Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:15.091Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 11, 19, 'Tsy iray andro ianareo no hihinan-kena, na 2 andro, na 5 andro, na 10 andro, na 20 andro,', 'tsy iray andro ianareo no hihinan-kena, na 2 andro, na 5 andro, na 10 andro, na 20 andro,'),
  ('6aadc72fdd16a6244f03211b', '2026-09-18T23:20:15.091Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:15.091Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 11, 18, 'Ary ilazao ny vahoaka hoe: ‘Hamasino ny tenanareo, fa hihinan-kena ianareo rahampitso. Efa henon’i Jehovah mantsy ilay ianareo nitomany hoe: “Iza no hanome hena hohaninay? Naleonay ihany tany Ejipta!” Dia homen’i Jehovah hena tokoa ianareo, ka hihinan-kena.', 'ary ilazao ny vahoaka hoe: ‘hamasino ny tenanareo, fa hihinan-kena ianareo rahampitso. efa henon’i jehovah mantsy ilay ianareo nitomany hoe: “iza no hanome hena hohaninay? naleonay ihany tany ejipta!” dia homen’i jehovah hena tokoa ianareo, ka hihinan-kena.'),
  ('6aadc72fdd16a6244f03211a', '2026-09-18T23:20:15.091Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:15.091Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 11, 17, 'Fa hidina aho ka hiresaka aminao eo. Ary hangalako ny fanahy ao aminao ka hataoko ao amin-dry zareo. Dia hanampy anao hitondra ny vahoaka ry zareo, amin’izay tsy ianao irery no hitondra an’izany enta-mavesatra izany.', 'fa hidina aho ka hiresaka aminao eo. ary hangalako ny fanahy ao aminao ka hataoko ao amin-dry zareo. dia hanampy anao hitondra ny vahoaka ry zareo, amin’izay tsy ianao irery no hitondra an’izany enta-mavesatra izany.'),
  ('6aadc72fdd16a6244f032119', '2026-09-18T23:20:15.091Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:15.091Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 11, 16, 'Dia hoy i Jehovah tamin’i Mosesy: “Manangòna 70 lahy amin’ny anti-panahin’ny Israely, dia izay fantatrao hoe anti-panahy sady mpifehy eo amin’ny vahoaka. Ento mankeo amin’ny tranolay fihaonana ry zareo, dia asaivo mijoro miaraka aminao eo.', 'dia hoy i jehovah tamin’i mosesy: “manangòna 70 lahy amin’ny anti-panahin’ny israely, dia izay fantatrao hoe anti-panahy sady mpifehy eo amin’ny vahoaka. ento mankeo amin’ny tranolay fihaonana ry zareo, dia asaivo mijoro miaraka aminao eo.'),
  ('6aadc72fdd16a6244f032118', '2026-09-18T23:20:15.091Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:15.091Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 11, 15, 'Tonga dia vonoy izao dia izao mihitsy re aho raha hoatr’izao no ataonao amiko e! Raha mba ankasitrahanao ihany aho, dia aza avela hahita fahoriana hafa intsony.”', 'tonga dia vonoy izao dia izao mihitsy re aho raha hoatr’izao no ataonao amiko e! raha mba ankasitrahanao ihany aho, dia aza avela hahita fahoriana hafa intsony.”'),
  ('6aadc72fdd16a6244f032117', '2026-09-18T23:20:15.091Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:15.091Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 11, 14, 'Tsy vitako raha izaho irery no hitondra an’ireo vahoaka rehetra ireo, fa mavesatra loatra amiko.', 'tsy vitako raha izaho irery no hitondra an’ireo vahoaka rehetra ireo, fa mavesatra loatra amiko.'),
  ('6aadc72fdd16a6244f032116', '2026-09-18T23:20:15.091Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:15.091Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 11, 13, 'Aiza no hahitako hena homena an’ireo vahoaka rehetra ireo? Fa mitomany eto amiko foana ry zareo hoe: ‘Omeo hena izahay hohaninay!’', 'aiza no hahitako hena homena an’ireo vahoaka rehetra ireo? fa mitomany eto amiko foana ry zareo hoe: ‘omeo hena izahay hohaninay!’'),
  ('6aadc72fdd16a6244f032115', '2026-09-18T23:20:15.091Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:15.091Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 11, 12, 'Izaho angaha no nitondra an’ireo vahoaka rehetra ireo tao an-kibo? Izaho angaha no niteraka an-dry zareo no teneninao hoe: ‘Trotroy izy, hoatran’ny ataon’ny mpitaiza mitrotro zaza mbola minono’, dia lasa izaho no hitondra azy ho any amin’ilay tany nianiananao hoe homena ny razambeny?', 'izaho angaha no nitondra an’ireo vahoaka rehetra ireo tao an-kibo? izaho angaha no niteraka an-dry zareo no teneninao hoe: ‘trotroy izy, hoatran’ny ataon’ny mpitaiza mitrotro zaza mbola minono’, dia lasa izaho no hitondra azy ho any amin’ilay tany nianiananao hoe homena ny razambeny?'),
  ('6aadc72fdd16a6244f032114', '2026-09-18T23:20:15.091Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:15.091Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 11, 11, 'Dia hoy i Mosesy tamin’i Jehovah: “Fa maninona no ampijalinao izaho mpanomponao? Fa inona no nataoko no tsy faly amiko ianao, dia izaho no asainao mitondra an’ireo vahoaka rehetra ireo, nefa enta-mavesatra amiko ry zareo?', 'dia hoy i mosesy tamin’i jehovah: “fa maninona no ampijalinao izaho mpanomponao? fa inona no nataoko no tsy faly amiko ianao, dia izaho no asainao mitondra an’ireo vahoaka rehetra ireo, nefa enta-mavesatra amiko ry zareo?'),
  ('6aadc72fdd16a6244f032113', '2026-09-18T23:20:15.091Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:15.091Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 11, 10, 'Ary henon’i Mosesy nitomany daholo ny fianakaviana. Samy teo amin’ny fidirana amin’ny tranolainy daholo ny olona. Dia tezitra be mihitsy i Jehovah, ary tena tsy faly mihitsy koa i Mosesy.', 'ary henon’i mosesy nitomany daholo ny fianakaviana. samy teo amin’ny fidirana amin’ny tranolainy daholo ny olona. dia tezitra be mihitsy i jehovah, ary tena tsy faly mihitsy koa i mosesy.'),
  ('6aadc72fdd16a6244f032112', '2026-09-18T23:20:15.091Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:15.091Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 11, 9, 'Rehefa nilatsaka teo amin’ny toby ny ando tamin’ny alina, dia nilatsaka teny koa ny mana.', 'rehefa nilatsaka teo amin’ny toby ny ando tamin’ny alina, dia nilatsaka teny koa ny mana.'),
  ('6aadc72fdd16a6244f032111', '2026-09-18T23:20:15.091Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:15.091Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 11, 8, 'Niparitaka nitsimpona azy io ny olona, ka nototoiny tao anaty vato fikosoham-bary na laona ilay izy. Dia nandrahoin’izy ireo tao anaty vilany ilay izy, na nataony mofo boribory, ka toy ny tsirona mofomamy misy menaka ny tsirony.', 'niparitaka nitsimpona azy io ny olona, ka nototoiny tao anaty vato fikosoham-bary na laona ilay izy. dia nandrahoin’izy ireo tao anaty vilany ilay izy, na nataony mofo boribory, ka toy ny tsirona mofomamy misy menaka ny tsirony.'),
  ('6aadc72fdd16a6244f032110', '2026-09-18T23:20:15.091Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:15.091Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 11, 7, 'Toy ny voan-kotimila ny mana, ary toy ny ditin’ny hazo matambelo.', 'toy ny voan-kotimila ny mana, ary toy ny ditin’ny hazo matambelo.'),
  ('6aadc72fdd16a6244f03210f', '2026-09-18T23:20:15.091Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:15.091Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 11, 6, 'Izao anefa mihareraka izahay! Tsy mba mahita na inona na inona afa-tsy mana izahay.”', 'izao anefa mihareraka izahay! tsy mba mahita na inona na inona afa-tsy mana izahay.”'),
  ('6aadc72fdd16a6244f03210e', '2026-09-18T23:20:15.091Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:15.091Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 11, 5, 'Tsaroanay erỳ ny trondro nohaninay maimaim-poana tany Ejipta, ny kôkômbra, ny pasteky, ny poarô, ny tongolobe, ary ny tongolo lay!', 'tsaroanay erỳ ny trondro nohaninay maimaim-poana tany ejipta, ny kôkômbra, ny pasteky, ny poarô, ny tongolobe, ary ny tongolo lay!'),
  ('6aadc72fdd16a6244f03210d', '2026-09-18T23:20:15.091Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:15.091Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 11, 4, 'Tia tena loatra ireo olona avy amin’ny firenena samihafa niaraka tamin’izy ireo, ka naniry mafy hihinana sakafo hafa. Dia nitomany indray ny Israelita hoe: “Iza no hanome hena hohaninay?', 'tia tena loatra ireo olona avy amin’ny firenena samihafa niaraka tamin’izy ireo, ka naniry mafy hihinana sakafo hafa. dia nitomany indray ny israelita hoe: “iza no hanome hena hohaninay?'),
  ('6aadc72fdd16a6244f03210c', '2026-09-18T23:20:15.091Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:15.091Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 11, 3, 'Dia natao hoe Tabera ny anaran’ilay toerana, satria nisy afo avy tamin’i Jehovah nandoro ny olona.', 'dia natao hoe tabera ny anaran’ilay toerana, satria nisy afo avy tamin’i jehovah nandoro ny olona.'),
  ('6aadc72fdd16a6244f03210b', '2026-09-18T23:20:15.091Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:15.091Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 11, 2, 'Rehefa nitaraina tamin’i Mosesy ny vahoaka, dia nitalaho tamin’i Jehovah i Mosesy, ka maty ilay afo.', 'rehefa nitaraina tamin’i mosesy ny vahoaka, dia nitalaho tamin’i jehovah i mosesy, ka maty ilay afo.'),
  ('6aadc72fdd16a6244f03210a', '2026-09-18T23:20:15.091Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:15.091Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 11, 1, 'Ary nitaraina mafy teo anatrehan’i Jehovah ny vahoaka, ka tezitra be i Jehovah rehefa naheno an’izany. Dia nisy afo avy tamin’i Jehovah nandoro azy ireo, ka levona ny sasany teny an-tsisin’ny toby.', 'ary nitaraina mafy teo anatrehan’i jehovah ny vahoaka, ka tezitra be i jehovah rehefa naheno an’izany. dia nisy afo avy tamin’i jehovah nandoro azy ireo, ka levona ny sasany teny an-tsisin’ny toby.'),
  ('6aadc72fdd16a6244f03212c', '2026-09-18T23:20:15.092Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:15.092Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 11, 35, 'Avy teo Kibrota-hatava ny vahoaka no niainga ho any Hazerota. Dia nijanona tao Hazerota izy ireo.', 'avy teo kibrota-hatava ny vahoaka no niainga ho any hazerota. dia nijanona tao hazerota izy ireo.'),
  ('6aadc72fdd16a6244f03212b', '2026-09-18T23:20:15.092Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:15.092Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 11, 34, 'Koa natao hoe Kibrota-hatava ny anaran’ilay toerana, satria teo no nandevenana ny olona tia tena loatra ka naniry mafy hihinana sakafo hafa.', 'koa natao hoe kibrota-hatava ny anaran’ilay toerana, satria teo no nandevenana ny olona tia tena loatra ka naniry mafy hihinana sakafo hafa.'),
  ('6aadc72fdd16a6244f03212a', '2026-09-18T23:20:15.092Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:15.092Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 11, 33, 'Raha mbola iny teo am-bavany iny anefa ny hena, ka mbola tsy voatsako akory, dia tezitra be tamin’ny vahoaka i Jehovah. Ary namely azy ireo i Jehovah, ka be dia be no maty.', 'raha mbola iny teo am-bavany iny anefa ny hena, ka mbola tsy voatsako akory, dia tezitra be tamin’ny vahoaka i jehovah. ary namely azy ireo i jehovah, ka be dia be no maty.'),
  ('6aadc730a8c6831955dd34bf', '2026-09-18T23:20:16.238Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:16.238Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 12, 16, 'Avy eo dia niala tao Hazerota ny vahoaka, ka nitoby tany an-tany efitr’i Parana.', 'avy eo dia niala tao hazerota ny vahoaka, ka nitoby tany an-tany efitr’i parana.'),
  ('6aadc730a8c6831955dd34be', '2026-09-18T23:20:16.238Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:16.238Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 12, 15, 'Dia natokan-toerana fito andro tany ivelan’ny toby i Miriama. Ary tsy nifindra lasy ny vahoaka raha tsy efa niverina tao an-toby izy.', 'dia natokan-toerana fito andro tany ivelan’ny toby i miriama. ary tsy nifindra lasy ny vahoaka raha tsy efa niverina tao an-toby izy.'),
  ('6aadc730a8c6831955dd34bd', '2026-09-18T23:20:16.238Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:16.238Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 12, 14, 'Dia hoy i Jehovah tamin’i Mosesy: “Tsy ho afa-baraka fito andro ve izy raha roran’ny dadany ny tarehiny? Fa aleo izy hatokan-toerana fito andro any ivelan’ny toby, dia aorian’izay izy vao mahazo miverina.”', 'dia hoy i jehovah tamin’i mosesy: “tsy ho afa-baraka fito andro ve izy raha roran’ny dadany ny tarehiny? fa aleo izy hatokan-toerana fito andro any ivelan’ny toby, dia aorian’izay izy vao mahazo miverina.”'),
  ('6aadc730a8c6831955dd34bc', '2026-09-18T23:20:16.238Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:16.238Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 12, 13, 'Koa nitaraina mafy tamin’i Jehovah i Mosesy hoe: “Mba miangavy re, Andriamanitra ô! Mba sitrano re izy e!”', 'koa nitaraina mafy tamin’i jehovah i mosesy hoe: “mba miangavy re, andriamanitra ô! mba sitrano re izy e!”'),
  ('6aadc730a8c6831955dd34bb', '2026-09-18T23:20:16.238Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:16.238Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 12, 12, 'Mba aza avela hijanona hoatr’izao re izy e, hoatran’ny zaza maty tao an-kibon-dreniny dia efa simba ny antsasaky ny nofony rehefa teraka izy.”', 'mba aza avela hijanona hoatr’izao re izy e, hoatran’ny zaza maty tao an-kibon-dreniny dia efa simba ny antsasaky ny nofony rehefa teraka izy.”'),
  ('6aadc730a8c6831955dd34ba', '2026-09-18T23:20:16.238Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:16.238Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 12, 11, 'Tonga dia niteny tamin’i Mosesy i Arona hoe: “Miangavy anao re aho, tompoko ô! Aza atao am-po re iny fahotanay iny e! Fa tena nanao hadalana mihitsy izahay tamin’iny.', 'tonga dia niteny tamin’i mosesy i arona hoe: “miangavy anao re aho, tompoko ô! aza atao am-po re iny fahotanay iny e! fa tena nanao hadalana mihitsy izahay tamin’iny.'),
  ('6aadc730a8c6831955dd34b9', '2026-09-18T23:20:16.238Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:16.238Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 12, 10, 'Niala teo ambonin’ny tranolay ny rahona, dia io fa boka i Miriama ka lasa fotsy be. Dia nitodika tany amin’i Miriama i Arona, ka hitany hoe boka izy.', 'niala teo ambonin’ny tranolay ny rahona, dia io fa boka i miriama ka lasa fotsy be. dia nitodika tany amin’i miriama i arona, ka hitany hoe boka izy.'),
  ('6aadc730a8c6831955dd34b8', '2026-09-18T23:20:16.238Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:16.238Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 12, 9, 'Tezitra be tamin’izy ireo àry i Jehovah, dia lasa.', 'tezitra be tamin’izy ireo àry i jehovah, dia lasa.'),
  ('6aadc730a8c6831955dd34b7', '2026-09-18T23:20:16.238Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:16.238Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 12, 8, 'Miresaka mivantana aminy mihitsy aho, sady miresaka mazava tsara, fa tsy mampiasa teny saro-pantarina. Ny endrik’i Jehovah mihitsy no hitany. Koa nahoana ianareo no tsy natahotra hanome tsiny an’i Mosesy mpanompoko?”', 'miresaka mivantana aminy mihitsy aho, sady miresaka mazava tsara, fa tsy mampiasa teny saro-pantarina. ny endrik’i jehovah mihitsy no hitany. koa nahoana ianareo no tsy natahotra hanome tsiny an’i mosesy mpanompoko?”'),
  ('6aadc730a8c6831955dd34b6', '2026-09-18T23:20:16.238Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:16.238Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 12, 7, 'Tsy hoatr’izany anefa no ataoko amin’i Mosesy mpanompoko. Fa izy no anankinako an’izay rehetra ao an-tranoko.', 'tsy hoatr’izany anefa no ataoko amin’i mosesy mpanompoko. fa izy no anankinako an’izay rehetra ao an-tranoko.'),
  ('6aadc730a8c6831955dd34b5', '2026-09-18T23:20:16.238Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:16.238Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 12, 6, 'Dia hoy izy: “Henoy ny teniko, azafady. Raha misy mpaminanin’i Jehovah eo aminareo, dia ao amin’ny fahitana aho no mampahafantatra ny tenako aminy, ary ao amin’ny nofy aho no miresaka aminy.', 'dia hoy izy: “henoy ny teniko, azafady. raha misy mpaminanin’i jehovah eo aminareo, dia ao amin’ny fahitana aho no mampahafantatra ny tenako aminy, ary ao amin’ny nofy aho no miresaka aminy.'),
  ('6aadc730a8c6831955dd34b4', '2026-09-18T23:20:16.238Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:16.238Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 12, 5, 'Nidina tao anatin’ny andry rahona àry i Jehovah. Nijoro teo amin’ny fidirana amin’ny tranolay fihaonana izy, ka niantso an’i Arona sy Miriama. Dia nandroso izy mianadahy.', 'nidina tao anatin’ny andry rahona àry i jehovah. nijoro teo amin’ny fidirana amin’ny tranolay fihaonana izy, ka niantso an’i arona sy miriama. dia nandroso izy mianadahy.'),
  ('6aadc730a8c6831955dd34b3', '2026-09-18T23:20:16.238Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:16.238Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 12, 4, 'Tampoka teo dia hoy i Jehovah tamin’i Mosesy sy Arona ary Miriama: “Mankanesa any amin’ny tranolay fihaonana ianareo telo mianadahy.” Dia lasa izy telo.', 'tampoka teo dia hoy i jehovah tamin’i mosesy sy arona ary miriama: “mankanesa any amin’ny tranolay fihaonana ianareo telo mianadahy.” dia lasa izy telo.'),
  ('6aadc730a8c6831955dd34b2', '2026-09-18T23:20:16.238Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:16.238Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 12, 3, 'Ary i Mosesy no be fandeferana indrindra, tamin’ny olona rehetra teto an-tany.', 'ary i mosesy no be fandeferana indrindra, tamin’ny olona rehetra teto an-tany.'),
  ('6aadc730a8c6831955dd34b1', '2026-09-18T23:20:16.238Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:16.238Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 12, 2, 'Dia hoy izy mianadahy: “Angaha amin’ny alalan’i Mosesy ihany i Jehovah no miteny, fa tsy amin’ny alalanay koa?” Dia henon’i Jehovah izany.', 'dia hoy izy mianadahy: “angaha amin’ny alalan’i mosesy ihany i jehovah no miteny, fa tsy amin’ny alalanay koa?” dia henon’i jehovah izany.'),
  ('6aadc730a8c6831955dd34b0', '2026-09-18T23:20:16.238Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:16.238Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 12, 1, 'Ary nanome tsiny an’i Mosesy i Miriama sy Arona, noho ilay vehivavy kosita nalainy ho vady. Nanambady vehivavy kosita mantsy i Mosesy.', 'ary nanome tsiny an’i mosesy i miriama sy arona, noho ilay vehivavy kosita nalainy ho vady. nanambady vehivavy kosita mantsy i mosesy.'),
  ('6aadc731fce26bea14d89a27', '2026-09-18T23:20:17.181Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:17.181Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 13, 26, 'Niverina tany amin’i Mosesy sy Arona ary ny vahoakan’Israely manontolo izy ireo, tany an-tany efitr’i Parana any Kadesy. Nanao tatitra tamin’ny vahoaka manontolo izy ireo, sady nampiseho azy ny vokatr’ilay tany.', 'niverina tany amin’i mosesy sy arona ary ny vahoakan’israely manontolo izy ireo, tany an-tany efitr’i parana any kadesy. nanao tatitra tamin’ny vahoaka manontolo izy ireo, sady nampiseho azy ny vokatr’ilay tany.'),
  ('6aadc731fce26bea14d89a26', '2026-09-18T23:20:17.181Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:17.181Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 13, 25, 'Dia niverina izy ireo, 40 andro tatỳ aoriana, rehefa avy nitsikilo an’ilay tany.', 'dia niverina izy ireo, 40 andro tatỳ aoriana, rehefa avy nitsikilo an’ilay tany.'),
  ('6aadc731fce26bea14d89a25', '2026-09-18T23:20:17.181Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:17.181Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 13, 24, 'Koa nantsoin’izy ireo hoe Lohasahan’i Eskola io toerana io, noho ilay voaloboka notapahin’ny Israelita teo.', 'koa nantsoin’izy ireo hoe lohasahan’i eskola io toerana io, noho ilay voaloboka notapahin’ny israelita teo.'),
  ('6aadc731fce26bea14d89a24', '2026-09-18T23:20:17.181Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:17.181Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 13, 23, 'Rehefa tonga teo amin’ny Lohasahan’i Eskola ireo mpitsikilo, dia nanapaka sampam-boaloboka nisy tangozany iray ngezabe. Roa lahy vao nahazaka an’ilay voaloboka tamin’ny bao filanjana. Nitondra ampongabendanitra sy aviavy koa izy ireo.', 'rehefa tonga teo amin’ny lohasahan’i eskola ireo mpitsikilo, dia nanapaka sampam-boaloboka nisy tangozany iray ngezabe. roa lahy vao nahazaka an’ilay voaloboka tamin’ny bao filanjana. nitondra ampongabendanitra sy aviavy koa izy ireo.'),
  ('6aadc731fce26bea14d89a23', '2026-09-18T23:20:17.181Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:17.181Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 13, 22, 'Rehefa niakatra nankany Negeba izy ireo, dia tonga tao Hebrona. Tao ry Ahimana sy Sesay ary Talmay, izany hoe ny Anakita, no nipetraka. Fito taona talohan’ny nanorenana an’i Zoana any Ejipta i Hebrona no efa voaorina.', 'rehefa niakatra nankany negeba izy ireo, dia tonga tao hebrona. tao ry ahimana sy sesay ary talmay, izany hoe ny anakita, no nipetraka. fito taona talohan’ny nanorenana an’i zoana any ejipta i hebrona no efa voaorina.'),
  ('6aadc731fce26bea14d89a22', '2026-09-18T23:20:17.181Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:17.181Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 13, 21, 'Koa niakatra nitsikilo an’ilay tany izy ireo, hatrany amin’ny tany efitr’i Zina ka hatrany Rehoba, tany akaikin’i Lebo-hamata.', 'koa niakatra nitsikilo an’ilay tany izy ireo, hatrany amin’ny tany efitr’i zina ka hatrany rehoba, tany akaikin’i lebo-hamata.'),
  ('6aadc731fce26bea14d89a21', '2026-09-18T23:20:17.181Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:17.181Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 13, 20, 'Jereo koa ilay tany raha lonaka na tsy mamokatra, ary raha misy hazo na tsia. Manàna herim-po, dia makà amin’ny vokatry ny tany any.” Fotoana fahamasahan’ny voaloboka tamin’izay, dia ny voaloboka vokatra voalohany.', 'jereo koa ilay tany raha lonaka na tsy mamokatra, ary raha misy hazo na tsia. manàna herim-po, dia makà amin’ny vokatry ny tany any.” fotoana fahamasahan’ny voaloboka tamin’izay, dia ny voaloboka vokatra voalohany.'),
  ('6aadc731fce26bea14d89a20', '2026-09-18T23:20:17.181Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:17.181Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 13, 19, 'Jereo ilay tany raha tsara na ratsy, ary jereo ny tanànany raha anaty toby na anaty manda.', 'jereo ilay tany raha tsara na ratsy, ary jereo ny tanànany raha anaty toby na anaty manda.'),
  ('6aadc731fce26bea14d89a1f', '2026-09-18T23:20:17.181Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:17.181Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 13, 18, 'Jereo hoe manao ahoana ilay tany. Dia jereo koa ny olona mipetraka ao raha matanjaka na tsia, ary raha vitsy na be dia be.', 'jereo hoe manao ahoana ilay tany. dia jereo koa ny olona mipetraka ao raha matanjaka na tsia, ary raha vitsy na be dia be.'),
  ('6aadc731fce26bea14d89a1e', '2026-09-18T23:20:17.181Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:17.181Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 13, 17, 'Rehefa nalefan’i Mosesy hitsikilo an’i Kanana izy ireo, dia noteneniny hoe: “Miakara mankany Negeba, dia avy eo miakara mankany amin’ny faritra be tendrombohitra.', 'rehefa nalefan’i mosesy hitsikilo an’i kanana izy ireo, dia noteneniny hoe: “miakara mankany negeba, dia avy eo miakara mankany amin’ny faritra be tendrombohitra.'),
  ('6aadc731fce26bea14d89a1d', '2026-09-18T23:20:17.181Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:17.181Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 13, 16, 'Ireo no anaran’ny lehilahy nirahin’i Mosesy hitsikilo an’ilay tany. Ary nantsoin’i Mosesy hoe Josoa i Hosea zanak’i Nona.', 'ireo no anaran’ny lehilahy nirahin’i mosesy hitsikilo an’ilay tany. ary nantsoin’i mosesy hoe josoa i hosea zanak’i nona.'),
  ('6aadc731fce26bea14d89a1c', '2026-09-18T23:20:17.181Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:17.181Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 13, 15, 'ary Geoela zanak’i Maky no avy amin’ny fokon’i Gada.', 'ary geoela zanak’i maky no avy amin’ny fokon’i gada.'),
