  ('6aadc731fce26bea14d89a15', '2026-09-18T23:20:17.181Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:17.181Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 13, 8, 'Hosea zanak’i Nona no avy amin’ny fokon’i Efraima;', 'hosea zanak’i nona no avy amin’ny fokon’i efraima;'),
  ('6aadc731fce26bea14d89a14', '2026-09-18T23:20:17.181Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:17.181Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 13, 7, 'Jigala zanak’i Josefa no avy amin’ny fokon’i Isakara;', 'jigala zanak’i josefa no avy amin’ny fokon’i isakara;'),
  ('6aadc731fce26bea14d89a13', '2026-09-18T23:20:17.181Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:17.181Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 13, 6, 'Kaleba zanak’i Jefone no avy amin’ny fokon’i Joda;', 'kaleba zanak’i jefone no avy amin’ny fokon’i joda;'),
  ('6aadc731fce26bea14d89a12', '2026-09-18T23:20:17.181Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:17.181Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 13, 5, 'Safata zanak’i Hory no avy amin’ny fokon’i Simeona;', 'safata zanak’i hory no avy amin’ny fokon’i simeona;'),
  ('6aadc731fce26bea14d89a11', '2026-09-18T23:20:17.181Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:17.181Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 13, 4, 'Ireto avy ny anaran’izy ireo: I Samoa zanak’i Zakora no avy amin’ny fokon’i Robena;', 'ireto avy ny anaran’izy ireo: i samoa zanak’i zakora no avy amin’ny fokon’i robena;'),
  ('6aadc731fce26bea14d89a10', '2026-09-18T23:20:17.181Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:17.181Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 13, 3, 'Koa nirahin’i Mosesy avy tany an-tany efitr’i Parana izy ireo, araka ny baikon’i Jehovah. Samy lohany teo amin’ny Israelita izy rehetra.', 'koa nirahin’i mosesy avy tany an-tany efitr’i parana izy ireo, araka ny baikon’i jehovah. samy lohany teo amin’ny israelita izy rehetra.'),
  ('6aadc731fce26bea14d89a0f', '2026-09-18T23:20:17.181Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:17.181Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 13, 2, '“Maniraha olona hitsikilo ny tany Kanana izay homeko ny Israelita. Lehilahy iray isam-poko no hirahinareo, izay samy mpiadidy eo amin’izy ireo.”', '“maniraha olona hitsikilo ny tany kanana izay homeko ny israelita. lehilahy iray isam-poko no hirahinareo, izay samy mpiadidy eo amin’izy ireo.”'),
  ('6aadc731fce26bea14d89a0e', '2026-09-18T23:20:17.181Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:17.181Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 13, 1, 'Ary hoy i Jehovah tamin’i Mosesy:', 'ary hoy i jehovah tamin’i mosesy:'),
  ('6aadc731fce26bea14d89a2e', '2026-09-18T23:20:17.182Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:17.182Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 13, 33, 'Hitanay tao koa ny Nefilima, dia ny taranak’i Anàka avy amin’ny Nefilima. Hoatran’ny valala izahay raha ampitahaina aminy, ary hoatr’izany koa ny fahitany anay.”', 'hitanay tao koa ny nefilima, dia ny taranak’i anàka avy amin’ny nefilima. hoatran’ny valala izahay raha ampitahaina aminy, ary hoatr’izany koa ny fahitany anay.”'),
  ('6aadc731fce26bea14d89a2d', '2026-09-18T23:20:17.182Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:17.182Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 13, 32, 'Ary ratsy foana ny tatitra nataon’izy ireo tamin’ny Israelita rehefa niresaka momba an’ilay tany izy ireo. Hoy mantsy izy ireo: “Mampidi-doza ilay tany notetezinay sy notsikilovinay, ka ho faty daholo izay mipetraka ao. Lava ranjanana daholo ny olona hitanay tao.', 'ary ratsy foana ny tatitra nataon’izy ireo tamin’ny israelita rehefa niresaka momba an’ilay tany izy ireo. hoy mantsy izy ireo: “mampidi-doza ilay tany notetezinay sy notsikilovinay, ka ho faty daholo izay mipetraka ao. lava ranjanana daholo ny olona hitanay tao.'),
  ('6aadc731fce26bea14d89a2c', '2026-09-18T23:20:17.182Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:17.182Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 13, 31, 'Hoy anefa ireo lehilahy niaraka taminy: “Tsy ho vitantsika ny hiakatra hiady amin’io firenena io, fa mahery noho isika ry zareo.”', 'hoy anefa ireo lehilahy niaraka taminy: “tsy ho vitantsika ny hiakatra hiady amin’io firenena io, fa mahery noho isika ry zareo.”'),
  ('6aadc731fce26bea14d89a2b', '2026-09-18T23:20:17.182Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:17.182Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 13, 30, 'Ary niezaka nampitony ny vahoaka i Kaleba. Nijoro teo anatrehan’i Mosesy ny vahoaka tamin’izay. Dia hoy i Kaleba: “Andao isika tonga dia hiakatra any, fa tsy maintsy ho azontsika io tany io. Tena ho resintsika ny mponina ao.”', 'ary niezaka nampitony ny vahoaka i kaleba. nijoro teo anatrehan’i mosesy ny vahoaka tamin’izay. dia hoy i kaleba: “andao isika tonga dia hiakatra any, fa tsy maintsy ho azontsika io tany io. tena ho resintsika ny mponina ao.”'),
  ('6aadc731fce26bea14d89a2a', '2026-09-18T23:20:17.182Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:17.182Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 13, 29, 'Mipetraka any Negeba ny Amalekita, ary any amin’ny faritra be tendrombohitra ny Hetita sy ny Jebosita ary ny Amorita. Ny Kananita kosa mipetraka any amoron’ny ranomasina sy eny amoron’i Jordana.”', 'mipetraka any negeba ny amalekita, ary any amin’ny faritra be tendrombohitra ny hetita sy ny jebosita ary ny amorita. ny kananita kosa mipetraka any amoron’ny ranomasina sy eny amoron’i jordana.”'),
  ('6aadc731fce26bea14d89a29', '2026-09-18T23:20:17.182Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:17.182Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 13, 28, 'Matanjaka anefa ny mponina ao, sady tena lehibe ireo tanàna voaro mafy. Hitanay tao koa ny Anakita.', 'matanjaka anefa ny mponina ao, sady tena lehibe ireo tanàna voaro mafy. hitanay tao koa ny anakita.'),
  ('6aadc731fce26bea14d89a28', '2026-09-18T23:20:17.182Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:17.182Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 13, 27, 'Ary izao no tatitra nataony tamin’i Mosesy: “Nankao amin’ilay tany nanirahanao anay izahay, ary tena tondra-dronono sy tantely tokoa ilay izy. Ireto no vokatra avy tany.', 'ary izao no tatitra nataony tamin’i mosesy: “nankao amin’ilay tany nanirahanao anay izahay, ary tena tondra-dronono sy tantely tokoa ilay izy. ireto no vokatra avy tany.'),
  ('6aadc731e855fb6f0f7bcb95', '2026-09-18T23:20:17.637Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:17.637Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 14, 40, 'Nifoha maraina koa izy ireo ny ampitson’iny, ka nitady hiakatra teny an-tampon-tendrombohitra, sady niteny hoe: “Efa nanota izahay. Koa ireto izahay vonona hiakatra any amin’ilay toerana nolazain’i Jehovah.”', 'nifoha maraina koa izy ireo ny ampitson’iny, ka nitady hiakatra teny an-tampon-tendrombohitra, sady niteny hoe: “efa nanota izahay. koa ireto izahay vonona hiakatra any amin’ilay toerana nolazain’i jehovah.”'),
  ('6aadc731e855fb6f0f7bcb94', '2026-09-18T23:20:17.637Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:17.637Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 14, 39, 'Dia nalahelo be ny Israelita rehetra rehefa nilazan’i Mosesy an’izany teny izany.', 'dia nalahelo be ny israelita rehetra rehefa nilazan’i mosesy an’izany teny izany.'),
  ('6aadc731e855fb6f0f7bcb93', '2026-09-18T23:20:17.637Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:17.637Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 14, 38, 'Amin’ireo lehilahy nitsikilo an’ilay tany kosa, dia i Josoa zanak’i Nona sy Kaleba zanak’i Jefone no mbola ho velona.”’”', 'amin’ireo lehilahy nitsikilo an’ilay tany kosa, dia i josoa zanak’i nona sy kaleba zanak’i jefone no mbola ho velona.”’”'),
  ('6aadc731e855fb6f0f7bcb92', '2026-09-18T23:20:17.637Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:17.637Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 14, 37, 'eny, ireo lehilahy nanao tatitra ratsy ireo no hosazina ka ho faty eo anatrehan’i Jehovah.', 'eny, ireo lehilahy nanao tatitra ratsy ireo no hosazina ka ho faty eo anatrehan’i jehovah.'),
  ('6aadc731e855fb6f0f7bcb91', '2026-09-18T23:20:17.637Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:17.637Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 14, 36, 'Ary ireo lehilahy nirahin’i Mosesy hitsikilo an’ilay tany ireo, nefa nanao tatitra ratsy momba an’ilay tany rehefa tafaverina, ka nahatonga ny vahoaka manontolo himenomenona tamin’i Mosesy,', 'ary ireo lehilahy nirahin’i mosesy hitsikilo an’ilay tany ireo, nefa nanao tatitra ratsy momba an’ilay tany rehefa tafaverina, ka nahatonga ny vahoaka manontolo himenomenona tamin’i mosesy,'),
  ('6aadc731e855fb6f0f7bcb90', '2026-09-18T23:20:17.637Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:17.637Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 14, 35, '“‘“Izaho Jehovah no efa niteny. Izao no hataoko amin’io vahoaka ratsy fanahy mitambatra hanohitra ahy io: Atỳ amin’ity tany efitra ity izy ireo no ho ripaka tanteraka, ary atỳ izy ireo no ho faty.', '“‘“izaho jehovah no efa niteny. izao no hataoko amin’io vahoaka ratsy fanahy mitambatra hanohitra ahy io: atỳ amin’ity tany efitra ity izy ireo no ho ripaka tanteraka, ary atỳ izy ireo no ho faty.'),
  ('6aadc731e855fb6f0f7bcb8f', '2026-09-18T23:20:17.637Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:17.637Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 14, 34, 'Satria 40 andro ianareo no nitsikilo an’ilay tany, dia 40 taona ianareo no hizaka ny vokatry ny fahadisoanareo. Ny andro iray mantsy hosoloana taona iray. Dia ho fantatrareo hoe inona ny vokany rehefa manohitra ahy ianareo.', 'satria 40 andro ianareo no nitsikilo an’ilay tany, dia 40 taona ianareo no hizaka ny vokatry ny fahadisoanareo. ny andro iray mantsy hosoloana taona iray. dia ho fantatrareo hoe inona ny vokany rehefa manohitra ahy ianareo.'),
  ('6aadc731e855fb6f0f7bcb8e', '2026-09-18T23:20:17.637Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:17.637Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 14, 33, 'Dia ho lasa mpiandry ondry atỳ an-tany efitra mandritra ny 40 taona ny zanakareo, ka ry zareo no hizaka ny vokatry ny nivadihanareo tamiko, mandra-pahafatinareo rehetra atỳ an-tany efitra.', 'dia ho lasa mpiandry ondry atỳ an-tany efitra mandritra ny 40 taona ny zanakareo, ka ry zareo no hizaka ny vokatry ny nivadihanareo tamiko, mandra-pahafatinareo rehetra atỳ an-tany efitra.'),
  ('6aadc731e855fb6f0f7bcb8d', '2026-09-18T23:20:17.637Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:17.637Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 14, 32, 'Ny fatinareo kosa hiampatrampatra atỳ amin’ity tany efitra ity.', 'ny fatinareo kosa hiampatrampatra atỳ amin’ity tany efitra ity.'),
  ('6aadc731e855fb6f0f7bcb8c', '2026-09-18T23:20:17.637Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:17.637Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 14, 31, '“‘“Hampidiriko ao koa ny zanakareo izay nolazainareo hoe ho lasa babo, dia ry zareo no hipetraka ao amin’ilay tany tsy tianareo.', '“‘“hampidiriko ao koa ny zanakareo izay nolazainareo hoe ho lasa babo, dia ry zareo no hipetraka ao amin’ilay tany tsy tianareo.'),
  ('6aadc731e855fb6f0f7bcb8b', '2026-09-18T23:20:17.637Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:17.637Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 14, 30, 'Tsy hisy aminareo na iray aza hiditra ao amin’ilay tany nianianako hoe hipetrahanareo, afa-tsy i Kaleba zanak’i Jefone, sy Josoa zanak’i Nona.', 'tsy hisy aminareo na iray aza hiditra ao amin’ilay tany nianianako hoe hipetrahanareo, afa-tsy i kaleba zanak’i jefone, sy josoa zanak’i nona.'),
  ('6aadc731e855fb6f0f7bcb8a', '2026-09-18T23:20:17.637Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:17.637Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 14, 29, 'Atỳ amin’ity tany efitra ity ny fatinareo no hiampatrampatra’, dia ianareo rehetra voasoratra anarana, izay 20 taona no ho miakatra, ka nimenomenona tamiko.', 'atỳ amin’ity tany efitra ity ny fatinareo no hiampatrampatra’, dia ianareo rehetra voasoratra anarana, izay 20 taona no ho miakatra, ka nimenomenona tamiko.'),
  ('6aadc731e855fb6f0f7bcb89', '2026-09-18T23:20:17.637Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:17.637Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 14, 28, 'Koa teneno ry zareo hoe: ‘“Raha mbola velona koa aho”, hoy i Jehovah, “dia hataoko aminareo izay henoko nolazainareo!', 'koa teneno ry zareo hoe: ‘“raha mbola velona koa aho”, hoy i jehovah, “dia hataoko aminareo izay henoko nolazainareo!'),
  ('6aadc731e855fb6f0f7bcb88', '2026-09-18T23:20:17.637Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:17.637Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 14, 27, '“Mandra-pahoviana ity vahoaka ratsy fanahy ity no himenomenona foana amiko hoatr’izao? Efa henoko hoe inona no imenomenonan’ny Israelita amiko.', '“mandra-pahoviana ity vahoaka ratsy fanahy ity no himenomenona foana amiko hoatr’izao? efa henoko hoe inona no imenomenonan’ny israelita amiko.'),
  ('6aadc731e855fb6f0f7bcb87', '2026-09-18T23:20:17.637Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:17.637Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 14, 26, 'Hoy koa i Jehovah tamin’i Mosesy sy Arona:', 'hoy koa i jehovah tamin’i mosesy sy arona:'),
  ('6aadc731e855fb6f0f7bcb86', '2026-09-18T23:20:17.637Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:17.637Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 14, 25, 'Koa miverena mankany an-tany efitra rahampitso, dia mandehana any amin’ny lalana mankany amin’ny Ranomasina Mena. Mipetraka eny amin’ny lohasaha mantsy ny Amalekita sy ny Kananita.”', 'koa miverena mankany an-tany efitra rahampitso, dia mandehana any amin’ny lalana mankany amin’ny ranomasina mena. mipetraka eny amin’ny lohasaha mantsy ny amalekita sy ny kananita.”'),
  ('6aadc731e855fb6f0f7bcb85', '2026-09-18T23:20:17.637Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:17.637Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 14, 24, 'Fa i Kaleba mpanompoko kosa hampidiriko ao amin’ilay tany nalehany, dia ny taranany no haka an’ilay izy ho fananany. Hafa mihitsy mantsy ny toe-tsainy, sady nanaraka ahy tamin’ny fony manontolo izy.', 'fa i kaleba mpanompoko kosa hampidiriko ao amin’ilay tany nalehany, dia ny taranany no haka an’ilay izy ho fananany. hafa mihitsy mantsy ny toe-tsainy, sady nanaraka ahy tamin’ny fony manontolo izy.'),
  ('6aadc731e855fb6f0f7bcb84', '2026-09-18T23:20:17.637Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:17.637Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 14, 23, 'tsy hahita an’ilay tany nianianako tamin’ny razambeny. Tsy hisy hahita an’ilay izy mihitsy izay rehetra tsy manaja ahy.', 'tsy hahita an’ilay tany nianianako tamin’ny razambeny. tsy hisy hahita an’ilay izy mihitsy izay rehetra tsy manaja ahy.'),
  ('6aadc731e855fb6f0f7bcb83', '2026-09-18T23:20:17.637Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:17.637Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 14, 22, 'Saingy izao: Efa nahita ny voninahitro sy ny famantarana nataoko tany Ejipta sy tatỳ an-tany efitra ireo lehilahy ireo. Mbola mitsapa toetra ahy ihany anefa ry zareo efa impolo izay, sady tsy nihaino ny teniko, ka na ny iray amin’ireo aza', 'saingy izao: efa nahita ny voninahitro sy ny famantarana nataoko tany ejipta sy tatỳ an-tany efitra ireo lehilahy ireo. mbola mitsapa toetra ahy ihany anefa ry zareo efa impolo izay, sady tsy nihaino ny teniko, ka na ny iray amin’ireo aza'),
  ('6aadc731e855fb6f0f7bcb82', '2026-09-18T23:20:17.637Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:17.637Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 14, 21, 'Raha mbola velona koa anefa aho, dia ho feno ny voninahitr’i Jehovah ny tany manontolo.', 'raha mbola velona koa anefa aho, dia ho feno ny voninahitr’i jehovah ny tany manontolo.'),
  ('6aadc731e855fb6f0f7bcb81', '2026-09-18T23:20:17.637Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:17.637Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 14, 20, 'Dia hoy i Jehovah: “Avelako àry ny helony, araka ny teninao.', 'dia hoy i jehovah: “avelako àry ny helony, araka ny teninao.'),
  ('6aadc731e855fb6f0f7bcb80', '2026-09-18T23:20:17.637Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:17.637Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 14, 19, 'Asehoy re fa tena be fitiavana sy tsy mivadika ianao e, ka avelao ny helok’ity vahoaka ity, toy ny namelanao ny helony nanomboka tany Ejipta ka hatramin’izao.”', 'asehoy re fa tena be fitiavana sy tsy mivadika ianao e, ka avelao ny helok’ity vahoaka ity, toy ny namelanao ny helony nanomboka tany ejipta ka hatramin’izao.”'),
  ('6aadc731e855fb6f0f7bcb7f', '2026-09-18T23:20:17.637Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:17.637Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 14, 18, '‘Tsy mora tezitra i Jehovah sady tena be fitiavana sy tsy mivadika, ary mamela fahadisoana sy heloka, kanefa sanatria azy ny tsy hanasazy an’izay meloka, fa hosaziny noho ny fahadisoan’ny rainy ny zanany sy ny zafikeliny ary ny zafiafiny.’', '‘tsy mora tezitra i jehovah sady tena be fitiavana sy tsy mivadika, ary mamela fahadisoana sy heloka, kanefa sanatria azy ny tsy hanasazy an’izay meloka, fa hosaziny noho ny fahadisoan’ny rainy ny zanany sy ny zafikeliny ary ny zafiafiny.’'),
  ('6aadc731e855fb6f0f7bcb7e', '2026-09-18T23:20:17.637Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:17.637Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 14, 17, 'Jehovah ô, mba asehoy re fa lehibe ny herinao e! Ianao mantsy efa nampanantena hoe:', 'jehovah ô, mba asehoy re fa lehibe ny herinao e! ianao mantsy efa nampanantena hoe:'),
  ('6aadc731e855fb6f0f7bcb7d', '2026-09-18T23:20:17.637Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:17.637Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 14, 16, '‘Tsy vitan’i Jehovah ny nitondra an’io vahoaka io nankany amin’ilay tany efa nianianany hoe homena azy, dia novonoiny tany an-tany efitra ry zareo.’', '‘tsy vitan’i jehovah ny nitondra an’io vahoaka io nankany amin’ilay tany efa nianianany hoe homena azy, dia novonoiny tany an-tany efitra ry zareo.’'),
  ('6aadc731e855fb6f0f7bcb7c', '2026-09-18T23:20:17.637Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:17.637Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 14, 15, 'Koa raha indray aripakao ity vahoaka ity, dia izao no holazain’ireo firenena efa naheno ny lazanao ireo:', 'koa raha indray aripakao ity vahoaka ity, dia izao no holazain’ireo firenena efa naheno ny lazanao ireo:'),
  ('6aadc731e855fb6f0f7bcb7b', '2026-09-18T23:20:17.637Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:17.637Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 14, 14, 'Dia horesahin-dry zareo amin’ny mponin’io tany io izany. Efa henon-dry zareo koa fa eto amin’ity vahoaka ity ianao, Jehovah ô, sady miseho aminy sy miresaka aminy mivantana. Ianao no Jehovah, ary asianao rahona eo ambonin’ny vahoakanao. Mandeha eo alohany ao anatin’ny andry rahona koa ianao rehefa antoandro, ary ao anatin’ny andry afo rehefa alina.', 'dia horesahin-dry zareo amin’ny mponin’io tany io izany. efa henon-dry zareo koa fa eto amin’ity vahoaka ity ianao, jehovah ô, sady miseho aminy sy miresaka aminy mivantana. ianao no jehovah, ary asianao rahona eo ambonin’ny vahoakanao. mandeha eo alohany ao anatin’ny andry rahona koa ianao rehefa antoandro, ary ao anatin’ny andry afo rehefa alina.'),
  ('6aadc731e855fb6f0f7bcb7a', '2026-09-18T23:20:17.637Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:17.637Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 14, 13, 'Hoy anefa i Mosesy tamin’i Jehovah: “Dia ho henon’ny Ejipsianina izany, nefa ianao efa nampiasa ny herinao dia namoaka an’ity vahoaka ity avy teo amin-dry zareo.', 'hoy anefa i mosesy tamin’i jehovah: “dia ho henon’ny ejipsianina izany, nefa ianao efa nampiasa ny herinao dia namoaka an’ity vahoaka ity avy teo amin-dry zareo.'),
  ('6aadc731e855fb6f0f7bcb79', '2026-09-18T23:20:17.637Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:17.637Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 14, 12, 'Avelao hasiako amin’ny areti-mandringana ry zareo dia haripako, dia aleo ianao hataoko firenena lehibe sy matanjaka noho ireo.”', 'avelao hasiako amin’ny areti-mandringana ry zareo dia haripako, dia aleo ianao hataoko firenena lehibe sy matanjaka noho ireo.”'),
  ('6aadc731e855fb6f0f7bcb78', '2026-09-18T23:20:17.637Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:17.637Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 14, 11, 'Dia hoy i Jehovah tamin’i Mosesy: “Mandra-pahoviana ity vahoaka ity no tsy hanaja ahy sy tsy hino ahy, na dia teo aza ny famantarana rehetra nataoko teo aminy?', 'dia hoy i jehovah tamin’i mosesy: “mandra-pahoviana ity vahoaka ity no tsy hanaja ahy sy tsy hino ahy, na dia teo aza ny famantarana rehetra nataoko teo aminy?'),
  ('6aadc731e855fb6f0f7bcb77', '2026-09-18T23:20:17.637Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:17.637Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 14, 10, 'Nifampiresaka anefa ny vahoaka manontolo hoe hitora-bato azy roa lahy, saingy niseho tampoka teo ambonin’ny tranolay fihaonana, teo imason’ny vahoakan’Israely manontolo, ny voninahitr’i Jehovah.', 'nifampiresaka anefa ny vahoaka manontolo hoe hitora-bato azy roa lahy, saingy niseho tampoka teo ambonin’ny tranolay fihaonana, teo imason’ny vahoakan’israely manontolo, ny voninahitr’i jehovah.'),
  ('6aadc731e855fb6f0f7bcb76', '2026-09-18T23:20:17.637Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:17.637Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 14, 9, 'Aza mikomy amin’i Jehovah anefa ianareo, ary aza atahorana ny olona ao amin’io tany io, fa tsy ampy hohanintsika ireo. Efa tsy misy miaro an-dry zareo intsony, dia i Jehovah koa manampy antsika, fa aza matahotra an-dry zareo.”', 'aza mikomy amin’i jehovah anefa ianareo, ary aza atahorana ny olona ao amin’io tany io, fa tsy ampy hohanintsika ireo. efa tsy misy miaro an-dry zareo intsony, dia i jehovah koa manampy antsika, fa aza matahotra an-dry zareo.”'),
  ('6aadc731e855fb6f0f7bcb75', '2026-09-18T23:20:17.637Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:17.637Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 14, 8, 'Raha ankasitrahan’i Jehovah isika, dia tena hoentiny hiditra ao amin’io tany io, ka homeny antsika io tany tondra-dronono sy tantely io.', 'raha ankasitrahan’i jehovah isika, dia tena hoentiny hiditra ao amin’io tany io, ka homeny antsika io tany tondra-dronono sy tantely io.'),
  ('6aadc731e855fb6f0f7bcb74', '2026-09-18T23:20:17.637Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:17.637Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 14, 7, 'Dia hoy izy roa lahy tamin’ny vahoakan’Israely manontolo: “Tena tsara be ilay tany notetezinay sy notsikilovinay.', 'dia hoy izy roa lahy tamin’ny vahoakan’israely manontolo: “tena tsara be ilay tany notetezinay sy notsikilovinay.'),
  ('6aadc731e855fb6f0f7bcb73', '2026-09-18T23:20:17.637Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:17.637Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 14, 6, 'Nandrovitra ny akanjony kosa i Josoa zanak’i Nona, sy Kaleba zanak’i Jefone, izay anisan’ireo nitsikilo an’ilay tany.', 'nandrovitra ny akanjony kosa i josoa zanak’i nona, sy kaleba zanak’i jefone, izay anisan’ireo nitsikilo an’ilay tany.'),
  ('6aadc731e855fb6f0f7bcb72', '2026-09-18T23:20:17.637Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:17.637Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 14, 5, 'Ary niankohoka tamin’ny tany teo anatrehan’ny fiangonan’Israely manontolo i Mosesy sy Arona.', 'ary niankohoka tamin’ny tany teo anatrehan’ny fiangonan’israely manontolo i mosesy sy arona.'),
  ('6aadc731e855fb6f0f7bcb71', '2026-09-18T23:20:17.637Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:17.637Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 14, 4, 'Nifampiresaka mihitsy aza izy ireo hoe: “Andao isika hanendry mpitarika, dia hiverina any Ejipta!”', 'nifampiresaka mihitsy aza izy ireo hoe: “andao isika hanendry mpitarika, dia hiverina any ejipta!”'),
  ('6aadc731e855fb6f0f7bcb70', '2026-09-18T23:20:17.637Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:17.637Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 14, 3, 'Fa maninona isika no entin’i Jehovah ho any amin’izany tany izany, dia ho fatin’ny sabatra any? Ho lasa babo any ny vadintsika sy ny zanatsika. Tsy aleontsika ve miverina any Ejipta e?”', 'fa maninona isika no entin’i jehovah ho any amin’izany tany izany, dia ho fatin’ny sabatra any? ho lasa babo any ny vadintsika sy ny zanatsika. tsy aleontsika ve miverina any ejipta e?”'),
  ('6aadc731e855fb6f0f7bcb6f', '2026-09-18T23:20:17.637Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:17.637Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 14, 2, 'Ary nimenomenona tamin’i Mosesy sy Arona ny Israelita rehetra. Dia nanohitra azy roa lahy ny vahoaka manontolo, hoe: “Naleonay maty tany Ejipta na tatỳ an-tany efitra!', 'ary nimenomenona tamin’i mosesy sy arona ny israelita rehetra. dia nanohitra azy roa lahy ny vahoaka manontolo, hoe: “naleonay maty tany ejipta na tatỳ an-tany efitra!'),
  ('6aadc731e855fb6f0f7bcb6e', '2026-09-18T23:20:17.637Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:17.637Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 14, 1, 'Dia nitaraina mafy ny vahoaka manontolo. Nigogogogo nitomany ny olona, nandritra an’iny alina iny.', 'dia nitaraina mafy ny vahoaka manontolo. nigogogogo nitomany ny olona, nandritra an’iny alina iny.'),
  ('6aadc731e855fb6f0f7bcb9a', '2026-09-18T23:20:17.638Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:17.638Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 14, 45, 'Dia nidina ny Amalekita sy ny Kananita nipetraka teo amin’ilay tendrombohitra, ka namely sy nanaparitaka azy ireo hatrany Horma.', 'dia nidina ny amalekita sy ny kananita nipetraka teo amin’ilay tendrombohitra, ka namely sy nanaparitaka azy ireo hatrany horma.'),
  ('6aadc731e855fb6f0f7bcb99', '2026-09-18T23:20:17.638Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:17.638Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 14, 44, 'Mbola sahisahy ratsy ihany anefa izy ireo ka niakatra teny an-tampon-tendrombohitra. Tsy niala teo an-toby kosa i Mosesy sy ny Vata misy ny fifanekena nataon’i Jehovah.', 'mbola sahisahy ratsy ihany anefa izy ireo ka niakatra teny an-tampon-tendrombohitra. tsy niala teo an-toby kosa i mosesy sy ny vata misy ny fifanekena nataon’i jehovah.'),
  ('6aadc731e855fb6f0f7bcb98', '2026-09-18T23:20:17.638Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:17.638Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 14, 43, 'Fa ho avy hiady aminareo ny Amalekita sy ny Kananita, ka ho fatin’ny sabatra ianareo. Tsy nankatò an’i Jehovah intsony mantsy ianareo, ka tsy hanampy anareo i Jehovah.”', 'fa ho avy hiady aminareo ny amalekita sy ny kananita, ka ho fatin’ny sabatra ianareo. tsy nankatò an’i jehovah intsony mantsy ianareo, ka tsy hanampy anareo i jehovah.”'),
  ('6aadc731e855fb6f0f7bcb97', '2026-09-18T23:20:17.638Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:17.638Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 14, 42, 'Aza miakatra any fa tsy hanampy anareo i Jehovah. Ho resin’ny fahavalonareo any ianareo.', 'aza miakatra any fa tsy hanampy anareo i jehovah. ho resin’ny fahavalonareo any ianareo.'),
  ('6aadc731e855fb6f0f7bcb96', '2026-09-18T23:20:17.638Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:17.638Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 14, 41, 'Hoy anefa i Mosesy: “Fa maninona ianareo no mandika ny didin’i Jehovah? Tsy hahomby izany ataonareo izany!', 'hoy anefa i mosesy: “fa maninona ianareo no mandika ny didin’i jehovah? tsy hahomby izany ataonareo izany!'),
  ('6aadc7322eb1e57da27d6f2b', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.036Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.036Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 15, 41, 'Izaho no Jehovah Andriamanitrareo, ilay nitondra anareo nivoaka avy tany Ejipta mba hampisehoako fa izaho no Andriamanitrareo. Izaho no Jehovah Andriamanitrareo.’”', 'izaho no jehovah andriamanitrareo, ilay nitondra anareo nivoaka avy tany ejipta mba hampisehoako fa izaho no andriamanitrareo. izaho no jehovah andriamanitrareo.’”'),
  ('6aadc7322eb1e57da27d6f2a', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.036Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.036Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 15, 40, 'Amin’izay dia hotadidinareo sy hankatoavinareo ny didiko rehetra, ka ho masina eo anatrehan’ilay Andriamanitrareo ianareo.', 'amin’izay dia hotadidinareo sy hankatoavinareo ny didiko rehetra, ka ho masina eo anatrehan’ilay andriamanitrareo ianareo.'),
  ('6aadc7322eb1e57da27d6f29', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.036Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.036Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 15, 39, '‘Asio an’ilay mikiramborambo ny akanjonareo, amin’izay rehefa mahita an’ilay izy ianareo, dia hahatsiaro ny didin’i Jehovah rehetra ka hankatò an’izany. Aza manao izay tian’ny fonareo sy ny masonareo fotsiny, fa hahatonga anareo hivaro-tena amin’ny andriamani-kafa izany.', '‘asio an’ilay mikiramborambo ny akanjonareo, amin’izay rehefa mahita an’ilay izy ianareo, dia hahatsiaro ny didin’i jehovah rehetra ka hankatò an’izany. aza manao izay tian’ny fonareo sy ny masonareo fotsiny, fa hahatonga anareo hivaro-tena amin’ny andriamani-kafa izany.'),
  ('6aadc7322eb1e57da27d6f28', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.036Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.036Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 15, 38, '“Teneno ny Israelita hoe tokony hanisy mikiramborambo eo amin’ny morontongotr’akanjony izy ireo, hatramin’ny taranany fara aman-dimby. Tokony hasiany kofehy manga koa eo ambonin’ilay mikiramborambo.', '“teneno ny israelita hoe tokony hanisy mikiramborambo eo amin’ny morontongotr’akanjony izy ireo, hatramin’ny taranany fara aman-dimby. tokony hasiany kofehy manga koa eo ambonin’ilay mikiramborambo.'),
  ('6aadc7322eb1e57da27d6f27', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.036Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.036Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 15, 37, 'Hoy koa i Jehovah tamin’i Mosesy:', 'hoy koa i jehovah tamin’i mosesy:'),
  ('6aadc7322eb1e57da27d6f26', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.036Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.036Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 15, 36, 'Dia nentin’ny vahoaka manontolo teny ivelan’ny toby izy ka notorahany vato, araka ny didy nomen’i Jehovah an’i Mosesy. Dia maty izy.', 'dia nentin’ny vahoaka manontolo teny ivelan’ny toby izy ka notorahany vato, araka ny didy nomen’i jehovah an’i mosesy. dia maty izy.'),
  ('6aadc7322eb1e57da27d6f25', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.036Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.036Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 15, 35, 'Dia hoy i Jehovah tamin’i Mosesy: “Tsy maintsy vonoina ho faty ilay lehilahy, ka hitora-bato azy eny ivelan’ny toby ny vahoaka manontolo.”', 'dia hoy i jehovah tamin’i mosesy: “tsy maintsy vonoina ho faty ilay lehilahy, ka hitora-bato azy eny ivelan’ny toby ny vahoaka manontolo.”'),
  ('6aadc7322eb1e57da27d6f24', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.036Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.036Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 15, 34, 'Nambenana tsara àry izy, satria mbola tsy tena fantatra hoe inona no tokony hatao aminy.', 'nambenana tsara àry izy, satria mbola tsy tena fantatra hoe inona no tokony hatao aminy.'),
  ('6aadc7322eb1e57da27d6f23', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.036Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.036Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 15, 33, 'Dia nitondra azy nankany amin’i Mosesy sy Arona ary ny vahoaka manontolo ireo nahita azy naka kitay ireo.', 'dia nitondra azy nankany amin’i mosesy sy arona ary ny vahoaka manontolo ireo nahita azy naka kitay ireo.'),
  ('6aadc7322eb1e57da27d6f22', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.036Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.036Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 15, 32, 'Tamin’ny mbola tany an-tany efitra ny Israelita, dia nahita lehilahy naka kitay tamin’ny andro sabata.', 'tamin’ny mbola tany an-tany efitra ny israelita, dia nahita lehilahy naka kitay tamin’ny andro sabata.'),
  ('6aadc7322eb1e57da27d6f21', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.036Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.036Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 15, 31, 'Tsy maintsy haringana izy satria nataony tsinontsinona ny tenin’i Jehovah sady tsy narahiny ny didiny. Hizaka ny vokatry ny fahadisoana nataony izy.’”', 'tsy maintsy haringana izy satria nataony tsinontsinona ny tenin’i jehovah sady tsy narahiny ny didiny. hizaka ny vokatry ny fahadisoana nataony izy.’”'),
  ('6aadc7322eb1e57da27d6f20', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.036Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.036Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 15, 30, '“‘Fa izay olona manao fanahy iniana manota kosa, na teratany izy na vahiny, dia manevateva an’i Jehovah, ka haringana tsy ho anisan’ny fireneny.', '“‘fa izay olona manao fanahy iniana manota kosa, na teratany izy na vahiny, dia manevateva an’i jehovah, ka haringana tsy ho anisan’ny fireneny.'),
  ('6aadc7322eb1e57da27d6f1f', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.036Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.036Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 15, 29, 'Lalàna iray ihany no ho an’ny teratany israelita sy ny vahiny mipetraka eo amin’izy ireo, rehefa misy manota tsy nahy.', 'lalàna iray ihany no ho an’ny teratany israelita sy ny vahiny mipetraka eo amin’izy ireo, rehefa misy manota tsy nahy.'),
  ('6aadc7322eb1e57da27d6f1e', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.036Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.036Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 15, 28, 'Dia handrakotra ny fahotan’ilay olona ny mpisorona, fa nanao fahadisoana izy tamin’izy nanota tsy nahy teo anatrehan’i Jehovah. Handrakotra ny fahotany ilay mpisorona, dia havela ny helony.', 'dia handrakotra ny fahotan’ilay olona ny mpisorona, fa nanao fahadisoana izy tamin’izy nanota tsy nahy teo anatrehan’i jehovah. handrakotra ny fahotany ilay mpisorona, dia havela ny helony.'),
  ('6aadc7322eb1e57da27d6f1d', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.036Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.036Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 15, 27, '“‘Ary raha misy olona manota tsy nahy, dia hanolotra osivavy tsy mihoatra ny herintaona izy, hatao fanatitra noho ny ota.', '“‘ary raha misy olona manota tsy nahy, dia hanolotra osivavy tsy mihoatra ny herintaona izy, hatao fanatitra noho ny ota.'),
  ('6aadc7322eb1e57da27d6f1c', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.036Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.036Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 15, 26, 'Havela ny heloky ny Israelita rehetra sy ny hafa firenena mipetraka eo aminy, satria tsy fanahy inian’ilay vahoaka manontolo ilay fahadisoana.', 'havela ny heloky ny israelita rehetra sy ny hafa firenena mipetraka eo aminy, satria tsy fanahy inian’ilay vahoaka manontolo ilay fahadisoana.'),
  ('6aadc7322eb1e57da27d6f1b', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.036Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.036Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 15, 25, 'Dia handrakotra ny fahotan’ny Israelita rehetra ny mpisorona, ka havela ny helok’izy ireo. Tsy fanahy inian’izy ireo mantsy ilay fahadisoana, sady izy ireo koa efa nitondra fanatitra atao anaty afo ho an’i Jehovah sy fanatitra noho ny ota eo anatrehan’i Jehovah noho ilay fahadisoany.', 'dia handrakotra ny fahotan’ny israelita rehetra ny mpisorona, ka havela ny helok’izy ireo. tsy fanahy inian’izy ireo mantsy ilay fahadisoana, sady izy ireo koa efa nitondra fanatitra atao anaty afo ho an’i jehovah sy fanatitra noho ny ota eo anatrehan’i jehovah noho ilay fahadisoany.'),
  ('6aadc7322eb1e57da27d6f1a', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.036Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.036Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 15, 24, 'ary raha tsy fanahy iniana ilay fahadisoana sady tsy fantatry ny vahoaka, dia hanolotra vantotr’ombilahy iray ho fanatitra dorana ny vahoaka manontolo mba ho hanitra mahafinaritra an’i Jehovah. Dia hampiarahiny amin’ny fanatitra varimbazaha sy fanatitra zava-pisotro izany, araka ny efa fanao. Hanolotra zanak’osy iray koa izy ireo, hatao fanatitra noho ny ota.', 'ary raha tsy fanahy iniana ilay fahadisoana sady tsy fantatry ny vahoaka, dia hanolotra vantotr’ombilahy iray ho fanatitra dorana ny vahoaka manontolo mba ho hanitra mahafinaritra an’i jehovah. dia hampiarahiny amin’ny fanatitra varimbazaha sy fanatitra zava-pisotro izany, araka ny efa fanao. hanolotra zanak’osy iray koa izy ireo, hatao fanatitra noho ny ota.'),
  ('6aadc7322eb1e57da27d6f19', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.036Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.036Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 15, 23, 'izany hoe izay rehetra nandidian’i Jehovah anareo tamin’ny alalan’i Mosesy, ka tokony harahinareo nanomboka tamin’ny andro nanomezan’i Jehovah an’izany didy izany sady tokony harahin’ny taranakareo fara aman-dimby,', 'izany hoe izay rehetra nandidian’i jehovah anareo tamin’ny alalan’i mosesy, ka tokony harahinareo nanomboka tamin’ny andro nanomezan’i jehovah an’izany didy izany sady tokony harahin’ny taranakareo fara aman-dimby,'),
  ('6aadc7322eb1e57da27d6f18', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.036Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.036Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 15, 22, '“‘Ary raha manao fahadisoana ianareo, ka tsy manaraka an’ireo didy rehetra nolazain’i Jehovah tamin’i Mosesy ireo,', '“‘ary raha manao fahadisoana ianareo, ka tsy manaraka an’ireo didy rehetra nolazain’i jehovah tamin’i mosesy ireo,'),
  ('6aadc7322eb1e57da27d6f17', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.036Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.036Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 15, 21, 'Ny ampahany amin’ny santatry ny varimbazahanareo tsy nototoina malemy no hataonareo fanomezana ho an’i Jehovah, ary hanao an’izany ianareo hatramin’ny taranakareo fara aman-dimby.', 'ny ampahany amin’ny santatry ny varimbazahanareo tsy nototoina malemy no hataonareo fanomezana ho an’i jehovah, ary hanao an’izany ianareo hatramin’ny taranakareo fara aman-dimby.'),
  ('6aadc7322eb1e57da27d6f16', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.036Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.036Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 15, 20, 'Mofo boribory avy amin’ny santatry ny varimbazahanareo tsy nototoina malemy no ataovy fanomezana. Hoatran’ny ataonareo rehefa manome vokatra avy eny am-pamoloana ihany no hataonareo rehefa manome an’ilay izy.', 'mofo boribory avy amin’ny santatry ny varimbazahanareo tsy nototoina malemy no ataovy fanomezana. hoatran’ny ataonareo rehefa manome vokatra avy eny am-pamoloana ihany no hataonareo rehefa manome an’ilay izy.'),
  ('6aadc7322eb1e57da27d6f15', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.036Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.036Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 15, 19, 'ka mihinana amin’ny vokatry ny tany, dia tokony hanao fanomezana ho an’i Jehovah.', 'ka mihinana amin’ny vokatry ny tany, dia tokony hanao fanomezana ho an’i jehovah.'),
  ('6aadc7322eb1e57da27d6f14', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.036Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.036Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 15, 18, '“Teneno ny Israelita hoe: ‘Rehefa tafiditra ao amin’ilay tany itondrako anareo ianareo,', '“teneno ny israelita hoe: ‘rehefa tafiditra ao amin’ilay tany itondrako anareo ianareo,'),
  ('6aadc7322eb1e57da27d6f13', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.036Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.036Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 15, 17, 'Hoy koa i Jehovah tamin’i Mosesy:', 'hoy koa i jehovah tamin’i mosesy:'),
  ('6aadc7322eb1e57da27d6f12', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.036Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.036Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 15, 16, 'Lalàna iray sy didim-pitsarana iray ihany no ho anareo sy ho an’ny hafa firenena mipetraka eo aminareo.’”', 'lalàna iray sy didim-pitsarana iray ihany no ho anareo sy ho an’ny hafa firenena mipetraka eo aminareo.’”'),
  ('6aadc7322eb1e57da27d6f11', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.036Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.036Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 15, 15, 'Ho fitsipika iray ihany no ho anareo anisan’ny fiangonana sy ho an’ny hafa firenena mipetraka eo aminareo. Ho fitsipika tokony harahinareo sy ny taranakareo foana izany. Eo anatrehan’i Jehovah, dia mitovy aminareo ihany ny hafa firenena mipetraka eo aminareo.', 'ho fitsipika iray ihany no ho anareo anisan’ny fiangonana sy ho an’ny hafa firenena mipetraka eo aminareo. ho fitsipika tokony harahinareo sy ny taranakareo foana izany. eo anatrehan’i jehovah, dia mitovy aminareo ihany ny hafa firenena mipetraka eo aminareo.'),
  ('6aadc7322eb1e57da27d6f10', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.036Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.036Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 15, 14, '“‘Ary raha misy hafa firenena mipetraka eo aminareo na olona efa teo aminareo efa hatramin’ny taranaka maro nifandimby, ka manolotra fanatitra atao anaty afo mba ho hanitra mahafinaritra an’i Jehovah, dia tokony hanao hoatran’ny ataonareo koa izy.', '“‘ary raha misy hafa firenena mipetraka eo aminareo na olona efa teo aminareo efa hatramin’ny taranaka maro nifandimby, ka manolotra fanatitra atao anaty afo mba ho hanitra mahafinaritra an’i jehovah, dia tokony hanao hoatran’ny ataonareo koa izy.'),
  ('6aadc7322eb1e57da27d6f0f', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.036Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.036Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 15, 13, 'Izany no tokony hataon’ny teratany israelita rehetra, rehefa manolotra fanatitra atao anaty afo mba ho hanitra mahafinaritra an’i Jehovah.', 'izany no tokony hataon’ny teratany israelita rehetra, rehefa manolotra fanatitra atao anaty afo mba ho hanitra mahafinaritra an’i jehovah.'),
  ('6aadc7322eb1e57da27d6f0e', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.036Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.036Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 15, 12, 'Na firy na firy no hatolotrareo, dia izany no tokony hataonareo isaky ny biby tsirairay.', 'na firy na firy no hatolotrareo, dia izany no tokony hataonareo isaky ny biby tsirairay.'),
  ('6aadc7322eb1e57da27d6f0d', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.036Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.036Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 15, 11, 'Izany no tokony hatao isaky ny manolotra ombilahy na ondrilahy efa lehibe na ondrilahy kely na osy.', 'izany no tokony hatao isaky ny manolotra ombilahy na ondrilahy efa lehibe na ondrilahy kely na osy.'),
  ('6aadc7322eb1e57da27d6f0c', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.036Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.036Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 15, 10, 'Manolora koa divay antsasaky ny hina mba hatao fanatitra zava-pisotro, ho fanatitra atao anaty afo, mba ho fofona mahafinaritra an’i Jehovah.', 'manolora koa divay antsasaky ny hina mba hatao fanatitra zava-pisotro, ho fanatitra atao anaty afo, mba ho fofona mahafinaritra an’i jehovah.'),
  ('6aadc7322eb1e57da27d6f0b', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.036Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.036Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 15, 9, 'dia tokony hanolotra fanatitra varimbazaha miaraka amin’ilay ombilahy koa ianao, izany hoe lafarinina tsara toto telo ampahafolon’ny efaha sady nafangaro menaka antsasaky ny hina.', 'dia tokony hanolotra fanatitra varimbazaha miaraka amin’ilay ombilahy koa ianao, izany hoe lafarinina tsara toto telo ampahafolon’ny efaha sady nafangaro menaka antsasaky ny hina.'),
  ('6aadc7322eb1e57da27d6f0a', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.036Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.036Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 15, 8, '“‘Raha ombilahy kosa no atolotrao mba hatao fanatitra dorana na ho sorona hanefana voady manokana na ho sorona iombonana ho an’i Jehovah,', '“‘raha ombilahy kosa no atolotrao mba hatao fanatitra dorana na ho sorona hanefana voady manokana na ho sorona iombonana ho an’i jehovah,'),
  ('6aadc7322eb1e57da27d6f09', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.036Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.036Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 15, 7, 'Ary manolora divay ampahatelon’ny hina ho fanatitra zava-pisotro, mba ho fofona mahafinaritra an’i Jehovah.', 'ary manolora divay ampahatelon’ny hina ho fanatitra zava-pisotro, mba ho fofona mahafinaritra an’i jehovah.'),
  ('6aadc7322eb1e57da27d6f08', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.036Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.036Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 15, 6, 'Raha ondrilahy efa lehibe kosa no hoentinao, dia ampiaraho amin’ny fanatitra varimbazaha ilay izy, izany hoe lafarinina tsara toto roa ampahafolon’ny efaha sady nafangaro menaka ampahatelon’ny hina.', 'raha ondrilahy efa lehibe kosa no hoentinao, dia ampiaraho amin’ny fanatitra varimbazaha ilay izy, izany hoe lafarinina tsara toto roa ampahafolon’ny efaha sady nafangaro menaka ampahatelon’ny hina.'),
  ('6aadc7322eb1e57da27d6f07', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.036Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.036Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 15, 5, 'Tokony hanolotra divay ampahefatry ny hina ho fanatitra zava-pisotro koa ianao, miaraka amin’ny ondrilahy kely atao fanatitra dorana na atao sorona.', 'tokony hanolotra divay ampahefatry ny hina ho fanatitra zava-pisotro koa ianao, miaraka amin’ny ondrilahy kely atao fanatitra dorana na atao sorona.'),
  ('6aadc7322eb1e57da27d6f06', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.036Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.036Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 15, 4, 'dia hanome fanatitra varimbazaha ho an’i Jehovah koa ilay manolotra fanatitra. Lafarinina tsara toto ampahafolon’ny efaha, sady nafangaro menaka ampahefatry ny hina, ilay fanatitra varimbazaha.', 'dia hanome fanatitra varimbazaha ho an’i jehovah koa ilay manolotra fanatitra. lafarinina tsara toto ampahafolon’ny efaha, sady nafangaro menaka ampahefatry ny hina, ilay fanatitra varimbazaha.'),
  ('6aadc7322eb1e57da27d6f05', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.036Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.036Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 15, 3, 'ka manolotra fanatitra atao anaty afo ho an’i Jehovah, na omby izany na ondry na osy, mba ho hanitra mahafinaritra an’i Jehovah,—na fanatitra dorana ilay izy, na sorona hanefana voady manokana, na fanatitra an-tsitrapo, na fanatitra mandritra an’ireo fety fanaonareo,—', 'ka manolotra fanatitra atao anaty afo ho an’i jehovah, na omby izany na ondry na osy, mba ho hanitra mahafinaritra an’i jehovah,—na fanatitra dorana ilay izy, na sorona hanefana voady manokana, na fanatitra an-tsitrapo, na fanatitra mandritra an’ireo fety fanaonareo,—'),
  ('6aadc7322eb1e57da27d6f04', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.036Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.036Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 15, 2, '“Teneno ny Israelita hoe: ‘Rehefa tafiditra ao amin’ilay tany omeko hipetrahanareo ianareo,', '“teneno ny israelita hoe: ‘rehefa tafiditra ao amin’ilay tany omeko hipetrahanareo ianareo,'),
  ('6aadc7322eb1e57da27d6f03', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.036Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.036Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 15, 1, 'Hoy koa i Jehovah tamin’i Mosesy:', 'hoy koa i jehovah tamin’i mosesy:'),
  ('6aadc7326bb8b32ff2024807', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.424Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.424Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 16, 50, 'Efa nitsahatra ilay loza vao niverina tany amin’i Mosesy teo amin’ny fidirana amin’ny tranolay fihaonana i Arona.', 'efa nitsahatra ilay loza vao niverina tany amin’i mosesy teo amin’ny fidirana amin’ny tranolay fihaonana i arona.'),
  ('6aadc7326bb8b32ff2024806', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.424Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.424Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 16, 49, 'Ary nahatratra 14 700 ny olona matin’ilay loza, ankoatra an’izay maty noho ny nataon’i Kora.', 'ary nahatratra 14 700 ny olona matin’ilay loza, ankoatra an’izay maty noho ny nataon’i kora.'),
  ('6aadc7326bb8b32ff2024805', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.424Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.424Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 16, 48, 'Nijoro teo anelanelan’ny maty sy ny velona foana izy, dia nitsahatra ihany ny loza tamin’ny farany.', 'nijoro teo anelanelan’ny maty sy ny velona foana izy, dia nitsahatra ihany ny loza tamin’ny farany.'),
  ('6aadc7326bb8b32ff2024804', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.424Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.424Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 16, 47, 'Tonga dia nalain’i Arona àry ilay izy, araka ny tenin’i Mosesy, ka nihazakazaka nankeny amin’ ny fiangonana izy. Dia io tokoa fa efa nanomboka namely ny vahoaka ny loza. Koa nasiany emboka manitra teo ambonin’ilay fitondrana afo, ka nandrakotra ny fahotan’ny vahoaka izy.', 'tonga dia nalain’i arona àry ilay izy, araka ny tenin’i mosesy, ka nihazakazaka nankeny amin’ ny fiangonana izy. dia io tokoa fa efa nanomboka namely ny vahoaka ny loza. koa nasiany emboka manitra teo ambonin’ilay fitondrana afo, ka nandrakotra ny fahotan’ny vahoaka izy.'),
  ('6aadc7326bb8b32ff2024803', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.424Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.424Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 16, 46, 'Avy eo dia hoy i Mosesy tamin’i Arona: “Alaivo ny fitondrana afo dia asio afo avy eo amin’ny alitara ilay izy, ary asio emboka manitra eo amboniny. Dia mandehana haingana eny amin’ny vahoaka mba handrakotra ny fahotan’izy ireo, fa tezitra be i Jehovah. Efa nanomboka mantsy ny loza!”', 'avy eo dia hoy i mosesy tamin’i arona: “alaivo ny fitondrana afo dia asio afo avy eo amin’ny alitara ilay izy, ary asio emboka manitra eo amboniny. dia mandehana haingana eny amin’ny vahoaka mba handrakotra ny fahotan’izy ireo, fa tezitra be i jehovah. efa nanomboka mantsy ny loza!”'),
  ('6aadc7326bb8b32ff2024802', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.424Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.424Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 16, 45, '“Mialà eo amin’io vahoaka io, fa haringako ao anatin’ny indray mipy maso ireo.” Dia niankohoka tamin’ny tany izy roa lahy.', '“mialà eo amin’io vahoaka io, fa haringako ao anatin’ny indray mipy maso ireo.” dia niankohoka tamin’ny tany izy roa lahy.'),
  ('6aadc7326bb8b32ff2024801', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.424Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.424Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 16, 44, 'Dia hoy i Jehovah tamin’i Mosesy:', 'dia hoy i jehovah tamin’i mosesy:'),
  ('6aadc7326bb8b32ff2024800', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.424Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.424Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 16, 43, 'Ary nankeo alohan’ny tranolay fihaonana i Mosesy sy Arona.', 'ary nankeo alohan’ny tranolay fihaonana i mosesy sy arona.'),
  ('6aadc7326bb8b32ff20247ff', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.424Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.424Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 16, 42, 'Tamin’ilay nivondrona hanohitra an’i Mosesy sy Arona ny vahoaka, dia nitodika tany amin’ny tranolay fihaonana izy ireo, dia io fa nanarona ny tranolay ny rahona, ary niseho ny voninahitr’i Jehovah.', 'tamin’ilay nivondrona hanohitra an’i mosesy sy arona ny vahoaka, dia nitodika tany amin’ny tranolay fihaonana izy ireo, dia io fa nanarona ny tranolay ny rahona, ary niseho ny voninahitr’i jehovah.'),
  ('6aadc7326bb8b32ff20247fe', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.424Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.424Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 16, 41, 'Ny ampitson’iny ihany, dia nimenomenona tamin’i Mosesy sy Arona ny vahoakan’Israely manontolo hoe: “Ianareo roa lahy ihany no nahafaty ny vahoakan’i Jehovah!”', 'ny ampitson’iny ihany, dia nimenomenona tamin’i mosesy sy arona ny vahoakan’israely manontolo hoe: “ianareo roa lahy ihany no nahafaty ny vahoakan’i jehovah!”'),
  ('6aadc7326bb8b32ff20247fd', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.424Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.424Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 16, 40, 'araka izay notenenin’i Jehovah taminy tamin’ny alalan’i Mosesy. Natao hampahatsiahivana ny Israelita izany hoe tsy misy mahazo mandoro emboka manitra eo anatrehan’i Jehovah ny olona tsy nahazo alalana sady tsy anisan’ny taranak’i Arona. Natao hampahatsiahivana ny Israelita koa izany hoe tsy misy olona tokony hanao hoatran’ny nataon’i Kora sy ny mpanohana azy.', 'araka izay notenenin’i jehovah taminy tamin’ny alalan’i mosesy. natao hampahatsiahivana ny israelita izany hoe tsy misy mahazo mandoro emboka manitra eo anatrehan’i jehovah ny olona tsy nahazo alalana sady tsy anisan’ny taranak’i arona. natao hampahatsiahivana ny israelita koa izany hoe tsy misy olona tokony hanao hoatran’ny nataon’i kora sy ny mpanohana azy.'),
  ('6aadc7326bb8b32ff20247fc', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.424Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.424Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 16, 39, 'Nalain’i Eleazara mpisorona àry ny fitondrana afo varahina nentin’ireny olona kilan’ny afo ireny. Dia nokapokapohiny izany ka nataony takelaka manify, dia napetany teo amin’ny alitara,', 'nalain’i eleazara mpisorona àry ny fitondrana afo varahina nentin’ireny olona kilan’ny afo ireny. dia nokapokapohiny izany ka nataony takelaka manify, dia napetany teo amin’ny alitara,'),
  ('6aadc7326bb8b32ff20247fb', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.424Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.424Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 16, 38, 'Alaivo ny fitondrana afon’ireny lehilahy maty noho ny fahotany ireny dia anamboary takelaka manify. Dia hapetaka eo amin’ny alitara ireo, satria nentiny teo anatrehan’i Jehovah ka masina. Hatao hampitandremana ny Israelita ireo takelaka manify ireo.’”', 'alaivo ny fitondrana afon’ireny lehilahy maty noho ny fahotany ireny dia anamboary takelaka manify. dia hapetaka eo amin’ny alitara ireo, satria nentiny teo anatrehan’i jehovah ka masina. hatao hampitandremana ny israelita ireo takelaka manify ireo.’”'),
  ('6aadc7326bb8b32ff20247fa', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.424Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.424Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 16, 37, '“Teneno i Eleazara zanakalahin’i Arona mpisorona mba haka an’ireo fitondrana afo ireo avy ao anaty afo, satria masina ireo. Teneno koa izy hoe ataovy miparitaka lavidavitra ny vainafo.', '“teneno i eleazara zanakalahin’i arona mpisorona mba haka an’ireo fitondrana afo ireo avy ao anaty afo, satria masina ireo. teneno koa izy hoe ataovy miparitaka lavidavitra ny vainafo.'),
  ('6aadc7326bb8b32ff20247f9', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.424Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.424Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 16, 36, 'Dia hoy i Jehovah tamin’i Mosesy:', 'dia hoy i jehovah tamin’i mosesy:'),
  ('6aadc7326bb8b32ff20247f8', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.424Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.424Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 16, 35, 'Avy eo dia nisy afo nalefan’i Jehovah ka nandevona an’ireo 250 lahy nanatitra emboka manitra.', 'avy eo dia nisy afo nalefan’i jehovah ka nandevona an’ireo 250 lahy nanatitra emboka manitra.'),
  ('6aadc7326bb8b32ff20247f7', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.424Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.424Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 16, 34, 'Ary nitsoaka daholo ny Israelita nanodidina teo, rehefa naheno azy ireo nikiakiaka. Hoy mantsy izy ireo: “Sao koa izahay hatelin’ny tany eo!”', 'ary nitsoaka daholo ny israelita nanodidina teo, rehefa naheno azy ireo nikiakiaka. hoy mantsy izy ireo: “sao koa izahay hatelin’ny tany eo!”'),
  ('6aadc7326bb8b32ff20247f6', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.424Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.424Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 16, 33, 'Dia nidina velona tany amin’ny Fasana izy ireo, niaraka tamin’izay nananany rehetra. Voasaron’ny tany tao izy ireo ka ringana tsy ho anisan’ny fiangonana intsony.', 'dia nidina velona tany amin’ny fasana izy ireo, niaraka tamin’izay nananany rehetra. voasaron’ny tany tao izy ireo ka ringana tsy ho anisan’ny fiangonana intsony.'),
  ('6aadc7326bb8b32ff20247f5', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.424Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.424Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 16, 32, 'Dia nisokatra ny tany ka nitelina azy ireo sy ny ankohonany ary ny olona rehetra niaraka tamin’i Kora. Natelin’ny tany daholo koa ny fananan’ireo olona ireo.', 'dia nisokatra ny tany ka nitelina azy ireo sy ny ankohonany ary ny olona rehetra niaraka tamin’i kora. natelin’ny tany daholo koa ny fananan’ireo olona ireo.'),
  ('6aadc7326bb8b32ff20247f4', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.424Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.424Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 16, 31, 'Vao avy niteny an’izany rehetra izany izy, dia nitresaka ny tany nitsanganan’izy ireo.', 'vao avy niteny an’izany rehetra izany izy, dia nitresaka ny tany nitsanganan’izy ireo.'),
  ('6aadc7326bb8b32ff20247f3', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.424Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.424Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 16, 30, 'Fa raha zavatra miavaka be kosa no ataon’i Jehovah amin’ireo, ka misokatra ny tany sady mitelina an’ireo miaraka amin’izay ananany rehetra, ary midina velona any amin’ny Fasana ireo, dia ho fantatrareo tokoa fa nanao tsinontsinona an’i Jehovah ireo lehilahy ireo.”', 'fa raha zavatra miavaka be kosa no ataon’i jehovah amin’ireo, ka misokatra ny tany sady mitelina an’ireo miaraka amin’izay ananany rehetra, ary midina velona any amin’ny fasana ireo, dia ho fantatrareo tokoa fa nanao tsinontsinona an’i jehovah ireo lehilahy ireo.”'),
  ('6aadc7326bb8b32ff20247f2', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.424Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.424Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 16, 29, 'Raha hoatran’ny fomba ahafatesan’ny olon-drehetra ihany ny fomba hahafatesan’ireo olona ireo, ary raha sazy mitovy amin’ny an’ny olon-drehetra ihany ny sazy homena azy, dia tsy i Jehovah no naniraka ahy.', 'raha hoatran’ny fomba ahafatesan’ny olon-drehetra ihany ny fomba hahafatesan’ireo olona ireo, ary raha sazy mitovy amin’ny an’ny olon-drehetra ihany ny sazy homena azy, dia tsy i jehovah no naniraka ahy.'),
  ('6aadc7326bb8b32ff20247f1', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.424Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.424Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 16, 28, 'Hoy i Mosesy avy eo: “Izao no hahafantaranareo fa i Jehovah no naniraka ahy hanao an’ireny zavatra rehetra ireny, fa tsy hoe sitrapoko fotsiny:', 'hoy i mosesy avy eo: “izao no hahafantaranareo fa i jehovah no naniraka ahy hanao an’ireny zavatra rehetra ireny, fa tsy hoe sitrapoko fotsiny:'),
  ('6aadc7326bb8b32ff20247f0', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.424Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.424Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 16, 27, 'Tonga dia niala teny amin’ny manodidina ny tranolain’i Kora sy Datana ary Abirama ny olona. Dia ireny i Datana sy Abirama fa nivoaka ka nijoro teo amin’ny fidirana amin’ny tranolainy, niaraka tamin’ny vadiny sy ny zanany ary ny zanany kely.', 'tonga dia niala teny amin’ny manodidina ny tranolain’i kora sy datana ary abirama ny olona. dia ireny i datana sy abirama fa nivoaka ka nijoro teo amin’ny fidirana amin’ny tranolainy, niaraka tamin’ny vadiny sy ny zanany ary ny zanany kely.'),
  ('6aadc7326bb8b32ff20247ef', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.424Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.424Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 16, 26, 'Ary hoy izy tamin’ny vahoaka: “Miangavy anareo aho mba hiala eny akaikin’ny tranolain’ireo olona ratsy fanahy ireo. Aza mikasika an’izay ananany rehetra, sao ianareo ho ringana noho ny fahotany.”', 'ary hoy izy tamin’ny vahoaka: “miangavy anareo aho mba hiala eny akaikin’ny tranolain’ireo olona ratsy fanahy ireo. aza mikasika an’izay ananany rehetra, sao ianareo ho ringana noho ny fahotany.”'),
  ('6aadc7326bb8b32ff20247ee', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.424Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.424Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 16, 25, 'Dia nankeny amin’i Datana sy Abirama i Mosesy, ary niaraka taminy ny anti-panahin’ny Israely.', 'dia nankeny amin’i datana sy abirama i mosesy, ary niaraka taminy ny anti-panahin’ny israely.'),
  ('6aadc7326bb8b32ff20247ed', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.424Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.424Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 16, 24, '“Teneno ny vahoaka hoe: ‘Mialà eny akaikin’ny tranolain’i Kora sy Datana ary Abirama!’”', '“teneno ny vahoaka hoe: ‘mialà eny akaikin’ny tranolain’i kora sy datana ary abirama!’”'),
  ('6aadc7326bb8b32ff20247ec', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.424Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.424Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 16, 23, 'Dia hoy i Jehovah tamin’i Mosesy:', 'dia hoy i jehovah tamin’i mosesy:'),
  ('6aadc7326bb8b32ff20247eb', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.424Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.424Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 16, 22, 'Dia niankohoka tamin’ny tany izy roa lahy ka niteny hoe: “Andriamanitra ô! Ianao no Andriamanitra manome aina ny olona rehetra. Olona iray ve no nanota dia tezitra amin’ny vahoaka manontolo ianao?”', 'dia niankohoka tamin’ny tany izy roa lahy ka niteny hoe: “andriamanitra ô! ianao no andriamanitra manome aina ny olona rehetra. olona iray ve no nanota dia tezitra amin’ny vahoaka manontolo ianao?”'),
  ('6aadc7326bb8b32ff20247ea', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.424Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.424Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 16, 21, '“Mialà eo amin’ireo olona ireo, fa haringako ao anatin’ny indray mipy maso ireo!”', '“mialà eo amin’ireo olona ireo, fa haringako ao anatin’ny indray mipy maso ireo!”'),
  ('6aadc7326bb8b32ff20247e9', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.424Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.424Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 16, 20, 'Ary hoy i Jehovah tamin’i Mosesy sy Arona:', 'ary hoy i jehovah tamin’i mosesy sy arona:'),
  ('6aadc7326bb8b32ff20247e8', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.424Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.424Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 16, 19, 'Ary efa novorin’i Kora teo amin’ny fidirana amin’ny tranolay fihaonana ny mpanohana azy, mba hanohitra azy roa lahy. Dia niseho tamin’ny vahoaka manontolo ny voninahitr’i Jehovah.', 'ary efa novorin’i kora teo amin’ny fidirana amin’ny tranolay fihaonana ny mpanohana azy, mba hanohitra azy roa lahy. dia niseho tamin’ny vahoaka manontolo ny voninahitr’i jehovah.'),
  ('6aadc7326bb8b32ff20247e7', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.424Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.424Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 16, 18, 'Dia samy naka ny fitondrany afo izy ireo, ka nanisy afo sy emboka manitra teo amboniny, dia nijoro teo amin’ny fidirana amin’ny tranolay fihaonana, niaraka tamin’i Mosesy sy Arona.', 'dia samy naka ny fitondrany afo izy ireo, ka nanisy afo sy emboka manitra teo amboniny, dia nijoro teo amin’ny fidirana amin’ny tranolay fihaonana, niaraka tamin’i mosesy sy arona.'),
  ('6aadc7326bb8b32ff20247e6', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.424Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.424Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 16, 17, 'Samia maka ny fitondrany afo, dia asio emboka manitra eo ambonin’ilay izy. Ary samia mitondra ny fitondrany afo eo anatrehan’i Jehovah. Hitondra fitondrana afo 250 ireo mpanohana anao ireo, dia hitondra koa ianao sy Arona.”', 'samia maka ny fitondrany afo, dia asio emboka manitra eo ambonin’ilay izy. ary samia mitondra ny fitondrany afo eo anatrehan’i jehovah. hitondra fitondrana afo 250 ireo mpanohana anao ireo, dia hitondra koa ianao sy arona.”'),
  ('6aadc7326bb8b32ff20247e5', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.424Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.424Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 16, 16, 'Ary hoy i Mosesy tamin’i Kora: “Mandehana miseho eo anatrehan’i Jehovah ianao sy ny mpanohana anao rehetra rahampitso, dia ianao sy ry zareo ary Arona.', 'ary hoy i mosesy tamin’i kora: “mandehana miseho eo anatrehan’i jehovah ianao sy ny mpanohana anao rehetra rahampitso, dia ianao sy ry zareo ary arona.'),
  ('6aadc7326bb8b32ff20247e4', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.424Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.424Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 16, 15, 'Dia tezitra be i Mosesy, ka hoy izy tamin’i Jehovah: “Aza jerena akory ny fanatitra varimbazaha atolotr’ireo. Na ampondra iray aza tsy nalaiko taminy, ary tsy nisy nasiako ratsy ry zareo.”', 'dia tezitra be i mosesy, ka hoy izy tamin’i jehovah: “aza jerena akory ny fanatitra varimbazaha atolotr’ireo. na ampondra iray aza tsy nalaiko taminy, ary tsy nisy nasiako ratsy ry zareo.”'),
  ('6aadc7326bb8b32ff20247e3', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.424Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.424Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 16, 14, 'Tsy nampiditra anay tany amin’ny tany tondra-dronono sy tantely ianao, sady tsy nanome anay saha sy tanimboaloboka mba ho lovanay. Fa tadiavinao hopotsirina mihitsy ve ny mason’ireo olona ireo e? Izahay tsy ho any!”', 'tsy nampiditra anay tany amin’ny tany tondra-dronono sy tantely ianao, sady tsy nanome anay saha sy tanimboaloboka mba ho lovanay. fa tadiavinao hopotsirina mihitsy ve ny mason’ireo olona ireo e? izahay tsy ho any!”'),
  ('6aadc7326bb8b32ff20247e2', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.424Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.424Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 16, 13, 'Ianao aza efa nitondra anay niala tany amin’ny tany tondra-dronono sy tantely mba hahafaty anay atỳ an-tany efitra atỳ! Angaha tsy ampy anao izany no mbola mitady hanjakazaka aminay koa ianao?', 'ianao aza efa nitondra anay niala tany amin’ny tany tondra-dronono sy tantely mba hahafaty anay atỳ an-tany efitra atỳ! angaha tsy ampy anao izany no mbola mitady hanjakazaka aminay koa ianao?'),
  ('6aadc7326bb8b32ff20247e1', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.424Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.424Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 16, 12, 'Nampanantsoin’i Mosesy i Datana sy Abirama zanak’i Eliaba taorian’izay, nefa hoy izy roa lahy: “Izahay tsy ho any!', 'nampanantsoin’i mosesy i datana sy abirama zanak’i eliaba taorian’izay, nefa hoy izy roa lahy: “izahay tsy ho any!'),
  ('6aadc7326bb8b32ff20247e0', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.424Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.424Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 16, 11, 'Izany no mahatonga anao sy ny mpanohana anao rehetra hiara-manohitra an’i Jehovah hoatr’izao. Fa i Arona moa no iza no imenomenonanareo?”', 'izany no mahatonga anao sy ny mpanohana anao rehetra hiara-manohitra an’i jehovah hoatr’izao. fa i arona moa no iza no imenomenonanareo?”'),
  ('6aadc7326bb8b32ff20247df', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.424Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.424Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 16, 10, 'Dia nasainy nanatona azy koa ianareo sy ny rahalahinareo rehetra taranak’i Levy. Angaha tsy misy dikany izany aminareo? Dia mbola te ho mpisorona koa ve ianareo?', 'dia nasainy nanatona azy koa ianareo sy ny rahalahinareo rehetra taranak’i levy. angaha tsy misy dikany izany aminareo? dia mbola te ho mpisorona koa ve ianareo?'),
  ('6aadc7326bb8b32ff20247de', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.424Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.424Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 16, 9, 'Angaha tsy misy dikany aminareo ilay ianareo navahan’ilay Andriamanitry ny Israely tamin’ny vahoakan’Israely? Dia navelany hanatona azy ianareo mba hanompo ao amin’ny tranolain’i Jehovah, sy hijoro eo anatrehan’ny vahoaka mba hanompo azy ireo!', 'angaha tsy misy dikany aminareo ilay ianareo navahan’ilay andriamanitry ny israely tamin’ny vahoakan’israely? dia navelany hanatona azy ianareo mba hanompo ao amin’ny tranolain’i jehovah, sy hijoro eo anatrehan’ny vahoaka mba hanompo azy ireo!'),
  ('6aadc7326bb8b32ff20247dd', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.424Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.424Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 16, 8, 'Dia hoy i Mosesy tamin’i Kora: “Mba henoy kely izao, ry taranak’i Levy:', 'dia hoy i mosesy tamin’i kora: “mba henoy kely izao, ry taranak’i levy:'),
  ('6aadc7326bb8b32ff20247dc', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.424Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.424Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 16, 7, 'Asio afo ao anatiny, dia asio emboka manitra eo amboniny. Rahampitso izany no hataonareo eo anatrehan’i Jehovah. Dia izay olona hofidin’i Jehovah no masina. Efa tafahoatra loatra ny ataonareo, ry taranak’i Levy!”', 'asio afo ao anatiny, dia asio emboka manitra eo amboniny. rahampitso izany no hataonareo eo anatrehan’i jehovah. dia izay olona hofidin’i jehovah no masina. efa tafahoatra loatra ny ataonareo, ry taranak’i levy!”'),
  ('6aadc7326bb8b32ff20247db', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.424Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.424Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 16, 6, 'Izao àry atao: Makà fitondrana afo, ry Kora sy ianareo mpanohana azy rehetra.', 'izao àry atao: makà fitondrana afo, ry kora sy ianareo mpanohana azy rehetra.'),
  ('6aadc7326bb8b32ff20247da', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.424Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.424Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 16, 5, 'Ary hoy izy tamin’i Kora sy ny mpanohana azy rehetra: “Rahampitso maraina i Jehovah no hampahafantatra hoe iza no azy, dia iza no masina, ary iza no tokony hanatona azy, ka izay hofidiny no hanatona azy.', 'ary hoy izy tamin’i kora sy ny mpanohana azy rehetra: “rahampitso maraina i jehovah no hampahafantatra hoe iza no azy, dia iza no masina, ary iza no tokony hanatona azy, ka izay hofidiny no hanatona azy.'),
  ('6aadc7326bb8b32ff20247d9', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.424Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.424Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 16, 4, 'Vao naheno an’izany i Mosesy dia niankohoka.', 'vao naheno an’izany i mosesy dia niankohoka.'),
  ('6aadc7326bb8b32ff20247d8', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.424Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.424Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 16, 3, 'Dia nitambatra hanohitra an’i Mosesy sy Arona izy ireo, ka niteny hoe: “Tena leo anareo izahay! Masina daholo ange ny vahoaka manontolo e, dia i Jehovah no eo aminy. Koa maninona ianareo no mieritreritra hoe ambony noho ny fiangonan’i Jehovah?”', 'dia nitambatra hanohitra an’i mosesy sy arona izy ireo, ka niteny hoe: “tena leo anareo izahay! masina daholo ange ny vahoaka manontolo e, dia i jehovah no eo aminy. koa maninona ianareo no mieritreritra hoe ambony noho ny fiangonan’i jehovah?”'),
  ('6aadc7326bb8b32ff20247d7', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.424Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.424Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 16, 2, 'Nanohitra an’i Mosesy izy ireo, niaraka tamin’ny lehilahy israelita 250. Mpiadidy vahoaka daholo ireo lehilahy ireo, ary solontenan’ny fiangonana sady olona ambony.', 'nanohitra an’i mosesy izy ireo, niaraka tamin’ny lehilahy israelita 250. mpiadidy vahoaka daholo ireo lehilahy ireo, ary solontenan’ny fiangonana sady olona ambony.'),
  ('6aadc7326bb8b32ff20247d6', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.424Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.424Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 16, 1, 'Ary i Kora, zanak’i Jizara, zanak’i Kehata, zanak’i Levy, dia niray tetika tamin’i Datana sy Abirama, zanak’i Eliaba, ary Ona zanak’i Peleta, izay samy taranak’i Robena.', 'ary i kora, zanak’i jizara, zanak’i kehata, zanak’i levy, dia niray tetika tamin’i datana sy abirama, zanak’i eliaba, ary ona zanak’i peleta, izay samy taranak’i robena.'),
  ('6aadc7323d3c2e2fe605944a', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.915Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.915Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 17, 13, 'Fa ho faty izay manakaikikaiky ny tranolain’i Jehovah! Dia izahay ve izany dia ho faty daholo?”', 'fa ho faty izay manakaikikaiky ny tranolain’i jehovah! dia izahay ve izany dia ho faty daholo?”'),
  ('6aadc7323d3c2e2fe6059449', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.915Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.915Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 17, 12, 'Ary hoy ny Israelita tamin’i Mosesy: “Ho faty izao izahay! Tena ho ringana mihitsy izahay! Ho ringana daholo!', 'ary hoy ny israelita tamin’i mosesy: “ho faty izao izahay! tena ho ringana mihitsy izahay! ho ringana daholo!'),
  ('6aadc7323d3c2e2fe6059448', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.915Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.915Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 17, 11, 'Tonga dia nataon’i Mosesy izany, araka ny didy nomen’i Jehovah azy. Izany mihitsy no nataony.', 'tonga dia nataon’i mosesy izany, araka ny didy nomen’i jehovah azy. izany mihitsy no nataony.'),
  ('6aadc7323d3c2e2fe6059447', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.915Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.915Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 17, 10, 'Dia hoy i Jehovah tamin’i Mosesy: “Avereno eo anoloan’ny Vata Misy ny Tenin’ny Vavolombelona ny tehin’i Arona, fa hotehirizina eo izy io ho fampitandremana ho an’izay zatra mikomy, mba tsy himenomenona amiko intsony izy ireo, ka tsy ho faty.”', 'dia hoy i jehovah tamin’i mosesy: “avereno eo anoloan’ny vata misy ny tenin’ny vavolombelona ny tehin’i arona, fa hotehirizina eo izy io ho fampitandremana ho an’izay zatra mikomy, mba tsy himenomenona amiko intsony izy ireo, ka tsy ho faty.”'),
  ('6aadc7323d3c2e2fe6059446', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.915Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.915Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 17, 9, 'Ary navoakan’i Mosesy avy teo anatrehan’i Jehovah daholo ireo tehina ireo, ka nentiny teo amin’ny vahoakan’Israely manontolo. Dia nijery an’ireo tehina ny olona, ka samy naka ny tehiny ny lehilahy tsirairay.', 'ary navoakan’i mosesy avy teo anatrehan’i jehovah daholo ireo tehina ireo, ka nentiny teo amin’ny vahoakan’israely manontolo. dia nijery an’ireo tehina ny olona, ka samy naka ny tehiny ny lehilahy tsirairay.'),
  ('6aadc7323d3c2e2fe6059445', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.915Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.915Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 17, 8, 'Rehefa nankao amin’ny tranolay misy ny Tenin’ny Vavolombelona i Mosesy ny ampitson’iny, dia io fa efa nitsimoka ny tehin’i Arona, ilay an’ny taranak’i Levy. Nitsimoka ilay izy ka nisy felany sy voan’amandy efa masaka.', 'rehefa nankao amin’ny tranolay misy ny tenin’ny vavolombelona i mosesy ny ampitson’iny, dia io fa efa nitsimoka ny tehin’i arona, ilay an’ny taranak’i levy. nitsimoka ilay izy ka nisy felany sy voan’amandy efa masaka.'),
  ('6aadc7323d3c2e2fe6059444', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.915Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.915Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 17, 7, 'Dia napetrak’i Mosesy teo anatrehan’i Jehovah, tao amin’ny tranolay misy ny Tenin’ny Vavolombelona, ireo tehina ireo.', 'dia napetrak’i mosesy teo anatrehan’i jehovah, tao amin’ny tranolay misy ny tenin’ny vavolombelona, ireo tehina ireo.'),
  ('6aadc7323d3c2e2fe6059443', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.915Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.915Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 17, 6, 'Dia niteny tamin’ny Israelita i Mosesy, ka samy nanome azy tehina iray avy isaky ny fianakaviambe ny mpiadidy rehetra, dia tehina 12. Teo koa ny tehin’i Arona.', 'dia niteny tamin’ny israelita i mosesy, ka samy nanome azy tehina iray avy isaky ny fianakaviambe ny mpiadidy rehetra, dia tehina 12. teo koa ny tehin’i arona.'),
  ('6aadc7323d3c2e2fe6059442', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.915Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.915Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 17, 5, 'Ary hitsimoka ny tehin’izay lehilahy hofidiko, ka hatsahatro ny fimenomenonan’ny Israelita, izay mimenomenona amiko sy aminareo koa.”', 'ary hitsimoka ny tehin’izay lehilahy hofidiko, ka hatsahatro ny fimenomenonan’ny israelita, izay mimenomenona amiko sy aminareo koa.”'),
  ('6aadc7323d3c2e2fe6059441', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.915Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.915Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 17, 4, 'Apetraho ao amin’ny tranolay fihaonana ireo tehina ireo, ka ataovy eo anoloan’ny Vata Misy ny Tenin’ny Vavolombelona, eo amin’ilay isehoako aminao foana.', 'apetraho ao amin’ny tranolay fihaonana ireo tehina ireo, ka ataovy eo anoloan’ny vata misy ny tenin’ny vavolombelona, eo amin’ilay isehoako aminao foana.'),
  ('6aadc7323d3c2e2fe6059440', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.915Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.915Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 17, 3, 'Tokony hosoratanao eo amin’ny tehin’i Levy ny anaran’i Arona, satria tehina iray ihany isaky ny lohan’ny fianakaviambe.', 'tokony hosoratanao eo amin’ny tehin’i levy ny anaran’i arona, satria tehina iray ihany isaky ny lohan’ny fianakaviambe.'),
  ('6aadc7323d3c2e2fe605943f', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.915Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.915Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 17, 2, '“Teneno ny Israelita mba hanome tehina iray isaky ny fianakaviambe, avy amin’ny mpiadidy ny fianakaviambe tsirairay, ka tehina 12 izy rehetra. Dia soraty eo amin’ny tehiny avy ny anaran’ny tsirairay.', '“teneno ny israelita mba hanome tehina iray isaky ny fianakaviambe, avy amin’ny mpiadidy ny fianakaviambe tsirairay, ka tehina 12 izy rehetra. dia soraty eo amin’ny tehiny avy ny anaran’ny tsirairay.'),
  ('6aadc7323d3c2e2fe605943e', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.915Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:18.915Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 17, 1, 'Ary hoy i Jehovah tamin’i Mosesy:', 'ary hoy i jehovah tamin’i mosesy:'),
  ('6aadc7334724b04a527a4ee6', '2026-09-18T23:20:19.325Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:19.325Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 18, 8, 'Hoy koa i Jehovah tamin’i Arona: “Izaho mihitsy no manendry anao hiandraikitra an’ireo fanomezana omena ahy. Omeko amin’ny zava-masina rehetra omen’ny Israelita ianao sy ny zanakao lahy, ka ho anjaranareo foana izany.', 'hoy koa i jehovah tamin’i arona: “izaho mihitsy no manendry anao hiandraikitra an’ireo fanomezana omena ahy. omeko amin’ny zava-masina rehetra omen’ny israelita ianao sy ny zanakao lahy, ka ho anjaranareo foana izany.'),
  ('6aadc7334724b04a527a4ee5', '2026-09-18T23:20:19.325Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:19.325Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 18, 7, 'Manana adidy amin’ny alitara sy izay ao ambadiky ny ridao ianareo mpisorona, ka ianao sy ny zanakao lahy no miandraikitra an’izany. Hataoko fanomezana ho anareo ny asan’ny mpisorona, ary hovonoina ho faty izay olona tsy nahazo alalana nefa manatona eo.”', 'manana adidy amin’ny alitara sy izay ao ambadiky ny ridao ianareo mpisorona, ka ianao sy ny zanakao lahy no miandraikitra an’izany. hataoko fanomezana ho anareo ny asan’ny mpisorona, ary hovonoina ho faty izay olona tsy nahazo alalana nefa manatona eo.”'),
  ('6aadc7334724b04a527a4ee4', '2026-09-18T23:20:19.325Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:19.325Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 18, 6, 'Efa nalaiko avy teo amin’ny Israelita ny Levita rahalahinareo, mba ho fanomezana ho anareo. Ho an’i Jehovah izy ireo ary hanao ny fanompoana ao amin’ny tranolay fihaonana.', 'efa nalaiko avy teo amin’ny israelita ny levita rahalahinareo, mba ho fanomezana ho anareo. ho an’i jehovah izy ireo ary hanao ny fanompoana ao amin’ny tranolay fihaonana.');
INSERT INTO "bible_verses" ("id", "created_date", "updated_date", "created_by_id", "created_by", "translation", "book", "bookOrder", "chapter", "verse", "text", "normalizedText") VALUES
  ('6aadc7334724b04a527a4ee3', '2026-09-18T23:20:19.325Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:19.325Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 18, 5, 'Ataovy ny andraikitrareo amin’ny toerana masina sy ny alitara, mba tsy ho tezitra amin’ny vahoakan’Israely intsony aho.', 'ataovy ny andraikitrareo amin’ny toerana masina sy ny alitara, mba tsy ho tezitra amin’ny vahoakan’israely intsony aho.'),
  ('6aadc7334724b04a527a4ee2', '2026-09-18T23:20:19.325Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:19.325Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 18, 4, 'Ary hiara-miasa aminao izy ireo, ka hanao ny andraikiny mifandray amin’ny tranolay fihaonana sy ny fanompoana rehetra ao amin’ny tranolay. Tsy misy mahazo manakaiky anareo ny olona tsy nahazo alalana.', 'ary hiara-miasa aminao izy ireo, ka hanao ny andraikiny mifandray amin’ny tranolay fihaonana sy ny fanompoana rehetra ao amin’ny tranolay. tsy misy mahazo manakaiky anareo ny olona tsy nahazo alalana.'),
  ('6aadc7334724b04a527a4ee1', '2026-09-18T23:20:19.325Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:19.325Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 18, 3, 'Ary hanao ny andraikiny aminao sy amin’ny tranolay manontolo ry zareo. Tsy mahazo manakaiky ny fitaovan’ny toerana masina sy ny alitara anefa izy ireo, sao ho faty na ry zareo na ianareo.', 'ary hanao ny andraikiny aminao sy amin’ny tranolay manontolo ry zareo. tsy mahazo manakaiky ny fitaovan’ny toerana masina sy ny alitara anefa izy ireo, sao ho faty na ry zareo na ianareo.'),
  ('6aadc7334724b04a527a4ee0', '2026-09-18T23:20:19.325Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:19.325Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 18, 2, 'Asaivo mankeo aminao ny rahalahinao avy amin’ny fokon’i Levy, dia ny fokon’ny razambenao, mba hiara-miasa aminao sy hanampy anao sy ny zanakao lahy, eo anoloan’ny tranolay misy ny Tenin’ny Vavolombelona.', 'asaivo mankeo aminao ny rahalahinao avy amin’ny fokon’i levy, dia ny fokon’ny razambenao, mba hiara-miasa aminao sy hanampy anao sy ny zanakao lahy, eo anoloan’ny tranolay misy ny tenin’ny vavolombelona.'),
  ('6aadc7334724b04a527a4edf', '2026-09-18T23:20:19.325Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:19.325Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 18, 1, 'Ary hoy i Jehovah tamin’i Arona: “Ianao sy ny zanakao lahy ary ny fianakaviambenao no ho tompon’andraikitra raha misy manao fahadisoana ka mandoto ny toerana masina, ary ianao sy ny zanakao lahy no ho tompon’andraikitra raha misy manao fahadisoana mifandray amin’ny asan’ny mpisorona.', 'ary hoy i jehovah tamin’i arona: “ianao sy ny zanakao lahy ary ny fianakaviambenao no ho tompon’andraikitra raha misy manao fahadisoana ka mandoto ny toerana masina, ary ianao sy ny zanakao lahy no ho tompon’andraikitra raha misy manao fahadisoana mifandray amin’ny asan’ny mpisorona.'),
  ('6aadc7334724b04a527a4efe', '2026-09-18T23:20:19.326Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:19.326Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 18, 32, 'Tsy fahotana ho anareo izany, rehefa ny tsara indrindra amin’ireny no omenareo. Ary aza manazimbazimba ny zava-masina omen’ny Israelita, sao ho faty ianareo.’”', 'tsy fahotana ho anareo izany, rehefa ny tsara indrindra amin’ireny no omenareo. ary aza manazimbazimba ny zava-masina omen’ny israelita, sao ho faty ianareo.’”'),
  ('6aadc7334724b04a527a4efd', '2026-09-18T23:20:19.326Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:19.326Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 18, 31, 'Mahazo mihinana an’ireny any amin’ny toerana rehetra ianareo sy ny ankohonanareo, satria ireny no karamanareo ho tambin’ny fanompoanareo ao amin’ny tranolay fihaonana.', 'mahazo mihinana an’ireny any amin’ny toerana rehetra ianareo sy ny ankohonanareo, satria ireny no karamanareo ho tambin’ny fanompoanareo ao amin’ny tranolay fihaonana.'),
  ('6aadc7334724b04a527a4efc', '2026-09-18T23:20:19.326Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:19.326Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 18, 30, '“Ary teneno ny Levita hoe: ‘Rehefa manome ny tsara indrindra amin’ireny ianareo, dia hoheverina hoatran’ny hoe vokatra avy eny amin’ny famoloananareo ihany izany, sy hoe divay na menaka avy amin’ny famiazanareo ihany.', '“ary teneno ny levita hoe: ‘rehefa manome ny tsara indrindra amin’ireny ianareo, dia hoheverina hoatran’ny hoe vokatra avy eny amin’ny famoloananareo ihany izany, sy hoe divay na menaka avy amin’ny famiazanareo ihany.'),
  ('6aadc7334724b04a527a4efb', '2026-09-18T23:20:19.326Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:19.326Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 18, 29, 'Hanao fanomezana isan-karazany ho an’i Jehovah ianareo, ary ho zava-masina izany. Avy amin’izay tsara indrindra amin’ny fanomezana rehetra omena anareo no hanaovanareo an’izany.’', 'hanao fanomezana isan-karazany ho an’i jehovah ianareo, ary ho zava-masina izany. avy amin’izay tsara indrindra amin’ny fanomezana rehetra omena anareo no hanaovanareo an’izany.’'),
  ('6aadc7334724b04a527a4efa', '2026-09-18T23:20:19.326Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:19.326Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 18, 28, 'Amin’izay ianareo dia hanao fanomezana ho an’i Jehovah, avy amin’ny ampahafolon-karena rehetra azonareo avy amin’ny Israelita. Avy amin’ireny no hakanareo fanomezana ho an’i Jehovah, ka homenareo an’i Arona mpisorona.', 'amin’izay ianareo dia hanao fanomezana ho an’i jehovah, avy amin’ny ampahafolon-karena rehetra azonareo avy amin’ny israelita. avy amin’ireny no hakanareo fanomezana ho an’i jehovah, ka homenareo an’i arona mpisorona.'),
  ('6aadc7334724b04a527a4ef9', '2026-09-18T23:20:19.326Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:19.326Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 18, 27, 'Hoheverina ho fanomezanareo izany, ka hoatran’ny hoe voa avy eny amin’ny famoloananareo ihany, na hoe divay na menaka avy amin’ny famiazanareo ihany.', 'hoheverina ho fanomezanareo izany, ka hoatran’ny hoe voa avy eny amin’ny famoloananareo ihany, na hoe divay na menaka avy amin’ny famiazanareo ihany.'),
  ('6aadc7334724b04a527a4ef8', '2026-09-18T23:20:19.326Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:19.326Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 18, 26, '“Teneno ny Levita hoe: ‘Hahazo ny ampahafolon-karena avy amin’ny Israelita ianareo, ary efa nomeko anareo ho lovanareo izany. Dia tokony hataonareo fanomezana ho an’i Jehovah ny ampahafolony amin’ilay ampahafolon-karena.', '“teneno ny levita hoe: ‘hahazo ny ampahafolon-karena avy amin’ny israelita ianareo, ary efa nomeko anareo ho lovanareo izany. dia tokony hataonareo fanomezana ho an’i jehovah ny ampahafolony amin’ilay ampahafolon-karena.'),
  ('6aadc7334724b04a527a4ef7', '2026-09-18T23:20:19.326Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:19.326Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 18, 25, 'Dia hoy i Jehovah tamin’i Mosesy:', 'dia hoy i jehovah tamin’i mosesy:'),
  ('6aadc7334724b04a527a4ef6', '2026-09-18T23:20:19.326Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:19.326Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 18, 24, 'Fa efa nomeko ho lovan’ny Levita ny ampahafolon-karena omen’ny vahoakan’Israely ho fanomezana ho an’i Jehovah. Izany no nilazako taminy hoe: ‘Tsy hahazo lova eo amin’ny Israelita izy ireo.’”', 'fa efa nomeko ho lovan’ny levita ny ampahafolon-karena omen’ny vahoakan’israely ho fanomezana ho an’i jehovah. izany no nilazako taminy hoe: ‘tsy hahazo lova eo amin’ny israelita izy ireo.’”'),
  ('6aadc7334724b04a527a4ef5', '2026-09-18T23:20:19.326Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:19.326Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 18, 23, 'Fa ny Levita no hanao ny fanompoana ao amin’ny tranolay fihaonana, ary izy ireo no hizaka ny vokatry ny fahadisoan’ny vahoaka. Ary tokony hanaraka an’izao fitsipika izao foana ianareo sy ny taranakareo fara aman-dimby: Tsy hahazo lova eo amin’ny Israelita ny Levita.', 'fa ny levita no hanao ny fanompoana ao amin’ny tranolay fihaonana, ary izy ireo no hizaka ny vokatry ny fahadisoan’ny vahoaka. ary tokony hanaraka an’izao fitsipika izao foana ianareo sy ny taranakareo fara aman-dimby: tsy hahazo lova eo amin’ny israelita ny levita.'),
  ('6aadc7334724b04a527a4ef4', '2026-09-18T23:20:19.326Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:19.326Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 18, 22, 'Tsy mahazo manakaiky ny tranolay fihaonana intsony ny vahoakan’Israely, sao hanota ka ho faty.', 'tsy mahazo manakaiky ny tranolay fihaonana intsony ny vahoakan’israely, sao hanota ka ho faty.'),
  ('6aadc7334724b04a527a4ef3', '2026-09-18T23:20:19.326Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:19.326Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 18, 21, '“Efa nomeko ho lovan’ny taranak’i Levy ny ampahafolon-karena rehetra eo amin’ny Israely, ho takalon’ny fanompoana ataony, dia ny fanompoana ao amin’ny tranolay fihaonana.', '“efa nomeko ho lovan’ny taranak’i levy ny ampahafolon-karena rehetra eo amin’ny israely, ho takalon’ny fanompoana ataony, dia ny fanompoana ao amin’ny tranolay fihaonana.'),
  ('6aadc7334724b04a527a4ef2', '2026-09-18T23:20:19.326Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:19.326Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 18, 20, 'Hoy koa i Jehovah tamin’i Arona: “Tsy hanana lova ao amin’ny tanin’izy ireo ianao, ary tsy hisy anjara taninao eo aminy. Fa izaho no anjaranao sy lovanao eo amin’ny Israelita.', 'hoy koa i jehovah tamin’i arona: “tsy hanana lova ao amin’ny tanin’izy ireo ianao, ary tsy hisy anjara taninao eo aminy. fa izaho no anjaranao sy lovanao eo amin’ny israelita.'),
  ('6aadc7334724b04a527a4ef1', '2026-09-18T23:20:19.326Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:19.326Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 18, 19, 'Ny fanomezana masina rehetra izay homen’ny Israelita an’i Jehovah, dia efa nomeko anao sy ny zanakao lahy ary ny zanakao vavy. Ho anjaranareo foana izany. Fifanekena maharitra ataon’i Jehovah aminao sy ny taranakao izany.”', 'ny fanomezana masina rehetra izay homen’ny israelita an’i jehovah, dia efa nomeko anao sy ny zanakao lahy ary ny zanakao vavy. ho anjaranareo foana izany. fifanekena maharitra ataon’i jehovah aminao sy ny taranakao izany.”'),
  ('6aadc7334724b04a527a4ef0', '2026-09-18T23:20:19.326Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:19.326Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 18, 18, 'Ho anao ny nofony, toy ny tratrany izay atao fanatitra ahetsiketsika sy ny feny ankavanana.', 'ho anao ny nofony, toy ny tratrany izay atao fanatitra ahetsiketsika sy ny feny ankavanana.'),
  ('6aadc7334724b04a527a4eef', '2026-09-18T23:20:19.326Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:19.326Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 18, 17, 'Ny lahy voalohan-teraky ny omby na ondry na osy ihany no tsy havotanao fa masina. Hafafinao eo ambony alitara ny rany, ary hodoranao ny taviny mba hidona-tsetroka, ho fanatitra atao anaty afo, mba ho hanitra mahafinaritra an’i Jehovah.', 'ny lahy voalohan-teraky ny omby na ondry na osy ihany no tsy havotanao fa masina. hafafinao eo ambony alitara ny rany, ary hodoranao ny taviny mba hidona-tsetroka, ho fanatitra atao anaty afo, mba ho hanitra mahafinaritra an’i jehovah.'),
  ('6aadc7334724b04a527a4eee', '2026-09-18T23:20:19.326Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:19.326Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 18, 16, 'Izay iray volana no ho miakatra no havotanao, ka ny vola hanavotana azy dia ny vidiny anombanana azy, izany hoe volafotsy dimy sekely, araka ny sekely fampiasa ao amin’ny toerana masina. Ny iray sekely dia 20 gera.', 'izay iray volana no ho miakatra no havotanao, ka ny vola hanavotana azy dia ny vidiny anombanana azy, izany hoe volafotsy dimy sekely, araka ny sekely fampiasa ao amin’ny toerana masina. ny iray sekely dia 20 gera.'),
  ('6aadc7334724b04a527a4eed', '2026-09-18T23:20:19.326Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:19.326Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 18, 15, '“Ho anao daholo koa ny voalohan-teraka amin’ny zavamananaina rehetra hatolony ho an’i Jehovah, na olona izany na biby. Tsy maintsy havotanao anefa ny voalohan-teraky ny olona, ary havotanao koa ny voalohan-teraky ny biby maloto.', '“ho anao daholo koa ny voalohan-teraka amin’ny zavamananaina rehetra hatolony ho an’i jehovah, na olona izany na biby. tsy maintsy havotanao anefa ny voalohan-teraky ny olona, ary havotanao koa ny voalohan-teraky ny biby maloto.'),
  ('6aadc7334724b04a527a4eec', '2026-09-18T23:20:19.326Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:19.326Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 18, 14, '“Ho anao izay zavatra voatokana rehetra eo amin’ny Israely.', '“ho anao izay zavatra voatokana rehetra eo amin’ny israely.'),
  ('6aadc7334724b04a527a4eeb', '2026-09-18T23:20:19.326Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:19.326Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 18, 13, 'Ho anao ny voaloham-bokatra rehetra avy amin’ny taniny hoentiny ho an’i Jehovah. Mahazo mihinana an’izany izay rehetra madio ao amin’ny ankohonanao.', 'ho anao ny voaloham-bokatra rehetra avy amin’ny taniny hoentiny ho an’i jehovah. mahazo mihinana an’izany izay rehetra madio ao amin’ny ankohonanao.'),
  ('6aadc7334724b04a527a4eea', '2026-09-18T23:20:19.326Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:19.326Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 18, 12, '“Omeko anao ny tsara indrindra amin’ny menaka sy ny divay vaovao ary ny varimbazaha, izany hoe ny voaloham-bokatra omeny an’i Jehovah.', '“omeko anao ny tsara indrindra amin’ny menaka sy ny divay vaovao ary ny varimbazaha, izany hoe ny voaloham-bokatra omeny an’i jehovah.'),
  ('6aadc7334724b04a527a4ee9', '2026-09-18T23:20:19.326Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:19.326Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 18, 11, 'Anao koa ny fanomezana omen’ny Israelita sy ny fanatitra ahetsiketsika rehetra ataony. Efa nomeko anao sy ny zanakao lahy ary ny zanakao vavy izany, mba ho anjaranareo foana. Mahazo mihinana an’izany izay rehetra madio ao amin’ny ankohonanao.', 'anao koa ny fanomezana omen’ny israelita sy ny fanatitra ahetsiketsika rehetra ataony. efa nomeko anao sy ny zanakao lahy ary ny zanakao vavy izany, mba ho anjaranareo foana. mahazo mihinana an’izany izay rehetra madio ao amin’ny ankohonanao.'),
  ('6aadc7334724b04a527a4ee8', '2026-09-18T23:20:19.326Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:19.326Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 18, 10, 'Ao amin’ny toerana tena masina ianao no hihinana an’izany, ka ny lehilahy rehetra aminareo no mahazo mihinana an’ilay izy. Ho zava-masina ho anao izany.', 'ao amin’ny toerana tena masina ianao no hihinana an’izany, ka ny lehilahy rehetra aminareo no mahazo mihinana an’ilay izy. ho zava-masina ho anao izany.'),
  ('6aadc7334724b04a527a4ee7', '2026-09-18T23:20:19.326Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:19.326Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 18, 9, 'Ireto avy no ho anao amin’ny fanatitra masina indrindra atao anaty afo: Izay fanatitra rehetra hatolony ho ahy, anisan’izany ny fanatitra varimbazaha sy ny fanatitra noho ny ota ary ny fanatitra noho ny heloka. Zavatra masina indrindra ho anao sy ho an’ny zanakao lahy izany.', 'ireto avy no ho anao amin’ny fanatitra masina indrindra atao anaty afo: izay fanatitra rehetra hatolony ho ahy, anisan’izany ny fanatitra varimbazaha sy ny fanatitra noho ny ota ary ny fanatitra noho ny heloka. zavatra masina indrindra ho anao sy ho an’ny zanakao lahy izany.'),
  ('6aadc733829787c0d724f697', '2026-09-18T23:20:19.803Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:19.803Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 19, 22, 'Haloto izay zavatra kasihin’ilay olona maloto, ary haloto mandra-paharivan’ny andro koa ilay olona mikasika an’iny zavatra iny.’”', 'haloto izay zavatra kasihin’ilay olona maloto, ary haloto mandra-paharivan’ny andro koa ilay olona mikasika an’iny zavatra iny.’”'),
  ('6aadc733829787c0d724f696', '2026-09-18T23:20:19.803Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:19.803Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 19, 21, '“‘Izao foana no fitsipika harahin’izy ireo: Tokony hanasa ny akanjony ilay namafy ny rano fanadiovana. Ary haloto mandra-paharivan’ny andro izay nikasika ny rano fanadiovana.', '“‘izao foana no fitsipika harahin’izy ireo: tokony hanasa ny akanjony ilay namafy ny rano fanadiovana. ary haloto mandra-paharivan’ny andro izay nikasika ny rano fanadiovana.'),
  ('6aadc733829787c0d724f695', '2026-09-18T23:20:19.803Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:19.803Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 19, 20, '“‘Haringana tsy ho anisan’ny fiangonana anefa izay olona maloto ka tsy manadio ny vatany. Nandoto ny toerana masin’i Jehovah mantsy izy. Tsy nofafazana rano fanadiovana izy ka maloto.', '“‘haringana tsy ho anisan’ny fiangonana anefa izay olona maloto ka tsy manadio ny vatany. nandoto ny toerana masin’i jehovah mantsy izy. tsy nofafazana rano fanadiovana izy ka maloto.'),
  ('6aadc733829787c0d724f694', '2026-09-18T23:20:19.803Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:19.803Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 19, 19, 'Ary hafafin’ilay olona madio amin’ilay olona maloto ilay rano, amin’ny andro fahatelo sy amin’ny andro fahafito, dia hodioviny ho afaka amin’ny ota izy amin’ny andro fahafito. Tokony hanasa ny akanjony izy avy eo, dia handro amin’ny rano, ka hadio amin’ny hariva.', 'ary hafafin’ilay olona madio amin’ilay olona maloto ilay rano, amin’ny andro fahatelo sy amin’ny andro fahafito, dia hodioviny ho afaka amin’ny ota izy amin’ny andro fahafito. tokony hanasa ny akanjony izy avy eo, dia handro amin’ny rano, ka hadio amin’ny hariva.'),
  ('6aadc733829787c0d724f693', '2026-09-18T23:20:19.803Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:19.803Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 19, 18, 'Ary haka hysopa ny lehilahy anankiray madio, dia hatsobony ao amin’ilay rano, ary hofafazany an’ilay rano ny tranolay sy ny vilia baolina ary ny olona rehetra tao. Hofafazany an’ilay izy koa izay nikasika taolam-paty na nikasika olona nisy namono na faty na fasana.', 'ary haka hysopa ny lehilahy anankiray madio, dia hatsobony ao amin’ilay rano, ary hofafazany an’ilay rano ny tranolay sy ny vilia baolina ary ny olona rehetra tao. hofafazany an’ilay izy koa izay nikasika taolam-paty na nikasika olona nisy namono na faty na fasana.'),
  ('6aadc733829787c0d724f692', '2026-09-18T23:20:19.803Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:19.803Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 19, 17, 'Tokony hakana mba hanadiovana an’ilay olona maloto ilay lavenon’ny fanatitra noho ny ota izay efa nodorana. Hatao ao anaty vilia baolina ilay izy, dia horarahana rano nalaina avy amin’ny rano mandeha.', 'tokony hakana mba hanadiovana an’ilay olona maloto ilay lavenon’ny fanatitra noho ny ota izay efa nodorana. hatao ao anaty vilia baolina ilay izy, dia horarahana rano nalaina avy amin’ny rano mandeha.'),
  ('6aadc733829787c0d724f691', '2026-09-18T23:20:19.803Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:19.803Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 19, 16, 'Haloto fito andro izay olona eny an-tsaha nikasika olona novonoina tamin’ny sabatra na nikasika faty na taolam-paty na fasana.', 'haloto fito andro izay olona eny an-tsaha nikasika olona novonoina tamin’ny sabatra na nikasika faty na taolam-paty na fasana.'),
  ('6aadc733829787c0d724f690', '2026-09-18T23:20:19.803Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:19.803Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 19, 15, 'Haloto koa izay fitoeran-javatra misokatra tsy misy sarony mifatotra aminy.', 'haloto koa izay fitoeran-javatra misokatra tsy misy sarony mifatotra aminy.'),
  ('6aadc733829787c0d724f68f', '2026-09-18T23:20:19.803Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:19.803Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 19, 14, '“‘Izao no lalàna harahina raha misy olona maty ao an-tranolay: Haloto fito andro izay miditra ao amin’ilay tranolay sy izay olona efa tao.', '“‘izao no lalàna harahina raha misy olona maty ao an-tranolay: haloto fito andro izay miditra ao amin’ilay tranolay sy izay olona efa tao.'),
  ('6aadc733829787c0d724f68e', '2026-09-18T23:20:19.803Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:19.803Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 19, 13, 'Izay mikasika fatin’olona nefa tsy manadio ny vatany, dia mandoto ny tranolain’i Jehovah. Tsy maintsy haringana tsy ho anisan’ny firenen’Israely izy. Mbola maloto izy, satria tsy nofafazana rano fanadiovana. Mbola haloto foana izy.', 'izay mikasika fatin’olona nefa tsy manadio ny vatany, dia mandoto ny tranolain’i jehovah. tsy maintsy haringana tsy ho anisan’ny firenen’israely izy. mbola maloto izy, satria tsy nofafazana rano fanadiovana. mbola haloto foana izy.'),
  ('6aadc733829787c0d724f68d', '2026-09-18T23:20:19.803Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:19.803Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 19, 12, 'Hanadio ny vatany amin’ilay rano fanadiovana izy amin’ny andro fahatelo, ka hadio amin’ny andro fahafito. Raha tsy manadio ny vatany anefa izy amin’ny andro fahatelo, dia tsy hadio amin’ny andro fahafito.', 'hanadio ny vatany amin’ilay rano fanadiovana izy amin’ny andro fahatelo, ka hadio amin’ny andro fahafito. raha tsy manadio ny vatany anefa izy amin’ny andro fahatelo, dia tsy hadio amin’ny andro fahafito.'),
  ('6aadc733829787c0d724f68c', '2026-09-18T23:20:19.803Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:19.803Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 19, 11, 'Haloto fito andro izay mikasika fatin’olona.', 'haloto fito andro izay mikasika fatin’olona.'),
  ('6aadc733829787c0d724f68b', '2026-09-18T23:20:19.803Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:19.803Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 19, 10, 'Ary hanasa ny akanjony ilay nanangona ny lavenon’ilay ombivavy. Haloto mandra-paharivan’ny andro anefa izy. “‘Fitsipika harahin’ny Israelita sy ny vahiny mipetraka eo aminy foana izany.', 'ary hanasa ny akanjony ilay nanangona ny lavenon’ilay ombivavy. haloto mandra-paharivan’ny andro anefa izy. “‘fitsipika harahin’ny israelita sy ny vahiny mipetraka eo aminy foana izany.'),
  ('6aadc733829787c0d724f68a', '2026-09-18T23:20:19.803Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:19.803Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 19, 9, '“‘Ary hisy lehilahy anankiray madio hanangona ny lavenon’ilay ombivavy, dia hapetrany eo amin’ny toerana iray madio any ivelan’ny toby ilay lavenona. Tokony hotehirizin’ny vahoakan’Israely manontolo ilay izy, mba hafangaro amin’ny rano ampiasaina amin’ny fanadiovana. Fanatitra noho ny ota ilay ombivavy.', '“‘ary hisy lehilahy anankiray madio hanangona ny lavenon’ilay ombivavy, dia hapetrany eo amin’ny toerana iray madio any ivelan’ny toby ilay lavenona. tokony hotehirizin’ny vahoakan’israely manontolo ilay izy, mba hafangaro amin’ny rano ampiasaina amin’ny fanadiovana. fanatitra noho ny ota ilay ombivavy.'),
  ('6aadc733829787c0d724f689', '2026-09-18T23:20:19.803Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:19.803Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 19, 8, '“‘Ary hanasa ny akanjony amin’ny rano ilay nandoro an’ilay ombivavy, dia handro amin’ny rano. Haloto mandra-paharivan’ny andro anefa izy.', '“‘ary hanasa ny akanjony amin’ny rano ilay nandoro an’ilay ombivavy, dia handro amin’ny rano. haloto mandra-paharivan’ny andro anefa izy.'),
  ('6aadc733829787c0d724f688', '2026-09-18T23:20:19.803Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:19.803Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 19, 7, 'Avy eo dia hanasa ny akanjony ilay mpisorona dia handro amin’ny rano, izay vao mahazo miditra ao an-toby. Haloto mandra-paharivan’ny andro anefa izy.', 'avy eo dia hanasa ny akanjony ilay mpisorona dia handro amin’ny rano, izay vao mahazo miditra ao an-toby. haloto mandra-paharivan’ny andro anefa izy.'),
  ('6aadc733829787c0d724f687', '2026-09-18T23:20:19.803Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:19.803Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 19, 6, 'Ary haka rantsankazo sedera sy hysopa ary kofehy mena midorehitra ilay mpisorona, dia hatsipiny ao amin’ilay afo andoroana an’ilay ombivavy izany.', 'ary haka rantsankazo sedera sy hysopa ary kofehy mena midorehitra ilay mpisorona, dia hatsipiny ao amin’ilay afo andoroana an’ilay ombivavy izany.'),
  ('6aadc733829787c0d724f686', '2026-09-18T23:20:19.803Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:19.803Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 19, 5, 'Dia hodorana eo imasony ilay ombivavy. Hodorana ny hodiny, ny nofony, ny rany, ary ny tainy.', 'dia hodorana eo imasony ilay ombivavy. hodorana ny hodiny, ny nofony, ny rany, ary ny tainy.'),
  ('6aadc733829787c0d724f685', '2026-09-18T23:20:19.803Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:19.803Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 19, 4, 'Ary hakan’i Eleazara mpisorona amin’ny rantsantanany iray ny ran’ilay ombivavy, dia hafafiny impito tandrifin’ny fidirana amin’ny tranolay fihaonana.', 'ary hakan’i eleazara mpisorona amin’ny rantsantanany iray ny ran’ilay ombivavy, dia hafafiny impito tandrifin’ny fidirana amin’ny tranolay fihaonana.'),
  ('6aadc733829787c0d724f684', '2026-09-18T23:20:19.803Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:19.803Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 19, 3, 'Omeo an’i Eleazara mpisorona ilay ombivavy, dia hoentiny any ivelan’ny toby, ka hovonoina eo imasony.', 'omeo an’i eleazara mpisorona ilay ombivavy, dia hoentiny any ivelan’ny toby, ka hovonoina eo imasony.'),
  ('6aadc733829787c0d724f683', '2026-09-18T23:20:19.803Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:19.803Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 19, 2, '“Izao no didy sy lalàna nomen’i Jehovah: ‘Asaivo itondran’ny Israelita ombivavy mena iray ianao, dia ombivavy tsy misy kilema sy tsy manan-takaitra ary mbola tsy nitondra zioga.', '“izao no didy sy lalàna nomen’i jehovah: ‘asaivo itondran’ny israelita ombivavy mena iray ianao, dia ombivavy tsy misy kilema sy tsy manan-takaitra ary mbola tsy nitondra zioga.'),
  ('6aadc733829787c0d724f682', '2026-09-18T23:20:19.803Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:19.803Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 19, 1, 'Hoy koa i Jehovah tamin’i Mosesy sy Arona:', 'hoy koa i jehovah tamin’i mosesy sy arona:'),
  ('6aadc734e70f7ca63f0f854d', '2026-09-18T23:20:20.508Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:20.508Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 21, 31, 'Nipetraka tao amin’ny tanin’ny Amorita àry ny Israely.', 'nipetraka tao amin’ny tanin’ny amorita àry ny israely.'),
  ('6aadc734e70f7ca63f0f854c', '2026-09-18T23:20:20.508Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:20.508Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 21, 30, 'Andao hotafihintsika ireo. Ho rava hatrany Dibona i Hesbona. Andao hataontsika tsy misy mponina intsony io tanàna io, hatrany Nofa. Dia hisy afo hitatra hatrany Medeba.”', 'andao hotafihintsika ireo. ho rava hatrany dibona i hesbona. andao hataontsika tsy misy mponina intsony io tanàna io, hatrany nofa. dia hisy afo hitatra hatrany medeba.”'),
  ('6aadc734e70f7ca63f0f854b', '2026-09-18T23:20:20.508Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:20.508Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 21, 29, 'Hahita loza ianao, ry Moaba! Ho ringana ianareo, ry vahoakan’i Kemosy! Tsy ho afa-manoatra izy mahita ny zanany lahy mandositra, sy mahita ny zanany vavy entin’i Sihona mpanjakan’ny Amorita ho babo.', 'hahita loza ianao, ry moaba! ho ringana ianareo, ry vahoakan’i kemosy! tsy ho afa-manoatra izy mahita ny zanany lahy mandositra, sy mahita ny zanany vavy entin’i sihona mpanjakan’ny amorita ho babo.'),
  ('6aadc734e70f7ca63f0f854a', '2026-09-18T23:20:20.508Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:20.508Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 21, 28, 'Fa nisy afo avy tao Hesbona, nisy lelafo avy tao an-tanànan’i Sihona, Ka nandevona an’i Aran’i Moaba, dia ny tompon’ny toerana avo any Arnona.', 'fa nisy afo avy tao hesbona, nisy lelafo avy tao an-tanànan’i sihona, ka nandevona an’i aran’i moaba, dia ny tompon’ny toerana avo any arnona.'),
  ('6aadc734e70f7ca63f0f8549', '2026-09-18T23:20:20.508Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:20.508Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 21, 27, 'Izany no nahatonga an’ilay tononkalo fanesoana hoe: “Tongava any Hesbona. Aleo hamboarina ny tanànan’i Sihona ka hatao mafy orina.', 'izany no nahatonga an’ilay tononkalo fanesoana hoe: “tongava any hesbona. aleo hamboarina ny tanànan’i sihona ka hatao mafy orina.'),
  ('6aadc734e70f7ca63f0f8548', '2026-09-18T23:20:20.508Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:20.508Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 21, 26, 'Fa i Hesbona no tanànan’i Sihona mpanjakan’ny Amorita. Efa niady tamin’ny mpanjakan’i Moaba izy taloha, ka nalainy daholo ny tanin’io mpanjaka io, hatrany Arnona.', 'fa i hesbona no tanànan’i sihona mpanjakan’ny amorita. efa niady tamin’ny mpanjakan’i moaba izy taloha, ka nalainy daholo ny tanin’io mpanjaka io, hatrany arnona.'),
  ('6aadc734e70f7ca63f0f8547', '2026-09-18T23:20:20.508Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:20.508Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 21, 25, 'Nalain’ny Israely daholo àry ireny tanàna ireny. Dia nipetrahan’izy ireo daholo ny tanànan’ny Amorita, izany hoe Hesbona sy ny tanàna rehetra niankina taminy.', 'nalain’ny israely daholo àry ireny tanàna ireny. dia nipetrahan’izy ireo daholo ny tanànan’ny amorita, izany hoe hesbona sy ny tanàna rehetra niankina taminy.'),
  ('6aadc734e70f7ca63f0f8546', '2026-09-18T23:20:20.508Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:20.508Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 21, 24, 'Resin’ny Israely anefa izy ka novonoiny tamin’ny sabatra ny mponina tao. Dia nalain’ny Israely ny taniny, hatrany Arnona ka hatrany Jaboka, teo akaikin’ny Amonita. I Jazera mantsy no sisin-tanin’ny Amonita.', 'resin’ny israely anefa izy ka novonoiny tamin’ny sabatra ny mponina tao. dia nalain’ny israely ny taniny, hatrany arnona ka hatrany jaboka, teo akaikin’ny amonita. i jazera mantsy no sisin-tanin’ny amonita.'),
  ('6aadc734e70f7ca63f0f8545', '2026-09-18T23:20:20.508Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:20.508Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 21, 23, 'Tsy navelan’i Sihona handalo tao amin’ny taniny anefa ny Israely. Nangoniny daholo kosa ny vahoakany, dia nivoaka hiady tamin’ny Israely tany an-tany efitra izy. Ary tonga tao Jahaza izy ka niady tamin’ny Israely.', 'tsy navelan’i sihona handalo tao amin’ny taniny anefa ny israely. nangoniny daholo kosa ny vahoakany, dia nivoaka hiady tamin’ny israely tany an-tany efitra izy. ary tonga tao jahaza izy ka niady tamin’ny israely.'),
  ('6aadc734e70f7ca63f0f8544', '2026-09-18T23:20:20.508Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:20.508Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 21, 22, '“Avelao izahay handalo ao amin’ny taninao. Tsy hivily ho eny amin’ny saha na tanimboaloboka izahay, sady tsy hisotro rano amin’izay lavadrano ao. Fa ny Lalan’ny Mpanjaka no handehananay, mandra-pahatafavoakanay ny taninao.”', '“avelao izahay handalo ao amin’ny taninao. tsy hivily ho eny amin’ny saha na tanimboaloboka izahay, sady tsy hisotro rano amin’izay lavadrano ao. fa ny lalan’ny mpanjaka no handehananay, mandra-pahatafavoakanay ny taninao.”'),
  ('6aadc734e70f7ca63f0f8543', '2026-09-18T23:20:20.508Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:20.508Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 21, 21, 'Ary naniraka olona nankany amin’i Sihona mpanjakan’ny Amorita ny Israely, hiteny hoe:', 'ary naniraka olona nankany amin’i sihona mpanjakan’ny amorita ny israely, hiteny hoe:'),
  ('6aadc734e70f7ca63f0f8542', '2026-09-18T23:20:20.508Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:20.508Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 21, 20, 'Avy tao Bamota kosa izy ireo dia nankany amin’ilay lohasaha teo amin’ny faritr’i Moaba, teo an-tampon’i Pisga, izay mahatazana an’i Jesimona.', 'avy tao bamota kosa izy ireo dia nankany amin’ilay lohasaha teo amin’ny faritr’i moaba, teo an-tampon’i pisga, izay mahatazana an’i jesimona.'),
  ('6aadc734e70f7ca63f0f8541', '2026-09-18T23:20:20.508Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:20.508Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 21, 19, 'Avy tao Matana indray izy ireo dia nankany Nahaliela, ary avy tao Nahaliela dia nankany Bamota.', 'avy tao matana indray izy ireo dia nankany nahaliela, ary avy tao nahaliela dia nankany bamota.'),
  ('6aadc734e70f7ca63f0f8540', '2026-09-18T23:20:20.508Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:20.508Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 21, 18, 'Io ilay lavadrano nolavahan’ny andriana! Ny olona ambony tamin’ny vahoaka no nandavaka azy, Tamin’ny tehim-pahefana sy tamin’ny tehin-dry zareo ihany.” Avy eo dia niala tany an-tany efitra izy ireo ka nankany Matana.', 'io ilay lavadrano nolavahan’ny andriana! ny olona ambony tamin’ny vahoaka no nandavaka azy, tamin’ny tehim-pahefana sy tamin’ny tehin-dry zareo ihany.” avy eo dia niala tany an-tany efitra izy ireo ka nankany matana.'),
  ('6aadc734e70f7ca63f0f853f', '2026-09-18T23:20:20.508Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:20.508Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 21, 17, 'Dia nihira an’izao hira izao ny Israely tamin’izay fotoana izay: “Hiboiboika anie ny ranonao, ry lavadrano! Valio izy e!', 'dia nihira an’izao hira izao ny israely tamin’izay fotoana izay: “hiboiboika anie ny ranonao, ry lavadrano! valio izy e!'),
  ('6aadc734e70f7ca63f0f853e', '2026-09-18T23:20:20.508Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:20.508Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 21, 16, 'Dia lasa nankany Bera izy ireo. Teo amin’io lavadrano io i Jehovah no niteny tamin’i Mosesy hoe: “Vorio ny vahoaka fa homeko rano.”', 'dia lasa nankany bera izy ireo. teo amin’io lavadrano io i jehovah no niteny tamin’i mosesy hoe: “vorio ny vahoaka fa homeko rano.”'),
  ('6aadc734e70f7ca63f0f853d', '2026-09-18T23:20:20.508Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:20.508Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 21, 15, 'ary ilay fidinana ao amin’ny lohasaha, izany hoe ilay fidinana tonga hatrany amin’ilay tanàna kely atao hoe Ara, sady manakaiky ny sisin-tanin’i Moaba.”', 'ary ilay fidinana ao amin’ny lohasaha, izany hoe ilay fidinana tonga hatrany amin’ilay tanàna kely atao hoe ara, sady manakaiky ny sisin-tanin’i moaba.”'),
  ('6aadc734e70f7ca63f0f853c', '2026-09-18T23:20:20.508Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:20.508Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 21, 14, 'Izany no mahatonga an’ilay bokin’ny Adin’i Jehovah hiresaka momba an’i “Vaheba any Sofa, sy ny lohasahan’i Arnona,', 'izany no mahatonga an’ilay bokin’ny adin’i jehovah hiresaka momba an’i “vaheba any sofa, sy ny lohasahan’i arnona,'),
  ('6aadc734e70f7ca63f0f853b', '2026-09-18T23:20:20.508Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:20.508Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 21, 13, 'Dia niala teo indray izy ireo ka nitoby tao amin’ny faritr’i Arnona, izay tany an-tany efitra. Nanomboka teo amin’ny sisin-tanin’ny Amorita io tany efitra io. Fa i Arnona no sisin-tanin’i Moaba, teo anelanelan’i Moaba sy ny tanin’ny Amorita.', 'dia niala teo indray izy ireo ka nitoby tao amin’ny faritr’i arnona, izay tany an-tany efitra. nanomboka teo amin’ny sisin-tanin’ny amorita io tany efitra io. fa i arnona no sisin-tanin’i moaba, teo anelanelan’i moaba sy ny tanin’ny amorita.'),
  ('6aadc734e70f7ca63f0f853a', '2026-09-18T23:20:20.508Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:20.508Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 21, 12, 'Ary niala teo izy ireo ka nitoby teo akaikin’ny Lohasahan’i Zareda.', 'ary niala teo izy ireo ka nitoby teo akaikin’ny lohasahan’i zareda.'),
  ('6aadc734e70f7ca63f0f8539', '2026-09-18T23:20:20.508Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:20.508Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 21, 11, 'Niala tao Obota indray izy ireo ka nitoby tao Ie-abarima, tany amin’ilay tany efitra tandrifin’i Moaba, any atsinanana.', 'niala tao obota indray izy ireo ka nitoby tao ie-abarima, tany amin’ilay tany efitra tandrifin’i moaba, any atsinanana.'),
  ('6aadc734e70f7ca63f0f8538', '2026-09-18T23:20:20.508Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:20.508Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 21, 10, 'Taorian’izay dia niainga ny Israelita ka nitoby tao Obota.', 'taorian’izay dia niainga ny israelita ka nitoby tao obota.'),
  ('6aadc734e70f7ca63f0f8537', '2026-09-18T23:20:20.508Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:20.508Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 21, 9, 'Tonga dia nanamboatra bibilava varahina i Mosesy, dia nataony teo amin’ny tsato-kazo ilay izy. Koa isaky ny nisy olona voakaikitra ka nijery an’ilay bibilava varahina, dia tsy maty.', 'tonga dia nanamboatra bibilava varahina i mosesy, dia nataony teo amin’ny tsato-kazo ilay izy. koa isaky ny nisy olona voakaikitra ka nijery an’ilay bibilava varahina, dia tsy maty.'),
  ('6aadc734e70f7ca63f0f8536', '2026-09-18T23:20:20.508Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:20.508Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 21, 8, 'Dia hoy i Jehovah tamin’i Mosesy: “Manamboara sarivongana bibilava misy poizina, dia ataovy eo amin’ny tsato-kazo ilay izy. Amin’izay rehefa misy voakaikitra dia hijery an’ilay bibilava izy ka tsy ho faty.”', 'dia hoy i jehovah tamin’i mosesy: “manamboara sarivongana bibilava misy poizina, dia ataovy eo amin’ny tsato-kazo ilay izy. amin’izay rehefa misy voakaikitra dia hijery an’ilay bibilava izy ka tsy ho faty.”'),
  ('6aadc734e70f7ca63f0f8535', '2026-09-18T23:20:20.508Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:20.508Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 21, 7, 'Nankany amin’i Mosesy àry ny vahoaka ka niteny hoe: “Efa nanota izahay, satria nanome tsiny anao sy Jehovah. Aleo re ianao mba mifona amin’i Jehovah ho anay e! Dia mba hesoriny any ireo bibilava ireo.” Ary nifona ho an’ny vahoaka i Mosesy.', 'nankany amin’i mosesy àry ny vahoaka ka niteny hoe: “efa nanota izahay, satria nanome tsiny anao sy jehovah. aleo re ianao mba mifona amin’i jehovah ho anay e! dia mba hesoriny any ireo bibilava ireo.” ary nifona ho an’ny vahoaka i mosesy.'),
  ('6aadc734e70f7ca63f0f8534', '2026-09-18T23:20:20.508Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:20.508Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 21, 6, 'Dia nandefa bibilava misy poizina teo amin’ny vahoaka i Jehovah. Nokaikerin’ireny ny Israelita, ka be dia be no maty.', 'dia nandefa bibilava misy poizina teo amin’ny vahoaka i jehovah. nokaikerin’ireny ny israelita, ka be dia be no maty.'),
  ('6aadc734e70f7ca63f0f8533', '2026-09-18T23:20:20.508Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:20.508Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 21, 5, 'Ary nanome tsiny an’Andriamanitra sy Mosesy foana ny vahoaka hoe: “Fa maninona ianareo no nitondra anay niakatra avy tany Ejipta mba ho faty atỳ amin’ity tany efitra ity? Tsy misy sakafo atỳ na rano, sady efa maharikoriko anay itony mofo tsisy ilana azy itony.”', 'ary nanome tsiny an’andriamanitra sy mosesy foana ny vahoaka hoe: “fa maninona ianareo no nitondra anay niakatra avy tany ejipta mba ho faty atỳ amin’ity tany efitra ity? tsy misy sakafo atỳ na rano, sady efa maharikoriko anay itony mofo tsisy ilana azy itony.”'),
  ('6aadc734e70f7ca63f0f8532', '2026-09-18T23:20:20.508Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:20.508Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 21, 4, 'Niala teo amin’ny Tendrombohitra Hora izy ireo avy eo, ka nanohy ny diany nanaraka an’ilay lalana mankany amin’ny Ranomasina Mena mba tsy handalo eo amin’ny tanin’i Edoma. Dia nanomboka leo an’ilay dia ny vahoaka.', 'niala teo amin’ny tendrombohitra hora izy ireo avy eo, ka nanohy ny diany nanaraka an’ilay lalana mankany amin’ny ranomasina mena mba tsy handalo eo amin’ny tanin’i edoma. dia nanomboka leo an’ilay dia ny vahoaka.'),
  ('6aadc734e70f7ca63f0f8531', '2026-09-18T23:20:20.508Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:20.508Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 21, 3, 'Nohenoin’i Jehovah àry ny Israely ka nataony resin’izy ireo ny Kananita. Dia naringan’izy ireo ny Kananita sy ny tanànany. Koa nataon’izy ireo hoe Horma ny anaran’ilay toerana.', 'nohenoin’i jehovah àry ny israely ka nataony resin’izy ireo ny kananita. dia naringan’izy ireo ny kananita sy ny tanànany. koa nataon’izy ireo hoe horma ny anaran’ilay toerana.'),
  ('6aadc734e70f7ca63f0f8530', '2026-09-18T23:20:20.508Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:20.508Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 21, 2, 'Koa nivoady tamin’i Jehovah ny Israely hoe: “Raha ataonao resinay io firenena io, dia tsy maintsy horavanay ny tanànany.”', 'koa nivoady tamin’i jehovah ny israely hoe: “raha ataonao resinay io firenena io, dia tsy maintsy horavanay ny tanànany.”'),
  ('6aadc734e70f7ca63f0f852f', '2026-09-18T23:20:20.508Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:20.508Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 21, 1, 'Ary henon’ilay Kananita mpanjakan’i Arada nipetraka tany Negeba fa efa eny amin’ny lalana mankany Atarima ny Israely. Dia notafihiny izy ireo ka nentiny ho babo ny sasany.', 'ary henon’ilay kananita mpanjakan’i arada nipetraka tany negeba fa efa eny amin’ny lalana mankany atarima ny israely. dia notafihiny izy ireo ka nentiny ho babo ny sasany.'),
  ('6aadc734e70f7ca63f0f8551', '2026-09-18T23:20:20.509Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:20.509Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 21, 35, 'Dia nasian’izy ireo izy sy ny zanany lahy ary ny tafiny manontolo, ka nataony tsy nisy niangana na iray aza. Dia nalain’izy ireo ny taniny.', 'dia nasian’izy ireo izy sy ny zanany lahy ary ny tafiny manontolo, ka nataony tsy nisy niangana na iray aza. dia nalain’izy ireo ny taniny.'),
  ('6aadc734e70f7ca63f0f8550', '2026-09-18T23:20:20.509Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:20.509Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 21, 34, 'Ary hoy i Jehovah tamin’i Mosesy: “Aza matahotra azy fa hataoko resinao izy sy ny tafiny manontolo ary homeko anao ny taniny. Hataonao hoatran’i Sihona izy, dia ilay mpanjakan’ny Amorita nipetraka tao Hesbona.”', 'ary hoy i jehovah tamin’i mosesy: “aza matahotra azy fa hataoko resinao izy sy ny tafiny manontolo ary homeko anao ny taniny. hataonao hoatran’i sihona izy, dia ilay mpanjakan’ny amorita nipetraka tao hesbona.”'),
  ('6aadc734e70f7ca63f0f854f', '2026-09-18T23:20:20.509Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:20.509Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 21, 33, 'Nivily lalana izy ireo avy eo, ka niakatra nanaraka an’ilay Lalan’i Basana. Dia nivoaka hiady tamin’izy ireo tao Edrehy i Oga mpanjakan’i Basana sy ny tafiny manontolo.', 'nivily lalana izy ireo avy eo, ka niakatra nanaraka an’ilay lalan’i basana. dia nivoaka hiady tamin’izy ireo tao edrehy i oga mpanjakan’i basana sy ny tafiny manontolo.'),
  ('6aadc734e70f7ca63f0f854e', '2026-09-18T23:20:20.509Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:20.509Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 21, 32, 'Ary nandefa lehilahy hitsikilo tany Jazera i Mosesy. Dia azon’izy ireo ny tanàna niankina tamin’i Jazera, ka noroahiny ny Amorita tao.', 'ary nandefa lehilahy hitsikilo tany jazera i mosesy. dia azon’izy ireo ny tanàna niankina tamin’i jazera, ka noroahiny ny amorita tao.'),
  ('6aadc735a78bab66b6110cb3', '2026-09-18T23:20:21.381Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:21.381Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 22, 41, 'Ny ampitso maraina, dia nalain’i Balaka i Balama ka nentiny niakatra nankeo Bamota-bala. Teo izy no nahatazana an’ilay vahoaka manontolo.', 'ny ampitso maraina, dia nalain’i balaka i balama ka nentiny niakatra nankeo bamota-bala. teo izy no nahatazana an’ilay vahoaka manontolo.'),
  ('6aadc735a78bab66b6110cb2', '2026-09-18T23:20:21.381Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:21.381Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 22, 40, 'Ary nanao sorona omby aman’ondry i Balaka, ka nisy hena nampanateriny tany amin’i Balama sy ireo andriana niaraka taminy.', 'ary nanao sorona omby aman’ondry i balaka, ka nisy hena nampanateriny tany amin’i balama sy ireo andriana niaraka taminy.'),
  ('6aadc735a78bab66b6110cb1', '2026-09-18T23:20:21.381Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:21.381Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 22, 39, 'Koa niaraka tamin’i Balaka i Balama, ka tonga tao Kiriata-hozota izy ireo.', 'koa niaraka tamin’i balaka i balama, ka tonga tao kiriata-hozota izy ireo.'),
  ('6aadc735a78bab66b6110cb0', '2026-09-18T23:20:21.381Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:21.381Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 22, 38, 'Dia hoy i Balama: “Efa tonga eto aminao aho izao. Tsy mahazo miteny an’izay tiako anefa aho, fa izay asain’Andriamanitra teneniko ihany no azoko tenenina.”', 'dia hoy i balama: “efa tonga eto aminao aho izao. tsy mahazo miteny an’izay tiako anefa aho, fa izay asain’andriamanitra teneniko ihany no azoko tenenina.”'),
  ('6aadc735a78bab66b6110caf', '2026-09-18T23:20:21.381Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:21.381Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 22, 37, 'Ary hoy i Balaka taminy: “Maninona ianao no tsy tonga tatỳ amiko tamin’izaho naniraka olona hiantso anao? Nieritreritra angaha ianao hoe tsy ho vitako ny manome voninahitra anao?”', 'ary hoy i balaka taminy: “maninona ianao no tsy tonga tatỳ amiko tamin’izaho naniraka olona hiantso anao? nieritreritra angaha ianao hoe tsy ho vitako ny manome voninahitra anao?”'),
  ('6aadc735a78bab66b6110cae', '2026-09-18T23:20:21.381Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:21.381Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 22, 36, 'Rehefa henon’i Balaka hoe tonga i Balama, dia tonga dia nivoaka hitsena azy tao amin’ny tanànan’i Moaba izy, teo amoron’i Arnona, teo amin’ny sisin-taniny.', 'rehefa henon’i balaka hoe tonga i balama, dia tonga dia nivoaka hitsena azy tao amin’ny tanànan’i moaba izy, teo amoron’i arnona, teo amin’ny sisin-taniny.'),
  ('6aadc735a78bab66b6110cad', '2026-09-18T23:20:21.381Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:21.381Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 22, 35, 'Hoy anefa ilay anjelin’i Jehovah tamin’i Balama: “Mandehana miaraka amin’ireo olona ireo, fa izay teny holazaiko aminao ihany no azonao lazaina.” Koa nanohy ny diany niaraka tamin’ny andrianan’i Balaka i Balama.', 'hoy anefa ilay anjelin’i jehovah tamin’i balama: “mandehana miaraka amin’ireo olona ireo, fa izay teny holazaiko aminao ihany no azonao lazaina.” koa nanohy ny diany niaraka tamin’ny andrianan’i balaka i balama.'),
  ('6aadc735a78bab66b6110cac', '2026-09-18T23:20:21.381Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:21.381Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 22, 34, 'Dia hoy i Balama tamin’ilay anjelin’i Jehovah: “Efa nanota aho, fa tsy fantatro hoe ianao no nijoro teo amin’ny lalana teo mba hisakana ahy. Koa raha tsy mahafaly anao izao ataoko izao, dia hiverina aho.”', 'dia hoy i balama tamin’ilay anjelin’i jehovah: “efa nanota aho, fa tsy fantatro hoe ianao no nijoro teo amin’ny lalana teo mba hisakana ahy. koa raha tsy mahafaly anao izao ataoko izao, dia hiverina aho.”'),
  ('6aadc735a78bab66b6110cab', '2026-09-18T23:20:21.381Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:21.381Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 22, 33, 'Nahita ahy anefa io ampondra io dia nitady hiala ahy intelo. Fa raha tsy niala ahy izy, dia efa matiko ianao, fa izy kosa navelako ho velona ihany.”', 'nahita ahy anefa io ampondra io dia nitady hiala ahy intelo. fa raha tsy niala ahy izy, dia efa matiko ianao, fa izy kosa navelako ho velona ihany.”'),
  ('6aadc735a78bab66b6110caa', '2026-09-18T23:20:21.381Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:21.381Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 22, 32, 'Ary hoy ilay anjelin’i Jehovah taminy: “Fa maninona no nokapohinao intelo ny ampondranao? Izaho mihitsy izao no nivoaka hisakana anao, satria mifanipaka tanteraka amin’ny sitrapoko ny zavatra ataonao.', 'ary hoy ilay anjelin’i jehovah taminy: “fa maninona no nokapohinao intelo ny ampondranao? izaho mihitsy izao no nivoaka hisakana anao, satria mifanipaka tanteraka amin’ny sitrapoko ny zavatra ataonao.'),
  ('6aadc735a78bab66b6110ca9', '2026-09-18T23:20:21.381Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:21.381Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 22, 31, 'Dia nosokafan’i Jehovah ny mason’i Balama, ka hitany ilay anjelin’i Jehovah nijoro teo an-dalana sady nitana sabatra efa voatsoaka avy tao anaty tranony. Dia niondrika avy hatrany izy ka niankohoka.', 'dia nosokafan’i jehovah ny mason’i balama, ka hitany ilay anjelin’i jehovah nijoro teo an-dalana sady nitana sabatra efa voatsoaka avy tao anaty tranony. dia niondrika avy hatrany izy ka niankohoka.'),
  ('6aadc735a78bab66b6110ca8', '2026-09-18T23:20:21.381Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:21.381Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 22, 30, 'Ary hoy ilay ampondra tamin’i Balama: “Angaha tsy efa izaho foana ny ampondra fitaingenanao hatrizay niainanao ka hatramin’izao? Dia efa nanao hoatr’izao taminao ve aho?” Hoy izy: “Mbola tsy nanao!”', 'ary hoy ilay ampondra tamin’i balama: “angaha tsy efa izaho foana ny ampondra fitaingenanao hatrizay niainanao ka hatramin’izao? dia efa nanao hoatr’izao taminao ve aho?” hoy izy: “mbola tsy nanao!”'),
  ('6aadc735a78bab66b6110ca7', '2026-09-18T23:20:21.381Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:21.381Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 22, 29, 'Dia hoy i Balama: “K’ianao manadala ahy! Raha nisy sabatra tetỳ an-tanako, dia efa matiko ianao!”', 'dia hoy i balama: “k’ianao manadala ahy! raha nisy sabatra tetỳ an-tanako, dia efa matiko ianao!”'),
  ('6aadc735a78bab66b6110ca6', '2026-09-18T23:20:21.381Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:21.381Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 22, 28, 'Farany, dia nampitenenin’i Jehovah ilay ampondra, ka niteny tamin’i Balama hoe: “Fa inona no nataoko taminao no dia nokapohinao intelo aho?”', 'farany, dia nampitenenin’i jehovah ilay ampondra, ka niteny tamin’i balama hoe: “fa inona no nataoko taminao no dia nokapohinao intelo aho?”'),
  ('6aadc735a78bab66b6110ca5', '2026-09-18T23:20:21.381Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:21.381Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 22, 27, 'Rehefa hitan’ilay ampondra ilay anjelin’i Jehovah, dia nipetraka ilay ampondra nefa i Balama mbola nitaingina azy. Dia tezitra i Balama, ka vao mainka nokapohiny tamin’ny tehiny ilay ampondra.', 'rehefa hitan’ilay ampondra ilay anjelin’i jehovah, dia nipetraka ilay ampondra nefa i balama mbola nitaingina azy. dia tezitra i balama, ka vao mainka nokapohiny tamin’ny tehiny ilay ampondra.'),
  ('6aadc735a78bab66b6110ca4', '2026-09-18T23:20:21.381Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:21.381Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 22, 26, 'Nandroso indray ilay anjelin’i Jehovah dia nijoro teo amin’ny toerana tery, ka tsy nisy nahafahana nivily niankavanana na niankavia mihitsy.', 'nandroso indray ilay anjelin’i jehovah dia nijoro teo amin’ny toerana tery, ka tsy nisy nahafahana nivily niankavanana na niankavia mihitsy.'),
  ('6aadc735a78bab66b6110ca3', '2026-09-18T23:20:21.381Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:21.381Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 22, 25, 'Rehefa hitan’ilay ampondra ilay anjelin’i Jehovah, dia nisisika nitampify teo amin’ilay fefy ilay ampondra ka tery tao ny tongotr’i Balama. Dia nokapohin’i Balama indray izy.', 'rehefa hitan’ilay ampondra ilay anjelin’i jehovah, dia nisisika nitampify teo amin’ilay fefy ilay ampondra ka tery tao ny tongotr’i balama. dia nokapohin’i balama indray izy.'),
  ('6aadc735a78bab66b6110ca2', '2026-09-18T23:20:21.381Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:21.381Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 22, 24, 'Avy eo dia nijoro teo amin’ny lalana tery kely, teo anelanelan’ny tanimboaloboka roa, ilay anjelin’i Jehovah. Nisy fefy vato teo amin’ny andaniny roa tamin’ilay lalana.', 'avy eo dia nijoro teo amin’ny lalana tery kely, teo anelanelan’ny tanimboaloboka roa, ilay anjelin’i jehovah. nisy fefy vato teo amin’ny andaniny roa tamin’ilay lalana.'),
  ('6aadc735a78bab66b6110ca1', '2026-09-18T23:20:21.381Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:21.381Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 22, 23, 'Hitan’ilay ampondra ilay anjelin’i Jehovah nijanona teo an-dalana, sady nitana sabatra efa voatsoaka avy tao anaty tranony. Dia nitady hivily tany anaty saha ilay ampondra, nefa nokapohin’i Balama mba hiverina teo amin’ilay lalana.', 'hitan’ilay ampondra ilay anjelin’i jehovah nijanona teo an-dalana, sady nitana sabatra efa voatsoaka avy tao anaty tranony. dia nitady hivily tany anaty saha ilay ampondra, nefa nokapohin’i balama mba hiverina teo amin’ilay lalana.'),
  ('6aadc735a78bab66b6110ca0', '2026-09-18T23:20:21.381Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:21.381Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 22, 22, 'Tezitra be anefa Andriamanitra fa nandeha i Balama. Ary nisy anjelin’i Jehovah nijanona teo an-dalana mba hisakana azy. Nitaingina ny ampondrany i Balama tamin’izay, ary niaraka taminy ny mpanompony anankiroa.', 'tezitra be anefa andriamanitra fa nandeha i balama. ary nisy anjelin’i jehovah nijanona teo an-dalana mba hisakana azy. nitaingina ny ampondrany i balama tamin’izay, ary niaraka taminy ny mpanompony anankiroa.'),
  ('6aadc735a78bab66b6110c9f', '2026-09-18T23:20:21.381Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:21.381Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 22, 21, 'Dia nifoha maraina i Balama ka nasiany lasely ny ampondrany, dia nandeha niaraka tamin’ireo andrianan’i Moaba ireo izy.', 'dia nifoha maraina i balama ka nasiany lasely ny ampondrany, dia nandeha niaraka tamin’ireo andrianan’i moaba ireo izy.'),
  ('6aadc735a78bab66b6110c9e', '2026-09-18T23:20:21.381Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:21.381Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 22, 20, 'Ary nankeo amin’i Balama Andriamanitra ny alin’iny, ka niteny hoe: “Raha tonga hiantso anao ireo olona ireo, dia mandehana miaraka aminy, fa izay holazaiko aminao ihany no azonao lazaina.”', 'ary nankeo amin’i balama andriamanitra ny alin’iny, ka niteny hoe: “raha tonga hiantso anao ireo olona ireo, dia mandehana miaraka aminy, fa izay holazaiko aminao ihany no azonao lazaina.”'),
  ('6aadc735a78bab66b6110c9d', '2026-09-18T23:20:21.381Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:21.381Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 22, 19, 'Miangavy anareo koa anefa aho mba hijanona eto anio alina. Amin’izay ho fantatro hoe inona no mbola holazain’i Jehovah amiko.”', 'miangavy anareo koa anefa aho mba hijanona eto anio alina. amin’izay ho fantatro hoe inona no mbola holazain’i jehovah amiko.”'),
  ('6aadc735a78bab66b6110c9c', '2026-09-18T23:20:21.381Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:21.381Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 22, 18, 'Hoy anefa i Balama tamin’ny mpanompon’i Balaka: “Na omen’i Balaka ahy aza ny tranony feno volafotsy sy volamena, dia tsy misy na inona na inona azoko atao, na kely izany na lehibe, afa-tsy izay asain’i Jehovah Andriamanitro ataoko ihany.', 'hoy anefa i balama tamin’ny mpanompon’i balaka: “na omen’i balaka ahy aza ny tranony feno volafotsy sy volamena, dia tsy misy na inona na inona azoko atao, na kely izany na lehibe, afa-tsy izay asain’i jehovah andriamanitro ataoko ihany.'),
  ('6aadc735a78bab66b6110c9b', '2026-09-18T23:20:21.381Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:21.381Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 22, 17, 'Fa homeko voninahitra miavaka be ianao, dia hataoko daholo izay asainao ataoko. Koa mba tongava re atỳ dia ozòny io vahoaka io e!’”', 'fa homeko voninahitra miavaka be ianao, dia hataoko daholo izay asainao ataoko. koa mba tongava re atỳ dia ozòny io vahoaka io e!’”'),
  ('6aadc735a78bab66b6110c9a', '2026-09-18T23:20:21.381Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:21.381Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 22, 16, 'Dia tonga tany amin’i Balama ireo ka nilaza hoe: “Niteny i Balaka zanak’i Zipora hoe: ‘Mba aza avela hisy zavatra hanakantsakana anao tsy ho tonga atỳ amiko re e!', 'dia tonga tany amin’i balama ireo ka nilaza hoe: “niteny i balaka zanak’i zipora hoe: ‘mba aza avela hisy zavatra hanakantsakana anao tsy ho tonga atỳ amiko re e!'),
  ('6aadc735a78bab66b6110c99', '2026-09-18T23:20:21.381Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:21.381Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 22, 15, 'Naniraka andriana hafa indray anefa i Balaka, dia andriana maro kokoa sy manan-kaja kokoa noho ny teo aloha.', 'naniraka andriana hafa indray anefa i balaka, dia andriana maro kokoa sy manan-kaja kokoa noho ny teo aloha.'),
  ('6aadc735a78bab66b6110c98', '2026-09-18T23:20:21.381Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:21.381Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 22, 14, 'Koa lasa niverina tany amin’i Balaka ireo andrianan’i Moaba ireo, ka nilaza hoe: “Tsy nety niaraka taminay i Balama.”', 'koa lasa niverina tany amin’i balaka ireo andrianan’i moaba ireo, ka nilaza hoe: “tsy nety niaraka taminay i balama.”'),
  ('6aadc735a78bab66b6110c97', '2026-09-18T23:20:21.381Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:21.381Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 22, 13, 'Ary nifoha maraina i Balama ka niteny tamin’ireo andrianan’i Balaka hoe: “Modia any amin’ny taninareo, fa tsy avelan’i Jehovah hiaraka aminareo aho.”', 'ary nifoha maraina i balama ka niteny tamin’ireo andrianan’i balaka hoe: “modia any amin’ny taninareo, fa tsy avelan’i jehovah hiaraka aminareo aho.”'),
  ('6aadc735a78bab66b6110c96', '2026-09-18T23:20:21.381Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:21.381Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 22, 12, 'Hoy anefa Andriamanitra tamin’i Balama: “Aza mandeha miaraka amin’ireo, ary aza manozona an’io vahoaka io, fa mitahy azy ireo aho.”', 'hoy anefa andriamanitra tamin’i balama: “aza mandeha miaraka amin’ireo, ary aza manozona an’io vahoaka io, fa mitahy azy ireo aho.”'),
  ('6aadc735a78bab66b6110c95', '2026-09-18T23:20:21.381Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:21.381Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 22, 11, '‘Mandrakotra ny tany ilay vahoaka nivoaka avy tany Ejipta. Koa tongava atỳ ka ozòny ireo. Amin’izay mba mety ho vitako ny hiady aminy sy handroaka azy.’”', '‘mandrakotra ny tany ilay vahoaka nivoaka avy tany ejipta. koa tongava atỳ ka ozòny ireo. amin’izay mba mety ho vitako ny hiady aminy sy handroaka azy.’”'),
  ('6aadc735a78bab66b6110c94', '2026-09-18T23:20:21.381Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:21.381Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 22, 10, 'Dia hoy i Balama tamin’ilay tena Andriamanitra: “Olona nirahin’i Balaka zanak’i Zipora, mpanjakan’i Moaba, hankatỳ amiko ireo, hilaza hoe:', 'dia hoy i balama tamin’ilay tena andriamanitra: “olona nirahin’i balaka zanak’i zipora, mpanjakan’i moaba, hankatỳ amiko ireo, hilaza hoe:'),
  ('6aadc735a78bab66b6110c93', '2026-09-18T23:20:21.381Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:21.381Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 22, 9, 'Avy eo dia nankeo amin’i Balama Andriamanitra, ka niteny hoe: “Iza ireo lehilahy ato aminao ireo?”', 'avy eo dia nankeo amin’i balama andriamanitra, ka niteny hoe: “iza ireo lehilahy ato aminao ireo?”'),
  ('6aadc735a78bab66b6110c92', '2026-09-18T23:20:21.381Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:21.381Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 22, 8, 'Dia hoy i Balama tamin’ireo: “Matoria eto anio alina, dia hoteneniko anareo izay holazain’i Jehovah amiko.” Koa nijanona tao amin’i Balama ireo andrianan’i Moaba ireo.', 'dia hoy i balama tamin’ireo: “matoria eto anio alina, dia hoteneniko anareo izay holazain’i jehovah amiko.” koa nijanona tao amin’i balama ireo andrianan’i moaba ireo.'),
  ('6aadc735a78bab66b6110c91', '2026-09-18T23:20:21.381Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:21.381Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 22, 7, 'Koa nandeha ny anti-panahin’i Moaba sy ny anti-panahin’ny Midianina, ka nitondra ny vola haloa amin’ny mpanao sikidy. Dia nankany amin’i Balama izy ireo ka nolazainy taminy ny tenin’i Balaka.', 'koa nandeha ny anti-panahin’i moaba sy ny anti-panahin’ny midianina, ka nitondra ny vola haloa amin’ny mpanao sikidy. dia nankany amin’i balama izy ireo ka nolazainy taminy ny tenin’i balaka.'),
  ('6aadc735a78bab66b6110c90', '2026-09-18T23:20:21.381Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:21.381Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 22, 6, 'Koa mba tongava re atỳ e! Dia ozòny io vahoaka io, fa mahery noho izaho izy. Amin’izay aho mety handresy azy dia handroaka azy hiala eto amin’ny taniko. Fantatro tsara mantsy hoe izay tsofinao rano dia tena mahazo fitahiana, fa izay ozoninao kosa dia tena voaozona.”', 'koa mba tongava re atỳ e! dia ozòny io vahoaka io, fa mahery noho izaho izy. amin’izay aho mety handresy azy dia handroaka azy hiala eto amin’ny taniko. fantatro tsara mantsy hoe izay tsofinao rano dia tena mahazo fitahiana, fa izay ozoninao kosa dia tena voaozona.”'),
  ('6aadc735a78bab66b6110c8f', '2026-09-18T23:20:21.381Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:21.381Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 22, 5, 'Ary nisy olona nirahiny ho any amin’i Balama zanak’i Beora, izay nipetraka tany amin’ny tanindrazany tany Petora, teo amoron’ilay Renirano. Nampiantso azy i Balaka sady niteny hoe: “Misy vahoaka iray izay, nivoaka avy tany Ejipta ka mandrakotra ny tany, ary mipetraka tandrifiko mihitsy izao ry zareo.', 'ary nisy olona nirahiny ho any amin’i balama zanak’i beora, izay nipetraka tany amin’ny tanindrazany tany petora, teo amoron’ilay renirano. nampiantso azy i balaka sady niteny hoe: “misy vahoaka iray izay, nivoaka avy tany ejipta ka mandrakotra ny tany, ary mipetraka tandrifiko mihitsy izao ry zareo.'),
  ('6aadc735a78bab66b6110c8e', '2026-09-18T23:20:21.381Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:21.381Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 22, 4, 'Ary hoy ny Moabita tamin’ny anti-panahin’ny Midianina: “Hataon’io vahoaka io ripaka daholo izao ny manodidina antsika, hoatran’ny andripahan’ny omby ny ahitra rehetra eny an-tsaha.” I Balaka zanak’i Zipora no mpanjakan’i Moaba tamin’izany fotoana izany.', 'ary hoy ny moabita tamin’ny anti-panahin’ny midianina: “hataon’io vahoaka io ripaka daholo izao ny manodidina antsika, hoatran’ny andripahan’ny omby ny ahitra rehetra eny an-tsaha.” i balaka zanak’i zipora no mpanjakan’i moaba tamin’izany fotoana izany.'),
  ('6aadc735a78bab66b6110c8d', '2026-09-18T23:20:21.381Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:21.381Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 22, 3, 'Dia natahotra be ny Moabita satria vahoaka be ny Israelita. Koa nitebiteby be ny Moabita noho ny amin’ny Israelita.', 'dia natahotra be ny moabita satria vahoaka be ny israelita. koa nitebiteby be ny moabita noho ny amin’ny israelita.'),
  ('6aadc735a78bab66b6110c8c', '2026-09-18T23:20:21.381Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:21.381Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 22, 2, 'Ary henon’i Balaka zanak’i Zipora ny zava-drehetra nataon’ny Israely tamin’ny Amorita.', 'ary henon’i balaka zanak’i zipora ny zava-drehetra nataon’ny israely tamin’ny amorita.'),
  ('6aadc735a78bab66b6110c8b', '2026-09-18T23:20:21.381Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:21.381Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 22, 1, 'Dia niainga ny Israelita ka nitoby teny amin’ny lemaka karakaina any Moaba, teny ampitan’i Jordana sady tandrifin’i Jeriko.', 'dia niainga ny israelita ka nitoby teny amin’ny lemaka karakaina any moaba, teny ampitan’i jordana sady tandrifin’i jeriko.'),
  ('6aadc737cba82f60a9712d3e', '2026-09-18T23:20:23.099Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:23.099Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 25, 18, 'satria nila ady taminareo ry zareo ka nampiasa fitaka isan-karazany mba hahatonga anareo hanompo an’i Balan’i Peora. Nampiasainy koa i Kosby anabavin’izy ireo sady zanakavavin’ny mpiadidy midianita, dia ilay novonoina tamin’ilay andro nandefasana loza taminareo noho ianareo nanompo an’i Balan’i Peora.”', 'satria nila ady taminareo ry zareo ka nampiasa fitaka isan-karazany mba hahatonga anareo hanompo an’i balan’i peora. nampiasainy koa i kosby anabavin’izy ireo sady zanakavavin’ny mpiadidy midianita, dia ilay novonoina tamin’ilay andro nandefasana loza taminareo noho ianareo nanompo an’i balan’i peora.”'),
  ('6aadc737cba82f60a9712d3d', '2026-09-18T23:20:23.099Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:23.099Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 25, 17, '“Mandehana tafiho ny Midianita ka aringano,', '“mandehana tafiho ny midianita ka aringano,'),
  ('6aadc737cba82f60a9712d3c', '2026-09-18T23:20:23.099Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:23.099Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 25, 16, 'Tatỳ aoriana dia hoy i Jehovah tamin’i Mosesy:', 'tatỳ aoriana dia hoy i jehovah tamin’i mosesy:'),
  ('6aadc737cba82f60a9712d3b', '2026-09-18T23:20:23.099Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:23.099Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 25, 15, 'Ary Kosby kosa no anaran’ilay vehivavy midianita novonoina. Zanakavavin’i Zora lehibem-poko teo amin’ny fianakaviambe iray tany Midianina izy.', 'ary kosby kosa no anaran’ilay vehivavy midianita novonoina. zanakavavin’i zora lehibem-poko teo amin’ny fianakaviambe iray tany midianina izy.'),
  ('6aadc737cba82f60a9712d3a', '2026-09-18T23:20:23.099Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:23.099Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 25, 14, 'Ary Zimry no anaran’ilay lehilahy israelita novonoina niaraka tamin’ilay vehivavy midianita. Zanak’i Salo izy, ary mpiadidy teo amin’ny fianakaviamben’ny Simeonita.', 'ary zimry no anaran’ilay lehilahy israelita novonoina niaraka tamin’ilay vehivavy midianita. zanak’i salo izy, ary mpiadidy teo amin’ny fianakaviamben’ny simeonita.'),
  ('6aadc737cba82f60a9712d39', '2026-09-18T23:20:23.099Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:23.099Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 25, 13, 'Manao fifanekena aminy aho fa hanao ny asan’ny mpisorona foana izy sy ny taranany mandimby azy. Tsy nilefitra mihitsy mantsy izy rehefa nisy nivadika tamin’Andriamaniny. Nandrakotra ny fahotan’ny vahoakan’Israely koa izy tamin’izany.’”', 'manao fifanekena aminy aho fa hanao ny asan’ny mpisorona foana izy sy ny taranany mandimby azy. tsy nilefitra mihitsy mantsy izy rehefa nisy nivadika tamin’andriamaniny. nandrakotra ny fahotan’ny vahoakan’israely koa izy tamin’izany.’”'),
  ('6aadc737cba82f60a9712d38', '2026-09-18T23:20:23.099Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:23.099Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 25, 12, 'Noho izany, dia teneno izy hoe: ‘Manao fifanekena aminy aho satria ankasitrahako izy.', 'noho izany, dia teneno izy hoe: ‘manao fifanekena aminy aho satria ankasitrahako izy.'),
  ('6aadc737cba82f60a9712d37', '2026-09-18T23:20:23.099Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:23.099Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 25, 11, '“I Finehasa zanak’i Eleazara, zanak’i Arona mpisorona, no nahatonga ahy tsy ho tezitra amin’ny vahoakan’Israely intsony, satria tsy nilefitra mihitsy izy rehefa nisy nivadika tamiko tamin’ilay vahoaka. Tsy naripako tanteraka àry ny Israelita, na dia tiako aza hoe izaho irery ihany no tompoina.', '“i finehasa zanak’i eleazara, zanak’i arona mpisorona, no nahatonga ahy tsy ho tezitra amin’ny vahoakan’israely intsony, satria tsy nilefitra mihitsy izy rehefa nisy nivadika tamiko tamin’ilay vahoaka. tsy naripako tanteraka àry ny israelita, na dia tiako aza hoe izaho irery ihany no tompoina.'),
  ('6aadc737cba82f60a9712d36', '2026-09-18T23:20:23.099Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:23.099Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 25, 10, 'Avy eo dia hoy i Jehovah tamin’i Mosesy:', 'avy eo dia hoy i jehovah tamin’i mosesy:'),
  ('6aadc737cba82f60a9712d35', '2026-09-18T23:20:23.099Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:23.099Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 25, 9, 'Nahatratra 24 000 ny olona matin’ilay loza.', 'nahatratra 24 000 ny olona matin’ilay loza.'),
  ('6aadc737cba82f60a9712d34', '2026-09-18T23:20:23.099Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:23.099Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 25, 8, 'Nanaraka an’ilay lehilahy israelita nankao an-tranolay izy, dia nataony indray nandefona ilay lehilahy israelita sy ilay vehivavy. Dia nilentika hatrany amin’ny taovam-pananahan’ilay vehivavy ilay lefona. Dia nitsahatra ilay loza nahazo ny Israelita.', 'nanaraka an’ilay lehilahy israelita nankao an-tranolay izy, dia nataony indray nandefona ilay lehilahy israelita sy ilay vehivavy. dia nilentika hatrany amin’ny taovam-pananahan’ilay vehivavy ilay lefona. dia nitsahatra ilay loza nahazo ny israelita.'),
  ('6aadc737cba82f60a9712d33', '2026-09-18T23:20:23.099Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:23.099Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 25, 7, 'Vao nahita an’izany i Finehasa zanak’i Eleazara, zanak’i Arona mpisorona, dia nitsangana avy teo amin’ny vahoaka ary naka lefona.', 'vao nahita an’izany i finehasa zanak’i eleazara, zanak’i arona mpisorona, dia nitsangana avy teo amin’ny vahoaka ary naka lefona.'),
  ('6aadc737cba82f60a9712d32', '2026-09-18T23:20:23.099Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:23.099Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 25, 6, 'Tamin’izay mihitsy anefa no nisy Israelita anankiray nitondra vehivavy midianita nankeo amin’ny rahalahiny, teo imason’i Mosesy sy ny vahoakan’Israely manontolo. Izy ireo anefa tamin’izay mbola nitomany teo amin’ny fidirana amin’ny tranolay fihaonana.', 'tamin’izay mihitsy anefa no nisy israelita anankiray nitondra vehivavy midianita nankeo amin’ny rahalahiny, teo imason’i mosesy sy ny vahoakan’israely manontolo. izy ireo anefa tamin’izay mbola nitomany teo amin’ny fidirana amin’ny tranolay fihaonana.'),
  ('6aadc737cba82f60a9712d31', '2026-09-18T23:20:23.099Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:23.099Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 25, 5, 'Hoy i Mosesy avy eo tamin’ny mpitsaran’ny Israely: “Samia mamono an’izay lehilahy eo ambany fahefany izay nanompo an’i Balan’i Peora!”', 'hoy i mosesy avy eo tamin’ny mpitsaran’ny israely: “samia mamono an’izay lehilahy eo ambany fahefany izay nanompo an’i balan’i peora!”'),
  ('6aadc737cba82f60a9712d30', '2026-09-18T23:20:23.099Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:23.099Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 25, 4, 'Dia hoy i Jehovah tamin’i Mosesy: “Sambory ny mpitarika rehetra eo amin’ny vahoaka, dia ahantòny eo anatrehan’i Jehovah ny fatiny, ho hitan’ny olona rehetra. Amin’izay tsy ho tezitra be amin’ny Israely intsony i Jehovah.”', 'dia hoy i jehovah tamin’i mosesy: “sambory ny mpitarika rehetra eo amin’ny vahoaka, dia ahantòny eo anatrehan’i jehovah ny fatiny, ho hitan’ny olona rehetra. amin’izay tsy ho tezitra be amin’ny israely intsony i jehovah.”'),
  ('6aadc737cba82f60a9712d2f', '2026-09-18T23:20:23.099Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:23.099Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 25, 3, 'Koa nanompo an’i Balan’i Peora ny Israely, ka tezitra be tamin’izy ireo i Jehovah.', 'koa nanompo an’i balan’i peora ny israely, ka tezitra be tamin’izy ireo i jehovah.'),
  ('6aadc737cba82f60a9712d2e', '2026-09-18T23:20:23.099Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:23.099Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 25, 2, 'Nasain’ireo vehivavy ireo hiaraka aminy hanao sorona ho an’ny andriamaniny ny olona. Nihinana àry izy ireo, dia niankohoka tamin’ny andriamanitr’ireny.', 'nasain’ireo vehivavy ireo hiaraka aminy hanao sorona ho an’ny andriamaniny ny olona. nihinana àry izy ireo, dia niankohoka tamin’ny andriamanitr’ireny.'),
  ('6aadc737cba82f60a9712d2d', '2026-09-18T23:20:23.099Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:23.099Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 25, 1, 'Rehefa nipetraka tao Sitima ny Israely, dia nijangajanga tamin’ny zanakavavin’i Moaba ny olona.', 'rehefa nipetraka tao sitima ny israely, dia nijangajanga tamin’ny zanakavavin’i moaba ny olona.'),
  ('6aadc7375822a96973d3512b', '2026-09-18T23:20:23.538Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:23.538Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 26, 65, 'Fa hoy i Jehovah momba azy ireny: “Tsy maintsy ho faty atỳ an-tany efitra ireo.” Koa tsy nisy niangana ireny, afa-tsy i Kaleba zanak’i Jefone sy Josoa zanak’i Nona.', 'fa hoy i jehovah momba azy ireny: “tsy maintsy ho faty atỳ an-tany efitra ireo.” koa tsy nisy niangana ireny, afa-tsy i kaleba zanak’i jefone sy josoa zanak’i nona.'),
  ('6aadc7375822a96973d3512a', '2026-09-18T23:20:23.538Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:23.538Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 26, 64, 'Tsy anisan’ireo voasoratra anarana tany an-tany efitr’i Sinay anefa izy ireo na iray aza, tamin’i Mosesy sy Arona mpisorona nanisa ny Israelita.', 'tsy anisan’ireo voasoratra anarana tany an-tany efitr’i sinay anefa izy ireo na iray aza, tamin’i mosesy sy arona mpisorona nanisa ny israelita.'),
  ('6aadc7375822a96973d35129', '2026-09-18T23:20:23.538Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:23.538Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 26, 63, 'Ireo no voasoratra anarana, ka i Mosesy sy Eleazara mpisorona no nanoratra ny anarany, tamin’izy ireo nanoratra ny anaran’ny Israelita tany amin’ny lemaka karakaina any Moaba, any akaikin’ny Reniranon’i Jordana sady tandrifin’i Jeriko.', 'ireo no voasoratra anarana, ka i mosesy sy eleazara mpisorona no nanoratra ny anarany, tamin’izy ireo nanoratra ny anaran’ny israelita tany amin’ny lemaka karakaina any moaba, any akaikin’ny reniranon’i jordana sady tandrifin’i jeriko.'),
  ('6aadc7375822a96973d35128', '2026-09-18T23:20:23.538Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:23.538Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 26, 62, 'Nisy 23 000 no voasoratra anarana rehetra, dia ny lahy rehetra iray volana no ho miakatra. Tsy nosoratana anarana niaraka tamin’ny Israelita mantsy izy ireo, satria tsy tokony homena lova teo amin’ny Israelita.', 'nisy 23 000 no voasoratra anarana rehetra, dia ny lahy rehetra iray volana no ho miakatra. tsy nosoratana anarana niaraka tamin’ny israelita mantsy izy ireo, satria tsy tokony homena lova teo amin’ny israelita.'),
  ('6aadc7375822a96973d35127', '2026-09-18T23:20:23.538Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:23.538Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 26, 61, 'Maty anefa i Nadaba sy Abiho, satria nanolotra afo teo anatrehan’i Jehovah nefa tsy nahazoana alalana ilay izy.', 'maty anefa i nadaba sy abiho, satria nanolotra afo teo anatrehan’i jehovah nefa tsy nahazoana alalana ilay izy.'),
  ('6aadc7375822a96973d35126', '2026-09-18T23:20:23.538Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:23.538Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 26, 60, 'Ary niteraka an’i Nadaba, Abiho, Eleazara, ary Itamara i Arona.', 'ary niteraka an’i nadaba, abiho, eleazara, ary itamara i arona.'),
  ('6aadc7375822a96973d35125', '2026-09-18T23:20:23.538Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:23.538Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 26, 59, 'Ny anaran’ny vadin’i Amrama dia Jokebeda, zanakavavin’i Levy izay naterany tany Ejipta. Niteraka an’i Arona sy Mosesy ary Miriama anabaviny tamin’i Amrama i Jokebeda.', 'ny anaran’ny vadin’i amrama dia jokebeda, zanakavavin’i levy izay naterany tany ejipta. niteraka an’i arona sy mosesy ary miriama anabaviny tamin’i amrama i jokebeda.'),
  ('6aadc7375822a96973d35124', '2026-09-18T23:20:23.538Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:23.538Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 26, 58, 'Ireto avy ny fianakavian’ny Levita: Ny Libnita, ny Hebronita, ny Malita, ny Mosita, ary ny Korahita. Ary niteraka an’i Amrama i Kehata.', 'ireto avy ny fianakavian’ny levita: ny libnita, ny hebronita, ny malita, ny mosita, ary ny korahita. ary niteraka an’i amrama i kehata.'),
  ('6aadc7375822a96973d35123', '2026-09-18T23:20:23.538Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:23.538Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 26, 57, 'Ireto avy no voasoratra anarana tamin’ny Levita, araka ny fianakaviany avy: Avy tamin’i Gersona ny Gersonita, avy tamin’i Kehata ny Kehatita, ary avy tamin’i Merary ny Merarita.', 'ireto avy no voasoratra anarana tamin’ny levita, araka ny fianakaviany avy: avy tamin’i gersona ny gersonita, avy tamin’i kehata ny kehatita, ary avy tamin’i merary ny merarita.'),
  ('6aadc7375822a96973d35122', '2026-09-18T23:20:23.538Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:23.538Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 26, 56, 'Hanao antsapaka ianareo mba hamantarana ny lovan’ny foko tsirairay, na kely ilay foko na lehibe.”', 'hanao antsapaka ianareo mba hamantarana ny lovan’ny foko tsirairay, na kely ilay foko na lehibe.”'),
