  ('6aadc7375822a96973d350ef', '2026-09-18T23:20:23.538Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:23.538Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 26, 5, 'I Robena no lahimatoan’i Israely, ka ireto avy ny taranany: Avy tamin’i Hanoka ny Hanokita, avy tamin’i Palo ny Paloita,', 'i robena no lahimatoan’i israely, ka ireto avy ny taranany: avy tamin’i hanoka ny hanokita, avy tamin’i palo ny paloita,'),
  ('6aadc7375822a96973d350ee', '2026-09-18T23:20:23.538Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:23.538Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 26, 4, '“Isao izay 20 taona no ho miakatra, araka ny didy nomen’i Jehovah an’i Mosesy.” Ireto avy ny zanak’Israely nivoaka avy tany Ejipta:', '“isao izay 20 taona no ho miakatra, araka ny didy nomen’i jehovah an’i mosesy.” ireto avy ny zanak’israely nivoaka avy tany ejipta:'),
  ('6aadc7375822a96973d350ed', '2026-09-18T23:20:23.538Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:23.538Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 26, 3, 'Hoy àry i Mosesy sy Eleazara mpisorona tamin’izy ireo, tany amin’ny lemaka karakaina any Moaba, tany akaikin’ny Reniranon’i Jordana sady tandrifin’i Jeriko:', 'hoy àry i mosesy sy eleazara mpisorona tamin’izy ireo, tany amin’ny lemaka karakaina any moaba, tany akaikin’ny reniranon’i jordana sady tandrifin’i jeriko:'),
  ('6aadc7375822a96973d350ec', '2026-09-18T23:20:23.538Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:23.538Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 26, 2, '“Isao ny vahoakan’Israely manontolo, dia izay 20 taona no ho miakatra, isaky ny fianakaviambeny, ka isao izay rehetra afaka manompo ao amin’ny tafika eo amin’ny Israely.”', '“isao ny vahoakan’israely manontolo, dia izay 20 taona no ho miakatra, isaky ny fianakaviambeny, ka isao izay rehetra afaka manompo ao amin’ny tafika eo amin’ny israely.”'),
  ('6aadc7375822a96973d350eb', '2026-09-18T23:20:23.538Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:23.538Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 26, 1, 'Taorian’ilay loza, dia hoy i Jehovah tamin’i Mosesy sy Eleazara zanak’i Arona mpisorona:', 'taorian’ilay loza, dia hoy i jehovah tamin’i mosesy sy eleazara zanak’i arona mpisorona:'),
  ('6aadc73788032c482d765259', '2026-09-18T23:20:23.953Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:23.953Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 27, 23, 'Dia nametra-tanana tamin’i Josoa izy ka nanendry azy, araka izay nolazain’i Jehovah tamin’ny alalan’i Mosesy.', 'dia nametra-tanana tamin’i josoa izy ka nanendry azy, araka izay nolazain’i jehovah tamin’ny alalan’i mosesy.'),
  ('6aadc73788032c482d765258', '2026-09-18T23:20:23.953Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:23.953Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 27, 22, 'Koa nanao an’izay nasain’i Jehovah nataony i Mosesy. Nalainy i Josoa ka nasainy nijoro teo anatrehan’i Eleazara mpisorona sy ny vahoaka manontolo.', 'koa nanao an’izay nasain’i jehovah nataony i mosesy. nalainy i josoa ka nasainy nijoro teo anatrehan’i eleazara mpisorona sy ny vahoaka manontolo.'),
  ('6aadc73788032c482d765257', '2026-09-18T23:20:23.953Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:23.953Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 27, 21, 'Hijoro eo anatrehan’i Eleazara mpisorona izy, ary rehefa manam-panontaniana izy, dia i Eleazara no hanontany eo anatrehan’i Jehovah, amin’ny alalan’ny fitsaran’ny Orima. Dia izay baiko azo eo no harahin’izy rehetra, dia izy sy ny Israelita rehetra, izany hoe ny vahoaka manontolo.”', 'hijoro eo anatrehan’i eleazara mpisorona izy, ary rehefa manam-panontaniana izy, dia i eleazara no hanontany eo anatrehan’i jehovah, amin’ny alalan’ny fitsaran’ny orima. dia izay baiko azo eo no harahin’izy rehetra, dia izy sy ny israelita rehetra, izany hoe ny vahoaka manontolo.”'),
  ('6aadc73788032c482d765256', '2026-09-18T23:20:23.953Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:23.953Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 27, 20, 'Ary zarao aminy ny fahefanao, mba hihaino azy ny vahoakan’Israely manontolo.', 'ary zarao aminy ny fahefanao, mba hihaino azy ny vahoakan’israely manontolo.'),
  ('6aadc73788032c482d765255', '2026-09-18T23:20:23.953Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:23.953Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 27, 19, 'Ary asaivo mijoro eo anatrehan’i Eleazara mpisorona sy ny vahoaka manontolo izy, dia tendreo ho mpitarika eo imason’izy ireo.', 'ary asaivo mijoro eo anatrehan’i eleazara mpisorona sy ny vahoaka manontolo izy, dia tendreo ho mpitarika eo imason’izy ireo.'),
  ('6aadc73788032c482d765254', '2026-09-18T23:20:23.953Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:23.953Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 27, 18, 'Dia hoy i Jehovah tamin’i Mosesy: “Alaivo i Josoa zanak’i Nona, fa manana ny toetra ilaina mba ho mpitarika izy. Dia ametraho tanana izy.', 'dia hoy i jehovah tamin’i mosesy: “alaivo i josoa zanak’i nona, fa manana ny toetra ilaina mba ho mpitarika izy. dia ametraho tanana izy.'),
  ('6aadc73788032c482d765253', '2026-09-18T23:20:23.953Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:23.953Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 27, 17, 'mba ho mpitarika azy amin’ny zava-drehetra, izany hoe hitarika azy amin’izay rehetra ataony, amin’izay tsy ho hoatran’ny ondry tsy misy mpiandry ny vahoakan’i Jehovah.”', 'mba ho mpitarika azy amin’ny zava-drehetra, izany hoe hitarika azy amin’izay rehetra ataony, amin’izay tsy ho hoatran’ny ondry tsy misy mpiandry ny vahoakan’i jehovah.”'),
  ('6aadc73788032c482d765252', '2026-09-18T23:20:23.953Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:23.953Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 27, 16, '“Ry Jehovah Andriamanitra mpanome aina ny olona rehetra ô! Manendre lehilahy iray hitondra ny vahoaka,', '“ry jehovah andriamanitra mpanome aina ny olona rehetra ô! manendre lehilahy iray hitondra ny vahoaka,'),
  ('6aadc73788032c482d765251', '2026-09-18T23:20:23.953Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:23.953Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 27, 15, 'Ary hoy i Mosesy tamin’i Jehovah:', 'ary hoy i mosesy tamin’i jehovah:'),
  ('6aadc73788032c482d765250', '2026-09-18T23:20:23.953Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:23.953Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 27, 14, 'Tamin’ilay vahoaka nila ady tamiko tany an-tany efitr’i Zina mantsy, dia nikomy tsy nanaraka ny didiko ianareo, ka tsy nanamasina ahy teo anatrehan’ny vahoaka. Teo amin’ny rano tao Meriba, tao Kadesy, tany an-tany efitr’i Zina, izany no nitranga.”', 'tamin’ilay vahoaka nila ady tamiko tany an-tany efitr’i zina mantsy, dia nikomy tsy nanaraka ny didiko ianareo, ka tsy nanamasina ahy teo anatrehan’ny vahoaka. teo amin’ny rano tao meriba, tao kadesy, tany an-tany efitr’i zina, izany no nitranga.”'),
  ('6aadc73788032c482d76524f', '2026-09-18T23:20:23.953Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:23.953Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 27, 13, 'Rehefa hitanao ilay izy, dia hangonina any amin’ny razambenao ianao, hoatran’i Arona rahalahinao.', 'rehefa hitanao ilay izy, dia hangonina any amin’ny razambenao ianao, hoatran’i arona rahalahinao.'),
  ('6aadc73788032c482d76524e', '2026-09-18T23:20:23.953Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:23.953Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 27, 12, 'Hoy koa i Jehovah tamin’i Mosesy: “Miakara eo amin’io tendrombohitr’i Abarima io, dia tazano ilay tany homeko ny Israelita.', 'hoy koa i jehovah tamin’i mosesy: “miakara eo amin’io tendrombohitr’i abarima io, dia tazano ilay tany homeko ny israelita.'),
  ('6aadc73788032c482d76524d', '2026-09-18T23:20:23.953Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:23.953Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 27, 11, 'Raha tsy manan-drahalahy kosa ny rainy, dia omeo an’izay havany akaiky indrindra ao amin’ny fokony ny lovany, ka ho lasan’io ilay izy. Ho lalàna ho an’ny Israelita izany didim-pitsarana izany, araka ny didy nomen’i Jehovah an’i Mosesy.’”', 'raha tsy manan-drahalahy kosa ny rainy, dia omeo an’izay havany akaiky indrindra ao amin’ny fokony ny lovany, ka ho lasan’io ilay izy. ho lalàna ho an’ny israelita izany didim-pitsarana izany, araka ny didy nomen’i jehovah an’i mosesy.’”'),
  ('6aadc73788032c482d76524c', '2026-09-18T23:20:23.953Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:23.953Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 27, 10, 'Ary raha tsy manan-drahalahy izy, dia omeo ny rahalahin-drainy ny lovany.', 'ary raha tsy manan-drahalahy izy, dia omeo ny rahalahin-drainy ny lovany.'),
  ('6aadc73788032c482d76524b', '2026-09-18T23:20:23.953Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:23.953Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 27, 9, 'Fa raha tsy manan-janakavavy izy, dia omeo ny rahalahiny izany.', 'fa raha tsy manan-janakavavy izy, dia omeo ny rahalahiny izany.'),
  ('6aadc73788032c482d76524a', '2026-09-18T23:20:23.953Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:23.953Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 27, 8, 'Ary teneno ny Israelita hoe: ‘Raha misy lehilahy maty nefa tsy manan-janakalahy, dia afindrao amin’ny zanany vavy ny lovany.', 'ary teneno ny israelita hoe: ‘raha misy lehilahy maty nefa tsy manan-janakalahy, dia afindrao amin’ny zanany vavy ny lovany.'),
  ('6aadc73788032c482d765249', '2026-09-18T23:20:23.953Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:23.953Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 27, 7, '“Marina ny tenin’ny zanakavavin’i Zelofada. Tena tokony homenao lova eo amin’ny rahalahin-drainy izy ireo. Afindrao aminy àry ny lovan’ny rainy.', '“marina ny tenin’ny zanakavavin’i zelofada. tena tokony homenao lova eo amin’ny rahalahin-drainy izy ireo. afindrao aminy àry ny lovan’ny rainy.'),
  ('6aadc73788032c482d765248', '2026-09-18T23:20:23.953Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:23.953Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 27, 6, 'Ary hoy i Jehovah tamin’i Mosesy:', 'ary hoy i jehovah tamin’i mosesy:'),
  ('6aadc73788032c482d765247', '2026-09-18T23:20:23.953Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:23.953Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 27, 5, 'Dia nentin’i Mosesy teo anatrehan’i Jehovah ilay raharaha.', 'dia nentin’i mosesy teo anatrehan’i jehovah ilay raharaha.'),
  ('6aadc73788032c482d765246', '2026-09-18T23:20:23.953Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:23.953Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 27, 4, 'Dia ny anaran’ny rainay ve dia hofoanana tsy ho eo amin’ny fianakaviany, satria hoe tsy nanan-janakalahy izy? Mba omeo lova koa izahay, hoatran’ny rahalahin-drainay.”', 'dia ny anaran’ny rainay ve dia hofoanana tsy ho eo amin’ny fianakaviany, satria hoe tsy nanan-janakalahy izy? mba omeo lova koa izahay, hoatran’ny rahalahin-drainay.”'),
  ('6aadc73788032c482d765245', '2026-09-18T23:20:23.953Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:23.953Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 27, 3, '“Maty tany an-tany efitra ny rainay, nefa izy tsy anisan’ireo olona nanohitra an’i Jehovah niaraka tamin’ny mpanohana an’i Kora. Maty noho ny fahotany ihany izy, ary tsy mba nanan-janakalahy.', '“maty tany an-tany efitra ny rainay, nefa izy tsy anisan’ireo olona nanohitra an’i jehovah niaraka tamin’ny mpanohana an’i kora. maty noho ny fahotany ihany izy, ary tsy mba nanan-janakalahy.'),
  ('6aadc73788032c482d765244', '2026-09-18T23:20:23.953Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:23.953Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 27, 2, 'Dia nijoro teo anatrehan’i Mosesy sy Eleazara mpisorona sy ny mpiadidy ary ny vahoaka manontolo izy ireo, teo amin’ny fidirana amin’ny tranolay fihaonana, ka niteny hoe:', 'dia nijoro teo anatrehan’i mosesy sy eleazara mpisorona sy ny mpiadidy ary ny vahoaka manontolo izy ireo, teo amin’ny fidirana amin’ny tranolay fihaonana, ka niteny hoe:'),
  ('6aadc73788032c482d765243', '2026-09-18T23:20:23.953Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:23.953Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 27, 1, 'Ary nanatona an’i Mosesy ny zanakavavin’i Zelofada, zanakalahin’i Hefera, zanak’i Gileada, zanak’i Makira, zanak’i Manase, avy tamin’ny fianakaviamben’i Manase zanak’i Josefa. Ireto avy ny anaran’ireo zanany vavy ireo: Mahala, Noa, Hogla, Milka, ary Tirza.', 'ary nanatona an’i mosesy ny zanakavavin’i zelofada, zanakalahin’i hefera, zanak’i gileada, zanak’i makira, zanak’i manase, avy tamin’ny fianakaviamben’i manase zanak’i josefa. ireto avy ny anaran’ireo zanany vavy ireo: mahala, noa, hogla, milka, ary tirza.'),
  ('6aadc73867a5f349e8355025', '2026-09-18T23:20:24.874Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:24.874Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 28, 1, 'Hoy koa i Jehovah tamin’i Mosesy:', 'hoy koa i jehovah tamin’i mosesy:'),
  ('6aadc73867a5f349e8355026', '2026-09-18T23:20:24.874Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:24.874Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 28, 2, '“Lazao amin’ny Israelita izao didy izao: ‘Tandremo sao hadinonareo ny manolotra ny fanatitra, izany hoe ny sakafo tokony homena ahy. Tsy maintsy atolotra amin’ny fotoana voatondro ny fanatitra atao anaty afo, mba ho hanitra mahafinaritra ahy.’', '“lazao amin’ny israelita izao didy izao: ‘tandremo sao hadinonareo ny manolotra ny fanatitra, izany hoe ny sakafo tokony homena ahy. tsy maintsy atolotra amin’ny fotoana voatondro ny fanatitra atao anaty afo, mba ho hanitra mahafinaritra ahy.’'),
  ('6aadc73867a5f349e8355027', '2026-09-18T23:20:24.874Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:24.874Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 28, 3, '“Lazao aminy hoe: ‘Izao no fanatitra atao anaty afo hatolotrareo ho an’i Jehovah: Ondrilahy kely roa tsy misy kilema herintaona avy, ho fanatitra dorana atolotra tsy tapaka.', '“lazao aminy hoe: ‘izao no fanatitra atao anaty afo hatolotrareo ho an’i jehovah: ondrilahy kely roa tsy misy kilema herintaona avy, ho fanatitra dorana atolotra tsy tapaka.'),
  ('6aadc73867a5f349e8355028', '2026-09-18T23:20:24.874Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:24.874Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 28, 4, 'Hatolotrao amin’ny maraina ny ondrilahy kely iray, fa ny iray kosa amin’ny takariva.', 'hatolotrao amin’ny maraina ny ondrilahy kely iray, fa ny iray kosa amin’ny takariva.'),
  ('6aadc73867a5f349e8355029', '2026-09-18T23:20:24.874Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:24.874Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 28, 5, 'Ny ondrilahy tsirairay dia hampiarahina amin’ny fanatitra varimbazaha, izany hoe lafarinina tsara toto ampahafolon’ny efaha, afangaro menaka ampahefatry ny hina avy amin’ny oliva voatoto.', 'ny ondrilahy tsirairay dia hampiarahina amin’ny fanatitra varimbazaha, izany hoe lafarinina tsara toto ampahafolon’ny efaha, afangaro menaka ampahefatry ny hina avy amin’ny oliva voatoto.'),
  ('6aadc73867a5f349e835502a', '2026-09-18T23:20:24.874Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:24.874Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 28, 6, 'Fanatitra dorana atolotra tsy tapaka izany, araka ny didy nomena teo amin’ny Tendrombohitra Sinay, mba ho hanitra mahafinaritra, ho fanatitra atao anaty afo ho an’i Jehovah.', 'fanatitra dorana atolotra tsy tapaka izany, araka ny didy nomena teo amin’ny tendrombohitra sinay, mba ho hanitra mahafinaritra, ho fanatitra atao anaty afo ho an’i jehovah.'),
  ('6aadc73867a5f349e835502b', '2026-09-18T23:20:24.874Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:24.874Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 28, 7, 'Hampiarahina amin’ny fanatitra zava-pisotro ampahefatry ny hina koa ny ondrilahy tsirairay. Dia araraho ho an’i Jehovah eo amin’ny toerana masina ilay fanatitra zava-pisotro misy alkaola.', 'hampiarahina amin’ny fanatitra zava-pisotro ampahefatry ny hina koa ny ondrilahy tsirairay. dia araraho ho an’i jehovah eo amin’ny toerana masina ilay fanatitra zava-pisotro misy alkaola.'),
  ('6aadc73867a5f349e835502c', '2026-09-18T23:20:24.874Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:24.874Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 28, 8, 'Ary atolory amin’ny takariva ny ondrilahy kely iray, dia ampiaraho amin’ny fanatitra varimbazaha mitovy amin’ilay atao amin’ny maraina, sy ny fanatitra zava-pisotro mitovy amin’ilay teo aloha, mba ho fanatitra atao anaty afo ka ho hanitra mahafinaritra an’i Jehovah.', 'ary atolory amin’ny takariva ny ondrilahy kely iray, dia ampiaraho amin’ny fanatitra varimbazaha mitovy amin’ilay atao amin’ny maraina, sy ny fanatitra zava-pisotro mitovy amin’ilay teo aloha, mba ho fanatitra atao anaty afo ka ho hanitra mahafinaritra an’i jehovah.'),
  ('6aadc73867a5f349e835502d', '2026-09-18T23:20:24.874Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:24.874Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 28, 9, '“‘Izao kosa no hatolotra amin’ny andro sabata: Ondrilahy kely roa tsy misy kilema herintaona avy, sy lafarinina tsara toto roa ampahafolon’ny efaha ho fanatitra varimbazaha afangaro menaka, ary ny fanatitra zava-pisotro ampiarahina aminy.', '“‘izao kosa no hatolotra amin’ny andro sabata: ondrilahy kely roa tsy misy kilema herintaona avy, sy lafarinina tsara toto roa ampahafolon’ny efaha ho fanatitra varimbazaha afangaro menaka, ary ny fanatitra zava-pisotro ampiarahina aminy.'),
  ('6aadc73867a5f349e835502e', '2026-09-18T23:20:24.874Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:24.874Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 28, 10, 'Izany no fanatitra dorana atolotra isaky ny Sabata, miaraka amin’ny fanatitra dorana atolotra tsy tapaka sy ny fanatitra zava-pisotro ampiarahina aminy.', 'izany no fanatitra dorana atolotra isaky ny sabata, miaraka amin’ny fanatitra dorana atolotra tsy tapaka sy ny fanatitra zava-pisotro ampiarahina aminy.'),
  ('6aadc73867a5f349e835502f', '2026-09-18T23:20:24.874Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:24.874Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 28, 11, '“‘Ireto no hatolotrareo ho fanatitra dorana ho an’i Jehovah, isaky ny voalohan’ny volana: Vantotr’ombilahy roa, sy ondrilahy iray, ary ondrilahy kely fito tsy misy kilema herintaona avy.', '“‘ireto no hatolotrareo ho fanatitra dorana ho an’i jehovah, isaky ny voalohan’ny volana: vantotr’ombilahy roa, sy ondrilahy iray, ary ondrilahy kely fito tsy misy kilema herintaona avy.'),
  ('6aadc73867a5f349e8355030', '2026-09-18T23:20:24.874Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:24.874Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 28, 12, 'Ny vantotr’ombilahy tsirairay dia hampiarahina amin’ny lafarinina tsara toto telo ampahafolon’ny efaha nafangaro menaka, izay atao fanatitra varimbazaha. Ilay ondrilahy kosa hampiarahina amin’ny lafarinina tsara toto roa ampahafolon’ny efaha, nafangaro menaka, izay atao fanatitra varimbazaha.', 'ny vantotr’ombilahy tsirairay dia hampiarahina amin’ny lafarinina tsara toto telo ampahafolon’ny efaha nafangaro menaka, izay atao fanatitra varimbazaha. ilay ondrilahy kosa hampiarahina amin’ny lafarinina tsara toto roa ampahafolon’ny efaha, nafangaro menaka, izay atao fanatitra varimbazaha.'),
  ('6aadc73867a5f349e8355031', '2026-09-18T23:20:24.874Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:24.874Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 28, 13, 'Ary ny ondrilahy kely tsirairay dia hampiarahina amin’ny lafarinina tsara toto ampahafolon’ny efaha, nafangaro menaka, izay atao fanatitra varimbazaha. Hatao fanatitra dorana izany mba ho hanitra mahafinaritra, ho fanatitra atao anaty afo ho an’i Jehovah.', 'ary ny ondrilahy kely tsirairay dia hampiarahina amin’ny lafarinina tsara toto ampahafolon’ny efaha, nafangaro menaka, izay atao fanatitra varimbazaha. hatao fanatitra dorana izany mba ho hanitra mahafinaritra, ho fanatitra atao anaty afo ho an’i jehovah.'),
  ('6aadc73867a5f349e8355032', '2026-09-18T23:20:24.874Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:24.874Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 28, 14, 'Ny fanatitra zava-pisotro hampiarahina amin’ireo, dia divay antsasaky ny hina isaky ny ombilahy, ary ampahatelon’ny hina no hampiarahina amin’ilay ondrilahy, ary ampahefatry ny hina kosa isaky ny ondrilahy kely. Izany no fanatitra dorana atolotra isam-bolana, mandritra ny taona.', 'ny fanatitra zava-pisotro hampiarahina amin’ireo, dia divay antsasaky ny hina isaky ny ombilahy, ary ampahatelon’ny hina no hampiarahina amin’ilay ondrilahy, ary ampahefatry ny hina kosa isaky ny ondrilahy kely. izany no fanatitra dorana atolotra isam-bolana, mandritra ny taona.'),
  ('6aadc73867a5f349e8355033', '2026-09-18T23:20:24.874Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:24.874Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 28, 15, 'Zanak’osy iray koa no tokony hatolotra ho an’i Jehovah mba ho fanatitra noho ny ota, ankoatra ny fanatitra dorana atolotra tsy tapaka sy ny fanatitra zava-pisotro ampiarahina aminy.', 'zanak’osy iray koa no tokony hatolotra ho an’i jehovah mba ho fanatitra noho ny ota, ankoatra ny fanatitra dorana atolotra tsy tapaka sy ny fanatitra zava-pisotro ampiarahina aminy.'),
  ('6aadc73867a5f349e8355034', '2026-09-18T23:20:24.874Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:24.874Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 28, 16, '“‘Ny andro faha-14 amin’ny volana voalohany no hankalazana ny Paskan’i Jehovah.', '“‘ny andro faha-14 amin’ny volana voalohany no hankalazana ny paskan’i jehovah.'),
  ('6aadc73867a5f349e8355035', '2026-09-18T23:20:24.874Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:24.874Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 28, 17, 'Hisy fety kosa amin’ny andro faha-15 amin’io volana io. Mofo tsy misy lalivay no hohanina mandritra ny fito andro.', 'hisy fety kosa amin’ny andro faha-15 amin’io volana io. mofo tsy misy lalivay no hohanina mandritra ny fito andro.');
INSERT INTO "bible_verses" ("id", "created_date", "updated_date", "created_by_id", "created_by", "translation", "book", "bookOrder", "chapter", "verse", "text", "normalizedText") VALUES
  ('6aadc73867a5f349e8355036', '2026-09-18T23:20:24.874Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:24.874Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 28, 18, 'Hisy fivoriambe masina amin’ny andro voalohany. Aza manao asa mafy, na inona izany na inona.', 'hisy fivoriambe masina amin’ny andro voalohany. aza manao asa mafy, na inona izany na inona.'),
  ('6aadc73867a5f349e8355037', '2026-09-18T23:20:24.874Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:24.874Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 28, 19, 'Ireto no hatolotrareo ho fanatitra atao anaty afo, ho fanatitra dorana ho an’i Jehovah: Vantotr’ombilahy roa, sy ondrilahy iray, ary ondrilahy kely fito izay herintaona avy. Biby tsy misy kilema no tokony hatolotrareo.', 'ireto no hatolotrareo ho fanatitra atao anaty afo, ho fanatitra dorana ho an’i jehovah: vantotr’ombilahy roa, sy ondrilahy iray, ary ondrilahy kely fito izay herintaona avy. biby tsy misy kilema no tokony hatolotrareo.'),
  ('6aadc73867a5f349e8355038', '2026-09-18T23:20:24.874Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:24.874Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 28, 20, 'Ny fanatitra varimbazaha tokony hatolotrareo miaraka amin’ireo dia lafarinina tsara toto afangaro menaka, ka lafarinina telo ampahafolon’ny efaha no hampiarahina amin’ny ombilahy tsirairay, ary roa ampahafolon’ny efaha no hampiarahina amin’ilay ondrilahy.', 'ny fanatitra varimbazaha tokony hatolotrareo miaraka amin’ireo dia lafarinina tsara toto afangaro menaka, ka lafarinina telo ampahafolon’ny efaha no hampiarahina amin’ny ombilahy tsirairay, ary roa ampahafolon’ny efaha no hampiarahina amin’ilay ondrilahy.'),
  ('6aadc73867a5f349e8355039', '2026-09-18T23:20:24.874Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:24.874Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 28, 21, 'Lafarinina ampahafolon’ny efaha kosa no hatolotrao isaky ny ondrilahy kely amin’ny ondrilahy kely fito.', 'lafarinina ampahafolon’ny efaha kosa no hatolotrao isaky ny ondrilahy kely amin’ny ondrilahy kely fito.'),
