  ('6aadc73a215c2768726796c7', '2026-09-18T23:20:26.160Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:26.160Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 30, 11, 'ary henon’ny vadiny ilay izy nefa tsy manakana azy ilay vadiny sady tsy miteny hoe tsy ekeny ilay izy, dia hanan-kery daholo ny voady rehetra nataon’ilay vehivavy, na izay voadiny hoe hifady zavatra.', 'ary henon’ny vadiny ilay izy nefa tsy manakana azy ilay vadiny sady tsy miteny hoe tsy ekeny ilay izy, dia hanan-kery daholo ny voady rehetra nataon’ilay vehivavy, na izay voadiny hoe hifady zavatra.'),
  ('6aadc73a215c2768726796cc', '2026-09-18T23:20:26.160Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:26.160Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 30, 16, '“Ireo no fitsipika nandidian’i Jehovah an’i Mosesy momba ny lehilahy sy ny vadiny, sy momba ny ray sy ny zanany vavy tanora mbola ao an-tranony.”', '“ireo no fitsipika nandidian’i jehovah an’i mosesy momba ny lehilahy sy ny vadiny, sy momba ny ray sy ny zanany vavy tanora mbola ao an-tranony.”'),
  ('6aadc73a215c2768726796c6', '2026-09-18T23:20:26.160Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:26.160Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 30, 10, '“Fa raha ao an-tranon’ny vadiny kosa ny vehivavy no manao voady, na mivoady hoe hifady zavatra,', '“fa raha ao an-tranon’ny vadiny kosa ny vehivavy no manao voady, na mivoady hoe hifady zavatra,'),
  ('6aadc73a215c2768726796c1', '2026-09-18T23:20:26.160Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:26.160Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 30, 5, 'Raha mandrara azy anefa ny rainy rehefa henony hoe nanao voady ilay zanany, na nivoady hoe hifady zavatra, dia tsy hanan-kery ilay voady. Hamela ny helok’ilay tovovavy i Jehovah, satria nandrara azy ny rainy.', 'raha mandrara azy anefa ny rainy rehefa henony hoe nanao voady ilay zanany, na nivoady hoe hifady zavatra, dia tsy hanan-kery ilay voady. hamela ny helok’ilay tovovavy i jehovah, satria nandrara azy ny rainy.'),
  ('6aadc73a215c2768726796c5', '2026-09-18T23:20:26.160Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:26.160Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 30, 9, '“Raha vehivavy maty vady na nisara-bady indray no mivoady, dia ho voafatotry ny teniny rehetra izy.', '“raha vehivavy maty vady na nisara-bady indray no mivoady, dia ho voafatotry ny teniny rehetra izy.'),
  ('6aadc73a215c2768726796c2', '2026-09-18T23:20:26.160Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:26.160Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 30, 6, '“Raha manambady kosa ilay vehivavy, ka mivoady na manao fampanantenana maimaika,', '“raha manambady kosa ilay vehivavy, ka mivoady na manao fampanantenana maimaika,'),
  ('6aadc73a215c2768726796c3', '2026-09-18T23:20:26.160Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:26.160Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 30, 7, 'ary henon’ny vadiny ilay izy nefa tsy manakana azy ilay vadiny amin’ilay andro ahenoany an’ilay izy, dia hanan-kery ny voady ataon’ilay vehivavy, na ny voadiny hoe hifady zavatra.', 'ary henon’ny vadiny ilay izy nefa tsy manakana azy ilay vadiny amin’ilay andro ahenoany an’ilay izy, dia hanan-kery ny voady ataon’ilay vehivavy, na ny voadiny hoe hifady zavatra.'),
  ('6aadc73a215c2768726796bf', '2026-09-18T23:20:26.160Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:26.160Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 30, 3, '“Ary raha misy tovovavy mbola mipetraka ao amin’ny rainy ka mivoady amin’i Jehovah, na mivoady hoe hifady zavatra,', '“ary raha misy tovovavy mbola mipetraka ao amin’ny rainy ka mivoady amin’i jehovah, na mivoady hoe hifady zavatra,'),
  ('6aadc73a215c2768726796c9', '2026-09-18T23:20:26.160Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:26.160Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 30, 13, 'Na inona na inona voady ataon’ilay vehivavy, na fianianana sy voady ataony hoe hifady zavatra na hampihafy tena, dia ny vadiny no hampanan-kery na hanafoana an’ilay izy.', 'na inona na inona voady ataon’ilay vehivavy, na fianianana sy voady ataony hoe hifady zavatra na hampihafy tena, dia ny vadiny no hampanan-kery na hanafoana an’ilay izy.'),
  ('6aadc73a215c2768726796c4', '2026-09-18T23:20:26.160Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:26.160Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 30, 8, 'Raha mandrara azy anefa ny vadiny amin’ilay andro ahenoany an’ilay izy, dia azon’ilay vadiny foanana ilay voady, na ilay fampanantenana maimaika nataon’ilay vehivavy. Ary hamela ny helok’ilay vehivavy i Jehovah.', 'raha mandrara azy anefa ny vadiny amin’ilay andro ahenoany an’ilay izy, dia azon’ilay vadiny foanana ilay voady, na ilay fampanantenana maimaika nataon’ilay vehivavy. ary hamela ny helok’ilay vehivavy i jehovah.'),
  ('6aadc73a215c2768726796be', '2026-09-18T23:20:26.160Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:26.160Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 30, 2, 'Raha mivoady amin’i Jehovah ny lehilahy iray, na mianiana ka mivoady hoe hifady zavatra, dia tsy mahazo mivadika amin’ny teniny izy. Tokony hotanterahiny daholo izay rehetra nolazainy tao amin’ilay voady.', 'raha mivoady amin’i jehovah ny lehilahy iray, na mianiana ka mivoady hoe hifady zavatra, dia tsy mahazo mivadika amin’ny teniny izy. tokony hotanterahiny daholo izay rehetra nolazainy tao amin’ilay voady.'),
  ('6aadc73a215c2768726796c0', '2026-09-18T23:20:26.160Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:26.160Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 30, 4, 'ary henon’ny rainy ilay voady nataony, na ilay voadiny hoe hifady zavatra, nefa tsy manakana azy ny rainy, dia hanan-kery ny voadiny rehetra, ary hanan-kery koa izay voadiny hoe hifady zavatra.', 'ary henon’ny rainy ilay voady nataony, na ilay voadiny hoe hifady zavatra, nefa tsy manakana azy ny rainy, dia hanan-kery ny voadiny rehetra, ary hanan-kery koa izay voadiny hoe hifady zavatra.'),
  ('6aadc73a215c2768726796cb', '2026-09-18T23:20:26.160Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:26.160Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 30, 15, 'Fa raha manafoana an’izany kosa ilay lehilahy taorian’ilay andro nahenoany an’izany, dia izy no hizaka ny fahadisoan’ilay vehivavy.', 'fa raha manafoana an’izany kosa ilay lehilahy taorian’ilay andro nahenoany an’izany, dia izy no hizaka ny fahadisoan’ilay vehivavy.'),
  ('6aadc73a215c2768726796c8', '2026-09-18T23:20:26.160Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:26.160Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 30, 12, 'Tsy hanan-kery anefa izay voady nataon’ilay vehivavy, na izay voadiny hoe hifady zavatra, na dia nianiana aza izy, raha nanafoana tanteraka an’ilay izy ny vadiny, tamin’ny andro nahenoany an’izany. Efa nofoanan’ny vadiny mantsy ilay izy. Ary hamela ny helok’ilay vehivavy i Jehovah.', 'tsy hanan-kery anefa izay voady nataon’ilay vehivavy, na izay voadiny hoe hifady zavatra, na dia nianiana aza izy, raha nanafoana tanteraka an’ilay izy ny vadiny, tamin’ny andro nahenoany an’izany. efa nofoanan’ny vadiny mantsy ilay izy. ary hamela ny helok’ilay vehivavy i jehovah.'),
  ('6aadc73a215c2768726796bd', '2026-09-18T23:20:26.160Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:26.160Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 30, 1, 'Dia niresaka tamin’ireo lehibem-pokon’ny Israely i Mosesy, hoe: “Izao no didin’i Jehovah:', 'dia niresaka tamin’ireo lehibem-pokon’ny israely i mosesy, hoe: “izao no didin’i jehovah:'),
  ('6aadc73a215c2768726796ca', '2026-09-18T23:20:26.160Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:26.160Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 30, 14, 'Raha tsy manakana azy mihitsy anefa ny vadiny rehefa mandeha ny fotoana, dia mampanan-kery ny voady rehetra nataon’ilay vehivavy izy, na ny voadiny rehetra hoe hifady zavatra. Mampanan-kery an’izany ilay lehilahy, satria tsy nanakana azy tamin’ilay andro nahenoany an’ilay vehivavy nanao an’ilay voady.', 'raha tsy manakana azy mihitsy anefa ny vadiny rehefa mandeha ny fotoana, dia mampanan-kery ny voady rehetra nataon’ilay vehivavy izy, na ny voadiny rehetra hoe hifady zavatra. mampanan-kery an’izany ilay lehilahy, satria tsy nanakana azy tamin’ilay andro nahenoany an’ilay vehivavy nanao an’ilay voady.'),
  ('6aadc73baf538092f7b6e6ed', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.310Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.310Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 31, 7, 'Niady tamin’ny Midianina izy ireo, araka ny didy nomen’i Jehovah an’i Mosesy, dia naripany ny lehilahy rehetra.', 'niady tamin’ny midianina izy ireo, araka ny didy nomen’i jehovah an’i mosesy, dia naripany ny lehilahy rehetra.'),
  ('6aadc73baf538092f7b6e6e8', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.310Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.310Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 31, 2, '“Valio ny Midianita noho ny ratsy nataony tamin’ny Israelita. Aorian’izay dia hangonina any amin’ny razambenao ianao.”', '“valio ny midianita noho ny ratsy nataony tamin’ny israelita. aorian’izay dia hangonina any amin’ny razambenao ianao.”'),
  ('6aadc73baf538092f7b6e6ee', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.310Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.310Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 31, 8, 'Novonoiny niaraka tamin’ireo ny mpanjaka dimy tany Midianina, dia i Evy, Rekema, Zora, Hora, ary Reba. Novonoiny tamin’ny sabatra koa i Balama zanak’i Beora.', 'novonoiny niaraka tamin’ireo ny mpanjaka dimy tany midianina, dia i evy, rekema, zora, hora, ary reba. novonoiny tamin’ny sabatra koa i balama zanak’i beora.'),
  ('6aadc73baf538092f7b6e6ea', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.310Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.310Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 31, 4, 'Tokony ho 1 000 lahy isaky ny fokon’ny Israely no halefanareo ao amin’ny tafika.”', 'tokony ho 1 000 lahy isaky ny fokon’ny israely no halefanareo ao amin’ny tafika.”'),
  ('6aadc73baf538092f7b6e6ec', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.310Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.310Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 31, 6, 'Dia nalefan’i Mosesy tany an’ady niaraka tamin’i Finehasa zanak’i Eleazara ireo 1 000 lahy isam-poko ireo. I Finehasa no mpisorona niaraka tamin’ilay tafika, sady nitondra ny fitaovana masina sy ny trompetra fanairana.', 'dia nalefan’i mosesy tany an’ady niaraka tamin’i finehasa zanak’i eleazara ireo 1 000 lahy isam-poko ireo. i finehasa no mpisorona niaraka tamin’ilay tafika, sady nitondra ny fitaovana masina sy ny trompetra fanairana.'),
  ('6aadc73baf538092f7b6e6eb', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.310Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.310Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 31, 5, 'Nisy 1 000 lahy isaky ny foko àry notendrena avy tamin’ireo fokon’ny Israely, ka 12 000 no vonona handeha hiady.', 'nisy 1 000 lahy isaky ny foko àry notendrena avy tamin’ireo fokon’ny israely, ka 12 000 no vonona handeha hiady.'),
  ('6aadc73baf538092f7b6e6e9', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.310Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.310Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 31, 3, 'Dia hoy i Mosesy tamin’ny vahoaka: “Asaivo miomana ny lehilahy sasany eo aminareo, mba handeha hiady amin’ny Midianina fa hamaly faty azy i Jehovah.', 'dia hoy i mosesy tamin’ny vahoaka: “asaivo miomana ny lehilahy sasany eo aminareo, mba handeha hiady amin’ny midianina fa hamaly faty azy i jehovah.'),
  ('6aadc73baf538092f7b6e6e7', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.310Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.310Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 31, 1, 'Ary hoy i Jehovah tamin’i Mosesy:', 'ary hoy i jehovah tamin’i mosesy:'),
  ('6aadc73baf538092f7b6e719', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.311Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.311Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 31, 51, 'Dia noraisin’i Mosesy sy Eleazara mpisorona ny volamena, dia ny firavaka rehetra nomen’izy ireo.', 'dia noraisin’i mosesy sy eleazara mpisorona ny volamena, dia ny firavaka rehetra nomen’izy ireo.'),
  ('6aadc73baf538092f7b6e715', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.311Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.311Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 31, 47, 'Tamin’io anjaran’ny Israelita io no nakan’i Mosesy iray isaky ny 50, na tamin’ny olona izany na tamin’ny biby, ka nomeny ny Levita, araka ny didy nomen’i Jehovah an’i Mosesy. Manana andraikitra ao amin’ny tranolain’i Jehovah mantsy ny Levita.', 'tamin’io anjaran’ny israelita io no nakan’i mosesy iray isaky ny 50, na tamin’ny olona izany na tamin’ny biby, ka nomeny ny levita, araka ny didy nomen’i jehovah an’i mosesy. manana andraikitra ao amin’ny tranolain’i jehovah mantsy ny levita.'),
  ('6aadc73baf538092f7b6e713', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.311Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.311Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 31, 45, 'ampondra 30 500,', 'ampondra 30 500,'),
