  ('6aadc73baf538092f7b6e709', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.311Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.311Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 31, 35, 'Ary 32 000 ny vehivavy mbola tsy nanao firaisana tamin’ny lehilahy.', 'ary 32 000 ny vehivavy mbola tsy nanao firaisana tamin’ny lehilahy.'),
  ('6aadc73baf538092f7b6e706', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.311Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.311Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 31, 32, 'Ary ny ambin’ny zavatra azo babo nentin’ny miaramila, dia ondry aman’osy 675 000,', 'ary ny ambin’ny zavatra azo babo nentin’ny miaramila, dia ondry aman’osy 675 000,'),
  ('6aadc73baf538092f7b6e6fe', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.311Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.311Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 31, 24, 'Ary sasao ny akanjonareo amin’ny andro fahafito, dia hadio ianareo ka mahazo miditra ao an-toby.’”', 'ary sasao ny akanjonareo amin’ny andro fahafito, dia hadio ianareo ka mahazo miditra ao an-toby.’”'),
  ('6aadc73baf538092f7b6e6f8', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.311Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.311Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 31, 18, 'Tsy voatery hovonoinareo kosa ny tovovavy rehetra mbola tsy nanao firaisana tamin’ny lehilahy.', 'tsy voatery hovonoinareo kosa ny tovovavy rehetra mbola tsy nanao firaisana tamin’ny lehilahy.'),
  ('6aadc73baf538092f7b6e6f3', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.311Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.311Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 31, 13, 'Dia nivoaka hitsena azy teny ivelan’ny toby i Mosesy sy Eleazara mpisorona ary ny mpiadidy rehetra teo amin’ny vahoaka.', 'dia nivoaka hitsena azy teny ivelan’ny toby i mosesy sy eleazara mpisorona ary ny mpiadidy rehetra teo amin’ny vahoaka.'),
  ('6aadc73baf538092f7b6e71b', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.311Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.311Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 31, 53, 'Samy naka tamin’ny zavatra norobaina mantsy ny miaramila.', 'samy naka tamin’ny zavatra norobaina mantsy ny miaramila.'),
  ('6aadc73baf538092f7b6e70f', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.311Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.311Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 31, 41, 'Dia nomen’i Mosesy an’i Eleazara mpisorona izany hetra izany ho fanomezana ho an’i Jehovah, araka ny didy nomen’i Jehovah an’i Mosesy.', 'dia nomen’i mosesy an’i eleazara mpisorona izany hetra izany ho fanomezana ho an’i jehovah, araka ny didy nomen’i jehovah an’i mosesy.'),
  ('6aadc73baf538092f7b6e70b', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.311Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.311Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 31, 37, 'Nisy 675 àry ny hetra ho an’i Jehovah nalaina tamin’ny ondry aman’osy.', 'nisy 675 àry ny hetra ho an’i jehovah nalaina tamin’ny ondry aman’osy.'),
  ('6aadc73baf538092f7b6e705', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.311Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.311Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 31, 31, 'Nataon’i Mosesy sy Eleazara mpisorona àry izay nandidian’i Jehovah an’i Mosesy.', 'nataon’i mosesy sy eleazara mpisorona àry izay nandidian’i jehovah an’i mosesy.'),
  ('6aadc73baf538092f7b6e700', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.311Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.311Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 31, 26, '“Ataovy lisitra ny zavatra rehetra azo babo, na olona na biby. Ianao sy Eleazara mpisorona ary ny lohan’ireo fianakaviambe eo amin’ny vahoaka no hanao an’izany.', '“ataovy lisitra ny zavatra rehetra azo babo, na olona na biby. ianao sy eleazara mpisorona ary ny lohan’ireo fianakaviambe eo amin’ny vahoaka no hanao an’izany.'),
  ('6aadc73baf538092f7b6e6fc', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.311Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.311Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 31, 22, '‘Ny volamena, ny volafotsy, ny varahina, ny vy, ny firapotsy, ary ny firamainty ihany,', '‘ny volamena, ny volafotsy, ny varahina, ny vy, ny firapotsy, ary ny firamainty ihany,'),
  ('6aadc73baf538092f7b6e6f1', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.311Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.311Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 31, 11, 'Dia nalainy daholo ny olona sy biby rehetra azony babo sy norobainy.', 'dia nalainy daholo ny olona sy biby rehetra azony babo sy norobainy.'),
  ('6aadc73baf538092f7b6e712', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.311Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.311Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 31, 44, 'omby 36 000,', 'omby 36 000,'),
  ('6aadc73baf538092f7b6e702', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.311Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.311Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 31, 28, 'Ary tokony hakanao iray isaky ny 500 ny anjaran’ny miaramila nandeha niady, ka hangalana daholo na ny olona na ny omby na ny ampondra na ny ondry aman’osy. Hatao hetra ho an’i Jehovah izany.', 'ary tokony hakanao iray isaky ny 500 ny anjaran’ny miaramila nandeha niady, ka hangalana daholo na ny olona na ny omby na ny ampondra na ny ondry aman’osy. hatao hetra ho an’i jehovah izany.'),
  ('6aadc73baf538092f7b6e6fd', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.311Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.311Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 31, 23, 'izany hoe izay rehetra mahatanty afo, no ataovy ao anaty afo mba hadio. Hodiovina amin’ny rano fanadiovana koa anefa ilay izy. Izay rehetra tsy mahatanty afo kosa dia diovy amin’ny rano.', 'izany hoe izay rehetra mahatanty afo, no ataovy ao anaty afo mba hadio. hodiovina amin’ny rano fanadiovana koa anefa ilay izy. izay rehetra tsy mahatanty afo kosa dia diovy amin’ny rano.'),
  ('6aadc73baf538092f7b6e70c', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.311Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.311Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 31, 38, 'Ary 36 000 ny omby, ka 72 ny hetra ho an’i Jehovah.', 'ary 36 000 ny omby, ka 72 ny hetra ho an’i jehovah.'),
  ('6aadc73baf538092f7b6e70a', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.311Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.311Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 31, 36, 'Ny anjaran’ireo nandeha niady dia ondry aman’osy 337 500.', 'ny anjaran’ireo nandeha niady dia ondry aman’osy 337 500.'),
  ('6aadc73baf538092f7b6e701', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.311Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.311Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 31, 27, 'Zarao izay rehetra azo babo, ka ny antsasany ho an’izay ao amin’ny tafika nandeha niady, ary ny antsasany ho an’ny vahoaka sisa rehetra.', 'zarao izay rehetra azo babo, ka ny antsasany ho an’izay ao amin’ny tafika nandeha niady, ary ny antsasany ho an’ny vahoaka sisa rehetra.'),
  ('6aadc73baf538092f7b6e716', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.311Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.311Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 31, 48, 'Avy eo dia nanatona an’i Mosesy ny lehilahy voatendry hifehy an’ireo antoko ao amin’ny tafika, izany hoe ny lehiben’ny arivo sy ny lehiben’ny zato,', 'avy eo dia nanatona an’i mosesy ny lehilahy voatendry hifehy an’ireo antoko ao amin’ny tafika, izany hoe ny lehiben’ny arivo sy ny lehiben’ny zato,'),
  ('6aadc73baf538092f7b6e711', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.311Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.311Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 31, 43, 'Ireto avy no tao amin’io antsasany io: Ondry aman’osy 337 500,', 'ireto avy no tao amin’io antsasany io: ondry aman’osy 337 500,'),
  ('6aadc73baf538092f7b6e6f9', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.311Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.311Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 31, 19, 'Ary mitobia fito andro atỳ ivelan’ny toby. Izay rehetra nahafaty olona aminareo sy nikasika faty, dia tokony hanadio ny vatany, amin’ny andro fahatelo sy amin’ny andro fahafito. Tokony hanadio ny tenany koa ny olona nentinareo ho babo.', 'ary mitobia fito andro atỳ ivelan’ny toby. izay rehetra nahafaty olona aminareo sy nikasika faty, dia tokony hanadio ny vatany, amin’ny andro fahatelo sy amin’ny andro fahafito. tokony hanadio ny tenany koa ny olona nentinareo ho babo.'),
  ('6aadc73baf538092f7b6e710', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.311Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.311Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 31, 42, 'Ny antsasany, izay anjaran’ny Israelita, kosa dia navahan’i Mosesy tamin’ny anjaran’ireo lehilahy nandeha niady.', 'ny antsasany, izay anjaran’ny israelita, kosa dia navahan’i mosesy tamin’ny anjaran’ireo lehilahy nandeha niady.'),
  ('6aadc73baf538092f7b6e6fa', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.311Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.311Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 31, 20, 'Diovy koa ny akanjo rehetra, sy ny zavatra rehetra vita amin’ny hoditra, na vita amin’ny volon’osy, na vita amin’ny hazo.”', 'diovy koa ny akanjo rehetra, sy ny zavatra rehetra vita amin’ny hoditra, na vita amin’ny volon’osy, na vita amin’ny hazo.”'),
  ('6aadc73baf538092f7b6e6ef', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.311Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.311Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 31, 9, 'Fa nentin’ny Israelita ho babo kosa ny zaza amam-behivavy tany Midianina. Norobain’izy ireo daholo koa ny biby fiompiny sy ny biby hafa ary ny fananany rehetra.', 'fa nentin’ny israelita ho babo kosa ny zaza amam-behivavy tany midianina. norobain’izy ireo daholo koa ny biby fiompiny sy ny biby hafa ary ny fananany rehetra.'),
  ('6aadc73baf538092f7b6e714', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.311Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.311Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 31, 46, 'ary olona 16 000.', 'ary olona 16 000.'),
  ('6aadc73baf538092f7b6e6f0', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.311Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.311Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 31, 10, 'Ary nodorany ny tanàna rehetra nipetrahan’izy ireo sy ny tobiny rehetra.', 'ary nodorany ny tanàna rehetra nipetrahan’izy ireo sy ny tobiny rehetra.'),
  ('6aadc73baf538092f7b6e718', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.311Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.311Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 31, 50, 'Aleo àry izahay samy hanolotra ny zavatra hitanay ho fanatitra ho an’i Jehovah, dia zavatra vita amin’ny volamena, rojon-tongotra, brasele, peratra fanombohan-kase, kavina, ary firavaka hafa, mba handrakofana ny fahotanay eo anatrehan’i Jehovah.”', 'aleo àry izahay samy hanolotra ny zavatra hitanay ho fanatitra ho an’i jehovah, dia zavatra vita amin’ny volamena, rojon-tongotra, brasele, peratra fanombohan-kase, kavina, ary firavaka hafa, mba handrakofana ny fahotanay eo anatrehan’i jehovah.”'),
  ('6aadc73baf538092f7b6e6f5', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.311Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.311Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 31, 15, 'Hoy izy tamin’ireo: “Ary toa tsy nisy novonoinareo ny vehivavy?', 'hoy izy tamin’ireo: “ary toa tsy nisy novonoinareo ny vehivavy?'),
  ('6aadc73baf538092f7b6e704', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.311Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.311Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 31, 30, 'Tokony hakanao iray isaky ny 50 kosa ilay anjaran’ny Israelita, ka hakanao daholo na ny olona na ny omby na ny ampondra na ny ondry aman’osy na ny karazana biby fiompy rehetra. Dia omeo ny Levita izany, satria manana andraikitra mifandray amin’ny tranolain’i Jehovah izy ireo.”', 'tokony hakanao iray isaky ny 50 kosa ilay anjaran’ny israelita, ka hakanao daholo na ny olona na ny omby na ny ampondra na ny ondry aman’osy na ny karazana biby fiompy rehetra. dia omeo ny levita izany, satria manana andraikitra mifandray amin’ny tranolain’i jehovah izy ireo.”'),
  ('6aadc73baf538092f7b6e6fb', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.311Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.311Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 31, 21, 'Dia hoy i Eleazara mpisorona tamin’ny miaramila nandeha niady: “Izao no lalàna nandidian’i Jehovah an’i Mosesy:', 'dia hoy i eleazara mpisorona tamin’ny miaramila nandeha niady: “izao no lalàna nandidian’i jehovah an’i mosesy:'),
  ('6aadc73baf538092f7b6e6f4', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.311Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.311Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 31, 14, 'Tezitra tamin’ireo lehilahy voatendry hifehy ny tafika anefa i Mosesy, dia tamin’ny lehiben’ny arivo sy ny lehiben’ny zato avy tany an’ady.', 'tezitra tamin’ireo lehilahy voatendry hifehy ny tafika anefa i mosesy, dia tamin’ny lehiben’ny arivo sy ny lehiben’ny zato avy tany an’ady.'),
  ('6aadc73baf538092f7b6e71c', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.311Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.311Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 31, 54, 'Noraisin’i Mosesy sy Eleazara mpisorona ny volamena nomen’ireo lehiben’ny arivo sy lehiben’ny zato, ka nentiny tao amin’ny tranolay fihaonana, mba ho fampahatsiahivana an’izay nataon’i Jehovah ho an’ny vahoakan’Israely.', 'noraisin’i mosesy sy eleazara mpisorona ny volamena nomen’ireo lehiben’ny arivo sy lehiben’ny zato, ka nentiny tao amin’ny tranolay fihaonana, mba ho fampahatsiahivana an’izay nataon’i jehovah ho an’ny vahoakan’israely.'),
  ('6aadc73baf538092f7b6e703', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.311Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.311Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 31, 29, 'Tokony halainao amin’ilay anjaran’izy ireo izany, ka homenao an’i Eleazara mpisorona mba hatao fanomezana ho an’i Jehovah.', 'tokony halainao amin’ilay anjaran’izy ireo izany, ka homenao an’i eleazara mpisorona mba hatao fanomezana ho an’i jehovah.'),
  ('6aadc73baf538092f7b6e6f6', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.311Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.311Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 31, 16, 'Ireo ihany anefa no nitaona ny Israelita hivadika tamin’i Jehovah mba hanompo an’i Balan’i Peora, rehefa nampirisihin’i Balama, ka namely ny vahoakan’i Jehovah ny loza.', 'ireo ihany anefa no nitaona ny israelita hivadika tamin’i jehovah mba hanompo an’i balan’i peora, rehefa nampirisihin’i balama, ka namely ny vahoakan’i jehovah ny loza.'),
  ('6aadc73baf538092f7b6e717', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.311Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.311Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 31, 49, 'ka niteny hoe: “Efa nisain’ny mpanomponao ny lehilahy mpiady eo ambany fahefanay, ka nolazaina taminay hoe tsy misy tsy ao na iray aza.', 'ka niteny hoe: “efa nisain’ny mpanomponao ny lehilahy mpiady eo ambany fahefanay, ka nolazaina taminay hoe tsy misy tsy ao na iray aza.'),
  ('6aadc73baf538092f7b6e707', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.311Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.311Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 31, 33, 'sy omby 72 000,', 'sy omby 72 000,'),
  ('6aadc73baf538092f7b6e6f7', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.311Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.311Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 31, 17, 'Vonoy daholo ny ankizilahikely rehetra sy ny vehivavy rehetra efa nanao firaisana tamin’ny lehilahy.', 'vonoy daholo ny ankizilahikely rehetra sy ny vehivavy rehetra efa nanao firaisana tamin’ny lehilahy.'),
  ('6aadc73baf538092f7b6e6f2', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.311Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.311Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 31, 12, 'Avy eo dia nentiny tao an-toby ny olona babo sy ny zavatra norobainy, izany hoe tany amin’i Mosesy sy Eleazara mpisorona ary ny vahoakan’Israely, tany amin’ny lemaka karakaina any Moaba, any akaikin’ny Reniranon’i Jordana sady tandrifin’i Jeriko.', 'avy eo dia nentiny tao an-toby ny olona babo sy ny zavatra norobainy, izany hoe tany amin’i mosesy sy eleazara mpisorona ary ny vahoakan’israely, tany amin’ny lemaka karakaina any moaba, any akaikin’ny reniranon’i jordana sady tandrifin’i jeriko.'),
  ('6aadc73baf538092f7b6e71a', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.311Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.311Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 31, 52, 'Koa nahatratra 16 750 sekely ny volamena rehetra natao fanomezana ho an’i Jehovah, avy tamin’ireo lehiben’ny arivo sy lehiben’ny zato.', 'koa nahatratra 16 750 sekely ny volamena rehetra natao fanomezana ho an’i jehovah, avy tamin’ireo lehiben’ny arivo sy lehiben’ny zato.'),
  ('6aadc73baf538092f7b6e70d', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.311Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.311Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 31, 39, 'Ny ampondra indray nisy 30 500, ka 61 ny hetra ho an’i Jehovah.', 'ny ampondra indray nisy 30 500, ka 61 ny hetra ho an’i jehovah.'),
  ('6aadc73baf538092f7b6e708', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.311Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.311Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 31, 34, 'ary ampondra 61 000.', 'ary ampondra 61 000.'),
  ('6aadc73baf538092f7b6e6ff', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.311Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.311Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 31, 25, 'Hoy koa i Jehovah tamin’i Mosesy:', 'hoy koa i jehovah tamin’i mosesy:'),
  ('6aadc73b1dec4a18283b28e9', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.748Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.748Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 32, 18, 'Tsy hody any an-tranonay izahay raha tsy efa mahazo anjara tany ho lovany ny Israelita tsirairay.', 'tsy hody any an-tranonay izahay raha tsy efa mahazo anjara tany ho lovany ny israelita tsirairay.'),
  ('6aadc73b1dec4a18283b28e0', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.748Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.748Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 32, 9, 'Rehefa niakatra nankany amin’ny Lohasahan’i Eskola izy ka nahita an’ilay tany, dia nataony izay hahakivy ny vahoakan’Israely mba tsy hiditra any amin’ilay tany homen’i Jehovah azy.', 'rehefa niakatra nankany amin’ny lohasahan’i eskola izy ka nahita an’ilay tany, dia nataony izay hahakivy ny vahoakan’israely mba tsy hiditra any amin’ilay tany homen’i jehovah azy.'),
  ('6aadc73b1dec4a18283b28d9', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.748Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.748Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 32, 2, 'Koa nanatona an’i Mosesy sy Eleazara mpisorona ary ny mpiadidy vahoaka ny taranak’i Gada sy ny taranak’i Robena, ka niteny hoe:', 'koa nanatona an’i mosesy sy eleazara mpisorona ary ny mpiadidy vahoaka ny taranak’i gada sy ny taranak’i robena, ka niteny hoe:'),
  ('6aadc73b1dec4a18283b28e4', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.748Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.748Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 32, 13, 'Koa tezitra be tamin’ny Israely i Jehovah ka nataony nirenireny tany an-tany efitra nandritra ny 40 taona ry zareo, mandra-paharipaka tanteraka an’ilay taranaka nanao izay ratsy teo imason’i Jehovah.', 'koa tezitra be tamin’ny israely i jehovah ka nataony nirenireny tany an-tany efitra nandritra ny 40 taona ry zareo, mandra-paharipaka tanteraka an’ilay taranaka nanao izay ratsy teo imason’i jehovah.'),
  ('6aadc73b1dec4a18283b28d8', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.748Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.748Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 32, 1, 'Ary nanana biby fiompy faran’izay betsaka ny taranak’i Robena sy ny taranak’i Gada. Dia hitan’izy ireo fa tsara ho an’ny biby fiompy ny tany tao Jazera sy ny tao Gileada.', 'ary nanana biby fiompy faran’izay betsaka ny taranak’i robena sy ny taranak’i gada. dia hitan’izy ireo fa tsara ho an’ny biby fiompy ny tany tao jazera sy ny tao gileada.'),
  ('6aadc73b1dec4a18283b28ee', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.748Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.748Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 32, 23, 'Fa raha tsy manao an’izany kosa ianareo, dia manota amin’i Jehovah. Raha manota anefa ianareo, dia fantaro fa hizaka ny vokatr’izany ianareo.', 'fa raha tsy manao an’izany kosa ianareo, dia manota amin’i jehovah. raha manota anefa ianareo, dia fantaro fa hizaka ny vokatr’izany ianareo.'),
  ('6aadc73b1dec4a18283b28de', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.748Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.748Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 32, 7, 'Maninona ianareo no manakivy ny vahoakan’Israely tsy hiampita hankany amin’ilay tany homen’i Jehovah azy?', 'maninona ianareo no manakivy ny vahoakan’israely tsy hiampita hankany amin’ilay tany homen’i jehovah azy?'),
  ('6aadc73b1dec4a18283b28da', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.748Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.748Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 32, 3, '“Tany tsara i Atarota, Dibona, Jazera, Nimra, Hesbona, Elale, Sebama, Nebo, ary Beona,', '“tany tsara i atarota, dibona, jazera, nimra, hesbona, elale, sebama, nebo, ary beona,'),
  ('6aadc73b1dec4a18283b28ea', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.748Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.748Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 32, 19, 'Fa tsy hahazo lova miaraka amin’izy ireo erỳ ampitan’i Jordana sy any ambadika rehetra any izahay, satria efa nahazo lova etỳ atsinanan’i Jordana.”', 'fa tsy hahazo lova miaraka amin’izy ireo erỳ ampitan’i jordana sy any ambadika rehetra any izahay, satria efa nahazo lova etỳ atsinanan’i jordana.”'),
  ('6aadc73b1dec4a18283b28f0', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.748Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.748Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 32, 25, 'Dia hoy ny taranak’i Gada sy ny taranak’i Robena tamin’i Mosesy: “Izay andidian’ny tompoko mihitsy no hataon’ny mpanomponao.', 'dia hoy ny taranak’i gada sy ny taranak’i robena tamin’i mosesy: “izay andidian’ny tompoko mihitsy no hataon’ny mpanomponao.'),
  ('6aadc73b1dec4a18283b28e2', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.748Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.748Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 32, 11, '‘Tsy hahita an’ilay tany nianianako tamin’i Abrahama sy Isaka ary Jakoba ny lehilahy 20 taona no ho miakatra, izay nivoaka avy tany Ejipta, satria tsy mba nanaraka ahy tamin’ny fony manontolo izy ireo.', '‘tsy hahita an’ilay tany nianianako tamin’i abrahama sy isaka ary jakoba ny lehilahy 20 taona no ho miakatra, izay nivoaka avy tany ejipta, satria tsy mba nanaraka ahy tamin’ny fony manontolo izy ireo.'),
  ('6aadc73b1dec4a18283b28e8', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.748Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.748Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 32, 17, 'Hiomana hiady foana anefa izahay, sady handeha eo alohan’ny Israelita, mandra-pitondranay azy any amin’ny taniny. Ny zanakay kosa hipetraka ao amin’ny tanàna misy manda, dia ho voaro amin’ny mponina eto amin’ity tany ity.', 'hiomana hiady foana anefa izahay, sady handeha eo alohan’ny israelita, mandra-pitondranay azy any amin’ny taniny. ny zanakay kosa hipetraka ao amin’ny tanàna misy manda, dia ho voaro amin’ny mponina eto amin’ity tany ity.'),
  ('6aadc73b1dec4a18283b28e3', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.748Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.748Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 32, 12, 'I Kaleba zanak’i Jefone Kenizita sy Josoa zanak’i Nona ihany no hahita an’ilay tany, satria nanaraka an’i Jehovah tamin’ny fony manontolo izy roa lahy.’', 'i kaleba zanak’i jefone kenizita sy josoa zanak’i nona ihany no hahita an’ilay tany, satria nanaraka an’i jehovah tamin’ny fony manontolo izy roa lahy.’'),
  ('6aadc73b1dec4a18283b28f1', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.748Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.748Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 32, 26, 'Hijanona atỳ amin’ny tanànan’i Gileada ny zanakay sy ny vadinay ary ny biby fiompinay rehetra.', 'hijanona atỳ amin’ny tanànan’i gileada ny zanakay sy ny vadinay ary ny biby fiompinay rehetra.'),
  ('6aadc73b1dec4a18283b28ed', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.748Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.748Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 32, 22, 'mandra-paharesy an’ilay tany eo anatrehan’i Jehovah, dia mahazo miverina ianareo. Tsy ho meloka eo imason’i Jehovah sy ny Israely ianareo amin’izay, dia ho lasanareo eo anatrehan’i Jehovah ity tany ity.', 'mandra-paharesy an’ilay tany eo anatrehan’i jehovah, dia mahazo miverina ianareo. tsy ho meloka eo imason’i jehovah sy ny israely ianareo amin’izay, dia ho lasanareo eo anatrehan’i jehovah ity tany ity.'),
  ('6aadc73b1dec4a18283b28eb', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.748Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.748Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 32, 20, 'Ary hoy i Mosesy tamin’izy ireo: “Izao àry: Raha mandray ny fiadianareo ianareo mba hoentinareo miady eo anatrehan’i Jehovah,', 'ary hoy i mosesy tamin’izy ireo: “izao àry: raha mandray ny fiadianareo ianareo mba hoentinareo miady eo anatrehan’i jehovah,'),
  ('6aadc73b1dec4a18283b28e5', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.748Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.748Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 32, 14, 'Manao hoatran’ny razambenareo ihany ianareo izao, ry taranaka ratsy fanahy, ka vao mainka tezitra be amin’ny Israely i Jehovah.', 'manao hoatran’ny razambenareo ihany ianareo izao, ry taranaka ratsy fanahy, ka vao mainka tezitra be amin’ny israely i jehovah.'),
  ('6aadc73b1dec4a18283b28e1', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.748Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.748Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 32, 10, 'Tezitra be i Jehovah tamin’izay andro izay, ka nianiana hoe:', 'tezitra be i jehovah tamin’izay andro izay, ka nianiana hoe:'),
  ('6aadc73b1dec4a18283b28ef', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.748Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.748Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 32, 24, 'Mahazo manorina tanàna ho an’ny zanakareo àry ianareo, sady mahazo manao vala ho an’ny ondry aman’osinareo koa. Tsy maintsy mitana ny teninareo anefa ianareo.”', 'mahazo manorina tanàna ho an’ny zanakareo àry ianareo, sady mahazo manao vala ho an’ny ondry aman’osinareo koa. tsy maintsy mitana ny teninareo anefa ianareo.”'),
  ('6aadc73b1dec4a18283b28dd', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.748Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.748Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 32, 6, 'Dia hoy i Mosesy tamin’ny taranak’i Gada sy ny taranak’i Robena: “Ny rahalahinareo ve handeha hiady nefa ianareo hijanona fotsiny atỳ?', 'dia hoy i mosesy tamin’ny taranak’i gada sy ny taranak’i robena: “ny rahalahinareo ve handeha hiady nefa ianareo hijanona fotsiny atỳ?'),
  ('6aadc73b1dec4a18283b28df', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.748Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.748Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 32, 8, 'Izany no nataon’ny razambenareo tamin-dry zareo nirahiko avy tany Kadesi-barnea mba hijery an’ilay tany.', 'izany no nataon’ny razambenareo tamin-dry zareo nirahiko avy tany kadesi-barnea mba hijery an’ilay tany.'),
  ('6aadc73b1dec4a18283b28dc', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.748Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.748Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 32, 5, 'Hoy koa izy ireo: “Aleo omena anay mpanomponao ity tany ity, raha mba mety aminao, fa aza asaina miampita an’i Jordana izahay.”', 'hoy koa izy ireo: “aleo omena anay mpanomponao ity tany ity, raha mba mety aminao, fa aza asaina miampita an’i jordana izahay.”'),
  ('6aadc73b1dec4a18283b28db', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.748Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.748Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 32, 4, 'izay nataon’i Jehovah resin’ny vahoakan’Israely. Tena tsara ho an’ny biby fiompy ilay tany. Izahay mpanomponao koa manana biby fiompy be dia be.”', 'izay nataon’i jehovah resin’ny vahoakan’israely. tena tsara ho an’ny biby fiompy ilay tany. izahay mpanomponao koa manana biby fiompy be dia be.”'),
  ('6aadc73b1dec4a18283b28ec', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.748Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.748Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 32, 21, 'ary raha samy mandray ny fiadianareo ianareo ka miampita an’i Jordana eo anatrehan’i Jehovah, rehefa mandroaka ny fahavalony hiala eo anatrehany izy,', 'ary raha samy mandray ny fiadianareo ianareo ka miampita an’i jordana eo anatrehan’i jehovah, rehefa mandroaka ny fahavalony hiala eo anatrehany izy,'),
  ('6aadc73b1dec4a18283b28e7', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.748Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.748Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 32, 16, 'Nanatona an’i Mosesy izy ireo taorian’izay, ka niteny hoe: “Aleo izahay mba hanorina vala eto ho an’ny biby fiompinay, sy tanàna ho an’ny zanakay.', 'nanatona an’i mosesy izy ireo taorian’izay, ka niteny hoe: “aleo izahay mba hanorina vala eto ho an’ny biby fiompinay, sy tanàna ho an’ny zanakay.'),
  ('6aadc73b1dec4a18283b28e6', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.748Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.748Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 32, 15, 'Raha mivadika aminy ianareo, dia tsy maintsy hafoiny atỳ an-tany efitra indray ity vahoaka manontolo ity. Dia ny ataonareo ihany no hampidi-kizo an-dry zareo.”', 'raha mivadika aminy ianareo, dia tsy maintsy hafoiny atỳ an-tany efitra indray ity vahoaka manontolo ity. dia ny ataonareo ihany no hampidi-kizo an-dry zareo.”'),
  ('6aadc73b1dec4a18283b28f4', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.749Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.749Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 32, 29, 'ka hoy izy tamin’izy ireo: “Raha miampita an’i Jordana miaraka aminareo eo anatrehan’i Jehovah ny taranak’i Gada sy ny taranak’i Robena, izany hoe izay lehilahy mitondra fitaovam-piadiana sy efa vonona hiady, ka resinareo ilay tany, dia omeo an-dry zareo i Gileada.', 'ka hoy izy tamin’izy ireo: “raha miampita an’i jordana miaraka aminareo eo anatrehan’i jehovah ny taranak’i gada sy ny taranak’i robena, izany hoe izay lehilahy mitondra fitaovam-piadiana sy efa vonona hiady, ka resinareo ilay tany, dia omeo an-dry zareo i gileada.'),
  ('6aadc73b1dec4a18283b28fb', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.749Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.749Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 32, 36, 'Beti-nimra, ary Beti-harana. Tanàna misy manda daholo ireo. Nanorina vala vita amin’ny vato ho an’ny ondry aman’osy koa izy ireo.', 'beti-nimra, ary beti-harana. tanàna misy manda daholo ireo. nanorina vala vita amin’ny vato ho an’ny ondry aman’osy koa izy ireo.'),
  ('6aadc73b1dec4a18283b28f7', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.749Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.749Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 32, 32, 'Hitondra fitaovam-piadiana izahay, dia handeha hiampita ho any Kanana eo anatrehan’i Jehovah. Ny etỳ aminay etỳ ampitan’i Jordana anefa no ho lovanay.”', 'hitondra fitaovam-piadiana izahay, dia handeha hiampita ho any kanana eo anatrehan’i jehovah. ny etỳ aminay etỳ ampitan’i jordana anefa no ho lovanay.”'),
  ('6aadc73b1dec4a18283b28fd', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.749Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.749Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 32, 38, 'Nebo sy Bala-meona izay samy novana anarana, ary Sibma. Naorin’izy ireo indray ireo tanàna ireo ka nomeny anarana vaovao.', 'nebo sy bala-meona izay samy novana anarana, ary sibma. naorin’izy ireo indray ireo tanàna ireo ka nomeny anarana vaovao.'),
  ('6aadc73b1dec4a18283b28fc', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.749Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.749Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 32, 37, 'Ny taranak’i Robena kosa nanorina an’i Hesbona, Elale, Kiriataima,', 'ny taranak’i robena kosa nanorina an’i hesbona, elale, kiriataima,'),
  ('6aadc73b1dec4a18283b28f5', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.749Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.749Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 32, 30, 'Fa raha tsy mitondra fitaovam-piadiana kosa ry zareo ary tsy miampita miaraka aminareo, dia hipetraka ao Kanana miaraka aminareo ihany.”', 'fa raha tsy mitondra fitaovam-piadiana kosa ry zareo ary tsy miampita miaraka aminareo, dia hipetraka ao kanana miaraka aminareo ihany.”'),
  ('6aadc73b1dec4a18283b2901', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.749Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.749Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 32, 42, 'Ary nandeha nanafika an’i Kenata sy ny tanàna niankina taminy i Noba. Dia nantsoiny hoe Noba araka ny anarany ihany ilay izy.', 'ary nandeha nanafika an’i kenata sy ny tanàna niankina taminy i noba. dia nantsoiny hoe noba araka ny anarany ihany ilay izy.'),
  ('6aadc73b1dec4a18283b2900', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.749Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.749Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 32, 41, 'I Jaira zanak’i Manase indray nandeha nanafika ka azony ny tanàna tranolay tao Gileada. Dia nantsoiny hoe Havota-jaira ireny.', 'i jaira zanak’i manase indray nandeha nanafika ka azony ny tanàna tranolay tao gileada. dia nantsoiny hoe havota-jaira ireny.'),
  ('6aadc73b1dec4a18283b28f3', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.749Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.749Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 32, 28, 'Dia nomen’i Mosesy baiko i Eleazara mpisorona sy Josoa zanak’i Nona ary ny lohan’ny fianakaviamben’ny fokon’ny Israely,', 'dia nomen’i mosesy baiko i eleazara mpisorona sy josoa zanak’i nona ary ny lohan’ny fianakaviamben’ny fokon’ny israely,'),
  ('6aadc73b1dec4a18283b28ff', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.749Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.749Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 32, 40, 'Koa nomen’i Mosesy an’i Makira zanak’i Manase i Gileada, ary lasa nipetraka tao izy.', 'koa nomen’i mosesy an’i makira zanak’i manase i gileada, ary lasa nipetraka tao izy.'),
  ('6aadc73b1dec4a18283b28f6', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.749Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.749Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 32, 31, 'Dia hoy ny taranak’i Gada sy ny taranak’i Robena: “Izay nolazain’i Jehovah taminay mpanomponao no hataonay.', 'dia hoy ny taranak’i gada sy ny taranak’i robena: “izay nolazain’i jehovah taminay mpanomponao no hataonay.'),
  ('6aadc73b1dec4a18283b28f9', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.749Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.749Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 32, 34, 'Dia naorin’ny taranak’i Gada i Dibona, Atarota, Aroera,', 'dia naorin’ny taranak’i gada i dibona, atarota, aroera,'),
  ('6aadc73b1dec4a18283b28fa', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.749Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.749Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 32, 35, 'Atrota-sofana, Jazera, Jogbeha,', 'atrota-sofana, jazera, jogbeha,'),
  ('6aadc73b1dec4a18283b28f8', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.749Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.749Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 32, 33, 'Ireto àry no nomen’i Mosesy ho an’ny taranak’i Gada sy ny taranak’i Robena ary ny antsasaky ny fokon’i Manase zanak’i Josefa: Ny fanjakan’i Sihona mpanjakan’ny Amorita sy ny fanjakan’i Oga mpanjakan’i Basana, izany hoe ny tany ao amin’ireo tanàna ao anatin’ireo faritra ireo, ary ny tanàna any amin’ny faritra manodidina.', 'ireto àry no nomen’i mosesy ho an’ny taranak’i gada sy ny taranak’i robena ary ny antsasaky ny fokon’i manase zanak’i josefa: ny fanjakan’i sihona mpanjakan’ny amorita sy ny fanjakan’i oga mpanjakan’i basana, izany hoe ny tany ao amin’ireo tanàna ao anatin’ireo faritra ireo, ary ny tanàna any amin’ny faritra manodidina.'),
  ('6aadc73b1dec4a18283b28fe', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.749Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.749Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 32, 39, 'Ary nandeha nanafika an’i Gileada ny taranak’i Makira zanak’i Manase, dia azony ilay tany ka noroahiny ny Amorita nipetraka tao.', 'ary nandeha nanafika an’i gileada ny taranak’i makira zanak’i manase, dia azony ilay tany ka noroahiny ny amorita nipetraka tao.'),
  ('6aadc73b1dec4a18283b28f2', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.749Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:27.749Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 32, 27, 'Fa araka izay lazain’ny tompoko, dia izahay mpanomponao rehetra no handeha hiampita, izany hoe izay lehilahy mitondra fitaovam-piadiana ka efa vonona hiady eo anatrehan’i Jehovah.”', 'fa araka izay lazain’ny tompoko, dia izahay mpanomponao rehetra no handeha hiampita, izany hoe izay lehilahy mitondra fitaovam-piadiana ka efa vonona hiady eo anatrehan’i jehovah.”'),
  ('6aadc73ca81a43d4c77c5ade', '2026-09-18T23:20:28.210Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:28.210Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 33, 49, 'Mbola nitoby teo akaikin’ny Reniranon’i Jordana izy ireo, nanomboka tany Beti-jesimota ka hatrany Abela-sitima, teny amin’ny lemaka karakaina any Moaba.', 'mbola nitoby teo akaikin’ny reniranon’i jordana izy ireo, nanomboka tany beti-jesimota ka hatrany abela-sitima, teny amin’ny lemaka karakaina any moaba.'),
  ('6aadc73ca81a43d4c77c5ada', '2026-09-18T23:20:28.210Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:28.210Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 33, 45, 'niainga avy tao Ima, dia nitoby tao Dibona-gada;', 'niainga avy tao ima, dia nitoby tao dibona-gada;'),
  ('6aadc73ca81a43d4c77c5ae4', '2026-09-18T23:20:28.210Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:28.210Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 33, 55, '“‘Fa raha tsy roahinareo hiala eo anatrehanareo ny mponina ao amin’ilay tany, dia ho toy ny zavatra malailay amin’ny masonareo ny olona avelanareo hijanona ao, sady ho toy ny tsilo eo amin’ny andilanareo. Hampijaly anareo ry zareo, eo amin’ilay tany hipetrahanareo.', '“‘fa raha tsy roahinareo hiala eo anatrehanareo ny mponina ao amin’ilay tany, dia ho toy ny zavatra malailay amin’ny masonareo ny olona avelanareo hijanona ao, sady ho toy ny tsilo eo amin’ny andilanareo. hampijaly anareo ry zareo, eo amin’ilay tany hipetrahanareo.'),
  ('6aadc73ca81a43d4c77c5ae3', '2026-09-18T23:20:28.210Z', '2026-09-18T23:20:28.210Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Nomery', 4, 33, 54, 'Dia zarao isaky ny foko sy fianakaviana ilay tany, ka ataovy antsapaka. Tokony hataonareo ngeza kokoa ny an’izay foko lehibe kokoa, fa hatao kely kokoa ny an’izay foko kely kokoa. Izay tany azon’ny foko tsirairay amin’ny antsapaka no ho lasa lovany. Ary araka ny fokon’ny razambenareo no hahazoanareo tany ho anjara lovanareo.', 'dia zarao isaky ny foko sy fianakaviana ilay tany, ka ataovy antsapaka. tokony hataonareo ngeza kokoa ny an’izay foko lehibe kokoa, fa hatao kely kokoa ny an’izay foko kely kokoa. izay tany azon’ny foko tsirairay amin’ny antsapaka no ho lasa lovany. ary araka ny fokon’ny razambenareo no hahazoanareo tany ho anjara lovanareo.'),
