  ('6aadc75fd7c26042a3b09eae', '2026-09-18T23:21:03.420Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:03.420Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Josoa', 6, 19, 26, 'Alameleka, Amada, ary Misala. Ary niankandrefana nankany Karmela sy Sihora-libnata izany,', 'alameleka, amada, ary misala. ary niankandrefana nankany karmela sy sihora-libnata izany,'),
  ('6aadc75fd7c26042a3b09eaa', '2026-09-18T23:21:03.420Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:03.420Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Josoa', 6, 19, 22, 'Ary nitohy hatrany Tabara sy Sahazoma ary Beti-semesy izany, ka nifarana teo amin’ny Reniranon’i Jordana, izany hoe tanàna 16 sy ny tanàna keliny.', 'ary nitohy hatrany tabara sy sahazoma ary beti-semesy izany, ka nifarana teo amin’ny reniranon’i jordana, izany hoe tanàna 16 sy ny tanàna keliny.'),
  ('6aadc75fd7c26042a3b09ec5', '2026-09-18T23:21:03.420Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:03.420Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Josoa', 6, 19, 49, 'Vitan’ny Israelita àry ny nizarazara an’ilay tany araka ny sisin-taniny avy, mba ho lovan’izy ireo. Dia nomen’izy ireo lova tao amin’ny taniny i Josoa zanak’i Nona.', 'vitan’ny israelita àry ny nizarazara an’ilay tany araka ny sisin-taniny avy, mba ho lovan’izy ireo. dia nomen’izy ireo lova tao amin’ny taniny i josoa zanak’i nona.'),
  ('6aadc75fd7c26042a3b09ebc', '2026-09-18T23:21:03.420Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:03.420Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Josoa', 6, 19, 40, 'Ary natao ny antsapaka fahafito ka nahazo anjara ny fokon’i Dana, araka ny fianakaviany avy.', 'ary natao ny antsapaka fahafito ka nahazo anjara ny fokon’i dana, araka ny fianakaviany avy.'),
  ('6aadc75fd7c26042a3b09eb9', '2026-09-18T23:21:03.420Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:03.420Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Josoa', 6, 19, 37, 'Kedesy, Edrehy, En-hazora,', 'kedesy, edrehy, en-hazora,'),
  ('6aadc75fd7c26042a3b09ec3', '2026-09-18T23:21:03.420Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:03.420Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Josoa', 6, 19, 47, 'Kely loatra ho an’i Dana anefa ny faritry ny taniny. Niakatra hiady tamin’i Lesema àry izy ireo. Dia azony izy io ary nasiany tamin’ny sabatra ny mponina tao. Ary naka an’ilay tanàna ho fananany izy ireo ka nipetraka tao. Dia novan’izy ireo hoe Dana, hoatran’ny anaran’i Dana razambeny, ny anaran’i Lesema.', 'kely loatra ho an’i dana anefa ny faritry ny taniny. niakatra hiady tamin’i lesema àry izy ireo. dia azony izy io ary nasiany tamin’ny sabatra ny mponina tao. ary naka an’ilay tanàna ho fananany izy ireo ka nipetraka tao. dia novan’izy ireo hoe dana, hoatran’ny anaran’i dana razambeny, ny anaran’i lesema.'),
  ('6aadc75fd7c26042a3b09eb6', '2026-09-18T23:21:03.420Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:03.420Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Josoa', 6, 19, 34, 'Ary niverina niankandrefana nankany Aznota-tabara ilay sisin-tany, dia tonga hatrany Hokoka ka hatrany Zebolona eo atsimo, sy Asera eo andrefana, ary Joda eo atsinanan’i Jordana.', 'ary niverina niankandrefana nankany aznota-tabara ilay sisin-tany, dia tonga hatrany hokoka ka hatrany zebolona eo atsimo, sy asera eo andrefana, ary joda eo atsinanan’i jordana.'),
  ('6aadc7600de5b4ce3d633acc', '2026-09-18T23:21:04.325Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:04.325Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Josoa', 6, 21, 11, 'Nomena azy ireo i Kiriata-arba, izany hoe Hebrona, any amin’ny faritra be tendrombohitr’i Joda, sy ny kijana manodidina azy.—Rain’i Anàka io Arba io.—', 'nomena azy ireo i kiriata-arba, izany hoe hebrona, any amin’ny faritra be tendrombohitr’i joda, sy ny kijana manodidina azy.—rain’i anàka io arba io.—'),
  ('6aadc7600de5b4ce3d633ac8', '2026-09-18T23:21:04.325Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:04.325Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Josoa', 6, 21, 7, 'Ny azon’ny Merarita kosa, araka ny fianakaviany avy, dia tanàna 12 avy tamin’ny fokon’i Robena sy ny fokon’i Gada ary ny fokon’i Zebolona.', 'ny azon’ny merarita kosa, araka ny fianakaviany avy, dia tanàna 12 avy tamin’ny fokon’i robena sy ny fokon’i gada ary ny fokon’i zebolona.'),
  ('6aadc7600de5b4ce3d633acd', '2026-09-18T23:21:04.325Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:04.325Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Josoa', 6, 21, 12, 'Nomena an’i Kaleba zanak’ i Jefone kosa ny faritra sy ny tanàna kely manodidina an’ilay tanàna.', 'nomena an’i kaleba zanak’ i jefone kosa ny faritra sy ny tanàna kely manodidina an’ilay tanàna.'),
  ('6aadc7600de5b4ce3d633acf', '2026-09-18T23:21:04.325Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:04.325Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Josoa', 6, 21, 14, 'Jatira sy ny kijanany, Estemoa sy ny kijanany,', 'jatira sy ny kijanany, estemoa sy ny kijanany,'),
  ('6aadc7600de5b4ce3d633ac9', '2026-09-18T23:21:04.325Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:04.325Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Josoa', 6, 21, 8, 'Dia nomen’ny Israelita ho an’ny Levita tamin’ny antsapaka ireo tanàna ireo sy ny kijanany, araka ny didy nomen’i Jehovah tamin’ny alalan’i Mosesy.', 'dia nomen’ny israelita ho an’ny levita tamin’ny antsapaka ireo tanàna ireo sy ny kijanany, araka ny didy nomen’i jehovah tamin’ny alalan’i mosesy.'),
  ('6aadc7600de5b4ce3d633ac6', '2026-09-18T23:21:04.325Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:04.325Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Josoa', 6, 21, 5, 'Ary ny sisa tamin’ny Kehatita dia nomena tanàna folo avy tamin’ireo fianakaviana anisan’ny fokon’i Efraima sy ny fokon’i Dana ary ny antsasaky ny fokon’i Manase.', 'ary ny sisa tamin’ny kehatita dia nomena tanàna folo avy tamin’ireo fianakaviana anisan’ny fokon’i efraima sy ny fokon’i dana ary ny antsasaky ny fokon’i manase.'),
  ('6aadc7600de5b4ce3d633ad1', '2026-09-18T23:21:04.325Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:04.325Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Josoa', 6, 21, 16, 'Aina sy ny kijanany, Jota sy ny kijanany, ary Beti-semesy sy ny kijanany. Tanàna sivy no avy tamin’ireo foko roa ireo.', 'aina sy ny kijanany, jota sy ny kijanany, ary beti-semesy sy ny kijanany. tanàna sivy no avy tamin’ireo foko roa ireo.'),
  ('6aadc7600de5b4ce3d633ad0', '2026-09-18T23:21:04.325Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:04.325Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Josoa', 6, 21, 15, 'Holona sy ny kijanany, Debira sy ny kijanany,', 'holona sy ny kijanany, debira sy ny kijanany,'),
  ('6aadc7600de5b4ce3d633ac3', '2026-09-18T23:21:04.325Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:04.325Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Josoa', 6, 21, 2, 'ka niteny tamin’izy ireo tao Silo, tany Kanana, hoe: “Efa nanome didy tamin’ny alalan’i Mosesy i Jehovah hoe homena tanàna hipetrahana sy kijana ho an’ny biby fiompinay izahay.”', 'ka niteny tamin’izy ireo tao silo, tany kanana, hoe: “efa nanome didy tamin’ny alalan’i mosesy i jehovah hoe homena tanàna hipetrahana sy kijana ho an’ny biby fiompinay izahay.”'),
  ('6aadc7600de5b4ce3d633acb', '2026-09-18T23:21:04.325Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:04.325Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Josoa', 6, 21, 10, 'Ireo no nomena ho an’ny taranak’i Arona, izany hoe ny fianakavian’ny Kehatita anisan’ny Levita, noho izy ireo nahazo anjara voalohany rehefa natao ny antsapaka.', 'ireo no nomena ho an’ny taranak’i arona, izany hoe ny fianakavian’ny kehatita anisan’ny levita, noho izy ireo nahazo anjara voalohany rehefa natao ny antsapaka.'),
  ('6aadc7600de5b4ce3d633aca', '2026-09-18T23:21:04.325Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:04.325Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Josoa', 6, 21, 9, 'Voatonona anarana ato ireo tanàna nomena avy tamin’ny fokon’i Joda sy ny fokon’i Simeona.', 'voatonona anarana ato ireo tanàna nomena avy tamin’ny fokon’i joda sy ny fokon’i simeona.'),
  ('6aadc7600de5b4ce3d633ac5', '2026-09-18T23:21:04.325Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:04.325Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Josoa', 6, 21, 4, 'Natao ny antsapaka ka nahazo ny anjarany ny fianakavian’ny Kehatita. Ary azon’ny Levita, taranak’i Arona mpisorona, tamin’ny antsapaka ny tanàna 13 avy tamin’ny fokon’i Joda sy ny fokon’i Simeona ary ny fokon’i Benjamina.', 'natao ny antsapaka ka nahazo ny anjarany ny fianakavian’ny kehatita. ary azon’ny levita, taranak’i arona mpisorona, tamin’ny antsapaka ny tanàna 13 avy tamin’ny fokon’i joda sy ny fokon’i simeona ary ny fokon’i benjamina.'),
  ('6aadc7600de5b4ce3d633ac7', '2026-09-18T23:21:04.325Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:04.325Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Josoa', 6, 21, 6, 'Ary ny Gersonita kosa nahazo tanàna 13 avy tamin’ny fianakavian’ny fokon’i Isakara, sy ny fokon’i Asera, sy ny fokon’i Naftaly, ary ny antsasaky ny fokon’i Manase any Basana.', 'ary ny gersonita kosa nahazo tanàna 13 avy tamin’ny fianakavian’ny fokon’i isakara, sy ny fokon’i asera, sy ny fokon’i naftaly, ary ny antsasaky ny fokon’i manase any basana.'),
  ('6aadc7600de5b4ce3d633ace', '2026-09-18T23:21:04.325Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:04.325Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Josoa', 6, 21, 13, 'Ary nomena ho an’ny taranak’i Arona mpisorona ilay tanàna fialokalofan’izay nahafaty olona, dia ny tanànan’i Hebrona sy ny kijanany. Nomena azy koa i Libna sy ny kijanany,', 'ary nomena ho an’ny taranak’i arona mpisorona ilay tanàna fialokalofan’izay nahafaty olona, dia ny tanànan’i hebrona sy ny kijanany. nomena azy koa i libna sy ny kijanany,'),
  ('6aadc7600de5b4ce3d633ac4', '2026-09-18T23:21:04.325Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:04.325Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Josoa', 6, 21, 3, 'Nomen’ny Israelita tanàna sy kijana avy tamin’ny lovany àry ny Levita, araka ny baikon’i Jehovah.', 'nomen’ny israelita tanàna sy kijana avy tamin’ny lovany àry ny levita, araka ny baikon’i jehovah.'),
  ('6aadc7600de5b4ce3d633ac2', '2026-09-18T23:21:04.325Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:04.325Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Josoa', 6, 21, 1, 'Nanatona an’i Eleazara mpisorona sy Josoa zanak’i Nona ary ny lohan’ny fianakaviamben’ny fokon’ny Israely ireo lohan’ny fianakaviamben’ny Levita,', 'nanatona an’i eleazara mpisorona sy josoa zanak’i nona ary ny lohan’ny fianakaviamben’ny fokon’ny israely ireo lohan’ny fianakaviamben’ny levita,'),
  ('6aadc7600de5b4ce3d633ae6', '2026-09-18T23:21:04.326Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:04.326Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Josoa', 6, 21, 37, 'Kedemota sy ny kijanany, ary Mefata sy ny kijanany, izany hoe tanàna efatra.', 'kedemota sy ny kijanany, ary mefata sy ny kijanany, izany hoe tanàna efatra.'),
  ('6aadc7600de5b4ce3d633ae9', '2026-09-18T23:21:04.326Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:04.326Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Josoa', 6, 21, 40, 'Ny tanàna rehetra azon’ireo fianakaviana anisan’ny Merarita, izay sisa tamin’ny fianakavian’ny Levita, dia tanàna 12.', 'ny tanàna rehetra azon’ireo fianakaviana anisan’ny merarita, izay sisa tamin’ny fianakavian’ny levita, dia tanàna 12.'),
  ('6aadc7600de5b4ce3d633ae0', '2026-09-18T23:21:04.326Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:04.326Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Josoa', 6, 21, 31, 'Helkata sy ny kijanany, ary Rehoba sy ny kijanany, izany hoe tanàna efatra.', 'helkata sy ny kijanany, ary rehoba sy ny kijanany, izany hoe tanàna efatra.'),
  ('6aadc7600de5b4ce3d633ad3', '2026-09-18T23:21:04.326Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:04.326Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Josoa', 6, 21, 18, 'Anatota sy ny kijanany, ary Almona sy ny kijanany, izany hoe tanàna efatra.', 'anatota sy ny kijanany, ary almona sy ny kijanany, izany hoe tanàna efatra.'),
  ('6aadc7600de5b4ce3d633aed', '2026-09-18T23:21:04.326Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:04.326Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Josoa', 6, 21, 44, 'Ary nataon’i Jehovah nilamina tanteraka ny tanin’izy ireo, araka ny fianianana nataony tamin’ny razamben’izy ireo, ka tsy nisy nahatohitra azy ny fahavalony rehetra na iray aza. Nataon’i Jehovah resin’izy ireo daholo ny fahavalony.', 'ary nataon’i jehovah nilamina tanteraka ny tanin’izy ireo, araka ny fianianana nataony tamin’ny razamben’izy ireo, ka tsy nisy nahatohitra azy ny fahavalony rehetra na iray aza. nataon’i jehovah resin’izy ireo daholo ny fahavalony.'),
  ('6aadc7600de5b4ce3d633ada', '2026-09-18T23:21:04.326Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:04.326Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Josoa', 6, 21, 25, 'Ary ny avy tamin’ny antsasaky ny fokon’i Manase dia i Tanàka sy ny kijanany, ary Gata-rimona sy ny kijanany, izany hoe tanàna roa.', 'ary ny avy tamin’ny antsasaky ny fokon’i manase dia i tanàka sy ny kijanany, ary gata-rimona sy ny kijanany, izany hoe tanàna roa.');
INSERT INTO "bible_verses" ("id", "created_date", "updated_date", "created_by_id", "created_by", "translation", "book", "bookOrder", "chapter", "verse", "text", "normalizedText") VALUES
  ('6aadc7600de5b4ce3d633ad2', '2026-09-18T23:21:04.326Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:04.326Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Josoa', 6, 21, 17, 'Ary ny avy tamin’ny fokon’i Benjamina dia i Gibeona sy ny kijanany, Geba sy ny kijanany,', 'ary ny avy tamin’ny fokon’i benjamina dia i gibeona sy ny kijanany, geba sy ny kijanany,'),
  ('6aadc7600de5b4ce3d633ae8', '2026-09-18T23:21:04.326Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:04.326Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Josoa', 6, 21, 39, 'Hesbona sy ny kijanany, ary Jazera sy ny kijanany. Tanàna efatra ny fitambarany.', 'hesbona sy ny kijanany, ary jazera sy ny kijanany. tanàna efatra ny fitambarany.'),
  ('6aadc7600de5b4ce3d633add', '2026-09-18T23:21:04.326Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:04.326Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Josoa', 6, 21, 28, 'Ny avy tamin’ny fokon’i Isakara dia i Kisiona sy ny kijanany, Daberata sy ny kijanany,', 'ny avy tamin’ny fokon’i isakara dia i kisiona sy ny kijanany, daberata sy ny kijanany,'),
  ('6aadc7600de5b4ce3d633ae2', '2026-09-18T23:21:04.326Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:04.326Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Josoa', 6, 21, 33, 'Ny tanàna rehetra azon’ny Gersonita, araka ny fianakaviany avy, dia tanàna 13 sy ny kijanany.', 'ny tanàna rehetra azon’ny gersonita, araka ny fianakaviany avy, dia tanàna 13 sy ny kijanany.'),
  ('6aadc7600de5b4ce3d633ae3', '2026-09-18T23:21:04.326Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:04.326Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Josoa', 6, 21, 34, 'Ary nahazo tanàna avy tamin’ny fokon’i Zebolona ny fianakavian’ny Merarita, izany hoe ny sisa tamin’ny Levita, dia ny tanànan’i Jokneama sy ny kijanany, Karta sy ny kijanany,', 'ary nahazo tanàna avy tamin’ny fokon’i zebolona ny fianakavian’ny merarita, izany hoe ny sisa tamin’ny levita, dia ny tanànan’i jokneama sy ny kijanany, karta sy ny kijanany,'),
  ('6aadc7600de5b4ce3d633ad6', '2026-09-18T23:21:04.326Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:04.326Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Josoa', 6, 21, 21, 'Nomena azy ireo ilay tanàna fialokalofan’izay nahafaty olona, dia i Sekema sy ny kijanany eny amin’ny faritra be tendrombohitr’i Efraima. Nomena azy koa i Gazera sy ny kijanany,', 'nomena azy ireo ilay tanàna fialokalofan’izay nahafaty olona, dia i sekema sy ny kijanany eny amin’ny faritra be tendrombohitr’i efraima. nomena azy koa i gazera sy ny kijanany,'),
  ('6aadc7600de5b4ce3d633aee', '2026-09-18T23:21:04.326Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:04.326Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Josoa', 6, 21, 45, 'Tsy nisy tsy tanteraka na iray aza ny zava-tsoa rehetra nampanantenain’i Jehovah tamin’ny taranak’Israely, fa tanteraka daholo.', 'tsy nisy tsy tanteraka na iray aza ny zava-tsoa rehetra nampanantenain’i jehovah tamin’ny taranak’israely, fa tanteraka daholo.'),
  ('6aadc7600de5b4ce3d633aeb', '2026-09-18T23:21:04.326Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:04.326Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Josoa', 6, 21, 42, 'Nanana kijana manodidina azy ny tsirairay tamin’ireo tanàna ireo. Hoatr’izany daholo ireo tanàna ireo.', 'nanana kijana manodidina azy ny tsirairay tamin’ireo tanàna ireo. hoatr’izany daholo ireo tanàna ireo.'),
  ('6aadc7600de5b4ce3d633aea', '2026-09-18T23:21:04.326Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:04.326Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Josoa', 6, 21, 41, 'Ny tanàna rehetra an’ny Levita teo amin’ny lovan’ny Israelita, dia tanàna 48 sy ny kijanany.', 'ny tanàna rehetra an’ny levita teo amin’ny lovan’ny israelita, dia tanàna 48 sy ny kijanany.'),
  ('6aadc7600de5b4ce3d633aec', '2026-09-18T23:21:04.326Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:04.326Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Josoa', 6, 21, 43, 'Nomen’i Jehovah ny Israely àry ilay tany manontolo, izay nanaovany fianianana tamin’ny razambeny hoe homeny azy ireo. Dia nalain’izy ireo izany ka nipetrahany.', 'nomen’i jehovah ny israely àry ilay tany manontolo, izay nanaovany fianianana tamin’ny razambeny hoe homeny azy ireo. dia nalain’izy ireo izany ka nipetrahany.'),
  ('6aadc7600de5b4ce3d633ad8', '2026-09-18T23:21:04.326Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:04.326Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Josoa', 6, 21, 23, 'Ny avy tamin’ny fokon’i Dana dia i Elteke sy ny kijanany, Gibetona sy ny kijanany,', 'ny avy tamin’ny fokon’i dana dia i elteke sy ny kijanany, gibetona sy ny kijanany,'),
  ('6aadc7600de5b4ce3d633ade', '2026-09-18T23:21:04.326Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:04.326Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Josoa', 6, 21, 29, 'Jarmota sy ny kijanany, ary En-ganima sy ny kijanany, izany hoe tanàna efatra.', 'jarmota sy ny kijanany, ary en-ganima sy ny kijanany, izany hoe tanàna efatra.'),
  ('6aadc7600de5b4ce3d633adb', '2026-09-18T23:21:04.326Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:04.326Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Josoa', 6, 21, 26, 'Folo ny tanàna rehetra sy ny kijanany azon’ny sisa tamin’ny fianakavian’ny Kehatita.', 'folo ny tanàna rehetra sy ny kijanany azon’ny sisa tamin’ny fianakavian’ny kehatita.'),
  ('6aadc7600de5b4ce3d633ae7', '2026-09-18T23:21:04.326Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:04.326Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Josoa', 6, 21, 38, 'Ary ny avy tamin’ny fokon’i Gada dia ilay tanàna fialokalofan’izay nahafaty olona, izany hoe ny tanànan’i Ramota any Gileada sy ny kijanany. Azony koa i Mahanaima sy ny kijanany,', 'ary ny avy tamin’ny fokon’i gada dia ilay tanàna fialokalofan’izay nahafaty olona, izany hoe ny tanànan’i ramota any gileada sy ny kijanany. azony koa i mahanaima sy ny kijanany,'),
  ('6aadc7600de5b4ce3d633ae4', '2026-09-18T23:21:04.326Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:04.326Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Josoa', 6, 21, 35, 'Dimna sy ny kijanany, ary Nahalala sy ny kijanany, izany hoe tanàna efatra.', 'dimna sy ny kijanany, ary nahalala sy ny kijanany, izany hoe tanàna efatra.'),
  ('6aadc7600de5b4ce3d633ae1', '2026-09-18T23:21:04.326Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:04.326Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Josoa', 6, 21, 32, 'Ary ny avy tamin’ny fokon’i Naftaly dia ilay tanàna fialokalofan’izay nahafaty olona, izany hoe ny tanànan’i Kedesy any Galilia sy ny kijanany. Azony koa i Hamota-dora sy ny kijanany, ary Kartana sy ny kijanany, izany hoe tanàna telo.', 'ary ny avy tamin’ny fokon’i naftaly dia ilay tanàna fialokalofan’izay nahafaty olona, izany hoe ny tanànan’i kedesy any galilia sy ny kijanany. azony koa i hamota-dora sy ny kijanany, ary kartana sy ny kijanany, izany hoe tanàna telo.'),
  ('6aadc7600de5b4ce3d633adf', '2026-09-18T23:21:04.326Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:04.326Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Josoa', 6, 21, 30, 'Ny avy tamin’ny fokon’i Asera dia i Misala sy ny kijanany, Abdona sy ny kijanany,', 'ny avy tamin’ny fokon’i asera dia i misala sy ny kijanany, abdona sy ny kijanany,'),
  ('6aadc7600de5b4ce3d633ad9', '2026-09-18T23:21:04.326Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:04.326Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Josoa', 6, 21, 24, 'Aialona sy ny kijanany, ary Gata-rimona sy ny kijanany, izany hoe tanàna efatra.', 'aialona sy ny kijanany, ary gata-rimona sy ny kijanany, izany hoe tanàna efatra.'),
  ('6aadc7600de5b4ce3d633ad7', '2026-09-18T23:21:04.326Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:04.326Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Josoa', 6, 21, 22, 'Kibzaima sy ny kijanany, ary Beti-horona sy ny kijanany, izany hoe tanàna efatra.', 'kibzaima sy ny kijanany, ary beti-horona sy ny kijanany, izany hoe tanàna efatra.'),
  ('6aadc7600de5b4ce3d633ae5', '2026-09-18T23:21:04.326Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:04.326Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Josoa', 6, 21, 36, 'Ny avy tamin’ny fokon’i Robena dia i Bezera sy ny kijanany, Jahaza sy ny kijanany,', 'ny avy tamin’ny fokon’i robena dia i bezera sy ny kijanany, jahaza sy ny kijanany,'),
  ('6aadc7600de5b4ce3d633adc', '2026-09-18T23:21:04.326Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:04.326Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Josoa', 6, 21, 27, 'Ary nahazo tanàna avy tamin’ny antsasaky ny fokon’i Manase ny Gersonita anisan’ny fianakavian’ny Levita, dia ilay tanàna fialokalofan’izay nahafaty olona, izany hoe ny tanànan’i Golana any Basana sy ny kijanany. Azony koa i Bestera sy ny kijanany, izany hoe tanàna roa.', 'ary nahazo tanàna avy tamin’ny antsasaky ny fokon’i manase ny gersonita anisan’ny fianakavian’ny levita, dia ilay tanàna fialokalofan’izay nahafaty olona, izany hoe ny tanànan’i golana any basana sy ny kijanany. azony koa i bestera sy ny kijanany, izany hoe tanàna roa.'),
  ('6aadc7600de5b4ce3d633ad5', '2026-09-18T23:21:04.326Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:04.326Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Josoa', 6, 21, 20, 'Ary nomena tanàna avy tamin’ny fokon’i Efraima, tamin’ny antsapaka, ny sisa tamin’ny fianakavian’ny Kehatita anisan’ny Levita.', 'ary nomena tanàna avy tamin’ny fokon’i efraima, tamin’ny antsapaka, ny sisa tamin’ny fianakavian’ny kehatita anisan’ny levita.'),
  ('6aadc7600de5b4ce3d633ad4', '2026-09-18T23:21:04.326Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:04.326Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Josoa', 6, 21, 19, 'Ny tanàna rehetra nomena ny mpisorona taranak’i Arona, dia tanàna 13 sy ny kijanany.', 'ny tanàna rehetra nomena ny mpisorona taranak’i arona, dia tanàna 13 sy ny kijanany.'),
  ('6aadc7602f11767836419ebd', '2026-09-18T23:21:04.717Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:04.717Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Josoa', 6, 22, 18, 'Ianareo indray anefa izao no miala amin’i Jehovah! Raha mikomy amin’i Jehovah ianareo androany, dia ho tezitra amin’ny vahoakan’Israely manontolo izy rahampitso.', 'ianareo indray anefa izao no miala amin’i jehovah! raha mikomy amin’i jehovah ianareo androany, dia ho tezitra amin’ny vahoakan’israely manontolo izy rahampitso.'),
  ('6aadc7602f11767836419ecc', '2026-09-18T23:21:04.717Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:04.717Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Josoa', 6, 22, 33, 'Koa nahafaly ny Israelita ilay tatitra. Dia nidera an’Andriamanitra izy ireo, ary tsy niresadresaka intsony hoe handeha hiady amin’ny Robenita sy ny Gadita mba hanimba ny tany nipetrahany.', 'koa nahafaly ny israelita ilay tatitra. dia nidera an’andriamanitra izy ireo, ary tsy niresadresaka intsony hoe handeha hiady amin’ny robenita sy ny gadita mba hanimba ny tany nipetrahany.'),
  ('6aadc7602f11767836419eb5', '2026-09-18T23:21:04.717Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:04.717Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Josoa', 6, 22, 10, 'Rehefa tonga teo amin’ny faritr’i Jordana tao Kanana ny Robenita sy ny Gadita ary ny antsasaky ny fokon’i Manase, dia nanorina alitara ngezabe teo akaikin’ny Reniranon’i Jordana.', 'rehefa tonga teo amin’ny faritr’i jordana tao kanana ny robenita sy ny gadita ary ny antsasaky ny fokon’i manase, dia nanorina alitara ngezabe teo akaikin’ny reniranon’i jordana.'),
  ('6aadc7602f11767836419eac', '2026-09-18T23:21:04.717Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:04.717Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Josoa', 6, 22, 1, 'Dia nantsoin’i Josoa ny Robenita sy ny Gadita ary ny antsasaky ny fokon’i Manase,', 'dia nantsoin’i josoa ny robenita sy ny gadita ary ny antsasaky ny fokon’i manase,'),
  ('6aadc7602f11767836419ec2', '2026-09-18T23:21:04.717Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:04.717Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Josoa', 6, 22, 23, 'I Jehovah mihitsy no hanasazy anay, raha ny hiala amin’i Jehovah sy ny hanolotra fanatitra dorana sy fanatitra varimbazaha ary sorona iombonana no antony nanorenanay an’ilay alitara.', 'i jehovah mihitsy no hanasazy anay, raha ny hiala amin’i jehovah sy ny hanolotra fanatitra dorana sy fanatitra varimbazaha ary sorona iombonana no antony nanorenanay an’ilay alitara.'),
  ('6aadc7602f11767836419ecd', '2026-09-18T23:21:04.717Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:04.717Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Josoa', 6, 22, 34, 'Nomen’ny Robenita sy ny Gadita anarana àry ilay alitara. Hoy mantsy izy ireo: “Io no vavolombelona amintsika fa i Jehovah no tena Andriamanitra.”', 'nomen’ny robenita sy ny gadita anarana àry ilay alitara. hoy mantsy izy ireo: “io no vavolombelona amintsika fa i jehovah no tena andriamanitra.”'),
  ('6aadc7602f11767836419eae', '2026-09-18T23:21:04.717Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:04.717Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Josoa', 6, 22, 3, 'Tsy nandao ny rahalahinareo ianareo nandritra an’izay fotoana rehetra izay ka hatramin’izao, sady narahinareo ny didin’i Jehovah Andriamanitrareo.', 'tsy nandao ny rahalahinareo ianareo nandritra an’izay fotoana rehetra izay ka hatramin’izao, sady narahinareo ny didin’i jehovah andriamanitrareo.'),
  ('6aadc7602f11767836419ec8', '2026-09-18T23:21:04.717Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:04.717Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Josoa', 6, 22, 29, 'Tsy izahay mihitsy sanatria no hikomy amin’i Jehovah sy hiala amin’i Jehovah, ka hanorina alitara hafa hanolorana fanatitra dorana sy fanatitra varimbazaha ary sorona, ankoatra an’ilay alitaran’i Jehovah Andriamanitsika izay eo anoloan’ny tranolainy!”', 'tsy izahay mihitsy sanatria no hikomy amin’i jehovah sy hiala amin’i jehovah, ka hanorina alitara hafa hanolorana fanatitra dorana sy fanatitra varimbazaha ary sorona, ankoatra an’ilay alitaran’i jehovah andriamanitsika izay eo anoloan’ny tranolainy!”'),
  ('6aadc7602f11767836419eb0', '2026-09-18T23:21:04.717Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:04.717Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Josoa', 6, 22, 5, 'Tandremo tsara fotsiny ny didy sy ny Lalàna nomen’i Mosesy mpanompon’i Jehovah anareo, ka tiavo i Jehovah Andriamanitrareo, mandehana amin’ny lalany rehetra, tandremo ny didiny, mifikira aminy, ary manompoa azy amin’ny fonareo manontolo sy ny tenanareo manontolo.”', 'tandremo tsara fotsiny ny didy sy ny lalàna nomen’i mosesy mpanompon’i jehovah anareo, ka tiavo i jehovah andriamanitrareo, mandehana amin’ny lalany rehetra, tandremo ny didiny, mifikira aminy, ary manompoa azy amin’ny fonareo manontolo sy ny tenanareo manontolo.”'),
  ('6aadc7602f11767836419ecb', '2026-09-18T23:21:04.717Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:04.717Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Josoa', 6, 22, 32, 'Niverina tany amin’ny Israelita tany Kanana i Finehasa zanak’i Eleazara mpisorona sy ny mpiadidy, dia nanao tatitra tamin’izy ireo, rehefa avy nihaona tamin’ny Robenita sy ny Gadita tany Gileada.', 'niverina tany amin’ny israelita tany kanana i finehasa zanak’i eleazara mpisorona sy ny mpiadidy, dia nanao tatitra tamin’izy ireo, rehefa avy nihaona tamin’ny robenita sy ny gadita tany gileada.'),
  ('6aadc7602f11767836419ec9', '2026-09-18T23:21:04.717Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:04.717Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Josoa', 6, 22, 30, 'Ary faly i Finehasa mpisorona sy ireo niaraka taminy, izany hoe ny mpiadidy vahoaka sy ny mpifehy ny arivo teo amin’ny Israely, rehefa naheno ny tenin’ny taranak’i Robena sy Gada ary Manase.', 'ary faly i finehasa mpisorona sy ireo niaraka taminy, izany hoe ny mpiadidy vahoaka sy ny mpifehy ny arivo teo amin’ny israely, rehefa naheno ny tenin’ny taranak’i robena sy gada ary manase.'),
  ('6aadc7602f11767836419eb8', '2026-09-18T23:21:04.717Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:04.717Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Josoa', 6, 22, 13, 'Ary nirahin’ny Israelita i Finehasa zanak’i Eleazara mpisorona, mba hankany amin’ny Robenita sy ny Gadita ary ny antsasaky ny fokon’i Manase, tany Gileada.', 'ary nirahin’ny israelita i finehasa zanak’i eleazara mpisorona, mba hankany amin’ny robenita sy ny gadita ary ny antsasaky ny fokon’i manase, tany gileada.'),
  ('6aadc7602f11767836419ec4', '2026-09-18T23:21:04.717Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:04.717Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Josoa', 6, 22, 25, 'Efa nataon’i Jehovah ho sisin-tany manasaraka anay aminareo Robenita sy Gadita ny Reniranon’i Jordana. Tsy manana anjara amin’ny fanompoana an’i Jehovah ianareo.’ Dia hisakana ny zanakay tsy hanompo an’i Jehovah ny zanakareo.', 'efa nataon’i jehovah ho sisin-tany manasaraka anay aminareo robenita sy gadita ny reniranon’i jordana. tsy manana anjara amin’ny fanompoana an’i jehovah ianareo.’ dia hisakana ny zanakay tsy hanompo an’i jehovah ny zanakareo.'),
  ('6aadc7602f11767836419ec3', '2026-09-18T23:21:04.717Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:04.717Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Josoa', 6, 22, 24, 'Zavatra hafa kosa no nampanahy anay ka nahatonga anay hanao an’izany. Sao dia hiteny amin’ny zanakay mantsy ny zanakareo any aoriana any hoe: ‘Misy idiranareo angaha moa ny fanompoana an’i Jehovah Andriamanitry ny Israely?', 'zavatra hafa kosa no nampanahy anay ka nahatonga anay hanao an’izany. sao dia hiteny amin’ny zanakay mantsy ny zanakareo any aoriana any hoe: ‘misy idiranareo angaha moa ny fanompoana an’i jehovah andriamanitry ny israely?'),
  ('6aadc7602f11767836419ebf', '2026-09-18T23:21:04.717Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:04.717Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Josoa', 6, 22, 20, 'Tsy ny vahoakan’Israely manontolo ve no niharan’ny fahatezeran’Andriamanitra, nefa i Akana zanak’i Zera no nivadika taminy ka tsy nankatò ny didy momba ny zavatra voatokana haringana? Ary tsy izy irery no maty noho ny fahadisoany.’”', 'tsy ny vahoakan’israely manontolo ve no niharan’ny fahatezeran’andriamanitra, nefa i akana zanak’i zera no nivadika taminy ka tsy nankatò ny didy momba ny zavatra voatokana haringana? ary tsy izy irery no maty noho ny fahadisoany.’”'),
  ('6aadc7602f11767836419eb3', '2026-09-18T23:21:04.717Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:04.717Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Josoa', 6, 22, 8, 'Hoy izy tamin’izy ireo: “Modia any amin’ny tranolainareo, miaraka amin’ny harem-be sy biby fiompy maro be, ary koa volafotsy, volamena, varahina, vy, ary fitafiana be dia be. Alaivo ny anjaranareo amin’ny zavatra azo babo avy tamin’ny fahavalonareo, ka zarao ho anareo sy ny rahalahinareo.”', 'hoy izy tamin’izy ireo: “modia any amin’ny tranolainareo, miaraka amin’ny harem-be sy biby fiompy maro be, ary koa volafotsy, volamena, varahina, vy, ary fitafiana be dia be. alaivo ny anjaranareo amin’ny zavatra azo babo avy tamin’ny fahavalonareo, ka zarao ho anareo sy ny rahalahinareo.”'),
  ('6aadc7602f11767836419ec1', '2026-09-18T23:21:04.717Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:04.717Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Josoa', 6, 22, 22, '“I Jehovah, ilay Andriamanitry ny andriamanitra, eny, i Jehovah, ilay Andriamanitry ny andriamanitra, no mahalala hoe nahoana izahay no nanao an’izany ary hahalala an’izany koa ny Israely. Raha mikomy sy mivadika aminao izahay, Jehovah ô, dia aza mamonjy anay androany.', '“i jehovah, ilay andriamanitry ny andriamanitra, eny, i jehovah, ilay andriamanitry ny andriamanitra, no mahalala hoe nahoana izahay no nanao an’izany ary hahalala an’izany koa ny israely. raha mikomy sy mivadika aminao izahay, jehovah ô, dia aza mamonjy anay androany.'),
  ('6aadc7602f11767836419ebc', '2026-09-18T23:21:04.717Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:04.717Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Josoa', 6, 22, 17, 'Mbola tsy ampy antsika angaha ny fahadisoana tany Peora? Isika aza mbola tsy voadio tamin’iny akory hatramin’izao, na dia efa nisy loza nihatra tamin’ny vahoakan’i Jehovah aza.', 'mbola tsy ampy antsika angaha ny fahadisoana tany peora? isika aza mbola tsy voadio tamin’iny akory hatramin’izao, na dia efa nisy loza nihatra tamin’ny vahoakan’i jehovah aza.'),
  ('6aadc7602f11767836419ec7', '2026-09-18T23:21:04.717Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:04.717Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Josoa', 6, 22, 28, 'Dia hoy izahay: ‘Raha milaza an’izany amintsika sy amin’ny taranatsika ry zareo any aoriana any, dia hiteny isika hoe: “Jereo ny alitara nataon’ny razambenay fa mitovy amin’ilay alitaran’i Jehovah. Tsy hanolorana fanatitra dorana anefa izany na hanaovana sorona, fa ho vavolombelona aminareo sy aminay.”’', 'dia hoy izahay: ‘raha milaza an’izany amintsika sy amin’ny taranatsika ry zareo any aoriana any, dia hiteny isika hoe: “jereo ny alitara nataon’ny razambenay fa mitovy amin’ilay alitaran’i jehovah. tsy hanolorana fanatitra dorana anefa izany na hanaovana sorona, fa ho vavolombelona aminareo sy aminay.”’'),
  ('6aadc7602f11767836419eb1', '2026-09-18T23:21:04.717Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:04.717Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Josoa', 6, 22, 6, 'Dia nitso-drano azy ireo i Josoa, ka nandefa azy ireo nody. Ary lasa nankany amin’ny tranolainy izy ireo.', 'dia nitso-drano azy ireo i josoa, ka nandefa azy ireo nody. ary lasa nankany amin’ny tranolainy izy ireo.'),
  ('6aadc7602f11767836419eaf', '2026-09-18T23:21:04.717Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:04.717Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Josoa', 6, 22, 4, 'Efa nataon’i Jehovah Andriamanitrareo milamina tsara izao ny fiainan’ny rahalahinareo, araka ny nampanantenainy azy ireo. Azonareo atao amin’izay izao ny miverina any amin’ny tranolainareo, any amin’ilay tany nomen’i Mosesy mpanompon’i Jehovah anareo, eny ampitan’i Jordana.', 'efa nataon’i jehovah andriamanitrareo milamina tsara izao ny fiainan’ny rahalahinareo, araka ny nampanantenainy azy ireo. azonareo atao amin’izay izao ny miverina any amin’ny tranolainareo, any amin’ilay tany nomen’i mosesy mpanompon’i jehovah anareo, eny ampitan’i jordana.'),
  ('6aadc7602f11767836419ec0', '2026-09-18T23:21:04.717Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:04.717Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Josoa', 6, 22, 21, 'Dia hoy ny Robenita sy ny Gadita ary ny antsasaky ny fokon’i Manase, tamin’ireo mpifehy ny arivo teo amin’ny Israely:', 'dia hoy ny robenita sy ny gadita ary ny antsasaky ny fokon’i manase, tamin’ireo mpifehy ny arivo teo amin’ny israely:'),
  ('6aadc7602f11767836419eba', '2026-09-18T23:21:04.717Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:04.717Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Josoa', 6, 22, 15, 'Rehefa tonga tany amin’ny Robenita sy ny Gadita ary ny antsasaky ny fokon’i Manase tany Gileada, izy ireo, dia niteny hoe:', 'rehefa tonga tany amin’ny robenita sy ny gadita ary ny antsasaky ny fokon’i manase tany gileada, izy ireo, dia niteny hoe:'),
  ('6aadc7602f11767836419eca', '2026-09-18T23:21:04.717Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:04.717Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Josoa', 6, 22, 31, 'Dia hoy i Finehasa zanak’i Eleazara mpisorona, tamin’ny taranak’i Robena sy Gada ary Manase: “Fantatray androany fa eto amintsika i Jehovah, satria tsy nivadika tamin’i Jehovah ianareo. Efa namonjy ny Israelita teo an-tanan’i Jehovah ianareo.”', 'dia hoy i finehasa zanak’i eleazara mpisorona, tamin’ny taranak’i robena sy gada ary manase: “fantatray androany fa eto amintsika i jehovah, satria tsy nivadika tamin’i jehovah ianareo. efa namonjy ny israelita teo an-tanan’i jehovah ianareo.”'),
  ('6aadc7602f11767836419ec5', '2026-09-18T23:21:04.717Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:04.717Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Josoa', 6, 22, 26, '“Izany no nahatonga anay hiteny hoe: ‘Andao isika hanorina alitara. Tsy hanolorana fanatitra dorana anefa izany na hanaovana sorona,', '“izany no nahatonga anay hiteny hoe: ‘andao isika hanorina alitara. tsy hanolorana fanatitra dorana anefa izany na hanaovana sorona,'),
  ('6aadc7602f11767836419eb9', '2026-09-18T23:21:04.717Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:04.717Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Josoa', 6, 22, 14, 'Nisy mpiadidy folo niaraka taminy, dia mpiadidy iray isaky ny foko rehetra teo amin’ny Israely. Samy lohan’ny fianakaviambe teo amin’ny Israely, izay voatsinjara ho arivo isan-tokony, izy ireo.', 'nisy mpiadidy folo niaraka taminy, dia mpiadidy iray isaky ny foko rehetra teo amin’ny israely. samy lohan’ny fianakaviambe teo amin’ny israely, izay voatsinjara ho arivo isan-tokony, izy ireo.'),
  ('6aadc7602f11767836419eb4', '2026-09-18T23:21:04.717Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:04.717Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Josoa', 6, 22, 9, 'Dia lasa ny Robenita sy ny Gadita ary ny antsasaky ny fokon’i Manase, ka nandao ny Israelita tao Silo, tany Kanana. Nody tany Gileada, tany amin’ilay tany nomena azy izy ireo, dia ilay tany efa nipetrahany araka ny baikon’i Jehovah tamin’ny alalan’i Mosesy.', 'dia lasa ny robenita sy ny gadita ary ny antsasaky ny fokon’i manase, ka nandao ny israelita tao silo, tany kanana. nody tany gileada, tany amin’ilay tany nomena azy izy ireo, dia ilay tany efa nipetrahany araka ny baikon’i jehovah tamin’ny alalan’i mosesy.'),
  ('6aadc7602f11767836419ebe', '2026-09-18T23:21:04.717Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:04.717Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Josoa', 6, 22, 19, 'Raha maloto ny taninareo, dia miampità atỳ amin’ny tanin’i Jehovah izay misy ny tranolain’i Jehovah, ary miaraha mipetraka aminay. Fa aza mikomy amin’i Jehovah, ary aza manorina alitara ankoatra an’ilay alitaran’i Jehovah Andriamanitsika, sao dia hahatonga anay hikomy aminy koa izany.', 'raha maloto ny taninareo, dia miampità atỳ amin’ny tanin’i jehovah izay misy ny tranolain’i jehovah, ary miaraha mipetraka aminay. fa aza mikomy amin’i jehovah, ary aza manorina alitara ankoatra an’ilay alitaran’i jehovah andriamanitsika, sao dia hahatonga anay hikomy aminy koa izany.'),
  ('6aadc7602f11767836419ebb', '2026-09-18T23:21:04.717Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:04.717Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Josoa', 6, 22, 16, '“Izao no nolazain’ny vahoakan’i Jehovah manontolo: ‘Fa ahoana izao ianareo mivadika amin’ny Andriamanitry ny Israely izao? Niala tamin’i Jehovah ianareo androany, satria nanorina alitara sy nikomy tamin’i Jehovah.', '“izao no nolazain’ny vahoakan’i jehovah manontolo: ‘fa ahoana izao ianareo mivadika amin’ny andriamanitry ny israely izao? niala tamin’i jehovah ianareo androany, satria nanorina alitara sy nikomy tamin’i jehovah.'),
  ('6aadc7602f11767836419ec6', '2026-09-18T23:21:04.717Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:04.717Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Josoa', 6, 22, 27, 'fa mba ho vavolombelona aminareo sy aminay ary ny taranaka mandimby antsika hoe hanao ny fanompoana an’i Jehovah eo anatrehany izahay, ka hanao fanatitra dorana sy sorona ary sorona iombonana. Amin’izay dia tsy hilaza amin’ny zanakay ny zanakareo any aoriana any hoe: “Tsy manana anjara amin’ny fanompoana an’i Jehovah ianareo.”’', 'fa mba ho vavolombelona aminareo sy aminay ary ny taranaka mandimby antsika hoe hanao ny fanompoana an’i jehovah eo anatrehany izahay, ka hanao fanatitra dorana sy sorona ary sorona iombonana. amin’izay dia tsy hilaza amin’ny zanakay ny zanakareo any aoriana any hoe: “tsy manana anjara amin’ny fanompoana an’i jehovah ianareo.”’'),
  ('6aadc7602f11767836419eb7', '2026-09-18T23:21:04.717Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:04.717Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Josoa', 6, 22, 12, 'Rehefa nahare an’izany ny Israelita, dia nivory tao Silo izy rehetra mba hiady tamin’izy ireo.', 'rehefa nahare an’izany ny israelita, dia nivory tao silo izy rehetra mba hiady tamin’izy ireo.'),
  ('6aadc7602f11767836419eb6', '2026-09-18T23:21:04.717Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:04.717Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Josoa', 6, 22, 11, 'Tatỳ aoriana, dia nisy niteny tamin’ny Israelita hoe: “Ny Robenita sy ny Gadita ary ny antsasaky ny fokon’i Manase, nanorina alitara eo amin’ny sisin’ny tany Kanana, eo amin’ny faritr’i Jordana, etỳ amin’ny ilany misy ny Israelita.”', 'tatỳ aoriana, dia nisy niteny tamin’ny israelita hoe: “ny robenita sy ny gadita ary ny antsasaky ny fokon’i manase, nanorina alitara eo amin’ny sisin’ny tany kanana, eo amin’ny faritr’i jordana, etỳ amin’ny ilany misy ny israelita.”'),
  ('6aadc7602f11767836419eb2', '2026-09-18T23:21:04.717Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:04.717Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Josoa', 6, 22, 7, 'Efa nomen’i Mosesy lova tany Basana ny antsasaky ny fokon’i Manase, fa ny antsasany kosa nomen’i Josoa tany niaraka tamin’ny rahalahiny tetỳ ampita andrefan’i Jordana. Nitso-drano azy ireo i Josoa rehefa nandefa azy ho any amin’ny tranolainy.', 'efa nomen’i mosesy lova tany basana ny antsasaky ny fokon’i manase, fa ny antsasany kosa nomen’i josoa tany niaraka tamin’ny rahalahiny tetỳ ampita andrefan’i jordana. nitso-drano azy ireo i josoa rehefa nandefa azy ho any amin’ny tranolainy.'),
  ('6aadc7602f11767836419ead', '2026-09-18T23:21:04.717Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:04.717Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Josoa', 6, 22, 2, 'ka nilazany hoe: “Nanao an’izay rehetra nandidian’i Mosesy mpanompon’i Jehovah anareo ianareo, sady nankatò an’izay rehetra nandidiako anareo.', 'ka nilazany hoe: “nanao an’izay rehetra nandidian’i mosesy mpanompon’i jehovah anareo ianareo, sady nankatò an’izay rehetra nandidiako anareo.'),
  ('6aadc761b685405884ee7053', '2026-09-18T23:21:05.627Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:05.627Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Josoa', 6, 23, 12, '“Fa raha miala aminy kosa ianareo ka mifikitra amin’ireo firenena sisa tavela eo aminareo, ary mifanambady amin’izy ireo ka mifanerasera aminy ary izy ireo koa mifanerasera aminareo,', '“fa raha miala aminy kosa ianareo ka mifikitra amin’ireo firenena sisa tavela eo aminareo, ary mifanambady amin’izy ireo ka mifanerasera aminy ary izy ireo koa mifanerasera aminareo,'),
  ('6aadc761b685405884ee704d', '2026-09-18T23:21:05.627Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:05.627Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Josoa', 6, 23, 6, '“Koa manàna herim-po hankatoavana sy hanarahana an’izay rehetra voasoratra ao amin’ny boky misy ny Lalàn’i Mosesy, ka aza miala amin’izany mihitsy, na mivily miankavanana na miankavia.', '“koa manàna herim-po hankatoavana sy hanarahana an’izay rehetra voasoratra ao amin’ny boky misy ny lalàn’i mosesy, ka aza miala amin’izany mihitsy, na mivily miankavanana na miankavia.'),
  ('6aadc761b685405884ee7055', '2026-09-18T23:21:05.627Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:05.627Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Josoa', 6, 23, 14, '“Efa ho faty aho izao. Ary fantatrareo tsara amin’ny fonareo manontolo sy ny tenanareo manontolo, fa tsy nisy tsy tanteraka na iray aza ny zava-tsoa rehetra nampanantenain’i Jehovah Andriamanitrareo anareo. Efa tanteraka taminareo daholo izy rehetra. Tsy nisy tsy tanteraka na iray aza.', '“efa ho faty aho izao. ary fantatrareo tsara amin’ny fonareo manontolo sy ny tenanareo manontolo, fa tsy nisy tsy tanteraka na iray aza ny zava-tsoa rehetra nampanantenain’i jehovah andriamanitrareo anareo. efa tanteraka taminareo daholo izy rehetra. tsy nisy tsy tanteraka na iray aza.'),
  ('6aadc761b685405884ee704f', '2026-09-18T23:21:05.627Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:05.627Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Josoa', 6, 23, 8, 'Mifikira kosa amin’i Jehovah Andriamanitrareo, hoatran’izay efa nataonareo hatramin’izao.', 'mifikira kosa amin’i jehovah andriamanitrareo, hoatran’izay efa nataonareo hatramin’izao.'),
  ('6aadc761b685405884ee704b', '2026-09-18T23:21:05.627Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:05.627Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Josoa', 6, 23, 4, 'Efa nozaraiko ho lovan’ny fokonareo tamin’ny alalan’ny antsapaka koa ny tanin’ireo firenena sisa tavela sy ny tanin’ireo firenena rehetra naringako, hatrany amin’ny Reniranon’i Jordana ka hatrany amin’ny Ranomasina Lehibe any andrefana.', 'efa nozaraiko ho lovan’ny fokonareo tamin’ny alalan’ny antsapaka koa ny tanin’ireo firenena sisa tavela sy ny tanin’ireo firenena rehetra naringako, hatrany amin’ny reniranon’i jordana ka hatrany amin’ny ranomasina lehibe any andrefana.'),
  ('6aadc761b685405884ee7049', '2026-09-18T23:21:05.627Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:05.627Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Josoa', 6, 23, 2, 'dia nantsoiny ny Israely rehetra, izany hoe ny anti-panahy sy ireo lohany teo amin’izy ireo ary ny mpitsara sy ny mpiadidy teo aminy. Dia hoy izy tamin’izy ireo: “Efa antitra sady mandroso taona aho.', 'dia nantsoiny ny israely rehetra, izany hoe ny anti-panahy sy ireo lohany teo amin’izy ireo ary ny mpitsara sy ny mpiadidy teo aminy. dia hoy izy tamin’izy ireo: “efa antitra sady mandroso taona aho.'),
  ('6aadc761b685405884ee7052', '2026-09-18T23:21:05.627Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:05.627Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Josoa', 6, 23, 11, 'Mitandrema tsara foana àry, ka tiavo i Jehovah Andriamanitrareo.', 'mitandrema tsara foana àry, ka tiavo i jehovah andriamanitrareo.'),
  ('6aadc761b685405884ee704e', '2026-09-18T23:21:05.627Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:05.627Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Josoa', 6, 23, 7, 'Ary aza mifanerasera mihitsy amin’ireo firenena mbola tavela eo aminareo ireo. Aza tononina na dia ny anaran’ny andriamaniny aza, ary aza mianiana amin’ny anaran’izy ireny. Aza manompo an’ireny mihitsy na miankohoka aminy.', 'ary aza mifanerasera mihitsy amin’ireo firenena mbola tavela eo aminareo ireo. aza tononina na dia ny anaran’ny andriamaniny aza, ary aza mianiana amin’ny anaran’izy ireny. aza manompo an’ireny mihitsy na miankohoka aminy.'),
  ('6aadc761b685405884ee7050', '2026-09-18T23:21:05.627Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:05.627Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Josoa', 6, 23, 9, 'Handroaka firenena lehibe sy mahery tsy ho eo anatrehanareo i Jehovah. Fa tsy nisy olona nahatohitra anareo hatramin’izao.', 'handroaka firenena lehibe sy mahery tsy ho eo anatrehanareo i jehovah. fa tsy nisy olona nahatohitra anareo hatramin’izao.'),
  ('6aadc761b685405884ee7057', '2026-09-18T23:21:05.627Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:05.627Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Josoa', 6, 23, 16, 'Raha mivadika amin’ny fifanekena nasain’i Jehovah Andriamanitrareo nohajainareo ianareo, ary mandeha manompo andriamani-kafa sy miankohoka amin’izy ireny, dia ho tezitra be aminareo i Jehovah, ka tsy ho ela ianareo dia ho ripaka tsy ho eo amin’ilay tany tsara nomeny anareo.”', 'raha mivadika amin’ny fifanekena nasain’i jehovah andriamanitrareo nohajainareo ianareo, ary mandeha manompo andriamani-kafa sy miankohoka amin’izy ireny, dia ho tezitra be aminareo i jehovah, ka tsy ho ela ianareo dia ho ripaka tsy ho eo amin’ilay tany tsara nomeny anareo.”'),
  ('6aadc761b685405884ee704a', '2026-09-18T23:21:05.627Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:05.627Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Josoa', 6, 23, 3, 'Ary efa hitanareo ny zava-drehetra nataon’i Jehovah Andriamanitrareo tamin’ireo firenena rehetra ireo, mba hanampiana anareo. I Jehovah Andriamanitrareo mantsy no niady ho anareo.', 'ary efa hitanareo ny zava-drehetra nataon’i jehovah andriamanitrareo tamin’ireo firenena rehetra ireo, mba hanampiana anareo. i jehovah andriamanitrareo mantsy no niady ho anareo.'),
  ('6aadc761b685405884ee7054', '2026-09-18T23:21:05.627Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:05.627Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Josoa', 6, 23, 13, 'dia fantaro tsara fa tsy handroaka an’ireo firenena ireo intsony i Jehovah Andriamanitrareo. Ho fandrika sy vela-pandrika ho anareo izy ireo, sady ho karavasy hikapoka ny tehezanareo ary ho tsilo ao anaty masonareo, mandra-paharipaka anareo tsy ho eto amin’ity tany tsara nomen’i Jehovah Andriamanitrareo anareo ity.', 'dia fantaro tsara fa tsy handroaka an’ireo firenena ireo intsony i jehovah andriamanitrareo. ho fandrika sy vela-pandrika ho anareo izy ireo, sady ho karavasy hikapoka ny tehezanareo ary ho tsilo ao anaty masonareo, mandra-paharipaka anareo tsy ho eto amin’ity tany tsara nomen’i jehovah andriamanitrareo anareo ity.'),
  ('6aadc761b685405884ee704c', '2026-09-18T23:21:05.627Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:05.627Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Josoa', 6, 23, 5, 'Ary i Jehovah Andriamanitrareo no nanala azy ireo tsy ho eo anatrehanareo. Nandroaka azy ireo izy ka afaka naka ny taniny ianareo, araka ny efa nampanantenain’i Jehovah Andriamanitrareo anareo.', 'ary i jehovah andriamanitrareo no nanala azy ireo tsy ho eo anatrehanareo. nandroaka azy ireo izy ka afaka naka ny taniny ianareo, araka ny efa nampanantenain’i jehovah andriamanitrareo anareo.'),
  ('6aadc761b685405884ee7048', '2026-09-18T23:21:05.627Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:05.627Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Josoa', 6, 23, 1, 'Efa nataon’i Jehovah milamina ny tanin’ny Israely, satria novonjeny tamin’ny fahavalony rehetra nanodidina izy ireo. Andro maro taorian’izay, rehefa antitra sady nandroso taona i Josoa,', 'efa nataon’i jehovah milamina ny tanin’ny israely, satria novonjeny tamin’ny fahavalony rehetra nanodidina izy ireo. andro maro taorian’izay, rehefa antitra sady nandroso taona i josoa,'),
  ('6aadc761b685405884ee7051', '2026-09-18T23:21:05.627Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:05.627Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Josoa', 6, 23, 10, 'Lehilahy iray monja aminareo no hanenjika arivo, satria i Jehovah Andriamanitrareo no miady ho anareo, araka ny efa nampanantenainy anareo.', 'lehilahy iray monja aminareo no hanenjika arivo, satria i jehovah andriamanitrareo no miady ho anareo, araka ny efa nampanantenainy anareo.'),
  ('6aadc761b685405884ee7056', '2026-09-18T23:21:05.627Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:05.627Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Josoa', 6, 23, 15, 'Hoatran’ny nahatanterahan’ny zava-tsoa rehetra nampanantenain’i Jehovah Andriamanitrareo anareo koa anefa, no hampiharan’i Jehovah aminareo ny loza rehetra nolazainy hoe hanjo anareo, sy handringanany anareo tsy ho eto amin’ity tany tsara nomen’i Jehovah Andriamanitrareo anareo ity.', 'hoatran’ny nahatanterahan’ny zava-tsoa rehetra nampanantenain’i jehovah andriamanitrareo anareo koa anefa, no hampiharan’i jehovah aminareo ny loza rehetra nolazainy hoe hanjo anareo, sy handringanany anareo tsy ho eto amin’ity tany tsara nomen’i jehovah andriamanitrareo anareo ity.'),
  ('6aadc7621c749ee21b3de7ca', '2026-09-18T23:21:06.158Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:06.158Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Josoa', 6, 24, 3, '“‘Rehefa nandeha ny fotoana, dia nalaiko avy tany ampitan’ny Renirano i Abrahama razambenareo, ka nentiko nitety ny tany Kanana manontolo, ary nataoko be dia be ny taranany. Nomeko azy i Isaka,', '“‘rehefa nandeha ny fotoana, dia nalaiko avy tany ampitan’ny renirano i abrahama razambenareo, ka nentiko nitety ny tany kanana manontolo, ary nataoko be dia be ny taranany. nomeko azy i isaka,'),
  ('6aadc7621c749ee21b3de7c9', '2026-09-18T23:21:06.158Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:06.158Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Josoa', 6, 24, 2, 'Ary hoy i Josoa tamin’ny olona rehetra: “Izao no nolazain’i Jehovah Andriamanitry ny Israely: ‘Tany ampitan’ny Renirano ny razambenareo no nipetraka taloha ela be, anisan’izany i Tera rain’i Abrahama sy Nahora. Ary nanompo andriamani-kafa izy ireo.', 'ary hoy i josoa tamin’ny olona rehetra: “izao no nolazain’i jehovah andriamanitry ny israely: ‘tany ampitan’ny renirano ny razambenareo no nipetraka taloha ela be, anisan’izany i tera rain’i abrahama sy nahora. ary nanompo andriamani-kafa izy ireo.'),
  ('6aadc7621c749ee21b3de7cd', '2026-09-18T23:21:06.158Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:06.158Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Josoa', 6, 24, 6, 'Rehefa nentiko nivoaka avy tany Ejipta ny razambenareo, dia tonga teo amin’ny ranomasina. Ary nanenjika azy ireo hatreny amin’ny Ranomasina Mena ny Ejipsianina, niaraka tamin’ny kalesy fitondra miady sy mpitaingin-tsoavaly.', 'rehefa nentiko nivoaka avy tany ejipta ny razambenareo, dia tonga teo amin’ny ranomasina. ary nanenjika azy ireo hatreny amin’ny ranomasina mena ny ejipsianina, niaraka tamin’ny kalesy fitondra miady sy mpitaingin-tsoavaly.'),
  ('6aadc7621c749ee21b3de7cc', '2026-09-18T23:21:06.158Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:06.158Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Josoa', 6, 24, 5, 'Naniraka an’i Mosesy sy Arona aho tatỳ aoriana, ary namely an’i Ejipta tamin’ny loza, dia nitondra anareo nivoaka avy tany.', 'naniraka an’i mosesy sy arona aho tatỳ aoriana, ary namely an’i ejipta tamin’ny loza, dia nitondra anareo nivoaka avy tany.'),
  ('6aadc7621c749ee21b3de7cb', '2026-09-18T23:21:06.158Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:06.158Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Josoa', 6, 24, 4, 'ary nomeko an’i Isaka i Jakoba sy Esao. Tatỳ aoriana dia nomeko an’i Esao ny Tendrombohitra Seira. Ary nidina tany Ejipta i Jakoba sy ny zanany.', 'ary nomeko an’i isaka i jakoba sy esao. tatỳ aoriana dia nomeko an’i esao ny tendrombohitra seira. ary nidina tany ejipta i jakoba sy ny zanany.'),
  ('6aadc7621c749ee21b3de7c8', '2026-09-18T23:21:06.158Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:06.158Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Josoa', 6, 24, 1, 'Dia novorin’i Josoa tao Sekema ny foko rehetra teo amin’ny Israely, ary nantsoiny ny anti-panahy sy ireo lohany ary ny mpitsara sy mpiadidy teo amin’ny Israely. Dia nitsangana teo anatrehan’ilay tena Andriamanitra izy ireo.', 'dia novorin’i josoa tao sekema ny foko rehetra teo amin’ny israely, ary nantsoiny ny anti-panahy sy ireo lohany ary ny mpitsara sy mpiadidy teo amin’ny israely. dia nitsangana teo anatrehan’ilay tena andriamanitra izy ireo.'),
  ('6aadc7621c749ee21b3de7ce', '2026-09-18T23:21:06.158Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:06.158Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Josoa', 6, 24, 7, 'Dia nitaraina mafy tamin’i Jehovah ny razambenareo, ka nasiany haizina nanelanelana anareo sy ny Ejipsianina. Ary nosaronany tamin’ny ranomasina izy ireo ka nataony difotra. Ny masonareo mihitsy no nahita an’izay nataoko tany Ejipta. Ary nijanona tany an-tany efitra nandritra ny taona maro ianareo.', 'dia nitaraina mafy tamin’i jehovah ny razambenareo, ka nasiany haizina nanelanelana anareo sy ny ejipsianina. ary nosaronany tamin’ny ranomasina izy ireo ka nataony difotra. ny masonareo mihitsy no nahita an’izay nataoko tany ejipta. ary nijanona tany an-tany efitra nandritra ny taona maro ianareo.'),
  ('6aadc7621c749ee21b3de7e7', '2026-09-18T23:21:06.159Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:06.159Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Josoa', 6, 24, 32, 'Ary ny taolambalon’i Josefa izay efa nentin’ny Israelita niakatra avy tany Ejipta, dia nalevina tao Sekema, tao amin’ilay tany novidin’i Jakoba 100 kesita tamin’ny taranak’i Hamora rain’i Sekema. Dia lasa lovan’ny taranak’i Josefa ilay tany.', 'ary ny taolambalon’i josefa izay efa nentin’ny israelita niakatra avy tany ejipta, dia nalevina tao sekema, tao amin’ilay tany novidin’i jakoba 100 kesita tamin’ny taranak’i hamora rain’i sekema. dia lasa lovan’ny taranak’i josefa ilay tany.'),
  ('6aadc7621c749ee21b3de7e3', '2026-09-18T23:21:06.159Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:06.159Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Josoa', 6, 24, 28, 'Dia nalefan’i Josoa nody tany amin’ny lovany avy ny olona.', 'dia nalefan’i josoa nody tany amin’ny lovany avy ny olona.'),
  ('6aadc7621c749ee21b3de7d9', '2026-09-18T23:21:06.159Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:06.159Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Josoa', 6, 24, 18, 'Noroahin’i Jehovah ny firenena rehetra nipetraka talohantsika teto amin’ity tany ity, anisan’izany ny Amorita. Hanompo an’i Jehovah koa àry izahay, satria izy no Andriamanitray.”', 'noroahin’i jehovah ny firenena rehetra nipetraka talohantsika teto amin’ity tany ity, anisan’izany ny amorita. hanompo an’i jehovah koa àry izahay, satria izy no andriamanitray.”'),
  ('6aadc7621c749ee21b3de7e4', '2026-09-18T23:21:06.159Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:06.159Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Josoa', 6, 24, 29, 'Taorian’izany zava-nitranga izany, dia maty i Josoa zanak’i Nona, mpanompon’i Jehovah, rehefa 110 taona.', 'taorian’izany zava-nitranga izany, dia maty i josoa zanak’i nona, mpanompon’i jehovah, rehefa 110 taona.'),
  ('6aadc7621c749ee21b3de7e1', '2026-09-18T23:21:06.159Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:06.159Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Josoa', 6, 24, 26, 'Dia nosoratan’i Josoa tao amin’ny boky misy ny Lalàn’Andriamanitra ireo teny ireo. Ary naka vato lehibe izy, ka nanangana izany teo ambanin’ilay hazobe teo akaikin’ny toerana masin’i Jehovah.', 'dia nosoratan’i josoa tao amin’ny boky misy ny lalàn’andriamanitra ireo teny ireo. ary naka vato lehibe izy, ka nanangana izany teo ambanin’ilay hazobe teo akaikin’ny toerana masin’i jehovah.'),
  ('6aadc7621c749ee21b3de7e0', '2026-09-18T23:21:06.159Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:06.159Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Josoa', 6, 24, 25, 'Nanao fifanekena tamin’ny vahoaka àry i Josoa tamin’izay andro izay, ka nametraka lalàna sy fitsipika ho azy ireo tao Sekema.', 'nanao fifanekena tamin’ny vahoaka àry i josoa tamin’izay andro izay, ka nametraka lalàna sy fitsipika ho azy ireo tao sekema.'),
  ('6aadc7621c749ee21b3de7e2', '2026-09-18T23:21:06.159Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:06.159Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Josoa', 6, 24, 27, 'Ary hoy i Josoa tamin’ny olona rehetra: “Ho vavolombelona hiampanga antsika ity vato ity, fa efa henon’izy io izay rehetra nolazain’i Jehovah tamintsika. Io no ho vavolombelona hiampanga anareo, amin’izay ianareo tsy mandà an’Andriamanitrareo.”', 'ary hoy i josoa tamin’ny olona rehetra: “ho vavolombelona hiampanga antsika ity vato ity, fa efa henon’izy io izay rehetra nolazain’i jehovah tamintsika. io no ho vavolombelona hiampanga anareo, amin’izay ianareo tsy mandà an’andriamanitrareo.”'),
  ('6aadc7621c749ee21b3de7d3', '2026-09-18T23:21:06.159Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:06.159Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Josoa', 6, 24, 12, 'Koa mbola tsy tonga tany akory ianareo dia efa nataoko izay hahakivy azy ireny, ka nandositra tsy ho eo anatrehanareo izy ireny, hoatran’ireo mpanjaka amorita roa. Tsy ny sabatrareo na ny tsipìkanareo no nahavita an’izany.', 'koa mbola tsy tonga tany akory ianareo dia efa nataoko izay hahakivy azy ireny, ka nandositra tsy ho eo anatrehanareo izy ireny, hoatran’ireo mpanjaka amorita roa. tsy ny sabatrareo na ny tsipìkanareo no nahavita an’izany.'),
  ('6aadc7621c749ee21b3de7de', '2026-09-18T23:21:06.159Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:06.159Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Josoa', 6, 24, 23, '“Ario àry ny andriamanitry ny firenen-kafa izay eo aminareo, ary manompoa an’i Jehovah Andriamanitry ny Israely amin’ny fonareo manontolo.”', '“ario àry ny andriamanitry ny firenen-kafa izay eo aminareo, ary manompoa an’i jehovah andriamanitry ny israely amin’ny fonareo manontolo.”'),
  ('6aadc7621c749ee21b3de7dd', '2026-09-18T23:21:06.159Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:06.159Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Josoa', 6, 24, 22, 'Hoy àry i Josoa tamin’ny vahoaka: “Ianareo ihany no ho vavolombelona hiampanga anareo, satria sitraponareo ny nifidy hanompo an’i Jehovah.” Dia namaly izy ireo hoe: “Ie, vavolombelona izahay.”', 'hoy àry i josoa tamin’ny vahoaka: “ianareo ihany no ho vavolombelona hiampanga anareo, satria sitraponareo ny nifidy hanompo an’i jehovah.” dia namaly izy ireo hoe: “ie, vavolombelona izahay.”'),
  ('6aadc7621c749ee21b3de7d6', '2026-09-18T23:21:06.159Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:06.159Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Josoa', 6, 24, 15, 'Fa raha ohatra hoe tsy tianareo ny hanompo an’i Jehovah, dia fidio androany izay hotompoinareo, na ny andriamanitra notompoin’ny razambenareo tany ampitan’ny Renirano, na ny andriamanitry ny Amorita nipetraka teto amin’ny tany ipetrahanareo. Fa izaho sy ny ankohonako kosa hanompo an’i Jehovah.”', 'fa raha ohatra hoe tsy tianareo ny hanompo an’i jehovah, dia fidio androany izay hotompoinareo, na ny andriamanitra notompoin’ny razambenareo tany ampitan’ny renirano, na ny andriamanitry ny amorita nipetraka teto amin’ny tany ipetrahanareo. fa izaho sy ny ankohonako kosa hanompo an’i jehovah.”'),
  ('6aadc7621c749ee21b3de7d2', '2026-09-18T23:21:06.159Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:06.159Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Josoa', 6, 24, 11, '“‘Niampita an’i Jordana ianareo avy eo, ka tonga tao Jeriko. Ary niady taminareo ny mpitarika tao Jeriko, sy ny Amorita, ny Perizita, ny Kananita, ny Hetita, ny Girgasita, ny Hivita, ary ny Jebosita. Nataoko resinareo anefa izy ireny.', '“‘niampita an’i jordana ianareo avy eo, ka tonga tao jeriko. ary niady taminareo ny mpitarika tao jeriko, sy ny amorita, ny perizita, ny kananita, ny hetita, ny girgasita, ny hivita, ary ny jebosita. nataoko resinareo anefa izy ireny.'),
  ('6aadc7621c749ee21b3de7d7', '2026-09-18T23:21:06.159Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:06.159Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Josoa', 6, 24, 16, 'Dia hoy ny vahoaka: “Sanatria anay ny hiala amin’i Jehovah ka hanompo andriamani-kafa.', 'dia hoy ny vahoaka: “sanatria anay ny hiala amin’i jehovah ka hanompo andriamani-kafa.'),
  ('6aadc7621c749ee21b3de7d5', '2026-09-18T23:21:06.159Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:06.159Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Josoa', 6, 24, 14, '“Koa matahora an’i Jehovah, ary manompoa azy ka aza mivadika aminy mihitsy. Ario ny andriamanitra notompoin’ny razambenareo tany ampitan’ny Renirano sy tany Ejipta, ka manompoa an’i Jehovah.', '“koa matahora an’i jehovah, ary manompoa azy ka aza mivadika aminy mihitsy. ario ny andriamanitra notompoin’ny razambenareo tany ampitan’ny renirano sy tany ejipta, ka manompoa an’i jehovah.'),
  ('6aadc7621c749ee21b3de7d1', '2026-09-18T23:21:06.159Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:06.159Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Josoa', 6, 24, 10, 'Tsy nihaino an’i Balama anefa aho. Nitso-drano anareo imbetsaka àry izy, ary namonjy anareo teo an-tanany aho.', 'tsy nihaino an’i balama anefa aho. nitso-drano anareo imbetsaka àry izy, ary namonjy anareo teo an-tanany aho.'),
  ('6aadc7621c749ee21b3de7d4', '2026-09-18T23:21:06.159Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:06.159Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Josoa', 6, 24, 13, 'Dia nomeko tany tsy nisasaranareo sy tanàna tsy naorinareo ianareo, ka nanorim-ponenana tao amin’ireny. Ary nihinana vokatra avy tamin’ny tanimboaloboka sy sahan’oliva tsy nambolenareo ianareo.’', 'dia nomeko tany tsy nisasaranareo sy tanàna tsy naorinareo ianareo, ka nanorim-ponenana tao amin’ireny. ary nihinana vokatra avy tamin’ny tanimboaloboka sy sahan’oliva tsy nambolenareo ianareo.’'),
  ('6aadc7621c749ee21b3de7da', '2026-09-18T23:21:06.159Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:06.159Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Josoa', 6, 24, 19, 'Dia hoy i Josoa tamin’ny vahoaka: “Tsy ho vitanareo ny hanompo an’i Jehovah, fa Andriamanitra masina izy sady mitaky ny hanompoana azy irery ihany. Tsy hamela ny helokareo sy ny fahotanareo izy.', 'dia hoy i josoa tamin’ny vahoaka: “tsy ho vitanareo ny hanompo an’i jehovah, fa andriamanitra masina izy sady mitaky ny hanompoana azy irery ihany. tsy hamela ny helokareo sy ny fahotanareo izy.'),
  ('6aadc7621c749ee21b3de7d8', '2026-09-18T23:21:06.159Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:06.159Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Josoa', 6, 24, 17, 'I Jehovah Andriamanitsika mantsy no nitondra antsika sy ny razambentsika niakatra avy tany Ejipta, avy tao amin’ny toerana nanandevozana antsika. Izy no nanao an’ireny famantarana lehibe ireny teo imasontsika, ary niaro antsika foana teny amin’ny lalana rehetra nalehantsika sy teo anivon’ny firenena rehetra nandalovantsika.', 'i jehovah andriamanitsika mantsy no nitondra antsika sy ny razambentsika niakatra avy tany ejipta, avy tao amin’ny toerana nanandevozana antsika. izy no nanao an’ireny famantarana lehibe ireny teo imasontsika, ary niaro antsika foana teny amin’ny lalana rehetra nalehantsika sy teo anivon’ny firenena rehetra nandalovantsika.'),
  ('6aadc7621c749ee21b3de7e5', '2026-09-18T23:21:06.159Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:06.159Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Josoa', 6, 24, 30, 'Koa nalevina tany amin’ny faritra nisy ny lovany izy, izany hoe tao Timnata-heresa, any amin’ny faritra be tendrombohitr’i Efraima, any avaratry ny Tendrombohitra Gasa.', 'koa nalevina tany amin’ny faritra nisy ny lovany izy, izany hoe tao timnata-heresa, any amin’ny faritra be tendrombohitr’i efraima, any avaratry ny tendrombohitra gasa.'),
  ('6aadc7621c749ee21b3de7e8', '2026-09-18T23:21:06.159Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:06.159Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Josoa', 6, 24, 33, 'Maty koa i Eleazara zanak’i Arona. Nalevina tany amin’ny Havoanan’i Finehasa zanany àry izy, dia ilay havoana nomena azy teny amin’ny faritra be tendrombohitr’i Efraima.', 'maty koa i eleazara zanak’i arona. nalevina tany amin’ny havoanan’i finehasa zanany àry izy, dia ilay havoana nomena azy teny amin’ny faritra be tendrombohitr’i efraima.'),
  ('6aadc7621c749ee21b3de7e6', '2026-09-18T23:21:06.159Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:06.159Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Josoa', 6, 24, 31, 'Nanompo an’i Jehovah foana ny Israely tamin’ny andron’i Josoa, sy tamin’ny andron’ireo anti-panahy mbola velona taoriany, dia ireo anti-panahy nahita ny asa rehetra nataon’i Jehovah ho an’ny Israely.', 'nanompo an’i jehovah foana ny israely tamin’ny andron’i josoa, sy tamin’ny andron’ireo anti-panahy mbola velona taoriany, dia ireo anti-panahy nahita ny asa rehetra nataon’i jehovah ho an’ny israely.'),
  ('6aadc7621c749ee21b3de7df', '2026-09-18T23:21:06.159Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:06.159Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Josoa', 6, 24, 24, 'Dia hoy ny vahoaka tamin’i Josoa: “I Jehovah Andriamanitray no hotompoinay, ary izy no hankatoavinay!”', 'dia hoy ny vahoaka tamin’i josoa: “i jehovah andriamanitray no hotompoinay, ary izy no hankatoavinay!”'),
  ('6aadc7621c749ee21b3de7db', '2026-09-18T23:21:06.159Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:06.159Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Josoa', 6, 24, 20, 'Raha miala amin’i Jehovah ianareo ka manompo ny andriamanitry ny firenen-kafa, dia hamely anareo izy ka handringana anareo, na dia efa nanisy soa anareo aza.”', 'raha miala amin’i jehovah ianareo ka manompo ny andriamanitry ny firenen-kafa, dia hamely anareo izy ka handringana anareo, na dia efa nanisy soa anareo aza.”'),
  ('6aadc7621c749ee21b3de7d0', '2026-09-18T23:21:06.159Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:06.159Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Josoa', 6, 24, 9, 'Dia nitsangana hiady tamin’ny Israely i Balaka zanak’i Zipora sady mpanjakan’i Moaba. Nampanantsoiny àry i Balama zanak’i Beora, mba hanozona anareo.', 'dia nitsangana hiady tamin’ny israely i balaka zanak’i zipora sady mpanjakan’i moaba. nampanantsoiny àry i balama zanak’i beora, mba hanozona anareo.'),
  ('6aadc7621c749ee21b3de7dc', '2026-09-18T23:21:06.159Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:06.159Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Josoa', 6, 24, 21, 'Hoy anefa ny vahoaka tamin’i Josoa: “I Jehovah no hotompoinay!”', 'hoy anefa ny vahoaka tamin’i josoa: “i jehovah no hotompoinay!”'),
  ('6aadc7621c749ee21b3de7cf', '2026-09-18T23:21:06.159Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:06.159Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Josoa', 6, 24, 8, '“‘Dia nentiko tany amin’ny tanin’ny Amorita nipetraka teny ampitan’i Jordana ianareo, ary niady taminareo izy ireo. Nataoko resinareo anefa izy ireo, mba ho afaka haka ny taniny ianareo. Ary naringako tsy ho eo anatrehanareo izy ireo.', '“‘dia nentiko tany amin’ny tanin’ny amorita nipetraka teny ampitan’i jordana ianareo, ary niady taminareo izy ireo. nataoko resinareo anefa izy ireo, mba ho afaka haka ny taniny ianareo. ary naringako tsy ho eo anatrehanareo izy ireo.'),
  ('6aadc763c994286a9593410d', '2026-09-18T23:21:07.292Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:07.292Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 1, 6, 'Nandositra anefa i Adoni-bezeka, dia nenjehin’izy ireo ka tratrany ary notapahin’izy ireo ny ankiben-tanany roa sy ny ankiben-tongony roa.', 'nandositra anefa i adoni-bezeka, dia nenjehin’izy ireo ka tratrany ary notapahin’izy ireo ny ankiben-tanany roa sy ny ankiben-tongony roa.'),
  ('6aadc763c994286a9593410b', '2026-09-18T23:21:07.292Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:07.292Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 1, 4, 'Rehefa niakatra ny fokon’i Joda, dia nataon’i Jehovah resiny ny Kananita sy ny Perizita, ka lehilahy 10 000 no resiny tao Bezeka.', 'rehefa niakatra ny fokon’i joda, dia nataon’i jehovah resiny ny kananita sy ny perizita, ka lehilahy 10 000 no resiny tao bezeka.'),
  ('6aadc763c994286a95934108', '2026-09-18T23:21:07.292Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:07.292Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 1, 1, 'Taorian’ny nahafatesan’i Josoa, dia nanontany an’i Jehovah ny Israelita hoe: “Iza aminay no hiakatra voalohany hiady amin’ny Kananita?”', 'taorian’ny nahafatesan’i josoa, dia nanontany an’i jehovah ny israelita hoe: “iza aminay no hiakatra voalohany hiady amin’ny kananita?”'),
  ('6aadc763c994286a9593410a', '2026-09-18T23:21:07.292Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:07.292Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 1, 3, 'Niteny tamin’ny fokon’i Simeona rahalahiny àry ny fokon’i Joda hoe: “Andao hiaraka ho any amin’ny anjara taninay mba hiady amin’ny Kananita, dia mba hiaraka aminareo ho any amin’ny anjara taninareo koa izahay.” Niaraka taminy àry izy ireo.', 'niteny tamin’ny fokon’i simeona rahalahiny àry ny fokon’i joda hoe: “andao hiaraka ho any amin’ny anjara taninay mba hiady amin’ny kananita, dia mba hiaraka aminareo ho any amin’ny anjara taninareo koa izahay.” niaraka taminy àry izy ireo.'),
  ('6aadc763c994286a95934112', '2026-09-18T23:21:07.292Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:07.292Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 1, 11, 'Rehefa avy tany izy ireo, dia nandeha niady tamin’ny mponin’i Debira. Kiriata-sefera no anaran’i Debira talohan’izay.', 'rehefa avy tany izy ireo, dia nandeha niady tamin’ny mponin’i debira. kiriata-sefera no anaran’i debira talohan’izay.'),
  ('6aadc763c994286a95934111', '2026-09-18T23:21:07.292Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:07.292Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 1, 10, 'Nandeha àry ny fokon’i Joda ka niady tamin’ny Kananita nipetraka tany Hebrona, izay nantsoina hoe Kiriata-arba taloha. Dia nasian’izy ireo i Sesay sy Ahimana ary Talmay.', 'nandeha àry ny fokon’i joda ka niady tamin’ny kananita nipetraka tany hebrona, izay nantsoina hoe kiriata-arba taloha. dia nasian’izy ireo i sesay sy ahimana ary talmay.'),
  ('6aadc763c994286a95934110', '2026-09-18T23:21:07.292Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:07.292Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 1, 9, 'Avy eo dia lasa ny fokon’i Joda nandeha niady tamin’ny Kananita nipetraka tany amin’ny faritra be tendrombohitra, sy tany Negeba, ary Sefela.', 'avy eo dia lasa ny fokon’i joda nandeha niady tamin’ny kananita nipetraka tany amin’ny faritra be tendrombohitra, sy tany negeba, ary sefela.'),
  ('6aadc763c994286a9593410f', '2026-09-18T23:21:07.292Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:07.292Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 1, 8, 'Ary niady tamin’ny mponin’i Jerosalema ny taranak’i Joda, ka nandresy an’ilay tanàna. Koa nasian’izy ireo tamin’ny sabatra ny olona nipetraka tao, ary nodorany ny tanàna.', 'ary niady tamin’ny mponin’i jerosalema ny taranak’i joda, ka nandresy an’ilay tanàna. koa nasian’izy ireo tamin’ny sabatra ny olona nipetraka tao, ary nodorany ny tanàna.'),
  ('6aadc763c994286a9593410c', '2026-09-18T23:21:07.292Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:07.292Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 1, 5, 'Hitan’izy ireo tao Bezeka koa i Adoni-bezeka ka notafihiny. Dia resin’izy ireo ny Kananita sy ny Perizita.', 'hitan’izy ireo tao bezeka koa i adoni-bezeka ka notafihiny. dia resin’izy ireo ny kananita sy ny perizita.'),
  ('6aadc763c994286a95934109', '2026-09-18T23:21:07.292Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:07.292Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 1, 2, 'Dia hoy i Jehovah: “Ny fokon’i Joda no hiakatra, ary homeko azy ilay tany.”', 'dia hoy i jehovah: “ny fokon’i joda no hiakatra, ary homeko azy ilay tany.”'),
  ('6aadc763c994286a9593410e', '2026-09-18T23:21:07.292Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:07.292Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 1, 7, 'Dia hoy i Adoni-bezeka: “Misy mpanjaka 70, notapahina ankiben-tanana sy ankiben-tongotra, mitsindroka sakafo ao ambany latabatro. Ny nataoko ihany ity no avalin’Andriamanitra ahy.” Nentin’izy ireo tany Jerosalema izy taorian’izay, ka maty tany.', 'dia hoy i adoni-bezeka: “misy mpanjaka 70, notapahina ankiben-tanana sy ankiben-tongotra, mitsindroka sakafo ao ambany latabatro. ny nataoko ihany ity no avalin’andriamanitra ahy.” nentin’izy ireo tany jerosalema izy taorian’izay, ka maty tany.'),
  ('6aadc763c994286a9593412b', '2026-09-18T23:21:07.293Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:07.293Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 1, 36, 'Ny tanin’ny Amorita, dia nanomboka teo amin’ny fiakarana Akrabima sy tao Sela no ho miakatra.', 'ny tanin’ny amorita, dia nanomboka teo amin’ny fiakarana akrabima sy tao sela no ho miakatra.'),
  ('6aadc763c994286a9593412a', '2026-09-18T23:21:07.293Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:07.293Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 1, 35, 'Ary tsy nety niala tany amin’ny Tendrombohitra Heresa sy tany Aialona ary Salbima ny Amorita. Rehefa nihanahery anefa ny taranak’i Josefa, dia notereny hiasa mafy ny Amorita.', 'ary tsy nety niala tany amin’ny tendrombohitra heresa sy tany aialona ary salbima ny amorita. rehefa nihanahery anefa ny taranak’i josefa, dia notereny hiasa mafy ny amorita.'),
  ('6aadc763c994286a95934121', '2026-09-18T23:21:07.293Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:07.293Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 1, 26, 'Dia nankany amin’ny tanin’ny Hetita ilay lehilahy, ka nanorina tanàna tany. Nantsoiny hoe Lozy ilay izy, ary mbola izany no anarany hatramin’izao.', 'dia nankany amin’ny tanin’ny hetita ilay lehilahy, ka nanorina tanàna tany. nantsoiny hoe lozy ilay izy, ary mbola izany no anarany hatramin’izao.'),
  ('6aadc763c994286a95934120', '2026-09-18T23:21:07.293Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:07.293Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 1, 25, 'Dia natoron’ilay lehilahy azy ireo ny fidirana. Koa nasian’izy ireo tamin’ny sabatra ny tao an-tanàna, fa ilay lehilahy sy ny fianakaviany manontolo kosa navelany handeha.', 'dia natoron’ilay lehilahy azy ireo ny fidirana. koa nasian’izy ireo tamin’ny sabatra ny tao an-tanàna, fa ilay lehilahy sy ny fianakaviany manontolo kosa navelany handeha.'),
  ('6aadc763c994286a95934123', '2026-09-18T23:21:07.293Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:07.293Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 1, 28, 'Rehefa nihanahery ny Israely, dia nampanaoviny asa an-terivozona ny Kananita fa tsy noroahiny daholo.', 'rehefa nihanahery ny israely, dia nampanaoviny asa an-terivozona ny kananita fa tsy noroahiny daholo.'),
  ('6aadc763c994286a9593411f', '2026-09-18T23:21:07.293Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:07.293Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 1, 24, 'Nahita lehilahy iray nivoaka avy tao an-tanàna ireo olona nitsikilo an’ilay tanàna, ka niteny hoe: “Mba atoroy anay, azafady, ny fidirana mankao an-tanàna, dia tsy hataonay na inona na inona ianao.”', 'nahita lehilahy iray nivoaka avy tao an-tanàna ireo olona nitsikilo an’ilay tanàna, ka niteny hoe: “mba atoroy anay, azafady, ny fidirana mankao an-tanàna, dia tsy hataonay na inona na inona ianao.”'),
  ('6aadc763c994286a9593411e', '2026-09-18T23:21:07.293Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:07.293Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 1, 23, 'Dia nitsikilo an’ilay tanàna ny taranak’i Josefa.—Lozy no anaran’i Betela talohan’izay.—', 'dia nitsikilo an’ilay tanàna ny taranak’i josefa.—lozy no anaran’i betela talohan’izay.—'),
  ('6aadc763c994286a9593411d', '2026-09-18T23:21:07.293Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:07.293Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 1, 22, 'Niakatra hiady tamin’i Betela ny taranak’i Josefa nandritra izany fotoana izany, ary nanampy azy ireo i Jehovah.', 'niakatra hiady tamin’i betela ny taranak’i josefa nandritra izany fotoana izany, ary nanampy azy ireo i jehovah.'),
  ('6aadc763c994286a9593411b', '2026-09-18T23:21:07.293Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:07.293Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 1, 20, 'Dia nomena an’i Kaleba i Hebrona, araka ny nampanantenain’i Mosesy, ka noroahiny hiala tao ny zanak’i Anàka telo lahy.', 'dia nomena an’i kaleba i hebrona, araka ny nampanantenain’i mosesy, ka noroahiny hiala tao ny zanak’i anàka telo lahy.'),
  ('6aadc763c994286a95934126', '2026-09-18T23:21:07.293Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:07.293Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 1, 31, 'Tsy noroahin’ny fokon’i Asera koa ny mponin’i Ako, sy ny mponin’i Sidona, Alaba, Akziba, Helba, Afika, ary Rehoba.', 'tsy noroahin’ny fokon’i asera koa ny mponin’i ako, sy ny mponin’i sidona, alaba, akziba, helba, afika, ary rehoba.'),
  ('6aadc763c994286a95934125', '2026-09-18T23:21:07.293Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:07.293Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 1, 30, 'Tsy noroahin’ny fokon’i Zebolona ny olona nipetraka tany Kitrona sy Nahalola. Dia niara-nipetraka tamin’izy ireo ihany ny Kananita, ka nampanaoviny asa an-terivozona.', 'tsy noroahin’ny fokon’i zebolona ny olona nipetraka tany kitrona sy nahalola. dia niara-nipetraka tamin’izy ireo ihany ny kananita, ka nampanaoviny asa an-terivozona.'),
  ('6aadc763c994286a95934124', '2026-09-18T23:21:07.293Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:07.293Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 1, 29, 'Tsy noroahin’ny fokon’i Efraima koa ny Kananita nipetraka tao Gazera, ka mbola niara-nipetraka tamin’izy ireo tao izy ireny.', 'tsy noroahin’ny fokon’i efraima koa ny kananita nipetraka tao gazera, ka mbola niara-nipetraka tamin’izy ireo tao izy ireny.'),
  ('6aadc763c994286a95934113', '2026-09-18T23:21:07.293Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:07.293Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 1, 12, 'Dia hoy i Kaleba: “Izay lehilahy maharesy an’i Kiriata-sefera ka mahazo an’io tanàna io, dia homeko ho vadiny i Aksa zanako vavy.”', 'dia hoy i kaleba: “izay lehilahy maharesy an’i kiriata-sefera ka mahazo an’io tanàna io, dia homeko ho vadiny i aksa zanako vavy.”'),
  ('6aadc763c994286a9593411c', '2026-09-18T23:21:07.293Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:07.293Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 1, 21, 'Tsy noroahin’ny Benjaminita kosa ny Jebosita nipetraka tao Jerosalema, fa mbola miara-mipetraka amin’izy ireo ao ihany hatramin’izao.', 'tsy noroahin’ny benjaminita kosa ny jebosita nipetraka tao jerosalema, fa mbola miara-mipetraka amin’izy ireo ao ihany hatramin’izao.'),
  ('6aadc763c994286a95934114', '2026-09-18T23:21:07.293Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:07.293Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 1, 13, 'I Otniela, zanak’i Kenaza zandrin’i Kaleba, no nahazo an’ilay tanàna, ka nomen’i Kaleba azy ho vadiny i Aksa zanany vavy.', 'i otniela, zanak’i kenaza zandrin’i kaleba, no nahazo an’ilay tanàna, ka nomen’i kaleba azy ho vadiny i aksa zanany vavy.'),
  ('6aadc763c994286a95934122', '2026-09-18T23:21:07.293Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:07.293Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 1, 27, 'Tsy vitan’ny fokon’i Manase ny naka an’i Beti-sana sy ny tanàna niankina taminy, Tanàka sy ny tanàna niankina taminy, Dora sy ny tanàna niankina taminy, Ibleama sy ny tanàna niankina taminy, ary Megido sy ny tanàna niankina taminy. Tsy nety niala tao amin’izany tany izany ny Kananita.', 'tsy vitan’ny fokon’i manase ny naka an’i beti-sana sy ny tanàna niankina taminy, tanàka sy ny tanàna niankina taminy, dora sy ny tanàna niankina taminy, ibleama sy ny tanàna niankina taminy, ary megido sy ny tanàna niankina taminy. tsy nety niala tao amin’izany tany izany ny kananita.'),
  ('6aadc763c994286a9593411a', '2026-09-18T23:21:07.293Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:07.293Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 1, 19, 'Nampian’i Jehovah ny fokon’i Joda, ka azon’izy ireo ny faritra be tendrombohitra. Tsy vitan’izy ireo anefa ny nandroaka ny olona nipetraka teny amin’ny tany lemaka, satria nanana kalesin’ady misy lelan’antsy izy ireny.', 'nampian’i jehovah ny fokon’i joda, ka azon’izy ireo ny faritra be tendrombohitra. tsy vitan’izy ireo anefa ny nandroaka ny olona nipetraka teny amin’ny tany lemaka, satria nanana kalesin’ady misy lelan’antsy izy ireny.'),
  ('6aadc763c994286a95934118', '2026-09-18T23:21:07.293Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:07.293Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 1, 17, 'Niaraka tamin’ny fokon’i Joda ny fokon’i Simeona rahalahiny, mba hanafika ny Kananita nipetraka tany Zefata. Dia noravany tanteraka ilay tanàna, ka nantsoiny hoe Horma.', 'niaraka tamin’ny fokon’i joda ny fokon’i simeona rahalahiny, mba hanafika ny kananita nipetraka tany zefata. dia noravany tanteraka ilay tanàna, ka nantsoiny hoe horma.'),
  ('6aadc763c994286a95934128', '2026-09-18T23:21:07.293Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:07.293Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 1, 33, 'Tsy noroahin’ny fokon’i Naftaly ireo mponin’i Beti-semesy sy Beti-anata. Mbola niara-nipetraka tamin’ny Kananita teo amin’ilay tany ihany izy ireo. Dia nampanaovin’ny fokon’i Naftaly asa an-terivozona ny mponin’i Beti-semesy sy Beti-anata.', 'tsy noroahin’ny fokon’i naftaly ireo mponin’i beti-semesy sy beti-anata. mbola niara-nipetraka tamin’ny kananita teo amin’ilay tany ihany izy ireo. dia nampanaovin’ny fokon’i naftaly asa an-terivozona ny mponin’i beti-semesy sy beti-anata.'),
  ('6aadc763c994286a95934127', '2026-09-18T23:21:07.293Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:07.293Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 1, 32, 'Mbola niara-nipetraka tamin’ny Kananita tao amin’ilay tany ihany ny fokon’i Asera, satria tsy noroahiny ireny.', 'mbola niara-nipetraka tamin’ny kananita tao amin’ilay tany ihany ny fokon’i asera, satria tsy noroahiny ireny.'),
  ('6aadc763c994286a95934119', '2026-09-18T23:21:07.293Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:07.293Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 1, 18, 'Azon’ny fokon’i Joda koa i Gaza sy ny faritra manodidina azy, Askelona sy ny faritra manodidina azy, ary Ekrona sy ny faritra manodidina azy.', 'azon’ny fokon’i joda koa i gaza sy ny faritra manodidina azy, askelona sy ny faritra manodidina azy, ary ekrona sy ny faritra manodidina azy.'),
  ('6aadc763c994286a95934115', '2026-09-18T23:21:07.293Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:07.293Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 1, 14, 'Rehefa nankany an-tranon’i Otniela i Aksa, dia nampirisihiny hangataka saha tamin’i Kaleba rainy i Otniela. Dia niala teo ambony ampondrany i Aksa, ka hoy ny rainy: “Inona no ilainao?”', 'rehefa nankany an-tranon’i otniela i aksa, dia nampirisihiny hangataka saha tamin’i kaleba rainy i otniela. dia niala teo ambony ampondrany i aksa, ka hoy ny rainy: “inona no ilainao?”'),
  ('6aadc763c994286a95934117', '2026-09-18T23:21:07.293Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:07.293Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 1, 16, 'Niara-niakatra avy tany amin’ny tanàna be hazo palmie ny taranak’ilay Kenita rafozandahin’i Mosesy sy ny taranak’i Joda. Dia nankany an-tany efitr’i Joda, tany atsimon’i Arada, izy ireo ka niara-nipetraka tamin’ny olona tany.', 'niara-niakatra avy tany amin’ny tanàna be hazo palmie ny taranak’ilay kenita rafozandahin’i mosesy sy ny taranak’i joda. dia nankany an-tany efitr’i joda, tany atsimon’i arada, izy ireo ka niara-nipetraka tamin’ny olona tany.'),
  ('6aadc763c994286a95934129', '2026-09-18T23:21:07.293Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:07.293Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 1, 34, 'Tsy afaka niala tany amin’ny faritra be tendrombohitra ny taranak’i Dana, satria tsy navelan’ny Amorita nidina teny amin’ny tany lemaka.', 'tsy afaka niala tany amin’ny faritra be tendrombohitra ny taranak’i dana, satria tsy navelan’ny amorita nidina teny amin’ny tany lemaka.'),
  ('6aadc763c994286a95934116', '2026-09-18T23:21:07.293Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:07.293Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 1, 15, 'Dia hoy i Aksa: “Mba omeo fanomezana aho, azafady. Efa nomenao tany kely any atsimo ihany aho, fa mba omeo ahy koa i Golota-maima.” Dia nomen’i Kaleba azy i Golota Ambony sy Golota Ambany.', 'dia hoy i aksa: “mba omeo fanomezana aho, azafady. efa nomenao tany kely any atsimo ihany aho, fa mba omeo ahy koa i golota-maima.” dia nomen’i kaleba azy i golota ambony sy golota ambany.'),
  ('6aadc76359883c516532a9bd', '2026-09-18T23:21:07.827Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:07.827Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 2, 22, 'Izany no hataoko amin’ny Israely mba hahitako raha hanaraka ny lalan’i Jehovah foana, hoatran’ny nataon’ny razambeny, izy na tsia.”', 'izany no hataoko amin’ny israely mba hahitako raha hanaraka ny lalan’i jehovah foana, hoatran’ny nataon’ny razambeny, izy na tsia.”'),
  ('6aadc76359883c516532a9a9', '2026-09-18T23:21:07.827Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:07.827Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 2, 2, 'Ianareo kosa tsy tokony hanao fifanekena amin’ny olona mipetraka eto amin’ity tany ity. Tokony harodanareo koa ny alitarany.’ Tsy nanaraka ny teniko anefa ianareo. Fa maninona ianareo no nanao an’izany?', 'ianareo kosa tsy tokony hanao fifanekena amin’ny olona mipetraka eto amin’ity tany ity. tokony harodanareo koa ny alitarany.’ tsy nanaraka ny teniko anefa ianareo. fa maninona ianareo no nanao an’izany?'),
  ('6aadc76359883c516532a9be', '2026-09-18T23:21:07.827Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:07.827Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 2, 23, 'Navelan’i Jehovah teo amin’izy ireo foana àry ireo firenena ireo. Tsy tonga dia noroahiny izy ireo sady tsy nataony resin’i Josoa.', 'navelan’i jehovah teo amin’izy ireo foana àry ireo firenena ireo. tsy tonga dia noroahiny izy ireo sady tsy nataony resin’i josoa.'),
  ('6aadc76359883c516532a9bb', '2026-09-18T23:21:07.827Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:07.827Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 2, 20, 'Dia tezitra be tamin’ny Israely i Jehovah tamin’ny farany, ka hoy izy: “Satria ity firenena ity tsy nanaja ny fifanekena nataoko tamin’ny razambeny sady tsy nankatò ahy,', 'dia tezitra be tamin’ny israely i jehovah tamin’ny farany, ka hoy izy: “satria ity firenena ity tsy nanaja ny fifanekena nataoko tamin’ny razambeny sady tsy nankatò ahy,'),
  ('6aadc76359883c516532a9b6', '2026-09-18T23:21:07.827Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:07.827Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 2, 15, 'Nosazin’i Jehovah izy ireo ka nisy loza nanjo azy, na taiza na taiza nalehany. Izany mantsy no efa nolazain’i Jehovah, ary efa nianiana tamin’izy ireo i Jehovah hoe hanao an’izany. Dia nijaly be izy ireo.', 'nosazin’i jehovah izy ireo ka nisy loza nanjo azy, na taiza na taiza nalehany. izany mantsy no efa nolazain’i jehovah, ary efa nianiana tamin’izy ireo i jehovah hoe hanao an’izany. dia nijaly be izy ireo.'),
  ('6aadc76359883c516532a9b2', '2026-09-18T23:21:07.827Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:07.827Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 2, 11, 'Ary nanao izay ratsy teo imason’i Jehovah ny Israelita ka nanompo an’ireo Bala.', 'ary nanao izay ratsy teo imason’i jehovah ny israelita ka nanompo an’ireo bala.'),
  ('6aadc76359883c516532a9b5', '2026-09-18T23:21:07.827Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:07.827Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 2, 14, 'Dia tezitra be tamin’ny Israely i Jehovah, ka navelany handroba azy ireo ny mpandroba. Navelany ho resin’ny fahavalo manodidina azy koa izy ireo, ka tsy nahavita nanohitra an’ireny intsony.', 'dia tezitra be tamin’ny israely i jehovah, ka navelany handroba azy ireo ny mpandroba. navelany ho resin’ny fahavalo manodidina azy koa izy ireo, ka tsy nahavita nanohitra an’ireny intsony.'),
  ('6aadc76359883c516532a9a8', '2026-09-18T23:21:07.827Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:07.827Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 2, 1, 'Ary nisy anjelin’i Jehovah niakatra avy tany Gilgala ka nankany Bokima. Dia hoy izy: “Avy tany Ejipta ianareo no nentiko nankatỳ amin’ity tany ity. Efa nianiana tamin’ny razambenareo mantsy aho hoe hitondra anareo atỳ. Izao koa no nolazaiko taminareo: ‘Tsy hivadika amin’ny fifanekena nataoko taminareo mihitsy aho.', 'ary nisy anjelin’i jehovah niakatra avy tany gilgala ka nankany bokima. dia hoy izy: “avy tany ejipta ianareo no nentiko nankatỳ amin’ity tany ity. efa nianiana tamin’ny razambenareo mantsy aho hoe hitondra anareo atỳ. izao koa no nolazaiko taminareo: ‘tsy hivadika amin’ny fifanekena nataoko taminareo mihitsy aho.'),
  ('6aadc76359883c516532a9b9', '2026-09-18T23:21:07.827Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:07.827Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 2, 18, 'Rehefa nisy mpitsara notendren’i Jehovah ho azy ireo, dia nampian’i Jehovah ilay mpitsara. Namonjy azy ireo tamin’ny fahavalony Izy, tamin’ilay mpitsara mbola velona. Nalahelo mantsy i Jehovah rehefa naheno azy ireo nitaraina satria nisy nampijaly.', 'rehefa nisy mpitsara notendren’i jehovah ho azy ireo, dia nampian’i jehovah ilay mpitsara. namonjy azy ireo tamin’ny fahavalony izy, tamin’ilay mpitsara mbola velona. nalahelo mantsy i jehovah rehefa naheno azy ireo nitaraina satria nisy nampijaly.'),
  ('6aadc76359883c516532a9bc', '2026-09-18T23:21:07.827Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:07.827Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 2, 21, 'dia tsy hisy horoahiko hiala eo aminy, na iray aza, ireo firenena tsy resin’i Josoa talohan’ny nahafatesany.', 'dia tsy hisy horoahiko hiala eo aminy, na iray aza, ireo firenena tsy resin’i josoa talohan’ny nahafatesany.'),
  ('6aadc76359883c516532a9af', '2026-09-18T23:21:07.827Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:07.827Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 2, 8, 'Dia maty i Josoa zanak’i Nona, mpanompon’i Jehovah, rehefa 110 taona.', 'dia maty i josoa zanak’i nona, mpanompon’i jehovah, rehefa 110 taona.'),
  ('6aadc76359883c516532a9b7', '2026-09-18T23:21:07.827Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:07.827Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 2, 16, 'Nanendry mpitsara àry i Jehovah mba hamonjy azy ireo amin’ny mpandroba.', 'nanendry mpitsara àry i jehovah mba hamonjy azy ireo amin’ny mpandroba.'),
  ('6aadc76359883c516532a9ba', '2026-09-18T23:21:07.827Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:07.827Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 2, 19, 'Rehefa maty anefa ilay mpitsara, dia nanao ratsy indray izy ireo ary ratsy noho ny nataon’ny razambeny aza no nataony. Nivavaka tamin’ny andriamani-kafa izy ireo ary niankohoka taminy. Tsy niala tamin’ny fanaony izy ireo, sady mafy loha.', 'rehefa maty anefa ilay mpitsara, dia nanao ratsy indray izy ireo ary ratsy noho ny nataon’ny razambeny aza no nataony. nivavaka tamin’ny andriamani-kafa izy ireo ary niankohoka taminy. tsy niala tamin’ny fanaony izy ireo, sady mafy loha.'),
  ('6aadc76359883c516532a9ae', '2026-09-18T23:21:07.827Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:07.827Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 2, 7, 'Ary nanompo an’i Jehovah foana ny vahoaka tamin’i Josoa mbola velona. Nanao an’izany foana koa izy ireo taorian’ny nahafatesan’i Josoa, tamin’ny mbola velona ireo anti-panahy nahita ny asa lehibe rehetra nataon’i Jehovah ho an’ny Israely.', 'ary nanompo an’i jehovah foana ny vahoaka tamin’i josoa mbola velona. nanao an’izany foana koa izy ireo taorian’ny nahafatesan’i josoa, tamin’ny mbola velona ireo anti-panahy nahita ny asa lehibe rehetra nataon’i jehovah ho an’ny israely.'),
  ('6aadc76359883c516532a9ac', '2026-09-18T23:21:07.827Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:07.827Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 2, 5, 'Dia nataon’izy ireo hoe Bokima ny anaran’ilay toerana, ary nanao sorona ho an’i Jehovah teo izy ireo.', 'dia nataon’izy ireo hoe bokima ny anaran’ilay toerana, ary nanao sorona ho an’i jehovah teo izy ireo.'),
  ('6aadc76359883c516532a9ad', '2026-09-18T23:21:07.827Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:07.827Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 2, 6, 'Rehefa nalefan’i Josoa ny Israelita, dia samy nandeha naka ny anjara lovany.', 'rehefa nalefan’i josoa ny israelita, dia samy nandeha naka ny anjara lovany.'),
  ('6aadc76359883c516532a9b4', '2026-09-18T23:21:07.827Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:07.827Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 2, 13, 'Niala tamin’i Jehovah ny Israelita, ary i Bala sy ireo sarin’i Astarta indray no nivavahany.', 'niala tamin’i jehovah ny israelita, ary i bala sy ireo sarin’i astarta indray no nivavahany.'),
  ('6aadc76359883c516532a9b8', '2026-09-18T23:21:07.827Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:07.827Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 2, 17, 'Na ireny mpitsara ireny aza anefa tsy nohenoiny, fa naleony nanompo andriamani-kafa sy niankohoka tamin’izy ireny. Vetivety izy ireo dia tsy nanao intsony hoatran’ny nataon’ny razambeny, izay nankatò ny didin’i Jehovah. Tsy mba nanao hoatr’izany izy ireo.', 'na ireny mpitsara ireny aza anefa tsy nohenoiny, fa naleony nanompo andriamani-kafa sy niankohoka tamin’izy ireny. vetivety izy ireo dia tsy nanao intsony hoatran’ny nataon’ny razambeny, izay nankatò ny didin’i jehovah. tsy mba nanao hoatr’izany izy ireo.'),
  ('6aadc76359883c516532a9b3', '2026-09-18T23:21:07.827Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:07.827Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 2, 12, 'Dia niala tamin’i Jehovah Andriamanitry ny razambeny, izay nitondra azy nivoaka avy tany Ejipta, izy ireo. Lasa nanompo andriamani-kafa izy ireo, izany hoe ny andriamanitry ny firenena manodidina. Dia tezitra i Jehovah satria niankohoka tamin’ireny izy ireo.', 'dia niala tamin’i jehovah andriamanitry ny razambeny, izay nitondra azy nivoaka avy tany ejipta, izy ireo. lasa nanompo andriamani-kafa izy ireo, izany hoe ny andriamanitry ny firenena manodidina. dia tezitra i jehovah satria niankohoka tamin’ireny izy ireo.'),
  ('6aadc76359883c516532a9b1', '2026-09-18T23:21:07.827Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:07.827Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 2, 10, 'Dia nangonina any amin’ny razambeny daholo izany taranaka rehetra izany, ary nisy taranaka hafa indray nandimby azy ireo. Tsy nahalala an’i Jehovah sy ny asa nataony ho an’ny Israely anefa ireo taranaka tatỳ aoriana ireo.', 'dia nangonina any amin’ny razambeny daholo izany taranaka rehetra izany, ary nisy taranaka hafa indray nandimby azy ireo. tsy nahalala an’i jehovah sy ny asa nataony ho an’ny israely anefa ireo taranaka tatỳ aoriana ireo.'),
  ('6aadc76359883c516532a9b0', '2026-09-18T23:21:07.827Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:07.827Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 2, 9, 'Tany amin’ny faritra nisy ny lovany àry izy no nalevina, izany hoe tao Timnata-heresa, any amin’ny faritra be tendrombohitr’i Efraima, any avaratry ny Tendrombohitra Gasa.', 'tany amin’ny faritra nisy ny lovany àry izy no nalevina, izany hoe tao timnata-heresa, any amin’ny faritra be tendrombohitr’i efraima, any avaratry ny tendrombohitra gasa.'),
  ('6aadc76359883c516532a9ab', '2026-09-18T23:21:07.827Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:07.827Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 2, 4, 'Rehefa avy niteny an’izany tamin’ny Israelita rehetra ilay anjelin’i Jehovah, dia nigogogogo nitomany ny vahoaka.', 'rehefa avy niteny an’izany tamin’ny israelita rehetra ilay anjelin’i jehovah, dia nigogogogo nitomany ny vahoaka.'),
  ('6aadc76359883c516532a9aa', '2026-09-18T23:21:07.827Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:07.827Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 2, 3, 'Izany koa no nahatonga ahy hiteny hoe: ‘Tsy horoahiko eo anoloanareo izy ireny ka hamandrika anareo. Dia ho voatarika hanompo ny andriamaniny ianareo.’”', 'izany koa no nahatonga ahy hiteny hoe: ‘tsy horoahiko eo anoloanareo izy ireny ka hamandrika anareo. dia ho voatarika hanompo ny andriamaniny ianareo.’”'),
  ('6aadc764b341655091a5f856', '2026-09-18T23:21:08.574Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:08.574Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 4, 14, 'Ary hoy i Debora tamin’i Baraka: “Mitsangàna fa hataon’i Jehovah resinao i Sisera androany. Tsy i Jehovah ve no mitarika anao?” Dia nidina avy tany an-tendrombohitra Tabara i Baraka sy ireo lehilahy 10 000 niaraka taminy.', 'ary hoy i debora tamin’i baraka: “mitsangàna fa hataon’i jehovah resinao i sisera androany. tsy i jehovah ve no mitarika anao?” dia nidina avy tany an-tendrombohitra tabara i baraka sy ireo lehilahy 10 000 niaraka taminy.'),
  ('6aadc764b341655091a5f851', '2026-09-18T23:21:08.574Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:08.574Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 4, 9, 'Dia hoy i Debora: “Ao fa hiaraka aminao aho! Tsy ianao anefa no hahazo voninahitra amin’ity fanafihana hataonao ity. Vehivavy mantsy no hataon’i Jehovah mandresy an’i Sisera.” Dia nitsangana i Debora ka niaraka tamin’i Baraka ho any Kedesy.', 'dia hoy i debora: “ao fa hiaraka aminao aho! tsy ianao anefa no hahazo voninahitra amin’ity fanafihana hataonao ity. vehivavy mantsy no hataon’i jehovah mandresy an’i sisera.” dia nitsangana i debora ka niaraka tamin’i baraka ho any kedesy.'),
  ('6aadc764b341655091a5f84c', '2026-09-18T23:21:08.574Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:08.574Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 4, 4, 'Ary i Debora mpaminanivavy, vadin’i Lapidota, no nitsara ny Israely tamin’izany fotoana izany.', 'ary i debora mpaminanivavy, vadin’i lapidota, no nitsara ny israely tamin’izany fotoana izany.'),
  ('6aadc764b341655091a5f85f', '2026-09-18T23:21:08.574Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:08.574Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 4, 23, 'Nataon’Andriamanitra resin’ny Israelita àry i Jabina mpanjakan’i Kanana, tamin’izay andro izay.', 'nataon’andriamanitra resin’ny israelita àry i jabina mpanjakan’i kanana, tamin’izay andro izay.'),
  ('6aadc764b341655091a5f853', '2026-09-18T23:21:08.574Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:08.574Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 4, 11, 'Ary efa tsy niaraka tamin’ny Kenita taranak’i Hobaba intsony i Hebera Kenita. Rafozandahin’i Mosesy io Hobaba io. Teo akaikin’ilay hazobe tao Zananima any Kedesy i Hebera no nanangana ny tranolainy.', 'ary efa tsy niaraka tamin’ny kenita taranak’i hobaba intsony i hebera kenita. rafozandahin’i mosesy io hobaba io. teo akaikin’ilay hazobe tao zananima any kedesy i hebera no nanangana ny tranolainy.'),
  ('6aadc764b341655091a5f850', '2026-09-18T23:21:08.574Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:08.574Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 4, 8, 'Dia hoy i Baraka tamin’i Debora: “Handeha aho raha miaraka amiko ianao, fa raha tsy mandeha ianao, dia tsy handeha koa aho.”', 'dia hoy i baraka tamin’i debora: “handeha aho raha miaraka amiko ianao, fa raha tsy mandeha ianao, dia tsy handeha koa aho.”'),
  ('6aadc764b341655091a5f84a', '2026-09-18T23:21:08.574Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:08.574Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 4, 2, 'Navelan’i Jehovah ho resin’i Jabina mpanjakan’i Kanana àry izy ireo. Tao Hazora i Jabina no nanjaka, ary i Sisera no lehiben’ny tafiny. Tao Harosetan’ireo firenena kosa i Sisera no nipetraka.', 'navelan’i jehovah ho resin’i jabina mpanjakan’i kanana àry izy ireo. tao hazora i jabina no nanjaka, ary i sisera no lehiben’ny tafiny. tao harosetan’ireo firenena kosa i sisera no nipetraka.'),
  ('6aadc764b341655091a5f860', '2026-09-18T23:21:08.574Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:08.574Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 4, 24, 'Ary niady tamin’i Jabina mpanjakan’i Kanana ny Israelita. Nihamafy foana izany ady izany, mandra-pamonony an’i Jabina mpanjakan’i Kanana.', 'ary niady tamin’i jabina mpanjakan’i kanana ny israelita. nihamafy foana izany ady izany, mandra-pamonony an’i jabina mpanjakan’i kanana.'),
  ('6aadc764b341655091a5f85d', '2026-09-18T23:21:08.574Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:08.574Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 4, 21, 'Reraka be i Sisera tamin’izay ka natory be. Naka fantsika be fanenjanan-day sy marotoa anefa i Jaela vadin’i Hebera. Dia nitsaitsaika nankeo amin’i Sisera izy ary natsatony teo amin’ny fihirifany ilay fantsika be, ka nokapohiny hilentika hatrany anaty tany. Dia maty i Sisera.', 'reraka be i sisera tamin’izay ka natory be. naka fantsika be fanenjanan-day sy marotoa anefa i jaela vadin’i hebera. dia nitsaitsaika nankeo amin’i sisera izy ary natsatony teo amin’ny fihirifany ilay fantsika be, ka nokapohiny hilentika hatrany anaty tany. dia maty i sisera.'),
  ('6aadc764b341655091a5f85c', '2026-09-18T23:21:08.574Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:08.574Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 4, 20, 'Hoy koa i Sisera taminy: “Mitsangàna eo amin’ny fidirana amin’ny tranolay, dia raha misy olona tonga eo ka manontany anao hoe: ‘Sao dia ao ilay lehilahy tadiavinay?’, dia valio hoe: ‘Tsisy an’izany ato.’”', 'hoy koa i sisera taminy: “mitsangàna eo amin’ny fidirana amin’ny tranolay, dia raha misy olona tonga eo ka manontany anao hoe: ‘sao dia ao ilay lehilahy tadiavinay?’, dia valio hoe: ‘tsisy an’izany ato.’”'),
  ('6aadc764b341655091a5f84e', '2026-09-18T23:21:08.574Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:08.574Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 4, 6, 'Ary naniraka olona ho any amin’i Baraka zanak’i Abinoama tany Kedesi-naftaly i Debora, mba hiteny aminy hoe: “Efa nandidy anao i Jehovah Andriamanitry ny Israely hoe: ‘Mandehana any amin’ny Tendrombohitra Tabara, ary makà lehilahy 10 000 eo amin’ny taranak’i Naftaly sy Zebolona mba hiaraka aminao.', 'ary naniraka olona ho any amin’i baraka zanak’i abinoama tany kedesi-naftaly i debora, mba hiteny aminy hoe: “efa nandidy anao i jehovah andriamanitry ny israely hoe: ‘mandehana any amin’ny tendrombohitra tabara, ary makà lehilahy 10 000 eo amin’ny taranak’i naftaly sy zebolona mba hiaraka aminao.'),
  ('6aadc764b341655091a5f85b', '2026-09-18T23:21:08.574Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:08.574Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 4, 19, 'Ary hoy i Sisera taminy: “Mba omeo rano kely aho azafady, fa mangetaheta.” Dia nanokatra siny hoditra fasiana ronono i Jaela, ary nomeny ronono izy hosotroiny. Dia norakofan’i Jaela indray izy avy eo.', 'ary hoy i sisera taminy: “mba omeo rano kely aho azafady, fa mangetaheta.” dia nanokatra siny hoditra fasiana ronono i jaela, ary nomeny ronono izy hosotroiny. dia norakofan’i jaela indray izy avy eo.'),
  ('6aadc764b341655091a5f859', '2026-09-18T23:21:08.574Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:08.574Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 4, 17, 'Fa i Sisera kosa nandositra nankany amin’ny tranolain’i Jaela vadin’i Hebera Kenita, satria nihavana tsara i Jabina mpanjakan’i Hazora sy ny fianakavian’i Hebera Kenita.', 'fa i sisera kosa nandositra nankany amin’ny tranolain’i jaela vadin’i hebera kenita, satria nihavana tsara i jabina mpanjakan’i hazora sy ny fianakavian’i hebera kenita.'),
  ('6aadc764b341655091a5f84d', '2026-09-18T23:21:08.574Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:08.574Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 4, 5, 'Fanaony ny nipetraka teo ambanin’ny hazo palmie iray, izay teo anelanelan’i Rama sy Betela, tany amin’ny faritra be tendrombohitr’i Efraima. Ary niakatra nankany aminy ny Israelita rehefa te hahafantatra ny didim-pitsaran’Andriamanitra.', 'fanaony ny nipetraka teo ambanin’ny hazo palmie iray, izay teo anelanelan’i rama sy betela, tany amin’ny faritra be tendrombohitr’i efraima. ary niakatra nankany aminy ny israelita rehefa te hahafantatra ny didim-pitsaran’andriamanitra.'),
  ('6aadc764b341655091a5f85a', '2026-09-18T23:21:08.574Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:08.574Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 4, 18, 'Dia nitsena an’i Sisera i Jaela, ka niteny hoe: “Mandrosoa tompoko! Mandrosoa ato fa aza matahotra.” Dia niditra tao amin’ilay tranolay i Sisera ary norakofan’i Jaela bodofotsy izy.', 'dia nitsena an’i sisera i jaela, ka niteny hoe: “mandrosoa tompoko! mandrosoa ato fa aza matahotra.” dia niditra tao amin’ilay tranolay i sisera ary norakofan’i jaela bodofotsy izy.'),
  ('6aadc764b341655091a5f858', '2026-09-18T23:21:08.574Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:08.574Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 4, 16, 'Dia nenjehin’i Baraka hatrany Harosetan’ireo firenena ireo kalesy fitondra miady sy ny miaramila. Matin’ny sabatra daholo ny miaramilan’i Sisera, ka tsy nisy niangana na iray aza.', 'dia nenjehin’i baraka hatrany harosetan’ireo firenena ireo kalesy fitondra miady sy ny miaramila. matin’ny sabatra daholo ny miaramilan’i sisera, ka tsy nisy niangana na iray aza.'),
  ('6aadc764b341655091a5f84f', '2026-09-18T23:21:08.574Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:08.574Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 4, 7, 'Ary hoentiko any aminao, any amin’ny reniranon’i Kisona, i Sisera lehiben’ny tafik’i Jabina sy ireo kalesy fitondrany miady ary ny miaramilany. Dia hataoko resinao izy.’”', 'ary hoentiko any aminao, any amin’ny reniranon’i kisona, i sisera lehiben’ny tafik’i jabina sy ireo kalesy fitondrany miady ary ny miaramilany. dia hataoko resinao izy.’”'),
  ('6aadc764b341655091a5f857', '2026-09-18T23:21:08.574Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:08.574Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 4, 15, 'Ary nataon’i Jehovah nifanaritaka, teo anoloan’ny sabatr’i Baraka, i Sisera sy ny kalesy rehetra fitondrany miady ary ny miaramilany rehetra. Dia nidina niala tamin’ny kalesiny i Sisera tamin’ny farany, ka lasa nandositra.', 'ary nataon’i jehovah nifanaritaka, teo anoloan’ny sabatr’i baraka, i sisera sy ny kalesy rehetra fitondrany miady ary ny miaramilany rehetra. dia nidina niala tamin’ny kalesiny i sisera tamin’ny farany, ka lasa nandositra.'),
  ('6aadc764b341655091a5f84b', '2026-09-18T23:21:08.574Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:08.574Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 4, 3, 'Dia nitaraina tamin’i Jehovah ny Israelita, satria nanana kalesin’ady 900 nisy lelan’antsy i Jabina, ary nampijaly be azy ireo izy nandritra ny 20 taona.', 'dia nitaraina tamin’i jehovah ny israelita, satria nanana kalesin’ady 900 nisy lelan’antsy i jabina, ary nampijaly be azy ireo izy nandritra ny 20 taona.'),
  ('6aadc764b341655091a5f852', '2026-09-18T23:21:08.574Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:08.574Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 4, 10, 'Ary nantsoin’i Baraka ho any Kedesy ny taranak’i Zebolona sy Naftaly, ka lehilahy 10 000 no tonga nanaraka azy. Niaraka taminy koa i Debora.', 'ary nantsoin’i baraka ho any kedesy ny taranak’i zebolona sy naftaly, ka lehilahy 10 000 no tonga nanaraka azy. niaraka taminy koa i debora.'),
  ('6aadc764b341655091a5f849', '2026-09-18T23:21:08.574Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:08.574Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 4, 1, 'Nanao izay ratsy teo imason’i Jehovah indray ny Israelita rehefa maty i Ehoda.', 'nanao izay ratsy teo imason’i jehovah indray ny israelita rehefa maty i ehoda.'),
  ('6aadc764b341655091a5f85e', '2026-09-18T23:21:08.574Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:08.574Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 4, 22, 'Ary tonga tany i Baraka nanenjika an’i Sisera. Dia nitsena azy i Jaela ka niteny hoe: “Avia fa hasehoko anao ilay lehilahy tadiavinao.” Dia niditra tao amin’ilay tranolay izy ireo, ary nahita an’i Sisera maty teo. Mbola teo amin’ny fihirifany ilay fantsika be.', 'ary tonga tany i baraka nanenjika an’i sisera. dia nitsena azy i jaela ka niteny hoe: “avia fa hasehoko anao ilay lehilahy tadiavinao.” dia niditra tao amin’ilay tranolay izy ireo, ary nahita an’i sisera maty teo. mbola teo amin’ny fihirifany ilay fantsika be.'),
  ('6aadc764b341655091a5f855', '2026-09-18T23:21:08.574Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:08.574Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 4, 13, 'Tonga dia nangonin’i Sisera daholo ny kalesin’adiny 900 nisy lelan’antsy sy ny miaramilany rehetra tao Harosetan’ireo firenena, mba ho any amin’ny reniranon’i Kisona.', 'tonga dia nangonin’i sisera daholo ny kalesin’adiny 900 nisy lelan’antsy sy ny miaramilany rehetra tao harosetan’ireo firenena, mba ho any amin’ny reniranon’i kisona.'),
  ('6aadc764b341655091a5f854', '2026-09-18T23:21:08.574Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:08.574Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 4, 12, 'Ary nisy nilaza tamin’i Sisera hoe efa niakatra any an-tendrombohitra Tabara i Baraka zanak’i Abinoama.', 'ary nisy nilaza tamin’i sisera hoe efa niakatra any an-tendrombohitra tabara i baraka zanak’i abinoama.'),
  ('6aadc76485d193ed1cfcaf67', '2026-09-18T23:21:08.925Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:08.925Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 5, 8, 'Nifidy andriamani-baovao izy ireo. Dia nisy ady teny am-bavahady, Ary tsy nanana ampinga na lefona Ireo olona 40 000 teo amin’ny Israely.', 'nifidy andriamani-baovao izy ireo. dia nisy ady teny am-bavahady, ary tsy nanana ampinga na lefona ireo olona 40 000 teo amin’ny israely.'),
  ('6aadc76485d193ed1cfcaf61', '2026-09-18T23:21:08.925Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:08.925Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 5, 2, '“Derao i Jehovah, Satria nirotsaka an-tsitrapo ny Israely, Ary tsy nofatorana ny volon’ireo miaramila.', '“derao i jehovah, satria nirotsaka an-tsitrapo ny israely, ary tsy nofatorana ny volon’ireo miaramila.'),
  ('6aadc76485d193ed1cfcaf65', '2026-09-18T23:21:08.925Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:08.925Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 5, 6, 'Tamin’ny andron’i Samgara, zanak’i Anata, Tamin’ny andron’i Jaela, dia tsy nisy mpandeha ny lalana, Fa nandeha tamin’ny lalan-kafa ny mpanao dia lavitra.', 'tamin’ny andron’i samgara, zanak’i anata, tamin’ny andron’i jaela, dia tsy nisy mpandeha ny lalana, fa nandeha tamin’ny lalan-kafa ny mpanao dia lavitra.'),
  ('6aadc76485d193ed1cfcaf68', '2026-09-18T23:21:08.925Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:08.925Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 5, 9, 'Manohana an’ireo mpitari-tafika eo amin’ny Israely aho, Dia ireo nirotsaka an-tsitrapo niaraka tamin’ny vahoaka. Derao i Jehovah!', 'manohana an’ireo mpitari-tafika eo amin’ny israely aho, dia ireo nirotsaka an-tsitrapo niaraka tamin’ny vahoaka. derao i jehovah!'),
  ('6aadc76485d193ed1cfcaf6b', '2026-09-18T23:21:08.925Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:08.925Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 5, 12, 'Mifohaza, mifohaza, ry Debora ô! Mifohaza, mifohaza, ka mihirà! Mitsangàna ry Baraka! Ento manaraka anao ireo olona azonao babo, ry zanak’i Abinoama!', 'mifohaza, mifohaza, ry debora ô! mifohaza, mifohaza, ka mihirà! mitsangàna ry baraka! ento manaraka anao ireo olona azonao babo, ry zanak’i abinoama!'),
  ('6aadc76485d193ed1cfcaf69', '2026-09-18T23:21:08.925Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:08.925Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 5, 10, 'Ianareo izay mitaingina ampondra volontany, Ianareo izay mipetraka eo ambony lamba matevina lafo vidy, Ary ianareo izay mandeha eny an-dalana, Mba diniho izao:', 'ianareo izay mitaingina ampondra volontany, ianareo izay mipetraka eo ambony lamba matevina lafo vidy, ary ianareo izay mandeha eny an-dalana, mba diniho izao:'),
  ('6aadc76485d193ed1cfcaf62', '2026-09-18T23:21:08.925Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:08.925Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 5, 3, 'Mihainoa ry mpanjaka! Mihainoa ry mpitondra! Hihira ho an’i Jehovah aho. Hihira fiderana ho an’i Jehovah Andriamanitry ny Israely aho.', 'mihainoa ry mpanjaka! mihainoa ry mpitondra! hihira ho an’i jehovah aho. hihira fiderana ho an’i jehovah andriamanitry ny israely aho.'),
  ('6aadc76485d193ed1cfcaf60', '2026-09-18T23:21:08.925Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:08.925Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 5, 1, 'Dia nihira toy izao i Debora sy Baraka zanak’i Abinoama, tamin’iny andro iny:', 'dia nihira toy izao i debora sy baraka zanak’i abinoama, tamin’iny andro iny:'),
  ('6aadc76485d193ed1cfcaf63', '2026-09-18T23:21:08.925Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:08.925Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 5, 4, 'Tamin’ianao avy tany Seira, Jehovah ô, Tamin’ianao niala avy tany amin’ny faritr’i Edoma, Dia nihovotrovotra ny tany, nandrotsaka orana ny lanitra, Ary nandraraka rano ny rahona.', 'tamin’ianao avy tany seira, jehovah ô, tamin’ianao niala avy tany amin’ny faritr’i edoma, dia nihovotrovotra ny tany, nandrotsaka orana ny lanitra, ary nandraraka rano ny rahona.'),
  ('6aadc76485d193ed1cfcaf66', '2026-09-18T23:21:08.925Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:08.925Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 5, 7, 'Tsy nisy mponina intsony tany amin’ireo tanàna kelin’ny Israely, Tsy nisy olona intsony tany mandra-panendry ahy, dia izaho Debora, Mandra-panendry ahy ho toy ny reny teo amin’ny Israely.', 'tsy nisy mponina intsony tany amin’ireo tanàna kelin’ny israely, tsy nisy olona intsony tany mandra-panendry ahy, dia izaho debora, mandra-panendry ahy ho toy ny reny teo amin’ny israely.'),
  ('6aadc76485d193ed1cfcaf6a', '2026-09-18T23:21:08.925Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:08.925Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 5, 11, 'Heno teny am-pantsakana ny feon’ny mpizara rano. Teny izy ireo no nitantara ny zavatra ara-drariny nataon’i Jehovah, Sy ny zavatra ara-drariny nataon’ny olony tany amin’ireo tanàna kelin’ny Israely. Dia nidina teny am-bavahady ny vahoakan’i Jehovah.', 'heno teny am-pantsakana ny feon’ny mpizara rano. teny izy ireo no nitantara ny zavatra ara-drariny nataon’i jehovah, sy ny zavatra ara-drariny nataon’ny olony tany amin’ireo tanàna kelin’ny israely. dia nidina teny am-bavahady ny vahoakan’i jehovah.'),
  ('6aadc76485d193ed1cfcaf64', '2026-09-18T23:21:08.925Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:08.925Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 5, 5, 'Nitsonika teo anoloan’i Jehovah ny tendrombohitra, Na i Sinay aza nitsonika teo anoloan’i Jehovah Andriamanitry ny Israely.', 'nitsonika teo anoloan’i jehovah ny tendrombohitra, na i sinay aza nitsonika teo anoloan’i jehovah andriamanitry ny israely.'),
  ('6aadc76485d193ed1cfcaf74', '2026-09-18T23:21:08.926Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:08.926Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 5, 21, 'Nifaoka an’ireo fahavalo ny reniranon’i Kisona, Dia ilay renirano efa nisy hatry ny ela, izany hoe ny reniranon’i Kisona. Nanitsakitsaka an’ireo olo-mahery aho.', 'nifaoka an’ireo fahavalo ny reniranon’i kisona, dia ilay renirano efa nisy hatry ny ela, izany hoe ny reniranon’i kisona. nanitsakitsaka an’ireo olo-mahery aho.'),
  ('6aadc76485d193ed1cfcaf6e', '2026-09-18T23:21:08.926Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:08.926Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 5, 15, 'Niaraka tamin’i Debora ny andriana teo amin’ny fokon’i Isakara, Ary toy ny nataon’i Isakara ihany ny nataon’i Baraka. Nirahina handeha an-tongotra hankeny amin’ny tany lemaka izy. Nisy tamin’ny fokon’i Robena nisalasala be.', 'niaraka tamin’i debora ny andriana teo amin’ny fokon’i isakara, ary toy ny nataon’i isakara ihany ny nataon’i baraka. nirahina handeha an-tongotra hankeny amin’ny tany lemaka izy. nisy tamin’ny fokon’i robena nisalasala be.'),
  ('6aadc76485d193ed1cfcaf6d', '2026-09-18T23:21:08.926Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:08.926Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 5, 14, 'Avy tamin’ny fokon’i Efraima ireo nankeny amin’ny lohasaha. Niaraka taminao sy ny vahoakanao izy ireo, ry Benjamina ô! Avy tamin’i Makira ireo mpitari-tafika nidina tany, Ary avy tamin’i Zebolona ireo niantso olona hanao miaramila.', 'avy tamin’ny fokon’i efraima ireo nankeny amin’ny lohasaha. niaraka taminao sy ny vahoakanao izy ireo, ry benjamina ô! avy tamin’i makira ireo mpitari-tafika nidina tany, ary avy tamin’i zebolona ireo niantso olona hanao miaramila.'),
  ('6aadc76485d193ed1cfcaf7a', '2026-09-18T23:21:08.926Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:08.926Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 5, 27, 'Teo anelanelan’ny tongotr’i Jaela izy no nianjera sy nitsitra. Teo anelanelan’ny tongony izy no nianjera, Ary teo amin’izay nianjerany izy no resy.', 'teo anelanelan’ny tongotr’i jaela izy no nianjera sy nitsitra. teo anelanelan’ny tongony izy no nianjera, ary teo amin’izay nianjerany izy no resy.'),
  ('6aadc76485d193ed1cfcaf78', '2026-09-18T23:21:08.926Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:08.926Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 5, 25, 'Rano no nangatahin’i Sisera, fa ronono no nomeny azy, Habobo no natolony tao anaty vilia baolina lehibe tsara tarehy.', 'rano no nangatahin’i sisera, fa ronono no nomeny azy, habobo no natolony tao anaty vilia baolina lehibe tsara tarehy.'),
  ('6aadc76485d193ed1cfcaf70', '2026-09-18T23:21:08.926Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:08.926Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 5, 17, 'Nijanona teny ampitan’i Jordana i Gileada. Ary nahoana i Dana no nijanona tao anaty sambo? Nipetra-potsiny teo amoron-dranomasina i Asera, Ary nijanona teo amin’ny seranan-tsambony izy.', 'nijanona teny ampitan’i jordana i gileada. ary nahoana i dana no nijanona tao anaty sambo? nipetra-potsiny teo amoron-dranomasina i asera, ary nijanona teo amin’ny seranan-tsambony izy.'),
  ('6aadc76485d193ed1cfcaf6c', '2026-09-18T23:21:08.926Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:08.926Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 5, 13, 'Dia nidina tany amin’ny olo-manan-kaja ny sisa tsy maty. Nidina nankatỳ amiko ny vahoakan’i Jehovah mba hiady amin’ny olo-mahery.', 'dia nidina tany amin’ny olo-manan-kaja ny sisa tsy maty. nidina nankatỳ amiko ny vahoakan’i jehovah mba hiady amin’ny olo-mahery.'),
  ('6aadc76485d193ed1cfcaf75', '2026-09-18T23:21:08.926Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:08.926Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 5, 22, 'Dia nikatrokatroka ny kitron-tsoavaly, Satria nihazakazaka mafy be ny soavalilahy.', 'dia nikatrokatroka ny kitron-tsoavaly, satria nihazakazaka mafy be ny soavalilahy.'),
  ('6aadc76485d193ed1cfcaf72', '2026-09-18T23:21:08.926Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:08.926Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 5, 19, 'Nisy mpanjaka tonga hiady, Dia niady ireo mpanjakan’i Kanana Tao Tanàka, teo amoron’ny ranon’i Megido. Tsy nahazo volafotsy anefa izy ireo.', 'nisy mpanjaka tonga hiady, dia niady ireo mpanjakan’i kanana tao tanàka, teo amoron’ny ranon’i megido. tsy nahazo volafotsy anefa izy ireo.'),
  ('6aadc76485d193ed1cfcaf7c', '2026-09-18T23:21:08.926Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:08.926Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 5, 29, 'Izay hendry indrindra tamin’ny vehivavy nanan-kaja teo aminy no namaly azy; Izy koa aza mba nieritreritra hoe:', 'izay hendry indrindra tamin’ny vehivavy nanan-kaja teo aminy no namaly azy; izy koa aza mba nieritreritra hoe:'),
  ('6aadc76485d193ed1cfcaf7e', '2026-09-18T23:21:08.926Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:08.926Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 5, 31, 'Ho faty toy izany koa anie ny fahavalonao rehetra, Jehovah ô! Fa izay tia anao kosa ho tahaka ny masoandro mibaliaka.” Ary nilamina nandritra ny 40 taona ilay tany.', 'ho faty toy izany koa anie ny fahavalonao rehetra, jehovah ô! fa izay tia anao kosa ho tahaka ny masoandro mibaliaka.” ary nilamina nandritra ny 40 taona ilay tany.'),
  ('6aadc76485d193ed1cfcaf79', '2026-09-18T23:21:08.926Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:08.926Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 5, 26, 'Dia nalainy ny fantsika be fanenjanan-day, Noraisiny tamin’ny tanana havanana ny marotoa, Dia nasiany tamin’iny i Sisera, ka vaky ny lohany. Nokapohiny mafy be ny fihirifany ary nolavahany.', 'dia nalainy ny fantsika be fanenjanan-day, noraisiny tamin’ny tanana havanana ny marotoa, dia nasiany tamin’iny i sisera, ka vaky ny lohany. nokapohiny mafy be ny fihirifany ary nolavahany.'),
  ('6aadc76485d193ed1cfcaf73', '2026-09-18T23:21:08.926Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:08.926Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 5, 20, 'Avy tany an-danitra ny kintana no niady, Avy teny izy ireny no niady tamin’i Sisera.', 'avy tany an-danitra ny kintana no niady, avy teny izy ireny no niady tamin’i sisera.'),
  ('6aadc76485d193ed1cfcaf77', '2026-09-18T23:21:08.926Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:08.926Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 5, 24, 'Tahina mihoatra noho ny vehivavy rehetra i Jaela, Vadin’i Hebera Kenita, Tahina mihoatra noho ny vehivavy rehetra mipetraka any anaty tranolay izy.', 'tahina mihoatra noho ny vehivavy rehetra i jaela, vadin’i hebera kenita, tahina mihoatra noho ny vehivavy rehetra mipetraka any anaty tranolay izy.'),
  ('6aadc76485d193ed1cfcaf7d', '2026-09-18T23:21:08.926Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:08.926Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 5, 30, '‘Efa nahazo babo izay ry zareo, dia nizara an’izany, Ankizivavy iray na ankizivavy roa no anjaran’ny miaramila tsirairay. Lamba miloko no azon’i Sisera, eny, lamba miloko, Akanjo iray misy peta-kofehy, lamba miloko, akanjo roa misy peta-kofehy No eny am-bozon’ireo nahazo babo.’', '‘efa nahazo babo izay ry zareo, dia nizara an’izany, ankizivavy iray na ankizivavy roa no anjaran’ny miaramila tsirairay. lamba miloko no azon’i sisera, eny, lamba miloko, akanjo iray misy peta-kofehy, lamba miloko, akanjo roa misy peta-kofehy no eny am-bozon’ireo nahazo babo.’'),
  ('6aadc76485d193ed1cfcaf71', '2026-09-18T23:21:08.926Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:08.926Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 5, 18, 'Ny taranak’i Zebolona kosa nanao vivery ny ainy, ary vonona ho faty mihitsy aza. Nanao toy izany koa i Naftaly teny amin’ny havoana.', 'ny taranak’i zebolona kosa nanao vivery ny ainy, ary vonona ho faty mihitsy aza. nanao toy izany koa i naftaly teny amin’ny havoana.'),
  ('6aadc76485d193ed1cfcaf7b', '2026-09-18T23:21:08.926Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:08.926Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 5, 28, 'Nisy vehivavy nitazana teo am-baravarankely, Nitazana teo amin’ny makarakaran’ny varavarankely ny renin’i Sisera, ka niteny hoe: ‘Fa maninona àry no mbola tsy tonga foana ny kalesy fitondrany miady? Fa maninona àry no mbola tsy re mikatrokatroka foana ny kitron’ny soavaliny?’', 'nisy vehivavy nitazana teo am-baravarankely, nitazana teo amin’ny makarakaran’ny varavarankely ny renin’i sisera, ka niteny hoe: ‘fa maninona àry no mbola tsy tonga foana ny kalesy fitondrany miady? fa maninona àry no mbola tsy re mikatrokatroka foana ny kitron’ny soavaliny?’'),
  ('6aadc76485d193ed1cfcaf76', '2026-09-18T23:21:08.926Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:08.926Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 5, 23, '‘Ozòny i Meroza’, hoy ilay anjelin’i Jehovah, ‘Ozòny ny mponina ao, Satria tsy mba tonga nanampy an’i Jehovah, Tsy niaraka tamin’ireo olo-mahery mba hanampy an’i Jehovah.’', '‘ozòny i meroza’, hoy ilay anjelin’i jehovah, ‘ozòny ny mponina ao, satria tsy mba tonga nanampy an’i jehovah, tsy niaraka tamin’ireo olo-mahery mba hanampy an’i jehovah.’'),
  ('6aadc76485d193ed1cfcaf6f', '2026-09-18T23:21:08.926Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:08.926Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 5, 16, 'Nahoana ianao no nipetraka toy ny biby anankiray mitondra kitapon-dasely roa, Mba hihaino an’ireo mpiandry ondry nitsoka sodina hibaikoana andian’ondry? Nisy tamin’ny fokon’i Robena nisalasala be.', 'nahoana ianao no nipetraka toy ny biby anankiray mitondra kitapon-dasely roa, mba hihaino an’ireo mpiandry ondry nitsoka sodina hibaikoana andian’ondry? nisy tamin’ny fokon’i robena nisalasala be.'),
  ('6aadc7656b4c78ac98ded265', '2026-09-18T23:21:09.929Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:09.929Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 6, 1, 'Nanao izay ratsy teo imason’i Jehovah indray anefa ny Israelita, ka navelan’i Jehovah ho resin’ny Midianina izy ireo nandritra ny fito taona.', 'nanao izay ratsy teo imason’i jehovah indray anefa ny israelita, ka navelan’i jehovah ho resin’ny midianina izy ireo nandritra ny fito taona.'),
  ('6aadc7656b4c78ac98ded266', '2026-09-18T23:21:09.929Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:09.929Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 6, 2, 'Dia nanjakazaka tamin’ny Israely ny Midianina. Noho ny nataon’ny Midianina, dia nanamboatra toerana hiafenany ny Israelita. Nataon’izy ireo teny an-tendrombohitra izany sy tao amin’ireo lava-bato ary tany amin’ireo toerana sarotra aleha.', 'dia nanjakazaka tamin’ny israely ny midianina. noho ny nataon’ny midianina, dia nanamboatra toerana hiafenany ny israelita. nataon’izy ireo teny an-tendrombohitra izany sy tao amin’ireo lava-bato ary tany amin’ireo toerana sarotra aleha.'),
  ('6aadc7656b4c78ac98ded267', '2026-09-18T23:21:09.929Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:09.929Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 6, 3, 'Ary rehefa namafy voa ny Israely, dia nanafika azy ny Midianina sy ny Amalekita ary ny Tatsinanana.', 'ary rehefa namafy voa ny israely, dia nanafika azy ny midianina sy ny amalekita ary ny tatsinanana.'),
  ('6aadc7656b4c78ac98ded268', '2026-09-18T23:21:09.929Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:09.929Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 6, 4, 'Nanangana toby izy ireo dia notafihiny ny Israely. Dia nosimban’izy ireo ny vokatry ny tany, hatrany Gaza. Nataony tsy nanana na inona na inona hatao sakafo intsony ny Israely. Ary nalainy daholo na ny ondry na ny omby na ny ampondra.', 'nanangana toby izy ireo dia notafihiny ny israely. dia nosimban’izy ireo ny vokatry ny tany, hatrany gaza. nataony tsy nanana na inona na inona hatao sakafo intsony ny israely. ary nalainy daholo na ny ondry na ny omby na ny ampondra.'),
  ('6aadc7656b4c78ac98ded269', '2026-09-18T23:21:09.929Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:09.929Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 6, 5, 'Nitondra biby fiompy sy tranolay izy ireo ary nanao rodobe hoatran’ny valala. Tsy voaisa koa izy ireo sy ny ramevany. Ary ny hanimba an’ilay tany no nahatongavany.', 'nitondra biby fiompy sy tranolay izy ireo ary nanao rodobe hoatran’ny valala. tsy voaisa koa izy ireo sy ny ramevany. ary ny hanimba an’ilay tany no nahatongavany.'),
  ('6aadc7656b4c78ac98ded26a', '2026-09-18T23:21:09.929Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:09.929Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 6, 6, 'Lasa nahantra be àry ny Israely noho ny nataon’ny Midianina. Dia niantso vonjy tamin’i Jehovah ny Israelita.', 'lasa nahantra be àry ny israely noho ny nataon’ny midianina. dia niantso vonjy tamin’i jehovah ny israelita.'),
  ('6aadc7656b4c78ac98ded26b', '2026-09-18T23:21:09.929Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:09.929Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 6, 7, 'Rehefa niantso vonjy tamin’i Jehovah ny Israelita noho ny nataon’ny Midianina,', 'rehefa niantso vonjy tamin’i jehovah ny israelita noho ny nataon’ny midianina,'),
  ('6aadc7656b4c78ac98ded26c', '2026-09-18T23:21:09.929Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:09.929Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 6, 8, 'dia naniraka mpaminany ho any amin’ny Israelita i Jehovah mba hiteny amin’izy ireo hoe: “Izao no nolazain’i Jehovah Andriamanitry ny Israely: ‘Izaho no nitondra anareo avy tany Ejipta, ka nanafaka anareo tany amin’ny toerana nanandevozana anareo.', 'dia naniraka mpaminany ho any amin’ny israelita i jehovah mba hiteny amin’izy ireo hoe: “izao no nolazain’i jehovah andriamanitry ny israely: ‘izaho no nitondra anareo avy tany ejipta, ka nanafaka anareo tany amin’ny toerana nanandevozana anareo.'),
  ('6aadc7656b4c78ac98ded26d', '2026-09-18T23:21:09.929Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:09.929Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 6, 9, 'Dia namonjy anareo tamin’ny Ejipsianina sy tamin’izay rehetra nampijaly anareo aho. Noroahiko ny fahavalonareo, ary nomeko anareo ny taniny.', 'dia namonjy anareo tamin’ny ejipsianina sy tamin’izay rehetra nampijaly anareo aho. noroahiko ny fahavalonareo, ary nomeko anareo ny taniny.'),
  ('6aadc7656b4c78ac98ded26e', '2026-09-18T23:21:09.929Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:09.929Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 6, 10, 'Dia niteny taminareo koa aho hoe: “Izaho no Jehovah Andriamanitrareo. Aza mivavaka amin’ireo andriamanitra ivavahan’ny Amorita, izay tompon’ny tany ipetrahanareo.” Tsy nankatò ahy anefa ianareo.’”', 'dia niteny taminareo koa aho hoe: “izaho no jehovah andriamanitrareo. aza mivavaka amin’ireo andriamanitra ivavahan’ny amorita, izay tompon’ny tany ipetrahanareo.” tsy nankatò ahy anefa ianareo.’”'),
  ('6aadc7656b4c78ac98ded26f', '2026-09-18T23:21:09.929Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:09.929Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 6, 11, 'Ary tonga ilay anjelin’i Jehovah taorian’izay, ka nipetraka teo ambanin’ilay hazoben’i Joasy Abi-ezerita, tany Ofra. Nively varimbazaha tao amin’ny lavaka famiazam-boaloboka i Gideona zanakalahin’i Joasy tamin’izay, mba tsy ho hitan’ny Midianina.', 'ary tonga ilay anjelin’i jehovah taorian’izay, ka nipetraka teo ambanin’ilay hazoben’i joasy abi-ezerita, tany ofra. nively varimbazaha tao amin’ny lavaka famiazam-boaloboka i gideona zanakalahin’i joasy tamin’izay, mba tsy ho hitan’ny midianina.'),
  ('6aadc7656b4c78ac98ded270', '2026-09-18T23:21:09.929Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:09.929Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 6, 12, 'Dia niseho taminy ilay anjelin’i Jehovah, ka niteny hoe: “Momba anao i Jehovah, ry miaramila matanjaka!”', 'dia niseho taminy ilay anjelin’i jehovah, ka niteny hoe: “momba anao i jehovah, ry miaramila matanjaka!”'),
  ('6aadc7656b4c78ac98ded271', '2026-09-18T23:21:09.929Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:09.929Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 6, 13, 'Hoy anefa i Gideona taminy: “Azafady tompoko, fa raha momba anay i Jehovah, maninona no manjo anay izao zavatra rehetra izao? Aiza daholo izao ny zava-mahagaga nataony, ilay notantarain’ny razambenay taminay hoe: ‘I Jehovah no nitondra antsika nivoaka avy tany Ejipta’? Efa nafoin’i Jehovah izahay, ka navelany hanompo ny Midianina.”', 'hoy anefa i gideona taminy: “azafady tompoko, fa raha momba anay i jehovah, maninona no manjo anay izao zavatra rehetra izao? aiza daholo izao ny zava-mahagaga nataony, ilay notantarain’ny razambenay taminay hoe: ‘i jehovah no nitondra antsika nivoaka avy tany ejipta’? efa nafoin’i jehovah izahay, ka navelany hanompo ny midianina.”'),
  ('6aadc7656b4c78ac98ded272', '2026-09-18T23:21:09.929Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:09.929Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 6, 14, 'Dia nijery azy i Jehovah ka niteny hoe: “Mandehana, ary ampiasao ny hery anananao mba hamonjena ny Israely eo an-tanan’ny Midianina. Izaho no maniraka anao.”', 'dia nijery azy i jehovah ka niteny hoe: “mandehana, ary ampiasao ny hery anananao mba hamonjena ny israely eo an-tanan’ny midianina. izaho no maniraka anao.”'),
  ('6aadc7656b4c78ac98ded273', '2026-09-18T23:21:09.929Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:09.929Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 6, 15, 'Ary hoy ny navalin’i Gideona: “Azafady Jehovah ô, ahoana moa no hamonjeko ny Israely? Ny fianakaviako ange no tsinontsinona indrindra ao amin’ny fokon’i Manase e! Dia izaho no tsy misy dikany indrindra ao amin’ny fianakavian’ny dadako.”', 'ary hoy ny navalin’i gideona: “azafady jehovah ô, ahoana moa no hamonjeko ny israely? ny fianakaviako ange no tsinontsinona indrindra ao amin’ny fokon’i manase e! dia izaho no tsy misy dikany indrindra ao amin’ny fianakavian’ny dadako.”'),
  ('6aadc7656b4c78ac98ded274', '2026-09-18T23:21:09.929Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:09.929Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 6, 16, 'Hoy anefa i Jehovah: “Hanampy anao aho, ka ho resinao hoatran’ny fandresena olona anankiray ny Midianina.”', 'hoy anefa i jehovah: “hanampy anao aho, ka ho resinao hoatran’ny fandresena olona anankiray ny midianina.”'),
  ('6aadc7656b4c78ac98ded275', '2026-09-18T23:21:09.929Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:09.929Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 6, 17, 'Dia hoy i Gideona: “Raha mahazo sitraka aminao àry aho, dia manaova famantarana mba hahalalako fa ianao tokoa no miresaka amiko.', 'dia hoy i gideona: “raha mahazo sitraka aminao àry aho, dia manaova famantarana mba hahalalako fa ianao tokoa no miresaka amiko.'),
  ('6aadc7656b4c78ac98ded276', '2026-09-18T23:21:09.929Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:09.929Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 6, 18, 'Aza miala eto, azafady, mandra-piveriko, fa handeha haka fanomezana aho mba hoentiko eto aminao.” Dia hoy izy: “Hijanona eto aho mandra-piverinao.”', 'aza miala eto, azafady, mandra-piveriko, fa handeha haka fanomezana aho mba hoentiko eto aminao.” dia hoy izy: “hijanona eto aho mandra-piverinao.”'),
  ('6aadc7656b4c78ac98ded277', '2026-09-18T23:21:09.929Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:09.929Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 6, 19, 'Ary lasa i Gideona, ka nahandro zanak’osy sy nanamboatra mofo tsy misy lalivay tamin’ny lafarinina iray efaha. Dia nataony tao anaty harona ny hena, ary nataony tao anaty vilany ny ron-kena. Dia nentiny tany amin’ilay anjely izany ka narosony azy, teo ambanin’ilay hazobe.', 'ary lasa i gideona, ka nahandro zanak’osy sy nanamboatra mofo tsy misy lalivay tamin’ny lafarinina iray efaha. dia nataony tao anaty harona ny hena, ary nataony tao anaty vilany ny ron-kena. dia nentiny tany amin’ilay anjely izany ka narosony azy, teo ambanin’ilay hazobe.'),
  ('6aadc7656b4c78ac98ded278', '2026-09-18T23:21:09.929Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:09.929Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 6, 20, 'Ary hoy ilay anjelin’ilay tena Andriamanitra: “Alaivo ilay hena sy ilay mofo tsy misy lalivay, ka apetraho erỳ ambonin’irỳ vatobe irỳ, ary araraho eo ilay ron-kena.” Dia nataon’i Gideona izany.', 'ary hoy ilay anjelin’ilay tena andriamanitra: “alaivo ilay hena sy ilay mofo tsy misy lalivay, ka apetraho erỳ ambonin’irỳ vatobe irỳ, ary araraho eo ilay ron-kena.” dia nataon’i gideona izany.'),
  ('6aadc7656b4c78ac98ded279', '2026-09-18T23:21:09.929Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:09.929Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 6, 21, 'Ary nokasihin’ilay anjelin’i Jehovah tamin’ny tendron’ny tehina teny an-tanany ilay hena sy ny mofo tsy misy lalivay. Dia nisy afo nivoaka avy tamin’ilay vato ka nandevona an’ilay hena sy ilay mofo tsy misy lalivay. Nanjavona ilay anjelin’i Jehovah avy eo ka tsy hitan’i Gideona intsony.', 'ary nokasihin’ilay anjelin’i jehovah tamin’ny tendron’ny tehina teny an-tanany ilay hena sy ny mofo tsy misy lalivay. dia nisy afo nivoaka avy tamin’ilay vato ka nandevona an’ilay hena sy ilay mofo tsy misy lalivay. nanjavona ilay anjelin’i jehovah avy eo ka tsy hitan’i gideona intsony.'),
  ('6aadc7656b4c78ac98ded27a', '2026-09-18T23:21:09.929Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:09.929Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 6, 22, 'Izay vao fantany hoe anjelin’i Jehovah ilay teo. Dia hoy i Gideona: “Maty aho, ry Jehovah Tompo Fara Tampony, fa nahita anjelin’i Jehovah!”', 'izay vao fantany hoe anjelin’i jehovah ilay teo. dia hoy i gideona: “maty aho, ry jehovah tompo fara tampony, fa nahita anjelin’i jehovah!”'),
  ('6aadc7656b4c78ac98ded27b', '2026-09-18T23:21:09.929Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:09.929Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 6, 23, 'Fa hoy i Jehovah taminy: “Aza taitaitra ianao! Aza matahotra fa tsy ho faty ianao.”', 'fa hoy i jehovah taminy: “aza taitaitra ianao! aza matahotra fa tsy ho faty ianao.”'),
  ('6aadc7656b4c78ac98ded27c', '2026-09-18T23:21:09.929Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:09.929Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 6, 24, 'Nanamboatra alitara ho an’i Jehovah teo àry i Gideona. Natao hoe Jehovah-saloma ny anaran’ilay alitara. Izany no iantsoana an’ilay izy hatramin’izao, ary mbola any Ofra, tanànan’ny Abi-ezerita, ilay izy.', 'nanamboatra alitara ho an’i jehovah teo àry i gideona. natao hoe jehovah-saloma ny anaran’ilay alitara. izany no iantsoana an’ilay izy hatramin’izao, ary mbola any ofra, tanànan’ny abi-ezerita, ilay izy.'),
  ('6aadc7656b4c78ac98ded27d', '2026-09-18T23:21:09.929Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:09.929Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 6, 25, 'Hoy i Jehovah tamin’i Gideona rehefa alina ny andro: “Alaivo ny vantotr’ombilahin’ny dadanao, dia ilay vantotr’omby faharoa efa fito taona. Arodano koa ny alitaran’i Bala, izay an’ny dadanao, ary tapaho ny tsato-kazo masina eo akaikiny.', 'hoy i jehovah tamin’i gideona rehefa alina ny andro: “alaivo ny vantotr’ombilahin’ny dadanao, dia ilay vantotr’omby faharoa efa fito taona. arodano koa ny alitaran’i bala, izay an’ny dadanao, ary tapaho ny tsato-kazo masina eo akaikiny.'),
  ('6aadc7656b4c78ac98ded27e', '2026-09-18T23:21:09.929Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:09.929Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 6, 26, 'Ary manamboara alitara ho an’i Jehovah Andriamanitrao eo an-tampon’ity toerana voaro mafy ity, ka ataovy milahatra tsara ny vato eo aminy. Ary alaivo ilay vantotr’ombilahy faharoa, dia ataovy fanatitra dorana eo ambony kitay, ka ilay tsato-kazo masina notapahinao no hataonao kitay.”', 'ary manamboara alitara ho an’i jehovah andriamanitrao eo an-tampon’ity toerana voaro mafy ity, ka ataovy milahatra tsara ny vato eo aminy. ary alaivo ilay vantotr’ombilahy faharoa, dia ataovy fanatitra dorana eo ambony kitay, ka ilay tsato-kazo masina notapahinao no hataonao kitay.”'),
  ('6aadc7656b4c78ac98ded27f', '2026-09-18T23:21:09.929Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:09.929Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 6, 27, 'Koa naka folo lahy tamin’ny mpanompony i Gideona, ka nataony izay notenenin’i Jehovah taminy. Tamin’ny alina anefa izy no nanao an’izany fa tsy tamin’ny antoandro, satria izy natahotra be an’ireo fianakavian’ny dadany sy ny lehilahy tao an-tanàna.', 'koa naka folo lahy tamin’ny mpanompony i gideona, ka nataony izay notenenin’i jehovah taminy. tamin’ny alina anefa izy no nanao an’izany fa tsy tamin’ny antoandro, satria izy natahotra be an’ireo fianakavian’ny dadany sy ny lehilahy tao an-tanàna.'),
  ('6aadc7656b4c78ac98ded280', '2026-09-18T23:21:09.929Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:09.929Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 6, 28, 'Rehefa nifoha maraina ny olona tao an-tanàna ny ampitson’iny, dia hitan’izy ireo fa nirodana ny alitaran’i Bala, tapaka ilay tsato-kazo masina teo akaikiny, ary efa natao fanatitra teo ambonin’ilay alitara vao namboarina ilay vantotr’ombilahy faharoa.', 'rehefa nifoha maraina ny olona tao an-tanàna ny ampitson’iny, dia hitan’izy ireo fa nirodana ny alitaran’i bala, tapaka ilay tsato-kazo masina teo akaikiny, ary efa natao fanatitra teo ambonin’ilay alitara vao namboarina ilay vantotr’ombilahy faharoa.'),
  ('6aadc7656b4c78ac98ded281', '2026-09-18T23:21:09.929Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:09.929Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 6, 29, 'Dia nifanontany ny olona hoe: “Fa iza no nanao an’ireo?” Rehefa avy nanadihady izy ireo, dia niteny hoe: “I Gideona zanak’i Joasy!”', 'dia nifanontany ny olona hoe: “fa iza no nanao an’ireo?” rehefa avy nanadihady izy ireo, dia niteny hoe: “i gideona zanak’i joasy!”'),
  ('6aadc7656b4c78ac98ded282', '2026-09-18T23:21:09.929Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:09.929Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 6, 30, 'Dia hoy ny lehilahy tao an-tanàna tamin’i Joasy: “Avoahy atỳ ny zanakao mba hovonoina ho faty, fa izy no nandrodana ny alitaran’i Bala sy nanapaka an’ilay tsato-kazo masina teo akaikin’ilay izy.”', 'dia hoy ny lehilahy tao an-tanàna tamin’i joasy: “avoahy atỳ ny zanakao mba hovonoina ho faty, fa izy no nandrodana ny alitaran’i bala sy nanapaka an’ilay tsato-kazo masina teo akaikin’ilay izy.”');
INSERT INTO "bible_verses" ("id", "created_date", "updated_date", "created_by_id", "created_by", "translation", "book", "bookOrder", "chapter", "verse", "text", "normalizedText") VALUES
  ('6aadc7656b4c78ac98ded283', '2026-09-18T23:21:09.929Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:09.929Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 6, 31, 'Dia hoy i Joasy tamin’izay rehetra nila ady taminy: “Angaha ianareo tsy maintsy miaro an’i Bala? Tsy maintsy mamonjy azy angaha ianareo? Izay rehetra miaro an’i Bala dia tokony hovonoina ho faty izao maraina izao ihany. Raha andriamanitra i Bala, dia avelao izy ihany no hiaro ny tenany, satria nisy nandrodana ny alitarany.”', 'dia hoy i joasy tamin’izay rehetra nila ady taminy: “angaha ianareo tsy maintsy miaro an’i bala? tsy maintsy mamonjy azy angaha ianareo? izay rehetra miaro an’i bala dia tokony hovonoina ho faty izao maraina izao ihany. raha andriamanitra i bala, dia avelao izy ihany no hiaro ny tenany, satria nisy nandrodana ny alitarany.”'),
  ('6aadc7656b4c78ac98ded284', '2026-09-18T23:21:09.929Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:09.929Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 6, 32, 'Ary nataon’i Joasy hoe Jerobala ny anaran’i Gideona nanomboka tamin’izay, fa hoy izy: “Avelao i Bala hiaro ny tenany, satria nisy nandrodana ny alitarany.”', 'ary nataon’i joasy hoe jerobala ny anaran’i gideona nanomboka tamin’izay, fa hoy izy: “avelao i bala hiaro ny tenany, satria nisy nandrodana ny alitarany.”'),
  ('6aadc7656b4c78ac98ded285', '2026-09-18T23:21:09.929Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:09.929Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 6, 33, 'Ary nivondrona ny Midianina sy ny Amalekita ary ny Tatsinanana ka niampita nankeny amin’ny Lohasahan’i Jezirela. Ary nitoby teo izy ireo.', 'ary nivondrona ny midianina sy ny amalekita ary ny tatsinanana ka niampita nankeny amin’ny lohasahan’i jezirela. ary nitoby teo izy ireo.'),
  ('6aadc7656b4c78ac98ded286', '2026-09-18T23:21:09.929Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:09.929Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 6, 34, 'Ary niasa tamin’i Gideona ny fanahin’i Jehovah, ka nitsoka anjombona izy. Dia nankany aminy ny Abi-ezerita mba hanohana azy.', 'ary niasa tamin’i gideona ny fanahin’i jehovah, ka nitsoka anjombona izy. dia nankany aminy ny abi-ezerita mba hanohana azy.'),
  ('6aadc7656b4c78ac98ded287', '2026-09-18T23:21:09.929Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:09.929Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 6, 35, 'Ary naniraka olona nankany amin’izay rehetra anisan’ny fokon’i Manase izy, dia nankany aminy koa ireo mba hanohana azy. Naniraka olona nankany amin’ny fokon’i Asera sy Zebolona ary Naftaly koa i Gideona, ka tonga nitsena azy izy ireo.', 'ary naniraka olona nankany amin’izay rehetra anisan’ny fokon’i manase izy, dia nankany aminy koa ireo mba hanohana azy. naniraka olona nankany amin’ny fokon’i asera sy zebolona ary naftaly koa i gideona, ka tonga nitsena azy izy ireo.'),
  ('6aadc7656b4c78ac98ded288', '2026-09-18T23:21:09.929Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:09.929Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 6, 36, 'Dia hoy i Gideona tamin’ilay tena Andriamanitra: “Ianao efa nampanantena hoe hamonjy ny Israely, ary izaho no hampiasainao hanao an’izany.', 'dia hoy i gideona tamin’ilay tena andriamanitra: “ianao efa nampanantena hoe hamonjy ny israely, ary izaho no hampiasainao hanao an’izany.'),
  ('6aadc7656b4c78ac98ded289', '2026-09-18T23:21:09.929Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:09.929Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 6, 37, 'Hametraka volonondry eo am-pamoloana àry aho. Raha ilay volonondry ihany no misy ranonando, fa ny tany manodidina an’ilay izy kosa maina, dia ho fantatro fa hamonjy ny Israely ianao ary izaho no hampiasainao. Izany mantsy no efa nampanantenainao.”', 'hametraka volonondry eo am-pamoloana àry aho. raha ilay volonondry ihany no misy ranonando, fa ny tany manodidina an’ilay izy kosa maina, dia ho fantatro fa hamonjy ny israely ianao ary izaho no hampiasainao. izany mantsy no efa nampanantenainao.”'),
  ('6aadc7656b4c78ac98ded28a', '2026-09-18T23:21:09.929Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:09.929Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 6, 38, 'Dia izany tokoa no nitranga. Nofiazany ilay volonondry rehefa nifoha maraina izy ny ampitson’iny, ka nahafeno vilia baolina lehibe ny ranonando avy tamin’ilay izy.', 'dia izany tokoa no nitranga. nofiazany ilay volonondry rehefa nifoha maraina izy ny ampitson’iny, ka nahafeno vilia baolina lehibe ny ranonando avy tamin’ilay izy.'),
  ('6aadc7656b4c78ac98ded28b', '2026-09-18T23:21:09.929Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:09.929Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 6, 39, 'Fa hoy indray i Gideona tamin’ilay tena Andriamanitra: “Aoka re ianao mba tsy ho tezitra be amiko e, fa mbola misy zavatra iray tiako hangatahina aminao. Mba avelao aho hampiasa an’ilay volonondry indray! Mba tiako ho hita mantsy raha tena hanampy ahy ianao na tsia. Aleo indray ilay volonondry ihany no ho maina, fa ny tany rehetra kosa hisy ranonando.”', 'fa hoy indray i gideona tamin’ilay tena andriamanitra: “aoka re ianao mba tsy ho tezitra be amiko e, fa mbola misy zavatra iray tiako hangatahina aminao. mba avelao aho hampiasa an’ilay volonondry indray! mba tiako ho hita mantsy raha tena hanampy ahy ianao na tsia. aleo indray ilay volonondry ihany no ho maina, fa ny tany rehetra kosa hisy ranonando.”'),
  ('6aadc7656b4c78ac98ded28c', '2026-09-18T23:21:09.929Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:09.929Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 6, 40, 'Dia izany no nataon’Andriamanitra tamin’iny alina iny. Ilay volonondry ihany no maina, fa ny tany rehetra kosa nisy ranonando.', 'dia izany no nataon’andriamanitra tamin’iny alina iny. ilay volonondry ihany no maina, fa ny tany rehetra kosa nisy ranonando.'),
  ('6aadc76676faefbcc581442c', '2026-09-18T23:21:10.679Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:10.679Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 7, 25, 'Voasambotr’izy ireo koa ny andrianan’ny Midianina roa lahy, dia i Oreba sy Zeba. Ary i Oreba novonoiny teo amin’ny vatobe iray, ka lasa hoe vatoben’i Oreba ny anaran’ilay izy. Fa i Zeba kosa novonoiny tao amin’ny famiazam-boaloboka iray, ka nantsoina hoe famiazam-boalobok’i Zeba ilay izy. Dia mbola nenjehin’izy ireo ihany ny Midianina. Ary nentiny tany amin’i Gideona, tany amin’ny faritr’i Jordana, ny lohan’i Oreba sy ny lohan’i Zeba.', 'voasambotr’izy ireo koa ny andrianan’ny midianina roa lahy, dia i oreba sy zeba. ary i oreba novonoiny teo amin’ny vatobe iray, ka lasa hoe vatoben’i oreba ny anaran’ilay izy. fa i zeba kosa novonoiny tao amin’ny famiazam-boaloboka iray, ka nantsoina hoe famiazam-boalobok’i zeba ilay izy. dia mbola nenjehin’izy ireo ihany ny midianina. ary nentiny tany amin’i gideona, tany amin’ny faritr’i jordana, ny lohan’i oreba sy ny lohan’i zeba.'),
  ('6aadc76676faefbcc581442b', '2026-09-18T23:21:10.679Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:10.679Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 7, 24, 'Ary naniraka olona eran’ny faritra be tendrombohitr’i Efraima i Gideona mba hilaza hoe: “Midìna mba hanafika ny Midianina, ka sakano ny lalana fiampitana ny ranon’i Beti-bara sy ny Reniranon’i Jordana.” Koa niaraka ny lehilahy efraimita rehetra, dia nosakanany ny lalana fiampitana ny ranon’i Beti-bara sy ny Reniranon’i Jordana.', 'ary naniraka olona eran’ny faritra be tendrombohitr’i efraima i gideona mba hilaza hoe: “midìna mba hanafika ny midianina, ka sakano ny lalana fiampitana ny ranon’i beti-bara sy ny reniranon’i jordana.” koa niaraka ny lehilahy efraimita rehetra, dia nosakanany ny lalana fiampitana ny ranon’i beti-bara sy ny reniranon’i jordana.'),
  ('6aadc76676faefbcc581442a', '2026-09-18T23:21:10.679Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:10.679Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 7, 23, 'Dia nantsoina ny lehilahy israelita avy tamin’ny fokon’i Naftaly sy Asera ary izay rehetra anisan’ny fokon’i Manase. Dia nenjehin’izy ireo ny Midianina.', 'dia nantsoina ny lehilahy israelita avy tamin’ny fokon’i naftaly sy asera ary izay rehetra anisan’ny fokon’i manase. dia nenjehin’izy ireo ny midianina.'),
  ('6aadc76676faefbcc5814429', '2026-09-18T23:21:10.679Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:10.679Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 7, 22, 'Ary mbola nitsoka anjombona foana izy 300 lahy. Dia nataon’i Jehovah nifamely tamin’ny sabatra ny eran’ny toby. Nandositra izy ireo ka tonga hatrany Beti-sita sy Zereraha, ary hatrany amin’ny sisin’i Abela-mehola, any akaikin’i Tabata.', 'ary mbola nitsoka anjombona foana izy 300 lahy. dia nataon’i jehovah nifamely tamin’ny sabatra ny eran’ny toby. nandositra izy ireo ka tonga hatrany beti-sita sy zereraha, ary hatrany amin’ny sisin’i abela-mehola, any akaikin’i tabata.'),
  ('6aadc76676faefbcc5814428', '2026-09-18T23:21:10.679Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:10.679Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 7, 21, 'Samy nijanona teo amin’izay nisy azy, nanodidina ny toby, izy ireo. Dia nihazakazaka nandositra izay rehetra tao an-toby sady nihorakoraka.', 'samy nijanona teo amin’izay nisy azy, nanodidina ny toby, izy ireo. dia nihazakazaka nandositra izay rehetra tao an-toby sady nihorakoraka.'),
  ('6aadc76676faefbcc5814427', '2026-09-18T23:21:10.679Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:10.679Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 7, 20, 'Dia samy nitsoka ny anjombony sy namotipotika an’ireo siny lehibe ny andiany telo. Ary notazonin’izy ireo tamin’ny tanany havia ny fanilo, fa ny tanany havanana kosa nitazona anjombona. Notsofin’izy ireo ny anjombona ary niantsoantso mafy izy ireo hoe: “Ny sabatr’i Jehovah sy Gideona!”', 'dia samy nitsoka ny anjombony sy namotipotika an’ireo siny lehibe ny andiany telo. ary notazonin’izy ireo tamin’ny tanany havia ny fanilo, fa ny tanany havanana kosa nitazona anjombona. notsofin’izy ireo ny anjombona ary niantsoantso mafy izy ireo hoe: “ny sabatr’i jehovah sy gideona!”'),
  ('6aadc76676faefbcc5814426', '2026-09-18T23:21:10.679Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:10.679Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 7, 19, 'Ary tonga teo an-tsisin’ny toby i Gideona sy ny 100 lahy niaraka taminy, rehefa nanomboka ny fotoam-piambenana faharoa amin’ny alina. Vao avy nosoloan’ny Midianina ny miaramila mpiambina tamin’izay. Dia nitsoka anjombona ry Gideona, ary nopotipotehiny ny sinin-drano lehibe teny an-tanany.', 'ary tonga teo an-tsisin’ny toby i gideona sy ny 100 lahy niaraka taminy, rehefa nanomboka ny fotoam-piambenana faharoa amin’ny alina. vao avy nosoloan’ny midianina ny miaramila mpiambina tamin’izay. dia nitsoka anjombona ry gideona, ary nopotipotehiny ny sinin-drano lehibe teny an-tanany.'),
  ('6aadc76676faefbcc5814425', '2026-09-18T23:21:10.679Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:10.679Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 7, 18, 'Rehefa mitsoka anjombona aho sy izay rehetra miaraka amiko, dia tokony hitsoka ny anjombonareo manodidina ny toby koa ianareo, sady hiteny mafy hoe: ‘Ho an’i Jehovah sy Gideona!’”', 'rehefa mitsoka anjombona aho sy izay rehetra miaraka amiko, dia tokony hitsoka ny anjombonareo manodidina ny toby koa ianareo, sady hiteny mafy hoe: ‘ho an’i jehovah sy gideona!’”'),
  ('6aadc76676faefbcc5814424', '2026-09-18T23:21:10.679Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:10.679Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 7, 17, 'Hoy izy tamin’izy ireo: “Jereo aho, dia ataovy izay hataoko. Ary rehefa tonga eo an-tsisin’ny toby aho, dia izay hataoko mihitsy no tokony hataonareo.', 'hoy izy tamin’izy ireo: “jereo aho, dia ataovy izay hataoko. ary rehefa tonga eo an-tsisin’ny toby aho, dia izay hataoko mihitsy no tokony hataonareo.'),
  ('6aadc76676faefbcc5814423', '2026-09-18T23:21:10.679Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:10.679Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 7, 16, 'Dia nozarainy ho andiany telo izy 300 lahy, ka samy nomeny anjombona sy siny lehibe tsy nisy na inona na inona. Nomeny fanilo koa izy ireo hatao ao anaty siny.', 'dia nozarainy ho andiany telo izy 300 lahy, ka samy nomeny anjombona sy siny lehibe tsy nisy na inona na inona. nomeny fanilo koa izy ireo hatao ao anaty siny.'),
  ('6aadc76676faefbcc5814422', '2026-09-18T23:21:10.679Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:10.679Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 7, 15, 'Raha vao henon’i Gideona ilay nofy sy ny dikan’ilay izy, dia niankohoka izy ka nivavaka. Ary niverina tany amin’ny tobin’ny Israely izy niteny hoe: “Mitsangàna, fa hataon’i Jehovah resinareo ny tobin’ny Midianina.”', 'raha vao henon’i gideona ilay nofy sy ny dikan’ilay izy, dia niankohoka izy ka nivavaka. ary niverina tany amin’ny tobin’ny israely izy niteny hoe: “mitsangàna, fa hataon’i jehovah resinareo ny tobin’ny midianina.”'),
  ('6aadc76676faefbcc5814421', '2026-09-18T23:21:10.679Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:10.679Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 7, 14, 'Dia hoy ilay namany: “Tena ny sabatr’i Gideona ilay lehilahy israelita zanak’i Joasy izany! Hataon’Andriamanitra resiny ny Midianina sy ny toby rehetra.”', 'dia hoy ilay namany: “tena ny sabatr’i gideona ilay lehilahy israelita zanak’i joasy izany! hataon’andriamanitra resiny ny midianina sy ny toby rehetra.”'),
  ('6aadc76676faefbcc5814420', '2026-09-18T23:21:10.679Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:10.679Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 7, 13, 'Ary tonga tany i Gideona, ka naheno lehilahy nitantara nofy tamin’ny namany. Hoy ilay lehilahy: “Nanonofy aho hoe nisy mofo boribory vita tamin’ny vary orza, nikodiadia nanketo amin’ny tobin’ny Midianina. Tonga hatreny amin’ny tranolay anankiray ilay izy, dia nandona mafy azy, ka nianjera ilay tranolay. Nataony ambony ambany mihitsy ilay tranolay, ka nirodana tanteraka.”', 'ary tonga tany i gideona, ka naheno lehilahy nitantara nofy tamin’ny namany. hoy ilay lehilahy: “nanonofy aho hoe nisy mofo boribory vita tamin’ny vary orza, nikodiadia nanketo amin’ny tobin’ny midianina. tonga hatreny amin’ny tranolay anankiray ilay izy, dia nandona mafy azy, ka nianjera ilay tranolay. nataony ambony ambany mihitsy ilay tranolay, ka nirodana tanteraka.”'),
  ('6aadc76676faefbcc581441f', '2026-09-18T23:21:10.679Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:10.679Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 7, 12, 'Be dia be hoatran’ny andiam-balala ny Midianina sy ny Amalekita ary ny Tatsinanana, ka rakotra azy ireo ilay tany lemaka. Tsy voaisa ny ramevany, fa maro be hoatran’ny fasika eny amoron-dranomasina.', 'be dia be hoatran’ny andiam-balala ny midianina sy ny amalekita ary ny tatsinanana, ka rakotra azy ireo ilay tany lemaka. tsy voaisa ny ramevany, fa maro be hoatran’ny fasika eny amoron-dranomasina.'),
  ('6aadc76676faefbcc581441e', '2026-09-18T23:21:10.679Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:10.679Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 7, 11, 'Ary henoy ny resak’izy ireo, dia amin’izay ianao ho sahy hanafika ny ao an-toby.” Dia nidina izy sy Pora mpanompony ka nankany an-tsisin’ilay toby.', 'ary henoy ny resak’izy ireo, dia amin’izay ianao ho sahy hanafika ny ao an-toby.” dia nidina izy sy pora mpanompony ka nankany an-tsisin’ilay toby.'),
  ('6aadc76676faefbcc581441d', '2026-09-18T23:21:10.679Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:10.679Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 7, 10, 'Fa raha matahotra hanafika azy ireo ianao, dia midìna any amin’ilay toby miaraka amin’i Pora mpanomponao.', 'fa raha matahotra hanafika azy ireo ianao, dia midìna any amin’ilay toby miaraka amin’i pora mpanomponao.'),
  ('6aadc76676faefbcc581441c', '2026-09-18T23:21:10.679Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:10.679Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 7, 9, 'Hoy i Jehovah tamin’i Gideona, tamin’iny alina iny: “Mitsangàna ary tafiho ny tobiny, fa hataoko resinao izy ireo.', 'hoy i jehovah tamin’i gideona, tamin’iny alina iny: “mitsangàna ary tafiho ny tobiny, fa hataoko resinao izy ireo.'),
  ('6aadc76676faefbcc581441b', '2026-09-18T23:21:10.679Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:10.679Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 7, 8, 'Dia nalain’ireo 300 lahy ny vatsy sy ny anjombona teny amin’ny olona. Nalefan’i Gideona nody avy eo ny lehilahy israelita rehetra, ka 300 lahy sisa no nijanona niaraka taminy. Teny amin’ny lohasaha, teny ambanin’ny tobin-dry Gideona, no nisy ny tobin’ny Midianina.', 'dia nalain’ireo 300 lahy ny vatsy sy ny anjombona teny amin’ny olona. nalefan’i gideona nody avy eo ny lehilahy israelita rehetra, ka 300 lahy sisa no nijanona niaraka taminy. teny amin’ny lohasaha, teny ambanin’ny tobin-dry gideona, no nisy ny tobin’ny midianina.'),
  ('6aadc76676faefbcc581441a', '2026-09-18T23:21:10.679Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:10.679Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 7, 7, 'Dia hoy i Jehovah tamin’i Gideona: “Ireo 300 lahy nilelaka rano ireo no hamonjeko anareo, ary hataoko resinareo ny Midianina. Asaivo mody kosa ny olona sisa rehetra.”', 'dia hoy i jehovah tamin’i gideona: “ireo 300 lahy nilelaka rano ireo no hamonjeko anareo, ary hataoko resinareo ny midianina. asaivo mody kosa ny olona sisa rehetra.”'),
  ('6aadc76676faefbcc5814419', '2026-09-18T23:21:10.679Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:10.679Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 7, 6, 'Dia 300 lahy no nandraoka rano tamin’ny tanany ka nilelaka an’izany. Ny sisa rehetra kosa nandohalika rehefa nisotro.', 'dia 300 lahy no nandraoka rano tamin’ny tanany ka nilelaka an’izany. ny sisa rehetra kosa nandohalika rehefa nisotro.'),
  ('6aadc76676faefbcc5814418', '2026-09-18T23:21:10.679Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:10.679Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 7, 5, 'Dia nasain’i Gideona nidina teny amoron-drano ny olona. Hoy i Jehovah taminy: “Atokàny izay rehetra milelaka rano hoatran’ny filelaky ny alika. Ary atokàny izay rehetra mandohalika rehefa misotro rano.”', 'dia nasain’i gideona nidina teny amoron-drano ny olona. hoy i jehovah taminy: “atokàny izay rehetra milelaka rano hoatran’ny filelaky ny alika. ary atokàny izay rehetra mandohalika rehefa misotro rano.”'),
  ('6aadc76676faefbcc5814417', '2026-09-18T23:21:10.679Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:10.679Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 7, 4, 'Hoy ihany anefa i Jehovah tamin’i Gideona: “Mbola be loatra ireo olona ireo. Asaivo midina eny amoron-drano ry zareo, fa hisy fitsapana hataoko amin’izy ireo eny mba hanampiako anao hifidy amin’izy ireo. Dia izay teneniko aminao hoe: ‘Ento miaraka aminao io’, no hiaraka aminao. Fa izay lazaiko hoe: ‘Aza entina miaraka aminao io’, dia tsy hiaraka aminao.”', 'hoy ihany anefa i jehovah tamin’i gideona: “mbola be loatra ireo olona ireo. asaivo midina eny amoron-drano ry zareo, fa hisy fitsapana hataoko amin’izy ireo eny mba hanampiako anao hifidy amin’izy ireo. dia izay teneniko aminao hoe: ‘ento miaraka aminao io’, no hiaraka aminao. fa izay lazaiko hoe: ‘aza entina miaraka aminao io’, dia tsy hiaraka aminao.”'),
  ('6aadc76676faefbcc5814416', '2026-09-18T23:21:10.679Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:10.679Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 7, 3, 'Ilazao ny olona, azafady, hoe: ‘Afaka mody izay matahotra sy mangovitra.’” Ary nisy fitsapana nataon’i Gideona tamin’izy ireo. Dia olona 22 000 no niverina nody, ka 10 000 sisa no tavela.', 'ilazao ny olona, azafady, hoe: ‘afaka mody izay matahotra sy mangovitra.’” ary nisy fitsapana nataon’i gideona tamin’izy ireo. dia olona 22 000 no niverina nody, ka 10 000 sisa no tavela.'),
  ('6aadc76676faefbcc5814415', '2026-09-18T23:21:10.679Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:10.679Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 7, 2, 'Dia hoy i Jehovah tamin’i Gideona: “Be loatra ny olona miaraka aminao, ka tsy hataoko resin’izy ireo ny Midianina. Sao mantsy hirehareha ny Israely, dia hiteny amiko hoe: ‘Izaho ihany no namonjy ny tenako.’', 'dia hoy i jehovah tamin’i gideona: “be loatra ny olona miaraka aminao, ka tsy hataoko resin’izy ireo ny midianina. sao mantsy hirehareha ny israely, dia hiteny amiko hoe: ‘izaho ihany no namonjy ny tenako.’'),
  ('6aadc76676faefbcc5814414', '2026-09-18T23:21:10.679Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:10.679Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 7, 1, 'Ary nifoha maraina i Jerobala, izany hoe i Gideona, sy ny olona rehetra niaraka taminy, ka nitoby teo amin’ny Loharanon’i Haroda. Ny tobin’ny Midianina kosa teo avaratry ry Gideona, teo amin’ny havoanan’i More, izay teny amin’ny lohasaha.', 'ary nifoha maraina i jerobala, izany hoe i gideona, sy ny olona rehetra niaraka taminy, ka nitoby teo amin’ny loharanon’i haroda. ny tobin’ny midianina kosa teo avaratry ry gideona, teo amin’ny havoanan’i more, izay teny amin’ny lohasaha.'),
  ('6aadc7677f5212b456111fb0', '2026-09-18T23:21:11.040Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:11.040Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 8, 35, 'Nivadika tamin’ny ankohonan’i Jerobala na Gideona koa izy ireo, na dia be dia be aza ny soa nataon’i Jerobala ho an’ny Israely.', 'nivadika tamin’ny ankohonan’i jerobala na gideona koa izy ireo, na dia be dia be aza ny soa nataon’i jerobala ho an’ny israely.'),
  ('6aadc7677f5212b456111faf', '2026-09-18T23:21:11.040Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:11.040Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 8, 34, 'Tsy tsaroan’ny Israelita intsony i Jehovah Andriamaniny, izay namonjy azy ireo tamin’ny fahavalony rehetra nanodidina.', 'tsy tsaroan’ny israelita intsony i jehovah andriamaniny, izay namonjy azy ireo tamin’ny fahavalony rehetra nanodidina.'),
  ('6aadc7677f5212b456111fae', '2026-09-18T23:21:11.040Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:11.040Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 8, 33, 'Vao maty anefa i Gideona dia lasa nivavaka tamin’ireo Bala indray ny Israelita, ka i Bala-berita no nofidiny ho andriamaniny.', 'vao maty anefa i gideona dia lasa nivavaka tamin’ireo bala indray ny israelita, ka i bala-berita no nofidiny ho andriamaniny.'),
  ('6aadc7677f5212b456111fad', '2026-09-18T23:21:11.040Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:11.040Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 8, 32, 'Dia maty i Gideona zanak’i Joasy rehefa tratrantitra, ka nalevina tao amin’ny fasan’i Joasy rainy tao Ofra, tanànan’ny Abi-ezerita.', 'dia maty i gideona zanak’i joasy rehefa tratrantitra, ka nalevina tao amin’ny fasan’i joasy rainy tao ofra, tanànan’ny abi-ezerita.'),
  ('6aadc7677f5212b456111fac', '2026-09-18T23:21:11.040Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:11.040Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 8, 31, 'Nitera-dahy taminy koa ilay vadikeliny tany Sekema, ka nantsoiny hoe Abimeleka io zanany io.', 'nitera-dahy taminy koa ilay vadikeliny tany sekema, ka nantsoiny hoe abimeleka io zanany io.'),
  ('6aadc7677f5212b456111fab', '2026-09-18T23:21:11.040Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:11.040Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 8, 30, 'Ary nanan-janakalahy 70 i Gideona, satria be dia be ny vadiny.', 'ary nanan-janakalahy 70 i gideona, satria be dia be ny vadiny.'),
  ('6aadc7677f5212b456111faa', '2026-09-18T23:21:11.040Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:11.040Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 8, 29, 'Dia nody tany an-tranony i Jerobala zanak’i Joasy, ka nijanona tany.', 'dia nody tany an-tranony i jerobala zanak’i joasy, ka nijanona tany.'),
  ('6aadc7677f5212b456111fa9', '2026-09-18T23:21:11.040Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:11.040Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 8, 28, 'Dia resin’ny Israelita ny Midianina, ka tsy nila ady tamin’ny Israelita intsony izy ireo. Ary nilamina nandritra ny 40 taona ilay tany, tamin’ny andron’i Gideona.', 'dia resin’ny israelita ny midianina, ka tsy nila ady tamin’ny israelita intsony izy ireo. ary nilamina nandritra ny 40 taona ilay tany, tamin’ny andron’i gideona.'),
  ('6aadc7677f5212b456111fa8', '2026-09-18T23:21:11.040Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:11.040Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 8, 27, 'Nanamboaran’i Gideona efoda ireo volamena ireo, ary narantirantiny tao an-tanànany tany Ofra ilay efoda. Dia nivavaka tamin’ilay efoda ny Israely rehetra, ary lasa fandrika ho an’i Gideona sy ny ankohonany ilay izy.', 'nanamboaran’i gideona efoda ireo volamena ireo, ary narantirantiny tao an-tanànany tany ofra ilay efoda. dia nivavaka tamin’ilay efoda ny israely rehetra, ary lasa fandrika ho an’i gideona sy ny ankohonany ilay izy.'),
  ('6aadc7677f5212b456111fa7', '2026-09-18T23:21:11.040Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:11.040Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 8, 26, 'Nilanja 1 700 sekely ny kavin’orona volamena nangatahin’i Gideona. Nahazo an’ireto koa izy: Firavaka miendrika volan-tsinana, kavina, akanjo volonondry volomparasy nanaovan’ireo mpanjakan’ny Midianina, ary rojo teny am-bozon’ny rameva.', 'nilanja 1 700 sekely ny kavin’orona volamena nangatahin’i gideona. nahazo an’ireto koa izy: firavaka miendrika volan-tsinana, kavina, akanjo volonondry volomparasy nanaovan’ireo mpanjakan’ny midianina, ary rojo teny am-bozon’ny rameva.'),
  ('6aadc7677f5212b456111fa6', '2026-09-18T23:21:11.040Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:11.040Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 8, 25, 'Dia hoy izy ireo: “Ao fa homenay anao ireny.” Namelatra lamba izy ireo avy eo, dia samy nanipy ny kavin’orona azony teo amin’ilay izy.', 'dia hoy izy ireo: “ao fa homenay anao ireny.” namelatra lamba izy ireo avy eo, dia samy nanipy ny kavin’orona azony teo amin’ilay izy.'),
  ('6aadc7677f5212b456111fa5', '2026-09-18T23:21:11.040Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:11.040Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 8, 24, 'Hoy koa i Gideona: “Mba misy zavatra iray tiako hangatahina aminareo tsirairay anefa: Omeo ahy ny kavin’orona azonareo tamin’ny babonareo.” Nanana kavin’orona volamena mantsy ireo babo azon’izy ireo satria Ismaelita.', 'hoy koa i gideona: “mba misy zavatra iray tiako hangatahina aminareo tsirairay anefa: omeo ahy ny kavin’orona azonareo tamin’ny babonareo.” nanana kavin’orona volamena mantsy ireo babo azon’izy ireo satria ismaelita.'),
  ('6aadc7677f5212b456111fa4', '2026-09-18T23:21:11.040Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:11.040Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 8, 23, 'Fa hoy i Gideona: “Tsy ho mpitondra anareo aho, ary tsy ho mpitondra anareo koa ny zanako. I Jehovah ihany no ho mpitondra anareo.”', 'fa hoy i gideona: “tsy ho mpitondra anareo aho, ary tsy ho mpitondra anareo koa ny zanako. i jehovah ihany no ho mpitondra anareo.”'),
  ('6aadc7677f5212b456111fa3', '2026-09-18T23:21:11.040Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:11.040Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 8, 22, 'Dia hoy ny lehilahy israelita tamin’i Gideona: “Andao ianao sy ny zanakao ary ny zafikelinao hatao mpitondra anay. Namonjy anay tamin’ny Midianina mantsy ianao.”', 'dia hoy ny lehilahy israelita tamin’i gideona: “andao ianao sy ny zanakao ary ny zafikelinao hatao mpitondra anay. namonjy anay tamin’ny midianina mantsy ianao.”'),
  ('6aadc7677f5212b456111fa2', '2026-09-18T23:21:11.040Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:11.040Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 8, 21, 'Fa hoy i Zebaha sy Zalmona tamin’i Gideona: “Maninona raha ianao mihitsy no mamono anay e! Raha tena lehilahy ianao, dia asehoy ny herinao.” Dia novonoin’i Gideona i Zebaha sy Zalmona. Ary nalainy ireo ravaka miendrika volan-tsinana teny am-bozon’ny ramevan’izy ireo.', 'fa hoy i zebaha sy zalmona tamin’i gideona: “maninona raha ianao mihitsy no mamono anay e! raha tena lehilahy ianao, dia asehoy ny herinao.” dia novonoin’i gideona i zebaha sy zalmona. ary nalainy ireo ravaka miendrika volan-tsinana teny am-bozon’ny ramevan’izy ireo.'),
  ('6aadc7677f5212b456111fa1', '2026-09-18T23:21:11.040Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:11.040Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 8, 20, 'Dia hoy i Gideona tamin’i Jatera zanany lahimatoa: “Mitsangàna, ka vonoy ho faty ireo!” Tsy nanatsoaka ny sabany anefa i Jatera. Mbola tovolahy mantsy izy dia natahotra.', 'dia hoy i gideona tamin’i jatera zanany lahimatoa: “mitsangàna, ka vonoy ho faty ireo!” tsy nanatsoaka ny sabany anefa i jatera. mbola tovolahy mantsy izy dia natahotra.'),
  ('6aadc7677f5212b456111fa0', '2026-09-18T23:21:11.040Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:11.040Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 8, 19, 'Dia hoy i Gideona: “Rahalahiko izany! Zanak’i Neny! Raha mbola velona koa i Jehovah, dia tsy ho voatery hamono anareo ho faty aho, raha mba nitsimbina ny ain-dry zareo ianareo.”', 'dia hoy i gideona: “rahalahiko izany! zanak’i neny! raha mbola velona koa i jehovah, dia tsy ho voatery hamono anareo ho faty aho, raha mba nitsimbina ny ain-dry zareo ianareo.”'),
  ('6aadc7677f5212b456111f9f', '2026-09-18T23:21:11.040Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:11.040Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 8, 18, 'Ary nanontany an’i Zebaha sy Zalmona izy hoe: “Hoatran’ny ahoana izany lehilahy novonoinareo tany Tabara izany?” Dia hoy izy ireo: “Hoatr’anao izao! Hoatran’ny zanaka mpanjaka ny bikabikan-dry zareo.”', 'ary nanontany an’i zebaha sy zalmona izy hoe: “hoatran’ny ahoana izany lehilahy novonoinareo tany tabara izany?” dia hoy izy ireo: “hoatr’anao izao! hoatran’ny zanaka mpanjaka ny bikabikan-dry zareo.”'),
  ('6aadc7677f5212b456111f9e', '2026-09-18T23:21:11.040Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:11.040Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 8, 17, 'Narodany koa ilay tilikambo tao Penoela, ary novonoiny ny lehilahy tao an-tanàna.', 'narodany koa ilay tilikambo tao penoela, ary novonoiny ny lehilahy tao an-tanàna.'),
  ('6aadc7677f5212b456111f9d', '2026-09-18T23:21:11.040Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:11.040Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 8, 16, 'Dia nalain’i Gideona ny anti-panahy tao an-tanàna. Ary naka voarointsilo sy tsilon’ny tany efitra izy, dia nokapohiny tamin’ireny ireo lehilahy tao Sokota ireo ka nataony nahalala ny anarany.', 'dia nalain’i gideona ny anti-panahy tao an-tanàna. ary naka voarointsilo sy tsilon’ny tany efitra izy, dia nokapohiny tamin’ireny ireo lehilahy tao sokota ireo ka nataony nahalala ny anarany.'),
  ('6aadc7677f5212b456111f9c', '2026-09-18T23:21:11.040Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:11.040Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 8, 15, 'Nankany amin’ny lehilahy tao Sokota i Gideona avy eo, dia nilaza hoe: “Ireto amin’izay i Zebaha sy Zalmona! Ianareo mantsy nanesoeso ahy hoe: ‘Fa maninona izahay no tokony hanome mofo ho an’ireo miaramilanao efa reraka? Efa azonao angaha i Zebaha sy Zalmona?’”', 'nankany amin’ny lehilahy tao sokota i gideona avy eo, dia nilaza hoe: “ireto amin’izay i zebaha sy zalmona! ianareo mantsy nanesoeso ahy hoe: ‘fa maninona izahay no tokony hanome mofo ho an’ireo miaramilanao efa reraka? efa azonao angaha i zebaha sy zalmona?’”'),
  ('6aadc7677f5212b456111f9b', '2026-09-18T23:21:11.040Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:11.040Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 8, 14, 'Nisambotra tovolahy iray avy tao Sokota i Gideona teny an-dalana ka nohadihadiny izy io. Dia nosoratan’ilay tovolahy ny anaran’ny andrianan’i Sokota sy ny anti-panahy tao, ary nomeny an’i Gideona. Nisy 77 lahy izy ireo.', 'nisambotra tovolahy iray avy tao sokota i gideona teny an-dalana ka nohadihadiny izy io. dia nosoratan’ilay tovolahy ny anaran’ny andrianan’i sokota sy ny anti-panahy tao, ary nomeny an’i gideona. nisy 77 lahy izy ireo.'),
  ('6aadc7677f5212b456111f9a', '2026-09-18T23:21:11.040Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:11.040Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 8, 13, 'Dia niverina avy tany an’ady i Gideona, zanak’i Joasy, ary nandeha tamin’ny lalan-kely niakatra tany Heresa.', 'dia niverina avy tany an’ady i gideona, zanak’i joasy, ary nandeha tamin’ny lalan-kely niakatra tany heresa.'),
  ('6aadc7677f5212b456111f99', '2026-09-18T23:21:11.040Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:11.040Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 8, 12, 'Ary nandositra i Zebaha sy Zalmona, mpanjaka midianita, ka nenjehin’i Gideona. Dia azony i Zebaha sy Zalmona ka nisahotaka ny iray toby.', 'ary nandositra i zebaha sy zalmona, mpanjaka midianita, ka nenjehin’i gideona. dia azony i zebaha sy zalmona ka nisahotaka ny iray toby.'),
  ('6aadc7677f5212b456111f98', '2026-09-18T23:21:11.040Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:11.040Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 8, 11, 'Mbola nanohy ny diany niakatra ihany i Gideona. Ny lalana falehan’ny olona nipetraka an-tranolay, any atsinanan’i Noba sy Jogbeha, no nandehanany. Dia nanafika ny toby izy, raha iny tsy nanampo na inona na inona iny izy ireo.', 'mbola nanohy ny diany niakatra ihany i gideona. ny lalana falehan’ny olona nipetraka an-tranolay, any atsinanan’i noba sy jogbeha, no nandehanany. dia nanafika ny toby izy, raha iny tsy nanampo na inona na inona iny izy ireo.'),
  ('6aadc7677f5212b456111f97', '2026-09-18T23:21:11.040Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:11.040Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 8, 10, 'Tany Karkora i Zebaha sy Zalmona ary ny miaramilany 15 000 teo ho eo. Ireo no sisa tavela tamin’ny tafiky ny Tatsinanana manontolo, fa efa maty ny lehilahy 120 000 mpitan-tsabatra.', 'tany karkora i zebaha sy zalmona ary ny miaramilany 15 000 teo ho eo. ireo no sisa tavela tamin’ny tafiky ny tatsinanana manontolo, fa efa maty ny lehilahy 120 000 mpitan-tsabatra.'),
  ('6aadc7677f5212b456111f96', '2026-09-18T23:21:11.040Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:11.040Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 8, 9, 'Dia hoy izy tamin’ny lehilahy tao Penoela: “Harodako ity tilikambo ity rehefa tafaverina soa aman-tsara aho.”', 'dia hoy izy tamin’ny lehilahy tao penoela: “harodako ity tilikambo ity rehefa tafaverina soa aman-tsara aho.”'),
  ('6aadc7677f5212b456111f95', '2026-09-18T23:21:11.040Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:11.040Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 8, 8, 'Dia niakatra nankany Penoela izy ary nangataka hoatr’izany tamin’ny lehilahy tao koa. Nitovy tamin’ny valin-tenin’ireo lehilahy tao Sokota ihany anefa ny valin-tenin’izy ireo.', 'dia niakatra nankany penoela izy ary nangataka hoatr’izany tamin’ny lehilahy tao koa. nitovy tamin’ny valin-tenin’ireo lehilahy tao sokota ihany anefa ny valin-tenin’izy ireo.'),
  ('6aadc7677f5212b456111f94', '2026-09-18T23:21:11.040Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:11.040Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 8, 7, 'Dia hoy i Gideona: “Noho izany vavanareo izany, dia hoveleziko amin’ny voarointsilo sy amin’ny tsilon’ny tany efitra ianareo, rehefa hataon’i Jehovah resiko i Zebaha sy Zalmona.”', 'dia hoy i gideona: “noho izany vavanareo izany, dia hoveleziko amin’ny voarointsilo sy amin’ny tsilon’ny tany efitra ianareo, rehefa hataon’i jehovah resiko i zebaha sy zalmona.”'),
  ('6aadc7677f5212b456111f93', '2026-09-18T23:21:11.040Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:11.040Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 8, 6, 'Fa hoy ireo andrianan’i Sokota: “Fa maninona izahay no tokony hanome mofo ho an’ny miaramilanao? Efa azonao angaha i Zebaha sy Zalmona?”', 'fa hoy ireo andrianan’i sokota: “fa maninona izahay no tokony hanome mofo ho an’ny miaramilanao? efa azonao angaha i zebaha sy zalmona?”'),
  ('6aadc7677f5212b456111f92', '2026-09-18T23:21:11.040Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:11.040Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 8, 5, 'Niteny tamin’ireo lehilahy tao Sokota àry izy hoe: “Mba omeo mofo ny olona miaraka amiko fa reraka! Izaho mantsy manenjika an’i Zebaha sy Zalmona, mpanjakan’ny Midianina!”', 'niteny tamin’ireo lehilahy tao sokota àry izy hoe: “mba omeo mofo ny olona miaraka amiko fa reraka! izaho mantsy manenjika an’i zebaha sy zalmona, mpanjakan’ny midianina!”'),
  ('6aadc7677f5212b456111f91', '2026-09-18T23:21:11.040Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:11.040Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 8, 4, 'Ary tonga teo amin’ny Reniranon’i Jordana i Gideona, dia niampita teo. Efa reraka izy sy ireo 300 lahy niaraka taminy, nefa mbola nanenjika ny fahavalony ihany.', 'ary tonga teo amin’ny reniranon’i jordana i gideona, dia niampita teo. efa reraka izy sy ireo 300 lahy niaraka taminy, nefa mbola nanenjika ny fahavalony ihany.'),
  ('6aadc7677f5212b456111f90', '2026-09-18T23:21:11.040Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:11.040Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 8, 3, 'Ianareo ange no nampian’Andriamanitra handresy an’i Oreba sy Zeba andrianan’ny Midianina e! Fa inona moa no mba vitako raha oharina amin’ny vitanareo?” Rehefa avy niteny an’izany i Gideona, dia mba tonitony izy ireo.', 'ianareo ange no nampian’andriamanitra handresy an’i oreba sy zeba andrianan’ny midianina e! fa inona moa no mba vitako raha oharina amin’ny vitanareo?” rehefa avy niteny an’izany i gideona, dia mba tonitony izy ireo.'),
  ('6aadc7677f5212b456111f8f', '2026-09-18T23:21:11.040Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:11.040Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 8, 2, 'Hoy anefa i Gideona: “Fa inona moa no mba vitako raha oharina amin’ny vitanareo? Tsy ny sisam-boaloboky ny Efraimita ve no tsara kokoa noho ny voaloboka rehetra notazan’ny Abi-ezerita?', 'hoy anefa i gideona: “fa inona moa no mba vitako raha oharina amin’ny vitanareo? tsy ny sisam-boaloboky ny efraimita ve no tsara kokoa noho ny voaloboka rehetra notazan’ny abi-ezerita?'),
  ('6aadc7677f5212b456111f8e', '2026-09-18T23:21:11.040Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:11.040Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 8, 1, 'Dia hoy ny lehilahy efraimita tamin’i Gideona: “Fa ahoana koa izao nataonao taminay izao? Maninona izahay no tsy nantsoinao rehefa nandeha niady tamin’ny Midianina ianao?” Dia nila ady taminy izy ireo.', 'dia hoy ny lehilahy efraimita tamin’i gideona: “fa ahoana koa izao nataonao taminay izao? maninona izahay no tsy nantsoinao rehefa nandeha niady tamin’ny midianina ianao?” dia nila ady taminy izy ireo.'),
  ('6aadc767ba69b18f886c8cdb', '2026-09-18T23:21:11.719Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:11.719Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 10, 18, 'Dia nifampiresaka ny olona sy ny andrianan’i Gileada hoe: “Iza no hitarika antsika rehefa hiady amin’ny Amonita isika? Izany lehilahy izany no hataontsika mpitarika ny mponina rehetra eto Gileada.”', 'dia nifampiresaka ny olona sy ny andrianan’i gileada hoe: “iza no hitarika antsika rehefa hiady amin’ny amonita isika? izany lehilahy izany no hataontsika mpitarika ny mponina rehetra eto gileada.”'),
  ('6aadc767ba69b18f886c8cda', '2026-09-18T23:21:11.719Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:11.719Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 10, 17, 'Tatỳ aoriana, dia novorin’ny Amonita ny miaramilany ka nanangana toby tao Gileada izy ireo. Dia novorin’ny Israelita koa ny miaramilany, ary nanangana toby tao Mizpa izy ireo.', 'tatỳ aoriana, dia novorin’ny amonita ny miaramilany ka nanangana toby tao gileada izy ireo. dia novorin’ny israelita koa ny miaramilany, ary nanangana toby tao mizpa izy ireo.'),
  ('6aadc767ba69b18f886c8cd9', '2026-09-18T23:21:11.719Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:11.719Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 10, 16, 'Ary narian’izy ireo ny andriamani-kafa nivavahany, ka nanompo an’i Jehovah izy ireo. Dia tsy zakan’Andriamanitra intsony ny nahita ny fahorian’ny Israely.', 'ary narian’izy ireo ny andriamani-kafa nivavahany, ka nanompo an’i jehovah izy ireo. dia tsy zakan’andriamanitra intsony ny nahita ny fahorian’ny israely.'),
  ('6aadc767ba69b18f886c8cd8', '2026-09-18T23:21:11.719Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:11.719Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 10, 15, 'Hoy anefa ny Israelita tamin’i Jehovah: “Efa nanota izahay, ka ataovy aminay izay hitanao fa mety. Fa mba vonjeo re izahay amin’ity indray mandeha ity fotsiny e!”', 'hoy anefa ny israelita tamin’i jehovah: “efa nanota izahay, ka ataovy aminay izay hitanao fa mety. fa mba vonjeo re izahay amin’ity indray mandeha ity fotsiny e!”'),
  ('6aadc767ba69b18f886c8cd7', '2026-09-18T23:21:11.719Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:11.719Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 10, 14, 'Mandehana miantso vonjy any amin’ireo andriamanitra nofidinareo. Ireny asaina mamonjy anareo amin’izao manjo anareo izao!”', 'mandehana miantso vonjy any amin’ireo andriamanitra nofidinareo. ireny asaina mamonjy anareo amin’izao manjo anareo izao!”'),
  ('6aadc767ba69b18f886c8cd6', '2026-09-18T23:21:11.719Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:11.719Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 10, 13, 'Fa ianareo kosa niala tamiko ka nanompo andriamani-kafa. Noho izany, dia tsy hamonjy anareo intsony aho.', 'fa ianareo kosa niala tamiko ka nanompo andriamani-kafa. noho izany, dia tsy hamonjy anareo intsony aho.'),
  ('6aadc767ba69b18f886c8cd5', '2026-09-18T23:21:11.719Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:11.719Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 10, 12, 'sy ny Sidonianina sy ny Amalekita ary ny Midianina, rehefa nampijaly be anareo ireny? Rehefa nitaraina mafy tamiko ianareo, dia novonjeko ka nafahako tamin’izy ireny.', 'sy ny sidonianina sy ny amalekita ary ny midianina, rehefa nampijaly be anareo ireny? rehefa nitaraina mafy tamiko ianareo, dia novonjeko ka nafahako tamin’izy ireny.'),
  ('6aadc767ba69b18f886c8cd4', '2026-09-18T23:21:11.719Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:11.719Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 10, 11, 'Hoy anefa i Jehovah tamin’ny Israelita: “Fa izaho angaha tsy namonjy anareo tamin’ny Ejipsianina sy ny Amorita sy ny Amonita sy ny Filistinina', 'hoy anefa i jehovah tamin’ny israelita: “fa izaho angaha tsy namonjy anareo tamin’ny ejipsianina sy ny amorita sy ny amonita sy ny filistinina'),
  ('6aadc767ba69b18f886c8cd3', '2026-09-18T23:21:11.719Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:11.719Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 10, 10, 'Dia niantso vonjy tamin’i Jehovah ny Israelita hoe: “Efa nanota taminao izahay ry Andriamanitray ô, satria niala taminao izahay ka nanompo an’ireo Bala.”', 'dia niantso vonjy tamin’i jehovah ny israelita hoe: “efa nanota taminao izahay ry andriamanitray ô, satria niala taminao izahay ka nanompo an’ireo bala.”'),
  ('6aadc767ba69b18f886c8cd2', '2026-09-18T23:21:11.719Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:11.719Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 10, 9, 'Niampita an’i Jordana koa ny Amonita mba hiady tamin’ny fokon’i Joda sy Benjamina ary Efraima, ka nijaly be ny Israely.', 'niampita an’i jordana koa ny amonita mba hiady tamin’ny fokon’i joda sy benjamina ary efraima, ka nijaly be ny israely.'),
  ('6aadc767ba69b18f886c8cd1', '2026-09-18T23:21:11.719Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:11.719Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 10, 8, 'Dia nampijalin’izy ireo sy nampahoriny mafy ny Israelita tamin’izany taona izany. Nampahorin’izy ireo nandritra ny 18 taona ny Israelita rehetra nipetraka tany amin’ny tanin’ny Amorita, tany Gileada, teny ampitan’i Jordana.', 'dia nampijalin’izy ireo sy nampahoriny mafy ny israelita tamin’izany taona izany. nampahorin’izy ireo nandritra ny 18 taona ny israelita rehetra nipetraka tany amin’ny tanin’ny amorita, tany gileada, teny ampitan’i jordana.'),
  ('6aadc767ba69b18f886c8cd0', '2026-09-18T23:21:11.719Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:11.719Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 10, 7, 'Dia tezitra be tamin’ny Israely i Jehovah, ka navelany hanjakazaka teo amin’ny Israely ny Filistinina sy ny Amonita.', 'dia tezitra be tamin’ny israely i jehovah, ka navelany hanjakazaka teo amin’ny israely ny filistinina sy ny amonita.'),
  ('6aadc767ba69b18f886c8ccf', '2026-09-18T23:21:11.719Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:11.719Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 10, 6, 'Nanao izay ratsy teo imason’i Jehovah indray ny Israelita, ka nanompo an’ireo Bala, sy ireo sarin’i Astarta, sy ireo andriamanitr’i Arama, sy ireo andriamanitr’i Sidona, sy ireo andriamanitr’i Moaba, sy ireo andriamanitry ny Amonita, ary ireo andriamanitry ny Filistinina. Niala tamin’i Jehovah izy ireo ary tsy nanompo azy intsony.', 'nanao izay ratsy teo imason’i jehovah indray ny israelita, ka nanompo an’ireo bala, sy ireo sarin’i astarta, sy ireo andriamanitr’i arama, sy ireo andriamanitr’i sidona, sy ireo andriamanitr’i moaba, sy ireo andriamanitry ny amonita, ary ireo andriamanitry ny filistinina. niala tamin’i jehovah izy ireo ary tsy nanompo azy intsony.'),
  ('6aadc767ba69b18f886c8cce', '2026-09-18T23:21:11.719Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:11.719Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 10, 5, 'Dia maty i Jaira ka nalevina tao Kamona.', 'dia maty i jaira ka nalevina tao kamona.'),
  ('6aadc767ba69b18f886c8ccd', '2026-09-18T23:21:11.719Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:11.719Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 10, 4, 'Nanan-janakalahy 30 izy. Nitaingina ampondra 30 izy ireo ary nanana tanàna 30. Mbola antsoina hoe Havota-jaira ireo tanàna ireo hatramin’izao, ary any Gileada no misy azy.', 'nanan-janakalahy 30 izy. nitaingina ampondra 30 izy ireo ary nanana tanàna 30. mbola antsoina hoe havota-jaira ireo tanàna ireo hatramin’izao, ary any gileada no misy azy.'),
  ('6aadc767ba69b18f886c8ccc', '2026-09-18T23:21:11.719Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:11.719Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 10, 3, 'Ary nandimby azy i Jaira Gileadita, izay nitsara ny Israely nandritra ny 22 taona.', 'ary nandimby azy i jaira gileadita, izay nitsara ny israely nandritra ny 22 taona.'),
  ('6aadc767ba69b18f886c8ccb', '2026-09-18T23:21:11.719Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:11.719Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 10, 2, 'Nitsara ny Israely nandritra ny 23 taona izy, dia maty ka nalevina tao Samira.', 'nitsara ny israely nandritra ny 23 taona izy, dia maty ka nalevina tao samira.'),
  ('6aadc767ba69b18f886c8cca', '2026-09-18T23:21:11.719Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:11.719Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 10, 1, 'Taorian’ny nahafatesan’i Abimeleka, dia nitsangana hamonjy ny Israely i Tola, lehilahy avy amin’ny fokon’i Isakara. Zanak’i Poha zanak’i Dodo izy ary nipetraka tany Samira, any amin’ny faritra be tendrombohitr’i Efraima.', 'taorian’ny nahafatesan’i abimeleka, dia nitsangana hamonjy ny israely i tola, lehilahy avy amin’ny fokon’i isakara. zanak’i poha zanak’i dodo izy ary nipetraka tany samira, any amin’ny faritra be tendrombohitr’i efraima.'),
  ('6aadc7699106ab967f69529a', '2026-09-18T23:21:13.982Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:13.982Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 14, 18, 'Raha mbola tsy nilentika àry ny masoandro tamin’ny andro fahafito, dia hoy ny lehilahy tao an-tanàna taminy: “Inona no mamy noho ny tantely, Ary inona no matanjaka noho ny liona?” Fa hoy i Samsona tamin’izy ireo: “Raha tsy ny ombivavikeliko no nampiasainareo hiasa ny tany, Dia tsy ho nahita ny valin’ny ankamantatro ianareo.”', 'raha mbola tsy nilentika àry ny masoandro tamin’ny andro fahafito, dia hoy ny lehilahy tao an-tanàna taminy: “inona no mamy noho ny tantely, ary inona no matanjaka noho ny liona?” fa hoy i samsona tamin’izy ireo: “raha tsy ny ombivavikeliko no nampiasainareo hiasa ny tany, dia tsy ho nahita ny valin’ny ankamantatro ianareo.”'),
  ('6aadc7699106ab967f695299', '2026-09-18T23:21:13.982Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:13.982Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 14, 17, 'Nitomany teo aminy foana anefa ilay vehivavy taorian’izay, mandra-pahatongan’ilay andro fahafito tamin’ilay fanasambe. Farany, dia nolazain’i Samsona taminy ihany ny valin’ilay izy tamin’ny andro fahafito, satria tsy namelany mihitsy izy raha tsy nilaza. Dia notenenin’ilay vehivavy tamin’ny fireneny ny valin’ilay ankamantatra.', 'nitomany teo aminy foana anefa ilay vehivavy taorian’izay, mandra-pahatongan’ilay andro fahafito tamin’ilay fanasambe. farany, dia nolazain’i samsona taminy ihany ny valin’ilay izy tamin’ny andro fahafito, satria tsy namelany mihitsy izy raha tsy nilaza. dia notenenin’ilay vehivavy tamin’ny fireneny ny valin’ilay ankamantatra.'),
  ('6aadc7699106ab967f695298', '2026-09-18T23:21:13.982Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:13.982Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 14, 16, 'Dia nitomany teo amin’i Samsona ny vadiny, sady niteny hoe: “Halanao mihitsy aho fa tsy tianao akory. Efa nanao ankamantatra tamin’ny fireneko ianao, nefa tsy nolazainao tamiko ny valiny.” Fa hoy i Samsona taminy: “Na ny dada sy mamako aza tsy nilazako an’ilay izy, dia ianao indray ve no hilazako an’ilay izy?”', 'dia nitomany teo amin’i samsona ny vadiny, sady niteny hoe: “halanao mihitsy aho fa tsy tianao akory. efa nanao ankamantatra tamin’ny fireneko ianao, nefa tsy nolazainao tamiko ny valiny.” fa hoy i samsona taminy: “na ny dada sy mamako aza tsy nilazako an’ilay izy, dia ianao indray ve no hilazako an’ilay izy?”'),
  ('6aadc7699106ab967f695297', '2026-09-18T23:21:13.982Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:13.982Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 14, 15, 'Ary tamin’ny andro fahefatra, dia hoy izy ireo tamin’ny vadin’i Samsona: “Fetseo ny vadinao mba hilazany amintsika ny valin’ilay ankamantatra. Raha tsy izany, dia hodoranay ianao sy ny ankohonan-drainao. Ny haka ny fanananay ve izany no antony nanasanareo anay?”', 'ary tamin’ny andro fahefatra, dia hoy izy ireo tamin’ny vadin’i samsona: “fetseo ny vadinao mba hilazany amintsika ny valin’ilay ankamantatra. raha tsy izany, dia hodoranay ianao sy ny ankohonan-drainao. ny haka ny fanananay ve izany no antony nanasanareo anay?”'),
  ('6aadc7699106ab967f695296', '2026-09-18T23:21:13.982Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:13.982Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 14, 14, 'Dia hoy izy: “Avy tao amin’ny mpihinana no nivoahan’ny zavatra azo hanina, Ary avy tao amin’ny matanjaka no nivoahan’ny mamy.” Tsy hitan’izy ireo anefa ny valin’ilay ankamantatra, nandritra ny telo andro.', 'dia hoy izy: “avy tao amin’ny mpihinana no nivoahan’ny zavatra azo hanina, ary avy tao amin’ny matanjaka no nivoahan’ny mamy.” tsy hitan’izy ireo anefa ny valin’ilay ankamantatra, nandritra ny telo andro.'),
  ('6aadc7699106ab967f695295', '2026-09-18T23:21:13.982Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:13.982Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 14, 13, 'Fa raha tsy hainareo kosa ny valiny, dia tsy maintsy manome ahy akanjo 30 vita amin’ny lamba rongony sy akanjo 30 hafa ianareo.” Dia hoy izy ireo: “Lazao àry ny ankamantatrao hohenoinay.”', 'fa raha tsy hainareo kosa ny valiny, dia tsy maintsy manome ahy akanjo 30 vita amin’ny lamba rongony sy akanjo 30 hafa ianareo.” dia hoy izy ireo: “lazao àry ny ankamantatrao hohenoinay.”'),
  ('6aadc7699106ab967f695294', '2026-09-18T23:21:13.982Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:13.982Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 14, 12, 'Ary hoy izy tamin’izy ireo: “Mba hanao ankamantatra aminareo aho. Raha hainareo ao anatin’ny fito andro anaovana ny fanasambe ny valiny sady teneninareo ahy, dia homeko akanjo 30 vita amin’ny lamba rongony sy akanjo 30 hafa ianareo.', 'ary hoy izy tamin’izy ireo: “mba hanao ankamantatra aminareo aho. raha hainareo ao anatin’ny fito andro anaovana ny fanasambe ny valiny sady teneninareo ahy, dia homeko akanjo 30 vita amin’ny lamba rongony sy akanjo 30 hafa ianareo.'),
  ('6aadc7699106ab967f695293', '2026-09-18T23:21:13.982Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:13.982Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 14, 11, 'Rehefa nahita an’i Samsona ny olona, dia naka lehilahy 30 mba ho namana hanotrona azy.', 'rehefa nahita an’i samsona ny olona, dia naka lehilahy 30 mba ho namana hanotrona azy.'),
  ('6aadc7699106ab967f695292', '2026-09-18T23:21:13.982Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:13.982Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 14, 10, 'Dia nidina nankany amin’ilay vehivavy ny dadan’i Samsona. Ary nanao fanasambe tany i Samsona, fa izany no fanaon’ny tovolahy.', 'dia nidina nankany amin’ilay vehivavy ny dadan’i samsona. ary nanao fanasambe tany i samsona, fa izany no fanaon’ny tovolahy.'),
  ('6aadc7699106ab967f695291', '2026-09-18T23:21:13.982Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:13.982Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 14, 9, 'Dia nakan’i Samsona ilay tantely ka nataony teo amin’ny felatanany, ary sady nandeha izy no nihinana. Rehefa tratrany ny rainy sy ny reniny, dia nomeny tamin’ilay tantely ka nihinana izy ireo. Tsy notenenin’i Samsona tamin’izy ireo anefa hoe tao amin’ny fatin’ilay liona no nakany an’ilay tantely.', 'dia nakan’i samsona ilay tantely ka nataony teo amin’ny felatanany, ary sady nandeha izy no nihinana. rehefa tratrany ny rainy sy ny reniny, dia nomeny tamin’ilay tantely ka nihinana izy ireo. tsy notenenin’i samsona tamin’izy ireo anefa hoe tao amin’ny fatin’ilay liona no nakany an’ilay tantely.'),
  ('6aadc7699106ab967f695290', '2026-09-18T23:21:13.982Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:13.982Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 14, 8, 'Niverina tany i Samsona, tatỳ aoriana, mba haka an’ilay vehivavy ho any an-tranony. Ary nivily mba hijery ny fatin’ilay liona izy, ka nahita renitantely be dia be tao amin’ilay izy, ary efa nisy tantely koa tao.', 'niverina tany i samsona, tatỳ aoriana, mba haka an’ilay vehivavy ho any an-tranony. ary nivily mba hijery ny fatin’ilay liona izy, ka nahita renitantely be dia be tao amin’ilay izy, ary efa nisy tantely koa tao.'),
  ('6aadc7699106ab967f69528f', '2026-09-18T23:21:13.982Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:13.982Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 14, 7, 'Dia nanohy ny diany nidina izy, ka niresaka tamin’ilay vehivavy. Ary hitan’i Samsona hoe mbola nety tsara taminy izy.', 'dia nanohy ny diany nidina izy, ka niresaka tamin’ilay vehivavy. ary hitan’i samsona hoe mbola nety tsara taminy izy.'),
  ('6aadc7699106ab967f69528e', '2026-09-18T23:21:13.982Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:13.982Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 14, 6, 'Dia nanome hery azy ny fanahin’i Jehovah, ka nozarainy roa hoatran’ny nizara zanak’osy ilay liona, nefa tsy nisy na inona na inona teny an-tanany. Tsy noteniteneniny tamin’ny rainy sy ny reniny anefa izay nataony.', 'dia nanome hery azy ny fanahin’i jehovah, ka nozarainy roa hoatran’ny nizara zanak’osy ilay liona, nefa tsy nisy na inona na inona teny an-tanany. tsy noteniteneniny tamin’ny rainy sy ny reniny anefa izay nataony.'),
  ('6aadc7699106ab967f69528d', '2026-09-18T23:21:13.982Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:13.982Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 14, 5, 'Dia nidina nankany Timna i Samsona sy ny rainy ary ny reniny. Rehefa tonga tany amin’ ny tanimboaloboka tao Timna i Samsona, dia nisy liona nierona nanatona azy.', 'dia nidina nankany timna i samsona sy ny rainy ary ny reniny. rehefa tonga tany amin’ ny tanimboaloboka tao timna i samsona, dia nisy liona nierona nanatona azy.'),
  ('6aadc7699106ab967f69528c', '2026-09-18T23:21:13.982Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:13.982Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 14, 4, 'Tsy fantatry ny rainy sy ny reniny hoe i Jehovah no nahatonga azy hanapa-kevitra hoatr’izany. Nitady hirika hamelezana ny Filistinina mantsy Izy, satria ny Filistinina no nifehy ny Israely tamin’izany fotoana izany.', 'tsy fantatry ny rainy sy ny reniny hoe i jehovah no nahatonga azy hanapa-kevitra hoatr’izany. nitady hirika hamelezana ny filistinina mantsy izy, satria ny filistinina no nifehy ny israely tamin’izany fotoana izany.'),
  ('6aadc7699106ab967f69528b', '2026-09-18T23:21:13.982Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:13.982Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 14, 3, 'Niteny taminy anefa ny rainy sy ny reniny hoe: “Fa angaha ianao tsy mahita vehivavy eo amin’ny havanao na eto amin’ny firenentsika? Tsy maintsy any amin’ny Filistinina tsy mifora ve ianao no haka vady?” Fa hoy i Samsona tamin’ny rainy: “Alaivo ho ahy izy, fa izy no hitako hoe mety amiko.”', 'niteny taminy anefa ny rainy sy ny reniny hoe: “fa angaha ianao tsy mahita vehivavy eo amin’ny havanao na eto amin’ny firenentsika? tsy maintsy any amin’ny filistinina tsy mifora ve ianao no haka vady?” fa hoy i samsona tamin’ny rainy: “alaivo ho ahy izy, fa izy no hitako hoe mety amiko.”'),
  ('6aadc7699106ab967f69528a', '2026-09-18T23:21:13.982Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:13.982Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 14, 2, 'Dia niakatra nankany amin’ny rainy sy ny reniny izy, dia niteny hoe: “Nisy vehivavy filistinina nahasarika ahy tany Timna. Mba alaivo ho vadiko izy.”', 'dia niakatra nankany amin’ny rainy sy ny reniny izy, dia niteny hoe: “nisy vehivavy filistinina nahasarika ahy tany timna. mba alaivo ho vadiko izy.”'),
  ('6aadc7699106ab967f695289', '2026-09-18T23:21:13.982Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:13.982Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 14, 1, 'Ary nidina nankany Timna i Samsona, ka nahita vehivavy filistinina anankiray tany.', 'ary nidina nankany timna i samsona, ka nahita vehivavy filistinina anankiray tany.'),
  ('6aadc7699106ab967f69529c', '2026-09-18T23:21:13.983Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:13.983Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 14, 20, 'Dia nomena ho an’ny iray tamin’ireo namany nanotrona azy ny vadin’i Samsona.', 'dia nomena ho an’ny iray tamin’ireo namany nanotrona azy ny vadin’i samsona.'),
  ('6aadc7699106ab967f69529b', '2026-09-18T23:21:13.983Z', '2026-09-18T23:21:13.983Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 14, 19, 'Dia nanome hery an’i Samsona ny fanahin’i Jehovah, ka nidina nankany Askelona izy, ary namono lehilahy 30 tao. Dia nalainy ny akanjon’ireny, ka nomeny an’ireo nilaza ny valin’ilay ankamantatra. Ary tezitra be i Samsona, tamin’izy nandeha niakatra ho any an-tranon-drainy.', 'dia nanome hery an’i samsona ny fanahin’i jehovah, ka nidina nankany askelona izy, ary namono lehilahy 30 tao. dia nalainy ny akanjon’ireny, ka nomeny an’ireo nilaza ny valin’ilay ankamantatra. ary tezitra be i samsona, tamin’izy nandeha niakatra ho any an-tranon-drainy.'),
  ('6ab25a04d3d28789d0edeb36', '2026-09-22T10:35:48.884Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:48.884Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 15, 10, 'Ary hoy ny lehilahy avy tamin’ny fokon’i Joda: “Fa maninona ianareo no miakatra hamely anay?” Dia hoy izy ireo: “Hisambotra an’i Samsona no niakaranay. Tianay hatao aminy koa izay nataony taminay.”', 'ary hoy ny lehilahy avy tamin’ny fokon’i joda: “fa maninona ianareo no miakatra hamely anay?” dia hoy izy ireo: “hisambotra an’i samsona no niakaranay. tianay hatao aminy koa izay nataony taminay.”'),
  ('6ab25a04d3d28789d0edeb3e', '2026-09-22T10:35:48.884Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:48.884Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 15, 18, 'Dia nangetaheta be izy, ka nitaraina tamin’i Jehovah hoe: “Ianao no nanampy ny mpanomponao ka nahatonga an’izao famonjena lehibe izao. Dia avelanao ho fatin’ny hetaheta ve aho izao, ka ho voasambotry ny tsy mifora?”', 'dia nangetaheta be izy, ka nitaraina tamin’i jehovah hoe: “ianao no nanampy ny mpanomponao ka nahatonga an’izao famonjena lehibe izao. dia avelanao ho fatin’ny hetaheta ve aho izao, ka ho voasambotry ny tsy mifora?”'),
  ('6ab25a04d3d28789d0edeb3f', '2026-09-22T10:35:48.884Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:48.884Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 15, 19, 'Nataon’Andriamanitra nitresaka àry ny lavaka iray tao Lehy, ka nisy rano nivoaka avy tao. Dia nisotro izy, ary nody ny ainy ka velombelona izy. Izany no nahatonga azy hiantso an’ilay toerana hoe En-hakore. Mbola any Lehy izy io hatramin’izao.', 'nataon’andriamanitra nitresaka àry ny lavaka iray tao lehy, ka nisy rano nivoaka avy tao. dia nisotro izy, ary nody ny ainy ka velombelona izy. izany no nahatonga azy hiantso an’ilay toerana hoe en-hakore. mbola any lehy izy io hatramin’izao.'),
  ('6ab25a04d3d28789d0edeb2e', '2026-09-22T10:35:48.884Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:48.884Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 15, 2, 'Fa hoy ny rain’ilay vehivavy: “Nieritreritra aho hoe: ‘Tsy tianao intsony mihitsy izy’, dia nomeko an’ilay namanao nanotrona anao. Ny zandriny vavy ange tsara tarehy noho izy e! Mba izy hatao solony.”', 'fa hoy ny rain’ilay vehivavy: “nieritreritra aho hoe: ‘tsy tianao intsony mihitsy izy’, dia nomeko an’ilay namanao nanotrona anao. ny zandriny vavy ange tsara tarehy noho izy e! mba izy hatao solony.”'),
  ('6ab25a04d3d28789d0edeb3b', '2026-09-22T10:35:48.884Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:48.884Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 15, 15, 'Nahita valanoranon’ampondralahy izy, ary mbola mando ilay taolana tamin’izay. Dia nalainy ilay izy, ka namono 1 000 lahy tamin’iny izy.', 'nahita valanoranon’ampondralahy izy, ary mbola mando ilay taolana tamin’izay. dia nalainy ilay izy, ka namono 1 000 lahy tamin’iny izy.'),
  ('6ab25a04d3d28789d0edeb39', '2026-09-22T10:35:48.884Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:48.884Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 15, 13, 'Dia hoy izy ireo taminy: “Tsy hikasi-tanana anao izahay, fa hamatotra anao fotsiny dia hanolotra anao ho an-dry zareo. Tsy hamono anao ho faty izahay.” Dia namatotra azy tamin’ny tady roa vaovao izy ireo, ka nentin’izy ireo niala tao amin’ilay harambato izy.', 'dia hoy izy ireo taminy: “tsy hikasi-tanana anao izahay, fa hamatotra anao fotsiny dia hanolotra anao ho an-dry zareo. tsy hamono anao ho faty izahay.” dia namatotra azy tamin’ny tady roa vaovao izy ireo, ka nentin’izy ireo niala tao amin’ilay harambato izy.'),
  ('6ab25a04d3d28789d0edeb37', '2026-09-22T10:35:48.884Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:48.884Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 15, 11, 'Koa nidina tany amin’ilay lava-bato, tany amin’ny harambato Etama, ny lehilahy 3 000 avy tamin’ny fokon’i Joda. Hoy izy ireo tamin’i Samsona: “Tsy fantatrao angaha fa ny Filistinina no mifehy antsika? Dia maninona izahay no ataonao an’izao?” Dia hoy izy tamin’izy ireo: “Izay nataony tamiko ihany no nataoko taminy.”', 'koa nidina tany amin’ilay lava-bato, tany amin’ny harambato etama, ny lehilahy 3 000 avy tamin’ny fokon’i joda. hoy izy ireo tamin’i samsona: “tsy fantatrao angaha fa ny filistinina no mifehy antsika? dia maninona izahay no ataonao an’izao?” dia hoy izy tamin’izy ireo: “izay nataony tamiko ihany no nataoko taminy.”'),
  ('6ab25a04d3d28789d0edeb32', '2026-09-22T10:35:48.884Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:48.884Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 15, 6, 'Ary hoy ny Filistinina: “Fa iza no nanao an’izao?” Ary nisy niteny hoe: “I Samsona, vinantolahin’ilay Timnita. Nalain’ny rafozandahiny mantsy ny vadin’i Samsona, dia nomeny an’ilay namany nanotrona azy.” Dia niakatra ny Filistinina ka nandoro an’ilay vehivavy sy ny dadany.', 'ary hoy ny filistinina: “fa iza no nanao an’izao?” ary nisy niteny hoe: “i samsona, vinantolahin’ilay timnita. nalain’ny rafozandahiny mantsy ny vadin’i samsona, dia nomeny an’ilay namany nanotrona azy.” dia niakatra ny filistinina ka nandoro an’ilay vehivavy sy ny dadany.'),
  ('6ab25a04d3d28789d0edeb30', '2026-09-22T10:35:48.884Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:48.884Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 15, 4, 'Nandeha nisambotra amboadia 300 àry i Samsona, ary naka fanilo be dia be. Dia nataony nifamatotra tsiroaroa ny rambon’ireo amboadia ireo, ka nasiany fanilo iray teo anelanelan’ny rambo roa.', 'nandeha nisambotra amboadia 300 àry i samsona, ary naka fanilo be dia be. dia nataony nifamatotra tsiroaroa ny rambon’ireo amboadia ireo, ka nasiany fanilo iray teo anelanelan’ny rambo roa.'),
  ('6ab25a04d3d28789d0edeb3c', '2026-09-22T10:35:48.884Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:48.884Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 15, 16, 'Ary hoy i Samsona: “Valanoranon’ampondra iray no nanaovako antontany iray, antontany roa! Valanoranon’ampondra iray no namonoako 1 000 lahy.”', 'ary hoy i samsona: “valanoranon’ampondra iray no nanaovako antontany iray, antontany roa! valanoranon’ampondra iray no namonoako 1 000 lahy.”'),
  ('6ab25a04d3d28789d0edeb38', '2026-09-22T10:35:48.884Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:48.884Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 15, 12, 'Hoy anefa izy ireo: “Tonga hisambotra anao sy hanolotra anao ho an’ny Filistinina izahay.” Dia hoy i Samsona: “Mila mianiana amiko àry ianareo hoe tsy hikasi-tanana ahy.”', 'hoy anefa izy ireo: “tonga hisambotra anao sy hanolotra anao ho an’ny filistinina izahay.” dia hoy i samsona: “mila mianiana amiko àry ianareo hoe tsy hikasi-tanana ahy.”'),
  ('6ab25a04d3d28789d0edeb3d', '2026-09-22T10:35:48.884Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:48.884Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 15, 17, 'Rehefa avy niteny an’izany izy, dia natsipiny ilay valanorano. Ary nataony hoe Ramata-lehy ny anaran’ilay toerana.', 'rehefa avy niteny an’izany izy, dia natsipiny ilay valanorano. ary nataony hoe ramata-lehy ny anaran’ilay toerana.'),
  ('6ab25a04d3d28789d0edeb3a', '2026-09-22T10:35:48.884Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:48.884Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 15, 14, 'Rehefa tonga tany Lehy izy, dia nihorakoraka ny Filistinina nahita azy. Dia nanome hery an’i Samsona ny fanahin’i Jehovah, ka lasa toy ny kofehy rongony main’ny afo ny tady teny amin’ny sandriny. Ary niala ny tady namatorana ny tanany.', 'rehefa tonga tany lehy izy, dia nihorakoraka ny filistinina nahita azy. dia nanome hery an’i samsona ny fanahin’i jehovah, ka lasa toy ny kofehy rongony main’ny afo ny tady teny amin’ny sandriny. ary niala ny tady namatorana ny tanany.'),
  ('6ab25a04d3d28789d0edeb2f', '2026-09-22T10:35:48.884Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:48.884Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 15, 3, 'Fa hoy i Samsona tamin’izy ireo: “Tsy afaka ny hanome tsiny ahy kosa ny Filistinina amin’ity indray mandeha ity, raha mamely an-dry zareo aho.”', 'fa hoy i samsona tamin’izy ireo: “tsy afaka ny hanome tsiny ahy kosa ny filistinina amin’ity indray mandeha ity, raha mamely an-dry zareo aho.”'),
  ('6ab25a04d3d28789d0edeb2d', '2026-09-22T10:35:48.884Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:48.884Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 15, 1, 'Nandeha nitsidika ny vadiny i Samsona taoriana kelin’izay, tamin’ny fotoam-pijinjana varimbazaha, ary nitondra zanak’osy. Dia hoy izy: “Te ho ao amin’ny vadiko ao amin’ny efitra fatoriana aho.” Tsy navelan’ny rain’ilay vehivavy hankany anefa izy.', 'nandeha nitsidika ny vadiny i samsona taoriana kelin’izay, tamin’ny fotoam-pijinjana varimbazaha, ary nitondra zanak’osy. dia hoy izy: “te ho ao amin’ny vadiko ao amin’ny efitra fatoriana aho.” tsy navelan’ny rain’ilay vehivavy hankany anefa izy.'),
  ('6ab25a04d3d28789d0edeb40', '2026-09-22T10:35:48.884Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:48.884Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 15, 20, 'Ary nitsara ny Israely nandritra ny 20 taona izy, tamin’ny andro nifehezan’ny Filistinina azy ireo.', 'ary nitsara ny israely nandritra ny 20 taona izy, tamin’ny andro nifehezan’ny filistinina azy ireo.'),
  ('6ab25a04d3d28789d0edeb35', '2026-09-22T10:35:48.884Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:48.884Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 15, 9, 'Tatỳ aoriana, dia niakatra ny Filistinina ka nitoby tany Joda sy nihaodihaody tany Lehy.', 'tatỳ aoriana, dia niakatra ny filistinina ka nitoby tany joda sy nihaodihaody tany lehy.'),
  ('6ab25a04d3d28789d0edeb33', '2026-09-22T10:35:48.884Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:48.884Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 15, 7, 'Ary hoy i Samsona tamin’izy ireo: “Raha izany no ataonareo, dia tsy hijanona mihitsy aho raha tsy vitako ny mamaly an’izay nataonareo.”', 'ary hoy i samsona tamin’izy ireo: “raha izany no ataonareo, dia tsy hijanona mihitsy aho raha tsy vitako ny mamaly an’izay nataonareo.”'),
  ('6ab25a04d3d28789d0edeb31', '2026-09-22T10:35:48.884Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:48.884Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 15, 5, 'Ary nampirehetiny ny fanilo, dia nalefany hankeny an-tanimbolin’ny Filistinina ireo amboadia. Dia nodoran’i Samsona daholo ireo vokatra efa vita amboara, sy ny voly teny an-tsaha, sy ny tanimboaloboka, ary ny sahan’oliva.', 'ary nampirehetiny ny fanilo, dia nalefany hankeny an-tanimbolin’ny filistinina ireo amboadia. dia nodoran’i samsona daholo ireo vokatra efa vita amboara, sy ny voly teny an-tsaha, sy ny tanimboaloboka, ary ny sahan’oliva.'),
  ('6ab25a04d3d28789d0edeb34', '2026-09-22T10:35:48.884Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:48.884Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 15, 8, 'Dia novonoiny tsirairay izy ireo, ary be dia be no maty. Nidina izy avy eo ka nipetraka tao anaty lava-bato, tany amin’ny harambato atao hoe Etama.', 'dia novonoiny tsirairay izy ireo, ary be dia be no maty. nidina izy avy eo ka nipetraka tao anaty lava-bato, tany amin’ny harambato atao hoe etama.'),
  ('6ab25a06cdfd8fc78833d6b0', '2026-09-22T10:35:50.402Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:50.402Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 16, 1, 'Nankany Gaza i Samsona indray mandeha. Nahita vehivavy mpivaro-tena izy tany, ka nankao an-tranony.', 'nankany gaza i samsona indray mandeha. nahita vehivavy mpivaro-tena izy tany, ka nankao an-tranony.'),
  ('6ab25a06cdfd8fc78833d6ba', '2026-09-22T10:35:50.402Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:50.402Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 16, 11, 'Dia hoy i Samsona: “Raha fatorana amin’ny tady vaovao mbola tsy nampiasaina aho, dia halemy hoatran’ny olon-drehetra ihany.”', 'dia hoy i samsona: “raha fatorana amin’ny tady vaovao mbola tsy nampiasaina aho, dia halemy hoatran’ny olon-drehetra ihany.”'),
  ('6ab25a06cdfd8fc78833d6b7', '2026-09-22T10:35:50.402Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:50.402Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 16, 8, 'Dia niakatra nankany amin’ilay vehivavy ireo andrianan’ny Filistinina, ka nitondra tady fito mbola tsy nohamainina. Ary nofatoran’ilay vehivavy tamin’ireny i Samsona.', 'dia niakatra nankany amin’ilay vehivavy ireo andrianan’ny filistinina, ka nitondra tady fito mbola tsy nohamainina. ary nofatoran’ilay vehivavy tamin’ireny i samsona.'),
  ('6ab25a06cdfd8fc78833d6b5', '2026-09-22T10:35:50.402Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:50.402Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 16, 6, 'Taorian’izay, dia hoy i Delila tamin’i Samsona: “Eo moa mba lazao amiko hoe inona no mahatonga anao hatanjaka be hoatr’izao e, dia inona no azo amatorana anao mba hahafahana mifehy anao.”', 'taorian’izay, dia hoy i delila tamin’i samsona: “eo moa mba lazao amiko hoe inona no mahatonga anao hatanjaka be hoatr’izao e, dia inona no azo amatorana anao mba hahafahana mifehy anao.”'),
  ('6ab25a06cdfd8fc78833d6c3', '2026-09-22T10:35:50.402Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:50.402Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 16, 20, 'Dia niantsoantso ilay vehivavy hoe: “Tonga hamely anao ny Filistinina, ry Samsona!” Dia nifoha i Samsona, ka niteny hoe: “Ho tafavoaka hoatran’ny teo aloha ihany aho. Hikofokofoka aho, dia ho afaka.” Tsy fantany anefa fa efa niala taminy i Jehovah.', 'dia niantsoantso ilay vehivavy hoe: “tonga hamely anao ny filistinina, ry samsona!” dia nifoha i samsona, ka niteny hoe: “ho tafavoaka hoatran’ny teo aloha ihany aho. hikofokofoka aho, dia ho afaka.” tsy fantany anefa fa efa niala taminy i jehovah.'),
  ('6ab25a06cdfd8fc78833d6b9', '2026-09-22T10:35:50.402Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:50.402Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 16, 10, 'Ary hoy i Delila tamin’i Samsona: “Sady namitaka ahy ianao no nandainga tamiko. Mba lazao ahy amin’izay moa izay azo amatorana anao e!”', 'ary hoy i delila tamin’i samsona: “sady namitaka ahy ianao no nandainga tamiko. mba lazao ahy amin’izay moa izay azo amatorana anao e!”'),
  ('6ab25a06cdfd8fc78833d6c2', '2026-09-22T10:35:50.402Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:50.402Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 16, 19, 'Ary nampatorin’ilay vehivavy teo ambony lohaliny i Samsona. Dia niantso lehilahy iray izy, ka nasainy notapahiny ny randrana fito teo amin’ny lohan’i Samsona. Lasa nahavita nifehy azy izy taorian’izay, satria nihena ny tanjak’i Samsona.', 'ary nampatorin’ilay vehivavy teo ambony lohaliny i samsona. dia niantso lehilahy iray izy, ka nasainy notapahiny ny randrana fito teo amin’ny lohan’i samsona. lasa nahavita nifehy azy izy taorian’izay, satria nihena ny tanjak’i samsona.'),
  ('6ab25a06cdfd8fc78833d6b3', '2026-09-22T10:35:50.402Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:50.402Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 16, 4, 'Raiki-pitia tamin’ny vehivavy iray tany amin’ny Lohasahan’i Soreka izy, taorian’izay. Delila no anaran’ilay vehivavy.', 'raiki-pitia tamin’ny vehivavy iray tany amin’ny lohasahan’i soreka izy, taorian’izay. delila no anaran’ilay vehivavy.'),
  ('6ab25a06cdfd8fc78833d6c1', '2026-09-22T10:35:50.402Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:50.402Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 16, 18, 'Rehefa hitan’i Delila fa namboraka ny tao am-pony taminy i Samsona, dia tonga dia nampiantso an’ireo andrianan’ny Filistinina izy. Dia hoy izy: “Tongava amin’izay amin’ity indray mandeha ity, fa efa namboraka ny tao am-pony tamiko izy.” Dia niakatra ho any aminy ireo andrianan’ny Filistinina, sady nitondra an’ilay vola.', 'rehefa hitan’i delila fa namboraka ny tao am-pony taminy i samsona, dia tonga dia nampiantso an’ireo andrianan’ny filistinina izy. dia hoy izy: “tongava amin’izay amin’ity indray mandeha ity, fa efa namboraka ny tao am-pony tamiko izy.” dia niakatra ho any aminy ireo andrianan’ny filistinina, sady nitondra an’ilay vola.'),
  ('6ab25a06cdfd8fc78833d6b4', '2026-09-22T10:35:50.402Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:50.402Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 16, 5, 'Koa nankao aminy ireo andrianan’ny Filistinina, dia niteny taminy hoe: “Fetseo izy ka fantaro hoe inona no mahatonga azy hatanjaka be. Ezaho fantarina koa hoe ahoana no handresenay sy hamatoranay azy mba ho voafehinay izy. Dia samy hanome anao volafotsy 1 100 sekely avy izahay.”', 'koa nankao aminy ireo andrianan’ny filistinina, dia niteny taminy hoe: “fetseo izy ka fantaro hoe inona no mahatonga azy hatanjaka be. ezaho fantarina koa hoe ahoana no handresenay sy hamatoranay azy mba ho voafehinay izy. dia samy hanome anao volafotsy 1 100 sekely avy izahay.”'),
  ('6ab25a06cdfd8fc78833d6bf', '2026-09-22T10:35:50.402Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:50.402Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 16, 16, 'Tsy namelan’i Delila i Samsona fa nosokiriny foana isan’andro, dia leo be i Samsona ka te ho faty mihitsy.', 'tsy namelan’i delila i samsona fa nosokiriny foana isan’andro, dia leo be i samsona ka te ho faty mihitsy.'),
  ('6ab25a06cdfd8fc78833d6b8', '2026-09-22T10:35:50.402Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:50.402Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 16, 9, 'Efa nisy olona niafina mba hamely an’i Samsona tao amin’ny efitra anatiny tamin’izay. Dia niantsoantso i Delila hoe: “Tonga hamely anao ny Filistinina, ry Samsona!” Dia notapahin’i Samsona ireo tady, ka tonga dia tapaka hoatran’ny kofehy rongony tratry ny afo. Ary tsy nisy nahafantatra hoe ahoana no nahatonga azy hatanjaka.', 'efa nisy olona niafina mba hamely an’i samsona tao amin’ny efitra anatiny tamin’izay. dia niantsoantso i delila hoe: “tonga hamely anao ny filistinina, ry samsona!” dia notapahin’i samsona ireo tady, ka tonga dia tapaka hoatran’ny kofehy rongony tratry ny afo. ary tsy nisy nahafantatra hoe ahoana no nahatonga azy hatanjaka.'),
  ('6ab25a06cdfd8fc78833d6b6', '2026-09-22T10:35:50.402Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:50.402Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 16, 7, 'Dia hoy i Samsona: “Raha fatorana amin’ny tady fito mbola tsy nohamainina aho, dia halemy hoatran’ny olon-drehetra ihany.”', 'dia hoy i samsona: “raha fatorana amin’ny tady fito mbola tsy nohamainina aho, dia halemy hoatran’ny olon-drehetra ihany.”'),
  ('6ab25a06cdfd8fc78833d6b1', '2026-09-22T10:35:50.402Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:50.402Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 16, 2, 'Ary nisy nilaza tamin’ny Gazita hoe: “Tonga eto i Samsona.” Dia nohodidinin’izy ireo ilay toerana, ary niafina teo am-bavahadin’ny tanàna izy ireo nandritra ny alina mba hamely azy. Tsy nikotaba anefa izy ireo nandritra ny alina, fa hoy izy ireo: “Raha vao mangiran-dratsy ny andro, dia hovonointsika izy.”', 'ary nisy nilaza tamin’ny gazita hoe: “tonga eto i samsona.” dia nohodidinin’izy ireo ilay toerana, ary niafina teo am-bavahadin’ny tanàna izy ireo nandritra ny alina mba hamely azy. tsy nikotaba anefa izy ireo nandritra ny alina, fa hoy izy ireo: “raha vao mangiran-dratsy ny andro, dia hovonointsika izy.”'),
  ('6ab25a06cdfd8fc78833d6c0', '2026-09-22T10:35:50.402Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:50.402Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 16, 17, 'Namboraka ny tao am-pony tamin’i Delila àry izy tamin’ny farany. Hoy izy: “Mbola tsy notapahina mihitsy ny volon-dohako, satria vao teraka aho dia efa Nazirita ho an’Andriamanitra. Fa raha tapahina ny voloko, dia tsy hatanjaka be intsony aho fa halemy, ary ho lasa hoatran’ny olon-drehetra ihany.”', 'namboraka ny tao am-pony tamin’i delila àry izy tamin’ny farany. hoy izy: “mbola tsy notapahina mihitsy ny volon-dohako, satria vao teraka aho dia efa nazirita ho an’andriamanitra. fa raha tapahina ny voloko, dia tsy hatanjaka be intsony aho fa halemy, ary ho lasa hoatran’ny olon-drehetra ihany.”'),
  ('6ab25a06cdfd8fc78833d6bd', '2026-09-22T10:35:50.402Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:50.402Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 16, 14, 'Ary nataon’ilay vehivavy nifatratra tsara tamin’ny alalan’ny hazo fisaka ireo randran’i Samsona, dia niantsoantso izy hoe: “Tonga hamely anao ny Filistinina, ry Samsona!” Dia nifoha i Samsona, ka nosintoniny hiala ilay hazon-tenona sy ilay kofehy natao tenany.', 'ary nataon’ilay vehivavy nifatratra tsara tamin’ny alalan’ny hazo fisaka ireo randran’i samsona, dia niantsoantso izy hoe: “tonga hamely anao ny filistinina, ry samsona!” dia nifoha i samsona, ka nosintoniny hiala ilay hazon-tenona sy ilay kofehy natao tenany.'),
  ('6ab25a06cdfd8fc78833d6bb', '2026-09-22T10:35:50.402Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:50.402Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 16, 12, 'Naka tady vaovao àry i Delila, ka namatotra an’i Samsona. Dia niantsoantso izy hoe: “Tonga hamely anao ny Filistinina, ry Samsona!”—Efa nisy olona niafina tao amin’ilay efitra anatiny tamin’izay.—Dia notapahin’i Samsona hiala teo amin’ny sandriny ireo tady, hoatran’ny manapaka kofehy.', 'naka tady vaovao àry i delila, ka namatotra an’i samsona. dia niantsoantso izy hoe: “tonga hamely anao ny filistinina, ry samsona!”—efa nisy olona niafina tao amin’ilay efitra anatiny tamin’izay.—dia notapahin’i samsona hiala teo amin’ny sandriny ireo tady, hoatran’ny manapaka kofehy.'),
  ('6ab25a06cdfd8fc78833d6be', '2026-09-22T10:35:50.402Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:50.402Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 16, 15, 'Dia hoy i Delila taminy: “Ahoana no ilazanao hoe: ‘Tena tiako ianao’, nefa ianao tsy matoky ahy akory? Intelo izay ianao no namitaka ahy, dia tsy nilaza tamiko hoe inona no mahatonga anao hatanjaka be.”', 'dia hoy i delila taminy: “ahoana no ilazanao hoe: ‘tena tiako ianao’, nefa ianao tsy matoky ahy akory? intelo izay ianao no namitaka ahy, dia tsy nilaza tamiko hoe inona no mahatonga anao hatanjaka be.”'),
  ('6ab25a06cdfd8fc78833d6bc', '2026-09-22T10:35:50.402Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:50.402Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 16, 13, 'Taorian’izay, dia hoy i Delila tamin’i Samsona: “Mbola namitaka ahy foana ianao hatramin’izao, sady nandainga tamiko. Lazao ahy moa izay azo amatorana anao e!” Dia hoy i Samsona: “Mila tenominao miaraka amin’ny kofehy atao tenany ny randrana fito eo amin’ny lohako.”', 'taorian’izay, dia hoy i delila tamin’i samsona: “mbola namitaka ahy foana ianao hatramin’izao, sady nandainga tamiko. lazao ahy moa izay azo amatorana anao e!” dia hoy i samsona: “mila tenominao miaraka amin’ny kofehy atao tenany ny randrana fito eo amin’ny lohako.”'),
  ('6ab25a06cdfd8fc78833d6b2', '2026-09-22T10:35:50.402Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:50.402Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 16, 3, 'Natory tao i Samsona mandra-pisasaky ny alina. Ary nifoha izy rehefa nisasaka ny alina, dia noraisiny ny vavahadin’ny tanàna sy ny andry roa tamin’ny sisiny, ka nongotany niaraka tamin’ny bara hidin’ilay vavahady. Nataony teny an-tsorony izany, ary nentiny niakatra ho any an-tampon’ilay tendrombohitra tandrifin’i Hebrona.', 'natory tao i samsona mandra-pisasaky ny alina. ary nifoha izy rehefa nisasaka ny alina, dia noraisiny ny vavahadin’ny tanàna sy ny andry roa tamin’ny sisiny, ka nongotany niaraka tamin’ny bara hidin’ilay vavahady. nataony teny an-tsorony izany, ary nentiny niakatra ho any an-tampon’ilay tendrombohitra tandrifin’i hebrona.'),
  ('6ab25a06cdfd8fc78833d6c8', '2026-09-22T10:35:50.403Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:50.403Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 16, 25, 'Ary falifaly izy ireo, ka niteny hoe: “Alaivo i Samsona mba hampiala voly antsika.” Dia nalainy avy tao am-ponja i Samsona mba hampiala voly azy ireo. Ary nasainy nitsangana teo anelanelan’ny andry izy.', 'ary falifaly izy ireo, ka niteny hoe: “alaivo i samsona mba hampiala voly antsika.” dia nalainy avy tao am-ponja i samsona mba hampiala voly azy ireo. ary nasainy nitsangana teo anelanelan’ny andry izy.'),
  ('6ab25a06cdfd8fc78833d6c7', '2026-09-22T10:35:50.403Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:50.403Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 16, 24, 'Rehefa nahita azy ny olona, dia nidera ny andriamaniny. Hoy izy ireo: “Efa nataon’ilay andriamanitsika resintsika ilay fahavalontsika, izay nanimba ny tanintsika sy namono olona be dia be teto amintsika.”', 'rehefa nahita azy ny olona, dia nidera ny andriamaniny. hoy izy ireo: “efa nataon’ilay andriamanitsika resintsika ilay fahavalontsika, izay nanimba ny tanintsika sy namono olona be dia be teto amintsika.”'),
  ('6ab25a06cdfd8fc78833d6c5', '2026-09-22T10:35:50.403Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:50.403Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 16, 22, 'Nanomboka naniry indray anefa ilay volon-dohany notapahina.', 'nanomboka naniry indray anefa ilay volon-dohany notapahina.'),
  ('6ab25a06cdfd8fc78833d6cc', '2026-09-22T10:35:50.403Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:50.403Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 16, 29, 'Dia nitehenan’i Samsona ireo andry roa teo afovoany izay nanohana an’ilay trano. Ny tanany havanana nitehina tamin’ny andry iray ary ny tanany havia nitehina tamin’ilay iray.', 'dia nitehenan’i samsona ireo andry roa teo afovoany izay nanohana an’ilay trano. ny tanany havanana nitehina tamin’ny andry iray ary ny tanany havia nitehina tamin’ilay iray.'),
  ('6ab25a06cdfd8fc78833d6c9', '2026-09-22T10:35:50.403Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:50.403Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 16, 26, 'Dia hoy i Samsona tamin’ilay zazalahy nitantana azy: “Mba avelao aho hikasika an’ireo andry manohana an’ity trano ity, mba hiankinako aminy.”', 'dia hoy i samsona tamin’ilay zazalahy nitantana azy: “mba avelao aho hikasika an’ireo andry manohana an’ity trano ity, mba hiankinako aminy.”'),
  ('6ab25a06cdfd8fc78833d6cb', '2026-09-22T10:35:50.403Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:50.403Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 16, 28, 'Dia niantso an’i Jehovah i Samsona hoe: “Ry Jehovah Tompo Fara Tampony ô! Mba tsarovy re aho ka omeo hery azafady indrindra e! Mba amin’ity indray mandeha ity fotsiny, ry Andriamanitra ô! Avelao aho hamaly faty ny Filistinina noho ny anankiray amin’ny masoko roa.”', 'dia niantso an’i jehovah i samsona hoe: “ry jehovah tompo fara tampony ô! mba tsarovy re aho ka omeo hery azafady indrindra e! mba amin’ity indray mandeha ity fotsiny, ry andriamanitra ô! avelao aho hamaly faty ny filistinina noho ny anankiray amin’ny masoko roa.”'),
  ('6ab25a06cdfd8fc78833d6c4', '2026-09-22T10:35:50.403Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:50.403Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 16, 21, 'Koa nosamborin’ny Filistinina izy, dia nopotsirin’izy ireo ny masony roa. Ary nentin’izy ireo nidina nankany Gaza izy, ka nofatorany tamin’ny gadra varahina roa. Dia lasa mpanodina vato lehibe fikosoham-bary tao am-ponja izy.', 'koa nosamborin’ny filistinina izy, dia nopotsirin’izy ireo ny masony roa. ary nentin’izy ireo nidina nankany gaza izy, ka nofatorany tamin’ny gadra varahina roa. dia lasa mpanodina vato lehibe fikosoham-bary tao am-ponja izy.'),
  ('6ab25a06cdfd8fc78833d6ca', '2026-09-22T10:35:50.403Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:50.403Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 16, 27, 'Feno lehilahy sy vehivavy ilay trano tamin’izay. Tao daholo ireo andrianan’ny Filistinina ary nisy lehilahy sy vehivavy 3 000 teo ho eo tany an-tampon-trano. Nijery an’i Samsona nampiala voly azy izy ireo.', 'feno lehilahy sy vehivavy ilay trano tamin’izay. tao daholo ireo andrianan’ny filistinina ary nisy lehilahy sy vehivavy 3 000 teo ho eo tany an-tampon-trano. nijery an’i samsona nampiala voly azy izy ireo.'),
  ('6ab25a06cdfd8fc78833d6cd', '2026-09-22T10:35:50.403Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:50.403Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 16, 30, 'Dia niteny mafy be i Samsona hoe: “Avelao aho ho faty miaraka amin’ny Filistinina!” Dia natosiny araka izay fara heriny ireo andry, ka nianjeran’ilay trano ireo andriana sy ny olona rehetra tao anatiny. Betsaka kokoa àry ny olona matiny tamin’ny andro nahafatesany, raha oharina amin’ny olona matiny nandritra ny androm-piainany.', 'dia niteny mafy be i samsona hoe: “avelao aho ho faty miaraka amin’ny filistinina!” dia natosiny araka izay fara heriny ireo andry, ka nianjeran’ilay trano ireo andriana sy ny olona rehetra tao anatiny. betsaka kokoa àry ny olona matiny tamin’ny andro nahafatesany, raha oharina amin’ny olona matiny nandritra ny androm-piainany.'),
  ('6ab25a06cdfd8fc78833d6c6', '2026-09-22T10:35:50.403Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:50.403Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 16, 23, 'Ary nivory ireo andrianan’ny Filistinina mba hanao sorona lehibe ho an’i Dagona andriamaniny sy hanao fety. Fa hoy izy ireo: “Efa nataon’ilay andriamanitsika resintsika i Samsona fahavalontsika!”', 'ary nivory ireo andrianan’ny filistinina mba hanao sorona lehibe ho an’i dagona andriamaniny sy hanao fety. fa hoy izy ireo: “efa nataon’ilay andriamanitsika resintsika i samsona fahavalontsika!”'),
  ('6ab25a06cdfd8fc78833d6ce', '2026-09-22T10:35:50.403Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:50.403Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 16, 31, 'Taorian’izay, dia nidina mba haka azy ny rahalahiny sy ny fianakavian-drainy manontolo. Nentin’izy ireo niakatra izy, ary naleviny teo anelanelan’i Zora sy Estaola, tao amin’ny fasan’i Manoa rainy. Ary efa nitsara ny Israely nandritra ny 20 taona izy.', 'taorian’izay, dia nidina mba haka azy ny rahalahiny sy ny fianakavian-drainy manontolo. nentin’izy ireo niakatra izy, ary naleviny teo anelanelan’i zora sy estaola, tao amin’ny fasan’i manoa rainy. ary efa nitsara ny israely nandritra ny 20 taona izy.'),
  ('6ab25a066dd7cda124dd14eb', '2026-09-22T10:35:50.868Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:50.868Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 17, 1, 'Nisy lehilahy atao hoe Mika, avy any amin’ny faritra be tendrombohitr’i Efraima.', 'nisy lehilahy atao hoe mika, avy any amin’ny faritra be tendrombohitr’i efraima.'),
  ('6ab25a066dd7cda124dd14f5', '2026-09-22T10:35:50.869Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:50.869Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 17, 11, 'Nanaiky hiara-mipetraka tamin’i Mika àry ilay tovolahy, ka nataony hoatran’ny anankiray amin’ny zanany.', 'nanaiky hiara-mipetraka tamin’i mika àry ilay tovolahy, ka nataony hoatran’ny anankiray amin’ny zanany.'),
  ('6ab25a066dd7cda124dd14ef', '2026-09-22T10:35:50.869Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:50.869Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 17, 5, 'Nanana tranon’andriamanitra io Mika io, ary nanamboatra efoda sy sarivongana terafima. Dia notendreny ny iray tamin’ny zanany lahy mba ho mpisorona ho azy.', 'nanana tranon’andriamanitra io mika io, ary nanamboatra efoda sy sarivongana terafima. dia notendreny ny iray tamin’ny zanany lahy mba ho mpisorona ho azy.'),
  ('6ab25a066dd7cda124dd14ec', '2026-09-22T10:35:50.869Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:50.869Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 17, 2, 'Ary hoy izy tamin-dreniny: “Tadidinao ilay volafotsy 1 100 sekely nisy naka tany aminao iny? Henoko ianao nanozona an’ilay olona naka azy. Atỳ amiko ilay izy. Izaho no naka azy.” Dia hoy ny reniny: “Hotahin’i Jehovah anie ny zanako!”', 'ary hoy izy tamin-dreniny: “tadidinao ilay volafotsy 1 100 sekely nisy naka tany aminao iny? henoko ianao nanozona an’ilay olona naka azy. atỳ amiko ilay izy. izaho no naka azy.” dia hoy ny reniny: “hotahin’i jehovah anie ny zanako!”'),
  ('6ab25a066dd7cda124dd14f7', '2026-09-22T10:35:50.869Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:50.869Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 17, 13, 'Dia hoy i Mika: “Fantatro izao fa hanisy soa ahy i Jehovah, satria efa lasa mpisorona ho ahy ity Levita ity.”', 'dia hoy i mika: “fantatro izao fa hanisy soa ahy i jehovah, satria efa lasa mpisorona ho ahy ity levita ity.”'),
  ('6ab25a066dd7cda124dd14f6', '2026-09-22T10:35:50.869Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:50.869Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 17, 12, 'Dia notendren’i Mika ho mpisorona ho azy ilay Levita, ka nipetraka tao an-tranony.', 'dia notendren’i mika ho mpisorona ho azy ilay levita, ka nipetraka tao an-tranony.'),
  ('6ab25a066dd7cda124dd14f2', '2026-09-22T10:35:50.869Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:50.869Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 17, 8, 'Niala tany amin’ny tanànan’i Betlehema any Joda io tovolahy io mba hitady toerana hipetrahana. Dia nandeha izy, ka tonga tany amin’ny faritra be tendrombohitr’i Efraima, tany an-tranon’i Mika.', 'niala tany amin’ny tanànan’i betlehema any joda io tovolahy io mba hitady toerana hipetrahana. dia nandeha izy, ka tonga tany amin’ny faritra be tendrombohitr’i efraima, tany an-tranon’i mika.'),
  ('6ab25a066dd7cda124dd14f1', '2026-09-22T10:35:50.869Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:50.869Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 17, 7, 'Nisy tovolahy anankiray, anisan’ny fianakavian’i Joda, avy any Betlehema any Joda. Levita izy, ary nipetraka kelikely tany.', 'nisy tovolahy anankiray, anisan’ny fianakavian’i joda, avy any betlehema any joda. levita izy, ary nipetraka kelikely tany.'),
  ('6ab25a066dd7cda124dd14f4', '2026-09-22T10:35:50.869Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:50.869Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 17, 10, 'Dia hoy i Mika taminy: “Miaraha mipetraka amiko, dia ho mpanolo-tsaina sy ho mpisorona ho ahy ianao. Ary homeko volafotsy folo sekely ianao isan-taona, dia homeko akanjo sy sakafo koa.” Dia niditra tao an-tranony ilay Levita.', 'dia hoy i mika taminy: “miaraha mipetraka amiko, dia ho mpanolo-tsaina sy ho mpisorona ho ahy ianao. ary homeko volafotsy folo sekely ianao isan-taona, dia homeko akanjo sy sakafo koa.” dia niditra tao an-tranony ilay levita.'),
  ('6ab25a066dd7cda124dd14ee', '2026-09-22T10:35:50.869Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:50.869Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 17, 4, 'Rehefa naveriny tany amin’ny reniny ilay volafotsy, dia naka volafotsy 200 sekely ny reniny ary nomeny ny mpanefy volafotsy izany. Nanamboaran’ilay mpanefy sary sokitra sy sarivongana metaly ilay izy, dia napetraka tao an-tranon’i Mika.', 'rehefa naveriny tany amin’ny reniny ilay volafotsy, dia naka volafotsy 200 sekely ny reniny ary nomeny ny mpanefy volafotsy izany. nanamboaran’ilay mpanefy sary sokitra sy sarivongana metaly ilay izy, dia napetraka tao an-tranon’i mika.'),
  ('6ab25a066dd7cda124dd14f0', '2026-09-22T10:35:50.869Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:50.869Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 17, 6, 'Tsy nisy mpanjaka teo amin’ny Israely tamin’izany andro izany, ary samy nanao izay noheveriny fa nety ny olona.', 'tsy nisy mpanjaka teo amin’ny israely tamin’izany andro izany, ary samy nanao izay noheveriny fa nety ny olona.'),
  ('6ab25a066dd7cda124dd14ed', '2026-09-22T10:35:50.869Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:50.869Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 17, 3, 'Naveriny tany amin’ny reniny àry ilay volafotsy 1 100 sekely. Hoy anefa ny reniny: “Tsy maintsy hohamasiniko ho an’i Jehovah ilay volafotsy, anaka, amin’izay ianao afaka manamboatra sary sokitra sy sarivongana metaly amin’ilay izy. Iny fa averiko aminao indray ilay izy izao.”', 'naveriny tany amin’ny reniny àry ilay volafotsy 1 100 sekely. hoy anefa ny reniny: “tsy maintsy hohamasiniko ho an’i jehovah ilay volafotsy, anaka, amin’izay ianao afaka manamboatra sary sokitra sy sarivongana metaly amin’ilay izy. iny fa averiko aminao indray ilay izy izao.”'),
  ('6ab25a066dd7cda124dd14f3', '2026-09-22T10:35:50.869Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:50.869Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 17, 9, 'Ary hoy i Mika taminy: “Avy aiza ianao?” Dia hoy izy: “Levita avy any Betlehema any Joda aho, ary handeha hitady toerana hipetrahana.”', 'ary hoy i mika taminy: “avy aiza ianao?” dia hoy izy: “levita avy any betlehema any joda aho, ary handeha hitady toerana hipetrahana.”'),
  ('6ab25a075b69dd2087872bec', '2026-09-22T10:35:51.618Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:51.618Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 18, 2, 'Naniraka lehilahy dimy anisan’ny fianakaviany ny Danita. Lehilahy mahery fo avy any Zora sy Estaola izy ireo, ary nirahina hitsikilo sy hamantatra an’ilay tany. Hoy ny Danita tamin’izy ireo: “Mandehana, jereo hoe manao ahoana ilay tany.” Dia tonga tany amin’ny faritra be tendrombohitr’i Efraima, tany an-tranon’i Mika, izy dimy lahy, ary natory indray alina tao.', 'naniraka lehilahy dimy anisan’ny fianakaviany ny danita. lehilahy mahery fo avy any zora sy estaola izy ireo, ary nirahina hitsikilo sy hamantatra an’ilay tany. hoy ny danita tamin’izy ireo: “mandehana, jereo hoe manao ahoana ilay tany.” dia tonga tany amin’ny faritra be tendrombohitr’i efraima, tany an-tranon’i mika, izy dimy lahy, ary natory indray alina tao.'),
  ('6ab25a075b69dd2087872beb', '2026-09-22T10:35:51.618Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:51.618Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 18, 1, 'Tsy nisy mpanjaka teo amin’ny Israely tamin’izany andro izany. Ary nitady toerana hipetrahana ny fokon’ny Danita tamin’izany, satria mbola tsy azony daholo ny lovany teo amin’ny fokon’ny Israely.', 'tsy nisy mpanjaka teo amin’ny israely tamin’izany andro izany. ary nitady toerana hipetrahana ny fokon’ny danita tamin’izany, satria mbola tsy azony daholo ny lovany teo amin’ny fokon’ny israely.'),
  ('6ab25a075b69dd2087872c09', '2026-09-22T10:35:51.619Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:51.619Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 18, 31, 'Ary natsangan’izy ireo teo amin’ny toerana iray ilay sary sokitra namboarin’i Mika. Teo foana ilay izy tamin’ny fotoana rehetra naha tao Silo ny tranon’ilay tena Andriamanitra.', 'ary natsangan’izy ireo teo amin’ny toerana iray ilay sary sokitra namboarin’i mika. teo foana ilay izy tamin’ny fotoana rehetra naha tao silo ny tranon’ilay tena andriamanitra.'),
  ('6ab25a075b69dd2087872c08', '2026-09-22T10:35:51.619Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:51.619Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 18, 30, 'Taorian’izay, dia natsangan’ny Danita teo amin’ny toerana iray ilay sary sokitra mba hivavahana. Ary lasa mpisorona ho an’ny fokon’ny Danita i Jonatana zanak’i Gersoma, zanak’i Mosesy, sy ny taranany, mandra-pahatongan’ny andro nanaovana sesitany ny mponin’ilay tany.', 'taorian’izay, dia natsangan’ny danita teo amin’ny toerana iray ilay sary sokitra mba hivavahana. ary lasa mpisorona ho an’ny fokon’ny danita i jonatana zanak’i gersoma, zanak’i mosesy, sy ny taranany, mandra-pahatongan’ny andro nanaovana sesitany ny mponin’ilay tany.'),
  ('6ab25a075b69dd2087872bfb', '2026-09-22T10:35:51.619Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:51.619Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 18, 17, 'Ary niditra izy dimy lahy, izay avy nitsikilo an’ilay tany, dia nalain’izy ireo ilay sary sokitra sy ny efoda sy ny sarivongana terafima ary ny sarivongana metaly. Ilay mpisorona kosa nijoro teo amin’ny vavahady fidirana, niaraka tamin’ireo 600 lahy nitondra fitaovam-piadiana.', 'ary niditra izy dimy lahy, izay avy nitsikilo an’ilay tany, dia nalain’izy ireo ilay sary sokitra sy ny efoda sy ny sarivongana terafima ary ny sarivongana metaly. ilay mpisorona kosa nijoro teo amin’ny vavahady fidirana, niaraka tamin’ireo 600 lahy nitondra fitaovam-piadiana.'),
  ('6ab25a075b69dd2087872bf8', '2026-09-22T10:35:51.619Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:51.619Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 18, 14, 'Dia niteny tamin’ny rahalahiny izy dimy lahy, izay avy nitsikilo ny tany Laisy, hoe: “Fantatrareo ve fa misy efoda sy sarivongana terafima sy sary sokitra ary sarivongana metaly ao amin’ireo trano ireo? Eritrereto izay tokony hataonareo.”', 'dia niteny tamin’ny rahalahiny izy dimy lahy, izay avy nitsikilo ny tany laisy, hoe: “fantatrareo ve fa misy efoda sy sarivongana terafima sy sary sokitra ary sarivongana metaly ao amin’ireo trano ireo? eritrereto izay tokony hataonareo.”'),
  ('6ab25a075b69dd2087872bf5', '2026-09-22T10:35:51.619Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:51.619Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 18, 11, 'Dia nisy 600 lahy, anisan’ny fianakavian’ny Danita, niainga avy tao Zora sy Estaola. Nitondra fitaovam-piadiana izy ireo ary vonona hiady.', 'dia nisy 600 lahy, anisan’ny fianakavian’ny danita, niainga avy tao zora sy estaola. nitondra fitaovam-piadiana izy ireo ary vonona hiady.'),
  ('6ab25a075b69dd2087872c02', '2026-09-22T10:35:51.619Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:51.619Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 18, 24, 'Dia hoy i Mika: “Nalainareo ny andriamanitra namboariko, ary nentinareo ny mpisorona. Dia inona izany sisa ny ahy? Koa maninona aho no mbola anontanianareo indray hoe: ‘Fa misy inona?’”', 'dia hoy i mika: “nalainareo ny andriamanitra namboariko, ary nentinareo ny mpisorona. dia inona izany sisa ny ahy? koa maninona aho no mbola anontanianareo indray hoe: ‘fa misy inona?’”'),
  ('6ab25a075b69dd2087872bef', '2026-09-22T10:35:51.619Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:51.619Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 18, 5, 'Dia hoy izy ireo taminy: “Mba anontanio hoe Andriamanitra, azafady, raha hahomby izao dianay izao na tsia!”', 'dia hoy izy ireo taminy: “mba anontanio hoe andriamanitra, azafady, raha hahomby izao dianay izao na tsia!”'),
  ('6ab25a075b69dd2087872bf3', '2026-09-22T10:35:51.619Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:51.619Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 18, 9, 'Dia hoy izy ireo: “Hitanay hoe tena tsara ilay tany, ka andao hiakatra hamely an-dry zareo. Aza misalasala, fa andao halaina haingana ilay tany.', 'dia hoy izy ireo: “hitanay hoe tena tsara ilay tany, ka andao hiakatra hamely an-dry zareo. aza misalasala, fa andao halaina haingana ilay tany.'),
  ('6ab25a075b69dd2087872bed', '2026-09-22T10:35:51.619Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:51.619Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 18, 3, 'Tamin’izy ireo teo akaikin’ny tranon’i Mika, dia fantany ny feon’ilay tovolahy Levita. Dia nivily nankao aminy izy ireo, ka niteny hoe: “Iza no nitondra anao tatỳ? Inona no ataonao eto amin’ity toerana ity? Ary inona no mahatamana anao atỳ?”', 'tamin’izy ireo teo akaikin’ny tranon’i mika, dia fantany ny feon’ilay tovolahy levita. dia nivily nankao aminy izy ireo, ka niteny hoe: “iza no nitondra anao tatỳ? inona no ataonao eto amin’ity toerana ity? ary inona no mahatamana anao atỳ?”'),
  ('6ab25a075b69dd2087872bf1', '2026-09-22T10:35:51.619Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:51.619Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 18, 7, 'Nandeha àry izy dimy lahy ka tonga tany Laisy. Dia hitan’izy ireo fa nahavita tena hoatran’ny Sidonianina ny mponina tao. Nilamina izy ireo sady tsy nanana ahiahy, ary tsy nisy fahavalo tonga nampijaly azy tao amin’ilay tany. Lavitra an’ireo Sidonianina izy ireo, sady tsy nifandray tamin’iza na iza.', 'nandeha àry izy dimy lahy ka tonga tany laisy. dia hitan’izy ireo fa nahavita tena hoatran’ny sidonianina ny mponina tao. nilamina izy ireo sady tsy nanana ahiahy, ary tsy nisy fahavalo tonga nampijaly azy tao amin’ilay tany. lavitra an’ireo sidonianina izy ireo, sady tsy nifandray tamin’iza na iza.'),
  ('6ab25a075b69dd2087872bf6', '2026-09-22T10:35:51.619Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:51.619Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 18, 12, 'Niakatra izy ireo ka nitoby tany Kiriata-jearima any Joda. Izany no antony niantsoana an’io toerana io hoe Mahane-dana hatramin’izao. Eo andrefan’i Kiriata-jearima no misy azy io.', 'niakatra izy ireo ka nitoby tany kiriata-jearima any joda. izany no antony niantsoana an’io toerana io hoe mahane-dana hatramin’izao. eo andrefan’i kiriata-jearima no misy azy io.'),
  ('6ab25a075b69dd2087872bff', '2026-09-22T10:35:51.619Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:51.619Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 18, 21, 'Dia nanohy ny diany izy ireo, ary nataony teo aloha ny zaza sy ny biby fiompy ary ny entana sarobidy.', 'dia nanohy ny diany izy ireo, ary nataony teo aloha ny zaza sy ny biby fiompy ary ny entana sarobidy.'),
  ('6ab25a075b69dd2087872bf2', '2026-09-22T10:35:51.619Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:51.619Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 18, 8, 'Rehefa tafaverina tany amin’ireo rahalahiny tany Zora sy Estaola izy dimy lahy, dia hoy ny rahalahiny taminy: “Nanao ahoana ny tany?”', 'rehefa tafaverina tany amin’ireo rahalahiny tany zora sy estaola izy dimy lahy, dia hoy ny rahalahiny taminy: “nanao ahoana ny tany?”'),
  ('6ab25a075b69dd2087872bee', '2026-09-22T10:35:51.619Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:51.619Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 18, 4, 'Dia nitantara izy hoe: “Izany sy izany no nataon’i Mika tamiko, dia karamainy ho mpisorona ho azy aho.”', 'dia nitantara izy hoe: “izany sy izany no nataon’i mika tamiko, dia karamainy ho mpisorona ho azy aho.”'),
  ('6ab25a075b69dd2087872c05', '2026-09-22T10:35:51.619Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:51.619Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 18, 27, 'Rehefa avy naka an’ireo zavatra namboarin’i Mika sy naka an’ilay mpisorony ny Danita, dia nankany Laisy. Notafihin’izy ireo ilay vahoaka nilamina sy tsy nanana ahiahy, ary nasiany tamin’ny sabatra. Dia nodoran’izy ireo ilay tanàna.', 'rehefa avy naka an’ireo zavatra namboarin’i mika sy naka an’ilay mpisorony ny danita, dia nankany laisy. notafihin’izy ireo ilay vahoaka nilamina sy tsy nanana ahiahy, ary nasiany tamin’ny sabatra. dia nodoran’izy ireo ilay tanàna.'),
  ('6ab25a075b69dd2087872bfa', '2026-09-22T10:35:51.619Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:51.619Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 18, 16, 'Ireo 600 lahy, anisan’ny fokon’i Dana, izay nitondra fitaovam-piadiana kosa nijoro teo amin’ny vavahady fidirana.', 'ireo 600 lahy, anisan’ny fokon’i dana, izay nitondra fitaovam-piadiana kosa nijoro teo amin’ny vavahady fidirana.'),
  ('6ab25a075b69dd2087872bf7', '2026-09-22T10:35:51.619Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:51.619Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 18, 13, 'Dia niala tao izy ireo, ka nankany amin’ny faritra be tendrombohitr’i Efraima, ary tonga tany an-tranon’i Mika.', 'dia niala tao izy ireo, ka nankany amin’ny faritra be tendrombohitr’i efraima, ary tonga tany an-tranon’i mika.'),
  ('6ab25a075b69dd2087872bf4', '2026-09-22T10:35:51.619Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:51.619Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 18, 10, 'Hahita olona tsy manana ahiahy ianareo rehefa tonga any. Midadasika be koa ilay tany. Hataon’Andriamanitra resinareo ilay izy, ary misy ao daholo ny zava-drehetra etỳ ambonin’ny tany.”', 'hahita olona tsy manana ahiahy ianareo rehefa tonga any. midadasika be koa ilay tany. hataon’andriamanitra resinareo ilay izy, ary misy ao daholo ny zava-drehetra etỳ ambonin’ny tany.”'),
  ('6ab25a075b69dd2087872c04', '2026-09-22T10:35:51.619Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:51.619Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 18, 26, 'Dia nanohy ny diany ny Danita. Ary hitan’i Mika fa nahery noho izy ry zareo, dia niverin-dalana izy ka nody tany an-tranony.', 'dia nanohy ny diany ny danita. ary hitan’i mika fa nahery noho izy ry zareo, dia niverin-dalana izy ka nody tany an-tranony.'),
  ('6ab25a075b69dd2087872bfe', '2026-09-22T10:35:51.619Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:51.619Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 18, 20, 'Faly àry ilay mpisorona, ka nalainy ilay efoda sy ilay sarivongana terafima ary ilay sary sokitra. Dia lasa izy nanaraka azy ireo.', 'faly àry ilay mpisorona, ka nalainy ilay efoda sy ilay sarivongana terafima ary ilay sary sokitra. dia lasa izy nanaraka azy ireo.'),
  ('6ab25a075b69dd2087872bfd', '2026-09-22T10:35:51.619Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:51.619Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 18, 19, 'Hoy anefa izy ireo taminy: “Mangìna! Tampeno amin’ny tananao ny vavanao, ary andao hiaraka aminay, dia ho mpanolo-tsaina sy ho mpisorona ho anay ianao. Fa inona no tianao: Ho mpisorona ho an’ny ankohonan’olona iray, sa ho mpisorona ho an’ny foko sy fianakaviambe iray eo amin’ny Israely?”', 'hoy anefa izy ireo taminy: “mangìna! tampeno amin’ny tananao ny vavanao, ary andao hiaraka aminay, dia ho mpanolo-tsaina sy ho mpisorona ho anay ianao. fa inona no tianao: ho mpisorona ho an’ny ankohonan’olona iray, sa ho mpisorona ho an’ny foko sy fianakaviambe iray eo amin’ny israely?”'),
  ('6ab25a075b69dd2087872c07', '2026-09-22T10:35:51.619Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:51.619Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 18, 29, 'Nantsoin’izy ireo hoe Dana ilay tanàna, araka ny anaran’i Dana rain’izy ireo, izay naterak’i Israely. Laisy anefa no anaran’izy io taloha.', 'nantsoin’izy ireo hoe dana ilay tanàna, araka ny anaran’i dana rain’izy ireo, izay naterak’i israely. laisy anefa no anaran’izy io taloha.'),
  ('6ab25a075b69dd2087872c03', '2026-09-22T10:35:51.619Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:51.619Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 18, 25, 'Dia hoy ny Danita taminy: “Aza tabatabaina izahay, sao dia hisy olona ho tezitra ka hamely anareo. Dia hamoy ny ainao sy ny ain’ny ankohonanao ianao.”', 'dia hoy ny danita taminy: “aza tabatabaina izahay, sao dia hisy olona ho tezitra ka hamely anareo. dia hamoy ny ainao sy ny ain’ny ankohonanao ianao.”'),
  ('6ab25a075b69dd2087872c01', '2026-09-22T10:35:51.619Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:51.619Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 18, 23, 'Nantsointsoin’izy ireo ny Danita dia nitodika, ka niteny tamin’i Mika hoe: “Fa misy inona? Maninona ianao no nanangona an’ireo olona ireo?”', 'nantsointsoin’izy ireo ny danita dia nitodika, ka niteny tamin’i mika hoe: “fa misy inona? maninona ianao no nanangona an’ireo olona ireo?”'),
  ('6ab25a075b69dd2087872bf0', '2026-09-22T10:35:51.619Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:51.619Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 18, 6, 'Dia hoy ilay mpisorona tamin’izy ireo: “Mandehana ary mirary soa ho anareo aho. Miaro anareo i Jehovah amin’izao dianareo izao.”', 'dia hoy ilay mpisorona tamin’izy ireo: “mandehana ary mirary soa ho anareo aho. miaro anareo i jehovah amin’izao dianareo izao.”'),
  ('6ab25a075b69dd2087872c00', '2026-09-22T10:35:51.619Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:51.619Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 18, 22, 'Rehefa lavidavitra an’ilay tranon’i Mika izy ireo, dia nifamory ireo lehilahy nipetraka teny akaikin’ny tranon’i Mika. Ary nenjehin’izy ireo ny Danita ka tratrany.', 'rehefa lavidavitra an’ilay tranon’i mika izy ireo, dia nifamory ireo lehilahy nipetraka teny akaikin’ny tranon’i mika. ary nenjehin’izy ireo ny danita ka tratrany.'),
  ('6ab25a075b69dd2087872bfc', '2026-09-22T10:35:51.619Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:51.619Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 18, 18, 'Niditra tao an-tranon’i Mika izy dimy lahy ka naka ny sary sokitra sy ny efoda sy ny sarivongana terafima ary ny sarivongana metaly. Dia hoy ilay mpisorona tamin’izy ireo: “Fa inona ity ataonareo?”', 'niditra tao an-tranon’i mika izy dimy lahy ka naka ny sary sokitra sy ny efoda sy ny sarivongana terafima ary ny sarivongana metaly. dia hoy ilay mpisorona tamin’izy ireo: “fa inona ity ataonareo?”'),
  ('6ab25a075b69dd2087872c06', '2026-09-22T10:35:51.619Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:51.619Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 18, 28, 'Tsy nisy olona tonga namonjy an’ilay tanàna, satria lavitra an’i Sidona izy io sady teo amin’ny tany lemak’i Beti-rehoba. Tsy nifandray tamin’iza na iza koa ny mponina tao. Dia naorin’izy ireo indray ilay tanàna ka nipetraka tao izy ireo.', 'tsy nisy olona tonga namonjy an’ilay tanàna, satria lavitra an’i sidona izy io sady teo amin’ny tany lemak’i beti-rehoba. tsy nifandray tamin’iza na iza koa ny mponina tao. dia naorin’izy ireo indray ilay tanàna ka nipetraka tao izy ireo.'),
  ('6ab25a075b69dd2087872bf9', '2026-09-22T10:35:51.619Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:51.619Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 18, 15, 'Dia nijanona izy ireo, ary nankao an-tranon’ilay tovolahy Levita, tao an-tranon’i Mika. Ary nanontany ny fahasalamany izy ireo.', 'dia nijanona izy ireo, ary nankao an-tranon’ilay tovolahy levita, tao an-tranon’i mika. ary nanontany ny fahasalamany izy ireo.'),
  ('6ab25a0a49922e95e539dcd2', '2026-09-22T10:35:54.744Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:54.744Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 19, 28, 'Ary hoy ilay lehilahy taminy: “Mitsangàna, andao handeha.” Tsy namaly anefa ilay vehivavy. Nataony teo ambony ampondrany àry ilay vehivavy, dia niainga izy ka lasa nody.', 'ary hoy ilay lehilahy taminy: “mitsangàna, andao handeha.” tsy namaly anefa ilay vehivavy. nataony teo ambony ampondrany àry ilay vehivavy, dia niainga izy ka lasa nody.'),
  ('6ab25a0a49922e95e539dcca', '2026-09-22T10:35:54.744Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:54.744Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 19, 20, 'Hoy anefa ilay zokiolona: “Dia tonga soa izany ianao! Avelao aho hikarakara izay ilainao, fa aza matory eto amin’ny tany malalaky ny tanàna.”', 'hoy anefa ilay zokiolona: “dia tonga soa izany ianao! avelao aho hikarakara izay ilainao, fa aza matory eto amin’ny tany malalaky ny tanàna.”'),
  ('6ab25a0a49922e95e539dcc7', '2026-09-22T10:35:54.744Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:54.744Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 19, 17, 'Dia nijery izy ka hitany teo amin’ny tany malalaky ny tanàna ilay lehilahy avy nanao dia lavitra. Dia hoy ilay zokiolona: “Avy taiza ianao, ary handeha ho aiza?”', 'dia nijery izy ka hitany teo amin’ny tany malalaky ny tanàna ilay lehilahy avy nanao dia lavitra. dia hoy ilay zokiolona: “avy taiza ianao, ary handeha ho aiza?”'),
  ('6ab25a0a49922e95e539dcb9', '2026-09-22T10:35:54.744Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:54.744Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 19, 3, 'Dia nankany aminy ny vadiny mba handresy lahatra azy hody. Ary nitondra mpanompolahy iray sy ampondra roa izy. Dia nampandrosoin’ilay vehivavy tao an-tranon-drainy izy. Faly ny rain’ilay vehivavy rehefa nahita azy.', 'dia nankany aminy ny vadiny mba handresy lahatra azy hody. ary nitondra mpanompolahy iray sy ampondra roa izy. dia nampandrosoin’ilay vehivavy tao an-tranon-drainy izy. faly ny rain’ilay vehivavy rehefa nahita azy.'),
  ('6ab25a0a49922e95e539dcc9', '2026-09-22T10:35:54.744Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:54.744Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 19, 19, 'Manana mololo sy sakafo ampy ho an’ny ampondranay izahay, sady manana mofo sy divay ho ahy sy ho an’ilay vadikeliko ary ho an’ilay mpanomponay. Efa ao daholo izay rehetra ilainay.”', 'manana mololo sy sakafo ampy ho an’ny ampondranay izahay, sady manana mofo sy divay ho ahy sy ho an’ilay vadikeliko ary ho an’ilay mpanomponay. efa ao daholo izay rehetra ilainay.”'),
  ('6ab25a0a49922e95e539dcba', '2026-09-22T10:35:54.744Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:54.744Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 19, 4, 'Ary nandresy lahatra azy hijanona telo andro tao aminy ilay rafozany, izany hoe ny rain’ilay vehivavy. Dia nihinana sy nisotro izy ireo, ary natory tao ilay lehilahy.', 'ary nandresy lahatra azy hijanona telo andro tao aminy ilay rafozany, izany hoe ny rain’ilay vehivavy. dia nihinana sy nisotro izy ireo, ary natory tao ilay lehilahy.'),
  ('6ab25a0a49922e95e539dcc5', '2026-09-22T10:35:54.744Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:54.744Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 19, 15, 'Nijanona hatory tao Gibea izy ireo. Dia niditra tao izy ireo ka nipetraka teo amin’ny tany malalaky ny tanàna. Tsy nisy nandray azy hatory tany an-tranony anefa.', 'nijanona hatory tao gibea izy ireo. dia niditra tao izy ireo ka nipetraka teo amin’ny tany malalaky ny tanàna. tsy nisy nandray azy hatory tany an-tranony anefa.'),
  ('6ab25a0a49922e95e539dcbe', '2026-09-22T10:35:54.744Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:54.744Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 19, 8, 'Rehefa nifoha maraina hiainga ilay lehilahy ny andro fahadimy, dia hoy ny rain’ilay vehivavy: “Mba mihinàna zavatra kely, amin’izay mba mahazo hery.” Ary nijanonjanona teo izy ireo mandra-paharivarivan’ny andro. Dia niara-nisakafo teo izy mianaka.', 'rehefa nifoha maraina hiainga ilay lehilahy ny andro fahadimy, dia hoy ny rain’ilay vehivavy: “mba mihinàna zavatra kely, amin’izay mba mahazo hery.” ary nijanonjanona teo izy ireo mandra-paharivarivan’ny andro. dia niara-nisakafo teo izy mianaka.'),
  ('6ab25a0a49922e95e539dcd1', '2026-09-22T10:35:54.744Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:54.744Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 19, 27, 'Nifoha ilay lehilahy rehefa maraina ny andro, dia nosokafany ny varavaran’ilay trano, ary nivoaka izy mba hanohy ny diany. Hitany nihohoka teo amin’ny fidirana amin’ilay trano ilay vadikeliny, ary teo an-tokonam-baravarana ny tanany roa.', 'nifoha ilay lehilahy rehefa maraina ny andro, dia nosokafany ny varavaran’ilay trano, ary nivoaka izy mba hanohy ny diany. hitany nihohoka teo amin’ny fidirana amin’ilay trano ilay vadikeliny, ary teo an-tokonam-baravarana ny tanany roa.'),
  ('6ab25a0a49922e95e539dcce', '2026-09-22T10:35:54.744Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:54.744Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 19, 24, 'Ao ny zanako vavy virjiny sy ny vadikelin’ilay lehilahy! Aleo ry zareo no havoakako, dia azonareo alaina baraka ry zareo, raha izay no efa masaka ao an-tsainareo. Fa aza manao zavatra mamoafady amin’io lehilahy io.”', 'ao ny zanako vavy virjiny sy ny vadikelin’ilay lehilahy! aleo ry zareo no havoakako, dia azonareo alaina baraka ry zareo, raha izay no efa masaka ao an-tsainareo. fa aza manao zavatra mamoafady amin’io lehilahy io.”'),
  ('6ab25a0a49922e95e539dcc4', '2026-09-22T10:35:54.744Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:54.744Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 19, 14, 'Dia nanohy ny diany izy ireo, ary nanomboka nilentika ny masoandro vao tonga teo akaikin’i Gibea tanànan’i Benjamina izy ireo.', 'dia nanohy ny diany izy ireo, ary nanomboka nilentika ny masoandro vao tonga teo akaikin’i gibea tanànan’i benjamina izy ireo.'),
  ('6ab25a0a49922e95e539dcbc', '2026-09-22T10:35:54.744Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:54.744Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 19, 6, 'Dia nipetraka izy mianaka, ary niara-nihinana sy nisotro. Avy eo, dia hoy ny rain’ilay vehivavy tamin’ilay lehilahy: “Mba mijanòna re androany alina e, ary ataovy izay mahafinaritra anao!”', 'dia nipetraka izy mianaka, ary niara-nihinana sy nisotro. avy eo, dia hoy ny rain’ilay vehivavy tamin’ilay lehilahy: “mba mijanòna re androany alina e, ary ataovy izay mahafinaritra anao!”'),
  ('6ab25a0a49922e95e539dcd0', '2026-09-22T10:35:54.744Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:54.744Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 19, 26, 'Vao maraina be, dia tonga ilay vehivavy ka nianjera teo amin’ny fidirana amin’ny tranon’ilay lehilahy nampiantrano ny tompony. Dia nidaboka teo izy mandra-pahazavan’ny andro.', 'vao maraina be, dia tonga ilay vehivavy ka nianjera teo amin’ny fidirana amin’ny tranon’ilay lehilahy nampiantrano ny tompony. dia nidaboka teo izy mandra-pahazavan’ny andro.'),
  ('6ab25a0a49922e95e539dcc3', '2026-09-22T10:35:54.744Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:54.744Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 19, 13, 'Dia hoy izy tamin’ilay mpanompony: “Andao hatao izay hahatongavana eny amin’ny iray amin’iretsy tanàna iretsy. Na isika hatory ao Gibea androany alina, na ao Rama.”', 'dia hoy izy tamin’ilay mpanompony: “andao hatao izay hahatongavana eny amin’ny iray amin’iretsy tanàna iretsy. na isika hatory ao gibea androany alina, na ao rama.”'),
  ('6ab25a0a49922e95e539dcbb', '2026-09-22T10:35:54.744Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:54.744Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 19, 5, 'Rehefa nifoha maraina hiainga izy ireo ny andro fahefatra, dia hoy ny rain’ilay vehivavy tamin’ny vinantolahiny: “Mihinàna zavatra kely, amin’izay mba mahazo hery, dia avy eo ianareo mandeha.”', 'rehefa nifoha maraina hiainga izy ireo ny andro fahefatra, dia hoy ny rain’ilay vehivavy tamin’ny vinantolahiny: “mihinàna zavatra kely, amin’izay mba mahazo hery, dia avy eo ianareo mandeha.”'),
  ('6ab25a0a49922e95e539dccf', '2026-09-22T10:35:54.744Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:54.744Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 19, 25, 'Tsy nety nihaino an’ilay zokiolona anefa ireo lehilahy ireo. Dia nalain’ilay lehilahy ilay vadikeliny ka navoakany tany amin’izy ireo. Ary naolan’izy ireo sy nanamparany ny filan-dratsiny ilay vehivavy nandritra ny alina mandra-paharainan’ny andro. Dia nalefan’izy ireo izy rehefa nangiran-dratsy ny andro.', 'tsy nety nihaino an’ilay zokiolona anefa ireo lehilahy ireo. dia nalain’ilay lehilahy ilay vadikeliny ka navoakany tany amin’izy ireo. ary naolan’izy ireo sy nanamparany ny filan-dratsiny ilay vehivavy nandritra ny alina mandra-paharainan’ny andro. dia nalefan’izy ireo izy rehefa nangiran-dratsy ny andro.'),
  ('6ab25a0a49922e95e539dccb', '2026-09-22T10:35:54.744Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:54.744Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 19, 21, 'Koa nentiny tany an-tranony ilay lehilahy, ary nomeny sakafo ireo ampondra. Dia nanasa tongotra izy ireo, ary nihinana sy nisotro.', 'koa nentiny tany an-tranony ilay lehilahy, ary nomeny sakafo ireo ampondra. dia nanasa tongotra izy ireo, ary nihinana sy nisotro.'),
  ('6ab25a0a49922e95e539dcc2', '2026-09-22T10:35:54.744Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:54.744Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 19, 12, 'Fa hoy ny tompony taminy: “Tsy tokony hijanona ao amin’ny tanànan’ny firenen-kafa tsy Israelita isika. Andao hanohy hatrany Gibea.”', 'fa hoy ny tompony taminy: “tsy tokony hijanona ao amin’ny tanànan’ny firenen-kafa tsy israelita isika. andao hanohy hatrany gibea.”'),
  ('6ab25a0a49922e95e539dcbd', '2026-09-22T10:35:54.744Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:54.744Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 19, 7, 'Rehefa hiainga ilay lehilahy, dia niangavy azy foana ilay rafozany, ka nijanona tao indray izy ny alin’iny.', 'rehefa hiainga ilay lehilahy, dia niangavy azy foana ilay rafozany, ka nijanona tao indray izy ny alin’iny.'),
  ('6ab25a0a49922e95e539dccc', '2026-09-22T10:35:54.744Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:54.744Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 19, 22, 'Raha mbola nifalifaly teo izy ireo, dia tonga nanodidina an’ilay trano ny jiolahim-boto sasany tao an-tanàna. Dia nodondonin’izy ireo mafy be ny varavarana, sady hoy foana izy ireo tamin’ilay zokiolona tompon-trano: “Avoahy atỳ ilay lehilahy nankao an-tranonao iny mba hanaovanay firaisana.”', 'raha mbola nifalifaly teo izy ireo, dia tonga nanodidina an’ilay trano ny jiolahim-boto sasany tao an-tanàna. dia nodondonin’izy ireo mafy be ny varavarana, sady hoy foana izy ireo tamin’ilay zokiolona tompon-trano: “avoahy atỳ ilay lehilahy nankao an-tranonao iny mba hanaovanay firaisana.”'),
  ('6ab25a0a49922e95e539dcd4', '2026-09-22T10:35:54.744Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:54.744Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 19, 30, 'Ary hoy izay rehetra nahita izany: “Mbola tsy nisy hoatr’izao mihitsy sady mbola tsy fahita izao, hatramin’izay niakaran’ny Israelita avy tany Ejipta ka hatramin’izao. Eritrereto tsara izany, ary miaraha midinika dia lazao anay izay tokony hatao.”', 'ary hoy izay rehetra nahita izany: “mbola tsy nisy hoatr’izao mihitsy sady mbola tsy fahita izao, hatramin’izay niakaran’ny israelita avy tany ejipta ka hatramin’izao. eritrereto tsara izany, ary miaraha midinika dia lazao anay izay tokony hatao.”'),
  ('6ab25a0a49922e95e539dcd3', '2026-09-22T10:35:54.744Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:54.744Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 19, 29, 'Rehefa tonga tao an-tranony izy, dia naka antsin-kena, ary noraisiny ny fatin’ilay vadikeliny, ka norasarasainy ho 12. Ary nandefasany ampahany iray avy ny faritra tsirairay tany Israely.', 'rehefa tonga tao an-tranony izy, dia naka antsin-kena, ary noraisiny ny fatin’ilay vadikeliny, ka norasarasainy ho 12. ary nandefasany ampahany iray avy ny faritra tsirairay tany israely.'),
  ('6ab25a0a49922e95e539dcc1', '2026-09-22T10:35:54.744Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:54.744Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 19, 11, 'Efa ho maizina ny andro, rehefa tonga teo akaikin’i Jebosa izy ireo. Dia hoy ilay mpanompo tamin’ny tompony: “Sao dia tokony hijanona ao amin’itsy tanànan’ny Jebosita itsy isika, dia hatory ao androany alina?”', 'efa ho maizina ny andro, rehefa tonga teo akaikin’i jebosa izy ireo. dia hoy ilay mpanompo tamin’ny tompony: “sao dia tokony hijanona ao amin’itsy tanànan’ny jebosita itsy isika, dia hatory ao androany alina?”'),
  ('6ab25a0a49922e95e539dcc0', '2026-09-22T10:35:54.744Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:54.744Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 19, 10, 'Tsy te hijanona indray alina intsony anefa ilay lehilahy. Nitsangana àry izy ka lasa nandeha ary tonga hatrany Jebosa, izany hoe Jerosalema. Ary nentiny ireo ampondra roa efa nisy lasely sy ilay vadikeliny ary ilay mpanompony.', 'tsy te hijanona indray alina intsony anefa ilay lehilahy. nitsangana àry izy ka lasa nandeha ary tonga hatrany jebosa, izany hoe jerosalema. ary nentiny ireo ampondra roa efa nisy lasely sy ilay vadikeliny ary ilay mpanompony.'),
  ('6ab25a0a49922e95e539dcc8', '2026-09-22T10:35:54.744Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:54.744Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 19, 18, 'Dia hoy ilay lehilahy: “Avy tany Betlehema any Joda izahay, ary ho any amin’ny toerana mitokana any amin’ny faritra be tendrombohitr’i Efraima, fa avy any aho. Nandeha kely tany Betlehema any Joda aho ary ho any an-tranon’i Jehovah. Tsy misy mampiantrano anefa aho.', 'dia hoy ilay lehilahy: “avy tany betlehema any joda izahay, ary ho any amin’ny toerana mitokana any amin’ny faritra be tendrombohitr’i efraima, fa avy any aho. nandeha kely tany betlehema any joda aho ary ho any an-tranon’i jehovah. tsy misy mampiantrano anefa aho.'),
  ('6ab25a0a49922e95e539dcbf', '2026-09-22T10:35:54.744Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:54.744Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 19, 9, 'Dia nitsangana mba handeha ilay lehilahy sy ilay vadikeliny ary ilay mpanompony. Fa hoy ny rafozany, izany hoe ny rain’ilay vehivavy, taminy: “Jereo fa efa ho hariva ny andro. Mba matoria atỳ androany alina! Efa hilentika ange ny masoandro e! Matoria atỳ ary ataovy izay mahafinaritra anao. Afaka mifoha maraina ianao rahampitso, dia mandeha mody any an-tranonao.”', 'dia nitsangana mba handeha ilay lehilahy sy ilay vadikeliny ary ilay mpanompony. fa hoy ny rafozany, izany hoe ny rain’ilay vehivavy, taminy: “jereo fa efa ho hariva ny andro. mba matoria atỳ androany alina! efa hilentika ange ny masoandro e! matoria atỳ ary ataovy izay mahafinaritra anao. afaka mifoha maraina ianao rahampitso, dia mandeha mody any an-tranonao.”'),
  ('6ab25a0a49922e95e539dcb7', '2026-09-22T10:35:54.744Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:54.744Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 19, 1, 'Tsy nisy mpanjaka teo amin’ny Israely tamin’izany andro izany. Ary nisy Levita anankiray nipetraka tany amin’ny toerana mitokana tany amin’ny faritra be tendrombohitr’i Efraima. Naka vehivavy iray avy any Betlehema any Joda izy, mba ho vadikeliny.', 'tsy nisy mpanjaka teo amin’ny israely tamin’izany andro izany. ary nisy levita anankiray nipetraka tany amin’ny toerana mitokana tany amin’ny faritra be tendrombohitr’i efraima. naka vehivavy iray avy any betlehema any joda izy, mba ho vadikeliny.'),
  ('6ab25a0a49922e95e539dccd', '2026-09-22T10:35:54.744Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:54.744Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 19, 23, 'Dia nivoaka ilay tompon-trano, ka niteny hoe: “Aza manao an’izany, ry rahalahiko! Aza manao an’izany zava-dratsy izany. Mba mivahiny ato amiko ange io lehilahy io e! Aza manao an’izany zavatra mamoafady izany.', 'dia nivoaka ilay tompon-trano, ka niteny hoe: “aza manao an’izany, ry rahalahiko! aza manao an’izany zava-dratsy izany. mba mivahiny ato amiko ange io lehilahy io e! aza manao an’izany zavatra mamoafady izany.'),
  ('6ab25a0a49922e95e539dcc6', '2026-09-22T10:35:54.744Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:54.744Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 19, 16, 'Rehefa ela ny ela, tamin’iny hariva iny, dia nisy lehilahy efa antitra tonga avy niasa tany an-tsaha. Avy any amin’ny faritra be tendrombohitr’i Efraima izy, fa nipetraka kelikely tao Gibea izy. Benjaminita kosa ny mponina tao Gibea.', 'rehefa ela ny ela, tamin’iny hariva iny, dia nisy lehilahy efa antitra tonga avy niasa tany an-tsaha. avy any amin’ny faritra be tendrombohitr’i efraima izy, fa nipetraka kelikely tao gibea izy. benjaminita kosa ny mponina tao gibea.'),
  ('6ab25a0a49922e95e539dcb8', '2026-09-22T10:35:54.744Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:54.744Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 19, 2, 'Nanitsakitsaka azy anefa ilay vadikeliny, ary nandao azy ka nody tany an-tranon-drainy tany Betlehema any Joda. Nijanona tany efa-bolana ilay vehivavy.', 'nanitsakitsaka azy anefa ilay vadikeliny, ary nandao azy ka nody tany an-tranon-drainy tany betlehema any joda. nijanona tany efa-bolana ilay vehivavy.'),
  ('6ab25a0bcf3fe2bc6d2dd788', '2026-09-22T10:35:55.895Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:55.895Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 20, 16, 'Nisy lehilahy tena nahay niady tamin’ireo miaramila rehetra ireo. Niisa 700 izy ireo sady samy kavia. Samy nahay nampiasa pilotra daholo izy ireo, ary tsy nisy nivaona ny vato nalefany na dia hoatran’ny singam-bolo iray aza, fa nahavoa an’izay nokendreny foana.', 'nisy lehilahy tena nahay niady tamin’ireo miaramila rehetra ireo. niisa 700 izy ireo sady samy kavia. samy nahay nampiasa pilotra daholo izy ireo, ary tsy nisy nivaona ny vato nalefany na dia hoatran’ny singam-bolo iray aza, fa nahavoa an’izay nokendreny foana.'),
  ('6ab25a0bcf3fe2bc6d2dd783', '2026-09-22T10:35:55.895Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:55.895Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 20, 11, 'Nifanaraka àry ny lehilahy israelita rehetra fa hiara-manafika an’ilay tanàna.', 'nifanaraka àry ny lehilahy israelita rehetra fa hiara-manafika an’ilay tanàna.'),
  ('6ab25a0bcf3fe2bc6d2dd77b', '2026-09-22T10:35:55.895Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:55.895Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 20, 3, 'Henon’ny Benjaminita hoe niakatra tany Mizpa ny lehilahy israelita. Ary hoy ny lehilahy israelita: “Teneno anay hoe ahoana no nahatonga an’izao zavatra mahatsiravina izao.”', 'henon’ny benjaminita hoe niakatra tany mizpa ny lehilahy israelita. ary hoy ny lehilahy israelita: “teneno anay hoe ahoana no nahatonga an’izao zavatra mahatsiravina izao.”'),
  ('6ab25a0bcf3fe2bc6d2dd77a', '2026-09-22T10:35:55.895Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:55.895Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 20, 2, 'Dia nitsangana teo anivon’ny fiangonan’ny vahoakan’Andriamanitra ireo lehiben’ny vahoaka, izany hoe ireo lehiben’ny foko rehetra teo amin’ny Israely. Miaramila 400 000 no anisan’ilay fiangonana, ary mpandeha an-tongotra sady mpitan-tsabatra izy ireo.', 'dia nitsangana teo anivon’ny fiangonan’ny vahoakan’andriamanitra ireo lehiben’ny vahoaka, izany hoe ireo lehiben’ny foko rehetra teo amin’ny israely. miaramila 400 000 no anisan’ilay fiangonana, ary mpandeha an-tongotra sady mpitan-tsabatra izy ireo.'),
  ('6ab25a0bcf3fe2bc6d2dd787', '2026-09-22T10:35:55.895Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:55.895Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 20, 15, 'Nahangona lehilahy 26 000 avy any an-tanànany ny Benjaminita tamin’ izay andro izay, ary samy mpitan-tsabatra izy ireo. Ankoatra an’ireo, dia nisy miaramila 700 tena nahay niady koa tao Gibea.', 'nahangona lehilahy 26 000 avy any an-tanànany ny benjaminita tamin’ izay andro izay, ary samy mpitan-tsabatra izy ireo. ankoatra an’ireo, dia nisy miaramila 700 tena nahay niady koa tao gibea.'),
  ('6ab25a0bcf3fe2bc6d2dd78d', '2026-09-22T10:35:55.895Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:55.895Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 20, 21, 'Nivoaka avy tao Gibea àry ny Benjaminita, ka nahafaty lehilahy israelita 22 000 tamin’io andro io.', 'nivoaka avy tao gibea àry ny benjaminita, ka nahafaty lehilahy israelita 22 000 tamin’io andro io.'),
  ('6ab25a0bcf3fe2bc6d2dd77f', '2026-09-22T10:35:55.895Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:55.895Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 20, 7, 'Dia teneno àry, ry vahoakan’Israely, hoe inona ny soso-kevitrareo.”', 'dia teneno àry, ry vahoakan’israely, hoe inona ny soso-kevitrareo.”'),
  ('6ab25a0bcf3fe2bc6d2dd784', '2026-09-22T10:35:55.895Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:55.895Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 20, 12, 'Dia naniraka olona ho any amin’izay rehetra anisan’ny fokon’i Benjamina ny fokon’ny Israely, mba hilaza hoe: “Inona izany zavatra mahatsiravina nitranga teto aminareo izany?', 'dia naniraka olona ho any amin’izay rehetra anisan’ny fokon’i benjamina ny fokon’ny israely, mba hilaza hoe: “inona izany zavatra mahatsiravina nitranga teto aminareo izany?'),
  ('6ab25a0bcf3fe2bc6d2dd782', '2026-09-22T10:35:55.895Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:55.895Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 20, 10, 'Ary hakantsika lehilahy 10 isaky ny 100 ny foko rehetra eo amin’ny Israely, 100 isaky ny 1 000, ary 1 000 isaky ny 10 000, mba hanangona vatsy ho an’ny miaramila. Amin’izay ireo miaramila dia ho afaka hanafika an’i Gibea tanànan’ny fokon’i Benjamina, noho ny zavatra mamoafady nataon-dry zareo teto amin’ny Israely.”', 'ary hakantsika lehilahy 10 isaky ny 100 ny foko rehetra eo amin’ny israely, 100 isaky ny 1 000, ary 1 000 isaky ny 10 000, mba hanangona vatsy ho an’ny miaramila. amin’izay ireo miaramila dia ho afaka hanafika an’i gibea tanànan’ny fokon’i benjamina, noho ny zavatra mamoafady nataon-dry zareo teto amin’ny israely.”'),
  ('6ab25a0bcf3fe2bc6d2dd781', '2026-09-22T10:35:55.895Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:55.895Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 20, 9, 'Fa izao no hataontsika amin’i Gibea: Hiakatra hiady aminy isika, fa hanao antsapaka aloha isika hahitana hoe iza no handeha.', 'fa izao no hataontsika amin’i gibea: hiakatra hiady aminy isika, fa hanao antsapaka aloha isika hahitana hoe iza no handeha.'),
  ('6ab25a0bcf3fe2bc6d2dd779', '2026-09-22T10:35:55.895Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:55.895Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 20, 1, 'Dia nivoaka daholo ny Israelita rehetra avy any Dana ka hatrany Beri-sheba, ary ny avy any Gileada. Ary niara-nivory teo anatrehan’i Jehovah tany Mizpa ny vahoaka manontolo.', 'dia nivoaka daholo ny israelita rehetra avy any dana ka hatrany beri-sheba, ary ny avy any gileada. ary niara-nivory teo anatrehan’i jehovah tany mizpa ny vahoaka manontolo.'),
  ('6ab25a0bcf3fe2bc6d2dd77c', '2026-09-22T10:35:55.895Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:55.895Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 20, 4, 'Dia hoy ilay Levita vadin’ilay vehivavy nisy namono: “Tonga tao Gibea tanànan’ny fokon’i Benjamina izaho sy ny vadikeliko, mba hatory tao.', 'dia hoy ilay levita vadin’ilay vehivavy nisy namono: “tonga tao gibea tanànan’ny fokon’i benjamina izaho sy ny vadikeliko, mba hatory tao.'),
  ('6ab25a0bcf3fe2bc6d2dd77d', '2026-09-22T10:35:55.895Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:55.895Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 20, 5, 'Ary nitsangana hanisy ratsy ahy ireo mponina tao Gibea, ka nanodidina an’ilay trano nisy ahy tamin’ny alina. Izaho no saika hovonoin’izy ireo, kanjo ny vadikeliko no naolany dia maty.', 'ary nitsangana hanisy ratsy ahy ireo mponina tao gibea, ka nanodidina an’ilay trano nisy ahy tamin’ny alina. izaho no saika hovonoin’izy ireo, kanjo ny vadikeliko no naolany dia maty.'),
  ('6ab25a0bcf3fe2bc6d2dd78c', '2026-09-22T10:35:55.895Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:55.895Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 20, 20, 'Dia nivoaka hiady tamin’ny Benjaminita ny lehilahy israelita, ka nilahatra hiady tamin’izy ireo tao Gibea.', 'dia nivoaka hiady tamin’ny benjaminita ny lehilahy israelita, ka nilahatra hiady tamin’izy ireo tao gibea.'),
  ('6ab25a0bcf3fe2bc6d2dd78a', '2026-09-22T10:35:55.895Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:55.895Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 20, 18, 'Dia niainga ny Israelita ka niakatra tany Betela, mba hanontany an’Andriamanitra. Ary hoy izy ireo: “Iza aminay no ho loha laharana rehefa hiakatra hiady amin’ny Benjaminita izahay?” Hoy i Jehovah: “Ny fokon’i Joda no ho loha laharana.”', 'dia niainga ny israelita ka niakatra tany betela, mba hanontany an’andriamanitra. ary hoy izy ireo: “iza aminay no ho loha laharana rehefa hiakatra hiady amin’ny benjaminita izahay?” hoy i jehovah: “ny fokon’i joda no ho loha laharana.”'),
  ('6ab25a0bcf3fe2bc6d2dd789', '2026-09-22T10:35:55.895Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:55.895Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 20, 17, 'Nahangona miaramila 400 000 ny lehilahy israelita. Mpitan-tsabatra izy ireo sady samy efa zatra ady. Tsy anisan’izany ny Benjaminita.', 'nahangona miaramila 400 000 ny lehilahy israelita. mpitan-tsabatra izy ireo sady samy efa zatra ady. tsy anisan’izany ny benjaminita.'),
  ('6ab25a0bcf3fe2bc6d2dd786', '2026-09-22T10:35:55.895Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:55.895Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 20, 14, 'Dia niala avy any an-tanànany avy ny Benjaminita, ka nankany Gibea mba hiady tamin’ny lehilahy israelita.', 'dia niala avy any an-tanànany avy ny benjaminita, ka nankany gibea mba hiady tamin’ny lehilahy israelita.');
INSERT INTO "bible_verses" ("id", "created_date", "updated_date", "created_by_id", "created_by", "translation", "book", "bookOrder", "chapter", "verse", "text", "normalizedText") VALUES
  ('6ab25a0bcf3fe2bc6d2dd78e', '2026-09-22T10:35:55.895Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:55.895Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 20, 22, 'Nisikina herim-po anefa ny miaramila israelita, ka nilahatra hiady tamin’izy ireo indray teo amin’ilay toerana niadiany tamin’ny andro voalohany.', 'nisikina herim-po anefa ny miaramila israelita, ka nilahatra hiady tamin’izy ireo indray teo amin’ilay toerana niadiany tamin’ny andro voalohany.'),
  ('6ab25a0bcf3fe2bc6d2dd78b', '2026-09-22T10:35:55.895Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:55.895Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 20, 19, 'Dia niainga ny Israelita rehefa maraina ny andro, ka nitoby mba hiady tamin’i Gibea.', 'dia niainga ny israelita rehefa maraina ny andro, ka nitoby mba hiady tamin’i gibea.'),
  ('6ab25a0bcf3fe2bc6d2dd77e', '2026-09-22T10:35:55.895Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:55.895Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 20, 6, 'Dia nalaiko ny fatin’ilay vadikeliko ka norasarasaiko, ary nalefako tany amin’ny faritra rehetra eo amin’ny lovan’ny Israely. Nanao zavatra mahamenatra sy mamoafady teto amin’ny Israely mantsy izy ireo.', 'dia nalaiko ny fatin’ilay vadikeliko ka norasarasaiko, ary nalefako tany amin’ny faritra rehetra eo amin’ny lovan’ny israely. nanao zavatra mahamenatra sy mamoafady teto amin’ny israely mantsy izy ireo.'),
  ('6ab25a0bcf3fe2bc6d2dd785', '2026-09-22T10:35:55.895Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:55.895Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 20, 13, 'Atolory anay ireo jiolahim-boto ao Gibea ireo, mba hamonoanay azy ho faty sy hanesorana ny ratsy tsy ho eto amin’ny Israely.” Tsy nety nihaino ny tenin’ny Israelita rahalahiny anefa ny Benjaminita.', 'atolory anay ireo jiolahim-boto ao gibea ireo, mba hamonoanay azy ho faty sy hanesorana ny ratsy tsy ho eto amin’ny israely.” tsy nety nihaino ny tenin’ny israelita rahalahiny anefa ny benjaminita.'),
  ('6ab25a0bcf3fe2bc6d2dd780', '2026-09-22T10:35:55.895Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:55.895Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 20, 8, 'Dia niara-nitsangana ny vahoaka manontolo, ka nilaza hoe: “Tsy hisy hiverina any amin’ny tranolaintsika isika, na hody any an-tranontsika.', 'dia niara-nitsangana ny vahoaka manontolo, ka nilaza hoe: “tsy hisy hiverina any amin’ny tranolaintsika isika, na hody any an-tranontsika.'),
  ('6ab25a0bcf3fe2bc6d2dd79c', '2026-09-22T10:35:55.896Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:55.896Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 20, 36, 'Noheverin’ny Benjaminita fa ho resy ny lehilahy israelita matoa nandositra. Nandositra anefa ny Israely satria natoky an’ireo nasainy niafina mba hanafika an’i Gibea.', 'noheverin’ny benjaminita fa ho resy ny lehilahy israelita matoa nandositra. nandositra anefa ny israely satria natoky an’ireo nasainy niafina mba hanafika an’i gibea.'),
  ('6ab25a0bcf3fe2bc6d2dd798', '2026-09-22T10:35:55.896Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:55.896Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 20, 32, 'Dia hoy ny Benjaminita: “Resintsika hoatran’ny teo aloha ry zareo.” Fa hoy kosa ny Israelita: “Mody handositra isika, dia hotarihintsika hanalavitra ny tanàna ry zareo, ho eny amin’ny lalambe.”', 'dia hoy ny benjaminita: “resintsika hoatran’ny teo aloha ry zareo.” fa hoy kosa ny israelita: “mody handositra isika, dia hotarihintsika hanalavitra ny tanàna ry zareo, ho eny amin’ny lalambe.”'),
  ('6ab25a0bcf3fe2bc6d2dd7a8', '2026-09-22T10:35:55.896Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:55.896Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 20, 48, 'Dia niverina niady tamin’ny Benjaminita ny lehilahy israelita. Ary nasian’izy ireo tamin’ny sabatra ny olona sy ny biby fiompy ary izay rehetra tavela tao an-tanàna. Nodoran’izy ireo daholo koa izay tanàna rehetra nandalovany.', 'dia niverina niady tamin’ny benjaminita ny lehilahy israelita. ary nasian’izy ireo tamin’ny sabatra ny olona sy ny biby fiompy ary izay rehetra tavela tao an-tanàna. nodoran’izy ireo daholo koa izay tanàna rehetra nandalovany.'),
  ('6ab25a0bcf3fe2bc6d2dd79e', '2026-09-22T10:35:55.896Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:55.896Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 20, 38, 'Ary efa nifanaraka ny lehilahy israelita sy ireo niafina mba hanafika an’ilay tanàna, fa hasiany setroka hiakatra avy ao an-tanàna mba ho famantarana.', 'ary efa nifanaraka ny lehilahy israelita sy ireo niafina mba hanafika an’ilay tanàna, fa hasiany setroka hiakatra avy ao an-tanàna mba ho famantarana.'),
  ('6ab25a0bcf3fe2bc6d2dd79a', '2026-09-22T10:35:55.896Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:55.896Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 20, 34, 'Dia tonga tandrifin’i Gibea ny lehilahy 10 000 tena nahay niady, izay nofidina avy tamin’ny Israely rehetra. Ary nafotaka ny ady. Tsy fantatry ny Benjaminita anefa fa efa nananontanona ny loza.', 'dia tonga tandrifin’i gibea ny lehilahy 10 000 tena nahay niady, izay nofidina avy tamin’ny israely rehetra. ary nafotaka ny ady. tsy fantatry ny benjaminita anefa fa efa nananontanona ny loza.'),
  ('6ab25a0bcf3fe2bc6d2dd799', '2026-09-22T10:35:55.896Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:55.896Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 20, 33, 'Dia niala teo amin’izay nisy azy ny lehilahy israelita rehetra, ka nilahatra hiady tany Bala-tamara. Fa ireo Israelita efa niafina kosa nirohotra niala avy tao amin’izay niafenany, teny amin’ny manodidina an’i Gibea.', 'dia niala teo amin’izay nisy azy ny lehilahy israelita rehetra, ka nilahatra hiady tany bala-tamara. fa ireo israelita efa niafina kosa nirohotra niala avy tao amin’izay niafenany, teny amin’ny manodidina an’i gibea.'),
  ('6ab25a0bcf3fe2bc6d2dd7a3', '2026-09-22T10:35:55.896Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:55.896Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 20, 43, 'Dia nanodidina an’ireo Benjaminita izy ireo, sady nanenjika azy ireo tsy an-kijanona. Resin’izy ireo tanteraka ny Benjaminita, teo amin’ny ilany atsinanana, tandrifin’i Gibea.', 'dia nanodidina an’ireo benjaminita izy ireo, sady nanenjika azy ireo tsy an-kijanona. resin’izy ireo tanteraka ny benjaminita, teo amin’ny ilany atsinanana, tandrifin’i gibea.'),
  ('6ab25a0bcf3fe2bc6d2dd792', '2026-09-22T10:35:55.896Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:55.896Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 20, 26, 'Dia niakatra tany Betela ny lehilahy israelita rehetra. Nipetraka nitomany teo anatrehan’i Jehovah izy ireo, ary nifady hanina mandra-paharivan’ny andro. Nanolotra fanatitra dorana sy fanatitra iombonana teo anatrehan’i Jehovah koa izy ireo.', 'dia niakatra tany betela ny lehilahy israelita rehetra. nipetraka nitomany teo anatrehan’i jehovah izy ireo, ary nifady hanina mandra-paharivan’ny andro. nanolotra fanatitra dorana sy fanatitra iombonana teo anatrehan’i jehovah koa izy ireo.'),
  ('6ab25a0bcf3fe2bc6d2dd797', '2026-09-22T10:35:55.896Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:55.896Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 20, 31, 'Rehefa nivoaka hifanandrina tamin’ny miaramila ny Benjaminita, dia notarihina hanalavitra ny tanàna. Ary nanomboka nasian’izy ireo sy novonoiny, hoatran’ny teo aloha, ny lehilahy sasany teny amin’ireo lalambe. Ny lalambe iray miakatra ho any Betela, ary ny iray kosa mankany Gibea. Israelita 30 teo ho eo àry no maty teny.', 'rehefa nivoaka hifanandrina tamin’ny miaramila ny benjaminita, dia notarihina hanalavitra ny tanàna. ary nanomboka nasian’izy ireo sy novonoiny, hoatran’ny teo aloha, ny lehilahy sasany teny amin’ireo lalambe. ny lalambe iray miakatra ho any betela, ary ny iray kosa mankany gibea. israelita 30 teo ho eo àry no maty teny.'),
  ('6ab25a0bcf3fe2bc6d2dd78f', '2026-09-22T10:35:55.896Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:55.896Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 20, 23, 'Ary niakatra nankany Betela ny Israelita ka nitomany teo anatrehan’i Jehovah mandra-paharivan’ny andro. Nanontany an’i Jehovah izy ireo hoe: “Mbola tokony handeha hiady amin’ny taranak’i Benjamina rahalahinay indray ve izahay?” Dia hoy i Jehovah: “Miakara hiady aminy.”', 'ary niakatra nankany betela ny israelita ka nitomany teo anatrehan’i jehovah mandra-paharivan’ny andro. nanontany an’i jehovah izy ireo hoe: “mbola tokony handeha hiady amin’ny taranak’i benjamina rahalahinay indray ve izahay?” dia hoy i jehovah: “miakara hiady aminy.”'),
  ('6ab25a0bcf3fe2bc6d2dd7a7', '2026-09-22T10:35:55.896Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:55.896Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 20, 47, 'Nisy 600 lahy kosa nandositra tany an-tany efitra, tany amin’ny harambaton’i Rimona, ary nijanona efa-bolana tany.', 'nisy 600 lahy kosa nandositra tany an-tany efitra, tany amin’ny harambaton’i rimona, ary nijanona efa-bolana tany.'),
  ('6ab25a0bcf3fe2bc6d2dd7a6', '2026-09-22T10:35:55.896Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:55.896Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 20, 46, 'Nahatratra 25 000 ny Benjaminita rehetra maty tamin’izay andro izay. Miaramila mpitan-tsabatra sy matanjaka daholo ireo maty ireo.', 'nahatratra 25 000 ny benjaminita rehetra maty tamin’izay andro izay. miaramila mpitan-tsabatra sy matanjaka daholo ireo maty ireo.'),
  ('6ab25a0bcf3fe2bc6d2dd7a5', '2026-09-22T10:35:55.896Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:55.896Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 20, 45, 'Dia nandositra nankany an-tany efitra, tany amin’ny harambaton’i Rimona, ny taranak’i Benjamina. Nisy 5 000 tamin’izy ireo no novonoin’ny Israelita teny an-dalambe. Ary nenjehin’izy ireo hatrany Gidoma ny Benjaminita, ka mbola nahafaty 2 000 lahy izy ireo.', 'dia nandositra nankany an-tany efitra, tany amin’ny harambaton’i rimona, ny taranak’i benjamina. nisy 5 000 tamin’izy ireo no novonoin’ny israelita teny an-dalambe. ary nenjehin’izy ireo hatrany gidoma ny benjaminita, ka mbola nahafaty 2 000 lahy izy ireo.'),
  ('6ab25a0bcf3fe2bc6d2dd7a2', '2026-09-22T10:35:55.896Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:55.896Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 20, 42, 'Dia nandositra an’ireo lehilahy israelita izy ireo, ka nankany an-tany efitra. Mbola nanenjika azy ireo ihany anefa ny Israelita. Nanampy azy ireo hamono an’ireo Benjaminita koa ny lehilahy avy amin’ny tanàna manodidina.', 'dia nandositra an’ireo lehilahy israelita izy ireo, ka nankany an-tany efitra. mbola nanenjika azy ireo ihany anefa ny israelita. nanampy azy ireo hamono an’ireo benjaminita koa ny lehilahy avy amin’ny tanàna manodidina.'),
  ('6ab25a0bcf3fe2bc6d2dd79f', '2026-09-22T10:35:55.896Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:55.896Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 20, 39, 'Rehefa nandositra ny Israelita, dia nanomboka nanafika azy ireo ny taranak’i Benjamina, ka lehilahy israelita 30 teo ho eo no matin’izy ireo. Dia hoy ny Benjaminita: “Tena resintsika hoatran’ny tamin’ilay ady teo aloha indray ry zareo.”', 'rehefa nandositra ny israelita, dia nanomboka nanafika azy ireo ny taranak’i benjamina, ka lehilahy israelita 30 teo ho eo no matin’izy ireo. dia hoy ny benjaminita: “tena resintsika hoatran’ny tamin’ilay ady teo aloha indray ry zareo.”'),
  ('6ab25a0bcf3fe2bc6d2dd79b', '2026-09-22T10:35:55.896Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:55.896Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 20, 35, 'Nataon’i Jehovah resin’ny Israelita ny Benjaminita, ka 25 100 ny Benjaminita matin’ny Israelita tamin’izay andro izay. Mpitan-tsabatra daholo ireo maty ireo.', 'nataon’i jehovah resin’ny israelita ny benjaminita, ka 25 100 ny benjaminita matin’ny israelita tamin’izay andro izay. mpitan-tsabatra daholo ireo maty ireo.'),
  ('6ab25a0bcf3fe2bc6d2dd791', '2026-09-22T10:35:55.896Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:55.896Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 20, 25, 'Nivoaka avy tao Gibea koa ny Benjaminita tamin’ny andro faharoa mba hifanandrina taminy, ka nahafaty Israelita 18 000 indray. Mpitan-tsabatra daholo ireo maty ireo.', 'nivoaka avy tao gibea koa ny benjaminita tamin’ny andro faharoa mba hifanandrina taminy, ka nahafaty israelita 18 000 indray. mpitan-tsabatra daholo ireo maty ireo.'),
  ('6ab25a0bcf3fe2bc6d2dd793', '2026-09-22T10:35:55.896Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:55.896Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 20, 27, 'Nanontany an’i Jehovah ny lehilahy israelita avy eo. Tany Betela mantsy tamin’izany no nisy an’ilay Vata misy ny fifanekena nataon’ilay tena Andriamanitra.', 'nanontany an’i jehovah ny lehilahy israelita avy eo. tany betela mantsy tamin’izany no nisy an’ilay vata misy ny fifanekena nataon’ilay tena andriamanitra.'),
  ('6ab25a0bcf3fe2bc6d2dd796', '2026-09-22T10:35:55.896Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:55.896Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 20, 30, 'Ary niakatra hiady tamin’ireo Benjaminita ny Israelita tamin’ny andro fahatelo, ka nilahatra hiady tamin’i Gibea, hoatran’ny teo aloha.', 'ary niakatra hiady tamin’ireo benjaminita ny israelita tamin’ny andro fahatelo, ka nilahatra hiady tamin’i gibea, hoatran’ny teo aloha.'),
  ('6ab25a0bcf3fe2bc6d2dd795', '2026-09-22T10:35:55.896Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:55.896Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 20, 29, 'Koa nametraka olona nanodidina an’i Gibea ny Israely, mba hiafina hanafika an’ilay tanàna.', 'koa nametraka olona nanodidina an’i gibea ny israely, mba hiafina hanafika an’ilay tanàna.'),
  ('6ab25a0bcf3fe2bc6d2dd794', '2026-09-22T10:35:55.896Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:55.896Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 20, 28, 'Nanompo teo anoloan’izy io i Finehasa zanak’i Eleazara, zanak’i Arona, tamin’izany andro izany. Dia hoy izy ireo: “Mbola tokony handeha hiady amin’ny taranak’i Benjamina rahalahinay indray ve izahay, sa aoka izay?” Dia hoy i Jehovah: “Miakara, fa hataoko resinareo izy rahampitso.”', 'nanompo teo anoloan’izy io i finehasa zanak’i eleazara, zanak’i arona, tamin’izany andro izany. dia hoy izy ireo: “mbola tokony handeha hiady amin’ny taranak’i benjamina rahalahinay indray ve izahay, sa aoka izay?” dia hoy i jehovah: “miakara, fa hataoko resinareo izy rahampitso.”'),
  ('6ab25a0bcf3fe2bc6d2dd7a1', '2026-09-22T10:35:55.896Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:55.896Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 20, 41, 'Ary niverina tampoka ny lehilahy israelita, ka very hevitra ny taranak’i Benjamina satria hitany fa nidiran-doza izy ireo.', 'ary niverina tampoka ny lehilahy israelita, ka very hevitra ny taranak’i benjamina satria hitany fa nidiran-doza izy ireo.'),
  ('6ab25a0bcf3fe2bc6d2dd7a0', '2026-09-22T10:35:55.896Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:55.896Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 20, 40, 'Nanomboka niakatra avy tao an-tanàna anefa ilay famantarana, izany hoe ilay setroka be. Dia nitodika ny taranak’i Benjamina, ka tazany nidedadeda nanakatra ny lanitra ny afo nandoro an’ilay tanàna manontolo.', 'nanomboka niakatra avy tao an-tanàna anefa ilay famantarana, izany hoe ilay setroka be. dia nitodika ny taranak’i benjamina, ka tazany nidedadeda nanakatra ny lanitra ny afo nandoro an’ilay tanàna manontolo.'),
  ('6ab25a0bcf3fe2bc6d2dd790', '2026-09-22T10:35:55.896Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:55.896Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 20, 24, 'Dia nanatona an’ireo Benjaminita ny Israelita tamin’ny andro faharoa mba hiady taminy.', 'dia nanatona an’ireo benjaminita ny israelita tamin’ny andro faharoa mba hiady taminy.'),
  ('6ab25a0bcf3fe2bc6d2dd7a4', '2026-09-22T10:35:55.896Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:55.896Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 20, 44, 'Farany, dia 18 000 tamin’ny taranak’i Benjamina no maty. Miaramila matanjaka daholo ireo maty ireo.', 'farany, dia 18 000 tamin’ny taranak’i benjamina no maty. miaramila matanjaka daholo ireo maty ireo.'),
  ('6ab25a0bcf3fe2bc6d2dd79d', '2026-09-22T10:35:55.896Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:55.896Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 20, 37, 'Ireo niafina kosa nirohotra haingana nankao Gibea. Dia niparitaka izy ireo, ka nasiany tamin’ny sabatra izay rehetra tao an-tanàna.', 'ireo niafina kosa nirohotra haingana nankao gibea. dia niparitaka izy ireo, ka nasiany tamin’ny sabatra izay rehetra tao an-tanàna.'),
  ('6ab25a0d74116d08a0db4eee', '2026-09-22T10:35:57.390Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:57.390Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 21, 22, 'Raha tonga mitaraina atỳ aminay ny rainy na ny anadahiny, dia izao no holazainay aminy: ‘Tsara fanahy aminay ange ianareo raha manampy an-dry zareo e! Tsy afaka nanome vady ho azy ireo tsirairay mantsy izahay, satria tsy ampy ny vehivavy azonay tany an’ady. Sady ho meloka koa ianareo raha nanome vady ho an-dry zareo.’”', 'raha tonga mitaraina atỳ aminay ny rainy na ny anadahiny, dia izao no holazainay aminy: ‘tsara fanahy aminay ange ianareo raha manampy an-dry zareo e! tsy afaka nanome vady ho azy ireo tsirairay mantsy izahay, satria tsy ampy ny vehivavy azonay tany an’ady. sady ho meloka koa ianareo raha nanome vady ho an-dry zareo.’”'),
  ('6ab25a0d74116d08a0db4ee8', '2026-09-22T10:35:57.390Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:57.390Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 21, 16, 'Dia hoy ny anti-panahy teo amin’ny vahoaka: “Inona no tokony hataontsika mba hanomezana vady ho an’ireo lehilahy sisa tavela ireo? Efa naripatsika mantsy ny vehivavy rehetra teo amin’ny fokon’i Benjamina.”', 'dia hoy ny anti-panahy teo amin’ny vahoaka: “inona no tokony hataontsika mba hanomezana vady ho an’ireo lehilahy sisa tavela ireo? efa naripatsika mantsy ny vehivavy rehetra teo amin’ny fokon’i benjamina.”'),
  ('6ab25a0d74116d08a0db4eec', '2026-09-22T10:35:57.390Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:57.390Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 21, 20, 'Nomen’izy ireo baiko àry ny taranak’i Benjamina hoe: “Mandehana miafina ao amin’ny tanimboaloboka.', 'nomen’izy ireo baiko àry ny taranak’i benjamina hoe: “mandehana miafina ao amin’ny tanimboaloboka.'),
  ('6ab25a0d74116d08a0db4ee6', '2026-09-22T10:35:57.390Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:57.390Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 21, 14, 'Niverina tany amin’ny taniny àry ny fokon’i Benjamina, tamin’izany fotoana izany. Dia nomen’izy ireo ho vadin’ny Benjaminita ireo zazavavy avy tao Jabesi-gileada, izay tsy novonoiny niaraka tamin’ireo vehivavy hafa tao. Tsy ampy anefa ny zazavavy hitan’izy ireo tao.', 'niverina tany amin’ny taniny àry ny fokon’i benjamina, tamin’izany fotoana izany. dia nomen’izy ireo ho vadin’ny benjaminita ireo zazavavy avy tao jabesi-gileada, izay tsy novonoiny niaraka tamin’ireo vehivavy hafa tao. tsy ampy anefa ny zazavavy hitan’izy ireo tao.'),
  ('6ab25a0d74116d08a0db4ee2', '2026-09-22T10:35:57.390Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:57.390Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 21, 10, 'Koa naniraka lehilahy 12 000 faran’izay matanjaka ny vahoaka, mba handeha ho any. Nanome baiko azy ireo ny vahoaka hoe: “Mandehana ka asio amin’ny sabatra ny mponin’i Jabesi-gileada, hatramin’ny zaza amam-behivavy.', 'koa naniraka lehilahy 12 000 faran’izay matanjaka ny vahoaka, mba handeha ho any. nanome baiko azy ireo ny vahoaka hoe: “mandehana ka asio amin’ny sabatra ny mponin’i jabesi-gileada, hatramin’ny zaza amam-behivavy.'),
  ('6ab25a0d74116d08a0db4edf', '2026-09-22T10:35:57.390Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:57.390Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 21, 7, 'Dia inona izany no tokony hataontsika mba hanomezana vady ho an’ireo sisa tavela? Isika mantsy efa nianiana tamin’ny anaran’i Jehovah hoe tsy hanome ny zanatsika vavy ho vadin’izy ireo.”', 'dia inona izany no tokony hataontsika mba hanomezana vady ho an’ireo sisa tavela? isika mantsy efa nianiana tamin’ny anaran’i jehovah hoe tsy hanome ny zanatsika vavy ho vadin’izy ireo.”'),
  ('6ab25a0d74116d08a0db4ee1', '2026-09-22T10:35:57.390Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:57.390Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 21, 9, 'Rehefa nisaina hoe firy ny olona, dia hitan’izy ireo fa tsy nisy tao ny mponin’i Jabesi-gileada na dia iray aza.', 'rehefa nisaina hoe firy ny olona, dia hitan’izy ireo fa tsy nisy tao ny mponin’i jabesi-gileada na dia iray aza.'),
  ('6ab25a0d74116d08a0db4eda', '2026-09-22T10:35:57.390Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:57.390Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 21, 2, 'Nankany Betela àry ny olona, ka nipetraka teo anatrehan’ilay tena Andriamanitra mandra-paharivan’ny andro, sady nigogogogo nitomany be mihitsy.', 'nankany betela àry ny olona, ka nipetraka teo anatrehan’ilay tena andriamanitra mandra-paharivan’ny andro, sady nigogogogo nitomany be mihitsy.'),
  ('6ab25a0d74116d08a0db4ed9', '2026-09-22T10:35:57.390Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:57.390Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 21, 1, 'Ary nianiana tany Mizpa ny lehilahy israelita hoe: “Tsy hisy amintsika ireto hanome ny zanany vavy ho vadin’ny lehilahy avy amin’ny fokon’i Benjamina.”', 'ary nianiana tany mizpa ny lehilahy israelita hoe: “tsy hisy amintsika ireto hanome ny zanany vavy ho vadin’ny lehilahy avy amin’ny fokon’i benjamina.”'),
  ('6ab25a0d74116d08a0db4ee3', '2026-09-22T10:35:57.390Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:57.390Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 21, 11, 'Ary izao atao: Aringano ny lehilahy rehetra, ary aringano koa ny vehivavy rehetra efa nanao firaisana tamin’ny lehilahy.”', 'ary izao atao: aringano ny lehilahy rehetra, ary aringano koa ny vehivavy rehetra efa nanao firaisana tamin’ny lehilahy.”'),
  ('6ab25a0d74116d08a0db4ede', '2026-09-22T10:35:57.390Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:57.390Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 21, 6, 'Nalahelo àry ny vahoakan’Israely noho izay nanjo ny fokon’i Benjamina rahalahiny. Hoy izy ireo: “Nisy foko iray fongotra teto amin’ny Israely androany.', 'nalahelo àry ny vahoakan’israely noho izay nanjo ny fokon’i benjamina rahalahiny. hoy izy ireo: “nisy foko iray fongotra teto amin’ny israely androany.'),
  ('6ab25a0d74116d08a0db4eed', '2026-09-22T10:35:57.390Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:57.390Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 21, 21, 'Rehefa hitanareo mivoaka handihy manao boribory ny tovovavy ao Silo, dia mivoaha avy ao amin’ny tanimboaloboka, ka samia misambotra iray amin’ireo tovovavy ao Silo mba ho vadinareo. Ary mandehana miverina any amin’ny tanin’i Benjamina.', 'rehefa hitanareo mivoaka handihy manao boribory ny tovovavy ao silo, dia mivoaha avy ao amin’ny tanimboaloboka, ka samia misambotra iray amin’ireo tovovavy ao silo mba ho vadinareo. ary mandehana miverina any amin’ny tanin’i benjamina.'),
  ('6ab25a0d74116d08a0db4ee0', '2026-09-22T10:35:57.390Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:57.390Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 21, 8, 'Dia hoy izy ireo: “Iza tamin’ny fokon’ny Israely no tsy niakatra teo anatrehan’i Jehovah tany Mizpa?” Ary hitan’izy ireo fa tsy nisy tonga tao amin’ilay toby nisy ny fiangonana, ny olona avy any Jabesi-gileada.', 'dia hoy izy ireo: “iza tamin’ny fokon’ny israely no tsy niakatra teo anatrehan’i jehovah tany mizpa?” ary hitan’izy ireo fa tsy nisy tonga tao amin’ilay toby nisy ny fiangonana, ny olona avy any jabesi-gileada.'),
  ('6ab25a0d74116d08a0db4ef1', '2026-09-22T10:35:57.390Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:57.390Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 21, 25, 'Tsy nisy mpanjaka teo amin’ny Israely tamin’izany andro izany, ary samy nanao izay noheveriny fa nety ny olona.', 'tsy nisy mpanjaka teo amin’ny israely tamin’izany andro izany, ary samy nanao izay noheveriny fa nety ny olona.'),
  ('6ab25a0d74116d08a0db4ee4', '2026-09-22T10:35:57.390Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:57.390Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 21, 12, 'Nahita zazavavy 400 mbola virjiny anefa izy ireo teo amin’ny mponin’i Jabesi-gileada. Mbola tsy nanao firaisana tamin’ny lehilahy mihitsy ireo zazavavy ireo. Dia nentiny tao an-toby tany Silo, tany amin’ny tany Kanana, izy ireo.', 'nahita zazavavy 400 mbola virjiny anefa izy ireo teo amin’ny mponin’i jabesi-gileada. mbola tsy nanao firaisana tamin’ny lehilahy mihitsy ireo zazavavy ireo. dia nentiny tao an-toby tany silo, tany amin’ny tany kanana, izy ireo.'),
  ('6ab25a0d74116d08a0db4ef0', '2026-09-22T10:35:57.390Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:57.390Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 21, 24, 'Dia niparitaka niala teo ny Israelita, tamin’izany fotoana izany, ka samy nankany amin’ny fokony sy ny fianakaviany avy. Niala teo izy ireo, ary samy nankany amin’ny lovany.', 'dia niparitaka niala teo ny israelita, tamin’izany fotoana izany, ka samy nankany amin’ny fokony sy ny fianakaviany avy. niala teo izy ireo, ary samy nankany amin’ny lovany.'),
  ('6ab25a0d74116d08a0db4ee9', '2026-09-22T10:35:57.390Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:57.390Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 21, 17, 'Hoy koa izy ireo: “Tokony hahazo lova ireo Benjaminita tsy maty ireo, mba tsy hisy foko ho fongana eo amin’ny Israely.', 'hoy koa izy ireo: “tokony hahazo lova ireo benjaminita tsy maty ireo, mba tsy hisy foko ho fongana eo amin’ny israely.'),
  ('6ab25a0d74116d08a0db4edc', '2026-09-22T10:35:57.390Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:57.390Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 21, 4, 'Ary nifoha maraina ny olona ny ampitson’iny ka nanorina alitara teo, mba hanolorana fanatitra dorana sy fanatitra iombonana.', 'ary nifoha maraina ny olona ny ampitson’iny ka nanorina alitara teo, mba hanolorana fanatitra dorana sy fanatitra iombonana.'),
  ('6ab25a0d74116d08a0db4edb', '2026-09-22T10:35:57.390Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:57.390Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 21, 3, 'Ary hoy izy ireo: “Jehovah Andriamanitry ny Israely ô, fa maninona no misy zavatra hoatr’izao eto Israely? Dia ho foana ve izany ny foko iray eto amin’ny Israely androany?”', 'ary hoy izy ireo: “jehovah andriamanitry ny israely ô, fa maninona no misy zavatra hoatr’izao eto israely? dia ho foana ve izany ny foko iray eto amin’ny israely androany?”'),
  ('6ab25a0d74116d08a0db4ee5', '2026-09-22T10:35:57.390Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:57.390Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 21, 13, 'Dia naniraka olona ho any amin’ny Benjaminita tao amin’ny harambaton’i Rimona ny vahoaka manontolo, ary namitram-pihavanana taminy.', 'dia naniraka olona ho any amin’ny benjaminita tao amin’ny harambaton’i rimona ny vahoaka manontolo, ary namitram-pihavanana taminy.'),
  ('6ab25a0d74116d08a0db4eeb', '2026-09-22T10:35:57.390Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:57.390Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 21, 19, 'Dia hoy izy ireo: “Misy fety ho an’i Jehovah atao isan-taona any Silo, any avaratr’i Betela, izany hoe eo atsinanan’ilay lalambe miakatra avy any Betela mankany Sekema, eo atsimon’i Lebona.”', 'dia hoy izy ireo: “misy fety ho an’i jehovah atao isan-taona any silo, any avaratr’i betela, izany hoe eo atsinanan’ilay lalambe miakatra avy any betela mankany sekema, eo atsimon’i lebona.”'),
  ('6ab25a0d74116d08a0db4eea', '2026-09-22T10:35:57.390Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:57.390Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 21, 18, 'Isika anefa tsy mahazo manome ny zanatsika vavy ho vadin’izy ireo, satria efa nianiana ny vahoakan’Israely hoe: ‘Voaozona izay manome vady ho an’ny fokon’i Benjamina.’”', 'isika anefa tsy mahazo manome ny zanatsika vavy ho vadin’izy ireo, satria efa nianiana ny vahoakan’israely hoe: ‘voaozona izay manome vady ho an’ny fokon’i benjamina.’”'),
  ('6ab25a0d74116d08a0db4ee7', '2026-09-22T10:35:57.390Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:57.390Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 21, 15, 'Dia nalahelo ny olona noho ny zavatra nanjo ny fokon’i Benjamina, satria nosarahin’i Jehovah tamin’ny foko hafa teo amin’ny Israely io foko io.', 'dia nalahelo ny olona noho ny zavatra nanjo ny fokon’i benjamina, satria nosarahin’i jehovah tamin’ny foko hafa teo amin’ny israely io foko io.'),
  ('6ab25a0d74116d08a0db4eef', '2026-09-22T10:35:57.390Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:57.390Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 21, 23, 'Dia izany mihitsy no nataon’ny taranak’i Benjamina. Samy naka vady avy tamin’ireo vehivavy nandihy izy ireo, ary avy eo lasa niverina tany amin’ny lovany. Dia naoriny indray ny tanànany, ka nipetraka tao amin’ireny tanàna ireny izy ireo.', 'dia izany mihitsy no nataon’ny taranak’i benjamina. samy naka vady avy tamin’ireo vehivavy nandihy izy ireo, ary avy eo lasa niverina tany amin’ny lovany. dia naoriny indray ny tanànany, ka nipetraka tao amin’ireny tanàna ireny izy ireo.'),
  ('6ab25a0d74116d08a0db4edd', '2026-09-22T10:35:57.390Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:57.390Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Mpitsara', 7, 21, 5, 'Dia hoy ny vahoakan’Israely: “Iza tamin’ny foko rehetra teo amin’ny Israely no tsy tonga nivory teo anatrehan’i Jehovah?” Efa nianiana mantsy izy ireo hoe tsy maintsy hovonoina ho faty izay tsy niakatra teo anatrehan’i Jehovah tany Mizpa.', 'dia hoy ny vahoakan’israely: “iza tamin’ny foko rehetra teo amin’ny israely no tsy tonga nivory teo anatrehan’i jehovah?” efa nianiana mantsy izy ireo hoe tsy maintsy hovonoina ho faty izay tsy niakatra teo anatrehan’i jehovah tany mizpa.'),
  ('6ab25a0e533ad96ba7ea9e38', '2026-09-22T10:35:58.832Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:58.832Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Rota', 8, 1, 12, 'Mandehana mody, anaka! Mandehana fa izaho ange efa antitra ka tsy hahazo vady intsony e! Ary na mbola hahazo vady aza aho androany alina ka hitera-dahy,', 'mandehana mody, anaka! mandehana fa izaho ange efa antitra ka tsy hahazo vady intsony e! ary na mbola hahazo vady aza aho androany alina ka hitera-dahy,'),
  ('6ab25a0e533ad96ba7ea9e30', '2026-09-22T10:35:58.832Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:58.832Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Rota', 8, 1, 4, 'Tatỳ aoriana, dia nanambady vehivavy moabita izy roa lahy. Orpa no anaran’ny iray, ary Rota no anaran’ny iray. Dia nijanona tany folo taona teo ho eo izy ireo.', 'tatỳ aoriana, dia nanambady vehivavy moabita izy roa lahy. orpa no anaran’ny iray, ary rota no anaran’ny iray. dia nijanona tany folo taona teo ho eo izy ireo.'),
  ('6ab25a0e533ad96ba7ea9e40', '2026-09-22T10:35:58.832Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:58.832Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Rota', 8, 1, 20, 'Dia hoy izy tamin’ireo: “Aza atao hoe Naomy aho, fa ataovy hoe Mara satria tena nampangidy ny fiainako ilay Mahery Indrindra.', 'dia hoy izy tamin’ireo: “aza atao hoe naomy aho, fa ataovy hoe mara satria tena nampangidy ny fiainako ilay mahery indrindra.'),
  ('6ab25a0e533ad96ba7ea9e3f', '2026-09-22T10:35:58.832Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:58.832Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Rota', 8, 1, 19, 'Dia nanohy ny diany izy mianaka mandra-pahatongany tany Betlehema. Ary taitaitra sy nientanentana ny iray tanàna raha vao nahita azy ireo, ka niteny ireo vehivavy tao an-tanàna hoe: “I Naomy ve io?”', 'dia nanohy ny diany izy mianaka mandra-pahatongany tany betlehema. ary taitaitra sy nientanentana ny iray tanàna raha vao nahita azy ireo, ka niteny ireo vehivavy tao an-tanàna hoe: “i naomy ve io?”'),
  ('6ab25a0e533ad96ba7ea9e3d', '2026-09-22T10:35:58.832Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:58.832Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Rota', 8, 1, 17, 'Izay toerana hahafatesanao no hahafatesako, ary any no hilevenako. Hofaizin’i Jehovah anie aho, raha tsy ny fahafatesana ihany no hampisaraka antsika!”', 'izay toerana hahafatesanao no hahafatesako, ary any no hilevenako. hofaizin’i jehovah anie aho, raha tsy ny fahafatesana ihany no hampisaraka antsika!”'),
  ('6ab25a0e533ad96ba7ea9e2e', '2026-09-22T10:35:58.832Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:58.832Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Rota', 8, 1, 2, 'Elimeleka no anaran’ilay lehilahy, Naomy no anaran’ny vadiny, ary Malona sy Kiliona no anaran’ny zanany. Efratita avy any Betlehema any Joda izy ireo, ary tonga tany amin’ny faritr’i Moaba ka nijanona tany.', 'elimeleka no anaran’ilay lehilahy, naomy no anaran’ny vadiny, ary malona sy kiliona no anaran’ny zanany. efratita avy any betlehema any joda izy ireo, ary tonga tany amin’ny faritr’i moaba ka nijanona tany.'),
  ('6ab25a0e533ad96ba7ea9e31', '2026-09-22T10:35:58.832Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:58.832Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Rota', 8, 1, 5, 'Ary maty koa i Malona sy Kiliona, dia i Naomy sisa no tavela, fa tsy teo intsony ny vadiny sy ny zanany roa lahy.', 'ary maty koa i malona sy kiliona, dia i naomy sisa no tavela, fa tsy teo intsony ny vadiny sy ny zanany roa lahy.'),
  ('6ab25a0e533ad96ba7ea9e42', '2026-09-22T10:35:58.832Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:58.832Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Rota', 8, 1, 22, 'Izany no tantaran’i Naomy tamin’izy nody avy tany amin’ny faritr’i Moaba, niaraka tamin’i Rota Moabita vinantovaviny. Tonga tany Betlehema izy mianaka rehefa nanomboka ny fijinjana vary orza.', 'izany no tantaran’i naomy tamin’izy nody avy tany amin’ny faritr’i moaba, niaraka tamin’i rota moabita vinantovaviny. tonga tany betlehema izy mianaka rehefa nanomboka ny fijinjana vary orza.'),
  ('6ab25a0e533ad96ba7ea9e3b', '2026-09-22T10:35:58.832Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:58.832Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Rota', 8, 1, 15, 'Hoy àry i Naomy: “Jereo fa lasa nody any amin’ny fireneny sy ny andriamaniny ny rahavavinao. Mandehana miaraka aminy.”', 'hoy àry i naomy: “jereo fa lasa nody any amin’ny fireneny sy ny andriamaniny ny rahavavinao. mandehana miaraka aminy.”'),
  ('6ab25a0e533ad96ba7ea9e2d', '2026-09-22T10:35:58.832Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:58.832Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Rota', 8, 1, 1, 'Tamin’ny andron’ny mpitsara, dia nisy mosary teo amin’ilay tany. Dia niala tany Betlehema any Joda ny lehilahy iray, ary nandeha nifindra tany amin’ny faritr’i Moaba niaraka tamin’ny vadiny sy ny zanany roa lahy.', 'tamin’ny andron’ny mpitsara, dia nisy mosary teo amin’ilay tany. dia niala tany betlehema any joda ny lehilahy iray, ary nandeha nifindra tany amin’ny faritr’i moaba niaraka tamin’ny vadiny sy ny zanany roa lahy.'),
  ('6ab25a0e533ad96ba7ea9e2f', '2026-09-22T10:35:58.832Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:58.832Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Rota', 8, 1, 3, 'Maty i Elimeleka vadin’i Naomy rehefa nandeha ny fotoana, ka i Naomy sy ny zanany roa lahy sisa no tavela.', 'maty i elimeleka vadin’i naomy rehefa nandeha ny fotoana, ka i naomy sy ny zanany roa lahy sisa no tavela.'),
  ('6ab25a0e533ad96ba7ea9e32', '2026-09-22T10:35:58.832Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:58.832Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Rota', 8, 1, 6, 'Koa niala tany amin’ny faritr’i Moaba izy mba handeha hody, dia niaraka taminy ireo vinantovaviny. Henony mantsy fa notahin’i Jehovah indray ny vahoakany ka nomeny sakafo.', 'koa niala tany amin’ny faritr’i moaba izy mba handeha hody, dia niaraka taminy ireo vinantovaviny. henony mantsy fa notahin’i jehovah indray ny vahoakany ka nomeny sakafo.'),
  ('6ab25a0e533ad96ba7ea9e3a', '2026-09-22T10:35:58.832Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:58.832Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Rota', 8, 1, 14, 'Dia nitomany be indray izy roa vavy. Ary nanoroka ny rafozambaviny i Orpa, dia lasa. I Rota kosa tsy nety nisaraka taminy.', 'dia nitomany be indray izy roa vavy. ary nanoroka ny rafozambaviny i orpa, dia lasa. i rota kosa tsy nety nisaraka taminy.'),
  ('6ab25a0e533ad96ba7ea9e39', '2026-09-22T10:35:58.832Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:58.832Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Rota', 8, 1, 13, 'dia hahandry azy mandra-pahalehibeny ve ianareo? Hahavita tsy hanambady ve ianareo fa hiandry azy? Tsy mety izany, anaka! Tena mampalahelo ahy ianareo fa noho izaho nofaizin’i Jehovah no nahatonga anareo ho hoatr’izao.”', 'dia hahandry azy mandra-pahalehibeny ve ianareo? hahavita tsy hanambady ve ianareo fa hiandry azy? tsy mety izany, anaka! tena mampalahelo ahy ianareo fa noho izaho nofaizin’i jehovah no nahatonga anareo ho hoatr’izao.”'),
  ('6ab25a0e533ad96ba7ea9e37', '2026-09-22T10:35:58.832Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:58.832Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Rota', 8, 1, 11, 'Hoy anefa i Naomy: “Mandehana mody, anaka! Fa maninona ianareo no hiaraka amiko? Izaho angaha mbola afaka miteraka zanakalahy ho lasa vadinareo?', 'hoy anefa i naomy: “mandehana mody, anaka! fa maninona ianareo no hiaraka amiko? izaho angaha mbola afaka miteraka zanakalahy ho lasa vadinareo?'),
  ('6ab25a0e533ad96ba7ea9e33', '2026-09-22T10:35:58.832Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:58.832Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Rota', 8, 1, 7, 'Niala tao amin’ilay toerana nisy azy izy, niaraka tamin’ny vinantony roa vavy. Rehefa teny an-dalana hiverina any Joda izy ireo,', 'niala tao amin’ilay toerana nisy azy izy, niaraka tamin’ny vinantony roa vavy. rehefa teny an-dalana hiverina any joda izy ireo,'),
  ('6ab25a0e533ad96ba7ea9e41', '2026-09-22T10:35:58.832Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:58.832Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Rota', 8, 1, 21, 'Nanana ny zava-drehetra aho tamin’izaho niala teto, nefa nampody ahy tanam-polo i Jehovah. Fa maninona aho no antsoinareo hoe Naomy? I Jehovah aza ange tsy faly tamiko e, ary ilay Mahery Indrindra aza efa nahatonga loza tamiko!”', 'nanana ny zava-drehetra aho tamin’izaho niala teto, nefa nampody ahy tanam-polo i jehovah. fa maninona aho no antsoinareo hoe naomy? i jehovah aza ange tsy faly tamiko e, ary ilay mahery indrindra aza efa nahatonga loza tamiko!”'),
  ('6ab25a0e533ad96ba7ea9e3e', '2026-09-22T10:35:58.832Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:58.832Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Rota', 8, 1, 18, 'Rehefa hitan’i Naomy fa nisisika hiaraka taminy i Rota, dia tsy niezaka nandresy lahatra azy intsony izy.', 'rehefa hitan’i naomy fa nisisika hiaraka taminy i rota, dia tsy niezaka nandresy lahatra azy intsony izy.'),
  ('6ab25a0e533ad96ba7ea9e36', '2026-09-22T10:35:58.832Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:58.832Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Rota', 8, 1, 10, 'sady namerimberina niteny hoe: “Avelao izahay mba hiaraka aminao any amin’ny firenenao.”', 'sady namerimberina niteny hoe: “avelao izahay mba hiaraka aminao any amin’ny firenenao.”'),
  ('6ab25a0e533ad96ba7ea9e35', '2026-09-22T10:35:58.832Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:58.832Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Rota', 8, 1, 9, 'I Jehovah koa anie hanome anareo vady hiadanana!” Dia nanoroka azy roa vavy izy, ary nitomany be izy ireo', 'i jehovah koa anie hanome anareo vady hiadanana!” dia nanoroka azy roa vavy izy, ary nitomany be izy ireo'),
  ('6ab25a0e533ad96ba7ea9e34', '2026-09-22T10:35:58.832Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:58.832Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Rota', 8, 1, 8, 'dia hoy i Naomy tamin’izy roa vavy: “Aleo ianareo samy mody any amin’ny tranon’ny mamanareo avy. Ary enga anie i Jehovah ho tia anareo foana sy tsy hivadika aminareo, hoatran’ny nataonareo tamiko sy tamin’ny vadinareo tamin’izy ireo mbola velona!', 'dia hoy i naomy tamin’izy roa vavy: “aleo ianareo samy mody any amin’ny tranon’ny mamanareo avy. ary enga anie i jehovah ho tia anareo foana sy tsy hivadika aminareo, hoatran’ny nataonareo tamiko sy tamin’ny vadinareo tamin’izy ireo mbola velona!'),
  ('6ab25a0e533ad96ba7ea9e3c', '2026-09-22T10:35:58.832Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:58.832Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Rota', 8, 1, 16, 'Fa hoy i Rota: “Aza terena handao anao sy hisaraka aminao aho, fa izay halehanao no halehako ary izay hatorianao no hatoriako. Ny firenenao no ho fireneko, ary ny Andriamanitrao no ho Andriamanitro.', 'fa hoy i rota: “aza terena handao anao sy hisaraka aminao aho, fa izay halehanao no halehako ary izay hatorianao no hatoriako. ny firenenao no ho fireneko, ary ny andriamanitrao no ho andriamanitro.'),
  ('6ab25a0f3817f681ab444355', '2026-09-22T10:35:59.490Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:59.490Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Rota', 8, 2, 18, 'Nentiny tany an-tanàna izany ary hitan’ny rafozambaviny. Navoakan’i Rota koa ny ambiny tsy laniny tamin’ilay izy nisakafo, dia nomeny azy.', 'nentiny tany an-tanàna izany ary hitan’ny rafozambaviny. navoakan’i rota koa ny ambiny tsy laniny tamin’ilay izy nisakafo, dia nomeny azy.'),
  ('6ab25a0f3817f681ab44434c', '2026-09-22T10:35:59.490Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:59.490Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Rota', 8, 2, 9, 'Jereo foana hoe aiza ry zareo no mijinja dia miaraha aminy. Efa nandidy an’ireo ankizilahy aho mba tsy hanadala anao. Efa nantsaka rano koa ry zareo dia nataony ao amin’iretsy siny iretsy. Mankanesa eny rehefa mangetaheta.”', 'jereo foana hoe aiza ry zareo no mijinja dia miaraha aminy. efa nandidy an’ireo ankizilahy aho mba tsy hanadala anao. efa nantsaka rano koa ry zareo dia nataony ao amin’iretsy siny iretsy. mankanesa eny rehefa mangetaheta.”'),
  ('6ab25a0f3817f681ab444348', '2026-09-22T10:35:59.490Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:59.490Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Rota', 8, 2, 5, 'Ary hoy i Boaza tamin’ilay lehilahy niandraikitra ny mpijinja: “Havan’iza io tovovavy io?”', 'ary hoy i boaza tamin’ilay lehilahy niandraikitra ny mpijinja: “havan’iza io tovovavy io?”'),
  ('6ab25a0f3817f681ab444359', '2026-09-22T10:35:59.490Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:59.490Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Rota', 8, 2, 22, 'Ary hoy i Naomy tamin’i Rota vinantovaviny: “Aleo mihitsy ianao, anaka, miaraka amin’ny ankizivavy mpanompony. Raha any amin’ny sahan’olon-kafa mantsy ianao dia mety hisy hanadala.”', 'ary hoy i naomy tamin’i rota vinantovaviny: “aleo mihitsy ianao, anaka, miaraka amin’ny ankizivavy mpanompony. raha any amin’ny sahan’olon-kafa mantsy ianao dia mety hisy hanadala.”'),
  ('6ab25a0f3817f681ab444352', '2026-09-22T10:35:59.490Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:59.490Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Rota', 8, 2, 15, 'Dia nitsangana indray i Rota mba hitsimpona salohim-bary. Ary nandidy an’ireo ankizilahy mpanompony i Boaza hoe: “Avelao izy hitsimpona ny salohim-bary eny anelanelan’ny amboara, ary aza mila vaniny aminy.', 'dia nitsangana indray i rota mba hitsimpona salohim-bary. ary nandidy an’ireo ankizilahy mpanompony i boaza hoe: “avelao izy hitsimpona ny salohim-bary eny anelanelan’ny amboara, ary aza mila vaniny aminy.'),
  ('6ab25a0f3817f681ab444347', '2026-09-22T10:35:59.490Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:59.490Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Rota', 8, 2, 4, 'Tonga avy any Betlehema i Boaza tamin’izay, ka hoy izy tamin’ireo mpijinja: “Hanampy anareo anie i Jehovah!” Dia namaly izy ireo hoe: “Hitahy anao anie i Jehovah!”', 'tonga avy any betlehema i boaza tamin’izay, ka hoy izy tamin’ireo mpijinja: “hanampy anareo anie i jehovah!” dia namaly izy ireo hoe: “hitahy anao anie i jehovah!”'),
  ('6ab25a0f3817f681ab444358', '2026-09-22T10:35:59.490Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:59.490Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Rota', 8, 2, 21, 'Dia hoy i Rota Moabita: “Niteny tamiko koa izy hoe: ‘Mijanòna foana eny akaikin’ny mpanompoko, mandra-pahavitan’ny fijinjana ny vokatra rehetra etỳ amin’ny sahako.’”', 'dia hoy i rota moabita: “niteny tamiko koa izy hoe: ‘mijanòna foana eny akaikin’ny mpanompoko, mandra-pahavitan’ny fijinjana ny vokatra rehetra etỳ amin’ny sahako.’”'),
  ('6ab25a0f3817f681ab44434e', '2026-09-22T10:35:59.490Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:59.490Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Rota', 8, 2, 11, 'Dia hoy i Boaza: “Efa henoko daholo izay nataonao tamin’ny rafozambavinao taorian’ny nahafatesan’ny vadinao. Henoko koa hoe nandao ny rainao sy ny reninao sy ny tany misy ny havanao ianao, dia nankatỳ amin’ny firenena mbola tsy fantatrao akory.', 'dia hoy i boaza: “efa henoko daholo izay nataonao tamin’ny rafozambavinao taorian’ny nahafatesan’ny vadinao. henoko koa hoe nandao ny rainao sy ny reninao sy ny tany misy ny havanao ianao, dia nankatỳ amin’ny firenena mbola tsy fantatrao akory.'),
  ('6ab25a0f3817f681ab44434a', '2026-09-22T10:35:59.490Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:59.490Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Rota', 8, 2, 7, 'Nangataka tamiko izy hoe: ‘Izaho ve mba afaka mitsimpona sy manangona salohim-bary eny anelanelan’ny amboara navelan’ny mpijinja?’ Dia tsy nipetraka mihitsy izy hatramin’ny nahatongavany tamin’ny maraina. Fa izao izy vao mba mipetraka maka aina kely eo amin’io tranokely fialokalofana io.”', 'nangataka tamiko izy hoe: ‘izaho ve mba afaka mitsimpona sy manangona salohim-bary eny anelanelan’ny amboara navelan’ny mpijinja?’ dia tsy nipetraka mihitsy izy hatramin’ny nahatongavany tamin’ny maraina. fa izao izy vao mba mipetraka maka aina kely eo amin’io tranokely fialokalofana io.”'),
  ('6ab25a0f3817f681ab44434b', '2026-09-22T10:35:59.490Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:59.490Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Rota', 8, 2, 8, 'Hoy i Boaza tamin’i Rota: “Izao, anaka: Aza mitsimpona any amin’ny sahan’olon-kafa na mankany an-toeran-kafa, fa miaraha foana amin’ny ankizivavy mpanompoko.', 'hoy i boaza tamin’i rota: “izao, anaka: aza mitsimpona any amin’ny sahan’olon-kafa na mankany an-toeran-kafa, fa miaraha foana amin’ny ankizivavy mpanompoko.'),
  ('6ab25a0f3817f681ab444357', '2026-09-22T10:35:59.490Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:59.490Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Rota', 8, 2, 20, 'Dia hoy i Naomy tamin’ny vinantovaviny: “Hitahy azy anie i Jehovah, ilay maneho fitiavana amin’ny velona sy ny maty!” Hoy koa i Naomy: “Havantsika iny lehilahy iny, ary anisan’ny mpanavotra antsika.”', 'dia hoy i naomy tamin’ny vinantovaviny: “hitahy azy anie i jehovah, ilay maneho fitiavana amin’ny velona sy ny maty!” hoy koa i naomy: “havantsika iny lehilahy iny, ary anisan’ny mpanavotra antsika.”'),
  ('6ab25a0f3817f681ab444354', '2026-09-22T10:35:59.490Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:59.490Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Rota', 8, 2, 17, 'Nitsimpona an’izay navelan’ny mpijinja teny an-tsaha àry i Rota, mandra-paharivan’ny andro. Nahazo vary orza iray efaha teo ho eo izy, rehefa avy nively an’izay notsimponiny.', 'nitsimpona an’izay navelan’ny mpijinja teny an-tsaha àry i rota, mandra-paharivan’ny andro. nahazo vary orza iray efaha teo ho eo izy, rehefa avy nively an’izay notsimponiny.'),
  ('6ab25a0f3817f681ab444356', '2026-09-22T10:35:59.490Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:59.490Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Rota', 8, 2, 19, 'Ary hoy ny rafozambaviny: “Taiza ianao no nitsimpona androany? Taiza ianao no niasa? Hotahina anie izay niantra anao!” Dia notenenin’i Rota taminy hoe tany amin’iza izy no niasa. Hoy izy: “Tany amin’ilay lehilahy atao hoe Boaza aho no niasa androany.”', 'ary hoy ny rafozambaviny: “taiza ianao no nitsimpona androany? taiza ianao no niasa? hotahina anie izay niantra anao!” dia notenenin’i rota taminy hoe tany amin’iza izy no niasa. hoy izy: “tany amin’ilay lehilahy atao hoe boaza aho no niasa androany.”'),
  ('6ab25a0f3817f681ab444349', '2026-09-22T10:35:59.490Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:59.490Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Rota', 8, 2, 6, 'Dia hoy ilay lehilahy: “Moabita niaraka tamin’i Naomy avy tany amin’ny faritr’i Moaba io.', 'dia hoy ilay lehilahy: “moabita niaraka tamin’i naomy avy tany amin’ny faritr’i moaba io.'),
  ('6ab25a0f3817f681ab444345', '2026-09-22T10:35:59.490Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:59.490Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Rota', 8, 2, 2, 'Hoy i Rota Moabita tamin’i Naomy: “Aleo aho mba ho any an-tsaha hitsimpona ny salohim-bary avelan’izay olona miantra ahy.” Dia hoy i Naomy: “Mandehana, anaka!”', 'hoy i rota moabita tamin’i naomy: “aleo aho mba ho any an-tsaha hitsimpona ny salohim-bary avelan’izay olona miantra ahy.” dia hoy i naomy: “mandehana, anaka!”'),
  ('6ab25a0f3817f681ab444344', '2026-09-22T10:35:59.490Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:59.490Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Rota', 8, 2, 1, 'Ary nisy lehilahy havam-badin’i Naomy nanan-karena be. Boaza no anarany, ary fianakavian’i Elimeleka izy.', 'ary nisy lehilahy havam-badin’i naomy nanan-karena be. boaza no anarany, ary fianakavian’i elimeleka izy.'),
  ('6ab25a0f3817f681ab444351', '2026-09-22T10:35:59.490Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:59.490Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Rota', 8, 2, 14, 'Tamin’ny fotoanan’ny sakafo, dia hoy i Boaza taminy: “Avia hihinana mofo, ary atsobohy ao anaty vinaingitra ny mofonao.” Dia nipetraka teo akaikin’ny mpijinja i Rota. Nomen’i Boaza voam-bary natono izy avy eo, dia nihinana ka voky. Tsy laniny daholo anefa ilay izy.', 'tamin’ny fotoanan’ny sakafo, dia hoy i boaza taminy: “avia hihinana mofo, ary atsobohy ao anaty vinaingitra ny mofonao.” dia nipetraka teo akaikin’ny mpijinja i rota. nomen’i boaza voam-bary natono izy avy eo, dia nihinana ka voky. tsy laniny daholo anefa ilay izy.'),
  ('6ab25a0f3817f681ab444353', '2026-09-22T10:35:59.490Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:59.490Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Rota', 8, 2, 16, 'Sintony hiala amin’ny amboara koa ny salohim-bary sasany dia avelao eny hotsimponiny, fa aza bedesina izy.”', 'sintony hiala amin’ny amboara koa ny salohim-bary sasany dia avelao eny hotsimponiny, fa aza bedesina izy.”'),
  ('6ab25a0f3817f681ab44435a', '2026-09-22T10:35:59.490Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:59.490Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Rota', 8, 2, 23, 'Dia nitsimpona teny akaikin’ny ankizivavy mpanompon’i Boaza i Rota, mandra-pahatapitry ny fijinjana vary orza sy varimbazaha. Ary niara-nipetraka tamin’ny rafozambaviny foana izy.', 'dia nitsimpona teny akaikin’ny ankizivavy mpanompon’i boaza i rota, mandra-pahatapitry ny fijinjana vary orza sy varimbazaha. ary niara-nipetraka tamin’ny rafozambaviny foana izy.'),
  ('6ab25a0f3817f681ab44434f', '2026-09-22T10:35:59.490Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:59.490Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Rota', 8, 2, 12, 'Enga anie hamaly soa anao i Jehovah noho izay nataonao! Ary hahazo valisoa lehibe avy amin’i Jehovah Andriamanitry ny Israely anie ianao, satria tonga hialoka eo ambany elany!”', 'enga anie hamaly soa anao i jehovah noho izay nataonao! ary hahazo valisoa lehibe avy amin’i jehovah andriamanitry ny israely anie ianao, satria tonga hialoka eo ambany elany!”'),
  ('6ab25a0f3817f681ab444350', '2026-09-22T10:35:59.490Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:59.490Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Rota', 8, 2, 13, 'Dia hoy i Rota: “Enga anie ho tsara fanahy foana amiko ianao, tompoko! Ianao mantsy efa nankahery sy nanome toky ahy, na dia tsy anisan’ny mpanomponao aza aho.”', 'dia hoy i rota: “enga anie ho tsara fanahy foana amiko ianao, tompoko! ianao mantsy efa nankahery sy nanome toky ahy, na dia tsy anisan’ny mpanomponao aza aho.”'),
  ('6ab25a0f3817f681ab44434d', '2026-09-22T10:35:59.490Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:59.490Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Rota', 8, 2, 10, 'Dia niankohoka tamin’ny tany i Rota, sady niteny taminy hoe: “Fa maninona ianao no tsara fanahy amiko sy miantra ahy, nefa izaho hafa firenena?”', 'dia niankohoka tamin’ny tany i rota, sady niteny taminy hoe: “fa maninona ianao no tsara fanahy amiko sy miantra ahy, nefa izaho hafa firenena?”'),
  ('6ab25a0f3817f681ab444346', '2026-09-22T10:35:59.490Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:59.490Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Rota', 8, 2, 3, 'Dia lasa tany an-tsaha izy, ka nitsimpona an’izay navelan’ny mpijinja. Ary sendra tonga teo amin’ny tanin’i Boaza havan’i Elimeleka izy.', 'dia lasa tany an-tsaha izy, ka nitsimpona an’izay navelan’ny mpijinja. ary sendra tonga teo amin’ny tanin’i boaza havan’i elimeleka izy.'),
  ('6ab25a0f591cfddc3f27e83b', '2026-09-22T10:35:59.970Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:59.970Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Rota', 8, 3, 3, 'Mandehana mandro ary hosory menaka manitra ny vatanao. Dia anaovy izay akanjonao tsara indrindra ary midìna eny am-pamoloana. Aza atao hitany ianao raha tsy efa avy mihinana sy misotro izy.', 'mandehana mandro ary hosory menaka manitra ny vatanao. dia anaovy izay akanjonao tsara indrindra ary midìna eny am-pamoloana. aza atao hitany ianao raha tsy efa avy mihinana sy misotro izy.'),
  ('6ab25a0f591cfddc3f27e839', '2026-09-22T10:35:59.970Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:59.970Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Rota', 8, 3, 1, 'Ary hoy i Naomy rafozambaviny taminy: “Sao dia tokony hitady vady ho anao aho, anaka, amin’izay mba mety tsara ny fiainanao?', 'ary hoy i naomy rafozambaviny taminy: “sao dia tokony hitady vady ho anao aho, anaka, amin’izay mba mety tsara ny fiainanao?'),
  ('6ab25a0f591cfddc3f27e83c', '2026-09-22T10:35:59.970Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:59.970Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Rota', 8, 3, 4, 'Rehefa hatory izy, dia jereo hoe aiza izy no hatory, ary mankanesa eny. Ingao ny lamba mandrakotra ny tongony, dia matoria eo. Izy no hiteny aminao izay tokony hataonao.”', 'rehefa hatory izy, dia jereo hoe aiza izy no hatory, ary mankanesa eny. ingao ny lamba mandrakotra ny tongony, dia matoria eo. izy no hiteny aminao izay tokony hataonao.”'),
  ('6ab25a0f591cfddc3f27e846', '2026-09-22T10:35:59.970Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:59.970Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Rota', 8, 3, 14, 'Dia natory teo an-tongony i Rota mandra-paharainan’ny andro. Ary nifoha izy raha mbola maizimaizina, amin’ilay mbola tsy ahafantarana olona iny. Dia hoy i Boaza: “Aza atao fantatr’olona hoe nisy vehivavy tonga teto am-pamoloana.”', 'dia natory teo an-tongony i rota mandra-paharainan’ny andro. ary nifoha izy raha mbola maizimaizina, amin’ilay mbola tsy ahafantarana olona iny. dia hoy i boaza: “aza atao fantatr’olona hoe nisy vehivavy tonga teto am-pamoloana.”'),
  ('6ab25a0f591cfddc3f27e844', '2026-09-22T10:35:59.970Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:59.970Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Rota', 8, 3, 12, 'Marina aloha fa mpanavotra aho, nefa mbola misy havana akaiky kokoa noho izaho afaka manavotra anao.', 'marina aloha fa mpanavotra aho, nefa mbola misy havana akaiky kokoa noho izaho afaka manavotra anao.'),
  ('6ab25a0f591cfddc3f27e84a', '2026-09-22T10:35:59.970Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:59.970Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Rota', 8, 3, 18, 'Dia hoy i Naomy: “Mipetraha amin’izay, anaka, mandra-pahafantatrao an’izay hitranga. Tsy hipetrapetraka mihitsy mantsy izy androany raha tsy efa milamina ny zava-drehetra.”', 'dia hoy i naomy: “mipetraha amin’izay, anaka, mandra-pahafantatrao an’izay hitranga. tsy hipetrapetraka mihitsy mantsy izy androany raha tsy efa milamina ny zava-drehetra.”'),
  ('6ab25a0f591cfddc3f27e847', '2026-09-22T10:35:59.970Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:59.970Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Rota', 8, 3, 15, 'Hoy koa izy: “Ento atỳ iny akanjonao ivelany iny ary velaro.” Dia novelarin’i Rota ilay izy. Koa namatra vary orza inenin’ny famarana i Boaza, dia nataony tao anatin’ilay akanjo ary nampitondrainy azy. Lasa nankany an-tanàna i Boaza taorian’izay.', 'hoy koa izy: “ento atỳ iny akanjonao ivelany iny ary velaro.” dia novelarin’i rota ilay izy. koa namatra vary orza inenin’ny famarana i boaza, dia nataony tao anatin’ilay akanjo ary nampitondrainy azy. lasa nankany an-tanàna i boaza taorian’izay.'),
  ('6ab25a0f591cfddc3f27e845', '2026-09-22T10:35:59.970Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:59.970Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Rota', 8, 3, 13, 'Mijanòna eto androany alina. Raha hanavotra anao izy rehefa maraina ny andro, dia tsara izany! Aleo izy no hanavotra anao. Raha tsy te hanavotra anao kosa izy, dia izaho no hanavotra anao, raha mbola velona koa i Jehovah. Fa matoria eto ihany aloha mandra-paharainan’ny andro.”', 'mijanòna eto androany alina. raha hanavotra anao izy rehefa maraina ny andro, dia tsara izany! aleo izy no hanavotra anao. raha tsy te hanavotra anao kosa izy, dia izaho no hanavotra anao, raha mbola velona koa i jehovah. fa matoria eto ihany aloha mandra-paharainan’ny andro.”'),
  ('6ab25a0f591cfddc3f27e849', '2026-09-22T10:35:59.970Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:59.970Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Rota', 8, 3, 17, 'Hoy koa izy: “Nomeny an’ireto vary orza inenin’ny famarana ireto aho sady niteny izy hoe: ‘Aza mitondra tanam-polo any amin’ny rafozambavinao.’”', 'hoy koa izy: “nomeny an’ireto vary orza inenin’ny famarana ireto aho sady niteny izy hoe: ‘aza mitondra tanam-polo any amin’ny rafozambavinao.’”'),
  ('6ab25a0f591cfddc3f27e848', '2026-09-22T10:35:59.970Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:59.970Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Rota', 8, 3, 16, 'I Rota kosa lasa nody. Rehefa tonga tany an-trano izy, dia hoy ny rafozambaviny: “Nanao ahoana ny tany, anaka?” Dia nolazain’i Rota azy daholo izay nataon’i Boaza taminy.', 'i rota kosa lasa nody. rehefa tonga tany an-trano izy, dia hoy ny rafozambaviny: “nanao ahoana ny tany, anaka?” dia nolazain’i rota azy daholo izay nataon’i boaza taminy.'),
  ('6ab25a0f591cfddc3f27e840', '2026-09-22T10:35:59.970Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:59.970Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Rota', 8, 3, 8, 'Nangovitra anefa i Boaza rehefa nisasaka ny alina. Niarina àry izy ka nipetraka, ary nahita vehivavy natory teo an-tongony.', 'nangovitra anefa i boaza rehefa nisasaka ny alina. niarina àry izy ka nipetraka, ary nahita vehivavy natory teo an-tongony.'),
  ('6ab25a0f591cfddc3f27e841', '2026-09-22T10:35:59.970Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:59.970Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Rota', 8, 3, 9, 'Dia hoy izy: “Fa iza ianao?” Hoy i Rota: “I Rota mpanomponao ihany ity! Mba rakofy amin’ny akanjonao ny mpanomponao, satria mpanavotra ianao.”', 'dia hoy izy: “fa iza ianao?” hoy i rota: “i rota mpanomponao ihany ity! mba rakofy amin’ny akanjonao ny mpanomponao, satria mpanavotra ianao.”'),
  ('6ab25a0f591cfddc3f27e83e', '2026-09-22T10:35:59.970Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:59.970Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Rota', 8, 3, 6, 'Nidina teny am-pamoloana àry izy, ka nataony daholo izay nasain’ny rafozambaviny nataony.', 'nidina teny am-pamoloana àry izy, ka nataony daholo izay nasain’ny rafozambaviny nataony.'),
  ('6ab25a0f591cfddc3f27e83a', '2026-09-22T10:35:59.970Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:59.970Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Rota', 8, 3, 2, 'Havantsika ange i Boaza e! Izy ilay namela anao hiara-miasa amin’ny ankizivavy mpanompony. Hikororoka vary orza eny am-pamoloana izy androany alina.', 'havantsika ange i boaza e! izy ilay namela anao hiara-miasa amin’ny ankizivavy mpanompony. hikororoka vary orza eny am-pamoloana izy androany alina.'),
  ('6ab25a0f591cfddc3f27e843', '2026-09-22T10:35:59.970Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:59.970Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Rota', 8, 3, 11, 'Aza matahotra, anaka, fa hataoko aminao daholo izay lazainao. Fantatry ny iray tanàna mantsy fa vehivavy tena miavaka ianao.', 'aza matahotra, anaka, fa hataoko aminao daholo izay lazainao. fantatry ny iray tanàna mantsy fa vehivavy tena miavaka ianao.'),
  ('6ab25a0f591cfddc3f27e842', '2026-09-22T10:35:59.970Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:59.970Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Rota', 8, 3, 10, 'Dia hoy i Boaza: “Hotahin’i Jehovah anie ianao, anaka! Efa nasehonao hoe be fitiavana sy tsy mivadika ianao, fa vao mainka hita izany izao. Tsy niaraka tamin’ny ankizilahy mantsy ianao, na mahantra izy na manankarena.', 'dia hoy i boaza: “hotahin’i jehovah anie ianao, anaka! efa nasehonao hoe be fitiavana sy tsy mivadika ianao, fa vao mainka hita izany izao. tsy niaraka tamin’ny ankizilahy mantsy ianao, na mahantra izy na manankarena.'),
  ('6ab25a0f591cfddc3f27e83f', '2026-09-22T10:35:59.970Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:59.970Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Rota', 8, 3, 7, 'Nihinana sy nisotro i Boaza tamin’izay ka falifaly. Dia nandeha natory teny akaikin’ny antontam-bary izy. Ary nitsaitsaika i Rota, ka ningainy ny lamba nandrakotra ny tongotr’i Boaza, dia natory teo izy.', 'nihinana sy nisotro i boaza tamin’izay ka falifaly. dia nandeha natory teny akaikin’ny antontam-bary izy. ary nitsaitsaika i rota, ka ningainy ny lamba nandrakotra ny tongotr’i boaza, dia natory teo izy.'),
  ('6ab25a0f591cfddc3f27e83d', '2026-09-22T10:35:59.970Z', '2026-09-22T10:35:59.970Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Rota', 8, 3, 5, 'Dia hoy i Rota: “Ao fa hataoko daholo izany zavatra lazainao izany.”', 'dia hoy i rota: “ao fa hataoko daholo izany zavatra lazainao izany.”'),
  ('6ab25a105088711b2c76fbd2', '2026-09-22T10:36:00.645Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:00.645Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Rota', 8, 4, 18, 'Ireto avy ny taranak’i Pereza: I Pereza niteraka an’i Hezrona;', 'ireto avy ny taranak’i pereza: i pereza niteraka an’i hezrona;'),
  ('6ab25a105088711b2c76fbce', '2026-09-22T10:36:00.645Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:00.645Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Rota', 8, 4, 14, 'Dia hoy ireo vehivavy tamin’i Naomy: “Hoderaina anie i Jehovah fa nomeny mpanavotra ianao! Hambara eo amin’ny Israely anie ny anarany!', 'dia hoy ireo vehivavy tamin’i naomy: “hoderaina anie i jehovah fa nomeny mpanavotra ianao! hambara eo amin’ny israely anie ny anarany!'),
  ('6ab25a105088711b2c76fbc4', '2026-09-22T10:36:00.645Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:00.645Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Rota', 8, 4, 4, 'Nieritreritra aho hoe tokony hampahafantatra an’izany aminao, sady hiteny hoe: ‘Vidio eto anatrehan’ny mpiara-monina amintsika sy ny anti-panahy eto amin’ny firenentsika ilay izy. Raha hanavotra an’ilay izy ianao dia avoty, fa raha tsy hanavotra kosa dia mba ilazao aho. Tsy misy olon-kafa tokony hanavotra azy io afa-tsy ianao mantsy, ary izaho no manarakaraka anao.’” Dia hoy ilay rangahy: “Hay, vonona aho.”', 'nieritreritra aho hoe tokony hampahafantatra an’izany aminao, sady hiteny hoe: ‘vidio eto anatrehan’ny mpiara-monina amintsika sy ny anti-panahy eto amin’ny firenentsika ilay izy. raha hanavotra an’ilay izy ianao dia avoty, fa raha tsy hanavotra kosa dia mba ilazao aho. tsy misy olon-kafa tokony hanavotra azy io afa-tsy ianao mantsy, ary izaho no manarakaraka anao.’” dia hoy ilay rangahy: “hay, vonona aho.”'),
  ('6ab25a105088711b2c76fbd0', '2026-09-22T10:36:00.645Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:00.645Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Rota', 8, 4, 16, 'Dia noraisin’i Naomy ilay zaza ka nofihininy teo an-tratrany, ary izy no nikarakara azy.', 'dia noraisin’i naomy ilay zaza ka nofihininy teo an-tratrany, ary izy no nikarakara azy.'),
  ('6ab25a105088711b2c76fbc8', '2026-09-22T10:36:00.645Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:00.645Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Rota', 8, 4, 8, 'Nanala ny kapany àry ilay mpanavotra sady niteny tamin’i Boaza hoe: “Vidio ho anao ilay izy.”', 'nanala ny kapany àry ilay mpanavotra sady niteny tamin’i boaza hoe: “vidio ho anao ilay izy.”'),
  ('6ab25a105088711b2c76fbc6', '2026-09-22T10:36:00.645Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:00.645Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Rota', 8, 4, 6, 'Dia hoy ilay mpanavotra: “Tsy afaka manavotra aho raha izany, sao izaho indray no ho voa mafy. Omeko anao ny zoko hanavotra ka avoty ho anao ilay izy, fa izaho tsy afaka manao an’izany.”', 'dia hoy ilay mpanavotra: “tsy afaka manavotra aho raha izany, sao izaho indray no ho voa mafy. omeko anao ny zoko hanavotra ka avoty ho anao ilay izy, fa izaho tsy afaka manao an’izany.”'),
  ('6ab25a105088711b2c76fbc2', '2026-09-22T10:36:00.645Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:00.645Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Rota', 8, 4, 2, 'Niantso anti-panahy folo tao an-tanàna i Boaza avy eo, ka niteny tamin’izy ireo hoe: “Mipetrapetraha eto!” Dia nipetraka izy ireo.', 'niantso anti-panahy folo tao an-tanàna i boaza avy eo, ka niteny tamin’izy ireo hoe: “mipetrapetraha eto!” dia nipetraka izy ireo.'),
  ('6ab25a105088711b2c76fbca', '2026-09-22T10:36:00.645Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:00.645Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Rota', 8, 4, 10, 'Halaiko ho vady koa i Rota Moabita vadin’i Malona, mba tsy ho very anarana ny maty sady tsy ho very lova. Amin’izay dia tsy hanadino ny anaran’ny maty ny rahalahiny sy izay eo amin’ny vavahadin’ny tanànany. Ianareo no vavolombelon’izany androany.”', 'halaiko ho vady koa i rota moabita vadin’i malona, mba tsy ho very anarana ny maty sady tsy ho very lova. amin’izay dia tsy hanadino ny anaran’ny maty ny rahalahiny sy izay eo amin’ny vavahadin’ny tanànany. ianareo no vavolombelon’izany androany.”'),
  ('6ab25a105088711b2c76fbc7', '2026-09-22T10:36:00.645Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:00.645Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Rota', 8, 4, 7, 'Izao no fanaon’ny Israelita taloha, mba hanan-kery izay fifanarahana nataon’izy ireo momba ny zo hanavotra sy ny takalo: Tsy maintsy nanala ny kapany ny lehilahy iray, ka nanome an’izany ho an’ny andaniny. Izany no fomba nanamafisana fifanarahana tany Israely.', 'izao no fanaon’ny israelita taloha, mba hanan-kery izay fifanarahana nataon’izy ireo momba ny zo hanavotra sy ny takalo: tsy maintsy nanala ny kapany ny lehilahy iray, ka nanome an’izany ho an’ny andaniny. izany no fomba nanamafisana fifanarahana tany israely.'),
  ('6ab25a105088711b2c76fbd5', '2026-09-22T10:36:00.645Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:00.645Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Rota', 8, 4, 21, 'Salmona niteraka an’i Boaza; Boaza niteraka an’i Obeda;', 'salmona niteraka an’i boaza; boaza niteraka an’i obeda;'),
  ('6ab25a105088711b2c76fbd1', '2026-09-22T10:36:00.645Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:00.645Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Rota', 8, 4, 17, 'Ary nanome anarana an’ilay zaza ireo vehivavy mpiara-monina taminy, sady niteny hoe: “Zazalahy no teraka ho an’i Naomy.” Dia nataon’izy ireo hoe Obeda ny anarany. Izy no rain’i Jese, rain’i Davida.', 'ary nanome anarana an’ilay zaza ireo vehivavy mpiara-monina taminy, sady niteny hoe: “zazalahy no teraka ho an’i naomy.” dia nataon’izy ireo hoe obeda ny anarany. izy no rain’i jese, rain’i davida.'),
  ('6ab25a105088711b2c76fbcd', '2026-09-22T10:36:00.645Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:00.645Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Rota', 8, 4, 13, 'Nalain’i Boaza ho vadiny àry i Rota, ary nanao firaisana taminy izy. Dia notahin’i Jehovah i Rota ka bevohoka ary tera-dahy.', 'nalain’i boaza ho vadiny àry i rota, ary nanao firaisana taminy izy. dia notahin’i jehovah i rota ka bevohoka ary tera-dahy.'),
  ('6ab25a105088711b2c76fbc9', '2026-09-22T10:36:00.645Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:00.645Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Rota', 8, 4, 9, 'Dia hoy i Boaza tamin’ny anti-panahy sy ny olona rehetra teo: “Ianareo no vavolombelona androany, fa hovidiko amin’i Naomy daholo izay an’i Elimeleka sy izay an’i Kiliona sy Malona.', 'dia hoy i boaza tamin’ny anti-panahy sy ny olona rehetra teo: “ianareo no vavolombelona androany, fa hovidiko amin’i naomy daholo izay an’i elimeleka sy izay an’i kiliona sy malona.'),
  ('6ab25a105088711b2c76fbc5', '2026-09-22T10:36:00.645Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:00.645Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Rota', 8, 4, 5, 'Ary hoy i Boaza: “Amin’ny fotoana hividiananao an’ilay saha amin’i Naomy, dia tsy maintsy mividy an’ilay izy amin’i Rota Moabita vadin’ny maty koa ianao. Amin’izay mba tsy ho very anarana ny maty sady tsy ho very lova.”', 'ary hoy i boaza: “amin’ny fotoana hividiananao an’ilay saha amin’i naomy, dia tsy maintsy mividy an’ilay izy amin’i rota moabita vadin’ny maty koa ianao. amin’izay mba tsy ho very anarana ny maty sady tsy ho very lova.”'),
  ('6ab25a105088711b2c76fbc3', '2026-09-22T10:36:00.645Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:00.645Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Rota', 8, 4, 3, 'Ary hoy i Boaza tamin’ilay mpanavotra: “Nody avy tany amin’ny faritr’i Moaba i Naomy, dia tsy maintsy hamidiny ny anjara tanin’i Elimeleka rahalahintsika.', 'ary hoy i boaza tamin’ilay mpanavotra: “nody avy tany amin’ny faritr’i moaba i naomy, dia tsy maintsy hamidiny ny anjara tanin’i elimeleka rahalahintsika.'),
  ('6ab25a105088711b2c76fbd3', '2026-09-22T10:36:00.645Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:00.645Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Rota', 8, 4, 19, 'Hezrona niteraka an’i Rama; Rama niteraka an’i Aminadaba;', 'hezrona niteraka an’i rama; rama niteraka an’i aminadaba;'),
  ('6ab25a105088711b2c76fbd6', '2026-09-22T10:36:00.645Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:00.645Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Rota', 8, 4, 22, 'Obeda niteraka an’i Jese; ary Jese niteraka an’i Davida.', 'obeda niteraka an’i jese; ary jese niteraka an’i davida.'),
  ('6ab25a105088711b2c76fbc1', '2026-09-22T10:36:00.645Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:00.645Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Rota', 8, 4, 1, 'Ary niakatra nankany am-bavahadin’ny tanàna i Boaza, ka nipetraka teo. Dia iny fa nandalo ilay mpanavotra nolazainy, ka hoy izy taminy: “Avia, ry Ingahy, mba hipetrapetraka eto a!” Dia nanatona ilay rangahy ary nipetraka.', 'ary niakatra nankany am-bavahadin’ny tanàna i boaza, ka nipetraka teo. dia iny fa nandalo ilay mpanavotra nolazainy, ka hoy izy taminy: “avia, ry ingahy, mba hipetrapetraka eto a!” dia nanatona ilay rangahy ary nipetraka.'),
  ('6ab25a105088711b2c76fbcb', '2026-09-22T10:36:00.645Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:00.645Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Rota', 8, 4, 11, 'Dia hoy ny olona rehetra teo am-bavahadin’ny tanàna sy ny anti-panahy: “Izahay no vavolombelona! Hotahin’i Jehovah anie ilay vehivavy ho vadinao ka ho lasa hoatran’i Rahely sy Lea, izay samy niavian’ny taranak’Israely! Enga anie ka handeha tsara ny fiainanao eto Efrata, ary halaza ny anaranao eto Betlehema!', 'dia hoy ny olona rehetra teo am-bavahadin’ny tanàna sy ny anti-panahy: “izahay no vavolombelona! hotahin’i jehovah anie ilay vehivavy ho vadinao ka ho lasa hoatran’i rahely sy lea, izay samy niavian’ny taranak’israely! enga anie ka handeha tsara ny fiainanao eto efrata, ary halaza ny anaranao eto betlehema!'),
  ('6ab25a105088711b2c76fbcf', '2026-09-22T10:36:00.645Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:00.645Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Rota', 8, 4, 15, 'Nampihiratra indray ny fiainanao izy, ary hikarakara anao amin’izao ianao efa antitra izao. Ilay vinantonao tena tia anao, izay tsara kokoa aminao noho ny zanaka fito lahy, mantsy no niteraka azy.”', 'nampihiratra indray ny fiainanao izy, ary hikarakara anao amin’izao ianao efa antitra izao. ilay vinantonao tena tia anao, izay tsara kokoa aminao noho ny zanaka fito lahy, mantsy no niteraka azy.”'),
  ('6ab25a105088711b2c76fbcc', '2026-09-22T10:36:00.645Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:00.645Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Rota', 8, 4, 12, 'Enga anie ny taranaka homen’i Jehovah anao avy amin’io vehivavy io ka ho tahaka ny taranak’i Pereza, izay naterak’i Tamara tamin’i Joda!”', 'enga anie ny taranaka homen’i jehovah anao avy amin’io vehivavy io ka ho tahaka ny taranak’i pereza, izay naterak’i tamara tamin’i joda!”'),
  ('6ab25a105088711b2c76fbd4', '2026-09-22T10:36:00.645Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:00.645Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Rota', 8, 4, 20, 'Aminadaba niteraka an’i Nasona; Nasona niteraka an’i Salmona;', 'aminadaba niteraka an’i nasona; nasona niteraka an’i salmona;'),
  ('6ab25a11dadc05c4f7caf36c', '2026-09-22T10:36:01.680Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:01.680Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 1, 24, 'Raha vao nosarahi-nono ilay zaza, dia nentiny niara-niakatra taminy, niaraka tamin’ny ombilahy telo taona sy lafarinina iray efaha * ary divay eran’ny siny lehibe. Koa nankao an-tranon’i Jehovah tao Silo izy, niaraka tamin’ilay zaza.', 'raha vao nosarahi-nono ilay zaza, dia nentiny niara-niakatra taminy, niaraka tamin’ny ombilahy telo taona sy lafarinina iray efaha * ary divay eran’ny siny lehibe. koa nankao an-tranon’i jehovah tao silo izy, niaraka tamin’ilay zaza.'),
  ('6ab25a11dadc05c4f7caf370', '2026-09-22T10:36:01.680Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:01.680Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 1, 28, 'Koa ampindramiko an’i Jehovah kosa izy izao. Omena an’i Jehovah izy mandritra ny androm-piainany.” Dia niankohoka teo anatrehan’i Jehovah teo i Elkana.', 'koa ampindramiko an’i jehovah kosa izy izao. omena an’i jehovah izy mandritra ny androm-piainany.” dia niankohoka teo anatrehan’i jehovah teo i elkana.'),
  ('6ab25a11dadc05c4f7caf36a', '2026-09-22T10:36:01.680Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:01.680Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 1, 22, 'I Hana kosa tsy niakatra, fa hoy izy tamin’ny vadiny: “Raha vao misara-nono ny zaza, dia hoentiko hiseho eo anatrehan’i Jehovah, ary hipetraka any mandritra ny fotoana tsy voafetra izy.”', 'i hana kosa tsy niakatra, fa hoy izy tamin’ny vadiny: “raha vao misara-nono ny zaza, dia hoentiko hiseho eo anatrehan’i jehovah, ary hipetraka any mandritra ny fotoana tsy voafetra izy.”'),
  ('6ab25a11dadc05c4f7caf367', '2026-09-22T10:36:01.680Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:01.680Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 1, 19, 'Dia nifoha maraina izy ireo, ka niankohoka teo anatrehan’i Jehovah vao nandeha nody, ary tonga tany an-tranony tany Rama. Ary nanao firaisana tamin’i Hana vadiny i Elkana. Koa nahatsiaro an’i Hana i Jehovah.', 'dia nifoha maraina izy ireo, ka niankohoka teo anatrehan’i jehovah vao nandeha nody, ary tonga tany an-tranony tany rama. ary nanao firaisana tamin’i hana vadiny i elkana. koa nahatsiaro an’i hana i jehovah.'),
  ('6ab25a11dadc05c4f7caf365', '2026-09-22T10:36:01.680Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:01.680Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 1, 17, 'Dia hoy ny navalin’i Ely: “Mirary soa ho anao àry aho! Homen’ny Andriamanitry ny Israely anao anie izay nangatahinao taminy!”', 'dia hoy ny navalin’i ely: “mirary soa ho anao àry aho! homen’ny andriamanitry ny israely anao anie izay nangatahinao taminy!”'),
  ('6ab25a11dadc05c4f7caf35b', '2026-09-22T10:36:01.680Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:01.680Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 1, 7, 'Toy izany no nataon’ilay rafiny isan-taona, isaky ny niakatra nankany an-tranon’i Jehovah izy ireo. Nanorisory azy toy izany ilay rafiny, ka nitomany sy tsy nahahinan-kanina i Hana.', 'toy izany no nataon’ilay rafiny isan-taona, isaky ny niakatra nankany an-tranon’i jehovah izy ireo. nanorisory azy toy izany ilay rafiny, ka nitomany sy tsy nahahinan-kanina i hana.'),
  ('6ab25a11dadc05c4f7caf36d', '2026-09-22T10:36:01.680Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:01.680Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 1, 25, 'Dia novonoina ilay omby, ary nentina teo amin’i Ely ilay zaza.', 'dia novonoina ilay omby, ary nentina teo amin’i ely ilay zaza.'),
  ('6ab25a11dadc05c4f7caf35e', '2026-09-22T10:36:01.680Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:01.680Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 1, 10, 'Ory dia ory i Hana, ka nivavaka tamin’i Jehovah tamin-dranomaso be.', 'ory dia ory i hana, ka nivavaka tamin’i jehovah tamin-dranomaso be.'),
  ('6ab25a11dadc05c4f7caf36e', '2026-09-22T10:36:01.680Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:01.680Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 1, 26, 'Ary hoy i Hana: “Azafady tompoko! Mianiana aminao aho, tompoko, fa izaho ilay vehivavy nijoro teo anilanao teto amin’ity toerana ity, mba hivavaka tamin’i Jehovah.', 'ary hoy i hana: “azafady tompoko! mianiana aminao aho, tompoko, fa izaho ilay vehivavy nijoro teo anilanao teto amin’ity toerana ity, mba hivavaka tamin’i jehovah.'),
  ('6ab25a11dadc05c4f7caf360', '2026-09-22T10:36:01.680Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:01.680Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 1, 12, 'Raha mbola naharitra nivavaka teo anatrehan’i Jehovah izy, dia nodinihin’i Ely ny vavany.', 'raha mbola naharitra nivavaka teo anatrehan’i jehovah izy, dia nodinihin’i ely ny vavany.'),
  ('6ab25a11dadc05c4f7caf36b', '2026-09-22T10:36:01.680Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:01.680Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 1, 23, 'Dia hoy i Elkana vadiny: “Ataovy izay hitanao fa mety. Mijanòna ato an-trano mandra-pahatongan’ny fotoana hampisarahanao nono azy. Hanatanteraka ny teniny anie i Jehovah!” Koa nijanona tao an-trano ravehivavy ary nampinono an’ilay zanany, mandra-pahatongan’ny fotoana nampisarahany nono azy.', 'dia hoy i elkana vadiny: “ataovy izay hitanao fa mety. mijanòna ato an-trano mandra-pahatongan’ny fotoana hampisarahanao nono azy. hanatanteraka ny teniny anie i jehovah!” koa nijanona tao an-trano ravehivavy ary nampinono an’ilay zanany, mandra-pahatongan’ny fotoana nampisarahany nono azy.'),
  ('6ab25a11dadc05c4f7caf366', '2026-09-22T10:36:01.680Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:01.680Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 1, 18, 'Koa hoy ravehivavy: “Aoka hahazo sitraka aminao ny mpanompovavinao.” Dia lasa nandeha tamin’ny nalehany izy ka nihinan-kanina. Ary hita tamin’ny endriny fa tsy niady saina intsony izy.', 'koa hoy ravehivavy: “aoka hahazo sitraka aminao ny mpanompovavinao.” dia lasa nandeha tamin’ny nalehany izy ka nihinan-kanina. ary hita tamin’ny endriny fa tsy niady saina intsony izy.'),
  ('6ab25a11dadc05c4f7caf364', '2026-09-22T10:36:01.680Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:01.680Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 1, 16, 'Aza heverina ho vehivavy tsy manjary re ny mpanompovavinao e! Fa matoa aho mbola miteny, dia satria be ny adin-tsaiko sy ny fahoriako.”', 'aza heverina ho vehivavy tsy manjary re ny mpanompovavinao e! fa matoa aho mbola miteny, dia satria be ny adin-tsaiko sy ny fahoriako.”'),
  ('6ab25a11dadc05c4f7caf359', '2026-09-22T10:36:01.680Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:01.680Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 1, 5, 'fa anjara iray kosa no nomeny an’i Hana. Na izany aza dia i Hana no tiany kokoa, saingy nohidian’i Jehovah ny kibon’i Hana.', 'fa anjara iray kosa no nomeny an’i hana. na izany aza dia i hana no tiany kokoa, saingy nohidian’i jehovah ny kibon’i hana.'),
  ('6ab25a11dadc05c4f7caf363', '2026-09-22T10:36:01.680Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:01.680Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 1, 15, 'Fa hoy ny navalin’i Hana: “Tsy izany mihitsy, tompoko, fa vehivavy ory dia ory aho! Tsy nisotro divay na toaka aho, fa mamboraka ny ato am-poko eo anatrehan’i Jehovah.', 'fa hoy ny navalin’i hana: “tsy izany mihitsy, tompoko, fa vehivavy ory dia ory aho! tsy nisotro divay na toaka aho, fa mamboraka ny ato am-poko eo anatrehan’i jehovah.'),
  ('6ab25a11dadc05c4f7caf35f', '2026-09-22T10:36:01.680Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:01.680Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 1, 11, 'Koa nivoady izy hoe: “Ry Jehovah Tompon’ny tafika ô, raha mba jerenao tokoa ny fahorian’ny mpanompovavinao ka tsarovanao aho, ary tsy hadinoinao ny mpanompovavinao ka omenao zanakalahy, dia homeko an’i Jehovah izy mandritra ny androm-piainany ary tsy hokasihin-kareza ny lohany!”', 'koa nivoady izy hoe: “ry jehovah tompon’ny tafika ô, raha mba jerenao tokoa ny fahorian’ny mpanompovavinao ka tsarovanao aho, ary tsy hadinoinao ny mpanompovavinao ka omenao zanakalahy, dia homeko an’i jehovah izy mandritra ny androm-piainany ary tsy hokasihin-kareza ny lohany!”'),
  ('6ab25a11dadc05c4f7caf35d', '2026-09-22T10:36:01.680Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:01.680Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 1, 9, 'Ary nitsangana i Hana rehefa avy nihinana sy nisotro tao Silo izy ireo. Tamin’izay i Ely mpisorona dia nipetraka teo amin’ilay seza teo akaikin’ny tolàm-baravaran’ny tempolin’i Jehovah.', 'ary nitsangana i hana rehefa avy nihinana sy nisotro tao silo izy ireo. tamin’izay i ely mpisorona dia nipetraka teo amin’ilay seza teo akaikin’ny tolàm-baravaran’ny tempolin’i jehovah.'),
  ('6ab25a11dadc05c4f7caf368', '2026-09-22T10:36:01.680Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:01.680Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 1, 20, 'Ary rehefa afaka herintaona teo ho eo, dia bevohoka i Hana ka tera-dahy, ary nataony hoe Samoela ny anarany, fa hoy izy: “Tamin’i Jehovah no nangatahako azy.”', 'ary rehefa afaka herintaona teo ho eo, dia bevohoka i hana ka tera-dahy, ary nataony hoe samoela ny anarany, fa hoy izy: “tamin’i jehovah no nangatahako azy.”'),
  ('6ab25a11dadc05c4f7caf35c', '2026-09-22T10:36:01.680Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:01.680Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 1, 8, 'Dia hoy i Elkana vadiny: “Fa maninona ianao, ry Hana, no mitomany sy tsy mihinan-kanina? Ary nahoana no malahelo ny fonao? Tsy tsara kokoa aminao noho ny zanaka folo mirahalahy ve aho?”', 'dia hoy i elkana vadiny: “fa maninona ianao, ry hana, no mitomany sy tsy mihinan-kanina? ary nahoana no malahelo ny fonao? tsy tsara kokoa aminao noho ny zanaka folo mirahalahy ve aho?”'),
  ('6ab25a11dadc05c4f7caf369', '2026-09-22T10:36:01.680Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:01.680Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 1, 21, 'Tatỳ aoriana, dia niakatra niaraka tamin’ny ankohonany manontolo i Elkana, mba hanao sorona ho an’i Jehovah, dia ny sorona fanao isan-taona sy ny fanatitra fanefana voady.', 'tatỳ aoriana, dia niakatra niaraka tamin’ny ankohonany manontolo i elkana, mba hanao sorona ho an’i jehovah, dia ny sorona fanao isan-taona sy ny fanatitra fanefana voady.'),
  ('6ab25a11dadc05c4f7caf362', '2026-09-22T10:36:01.680Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:01.680Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 1, 14, 'Dia hoy i Ely taminy: “Mandra-pahoviana ianao no mbola ho mamo? Ataovy aloha izay hampisava ny divay nosotroinao.”', 'dia hoy i ely taminy: “mandra-pahoviana ianao no mbola ho mamo? ataovy aloha izay hampisava ny divay nosotroinao.”'),
  ('6ab25a11dadc05c4f7caf35a', '2026-09-22T10:36:01.680Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:01.680Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 1, 6, 'Nanorisory azy mafy koa ny rafivaviny, mba hahamenatra azy noho i Jehovah nanidy ny kibony.', 'nanorisory azy mafy koa ny rafivaviny, mba hahamenatra azy noho i jehovah nanidy ny kibony.'),
  ('6ab25a11dadc05c4f7caf357', '2026-09-22T10:36:01.680Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:01.680Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 1, 3, 'Ary niakatra avy tao an-tanànany isan-taona ralehilahy mba hiankohoka sy hanao sorona ho an’i Jehovah Tompon’ny tafika, tao Silo. Mpisoron’i Jehovah tao ny zanak’i Ely roa lahy, dia i Hofinia sy Finehasa.', 'ary niakatra avy tao an-tanànany isan-taona ralehilahy mba hiankohoka sy hanao sorona ho an’i jehovah tompon’ny tafika, tao silo. mpisoron’i jehovah tao ny zanak’i ely roa lahy, dia i hofinia sy finehasa.'),
  ('6ab25a11dadc05c4f7caf361', '2026-09-22T10:36:01.680Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:01.680Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 1, 13, 'Niteny anakampo fotsiny anefa i Hana, ka ny molony ihany no nihetsiketsika, ary tsy re ny feony. Koa noheverin’i Ely fa mamo izy.', 'niteny anakampo fotsiny anefa i hana, ka ny molony ihany no nihetsiketsika, ary tsy re ny feony. koa noheverin’i ely fa mamo izy.'),
  ('6ab25a11dadc05c4f7caf358', '2026-09-22T10:36:01.680Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:01.680Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 1, 4, 'Ary tamin’ny andro nanaovan’i Elkana sorona, dia nomeny anjara maromaro i Penina vadiny mbamin’ny zanak’io rehetra, na lahy na vavy,', 'ary tamin’ny andro nanaovan’i elkana sorona, dia nomeny anjara maromaro i penina vadiny mbamin’ny zanak’io rehetra, na lahy na vavy,'),
  ('6ab25a11dadc05c4f7caf356', '2026-09-22T10:36:01.680Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:01.680Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 1, 2, 'Nanana vady roa izy: Hana no anaran’ny iray, ary Penina no anaran’ny iray. Nanan-janaka i Penina, fa i Hana kosa tsy mba nanana.', 'nanana vady roa izy: hana no anaran’ny iray, ary penina no anaran’ny iray. nanan-janaka i penina, fa i hana kosa tsy mba nanana.'),
  ('6ab25a11dadc05c4f7caf36f', '2026-09-22T10:36:01.680Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:01.680Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 1, 27, 'Momba ity zazalahy ity no nivavahako tamin’i Jehovah, mba hanomezany ahy izay nangatahiko taminy.', 'momba ity zazalahy ity no nivavahako tamin’i jehovah, mba hanomezany ahy izay nangatahiko taminy.'),
  ('6ab25a11dadc05c4f7caf355', '2026-09-22T10:36:01.680Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:01.680Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 1, 1, 'Ary nisy lehilahy efraimita iray atao hoe Elkana, tao Ramataima-zofima any amin’ny faritra be tendrombohitr’i Efraima. Izy dia zanak’i Jerohama, zanak’i Eliho, zanak’i Toho, zanak’i Zofa.', 'ary nisy lehilahy efraimita iray atao hoe elkana, tao ramataima-zofima any amin’ny faritra be tendrombohitr’i efraima. izy dia zanak’i jerohama, zanak’i eliho, zanak’i toho, zanak’i zofa.'),
  ('6ab25a12de55a8c31d65d50c', '2026-09-22T10:36:02.166Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:02.166Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 2, 3, 'Aza manao teny an’avona loatra ianareo, Aoka tsy hisy teny tsy voahevitra haloaky ny vavanareo, Fa Andriamanitry ny fahalalana i Jehovah, Ary izay atao dia tombanany ara-drariny.', 'aza manao teny an’avona loatra ianareo, aoka tsy hisy teny tsy voahevitra haloaky ny vavanareo, fa andriamanitry ny fahalalana i jehovah, ary izay atao dia tombanany ara-drariny.'),
  ('6ab25a12de55a8c31d65d50b', '2026-09-22T10:36:02.166Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:02.166Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 2, 2, 'Tsy misy masina tahaka an’i Jehovah, satria tsy misy Andriamanitra ankoatra anao, Ary tsy misy vatolampy tahaka ny Andriamanitsika.', 'tsy misy masina tahaka an’i jehovah, satria tsy misy andriamanitra ankoatra anao, ary tsy misy vatolampy tahaka ny andriamanitsika.'),
  ('6ab25a12de55a8c31d65d50e', '2026-09-22T10:36:02.166Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:02.166Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 2, 5, 'Tsy maintsy mikarama mba hahazoana sakafo ireo voky, Fa ny noana kosa tsy noana intsony. Na ny vehivavy momba aza miteraka fito, Fa izay niteraka maro kosa tsy hanan-janaka intsony.', 'tsy maintsy mikarama mba hahazoana sakafo ireo voky, fa ny noana kosa tsy noana intsony. na ny vehivavy momba aza miteraka fito, fa izay niteraka maro kosa tsy hanan-janaka intsony.'),
  ('6ab25a12de55a8c31d65d50d', '2026-09-22T10:36:02.166Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:02.166Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 2, 4, 'Mihorohoro ny lehilahy mahay mandefa zana-tsipìka, Fa manjary mahery kosa ireo malemy.', 'mihorohoro ny lehilahy mahay mandefa zana-tsipìka, fa manjary mahery kosa ireo malemy.'),
  ('6ab25a12de55a8c31d65d50a', '2026-09-22T10:36:02.166Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:02.166Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 2, 1, 'Dia nivavaka i Hana ka nanao hoe: “Mifaly amin’i Jehovah ny foko, Ao amin’i Jehovah no isandratan’ny tandroko. * Misokatra ny vavako hamaly ny fahavaloko, Satria tena faly aho noho ny famonjena avy aminao.', 'dia nivavaka i hana ka nanao hoe: “mifaly amin’i jehovah ny foko, ao amin’i jehovah no isandratan’ny tandroko. * misokatra ny vavako hamaly ny fahavaloko, satria tena faly aho noho ny famonjena avy aminao.'),
  ('6ab25a12de55a8c31d65d520', '2026-09-22T10:36:02.167Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:02.167Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 2, 23, 'Koa hoy izy tamin’ireo zanany ireo: “Nahoana ianareo no manao toy izany foana? Ratsy ny zavatra reko tamin’ny olon-drehetra momba anareo.', 'koa hoy izy tamin’ireo zanany ireo: “nahoana ianareo no manao toy izany foana? ratsy ny zavatra reko tamin’ny olon-drehetra momba anareo.'),
  ('6ab25a12de55a8c31d65d519', '2026-09-22T10:36:02.167Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:02.167Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 2, 16, 'Ary raha niteny taminy ilay olona hoe: “Aleo aloha hodorana mba hidona-tsetroka ny tavin-kena, vao haka izay tianao ianao”, dia hoy izy: “Tsia! Fa omeo izao dia izao ilay izy. Raha tsy izany dia halaiko an-keriny!”', 'ary raha niteny taminy ilay olona hoe: “aleo aloha hodorana mba hidona-tsetroka ny tavin-kena, vao haka izay tianao ianao”, dia hoy izy: “tsia! fa omeo izao dia izao ilay izy. raha tsy izany dia halaiko an-keriny!”'),
  ('6ab25a12de55a8c31d65d517', '2026-09-22T10:36:02.167Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:02.167Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 2, 14, 'dia natsindron’izy ireo tao anaty vilany ilay fitrebika. Natsindrony tao anaty vilany fandrahoan-kena izany, na tao anaty vilany misy tahony roa na tao anaty vilanibe na vilany misy tahony, ka izay azon’ny fitrebika dia nalain’ny mpisorona ho azy. Izany no nataon’izy ireo tao Silo, tamin’ny Israelita rehetra tonga tany.', 'dia natsindron’izy ireo tao anaty vilany ilay fitrebika. natsindrony tao anaty vilany fandrahoan-kena izany, na tao anaty vilany misy tahony roa na tao anaty vilanibe na vilany misy tahony, ka izay azon’ny fitrebika dia nalain’ny mpisorona ho azy. izany no nataon’izy ireo tao silo, tamin’ny israelita rehetra tonga tany.'),
  ('6ab25a12de55a8c31d65d529', '2026-09-22T10:36:02.167Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:02.167Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 2, 32, 'Fahavalo no ho hitanao ao an-tranoko, na dia eo aza ny soa rehetra atao amin’ny Israely. Ary tsy hisy lehilahy ho tratrantitra mihitsy ao amin’ny ankohonanao.', 'fahavalo no ho hitanao ao an-tranoko, na dia eo aza ny soa rehetra atao amin’ny israely. ary tsy hisy lehilahy ho tratrantitra mihitsy ao amin’ny ankohonanao.'),
  ('6ab25a12de55a8c31d65d528', '2026-09-22T10:36:02.167Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:02.167Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 2, 31, 'Ho avy ny andro hanesorako ny herinao sy ny herin’ny ankohonan’ny razambenao, ka tsy hisy lehilahy ho tratrantitra ao amin’ny ankohonanao.', 'ho avy ny andro hanesorako ny herinao sy ny herin’ny ankohonan’ny razambenao, ka tsy hisy lehilahy ho tratrantitra ao amin’ny ankohonanao.'),
  ('6ab25a12de55a8c31d65d51e', '2026-09-22T10:36:02.167Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:02.167Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 2, 21, 'Dia nitsinjo an’i Hana tokoa i Jehovah, ka nanana anaka izy ary niteraka telo lahy sy roa vavy. Ary nihalehibe teo anatrehan’i Jehovah i Samoela zaza.', 'dia nitsinjo an’i hana tokoa i jehovah, ka nanana anaka izy ary niteraka telo lahy sy roa vavy. ary nihalehibe teo anatrehan’i jehovah i samoela zaza.'),
  ('6ab25a12de55a8c31d65d51a', '2026-09-22T10:36:02.167Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:02.167Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 2, 17, 'Ary lehibe indrindra teo anatrehan’i Jehovah ny fahotan’ireo mpanompo ireo, satria nanao tsinontsinona ny fanatitra ho an’i Jehovah ireo lehilahy ireo.', 'ary lehibe indrindra teo anatrehan’i jehovah ny fahotan’ireo mpanompo ireo, satria nanao tsinontsinona ny fanatitra ho an’i jehovah ireo lehilahy ireo.'),
  ('6ab25a12de55a8c31d65d518', '2026-09-22T10:36:02.167Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:02.167Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 2, 15, 'Ary raha mbola tsy nodorana mba hidona-tsetroka ny tavin-kena, dia efa nisy mpanompon’ny mpisorona tonga ka niteny toy izao tamin’ny olona nanao sorona: “Omeo hena hatsatsika ny mpisorona, mba ho hena manta no azony avy aminao, fa tsy hena nandrahoina.”', 'ary raha mbola tsy nodorana mba hidona-tsetroka ny tavin-kena, dia efa nisy mpanompon’ny mpisorona tonga ka niteny toy izao tamin’ny olona nanao sorona: “omeo hena hatsatsika ny mpisorona, mba ho hena manta no azony avy aminao, fa tsy hena nandrahoina.”'),
  ('6ab25a12de55a8c31d65d51c', '2026-09-22T10:36:02.167Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:02.167Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 2, 19, 'Nanjairan-dreniny akanjo kely tsy misy tanany koa izy isan-taona. Ary nitondra izany tany amin’i Samoela ny reniny, rehefa niara-niakatra tamin’ny vadiny mba hanolotra ny sorona fanao isan-taona.', 'nanjairan-dreniny akanjo kely tsy misy tanany koa izy isan-taona. ary nitondra izany tany amin’i samoela ny reniny, rehefa niara-niakatra tamin’ny vadiny mba hanolotra ny sorona fanao isan-taona.'),
  ('6ab25a12de55a8c31d65d516', '2026-09-22T10:36:02.167Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:02.167Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 2, 13, 'Koa izao no nataon’izy ireo tamin’ireo anjara tokony ho azon’ny mpisorona avy tamin’ny vahoaka: Rehefa nisy nanolotra sorona, dia tonga ny mpanompon’ny mpisorona nitondra fitrebika telo rantsana. Koa raha vao nangotraka ny hena,', 'koa izao no nataon’izy ireo tamin’ireo anjara tokony ho azon’ny mpisorona avy tamin’ny vahoaka: rehefa nisy nanolotra sorona, dia tonga ny mpanompon’ny mpisorona nitondra fitrebika telo rantsana. koa raha vao nangotraka ny hena,'),
  ('6ab25a12de55a8c31d65d50f', '2026-09-22T10:36:02.167Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:02.167Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 2, 6, 'I Jehovah no mamono sy mitsimbina ny aina, Izy no mampidina any amin’ny Fasana, * sy mampiakatra avy any.', 'i jehovah no mamono sy mitsimbina ny aina, izy no mampidina any amin’ny fasana, * sy mampiakatra avy any.'),
  ('6ab25a12de55a8c31d65d525', '2026-09-22T10:36:02.167Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:02.167Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 2, 28, 'Ny ankohonan’ny razambenao koa no nofidina ho ahy teo amin’ny foko rehetran’ny Israely, mba hanao ny asan’ny mpisorona sy hiakatra eo amin’ny alitarako ka hampiakatra ny setroky ny sorona, ary koa hanao efoda eo anatrehako, mba hanomezako azy ny fanatitra rehetra atao anaty afo izay atolotry ny zanak’Israely.', 'ny ankohonan’ny razambenao koa no nofidina ho ahy teo amin’ny foko rehetran’ny israely, mba hanao ny asan’ny mpisorona sy hiakatra eo amin’ny alitarako ka hampiakatra ny setroky ny sorona, ary koa hanao efoda eo anatrehako, mba hanomezako azy ny fanatitra rehetra atao anaty afo izay atolotry ny zanak’israely.'),
  ('6ab25a12de55a8c31d65d527', '2026-09-22T10:36:02.167Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:02.167Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 2, 30, '“‘Koa izao no lazain’i Jehovah Andriamanitry ny Israely: “Efa niteny tokoa aho hoe: Handeha eo anatrehako mandritra ny fotoana tsy voafetra ny ankohonanao sy ny ankohonan’ny razambenao.” Fa izao kosa no tenin’i Jehovah ankehitriny: “Sanatria ahy izany! Fa izay manome voninahitra ahy no homeko voninahitra, ary izay maniratsira ahy kosa hatao tsinontsinona.”', '“‘koa izao no lazain’i jehovah andriamanitry ny israely: “efa niteny tokoa aho hoe: handeha eo anatrehako mandritra ny fotoana tsy voafetra ny ankohonanao sy ny ankohonan’ny razambenao.” fa izao kosa no tenin’i jehovah ankehitriny: “sanatria ahy izany! fa izay manome voninahitra ahy no homeko voninahitra, ary izay maniratsira ahy kosa hatao tsinontsinona.”'),
  ('6ab25a12de55a8c31d65d515', '2026-09-22T10:36:02.167Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:02.167Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 2, 12, 'Ary ny zanakalahin’i Ely dia olona tsy manjary, sady tsy niraharaha an’i Jehovah.', 'ary ny zanakalahin’i ely dia olona tsy manjary, sady tsy niraharaha an’i jehovah.'),
  ('6ab25a12de55a8c31d65d52a', '2026-09-22T10:36:02.167Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:02.167Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 2, 33, 'Hisy ihany lehilahy taranakao havelako hanompo eo amin’ny alitarako, ka ho reraka ny masonao ary hihaosa ny vatanao. Hovonoin’ny olona amin’ny sabatra anefa ny ankamaroan’izay ao amin’ny ankohonanao.', 'hisy ihany lehilahy taranakao havelako hanompo eo amin’ny alitarako, ka ho reraka ny masonao ary hihaosa ny vatanao. hovonoin’ny olona amin’ny sabatra anefa ny ankamaroan’izay ao amin’ny ankohonanao.'),
  ('6ab25a12de55a8c31d65d511', '2026-09-22T10:36:02.167Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:02.167Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 2, 8, 'Izy no manangana ny olona ambany hiala amin’ny vovoka, Ary avy ao amin’ny lavaka misy lavenona no ampiakarany ny mahantra, Mba hametrahany azy miaraka amin’ny olona ambony. Ary seza fiandrianana be voninahitra no omeny azy ireo ho fananany. Fa an’i Jehovah ny fototry ny tany, Ary apetrany eo ambonin’izany ny tany lonaka.', 'izy no manangana ny olona ambany hiala amin’ny vovoka, ary avy ao amin’ny lavaka misy lavenona no ampiakarany ny mahantra, mba hametrahany azy miaraka amin’ny olona ambony. ary seza fiandrianana be voninahitra no omeny azy ireo ho fananany. fa an’i jehovah ny fototry ny tany, ary apetrany eo ambonin’izany ny tany lonaka.'),
  ('6ab25a12de55a8c31d65d52d', '2026-09-22T10:36:02.167Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:02.167Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 2, 36, 'Ary izay sisa tavela amin’ny ankohonanao dia ho avy hiankohoka eo anatrehany mba hahazoana vola sy mofo boribory. Dia hiteny izy ireo hoe: “Ampanaovy asan’ny mpisorona re aho, mba hihinanako sombi-mofo e!”’”', 'ary izay sisa tavela amin’ny ankohonanao dia ho avy hiankohoka eo anatrehany mba hahazoana vola sy mofo boribory. dia hiteny izy ireo hoe: “ampanaovy asan’ny mpisorona re aho, mba hihinanako sombi-mofo e!”’”'),
  ('6ab25a12de55a8c31d65d51d', '2026-09-22T10:36:02.167Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:02.167Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 2, 20, 'Dia nitso-drano an’i Elkana sy ny vadiny i Ely, ka nanao hoe: “Homen’i Jehovah zanaka avy amin’ity vehivavy ity anie ianao, ho solon’ilay zavatra nampindramina, izay nampindramina an’i Jehovah!” Ary lasa nody izy ireo.', 'dia nitso-drano an’i elkana sy ny vadiny i ely, ka nanao hoe: “homen’i jehovah zanaka avy amin’ity vehivavy ity anie ianao, ho solon’ilay zavatra nampindramina, izay nampindramina an’i jehovah!” ary lasa nody izy ireo.'),
  ('6ab25a12de55a8c31d65d526', '2026-09-22T10:36:02.167Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:02.167Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 2, 29, 'Koa nahoana ianareo no dia manitsakitsaka foana ny sorona sy ny fanatitra izay nandidiako hatolotra ho ahy ao an-tranoko? Nahoana ianao no manome voninahitra foana ny zanakao mihoatra noho izaho, ka ny tsara indrindra amin’izay fanatitry ny Israely oloko no hanatavezanareo ny tenanareo?', 'koa nahoana ianareo no dia manitsakitsaka foana ny sorona sy ny fanatitra izay nandidiako hatolotra ho ahy ao an-tranoko? nahoana ianao no manome voninahitra foana ny zanakao mihoatra noho izaho, ka ny tsara indrindra amin’izay fanatitry ny israely oloko no hanatavezanareo ny tenanareo?'),
  ('6ab25a12de55a8c31d65d523', '2026-09-22T10:36:02.167Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:02.167Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 2, 26, 'Nihalehibe ihany i Samoela nandritra izany fotoana izany, sady vao mainka nahatehotia teo imason’i Jehovah sy teo imason’ny olona.', 'nihalehibe ihany i samoela nandritra izany fotoana izany, sady vao mainka nahatehotia teo imason’i jehovah sy teo imason’ny olona.'),
  ('6ab25a12de55a8c31d65d521', '2026-09-22T10:36:02.167Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:02.167Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 2, 24, 'Tsy tsara mihitsy, anaka, ny tatitra reko aelin’ny olon’i Jehovah.', 'tsy tsara mihitsy, anaka, ny tatitra reko aelin’ny olon’i jehovah.'),
  ('6ab25a12de55a8c31d65d524', '2026-09-22T10:36:02.167Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:02.167Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 2, 27, 'Dia nisy lehilahin’Andriamanitra tonga tany amin’i Ely, ka niteny hoe: “Izao no nolazain’i Jehovah: ‘Tsy efa nampahafantatra ny tenako tamin’ny ankohonan’ny razambenao ve aho, fony izy ireo andevon’ny ankohonan’i Farao tany Ejipta?', 'dia nisy lehilahin’andriamanitra tonga tany amin’i ely, ka niteny hoe: “izao no nolazain’i jehovah: ‘tsy efa nampahafantatra ny tenako tamin’ny ankohonan’ny razambenao ve aho, fony izy ireo andevon’ny ankohonan’i farao tany ejipta?'),
  ('6ab25a12de55a8c31d65d512', '2026-09-22T10:36:02.167Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:02.167Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 2, 9, 'Ambenany ny tongotry ny olona tsy mivadika aminy, Fa ny ratsy fanahy kosa ampanginina ao anatin’ny haizina, Satria tsy amin’ny herin’ny tenany no andresen’ny olona.', 'ambenany ny tongotry ny olona tsy mivadika aminy, fa ny ratsy fanahy kosa ampanginina ao anatin’ny haizina, satria tsy amin’ny herin’ny tenany no andresen’ny olona.'),
  ('6ab25a12de55a8c31d65d52c', '2026-09-22T10:36:02.167Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:02.167Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 2, 35, 'Ary hanendry mpisorona mendri-pitokisana ho an’ny tenako aho. Koa mifanaraka amin’izay ao am-poko sy ao an-tsaiko * no hataony. Dia hataoko tokoa izay hananany taranaka maharitra, ary ho mpisorona mandrakariva ho an’ny voahosotro izy.', 'ary hanendry mpisorona mendri-pitokisana ho an’ny tenako aho. koa mifanaraka amin’izay ao am-poko sy ao an-tsaiko * no hataony. dia hataoko tokoa izay hananany taranaka maharitra, ary ho mpisorona mandrakariva ho an’ny voahosotro izy.'),
  ('6ab25a12de55a8c31d65d522', '2026-09-22T10:36:02.167Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:02.167Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 2, 25, 'Raha misy manota amin’olona, dia Andriamanitra no hitsara hiaro azy. Fa raha amin’i Jehovah kosa ny olona iray no manota, iza no hivavaka ho azy?” Tsy nihaino ny tenin-drainy anefa izy ireo, satria efa sitrak’i Jehovah ny hamono azy ireo ho faty.', 'raha misy manota amin’olona, dia andriamanitra no hitsara hiaro azy. fa raha amin’i jehovah kosa ny olona iray no manota, iza no hivavaka ho azy?” tsy nihaino ny tenin-drainy anefa izy ireo, satria efa sitrak’i jehovah ny hamono azy ireo ho faty.'),
  ('6ab25a12de55a8c31d65d52b', '2026-09-22T10:36:02.167Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:02.167Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 2, 34, 'Koa ho famantarana ho anao izao hanjo an’i Hofinia sy Finehasa zanakao roa lahy izao: Andro iray ihany no hahafatesan’izy roa lahy.', 'koa ho famantarana ho anao izao hanjo an’i hofinia sy finehasa zanakao roa lahy izao: andro iray ihany no hahafatesan’izy roa lahy.'),
  ('6ab25a12de55a8c31d65d514', '2026-09-22T10:36:02.167Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:02.167Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 2, 11, 'Dia nandeha nody tany an-tranony tany Rama i Elkana, ary ilay zaza kosa lasa mpanompon’i Jehovah teo anatrehan’i Ely mpisorona.', 'dia nandeha nody tany an-tranony tany rama i elkana, ary ilay zaza kosa lasa mpanompon’i jehovah teo anatrehan’i ely mpisorona.'),
  ('6ab25a12de55a8c31d65d51f', '2026-09-22T10:36:02.167Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:02.167Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 2, 22, 'Efa antitra be i Ely, ary reny ny zava-drehetra fanaon’ny zanany tamin’ny Israely rehetra, sy ny nanaovan’izy ireo firaisana tamin’ireo vehivavy nanompo teo amin’ny fidirana amin’ny tranolay fihaonana.', 'efa antitra be i ely, ary reny ny zava-drehetra fanaon’ny zanany tamin’ny israely rehetra, sy ny nanaovan’izy ireo firaisana tamin’ireo vehivavy nanompo teo amin’ny fidirana amin’ny tranolay fihaonana.'),
  ('6ab25a12de55a8c31d65d510', '2026-09-22T10:36:02.167Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:02.167Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 2, 7, 'I Jehovah no mampahantra sy mampanan-karena, Izy no mampietry sy manandratra.', 'i jehovah no mampahantra sy mampanan-karena, izy no mampietry sy manandratra.'),
  ('6ab25a12de55a8c31d65d51b', '2026-09-22T10:36:02.167Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:02.167Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 2, 18, 'I Samoela kosa nanompo teo anatrehan’i Jehovah. Mbola zaza izy tamin’izay, ary nanao efoda rongony izay nisy fehikibo nafatotra taminy.', 'i samoela kosa nanompo teo anatrehan’i jehovah. mbola zaza izy tamin’izay, ary nanao efoda rongony izay nisy fehikibo nafatotra taminy.'),
  ('6ab25a12de55a8c31d65d513', '2026-09-22T10:36:02.167Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:02.167Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 2, 10, 'Raha ny amin’i Jehovah, dia hihorohoro izay miady aminy. Ary izy hampirefotra kotroka avy any an-danitra mba hamelezana an’ireny. I Jehovah mihitsy no hitsara ny tany manontolo, Mba hanomezany hery ny mpanjakany, Sy mba hanandratany ny tandroky ny voahosony.”', 'raha ny amin’i jehovah, dia hihorohoro izay miady aminy. ary izy hampirefotra kotroka avy any an-danitra mba hamelezana an’ireny. i jehovah mihitsy no hitsara ny tany manontolo, mba hanomezany hery ny mpanjakany, sy mba hanandratany ny tandroky ny voahosony.”'),
  ('6ab25a12669406114281b25b', '2026-09-22T10:36:02.728Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:02.728Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 3, 5, 'Dia nihazakazaka nankao amin’i Ely izy ka niteny hoe: “Intỳ aho, fa niantso ahy ianao.” Fa hoy i Ely: “Tsy niantso aho, fa miverena matory.” Koa lasa natory izy.', 'dia nihazakazaka nankao amin’i ely izy ka niteny hoe: “intỳ aho, fa niantso ahy ianao.” fa hoy i ely: “tsy niantso aho, fa miverena matory.” koa lasa natory izy.'),
  ('6ab25a12669406114281b258', '2026-09-22T10:36:02.728Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:02.728Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 3, 2, 'Tamin’izay andro izay i Ely dia natory tao amin’izay nisy azy, ary efa pahina ny masony ka tsy nahita izy.', 'tamin’izay andro izay i ely dia natory tao amin’izay nisy azy, ary efa pahina ny masony ka tsy nahita izy.'),
  ('6ab25a12669406114281b25c', '2026-09-22T10:36:02.728Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:02.728Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 3, 6, 'Niantso indray anefa i Jehovah hoe: “Samoela!” Dia nitsangana i Samoela ka nankao amin’i Ely, ary niteny hoe: “Intỳ aho, fa tena niantso ahy ianao.” Fa hoy i Ely: “Tsy niantso anao aho, anaka, fa miverena matory.”', 'niantso indray anefa i jehovah hoe: “samoela!” dia nitsangana i samoela ka nankao amin’i ely, ary niteny hoe: “intỳ aho, fa tena niantso ahy ianao.” fa hoy i ely: “tsy niantso anao aho, anaka, fa miverena matory.”'),
  ('6ab25a12669406114281b25a', '2026-09-22T10:36:02.728Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:02.728Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 3, 4, 'Ary nantsoin’i Jehovah i Samoela, ka namaly hoe: “Intỳ aho.”', 'ary nantsoin’i jehovah i samoela, ka namaly hoe: “intỳ aho.”'),
  ('6ab25a12669406114281b257', '2026-09-22T10:36:02.728Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:02.728Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 3, 1, 'Nanompo an’i Jehovah teo anatrehan’i Ely i Samoela zaza, nandritra izany fotoana izany. Ary nahalana ny teny avy tamin’i Jehovah tamin’izany andro izany, sady tsy dia nisy firy ny fahitana.', 'nanompo an’i jehovah teo anatrehan’i ely i samoela zaza, nandritra izany fotoana izany. ary nahalana ny teny avy tamin’i jehovah tamin’izany andro izany, sady tsy dia nisy firy ny fahitana.'),
  ('6ab25a12669406114281b259', '2026-09-22T10:36:02.728Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:02.728Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 3, 3, 'Mbola tsy novonoina ny jiron’Andriamanitra, ary i Samoela natory tao amin’ny tempolin’i Jehovah, izay nisy ny Vata masin’Andriamanitra.', 'mbola tsy novonoina ny jiron’andriamanitra, ary i samoela natory tao amin’ny tempolin’i jehovah, izay nisy ny vata masin’andriamanitra.'),
  ('6ab25a12669406114281b264', '2026-09-22T10:36:02.729Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:02.729Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 3, 14, 'Koa izany no nianianako tamin’ny ankohonan’i Ely hoe tsy ho afaka amin’izy ireo ny sazy vokatry ny fahadisoany, mandritra ny fotoana tsy voafetra, na dia misy sorona sy fanatitra atao aza.”', 'koa izany no nianianako tamin’ny ankohonan’i ely hoe tsy ho afaka amin’izy ireo ny sazy vokatry ny fahadisoany, mandritra ny fotoana tsy voafetra, na dia misy sorona sy fanatitra atao aza.”'),
  ('6ab25a12669406114281b25f', '2026-09-22T10:36:02.729Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:02.729Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 3, 9, 'Koa hoy i Ely tamin’i Samoela: “Mandehana matory, ka raha mbola miantso anao izy, dia lazao hoe: ‘Mitenena, Jehovah ô, fa mihaino ny mpanomponao.’” Koa lasa natory tao amin’izay nisy azy i Samoela.', 'koa hoy i ely tamin’i samoela: “mandehana matory, ka raha mbola miantso anao izy, dia lazao hoe: ‘mitenena, jehovah ô, fa mihaino ny mpanomponao.’” koa lasa natory tao amin’izay nisy azy i samoela.'),
  ('6ab25a12669406114281b269', '2026-09-22T10:36:02.729Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:02.729Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 3, 19, 'Dia nihalehibe i Samoela, ka nomba azy i Jehovah. Ary tsy nisy navelany ho raraka an-tany ny teniny rehetra.', 'dia nihalehibe i samoela, ka nomba azy i jehovah. ary tsy nisy navelany ho raraka an-tany ny teniny rehetra.'),
  ('6ab25a12669406114281b260', '2026-09-22T10:36:02.729Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:02.729Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 3, 10, 'Dia tonga i Jehovah ka nijoro teo, sady niantso indray hoe: “Samoela! Samoela!” Koa hoy i Samoela: “Mitenena fa mihaino ny mpanomponao.”', 'dia tonga i jehovah ka nijoro teo, sady niantso indray hoe: “samoela! samoela!” koa hoy i samoela: “mitenena fa mihaino ny mpanomponao.”'),
  ('6ab25a12669406114281b265', '2026-09-22T10:36:02.729Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:02.729Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 3, 15, 'Dia natory mandra-paharainan’ny andro i Samoela. Avy eo izy dia nanokatra ny varavaran’ny tranon’i Jehovah. Ary natahotra ny hilaza tamin’i Ely momba izay niseho i Samoela.', 'dia natory mandra-paharainan’ny andro i samoela. avy eo izy dia nanokatra ny varavaran’ny tranon’i jehovah. ary natahotra ny hilaza tamin’i ely momba izay niseho i samoela.'),
  ('6ab25a12669406114281b261', '2026-09-22T10:36:02.729Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:02.729Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 3, 11, 'Ary hoy i Jehovah taminy: “Hanao zavatra eo amin’ny Israely aho, ka izay mandre momba izany dia hangorintsina ny sofiny roa.', 'ary hoy i jehovah taminy: “hanao zavatra eo amin’ny israely aho, ka izay mandre momba izany dia hangorintsina ny sofiny roa.'),
  ('6ab25a12669406114281b26b', '2026-09-22T10:36:02.729Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:02.729Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 3, 21, 'Ary niseho tao Silo indray i Jehovah, satria efa nampahafantatra ny tenany tamin’i Samoela tao Silo i Jehovah, tamin’ny alalan’ny tenin’i Jehovah.', 'ary niseho tao silo indray i jehovah, satria efa nampahafantatra ny tenany tamin’i samoela tao silo i jehovah, tamin’ny alalan’ny tenin’i jehovah.'),
  ('6ab25a12669406114281b268', '2026-09-22T10:36:02.729Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:02.729Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 3, 18, 'Koa nolazain’i Samoela taminy ny zava-drehetra, fa tsy nisy nafeniny. Dia hoy i Ely: “Avy amin’i Jehovah izany! Aoka hataony izay hitany fa mety.”', 'koa nolazain’i samoela taminy ny zava-drehetra, fa tsy nisy nafeniny. dia hoy i ely: “avy amin’i jehovah izany! aoka hataony izay hitany fa mety.”'),
  ('6ab25a12669406114281b262', '2026-09-22T10:36:02.729Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:02.729Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 3, 12, 'Amin’izany andro izany no hotanterahiko amin’i Ely hatramin’ny voalohany ka hatramin’ny farany ny zava-drehetra nolazaiko momba ny ankohonany.', 'amin’izany andro izany no hotanterahiko amin’i ely hatramin’ny voalohany ka hatramin’ny farany ny zava-drehetra nolazaiko momba ny ankohonany.'),
  ('6ab25a12669406114281b266', '2026-09-22T10:36:02.729Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:02.729Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 3, 16, 'Niantso azy anefa i Ely hoe: “Ry Samoela zanako ô!” Dia hoy izy: “Intỳ aho.”', 'niantso azy anefa i ely hoe: “ry samoela zanako ô!” dia hoy izy: “intỳ aho.”'),
  ('6ab25a12669406114281b267', '2026-09-22T10:36:02.729Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:02.729Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 3, 17, 'Ary hoy i Ely: “Inona no nolazainy taminao? Aza afenina ahy, raha sitrakao. Hofaizin’Andriamanitra anie ianao, * ary mihoatra noho izany aza, raha misy afeninao ahy izay teny nolazainy taminao!”', 'ary hoy i ely: “inona no nolazainy taminao? aza afenina ahy, raha sitrakao. hofaizin’andriamanitra anie ianao, * ary mihoatra noho izany aza, raha misy afeninao ahy izay teny nolazainy taminao!”'),
  ('6ab25a12669406114281b263', '2026-09-22T10:36:02.729Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:02.729Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 3, 13, 'Dia lazao aminy fa hosaziko mandritra ny fotoana tsy voafetra ny ankohonany, noho ny fahadisoana efa fantany, satria manozona an’Andriamanitra ny zanany lahy nefa tsy noteneniny mafy.', 'dia lazao aminy fa hosaziko mandritra ny fotoana tsy voafetra ny ankohonany, noho ny fahadisoana efa fantany, satria manozona an’andriamanitra ny zanany lahy nefa tsy noteneniny mafy.'),
  ('6ab25a12669406114281b25d', '2026-09-22T10:36:02.729Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:02.729Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 3, 7, 'Mbola tsy nahalala tsara an’i Jehovah mantsy i Samoela, ary mbola tsy nampahafantarina azy ny tenin’i Jehovah.', 'mbola tsy nahalala tsara an’i jehovah mantsy i samoela, ary mbola tsy nampahafantarina azy ny tenin’i jehovah.'),
  ('6ab25a12669406114281b26a', '2026-09-22T10:36:02.729Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:02.729Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 3, 20, 'Koa nanjary fantatry ny Israely rehetra hatrany Dana ka hatrany Beri-sheba, fa nekena ho mpaminanin’i Jehovah i Samoela.', 'koa nanjary fantatry ny israely rehetra hatrany dana ka hatrany beri-sheba, fa nekena ho mpaminanin’i jehovah i samoela.'),
  ('6ab25a12669406114281b25e', '2026-09-22T10:36:02.729Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:02.729Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 3, 8, 'Koa niantso fanintelony i Jehovah hoe: “Samoela!” Dia nitsangana izy ka nankao amin’i Ely, ary niteny hoe: “Intỳ aho, fa niantso ahy mihitsy ianao.” Dia fantatr’i Ely fa i Jehovah no niantso an’ilay zazalahy.', 'koa niantso fanintelony i jehovah hoe: “samoela!” dia nitsangana izy ka nankao amin’i ely, ary niteny hoe: “intỳ aho, fa niantso ahy mihitsy ianao.” dia fantatr’i ely fa i jehovah no niantso an’ilay zazalahy.'),
  ('6ab25a1378064c9f4bb329c7', '2026-09-22T10:36:03.994Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:03.994Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 4, 4, 'Koa naniraka olona hankany Silo ny vahoaka, ka nentina avy any ny Vata misy ny fifanekena nataon’i Jehovah Tompon’ny tafika, ilay mipetraka eo amin’ny kerobima. Ary teo koa izy mirahalahy zanak’i Ely, dia i Hofinia sy Finehasa, niaraka tamin’ilay Vata misy ny fifanekena nataon’Andriamanitra.', 'koa naniraka olona hankany silo ny vahoaka, ka nentina avy any ny vata misy ny fifanekena nataon’i jehovah tompon’ny tafika, ilay mipetraka eo amin’ny kerobima. ary teo koa izy mirahalahy zanak’i ely, dia i hofinia sy finehasa, niaraka tamin’ilay vata misy ny fifanekena nataon’andriamanitra.'),
  ('6ab25a1378064c9f4bb329c8', '2026-09-22T10:36:03.994Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:03.994Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 4, 5, 'Raha vao tonga tao an-toby ilay Vata misy ny fifanekena nataon’i Jehovah, dia nihorakoraka mafy ny Israelita rehetra, ka nihovotrovotra mihitsy ny tany.', 'raha vao tonga tao an-toby ilay vata misy ny fifanekena nataon’i jehovah, dia nihorakoraka mafy ny israelita rehetra, ka nihovotrovotra mihitsy ny tany.'),
  ('6ab25a1378064c9f4bb329c9', '2026-09-22T10:36:03.994Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:03.994Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 4, 6, 'Ary ren’ny Filistinina ilay horakoraka ka hoy izy ireo: “Fa maninona no misy horakoraka be toy izany ao an-tobin’ny Hebreo?” Dia fantatr’izy ireo fa tonga tao ny Vata masin’i Jehovah.', 'ary ren’ny filistinina ilay horakoraka ka hoy izy ireo: “fa maninona no misy horakoraka be toy izany ao an-tobin’ny hebreo?” dia fantatr’izy ireo fa tonga tao ny vata masin’i jehovah.'),
  ('6ab25a1378064c9f4bb329c6', '2026-09-22T10:36:03.994Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:03.994Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 4, 3, 'Koa rehefa tonga tao an-toby ny olona, dia hoy ny anti-panahin’ny Israely: “Nahoana no nataon’i Jehovah resy teo anoloan’ny Filistinina isika androany? Andao halaintsika avy any Silo ny Vata misy ny fifanekena nataon’i Jehovah, mba ho eto amintsika ka hamonjy antsika eo am-pelatanan’ny fahavalontsika.”', 'koa rehefa tonga tao an-toby ny olona, dia hoy ny anti-panahin’ny israely: “nahoana no nataon’i jehovah resy teo anoloan’ny filistinina isika androany? andao halaintsika avy any silo ny vata misy ny fifanekena nataon’i jehovah, mba ho eto amintsika ka hamonjy antsika eo am-pelatanan’ny fahavalontsika.”'),
  ('6ab25a1378064c9f4bb329c5', '2026-09-22T10:36:03.994Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:03.994Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 4, 2, 'Ary samy naka ny toerany avy ny miaramilan’ny Filistinina, mba hifanandrina tamin’ny Israely. Ratsy anefa ny fandehan’ny ady ka resy ny Israely teo anoloan’ny Filistinina, izay nahafaty lehilahy tokony ho efatra arivo tao an’ady.', 'ary samy naka ny toerany avy ny miaramilan’ny filistinina, mba hifanandrina tamin’ny israely. ratsy anefa ny fandehan’ny ady ka resy ny israely teo anoloan’ny filistinina, izay nahafaty lehilahy tokony ho efatra arivo tao an’ady.'),
  ('6ab25a1378064c9f4bb329ca', '2026-09-22T10:36:03.994Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:03.994Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 4, 7, 'Koa natahotra ny Filistinina satria, araka ny filazany dia “tonga ao an-toby Andriamanitra!” Hoy koa izy ireo: “Hahita loza isika, fa mbola tsy nisy toy izao mihitsy hatramin’izay!', 'koa natahotra ny filistinina satria, araka ny filazany dia “tonga ao an-toby andriamanitra!” hoy koa izy ireo: “hahita loza isika, fa mbola tsy nisy toy izao mihitsy hatramin’izay!'),
  ('6ab25a1378064c9f4bb329c4', '2026-09-22T10:36:03.994Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:03.994Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 4, 1, 'Dia nampitain’i Samoela tamin’ny Israely rehetra foana ny tenin’Andriamanitra. Ary nivoaka hiady tamin’ny Filistinina ny Israely, ka nitoby teo akaikin’i Ebenezera. Ny Filistinina kosa nitoby tao Afeka.', 'dia nampitain’i samoela tamin’ny israely rehetra foana ny tenin’andriamanitra. ary nivoaka hiady tamin’ny filistinina ny israely, ka nitoby teo akaikin’i ebenezera. ny filistinina kosa nitoby tao afeka.'),
  ('6ab25a1378064c9f4bb329d1', '2026-09-22T10:36:03.995Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:03.995Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 4, 14, 'Dia henon’i Ely ilay fidradradradrana, ka hoy izy: “Fa inona izany tabataba izany?” Koa nandeha haingana nankeo amin’i Ely ilay lehilahy, ka nilaza ilay vaovao taminy.', 'dia henon’i ely ilay fidradradradrana, ka hoy izy: “fa inona izany tabataba izany?” koa nandeha haingana nankeo amin’i ely ilay lehilahy, ka nilaza ilay vaovao taminy.'),
  ('6ab25a1378064c9f4bb329d9', '2026-09-22T10:36:03.995Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:03.995Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 4, 22, 'Koa hoy izy: “Niala tamin’ny Israely ho any an-tsesitany ny voninahitra, fa lasa babo ny Vata masin’Andriamanitra.”', 'koa hoy izy: “niala tamin’ny israely ho any an-tsesitany ny voninahitra, fa lasa babo ny vata masin’andriamanitra.”'),
  ('6ab25a1378064c9f4bb329d7', '2026-09-22T10:36:03.995Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:03.995Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 4, 20, 'Ary rehefa ho faty izy, dia hoy ireo vehivavy nijoro teo akaikiny: “Aza matahotra fa tera-dahy ianao.” Tsy namaly anefa izy, sady tsy nahoany akory izany tao am-pony tao.', 'ary rehefa ho faty izy, dia hoy ireo vehivavy nijoro teo akaikiny: “aza matahotra fa tera-dahy ianao.” tsy namaly anefa izy, sady tsy nahoany akory izany tao am-pony tao.'),
  ('6ab25a1378064c9f4bb329d6', '2026-09-22T10:36:03.995Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:03.995Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 4, 19, 'Ary bevohoka efa ho teraka ny vinantovaviny, vadin’i Finehasa. Ary ren-dravehivavy fa lasa babo ny Vata masin’Andriamanitra, sady henony koa fa maty ny rafozandahiny sy ny vadiny. Dia nitambonkina izy ka teraka, satria nihetsi-jaza tampoka.', 'ary bevohoka efa ho teraka ny vinantovaviny, vadin’i finehasa. ary ren-dravehivavy fa lasa babo ny vata masin’andriamanitra, sady henony koa fa maty ny rafozandahiny sy ny vadiny. dia nitambonkina izy ka teraka, satria nihetsi-jaza tampoka.'),
  ('6ab25a1378064c9f4bb329cc', '2026-09-22T10:36:03.995Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:03.995Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 4, 9, 'Manàna herim-po, ry Filistinina, ary misehoa ho tena lehilahy, sao ianareo hanompo ny Hebreo tahaka ny efa nanompoany anareo. Misehoa ho tena lehilahy, ka miadia!”', 'manàna herim-po, ry filistinina, ary misehoa ho tena lehilahy, sao ianareo hanompo ny hebreo tahaka ny efa nanompoany anareo. misehoa ho tena lehilahy, ka miadia!”'),
  ('6ab25a1378064c9f4bb329cb', '2026-09-22T10:36:03.995Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:03.995Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 4, 8, 'Hahita loza isika! Iza no hamonjy antsika eo an-tanan’izany Andriamanitra heni-kaja izany? Izy ilay Andriamanitra namely an’i Ejipta tamin’ny fandripahana isan-karazany tany an-tany efitra.', 'hahita loza isika! iza no hamonjy antsika eo an-tanan’izany andriamanitra heni-kaja izany? izy ilay andriamanitra namely an’i ejipta tamin’ny fandripahana isan-karazany tany an-tany efitra.'),
  ('6ab25a1378064c9f4bb329d3', '2026-09-22T10:36:03.995Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:03.995Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 4, 16, 'Ary hoy ilay lehilahy taminy: “Izaho no avy tany an’ady, ary avy any aho no nandositra androany.” Dia hoy i Ely: “Inona no nitranga, anaka?”', 'ary hoy ilay lehilahy taminy: “izaho no avy tany an’ady, ary avy any aho no nandositra androany.” dia hoy i ely: “inona no nitranga, anaka?”'),
  ('6ab25a1378064c9f4bb329cd', '2026-09-22T10:36:03.995Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:03.995Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 4, 10, 'Koa niady tokoa ny Filistinina. Dia resy ny Israely, ka samy nandositra tany amin’ny tranolainy avy. Ary be dia be no maty, ka ny Israely dia nahafatesana lehilahy telo alina nandeha an-tongotra.', 'koa niady tokoa ny filistinina. dia resy ny israely, ka samy nandositra tany amin’ny tranolainy avy. ary be dia be no maty, ka ny israely dia nahafatesana lehilahy telo alina nandeha an-tongotra.'),
  ('6ab25a1378064c9f4bb329d2', '2026-09-22T10:36:03.995Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:03.995Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 4, 15, 'Valo amby sivy folo taona i Ely tamin’izay, ary tsy nihetsika ny masony ka tsy nahita izy.', 'valo amby sivy folo taona i ely tamin’izay, ary tsy nihetsika ny masony ka tsy nahita izy.'),
  ('6ab25a1378064c9f4bb329ce', '2026-09-22T10:36:03.995Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:03.995Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 4, 11, 'Lasa babo koa ny Vata masin’Andriamanitra, ary maty izy mirahalahy zanak’i Ely, dia i Hofinia sy Finehasa.', 'lasa babo koa ny vata masin’andriamanitra, ary maty izy mirahalahy zanak’i ely, dia i hofinia sy finehasa.'),
  ('6ab25a1378064c9f4bb329d8', '2026-09-22T10:36:03.995Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:03.995Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 4, 21, 'Ary nataony hoe Ikaboda ny anaran’ilay zaza, fa hoy izy: “Niala tamin’ny Israely ho any an-tsesitany ny voninahitra.” Ny Vata masin’Andriamanitra izay lasa babo, mbamin’ny rafozandahiny sy ny vadiny, no tiany holazaina tamin’izany.', 'ary nataony hoe ikaboda ny anaran’ilay zaza, fa hoy izy: “niala tamin’ny israely ho any an-tsesitany ny voninahitra.” ny vata masin’andriamanitra izay lasa babo, mbamin’ny rafozandahiny sy ny vadiny, no tiany holazaina tamin’izany.'),
  ('6ab25a1378064c9f4bb329d4', '2026-09-22T10:36:03.995Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:03.995Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 4, 17, 'Koa hoy ilay mpilaza vaovao: “Nandositra teo anoloan’ny Filistinina ny Israely, ary resy tanteraka ny olona. Maty koa i Hofinia sy Finehasa zanakao mirahalahy, ary lasa babo ny Vata masin’Andriamanitra.”', 'koa hoy ilay mpilaza vaovao: “nandositra teo anoloan’ny filistinina ny israely, ary resy tanteraka ny olona. maty koa i hofinia sy finehasa zanakao mirahalahy, ary lasa babo ny vata masin’andriamanitra.”'),
  ('6ab25a1378064c9f4bb329cf', '2026-09-22T10:36:03.995Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:03.995Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 4, 12, 'Ary nisy lehilahy benjaminita nihazakazaka avy tany an’ady, ka tonga tao Silo ny androtr’iny ihany. Rovitra ny akanjony sady nihosim-bovoka ny lohany.', 'ary nisy lehilahy benjaminita nihazakazaka avy tany an’ady, ka tonga tao silo ny androtr’iny ihany. rovitra ny akanjony sady nihosim-bovoka ny lohany.'),
  ('6ab25a1378064c9f4bb329d5', '2026-09-22T10:36:03.995Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:03.995Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 4, 18, 'Raha vao niteny momba ny Vata masin’Andriamanitra ilay lehilahy, dia nianjera avy teo amin’ny sezany teo akaikin’ny vavahady i Ely ary nidaboka nankany aoriana ka tapaka ny vozony, dia maty izy. Efa antitra mantsy izy sady navesatra. Izy no nitsara ny Israely efapolo taona.', 'raha vao niteny momba ny vata masin’andriamanitra ilay lehilahy, dia nianjera avy teo amin’ny sezany teo akaikin’ny vavahady i ely ary nidaboka nankany aoriana ka tapaka ny vozony, dia maty izy. efa antitra mantsy izy sady navesatra. izy no nitsara ny israely efapolo taona.'),
  ('6ab25a1378064c9f4bb329d0', '2026-09-22T10:36:03.995Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:03.995Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 4, 13, 'Tamin’izy tonga, dia efa nipetraka nitazantazana teo amin’ny seza teo amoron-dalana i Ely, satria nangitakitaka ny fony noho ny amin’ny Vata masin’Andriamanitra. Ary tonga nilaza ny vaovao tao an-tanàna ilay lehilahy, ka nidradradradra ny iray tanàna.', 'tamin’izy tonga, dia efa nipetraka nitazantazana teo amin’ny seza teo amoron-dalana i ely, satria nangitakitaka ny fony noho ny amin’ny vata masin’andriamanitra. ary tonga nilaza ny vaovao tao an-tanàna ilay lehilahy, ka nidradradradra ny iray tanàna.'),
  ('6ab25a14fb583b5a45d4cb26', '2026-09-22T10:36:04.509Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:04.509Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 5, 6, 'Ary ny tanan’i Jehovah dia navesatra tamin’ny Asdodita, eny, i Asdoda sy ny faritaniny, satria nampisahotahany sy nasiany tamin’ny hemoroida izy ireo.', 'ary ny tanan’i jehovah dia navesatra tamin’ny asdodita, eny, i asdoda sy ny faritaniny, satria nampisahotahany sy nasiany tamin’ny hemoroida izy ireo.'),
  ('6ab25a14fb583b5a45d4cb28', '2026-09-22T10:36:04.509Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:04.509Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 5, 8, 'Koa naniraka olona hamory ny andriana mpiray dina rehetran’ny Filistinina hankeo aminy izy ireo, ka niteny hoe: “Hataontsika ahoana ny Vata masin’ny Andriamanitry ny Israely?” Farany, dia hoy ireo: “Aoka hafindra any Gata ny Vata masin’ny Andriamanitry ny Israely.” Koa nentin’izy ireo nankany ilay Vata masin’ny Andriamanitry ny Israely.', 'koa naniraka olona hamory ny andriana mpiray dina rehetran’ny filistinina hankeo aminy izy ireo, ka niteny hoe: “hataontsika ahoana ny vata masin’ny andriamanitry ny israely?” farany, dia hoy ireo: “aoka hafindra any gata ny vata masin’ny andriamanitry ny israely.” koa nentin’izy ireo nankany ilay vata masin’ny andriamanitry ny israely.');
INSERT INTO "bible_verses" ("id", "created_date", "updated_date", "created_by_id", "created_by", "translation", "book", "bookOrder", "chapter", "verse", "text", "normalizedText") VALUES
  ('6ab25a14fb583b5a45d4cb29', '2026-09-22T10:36:04.509Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:04.509Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 5, 9, 'Rehefa tongan’ireo tany ilay Vata, dia nataon’ny tanan’i Jehovah nisahotaka be ilay tanàna. Ary nasiany ny olona tao an-tanàna, na kely na lehibe, ka voan’ny hemoroida.', 'rehefa tongan’ireo tany ilay vata, dia nataon’ny tanan’i jehovah nisahotaka be ilay tanàna. ary nasiany ny olona tao an-tanàna, na kely na lehibe, ka voan’ny hemoroida.'),
  ('6ab25a14fb583b5a45d4cb2a', '2026-09-22T10:36:04.509Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:04.509Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 5, 10, 'Koa nalefan’izy ireo nankany Ekrona ny Vata masin’Andriamanitra. Raha vao tonga tao Ekrona anefa ny Vata masin’Andriamanitra, dia nitaraina mafy ny Ekronita hoe: “Nentin-dry zareo atỳ aminay ny Vata masin’ny Andriamanitry ny Israely, mba hahafaty anay sy ny vahoakanay!”', 'koa nalefan’izy ireo nankany ekrona ny vata masin’andriamanitra. raha vao tonga tao ekrona anefa ny vata masin’andriamanitra, dia nitaraina mafy ny ekronita hoe: “nentin-dry zareo atỳ aminay ny vata masin’ny andriamanitry ny israely, mba hahafaty anay sy ny vahoakanay!”'),
  ('6ab25a14fb583b5a45d4cb27', '2026-09-22T10:36:04.509Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:04.509Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 5, 7, 'Dia hitan’ny olona tao Asdoda izany, ka hoy izy ireo: “Aoka tsy havela hitoetra eto amintsika ny Vata masin’ny Andriamanitry ny Israely, fa ny tanany efa namely mafy antsika sy Dagona andriamanitsika.”', 'dia hitan’ny olona tao asdoda izany, ka hoy izy ireo: “aoka tsy havela hitoetra eto amintsika ny vata masin’ny andriamanitry ny israely, fa ny tanany efa namely mafy antsika sy dagona andriamanitsika.”'),
  ('6ab25a14fb583b5a45d4cb2b', '2026-09-22T10:36:04.509Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:04.509Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 5, 11, 'Koa naniraka olona hamory ny andriana mpiray dina rehetran’ny Filistinina izy ireo, ka niteny hoe: “Alefaso any io Vata masin’ny Andriamanitry ny Israely io, ka avereno any amin’ny toerany mba tsy hahafaty anay sy ny vahoakanay.” Fa nisahotaka ny olona nanerana an’ilay tanàna, ka maro no maty. Ary navesatra be tao ny tanan’ilay tena Andriamanitra,', 'koa naniraka olona hamory ny andriana mpiray dina rehetran’ny filistinina izy ireo, ka niteny hoe: “alefaso any io vata masin’ny andriamanitry ny israely io, ka avereno any amin’ny toerany mba tsy hahafaty anay sy ny vahoakanay.” fa nisahotaka ny olona nanerana an’ilay tanàna, ka maro no maty. ary navesatra be tao ny tanan’ilay tena andriamanitra,'),
  ('6ab25a14fb583b5a45d4cb21', '2026-09-22T10:36:04.509Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:04.509Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 5, 1, 'Ary naka ny Vata masin’Andriamanitra ny Filistinina, ka nitondra izany avy tao Ebenezera nankany Asdoda.', 'ary naka ny vata masin’andriamanitra ny filistinina, ka nitondra izany avy tao ebenezera nankany asdoda.'),
  ('6ab25a14fb583b5a45d4cb2c', '2026-09-22T10:36:04.509Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:04.509Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 5, 12, 'ka izay olona tsy maty dia voan’ny hemoroida. Koa niakatra mandrakariva tany an-danitra ny antso vonjy nataon’ilay tanàna.', 'ka izay olona tsy maty dia voan’ny hemoroida. koa niakatra mandrakariva tany an-danitra ny antso vonjy nataon’ilay tanàna.'),
  ('6ab25a14fb583b5a45d4cb22', '2026-09-22T10:36:04.509Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:04.509Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 5, 2, 'Dia nalain’izy ireo ilay Vata masin’Andriamanitra, ka nampidiriny tao an-tranon’i Dagona ary napetrany teo akaikin’i Dagona.', 'dia nalain’izy ireo ilay vata masin’andriamanitra, ka nampidiriny tao an-tranon’i dagona ary napetrany teo akaikin’i dagona.'),
  ('6ab25a14fb583b5a45d4cb23', '2026-09-22T10:36:04.509Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:04.509Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 5, 3, 'Ary nifoha maraina ny Asdodita ny ampitson’iny, ka nahita an’i Dagona nianjera nihohoka tamin’ny tany, teo anoloan’ny Vata masin’i Jehovah. Koa noraisin’izy ireo i Dagona ka naveriny teo amin’ny toerany.', 'ary nifoha maraina ny asdodita ny ampitson’iny, ka nahita an’i dagona nianjera nihohoka tamin’ny tany, teo anoloan’ny vata masin’i jehovah. koa noraisin’izy ireo i dagona ka naveriny teo amin’ny toerany.'),
  ('6ab25a14fb583b5a45d4cb25', '2026-09-22T10:36:04.509Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:04.509Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 5, 5, 'Izany no mahatonga ny mpisoron’i Dagona sy izay rehetra mankao ao an-tranon’i Dagona, tsy hanitsaka ny eo an-tokonam-baravaran’i Dagona ao Asdoda, mandraka androany.', 'izany no mahatonga ny mpisoron’i dagona sy izay rehetra mankao ao an-tranon’i dagona, tsy hanitsaka ny eo an-tokonam-baravaran’i dagona ao asdoda, mandraka androany.'),
  ('6ab25a14fb583b5a45d4cb24', '2026-09-22T10:36:04.509Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:04.509Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 5, 4, 'Nony nifoha maraina koa izy ireo ny ampitson’iny, dia nahita an’i Dagona nianjera nihohoka tamin’ny tany indray, teo an-tokonam-baravarana, teo anoloan’ny Vata masin’i Jehovah, sady tapaka ny lohany sy ny felatanany roa, ka ny tapany toy ny trondro ihany sisa tavela.', 'nony nifoha maraina koa izy ireo ny ampitson’iny, dia nahita an’i dagona nianjera nihohoka tamin’ny tany indray, teo an-tokonam-baravarana, teo anoloan’ny vata masin’i jehovah, sady tapaka ny lohany sy ny felatanany roa, ka ny tapany toy ny trondro ihany sisa tavela.'),
  ('6ab25a15c750df762e6ebd5b', '2026-09-22T10:36:05.041Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:05.041Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 6, 16, 'Dia nahita izany ireo andriana dimy mpiray dinan’ny Filistinina, ka niverina nankany Ekrona ny androtr’iny ihany.', 'dia nahita izany ireo andriana dimy mpiray dinan’ny filistinina, ka niverina nankany ekrona ny androtr’iny ihany.'),
  ('6ab25a15c750df762e6ebd5d', '2026-09-22T10:36:05.041Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:05.041Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 6, 18, 'Ireo voalavo mpitsambikina vita tamin’ny volamena kosa, dia araka ny isan’ny tanàna rehetran’ny Filistinina izay an’ireo andriana dimy mpiray dina, hatramin’ny tanàna voaro mafy ka hatramin’ny tanàna kely teny ambanivohitra. Ary ilay vato be nametrahan’izy ireo ny Vata masin’i Jehovah, dia vavolombelona eo amin’ny sahan’i Josoa Beti-semita mandraka androany.', 'ireo voalavo mpitsambikina vita tamin’ny volamena kosa, dia araka ny isan’ny tanàna rehetran’ny filistinina izay an’ireo andriana dimy mpiray dina, hatramin’ny tanàna voaro mafy ka hatramin’ny tanàna kely teny ambanivohitra. ary ilay vato be nametrahan’izy ireo ny vata masin’i jehovah, dia vavolombelona eo amin’ny sahan’i josoa beti-semita mandraka androany.'),
  ('6ab25a15c750df762e6ebd52', '2026-09-22T10:36:05.041Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:05.041Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 6, 7, 'Koa manaova sarety vaovao, ary makà ombivavy roa mampinono, izay mbola tsy nasiana zioga mihitsy. Fehezo eo amin’ilay sarety ireo ombivavy, dia alefaso mody ny zanany mba tsy hanaraka azy.', 'koa manaova sarety vaovao, ary makà ombivavy roa mampinono, izay mbola tsy nasiana zioga mihitsy. fehezo eo amin’ilay sarety ireo ombivavy, dia alefaso mody ny zanany mba tsy hanaraka azy.'),
  ('6ab25a15c750df762e6ebd4e', '2026-09-22T10:36:05.041Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:05.041Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 6, 3, 'Dia hoy ireo: “Aza alefa tsy miaraka amin’ny fanatitra ny Vata masin’ny Andriamanitry ny Israely raha alefanareo, fa atero any aminy miaraka amin’ny fanatitra noho ny heloka. Dia ho sitrana ianareo, ka ho fantatrareo ny antony tsy ialan’ny tanany aminareo.”', 'dia hoy ireo: “aza alefa tsy miaraka amin’ny fanatitra ny vata masin’ny andriamanitry ny israely raha alefanareo, fa atero any aminy miaraka amin’ny fanatitra noho ny heloka. dia ho sitrana ianareo, ka ho fantatrareo ny antony tsy ialan’ny tanany aminareo.”'),
  ('6ab25a15c750df762e6ebd60', '2026-09-22T10:36:05.041Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:05.041Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 6, 21, 'Farany, dia nandefa iraka nankany amin’ny mponin’i Kiriata-jearima izy ireo, nanao hoe: “Naverin’ny Filistinina ny Vata masin’i Jehovah. Koa midìna atỳ, mba hampiakatra azy any aminareo.”', 'farany, dia nandefa iraka nankany amin’ny mponin’i kiriata-jearima izy ireo, nanao hoe: “naverin’ny filistinina ny vata masin’i jehovah. koa midìna atỳ, mba hampiakatra azy any aminareo.”'),
  ('6ab25a15c750df762e6ebd5e', '2026-09-22T10:36:05.041Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:05.041Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 6, 19, 'Novonoin’Andriamanitra anefa ny olona tao Beti-semesy satria nojerijeren’izy ireo ny Vata masin’i Jehovah. Koa namono olona fitopolo—sy dimy alina— * teo amin’ny vahoaka izy. Dia nalahelo mafy ny olona satria namely ny olona i Jehovah ka be dia be no maty.', 'novonoin’andriamanitra anefa ny olona tao beti-semesy satria nojerijeren’izy ireo ny vata masin’i jehovah. koa namono olona fitopolo—sy dimy alina— * teo amin’ny vahoaka izy. dia nalahelo mafy ny olona satria namely ny olona i jehovah ka be dia be no maty.'),
  ('6ab25a15c750df762e6ebd54', '2026-09-22T10:36:05.041Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:05.041Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 6, 9, 'Jereo fa raha miakatra amin’ny lalana mankany amin’ny taniny izany, ho any Beti-semesy, dia Izy no nanao tamintsika izao zava-dratsy lehibe izao. Raha tsy izany kosa, dia ho fantatsika hoe tsy ny tanany no nikasika antsika, fa nisy loza sendra nanjo antsika fotsiny.”', 'jereo fa raha miakatra amin’ny lalana mankany amin’ny taniny izany, ho any beti-semesy, dia izy no nanao tamintsika izao zava-dratsy lehibe izao. raha tsy izany kosa, dia ho fantatsika hoe tsy ny tanany no nikasika antsika, fa nisy loza sendra nanjo antsika fotsiny.”'),
  ('6ab25a15c750df762e6ebd53', '2026-09-22T10:36:05.041Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:05.041Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 6, 8, 'Ary alaivo ny Vata masin’i Jehovah ka apetraho eo ambonin’ilay sarety. Ataovy ao anaty boaty eo akaikin’ilay Vata ireo sarivongana volamena, izay haterinareo any aminy ho fanatitra noho ny heloka. Ary alefaso izany, dia handeha.', 'ary alaivo ny vata masin’i jehovah ka apetraho eo ambonin’ilay sarety. ataovy ao anaty boaty eo akaikin’ilay vata ireo sarivongana volamena, izay haterinareo any aminy ho fanatitra noho ny heloka. ary alefaso izany, dia handeha.'),
  ('6ab25a15c750df762e6ebd51', '2026-09-22T10:36:05.041Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:05.041Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 6, 6, 'Nahoana ianareo no manamafy ny fonareo toy ny nanamafisan’i Ejipta sy Farao ny fony? Rehefa nofaizin’Andriamanitra anefa izy ireo, moa ve tsy nalefany avy hatrany ny Israelita ka lasa nandeha?', 'nahoana ianareo no manamafy ny fonareo toy ny nanamafisan’i ejipta sy farao ny fony? rehefa nofaizin’andriamanitra anefa izy ireo, moa ve tsy nalefany avy hatrany ny israelita ka lasa nandeha?'),
  ('6ab25a15c750df762e6ebd57', '2026-09-22T10:36:05.041Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:05.041Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 6, 12, 'Ary nizotra nahitsy tamin’ny lalana nankany Beti-semesy ireo omby. Dia nandeha tamin’ny lalambe iray ihany izy ireo ka nitrena teny an-dalana, ary tsy nivily niankavanana na niankavia. Nanaraka an’ireo omby hatrany amin’ny sisin-tanin’i Beti-semesy ireo andriana mpiray dinan’ny Filistinina.', 'ary nizotra nahitsy tamin’ny lalana nankany beti-semesy ireo omby. dia nandeha tamin’ny lalambe iray ihany izy ireo ka nitrena teny an-dalana, ary tsy nivily niankavanana na niankavia. nanaraka an’ireo omby hatrany amin’ny sisin-tanin’i beti-semesy ireo andriana mpiray dinan’ny filistinina.'),
  ('6ab25a15c750df762e6ebd4c', '2026-09-22T10:36:05.041Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:05.041Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 6, 1, 'Fito volana ny Vata masin’i Jehovah no tany ambanivohitry ny Filistinina.', 'fito volana ny vata masin’i jehovah no tany ambanivohitry ny filistinina.'),
  ('6ab25a15c750df762e6ebd50', '2026-09-22T10:36:05.041Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:05.041Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 6, 5, 'Ataovy sarivongana ny hemoroidanareo sy ny voalavo mpitsambikina manimba ny taninareo, ary omeo voninahitra ny Andriamanitry ny Israely. Angamba izy mba hanala ny tanany tsy ho eo aminareo sy ny andriamanitrareo ary ny taninareo.', 'ataovy sarivongana ny hemoroidanareo sy ny voalavo mpitsambikina manimba ny taninareo, ary omeo voninahitra ny andriamanitry ny israely. angamba izy mba hanala ny tanany tsy ho eo aminareo sy ny andriamanitrareo ary ny taninareo.'),
  ('6ab25a15c750df762e6ebd58', '2026-09-22T10:36:05.041Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:05.041Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 6, 13, 'Tamin’izay ny olona tao Beti-semesy dia nijinja varimbazaha teny amin’ny lemaka iva. Ary nanopy ny masony izy ireo ka nahita an’ilay Vata, dia faly be.', 'tamin’izay ny olona tao beti-semesy dia nijinja varimbazaha teny amin’ny lemaka iva. ary nanopy ny masony izy ireo ka nahita an’ilay vata, dia faly be.'),
  ('6ab25a15c750df762e6ebd4f', '2026-09-22T10:36:05.041Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:05.041Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 6, 4, 'Koa hoy ny Filistinina: “Inona no fanatitra noho ny heloka tokony haterinay any aminy?” Dia hoy ireo: “Hemoroida volamena dimy sy voalavo mpitsambikina dimy vita amin’ny volamena, araka ny isan’ny andriana mpiray dinan’ny Filistinina. Mitovy ihany mantsy ny loza manjo anareo rehetra sy ireo andriana mpiray dina eo aminareo.', 'koa hoy ny filistinina: “inona no fanatitra noho ny heloka tokony haterinay any aminy?” dia hoy ireo: “hemoroida volamena dimy sy voalavo mpitsambikina dimy vita amin’ny volamena, araka ny isan’ny andriana mpiray dinan’ny filistinina. mitovy ihany mantsy ny loza manjo anareo rehetra sy ireo andriana mpiray dina eo aminareo.'),
  ('6ab25a15c750df762e6ebd56', '2026-09-22T10:36:05.041Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:05.041Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 6, 11, 'Napetrak’izy ireo teo ambonin’ilay sarety ny Vata masin’i Jehovah mbamin’ilay boaty nisy ireo voalavo mpitsambikina vita tamin’ny volamena sy ny sarivongan’ny hemoroidan-dry zareo.', 'napetrak’izy ireo teo ambonin’ilay sarety ny vata masin’i jehovah mbamin’ilay boaty nisy ireo voalavo mpitsambikina vita tamin’ny volamena sy ny sarivongan’ny hemoroidan-dry zareo.'),
  ('6ab25a15c750df762e6ebd5f', '2026-09-22T10:36:05.041Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:05.041Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 6, 20, 'Ary hoy ny olona tao Beti-semesy: “Iza no ho afaka hankeo anatrehan’i Jehovah, ilay Andriamanitra masina? Tsy afaka miala amintsika ve izy ka mankany an-kafa?”', 'ary hoy ny olona tao beti-semesy: “iza no ho afaka hankeo anatrehan’i jehovah, ilay andriamanitra masina? tsy afaka miala amintsika ve izy ka mankany an-kafa?”'),
  ('6ab25a15c750df762e6ebd59', '2026-09-22T10:36:05.041Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:05.041Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 6, 14, 'Tonga teo amin’ny sahan’i Josoa Beti-semita ilay sarety, ka nijanona teo amin’ilay vato be. Ary nokapakapain’izy ireo ny hazon’ilay sarety, fa ireo omby kosa natolony ho fanatitra dorana ho an’i Jehovah.', 'tonga teo amin’ny sahan’i josoa beti-semita ilay sarety, ka nijanona teo amin’ilay vato be. ary nokapakapain’izy ireo ny hazon’ilay sarety, fa ireo omby kosa natolony ho fanatitra dorana ho an’i jehovah.'),
  ('6ab25a15c750df762e6ebd55', '2026-09-22T10:36:05.041Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:05.041Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 6, 10, 'Dia nanao araka izany tokoa ny olona. Naka ombivavy roa mbola mampinono izy ireo ka nofeheziny teo amin’ilay sarety, ary ny zanak’omby kosa nohidiany tao an-trano.', 'dia nanao araka izany tokoa ny olona. naka ombivavy roa mbola mampinono izy ireo ka nofeheziny teo amin’ilay sarety, ary ny zanak’omby kosa nohidiany tao an-trano.'),
  ('6ab25a15c750df762e6ebd5c', '2026-09-22T10:36:05.041Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:05.041Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 6, 17, 'Ary ireto avy ny hemoroida volamena naterin’ny Filistinina ho fanatitra noho ny heloka ho an’i Jehovah: Iray an’i Asdoda, iray an’i Gaza, iray an’i Askelona, iray an’i Gata, ary iray an’i Ekrona.', 'ary ireto avy ny hemoroida volamena naterin’ny filistinina ho fanatitra noho ny heloka ho an’i jehovah: iray an’i asdoda, iray an’i gaza, iray an’i askelona, iray an’i gata, ary iray an’i ekrona.'),
  ('6ab25a15c750df762e6ebd4d', '2026-09-22T10:36:05.041Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:05.041Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 6, 2, 'Ary nantsoin’ny Filistinina ny mpisorona sy ny mpisikidy, ka nanontaniany hoe: “Hataonay ahoana ny Vata masin’i Jehovah? Lazao aminay hoe ampiarahinay amin’ny inona io rehefa alefanay any amin’ny toerany.”', 'ary nantsoin’ny filistinina ny mpisorona sy ny mpisikidy, ka nanontaniany hoe: “hataonay ahoana ny vata masin’i jehovah? lazao aminay hoe ampiarahinay amin’ny inona io rehefa alefanay any amin’ny toerany.”'),
  ('6ab25a15c750df762e6ebd5a', '2026-09-22T10:36:05.041Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:05.041Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 6, 15, 'Ny Levita no nampidina ny Vata masin’i Jehovah mbamin’ilay boaty nisy an’ireo sarivongana volamena. Ary napetrak’izy ireo teo ambonin’ilay vato be ny Vata. Ny olona tao Beti-semesy kosa nanolotra fanatitra dorana, sady tsy nitsahatra nanao sorona ho an’i Jehovah tamin’iny andro iny.', 'ny levita no nampidina ny vata masin’i jehovah mbamin’ilay boaty nisy an’ireo sarivongana volamena. ary napetrak’izy ireo teo ambonin’ilay vato be ny vata. ny olona tao beti-semesy kosa nanolotra fanatitra dorana, sady tsy nitsahatra nanao sorona ho an’i jehovah tamin’iny andro iny.'),
  ('6ab25a15d407ba36a7ab8cf0', '2026-09-22T10:36:05.557Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:05.557Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 7, 1, 'Koa tonga ny lehilahy avy tao Kiriata-jearima. Dia nentin’izy ireo niakatra ny Vata masin’i Jehovah ary nampidiriny tao an-tranon’i Abinadaba teny an-kavoana. Ary i Eleazara zanakalahin’i Abinadaba no nohamasinina hiambina an’ilay Vata masin’i Jehovah.', 'koa tonga ny lehilahy avy tao kiriata-jearima. dia nentin’izy ireo niakatra ny vata masin’i jehovah ary nampidiriny tao an-tranon’i abinadaba teny an-kavoana. ary i eleazara zanakalahin’i abinadaba no nohamasinina hiambina an’ilay vata masin’i jehovah.'),
  ('6ab25a15d407ba36a7ab8cf4', '2026-09-22T10:36:05.557Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:05.557Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 7, 5, 'Ary hoy i Samoela: “Vorio ao Mizpa ny Israely rehetra, fa hivavaka amin’i Jehovah ho anareo aho.”', 'ary hoy i samoela: “vorio ao mizpa ny israely rehetra, fa hivavaka amin’i jehovah ho anareo aho.”'),
  ('6ab25a15d407ba36a7ab8cf2', '2026-09-22T10:36:05.557Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:05.557Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 7, 3, 'Koa hoy i Samoela tamin’ny taranak’Israely manontolo: “Raha amin’ny fonareo manontolo no iverenanareo amin’i Jehovah, dia esory tsy ho eo aminareo ny andriamani-kafa sy ireo sarin’i Astarta. Atodiho amin’i Jehovah ny fonareo ka aza avela hiovaova, ary manompoa azy irery ihany, dia hanafaka anareo eo an-tanan’ny Filistinina izy.”', 'koa hoy i samoela tamin’ny taranak’israely manontolo: “raha amin’ny fonareo manontolo no iverenanareo amin’i jehovah, dia esory tsy ho eo aminareo ny andriamani-kafa sy ireo sarin’i astarta. atodiho amin’i jehovah ny fonareo ka aza avela hiovaova, ary manompoa azy irery ihany, dia hanafaka anareo eo an-tanan’ny filistinina izy.”'),
  ('6ab25a15d407ba36a7ab8cf1', '2026-09-22T10:36:05.557Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:05.557Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 7, 2, 'Hatramin’ny andro nametrahana an’ilay Vata tao Kiriata-jearima, dia andro maro no lasa, ka nahatratra roapolo taona izany. Ary nitomany ny taranak’Israely manontolo ka nitady an’i Jehovah.', 'hatramin’ny andro nametrahana an’ilay vata tao kiriata-jearima, dia andro maro no lasa, ka nahatratra roapolo taona izany. ary nitomany ny taranak’israely manontolo ka nitady an’i jehovah.'),
  ('6ab25a15d407ba36a7ab8cf3', '2026-09-22T10:36:05.557Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:05.557Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 7, 4, 'Koa nesorin’ny zanak’Israely ireo Bala sy ireo sarin’i Astarta, ka nanompo an’i Jehovah irery ihany izy ireo.', 'koa nesorin’ny zanak’israely ireo bala sy ireo sarin’i astarta, ka nanompo an’i jehovah irery ihany izy ireo.'),
  ('6ab25a15d407ba36a7ab8cfa', '2026-09-22T10:36:05.558Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:05.558Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 7, 11, 'Koa nivoaka avy tao Mizpa ny lehilahy israelita, ka nanenjika an’ireo Filistinina sady namono azy hatrany atsimon’i Beti-kara.', 'koa nivoaka avy tao mizpa ny lehilahy israelita, ka nanenjika an’ireo filistinina sady namono azy hatrany atsimon’i beti-kara.'),
  ('6ab25a15d407ba36a7ab8cfc', '2026-09-22T10:36:05.558Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:05.558Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 7, 13, 'Dia resy ny Filistinina, ka tsy nitsofotsofoka tao amin’ny faritanin’ny Israely intsony. Ary nanohitra ny Filistinina foana ny tanan’i Jehovah, nandritra ny androm-piainan’i Samoela.', 'dia resy ny filistinina, ka tsy nitsofotsofoka tao amin’ny faritanin’ny israely intsony. ary nanohitra ny filistinina foana ny tanan’i jehovah, nandritra ny androm-piainan’i samoela.'),
  ('6ab25a15d407ba36a7ab8cf6', '2026-09-22T10:36:05.558Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:05.558Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 7, 7, 'Ary ren’ny Filistinina fa nivory tao Mizpa ny zanak’Israely. Koa niakatra hamely ny Israely ireo andriana mpiray dinan’ny Filistinina. Natahotra noho ny amin’ny Filistinina anefa ny zanak’Israely rehefa nandre izany.', 'ary ren’ny filistinina fa nivory tao mizpa ny zanak’israely. koa niakatra hamely ny israely ireo andriana mpiray dinan’ny filistinina. natahotra noho ny amin’ny filistinina anefa ny zanak’israely rehefa nandre izany.'),
  ('6ab25a15d407ba36a7ab8d00', '2026-09-22T10:36:05.558Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:05.558Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 7, 17, 'Niverina tao Rama ihany anefa izy satria tao ny tranony, ka tao izy no nitsara ny Israely. Ary nanorina alitara tao ho an’i Jehovah izy.', 'niverina tao rama ihany anefa izy satria tao ny tranony, ka tao izy no nitsara ny israely. ary nanorina alitara tao ho an’i jehovah izy.'),
  ('6ab25a15d407ba36a7ab8cf5', '2026-09-22T10:36:05.558Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:05.558Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 7, 6, 'Dia nivory tao Mizpa izy ireo, ary nantsaka rano ka nandraraka izany teo anatrehan’i Jehovah, sady nifady hanina tamin’iny andro iny. Teo koa izy ireo no niteny hoe: “Efa nanota tamin’i Jehovah izahay.” Ary nanomboka nitsara ny zanak’Israely tao Mizpa i Samoela.', 'dia nivory tao mizpa izy ireo, ary nantsaka rano ka nandraraka izany teo anatrehan’i jehovah, sady nifady hanina tamin’iny andro iny. teo koa izy ireo no niteny hoe: “efa nanota tamin’i jehovah izahay.” ary nanomboka nitsara ny zanak’israely tao mizpa i samoela.'),
  ('6ab25a15d407ba36a7ab8cfb', '2026-09-22T10:36:05.558Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:05.558Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 7, 12, 'Ary naka vato i Samoela ka nametraka izany teo anelanelan’i Mizpa sy Jesana, dia nataony hoe Ebenezera ny anaran’ilay vato. Fa hoy izy: “Nanampy antsika i Jehovah hatramin’izao.”', 'ary naka vato i samoela ka nametraka izany teo anelanelan’i mizpa sy jesana, dia nataony hoe ebenezera ny anaran’ilay vato. fa hoy izy: “nanampy antsika i jehovah hatramin’izao.”'),
  ('6ab25a15d407ba36a7ab8cf9', '2026-09-22T10:36:05.558Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:05.558Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 7, 10, 'Raha mbola nanolotra an’ilay fanatitra dorana i Samoela, dia niroso hiady tamin’ny Israely ny Filistinina. Koa nandefa kotroka mafy be i Jehovah hoenti-manohitra ny Filistinina tamin’iny andro iny, mba hampisahotaka azy. Dia resy teo anoloan’ny Israely izy ireo.', 'raha mbola nanolotra an’ilay fanatitra dorana i samoela, dia niroso hiady tamin’ny israely ny filistinina. koa nandefa kotroka mafy be i jehovah hoenti-manohitra ny filistinina tamin’iny andro iny, mba hampisahotaka azy. dia resy teo anoloan’ny israely izy ireo.'),
  ('6ab25a15d407ba36a7ab8cff', '2026-09-22T10:36:05.558Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:05.558Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 7, 16, 'Dia nandeha nitety an’i Betela sy Gilgala ary Mizpa izy isan-taona, ka nitsara ny Israely tao amin’ireny toerana rehetra ireny.', 'dia nandeha nitety an’i betela sy gilgala ary mizpa izy isan-taona, ka nitsara ny israely tao amin’ireny toerana rehetra ireny.'),
  ('6ab25a15d407ba36a7ab8cf7', '2026-09-22T10:36:05.558Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:05.558Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 7, 8, 'Koa hoy izy ireo tamin’i Samoela: “Aza mangina, ary aza mitsahatra miantso vonjy amin’i Jehovah Andriamanitsika mba hamonjeny antsika eo an-tanan’ny Filistinina.”', 'koa hoy izy ireo tamin’i samoela: “aza mangina, ary aza mitsahatra miantso vonjy amin’i jehovah andriamanitsika mba hamonjeny antsika eo an-tanan’ny filistinina.”'),
  ('6ab25a15d407ba36a7ab8cfe', '2026-09-22T10:36:05.558Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:05.558Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 7, 15, 'Ary nitsara ny Israely foana i Samoela, nandritra ny androm-piainany.', 'ary nitsara ny israely foana i samoela, nandritra ny androm-piainany.'),
  ('6ab25a15d407ba36a7ab8cfd', '2026-09-22T10:36:05.558Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:05.558Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 7, 14, 'Koa niverina tsikelikely tamin’ny Israely ny tanàna efa nalain’ny Filistinina tamin’izy ireo, hatrany Ekrona ka hatrany Gata. Dia nafahan’ny Israely teo an-tanan’ny Filistinina ny faritanin’ireny tanàna ireny. Nanjary tsy nisy ady koa teo amin’ny Israely sy ny Amorita.', 'koa niverina tsikelikely tamin’ny israely ny tanàna efa nalain’ny filistinina tamin’izy ireo, hatrany ekrona ka hatrany gata. dia nafahan’ny israely teo an-tanan’ny filistinina ny faritanin’ireny tanàna ireny. nanjary tsy nisy ady koa teo amin’ny israely sy ny amorita.'),
  ('6ab25a15d407ba36a7ab8cf8', '2026-09-22T10:36:05.558Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:05.558Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 7, 9, 'Dia naka zanak’ondry mbola minono i Samoela, ka nanolotra izany ho fanatitra dorana manontolo ho an’i Jehovah. Ary niantso vonjy tamin’i Jehovah ho an’ny Israely izy, ka namaly azy i Jehovah.', 'dia naka zanak’ondry mbola minono i samoela, ka nanolotra izany ho fanatitra dorana manontolo ho an’i jehovah. ary niantso vonjy tamin’i jehovah ho an’ny israely izy, ka namaly azy i jehovah.'),
  ('6ab25a155d275a62bbf4e1b4', '2026-09-22T10:36:05.995Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:05.995Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 8, 18, 'Dia hitaraina mafy ianareo amin’izany andro izany, noho ny amin’ny mpanjakanareo izay nofidinareo ho anareo, saingy tsy hamaly anareo i Jehovah amin’izany andro izany.”', 'dia hitaraina mafy ianareo amin’izany andro izany, noho ny amin’ny mpanjakanareo izay nofidinareo ho anareo, saingy tsy hamaly anareo i jehovah amin’izany andro izany.”'),
  ('6ab25a155d275a62bbf4e1b5', '2026-09-22T10:36:05.995Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:05.995Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 8, 19, 'Tsy nety nihaino ny tenin’i Samoela anefa ny vahoaka, fa nanao hoe: “Tsia, fa aleo ihany hisy mpanjaka hifehy anay.', 'tsy nety nihaino ny tenin’i samoela anefa ny vahoaka, fa nanao hoe: “tsia, fa aleo ihany hisy mpanjaka hifehy anay.'),
  ('6ab25a155d275a62bbf4e1af', '2026-09-22T10:36:05.995Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:05.995Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 8, 13, 'Halainy koa ny zanakareo vavy, ka hataony mpanamboatra menaka fanosorana sy ho mpahandro ary ho mpanao mofo.', 'halainy koa ny zanakareo vavy, ka hataony mpanamboatra menaka fanosorana sy ho mpahandro ary ho mpanao mofo.'),
  ('6ab25a155d275a62bbf4e1b1', '2026-09-22T10:36:05.995Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:05.995Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 8, 15, 'Halainy koa ny ampahafolon’ny vokatra avy amin’ny sahanareo sy ny tanimboalobokareo, ka homeny ho an’ny tandapany sy ny mpanompony.', 'halainy koa ny ampahafolon’ny vokatra avy amin’ny sahanareo sy ny tanimboalobokareo, ka homeny ho an’ny tandapany sy ny mpanompony.'),
  ('6ab25a155d275a62bbf4e1ae', '2026-09-22T10:36:05.995Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:05.995Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 8, 12, 'Ny sasany hotendreny ho lehiben’ny arivony sy lehiben’ny dimampolony, ary ny sasany kosa hiasa ny taniny sy hijinja ny vokatry ny taniny ary hanamboatra ny fitaovam-piadiany sy ny fitaovana amin’ny kalesiny.', 'ny sasany hotendreny ho lehiben’ny arivony sy lehiben’ny dimampolony, ary ny sasany kosa hiasa ny taniny sy hijinja ny vokatry ny taniny ary hanamboatra ny fitaovam-piadiany sy ny fitaovana amin’ny kalesiny.'),
  ('6ab25a155d275a62bbf4e1a3', '2026-09-22T10:36:05.995Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:05.995Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 8, 1, 'Rehefa antitra i Samoela, dia notendreny ho mpitsaran’ny Israely ireo zanany lahy:', 'rehefa antitra i samoela, dia notendreny ho mpitsaran’ny israely ireo zanany lahy:'),
  ('6ab25a155d275a62bbf4e1b6', '2026-09-22T10:36:05.995Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:05.995Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 8, 20, 'Dia ho sahala amin’ny firenena rehetra izahay, ka hitsara anay ny mpanjakanay sady handeha eo alohanay ary hiady ho anay amin’izay ady ataonay.”', 'dia ho sahala amin’ny firenena rehetra izahay, ka hitsara anay ny mpanjakanay sady handeha eo alohanay ary hiady ho anay amin’izay ady ataonay.”'),
  ('6ab25a155d275a62bbf4e1b3', '2026-09-22T10:36:05.995Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:05.995Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 8, 17, 'Halainy koa ny ampahafolon’ny ondry aman’osinareo, ary ianareo ho lasa mpanompony.', 'halainy koa ny ampahafolon’ny ondry aman’osinareo, ary ianareo ho lasa mpanompony.'),
  ('6ab25a155d275a62bbf4e1a5', '2026-09-22T10:36:05.995Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:05.995Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 8, 3, 'Tsy mba nanao toy izay nataony anefa ireo zanany ireo, fa sady tia tombony azo tamin’ny tsy rariny no nandray kolikoly ary nanao fitsarana miangatra.', 'tsy mba nanao toy izay nataony anefa ireo zanany ireo, fa sady tia tombony azo tamin’ny tsy rariny no nandray kolikoly ary nanao fitsarana miangatra.'),
  ('6ab25a155d275a62bbf4e1b7', '2026-09-22T10:36:05.995Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:05.995Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 8, 21, 'Koa nihaino ny teny rehetra nolazain’ny vahoaka i Samoela, ary nolazainy tamin’i Jehovah izany.', 'koa nihaino ny teny rehetra nolazain’ny vahoaka i samoela, ary nolazainy tamin’i jehovah izany.'),
  ('6ab25a155d275a62bbf4e1ad', '2026-09-22T10:36:05.995Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:05.995Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 8, 11, 'Hoy koa izy: “Izao no ho zo ara-dalàna hananan’izay ho mpanjakanareo: Halainy ho azy ny zanakareo lahy, ka hataony eny amin’ny kalesiny sy miaraka amin’ny mpitaingin-tsoavaliny, ary ny sasany hihazakazaka eo alohan’ny kalesiny.', 'hoy koa izy: “izao no ho zo ara-dalàna hananan’izay ho mpanjakanareo: halainy ho azy ny zanakareo lahy, ka hataony eny amin’ny kalesiny sy miaraka amin’ny mpitaingin-tsoavaliny, ary ny sasany hihazakazaka eo alohan’ny kalesiny.'),
  ('6ab25a155d275a62bbf4e1a4', '2026-09-22T10:36:05.995Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:05.995Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 8, 2, 'Joela no anaran’ny zanany lahimatoa, ary Abia kosa no anaran’ny faharoa. Nitsara tao Beri-sheba izy ireo.', 'joela no anaran’ny zanany lahimatoa, ary abia kosa no anaran’ny faharoa. nitsara tao beri-sheba izy ireo.'),
  ('6ab25a155d275a62bbf4e1b2', '2026-09-22T10:36:05.995Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:05.995Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 8, 16, 'Halainy koa ny mpanompolahinareo sy ny mpanompovavinareo, mbamin’izay tsara indrindra amin’ny ombinareo ary ny ampondranareo, ka hampiasainy hiasa ho an’ny tenany.', 'halainy koa ny mpanompolahinareo sy ny mpanompovavinareo, mbamin’izay tsara indrindra amin’ny ombinareo ary ny ampondranareo, ka hampiasainy hiasa ho an’ny tenany.'),
  ('6ab25a155d275a62bbf4e1a6', '2026-09-22T10:36:05.995Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:05.995Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 8, 4, 'Rehefa nandeha ny fotoana, dia nivory ny anti-panahy rehetran’ny Israely ka nankany amin’i Samoela tao Rama,', 'rehefa nandeha ny fotoana, dia nivory ny anti-panahy rehetran’ny israely ka nankany amin’i samoela tao rama,'),
  ('6ab25a155d275a62bbf4e1ab', '2026-09-22T10:36:05.995Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:05.995Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 8, 9, 'Koa henoy ny teniny. Fa ampitandremo tsara fotsiny izy ireo ny amin’izay ho vokany, ka lazao aminy ny zo ara-dalàna ananan’izay ho mpanjakany.”', 'koa henoy ny teniny. fa ampitandremo tsara fotsiny izy ireo ny amin’izay ho vokany, ka lazao aminy ny zo ara-dalàna ananan’izay ho mpanjakany.”'),
  ('6ab25a155d275a62bbf4e1b8', '2026-09-22T10:36:05.995Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:05.995Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 8, 22, 'Dia hoy i Jehovah taminy: “Henoy ny tenin’izy ireo, ka manendre mpanjaka hitondra azy.” Koa hoy i Samoela tamin’ireo lehilahy israelita: “Samia mody any an-tanànany avy.”', 'dia hoy i jehovah taminy: “henoy ny tenin’izy ireo, ka manendre mpanjaka hitondra azy.” koa hoy i samoela tamin’ireo lehilahy israelita: “samia mody any an-tanànany avy.”'),
  ('6ab25a155d275a62bbf4e1a7', '2026-09-22T10:36:05.995Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:05.995Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 8, 5, 'ary niteny taminy hoe: “Efa antitra ianao izao, nefa ny zanakao tsy mba nanao toy izay nataonao. Koa manendre mpanjaka hitsara anay, sahala amin’ny firenena rehetra.”', 'ary niteny taminy hoe: “efa antitra ianao izao, nefa ny zanakao tsy mba nanao toy izay nataonao. koa manendre mpanjaka hitsara anay, sahala amin’ny firenena rehetra.”'),
  ('6ab25a155d275a62bbf4e1ac', '2026-09-22T10:36:05.995Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:05.995Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 8, 10, 'Dia nolazain’i Samoela tamin’ilay vahoaka nangataka mpanjaka taminy ny tenin’i Jehovah rehetra.', 'dia nolazain’i samoela tamin’ilay vahoaka nangataka mpanjaka taminy ny tenin’i jehovah rehetra.'),
  ('6ab25a155d275a62bbf4e1a9', '2026-09-22T10:36:05.995Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:05.995Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 8, 7, 'Dia hoy i Jehovah taminy: “Henoy izay rehetra lazain’ny vahoaka aminao, satria tsy ianao no laviny, fa izaho no laviny tsy ho mpanjakany.', 'dia hoy i jehovah taminy: “henoy izay rehetra lazain’ny vahoaka aminao, satria tsy ianao no laviny, fa izaho no laviny tsy ho mpanjakany.'),
  ('6ab25a155d275a62bbf4e1b0', '2026-09-22T10:36:05.995Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:05.995Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 8, 14, 'Ary halainy ka homeny ho an’ny mpanompony ny tsara indrindra amin’ny sahanareo sy ny tanimboalobokareo ary ny sahan’olivanareo.', 'ary halainy ka homeny ho an’ny mpanompony ny tsara indrindra amin’ny sahanareo sy ny tanimboalobokareo ary ny sahan’olivanareo.'),
  ('6ab25a155d275a62bbf4e1a8', '2026-09-22T10:36:05.995Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:05.995Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 8, 6, 'Ratsy teo imason’i Samoela anefa ny tenin’izy ireo hoe: “Omeo mpanjaka izahay hitsara anay.” Koa nivavaka tamin’i Jehovah izy.', 'ratsy teo imason’i samoela anefa ny tenin’izy ireo hoe: “omeo mpanjaka izahay hitsara anay.” koa nivavaka tamin’i jehovah izy.'),
  ('6ab25a155d275a62bbf4e1aa', '2026-09-22T10:36:05.995Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:05.995Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 8, 8, 'Nahafoy ahy foana izy ireo sady nanompo andriamani-kafa. Ary toy izany foana no efa nataony, hatramin’ny andro nitondrako azy niakatra avy tany Ejipta ka mandraka androany. Izany koa no ataony aminao izao.', 'nahafoy ahy foana izy ireo sady nanompo andriamani-kafa. ary toy izany foana no efa nataony, hatramin’ny andro nitondrako azy niakatra avy tany ejipta ka mandraka androany. izany koa no ataony aminao izao.'),
  ('6ab25a164cbbb4696110c71b', '2026-09-22T10:36:06.755Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:06.755Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 9, 5, 'Ary tonga tany Zofa izy ireo. Dia hoy i Saoly tamin’ilay mpanompo niaraka taminy: “Andao isika hiverina, sao dia tsy ny ampondra intsony no hoeritreretin’ny raiko, fa isika indray no tena hampanahy azy.”', 'ary tonga tany zofa izy ireo. dia hoy i saoly tamin’ilay mpanompo niaraka taminy: “andao isika hiverina, sao dia tsy ny ampondra intsony no hoeritreretin’ny raiko, fa isika indray no tena hampanahy azy.”'),
  ('6ab25a164cbbb4696110c71f', '2026-09-22T10:36:06.755Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:06.755Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 9, 9, '—Toy izao no lazain’ny olona teo amin’ny Israely taloha, rehefa handeha hitady an’Andriamanitra: “Andao ho any amin’ny mpahita.” Mpahita mantsy taloha no fiantsoana ny mpaminany.—', '—toy izao no lazain’ny olona teo amin’ny israely taloha, rehefa handeha hitady an’andriamanitra: “andao ho any amin’ny mpahita.” mpahita mantsy taloha no fiantsoana ny mpaminany.—'),
  ('6ab25a164cbbb4696110c724', '2026-09-22T10:36:06.755Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:06.755Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 9, 14, 'Dia niakatra tao an-tanàna izy ireo. Ary nony tonga teo afovoan-tanàna izy ireo, dia iny i Samoela fa nivoaka hitsena azy mba hiakatra teny amin’ny toerana avo.', 'dia niakatra tao an-tanàna izy ireo. ary nony tonga teo afovoan-tanàna izy ireo, dia iny i samoela fa nivoaka hitsena azy mba hiakatra teny amin’ny toerana avo.'),
  ('6ab25a164cbbb4696110c71c', '2026-09-22T10:36:06.755Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:06.755Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 9, 6, 'Hoy anefa ilay mpanompo: “Azafady, tompoko, fa misy lehilahin’Andriamanitra ao amin’irỳ tanàna irỳ. Hajain’ny olona izy, ary tanteraka avokoa izay lazainy. Andao ho eny, fa angamba izy afaka milaza amintsika izay lalana tokony halehantsika.”', 'hoy anefa ilay mpanompo: “azafady, tompoko, fa misy lehilahin’andriamanitra ao amin’irỳ tanàna irỳ. hajain’ny olona izy, ary tanteraka avokoa izay lazainy. andao ho eny, fa angamba izy afaka milaza amintsika izay lalana tokony halehantsika.”'),
  ('6ab25a164cbbb4696110c71a', '2026-09-22T10:36:06.755Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:06.755Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 9, 4, 'Dia lasa izy nitety ny faritra be tendrombohitr’i Efraima sy ny faritr’i Salisa, nefa tsy nahita an’ireo ampondra. Ary nitety ny faritr’i Salima izy ireo, nefa tsy tany koa ireo ampondra. Nitety ny tanin’ny Benjaminita koa izy, fa tsy nahita.', 'dia lasa izy nitety ny faritra be tendrombohitr’i efraima sy ny faritr’i salisa, nefa tsy nahita an’ireo ampondra. ary nitety ny faritr’i salima izy ireo, nefa tsy tany koa ireo ampondra. nitety ny tanin’ny benjaminita koa izy, fa tsy nahita.'),
  ('6ab25a164cbbb4696110c722', '2026-09-22T10:36:06.755Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:06.755Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 9, 12, 'Dia hoy ireo: “Ao izy. Jereo fa ao alohanao ao izy. Mandehana haingana fa efa tonga eto an-tanàna izy izao. Misy fanaovana sorona ho an’ny olona mantsy eny amin’ny toerana avo anio.', 'dia hoy ireo: “ao izy. jereo fa ao alohanao ao izy. mandehana haingana fa efa tonga eto an-tanàna izy izao. misy fanaovana sorona ho an’ny olona mantsy eny amin’ny toerana avo anio.'),
  ('6ab25a164cbbb4696110c71e', '2026-09-22T10:36:06.755Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:06.755Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 9, 8, 'Dia namaly indray ilay mpanompo hoe: “Misy ampahefatry ny sekely volafotsy atỳ amiko. Homeko an’ilay lehilahin’Andriamanitra izany, dia holazainy amintsika izay lalana tokony halehantsika.”', 'dia namaly indray ilay mpanompo hoe: “misy ampahefatry ny sekely volafotsy atỳ amiko. homeko an’ilay lehilahin’andriamanitra izany, dia holazainy amintsika izay lalana tokony halehantsika.”'),
  ('6ab25a164cbbb4696110c723', '2026-09-22T10:36:06.755Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:06.755Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 9, 13, 'Raha vao miditra ao an-tanàna ianareo, dia hahita azy, alohan’ny hiakarany hisakafo eny amin’ny toerana avo. Tsy afaka misakafo mantsy ny olona mandra-pahatongany, fa izy no manao fisaorana ny amin’ny sorona. Aorian’izay vao mahazo misakafo ireo nasaina. Koa miakara, fa izao dia izao izy no ho hitanareo.”', 'raha vao miditra ao an-tanàna ianareo, dia hahita azy, alohan’ny hiakarany hisakafo eny amin’ny toerana avo. tsy afaka misakafo mantsy ny olona mandra-pahatongany, fa izy no manao fisaorana ny amin’ny sorona. aorian’izay vao mahazo misakafo ireo nasaina. koa miakara, fa izao dia izao izy no ho hitanareo.”'),
  ('6ab25a164cbbb4696110c718', '2026-09-22T10:36:06.755Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:06.755Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 9, 2, 'Nanan-janakalahy atao hoe Saoly izy. Mbola tanora i Saoly sady tsara tarehy, ka tsy nisy lehilahy tsara tarehy noho izy teo amin’ny zanak’Israely. Lava be koa izy, ka tsy nisy nihoatra ny sorony ny halavan’ny olona rehetra.', 'nanan-janakalahy atao hoe saoly izy. mbola tanora i saoly sady tsara tarehy, ka tsy nisy lehilahy tsara tarehy noho izy teo amin’ny zanak’israely. lava be koa izy, ka tsy nisy nihoatra ny sorony ny halavan’ny olona rehetra.'),
  ('6ab25a164cbbb4696110c720', '2026-09-22T10:36:06.755Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:06.755Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 9, 10, 'Koa hoy i Saoly tamin’ilay mpanompony: “Marina ny teninao, fa andao ho eny.” Dia nankeny amin’ny tanàna nisy an’ilay lehilahin’Andriamanitra izy ireo.', 'koa hoy i saoly tamin’ilay mpanompony: “marina ny teninao, fa andao ho eny.” dia nankeny amin’ny tanàna nisy an’ilay lehilahin’andriamanitra izy ireo.'),
  ('6ab25a164cbbb4696110c71d', '2026-09-22T10:36:06.755Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:06.755Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 9, 7, 'Dia hoy i Saoly taminy: “Inona anefa no hoentintsika any amin-dralehilahy, raha mankeny isika? Efa lany mantsy ny mofo tao anaty harona, ka tsy misy na inona na inona hoentina ho fanomezana ho an’ilay lehilahin’Andriamanitra. Sa mbola misy inona atỳ amintsika?”', 'dia hoy i saoly taminy: “inona anefa no hoentintsika any amin-dralehilahy, raha mankeny isika? efa lany mantsy ny mofo tao anaty harona, ka tsy misy na inona na inona hoentina ho fanomezana ho an’ilay lehilahin’andriamanitra. sa mbola misy inona atỳ amintsika?”'),
  ('6ab25a164cbbb4696110c719', '2026-09-22T10:36:06.755Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:06.755Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 9, 3, 'Ary very ireo ampondravavin’i Kisy rain’i Saoly, ka hoy izy tamin’i Saoly zanany: “Mitondrà re mpanompo iray miaraka aminao, ka mandehana mitady an’ireo ampondra.”', 'ary very ireo ampondravavin’i kisy rain’i saoly, ka hoy izy tamin’i saoly zanany: “mitondrà re mpanompo iray miaraka aminao, ka mandehana mitady an’ireo ampondra.”'),
  ('6ab25a164cbbb4696110c717', '2026-09-22T10:36:06.755Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:06.755Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 9, 1, 'Ary nisy lehilahy benjaminita iray atao hoe Kisy, zanak’i Abiela, zanak’i Zerora, zanak’i Bekorata, zanak’i Afia, Benjaminita. Mpanankarem-be ralehilahy.', 'ary nisy lehilahy benjaminita iray atao hoe kisy, zanak’i abiela, zanak’i zerora, zanak’i bekorata, zanak’i afia, benjaminita. mpanankarem-be ralehilahy.'),
  ('6ab25a164cbbb4696110c721', '2026-09-22T10:36:06.755Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:06.755Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 9, 11, 'Nony niakatra ny fiakarana nankao an-tanàna izy ireo, dia nahita ankizivavy nivoaka hantsaka, ka niteny hoe: “Ao ve ny mpahita?”', 'nony niakatra ny fiakarana nankao an-tanàna izy ireo, dia nahita ankizivavy nivoaka hantsaka, ka niteny hoe: “ao ve ny mpahita?”'),
  ('6ab25a164cbbb4696110c72d', '2026-09-22T10:36:06.756Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:06.756Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 9, 23, 'Ary hoy i Samoela tamin’ny mpahandro nony avy eo: “Omeo atỳ ilay hena nomeko anao, izay efa nasaiko natokanao.”', 'ary hoy i samoela tamin’ny mpahandro nony avy eo: “omeo atỳ ilay hena nomeko anao, izay efa nasaiko natokanao.”'),
  ('6ab25a164cbbb4696110c726', '2026-09-22T10:36:06.756Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:06.756Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 9, 16, '“Rahampitso tokotokony ho amin’ny ora toy izao, dia halefako atỳ aminao ny lehilahy iray avy any amin’ny tanin’i Benjamina. Koa hosory ho mpitarika ny Israely oloko izy. Hamonjy ny oloko eo an-tanan’ny Filistinina izy, satria efa hitako ny fahorian’ny oloko ary efa tonga atỳ amiko ny fitarainany.”', '“rahampitso tokotokony ho amin’ny ora toy izao, dia halefako atỳ aminao ny lehilahy iray avy any amin’ny tanin’i benjamina. koa hosory ho mpitarika ny israely oloko izy. hamonjy ny oloko eo an-tanan’ny filistinina izy, satria efa hitako ny fahorian’ny oloko ary efa tonga atỳ amiko ny fitarainany.”'),
  ('6ab25a164cbbb4696110c725', '2026-09-22T10:36:06.756Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:06.756Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 9, 15, 'Ny omalin’ny nahatongavan’i Saoly anefa, dia efa nanambara tamin’i Samoela i Jehovah hoe:', 'ny omalin’ny nahatongavan’i saoly anefa, dia efa nanambara tamin’i samoela i jehovah hoe:'),
  ('6ab25a164cbbb4696110c72f', '2026-09-22T10:36:06.756Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:06.756Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 9, 25, 'Niala teo amin’ilay toerana avo izy ireo avy eo, ka nidina nankeny an-tanàna. Ary mbola niresaka tamin’i Saoly teo an-tampon-trano i Samoela.', 'niala teo amin’ilay toerana avo izy ireo avy eo, ka nidina nankeny an-tanàna. ary mbola niresaka tamin’i saoly teo an-tampon-trano i samoela.'),
  ('6ab25a164cbbb4696110c727', '2026-09-22T10:36:06.756Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:06.756Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 9, 17, 'Dia nahita an’i Saoly i Samoela, ary i Jehovah niteny taminy hoe: “Io ilay lehilahy nolazaiko taminao hoe: ‘Izy no hifehy ny oloko.’”', 'dia nahita an’i saoly i samoela, ary i jehovah niteny taminy hoe: “io ilay lehilahy nolazaiko taminao hoe: ‘izy no hifehy ny oloko.’”'),
  ('6ab25a164cbbb4696110c72e', '2026-09-22T10:36:06.756Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:06.756Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 9, 24, 'Koa nalain’ny mpahandro ilay feny sy ny hena niaraka taminy, ka nataony teo anoloan’i Saoly. Ary hoy i Samoela: “Io ilay natokana, ka ataovy eo anoloanao ary hano, fa ho amin’ity fotoana voatondro ity no nanokanana azy io ho anao, mba hiara-misakafo amin’izay nasaina ianao.” Koa niara-nisakafo tamin’i Samoela i Saoly tamin’iny andro iny.', 'koa nalain’ny mpahandro ilay feny sy ny hena niaraka taminy, ka nataony teo anoloan’i saoly. ary hoy i samoela: “io ilay natokana, ka ataovy eo anoloanao ary hano, fa ho amin’ity fotoana voatondro ity no nanokanana azy io ho anao, mba hiara-misakafo amin’izay nasaina ianao.” koa niara-nisakafo tamin’i samoela i saoly tamin’iny andro iny.'),
  ('6ab25a164cbbb4696110c728', '2026-09-22T10:36:06.756Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:06.756Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 9, 18, 'Ary nanatona an’i Samoela teo am-bavahady i Saoly, ka niteny hoe: “Mba atoroy ahy kely ny tranon’ny mpahita.”', 'ary nanatona an’i samoela teo am-bavahady i saoly, ka niteny hoe: “mba atoroy ahy kely ny tranon’ny mpahita.”'),
  ('6ab25a164cbbb4696110c731', '2026-09-22T10:36:06.756Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:06.756Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 9, 27, 'Nony nidina nanaraka ny sisin’ny tanàna izy ireo, dia hoy i Samoela tamin’i Saoly: “Asaivo mialoha antsika ilay mpanompo, fa ianao kosa mijanòna mba hilazako ny tenin’Andriamanitra.” Koa lasa ilay mpanompo.', 'nony nidina nanaraka ny sisin’ny tanàna izy ireo, dia hoy i samoela tamin’i saoly: “asaivo mialoha antsika ilay mpanompo, fa ianao kosa mijanòna mba hilazako ny tenin’andriamanitra.” koa lasa ilay mpanompo.'),
  ('6ab25a164cbbb4696110c730', '2026-09-22T10:36:06.756Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:06.756Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 9, 26, 'Ary nifoha maraina izy ireo. Koa raha vao nazava ratsy ny andro, dia niantso an’i Saoly teo an-tampon-trano i Samoela, nanao hoe: “Mitsangàna, fa halefako hody ianao.” Dia nitsangana i Saoly, ary nivoaka ny trano izy sy Samoela.', 'ary nifoha maraina izy ireo. koa raha vao nazava ratsy ny andro, dia niantso an’i saoly teo an-tampon-trano i samoela, nanao hoe: “mitsangàna, fa halefako hody ianao.” dia nitsangana i saoly, ary nivoaka ny trano izy sy samoela.'),
  ('6ab25a164cbbb4696110c72c', '2026-09-22T10:36:06.756Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:06.756Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 9, 22, 'Ary nalain’i Samoela i Saoly sy ny mpanompony, dia nentiny tao amin’ny efitra fisakafoana ka nomeny ny toerana mihaja indrindra teo amin’izay nasaina. Tokony ho telopolo lahy izy ireo no tao.', 'ary nalain’i samoela i saoly sy ny mpanompony, dia nentiny tao amin’ny efitra fisakafoana ka nomeny ny toerana mihaja indrindra teo amin’izay nasaina. tokony ho telopolo lahy izy ireo no tao.'),
  ('6ab25a164cbbb4696110c72a', '2026-09-22T10:36:06.756Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:06.756Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 9, 20, 'Aza manahy kosa ny amin’ny ampondranao very efa telo andro izay, fa efa hita ireny. Ary an’iza moa ny zava-tsarobidy rehetra eo amin’ny Israely? Tsy anao sy ny ankohonan-drainao manontolo ve?”', 'aza manahy kosa ny amin’ny ampondranao very efa telo andro izay, fa efa hita ireny. ary an’iza moa ny zava-tsarobidy rehetra eo amin’ny israely? tsy anao sy ny ankohonan-drainao manontolo ve?”'),
  ('6ab25a164cbbb4696110c72b', '2026-09-22T10:36:06.756Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:06.756Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 9, 21, 'Dia hoy i Saoly: “Tsy Benjaminita avy amin’ny foko kely indrindran’ny Israely ve aho? Ary tsy ny fianakaviako ve no tsy manan-danja indrindra amin’ny fianakaviana rehetran’ny fokon’i Benjamina? Koa nahoana ianao no miteny toy izany amiko?”', 'dia hoy i saoly: “tsy benjaminita avy amin’ny foko kely indrindran’ny israely ve aho? ary tsy ny fianakaviako ve no tsy manan-danja indrindra amin’ny fianakaviana rehetran’ny fokon’i benjamina? koa nahoana ianao no miteny toy izany amiko?”'),
  ('6ab25a164cbbb4696110c729', '2026-09-22T10:36:06.756Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:06.756Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 9, 19, 'Koa hoy i Samoela: “Izaho ilay mpahita. Miakara eo alohako ho eny amin’ny toerana avo, fa hiara-misakafo amiko ianareo anio. Dia halefako ianao rahampitso maraina, ary holazaiko aminao izay rehetra ao am-ponao.', 'koa hoy i samoela: “izaho ilay mpahita. miakara eo alohako ho eny amin’ny toerana avo, fa hiara-misakafo amiko ianareo anio. dia halefako ianao rahampitso maraina, ary holazaiko aminao izay rehetra ao am-ponao.'),
  ('6ab25a17ee0e8cbf32262b12', '2026-09-22T10:36:07.318Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:07.318Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 10, 2, 'Rehefa miala eto amiko ianao anio, dia hahita lehilahy roa eo akaikin’ny fasan’i Rahely, ao Zelza any amin’ny faritanin’i Benjamina. Ary hilaza aminao izy ireo hoe: ‘Efa hita ireo ampondravavy notadiavinao, ary tsy ny ampondra intsony izao no eritreretin-drainao, fa ianareo indray no mampanahy azy, ka hoy izy: “Ahoana re no hataoko momba an’izay zanako izay e?”’', 'rehefa miala eto amiko ianao anio, dia hahita lehilahy roa eo akaikin’ny fasan’i rahely, ao zelza any amin’ny faritanin’i benjamina. ary hilaza aminao izy ireo hoe: ‘efa hita ireo ampondravavy notadiavinao, ary tsy ny ampondra intsony izao no eritreretin-drainao, fa ianareo indray no mampanahy azy, ka hoy izy: “ahoana re no hataoko momba an’izay zanako izay e?”’'),
  ('6ab25a17ee0e8cbf32262b2b', '2026-09-22T10:36:07.318Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:07.318Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 10, 27, 'Nilaza kosa anefa ireo lehilahy tsy manjary hoe: “Ahoana koa no hamonjen’ilehio antsika?” Dia nanamavo an’i Saoly izy ireo, ary tsy mba nitondra fanomezana ho azy. Tsy niteny mihitsy anefa i Saoly fa toy ny olona moana.', 'nilaza kosa anefa ireo lehilahy tsy manjary hoe: “ahoana koa no hamonjen’ilehio antsika?” dia nanamavo an’i saoly izy ireo, ary tsy mba nitondra fanomezana ho azy. tsy niteny mihitsy anefa i saoly fa toy ny olona moana.'),
  ('6ab25a17ee0e8cbf32262b16', '2026-09-22T10:36:07.318Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:07.318Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 10, 6, 'Ary hiasa aminao ny fanahin’i Jehovah, ka hiteny toy ny mpaminany miaraka amin’izy ireo eo ianao, sady hovana ho olom-baovao.', 'ary hiasa aminao ny fanahin’i jehovah, ka hiteny toy ny mpaminany miaraka amin’izy ireo eo ianao, sady hovana ho olom-baovao.'),
  ('6ab25a17ee0e8cbf32262b14', '2026-09-22T10:36:07.318Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:07.318Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 10, 4, 'Dia hanontany ny fahasalamanao izy ireo, ary hanome anao mofo roa. Koa raiso avy eny an-tanany izany.', 'dia hanontany ny fahasalamanao izy ireo, ary hanome anao mofo roa. koa raiso avy eny an-tanany izany.'),
  ('6ab25a17ee0e8cbf32262b1e', '2026-09-22T10:36:07.318Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:07.318Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 10, 14, 'Ary hoy ny rahalahin-drain’i Saoly taminy sy tamin’ilay mpanompony: “Fa taiza ianareo?” Dia namaly izy hoe: “Nitady an’ireo ampondravavy izahay, ary nandeha nitady foana nefa tsy tany ireo ampondra. Koa nankany amin’i Samoela izahay.”', 'ary hoy ny rahalahin-drain’i saoly taminy sy tamin’ilay mpanompony: “fa taiza ianareo?” dia namaly izy hoe: “nitady an’ireo ampondravavy izahay, ary nandeha nitady foana nefa tsy tany ireo ampondra. koa nankany amin’i samoela izahay.”'),
  ('6ab25a17ee0e8cbf32262b27', '2026-09-22T10:36:07.318Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:07.318Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 10, 23, 'Koa nihazakazaka naka azy avy tao izy ireo. Ary rehefa nijoro teo afovoan’ny olona izy, dia lava be ka tsy nisy nihoatra ny sorony ny halavan’ny olona rehetra.', 'koa nihazakazaka naka azy avy tao izy ireo. ary rehefa nijoro teo afovoan’ny olona izy, dia lava be ka tsy nisy nihoatra ny sorony ny halavan’ny olona rehetra.'),
  ('6ab25a17ee0e8cbf32262b21', '2026-09-22T10:36:07.318Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:07.318Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 10, 17, 'Ary i Samoela namory ny vahoaka hankeo anatrehan’i Jehovah tao Mizpa,', 'ary i samoela namory ny vahoaka hankeo anatrehan’i jehovah tao mizpa,'),
  ('6ab25a17ee0e8cbf32262b18', '2026-09-22T10:36:07.318Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:07.318Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 10, 8, 'Ary midìna hialoha ahy any Gilgala, fa hidina hankany aminao aho mba hanolotra sorona dorana sy sorona iombonana. Dia miandrasa fito andro mandra-pahatongako any aminao, fa hampahafantariko anao izay tokony hataonao.”', 'ary midìna hialoha ahy any gilgala, fa hidina hankany aminao aho mba hanolotra sorona dorana sy sorona iombonana. dia miandrasa fito andro mandra-pahatongako any aminao, fa hampahafantariko anao izay tokony hataonao.”'),
  ('6ab25a17ee0e8cbf32262b2a', '2026-09-22T10:36:07.318Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:07.318Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 10, 26, 'Nody tany an-tranony tany Gibea kosa i Saoly. Ary niaraka taminy ireo lehilahy mahery fo, satria nanohina ny fon’izy ireo Andriamanitra.', 'nody tany an-tranony tany gibea kosa i saoly. ary niaraka taminy ireo lehilahy mahery fo, satria nanohina ny fon’izy ireo andriamanitra.'),
  ('6ab25a17ee0e8cbf32262b26', '2026-09-22T10:36:07.318Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:07.318Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 10, 22, 'Koa nanontany an’i Jehovah indray izy ireo hoe: “Efa tonga eto ve ralehilahy e?” Dia hoy i Jehovah: “Io miafina ao amin’ny entana io izy.”', 'koa nanontany an’i jehovah indray izy ireo hoe: “efa tonga eto ve ralehilahy e?” dia hoy i jehovah: “io miafina ao amin’ny entana io izy.”'),
  ('6ab25a17ee0e8cbf32262b19', '2026-09-22T10:36:07.318Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:07.318Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 10, 9, 'Koa raha vao nihodina niala teo amin’i Samoela izy, dia novan’Andriamanitra ho hafa ny fony. Ary tanteraka daholo ireo famantarana ireo tamin’iny andro iny.', 'koa raha vao nihodina niala teo amin’i samoela izy, dia novan’andriamanitra ho hafa ny fony. ary tanteraka daholo ireo famantarana ireo tamin’iny andro iny.'),
  ('6ab25a17ee0e8cbf32262b22', '2026-09-22T10:36:07.318Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:07.318Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 10, 18, 'ka niteny tamin’ny zanak’Israely hoe: “Izao no nolazain’i Jehovah Andriamanitry ny Israely: ‘Izaho no nitondra ny Israely niakatra avy tany Ejipta, sy nanafaka anareo teo an-tanan’i Ejipta sy teo an-tanan’ireo fanjakana rehetra nampahory anareo.', 'ka niteny tamin’ny zanak’israely hoe: “izao no nolazain’i jehovah andriamanitry ny israely: ‘izaho no nitondra ny israely niakatra avy tany ejipta, sy nanafaka anareo teo an-tanan’i ejipta sy teo an-tanan’ireo fanjakana rehetra nampahory anareo.'),
  ('6ab25a17ee0e8cbf32262b1d', '2026-09-22T10:36:07.318Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:07.318Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 10, 13, 'Farany, dia tsy niteny toy ny mpaminany intsony izy, ary tonga teny amin’ny toerana avo.', 'farany, dia tsy niteny toy ny mpaminany intsony izy, ary tonga teny amin’ny toerana avo.'),
  ('6ab25a17ee0e8cbf32262b20', '2026-09-22T10:36:07.318Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:07.318Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 10, 16, 'Koa hoy i Saoly taminy: “Nilaza marimarina taminay izy fa efa hita ireo ampondra.” Tsy noresahiny taminy anefa ny amin’ilay fanjakana nolazain’i Samoela.', 'koa hoy i saoly taminy: “nilaza marimarina taminay izy fa efa hita ireo ampondra.” tsy noresahiny taminy anefa ny amin’ilay fanjakana nolazain’i samoela.'),
  ('6ab25a17ee0e8cbf32262b25', '2026-09-22T10:36:07.318Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:07.318Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 10, 21, 'Ary nasainy nanatona araka ny fianakaviany avy ny fokon’i Benjamina, ka ny fianakavian’ny Matrita no voafidy. Farany, dia i Saoly zanak’i Kisy no voafidy. Ary notadiavin’ny olona izy, nefa tsy hita.', 'ary nasainy nanatona araka ny fianakaviany avy ny fokon’i benjamina, ka ny fianakavian’ny matrita no voafidy. farany, dia i saoly zanak’i kisy no voafidy. ary notadiavin’ny olona izy, nefa tsy hita.'),
  ('6ab25a17ee0e8cbf32262b11', '2026-09-22T10:36:07.318Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:07.318Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 10, 1, 'Dia naka ny menaka tao anaty tavoara kely i Samoela, ka nandraraka izany teo amin’ny lohan’i Saoly sady nanoroka azy, ary niteny hoe: “Nohosoran’i Jehovah tokoa ianao, mba ho mpitarika eo amin’ny lovany.', 'dia naka ny menaka tao anaty tavoara kely i samoela, ka nandraraka izany teo amin’ny lohan’i saoly sady nanoroka azy, ary niteny hoe: “nohosoran’i jehovah tokoa ianao, mba ho mpitarika eo amin’ny lovany.'),
  ('6ab25a17ee0e8cbf32262b29', '2026-09-22T10:36:07.318Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:07.318Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 10, 25, 'Dia nolazain’i Samoela tamin’ny vahoaka ny zo ara-dalàna ananan’ny mpanjaka, ka nosoratany tao amin’ny boky ary napetrany teo anatrehan’i Jehovah. Ary nalefan’i Samoela hody tany an-tranony avy ny olona rehetra.', 'dia nolazain’i samoela tamin’ny vahoaka ny zo ara-dalàna ananan’ny mpanjaka, ka nosoratany tao amin’ny boky ary napetrany teo anatrehan’i jehovah. ary nalefan’i samoela hody tany an-tranony avy ny olona rehetra.'),
  ('6ab25a17ee0e8cbf32262b24', '2026-09-22T10:36:07.318Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:07.318Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 10, 20, 'Dia nampanatonin’i Samoela ny foko rehetran’ny Israely, ka ny fokon’i Benjamina no voafidy.', 'dia nampanatonin’i samoela ny foko rehetran’ny israely, ka ny fokon’i benjamina no voafidy.'),
  ('6ab25a17ee0e8cbf32262b1b', '2026-09-22T10:36:07.318Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:07.318Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 10, 11, 'Ary izay rehetra nahafantatra azy taloha, dia nahita azy naminany niaraka tamin’ny mpaminany. Koa nifampiresaka ny olona hoe: “Fa naninona ity zanak’i Kisy? Anisan’ny mpaminany koa angaha i Saoly?”', 'ary izay rehetra nahafantatra azy taloha, dia nahita azy naminany niaraka tamin’ny mpaminany. koa nifampiresaka ny olona hoe: “fa naninona ity zanak’i kisy? anisan’ny mpaminany koa angaha i saoly?”'),
  ('6ab25a17ee0e8cbf32262b1c', '2026-09-22T10:36:07.318Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:07.318Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 10, 12, 'Ary nisy olona teo niteny hoe: “Fa iza no rain’ireo e?” Izany no nahatonga ilay fitenenana hoe: “Anisan’ny mpaminany koa angaha i Saoly?”', 'ary nisy olona teo niteny hoe: “fa iza no rain’ireo e?” izany no nahatonga ilay fitenenana hoe: “anisan’ny mpaminany koa angaha i saoly?”'),
  ('6ab25a17ee0e8cbf32262b1a', '2026-09-22T10:36:07.318Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:07.318Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 10, 10, 'Dia lasa nankeny amin’ilay havoana izy ireo, ka nifanena tamin’ny mpaminany maromaro. Koa niasa tamin’i Saoly avy hatrany ny fanahin’Andriamanitra, ka niteny toy ny mpaminany teo amin’ireo izy.', 'dia lasa nankeny amin’ilay havoana izy ireo, ka nifanena tamin’ny mpaminany maromaro. koa niasa tamin’i saoly avy hatrany ny fanahin’andriamanitra, ka niteny toy ny mpaminany teo amin’ireo izy.'),
  ('6ab25a17ee0e8cbf32262b28', '2026-09-22T10:36:07.318Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:07.318Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 10, 24, 'Dia hoy i Samoela tamin’ny olona rehetra: “Hitanareo ve ilay nofidin’i Jehovah, fa tsy misy tahaka azy amin’ny olona rehetra?” Koa nihorakoraka izy rehetra hoe: “Ho ela velona anie ny mpanjaka!”', 'dia hoy i samoela tamin’ny olona rehetra: “hitanareo ve ilay nofidin’i jehovah, fa tsy misy tahaka azy amin’ny olona rehetra?” koa nihorakoraka izy rehetra hoe: “ho ela velona anie ny mpanjaka!”'),
  ('6ab25a17ee0e8cbf32262b23', '2026-09-22T10:36:07.318Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:07.318Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 10, 19, 'Kanefa efa nolavinareo androany ny Andriamanitrareo, izay namonjy anareo tamin’ny loza sy ny fahoriana rehetra nanjo anareo. Dia mbola niteny ihany ianareo hoe: “Tsia, fa manendre mpanjaka hifehy anay.” Koa mijoroa eo anatrehan’i Jehovah, araka ny fizarazaranareo isam-poko sy isaky ny arivo.’”', 'kanefa efa nolavinareo androany ny andriamanitrareo, izay namonjy anareo tamin’ny loza sy ny fahoriana rehetra nanjo anareo. dia mbola niteny ihany ianareo hoe: “tsia, fa manendre mpanjaka hifehy anay.” koa mijoroa eo anatrehan’i jehovah, araka ny fizarazaranareo isam-poko sy isaky ny arivo.’”'),
  ('6ab25a17ee0e8cbf32262b1f', '2026-09-22T10:36:07.318Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:07.318Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 10, 15, 'Dia hoy ilay dadatoan’i Saoly: “Mba lazao ahy izay nambaran’i Samoela taminareo!”', 'dia hoy ilay dadatoan’i saoly: “mba lazao ahy izay nambaran’i samoela taminareo!”'),
  ('6ab25a17ee0e8cbf32262b17', '2026-09-22T10:36:07.318Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:07.318Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 10, 7, 'Rehefa mitranga aminao ireo famantarana ireo, dia ataovy izay azon’ny tananao atao, fa momba anao Andriamanitra.', 'rehefa mitranga aminao ireo famantarana ireo, dia ataovy izay azon’ny tananao atao, fa momba anao andriamanitra.'),
  ('6ab25a17ee0e8cbf32262b15', '2026-09-22T10:36:07.318Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:07.318Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 10, 5, 'Aorian’izay ianao dia ho tonga eo amin’ny havoanan’Andriamanitra, izay misy toby miaramilan’ny Filistinina. Koa rehefa tonga eo ianao, izany hoe rehefa ao an-tanàna, dia hifanena amin’ny mpaminany maromaro midina avy eny amin’ny toerana avo. Ary eo alohan’izy ireo hisy olona mitondra lokanga sy ampongatapaka sy sodina ary harpa, raha mbola miteny toy ny mpaminany izy ireo.', 'aorian’izay ianao dia ho tonga eo amin’ny havoanan’andriamanitra, izay misy toby miaramilan’ny filistinina. koa rehefa tonga eo ianao, izany hoe rehefa ao an-tanàna, dia hifanena amin’ny mpaminany maromaro midina avy eny amin’ny toerana avo. ary eo alohan’izy ireo hisy olona mitondra lokanga sy ampongatapaka sy sodina ary harpa, raha mbola miteny toy ny mpaminany izy ireo.'),
  ('6ab25a17ee0e8cbf32262b13', '2026-09-22T10:36:07.318Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:07.318Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 10, 3, 'Ary mandehana lavidavitra kokoa, hatrany amin’ilay hazobe ao Tabara. Dia hisy olona telo lahy hifanena aminao eo, hiakatra hitady an’Andriamanitra any Betela, ka ny iray mitondra zanak’osy telo, ny iray mitondra mofo boribory telo, ary ny iray kosa mitondra divay eran’ny siny lehibe.', 'ary mandehana lavidavitra kokoa, hatrany amin’ilay hazobe ao tabara. dia hisy olona telo lahy hifanena aminao eo, hiakatra hitady an’andriamanitra any betela, ka ny iray mitondra zanak’osy telo, ny iray mitondra mofo boribory telo, ary ny iray kosa mitondra divay eran’ny siny lehibe.'),
  ('6ab25a175f4edc6088229c13', '2026-09-22T10:36:07.988Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:07.988Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 11, 7, 'Dia naka omby roa izy, ka norasarasainy ary nampitondrainy an’ireo iraka ho any amin’ny faritra rehetran’ny Israely. Ary hoy izy: “Na iza na iza amintsika tsy mivoaka hanaraka an’i Saoly sy Samoela, dia toy izao no hatao amin’ny ombiny!” Koa natahotra mafy an’i Jehovah ny olona, ka niainga toy ny olona iray.', 'dia naka omby roa izy, ka norasarasainy ary nampitondrainy an’ireo iraka ho any amin’ny faritra rehetran’ny israely. ary hoy izy: “na iza na iza amintsika tsy mivoaka hanaraka an’i saoly sy samoela, dia toy izao no hatao amin’ny ombiny!” koa natahotra mafy an’i jehovah ny olona, ka niainga toy ny olona iray.'),
  ('6ab25a175f4edc6088229c12', '2026-09-22T10:36:07.988Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:07.988Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 11, 6, 'Nony ren’i Saoly izany teny izany, dia niasa taminy ny fanahin’Andriamanitra, ka tezitra mafy izy.', 'nony ren’i saoly izany teny izany, dia niasa taminy ny fanahin’andriamanitra, ka tezitra mafy izy.'),
  ('6ab25a175f4edc6088229c10', '2026-09-22T10:36:07.988Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:07.988Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 11, 4, 'Ary tonga tao Gibean’i Saoly ireo iraka, ka nilaza ireo teny ireo tamin’ny olona. Dia nidradradradra nitomany ny olona rehetra.', 'ary tonga tao gibean’i saoly ireo iraka, ka nilaza ireo teny ireo tamin’ny olona. dia nidradradradra nitomany ny olona rehetra.'),
  ('6ab25a175f4edc6088229c14', '2026-09-22T10:36:07.988Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:07.988Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 11, 8, 'Dia nisain’i Saoly tao Bezeka izy ireo, ka telo hetsy ny zanak’Israely, ary telo alina ny lehilahy anisan’ny fokon’i Joda.', 'dia nisain’i saoly tao bezeka izy ireo, ka telo hetsy ny zanak’israely, ary telo alina ny lehilahy anisan’ny fokon’i joda.'),
  ('6ab25a175f4edc6088229c11', '2026-09-22T10:36:07.988Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:07.988Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 11, 5, 'Tamin’izay indrindra i Saoly no tonga avy any an-tsaha nandroaka omby, ka nanao hoe: “Fa maninona ny olona no mitomany?” Dia nolazain’izy ireo taminy ny tenin’ny olona avy ao Jabesy.', 'tamin’izay indrindra i saoly no tonga avy any an-tsaha nandroaka omby, ka nanao hoe: “fa maninona ny olona no mitomany?” dia nolazain’izy ireo taminy ny tenin’ny olona avy ao jabesy.'),
  ('6ab25a175f4edc6088229c15', '2026-09-22T10:36:07.988Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:07.988Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 11, 9, 'Ary hoy izy ireo tamin’ireo iraka tonga teo: “Izao no holazainareo amin’ireo lehilahy ao Jabesy any Gileada: ‘Hisy famonjena ho anareo rahampitso, amin’ny mitataovovonana.’” * Dia tonga nilaza izany tamin’ireo lehilahy tao Jabesy ny iraka, ka faly ireo.', 'ary hoy izy ireo tamin’ireo iraka tonga teo: “izao no holazainareo amin’ireo lehilahy ao jabesy any gileada: ‘hisy famonjena ho anareo rahampitso, amin’ny mitataovovonana.’” * dia tonga nilaza izany tamin’ireo lehilahy tao jabesy ny iraka, ka faly ireo.'),
  ('6ab25a175f4edc6088229c0f', '2026-09-22T10:36:07.988Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:07.988Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 11, 3, 'Dia hoy ny anti-panahin’i Jabesy: “Omeo fito andro aloha izahay, fa handefa iraka any amin’ny faritra rehetran’ny Israely. Koa raha tsy misy mamonjy anay, dia hitolo-batana aminao izahay.”', 'dia hoy ny anti-panahin’i jabesy: “omeo fito andro aloha izahay, fa handefa iraka any amin’ny faritra rehetran’ny israely. koa raha tsy misy mamonjy anay, dia hitolo-batana aminao izahay.”'),
  ('6ab25a175f4edc6088229c0d', '2026-09-22T10:36:07.988Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:07.988Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 11, 1, 'Ary niakatra i Nahasy Amonita ka nitoby hamely an’i Jabesy any Gileada. Dia hoy ny lehilahy rehetra tao Jabesy tamin’i Nahasy: “Manaova fifanekena aminay mba hanompoanay anao.”', 'ary niakatra i nahasy amonita ka nitoby hamely an’i jabesy any gileada. dia hoy ny lehilahy rehetra tao jabesy tamin’i nahasy: “manaova fifanekena aminay mba hanompoanay anao.”'),
  ('6ab25a175f4edc6088229c0e', '2026-09-22T10:36:07.988Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:07.988Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 11, 2, 'Ary hoy i Nahasy Amonita: “Hanao fifanekena aminareo aho raha toa ka hopotsirina daholo ny masonareo ankavanana, ka ataoko fanalam-baraka ny Israely rehetra izany.”', 'ary hoy i nahasy amonita: “hanao fifanekena aminareo aho raha toa ka hopotsirina daholo ny masonareo ankavanana, ka ataoko fanalam-baraka ny israely rehetra izany.”'),
  ('6ab25a175f4edc6088229c19', '2026-09-22T10:36:07.989Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:07.989Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 11, 13, 'Hoy anefa i Saoly: “Tsy misy olona hovonoina ho faty anio, satria androany i Jehovah no nanao famonjena teo amin’ny Israely.”', 'hoy anefa i saoly: “tsy misy olona hovonoina ho faty anio, satria androany i jehovah no nanao famonjena teo amin’ny israely.”'),
  ('6ab25a175f4edc6088229c1a', '2026-09-22T10:36:07.989Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:07.989Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 11, 14, 'Hoy i Samoela tamin’ny olona nony avy eo: “Andao ho any Gilgala fa any isika no hanavao ny fanjakana.”', 'hoy i samoela tamin’ny olona nony avy eo: “andao ho any gilgala fa any isika no hanavao ny fanjakana.”'),
  ('6ab25a175f4edc6088229c18', '2026-09-22T10:36:07.989Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:07.989Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 11, 12, 'Koa hoy ny olona tamin’i Samoela: “Iza no milaza hoe: ‘Saoly ve no ho mpanjakanay?’ Atolory ireny olona ireny hovonoinay ho faty.”', 'koa hoy ny olona tamin’i samoela: “iza no milaza hoe: ‘saoly ve no ho mpanjakanay?’ atolory ireny olona ireny hovonoinay ho faty.”'),
  ('6ab25a175f4edc6088229c16', '2026-09-22T10:36:07.989Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:07.989Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 11, 10, 'Koa hoy ireo lehilahy tao Jabesy tamin’ny Amonita: “Hitolo-batana aminareo izahay rahampitso, ka ataovy aminay izay hitanareo fa mety.”', 'koa hoy ireo lehilahy tao jabesy tamin’ny amonita: “hitolo-batana aminareo izahay rahampitso, ka ataovy aminay izay hitanareo fa mety.”'),
  ('6ab25a175f4edc6088229c1b', '2026-09-22T10:36:07.989Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:07.989Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 11, 15, 'Koa nankany Gilgala ny olona rehetra. Ary tao i Saoly no nataony mpanjaka teo anatrehan’i Jehovah. Dia nanolotra sorona iombonana teo anatrehan’i Jehovah izy ireo tao, ka nifaly aoka izany i Saoly sy ny Israelita rehetra.', 'koa nankany gilgala ny olona rehetra. ary tao i saoly no nataony mpanjaka teo anatrehan’i jehovah. dia nanolotra sorona iombonana teo anatrehan’i jehovah izy ireo tao, ka nifaly aoka izany i saoly sy ny israelita rehetra.'),
  ('6ab25a175f4edc6088229c17', '2026-09-22T10:36:07.989Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:07.989Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 11, 11, 'Nozarain’i Saoly ho telo toko ny olona ny ampitso. Dia tafiditra tao an-toby izy ireo tamin’ny fiambenana maraina, ka namono an’ireo Amonita mandra-pahafanan’ny andro. Ary niparitaka izay sisa tavela tamin’ny Amonita ka tsy nisy tafaraka na roa monja aza.', 'nozarain’i saoly ho telo toko ny olona ny ampitso. dia tafiditra tao an-toby izy ireo tamin’ny fiambenana maraina, ka namono an’ireo amonita mandra-pahafanan’ny andro. ary niparitaka izay sisa tavela tamin’ny amonita ka tsy nisy tafaraka na roa monja aza.'),
  ('6ab25a186612a20540e6879b', '2026-09-22T10:36:08.471Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:08.471Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 12, 20, 'Koa hoy i Samoela tamin’ny vahoaka: “Aza matahotra. Nanao izany zava-dratsy rehetra izany tokoa ianareo, fa izao fotsiny: Manaraha foana an’i Jehovah fa aza miala aminy, ary manompoa an’i Jehovah amin’ny fonareo manontolo.', 'koa hoy i samoela tamin’ny vahoaka: “aza matahotra. nanao izany zava-dratsy rehetra izany tokoa ianareo, fa izao fotsiny: manaraha foana an’i jehovah fa aza miala aminy, ary manompoa an’i jehovah amin’ny fonareo manontolo.'),
  ('6ab25a186612a20540e68799', '2026-09-22T10:36:08.471Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:08.471Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 12, 18, 'Dia niantso an’i Jehovah i Samoela, ary nampisy kotroka sy orana i Jehovah tamin’iny andro iny. Koa natahotra mafy an’i Jehovah sy Samoela ny vahoaka manontolo.', 'dia niantso an’i jehovah i samoela, ary nampisy kotroka sy orana i jehovah tamin’iny andro iny. koa natahotra mafy an’i jehovah sy samoela ny vahoaka manontolo.'),
  ('6ab25a186612a20540e6878e', '2026-09-22T10:36:08.471Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:08.471Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 12, 7, 'Koa mitsangàna, fa hitsara anareo eo anatrehan’i Jehovah aho, ary hitantara aminareo ny zavatra ara-drariny rehetra nataon’i Jehovah taminareo sy ny razanareo.', 'koa mitsangàna, fa hitsara anareo eo anatrehan’i jehovah aho, ary hitantara aminareo ny zavatra ara-drariny rehetra nataon’i jehovah taminareo sy ny razanareo.'),
  ('6ab25a186612a20540e68793', '2026-09-22T10:36:08.471Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:08.471Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 12, 12, 'Ary rehefa hitanareo fa tonga hanafika anareo i Nahasy mpanjakan’ny taranak’i Amona, dia niteny tamiko foana ianareo hoe: ‘Tsia, fa tokony hisy mpanjaka hifehy anay.’ I Jehovah Andriamanitrareo anefa no Mpanjakanareo hatramin’izay.', 'ary rehefa hitanareo fa tonga hanafika anareo i nahasy mpanjakan’ny taranak’i amona, dia niteny tamiko foana ianareo hoe: ‘tsia, fa tokony hisy mpanjaka hifehy anay.’ i jehovah andriamanitrareo anefa no mpanjakanareo hatramin’izay.'),
  ('6ab25a186612a20540e6878b', '2026-09-22T10:36:08.471Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:08.471Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 12, 4, 'Dia hoy izy ireo: “Tsy nanambaka anay ianao, na nampahory anay, na nanaiky handray na inona na inona avy tamin’iza na iza.”', 'dia hoy izy ireo: “tsy nanambaka anay ianao, na nampahory anay, na nanaiky handray na inona na inona avy tamin’iza na iza.”'),
  ('6ab25a186612a20540e6879f', '2026-09-22T10:36:08.471Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:08.471Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 12, 24, 'Matahora fotsiny an’i Jehovah, ka manompoa azy amim-pahatsorana * sy amin’ny fonareo manontolo, satria jereo ange ireo zavatra lehibe nataony ho anareo e!', 'matahora fotsiny an’i jehovah, ka manompoa azy amim-pahatsorana * sy amin’ny fonareo manontolo, satria jereo ange ireo zavatra lehibe nataony ho anareo e!'),
  ('6ab25a186612a20540e6879e', '2026-09-22T10:36:08.471Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:08.471Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 12, 23, 'Raha ny amiko kosa, dia sanatria ahy ny hanota amin’i Jehovah ka hitsahatra tsy hivavaka ho anareo. Tsy maintsy mampianatra anareo ny lalana tsara sy mahitsy aho.', 'raha ny amiko kosa, dia sanatria ahy ny hanota amin’i jehovah ka hitsahatra tsy hivavaka ho anareo. tsy maintsy mampianatra anareo ny lalana tsara sy mahitsy aho.'),
  ('6ab25a186612a20540e6879d', '2026-09-22T10:36:08.471Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:08.471Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 12, 22, 'Fa tsy hahafoy ny olony i Jehovah, noho ny amin’ny anarany be voninahitra, satria i Jehovah mihitsy no efa nanapa-kevitra hanao anareo ho olony.', 'fa tsy hahafoy ny olony i jehovah, noho ny amin’ny anarany be voninahitra, satria i jehovah mihitsy no efa nanapa-kevitra hanao anareo ho olony.'),
  ('6ab25a186612a20540e6878a', '2026-09-22T10:36:08.471Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:08.471Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 12, 3, 'Koa intỳ aho! Lazao eto anatrehan’i Jehovah sy ny voahosony raha misy iampanganareo ahy: Ombin’iza, na ampondran’iza no nalaiko? Iza no nambakaiko na nampahoriko? Avy tamin’iza no nandraisako tsolotra mba hanampenako ny masoko? Lazao fa honerako aminareo izany.”', 'koa intỳ aho! lazao eto anatrehan’i jehovah sy ny voahosony raha misy iampanganareo ahy: ombin’iza, na ampondran’iza no nalaiko? iza no nambakaiko na nampahoriko? avy tamin’iza no nandraisako tsolotra mba hanampenako ny masoko? lazao fa honerako aminareo izany.”'),
  ('6ab25a186612a20540e68792', '2026-09-22T10:36:08.471Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:08.471Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 12, 11, 'Dia naniraka an’i Jerobala sy Bedana sy Jefta ary Samoela i Jehovah, ka nanafaka anareo teo an-tanan’ny fahavalo manodidina, mba hahatonga anareo tsy hanana ahiahy.', 'dia naniraka an’i jerobala sy bedana sy jefta ary samoela i jehovah, ka nanafaka anareo teo an-tanan’ny fahavalo manodidina, mba hahatonga anareo tsy hanana ahiahy.'),
  ('6ab25a186612a20540e68790', '2026-09-22T10:36:08.471Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:08.471Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 12, 9, 'Nanadino an’i Jehovah Andriamaniny anefa izy ireo, ka namidin’Andriamanitra teo an-tanan’i Sisera lehiben’ny tafik’i Hazora, sy teo an-tanan’ny Filistinina, ary teo an-tanan’ny mpanjakan’i Moaba. Ary niady tamin’izy ireo foana ireny.', 'nanadino an’i jehovah andriamaniny anefa izy ireo, ka namidin’andriamanitra teo an-tanan’i sisera lehiben’ny tafik’i hazora, sy teo an-tanan’ny filistinina, ary teo an-tanan’ny mpanjakan’i moaba. ary niady tamin’izy ireo foana ireny.'),
  ('6ab25a186612a20540e68788', '2026-09-22T10:36:08.471Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:08.471Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 12, 1, 'Farany, dia hoy i Samoela tamin’ny Israely rehetra: “Efa nohenoiko daholo ny teninareo tamiko, rehefa nilaza ianareo hoe tokony hanendry mpanjaka hitondra anareo aho.', 'farany, dia hoy i samoela tamin’ny israely rehetra: “efa nohenoiko daholo ny teninareo tamiko, rehefa nilaza ianareo hoe tokony hanendry mpanjaka hitondra anareo aho.'),
  ('6ab25a186612a20540e68798', '2026-09-22T10:36:08.471Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:08.471Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 12, 17, 'Tsy fotoana fijinjana varimbazaha ve izao? Hiantso an’i Jehovah anefa aho mba hampisy kotroka sy orana. Dia aoka ho fantatrareo sy ho hitanareo fa be dia be ny zava-dratsy nataonareo teo imason’i Jehovah, satria nangataka mpanjaka ho anareo ianareo.”', 'tsy fotoana fijinjana varimbazaha ve izao? hiantso an’i jehovah anefa aho mba hampisy kotroka sy orana. dia aoka ho fantatrareo sy ho hitanareo fa be dia be ny zava-dratsy nataonareo teo imason’i jehovah, satria nangataka mpanjaka ho anareo ianareo.”'),
  ('6ab25a186612a20540e68796', '2026-09-22T10:36:08.471Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:08.471Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 12, 15, 'Fa raha tsy mankatò ny tenin’i Jehovah kosa ianareo ka manohitra ny baikon’i Jehovah, dia hamely anareo sy ny rainareo tokoa ny tanan’i Jehovah.', 'fa raha tsy mankatò ny tenin’i jehovah kosa ianareo ka manohitra ny baikon’i jehovah, dia hamely anareo sy ny rainareo tokoa ny tanan’i jehovah.'),
  ('6ab25a186612a20540e6879c', '2026-09-22T10:36:08.471Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:08.471Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 12, 21, 'Aza mivily hanaraka zava-poana izay tsy mahasoa sady tsy mahavonjy, satria zava-poana ireny.', 'aza mivily hanaraka zava-poana izay tsy mahasoa sady tsy mahavonjy, satria zava-poana ireny.'),
  ('6ab25a186612a20540e68795', '2026-09-22T10:36:08.471Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:08.471Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 12, 14, 'Raha matahotra an’i Jehovah ianareo ka manompo azy tokoa ary mankatò ny teniny, sady tsy manohitra ny baikon’i Jehovah, dia homba anareo sy ny mpanjakanareo i Jehovah Andriamanitrareo.', 'raha matahotra an’i jehovah ianareo ka manompo azy tokoa ary mankatò ny teniny, sady tsy manohitra ny baikon’i jehovah, dia homba anareo sy ny mpanjakanareo i jehovah andriamanitrareo.'),
  ('6ab25a186612a20540e68791', '2026-09-22T10:36:08.471Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:08.471Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 12, 10, 'Dia niantso vonjy tamin’i Jehovah izy ireo, ka nanao hoe: ‘Efa nanota izahay, fa nafoinay i Jehovah mba hanompoanay an’ireo Bala sy ireo sarin’i Astarta. Koa afaho eo an-tanan’ny fahavalonay izahay mba hanompoanay anao.’', 'dia niantso vonjy tamin’i jehovah izy ireo, ka nanao hoe: ‘efa nanota izahay, fa nafoinay i jehovah mba hanompoanay an’ireo bala sy ireo sarin’i astarta. koa afaho eo an-tanan’ny fahavalonay izahay mba hanompoanay anao.’'),
  ('6ab25a186612a20540e6878f', '2026-09-22T10:36:08.471Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:08.471Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 12, 8, '“Raha vao tonga tany Ejipta i Jakoba, ary niantso vonjy tamin’i Jehovah ny razanareo, dia naniraka an’i Mosesy sy Arona i Jehovah mba hitarika ny razanareo hivoaka avy tany Ejipta sy hampitoetra azy teto amin’ity toerana ity.', '“raha vao tonga tany ejipta i jakoba, ary niantso vonjy tamin’i jehovah ny razanareo, dia naniraka an’i mosesy sy arona i jehovah mba hitarika ny razanareo hivoaka avy tany ejipta sy hampitoetra azy teto amin’ity toerana ity.'),
  ('6ab25a186612a20540e6879a', '2026-09-22T10:36:08.471Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:08.471Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 12, 19, 'Ary hoy izy ireo tamin’i Samoela: “Mivavaha amin’i Jehovah Andriamanitrao ho anay mpanomponao, fa tsy te ho faty izahay. Fa nampianay indray ny fahotana rehetra efa vitanay, satria nanao ratsy izahay tamin’ny nangatahanay mpanjaka ho anay.”', 'ary hoy izy ireo tamin’i samoela: “mivavaha amin’i jehovah andriamanitrao ho anay mpanomponao, fa tsy te ho faty izahay. fa nampianay indray ny fahotana rehetra efa vitanay, satria nanao ratsy izahay tamin’ny nangatahanay mpanjaka ho anay.”'),
  ('6ab25a186612a20540e68797', '2026-09-22T10:36:08.471Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:08.471Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 12, 16, 'Koa mijoroa, ka jereo izao zavatra lehibe ataon’i Jehovah eo imasonareo izao:', 'koa mijoroa, ka jereo izao zavatra lehibe ataon’i jehovah eo imasonareo izao:'),
  ('6ab25a186612a20540e6878c', '2026-09-22T10:36:08.471Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:08.471Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 12, 5, 'Koa hoy izy tamin’ireo: “I Jehovah sy ny voahosony no vavolombelona androany, fa tsy naka na inona na inona taminareo aho.” Dia hoy izy ireo: “Eny, vavolombelona izy.”', 'koa hoy izy tamin’ireo: “i jehovah sy ny voahosony no vavolombelona androany, fa tsy naka na inona na inona taminareo aho.” dia hoy izy ireo: “eny, vavolombelona izy.”'),
  ('6ab25a186612a20540e6878d', '2026-09-22T10:36:08.471Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:08.471Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 12, 6, 'Hoy koa i Samoela tamin’ny vahoaka: “I Jehovah no vavolombelona nampiasa an’i Mosesy sy Arona, sady nitondra ny razanareo niakatra avy tany Ejipta.', 'hoy koa i samoela tamin’ny vahoaka: “i jehovah no vavolombelona nampiasa an’i mosesy sy arona, sady nitondra ny razanareo niakatra avy tany ejipta.'),
  ('6ab25a186612a20540e68789', '2026-09-22T10:36:08.471Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:08.471Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 12, 2, 'Koa io àry ilay mpanjaka mitarika anareo! Izaho kosa efa antitra sy fotsy volo, ary indreo ny zanako miaraka aminareo. Izaho efa nanompo an’Andriamanitra sy nitarika anareo, hatramin’ny fahazazako ka mandraka androany.', 'koa io àry ilay mpanjaka mitarika anareo! izaho kosa efa antitra sy fotsy volo, ary indreo ny zanako miaraka aminareo. izaho efa nanompo an’andriamanitra sy nitarika anareo, hatramin’ny fahazazako ka mandraka androany.'),
  ('6ab25a186612a20540e687a0', '2026-09-22T10:36:08.471Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:08.471Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 12, 25, 'Raha sahy manao ratsy an-kitsirano kosa ianareo, dia ho ringana ianareo sy ny mpanjakanareo.”', 'raha sahy manao ratsy an-kitsirano kosa ianareo, dia ho ringana ianareo sy ny mpanjakanareo.”'),
  ('6ab25a186612a20540e68794', '2026-09-22T10:36:08.471Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:08.471Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 12, 13, 'Koa io ny mpanjaka nofidinareo, izay nangatahinareo. Ary efa nanendry mpanjaka hifehy anareo i Jehovah.', 'koa io ny mpanjaka nofidinareo, izay nangatahinareo. ary efa nanendry mpanjaka hifehy anareo i jehovah.'),
  ('6ab25a198e9216100b4867f7', '2026-09-22T10:36:09.636Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:09.636Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 13, 16, 'Ary nitoetra tao Geban’i Benjamina i Saoly sy Jonatana zanany mbamin’ny olona mbola niaraka tamin’izy ireo, fa ny Filistinina kosa nitoby tao Mikmasy.', 'ary nitoetra tao geban’i benjamina i saoly sy jonatana zanany mbamin’ny olona mbola niaraka tamin’izy ireo, fa ny filistinina kosa nitoby tao mikmasy.'),
  ('6ab25a198e9216100b4867f4', '2026-09-22T10:36:09.636Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:09.636Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 13, 13, 'Dia hoy i Samoela taminy: “Hadalana mihitsy izao nataonao izao. Tsy notandremanao ny didin’i Jehovah Andriamanitrao izay nandidiany anao. Fa raha notandremanao izany, dia ho nataon’i Jehovah mafy orina teo amin’ny Israely ny fanjakanao nandritra ny fotoana tsy voafetra.', 'dia hoy i samoela taminy: “hadalana mihitsy izao nataonao izao. tsy notandremanao ny didin’i jehovah andriamanitrao izay nandidiany anao. fa raha notandremanao izany, dia ho nataon’i jehovah mafy orina teo amin’ny israely ny fanjakanao nandritra ny fotoana tsy voafetra.'),
  ('6ab25a198e9216100b4867f3', '2026-09-22T10:36:09.636Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:09.636Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 13, 12, 'ka hoy aho anakampo: ‘Hidina hamely ahy eto Gilgala izao ny Filistinina, nefa izaho mbola tsy nampitony an’i Jehovah.’ Koa voatery nanolotra ny sorona dorana aho.”', 'ka hoy aho anakampo: ‘hidina hamely ahy eto gilgala izao ny filistinina, nefa izaho mbola tsy nampitony an’i jehovah.’ koa voatery nanolotra ny sorona dorana aho.”'),
  ('6ab25a198e9216100b4867f9', '2026-09-22T10:36:09.636Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:09.636Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 13, 18, 'ny iray nihazo ny lalan’i Beti-horona, ary ny fahatelo kosa nihazo ny lalana mankany amin’ny sisin-tany manatrika ny lohasahan’i Zeboima, tandrifin’ny tany efitra.', 'ny iray nihazo ny lalan’i beti-horona, ary ny fahatelo kosa nihazo ny lalana mankany amin’ny sisin-tany manatrika ny lohasahan’i zeboima, tandrifin’ny tany efitra.'),
  ('6ab25a198e9216100b4867f5', '2026-09-22T10:36:09.636Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:09.636Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 13, 14, 'Koa izao dia tsy haharitra ny fanjakanao. Hahita lehilahy sitraky ny fony i Jehovah, ary hotendren’i Jehovah ho mpitarika ny vahoakany izy, satria ianao tsy nitandrina an’izay nandidian’i Jehovah anao.”', 'koa izao dia tsy haharitra ny fanjakanao. hahita lehilahy sitraky ny fony i jehovah, ary hotendren’i jehovah ho mpitarika ny vahoakany izy, satria ianao tsy nitandrina an’izay nandidian’i jehovah anao.”'),
  ('6ab25a198e9216100b4867e8', '2026-09-22T10:36:09.636Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:09.636Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 13, 1, 'Ny taonan’i Saoly fony izy nanomboka nanjaka dia .... * Ary efa roa taona no nanjakany teo amin’ny Israely.', 'ny taonan’i saoly fony izy nanomboka nanjaka dia .... * ary efa roa taona no nanjakany teo amin’ny israely.'),
  ('6ab25a198e9216100b4867ea', '2026-09-22T10:36:09.636Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:09.636Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 13, 3, 'Ary i Jonatana namely ny toby miaramilan’ny Filistinina tao Geba, ka ren’ny Filistinina izany. Nasain’i Saoly notsofina nanerana an’ilay tany kosa ny anjombona, ka hoy izy: “Aoka ny Hebreo handre!”', 'ary i jonatana namely ny toby miaramilan’ny filistinina tao geba, ka ren’ny filistinina izany. nasain’i saoly notsofina nanerana an’ilay tany kosa ny anjombona, ka hoy izy: “aoka ny hebreo handre!”'),
  ('6ab25a198e9216100b4867e9', '2026-09-22T10:36:09.636Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:09.636Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 13, 2, 'Dia nifidy telo arivo lahy tamin’ny Israely izy, ka ny roa arivo niaraka taminy tao Mikmasy sy teny amin’ny faritra be tendrombohitr’i Betela, ary ny arivo niaraka tamin’i Jonatana tao Gibean’i Benjamina. Ny olona sisa kosa nalefany hody tany amin’ny tranolainy avy.', 'dia nifidy telo arivo lahy tamin’ny israely izy, ka ny roa arivo niaraka taminy tao mikmasy sy teny amin’ny faritra be tendrombohitr’i betela, ary ny arivo niaraka tamin’i jonatana tao gibean’i benjamina. ny olona sisa kosa nalefany hody tany amin’ny tranolainy avy.'),
  ('6ab25a198e9216100b4867f2', '2026-09-22T10:36:09.636Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:09.636Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 13, 11, 'Ary hoy i Samoela: “Fa inona no nataonao?” Dia hoy i Saoly: “Hitako fa efa niparitaka nandao ahy ny olona, ary ianao tsy tonga tao anatin’ny andro voatondro, nefa ny Filistinina efa tafangona ao Mikmasy,', 'ary hoy i samoela: “fa inona no nataonao?” dia hoy i saoly: “hitako fa efa niparitaka nandao ahy ny olona, ary ianao tsy tonga tao anatin’ny andro voatondro, nefa ny filistinina efa tafangona ao mikmasy,'),
  ('6ab25a198e9216100b4867fc', '2026-09-22T10:36:09.636Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:09.636Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 13, 21, 'Pima * iray ny saran’ny fandranitana ny lelan’angadinomby, na ny lapìka, na ny fitaovana telo rantsana, na ny famaky, ary toy izany koa ny fametahana ny lohan’ny fanindronana omby.', 'pima * iray ny saran’ny fandranitana ny lelan’angadinomby, na ny lapìka, na ny fitaovana telo rantsana, na ny famaky, ary toy izany koa ny fametahana ny lohan’ny fanindronana omby.'),
  ('6ab25a198e9216100b4867fb', '2026-09-22T10:36:09.636Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:09.636Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 13, 20, 'Koa nidina tany amin’ny Filistinina ny Israelita rehetra mba handranitra lelan’angadinomby na lapìka na famaky na antsy fijinjana.', 'koa nidina tany amin’ny filistinina ny israelita rehetra mba handranitra lelan’angadinomby na lapìka na famaky na antsy fijinjana.'),
  ('6ab25a198e9216100b4867f8', '2026-09-22T10:36:09.636Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:09.636Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 13, 17, 'Ary nivoaka avy tao amin’ny tobin’ny Filistinina ireo mpandroba, dia nanao telo toko, ka ny iray nihazo ny lalana mankany Ofra ho any amin’ny tany Soala,', 'ary nivoaka avy tao amin’ny tobin’ny filistinina ireo mpandroba, dia nanao telo toko, ka ny iray nihazo ny lalana mankany ofra ho any amin’ny tany soala,'),
  ('6ab25a198e9216100b4867eb', '2026-09-22T10:36:09.636Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:09.636Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 13, 4, 'Dia ren’ny Israely rehetra hoe: “Notafihin’i Saoly ny toby miaramilan’ny Filistinina, ka nanjary halan’ny Filistinina ny Israely.” Koa nantsoina avokoa ny olona mba hanaraka an’i Saoly ho any Gilgala.', 'dia ren’ny israely rehetra hoe: “notafihin’i saoly ny toby miaramilan’ny filistinina, ka nanjary halan’ny filistinina ny israely.” koa nantsoina avokoa ny olona mba hanaraka an’i saoly ho any gilgala.'),
  ('6ab25a198e9216100b4867f6', '2026-09-22T10:36:09.636Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:09.636Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 13, 15, 'Ary niala tao Gilgala i Samoela, ka niakatra nankany Gibean’i Benjamina. Dia nisain’i Saoly ny olona mbola teo aminy, ka eninjato lahy teo ho eo izy ireo.', 'ary niala tao gilgala i samoela, ka niakatra nankany gibean’i benjamina. dia nisain’i saoly ny olona mbola teo aminy, ka eninjato lahy teo ho eo izy ireo.'),
  ('6ab25a198e9216100b4867ef', '2026-09-22T10:36:09.636Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:09.636Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 13, 8, 'Dia niandry ihany izy nandritra ny fito andro, hatramin’ilay fotoana voatondro nolazain’i Samoela. Tsy tonga tao Gilgala anefa i Samoela, ary niparitaka tsikelikely nandao an’i Saoly ny olona.', 'dia niandry ihany izy nandritra ny fito andro, hatramin’ilay fotoana voatondro nolazain’i samoela. tsy tonga tao gilgala anefa i samoela, ary niparitaka tsikelikely nandao an’i saoly ny olona.'),
  ('6ab25a198e9216100b4867ee', '2026-09-22T10:36:09.636Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:09.636Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 13, 7, 'Niampita ny Reniranon’i Jordana mihitsy aza ny Hebreo sasany, mba ho any amin’ny tanin’i Gada sy Gileada. Fa i Saoly kosa mbola tao Gilgala, ary tora-kovitra ny olona rehetra nanaraka azy.', 'niampita ny reniranon’i jordana mihitsy aza ny hebreo sasany, mba ho any amin’ny tanin’i gada sy gileada. fa i saoly kosa mbola tao gilgala, ary tora-kovitra ny olona rehetra nanaraka azy.'),
  ('6ab25a198e9216100b4867ec', '2026-09-22T10:36:09.636Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:09.636Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 13, 5, 'Ny Filistinina kosa niangona mba hiady tamin’ny Israely: Telo alina ny kalesin’adiny, enina arivo ny mpitaingin-tsoavaliny, ary maro be toy ny fasika eny amoron-dranomasina izy ireo. Niakatra izy ireo ka nitoby tao Mikmasy, eo atsinanan’i Beti-avena.', 'ny filistinina kosa niangona mba hiady tamin’ny israely: telo alina ny kalesin’adiny, enina arivo ny mpitaingin-tsoavaliny, ary maro be toy ny fasika eny amoron-dranomasina izy ireo. niakatra izy ireo ka nitoby tao mikmasy, eo atsinanan’i beti-avena.'),
  ('6ab25a198e9216100b4867f0', '2026-09-22T10:36:09.636Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:09.636Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 13, 9, 'Farany, dia hoy i Saoly: “Ento atỳ amiko ny sorona dorana sy ny sorona iombonana.” Dia nanolotra ny sorona dorana izy.', 'farany, dia hoy i saoly: “ento atỳ amiko ny sorona dorana sy ny sorona iombonana.” dia nanolotra ny sorona dorana izy.'),
  ('6ab25a198e9216100b4867f1', '2026-09-22T10:36:09.636Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:09.636Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 13, 10, 'Raha vao vitany anefa ny fanolorana ny sorona dorana, dia iny fa tonga i Samoela. Koa nivoaka hitsena azy i Saoly sady niarahaba azy.', 'raha vao vitany anefa ny fanolorana ny sorona dorana, dia iny fa tonga i samoela. koa nivoaka hitsena azy i saoly sady niarahaba azy.'),
  ('6ab25a198e9216100b4867fd', '2026-09-22T10:36:09.636Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:09.636Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 13, 22, 'Koa tsy nisy nanana sabatra na lefona ny olona niaraka tamin’i Saoly sy Jonatana tamin’ny andro niadiana, fa i Saoly sy Jonatana zanany ihany no nanana.', 'koa tsy nisy nanana sabatra na lefona ny olona niaraka tamin’i saoly sy jonatana tamin’ny andro niadiana, fa i saoly sy jonatana zanany ihany no nanana.'),
  ('6ab25a198e9216100b4867fa', '2026-09-22T10:36:09.636Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:09.636Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 13, 19, 'Tamin’izany dia tsy nahitana mpanefy teo amin’ny tanin’ny Israely manontolo, satria hoy ny Filistinina: “Sao manao sabatra na lefona ny Hebreo.”', 'tamin’izany dia tsy nahitana mpanefy teo amin’ny tanin’ny israely manontolo, satria hoy ny filistinina: “sao manao sabatra na lefona ny hebreo.”'),
  ('6ab25a198e9216100b4867fe', '2026-09-22T10:36:09.636Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:09.636Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 13, 23, 'Ary nisy andia-miaramilan’ny Filistinina nivoaka nankeo amin’ny hadilanana ao Mikmasy.', 'ary nisy andia-miaramilan’ny filistinina nivoaka nankeo amin’ny hadilanana ao mikmasy.'),
  ('6ab25a198e9216100b4867ed', '2026-09-22T10:36:09.636Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:09.636Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 13, 6, 'Rehefa hitan’ny Israelita fa notandindomin-doza izy ireo satria voaterin’ny fahavalo, dia lasa niafina tany an-dava-bato sy tany an-tsefatsefaky ny harambato izy ireo, ary koa tany anaty vatolampy sy zohy ary lavaka fanangonan-drano.', 'rehefa hitan’ny israelita fa notandindomin-doza izy ireo satria voaterin’ny fahavalo, dia lasa niafina tany an-dava-bato sy tany an-tsefatsefaky ny harambato izy ireo, ary koa tany anaty vatolampy sy zohy ary lavaka fanangonan-drano.'),
  ('6ab25a1a57da96c9efdf1ddf', '2026-09-22T10:36:10.194Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:10.194Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 14, 46, 'Koa tsy nanenjika ny Filistinina i Saoly, ary ny Filistinina nody tany amin’ny taniny.', 'koa tsy nanenjika ny filistinina i saoly, ary ny filistinina nody tany amin’ny taniny.'),
  ('6ab25a1a57da96c9efdf1dd4', '2026-09-22T10:36:10.194Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:10.194Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 14, 35, 'Dia nanorina alitara ho an’i Jehovah i Saoly. Io no alitara voalohany naoriny ho an’i Jehovah.', 'dia nanorina alitara ho an’i jehovah i saoly. io no alitara voalohany naoriny ho an’i jehovah.'),
  ('6ab25a1a57da96c9efdf1dc6', '2026-09-22T10:36:10.194Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:10.194Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 14, 21, 'Ary ny Hebreo izay niaraka tamin’ny Filistinina sy niara-niakatra tamin’izy ireo nankao an-toby sady niharoharo taminy tao, dia nanjary niandany tamin’ny Israely izay niaraka tamin’i Saoly sy Jonatana.', 'ary ny hebreo izay niaraka tamin’ny filistinina sy niara-niakatra tamin’izy ireo nankao an-toby sady niharoharo taminy tao, dia nanjary niandany tamin’ny israely izay niaraka tamin’i saoly sy jonatana.'),
  ('6ab25a1a57da96c9efdf1db4', '2026-09-22T10:36:10.194Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:10.194Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 14, 3, 'I Ahia zanak’i Ahitoba, rahalahin’i Ikaboda, zanak’i Finehasa, zanak’i Ely mpisoron’i Jehovah tao Silo, no nitondra ny efoda. Ary tsy fantatry ny olona hoe lasa i Jonatana.', 'i ahia zanak’i ahitoba, rahalahin’i ikaboda, zanak’i finehasa, zanak’i ely mpisoron’i jehovah tao silo, no nitondra ny efoda. ary tsy fantatry ny olona hoe lasa i jonatana.'),
  ('6ab25a1a57da96c9efdf1dd8', '2026-09-22T10:36:10.194Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:10.194Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 14, 39, 'Fa raha mbola velona koa i Jehovah, ilay Mpanafaka ny Israely, na dia i Jonatana zanako aza no ahitana izay nahatonga izao, dia ho faty tokoa izy.” Tsy nisy namaly azy anefa ny olona rehetra.', 'fa raha mbola velona koa i jehovah, ilay mpanafaka ny israely, na dia i jonatana zanako aza no ahitana izay nahatonga izao, dia ho faty tokoa izy.” tsy nisy namaly azy anefa ny olona rehetra.'),
  ('6ab25a1a57da96c9efdf1db8', '2026-09-22T10:36:10.194Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:10.194Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 14, 7, 'Dia hoy ilay mpitondra fiadiana: “Izay ao am-ponao no ataovy. Ary mandehana any amin’izay tianao, fa vonona hanaraka anao aho araka izay sitraky ny fonao.”', 'dia hoy ilay mpitondra fiadiana: “izay ao am-ponao no ataovy. ary mandehana any amin’izay tianao, fa vonona hanaraka anao aho araka izay sitraky ny fonao.”'),
  ('6ab25a1a57da96c9efdf1dd3', '2026-09-22T10:36:10.194Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:10.194Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 14, 34, 'Avy eo dia hoy izy: “Mieleza eny amin’ny olona ka teneno izy ireo hoe: ‘Samia mitondra ny ombiny sy ny ondriny etỳ amiko, ka vonoy sy hano eto ireny. Ary aza manota amin’i Jehovah ka mihinana an’ireny miaraka amin’ny rany.’” Koa samy nitondra ny ombiny ny olona rehetra tamin’iny alina iny, ary namono an’ireny teo.', 'avy eo dia hoy izy: “mieleza eny amin’ny olona ka teneno izy ireo hoe: ‘samia mitondra ny ombiny sy ny ondriny etỳ amiko, ka vonoy sy hano eto ireny. ary aza manota amin’i jehovah ka mihinana an’ireny miaraka amin’ny rany.’” koa samy nitondra ny ombiny ny olona rehetra tamin’iny alina iny, ary namono an’ireny teo.'),
  ('6ab25a1a57da96c9efdf1dcf', '2026-09-22T10:36:10.194Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:10.194Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 14, 30, 'Mainka fa raha nihinana tamin’ny zavatra nobaboina tamin’ireo fahavalony ny olona androany! Fa izao dia tsy betsaka loatra ny maty tamin’ny Filistinina.”', 'mainka fa raha nihinana tamin’ny zavatra nobaboina tamin’ireo fahavalony ny olona androany! fa izao dia tsy betsaka loatra ny maty tamin’ny filistinina.”'),
  ('6ab25a1a57da96c9efdf1dbb', '2026-09-22T10:36:10.194Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:10.194Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 14, 10, 'Raha milaza kosa izy hoe: ‘Miakara hiady aminay!’, dia hiakatra isika, satria hatolotr’i Jehovah eo an-tanantsika ireo. Izany no ho famantarana ho antsika.”', 'raha milaza kosa izy hoe: ‘miakara hiady aminay!’, dia hiakatra isika, satria hatolotr’i jehovah eo an-tanantsika ireo. izany no ho famantarana ho antsika.”'),
  ('6ab25a1a57da96c9efdf1db7', '2026-09-22T10:36:10.194Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:10.194Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 14, 6, 'Ary hoy i Jonatana tamin’ilay mpanompony mpitondra fiadiana: “Andao hiampita erỳ amin’ny toby mpitilin’ireo lehilahy tsy mifora ireo. Angamba hanampy antsika i Jehovah fa tsy misy mahasakana an’i Jehovah tsy hamonjy, na maro na vitsy no ampiasainy.”', 'ary hoy i jonatana tamin’ilay mpanompony mpitondra fiadiana: “andao hiampita erỳ amin’ny toby mpitilin’ireo lehilahy tsy mifora ireo. angamba hanampy antsika i jehovah fa tsy misy mahasakana an’i jehovah tsy hamonjy, na maro na vitsy no ampiasainy.”'),
  ('6ab25a1a57da96c9efdf1dd7', '2026-09-22T10:36:10.194Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:10.194Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 14, 38, 'Koa hoy i Saoly: “Avia atỳ ianareo rehetra lehiben’ny vahoaka, ka jereo sy fantaro izay nahatonga izao fahotana androany izao.', 'koa hoy i saoly: “avia atỳ ianareo rehetra lehiben’ny vahoaka, ka jereo sy fantaro izay nahatonga izao fahotana androany izao.'),
  ('6ab25a1a57da96c9efdf1dd1', '2026-09-22T10:36:10.194Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:10.194Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 14, 32, 'Ary nihazakazaka nandrombaka ny zavatra azo babo izy ireo, ka naka ondry sy omby ary zanak’omby, dia namono an’ireny teo amin’ny tany. Nanomboka nihinana an’ireny niaraka tamin’ny rany ny olona.', 'ary nihazakazaka nandrombaka ny zavatra azo babo izy ireo, ka naka ondry sy omby ary zanak’omby, dia namono an’ireny teo amin’ny tany. nanomboka nihinana an’ireny niaraka tamin’ny rany ny olona.'),
  ('6ab25a1a57da96c9efdf1dc2', '2026-09-22T10:36:10.194Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:10.194Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 14, 17, 'Ary hoy i Saoly tamin’ireo olona niaraka taminy: “Mba isao kely ny olona, ka jereo hoe iza tamintsika no lasa.” Rehefa nanisa izy ireo, dia hitany fa tsy teo i Jonatana sy ny mpitondra ny fiadiany.', 'ary hoy i saoly tamin’ireo olona niaraka taminy: “mba isao kely ny olona, ka jereo hoe iza tamintsika no lasa.” rehefa nanisa izy ireo, dia hitany fa tsy teo i jonatana sy ny mpitondra ny fiadiany.'),
  ('6ab25a1a57da96c9efdf1dce', '2026-09-22T10:36:10.194Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:10.194Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 14, 29, 'Ary hoy i Jonatana: “Nahatonga loza tamin’ny tanintsika ny raiko. Mba jereo ange ny fihiratry ny masoko rehefa nihinana an’iny tantely kely iny aho e!', 'ary hoy i jonatana: “nahatonga loza tamin’ny tanintsika ny raiko. mba jereo ange ny fihiratry ny masoko rehefa nihinana an’iny tantely kely iny aho e!'),
  ('6ab25a1a57da96c9efdf1db6', '2026-09-22T10:36:10.194Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:10.194Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 14, 5, 'ka ny iray dia andry teo avaratra tandrifin’i Mikmasy, ary ny iray kosa teo atsimo tandrifin’i Geba.', 'ka ny iray dia andry teo avaratra tandrifin’i mikmasy, ary ny iray kosa teo atsimo tandrifin’i geba.'),
  ('6ab25a1a57da96c9efdf1de3', '2026-09-22T10:36:10.194Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:10.194Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 14, 50, 'Ny anaran’ny vadin’i Saoly dia Ahinoama, zanak’i Ahimaza. Ny anaran’ny lehiben’ny tafiny dia Abnera, zanak’i Nera, dadatoan’i Saoly.', 'ny anaran’ny vadin’i saoly dia ahinoama, zanak’i ahimaza. ny anaran’ny lehiben’ny tafiny dia abnera, zanak’i nera, dadatoan’i saoly.'),
  ('6ab25a1a57da96c9efdf1dd5', '2026-09-22T10:36:10.194Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:10.194Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 14, 36, 'Hoy i Saoly avy eo: “Andao hidina hanenjika ny Filistinina izao alina izao, ka handroba azy mandra-pahazavan’ny andro, ary hataontsika tsy misy miangana ireo na iray aza.” Dia hoy ny olona: “Ataovy izay hitanao fa mety.” Hoy kosa ny mpisorona: “Andao aloha hanatona an’Andriamanitra eto.”', 'hoy i saoly avy eo: “andao hidina hanenjika ny filistinina izao alina izao, ka handroba azy mandra-pahazavan’ny andro, ary hataontsika tsy misy miangana ireo na iray aza.” dia hoy ny olona: “ataovy izay hitanao fa mety.” hoy kosa ny mpisorona: “andao aloha hanatona an’andriamanitra eto.”'),
  ('6ab25a1a57da96c9efdf1de2', '2026-09-22T10:36:10.194Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:10.194Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 14, 49, 'Ary ireto avy ny zanakalahin’i Saoly: I Jonatana sy Jisvy ary Malkisoa. Ary ny anaran’ny zanany roa vavy dia Meraba, vavimatoa, sy Mikala, zandriny.', 'ary ireto avy ny zanakalahin’i saoly: i jonatana sy jisvy ary malkisoa. ary ny anaran’ny zanany roa vavy dia meraba, vavimatoa, sy mikala, zandriny.'),
  ('6ab25a1a57da96c9efdf1dd2', '2026-09-22T10:36:10.194Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:10.194Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 14, 33, 'Koa nisy niteny tamin’i Saoly hoe: “Manota amin’i Jehovah ny olona, fa mihinan-javatra miaraka amin’ny rany.” Dia hoy i Saoly: “Efa nivadika ianareo. Manakodiava aloha vato lehibe etỳ amiko.”', 'koa nisy niteny tamin’i saoly hoe: “manota amin’i jehovah ny olona, fa mihinan-javatra miaraka amin’ny rany.” dia hoy i saoly: “efa nivadika ianareo. manakodiava aloha vato lehibe etỳ amiko.”'),
  ('6ab25a1a57da96c9efdf1dcd', '2026-09-22T10:36:10.194Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:10.194Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 14, 28, 'Koa hoy ny iray tamin’ny olona: “Ny rainao efa nampianiana mafy ny olona hoe: ‘Voaozona izay mihinan-kanina anio!’” Efa nihareraka ny olona tamin’izay.', 'koa hoy ny iray tamin’ny olona: “ny rainao efa nampianiana mafy ny olona hoe: ‘voaozona izay mihinan-kanina anio!’” efa nihareraka ny olona tamin’izay.'),
  ('6ab25a1a57da96c9efdf1dc4', '2026-09-22T10:36:10.194Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:10.194Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 14, 19, 'Raha mbola niresaka tamin’ilay mpisorona i Saoly, dia vao mainka nitombo ny sahotaka teny an-tobin’ny Filistinina. Dia hoy i Saoly tamin’ilay mpisorona: “Aoka ihany! Esory ny tananao.”', 'raha mbola niresaka tamin’ilay mpisorona i saoly, dia vao mainka nitombo ny sahotaka teny an-tobin’ny filistinina. dia hoy i saoly tamin’ilay mpisorona: “aoka ihany! esory ny tananao.”'),
  ('6ab25a1a57da96c9efdf1dba', '2026-09-22T10:36:10.194Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:10.194Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 14, 9, 'Koa raha milaza amintsika ry zareo hoe: ‘Aza mihetsika mandra-pahatonganay eny aminareo!’, dia hijanona eo amin’izay misy antsika isika, fa tsy hiakatra hankeny aminy.', 'koa raha milaza amintsika ry zareo hoe: ‘aza mihetsika mandra-pahatonganay eny aminareo!’, dia hijanona eo amin’izay misy antsika isika, fa tsy hiakatra hankeny aminy.'),
  ('6ab25a1a57da96c9efdf1de0', '2026-09-22T10:36:10.194Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:10.194Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 14, 47, 'Ary nanamafy orina ny fanjakany teo amin’ny Israely i Saoly, ka niady tamin’ny fahavalony rehetra manodidina, dia i Moaba, sy ny taranak’i Amona, sy Edoma, sy ireo mpanjakan’i Zoba, ary ny Filistinina. Nosaziny ireny, tany amin’izay rehetra nalehany.', 'ary nanamafy orina ny fanjakany teo amin’ny israely i saoly, ka niady tamin’ny fahavalony rehetra manodidina, dia i moaba, sy ny taranak’i amona, sy edoma, sy ireo mpanjakan’i zoba, ary ny filistinina. nosaziny ireny, tany amin’izay rehetra nalehany.'),
  ('6ab25a1a57da96c9efdf1dca', '2026-09-22T10:36:10.194Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:10.194Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 14, 25, 'Ary nankany an’ala ny olona rehetra tompon-tany. Nisy tantely nanerana ny faritra ambanivohitra, tamin’izay.', 'ary nankany an’ala ny olona rehetra tompon-tany. nisy tantely nanerana ny faritra ambanivohitra, tamin’izay.'),
  ('6ab25a1a57da96c9efdf1dc9', '2026-09-22T10:36:10.194Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:10.194Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 14, 24, 'Efa reraka ireo lehilahy israelita tamin’iny andro iny, nefa i Saoly mbola nampianiana ny olona ihany, hoe: “Voaozona izay olona mihinan-kanina alohan’ny takariva, mandra-pamitako ny valifatiko amin’ny fahavaloko!” Dia tsy nisy nihinan-kanina ny olona.', 'efa reraka ireo lehilahy israelita tamin’iny andro iny, nefa i saoly mbola nampianiana ny olona ihany, hoe: “voaozona izay olona mihinan-kanina alohan’ny takariva, mandra-pamitako ny valifatiko amin’ny fahavaloko!” dia tsy nisy nihinan-kanina ny olona.'),
  ('6ab25a1a57da96c9efdf1dc3', '2026-09-22T10:36:10.194Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:10.194Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 14, 18, 'Koa hoy i Saoly tamin’i Ahia: “Ento etỳ ny Vata masin’Andriamanitra!” Teo amin’ny zanak’Israely mantsy ny Vata masin’Andriamanitra tamin’iny andro iny.', 'koa hoy i saoly tamin’i ahia: “ento etỳ ny vata masin’andriamanitra!” teo amin’ny zanak’israely mantsy ny vata masin’andriamanitra tamin’iny andro iny.'),
  ('6ab25a1a57da96c9efdf1db9', '2026-09-22T10:36:10.194Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:10.194Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 14, 8, 'Ary hoy i Jonatana: “Hiampita hankeny amin’izy ireo isika, ka hiseho mba ho hitany.', 'ary hoy i jonatana: “hiampita hankeny amin’izy ireo isika, ka hiseho mba ho hitany.'),
  ('6ab25a1a57da96c9efdf1db5', '2026-09-22T10:36:10.194Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:10.194Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 14, 4, 'Nahita lalana hiampitana mba hanafihana ny toby mpitilin’ny Filistinina i Jonatana. Nisy harambato miendrika nify teo anelanelan’ireo lalana, ka ny iray teo amin’ny andaniny ary ny iray teo amin’ny ankilany. Bozeza no anaran’ny harambato iray ary Sene kosa no anaran’ny iray,', 'nahita lalana hiampitana mba hanafihana ny toby mpitilin’ny filistinina i jonatana. nisy harambato miendrika nify teo anelanelan’ireo lalana, ka ny iray teo amin’ny andaniny ary ny iray teo amin’ny ankilany. bozeza no anaran’ny harambato iray ary sene kosa no anaran’ny iray,'),
  ('6ab25a1a57da96c9efdf1de4', '2026-09-22T10:36:10.194Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:10.194Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 14, 51, 'I Kisy no rain’i Saoly, ary i Nera rain’i Abnera dia zanak’i Abiela.', 'i kisy no rain’i saoly, ary i nera rain’i abnera dia zanak’i abiela.'),
  ('6ab25a1a57da96c9efdf1ddb', '2026-09-22T10:36:10.194Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:10.194Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 14, 42, 'Koa hoy i Saoly: “Manaova antsapaka hahitana izay ho voatana, na izaho na i Jonatana zanako.” Ary i Jonatana no voatana.', 'koa hoy i saoly: “manaova antsapaka hahitana izay ho voatana, na izaho na i jonatana zanako.” ary i jonatana no voatana.'),
  ('6ab25a1a57da96c9efdf1dcc', '2026-09-22T10:36:10.194Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:10.194Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 14, 27, 'I Jonatana kosa tsy nandre an-drainy nampianiana ny olona. Koa narosony ny tendron’ilay tehina teny an-tanany ka natsobony tao amin’ny toho-tantely, ary nataony teo amin’ny vavany. Dia nihiratra ny masony.', 'i jonatana kosa tsy nandre an-drainy nampianiana ny olona. koa narosony ny tendron’ilay tehina teny an-tanany ka natsobony tao amin’ny toho-tantely, ary nataony teo amin’ny vavany. dia nihiratra ny masony.'),
  ('6ab25a1a57da96c9efdf1dbd', '2026-09-22T10:36:10.194Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:10.194Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 14, 12, 'Dia niteny tamin’i Jonatana sy ilay mpitondra fiadiana ireo lehilahy tao amin’ny toby mpitily, hoe: “Miakara etỳ aminay, fa ataonay mahita faisana ianareo!” Tonga dia niteny tamin’ilay mpitondra fiadiana i Jonatana hoe: “Miakara manaraka ahy, fa hatolotr’i Jehovah eo an-tanan’ny Israely tokoa ireo.”', 'dia niteny tamin’i jonatana sy ilay mpitondra fiadiana ireo lehilahy tao amin’ny toby mpitily, hoe: “miakara etỳ aminay, fa ataonay mahita faisana ianareo!” tonga dia niteny tamin’ilay mpitondra fiadiana i jonatana hoe: “miakara manaraka ahy, fa hatolotr’i jehovah eo an-tanan’ny israely tokoa ireo.”'),
  ('6ab25a1a57da96c9efdf1db3', '2026-09-22T10:36:10.194Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:10.194Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 14, 2, 'Nitoetra tany amin’ny sisin’i Gibea i Saoly tamin’izay, teo ambanin’ilay ampongabendanitra naniry teo Migrona, ary nisy eninjato lahy teo ho eo niaraka taminy.', 'nitoetra tany amin’ny sisin’i gibea i saoly tamin’izay, teo ambanin’ilay ampongabendanitra naniry teo migrona, ary nisy eninjato lahy teo ho eo niaraka taminy.'),
  ('6ab25a1a57da96c9efdf1dda', '2026-09-22T10:36:10.194Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:10.194Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 14, 41, 'Ary hoy i Saoly tamin’i Jehovah: “Omeo anay ny Tomima, ry Andriamanitry ny Israely ô!” Dia voatana i Jonatana sy Saoly, fa ny olona kosa afaka.', 'ary hoy i saoly tamin’i jehovah: “omeo anay ny tomima, ry andriamanitry ny israely ô!” dia voatana i jonatana sy saoly, fa ny olona kosa afaka.'),
  ('6ab25a1a57da96c9efdf1dd6', '2026-09-22T10:36:10.194Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:10.194Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 14, 37, 'Ary nanontany an’Andriamanitra i Saoly hoe: “Hidina hanenjika ny Filistinina ve aho? Hatolotrao eo an-tanan’ny Israely ve ireo?” Tsy namaly an’i Saoly anefa izy tamin’iny andro iny.', 'ary nanontany an’andriamanitra i saoly hoe: “hidina hanenjika ny filistinina ve aho? hatolotrao eo an-tanan’ny israely ve ireo?” tsy namaly an’i saoly anefa izy tamin’iny andro iny.'),
  ('6ab25a1a57da96c9efdf1dc5', '2026-09-22T10:36:10.194Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:10.194Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 14, 20, 'Ary nifamory i Saoly sy ny olona rehetra niaraka taminy, ka nankeny an’ady. Nifamely tamin’ny sabatra ny Filistinina teny, ka vaky nandositra tao anatin’ny fisavoritahana be.', 'ary nifamory i saoly sy ny olona rehetra niaraka taminy, ka nankeny an’ady. nifamely tamin’ny sabatra ny filistinina teny, ka vaky nandositra tao anatin’ny fisavoritahana be.'),
  ('6ab25a1a57da96c9efdf1dbf', '2026-09-22T10:36:10.194Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:10.194Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 14, 14, 'Lehilahy roapolo teo ho eo no matin’i Jonatana sy ilay mpitondra fiadiana, tamin’ny fandripahana voalohany teo amin’ny velaran-tany ampahefatry ny hektara teo ho eo.', 'lehilahy roapolo teo ho eo no matin’i jonatana sy ilay mpitondra fiadiana, tamin’ny fandripahana voalohany teo amin’ny velaran-tany ampahefatry ny hektara teo ho eo.'),
  ('6ab25a1a57da96c9efdf1dbe', '2026-09-22T10:36:10.194Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:10.194Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 14, 13, 'Nandady i Jonatana rehefa niakatra, ary nanaraka azy ilay mpitondra fiadiana. Dia lavo teo anoloan’i Jonatana ny Filistinina, fa ilay mpitondra fiadiana kosa no namono ho faty avy tao aoriany.', 'nandady i jonatana rehefa niakatra, ary nanaraka azy ilay mpitondra fiadiana. dia lavo teo anoloan’i jonatana ny filistinina, fa ilay mpitondra fiadiana kosa no namono ho faty avy tao aoriany.'),
  ('6ab25a1a57da96c9efdf1dde', '2026-09-22T10:36:10.194Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:10.194Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 14, 45, 'Hoy anefa ny olona tamin’i Saoly: “Ho faty ve i Jonatana, izay nanao izao famonjena lehibe teo amin’ny Israely izao? Sanatria izany! Raha mbola velona koa i Jehovah, dia tsy hisy ho latsaka amin’ny tany na dia ny singam-bolony iray aza. Fa niara-niasa tamin’Andriamanitra izy androany.” Toy izany no nanavotan’ny olona an’i Jonatana, ka tsy maty izy.', 'hoy anefa ny olona tamin’i saoly: “ho faty ve i jonatana, izay nanao izao famonjena lehibe teo amin’ny israely izao? sanatria izany! raha mbola velona koa i jehovah, dia tsy hisy ho latsaka amin’ny tany na dia ny singam-bolony iray aza. fa niara-niasa tamin’andriamanitra izy androany.” toy izany no nanavotan’ny olona an’i jonatana, ka tsy maty izy.'),
  ('6ab25a1a57da96c9efdf1dc1', '2026-09-22T10:36:10.194Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:10.194Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 14, 16, 'Dia nahatazana an’izany ny mpiambin’i Saoly tao Gibean’i Benjamina, ka hitany fa nisy sahotaka be eran’ilay toby.', 'dia nahatazana an’izany ny mpiambin’i saoly tao gibean’i benjamina, ka hitany fa nisy sahotaka be eran’ilay toby.'),
  ('6ab25a1a57da96c9efdf1dc0', '2026-09-22T10:36:10.194Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:10.194Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 14, 15, 'Dia nihorohoro ny tao an-toby izay teny ambanivohitra, sy ny olona rehetra tao amin’ilay toby mpitily. Ny mpandroba koa aza nihorohoro. Ary nanomboka nihovotrovotra ny tany. Avy tamin’Andriamanitra daholo izany.', 'dia nihorohoro ny tao an-toby izay teny ambanivohitra, sy ny olona rehetra tao amin’ilay toby mpitily. ny mpandroba koa aza nihorohoro. ary nanomboka nihovotrovotra ny tany. avy tamin’andriamanitra daholo izany.'),
  ('6ab25a1a57da96c9efdf1de5', '2026-09-22T10:36:10.194Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:10.194Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 14, 52, 'Ary nihamafy hatrany ny fanafihana an’ireo Filistinina, tamin’ny andron’i Saoly. Koa nalain’i Saoly izay lehilahy matanjaka na olona mahery fo hitany.', 'ary nihamafy hatrany ny fanafihana an’ireo filistinina, tamin’ny andron’i saoly. koa nalain’i saoly izay lehilahy matanjaka na olona mahery fo hitany.'),
  ('6ab25a1a57da96c9efdf1de1', '2026-09-22T10:36:10.194Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:10.194Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 14, 48, 'Ary nampiseho herim-po hatrany izy, ka namely an’i Amaleka ary nanafaka ny Israely teo an-tanan’ny mpandroba azy.', 'ary nampiseho herim-po hatrany izy, ka namely an’i amaleka ary nanafaka ny israely teo an-tanan’ny mpandroba azy.'),
  ('6ab25a1a57da96c9efdf1ddc', '2026-09-22T10:36:10.194Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:10.194Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 14, 43, 'Dia hoy i Saoly tamin’i Jonatana: “Lazao ahy izay nataonao.” Koa hoy i Jonatana: “Nihinana tantely kely tokoa aho, tamin’ny tendron’ity tehina etỳ an-tanako ity. Koa intỳ aho! Aoka aho ho faty!”', 'dia hoy i saoly tamin’i jonatana: “lazao ahy izay nataonao.” koa hoy i jonatana: “nihinana tantely kely tokoa aho, tamin’ny tendron’ity tehina etỳ an-tanako ity. koa intỳ aho! aoka aho ho faty!”'),
  ('6ab25a1a57da96c9efdf1dd9', '2026-09-22T10:36:10.194Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:10.194Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 14, 40, 'Hoy koa izy tamin’ny Israely rehetra: “Ianareo ho eo amin’ny andaniny iray, ary izaho sy Jonatana zanako kosa ho eo amin’ny andaniny iray.” Dia hoy ny olona tamin’i Saoly: “Ataovy izay hitanao fa mety.”', 'hoy koa izy tamin’ny israely rehetra: “ianareo ho eo amin’ny andaniny iray, ary izaho sy jonatana zanako kosa ho eo amin’ny andaniny iray.” dia hoy ny olona tamin’i saoly: “ataovy izay hitanao fa mety.”'),
  ('6ab25a1a57da96c9efdf1dd0', '2026-09-22T10:36:10.194Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:10.194Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 14, 31, 'Ary tsy nitsahatra namely an’ireo Filistinina izy ireo tamin’iny andro iny, hatrany Mikmasy ka hatrany Aialona. Dia reraka be ny olona.', 'ary tsy nitsahatra namely an’ireo filistinina izy ireo tamin’iny andro iny, hatrany mikmasy ka hatrany aialona. dia reraka be ny olona.'),
  ('6ab25a1a57da96c9efdf1dcb', '2026-09-22T10:36:10.194Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:10.194Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 14, 26, 'Nahita tantely nitete izy ireo rehefa tonga tao anaty ala, nefa tsy nisy na iray aza sahy nampiakatra ny tanany tao am-bavany, noho ny amin’ilay fianianana.', 'nahita tantely nitete izy ireo rehefa tonga tao anaty ala, nefa tsy nisy na iray aza sahy nampiakatra ny tanany tao am-bavany, noho ny amin’ilay fianianana.'),
  ('6ab25a1a57da96c9efdf1dc8', '2026-09-22T10:36:10.194Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:10.194Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 14, 23, 'Novonjen’i Jehovah ny Israely tamin’iny andro iny. Ary nitohy hatrany Beti-avena ny ady.', 'novonjen’i jehovah ny israely tamin’iny andro iny. ary nitohy hatrany beti-avena ny ady.'),
  ('6ab25a1a57da96c9efdf1dc7', '2026-09-22T10:36:10.194Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:10.194Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 14, 22, 'Ary ny lehilahy israelita rehetra niafina tany amin’ny faritra be tendrombohitr’i Efraima, dia nandre fa nandositra ny Filistinina. Dia mba nanenjika an’ireny tany an’ady koa izy ireo.', 'ary ny lehilahy israelita rehetra niafina tany amin’ny faritra be tendrombohitr’i efraima, dia nandre fa nandositra ny filistinina. dia mba nanenjika an’ireny tany an’ady koa izy ireo.'),
  ('6ab25a1a57da96c9efdf1ddd', '2026-09-22T10:36:10.194Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:10.194Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 14, 44, 'Dia hoy i Saoly: “Hofaizin’Andriamanitra anie aho, * ary mihoatra noho izany aza, raha tsy ho faty tokoa ianao, ry Jonatana!”', 'dia hoy i saoly: “hofaizin’andriamanitra anie aho, * ary mihoatra noho izany aza, raha tsy ho faty tokoa ianao, ry jonatana!”'),
  ('6ab25a1a57da96c9efdf1dbc', '2026-09-22T10:36:10.194Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:10.194Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 14, 11, 'Dia niseho izy roa lahy mba ho hitan’ireo tao amin’ny toby mpitilin’ny Filistinina. Koa hoy ny Filistinina: “Ireny ny Hebreo fa nivoaka avy tany amin’ny lavaka niafenany.”', 'dia niseho izy roa lahy mba ho hitan’ireo tao amin’ny toby mpitilin’ny filistinina. koa hoy ny filistinina: “ireny ny hebreo fa nivoaka avy tany amin’ny lavaka niafenany.”'),
  ('6ab25a1a57da96c9efdf1db2', '2026-09-22T10:36:10.194Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:10.194Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 14, 1, 'Indray andro, dia hoy i Jonatana zanak’i Saoly, tamin’ilay mpanompo nitondra ny fiadiany: “Andao hiampita eny amin’ny toby mpitilin’ny Filistinina, erỳ ampita erỳ.” Tsy niteniteny tamin-drainy anefa izy.', 'indray andro, dia hoy i jonatana zanak’i saoly, tamin’ilay mpanompo nitondra ny fiadiany: “andao hiampita eny amin’ny toby mpitilin’ny filistinina, erỳ ampita erỳ.” tsy niteniteny tamin-drainy anefa izy.'),
  ('6ab25a1bc55b75539fc43579', '2026-09-22T10:36:11.571Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:11.571Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 15, 10, 'Ary tonga tamin’i Samoela ny tenin’i Jehovah, hoe:', 'ary tonga tamin’i samoela ny tenin’i jehovah, hoe:'),
  ('6ab25a1bc55b75539fc43576', '2026-09-22T10:36:11.571Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:11.571Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 15, 7, 'Avy eo, dia namely an’i Amaleka hatrany Havila ka hatrany Sora, tandrifin’i Ejipta, i Saoly.', 'avy eo, dia namely an’i amaleka hatrany havila ka hatrany sora, tandrifin’i ejipta, i saoly.'),
  ('6ab25a1bc55b75539fc43570', '2026-09-22T10:36:11.571Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:11.571Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 15, 1, 'Dia hoy i Samoela tamin’i Saoly: “Izaho no nirahin’i Jehovah hanosotra anao ho mpanjakan’ny Israely olony. Koa ankehitriny, henoy ny tenin’i Jehovah.', 'dia hoy i samoela tamin’i saoly: “izaho no nirahin’i jehovah hanosotra anao ho mpanjakan’ny israely olony. koa ankehitriny, henoy ny tenin’i jehovah.'),
  ('6ab25a1bc55b75539fc43577', '2026-09-22T10:36:11.571Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:11.571Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 15, 8, 'Ary nataony sambo-belona i Agaga mpanjakan’i Amaleka, fa ny olon-kafa rehetra kosa naringany tanteraka tamin’ny lelan-tsabatra.', 'ary nataony sambo-belona i agaga mpanjakan’i amaleka, fa ny olon-kafa rehetra kosa naringany tanteraka tamin’ny lelan-tsabatra.'),
  ('6ab25a1bc55b75539fc4357c', '2026-09-22T10:36:11.571Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:11.571Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 15, 13, 'Farany, dia tonga tany amin’i Saoly i Samoela. Ary hoy i Saoly taminy: “Hotahin’i Jehovah anie ianao! Efa nanatanteraka ny tenin’i Jehovah aho.”', 'farany, dia tonga tany amin’i saoly i samoela. ary hoy i saoly taminy: “hotahin’i jehovah anie ianao! efa nanatanteraka ny tenin’i jehovah aho.”'),
  ('6ab25a1bc55b75539fc4357f', '2026-09-22T10:36:11.571Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:11.571Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 15, 16, 'Ary hoy i Samoela tamin’i Saoly: “Aoka izay! Holazaiko aminao izay notenenin’i Jehovah tamiko halina.” Koa hoy izy taminy: “Lazao àry!”', 'ary hoy i samoela tamin’i saoly: “aoka izay! holazaiko aminao izay notenenin’i jehovah tamiko halina.” koa hoy izy taminy: “lazao àry!”'),
  ('6ab25a1bc55b75539fc43574', '2026-09-22T10:36:11.571Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:11.571Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 15, 5, 'Dia tonga hatreo amin’ny tanànan’i Amaleka i Saoly, ka niafina teo akaikin’ny lohasaha falehan-driaka mba hanafika.', 'dia tonga hatreo amin’ny tanànan’i amaleka i saoly, ka niafina teo akaikin’ny lohasaha falehan-driaka mba hanafika.'),
  ('6ab25a1bc55b75539fc43580', '2026-09-22T10:36:11.571Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:11.571Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 15, 17, 'Dia hoy i Samoela: “Tsy lasa lehiben’ireo fokon’ny Israely ve ianao, fony ianao nihevi-tena ho kely? Ary nanosotra anao ho mpanjakan’ny Israely i Jehovah.', 'dia hoy i samoela: “tsy lasa lehiben’ireo fokon’ny israely ve ianao, fony ianao nihevi-tena ho kely? ary nanosotra anao ho mpanjakan’ny israely i jehovah.'),
  ('6ab25a1bc55b75539fc43578', '2026-09-22T10:36:11.571Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:11.571Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 15, 9, 'Ary i Saoly sy ny olona nangoraka an’i Agaga sy ny tsara indrindra tamin’ny ondry aman’osy sy ny omby ary izay matavy, mbamin’ny ondrilahy sy izay tsara rehetra, ka tsy tian’izy ireo haringana tanteraka ireny. Naringany tanteraka kosa ny zava-drehetra tsy nisy vidiny sy nailikilika.', 'ary i saoly sy ny olona nangoraka an’i agaga sy ny tsara indrindra tamin’ny ondry aman’osy sy ny omby ary izay matavy, mbamin’ny ondrilahy sy izay tsara rehetra, ka tsy tian’izy ireo haringana tanteraka ireny. naringany tanteraka kosa ny zava-drehetra tsy nisy vidiny sy nailikilika.'),
  ('6ab25a1bc55b75539fc4357e', '2026-09-22T10:36:11.571Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:11.571Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 15, 15, 'Dia hoy i Saoly: “Avy tany amin’ny Amalekita no nitondran’ny olona an’ireny, satria nangoraka ny tsara indrindra tamin’ny ondry aman’osy sy ny omby izy ireo, mba hatao sorona ho an’i Jehovah Andriamanitrao. Ny sisa kosa naringanay tanteraka.”', 'dia hoy i saoly: “avy tany amin’ny amalekita no nitondran’ny olona an’ireny, satria nangoraka ny tsara indrindra tamin’ny ondry aman’osy sy ny omby izy ireo, mba hatao sorona ho an’i jehovah andriamanitrao. ny sisa kosa naringanay tanteraka.”'),
  ('6ab25a1bc55b75539fc4357d', '2026-09-22T10:36:11.571Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:11.571Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 15, 14, 'Hoy anefa i Samoela: “Koa inona izany feon’ny ondry aman’osy sy izany feon’omby reko izany?”', 'hoy anefa i samoela: “koa inona izany feon’ny ondry aman’osy sy izany feon’omby reko izany?”');
INSERT INTO "bible_verses" ("id", "created_date", "updated_date", "created_by_id", "created_by", "translation", "book", "bookOrder", "chapter", "verse", "text", "normalizedText") VALUES
  ('6ab25a1bc55b75539fc43575', '2026-09-22T10:36:11.571Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:11.571Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 15, 6, 'Ary hoy i Saoly tamin’ny Kenita: “Mandehana midina, ka mialà amin’ny Amalekita, mba tsy handringanako anao miaraka aminy. Fa naneho hatsaram-panahy feno fitiavana tamin’ny zanak’Israely rehetra ianao, fony izy ireo niakatra avy tany Ejipta.” Koa niala tamin’i Amaleka ny Kenita.', 'ary hoy i saoly tamin’ny kenita: “mandehana midina, ka mialà amin’ny amalekita, mba tsy handringanako anao miaraka aminy. fa naneho hatsaram-panahy feno fitiavana tamin’ny zanak’israely rehetra ianao, fony izy ireo niakatra avy tany ejipta.” koa niala tamin’i amaleka ny kenita.'),
  ('6ab25a1bc55b75539fc43572', '2026-09-22T10:36:11.571Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:11.571Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 15, 3, 'Koa mandehana, ka asio i Amaleka ary aringano tanteraka izy mbamin’izay rehetra azy. Aza mangoraka azy fa vonoy ho faty izy ireo, na lehilahy na vehivavy, na ankizikely na zaza minono, na omby na ondry, na rameva na ampondra.’”', 'koa mandehana, ka asio i amaleka ary aringano tanteraka izy mbamin’izay rehetra azy. aza mangoraka azy fa vonoy ho faty izy ireo, na lehilahy na vehivavy, na ankizikely na zaza minono, na omby na ondry, na rameva na ampondra.’”'),
  ('6ab25a1bc55b75539fc43581', '2026-09-22T10:36:11.571Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:11.571Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 15, 18, 'Tatỳ aoriana, dia naniraka anao i Jehovah ka nilaza hoe: ‘Mandehana, atokàny haringana ireo mpanota, dia ny Amalekita. Ary miadia aminy mandra-pandringanao azy tanteraka.’', 'tatỳ aoriana, dia naniraka anao i jehovah ka nilaza hoe: ‘mandehana, atokàny haringana ireo mpanota, dia ny amalekita. ary miadia aminy mandra-pandringanao azy tanteraka.’'),
  ('6ab25a1bc55b75539fc43571', '2026-09-22T10:36:11.571Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:11.571Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 15, 2, 'Izao no nolazain’i Jehovah Tompon’ny tafika: ‘Hanao ampamoaka an’i Amaleka aho, noho ny namelezany ny Israely teny an-dalana fony izy ireo niakatra avy tany Ejipta.', 'izao no nolazain’i jehovah tompon’ny tafika: ‘hanao ampamoaka an’i amaleka aho, noho ny namelezany ny israely teny an-dalana fony izy ireo niakatra avy tany ejipta.'),
  ('6ab25a1bc55b75539fc43583', '2026-09-22T10:36:11.571Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:11.571Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 15, 20, 'Dia hoy i Saoly tamin’i Samoela: “Nankatò ny tenin’i Jehovah ange aho e! Nataoko izay nanirahan’i Jehovah ahy, ary nentiko i Agaga mpanjakan’i Amaleka, fa i Amaleka kosa naringako tanteraka.', 'dia hoy i saoly tamin’i samoela: “nankatò ny tenin’i jehovah ange aho e! nataoko izay nanirahan’i jehovah ahy, ary nentiko i agaga mpanjakan’i amaleka, fa i amaleka kosa naringako tanteraka.'),
  ('6ab25a1bc55b75539fc43582', '2026-09-22T10:36:11.571Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:11.571Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 15, 19, 'Koa nahoana no tsy nankatò ny tenin’i Jehovah ianao, fa nihazakazaka nandrombaka ny zavatra azo babo ka nanao izay ratsy teo imason’i Jehovah?”', 'koa nahoana no tsy nankatò ny tenin’i jehovah ianao, fa nihazakazaka nandrombaka ny zavatra azo babo ka nanao izay ratsy teo imason’i jehovah?”'),
  ('6ab25a1bc55b75539fc4357b', '2026-09-22T10:36:11.571Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:11.571Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 15, 12, 'Dia nifoha maraina i Samoela mba hihaona tamin’i Saoly. Nisy nilaza taminy anefa hoe: “Nankao Karmela i Saoly, ka nanorina tsangambato hahatsiarovana ny tenany, dia niverina ary niampita nidina nankany Gilgala.”', 'dia nifoha maraina i samoela mba hihaona tamin’i saoly. nisy nilaza taminy anefa hoe: “nankao karmela i saoly, ka nanorina tsangambato hahatsiarovana ny tenany, dia niverina ary niampita nidina nankany gilgala.”'),
  ('6ab25a1bc55b75539fc4357a', '2026-09-22T10:36:11.571Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:11.571Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 15, 11, '“Tena manenina aho noho ny nanaovako an’i Saoly ho mpanjaka, satria tsy nanaraka ahy intsony izy, sady tsy nanatanteraka ny teniko.” Ary nampahory an’i Samoela izany, ka nitaraina mafy tamin’i Jehovah izy ny alina manontolo.', '“tena manenina aho noho ny nanaovako an’i saoly ho mpanjaka, satria tsy nanaraka ahy intsony izy, sady tsy nanatanteraka ny teniko.” ary nampahory an’i samoela izany, ka nitaraina mafy tamin’i jehovah izy ny alina manontolo.'),
  ('6ab25a1bc55b75539fc43573', '2026-09-22T10:36:11.571Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:11.571Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 15, 4, 'Koa novorin’i Saoly ny olona, dia nisainy tao Telaima, ka roa hetsy ny lehilahy nandeha an-tongotra, ary iray alina ny lehilahy anisan’ny fokon’i Joda.', 'koa novorin’i saoly ny olona, dia nisainy tao telaima, ka roa hetsy ny lehilahy nandeha an-tongotra, ary iray alina ny lehilahy anisan’ny fokon’i joda.'),
  ('6ab25a1bc55b75539fc4358c', '2026-09-22T10:36:11.572Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:11.572Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 15, 29, 'Ary tsy handainga ilay Hajaina Indrindra eo amin’ny Israely, sady tsy hanenina, satria tsy olombelona izy ka hanenina.”', 'ary tsy handainga ilay hajaina indrindra eo amin’ny israely, sady tsy hanenina, satria tsy olombelona izy ka hanenina.”'),
  ('6ab25a1bc55b75539fc43586', '2026-09-22T10:36:11.572Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:11.572Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 15, 23, 'Fa ny mikomy dia mitovy amin’ny manao sikidy, izay fahotana, ary ny minia miana-kendry dia mitovy amin’ny mampiasa herin’ny maizina sy terafima. * Nanda ny tenin’i Jehovah ianao, ka laviny tsy ho mpanjaka.”', 'fa ny mikomy dia mitovy amin’ny manao sikidy, izay fahotana, ary ny minia miana-kendry dia mitovy amin’ny mampiasa herin’ny maizina sy terafima. * nanda ny tenin’i jehovah ianao, ka laviny tsy ho mpanjaka.”'),
  ('6ab25a1bc55b75539fc43590', '2026-09-22T10:36:11.572Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:11.572Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 15, 33, 'Hoy anefa i Samoela: “Nataon’ny sabatrao fongana ny zanaky ny vehivavy, koa mba hatao fongana toy izany koa ny zanaky ny reninao, ka amin’ny vehivavy rehetra dia izy no ho fongana anaka indrindra.” Dia notetitetehin’i Samoela teo anatrehan’i Jehovah tao Gilgala i Agaga.', 'hoy anefa i samoela: “nataon’ny sabatrao fongana ny zanaky ny vehivavy, koa mba hatao fongana toy izany koa ny zanaky ny reninao, ka amin’ny vehivavy rehetra dia izy no ho fongana anaka indrindra.” dia notetitetehin’i samoela teo anatrehan’i jehovah tao gilgala i agaga.'),
  ('6ab25a1bc55b75539fc4358a', '2026-09-22T10:36:11.572Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:11.572Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 15, 27, 'Ary raha vao nihodina handeha i Samoela, dia notazonin’i Saoly ny morontongotr’ilay akanjony tsy misy tanany, ka rovitra.', 'ary raha vao nihodina handeha i samoela, dia notazonin’i saoly ny morontongotr’ilay akanjony tsy misy tanany, ka rovitra.'),
  ('6ab25a1bc55b75539fc43585', '2026-09-22T10:36:11.572Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:11.572Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 15, 22, 'Koa hoy i Samoela: “Ny fanatitra dorana sy sorona ve no sitrak’i Jehovah kokoa noho ny mankatò ny tenin’i Jehovah? Ny mankatò no tsara kokoa noho ny sorona, ary ny mihaino no tsara kokoa noho ny tavin’ondrilahy.', 'koa hoy i samoela: “ny fanatitra dorana sy sorona ve no sitrak’i jehovah kokoa noho ny mankatò ny tenin’i jehovah? ny mankatò no tsara kokoa noho ny sorona, ary ny mihaino no tsara kokoa noho ny tavin’ondrilahy.'),
  ('6ab25a1bc55b75539fc4358d', '2026-09-22T10:36:11.572Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:11.572Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 15, 30, 'Dia hoy i Saoly: “Efa nanota aho. Ary ankehitriny, mba omeo voninahitra eo anatrehan’ny anti-panahin’ny vahoakako sy eo anatrehan’ny Israely aho, ka miverena miaraka amiko, ary hiankohoka eo anatrehan’i Jehovah Andriamanitrao aho.”', 'dia hoy i saoly: “efa nanota aho. ary ankehitriny, mba omeo voninahitra eo anatrehan’ny anti-panahin’ny vahoakako sy eo anatrehan’ny israely aho, ka miverena miaraka amiko, ary hiankohoka eo anatrehan’i jehovah andriamanitrao aho.”'),
  ('6ab25a1bc55b75539fc43591', '2026-09-22T10:36:11.572Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:11.572Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 15, 34, 'Ary lasa nankany Rama i Samoela, fa i Saoly kosa niakatra nankany an-tranony tao Gibean’i Saoly.', 'ary lasa nankany rama i samoela, fa i saoly kosa niakatra nankany an-tranony tao gibean’i saoly.'),
  ('6ab25a1bc55b75539fc4358b', '2026-09-22T10:36:11.572Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:11.572Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 15, 28, 'Dia hoy i Samoela: “Efa norovitin’i Jehovah hiala aminao ny fanjakan’ny Israely androany, ka homeny ho an’olona tsara kokoa noho ianao.', 'dia hoy i samoela: “efa norovitin’i jehovah hiala aminao ny fanjakan’ny israely androany, ka homeny ho an’olona tsara kokoa noho ianao.'),
  ('6ab25a1bc55b75539fc43588', '2026-09-22T10:36:11.572Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:11.572Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 15, 25, 'Mba avelao re ny fahotako e, ary miverena miaraka amiko mba hiankohofako eo anatrehan’i Jehovah.”', 'mba avelao re ny fahotako e, ary miverena miaraka amiko mba hiankohofako eo anatrehan’i jehovah.”'),
  ('6ab25a1bc55b75539fc43592', '2026-09-22T10:36:11.572Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:11.572Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 15, 35, 'Ary i Samoela tsy nahita an’i Saoly intsony mandra-pahafatiny, nefa nalahelo noho ny amin’i Saoly izy. I Jehovah kosa nanenina noho ny nanaovany an’i Saoly ho mpanjakan’ny Israely.', 'ary i samoela tsy nahita an’i saoly intsony mandra-pahafatiny, nefa nalahelo noho ny amin’i saoly izy. i jehovah kosa nanenina noho ny nanaovany an’i saoly ho mpanjakan’ny israely.'),
  ('6ab25a1bc55b75539fc4358e', '2026-09-22T10:36:11.572Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:11.572Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 15, 31, 'Koa niverina nanaraka an’i Saoly i Samoela, ary i Saoly niankohoka teo anatrehan’i Jehovah.', 'koa niverina nanaraka an’i saoly i samoela, ary i saoly niankohoka teo anatrehan’i jehovah.'),
  ('6ab25a1bc55b75539fc4358f', '2026-09-22T10:36:11.572Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:11.572Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 15, 32, 'Hoy i Samoela nony avy eo: “Ento atỳ amiko i Agaga mpanjakan’i Amaleka.” Koa natahotahotra i Agaga rehefa nankeo aminy, nefa niteny anakampo ihany hoe: “Efa niala tamiko ny ngidin’ny fahafatesana.”', 'hoy i samoela nony avy eo: “ento atỳ amiko i agaga mpanjakan’i amaleka.” koa natahotahotra i agaga rehefa nankeo aminy, nefa niteny anakampo ihany hoe: “efa niala tamiko ny ngidin’ny fahafatesana.”'),
  ('6ab25a1bc55b75539fc43584', '2026-09-22T10:36:11.572Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:11.572Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 15, 21, 'Ary naka ondry sy omby tamin’ny zavatra azo babo ny olona, ka ny tsara indrindra tamin’ny zavatra natokana haringana no nalainy mba hatao sorona ho an’i Jehovah Andriamanitrao eto Gilgala.”', 'ary naka ondry sy omby tamin’ny zavatra azo babo ny olona, ka ny tsara indrindra tamin’ny zavatra natokana haringana no nalainy mba hatao sorona ho an’i jehovah andriamanitrao eto gilgala.”'),
  ('6ab25a1bc55b75539fc43589', '2026-09-22T10:36:11.572Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:11.572Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 15, 26, 'Hoy anefa i Samoela taminy: “Tsy hiverina hiaraka aminao aho, fa efa nanda ny tenin’i Jehovah ianao, ka lavin’i Jehovah tsy ho mpanjakan’ny Israely intsony.”', 'hoy anefa i samoela taminy: “tsy hiverina hiaraka aminao aho, fa efa nanda ny tenin’i jehovah ianao, ka lavin’i jehovah tsy ho mpanjakan’ny israely intsony.”'),
  ('6ab25a1bc55b75539fc43587', '2026-09-22T10:36:11.572Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:11.572Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 15, 24, 'Ary hoy i Saoly tamin’i Samoela: “Efa nanota aho, satria nandika ny baikon’i Jehovah sy ny teninao. Natahotra ny olona mantsy aho ka nankatò ny teniny.', 'ary hoy i saoly tamin’i samoela: “efa nanota aho, satria nandika ny baikon’i jehovah sy ny teninao. natahotra ny olona mantsy aho ka nankatò ny teniny.'),
  ('6ab25a1cbbc2b80fefa2e92b', '2026-09-22T10:36:12.079Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:12.079Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 16, 8, 'Dia nantsoin’i Jese i Abinadaba, ka nampandaloviny teo anoloan’i Samoela, nefa hoy i Samoela: “Tsy nifidy an’io koa i Jehovah.”', 'dia nantsoin’i jese i abinadaba, ka nampandaloviny teo anoloan’i samoela, nefa hoy i samoela: “tsy nifidy an’io koa i jehovah.”'),
  ('6ab25a1cbbc2b80fefa2e928', '2026-09-22T10:36:12.079Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:12.079Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 16, 5, 'Dia namaly izy hoe: “Eny, fihavanana! Tonga hanao sorona ho an’i Jehovah aho. Koa hamasino ny tenanareo, ka avia hiaraka amiko any amin’ny sorona.” Ary nohamasininy i Jese sy ireo zanany lahy, ka nantsoiny ho any amin’ny sorona.', 'dia namaly izy hoe: “eny, fihavanana! tonga hanao sorona ho an’i jehovah aho. koa hamasino ny tenanareo, ka avia hiaraka amiko any amin’ny sorona.” ary nohamasininy i jese sy ireo zanany lahy, ka nantsoiny ho any amin’ny sorona.'),
  ('6ab25a1cbbc2b80fefa2e933', '2026-09-22T10:36:12.079Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:12.079Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 16, 16, 'Koa raha sitrakao, dia aoka ianao tompoko handidy ny mpanomponao izay eto anatrehanao, mba hitady olona mahay mitendry harpa. Ary rehefa mahazo anao ilay fikorontanan-tsaina avy amin’Andriamanitra, dia hitendry harpa izy, ka hihatsara ianao.”', 'koa raha sitrakao, dia aoka ianao tompoko handidy ny mpanomponao izay eto anatrehanao, mba hitady olona mahay mitendry harpa. ary rehefa mahazo anao ilay fikorontanan-tsaina avy amin’andriamanitra, dia hitendry harpa izy, ka hihatsara ianao.”'),
  ('6ab25a1cbbc2b80fefa2e926', '2026-09-22T10:36:12.079Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:12.079Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 16, 3, 'Dia antsoy ho any amin’ny sorona i Jese, fa hampahafantariko anao izay tokony hataonao. Koa hosory ho ahy izay hasehoko anao.”', 'dia antsoy ho any amin’ny sorona i jese, fa hampahafantariko anao izay tokony hataonao. koa hosory ho ahy izay hasehoko anao.”'),
  ('6ab25a1cbbc2b80fefa2e924', '2026-09-22T10:36:12.079Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:12.079Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 16, 1, 'Farany, dia hoy i Jehovah tamin’i Samoela: “Mandra-pahoviana ianao no halahelo noho ny amin’i Saoly, nefa izaho efa nanda azy tsy ho mpanjakan’ny Israely? Fenoy menaka ilay tandroka any aminao, ka mandehana. Hirahiko ho any amin’i Jese Betlehemita ianao, fa efa nahita mpanjaka ho ahy aho, eo amin’ireo zanany lahy.”', 'farany, dia hoy i jehovah tamin’i samoela: “mandra-pahoviana ianao no halahelo noho ny amin’i saoly, nefa izaho efa nanda azy tsy ho mpanjakan’ny israely? fenoy menaka ilay tandroka any aminao, ka mandehana. hirahiko ho any amin’i jese betlehemita ianao, fa efa nahita mpanjaka ho ahy aho, eo amin’ireo zanany lahy.”'),
  ('6ab25a1cbbc2b80fefa2e927', '2026-09-22T10:36:12.079Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:12.079Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 16, 4, 'Koa nataon’i Samoela izay nolazain’i Jehovah. Ary nony tonga tany Betlehema izy, dia nihorohoro ny anti-panahin’ilay tanàna rehefa nihaona taminy, ka nilaza hoe: “Fihavanana ve no ahatongavanao?”', 'koa nataon’i samoela izay nolazain’i jehovah. ary nony tonga tany betlehema izy, dia nihorohoro ny anti-panahin’ilay tanàna rehefa nihaona taminy, ka nilaza hoe: “fihavanana ve no ahatongavanao?”'),
  ('6ab25a1cbbc2b80fefa2e925', '2026-09-22T10:36:12.079Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:12.079Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 16, 2, 'Fa hoy i Samoela: “Ataoko ahoana no fandeha any? Raha vao ren’i Saoly izany, dia hovonoiny ho faty aho.” Ary hoy i Jehovah: “Mitondrà vantotr’ombivavy avy amin’ny andian’omby, ka lazao hoe: ‘Tonga hanao sorona ho an’i Jehovah aho.’', 'fa hoy i samoela: “ataoko ahoana no fandeha any? raha vao ren’i saoly izany, dia hovonoiny ho faty aho.” ary hoy i jehovah: “mitondrà vantotr’ombivavy avy amin’ny andian’omby, ka lazao hoe: ‘tonga hanao sorona ho an’i jehovah aho.’'),
  ('6ab25a1cbbc2b80fefa2e936', '2026-09-22T10:36:12.079Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:12.079Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 16, 19, 'Dia nandefa iraka hankany amin’i Jese i Saoly, nanao hoe: “Alefaso atỳ amiko i Davida zanakao, izay miandry ondry.”', 'dia nandefa iraka hankany amin’i jese i saoly, nanao hoe: “alefaso atỳ amiko i davida zanakao, izay miandry ondry.”'),
  ('6ab25a1cbbc2b80fefa2e934', '2026-09-22T10:36:12.079Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:12.079Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 16, 17, 'Koa hoy i Saoly tamin’ny mpanompony: “Mba itadiavo olona mahay mitendry àry aho, ka ento atỳ amiko.”', 'koa hoy i saoly tamin’ny mpanompony: “mba itadiavo olona mahay mitendry àry aho, ka ento atỳ amiko.”'),
  ('6ab25a1cbbc2b80fefa2e92d', '2026-09-22T10:36:12.079Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:12.079Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 16, 10, 'Koa nampandalovin’i Jese teo anoloan’i Samoela ny fito tamin’ny zanany lahy, nefa mbola nilaza tamin’i Jese ihany i Samoela hoe: “Tsy nifidy an’ireo i Jehovah.”', 'koa nampandalovin’i jese teo anoloan’i samoela ny fito tamin’ny zanany lahy, nefa mbola nilaza tamin’i jese ihany i samoela hoe: “tsy nifidy an’ireo i jehovah.”'),
  ('6ab25a1cbbc2b80fefa2e930', '2026-09-22T10:36:12.079Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:12.079Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 16, 13, 'Koa naka an’ilay tandroka nisy menaka i Samoela, ka nanosotra an’i Davida teo anivon’ireo rahalahiny. Ary niasa tamin’i Davida ny fanahin’i Jehovah, nanomboka tamin’iny andro iny. Dia nitsangana i Samoela avy eo, ka lasa nankany Rama.', 'koa naka an’ilay tandroka nisy menaka i samoela, ka nanosotra an’i davida teo anivon’ireo rahalahiny. ary niasa tamin’i davida ny fanahin’i jehovah, nanomboka tamin’iny andro iny. dia nitsangana i samoela avy eo, ka lasa nankany rama.'),
  ('6ab25a1cbbc2b80fefa2e931', '2026-09-22T10:36:12.079Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:12.079Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 16, 14, 'Ary ny fanahin’i Jehovah niala tamin’i Saoly, ka nisy fikorontanan-tsaina * avy amin’i Jehovah nahatonga azy hihorohoro.', 'ary ny fanahin’i jehovah niala tamin’i saoly, ka nisy fikorontanan-tsaina * avy amin’i jehovah nahatonga azy hihorohoro.'),
  ('6ab25a1cbbc2b80fefa2e92e', '2026-09-22T10:36:12.079Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:12.079Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 16, 11, 'Farany, dia hoy i Samoela: “Ireo daholo ve ny lahy rehetra?” Dia hoy i Jese: “Ilay faralahy sisa no tsy eo, fa mbola miandry ondry.” Koa hoy i Samoela tamin’i Jese: “Maniraha olona haka azy, fa tsy hipetraka hisakafo isika raha tsy tonga eto izy.”', 'farany, dia hoy i samoela: “ireo daholo ve ny lahy rehetra?” dia hoy i jese: “ilay faralahy sisa no tsy eo, fa mbola miandry ondry.” koa hoy i samoela tamin’i jese: “maniraha olona haka azy, fa tsy hipetraka hisakafo isika raha tsy tonga eto izy.”'),
  ('6ab25a1cbbc2b80fefa2e937', '2026-09-22T10:36:12.079Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:12.079Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 16, 20, 'Ary naka ampondra sy mofo sy divay eran’ny siny hoditra ary zanak’osy i Jese, ka nampitondrainy an’i Davida zanany mba homena an’i Saoly.', 'ary naka ampondra sy mofo sy divay eran’ny siny hoditra ary zanak’osy i jese, ka nampitondrainy an’i davida zanany mba homena an’i saoly.'),
  ('6ab25a1cbbc2b80fefa2e92a', '2026-09-22T10:36:12.079Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:12.079Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 16, 7, 'Hoy anefa i Jehovah tamin’i Samoela: “Aza mijery ny bika aman’endriny sy ny haavon’ny tsanganany, fa efa nolaviko izy. Fa tsy toy ny fijerin’ny olona ny fijerin’Andriamanitra, satria ny olona mijery izay hitan’ny maso, fa i Jehovah kosa mijery ny fo.”', 'hoy anefa i jehovah tamin’i samoela: “aza mijery ny bika aman’endriny sy ny haavon’ny tsanganany, fa efa nolaviko izy. fa tsy toy ny fijerin’ny olona ny fijerin’andriamanitra, satria ny olona mijery izay hitan’ny maso, fa i jehovah kosa mijery ny fo.”'),
  ('6ab25a1cbbc2b80fefa2e935', '2026-09-22T10:36:12.079Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:12.079Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 16, 18, 'Dia hoy ny iray tamin’ny mpanompo hoe: “Misy zanak’i Jese Betlehemita fantatro fa mahay mitendry harpa. Lehilahy matanjaka sy mahery fo izy sady lehilahy mpiady. Mahay mandaha-teny koa izy sady tsara bika, ary momba azy i Jehovah.”', 'dia hoy ny iray tamin’ny mpanompo hoe: “misy zanak’i jese betlehemita fantatro fa mahay mitendry harpa. lehilahy matanjaka sy mahery fo izy sady lehilahy mpiady. mahay mandaha-teny koa izy sady tsara bika, ary momba azy i jehovah.”'),
  ('6ab25a1cbbc2b80fefa2e939', '2026-09-22T10:36:12.079Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:12.079Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 16, 22, 'Koa naniraka olona nankany amin’i Jese i Saoly, nanao hoe: “Mba avelao i Davida hanompo ahy atỳ ihany, fa efa nankasitrahako izy.”', 'koa naniraka olona nankany amin’i jese i saoly, nanao hoe: “mba avelao i davida hanompo ahy atỳ ihany, fa efa nankasitrahako izy.”'),
  ('6ab25a1cbbc2b80fefa2e938', '2026-09-22T10:36:12.079Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:12.079Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 16, 21, 'Dia tonga tany amin’i Saoly i Davida ka nanompo azy. Ary tena tia be azy i Saoly, ka nanjary mpitondra ny fiadiany izy.', 'dia tonga tany amin’i saoly i davida ka nanompo azy. ary tena tia be azy i saoly, ka nanjary mpitondra ny fiadiany izy.'),
  ('6ab25a1cbbc2b80fefa2e92f', '2026-09-22T10:36:12.079Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:12.079Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 16, 12, 'Koa nampanalain’i Jese izy. Somary mena ilay zazalahy, ary mahafinaritra be ny masony sady tsara tarehy izy. Dia hoy i Jehovah: “Mitsangàna, ka hosory izy, fa io no izy!”', 'koa nampanalain’i jese izy. somary mena ilay zazalahy, ary mahafinaritra be ny masony sady tsara tarehy izy. dia hoy i jehovah: “mitsangàna, ka hosory izy, fa io no izy!”'),
  ('6ab25a1cbbc2b80fefa2e92c', '2026-09-22T10:36:12.079Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:12.079Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 16, 9, 'Nampandalovin’i Jese koa i Sama, nefa hoy i Samoela: “Tsy nifidy an’io koa i Jehovah.”', 'nampandalovin’i jese koa i sama, nefa hoy i samoela: “tsy nifidy an’io koa i jehovah.”'),
  ('6ab25a1cbbc2b80fefa2e932', '2026-09-22T10:36:12.079Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:12.079Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 16, 15, 'Dia hoy ny mpanompon’i Saoly taminy: “Jereo fa mihorohoro ianao noho ny fikorontanan-tsaina avy amin’Andriamanitra.', 'dia hoy ny mpanompon’i saoly taminy: “jereo fa mihorohoro ianao noho ny fikorontanan-tsaina avy amin’andriamanitra.'),
  ('6ab25a1cbbc2b80fefa2e93a', '2026-09-22T10:36:12.079Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:12.079Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 16, 23, 'Ary rehefa nahazo an’i Saoly ilay fikorontanan-tsaina avy amin’Andriamanitra, dia nandray ny harpa i Davida ka nitendry izany. Koa nahatsiaro ho maivamaivana i Saoly sady nihatsara, ary tsy nikorontan-tsaina intsony.', 'ary rehefa nahazo an’i saoly ilay fikorontanan-tsaina avy amin’andriamanitra, dia nandray ny harpa i davida ka nitendry izany. koa nahatsiaro ho maivamaivana i saoly sady nihatsara, ary tsy nikorontan-tsaina intsony.'),
  ('6ab25a1cbbc2b80fefa2e929', '2026-09-22T10:36:12.079Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:12.079Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 16, 6, 'Dia niditra izy ireo. Koa hoy i Samoela raha vao nahita an’i Eliaba: “Io eo anatrehan’i Jehovah io mihitsy ilay voahosony.”', 'dia niditra izy ireo. koa hoy i samoela raha vao nahita an’i eliaba: “io eo anatrehan’i jehovah io mihitsy ilay voahosony.”'),
  ('6ab25a1ceaa97ffe787f044f', '2026-09-22T10:36:12.900Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:12.900Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 17, 54, 'Ary nalain’i Davida ny lohan’ilay Filistinina ka nentiny tany Jerosalema, fa ny fitaovam-piadian’ilay Filistinina kosa nataony tao an-tranolainy.', 'ary nalain’i davida ny lohan’ilay filistinina ka nentiny tany jerosalema, fa ny fitaovam-piadian’ilay filistinina kosa nataony tao an-tranolainy.'),
  ('6ab25a1ceaa97ffe787f0440', '2026-09-22T10:36:12.900Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:12.900Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 17, 39, 'Ary nataon’i Davida teo amin’ny fehikibony teo ambonin’ny akanjony ny sabatr’i Saoly. Dia nandeha izy nefa tsy afaka, fa mbola tsy zatra nanao an’ireny. Farany, dia hoy i Davida tamin’i Saoly: “Tsy afa-mandeha aho raha manao an’ireto, fa mbola tsy mahazatra ahy ireto.” Koa nesorin’i Davida ireny.', 'ary nataon’i davida teo amin’ny fehikibony teo ambonin’ny akanjony ny sabatr’i saoly. dia nandeha izy nefa tsy afaka, fa mbola tsy zatra nanao an’ireny. farany, dia hoy i davida tamin’i saoly: “tsy afa-mandeha aho raha manao an’ireto, fa mbola tsy mahazatra ahy ireto.” koa nesorin’i davida ireny.'),
  ('6ab25a1ceaa97ffe787f0436', '2026-09-22T10:36:12.900Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:12.900Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 17, 29, 'Ary hoy i Davida: “Fa maninona aho izao? Mba manontany fotsiny ange aho e!”', 'ary hoy i davida: “fa maninona aho izao? mba manontany fotsiny ange aho e!”'),
  ('6ab25a1ceaa97ffe787f0431', '2026-09-22T10:36:12.900Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:12.900Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 17, 24, 'Rehefa nahita an’ilay miaramila ny lehilahy israelita rehetra, dia nandositra sady natahotra mafy.', 'rehefa nahita an’ilay miaramila ny lehilahy israelita rehetra, dia nandositra sady natahotra mafy.'),
  ('6ab25a1ceaa97ffe787f041a', '2026-09-22T10:36:12.900Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:12.900Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 17, 1, 'Ary nangonin’ny Filistinina hiatrika ady ireo tobiny. Rehefa tafangona tao Soko any Joda izy ireo, dia nandeha nitoby tao Efesa-damima, eo anelanelan’i Soko sy Azeka.', 'ary nangonin’ny filistinina hiatrika ady ireo tobiny. rehefa tafangona tao soko any joda izy ireo, dia nandeha nitoby tao efesa-damima, eo anelanelan’i soko sy azeka.'),
  ('6ab25a1ceaa97ffe787f044b', '2026-09-22T10:36:12.900Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:12.900Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 17, 50, 'Koa nahery noho ilay Filistinina i Davida nefa pilotra sy vato fotsiny no teny aminy, ka namely nahafaty azy izy. Ary tsy nisy sabatra teny an-tanan’i Davida.', 'koa nahery noho ilay filistinina i davida nefa pilotra sy vato fotsiny no teny aminy, ka namely nahafaty azy izy. ary tsy nisy sabatra teny an-tanan’i davida.'),
  ('6ab25a1ceaa97ffe787f042d', '2026-09-22T10:36:12.900Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:12.900Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 17, 20, 'Koa nifoha maraina i Davida, dia nampiandraiketiny olon-kafa ireo ondry. Ary nalainy ny entana ka lasa izy, araka izay nandidian’i Jese azy. Nony tonga teo an-tsisin’ny toby izy, dia indreny fa nivoaka nankeny an’ady ireo tafika, ka nihorakoraka nanao hiakan’ady.', 'koa nifoha maraina i davida, dia nampiandraiketiny olon-kafa ireo ondry. ary nalainy ny entana ka lasa izy, araka izay nandidian’i jese azy. nony tonga teo an-tsisin’ny toby izy, dia indreny fa nivoaka nankeny an’ady ireo tafika, ka nihorakoraka nanao hiakan’ady.'),
  ('6ab25a1ceaa97ffe787f043a', '2026-09-22T10:36:12.900Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:12.900Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 17, 33, 'Hoy anefa i Saoly tamin’i Davida: “Tsy vitanao ny hiady amin’io Filistinina io satria mbola zaza ianao, fa izy kosa lehilahy mpiady hatramin’ny fahakeliny.”', 'hoy anefa i saoly tamin’i davida: “tsy vitanao ny hiady amin’io filistinina io satria mbola zaza ianao, fa izy kosa lehilahy mpiady hatramin’ny fahakeliny.”'),
  ('6ab25a1ceaa97ffe787f042f', '2026-09-22T10:36:12.900Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:12.900Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 17, 22, 'Avy hatrany dia napetrak’i Davida tamin’ny mpiambina entana ireo entana nentiny, ka nihazakazaka nankeny an’ady izy. Ary nanontany ny fahasalaman’ny rahalahiny izy nony tonga teny.', 'avy hatrany dia napetrak’i davida tamin’ny mpiambina entana ireo entana nentiny, ka nihazakazaka nankeny an’ady izy. ary nanontany ny fahasalaman’ny rahalahiny izy nony tonga teny.'),
  ('6ab25a1ceaa97ffe787f0442', '2026-09-22T10:36:12.900Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:12.900Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 17, 41, 'Ary nanatona an’i Davida tsikelikely ilay Filistinina, sady teo alohany ilay lehilahy nitondra ny ampinga lehibe.', 'ary nanatona an’i davida tsikelikely ilay filistinina, sady teo alohany ilay lehilahy nitondra ny ampinga lehibe.'),
  ('6ab25a1ceaa97ffe787f043b', '2026-09-22T10:36:12.900Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:12.900Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 17, 34, 'Dia hoy i Davida taminy: “Ny mpanomponao dia lasa mpiandry ny ondry aman’osin-drainy. Ary nisy liona sy orsa tonga ka samy naka ondry tamin’ny andiany.', 'dia hoy i davida taminy: “ny mpanomponao dia lasa mpiandry ny ondry aman’osin-drainy. ary nisy liona sy orsa tonga ka samy naka ondry tamin’ny andiany.'),
  ('6ab25a1ceaa97ffe787f041d', '2026-09-22T10:36:12.900Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:12.900Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 17, 4, 'Ary nisy miaramila iray solontenan’ny tafiky ny Filistinina nivoaka avy tao an-tobiny. Goliata no anarany, avy any Gata izy, ary enina hakiho sy irain-jehy ny halavany.', 'ary nisy miaramila iray solontenan’ny tafiky ny filistinina nivoaka avy tao an-tobiny. goliata no anarany, avy any gata izy, ary enina hakiho sy irain-jehy ny halavany.'),
  ('6ab25a1ceaa97ffe787f0430', '2026-09-22T10:36:12.900Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:12.900Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 17, 23, 'Raha mbola niresaka tamin’izy ireo izy, dia iny fa niakatra avy eny amin’ny tafiky ny Filistinina ilay miaramila solontenan’izy ireo atao hoe Goliata, izay Filistinina avy any Gata. Ary nilaza izay efa noteneniny teo aloha ihany i Goliata, ka ren’i Davida izany.', 'raha mbola niresaka tamin’izy ireo izy, dia iny fa niakatra avy eny amin’ny tafiky ny filistinina ilay miaramila solontenan’izy ireo atao hoe goliata, izay filistinina avy any gata. ary nilaza izay efa noteneniny teo aloha ihany i goliata, ka ren’i davida izany.'),
  ('6ab25a1ceaa97ffe787f0451', '2026-09-22T10:36:12.900Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:12.900Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 17, 56, 'Koa hoy ny mpanjaka: “Anontanio hoe zanak’iza iny zazalahy iny.”', 'koa hoy ny mpanjaka: “anontanio hoe zanak’iza iny zazalahy iny.”'),
  ('6ab25a1ceaa97ffe787f0450', '2026-09-22T10:36:12.900Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:12.900Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 17, 55, 'Tamin’i Saoly nahita an’i Davida nivoaka hifanandrina tamin’ilay Filistinina, dia hoy izy tamin’i Abnera, lehiben’ny tafika: “Zanak’iza iny zazalahy iny, ry Abnera?” Dia hoy i Abnera: “Mianiana aminao aho, ry mpanjaka, fa tsy fantatro mihitsy!”', 'tamin’i saoly nahita an’i davida nivoaka hifanandrina tamin’ilay filistinina, dia hoy izy tamin’i abnera, lehiben’ny tafika: “zanak’iza iny zazalahy iny, ry abnera?” dia hoy i abnera: “mianiana aminao aho, ry mpanjaka, fa tsy fantatro mihitsy!”'),
  ('6ab25a1ceaa97ffe787f0449', '2026-09-22T10:36:12.900Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:12.900Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 17, 48, 'Koa niroso ilay Filistinina ka nihananatona hifanandrina tamin’i Davida. I Davida koa nandroso haingana ka nihazakazaka nankeo amin’ny toeram-piadiana mba hifanandrina tamin’ilay Filistinina.', 'koa niroso ilay filistinina ka nihananatona hifanandrina tamin’i davida. i davida koa nandroso haingana ka nihazakazaka nankeo amin’ny toeram-piadiana mba hifanandrina tamin’ilay filistinina.'),
  ('6ab25a1ceaa97ffe787f0445', '2026-09-22T10:36:12.900Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:12.900Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 17, 44, 'Hoy koa izy tamin’i Davida: “Avia ialahy etỳ, fa homeko ny voro-manidina sy ny biby any an-tsaha ny nofon’ialahy.”', 'hoy koa izy tamin’i davida: “avia ialahy etỳ, fa homeko ny voro-manidina sy ny biby any an-tsaha ny nofon’ialahy.”'),
  ('6ab25a1ceaa97ffe787f0444', '2026-09-22T10:36:12.900Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:12.900Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 17, 43, 'Koa hoy ilay Filistinina tamin’i Davida: “Izaho angaha alika no hatonin’ialahy amin’ny tehina?” Dia niantso ny anaran’ireo andriamaniny izy mba hanozonana an’i Davida.', 'koa hoy ilay filistinina tamin’i davida: “izaho angaha alika no hatonin’ialahy amin’ny tehina?” dia niantso ny anaran’ireo andriamaniny izy mba hanozonana an’i davida.'),
  ('6ab25a1ceaa97ffe787f0433', '2026-09-22T10:36:12.900Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:12.900Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 17, 26, 'Dia hoy i Davida tamin’ireo lehilahy nijoro teo anilany: “Hatao ahoana tsara hoe izay lehilahy mahafaty an’io Filistinina io, ka mahafaka ny Israely amin’izao fahafaham-baraka izao? Fa zinona moa io Filistinina tsy mifora io no dia mihantsy ady amin’ny tafik’ilay Andriamanitra velona?”', 'dia hoy i davida tamin’ireo lehilahy nijoro teo anilany: “hatao ahoana tsara hoe izay lehilahy mahafaty an’io filistinina io, ka mahafaka ny israely amin’izao fahafaham-baraka izao? fa zinona moa io filistinina tsy mifora io no dia mihantsy ady amin’ny tafik’ilay andriamanitra velona?”'),
  ('6ab25a1ceaa97ffe787f0443', '2026-09-22T10:36:12.900Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:12.900Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 17, 42, 'Nony nijery izy ka nahita an’i Davida, dia nanao tsinontsinona an’i Davida satria mbola zaza io, ary somary menamena sady tsara tarehy.', 'nony nijery izy ka nahita an’i davida, dia nanao tsinontsinona an’i davida satria mbola zaza io, ary somary menamena sady tsara tarehy.'),
  ('6ab25a1ceaa97ffe787f0441', '2026-09-22T10:36:12.900Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:12.900Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 17, 40, 'Ary naka ny tehiny izy, dia nifidy ny vato dimy malama indrindra teo amin’ny lohasaha falehan-driaka, ka nanao izany tao anaty kitapony fitondrany miandry ondry sady fasiany zavatra. Teny an-tanany koa ny pilotra. Dia nanatona an’ilay Filistinina izy.', 'ary naka ny tehiny izy, dia nifidy ny vato dimy malama indrindra teo amin’ny lohasaha falehan-driaka, ka nanao izany tao anaty kitapony fitondrany miandry ondry sady fasiany zavatra. teny an-tanany koa ny pilotra. dia nanatona an’ilay filistinina izy.'),
  ('6ab25a1ceaa97ffe787f043f', '2026-09-22T10:36:12.900Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:12.900Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 17, 38, 'Dia nampanaovin’i Saoly an’i Davida ny akanjony, sady nosatrohany fiarovan-doha varahina ny lohany, ary nampanaoviny akanjo mifono vy izy.', 'dia nampanaovin’i saoly an’i davida ny akanjony, sady nosatrohany fiarovan-doha varahina ny lohany, ary nampanaoviny akanjo mifono vy izy.'),
  ('6ab25a1ceaa97ffe787f0432', '2026-09-22T10:36:12.900Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:12.900Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 17, 25, 'Ary hoy ny lehilahy israelita: “Hitanareo ve io lehilahy miakatra io? Hihantsy ady amin’ny Israely no iakarany. Koa izay lehilahy mahafaty an’io, hono, dia homen’ny mpanjaka harem-be, ary homeny ho vadiny ny zanany vavy. Ny ankohonan-drain’izany lehilahy izany koa, hono, hataony afaka amin’ireo adidy eto amin’ny Israely.”', 'ary hoy ny lehilahy israelita: “hitanareo ve io lehilahy miakatra io? hihantsy ady amin’ny israely no iakarany. koa izay lehilahy mahafaty an’io, hono, dia homen’ny mpanjaka harem-be, ary homeny ho vadiny ny zanany vavy. ny ankohonan-drain’izany lehilahy izany koa, hono, hataony afaka amin’ireo adidy eto amin’ny israely.”'),
  ('6ab25a1ceaa97ffe787f0422', '2026-09-22T10:36:12.900Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:12.900Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 17, 9, 'Raha sahy miady amiko izy ka mahafaty ahy, dia ho mpanomponareo izahay. Fa raha afaka mifampitana aminy kosa aho ka mahafaty azy, dia ho mpanomponay ianareo ka hanompo anay.”', 'raha sahy miady amiko izy ka mahafaty ahy, dia ho mpanomponareo izahay. fa raha afaka mifampitana aminy kosa aho ka mahafaty azy, dia ho mpanomponay ianareo ka hanompo anay.”'),
  ('6ab25a1ceaa97ffe787f041f', '2026-09-22T10:36:12.900Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:12.900Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 17, 6, 'Nisy fiarovan-dranjo varahina teo amin’ny tongony, ary nisy lefom-pohy varahina teo andamosiny.', 'nisy fiarovan-dranjo varahina teo amin’ny tongony, ary nisy lefom-pohy varahina teo andamosiny.'),
  ('6ab25a1ceaa97ffe787f0453', '2026-09-22T10:36:12.900Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:12.900Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 17, 58, 'Dia hoy i Saoly taminy: “Zanak’iza moa ianao, anaka?” Ary hoy i Davida: “Zanak’i Jese Betlehemita mpanomponao.”', 'dia hoy i saoly taminy: “zanak’iza moa ianao, anaka?” ary hoy i davida: “zanak’i jese betlehemita mpanomponao.”'),
  ('6ab25a1ceaa97ffe787f044a', '2026-09-22T10:36:12.900Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:12.900Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 17, 49, 'Ary natsofok’i Davida tao anaty kitapony ny tanany, ka naka vato iray tao izy. Dia nandefa izany tamin’ny pilotra izy ka nahavoa an’ilay Filistinina teo an-tampon-kandriny. Ary nilentika teo amin’ny handrin’ilay Filistinina ilay vato, ka nianjera nihohoka tamin’ny tany izy.', 'ary natsofok’i davida tao anaty kitapony ny tanany, ka naka vato iray tao izy. dia nandefa izany tamin’ny pilotra izy ka nahavoa an’ilay filistinina teo an-tampon-kandriny. ary nilentika teo amin’ny handrin’ilay filistinina ilay vato, ka nianjera nihohoka tamin’ny tany izy.'),
  ('6ab25a1ceaa97ffe787f043d', '2026-09-22T10:36:12.900Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:12.900Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 17, 36, 'Samy novonoin’ny mpanomponao na ilay liona na ilay orsa, ary ho toy ny iray amin’ireny koa io Filistinina tsy mifora io, noho izy nihantsy ady tamin’ny tafik’ilay Andriamanitra velona.”', 'samy novonoin’ny mpanomponao na ilay liona na ilay orsa, ary ho toy ny iray amin’ireny koa io filistinina tsy mifora io, noho izy nihantsy ady tamin’ny tafik’ilay andriamanitra velona.”'),
  ('6ab25a1ceaa97ffe787f043c', '2026-09-22T10:36:12.900Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:12.900Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 17, 35, 'Dia lasa nanenjika azy aho ka namely azy ary namonjy an’ilay teny am-bavany. Nony nitsangana hamely ahy izy, dia notazoniko ny volombavany, ary nasiako izy ka matiko.', 'dia lasa nanenjika azy aho ka namely azy ary namonjy an’ilay teny am-bavany. nony nitsangana hamely ahy izy, dia notazoniko ny volombavany, ary nasiako izy ka matiko.'),
  ('6ab25a1ceaa97ffe787f0437', '2026-09-22T10:36:12.900Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:12.900Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 17, 30, 'Dia niala teo aminy izy ka nankeo amin’ny olon-kafa indray ary nilaza izay efa nolazainy teo aloha. Ary valin-teny toy ny teo aloha ihany no azony.', 'dia niala teo aminy izy ka nankeo amin’ny olon-kafa indray ary nilaza izay efa nolazainy teo aloha. ary valin-teny toy ny teo aloha ihany no azony.'),
  ('6ab25a1ceaa97ffe787f0434', '2026-09-22T10:36:12.900Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:12.900Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 17, 27, 'Ary toy ny teo aloha ihany no nolazain’ny olona taminy hoe: “Izany sy izany no hatao amin’izay lehilahy mahafaty azy.”', 'ary toy ny teo aloha ihany no nolazain’ny olona taminy hoe: “izany sy izany no hatao amin’izay lehilahy mahafaty azy.”'),
  ('6ab25a1ceaa97ffe787f0428', '2026-09-22T10:36:12.900Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:12.900Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 17, 15, 'Ary nivezivezy nankany amin’i Saoly sy niandry ny ondrin-drainy tany Betlehema i Davida.', 'ary nivezivezy nankany amin’i saoly sy niandry ny ondrin-drainy tany betlehema i davida.'),
  ('6ab25a1ceaa97ffe787f0427', '2026-09-22T10:36:12.900Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:12.900Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 17, 14, 'I Davida no faralahy. Ary lasa nanaraka an’i Saoly izy telo lahy zokiny indrindra.', 'i davida no faralahy. ary lasa nanaraka an’i saoly izy telo lahy zokiny indrindra.'),
  ('6ab25a1ceaa97ffe787f0426', '2026-09-22T10:36:12.900Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:12.900Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 17, 13, 'Ary lasa nanaraka an’i Saoly tany an’ady ny telo lahy zokiny indrindra tamin’ny zanak’i Jese. Ireto avy ny anaran’ireo zanany telo lahy lasa tany an’ady ireo: Eliaba no lahimatoa, Abinadaba ny faharoa, ary Sama ny fahatelo.', 'ary lasa nanaraka an’i saoly tany an’ady ny telo lahy zokiny indrindra tamin’ny zanak’i jese. ireto avy ny anaran’ireo zanany telo lahy lasa tany an’ady ireo: eliaba no lahimatoa, abinadaba ny faharoa, ary sama ny fahatelo.'),
  ('6ab25a1ceaa97ffe787f0421', '2026-09-22T10:36:12.900Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:12.900Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 17, 8, 'Dia nijanona izy ka niantsoantso tamin’ny tafiky ny Israely hoe: “Nahoana ianareo no mivoaka hiady? Hiady ho an’ny Filistinina aho, ary mpanompon’i Saoly ianareo. Koa mifidiana lehilahy iray hiady amiko.', 'dia nijanona izy ka niantsoantso tamin’ny tafiky ny israely hoe: “nahoana ianareo no mivoaka hiady? hiady ho an’ny filistinina aho, ary mpanompon’i saoly ianareo. koa mifidiana lehilahy iray hiady amiko.'),
  ('6ab25a1ceaa97ffe787f041e', '2026-09-22T10:36:12.900Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:12.900Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 17, 5, 'Nisy fiarovan-doha varahina teo amin’ny lohany, ary nanao akanjo nisy takela-barahina nifanindritsindry toy ny kiran-trondro izy, ka sekely dimy arivo ny lanjan’ny varahina tamin’ilay akanjo.', 'nisy fiarovan-doha varahina teo amin’ny lohany, ary nanao akanjo nisy takela-barahina nifanindritsindry toy ny kiran-trondro izy, ka sekely dimy arivo ny lanjan’ny varahina tamin’ilay akanjo.'),
  ('6ab25a1ceaa97ffe787f0439', '2026-09-22T10:36:12.900Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:12.900Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 17, 32, 'Ary hoy i Davida tamin’i Saoly: “Aoka tsy ho ketraka ny fon’ny olona, fa ny mpanomponao no handeha hiady amin’io Filistinina io.”', 'ary hoy i davida tamin’i saoly: “aoka tsy ho ketraka ny fon’ny olona, fa ny mpanomponao no handeha hiady amin’io filistinina io.”'),
  ('6ab25a1ceaa97ffe787f0429', '2026-09-22T10:36:12.900Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:12.900Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 17, 16, 'Ary niroso nanatona marain-tsy hariva ilay Filistinina ka niseho nandritra ny efapolo andro.', 'ary niroso nanatona marain-tsy hariva ilay filistinina ka niseho nandritra ny efapolo andro.'),
  ('6ab25a1ceaa97ffe787f044e', '2026-09-22T10:36:12.900Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:12.900Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 17, 53, 'Dia niverina ny zanak’Israely rehefa avy nanenjika mafy an’ireo Filistinina sy nandroba ny tobiny.', 'dia niverina ny zanak’israely rehefa avy nanenjika mafy an’ireo filistinina sy nandroba ny tobiny.'),
  ('6ab25a1ceaa97ffe787f043e', '2026-09-22T10:36:12.900Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:12.900Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 17, 37, 'Hoy koa i Davida: “I Jehovah izay namonjy ahy teo an-tanan’ny liona sy ny orsa, no hamonjy ahy eo an-tanan’io Filistinina io.” Dia hoy i Saoly taminy: “Mandehana àry, ary homba anao anie i Jehovah!”', 'hoy koa i davida: “i jehovah izay namonjy ahy teo an-tanan’ny liona sy ny orsa, no hamonjy ahy eo an-tanan’io filistinina io.” dia hoy i saoly taminy: “mandehana àry, ary homba anao anie i jehovah!”'),
  ('6ab25a1ceaa97ffe787f0435', '2026-09-22T10:36:12.900Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:12.900Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 17, 28, 'Ary nandre an’i Davida nifampiresaka tamin’ireo lehilahy ireo i Eliaba zokiny. Dia tezitra be tamin’i Davida izy, ka nanao hoe: “Nahoana ianao no nidina atỳ? Ary iza no nampiandraiketinao an’ireo ondry vitsy any an-tany efitra? Fantatro tsara ny fireharehanao sy ny haratsian’ny fonao, satria hijery ny ady no nidinanao atỳ.”', 'ary nandre an’i davida nifampiresaka tamin’ireo lehilahy ireo i eliaba zokiny. dia tezitra be tamin’i davida izy, ka nanao hoe: “nahoana ianao no nidina atỳ? ary iza no nampiandraiketinao an’ireo ondry vitsy any an-tany efitra? fantatro tsara ny fireharehanao sy ny haratsian’ny fonao, satria hijery ny ady no nidinanao atỳ.”'),
  ('6ab25a1ceaa97ffe787f042c', '2026-09-22T10:36:12.900Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:12.900Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 17, 19, 'Tamin’izay fotoana izay, dia nivonona hiady tamin’ny Filistinina teo amin’ilay lemaka ivan’i Elaha izy ireo mbamin’i Saoly sy ny lehilahy israelita rehetra.', 'tamin’izay fotoana izay, dia nivonona hiady tamin’ny filistinina teo amin’ilay lemaka ivan’i elaha izy ireo mbamin’i saoly sy ny lehilahy israelita rehetra.'),
  ('6ab25a1ceaa97ffe787f0424', '2026-09-22T10:36:12.900Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:12.900Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 17, 11, 'Rehefa nandre izany tenin’ilay Filistinina izany i Saoly sy ny Israely rehetra, dia nihorohoro sy natahotra mafy.', 'rehefa nandre izany tenin’ilay filistinina izany i saoly sy ny israely rehetra, dia nihorohoro sy natahotra mafy.'),
  ('6ab25a1ceaa97ffe787f044c', '2026-09-22T10:36:12.900Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:12.900Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 17, 51, 'Dia mbola nihazakazaka ihany i Davida ka nitsangana teo amin’ilay Filistinina. Ary nalainy ny sabatr’ilay Filistinina ka notsoahany tamin’ny tranony. Dia iny no nanapahany ny lohan’ilay Filistinina, ka namonoany azy ho faty tanteraka. Koa rehefa hitan’ny Filistinina fa maty ilay maheriny, dia vaky nandositra izy ireo.', 'dia mbola nihazakazaka ihany i davida ka nitsangana teo amin’ilay filistinina. ary nalainy ny sabatr’ilay filistinina ka notsoahany tamin’ny tranony. dia iny no nanapahany ny lohan’ilay filistinina, ka namonoany azy ho faty tanteraka. koa rehefa hitan’ny filistinina fa maty ilay maheriny, dia vaky nandositra izy ireo.'),
  ('6ab25a1ceaa97ffe787f0448', '2026-09-22T10:36:12.900Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:12.900Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 17, 47, 'Ho fantatry ny fiangonana manontolo eto koa fa tsy sabatra na lefona no amonjen’i Jehovah, satria an’i Jehovah ny ady. Ary hanolotra anareo eo an-tananay izy.”', 'ho fantatry ny fiangonana manontolo eto koa fa tsy sabatra na lefona no amonjen’i jehovah, satria an’i jehovah ny ady. ary hanolotra anareo eo an-tananay izy.”'),
  ('6ab25a1ceaa97ffe787f0447', '2026-09-22T10:36:12.900Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:12.900Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 17, 46, 'Anio no hanoloran’i Jehovah anao ho eto an-tanako, ka hovonoiko ianao ary hotapahiko ny lohanao. Ary homeko ho an’ny voro-manidina sy ny bibidia ny fatin’izay ao an-tobin’ny Filistinina anio. Dia ho fantatry ny olona eran-tany fa manana Andriamanitra ny Israely.', 'anio no hanoloran’i jehovah anao ho eto an-tanako, ka hovonoiko ianao ary hotapahiko ny lohanao. ary homeko ho an’ny voro-manidina sy ny bibidia ny fatin’izay ao an-tobin’ny filistinina anio. dia ho fantatry ny olona eran-tany fa manana andriamanitra ny israely.'),
  ('6ab25a1ceaa97ffe787f0438', '2026-09-22T10:36:12.900Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:12.900Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 17, 31, 'Dia ren’ny olona ny tenin’i Davida ka nisy niresaka an’izany teo anatrehan’i Saoly. Koa nampanalain’i Saoly izy.', 'dia ren’ny olona ny tenin’i davida ka nisy niresaka an’izany teo anatrehan’i saoly. koa nampanalain’i saoly izy.'),
  ('6ab25a1ceaa97ffe787f0452', '2026-09-22T10:36:12.900Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:12.900Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 17, 57, 'Koa raha vao niverina avy namono an’ilay Filistinina i Davida, dia nentin’i Abnera teo anatrehan’i Saoly. Ary teny an-tanan’i Davida ny lohan’ilay Filistinina.', 'koa raha vao niverina avy namono an’ilay filistinina i davida, dia nentin’i abnera teo anatrehan’i saoly. ary teny an-tanan’i davida ny lohan’ilay filistinina.'),
  ('6ab25a1ceaa97ffe787f044d', '2026-09-22T10:36:12.900Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:12.900Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 17, 52, 'Dia nitsangana ny lehilahy israelita sy izay anisan’ny fokon’i Joda, ka nihorakoraka sady nanenjika an’ireo Filistinina hatrany amin’ny lohasaha sy hatrany amin’ny vavahadin’i Ekrona. Ary izay naratra mafy tamin’ny Filistinina ka maty, dia niampatrampatra teny an-dalana, nanomboka teo Saraima ka hatrany Gata sy Ekrona.', 'dia nitsangana ny lehilahy israelita sy izay anisan’ny fokon’i joda, ka nihorakoraka sady nanenjika an’ireo filistinina hatrany amin’ny lohasaha sy hatrany amin’ny vavahadin’i ekrona. ary izay naratra mafy tamin’ny filistinina ka maty, dia niampatrampatra teny an-dalana, nanomboka teo saraima ka hatrany gata sy ekrona.'),
  ('6ab25a1ceaa97ffe787f0446', '2026-09-22T10:36:12.900Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:12.900Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 17, 45, 'Ary hoy i Davida taminy: “Ianao manatona ahy amin’ny sabatra sy lefona ary lefom-pohy, fa izaho kosa manatona anao amin’ny anaran’i Jehovah Tompon’ny tafika, ilay Andriamanitry ny tafiky ny Israely izay nohantsinao.', 'ary hoy i davida taminy: “ianao manatona ahy amin’ny sabatra sy lefona ary lefom-pohy, fa izaho kosa manatona anao amin’ny anaran’i jehovah tompon’ny tafika, ilay andriamanitry ny tafiky ny israely izay nohantsinao.'),
  ('6ab25a1ceaa97ffe787f042a', '2026-09-22T10:36:12.900Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:12.900Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 17, 17, 'Ary hoy i Jese tamin’i Davida zanany: “Mba ento kely any amin’ny rahalahinao ireto voam-bary natono iray efaha ireto sy ireto mofo folo ireto, ka atero haingana any aminy any an-toby.', 'ary hoy i jese tamin’i davida zanany: “mba ento kely any amin’ny rahalahinao ireto voam-bary natono iray efaha ireto sy ireto mofo folo ireto, ka atero haingana any aminy any an-toby.'),
  ('6ab25a1ceaa97ffe787f0423', '2026-09-22T10:36:12.900Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:12.900Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 17, 10, 'Hoy koa izy: “Mihantsy ady amin’ny tafiky ny Israely aho androany. Koa omeo lehilahy iray aho, dia hiady izahay!”', 'hoy koa izy: “mihantsy ady amin’ny tafiky ny israely aho androany. koa omeo lehilahy iray aho, dia hiady izahay!”'),
  ('6ab25a1ceaa97ffe787f042e', '2026-09-22T10:36:12.900Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:12.900Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 17, 21, 'Dia nilahatra hifanandrina ny tafiky ny Israely sy ny tafiky ny Filistinina.', 'dia nilahatra hifanandrina ny tafiky ny israely sy ny tafiky ny filistinina.'),
  ('6ab25a1ceaa97ffe787f0425', '2026-09-22T10:36:12.900Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:12.900Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 17, 12, 'Ary i Davida dia zanak’ilay Efratita atao hoe Jese, avy any Betleheman’i Joda. Nanan-janaka valo mirahalahy i Jese, izay efa antitra tamin’ny andron’i Saoly.', 'ary i davida dia zanak’ilay efratita atao hoe jese, avy any betleheman’i joda. nanan-janaka valo mirahalahy i jese, izay efa antitra tamin’ny andron’i saoly.'),
  ('6ab25a1ceaa97ffe787f042b', '2026-09-22T10:36:12.900Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:12.900Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 17, 18, 'Ento koa ireto fromazy * folo ireto ho an’ny lehiben’ny arivo. Ary jereo raha tsy misy maninona ny rahalahinao, ka itondrao vaovao avy any aminy aho.”', 'ento koa ireto fromazy * folo ireto ho an’ny lehiben’ny arivo. ary jereo raha tsy misy maninona ny rahalahinao, ka itondrao vaovao avy any aminy aho.”'),
  ('6ab25a1ceaa97ffe787f0420', '2026-09-22T10:36:12.900Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:12.900Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 17, 7, 'Ny tahon’ny lefony dia toy ny voditenon’ny mpanenona, ary sekely eninjato ny lanjan’ny vy tamin’ny lela lefony. Ary nandeha teo alohany ny mpitondra ny ampinga lehibe.', 'ny tahon’ny lefony dia toy ny voditenon’ny mpanenona, ary sekely eninjato ny lanjan’ny vy tamin’ny lela lefony. ary nandeha teo alohany ny mpitondra ny ampinga lehibe.'),
  ('6ab25a1ceaa97ffe787f041c', '2026-09-22T10:36:12.900Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:12.900Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 17, 3, 'Teny ampita teo amin’ny tendrombohitra iray ny Filistinina, ary ny Israelita kosa terỳ ampita teo amin’ny tendrombohitra iray, ka ny lohasaha no nanelanelana azy ireo.', 'teny ampita teo amin’ny tendrombohitra iray ny filistinina, ary ny israelita kosa terỳ ampita teo amin’ny tendrombohitra iray, ka ny lohasaha no nanelanelana azy ireo.'),
  ('6ab25a1ceaa97ffe787f041b', '2026-09-22T10:36:12.900Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:12.900Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 17, 2, 'Tafangona koa i Saoly sy ny lehilahy israelita ka nitoby teo amin’ny lemaka ivan’i Elaha. Dia samy naka ny toerany avy izy ireo mba hifanandrina tamin’ny Filistinina.', 'tafangona koa i saoly sy ny lehilahy israelita ka nitoby teo amin’ny lemaka ivan’i elaha. dia samy naka ny toerany avy izy ireo mba hifanandrina tamin’ny filistinina.'),
  ('6ab25a1ed333375ca8b4659f', '2026-09-22T10:36:14.277Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:14.277Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 18, 17, 'Farany, dia hoy i Saoly tamin’i Davida: “Io i Meraba zanako vavimatoa. Izy no homeko ho vadinao, fa aoka fotsiny ianao hahery fo eo anatrehako ka hiady ny adin’i Jehovah.” Fa hoy i Saoly anakampo: “Aoka tsy ny tanako no hamely azy, fa ny tanan’ny Filistinina.”', 'farany, dia hoy i saoly tamin’i davida: “io i meraba zanako vavimatoa. izy no homeko ho vadinao, fa aoka fotsiny ianao hahery fo eo anatrehako ka hiady ny adin’i jehovah.” fa hoy i saoly anakampo: “aoka tsy ny tanako no hamely azy, fa ny tanan’ny filistinina.”'),
  ('6ab25a1ed333375ca8b465a3', '2026-09-22T10:36:14.277Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:14.277Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 18, 21, 'Dia hoy i Saoly anakampo: “Homeko azy i Mikala mba hamandrihana azy, ka hamelezan’ny tanan’ny Filistinina azy.” Koa hoy i Saoly tamin’i Davida: “Ny iray amin’izy roa vavy no hahatonga anao ho vinantolahiko.” *', 'dia hoy i saoly anakampo: “homeko azy i mikala mba hamandrihana azy, ka hamelezan’ny tanan’ny filistinina azy.” koa hoy i saoly tamin’i davida: “ny iray amin’izy roa vavy no hahatonga anao ho vinantolahiko.” *'),
  ('6ab25a1ed333375ca8b46596', '2026-09-22T10:36:14.277Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:14.277Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 18, 8, 'Dia tezitra be i Saoly. Tsy tiany mantsy izany teny izany, ka hoy izy anakampo: “Ny an’i Davida nataony alinalina, fa ny ahy kosa nataony arivoarivo. Ny fanjakana ihany sisa no tsy azony!”', 'dia tezitra be i saoly. tsy tiany mantsy izany teny izany, ka hoy izy anakampo: “ny an’i davida nataony alinalina, fa ny ahy kosa nataony arivoarivo. ny fanjakana ihany sisa no tsy azony!”'),
  ('6ab25a1ed333375ca8b4659d', '2026-09-22T10:36:14.277Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:14.277Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 18, 15, 'Dia hitan’i Saoly fa tena malina izy, ka natahorany.', 'dia hitan’i saoly fa tena malina izy, ka natahorany.'),
  ('6ab25a1ed333375ca8b46598', '2026-09-22T10:36:14.277Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:14.277Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 18, 10, 'Ary nahazo an’i Saoly ilay fikorontanan-tsaina * avy amin’Andriamanitra ny ampitson’iny, ka nanao hoatran’ny mpaminany izy tao an-trano. Teo am-pitendrena zavamaneno i Davida tamin’izay, toy ny tamin’ny andro teo aloha. Ary teny an-tanan’i Saoly ny lefona.', 'ary nahazo an’i saoly ilay fikorontanan-tsaina * avy amin’andriamanitra ny ampitson’iny, ka nanao hoatran’ny mpaminany izy tao an-trano. teo am-pitendrena zavamaneno i davida tamin’izay, toy ny tamin’ny andro teo aloha. ary teny an-tanan’i saoly ny lefona.'),
  ('6ab25a1ed333375ca8b4659b', '2026-09-22T10:36:14.277Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:14.277Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 18, 13, 'Koa nesorin’i Saoly tsy ho eo aminy i Davida, ka notendreny ho lehiben’ny arivo. Ary nitarika ny olona foana i Davida.', 'koa nesorin’i saoly tsy ho eo aminy i davida, ka notendreny ho lehiben’ny arivo. ary nitarika ny olona foana i davida.'),
  ('6ab25a1ed333375ca8b465a2', '2026-09-22T10:36:14.277Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:14.277Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 18, 20, 'Ary raiki-pitia tamin’i Davida i Mikala zanakavavin’i Saoly. Koa nolazaina tamin’i Saoly izany, ka sitrany.', 'ary raiki-pitia tamin’i davida i mikala zanakavavin’i saoly. koa nolazaina tamin’i saoly izany, ka sitrany.'),
  ('6ab25a1ed333375ca8b46592', '2026-09-22T10:36:14.277Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:14.277Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 18, 4, 'Dia nesorin’i Jonatana ilay akanjo tsy misy tanany nanaovany, ka nomeny an’i Davida. Nomeny azy koa ny akanjony hafa, hatramin’ny sabany sy ny tsipìkany ary ny fehikibony.', 'dia nesorin’i jonatana ilay akanjo tsy misy tanany nanaovany, ka nomeny an’i davida. nomeny azy koa ny akanjony hafa, hatramin’ny sabany sy ny tsipìkany ary ny fehikibony.'),
  ('6ab25a1ed333375ca8b46595', '2026-09-22T10:36:14.277Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:14.277Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 18, 7, 'Ary nanao hira nifamaly ireo vehivavy nitotorebika ireo hoe: “I Saoly nahafaty arivoarivo, Fa i Davida kosa nahafaty alinalina.”', 'ary nanao hira nifamaly ireo vehivavy nitotorebika ireo hoe: “i saoly nahafaty arivoarivo, fa i davida kosa nahafaty alinalina.”'),
  ('6ab25a1ed333375ca8b46590', '2026-09-22T10:36:14.277Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:14.277Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 18, 2, 'Nalain’i Saoly i Davida tamin’iny andro iny, ka tsy navelany hiverina tany an-tranon-drainy intsony.', 'nalain’i saoly i davida tamin’iny andro iny, ka tsy navelany hiverina tany an-tranon-drainy intsony.'),
  ('6ab25a1ed333375ca8b465a4', '2026-09-22T10:36:14.277Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:14.277Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 18, 22, 'Nandidy ny mpanompony koa i Saoly hoe: “Resaho mangingina i Davida hoe: ‘Mankasitraka anao ny mpanjaka, ary lasa tia anao daholo ny mpanompony rehetra. Koa meteza ho lasa vinantolahin’ny mpanjaka.’” *', 'nandidy ny mpanompony koa i saoly hoe: “resaho mangingina i davida hoe: ‘mankasitraka anao ny mpanjaka, ary lasa tia anao daholo ny mpanompony rehetra. koa meteza ho lasa vinantolahin’ny mpanjaka.’” *'),
  ('6ab25a1ed333375ca8b465a1', '2026-09-22T10:36:14.277Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:14.277Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 18, 19, 'Tamin’ny fotoana hanomezana an’i Meraba zanakavavin’i Saoly ho an’i Davida anefa, dia efa nomena ho vadin’i Adriela Meholatita izy.', 'tamin’ny fotoana hanomezana an’i meraba zanakavavin’i saoly ho an’i davida anefa, dia efa nomena ho vadin’i adriela meholatita izy.'),
  ('6ab25a1ed333375ca8b46599', '2026-09-22T10:36:14.277Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:14.277Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 18, 11, 'Dia natorak’i Saoly ilay lefona sady niteny izy hoe: “Ataoko mifantsika amin’ny rindrina i Davida!” Kanjo nahay niala indroa izy.', 'dia natorak’i saoly ilay lefona sady niteny izy hoe: “ataoko mifantsika amin’ny rindrina i davida!” kanjo nahay niala indroa izy.'),
  ('6ab25a1ed333375ca8b46597', '2026-09-22T10:36:14.277Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:14.277Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 18, 9, 'Dia niahiahy an’i Davida foana i Saoly nanomboka tamin’iny andro iny, ka hita tamin’ny fijeriny azy izany.', 'dia niahiahy an’i davida foana i saoly nanomboka tamin’iny andro iny, ka hita tamin’ny fijeriny azy izany.'),
  ('6ab25a1ed333375ca8b465a0', '2026-09-22T10:36:14.277Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:14.277Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 18, 18, 'Dia hoy i Davida tamin’i Saoly: “Zinona moa aho, ary inona eto amin’ny Israely moa ny havako sy ny fianakavian-draiko, no ho lasa vinanton’ny mpanjaka aho?”', 'dia hoy i davida tamin’i saoly: “zinona moa aho, ary inona eto amin’ny israely moa ny havako sy ny fianakavian-draiko, no ho lasa vinanton’ny mpanjaka aho?”'),
  ('6ab25a1ed333375ca8b46591', '2026-09-22T10:36:14.277Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:14.277Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 18, 3, 'Ary nanao fifanekena i Jonatana sy Davida, satria tia azy toy ny tenany mihitsy i Jonatana.', 'ary nanao fifanekena i jonatana sy davida, satria tia azy toy ny tenany mihitsy i jonatana.'),
  ('6ab25a1ed333375ca8b4658f', '2026-09-22T10:36:14.277Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:14.277Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 18, 1, 'Raha vao avy niresaka tamin’i Saoly i Davida, dia nanjary niraiki-po be tamin’i Davida i Jonatana, ka tia azy toy ny tenany mihitsy.', 'raha vao avy niresaka tamin’i saoly i davida, dia nanjary niraiki-po be tamin’i davida i jonatana, ka tia azy toy ny tenany mihitsy.'),
  ('6ab25a1ed333375ca8b4659e', '2026-09-22T10:36:14.277Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:14.277Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 18, 16, 'Ary tia an’i Davida ny Israely rehetra sy ny Joda, satria izy no nitarika azy ireo.', 'ary tia an’i davida ny israely rehetra sy ny joda, satria izy no nitarika azy ireo.'),
  ('6ab25a1ed333375ca8b4659a', '2026-09-22T10:36:14.277Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:14.277Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 18, 12, 'Ary natahotra an’i Davida i Saoly satria nomba an’i Davida i Jehovah, fa ny tenany kosa efa nialany.', 'ary natahotra an’i davida i saoly satria nomba an’i davida i jehovah, fa ny tenany kosa efa nialany.'),
  ('6ab25a1ed333375ca8b46593', '2026-09-22T10:36:14.277Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:14.277Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 18, 5, 'Ary nanomboka nivoaka hiady i Davida. Malina foana izy na taiza na taiza nandefasan’i Saoly azy, ka nataon’i Saoly ho mpifehy an’ireo lehilahy mpiady. Dia sitraky ny olona rehetra sy ny mpanompon’i Saoly izany.', 'ary nanomboka nivoaka hiady i davida. malina foana izy na taiza na taiza nandefasan’i saoly azy, ka nataon’i saoly ho mpifehy an’ireo lehilahy mpiady. dia sitraky ny olona rehetra sy ny mpanompon’i saoly izany.'),
  ('6ab25a1ed333375ca8b46594', '2026-09-22T10:36:14.277Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:14.277Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 18, 6, 'Rehefa avy namely ny Filistinina ry Davida ka tafaverina, dia nivoaka avy any amin’ny tanàna rehetran’ny Israely ireo vehivavy. Sady nihira izy ireo no nandihy tamin’ny feon’ampongatapaka sy mandôlinina, mba hitsena an’i Saoly mpanjaka tamim-pifaliana.', 'rehefa avy namely ny filistinina ry davida ka tafaverina, dia nivoaka avy any amin’ny tanàna rehetran’ny israely ireo vehivavy. sady nihira izy ireo no nandihy tamin’ny feon’ampongatapaka sy mandôlinina, mba hitsena an’i saoly mpanjaka tamim-pifaliana.'),
  ('6ab25a1ed333375ca8b4659c', '2026-09-22T10:36:14.277Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:14.277Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 18, 14, 'Malina foana izy tamin’izay rehetra nataony, ary nomba azy i Jehovah.', 'malina foana izy tamin’izay rehetra nataony, ary nomba azy i jehovah.'),
  ('6ab25a1ed333375ca8b465ab', '2026-09-22T10:36:14.278Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:14.278Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 18, 29, 'Dia nihamafy ny tahotr’i Saoly an’i Davida, ka nanjary fahavalon’i Davida foana izy.', 'dia nihamafy ny tahotr’i saoly an’i davida, ka nanjary fahavalon’i davida foana izy.'),
  ('6ab25a1ed333375ca8b465a9', '2026-09-22T10:36:14.278Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:14.278Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 18, 27, 'dia niainga i Davida sy ny olony ka lasa namono roanjato lahy teo amin’ny Filistinina. Dia nentin’i Davida ny tsitsy nesorina tamin’ireo Filistinina ireo ka nomeny ny mpanjaka, araka ny isany feno, mba hahatonga azy ho vinantolahin’ny mpanjaka. Koa nomen’i Saoly ho vadin’i Davida i Mikala zanany vavy.', 'dia niainga i davida sy ny olony ka lasa namono roanjato lahy teo amin’ny filistinina. dia nentin’i davida ny tsitsy nesorina tamin’ireo filistinina ireo ka nomeny ny mpanjaka, araka ny isany feno, mba hahatonga azy ho vinantolahin’ny mpanjaka. koa nomen’i saoly ho vadin’i davida i mikala zanany vavy.'),
  ('6ab25a1ed333375ca8b465a5', '2026-09-22T10:36:14.278Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:14.278Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 18, 23, 'Dia nilaza izany teny izany tamin’i Davida ny mpanompon’i Saoly. Hoy anefa i Davida: “Heverinareo fa moramora angaha izany hoe lasa vinantolahin’ny mpanjaka izany? Izaho ange lehilahy mahantra sy tsy dia asian’ny olona vidiny e!”', 'dia nilaza izany teny izany tamin’i davida ny mpanompon’i saoly. hoy anefa i davida: “heverinareo fa moramora angaha izany hoe lasa vinantolahin’ny mpanjaka izany? izaho ange lehilahy mahantra sy tsy dia asian’ny olona vidiny e!”'),
  ('6ab25a1ed333375ca8b465a8', '2026-09-22T10:36:14.278Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:14.278Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 18, 26, 'Dia nolazain’ny mpanompon’i Saoly tamin’i Davida izany teny izany, ka sitrak’i Davida ny ho lasa vinantolahin’ny mpanjaka. Koa raha mbola tsy tapitra ny fotoana nomena,', 'dia nolazain’ny mpanompon’i saoly tamin’i davida izany teny izany, ka sitrak’i davida ny ho lasa vinantolahin’ny mpanjaka. koa raha mbola tsy tapitra ny fotoana nomena,'),
  ('6ab25a1ed333375ca8b465aa', '2026-09-22T10:36:14.278Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:14.278Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 18, 28, 'Dia hitan’i Saoly fa nomba an’i Davida i Jehovah. Ary tia an’i Davida i Mikala zanakavavin’i Saoly.', 'dia hitan’i saoly fa nomba an’i davida i jehovah. ary tia an’i davida i mikala zanakavavin’i saoly.'),
  ('6ab25a1ed333375ca8b465a6', '2026-09-22T10:36:14.278Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:14.278Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 18, 24, 'Koa nitantara tamin’i Saoly ny mpanompony hoe: “Izany sy izany no tenin’i Davida.”', 'koa nitantara tamin’i saoly ny mpanompony hoe: “izany sy izany no tenin’i davida.”'),
  ('6ab25a1ed333375ca8b465ac', '2026-09-22T10:36:14.278Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:14.278Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 18, 30, 'Ary nivoaka hiady ireo andrianan’ny Filistinina. Isaky ny nanao izany izy ireo, dia i Davida no malina indrindra tamin’ny mpanompon’i Saoly rehetra. Koa lasa nalaza be ny anaran’i Davida.', 'ary nivoaka hiady ireo andrianan’ny filistinina. isaky ny nanao izany izy ireo, dia i davida no malina indrindra tamin’ny mpanompon’i saoly rehetra. koa lasa nalaza be ny anaran’i davida.'),
  ('6ab25a1ed333375ca8b465a7', '2026-09-22T10:36:14.278Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:14.278Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 18, 25, 'Ary hoy i Saoly: “Izao no holazainareo amin’i Davida: ‘Tsy vodiondry no sitraky ny mpanjaka, fa tsitsy * esorina amin’ny lehilahy filistinina zato, mba hampiharan’ny mpanjaka ny valifatiny amin’ny fahavalony.’” I Saoly anefa efa nitetika ny hahafatesan’i Davida eo an-tanan’ny Filistinina.', 'ary hoy i saoly: “izao no holazainareo amin’i davida: ‘tsy vodiondry no sitraky ny mpanjaka, fa tsitsy * esorina amin’ny lehilahy filistinina zato, mba hampiharan’ny mpanjaka ny valifatiny amin’ny fahavalony.’” i saoly anefa efa nitetika ny hahafatesan’i davida eo an-tanan’ny filistinina.'),
  ('6ab25a1e931e56770ca969de', '2026-09-22T10:36:14.717Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:14.717Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 19, 2, 'I Jonatana zanak’i Saoly kosa anefa tia be an’i Davida. Koa hoy izy tamin’i Davida: “Mitady hamono anao i Saoly raiko. Koa mitandrema re rahampitso maraina e, ary mijanòna any amin’ny toerana tsisy mahita ka miafena.', 'i jonatana zanak’i saoly kosa anefa tia be an’i davida. koa hoy izy tamin’i davida: “mitady hamono anao i saoly raiko. koa mitandrema re rahampitso maraina e, ary mijanòna any amin’ny toerana tsisy mahita ka miafena.'),
  ('6ab25a1e931e56770ca969dd', '2026-09-22T10:36:14.717Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:14.717Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 19, 1, 'Tamin’ny farany, dia nilazan’i Saoly i Jonatana zanany sy ny mpanompony rehetra fa tiany hovonoina ho faty i Davida.', 'tamin’ny farany, dia nilazan’i saoly i jonatana zanany sy ny mpanompony rehetra fa tiany hovonoina ho faty i davida.'),
  ('6ab25a1e931e56770ca969f0', '2026-09-22T10:36:14.718Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:14.718Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 19, 20, 'Avy hatrany dia nandefa iraka hisambotra an’i Davida i Saoly. Rehefa nahita ny mpaminany zokiolona naminany ny iraka nalefan’i Saoly, sady nahita an’i Samoela nitarika an’ireny, dia tonga tamin’ireo iraka ny fanahin’Andriamanitra, * ka nanao hoatran’ny mpaminany koa ireo.', 'avy hatrany dia nandefa iraka hisambotra an’i davida i saoly. rehefa nahita ny mpaminany zokiolona naminany ny iraka nalefan’i saoly, sady nahita an’i samoela nitarika an’ireny, dia tonga tamin’ireo iraka ny fanahin’andriamanitra, * ka nanao hoatran’ny mpaminany koa ireo.'),
  ('6ab25a1e931e56770ca969df', '2026-09-22T10:36:14.718Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:14.718Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 19, 3, 'Izaho kosa hivoaka hijoro eo anilan’ny raiko any amin’ilay saha izay hisy anao, ka hiresaka amin’ny raiko momba anao. Dia ho hitako eo izay hitranga, ka holazaiko aminao.”', 'izaho kosa hivoaka hijoro eo anilan’ny raiko any amin’ilay saha izay hisy anao, ka hiresaka amin’ny raiko momba anao. dia ho hitako eo izay hitranga, ka holazaiko aminao.”'),
  ('6ab25a1e931e56770ca969e6', '2026-09-22T10:36:14.718Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:14.718Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 19, 10, 'Koa nikendry handefona an’i Davida hifantsika tamin’ny rindrina i Saoly, nefa nahay niala i Davida, ka ny rindrina no voany tamin’ny lefona. Dia nitsoaka i Davida mba tsy hiharan-doza tamin’iny alina iny.', 'koa nikendry handefona an’i davida hifantsika tamin’ny rindrina i saoly, nefa nahay niala i davida, ka ny rindrina no voany tamin’ny lefona. dia nitsoaka i davida mba tsy hiharan-doza tamin’iny alina iny.'),
  ('6ab25a1e931e56770ca969f3', '2026-09-22T10:36:14.718Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:14.718Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 19, 23, 'Ary nanohy ny diany ihany izy nankany Naiota any Rama. Dia tonga taminy koa ny fanahin’Andriamanitra, ka nandeha ihany izy sady nanao hoatran’ny mpaminany, mandra-pahatongany tao Naiota any Rama.', 'ary nanohy ny diany ihany izy nankany naiota any rama. dia tonga taminy koa ny fanahin’andriamanitra, ka nandeha ihany izy sady nanao hoatran’ny mpaminany, mandra-pahatongany tao naiota any rama.'),
  ('6ab25a1e931e56770ca969e3', '2026-09-22T10:36:14.718Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:14.718Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 19, 7, 'Dia nantsoin’i Jonatana i Davida, ka nilazany izany teny rehetra izany. Ary nentiny teo amin’i Saoly i Davida, ka nitoetra teo anatrehan’i Saoly toy ny teo aloha indray.', 'dia nantsoin’i jonatana i davida, ka nilazany izany teny rehetra izany. ary nentiny teo amin’i saoly i davida, ka nitoetra teo anatrehan’i saoly toy ny teo aloha indray.'),
  ('6ab25a1e931e56770ca969f1', '2026-09-22T10:36:14.718Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:14.718Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 19, 21, 'Rehefa nisy nilaza izany tamin’i Saoly, dia nandefa iraka hafa avy hatrany izy, nefa nanao hoatran’ny mpaminany koa ireo. Koa nandefa andiany fahatelo indray i Saoly, nefa mbola nanao toy izany koa ireo.', 'rehefa nisy nilaza izany tamin’i saoly, dia nandefa iraka hafa avy hatrany izy, nefa nanao hoatran’ny mpaminany koa ireo. koa nandefa andiany fahatelo indray i saoly, nefa mbola nanao toy izany koa ireo.'),
  ('6ab25a1e931e56770ca969ef', '2026-09-22T10:36:14.718Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:14.718Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 19, 19, 'Ary nisy nilaza tamin’i Saoly hoe: “Ao Naiota any Rama i Davida!”', 'ary nisy nilaza tamin’i saoly hoe: “ao naiota any rama i davida!”'),
  ('6ab25a1e931e56770ca969e2', '2026-09-22T10:36:14.718Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:14.718Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 19, 6, 'Ary nihaino ny tenin’i Jonatana i Saoly ka nianiana hoe: “Raha mbola velona koa i Jehovah, dia tsy hovonoina ho faty izy.”', 'ary nihaino ny tenin’i jonatana i saoly ka nianiana hoe: “raha mbola velona koa i jehovah, dia tsy hovonoina ho faty izy.”'),
  ('6ab25a1e931e56770ca969e0', '2026-09-22T10:36:14.718Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:14.718Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 19, 4, 'Koa zavatra tsara momba an’i Davida no noresahin’i Jonatana tamin’i Saoly rainy, hoe: “Aoka ny mpanjaka tsy hanota amin’i Davida mpanompony, fa izy tsy nanota taminao ary tena nahasoa anao ny nataony.', 'koa zavatra tsara momba an’i davida no noresahin’i jonatana tamin’i saoly rainy, hoe: “aoka ny mpanjaka tsy hanota amin’i davida mpanompony, fa izy tsy nanota taminao ary tena nahasoa anao ny nataony.'),
  ('6ab25a1e931e56770ca969eb', '2026-09-22T10:36:14.718Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:14.718Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 19, 15, 'Koa nandefa an’ireo iraka hijery an’i Davida i Saoly, sady hoy izy: “Ento atỳ amiko eo ambony fandrianany izy, mba hovonoina ho faty.”', 'koa nandefa an’ireo iraka hijery an’i davida i saoly, sady hoy izy: “ento atỳ amiko eo ambony fandrianany izy, mba hovonoina ho faty.”'),
  ('6ab25a1e931e56770ca969e9', '2026-09-22T10:36:14.718Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:14.718Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 19, 13, 'Dia nalain’i Mikala ny sarin’ny terafima * ka nataony teo am-pandriana, ary nasiany lamba makarakara vita tamin’ny volon’osy teo amin’izay tokony hisy ny lohan’i Davida. Dia norakofany lamba ilay sary.', 'dia nalain’i mikala ny sarin’ny terafima * ka nataony teo am-pandriana, ary nasiany lamba makarakara vita tamin’ny volon’osy teo amin’izay tokony hisy ny lohan’i davida. dia norakofany lamba ilay sary.'),
  ('6ab25a1e931e56770ca969e1', '2026-09-22T10:36:14.718Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:14.718Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 19, 5, 'Fa nanao vivery ny ainy * izy namono an’ilay Filistinina, ka dia nanao famonjena lehibe ho an’ny Israely rehetra i Jehovah. Ary faly ianao nahita izany. Koa nahoana ianao no hanota ka handatsaka ran’olona tsy manan-tsiny, amin’ny famonoana an’i Davida tsy amin’antony?”', 'fa nanao vivery ny ainy * izy namono an’ilay filistinina, ka dia nanao famonjena lehibe ho an’ny israely rehetra i jehovah. ary faly ianao nahita izany. koa nahoana ianao no hanota ka handatsaka ran’olona tsy manan-tsiny, amin’ny famonoana an’i davida tsy amin’antony?”'),
  ('6ab25a1e931e56770ca969ec', '2026-09-22T10:36:14.718Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:14.718Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 19, 16, 'Nony niditra ireo iraka, dia ilay sarin’ny terafima no teo am-pandriana, ary lamba makarakara vita tamin’ny volon’osy no teo amin’izay tokony hisy ny lohan’i Davida.', 'nony niditra ireo iraka, dia ilay sarin’ny terafima no teo am-pandriana, ary lamba makarakara vita tamin’ny volon’osy no teo amin’izay tokony hisy ny lohan’i davida.'),
  ('6ab25a1e931e56770ca969e4', '2026-09-22T10:36:14.718Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:14.718Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 19, 8, 'Nipoaka indray ny ady tatỳ aoriana. Dia nivoaka hiady tamin’ny Filistinina i Davida ary namely azy, ka be dia be no maty. Ary nandositra teo anoloany ny Filistinina.', 'nipoaka indray ny ady tatỳ aoriana. dia nivoaka hiady tamin’ny filistinina i davida ary namely azy, ka be dia be no maty. ary nandositra teo anoloany ny filistinina.'),
  ('6ab25a1e931e56770ca969f4', '2026-09-22T10:36:14.718Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:14.718Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 19, 24, 'Ary mba nanala ny akanjony koa izy sady nanao hoatran’ny mpaminany teo anatrehan’i Samoela, ka nandry nitanjaka * nandritra iny andro iny sy ny alina tontolo. Koa izany no nahatonga ilay fitenenana hoe: “Anisan’ny mpaminany koa angaha i Saoly?”', 'ary mba nanala ny akanjony koa izy sady nanao hoatran’ny mpaminany teo anatrehan’i samoela, ka nandry nitanjaka * nandritra iny andro iny sy ny alina tontolo. koa izany no nahatonga ilay fitenenana hoe: “anisan’ny mpaminany koa angaha i saoly?”'),
  ('6ab25a1e931e56770ca969e7', '2026-09-22T10:36:14.718Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:14.718Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 19, 11, 'Ary nisy olona nirahin’i Saoly mba hanao andry maso ny tranon’i Davida, sy hamono azy ho faty ny ampitso maraina. I Mikala vadin’i Davida kosa anefa nilaza taminy hoe: “Raha tsy mandositra izao alina izao ianao, dia hovonoina ho faty rahampitso.”', 'ary nisy olona nirahin’i saoly mba hanao andry maso ny tranon’i davida, sy hamono azy ho faty ny ampitso maraina. i mikala vadin’i davida kosa anefa nilaza taminy hoe: “raha tsy mandositra izao alina izao ianao, dia hovonoina ho faty rahampitso.”'),
  ('6ab25a1e931e56770ca969e8', '2026-09-22T10:36:14.718Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:14.718Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 19, 12, 'Koa nampidinin’i Mikala teo am-baravarankely avy hatrany i Davida, mba hitsoaka ka tsy hiharan-doza.', 'koa nampidinin’i mikala teo am-baravarankely avy hatrany i davida, mba hitsoaka ka tsy hiharan-doza.'),
  ('6ab25a1e931e56770ca969ee', '2026-09-22T10:36:14.718Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:14.718Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 19, 18, 'Nitsoaka nandositra i Davida ka tonga tany amin’i Samoela tao Rama. Ary notantarainy tamin’i Samoela ny zava-drehetra nataon’i Saoly taminy. Dia lasa izy sy Samoela ka nitoetra tao Naiota.', 'nitsoaka nandositra i davida ka tonga tany amin’i samoela tao rama. ary notantarainy tamin’i samoela ny zava-drehetra nataon’i saoly taminy. dia lasa izy sy samoela ka nitoetra tao naiota.'),
  ('6ab25a1e931e56770ca969f2', '2026-09-22T10:36:14.718Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:14.718Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 19, 22, 'Farany, dia nankany Rama koa izy. Rehefa tonga teo amin’ilay lavaka lehibe fanangonan-drano tao Seko izy, dia nanontany hoe: “Aiza i Samoela sy Davida?” Dia hoy ny olona: “Ao Naiota, atsy Rama.”', 'farany, dia nankany rama koa izy. rehefa tonga teo amin’ilay lavaka lehibe fanangonan-drano tao seko izy, dia nanontany hoe: “aiza i samoela sy davida?” dia hoy ny olona: “ao naiota, atsy rama.”'),
  ('6ab25a1e931e56770ca969e5', '2026-09-22T10:36:14.718Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:14.718Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 19, 9, 'Ary nahazo an’i Saoly ilay fikorontanan-tsaina * avy amin’i Jehovah raha mbola nipetraka tao an-tranony izy, ary teny an-tanany ny lefony. I Davida kosa tamin’izay teo am-pitendrena zavamaneno.', 'ary nahazo an’i saoly ilay fikorontanan-tsaina * avy amin’i jehovah raha mbola nipetraka tao an-tranony izy, ary teny an-tanany ny lefony. i davida kosa tamin’izay teo am-pitendrena zavamaneno.'),
  ('6ab25a1e931e56770ca969ed', '2026-09-22T10:36:14.718Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:14.718Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 19, 17, 'Ary hoy i Saoly tamin’i Mikala: “Nahoana no namitaka ahy toy izao ianao, ka nandefa an’ilay fahavaloko mba hahafahany handositra?” Dia hoy i Mikala tamin’i Saoly: “Izy no nilaza tamiko hoe: ‘Avelao aho handeha, sao hovonoiko eo ianao!’”', 'ary hoy i saoly tamin’i mikala: “nahoana no namitaka ahy toy izao ianao, ka nandefa an’ilay fahavaloko mba hahafahany handositra?” dia hoy i mikala tamin’i saoly: “izy no nilaza tamiko hoe: ‘avelao aho handeha, sao hovonoiko eo ianao!’”'),
  ('6ab25a1e931e56770ca969ea', '2026-09-22T10:36:14.718Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:14.718Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 19, 14, 'Ary nandefa iraka hisambotra an’i Davida i Saoly, nefa hoy ravehivavy: “Marary izy.”', 'ary nandefa iraka hisambotra an’i davida i saoly, nefa hoy ravehivavy: “marary izy.”'),
  ('6ab25a1f7ba6af6de00a0a4f', '2026-09-22T10:36:15.150Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:15.150Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 20, 6, 'Ary raha hitan’ny rainao fa tsy eo aho, dia lazao hoe: ‘Niera tamiko i Davida mba handeha vetivety ho any Betlehema tanànany, satria misy sorona fanao isan-taona hataon’ny fianakaviany manontolo any.’', 'ary raha hitan’ny rainao fa tsy eo aho, dia lazao hoe: ‘niera tamiko i davida mba handeha vetivety ho any betlehema tanànany, satria misy sorona fanao isan-taona hataon’ny fianakaviany manontolo any.’'),
  ('6ab25a1f7ba6af6de00a0a4c', '2026-09-22T10:36:15.150Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:15.150Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 20, 3, 'Mbola nianiana koa anefa i Davida hoe: “Tsy maintsy efa fantatry ny rainao fa nahazo sitraka taminao aho, ka hilaza izy hoe: ‘Aoka tsy ho fantatr’i Jonatana izany, sao halahelo izy.’ Raha mbola velona koa anefa i Jehovah, ary raha mbola velon’aina koa ianao, dia tsoriko aminao fa zara raha misy indray mandingana sisa no manelanelana ahy amin’ny fahafatesana!”', 'mbola nianiana koa anefa i davida hoe: “tsy maintsy efa fantatry ny rainao fa nahazo sitraka taminao aho, ka hilaza izy hoe: ‘aoka tsy ho fantatr’i jonatana izany, sao halahelo izy.’ raha mbola velona koa anefa i jehovah, ary raha mbola velon’aina koa ianao, dia tsoriko aminao fa zara raha misy indray mandingana sisa no manelanelana ahy amin’ny fahafatesana!”'),
  ('6ab25a1f7ba6af6de00a0a68', '2026-09-22T10:36:15.150Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:15.150Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 20, 31, 'Fa amin’ny andro rehetra hahaveloman’ny zanak’i Jese eto an-tany, dia tsy haharitra ialahy sy ny fanjakan’ialahy. Koa maniraha olona haka azy hankatỳ amiko, fa tokony ho faty izy.”', 'fa amin’ny andro rehetra hahaveloman’ny zanak’i jese eto an-tany, dia tsy haharitra ialahy sy ny fanjakan’ialahy. koa maniraha olona haka azy hankatỳ amiko, fa tokony ho faty izy.”'),
  ('6ab25a1f7ba6af6de00a0a4a', '2026-09-22T10:36:15.150Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:15.150Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 20, 1, 'Ary nandositra niala tao Naiota any Rama i Davida. Nankany amin’i Jonatana anefa izy ka nilaza taminy hoe: “Fa inona no nataoko? Inona no fahadisoako, ary inona no fahotana vitako teo anatrehan’ny rainao, no mifofo ny aiko izy?”', 'ary nandositra niala tao naiota any rama i davida. nankany amin’i jonatana anefa izy ka nilaza taminy hoe: “fa inona no nataoko? inona no fahadisoako, ary inona no fahotana vitako teo anatrehan’ny rainao, no mifofo ny aiko izy?”'),
  ('6ab25a1f7ba6af6de00a0a6e', '2026-09-22T10:36:15.150Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:15.150Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 20, 37, 'Nony tonga teny amin’ilay toerana nisy ny zana-tsipìka nalefan’i Jonatana ilay mpanompo, dia niantso avy tany aoriany i Jonatana, nanao hoe: “Tsy mbola lavitra kokoa anao ve ilay zana-tsipìka?”', 'nony tonga teny amin’ilay toerana nisy ny zana-tsipìka nalefan’i jonatana ilay mpanompo, dia niantso avy tany aoriany i jonatana, nanao hoe: “tsy mbola lavitra kokoa anao ve ilay zana-tsipìka?”'),
  ('6ab25a1f7ba6af6de00a0a5c', '2026-09-22T10:36:15.150Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:15.150Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 20, 19, 'Ary vao mainka ho hita fa tsy eo ianao rahafakampitso. Koa tongava eo amin’ilay toerana niafenanao tamin’ny indray andro * iny, ary mitoera erỳ akaikin’ny vato erỳ.', 'ary vao mainka ho hita fa tsy eo ianao rahafakampitso. koa tongava eo amin’ilay toerana niafenanao tamin’ny indray andro * iny, ary mitoera erỳ akaikin’ny vato erỳ.'),
  ('6ab25a1f7ba6af6de00a0a4d', '2026-09-22T10:36:15.150Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:15.150Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 20, 4, 'Koa hoy i Jonatana tamin’i Davida: “Izay lazainao dia hataoko ho anao.”', 'koa hoy i jonatana tamin’i davida: “izay lazainao dia hataoko ho anao.”'),
  ('6ab25a1f7ba6af6de00a0a73', '2026-09-22T10:36:15.150Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:15.150Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 20, 42, 'Ary hoy i Jonatana tamin’i Davida: “Mandehana soa aman-tsara, fa efa samy nianiana tamin’ny anaran’i Jehovah isika, hoe: ‘Enga anie i Jehovah no ho vavolombelona amiko sy aminao, ary amin’ny taranako sy ny taranakao, mandritra ny fotoana tsy voafetra!’” Koa nitsangana i Davida dia lasa. Ary i Jonatana kosa niditra tao an-tanàna.', 'ary hoy i jonatana tamin’i davida: “mandehana soa aman-tsara, fa efa samy nianiana tamin’ny anaran’i jehovah isika, hoe: ‘enga anie i jehovah no ho vavolombelona amiko sy aminao, ary amin’ny taranako sy ny taranakao, mandritra ny fotoana tsy voafetra!’” koa nitsangana i davida dia lasa. ary i jonatana kosa niditra tao an-tanàna.'),
  ('6ab25a1f7ba6af6de00a0a72', '2026-09-22T10:36:15.150Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:15.150Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 20, 41, 'Koa lasa ilay mpanompo. Fa i Davida kosa nitsangana avy teo akaiky teo, teo atsimo. Dia niondrika izy ka niankohoka tamin’ny tany intelo. Koa nifanoroka izy roa lahy ary samy nitomany, ka ny iray nitomany ny iray, ary ny iray koa nitomany ny iray. Tamin’ny farany dia i Davida no nitomany mafy indrindra.', 'koa lasa ilay mpanompo. fa i davida kosa nitsangana avy teo akaiky teo, teo atsimo. dia niondrika izy ka niankohoka tamin’ny tany intelo. koa nifanoroka izy roa lahy ary samy nitomany, ka ny iray nitomany ny iray, ary ny iray koa nitomany ny iray. tamin’ny farany dia i davida no nitomany mafy indrindra.'),
  ('6ab25a1f7ba6af6de00a0a67', '2026-09-22T10:36:15.150Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:15.150Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 20, 30, 'Dia tezitra be tamin’i Jonatana i Saoly, ka hoy izy taminy: “Ilay zanaky ny mpanompovavy mpikomy ity! Tsy fantatro tsara angaha fa nifidy an’iny zanak’i Jese iny ialahy mba hahatonga henatra ho an’ialahy sy ho an’ny fitanjahan-drenin’ialahy?', 'dia tezitra be tamin’i jonatana i saoly, ka hoy izy taminy: “ilay zanaky ny mpanompovavy mpikomy ity! tsy fantatro tsara angaha fa nifidy an’iny zanak’i jese iny ialahy mba hahatonga henatra ho an’ialahy sy ho an’ny fitanjahan-drenin’ialahy?'),
  ('6ab25a1f7ba6af6de00a0a66', '2026-09-22T10:36:15.150Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:15.150Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 20, 29, 'ka niteny hoe: ‘Mba avelao aho handeha, fa misy sorona ataon’ny fianakavianay any an-tanàna, ary ny rahalahiko mihitsy no nandidy ahy ho any. Koa raha mahazo sitraka aminao aho, dia mba avelao aho hitsoriaka kely hijery ny rahalahiko.’ Izany no antony tsy nahatongavany teto amin’ny latabatry ny mpanjaka.”', 'ka niteny hoe: ‘mba avelao aho handeha, fa misy sorona ataon’ny fianakavianay any an-tanàna, ary ny rahalahiko mihitsy no nandidy ahy ho any. koa raha mahazo sitraka aminao aho, dia mba avelao aho hitsoriaka kely hijery ny rahalahiko.’ izany no antony tsy nahatongavany teto amin’ny latabatry ny mpanjaka.”'),
  ('6ab25a1f7ba6af6de00a0a5a', '2026-09-22T10:36:15.150Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:15.150Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 20, 17, 'Dia nivoady tamin’i Davida indray i Jonatana noho ny fitiavany azy, fa tiany toy ny tenany mihitsy izy.', 'dia nivoady tamin’i davida indray i jonatana noho ny fitiavany azy, fa tiany toy ny tenany mihitsy izy.'),
  ('6ab25a1f7ba6af6de00a0a62', '2026-09-22T10:36:15.150Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:15.150Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 20, 25, 'Ary nipetraka teo amin’ny sezany teo akaikin’ny rindrina toy ny mahazatra ny mpanjaka, ka i Jonatana no nifanatrika taminy, ary i Abnera no nipetraka teo akaikiny, fa banga kosa ny toeran’i Davida.', 'ary nipetraka teo amin’ny sezany teo akaikin’ny rindrina toy ny mahazatra ny mpanjaka, ka i jonatana no nifanatrika taminy, ary i abnera no nipetraka teo akaikiny, fa banga kosa ny toeran’i davida.'),
  ('6ab25a1f7ba6af6de00a0a5e', '2026-09-22T10:36:15.150Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:15.150Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 20, 21, 'Ary haniraka mpanompo aho ka hanao hoe: ‘Mandehana, tadiavo ireo zana-tsipìka.’ Koa raha milaza aminy aho hoe: ‘Jereo fa iretsy an-kilanao iretsy ny zana-tsipìka, ka alaivo’, dia manatòna fa midika ho fiadanana ho anao izany ary tsy misy atahorana, raha mbola velona koa i Jehovah.', 'ary haniraka mpanompo aho ka hanao hoe: ‘mandehana, tadiavo ireo zana-tsipìka.’ koa raha milaza aminy aho hoe: ‘jereo fa iretsy an-kilanao iretsy ny zana-tsipìka, ka alaivo’, dia manatòna fa midika ho fiadanana ho anao izany ary tsy misy atahorana, raha mbola velona koa i jehovah.'),
  ('6ab25a1f7ba6af6de00a0a6c', '2026-09-22T10:36:15.150Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:15.150Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 20, 35, 'Ary nivoaka nankany an-tsaha i Jonatana ny ampitso maraina, nankany amin’ilay toerana nifanarahana tamin’i Davida, ary nisy mpanompo tanora iray niaraka taminy.', 'ary nivoaka nankany an-tsaha i jonatana ny ampitso maraina, nankany amin’ilay toerana nifanarahana tamin’i davida, ary nisy mpanompo tanora iray niaraka taminy.'),
  ('6ab25a1f7ba6af6de00a0a69', '2026-09-22T10:36:15.150Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:15.150Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 20, 32, 'Namaly an’i Saoly rainy anefa i Jonatana hoe: “Nahoana izy no tokony hovonoina ho faty? Fa inona no nataony?”', 'namaly an’i saoly rainy anefa i jonatana hoe: “nahoana izy no tokony hovonoina ho faty? fa inona no nataony?”'),
  ('6ab25a1f7ba6af6de00a0a5d', '2026-09-22T10:36:15.150Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:15.150Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 20, 20, 'Fa izaho kosa handefa zana-tsipìka telo eo akaikiny, toy ny hoe mikendry zavatra.', 'fa izaho kosa handefa zana-tsipìka telo eo akaikiny, toy ny hoe mikendry zavatra.'),
  ('6ab25a1f7ba6af6de00a0a58', '2026-09-22T10:36:15.150Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:15.150Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 20, 15, 'Dia tsy hesorinao amin’ny ankohonako ny hatsaram-panahinao feno fitiavana, mandritra ny fotoana tsy voafetra. Ary na rehefa haringan’i Jehovah tsy ho etỳ ambonin’ny tany aza ny fahavalon’i Davida rehetra,', 'dia tsy hesorinao amin’ny ankohonako ny hatsaram-panahinao feno fitiavana, mandritra ny fotoana tsy voafetra. ary na rehefa haringan’i jehovah tsy ho etỳ ambonin’ny tany aza ny fahavalon’i davida rehetra,'),
  ('6ab25a1f7ba6af6de00a0a60', '2026-09-22T10:36:15.150Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:15.150Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 20, 23, 'Ary momba ilay resaka nifanaovantsika sy ianao iny, dia enga anie i Jehovah no ho vavolombelona amiko sy aminao mandritra ny fotoana tsy voafetra!”', 'ary momba ilay resaka nifanaovantsika sy ianao iny, dia enga anie i jehovah no ho vavolombelona amiko sy aminao mandritra ny fotoana tsy voafetra!”'),
  ('6ab25a1f7ba6af6de00a0a56', '2026-09-22T10:36:15.150Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:15.150Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 20, 13, 'Hofaizin’i Jehovah anie i Jonatana, * ary mihoatra noho izany aza, raha toa aho ka tsy milaza aminao ka mandefa anao soa aman-tsara, rehefa fantatro fa te hanisy ratsy anao ny raiko! Homba anao anie i Jehovah, toy ny nombany ny raiko!', 'hofaizin’i jehovah anie i jonatana, * ary mihoatra noho izany aza, raha toa aho ka tsy milaza aminao ka mandefa anao soa aman-tsara, rehefa fantatro fa te hanisy ratsy anao ny raiko! homba anao anie i jehovah, toy ny nombany ny raiko!'),
  ('6ab25a1f7ba6af6de00a0a53', '2026-09-22T10:36:15.150Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:15.150Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 20, 10, 'Ary hoy i Davida tamin’i Jonatana: “Dia iza no hilaza amiko raha masiaka ny valin-tenin-drainao na tsia?”', 'ary hoy i davida tamin’i jonatana: “dia iza no hilaza amiko raha masiaka ny valin-tenin-drainao na tsia?”'),
  ('6ab25a1f7ba6af6de00a0a6d', '2026-09-22T10:36:15.150Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:15.150Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 20, 36, 'Koa hoy izy tamin’ilay mpanompony: “Mihazakazaha ianao ka tadiavo ireo zana-tsipìka alefako.” Dia nihazakazaka ilay mpanompo, ary nalefan’i Jonatana hihoatra azy ny zana-tsipìka.', 'koa hoy izy tamin’ilay mpanompony: “mihazakazaha ianao ka tadiavo ireo zana-tsipìka alefako.” dia nihazakazaka ilay mpanompo, ary nalefan’i jonatana hihoatra azy ny zana-tsipìka.'),
  ('6ab25a1f7ba6af6de00a0a55', '2026-09-22T10:36:15.150Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:15.150Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 20, 12, 'Ary hoy i Jonatana taminy: “I Jehovah Andriamanitry ny Israely no vavolombelona fa hofantariko tsara izay ao an-tsain’ny raiko, rahampitso tokotokony ho amin’ny ora toy izao na rahafakampitso. Raha vonona ny hanisy soa an’i Davida izy, dia tsy handefasako olona ve ho any aminao mba hilaza aminao?', 'ary hoy i jonatana taminy: “i jehovah andriamanitry ny israely no vavolombelona fa hofantariko tsara izay ao an-tsain’ny raiko, rahampitso tokotokony ho amin’ny ora toy izao na rahafakampitso. raha vonona ny hanisy soa an’i davida izy, dia tsy handefasako olona ve ho any aminao mba hilaza aminao?'),
  ('6ab25a1f7ba6af6de00a0a4e', '2026-09-22T10:36:15.150Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:15.150Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 20, 5, 'Dia hoy i Davida tamin’i Jonatana: “Tsinam-bolana rahampitso ka tokony hiara-misakafo amin’ny mpanjaka aho. Koa avelao aho handeha, dia hiafina any an-tsaha hatramin’ny rahafakampitso hariva.', 'dia hoy i davida tamin’i jonatana: “tsinam-bolana rahampitso ka tokony hiara-misakafo amin’ny mpanjaka aho. koa avelao aho handeha, dia hiafina any an-tsaha hatramin’ny rahafakampitso hariva.'),
  ('6ab25a1f7ba6af6de00a0a71', '2026-09-22T10:36:15.150Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:15.150Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 20, 40, 'Dia nomen’i Jonatana an’ilay mpanompony ny fitaovam-piadiany, ka hoy izy taminy: “Mandehana, ento any an-tanàna ireto.”', 'dia nomen’i jonatana an’ilay mpanompony ny fitaovam-piadiany, ka hoy izy taminy: “mandehana, ento any an-tanàna ireto.”'),
  ('6ab25a1f7ba6af6de00a0a59', '2026-09-22T10:36:15.150Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:15.150Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 20, 16, 'dia tsy hofoanana eo amin’ny taranak’i Davida ny anaran’i Jonatana. Koa hampamoahin’i Jehovah ny amin’izany fifanekena izany ny fahavalon’i Davida.”', 'dia tsy hofoanana eo amin’ny taranak’i davida ny anaran’i jonatana. koa hampamoahin’i jehovah ny amin’izany fifanekena izany ny fahavalon’i davida.”'),
  ('6ab25a1f7ba6af6de00a0a50', '2026-09-22T10:36:15.150Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:15.150Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 20, 7, 'Koa raha milaza izy hoe: ‘Tsara izany!’, dia ho fiadanana ho an’ny mpanomponao izany. Fa raha tezitra kosa izy, dia fantaro fa efa masaka ao an-tsainy ny hanao ratsy.', 'koa raha milaza izy hoe: ‘tsara izany!’, dia ho fiadanana ho an’ny mpanomponao izany. fa raha tezitra kosa izy, dia fantaro fa efa masaka ao an-tsainy ny hanao ratsy.'),
  ('6ab25a1f7ba6af6de00a0a65', '2026-09-22T10:36:15.150Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:15.150Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 20, 28, 'Koa namaly an’i Saoly i Jonatana hoe: “Niera tamiko i Davida mba hankany Betlehema,', 'koa namaly an’i saoly i jonatana hoe: “niera tamiko i davida mba hankany betlehema,'),
  ('6ab25a1f7ba6af6de00a0a61', '2026-09-22T10:36:15.150Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:15.150Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 20, 24, 'Koa niafina tany an-tsaha i Davida. Tsinam-bolana ny andro, ka naka toerana mba hisakafo ny mpanjaka.', 'koa niafina tany an-tsaha i davida. tsinam-bolana ny andro, ka naka toerana mba hisakafo ny mpanjaka.'),
  ('6ab25a1f7ba6af6de00a0a51', '2026-09-22T10:36:15.150Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:15.150Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 20, 8, 'Koa manehoa hatsaram-panahy feno fitiavana amin’ny mpanomponao, satria efa nampidirinao tao amin’ny fifanekena iray teo anatrehan’i Jehovah ny mpanomponao. Raha misy fahadisoako anefa, dia aoka ianao ihany no hamono ahy ho faty. Fa nahoana aho no hoentinao any amin’ny rainao?”', 'koa manehoa hatsaram-panahy feno fitiavana amin’ny mpanomponao, satria efa nampidirinao tao amin’ny fifanekena iray teo anatrehan’i jehovah ny mpanomponao. raha misy fahadisoako anefa, dia aoka ianao ihany no hamono ahy ho faty. fa nahoana aho no hoentinao any amin’ny rainao?”'),
  ('6ab25a1f7ba6af6de00a0a4b', '2026-09-22T10:36:15.150Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:15.150Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 20, 2, 'Dia hoy i Jonatana: “Sanatria anao izany ho faty izany! Tsy misy tsy lazain’ny raiko amiko izay zavatra hataony na kely na lehibe. Inona moa no antony hanafenany izany amiko? Tsy hanao izany mihitsy izy!”', 'dia hoy i jonatana: “sanatria anao izany ho faty izany! tsy misy tsy lazain’ny raiko amiko izay zavatra hataony na kely na lehibe. inona moa no antony hanafenany izany amiko? tsy hanao izany mihitsy izy!”'),
  ('6ab25a1f7ba6af6de00a0a52', '2026-09-22T10:36:15.150Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:15.150Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 20, 9, 'Koa hoy i Jonatana: “Tsy hanjo anao mihitsy izany! Raha fantatro anefa fa ny hanisy ratsy anao no efa masaka ao an-tsain’ny raiko, dia tsy holazaiko aminao ve izany?”', 'koa hoy i jonatana: “tsy hanjo anao mihitsy izany! raha fantatro anefa fa ny hanisy ratsy anao no efa masaka ao an-tsain’ny raiko, dia tsy holazaiko aminao ve izany?”'),
  ('6ab25a1f7ba6af6de00a0a70', '2026-09-22T10:36:15.150Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:15.150Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 20, 39, 'Ary tsy nahafantatra na inona na inona momba izany ilay mpanompo, fa i Jonatana sy Davida ihany no nahafantatra.', 'ary tsy nahafantatra na inona na inona momba izany ilay mpanompo, fa i jonatana sy davida ihany no nahafantatra.'),
  ('6ab25a1f7ba6af6de00a0a64', '2026-09-22T10:36:15.150Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:15.150Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 20, 27, 'Ny ampitson’ny tsinam-bolana, tamin’ny andro faharoa anefa, dia mbola banga ihany ny toeran’i Davida. Koa hoy i Saoly tamin’i Jonatana zanany: “Nahoana no tsy tonga tamin’ny sakafo ny zanak’i Jese, na omaly na androany?”', 'ny ampitson’ny tsinam-bolana, tamin’ny andro faharoa anefa, dia mbola banga ihany ny toeran’i davida. koa hoy i saoly tamin’i jonatana zanany: “nahoana no tsy tonga tamin’ny sakafo ny zanak’i jese, na omaly na androany?”'),
  ('6ab25a1f7ba6af6de00a0a63', '2026-09-22T10:36:15.150Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:15.150Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 20, 26, 'Ary tsy niteny na inona na inona mihitsy i Saoly tamin’iny andro iny, fa hoy izy anakampo: “Nisy zavatra nitranga angamba ka tsy madio izy, satria tsy voadio.”', 'ary tsy niteny na inona na inona mihitsy i saoly tamin’iny andro iny, fa hoy izy anakampo: “nisy zavatra nitranga angamba ka tsy madio izy, satria tsy voadio.”'),
  ('6ab25a1f7ba6af6de00a0a6b', '2026-09-22T10:36:15.150Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:15.150Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 20, 34, 'Avy hatrany dia nitsangana avy teo an-databatra i Jonatana, sady tezitra mafy. Ary tsy nihinan-kanina izy tamin’iny ampitson’ny tsinam-bolana iny, fa nalahelo noho ny amin’i Davida, izay nampietren’ny rainy.', 'avy hatrany dia nitsangana avy teo an-databatra i jonatana, sady tezitra mafy. ary tsy nihinan-kanina izy tamin’iny ampitson’ny tsinam-bolana iny, fa nalahelo noho ny amin’i davida, izay nampietren’ny rainy.'),
  ('6ab25a1f7ba6af6de00a0a5f', '2026-09-22T10:36:15.150Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:15.150Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 20, 22, 'Fa raha milaza amin’ilay zazalahy kosa aho hoe: ‘Jereo fa lavitra kokoa anao ireo zana-tsipìka’, dia mandehana fa efa nandefa anao i Jehovah.', 'fa raha milaza amin’ilay zazalahy kosa aho hoe: ‘jereo fa lavitra kokoa anao ireo zana-tsipìka’, dia mandehana fa efa nandefa anao i jehovah.'),
  ('6ab25a1f7ba6af6de00a0a54', '2026-09-22T10:36:15.150Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:15.150Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 20, 11, 'Koa hoy i Jonatana tamin’i Davida: “Andao hivoaka ho any an-tsaha.” Koa nivoaka nankany an-tsaha izy roa lahy.', 'koa hoy i jonatana tamin’i davida: “andao hivoaka ho any an-tsaha.” koa nivoaka nankany an-tsaha izy roa lahy.'),
  ('6ab25a1f7ba6af6de00a0a6a', '2026-09-22T10:36:15.150Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:15.150Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 20, 33, 'Dia notorahan’i Saoly lefona i Jonatana mba hamelezana azy. Koa fantatr’i Jonatana fa efa masaka tao an-tsain-drainy ny hamono an’i Davida ho faty.', 'dia notorahan’i saoly lefona i jonatana mba hamelezana azy. koa fantatr’i jonatana fa efa masaka tao an-tsain-drainy ny hamono an’i davida ho faty.'),
  ('6ab25a1f7ba6af6de00a0a57', '2026-09-22T10:36:15.150Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:15.150Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 20, 14, 'Ary raha mbola velona koa aho, moa ve aho tsy hanehoanao hatsaram-panahy feno fitiavana, toy izay asehon’i Jehovah, mba tsy hahafaty ahy?', 'ary raha mbola velona koa aho, moa ve aho tsy hanehoanao hatsaram-panahy feno fitiavana, toy izay asehon’i jehovah, mba tsy hahafaty ahy?'),
  ('6ab25a1f7ba6af6de00a0a6f', '2026-09-22T10:36:15.150Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:15.150Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 20, 38, 'Mbola niantso avy tany aorian’ilay mpanompo ihany i Jonatana, nanao hoe: “Haingana ianao! Haingana! Aza mijanona!” Koa nandeha naka an’ireo zana-tsipìka ilay mpanompony, dia nankeny amin’ny tompony.', 'mbola niantso avy tany aorian’ilay mpanompo ihany i jonatana, nanao hoe: “haingana ianao! haingana! aza mijanona!” koa nandeha naka an’ireo zana-tsipìka ilay mpanompony, dia nankeny amin’ny tompony.'),
  ('6ab25a1f7ba6af6de00a0a5b', '2026-09-22T10:36:15.150Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:15.150Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 20, 18, 'Ary hoy i Jonatana taminy: “Tsinam-bolana rahampitso, ary ho hita fa tsy eo ianao, satria ho banga ny toeranao.', 'ary hoy i jonatana taminy: “tsinam-bolana rahampitso, ary ho hita fa tsy eo ianao, satria ho banga ny toeranao.'),
  ('6ab25a20df9e0fd5d6ec480f', '2026-09-22T10:36:16.037Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:16.037Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 21, 4, 'Hoy anefa ilay mpisorona: “Tsy misy mofo tsotra eto am-pelatanako, fa mofo masina ihany. Homeko izany raha toa ka tsy nikasi-behivavy ireo tovolahy.”', 'hoy anefa ilay mpisorona: “tsy misy mofo tsotra eto am-pelatanako, fa mofo masina ihany. homeko izany raha toa ka tsy nikasi-behivavy ireo tovolahy.”'),
  ('6ab25a20df9e0fd5d6ec4819', '2026-09-22T10:36:16.037Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:16.037Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 21, 14, 'Ary hoy i Akisy tamin’ny mpanompony: “Hitanareo fa adala io lehilahy io, ka maninona no entinareo atỳ amiko?', 'ary hoy i akisy tamin’ny mpanompony: “hitanareo fa adala io lehilahy io, ka maninona no entinareo atỳ amiko?'),
  ('6ab25a20df9e0fd5d6ec4810', '2026-09-22T10:36:16.037Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:16.037Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 21, 5, 'Ary hoy i Davida tamin’ilay mpisorona: “Efa tsy nikasi-behivavy mihitsy izahay, toy ny tamin’izaho nivoaka niady teo aloha ihany. Ary na raharaha tsotsotra aza no anirahana an’ireo tovolahy, dia efa masina foana ny tenany, koa mainka fa androany amin’izao fanirahana manokana izao?”', 'ary hoy i davida tamin’ilay mpisorona: “efa tsy nikasi-behivavy mihitsy izahay, toy ny tamin’izaho nivoaka niady teo aloha ihany. ary na raharaha tsotsotra aza no anirahana an’ireo tovolahy, dia efa masina foana ny tenany, koa mainka fa androany amin’izao fanirahana manokana izao?”'),
  ('6ab25a20df9e0fd5d6ec480c', '2026-09-22T10:36:16.037Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:16.037Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 21, 1, 'Tonga tao amin’i Ahimeleka mpisorona tany Noba i Davida, tatỳ aoriana. Dia nihorohoro i Ahimeleka rehefa nahita an’i Davida, ka niteny hoe: “Nahoana ianao no mandeha irery, fa tsy misy miaraka aminao?”', 'tonga tao amin’i ahimeleka mpisorona tany noba i davida, tatỳ aoriana. dia nihorohoro i ahimeleka rehefa nahita an’i davida, ka niteny hoe: “nahoana ianao no mandeha irery, fa tsy misy miaraka aminao?”'),
  ('6ab25a20df9e0fd5d6ec481a', '2026-09-22T10:36:16.037Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:16.037Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 21, 15, 'Izaho angaha mila olona adala, no itondranareo an’io mba hampisehoany ny hadalany eto amiko? Io ve dia hiditra ao an-tranoko?”', 'izaho angaha mila olona adala, no itondranareo an’io mba hampisehoany ny hadalany eto amiko? io ve dia hiditra ao an-tranoko?”'),
  ('6ab25a20df9e0fd5d6ec4818', '2026-09-22T10:36:16.037Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:16.037Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 21, 13, 'Koa nody adala teo imason’izy ireo izy sady nanao very saina, ka nanoratsoratra teo amin’ny vavahady, sady namela ny iviny hiraraka tamin’ny volombavany, raha mbola teo am-pelatanan’izy ireo izy.', 'koa nody adala teo imason’izy ireo izy sady nanao very saina, ka nanoratsoratra teo amin’ny vavahady, sady namela ny iviny hiraraka tamin’ny volombavany, raha mbola teo am-pelatanan’izy ireo izy.'),
  ('6ab25a20df9e0fd5d6ec4814', '2026-09-22T10:36:16.037Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:16.037Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 21, 9, 'Dia hoy ilay mpisorona: “Ny sabatr’i Goliata Filistinina, izay novonoinao teo amin’ny lemaka ivan’i Elaha, no ao. Mifono lamba fitafy ilay izy, ao ambadiky ny efoda. Raha iny no hoentinao, dia ento, satria tsy misy afa-tsy iny ato.” Ary hoy i Davida: “Tsy misy tahaka an’iny, fa omeo ahy iny.”', 'dia hoy ilay mpisorona: “ny sabatr’i goliata filistinina, izay novonoinao teo amin’ny lemaka ivan’i elaha, no ao. mifono lamba fitafy ilay izy, ao ambadiky ny efoda. raha iny no hoentinao, dia ento, satria tsy misy afa-tsy iny ato.” ary hoy i davida: “tsy misy tahaka an’iny, fa omeo ahy iny.”'),
  ('6ab25a20df9e0fd5d6ec480e', '2026-09-22T10:36:16.037Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:16.037Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 21, 3, 'Koa raha misy mofo dimy ao aminao, dia mba omeo ahy. Na izay misy ao omena ahy.”', 'koa raha misy mofo dimy ao aminao, dia mba omeo ahy. na izay misy ao omena ahy.”'),
  ('6ab25a20df9e0fd5d6ec4811', '2026-09-22T10:36:16.037Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:16.037Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 21, 6, 'Dia nomen’ilay mpisorona azy ny zava-masina. Tsy nisy mofo mantsy tao, afa-tsy ny mofo aseho izay efa nesorina teo anatrehan’i Jehovah tamin’ny andro fanesorana azy, mba hametrahana mofo vaovao.', 'dia nomen’ilay mpisorona azy ny zava-masina. tsy nisy mofo mantsy tao, afa-tsy ny mofo aseho izay efa nesorina teo anatrehan’i jehovah tamin’ny andro fanesorana azy, mba hametrahana mofo vaovao.'),
  ('6ab25a20df9e0fd5d6ec480d', '2026-09-22T10:36:16.037Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:16.037Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 21, 2, 'Ary hoy i Davida tamin’i Ahimeleka mpisorona: “Ny mpanjaka no nandidy ahy hikarakara raharaha iray, ka niteny tamiko hoe: ‘Aoka tsy hisy hahalala mihitsy ny momba izao raharaha anirahako anao sy andidiako anao izao.’ Ary manao fotoana amin’ireo tovolahy any Ananona aho.', 'ary hoy i davida tamin’i ahimeleka mpisorona: “ny mpanjaka no nandidy ahy hikarakara raharaha iray, ka niteny tamiko hoe: ‘aoka tsy hisy hahalala mihitsy ny momba izao raharaha anirahako anao sy andidiako anao izao.’ ary manao fotoana amin’ireo tovolahy any ananona aho.'),
  ('6ab25a20df9e0fd5d6ec4812', '2026-09-22T10:36:16.037Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:16.037Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 21, 7, 'Ary teo ny iray tamin’ny mpanompon’i Saoly tamin’iny andro iny, fa voatana teo anatrehan’i Jehovah izy. Doega no anarany, Edomita izy, ary lehiben’ny mpiandry ondrin’i Saoly.', 'ary teo ny iray tamin’ny mpanompon’i saoly tamin’iny andro iny, fa voatana teo anatrehan’i jehovah izy. doega no anarany, edomita izy, ary lehiben’ny mpiandry ondrin’i saoly.'),
  ('6ab25a20df9e0fd5d6ec4817', '2026-09-22T10:36:16.037Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:16.037Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 21, 12, 'Ary nandatsaka izany teny izany tao am-pony i Davida, ka raiki-tahotra mafy noho ny amin’i Akisy mpanjakan’i Gata.', 'ary nandatsaka izany teny izany tao am-pony i davida, ka raiki-tahotra mafy noho ny amin’i akisy mpanjakan’i gata.'),
  ('6ab25a20df9e0fd5d6ec4815', '2026-09-22T10:36:16.037Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:16.037Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 21, 10, 'Dia lasa i Davida tamin’iny andro iny, ary mbola nandositra ihany izy noho ny amin’i Saoly, ka tonga tany amin’i Akisy mpanjakan’i Gata.', 'dia lasa i davida tamin’iny andro iny, ary mbola nandositra ihany izy noho ny amin’i saoly, ka tonga tany amin’i akisy mpanjakan’i gata.'),
  ('6ab25a20df9e0fd5d6ec4816', '2026-09-22T10:36:16.037Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:16.037Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 21, 11, 'Ary hoy ny mpanompon’i Akisy: “Tsy io ve ilay Davida mpanjakan’ity tany ity? Tsy noho izy ve no nahatonga ny olona handihy sy hanao hira mifamaly hoe: ‘I Saoly nahafaty arivoarivo, Fa i Davida kosa nahafaty alinalina’?”', 'ary hoy ny mpanompon’i akisy: “tsy io ve ilay davida mpanjakan’ity tany ity? tsy noho izy ve no nahatonga ny olona handihy sy hanao hira mifamaly hoe: ‘i saoly nahafaty arivoarivo, fa i davida kosa nahafaty alinalina’?”'),
  ('6ab25a20df9e0fd5d6ec4813', '2026-09-22T10:36:16.037Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:16.037Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 21, 8, 'Hoy koa i Davida tamin’i Ahimeleka: “Ary tsy misy lefona na sabatra ve ato aminao? Fa tsy nisy voaraiko na ny sabatro na ny fitaovam-piadiako, satria maika ny raharahan’ny mpanjaka.”', 'hoy koa i davida tamin’i ahimeleka: “ary tsy misy lefona na sabatra ve ato aminao? fa tsy nisy voaraiko na ny sabatro na ny fitaovam-piadiako, satria maika ny raharahan’ny mpanjaka.”'),
  ('6ab25a22e4caf273fca0b0e4', '2026-09-22T10:36:18.382Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:18.382Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 22, 8, 'Fa efa niray tetika hanohitra ahy ianareo rehetra. Ary tsy nisy nilaza tamiko hoe nanao fifanekena tamin’ny zanak’i Jese ny zanako. Tsy nisy nangoraka ahy koa ianareo, ka tsy nilaza tamiko hoe ny zanako efa nanangana ny mpanompoko hanohitra ahy sy hiafina mba hanafika ahy toy izao anio izao.”', 'fa efa niray tetika hanohitra ahy ianareo rehetra. ary tsy nisy nilaza tamiko hoe nanao fifanekena tamin’ny zanak’i jese ny zanako. tsy nisy nangoraka ahy koa ianareo, ka tsy nilaza tamiko hoe ny zanako efa nanangana ny mpanompoko hanohitra ahy sy hiafina mba hanafika ahy toy izao anio izao.”'),
  ('6ab25a22e4caf273fca0b0df', '2026-09-22T10:36:18.382Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:18.382Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 22, 3, 'Tatỳ aoriana, dia niala tao i Davida ka nankany Mizpe any Moaba. Ary hoy izy tamin’ny mpanjakan’i Moaba: “Mba avelao hipetraka atỳ aminareo re ny raiko sy ny reniko e, mandra-pahafantatro izay hataon’Andriamanitra amiko.”', 'tatỳ aoriana, dia niala tao i davida ka nankany mizpe any moaba. ary hoy izy tamin’ny mpanjakan’i moaba: “mba avelao hipetraka atỳ aminareo re ny raiko sy ny reniko e, mandra-pahafantatro izay hataon’andriamanitra amiko.”'),
  ('6ab25a22e4caf273fca0b0dd', '2026-09-22T10:36:18.382Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:18.382Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 22, 1, 'Koa niala tao i Davida, ka nandositra nankany amin’ilay lava-bato ao Adolama. Ary nandre izany ny rahalahiny sy ny ankohonan-drainy manontolo, ka nidina nankany aminy.', 'koa niala tao i davida, ka nandositra nankany amin’ilay lava-bato ao adolama. ary nandre izany ny rahalahiny sy ny ankohonan-drainy manontolo, ka nidina nankany aminy.'),
  ('6ab25a22e4caf273fca0b0ea', '2026-09-22T10:36:18.382Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:18.382Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 22, 14, 'Dia hoy ny navalin’i Ahimeleka ny mpanjaka: “Iza amin’ny mpanomponao rehetra moa no mendri-pitokisana tahaka an’i Davida, izay vinantolahin’ny mpanjaka sady lehiben’ny mpiaro anao ary hajaina ao an-tranonao?', 'dia hoy ny navalin’i ahimeleka ny mpanjaka: “iza amin’ny mpanomponao rehetra moa no mendri-pitokisana tahaka an’i davida, izay vinantolahin’ny mpanjaka sady lehiben’ny mpiaro anao ary hajaina ao an-tranonao?'),
  ('6ab25a22e4caf273fca0b0e5', '2026-09-22T10:36:18.382Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:18.382Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 22, 9, 'Dia hoy i Doega Edomita izay voatendry ho lehiben’ny mpanompon’i Saoly: “Hitako ny zanak’i Jese tonga tany Noba, tao amin’i Ahimeleka zanak’i Ahitoba.', 'dia hoy i doega edomita izay voatendry ho lehiben’ny mpanompon’i saoly: “hitako ny zanak’i jese tonga tany noba, tao amin’i ahimeleka zanak’i ahitoba.'),
  ('6ab25a22e4caf273fca0b0e0', '2026-09-22T10:36:18.382Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:18.382Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 22, 4, 'Koa nampitoeriny teo anatrehan’ny mpanjakan’i Moaba izy ireo. Dia nifindra tany amin’ny faritanin’io mpanjaka io izy ireo, ka nonina tany tamin’ny andro rehetra nitoeran’i Davida tany amin’ny toerana sarotra aleha.', 'koa nampitoeriny teo anatrehan’ny mpanjakan’i moaba izy ireo. dia nifindra tany amin’ny faritanin’io mpanjaka io izy ireo, ka nonina tany tamin’ny andro rehetra nitoeran’i davida tany amin’ny toerana sarotra aleha.'),
  ('6ab25a22e4caf273fca0b0e2', '2026-09-22T10:36:18.382Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:18.382Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 22, 6, 'Ary ren’i Saoly fa nisy nahita i Davida sy ny olona niaraka taminy. Nipetraka teo ambanin’ilay hazo tamariska teny amin’ny toerana avo tany Gibea i Saoly tamin’izay. Ary teny an-tanany ny lefony sady teo aminy ny mpanompony rehetra.', 'ary ren’i saoly fa nisy nahita i davida sy ny olona niaraka taminy. nipetraka teo ambanin’ilay hazo tamariska teny amin’ny toerana avo tany gibea i saoly tamin’izay. ary teny an-tanany ny lefony sady teo aminy ny mpanompony rehetra.'),
  ('6ab25a22e4caf273fca0b0de', '2026-09-22T10:36:18.382Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:18.382Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 22, 2, 'Ary niangona teo aminy izay lehilahy rehetra azom-pahoriana, sy izay nananan’olona trosa, ary izay tezitra noho ny zava-nisy tamin’izany fotoana izany. Koa lasa lehiben’izy ireo i Davida. Ary nanjary nisy efajato lahy teo ho eo niaraka taminy.', 'ary niangona teo aminy izay lehilahy rehetra azom-pahoriana, sy izay nananan’olona trosa, ary izay tezitra noho ny zava-nisy tamin’izany fotoana izany. koa lasa lehiben’izy ireo i davida. ary nanjary nisy efajato lahy teo ho eo niaraka taminy.'),
  ('6ab25a22e4caf273fca0b0e9', '2026-09-22T10:36:18.382Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:18.382Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 22, 13, 'Ary hoy i Saoly: “Nahoana ianao sy ny zanak’i Jese no niray tetika hanohitra ahy, ka nomenao mofo sy sabatra izy? Nanontany an’Andriamanitra ho azy koa ianao, mba hitsanganany hanohitra ahy, sy hiafenany mba hanafika ahy toy izao anio izao.”', 'ary hoy i saoly: “nahoana ianao sy ny zanak’i jese no niray tetika hanohitra ahy, ka nomenao mofo sy sabatra izy? nanontany an’andriamanitra ho azy koa ianao, mba hitsanganany hanohitra ahy, sy hiafenany mba hanafika ahy toy izao anio izao.”'),
  ('6ab25a22e4caf273fca0b0e1', '2026-09-22T10:36:18.382Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:18.382Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 22, 5, 'Rehefa nandeha ny fotoana, dia hoy i Gada mpaminany tamin’i Davida: “Aza mijanona any amin’ny toerana sarotra aleha. Mialà any, ka mankanesa any amin’ny tanin’i Joda.” Dia lasa i Davida, ka tonga tany amin’ny alan’i Hareta.', 'rehefa nandeha ny fotoana, dia hoy i gada mpaminany tamin’i davida: “aza mijanona any amin’ny toerana sarotra aleha. mialà any, ka mankanesa any amin’ny tanin’i joda.” dia lasa i davida, ka tonga tany amin’ny alan’i hareta.'),
  ('6ab25a22e4caf273fca0b0e8', '2026-09-22T10:36:18.382Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:18.382Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 22, 12, 'Ary hoy i Saoly: “Mba mihainoa kely, ry zanak’i Ahitoba!” Dia hoy izy: “Intỳ aho, tompoko.”', 'ary hoy i saoly: “mba mihainoa kely, ry zanak’i ahitoba!” dia hoy izy: “intỳ aho, tompoko.”'),
  ('6ab25a22e4caf273fca0b0eb', '2026-09-22T10:36:18.382Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:18.382Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 22, 15, 'Angaha moa androany aho vao nanontany an’Andriamanitra ho azy? Sanatria ahy ny hanao teti-dratsy hanoherana anao! Aoka ny mpanjaka tsy hiampanga ny mpanompony sy ny ankohonan-draiko manontolo na amin’inona na amin’inona, fa tsy misy fantatry ny mpanomponao ny amin’izany rehetra izany, na kely na lehibe.”', 'angaha moa androany aho vao nanontany an’andriamanitra ho azy? sanatria ahy ny hanao teti-dratsy hanoherana anao! aoka ny mpanjaka tsy hiampanga ny mpanompony sy ny ankohonan-draiko manontolo na amin’inona na amin’inona, fa tsy misy fantatry ny mpanomponao ny amin’izany rehetra izany, na kely na lehibe.”'),
  ('6ab25a22e4caf273fca0b0e6', '2026-09-22T10:36:18.382Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:18.382Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 22, 10, 'Ary nanontany an’i Jehovah ho azy i Ahimeleka, sady nanome vatsy azy, sy nanome azy ny sabatr’i Goliata Filistinina.”', 'ary nanontany an’i jehovah ho azy i ahimeleka, sady nanome vatsy azy, sy nanome azy ny sabatr’i goliata filistinina.”'),
  ('6ab25a22e4caf273fca0b0e7', '2026-09-22T10:36:18.382Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:18.382Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 22, 11, 'Koa nampanantsoin’ny mpanjaka avy hatrany i Ahimeleka zanak’i Ahitoba mpisorona mbamin’ny ankohonan-drainy manontolo, dia ireo mpisorona tany Noba. Dia tonga teo amin’ny mpanjaka izy rehetra.', 'koa nampanantsoin’ny mpanjaka avy hatrany i ahimeleka zanak’i ahitoba mpisorona mbamin’ny ankohonan-drainy manontolo, dia ireo mpisorona tany noba. dia tonga teo amin’ny mpanjaka izy rehetra.'),
  ('6ab25a22e4caf273fca0b0e3', '2026-09-22T10:36:18.382Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:18.382Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 22, 7, 'Dia hoy i Saoly tamin’ireo mpanompony niaraka taminy: “Mba henoy kely izao, ry Benjaminita: Ny zanak’i Jese koa ve mba ho afaka hanome saha sy tanimboaloboka ho anareo rehetra? Hanendry anareo rehetra ho lehiben’ny arivo sy ho lehiben’ny zato ve izy?', 'dia hoy i saoly tamin’ireo mpanompony niaraka taminy: “mba henoy kely izao, ry benjaminita: ny zanak’i jese koa ve mba ho afaka hanome saha sy tanimboaloboka ho anareo rehetra? hanendry anareo rehetra ho lehiben’ny arivo sy ho lehiben’ny zato ve izy?'),
  ('6ab25a22e4caf273fca0b0f3', '2026-09-22T10:36:18.383Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:18.383Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 22, 23, 'Mijanòna fotsiny eto amiko. Ary aza matahotra, fa izay mifofo ny aiko dia mifofo ny ainao koa, satria mila fiarovana avy amiko ianao.”', 'mijanòna fotsiny eto amiko. ary aza matahotra, fa izay mifofo ny aiko dia mifofo ny ainao koa, satria mila fiarovana avy amiko ianao.”'),
  ('6ab25a22e4caf273fca0b0ee', '2026-09-22T10:36:18.383Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:18.383Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 22, 18, 'Farany, dia hoy ny mpanjaka tamin’i Doega: “Mihodìna, ka asio ireo mpisorona ireo!” Dia nihodina avy hatrany i Doega Edomita, ka namely an’ireo mpisorona. Koa dimy amby valopolo lahy nisalotra efoda rongony, no matiny tamin’iny andro iny.', 'farany, dia hoy ny mpanjaka tamin’i doega: “mihodìna, ka asio ireo mpisorona ireo!” dia nihodina avy hatrany i doega edomita, ka namely an’ireo mpisorona. koa dimy amby valopolo lahy nisalotra efoda rongony, no matiny tamin’iny andro iny.'),
  ('6ab25a22e4caf273fca0b0ed', '2026-09-22T10:36:18.383Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:18.383Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 22, 17, 'Dia hoy ny mpanjaka tamin’ireo mpihazakazaka teo akaikiny: “Mihodìna, ka vonoy ho faty ireo mpisoron’i Jehovah ireo, fa momba an’i Davida koa ny tanan’ireo sady efa fantatr’ireo fa nandositra izy, nefa tsy nolazainy tamiko izany!” Tsy nety naninjitra ny tanany hamely an’ireo mpisoron’i Jehovah anefa ny mpanompon’ny mpanjaka.', 'dia hoy ny mpanjaka tamin’ireo mpihazakazaka teo akaikiny: “mihodìna, ka vonoy ho faty ireo mpisoron’i jehovah ireo, fa momba an’i davida koa ny tanan’ireo sady efa fantatr’ireo fa nandositra izy, nefa tsy nolazainy tamiko izany!” tsy nety naninjitra ny tanany hamely an’ireo mpisoron’i jehovah anefa ny mpanompon’ny mpanjaka.'),
  ('6ab25a22e4caf273fca0b0ec', '2026-09-22T10:36:18.383Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:18.383Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 22, 16, 'Hoy anefa ny mpanjaka: “Ho faty tokoa ianao sy ny ankohonan-drainao manontolo, ry Ahimeleka!”', 'hoy anefa ny mpanjaka: “ho faty tokoa ianao sy ny ankohonan-drainao manontolo, ry ahimeleka!”'),
  ('6ab25a22e4caf273fca0b0f0', '2026-09-22T10:36:18.383Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:18.383Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 22, 20, 'Afa-nandositra anefa i Abiatara, iray tamin’ny zanakalahin’i Ahimeleka zanak’i Ahitoba, ka nitsoaka mba hanaraka an’i Davida.', 'afa-nandositra anefa i abiatara, iray tamin’ny zanakalahin’i ahimeleka zanak’i ahitoba, ka nitsoaka mba hanaraka an’i davida.'),
  ('6ab25a22e4caf273fca0b0f1', '2026-09-22T10:36:18.383Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:18.383Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 22, 21, 'Ary hoy i Abiatara tamin’i Davida: “Novonoin’i Saoly ny mpisoron’i Jehovah.”', 'ary hoy i abiatara tamin’i davida: “novonoin’i saoly ny mpisoron’i jehovah.”'),
  ('6ab25a22e4caf273fca0b0ef', '2026-09-22T10:36:18.383Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:18.383Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 22, 19, 'Nasiany tamin’ny lelan-tsabatra koa i Noba tanànan’ireo mpisorona, eny, nasiany avokoa na lehilahy na vehivavy, na ankizikely na zaza minono, na omby na ampondra na ondry.', 'nasiany tamin’ny lelan-tsabatra koa i noba tanànan’ireo mpisorona, eny, nasiany avokoa na lehilahy na vehivavy, na ankizikely na zaza minono, na omby na ampondra na ondry.'),
  ('6ab25a22e4caf273fca0b0f2', '2026-09-22T10:36:18.383Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:18.383Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 22, 22, 'Dia hoy i Davida tamin’i Abiatara: “Efa fantatro mihitsy tamin’iny andro iny fa tsy maintsy hilaza amin’i Saoly i Doega Edomita, satria teo izy. Izaho no tompon’andraikitra tamin’ny nahafatesan’izay * rehetra anisan’ny ankohonan-drainao.', 'dia hoy i davida tamin’i abiatara: “efa fantatro mihitsy tamin’iny andro iny fa tsy maintsy hilaza amin’i saoly i doega edomita, satria teo izy. izaho no tompon’andraikitra tamin’ny nahafatesan’izay * rehetra anisan’ny ankohonan-drainao.'),
  ('6ab25a233973f61970c153fa', '2026-09-22T10:36:19.309Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:19.309Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 23, 4, 'Koa nanontany an’i Jehovah indray i Davida. Dia hoy ny navalin’i Jehovah azy: “Mandehana midina any Keila, fa hatolotro eo an-tananao ny Filistinina.”', 'koa nanontany an’i jehovah indray i davida. dia hoy ny navalin’i jehovah azy: “mandehana midina any keila, fa hatolotro eo an-tananao ny filistinina.”'),
  ('6ab25a233973f61970c153f8', '2026-09-22T10:36:19.309Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:19.309Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 23, 2, 'Koa nanontany an’i Jehovah i Davida hoe: “Handeha hamely ny Filistinina ve aho?” Dia hoy i Jehovah taminy: “Mandehana mamely ny Filistinina ka vonjeo i Keila.”', 'koa nanontany an’i jehovah i davida hoe: “handeha hamely ny filistinina ve aho?” dia hoy i jehovah taminy: “mandehana mamely ny filistinina ka vonjeo i keila.”'),
  ('6ab25a233973f61970c153f9', '2026-09-22T10:36:19.309Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:19.309Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 23, 3, 'Ary hoy ny olon’i Davida: “Eto Joda aza isika matahotra, koa mainka fa raha ho any Keila hiady amin’ny tafiky ny Filistinina?”', 'ary hoy ny olon’i davida: “eto joda aza isika matahotra, koa mainka fa raha ho any keila hiady amin’ny tafiky ny filistinina?”'),
  ('6ab25a233973f61970c153f7', '2026-09-22T10:36:19.309Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:19.309Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 23, 1, 'Ary nisy nilaza tamin’i Davida hoe: “Miady amin’i Keila ny Filistinina, sady robainy ny eny am-pamoloana.”', 'ary nisy nilaza tamin’i davida hoe: “miady amin’i keila ny filistinina, sady robainy ny eny am-pamoloana.”'),
  ('6ab25a233973f61970c153fb', '2026-09-22T10:36:19.310Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:19.310Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 23, 5, 'Koa nankany Keila i Davida sy ny olony, ka niady tamin’ny Filistinina. Ary nentiny ny biby fiompin’ny Filistinina, fa izy ireo kosa novonoiny ka be dia be no maty. Koa lasa mpamonjy an’ireo mponin’i Keila i Davida.', 'koa nankany keila i davida sy ny olony, ka niady tamin’ny filistinina. ary nentiny ny biby fiompin’ny filistinina, fa izy ireo kosa novonoiny ka be dia be no maty. koa lasa mpamonjy an’ireo mponin’i keila i davida.'),
  ('6ab25a233973f61970c153fc', '2026-09-22T10:36:19.310Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:19.310Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 23, 6, 'Nitondra efoda nidina niaraka taminy i Abiatara zanak’i Ahimeleka, tamin’izy nandositra nankany amin’i Davida tany Keila.', 'nitondra efoda nidina niaraka taminy i abiatara zanak’i ahimeleka, tamin’izy nandositra nankany amin’i davida tany keila.'),
  ('6ab25a233973f61970c153fd', '2026-09-22T10:36:19.310Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:19.310Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 23, 7, 'Ary nisy nilaza tamin’i Saoly hoe: “Tonga ao Keila i Davida.” Dia hoy i Saoly: “Efa namidin’Andriamanitra ho eo an-tanako izy, satria efa nanidy ny tenany tao amin’ny tanàna misy vavahady sy bara hidiny.”', 'ary nisy nilaza tamin’i saoly hoe: “tonga ao keila i davida.” dia hoy i saoly: “efa namidin’andriamanitra ho eo an-tanako izy, satria efa nanidy ny tenany tao amin’ny tanàna misy vavahady sy bara hidiny.”'),
  ('6ab25a233973f61970c153fe', '2026-09-22T10:36:19.310Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:19.310Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 23, 8, 'Koa nantsoin’i Saoly ny olona rehetra mba hiady, ka hidina hanao fahirano an’i Davida sy ny olony any Keila.', 'koa nantsoin’i saoly ny olona rehetra mba hiady, ka hidina hanao fahirano an’i davida sy ny olony any keila.'),
  ('6ab25a233973f61970c153ff', '2026-09-22T10:36:19.310Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:19.310Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 23, 9, 'Ary nanjary fantatr’i Davida fa nitetika ny hanisy ratsy azy i Saoly. Koa hoy izy tamin’i Abiatara mpisorona: “Ento etỳ ny efoda.”', 'ary nanjary fantatr’i davida fa nitetika ny hanisy ratsy azy i saoly. koa hoy izy tamin’i abiatara mpisorona: “ento etỳ ny efoda.”'),
  ('6ab25a233973f61970c15400', '2026-09-22T10:36:19.310Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:19.310Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 23, 10, 'Ary hoy i Davida: “Ry Jehovah Andriamanitry ny Israely ô, efa ren’ny mpanomponao tokoa fa mitady hanketo Keila i Saoly mba handrava ny tanàna noho ny amiko.', 'ary hoy i davida: “ry jehovah andriamanitry ny israely ô, efa ren’ny mpanomponao tokoa fa mitady hanketo keila i saoly mba handrava ny tanàna noho ny amiko.'),
  ('6ab25a233973f61970c15401', '2026-09-22T10:36:19.310Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:19.310Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 23, 11, 'Hanolotra ahy eo an-tanany ve ireo mponin’i * Keila? Hidina ve i Saoly, araka izay efa ren’ny mpanomponao? Mba lazao amin’ny mpanomponao re, ry Jehovah Andriamanitry ny Israely ô!” Dia hoy i Jehovah: “Hidina izy.”', 'hanolotra ahy eo an-tanany ve ireo mponin’i * keila? hidina ve i saoly, araka izay efa ren’ny mpanomponao? mba lazao amin’ny mpanomponao re, ry jehovah andriamanitry ny israely ô!” dia hoy i jehovah: “hidina izy.”');
INSERT INTO "bible_verses" ("id", "created_date", "updated_date", "created_by_id", "created_by", "translation", "book", "bookOrder", "chapter", "verse", "text", "normalizedText") VALUES
  ('6ab25a233973f61970c15402', '2026-09-22T10:36:19.310Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:19.310Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 23, 12, 'Hoy indray i Davida: “Hanolotra ahy sy ny oloko eo an-tanan’i Saoly ve ireo mponin’i Keila?” Dia hoy i Jehovah: “Hanolotra anareo izy.”', 'hoy indray i davida: “hanolotra ahy sy ny oloko eo an-tanan’i saoly ve ireo mponin’i keila?” dia hoy i jehovah: “hanolotra anareo izy.”'),
  ('6ab25a233973f61970c15403', '2026-09-22T10:36:19.310Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:19.310Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 23, 13, 'Koa niainga avy hatrany i Davida sy ny olony eninjato lahy teo ho eo, ka nivoaka avy tao Keila, ary nirenireny tany amin’izay azony naleha. Ary nisy nilaza tamin’i Saoly fa efa nandositra avy tao Keila i Davida. Dia tsy nankany indray i Saoly.', 'koa niainga avy hatrany i davida sy ny olony eninjato lahy teo ho eo, ka nivoaka avy tao keila, ary nirenireny tany amin’izay azony naleha. ary nisy nilaza tamin’i saoly fa efa nandositra avy tao keila i davida. dia tsy nankany indray i saoly.'),
  ('6ab25a233973f61970c15404', '2026-09-22T10:36:19.310Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:19.310Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 23, 14, 'Ary nitoetra tany an-tany efitra, teny amin’ny toerana sarotra aleha i Davida, ka nipetraka teny amin’ny faritra be tendrombohitra, tany an-tany efitr’i Zifa. Ary nitady azy foana i Saoly, nefa tsy natolotr’Andriamanitra teo an-tanany izy.', 'ary nitoetra tany an-tany efitra, teny amin’ny toerana sarotra aleha i davida, ka nipetraka teny amin’ny faritra be tendrombohitra, tany an-tany efitr’i zifa. ary nitady azy foana i saoly, nefa tsy natolotr’andriamanitra teo an-tanany izy.'),
  ('6ab25a233973f61970c15405', '2026-09-22T10:36:19.310Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:19.310Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 23, 15, 'Ary natahotra i Davida, tao Horesa tany an-tany efitr’i Zifa, satria nivoaka hifofo ny ainy i Saoly.', 'ary natahotra i davida, tao horesa tany an-tany efitr’i zifa, satria nivoaka hifofo ny ainy i saoly.'),
  ('6ab25a233973f61970c15406', '2026-09-22T10:36:19.310Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:19.310Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 23, 16, 'Ary nankany amin’i Davida tao Horesa i Jonatana zanak’i Saoly, mba hanamafy ny fatokisan’i Davida an’Andriamanitra.', 'ary nankany amin’i davida tao horesa i jonatana zanak’i saoly, mba hanamafy ny fatokisan’i davida an’andriamanitra.'),
  ('6ab25a233973f61970c15407', '2026-09-22T10:36:19.310Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:19.310Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 23, 17, 'Hoy koa izy taminy: “Aza matahotra fa tsy hahatratra anao ny tanan’i Saoly raiko. Ianao no ho mpanjakan’ny Israely, ary izaho no hanarakaraka anao. Ary mahafantatra izany koa i Saoly raiko.”', 'hoy koa izy taminy: “aza matahotra fa tsy hahatratra anao ny tanan’i saoly raiko. ianao no ho mpanjakan’ny israely, ary izaho no hanarakaraka anao. ary mahafantatra izany koa i saoly raiko.”'),
  ('6ab25a233973f61970c15408', '2026-09-22T10:36:19.310Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:19.310Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 23, 18, 'Dia nanao fifanekena teo anatrehan’i Jehovah izy roa lahy. Ary mbola nitoetra tao Horesa i Davida, fa i Jonatana kosa lasa nody.', 'dia nanao fifanekena teo anatrehan’i jehovah izy roa lahy. ary mbola nitoetra tao horesa i davida, fa i jonatana kosa lasa nody.'),
  ('6ab25a233973f61970c15409', '2026-09-22T10:36:19.310Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:19.310Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 23, 19, 'Tatỳ aoriana, dia niakatra nankany amin’i Saoly tao Gibea ny lehilahy tao Zifa, ka nanao hoe: “Tsy fantatrao angaha fa miafina any akaikinay i Davida, eny amin’ny toerana sarotra aleha ao Horesa, eny amin’ny havoanan’i Hakila, izay eo ankavanan’i Jesimona?', 'tatỳ aoriana, dia niakatra nankany amin’i saoly tao gibea ny lehilahy tao zifa, ka nanao hoe: “tsy fantatrao angaha fa miafina any akaikinay i davida, eny amin’ny toerana sarotra aleha ao horesa, eny amin’ny havoanan’i hakila, izay eo ankavanan’i jesimona?'),
  ('6ab25a233973f61970c1540a', '2026-09-22T10:36:19.310Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:19.310Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 23, 20, 'Ianao rahateo efa te hidina mafy, ry mpanjaka, koa midìna fa anjaranay ny manolotra azy eo an-tanan’ny mpanjaka.”', 'ianao rahateo efa te hidina mafy, ry mpanjaka, koa midìna fa anjaranay ny manolotra azy eo an-tanan’ny mpanjaka.”'),
  ('6ab25a233973f61970c1540b', '2026-09-22T10:36:19.310Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:19.310Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 23, 21, 'Dia hoy i Saoly: “Tena tahin’i Jehovah mihitsy ianareo, satria mangoraka ahy.', 'dia hoy i saoly: “tena tahin’i jehovah mihitsy ianareo, satria mangoraka ahy.'),
  ('6ab25a233973f61970c1540c', '2026-09-22T10:36:19.310Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:19.310Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 23, 22, 'Koa mandehana, azafady, ary tohizo ihany izay efa ataonareo. Fantaro ka zahao izay toerana alehany sy izay olona efa nahita azy tany, fa tena fetsy tokoa, hono, ilehiny.', 'koa mandehana, azafady, ary tohizo ihany izay efa ataonareo. fantaro ka zahao izay toerana alehany sy izay olona efa nahita azy tany, fa tena fetsy tokoa, hono, ilehiny.'),
  ('6ab25a233973f61970c1540d', '2026-09-22T10:36:19.310Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:19.310Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 23, 23, 'Zahao ka fantaro daholo izay toeram-piafenany, ary mitondrà porofo miverina atỳ amiko, dia hiaraka aminareo aho. Fa raha eto amin’ity tany ity izy, dia hataoko sava hao ny arivon’i Joda rehetra mba hahitako azy.”', 'zahao ka fantaro daholo izay toeram-piafenany, ary mitondrà porofo miverina atỳ amiko, dia hiaraka aminareo aho. fa raha eto amin’ity tany ity izy, dia hataoko sava hao ny arivon’i joda rehetra mba hahitako azy.”'),
  ('6ab25a233973f61970c1540e', '2026-09-22T10:36:19.310Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:19.310Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 23, 24, 'Koa lasa nankany Zifa hialoha an’i Saoly izy ireo. I Davida sy ny olony kosa tany an-tany efitr’i Maona any Araba, eo atsimon’i Jesimona.', 'koa lasa nankany zifa hialoha an’i saoly izy ireo. i davida sy ny olony kosa tany an-tany efitr’i maona any araba, eo atsimon’i jesimona.'),
  ('6ab25a233973f61970c1540f', '2026-09-22T10:36:19.310Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:19.310Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 23, 25, 'Ary tonga mba hitady azy i Saoly sy ny olony. Rehefa nisy nilaza izany tamin’i Davida, dia nidina avy hatrany nankeny amin’ny harambato izy ka nijanona tany an-tany efitr’i Maona. Nony ren’i Saoly izany, dia nanenjika azy tany an-tany efitr’i Maona izy.', 'ary tonga mba hitady azy i saoly sy ny olony. rehefa nisy nilaza izany tamin’i davida, dia nidina avy hatrany nankeny amin’ny harambato izy ka nijanona tany an-tany efitr’i maona. nony ren’i saoly izany, dia nanenjika azy tany an-tany efitr’i maona izy.'),
  ('6ab25a233973f61970c15410', '2026-09-22T10:36:19.310Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:19.310Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 23, 26, 'Farany, dia tonga teo amin’ny andaniny iray tamin’ny tendrombohitra i Saoly, fa i Davida sy ny olony kosa teo amin’ny ankilany. Koa niala teo haingana i Davida, noho ny amin’i Saoly. Ary nihananatona an’i Davida sy ny olony i Saoly sy ny olony, mba hisambotra azy.', 'farany, dia tonga teo amin’ny andaniny iray tamin’ny tendrombohitra i saoly, fa i davida sy ny olony kosa teo amin’ny ankilany. koa niala teo haingana i davida, noho ny amin’i saoly. ary nihananatona an’i davida sy ny olony i saoly sy ny olony, mba hisambotra azy.'),
  ('6ab25a233973f61970c15411', '2026-09-22T10:36:19.310Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:19.310Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 23, 27, 'Nisy iraka anefa tonga nilaza tamin’i Saoly hoe: “Andao haingana fa manafika ny tanintsika ny Filistinina!”', 'nisy iraka anefa tonga nilaza tamin’i saoly hoe: “andao haingana fa manafika ny tanintsika ny filistinina!”'),
  ('6ab25a233973f61970c15412', '2026-09-22T10:36:19.310Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:19.310Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 23, 28, 'Dia niverina i Saoly fa tsy nanenjika an’i Davida indray, ka lasa nifanandrina tamin’ny Filistinina. Izany no antony niantsoana an’ilay toerana hoe Harambaton’ny Fisarahana.', 'dia niverina i saoly fa tsy nanenjika an’i davida indray, ka lasa nifanandrina tamin’ny filistinina. izany no antony niantsoana an’ilay toerana hoe harambaton’ny fisarahana.'),
  ('6ab25a233973f61970c15413', '2026-09-22T10:36:19.310Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:19.310Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 23, 29, 'Ary niala teo i Davida ka niakatra teny amin’ny toerana sarotra aleha tany En-jedy, ary nitoetra tany.', 'ary niala teo i davida ka niakatra teny amin’ny toerana sarotra aleha tany en-jedy, ary nitoetra tany.'),
  ('6ab25a24a96fb4b4ecb025e5', '2026-09-22T10:36:20.367Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:20.367Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 24, 10, 'Hitan’ny masonao androany ny nanoloran’i Jehovah anao teo an-tanako tao an-dava-bato. Ary nisy nanome hevitra ahy hamono anao, nefa niantra anao aho ka niteny hoe: ‘Tsy haninjitra ny tanako hamely ny tompoko aho, fa voahosotr’i Jehovah izy.’', 'hitan’ny masonao androany ny nanoloran’i jehovah anao teo an-tanako tao an-dava-bato. ary nisy nanome hevitra ahy hamono anao, nefa niantra anao aho ka niteny hoe: ‘tsy haninjitra ny tanako hamely ny tompoko aho, fa voahosotr’i jehovah izy.’'),
  ('6ab25a24a96fb4b4ecb025e2', '2026-09-22T10:36:20.367Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:20.367Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 24, 7, 'Koa naparitak’i Davida ny olony rehefa avy nilaza izany teny izany izy, ary tsy navelany hamely an’i Saoly izy ireo. Fa i Saoly kosa nitsangana ka niala tao amin’ilay lava-bato, ary nanohy ny diany.', 'koa naparitak’i davida ny olony rehefa avy nilaza izany teny izany izy, ary tsy navelany hamely an’i saoly izy ireo. fa i saoly kosa nitsangana ka niala tao amin’ilay lava-bato, ary nanohy ny diany.'),
  ('6ab25a24a96fb4b4ecb025ec', '2026-09-22T10:36:20.367Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:20.367Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 24, 17, 'Hoy koa izy tamin’i Davida: “Marina kokoa noho izaho ianao, satria soa no navalinao ahy, fa ratsy kosa no navaliko anao.', 'hoy koa izy tamin’i davida: “marina kokoa noho izaho ianao, satria soa no navalinao ahy, fa ratsy kosa no navaliko anao.'),
  ('6ab25a24a96fb4b4ecb025e0', '2026-09-22T10:36:20.367Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:20.367Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 24, 5, 'Taorian’izay anefa, dia nanameloka an’i Davida foana ny fony, noho ny nanapahany ny morontongotr’akanjon’i Saoly.', 'taorian’izay anefa, dia nanameloka an’i davida foana ny fony, noho ny nanapahany ny morontongotr’akanjon’i saoly.'),
  ('6ab25a24a96fb4b4ecb025e4', '2026-09-22T10:36:20.367Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:20.367Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 24, 9, 'Hoy koa i Davida tamin’i Saoly: “Nahoana ianao no mihaino ny tenin’ny olona hoe: ‘Mitady hanisy ratsy anao i Davida’?', 'hoy koa i davida tamin’i saoly: “nahoana ianao no mihaino ny tenin’ny olona hoe: ‘mitady hanisy ratsy anao i davida’?'),
  ('6ab25a24a96fb4b4ecb025e1', '2026-09-22T10:36:20.367Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:20.367Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 24, 6, 'Koa hoy izy tamin’ny olony: “Sanatria ahy ny haninjitra ny tanako hamely ny tompoko izay voahosotr’i Jehovah, satria tsy mifanaraka amin’ny fihevitr’i Jehovah izany. Tsy hanao izany aho, fa voahosotr’i Jehovah izy.”', 'koa hoy izy tamin’ny olony: “sanatria ahy ny haninjitra ny tanako hamely ny tompoko izay voahosotr’i jehovah, satria tsy mifanaraka amin’ny fihevitr’i jehovah izany. tsy hanao izany aho, fa voahosotr’i jehovah izy.”'),
  ('6ab25a24a96fb4b4ecb025dd', '2026-09-22T10:36:20.367Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:20.367Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 24, 2, 'Dia naka telo arivo lahy voafantina teo amin’ny Israely rehetra i Saoly, ka nandeha nitady an’i Davida sy ny olony teny amin’ireo harambato mangadihady nisy osidia.', 'dia naka telo arivo lahy voafantina teo amin’ny israely rehetra i saoly, ka nandeha nitady an’i davida sy ny olony teny amin’ireo harambato mangadihady nisy osidia.'),
  ('6ab25a24a96fb4b4ecb025e3', '2026-09-22T10:36:20.367Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:20.367Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 24, 8, 'Dia nitsangana i Davida ka nivoaka avy tao amin’ilay lava-bato, ary niantso mafy avy taorian’i Saoly hoe: “Ry mpanjaka tompoko ô!” Dia nitodika i Saoly. Ary niondrika i Davida ka niankohoka tamin’ny tany.', 'dia nitsangana i davida ka nivoaka avy tao amin’ilay lava-bato, ary niantso mafy avy taorian’i saoly hoe: “ry mpanjaka tompoko ô!” dia nitodika i saoly. ary niondrika i davida ka niankohoka tamin’ny tany.'),
  ('6ab25a24a96fb4b4ecb025eb', '2026-09-22T10:36:20.367Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:20.367Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 24, 16, 'Raha vao tapitra izany tenin’i Davida izany, dia hoy i Saoly: “Feonao ve izany, ry Davida zanako?” Ary nidradradradra nitomany i Saoly.', 'raha vao tapitra izany tenin’i davida izany, dia hoy i saoly: “feonao ve izany, ry davida zanako?” ary nidradradradra nitomany i saoly.'),
  ('6ab25a24a96fb4b4ecb025e9', '2026-09-22T10:36:20.367Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:20.367Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 24, 14, 'Nivoaka hitady an’iza ny mpanjakan’ny Israely? Iza no enjehinao? Amboa maty ve? Sa parasy iray?', 'nivoaka hitady an’iza ny mpanjakan’ny israely? iza no enjehinao? amboa maty ve? sa parasy iray?'),
  ('6ab25a24a96fb4b4ecb025de', '2026-09-22T10:36:20.367Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:20.367Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 24, 3, 'Farany dia tonga teny amin’ny valan’ondry * teny an-dalana i Saoly, ary nisy lava-bato teo. Dia nankao izy fa te hivoaka. * Efa nipetrapetraka tany anatiny indrindra tao amin’ilay lava-bato anefa i Davida sy ny olony tamin’izay.', 'farany dia tonga teny amin’ny valan’ondry * teny an-dalana i saoly, ary nisy lava-bato teo. dia nankao izy fa te hivoaka. * efa nipetrapetraka tany anatiny indrindra tao amin’ilay lava-bato anefa i davida sy ny olony tamin’izay.'),
  ('6ab25a24a96fb4b4ecb025dc', '2026-09-22T10:36:20.367Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:20.367Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 24, 1, 'Raha vao tafaverina avy nanenjika ny Filistinina i Saoly, dia nisy nilaza taminy hoe: “Any an-tany efitr’i En-jedy i Davida.”', 'raha vao tafaverina avy nanenjika ny filistinina i saoly, dia nisy nilaza taminy hoe: “any an-tany efitr’i en-jedy i davida.”'),
  ('6ab25a24a96fb4b4ecb025ea', '2026-09-22T10:36:20.367Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:20.367Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 24, 15, 'Aoka i Jehovah no ho mpitsara ka hitsara ahy sy ianao. Dia hijery izy ary hiady ho ahy eo amin’ny fitsarana ka hitsara ahy mba hanafaka ahy eo an-tananao.”', 'aoka i jehovah no ho mpitsara ka hitsara ahy sy ianao. dia hijery izy ary hiady ho ahy eo amin’ny fitsarana ka hitsara ahy mba hanafaka ahy eo an-tananao.”'),
  ('6ab25a24a96fb4b4ecb025e8', '2026-09-22T10:36:20.367Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:20.367Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 24, 13, 'Araka ny fitenenan’ny ntaolo, dia ‘avy amin’ny ratsy fanahy no ivoahan’ny faharatsiana’, fa ny tanako kosa tsy mba hikasika anao.', 'araka ny fitenenan’ny ntaolo, dia ‘avy amin’ny ratsy fanahy no ivoahan’ny faharatsiana’, fa ny tanako kosa tsy mba hikasika anao.'),
  ('6ab25a24a96fb4b4ecb025df', '2026-09-22T10:36:20.367Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:20.367Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 24, 4, 'Dia hoy ny olon’i Davida taminy: “Izao no andro ilazan’i Jehovah aminao hoe: ‘Atolotro eo an-tananao ny fahavalonao, ka ataovy aminy izay hitanao fa mety.’” Koa nitsangana i Davida, ka notapahiny mangingina ny morontongotr’akanjon’i Saoly, dia ilay akanjo ivelany tsy misy tanany.', 'dia hoy ny olon’i davida taminy: “izao no andro ilazan’i jehovah aminao hoe: ‘atolotro eo an-tananao ny fahavalonao, ka ataovy aminy izay hitanao fa mety.’” koa nitsangana i davida, ka notapahiny mangingina ny morontongotr’akanjon’i saoly, dia ilay akanjo ivelany tsy misy tanany.'),
  ('6ab25a24a96fb4b4ecb025e7', '2026-09-22T10:36:20.367Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:20.367Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 24, 12, 'I Jehovah anie hitsara ahy sy ianao! Ary aoka i Jehovah no hamaly anao noho ny amiko, fa ny tanako kosa tsy hikasika anao.', 'i jehovah anie hitsara ahy sy ianao! ary aoka i jehovah no hamaly anao noho ny amiko, fa ny tanako kosa tsy hikasika anao.'),
  ('6ab25a24a96fb4b4ecb025e6', '2026-09-22T10:36:20.367Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:20.367Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 24, 11, 'Ry raiko ô, jereo ange e! Jereo fa ity an-tanako ity ny morontongotr’iny akanjonao iny! Fa tsy namono anao aho rehefa nanapaka ny morontongotr’akanjonao. Koa aoka ho fantatrao sy ho hitanao fa tsy misy faharatsiana na fikomiana eto an-tanako, ary tsy nanota taminao aho na dia mikendry ny hanala ny aiko aza ianao.', 'ry raiko ô, jereo ange e! jereo fa ity an-tanako ity ny morontongotr’iny akanjonao iny! fa tsy namono anao aho rehefa nanapaka ny morontongotr’akanjonao. koa aoka ho fantatrao sy ho hitanao fa tsy misy faharatsiana na fikomiana eto an-tanako, ary tsy nanota taminao aho na dia mikendry ny hanala ny aiko aza ianao.'),
  ('6ab25a24a96fb4b4ecb025ee', '2026-09-22T10:36:20.368Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:20.368Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 24, 19, 'Havelan’ny olona handeha soa aman-tsara ve ny fahavalony raha sendra azy? Koa hamaly soa anao anie i Jehovah, noho ny nanaovanao izany tamiko androany!', 'havelan’ny olona handeha soa aman-tsara ve ny fahavalony raha sendra azy? koa hamaly soa anao anie i jehovah, noho ny nanaovanao izany tamiko androany!'),
  ('6ab25a24a96fb4b4ecb025ed', '2026-09-22T10:36:20.368Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:20.368Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 24, 18, 'Nasehonao tamin’izany androany fa nanao soa tamiko ianao. Natolotr’i Jehovah teo an-tananao aho, nefa tsy novonoinao.', 'nasehonao tamin’izany androany fa nanao soa tamiko ianao. natolotr’i jehovah teo an-tananao aho, nefa tsy novonoinao.'),
  ('6ab25a24a96fb4b4ecb025ef', '2026-09-22T10:36:20.368Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:20.368Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 24, 20, 'Fantatro tsara izao fa tsy maintsy hanjaka ianao, ary azo antoka fa haharitra eo an-tananao ny fanjakan’ny Israely.', 'fantatro tsara izao fa tsy maintsy hanjaka ianao, ary azo antoka fa haharitra eo an-tananao ny fanjakan’ny israely.'),
  ('6ab25a24a96fb4b4ecb025f1', '2026-09-22T10:36:20.368Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:20.368Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 24, 22, 'Dia nianiana tamin’i Saoly i Davida. Ary lasa nody i Saoly, fa i Davida sy ny olony kosa niakatra teny amin’ny toerana sarotra aleha.', 'dia nianiana tamin’i saoly i davida. ary lasa nody i saoly, fa i davida sy ny olony kosa niakatra teny amin’ny toerana sarotra aleha.'),
  ('6ab25a24a96fb4b4ecb025f0', '2026-09-22T10:36:20.368Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:20.368Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 24, 21, 'Koa mianiàna amiko amin’ny anaran’i Jehovah fa tsy handringana ny taranako any aoriana ianao, ary tsy hanafoana ny anarako eo amin’ny ankohonan-draiko.”', 'koa mianiàna amiko amin’ny anaran’i jehovah fa tsy handringana ny taranako any aoriana ianao, ary tsy hanafoana ny anarako eo amin’ny ankohonan-draiko.”'),
  ('6ab25a24b9435b67b7bfe1e7', '2026-09-22T10:36:20.887Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:20.887Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 25, 4, 'Ary ren’i Davida tany an-tany efitra fa nanety ny ondriny i Nabala.', 'ary ren’i davida tany an-tany efitra fa nanety ny ondriny i nabala.'),
  ('6ab25a24b9435b67b7bfe1ec', '2026-09-22T10:36:20.887Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:20.887Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 25, 9, 'Koa tonga tany amin’i Nabala ny zatovon’i Davida ka nilaza ny tenin’i Davida rehetra, ary niandry avy eo.', 'koa tonga tany amin’i nabala ny zatovon’i davida ka nilaza ny tenin’i davida rehetra, ary niandry avy eo.'),
  ('6ab25a24b9435b67b7bfe1ea', '2026-09-22T10:36:20.887Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:20.887Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 25, 7, 'Reko fa manety ondry ianao. Efa nisy fotoana niarahanay tamin’ireo mpiandry ondrinao. Ary tsy nihetraketraka taminy izahay, sady tsy nisy very mihitsy izay azy tamin’ny andro rehetra nitoerany teto Karmela.', 'reko fa manety ondry ianao. efa nisy fotoana niarahanay tamin’ireo mpiandry ondrinao. ary tsy nihetraketraka taminy izahay, sady tsy nisy very mihitsy izay azy tamin’ny andro rehetra nitoerany teto karmela.'),
  ('6ab25a24b9435b67b7bfe1e5', '2026-09-22T10:36:20.887Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:20.887Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 25, 2, 'Nisy lehilahy iray tao Maona, ary niasa tany Karmela izy. Mpanankarem-be ralehilahy, sady nanana ondry telo arivo sy osy arivo. Dia nanety ny ondriny tao Karmela izy.', 'nisy lehilahy iray tao maona, ary niasa tany karmela izy. mpanankarem-be ralehilahy, sady nanana ondry telo arivo sy osy arivo. dia nanety ny ondriny tao karmela izy.'),
  ('6ab25a24b9435b67b7bfe1e6', '2026-09-22T10:36:20.887Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:20.887Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 25, 3, 'Kalebita ralehilahy, Nabala no anarany, ary Abigaila no anaran’ny vadiny. Tena malina sady tsara bika ravehivavy, fa ralehilahy kosa masiaka sady ratsy toetra.', 'kalebita ralehilahy, nabala no anarany, ary abigaila no anaran’ny vadiny. tena malina sady tsara bika ravehivavy, fa ralehilahy kosa masiaka sady ratsy toetra.'),
  ('6ab25a24b9435b67b7bfe1e4', '2026-09-22T10:36:20.887Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:20.887Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 25, 1, 'Ary maty i Samoela tatỳ aoriana. Dia nivory ny Israely rehetra ka nitomany azy sy nandevina azy tany amin’izay nisy ny tranony, tao Rama. Ary nidina nankany an-tany efitr’i Parana i Davida.', 'ary maty i samoela tatỳ aoriana. dia nivory ny israely rehetra ka nitomany azy sy nandevina azy tany amin’izay nisy ny tranony, tao rama. ary nidina nankany an-tany efitr’i parana i davida.'),
  ('6ab25a24b9435b67b7bfe1e8', '2026-09-22T10:36:20.887Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:20.887Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 25, 5, 'Koa naniraka zatovolahy folo i Davida ka niteny hoe: “Miakara any Karmela ka mankanesa any amin’i Nabala, ary miresaha aminy amin’ny anarako ka anontanio hoe manahoana izy.', 'koa naniraka zatovolahy folo i davida ka niteny hoe: “miakara any karmela ka mankanesa any amin’i nabala, ary miresaha aminy amin’ny anarako ka anontanio hoe manahoana izy.'),
  ('6ab25a24b9435b67b7bfe1ed', '2026-09-22T10:36:20.887Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:20.887Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 25, 10, 'Hoy anefa i Nabala tamin’izy ireo: “Fa iza moa i Davida, ary iza moa ny zanak’i Jese? Efa maro izao ny mpanompo mitsoaka mandositra ny tompony.', 'hoy anefa i nabala tamin’izy ireo: “fa iza moa i davida, ary iza moa ny zanak’i jese? efa maro izao ny mpanompo mitsoaka mandositra ny tompony.'),
  ('6ab25a24b9435b67b7bfe1e9', '2026-09-22T10:36:20.887Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:20.887Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 25, 6, 'Ary lazao amin’ny rahalahiko hoe: ‘Fiadanana anie ho anao sy ny ankohonanao ary izay rehetra anao!', 'ary lazao amin’ny rahalahiko hoe: ‘fiadanana anie ho anao sy ny ankohonanao ary izay rehetra anao!'),
  ('6ab25a24b9435b67b7bfe1eb', '2026-09-22T10:36:20.887Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:20.887Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 25, 8, 'Anontanio ny zatovonao fa hilaza izany aminao izy. Dia hahazo sitraka aminao ny zatovoko, fa andro fifaliana izao ahatongavanay izao. Koa raha sitrakao, dia mba omeo izay azon’ny tananao ny mpanomponao sy Davida zanakao.’”', 'anontanio ny zatovonao fa hilaza izany aminao izy. dia hahazo sitraka aminao ny zatovoko, fa andro fifaliana izao ahatongavanay izao. koa raha sitrakao, dia mba omeo izay azon’ny tananao ny mpanomponao sy davida zanakao.’”'),
  ('6ab25a24b9435b67b7bfe20c', '2026-09-22T10:36:20.888Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:20.888Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 25, 41, 'Dia niankohoka tamin’ny tany avy hatrany i Abigaila, sady niteny hoe: “Intỳ aho mpanompovavinao, ho mpanompovavy hanasa ny tongotry ny mpanompon’ny tompoko.”', 'dia niankohoka tamin’ny tany avy hatrany i abigaila, sady niteny hoe: “intỳ aho mpanompovavinao, ho mpanompovavy hanasa ny tongotry ny mpanompon’ny tompoko.”'),
  ('6ab25a24b9435b67b7bfe202', '2026-09-22T10:36:20.888Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:20.888Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 25, 31, 'Nahoana moa ny tompoko no hanao zavatra hahatonga azy henjehin’ny eritreriny, ka handatsa-dra tsy amin’antony sy hamaly faty? Hanao soa amin’ny tompoko tokoa i Jehovah, ka mba tsarovy ny mpanompovavinao.”', 'nahoana moa ny tompoko no hanao zavatra hahatonga azy henjehin’ny eritreriny, ka handatsa-dra tsy amin’antony sy hamaly faty? hanao soa amin’ny tompoko tokoa i jehovah, ka mba tsarovy ny mpanompovavinao.”'),
  ('6ab25a24b9435b67b7bfe1f9', '2026-09-22T10:36:20.888Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:20.888Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 25, 22, 'Hofaizin’Andriamanitra anie ny fahavalon’i Davida, * ary mihoatra noho izany aza, raha avelako hisy hiangana na iray aza ny lahy rehetra izay azy, mandra-paharainan’ny andro!”', 'hofaizin’andriamanitra anie ny fahavalon’i davida, * ary mihoatra noho izany aza, raha avelako hisy hiangana na iray aza ny lahy rehetra izay azy, mandra-paharainan’ny andro!”'),
  ('6ab25a24b9435b67b7bfe209', '2026-09-22T10:36:20.888Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:20.888Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 25, 38, 'Rehefa afaka folo andro teo ho eo, dia nasian’i Jehovah izy ka maty.', 'rehefa afaka folo andro teo ho eo, dia nasian’i jehovah izy ka maty.'),
  ('6ab25a24b9435b67b7bfe206', '2026-09-22T10:36:20.888Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:20.888Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 25, 35, 'Koa noraisin’i Davida avy tamin’ny tanan-dravehivavy izay nentiny ho azy, ka hoy izy taminy: “Miakara soa aman-tsara ho any an-tranonao, fa efa nihaino ny teninao aho ka ekeko ny fangatahanao.”', 'koa noraisin’i davida avy tamin’ny tanan-dravehivavy izay nentiny ho azy, ka hoy izy taminy: “miakara soa aman-tsara ho any an-tranonao, fa efa nihaino ny teninao aho ka ekeko ny fangatahanao.”'),
  ('6ab25a24b9435b67b7bfe204', '2026-09-22T10:36:20.888Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:20.888Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 25, 33, 'Hotahina anie ny fahendrenao, ary hotahina anie ianao, izay nisakana ahy androany tsy ho meloka ho nandatsa-dra sy tsy hamaly faty!', 'hotahina anie ny fahendrenao, ary hotahina anie ianao, izay nisakana ahy androany tsy ho meloka ho nandatsa-dra sy tsy hamaly faty!'),
  ('6ab25a24b9435b67b7bfe203', '2026-09-22T10:36:20.888Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:20.888Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 25, 32, 'Dia hoy i Davida tamin’i Abigaila: “Hisaorana anie i Jehovah Andriamanitry ny Israely, izay naniraka anao androany mba hihaona amiko!', 'dia hoy i davida tamin’i abigaila: “hisaorana anie i jehovah andriamanitry ny israely, izay naniraka anao androany mba hihaona amiko!'),
  ('6ab25a24b9435b67b7bfe1f3', '2026-09-22T10:36:20.888Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:20.888Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 25, 16, 'Toy ny manda nanodidina anay izy ireo, na andro na alina, tamin’ny andro rehetra niarahanay taminy niandry ny andian’ondry.', 'toy ny manda nanodidina anay izy ireo, na andro na alina, tamin’ny andro rehetra niarahanay taminy niandry ny andian’ondry.'),
  ('6ab25a24b9435b67b7bfe1f1', '2026-09-22T10:36:20.888Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:20.888Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 25, 14, 'Ary nilaza tamin’i Abigaila vadin’i Nabala ny iray tamin’ny mpanompony hoe: “Nandefa iraka avy tany an-tany efitra i Davida mba hirary soa ho an’ny tompontsika, kanjo vazavaza sy teny henjana no nataony tamin’izy ireo.', 'ary nilaza tamin’i abigaila vadin’i nabala ny iray tamin’ny mpanompony hoe: “nandefa iraka avy tany an-tany efitra i davida mba hirary soa ho an’ny tompontsika, kanjo vazavaza sy teny henjana no nataony tamin’izy ireo.'),
  ('6ab25a24b9435b67b7bfe1f0', '2026-09-22T10:36:20.888Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:20.888Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 25, 13, 'Avy hatrany dia hoy i Davida tamin’ny olony: “Samia manao ny sabany eo amin’ny fehikibony!” Koa samy nanao ny sabany teo amin’ny fehikibony izy ireo, ary nanao toy izany koa i Davida. Ary niakatra nanaraka an’i Davida ny efajato lahy teo ho eo, fa ny roanjato kosa nipetraka teo anilan’ny entana.', 'avy hatrany dia hoy i davida tamin’ny olony: “samia manao ny sabany eo amin’ny fehikibony!” koa samy nanao ny sabany teo amin’ny fehikibony izy ireo, ary nanao toy izany koa i davida. ary niakatra nanaraka an’i davida ny efajato lahy teo ho eo, fa ny roanjato kosa nipetraka teo anilan’ny entana.'),
  ('6ab25a24b9435b67b7bfe20e', '2026-09-22T10:36:20.888Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:20.888Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 25, 43, 'Ary efa nalain’i Davida ho vadiny koa i Ahinoama avy any Jezirela. Koa izy roa vavy no lasa vadiny.', 'ary efa nalain’i davida ho vadiny koa i ahinoama avy any jezirela. koa izy roa vavy no lasa vadiny.'),
  ('6ab25a24b9435b67b7bfe1f7', '2026-09-22T10:36:20.888Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:20.888Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 25, 20, 'Rehefa nidina mangingina ny tendrombohitra izy nitaingina ampondra, dia indreny koa i Davida sy ny olony fa nidina ka tojo azy. Koa nifanena tamin’izy ireo ravehivavy.', 'rehefa nidina mangingina ny tendrombohitra izy nitaingina ampondra, dia indreny koa i davida sy ny olony fa nidina ka tojo azy. koa nifanena tamin’izy ireo ravehivavy.'),
  ('6ab25a24b9435b67b7bfe1fa', '2026-09-22T10:36:20.888Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:20.888Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 25, 23, 'Raha vao nahita an’i Davida i Abigaila, dia nidina haingana avy teo amin’ny ampondra ka niondrika teo anatrehan’i Davida sady niankohoka tamin’ny tany.', 'raha vao nahita an’i davida i abigaila, dia nidina haingana avy teo amin’ny ampondra ka niondrika teo anatrehan’i davida sady niankohoka tamin’ny tany.'),
  ('6ab25a24b9435b67b7bfe1f4', '2026-09-22T10:36:20.888Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:20.888Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 25, 17, 'Koa fantaro sy eritrereto izay hataonao, fa misy loza miandry ny tompontsika sy ny ankohonany manontolo. Olona tena tsy manjary mantsy izy ka tsy azo ifampiresahana mihitsy.”', 'koa fantaro sy eritrereto izay hataonao, fa misy loza miandry ny tompontsika sy ny ankohonany manontolo. olona tena tsy manjary mantsy izy ka tsy azo ifampiresahana mihitsy.”'),
  ('6ab25a24b9435b67b7bfe1ef', '2026-09-22T10:36:20.888Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:20.888Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 25, 12, 'Dia niverin-dalana ny zatovon’i Davida. Ary nony tonga izy ireo dia nolazainy tamin’i Davida izany teny rehetra izany.', 'dia niverin-dalana ny zatovon’i davida. ary nony tonga izy ireo dia nolazainy tamin’i davida izany teny rehetra izany.'),
  ('6ab25a24b9435b67b7bfe1fb', '2026-09-22T10:36:20.888Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:20.888Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 25, 24, 'Ary niankohoka teo an-tongony ravehivavy ka niteny hoe: “Aoka ho ahy ny fahadisoana, tompoko. Ary mba avelao ny mpanompovavinao hiteny kely aminao, ka henoy ny tenin’ny mpanompovavinao.', 'ary niankohoka teo an-tongony ravehivavy ka niteny hoe: “aoka ho ahy ny fahadisoana, tompoko. ary mba avelao ny mpanompovavinao hiteny kely aminao, ka henoy ny tenin’ny mpanompovavinao.'),
  ('6ab25a24b9435b67b7bfe20b', '2026-09-22T10:36:20.888Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:20.888Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 25, 40, 'Koa tonga tany amin’i Abigaila tao Karmela ny mpanompon’i Davida ka niteny hoe: “Nirahin’i Davida atỳ aminao izahay mba haka anao ho vadiny.”', 'koa tonga tany amin’i abigaila tao karmela ny mpanompon’i davida ka niteny hoe: “nirahin’i davida atỳ aminao izahay mba haka anao ho vadiny.”'),
  ('6ab25a24b9435b67b7bfe1fd', '2026-09-22T10:36:20.888Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:20.888Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 25, 26, 'Koa ankehitriny, tompoko, raha mbola velona koa i Jehovah ary raha mbola velon’aina koa ianao, dia i Jehovah no nisakana anao tsy ho meloka ho nandatsa-dra sy tsy hamaly faty. Aoka ho sahala amin’i Nabala ny fahavalonao sy izay mitady hanisy ratsy ny tompoko.', 'koa ankehitriny, tompoko, raha mbola velona koa i jehovah ary raha mbola velon’aina koa ianao, dia i jehovah no nisakana anao tsy ho meloka ho nandatsa-dra sy tsy hamaly faty. aoka ho sahala amin’i nabala ny fahavalonao sy izay mitady hanisy ratsy ny tompoko.'),
  ('6ab25a24b9435b67b7bfe1fe', '2026-09-22T10:36:20.888Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:20.888Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 25, 27, 'Ary ity fanomezana ho fisaorana ity, dia nentin’ny mpanompovavinao ho an’ny tompoko mba homena an’ireo zatovolahy manaraka ny tompoko.', 'ary ity fanomezana ho fisaorana ity, dia nentin’ny mpanompovavinao ho an’ny tompoko mba homena an’ireo zatovolahy manaraka ny tompoko.'),
  ('6ab25a24b9435b67b7bfe208', '2026-09-22T10:36:20.888Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:20.888Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 25, 37, 'Nony maraina, rehefa nisava ny divay nosotroin’i Nabala, dia notantarain’ny vadiny taminy daholo izany zavatra izany. Koa maty tao anatin’i Nabala ny fony, ary nanjary toy ny vato izy.', 'nony maraina, rehefa nisava ny divay nosotroin’i nabala, dia notantarain’ny vadiny taminy daholo izany zavatra izany. koa maty tao anatin’i nabala ny fony, ary nanjary toy ny vato izy.'),
  ('6ab25a24b9435b67b7bfe1fc', '2026-09-22T10:36:20.888Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:20.888Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 25, 25, 'Aoka ny tompoko tsy hiraharaha an’iny Nabala tsy manjary iny, fa araka ny anarany ihany ny toetrany. Nabala no anarany, ary hadalana no ao aminy. Izaho mpanompovavinao mantsy tsy nahita ny zatovon’ny tompoko nirahinao.', 'aoka ny tompoko tsy hiraharaha an’iny nabala tsy manjary iny, fa araka ny anarany ihany ny toetrany. nabala no anarany, ary hadalana no ao aminy. izaho mpanompovavinao mantsy tsy nahita ny zatovon’ny tompoko nirahinao.'),
  ('6ab25a24b9435b67b7bfe1f8', '2026-09-22T10:36:20.888Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:20.888Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 25, 21, 'Ary i Davida efa niteny hoe: “Fahadisoam-panantenana tanteraka no mba setrin’ny niambenako ny zava-drehetran’ilehiny tany an-tany efitra. Tsy nisy very na iray aza izay rehetra azy. Ratsy anefa no avaliny ny soa nataoko.', 'ary i davida efa niteny hoe: “fahadisoam-panantenana tanteraka no mba setrin’ny niambenako ny zava-drehetran’ilehiny tany an-tany efitra. tsy nisy very na iray aza izay rehetra azy. ratsy anefa no avaliny ny soa nataoko.'),
  ('6ab25a24b9435b67b7bfe1f5', '2026-09-22T10:36:20.888Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:20.888Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 25, 18, 'Avy hatrany i Abigaila dia lasa haingana naka mofo roanjato, sy siny lehibe roa feno divay, sy ondry dimy efa voakarakara, sy voam-bary natono indimin’ny seha, * sy mofo zato vita tamin’ny voaloboka maina, ary mofo roanjato vita tamin’ny aviavy noporetina. Ary napetrany teo ambonin’ny ampondra izany.', 'avy hatrany i abigaila dia lasa haingana naka mofo roanjato, sy siny lehibe roa feno divay, sy ondry dimy efa voakarakara, sy voam-bary natono indimin’ny seha, * sy mofo zato vita tamin’ny voaloboka maina, ary mofo roanjato vita tamin’ny aviavy noporetina. ary napetrany teo ambonin’ny ampondra izany.'),
  ('6ab25a24b9435b67b7bfe1f2', '2026-09-22T10:36:20.888Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:20.888Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 25, 15, 'Tsara fanahy be taminay anefa ireo lehilahy ireo sady tsy mba nihetraketraka taminay. Ary tsy nisy zavatray very na iray aza tamin’ny andro rehetra niarahanay tamin’izy ireo tany an-tsaha.', 'tsara fanahy be taminay anefa ireo lehilahy ireo sady tsy mba nihetraketraka taminay. ary tsy nisy zavatray very na iray aza tamin’ny andro rehetra niarahanay tamin’izy ireo tany an-tsaha.'),
  ('6ab25a24b9435b67b7bfe20f', '2026-09-22T10:36:20.888Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:20.888Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 25, 44, 'Ary i Saoly efa nanome an’i Mikala zanany vavy, izay vadin’i Davida, ho vadin’i Palty, zanak’i Laisy avy any Galima.', 'ary i saoly efa nanome an’i mikala zanany vavy, izay vadin’i davida, ho vadin’i palty, zanak’i laisy avy any galima.'),
  ('6ab25a24b9435b67b7bfe200', '2026-09-22T10:36:20.888Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:20.888Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 25, 29, 'Rehefa misy olona manenjika anao ka mifofo ny ainao, dia harovan’i Jehovah Andriamanitrao ianao, toy ny fiarovana zava-tsarobidy voafono ao anaty kitapo. Fa ny ain’ny fahavalonao kosa hatorany toy ny vato avy eo amin’ny foitran’ny pilotra.', 'rehefa misy olona manenjika anao ka mifofo ny ainao, dia harovan’i jehovah andriamanitrao ianao, toy ny fiarovana zava-tsarobidy voafono ao anaty kitapo. fa ny ain’ny fahavalonao kosa hatorany toy ny vato avy eo amin’ny foitran’ny pilotra.'),
  ('6ab25a24b9435b67b7bfe1ff', '2026-09-22T10:36:20.888Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:20.888Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 25, 28, 'Avelao re ny heloky ny mpanompovavinao e! Fa hataon’i Jehovah tokoa izay hampaharitra ny taranaky ny tompoko, satria miady ny adin’i Jehovah ny tompoko. Ary tsy ho hita ao aminao ny faharatsiana, amin’ny andronao rehetra.', 'avelao re ny heloky ny mpanompovavinao e! fa hataon’i jehovah tokoa izay hampaharitra ny taranaky ny tompoko, satria miady ny adin’i jehovah ny tompoko. ary tsy ho hita ao aminao ny faharatsiana, amin’ny andronao rehetra.'),
  ('6ab25a24b9435b67b7bfe1ee', '2026-09-22T10:36:20.888Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:20.888Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 25, 11, 'Koa izaho ve dia haka ny mofoko sy ny ranoko ary ny henan’ny biby izay novonoiko sy norasarasaiko ho an’ny mpanety ondriko, ka hanome izany ho an’ny olona tsy fanta-piaviana?”', 'koa izaho ve dia haka ny mofoko sy ny ranoko ary ny henan’ny biby izay novonoiko sy norasarasaiko ho an’ny mpanety ondriko, ka hanome izany ho an’ny olona tsy fanta-piaviana?”'),
  ('6ab25a24b9435b67b7bfe20d', '2026-09-22T10:36:20.888Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:20.888Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 25, 42, 'Dia nitsangana haingana izy ka nitaingina ampondra, ary nisy mpanompovavy dimy nanaraka azy. Ary niaraka tamin’ireo iraka izy ka lasa vadin’i Davida.', 'dia nitsangana haingana izy ka nitaingina ampondra, ary nisy mpanompovavy dimy nanaraka azy. ary niaraka tamin’ireo iraka izy ka lasa vadin’i davida.'),
  ('6ab25a24b9435b67b7bfe207', '2026-09-22T10:36:20.888Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:20.888Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 25, 36, 'Dia tonga tany amin’i Nabala i Abigaila. Nanao fanasambe tao an-tranony ralehilahy tamin’izay, toy ny fanasan’ny mpanjaka. Ary falifaly ny fon’i Nabala, sady mamo be izy. Koa tsy nilaza na inona na inona taminy ravehivavy, na kely na lehibe, mandra-paharainan’ny andro.', 'dia tonga tany amin’i nabala i abigaila. nanao fanasambe tao an-tranony ralehilahy tamin’izay, toy ny fanasan’ny mpanjaka. ary falifaly ny fon’i nabala, sady mamo be izy. koa tsy nilaza na inona na inona taminy ravehivavy, na kely na lehibe, mandra-paharainan’ny andro.'),
  ('6ab25a24b9435b67b7bfe205', '2026-09-22T10:36:20.888Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:20.888Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 25, 34, 'Ary raha mbola velona koa i Jehovah Andriamanitry ny Israely izay nisakana ahy tsy hanisy ratsy anao, dia tsoriko aminao fa efa tsy nisy niangana intsony ny lahy rehetra izay an’i Nabala, mandra-paharainan’ny andro, raha toa ka tsy nandeha haingana hihaona amiko ianao.”', 'ary raha mbola velona koa i jehovah andriamanitry ny israely izay nisakana ahy tsy hanisy ratsy anao, dia tsoriko aminao fa efa tsy nisy niangana intsony ny lahy rehetra izay an’i nabala, mandra-paharainan’ny andro, raha toa ka tsy nandeha haingana hihaona amiko ianao.”'),
  ('6ab25a24b9435b67b7bfe201', '2026-09-22T10:36:20.888Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:20.888Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 25, 30, 'Hanendry anao ho mpitarika ny Israely i Jehovah, satria hanao soa amin’ny tompoko izy, araka izay rehetra efa nolazainy.', 'hanendry anao ho mpitarika ny israely i jehovah, satria hanao soa amin’ny tompoko izy, araka izay rehetra efa nolazainy.'),
  ('6ab25a24b9435b67b7bfe20a', '2026-09-22T10:36:20.888Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:20.888Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 25, 39, 'Dia ren’i Davida fa maty i Nabala, ka hoy izy: “Hisaorana anie i Jehovah, izay niady ho ahy teo amin’ny fitsarana ka nanafaka ahy tamin’ilay fanalam-baraka nataon’i Nabala tamiko, sady nisakana ny mpanompony tsy hanao ratsy! Ary ny faharatsian’i Nabala dia natsingerin’i Jehovah teo an-dohany ihany!” Dia naniraka olona i Davida mba hilaza tamin’i Abigaila ny fangatahany azy ho vady.', 'dia ren’i davida fa maty i nabala, ka hoy izy: “hisaorana anie i jehovah, izay niady ho ahy teo amin’ny fitsarana ka nanafaka ahy tamin’ilay fanalam-baraka nataon’i nabala tamiko, sady nisakana ny mpanompony tsy hanao ratsy! ary ny faharatsian’i nabala dia natsingerin’i jehovah teo an-dohany ihany!” dia naniraka olona i davida mba hilaza tamin’i abigaila ny fangatahany azy ho vady.'),
  ('6ab25a24b9435b67b7bfe1f6', '2026-09-22T10:36:20.888Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:20.888Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 25, 19, 'Dia hoy izy tamin’ny mpanompony: “Mandehana mialoha ahy, fa ho avy ao aorianareo aho.” Tsy nilazany na inona na inona anefa i Nabala vadiny.', 'dia hoy izy tamin’ny mpanompony: “mandehana mialoha ahy, fa ho avy ao aorianareo aho.” tsy nilazany na inona na inona anefa i nabala vadiny.'),
  ('6ab25a2574de488033056147', '2026-09-22T10:36:21.930Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:21.930Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 26, 25, 'Dia hoy i Saoly tamin’i Davida: “Hotahin’Andriamanitra anie ianao, ry Davida zanako! Tsy maintsy hanao zavatra ianao, ary ianao no tsy maintsy ho mpandresy.” Dia lasa nandeha i Davida, fa i Saoly kosa nody tany amin’izay nisy azy.', 'dia hoy i saoly tamin’i davida: “hotahin’andriamanitra anie ianao, ry davida zanako! tsy maintsy hanao zavatra ianao, ary ianao no tsy maintsy ho mpandresy.” dia lasa nandeha i davida, fa i saoly kosa nody tany amin’izay nisy azy.'),
  ('6ab25a2574de488033056136', '2026-09-22T10:36:21.930Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:21.930Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 26, 8, 'Ary hoy i Abisay tamin’i Davida: “Efa natolotr’Andriamanitra eo an-tananao ny fahavalonao androany. Mba avelao aho handefona azy hifantsika amin’ny tany indray mandeha tsy miverina.”', 'ary hoy i abisay tamin’i davida: “efa natolotr’andriamanitra eo an-tananao ny fahavalonao androany. mba avelao aho handefona azy hifantsika amin’ny tany indray mandeha tsy miverina.”'),
  ('6ab25a2574de488033056145', '2026-09-22T10:36:21.930Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:21.930Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 26, 23, 'I Jehovah no hamaly ny tsirairay araka ny fahamarinany sy ny tsy fivadihany avy, satria nanolotra anao teo an-tanako i Jehovah androany, nefa izaho tsy nety naninjitra ny tanako hamely ny voahosotr’i Jehovah.', 'i jehovah no hamaly ny tsirairay araka ny fahamarinany sy ny tsy fivadihany avy, satria nanolotra anao teo an-tanako i jehovah androany, nefa izaho tsy nety naninjitra ny tanako hamely ny voahosotr’i jehovah.'),
  ('6ab25a2574de488033056141', '2026-09-22T10:36:21.930Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:21.930Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 26, 19, 'Aoka ny mpanjaka tompoko mba hihaino ny tenin’ny mpanompony: Raha i Jehovah no nampirisika anao hamely ahy, dia aoka izy hankasitraka ny fanatitra varimbazaha atolotro. Fa raha olona kosa no nampirisika anao, dia voaozona eo anatrehan’i Jehovah izy ireo, satria efa nandroaka ahy androany mba tsy hiraiki-po intsony amin’ny lovan’i Jehovah, ka nanao hoe: ‘Mandehana manompo andriamani-kafa!’', 'aoka ny mpanjaka tompoko mba hihaino ny tenin’ny mpanompony: raha i jehovah no nampirisika anao hamely ahy, dia aoka izy hankasitraka ny fanatitra varimbazaha atolotro. fa raha olona kosa no nampirisika anao, dia voaozona eo anatrehan’i jehovah izy ireo, satria efa nandroaka ahy androany mba tsy hiraiki-po intsony amin’ny lovan’i jehovah, ka nanao hoe: ‘mandehana manompo andriamani-kafa!’'),
  ('6ab25a2574de48803305613d', '2026-09-22T10:36:21.930Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:21.930Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 26, 15, 'Dia hoy i Davida: “Tsy lehilahy ve ianao e? Ary iza no tahaka anao eo amin’ny Israely? Koa nahoana ianao no tsy niambina ny mpanjaka tomponao? Fa nisy tonga hamono ny mpanjaka tomponao teo.', 'dia hoy i davida: “tsy lehilahy ve ianao e? ary iza no tahaka anao eo amin’ny israely? koa nahoana ianao no tsy niambina ny mpanjaka tomponao? fa nisy tonga hamono ny mpanjaka tomponao teo.'),
  ('6ab25a2574de488033056140', '2026-09-22T10:36:21.930Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:21.930Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 26, 18, 'Hoy koa izy: “Nahoana ny tompoko no manenjika ny mpanompony? Fa inona no nataoko ary inona no ratsy vitako?', 'hoy koa izy: “nahoana ny tompoko no manenjika ny mpanompony? fa inona no nataoko ary inona no ratsy vitako?'),
  ('6ab25a2574de488033056138', '2026-09-22T10:36:21.930Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:21.930Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 26, 10, 'Hoy koa i Davida: “Raha mbola velona koa i Jehovah, dia i Jehovah ihany no hamely azy, na ho avy ny andro tsy maintsy hahafatesany, na hidina any an’ady izy ka ho faty.', 'hoy koa i davida: “raha mbola velona koa i jehovah, dia i jehovah ihany no hamely azy, na ho avy ny andro tsy maintsy hahafatesany, na hidina any an’ady izy ka ho faty.'),
  ('6ab25a2574de488033056133', '2026-09-22T10:36:21.930Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:21.930Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 26, 5, 'Ary nankany amin’ny toerana nitobian’i Saoly i Davida. Dia tazany ny toerana natorian’i Saoly, ary tazany koa i Abnera zanak’i Nera, lehiben’ny tafiny. Natory tao amin’ny faritry ny toby i Saoly tamin’izay, ary nitoby nanodidina azy ny olona.', 'ary nankany amin’ny toerana nitobian’i saoly i davida. dia tazany ny toerana natorian’i saoly, ary tazany koa i abnera zanak’i nera, lehiben’ny tafiny. natory tao amin’ny faritry ny toby i saoly tamin’izay, ary nitoby nanodidina azy ny olona.'),
  ('6ab25a2574de48803305613a', '2026-09-22T10:36:21.930Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:21.930Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 26, 12, 'Dia nalain’i Davida teo akaikin’ny lohan’i Saoly ilay lefona sy ilay tavoara fasiana rano, ary lasa nandeha ry zareo. Ary tsy nisy nahita na nahatsikaritra na nifoha, fa natory daholo izy ireo satria nataon’i Jehovah renoky ny torimaso lalina.', 'dia nalain’i davida teo akaikin’ny lohan’i saoly ilay lefona sy ilay tavoara fasiana rano, ary lasa nandeha ry zareo. ary tsy nisy nahita na nahatsikaritra na nifoha, fa natory daholo izy ireo satria nataon’i jehovah renoky ny torimaso lalina.'),
  ('6ab25a2574de48803305613b', '2026-09-22T10:36:21.930Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:21.930Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 26, 13, 'Dia nankeny ampita i Davida, ka nijoro teo an-tampon’ny tendrombohitra teny lavidavitra. Koa nifanalavidavitra izy ireo.', 'dia nankeny ampita i davida, ka nijoro teo an-tampon’ny tendrombohitra teny lavidavitra. koa nifanalavidavitra izy ireo.'),
  ('6ab25a2574de488033056132', '2026-09-22T10:36:21.930Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:21.930Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 26, 4, 'Koa nandefa mpitsikilo i Davida, mba hahafantarany raha tonga tokoa i Saoly.', 'koa nandefa mpitsikilo i davida, mba hahafantarany raha tonga tokoa i saoly.'),
  ('6ab25a2574de48803305613c', '2026-09-22T10:36:21.930Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:21.930Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 26, 14, 'Ary i Davida niantsoantso ho ren’ny olona sy Abnera zanak’i Nera, nanao hoe: “Valio aho, ry Abnera a!” Koa namaly i Abnera hoe: “Iza moa izao miantsoantso ho ren’ny mpanjaka izao?”', 'ary i davida niantsoantso ho ren’ny olona sy abnera zanak’i nera, nanao hoe: “valio aho, ry abnera a!” koa namaly i abnera hoe: “iza moa izao miantsoantso ho ren’ny mpanjaka izao?”'),
  ('6ab25a2574de488033056135', '2026-09-22T10:36:21.930Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:21.930Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 26, 7, 'Koa nankeny amin’izy ireo i Davida sy Abisay, tamin’ny alina. Natory tao amin’ny faritry ny toby i Saoly, ary nitsatoka tamin’ny tany teo akaikin’ny lohany ny lefony. I Abnera sy ny olona kosa natory nanodidina azy.', 'koa nankeny amin’izy ireo i davida sy abisay, tamin’ny alina. natory tao amin’ny faritry ny toby i saoly, ary nitsatoka tamin’ny tany teo akaikin’ny lohany ny lefony. i abnera sy ny olona kosa natory nanodidina azy.'),
  ('6ab25a2574de488033056131', '2026-09-22T10:36:21.930Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:21.930Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 26, 3, 'Ary nitoby teo amoron-dalana i Saoly, teo amin’ny havoanan’i Hakila, tandrifin’i Jesimona, fa i Davida kosa nitoetra tany an-tany efitra. Ary fantatr’i Davida fa nanaraka azy tany an-tany efitra i Saoly.', 'ary nitoby teo amoron-dalana i saoly, teo amin’ny havoanan’i hakila, tandrifin’i jesimona, fa i davida kosa nitoetra tany an-tany efitra. ary fantatr’i davida fa nanaraka azy tany an-tany efitra i saoly.'),
  ('6ab25a2574de488033056142', '2026-09-22T10:36:21.930Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:21.930Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 26, 20, 'Ary ankehitriny, aza avela ho latsaka amin’ny tany eo anatrehan’i Jehovah ny rako. Fa efa nivoaka hitady parasy iray ny mpanjakan’ny Israely, toy ny olona manenjika tsipoy eny an-tendrombohitra.”', 'ary ankehitriny, aza avela ho latsaka amin’ny tany eo anatrehan’i jehovah ny rako. fa efa nivoaka hitady parasy iray ny mpanjakan’ny israely, toy ny olona manenjika tsipoy eny an-tendrombohitra.”'),
  ('6ab25a2574de488033056137', '2026-09-22T10:36:21.930Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:21.930Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 26, 9, 'Hoy anefa i Davida tamin’i Abisay: “Aza mamono azy, fa iza moa no naninjitra ny tanany hamely ny voahosotr’i Jehovah ka tsy nanan-tsiny?”', 'hoy anefa i davida tamin’i abisay: “aza mamono azy, fa iza moa no naninjitra ny tanany hamely ny voahosotr’i jehovah ka tsy nanan-tsiny?”'),
  ('6ab25a2574de488033056146', '2026-09-22T10:36:21.930Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:21.930Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 26, 24, 'Ary toy ny naha zava-dehibe ny ainao teo imasoko androany, dia enga anie mba ho zava-dehibe eo imason’i Jehovah koa ny aiko, ka hanafaka ahy amin’ny fahoriana rehetra izy!”', 'ary toy ny naha zava-dehibe ny ainao teo imasoko androany, dia enga anie mba ho zava-dehibe eo imason’i jehovah koa ny aiko, ka hanafaka ahy amin’ny fahoriana rehetra izy!”'),
  ('6ab25a2574de488033056134', '2026-09-22T10:36:21.930Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:21.930Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 26, 6, 'Ary hoy i Davida tamin’i Ahimeleka Hetita sy Abisay zanak’i Zeroia, rahalahin’i Joaba: “Iza no hidina hiaraka amiko hankeny amin’i Saoly ao an-toby?” Dia hoy i Abisay: “Hiaraka aminao aho.”', 'ary hoy i davida tamin’i ahimeleka hetita sy abisay zanak’i zeroia, rahalahin’i joaba: “iza no hidina hiaraka amiko hankeny amin’i saoly ao an-toby?” dia hoy i abisay: “hiaraka aminao aho.”'),
  ('6ab25a2574de48803305613e', '2026-09-22T10:36:21.930Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:21.930Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 26, 16, 'Tsy tsara izany nataonao izany. Raha mbola velona koa i Jehovah, dia mendrika ny ho faty ianareo, satria tsy nambenanareo ny tomponareo, izay voahosotr’i Jehovah. Aiza izao ny lefon’ny mpanjaka sy ilay tavoara fasiana rano teo akaikin’ny lohany?”', 'tsy tsara izany nataonao izany. raha mbola velona koa i jehovah, dia mendrika ny ho faty ianareo, satria tsy nambenanareo ny tomponareo, izay voahosotr’i jehovah. aiza izao ny lefon’ny mpanjaka sy ilay tavoara fasiana rano teo akaikin’ny lohany?”'),
  ('6ab25a2574de488033056130', '2026-09-22T10:36:21.930Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:21.930Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 26, 2, 'Dia nidina nankany an-tany efitr’i Zifa i Saoly mba hitady an’i Davida tany. Ary nisy telo arivo lahy niaraka tamin’i Saoly, dia ireo lehilahy voafantina teo amin’ny Israely.', 'dia nidina nankany an-tany efitr’i zifa i saoly mba hitady an’i davida tany. ary nisy telo arivo lahy niaraka tamin’i saoly, dia ireo lehilahy voafantina teo amin’ny israely.'),
  ('6ab25a2574de488033056143', '2026-09-22T10:36:21.930Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:21.930Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 26, 21, 'Dia hoy i Saoly: “Efa nanota aho. Miverena, ry Davida zanako, fa tsy hanisy ratsy anao intsony aho satria sarobidy teo imasonao ny aiko androany. Hadalana mihitsy no nataoko ary tena diso aho.”', 'dia hoy i saoly: “efa nanota aho. miverena, ry davida zanako, fa tsy hanisy ratsy anao intsony aho satria sarobidy teo imasonao ny aiko androany. hadalana mihitsy no nataoko ary tena diso aho.”'),
  ('6ab25a2574de48803305612f', '2026-09-22T10:36:21.930Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:21.930Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 26, 1, 'Tatỳ aoriana, dia tonga tany amin’i Saoly tany Gibea ireo lehilahy tao Zifa, ka niteny hoe: “Tsy fantatrao angaha fa miafina any amin’ny havoanan’i Hakila, tandrifin’i Jesimona, i Davida?”', 'tatỳ aoriana, dia tonga tany amin’i saoly tany gibea ireo lehilahy tao zifa, ka niteny hoe: “tsy fantatrao angaha fa miafina any amin’ny havoanan’i hakila, tandrifin’i jesimona, i davida?”'),
  ('6ab25a2574de48803305613f', '2026-09-22T10:36:21.930Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:21.930Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 26, 17, 'Dia fantatr’i Saoly ny feon’i Davida, ka hoy izy: “Feonao ve izany, ry Davida zanako?” Ary hoy i Davida: “Feoko izany, ry mpanjaka tompoko.”', 'dia fantatr’i saoly ny feon’i davida, ka hoy izy: “feonao ve izany, ry davida zanako?” ary hoy i davida: “feoko izany, ry mpanjaka tompoko.”'),
  ('6ab25a2574de488033056139', '2026-09-22T10:36:21.930Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:21.930Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 26, 11, 'Fa sanatria ahy ny haninjitra ny tanako hamely ny voahosotr’i Jehovah, satria tsy mifanaraka amin’ny fihevitr’i Jehovah izany! Koa alaivo, azafady, ny lefona eo akaikin’ny lohany sy ny tavoara fasiana rano, dia andao handeha.”', 'fa sanatria ahy ny haninjitra ny tanako hamely ny voahosotr’i jehovah, satria tsy mifanaraka amin’ny fihevitr’i jehovah izany! koa alaivo, azafady, ny lefona eo akaikin’ny lohany sy ny tavoara fasiana rano, dia andao handeha.”'),
  ('6ab25a2574de488033056144', '2026-09-22T10:36:21.930Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:21.930Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 26, 22, 'Ary hoy i Davida: “Intỳ ny lefon’ny mpanjaka! Aoka hisy iray amin’ireo tovolahy haka azy etỳ.', 'ary hoy i davida: “intỳ ny lefon’ny mpanjaka! aoka hisy iray amin’ireo tovolahy haka azy etỳ.'),
  ('6ab25a269a6eade8fb7f5306', '2026-09-22T10:36:22.376Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:22.376Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 27, 5, 'Ary hoy i Davida tamin’i Akisy: “Raha mahazo sitraka aminao aho, dia aoka mba homena toerana ao amin’ny tanàna iray any ambanivohitra, mba hipetrahako any. Fa nahoana ny mpanomponao no hipetraka miaraka aminao eto amin’ny tanànan’ny mpanjaka?”', 'ary hoy i davida tamin’i akisy: “raha mahazo sitraka aminao aho, dia aoka mba homena toerana ao amin’ny tanàna iray any ambanivohitra, mba hipetrahako any. fa nahoana ny mpanomponao no hipetraka miaraka aminao eto amin’ny tanànan’ny mpanjaka?”'),
  ('6ab25a269a6eade8fb7f5305', '2026-09-22T10:36:22.376Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:22.376Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 27, 4, 'Tatỳ aoriana, dia nisy nilaza tamin’i Saoly fa efa nandositra nankany Gata i Davida, ka tsy nandeha nitady azy intsony izy.', 'tatỳ aoriana, dia nisy nilaza tamin’i saoly fa efa nandositra nankany gata i davida, ka tsy nandeha nitady azy intsony izy.'),
  ('6ab25a269a6eade8fb7f530c', '2026-09-22T10:36:22.376Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:22.376Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 27, 11, 'Tsy nisy lehilahy na vehivavy navelan’i Davida ho velona na iray aza, mba tsy hisy hoentiny tany Gata. Fa hoy izy: “Sao hitantara momba antsika ry zareo hoe: ‘Toy izao no nataon’i Davida.’” Ary toy izany foana no fanaony tamin’ny andro rehetra nipetrahany tany ambanivohitry ny Filistinina.', 'tsy nisy lehilahy na vehivavy navelan’i davida ho velona na iray aza, mba tsy hisy hoentiny tany gata. fa hoy izy: “sao hitantara momba antsika ry zareo hoe: ‘toy izao no nataon’i davida.’” ary toy izany foana no fanaony tamin’ny andro rehetra nipetrahany tany ambanivohitry ny filistinina.'),
  ('6ab25a269a6eade8fb7f5304', '2026-09-22T10:36:22.376Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:22.376Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 27, 3, 'Ary nitoetra tany amin’i Akisy tao Gata i Davida sy ny olony, izay samy niaraka tamin’ny ankohonany avy. I Davida koa niaraka tamin’ireo vadiny roa, dia i Ahinoama Jezirelita sy Abigaila Karmelita, ilay vadin’i Nabala.', 'ary nitoetra tany amin’i akisy tao gata i davida sy ny olony, izay samy niaraka tamin’ny ankohonany avy. i davida koa niaraka tamin’ireo vadiny roa, dia i ahinoama jezirelita sy abigaila karmelita, ilay vadin’i nabala.'),
  ('6ab25a269a6eade8fb7f5307', '2026-09-22T10:36:22.376Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:22.376Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 27, 6, 'Koa nomen’i Akisy azy i Ziklaga tamin’izay andro izay. Izany no nahatonga an’i Ziklaga ho fananan’ny mpanjakan’ny Joda mandraka androany.', 'koa nomen’i akisy azy i ziklaga tamin’izay andro izay. izany no nahatonga an’i ziklaga ho fananan’ny mpanjakan’ny joda mandraka androany.'),
  ('6ab25a269a6eade8fb7f5303', '2026-09-22T10:36:22.376Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:22.376Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 27, 2, 'Dia niainga i Davida sy ny eninjato lahy niaraka taminy ka niampita nankany amin’i Akisy mpanjakan’i Gata, zanak’i Maoka.', 'dia niainga i davida sy ny eninjato lahy niaraka taminy ka niampita nankany amin’i akisy mpanjakan’i gata, zanak’i maoka.'),
  ('6ab25a269a6eade8fb7f530b', '2026-09-22T10:36:22.376Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:22.376Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 27, 10, 'Ary hoy i Akisy: “Taiza ianareo no nanafika androany?” Dia hoy i Davida: “Tany atsimon’i Joda sy tany atsimon’ny tanin’ny Jeramelita ary tany atsimon’ny tanin’ny Kenita.”', 'ary hoy i akisy: “taiza ianareo no nanafika androany?” dia hoy i davida: “tany atsimon’i joda sy tany atsimon’ny tanin’ny jeramelita ary tany atsimon’ny tanin’ny kenita.”'),
  ('6ab25a269a6eade8fb7f5309', '2026-09-22T10:36:22.376Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:22.376Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 27, 8, 'Ary niakatra i Davida sy ny olony mba hanafika ny Gesorita sy ny Girzita ary ny Amalekita, izay nonina tao amin’ny faritra nanomboka tany Telama ka hatrany Sora ary nipaka hatrany Ejipta.', 'ary niakatra i davida sy ny olony mba hanafika ny gesorita sy ny girzita ary ny amalekita, izay nonina tao amin’ny faritra nanomboka tany telama ka hatrany sora ary nipaka hatrany ejipta.'),
  ('6ab25a269a6eade8fb7f5308', '2026-09-22T10:36:22.376Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:22.376Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 27, 7, 'Herintaona sy efa-bolana no andro nipetrahan’i Davida tany ambanivohitry ny Filistinina.', 'herintaona sy efa-bolana no andro nipetrahan’i davida tany ambanivohitry ny filistinina.'),
  ('6ab25a269a6eade8fb7f530a', '2026-09-22T10:36:22.376Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:22.376Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 27, 9, 'Ary namely an’ilay faritra i Davida, ka tsy nisy nasiany niangana na lehilahy na vehivavy. Namabo ondry sy omby sy ampondra sy rameva ary akanjo koa izy, dia niverina tany amin’i Akisy.', 'ary namely an’ilay faritra i davida, ka tsy nisy nasiany niangana na lehilahy na vehivavy. namabo ondry sy omby sy ampondra sy rameva ary akanjo koa izy, dia niverina tany amin’i akisy.'),
  ('6ab25a269a6eade8fb7f530d', '2026-09-22T10:36:22.376Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:22.376Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 27, 12, 'Koa nino an’i Davida i Akisy, ka niteny anakampo hoe: “Efa nanjary halan’ny Israely olony tokoa izy, ka ho mpanompoko mandritra ny fotoana tsy voafetra.”', 'koa nino an’i davida i akisy, ka niteny anakampo hoe: “efa nanjary halan’ny israely olony tokoa izy, ka ho mpanompoko mandritra ny fotoana tsy voafetra.”'),
  ('6ab25a269a6eade8fb7f5302', '2026-09-22T10:36:22.376Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:22.376Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 27, 1, 'Hoy anefa i Davida anakampo: “Ho fatin’ny tanan’i Saoly ihany aho indray andro any. Koa tsy misy afa-tsy ny mandositra any amin’ny tanin’ny Filistinina no mety amiko. Amin’izay dia ho kivy i Saoly ka tsy te hitady ahy intsony, manerana ny faritanin’ny Israely. Ary tsy ho azon’ny tanany intsony aho.”', 'hoy anefa i davida anakampo: “ho fatin’ny tanan’i saoly ihany aho indray andro any. koa tsy misy afa-tsy ny mandositra any amin’ny tanin’ny filistinina no mety amiko. amin’izay dia ho kivy i saoly ka tsy te hitady ahy intsony, manerana ny faritanin’ny israely. ary tsy ho azon’ny tanany intsony aho.”'),
  ('6ab25a262a7ae9a9c89a9cfc', '2026-09-22T10:36:22.849Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:22.849Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 28, 23, 'Tsy nety anefa i Saoly fa niteny hoe: “Tsy hihinana aho.” Nampirisika azy foana anefa ny mpanompony sy ilay vehivavy. Koa nanaraka ny tenin’izy ireo ihany izy tamin’ny farany, ka niarina avy teo amin’ny tany ary nipetraka teo am-pandriana.', 'tsy nety anefa i saoly fa niteny hoe: “tsy hihinana aho.” nampirisika azy foana anefa ny mpanompony sy ilay vehivavy. koa nanaraka ny tenin’izy ireo ihany izy tamin’ny farany, ka niarina avy teo amin’ny tany ary nipetraka teo am-pandriana.'),
  ('6ab25a262a7ae9a9c89a9cf2', '2026-09-22T10:36:22.849Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:22.849Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 28, 13, 'Hoy anefa ny mpanjaka: “Aza matahotra, fa inona no hitanao?” Dia hoy ravehivavy: “Nahita andriamanitra niakatra avy ao amin’ny tany aho.”', 'hoy anefa ny mpanjaka: “aza matahotra, fa inona no hitanao?” dia hoy ravehivavy: “nahita andriamanitra niakatra avy ao amin’ny tany aho.”'),
  ('6ab25a262a7ae9a9c89a9cf8', '2026-09-22T10:36:22.849Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:22.849Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 28, 19, 'Ary hatolotr’i Jehovah miaraka aminao eo an-tanan’ny Filistinina koa ny Israely, ka ho atỳ amiko ianao sy ireo zanakao lahy rahampitso. Ary na ny tobin’ny Israely koa aza hatolotr’i Jehovah eo an-tanan’ny Filistinina.”', 'ary hatolotr’i jehovah miaraka aminao eo an-tanan’ny filistinina koa ny israely, ka ho atỳ amiko ianao sy ireo zanakao lahy rahampitso. ary na ny tobin’ny israely koa aza hatolotr’i jehovah eo an-tanan’ny filistinina.”'),
  ('6ab25a262a7ae9a9c89a9ced', '2026-09-22T10:36:22.849Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:22.849Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 28, 8, 'Koa mody nanao olon-kafa i Saoly ka akanjo hafa no nanaovany. Dia lasa izy, ary nisy lehilahy roa niaraka taminy. Ary tonga tany amin’ilay vehivavy izy ireo tamin’ny alina. Dia hoy i Saoly: “Manaova sikidy, azafady, ka miantsoa fanahy, dia ampiakaro ho ahy izay holazaiko aminao.”', 'koa mody nanao olon-kafa i saoly ka akanjo hafa no nanaovany. dia lasa izy, ary nisy lehilahy roa niaraka taminy. ary tonga tany amin’ilay vehivavy izy ireo tamin’ny alina. dia hoy i saoly: “manaova sikidy, azafady, ka miantsoa fanahy, dia ampiakaro ho ahy izay holazaiko aminao.”'),
  ('6ab25a262a7ae9a9c89a9ceb', '2026-09-22T10:36:22.849Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:22.849Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 28, 6, 'Dia nanontany an’i Jehovah i Saoly, nefa tsy namaly azy mihitsy i Jehovah, na tamin’ny nofy na tamin’ny Orima, na tamin’ny alalan’ny mpaminany.', 'dia nanontany an’i jehovah i saoly, nefa tsy namaly azy mihitsy i jehovah, na tamin’ny nofy na tamin’ny orima, na tamin’ny alalan’ny mpaminany.'),
  ('6ab25a262a7ae9a9c89a9cfb', '2026-09-22T10:36:22.849Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:22.849Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 28, 22, 'Koa mba henoy kosa izao ny tenin’ny mpanompovavinao. Avelao aho handroso sombi-mofo eo anoloanao, dia hihinana ianao mba hahazo hery satria mbola handeha.”', 'koa mba henoy kosa izao ny tenin’ny mpanompovavinao. avelao aho handroso sombi-mofo eo anoloanao, dia hihinana ianao mba hahazo hery satria mbola handeha.”'),
  ('6ab25a262a7ae9a9c89a9cfa', '2026-09-22T10:36:22.849Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:22.849Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 28, 21, 'Dia nankeo amin’i Saoly ravehivavy ka nahita fa nivarahontsana mafy izy. Ary hoy izy taminy: “Efa nihaino ny teninao ny mpanompovavinao, ary efa nanao vivery ny aiko aho ka nihaino izay nolazainao tamiko.', 'dia nankeo amin’i saoly ravehivavy ka nahita fa nivarahontsana mafy izy. ary hoy izy taminy: “efa nihaino ny teninao ny mpanompovavinao, ary efa nanao vivery ny aiko aho ka nihaino izay nolazainao tamiko.'),
  ('6ab25a262a7ae9a9c89a9cef', '2026-09-22T10:36:22.849Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:22.849Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 28, 10, 'Avy hatrany dia nianiana taminy tamin’ny anaran’i Jehovah i Saoly hoe: “Raha mbola velona koa i Jehovah, dia tsy hisy heloka ho anao amin’ity raharaha ity!”', 'avy hatrany dia nianiana taminy tamin’ny anaran’i jehovah i saoly hoe: “raha mbola velona koa i jehovah, dia tsy hisy heloka ho anao amin’ity raharaha ity!”'),
  ('6ab25a262a7ae9a9c89a9ce7', '2026-09-22T10:36:22.849Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:22.849Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 28, 2, 'Dia hoy i Davida: “Ianao mahalala tsara izay tokony hataon’ny mpanomponao.” Koa hoy i Akisy: “Izany no hanendreko anao ho mpiaro ahy mandrakariva.”', 'dia hoy i davida: “ianao mahalala tsara izay tokony hataon’ny mpanomponao.” koa hoy i akisy: “izany no hanendreko anao ho mpiaro ahy mandrakariva.”'),
  ('6ab25a262a7ae9a9c89a9cf9', '2026-09-22T10:36:22.849Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:22.849Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 28, 20, 'Tonga dia nianjera niampatra tamin’ny tany i Saoly sady raiki-tahotra mafy noho ny tenin’i “Samoela.” Tsy nisy hery intsony koa tao aminy, satria tsy nihinan-kanina izy iny andro iny sy ny alina manontolo.', 'tonga dia nianjera niampatra tamin’ny tany i saoly sady raiki-tahotra mafy noho ny tenin’i “samoela.” tsy nisy hery intsony koa tao aminy, satria tsy nihinan-kanina izy iny andro iny sy ny alina manontolo.'),
  ('6ab25a262a7ae9a9c89a9cf6', '2026-09-22T10:36:22.849Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:22.849Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 28, 17, 'Izay efa nolazain’i Jehovah tamin’ny alalako no hataony, eny, izany no hataony ho an’ny tenany. Dia hendahan’i Jehovah eo an-tananao ny fanjakana, ka homeny an’i Davida namanao.', 'izay efa nolazain’i jehovah tamin’ny alalako no hataony, eny, izany no hataony ho an’ny tenany. dia hendahan’i jehovah eo an-tananao ny fanjakana, ka homeny an’i davida namanao.'),
  ('6ab25a262a7ae9a9c89a9cf4', '2026-09-22T10:36:22.849Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:22.849Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 28, 15, 'Ary hoy i “Samoela” tamin’i Saoly: “Nahoana ianao no manelingelina ahy ka mampiakatra ahy?” Dia hoy i Saoly: “Mafy ny manjo ahy, fa miady amiko ny Filistinina nefa Andriamanitra efa nahafoy ahy ka tsy namaly ahy intsony, na tamin’ny alalan’ny mpaminany na tamin’ny nofy. Koa miantso anao aho mba hampahafantatra ahy izay tokony hataoko.”', 'ary hoy i “samoela” tamin’i saoly: “nahoana ianao no manelingelina ahy ka mampiakatra ahy?” dia hoy i saoly: “mafy ny manjo ahy, fa miady amiko ny filistinina nefa andriamanitra efa nahafoy ahy ka tsy namaly ahy intsony, na tamin’ny alalan’ny mpaminany na tamin’ny nofy. koa miantso anao aho mba hampahafantatra ahy izay tokony hataoko.”'),
  ('6ab25a262a7ae9a9c89a9ce9', '2026-09-22T10:36:22.849Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:22.849Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 28, 4, 'Dia niangona ny Filistinina, ary tonga tao Sonema ka nanangana toby tao. Koa novorin’i Saoly ny Israely rehetra, ary nanangana toby tao Gilboa izy ireo.', 'dia niangona ny filistinina, ary tonga tao sonema ka nanangana toby tao. koa novorin’i saoly ny israely rehetra, ary nanangana toby tao gilboa izy ireo.'),
  ('6ab25a262a7ae9a9c89a9cf5', '2026-09-22T10:36:22.849Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:22.849Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 28, 16, 'Ary hoy i “Samoela”: “Koa nahoana ianao no manontany ahy, nefa i Jehovah aza efa nahafoy anao ka lasa fahavalonao?', 'ary hoy i “samoela”: “koa nahoana ianao no manontany ahy, nefa i jehovah aza efa nahafoy anao ka lasa fahavalonao?'),
  ('6ab25a262a7ae9a9c89a9cf3', '2026-09-22T10:36:22.849Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:22.849Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 28, 14, 'Avy hatrany dia hoy izy tamin-dravehivavy: “Manao ahoana ny bikabikany?” Dia namaly ravehivavy hoe: “Lahiantitra no miakatra avy any, ary manao akanjo ivelany tsy misy tanany izy.” Koa fantatr’i Saoly fa i “Samoela” izany, dia niondrika izy ka niankohoka tamin’ny tany.', 'avy hatrany dia hoy izy tamin-dravehivavy: “manao ahoana ny bikabikany?” dia namaly ravehivavy hoe: “lahiantitra no miakatra avy any, ary manao akanjo ivelany tsy misy tanany izy.” koa fantatr’i saoly fa i “samoela” izany, dia niondrika izy ka niankohoka tamin’ny tany.'),
  ('6ab25a262a7ae9a9c89a9cea', '2026-09-22T10:36:22.849Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:22.849Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 28, 5, 'Rehefa nahita ny tobin’ny Filistinina i Saoly, dia raiki-tahotra ka nidobodoboka be ny fony.', 'rehefa nahita ny tobin’ny filistinina i saoly, dia raiki-tahotra ka nidobodoboka be ny fony.'),
  ('6ab25a262a7ae9a9c89a9cfe', '2026-09-22T10:36:22.849Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:22.849Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 28, 25, 'Dia narosony teo anoloan’i Saoly sy ny mpanompony izany, ka nihinana izy ireo. Avy eo dia nitsangana izy ireo ka lasa nandeha iny alina iny ihany.', 'dia narosony teo anoloan’i saoly sy ny mpanompony izany, ka nihinana izy ireo. avy eo dia nitsangana izy ireo ka lasa nandeha iny alina iny ihany.'),
  ('6ab25a262a7ae9a9c89a9cf7', '2026-09-22T10:36:22.849Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:22.849Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 28, 18, 'Tsy nankatò ny tenin’i Jehovah ianao ary tsy nampihatra ny fahatezerany mirehitra tamin’i Amaleka, ka izany no antony hanaovan’i Jehovah izany zavatra izany aminao anio.', 'tsy nankatò ny tenin’i jehovah ianao ary tsy nampihatra ny fahatezerany mirehitra tamin’i amaleka, ka izany no antony hanaovan’i jehovah izany zavatra izany aminao anio.'),
  ('6ab25a262a7ae9a9c89a9cf1', '2026-09-22T10:36:22.849Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:22.849Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 28, 12, 'Rehefa nahita an’i “Samoela” ravehivavy, dia nikiakiaka faran’izay mafy. Dia hoy izy tamin’i Saoly: “Nahoana ianao no namitaka ahy? Hay, ianao no Saoly.”', 'rehefa nahita an’i “samoela” ravehivavy, dia nikiakiaka faran’izay mafy. dia hoy izy tamin’i saoly: “nahoana ianao no namitaka ahy? hay, ianao no saoly.”'),
  ('6ab25a262a7ae9a9c89a9cfd', '2026-09-22T10:36:22.849Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:22.849Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 28, 24, 'Ary nanana zanak’omby mifahy ravehivavy tao an-trano, ka nataony sorona haingana izany. Naka lafarinina koa izy ka namolavola koba, dia nanao mofo tsy misy lalivay izay nataony tao anaty lafaoro.', 'ary nanana zanak’omby mifahy ravehivavy tao an-trano, ka nataony sorona haingana izany. naka lafarinina koa izy ka namolavola koba, dia nanao mofo tsy misy lalivay izay nataony tao anaty lafaoro.'),
  ('6ab25a262a7ae9a9c89a9cec', '2026-09-22T10:36:22.849Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:22.849Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 28, 7, 'Farany, dia hoy i Saoly tamin’ny mpanompony: “Itadiavo vehivavy mahay mamoha angatra aho. Dia hankany aminy aho hanontany azy.” Ary hoy ny mpanompony: “Misy vehivavy mahay mamoha angatra ao En-dora.”', 'farany, dia hoy i saoly tamin’ny mpanompony: “itadiavo vehivavy mahay mamoha angatra aho. dia hankany aminy aho hanontany azy.” ary hoy ny mpanompony: “misy vehivavy mahay mamoha angatra ao en-dora.”'),
  ('6ab25a262a7ae9a9c89a9ce8', '2026-09-22T10:36:22.849Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:22.849Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 28, 3, 'Efa maty i Samoela tamin’izay, ary efa nitomany azy ny Israely rehetra ka nandevina azy tao an-tanànany tao Rama. Ary efa nesorin’i Saoly tsy ho eo amin’ilay tany ny mpamoha angatra sy ny mpilaza ny hoavy.', 'efa maty i samoela tamin’izay, ary efa nitomany azy ny israely rehetra ka nandevina azy tao an-tanànany tao rama. ary efa nesorin’i saoly tsy ho eo amin’ilay tany ny mpamoha angatra sy ny mpilaza ny hoavy.'),
  ('6ab25a262a7ae9a9c89a9ce6', '2026-09-22T10:36:22.849Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:22.849Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 28, 1, 'Ary tamin’izany andro izany, dia namory ny tobiny ny Filistinina, mba hiady amin’ny Israely. Koa hoy i Akisy tamin’i Davida: “Fantatrao tsara angamba fa tokony hiaraka amiko ho any amin’ny toby ianao sy ny olonao.”', 'ary tamin’izany andro izany, dia namory ny tobiny ny filistinina, mba hiady amin’ny israely. koa hoy i akisy tamin’i davida: “fantatrao tsara angamba fa tokony hiaraka amiko ho any amin’ny toby ianao sy ny olonao.”'),
  ('6ab25a262a7ae9a9c89a9cf0', '2026-09-22T10:36:22.849Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:22.849Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 28, 11, 'Dia hoy ravehivavy: “Iza àry no hampiakariko ho anao?” Ary hoy izy: “Ampiakaro ho ahy i Samoela.”', 'dia hoy ravehivavy: “iza àry no hampiakariko ho anao?” ary hoy izy: “ampiakaro ho ahy i samoela.”'),
  ('6ab25a262a7ae9a9c89a9cee', '2026-09-22T10:36:22.849Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:22.849Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 28, 9, 'Hoy anefa ravehivavy: “Fantatrao tsara ny nataon’i Saoly, fa naringany tsy ho eto amin’ity tany ity ny mpamoha angatra sy ny mpilaza ny hoavy. Koa nahoana ianao no mamandrika ny aiko mba hamonoana ahy ho faty?”', 'hoy anefa ravehivavy: “fantatrao tsara ny nataon’i saoly, fa naringany tsy ho eto amin’ity tany ity ny mpamoha angatra sy ny mpilaza ny hoavy. koa nahoana ianao no mamandrika ny aiko mba hamonoana ahy ho faty?”'),
  ('6ab25a27400dd9d3318670c3', '2026-09-22T10:36:23.357Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:23.357Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 29, 11, 'Koa nifoha maraina i Davida sy ny olony, mba handeha maraina hiverina tany amin’ny tanin’ny Filistinina. Ary ny Filistinina kosa niakatra nankany Jezirela.', 'koa nifoha maraina i davida sy ny olony, mba handeha maraina hiverina tany amin’ny tanin’ny filistinina. ary ny filistinina kosa niakatra nankany jezirela.'),
  ('6ab25a27400dd9d3318670c0', '2026-09-22T10:36:23.357Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:23.357Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 29, 8, 'Hoy anefa i Davida tamin’i Akisy: “Fa inona no nataoko, ary inona no hitanao tamin’ny mpanomponao hatramin’ny andro nahatongavako teo anatrehanao ka mandraka androany, no tsy mahazo mandeha miady amin’ny fahavalon’ny mpanjaka tompoko aho?”', 'hoy anefa i davida tamin’i akisy: “fa inona no nataoko, ary inona no hitanao tamin’ny mpanomponao hatramin’ny andro nahatongavako teo anatrehanao ka mandraka androany, no tsy mahazo mandeha miady amin’ny fahavalon’ny mpanjaka tompoko aho?”'),
  ('6ab25a27400dd9d3318670bc', '2026-09-22T10:36:23.357Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:23.357Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 29, 4, 'Koa tezitra taminy ireo andrianan’ny Filistinina ka niteny hoe: “Asaivo miverina any amin’ny toerana nanendrenao azy ilehio, fa aza avela hiara-midina amintsika ho any an’ady, sao izy ho lasa mpanohitra antsika any. Ary amin’inona moa no hahazoan’ilehio sitraka amin’ny tompony? Tsy amin’ny fanolorana ny lohan’ireto olontsika ireto ihany ve?', 'koa tezitra taminy ireo andrianan’ny filistinina ka niteny hoe: “asaivo miverina any amin’ny toerana nanendrenao azy ilehio, fa aza avela hiara-midina amintsika ho any an’ady, sao izy ho lasa mpanohitra antsika any. ary amin’inona moa no hahazoan’ilehio sitraka amin’ny tompony? tsy amin’ny fanolorana ny lohan’ireto olontsika ireto ihany ve?'),
  ('6ab25a27400dd9d3318670c2', '2026-09-22T10:36:23.357Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:23.357Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 29, 10, 'Koa mifohaza maraina ianao sy ny mpanompon’ny tomponao izay niaraka taminao, eny, mifohaza raha vao mangiran-dratsy, ka mandehana.”', 'koa mifohaza maraina ianao sy ny mpanompon’ny tomponao izay niaraka taminao, eny, mifohaza raha vao mangiran-dratsy, ka mandehana.”'),
  ('6ab25a27400dd9d3318670b9', '2026-09-22T10:36:23.357Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:23.357Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 29, 1, 'Ary namory ny tobiny rehetra tao Afeka ny Filistinina, fa ny Israelita kosa nitoby teo akaikin’ilay loharano tao Jezirela.', 'ary namory ny tobiny rehetra tao afeka ny filistinina, fa ny israelita kosa nitoby teo akaikin’ilay loharano tao jezirela.'),
  ('6ab25a27400dd9d3318670be', '2026-09-22T10:36:23.357Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:23.357Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 29, 6, 'Koa niantso an’i Davida i Akisy ka niteny taminy hoe: “Raha mbola velona koa i Jehovah, dia olona mahitsy ianao, ary faly aho fa niaraka tamiko niantafika ianao. Fa tsy nahita faharatsiana teo aminao aho hatramin’ny andro nahatongavanao tatỳ amiko ka mandraka androany. Tsy sitrak’ireo andriana mpiray dina anefa ianao.', 'koa niantso an’i davida i akisy ka niteny taminy hoe: “raha mbola velona koa i jehovah, dia olona mahitsy ianao, ary faly aho fa niaraka tamiko niantafika ianao. fa tsy nahita faharatsiana teo aminao aho hatramin’ny andro nahatongavanao tatỳ amiko ka mandraka androany. tsy sitrak’ireo andriana mpiray dina anefa ianao.'),
  ('6ab25a27400dd9d3318670c1', '2026-09-22T10:36:23.357Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:23.357Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 29, 9, 'Dia hoy ny navalin’i Akisy: “Fantatro tokoa fa tsara teo imasoko sahala amin’ny anjelin’Andriamanitra ianao, saingy ireo andrianan’ny Filistinina no niteny hoe: ‘Aoka izy tsy hiara-miakatra amintsika ho any an’ady.’', 'dia hoy ny navalin’i akisy: “fantatro tokoa fa tsara teo imasoko sahala amin’ny anjelin’andriamanitra ianao, saingy ireo andrianan’ny filistinina no niteny hoe: ‘aoka izy tsy hiara-miakatra amintsika ho any an’ady.’'),
  ('6ab25a27400dd9d3318670bf', '2026-09-22T10:36:23.357Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:23.357Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 29, 7, 'Koa miverena soa aman-tsara, mba tsy hanaovanao zava-dratsy eo imason’ny andriana mpiray dinan’ny Filistinina.”', 'koa miverena soa aman-tsara, mba tsy hanaovanao zava-dratsy eo imason’ny andriana mpiray dinan’ny filistinina.”'),
  ('6ab25a27400dd9d3318670bd', '2026-09-22T10:36:23.357Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:23.357Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 29, 5, 'Tsy io ve no Davida, ary tsy noho izy ve no nahatonga ny olona handihy sy hanao hira mifamaly hoe: ‘I Saoly nahafaty arivoarivo, fa i Davida kosa nahafaty alinalina’?”', 'tsy io ve no davida, ary tsy noho izy ve no nahatonga ny olona handihy sy hanao hira mifamaly hoe: ‘i saoly nahafaty arivoarivo, fa i davida kosa nahafaty alinalina’?”'),
  ('6ab25a27400dd9d3318670bb', '2026-09-22T10:36:23.357Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:23.357Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 29, 3, 'Ary hoy ireo andrianan’ny Filistinina: “Fa ahoana koa ireto Hebreo ireto?” Dia hoy i Akisy: “Angaha moa tsy io no Davida, mpanompon’i Saoly mpanjakan’ny Israely? Efa teto amiko herintaona na roa taona izy izao, ary tsy hitako izay tsininy hatramin’ny andro nitsoahany ho atỳ amiko ka mandraka androany.”', 'ary hoy ireo andrianan’ny filistinina: “fa ahoana koa ireto hebreo ireto?” dia hoy i akisy: “angaha moa tsy io no davida, mpanompon’i saoly mpanjakan’ny israely? efa teto amiko herintaona na roa taona izy izao, ary tsy hitako izay tsininy hatramin’ny andro nitsoahany ho atỳ amiko ka mandraka androany.”'),
  ('6ab25a27400dd9d3318670ba', '2026-09-22T10:36:23.357Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:23.357Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 29, 2, 'Dia nandroso niaraka tamin’ireo andia-miaramila ny andriana mpiray dinan’ny Filistinina, ary nisy miaramila zato na arivo ny andiany tsirairay. Nandroso koa avy eo i Davida sy ny olony, niaraka tamin’i Akisy.', 'dia nandroso niaraka tamin’ireo andia-miaramila ny andriana mpiray dinan’ny filistinina, ary nisy miaramila zato na arivo ny andiany tsirairay. nandroso koa avy eo i davida sy ny olony, niaraka tamin’i akisy.'),
  ('6ab25a2798bfadabc5e98137', '2026-09-22T10:36:23.778Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:23.778Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 30, 31, 'sy ny tany Hebrona, ary ny tany amin’ny toerana rehetra efa nalehan’i Davida sy ny olony.', 'sy ny tany hebrona, ary ny tany amin’ny toerana rehetra efa nalehan’i davida sy ny olony.'),
  ('6ab25a2798bfadabc5e9812d', '2026-09-22T10:36:23.778Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:23.778Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 30, 21, 'Farany, dia tonga teo amin’ireo roanjato lahy i Davida. Tsy tafaraka taminy mantsy ireo satria reraka loatra, ka nasaina nipetraka teo akaikin’ny lohasaha falehan-driakan’i Besora. Ary nitsena an’i Davida sy ny olona niaraka taminy izy ireo. Nony tonga teo amin’izy ireo i Davida, dia nanontany hoe nanahoana izy ireo.', 'farany, dia tonga teo amin’ireo roanjato lahy i davida. tsy tafaraka taminy mantsy ireo satria reraka loatra, ka nasaina nipetraka teo akaikin’ny lohasaha falehan-driakan’i besora. ary nitsena an’i davida sy ny olona niaraka taminy izy ireo. nony tonga teo amin’izy ireo i davida, dia nanontany hoe nanahoana izy ireo.'),
  ('6ab25a2798bfadabc5e9811c', '2026-09-22T10:36:23.778Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:23.778Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 30, 4, 'Dia nidradradradra nitomany i Davida sy ny olona niaraka taminy, ary rehefa tsy nanan-kery hitomaniana intsony izy ireo vao nangina.', 'dia nidradradradra nitomany i davida sy ny olona niaraka taminy, ary rehefa tsy nanan-kery hitomaniana intsony izy ireo vao nangina.'),
  ('6ab25a2798bfadabc5e98134', '2026-09-22T10:36:23.778Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:23.778Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 30, 28, 'sy ny tany Aroera, sy ny tany Sifmota, sy ny tany Estemoa,', 'sy ny tany aroera, sy ny tany sifmota, sy ny tany estemoa,'),
  ('6ab25a2798bfadabc5e98135', '2026-09-22T10:36:23.778Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:23.778Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 30, 29, 'sy ny tany Rakala, sy ny tany amin’ireo tanànan’ny Jeramelita, sy ny tany amin’ireo tanànan’ny Kenita,', 'sy ny tany rakala, sy ny tany amin’ireo tanànan’ny jeramelita, sy ny tany amin’ireo tanànan’ny kenita,'),
  ('6ab25a2798bfadabc5e9812e', '2026-09-22T10:36:23.778Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:23.778Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 30, 22, 'Nisy olona ratsy fanahy sy tsy manjary anefa tamin’ireo niaraka tamin’i Davida, ka niteny hoe: “Tsy nandeha niaraka tamintsika ireo, ka tsy homentsika na inona na inona amin’ny zavatra nobaboina izay navotantsika, afa-tsy ny vady aman-janany ihany. Aoka hoentiny ireny dia aleo izy handeha.”', 'nisy olona ratsy fanahy sy tsy manjary anefa tamin’ireo niaraka tamin’i davida, ka niteny hoe: “tsy nandeha niaraka tamintsika ireo, ka tsy homentsika na inona na inona amin’ny zavatra nobaboina izay navotantsika, afa-tsy ny vady aman-janany ihany. aoka hoentiny ireny dia aleo izy handeha.”'),
  ('6ab25a2798bfadabc5e9811a', '2026-09-22T10:36:23.778Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:23.778Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 30, 2, 'ary nobaboiny ny vehivavy sy izay rehetra tao an-tanàna, hatramin’ny kely indrindra ka hatramin’ny lehibe indrindra. Tsy nisy novonoiny ho faty anefa ny olona, fa nentiny fotsiny dia lasa izy ireo nandeha.', 'ary nobaboiny ny vehivavy sy izay rehetra tao an-tanàna, hatramin’ny kely indrindra ka hatramin’ny lehibe indrindra. tsy nisy novonoiny ho faty anefa ny olona, fa nentiny fotsiny dia lasa izy ireo nandeha.'),
  ('6ab25a2798bfadabc5e98129', '2026-09-22T10:36:23.778Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:23.778Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 30, 17, 'Ary namely azy ireo i Davida, nanomboka tamin’ny mazava ratsy ka hatramin’ny takariva, mba handringanana azy tanteraka. Ary tsy nisy niangana izy ireo, afa-tsy zatovolahy efajato nitsoaka nitaingina rameva.', 'ary namely azy ireo i davida, nanomboka tamin’ny mazava ratsy ka hatramin’ny takariva, mba handringanana azy tanteraka. ary tsy nisy niangana izy ireo, afa-tsy zatovolahy efajato nitsoaka nitaingina rameva.'),
  ('6ab25a2798bfadabc5e98120', '2026-09-22T10:36:23.778Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:23.778Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 30, 8, 'Ary nanontany an’i Jehovah i Davida hoe: “Hanenjika an’ireo mpandroba ve aho? Ho tratrako ve ry zareo?” Dia hoy izy taminy: “Mandehana, enjeho, fa tsy maintsy ho tratranao ry zareo, ary hanafaka tokoa ianao.”', 'ary nanontany an’i jehovah i davida hoe: “hanenjika an’ireo mpandroba ve aho? ho tratrako ve ry zareo?” dia hoy izy taminy: “mandehana, enjeho, fa tsy maintsy ho tratranao ry zareo, ary hanafaka tokoa ianao.”'),
  ('6ab25a2798bfadabc5e9811d', '2026-09-22T10:36:23.778Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:23.778Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 30, 5, 'Voababo koa ny vadin’i Davida anankiroa, dia i Ahinoama Jezirelita sy Abigaila vadin’i Nabala Karmelita.', 'voababo koa ny vadin’i davida anankiroa, dia i ahinoama jezirelita sy abigaila vadin’i nabala karmelita.'),
  ('6ab25a2798bfadabc5e98122', '2026-09-22T10:36:23.778Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:23.778Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 30, 10, 'Ary notohizin’i Davida sy ny efajato lahy ny fanenjehana an’ireo mpandroba, fa ny roanjato lahy kosa nijanona satria reraka loatra ka tsy afa-niampita ny lohasaha falehan-driakan’i Besora.', 'ary notohizin’i davida sy ny efajato lahy ny fanenjehana an’ireo mpandroba, fa ny roanjato lahy kosa nijanona satria reraka loatra ka tsy afa-niampita ny lohasaha falehan-driakan’i besora.'),
  ('6ab25a2798bfadabc5e9811f', '2026-09-22T10:36:23.778Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:23.778Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 30, 7, 'Dia hoy i Davida tamin’i Abiatara mpisorona zanak’i Ahimeleka: “Mba ento kely etỳ amiko ny efoda!” Koa nentin’i Abiatara teo amin’i Davida ny efoda.', 'dia hoy i davida tamin’i abiatara mpisorona zanak’i ahimeleka: “mba ento kely etỳ amiko ny efoda!” koa nentin’i abiatara teo amin’i davida ny efoda.'),
  ('6ab25a2798bfadabc5e9812f', '2026-09-22T10:36:23.778Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:23.778Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 30, 23, 'Hoy anefa i Davida: “Aza manao an’izany momba ny zavatra nomen’i Jehovah antsika, ry rahalahiko, fa izy no niaro antsika sy nanolotra teo an-tanantsika an’ireo mpandroba izay nanafika antsika.', 'hoy anefa i davida: “aza manao an’izany momba ny zavatra nomen’i jehovah antsika, ry rahalahiko, fa izy no niaro antsika sy nanolotra teo an-tanantsika an’ireo mpandroba izay nanafika antsika.'),
  ('6ab25a2798bfadabc5e9812b', '2026-09-22T10:36:23.778Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:23.778Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 30, 19, 'Ary tsy nisy tsy azon’izy ireo izay azy, hatramin’ny kely indrindra ka hatramin’ny lehibe indrindra, na ny zanany lahy na ny zanany vavy na ny zavatra voababo, eny, izay rehetra lasan’ireo mpandroba. Azon’i Davida indray ny zava-drehetra.', 'ary tsy nisy tsy azon’izy ireo izay azy, hatramin’ny kely indrindra ka hatramin’ny lehibe indrindra, na ny zanany lahy na ny zanany vavy na ny zavatra voababo, eny, izay rehetra lasan’ireo mpandroba. azon’i davida indray ny zava-drehetra.'),
  ('6ab25a2798bfadabc5e98133', '2026-09-22T10:36:23.778Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:23.778Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 30, 27, 'Eny, nandefasany ny anti-panahy tany Betela, sy ny tany Ramota any atsimo, sy ny tany Jatira,', 'eny, nandefasany ny anti-panahy tany betela, sy ny tany ramota any atsimo, sy ny tany jatira,'),
  ('6ab25a2798bfadabc5e9812a', '2026-09-22T10:36:23.778Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:23.778Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 30, 18, 'Dia avotr’i Davida daholo izay nalain’ny Amalekita, ary nafahany koa ny vadiny roa.', 'dia avotr’i davida daholo izay nalain’ny amalekita, ary nafahany koa ny vadiny roa.'),
  ('6ab25a2798bfadabc5e98136', '2026-09-22T10:36:23.778Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:23.778Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 30, 30, 'sy ny tany Horma, sy ny tany Borasana, sy ny tany Ataka,', 'sy ny tany horma, sy ny tany borasana, sy ny tany ataka,'),
  ('6ab25a2798bfadabc5e98130', '2026-09-22T10:36:23.778Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:23.778Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 30, 24, 'Ary iza no hihaino izany teninareo izany? Fa tahaka ny anjaran’izay nidina tany an’ady ihany no ho anjaran’izay nipetraka teo anilan’ny entana. Samy hahazo anjara ny rehetra.”', 'ary iza no hihaino izany teninareo izany? fa tahaka ny anjaran’izay nidina tany an’ady ihany no ho anjaran’izay nipetraka teo anilan’ny entana. samy hahazo anjara ny rehetra.”'),
  ('6ab25a2798bfadabc5e98127', '2026-09-22T10:36:23.778Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:23.778Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 30, 15, 'Koa hoy i Davida: “Azonao entina midina mankany amin’ireo mpandroba ve aho?” Dia hoy izy: “Raha mianiana amiko amin’ny anaran’Andriamanitra ianao fa tsy hamono ahy ho faty, sady tsy hanolotra ahy eo an-tanan’ny tompoko, dia hoentiko midina mankany amin’ireo mpandroba.”', 'koa hoy i davida: “azonao entina midina mankany amin’ireo mpandroba ve aho?” dia hoy izy: “raha mianiana amiko amin’ny anaran’andriamanitra ianao fa tsy hamono ahy ho faty, sady tsy hanolotra ahy eo an-tanan’ny tompoko, dia hoentiko midina mankany amin’ireo mpandroba.”'),
  ('6ab25a2798bfadabc5e98123', '2026-09-22T10:36:23.778Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:23.778Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 30, 11, 'Ary nahita lehilahy ejipsianina iray tany ambanivohitra izy ireo. Dia nentiny tany amin’i Davida ralehilahy ka nomeny mofo hohaniny sy rano hosotroiny.', 'ary nahita lehilahy ejipsianina iray tany ambanivohitra izy ireo. dia nentiny tany amin’i davida ralehilahy ka nomeny mofo hohaniny sy rano hosotroiny.'),
  ('6ab25a2798bfadabc5e98126', '2026-09-22T10:36:23.778Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:23.778Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 30, 14, 'Izahay no nanafika ny faritra atsimon’ny Keretita sy ny tanin’i Joda ary ny faritra atsimon’i Kaleba. Ary nodoranay i Ziklaga.”', 'izahay no nanafika ny faritra atsimon’ny keretita sy ny tanin’i joda ary ny faritra atsimon’i kaleba. ary nodoranay i ziklaga.”'),
  ('6ab25a2798bfadabc5e98125', '2026-09-22T10:36:23.778Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:23.778Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 30, 13, 'Ary hoy i Davida taminy: “An’iza moa ianao, ary avy aiza?” Dia namaly izy hoe: “Ejipsianina aho, andevon’ny lehilahy amalekita iray. Nilaozan’ny tompoko anefa aho satria narary, telo andro lasa izay.', 'ary hoy i davida taminy: “an’iza moa ianao, ary avy aiza?” dia namaly izy hoe: “ejipsianina aho, andevon’ny lehilahy amalekita iray. nilaozan’ny tompoko anefa aho satria narary, telo andro lasa izay.'),
  ('6ab25a2798bfadabc5e98124', '2026-09-22T10:36:23.778Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:23.778Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 30, 12, 'Dia nomeny sombi-mofo vita tamin’ny aviavy noporetina izy, ary koa mofo roa vita tamin’ny voaloboka maina. Koa nihinana ralehilahy ka nody ny ainy. Efa telo andro sy telo alina mantsy izy no tsy nihinan-kanina sady tsy nisotro rano.', 'dia nomeny sombi-mofo vita tamin’ny aviavy noporetina izy, ary koa mofo roa vita tamin’ny voaloboka maina. koa nihinana ralehilahy ka nody ny ainy. efa telo andro sy telo alina mantsy izy no tsy nihinan-kanina sady tsy nisotro rano.'),
  ('6ab25a2798bfadabc5e9811b', '2026-09-22T10:36:23.778Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:23.778Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 30, 3, 'Rehefa tonga tao an-tanàna i Davida sy ny olony, dia efa main’ny afo ny tanàna ary nisy namabo ny vadin’izy ireo sy ny zanany lahy ary ny zanany vavy.', 'rehefa tonga tao an-tanàna i davida sy ny olony, dia efa main’ny afo ny tanàna ary nisy namabo ny vadin’izy ireo sy ny zanany lahy ary ny zanany vavy.'),
  ('6ab25a2798bfadabc5e98132', '2026-09-22T10:36:23.778Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:23.778Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 30, 26, 'Rehefa tonga tao Ziklaga i Davida, dia nandefasany tamin’ny zavatra azo babo ireo namany anti-panahin’i Joda, ka hoy izy: “Ity misy fanomezana ho fisaorana anareo, avy amin’ny zavatra azo babo tamin’ny fahavalon’i Jehovah.”', 'rehefa tonga tao ziklaga i davida, dia nandefasany tamin’ny zavatra azo babo ireo namany anti-panahin’i joda, ka hoy izy: “ity misy fanomezana ho fisaorana anareo, avy amin’ny zavatra azo babo tamin’ny fahavalon’i jehovah.”'),
  ('6ab25a2798bfadabc5e98119', '2026-09-22T10:36:23.778Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:23.778Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 30, 1, 'Rehefa tonga tany Ziklaga i Davida sy ny olony tamin’ny andro fahatelo, dia hitany fa notafihin’ny Amalekita ny faritra atsimo sy Ziklaga. Nasian’izy ireo i Ziklaga ka nodorany,', 'rehefa tonga tany ziklaga i davida sy ny olony tamin’ny andro fahatelo, dia hitany fa notafihin’ny amalekita ny faritra atsimo sy ziklaga. nasian’izy ireo i ziklaga ka nodorany,'),
  ('6ab25a2798bfadabc5e98131', '2026-09-22T10:36:23.778Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:23.778Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 30, 25, 'Nanomboka tamin’izay andro izay, dia napetrany ho fitsipika sy didim-pitsarana ho an’ny Israely izany, mandraka androany.', 'nanomboka tamin’izay andro izay, dia napetrany ho fitsipika sy didim-pitsarana ho an’ny israely izany, mandraka androany.'),
  ('6ab25a2798bfadabc5e9812c', '2026-09-22T10:36:23.778Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:23.778Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 30, 20, 'Koa nalain’i Davida daholo ny ondry sy ny omby, ka noroahin’ny olony teo alohan’ireo biby fiompiny. Ary hoy izy ireo: “Itony ny zavatra nobaboin’i Davida.”', 'koa nalain’i davida daholo ny ondry sy ny omby, ka noroahin’ny olony teo alohan’ireo biby fiompiny. ary hoy izy ireo: “itony ny zavatra nobaboin’i davida.”'),
  ('6ab25a2798bfadabc5e98128', '2026-09-22T10:36:23.778Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:23.778Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 30, 16, 'Koa nentiny nidina tokoa izy, ary indreo ny Amalekita niparitadritaka tetsy sy teroa nanerana an’ilay faritra, sady nihinana sy nisotro ary nanao fety noho ny zava-drehetra nobaboiny tany amin’ny tanin’ny Filistinina sy ny tanin’i Joda.', 'koa nentiny nidina tokoa izy, ary indreo ny amalekita niparitadritaka tetsy sy teroa nanerana an’ilay faritra, sady nihinana sy nisotro ary nanao fety noho ny zava-drehetra nobaboiny tany amin’ny tanin’ny filistinina sy ny tanin’i joda.'),
  ('6ab25a2798bfadabc5e98121', '2026-09-22T10:36:23.778Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:23.778Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 30, 9, 'Tonga dia niainga i Davida sy ny eninjato lahy niaraka taminy, ka nandeha hatrany amin’ny lohasaha falehan-driakan’i Besora. Ary nijanona teo ny sasany tamin’izy ireo.', 'tonga dia niainga i davida sy ny eninjato lahy niaraka taminy, ka nandeha hatrany amin’ny lohasaha falehan-driakan’i besora. ary nijanona teo ny sasany tamin’izy ireo.'),
  ('6ab25a2798bfadabc5e9811e', '2026-09-22T10:36:23.778Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:23.778Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 30, 6, 'Ary ory dia ory i Davida satria nilaza ny hitora-bato azy ny olona. Samy tezitra daholo mantsy izy ireo noho ny amin’ny zanany lahy sy ny zanany vavy. Koa nankahery tena tamin’ny alalan’i Jehovah Andriamaniny i Davida.', 'ary ory dia ory i davida satria nilaza ny hitora-bato azy ny olona. samy tezitra daholo mantsy izy ireo noho ny amin’ny zanany lahy sy ny zanany vavy. koa nankahery tena tamin’ny alalan’i jehovah andriamaniny i davida.'),
  ('6ab25a288d5faafc03260d50', '2026-09-22T10:36:24.207Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:24.207Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 31, 4, 'Koa hoy i Saoly tamin’ny mpitondra ny fiadiany: “Tsoahy ny sabatrao dia trobahy amin’iny aho, sao ho avy ireo tsy mifora ireo ka hanatrobaka ahy sy hampijalijaly ahy.” Tsy nety anefa ilay mpitondra fiadiana, satria natahotra be. Koa nalain’i Saoly ny sabatra, dia nianjerany.', 'koa hoy i saoly tamin’ny mpitondra ny fiadiany: “tsoahy ny sabatrao dia trobahy amin’iny aho, sao ho avy ireo tsy mifora ireo ka hanatrobaka ahy sy hampijalijaly ahy.” tsy nety anefa ilay mpitondra fiadiana, satria natahotra be. koa nalain’i saoly ny sabatra, dia nianjerany.'),
  ('6ab25a288d5faafc03260d56', '2026-09-22T10:36:24.207Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:24.207Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 31, 10, 'Farany, dia napetrany tao amin’ny trano nisy an’ireo sarin’i Astarta ny fiadian’i Saoly, fa ny fatiny kosa nataony teo amin’ny mandan’i Beti-sana.', 'farany, dia napetrany tao amin’ny trano nisy an’ireo sarin’i astarta ny fiadian’i saoly, fa ny fatiny kosa nataony teo amin’ny mandan’i beti-sana.'),
  ('6ab25a288d5faafc03260d57', '2026-09-22T10:36:24.207Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:24.207Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 31, 11, 'Ary ren’ny mponin’i Jabesi-gileada izay nataon’ny Filistinina tamin’i Saoly.', 'ary ren’ny mponin’i jabesi-gileada izay nataon’ny filistinina tamin’i saoly.'),
  ('6ab25a288d5faafc03260d4e', '2026-09-22T10:36:24.207Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:24.207Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 31, 2, 'Ary narahin’ny Filistinina akaiky dia akaiky i Saoly sy ny zanany lahy, ka matin’izy ireo ny zanak’i Saoly, dia i Jonatana sy Abinadaba ary Malkisoa.', 'ary narahin’ny filistinina akaiky dia akaiky i saoly sy ny zanany lahy, ka matin’izy ireo ny zanak’i saoly, dia i jonatana sy abinadaba ary malkisoa.'),
  ('6ab25a288d5faafc03260d52', '2026-09-22T10:36:24.207Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:24.207Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 31, 6, 'Dia niara-maty tamin’iny andro iny i Saoly sy ny zanany telo lahy ary ny mpitondra ny fiadiany, eny, ny olony rehetra.', 'dia niara-maty tamin’iny andro iny i saoly sy ny zanany telo lahy ary ny mpitondra ny fiadiany, eny, ny olony rehetra.'),
  ('6ab25a288d5faafc03260d4f', '2026-09-22T10:36:24.207Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:24.207Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 31, 3, 'Ary nihamafy ny fanafihana an’i Saoly. Farany, dia hitan’ireo mpandefa zana-tsipìka izy, ka voan’izy ireo ary naratra mafy.', 'ary nihamafy ny fanafihana an’i saoly. farany, dia hitan’ireo mpandefa zana-tsipìka izy, ka voan’izy ireo ary naratra mafy.'),
  ('6ab25a288d5faafc03260d58', '2026-09-22T10:36:24.207Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:24.207Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 31, 12, 'Koa niainga avy hatrany ny lehilahy mahery fo rehetra ka nandeha nandritra ny alina. Dia nalain’izy ireo teo amin’ny mandan’i Beti-sana ny fatin’i Saoly sy ny fatin’ny zanany. Ary tonga tany Jabesy izy ireo ka nodorany tany ireo faty.', 'koa niainga avy hatrany ny lehilahy mahery fo rehetra ka nandeha nandritra ny alina. dia nalain’izy ireo teo amin’ny mandan’i beti-sana ny fatin’i saoly sy ny fatin’ny zanany. ary tonga tany jabesy izy ireo ka nodorany tany ireo faty.'),
  ('6ab25a288d5faafc03260d4d', '2026-09-22T10:36:24.207Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:24.207Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 31, 1, 'Niady tamin’ny Israely ny Filistinina, ary nandositra teo anoloan’izy ireo ny Israelita. Dia niampatrampatra teny amin’ny Tendrombohitra Gilboa ny fatin’ny Israelita.', 'niady tamin’ny israely ny filistinina, ary nandositra teo anoloan’izy ireo ny israelita. dia niampatrampatra teny amin’ny tendrombohitra gilboa ny fatin’ny israelita.'),
  ('6ab25a288d5faafc03260d54', '2026-09-22T10:36:24.207Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:24.207Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 31, 8, 'Rehefa tonga haka an’izay zavatra teny amin’ireo faty ny Filistinina ny ampitson’iny, dia nahita an’i Saoly sy ny zanany telo lahy niampatra teo amin’ny Tendrombohitra Gilboa.', 'rehefa tonga haka an’izay zavatra teny amin’ireo faty ny filistinina ny ampitson’iny, dia nahita an’i saoly sy ny zanany telo lahy niampatra teo amin’ny tendrombohitra gilboa.'),
  ('6ab25a288d5faafc03260d59', '2026-09-22T10:36:24.207Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:24.207Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 31, 13, 'Avy eo dia nentiny ireo taolam-paty, ka naleviny teo ambanin’ilay hazo tamariska tany Jabesy. Ary nifady hanina fito andro izy ireo.', 'avy eo dia nentiny ireo taolam-paty, ka naleviny teo ambanin’ilay hazo tamariska tany jabesy. ary nifady hanina fito andro izy ireo.'),
  ('6ab25a288d5faafc03260d55', '2026-09-22T10:36:24.207Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:24.207Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 31, 9, 'Dia notapahin’izy ireo ny lohan’i Saoly, ary nalainy ny fiadiany. Ary naniraka olona ho any amin’ny tanin’ny Filistinina manodidina izy ireo, hilaza izany tany amin’ireo tranon’ny sampiny sy tamin’ny vahoaka.', 'dia notapahin’izy ireo ny lohan’i saoly, ary nalainy ny fiadiany. ary naniraka olona ho any amin’ny tanin’ny filistinina manodidina izy ireo, hilaza izany tany amin’ireo tranon’ny sampiny sy tamin’ny vahoaka.'),
  ('6ab25a288d5faafc03260d53', '2026-09-22T10:36:24.207Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:24.207Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 31, 7, 'Nony tazan’ny Israelita teny amin’ny faritry ny lemaka iva sy teny amin’ny faritr’i Jordana fa nandositra ny tafiky ny Israely ary maty i Saoly sy ny zanany, dia nandao ny tanànany izy ireo ka nandositra. Ary tonga tany ny Filistinina, ka nonina tany.', 'nony tazan’ny israelita teny amin’ny faritry ny lemaka iva sy teny amin’ny faritr’i jordana fa nandositra ny tafiky ny israely ary maty i saoly sy ny zanany, dia nandao ny tanànany izy ireo ka nandositra. ary tonga tany ny filistinina, ka nonina tany.'),
  ('6ab25a288d5faafc03260d51', '2026-09-22T10:36:24.207Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:24.207Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Samoela', 9, 31, 5, 'Nony hitan’ilay mpitondra fiadiana fa maty i Saoly, dia mba nianjerany koa ny sabany ka niara-maty taminy izy.', 'nony hitan’ilay mpitondra fiadiana fa maty i saoly, dia mba nianjerany koa ny sabany ka niara-maty taminy izy.'),
  ('6ab25a289d834275436084a7', '2026-09-22T10:36:24.743Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:24.743Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 1, 12, 'Ary nidradradradra nitomany izy ireo sady nifady hanina mandra-paharivan’ny andro, noho ny amin’i Saoly sy Jonatana zanany sy ny olon’i Jehovah ary ny taranak’Israely, satria lavon-tsabatra ireny.', 'ary nidradradradra nitomany izy ireo sady nifady hanina mandra-paharivan’ny andro, noho ny amin’i saoly sy jonatana zanany sy ny olon’i jehovah ary ny taranak’israely, satria lavon-tsabatra ireny.'),
  ('6ab25a289d834275436084a4', '2026-09-22T10:36:24.743Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:24.743Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 1, 9, 'Ary hoy izy: ‘Avia ange e! Vonoy ho faty aho fa mijaly be, nefa mbola ato amiko ihany ny aiko rehetra.’', 'ary hoy izy: ‘avia ange e! vonoy ho faty aho fa mijaly be, nefa mbola ato amiko ihany ny aiko rehetra.’'),
  ('6ab25a289d8342754360849f', '2026-09-22T10:36:24.743Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:24.743Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 1, 4, 'Ary hoy i Davida: “Nanahoana ny fandehany tany? Mba lazao ahy kely, azafady.” Dia hoy izy: “Vaky nandositra tamin’ny ady ny olona, ary be dia be koa no lavo ka maty. Ary maty hatramin’i Saoly sy Jonatana zanany.”', 'ary hoy i davida: “nanahoana ny fandehany tany? mba lazao ahy kely, azafady.” dia hoy izy: “vaky nandositra tamin’ny ady ny olona, ary be dia be koa no lavo ka maty. ary maty hatramin’i saoly sy jonatana zanany.”'),
  ('6ab25a289d834275436084b2', '2026-09-22T10:36:24.743Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:24.743Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 1, 23, 'Nahatehotia sy nahafinaritra i Saoly sy Jonatana fony fahavelony, Ary tsy nisaraka na teo amin’ny fahafatesany aza. Haingam-pandeha noho ny voromahery izy ireo, Ary mahery noho ny liona.', 'nahatehotia sy nahafinaritra i saoly sy jonatana fony fahavelony, ary tsy nisaraka na teo amin’ny fahafatesany aza. haingam-pandeha noho ny voromahery izy ireo, ary mahery noho ny liona.'),
  ('6ab25a289d834275436084ae', '2026-09-22T10:36:24.743Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:24.743Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 1, 19, '“Voavono teny amin’ny toerana avonao ireo tsara tarehy, ry Israely ô! Dia lavo tokoa mantsy ireo lehilahy mahery!', '“voavono teny amin’ny toerana avonao ireo tsara tarehy, ry israely ô! dia lavo tokoa mantsy ireo lehilahy mahery!'),
  ('6ab25a289d834275436084ab', '2026-09-22T10:36:24.743Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:24.743Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 1, 16, 'Ary hoy i Davida taminy: “Ianao ihany no ho tompon’andraikitra amin’ny fahafatesanao, * satria ny vavanao ihany no niampanga anao hoe: ‘Izaho no namono ho faty ny voahosotr’i Jehovah.’”', 'ary hoy i davida taminy: “ianao ihany no ho tompon’andraikitra amin’ny fahafatesanao, * satria ny vavanao ihany no niampanga anao hoe: ‘izaho no namono ho faty ny voahosotr’i jehovah.’”'),
  ('6ab25a289d834275436084b0', '2026-09-22T10:36:24.743Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:24.743Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 1, 21, 'Ry tendrombohitr’i Gilboa! Aoka tsy hisy ando na orana hilatsaka eny aminareo, ary aoka tsy hisy saha hanome vokatra hatao fanomezana masina. Fa teny no nandotoana ny ampingan’ireo mahery, Dia ny ampingan’i Saoly, ka tsy misy ampinga voahosotra menaka intsony.', 'ry tendrombohitr’i gilboa! aoka tsy hisy ando na orana hilatsaka eny aminareo, ary aoka tsy hisy saha hanome vokatra hatao fanomezana masina. fa teny no nandotoana ny ampingan’ireo mahery, dia ny ampingan’i saoly, ka tsy misy ampinga voahosotra menaka intsony.'),
  ('6ab25a289d834275436084b3', '2026-09-22T10:36:24.743Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:24.743Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 1, 24, 'Mitomania an’i Saoly, ry zanakavavin’ny Israely! Nampitafy anareo akanjo mena midorehitra nisy ravaka mirenty izy, Ary nanisy haingony volamena teny amin’ny akanjonareo.', 'mitomania an’i saoly, ry zanakavavin’ny israely! nampitafy anareo akanjo mena midorehitra nisy ravaka mirenty izy, ary nanisy haingony volamena teny amin’ny akanjonareo.'),
  ('6ab25a289d8342754360849d', '2026-09-22T10:36:24.743Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:24.743Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 1, 2, 'Ary tamin’ny andro fahatelo, dia nisy lehilahy tonga avy tany an-toby, avy tany amin’ny tafik’i Saoly. Rovitra ny akanjony ary nihosim-bovoka ny lohany. Raha vao tonga teo amin’i Davida izy, dia niondrika tamin’ny tany ka niankohoka.', 'ary tamin’ny andro fahatelo, dia nisy lehilahy tonga avy tany an-toby, avy tany amin’ny tafik’i saoly. rovitra ny akanjony ary nihosim-bovoka ny lohany. raha vao tonga teo amin’i davida izy, dia niondrika tamin’ny tany ka niankohoka.'),
  ('6ab25a289d834275436084b1', '2026-09-22T10:36:24.743Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:24.743Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 1, 22, 'Teo anoloan’ny ran’ny voavono sy ny tavin’ny mahery, Dia tsy mba nihemotra ny tsipìkan’i Jonatana, Ary tsy niveri-maina ny sabatr’i Saoly.', 'teo anoloan’ny ran’ny voavono sy ny tavin’ny mahery, dia tsy mba nihemotra ny tsipìkan’i jonatana, ary tsy niveri-maina ny sabatr’i saoly.'),
  ('6ab25a289d834275436084a1', '2026-09-22T10:36:24.743Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:24.743Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 1, 6, 'Dia hoy ilay tovolahy: “Sendra teo amin’ny Tendrombohitra Gilboa aho, no nahita an’i Saoly nitehina tamin’ny lefony. Ary nihananatona azy ny mpitondra kalesy sy ny mpitaingin-tsoavaly.', 'dia hoy ilay tovolahy: “sendra teo amin’ny tendrombohitra gilboa aho, no nahita an’i saoly nitehina tamin’ny lefony. ary nihananatona azy ny mpitondra kalesy sy ny mpitaingin-tsoavaly.'),
  ('6ab25a289d834275436084b6', '2026-09-22T10:36:24.743Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:24.743Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 1, 27, 'Dia lavo tokoa mantsy ireo mahery, Ary potika ny fitaovam-piadiana!”', 'dia lavo tokoa mantsy ireo mahery, ary potika ny fitaovam-piadiana!”'),
  ('6ab25a289d834275436084ac', '2026-09-22T10:36:24.743Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:24.743Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 1, 17, 'Ary nanao izao hira fisaonana an’i Saoly sy Jonatana zanany izao i Davida.', 'ary nanao izao hira fisaonana an’i saoly sy jonatana zanany izao i davida.'),
  ('6ab25a289d834275436084aa', '2026-09-22T10:36:24.743Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:24.743Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 1, 15, 'Dia niantso ny iray tamin’ireo zatovolahy i Davida, ka nanao hoe: “Avia! Vonoy io.” Koa novonoiny izy, ka maty.', 'dia niantso ny iray tamin’ireo zatovolahy i davida, ka nanao hoe: “avia! vonoy io.” koa novonoiny izy, ka maty.'),
  ('6ab25a289d834275436084a9', '2026-09-22T10:36:24.743Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:24.743Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 1, 14, 'Ary hoy i Davida: “Nahoana ianao no tsy natahotra ny haninjitra ny tananao hamono ny voahosotr’i Jehovah?”', 'ary hoy i davida: “nahoana ianao no tsy natahotra ny haninjitra ny tananao hamono ny voahosotr’i jehovah?”'),
  ('6ab25a289d8342754360849c', '2026-09-22T10:36:24.743Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:24.743Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 1, 1, 'Nony maty i Saoly, dia nijanona roa andro tao Ziklaga i Davida, rehefa niverina avy namely an’ireo Amalekita.', 'nony maty i saoly, dia nijanona roa andro tao ziklaga i davida, rehefa niverina avy namely an’ireo amalekita.'),
  ('6ab25a289d834275436084b5', '2026-09-22T10:36:24.743Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:24.743Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 1, 26, 'Ory noho ny aminao aho, ry Jonatana rahalahiko, Tena nahafinaritra ahy ianao. Ary nihoatra noho ny fitiavan’ny vehivavy ny fitiavanao ahy.', 'ory noho ny aminao aho, ry jonatana rahalahiko, tena nahafinaritra ahy ianao. ary nihoatra noho ny fitiavan’ny vehivavy ny fitiavanao ahy.'),
  ('6ab25a289d834275436084b4', '2026-09-22T10:36:24.743Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:24.743Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 1, 25, 'Dia lavo tany an’ady tokoa mantsy ireo mahery! Voavono teny amin’ny toerana avonao i Jonatana!', 'dia lavo tany an’ady tokoa mantsy ireo mahery! voavono teny amin’ny toerana avonao i jonatana!'),
  ('6ab25a289d8342754360849e', '2026-09-22T10:36:24.743Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:24.743Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 1, 3, 'Ary hoy i Davida taminy: “Avy aiza ianao?” Dia hoy izy: “Nandositra avy any an-tobin’ny Israely aho.”', 'ary hoy i davida taminy: “avy aiza ianao?” dia hoy izy: “nandositra avy any an-tobin’ny israely aho.”'),
  ('6ab25a289d834275436084a6', '2026-09-22T10:36:24.743Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:24.743Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 1, 11, 'Dia nandrovitra ny akanjony i Davida, ary samy nanao toy izany koa ny lehilahy rehetra niaraka taminy.', 'dia nandrovitra ny akanjony i davida, ary samy nanao toy izany koa ny lehilahy rehetra niaraka taminy.'),
  ('6ab25a289d834275436084a3', '2026-09-22T10:36:24.743Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:24.743Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 1, 8, 'Ary hoy izy: ‘Iza moa ianao?’ Dia hoy aho: ‘Amalekita aho.’', 'ary hoy izy: ‘iza moa ianao?’ dia hoy aho: ‘amalekita aho.’'),
  ('6ab25a289d834275436084a5', '2026-09-22T10:36:24.743Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:24.743Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 1, 10, 'Koa nanatona azy aho ka namono azy ho faty, satria fantatro fa tsy ho velona intsony izy rehefa lavo noho ny ratra nahazo azy. Dia nalaiko ny diadema teo amin’ny lohany sy ny brasele teny an-tsandriny, mba hoentiko atỳ amin’ny tompoko.”', 'koa nanatona azy aho ka namono azy ho faty, satria fantatro fa tsy ho velona intsony izy rehefa lavo noho ny ratra nahazo azy. dia nalaiko ny diadema teo amin’ny lohany sy ny brasele teny an-tsandriny, mba hoentiko atỳ amin’ny tompoko.”'),
  ('6ab25a289d834275436084a2', '2026-09-22T10:36:24.743Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:24.743Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 1, 7, 'Dia niherika izy ka nahita ahy, ary niantso ahy. Dia hoy aho: ‘Intỳ aho!’', 'dia niherika izy ka nahita ahy, ary niantso ahy. dia hoy aho: ‘intỳ aho!’'),
  ('6ab25a289d834275436084a0', '2026-09-22T10:36:24.743Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:24.743Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 1, 5, 'Ary hoy i Davida tamin’ilay tovolahy niresaka taminy: “Ahoana no ahafantaranao fa tena maty i Saoly sy Jonatana zanany?”', 'ary hoy i davida tamin’ilay tovolahy niresaka taminy: “ahoana no ahafantaranao fa tena maty i saoly sy jonatana zanany?”'),
  ('6ab25a289d834275436084ad', '2026-09-22T10:36:24.743Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:24.743Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 1, 18, 'Nilaza koa izy fa tokony hampianarina ny taranak’i Joda io hira antsoina hoe “Ilay Tsipìka” io, izay voasoratra toy izao ao amin’ny bokin’i Jasara:', 'nilaza koa izy fa tokony hampianarina ny taranak’i joda io hira antsoina hoe “ilay tsipìka” io, izay voasoratra toy izao ao amin’ny bokin’i jasara:'),
  ('6ab25a289d834275436084a8', '2026-09-22T10:36:24.743Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:24.743Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 1, 13, 'Ary hoy i Davida tamin’ilay tovolahy: “Avy aiza moa ianao?” Dia hoy izy: “Zanaka Amalekita mpivahiny eto aho.”', 'ary hoy i davida tamin’ilay tovolahy: “avy aiza moa ianao?” dia hoy izy: “zanaka amalekita mpivahiny eto aho.”'),
  ('6ab25a289d834275436084af', '2026-09-22T10:36:24.743Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:24.743Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 1, 20, 'Aza lazaina any Gata izany, Ary aza ambara eny amin’ny lalan’i Askelona, Sao hifaly ny zanakavavin’ny Filistinina, Sao hiravoravo ny zanakavavin’ireo tsy mifora.', 'aza lazaina any gata izany, ary aza ambara eny amin’ny lalan’i askelona, sao hifaly ny zanakavavin’ny filistinina, sao hiravoravo ny zanakavavin’ireo tsy mifora.'),
  ('6ab25a29333176739517380b', '2026-09-22T10:36:25.207Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:25.207Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 2, 26, 'Ary niantso an’i Joaba i Abnera ka niteny hoe: “Handrapaka tsy misy farany ve ny sabatra? Tsy fantatrao angaha fa fahoriana no hiafaran’izao? Koa rahoviana ianao vao hiteny ny olona mba hiverina ka tsy hanenjika ny rahalahiny intsony?”', 'ary niantso an’i joaba i abnera ka niteny hoe: “handrapaka tsy misy farany ve ny sabatra? tsy fantatrao angaha fa fahoriana no hiafaran’izao? koa rahoviana ianao vao hiteny ny olona mba hiverina ka tsy hanenjika ny rahalahiny intsony?”'),
  ('6ab25a293331767395173806', '2026-09-22T10:36:25.207Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:25.207Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 2, 21, 'Ary hoy i Abnera: “Mivilia miankavanana na miankavia ka misambora zatovolahy iray, dia alaivo ho anao izay eny aminy.” Tsy nety nivily anefa i Asahela fa nanenjika azy foana.', 'ary hoy i abnera: “mivilia miankavanana na miankavia ka misambora zatovolahy iray, dia alaivo ho anao izay eny aminy.” tsy nety nivily anefa i asahela fa nanenjika azy foana.'),
  ('6ab25a293331767395173805', '2026-09-22T10:36:25.207Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:25.207Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 2, 20, 'Farany, dia niherika i Abnera ka niteny hoe: “Ianao ve io, ry Asahela?” Dia hoy izy: “Izaho ity.”', 'farany, dia niherika i abnera ka niteny hoe: “ianao ve io, ry asahela?” dia hoy izy: “izaho ity.”'),
  ('6ab25a293331767395173802', '2026-09-22T10:36:25.207Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:25.207Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 2, 17, 'Nafotaka ny ady tamin’iny andro iny, ka resy teo anoloan’ny mpanompon’i Davida i Abnera sy ny lehilahy israelita.', 'nafotaka ny ady tamin’iny andro iny, ka resy teo anoloan’ny mpanompon’i davida i abnera sy ny lehilahy israelita.'),
  ('6ab25a2933317673951737fb', '2026-09-22T10:36:25.207Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:25.207Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 2, 10, 'Efapolo taona i Isboseta zanak’i Saoly fony izy lasa mpanjakan’ny Israely, ary roa taona no nanjakany. Fa ny taranak’i Joda ihany no nomba an’i Davida.', 'efapolo taona i isboseta zanak’i saoly fony izy lasa mpanjakan’ny israely, ary roa taona no nanjakany. fa ny taranak’i joda ihany no nomba an’i davida.'),
  ('6ab25a2933317673951737f4', '2026-09-22T10:36:25.207Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:25.207Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 2, 3, 'Ary nentin’i Davida niakatra koa ny lehilahy niaraka taminy, mbamin’ny ankohonan’izy ireo avy. Dia nanorim-ponenana tao amin’ireo tanàna tany amin’ny faritr’i Hebrona izy ireo.', 'ary nentin’i davida niakatra koa ny lehilahy niaraka taminy, mbamin’ny ankohonan’izy ireo avy. dia nanorim-ponenana tao amin’ireo tanàna tany amin’ny faritr’i hebrona izy ireo.'),
  ('6ab25a29333176739517380e', '2026-09-22T10:36:25.207Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:25.207Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 2, 29, 'Ary namakivaky an’i Araba iny alina tontolo iny i Abnera sy ny olony, ka niampita ny Reniranon’i Jordana, ary namakivaky an’ilay lohasaha manontolo, dia tonga tany Mahanaima tamin’ny farany.', 'ary namakivaky an’i araba iny alina tontolo iny i abnera sy ny olony, ka niampita ny reniranon’i jordana, ary namakivaky an’ilay lohasaha manontolo, dia tonga tany mahanaima tamin’ny farany.'),
  ('6ab25a293331767395173804', '2026-09-22T10:36:25.207Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:25.207Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 2, 19, 'Dia nanenjika an’i Abnera i Asahela, ka tsy nivily niankavanana na niankavia fa nanaraka azy foana.', 'dia nanenjika an’i abnera i asahela, ka tsy nivily niankavanana na niankavia fa nanaraka azy foana.'),
  ('6ab25a293331767395173803', '2026-09-22T10:36:25.207Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:25.207Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 2, 18, 'Tany koa izy telo mirahalahy zanak’i Zeroia: I Joaba sy Abisay ary Asahela. Ary haingam-pandeha toy ny gazela any an-tsaha i Asahela.', 'tany koa izy telo mirahalahy zanak’i zeroia: i joaba sy abisay ary asahela. ary haingam-pandeha toy ny gazela any an-tsaha i asahela.'),
  ('6ab25a29333176739517380a', '2026-09-22T10:36:25.207Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:25.207Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 2, 25, 'Ary niangona ho antokony iray nanodidina an’i Abnera ny taranak’i Benjamina. Dia nijoro teo an-tampon-kavoana izy ireo.', 'ary niangona ho antokony iray nanodidina an’i abnera ny taranak’i benjamina. dia nijoro teo an-tampon-kavoana izy ireo.'),
  ('6ab25a2933317673951737fe', '2026-09-22T10:36:25.207Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:25.207Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 2, 13, 'Ary nankany amin’ny dobon’i Gibeona koa i Joaba zanak’i Zeroia sy ny mpanompon’i Davida, ka nihaona teo ny roa tonta. Ary samy naka toerana teo izy ireo, ka ny iray teo amin’ny andanin’ilay dobo, ary ny iray kosa teo amin’ny ankilany.', 'ary nankany amin’ny dobon’i gibeona koa i joaba zanak’i zeroia sy ny mpanompon’i davida, ka nihaona teo ny roa tonta. ary samy naka toerana teo izy ireo, ka ny iray teo amin’ny andanin’ilay dobo, ary ny iray kosa teo amin’ny ankilany.'),
  ('6ab25a2933317673951737fc', '2026-09-22T10:36:25.207Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:25.207Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 2, 11, 'Fito taona sy enim-bolana no andro nanjakan’i Davida tao Hebrona tamin’ny taranak’i Joda.', 'fito taona sy enim-bolana no andro nanjakan’i davida tao hebrona tamin’ny taranak’i joda.'),
  ('6ab25a293331767395173808', '2026-09-22T10:36:25.207Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:25.207Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 2, 23, 'Tsy nety nivily mihitsy anefa izy. Koa nasian’i Abnera tamin’ny vodilefona ny kibony, ka niboroaka teo andamosiny ny lefona. Dia lavo teo izy ka maty teo amin’izay nisy azy. Ary nijanona izay rehetra tonga teo amin’ilay toerana nahalavoan’i Asahela sy nahafatesany.', 'tsy nety nivily mihitsy anefa izy. koa nasian’i abnera tamin’ny vodilefona ny kibony, ka niboroaka teo andamosiny ny lefona. dia lavo teo izy ka maty teo amin’izay nisy azy. ary nijanona izay rehetra tonga teo amin’ilay toerana nahalavoan’i asahela sy nahafatesany.'),
  ('6ab25a293331767395173801', '2026-09-22T10:36:25.207Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:25.207Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 2, 16, 'Ary nifampihazona tamin’ny lohany izy ireo, ka nifanindron-tsabatra teo amin’ny tehezany, dia niara-maty. Koa nantsoina hoe Helkata-hazorima io toerana io, izay any Gibeona.', 'ary nifampihazona tamin’ny lohany izy ireo, ka nifanindron-tsabatra teo amin’ny tehezany, dia niara-maty. koa nantsoina hoe helkata-hazorima io toerana io, izay any gibeona.'),
  ('6ab25a2933317673951737f6', '2026-09-22T10:36:25.207Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:25.207Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 2, 5, 'Koa nandefa iraka ho any amin’ireo lehilahy tany Jabesi-gileada i Davida, hilaza hoe: “Hotahin’i Jehovah anie ianareo, satria naneho izany hatsaram-panahy feno fitiavana izany tamin’i Saoly tomponareo, ka nandevina azy!', 'koa nandefa iraka ho any amin’ireo lehilahy tany jabesi-gileada i davida, hilaza hoe: “hotahin’i jehovah anie ianareo, satria naneho izany hatsaram-panahy feno fitiavana izany tamin’i saoly tomponareo, ka nandevina azy!'),
  ('6ab25a29333176739517380f', '2026-09-22T10:36:25.207Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:25.207Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 2, 30, 'Fa i Joaba kosa niverina ka tsy nanenjika an’i Abnera intsony. Dia novoriny ny olona rehetra. Ary sivy ambin’ny folo lahy, niampy an’i Asahela, no tsy teo intsony tamin’ny mpanompon’i Davida.', 'fa i joaba kosa niverina ka tsy nanenjika an’i abnera intsony. dia novoriny ny olona rehetra. ary sivy ambin’ny folo lahy, niampy an’i asahela, no tsy teo intsony tamin’ny mpanompon’i davida.'),
  ('6ab25a2933317673951737fa', '2026-09-22T10:36:25.207Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:25.207Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 2, 9, 'mba hatao mpanjakan’i Gileada sy ny Asorita, sy Jezirela sy Efraima ary Benjamina, eny, mpanjakan’ny Israely manontolo.', 'mba hatao mpanjakan’i gileada sy ny asorita, sy jezirela sy efraima ary benjamina, eny, mpanjakan’ny israely manontolo.'),
  ('6ab25a2933317673951737f3', '2026-09-22T10:36:25.207Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:25.207Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 2, 2, 'Koa niakatra nankany i Davida mbamin’ny vadiny roa, dia i Ahinoama Jezirelita sy Abigaila vadin’i Nabala Karmelita.', 'koa niakatra nankany i davida mbamin’ny vadiny roa, dia i ahinoama jezirelita sy abigaila vadin’i nabala karmelita.'),
  ('6ab25a293331767395173810', '2026-09-22T10:36:25.207Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:25.207Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 2, 31, 'Enimpolo sy telonjato kosa no matin’ny mpanompon’i Davida, tamin’ny olon’i Benjamina sy ny olon’i Abnera.', 'enimpolo sy telonjato kosa no matin’ny mpanompon’i davida, tamin’ny olon’i benjamina sy ny olon’i abnera.'),
  ('6ab25a293331767395173807', '2026-09-22T10:36:25.207Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:25.207Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 2, 22, 'Koa hoy indray i Abnera tamin’i Asahela: “Efa hoe mivilia fa aza manaraka ahy, sao hasiako ianao ka ho faty hiampatra amin’ny tany. Dia hataoko ahoana no fijery an’i Joaba rahalahinao?”', 'koa hoy indray i abnera tamin’i asahela: “efa hoe mivilia fa aza manaraka ahy, sao hasiako ianao ka ho faty hiampatra amin’ny tany. dia hataoko ahoana no fijery an’i joaba rahalahinao?”'),
  ('6ab25a293331767395173809', '2026-09-22T10:36:25.207Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:25.207Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 2, 24, 'Koa nanenjika an’i Abnera i Joaba sy Abisay. Nony nilentika ny masoandro, dia tonga teo amin’ny havoanan’i Ama tandrifin’i Gia, eo amin’ny lalana mankany amin’ny tany efitr’i Gibeona, izy ireo.', 'koa nanenjika an’i abnera i joaba sy abisay. nony nilentika ny masoandro, dia tonga teo amin’ny havoanan’i ama tandrifin’i gia, eo amin’ny lalana mankany amin’ny tany efitr’i gibeona, izy ireo.'),
  ('6ab25a2933317673951737f7', '2026-09-22T10:36:25.207Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:25.207Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 2, 6, 'Ary haneho hatsaram-panahy feno fitiavana aminareo anie i Jehovah, sady hasehony aminareo koa anie fa mendri-pitokisana izy! Ary izaho koa mba hanao soa toy izany aminareo, noho ny nanaovanareo izany zavatra izany.', 'ary haneho hatsaram-panahy feno fitiavana aminareo anie i jehovah, sady hasehony aminareo koa anie fa mendri-pitokisana izy! ary izaho koa mba hanao soa toy izany aminareo, noho ny nanaovanareo izany zavatra izany.');
INSERT INTO "bible_verses" ("id", "created_date", "updated_date", "created_by_id", "created_by", "translation", "book", "bookOrder", "chapter", "verse", "text", "normalizedText") VALUES
  ('6ab25a293331767395173800', '2026-09-22T10:36:25.207Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:25.207Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 2, 15, 'Koa nitsangana izy ireo ka nifidy roa ambin’ny folo avy tamin’i Benjamina sy Isboseta zanak’i Saoly, ary roa ambin’ny folo avy tamin’ny mpanompon’i Davida.', 'koa nitsangana izy ireo ka nifidy roa ambin’ny folo avy tamin’i benjamina sy isboseta zanak’i saoly, ary roa ambin’ny folo avy tamin’ny mpanompon’i davida.'),
  ('6ab25a2933317673951737ff', '2026-09-22T10:36:25.207Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:25.207Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 2, 14, 'Farany, dia hoy i Abnera tamin’i Joaba: “Aleo hitsangana ireo zatovolahy, azafady, ka hiady eto anatrehantsika.” Dia hoy i Joaba: “Aleo àry izy ireo hitsangana.”', 'farany, dia hoy i abnera tamin’i joaba: “aleo hitsangana ireo zatovolahy, azafady, ka hiady eto anatrehantsika.” dia hoy i joaba: “aleo àry izy ireo hitsangana.”'),
  ('6ab25a2933317673951737f8', '2026-09-22T10:36:25.207Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:25.207Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 2, 7, 'Koa mahereza ary aoka hahery fo ianareo, fa efa maty i Saoly tomponareo, ary izaho no nohosoran’ny taranak’i Joda ho mpanjakan’izy ireo.”', 'koa mahereza ary aoka hahery fo ianareo, fa efa maty i saoly tomponareo, ary izaho no nohosoran’ny taranak’i joda ho mpanjakan’izy ireo.”'),
  ('6ab25a2933317673951737f2', '2026-09-22T10:36:25.207Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:25.207Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 2, 1, 'Taorian’izay, dia nanontany an’i Jehovah i Davida hoe: “Hiakatra ho any amin’ny tanàna iray any Joda ve aho?” Dia hoy i Jehovah: “Miakara.” Ary hoy i Davida: “Any aninona no hiakarako?” Dia hoy izy: “Any Hebrona.”', 'taorian’izay, dia nanontany an’i jehovah i davida hoe: “hiakatra ho any amin’ny tanàna iray any joda ve aho?” dia hoy i jehovah: “miakara.” ary hoy i davida: “any aninona no hiakarako?” dia hoy izy: “any hebrona.”'),
  ('6ab25a2933317673951737f9', '2026-09-22T10:36:25.207Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:25.207Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 2, 8, 'Ary i Abnera zanak’i Nera lehiben’ny tafik’i Saoly dia naka an’i Isboseta zanak’i Saoly, ka nitondra azy niampita nankany Mahanaima,', 'ary i abnera zanak’i nera lehiben’ny tafik’i saoly dia naka an’i isboseta zanak’i saoly, ka nitondra azy niampita nankany mahanaima,'),
  ('6ab25a2933317673951737f5', '2026-09-22T10:36:25.207Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:25.207Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 2, 4, 'Ary tonga ireo lehilahy anisan’ny fokon’i Joda, ka tao no nanosorany an’i Davida ho mpanjakan’ny taranak’i Joda. Ary nisy tonga nilaza tamin’i Davida hoe: “Ireo lehilahy any Jabesi-gileada no nandevina an’i Saoly.”', 'ary tonga ireo lehilahy anisan’ny fokon’i joda, ka tao no nanosorany an’i davida ho mpanjakan’ny taranak’i joda. ary nisy tonga nilaza tamin’i davida hoe: “ireo lehilahy any jabesi-gileada no nandevina an’i saoly.”'),
  ('6ab25a2933317673951737fd', '2026-09-22T10:36:25.207Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:25.207Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 2, 12, 'Ary nivoaka avy tao Mahanaima i Abnera zanak’i Nera sy ny mpanompon’i Isboseta zanak’i Saoly, ka nankany Gibeona.', 'ary nivoaka avy tao mahanaima i abnera zanak’i nera sy ny mpanompon’i isboseta zanak’i saoly, ka nankany gibeona.'),
  ('6ab25a29333176739517380c', '2026-09-22T10:36:25.207Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:25.207Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 2, 27, 'Dia hoy i Joaba: “Raha mbola velona koa Andriamanitra, dia tsoriko fa raha tsy niteny ianao, dia rahampitso maraina ny olona vao ho najanona tsy hanenjika ny rahalahiny intsony.”', 'dia hoy i joaba: “raha mbola velona koa andriamanitra, dia tsoriko fa raha tsy niteny ianao, dia rahampitso maraina ny olona vao ho najanona tsy hanenjika ny rahalahiny intsony.”'),
  ('6ab25a293331767395173811', '2026-09-22T10:36:25.207Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:25.207Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 2, 32, 'Ary nentin’izy ireo i Asahela ka naleviny tao amin’ny fasan-drainy tao Betlehema. Ary nandeha nandritra ny alina i Joaba sy ny olony, ka tonga tany Hebrona rehefa nazava ny andro.', 'ary nentin’izy ireo i asahela ka naleviny tao amin’ny fasan-drainy tao betlehema. ary nandeha nandritra ny alina i joaba sy ny olony, ka tonga tany hebrona rehefa nazava ny andro.'),
  ('6ab25a29333176739517380d', '2026-09-22T10:36:25.207Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:25.207Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 2, 28, 'Ary notsofin’i Joaba ny anjombona, dia nijanona ny olona rehetra ka tsy nanenjika ny Israely intsony, ary tsy nanohy ny ady intsony koa.', 'ary notsofin’i joaba ny anjombona, dia nijanona ny olona rehetra ka tsy nanenjika ny israely intsony, ary tsy nanohy ny ady intsony koa.'),
  ('6ab25a2b184c66283029324a', '2026-09-22T10:36:27.795Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:27.795Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 3, 31, 'Dia hoy i Davida tamin’i Joaba sy ny olona rehetra niaraka taminy: “Rovito ny akanjonareo ary misikìna lamba gony, ka midradradradrà eo alohan’i Abnera.” Ary nandeha taorian’ilay filanjana faty i Davida Mpanjaka.', 'dia hoy i davida tamin’i joaba sy ny olona rehetra niaraka taminy: “rovito ny akanjonareo ary misikìna lamba gony, ka midradradradrà eo alohan’i abnera.” ary nandeha taorian’ilay filanjana faty i davida mpanjaka.'),
  ('6ab25a2b184c662830293249', '2026-09-22T10:36:27.795Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:27.795Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 3, 30, 'Koa i Joaba sy Abisay rahalahiny no namono an’i Abnera, noho ny namonoany ho faty an’i Asahela rahalahin’izy ireo tany an’ady, tany Gibeona.', 'koa i joaba sy abisay rahalahiny no namono an’i abnera, noho ny namonoany ho faty an’i asahela rahalahin’izy ireo tany an’ady, tany gibeona.'),
  ('6ab25a2b184c662830293240', '2026-09-22T10:36:27.795Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:27.795Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 3, 21, 'Ary hoy i Abnera tamin’i Davida: “Aleo aho handeha hanangona ny Israely rehetra ho atỳ amin’ny mpanjaka tompoko, mba hanaovan’izy ireo fifanekena aminao. Dia ho mpanjaka eo amin’izay rehetra irinao ianao.” Koa nalefan’i Davida i Abnera, ka lasa soa aman-tsara.', 'ary hoy i abnera tamin’i davida: “aleo aho handeha hanangona ny israely rehetra ho atỳ amin’ny mpanjaka tompoko, mba hanaovan’izy ireo fifanekena aminao. dia ho mpanjaka eo amin’izay rehetra irinao ianao.” koa nalefan’i davida i abnera, ka lasa soa aman-tsara.'),
  ('6ab25a2b184c66283029324e', '2026-09-22T10:36:27.795Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:27.795Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 3, 35, 'Ary nanatona mba hanome mofo fampiononana ho an’i Davida ny olona rehetra, tamin’iny andro iny ihany. Nianiana anefa i Davida hoe: “Hofaizin’Andriamanitra anie aho, * ary mihoatra noho izany aza, raha hihinana mofo na zavatra hafa na inona na inona, alohan’ny hilentehan’ny masoandro!”', 'ary nanatona mba hanome mofo fampiononana ho an’i davida ny olona rehetra, tamin’iny andro iny ihany. nianiana anefa i davida hoe: “hofaizin’andriamanitra anie aho, * ary mihoatra noho izany aza, raha hihinana mofo na zavatra hafa na inona na inona, alohan’ny hilentehan’ny masoandro!”'),
  ('6ab25a2b184c66283029324c', '2026-09-22T10:36:27.795Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:27.795Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 3, 33, 'Ary nanao izao hira fisaonana an’i Abnera izao ny mpanjaka: “Toy ny fahafatesan’ny olona tsy misaina ve no tokony ho nahafatesan’i Abnera?', 'ary nanao izao hira fisaonana an’i abnera izao ny mpanjaka: “toy ny fahafatesan’ny olona tsy misaina ve no tokony ho nahafatesan’i abnera?'),
  ('6ab25a2b184c66283029323d', '2026-09-22T10:36:27.795Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:27.795Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 3, 18, 'Koa manaova zavatra ankehitriny, fa i Jehovah no efa nilaza tamin’i Davida hoe: ‘Ny tanan’i Davida mpanompoko no hamonjeko ny Israely oloko eo an-tanan’ny Filistinina sy eo an-tanan’ny fahavalony rehetra.’”', 'koa manaova zavatra ankehitriny, fa i jehovah no efa nilaza tamin’i davida hoe: ‘ny tanan’i davida mpanompoko no hamonjeko ny israely oloko eo an-tanan’ny filistinina sy eo an-tanan’ny fahavalony rehetra.’”'),
  ('6ab25a2b184c66283029322d', '2026-09-22T10:36:27.795Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:27.795Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 3, 2, 'Nandritra izany fotoana izany, dia niteraka zazalahy i Davida tany Hebrona, ka ny lahimatoany dia i Amnona, zanany tamin’i Ahinoama Jezirelita.', 'nandritra izany fotoana izany, dia niteraka zazalahy i davida tany hebrona, ka ny lahimatoany dia i amnona, zanany tamin’i ahinoama jezirelita.'),
  ('6ab25a2b184c66283029324b', '2026-09-22T10:36:27.795Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:27.795Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 3, 32, 'Dia nalevin’izy ireo tao Hebrona i Abnera. Ary nidradradradra nitomany teo amin’ny fasan’i Abnera ny mpanjaka. Nitomany koa ny olona rehetra.', 'dia nalevin’izy ireo tao hebrona i abnera. ary nidradradradra nitomany teo amin’ny fasan’i abnera ny mpanjaka. nitomany koa ny olona rehetra.'),
  ('6ab25a2b184c662830293248', '2026-09-22T10:36:27.795Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:27.795Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 3, 29, 'I Joaba sy ny ankohonan-drainy manontolo anie no ho tompon’andraikitra amin’izany! Ary aoka hisy foana eo amin’ny taranak’i Joaba ny lehilahy misy tsiranoka mivoaka amin’ny filahiany, na olona boka, na lehilahy mihazona ny hazo fangoronana kofehy, na olona lavon-tsabatra, na olona tsy ampy sakafo!”', 'i joaba sy ny ankohonan-drainy manontolo anie no ho tompon’andraikitra amin’izany! ary aoka hisy foana eo amin’ny taranak’i joaba ny lehilahy misy tsiranoka mivoaka amin’ny filahiany, na olona boka, na lehilahy mihazona ny hazo fangoronana kofehy, na olona lavon-tsabatra, na olona tsy ampy sakafo!”'),
  ('6ab25a2b184c662830293242', '2026-09-22T10:36:27.795Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:27.795Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 3, 23, 'Ary tonga i Joaba sy ny tafika manontolo niaraka taminy. Dia nisy nilaza tamin’i Joaba hoe: “Tonga tao amin’ny mpanjaka i Abnera zanak’i Nera, nefa nalefany soa aman-tsara.”', 'ary tonga i joaba sy ny tafika manontolo niaraka taminy. dia nisy nilaza tamin’i joaba hoe: “tonga tao amin’ny mpanjaka i abnera zanak’i nera, nefa nalefany soa aman-tsara.”'),
  ('6ab25a2b184c662830293236', '2026-09-22T10:36:27.795Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:27.795Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 3, 11, 'Dia tsy nahavaly an’i Abnera izy na indraim-bava aza, satria natahotra azy.', 'dia tsy nahavaly an’i abnera izy na indraim-bava aza, satria natahotra azy.'),
  ('6ab25a2b184c66283029322e', '2026-09-22T10:36:27.795Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:27.795Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 3, 3, 'Ny faharoa dia i Kileaba, zanany tamin’i Abigaila, ilay vadin’i Nabala Karmelita, ary ny fahatelo dia i Absaloma zanak’i Maka, zanakavavin’i Talmay mpanjakan’i Gesora.', 'ny faharoa dia i kileaba, zanany tamin’i abigaila, ilay vadin’i nabala karmelita, ary ny fahatelo dia i absaloma zanak’i maka, zanakavavin’i talmay mpanjakan’i gesora.'),
  ('6ab25a2b184c66283029323e', '2026-09-22T10:36:27.795Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:27.795Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 3, 19, 'Niresaka tamin’ny Benjaminita * koa i Abnera. Avy eo dia lasa koa izy niresaka tamin’i Davida tany Hebrona, momba ny zava-drehetra sitraky ny Israely sy ny taranak’i Benjamina manontolo.', 'niresaka tamin’ny benjaminita * koa i abnera. avy eo dia lasa koa izy niresaka tamin’i davida tany hebrona, momba ny zava-drehetra sitraky ny israely sy ny taranak’i benjamina manontolo.'),
  ('6ab25a2b184c662830293234', '2026-09-22T10:36:27.795Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:27.795Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 3, 9, 'Hofaizin’Andriamanitra anie i Abnera, * ary mihoatra noho izany aza, raha tsy araka izay nianianan’i Jehovah tamin’i Davida no hataoko aminy!', 'hofaizin’andriamanitra anie i abnera, * ary mihoatra noho izany aza, raha tsy araka izay nianianan’i jehovah tamin’i davida no hataoko aminy!'),
  ('6ab25a2b184c662830293245', '2026-09-22T10:36:27.795Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:27.795Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 3, 26, 'Dia niala teo amin’i Davida i Joaba, ka nandefa iraka hanaraka an’i Abnera. Teo amin’ny lavaka fanangonan-dranon’i Siraha i Abnera no nilazan’izy ireo mba hiverina. Ary tsy fantatr’i Davida izany.', 'dia niala teo amin’i davida i joaba, ka nandefa iraka hanaraka an’i abnera. teo amin’ny lavaka fanangonan-dranon’i siraha i abnera no nilazan’izy ireo mba hiverina. ary tsy fantatr’i davida izany.'),
  ('6ab25a2b184c662830293243', '2026-09-22T10:36:27.795Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:27.795Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 3, 24, 'Koa nankao amin’ny mpanjaka i Joaba, ka niteny hoe: “Fa inona ity nataonao? Tonga teto aminao i Abnera, ka nahoana no navelanao handeha fotsiny?', 'koa nankao amin’ny mpanjaka i joaba, ka niteny hoe: “fa inona ity nataonao? tonga teto aminao i abnera, ka nahoana no navelanao handeha fotsiny?'),
  ('6ab25a2b184c66283029323f', '2026-09-22T10:36:27.795Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:27.795Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 3, 20, 'Rehefa tonga tany amin’i Davida tao Hebrona i Abnera sy ny roapolo lahy niaraka taminy, dia nanaovan’i Davida fety.', 'rehefa tonga tany amin’i davida tao hebrona i abnera sy ny roapolo lahy niaraka taminy, dia nanaovan’i davida fety.'),
  ('6ab25a2b184c662830293238', '2026-09-22T10:36:27.795Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:27.795Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 3, 13, 'Dia hoy i Davida: “Mety izany! Hanao fifanekena aminao aho, nefa misy zavatra iray monja angatahiko aminao: ‘Tsy mahazo mahita ny tavako ianao raha tsy mitondra an’i Mikala zanakavavin’i Saoly rehefa tonga hifanatri-tava amiko.’”', 'dia hoy i davida: “mety izany! hanao fifanekena aminao aho, nefa misy zavatra iray monja angatahiko aminao: ‘tsy mahazo mahita ny tavako ianao raha tsy mitondra an’i mikala zanakavavin’i saoly rehefa tonga hifanatri-tava amiko.’”'),
  ('6ab25a2b184c662830293231', '2026-09-22T10:36:27.795Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:27.795Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 3, 6, 'Raha mbola nitohy ny ady teo amin’ny taranak’i Saoly sy ny ankohonan’i Davida, dia nanamafy hatrany ny toerany teo amin’ny taranak’i Saoly i Abnera.', 'raha mbola nitohy ny ady teo amin’ny taranak’i saoly sy ny ankohonan’i davida, dia nanamafy hatrany ny toerany teo amin’ny taranak’i saoly i abnera.'),
  ('6ab25a2b184c662830293247', '2026-09-22T10:36:27.795Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:27.795Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 3, 28, 'Raha vao nandre izany i Davida, dia hoy izy: “Fantatr’i Jehovah fa tsy meloka ho nandatsaka ny ran’i Abnera zanak’i Nera izaho sy ny fanjakako, eny, tsy meloka mandritra ny fotoana tsy voafetra.', 'raha vao nandre izany i davida, dia hoy izy: “fantatr’i jehovah fa tsy meloka ho nandatsaka ny ran’i abnera zanak’i nera izaho sy ny fanjakako, eny, tsy meloka mandritra ny fotoana tsy voafetra.'),
  ('6ab25a2b184c662830293246', '2026-09-22T10:36:27.795Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:27.795Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 3, 27, 'Rehefa tafaverina tao Hebrona i Abnera, dia nentin’i Joaba nihataka kely nankao am-bavahady mba hiresahany mangingina. Teo anefa izy no nasiany teo amin’ny kibony, ka maty noho ny amin’ny ran’i Asahela rahalahin’i Joaba.', 'rehefa tafaverina tao hebrona i abnera, dia nentin’i joaba nihataka kely nankao am-bavahady mba hiresahany mangingina. teo anefa izy no nasiany teo amin’ny kibony, ka maty noho ny amin’ny ran’i asahela rahalahin’i joaba.'),
  ('6ab25a2b184c66283029323c', '2026-09-22T10:36:27.795Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:27.795Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 3, 17, 'Ary niresaka tamin’ny anti-panahin’ny Israely i Abnera, nanao hoe: “Omaly sy hatramin’izay ianareo no efa naniry an’i Davida ho mpanjakanareo.', 'ary niresaka tamin’ny anti-panahin’ny israely i abnera, nanao hoe: “omaly sy hatramin’izay ianareo no efa naniry an’i davida ho mpanjakanareo.'),
  ('6ab25a2b184c66283029323b', '2026-09-22T10:36:27.795Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:27.795Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 3, 16, 'Niaraka tamin-dravehivavy teny foana anefa io vadiny io, ka sady nitomany no nanaraka azy hatrany Bahorima. Dia hoy i Abnera tamin-dralehilahy: “Mandehana miverina!” Dia niverina izy.', 'niaraka tamin-dravehivavy teny foana anefa io vadiny io, ka sady nitomany no nanaraka azy hatrany bahorima. dia hoy i abnera tamin-dralehilahy: “mandehana miverina!” dia niverina izy.'),
  ('6ab25a2b184c662830293235', '2026-09-22T10:36:27.795Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:27.795Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 3, 10, 'Dia hafindra hiala amin’ny taranak’i Saoly ny fanjakana, ka hatao mafy orina ny seza fiandrianan’i Davida eo amin’ny Israely sy Joda, hatrany Dana ka hatrany Beri-sheba.”', 'dia hafindra hiala amin’ny taranak’i saoly ny fanjakana, ka hatao mafy orina ny seza fiandrianan’i davida eo amin’ny israely sy joda, hatrany dana ka hatrany beri-sheba.”'),
  ('6ab25a2b184c662830293237', '2026-09-22T10:36:27.795Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:27.795Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 3, 12, 'Koa nandefa iraka ho any amin’i Davida avy hatrany i Abnera, hilaza hoe: “An’iza moa ny tany?” Ary nampiany hoe: “Manaova fifanekena amiko, dia homba anao hampitodika ny Israely manontolo hiandany aminao aho.”', 'koa nandefa iraka ho any amin’i davida avy hatrany i abnera, hilaza hoe: “an’iza moa ny tany?” ary nampiany hoe: “manaova fifanekena amiko, dia homba anao hampitodika ny israely manontolo hiandany aminao aho.”'),
  ('6ab25a2b184c662830293232', '2026-09-22T10:36:27.795Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:27.795Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 3, 7, 'Ary i Saoly nanana vadikely nantsoina hoe Rizpa, zanakavavin’i Aia. Tatỳ aoriana, dia hoy i Isboseta tamin’i Abnera: “Fa nahoana ianao no nanao firaisana tamin’ny vadikelin-draiko?”', 'ary i saoly nanana vadikely nantsoina hoe rizpa, zanakavavin’i aia. tatỳ aoriana, dia hoy i isboseta tamin’i abnera: “fa nahoana ianao no nanao firaisana tamin’ny vadikelin-draiko?”'),
  ('6ab25a2b184c662830293244', '2026-09-22T10:36:27.795Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:27.795Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 3, 25, 'Fantatrao tsara i Abnera zanak’i Nera. Ny hamitaka anao no nahatongavany, ary koa ny hamantatra ny ivoahanao sy idiranao ary ny zava-drehetra ataonao.”', 'fantatrao tsara i abnera zanak’i nera. ny hamitaka anao no nahatongavany, ary koa ny hamantatra ny ivoahanao sy idiranao ary ny zava-drehetra ataonao.”'),
  ('6ab25a2b184c66283029322c', '2026-09-22T10:36:27.795Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:27.795Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 3, 1, 'Ary naharitra ela ny ady teo amin’ny taranak’i Saoly sy ny ankohonan’i Davida. Nihanahery hatrany anefa i Davida, fa nihaosa hatrany kosa ny taranak’i Saoly.', 'ary naharitra ela ny ady teo amin’ny taranak’i saoly sy ny ankohonan’i davida. nihanahery hatrany anefa i davida, fa nihaosa hatrany kosa ny taranak’i saoly.'),
  ('6ab25a2b184c662830293230', '2026-09-22T10:36:27.795Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:27.795Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 3, 5, 'Ary ny fahenina dia i Jitreama, zanany tamin’i Egla vadin’i Davida. Ireo no naterak’i Davida tany Hebrona.', 'ary ny fahenina dia i jitreama, zanany tamin’i egla vadin’i davida. ireo no naterak’i davida tany hebrona.'),
  ('6ab25a2b184c66283029324d', '2026-09-22T10:36:27.795Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:27.795Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 3, 34, 'Tsy voafatotra ny tananao, Ary tsy natao tao anaty gadra varahina ny tongotrao. Toy ny fahalavoan’ny olona iray eo anoloan’ny zanaky ny tsy fahamarinana, no nahalavoanao.” Dia nitomany azy indray ny olona rehetra.', 'tsy voafatotra ny tananao, ary tsy natao tao anaty gadra varahina ny tongotrao. toy ny fahalavoan’ny olona iray eo anoloan’ny zanaky ny tsy fahamarinana, no nahalavoanao.” dia nitomany azy indray ny olona rehetra.'),
  ('6ab25a2b184c66283029323a', '2026-09-22T10:36:27.795Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:27.795Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 3, 15, 'Koa nisy olona nirahin’i Isboseta haka an-dravehivavy tany amin’i Paltiela vadiny, zanakalahin’i Laisy.', 'koa nisy olona nirahin’i isboseta haka an-dravehivavy tany amin’i paltiela vadiny, zanakalahin’i laisy.'),
  ('6ab25a2b184c662830293239', '2026-09-22T10:36:27.795Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:27.795Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 3, 14, 'Nandefa iraka ho any amin’i Isboseta zanak’i Saoly koa i Davida, hiteny hoe: “Omeo ahy i Mikala vadiko. Efa lasa fofombadiko mantsy izy, tamin’ny nanomezako tsitsy * nesorina tamin’ny lehilahy filistinina zato.”', 'nandefa iraka ho any amin’i isboseta zanak’i saoly koa i davida, hiteny hoe: “omeo ahy i mikala vadiko. efa lasa fofombadiko mantsy izy, tamin’ny nanomezako tsitsy * nesorina tamin’ny lehilahy filistinina zato.”'),
  ('6ab25a2b184c662830293241', '2026-09-22T10:36:27.795Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:27.795Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 3, 22, 'Ary tafaverina avy nanafika ry Joaba sy ny mpanompon’i Davida, ka be dia be ny zavatra voababo nentin’izy ireo. Tsy teo amin’i Davida tao Hebrona intsony i Abnera tamin’izay, satria efa nalefany soa aman-tsara.', 'ary tafaverina avy nanafika ry joaba sy ny mpanompon’i davida, ka be dia be ny zavatra voababo nentin’izy ireo. tsy teo amin’i davida tao hebrona intsony i abnera tamin’izay, satria efa nalefany soa aman-tsara.'),
  ('6ab25a2b184c66283029322f', '2026-09-22T10:36:27.795Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:27.795Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 3, 4, 'Ny fahefatra dia i Adonia zanak’i Hagita, ary ny fahadimy dia i Sefatia zanak’i Abitala.', 'ny fahefatra dia i adonia zanak’i hagita, ary ny fahadimy dia i sefatia zanak’i abitala.'),
  ('6ab25a2b184c662830293233', '2026-09-22T10:36:27.795Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:27.795Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 3, 8, 'Dia tezitra be i Abnera noho ny tenin’i Isboseta, ka hoy izy: “Izaho angaha lohan’alikan’i Joda? Mbola anehoako hatsaram-panahy feno fitiavana ankehitriny ny taranak’i Saoly rainao sy ny rahalahiny ary ny namany akaiky, ary tsy navelako ho azon’ny tanan’i Davida ianao. Koa izay fahadisoana momba ny vehivavy iray ve dia hanaovanao ampamoaka ahy androany?', 'dia tezitra be i abnera noho ny tenin’i isboseta, ka hoy izy: “izaho angaha lohan’alikan’i joda? mbola anehoako hatsaram-panahy feno fitiavana ankehitriny ny taranak’i saoly rainao sy ny rahalahiny ary ny namany akaiky, ary tsy navelako ho azon’ny tanan’i davida ianao. koa izay fahadisoana momba ny vehivavy iray ve dia hanaovanao ampamoaka ahy androany?'),
  ('6ab25a2b184c662830293252', '2026-09-22T10:36:27.796Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:27.796Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 3, 39, 'Ary malemy aho androany na dia voahosotra ho mpanjaka aza. Fa amiko dia masiaka loatra ireo lehilahy zanak’i Zeroia ireo. I Jehovah anie hamaly ilay mpanao ratsy araka ny faharatsiany ihany!”', 'ary malemy aho androany na dia voahosotra ho mpanjaka aza. fa amiko dia masiaka loatra ireo lehilahy zanak’i zeroia ireo. i jehovah anie hamaly ilay mpanao ratsy araka ny faharatsiany ihany!”'),
  ('6ab25a2b184c662830293250', '2026-09-22T10:36:27.796Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:27.796Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 3, 37, 'Ary fantatry ny olona rehetra sy ny Israely rehetra tamin’iny andro iny, fa tsy avy tamin’ny mpanjaka ny namonoana ho faty an’i Abnera zanak’i Nera.', 'ary fantatry ny olona rehetra sy ny israely rehetra tamin’iny andro iny, fa tsy avy tamin’ny mpanjaka ny namonoana ho faty an’i abnera zanak’i nera.'),
  ('6ab25a2b184c662830293251', '2026-09-22T10:36:27.796Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:27.796Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 3, 38, 'Hoy koa ny mpanjaka tamin’ny mpanompony: “Tsy fantatrareo ve fa andriana sady olo-malaza no lavo androany teo amin’ny Israely?', 'hoy koa ny mpanjaka tamin’ny mpanompony: “tsy fantatrareo ve fa andriana sady olo-malaza no lavo androany teo amin’ny israely?'),
  ('6ab25a2b184c66283029324f', '2026-09-22T10:36:27.796Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:27.796Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 3, 36, 'Dia hitan’ny olona rehetra izany ka nankasitrahany. Eny, nankasitrahan’ny olona rehetra izany, toy ny zava-drehetra efa nataon’ny mpanjaka.', 'dia hitan’ny olona rehetra izany ka nankasitrahany. eny, nankasitrahan’ny olona rehetra izany, toy ny zava-drehetra efa nataon’ny mpanjaka.'),
  ('6ab25a2e19992ea423a531af', '2026-09-22T10:36:30.709Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:30.709Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 4, 9, 'Hoy anefa i Davida tamin’i Rekaba sy Bana rahalahiny, zanak’i Rimona Berotita: “Raha mbola velona koa i Jehovah izay nanavotra ny aiko ho afaka tamin’ny fahoriana rehetra,', 'hoy anefa i davida tamin’i rekaba sy bana rahalahiny, zanak’i rimona berotita: “raha mbola velona koa i jehovah izay nanavotra ny aiko ho afaka tamin’ny fahoriana rehetra,'),
  ('6ab25a2e19992ea423a531ad', '2026-09-22T10:36:30.709Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:30.709Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 4, 7, 'Tamin’izy ireo niditra tao an-trano mantsy, dia natory teo am-pandriana tao amin’ny efitra fatoriany i Isboseta. Ary nasian’izy ireo izy ka matiny, dia notapahin’izy ireo ny lohany ka nentiny. Ary nandeha tamin’ny lalana mankany Araba izy ireo nandritra ny alina.', 'tamin’izy ireo niditra tao an-trano mantsy, dia natory teo am-pandriana tao amin’ny efitra fatoriany i isboseta. ary nasian’izy ireo izy ka matiny, dia notapahin’izy ireo ny lohany ka nentiny. ary nandeha tamin’ny lalana mankany araba izy ireo nandritra ny alina.'),
  ('6ab25a2e19992ea423a531aa', '2026-09-22T10:36:30.709Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:30.709Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 4, 4, 'Ary nanan-janakalahy malemy tongotra i Jonatana zanak’i Saoly. Dimy taona ilay zaza fony tonga avy tany Jezirela ny vaovao momba an’i Saoly sy Jonatana. Dia nitondra an’ilay zaza nandositra ny mpitaiza azy. Raha iny izy nikoropaka ny handositra iny indrindra anefa, dia nianjera ilay zaza ka lasa nalemy tongotra. Mefiboseta no anarany.', 'ary nanan-janakalahy malemy tongotra i jonatana zanak’i saoly. dimy taona ilay zaza fony tonga avy tany jezirela ny vaovao momba an’i saoly sy jonatana. dia nitondra an’ilay zaza nandositra ny mpitaiza azy. raha iny izy nikoropaka ny handositra iny indrindra anefa, dia nianjera ilay zaza ka lasa nalemy tongotra. mefiboseta no anarany.'),
  ('6ab25a2e19992ea423a531a7', '2026-09-22T10:36:30.709Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:30.709Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 4, 1, 'Rehefa henon’ny zanak’i Saoly fa maty tany Hebrona i Abnera, dia niraviravy tanana izy, ary nivarahontsana ny Israelita rehetra.', 'rehefa henon’ny zanak’i saoly fa maty tany hebrona i abnera, dia niraviravy tanana izy, ary nivarahontsana ny israelita rehetra.'),
  ('6ab25a2e19992ea423a531b1', '2026-09-22T10:36:30.709Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:30.710Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 4, 11, 'Koa mainka raha lehilahy ratsy fanahy no namono olo-marina teo am-pandriana tao an-tranony? Tsy hataoko ampamoaka noho ny rany ve ianareo, ka hesoriko tsy ho eto an-tany?”', 'koa mainka raha lehilahy ratsy fanahy no namono olo-marina teo am-pandriana tao an-tranony? tsy hataoko ampamoaka noho ny rany ve ianareo, ka hesoriko tsy ho eto an-tany?”'),
  ('6ab25a2e19992ea423a531ab', '2026-09-22T10:36:30.709Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:30.709Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 4, 5, 'Ary nandeha nankany an-tranon’i Isboseta i Rekaba sy Bana zanak’i Rimona Berotita, raha iny nahamay be iny ny andro. Natory antoandro i Isboseta tamin’izay.', 'ary nandeha nankany an-tranon’i isboseta i rekaba sy bana zanak’i rimona berotita, raha iny nahamay be iny ny andro. natory antoandro i isboseta tamin’izay.'),
  ('6ab25a2e19992ea423a531ae', '2026-09-22T10:36:30.709Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:30.709Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 4, 8, 'Dia tonga tany amin’i Davida tao Hebrona izy ireo, niaraka tamin’ny lohan’i Isboseta, ka niteny tamin’ny mpanjaka hoe: “Intỳ ny lohan’i Isboseta, zanak’i Saoly fahavalonao izay nifofo ny ainao. Fa nampiharin’i Jehovah tamin’i Saoly sy ny taranany ny famaliana ho an’ny mpanjaka tompoko androany.”', 'dia tonga tany amin’i davida tao hebrona izy ireo, niaraka tamin’ny lohan’i isboseta, ka niteny tamin’ny mpanjaka hoe: “intỳ ny lohan’i isboseta, zanak’i saoly fahavalonao izay nifofo ny ainao. fa nampiharin’i jehovah tamin’i saoly sy ny taranany ny famaliana ho an’ny mpanjaka tompoko androany.”'),
  ('6ab25a2e19992ea423a531ac', '2026-09-22T10:36:30.709Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:30.709Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 4, 6, 'Nankeo afovoan-trano izy roa lahy, toy ny hoe haka varimbazaha, ka namely an’i Isboseta teo amin’ny kibony. Ary tsy nisy nahita an’izay nataon’i Rekaba sy Bana rahalahiny.', 'nankeo afovoan-trano izy roa lahy, toy ny hoe haka varimbazaha, ka namely an’i isboseta teo amin’ny kibony. ary tsy nisy nahita an’izay nataon’i rekaba sy bana rahalahiny.'),
  ('6ab25a2e19992ea423a531a9', '2026-09-22T10:36:30.709Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:30.709Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 4, 3, 'Ary nandositra nankany Gitaima ny Berotita, ka lasa vahiny monina any mandraka androany.', 'ary nandositra nankany gitaima ny berotita, ka lasa vahiny monina any mandraka androany.'),
  ('6ab25a2e19992ea423a531a8', '2026-09-22T10:36:30.709Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:30.709Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 4, 2, 'Ary nisy roa lahy, lehiben’ireo mpandroba nampiasain’ny zanak’i Saoly: Bana no anaran’ny iray, ary Rekaba no anaran’ny iray. Zanak’i Rimona Berotita, avy amin’ny taranak’i Benjamina izy ireo. Natao ho isan’ny faritr’i Benjamina koa mantsy i Berota.', 'ary nisy roa lahy, lehiben’ireo mpandroba nampiasain’ny zanak’i saoly: bana no anaran’ny iray, ary rekaba no anaran’ny iray. zanak’i rimona berotita, avy amin’ny taranak’i benjamina izy ireo. natao ho isan’ny faritr’i benjamina koa mantsy i berota.'),
  ('6ab25a2e19992ea423a531b0', '2026-09-22T10:36:30.709Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:30.709Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 4, 10, 'dia tsoriko aminareo fa rehefa nisy olona nihevi-tena ho mpitondra vaovao tsara tamin’izy nilaza tamiko hoe: ‘Maty i Saoly’, dia tsy mba nomeko ny valisoa fanome ny iraka izy, fa nosamboriko sy novonoiko ho faty kosa tany Ziklaga.', 'dia tsoriko aminareo fa rehefa nisy olona nihevi-tena ho mpitondra vaovao tsara tamin’izy nilaza tamiko hoe: ‘maty i saoly’, dia tsy mba nomeko ny valisoa fanome ny iraka izy, fa nosamboriko sy novonoiko ho faty kosa tany ziklaga.'),
  ('6ab25a2e19992ea423a531b2', '2026-09-22T10:36:30.710Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:30.710Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 4, 12, 'Ary nomen’i Davida baiko ny zatovolahy, ka novonoin’ireo ho faty izy roa lahy. Dia notapahiny ny tanany sy ny tongony, ary nahantony teo akaikin’ilay dobo tao Hebrona ny fatiny. Ary nalain’izy ireo ny lohan’i Isboseta, ka naleviny tao amin’ny fasan’i Abnera tao Hebrona.', 'ary nomen’i davida baiko ny zatovolahy, ka novonoin’ireo ho faty izy roa lahy. dia notapahiny ny tanany sy ny tongony, ary nahantony teo akaikin’ilay dobo tao hebrona ny fatiny. ary nalain’izy ireo ny lohan’i isboseta, ka naleviny tao amin’ny fasan’i abnera tao hebrona.'),
  ('6ab25a302f8cdc5648209826', '2026-09-22T10:36:32.247Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:32.247Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 5, 18, 'Ary tonga ny Filistinina, ka nihaodihaody teo amin’ny lemaka ivan’ny Refaima teo foana.', 'ary tonga ny filistinina, ka nihaodihaody teo amin’ny lemaka ivan’ny refaima teo foana.'),
  ('6ab25a302f8cdc564820981d', '2026-09-22T10:36:32.247Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:32.247Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 5, 9, 'Ary nanorim-ponenana tao amin’ilay tanàna voaro mafy i Davida. Dia nantsoina hoe Tanànan’i Davida izy io. Ary nanorina manda sy zavatra hafa teo amin’ilay Dongon-tany sy tao an-tanàna izy.', 'ary nanorim-ponenana tao amin’ilay tanàna voaro mafy i davida. dia nantsoina hoe tanànan’i davida izy io. ary nanorina manda sy zavatra hafa teo amin’ilay dongon-tany sy tao an-tanàna izy.'),
  ('6ab25a302f8cdc564820982a', '2026-09-22T10:36:32.247Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:32.247Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 5, 22, 'Niakatra indray ny Filistinina tatỳ aoriana, ka nihaodihaody teo amin’ny lemaka ivan’ny Refaima.', 'niakatra indray ny filistinina tatỳ aoriana, ka nihaodihaody teo amin’ny lemaka ivan’ny refaima.'),
  ('6ab25a302f8cdc5648209820', '2026-09-22T10:36:32.247Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:32.247Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 5, 12, 'Ary fantatr’i Davida fa efa nampitoetra azy ho mpanjakan’ny Israely i Jehovah, sady nanandratra ny fanjakany, noho ny amin’ny Israely olony.', 'ary fantatr’i davida fa efa nampitoetra azy ho mpanjakan’ny israely i jehovah, sady nanandratra ny fanjakany, noho ny amin’ny israely olony.'),
  ('6ab25a302f8cdc5648209819', '2026-09-22T10:36:32.247Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:32.247Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 5, 5, 'Tao Hebrona no nanjakany teo amin’ny Joda fito taona sy enim-bolana, ary tao Jerosalema kosa no nanjakany teo amin’ny Israely rehetra sy ny Joda telo amby telopolo taona.', 'tao hebrona no nanjakany teo amin’ny joda fito taona sy enim-bolana, ary tao jerosalema kosa no nanjakany teo amin’ny israely rehetra sy ny joda telo amby telopolo taona.'),
  ('6ab25a302f8cdc5648209817', '2026-09-22T10:36:32.247Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:32.247Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 5, 3, 'Tonga tany amin’ny mpanjaka tao Hebrona àry ny anti-panahy rehetran’ny Israely. Ary nanao fifanekena tamin’izy ireo teo anatrehan’i Jehovah tao Hebrona i Davida Mpanjaka. Avy eo dia nohosoran’izy ireo ho mpanjakan’ny Israely i Davida.', 'tonga tany amin’ny mpanjaka tao hebrona àry ny anti-panahy rehetran’ny israely. ary nanao fifanekena tamin’izy ireo teo anatrehan’i jehovah tao hebrona i davida mpanjaka. avy eo dia nohosoran’izy ireo ho mpanjakan’ny israely i davida.'),
  ('6ab25a302f8cdc564820982c', '2026-09-22T10:36:32.247Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:32.247Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 5, 24, 'Rehefa mandre figadongadona eny an-tendron’ireo hazo bakà ianao, dia manaova zavatra avy hatrany, satria ho efa nivoaka hialoha anao i Jehovah amin’izay fotoana izay mba hamely ny tobin’ny Filistinina.”', 'rehefa mandre figadongadona eny an-tendron’ireo hazo bakà ianao, dia manaova zavatra avy hatrany, satria ho efa nivoaka hialoha anao i jehovah amin’izay fotoana izay mba hamely ny tobin’ny filistinina.”'),
  ('6ab25a302f8cdc5648209828', '2026-09-22T10:36:32.247Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:32.247Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 5, 20, 'Koa nankany Bala-perazima i Davida, ka novonoiny tany izy ireo. Ary hoy izy: “I Jehovah efa nialoha ahy ka namaky ny laharan’ny fahavaloko, sahala amin’ny rano mamaky fefiloha.” Koa nataony hoe Bala-perazima ny anaran’io toerana io.', 'koa nankany bala-perazima i davida, ka novonoiny tany izy ireo. ary hoy izy: “i jehovah efa nialoha ahy ka namaky ny laharan’ny fahavaloko, sahala amin’ny rano mamaky fefiloha.” koa nataony hoe bala-perazima ny anaran’io toerana io.'),
  ('6ab25a302f8cdc564820981f', '2026-09-22T10:36:32.247Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:32.247Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 5, 11, 'Ary nandefa iraka ho any amin’i Davida i Hirama mpanjakan’i Tyro, sady nandefa hazo sedera sy mpandrafitra ary mpanao ny vato hatao rindrina. Dia nanorina trano ho an’i Davida ireo.', 'ary nandefa iraka ho any amin’i davida i hirama mpanjakan’i tyro, sady nandefa hazo sedera sy mpandrafitra ary mpanao ny vato hatao rindrina. dia nanorina trano ho an’i davida ireo.'),
  ('6ab25a302f8cdc564820981b', '2026-09-22T10:36:32.247Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:32.247Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 5, 7, 'Voababon’i Davida ihany anefa i Ziona, ilay tanàna voaro mafy, izany hoe ny Tanànan’i Davida.', 'voababon’i davida ihany anefa i ziona, ilay tanàna voaro mafy, izany hoe ny tanànan’i davida.'),
  ('6ab25a302f8cdc5648209824', '2026-09-22T10:36:32.247Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:32.247Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 5, 16, 'Elisama, Eliada ary Elifeleta.', 'elisama, eliada ary elifeleta.'),
  ('6ab25a302f8cdc5648209823', '2026-09-22T10:36:32.247Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:32.247Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 5, 15, 'Jibara, Elisoa, Nafega, Jafia,', 'jibara, elisoa, nafega, jafia,'),
  ('6ab25a302f8cdc5648209815', '2026-09-22T10:36:32.247Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:32.247Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 5, 1, 'Tatỳ aoriana, dia tonga tany amin’i Davida tao Hebrona ny foko rehetran’ny Israely, ka niteny hoe: “Indreto izahay, taolanao sy nofonao.', 'tatỳ aoriana, dia tonga tany amin’i davida tao hebrona ny foko rehetran’ny israely, ka niteny hoe: “indreto izahay, taolanao sy nofonao.'),
  ('6ab25a302f8cdc5648209825', '2026-09-22T10:36:32.247Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:32.247Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 5, 17, 'Rehefa ren’ny Filistinina fa nohosorana ho mpanjakan’ny Israely i Davida, dia niakatra hitady an’i Davida izy rehetra. Ren’i Davida izany, ka nidina tany amin’ny toerana sarotra haleha izy.', 'rehefa ren’ny filistinina fa nohosorana ho mpanjakan’ny israely i davida, dia niakatra hitady an’i davida izy rehetra. ren’i davida izany, ka nidina tany amin’ny toerana sarotra haleha izy.'),
  ('6ab25a302f8cdc564820982b', '2026-09-22T10:36:32.247Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:32.247Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 5, 23, 'Koa nanontany an’i Jehovah i Davida, ka novaliany hoe: “Aza miakatra, fa mandehana mihodidina mankany aorian’izy ireo, ary mameleza azy tandrifin’ireo hazo bakà.', 'koa nanontany an’i jehovah i davida, ka novaliany hoe: “aza miakatra, fa mandehana mihodidina mankany aorian’izy ireo, ary mameleza azy tandrifin’ireo hazo bakà.'),
  ('6ab25a302f8cdc5648209818', '2026-09-22T10:36:32.247Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:32.247Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 5, 4, 'Telopolo taona i Davida tamin’izy lasa mpanjaka, ary efapolo taona no nanjakany.', 'telopolo taona i davida tamin’izy lasa mpanjaka, ary efapolo taona no nanjakany.'),
  ('6ab25a302f8cdc5648209829', '2026-09-22T10:36:32.247Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:32.247Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 5, 21, 'Ary navelan’ny Filistinina teo ny sampiny, ka nentin’i Davida sy ny olony.', 'ary navelan’ny filistinina teo ny sampiny, ka nentin’i davida sy ny olony.'),
  ('6ab25a302f8cdc564820981e', '2026-09-22T10:36:32.247Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:32.247Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 5, 10, 'Koa nihanahery hatrany i Davida, ary nomba azy i Jehovah Andriamanitry ny tafika.', 'koa nihanahery hatrany i davida, ary nomba azy i jehovah andriamanitry ny tafika.'),
  ('6ab25a302f8cdc5648209822', '2026-09-22T10:36:32.247Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:32.247Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 5, 14, 'Ireto avy ny anaran’ireo naterany tany Jerosalema: Samoa, Sobaba, Natana, Solomona,', 'ireto avy ny anaran’ireo naterany tany jerosalema: samoa, sobaba, natana, solomona,'),
  ('6ab25a302f8cdc564820981a', '2026-09-22T10:36:32.247Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:32.247Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 5, 6, 'Dia nankany Jerosalema ny mpanjaka sy ny olony mba hanafika an’ireo Jebosita nonina tao amin’ilay tany. Ary hoy ny Jebosita tamin’i Davida: “Tsy ho tafiditra eto ianao, fa ny jamba sy ny kilemaina no hisakana anao.” Nieritreritra mantsy izy ireo hoe: “Tsy ho tafiditra eto i Davida.”', 'dia nankany jerosalema ny mpanjaka sy ny olony mba hanafika an’ireo jebosita nonina tao amin’ilay tany. ary hoy ny jebosita tamin’i davida: “tsy ho tafiditra eto ianao, fa ny jamba sy ny kilemaina no hisakana anao.” nieritreritra mantsy izy ireo hoe: “tsy ho tafiditra eto i davida.”'),
  ('6ab25a302f8cdc5648209827', '2026-09-22T10:36:32.247Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:32.247Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 5, 19, 'Dia nanontany an’i Jehovah i Davida hoe: “Hiakatra hamely ny Filistinina ve aho? Hatolotrao eo an-tanako ve izy ireo?” Ary hoy i Jehovah taminy: “Miakara, fa hatolotro eo an-tananao tokoa ny Filistinina.”', 'dia nanontany an’i jehovah i davida hoe: “hiakatra hamely ny filistinina ve aho? hatolotrao eo an-tanako ve izy ireo?” ary hoy i jehovah taminy: “miakara, fa hatolotro eo an-tananao tokoa ny filistinina.”'),
  ('6ab25a302f8cdc5648209816', '2026-09-22T10:36:32.247Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:32.247Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 5, 2, 'Ianao no efa nitarika ny Israely tamin’ny ady, na omaly na talohan’izay, fony i Saoly mbola mpanjakantsika. Ary nilaza taminao i Jehovah hoe: ‘Ianao no hiandry ny Israely oloko, ary ianao koa no ho mpitarika ny Israely.’”', 'ianao no efa nitarika ny israely tamin’ny ady, na omaly na talohan’izay, fony i saoly mbola mpanjakantsika. ary nilaza taminao i jehovah hoe: ‘ianao no hiandry ny israely oloko, ary ianao koa no ho mpitarika ny israely.’”'),
  ('6ab25a302f8cdc564820981c', '2026-09-22T10:36:32.247Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:32.247Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 5, 8, 'Koa hoy i Davida tamin’izay andro izay: “Izay mamely an’ireo Jebosita, dia aoka izy hiditra avy eo amin’ny tionelin-drano, ka hamely ny kilemaina sy ny jamba, izay samy halan’i Davida!” Izany no anton’ilay fitenenana hoe: “Tsy hiditra ao an-trano ny jamba sy ny kilemaina.”', 'koa hoy i davida tamin’izay andro izay: “izay mamely an’ireo jebosita, dia aoka izy hiditra avy eo amin’ny tionelin-drano, ka hamely ny kilemaina sy ny jamba, izay samy halan’i davida!” izany no anton’ilay fitenenana hoe: “tsy hiditra ao an-trano ny jamba sy ny kilemaina.”'),
  ('6ab25a302f8cdc564820982d', '2026-09-22T10:36:32.247Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:32.247Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 5, 25, 'Koa izany no nataon’i Davida, araka izay nandidian’i Jehovah azy. Dia nasiany ny Filistinina hatrany Geba ka hatrany Gazera.', 'koa izany no nataon’i davida, araka izay nandidian’i jehovah azy. dia nasiany ny filistinina hatrany geba ka hatrany gazera.'),
  ('6ab25a302f8cdc5648209821', '2026-09-22T10:36:32.247Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:32.247Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 5, 13, 'Nandritra izany fotoana izany, dia naka vadikely sy vady hafa koa tao Jerosalema i Davida, rehefa tonga avy tany Hebrona. Ary mbola niteraka zazalahy sy zazavavy hafa koa i Davida.', 'nandritra izany fotoana izany, dia naka vadikely sy vady hafa koa tao jerosalema i davida, rehefa tonga avy tany hebrona. ary mbola niteraka zazalahy sy zazavavy hafa koa i davida.'),
  ('6ab25a301675be427d3f65d9', '2026-09-22T10:36:32.851Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:32.851Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 6, 14, 'Ary nandihy nihodinkodina teo anatrehan’i Jehovah tamin’ny heriny manontolo i Davida. Nanao efoda rongony nisy fehikibony izy tamin’izay.', 'ary nandihy nihodinkodina teo anatrehan’i jehovah tamin’ny heriny manontolo i davida. nanao efoda rongony nisy fehikibony izy tamin’izay.'),
  ('6ab25a301675be427d3f65cd', '2026-09-22T10:36:32.851Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:32.851Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 6, 2, 'Dia nankany Bala-joda i Davida sy ny olona rehetra niaraka taminy, mba hampiakatra avy tany ny Vata masin’Andriamanitra. Eo amin’io Vata io no iantsoana ny anaran’i Jehovah Tompon’ny tafika, ilay mipetraka eo amin’ny kerobima.', 'dia nankany bala-joda i davida sy ny olona rehetra niaraka taminy, mba hampiakatra avy tany ny vata masin’andriamanitra. eo amin’io vata io no iantsoana ny anaran’i jehovah tompon’ny tafika, ilay mipetraka eo amin’ny kerobima.'),
  ('6ab25a301675be427d3f65d5', '2026-09-22T10:36:32.851Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:32.851Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 6, 10, 'Ary tsy tian’i Davida ny hamindra ny Vata masin’i Jehovah ho any aminy, any amin’ny Tanànan’i Davida. Koa nasainy navily nankany an-tranon’i Obeda-edoma Gatita ilay izy.', 'ary tsy tian’i davida ny hamindra ny vata masin’i jehovah ho any aminy, any amin’ny tanànan’i davida. koa nasainy navily nankany an-tranon’i obeda-edoma gatita ilay izy.'),
  ('6ab25a301675be427d3f65e2', '2026-09-22T10:36:32.851Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:32.851Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 6, 23, 'Koa tsy nanan-janaka i Mikala zanakavavin’i Saoly, mandra-pahafatiny.', 'koa tsy nanan-janaka i mikala zanakavavin’i saoly, mandra-pahafatiny.'),
  ('6ab25a301675be427d3f65df', '2026-09-22T10:36:32.851Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:32.851Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 6, 20, 'Ary nody mba hitso-drano ny ankohonany i Davida. Koa nivoaka hitsena azy i Mikala zanakavavin’i Saoly, ka niteny hoe: “Nanao izay hahabe voninahitra ny tenany kosa ny mpanjakan’ny Israely androany! Fa nanary lamba teo imason’ny mpanompovavin’ny mpanompony izy androany, sahala amin’ireny lehilahy tsisy saina manary lamba ireny.”', 'ary nody mba hitso-drano ny ankohonany i davida. koa nivoaka hitsena azy i mikala zanakavavin’i saoly, ka niteny hoe: “nanao izay hahabe voninahitra ny tenany kosa ny mpanjakan’ny israely androany! fa nanary lamba teo imason’ny mpanompovavin’ny mpanompony izy androany, sahala amin’ireny lehilahy tsisy saina manary lamba ireny.”'),
  ('6ab25a301675be427d3f65dc', '2026-09-22T10:36:32.851Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:32.851Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 6, 17, 'Ary nampidirina ny Vata masin’i Jehovah, ka napetraka teo amin’ny toerany, tao amin’ny tranolay natsangan’i Davida ho azy io. Dia nanolotra sorona dorana sy sorona iombonana teo anatrehan’i Jehovah i Davida.', 'ary nampidirina ny vata masin’i jehovah, ka napetraka teo amin’ny toerany, tao amin’ny tranolay natsangan’i davida ho azy io. dia nanolotra sorona dorana sy sorona iombonana teo anatrehan’i jehovah i davida.'),
  ('6ab25a301675be427d3f65cc', '2026-09-22T10:36:32.851Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:32.851Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 6, 1, 'Ary novorin’i Davida indray ny lehilahy voafantina rehetra teo amin’ny Israely, dia lehilahy telo alina.', 'ary novorin’i davida indray ny lehilahy voafantina rehetra teo amin’ny israely, dia lehilahy telo alina.'),
  ('6ab25a301675be427d3f65e1', '2026-09-22T10:36:32.851Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:32.851Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 6, 22, 'Ary vao mainka aza hataoko tsy misy vidiny noho izany ny tenako, ka hataoko mietry aho eo imasoko. Ary eo imason’ireo mpanompovavy nolazainao ireo no hanomezako voninahitra ny tenako.”', 'ary vao mainka aza hataoko tsy misy vidiny noho izany ny tenako, ka hataoko mietry aho eo imasoko. ary eo imason’ireo mpanompovavy nolazainao ireo no hanomezako voninahitra ny tenako.”'),
  ('6ab25a301675be427d3f65d3', '2026-09-22T10:36:32.851Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:32.851Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 6, 8, 'Ary tezitra i Davida noho ny fipoahan’ny fahatezeran’i Jehovah tamin’i Oza. Dia nantsoina hoe Pereza-oza io toerana io mandraka androany.', 'ary tezitra i davida noho ny fipoahan’ny fahatezeran’i jehovah tamin’i oza. dia nantsoina hoe pereza-oza io toerana io mandraka androany.'),
  ('6ab25a301675be427d3f65d2', '2026-09-22T10:36:32.851Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:32.851Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 6, 7, 'Koa nirehitra tamin’i Oza ny fahatezeran’i Jehovah, ka novonoin’Andriamanitra teo izy satria tsy naneho fanajana. Dia maty teo akaikin’ilay Vata masin’Andriamanitra izy.', 'koa nirehitra tamin’i oza ny fahatezeran’i jehovah, ka novonoin’andriamanitra teo izy satria tsy naneho fanajana. dia maty teo akaikin’ilay vata masin’andriamanitra izy.'),
  ('6ab25a301675be427d3f65de', '2026-09-22T10:36:32.851Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:32.851Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 6, 19, 'Ary nizarany mofo boribory * sy mofo antrendry ary mofo vita tamin’ny voaloboka maina ny olona rehetra, dia ny vahoakan’Israely manontolo, na lahy na vavy. Dia samy nody tany an-tranony avy ny olona rehetra avy eo.', 'ary nizarany mofo boribory * sy mofo antrendry ary mofo vita tamin’ny voaloboka maina ny olona rehetra, dia ny vahoakan’israely manontolo, na lahy na vavy. dia samy nody tany an-tranony avy ny olona rehetra avy eo.'),
  ('6ab25a301675be427d3f65db', '2026-09-22T10:36:32.851Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:32.851Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 6, 16, 'Rehefa tonga tao amin’ny Tanànan’i Davida ny Vata masin’i Jehovah, dia nitazana avy teo am-baravarankely i Mikala zanakavavin’i Saoly. Koa nony nahita an’i Davida Mpanjaka nitsinjaka sy nandihy nihodinkodina teo anatrehan’i Jehovah izy, dia nanamavo azy anakampo.', 'rehefa tonga tao amin’ny tanànan’i davida ny vata masin’i jehovah, dia nitazana avy teo am-baravarankely i mikala zanakavavin’i saoly. koa nony nahita an’i davida mpanjaka nitsinjaka sy nandihy nihodinkodina teo anatrehan’i jehovah izy, dia nanamavo azy anakampo.'),
  ('6ab25a301675be427d3f65da', '2026-09-22T10:36:32.851Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:32.851Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 6, 15, 'Dia nampiakatra ny Vata masin’i Jehovah i Davida sy ny taranak’Israely rehetra, sady nanao horakora-pifaliana narahina feon’anjombona.', 'dia nampiakatra ny vata masin’i jehovah i davida sy ny taranak’israely rehetra, sady nanao horakora-pifaliana narahina feon’anjombona.'),
  ('6ab25a301675be427d3f65d7', '2026-09-22T10:36:32.851Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:32.851Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 6, 12, 'Farany, dia nisy nilaza tamin’i Davida Mpanjaka hoe: “Notahin’i Jehovah ny ankohonan’i Obeda-edoma sy izay rehetra azy, noho ny amin’ny Vata masin’Andriamanitra.” Koa lasa i Davida naka ny Vata masin’Andriamanitra tao an-tranon’i Obeda-edoma, ka nampiakatra azy io tamim-pifaliana ho any amin’ny Tanànan’i Davida.', 'farany, dia nisy nilaza tamin’i davida mpanjaka hoe: “notahin’i jehovah ny ankohonan’i obeda-edoma sy izay rehetra azy, noho ny amin’ny vata masin’andriamanitra.” koa lasa i davida naka ny vata masin’andriamanitra tao an-tranon’i obeda-edoma, ka nampiakatra azy io tamim-pifaliana ho any amin’ny tanànan’i davida.'),
  ('6ab25a301675be427d3f65ce', '2026-09-22T10:36:32.851Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:32.851Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 6, 3, 'Nataon’izy ireo teo ambony sarety vaovao anefa ilay Vata masin’Andriamanitra, mba hitondrana azy avy tao an-tranon’i Abinadaba, izay teny an-kavoana. I Oza sy Ahio, zanakalahin’i Abinadaba, no nitondra an’ilay sarety vaovao.', 'nataon’izy ireo teo ambony sarety vaovao anefa ilay vata masin’andriamanitra, mba hitondrana azy avy tao an-tranon’i abinadaba, izay teny an-kavoana. i oza sy ahio, zanakalahin’i abinadaba, no nitondra an’ilay sarety vaovao.'),
  ('6ab25a301675be427d3f65d8', '2026-09-22T10:36:32.851Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:32.851Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 6, 13, 'Raha vao namindra inenina ireo mpilanja ny Vata masin’i Jehovah, dia nanao sorona omby iray sy biby nohatavezina iray izy.', 'raha vao namindra inenina ireo mpilanja ny vata masin’i jehovah, dia nanao sorona omby iray sy biby nohatavezina iray izy.'),
  ('6ab25a301675be427d3f65d4', '2026-09-22T10:36:32.851Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:32.851Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 6, 9, 'Koa natahotra an’i Jehovah i Davida tamin’iny andro iny, ka nilaza hoe: “Ahoana no hahatongavan’ny Vata masin’i Jehovah any amiko?”', 'koa natahotra an’i jehovah i davida tamin’iny andro iny, ka nilaza hoe: “ahoana no hahatongavan’ny vata masin’i jehovah any amiko?”'),
  ('6ab25a301675be427d3f65dd', '2026-09-22T10:36:32.851Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:32.851Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 6, 18, 'Rehefa voatolotr’i Davida ny sorona dorana sy ny sorona iombonana, dia nitso-drano ny vahoaka tamin’ny anaran’i Jehovah Tompon’ny tafika izy.', 'rehefa voatolotr’i davida ny sorona dorana sy ny sorona iombonana, dia nitso-drano ny vahoaka tamin’ny anaran’i jehovah tompon’ny tafika izy.'),
  ('6ab25a301675be427d3f65d0', '2026-09-22T10:36:32.851Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:32.851Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 6, 5, 'Dia nanao fety teo anatrehan’i Jehovah i Davida sy ny taranak’Israely rehetra, ka nampiasa ny karazan-javamaneno rehetra vita tamin’ny hazo zenevrie, ary nampiasa harpa sy lokanga sy ampongatapaka sy korintsana ary kipantsona.', 'dia nanao fety teo anatrehan’i jehovah i davida sy ny taranak’israely rehetra, ka nampiasa ny karazan-javamaneno rehetra vita tamin’ny hazo zenevrie, ary nampiasa harpa sy lokanga sy ampongatapaka sy korintsana ary kipantsona.'),
  ('6ab25a301675be427d3f65cf', '2026-09-22T10:36:32.851Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:32.851Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 6, 4, 'Koa nentin’izy ireo avy tao amin’ilay tranon’i Abinadaba teny an-kavoana ilay Vata masin’Andriamanitra. Ary nandeha teo alohan’ilay Vata i Ahio.', 'koa nentin’izy ireo avy tao amin’ilay tranon’i abinadaba teny an-kavoana ilay vata masin’andriamanitra. ary nandeha teo alohan’ilay vata i ahio.'),
  ('6ab25a301675be427d3f65d6', '2026-09-22T10:36:32.851Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:32.851Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 6, 11, 'Ary nipetraka telo volana tao an-tranon’i Obeda-edoma Gatita ny Vata masin’i Jehovah. Dia notahin’i Jehovah foana i Obeda-edoma sy ny ankohonany manontolo.', 'ary nipetraka telo volana tao an-tranon’i obeda-edoma gatita ny vata masin’i jehovah. dia notahin’i jehovah foana i obeda-edoma sy ny ankohonany manontolo.'),
  ('6ab25a301675be427d3f65d1', '2026-09-22T10:36:32.851Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:32.851Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 6, 6, 'Ary tonga teo amin’ny famoloana tao Nakona izy ireo. Ary nanatsotra ny tanany i Oza ka nihazona ny Vata masin’Andriamanitra, satria saika nazeran’ny omby ilay izy.', 'ary tonga teo amin’ny famoloana tao nakona izy ireo. ary nanatsotra ny tanany i oza ka nihazona ny vata masin’andriamanitra, satria saika nazeran’ny omby ilay izy.'),
  ('6ab25a301675be427d3f65e0', '2026-09-22T10:36:32.851Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:32.851Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 6, 21, 'Hoy anefa i Davida taminy: “Izay nataoko, dia nataoko teo anatrehan’i Jehovah, ilay nifidy ahy fa tsy nifidy ny rainao sy ny ankohonany manontolo. Nifidy ahy izy mba hametraka ahy ho mpifehy sy ho mpitarika ny Israely olon’i Jehovah. Ary hanao fety eo anatrehan’i Jehovah aho.', 'hoy anefa i davida taminy: “izay nataoko, dia nataoko teo anatrehan’i jehovah, ilay nifidy ahy fa tsy nifidy ny rainao sy ny ankohonany manontolo. nifidy ahy izy mba hametraka ahy ho mpifehy sy ho mpitarika ny israely olon’i jehovah. ary hanao fety eo anatrehan’i jehovah aho.'),
  ('6ab25a310edc6700f28a9056', '2026-09-22T10:36:33.259Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:33.259Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 7, 29, 'Aoka ho sitrakao ny hitahy ny taranaky ny mpanomponao, mba haharetany mandritra ny fotoana tsy voafetra eo anatrehanao. Fa ianao, ry Jehovah Tompo Fara Tampony ô, no efa nampanantena, ary noho ny fitahianao, dia aoka ny taranaky ny mpanomponao hotahina mandritra ny fotoana tsy voafetra.”', 'aoka ho sitrakao ny hitahy ny taranaky ny mpanomponao, mba haharetany mandritra ny fotoana tsy voafetra eo anatrehanao. fa ianao, ry jehovah tompo fara tampony ô, no efa nampanantena, ary noho ny fitahianao, dia aoka ny taranaky ny mpanomponao hotahina mandritra ny fotoana tsy voafetra.”'),
  ('6ab25a310edc6700f28a903e', '2026-09-22T10:36:33.259Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:33.259Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 7, 5, '“Mandehana lazao amin’i Davida mpanompoko hoe: ‘Izao no nolazain’i Jehovah: “Tokony hanorina trano hipetrahako ve ianao?', '“mandehana lazao amin’i davida mpanompoko hoe: ‘izao no nolazain’i jehovah: “tokony hanorina trano hipetrahako ve ianao?'),
  ('6ab25a310edc6700f28a904b', '2026-09-22T10:36:33.259Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:33.259Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 7, 18, 'Dia niditra teo anatrehan’i Jehovah i Davida Mpanjaka ka nipetraka, ary nilaza hoe: “Zinona moa aho, ry Jehovah Tompo Fara Tampony ô? Zinona moa ny ankohonako no nataonao lasa toy izao aho?', 'dia niditra teo anatrehan’i jehovah i davida mpanjaka ka nipetraka, ary nilaza hoe: “zinona moa aho, ry jehovah tompo fara tampony ô? zinona moa ny ankohonako no nataonao lasa toy izao aho?'),
  ('6ab25a310edc6700f28a9046', '2026-09-22T10:36:33.259Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:33.259Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 7, 13, 'Izy no hanorina trano ho an’ny anarako, ary hataoko mafy orina mandritra ny fotoana tsy voafetra ny seza fiandrianan’ny fanjakany.', 'izy no hanorina trano ho an’ny anarako, ary hataoko mafy orina mandritra ny fotoana tsy voafetra ny seza fiandrianan’ny fanjakany.'),
  ('6ab25a310edc6700f28a9043', '2026-09-22T10:36:33.259Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:33.259Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 7, 10, 'Ary hifidy toerana ho an’ny Israely oloko aho ka hampitoetra * azy. Dia honina eo amin’izay misy azy izy, ka tsy ho voahelingelina intsony. Ary ny zanaky ny tsy fahamarinana tsy hampahory azy toy ny tamin’ny voalohany intsony,', 'ary hifidy toerana ho an’ny israely oloko aho ka hampitoetra * azy. dia honina eo amin’izay misy azy izy, ka tsy ho voahelingelina intsony. ary ny zanaky ny tsy fahamarinana tsy hampahory azy toy ny tamin’ny voalohany intsony,'),
  ('6ab25a310edc6700f28a9049', '2026-09-22T10:36:33.259Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:33.259Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 7, 16, 'Tsy hihozongozona eo anatrehanao mandritra ny fotoana tsy voafetra ny taranakao sy ny fanjakanao. Ary ho mafy orina mandritra ny fotoana tsy voafetra ny seza fiandriananao.”’”', 'tsy hihozongozona eo anatrehanao mandritra ny fotoana tsy voafetra ny taranakao sy ny fanjakanao. ary ho mafy orina mandritra ny fotoana tsy voafetra ny seza fiandriananao.”’”'),
  ('6ab25a310edc6700f28a9048', '2026-09-22T10:36:33.259Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:33.259Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 7, 15, 'Ny hatsaram-panahiko feno fitiavana dia tsy hiala aminy toy ny nanesorako izany tamin’i Saoly, izay nalako tamin’ny toerany noho ny aminao.', 'ny hatsaram-panahiko feno fitiavana dia tsy hiala aminy toy ny nanesorako izany tamin’i saoly, izay nalako tamin’ny toerany noho ny aminao.'),
  ('6ab25a310edc6700f28a9047', '2026-09-22T10:36:33.259Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:33.259Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 7, 14, 'Izaho ho rainy, ary izy ho zanako. Rehefa manao fahadisoana izy, dia hanariko amin’ny tsorakazon’ny olombelona, sy amin’ny kapoky ny taranak’i Adama.', 'izaho ho rainy, ary izy ho zanako. rehefa manao fahadisoana izy, dia hanariko amin’ny tsorakazon’ny olombelona, sy amin’ny kapoky ny taranak’i adama.'),
  ('6ab25a310edc6700f28a903f', '2026-09-22T10:36:33.259Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:33.259Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 7, 6, 'Fa tsy nipetraka tao anaty trano aho, hatramin’ny andro nitondrako ny zanak’Israely niakatra avy tany Ejipta ka mandraka androany. Tao anaty tranolay foana no nisy ahy tamin’ireny nandehandeha ireny.', 'fa tsy nipetraka tao anaty trano aho, hatramin’ny andro nitondrako ny zanak’israely niakatra avy tany ejipta ka mandraka androany. tao anaty tranolay foana no nisy ahy tamin’ireny nandehandeha ireny.'),
  ('6ab25a310edc6700f28a9055', '2026-09-22T10:36:33.259Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:33.259Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 7, 28, 'Koa ankehitriny, ry Jehovah Tompo Fara Tampony ô, ianao no tena Andriamanitra. Ary aoka ho hita fa marina ny teninao, satria ianao mampanantena izany zava-tsoa izany amin’ny mpanomponao.', 'koa ankehitriny, ry jehovah tompo fara tampony ô, ianao no tena andriamanitra. ary aoka ho hita fa marina ny teninao, satria ianao mampanantena izany zava-tsoa izany amin’ny mpanomponao.'),
  ('6ab25a310edc6700f28a9052', '2026-09-22T10:36:33.259Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:33.259Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 7, 25, '“Koa ankehitriny, ry Jehovah Andriamanitra ô, tanteraho mandritra ny fotoana tsy voafetra ny teninao momba ny mpanomponao sy ny taranany. Ary ataovy izay efa nolazainao.', '“koa ankehitriny, ry jehovah andriamanitra ô, tanteraho mandritra ny fotoana tsy voafetra ny teninao momba ny mpanomponao sy ny taranany. ary ataovy izay efa nolazainao.'),
  ('6ab25a310edc6700f28a904e', '2026-09-22T10:36:33.259Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:33.259Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 7, 21, 'Fa noho ny teninao sy araka izay sitraky ny fonao no nanaovanao izany zavatra lehibe rehetra izany, ka nampahafantarinao ny mpanomponao izany.', 'fa noho ny teninao sy araka izay sitraky ny fonao no nanaovanao izany zavatra lehibe rehetra izany, ka nampahafantarinao ny mpanomponao izany.'),
  ('6ab25a310edc6700f28a904d', '2026-09-22T10:36:33.259Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:33.259Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 7, 20, 'Inona intsony moa no azon’i Davida lazaina aminao? Ianao efa mahalala tsara ny mpanomponao, ry Jehovah Tompo Fara Tampony ô!', 'inona intsony moa no azon’i davida lazaina aminao? ianao efa mahalala tsara ny mpanomponao, ry jehovah tompo fara tampony ô!'),
  ('6ab25a310edc6700f28a904f', '2026-09-22T10:36:33.259Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:33.259Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 7, 22, 'Koa lehibe tokoa ianao, ry Jehovah Tompo Fara Tampony ô! Fa tsy misy tahaka anao, ary tsy misy Andriamanitra ankoatra anao amin’izay rehetra efa renay.', 'koa lehibe tokoa ianao, ry jehovah tompo fara tampony ô! fa tsy misy tahaka anao, ary tsy misy andriamanitra ankoatra anao amin’izay rehetra efa renay.'),
  ('6ab25a310edc6700f28a904c', '2026-09-22T10:36:33.259Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:33.259Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 7, 19, 'Ary toy ny hoe tsy ampy izany efa nataonao izany, ry Jehovah Tompo Fara Tampony ô, fa mbola nilazanao koa aho hoe haharitra hatrany aoriana lavitra any ny taranaky ny mpanomponao. Izany no lalàna nomenao ny olombelona, ry Jehovah Tompo Fara Tampony ô!', 'ary toy ny hoe tsy ampy izany efa nataonao izany, ry jehovah tompo fara tampony ô, fa mbola nilazanao koa aho hoe haharitra hatrany aoriana lavitra any ny taranaky ny mpanomponao. izany no lalàna nomenao ny olombelona, ry jehovah tompo fara tampony ô!'),
  ('6ab25a310edc6700f28a904a', '2026-09-22T10:36:33.259Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:33.259Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 7, 17, 'Koa niresaka tamin’i Davida araka izany teny sy fahitana rehetra izany i Natana.', 'koa niresaka tamin’i davida araka izany teny sy fahitana rehetra izany i natana.'),
  ('6ab25a310edc6700f28a903d', '2026-09-22T10:36:33.259Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:33.259Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 7, 4, 'Ny alin’iny, dia tonga tamin’i Natana ny tenin’i Jehovah, nanao hoe:', 'ny alin’iny, dia tonga tamin’i natana ny tenin’i jehovah, nanao hoe:'),
  ('6ab25a310edc6700f28a9051', '2026-09-22T10:36:33.259Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:33.259Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 7, 24, 'Ary efa nampitoerinao ho olonao mandritra ny fotoana tsy voafetra ny Israely olonao. Ary ianao, Jehovah ô, no lasa Andriamaniny.”', 'ary efa nampitoerinao ho olonao mandritra ny fotoana tsy voafetra ny israely olonao. ary ianao, jehovah ô, no lasa andriamaniny.”'),
  ('6ab25a310edc6700f28a9050', '2026-09-22T10:36:33.259Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:33.259Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 7, 23, 'Ary firenena iza eto an-tany no tahaka ny Israely olonao, izay navotan’Andriamanitra ho olony? Nataon’Andriamanitra izany mba hampahalaza ny anarany. Nanao zavatra lehibe sy mampahatahotra ho azy ireo koa ianao, ka nandroaka an’ireo firenena sy ny andriamanitr’ireny, noho ny amin’ny olonao izay navotanao ho anao avy tany Ejipta.', 'ary firenena iza eto an-tany no tahaka ny israely olonao, izay navotan’andriamanitra ho olony? nataon’andriamanitra izany mba hampahalaza ny anarany. nanao zavatra lehibe sy mampahatahotra ho azy ireo koa ianao, ka nandroaka an’ireo firenena sy ny andriamanitr’ireny, noho ny amin’ny olonao izay navotanao ho anao avy tany ejipta.'),
  ('6ab25a310edc6700f28a9044', '2026-09-22T10:36:33.259Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:33.259Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 7, 11, 'sy toy ny tamin’ny fotoana nanendreko mpitsara hifehy ny Israely oloko. Ary hataoko mandry feizay eo anivon’ny fahavalonao rehetra ianao. “‘“Ary nolazain’i Jehovah taminao fa hanome taranaka anao i Jehovah.', 'sy toy ny tamin’ny fotoana nanendreko mpitsara hifehy ny israely oloko. ary hataoko mandry feizay eo anivon’ny fahavalonao rehetra ianao. “‘“ary nolazain’i jehovah taminao fa hanome taranaka anao i jehovah.'),
  ('6ab25a310edc6700f28a9053', '2026-09-22T10:36:33.259Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:33.259Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 7, 26, 'Aoka ho be voninahitra mandritra ny fotoana tsy voafetra ny anaranao, ary aoka ny olona hilaza hoe: ‘I Jehovah Tompon’ny tafika no Andriamanitry ny Israely.’ Aoka koa ho tafatoetra eo anatrehanao ny taranak’i Davida mpanomponao.', 'aoka ho be voninahitra mandritra ny fotoana tsy voafetra ny anaranao, ary aoka ny olona hilaza hoe: ‘i jehovah tompon’ny tafika no andriamanitry ny israely.’ aoka koa ho tafatoetra eo anatrehanao ny taranak’i davida mpanomponao.'),
  ('6ab25a310edc6700f28a9045', '2026-09-22T10:36:33.259Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:33.259Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 7, 12, 'Rehefa tapitra ny andronao ka hodimandry any amin’ny razanao ianao, dia hotendreko ny taranaka handimby anao izay haterakao, ary hataoko mafy orina tokoa ny fanjakany.', 'rehefa tapitra ny andronao ka hodimandry any amin’ny razanao ianao, dia hotendreko ny taranaka handimby anao izay haterakao, ary hataoko mafy orina tokoa ny fanjakany.'),
  ('6ab25a310edc6700f28a9042', '2026-09-22T10:36:33.259Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:33.259Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 7, 9, 'Ary homba anao aho na aiza na aiza alehanao, ka haringako tsy ho eo anoloanao ny fahavalonao rehetra. Dia hataoko malaza tokoa ny anaranao, toy ny anaran’ny olo-malaza eny ambonin’ny tany.', 'ary homba anao aho na aiza na aiza alehanao, ka haringako tsy ho eo anoloanao ny fahavalonao rehetra. dia hataoko malaza tokoa ny anaranao, toy ny anaran’ny olo-malaza eny ambonin’ny tany.'),
  ('6ab25a310edc6700f28a9040', '2026-09-22T10:36:33.259Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:33.259Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 7, 7, 'Nandritra ny fotoana nandehandehanako teo amin’ny zanak’Israely rehetra, moa ve efa nisy iray tamin’ny fokon’ny Israely, izay nodidiako hiandry ny Israely oloko, mba efa nilazako hoe: ‘Nahoana ianareo no tsy nanorina trano sedera ho ahy?’”’', 'nandritra ny fotoana nandehandehanako teo amin’ny zanak’israely rehetra, moa ve efa nisy iray tamin’ny fokon’ny israely, izay nodidiako hiandry ny israely oloko, mba efa nilazako hoe: ‘nahoana ianareo no tsy nanorina trano sedera ho ahy?’”’'),
  ('6ab25a310edc6700f28a9041', '2026-09-22T10:36:33.259Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:33.259Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 7, 8, 'Koa izao no holazainao amin’i Davida mpanompoko: ‘Izao no nolazain’i Jehovah Tompon’ny tafika: “Izaho no naka anao avy teny amin’ny kijana, teny am-piandrasana ondry, mba ho mpitarika ny Israely oloko.', 'koa izao no holazainao amin’i davida mpanompoko: ‘izao no nolazain’i jehovah tompon’ny tafika: “izaho no naka anao avy teny amin’ny kijana, teny am-piandrasana ondry, mba ho mpitarika ny israely oloko.'),
  ('6ab25a310edc6700f28a9054', '2026-09-22T10:36:33.259Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:33.259Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 7, 27, 'Fa ianao, ry Jehovah Tompon’ny tafika, Andriamanitry ny Israely, no nanambara tamin’ny mpanomponao hoe: ‘Hanome taranaka ho anao aho.’ Izany no nahasahian’ny mpanomponao hanao izao vavaka izao aminao.', 'fa ianao, ry jehovah tompon’ny tafika, andriamanitry ny israely, no nanambara tamin’ny mpanomponao hoe: ‘hanome taranaka ho anao aho.’ izany no nahasahian’ny mpanomponao hanao izao vavaka izao aminao.'),
  ('6ab25a310edc6700f28a903c', '2026-09-22T10:36:33.259Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:33.259Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 7, 3, 'Dia hoy i Natana taminy: “Mandehana ka ataovy izay rehetra ao am-ponao, fa momba anao i Jehovah.”', 'dia hoy i natana taminy: “mandehana ka ataovy izay rehetra ao am-ponao, fa momba anao i jehovah.”'),
  ('6ab25a310edc6700f28a903b', '2026-09-22T10:36:33.259Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:33.259Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 7, 2, 'dia hoy izy tamin’i Natana mpaminany: “Jereo fa izaho mipetraka amin’ny trano sedera, nefa ny Vata masin’Andriamanitra mipetraka anaty tranolay.”', 'dia hoy izy tamin’i natana mpaminany: “jereo fa izaho mipetraka amin’ny trano sedera, nefa ny vata masin’andriamanitra mipetraka anaty tranolay.”'),
  ('6ab25a310edc6700f28a903a', '2026-09-22T10:36:33.259Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:33.259Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 7, 1, 'Rehefa tafapetraka tao an-dapany ny mpanjaka, sady efa nataon’i Jehovah mandry feizay teo anivon’ny fahavalony rehetra nanodidina,', 'rehefa tafapetraka tao an-dapany ny mpanjaka, sady efa nataon’i jehovah mandry feizay teo anivon’ny fahavalony rehetra nanodidina,'),
  ('6ab25a3265e919060284d103', '2026-09-22T10:36:34.299Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:34.299Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 8, 18, 'ary Benaia zanak’i Joiada no lehiben’ny Keretita sy ny Peletita. Ary ny zanakalahin’i Davida dia lasa mpisorona. *', 'ary benaia zanak’i joiada no lehiben’ny keretita sy ny peletita. ary ny zanakalahin’i davida dia lasa mpisorona. *'),
  ('6ab25a3265e919060284d101', '2026-09-22T10:36:34.299Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:34.299Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 8, 16, 'I Joaba zanak’i Zeroia no lehiben’ny tafika; Josafata zanak’i Ahiloda no mpanoratra ny raharaham-panjakana;', 'i joaba zanak’i zeroia no lehiben’ny tafika; josafata zanak’i ahiloda no mpanoratra ny raharaham-panjakana;'),
  ('6ab25a3265e919060284d100', '2026-09-22T10:36:34.299Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:34.299Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 8, 15, 'Dia nanjaka teo amin’ny Israely rehetra i Davida, ka namoaka didim-pitsarana sy nampihatra ny rariny foana teo amin’ny vahoakany manontolo.', 'dia nanjaka teo amin’ny israely rehetra i davida, ka namoaka didim-pitsarana sy nampihatra ny rariny foana teo amin’ny vahoakany manontolo.'),
  ('6ab25a3265e919060284d0f8', '2026-09-22T10:36:34.299Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:34.299Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 8, 7, 'Nalain’i Davida koa ny ampinga volamena boribory teny amin’ireo mpanompon’i Hadadezera, ka nentiny tany Jerosalema.', 'nalain’i davida koa ny ampinga volamena boribory teny amin’ireo mpanompon’i hadadezera, ka nentiny tany jerosalema.'),
  ('6ab25a3265e919060284d0fe', '2026-09-22T10:36:34.299Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:34.299Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 8, 13, 'Dia nanjary nalaza ny anaran’i Davida, rehefa tafaverina avy namono nahafaty Edomita valo arivo sy iray alina teo amin’ny Lohasahan-tsira izy.', 'dia nanjary nalaza ny anaran’i davida, rehefa tafaverina avy namono nahafaty edomita valo arivo sy iray alina teo amin’ny lohasahan-tsira izy.'),
  ('6ab25a3265e919060284d0fd', '2026-09-22T10:36:34.299Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:34.299Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 8, 12, 'dia avy tamin’i Syria sy Moaba, sy ny taranak’i Amona sy ny Filistinina, ary ny Amalekita, ary avy tamin’ny zavatra azo babo tamin’i Hadadezera zanak’i Rehoba mpanjakan’i Zoba.', 'dia avy tamin’i syria sy moaba, sy ny taranak’i amona sy ny filistinina, ary ny amalekita, ary avy tamin’ny zavatra azo babo tamin’i hadadezera zanak’i rehoba mpanjakan’i zoba.'),
  ('6ab25a3265e919060284d0f6', '2026-09-22T10:36:34.299Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:34.299Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 8, 5, 'Rehefa tonga hanampy an’i Hadadezera mpanjakan’i Zoba ny Syrianina avy any Damaskosy, dia nahafatesan’i Davida roa arivo sy roa alina izy ireo.', 'rehefa tonga hanampy an’i hadadezera mpanjakan’i zoba ny syrianina avy any damaskosy, dia nahafatesan’i davida roa arivo sy roa alina izy ireo.'),
  ('6ab25a3265e919060284d0ff', '2026-09-22T10:36:34.299Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:34.299Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 8, 14, 'Ary nametrahany toby miaramila tany Edoma. Eny, nametrahany toby miaramila eran’i Edoma, ka lasa mpanompon’i Davida ny Edomita rehetra. Ary novonjen’i Jehovah foana i Davida, na taiza na taiza nalehany.', 'ary nametrahany toby miaramila tany edoma. eny, nametrahany toby miaramila eran’i edoma, ka lasa mpanompon’i davida ny edomita rehetra. ary novonjen’i jehovah foana i davida, na taiza na taiza nalehany.'),
  ('6ab25a3265e919060284d0fa', '2026-09-22T10:36:34.299Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:34.299Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 8, 9, 'Dia henon’i Toy mpanjakan’i Hamata fa resin’i Davida ny tafika manontolon’i Hadadezera.', 'dia henon’i toy mpanjakan’i hamata fa resin’i davida ny tafika manontolon’i hadadezera.'),
  ('6ab25a3265e919060284d0f3', '2026-09-22T10:36:34.299Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:34.299Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 8, 2, 'Nandresy ny Moabita koa izy. Dia nasainy nitsotra tamin’ny tany ireo mba horefesina amin’ny tady. Ary nandrefy indroa tamin’ny halavan’ilay tady izy, ka natokany hovonoina ho faty izay tafiditra tao anatin’izay, ary nandrefy indray mandeha izy ka navelany ho velona izay tao anatin’izay. Dia lasa mpanompon’i Davida ny Moabita ka nandoa hetra taminy.', 'nandresy ny moabita koa izy. dia nasainy nitsotra tamin’ny tany ireo mba horefesina amin’ny tady. ary nandrefy indroa tamin’ny halavan’ilay tady izy, ka natokany hovonoina ho faty izay tafiditra tao anatin’izay, ary nandrefy indray mandeha izy ka navelany ho velona izay tao anatin’izay. dia lasa mpanompon’i davida ny moabita ka nandoa hetra taminy.'),
  ('6ab25a3265e919060284d0f5', '2026-09-22T10:36:34.299Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:34.299Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 8, 4, 'Ary i Davida nahazo babo avy taminy, dia mpitaingin-tsoavaly fitonjato sy arivo, sy lehilahy roa alina nandeha an-tongotra. Dia notapahin’i Davida ny hoza-tongotry ny soavaly rehetra mpitarika kalesy, fa soavaly zato sisa no tsy nataony na inona na inona.', 'ary i davida nahazo babo avy taminy, dia mpitaingin-tsoavaly fitonjato sy arivo, sy lehilahy roa alina nandeha an-tongotra. dia notapahin’i davida ny hoza-tongotry ny soavaly rehetra mpitarika kalesy, fa soavaly zato sisa no tsy nataony na inona na inona.'),
  ('6ab25a3265e919060284d0f2', '2026-09-22T10:36:34.299Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:34.299Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 8, 1, 'Taorian’izany, dia notafihin’i Davida ny Filistinina ka resiny. Ary nalainy teo an-tanan’izy ireo i Metega-ama.', 'taorian’izany, dia notafihin’i davida ny filistinina ka resiny. ary nalainy teo an-tanan’izy ireo i metega-ama.'),
  ('6ab25a3265e919060284d0f9', '2026-09-22T10:36:34.299Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:34.299Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 8, 8, 'Ary naka varahina be dia be avy tany Beta sy Berotahy, tanànan’i Hadadezera, i Davida Mpanjaka.', 'ary naka varahina be dia be avy tany beta sy berotahy, tanànan’i hadadezera, i davida mpanjaka.'),
  ('6ab25a3265e919060284d0fb', '2026-09-22T10:36:34.299Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:34.299Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 8, 10, 'Koa nirahin’i Toy ho any amin’i Davida Mpanjaka i Jorama zanany lahy, mba hanontany ny fahasalamany sy hiarahaba azy noho ny niadiany tamin’i Hadadezera ka nandreseny azy. I Hadadezera mantsy efa niady matetika tamin’i Toy. Ary nitondra zavatra vita tamin’ny volafotsy sy volamena ary varahina i Jorama.', 'koa nirahin’i toy ho any amin’i davida mpanjaka i jorama zanany lahy, mba hanontany ny fahasalamany sy hiarahaba azy noho ny niadiany tamin’i hadadezera ka nandreseny azy. i hadadezera mantsy efa niady matetika tamin’i toy. ary nitondra zavatra vita tamin’ny volafotsy sy volamena ary varahina i jorama.'),
  ('6ab25a3265e919060284d102', '2026-09-22T10:36:34.299Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:34.299Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 8, 17, 'Zadoka zanak’i Ahitoba sy Ahimeleka zanak’i Abiatara no mpisorona; Seraia no mpitan-tsoratra;', 'zadoka zanak’i ahitoba sy ahimeleka zanak’i abiatara no mpisorona; seraia no mpitan-tsoratra;'),
  ('6ab25a3265e919060284d0fc', '2026-09-22T10:36:34.299Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:34.299Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 8, 11, 'Nohamasinin’i Davida Mpanjaka ho an’i Jehovah koa ireny, toy ny nanamasinany ny volafotsy sy ny volamena avy tamin’ny firenena rehetra resiny,', 'nohamasinin’i davida mpanjaka ho an’i jehovah koa ireny, toy ny nanamasinany ny volafotsy sy ny volamena avy tamin’ny firenena rehetra resiny,'),
  ('6ab25a3265e919060284d0f7', '2026-09-22T10:36:34.299Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:34.299Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 8, 6, 'Nametraka toby miaramila tany Damaskosin’i Syria i Davida. Dia lasa mpanompony ny Syrianina, ka nandoa hetra taminy. Ary novonjen’i Jehovah foana i Davida, na taiza na taiza nalehany.', 'nametraka toby miaramila tany damaskosin’i syria i davida. dia lasa mpanompony ny syrianina, ka nandoa hetra taminy. ary novonjen’i jehovah foana i davida, na taiza na taiza nalehany.'),
  ('6ab25a3265e919060284d0f4', '2026-09-22T10:36:34.299Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:34.299Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 8, 3, 'Notafihin’i Davida koa i Hadadezera, zanak’i Rehoba mpanjakan’i Zoba, tamin’izy io nitady hanamafy indray ny fahefany, tany amin’ny reniranon’i Eofrata.', 'notafihin’i davida koa i hadadezera, zanak’i rehoba mpanjakan’i zoba, tamin’izy io nitady hanamafy indray ny fahefany, tany amin’ny reniranon’i eofrata.'),
  ('6ab25a418e7c659d2db78b4f', '2026-09-22T10:36:49.815Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:49.815Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 22, 2, 'Hoy izy: “I Jehovah no harambatoko sy fiarovana mafy ho ahy ary Mpanafaka ahy.', 'hoy izy: “i jehovah no harambatoko sy fiarovana mafy ho ahy ary mpanafaka ahy.'),
  ('6ab25a418e7c659d2db78b51', '2026-09-22T10:36:49.815Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:49.815Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 22, 4, 'I Jehovah, Ilay mendrika hoderaina, no hantsoiko, Ka ho voavonjy amin’ny fahavaloko aho.', 'i jehovah, ilay mendrika hoderaina, no hantsoiko, ka ho voavonjy amin’ny fahavaloko aho.'),
  ('6ab25a418e7c659d2db78b50', '2026-09-22T10:36:49.815Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:49.815Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 22, 3, 'Andriamanitro no vatolampiko. Hialoka aminy aho, Fa izy no ampingako sy tandroka famonjena ahy, tendrombohitra fandosirako, Toerana fandosirako, ary Mpamonjy ahy. Mamonjy ahy amin’ny herisetra ianao.', 'andriamanitro no vatolampiko. hialoka aminy aho, fa izy no ampingako sy tandroka famonjena ahy, tendrombohitra fandosirako, toerana fandosirako, ary mpamonjy ahy. mamonjy ahy amin’ny herisetra ianao.'),
  ('6ab25a418e7c659d2db78b4e', '2026-09-22T10:36:49.815Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:49.815Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 22, 1, 'Nanao izao tononkira izao ho an’i Jehovah i Davida, tamin’ny andro namonjen’i Jehovah azy teo am-pelatanan’ny fahavalony rehetra sy teo am-pelatanan’i Saoly.', 'nanao izao tononkira izao ho an’i jehovah i davida, tamin’ny andro namonjen’i jehovah azy teo am-pelatanan’ny fahavalony rehetra sy teo am-pelatanan’i saoly.'),
  ('6ab25a418e7c659d2db78b80', '2026-09-22T10:36:49.816Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:49.816Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 22, 51, 'Ry Ilay manao asa famonjena lehibe ho an’ny mpanjaka voatendriny, Ary maneho hatsaram-panahy feno fitiavana amin’ny voahosony, Dia i Davida sy ny taranany, mandritra ny fotoana tsy voafetra.”', 'ry ilay manao asa famonjena lehibe ho an’ny mpanjaka voatendriny, ary maneho hatsaram-panahy feno fitiavana amin’ny voahosony, dia i davida sy ny taranany, mandritra ny fotoana tsy voafetra.”'),
  ('6ab25a418e7c659d2db78b7d', '2026-09-22T10:36:49.816Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:49.816Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 22, 48, 'Ilay tena Andriamanitra no Mpamaly ny ratsy atao amiko. Izy no mampietry an’ireo firenena ho eo ambaniko,', 'ilay tena andriamanitra no mpamaly ny ratsy atao amiko. izy no mampietry an’ireo firenena ho eo ambaniko,'),
  ('6ab25a418e7c659d2db78b75', '2026-09-22T10:36:49.816Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:49.816Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 22, 40, 'Homenao hery hoenti-miady aho, Ary hataonao lavo eo ambaniko izay mitsangana hanohitra ahy.', 'homenao hery hoenti-miady aho, ary hataonao lavo eo ambaniko izay mitsangana hanohitra ahy.'),
  ('6ab25a418e7c659d2db78b5b', '2026-09-22T10:36:49.816Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:49.816Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 22, 14, 'Nampirefotra kotroka avy tany an-danitra i Jehovah, Ary nanandratra ny feony ny Avo Indrindra.', 'nampirefotra kotroka avy tany an-danitra i jehovah, ary nanandratra ny feony ny avo indrindra.'),
  ('6ab25a418e7c659d2db78b58', '2026-09-22T10:36:49.816Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:49.816Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 22, 11, 'Nitaingina kerobima izy ka nanidina, Ary hita teny ambony elatry ny anjely. *', 'nitaingina kerobima izy ka nanidina, ary hita teny ambony elatry ny anjely. *'),
  ('6ab25a418e7c659d2db78b7f', '2026-09-22T10:36:49.816Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:49.816Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 22, 50, 'Koa izany no hisaorako anao eo amin’ireo firenena, Jehovah ô, Sy hanaovako hira fiderana ho an’ny anaranao,', 'koa izany no hisaorako anao eo amin’ireo firenena, jehovah ô, sy hanaovako hira fiderana ho an’ny anaranao,'),
  ('6ab25a418e7c659d2db78b5a', '2026-09-22T10:36:49.816Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:49.816Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 22, 13, 'Ny famirapiratana teo anatrehany no nampirehitra vainafo.', 'ny famirapiratana teo anatrehany no nampirehitra vainafo.'),
  ('6ab25a418e7c659d2db78b73', '2026-09-22T10:36:49.816Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:49.816Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 22, 38, 'Hanenjika ny fahavaloko aho mba handripahako azy, Ary tsy hiverina aho mandra-paharingany tanteraka.', 'hanenjika ny fahavaloko aho mba handripahako azy, ary tsy hiverina aho mandra-paharingany tanteraka.'),
  ('6ab25a418e7c659d2db78b71', '2026-09-22T10:36:49.816Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:49.816Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 22, 36, 'Hanome ahy ny ampinga famonjenao ianao, Ary ny fanetren-tenanao no mampisandratra ahy.', 'hanome ahy ny ampinga famonjenao ianao, ary ny fanetren-tenanao no mampisandratra ahy.'),
  ('6ab25a418e7c659d2db78b7c', '2026-09-22T10:36:49.816Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:49.816Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 22, 47, 'Velona i Jehovah. Hisaorana anie ilay Vatolampiko, Ary hasandratra anie Andriamanitra, ilay vatolampy mpamonjy ahy!', 'velona i jehovah. hisaorana anie ilay vatolampiko, ary hasandratra anie andriamanitra, ilay vatolampy mpamonjy ahy!'),
  ('6ab25a418e7c659d2db78b74', '2026-09-22T10:36:49.816Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:49.816Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 22, 39, 'Haringako sy hotorotoroiko ireny mba tsy ho afa-mitsangana intsony. Ho lavo eo ambany tongotro ireny.', 'haringako sy hotorotoroiko ireny mba tsy ho afa-mitsangana intsony. ho lavo eo ambany tongotro ireny.'),
  ('6ab25a418e7c659d2db78b6e', '2026-09-22T10:36:49.816Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:49.816Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 22, 33, 'Ilay tena Andriamanitra no fiarovana mafy ho ahy, Ary hataony izay hahalavorary ny lalako.', 'ilay tena andriamanitra no fiarovana mafy ho ahy, ary hataony izay hahalavorary ny lalako.'),
  ('6ab25a418e7c659d2db78b64', '2026-09-22T10:36:49.816Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:49.816Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 22, 23, 'Eo anatrehako ny didim-pitsarany rehetra, Ary tsy mba hiala amin’ny lalàny aho.', 'eo anatrehako ny didim-pitsarany rehetra, ary tsy mba hiala amin’ny lalàny aho.'),
  ('6ab25a418e7c659d2db78b7e', '2026-09-22T10:36:49.816Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:49.816Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 22, 49, 'Ary Izy no mamoaka ahy ho afaka amin’ny fahavaloko. Hanandratra ahy ho ambonin’izay mitsangana hanohitra ahy ianao, Ary hanafaka ahy amin’ny olona mahery setra.', 'ary izy no mamoaka ahy ho afaka amin’ny fahavaloko. hanandratra ahy ho ambonin’izay mitsangana hanohitra ahy ianao, ary hanafaka ahy amin’ny olona mahery setra.'),
  ('6ab25a418e7c659d2db78b5d', '2026-09-22T10:36:49.816Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:49.816Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 22, 16, 'Nanjary hita ny fanambanin’ny ranomasina, Ary niharihary ny fototry ny tany lonaka, Satria niteny mafy azy i Jehovah, ary ny fofonain’ny vavorony no nitsofany azy.', 'nanjary hita ny fanambanin’ny ranomasina, ary niharihary ny fototry ny tany lonaka, satria niteny mafy azy i jehovah, ary ny fofonain’ny vavorony no nitsofany azy.'),
  ('6ab25a418e7c659d2db78b5c', '2026-09-22T10:36:49.816Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:49.816Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 22, 15, 'Tsy nitsahatra nandefa zana-tsipìka izy mba hanaparitahana an’ireny, Sy tselatra mba hahatonga an’ireny hisahotaka.', 'tsy nitsahatra nandefa zana-tsipìka izy mba hanaparitahana an’ireny, sy tselatra mba hahatonga an’ireny hisahotaka.'),
  ('6ab25a418e7c659d2db78b6b', '2026-09-22T10:36:49.816Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:49.816Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 22, 30, 'Noho ianao, dia mahavita mihazakazaka hamely mpandroba aho, Noho ilay Andriamanitro, dia mahavita mianika manda aho.', 'noho ianao, dia mahavita mihazakazaka hamely mpandroba aho, noho ilay andriamanitro, dia mahavita mianika manda aho.'),
  ('6ab25a418e7c659d2db78b62', '2026-09-22T10:36:49.816Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:49.816Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 22, 21, 'Mamaly soa ahy araka ny fahamarinako i Jehovah, Ary mamaly ahy araka ny fahadiovan’ny tanako.', 'mamaly soa ahy araka ny fahamarinako i jehovah, ary mamaly ahy araka ny fahadiovan’ny tanako.'),
  ('6ab25a418e7c659d2db78b5e', '2026-09-22T10:36:49.816Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:49.816Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 22, 17, 'Avy any amin’ny avo izy no nanatsotra ny tanany ka nandray ahy, Ary nisarika ahy avy tao anaty rano be.', 'avy any amin’ny avo izy no nanatsotra ny tanany ka nandray ahy, ary nisarika ahy avy tao anaty rano be.'),
  ('6ab25a418e7c659d2db78b56', '2026-09-22T10:36:49.816Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:49.816Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 22, 9, 'Nisy setroka niakatra avy teo am-bavorony, ary nisy afo nandevona avy tamin’ny vavany. Nisy vainafo niredareda avy taminy.', 'nisy setroka niakatra avy teo am-bavorony, ary nisy afo nandevona avy tamin’ny vavany. nisy vainafo niredareda avy taminy.'),
  ('6ab25a418e7c659d2db78b6c', '2026-09-22T10:36:49.816Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:49.816Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 22, 31, 'Tonga lafatra ny lalan’ilay tena Andriamanitra. Madio toy ny metaly voadio ny tenin’i Jehovah. Ampingan’izay rehetra mialoka aminy izy.', 'tonga lafatra ny lalan’ilay tena andriamanitra. madio toy ny metaly voadio ny tenin’i jehovah. ampingan’izay rehetra mialoka aminy izy.'),
  ('6ab25a418e7c659d2db78b67', '2026-09-22T10:36:49.816Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:49.816Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 22, 26, 'Ny olona tsy mivadika no tsy hivadihanao, Ary ny olo-mahery tsy manan-tsiny no hoentinao amin’ny fomba tsy misy tsiny.', 'ny olona tsy mivadika no tsy hivadihanao, ary ny olo-mahery tsy manan-tsiny no hoentinao amin’ny fomba tsy misy tsiny.'),
  ('6ab25a418e7c659d2db78b61', '2026-09-22T10:36:49.816Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:49.816Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 22, 20, 'Namoaka ahy eo amin’ny toerana malalaka izy, Ary namonjy ahy satria nankasitraka ahy.', 'namoaka ahy eo amin’ny toerana malalaka izy, ary namonjy ahy satria nankasitraka ahy.'),
  ('6ab25a418e7c659d2db78b7b', '2026-09-22T10:36:49.816Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:49.816Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 22, 46, 'Ho lany hery ny hafa firenena, Ary hipararetra izy ireo mivoaka avy ao amin’ny manda fiarovany.', 'ho lany hery ny hafa firenena, ary hipararetra izy ireo mivoaka avy ao amin’ny manda fiarovany.'),
  ('6ab25a418e7c659d2db78b57', '2026-09-22T10:36:49.816Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:49.816Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 22, 10, 'Dia natongilany ny lanitra ka nidina izy, Ary haizim-pito no teo ambany tongony.', 'dia natongilany ny lanitra ka nidina izy, ary haizim-pito no teo ambany tongony.'),
  ('6ab25a418e7c659d2db78b7a', '2026-09-22T10:36:49.816Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:49.816Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 22, 45, 'Hanatona ahy amin-tahotra ny hafa firenena, Ary hanaiky hihaino ahy ny sofiny.', 'hanatona ahy amin-tahotra ny hafa firenena, ary hanaiky hihaino ahy ny sofiny.'),
  ('6ab25a418e7c659d2db78b72', '2026-09-22T10:36:49.816Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:49.816Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 22, 37, 'Hataonao malalaka tsara ny lalana hodiaviko, Ary tsy hangozohozo mihitsy ny tongotro.', 'hataonao malalaka tsara ny lalana hodiaviko, ary tsy hangozohozo mihitsy ny tongotro.'),
  ('6ab25a418e7c659d2db78b6a', '2026-09-22T10:36:49.816Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:49.816Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 22, 29, 'Fa ianao no jiroko, Jehovah ô! Ary i Jehovah no manazava ny haizina misy ahy.', 'fa ianao no jiroko, jehovah ô! ary i jehovah no manazava ny haizina misy ahy.'),
  ('6ab25a418e7c659d2db78b69', '2026-09-22T10:36:49.816Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:49.816Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 22, 28, 'Hovonjenao ny manetry tena, Ary manohitra ny mpirehareha ny masonao, mba hampietrenao azy.', 'hovonjenao ny manetry tena, ary manohitra ny mpirehareha ny masonao, mba hampietrenao azy.'),
  ('6ab25a418e7c659d2db78b55', '2026-09-22T10:36:49.816Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:49.816Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 22, 8, 'Nihozongozona sy nihovotrovotra ny tany, Nihorohoro ny fototry ny lanitra. Nihozongozona tsy an-kijanona ireny satria nisy nampahatezitra Azy.', 'nihozongozona sy nihovotrovotra ny tany, nihorohoro ny fototry ny lanitra. nihozongozona tsy an-kijanona ireny satria nisy nampahatezitra azy.'),
  ('6ab25a418e7c659d2db78b79', '2026-09-22T10:36:49.816Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:49.816Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 22, 44, 'Hanafaka ahy amin’ny fanakianan’ny oloko ianao. Hiaro ahy ianao mba hahatonga ahy ho filohan’ireo firenena, Ary vahoaka mbola tsy fantatro no hanompo ahy.', 'hanafaka ahy amin’ny fanakianan’ny oloko ianao. hiaro ahy ianao mba hahatonga ahy ho filohan’ireo firenena, ary vahoaka mbola tsy fantatro no hanompo ahy.'),
  ('6ab25a418e7c659d2db78b77', '2026-09-22T10:36:49.816Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:49.816Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 22, 42, 'Miantso vonjy ireny, nefa tsy misy mpamonjy, Eny, miantso an’i Jehovah ireny nefa tsy valiany.', 'miantso vonjy ireny, nefa tsy misy mpamonjy, eny, miantso an’i jehovah ireny nefa tsy valiany.'),
  ('6ab25a418e7c659d2db78b68', '2026-09-22T10:36:49.816Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:49.816Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 22, 27, 'Ny olona madio no hisehoanao ho madio, Ary ny olona fatsora no hanaovanao zavatra toa adaladala.', 'ny olona madio no hisehoanao ho madio, ary ny olona fatsora no hanaovanao zavatra toa adaladala.'),
  ('6ab25a418e7c659d2db78b65', '2026-09-22T10:36:49.816Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:49.816Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 22, 24, 'Tsy hanan-tsiny eo anatrehany aho, Sady hitandrin-tena tsy hanao fahadisoana.', 'tsy hanan-tsiny eo anatrehany aho, sady hitandrin-tena tsy hanao fahadisoana.'),
  ('6ab25a418e7c659d2db78b63', '2026-09-22T10:36:49.816Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:49.816Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 22, 22, 'Fa nanaraka foana ny lalan’i Jehovah aho, Ary tsy niala tamin’Andriamanitro, eny, tsy nanao izany ratsy izany aho.', 'fa nanaraka foana ny lalan’i jehovah aho, ary tsy niala tamin’andriamanitro, eny, tsy nanao izany ratsy izany aho.'),
  ('6ab25a418e7c659d2db78b60', '2026-09-22T10:36:49.816Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:49.816Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 22, 19, 'Nanohitra ahy foana ireny tamin’ny andro nahitako loza, Nefa i Jehovah nanampy ahy.', 'nanohitra ahy foana ireny tamin’ny andro nahitako loza, nefa i jehovah nanampy ahy.'),
  ('6ab25a418e7c659d2db78b54', '2026-09-22T10:36:49.816Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:49.816Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 22, 7, 'Niantso an’i Jehovah foana aho, tao anatin’ny fahoriako. Ilay Andriamanitro no nantsoiko mandrakariva. Tao an-tempoliny izy no nandre ny feoko, Ary ren’ny sofiny ny antso vonjy nataoko.', 'niantso an’i jehovah foana aho, tao anatin’ny fahoriako. ilay andriamanitro no nantsoiko mandrakariva. tao an-tempoliny izy no nandre ny feoko, ary ren’ny sofiny ny antso vonjy nataoko.'),
  ('6ab25a418e7c659d2db78b52', '2026-09-22T10:36:49.816Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:49.816Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 22, 5, 'Fa nihodidina ahy ny onja mahery mahafaty, Ary nampihorohoro ahy koa ireo olona tsy manjary, izay nanafotra tampoka toy ny ranotrambo.', 'fa nihodidina ahy ny onja mahery mahafaty, ary nampihorohoro ahy koa ireo olona tsy manjary, izay nanafotra tampoka toy ny ranotrambo.'),
  ('6ab25a418e7c659d2db78b76', '2026-09-22T10:36:49.816Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:49.816Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 22, 41, 'Hataonao mandositra eo anatrehako ny fahavaloko, * Ary hataoko mangina koa izay mankahala mafy ahy.', 'hataonao mandositra eo anatrehako ny fahavaloko, * ary hataoko mangina koa izay mankahala mafy ahy.'),
  ('6ab25a418e7c659d2db78b70', '2026-09-22T10:36:49.816Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:49.816Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 22, 35, 'Mampianatra ny tanako hiady izy, Ary ny sandriko no nampiasaiko hamatorana ny tadin’ny tsipìka varahina.', 'mampianatra ny tanako hiady izy, ary ny sandriko no nampiasaiko hamatorana ny tadin’ny tsipìka varahina.'),
  ('6ab25a418e7c659d2db78b6f', '2026-09-22T10:36:49.816Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:49.816Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 22, 34, 'Ataony toy ny an’ny serfavavy ny tongotro, Ary eo amin’ny toerana avo be no ampijoroany ahy.', 'ataony toy ny an’ny serfavavy ny tongotro, ary eo amin’ny toerana avo be no ampijoroany ahy.'),
  ('6ab25a418e7c659d2db78b5f', '2026-09-22T10:36:49.816Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:49.816Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 22, 18, 'Nanafaka ahy tamin’ny fahavalo mahery izy, Dia tamin’izay nankahala ahy. Nahery noho izaho mantsy ireny.', 'nanafaka ahy tamin’ny fahavalo mahery izy, dia tamin’izay nankahala ahy. nahery noho izaho mantsy ireny.'),
  ('6ab25a418e7c659d2db78b59', '2026-09-22T10:36:49.816Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:49.816Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 22, 12, 'Nataony nanodidina azy toy ny trano rantsankazo ny haizina, Dia rahona mainty vonton-drano.', 'nataony nanodidina azy toy ny trano rantsankazo ny haizina, dia rahona mainty vonton-drano.'),
  ('6ab25a418e7c659d2db78b53', '2026-09-22T10:36:49.816Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:49.816Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 22, 6, 'Nangeja ahy toy ny tady ny Fasana, * Ary nivelatra teo anoloako ny fandriky ny fahafatesana.', 'nangeja ahy toy ny tady ny fasana, * ary nivelatra teo anoloako ny fandriky ny fahafatesana.'),
  ('6ab25a418e7c659d2db78b6d', '2026-09-22T10:36:49.816Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:49.816Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 22, 32, 'Fa iza no Andriamanitra ankoatra an’i Jehovah, Ary iza no vatolampy ankoatra an’Andriamanitsika?', 'fa iza no andriamanitra ankoatra an’i jehovah, ary iza no vatolampy ankoatra an’andriamanitsika?'),
  ('6ab25a418e7c659d2db78b78', '2026-09-22T10:36:49.816Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:49.816Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 22, 43, 'Hataoko torotoro toy ny vovo-tany ireny, Ary hohitsakitsahiko toy ny fotaka eny an-dalambe, Ka hohoseko.', 'hataoko torotoro toy ny vovo-tany ireny, ary hohitsakitsahiko toy ny fotaka eny an-dalambe, ka hohoseko.'),
  ('6ab25a418e7c659d2db78b66', '2026-09-22T10:36:49.816Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:49.816Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 22, 25, 'Enga anie i Jehovah hamaly ahy araka ny fahamarinako, Sy araka ny fahadiovako eo imasony!', 'enga anie i jehovah hamaly ahy araka ny fahamarinako, sy araka ny fahadiovako eo imasony!'),
  ('6ab25a42cfa2e1617ad76dcf', '2026-09-22T10:36:50.728Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:50.728Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 24, 21, 'Ary hoy i Araona: “Nahoana ny mpanjaka tompoko no tonga atỳ amin’ny mpanompony?” Dia hoy i Davida: “Hividy ny famoloana aminao aho, hanorenana alitara ho an’i Jehovah mba hitsaharan’ilay loza mamely ny vahoaka.”', 'ary hoy i araona: “nahoana ny mpanjaka tompoko no tonga atỳ amin’ny mpanompony?” dia hoy i davida: “hividy ny famoloana aminao aho, hanorenana alitara ho an’i jehovah mba hitsaharan’ilay loza mamely ny vahoaka.”'),
  ('6ab25a42cfa2e1617ad76dca', '2026-09-22T10:36:50.728Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:50.728Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 24, 16, 'Ary naninjitra foana ny tanany tandrifin’i Jerosalema ilay anjely mba handringana an’ilay tanàna. Koa nanenina ny amin’ilay loza i Jehovah, ka hoy izy tamin’ilay anjely nandringana ny olona: “Aoka izay! Ampidino amin’izay ny tananao.” Ary teo akaikin’ny famoloan’i Araona Jebosita ilay anjelin’i Jehovah.', 'ary naninjitra foana ny tanany tandrifin’i jerosalema ilay anjely mba handringana an’ilay tanàna. koa nanenina ny amin’ilay loza i jehovah, ka hoy izy tamin’ilay anjely nandringana ny olona: “aoka izay! ampidino amin’izay ny tananao.” ary teo akaikin’ny famoloan’i araona jebosita ilay anjelin’i jehovah.'),
  ('6ab25a42cfa2e1617ad76dc2', '2026-09-22T10:36:50.728Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:50.728Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 24, 8, 'Koa nitety an’ilay tany manontolo izy ireo, ka tafaverina tany Jerosalema rehefa afaka sivy volana sy roapolo andro.', 'koa nitety an’ilay tany manontolo izy ireo, ka tafaverina tany jerosalema rehefa afaka sivy volana sy roapolo andro.'),
  ('6ab25a42cfa2e1617ad76dbe', '2026-09-22T10:36:50.728Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:50.728Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 24, 4, 'Farany anefa, dia tsy nahatohitra ny tenin’ny mpanjaka i Joaba sy ireo lehiben’ny tafika. Koa nivoaka avy teo anatrehan’ny mpanjaka i Joaba sy ireo lehiben’ny tafika mba hanisa ny vahoakan’Israely.', 'farany anefa, dia tsy nahatohitra ny tenin’ny mpanjaka i joaba sy ireo lehiben’ny tafika. koa nivoaka avy teo anatrehan’ny mpanjaka i joaba sy ireo lehiben’ny tafika mba hanisa ny vahoakan’israely.'),
  ('6ab25a42cfa2e1617ad76dbd', '2026-09-22T10:36:50.728Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:50.728Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 24, 3, 'Hoy anefa i Joaba tamin’ny mpanjaka: “Hampitomboin’i Jehovah Andriamanitrao avo zato heny anie ny isan’ny olona, ary ho hitan’ny mason’ny mpanjaka tompoko izany! Fa nahoana ny mpanjaka tompoko no te hanao izany zavatra izany?”', 'hoy anefa i joaba tamin’ny mpanjaka: “hampitomboin’i jehovah andriamanitrao avo zato heny anie ny isan’ny olona, ary ho hitan’ny mason’ny mpanjaka tompoko izany! fa nahoana ny mpanjaka tompoko no te hanao izany zavatra izany?”'),
  ('6ab25a42cfa2e1617ad76dcd', '2026-09-22T10:36:50.728Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:50.728Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 24, 19, 'Koa niakatra i Davida araka ny tenin’i Gada, araka izay nandidian’i Jehovah.', 'koa niakatra i davida araka ny tenin’i gada, araka izay nandidian’i jehovah.'),
  ('6ab25a42cfa2e1617ad76dbb', '2026-09-22T10:36:50.728Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:50.728Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 24, 1, 'Ary nirehitra tamin’ny Israely indray ny fahatezeran’i Jehovah, rehefa nisy nampirisika an’i Davida hahatonga loza tamin’ny Israely, nanao hoe: “Mandehana isao ny Israely sy ny Joda.”', 'ary nirehitra tamin’ny israely indray ny fahatezeran’i jehovah, rehefa nisy nampirisika an’i davida hahatonga loza tamin’ny israely, nanao hoe: “mandehana isao ny israely sy ny joda.”'),
  ('6ab25a42cfa2e1617ad76dc0', '2026-09-22T10:36:50.728Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:50.728Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 24, 6, 'Ary tonga tany Gileada izy ireo, ary avy eo tany Tatima-hodsy, dia nanohy ny diany nankany Dana-jana, ary nivily nankany Sidona.', 'ary tonga tany gileada izy ireo, ary avy eo tany tatima-hodsy, dia nanohy ny diany nankany dana-jana, ary nivily nankany sidona.'),
  ('6ab25a42cfa2e1617ad76dcc', '2026-09-22T10:36:50.728Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:50.728Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 24, 18, 'Dia nankao amin’i Davida i Gada tamin’iny andro iny ihany, ka niteny taminy hoe: “Miakara ka manorena alitara ho an’i Jehovah, eo amin’ny famoloan’i Araona Jebosita.”', 'dia nankao amin’i davida i gada tamin’iny andro iny ihany, ka niteny taminy hoe: “miakara ka manorena alitara ho an’i jehovah, eo amin’ny famoloan’i araona jebosita.”'),
  ('6ab25a42cfa2e1617ad76dc5', '2026-09-22T10:36:50.728Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:50.728Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 24, 11, 'Nony nifoha i Davida ny ampitso maraina, dia efa tonga tamin’i Gada mpaminany, mpahita fahitana ho an’i Davida, ny tenin’i Jehovah hoe:', 'nony nifoha i davida ny ampitso maraina, dia efa tonga tamin’i gada mpaminany, mpahita fahitana ho an’i davida, ny tenin’i jehovah hoe:'),
  ('6ab25a42cfa2e1617ad76dc1', '2026-09-22T10:36:50.728Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:50.728Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 24, 7, 'Avy eo izy ireo dia tonga tany Tyro, tanàna voaro mafy, sy tany amin’ny tanàna rehetran’ny Hivita sy ny Kananita, ary farany dia tany Beri-sheba any Negeba, any Joda.', 'avy eo izy ireo dia tonga tany tyro, tanàna voaro mafy, sy tany amin’ny tanàna rehetran’ny hivita sy ny kananita, ary farany dia tany beri-sheba any negeba, any joda.'),
  ('6ab25a42cfa2e1617ad76dc3', '2026-09-22T10:36:50.728Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:50.728Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 24, 9, 'Dia nomen’i Joaba ny mpanjaka ny isan’ireo voasoratra anarana, ka valo hetsy ny lehilahy mahery fo mpitan-tsabatra teo amin’ny Israely, ary dimy hetsy kosa ireo anisan’ny fokon’i Joda.', 'dia nomen’i joaba ny mpanjaka ny isan’ireo voasoratra anarana, ka valo hetsy ny lehilahy mahery fo mpitan-tsabatra teo amin’ny israely, ary dimy hetsy kosa ireo anisan’ny fokon’i joda.'),
  ('6ab25a42cfa2e1617ad76dbf', '2026-09-22T10:36:50.728Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:50.728Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 24, 5, 'Ary niampita ny Reniranon’i Jordana izy ireo ka nitoby tao Aroera, teo ankavanan’ilay tanàna izay eo afovoan’ilay lohasaha falehan-driaka. Dia nankany amin’ny Gadita sy nankany Jazera izy ireo.', 'ary niampita ny reniranon’i jordana izy ireo ka nitoby tao aroera, teo ankavanan’ilay tanàna izay eo afovoan’ilay lohasaha falehan-driaka. dia nankany amin’ny gadita sy nankany jazera izy ireo.'),
  ('6ab25a42cfa2e1617ad76dce', '2026-09-22T10:36:50.728Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:50.728Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 24, 20, 'Nony nitazana i Araona ka nahita fa tonga hankeny aminy ny mpanjaka sy ny mpanompony, dia niala teo avy hatrany izy ka niankohoka tamin’ny tany teo anatrehan’ny mpanjaka.', 'nony nitazana i araona ka nahita fa tonga hankeny aminy ny mpanjaka sy ny mpanompony, dia niala teo avy hatrany izy ka niankohoka tamin’ny tany teo anatrehan’ny mpanjaka.'),
  ('6ab25a42cfa2e1617ad76dbc', '2026-09-22T10:36:50.728Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:50.728Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 24, 2, 'Koa hoy ny mpanjaka tamin’i Joaba, lehiben’ny tafika, izay niaraka taminy: “Tetezo, azafady, ny foko rehetran’ny Israely, hatrany Dana ka hatrany Beri-sheba, ary isao ny vahoaka mba hahafantarako ny isany.”', 'koa hoy ny mpanjaka tamin’i joaba, lehiben’ny tafika, izay niaraka taminy: “tetezo, azafady, ny foko rehetran’ny israely, hatrany dana ka hatrany beri-sheba, ary isao ny vahoaka mba hahafantarako ny isany.”'),
  ('6ab25a42cfa2e1617ad76dcb', '2026-09-22T10:36:50.728Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:50.728Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 24, 17, 'Nony nahita an’ilay anjely namono ny olona i Davida, dia hoy izy tamin’i Jehovah: “Izaho no nanota ary izaho no nanao ratsy, fa ireto ondry ireto kosa, inona moa no nataony? Aoka re ny tananao hamely ahy sy ny ankohonan-draiko e!”', 'nony nahita an’ilay anjely namono ny olona i davida, dia hoy izy tamin’i jehovah: “izaho no nanota ary izaho no nanao ratsy, fa ireto ondry ireto kosa, inona moa no nataony? aoka re ny tananao hamely ahy sy ny ankohonan-draiko e!”'),
  ('6ab25a42cfa2e1617ad76dd0', '2026-09-22T10:36:50.728Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:50.728Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 24, 22, 'Hoy anefa i Araona: “Aoka ny mpanjaka tompoko haka ny famoloana, ka hanolotra izay hitany fa mety. Indreto ny omby hatao fanatitra dorana, ary ny fitaovana fanosihosena varimbazaha sy ny hazo amin’ny angadinomby mba hatao kitay.', 'hoy anefa i araona: “aoka ny mpanjaka tompoko haka ny famoloana, ka hanolotra izay hitany fa mety. indreto ny omby hatao fanatitra dorana, ary ny fitaovana fanosihosena varimbazaha sy ny hazo amin’ny angadinomby mba hatao kitay.'),
  ('6ab25a42cfa2e1617ad76dc8', '2026-09-22T10:36:50.728Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:50.728Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 24, 14, 'Dia hoy i Davida tamin’i Gada: “Ory loatra aho. Aleontsika azon’ny tanan’i Jehovah, fa lehibe ny famindram-pony, toy izay azon’ny tanan’olona.”', 'dia hoy i davida tamin’i gada: “ory loatra aho. aleontsika azon’ny tanan’i jehovah, fa lehibe ny famindram-pony, toy izay azon’ny tanan’olona.”'),
  ('6ab25a42cfa2e1617ad76dc6', '2026-09-22T10:36:50.728Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:50.728Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 24, 12, '“Mandehana, lazao amin’i Davida hoe: ‘Izao no nolazain’i Jehovah: “Famaizana telo no ataoko eo anoloanao, ka fidio izay iray hataoko aminao.”’”', '“mandehana, lazao amin’i davida hoe: ‘izao no nolazain’i jehovah: “famaizana telo no ataoko eo anoloanao, ka fidio izay iray hataoko aminao.”’”'),
  ('6ab25a42cfa2e1617ad76dc4', '2026-09-22T10:36:50.728Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:50.728Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 24, 10, 'Nanameloka an’i Davida anefa ny fony rehefa voaisany ny vahoaka. Koa hoy i Davida tamin’i Jehovah: “Tena nanao fahotana lehibe aho tamin’iny zavatra nataoko iny. Mba avelao * re ny fahadisoan’ny mpanomponao, Jehovah ô! Fa hadalana be mihitsy no nataoko.”', 'nanameloka an’i davida anefa ny fony rehefa voaisany ny vahoaka. koa hoy i davida tamin’i jehovah: “tena nanao fahotana lehibe aho tamin’iny zavatra nataoko iny. mba avelao * re ny fahadisoan’ny mpanomponao, jehovah ô! fa hadalana be mihitsy no nataoko.”'),
  ('6ab25a42cfa2e1617ad76dc9', '2026-09-22T10:36:50.728Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:50.728Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 24, 15, 'Koa nandefa areti-mandringana teo amin’ny Israely i Jehovah hatramin’ny maraina ka hatramin’ny fotoana voatondro, ka fito alina no maty hatrany Dana ka hatrany Beri-sheba.', 'koa nandefa areti-mandringana teo amin’ny israely i jehovah hatramin’ny maraina ka hatramin’ny fotoana voatondro, ka fito alina no maty hatrany dana ka hatrany beri-sheba.'),
  ('6ab25a42cfa2e1617ad76dc7', '2026-09-22T10:36:50.728Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:50.728Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 24, 13, 'Koa nankao amin’i Davida i Gada, ka nilaza taminy hoe: “Ho tratran’ny mosary fito taona eto amin’ny taninao ve no tianao, sa handositra telo volana eo anoloan’ny fahavalo manenjika anao, sa areti-mandringana telo andro eto amin’ny taninao? Diniho tsara izay havaliko an’Ilay naniraka ahy.”', 'koa nankao amin’i davida i gada, ka nilaza taminy hoe: “ho tratran’ny mosary fito taona eto amin’ny taninao ve no tianao, sa handositra telo volana eo anoloan’ny fahavalo manenjika anao, sa areti-mandringana telo andro eto amin’ny taninao? diniho tsara izay havaliko an’ilay naniraka ahy.”'),
  ('6ab25a42cfa2e1617ad76dd3', '2026-09-22T10:36:50.729Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:50.729Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 24, 25, 'Dia nanorina alitara ho an’i Jehovah teo i Davida, ka nanolotra sorona dorana sy sorona iombonana. Koa nohenoin’i Jehovah ny fitalahoana ho an’ilay tany, ka nitsahatra ilay loza namely ny Israely.', 'dia nanorina alitara ho an’i jehovah teo i davida, ka nanolotra sorona dorana sy sorona iombonana. koa nohenoin’i jehovah ny fitalahoana ho an’ilay tany, ka nitsahatra ilay loza namely ny israely.'),
  ('6ab25a42cfa2e1617ad76dd1', '2026-09-22T10:36:50.729Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:50.729Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 24, 23, 'Omen’i Araona ny mpanjaka avokoa izany, ry mpanjaka ô!” Hoy koa izy: “Hankasitraka anao anie i Jehovah Andriamanitrao!”', 'omen’i araona ny mpanjaka avokoa izany, ry mpanjaka ô!” hoy koa izy: “hankasitraka anao anie i jehovah andriamanitrao!”'),
  ('6ab25a42cfa2e1617ad76dd2', '2026-09-22T10:36:50.729Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:50.729Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Samoela', 10, 24, 24, 'Hoy anefa ny mpanjaka taminy: “Tsia, fa tsy maintsy hovidiko aminao araka izay vidiny izany. Tsy zavatra azoko maimaim-poana no hatolotro ho sorona dorana ho an’i Jehovah Andriamanitro.” Koa novidin’i Davida sekely volafotsy dimampolo ilay famoloana sy ny omby.', 'hoy anefa ny mpanjaka taminy: “tsia, fa tsy maintsy hovidiko aminao araka izay vidiny izany. tsy zavatra azoko maimaim-poana no hatolotro ho sorona dorana ho an’i jehovah andriamanitro.” koa novidin’i davida sekely volafotsy dimampolo ilay famoloana sy ny omby.'),
  ('6ab25a4416316be9e7d6a93e', '2026-09-22T10:36:52.164Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:52.164Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 1, 1, 'Efa antitra i Davida Mpanjaka sady nandroso taona, ka tsy nahatsiaro nafana na dia nanao fitafiana maro aza.', 'efa antitra i davida mpanjaka sady nandroso taona, ka tsy nahatsiaro nafana na dia nanao fitafiana maro aza.'),
  ('6ab25a4416316be9e7d6a93f', '2026-09-22T10:36:52.164Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:52.164Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 1, 2, 'Dia hoy ireo mpanompony taminy: “Aoka hitadiavana zazavavy virjiny ny mpanjaka tompoko, mba hiahy sy hikarakara ny mpanjaka. Ary hatory eo an-tratranao izy, ka hafana ny mpanjaka tompoko.”', 'dia hoy ireo mpanompony taminy: “aoka hitadiavana zazavavy virjiny ny mpanjaka tompoko, mba hiahy sy hikarakara ny mpanjaka. ary hatory eo an-tratranao izy, ka hafana ny mpanjaka tompoko.”'),
  ('6ab25a4416316be9e7d6a941', '2026-09-22T10:36:52.164Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:52.164Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 1, 4, 'Faran’izay tsara tarehy razazavavy, ary izy no lasa mpikarakara ny mpanjaka sy mpiahy azy. Tsy nanao firaisana taminy anefa ny mpanjaka.', 'faran’izay tsara tarehy razazavavy, ary izy no lasa mpikarakara ny mpanjaka sy mpiahy azy. tsy nanao firaisana taminy anefa ny mpanjaka.'),
  ('6ab25a4416316be9e7d6a940', '2026-09-22T10:36:52.164Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:52.164Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 1, 3, 'Koa nitady zazavavy tsara tarehy tany amin’ny faritra rehetra eran’i Israely izy ireo, ka nahita an’i Abisaga Sonemita tamin’ny farany. Dia nentiny tany amin’ny mpanjaka izy.', 'koa nitady zazavavy tsara tarehy tany amin’ny faritra rehetra eran’i israely izy ireo, ka nahita an’i abisaga sonemita tamin’ny farany. dia nentiny tany amin’ny mpanjaka izy.'),
  ('6ab25a4416316be9e7d6a966', '2026-09-22T10:36:52.165Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:52.165Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 1, 41, 'Ary nandre izany i Adonia sy ny olona rehetra nasainy, rehefa avy nisakafo. Dia hoy i Joaba raha vao nandre feon’anjombona: “Inona izany tabataba izany fa toa mientanentana be ihany ny iray tanàna?”', 'ary nandre izany i adonia sy ny olona rehetra nasainy, rehefa avy nisakafo. dia hoy i joaba raha vao nandre feon’anjombona: “inona izany tabataba izany fa toa mientanentana be ihany ny iray tanàna?”'),
  ('6ab25a4416316be9e7d6a962', '2026-09-22T10:36:52.165Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:52.165Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 1, 37, 'Sahala amin’ny nomban’i Jehovah ny mpanjaka tompoko anie no hombany an’i Solomona, ary hataony be voninahitra noho ny seza fiandrianan’i Davida Mpanjaka tompoko anie ny seza fiandrianan’i Solomona!”', 'sahala amin’ny nomban’i jehovah ny mpanjaka tompoko anie no hombany an’i solomona, ary hataony be voninahitra noho ny seza fiandrianan’i davida mpanjaka tompoko anie ny seza fiandrianan’i solomona!”'),
  ('6ab25a4416316be9e7d6a954', '2026-09-22T10:36:52.165Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:52.165Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 1, 23, 'Avy hatrany dia nisy nilaza tamin’ny mpanjaka hoe: “Ao i Natana mpaminany!” Dia niditra teo anatrehan’ny mpanjaka izy ka niankohoka tamin’ny tany teo anatrehany.', 'avy hatrany dia nisy nilaza tamin’ny mpanjaka hoe: “ao i natana mpaminany!” dia niditra teo anatrehan’ny mpanjaka izy ka niankohoka tamin’ny tany teo anatrehany.'),
  ('6ab25a4416316be9e7d6a94c', '2026-09-22T10:36:52.165Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:52.165Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 1, 15, 'Koa nankao amin’ny mpanjaka tao amin’ny efitrano anatiny i Batseba. Efa antitra be ny mpanjaka tamin’izay, ary nikarakara azy i Abisaga Sonemita.', 'koa nankao amin’ny mpanjaka tao amin’ny efitrano anatiny i batseba. efa antitra be ny mpanjaka tamin’izay, ary nikarakara azy i abisaga sonemita.'),
  ('6ab25a4416316be9e7d6a95f', '2026-09-22T10:36:52.165Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:52.165Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 1, 34, 'Hanosotra azy ho mpanjakan’ny Israely i Zadoka mpisorona sy Natana mpaminany rehefa any. Dia tsofy ny anjombona, ka milazà hoe: ‘Ho ela velona anie i Solomona Mpanjaka!’', 'hanosotra azy ho mpanjakan’ny israely i zadoka mpisorona sy natana mpaminany rehefa any. dia tsofy ny anjombona, ka milazà hoe: ‘ho ela velona anie i solomona mpanjaka!’'),
  ('6ab25a4416316be9e7d6a96e', '2026-09-22T10:36:52.165Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:52.165Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 1, 49, 'Dia nangovitra ireo rehetra nasain’i Adonia ka nitsangana, ary samy lasa nandeha tany amin’izay nalehany avy.', 'dia nangovitra ireo rehetra nasain’i adonia ka nitsangana, ary samy lasa nandeha tany amin’izay nalehany avy.'),
  ('6ab25a4416316be9e7d6a94a', '2026-09-22T10:36:52.165Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:52.165Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 1, 13, 'Mandehana mankao amin’i Davida Mpanjaka, ka izao lazaina aminy: ‘Tsy ianao moa, ry mpanjaka tompoko, no nianiana tamin’ny mpanompovavinao hoe: “I Solomona zanakao lahy no ho mpanjaka handimby ahy, ary izy no hipetraka eo amin’ny seza fiandrianako”? Koa nahoana indray no i Adonia no lasa mpanjaka?’', 'mandehana mankao amin’i davida mpanjaka, ka izao lazaina aminy: ‘tsy ianao moa, ry mpanjaka tompoko, no nianiana tamin’ny mpanompovavinao hoe: “i solomona zanakao lahy no ho mpanjaka handimby ahy, ary izy no hipetraka eo amin’ny seza fiandrianako”? koa nahoana indray no i adonia no lasa mpanjaka?’'),
  ('6ab25a4416316be9e7d6a942', '2026-09-22T10:36:52.165Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:52.165Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 1, 5, 'Tamin’izany fotoana izany, dia nanandra-tena i Adonia zanakalahin’i Hagita, ka nanao hoe: “Izaho no hanjaka!” Dia nampanao kalesy ho azy izy, ary naka mpitaingin-tsoavaly sy lehilahy dimampolo ho mpihazakazaka eo alohany.', 'tamin’izany fotoana izany, dia nanandra-tena i adonia zanakalahin’i hagita, ka nanao hoe: “izaho no hanjaka!” dia nampanao kalesy ho azy izy, ary naka mpitaingin-tsoavaly sy lehilahy dimampolo ho mpihazakazaka eo alohany.'),
  ('6ab25a4416316be9e7d6a970', '2026-09-22T10:36:52.165Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:52.165Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 1, 51, 'Taorian’izay, dia nisy nilaza tamin’i Solomona hoe: “Matahotra an’i Solomona Mpanjaka i Adonia, ka mamikitra amin’ny tandroky ny alitara, sady milaza hoe: ‘Aoka hianiana amiko aloha i Solomona Mpanjaka fa tsy hamono ny mpanompony amin’ny sabatra.’”', 'taorian’izay, dia nisy nilaza tamin’i solomona hoe: “matahotra an’i solomona mpanjaka i adonia, ka mamikitra amin’ny tandroky ny alitara, sady milaza hoe: ‘aoka hianiana amiko aloha i solomona mpanjaka fa tsy hamono ny mpanompony amin’ny sabatra.’”'),
  ('6ab25a4416316be9e7d6a959', '2026-09-22T10:36:52.165Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:52.165Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 1, 28, 'Ary hoy ny navalin’i Davida Mpanjaka: “Asaivo mankatỳ i Batseba.” Dia niditra nankeo anatrehan’ny mpanjaka i Batseba ka nijoro teo anatrehany.', 'ary hoy ny navalin’i davida mpanjaka: “asaivo mankatỳ i batseba.” dia niditra nankeo anatrehan’ny mpanjaka i batseba ka nijoro teo anatrehany.'),
  ('6ab25a4416316be9e7d6a96f', '2026-09-22T10:36:52.165Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:52.165Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 1, 50, 'Natahotra an’i Solomona koa i Adonia ka nitsangana. Dia lasa izy, ary namikitra tamin’ny tandroky ny alitara.', 'natahotra an’i solomona koa i adonia ka nitsangana. dia lasa izy, ary namikitra tamin’ny tandroky ny alitara.'),
  ('6ab25a4416316be9e7d6a96b', '2026-09-22T10:36:52.165Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:52.165Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 1, 46, 'Ary tsy izany ihany fa efa mipetraka eo amin’ny seza fiandrianan’ny fanjakana i Solomona.', 'ary tsy izany ihany fa efa mipetraka eo amin’ny seza fiandrianan’ny fanjakana i solomona.'),
  ('6ab25a4416316be9e7d6a965', '2026-09-22T10:36:52.165Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:52.165Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 1, 40, 'Dia niakatra nanaraka azy ny olona rehetra sady nitsoka sodina ary ravoravo fatratra, hany ka nitresaka ny tany noho ny kotaban’izy ireo.', 'dia niakatra nanaraka azy ny olona rehetra sady nitsoka sodina ary ravoravo fatratra, hany ka nitresaka ny tany noho ny kotaban’izy ireo.'),
  ('6ab25a4416316be9e7d6a945', '2026-09-22T10:36:52.165Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:52.165Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 1, 8, 'Tsy niandany tamin’i Adonia kosa anefa i Zadoka mpisorona sy Benaia zanak’i Joiada sy Natana mpaminany sy Simey sy Rey ary ny lehilahy maherin’i Davida.', 'tsy niandany tamin’i adonia kosa anefa i zadoka mpisorona sy benaia zanak’i joiada sy natana mpaminany sy simey sy rey ary ny lehilahy maherin’i davida.');
INSERT INTO "bible_verses" ("id", "created_date", "updated_date", "created_by_id", "created_by", "translation", "book", "bookOrder", "chapter", "verse", "text", "normalizedText") VALUES
  ('6ab25a4416316be9e7d6a96a', '2026-09-22T10:36:52.165Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:52.165Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 1, 45, 'Ary nanosotra azy ho mpanjaka tany Gihona i Zadoka mpisorona sy Natana mpaminany. Dia niakatra avy tany izy ireo sady faly, ka nientanentana ny iray tanàna. Izany ilay tabataba renareo.', 'ary nanosotra azy ho mpanjaka tany gihona i zadoka mpisorona sy natana mpaminany. dia niakatra avy tany izy ireo sady faly, ka nientanentana ny iray tanàna. izany ilay tabataba renareo.'),
  ('6ab25a4416316be9e7d6a953', '2026-09-22T10:36:52.165Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:52.165Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 1, 22, 'Raha mbola teo am-piresahana tamin’ny mpanjaka i Batseba, dia niditra i Natana mpaminany.', 'raha mbola teo am-piresahana tamin’ny mpanjaka i batseba, dia niditra i natana mpaminany.'),
  ('6ab25a4416316be9e7d6a94f', '2026-09-22T10:36:52.165Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:52.165Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 1, 18, 'I Adonia anefa izao no lasa mpanjaka, nefa tsy fantatry ny mpanjaka tompoko mihitsy izany.', 'i adonia anefa izao no lasa mpanjaka, nefa tsy fantatry ny mpanjaka tompoko mihitsy izany.'),
  ('6ab25a4416316be9e7d6a968', '2026-09-22T10:36:52.165Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:52.165Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 1, 43, 'Fa hoy ny navalin’i Jonatana an’i Adonia: “Tsy izany mihitsy! Efa nanao an’i Solomona ho mpanjaka i Davida Mpanjaka tompontsika.', 'fa hoy ny navalin’i jonatana an’i adonia: “tsy izany mihitsy! efa nanao an’i solomona ho mpanjaka i davida mpanjaka tompontsika.'),
  ('6ab25a4416316be9e7d6a948', '2026-09-22T10:36:52.165Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:52.165Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 1, 11, 'Koa hoy i Natana tamin’i Batseba renin’i Solomona: “Tsy efa renao ve fa lasa mpanjaka i Adonia zanak’i Hagita, nefa tsy fantatr’i Davida tompontsika mihitsy izany?', 'koa hoy i natana tamin’i batseba renin’i solomona: “tsy efa renao ve fa lasa mpanjaka i adonia zanak’i hagita, nefa tsy fantatr’i davida tompontsika mihitsy izany?'),
  ('6ab25a4416316be9e7d6a96d', '2026-09-22T10:36:52.165Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:52.165Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 1, 48, 'Ary hoy ny mpanjaka: ‘Hisaorana anie i Jehovah Andriamanitry ny Israely, fa nanome an’izay hipetraka eo amin’ny seza fiandrianako izy androany, sady hitan’ny masoko izany!’”', 'ary hoy ny mpanjaka: ‘hisaorana anie i jehovah andriamanitry ny israely, fa nanome an’izay hipetraka eo amin’ny seza fiandrianako izy androany, sady hitan’ny masoko izany!’”'),
  ('6ab25a4416316be9e7d6a960', '2026-09-22T10:36:52.165Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:52.165Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 1, 35, 'Ary miakara hanaraka azy ianareo, ary hiditra izy ka hipetraka eo amin’ny seza fiandrianako, fa izy no ho mpanjaka handimby ahy, ary izy no hotendreko ho mpitarika ny Israely sy Joda.”', 'ary miakara hanaraka azy ianareo, ary hiditra izy ka hipetraka eo amin’ny seza fiandrianako, fa izy no ho mpanjaka handimby ahy, ary izy no hotendreko ho mpitarika ny israely sy joda.”'),
  ('6ab25a4416316be9e7d6a95c', '2026-09-22T10:36:52.165Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:52.165Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 1, 31, 'Ary niondrika i Batseba, ka niankohoka tamin’ny tany teo anatrehan’ny mpanjaka, ary nanao hoe: “Ho ela velona anie i Davida Mpanjaka tompoko!”', 'ary niondrika i batseba, ka niankohoka tamin’ny tany teo anatrehan’ny mpanjaka, ary nanao hoe: “ho ela velona anie i davida mpanjaka tompoko!”'),
  ('6ab25a4416316be9e7d6a957', '2026-09-22T10:36:52.165Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:52.165Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 1, 26, 'Fa tsy mba nasainy kosa izaho mpanomponao, sy Zadoka mpisorona, sy Benaia zanak’i Joiada, ary Solomona mpanomponao.', 'fa tsy mba nasainy kosa izaho mpanomponao, sy zadoka mpisorona, sy benaia zanak’i joiada, ary solomona mpanomponao.'),
  ('6ab25a4416316be9e7d6a951', '2026-09-22T10:36:52.165Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:52.165Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 1, 20, 'Ary miandrandra anao daholo ny mason’ny Israely rehetra, ry mpanjaka tompoko ô, mba hilaza amin’izy ireo hoe iza no hipetraka eo amin’ny seza fiandrianan’ny mpanjaka tompoko handimby azy.', 'ary miandrandra anao daholo ny mason’ny israely rehetra, ry mpanjaka tompoko ô, mba hilaza amin’izy ireo hoe iza no hipetraka eo amin’ny seza fiandrianan’ny mpanjaka tompoko handimby azy.'),
  ('6ab25a4416316be9e7d6a950', '2026-09-22T10:36:52.165Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:52.165Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 1, 19, 'Ary nanao sorona izy ka namono omby sy biby nohatavezina ary ondry be dia be. Nasainy daholo ny zanakalahin’ny mpanjaka, sy Abiatara mpisorona ary Joaba lehiben’ny tafika, fa i Solomona mpanomponao tsy mba nasainy.', 'ary nanao sorona izy ka namono omby sy biby nohatavezina ary ondry be dia be. nasainy daholo ny zanakalahin’ny mpanjaka, sy abiatara mpisorona ary joaba lehiben’ny tafika, fa i solomona mpanomponao tsy mba nasainy.'),
  ('6ab25a4416316be9e7d6a946', '2026-09-22T10:36:52.165Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:52.165Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 1, 9, 'Ary nanao sorona i Adonia ka namono ondry sy omby ary biby nohatavezina, teo akaikin’ny vaton’i Zoheleta, teo anilan’i En-rogela. Koa nasainy daholo ny rahalahiny zanaky ny mpanjaka, sy ny lehilahy rehetra anisan’ny fokon’i Joda sady mpanompon’ny mpanjaka.', 'ary nanao sorona i adonia ka namono ondry sy omby ary biby nohatavezina, teo akaikin’ny vaton’i zoheleta, teo anilan’i en-rogela. koa nasainy daholo ny rahalahiny zanaky ny mpanjaka, sy ny lehilahy rehetra anisan’ny fokon’i joda sady mpanompon’ny mpanjaka.'),
  ('6ab25a4416316be9e7d6a96c', '2026-09-22T10:36:52.165Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:52.165Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 1, 47, 'Tonga nirary soa an’i Davida Mpanjaka tompontsika koa ireo mpanompon’ny mpanjaka hoe: ‘Hataon’Andriamanitrao malaza noho ny anaranao anie ny anaran’i Solomona, ary hataony be voninahitra noho ny seza fiandriananao anie ny seza fiandrianany!’ Dia niankohoka teo am-pandriana ny mpanjaka.', 'tonga nirary soa an’i davida mpanjaka tompontsika koa ireo mpanompon’ny mpanjaka hoe: ‘hataon’andriamanitrao malaza noho ny anaranao anie ny anaran’i solomona, ary hataony be voninahitra noho ny seza fiandriananao anie ny seza fiandrianany!’ dia niankohoka teo am-pandriana ny mpanjaka.'),
  ('6ab25a4416316be9e7d6a95b', '2026-09-22T10:36:52.165Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:52.165Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 1, 30, 'dia hotanterahiko anio ilay fianianako taminao tamin’ny anaran’i Jehovah Andriamanitry ny Israely hoe: ‘I Solomona zanakao lahy no ho mpanjaka handimby ahy, ary izy no hipetraka eo amin’ny seza fiandrianako handimby ahy!’”', 'dia hotanterahiko anio ilay fianianako taminao tamin’ny anaran’i jehovah andriamanitry ny israely hoe: ‘i solomona zanakao lahy no ho mpanjaka handimby ahy, ary izy no hipetraka eo amin’ny seza fiandrianako handimby ahy!’”'),
  ('6ab25a4416316be9e7d6a947', '2026-09-22T10:36:52.165Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:52.165Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 1, 10, 'Fa tsy mba nasainy kosa i Natana mpaminany sy Benaia sy ireo lehilahy mahery ary Solomona rahalahiny.', 'fa tsy mba nasainy kosa i natana mpaminany sy benaia sy ireo lehilahy mahery ary solomona rahalahiny.'),
  ('6ab25a4416316be9e7d6a949', '2026-09-22T10:36:52.165Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:52.165Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 1, 12, 'Koa etsy ange ianao e! Mba avelao aho hanoro hevitra anao ka vonjeo ny ainao sy ny ain’i Solomona zanakao:', 'koa etsy ange ianao e! mba avelao aho hanoro hevitra anao ka vonjeo ny ainao sy ny ain’i solomona zanakao:'),
  ('6ab25a4416316be9e7d6a944', '2026-09-22T10:36:52.165Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:52.165Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 1, 7, 'Ary nifampiraharaha tamin’i Joaba zanak’i Zeroia sy tamin’i Abiatara mpisorona i Adonia. Koa nanampy azy izy roa lahy ireo, ka lasa mpomba azy.', 'ary nifampiraharaha tamin’i joaba zanak’i zeroia sy tamin’i abiatara mpisorona i adonia. koa nanampy azy izy roa lahy ireo, ka lasa mpomba azy.'),
  ('6ab25a4416316be9e7d6a963', '2026-09-22T10:36:52.165Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:52.165Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 1, 38, 'Dia nidina i Zadoka mpisorona sy Natana mpaminany sy Benaia zanak’i Joiada sy ny Keretita ary ny Peletita, ka nampitaingeniny an’i Solomona ilay ramolevavin’i Davida Mpanjaka, ary nentiny tany Gihona i Solomona.', 'dia nidina i zadoka mpisorona sy natana mpaminany sy benaia zanak’i joiada sy ny keretita ary ny peletita, ka nampitaingeniny an’i solomona ilay ramolevavin’i davida mpanjaka, ary nentiny tany gihona i solomona.'),
  ('6ab25a4416316be9e7d6a95a', '2026-09-22T10:36:52.165Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:52.165Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 1, 29, 'Ary nianiana ny mpanjaka hoe: “Raha mbola velona koa i Jehovah, izay nanavotra ahy tamin’ny fahoriako rehetra,', 'ary nianiana ny mpanjaka hoe: “raha mbola velona koa i jehovah, izay nanavotra ahy tamin’ny fahoriako rehetra,'),
  ('6ab25a4416316be9e7d6a943', '2026-09-22T10:36:52.165Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:52.165Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 1, 6, 'Ary tsy te hampalahelo azy mihitsy ny rainy ka tsy niteny taminy hoe: “Fa maninona ianao no manao hoatr’izao?” Lehilahy tena tsara tarehy i Adonia, ary izy no nateraky ny reniny taorian’i Absaloma.', 'ary tsy te hampalahelo azy mihitsy ny rainy ka tsy niteny taminy hoe: “fa maninona ianao no manao hoatr’izao?” lehilahy tena tsara tarehy i adonia, ary izy no nateraky ny reniny taorian’i absaloma.'),
  ('6ab25a4416316be9e7d6a972', '2026-09-22T10:36:52.165Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:52.165Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 1, 53, 'Dia naniraka olona hampidina an’i Adonia avy teo amin’ny alitara i Solomona Mpanjaka. Ary tonga niankohoka teo anatrehan’i Solomona Mpanjaka izy. Dia hoy i Solomona taminy: “Modia any an-tranonao.”', 'dia naniraka olona hampidina an’i adonia avy teo amin’ny alitara i solomona mpanjaka. ary tonga niankohoka teo anatrehan’i solomona mpanjaka izy. dia hoy i solomona taminy: “modia any an-tranonao.”'),
  ('6ab25a4416316be9e7d6a964', '2026-09-22T10:36:52.165Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:52.165Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 1, 39, 'Ary nalain’i Zadoka mpisorona avy tao amin’ny tranolay ny tandroka misy menaka, ka nohosorany ho mpanjaka i Solomona. Dia notsofina ny anjombona, ary indray niredona ny olona rehetra hoe: “Ho ela velona anie i Solomona Mpanjaka!”', 'ary nalain’i zadoka mpisorona avy tao amin’ny tranolay ny tandroka misy menaka, ka nohosorany ho mpanjaka i solomona. dia notsofina ny anjombona, ary indray niredona ny olona rehetra hoe: “ho ela velona anie i solomona mpanjaka!”'),
  ('6ab25a4416316be9e7d6a961', '2026-09-22T10:36:52.165Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:52.165Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 1, 36, 'Dia namaly avy hatrany i Benaia zanak’i Joiada, ka hoy izy tamin’ny mpanjaka: “Amena! * Ho toy izany koa anie ny tenin’i Jehovah Andriamanitry ny mpanjaka tompoko!', 'dia namaly avy hatrany i benaia zanak’i joiada, ka hoy izy tamin’ny mpanjaka: “amena! * ho toy izany koa anie ny tenin’i jehovah andriamanitry ny mpanjaka tompoko!'),
  ('6ab25a4416316be9e7d6a956', '2026-09-22T10:36:52.165Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:52.165Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 1, 25, 'Nandeha nidina mantsy i Adonia androany mba hanao sorona omby sy biby nohatavezina ary ondry be dia be. Ary nasainy daholo ny zanakalahin’ny mpanjaka sy ny lehiben’ny tafika ary Abiatara mpisorona. Koa mihinana sy misotro eo anatrehan’i Adonia ao ry zareo, ary izao foana no teniny: ‘Ho ela velona anie i Adonia Mpanjaka!’', 'nandeha nidina mantsy i adonia androany mba hanao sorona omby sy biby nohatavezina ary ondry be dia be. ary nasainy daholo ny zanakalahin’ny mpanjaka sy ny lehiben’ny tafika ary abiatara mpisorona. koa mihinana sy misotro eo anatrehan’i adonia ao ry zareo, ary izao foana no teniny: ‘ho ela velona anie i adonia mpanjaka!’'),
  ('6ab25a4416316be9e7d6a952', '2026-09-22T10:36:52.165Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:52.165Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 1, 21, 'Azo antoka mantsy fa raha vao hodimandry any amin’ny razany ny mpanjaka tompoko, dia hoheverina ho olo-meloka izaho sy Solomona zanako.”', 'azo antoka mantsy fa raha vao hodimandry any amin’ny razany ny mpanjaka tompoko, dia hoheverina ho olo-meloka izaho sy solomona zanako.”'),
  ('6ab25a4416316be9e7d6a94e', '2026-09-22T10:36:52.165Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:52.165Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 1, 17, 'Dia hoy izy: “Tompokolahy ô, ianao no efa nianiana tamin’ny anaran’i Jehovah Andriamanitrao ka niteny tamin’ny mpanompovavinao hoe: ‘I Solomona zanakao lahy no ho mpanjaka handimby ahy, ary izy no hipetraka eo amin’ny seza fiandrianako.’', 'dia hoy izy: “tompokolahy ô, ianao no efa nianiana tamin’ny anaran’i jehovah andriamanitrao ka niteny tamin’ny mpanompovavinao hoe: ‘i solomona zanakao lahy no ho mpanjaka handimby ahy, ary izy no hipetraka eo amin’ny seza fiandrianako.’'),
  ('6ab25a4416316be9e7d6a967', '2026-09-22T10:36:52.165Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:52.165Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 1, 42, 'Raha mbola niteny izy, dia tonga i Jonatana zanak’i Abiatara mpisorona. Dia hoy i Adonia: “Mandrosoa, fa lehilahy mahery fo ianao, ary mitondra vaovao tsara.”', 'raha mbola niteny izy, dia tonga i jonatana zanak’i abiatara mpisorona. dia hoy i adonia: “mandrosoa, fa lehilahy mahery fo ianao, ary mitondra vaovao tsara.”'),
  ('6ab25a4416316be9e7d6a971', '2026-09-22T10:36:52.165Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:52.165Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 1, 52, 'Dia hoy i Solomona: “Raha ho tonga lehilahy mahery fo izy, dia tsy hisy ho latsaka amin’ny tany na dia ny singam-bolony iray aza. Fa raha hita kosa hoe misy ratsy hataony, dia tsy maintsy ho faty izy.”', 'dia hoy i solomona: “raha ho tonga lehilahy mahery fo izy, dia tsy hisy ho latsaka amin’ny tany na dia ny singam-bolony iray aza. fa raha hita kosa hoe misy ratsy hataony, dia tsy maintsy ho faty izy.”'),
  ('6ab25a4416316be9e7d6a969', '2026-09-22T10:36:52.165Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:52.165Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 1, 44, 'Koa nirahin’ny mpanjaka hiaraka amin’i Solomona i Zadoka mpisorona sy Natana mpaminany sy Benaia zanak’i Joiada sy ny Keretita ary ny Peletita, ka nampitaingenin’ireo an’i Solomona ny ramolevavin’ny mpanjaka.', 'koa nirahin’ny mpanjaka hiaraka amin’i solomona i zadoka mpisorona sy natana mpaminany sy benaia zanak’i joiada sy ny keretita ary ny peletita, ka nampitaingenin’ireo an’i solomona ny ramolevavin’ny mpanjaka.'),
  ('6ab25a4416316be9e7d6a95e', '2026-09-22T10:36:52.165Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:52.165Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 1, 33, 'Ary hoy ny mpanjaka tamin’ireo: “Ento miaraka aminareo ireo mpanompon’ny tomponareo. Manana ramole aho ao, ka ampitaingeno an’iny i Solomona zanako, ary ento midina any Gihona izy.', 'ary hoy ny mpanjaka tamin’ireo: “ento miaraka aminareo ireo mpanompon’ny tomponareo. manana ramole aho ao, ka ampitaingeno an’iny i solomona zanako, ary ento midina any gihona izy.'),
  ('6ab25a4416316be9e7d6a95d', '2026-09-22T10:36:52.165Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:52.165Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 1, 32, 'Avy hatrany dia hoy i Davida Mpanjaka: “Asaivo mankatỳ i Zadoka mpisorona sy Natana mpaminany ary Benaia zanak’i Joiada.” Dia niditra nankeo anatrehan’ny mpanjaka izy ireo.', 'avy hatrany dia hoy i davida mpanjaka: “asaivo mankatỳ i zadoka mpisorona sy natana mpaminany ary benaia zanak’i joiada.” dia niditra nankeo anatrehan’ny mpanjaka izy ireo.'),
  ('6ab25a4416316be9e7d6a958', '2026-09-22T10:36:52.165Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:52.165Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 1, 27, 'Koa raha avy amin’ny mpanjaka tompoko izany zavatra izany, dia midika izany fa tsy nampahafantarinao ny mpanomponao hoe iza no hipetraka eo amin’ny seza fiandrianan’ny mpanjaka tompoko handimby azy.”', 'koa raha avy amin’ny mpanjaka tompoko izany zavatra izany, dia midika izany fa tsy nampahafantarinao ny mpanomponao hoe iza no hipetraka eo amin’ny seza fiandrianan’ny mpanjaka tompoko handimby azy.”'),
  ('6ab25a4416316be9e7d6a955', '2026-09-22T10:36:52.165Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:52.165Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 1, 24, 'Ary hoy i Natana: “Ry mpanjaka tompoko ô, angaha ianao efa niteny hoe: ‘I Adonia no ho mpanjaka handimby ahy, ary izy no hipetraka eo amin’ny seza fiandrianako’?', 'ary hoy i natana: “ry mpanjaka tompoko ô, angaha ianao efa niteny hoe: ‘i adonia no ho mpanjaka handimby ahy, ary izy no hipetraka eo amin’ny seza fiandrianako’?'),
  ('6ab25a4416316be9e7d6a94d', '2026-09-22T10:36:52.165Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:52.165Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 1, 16, 'Dia niondrika i Batseba ka niankohoka teo anatrehan’ny mpanjaka. Ary hoy ny mpanjaka: “Inona no angatahinao?”', 'dia niondrika i batseba ka niankohoka teo anatrehan’ny mpanjaka. ary hoy ny mpanjaka: “inona no angatahinao?”'),
  ('6ab25a4416316be9e7d6a94b', '2026-09-22T10:36:52.165Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:52.165Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 1, 14, 'Ary raha mbola eo am-piresahana amin’ny mpanjaka ianao, dia hiditra koa aho, ka hanamafy ny teninao.”', 'ary raha mbola eo am-piresahana amin’ny mpanjaka ianao, dia hiditra koa aho, ka hanamafy ny teninao.”'),
  ('6ab25a456d0ab6f9268e838b', '2026-09-22T10:36:53.659Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:53.659Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 2, 6, 'Koa araka izay fahendrenao no ataovy, ka aza avela hidina amim-piadanana any amin’ny Fasana * ny volofotsiny.', 'koa araka izay fahendrenao no ataovy, ka aza avela hidina amim-piadanana any amin’ny fasana * ny volofotsiny.'),
  ('6ab25a456d0ab6f9268e8389', '2026-09-22T10:36:53.659Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:53.659Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 2, 4, 'ary mba hotanterahin’i Jehovah ny teny nolazainy momba ahy hoe: ‘Raha hitandrina ny fitondran-tenany ny taranakao, ka handeha amim-pahitsiana * eo anatrehako amin’ny fony manontolo sy amin’ny heriny manontolo, dia hisy olona avy amin’ny taranakao foana hipetraka eo amin’ny seza fiandrianan’ny Israely.’', 'ary mba hotanterahin’i jehovah ny teny nolazainy momba ahy hoe: ‘raha hitandrina ny fitondran-tenany ny taranakao, ka handeha amim-pahitsiana * eo anatrehako amin’ny fony manontolo sy amin’ny heriny manontolo, dia hisy olona avy amin’ny taranakao foana hipetraka eo amin’ny seza fiandrianan’ny israely.’'),
  ('6ab25a456d0ab6f9268e83a3', '2026-09-22T10:36:53.659Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:53.659Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 2, 30, 'Dia nankao amin’ny tranolain’i Jehovah i Benaia, ka hoy izy tamin’i Joaba: “Izao no nolazain’ny mpanjaka: ‘Mivoaha ianao!’” Fa hoy i Joaba: “Tsia, fa eto aho no ho faty.” Ary niverina tany amin’ny mpanjaka i Benaia niteny hoe: “Izany no nolazain’i Joaba, ary izany no navaliny ahy.”', 'dia nankao amin’ny tranolain’i jehovah i benaia, ka hoy izy tamin’i joaba: “izao no nolazain’ny mpanjaka: ‘mivoaha ianao!’” fa hoy i joaba: “tsia, fa eto aho no ho faty.” ary niverina tany amin’ny mpanjaka i benaia niteny hoe: “izany no nolazain’i joaba, ary izany no navaliny ahy.”'),
  ('6ab25a456d0ab6f9268e838e', '2026-09-22T10:36:53.659Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:53.659Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 2, 9, 'Aza avela tsy ho voasazy anefa izy. Lehilahy hendry mantsy ianao, ka fantatrao tsara izay tokony hataonao aminy. Ary amin’ny fandatsahan-dra no hampidinanao ny volofotsiny any amin’ny Fasana.” *', 'aza avela tsy ho voasazy anefa izy. lehilahy hendry mantsy ianao, ka fantatrao tsara izay tokony hataonao aminy. ary amin’ny fandatsahan-dra no hampidinanao ny volofotsiny any amin’ny fasana.” *'),
  ('6ab25a456d0ab6f9268e83ac', '2026-09-22T10:36:53.659Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:53.659Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 2, 39, 'Rehefa afaka telo taona, dia nandositra ny mpanompon’i Simey anankiroa, ka nankany amin’i Akisy zanak’i Maka, mpanjakan’i Gata. Ary nisy nampandre an’i Simey hoe: “Any Gata ireo mpanomponao.”', 'rehefa afaka telo taona, dia nandositra ny mpanompon’i simey anankiroa, ka nankany amin’i akisy zanak’i maka, mpanjakan’i gata. ary nisy nampandre an’i simey hoe: “any gata ireo mpanomponao.”'),
  ('6ab25a456d0ab6f9268e8397', '2026-09-22T10:36:53.659Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:53.659Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 2, 18, 'Dia hoy i Batseba: “Eny àry, fa hampitaiko amin’ny mpanjaka ny teninao.”', 'dia hoy i batseba: “eny àry, fa hampitaiko amin’ny mpanjaka ny teninao.”'),
  ('6ab25a456d0ab6f9268e83b2', '2026-09-22T10:36:53.659Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:53.659Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 2, 45, 'Fa hotahina kosa i Solomona Mpanjaka, ary ny seza fiandrianan’i Davida ho mafy orina mandrakizay eo anatrehan’i Jehovah.”', 'fa hotahina kosa i solomona mpanjaka, ary ny seza fiandrianan’i davida ho mafy orina mandrakizay eo anatrehan’i jehovah.”'),
  ('6ab25a456d0ab6f9268e83af', '2026-09-22T10:36:53.659Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:53.659Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 2, 42, 'Koa nandefa olona hiantso an’i Simey ny mpanjaka, ka nanao taminy hoe: “Tsy efa nampianiana anao tamin’ny anaran’i Jehovah moa aho ka nampitandrina anao hoe: ‘Amin’ny andro hialanao ao sy handehananao etsy sy eroa, dia aoka ho fantatrao marimarina fa ho faty tokoa ianao’? Ary tsy efa niteny tamiko ve ianao hoe: ‘Tena mety izany teny reko izany’?', 'koa nandefa olona hiantso an’i simey ny mpanjaka, ka nanao taminy hoe: “tsy efa nampianiana anao tamin’ny anaran’i jehovah moa aho ka nampitandrina anao hoe: ‘amin’ny andro hialanao ao sy handehananao etsy sy eroa, dia aoka ho fantatrao marimarina fa ho faty tokoa ianao’? ary tsy efa niteny tamiko ve ianao hoe: ‘tena mety izany teny reko izany’?'),
  ('6ab25a456d0ab6f9268e83a6', '2026-09-22T10:36:53.659Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:53.659Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 2, 33, 'Koa ho tompon’andraikitra amin’ny fahafatesan’izy roa lahy i Joaba sy ny taranany, * mandritra ny fotoana tsy voafetra. Fa i Davida sy ny taranany sy ny ankohonany ary ny seza fiandrianany kosa hahazo fiadanana avy amin’i Jehovah, mandritra ny fotoana tsy voafetra.”', 'koa ho tompon’andraikitra amin’ny fahafatesan’izy roa lahy i joaba sy ny taranany, * mandritra ny fotoana tsy voafetra. fa i davida sy ny taranany sy ny ankohonany ary ny seza fiandrianany kosa hahazo fiadanana avy amin’i jehovah, mandritra ny fotoana tsy voafetra.”'),
  ('6ab25a456d0ab6f9268e83a5', '2026-09-22T10:36:53.659Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:53.659Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 2, 32, 'Ary hatsingerin’i Jehovah eo an-dohany ihany ny rany, satria lehilahy roa izay marina sy tsara noho izy no nasiany, ka novonoiny tamin’ny sabatra, nefa tsy fantatr’i Davida raiko izany. Novonoiny mantsy i Abnera zanak’i Nera, lehiben’ny tafiky ny Israely, sy Amasa zanak’i Jatera, lehiben’ny tafik’i Joda.', 'ary hatsingerin’i jehovah eo an-dohany ihany ny rany, satria lehilahy roa izay marina sy tsara noho izy no nasiany, ka novonoiny tamin’ny sabatra, nefa tsy fantatr’i davida raiko izany. novonoiny mantsy i abnera zanak’i nera, lehiben’ny tafiky ny israely, sy amasa zanak’i jatera, lehiben’ny tafik’i joda.'),
  ('6ab25a456d0ab6f9268e839b', '2026-09-22T10:36:53.659Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:53.659Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 2, 22, 'Fa hoy i Solomona Mpanjaka tamin-dreniny: “Fa maninona ianao no mangataka an’i Abisaga Sonemita ho an’i Adonia? Angataho ho azy koa ny fanjakana fa zokiko izy, angataho ho azy sy ho an’i Abiatara mpisorona ary ho an’i Joaba zanak’i Zeroia.”', 'fa hoy i solomona mpanjaka tamin-dreniny: “fa maninona ianao no mangataka an’i abisaga sonemita ho an’i adonia? angataho ho azy koa ny fanjakana fa zokiko izy, angataho ho azy sy ho an’i abiatara mpisorona ary ho an’i joaba zanak’i zeroia.”'),
  ('6ab25a456d0ab6f9268e8398', '2026-09-22T10:36:53.659Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:53.659Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 2, 19, 'Koa nankao amin’i Solomona Mpanjaka i Batseba mba hilaza taminy ny tenin’i Adonia. Dia nitsangana hitsena azy avy hatrany ny mpanjaka, ka niankohoka teo anatrehany. Avy eo dia nipetraka teo amin’ny seza fiandrianany izy, ary nasainy nasiana seza fiandrianana iray koa ho an’ny renin’ny mpanjaka, mba hipetrahan-dreniny teo ankavanany.', 'koa nankao amin’i solomona mpanjaka i batseba mba hilaza taminy ny tenin’i adonia. dia nitsangana hitsena azy avy hatrany ny mpanjaka, ka niankohoka teo anatrehany. avy eo dia nipetraka teo amin’ny seza fiandrianany izy, ary nasainy nasiana seza fiandrianana iray koa ho an’ny renin’ny mpanjaka, mba hipetrahan-dreniny teo ankavanany.'),
  ('6ab25a456d0ab6f9268e838c', '2026-09-22T10:36:53.659Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:53.659Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 2, 7, '“Fa anehoy hatsaram-panahy feno fitiavana kosa ireo zanakalahin’i Barzilay Gileadita, ka aoka ho anisan’izay mihinana eo amin’ny latabatrao izy ireo. Tsara fanahy tamiko mantsy izy ireo ka nanampy ahy fony aho nandositra teo anoloan’i Absaloma rahalahinao.', '“fa anehoy hatsaram-panahy feno fitiavana kosa ireo zanakalahin’i barzilay gileadita, ka aoka ho anisan’izay mihinana eo amin’ny latabatrao izy ireo. tsara fanahy tamiko mantsy izy ireo ka nanampy ahy fony aho nandositra teo anoloan’i absaloma rahalahinao.'),
  ('6ab25a456d0ab6f9268e8386', '2026-09-22T10:36:53.659Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:53.659Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 2, 1, 'Ary nihananatona ny andro hahafatesan’i Davida, ka nandidy an’i Solomona zanany izy hoe:', 'ary nihananatona ny andro hahafatesan’i davida, ka nandidy an’i solomona zanany izy hoe:'),
  ('6ab25a456d0ab6f9268e839e', '2026-09-22T10:36:53.659Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:53.659Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 2, 25, 'Avy hatrany i Solomona Mpanjaka dia nanome baiko tamin’ny alalan’i Benaia zanak’i Joiada. Ary namely azy izy ka maty i Adonia.', 'avy hatrany i solomona mpanjaka dia nanome baiko tamin’ny alalan’i benaia zanak’i joiada. ary namely azy izy ka maty i adonia.'),
  ('6ab25a456d0ab6f9268e8394', '2026-09-22T10:36:53.659Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:53.659Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 2, 15, 'Koa hoy i Adonia: “Fantatrao tsara fa tokony ho ahy ny fanjakana, ary izaho no nandrandrain’ny Israely rehetra ho lasa mpanjaka, kanjo nifindra ny fanjakana ka lasan’ny rahalahiko, fa avy tamin’i Jehovah no nahazoany izany.', 'koa hoy i adonia: “fantatrao tsara fa tokony ho ahy ny fanjakana, ary izaho no nandrandrain’ny israely rehetra ho lasa mpanjaka, kanjo nifindra ny fanjakana ka lasan’ny rahalahiko, fa avy tamin’i jehovah no nahazoany izany.'),
  ('6ab25a456d0ab6f9268e83b1', '2026-09-22T10:36:53.659Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:53.659Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 2, 44, 'Hoy koa ny mpanjaka tamin’i Simey: “Fantatrao tsara ny ratsy rehetra nataonao tamin’i Davida raiko, ary mahalala tsara izany ianao ao am-ponao ao. Koa hatsingerin’i Jehovah ho eo an-dohanao ihany ny ratsy nataonao.', 'hoy koa ny mpanjaka tamin’i simey: “fantatrao tsara ny ratsy rehetra nataonao tamin’i davida raiko, ary mahalala tsara izany ianao ao am-ponao ao. koa hatsingerin’i jehovah ho eo an-dohanao ihany ny ratsy nataonao.'),
  ('6ab25a456d0ab6f9268e83a8', '2026-09-22T10:36:53.659Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:53.659Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 2, 35, 'Dia notendren’ny mpanjaka ho lehiben’ny tafika hisolo azy i Benaia zanak’i Joiada. Ary i Zadoka mpisorona no notendren’ny mpanjaka hisolo an’i Abiatara.', 'dia notendren’ny mpanjaka ho lehiben’ny tafika hisolo azy i benaia zanak’i joiada. ary i zadoka mpisorona no notendren’ny mpanjaka hisolo an’i abiatara.'),
  ('6ab25a456d0ab6f9268e83a1', '2026-09-22T10:36:53.659Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:53.659Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 2, 28, 'Ary nisy nilaza izany tamin’i Joaba. Niandany tamin’i Adonia mantsy i Joaba, na dia tsy niandany tamin’i Absaloma aza. Dia nandositra tao amin’ny tranolain’i Jehovah i Joaba, ka nohazoniny mafy ny tandroky ny alitara.', 'ary nisy nilaza izany tamin’i joaba. niandany tamin’i adonia mantsy i joaba, na dia tsy niandany tamin’i absaloma aza. dia nandositra tao amin’ny tranolain’i jehovah i joaba, ka nohazoniny mafy ny tandroky ny alitara.'),
  ('6ab25a456d0ab6f9268e839c', '2026-09-22T10:36:53.659Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:53.659Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 2, 23, 'Dia nianiana tamin’ny anaran’i Jehovah i Solomona Mpanjaka hoe: “Hofaizin’Andriamanitra anie aho, * ary mihoatra noho izany aza, raha tsy ny ain’i Adonia no manefa noho ny nilazany izany!', 'dia nianiana tamin’ny anaran’i jehovah i solomona mpanjaka hoe: “hofaizin’andriamanitra anie aho, * ary mihoatra noho izany aza, raha tsy ny ain’i adonia no manefa noho ny nilazany izany!'),
  ('6ab25a456d0ab6f9268e839a', '2026-09-22T10:36:53.659Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:53.659Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 2, 21, 'Dia hoy i Batseba: “Aoka homena ho vadin’i Adonia rahalahinao i Abisaga Sonemita.”', 'dia hoy i batseba: “aoka homena ho vadin’i adonia rahalahinao i abisaga sonemita.”'),
  ('6ab25a456d0ab6f9268e8399', '2026-09-22T10:36:53.659Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:53.659Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 2, 20, 'Ary hoy i Batseba: “Misy zavatra kely mba hangatahiko aminao, ka aza lavinao aho.” Koa hoy ny mpanjaka taminy: “Angataho àry, ry Neny, fa tsy handa anao aho.”', 'ary hoy i batseba: “misy zavatra kely mba hangatahiko aminao, ka aza lavinao aho.” koa hoy ny mpanjaka taminy: “angataho àry, ry neny, fa tsy handa anao aho.”'),
  ('6ab25a456d0ab6f9268e8387', '2026-09-22T10:36:53.659Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:53.659Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 2, 2, '“Handeha amin’ny lalana falehan’ny tany rehetra aho izao, koa mahereza ianao ary misehoa ho lehilahy.', '“handeha amin’ny lalana falehan’ny tany rehetra aho izao, koa mahereza ianao ary misehoa ho lehilahy.'),
  ('6ab25a456d0ab6f9268e83b3', '2026-09-22T10:36:53.659Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:53.659Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 2, 46, 'Dia nanome baiko an’i Benaia zanak’i Joiada ny mpanjaka, ka nivoaka i Benaia ary namely an’i Simey, ka maty izy. Ary mafy orina ny fanjakana teo am-pelatanan’i Solomona.', 'dia nanome baiko an’i benaia zanak’i joiada ny mpanjaka, ka nivoaka i benaia ary namely an’i simey, ka maty izy. ary mafy orina ny fanjakana teo am-pelatanan’i solomona.'),
  ('6ab25a456d0ab6f9268e83aa', '2026-09-22T10:36:53.659Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:53.659Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 2, 37, 'Fa amin’ny andro hialanao ao sy hiampitanao ny lohasaha falehan-driakan’i Kidrona, dia aoka ho fantatrao marimarina fa ho faty tokoa ianao. Ary ianao ihany no ho tompon’andraikitra amin’ny fahafatesanao.” *', 'fa amin’ny andro hialanao ao sy hiampitanao ny lohasaha falehan-driakan’i kidrona, dia aoka ho fantatrao marimarina fa ho faty tokoa ianao. ary ianao ihany no ho tompon’andraikitra amin’ny fahafatesanao.” *'),
  ('6ab25a456d0ab6f9268e839d', '2026-09-22T10:36:53.659Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:53.659Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 2, 24, 'Koa ankehitriny, raha mbola velona koa i Jehovah, izay nanendry ahy sy nametraka ahy eo amin’ny seza fiandrianan’i Davida raiko sady nanome ahy taranaka araka izay nolazainy, dia hovonoina ho faty anio ihany i Adonia.”', 'koa ankehitriny, raha mbola velona koa i jehovah, izay nanendry ahy sy nametraka ahy eo amin’ny seza fiandrianan’i davida raiko sady nanome ahy taranaka araka izay nolazainy, dia hovonoina ho faty anio ihany i adonia.”'),
  ('6ab25a456d0ab6f9268e83ad', '2026-09-22T10:36:53.659Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:53.659Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 2, 40, 'Dia nasiany lasely avy hatrany ny ampondrany, ka lasa izy nankany Gata ho any amin’i Akisy, mba hitady ny mpanompony. Avy eo, dia nentiny nody avy tany Gata ny mpanompony.', 'dia nasiany lasely avy hatrany ny ampondrany, ka lasa izy nankany gata ho any amin’i akisy, mba hitady ny mpanompony. avy eo, dia nentiny nody avy tany gata ny mpanompony.'),
  ('6ab25a456d0ab6f9268e83a4', '2026-09-22T10:36:53.659Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:53.659Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 2, 31, 'Dia hoy ny mpanjaka taminy: “Izany nolazainy izany mihitsy atao ka asio izy. Dia aleveno izy, ka esory amiko sy amin’ny taranaky ny raiko ny ra nalatsak’i Joaba tsy ara-drariny.', 'dia hoy ny mpanjaka taminy: “izany nolazainy izany mihitsy atao ka asio izy. dia aleveno izy, ka esory amiko sy amin’ny taranaky ny raiko ny ra nalatsak’i joaba tsy ara-drariny.'),
  ('6ab25a456d0ab6f9268e83a7', '2026-09-22T10:36:53.659Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:53.659Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 2, 34, 'Dia niakatra i Benaia zanak’i Joiada ka namely an’i Joaba, ary namono azy ho faty. Ary nalevina tany amin’izay nisy ny tranony tany an-tany efitra izy.', 'dia niakatra i benaia zanak’i joiada ka namely an’i joaba, ary namono azy ho faty. ary nalevina tany amin’izay nisy ny tranony tany an-tany efitra izy.'),
  ('6ab25a456d0ab6f9268e83a0', '2026-09-22T10:36:53.659Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:53.659Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 2, 27, 'Koa nesorin’i Solomona tsy ho mpisoron’i Jehovah i Abiatara, mba hahatanteraka ilay tenin’i Jehovah nanameloka ny taranak’i Ely, tany Silo.', 'koa nesorin’i solomona tsy ho mpisoron’i jehovah i abiatara, mba hahatanteraka ilay tenin’i jehovah nanameloka ny taranak’i ely, tany silo.'),
  ('6ab25a456d0ab6f9268e8391', '2026-09-22T10:36:53.659Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:53.659Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 2, 12, 'Ary nipetraka teo amin’ny seza fiandrianan’i Davida rainy i Solomona. Dia nihamafy orina tsikelikely ny fanjakany.', 'ary nipetraka teo amin’ny seza fiandrianan’i davida rainy i solomona. dia nihamafy orina tsikelikely ny fanjakany.'),
  ('6ab25a456d0ab6f9268e838d', '2026-09-22T10:36:53.659Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:53.659Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 2, 8, '“Eo koa i Simey zanak’i Gera, ilay Benjaminita avy any Bahorima: Izy no nanozona ahy tamin’ny andro nankanesako tany Mahanaima, ary ozona nandratra fo tokoa no nataony. Izy anefa no nidina hitsena ahy tany amin’ny Reniranon’i Jordana. Koa nianiana taminy tamin’ny anaran’i Jehovah aho hoe: ‘Tsy hovonoiko amin’ny sabatra ianao.’', '“eo koa i simey zanak’i gera, ilay benjaminita avy any bahorima: izy no nanozona ahy tamin’ny andro nankanesako tany mahanaima, ary ozona nandratra fo tokoa no nataony. izy anefa no nidina hitsena ahy tany amin’ny reniranon’i jordana. koa nianiana taminy tamin’ny anaran’i jehovah aho hoe: ‘tsy hovonoiko amin’ny sabatra ianao.’'),
  ('6ab25a456d0ab6f9268e8388', '2026-09-22T10:36:53.659Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:53.659Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 2, 3, 'Ankatoavy i Jehovah Andriamanitrao ka mandehana amin’ny lalana atorony, ary tandremo ny lalàny sy ny didiny sy ny didim-pitsarany ary ny fampahatsiahivany, araka izay voasoratra ao amin’ny lalàn’i Mosesy. Amin’izay dia ho malina ianao amin’izay rehetra hataonao sy any amin’izay rehetra halehanao,', 'ankatoavy i jehovah andriamanitrao ka mandehana amin’ny lalana atorony, ary tandremo ny lalàny sy ny didiny sy ny didim-pitsarany ary ny fampahatsiahivany, araka izay voasoratra ao amin’ny lalàn’i mosesy. amin’izay dia ho malina ianao amin’izay rehetra hataonao sy any amin’izay rehetra halehanao,'),
  ('6ab25a456d0ab6f9268e839f', '2026-09-22T10:36:53.659Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:53.659Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 2, 26, 'Fa hoy kosa ny mpanjaka tamin’i Abiatara mpisorona: “Mandehana any Anatota, any amin’ny misy anao, fa mendrika ny ho faty ianao. Androany anefa dia tsy hamono anao aho, satria nitondra ny Vata masin’i Jehovah Tompo Fara Tampony teo anatrehan’i Davida raiko ianao, sady nitondra fahoriana tamin’ny fotoana rehetra nahitan’ny raiko fahoriana.”', 'fa hoy kosa ny mpanjaka tamin’i abiatara mpisorona: “mandehana any anatota, any amin’ny misy anao, fa mendrika ny ho faty ianao. androany anefa dia tsy hamono anao aho, satria nitondra ny vata masin’i jehovah tompo fara tampony teo anatrehan’i davida raiko ianao, sady nitondra fahoriana tamin’ny fotoana rehetra nahitan’ny raiko fahoriana.”'),
  ('6ab25a456d0ab6f9268e83a9', '2026-09-22T10:36:53.659Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:53.659Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 2, 36, 'Ary nandefa olona hiantso an’i Simey ny mpanjaka, ka nanao taminy hoe: “Manorena trano eto Jerosalema, ka mipetraha ao. Aza miala ao an-tanàna mihitsy ary aza mankany an-toeran-kafa.', 'ary nandefa olona hiantso an’i simey ny mpanjaka, ka nanao taminy hoe: “manorena trano eto jerosalema, ka mipetraha ao. aza miala ao an-tanàna mihitsy ary aza mankany an-toeran-kafa.'),
  ('6ab25a456d0ab6f9268e838a', '2026-09-22T10:36:53.659Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:53.659Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 2, 5, '“Fantatrao tsara koa ny nataon’i Joaba tamiko, dia i Joaba zanak’i Zeroia. Novonoiny mantsy izy roa lahy lehiben’ny tafiky ny Israely, izany hoe i Abnera zanak’i Nera sy Amasa zanak’i Jatera. Nalatsany tamin’ny fotoana tsy nisy ady ny ra fandatsaka amin’ny ady, ka voaloton’ny ra toy ny amin’ny ady ny fehikibo teo amin’ny andilany sy ny kapa teny an-tongony.', '“fantatrao tsara koa ny nataon’i joaba tamiko, dia i joaba zanak’i zeroia. novonoiny mantsy izy roa lahy lehiben’ny tafiky ny israely, izany hoe i abnera zanak’i nera sy amasa zanak’i jatera. nalatsany tamin’ny fotoana tsy nisy ady ny ra fandatsaka amin’ny ady, ka voaloton’ny ra toy ny amin’ny ady ny fehikibo teo amin’ny andilany sy ny kapa teny an-tongony.'),
  ('6ab25a456d0ab6f9268e83ae', '2026-09-22T10:36:53.659Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:53.659Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 2, 41, 'Ary nisy nilaza tamin’i Solomona hoe: “Niala tao Jerosalema i Simey ka nankany Gata, ary efa tafaverina.”', 'ary nisy nilaza tamin’i solomona hoe: “niala tao jerosalema i simey ka nankany gata, ary efa tafaverina.”'),
  ('6ab25a456d0ab6f9268e83ab', '2026-09-22T10:36:53.659Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:53.659Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 2, 38, 'Dia hoy i Simey tamin’ny mpanjaka: “Tena mety izany teninao izany! Araka izany nolazain’ny mpanjaka tompoko izany no hataon’ny mpanomponao.” Ary nonina andro maro tao Jerosalema i Simey.', 'dia hoy i simey tamin’ny mpanjaka: “tena mety izany teninao izany! araka izany nolazain’ny mpanjaka tompoko izany no hataon’ny mpanomponao.” ary nonina andro maro tao jerosalema i simey.'),
  ('6ab25a456d0ab6f9268e8396', '2026-09-22T10:36:53.659Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:53.659Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 2, 17, 'Dia hoy i Adonia: “Mba mitenena re, azafady, amin’i Solomona Mpanjaka fa tsy handa anao izy e! Mba asaivo homeny ho vadiko i Abisaga Sonemita.”', 'dia hoy i adonia: “mba mitenena re, azafady, amin’i solomona mpanjaka fa tsy handa anao izy e! mba asaivo homeny ho vadiko i abisaga sonemita.”'),
  ('6ab25a456d0ab6f9268e8390', '2026-09-22T10:36:53.659Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:53.659Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 2, 11, 'Efapolo taona no nanjakan’i Davida teo amin’ny Israely, ka fito taona tao Hebrona ary telo amby telopolo taona tao Jerosalema.', 'efapolo taona no nanjakan’i davida teo amin’ny israely, ka fito taona tao hebrona ary telo amby telopolo taona tao jerosalema.'),
  ('6ab25a456d0ab6f9268e838f', '2026-09-22T10:36:53.659Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:53.659Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 2, 10, 'Ary nodimandry any amin’ny razany i Davida ka nalevina tao amin’ny Tanànan’i Davida.', 'ary nodimandry any amin’ny razany i davida ka nalevina tao amin’ny tanànan’i davida.'),
  ('6ab25a456d0ab6f9268e83b0', '2026-09-22T10:36:53.659Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:53.659Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 2, 43, 'Koa nahoana ianao no tsy nitana ny fianianana natao teo anatrehan’i Jehovah ka tsy nankatò ny didy izay nameperako mafy anao?”', 'koa nahoana ianao no tsy nitana ny fianianana natao teo anatrehan’i jehovah ka tsy nankatò ny didy izay nameperako mafy anao?”'),
  ('6ab25a456d0ab6f9268e83a2', '2026-09-22T10:36:53.659Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:53.659Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 2, 29, 'Ary nisy nilaza tamin’i Solomona Mpanjaka hoe: “Nandositra ao amin’ny tranolain’i Jehovah i Joaba. Eo anilan’ny alitara izy.” Dia nirahin’i Solomona i Benaia zanak’i Joiada, ka nilazany hoe: “Mandehana, asio izy!”', 'ary nisy nilaza tamin’i solomona mpanjaka hoe: “nandositra ao amin’ny tranolain’i jehovah i joaba. eo anilan’ny alitara izy.” dia nirahin’i solomona i benaia zanak’i joiada, ka nilazany hoe: “mandehana, asio izy!”'),
  ('6ab25a456d0ab6f9268e8395', '2026-09-22T10:36:53.659Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:53.659Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 2, 16, 'Koa zavatra iray ihany no mba angatahiko aminao, ka aza lavinao aho.” Ary hoy i Batseba taminy: “Lazao àry.”', 'koa zavatra iray ihany no mba angatahiko aminao, ka aza lavinao aho.” ary hoy i batseba taminy: “lazao àry.”'),
  ('6ab25a456d0ab6f9268e8393', '2026-09-22T10:36:53.659Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:53.659Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 2, 14, 'Hoy koa izy: “Misy zavatra tiako holazaina aminao.” Dia hoy i Batseba: “Lazao àry.”', 'hoy koa izy: “misy zavatra tiako holazaina aminao.” dia hoy i batseba: “lazao àry.”'),
  ('6ab25a456d0ab6f9268e8392', '2026-09-22T10:36:53.659Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:53.659Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 2, 13, 'Tatỳ aoriana, dia nankany amin’i Batseba renin’i Solomona i Adonia zanak’i Hagita. Ary hoy i Batseba: “Fihavanana ve no ahatongavanao?” Dia hoy i Adonia: “Eny, fihavanana.”', 'tatỳ aoriana, dia nankany amin’i batseba renin’i solomona i adonia zanak’i hagita. ary hoy i batseba: “fihavanana ve no ahatongavanao?” dia hoy i adonia: “eny, fihavanana.”'),
  ('6ab25a47236472c122a1c102', '2026-09-22T10:36:55.090Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:55.090Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 5, 7, 'Raha vao ren’i Hirama ny tenin’i Solomona, dia faly be izy ka nanao hoe: “Isaorana i Jehovah ankehitriny, satria nanome zanaka hendry ho an’i Davida izy mba hitondra an’izany vahoaka maro be izany!”', 'raha vao ren’i hirama ny tenin’i solomona, dia faly be izy ka nanao hoe: “isaorana i jehovah ankehitriny, satria nanome zanaka hendry ho an’i davida izy mba hitondra an’izany vahoaka maro be izany!”'),
  ('6ab25a47236472c122a1c0fd', '2026-09-22T10:36:55.090Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:55.090Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 5, 2, 'Dia nandefa iraka tany amin’i Hirama koa i Solomona, nanao hoe:', 'dia nandefa iraka tany amin’i hirama koa i solomona, nanao hoe:'),
  ('6ab25a47236472c122a1c10c', '2026-09-22T10:36:55.090Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:55.090Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 5, 17, 'Koa nasain’ny mpanjaka namaky vato izy ireo, mba hahazoana vato lehibe sady lafo vidy. Amin’izay dia ho vato voapaika no hatao fototr’ilay trano.', 'koa nasain’ny mpanjaka namaky vato izy ireo, mba hahazoana vato lehibe sady lafo vidy. amin’izay dia ho vato voapaika no hatao fototr’ilay trano.'),
  ('6ab25a47236472c122a1c0ff', '2026-09-22T10:36:55.090Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:55.090Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 5, 4, 'Nataon’i Jehovah Andriamanitro mandry feizay eo anivon’ny fahavaloko rehetra manodidina anefa aho ankehitriny, ka sady tsy misy mpanohitra no tsy misy loza mitranga.', 'nataon’i jehovah andriamanitro mandry feizay eo anivon’ny fahavaloko rehetra manodidina anefa aho ankehitriny, ka sady tsy misy mpanohitra no tsy misy loza mitranga.'),
  ('6ab25a47236472c122a1c108', '2026-09-22T10:36:55.090Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:55.090Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 5, 13, 'Ary tsy nitsahatra nampiantso olona avy tamin’ny Israely rehetra i Solomona Mpanjaka mba hanao fanompoana. Telo alina ny isan’ireo voantso hanao fanompoana.', 'ary tsy nitsahatra nampiantso olona avy tamin’ny israely rehetra i solomona mpanjaka mba hanao fanompoana. telo alina ny isan’ireo voantso hanao fanompoana.'),
  ('6ab25a47236472c122a1c105', '2026-09-22T10:36:55.090Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:55.090Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 5, 10, 'I Hirama àry no lasa mpamatsy hazo sedera sy zenevrie ho an’i Solomona, araka izay rehetra nahafinaritra azy.', 'i hirama àry no lasa mpamatsy hazo sedera sy zenevrie ho an’i solomona, araka izay rehetra nahafinaritra azy.'),
  ('6ab25a47236472c122a1c109', '2026-09-22T10:36:55.090Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:55.090Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 5, 14, 'Nalefan’i Solomona tany Libanona ireny, ka iray alina isam-bolana no niara-nalefany. Koa nijanona iray volana tany Libanona ireo, ary roa volana kosa tany an-tranony avy. I Adonirama no niandraikitra an’ireo voantso hanao fanompoana.', 'nalefan’i solomona tany libanona ireny, ka iray alina isam-bolana no niara-nalefany. koa nijanona iray volana tany libanona ireo, ary roa volana kosa tany an-tranony avy. i adonirama no niandraikitra an’ireo voantso hanao fanompoana.'),
  ('6ab25a47236472c122a1c107', '2026-09-22T10:36:55.090Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:55.090Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 5, 12, 'Ary i Jehovah nanome fahendrena an’i Solomona, araka izay nampanantenainy azy. Ary tsara fihavanana i Hirama sy Solomona, ka nanao fifanekena izy roa lahy.', 'ary i jehovah nanome fahendrena an’i solomona, araka izay nampanantenainy azy. ary tsara fihavanana i hirama sy solomona, ka nanao fifanekena izy roa lahy.'),
  ('6ab25a47236472c122a1c106', '2026-09-22T10:36:55.090Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:55.090Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 5, 11, 'Ary i Solomona kosa nanome an’i Hirama varimbazaha roa alina kora ho sakafon’ny ankohonany, ary menaka roapolo kora avy amin’ny oliva voatoto. Izany no nomen’i Solomona an’i Hirama isan-taona.', 'ary i solomona kosa nanome an’i hirama varimbazaha roa alina kora ho sakafon’ny ankohonany, ary menaka roapolo kora avy amin’ny oliva voatoto. izany no nomen’i solomona an’i hirama isan-taona.'),
  ('6ab25a47236472c122a1c0fc', '2026-09-22T10:36:55.090Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:55.090Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 5, 1, 'Ary naniraka ny mpanompony ho any amin’i Solomona i Hirama, mpanjakan’i Tyro, satria henony fa i Solomona no voahosotra ho mpanjaka handimby an-drainy. Efa hatramin’izay mantsy i Hirama no tia an’i Davida.', 'ary naniraka ny mpanompony ho any amin’i solomona i hirama, mpanjakan’i tyro, satria henony fa i solomona no voahosotra ho mpanjaka handimby an-drainy. efa hatramin’izay mantsy i hirama no tia an’i davida.'),
  ('6ab25a47236472c122a1c100', '2026-09-22T10:36:55.090Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:55.090Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 5, 5, 'Ary mieritreritra ny hanorina trano ho an’ny anaran’i Jehovah Andriamanitro aho, araka izay nampanantenain’i Jehovah an’i Davida raiko hoe: ‘Ny zanakao izay hapetrako eo amin’ny seza fiandriananao handimby anao no hanorina ilay trano ho an’ny anarako.’', 'ary mieritreritra ny hanorina trano ho an’ny anaran’i jehovah andriamanitro aho, araka izay nampanantenain’i jehovah an’i davida raiko hoe: ‘ny zanakao izay hapetrako eo amin’ny seza fiandriananao handimby anao no hanorina ilay trano ho an’ny anarako.’'),
  ('6ab25a47236472c122a1c103', '2026-09-22T10:36:55.090Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:55.090Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 5, 8, 'Koa nandefa iraka tany amin’i Solomona i Hirama, nanao hoe: “Efa reko izay nambaran’ny iraka nalefanao tatỳ amiko. Koa hataoko izay rehetra mahafinaritra anao ka homeko anao ny hazo sedera sy zenevrie tadiavinao.', 'koa nandefa iraka tany amin’i solomona i hirama, nanao hoe: “efa reko izay nambaran’ny iraka nalefanao tatỳ amiko. koa hataoko izay rehetra mahafinaritra anao ka homeko anao ny hazo sedera sy zenevrie tadiavinao.'),
  ('6ab25a47236472c122a1c0fe', '2026-09-22T10:36:55.090Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:55.090Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 5, 3, '“Fantatrao tsara fa tsy afaka nanao trano ho an’ny anaran’i Jehovah Andriamaniny i Davida raiko noho ny ady nataon’ny fahavalony taminy. Niady taminy foana mantsy ireny mandra-panaon’i Jehovah an’ireny ho eo ambany faladiany.', '“fantatrao tsara fa tsy afaka nanao trano ho an’ny anaran’i jehovah andriamaniny i davida raiko noho ny ady nataon’ny fahavalony taminy. niady taminy foana mantsy ireny mandra-panaon’i jehovah an’ireny ho eo ambany faladiany.'),
  ('6ab25a47236472c122a1c10b', '2026-09-22T10:36:55.090Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:55.090Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 5, 16, 'ankoatra an’ireo andriana lehibem-paritra nampiasain’i Solomona mba hanara-maso ny asa, izany hoe ireo telonjato sy telo arivo lahy lehiben’ireo mpiasa am-perinasa.', 'ankoatra an’ireo andriana lehibem-paritra nampiasain’i solomona mba hanara-maso ny asa, izany hoe ireo telonjato sy telo arivo lahy lehiben’ireo mpiasa am-perinasa.'),
  ('6ab25a47236472c122a1c10d', '2026-09-22T10:36:55.090Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:55.090Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 5, 18, 'Koa nipai-bato ny mpanao tranon’i Solomona sy ny mpanao tranon’i Hirama ary ny Gebalita, sady nanomana ny hazo sy ny vato hanaovana ilay trano.', 'koa nipai-bato ny mpanao tranon’i solomona sy ny mpanao tranon’i hirama ary ny gebalita, sady nanomana ny hazo sy ny vato hanaovana ilay trano.'),
  ('6ab25a47236472c122a1c104', '2026-09-22T10:36:55.090Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:55.090Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 5, 9, 'Ny mpanompoko mihitsy no hampidina izany avy any Libanona ho any an-dranomasina. Ary hatambatro ho zahatra ny hazo ka halefako eny an-dranomasina hatrany amin’izay toerana holazainao amiko. Any no hasaiko hoborahina izany, ary ianao no hitatitra izany. Ary ianao kosa hanao izay mahafinaritra ahy, ka hanome sakafo ho an’ny ankohonako.”', 'ny mpanompoko mihitsy no hampidina izany avy any libanona ho any an-dranomasina. ary hatambatro ho zahatra ny hazo ka halefako eny an-dranomasina hatrany amin’izay toerana holazainao amiko. any no hasaiko hoborahina izany, ary ianao no hitatitra izany. ary ianao kosa hanao izay mahafinaritra ahy, ka hanome sakafo ho an’ny ankohonako.”'),
  ('6ab25a47236472c122a1c101', '2026-09-22T10:36:55.090Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:55.090Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 5, 6, 'Koa aoka ianao hanome baiko mba hisy hikapa hazo ho ahy, dia hazo sedera avy any Libanona. Hiaraka amin’ny mpanomponao ny mpanompoko, ary homeko anao araka izay holazainao ny karaman’ny mpanomponao, satria fantatrao tsara fa tsy misy mahay mikapa hazo tahaka ny Sidonianina eto aminay.”', 'koa aoka ianao hanome baiko mba hisy hikapa hazo ho ahy, dia hazo sedera avy any libanona. hiaraka amin’ny mpanomponao ny mpanompoko, ary homeko anao araka izay holazainao ny karaman’ny mpanomponao, satria fantatrao tsara fa tsy misy mahay mikapa hazo tahaka ny sidonianina eto aminay.”'),
  ('6ab25a47236472c122a1c10a', '2026-09-22T10:36:55.090Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:55.090Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 5, 15, 'Ary i Solomona dia lasa nanana mpitondra entana fito alina sy mpipai-bato valo alina eny an-tendrombohitra,', 'ary i solomona dia lasa nanana mpitondra entana fito alina sy mpipai-bato valo alina eny an-tendrombohitra,'),
  ('6ab25a477fa92128fb8c7d2e', '2026-09-22T10:36:55.980Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:55.980Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 7, 46, 'Teo amin’ny Faritr’i Jordana no nandrendrehan’ny mpanjaka azy ireo, tao anaty lasitra tanimanga, teo anelanelan’i Sokota sy Zaretana.', 'teo amin’ny faritr’i jordana no nandrendrehan’ny mpanjaka azy ireo, tao anaty lasitra tanimanga, teo anelanelan’i sokota sy zaretana.'),
  ('6ab25a477fa92128fb8c7d2a', '2026-09-22T10:36:55.980Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:55.980Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 7, 42, 'sy ny ampongabendanitra efajato ho an’ny harato roa, ka ampongabendanitra roa andalana ho an’ny harato tsirairay mba handrakotra ny loha andry roa niendrika vilia baolina, izay teo ambonin’ny andry roa,', 'sy ny ampongabendanitra efajato ho an’ny harato roa, ka ampongabendanitra roa andalana ho an’ny harato tsirairay mba handrakotra ny loha andry roa niendrika vilia baolina, izay teo ambonin’ny andry roa,'),
  ('6ab25a477fa92128fb8c7d1d', '2026-09-22T10:36:55.980Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:55.980Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 7, 29, 'Nisy sarina liona sy omby ary kerobima teo amin’ireo takela-barahina izay teny anelanelan’ireo sisiny nifanapaka, ary nisy toy izany koa teo amin’ireo sisiny nifanapaka. Ary nisy sarim-boninkazo natohitohy natao haingony teo ambony sy teo ambanin’ny liona sy ny omby.', 'nisy sarina liona sy omby ary kerobima teo amin’ireo takela-barahina izay teny anelanelan’ireo sisiny nifanapaka, ary nisy toy izany koa teo amin’ireo sisiny nifanapaka. ary nisy sarim-boninkazo natohitohy natao haingony teo ambony sy teo ambanin’ny liona sy ny omby.'),
  ('6ab25a477fa92128fb8c7d06', '2026-09-22T10:36:55.980Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:55.980Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 7, 6, 'Ary ny Lala-mitafo Maro Andry dia nataony dimampolo hakiho ny lavany ary telopolo hakiho ny sakany. Nisy lala-mitafo iray koa teo anoloan’ireo andry ireo, ary andry maro no nanohana azy. Ary nisy tafokely somary mivoaka koa teo anoloan’ireo andry.', 'ary ny lala-mitafo maro andry dia nataony dimampolo hakiho ny lavany ary telopolo hakiho ny sakany. nisy lala-mitafo iray koa teo anoloan’ireo andry ireo, ary andry maro no nanohana azy. ary nisy tafokely somary mivoaka koa teo anoloan’ireo andry.'),
  ('6ab25a477fa92128fb8c7d11', '2026-09-22T10:36:55.980Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:55.980Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 7, 17, 'Ary nisy harato nifampidipiditra teo amin’ireo loha andry teo an-tampon’ny andry, sady nisy haingony niolanolana natao toy ny rojo. Harato fito no teo amin’ny loha andry iray, ary fito koa no teo amin’ny iray.', 'ary nisy harato nifampidipiditra teo amin’ireo loha andry teo an-tampon’ny andry, sady nisy haingony niolanolana natao toy ny rojo. harato fito no teo amin’ny loha andry iray, ary fito koa no teo amin’ny iray.'),
  ('6ab25a477fa92128fb8c7d0b', '2026-09-22T10:36:55.980Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:55.980Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 7, 11, 'Ary teo amboniny dia nisy vato lafo vidy sy manara-drefy ary voapaika, ary koa hazo sedera.', 'ary teo amboniny dia nisy vato lafo vidy sy manara-drefy ary voapaika, ary koa hazo sedera.'),
  ('6ab25a477fa92128fb8c7d04', '2026-09-22T10:36:55.980Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:55.980Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 7, 4, 'Natao telo andalana kosa ireo varavarankely nisy tolàna. Ary nisy lavaka maro fidiran’ny hazavana ilay trano, ary nifanandrify ireny sady nisy ambaratonga telo.', 'natao telo andalana kosa ireo varavarankely nisy tolàna. ary nisy lavaka maro fidiran’ny hazavana ilay trano, ary nifanandrify ireny sady nisy ambaratonga telo.'),
  ('6ab25a477fa92128fb8c7d33', '2026-09-22T10:36:55.980Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:55.980Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 7, 51, 'Farany, dia vita ny asa rehetra nataon’i Solomona Mpanjaka momba ny tranon’i Jehovah, ka nampidiriny tao ireo zavatra efa nohamasinin’i Davida rainy. Ary nataony tao amin’ny fitehirizana zava-tsarobidy tao an-tranon’i Jehovah ny volafotsy sy ny volamena ary ny fitaovana hafa.', 'farany, dia vita ny asa rehetra nataon’i solomona mpanjaka momba ny tranon’i jehovah, ka nampidiriny tao ireo zavatra efa nohamasinin’i davida rainy. ary nataony tao amin’ny fitehirizana zava-tsarobidy tao an-tranon’i jehovah ny volafotsy sy ny volamena ary ny fitaovana hafa.'),
  ('6ab25a477fa92128fb8c7d2f', '2026-09-22T10:36:55.980Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:55.980Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 7, 47, 'Ary tsy nolanjain’i Solomona ny fitaovana rehetra, satria be dia be loatra. Tsy fantatra intsony izay lanjan’ny varahina.', 'ary tsy nolanjain’i solomona ny fitaovana rehetra, satria be dia be loatra. tsy fantatra intsony izay lanjan’ny varahina.'),
  ('6ab25a477fa92128fb8c7d26', '2026-09-22T10:36:55.980Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:55.980Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 7, 38, 'Ary nanao koveta varahina folo izy: Rano efapolo bata no natao tao anaty koveta tsirairay. Efatra hakiho ny koveta tsirairay, ary nisy koveta iray avy teo ambonin’ny kalesy folo.', 'ary nanao koveta varahina folo izy: rano efapolo bata no natao tao anaty koveta tsirairay. efatra hakiho ny koveta tsirairay, ary nisy koveta iray avy teo ambonin’ny kalesy folo.'),
  ('6ab25a477fa92128fb8c7d07', '2026-09-22T10:36:55.980Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:55.980Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 7, 7, 'Ary ny Lala-mitafon’ny Seza Fiandrianana, izay toerana hitsaran’i Solomona, dia nataony lala-mitafo fitsarana. Norakofana hazo sedera ilay izy, nanomboka teo amin’ny gorodona ka hatreny amin’ireo hazo mitondra ny tafo.', 'ary ny lala-mitafon’ny seza fiandrianana, izay toerana hitsaran’i solomona, dia nataony lala-mitafo fitsarana. norakofana hazo sedera ilay izy, nanomboka teo amin’ny gorodona ka hatreny amin’ireo hazo mitondra ny tafo.'),
  ('6ab25a477fa92128fb8c7d23', '2026-09-22T10:36:55.980Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:55.980Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 7, 35, 'Ary teo an-tampon’ny kalesy dia nisy boribory fipetrahan-javatra, antsasaky ny hakiho ny haavony. Ary teo an-tampon’ny kalesy no nisy ny tendany sy ireo takela-barahina, ary tenany iray tamin’ilay kalesy ireo.', 'ary teo an-tampon’ny kalesy dia nisy boribory fipetrahan-javatra, antsasaky ny hakiho ny haavony. ary teo an-tampon’ny kalesy no nisy ny tendany sy ireo takela-barahina, ary tenany iray tamin’ilay kalesy ireo.'),
  ('6ab25a477fa92128fb8c7d21', '2026-09-22T10:36:55.980Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:55.980Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 7, 33, 'Sahala amin’ny kodiaran-tsarety no nanaovana ny kodiarany. Natao tamin’ny metaly narendrika daholo na ireo fitaovana nihazona azy na ny tena kodiarana na ny rantsany na ny ivon-kodiarana.', 'sahala amin’ny kodiaran-tsarety no nanaovana ny kodiarany. natao tamin’ny metaly narendrika daholo na ireo fitaovana nihazona azy na ny tena kodiarana na ny rantsany na ny ivon-kodiarana.'),
  ('6ab25a477fa92128fb8c7d17', '2026-09-22T10:36:55.980Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:55.980Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 7, 23, 'Ary nanao fitoeran-drano lehibe, nantsoina hoe ranomasina varahina izy, ka folo hakiho ny savaivony. Boribory ilay izy, ary dimy hakiho ny haavony. Ary tady telopolo hakiho vao nahodidina azy.', 'ary nanao fitoeran-drano lehibe, nantsoina hoe ranomasina varahina izy, ka folo hakiho ny savaivony. boribory ilay izy, ary dimy hakiho ny haavony. ary tady telopolo hakiho vao nahodidina azy.'),
  ('6ab25a477fa92128fb8c7d01', '2026-09-22T10:36:55.980Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:55.980Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 7, 1, 'Telo ambin’ny folo taona no nanaovan’i Solomona ny tranony, dia vitany tanteraka ilay izy.', 'telo ambin’ny folo taona no nanaovan’i solomona ny tranony, dia vitany tanteraka ilay izy.'),
  ('6ab25a477fa92128fb8c7d0f', '2026-09-22T10:36:55.980Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:55.980Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 7, 15, 'Dia nandrendrika varahina izy hanaovana ny andry roa: Valo ambin’ny folo hakiho avy ny haavony, ary tady roa ambin’ny folo hakiho vao nahodidina ny andry tsirairay.', 'dia nandrendrika varahina izy hanaovana ny andry roa: valo ambin’ny folo hakiho avy ny haavony, ary tady roa ambin’ny folo hakiho vao nahodidina ny andry tsirairay.'),
  ('6ab25a477fa92128fb8c7d09', '2026-09-22T10:36:55.980Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:55.980Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 7, 9, 'Ireo rehetra ireo dia natao tamin’ny vato lafo vidy, izay manara-drefy sy voapaika ary voatsofa tamin’ny tsofam-bato, na ny atiny na ny ivelany. Vato toy izany no nampiasaina, manomboka amin’ny fototra ka hatramin’ny tampon’ny rindrina, ary toy izany koa ny ivelany, hatramin’ilay tokotany lehibe.', 'ireo rehetra ireo dia natao tamin’ny vato lafo vidy, izay manara-drefy sy voapaika ary voatsofa tamin’ny tsofam-bato, na ny atiny na ny ivelany. vato toy izany no nampiasaina, manomboka amin’ny fototra ka hatramin’ny tampon’ny rindrina, ary toy izany koa ny ivelany, hatramin’ilay tokotany lehibe.'),
  ('6ab25a477fa92128fb8c7d30', '2026-09-22T10:36:55.980Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:55.980Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 7, 48, 'Ary nataon’i Solomona tsikelikely ny fitaovana rehetra momba ny tranon’i Jehovah: Ny alitara volamena sy ny latabatra volamena fitoeran’ny mofo aseho,', 'ary nataon’i solomona tsikelikely ny fitaovana rehetra momba ny tranon’i jehovah: ny alitara volamena sy ny latabatra volamena fitoeran’ny mofo aseho,'),
  ('6ab25a477fa92128fb8c7d1c', '2026-09-22T10:36:55.980Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:55.980Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 7, 28, 'Toy izao no nanaovana an’ireo kalesy ireo: Nisy takela-barahina maromaro teo amin’izy ireo, ary teo anelanelan’ireo sisiny nifanapaka no nisy ireo takela-barahina ireo.', 'toy izao no nanaovana an’ireo kalesy ireo: nisy takela-barahina maromaro teo amin’izy ireo, ary teo anelanelan’ireo sisiny nifanapaka no nisy ireo takela-barahina ireo.'),
  ('6ab25a477fa92128fb8c7d19', '2026-09-22T10:36:55.980Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:55.980Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 7, 25, 'Nipetraka teo ambonin’ny omby roa ambin’ny folo ilay izy, ka omby telo nitodika nianavaratra, telo niankandrefana, telo nianatsimo, ary telo niantsinanana. Ilay ranomasina dia teo ambonin’ireo omby ireo, ary nifampiamboho izy rehetra.', 'nipetraka teo ambonin’ny omby roa ambin’ny folo ilay izy, ka omby telo nitodika nianavaratra, telo niankandrefana, telo nianatsimo, ary telo niantsinanana. ilay ranomasina dia teo ambonin’ireo omby ireo, ary nifampiamboho izy rehetra.'),
  ('6ab25a477fa92128fb8c7d14', '2026-09-22T10:36:55.980Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:55.980Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 7, 20, 'Ary teo an-tampon’ny andry roa ireo loha andry, sady teo akaikin’ilay kibony, izay voahodidin’ireo harato. Ampongabendanitra roanjato natao roa andalana no nanodidina ny loha andry tsirairay.', 'ary teo an-tampon’ny andry roa ireo loha andry, sady teo akaikin’ilay kibony, izay voahodidin’ireo harato. ampongabendanitra roanjato natao roa andalana no nanodidina ny loha andry tsirairay.'),
  ('6ab25a477fa92128fb8c7d03', '2026-09-22T10:36:55.980Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:55.980Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 7, 3, 'Ary nopetahana takela-kazo sedera ilay trano, teo ambonin’ireo tsivalan-kazo izay teo ambonin’ny andry dimy amby efapolo. Nisy andry dimy ambin’ny folo ny laharana iray.', 'ary nopetahana takela-kazo sedera ilay trano, teo ambonin’ireo tsivalan-kazo izay teo ambonin’ny andry dimy amby efapolo. nisy andry dimy ambin’ny folo ny laharana iray.'),
  ('6ab25a477fa92128fb8c7d28', '2026-09-22T10:36:55.980Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:55.980Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 7, 40, 'Ary nataon’i Hirama tsikelikely ireo koveta sy lapelina ary vilia baolina. Farany, dia vitan’i Hirama ny asa rehetra nataony ho an’i Solomona Mpanjaka, momba ny tranon’i Jehovah:', 'ary nataon’i hirama tsikelikely ireo koveta sy lapelina ary vilia baolina. farany, dia vitan’i hirama ny asa rehetra nataony ho an’i solomona mpanjaka, momba ny tranon’i jehovah:'),
  ('6ab25a477fa92128fb8c7d18', '2026-09-22T10:36:55.980Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:55.980Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 7, 24, 'Ary nisy haingony niendrika voatango teo ambany molony manodidina azy, ka voatango folo isaky ny iray hakiho no nanodidina an’ilay ranomasina. Roa andalana ilay haingony niendrika voatango sady niara-narendrika tamin’ilay ranomasina.', 'ary nisy haingony niendrika voatango teo ambany molony manodidina azy, ka voatango folo isaky ny iray hakiho no nanodidina an’ilay ranomasina. roa andalana ilay haingony niendrika voatango sady niara-narendrika tamin’ilay ranomasina.'),
  ('6ab25a477fa92128fb8c7d12', '2026-09-22T10:36:55.980Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:55.980Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 7, 18, 'Ary nanao ampongabendanitra izy, ka nataony roa andalana manodidina, teo ambonin’ireo harato ireny, mba handrakotra ny loha andry teo an-tampon’ny andry. Ary nataony toy izany koa ny loha andry iray.', 'ary nanao ampongabendanitra izy, ka nataony roa andalana manodidina, teo ambonin’ireo harato ireny, mba handrakotra ny loha andry teo an-tampon’ny andry. ary nataony toy izany koa ny loha andry iray.'),
  ('6ab25a477fa92128fb8c7d05', '2026-09-22T10:36:55.980Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:55.980Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 7, 5, 'Ary nasiana sisiny efajoro ny fidirana sy ny tolàm-baravarana rehetra. Natao toy izany koa ny anoloan’ireo lavaka fidiran’ny hazavana, izay nifanandrify sady nisy ambaratonga telo.', 'ary nasiana sisiny efajoro ny fidirana sy ny tolàm-baravarana rehetra. natao toy izany koa ny anoloan’ireo lavaka fidiran’ny hazavana, izay nifanandrify sady nisy ambaratonga telo.'),
  ('6ab25a477fa92128fb8c7d22', '2026-09-22T10:36:55.980Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:55.980Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 7, 34, 'Ary nisy tohany efatra ny zorony efatra tamin’ny kalesy tsirairay. Tenany iray tamin’ny kalesy ireo tohany ireo.', 'ary nisy tohany efatra ny zorony efatra tamin’ny kalesy tsirairay. tenany iray tamin’ny kalesy ireo tohany ireo.'),
  ('6ab25a477fa92128fb8c7d20', '2026-09-22T10:36:55.980Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:55.980Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 7, 32, 'Teo ambanin’ireo takela-barahina no nisy ny kodiarana efatra, ary teo ambanin’ilay kalesy ny fitaovana nihazona an’ireo kodiarana. Iray hakiho sy sasany ny haavon’ny kodiarana tsirairay.', 'teo ambanin’ireo takela-barahina no nisy ny kodiarana efatra, ary teo ambanin’ilay kalesy ny fitaovana nihazona an’ireo kodiarana. iray hakiho sy sasany ny haavon’ny kodiarana tsirairay.'),
  ('6ab25a477fa92128fb8c7d13', '2026-09-22T10:36:55.980Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:55.980Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 7, 19, 'Ary ny loha andry teo an-tampon’ny andry, izay teo akaikin’ny tilikambo fidirana, dia nataony miendrika voninkazo lisy: Efatra hakiho ny refiny.', 'ary ny loha andry teo an-tampon’ny andry, izay teo akaikin’ny tilikambo fidirana, dia nataony miendrika voninkazo lisy: efatra hakiho ny refiny.'),
  ('6ab25a477fa92128fb8c7d10', '2026-09-22T10:36:55.980Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:55.980Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 7, 16, 'Ary nanao loha andry roa tamin’ny varahina narendrika izy, mba hatao teo amin’ny tampon’ny andry: Dimy hakiho ny haavon’ny loha andry iray, ary dimy hakiho koa ny haavon’ny iray.', 'ary nanao loha andry roa tamin’ny varahina narendrika izy, mba hatao teo amin’ny tampon’ny andry: dimy hakiho ny haavon’ny loha andry iray, ary dimy hakiho koa ny haavon’ny iray.'),
  ('6ab25a477fa92128fb8c7d02', '2026-09-22T10:36:55.980Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:55.980Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 7, 2, 'Dia nanao ny Trano Alan’i Libanona izy, ka nataony zato hakiho ny lavany, dimampolo hakiho ny sakany, ary telopolo hakiho ny haavony, teo ambonin’ny andry sedera nisy laharany efatra. Ary nisy vatan-kazo sedera teo ambonin’ireo andry.', 'dia nanao ny trano alan’i libanona izy, ka nataony zato hakiho ny lavany, dimampolo hakiho ny sakany, ary telopolo hakiho ny haavony, teo ambonin’ny andry sedera nisy laharany efatra. ary nisy vatan-kazo sedera teo ambonin’ireo andry.'),
  ('6ab25a477fa92128fb8c7d1f', '2026-09-22T10:36:55.980Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:55.980Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 7, 31, 'Ny refin’ny vavan’ilay koveta, manomboka ao anatiny ka hatramin’ireo tohany no ho miakatra dia ... * hakiho. Boribory ny vavany, ary iray hakiho sy sasany ny fipetrahany. Ary nisy sary sokitra koa teo amin’io vavany io. Efajoro ireo takela-barahina teo aminy, fa tsy boribory.', 'ny refin’ny vavan’ilay koveta, manomboka ao anatiny ka hatramin’ireo tohany no ho miakatra dia ... * hakiho. boribory ny vavany, ary iray hakiho sy sasany ny fipetrahany. ary nisy sary sokitra koa teo amin’io vavany io. efajoro ireo takela-barahina teo aminy, fa tsy boribory.'),
  ('6ab25a477fa92128fb8c7d1b', '2026-09-22T10:36:55.980Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:55.980Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 7, 27, 'Ary nanao kalesy varahina folo izy: Efatra hakiho ny lavan’ny kalesy tsirairay, ary efatra hakiho koa ny sakany, ary telo hakiho ny haavony.', 'ary nanao kalesy varahina folo izy: efatra hakiho ny lavan’ny kalesy tsirairay, ary efatra hakiho koa ny sakany, ary telo hakiho ny haavony.'),
  ('6ab25a477fa92128fb8c7d15', '2026-09-22T10:36:55.980Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:55.980Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 7, 21, 'Ary natsangany ireo andrin’ny tilikambo fidirana mankao amin’ny tempoly. Natsangany ny andry ankavanana ary nantsoiny hoe Jakina. Avy eo dia natsangany ny andry ankavia ary nantsoiny hoe Boaza.', 'ary natsangany ireo andrin’ny tilikambo fidirana mankao amin’ny tempoly. natsangany ny andry ankavanana ary nantsoiny hoe jakina. avy eo dia natsangany ny andry ankavia ary nantsoiny hoe boaza.'),
  ('6ab25a477fa92128fb8c7d24', '2026-09-22T10:36:55.980Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:55.980Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 7, 36, 'Nisy zavatra manify napetaka teo amin’ny tendany sy teo amin’ireo takela-barahina. Samy nasiany sary sokitra ireo, dia sarina kerobima sy liona ary hazo palmie, arakaraka izay nisy nalalaka teo amin’ny tsirairay. Ary nasiana sarim-boninkazo natohitohy ny manodidina azy.', 'nisy zavatra manify napetaka teo amin’ny tendany sy teo amin’ireo takela-barahina. samy nasiany sary sokitra ireo, dia sarina kerobima sy liona ary hazo palmie, arakaraka izay nisy nalalaka teo amin’ny tsirairay. ary nasiana sarim-boninkazo natohitohy ny manodidina azy.'),
  ('6ab25a477fa92128fb8c7d16', '2026-09-22T10:36:55.980Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:55.980Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 7, 22, 'Nisy toy ny lisy teo an-tampon’ireo andry. Ary novitaina tsikelikely ny fanamboarana an’ireo andry.', 'nisy toy ny lisy teo an-tampon’ireo andry. ary novitaina tsikelikely ny fanamboarana an’ireo andry.'),
  ('6ab25a477fa92128fb8c7d2c', '2026-09-22T10:36:55.980Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:55.980Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 7, 44, 'sy ny ranomasina iray sy ny omby roa ambin’ny folo teo ambaniny,', 'sy ny ranomasina iray sy ny omby roa ambin’ny folo teo ambaniny,'),
  ('6ab25a477fa92128fb8c7d0d', '2026-09-22T10:36:55.980Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:55.980Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 7, 13, 'Ary naniraka olona haka an’i Hirama avy any Tyro i Solomona Mpanjaka.', 'ary naniraka olona haka an’i hirama avy any tyro i solomona mpanjaka.'),
  ('6ab25a477fa92128fb8c7d0c', '2026-09-22T10:36:55.980Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:55.980Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 7, 12, 'Ary manodidina an’ilay tokotany lehibe dia nasiany tamboho natao tamin’ny vato voapaika telo andalana sy vatan-kazo sedera iray andalana. Toy izany koa ilay tokotany anatiny, izay misy ny tranon’i Jehovah sy ny tilikambo fidirana mankao amin’io trano io.', 'ary manodidina an’ilay tokotany lehibe dia nasiany tamboho natao tamin’ny vato voapaika telo andalana sy vatan-kazo sedera iray andalana. toy izany koa ilay tokotany anatiny, izay misy ny tranon’i jehovah sy ny tilikambo fidirana mankao amin’io trano io.'),
  ('6ab25a477fa92128fb8c7d2d', '2026-09-22T10:36:55.980Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:55.980Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 7, 45, 'sy ny fitoeran-davenona sy ny lapelina sy ny vilia baolina ary ny fitaovana rehetra, izay nataon’i Hirama tamin’ny varahina nokosehina hangirana. Nataony ho an’i Solomona Mpanjaka izany, ho an’ny tranon’i Jehovah.', 'sy ny fitoeran-davenona sy ny lapelina sy ny vilia baolina ary ny fitaovana rehetra, izay nataon’i hirama tamin’ny varahina nokosehina hangirana. nataony ho an’i solomona mpanjaka izany, ho an’ny tranon’i jehovah.'),
  ('6ab25a477fa92128fb8c7d25', '2026-09-22T10:36:55.980Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:55.980Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 7, 37, 'Toy izany no nanaovany ny kalesy folo: Nitovy daholo ny fomba nandrendrehana azy, sady nitovy refy sy bika.', 'toy izany no nanaovany ny kalesy folo: nitovy daholo ny fomba nandrendrehana azy, sady nitovy refy sy bika.'),
  ('6ab25a477fa92128fb8c7d0e', '2026-09-22T10:36:55.980Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:55.980Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 7, 14, 'Zanaky ny vehivavy mpitondratena avy amin’ny fokon’i Naftaly i Hirama, fa avy any Tyro kosa ny rainy, izay mpanao asa varahina. Feno fahendrena sy fahiratan-tsaina ary fahalalana hoenti-manao asa varahina isan-karazany izy. Dia tonga tany amin’i Solomona Mpanjaka izy ka nanao ny asa rehetra nampanaoviny.', 'zanaky ny vehivavy mpitondratena avy amin’ny fokon’i naftaly i hirama, fa avy any tyro kosa ny rainy, izay mpanao asa varahina. feno fahendrena sy fahiratan-tsaina ary fahalalana hoenti-manao asa varahina isan-karazany izy. dia tonga tany amin’i solomona mpanjaka izy ka nanao ny asa rehetra nampanaoviny.'),
  ('6ab25a477fa92128fb8c7d0a', '2026-09-22T10:36:55.980Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:55.980Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 7, 10, 'Vato lehibe mirefy folo hakiho sy valo hakiho ireo vato lafo vidy natao fototra ireo.', 'vato lehibe mirefy folo hakiho sy valo hakiho ireo vato lafo vidy natao fototra ireo.'),
  ('6ab25a477fa92128fb8c7d31', '2026-09-22T10:36:55.980Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:55.980Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 7, 49, 'sy ny fitoeran-jiro volamena tsy misy fangarony, dimy teo ankavanana ary dimy teo ankavia, teo anoloan’ny efitra anatiny indrindra, sy ny felan’ny fitoeran-jiro sy ny jiro sy ny fihazonana lahin-jiro, izay samy volamena,', 'sy ny fitoeran-jiro volamena tsy misy fangarony, dimy teo ankavanana ary dimy teo ankavia, teo anoloan’ny efitra anatiny indrindra, sy ny felan’ny fitoeran-jiro sy ny jiro sy ny fihazonana lahin-jiro, izay samy volamena,'),
  ('6ab25a477fa92128fb8c7d2b', '2026-09-22T10:36:55.980Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:55.980Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 7, 43, 'sy ny kalesy folo sy ny koveta folo teo amboniny,', 'sy ny kalesy folo sy ny koveta folo teo amboniny,'),
  ('6ab25a477fa92128fb8c7d29', '2026-09-22T10:36:55.980Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:55.980Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 7, 41, 'Ny andry roa sy ny loha andry niendrika vilia baolina izay teo an-tampon’ny andry roa, sy ny harato roa nandrakotra ny loha andry boribory roa izay teo an-tampon’ireo andry,', 'ny andry roa sy ny loha andry niendrika vilia baolina izay teo an-tampon’ny andry roa, sy ny harato roa nandrakotra ny loha andry boribory roa izay teo an-tampon’ireo andry,'),
  ('6ab25a477fa92128fb8c7d1e', '2026-09-22T10:36:55.980Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:55.980Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 7, 30, 'Nisy kodiarana varahina efatra ny kalesy tsirairay, ary varahina lavalava no ihodinan’ireo kodiarana. Ary ny zorony efatra tamin’ny kalesy no tohana nihazona an’ireo. Teo ambanin’ny koveta no nisy an’ireo tohana vita tamin’ny metaly narendrika, ary nisy sarim-boninkazo teo amin’ny tohana iray nankamin’ny tohana iray.', 'nisy kodiarana varahina efatra ny kalesy tsirairay, ary varahina lavalava no ihodinan’ireo kodiarana. ary ny zorony efatra tamin’ny kalesy no tohana nihazona an’ireo. teo ambanin’ny koveta no nisy an’ireo tohana vita tamin’ny metaly narendrika, ary nisy sarim-boninkazo teo amin’ny tohana iray nankamin’ny tohana iray.'),
  ('6ab25a477fa92128fb8c7d32', '2026-09-22T10:36:55.980Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:55.980Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 7, 50, 'sy ny koveta sy ny famonoan-jiro sy ny vilia baolina sy ny kaopy sy ny fitondrana afo, izay samy volamena tsy misy fangarony, ary ny vavin-tsavily ho an’ny varavaran’ny trano anatiny, izany hoe ny Masina Indrindra, sy ho an’ny varavaran’ny tempoly, izay samy volamena.', 'sy ny koveta sy ny famonoan-jiro sy ny vilia baolina sy ny kaopy sy ny fitondrana afo, izay samy volamena tsy misy fangarony, ary ny vavin-tsavily ho an’ny varavaran’ny trano anatiny, izany hoe ny masina indrindra, sy ho an’ny varavaran’ny tempoly, izay samy volamena.'),
  ('6ab25a477fa92128fb8c7d27', '2026-09-22T10:36:55.980Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:55.980Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 7, 39, 'Kalesy dimy no napetrany teo ankavanan’ny trano, ary dimy teo ankavia. Ilay ranomasina kosa nataony teo ankavanan’ny trano, teo atsimoatsinanana.', 'kalesy dimy no napetrany teo ankavanan’ny trano, ary dimy teo ankavia. ilay ranomasina kosa nataony teo ankavanan’ny trano, teo atsimoatsinanana.'),
  ('6ab25a477fa92128fb8c7d1a', '2026-09-22T10:36:55.980Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:55.980Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 7, 26, 'Toy ny sakan’ny felatanana * ny hatevin’ilay ranomasina, ary natao sahala amin’ny molotry ny kaopy ny molony, tahaka ny felana lisy. Rano roa arivo bata * no natao tao anatiny.', 'toy ny sakan’ny felatanana * ny hatevin’ilay ranomasina, ary natao sahala amin’ny molotry ny kaopy ny molony, tahaka ny felana lisy. rano roa arivo bata * no natao tao anatiny.'),
  ('6ab25a477fa92128fb8c7d08', '2026-09-22T10:36:55.980Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:55.980Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 7, 8, 'Lavidavitra an’ilay trano anisan’ny Lala-mitafo kosa ny trano hipetrahan’i Solomona, izay nataony teo amin’ilay tokotany iray. Nitovy tamin’io trano io ihany ny nanaovana azy. Ary nisy trano sahala amin’io Lala-mitafo io naorin’i Solomona ho an’ny zanakavavin’i Farao, izay nalainy ho vady.', 'lavidavitra an’ilay trano anisan’ny lala-mitafo kosa ny trano hipetrahan’i solomona, izay nataony teo amin’ilay tokotany iray. nitovy tamin’io trano io ihany ny nanaovana azy. ary nisy trano sahala amin’io lala-mitafo io naorin’i solomona ho an’ny zanakavavin’i farao, izay nalainy ho vady.'),
  ('6ab25a497bd2d0d5b07582b4', '2026-09-22T10:36:57.535Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:57.535Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 9, 24, 'Fa niakatra avy tao amin’ny Tanànan’i Davida kosa ny zanakavavin’i Farao, ka nankany amin’ilay trano naorin’i Solomona ho azy. Tamin’izay i Solomona no nanorina ny Dongon-tany.', 'fa niakatra avy tao amin’ny tanànan’i davida kosa ny zanakavavin’i farao, ka nankany amin’ilay trano naorin’i solomona ho azy. tamin’izay i solomona no nanorina ny dongon-tany.'),
  ('6ab25a497bd2d0d5b07582b3', '2026-09-22T10:36:57.535Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:57.535Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 9, 23, 'Dimampolo sy dimanjato lahy ny mpiadidy ny lehibem-paritra, izay niandraikitra ny asan’i Solomona. Lehiben’ny mpiasa am-perinasa izy ireo.', 'dimampolo sy dimanjato lahy ny mpiadidy ny lehibem-paritra, izay niandraikitra ny asan’i solomona. lehiben’ny mpiasa am-perinasa izy ireo.'),
  ('6ab25a497bd2d0d5b07582b0', '2026-09-22T10:36:57.535Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:57.535Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 9, 20, 'Ary mbola nisy sisa tavela ny Amorita sy ny Hetita sy ny Perizita sy ny Hivita ary ny Jebosita, izay samy tsy anisan’ny zanak’Israely,', 'ary mbola nisy sisa tavela ny amorita sy ny hetita sy ny perizita sy ny hivita ary ny jebosita, izay samy tsy anisan’ny zanak’israely,'),
  ('6ab25a497bd2d0d5b07582ab', '2026-09-22T10:36:57.535Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:57.535Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 9, 15, 'Ary nampanantsoin’i Solomona Mpanjaka ireo voantso hanao fanompoana, mba hanao ny tranon’i Jehovah sy ny tranony ary ny Dongon-tany sy ny mandan’i Jerosalema, sy Hazora sy Megido ary Gazera.', 'ary nampanantsoin’i solomona mpanjaka ireo voantso hanao fanompoana, mba hanao ny tranon’i jehovah sy ny tranony ary ny dongon-tany sy ny mandan’i jerosalema, sy hazora sy megido ary gazera.'),
  ('6ab25a497bd2d0d5b07582a0', '2026-09-22T10:36:57.535Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:57.535Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 9, 4, 'Fa ianao kosa, raha manompo ahy amin’ny fo manontolo sy amim-pahitsiana, toy ny nanompoan’i Davida rainao, ka manao izay rehetra nandidiako anao ary mitandrina ny fitsipiko sy ny didim-pitsarako,', 'fa ianao kosa, raha manompo ahy amin’ny fo manontolo sy amim-pahitsiana, toy ny nanompoan’i davida rainao, ka manao izay rehetra nandidiako anao ary mitandrina ny fitsipiko sy ny didim-pitsarako,'),
  ('6ab25a497bd2d0d5b07582b1', '2026-09-22T10:36:57.535Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:57.535Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 9, 21, 'ka ny taranak’ireny, izay tsy voaringan’ny zanak’Israely fa mbola tavela teo amin’ilay tany, no nampanantsoin’i Solomona hanao asa an-terivozona, mandraka androany.', 'ka ny taranak’ireny, izay tsy voaringan’ny zanak’israely fa mbola tavela teo amin’ilay tany, no nampanantsoin’i solomona hanao asa an-terivozona, mandraka androany.'),
  ('6ab25a497bd2d0d5b07582ad', '2026-09-22T10:36:57.535Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:57.535Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 9, 17, 'Ary naorin’i Solomona i Gazera, sy Beti-horona Ambany,', 'ary naorin’i solomona i gazera, sy beti-horona ambany,'),
  ('6ab25a497bd2d0d5b07582a8', '2026-09-22T10:36:57.535Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:57.535Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 9, 12, 'Koa niainga avy any Tyro i Hirama mba hijery an’ireo tanàna nomen’i Solomona azy. Tsy tiany anefa ireny,', 'koa niainga avy any tyro i hirama mba hijery an’ireo tanàna nomen’i solomona azy. tsy tiany anefa ireny,'),
  ('6ab25a497bd2d0d5b075829e', '2026-09-22T10:36:57.535Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:57.535Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 9, 2, 'dia niseho fanindroany taminy i Jehovah, sahala amin’ilay nisehoany taminy tao Gibeona.', 'dia niseho fanindroany taminy i jehovah, sahala amin’ilay nisehoany taminy tao gibeona.'),
  ('6ab25a497bd2d0d5b075829d', '2026-09-22T10:36:57.535Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:57.535Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 9, 1, 'Raha vao vitan’i Solomona ny tranon’i Jehovah, sy ny tranon’ny mpanjaka, ary ny zavatra tsara rehetra niriny ka nahafinaritra azy ny nanao azy,', 'raha vao vitan’i solomona ny tranon’i jehovah, sy ny tranon’ny mpanjaka, ary ny zavatra tsara rehetra niriny ka nahafinaritra azy ny nanao azy,'),
  ('6ab25a497bd2d0d5b07582ae', '2026-09-22T10:36:57.535Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:57.535Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 9, 18, 'sy Baleta, sy Tamara tany an-tany efitra tao amin’ilay tany,', 'sy baleta, sy tamara tany an-tany efitra tao amin’ilay tany,'),
  ('6ab25a497bd2d0d5b07582af', '2026-09-22T10:36:57.535Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:57.535Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 9, 19, 'sy ny tanàna rehetra fitehirizana entana sy vokatra izay lasan’i Solomona, sy ny tanàna fanatobiana kalesy sy ny tanànan’ny mpitaingin-tsoavaly ary ireo zavatra tsara nirin’i Solomona haorina tao Jerosalema sy Libanona ary nanerana ny tany nanjakany.', 'sy ny tanàna rehetra fitehirizana entana sy vokatra izay lasan’i solomona, sy ny tanàna fanatobiana kalesy sy ny tanànan’ny mpitaingin-tsoavaly ary ireo zavatra tsara nirin’i solomona haorina tao jerosalema sy libanona ary nanerana ny tany nanjakany.'),
  ('6ab25a497bd2d0d5b07582a4', '2026-09-22T10:36:57.535Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:57.535Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 9, 8, 'Ary ho lasa korontam-bato miavosa ity trano ity, ka hidanàka izay rehetra mandalo eo, ary hisioka sy hiteny hoe: ‘Fa naninona àry no dia nataon’i Jehovah hoatr’izao ity tany sy trano ity?’', 'ary ho lasa korontam-bato miavosa ity trano ity, ka hidanàka izay rehetra mandalo eo, ary hisioka sy hiteny hoe: ‘fa naninona àry no dia nataon’i jehovah hoatr’izao ity tany sy trano ity?’'),
  ('6ab25a497bd2d0d5b07582a3', '2026-09-22T10:36:57.535Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:57.535Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 9, 7, 'dia haringako tsy ho eo amin’ny tany nomeko azy ny Israely. Ilay trano nohamasiniko ho an’ny anarako kosa hariako tsy ho eo anatrehako, ary ny Israely hatao teny fanarabiana sy teny fanesoana eo amin’ny firenena rehetra.', 'dia haringako tsy ho eo amin’ny tany nomeko azy ny israely. ilay trano nohamasiniko ho an’ny anarako kosa hariako tsy ho eo anatrehako, ary ny israely hatao teny fanarabiana sy teny fanesoana eo amin’ny firenena rehetra.'),
  ('6ab25a497bd2d0d5b07582b2', '2026-09-22T10:36:57.535Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:57.535Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 9, 22, 'Tsy nisy tamin’ny zanak’Israely anefa nataon’i Solomona andevo. Fa izy ireo kosa dia miaramila mpiady sy mpanompon’i Solomona sy andrianany sy manamboninahitra lefitra sy lehiben’ny mpitondra kalesiny ary lehiben’ny mpitaingin-tsoavaliny.', 'tsy nisy tamin’ny zanak’israely anefa nataon’i solomona andevo. fa izy ireo kosa dia miaramila mpiady sy mpanompon’i solomona sy andrianany sy manamboninahitra lefitra sy lehiben’ny mpitondra kalesiny ary lehiben’ny mpitaingin-tsoavaliny.'),
  ('6ab25a497bd2d0d5b07582a5', '2026-09-22T10:36:57.535Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:57.535Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 9, 9, 'Dia hisy hilaza hoe: ‘Satria ry zareo nahafoy an’i Jehovah Andriamaniny, izay nitondra ny razany nivoaka avy tany Ejipta, ary nifikitra tamin’andriamani-kafa ka niankohoka teo anatrehan’ireny sady nanompo azy. Izany no nahatonga an’i Jehovah hamely azy ireo tamin’izao loza rehetra izao.’”', 'dia hisy hilaza hoe: ‘satria ry zareo nahafoy an’i jehovah andriamaniny, izay nitondra ny razany nivoaka avy tany ejipta, ary nifikitra tamin’andriamani-kafa ka niankohoka teo anatrehan’ireny sady nanompo azy. izany no nahatonga an’i jehovah hamely azy ireo tamin’izao loza rehetra izao.’”'),
  ('6ab25a497bd2d0d5b07582aa', '2026-09-22T10:36:57.535Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:57.535Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 9, 14, 'Efa nampanatitra talenta volamena roapolo amby zato tany amin’ny mpanjaka i Hirama, tamin’izay.', 'efa nampanatitra talenta volamena roapolo amby zato tany amin’ny mpanjaka i hirama, tamin’izay.'),
  ('6ab25a497bd2d0d5b07582a2', '2026-09-22T10:36:57.535Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:57.535Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 9, 6, 'Fa raha tsy manaraka ahy intsony ianareo sy ny zanakareo, ka tsy mitandrina ny didy sy ny lalàna nomeko anareo, fa mandeha manompo andriamani-kafa sy miankohoka eo anatrehan’ireny,', 'fa raha tsy manaraka ahy intsony ianareo sy ny zanakareo, ka tsy mitandrina ny didy sy ny lalàna nomeko anareo, fa mandeha manompo andriamani-kafa sy miankohoka eo anatrehan’ireny,'),
  ('6ab25a497bd2d0d5b07582b5', '2026-09-22T10:36:57.535Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:57.535Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 9, 25, 'Intelo isan-taona i Solomona no nanolotra sorona dorana sy sorona iombonana, teo amin’ilay alitara naoriny ho an’i Jehovah. Ary nanolotra setroka ho sorona teo amin’ilay alitara teo anatrehan’i Jehovah izy. Dia namita ilay trano i Solomona.', 'intelo isan-taona i solomona no nanolotra sorona dorana sy sorona iombonana, teo amin’ilay alitara naoriny ho an’i jehovah. ary nanolotra setroka ho sorona teo amin’ilay alitara teo anatrehan’i jehovah izy. dia namita ilay trano i solomona.'),
  ('6ab25a497bd2d0d5b07582a9', '2026-09-22T10:36:57.535Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:57.535Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 9, 13, 'ka hoy izy: “Mba inona koa ireto tanàna nomenao ahy ireto, ry rahalahiko?” Ary nantsoina hoe Tany Kabola * ireny mandraka androany.', 'ka hoy izy: “mba inona koa ireto tanàna nomenao ahy ireto, ry rahalahiko?” ary nantsoina hoe tany kabola * ireny mandraka androany.'),
  ('6ab25a497bd2d0d5b07582a1', '2026-09-22T10:36:57.535Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:57.535Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 9, 5, 'dia hataoko mafy orina mandritra ny fotoana tsy voafetra ny seza fiandrianan’ny fanjakanao eo amin’ny Israely, araka izay nampanantenaiko an’i Davida rainao hoe: ‘Hisy olona avy amin’ny taranakao foana hipetraka eo amin’ny seza fiandrianan’ny Israely.’', 'dia hataoko mafy orina mandritra ny fotoana tsy voafetra ny seza fiandrianan’ny fanjakanao eo amin’ny israely, araka izay nampanantenaiko an’i davida rainao hoe: ‘hisy olona avy amin’ny taranakao foana hipetraka eo amin’ny seza fiandrianan’ny israely.’'),
  ('6ab25a497bd2d0d5b07582b6', '2026-09-22T10:36:57.535Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:57.535Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 9, 26, 'Ary i Solomona Mpanjaka nanao sambo maromaro tao Eziona-gebera, izay teo akaikin’i Elota, teo amoron’ny Ranomasina Mena, tany Edoma.', 'ary i solomona mpanjaka nanao sambo maromaro tao eziona-gebera, izay teo akaikin’i elota, teo amoron’ny ranomasina mena, tany edoma.'),
  ('6ab25a497bd2d0d5b07582a6', '2026-09-22T10:36:57.535Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:57.535Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 9, 10, 'Rehefa tapitra ny roapolo taona nanorenan’i Solomona ny trano roa, izany hoe ny tranon’i Jehovah sy ny tranon’ny mpanjaka,', 'rehefa tapitra ny roapolo taona nanorenan’i solomona ny trano roa, izany hoe ny tranon’i jehovah sy ny tranon’ny mpanjaka,'),
  ('6ab25a497bd2d0d5b075829f', '2026-09-22T10:36:57.535Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:57.535Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 9, 3, 'Ary hoy i Jehovah: “Efa reko ny vavakao sy ny fitalahoanao famindram-po teo anatrehako. Ary efa nohamasiniko ity trano nataonao ity ka nataoko ao mandritra ny fotoana tsy voafetra ny anarako, ary ho ao foana koa ny masoko sy ny foko.', 'ary hoy i jehovah: “efa reko ny vavakao sy ny fitalahoanao famindram-po teo anatrehako. ary efa nohamasiniko ity trano nataonao ity ka nataoko ao mandritra ny fotoana tsy voafetra ny anarako, ary ho ao foana koa ny masoko sy ny foko.'),
  ('6ab25a497bd2d0d5b07582a7', '2026-09-22T10:36:57.535Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:57.535Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 9, 11, 'dia nomen’i Solomona Mpanjaka tanàna roapolo tany Galilia i Hirama mpanjakan’i Tyro. Izy mantsy no nanampy an’i Solomona ka nanome azy hazo sedera sy hazo zenevrie ary volamena betsaka araka izay tiany.', 'dia nomen’i solomona mpanjaka tanàna roapolo tany galilia i hirama mpanjakan’i tyro. izy mantsy no nanampy an’i solomona ka nanome azy hazo sedera sy hazo zenevrie ary volamena betsaka araka izay tiany.'),
  ('6ab25a497bd2d0d5b07582ac', '2026-09-22T10:36:57.535Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:57.535Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 9, 16, 'I Farao mpanjakan’i Ejipta no niakatra namabo ny tanànan’i Gazera ary nandoro azy. Dia novonoiny ny Kananita nonina tao, ary nomeny an-janany vavy, vadin’i Solomona, ilay tanàna ho fanomezana fanaovam-beloma azy.', 'i farao mpanjakan’i ejipta no niakatra namabo ny tanànan’i gazera ary nandoro azy. dia novonoiny ny kananita nonina tao, ary nomeny an-janany vavy, vadin’i solomona, ilay tanàna ho fanomezana fanaovam-beloma azy.'),
  ('6ab25a497bd2d0d5b07582b8', '2026-09-22T10:36:57.536Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:57.536Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 9, 28, 'Ary nankany Ofira ireo, ka naka talenta volamena roapolo sy efajato, ary nitondra izany tany amin’i Solomona Mpanjaka.', 'ary nankany ofira ireo, ka naka talenta volamena roapolo sy efajato, ary nitondra izany tany amin’i solomona mpanjaka.'),
  ('6ab25a497bd2d0d5b07582b7', '2026-09-22T10:36:57.536Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:57.536Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 9, 27, 'Nalefan’i Hirama tamin’izany andian-tsambo izany ny mpanompony, izay tantsambo nahay ranomasina, mba hiaraka tamin’ny mpanompon’i Solomona.', 'nalefan’i hirama tamin’izany andian-tsambo izany ny mpanompony, izay tantsambo nahay ranomasina, mba hiaraka tamin’ny mpanompon’i solomona.'),
  ('6ab25a4bf7deaef93f413a51', '2026-09-22T10:36:59.991Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:59.991Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 10, 6, 'Koa hoy izy tamin’ny mpanjaka: “Marina tokoa ny zavatra reko tany amin’ny taniko momba anao sy ny fahendrenao.', 'koa hoy izy tamin’ny mpanjaka: “marina tokoa ny zavatra reko tany amin’ny taniko momba anao sy ny fahendrenao.'),
  ('6ab25a4bf7deaef93f413a4f', '2026-09-22T10:36:59.991Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:59.991Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 10, 4, 'Rehefa hitan’ilay mpanjakavavin’i Sheba ny fahendrena rehetra nananan’i Solomona sy ny trano naoriny,', 'rehefa hitan’ilay mpanjakavavin’i sheba ny fahendrena rehetra nananan’i solomona sy ny trano naoriny,'),
  ('6ab25a4bf7deaef93f413a62', '2026-09-22T10:36:59.991Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:59.991Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 10, 23, 'Koa nanan-karena sy hendry noho ny mpanjaka rehetra teto an-tany i Solomona Mpanjaka.', 'koa nanan-karena sy hendry noho ny mpanjaka rehetra teto an-tany i solomona mpanjaka.'),
  ('6ab25a4bf7deaef93f413a5c', '2026-09-22T10:36:59.991Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:59.991Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 10, 17, 'Nanao ampinga kely telonjato tamin’ny volamena misy fangarony koa izy, ka volamena telo mina no nandrakofany ny ampinga kely tsirairay. Dia napetrany tao amin’ny Trano Alan’i Libanona ireo.', 'nanao ampinga kely telonjato tamin’ny volamena misy fangarony koa izy, ka volamena telo mina no nandrakofany ny ampinga kely tsirairay. dia napetrany tao amin’ny trano alan’i libanona ireo.'),
  ('6ab25a4bf7deaef93f413a61', '2026-09-22T10:36:59.991Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:59.991Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 10, 22, 'Nanana andian-tsambon’i Tarsisy teny an-dranomasina ny mpanjaka, niaraka tamin’ny andian-tsambon’i Hirama. Ary tonga isaky ny telo taona ny andian-tsambon’i Tarsisy, izay nitondra volamena sy volafotsy sy ivoara sy rajako ary vorombola.', 'nanana andian-tsambon’i tarsisy teny an-dranomasina ny mpanjaka, niaraka tamin’ny andian-tsambon’i hirama. ary tonga isaky ny telo taona ny andian-tsambon’i tarsisy, izay nitondra volamena sy volafotsy sy ivoara sy rajako ary vorombola.'),
  ('6ab25a4bf7deaef93f413a65', '2026-09-22T10:36:59.991Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:59.991Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 10, 26, 'Ary nanangona kalesy sy soavaly fitondra miady maro kokoa hatrany i Solomona, ka nanjary nanana kalesy efajato sy arivo, sy soavaly fitondra miady roa arivo sy iray alina. Nataony tao amin’ny tanàna fanatobiana kalesy, sy tany akaikin’ny mpanjaka tany Jerosalema ireo.', 'ary nanangona kalesy sy soavaly fitondra miady maro kokoa hatrany i solomona, ka nanjary nanana kalesy efajato sy arivo, sy soavaly fitondra miady roa arivo sy iray alina. nataony tao amin’ny tanàna fanatobiana kalesy, sy tany akaikin’ny mpanjaka tany jerosalema ireo.'),
  ('6ab25a4bf7deaef93f413a63', '2026-09-22T10:36:59.991Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:59.991Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 10, 24, 'Ary te hihaona taminy ny olona rehetra teto an-tany, mba hihaino ny fahendrena nataon’Andriamanitra tao am-pony.', 'ary te hihaona taminy ny olona rehetra teto an-tany, mba hihaino ny fahendrena nataon’andriamanitra tao am-pony.'),
  ('6ab25a4bf7deaef93f413a56', '2026-09-22T10:36:59.991Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:59.991Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 10, 11, 'Nitondra hazo algoma be dia be sy vatosoa avy any Ofira, ny andian-tsambon’i Hirama, izay nitondra volamena avy any Ofira.', 'nitondra hazo algoma be dia be sy vatosoa avy any ofira, ny andian-tsambon’i hirama, izay nitondra volamena avy any ofira.'),
  ('6ab25a4bf7deaef93f413a54', '2026-09-22T10:36:59.991Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:59.991Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 10, 9, 'Hisaorana anie i Jehovah Andriamanitrao izay nankasitraka anao ka nametraka anao eo amin’ny seza fiandrianan’ny Israely! Tian’i Jehovah mandritra ny fotoana tsy voafetra mantsy ny Israely, ka notendreny ho mpanjaka ianao, mba hamoaka didim-pitsarana sy hampihatra ny rariny.”', 'hisaorana anie i jehovah andriamanitrao izay nankasitraka anao ka nametraka anao eo amin’ny seza fiandrianan’ny israely! tian’i jehovah mandritra ny fotoana tsy voafetra mantsy ny israely, ka notendreny ho mpanjaka ianao, mba hamoaka didim-pitsarana sy hampihatra ny rariny.”'),
  ('6ab25a4bf7deaef93f413a52', '2026-09-22T10:36:59.991Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:59.991Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 10, 7, 'Tsy nino ny tenin’ny olona aho raha tsy tonga tatỳ, ka ny masoko mihitsy no nahita. Fa hay na ny antsasany aza tsy nolazaina tamiko! Fa mihoatra lavitra noho ny zavatra reko tamin’ny olona ny fahendrenao sy ny harenanao.', 'tsy nino ny tenin’ny olona aho raha tsy tonga tatỳ, ka ny masoko mihitsy no nahita. fa hay na ny antsasany aza tsy nolazaina tamiko! fa mihoatra lavitra noho ny zavatra reko tamin’ny olona ny fahendrenao sy ny harenanao.'),
  ('6ab25a4bf7deaef93f413a66', '2026-09-22T10:36:59.991Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:59.991Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 10, 27, 'Ary nataon’ny mpanjaka be dia be toy ny vato ny volafotsy tany Jerosalema, ary nataony betsaka toy ny aviavidia any Sefela ny hazo sedera.', 'ary nataon’ny mpanjaka be dia be toy ny vato ny volafotsy tany jerosalema, ary nataony betsaka toy ny aviavidia any sefela ny hazo sedera.'),
  ('6ab25a4bf7deaef93f413a58', '2026-09-22T10:36:59.991Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:59.991Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 10, 13, 'Ary nomen’i Solomona Mpanjaka ho an’ny mpanjakavavin’i Sheba izay rehetra nahafinaritra an-dravehivavy ka nangatahiny, ankoatra an’izay efa nomeny azy satria nalala-tanana taminy i Solomona Mpanjaka. Dia niverina nody tany amin’ny taniny ravehivavy sy ny mpanompony.', 'ary nomen’i solomona mpanjaka ho an’ny mpanjakavavin’i sheba izay rehetra nahafinaritra an-dravehivavy ka nangatahiny, ankoatra an’izay efa nomeny azy satria nalala-tanana taminy i solomona mpanjaka. dia niverina nody tany amin’ny taniny ravehivavy sy ny mpanompony.'),
  ('6ab25a4bf7deaef93f413a68', '2026-09-22T10:36:59.991Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:59.991Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 10, 29, 'Ary efa fanao ny nitondra kalesy niakatra avy tany Ejipta, ka farantsa volafotsy eninjato no vidin’ny kalesy iray, ary farantsa volafotsy dimampolo amby zato ny soavaly iray. Dia toy izany koa no natao ho an’ny mpanjaka rehetran’ny Hetita sy ireo mpanjakan’i Syria. Tamin’ny alalan’ireny mpandraharahan’ny mpanjaka ireny no nanaovan’izy ireo ny fanafarana.', 'ary efa fanao ny nitondra kalesy niakatra avy tany ejipta, ka farantsa volafotsy eninjato no vidin’ny kalesy iray, ary farantsa volafotsy dimampolo amby zato ny soavaly iray. dia toy izany koa no natao ho an’ny mpanjaka rehetran’ny hetita sy ireo mpanjakan’i syria. tamin’ny alalan’ireny mpandraharahan’ny mpanjaka ireny no nanaovan’izy ireo ny fanafarana.'),
  ('6ab25a4bf7deaef93f413a67', '2026-09-22T10:36:59.991Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:59.991Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 10, 28, 'Nahazo soavaly nohafarana avy tany Ejipta i Solomona, ka ny mpandraharahan’ny mpanjaka no nasaina nividy ny andian-tsoavaly araka izay vidiny.', 'nahazo soavaly nohafarana avy tany ejipta i solomona, ka ny mpandraharahan’ny mpanjaka no nasaina nividy ny andian-tsoavaly araka izay vidiny.'),
  ('6ab25a4bf7deaef93f413a55', '2026-09-22T10:36:59.991Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:59.991Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 10, 10, 'Dia nomen’ilay mpanjakavavy talenta volamena roapolo amby zato ny mpanjaka, ary koa menaka balsama tena be dia be sy vatosoa. Be dia be tokoa ny menaka balsama nomen’ny mpanjakavavin’i Sheba an’i Solomona Mpanjaka, ka tsy nisy menaka be dia be toy izany intsony tonga tany.', 'dia nomen’ilay mpanjakavavy talenta volamena roapolo amby zato ny mpanjaka, ary koa menaka balsama tena be dia be sy vatosoa. be dia be tokoa ny menaka balsama nomen’ny mpanjakavavin’i sheba an’i solomona mpanjaka, ka tsy nisy menaka be dia be toy izany intsony tonga tany.'),
  ('6ab25a4bf7deaef93f413a59', '2026-09-22T10:36:59.991Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:59.991Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 10, 14, 'Ary ny lanjan’ny volamena tonga tany amin’i Solomona tao anatin’ny herintaona dia talenta volamena enina amby enimpolo sy eninjato,', 'ary ny lanjan’ny volamena tonga tany amin’i solomona tao anatin’ny herintaona dia talenta volamena enina amby enimpolo sy eninjato,'),
  ('6ab25a4bf7deaef93f413a57', '2026-09-22T10:36:59.991Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:59.991Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 10, 12, 'Ary ny hazo algoma dia nanaovan’ny mpanjaka tohana ho an’ny tranon’i Jehovah sy ho an’ny tranon’ny mpanjaka, ary harpa sy lokanga ho an’ny mpihira. Tsy nisy hazo algoma toy izany intsony tonga tany, na hita tany, mandraka androany.', 'ary ny hazo algoma dia nanaovan’ny mpanjaka tohana ho an’ny tranon’i jehovah sy ho an’ny tranon’ny mpanjaka, ary harpa sy lokanga ho an’ny mpihira. tsy nisy hazo algoma toy izany intsony tonga tany, na hita tany, mandraka androany.'),
  ('6ab25a4bf7deaef93f413a5e', '2026-09-22T10:36:59.991Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:59.991Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 10, 19, 'Nisy zanatohatra enina nankeo amin’ilay seza fiandrianana, ary nisy tafokely boribory nitatao tao aorian’izy io. Ary nasiany fitoeran-tanana teo amin’ny andaniny roa amin’ilay seza, ary nasiany liona iray avy nitsangana teo anilan’ireo fitoeran-tanana.', 'nisy zanatohatra enina nankeo amin’ilay seza fiandrianana, ary nisy tafokely boribory nitatao tao aorian’izy io. ary nasiany fitoeran-tanana teo amin’ny andaniny roa amin’ilay seza, ary nasiany liona iray avy nitsangana teo anilan’ireo fitoeran-tanana.'),
  ('6ab25a4bf7deaef93f413a4d', '2026-09-22T10:36:59.991Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:59.991Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 10, 2, 'Farany, dia tonga tany Jerosalema izy sy ny mpanotrona maro be, narahin’ny rameva nitondra menaka balsama sy volamena be dia be ary vatosoa. Dia nankao amin’i Solomona izy, ka nilaza taminy izay rehetra tao am-pony.', 'farany, dia tonga tany jerosalema izy sy ny mpanotrona maro be, narahin’ny rameva nitondra menaka balsama sy volamena be dia be ary vatosoa. dia nankao amin’i solomona izy, ka nilaza taminy izay rehetra tao am-pony.'),
  ('6ab25a4bf7deaef93f413a4c', '2026-09-22T10:36:59.991Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:59.991Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 10, 1, 'Lasa nalaza i Solomona noho ny anaran’i Jehovah. Ary ren’ny mpanjakavavin’i Sheba ny lazany, ka tonga hitsapa azy tamin’ny fanontaniana saro-baliana izy.', 'lasa nalaza i solomona noho ny anaran’i jehovah. ary ren’ny mpanjakavavin’i sheba ny lazany, ka tonga hitsapa azy tamin’ny fanontaniana saro-baliana izy.'),
  ('6ab25a4bf7deaef93f413a64', '2026-09-22T10:36:59.991Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:59.991Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 10, 25, 'Samy nitondra an’ireto fanomezana ireto izy ireo isan-taona: Zavatra vita tamin’ny volafotsy sy volamena, fitafiana, fiadiana, menaka balsama, ary soavaly sy ramole.', 'samy nitondra an’ireto fanomezana ireto izy ireo isan-taona: zavatra vita tamin’ny volafotsy sy volamena, fitafiana, fiadiana, menaka balsama, ary soavaly sy ramole.'),
  ('6ab25a4bf7deaef93f413a50', '2026-09-22T10:36:59.991Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:59.991Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 10, 5, 'sy ny sakafo teo an-databany, sy ny fomba nametrahana an’ireo mpanompony, sy ny fomba fiasan’ireo mpandroso sakafo sy ny fitafian’ireo, sy ny zava-pisotron’ny mpanjaka, ary ny sorona dorana izay natolony tsy tapaka tao an-tranon’i Jehovah, dia tena talanjona izy.', 'sy ny sakafo teo an-databany, sy ny fomba nametrahana an’ireo mpanompony, sy ny fomba fiasan’ireo mpandroso sakafo sy ny fitafian’ireo, sy ny zava-pisotron’ny mpanjaka, ary ny sorona dorana izay natolony tsy tapaka tao an-tranon’i jehovah, dia tena talanjona izy.'),
  ('6ab25a4bf7deaef93f413a5d', '2026-09-22T10:36:59.991Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:59.991Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 10, 18, 'Nanao seza fiandrianana ivoara lehibe koa ny mpanjaka, ary nopetahany takela-bolamena voadio izy io.', 'nanao seza fiandrianana ivoara lehibe koa ny mpanjaka, ary nopetahany takela-bolamena voadio izy io.'),
  ('6ab25a4bf7deaef93f413a4e', '2026-09-22T10:36:59.991Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:59.991Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 10, 3, 'Ary voavalin’i Solomona izay rehetra nanontaniany. Tsy nisy tsy voavalin’ny mpanjaka izany, satria tsy nisy niafina taminy ny zava-drehetra.', 'ary voavalin’i solomona izay rehetra nanontaniany. tsy nisy tsy voavalin’ny mpanjaka izany, satria tsy nisy niafina taminy ny zava-drehetra.'),
  ('6ab25a4bf7deaef93f413a5a', '2026-09-22T10:36:59.991Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:59.991Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 10, 15, 'ankoatra an’izay avy tamin’ny mpivaro-mandeha, sy izay tombony avy tamin’ny mpivarotra, ary izay avy tamin’ny mpanjaka rehetran’ny Arabo sy ireo governoran’ilay tany.', 'ankoatra an’izay avy tamin’ny mpivaro-mandeha, sy izay tombony avy tamin’ny mpivarotra, ary izay avy tamin’ny mpanjaka rehetran’ny arabo sy ireo governoran’ilay tany.'),
  ('6ab25a4bf7deaef93f413a60', '2026-09-22T10:36:59.991Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:59.991Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 10, 21, 'Volamena daholo ny kaopin’i Solomona Mpanjaka. Volamena tsy misy fangarony ny fitaovana rehetra tao amin’ny Trano Alan’i Libanona. Tsy nisy mihitsy zavatra vita tamin’ny volafotsy, satria noheverina ho tsinontsinona ny volafotsy tamin’ny andron’i Solomona.', 'volamena daholo ny kaopin’i solomona mpanjaka. volamena tsy misy fangarony ny fitaovana rehetra tao amin’ny trano alan’i libanona. tsy nisy mihitsy zavatra vita tamin’ny volafotsy, satria noheverina ho tsinontsinona ny volafotsy tamin’ny andron’i solomona.'),
  ('6ab25a4bf7deaef93f413a5f', '2026-09-22T10:36:59.991Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:59.991Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 10, 20, 'Nisy liona roa ambin’ny folo koa teo amin’ireo zanatohatra enina, ka enina avy no teo amin’ny andaniny roa. Tsy nisy mihitsy fanjakana nanana seza fiandrianana toy izany.', 'nisy liona roa ambin’ny folo koa teo amin’ireo zanatohatra enina, ka enina avy no teo amin’ny andaniny roa. tsy nisy mihitsy fanjakana nanana seza fiandrianana toy izany.'),
  ('6ab25a4bf7deaef93f413a5b', '2026-09-22T10:36:59.991Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:59.991Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 10, 16, 'Ary nanao ampinga lehibe roanjato tamin’ny volamena misy fangarony i Solomona Mpanjaka, ka sekely volamena eninjato no nandrakofany ny ampinga lehibe tsirairay.', 'ary nanao ampinga lehibe roanjato tamin’ny volamena misy fangarony i solomona mpanjaka, ka sekely volamena eninjato no nandrakofany ny ampinga lehibe tsirairay.'),
  ('6ab25a4bf7deaef93f413a53', '2026-09-22T10:36:59.991Z', '2026-09-22T10:36:59.991Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 10, 8, 'Sambatra ny olonao, ary sambatra ireto mpanomponao ireto, izay eto anatrehanao mandrakariva, ka mandre ny fahendrenao!', 'sambatra ny olonao, ary sambatra ireto mpanomponao ireto, izay eto anatrehanao mandrakariva, ka mandre ny fahendrenao!'),
  ('6ab25a4c3e9725fe0670343c', '2026-09-22T10:37:00.611Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:00.611Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 11, 36, 'Fa homeko foko iray ny zanany, mba hisy jiro ho an’i Davida mpanompoko foana eo anatrehako, any Jerosalema, ilay tanàna nofidiko ho ahy mba hametrahana ny anarako.', 'fa homeko foko iray ny zanany, mba hisy jiro ho an’i davida mpanompoko foana eo anatrehako, any jerosalema, ilay tanàna nofidiko ho ahy mba hametrahana ny anarako.'),
  ('6ab25a4c3e9725fe06703443', '2026-09-22T10:37:00.611Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:00.611Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 11, 43, 'Dia nodimandry any amin’ny razany izy, ka nalevina tao amin’ny Tanànan’i Davida rainy. Ary i Rehoboama zanany no nanjaka nandimby azy.', 'dia nodimandry any amin’ny razany izy, ka nalevina tao amin’ny tanànan’i davida rainy. ary i rehoboama zanany no nanjaka nandimby azy.'),
  ('6ab25a4c3e9725fe06703435', '2026-09-22T10:37:00.611Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:00.611Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 11, 29, 'Ary tamin’izay fotoana izay no nivoahan’i Jeroboama avy tany Jerosalema, ka nahitan’i Ahia mpaminany azy teny an-dalana. Akanjo vaovao no nanaovan’i Ahia Silonita, ary izy roa lahy irery no tany an-tsaha.', 'ary tamin’izay fotoana izay no nivoahan’i jeroboama avy tany jerosalema, ka nahitan’i ahia mpaminany azy teny an-dalana. akanjo vaovao no nanaovan’i ahia silonita, ary izy roa lahy irery no tany an-tsaha.'),
  ('6ab25a4c3e9725fe06703432', '2026-09-22T10:37:00.611Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:00.611Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 11, 26, 'Ary teo koa i Jeroboama zanak’i Nebata. Efraimita avy any Zareda izy, ary mpanompon’i Solomona. Zeroa no anaran-dreniny, ary mpitondratena ravehivavy. Nikomy tamin’ny mpanjaka koa io Jeroboama io.', 'ary teo koa i jeroboama zanak’i nebata. efraimita avy any zareda izy, ary mpanompon’i solomona. zeroa no anaran-dreniny, ary mpitondratena ravehivavy. nikomy tamin’ny mpanjaka koa io jeroboama io.'),
  ('6ab25a4c3e9725fe06703431', '2026-09-22T10:37:00.611Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:00.611Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 11, 25, 'Ary lasa mpanohitra ny Israely i Rezona, tamin’ny andro rehetra nanjakan’i Solomona, ka nanampy trotraka ny ratsy efa nataon’i Hadada. Nankahala ny Israely izy tamin’izy nanjaka tany Syria.', 'ary lasa mpanohitra ny israely i rezona, tamin’ny andro rehetra nanjakan’i solomona, ka nanampy trotraka ny ratsy efa nataon’i hadada. nankahala ny israely izy tamin’izy nanjaka tany syria.'),
  ('6ab25a4c3e9725fe0670341f', '2026-09-22T10:37:00.611Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:00.611Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 11, 7, 'Tamin’izay i Solomona no nanorina toerana avo teo amin’ilay tendrombohitra nanandrify an’i Jerosalema, ho an’i Kemosy, zava-maharikoriko notompoin’i Moaba, sy ho an’i Moleka, zava-maharikoriko notompoin’ny taranak’i Amona.', 'tamin’izay i solomona no nanorina toerana avo teo amin’ilay tendrombohitra nanandrify an’i jerosalema, ho an’i kemosy, zava-maharikoriko notompoin’i moaba, sy ho an’i moleka, zava-maharikoriko notompoin’ny taranak’i amona.'),
  ('6ab25a4c3e9725fe0670341a', '2026-09-22T10:37:00.611Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:00.611Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 11, 2, 'avy tamin’ireo firenena nolazain’i Jehovah tamin’ny zanak’Israely hoe: “Aza mankany amin’ireny ianareo, ary ireny koa tsy tokony hankany aminareo, fa tena ho voatariny hanaraka ny andriamaniny ny fonareo.” Ireny anefa no niraiketan’ny fitiavan’i Solomona.', 'avy tamin’ireo firenena nolazain’i jehovah tamin’ny zanak’israely hoe: “aza mankany amin’ireny ianareo, ary ireny koa tsy tokony hankany aminareo, fa tena ho voatariny hanaraka ny andriamaniny ny fonareo.” ireny anefa no niraiketan’ny fitiavan’i solomona.'),
  ('6ab25a4c3e9725fe06703419', '2026-09-22T10:37:00.611Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:00.611Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 11, 1, 'Tia vady maro hafa firenena i Solomona Mpanjaka, ankoatra an’ilay zanakavavin’i Farao, dia vehivavy moabita sy amonita sy edomita sy sidonianina ary hetita,', 'tia vady maro hafa firenena i solomona mpanjaka, ankoatra an’ilay zanakavavin’i farao, dia vehivavy moabita sy amonita sy edomita sy sidonianina ary hetita,'),
  ('6ab25a4c3e9725fe0670343f', '2026-09-22T10:37:00.611Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:00.611Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 11, 39, 'Ary haetriko ny taranak’i Davida noho izany ratsy nataony izany, nefa tsy avelako hietry eo foana izy.’”', 'ary haetriko ny taranak’i davida noho izany ratsy nataony izany, nefa tsy avelako hietry eo foana izy.’”'),
  ('6ab25a4c3e9725fe06703436', '2026-09-22T10:37:00.611Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:00.611Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 11, 30, 'Dia nalain’i Ahia ilay akanjo vaovao teny aminy, ka norovidrovitiny ho roa ambin’ny folo.', 'dia nalain’i ahia ilay akanjo vaovao teny aminy, ka norovidrovitiny ho roa ambin’ny folo.'),
  ('6ab25a4c3e9725fe0670341d', '2026-09-22T10:37:00.611Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:00.611Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 11, 5, 'Fa nanaraka an’i Astarta, andriamanibavin’ny Sidonianina i Solomona, sady nanaraka an’i Milkoma, zava-maharikoriko notompoin’ny Amonita.', 'fa nanaraka an’i astarta, andriamanibavin’ny sidonianina i solomona, sady nanaraka an’i milkoma, zava-maharikoriko notompoin’ny amonita.'),
  ('6ab25a4c3e9725fe06703428', '2026-09-22T10:37:00.611Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:00.611Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 11, 16, 'Fa enim-bolana no nijanonan’i Joaba sy ny Israely rehetra tany, mandra-pandringany ny lahy rehetra tany Edoma.', 'fa enim-bolana no nijanonan’i joaba sy ny israely rehetra tany, mandra-pandringany ny lahy rehetra tany edoma.'),
  ('6ab25a4c3e9725fe06703425', '2026-09-22T10:37:00.611Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:00.611Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 11, 13, 'Tsy ny fanjakana manontolo anefa no hesoriko aminy, fa homeko foko iray izy noho ny amin’i Davida mpanompoko sy noho ny amin’i Jerosalema izay nofidiko.”', 'tsy ny fanjakana manontolo anefa no hesoriko aminy, fa homeko foko iray izy noho ny amin’i davida mpanompoko sy noho ny amin’i jerosalema izay nofidiko.”'),
  ('6ab25a4c3e9725fe0670341c', '2026-09-22T10:37:00.611Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:00.611Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 11, 4, 'Rehefa antitra i Solomona, dia voatarik’ireny vadiny ireny hanaraka andriamani-kafa ny fony. Ary tsy nifikitra tanteraka tamin’i Jehovah Andriamaniny ny fony, tsy mba hoatran’ny fon’i Davida rainy.', 'rehefa antitra i solomona, dia voatarik’ireny vadiny ireny hanaraka andriamani-kafa ny fony. ary tsy nifikitra tanteraka tamin’i jehovah andriamaniny ny fony, tsy mba hoatran’ny fon’i davida rainy.'),
  ('6ab25a4c3e9725fe0670343b', '2026-09-22T10:37:00.611Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:00.611Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 11, 35, 'Ary hesoriko tsy ho eo an-tanan’ny zanany tokoa ny fanjakana, ka homeko anao. Dia ho lasanao ny foko folo.', 'ary hesoriko tsy ho eo an-tanan’ny zanany tokoa ny fanjakana, ka homeko anao. dia ho lasanao ny foko folo.'),
  ('6ab25a4c3e9725fe0670343a', '2026-09-22T10:37:00.611Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:00.611Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 11, 34, 'Tsy ny fanjakana manontolo anefa no hesoriko eo an-tanany, satria hotendreko ho mpiadidy izy mandritra ny androm-piainany, noho ny amin’i Davida mpanompoko izay nofidiko, fa nitandrina ny didiko sy ny lalàko izy.', 'tsy ny fanjakana manontolo anefa no hesoriko eo an-tanany, satria hotendreko ho mpiadidy izy mandritra ny androm-piainany, noho ny amin’i davida mpanompoko izay nofidiko, fa nitandrina ny didiko sy ny lalàko izy.'),
  ('6ab25a4c3e9725fe0670342a', '2026-09-22T10:37:00.611Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:00.611Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 11, 18, 'Dia niainga avy tany Midianina izy ireo ary nankany Parana, ka naka olona avy tany mba hiaraka taminy. Ary nankany Ejipta, tany amin’i Farao mpanjakan’i Ejipta izy ireo, ka nomeny trano. Nasainy nomena sakafo koa izy ireo, ary nomeny tany.', 'dia niainga avy tany midianina izy ireo ary nankany parana, ka naka olona avy tany mba hiaraka taminy. ary nankany ejipta, tany amin’i farao mpanjakan’i ejipta izy ireo, ka nomeny trano. nasainy nomena sakafo koa izy ireo, ary nomeny tany.'),
  ('6ab25a4c3e9725fe06703421', '2026-09-22T10:37:00.611Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:00.611Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 11, 9, 'Dia tezitra mafy tamin’i Solomona i Jehovah, satria ny fony niala tamin’i Jehovah Andriamanitry ny Israely, izay niseho taminy indroa.', 'dia tezitra mafy tamin’i solomona i jehovah, satria ny fony niala tamin’i jehovah andriamanitry ny israely, izay niseho taminy indroa.'),
  ('6ab25a4c3e9725fe0670342f', '2026-09-22T10:37:00.611Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:00.611Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 11, 23, 'Nataon’Andriamanitra koa izay hisian’ny mpanohitra an’i Solomona, dia i Rezona zanak’i Eliada. Nandositra an’i Hadadezera tompony, mpanjakan’i Zoba, izy.', 'nataon’andriamanitra koa izay hisian’ny mpanohitra an’i solomona, dia i rezona zanak’i eliada. nandositra an’i hadadezera tompony, mpanjakan’i zoba, izy.'),
  ('6ab25a4c3e9725fe0670342c', '2026-09-22T10:37:00.611Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:00.611Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 11, 20, 'Tatỳ aoriana, dia niteraka an’i Genobata zanany lahy tamin’i Hadada ny rahavavin’i Tapanesa. Ary tao an-tranon’i Farao mihitsy i Tapanesa no nampisara-nono an’i Genobata. Dia nipetraka tao an-tranon’i Farao, niaraka tamin’ny zanany, i Genobata.', 'tatỳ aoriana, dia niteraka an’i genobata zanany lahy tamin’i hadada ny rahavavin’i tapanesa. ary tao an-tranon’i farao mihitsy i tapanesa no nampisara-nono an’i genobata. dia nipetraka tao an-tranon’i farao, niaraka tamin’ny zanany, i genobata.'),
  ('6ab25a4c3e9725fe0670342b', '2026-09-22T10:37:00.611Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:00.611Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 11, 19, 'Ary tena tian’i Farao i Hadada, ka nomeny ho vadiny ny rahavavim-badiny, izany hoe ny rahavavin’i Tapanesa andriambavy.', 'ary tena tian’i farao i hadada, ka nomeny ho vadiny ny rahavavim-badiny, izany hoe ny rahavavin’i tapanesa andriambavy.'),
  ('6ab25a4c3e9725fe06703438', '2026-09-22T10:37:00.611Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:00.611Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 11, 32, 'Mbola ho azy ihany anefa ny foko iray, noho ny amin’i Davida mpanompoko sy noho ny amin’i Jerosalema, ilay tanàna nofidiko teo amin’ny foko rehetran’ny Israely.', 'mbola ho azy ihany anefa ny foko iray, noho ny amin’i davida mpanompoko sy noho ny amin’i jerosalema, ilay tanàna nofidiko teo amin’ny foko rehetran’ny israely.'),
  ('6ab25a4c3e9725fe06703433', '2026-09-22T10:37:00.611Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:00.611Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 11, 27, 'Nikomy tamin’ny mpanjaka izy, satria nanorina ny Dongon-tany i Solomona, ka notampenany ny banga teo amin’ny Tanànan’i Davida rainy.', 'nikomy tamin’ny mpanjaka izy, satria nanorina ny dongon-tany i solomona, ka notampenany ny banga teo amin’ny tanànan’i davida rainy.'),
  ('6ab25a4c3e9725fe06703429', '2026-09-22T10:37:00.611Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:00.611Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 11, 17, 'Nandositra anefa i Hadada, ary niaraka taminy ny lehilahy edomita sasany anisan’ny mpanompon-drainy, ka nankany Ejipta izy ireo. Mbola ankizilahikely i Hadada tamin’izay.', 'nandositra anefa i hadada, ary niaraka taminy ny lehilahy edomita sasany anisan’ny mpanompon-drainy, ka nankany ejipta izy ireo. mbola ankizilahikely i hadada tamin’izay.'),
  ('6ab25a4c3e9725fe06703427', '2026-09-22T10:37:00.611Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:00.611Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 11, 15, 'Fony i Davida namely an’i Edoma, rehefa niakatra handevina an’izay maty i Joaba lehiben’ny tafika, dia niezaka hamono ny lahy rehetra tany Edoma i Joaba.', 'fony i davida namely an’i edoma, rehefa niakatra handevina an’izay maty i joaba lehiben’ny tafika, dia niezaka hamono ny lahy rehetra tany edoma i joaba.'),
  ('6ab25a4c3e9725fe0670341e', '2026-09-22T10:37:00.611Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:00.611Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 11, 6, 'Ary nanao izay ratsy teo imason’i Jehovah i Solomona, ka tsy nanaraka an’i Jehovah tamin’ny fony manontolo, tsy mba hoatran’i Davida rainy.', 'ary nanao izay ratsy teo imason’i jehovah i solomona, ka tsy nanaraka an’i jehovah tamin’ny fony manontolo, tsy mba hoatran’i davida rainy.'),
  ('6ab25a4c3e9725fe06703441', '2026-09-22T10:37:00.611Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:00.611Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 11, 41, 'Ary ny sisa amin’ny tantaran’i Solomona, mbamin’izay rehetra nataony sy ny fahendreny, tsy efa voasoratra ao amin’ny boky mirakitra ny tantaran’i Solomona ve izany?', 'ary ny sisa amin’ny tantaran’i solomona, mbamin’izay rehetra nataony sy ny fahendreny, tsy efa voasoratra ao amin’ny boky mirakitra ny tantaran’i solomona ve izany?'),
  ('6ab25a4c3e9725fe06703420', '2026-09-22T10:37:00.611Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:00.611Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 11, 8, 'Ary toy izany no nataony ho an’ny vadiny rehetra hafa firenena, izay nanolotra setroka ho sorona sady nanao sorona ho an’ny andriamanitr’izy ireo.', 'ary toy izany no nataony ho an’ny vadiny rehetra hafa firenena, izay nanolotra setroka ho sorona sady nanao sorona ho an’ny andriamanitr’izy ireo.'),
  ('6ab25a4c3e9725fe0670341b', '2026-09-22T10:37:00.611Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:00.611Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 11, 3, 'Ary nanjary nanana vady andriambavy fitonjato izy, ary vadikely telonjato, ka voatarik’ireny tsikelikely ny fony.', 'ary nanjary nanana vady andriambavy fitonjato izy, ary vadikely telonjato, ka voatarik’ireny tsikelikely ny fony.'),
  ('6ab25a4c3e9725fe06703442', '2026-09-22T10:37:00.611Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:00.611Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 11, 42, 'Efapolo taona ny andro nanjakan’i Solomona tany Jerosalema, teo amin’ny Israely rehetra.', 'efapolo taona ny andro nanjakan’i solomona tany jerosalema, teo amin’ny israely rehetra.'),
  ('6ab25a4c3e9725fe06703440', '2026-09-22T10:37:00.611Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:00.611Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 11, 40, 'Nitady hamono an’i Jeroboama i Solomona. Koa lasa nandositra tany Ejipta ho any amin’i Sisaka mpanjakan’i Ejipta i Jeroboama, ary nijanona tany mandra-pahafatin’i Solomona.', 'nitady hamono an’i jeroboama i solomona. koa lasa nandositra tany ejipta ho any amin’i sisaka mpanjakan’i ejipta i jeroboama, ary nijanona tany mandra-pahafatin’i solomona.'),
  ('6ab25a4c3e9725fe0670343e', '2026-09-22T10:37:00.611Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:00.611Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 11, 38, 'Koa raha mankatò an’izay rehetra handidiako anao ianao, sady tena mandeha amin’ny lalako ary manao izay mahitsy eo imasoko, ka mitandrina ny lalàko sy ny didiko sahala amin’ny nataon’i Davida mpanompoko, dia homba anao aho ka hampaharitra ny taranakao, sahala amin’izay nataoko ho an’i Davida. Ary homeko anao ny Israely.', 'koa raha mankatò an’izay rehetra handidiako anao ianao, sady tena mandeha amin’ny lalako ary manao izay mahitsy eo imasoko, ka mitandrina ny lalàko sy ny didiko sahala amin’ny nataon’i davida mpanompoko, dia homba anao aho ka hampaharitra ny taranakao, sahala amin’izay nataoko ho an’i davida. ary homeko anao ny israely.'),
  ('6ab25a4c3e9725fe06703434', '2026-09-22T10:37:00.611Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:00.611Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 11, 28, 'Lehilahy matanjaka sy mahery fo i Jeroboama. Rehefa hitan’i Solomona fa tia niasa mafy io tovolahy io, dia notendreny ho mpiandraikitra ny fanompoana rehetra tsy maintsy nataon’ny taranak’i Josefa izy.', 'lehilahy matanjaka sy mahery fo i jeroboama. rehefa hitan’i solomona fa tia niasa mafy io tovolahy io, dia notendreny ho mpiandraikitra ny fanompoana rehetra tsy maintsy nataon’ny taranak’i josefa izy.'),
  ('6ab25a4c3e9725fe06703426', '2026-09-22T10:37:00.611Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:00.611Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 11, 14, 'Ary nataon’i Jehovah izay hisian’ny mpanohitra an’i Solomona, dia i Hadada Edomita izay taranaka mpanjaka. Tany Edoma izy tamin’izay.', 'ary nataon’i jehovah izay hisian’ny mpanohitra an’i solomona, dia i hadada edomita izay taranaka mpanjaka. tany edoma izy tamin’izay.'),
  ('6ab25a4c3e9725fe06703424', '2026-09-22T10:37:00.611Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:00.611Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 11, 12, 'Tsy hataoko amin’ny andronao anefa izany noho ny amin’i Davida rainao, fa rehefa eo an-tanan’ny zanakao ny fanjakana vao hesoriko aminy.', 'tsy hataoko amin’ny andronao anefa izany noho ny amin’i davida rainao, fa rehefa eo an-tanan’ny zanakao ny fanjakana vao hesoriko aminy.'),
  ('6ab25a4c3e9725fe06703423', '2026-09-22T10:37:00.611Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:00.611Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 11, 11, 'Koa hoy i Jehovah taminy: “Satria izany no nataonao, ka tsy nohajainao ny fifanekena nataoko sady tsy notandremanao ny lalàko izay nandidiako anao, dia hesoriko aminao tokoa ny fanjakana ka homeko ny mpanomponao.', 'koa hoy i jehovah taminy: “satria izany no nataonao, ka tsy nohajainao ny fifanekena nataoko sady tsy notandremanao ny lalàko izay nandidiako anao, dia hesoriko aminao tokoa ny fanjakana ka homeko ny mpanomponao.'),
  ('6ab25a4c3e9725fe06703439', '2026-09-22T10:37:00.611Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:00.611Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 11, 33, 'Ny antony dia satria nahafoy ahy izy ireo ka niankohoka teo anatrehan’i Astarta andriamanibavin’ny Sidonianina, sy Kemosy andriamanitr’i Moaba, ary Milkoma andriamanitry ny taranak’i Amona. Ary tsy nandeha tamin’ny lalako izy ireo, ka tsy nanao izay mahitsy teo imasoko sady tsy nitandrina ny didiko sy ny fitsipiko, tsy mba hoatran’i Davida rainy.', 'ny antony dia satria nahafoy ahy izy ireo ka niankohoka teo anatrehan’i astarta andriamanibavin’ny sidonianina, sy kemosy andriamanitr’i moaba, ary milkoma andriamanitry ny taranak’i amona. ary tsy nandeha tamin’ny lalako izy ireo, ka tsy nanao izay mahitsy teo imasoko sady tsy nitandrina ny didiko sy ny fitsipiko, tsy mba hoatran’i davida rainy.'),
  ('6ab25a4c3e9725fe0670343d', '2026-09-22T10:37:00.611Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:00.611Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 11, 37, 'Ary ianao no hofidiko, ka hanjaka eo amin’izay rehetra irinao, ary ho mpanjakan’ny Israely tokoa ianao.', 'ary ianao no hofidiko, ka hanjaka eo amin’izay rehetra irinao, ary ho mpanjakan’ny israely tokoa ianao.'),
  ('6ab25a4c3e9725fe06703437', '2026-09-22T10:37:00.611Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:00.611Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 11, 31, 'Ary hoy izy tamin’i Jeroboama: “Makà folo ho anao, fa izao no nolazain’i Jehovah Andriamanitry ny Israely: ‘Hesoriko tsy ho eo an-tanan’i Solomona ny fanjakana, ka homeko foko folo ianao.', 'ary hoy izy tamin’i jeroboama: “makà folo ho anao, fa izao no nolazain’i jehovah andriamanitry ny israely: ‘hesoriko tsy ho eo an-tanan’i solomona ny fanjakana, ka homeko foko folo ianao.'),
  ('6ab25a4c3e9725fe0670342d', '2026-09-22T10:37:00.611Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:00.611Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 11, 21, 'Ary ren’i Hadada tany Ejipta fa nodimandry any amin’ny razany i Davida, ary maty koa i Joaba lehiben’ny tafika. Dia hoy izy tamin’i Farao: “Alefaso hody any amin’ny taniko aho.”', 'ary ren’i hadada tany ejipta fa nodimandry any amin’ny razany i davida, ary maty koa i joaba lehiben’ny tafika. dia hoy izy tamin’i farao: “alefaso hody any amin’ny taniko aho.”'),
  ('6ab25a4c3e9725fe06703430', '2026-09-22T10:37:00.611Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:00.611Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 11, 24, 'Ary tsy nitsahatra namory olona homba azy izy, ka tonga lehiben’ny mpandroba, tamin’i Davida namono ny olona tao Zoba. Koa nankany Damaskosy izy ireo ary nanorim-ponenana tany, dia nanjaka tany.', 'ary tsy nitsahatra namory olona homba azy izy, ka tonga lehiben’ny mpandroba, tamin’i davida namono ny olona tao zoba. koa nankany damaskosy izy ireo ary nanorim-ponenana tany, dia nanjaka tany.'),
  ('6ab25a4c3e9725fe0670342e', '2026-09-22T10:37:00.611Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:00.611Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 11, 22, 'Fa hoy i Farao taminy: “Fa inona no mahory anao eto amiko no te hody any amin’ny taninao ianao?” Dia hoy izy: “Tsy misy! Fa alefaso mihitsy aho na izany aza.”', 'fa hoy i farao taminy: “fa inona no mahory anao eto amiko no te hody any amin’ny taninao ianao?” dia hoy izy: “tsy misy! fa alefaso mihitsy aho na izany aza.”'),
  ('6ab25a4c3e9725fe06703422', '2026-09-22T10:37:00.611Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:00.611Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 11, 10, 'Ary efa nandidy azy mba tsy hanao izany sy tsy hanaraka andriamani-kafa i Jehovah, nefa tsy nitandrina an’izany didy izany izy.', 'ary efa nandidy azy mba tsy hanao izany sy tsy hanaraka andriamani-kafa i jehovah, nefa tsy nitandrina an’izany didy izany izy.');
INSERT INTO "bible_verses" ("id", "created_date", "updated_date", "created_by_id", "created_by", "translation", "book", "bookOrder", "chapter", "verse", "text", "normalizedText") VALUES
  ('6ab25a4d2c04637dbdc7f2ab', '2026-09-22T10:37:01.355Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:01.355Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 12, 10, 'Koa hoy ireo tovolahy niaraka lehibe taminy: “Na dia nilaza taminao aza ny vahoaka hoe: ‘Nampitondra zioga mavesatra anay ny rainao, fa ianao kosa tokony hanamaivana izany’, dia izao lazaina aminy: ‘Ho lehibe noho ny andilan’ny raiko ny ankikeliko.', 'koa hoy ireo tovolahy niaraka lehibe taminy: “na dia nilaza taminao aza ny vahoaka hoe: ‘nampitondra zioga mavesatra anay ny rainao, fa ianao kosa tokony hanamaivana izany’, dia izao lazaina aminy: ‘ho lehibe noho ny andilan’ny raiko ny ankikeliko.'),
  ('6ab25a4d2c04637dbdc7f2a9', '2026-09-22T10:37:01.355Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:01.355Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 12, 8, 'Tsy nanaiky ny soso-kevitr’ireo zokiolona anefa izy, fa naka hevitra tamin’ireo tovolahy niaraka lehibe taminy, izay mpanolo-tsaina azy.', 'tsy nanaiky ny soso-kevitr’ireo zokiolona anefa izy, fa naka hevitra tamin’ireo tovolahy niaraka lehibe taminy, izay mpanolo-tsaina azy.'),
  ('6ab25a4d2c04637dbdc7f2b9', '2026-09-22T10:37:01.355Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:01.355Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 12, 24, '‘Izao no nolazain’i Jehovah: “Aza miakatra hiady amin’ny zanak’Israely rahalahinareo, fa samia mody any an-tranony avy. Fa izaho no nahatonga izao zavatra izao.”’” Dia nankatò ny tenin’i Jehovah izy ireo, ka nody tany an-tranony araka ny tenin’i Jehovah.', '‘izao no nolazain’i jehovah: “aza miakatra hiady amin’ny zanak’israely rahalahinareo, fa samia mody any an-tranony avy. fa izaho no nahatonga izao zavatra izao.”’” dia nankatò ny tenin’i jehovah izy ireo, ka nody tany an-tranony araka ny tenin’i jehovah.'),
  ('6ab25a4d2c04637dbdc7f2a8', '2026-09-22T10:37:01.355Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:01.355Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 12, 7, 'Dia hoy ireo zokiolona taminy: “Raha asehonao fa mpanompon’ny vahoaka ianao, ary tena manompo azy, dia teny mahafinaritra no tokony havalinao sy holazainao aminy. Dia azo antoka fa hanompo anao foana ny vahoaka.”', 'dia hoy ireo zokiolona taminy: “raha asehonao fa mpanompon’ny vahoaka ianao, ary tena manompo azy, dia teny mahafinaritra no tokony havalinao sy holazainao aminy. dia azo antoka fa hanompo anao foana ny vahoaka.”'),
  ('6ab25a4d2c04637dbdc7f2bf', '2026-09-22T10:37:01.355Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:01.355Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 12, 30, 'Nahatonga ny vahoaka hanota izany, ka tonga hatrany Dana izy ireo mba ho eo anatrehan’ilay zanak’omby tao.', 'nahatonga ny vahoaka hanota izany, ka tonga hatrany dana izy ireo mba ho eo anatrehan’ilay zanak’omby tao.'),
  ('6ab25a4d2c04637dbdc7f2b3', '2026-09-22T10:37:01.355Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:01.355Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 12, 18, 'Tatỳ aoriana, dia nirahin’i Rehoboama Mpanjaka i Adorama, izay niandraikitra an’ireo voantso hanao fanompoana. Nitora-bato azy anefa ny Israely rehetra, ka maty izy. I Rehoboama Mpanjaka kosa tafakatra tao anaty kalesiny, ka nandositra tany Jerosalema.', 'tatỳ aoriana, dia nirahin’i rehoboama mpanjaka i adorama, izay niandraikitra an’ireo voantso hanao fanompoana. nitora-bato azy anefa ny israely rehetra, ka maty izy. i rehoboama mpanjaka kosa tafakatra tao anaty kalesiny, ka nandositra tany jerosalema.'),
  ('6ab25a4d2c04637dbdc7f2a5', '2026-09-22T10:37:01.355Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:01.355Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 12, 4, '“Nampitondra zioga mavesatra anay ny rainao, fa ianao kosa, mba hamaivano ny fanompoana mafy nampanaovin-drainao sy ny zioga mavesatra nampitondrainy anay, dia hanompo anao izahay.”', '“nampitondra zioga mavesatra anay ny rainao, fa ianao kosa, mba hamaivano ny fanompoana mafy nampanaovin-drainao sy ny zioga mavesatra nampitondrainy anay, dia hanompo anao izahay.”'),
  ('6ab25a4d2c04637dbdc7f2b4', '2026-09-22T10:37:01.355Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:01.355Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 12, 19, 'Ary mbola mikomy amin’ny taranak’i Davida ny Israelita mandraka androany.', 'ary mbola mikomy amin’ny taranak’i davida ny israelita mandraka androany.'),
  ('6ab25a4d2c04637dbdc7f2aa', '2026-09-22T10:37:01.355Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:01.355Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 12, 9, 'Hoy izy tamin’ireo: “Inona no soso-kevitra omenareo mba havalintsika ny vahoaka? Niteny tamiko mantsy ry zareo hoe: ‘Mba hamaivano ny zioga nampitondrain’ny rainao anay.’”', 'hoy izy tamin’ireo: “inona no soso-kevitra omenareo mba havalintsika ny vahoaka? niteny tamiko mantsy ry zareo hoe: ‘mba hamaivano ny zioga nampitondrain’ny rainao anay.’”'),
  ('6ab25a4d2c04637dbdc7f2a2', '2026-09-22T10:37:01.355Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:01.355Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 12, 1, 'Nankany Sekema i Rehoboama, satria tany no nalehan’ny Israely rehetra mba hanao azy ho mpanjaka.', 'nankany sekema i rehoboama, satria tany no nalehan’ny israely rehetra mba hanao azy ho mpanjaka.'),
  ('6ab25a4d2c04637dbdc7f2b2', '2026-09-22T10:37:01.355Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:01.355Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 12, 17, 'Ny zanak’Israely izay nonina tany amin’ireo tanànan’i Joda ihany no mbola nanjakan’i Rehoboama.', 'ny zanak’israely izay nonina tany amin’ireo tanànan’i joda ihany no mbola nanjakan’i rehoboama.'),
  ('6ab25a4d2c04637dbdc7f2a3', '2026-09-22T10:37:01.355Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:01.355Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 12, 2, 'Raha vao ren’i Jeroboama zanak’i Nebata izany, raha mbola tany Ejipta izy—fa nandositra tany izy noho ny amin’i Solomona Mpanjaka ka nonina tany—', 'raha vao ren’i jeroboama zanak’i nebata izany, raha mbola tany ejipta izy—fa nandositra tany izy noho ny amin’i solomona mpanjaka ka nonina tany—'),
  ('6ab25a4d2c04637dbdc7f2ba', '2026-09-22T10:37:01.355Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:01.355Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 12, 25, 'Dia nanorina an’i Sekema tany amin’ny faritra be tendrombohitr’i Efraima i Jeroboama, ka nonina tany. Ary niala tany izy, ka nanorina an’i Penoela.', 'dia nanorina an’i sekema tany amin’ny faritra be tendrombohitr’i efraima i jeroboama, ka nonina tany. ary niala tany izy, ka nanorina an’i penoela.'),
  ('6ab25a4d2c04637dbdc7f2b1', '2026-09-22T10:37:01.355Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:01.355Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 12, 16, 'Rehefa hitan’ny vahoakan’Israely manontolo fa tsy nihaino azy ny mpanjaka, dia hoy ny navalin’izy ireo: “Inona moa no mba anjaranay amin’i Davida? Tsy misy lovanay ange ao amin’ny zanak’i Jese e! Samia mankany amin’ny andriamaniny avy, ry Israely ô! Karakarao amin’izay ny taranakao, ry Davida ô!” Dia nody tany amin’ny tranolainy avy ny Israely.', 'rehefa hitan’ny vahoakan’israely manontolo fa tsy nihaino azy ny mpanjaka, dia hoy ny navalin’izy ireo: “inona moa no mba anjaranay amin’i davida? tsy misy lovanay ange ao amin’ny zanak’i jese e! samia mankany amin’ny andriamaniny avy, ry israely ô! karakarao amin’izay ny taranakao, ry davida ô!” dia nody tany amin’ny tranolainy avy ny israely.'),
  ('6ab25a4d2c04637dbdc7f2a7', '2026-09-22T10:37:01.355Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:01.355Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 12, 6, 'Ary i Rehoboama Mpanjaka naka hevitra tamin’ireo zokiolona izay mpanolo-tsaina an’i Solomona rainy fony fahavelony, ka niteny hoe: “Inona no havaly ny vahoaka, araka ny hevitrareo?”', 'ary i rehoboama mpanjaka naka hevitra tamin’ireo zokiolona izay mpanolo-tsaina an’i solomona rainy fony fahavelony, ka niteny hoe: “inona no havaly ny vahoaka, araka ny hevitrareo?”'),
  ('6ab25a4d2c04637dbdc7f2a4', '2026-09-22T10:37:01.355Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:01.355Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 12, 3, 'dia nampiantso azy ny olona. Dia tonga i Jeroboama sy ny fiangonan’Israely manontolo, ka niteny tamin’i Rehoboama hoe:', 'dia nampiantso azy ny olona. dia tonga i jeroboama sy ny fiangonan’israely manontolo, ka niteny tamin’i rehoboama hoe:'),
  ('6ab25a4d2c04637dbdc7f2b5', '2026-09-22T10:37:01.355Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:01.355Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 12, 20, 'Raha vao ren’ny Israely rehetra fa tafaverina i Jeroboama, dia nampiantso azy avy hatrany izy ireo hankeo amin’ny vahoaka, ka nampanjaka azy teo amin’ny Israely rehetra. Tsy nisy nanaraka ny taranak’i Davida, afa-tsy ny fokon’i Joda ihany.', 'raha vao ren’ny israely rehetra fa tafaverina i jeroboama, dia nampiantso azy avy hatrany izy ireo hankeo amin’ny vahoaka, ka nampanjaka azy teo amin’ny israely rehetra. tsy nisy nanaraka ny taranak’i davida, afa-tsy ny fokon’i joda ihany.'),
  ('6ab25a4d2c04637dbdc7f2be', '2026-09-22T10:37:01.355Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:01.355Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 12, 29, 'Dia napetrany tao Betela ny iray, fa ny iray kosa tany Dana.', 'dia napetrany tao betela ny iray, fa ny iray kosa tany dana.'),
  ('6ab25a4d2c04637dbdc7f2b8', '2026-09-22T10:37:01.355Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:01.355Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 12, 23, '“Lazao amin’i Rehoboama zanak’i Solomona mpanjakan’ny Joda, sy amin’ny taranak’i Joda sy Benjamina rehetra, ary amin’ny vahoaka sisa hoe:', '“lazao amin’i rehoboama zanak’i solomona mpanjakan’ny joda, sy amin’ny taranak’i joda sy benjamina rehetra, ary amin’ny vahoaka sisa hoe:'),
  ('6ab25a4d2c04637dbdc7f2b7', '2026-09-22T10:37:01.355Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:01.355Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 12, 22, 'Dia tonga tamin’i Semaia lehilahin’Andriamanitra, ny tenin’Andriamanitra, nanao hoe:', 'dia tonga tamin’i semaia lehilahin’andriamanitra, ny tenin’andriamanitra, nanao hoe:'),
  ('6ab25a4d2c04637dbdc7f2af', '2026-09-22T10:37:01.355Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:01.355Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 12, 14, 'Nanaraka ny soso-kevitr’ireo tovolahy izy, ka nilaza hoe: “Nampitondra zioga mavesatra anareo ny raiko, fa izaho kosa vao mainka hampitombo ny zioganareo. Nanafay anareo tamin’ny karavasy tsotra ny raiko, fa izaho kosa hanafay anareo amin’ny karavasy misy zava-maranitra.”', 'nanaraka ny soso-kevitr’ireo tovolahy izy, ka nilaza hoe: “nampitondra zioga mavesatra anareo ny raiko, fa izaho kosa vao mainka hampitombo ny zioganareo. nanafay anareo tamin’ny karavasy tsotra ny raiko, fa izaho kosa hanafay anareo amin’ny karavasy misy zava-maranitra.”'),
  ('6ab25a4d2c04637dbdc7f2ae', '2026-09-22T10:37:01.355Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:01.355Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 12, 13, 'Teny henjana anefa no navalin’ny mpanjaka ny vahoaka, ary tsy noraisiny ny soso-kevitr’ireo zokiolona.', 'teny henjana anefa no navalin’ny mpanjaka ny vahoaka, ary tsy noraisiny ny soso-kevitr’ireo zokiolona.'),
  ('6ab25a4d2c04637dbdc7f2b0', '2026-09-22T10:37:01.355Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:01.355Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 12, 15, 'Koa tsy nohenoin’ny mpanjaka ny vahoaka, satria avy tamin’i Jehovah izany, mba hanatanterahan’i Jehovah ny teny nolazainy tamin’i Jeroboama zanak’i Nebata, tamin’ny alalan’i Ahia Silonita.', 'koa tsy nohenoin’ny mpanjaka ny vahoaka, satria avy tamin’i jehovah izany, mba hanatanterahan’i jehovah ny teny nolazainy tamin’i jeroboama zanak’i nebata, tamin’ny alalan’i ahia silonita.'),
  ('6ab25a4d2c04637dbdc7f2ac', '2026-09-22T10:37:01.355Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:01.355Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 12, 11, 'Nampitondra zioga mavesatra anareo ny raiko, fa izaho kosa vao mainka hampitombo ny zioganareo. Nanafay anareo tamin’ny karavasy tsotra ny raiko, fa izaho kosa hanafay anareo amin’ny karavasy misy zava-maranitra.’”', 'nampitondra zioga mavesatra anareo ny raiko, fa izaho kosa vao mainka hampitombo ny zioganareo. nanafay anareo tamin’ny karavasy tsotra ny raiko, fa izaho kosa hanafay anareo amin’ny karavasy misy zava-maranitra.’”'),
  ('6ab25a4d2c04637dbdc7f2bb', '2026-09-22T10:37:01.355Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:01.355Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 12, 26, 'Ary hoy i Jeroboama anakampo: “Hiverina amin’ny taranak’i Davida izao ny fanjakana.', 'ary hoy i jeroboama anakampo: “hiverina amin’ny taranak’i davida izao ny fanjakana.'),
  ('6ab25a4d2c04637dbdc7f2ad', '2026-09-22T10:37:01.355Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:01.355Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 12, 12, 'Dia nankany amin’i Rehoboama i Jeroboama sy ny olona rehetra, tamin’ny andro fahatelo, araka ny tenin’ny mpanjaka hoe: “Miverena atỳ amiko amin’ny andro fahatelo.”', 'dia nankany amin’i rehoboama i jeroboama sy ny olona rehetra, tamin’ny andro fahatelo, araka ny tenin’ny mpanjaka hoe: “miverena atỳ amiko amin’ny andro fahatelo.”'),
  ('6ab25a4d2c04637dbdc7f2c2', '2026-09-22T10:37:01.355Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:01.355Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 12, 33, 'Dia nanolotra fanatitra teo amin’ilay alitara nataony tao Betela izy, tamin’ny andro fahadimy ambin’ny folon’ny volana fahavalo. Izy ihany no nifidy an’io volana io. Ary nanao andro fety ho an’ny zanak’Israely izy, sady nanolotra fanatitra teo amin’ilay alitara mba hidona-tsetroka.', 'dia nanolotra fanatitra teo amin’ilay alitara nataony tao betela izy, tamin’ny andro fahadimy ambin’ny folon’ny volana fahavalo. izy ihany no nifidy an’io volana io. ary nanao andro fety ho an’ny zanak’israely izy, sady nanolotra fanatitra teo amin’ilay alitara mba hidona-tsetroka.'),
  ('6ab25a4d2c04637dbdc7f2c0', '2026-09-22T10:37:01.355Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:01.355Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 12, 31, 'Nanao trano teny amin’ireo toerana avo i Jeroboama, sady nanendry mpisorona avy tamin’ny sarambabem-bahoaka, izay tsy anisan’ny taranak’i Levy.', 'nanao trano teny amin’ireo toerana avo i jeroboama, sady nanendry mpisorona avy tamin’ny sarambabem-bahoaka, izay tsy anisan’ny taranak’i levy.'),
  ('6ab25a4d2c04637dbdc7f2bc', '2026-09-22T10:37:01.355Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:01.355Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 12, 27, 'Raha miakatra lava mba hanao sorona ao an-tranon’i Jehovah any Jerosalema ity vahoaka ity, dia tena hiverina amin’ny tompon’izy ireo indray ny fony, dia amin’i Rehoboama mpanjakan’ny Joda. Ary hamono ahy tokoa izy ireo, ka hiverina amin’i Rehoboama mpanjakan’ny Joda.”', 'raha miakatra lava mba hanao sorona ao an-tranon’i jehovah any jerosalema ity vahoaka ity, dia tena hiverina amin’ny tompon’izy ireo indray ny fony, dia amin’i rehoboama mpanjakan’ny joda. ary hamono ahy tokoa izy ireo, ka hiverina amin’i rehoboama mpanjakan’ny joda.”'),
  ('6ab25a4d2c04637dbdc7f2bd', '2026-09-22T10:37:01.355Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:01.355Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 12, 28, 'Koa naka hevitra ny mpanjaka, ka nanao zanak’omby volamena roa, ary niteny tamin’ny vahoaka hoe: “Mafy loatra aminareo ny miakatra any Jerosalema. Koa io ny Andriamanitrao izay nitondra anao niakatra avy tany Ejipta, ry Israely ô!”', 'koa naka hevitra ny mpanjaka, ka nanao zanak’omby volamena roa, ary niteny tamin’ny vahoaka hoe: “mafy loatra aminareo ny miakatra any jerosalema. koa io ny andriamanitrao izay nitondra anao niakatra avy tany ejipta, ry israely ô!”'),
  ('6ab25a4d2c04637dbdc7f2b6', '2026-09-22T10:37:01.355Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:01.355Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 12, 21, 'Vao tonga tany Jerosalema i Rehoboama, dia namory ny taranak’i Joda rehetra sy ny fokon’i Benjamina, izany hoe vatan-dehilahy mpiady voafantina valo alina sy iray hetsy. Namory azy ireo hiady tamin’ny taranak’Israely i Rehoboama zanak’i Solomona, mba hahazoana indray ny fanjakana.', 'vao tonga tany jerosalema i rehoboama, dia namory ny taranak’i joda rehetra sy ny fokon’i benjamina, izany hoe vatan-dehilahy mpiady voafantina valo alina sy iray hetsy. namory azy ireo hiady tamin’ny taranak’israely i rehoboama zanak’i solomona, mba hahazoana indray ny fanjakana.'),
  ('6ab25a4d2c04637dbdc7f2c1', '2026-09-22T10:37:01.355Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:01.355Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 12, 32, 'Ary nataon’i Jeroboama andro fety ny fahadimy ambin’ny folon’ny volana fahavalo, sahala amin’ny fety tany Joda, mba hanolorany fanatitra teo amin’ilay alitara nataony tao Betela, ka hanaovany sorona ho an’ireo zanak’omby nataony. Ary notendreny hanompo tao Betela ny mpisoron’ireo toerana avo namboariny.', 'ary nataon’i jeroboama andro fety ny fahadimy ambin’ny folon’ny volana fahavalo, sahala amin’ny fety tany joda, mba hanolorany fanatitra teo amin’ilay alitara nataony tao betela, ka hanaovany sorona ho an’ireo zanak’omby nataony. ary notendreny hanompo tao betela ny mpisoron’ireo toerana avo namboariny.'),
  ('6ab25a4d2c04637dbdc7f2a6', '2026-09-22T10:37:01.355Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:01.355Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 12, 5, 'Dia hoy izy tamin’ireo: “Mandehana aloha, dia miverena atỳ amiko rehefa afaka telo andro.” Koa lasa ny olona.', 'dia hoy izy tamin’ireo: “mandehana aloha, dia miverena atỳ amiko rehefa afaka telo andro.” koa lasa ny olona.'),
  ('6ab25a4e9ebada78bb07dc63', '2026-09-22T10:37:02.469Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:02.469Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 13, 14, 'Ary nanaraka an’ilay lehilahin’Andriamanitra izy, ka nahita azy nipetraka teo ambanin’ny hazobe. Dia hoy izy: “Ianao ve ilay lehilahin’Andriamanitra avy any Joda?” Ary hoy izy: “Ia, izaho no izy.”', 'ary nanaraka an’ilay lehilahin’andriamanitra izy, ka nahita azy nipetraka teo ambanin’ny hazobe. dia hoy izy: “ianao ve ilay lehilahin’andriamanitra avy any joda?” ary hoy izy: “ia, izaho no izy.”'),
  ('6ab25a4e9ebada78bb07dc60', '2026-09-22T10:37:02.469Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:02.469Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 13, 11, 'Fa nisy mpaminany zokiolona iray nipetraka tany Betela. Ary tonga tao aminy ny zanany, ka nitantara taminy ny zava-drehetra nataon’ilay lehilahin’Andriamanitra tao Betela tamin’iny andro iny, mbamin’ny teny nolazainy tamin’ny mpanjaka. Eny, notantarain’izy ireo tamin-drainy izany.', 'fa nisy mpaminany zokiolona iray nipetraka tany betela. ary tonga tao aminy ny zanany, ka nitantara taminy ny zava-drehetra nataon’ilay lehilahin’andriamanitra tao betela tamin’iny andro iny, mbamin’ny teny nolazainy tamin’ny mpanjaka. eny, notantarain’izy ireo tamin-drainy izany.'),
  ('6ab25a4e9ebada78bb07dc5f', '2026-09-22T10:37:02.469Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:02.469Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 13, 10, 'Dia lalan-kafa no nalehany, fa tsy niverina tamin’ilay lalana nahatongavany tany Betela izy.', 'dia lalan-kafa no nalehany, fa tsy niverina tamin’ilay lalana nahatongavany tany betela izy.'),
  ('6ab25a4e9ebada78bb07dc5c', '2026-09-22T10:37:02.469Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:02.469Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 13, 7, 'Hoy koa izy tamin’ilay lehilahin’Andriamanitra: “Andao hiaraka amiko ho any an-trano, mba hihinan-javatra kely, ary homeko fanomezana ianao.”', 'hoy koa izy tamin’ilay lehilahin’andriamanitra: “andao hiaraka amiko ho any an-trano, mba hihinan-javatra kely, ary homeko fanomezana ianao.”'),
  ('6ab25a4e9ebada78bb07dc56', '2026-09-22T10:37:02.469Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:02.469Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 13, 1, 'Nisy lehilahin’Andriamanitra niainga avy any Joda, noho ny tenin’i Jehovah. Ary tonga tany Betela izy, raha mbola nitsangana teo anilan’ny alitara i Jeroboama mba hanolotra setroka ho sorona.', 'nisy lehilahin’andriamanitra niainga avy any joda, noho ny tenin’i jehovah. ary tonga tany betela izy, raha mbola nitsangana teo anilan’ny alitara i jeroboama mba hanolotra setroka ho sorona.'),
  ('6ab25a4e9ebada78bb07dc6b', '2026-09-22T10:37:02.469Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:02.469Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 13, 22, 'fa niverina mba hihinan-kanina sy hisotro rano tany amin’ilay toerana efa nolazainy taminao hoe: “Aza mihinan-kanina na misotro rano any”, dia tsy ho tonga any amin’ny fasan-drazanao ny fatinao.’”', 'fa niverina mba hihinan-kanina sy hisotro rano tany amin’ilay toerana efa nolazainy taminao hoe: “aza mihinan-kanina na misotro rano any”, dia tsy ho tonga any amin’ny fasan-drazanao ny fatinao.’”'),
  ('6ab25a4e9ebada78bb07dc6a', '2026-09-22T10:37:02.469Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:02.469Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 13, 21, 'Koa hoy izy tamin’ilay lehilahin’Andriamanitra avy any Joda: “Izao no nolazain’i Jehovah: ‘Satria nikomy tsy nanaraka ny baikon’i Jehovah ianao, ary tsy nitandrina ny didy nandidian’i Jehovah Andriamanitrao anao,', 'koa hoy izy tamin’ilay lehilahin’andriamanitra avy any joda: “izao no nolazain’i jehovah: ‘satria nikomy tsy nanaraka ny baikon’i jehovah ianao, ary tsy nitandrina ny didy nandidian’i jehovah andriamanitrao anao,'),
  ('6ab25a4e9ebada78bb07dc5b', '2026-09-22T10:37:02.469Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:02.469Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 13, 6, 'Ary hoy ny mpanjaka tamin’ilay lehilahin’Andriamanitra: “Mba iangavio re i Jehovah Andriamanitrao, azafady, ka mivavaha ho ahy mba hiverina amin’ny laoniny ny tanako e!” Dia niangavy an’i Jehovah ilay lehilahin’Andriamanitra, ka niverina tamin’ny laoniny ny tanan’ny mpanjaka ary lasa toy ny taloha.', 'ary hoy ny mpanjaka tamin’ilay lehilahin’andriamanitra: “mba iangavio re i jehovah andriamanitrao, azafady, ka mivavaha ho ahy mba hiverina amin’ny laoniny ny tanako e!” dia niangavy an’i jehovah ilay lehilahin’andriamanitra, ka niverina tamin’ny laoniny ny tanan’ny mpanjaka ary lasa toy ny taloha.'),
  ('6ab25a4e9ebada78bb07dc57', '2026-09-22T10:37:02.469Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:02.469Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 13, 2, 'Dia nanameloka an’ilay alitara ilay lehilahin’Andriamanitra, araka ny tenin’i Jehovah, ka niantsoantso hoe: “Ry alitara ô, ry alitara ô! Izao no nolazain’i Jehovah: ‘Hisy zazalahy ho teraka ao amin’ny taranak’i Davida. Josia no anarany. Ary hataony sorona eo amboninao ireo mpisoron’ny toerana avo, izay manolotra setroka ho sorona eo amboninao. Taolan’olona no hodorany eo amboninao.’”', 'dia nanameloka an’ilay alitara ilay lehilahin’andriamanitra, araka ny tenin’i jehovah, ka niantsoantso hoe: “ry alitara ô, ry alitara ô! izao no nolazain’i jehovah: ‘hisy zazalahy ho teraka ao amin’ny taranak’i davida. josia no anarany. ary hataony sorona eo amboninao ireo mpisoron’ny toerana avo, izay manolotra setroka ho sorona eo amboninao. taolan’olona no hodorany eo amboninao.’”'),
  ('6ab25a4e9ebada78bb07dc6c', '2026-09-22T10:37:02.469Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:02.469Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 13, 23, 'Rehefa avy nihinana sy nisotro izy, dia nasiany lasely avy hatrany ny ampondra mba hitaingenan’ilay mpaminany izay nentiny niverina.', 'rehefa avy nihinana sy nisotro izy, dia nasiany lasely avy hatrany ny ampondra mba hitaingenan’ilay mpaminany izay nentiny niverina.'),
  ('6ab25a4e9ebada78bb07dc65', '2026-09-22T10:37:02.469Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:02.469Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 13, 16, 'Fa hoy izy: “Tsy afaka miverina miaraka aminao aho na miditra ao an-tranonao, ary tsy mahazo mihinan-kanina na misotro rano miaraka aminao atỳ amin’ity toerana ity aho.', 'fa hoy izy: “tsy afaka miverina miaraka aminao aho na miditra ao an-tranonao, ary tsy mahazo mihinan-kanina na misotro rano miaraka aminao atỳ amin’ity toerana ity aho.'),
  ('6ab25a4e9ebada78bb07dc75', '2026-09-22T10:37:02.469Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:02.469Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 13, 32, 'Fa tsy maintsy ho tanteraka ilay tenin’i Jehovah nataony antso avo, ka nanamelohany an’ilay alitara eto Betela sy ireo trano rehetra eny amin’ny toerana avo ao amin’ireo tanànan’i Samaria.”', 'fa tsy maintsy ho tanteraka ilay tenin’i jehovah nataony antso avo, ka nanamelohany an’ilay alitara eto betela sy ireo trano rehetra eny amin’ny toerana avo ao amin’ireo tanànan’i samaria.”'),
  ('6ab25a4e9ebada78bb07dc6f', '2026-09-22T10:37:02.469Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:02.469Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 13, 26, 'Raha vao nandre izany ilay mpaminany nitondra azy niverina, dia niteny hoe: “Ilay lehilahin’Andriamanitra nikomy tsy nanaraka ny baikon’i Jehovah izay! Natolotr’i Jehovah hoviravirain’ny liona sy hovonoiny izy, araka ny tenin’i Jehovah taminy.”', 'raha vao nandre izany ilay mpaminany nitondra azy niverina, dia niteny hoe: “ilay lehilahin’andriamanitra nikomy tsy nanaraka ny baikon’i jehovah izay! natolotr’i jehovah hoviravirain’ny liona sy hovonoiny izy, araka ny tenin’i jehovah taminy.”'),
  ('6ab25a4e9ebada78bb07dc76', '2026-09-22T10:37:02.469Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:02.469Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 13, 33, 'Mbola tsy niala tamin’ny lalan-dratsiny i Jeroboama taorian’izany, fa mbola nanendry olona avy tamin’ny sarambabem-bahoaka mba ho mpisoron’ny toerana avo. Koa izay tia an’izany, dia nomeny fahefana, ka hoy izy: “Aoka izy ho anisan’ireo mpisoron’ny toerana avo.”', 'mbola tsy niala tamin’ny lalan-dratsiny i jeroboama taorian’izany, fa mbola nanendry olona avy tamin’ny sarambabem-bahoaka mba ho mpisoron’ny toerana avo. koa izay tia an’izany, dia nomeny fahefana, ka hoy izy: “aoka izy ho anisan’ireo mpisoron’ny toerana avo.”'),
  ('6ab25a4e9ebada78bb07dc74', '2026-09-22T10:37:02.469Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:02.469Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 13, 31, 'Rehefa voaleviny ralehilahy, dia hoy izy tamin’ireo zanany: “Rehefa maty aho, dia aleveno ao amin’ny fasana misy an’ilay lehilahin’Andriamanitra, ka apetraho eo anilan’ny taolany ny taolako.', 'rehefa voaleviny ralehilahy, dia hoy izy tamin’ireo zanany: “rehefa maty aho, dia aleveno ao amin’ny fasana misy an’ilay lehilahin’andriamanitra, ka apetraho eo anilan’ny taolany ny taolako.'),
  ('6ab25a4e9ebada78bb07dc69', '2026-09-22T10:37:02.469Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:02.469Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 13, 20, 'Raha mbola nipetraka teo anoloan’ny latabatra izy roa lahy, dia tonga tamin’ilay mpaminany izay nitondra azy niverina ny tenin’i Jehovah.', 'raha mbola nipetraka teo anoloan’ny latabatra izy roa lahy, dia tonga tamin’ilay mpaminany izay nitondra azy niverina ny tenin’i jehovah.'),
  ('6ab25a4e9ebada78bb07dc5a', '2026-09-22T10:37:02.469Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:02.469Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 13, 5, 'Ary nitresaka ny alitara, ka raraka avy teo ny lavenona feno menaka, araka ilay fambara nomen’ilay lehilahin’Andriamanitra, araka izay nolazain’i Jehovah.', 'ary nitresaka ny alitara, ka raraka avy teo ny lavenona feno menaka, araka ilay fambara nomen’ilay lehilahin’andriamanitra, araka izay nolazain’i jehovah.'),
  ('6ab25a4e9ebada78bb07dc73', '2026-09-22T10:37:02.469Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:02.469Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 13, 30, 'Koa naleviny tao amin’ny fasany ny fatin-dralehilahy. Ary nitomany azy ny olona, sady nanao hoe: “Indrisy, ry rahalahiko!”', 'koa naleviny tao amin’ny fasany ny fatin-dralehilahy. ary nitomany azy ny olona, sady nanao hoe: “indrisy, ry rahalahiko!”'),
  ('6ab25a4e9ebada78bb07dc6e', '2026-09-22T10:37:02.469Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:02.469Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 13, 25, 'Ary nisy olona nandalo ka nahita ilay faty teo an-dalana, sy ilay liona nijanona teo anilan’ny faty. Dia niditra tao an-tanàna ireo, ka nilaza izany tao amin’ilay tanàna nonenan’ilay mpaminany zokiolona.', 'ary nisy olona nandalo ka nahita ilay faty teo an-dalana, sy ilay liona nijanona teo anilan’ny faty. dia niditra tao an-tanàna ireo, ka nilaza izany tao amin’ilay tanàna nonenan’ilay mpaminany zokiolona.'),
  ('6ab25a4e9ebada78bb07dc68', '2026-09-22T10:37:02.469Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:02.469Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 13, 19, 'Koa niara-niverina taminy izy ka nihinan-kanina sy nisotro rano tao an-tranony.', 'koa niara-niverina taminy izy ka nihinan-kanina sy nisotro rano tao an-tranony.'),
  ('6ab25a4e9ebada78bb07dc61', '2026-09-22T10:37:02.469Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:02.469Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 13, 12, 'Ary hoy ny rainy tamin’izy ireo: “Dia nankaiza ny lalany?” Koa natoron’ny zanany azy ny lalana nalehan’ilay lehilahin’Andriamanitra, izay avy any Joda.', 'ary hoy ny rainy tamin’izy ireo: “dia nankaiza ny lalany?” koa natoron’ny zanany azy ny lalana nalehan’ilay lehilahin’andriamanitra, izay avy any joda.'),
  ('6ab25a4e9ebada78bb07dc72', '2026-09-22T10:37:02.469Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:02.469Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 13, 29, 'Dia nobatain’ilay mpaminany ny fatin’ilay lehilahin’Andriamanitra, ka nataony teo ambony ampondra, ary nentiny niverina. Ary niditra tao an-tanànany ilay mpaminany zokiolona, mba hitomany sy handevina azy.', 'dia nobatain’ilay mpaminany ny fatin’ilay lehilahin’andriamanitra, ka nataony teo ambony ampondra, ary nentiny niverina. ary niditra tao an-tanànany ilay mpaminany zokiolona, mba hitomany sy handevina azy.'),
  ('6ab25a4e9ebada78bb07dc66', '2026-09-22T10:37:02.469Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:02.469Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 13, 17, 'Izao mantsy no nolazaina tamiko, araka ny tenin’i Jehovah: ‘Aza mihinan-kanina na misotro rano any ianao, ary aza miverina amin’izay lalana efa nalehanao.’”', 'izao mantsy no nolazaina tamiko, araka ny tenin’i jehovah: ‘aza mihinan-kanina na misotro rano any ianao, ary aza miverina amin’izay lalana efa nalehanao.’”'),
  ('6ab25a4e9ebada78bb07dc62', '2026-09-22T10:37:02.469Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:02.469Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 13, 13, 'Hoy koa izy tamin’ny zanany: “Asio lasely ny ampondra mba hitaingenako.” Dia nasian’izy ireo lasely ny ampondra ka nitaingenany.', 'hoy koa izy tamin’ny zanany: “asio lasely ny ampondra mba hitaingenako.” dia nasian’izy ireo lasely ny ampondra ka nitaingenany.'),
  ('6ab25a4e9ebada78bb07dc67', '2026-09-22T10:37:02.469Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:02.469Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 13, 18, 'Dia hoy izy taminy: “Izaho koa mba mpaminany sahala aminao. Ary nisy anjely nilaza tamiko ny tenin’i Jehovah hoe: ‘Asaivo miverina miaraka aminao ho any an-tranonao izy mba hihinan-kanina sy hisotro rano.’” Namitaka azy anefa izy.', 'dia hoy izy taminy: “izaho koa mba mpaminany sahala aminao. ary nisy anjely nilaza tamiko ny tenin’i jehovah hoe: ‘asaivo miverina miaraka aminao ho any an-tranonao izy mba hihinan-kanina sy hisotro rano.’” namitaka azy anefa izy.'),
  ('6ab25a4e9ebada78bb07dc59', '2026-09-22T10:37:02.469Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:02.469Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 13, 4, 'Raha vao ren’i Jeroboama Mpanjaka ny tenin’ilay lehilahin’Andriamanitra izay niantsoantso nanameloka ilay alitara tao Betela, dia natsotrany avy hatrany ny tanany hiala teo amin’ny alitara, ka hoy izy: “Hazòny izy!” Avy hatrany, dia maty ilay tanany natsotrany izay nanondroany an-dralehilahy, ka tsy azony naforitra.', 'raha vao ren’i jeroboama mpanjaka ny tenin’ilay lehilahin’andriamanitra izay niantsoantso nanameloka ilay alitara tao betela, dia natsotrany avy hatrany ny tanany hiala teo amin’ny alitara, ka hoy izy: “hazòny izy!” avy hatrany, dia maty ilay tanany natsotrany izay nanondroany an-dralehilahy, ka tsy azony naforitra.'),
  ('6ab25a4e9ebada78bb07dc70', '2026-09-22T10:37:02.469Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:02.469Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 13, 27, 'Ary hoy izy tamin’ireo zanany: “Asio lasely ny ampondra mba hitaingenako.” Dia nasian’izy ireo lasely ilay ampondra.', 'ary hoy izy tamin’ireo zanany: “asio lasely ny ampondra mba hitaingenako.” dia nasian’izy ireo lasely ilay ampondra.'),
  ('6ab25a4e9ebada78bb07dc58', '2026-09-22T10:37:02.469Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:02.469Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 13, 3, 'Dia nilaza fambara izy tamin’izay andro izay hoe: “Izao no fambara nolazain’i Jehovah: Jereo fa hitresaka ny alitara ka hiraraka ny lavenona feno menaka izay eo amboniny.”', 'dia nilaza fambara izy tamin’izay andro izay hoe: “izao no fambara nolazain’i jehovah: jereo fa hitresaka ny alitara ka hiraraka ny lavenona feno menaka izay eo amboniny.”'),
  ('6ab25a4e9ebada78bb07dc71', '2026-09-22T10:37:02.469Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:02.469Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 13, 28, 'Ary lasa nandeha izy, ka nahita ny fatin-dralehilahy teo an-dalana, ary samy nijoro teo anilan’ilay faty ny ampondra sy ny liona. Tsy nohanin’ilay liona ilay faty, ary tsy noviravirainy ilay ampondra.', 'ary lasa nandeha izy, ka nahita ny fatin-dralehilahy teo an-dalana, ary samy nijoro teo anilan’ilay faty ny ampondra sy ny liona. tsy nohanin’ilay liona ilay faty, ary tsy noviravirainy ilay ampondra.'),
  ('6ab25a4e9ebada78bb07dc6d', '2026-09-22T10:37:02.469Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:02.469Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 13, 24, 'Ary lasa nandeha io. Nony afaka kelikely, dia nisy liona nahita azy teny an-dalana ka namono azy. Dia nipitika teo amin’ny lalana ny fatiny, fa ilay ampondra kosa nijoro teo anilan’ny faty. Nijanona teo anilan’ny faty koa ilay liona.', 'ary lasa nandeha io. nony afaka kelikely, dia nisy liona nahita azy teny an-dalana ka namono azy. dia nipitika teo amin’ny lalana ny fatiny, fa ilay ampondra kosa nijoro teo anilan’ny faty. nijanona teo anilan’ny faty koa ilay liona.'),
  ('6ab25a4e9ebada78bb07dc5e', '2026-09-22T10:37:02.469Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:02.469Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 13, 9, 'Fa izao no baiko nomena ahy, araka ny tenin’i Jehovah: ‘Aza mihinan-kanina na misotro rano, ary aza miverina amin’izay lalana efa nalehanao.’”', 'fa izao no baiko nomena ahy, araka ny tenin’i jehovah: ‘aza mihinan-kanina na misotro rano, ary aza miverina amin’izay lalana efa nalehanao.’”'),
  ('6ab25a4e9ebada78bb07dc5d', '2026-09-22T10:37:02.469Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:02.469Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 13, 8, 'Fa hoy ilay lehilahin’Andriamanitra taminy: “Na homenao ahy aza ny antsasaky ny tranonao, dia tsy hiaraka aminao aho, na hihinan-kanina, na hisotro rano atỳ amin’ity toerana ity.', 'fa hoy ilay lehilahin’andriamanitra taminy: “na homenao ahy aza ny antsasaky ny tranonao, dia tsy hiaraka aminao aho, na hihinan-kanina, na hisotro rano atỳ amin’ity toerana ity.'),
  ('6ab25a4e9ebada78bb07dc77', '2026-09-22T10:37:02.469Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:02.469Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 13, 34, 'Ary nahatonga ny ankohonan’i Jeroboama hanota izany, ka nitarika ho amin’ny fanafoanana sy ny fandringanana azy tsy ho etỳ ambonin’ny tany.', 'ary nahatonga ny ankohonan’i jeroboama hanota izany, ka nitarika ho amin’ny fanafoanana sy ny fandringanana azy tsy ho etỳ ambonin’ny tany.'),
  ('6ab25a4e9ebada78bb07dc64', '2026-09-22T10:37:02.469Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:02.469Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 13, 15, 'Dia hoy izy: “Andao hiaraka amiko ho any an-trano mba hihinan-kanina.”', 'dia hoy izy: “andao hiaraka amiko ho any an-trano mba hihinan-kanina.”'),
  ('6ab25a50226a65972aa6a6a2', '2026-09-22T10:37:04.152Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:04.152Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 14, 30, 'Ary nisy ady foana teo amin’i Rehoboama sy Jeroboama.', 'ary nisy ady foana teo amin’i rehoboama sy jeroboama.'),
  ('6ab25a50226a65972aa6a694', '2026-09-22T10:37:04.152Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:04.152Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 14, 16, 'Ary hafoiny ny Israely noho ny fahotana izay nataon’i Jeroboama sy nampanotany ny Israely.”', 'ary hafoiny ny israely noho ny fahotana izay nataon’i jeroboama sy nampanotany ny israely.”'),
  ('6ab25a50226a65972aa6a68e', '2026-09-22T10:37:04.152Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:04.152Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 14, 10, 'Noho izany, dia hahatonga loza amin’ny ankohonan’i Jeroboama aho, ka haringako daholo ny lahy rehetra anisan’ny ankohonany, dia ireo tsy misy mpiaro sy tsy misy ilana azy eo amin’ny Israely. Ary hofafako tsy hisy intsony ny ankohonan’i Jeroboama toy ny famafa diky, * mandra-panaisotra azy tanteraka.', 'noho izany, dia hahatonga loza amin’ny ankohonan’i jeroboama aho, ka haringako daholo ny lahy rehetra anisan’ny ankohonany, dia ireo tsy misy mpiaro sy tsy misy ilana azy eo amin’ny israely. ary hofafako tsy hisy intsony ny ankohonan’i jeroboama toy ny famafa diky, * mandra-panaisotra azy tanteraka.'),
  ('6ab25a50226a65972aa6a686', '2026-09-22T10:37:04.152Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:04.152Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 14, 2, 'Koa hoy i Jeroboama tamin’ny vadiny: “Mitsangàna re, azafady, ary mody manaova olon-kafa mba tsy ho fantatry ny olona hoe vadiko ianao, ka mandehana any Silo. Any mantsy i Ahia mpaminany, izay nilaza tamiko hoe ho mpanjakan’ity firenena ity aho.', 'koa hoy i jeroboama tamin’ny vadiny: “mitsangàna re, azafady, ary mody manaova olon-kafa mba tsy ho fantatry ny olona hoe vadiko ianao, ka mandehana any silo. any mantsy i ahia mpaminany, izay nilaza tamiko hoe ho mpanjakan’ity firenena ity aho.'),
  ('6ab25a50226a65972aa6a69f', '2026-09-22T10:37:04.152Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:04.152Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 14, 27, 'Koa nanao ampinga varahina ho solon’ireny i Rehoboama Mpanjaka, ka nametraka izany ho andraikitr’ireo lehiben’ny mpihazakazaka, dia ireo mpiambina ny fidirana mankao an-tranon’ny mpanjaka.', 'koa nanao ampinga varahina ho solon’ireny i rehoboama mpanjaka, ka nametraka izany ho andraikitr’ireo lehiben’ny mpihazakazaka, dia ireo mpiambina ny fidirana mankao an-tranon’ny mpanjaka.'),
  ('6ab25a50226a65972aa6a697', '2026-09-22T10:37:04.152Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:04.152Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 14, 19, 'Ary ny sisa amin’ny tantaran’i Jeroboama, eny, ny ady nataony sy ny nanjakany, dia efa voasoratra ao amin’ny boky mirakitra ny tantara tamin’ny andron’ireo mpanjakan’ny Israely.', 'ary ny sisa amin’ny tantaran’i jeroboama, eny, ny ady nataony sy ny nanjakany, dia efa voasoratra ao amin’ny boky mirakitra ny tantara tamin’ny andron’ireo mpanjakan’ny israely.'),
  ('6ab25a50226a65972aa6a68a', '2026-09-22T10:37:04.152Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:04.152Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 14, 6, 'Raha vao ren’i Ahia ny figodongodon’ny tongony niditra teo amin’ny fidirana, dia hoy izy: “Mandrosoa, ry vadin’i Jeroboama! Nahoana ianao no manao izay tsy hahafantarana anao, nefa izaho nirahina ho any aminao mba hitondra hafatra henjana?', 'raha vao ren’i ahia ny figodongodon’ny tongony niditra teo amin’ny fidirana, dia hoy izy: “mandrosoa, ry vadin’i jeroboama! nahoana ianao no manao izay tsy hahafantarana anao, nefa izaho nirahina ho any aminao mba hitondra hafatra henjana?'),
  ('6ab25a50226a65972aa6a690', '2026-09-22T10:37:04.152Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:04.152Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 14, 12, '“Fa ianao kosa, mitsangàna ka modia any an-tranonao, fa raha vao mandingana ho ao an-tanàna ny tongotrao, dia ho faty tokoa ilay zaza.', '“fa ianao kosa, mitsangàna ka modia any an-tranonao, fa raha vao mandingana ho ao an-tanàna ny tongotrao, dia ho faty tokoa ilay zaza.'),
  ('6ab25a50226a65972aa6a691', '2026-09-22T10:37:04.152Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:04.152Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 14, 13, 'Koa hitomany azy ny Israely rehetra ary handevina azy, satria izy irery ihany, amin’ny ankohonan’i Jeroboama, no hiditra am-pasana. Tamin’ny ankohonan’i Jeroboama mantsy, dia izy no mba nahitana zavatra tsara teo imason’i Jehovah Andriamanitry ny Israely.', 'koa hitomany azy ny israely rehetra ary handevina azy, satria izy irery ihany, amin’ny ankohonan’i jeroboama, no hiditra am-pasana. tamin’ny ankohonan’i jeroboama mantsy, dia izy no mba nahitana zavatra tsara teo imason’i jehovah andriamanitry ny israely.'),
  ('6ab25a50226a65972aa6a6a0', '2026-09-22T10:37:04.152Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:04.152Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 14, 28, 'Ary isaky ny nankao amin’ny tranon’i Jehovah ny mpanjaka, dia nentin’ny mpihazakazaka ireo ampinga ireo, ary avy eo dia naveriny tao amin’ny efitra fiambenan’izy ireo.', 'ary isaky ny nankao amin’ny tranon’i jehovah ny mpanjaka, dia nentin’ny mpihazakazaka ireo ampinga ireo, ary avy eo dia naveriny tao amin’ny efitra fiambenan’izy ireo.'),
  ('6ab25a50226a65972aa6a685', '2026-09-22T10:37:04.152Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:04.152Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 14, 1, 'Narary i Abia zanak’i Jeroboama, tamin’izay fotoana izay.', 'narary i abia zanak’i jeroboama, tamin’izay fotoana izay.'),
  ('6ab25a50226a65972aa6a68d', '2026-09-22T10:37:04.152Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:04.152Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 14, 9, 'Fa nanao ratsy mihoatra noho izay rehetra talohanao ianao, ka lasa nanao andriamani-kafa sy sarivongana metaly mba hampahatezitra ahy, fa izaho kosa narianao tany ivohonao.', 'fa nanao ratsy mihoatra noho izay rehetra talohanao ianao, ka lasa nanao andriamani-kafa sy sarivongana metaly mba hampahatezitra ahy, fa izaho kosa narianao tany ivohonao.'),
  ('6ab25a50226a65972aa6a69e', '2026-09-22T10:37:04.152Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:04.152Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 14, 26, 'Dia nalainy ireo zava-tsarobidy notehirizina tao an-tranon’i Jehovah sy ireo tao an-tranon’ny mpanjaka, ka lasany daholo ny zava-drehetra. Lasany koa ny ampinga volamena rehetra nataon’i Solomona.', 'dia nalainy ireo zava-tsarobidy notehirizina tao an-tranon’i jehovah sy ireo tao an-tranon’ny mpanjaka, ka lasany daholo ny zava-drehetra. lasany koa ny ampinga volamena rehetra nataon’i solomona.'),
  ('6ab25a50226a65972aa6a69d', '2026-09-22T10:37:04.152Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:04.152Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 14, 25, 'Ary tamin’ny taona fahadimy nanjakan’i Rehoboama Mpanjaka, dia niakatra hanafika an’i Jerosalema i Sisaka mpanjakan’i Ejipta.', 'ary tamin’ny taona fahadimy nanjakan’i rehoboama mpanjaka, dia niakatra hanafika an’i jerosalema i sisaka mpanjakan’i ejipta.'),
  ('6ab25a50226a65972aa6a698', '2026-09-22T10:37:04.152Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:04.152Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 14, 20, 'Roa amby roapolo taona ny andro nanjakan’i Jeroboama, dia nodimandry any amin’ny razany izy. Ary i Nadaba zanany no nanjaka nandimby azy.', 'roa amby roapolo taona ny andro nanjakan’i jeroboama, dia nodimandry any amin’ny razany izy. ary i nadaba zanany no nanjaka nandimby azy.'),
  ('6ab25a50226a65972aa6a696', '2026-09-22T10:37:04.152Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:04.152Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 14, 18, 'Koa nalevina ilay zaza, ary nitomany azy ny Israely rehetra, araka ny tenin’i Jehovah tamin’ny alalan’i Ahia mpaminany mpanompony.', 'koa nalevina ilay zaza, ary nitomany azy ny israely rehetra, araka ny tenin’i jehovah tamin’ny alalan’i ahia mpaminany mpanompony.'),
  ('6ab25a50226a65972aa6a692', '2026-09-22T10:37:04.152Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:04.152Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 14, 14, 'Ary hanendry mpanjaka hitondra ny Israely i Jehovah, ka io no handringana ny ankohonan’i Jeroboama amin’io andro voalaza io. Ary ahoana raha mitranga izao ankehitriny izao izany?', 'ary hanendry mpanjaka hitondra ny israely i jehovah, ka io no handringana ny ankohonan’i jeroboama amin’io andro voalaza io. ary ahoana raha mitranga izao ankehitriny izao izany?'),
  ('6ab25a50226a65972aa6a68c', '2026-09-22T10:37:04.152Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:04.152Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 14, 8, 'Ary nesoriko tamin’ny taranak’i Davida ny fanjakana ka nomeko anao, nefa ianao tsy mba nanao tahaka an’i Davida mpanompoko, izay nitandrina ny didiko sy nanaraka ahy tamin’ny fony manontolo ka tsy nanao afa-tsy izay mahitsy teo imasoko.', 'ary nesoriko tamin’ny taranak’i davida ny fanjakana ka nomeko anao, nefa ianao tsy mba nanao tahaka an’i davida mpanompoko, izay nitandrina ny didiko sy nanaraka ahy tamin’ny fony manontolo ka tsy nanao afa-tsy izay mahitsy teo imasoko.'),
  ('6ab25a50226a65972aa6a6a1', '2026-09-22T10:37:04.152Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:04.152Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 14, 29, 'Ary ny sisa amin’ny tantaran’i Rehoboama, mbamin’izay rehetra nataony, tsy efa voasoratra ao amin’ny boky mirakitra ny tantara tamin’ny andron’ireo mpanjakan’ny Joda ve izany?', 'ary ny sisa amin’ny tantaran’i rehoboama, mbamin’izay rehetra nataony, tsy efa voasoratra ao amin’ny boky mirakitra ny tantara tamin’ny andron’ireo mpanjakan’ny joda ve izany?'),
  ('6ab25a50226a65972aa6a699', '2026-09-22T10:37:04.152Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:04.152Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 14, 21, 'Ary i Rehoboama zanak’i Solomona no lasa mpanjaka tany Joda. Iraika amby efapolo taona i Rehoboama tamin’izy nanomboka nanjaka, ary fito ambin’ny folo taona no nanjakany tao Jerosalema, ilay tanàna nofidin’i Jehovah teo amin’ny foko rehetran’ny Israely mba hametrahany ny anarany. Ary Nama no anaran-dreniny, dia i Nama Amonita.', 'ary i rehoboama zanak’i solomona no lasa mpanjaka tany joda. iraika amby efapolo taona i rehoboama tamin’izy nanomboka nanjaka, ary fito ambin’ny folo taona no nanjakany tao jerosalema, ilay tanàna nofidin’i jehovah teo amin’ny foko rehetran’ny israely mba hametrahany ny anarany. ary nama no anaran-dreniny, dia i nama amonita.'),
  ('6ab25a50226a65972aa6a69b', '2026-09-22T10:37:04.152Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:04.152Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 14, 23, 'Nanao toerana avo ho an’ny tenany koa izy ireo, ary nanao tsangambato masina sy tsato-kazo masina, teny amin’ny havoana avo rehetra sy teny ambanin’ny hazo midoroboka rehetra.', 'nanao toerana avo ho an’ny tenany koa izy ireo, ary nanao tsangambato masina sy tsato-kazo masina, teny amin’ny havoana avo rehetra sy teny ambanin’ny hazo midoroboka rehetra.'),
  ('6ab25a50226a65972aa6a69a', '2026-09-22T10:37:04.152Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:04.152Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 14, 22, 'Ary nanao izay ratsy teo imason’i Jehovah foana ny Joda, hany ka nanao izay hahasaro-piaro Azy mihoatra noho ny nataon’ny razan’izy ireo tamin’ny fahotana vitany.', 'ary nanao izay ratsy teo imason’i jehovah foana ny joda, hany ka nanao izay hahasaro-piaro azy mihoatra noho ny nataon’ny razan’izy ireo tamin’ny fahotana vitany.'),
  ('6ab25a50226a65972aa6a693', '2026-09-22T10:37:04.152Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:04.152Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 14, 15, 'Dia hasian’i Jehovah tokoa ny Israely, toy ny bararata mihozongozona any anaty rano. Ary tena hongotany tsy ho eto amin’ity tany tsara nomeny ny razany ity ny Israely, ka haparitany any ampitan’ny Renirano, noho izy ireo nanao an’ireny tsato-kazony masina ireny, ka nampahatezitra an’i Jehovah.', 'dia hasian’i jehovah tokoa ny israely, toy ny bararata mihozongozona any anaty rano. ary tena hongotany tsy ho eto amin’ity tany tsara nomeny ny razany ity ny israely, ka haparitany any ampitan’ny renirano, noho izy ireo nanao an’ireny tsato-kazony masina ireny, ka nampahatezitra an’i jehovah.'),
  ('6ab25a50226a65972aa6a68b', '2026-09-22T10:37:04.152Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:04.152Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 14, 7, 'Mandehana lazao amin’i Jeroboama hoe: ‘Izao no nolazain’i Jehovah Andriamanitry ny Israely: “Nasandratro avy teo amin’ny vahoaka ianao mba hotendreko ho mpitarika ny Israely oloko.', 'mandehana lazao amin’i jeroboama hoe: ‘izao no nolazain’i jehovah andriamanitry ny israely: “nasandratro avy teo amin’ny vahoaka ianao mba hotendreko ho mpitarika ny israely oloko.'),
  ('6ab25a50226a65972aa6a69c', '2026-09-22T10:37:04.152Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:04.152Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 14, 24, 'Ary nisy lehilahy mpivaro-tenan’ny tempoly mihitsy aza tao amin’ilay tany. Dia nataon’izy ireo daholo ny zava-maharikoriko rehetra fanaon’ireo firenena noroahin’i Jehovah tsy ho eo anatrehan’ny zanak’Israely.', 'ary nisy lehilahy mpivaro-tenan’ny tempoly mihitsy aza tao amin’ilay tany. dia nataon’izy ireo daholo ny zava-maharikoriko rehetra fanaon’ireo firenena noroahin’i jehovah tsy ho eo anatrehan’ny zanak’israely.'),
  ('6ab25a50226a65972aa6a689', '2026-09-22T10:37:04.152Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:04.152Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 14, 5, 'Ary efa niteny tamin’i Ahia i Jehovah hoe: “Iny avy iny ny vadin’i Jeroboama mba hanontany anao momba an-janany, fa marary ilay zaza. Koa izao sy izao no holazainao aminy. Ary izao no hitranga: Raha vao tonga izy, dia hataony izay tsy hahafantarana azy.”', 'ary efa niteny tamin’i ahia i jehovah hoe: “iny avy iny ny vadin’i jeroboama mba hanontany anao momba an-janany, fa marary ilay zaza. koa izao sy izao no holazainao aminy. ary izao no hitranga: raha vao tonga izy, dia hataony izay tsy hahafantarana azy.”'),
  ('6ab25a50226a65972aa6a688', '2026-09-22T10:37:04.152Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:04.152Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 14, 4, 'Koa izany tokoa no nataon’ny vadin’i Jeroboama ka niainga ho any Silo izy, ary nankao an-tranon’i Ahia. Ary efa tsy nahita intsony i Ahia fa efa pahina ny masony, noho izy efa be taona.', 'koa izany tokoa no nataon’ny vadin’i jeroboama ka niainga ho any silo izy, ary nankao an-tranon’i ahia. ary efa tsy nahita intsony i ahia fa efa pahina ny masony, noho izy efa be taona.'),
  ('6ab25a50226a65972aa6a6a3', '2026-09-22T10:37:04.152Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:04.152Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 14, 31, 'Farany, dia nodimandry any amin’ny razany i Rehoboama, ka nalevina any amin’ny razany tao amin’ny Tanànan’i Davida. Nama no anaran-dreniny, dia i Nama Amonita. Ary i Abiama zanak’i Rehoboama no nanjaka nandimby azy.', 'farany, dia nodimandry any amin’ny razany i rehoboama, ka nalevina any amin’ny razany tao amin’ny tanànan’i davida. nama no anaran-dreniny, dia i nama amonita. ary i abiama zanak’i rehoboama no nanjaka nandimby azy.'),
  ('6ab25a50226a65972aa6a695', '2026-09-22T10:37:04.152Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:04.152Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 14, 17, 'Dia nitsangana ny vadin’i Jeroboama ka lasa nandeha ary tonga tany Tirza. Raha vao tonga teo an-tokonan’ny tranony izy, dia maty ilay zanany.', 'dia nitsangana ny vadin’i jeroboama ka lasa nandeha ary tonga tany tirza. raha vao tonga teo an-tokonan’ny tranony izy, dia maty ilay zanany.'),
  ('6ab25a50226a65972aa6a68f', '2026-09-22T10:37:04.152Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:04.152Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 14, 11, 'Koa izay ankohonan’i Jeroboama maty ao an-tanàna dia hohanin’ny alika, ary izay maty any an-tsaha kosa hohanin’ny voro-manidina, fa i Jehovah no efa niteny.”’', 'koa izay ankohonan’i jeroboama maty ao an-tanàna dia hohanin’ny alika, ary izay maty any an-tsaha kosa hohanin’ny voro-manidina, fa i jehovah no efa niteny.”’'),
  ('6ab25a50226a65972aa6a687', '2026-09-22T10:37:04.152Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:04.152Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 14, 3, 'Ary mitondrà mofo folo sy mofomamy ary tantely eran’ny tavoara, ka mankanesa ao amin’i Ahia, fa izy no hilaza aminao izay hanjo ny zaza.”', 'ary mitondrà mofo folo sy mofomamy ary tantely eran’ny tavoara, ka mankanesa ao amin’i ahia, fa izy no hilaza aminao izay hanjo ny zaza.”'),
  ('6ab25a50f0d89b5af2ffa582', '2026-09-22T10:37:04.733Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:04.733Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 15, 29, 'Raha vao lasa mpanjaka i Basa, dia novonoiny daholo ny ankohonan’i Jeroboama manontolo, ka tsy nasiany niangana izay rehetra nanam-pofonaina tamin’ny ankohonan’i Jeroboama mandra-pandringany azy tanteraka, araka ny tenin’i Jehovah tamin’ny alalan’i Ahia Silonita mpanompony,', 'raha vao lasa mpanjaka i basa, dia novonoiny daholo ny ankohonan’i jeroboama manontolo, ka tsy nasiany niangana izay rehetra nanam-pofonaina tamin’ny ankohonan’i jeroboama mandra-pandringany azy tanteraka, araka ny tenin’i jehovah tamin’ny alalan’i ahia silonita mpanompony,'),
  ('6ab25a50f0d89b5af2ffa574', '2026-09-22T10:37:04.733Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:04.733Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 15, 15, 'Ary nampidiriny tao an-tranon’i Jehovah izay zavatra nohamasinin-drainy sy nohamasinin’ny tenany, dia volafotsy sy volamena ary zavatra maro hafa.', 'ary nampidiriny tao an-tranon’i jehovah izay zavatra nohamasinin-drainy sy nohamasinin’ny tenany, dia volafotsy sy volamena ary zavatra maro hafa.'),
  ('6ab25a50f0d89b5af2ffa581', '2026-09-22T10:37:04.733Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:04.733Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 15, 28, 'Koa novonoin’i Basa izy tamin’ny taona fahatelo nanjakan’i Asa mpanjakan’ny Joda, ka i Basa no nanjaka nandimby azy.', 'koa novonoin’i basa izy tamin’ny taona fahatelo nanjakan’i asa mpanjakan’ny joda, ka i basa no nanjaka nandimby azy.'),
  ('6ab25a50f0d89b5af2ffa587', '2026-09-22T10:37:04.733Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:04.733Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 15, 34, 'Ary nanao izay ratsy teo imason’i Jehovah foana izy, ary mbola nanao hoatran’izay nataon’i Jeroboama sady nanao araka ny fahotany izay nampanotany ny Israely.', 'ary nanao izay ratsy teo imason’i jehovah foana izy, ary mbola nanao hoatran’izay nataon’i jeroboama sady nanao araka ny fahotany izay nampanotany ny israely.'),
  ('6ab25a50f0d89b5af2ffa585', '2026-09-22T10:37:04.733Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:04.733Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 15, 32, 'Ary nisy ady teo amin’i Asa sy Basa mpanjakan’ny Israely, nandritra ny androm-piainan’izy ireo.', 'ary nisy ady teo amin’i asa sy basa mpanjakan’ny israely, nandritra ny androm-piainan’izy ireo.'),
  ('6ab25a50f0d89b5af2ffa57d', '2026-09-22T10:37:04.733Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:04.733Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 15, 24, 'Farany, dia nodimandry any amin’ny razany i Asa, ka nalevina any amin’ny razany tao amin’ny Tanànan’i Davida razambeny. Ary i Josafata zanany no nanjaka nandimby azy.', 'farany, dia nodimandry any amin’ny razany i asa, ka nalevina any amin’ny razany tao amin’ny tanànan’i davida razambeny. ary i josafata zanany no nanjaka nandimby azy.'),
  ('6ab25a50f0d89b5af2ffa583', '2026-09-22T10:37:04.733Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:04.733Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 15, 30, 'noho ny fahotana izay nataon’i Jeroboama sy nampanotany ny Israely, ary koa noho ny nanaovany izay hampahatezitra an’i Jehovah Andriamanitry ny Israely.', 'noho ny fahotana izay nataon’i jeroboama sy nampanotany ny israely, ary koa noho ny nanaovany izay hampahatezitra an’i jehovah andriamanitry ny israely.'),
  ('6ab25a50f0d89b5af2ffa578', '2026-09-22T10:37:04.733Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:04.733Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 15, 19, '“Misy fifanekena eo amiko sy aminao, ary eo amin’ny raiko sy ny rainao. Nandefasako volafotsy sy volamena ianao ho fanomezana. Koa foany ny fifanekena nifanaovanao tamin’i Basa mpanjakan’ny Israely, mba hialany amiko.”', '“misy fifanekena eo amiko sy aminao, ary eo amin’ny raiko sy ny rainao. nandefasako volafotsy sy volamena ianao ho fanomezana. koa foany ny fifanekena nifanaovanao tamin’i basa mpanjakan’ny israely, mba hialany amiko.”'),
  ('6ab25a50f0d89b5af2ffa577', '2026-09-22T10:37:04.733Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:04.733Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 15, 18, 'Koa nalain’i Asa daholo ny volafotsy sy ny volamena sisa tamin’ireo zava-tsarobidy notehirizina tao an-tranon’i Jehovah sy tao an-tranon’ny mpanjaka, ka nataony teo an-tanan’ny mpanompony. Ary nirahin’i Asa Mpanjaka ireo ho any amin’i Beni-hadada zanak’i Tabrimona, zanak’i Heziona, mpanjakan’i Syria, izay nonina tao Damaskosy, mba hilaza hoe:', 'koa nalain’i asa daholo ny volafotsy sy ny volamena sisa tamin’ireo zava-tsarobidy notehirizina tao an-tranon’i jehovah sy tao an-tranon’ny mpanjaka, ka nataony teo an-tanan’ny mpanompony. ary nirahin’i asa mpanjaka ireo ho any amin’i beni-hadada zanak’i tabrimona, zanak’i heziona, mpanjakan’i syria, izay nonina tao damaskosy, mba hilaza hoe:'),
  ('6ab25a50f0d89b5af2ffa56a', '2026-09-22T10:37:04.733Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:04.733Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 15, 5, 'Nanao izay mahitsy teo imason’i Jehovah mantsy i Davida, ary tsy niala tamin’izay nandidiany azy izy nandritra ny androm-piainany, afa-tsy tamin’ilay raharaha momba an’i Oria Hetita.', 'nanao izay mahitsy teo imason’i jehovah mantsy i davida, ary tsy niala tamin’izay nandidiany azy izy nandritra ny androm-piainany, afa-tsy tamin’ilay raharaha momba an’i oria hetita.'),
  ('6ab25a50f0d89b5af2ffa586', '2026-09-22T10:37:04.733Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:04.733Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 15, 33, 'Tamin’ny taona fahatelo nanjakan’i Asa mpanjakan’ny Joda, no lasa mpanjakan’ny Israely rehetra tao Tirza i Basa zanak’i Ahia, ary nanjaka efatra amby roapolo taona izy.', 'tamin’ny taona fahatelo nanjakan’i asa mpanjakan’ny joda, no lasa mpanjakan’ny israely rehetra tao tirza i basa zanak’i ahia, ary nanjaka efatra amby roapolo taona izy.'),
  ('6ab25a50f0d89b5af2ffa57a', '2026-09-22T10:37:04.733Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:04.733Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 15, 21, 'Raha vao ren’i Basa izany, dia tsy nanorina an’i Rama intsony izy. Ary mbola nonina tao Tirza izy.', 'raha vao ren’i basa izany, dia tsy nanorina an’i rama intsony izy. ary mbola nonina tao tirza izy.'),
  ('6ab25a50f0d89b5af2ffa573', '2026-09-22T10:37:04.733Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:04.733Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 15, 14, 'Fa tsy mba nesoriny kosa ireo toerana avo. Na izany aza, dia nifikitra tanteraka tamin’i Jehovah ny fon’i Asa, nandritra ny androm-piainany.', 'fa tsy mba nesoriny kosa ireo toerana avo. na izany aza, dia nifikitra tanteraka tamin’i jehovah ny fon’i asa, nandritra ny androm-piainany.'),
  ('6ab25a50f0d89b5af2ffa572', '2026-09-22T10:37:04.733Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:04.733Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 15, 13, 'Nesoriny tsy ho andriambavy koa na dia i Maka renibeny aza, satria nanao sampy mahatsiravina izay nampiasaina hivavahana tamin’ny tsato-kazo masina. Dia nokapain’i Asa ilay sampy mahatsiravina nataon’ny renibeny ka nodorany tao amin’ny lohasaha falehan-driakan’i Kidrona.', 'nesoriny tsy ho andriambavy koa na dia i maka renibeny aza, satria nanao sampy mahatsiravina izay nampiasaina hivavahana tamin’ny tsato-kazo masina. dia nokapain’i asa ilay sampy mahatsiravina nataon’ny renibeny ka nodorany tao amin’ny lohasaha falehan-driakan’i kidrona.'),
  ('6ab25a50f0d89b5af2ffa580', '2026-09-22T10:37:04.733Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:04.733Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 15, 27, 'Ary nanao tetika hamelezana an’i Nadaba i Basa zanak’i Ahia anisan’ny taranak’Isakara, ka namono azy ho faty tao Gibetona, izay an’ny Filistinina. Mbola nanao fahirano an’i Gibetona i Nadaba sy ny Israely rehetra tamin’izay.', 'ary nanao tetika hamelezana an’i nadaba i basa zanak’i ahia anisan’ny taranak’isakara, ka namono azy ho faty tao gibetona, izay an’ny filistinina. mbola nanao fahirano an’i gibetona i nadaba sy ny israely rehetra tamin’izay.'),
  ('6ab25a50f0d89b5af2ffa56c', '2026-09-22T10:37:04.733Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:04.733Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 15, 7, 'Ary ny sisa amin’ny tantaran’i Abiama, mbamin’izay rehetra nataony, tsy efa voasoratra ao amin’ny boky mirakitra ny tantara tamin’ny andron’ireo mpanjakan’ny Joda ve izany? Ary nisy ady koa teo amin’i Abiama sy Jeroboama.', 'ary ny sisa amin’ny tantaran’i abiama, mbamin’izay rehetra nataony, tsy efa voasoratra ao amin’ny boky mirakitra ny tantara tamin’ny andron’ireo mpanjakan’ny joda ve izany? ary nisy ady koa teo amin’i abiama sy jeroboama.'),
  ('6ab25a50f0d89b5af2ffa568', '2026-09-22T10:37:04.733Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:04.733Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 15, 3, 'Nandeha tamin’ny fahotana rehetra efa nataon-drainy talohany i Abiama. Ary tsy nifikitra tanteraka tamin’i Jehovah Andriamaniny ny fony, tsy mba hoatran’ny fon’i Davida razambeny.', 'nandeha tamin’ny fahotana rehetra efa nataon-drainy talohany i abiama. ary tsy nifikitra tanteraka tamin’i jehovah andriamaniny ny fony, tsy mba hoatran’ny fon’i davida razambeny.'),
  ('6ab25a50f0d89b5af2ffa567', '2026-09-22T10:37:04.733Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:04.733Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 15, 2, 'Telo taona no nanjakany tany Jerosalema. Ary ny anaran-dreniny dia Maka, zafikelin’i Abisaloma.', 'telo taona no nanjakany tany jerosalema. ary ny anaran-dreniny dia maka, zafikelin’i abisaloma.'),
  ('6ab25a50f0d89b5af2ffa57e', '2026-09-22T10:37:04.733Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:04.733Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 15, 25, 'Ary i Nadaba zanak’i Jeroboama kosa lasa mpanjakan’ny Israely tamin’ny taona faharoa nanjakan’i Asa mpanjakan’ny Joda. Ary nanjaka roa taona teo amin’ny Israely izy.', 'ary i nadaba zanak’i jeroboama kosa lasa mpanjakan’ny israely tamin’ny taona faharoa nanjakan’i asa mpanjakan’ny joda. ary nanjaka roa taona teo amin’ny israely izy.'),
  ('6ab25a50f0d89b5af2ffa584', '2026-09-22T10:37:04.733Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:04.733Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 15, 31, 'Ary ny sisa amin’ny tantaran’i Nadaba, mbamin’izay rehetra nataony, tsy efa voasoratra ao amin’ny boky mirakitra ny tantara tamin’ny andron’ireo mpanjakan’ny Israely ve izany?', 'ary ny sisa amin’ny tantaran’i nadaba, mbamin’izay rehetra nataony, tsy efa voasoratra ao amin’ny boky mirakitra ny tantara tamin’ny andron’ireo mpanjakan’ny israely ve izany?'),
  ('6ab25a50f0d89b5af2ffa57b', '2026-09-22T10:37:04.733Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:04.733Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 15, 22, 'Fa nampiantsoin’i Asa Mpanjaka kosa ny Joda rehetra, ary tsy nisy afa-niala tamin’ny fiantsoany. Dia nentin’ny olona ny vato sy ny hazo nanorenan’i Basa an’i Rama, ka ireny no nampiasain’i Asa Mpanjaka hanorenana an’i Geba an’i Benjamina, sy Mizpa.', 'fa nampiantsoin’i asa mpanjaka kosa ny joda rehetra, ary tsy nisy afa-niala tamin’ny fiantsoany. dia nentin’ny olona ny vato sy ny hazo nanorenan’i basa an’i rama, ka ireny no nampiasain’i asa mpanjaka hanorenana an’i geba an’i benjamina, sy mizpa.'),
  ('6ab25a50f0d89b5af2ffa579', '2026-09-22T10:37:04.733Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:04.733Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 15, 20, 'Dia neken’i Beni-hadada ny tenin’i Asa Mpanjaka, ka nirahiny ireo lehiben’ny tafiny mba hanafika ny tanànan’ny Israely. Koa notafihiny i Iona sy Dana sy Abela-beti-maka mbamin’i Kinereta manontolo, hatrany amin’ny tanin’i Naftaly manontolo.', 'dia neken’i beni-hadada ny tenin’i asa mpanjaka, ka nirahiny ireo lehiben’ny tafiny mba hanafika ny tanànan’ny israely. koa notafihiny i iona sy dana sy abela-beti-maka mbamin’i kinereta manontolo, hatrany amin’ny tanin’i naftaly manontolo.'),
  ('6ab25a50f0d89b5af2ffa571', '2026-09-22T10:37:04.733Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:04.733Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 15, 12, 'Koa nofoanany teo amin’ilay tany ireo lehilahy mpivaro-tenan’ny tempoly, ary nesoriny daholo koa ny sampy maharikoriko * nataon’ny razany.', 'koa nofoanany teo amin’ilay tany ireo lehilahy mpivaro-tenan’ny tempoly, ary nesoriny daholo koa ny sampy maharikoriko * nataon’ny razany.'),
  ('6ab25a50f0d89b5af2ffa57f', '2026-09-22T10:37:04.733Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:04.733Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 15, 26, 'Ary nanao izay ratsy teo imason’i Jehovah foana izy, ary mbola nanao hoatran’izay nataon-drainy sady nanao araka ny fahotan-drainy izay nampanotany ny Israely.', 'ary nanao izay ratsy teo imason’i jehovah foana izy, ary mbola nanao hoatran’izay nataon-drainy sady nanao araka ny fahotan-drainy izay nampanotany ny israely.'),
  ('6ab25a50f0d89b5af2ffa56b', '2026-09-22T10:37:04.733Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:04.733Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 15, 6, 'Ary nisy ady teo amin’i Rehoboama sy Jeroboama nandritra ny androm-piainany.', 'ary nisy ady teo amin’i rehoboama sy jeroboama nandritra ny androm-piainany.'),
  ('6ab25a50f0d89b5af2ffa566', '2026-09-22T10:37:04.733Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:04.733Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 15, 1, 'Tamin’ny taona fahavalo ambin’ny folo nanjakan’i Jeroboama Mpanjaka zanak’i Nebata, no lasa mpanjakan’ny Joda i Abiama.', 'tamin’ny taona fahavalo ambin’ny folo nanjakan’i jeroboama mpanjaka zanak’i nebata, no lasa mpanjakan’ny joda i abiama.'),
  ('6ab25a50f0d89b5af2ffa576', '2026-09-22T10:37:04.733Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:04.733Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 15, 17, 'Koa niakatra hanafika an’i Joda i Basa mpanjakan’ny Israely, ary nanorina an’i Rama izy mba tsy hamelana na iza na iza hivezivezy hankao amin’i Asa mpanjakan’ny Joda.', 'koa niakatra hanafika an’i joda i basa mpanjakan’ny israely, ary nanorina an’i rama izy mba tsy hamelana na iza na iza hivezivezy hankao amin’i asa mpanjakan’ny joda.'),
  ('6ab25a50f0d89b5af2ffa57c', '2026-09-22T10:37:04.733Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:04.733Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 15, 23, 'Ary ny sisa amin’ny tantaran’i Asa rehetra, mbamin’ny heriny rehetra sy izay rehetra nataony ary ireo tanàna naoriny, tsy efa voasoratra ao amin’ny boky mirakitra ny tantara tamin’ny andron’ireo mpanjakan’ny Joda ve izany? Narary tongotra anefa izy rehefa antitra.', 'ary ny sisa amin’ny tantaran’i asa rehetra, mbamin’ny heriny rehetra sy izay rehetra nataony ary ireo tanàna naoriny, tsy efa voasoratra ao amin’ny boky mirakitra ny tantara tamin’ny andron’ireo mpanjakan’ny joda ve izany? narary tongotra anefa izy rehefa antitra.'),
  ('6ab25a50f0d89b5af2ffa56d', '2026-09-22T10:37:04.733Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:04.733Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 15, 8, 'Farany, dia nodimandry any amin’ny razany i Abiama, ka nalevina tao amin’ny Tanànan’i Davida. Ary i Asa zanany no nanjaka nandimby azy.', 'farany, dia nodimandry any amin’ny razany i abiama, ka nalevina tao amin’ny tanànan’i davida. ary i asa zanany no nanjaka nandimby azy.'),
  ('6ab25a50f0d89b5af2ffa575', '2026-09-22T10:37:04.733Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:04.733Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 15, 16, 'Ary nisy ady teo amin’i Asa sy Basa mpanjakan’ny Israely, nandritra ny androm-piainan’izy ireo.', 'ary nisy ady teo amin’i asa sy basa mpanjakan’ny israely, nandritra ny androm-piainan’izy ireo.'),
  ('6ab25a50f0d89b5af2ffa56e', '2026-09-22T10:37:04.733Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:04.733Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 15, 9, 'Tamin’ny taona faharoapolo nanjakan’i Jeroboama mpanjakan’ny Israely no nanjakan’i Asa teo amin’ny Joda.', 'tamin’ny taona faharoapolo nanjakan’i jeroboama mpanjakan’ny israely no nanjakan’i asa teo amin’ny joda.'),
  ('6ab25a50f0d89b5af2ffa56f', '2026-09-22T10:37:04.733Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:04.733Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 15, 10, 'Iraika amby efapolo taona no nanjakany tany Jerosalema. Ary ny anaran’ny renibeny dia Maka, zafikelin’i Abisaloma.', 'iraika amby efapolo taona no nanjakany tany jerosalema. ary ny anaran’ny renibeny dia maka, zafikelin’i abisaloma.'),
  ('6ab25a50f0d89b5af2ffa569', '2026-09-22T10:37:04.733Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:04.733Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 15, 4, 'Fa noho ny amin’i Davida no nanomezan’i Jehovah Andriamaniny azy jiro tany Jerosalema, ka nanendreny an-janany handimby azy sy nampaharetany an’i Jerosalema.', 'fa noho ny amin’i davida no nanomezan’i jehovah andriamaniny azy jiro tany jerosalema, ka nanendreny an-janany handimby azy sy nampaharetany an’i jerosalema.'),
  ('6ab25a50f0d89b5af2ffa570', '2026-09-22T10:37:04.733Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:04.733Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 15, 11, 'Ary nanao izay mahitsy teo imason’i Jehovah i Asa, sahala amin’i Davida razambeny.', 'ary nanao izay mahitsy teo imason’i jehovah i asa, sahala amin’i davida razambeny.'),
  ('6ab25a5116d01074c19ece39', '2026-09-22T10:37:05.346Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:05.346Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 16, 15, 'Tamin’ny taona fahafito amby roapolo nanjakan’i Asa mpanjakan’ny Joda, no lasa mpanjaka tao Tirza i Zimry, ary nanjaka fito andro izy. Nitoby mba hiady tamin’i Gibetona, izay an’ny Filistinina, ny olona tamin’izay.', 'tamin’ny taona fahafito amby roapolo nanjakan’i asa mpanjakan’ny joda, no lasa mpanjaka tao tirza i zimry, ary nanjaka fito andro izy. nitoby mba hiady tamin’i gibetona, izay an’ny filistinina, ny olona tamin’izay.'),
  ('6ab25a5116d01074c19ece46', '2026-09-22T10:37:05.346Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:05.346Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 16, 28, 'Farany, dia nodimandry any amin’ny razany i Omry, ka nalevina tao Samaria. Ary i Ahaba zanany no nanjaka nandimby azy.', 'farany, dia nodimandry any amin’ny razany i omry, ka nalevina tao samaria. ary i ahaba zanany no nanjaka nandimby azy.'),
  ('6ab25a5116d01074c19ece45', '2026-09-22T10:37:05.346Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:05.346Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 16, 27, 'Ary ny sisa amin’ny tantaran’i Omry, dia izay nataony sy ny hery nentiny nanao zavatra, tsy efa voasoratra ao amin’ny boky mirakitra ny tantara tamin’ny andron’ireo mpanjakan’ny Israely ve izany?', 'ary ny sisa amin’ny tantaran’i omry, dia izay nataony sy ny hery nentiny nanao zavatra, tsy efa voasoratra ao amin’ny boky mirakitra ny tantara tamin’ny andron’ireo mpanjakan’ny israely ve izany?'),
  ('6ab25a5116d01074c19ece31', '2026-09-22T10:37:05.346Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:05.346Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 16, 7, 'Tamin’ny alalan’i Jeho mpaminany zanak’i Hanany no nahatongavan’ny tenin’i Jehovah ho fanamelohana an’i Basa sy ny ankohonany. Nomelohina izy ireo noho ny ratsy rehetra nataony teo imason’i Jehovah, dia ny nanaovany izay hampahatezitra Azy noho ny asan’ny tanany, hany ka ho lasa toy ny ankohonan’i Jeroboama ny ankohonany. Nomelohina koa izy ireo noho ny namonoany an’i Nadaba.', 'tamin’ny alalan’i jeho mpaminany zanak’i hanany no nahatongavan’ny tenin’i jehovah ho fanamelohana an’i basa sy ny ankohonany. nomelohina izy ireo noho ny ratsy rehetra nataony teo imason’i jehovah, dia ny nanaovany izay hampahatezitra azy noho ny asan’ny tanany, hany ka ho lasa toy ny ankohonan’i jeroboama ny ankohonany. nomelohina koa izy ireo noho ny namonoany an’i nadaba.'),
  ('6ab25a5116d01074c19ece48', '2026-09-22T10:37:05.346Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:05.346Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 16, 30, 'Nanao izay ratsy teo imason’i Jehovah, mihoatra noho izay rehetra talohany, i Ahaba.', 'nanao izay ratsy teo imason’i jehovah, mihoatra noho izay rehetra talohany, i ahaba.'),
  ('6ab25a5116d01074c19ece43', '2026-09-22T10:37:05.346Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:05.346Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 16, 25, 'Ary nanao izay ratsy teo imason’i Jehovah foana i Omry, ary nanao ratsy mihoatra noho izay rehetra talohany aza izy.', 'ary nanao izay ratsy teo imason’i jehovah foana i omry, ary nanao ratsy mihoatra noho izay rehetra talohany aza izy.'),
  ('6ab25a5116d01074c19ece42', '2026-09-22T10:37:05.346Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:05.346Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 16, 24, 'Ary novidiny talenta volafotsy roa tamin’i Samera ny tendrombohitr’i Samaria. Koa nanorina tanàna teo amin’ilay tendrombohitra izy, ary Samaria no nataony anaran’ilay tanàna, araka ny anaran’i Samera, tompon’ilay tendrombohitra.', 'ary novidiny talenta volafotsy roa tamin’i samera ny tendrombohitr’i samaria. koa nanorina tanàna teo amin’ilay tendrombohitra izy, ary samaria no nataony anaran’ilay tanàna, araka ny anaran’i samera, tompon’ilay tendrombohitra.'),
  ('6ab25a5116d01074c19ece38', '2026-09-22T10:37:05.346Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:05.346Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 16, 14, 'Ary ny sisa amin’ny tantaran’i Elaha, mbamin’izay rehetra nataony, tsy efa voasoratra ao amin’ny boky mirakitra ny tantara tamin’ny andron’ireo mpanjakan’ny Israely ve izany?', 'ary ny sisa amin’ny tantaran’i elaha, mbamin’izay rehetra nataony, tsy efa voasoratra ao amin’ny boky mirakitra ny tantara tamin’ny andron’ireo mpanjakan’ny israely ve izany?'),
  ('6ab25a5116d01074c19ece49', '2026-09-22T10:37:05.346Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:05.346Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 16, 31, 'Toy ny hoe mbola tsy ampy azy ihany ny nandeha tamin’ny fahotan’i Jeroboama zanak’i Nebata, fa mbola nalainy ho vady koa i Jezebela zanakavavin’i Etibala mpanjakan’ny Sidonianina, ary lasa nanompo an’i Bala izy ka niankohoka teo anatrehany.', 'toy ny hoe mbola tsy ampy azy ihany ny nandeha tamin’ny fahotan’i jeroboama zanak’i nebata, fa mbola nalainy ho vady koa i jezebela zanakavavin’i etibala mpanjakan’ny sidonianina, ary lasa nanompo an’i bala izy ka niankohoka teo anatrehany.'),
  ('6ab25a5116d01074c19ece41', '2026-09-22T10:37:05.346Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:05.346Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 16, 23, 'Tamin’ny taona fahiraika amby telopolo nanjakan’i Asa mpanjakan’ny Joda, no lasa mpanjakan’ny Israely i Omry. Roa ambin’ny folo taona no nanjakany, ka ny enin-taona tamin’izany tao Tirza.', 'tamin’ny taona fahiraika amby telopolo nanjakan’i asa mpanjakan’ny joda, no lasa mpanjakan’ny israely i omry. roa ambin’ny folo taona no nanjakany, ka ny enin-taona tamin’izany tao tirza.'),
  ('6ab25a5116d01074c19ece3c', '2026-09-22T10:37:05.346Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:05.346Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 16, 18, 'Raha vao hitan’i Zimry fa voababo ny tanàna, dia niditra tao amin’ny tilikambo fonenana, izay anisan’ny tranon’ny mpanjaka izy. Dia nodorany ny tranon’ny mpanjaka mba ho kilan’ny afo tao izy. Koa maty izy,', 'raha vao hitan’i zimry fa voababo ny tanàna, dia niditra tao amin’ny tilikambo fonenana, izay anisan’ny tranon’ny mpanjaka izy. dia nodorany ny tranon’ny mpanjaka mba ho kilan’ny afo tao izy. koa maty izy,'),
  ('6ab25a5116d01074c19ece3d', '2026-09-22T10:37:05.346Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:05.346Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 16, 19, 'noho ny fahotana nataony, tamin’ny nanaovany izay ratsy teo imason’i Jehovah, ka nanaovany hoatran’i Jeroboama sy nandehanany tamin’ny fahotany, izay nampanotany ny Israely.', 'noho ny fahotana nataony, tamin’ny nanaovany izay ratsy teo imason’i jehovah, ka nanaovany hoatran’i jeroboama sy nandehanany tamin’ny fahotany, izay nampanotany ny israely.'),
  ('6ab25a5116d01074c19ece37', '2026-09-22T10:37:05.346Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:05.346Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 16, 13, 'noho ny fahotana rehetra nataon’i Basa sy ny fahotan’i Elaha zanany, dia ny fahotana izay nataon’izy ireo sy nampanotany ny Israely, rehefa nanao izay hahatezitra an’i Jehovah Andriamanitry ny Israely izy ireo noho ny sampiny tsy misy ilana azy.', 'noho ny fahotana rehetra nataon’i basa sy ny fahotan’i elaha zanany, dia ny fahotana izay nataon’izy ireo sy nampanotany ny israely, rehefa nanao izay hahatezitra an’i jehovah andriamanitry ny israely izy ireo noho ny sampiny tsy misy ilana azy.'),
  ('6ab25a5116d01074c19ece36', '2026-09-22T10:37:05.346Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:05.346Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 16, 12, 'Koa naringan’i Zimry daholo ny ankohonan’i Basa, araka ny tenin’i Jehovah izay nanamelohany an’i Basa tamin’ny alalan’i Jeho mpaminany,', 'koa naringan’i zimry daholo ny ankohonan’i basa, araka ny tenin’i jehovah izay nanamelohany an’i basa tamin’ny alalan’i jeho mpaminany,'),
  ('6ab25a5116d01074c19ece4b', '2026-09-22T10:37:05.346Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:05.346Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 16, 33, 'Ary nanao tsato-kazo masina koa izy. Koa nanao zavatra maro hampahatezitra an’i Jehovah Andriamanitry ny Israely i Ahaba, mihoatra noho ny mpanjaka rehetran’ny Israely izay talohany.', 'ary nanao tsato-kazo masina koa izy. koa nanao zavatra maro hampahatezitra an’i jehovah andriamanitry ny israely i ahaba, mihoatra noho ny mpanjaka rehetran’ny israely izay talohany.'),
  ('6ab25a5116d01074c19ece44', '2026-09-22T10:37:05.346Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:05.346Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 16, 26, 'Nanao hoatran’izay rehetra nataon’i Jeroboama zanak’i Nebata izy, dia ny fahotana izay nataony sy nampanotany ny Israely, rehefa nanao izay hahatezitra an’i Jehovah Andriamanitry ny Israely izy noho ny sampiny tsy misy ilana azy.', 'nanao hoatran’izay rehetra nataon’i jeroboama zanak’i nebata izy, dia ny fahotana izay nataony sy nampanotany ny israely, rehefa nanao izay hahatezitra an’i jehovah andriamanitry ny israely izy noho ny sampiny tsy misy ilana azy.'),
  ('6ab25a5116d01074c19ece3f', '2026-09-22T10:37:05.346Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:05.346Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 16, 21, 'Tamin’izay no nizara roa ny vahoakan’Israely, ka ny iray nomba an’i Tibny zanak’i Ginata mba hampanjaka azy, fa ny iray kosa nomba an’i Omry.', 'tamin’izay no nizara roa ny vahoakan’israely, ka ny iray nomba an’i tibny zanak’i ginata mba hampanjaka azy, fa ny iray kosa nomba an’i omry.'),
  ('6ab25a5116d01074c19ece2c', '2026-09-22T10:37:05.346Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:05.346Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 16, 2, '“Nasandratro avy tamin’ny vovoka ianao mba hotendreko ho mpitarika ny Israely oloko, nefa ianao mbola nanao hoatran’ny nataon’i Jeroboama, ka nampanota ny Israely oloko. Nampahatezitra ahy mantsy ny Israely noho ny fahotany.', '“nasandratro avy tamin’ny vovoka ianao mba hotendreko ho mpitarika ny israely oloko, nefa ianao mbola nanao hoatran’ny nataon’i jeroboama, ka nampanota ny israely oloko. nampahatezitra ahy mantsy ny israely noho ny fahotany.'),
  ('6ab25a5116d01074c19ece2b', '2026-09-22T10:37:05.346Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:05.346Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 16, 1, 'Tonga tamin’i Jeho zanak’i Hanany ny tenin’i Jehovah nanameloka an’i Basa, nanao hoe:', 'tonga tamin’i jeho zanak’i hanany ny tenin’i jehovah nanameloka an’i basa, nanao hoe:'),
  ('6ab25a5116d01074c19ece4a', '2026-09-22T10:37:05.346Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:05.346Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 16, 32, 'Nanorina alitara ho an’i Bala koa izy, tao an-tranon’i Bala izay naoriny tao Samaria.', 'nanorina alitara ho an’i bala koa izy, tao an-tranon’i bala izay naoriny tao samaria.'),
  ('6ab25a5116d01074c19ece3e', '2026-09-22T10:37:05.346Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:05.346Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 16, 20, 'Ary ny sisa amin’ny tantaran’i Zimry, mbamin’ny teti-dratsy nataony, tsy efa voasoratra ao amin’ny boky mirakitra ny tantara tamin’ny andron’ireo mpanjakan’ny Israely ve izany?', 'ary ny sisa amin’ny tantaran’i zimry, mbamin’ny teti-dratsy nataony, tsy efa voasoratra ao amin’ny boky mirakitra ny tantara tamin’ny andron’ireo mpanjakan’ny israely ve izany?'),
  ('6ab25a5116d01074c19ece2f', '2026-09-22T10:37:05.346Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:05.346Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 16, 5, 'Ary ny sisa amin’ny tantaran’i Basa, mbamin’izay nataony sy ny heriny, tsy efa voasoratra ao amin’ny boky mirakitra ny tantara tamin’ny andron’ireo mpanjakan’ny Israely ve izany?', 'ary ny sisa amin’ny tantaran’i basa, mbamin’izay nataony sy ny heriny, tsy efa voasoratra ao amin’ny boky mirakitra ny tantara tamin’ny andron’ireo mpanjakan’ny israely ve izany?'),
  ('6ab25a5116d01074c19ece3a', '2026-09-22T10:37:05.346Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:05.346Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 16, 16, 'Ary ren’ny olona tany an-toby ihany nony farany fa nanao tetika hamelezana ny mpanjaka i Zimry, ka namono azy. Koa nalain’ny Israely rehetra i Omry lehiben’ny tafika, ka nataony mpanjakan’ny Israely tamin’izay andro izay, tao an-toby.', 'ary ren’ny olona tany an-toby ihany nony farany fa nanao tetika hamelezana ny mpanjaka i zimry, ka namono azy. koa nalain’ny israely rehetra i omry lehiben’ny tafika, ka nataony mpanjakan’ny israely tamin’izay andro izay, tao an-toby.'),
  ('6ab25a5116d01074c19ece47', '2026-09-22T10:37:05.346Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:05.346Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 16, 29, 'Koa i Ahaba zanak’i Omry no lasa mpanjakan’ny Israely tamin’ny taona fahavalo amby telopolo nanjakan’i Asa mpanjakan’ny Joda. Nanjaka teo amin’ny Israely tao Samaria roa amby roapolo taona i Ahaba zanak’i Omry.', 'koa i ahaba zanak’i omry no lasa mpanjakan’ny israely tamin’ny taona fahavalo amby telopolo nanjakan’i asa mpanjakan’ny joda. nanjaka teo amin’ny israely tao samaria roa amby roapolo taona i ahaba zanak’i omry.'),
  ('6ab25a5116d01074c19ece40', '2026-09-22T10:37:05.346Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:05.346Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 16, 22, 'Farany, dia resin’ny mpomba an’i Omry ny mpomba an’i Tibny zanak’i Ginata, ka maty i Tibny, ary nanomboka nanjaka i Omry.', 'farany, dia resin’ny mpomba an’i omry ny mpomba an’i tibny zanak’i ginata, ka maty i tibny, ary nanomboka nanjaka i omry.'),
  ('6ab25a5116d01074c19ece3b', '2026-09-22T10:37:05.346Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:05.346Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 16, 17, 'Dia niakatra avy tany Gibetona i Omry sy ny Israely rehetra, ka nanao fahirano an’i Tirza.', 'dia niakatra avy tany gibetona i omry sy ny israely rehetra, ka nanao fahirano an’i tirza.'),
  ('6ab25a5116d01074c19ece34', '2026-09-22T10:37:05.346Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:05.346Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 16, 10, 'Dia niditra i Zimry ka namono an’i Elaha tamin’ny taona fahafito amby roapolo nanjakan’i Asa mpanjakan’ny Joda. Ary i Zimry no nanjaka nandimby an’i Elaha.', 'dia niditra i zimry ka namono an’i elaha tamin’ny taona fahafito amby roapolo nanjakan’i asa mpanjakan’ny joda. ary i zimry no nanjaka nandimby an’i elaha.'),
  ('6ab25a5116d01074c19ece33', '2026-09-22T10:37:05.346Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:05.346Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 16, 9, 'Ary nanao tetika hamelezana azy i Zimry mpanompony, lehiben’ny antsasak’ireo kalesiny, raha mbola tao Tirza i Elaha ka nimamo tao an-tranon’i Arza, izay niandraikitra ny ankohonany tao Tirza.', 'ary nanao tetika hamelezana azy i zimry mpanompony, lehiben’ny antsasak’ireo kalesiny, raha mbola tao tirza i elaha ka nimamo tao an-tranon’i arza, izay niandraikitra ny ankohonany tao tirza.'),
  ('6ab25a5116d01074c19ece30', '2026-09-22T10:37:05.346Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:05.346Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 16, 6, 'Farany, dia nodimandry any amin’ny razany i Basa, ka nalevina tao Tirza. Ary i Elaha zanany no nanjaka nandimby azy.', 'farany, dia nodimandry any amin’ny razany i basa, ka nalevina tao tirza. ary i elaha zanany no nanjaka nandimby azy.'),
  ('6ab25a5116d01074c19ece4c', '2026-09-22T10:37:05.346Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:05.346Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 16, 34, 'Tamin’ny andron’i Ahaba no nanorenan’i Hiela Betelita an’i Jeriko. Koa maty i Abirama lahimatoany noho ny nanaovany ny fototra, ary maty i Segoba faralahiny noho ny nananganany ny vavahadiny, araka ny tenin’i Jehovah tamin’ny alalan’i Josoa zanak’i Nona.', 'tamin’ny andron’i ahaba no nanorenan’i hiela betelita an’i jeriko. koa maty i abirama lahimatoany noho ny nanaovany ny fototra, ary maty i segoba faralahiny noho ny nananganany ny vavahadiny, araka ny tenin’i jehovah tamin’ny alalan’i josoa zanak’i nona.'),
  ('6ab25a5116d01074c19ece32', '2026-09-22T10:37:05.346Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:05.346Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 16, 8, 'Tamin’ny taona fahenina amby roapolo nanjakan’i Asa mpanjakan’ny Joda, no lasa mpanjakan’ny Israely tao Tirza i Elaha zanak’i Basa, ary nanjaka roa taona izy.', 'tamin’ny taona fahenina amby roapolo nanjakan’i asa mpanjakan’ny joda, no lasa mpanjakan’ny israely tao tirza i elaha zanak’i basa, ary nanjaka roa taona izy.'),
  ('6ab25a5116d01074c19ece2e', '2026-09-22T10:37:05.346Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:05.346Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 16, 4, 'Koa izay ankohonan’i Basa maty ao an-tanàna dia hohanin’ny alika, ary izay maty any an-tsaha kosa hohanin’ny voro-manidina.”', 'koa izay ankohonan’i basa maty ao an-tanàna dia hohanin’ny alika, ary izay maty any an-tsaha kosa hohanin’ny voro-manidina.”'),
  ('6ab25a5116d01074c19ece35', '2026-09-22T10:37:05.346Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:05.346Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 16, 11, 'Raha vao nanjaka i Zimry ka nipetraka teo amin’ny seza fiandrianany, dia novonoiny daholo ny ankohonan’i Basa. Tsy nasiany niangana ny lahy rehetra anisan’ny ankohonany, sy ny havany mpamaly ra, ary ny namany.', 'raha vao nanjaka i zimry ka nipetraka teo amin’ny seza fiandrianany, dia novonoiny daholo ny ankohonan’i basa. tsy nasiany niangana ny lahy rehetra anisan’ny ankohonany, sy ny havany mpamaly ra, ary ny namany.'),
  ('6ab25a5116d01074c19ece2d', '2026-09-22T10:37:05.346Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:05.346Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 16, 3, 'Koa hofongorako tanteraka i Basa sy ny ankohonany, ka hataoko sahala amin’ny ankohonan’i Jeroboama zanak’i Nebata.', 'koa hofongorako tanteraka i basa sy ny ankohonany, ka hataoko sahala amin’ny ankohonan’i jeroboama zanak’i nebata.'),
  ('6ab25a5156cba8eb7e14d046', '2026-09-22T10:37:05.873Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:05.873Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 17, 8, 'Dia tonga taminy ny tenin’i Jehovah hoe:', 'dia tonga taminy ny tenin’i jehovah hoe:'),
  ('6ab25a5156cba8eb7e14d043', '2026-09-22T10:37:05.873Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:05.873Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 17, 5, 'Dia lasa avy hatrany i Elia, ka nanao araka ny tenin’i Jehovah. Koa nandeha izy ka nonina tany amin’ny lohasaha falehan-driakan’i Kerita, any atsinanan’i Jordana.', 'dia lasa avy hatrany i elia, ka nanao araka ny tenin’i jehovah. koa nandeha izy ka nonina tany amin’ny lohasaha falehan-driakan’i kerita, any atsinanan’i jordana.'),
  ('6ab25a5156cba8eb7e14d048', '2026-09-22T10:37:05.873Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:05.873Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 17, 10, 'Koa nitsangana izy ka nankany Zarefata, dia nankao amin’ny fidirana amin’ilay tanàna. Ary nisy vehivavy mpitondratena naka kitay teo. Dia niantso azy i Elia, ka nanao hoe: “Mba itondray rano kely anaty kaopy re aho hosotroiko e!”', 'koa nitsangana izy ka nankany zarefata, dia nankao amin’ny fidirana amin’ilay tanàna. ary nisy vehivavy mpitondratena naka kitay teo. dia niantso azy i elia, ka nanao hoe: “mba itondray rano kely anaty kaopy re aho hosotroiko e!”'),
  ('6ab25a5156cba8eb7e14d044', '2026-09-22T10:37:05.873Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:05.873Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 17, 6, 'Ny goaika no nitondra mofo sy hena ho azy rehefa maraina sy hariva, ary ny rano teo amin’ilay lohasaha falehan-driaka no nosotroiny.', 'ny goaika no nitondra mofo sy hena ho azy rehefa maraina sy hariva, ary ny rano teo amin’ilay lohasaha falehan-driaka no nosotroiny.'),
  ('6ab25a5156cba8eb7e14d041', '2026-09-22T10:37:05.873Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:05.873Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 17, 3, '“Mialà eto ka mivilia miantsinanana ary miafena any amin’ny lohasaha falehan-driakan’i Kerita, any atsinanan’i Jordana.', '“mialà eto ka mivilia miantsinanana ary miafena any amin’ny lohasaha falehan-driakan’i kerita, any atsinanan’i jordana.'),
  ('6ab25a5156cba8eb7e14d03f', '2026-09-22T10:37:05.873Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:05.873Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 17, 1, 'Ary niteny tamin’i Ahaba i Elia Tisbita, izay anisan’ny mponin’i Gileada, hoe: “Raha mbola velona koa i Jehovah Andriamanitry ny Israely, izay eo anatrehany no itsanganako, dia tsy hisy ando na orana mandritra ny taona maro, raha tsy noho ny baiko avy amiko!”', 'ary niteny tamin’i ahaba i elia tisbita, izay anisan’ny mponin’i gileada, hoe: “raha mbola velona koa i jehovah andriamanitry ny israely, izay eo anatrehany no itsanganako, dia tsy hisy ando na orana mandritra ny taona maro, raha tsy noho ny baiko avy amiko!”'),
  ('6ab25a5156cba8eb7e14d045', '2026-09-22T10:37:05.873Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:05.873Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 17, 7, 'Ritra anefa ny rano teo amin’ilay lohasaha rehefa afaka andro maromaro, satria tsy nisy oram-be nilatsaka tamin’ny tany.', 'ritra anefa ny rano teo amin’ilay lohasaha rehefa afaka andro maromaro, satria tsy nisy oram-be nilatsaka tamin’ny tany.'),
  ('6ab25a5156cba8eb7e14d040', '2026-09-22T10:37:05.873Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:05.873Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 17, 2, 'Dia tonga tamin’i Elia ny tenin’i Jehovah hoe:', 'dia tonga tamin’i elia ny tenin’i jehovah hoe:'),
  ('6ab25a5156cba8eb7e14d047', '2026-09-22T10:37:05.873Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:05.873Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 17, 9, '“Mitsangàna ka mandehana any Zarefata any Sidona, ary mijanòna any. Misy vehivavy mpitondratena efa nasaiko hanome sakafo anao any.”', '“mitsangàna ka mandehana any zarefata any sidona, ary mijanòna any. misy vehivavy mpitondratena efa nasaiko hanome sakafo anao any.”'),
  ('6ab25a5156cba8eb7e14d042', '2026-09-22T10:37:05.873Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:05.873Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 17, 4, 'Ary ny rano eo amin’ilay lohasaha no hosotroinao, ary ny goaika no hodidiako hanome sakafo anao any.”', 'ary ny rano eo amin’ilay lohasaha no hosotroinao, ary ny goaika no hodidiako hanome sakafo anao any.”'),
  ('6ab25a5156cba8eb7e14d056', '2026-09-22T10:37:05.874Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:05.874Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 17, 24, 'Ary hoy ravehivavy tamin’i Elia: “Tena fantatro tokoa izao fa lehilahin’Andriamanitra ianao, ary marina ny tenin’i Jehovah aloaky ny vavanao.”', 'ary hoy ravehivavy tamin’i elia: “tena fantatro tokoa izao fa lehilahin’andriamanitra ianao, ary marina ny tenin’i jehovah aloaky ny vavanao.”'),
  ('6ab25a5156cba8eb7e14d052', '2026-09-22T10:37:05.874Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:05.874Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 17, 20, 'Dia niantso an’i Jehovah izy hoe: “Ry Jehovah Andriamanitro ô, nahatonga loza tamin’ity mpitondratena ivahiniako ity koa ve ianao ka nahafaty ny zanany?”', 'dia niantso an’i jehovah izy hoe: “ry jehovah andriamanitro ô, nahatonga loza tamin’ity mpitondratena ivahiniako ity koa ve ianao ka nahafaty ny zanany?”'),
  ('6ab25a5156cba8eb7e14d051', '2026-09-22T10:37:05.874Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:05.874Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 17, 19, 'Fa hoy i Elia taminy: “Atolory ahy ny zanakao.” Dia noraisiny avy teo an-tratran-dravehivavy ilay ankizy, ary nentiny niakatra tao amin’ilay efitra nipetrahany tany an-tampon-trano, ka nataony teo ambony fandrianany.', 'fa hoy i elia taminy: “atolory ahy ny zanakao.” dia noraisiny avy teo an-tratran-dravehivavy ilay ankizy, ary nentiny niakatra tao amin’ilay efitra nipetrahany tany an-tampon-trano, ka nataony teo ambony fandrianany.'),
  ('6ab25a5156cba8eb7e14d049', '2026-09-22T10:37:05.874Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:05.874Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 17, 11, 'Ary raha iny izy lasa naka rano iny, dia niantso azy indray i Elia, ary niteny hoe: “Dia mba itondray mofo kely koa aho, azafady.”', 'ary raha iny izy lasa naka rano iny, dia niantso azy indray i elia, ary niteny hoe: “dia mba itondray mofo kely koa aho, azafady.”'),
  ('6ab25a5156cba8eb7e14d04f', '2026-09-22T10:37:05.874Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:05.874Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 17, 17, 'Narary ny zanak’ilay vehivavy tompon-trano, taorian’izay. Tena narary mafy ilay ankizilahy, ka tsy nisy fofonaina intsony tao aminy.', 'narary ny zanak’ilay vehivavy tompon-trano, taorian’izay. tena narary mafy ilay ankizilahy, ka tsy nisy fofonaina intsony tao aminy.'),
  ('6ab25a5156cba8eb7e14d054', '2026-09-22T10:37:05.874Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:05.874Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 17, 22, 'Farany, dia nihaino an’i Elia i Jehovah ka niverina ny ain’ilay ankizy, ary velona indray izy.', 'farany, dia nihaino an’i elia i jehovah ka niverina ny ain’ilay ankizy, ary velona indray izy.'),
  ('6ab25a5156cba8eb7e14d053', '2026-09-22T10:37:05.874Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:05.874Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 17, 21, 'Dia nitsotra intelo teo ambonin’ilay ankizy izy, sady niantso an’i Jehovah hoe: “Ry Jehovah Andriamanitro ô! Mba ataovy re izay hampiverina ny ain’ity ankizy ity e!”', 'dia nitsotra intelo teo ambonin’ilay ankizy izy, sady niantso an’i jehovah hoe: “ry jehovah andriamanitro ô! mba ataovy re izay hampiverina ny ain’ity ankizy ity e!”'),
  ('6ab25a5156cba8eb7e14d04d', '2026-09-22T10:37:05.874Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:05.874Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 17, 15, 'Dia lasa ravehivavy, ka nanao araka ny tenin’i Elia. Ary nanan-kohanina nandritra ny andro maro ravehivavy sy Elia ary ny ankohonan-dravehivavy.', 'dia lasa ravehivavy, ka nanao araka ny tenin’i elia. ary nanan-kohanina nandritra ny andro maro ravehivavy sy elia ary ny ankohonan-dravehivavy.'),
  ('6ab25a5156cba8eb7e14d04e', '2026-09-22T10:37:05.874Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:05.874Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 17, 16, 'Tsy lany ny lafarinina tao anatin’ilay siny lehibe, ary tsy ritra ny menaka tao anatin’ilay siny kely, araka ny tenin’i Jehovah tamin’ny alalan’i Elia.', 'tsy lany ny lafarinina tao anatin’ilay siny lehibe, ary tsy ritra ny menaka tao anatin’ilay siny kely, araka ny tenin’i jehovah tamin’ny alalan’i elia.'),
  ('6ab25a5156cba8eb7e14d04a', '2026-09-22T10:37:05.874Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:05.874Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 17, 12, 'Fa hoy ravehivavy: “Raha mbola velona koa i Jehovah Andriamanitrao, dia tsy manana mofo aho. Tsy manana afa-tsy lafarinina eran-tanan’ila ao anaty siny lehibe sy menaka kely ao anaty siny kely aho. Maka kitay vitsivitsy aho izao, dia hiditra hikarakara sakafo ho anay mianaka. Dia hihinana izahay, ary ho faty avy eo.”', 'fa hoy ravehivavy: “raha mbola velona koa i jehovah andriamanitrao, dia tsy manana mofo aho. tsy manana afa-tsy lafarinina eran-tanan’ila ao anaty siny lehibe sy menaka kely ao anaty siny kely aho. maka kitay vitsivitsy aho izao, dia hiditra hikarakara sakafo ho anay mianaka. dia hihinana izahay, ary ho faty avy eo.”'),
  ('6ab25a5156cba8eb7e14d04b', '2026-09-22T10:37:05.874Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:05.874Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 17, 13, 'Dia hoy i Elia taminy: “Aza matahotra. Midira, ka manaova araka ny teninao. Fa anaovy mofo kely boribory anankiray amin’izay misy ao fotsiny aho aloha, ka ento etỳ amiko. Avy eo, dia afaka mikarakara sakafo ho anareo mianaka ianao.', 'dia hoy i elia taminy: “aza matahotra. midira, ka manaova araka ny teninao. fa anaovy mofo kely boribory anankiray amin’izay misy ao fotsiny aho aloha, ka ento etỳ amiko. avy eo, dia afaka mikarakara sakafo ho anareo mianaka ianao.'),
  ('6ab25a5156cba8eb7e14d055', '2026-09-22T10:37:05.874Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:05.874Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 17, 23, 'Dia noraisin’i Elia ilay ankizy, ka nentiny nidina avy tao amin’ilay efitra tany an-tampon-trano, ary natolony an-dreniny tao an-trano. Dia hoy i Elia: “Io fa velona ny zanakao.”', 'dia noraisin’i elia ilay ankizy, ka nentiny nidina avy tao amin’ilay efitra tany an-tampon-trano, ary natolony an-dreniny tao an-trano. dia hoy i elia: “io fa velona ny zanakao.”'),
  ('6ab25a5156cba8eb7e14d050', '2026-09-22T10:37:05.874Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:05.874Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 17, 18, 'Dia hoy ravehivavy tamin’i Elia: “Misy zavatra iombonako aminao angaha moa, ry lehilahin’Andriamanitra ô? Tonga atỳ amiko ianao mba hampahatsiahy ny fahotako sy hamono ny zanako.”', 'dia hoy ravehivavy tamin’i elia: “misy zavatra iombonako aminao angaha moa, ry lehilahin’andriamanitra ô? tonga atỳ amiko ianao mba hampahatsiahy ny fahotako sy hamono ny zanako.”'),
  ('6ab25a5156cba8eb7e14d04c', '2026-09-22T10:37:05.874Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:05.874Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 17, 14, 'Fa izao no lazain’i Jehovah Andriamanitry ny Israely: ‘Tsy ho lany ny lafarinina ao anatin’ilay siny lehibe, ary tsy ho ritra ny menaka ao anatin’ilay siny kely, mandra-pahatongan’ny andro handatsahan’i Jehovah oram-be amin’ny tany.’”', 'fa izao no lazain’i jehovah andriamanitry ny israely: ‘tsy ho lany ny lafarinina ao anatin’ilay siny lehibe, ary tsy ho ritra ny menaka ao anatin’ilay siny kely, mandra-pahatongan’ny andro handatsahan’i jehovah oram-be amin’ny tany.’”'),
  ('6ab25a528b7e6644e898ee7b', '2026-09-22T10:37:06.500Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:06.500Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 18, 33, 'Avy eo dia nalahany ny kitay ary norasarasainy ilay vantotr’ombilahy ka napetrany teo ambony kitay. Dia hoy izy: “Fenoy rano ny siny lehibe efatra, ka araraho eo amin’ny fanatitra dorana sy ny kitay.”', 'avy eo dia nalahany ny kitay ary norasarasainy ilay vantotr’ombilahy ka napetrany teo ambony kitay. dia hoy izy: “fenoy rano ny siny lehibe efatra, ka araraho eo amin’ny fanatitra dorana sy ny kitay.”'),
  ('6ab25a528b7e6644e898ee7d', '2026-09-22T10:37:06.500Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:06.500Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 18, 35, 'Koa niraraka nanodidina ny alitara ny rano. Ary nofenoin’i Elia rano koa ny tatatra.', 'koa niraraka nanodidina ny alitara ny rano. ary nofenoin’i elia rano koa ny tatatra.'),
  ('6ab25a528b7e6644e898ee79', '2026-09-22T10:37:06.500Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:06.500Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 18, 31, 'Koa naka vato roa ambin’ny folo izy, araka ny isan’ny fokon’ny zanak’i Jakoba, izay nilazan’i Jehovah hoe: “Hatao hoe Israely ny anaranao.”', 'koa naka vato roa ambin’ny folo izy, araka ny isan’ny fokon’ny zanak’i jakoba, izay nilazan’i jehovah hoe: “hatao hoe israely ny anaranao.”'),
  ('6ab25a528b7e6644e898ee6f', '2026-09-22T10:37:06.500Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:06.500Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 18, 21, 'Ary nankeo amin’ny olona rehetra i Elia, ka nanao hoe: “Mandra-pahoviana ianareo no hiroa saina? * Raha i Jehovah no tena Andriamanitra, dia manaraha azy. Fa raha i Bala kosa, dia manaraha azy.” Tsy namaly azy anefa ny olona na indraim-bava aza.', 'ary nankeo amin’ny olona rehetra i elia, ka nanao hoe: “mandra-pahoviana ianareo no hiroa saina? * raha i jehovah no tena andriamanitra, dia manaraha azy. fa raha i bala kosa, dia manaraha azy.” tsy namaly azy anefa ny olona na indraim-bava aza.'),
  ('6ab25a528b7e6644e898ee64', '2026-09-22T10:37:06.500Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:06.500Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 18, 10, 'Raha mbola velona koa i Jehovah Andriamanitrao, dia tsy nisy firenena na fanjakana tsy nandefasan’ny tompoko olona hitady anao. Ary rehefa niteny ireny hoe: ‘Tsy atỳ izy’, dia nasainy nianiana izany firenena sy fanjakana izany hoe tena tsy nahita anao tokoa.', 'raha mbola velona koa i jehovah andriamanitrao, dia tsy nisy firenena na fanjakana tsy nandefasan’ny tompoko olona hitady anao. ary rehefa niteny ireny hoe: ‘tsy atỳ izy’, dia nasainy nianiana izany firenena sy fanjakana izany hoe tena tsy nahita anao tokoa.'),
  ('6ab25a528b7e6644e898ee7e', '2026-09-22T10:37:06.500Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:06.501Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 18, 36, 'Tamin’ny fotoana fanolorana ny fanatitra varimbazaha, dia nanatona i Elia mpaminany ka nanao hoe: “Ry Jehovah Andriamanitr’i Abrahama sy Isaka ary Israely ô! Aoka ho fantatra anio fa ianao no Andriamanitra eo amin’ny Israely, ary izaho dia mpanomponao, ka araka ny teninao no nanaovako izao zavatra rehetra izao.', 'tamin’ny fotoana fanolorana ny fanatitra varimbazaha, dia nanatona i elia mpaminany ka nanao hoe: “ry jehovah andriamanitr’i abrahama sy isaka ary israely ô! aoka ho fantatra anio fa ianao no andriamanitra eo amin’ny israely, ary izaho dia mpanomponao, ka araka ny teninao no nanaovako izao zavatra rehetra izao.'),
  ('6ab25a528b7e6644e898ee69', '2026-09-22T10:37:06.500Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:06.500Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 18, 15, 'Hoy anefa i Elia: “Raha mbola velona koa i Jehovah Tompon’ny tafika, izay eo anatrehany no itsanganako, dia hiseho amin’i Ahaba aho anio.”', 'hoy anefa i elia: “raha mbola velona koa i jehovah tompon’ny tafika, izay eo anatrehany no itsanganako, dia hiseho amin’i ahaba aho anio.”'),
  ('6ab25a528b7e6644e898ee73', '2026-09-22T10:37:06.500Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:06.500Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 18, 25, 'Ary hoy i Elia tamin’ireo mpaminanin’i Bala: “Fidio izay vantotr’ombilahy ho anareo, ka karakarao aloha fa ianareo no maro an’isa. Ary antsoy ny anaran’ny andriamanitrareo. Aza asiana afo anefa eo.”', 'ary hoy i elia tamin’ireo mpaminanin’i bala: “fidio izay vantotr’ombilahy ho anareo, ka karakarao aloha fa ianareo no maro an’isa. ary antsoy ny anaran’ny andriamanitrareo. aza asiana afo anefa eo.”'),
  ('6ab25a528b7e6644e898ee6b', '2026-09-22T10:37:06.500Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:06.500Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 18, 17, 'Raha vao nahita an’i Elia i Ahaba, dia nilaza taminy hoe: “Ianao ve ity, ry ilay nahatonga loza tamin’ny Israely?”', 'raha vao nahita an’i elia i ahaba, dia nilaza taminy hoe: “ianao ve ity, ry ilay nahatonga loza tamin’ny israely?”'),
  ('6ab25a528b7e6644e898ee63', '2026-09-22T10:37:06.500Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:06.500Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 18, 9, 'Fa hoy i Obadia: “Fa dia inona loatra no fahotana vitako no atolotrao eo an-tanan’i Ahaba ity mpanomponao mba hamonoany ahy ho faty?', 'fa hoy i obadia: “fa dia inona loatra no fahotana vitako no atolotrao eo an-tanan’i ahaba ity mpanomponao mba hamonoany ahy ho faty?'),
  ('6ab25a528b7e6644e898ee62', '2026-09-22T10:37:06.500Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:06.500Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 18, 8, 'Dia hoy i Elia taminy: “Izaho ity! Mandehana, lazao amin’ny tomponao hoe: ‘Any i Elia!’”', 'dia hoy i elia taminy: “izaho ity! mandehana, lazao amin’ny tomponao hoe: ‘any i elia!’”'),
  ('6ab25a528b7e6644e898ee7c', '2026-09-22T10:37:06.500Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:06.500Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 18, 34, 'Ary hoy izy: “Asio indray.” Dia nasian’ireo indray. Hoy ihany izy: “Asio fanintelony.” Dia nasian’ireo fanintelony.', 'ary hoy izy: “asio indray.” dia nasian’ireo indray. hoy ihany izy: “asio fanintelony.” dia nasian’ireo fanintelony.'),
  ('6ab25a528b7e6644e898ee78', '2026-09-22T10:37:06.500Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:06.500Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 18, 30, 'Farany, dia hoy i Elia tamin’ny olona rehetra: “Manatòna ahy.” Koa nanatona azy ny olona rehetra. Dia namboarin’i Elia ilay alitaran’i Jehovah efa rava.', 'farany, dia hoy i elia tamin’ny olona rehetra: “manatòna ahy.” koa nanatona azy ny olona rehetra. dia namboarin’i elia ilay alitaran’i jehovah efa rava.'),
  ('6ab25a528b7e6644e898ee6c', '2026-09-22T10:37:06.500Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:06.500Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 18, 18, 'Ary hoy ny navalin’i Elia: “Tsy izaho no nahatonga loza tamin’ny Israely, fa ianao sy ny ankohonan-drainao, satria niala tamin’ny didin’i Jehovah ianareo, ka nanaraka an’ireo Bala.', 'ary hoy ny navalin’i elia: “tsy izaho no nahatonga loza tamin’ny israely, fa ianao sy ny ankohonan-drainao, satria niala tamin’ny didin’i jehovah ianareo, ka nanaraka an’ireo bala.'),
  ('6ab25a528b7e6644e898ee67', '2026-09-22T10:37:06.500Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:06.500Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 18, 13, 'Mbola tsy nolazaina tamin’ny tompoko angaha izay nataoko rehefa novonoin’i Jezebela ny mpaminanin’i Jehovah, dia ny nanafenako ny mpaminanin’i Jehovah zato lahy? Dimampolo avy no nataoko tao anaty lava-bato, ary nitondrako mofo sy rano izy ireo.', 'mbola tsy nolazaina tamin’ny tompoko angaha izay nataoko rehefa novonoin’i jezebela ny mpaminanin’i jehovah, dia ny nanafenako ny mpaminanin’i jehovah zato lahy? dimampolo avy no nataoko tao anaty lava-bato, ary nitondrako mofo sy rano izy ireo.'),
  ('6ab25a528b7e6644e898ee61', '2026-09-22T10:37:06.500Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:06.500Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 18, 7, 'Ary nifanena tamin’i Elia teny an-dalana i Obadia, ka fantany avy hatrany hoe i Elia io. Dia niankohoka izy ka nanao hoe: “Ianao ve ity, ry Elia tompoko?”', 'ary nifanena tamin’i elia teny an-dalana i obadia, ka fantany avy hatrany hoe i elia io. dia niankohoka izy ka nanao hoe: “ianao ve ity, ry elia tompoko?”'),
  ('6ab25a528b7e6644e898ee7a', '2026-09-22T10:37:06.500Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:06.500Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 18, 32, 'Dia nanamboatra alitara ho an’ny anaran’i Jehovah tamin’ireo vato ireo izy, sady nanisy tatatra manodidina an’ilay alitara, ka nitovitovy velarana amin’ny tany ampy hamafazana voa indroan’ny seha * ilay izy.', 'dia nanamboatra alitara ho an’ny anaran’i jehovah tamin’ireo vato ireo izy, sady nanisy tatatra manodidina an’ilay alitara, ka nitovitovy velarana amin’ny tany ampy hamafazana voa indroan’ny seha * ilay izy.'),
  ('6ab25a528b7e6644e898ee76', '2026-09-22T10:37:06.500Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:06.500Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 18, 28, 'Dia niantsoantso faran’izay mafy izy ireo. Ary nandidididy ny vatany tamin’ny sabatra kely sy ny lefona izy ireo araka ny fanaony, mandra-pikorianan’ny ra tamin’ny tenany.', 'dia niantsoantso faran’izay mafy izy ireo. ary nandidididy ny vatany tamin’ny sabatra kely sy ny lefona izy ireo araka ny fanaony, mandra-pikorianan’ny ra tamin’ny tenany.'),
  ('6ab25a528b7e6644e898ee5e', '2026-09-22T10:37:06.500Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:06.500Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 18, 4, 'Rehefa nandringana an’ireo mpaminanin’i Jehovah mantsy i Jezebela, dia mpaminany zato no nalain’i Obadia ka nafeniny. Dimampolo avy no nataony tao anaty lava-bato, ary nitondrany mofo sy rano izy ireo.', 'rehefa nandringana an’ireo mpaminanin’i jehovah mantsy i jezebela, dia mpaminany zato no nalain’i obadia ka nafeniny. dimampolo avy no nataony tao anaty lava-bato, ary nitondrany mofo sy rano izy ireo.'),
  ('6ab25a528b7e6644e898ee5d', '2026-09-22T10:37:06.500Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:06.500Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 18, 3, 'Tao anatin’izany fotoana izany, dia nantsoin’i Ahaba i Obadia, izay niandraikitra ny ankohonany. Olona tena natahotra an’i Jehovah i Obadia.', 'tao anatin’izany fotoana izany, dia nantsoin’i ahaba i obadia, izay niandraikitra ny ankohonany. olona tena natahotra an’i jehovah i obadia.'),
  ('6ab25a528b7e6644e898ee5b', '2026-09-22T10:37:06.500Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:06.500Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 18, 1, 'Rehefa afaka andro maro, izany hoe tamin’ny taona fahatelo, dia tonga tamin’i Elia ny tenin’i Jehovah, nanao hoe: “Mandehana miseho amin’i Ahaba, fa handatsaka orana amin’ny tany aho.”', 'rehefa afaka andro maro, izany hoe tamin’ny taona fahatelo, dia tonga tamin’i elia ny tenin’i jehovah, nanao hoe: “mandehana miseho amin’i ahaba, fa handatsaka orana amin’ny tany aho.”'),
  ('6ab25a528b7e6644e898ee6a', '2026-09-22T10:37:06.500Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:06.500Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 18, 16, 'Dia nankany amin’i Ahaba i Obadia ka nilaza izany taminy. Koa nankany amin’i Elia i Ahaba.', 'dia nankany amin’i ahaba i obadia ka nilaza izany taminy. koa nankany amin’i elia i ahaba.'),
  ('6ab25a528b7e6644e898ee60', '2026-09-22T10:37:06.500Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:06.500Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 18, 6, 'Dia nozarain’izy ireo ny tany tokony hotetezina, ka i Ahaba nandeha irery tamin’ny lalana iray, ary i Obadia kosa nandeha irery tamin’ny lalana iray.', 'dia nozarain’izy ireo ny tany tokony hotetezina, ka i ahaba nandeha irery tamin’ny lalana iray, ary i obadia kosa nandeha irery tamin’ny lalana iray.'),
  ('6ab25a528b7e6644e898ee77', '2026-09-22T10:37:06.500Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:06.500Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 18, 29, 'Efa dila ny mitataovovonana, nefa mbola nanao hoatran’ny mpaminany teo foana izy ireo, mandra-pahatongan’ny fotoana fanolorana ny fanatitra varimbazaha. Mbola tsy nisy feo re ihany anefa, sady tsy nisy namaly na nihaino.', 'efa dila ny mitataovovonana, nefa mbola nanao hoatran’ny mpaminany teo foana izy ireo, mandra-pahatongan’ny fotoana fanolorana ny fanatitra varimbazaha. mbola tsy nisy feo re ihany anefa, sady tsy nisy namaly na nihaino.'),
  ('6ab25a528b7e6644e898ee70', '2026-09-22T10:37:06.500Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:06.500Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 18, 22, 'Dia hoy koa i Elia tamin’ny olona: “Izaho irery sisa no mpaminanin’i Jehovah, fa ny mpaminanin’i Bala kosa dimampolo sy efajato.', 'dia hoy koa i elia tamin’ny olona: “izaho irery sisa no mpaminanin’i jehovah, fa ny mpaminanin’i bala kosa dimampolo sy efajato.'),
  ('6ab25a528b7e6644e898ee6e', '2026-09-22T10:37:06.500Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:06.500Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 18, 20, 'Dia naniraka olona tany amin’ny zanak’Israely rehetra i Ahaba, sady namory ny mpaminany rehetra ho any amin’ny Tendrombohitra Karmela.', 'dia naniraka olona tany amin’ny zanak’israely rehetra i ahaba, sady namory ny mpaminany rehetra ho any amin’ny tendrombohitra karmela.'),
  ('6ab25a528b7e6644e898ee65', '2026-09-22T10:37:06.500Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:06.500Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 18, 11, 'Izao anefa ianao manao hoe: ‘Mandehana, lazao amin’ny tomponao hoe: “Any i Elia!”’', 'izao anefa ianao manao hoe: ‘mandehana, lazao amin’ny tomponao hoe: “any i elia!”’'),
  ('6ab25a528b7e6644e898ee5f', '2026-09-22T10:37:06.500Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:06.500Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 18, 5, 'Ary hoy i Ahaba tamin’i Obadia: “Mandehana mitety ny tany, ho any amin’ny loharano rehetra sy ny lohasaha falehan-driaka rehetra. Angamba hahita ahi-maitso isika, ka ho voatsimbina ny ain’ny soavaly sy ny ramole, ary tsy hisy biby ho ripaka intsony.”', 'ary hoy i ahaba tamin’i obadia: “mandehana mitety ny tany, ho any amin’ny loharano rehetra sy ny lohasaha falehan-driaka rehetra. angamba hahita ahi-maitso isika, ka ho voatsimbina ny ain’ny soavaly sy ny ramole, ary tsy hisy biby ho ripaka intsony.”'),
  ('6ab25a528b7e6644e898ee5c', '2026-09-22T10:37:06.500Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:06.500Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 18, 2, 'Dia lasa i Elia mba hiseho tamin’i Ahaba, raha mbola mafy dia mafy ny mosary tany Samaria.', 'dia lasa i elia mba hiseho tamin’i ahaba, raha mbola mafy dia mafy ny mosary tany samaria.'),
  ('6ab25a528b7e6644e898ee75', '2026-09-22T10:37:06.500Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:06.500Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 18, 27, 'Ary nony mitataovovonana, dia nanesoeso azy ireo i Elia hoe: “Miantsoa faran’izay mafy fa andriamanitra izy. Tsy maintsy misy manahirana azy any, na te hivoaka * izy ka lasa any an-kabine. Na matory angamba izy ka tokony hifoha!”', 'ary nony mitataovovonana, dia nanesoeso azy ireo i elia hoe: “miantsoa faran’izay mafy fa andriamanitra izy. tsy maintsy misy manahirana azy any, na te hivoaka * izy ka lasa any an-kabine. na matory angamba izy ka tokony hifoha!”'),
  ('6ab25a528b7e6644e898ee72', '2026-09-22T10:37:06.500Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:06.500Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 18, 24, 'Ary antsoy ny anaran’ny andriamanitrareo, fa izaho kosa hiantso ny anaran’i Jehovah. Koa izay Andriamanitra mamaly amin’ny afo no tena Andriamanitra.” Dia namaly ny olona rehetra hoe: “Mety izany.”', 'ary antsoy ny anaran’ny andriamanitrareo, fa izaho kosa hiantso ny anaran’i jehovah. koa izay andriamanitra mamaly amin’ny afo no tena andriamanitra.” dia namaly ny olona rehetra hoe: “mety izany.”'),
  ('6ab25a528b7e6644e898ee71', '2026-09-22T10:37:06.500Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:06.500Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 18, 23, 'Koa aoka homena vantotr’ombilahy roa izahay, dia aoka ry zareo hifidy vantotr’ombilahy iray, ka handrasa azy ary hametraka azy eo ambony kitay, nefa tsy hanisy afo eo. Ary izaho kosa hikarakara an’ilay vantotr’ombilahy iray ka hametraka azy eo ambony kitay, nefa tsy hanisy afo eo koa.', 'koa aoka homena vantotr’ombilahy roa izahay, dia aoka ry zareo hifidy vantotr’ombilahy iray, ka handrasa azy ary hametraka azy eo ambony kitay, nefa tsy hanisy afo eo. ary izaho kosa hikarakara an’ilay vantotr’ombilahy iray ka hametraka azy eo ambony kitay, nefa tsy hanisy afo eo koa.'),
  ('6ab25a528b7e6644e898ee6d', '2026-09-22T10:37:06.500Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:06.500Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 18, 19, 'Koa maniraha olona, ka vorio ny Israely rehetra hankany amiko any amin’ny Tendrombohitra Karmela. Vorio koa ny mpaminanin’i Bala dimampolo sy efajato sy ny mpaminanin’ny tsato-kazo masina efajato, izay samy mihinana eo an-databatr’i Jezebela.”', 'koa maniraha olona, ka vorio ny israely rehetra hankany amiko any amin’ny tendrombohitra karmela. vorio koa ny mpaminanin’i bala dimampolo sy efajato sy ny mpaminanin’ny tsato-kazo masina efajato, izay samy mihinana eo an-databatr’i jezebela.”'),
  ('6ab25a528b7e6644e898ee68', '2026-09-22T10:37:06.500Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:06.500Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 18, 14, 'Izao anefa ianao manao hoe: ‘Mandehana, lazao amin’ny tomponao hoe: “Any i Elia!”’ Koa azo antoka fa hovonoiny ho faty aho.”', 'izao anefa ianao manao hoe: ‘mandehana, lazao amin’ny tomponao hoe: “any i elia!”’ koa azo antoka fa hovonoiny ho faty aho.”'),
  ('6ab25a528b7e6644e898ee66', '2026-09-22T10:37:06.500Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:06.500Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 18, 12, 'Azo antoka fa raha vao miala eto aminao aho, dia hoentin’ny fanahin’i Jehovah any amin’izay toerana tsy fantatro any ianao. Koa raha tonga any amin’i Ahaba aho ka milaza aminy, nefa tsy hahita anao izy, dia azo antoka fa hovonoiny ho faty aho. Efa hatramin’ny fahazazako anefa izaho mpanomponao no matahotra an’i Jehovah.', 'azo antoka fa raha vao miala eto aminao aho, dia hoentin’ny fanahin’i jehovah any amin’izay toerana tsy fantatro any ianao. koa raha tonga any amin’i ahaba aho ka milaza aminy, nefa tsy hahita anao izy, dia azo antoka fa hovonoiny ho faty aho. efa hatramin’ny fahazazako anefa izaho mpanomponao no matahotra an’i jehovah.'),
  ('6ab25a528b7e6644e898ee74', '2026-09-22T10:37:06.500Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:06.500Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 18, 26, 'Koa nalain’izy ireo ilay vantotr’ombilahy nomena azy, ka nokarakarainy. Dia niantso ny anaran’i Bala izy ireo hatramin’ny maraina ka mandra-pitataovovonan’ny andro, hoe: “Ry Bala ô, valio izahay!” Kanjo tsy nisy feo re, sady tsy nisy namaly. Dia tsy nitsahatra nihinjakinjaka nanodidina an’ilay alitara nataony izy ireo.', 'koa nalain’izy ireo ilay vantotr’ombilahy nomena azy, ka nokarakarainy. dia niantso ny anaran’i bala izy ireo hatramin’ny maraina ka mandra-pitataovovonan’ny andro, hoe: “ry bala ô, valio izahay!” kanjo tsy nisy feo re, sady tsy nisy namaly. dia tsy nitsahatra nihinjakinjaka nanodidina an’ilay alitara nataony izy ireo.'),
  ('6ab25a528b7e6644e898ee85', '2026-09-22T10:37:06.501Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:06.501Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 18, 43, 'Ary hoy izy tamin’ny mpanompony: “Miakara, azafady, ka mitazàna any an-dranomasina.” Dia niakatra izy ka nitazana, ary nanao hoe: “Tsy misy na inona na inona mihitsy any.” Hoy ihany i Elia: “Miverena indray.” Ary toy izany foana impito.', 'ary hoy izy tamin’ny mpanompony: “miakara, azafady, ka mitazàna any an-dranomasina.” dia niakatra izy ka nitazana, ary nanao hoe: “tsy misy na inona na inona mihitsy any.” hoy ihany i elia: “miverena indray.” ary toy izany foana impito.'),
  ('6ab25a528b7e6644e898ee84', '2026-09-22T10:37:06.501Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:06.501Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 18, 42, 'Dia niakatra i Ahaba mba hihinana sy hisotro. Fa i Elia kosa niakatra teo an-tampon’i Karmela, dia nipetraka nininginingina teo amin’ny tany, ka nataony teo anelanelan’ny lohaliny ny tarehiny.', 'dia niakatra i ahaba mba hihinana sy hisotro. fa i elia kosa niakatra teo an-tampon’i karmela, dia nipetraka nininginingina teo amin’ny tany, ka nataony teo anelanelan’ny lohaliny ny tarehiny.'),
  ('6ab25a528b7e6644e898ee88', '2026-09-22T10:37:06.501Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:06.501Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 18, 46, 'Ary nomba an’i Elia ny tanan’i Jehovah, ka nofeheziny teo amin’ny andilany ny akanjony, ary nihazakazaka teo alohan’i Ahaba izy mandra-pahatongany tany Jezirela.', 'ary nomba an’i elia ny tanan’i jehovah, ka nofeheziny teo amin’ny andilany ny akanjony, ary nihazakazaka teo alohan’i ahaba izy mandra-pahatongany tany jezirela.'),
  ('6ab25a528b7e6644e898ee87', '2026-09-22T10:37:06.501Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:06.501Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 18, 45, 'Nandritra izany fotoana izany, dia maintin’ny rahona ny lanitra ary nifofofofo ny rivotra, ka nirotsaka ny oram-be nivatravatra. Koa nitaingina ny kalesiny i Ahaba, ary nanezaka mafy ho tonga tany Jezirela.', 'nandritra izany fotoana izany, dia maintin’ny rahona ny lanitra ary nifofofofo ny rivotra, ka nirotsaka ny oram-be nivatravatra. koa nitaingina ny kalesiny i ahaba, ary nanezaka mafy ho tonga tany jezirela.'),
  ('6ab25a528b7e6644e898ee82', '2026-09-22T10:37:06.501Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:06.501Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 18, 40, 'Dia hoy i Elia tamin’izy ireo: “Sambory ireo mpaminanin’i Bala! Aza avela hisy ho afa-mandositra na iray aza!” Koa nosamborin’ny olona avy hatrany izy ireo, ka nentin’i Elia nidina nankany amin’ny lohasaha falehan-driakan’i Kisona, dia novonoiny tany.', 'dia hoy i elia tamin’izy ireo: “sambory ireo mpaminanin’i bala! aza avela hisy ho afa-mandositra na iray aza!” koa nosamborin’ny olona avy hatrany izy ireo, ka nentin’i elia nidina nankany amin’ny lohasaha falehan-driakan’i kisona, dia novonoiny tany.'),
  ('6ab25a528b7e6644e898ee83', '2026-09-22T10:37:06.501Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:06.501Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 18, 41, 'Ary hoy i Elia tamin’i Ahaba: “Miakara ka mihinàna sy misotroa, fa injany ny feon’ny oram-be mivatravatra.”', 'ary hoy i elia tamin’i ahaba: “miakara ka mihinàna sy misotroa, fa injany ny feon’ny oram-be mivatravatra.”'),
  ('6ab25a528b7e6644e898ee80', '2026-09-22T10:37:06.501Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:06.501Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 18, 38, 'Dia nilatsaka ny afon’i Jehovah ka nandevona ny fanatitra dorana sy ny kitay sy ny vato ary ny vovoka. Ritran’ny afo koa ny rano tao amin’ilay tatatra.', 'dia nilatsaka ny afon’i jehovah ka nandevona ny fanatitra dorana sy ny kitay sy ny vato ary ny vovoka. ritran’ny afo koa ny rano tao amin’ilay tatatra.'),
  ('6ab25a528b7e6644e898ee7f', '2026-09-22T10:37:06.501Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:06.501Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 18, 37, 'Valio aho, Jehovah ô! Valio aho mba ho fantatr’ireto vahoaka ireto fa ianao, Jehovah ô, no tena Andriamanitra, ary ianao no nampiverina indray ny fon’izy ireo.”', 'valio aho, jehovah ô! valio aho mba ho fantatr’ireto vahoaka ireto fa ianao, jehovah ô, no tena andriamanitra, ary ianao no nampiverina indray ny fon’izy ireo.”'),
  ('6ab25a528b7e6644e898ee86', '2026-09-22T10:37:06.501Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:06.501Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 18, 44, 'Ary tamin’ny fanimpitony, dia hoy ilay mpanompo: “Iny misy rahona kely hoatran’ny felatanana miakatra avy eny an-dranomasina.” Dia hoy i Elia: “Miakara, ka lazao amin’i Ahaba hoe: ‘Omano ny kalesinao, ary midìna sao ho voasakan’ny oram-be ianao!’”', 'ary tamin’ny fanimpitony, dia hoy ilay mpanompo: “iny misy rahona kely hoatran’ny felatanana miakatra avy eny an-dranomasina.” dia hoy i elia: “miakara, ka lazao amin’i ahaba hoe: ‘omano ny kalesinao, ary midìna sao ho voasakan’ny oram-be ianao!’”'),
  ('6ab25a528b7e6644e898ee81', '2026-09-22T10:37:06.501Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:06.501Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 18, 39, 'Rehefa nahita izany ny olona rehetra, dia niankohoka avy hatrany ka nanao hoe: “I Jehovah no tena Andriamanitra! I Jehovah no tena Andriamanitra!”', 'rehefa nahita izany ny olona rehetra, dia niankohoka avy hatrany ka nanao hoe: “i jehovah no tena andriamanitra! i jehovah no tena andriamanitra!”'),
  ('6ab25a53028c980d3d472079', '2026-09-22T10:37:07.528Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:07.528Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 19, 1, 'Ary nolazain’i Ahaba tamin’i Jezebela daholo ny nataon’i Elia, sy ny namonoan’i Elia ny mpaminany rehetra tamin’ny sabatra.', 'ary nolazain’i ahaba tamin’i jezebela daholo ny nataon’i elia, sy ny namonoan’i elia ny mpaminany rehetra tamin’ny sabatra.'),
  ('6ab25a53028c980d3d47207a', '2026-09-22T10:37:07.528Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:07.528Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 19, 2, 'Dia nampitondra hafatra tany amin’i Elia i Jezebela, nanao hoe: “Hofaizin’ireo andriamanitra anie aho, * ary mihoatra noho izany aza, raha tsy hataoko sahala amin’ny ain’ny tsirairay amin’ireny ny ainao rahampitso toy izao!”', 'dia nampitondra hafatra tany amin’i elia i jezebela, nanao hoe: “hofaizin’ireo andriamanitra anie aho, * ary mihoatra noho izany aza, raha tsy hataoko sahala amin’ny ain’ny tsirairay amin’ireny ny ainao rahampitso toy izao!”'),
  ('6ab25a53028c980d3d47207b', '2026-09-22T10:37:07.528Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:07.528Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 19, 3, 'Dia natahotra i Elia ka nandositra mba hamonjy ny ainy. Koa tonga tany Beri-sheba any Joda izy, ary navelany tao ny mpanompony,', 'dia natahotra i elia ka nandositra mba hamonjy ny ainy. koa tonga tany beri-sheba any joda izy, ary navelany tao ny mpanompony,'),
  ('6ab25a53028c980d3d47207c', '2026-09-22T10:37:07.528Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:07.528Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 19, 4, 'fa izy kosa nandeha lalana indray andro tany an-tany efitra. Farany, dia tonga izy ka nipetraka teo ambany anjavidy iray. Ary nangataka ny ho faty izy, * ka nanao hoe: “Aoka izay! Esory amin’izay ny aiko, Jehovah ô, fa tsy tsara noho ny razako aho.”', 'fa izy kosa nandeha lalana indray andro tany an-tany efitra. farany, dia tonga izy ka nipetraka teo ambany anjavidy iray. ary nangataka ny ho faty izy, * ka nanao hoe: “aoka izay! esory amin’izay ny aiko, jehovah ô, fa tsy tsara noho ny razako aho.”'),
  ('6ab25a53028c980d3d47207d', '2026-09-22T10:37:07.528Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:07.528Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 19, 5, 'Ary nandry izy ka resin-tory teo ambanin’ilay anjavidy. Dia nisy anjely nikasika azy ka nanao taminy hoe: “Miarena ka mihinàna.”', 'ary nandry izy ka resin-tory teo ambanin’ilay anjavidy. dia nisy anjely nikasika azy ka nanao taminy hoe: “miarena ka mihinàna.”'),
  ('6ab25a53028c980d3d47207e', '2026-09-22T10:37:07.528Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:07.528Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 19, 6, 'Dia nijery i Elia ka hitany fa nisy mofo boribory teo akaikin’ny lohany, ary teo ambony vato mahamay ilay izy. Nisy tavoara fasiana rano koa teo. Koa nihinana sy nisotro izy, dia nandry indray.', 'dia nijery i elia ka hitany fa nisy mofo boribory teo akaikin’ny lohany, ary teo ambony vato mahamay ilay izy. nisy tavoara fasiana rano koa teo. koa nihinana sy nisotro izy, dia nandry indray.'),
  ('6ab25a53028c980d3d47207f', '2026-09-22T10:37:07.528Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:07.528Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 19, 7, 'Tonga fanindroany indray ilay anjelin’i Jehovah, ka nikasika azy ary nanao hoe: “Miarena, ka mihinàna fa mbola tena lavitra ny dia halehanao.”', 'tonga fanindroany indray ilay anjelin’i jehovah, ka nikasika azy ary nanao hoe: “miarena, ka mihinàna fa mbola tena lavitra ny dia halehanao.”'),
  ('6ab25a53028c980d3d472080', '2026-09-22T10:37:07.528Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:07.528Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 19, 8, 'Dia niarina i Elia ka nihinana sy nisotro, ary nahazo hery avy tamin’izany ka nanohy ny diany efapolo andro sy efapolo alina, ary tonga hatrany Horeba, tendrombohitr’ilay tena Andriamanitra.', 'dia niarina i elia ka nihinana sy nisotro, ary nahazo hery avy tamin’izany ka nanohy ny diany efapolo andro sy efapolo alina, ary tonga hatrany horeba, tendrombohitr’ilay tena andriamanitra.'),
  ('6ab25a53028c980d3d472081', '2026-09-22T10:37:07.528Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:07.528Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 19, 9, 'Rehefa tany izy, dia niditra tao anaty lava-bato mba hatory tao ny alina. Ary injay fa tonga taminy ny tenin’i Jehovah, nanao hoe: “Inona no ataonao atỳ, ry Elia?”', 'rehefa tany izy, dia niditra tao anaty lava-bato mba hatory tao ny alina. ary injay fa tonga taminy ny tenin’i jehovah, nanao hoe: “inona no ataonao atỳ, ry elia?”'),
  ('6ab25a53028c980d3d472082', '2026-09-22T10:37:07.528Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:07.528Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 19, 10, 'Dia hoy i Elia: “Tena nafana fo tamin’ny fanompoana an’i Jehovah Andriamanitry ny tafika aho. Efa nivadika tamin’ny fifanekena nataonao mantsy ny zanak’Israely. Noravany ny alitaranao, ary novonoiny tamin’ny sabatra ny mpaminaninao, ka izaho irery sisa, nefa mbola mifofo ny aiko koa izy ireo.”', 'dia hoy i elia: “tena nafana fo tamin’ny fanompoana an’i jehovah andriamanitry ny tafika aho. efa nivadika tamin’ny fifanekena nataonao mantsy ny zanak’israely. noravany ny alitaranao, ary novonoiny tamin’ny sabatra ny mpaminaninao, ka izaho irery sisa, nefa mbola mifofo ny aiko koa izy ireo.”'),
  ('6ab25a53028c980d3d472083', '2026-09-22T10:37:07.528Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:07.528Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 19, 11, 'Fa hoy Andriamanitra: “Mivoaha, ka mitsangàna eo an-tendrombohitra, eo anatrehan’i Jehovah.” Ary iny fa nandalo i Jehovah, ka nisy rivotra be sady mahery nampitresaka tendrombohitra sy namaky harambato, teo anatrehan’i Jehovah. Tsy tao amin’ilay rivotra anefa i Jehovah. Ary nisy horohoron-tany taorian’ilay rivotra. Tsy tao amin’ilay horohoron-tany anefa i Jehovah.', 'fa hoy andriamanitra: “mivoaha, ka mitsangàna eo an-tendrombohitra, eo anatrehan’i jehovah.” ary iny fa nandalo i jehovah, ka nisy rivotra be sady mahery nampitresaka tendrombohitra sy namaky harambato, teo anatrehan’i jehovah. tsy tao amin’ilay rivotra anefa i jehovah. ary nisy horohoron-tany taorian’ilay rivotra. tsy tao amin’ilay horohoron-tany anefa i jehovah.'),
  ('6ab25a53028c980d3d472084', '2026-09-22T10:37:07.528Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:07.528Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 19, 12, 'Ary nisy afo taorian’ilay horohoron-tany. Tsy tao amin’ilay afo anefa i Jehovah. Ary nisy feo malefaka sy iva taorian’ilay afo.', 'ary nisy afo taorian’ilay horohoron-tany. tsy tao amin’ilay afo anefa i jehovah. ary nisy feo malefaka sy iva taorian’ilay afo.'),
  ('6ab25a53028c980d3d472085', '2026-09-22T10:37:07.528Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:07.528Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 19, 13, 'Raha vao ren’i Elia izany, dia nosaronany tamin’ilay akanjona mpaminany teny aminy ny tarehiny, ary nivoaka izy ka nitsangana teo amin’ny fidirana tamin’ilay lava-bato. Ary injay nisy feo tonga taminy, nanao hoe: “Inona no ataonao atỳ, ry Elia?”', 'raha vao ren’i elia izany, dia nosaronany tamin’ilay akanjona mpaminany teny aminy ny tarehiny, ary nivoaka izy ka nitsangana teo amin’ny fidirana tamin’ilay lava-bato. ary injay nisy feo tonga taminy, nanao hoe: “inona no ataonao atỳ, ry elia?”'),
  ('6ab25a53028c980d3d472086', '2026-09-22T10:37:07.528Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:07.528Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 19, 14, 'Dia hoy i Elia: “Tena nafana fo tamin’ny fanompoana an’i Jehovah Andriamanitry ny tafika aho. Efa nivadika tamin’ny fifanekena nataonao mantsy ny zanak’Israely. Noravany ny alitaranao, ary novonoiny tamin’ny sabatra ny mpaminaninao, ka izaho irery sisa, nefa mbola mifofo ny aiko koa izy ireo.”', 'dia hoy i elia: “tena nafana fo tamin’ny fanompoana an’i jehovah andriamanitry ny tafika aho. efa nivadika tamin’ny fifanekena nataonao mantsy ny zanak’israely. noravany ny alitaranao, ary novonoiny tamin’ny sabatra ny mpaminaninao, ka izaho irery sisa, nefa mbola mifofo ny aiko koa izy ireo.”');
INSERT INTO "bible_verses" ("id", "created_date", "updated_date", "created_by_id", "created_by", "translation", "book", "bookOrder", "chapter", "verse", "text", "normalizedText") VALUES
  ('6ab25a53028c980d3d472087', '2026-09-22T10:37:07.528Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:07.528Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 19, 15, 'Dia hoy i Jehovah taminy: “Mandehana miverina ka mankanesa any an-tany efitr’i Damaskosy. Rehefa any ianao, dia hosory ho mpanjakan’i Syria i Hazaela.', 'dia hoy i jehovah taminy: “mandehana miverina ka mankanesa any an-tany efitr’i damaskosy. rehefa any ianao, dia hosory ho mpanjakan’i syria i hazaela.'),
  ('6ab25a53028c980d3d472088', '2026-09-22T10:37:07.528Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:07.528Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 19, 16, 'I Jeho zafikelin’i Nimsy kosa hosory ho mpanjakan’ny Israely. Ary i Elisa zanak’i Safata, avy any Abela-mehola, hosory ho mpaminany handimby anao.', 'i jeho zafikelin’i nimsy kosa hosory ho mpanjakan’ny israely. ary i elisa zanak’i safata, avy any abela-mehola, hosory ho mpaminany handimby anao.'),
  ('6ab25a53028c980d3d472089', '2026-09-22T10:37:07.528Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:07.528Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 19, 17, 'Izay afa-mandositra ny sabatr’i Hazaela dia hovonoin’i Jeho. Ary izay afa-mandositra ny sabatr’i Jeho kosa hovonoin’i Elisa.', 'izay afa-mandositra ny sabatr’i hazaela dia hovonoin’i jeho. ary izay afa-mandositra ny sabatr’i jeho kosa hovonoin’i elisa.'),
  ('6ab25a53028c980d3d47208a', '2026-09-22T10:37:07.528Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:07.528Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 19, 18, 'Fa mbola misy fito arivo navelako any Israely, dia ny lohalika rehetra tsy nandohalika tamin’i Bala, sy ny vava rehetra tsy nanoroka azy.”', 'fa mbola misy fito arivo navelako any israely, dia ny lohalika rehetra tsy nandohalika tamin’i bala, sy ny vava rehetra tsy nanoroka azy.”'),
  ('6ab25a53028c980d3d47208b', '2026-09-22T10:37:07.528Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:07.528Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 19, 19, 'Koa niala teo i Elia ary nahita an’i Elisa zanak’i Safata, nanao asa tany. Ary omby efatra amby roapolo nandeha tsiroaroa no teo alohany, ary izy no teo amin’ireo omby roa faharoa ambin’ny folo farany. Dia niampita nankeny aminy i Elia, ary natsipiny teny amin’i Elisa ilay akanjo nanaovany.', 'koa niala teo i elia ary nahita an’i elisa zanak’i safata, nanao asa tany. ary omby efatra amby roapolo nandeha tsiroaroa no teo alohany, ary izy no teo amin’ireo omby roa faharoa ambin’ny folo farany. dia niampita nankeny aminy i elia, ary natsipiny teny amin’i elisa ilay akanjo nanaovany.'),
  ('6ab25a53028c980d3d47208c', '2026-09-22T10:37:07.528Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:07.528Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 19, 20, 'Dia nilaozan’i Elisa teo ny omby ka lasa izy nihazakazaka nanaraka an’i Elia, ary niteny hoe: “Avelao aho aloha, azafady, mba hanoroka ny ray aman-dreniko, ary hanaraka anao aho avy eo.” Dia hoy i Elia: “Mandehana miverina, fa inona moa no nataoko taminao?”', 'dia nilaozan’i elisa teo ny omby ka lasa izy nihazakazaka nanaraka an’i elia, ary niteny hoe: “avelao aho aloha, azafady, mba hanoroka ny ray aman-dreniko, ary hanaraka anao aho avy eo.” dia hoy i elia: “mandehana miverina, fa inona moa no nataoko taminao?”'),
  ('6ab25a53028c980d3d47208d', '2026-09-22T10:37:07.528Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:07.528Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 19, 21, 'Dia niverina i Elisa fa tsy nanaraka azy. Ary naka omby roa i Elisa, ka nataony sorona. Hazo tamin’ny angadinomby no nataony kitay handrahoana ny hena. Dia nomeny ny olona izany, ka nihinana ireo. Ary nitsangana izy taorian’izay ka nanaraka an’i Elia, ary nanompo azy.', 'dia niverina i elisa fa tsy nanaraka azy. ary naka omby roa i elisa, ka nataony sorona. hazo tamin’ny angadinomby no nataony kitay handrahoana ny hena. dia nomeny ny olona izany, ka nihinana ireo. ary nitsangana izy taorian’izay ka nanaraka an’i elia, ary nanompo azy.'),
  ('6ab25a5414981dbfc9ab329a', '2026-09-22T10:37:08.038Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:08.038Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 20, 40, 'Kanjo nony nanao zavatra tetsy sy teroa ny mpanomponao, dia lasa izy.” Koa hoy ny mpanjakan’ny Israely: “Dia izay izany ny didim-pitsarana sahaza anao. Ianao ihany no nitsara ny tenanao.”', 'kanjo nony nanao zavatra tetsy sy teroa ny mpanomponao, dia lasa izy.” koa hoy ny mpanjakan’ny israely: “dia izay izany ny didim-pitsarana sahaza anao. ianao ihany no nitsara ny tenanao.”'),
  ('6ab25a5414981dbfc9ab3296', '2026-09-22T10:37:08.038Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:08.038Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 20, 36, 'Koa hoy izy taminy: “Satria tsy nihaino ny feon’i Jehovah ianao, dia hisy liona hamono anao rehefa hiala eto amiko ianao.” Dia niala teo aminy ralehilahy, ary nifanena tamin’ny liona tokoa, ka matin’ilay liona.', 'koa hoy izy taminy: “satria tsy nihaino ny feon’i jehovah ianao, dia hisy liona hamono anao rehefa hiala eto amiko ianao.” dia niala teo aminy ralehilahy, ary nifanena tamin’ny liona tokoa, ka matin’ilay liona.'),
  ('6ab25a5414981dbfc9ab328b', '2026-09-22T10:37:08.038Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:08.038Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 20, 25, 'Makà miaramila mitovy isa amin’ireo efa lavo, ary makà soavaly ho solon’ny soavaly, sy kalesy ho solon’ny kalesy. Ary andao hiady aminy eny amin’ny tany lemaka, ka jereo ange raha tsy hahery noho ry zareo isika e!” Dia nihaino azy ireo i Beni-hadada, ka izany tokoa no nataony.', 'makà miaramila mitovy isa amin’ireo efa lavo, ary makà soavaly ho solon’ny soavaly, sy kalesy ho solon’ny kalesy. ary andao hiady aminy eny amin’ny tany lemaka, ka jereo ange raha tsy hahery noho ry zareo isika e!” dia nihaino azy ireo i beni-hadada, ka izany tokoa no nataony.'),
  ('6ab25a5414981dbfc9ab327d', '2026-09-22T10:37:08.038Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:08.038Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 20, 11, 'Dia hoy ny navalin’ny mpanjakan’ny Israely: “Lazao aminy hoe: ‘Aoka ny vao mamatotra fehikibo tsy hirehareha sahala amin’ny efa mamaha.’”', 'dia hoy ny navalin’ny mpanjakan’ny israely: “lazao aminy hoe: ‘aoka ny vao mamatotra fehikibo tsy hirehareha sahala amin’ny efa mamaha.’”'),
  ('6ab25a5414981dbfc9ab3290', '2026-09-22T10:37:08.038Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:08.038Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 20, 30, 'Ny sisa kosa nandositra tany Afeka, tany an-tanàna. Kanjo nianjeran’ny manda ny olona fito arivo sy roa alina sisa. Nandositra kosa i Beni-hadada ka tafiditra tao an-tanàna ihany, ary nankao amin’ny efitra anatiny indrindra.', 'ny sisa kosa nandositra tany afeka, tany an-tanàna. kanjo nianjeran’ny manda ny olona fito arivo sy roa alina sisa. nandositra kosa i beni-hadada ka tafiditra tao an-tanàna ihany, ary nankao amin’ny efitra anatiny indrindra.'),
  ('6ab25a5414981dbfc9ab328e', '2026-09-22T10:37:08.038Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:08.038Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 20, 28, 'Dia nankany amin’ny mpanjakan’ny Israely ilay lehilahin’Andriamanitra, ka hoy izy taminy: “Izao no nolazain’i Jehovah: ‘Satria hoy ny Syrianina hoe: “Andriamanitry ny tendrombohitra i Jehovah, fa tsy Andriamanitry ny tany lemaka”, dia hatolotro eo an-tananao io vahoaka be io, ka ho fantatrareo tokoa fa izaho no Jehovah.’”', 'dia nankany amin’ny mpanjakan’ny israely ilay lehilahin’andriamanitra, ka hoy izy taminy: “izao no nolazain’i jehovah: ‘satria hoy ny syrianina hoe: “andriamanitry ny tendrombohitra i jehovah, fa tsy andriamanitry ny tany lemaka”, dia hatolotro eo an-tananao io vahoaka be io, ka ho fantatrareo tokoa fa izaho no jehovah.’”'),
  ('6ab25a5414981dbfc9ab3286', '2026-09-22T10:37:08.038Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:08.038Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 20, 20, 'Dia namono an’izay lehilahy niady taminy ny tsirairay. Koa nirifatra nitsoaka ny Syrianina ka nenjehin’ny Israely. Fa i Beni-hadada mpanjakan’i Syria kosa afa-nandositra an-tsoavaly, niaraka tamin’ireo mpitaingin-tsoavaly.', 'dia namono an’izay lehilahy niady taminy ny tsirairay. koa nirifatra nitsoaka ny syrianina ka nenjehin’ny israely. fa i beni-hadada mpanjakan’i syria kosa afa-nandositra an-tsoavaly, niaraka tamin’ireo mpitaingin-tsoavaly.'),
  ('6ab25a5414981dbfc9ab327c', '2026-09-22T10:37:08.038Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:08.038Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 20, 10, 'Ary nandefa iraka indray i Beni-hadada, nanao hoe: “Hofaizin’ireo andriamanitra anie aho, * ary mihoatra noho izany aza, raha havelako hisy tavela ny vovok’i Samaria ka samy hanana eran-tanan’ila avy izay rehetra manaraka ahy!”', 'ary nandefa iraka indray i beni-hadada, nanao hoe: “hofaizin’ireo andriamanitra anie aho, * ary mihoatra noho izany aza, raha havelako hisy tavela ny vovok’i samaria ka samy hanana eran-tanan’ila avy izay rehetra manaraka ahy!”'),
  ('6ab25a5414981dbfc9ab3285', '2026-09-22T10:37:08.038Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:08.038Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 20, 19, 'Ireo tovolahy ampiasain’ny mpifehy isam-paritany no nivoaka avy ao an-tanàna, ary nanaraka azy ireo ny tafika.', 'ireo tovolahy ampiasain’ny mpifehy isam-paritany no nivoaka avy ao an-tanàna, ary nanaraka azy ireo ny tafika.'),
  ('6ab25a5414981dbfc9ab3280', '2026-09-22T10:37:08.038Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:08.038Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 20, 14, 'Ary hoy i Ahaba: “Amin’ny alalan’iza?” Dia hoy izy: “Izao no nolazain’i Jehovah: ‘Amin’ny alalan’ireo tovolahy ampiasain’ny mpifehy isam-paritany.’” Ary hoy i Ahaba: “Iza no hamely voalohany?” Dia hoy izy: “Ianao!”', 'ary hoy i ahaba: “amin’ny alalan’iza?” dia hoy izy: “izao no nolazain’i jehovah: ‘amin’ny alalan’ireo tovolahy ampiasain’ny mpifehy isam-paritany.’” ary hoy i ahaba: “iza no hamely voalohany?” dia hoy izy: “ianao!”'),
  ('6ab25a5414981dbfc9ab3297', '2026-09-22T10:37:08.038Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:08.038Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 20, 37, 'Ary nahita lehilahy hafa indray izy, ka nanao hoe: “Asio aho, azafady.” Koa namely azy ilay lehilahy ka nandratra azy.', 'ary nahita lehilahy hafa indray izy, ka nanao hoe: “asio aho, azafady.” koa namely azy ilay lehilahy ka nandratra azy.'),
  ('6ab25a5414981dbfc9ab328d', '2026-09-22T10:37:08.038Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:08.038Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 20, 27, 'Ary ny zanak’Israely kosa novorina sy nomena vatsy, ka nivoaka mba hifanandrina tamin’izy ireo. Nitoby tandrifin’izy ireo ny zanak’Israely, izay toy ny osy vitsy kely roa toko, fa ny Syrianina kosa nanenika ny tany.', 'ary ny zanak’israely kosa novorina sy nomena vatsy, ka nivoaka mba hifanandrina tamin’izy ireo. nitoby tandrifin’izy ireo ny zanak’israely, izay toy ny osy vitsy kely roa toko, fa ny syrianina kosa nanenika ny tany.'),
  ('6ab25a5414981dbfc9ab3273', '2026-09-22T10:37:08.038Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:08.038Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 20, 1, 'Ary novorin’i Beni-hadada mpanjakan’i Syria ny tafiny rehetra, sy ireo mpanjaka roa amby telopolo niaraka taminy, mbamin’ny soavaly sy ny kalesy. Dia niakatra izy ka nanao fahirano an’i Samaria, ary nanafika azy.', 'ary novorin’i beni-hadada mpanjakan’i syria ny tafiny rehetra, sy ireo mpanjaka roa amby telopolo niaraka taminy, mbamin’ny soavaly sy ny kalesy. dia niakatra izy ka nanao fahirano an’i samaria, ary nanafika azy.'),
  ('6ab25a5414981dbfc9ab3291', '2026-09-22T10:37:08.038Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:08.038Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 20, 31, 'Dia hoy ny mpanompony taminy: “Renay fa be hatsaram-panahy feno fitiavana ny mpanjakan’ny taranak’Israely. Koa aoka re izahay hisikina lamba gony, ary hanisy tady eo ambony lohanay, ka hivoaka ho any amin’ny mpanjakan’ny Israely e, fa angamba hitsimbina anao * izy ka tsy hamono anao.”', 'dia hoy ny mpanompony taminy: “renay fa be hatsaram-panahy feno fitiavana ny mpanjakan’ny taranak’israely. koa aoka re izahay hisikina lamba gony, ary hanisy tady eo ambony lohanay, ka hivoaka ho any amin’ny mpanjakan’ny israely e, fa angamba hitsimbina anao * izy ka tsy hamono anao.”'),
  ('6ab25a5414981dbfc9ab3298', '2026-09-22T10:37:08.038Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:08.038Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 20, 38, 'Dia lasa ilay mpaminany ka nijanona teo amoron-dalana mba hiandry ny mpanjaka. Ary nataony izay tsy hahafantarana azy ka nasiany fehy lamba teo ambony masony.', 'dia lasa ilay mpaminany ka nijanona teo amoron-dalana mba hiandry ny mpanjaka. ary nataony izay tsy hahafantarana azy ka nasiany fehy lamba teo ambony masony.'),
  ('6ab25a5414981dbfc9ab328c', '2026-09-22T10:37:08.038Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:08.038Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 20, 26, 'Rehefa niandoha ny taona, dia nangonin’i Beni-hadada ny Syrianina, ary niakatra tany Afeka izy mba hiady tamin’ny Israely.', 'rehefa niandoha ny taona, dia nangonin’i beni-hadada ny syrianina, ary niakatra tany afeka izy mba hiady tamin’ny israely.'),
  ('6ab25a5414981dbfc9ab3279', '2026-09-22T10:37:08.038Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:08.038Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 20, 7, 'Dia nantsoin’ny mpanjakan’ny Israely daholo ny anti-panahy teo amin’ny taniny, ka hoy izy: “Mba diniho kely, ary jereo fa te hanisy ratsy antsika mihitsy ilehiny. Efa nandefa iraka tatỳ amiko mantsy izy haka an’ireo vady aman-janako mbamin’ny volafotsiko sy ny volamenako, ary tsy nanda aho.”', 'dia nantsoin’ny mpanjakan’ny israely daholo ny anti-panahy teo amin’ny taniny, ka hoy izy: “mba diniho kely, ary jereo fa te hanisy ratsy antsika mihitsy ilehiny. efa nandefa iraka tatỳ amiko mantsy izy haka an’ireo vady aman-janako mbamin’ny volafotsiko sy ny volamenako, ary tsy nanda aho.”'),
  ('6ab25a5414981dbfc9ab3277', '2026-09-22T10:37:08.038Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:08.038Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 20, 5, 'Dia niverina indray ny iraka taorian’izay, ka nanao hoe: “Izao no nolazain’i Beni-hadada: ‘Nandefa iraka tatỳ aminao aho nilaza hoe: “Omeo ahy ny volafotsinao sy ny volamenanao ary ireo vady aman-janakao.', 'dia niverina indray ny iraka taorian’izay, ka nanao hoe: “izao no nolazain’i beni-hadada: ‘nandefa iraka tatỳ aminao aho nilaza hoe: “omeo ahy ny volafotsinao sy ny volamenanao ary ireo vady aman-janakao.'),
  ('6ab25a5414981dbfc9ab329d', '2026-09-22T10:37:08.038Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:08.038Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 20, 43, 'Ary nanohy ny diany ny mpanjakan’ny Israely ka nody tany an-tranony, sady sosotra no kivy. Dia tonga tany Samaria izy.', 'ary nanohy ny diany ny mpanjakan’ny israely ka nody tany an-tranony, sady sosotra no kivy. dia tonga tany samaria izy.'),
  ('6ab25a5414981dbfc9ab327e', '2026-09-22T10:37:08.038Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:08.038Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 20, 12, 'Raha vao ren’i Beni-hadada izany, tamin’izy niara-nisotro tamin’ireo mpanjaka tao an-trano rantsankazo, dia hoy izy tamin’ny mpanompony: “Miomàna ianareo!” Dia niomana hanafika an’ilay tanàna ireo.', 'raha vao ren’i beni-hadada izany, tamin’izy niara-nisotro tamin’ireo mpanjaka tao an-trano rantsankazo, dia hoy izy tamin’ny mpanompony: “miomàna ianareo!” dia niomana hanafika an’ilay tanàna ireo.'),
  ('6ab25a5414981dbfc9ab327a', '2026-09-22T10:37:08.038Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:08.038Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 20, 8, 'Dia hoy ny anti-panahy rehetra sy ny olona rehetra: “Aza mankatò azy, ary aza manaiky.”', 'dia hoy ny anti-panahy rehetra sy ny olona rehetra: “aza mankatò azy, ary aza manaiky.”'),
  ('6ab25a5414981dbfc9ab3275', '2026-09-22T10:37:08.038Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:08.038Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 20, 3, '‘Ahy ny volafotsinao sy ny volamenanao. Ary ahy koa ireo vady aman-janakao, dia ireo tsara tarehy indrindra.’”', '‘ahy ny volafotsinao sy ny volamenanao. ary ahy koa ireo vady aman-janakao, dia ireo tsara tarehy indrindra.’”'),
  ('6ab25a5414981dbfc9ab329b', '2026-09-22T10:37:08.038Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:08.038Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 20, 41, 'Dia nesoriny haingana ilay fehy lamba teo ambony masony, ka fantatry ny mpanjakan’ny Israely fa anisan’ny mpaminany izy.', 'dia nesoriny haingana ilay fehy lamba teo ambony masony, ka fantatry ny mpanjakan’ny israely fa anisan’ny mpaminany izy.'),
  ('6ab25a5414981dbfc9ab3281', '2026-09-22T10:37:08.038Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:08.038Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 20, 15, 'Ary nisain’i Ahaba ireo tovolahy ampiasain’ny mpifehy isam-paritany, ka roa amby telopolo sy roanjato ny isany. Dia nisainy koa ny olona rehetra, izany hoe ny zanak’Israely rehetra, ka fito arivo ny isany.', 'ary nisain’i ahaba ireo tovolahy ampiasain’ny mpifehy isam-paritany, ka roa amby telopolo sy roanjato ny isany. dia nisainy koa ny olona rehetra, izany hoe ny zanak’israely rehetra, ka fito arivo ny isany.'),
  ('6ab25a5414981dbfc9ab3295', '2026-09-22T10:37:08.038Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:08.038Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 20, 35, 'Ary nisy lehilahy iray anisan’ny zanaky ny mpaminany, nilaza tamin’ny namany araka ny tenin’i Jehovah hoe: “Asio aho, azafady!” Fa tsy nety namely azy ralehilahy.', 'ary nisy lehilahy iray anisan’ny zanaky ny mpaminany, nilaza tamin’ny namany araka ny tenin’i jehovah hoe: “asio aho, azafady!” fa tsy nety namely azy ralehilahy.'),
  ('6ab25a5414981dbfc9ab3292', '2026-09-22T10:37:08.038Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:08.038Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 20, 32, 'Koa nisikina lamba gony izy ireo, ary nanisy tady teo ambony lohany, dia nankao amin’ny mpanjakan’ny Israely, ka nanao hoe: “Izao no nolazain’i Beni-hadada mpanomponao: ‘Mba tsimbino re ny aiko e!’” Dia hoy ny mpanjaka: “Mbola velona angaha izy? Rahalahiko izy.”', 'koa nisikina lamba gony izy ireo, ary nanisy tady teo ambony lohany, dia nankao amin’ny mpanjakan’ny israely, ka nanao hoe: “izao no nolazain’i beni-hadada mpanomponao: ‘mba tsimbino re ny aiko e!’” dia hoy ny mpanjaka: “mbola velona angaha izy? rahalahiko izy.”'),
  ('6ab25a5414981dbfc9ab3289', '2026-09-22T10:37:08.038Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:08.038Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 20, 23, 'Ary hoy ny mpanompon’ny mpanjakan’i Syria taminy: “Andriamanitry ny tendrombohitra ny Andriamanitr’izy ireo, ka nahery noho isika ry zareo. Fa andao ange hiady aminy eny amin’ny tany lemaka e! Ho hitanao eo raha tsy hahery noho ry zareo isika.', 'ary hoy ny mpanompon’ny mpanjakan’i syria taminy: “andriamanitry ny tendrombohitra ny andriamanitr’izy ireo, ka nahery noho isika ry zareo. fa andao ange hiady aminy eny amin’ny tany lemaka e! ho hitanao eo raha tsy hahery noho ry zareo isika.'),
  ('6ab25a5414981dbfc9ab3278', '2026-09-22T10:37:08.038Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:08.038Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 20, 6, 'Fa rahampitso toy izao dia hirahiko atỳ aminao ny mpanompoko, ka hataony sava hao ny tranonao sy ny tranon’ny mpanomponao. Koa izay rehetra mahafinaritra ny masonao no halainy ka hoentiny.”’”', 'fa rahampitso toy izao dia hirahiko atỳ aminao ny mpanompoko, ka hataony sava hao ny tranonao sy ny tranon’ny mpanomponao. koa izay rehetra mahafinaritra ny masonao no halainy ka hoentiny.”’”'),
  ('6ab25a5414981dbfc9ab329c', '2026-09-22T10:37:08.038Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:08.038Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 20, 42, 'Dia hoy izy tamin’ny mpanjaka: “Izao no nolazain’i Jehovah: ‘Satria navelanao handeha ilay lehilahy efa natokako haringana, na dia efa teo am-pelatananao aza, dia ny ainao no hasolo ny ainy, ary ny olonao no hasolo ny olony.’”', 'dia hoy izy tamin’ny mpanjaka: “izao no nolazain’i jehovah: ‘satria navelanao handeha ilay lehilahy efa natokako haringana, na dia efa teo am-pelatananao aza, dia ny ainao no hasolo ny ainy, ary ny olonao no hasolo ny olony.’”'),
  ('6ab25a5414981dbfc9ab3294', '2026-09-22T10:37:08.038Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:08.038Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 20, 34, 'Ary hoy i Beni-hadada taminy: “Haveriko aminao ny tanàna nalain-draiko tamin-drainao. Ary hifidy arabe ho anao ianao any Damaskosy, toy ny nifidianan’ny raiko arabe tany Samaria.” Dia hoy i Ahaba: “Halefako ianao raha manao fifanekena isika.” Koa nanao fifanekena taminy izy, ka namela azy handeha.', 'ary hoy i beni-hadada taminy: “haveriko aminao ny tanàna nalain-draiko tamin-drainao. ary hifidy arabe ho anao ianao any damaskosy, toy ny nifidianan’ny raiko arabe tany samaria.” dia hoy i ahaba: “halefako ianao raha manao fifanekena isika.” koa nanao fifanekena taminy izy, ka namela azy handeha.'),
  ('6ab25a5414981dbfc9ab3293', '2026-09-22T10:37:08.038Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:08.038Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 20, 33, 'Tamin’izy ireo dia fambara tsara izany, ka noraisin’izy ireo avy hatrany ho efa fanapahan-kevitry ny mpanjaka. Koa hoy izy ireo: “Rahalahinao tokoa i Beni-hadada.” Dia hoy ny mpanjaka: “Mandehana, alaivo izy.” Koa nivoaka nankany amin’ny mpanjaka i Beni-hadada, ka avy hatrany dia nasainy niakatra nankao amin’ny kalesy.', 'tamin’izy ireo dia fambara tsara izany, ka noraisin’izy ireo avy hatrany ho efa fanapahan-kevitry ny mpanjaka. koa hoy izy ireo: “rahalahinao tokoa i beni-hadada.” dia hoy ny mpanjaka: “mandehana, alaivo izy.” koa nivoaka nankany amin’ny mpanjaka i beni-hadada, ka avy hatrany dia nasainy niakatra nankao amin’ny kalesy.'),
  ('6ab25a5414981dbfc9ab3288', '2026-09-22T10:37:08.038Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:08.038Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 20, 22, 'Tatỳ aoriana, dia nankany amin’ny mpanjakan’ny Israely ilay mpaminany, ka nanao hoe: “Mandehana, ary ataovy izay hampahery anao. Ary diniho sy eritrereto izay hataonao, fa hiakatra hiady aminao ny mpanjakan’i Syria, eo am-piandohan’ny taona.”', 'tatỳ aoriana, dia nankany amin’ny mpanjakan’ny israely ilay mpaminany, ka nanao hoe: “mandehana, ary ataovy izay hampahery anao. ary diniho sy eritrereto izay hataonao, fa hiakatra hiady aminao ny mpanjakan’i syria, eo am-piandohan’ny taona.”'),
  ('6ab25a5414981dbfc9ab3282', '2026-09-22T10:37:08.038Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:08.038Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 20, 16, 'Ary nivoaka izy ireo nony mitataovovonana, raha mbola nimamo tao an-trano rantsankazo i Beni-hadada sy ireo mpanjaka roa amby telopolo nanampy azy.', 'ary nivoaka izy ireo nony mitataovovonana, raha mbola nimamo tao an-trano rantsankazo i beni-hadada sy ireo mpanjaka roa amby telopolo nanampy azy.'),
  ('6ab25a5414981dbfc9ab328f', '2026-09-22T10:37:08.038Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:08.038Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 20, 29, 'Dia nitoby nifanatrika teo nandritra ny fito andro izy ireo. Ary raikitra ny ady tamin’ny andro fahafito. Dia novonoin’ny zanak’Israely ny Syrianina, ka miaramila iray hetsy mandeha an-tongotra no matiny indray andro.', 'dia nitoby nifanatrika teo nandritra ny fito andro izy ireo. ary raikitra ny ady tamin’ny andro fahafito. dia novonoin’ny zanak’israely ny syrianina, ka miaramila iray hetsy mandeha an-tongotra no matiny indray andro.'),
  ('6ab25a5414981dbfc9ab3284', '2026-09-22T10:37:08.038Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:08.038Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 20, 18, 'Dia hoy i Beni-hadada: “Raha fihavanana no ivoahany, dia ataovy sambo-belona izy, fa raha ady kosa, dia mbola ataovy sambo-belona ihany izy.”', 'dia hoy i beni-hadada: “raha fihavanana no ivoahany, dia ataovy sambo-belona izy, fa raha ady kosa, dia mbola ataovy sambo-belona ihany izy.”'),
  ('6ab25a5414981dbfc9ab327f', '2026-09-22T10:37:08.038Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:08.038Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 20, 13, 'Ary nisy mpaminany iray nanatona an’i Ahaba mpanjakan’ny Israely, ka nanao hoe: “Izao no nolazain’i Jehovah: ‘Hitanao ve io vahoaka be io? Hatolotro eo an-tananao ireo anio, ary ho fantatrao tokoa fa izaho no Jehovah.’”', 'ary nisy mpaminany iray nanatona an’i ahaba mpanjakan’ny israely, ka nanao hoe: “izao no nolazain’i jehovah: ‘hitanao ve io vahoaka be io? hatolotro eo an-tananao ireo anio, ary ho fantatrao tokoa fa izaho no jehovah.’”'),
  ('6ab25a5414981dbfc9ab3274', '2026-09-22T10:37:08.038Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:08.038Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 20, 2, 'Dia nandefa iraka ho ao an-tanàna izy, ho any amin’i Ahaba mpanjakan’ny Israely, nanao hoe: “Izao no nolazain’i Beni-hadada:', 'dia nandefa iraka ho ao an-tanàna izy, ho any amin’i ahaba mpanjakan’ny israely, nanao hoe: “izao no nolazain’i beni-hadada:'),
  ('6ab25a5414981dbfc9ab327b', '2026-09-22T10:37:08.038Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:08.038Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 20, 9, 'Koa hoy i Ahaba tamin’ny irak’i Beni-hadada: “Lazao amin’ny mpanjaka tompoko hoe: ‘Hataoko izay rehetra nanirahanao tatỳ amin’ny mpanomponao tamin’ny voalohany. Fa raha izao zavatra izao kosa, dia tsy vitako.’” Dia lasa niverina ny iraka, ka nitatitra izany taminy.', 'koa hoy i ahaba tamin’ny irak’i beni-hadada: “lazao amin’ny mpanjaka tompoko hoe: ‘hataoko izay rehetra nanirahanao tatỳ amin’ny mpanomponao tamin’ny voalohany. fa raha izao zavatra izao kosa, dia tsy vitako.’” dia lasa niverina ny iraka, ka nitatitra izany taminy.'),
  ('6ab25a5414981dbfc9ab3276', '2026-09-22T10:37:08.038Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:08.038Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 20, 4, 'Dia hoy ny navalin’ny mpanjakan’ny Israely: “Anao tokoa aho sy izay rehetra ananako, araka ny teninao, ry mpanjaka tompoko.”', 'dia hoy ny navalin’ny mpanjakan’ny israely: “anao tokoa aho sy izay rehetra ananako, araka ny teninao, ry mpanjaka tompoko.”'),
  ('6ab25a5414981dbfc9ab3299', '2026-09-22T10:37:08.038Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:08.038Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 20, 39, 'Rehefa nandalo ny mpanjaka, dia nitaraina mafy taminy izy hoe: “Nankany afovoan’ny ady ny mpanomponao, ary nisy lehilahy niala teny amin’ny laharany ka nitondra lehilahy iray teo amiko sady nanao hoe: ‘Ambeno ity lehilahy ity. Fa raha sanatria lasa izy, dia ny ainao no hasolo ny ainy, na hanome volafotsy milanja talenta iray ianao.’', 'rehefa nandalo ny mpanjaka, dia nitaraina mafy taminy izy hoe: “nankany afovoan’ny ady ny mpanomponao, ary nisy lehilahy niala teny amin’ny laharany ka nitondra lehilahy iray teo amiko sady nanao hoe: ‘ambeno ity lehilahy ity. fa raha sanatria lasa izy, dia ny ainao no hasolo ny ainy, na hanome volafotsy milanja talenta iray ianao.’'),
  ('6ab25a5414981dbfc9ab328a', '2026-09-22T10:37:08.038Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:08.038Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 20, 24, 'Koa izao atao: Esory amin’ny toerany ny mpanjaka tsirairay, ka soloy governora.', 'koa izao atao: esory amin’ny toerany ny mpanjaka tsirairay, ka soloy governora.'),
  ('6ab25a5414981dbfc9ab3287', '2026-09-22T10:37:08.038Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:08.038Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 20, 21, 'Ary nivoaka kosa ny mpanjakan’ny Israely, ka naripany ny soavaly sy ny kalesy. Nasiany koa ny Syrianina ka be dia be no maty.', 'ary nivoaka kosa ny mpanjakan’ny israely, ka naripany ny soavaly sy ny kalesy. nasiany koa ny syrianina ka be dia be no maty.'),
  ('6ab25a5414981dbfc9ab3283', '2026-09-22T10:37:08.038Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:08.038Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 20, 17, 'Ireo tovolahy ampiasain’ny mpifehy isam-paritany no nivoaka voalohany. Dia naniraka olona avy hatrany i Beni-hadada, ary tonga nilaza taminy ireo hoe: “Misy olona mivoaka avy ao Samaria.”', 'ireo tovolahy ampiasain’ny mpifehy isam-paritany no nivoaka voalohany. dia naniraka olona avy hatrany i beni-hadada, ary tonga nilaza taminy ireo hoe: “misy olona mivoaka avy ao samaria.”'),
  ('6ab25a54ff73825607b2c478', '2026-09-22T10:37:08.736Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:08.736Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 21, 12, 'Ary nanao antso avo izy ireo hoe hisy fifadian-kanina, ary nasainy nipetraka teo alohan’ny olona i Nabota.', 'ary nanao antso avo izy ireo hoe hisy fifadian-kanina, ary nasainy nipetraka teo alohan’ny olona i nabota.'),
  ('6ab25a54ff73825607b2c476', '2026-09-22T10:37:08.736Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:08.736Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 21, 10, 'Makà lehilahy roa tsy manjary, ka asaivo mipetraka eo anoloany ireo hiampanga azy hoe: ‘Nanozona an’Andriamanitra sy ny mpanjaka ianao!’ Dia ento mivoaka izy, ka torahy vato ho faty.”', 'makà lehilahy roa tsy manjary, ka asaivo mipetraka eo anoloany ireo hiampanga azy hoe: ‘nanozona an’andriamanitra sy ny mpanjaka ianao!’ dia ento mivoaka izy, ka torahy vato ho faty.”'),
  ('6ab25a54ff73825607b2c475', '2026-09-22T10:37:08.736Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:08.736Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 21, 9, 'Izao no nosoratany tao: “Manaova antso avo hoe hisy fifadian-kanina, ary asaivo mipetraka eo alohan’ny olona i Nabota.', 'izao no nosoratany tao: “manaova antso avo hoe hisy fifadian-kanina, ary asaivo mipetraka eo alohan’ny olona i nabota.'),
  ('6ab25a54ff73825607b2c471', '2026-09-22T10:37:08.736Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:08.736Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 21, 5, 'Ary nankao aminy i Jezebela vadiny tamin’ny farany, ka nanao hoe: “Fa maninona ianao no malahelo sy tsy mihinan-kanina?”', 'ary nankao aminy i jezebela vadiny tamin’ny farany, ka nanao hoe: “fa maninona ianao no malahelo sy tsy mihinan-kanina?”'),
  ('6ab25a54ff73825607b2c46f', '2026-09-22T10:37:08.736Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:08.736Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 21, 3, 'Fa hoy i Nabota tamin’i Ahaba: “Sanatria ahy ny hanome anao ny lova avy amin’ny razako, satria tsy mifanaraka amin’ny fihevitr’i Jehovah izany!”', 'fa hoy i nabota tamin’i ahaba: “sanatria ahy ny hanome anao ny lova avy amin’ny razako, satria tsy mifanaraka amin’ny fihevitr’i jehovah izany!”'),
  ('6ab25a54ff73825607b2c46d', '2026-09-22T10:37:08.736Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:08.736Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 21, 1, 'Ary izao no nitranga taorian’izany: Nanana tanimboaloboka iray tao Jezirela i Nabota Jezirelita, teo akaikin’ny lapan’i Ahaba mpanjakan’i Samaria.', 'ary izao no nitranga taorian’izany: nanana tanimboaloboka iray tao jezirela i nabota jezirelita, teo akaikin’ny lapan’i ahaba mpanjakan’i samaria.'),
  ('6ab25a54ff73825607b2c470', '2026-09-22T10:37:08.736Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:08.736Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 21, 4, 'Koa niditra tao an-tranony i Ahaba, sady sosotra no kivy noho ilay tenin’i Nabota Jezirelita taminy hoe: “Tsy homeko anao ny lova avy amin’ny razako.” Dia nandry teo am-pandrianany izy, ary nitodi-damosina, sady tsy nihinan-kanina.', 'koa niditra tao an-tranony i ahaba, sady sosotra no kivy noho ilay tenin’i nabota jezirelita taminy hoe: “tsy homeko anao ny lova avy amin’ny razako.” dia nandry teo am-pandrianany izy, ary nitodi-damosina, sady tsy nihinan-kanina.'),
  ('6ab25a54ff73825607b2c474', '2026-09-22T10:37:08.736Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:08.736Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 21, 8, 'Koa nanoratra taratasy tamin’ny anaran’i Ahaba i Jezebela, ary nasiany tombo-kasen’ny mpanjaka izany, ka nalefany tany amin’ny anti-panahy sy ny olona ambony izay niara-nonina tamin’i Nabota tao an-tanànany.', 'koa nanoratra taratasy tamin’ny anaran’i ahaba i jezebela, ary nasiany tombo-kasen’ny mpanjaka izany, ka nalefany tany amin’ny anti-panahy sy ny olona ambony izay niara-nonina tamin’i nabota tao an-tanànany.'),
  ('6ab25a54ff73825607b2c46e', '2026-09-22T10:37:08.736Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:08.736Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 21, 2, 'Koa hoy i Ahaba tamin’i Nabota: “Omeo ahy ny tanimboalobokao mba hataoko zaridaina fambolena legioma, fa akaikin’ny tranoko ilay izy. Dia homeko tanimboaloboka tsara noho io ianao ho takalony, na homeko vola ianao ho vidiny, raha mety aminao.”', 'koa hoy i ahaba tamin’i nabota: “omeo ahy ny tanimboalobokao mba hataoko zaridaina fambolena legioma, fa akaikin’ny tranoko ilay izy. dia homeko tanimboaloboka tsara noho io ianao ho takalony, na homeko vola ianao ho vidiny, raha mety aminao.”'),
  ('6ab25a54ff73825607b2c477', '2026-09-22T10:37:08.736Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:08.736Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 21, 11, 'Koa izay nampanaovin’i Jezebela azy no nataon’ireo lehilahy tao an-tanànan’i Nabota, dia ny anti-panahy sy ny olona ambony izay nonina tao an-tanànany. Araka izay voasoratra tao amin’ny taratasy nalefan’i Jezebela tany amin’izy ireo no nataony.', 'koa izay nampanaovin’i jezebela azy no nataon’ireo lehilahy tao an-tanànan’i nabota, dia ny anti-panahy sy ny olona ambony izay nonina tao an-tanànany. araka izay voasoratra tao amin’ny taratasy nalefan’i jezebela tany amin’izy ireo no nataony.'),
  ('6ab25a54ff73825607b2c473', '2026-09-22T10:37:08.736Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:08.736Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 21, 7, 'Dia hoy i Jezebela vadiny: “Tsy ianao angaha moa no mpanjakan’ny Israely? Mitsangàna, mihinàna hanina, ary aoka ho falifaly ny fonao. Izaho no hanome anao ny tanimboalobok’i Nabota Jezirelita.”', 'dia hoy i jezebela vadiny: “tsy ianao angaha moa no mpanjakan’ny israely? mitsangàna, mihinàna hanina, ary aoka ho falifaly ny fonao. izaho no hanome anao ny tanimboalobok’i nabota jezirelita.”'),
  ('6ab25a54ff73825607b2c479', '2026-09-22T10:37:08.736Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:08.736Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 21, 13, 'Dia nisy roa lahy niditra ka nipetraka teo anoloan’i Nabota, ary olona tsy manjary izy roa lahy ireo. Ary niampanga an’i Nabota teo anatrehan’ny olona izy roa lahy hoe: “Nanozona an’Andriamanitra sy ny mpanjaka i Nabota!” Avy eo, dia nentin’ny olona nivoaka teny an-tsisin-tanàna izy, ary notorahany vato ka maty.', 'dia nisy roa lahy niditra ka nipetraka teo anoloan’i nabota, ary olona tsy manjary izy roa lahy ireo. ary niampanga an’i nabota teo anatrehan’ny olona izy roa lahy hoe: “nanozona an’andriamanitra sy ny mpanjaka i nabota!” avy eo, dia nentin’ny olona nivoaka teny an-tsisin-tanàna izy, ary notorahany vato ka maty.'),
  ('6ab25a54ff73825607b2c472', '2026-09-22T10:37:08.736Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:08.736Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 21, 6, 'Dia hoy i Ahaba: “Satria nilaza tamin’i Nabota Jezirelita aho hoe: ‘Omeo ahy ny tanimboalobokao hovidiko, na raha tianao, dia homeko tanimboaloboka hafa ianao ho takalony’, nefa hoy izy: ‘Tsy homeko anao ny tanimboaloboko.’”', 'dia hoy i ahaba: “satria nilaza tamin’i nabota jezirelita aho hoe: ‘omeo ahy ny tanimboalobokao hovidiko, na raha tianao, dia homeko tanimboaloboka hafa ianao ho takalony’, nefa hoy izy: ‘tsy homeko anao ny tanimboaloboko.’”'),
  ('6ab25a54ff73825607b2c47d', '2026-09-22T10:37:08.737Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:08.737Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 21, 17, 'Ary tonga tamin’i Elia Tisbita ny tenin’i Jehovah hoe:', 'ary tonga tamin’i elia tisbita ny tenin’i jehovah hoe:'),
  ('6ab25a54ff73825607b2c489', '2026-09-22T10:37:08.737Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:08.737Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 21, 29, '“Hitanao ve ny fanetren-tenan’i Ahaba teo anatrehako? Nanetry tena izy noho ny amiko, ka tsy hataoko tonga amin’izao androny izao ilay loza. Amin’ny andron’ny zanany kosa vao hataoko tonga amin’ny ankohonany izany.”', '“hitanao ve ny fanetren-tenan’i ahaba teo anatrehako? nanetry tena izy noho ny amiko, ka tsy hataoko tonga amin’izao androny izao ilay loza. amin’ny andron’ny zanany kosa vao hataoko tonga amin’ny ankohonany izany.”'),
  ('6ab25a54ff73825607b2c480', '2026-09-22T10:37:08.737Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:08.737Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 21, 20, 'Ary hoy i Ahaba tamin’i Elia: “Hitanao ihany angaha aho, ry ilay fahavaloko?” Dia hoy i Elia: “Hitako tokoa ianao. ‘Noho ianao tsy manan-tsaina afa-tsy ny hanao izay ratsy eo imason’i Jehovah,', 'ary hoy i ahaba tamin’i elia: “hitanao ihany angaha aho, ry ilay fahavaloko?” dia hoy i elia: “hitako tokoa ianao. ‘noho ianao tsy manan-tsaina afa-tsy ny hanao izay ratsy eo imason’i jehovah,'),
  ('6ab25a54ff73825607b2c483', '2026-09-22T10:37:08.737Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:08.737Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 21, 23, 'Izao kosa no nolazain’i Jehovah momba an’i Jezebela: ‘Ny alika mihitsy no hihinana an’i Jezebela ao amin’ilay sombin-tany eto Jezirela.', 'izao kosa no nolazain’i jehovah momba an’i jezebela: ‘ny alika mihitsy no hihinana an’i jezebela ao amin’ilay sombin-tany eto jezirela.'),
  ('6ab25a54ff73825607b2c488', '2026-09-22T10:37:08.737Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:08.737Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 21, 28, 'Koa tonga tamin’i Elia Tisbita ny tenin’i Jehovah, nanao hoe:', 'koa tonga tamin’i elia tisbita ny tenin’i jehovah, nanao hoe:'),
  ('6ab25a54ff73825607b2c487', '2026-09-22T10:37:08.737Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:08.737Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 21, 27, 'Raha vao ren’i Ahaba izany, dia nandrovitra ny akanjony izy, ka nitafy lamba gony nataony nanolo-koditra. Dia nifady hanina izy sady nandry nitafy gony teo foana. Ary ny famindrany dia nahitana fa kivy tanteraka izy.', 'raha vao ren’i ahaba izany, dia nandrovitra ny akanjony izy, ka nitafy lamba gony nataony nanolo-koditra. dia nifady hanina izy sady nandry nitafy gony teo foana. ary ny famindrany dia nahitana fa kivy tanteraka izy.'),
  ('6ab25a54ff73825607b2c485', '2026-09-22T10:37:08.737Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:08.737Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 21, 25, 'Tsy nisy mihitsy olona sahala amin’i Ahaba, izay tsy nanan-tsaina afa-tsy ny hanao izay ratsy teo imason’i Jehovah noho ny fampirisihan’i Jezebela vadiny.', 'tsy nisy mihitsy olona sahala amin’i ahaba, izay tsy nanan-tsaina afa-tsy ny hanao izay ratsy teo imason’i jehovah noho ny fampirisihan’i jezebela vadiny.'),
  ('6ab25a54ff73825607b2c47b', '2026-09-22T10:37:08.737Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:08.737Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 21, 15, 'Raha vao ren’i Jezebela fa notoraham-bato i Nabota ka maty, dia niteny avy hatrany tamin’i Ahaba izy hoe: “Mitsangàna, ka alaivo ho fanananao ny tanimboalobok’i Nabota Jezirelita, izay tsy nomeny hovidinao. Efa maty mantsy i Nabota, fa tsy velona intsony.”', 'raha vao ren’i jezebela fa notoraham-bato i nabota ka maty, dia niteny avy hatrany tamin’i ahaba izy hoe: “mitsangàna, ka alaivo ho fanananao ny tanimboalobok’i nabota jezirelita, izay tsy nomeny hovidinao. efa maty mantsy i nabota, fa tsy velona intsony.”'),
  ('6ab25a54ff73825607b2c47f', '2026-09-22T10:37:08.737Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:08.737Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 21, 19, 'Koa lazao aminy hoe: ‘Izao no nolazain’i Jehovah: “Sady namono olona ve ianao no naka fananan’olona?”’ Lazao aminy koa hoe: ‘Izao no nolazain’i Jehovah: “Eo amin’izay nilelafan’ny alika ny ran’i Nabota no hilelafan’ny alika ny ranao, eny, ny ranao io mihitsy.”’”', 'koa lazao aminy hoe: ‘izao no nolazain’i jehovah: “sady namono olona ve ianao no naka fananan’olona?”’ lazao aminy koa hoe: ‘izao no nolazain’i jehovah: “eo amin’izay nilelafan’ny alika ny ran’i nabota no hilelafan’ny alika ny ranao, eny, ny ranao io mihitsy.”’”'),
  ('6ab25a54ff73825607b2c484', '2026-09-22T10:37:08.737Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:08.737Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 21, 24, 'Izay ankohonan’i Ahaba maty ao an-tanàna dia hohanin’ny alika, ary izay maty any an-tsaha kosa hohanin’ny voro-manidina.', 'izay ankohonan’i ahaba maty ao an-tanàna dia hohanin’ny alika, ary izay maty any an-tsaha kosa hohanin’ny voro-manidina.'),
  ('6ab25a54ff73825607b2c482', '2026-09-22T10:37:08.737Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:08.737Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 21, 22, 'Ary hataoko sahala amin’ny ankohonan’i Jeroboama zanak’i Nebata ny ankohonanao, eny, hataoko sahala amin’ny ankohonan’i Basa zanak’i Ahia, noho ny nanaovanao izay hampahatezitra ahy sady nampanotanao ny Israely.’', 'ary hataoko sahala amin’ny ankohonan’i jeroboama zanak’i nebata ny ankohonanao, eny, hataoko sahala amin’ny ankohonan’i basa zanak’i ahia, noho ny nanaovanao izay hampahatezitra ahy sady nampanotanao ny israely.’'),
  ('6ab25a54ff73825607b2c47a', '2026-09-22T10:37:08.737Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:08.737Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 21, 14, 'Dia nandefa iraka tany amin’i Jezebela izy ireo, nanao hoe: “Efa notoraham-bato i Nabota ka maty.”', 'dia nandefa iraka tany amin’i jezebela izy ireo, nanao hoe: “efa notoraham-bato i nabota ka maty.”'),
  ('6ab25a54ff73825607b2c47e', '2026-09-22T10:37:08.737Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:08.737Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 21, 18, '“Mitsangàna, ka midìna hihaona amin’i Ahaba mpanjakan’ny Israely, izay ao Samaria. Any amin’ny tanimboalobok’i Nabota izy izao. Nidina any izy mba haka izany ho fananany.', '“mitsangàna, ka midìna hihaona amin’i ahaba mpanjakan’ny israely, izay ao samaria. any amin’ny tanimboalobok’i nabota izy izao. nidina any izy mba haka izany ho fananany.'),
  ('6ab25a54ff73825607b2c486', '2026-09-22T10:37:08.737Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:08.737Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 21, 26, 'Ary nanao zavatra tena nahatsiravina i Ahaba, tamin’izy nanaraka ny sampy maharikoriko, tsy nisy hafa tamin’ny nataon’ny Amorita, izay noroahin’i Jehovah tsy ho eo anatrehan’ny zanak’Israely.’”', 'ary nanao zavatra tena nahatsiravina i ahaba, tamin’izy nanaraka ny sampy maharikoriko, tsy nisy hafa tamin’ny nataon’ny amorita, izay noroahin’i jehovah tsy ho eo anatrehan’ny zanak’israely.’”'),
  ('6ab25a54ff73825607b2c481', '2026-09-22T10:37:08.737Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:08.737Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 21, 21, 'dia hahatonga loza aminao aho ka hofongorako tanteraka ny taranakao, ary haringako ny lahy rehetra anisan’ny ankohonanao, mbamin’izay tsy misy mpiaro sy tsy misy ilana azy eo amin’ny Israely.', 'dia hahatonga loza aminao aho ka hofongorako tanteraka ny taranakao, ary haringako ny lahy rehetra anisan’ny ankohonanao, mbamin’izay tsy misy mpiaro sy tsy misy ilana azy eo amin’ny israely.'),
  ('6ab25a54ff73825607b2c47c', '2026-09-22T10:37:08.737Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:08.737Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 21, 16, 'Raha vao ren’i Ahaba fa maty i Nabota, dia nitsangana avy hatrany izy ka nidina tany amin’ny tanimboalobok’i Nabota Jezirelita, mba haka izany ho fananany.', 'raha vao ren’i ahaba fa maty i nabota, dia nitsangana avy hatrany izy ka nidina tany amin’ny tanimboalobok’i nabota jezirelita, mba haka izany ho fananany.'),
  ('6ab25a55f0c8efc803e0235e', '2026-09-22T10:37:09.799Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:09.799Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 22, 43, 'Nanao hoatran’izay rehetra nataon’i Asa rainy foana izy, ka tsy niala tamin’izany, fa nanao izay mahitsy teo imason’i Jehovah. Mbola nisy ihany anefa ny toerana avo. Mbola nanao sorona ihany ny olona, sady nanolotra setroka ho sorona teny amin’ny toerana avo.', 'nanao hoatran’izay rehetra nataon’i asa rainy foana izy, ka tsy niala tamin’izany, fa nanao izay mahitsy teo imason’i jehovah. mbola nisy ihany anefa ny toerana avo. mbola nanao sorona ihany ny olona, sady nanolotra setroka ho sorona teny amin’ny toerana avo.'),
  ('6ab25a55f0c8efc803e02357', '2026-09-22T10:37:09.799Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:09.799Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 22, 36, 'Ary rehefa hilentika ny masoandro, dia nalefa eran’ny toby izao antsoantso mafy izao: “Samia mody any an-tanànany, ary samia mody any amin’ny taniny!”', 'ary rehefa hilentika ny masoandro, dia nalefa eran’ny toby izao antsoantso mafy izao: “samia mody any an-tanànany, ary samia mody any amin’ny taniny!”'),
  ('6ab25a55f0c8efc803e02340', '2026-09-22T10:37:09.799Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:09.799Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 22, 13, 'Ary niteny tamin’i Mikaia ilay iraka nandeha niantso azy, ka nanao hoe: “Iray teny daholo ireo mpaminany ka samy nilaza zava-tsoa tamin’ny mpanjaka. Koa aoka re mba ho toy ny tenin’izy ireo koa ny teninao, azafady, ka mba milazà zava-tsoa e!”', 'ary niteny tamin’i mikaia ilay iraka nandeha niantso azy, ka nanao hoe: “iray teny daholo ireo mpaminany ka samy nilaza zava-tsoa tamin’ny mpanjaka. koa aoka re mba ho toy ny tenin’izy ireo koa ny teninao, azafady, ka mba milazà zava-tsoa e!”'),
  ('6ab25a55f0c8efc803e0233b', '2026-09-22T10:37:09.799Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:09.799Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 22, 8, 'Dia hoy ny mpanjakan’ny Israely tamin’i Josafata: “Mbola misy lehilahy iray any azo asaina manontany an’i Jehovah. Tena halako anefa izy satria tsy mba maminany zava-tsoa momba ahy, fa zava-dratsy. I Mikaia zanak’i Jimla izany.” Fa hoy i Josafata: “Aza dia miteny toy izany, ry mpanjaka ô!”', 'dia hoy ny mpanjakan’ny israely tamin’i josafata: “mbola misy lehilahy iray any azo asaina manontany an’i jehovah. tena halako anefa izy satria tsy mba maminany zava-tsoa momba ahy, fa zava-dratsy. i mikaia zanak’i jimla izany.” fa hoy i josafata: “aza dia miteny toy izany, ry mpanjaka ô!”'),
  ('6ab25a55f0c8efc803e0233a', '2026-09-22T10:37:09.799Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:09.799Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 22, 7, 'Fa hoy i Josafata: “Tsy mbola misy mpaminanin’i Jehovah moa eto? Aleo izy no asaintsika manontany.”', 'fa hoy i josafata: “tsy mbola misy mpaminanin’i jehovah moa eto? aleo izy no asaintsika manontany.”'),
  ('6ab25a55f0c8efc803e02337', '2026-09-22T10:37:09.799Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:09.799Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 22, 4, 'Hoy koa izy tamin’i Josafata: “Hiaraka amiko hiady any Ramota-gileada ve ianao?” Dia hoy i Josafata: “Iray ihany izaho sy ianao, ary vahoakanao ihany ny vahoakako, ary ny soavaliko dia soavalinao.”', 'hoy koa izy tamin’i josafata: “hiaraka amiko hiady any ramota-gileada ve ianao?” dia hoy i josafata: “iray ihany izaho sy ianao, ary vahoakanao ihany ny vahoakako, ary ny soavaliko dia soavalinao.”'),
  ('6ab25a55f0c8efc803e0234e', '2026-09-22T10:37:09.799Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:09.799Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 22, 27, 'Dia ilazao izy ireo hoe: ‘Izao no nolazain’ny mpanjaka: “Ampidiro am-ponja ilehio, ka ataovy kely ny anjara mofo sy rano omena azy mandra-piveriko soa aman-tsara.”’”', 'dia ilazao izy ireo hoe: ‘izao no nolazain’ny mpanjaka: “ampidiro am-ponja ilehio, ka ataovy kely ny anjara mofo sy rano omena azy mandra-piveriko soa aman-tsara.”’”'),
  ('6ab25a55f0c8efc803e02354', '2026-09-22T10:37:09.799Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:09.799Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 22, 33, 'Ary raha vao hitan’ireo lehiben’ny kalesy fa tsy ny mpanjakan’ny Israely izy, dia niverina avy hatrany ireo ka tsy nanaraka azy intsony.', 'ary raha vao hitan’ireo lehiben’ny kalesy fa tsy ny mpanjakan’ny israely izy, dia niverina avy hatrany ireo ka tsy nanaraka azy intsony.'),
  ('6ab25a55f0c8efc803e02353', '2026-09-22T10:37:09.799Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:09.799Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 22, 32, 'Raha vao hitan’ireo lehiben’ny kalesy i Josafata, dia hoy izy ireo anakampo: “Io mihitsy no mpanjakan’ny Israely.” Koa nivily izy ireo mba hiady taminy. Dia niantso vonjy i Josafata.', 'raha vao hitan’ireo lehiben’ny kalesy i josafata, dia hoy izy ireo anakampo: “io mihitsy no mpanjakan’ny israely.” koa nivily izy ireo mba hiady taminy. dia niantso vonjy i josafata.'),
  ('6ab25a55f0c8efc803e02346', '2026-09-22T10:37:09.799Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:09.799Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 22, 19, 'Ary hoy i Mikaia: “Henoy àry ny tenin’i Jehovah: Hitako i Jehovah mipetraka eo amin’ny seza fiandrianany, ary ny tafiky ny lanitra manontolo mitsangana eo akaikiny, eo ankavanany sy eo ankaviany.', 'ary hoy i mikaia: “henoy àry ny tenin’i jehovah: hitako i jehovah mipetraka eo amin’ny seza fiandrianany, ary ny tafiky ny lanitra manontolo mitsangana eo akaikiny, eo ankavanany sy eo ankaviany.'),
  ('6ab25a55f0c8efc803e02360', '2026-09-22T10:37:09.799Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:09.799Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 22, 45, 'Ary ny sisa amin’ny tantaran’i Josafata, mbamin’ny hery nentiny nanao zavatra ary ny ady nataony, tsy efa voasoratra ao amin’ny boky mirakitra ny tantara tamin’ny andron’ireo mpanjakan’ny Joda ve izany?', 'ary ny sisa amin’ny tantaran’i josafata, mbamin’ny hery nentiny nanao zavatra ary ny ady nataony, tsy efa voasoratra ao amin’ny boky mirakitra ny tantara tamin’ny andron’ireo mpanjakan’ny joda ve izany?'),
  ('6ab25a55f0c8efc803e02345', '2026-09-22T10:37:09.799Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:09.799Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 22, 18, 'Dia hoy ny mpanjakan’ny Israely tamin’i Josafata: “Tsy efa nilaza taminao moa aho hoe: ‘Tsy haminany zava-tsoa momba ahy izy, fa zava-dratsy ihany’?”', 'dia hoy ny mpanjakan’ny israely tamin’i josafata: “tsy efa nilaza taminao moa aho hoe: ‘tsy haminany zava-tsoa momba ahy izy, fa zava-dratsy ihany’?”'),
  ('6ab25a55f0c8efc803e02344', '2026-09-22T10:37:09.799Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:09.799Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 22, 17, 'Dia hoy i Mikaia: “Ireny fa hitako miparitaka eny an-tendrombohitra, tahaka ny ondry tsy misy mpiandry, ny Israelita rehetra. Ary hoy i Jehovah: ‘Tsy manan-tompo ireo. Aoka izy samy hody soa aman-tsara any an-tranony.’”', 'dia hoy i mikaia: “ireny fa hitako miparitaka eny an-tendrombohitra, tahaka ny ondry tsy misy mpiandry, ny israelita rehetra. ary hoy i jehovah: ‘tsy manan-tompo ireo. aoka izy samy hody soa aman-tsara any an-tranony.’”'),
  ('6ab25a55f0c8efc803e0233c', '2026-09-22T10:37:09.799Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:09.799Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 22, 9, 'Koa niantso tandapa iray ny mpanjakan’ny Israely, ka nanao hoe: “Alaivo haingana i Mikaia zanak’i Jimla.”', 'koa niantso tandapa iray ny mpanjakan’ny israely, ka nanao hoe: “alaivo haingana i mikaia zanak’i jimla.”'),
  ('6ab25a55f0c8efc803e0235c', '2026-09-22T10:37:09.799Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:09.799Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 22, 41, 'Ary i Josafata zanak’i Asa no lasa mpanjakan’ny Joda, tamin’ny taona fahefatra nanjakan’i Ahaba mpanjakan’ny Israely.', 'ary i josafata zanak’i asa no lasa mpanjakan’ny joda, tamin’ny taona fahefatra nanjakan’i ahaba mpanjakan’ny israely.'),
  ('6ab25a55f0c8efc803e02351', '2026-09-22T10:37:09.799Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:09.799Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 22, 30, 'Ary hoy ny mpanjakan’ny Israely tamin’i Josafata: “Mody hanao olon-kafa aho ka hirotsaka ao amin’ny ady, fa ianao kosa anaovy ny akanjom-boninahitrao.” Koa mody nanao olon-kafa tokoa ny mpanjakan’ny Israely, ka nirotsaka tao amin’ny ady.', 'ary hoy ny mpanjakan’ny israely tamin’i josafata: “mody hanao olon-kafa aho ka hirotsaka ao amin’ny ady, fa ianao kosa anaovy ny akanjom-boninahitrao.” koa mody nanao olon-kafa tokoa ny mpanjakan’ny israely, ka nirotsaka tao amin’ny ady.'),
  ('6ab25a55f0c8efc803e0233e', '2026-09-22T10:37:09.799Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:09.799Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 22, 11, 'Dia nanamboatra tandroka vy i Zedekia zanak’i Kenana, ka niteny hoe: “Izao no nolazain’i Jehovah: ‘Amin’ireto no hanotoanao ny Syrianina mandra-pandringanao azy tanteraka.’”', 'dia nanamboatra tandroka vy i zedekia zanak’i kenana, ka niteny hoe: “izao no nolazain’i jehovah: ‘amin’ireto no hanotoanao ny syrianina mandra-pandringanao azy tanteraka.’”'),
  ('6ab25a55f0c8efc803e02361', '2026-09-22T10:37:09.799Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:09.799Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 22, 46, 'Nofoanany tsy hisy teo amin’ilay tany ny sisa tamin’ireo lehilahy mpivaro-tenan’ny tempoly, izay mbola tavela tamin’ny andron’i Asa rainy.', 'nofoanany tsy hisy teo amin’ilay tany ny sisa tamin’ireo lehilahy mpivaro-tenan’ny tempoly, izay mbola tavela tamin’ny andron’i asa rainy.'),
  ('6ab25a55f0c8efc803e02350', '2026-09-22T10:37:09.799Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:09.799Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 22, 29, 'Dia niakatra nankany Ramota-gileada ny mpanjakan’ny Israely, sy Josafata mpanjakan’ny Joda.', 'dia niakatra nankany ramota-gileada ny mpanjakan’ny israely, sy josafata mpanjakan’ny joda.'),
  ('6ab25a55f0c8efc803e0234f', '2026-09-22T10:37:09.799Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:09.799Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 22, 28, 'Ary hoy i Mikaia: “Raha tafaverina soa aman-tsara ianao, dia tsy i Jehovah no niteny tamiko.” Ary hoy koa izy: “Renareo rehetra izany, rey olona!”', 'ary hoy i mikaia: “raha tafaverina soa aman-tsara ianao, dia tsy i jehovah no niteny tamiko.” ary hoy koa izy: “renareo rehetra izany, rey olona!”'),
  ('6ab25a55f0c8efc803e0235a', '2026-09-22T10:37:09.799Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:09.799Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 22, 39, 'Ary ny sisa amin’ny tantaran’i Ahaba, mbamin’izay rehetra nataony, sy ny trano ivoara natsangany ary ny tanàna rehetra naoriny, tsy efa voasoratra ao amin’ny boky mirakitra ny tantara tamin’ny andron’ireo mpanjakan’ny Israely ve izany?', 'ary ny sisa amin’ny tantaran’i ahaba, mbamin’izay rehetra nataony, sy ny trano ivoara natsangany ary ny tanàna rehetra naoriny, tsy efa voasoratra ao amin’ny boky mirakitra ny tantara tamin’ny andron’ireo mpanjakan’ny israely ve izany?'),
  ('6ab25a55f0c8efc803e02341', '2026-09-22T10:37:09.799Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:09.799Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 22, 14, 'Fa hoy i Mikaia: “Raha mbola velona koa i Jehovah, dia izay holazain’i Jehovah amiko ihany no hambarako.”', 'fa hoy i mikaia: “raha mbola velona koa i jehovah, dia izay holazain’i jehovah amiko ihany no hambarako.”'),
  ('6ab25a55f0c8efc803e02355', '2026-09-22T10:37:09.799Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:09.799Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 22, 34, 'Ary nisy lehilahy nandefalefa zana-tsipìka anjoanjo fotsiny, ka voany teo anelanelan’ny tapany samy hafa amin’ilay akanjo mifono vy ny mpanjakan’ny Israely. Koa hoy ny mpanjaka tamin’ny mpitondra kalesiny: “Avilio ny kalesy, ka ento miala eto aho, fa maratra mafy.”', 'ary nisy lehilahy nandefalefa zana-tsipìka anjoanjo fotsiny, ka voany teo anelanelan’ny tapany samy hafa amin’ilay akanjo mifono vy ny mpanjakan’ny israely. koa hoy ny mpanjaka tamin’ny mpitondra kalesiny: “avilio ny kalesy, ka ento miala eto aho, fa maratra mafy.”'),
  ('6ab25a55f0c8efc803e0234c', '2026-09-22T10:37:09.799Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:09.799Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 22, 25, 'Dia hoy i Mikaia: “Ho hitanao ny lalany amin’ny andro hidiranao ao amin’ny efitra anatiny indrindra mba hiafina ao.”', 'dia hoy i mikaia: “ho hitanao ny lalany amin’ny andro hidiranao ao amin’ny efitra anatiny indrindra mba hiafina ao.”'),
  ('6ab25a55f0c8efc803e0234b', '2026-09-22T10:37:09.799Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:09.799Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 22, 24, 'Ary nanatona i Zedekia zanak’i Kenana, ka namely tehamaina an’i Mikaia, sady nanao hoe: “Taiza ny lalana nivoahan’ny fanahin’i Jehovah tamiko mba hiteny tamin’ialahy?”', 'ary nanatona i zedekia zanak’i kenana, ka namely tehamaina an’i mikaia, sady nanao hoe: “taiza ny lalana nivoahan’ny fanahin’i jehovah tamiko mba hiteny tamin’ialahy?”'),
  ('6ab25a55f0c8efc803e0233d', '2026-09-22T10:37:09.799Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:09.799Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 22, 10, 'Ary samy nipetraka teo amin’ny seza fiandrianany sady samy nanao akanjom-boninahitra ny mpanjakan’ny Israely sy Josafata mpanjakan’ny Joda, teo amin’ilay famoloana teo amin’ny fidirana amin’ny vavahadin’i Samaria. Ary nanao toy ny fanaon’ny mpaminany teo anatrehan’izy roa lahy ny mpaminany rehetra.', 'ary samy nipetraka teo amin’ny seza fiandrianany sady samy nanao akanjom-boninahitra ny mpanjakan’ny israely sy josafata mpanjakan’ny joda, teo amin’ilay famoloana teo amin’ny fidirana amin’ny vavahadin’i samaria. ary nanao toy ny fanaon’ny mpaminany teo anatrehan’izy roa lahy ny mpaminany rehetra.'),
  ('6ab25a55f0c8efc803e02335', '2026-09-22T10:37:09.799Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:09.799Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 22, 2, 'Tamin’ny taona fahatelo, dia nidina tany amin’ny mpanjakan’ny Israely i Josafata mpanjakan’ny Joda.', 'tamin’ny taona fahatelo, dia nidina tany amin’ny mpanjakan’ny israely i josafata mpanjakan’ny joda.'),
  ('6ab25a55f0c8efc803e0235d', '2026-09-22T10:37:09.799Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:09.799Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 22, 42, 'Dimy amby telopolo taona i Josafata, tamin’izy nanomboka nanjaka, ary dimy amby roapolo taona no nanjakany tany Jerosalema. Ary ny anaran-dreniny dia Azoba, zanak’i Sily.', 'dimy amby telopolo taona i josafata, tamin’izy nanomboka nanjaka, ary dimy amby roapolo taona no nanjakany tany jerosalema. ary ny anaran-dreniny dia azoba, zanak’i sily.'),
  ('6ab25a55f0c8efc803e02356', '2026-09-22T10:37:09.799Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:09.799Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 22, 35, 'Nihamafy ny ady tamin’izay fotoana izay, ary voatery notohanana tao amin’ny kalesiny ny mpanjaka, mba ho afaka hitsangana foana hiatrika ny Syrianina. Dia maty izy rehefa harivariva. Ary tsy nety nijanona ny ra avy tamin’ny ratrany, ka niraraka tao amin’ilay kalesin’ady.', 'nihamafy ny ady tamin’izay fotoana izay, ary voatery notohanana tao amin’ny kalesiny ny mpanjaka, mba ho afaka hitsangana foana hiatrika ny syrianina. dia maty izy rehefa harivariva. ary tsy nety nijanona ny ra avy tamin’ny ratrany, ka niraraka tao amin’ilay kalesin’ady.'),
  ('6ab25a55f0c8efc803e02352', '2026-09-22T10:37:09.799Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:09.799Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 22, 31, 'Ny mpanjakan’i Syria anefa efa nandidy azy roa amby telopolo lahy, lehiben’ny kalesiny, hoe: “Aza miady amin’ny kely na amin’ny lehibe, fa amin’ny mpanjakan’ny Israely ihany.”', 'ny mpanjakan’i syria anefa efa nandidy azy roa amby telopolo lahy, lehiben’ny kalesiny, hoe: “aza miady amin’ny kely na amin’ny lehibe, fa amin’ny mpanjakan’ny israely ihany.”'),
  ('6ab25a55f0c8efc803e0234a', '2026-09-22T10:37:09.799Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:09.799Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 22, 23, 'Koa nasian’i Jehovah fanahy mamitaka tao am-bavan’ireto mpaminaninao rehetra ireto. Nilaza anefa i Jehovah fa loza no hanjo anao.”', 'koa nasian’i jehovah fanahy mamitaka tao am-bavan’ireto mpaminaninao rehetra ireto. nilaza anefa i jehovah fa loza no hanjo anao.”'),
  ('6ab25a55f0c8efc803e02347', '2026-09-22T10:37:09.799Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:09.799Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 22, 20, 'Dia hoy i Jehovah: ‘Iza no hamitaka an’i Ahaba mba hiakarany any Ramota-gileada ka hahalavo azy any?’ Ary niteny toy izao ny anankiray, ary ny anankiray kosa niteny toy izao.', 'dia hoy i jehovah: ‘iza no hamitaka an’i ahaba mba hiakarany any ramota-gileada ka hahalavo azy any?’ ary niteny toy izao ny anankiray, ary ny anankiray kosa niteny toy izao.'),
  ('6ab25a55f0c8efc803e02342', '2026-09-22T10:37:09.799Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:09.799Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 22, 15, 'Dia nankao amin’ny mpanjaka izy, ary hoy ny mpanjaka taminy: “Handeha hiady amin’i Ramota-gileada ve izahay, ry Mikaia, sa tsy handeha?” Avy hatrany dia hoy i Mikaia: “Miakara, ary mahazoa fandresena, fa hatolotr’i Jehovah eo an-tanan’ny mpanjaka tokoa ilay tanàna.”', 'dia nankao amin’ny mpanjaka izy, ary hoy ny mpanjaka taminy: “handeha hiady amin’i ramota-gileada ve izahay, ry mikaia, sa tsy handeha?” avy hatrany dia hoy i mikaia: “miakara, ary mahazoa fandresena, fa hatolotr’i jehovah eo an-tanan’ny mpanjaka tokoa ilay tanàna.”'),
  ('6ab25a55f0c8efc803e02334', '2026-09-22T10:37:09.799Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:09.799Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 22, 1, 'Tsy nisy ady teo amin’ny Syrianina sy ny Israely nandritra ny telo taona.', 'tsy nisy ady teo amin’ny syrianina sy ny israely nandritra ny telo taona.'),
  ('6ab25a55f0c8efc803e0235f', '2026-09-22T10:37:09.799Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:09.799Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 22, 44, 'Ary tsara fihavanana tamin’ny mpanjakan’ny Israely foana i Josafata.', 'ary tsara fihavanana tamin’ny mpanjakan’ny israely foana i josafata.'),
  ('6ab25a55f0c8efc803e0235b', '2026-09-22T10:37:09.799Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:09.799Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 22, 40, 'Dia nodimandry any amin’ny razany i Ahaba, ary i Ahazia zanany no nanjaka nandimby azy.', 'dia nodimandry any amin’ny razany i ahaba, ary i ahazia zanany no nanjaka nandimby azy.'),
  ('6ab25a55f0c8efc803e0234d', '2026-09-22T10:37:09.799Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:09.799Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 22, 26, 'Koa hoy ny mpanjakan’ny Israely: “Ento i Mikaia, ka avereno any amin’i Amona lehiben’ny tanàna sy Joasy zanaky ny mpanjaka.', 'koa hoy ny mpanjakan’ny israely: “ento i mikaia, ka avereno any amin’i amona lehiben’ny tanàna sy joasy zanaky ny mpanjaka.'),
  ('6ab25a55f0c8efc803e02343', '2026-09-22T10:37:09.799Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:09.799Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 22, 16, 'Dia hoy ny mpanjaka: “Impiry aho no hampianiana anao mba tsy hilaza na inona na inona amiko amin’ny anaran’i Jehovah afa-tsy ny marina ihany?”', 'dia hoy ny mpanjaka: “impiry aho no hampianiana anao mba tsy hilaza na inona na inona amiko amin’ny anaran’i jehovah afa-tsy ny marina ihany?”'),
  ('6ab25a55f0c8efc803e02359', '2026-09-22T10:37:09.799Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:09.799Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 22, 38, 'Ary nosasana teo akaikin’ny dobon’i Samaria ilay kalesin’ady, dia nolelafin’ny alika ny ran’i Ahaba, araka ny tenin’i Jehovah. Ary nisy mpivaro-tena nandro teo.', 'ary nosasana teo akaikin’ny dobon’i samaria ilay kalesin’ady, dia nolelafin’ny alika ny ran’i ahaba, araka ny tenin’i jehovah. ary nisy mpivaro-tena nandro teo.'),
  ('6ab25a55f0c8efc803e02339', '2026-09-22T10:37:09.799Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:09.799Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 22, 6, 'Koa novorin’ny mpanjakan’ny Israely ny mpaminany efajato lahy teo ho eo, ka hoy izy tamin’ireo: “Handeha hanafika an’i Ramota-gileada ve aho, sa tsy handeha?” Dia hoy ireo: “Miakara fa hatolotr’i Jehovah eo an-tanan’ny mpanjaka ilay tanàna.”', 'koa novorin’ny mpanjakan’ny israely ny mpaminany efajato lahy teo ho eo, ka hoy izy tamin’ireo: “handeha hanafika an’i ramota-gileada ve aho, sa tsy handeha?” dia hoy ireo: “miakara fa hatolotr’i jehovah eo an-tanan’ny mpanjaka ilay tanàna.”'),
  ('6ab25a55f0c8efc803e02349', '2026-09-22T10:37:09.799Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:09.799Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 22, 22, 'Dia hoy izy: ‘Handeha aho ka ho tonga fanahy mamitaka ao am-bavan’ny mpaminaniny rehetra.’ Ary hoy Andriamanitra: ‘Ho voafitakao izy, ary hahomby tokoa ianao amin’izany. Mandehana àry, ka ataovy izany.’', 'dia hoy izy: ‘handeha aho ka ho tonga fanahy mamitaka ao am-bavan’ny mpaminaniny rehetra.’ ary hoy andriamanitra: ‘ho voafitakao izy, ary hahomby tokoa ianao amin’izany. mandehana àry, ka ataovy izany.’'),
  ('6ab25a55f0c8efc803e02348', '2026-09-22T10:37:09.799Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:09.799Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 22, 21, 'Farany, dia nisy fanahy * iray niroso ka nitsangana teo anatrehan’i Jehovah, ary nanao hoe: ‘Izaho no hamitaka azy.’ Ary hoy i Jehovah taminy: ‘Amin’ny fomba ahoana?’', 'farany, dia nisy fanahy * iray niroso ka nitsangana teo anatrehan’i jehovah, ary nanao hoe: ‘izaho no hamitaka azy.’ ary hoy i jehovah taminy: ‘amin’ny fomba ahoana?’'),
  ('6ab25a55f0c8efc803e02358', '2026-09-22T10:37:09.799Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:09.799Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 22, 37, 'Dia maty ny mpanjaka, ka nentina tany Samaria, ary nalevina tany.', 'dia maty ny mpanjaka, ka nentina tany samaria, ary nalevina tany.'),
  ('6ab25a55f0c8efc803e0233f', '2026-09-22T10:37:09.799Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:09.799Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 22, 12, 'Naminany toy izany koa ny mpaminany hafa rehetra hoe: “Miakara any Ramota-gileada, ka mahazoa fandresena, fa hatolotr’i Jehovah eo an-tanan’ny mpanjaka tokoa ilay tanàna.”', 'naminany toy izany koa ny mpaminany hafa rehetra hoe: “miakara any ramota-gileada, ka mahazoa fandresena, fa hatolotr’i jehovah eo an-tanan’ny mpanjaka tokoa ilay tanàna.”'),
  ('6ab25a55f0c8efc803e02338', '2026-09-22T10:37:09.799Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:09.799Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 22, 5, 'Hoy anefa izy tamin’ny mpanjakan’ny Israely: “Mba anontanio ihany aloha izay tenin’i Jehovah, azafady.”', 'hoy anefa izy tamin’ny mpanjakan’ny israely: “mba anontanio ihany aloha izay tenin’i jehovah, azafady.”'),
  ('6ab25a55f0c8efc803e02336', '2026-09-22T10:37:09.799Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:09.799Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 22, 3, 'Dia hoy ny mpanjakan’ny Israely tamin’ny mpanompony: “Mba fantatrareo moa fa antsika i Ramota-gileada? Koa nahoana isika no misalasala ny haka azy eo an-tanan’ny mpanjakan’i Syria?”', 'dia hoy ny mpanjakan’ny israely tamin’ny mpanompony: “mba fantatrareo moa fa antsika i ramota-gileada? koa nahoana isika no misalasala ny haka azy eo an-tanan’ny mpanjakan’i syria?”'),
  ('6ab25a55f0c8efc803e02365', '2026-09-22T10:37:09.800Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:09.800Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 22, 50, 'Farany, dia nodimandry any amin’ny razany i Josafata, ka nalevina any amin’ny razany tao amin’ny Tanànan’i Davida razambeny. Ary i Jorama zanany no nanjaka nandimby azy.', 'farany, dia nodimandry any amin’ny razany i josafata, ka nalevina any amin’ny razany tao amin’ny tanànan’i davida razambeny. ary i jorama zanany no nanjaka nandimby azy.'),
  ('6ab25a55f0c8efc803e02362', '2026-09-22T10:37:09.800Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:09.800Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 22, 47, 'Tsy nisy mpanjaka tany Edoma, fa lehibem-paritra no nanjaka.', 'tsy nisy mpanjaka tany edoma, fa lehibem-paritra no nanjaka.'),
  ('6ab25a55f0c8efc803e02368', '2026-09-22T10:37:09.800Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:09.800Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 22, 53, 'Nanompo an’i Bala foana izy, sady niankohoka teo anatrehany ary nampahatezitra an’i Jehovah Andriamanitry ny Israely foana, tahaka izay rehetra efa nataon-drainy.', 'nanompo an’i bala foana izy, sady niankohoka teo anatrehany ary nampahatezitra an’i jehovah andriamanitry ny israely foana, tahaka izay rehetra efa nataon-drainy.'),
  ('6ab25a55f0c8efc803e02367', '2026-09-22T10:37:09.800Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:09.800Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 22, 52, 'Ary nanao izay ratsy teo imason’i Jehovah foana izy, sady nanao hoatran’ny rainy sy ny reniny, ary nanao hoatran’i Jeroboama zanak’i Nebata, izay nampanota ny Israely.', 'ary nanao izay ratsy teo imason’i jehovah foana izy, sady nanao hoatran’ny rainy sy ny reniny, ary nanao hoatran’i jeroboama zanak’i nebata, izay nampanota ny israely.'),
  ('6ab25a55f0c8efc803e02366', '2026-09-22T10:37:09.800Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:09.800Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 22, 51, 'Ary i Ahazia zanak’i Ahaba no lasa mpanjakan’ny Israely tao Samaria, tamin’ny taona fahafito ambin’ny folo nanjakan’i Josafata mpanjakan’ny Joda. Nanjaka roa taona teo amin’ny Israely izy.', 'ary i ahazia zanak’i ahaba no lasa mpanjakan’ny israely tao samaria, tamin’ny taona fahafito ambin’ny folo nanjakan’i josafata mpanjakan’ny joda. nanjaka roa taona teo amin’ny israely izy.'),
  ('6ab25a55f0c8efc803e02363', '2026-09-22T10:37:09.800Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:09.800Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 22, 48, 'Ary nanao sambon’i Tarsisy i Josafata, mba handehanana haka volamena tany Ofira. Tsy lasa tany anefa ireo, satria rendrika tao Eziona-gebera.', 'ary nanao sambon’i tarsisy i josafata, mba handehanana haka volamena tany ofira. tsy lasa tany anefa ireo, satria rendrika tao eziona-gebera.'),
  ('6ab25a55f0c8efc803e02364', '2026-09-22T10:37:09.800Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:09.800Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Mpanjaka', 11, 22, 49, 'Tamin’izay i Ahazia zanak’i Ahaba no niteny tamin’i Josafata hoe: “Aoka ny mpanompoko mba handeha amin’ireo sambonao, miaraka amin’ny mpanomponao.” Tsy nety anefa i Josafata.', 'tamin’izay i ahazia zanak’i ahaba no niteny tamin’i josafata hoe: “aoka ny mpanompoko mba handeha amin’ireo sambonao, miaraka amin’ny mpanomponao.” tsy nety anefa i josafata.'),
  ('6ab25a56c190d9f02e9e32e6', '2026-09-22T10:37:10.503Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:10.503Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 1, 3, 'Ary niteny tamin’i Elia Tisbita ny anjelin’i Jehovah hoe: “Miakara hihaona amin’ireo iraky ny mpanjakan’i Samaria, ka lazao aminy hoe: ‘Fa angaha dia tsy misy Andriamanitra mihitsy eto amin’ny Israely, no mandeha manontany an’i Bala-zeboba andriamanitr’i Ekrona ianareo?', 'ary niteny tamin’i elia tisbita ny anjelin’i jehovah hoe: “miakara hihaona amin’ireo iraky ny mpanjakan’i samaria, ka lazao aminy hoe: ‘fa angaha dia tsy misy andriamanitra mihitsy eto amin’ny israely, no mandeha manontany an’i bala-zeboba andriamanitr’i ekrona ianareo?'),
  ('6ab25a56c190d9f02e9e32e5', '2026-09-22T10:37:10.503Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:10.503Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 1, 2, 'Ary i Ahazia dia nianjera avy teo amin’ny makarakaran’ny efitranony tany an-tampon-trano tao Samaria, ka narary. Koa nandefa iraka izy, ka nanao tamin’ireo hoe: “Mandehana, anontanio i Bala-zeboba andriamanitr’i Ekrona, raha ho sitrana amin’izao aretina izao aho, na tsia.”', 'ary i ahazia dia nianjera avy teo amin’ny makarakaran’ny efitranony tany an-tampon-trano tao samaria, ka narary. koa nandefa iraka izy, ka nanao tamin’ireo hoe: “mandehana, anontanio i bala-zeboba andriamanitr’i ekrona, raha ho sitrana amin’izao aretina izao aho, na tsia.”'),
  ('6ab25a56c190d9f02e9e32eb', '2026-09-22T10:37:10.503Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:10.503Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 1, 8, 'Ary hoy ireo: “Lehilahy manao akanjo volom-biby, ary misy fehikibo hoditra eo amin’ny andilany.” Avy hatrany dia hoy izy: “I Elia Tisbita izany.”', 'ary hoy ireo: “lehilahy manao akanjo volom-biby, ary misy fehikibo hoditra eo amin’ny andilany.” avy hatrany dia hoy izy: “i elia tisbita izany.”'),
  ('6ab25a56c190d9f02e9e32e9', '2026-09-22T10:37:10.503Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:10.503Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 1, 6, 'Ary hoy ireo: “Nisy lehilahy niakatra hihaona taminay, ka niteny taminay hoe: ‘Mandehana miverina any amin’ny mpanjaka naniraka anareo, ka lazao aminy hoe: “Izao no nolazain’i Jehovah: ‘Fa angaha dia tsy misy Andriamanitra mihitsy eto amin’ny Israely, no mandefa iraka hanontany an’i Bala-zeboba andriamanitr’i Ekrona ianao? Koa tsy hiala eo amin’io fandriana niakaranao io intsony ianao, fa ho faty tokoa.’”’”', 'ary hoy ireo: “nisy lehilahy niakatra hihaona taminay, ka niteny taminay hoe: ‘mandehana miverina any amin’ny mpanjaka naniraka anareo, ka lazao aminy hoe: “izao no nolazain’i jehovah: ‘fa angaha dia tsy misy andriamanitra mihitsy eto amin’ny israely, no mandefa iraka hanontany an’i bala-zeboba andriamanitr’i ekrona ianao? koa tsy hiala eo amin’io fandriana niakaranao io intsony ianao, fa ho faty tokoa.’”’”'),
  ('6ab25a56c190d9f02e9e32e8', '2026-09-22T10:37:10.503Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:10.503Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 1, 5, 'Raha vao tonga tany amin’ny mpanjaka ireo iraka, dia nanontaniany hoe: “Fa maninona ianareo no niverina?”', 'raha vao tonga tany amin’ny mpanjaka ireo iraka, dia nanontaniany hoe: “fa maninona ianareo no niverina?”'),
  ('6ab25a56c190d9f02e9e32ee', '2026-09-22T10:37:10.503Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:10.503Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 1, 11, 'Ary naniraka lehiben’ny dimampolo hafa, mbamin’ny miaramilany dimampolo indray ny mpanjaka. Dia hoy koa io tamin’i Elia: “Ry lehilahin’Andriamanitra! ‘Midìna haingana ianao’, hoy ny mpanjaka.”', 'ary naniraka lehiben’ny dimampolo hafa, mbamin’ny miaramilany dimampolo indray ny mpanjaka. dia hoy koa io tamin’i elia: “ry lehilahin’andriamanitra! ‘midìna haingana ianao’, hoy ny mpanjaka.”'),
  ('6ab25a56c190d9f02e9e32f5', '2026-09-22T10:37:10.503Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:10.503Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 1, 18, 'Ary ny sisa amin’ny zavatra nataon’i Ahazia, tsy efa voasoratra ao amin’ny boky mirakitra ny tantara tamin’ny andron’ireo mpanjakan’ny Israely ve izany?', 'ary ny sisa amin’ny zavatra nataon’i ahazia, tsy efa voasoratra ao amin’ny boky mirakitra ny tantara tamin’ny andron’ireo mpanjakan’ny israely ve izany?'),
  ('6ab25a56c190d9f02e9e32ef', '2026-09-22T10:37:10.503Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:10.503Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 1, 12, 'Hoy anefa i Elia: “Raha lehilahin’Andriamanitra tokoa aho, dia aoka hisy afo hilatsaka avy any an-danitra handevona anao sy ny miaramilanao dimampolo.” Dia nisy afon’Andriamanitra nilatsaka avy tany an-danitra, ka nandevona azy sy ny miaramilany dimampolo.', 'hoy anefa i elia: “raha lehilahin’andriamanitra tokoa aho, dia aoka hisy afo hilatsaka avy any an-danitra handevona anao sy ny miaramilanao dimampolo.” dia nisy afon’andriamanitra nilatsaka avy tany an-danitra, ka nandevona azy sy ny miaramilany dimampolo.'),
  ('6ab25a56c190d9f02e9e32ed', '2026-09-22T10:37:10.503Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:10.503Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 1, 10, 'Hoy anefa i Elia taminy: “Raha lehilahin’Andriamanitra tokoa aho, dia aoka hisy afo hilatsaka avy any an-danitra handevona anao sy ny miaramilanao dimampolo.” Dia nisy afo nilatsaka avy tany an-danitra, ka nandevona azy sy ny miaramilany dimampolo.', 'hoy anefa i elia taminy: “raha lehilahin’andriamanitra tokoa aho, dia aoka hisy afo hilatsaka avy any an-danitra handevona anao sy ny miaramilanao dimampolo.” dia nisy afo nilatsaka avy tany an-danitra, ka nandevona azy sy ny miaramilany dimampolo.'),
  ('6ab25a56c190d9f02e9e32e7', '2026-09-22T10:37:10.503Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:10.503Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 1, 4, 'Koa izao no nolazain’i Jehovah: “Tsy hiala eo amin’io fandriana niakaranao io intsony ianao, fa ho faty tokoa.”’” Dia lasa i Elia.', 'koa izao no nolazain’i jehovah: “tsy hiala eo amin’io fandriana niakaranao io intsony ianao, fa ho faty tokoa.”’” dia lasa i elia.'),
  ('6ab25a56c190d9f02e9e32f2', '2026-09-22T10:37:10.503Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:10.503Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 1, 15, 'Dia hoy ilay anjelin’i Jehovah tamin’i Elia: “Midìna miaraka aminy, ary aza matahotra azy.” Koa nitsangana i Elia, ka nidina niaraka taminy ho any amin’ny mpanjaka.', 'dia hoy ilay anjelin’i jehovah tamin’i elia: “midìna miaraka aminy, ary aza matahotra azy.” koa nitsangana i elia, ka nidina niaraka taminy ho any amin’ny mpanjaka.'),
  ('6ab25a56c190d9f02e9e32f1', '2026-09-22T10:37:10.503Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:10.503Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 1, 14, 'Efa nisy afo nilatsaka avy tany an-danitra, ka nandevona an’ireo roa lahy lehiben’ny dimampolo teo aloha mbamin’ny miaramilany dimampolo avy. Fa mba tsimbino kosa re ny aiko e!”', 'efa nisy afo nilatsaka avy tany an-danitra, ka nandevona an’ireo roa lahy lehiben’ny dimampolo teo aloha mbamin’ny miaramilany dimampolo avy. fa mba tsimbino kosa re ny aiko e!”'),
  ('6ab25a56c190d9f02e9e32f4', '2026-09-22T10:37:10.503Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:10.503Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 1, 17, 'Dia maty izy, araka ny tenin’i Jehovah nolazain’i Elia. Ary tsy nanan-janakalahy izy, ka i Jorama no nanjaka nandimby azy, tamin’ny taona faharoa nanjakan’i Jorama zanak’i Josafata mpanjakan’ny Joda.', 'dia maty izy, araka ny tenin’i jehovah nolazain’i elia. ary tsy nanan-janakalahy izy, ka i jorama no nanjaka nandimby azy, tamin’ny taona faharoa nanjakan’i jorama zanak’i josafata mpanjakan’ny joda.'),
  ('6ab25a56c190d9f02e9e32ea', '2026-09-22T10:37:10.503Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:10.503Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 1, 7, 'Dia hoy ny mpanjaka: “Lehilahy manao ahoana ilay niakatra hihaona taminareo sy nilaza izany teny izany taminareo?”', 'dia hoy ny mpanjaka: “lehilahy manao ahoana ilay niakatra hihaona taminareo sy nilaza izany teny izany taminareo?”'),
  ('6ab25a56c190d9f02e9e32e4', '2026-09-22T10:37:10.503Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:10.503Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 1, 1, 'Rehefa maty i Ahaba, dia nikomy tamin’ny Israely i Moaba.', 'rehefa maty i ahaba, dia nikomy tamin’ny israely i moaba.'),
  ('6ab25a56c190d9f02e9e32f3', '2026-09-22T10:37:10.503Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:10.503Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 1, 16, 'Ary hoy izy tamin’ny mpanjaka: “Izao no nolazain’i Jehovah: ‘Fa angaha dia tsy misy Andriamanitra hanontaniana mihitsy eto amin’ny Israely, no nandefa iraka hanontany an’i Bala-zeboba andriamanitr’i Ekrona ianao? Koa tsy hiala eo amin’io fandriana niakaranao io intsony ianao, fa ho faty tokoa.’”', 'ary hoy izy tamin’ny mpanjaka: “izao no nolazain’i jehovah: ‘fa angaha dia tsy misy andriamanitra hanontaniana mihitsy eto amin’ny israely, no nandefa iraka hanontany an’i bala-zeboba andriamanitr’i ekrona ianao? koa tsy hiala eo amin’io fandriana niakaranao io intsony ianao, fa ho faty tokoa.’”'),
  ('6ab25a56c190d9f02e9e32f0', '2026-09-22T10:37:10.503Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:10.503Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 1, 13, 'Ary naniraka lehilahy fahatelo izay lehiben’ny dimampolo, mbamin’ny miaramilany dimampolo indray ny mpanjaka. Ary niakatra ralehilahy ka nandohalika teo anatrehan’i Elia, ary nitalaho ny famindram-pony, nanao hoe: “Ry lehilahin’Andriamanitra ô, mba tsimbino re ny aiko sy ny ain’ireto dimampolo lahy mpanomponao ireto e!', 'ary naniraka lehilahy fahatelo izay lehiben’ny dimampolo, mbamin’ny miaramilany dimampolo indray ny mpanjaka. ary niakatra ralehilahy ka nandohalika teo anatrehan’i elia, ary nitalaho ny famindram-pony, nanao hoe: “ry lehilahin’andriamanitra ô, mba tsimbino re ny aiko sy ny ain’ireto dimampolo lahy mpanomponao ireto e!'),
  ('6ab25a56c190d9f02e9e32ec', '2026-09-22T10:37:10.503Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:10.503Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 1, 9, 'Ary naniraka lehiben’ny dimampolo nankany amin’i Elia ny mpanjaka. Dia niakatra nankany amin’i Elia ralehilahy, niaraka tamin’ny miaramilany dimampolo. Nipetraka teo an-tampon’ny tendrombohitra i Elia tamin’izay. Ary hoy ralehilahy taminy: “Ry lehilahin’Andriamanitra! ‘Midìna ianao’, hoy ny mpanjaka.”', 'ary naniraka lehiben’ny dimampolo nankany amin’i elia ny mpanjaka. dia niakatra nankany amin’i elia ralehilahy, niaraka tamin’ny miaramilany dimampolo. nipetraka teo an-tampon’ny tendrombohitra i elia tamin’izay. ary hoy ralehilahy taminy: “ry lehilahin’andriamanitra! ‘midìna ianao’, hoy ny mpanjaka.”'),
  ('6ab25a56ce012678f7f55ce2', '2026-09-22T10:37:10.984Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:10.984Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 2, 8, 'Koa nesorin’i Elia ilay akanjona mpaminany nanaovany, ary navalony ka nikapohany ny rano. Dia nisaraka nankeo amin’ny andaniny sy ny ankilany ny rano, ka niampita tamin’ny tany maina izy roa lahy.', 'koa nesorin’i elia ilay akanjona mpaminany nanaovany, ary navalony ka nikapohany ny rano. dia nisaraka nankeo amin’ny andaniny sy ny ankilany ny rano, ka niampita tamin’ny tany maina izy roa lahy.'),
  ('6ab25a56ce012678f7f55ce5', '2026-09-22T10:37:10.984Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:10.984Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 2, 11, 'Raha mbola nandeha izy ireo, sady niresaka teny am-pandehanana, dia nisy kalesy afo sy soavaly afo nampisaraka azy roa lahy. Ary niakatra ho any amin’ny lanitra tao anaty tafio-drivotra i Elia.', 'raha mbola nandeha izy ireo, sady niresaka teny am-pandehanana, dia nisy kalesy afo sy soavaly afo nampisaraka azy roa lahy. ary niakatra ho any amin’ny lanitra tao anaty tafio-drivotra i elia.'),
  ('6ab25a56ce012678f7f55cdb', '2026-09-22T10:37:10.984Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:10.984Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 2, 1, 'Rehefa nadiva hitondra an’i Elia hiakatra ho any amin’ny lanitra tao anaty tafio-drivotra i Jehovah, dia niainga avy tany Gilgala i Elia sy Elisa.', 'rehefa nadiva hitondra an’i elia hiakatra ho any amin’ny lanitra tao anaty tafio-drivotra i jehovah, dia niainga avy tany gilgala i elia sy elisa.'),
  ('6ab25a56ce012678f7f55cde', '2026-09-22T10:37:10.984Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:10.984Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 2, 4, 'Ary hoy i Elia tamin’i Elisa: “Mijanòna eto, ry Elisa, azafady, fa nirahin’i Jehovah ho any Jeriko aho.” Hoy anefa i Elisa: “Raha mbola velona koa i Jehovah, ary raha mbola velon’aina koa ianao, dia tsy handao anao aho.” Koa tonga tany Jeriko izy roa lahy.', 'ary hoy i elia tamin’i elisa: “mijanòna eto, ry elisa, azafady, fa nirahin’i jehovah ho any jeriko aho.” hoy anefa i elisa: “raha mbola velona koa i jehovah, ary raha mbola velon’aina koa ianao, dia tsy handao anao aho.” koa tonga tany jeriko izy roa lahy.'),
  ('6ab25a56ce012678f7f55ce7', '2026-09-22T10:37:10.984Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:10.984Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 2, 13, 'Ary noraisiny ilay akanjona mpaminany nanaovan’i Elia, izay latsaka avy teny aminy. Dia niverin-dalana izy ka nijoro teo amoron’i Jordana.', 'ary noraisiny ilay akanjona mpaminany nanaovan’i elia, izay latsaka avy teny aminy. dia niverin-dalana izy ka nijoro teo amoron’i jordana.'),
  ('6ab25a56ce012678f7f55ce0', '2026-09-22T10:37:10.984Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:10.984Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 2, 6, 'Ary hoy i Elia taminy: “Mijanòna eto, azafady, fa nirahin’i Jehovah ho any Jordana aho.” Hoy anefa i Elisa: “Raha mbola velona koa i Jehovah, ary raha mbola velon’aina koa ianao, dia tsy handao anao aho.” Koa nanohy ny diany izy roa lahy.', 'ary hoy i elia taminy: “mijanòna eto, azafady, fa nirahin’i jehovah ho any jordana aho.” hoy anefa i elisa: “raha mbola velona koa i jehovah, ary raha mbola velon’aina koa ianao, dia tsy handao anao aho.” koa nanohy ny diany izy roa lahy.'),
  ('6ab25a56ce012678f7f55cdd', '2026-09-22T10:37:10.984Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:10.984Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 2, 3, 'Dia nivoaka nankany amin’i Elisa ireo zanaky ny mpaminany tao Betela, ka nanao taminy hoe: “Mba fantatrao tokoa moa fa anio no hakan’i Jehovah ny tomponao, ka tsy ho tomponao intsony izy?” Dia hoy izy: “Izaho koa mahalala tsara an’izany, fa mangìna ianareo.”', 'dia nivoaka nankany amin’i elisa ireo zanaky ny mpaminany tao betela, ka nanao taminy hoe: “mba fantatrao tokoa moa fa anio no hakan’i jehovah ny tomponao, ka tsy ho tomponao intsony izy?” dia hoy izy: “izaho koa mahalala tsara an’izany, fa mangìna ianareo.”'),
  ('6ab25a56ce012678f7f55cdc', '2026-09-22T10:37:10.984Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:10.984Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 2, 2, 'Ary hoy i Elia tamin’i Elisa: “Mijanòna eto, azafady, fa nirahin’i Jehovah ho any Betela aho.” Hoy anefa i Elisa: “Raha mbola velona koa i Jehovah, ary raha mbola velon’aina koa ianao, dia tsy handao anao aho.” Koa nidina nankany Betela izy roa lahy.', 'ary hoy i elia tamin’i elisa: “mijanòna eto, azafady, fa nirahin’i jehovah ho any betela aho.” hoy anefa i elisa: “raha mbola velona koa i jehovah, ary raha mbola velon’aina koa ianao, dia tsy handao anao aho.” koa nidina nankany betela izy roa lahy.'),
  ('6ab25a56ce012678f7f55ce3', '2026-09-22T10:37:10.984Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:10.984Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 2, 9, 'Raha vao tonga teny ampita izy ireo, dia hoy i Elia tamin’i Elisa: “Angataho izay tokony hataoko ho anao, alohan’ny hakana ahy hiala aminao.” Dia hoy i Elisa: “Aoka aho mba hahazo anjaran’olon-droa amin’ny fanahy * miasa aminao.”', 'raha vao tonga teny ampita izy ireo, dia hoy i elia tamin’i elisa: “angataho izay tokony hataoko ho anao, alohan’ny hakana ahy hiala aminao.” dia hoy i elisa: “aoka aho mba hahazo anjaran’olon-droa amin’ny fanahy * miasa aminao.”'),
  ('6ab25a56ce012678f7f55ce6', '2026-09-22T10:37:10.984Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:10.984Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 2, 12, 'Nahita izany rehetra izany i Elisa, ka niantsoantso hoe: “Ry raiko ô, ry raiko ô, ny kalesin’adin’ny Israely mbamin’ny mpitaingin-tsoavaliny!” Dia tsy nahita an’i Elia intsony izy. Koa noraisiny ny fitafiany, ka norovitiny hizara roa.', 'nahita izany rehetra izany i elisa, ka niantsoantso hoe: “ry raiko ô, ry raiko ô, ny kalesin’adin’ny israely mbamin’ny mpitaingin-tsoavaliny!” dia tsy nahita an’i elia intsony izy. koa noraisiny ny fitafiany, ka norovitiny hizara roa.'),
  ('6ab25a56ce012678f7f55ce4', '2026-09-22T10:37:10.984Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:10.984Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 2, 10, 'Hoy anefa i Elia: “Sarotra izany zavatra angatahinao izany. Raha hitanao ny hakana ahy hiala aminao, dia ho azonao izany. Fa raha tsy izany kosa, dia tsy ho azonao izany.”', 'hoy anefa i elia: “sarotra izany zavatra angatahinao izany. raha hitanao ny hakana ahy hiala aminao, dia ho azonao izany. fa raha tsy izany kosa, dia tsy ho azonao izany.”'),
  ('6ab25a56ce012678f7f55ce1', '2026-09-22T10:37:10.984Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:10.984Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 2, 7, 'Ary nisy dimampolo lahy zanaky ny mpaminany, nanaraka azy roa lahy ka nijanona nitazana teny lavidavitra teny. Fa izy roa lahy kosa nijoro teo amoron’i Jordana.', 'ary nisy dimampolo lahy zanaky ny mpaminany, nanaraka azy roa lahy ka nijanona nitazana teny lavidavitra teny. fa izy roa lahy kosa nijoro teo amoron’i jordana.'),
  ('6ab25a56ce012678f7f55cdf', '2026-09-22T10:37:10.984Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:10.984Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 2, 5, 'Dia nanatona an’i Elisa ireo zanaky ny mpaminany tao Jeriko, ka nanao taminy hoe: “Mba fantatrao tokoa moa fa anio no hakan’i Jehovah ny tomponao, ka tsy ho tomponao intsony izy?” Dia hoy i Elisa: “Izaho koa mahalala tsara an’izany, fa mangìna ianareo.”', 'dia nanatona an’i elisa ireo zanaky ny mpaminany tao jeriko, ka nanao taminy hoe: “mba fantatrao tokoa moa fa anio no hakan’i jehovah ny tomponao, ka tsy ho tomponao intsony izy?” dia hoy i elisa: “izaho koa mahalala tsara an’izany, fa mangìna ianareo.”'),
  ('6ab25a56ce012678f7f55cee', '2026-09-22T10:37:10.985Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:10.985Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 2, 20, 'Dia hoy i Elisa: “Akao vilia baolina kely vaovao aho, ary asio sira ao anatiny.” Dia nakan’izy ireo izy.', 'dia hoy i elisa: “akao vilia baolina kely vaovao aho, ary asio sira ao anatiny.” dia nakan’izy ireo izy.'),
  ('6ab25a56ce012678f7f55cf0', '2026-09-22T10:37:10.985Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:10.985Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 2, 22, 'Ary mbola sitrana mandraka androany ilay rano, araka ny tenin’i Elisa.', 'ary mbola sitrana mandraka androany ilay rano, araka ny tenin’i elisa.'),
  ('6ab25a56ce012678f7f55cef', '2026-09-22T10:37:10.985Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:10.985Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 2, 21, 'Ary nankany amin’ilay loharano izy, dia nanipy sira tao sady nanao hoe: “Izao no nolazain’i Jehovah: ‘Ataoko mahasalama ity rano ity. Tsy hahatonga ny olona ho faty na ho afa-jaza intsony izy ity.’”', 'ary nankany amin’ilay loharano izy, dia nanipy sira tao sady nanao hoe: “izao no nolazain’i jehovah: ‘ataoko mahasalama ity rano ity. tsy hahatonga ny olona ho faty na ho afa-jaza intsony izy ity.’”'),
  ('6ab25a56ce012678f7f55cea', '2026-09-22T10:37:10.985Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:10.985Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 2, 16, 'Dia hoy ireo taminy: “Misy dimampolo lahy mahery fo eto amin’ny mpanomponao. Aoka re izy ireo hitady ny tomponao e! Angamba nampiakarin’ny fanahin’i Jehovah izy, ka nazerany any an-tendrombohitra any, na any an-dohasaha any.” Hoy anefa i Elisa: “Aza irahina ry zareo.”', 'dia hoy ireo taminy: “misy dimampolo lahy mahery fo eto amin’ny mpanomponao. aoka re izy ireo hitady ny tomponao e! angamba nampiakarin’ny fanahin’i jehovah izy, ka nazerany any an-tendrombohitra any, na any an-dohasaha any.” hoy anefa i elisa: “aza irahina ry zareo.”'),
  ('6ab25a56ce012678f7f55ce8', '2026-09-22T10:37:10.985Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:10.985Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 2, 14, 'Ary nalainy ilay akanjo nanaovan’i Elia, izay latsaka avy teny aminy, ka nikapohany ny rano. Dia hoy izy: “Aiza i Jehovah Andriamanitr’i Elia?” Ary nokapohiny ny rano, ka nisaraka nankeo amin’ny andaniny sy ny ankilany, dia niampita izy.', 'ary nalainy ilay akanjo nanaovan’i elia, izay latsaka avy teny aminy, ka nikapohany ny rano. dia hoy izy: “aiza i jehovah andriamanitr’i elia?” ary nokapohiny ny rano, ka nisaraka nankeo amin’ny andaniny sy ny ankilany, dia niampita izy.'),
  ('6ab25a56ce012678f7f55ced', '2026-09-22T10:37:10.985Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:10.985Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 2, 19, 'Tatỳ aoriana, dia hoy ny mponina tao an-tanàna tamin’i Elisa: “Tsara honenana ity tanàna ity, araka izao ahitan’ny tompoko azy izao. Ratsy anefa ny rano, ary mahatonga ny olona ho afa-jaza koa ny tany.”', 'tatỳ aoriana, dia hoy ny mponina tao an-tanàna tamin’i elisa: “tsara honenana ity tanàna ity, araka izao ahitan’ny tompoko azy izao. ratsy anefa ny rano, ary mahatonga ny olona ho afa-jaza koa ny tany.”'),
  ('6ab25a56ce012678f7f55ce9', '2026-09-22T10:37:10.985Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:10.985Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 2, 15, 'Rehefa nahatazana azy teny lavidavitra teny ny zanaky ny mpaminany tao Jeriko, dia nanao hoe: “Efa mitoetra ao amin’i Elisa ny fanahy niasa tamin’i Elia.” Koa nitsena azy izy ireo, ka niankohoka tamin’ny tany teo anatrehany.', 'rehefa nahatazana azy teny lavidavitra teny ny zanaky ny mpaminany tao jeriko, dia nanao hoe: “efa mitoetra ao amin’i elisa ny fanahy niasa tamin’i elia.” koa nitsena azy izy ireo, ka niankohoka tamin’ny tany teo anatrehany.'),
  ('6ab25a56ce012678f7f55cec', '2026-09-22T10:37:10.985Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:10.985Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 2, 18, 'Efa nipetraka tao Jeriko i Elisa, rehefa niverina tany aminy izy ireo. Dia hoy i Elisa: “Tsy efa nilazako moa ianareo hoe: ‘Aza mandeha’?”', 'efa nipetraka tao jeriko i elisa, rehefa niverina tany aminy izy ireo. dia hoy i elisa: “tsy efa nilazako moa ianareo hoe: ‘aza mandeha’?”'),
  ('6ab25a56ce012678f7f55cf1', '2026-09-22T10:37:10.985Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:10.985Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 2, 23, 'Ary niakatra avy tany Jeriko i Elisa, ka nankany Betela. Raha mbola teny an-dalana izy, dia indreny nisy ankizilahikely nivoaka avy ao an-tanàna, ka nanakora azy tsy an-kijanona hoe: “Miakara, ry ilay sola! Miakara, ry ilay sola!”', 'ary niakatra avy tany jeriko i elisa, ka nankany betela. raha mbola teny an-dalana izy, dia indreny nisy ankizilahikely nivoaka avy ao an-tanàna, ka nanakora azy tsy an-kijanona hoe: “miakara, ry ilay sola! miakara, ry ilay sola!”'),
  ('6ab25a56ce012678f7f55ceb', '2026-09-22T10:37:10.985Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:10.985Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 2, 17, 'Niangavy an’i Elisa foana anefa izy ireo. Koa sanganehana i Elisa, ka niteny hoe: “Iraho àry ry zareo!” Dia naniraka dimampolo lahy izy ireo. Ary nitady nandritra ny telo andro ireny, fa tsy nahita an’i Elia.', 'niangavy an’i elisa foana anefa izy ireo. koa sanganehana i elisa, ka niteny hoe: “iraho àry ry zareo!” dia naniraka dimampolo lahy izy ireo. ary nitady nandritra ny telo andro ireny, fa tsy nahita an’i elia.'),
  ('6ab25a56ce012678f7f55cf3', '2026-09-22T10:37:10.985Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:10.985Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 2, 25, 'Ary nanohy ny diany i Elisa ka nankany amin’ny Tendrombohitra Karmela. Avy eo dia niverina nankany Samaria izy.', 'ary nanohy ny diany i elisa ka nankany amin’ny tendrombohitra karmela. avy eo dia niverina nankany samaria izy.'),
  ('6ab25a56ce012678f7f55cf2', '2026-09-22T10:37:10.985Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:10.985Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 2, 24, 'Farany dia niherika tany aoriany i Elisa ka nahita an’ireo ankizy, ary nanozona azy tamin’ny anaran’i Jehovah. Dia nisy orsavavy roa nivoaka avy tao anaty ala, ka namiravira roa amby efapolo tamin’ireo ankizy.', 'farany dia niherika tany aoriany i elisa ka nahita an’ireo ankizy, ary nanozona azy tamin’ny anaran’i jehovah. dia nisy orsavavy roa nivoaka avy tao anaty ala, ka namiravira roa amby efapolo tamin’ireo ankizy.'),
  ('6ab25a57fd20955e4180bdf6', '2026-09-22T10:37:11.440Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:11.440Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 3, 13, 'Ary hoy i Elisa tamin’ny mpanjakan’ny Israely: “Misy zavatra iombonako aminao angaha moa? Mandehana any amin’ny mpaminanin-drainao sy ny mpaminanin-dreninao.” Hoy anefa ny mpanjakan’ny Israely: “Aza miteny an’izany, fa ny hanolotra anay eo an-tanan’i Moaba no niantsoan’i Jehovah anay mpanjaka telo ireto.”', 'ary hoy i elisa tamin’ny mpanjakan’ny israely: “misy zavatra iombonako aminao angaha moa? mandehana any amin’ny mpaminanin-drainao sy ny mpaminanin-dreninao.” hoy anefa ny mpanjakan’ny israely: “aza miteny an’izany, fa ny hanolotra anay eo an-tanan’i moaba no niantsoan’i jehovah anay mpanjaka telo ireto.”'),
  ('6ab25a57fd20955e4180bdea', '2026-09-22T10:37:11.440Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:11.440Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 3, 1, 'Lasa mpanjakan’ny Israely tao Samaria i Jorama zanak’i Ahaba, tamin’ny taona fahavalo ambin’ny folo nanjakan’i Josafata mpanjakan’ny Joda. Ary roa ambin’ny folo taona no nanjakany.', 'lasa mpanjakan’ny israely tao samaria i jorama zanak’i ahaba, tamin’ny taona fahavalo ambin’ny folo nanjakan’i josafata mpanjakan’ny joda. ary roa ambin’ny folo taona no nanjakany.'),
  ('6ab25a57fd20955e4180bdf3', '2026-09-22T10:37:11.440Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:11.440Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 3, 10, 'Farany, dia hoy ny mpanjakan’ny Israely: “Indrisy! Nantsoin’i Jehovah isika mpanjaka telo ireto mba hatolony eo an-tanan’i Moaba!”', 'farany, dia hoy ny mpanjakan’ny israely: “indrisy! nantsoin’i jehovah isika mpanjaka telo ireto mba hatolony eo an-tanan’i moaba!”'),
  ('6ab25a57fd20955e4180bdf0', '2026-09-22T10:37:11.440Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:11.440Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 3, 7, 'Ankoatra izany, dia nandefa iraka tany amin’i Josafata mpanjakan’ny Joda izy, nanao hoe: “Mikomy amiko ny mpanjakan’i Moaba. Koa hiaraka amiko hiady any Moaba ve ianao?” Dia hoy i Josafata: “Handeha aho, fa izay ahy dia anao, ny oloko dia olonao, ary ny soavaliko dia soavalinao.”', 'ankoatra izany, dia nandefa iraka tany amin’i josafata mpanjakan’ny joda izy, nanao hoe: “mikomy amiko ny mpanjakan’i moaba. koa hiaraka amiko hiady any moaba ve ianao?” dia hoy i josafata: “handeha aho, fa izay ahy dia anao, ny oloko dia olonao, ary ny soavaliko dia soavalinao.”'),
  ('6ab25a57fd20955e4180bdee', '2026-09-22T10:37:11.440Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:11.440Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 3, 5, 'Raha vao maty anefa i Ahaba, dia nikomy tamin’ny mpanjakan’ny Israely ny mpanjakan’i Moaba.', 'raha vao maty anefa i ahaba, dia nikomy tamin’ny mpanjakan’ny israely ny mpanjakan’i moaba.'),
  ('6ab25a57fd20955e4180bdfc', '2026-09-22T10:37:11.440Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:11.440Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 3, 19, 'Ary tafiho ny tanàna voaro mafy rehetra sy ny tanàna tena tsara rehetra. Kapao ny hazo tsara rehetra, tampeno ny loharano rehetra, ary simbasimbao amin’ny vato ny tany tsara rehetra.”', 'ary tafiho ny tanàna voaro mafy rehetra sy ny tanàna tena tsara rehetra. kapao ny hazo tsara rehetra, tampeno ny loharano rehetra, ary simbasimbao amin’ny vato ny tany tsara rehetra.”'),
  ('6ab25a57fd20955e4180bdf1', '2026-09-22T10:37:11.440Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:11.440Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 3, 8, 'Hoy koa izy: “Avy aiza isika no hiakatra?” Dia hoy i Jorama: “Avy any amin’ny lalana mankany an-tany efitr’i Edoma.”', 'hoy koa izy: “avy aiza isika no hiakatra?” dia hoy i jorama: “avy any amin’ny lalana mankany an-tany efitr’i edoma.”'),
  ('6ab25a57fd20955e4180bded', '2026-09-22T10:37:11.440Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:11.440Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 3, 4, 'I Mesa mpanjakan’i Moaba dia lasa mpiompy ondry. Ary nandoa hetra ho an’ny mpanjakan’ny Israely izy, dia zanak’ondry iray hetsy sy ondrilahy iray hetsy mbola tsy nohetezana.', 'i mesa mpanjakan’i moaba dia lasa mpiompy ondry. ary nandoa hetra ho an’ny mpanjakan’ny israely izy, dia zanak’ondry iray hetsy sy ondrilahy iray hetsy mbola tsy nohetezana.'),
  ('6ab25a57fd20955e4180bdf8', '2026-09-22T10:37:11.440Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:11.440Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 3, 15, 'Koa akao mpitendry lokanga aho.” Raha vao nitendry ny lokangany ilay mpitendry, dia niasa tamin’i Elisa ny tanan’i Jehovah.', 'koa akao mpitendry lokanga aho.” raha vao nitendry ny lokangany ilay mpitendry, dia niasa tamin’i elisa ny tanan’i jehovah.'),
  ('6ab25a57fd20955e4180bdeb', '2026-09-22T10:37:11.440Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:11.440Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 3, 2, 'Nanao izay ratsy teo imason’i Jehovah foana izy, saingy tsy toy ny nataon’ny rainy na ny reniny, satria mba nesoriny ihany ilay tsangambato masin’i Bala nataon-drainy.', 'nanao izay ratsy teo imason’i jehovah foana izy, saingy tsy toy ny nataon’ny rainy na ny reniny, satria mba nesoriny ihany ilay tsangambato masin’i bala nataon-drainy.'),
  ('6ab25a57fd20955e4180be03', '2026-09-22T10:37:11.440Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:11.440Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 3, 26, 'Raha vao hitan’ny mpanjakan’i Moaba fa efa ho resy izy, dia nitondra fitonjato lahy mpitan-tsabatra izy mba hanavatsava teo amin’ny mpanjakan’i Edoma. Tsy nahomby anefa izy ireo.', 'raha vao hitan’ny mpanjakan’i moaba fa efa ho resy izy, dia nitondra fitonjato lahy mpitan-tsabatra izy mba hanavatsava teo amin’ny mpanjakan’i edoma. tsy nahomby anefa izy ireo.'),
  ('6ab25a57fd20955e4180be02', '2026-09-22T10:37:11.440Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:11.440Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 3, 25, 'Noravany koa ireo tanàna. Samy nanipy vato teny amin’ny tany tsara rehetra izy ireo, ka nofenoiny vato izany. Ary notampenany ny loharano rehetra, nokapainy ny hazo tsara rehetra, ary ny vato tao Kira-haresa sisa no navelany. Dia nanodidina an’ilay tanàna ireo mpampiasa pilotra, ka namely azy.', 'noravany koa ireo tanàna. samy nanipy vato teny amin’ny tany tsara rehetra izy ireo, ka nofenoiny vato izany. ary notampenany ny loharano rehetra, nokapainy ny hazo tsara rehetra, ary ny vato tao kira-haresa sisa no navelany. dia nanodidina an’ilay tanàna ireo mpampiasa pilotra, ka namely azy.'),
  ('6ab25a57fd20955e4180bdff', '2026-09-22T10:37:11.440Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:11.440Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 3, 22, 'Efa notarafin’ny masoandro ny rano rehefa nifoha ny Moabita teny ampita, ny ampitso maraina. Koa mena sahala amin’ny ra no fahitan’izy ireo ny rano.', 'efa notarafin’ny masoandro ny rano rehefa nifoha ny moabita teny ampita, ny ampitso maraina. koa mena sahala amin’ny ra no fahitan’izy ireo ny rano.'),
  ('6ab25a57fd20955e4180bdf2', '2026-09-22T10:37:11.440Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:11.440Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 3, 9, 'Dia niainga ny mpanjakan’ny Israely sy ny mpanjakan’ny Joda ary ny mpanjakan’i Edoma, ka nandeha nanodidina nandritra ny fito andro. Ary tsy nisy rano ho an’ny tao an-toby sy ho an’ny biby fiompy izay nanara-dia azy ireo.', 'dia niainga ny mpanjakan’ny israely sy ny mpanjakan’ny joda ary ny mpanjakan’i edoma, ka nandeha nanodidina nandritra ny fito andro. ary tsy nisy rano ho an’ny tao an-toby sy ho an’ny biby fiompy izay nanara-dia azy ireo.'),
  ('6ab25a57fd20955e4180bdfe', '2026-09-22T10:37:11.440Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:11.440Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 3, 21, 'Ary ren’ny Moabita rehetra fa niakatra hiady taminy ireo mpanjaka ireo. Koa novoriny ny lehilahy rehetra ampy taona hiady. Dia nijoro teo amin’ny sisin-tany ireo.', 'ary ren’ny moabita rehetra fa niakatra hiady taminy ireo mpanjaka ireo. koa novoriny ny lehilahy rehetra ampy taona hiady. dia nijoro teo amin’ny sisin-tany ireo.'),
  ('6ab25a57fd20955e4180bdfa', '2026-09-22T10:37:11.440Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:11.440Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 3, 17, 'Fa izao no nolazain’i Jehovah: “Tsy hahita rivotra na oram-be ianareo, nefa ho feno rano io lohasaha falehan-driaka io. Ary hisotro rano avy aminy ianareo sy ny biby fiompinareo.”’', 'fa izao no nolazain’i jehovah: “tsy hahita rivotra na oram-be ianareo, nefa ho feno rano io lohasaha falehan-driaka io. ary hisotro rano avy aminy ianareo sy ny biby fiompinareo.”’'),
  ('6ab25a57fd20955e4180bdf7', '2026-09-22T10:37:11.440Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:11.440Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 3, 14, 'Dia hoy i Elisa: “Raha mbola velona koa i Jehovah Tompon’ny tafika, izay tompoiko, dia tsoriko aminao fa raha tsy noho ny amin’i Josafata mpanjakan’ny Joda sy noho ny fanajako azy, dia tsy ho nijery anao akory aho.', 'dia hoy i elisa: “raha mbola velona koa i jehovah tompon’ny tafika, izay tompoiko, dia tsoriko aminao fa raha tsy noho ny amin’i josafata mpanjakan’ny joda sy noho ny fanajako azy, dia tsy ho nijery anao akory aho.'),
  ('6ab25a57fd20955e4180bdf4', '2026-09-22T10:37:11.440Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:11.440Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 3, 11, 'Dia hoy i Josafata: “Tsy misy mpaminanin’i Jehovah angaha atỳ? Andao asaintsika manontany an’i Jehovah izy.” Ary hoy ny lehilahy iray mpanompon’ny mpanjakan’ny Israely: “Atỳ i Elisa zanak’i Safata, ilay mpanondraka rano ny tanan’i Elia.”', 'dia hoy i josafata: “tsy misy mpaminanin’i jehovah angaha atỳ? andao asaintsika manontany an’i jehovah izy.” ary hoy ny lehilahy iray mpanompon’ny mpanjakan’ny israely: “atỳ i elisa zanak’i safata, ilay mpanondraka rano ny tanan’i elia.”'),
  ('6ab25a57fd20955e4180be01', '2026-09-22T10:37:11.440Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:11.440Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 3, 24, 'Kanjo nony niditra tao an-tobin’ny Israely izy ireo, dia nitsangana avy hatrany ny Israelita ka namely azy. Dia nandositra teo anoloan’ny Israelita ny Moabita. Ary tonga tany Moaba ny Israelita, ka sady namono ny Moabita izy ireo no nandroso ihany.', 'kanjo nony niditra tao an-tobin’ny israely izy ireo, dia nitsangana avy hatrany ny israelita ka namely azy. dia nandositra teo anoloan’ny israelita ny moabita. ary tonga tany moaba ny israelita, ka sady namono ny moabita izy ireo no nandroso ihany.'),
  ('6ab25a57fd20955e4180bdef', '2026-09-22T10:37:11.440Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:11.440Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 3, 6, 'Koa nivoaka avy any Samaria i Jorama Mpanjaka tamin’izay, ka novoriny ny Israely rehetra.', 'koa nivoaka avy any samaria i jorama mpanjaka tamin’izay, ka novoriny ny israely rehetra.'),
  ('6ab25a57fd20955e4180bdfb', '2026-09-22T10:37:11.440Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:11.440Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 3, 18, 'Zavatra tsotra amin’i Jehovah ny hanao izany. Koa hanolotra an’i Moaba eo an-tananareo tokoa izy.', 'zavatra tsotra amin’i jehovah ny hanao izany. koa hanolotra an’i moaba eo an-tananareo tokoa izy.'),
  ('6ab25a57fd20955e4180bdf5', '2026-09-22T10:37:11.440Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:11.440Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 3, 12, 'Dia hoy i Josafata: “Nankinina taminy ny tenin’i Jehovah.” Koa nidina tany aminy ny mpanjakan’ny Israely sy Josafata ary ny mpanjakan’i Edoma.', 'dia hoy i josafata: “nankinina taminy ny tenin’i jehovah.” koa nidina tany aminy ny mpanjakan’ny israely sy josafata ary ny mpanjakan’i edoma.'),
  ('6ab25a57fd20955e4180bdec', '2026-09-22T10:37:11.440Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:11.440Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 3, 3, 'Nifikitra tamin’ny fahotan’i Jeroboama zanak’i Nebata anefa izy, dia ny fahotan’i Jeroboama izay nampanotany ny Israely. Tsy niala tamin’izany izy.', 'nifikitra tamin’ny fahotan’i jeroboama zanak’i nebata anefa izy, dia ny fahotan’i jeroboama izay nampanotany ny israely. tsy niala tamin’izany izy.'),
  ('6ab25a57fd20955e4180be00', '2026-09-22T10:37:11.440Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:11.440Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 3, 23, 'Dia hoy izy ireo: “Ra io! Tena nifamely tamin’ny sabatra ireo mpanjaka ka nifamono. Andao haka babo, ry Moaba ô!”', 'dia hoy izy ireo: “ra io! tena nifamely tamin’ny sabatra ireo mpanjaka ka nifamono. andao haka babo, ry moaba ô!”'),
  ('6ab25a57fd20955e4180be04', '2026-09-22T10:37:11.440Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:11.440Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 3, 27, 'Farany, dia nalain’ny mpanjakan’i Moaba ny zanany lahimatoa, izay tokony hanjaka handimby azy, ka natolony ho fanatitra dorana teo ambony manda. Niharan’ny fahatezerana mafy àry ny Israely, dia niala ka tsy nanafika azy intsony, ary niverina tany amin’ny taniny.', 'farany, dia nalain’ny mpanjakan’i moaba ny zanany lahimatoa, izay tokony hanjaka handimby azy, ka natolony ho fanatitra dorana teo ambony manda. niharan’ny fahatezerana mafy àry ny israely, dia niala ka tsy nanafika azy intsony, ary niverina tany amin’ny taniny.'),
  ('6ab25a57fd20955e4180bdfd', '2026-09-22T10:37:11.440Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:11.440Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 3, 20, 'Nony maraina, tamin’ny fotoana fanolorana fanatitra varimbazaha, dia nisy rano tonga avy any amin’ny faritr’i Edoma, ka feno rano ilay tany.', 'nony maraina, tamin’ny fotoana fanolorana fanatitra varimbazaha, dia nisy rano tonga avy any amin’ny faritr’i edoma, ka feno rano ilay tany.'),
  ('6ab25a57fd20955e4180bdf9', '2026-09-22T10:37:11.440Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:11.440Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 3, 16, 'Dia hoy izy: “Izao no nolazain’i Jehovah: ‘Aoka hasiana tatatra be dia be ity lohasaha falehan-driaka ity.', 'dia hoy izy: “izao no nolazain’i jehovah: ‘aoka hasiana tatatra be dia be ity lohasaha falehan-driaka ity.'),
  ('6ab25a58ce58b96e7591b08d', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.021Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.021Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 4, 10, 'Andao mba hanao efitrano kely ao an-tampon-trano, mifanila amin’ny rindrina, ka hasiantsika fandriana sy latabatra sy seza ary fitoeran-jiro hampiasainy. Ary afaka mankao izy isaky ny tonga eto amintsika.”', 'andao mba hanao efitrano kely ao an-tampon-trano, mifanila amin’ny rindrina, ka hasiantsika fandriana sy latabatra sy seza ary fitoeran-jiro hampiasainy. ary afaka mankao izy isaky ny tonga eto amintsika.”'),
  ('6ab25a58ce58b96e7591b08c', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.021Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.021Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 4, 9, 'Rehefa ela ny ela, dia hoy ravehivavy tamin’ny vadiny: “Fantatro fa tena olo-masin’Andriamanitra ilay mpandalo eto amintsika iny.', 'rehefa ela ny ela, dia hoy ravehivavy tamin’ny vadiny: “fantatro fa tena olo-masin’andriamanitra ilay mpandalo eto amintsika iny.'),
  ('6ab25a58ce58b96e7591b08f', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.021Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.021Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 4, 12, 'Dia hoy i Elisa tamin’i Gehazy mpanompony: “Antsoy ilay vehivavy sonemita.” Dia nantsoiny ho eo anatrehany izy.', 'dia hoy i elisa tamin’i gehazy mpanompony: “antsoy ilay vehivavy sonemita.” dia nantsoiny ho eo anatrehany izy.'),
  ('6ab25a58ce58b96e7591b08b', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.021Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.021Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 4, 8, 'Ary nandalo tao Sonema i Elisa indray andro. Nisy vehivavy nanan-kaja tao, ary nanery an’i Elisa hisakafo izy. Koa isaky ny nandalo i Elisa, dia nivily mba hisakafo tao.', 'ary nandalo tao sonema i elisa indray andro. nisy vehivavy nanan-kaja tao, ary nanery an’i elisa hisakafo izy. koa isaky ny nandalo i elisa, dia nivily mba hisakafo tao.'),
  ('6ab25a58ce58b96e7591b085', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.021Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.021Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 4, 2, 'Dia hoy i Elisa taminy: “Inona àry no hataoko ho anao? Lazao ahy izay anananao ao an-trano.” Ary hoy ravehivavy: “Tsy manana na inona na inona ao an-trano ny mpanompovavinao, afa-tsy siny iray fasiana menaka.”', 'dia hoy i elisa taminy: “inona àry no hataoko ho anao? lazao ahy izay anananao ao an-trano.” ary hoy ravehivavy: “tsy manana na inona na inona ao an-trano ny mpanompovavinao, afa-tsy siny iray fasiana menaka.”'),
  ('6ab25a58ce58b96e7591b087', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.021Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.021Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 4, 4, 'Dia aoka hihidy ao an-trano ianao sy ny zanakao. Ary mandraraha menaka ao anatin’ireo siny rehetra ireo, ka atokàny izay feno.”', 'dia aoka hihidy ao an-trano ianao sy ny zanakao. ary mandraraha menaka ao anatin’ireo siny rehetra ireo, ka atokàny izay feno.”'),
  ('6ab25a58ce58b96e7591b084', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.021Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.021Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 4, 1, 'Ary nisy vehivavy iray vadin’ny zanaky ny mpaminany, tonga nitaraina tamin’i Elisa hoe: “Maty ny vadiko mpanomponao, ary fantatrao tsara fa natahotra an’i Jehovah foana izy. Tonga anefa izao ny tompon-trosa haka ny zanako roa ho andevony.”', 'ary nisy vehivavy iray vadin’ny zanaky ny mpaminany, tonga nitaraina tamin’i elisa hoe: “maty ny vadiko mpanomponao, ary fantatrao tsara fa natahotra an’i jehovah foana izy. tonga anefa izao ny tompon-trosa haka ny zanako roa ho andevony.”'),
  ('6ab25a58ce58b96e7591b08a', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.021Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.021Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 4, 7, 'Ary nankao amin’ilay lehilahin’Andriamanitra ravehivavy, ka nilaza izany. Dia hoy ralehilahy: “Mandehana, amidio ny menaka ka aloavy ny trosanao. Ny ambiny kosa hivelomanao sy ny zanakao.”', 'ary nankao amin’ilay lehilahin’andriamanitra ravehivavy, ka nilaza izany. dia hoy ralehilahy: “mandehana, amidio ny menaka ka aloavy ny trosanao. ny ambiny kosa hivelomanao sy ny zanakao.”'),
  ('6ab25a58ce58b96e7591b086', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.021Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.021Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 4, 3, 'Ary hoy i Elisa: “Mankanesa any amin’ny mpiara-monina aminao rehetra, ka mangataha siny tsy misy na inona na inona. Mitondrà betsaka araka izay azonao atao.', 'ary hoy i elisa: “mankanesa any amin’ny mpiara-monina aminao rehetra, ka mangataha siny tsy misy na inona na inona. mitondrà betsaka araka izay azonao atao.'),
  ('6ab25a58ce58b96e7591b088', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.021Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.021Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 4, 5, 'Dia niala teo aminy ravehivavy. Rehefa nihidy tao an-trano izy sy ny zanany mirahalahy, dia nentin’izy roa lahy teo akaikiny ny siny, ka ravehivavy no nandraraka menaka.', 'dia niala teo aminy ravehivavy. rehefa nihidy tao an-trano izy sy ny zanany mirahalahy, dia nentin’izy roa lahy teo akaikiny ny siny, ka ravehivavy no nandraraka menaka.'),
  ('6ab25a58ce58b96e7591b08e', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.021Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.021Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 4, 11, 'Indray andro, dia nankany toy ny mahazatra i Elisa, ka nankao amin’ilay efitrano tany an-tampon-trano, ary natory tao.', 'indray andro, dia nankany toy ny mahazatra i elisa, ka nankao amin’ilay efitrano tany an-tampon-trano, ary natory tao.'),
  ('6ab25a58ce58b96e7591b089', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.021Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.021Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 4, 6, 'Raha vao feno ireo siny, dia hoy izy tamin-janany: “Itondray siny hafa koa aho.” Hoy anefa ilay zanany: “Tsy misy intsony.” Dia nitsahatra ny menaka.', 'raha vao feno ireo siny, dia hoy izy tamin-janany: “itondray siny hafa koa aho.” hoy anefa ilay zanany: “tsy misy intsony.” dia nitsahatra ny menaka.'),
  ('6ab25a58ce58b96e7591b090', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.021Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.021Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 4, 13, 'Ary hoy i Elisa tamin’i Gehazy: “Lazao aminy, azafady, hoe: ‘Mihafy be ianao noho izao fikarakarana anay izao, ka inona kosa no mba hatao ho anao? Misy zavatra tianao holazaina amin’ny mpanjaka ve, na amin’ny lehiben’ny tafika?’” Dia hoy ravehivavy: “Tsia, satria izaho eto amin’ny fireneko ihany.”', 'ary hoy i elisa tamin’i gehazy: “lazao aminy, azafady, hoe: ‘mihafy be ianao noho izao fikarakarana anay izao, ka inona kosa no mba hatao ho anao? misy zavatra tianao holazaina amin’ny mpanjaka ve, na amin’ny lehiben’ny tafika?’” dia hoy ravehivavy: “tsia, satria izaho eto amin’ny fireneko ihany.”'),
  ('6ab25a58ce58b96e7591b0ad', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.022Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.022Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 4, 42, 'Ary nisy lehilahy iray avy any Bala-salisa, nitondra mofo roapolo vita tamin’ny vary orza voaloham-bokatra, ary koa voa vaovao tao anaty kitapo mofony. Nentiny ho an’ilay lehilahin’Andriamanitra ireo. Dia hoy i Elisa: “Omeo hohanin’ny olona ireo.”', 'ary nisy lehilahy iray avy any bala-salisa, nitondra mofo roapolo vita tamin’ny vary orza voaloham-bokatra, ary koa voa vaovao tao anaty kitapo mofony. nentiny ho an’ilay lehilahin’andriamanitra ireo. dia hoy i elisa: “omeo hohanin’ny olona ireo.”'),
  ('6ab25a58ce58b96e7591b0a7', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.022Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.022Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 4, 36, 'Dia nantsoin’i Elisa i Gehazy, ka nilazany hoe: “Antsoy ilay vehivavy sonemita.” Ary nantsoiny ravehivavy, ka nankao aminy. Dia hoy i Elisa: “Raiso ny zanakao.”', 'dia nantsoin’i elisa i gehazy, ka nilazany hoe: “antsoy ilay vehivavy sonemita.” ary nantsoiny ravehivavy, ka nankao aminy. dia hoy i elisa: “raiso ny zanakao.”'),
  ('6ab25a58ce58b96e7591b0a5', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.022Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.022Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 4, 34, 'Farany, dia niakatra teo amin’ilay fandriana izy ary nandry teo ambonin’ilay zaza, ka nataony teo amin’ny vavan’ilay zaza ny vavany, teo amin’ny masony ny masony, ary teo amin’ny felatanany ny felatanany. Dia nivalampatra teo aminy elaela izy, ka nafana tsikelikely ny nofon’ilay zaza.', 'farany, dia niakatra teo amin’ilay fandriana izy ary nandry teo ambonin’ilay zaza, ka nataony teo amin’ny vavan’ilay zaza ny vavany, teo amin’ny masony ny masony, ary teo amin’ny felatanany ny felatanany. dia nivalampatra teo aminy elaela izy, ka nafana tsikelikely ny nofon’ilay zaza.'),
  ('6ab25a58ce58b96e7591b092', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.022Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.022Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 4, 15, 'Avy hatrany, dia hoy i Elisa: “Antsoy àry izy.” Dia nantsoiny ravehivavy, ka nijoro teo amin’ny fidirana.', 'avy hatrany, dia hoy i elisa: “antsoy àry izy.” dia nantsoiny ravehivavy, ka nijoro teo amin’ny fidirana.'),
  ('6ab25a58ce58b96e7591b09d', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.022Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.022Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 4, 26, 'Mba mihazakazaha hitsena azy, ary anontanio izy hoe: ‘Tsy maninona ve ianao? Tsy maninona ve ny vadinao? Ary tsy maninona ve ilay zaza?’” Dia hoy ravehivavy: “Tsy maninona izahay!”', 'mba mihazakazaha hitsena azy, ary anontanio izy hoe: ‘tsy maninona ve ianao? tsy maninona ve ny vadinao? ary tsy maninona ve ilay zaza?’” dia hoy ravehivavy: “tsy maninona izahay!”'),
  ('6ab25a58ce58b96e7591b096', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.022Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.022Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 4, 19, 'Ary hoy foana izy tamin-drainy: “Ny an-dohako e! Ny an-dohako e!” Farany, dia hoy ny rainy tamin’ny mpanompo: “Ento any amin-dreniny izy.”', 'ary hoy foana izy tamin-drainy: “ny an-dohako e! ny an-dohako e!” farany, dia hoy ny rainy tamin’ny mpanompo: “ento any amin-dreniny izy.”'),
  ('6ab25a58ce58b96e7591b0a6', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.022Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.022Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 4, 35, 'Ary nivezivezy kely tao an-trano indray izy. Dia niakatra teo amin’ilay fandriana izy, ka nivalampatra teo amin’ilay zaza indray. Koa nievina impito ilay zazalahy, ary avy eo dia nihiratra.', 'ary nivezivezy kely tao an-trano indray izy. dia niakatra teo amin’ilay fandriana izy, ka nivalampatra teo amin’ilay zaza indray. koa nievina impito ilay zazalahy, ary avy eo dia nihiratra.'),
  ('6ab25a58ce58b96e7591b09a', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.022Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.022Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 4, 23, 'Hoy anefa ny vadiny: “Fa misy inona no hankany aminy ianao anio, nefa tsy tsinam-bolana na sabata izao?” Ary hoy ravehivavy: “Tsy misy inona na inona!”', 'hoy anefa ny vadiny: “fa misy inona no hankany aminy ianao anio, nefa tsy tsinam-bolana na sabata izao?” ary hoy ravehivavy: “tsy misy inona na inona!”'),
  ('6ab25a58ce58b96e7591b0a4', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.022Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.022Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 4, 33, 'Dia niditra izy ka nihidy tao an-trano niaraka tamin’ilay zaza. Ary nivavaka tamin’i Jehovah i Elisa.', 'dia niditra izy ka nihidy tao an-trano niaraka tamin’ilay zaza. ary nivavaka tamin’i jehovah i elisa.'),
  ('6ab25a58ce58b96e7591b0a2', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.022Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.022Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 4, 31, 'Ary nialoha lalana azy ireo i Gehazy, ka nametraka ilay tehina teo amin’ny tarehin’ilay zazalahy. Sady tsy namoaka feo anefa ilay zaza no tsy nihetsika. Dia niverina hitsena an’i Elisa izy, ka nanao hoe: “Tsy nifoha ilay zazalahy.”', 'ary nialoha lalana azy ireo i gehazy, ka nametraka ilay tehina teo amin’ny tarehin’ilay zazalahy. sady tsy namoaka feo anefa ilay zaza no tsy nihetsika. dia niverina hitsena an’i elisa izy, ka nanao hoe: “tsy nifoha ilay zazalahy.”'),
  ('6ab25a58ce58b96e7591b0a1', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.022Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.022Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 4, 30, 'Dia hoy ny renin’ilay zazalahy: “Raha mbola velona koa i Jehovah, ary raha mbola velon’aina koa ianao, dia tsy hiala aminao mihitsy aho.” Koa nitsangana ralehilahy, ary lasa niaraka taminy.', 'dia hoy ny renin’ilay zazalahy: “raha mbola velona koa i jehovah, ary raha mbola velon’aina koa ianao, dia tsy hiala aminao mihitsy aho.” koa nitsangana ralehilahy, ary lasa niaraka taminy.'),
  ('6ab25a58ce58b96e7591b09c', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.022Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.022Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 4, 25, 'Dia nankany amin’ilay lehilahin’Andriamanitra tany amin’ny Tendrombohitra Karmela izy. Raha vao nahatazana azy nanatona ilay lehilahin’Andriamanitra, dia niteny tamin’i Gehazy mpanompony hoe: “Iny ilay vehivavy sonemita!', 'dia nankany amin’ilay lehilahin’andriamanitra tany amin’ny tendrombohitra karmela izy. raha vao nahatazana azy nanatona ilay lehilahin’andriamanitra, dia niteny tamin’i gehazy mpanompony hoe: “iny ilay vehivavy sonemita!'),
  ('6ab25a58ce58b96e7591b093', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.022Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.022Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 4, 16, 'Ary hoy i Elisa: “Amin’ny fotoana voatondro, amin’ny herintaona toy izao, dia hitrotro zanakalahy ianao.” Hoy anefa ravehivavy: “Tsia re, tompoko ô! Aza mandainga amin’ny mpanompovavinao, ry lehilahin’Andriamanitra ô!”', 'ary hoy i elisa: “amin’ny fotoana voatondro, amin’ny herintaona toy izao, dia hitrotro zanakalahy ianao.” hoy anefa ravehivavy: “tsia re, tompoko ô! aza mandainga amin’ny mpanompovavinao, ry lehilahin’andriamanitra ô!”'),
  ('6ab25a58ce58b96e7591b0ac', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.022Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.022Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 4, 41, 'Dia hoy i Elisa: “Akao lafarinina àry aho.” Ary narotsany tao am-bilany izany, ka hoy izy: “Andoary amin’io ny olona mba hohaniny.” Dia tsy nisy zava-dratsy intsony tao am-bilany.', 'dia hoy i elisa: “akao lafarinina àry aho.” ary narotsany tao am-bilany izany, ka hoy izy: “andoary amin’io ny olona mba hohaniny.” dia tsy nisy zava-dratsy intsony tao am-bilany.'),
  ('6ab25a58ce58b96e7591b09e', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.022Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.022Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 4, 27, 'Raha vao tonga teo amin’ilay lehilahin’Andriamanitra teo an-tendrombohitra izy, dia nohazoniny ny tongotr’ilay lehilahin’Andriamanitra. Dia nanatona i Gehazy mba hanosika azy hiala, nefa hoy ilay lehilahin’Andriamanitra: “Avelao izy fa ory dia ory. Nafenin’i Jehovah tamiko izany, fa tsy nambarany ahy.”', 'raha vao tonga teo amin’ilay lehilahin’andriamanitra teo an-tendrombohitra izy, dia nohazoniny ny tongotr’ilay lehilahin’andriamanitra. dia nanatona i gehazy mba hanosika azy hiala, nefa hoy ilay lehilahin’andriamanitra: “avelao izy fa ory dia ory. nafenin’i jehovah tamiko izany, fa tsy nambarany ahy.”'),
  ('6ab25a58ce58b96e7591b09b', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.022Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.022Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 4, 24, 'Dia nasiany lasely ilay ampondravavy, ary hoy izy tamin’ilay mpanompony: “Tariho ny ampondra, dia rosoy ny dia! Aza manahy momba ahy, ary aza mijanona mihitsy raha tsy mahazo baiko avy amiko.”', 'dia nasiany lasely ilay ampondravavy, ary hoy izy tamin’ilay mpanompony: “tariho ny ampondra, dia rosoy ny dia! aza manahy momba ahy, ary aza mijanona mihitsy raha tsy mahazo baiko avy amiko.”'),
  ('6ab25a58ce58b96e7591b095', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.022Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.022Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 4, 18, 'Ary nihalehibe ilay zaza. Indray andro izy dia nankany amin-drainy toy ny fanaony. Niaraka tamin’ireo mpijinja ny rainy tamin’izay.', 'ary nihalehibe ilay zaza. indray andro izy dia nankany amin-drainy toy ny fanaony. niaraka tamin’ireo mpijinja ny rainy tamin’izay.'),
  ('6ab25a58ce58b96e7591b0aa', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.022Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.022Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 4, 39, 'Koa nisy anankiray nankany an-tsaha mba hitsongo anana atao hoe fiandrilavenona, ka nahita zavamaniry mandady. Dia nioty voantangomboalavo teo amin’io izy, ka nahangona eran’ny akanjony. Ary nony tonga izy, dia notetitetehiny ilay izy, ka narotsany tao anatin’ilay vilanin-dasopy, fa tsy fantatr’izy ireo hoe inona ilay izy.', 'koa nisy anankiray nankany an-tsaha mba hitsongo anana atao hoe fiandrilavenona, ka nahita zavamaniry mandady. dia nioty voantangomboalavo teo amin’io izy, ka nahangona eran’ny akanjony. ary nony tonga izy, dia notetitetehiny ilay izy, ka narotsany tao anatin’ilay vilanin-dasopy, fa tsy fantatr’izy ireo hoe inona ilay izy.'),
  ('6ab25a58ce58b96e7591b0a9', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.022Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.022Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 4, 38, 'Dia niverina tany Gilgala i Elisa. Nisy mosary tany tamin’izay. Ary nipetraka teo anatrehany ireo zanaky ny mpaminany, ka hoy izy tamin’ny mpanompony: “Ataingeno ilay vilanibe, ka manaova lasopy ho an’ny zanaky ny mpaminany.”', 'dia niverina tany gilgala i elisa. nisy mosary tany tamin’izay. ary nipetraka teo anatrehany ireo zanaky ny mpaminany, ka hoy izy tamin’ny mpanompony: “ataingeno ilay vilanibe, ka manaova lasopy ho an’ny zanaky ny mpaminany.”'),
  ('6ab25a58ce58b96e7591b0a3', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.022Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.022Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 4, 32, 'Farany, dia tonga tao amin’ilay trano i Elisa. Ary nampandrina teo am-pandrianany ilay zazalahy efa maty.', 'farany, dia tonga tao amin’ilay trano i elisa. ary nampandrina teo am-pandrianany ilay zazalahy efa maty.'),
  ('6ab25a58ce58b96e7591b0a0', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.022Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.022Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 4, 29, 'Avy hatrany, dia hoy i Elisa tamin’i Gehazy: “Misikìna, * ka raiso ny tehiko, ary mandehana. Raha mifanena amin’olona ianao, dia aza miarahaba azy. Ary raha misy miarahaba anao, dia aza mamaly. Ary apetraho eo amin’ny tarehin’ilay zazalahy ny tehiko.”', 'avy hatrany, dia hoy i elisa tamin’i gehazy: “misikìna, * ka raiso ny tehiko, ary mandehana. raha mifanena amin’olona ianao, dia aza miarahaba azy. ary raha misy miarahaba anao, dia aza mamaly. ary apetraho eo amin’ny tarehin’ilay zazalahy ny tehiko.”'),
  ('6ab25a58ce58b96e7591b098', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.022Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.022Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 4, 21, 'Ary niakatra nampandry azy teo amin’ny fandrianan’ilay lehilahin’Andriamanitra ravehivavy. Dia nakatony ny varavarana, ka lasa izy.', 'ary niakatra nampandry azy teo amin’ny fandrianan’ilay lehilahin’andriamanitra ravehivavy. dia nakatony ny varavarana, ka lasa izy.'),
  ('6ab25a58ce58b96e7591b094', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.022Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.022Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 4, 17, 'Bevohoka tokoa anefa ravehivavy. Dia tera-dahy izy tamin’ny fotoana voatondro, herintaona taorian’izay, araka izay nolazain’i Elisa taminy.', 'bevohoka tokoa anefa ravehivavy. dia tera-dahy izy tamin’ny fotoana voatondro, herintaona taorian’izay, araka izay nolazain’i elisa taminy.'),
  ('6ab25a58ce58b96e7591b0ae', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.022Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.022Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 4, 43, 'Fa hoy kosa ny mpanompony: “Hataoko ahoana ny handroso an’ireo eo anoloan’ny lehilahy zato?” Dia hoy i Elisa: “Omeo hohanin’ny olona ireo, fa izao no nolazain’i Jehovah: ‘Hihinana ny olona, ary hisy sisa tsy lany.’”', 'fa hoy kosa ny mpanompony: “hataoko ahoana ny handroso an’ireo eo anoloan’ny lehilahy zato?” dia hoy i elisa: “omeo hohanin’ny olona ireo, fa izao no nolazain’i jehovah: ‘hihinana ny olona, ary hisy sisa tsy lany.’”'),
  ('6ab25a58ce58b96e7591b0a8', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.022Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.022Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 4, 37, 'Dia niditra ravehivavy, ka niantoraka teo an-tongotr’i Elisa ary niankohoka tamin’ny tany teo anatrehany. Avy eo dia noraisiny ny zanany ary lasa izy.', 'dia niditra ravehivavy, ka niantoraka teo an-tongotr’i elisa ary niankohoka tamin’ny tany teo anatrehany. avy eo dia noraisiny ny zanany ary lasa izy.'),
  ('6ab25a58ce58b96e7591b0ab', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.022Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.022Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 4, 40, 'Avy eo, dia noloarana ilay lasopy mba hohanin’ny olona. Raha vao nihinana tamin’ilay izy anefa izy ireo, dia nikiakiaka hoe: “Misy zava-mahafaty ao am-bilany, ry lehilahin’Andriamanitra ô!” Koa tsy nahahinana izy ireo.', 'avy eo, dia noloarana ilay lasopy mba hohanin’ny olona. raha vao nihinana tamin’ilay izy anefa izy ireo, dia nikiakiaka hoe: “misy zava-mahafaty ao am-bilany, ry lehilahin’andriamanitra ô!” koa tsy nahahinana izy ireo.'),
  ('6ab25a58ce58b96e7591b0af', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.022Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.022Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 4, 44, 'Dia narosony teo anoloan’izy ireo izany, ka nihinana ireo ary nisy sisa tsy lany, araka ny tenin’i Jehovah.', 'dia narosony teo anoloan’izy ireo izany, ka nihinana ireo ary nisy sisa tsy lany, araka ny tenin’i jehovah.'),
  ('6ab25a58ce58b96e7591b09f', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.022Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.022Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 4, 28, 'Dia hoy ravehivavy: “Izaho angaha nangataka zanakalahy tamin’ny alalan’ny tompoko? Tsy efa nilaza ve aho hoe: ‘Aza mampanantena tsy misy’?”', 'dia hoy ravehivavy: “izaho angaha nangataka zanakalahy tamin’ny alalan’ny tompoko? tsy efa nilaza ve aho hoe: ‘aza mampanantena tsy misy’?”'),
  ('6ab25a58ce58b96e7591b099', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.022Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.022Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 4, 22, 'Ary nantsoiny ny vadiny, ka nilazany hoe: “Mba andefaso mpanompo iray sy ampondravavy iray aho, azafady. Aleo aho handeha haingana ho any amin’ilay lehilahin’Andriamanitra, dia hiverina.”', 'ary nantsoiny ny vadiny, ka nilazany hoe: “mba andefaso mpanompo iray sy ampondravavy iray aho, azafady. aleo aho handeha haingana ho any amin’ilay lehilahin’andriamanitra, dia hiverina.”'),
  ('6ab25a58ce58b96e7591b097', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.022Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.022Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 4, 20, 'Koa nentin’ilay mpanompo tany amin-dreniny izy. Dia nipetraka teo ampofoan-dreniny izy mandra-pitataovovonan’ny andro, ary farany dia maty.', 'koa nentin’ilay mpanompo tany amin-dreniny izy. dia nipetraka teo ampofoan-dreniny izy mandra-pitataovovonan’ny andro, ary farany dia maty.'),
  ('6ab25a58ce58b96e7591b091', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.022Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.022Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 4, 14, 'Ary hoy i Elisa: “Inona àry no tokony hatao ho azy?” Dia hoy i Gehazy: “Zanakalahy no tsy ananany, sady efa antitra ny vadiny.”', 'ary hoy i elisa: “inona àry no tokony hatao ho azy?” dia hoy i gehazy: “zanakalahy no tsy ananany, sady efa antitra ny vadiny.”'),
  ('6ab25a58f1e5fd09af2f354b', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.495Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.495Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 5, 3, 'Ary hoy izy tamin’ny tompovaviny: “Raha mba mankany amin’ilay mpaminany any Samaria mantsy ny tompoko, dia hositraniny amin’ny habokany!”', 'ary hoy izy tamin’ny tompovaviny: “raha mba mankany amin’ilay mpaminany any samaria mantsy ny tompoko, dia hositraniny amin’ny habokany!”'),
  ('6ab25a58f1e5fd09af2f3549', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.495Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.495Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 5, 1, 'Ary nisy lehilahy atao hoe Namàna, lehiben’ny tafiky ny mpanjakan’i Syria. Lasa olo-malaza teo anatrehan’ny tompony izy, sady nohajaina fatratra, satria tamin’ny alalany no namonjen’i Jehovah an’i Syria. Lehilahy matanjaka sy mahery fo izy, saingy boka.', 'ary nisy lehilahy atao hoe namàna, lehiben’ny tafiky ny mpanjakan’i syria. lasa olo-malaza teo anatrehan’ny tompony izy, sady nohajaina fatratra, satria tamin’ny alalany no namonjen’i jehovah an’i syria. lehilahy matanjaka sy mahery fo izy, saingy boka.'),
  ('6ab25a58f1e5fd09af2f354a', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.495Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.495Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 5, 2, 'Ary nahazo babo zazavavikely iray tany amin’ny tanin’ny Israely ny Syrianina mpandroba. Lasa mpanompon’ny vadin’i Namàna izy io.', 'ary nahazo babo zazavavikely iray tany amin’ny tanin’ny israely ny syrianina mpandroba. lasa mpanompon’ny vadin’i namàna izy io.'),
  ('6ab25a58f1e5fd09af2f355d', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.496Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.496Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 5, 21, 'Dia lasa nanenjika an’i Namàna i Gehazy. Raha vao nahatazana olona nihazakazaka nanenjika azy i Namàna, dia nidina avy hatrany avy teny amin’ny kalesiny mba hitsena azy, ka nanao hoe: “Tsy misy maninona ve?”', 'dia lasa nanenjika an’i namàna i gehazy. raha vao nahatazana olona nihazakazaka nanenjika azy i namàna, dia nidina avy hatrany avy teny amin’ny kalesiny mba hitsena azy, ka nanao hoe: “tsy misy maninona ve?”');
INSERT INTO "bible_verses" ("id", "created_date", "updated_date", "created_by_id", "created_by", "translation", "book", "bookOrder", "chapter", "verse", "text", "normalizedText") VALUES
  ('6ab25a58f1e5fd09af2f355b', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.496Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.496Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 5, 19, 'Dia hoy i Elisa taminy: “Mandehana soa aman-tsara.” Koa niala teo aminy izy, dia nandeha ary efa lasa lavidavitra.', 'dia hoy i elisa taminy: “mandehana soa aman-tsara.” koa niala teo aminy izy, dia nandeha ary efa lasa lavidavitra.'),
  ('6ab25a58f1e5fd09af2f3561', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.496Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.496Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 5, 25, 'Ary nankao amin’ny tompony i Gehazy ka nijoro teo akaikiny. Dia hoy i Elisa taminy: “Avy taiza ianao, ry Gehazy?” Ary hoy izy: “Tsy taiza tsy taiza ny mpanomponao.”', 'ary nankao amin’ny tompony i gehazy ka nijoro teo akaikiny. dia hoy i elisa taminy: “avy taiza ianao, ry gehazy?” ary hoy izy: “tsy taiza tsy taiza ny mpanomponao.”'),
  ('6ab25a58f1e5fd09af2f3555', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.496Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.496Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 5, 13, 'Nanatona azy anefa ny mpanompony, ka niteny taminy hoe: “Ry raiko ô, na zavatra lehibe aza ve no nasain’ilay mpaminany nataonao, tsy ho nataonao? Koa mainka fa izay nolazainy taminao hoe: ‘Mandroa, dia hadio ianao’?”', 'nanatona azy anefa ny mpanompony, ka niteny taminy hoe: “ry raiko ô, na zavatra lehibe aza ve no nasain’ilay mpaminany nataonao, tsy ho nataonao? koa mainka fa izay nolazainy taminao hoe: ‘mandroa, dia hadio ianao’?”'),
  ('6ab25a58f1e5fd09af2f354c', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.496Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.496Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 5, 4, 'Ary nisy olona tonga tao amin’ny tompon’i Namàna, ka nitantara taminy hoe: “Izany sy izany no nolazain’ilay zazavavy avy any Israely.”', 'ary nisy olona tonga tao amin’ny tompon’i namàna, ka nitantara taminy hoe: “izany sy izany no nolazain’ilay zazavavy avy any israely.”'),
  ('6ab25a58f1e5fd09af2f354f', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.496Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.496Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 5, 7, 'Raha vao voavakin’ny mpanjakan’ny Israely ilay taratasy, dia nandrovitra ny akanjony izy, ka nanao hoe: “Izaho angaha Andriamanitra ka mahay mamono na misakana tsy ho faty, no andefasany olona hositraniko amin’ny habokany? Jereo tsara fa mila ady amiko mihitsy izy.”', 'raha vao voavakin’ny mpanjakan’ny israely ilay taratasy, dia nandrovitra ny akanjony izy, ka nanao hoe: “izaho angaha andriamanitra ka mahay mamono na misakana tsy ho faty, no andefasany olona hositraniko amin’ny habokany? jereo tsara fa mila ady amiko mihitsy izy.”'),
  ('6ab25a58f1e5fd09af2f354d', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.496Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.496Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 5, 5, 'Dia hoy ny mpanjakan’i Syria: “Mandehana mankany, fa hampitondra taratasy ho any amin’ny mpanjakan’ny Israely aho.” Dia lasa izy sady nitondra talenta volafotsy folo, sy sekely volamena enina arivo, ary akanjo impolo miova.', 'dia hoy ny mpanjakan’i syria: “mandehana mankany, fa hampitondra taratasy ho any amin’ny mpanjakan’ny israely aho.” dia lasa izy sady nitondra talenta volafotsy folo, sy sekely volamena enina arivo, ary akanjo impolo miova.'),
  ('6ab25a58f1e5fd09af2f3552', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.496Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.496Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 5, 10, 'Olona anefa no nirahin’i Elisa nankany aminy, hilaza hoe: “Mandehana mandro impito ao amin’ny Reniranon’i Jordana, dia ho toy ny taloha indray ny nofonao, ka hadio ianao.”', 'olona anefa no nirahin’i elisa nankany aminy, hilaza hoe: “mandehana mandro impito ao amin’ny reniranon’i jordana, dia ho toy ny taloha indray ny nofonao, ka hadio ianao.”'),
  ('6ab25a58f1e5fd09af2f3563', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.496Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.496Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 5, 27, 'Koa hiraikitra aminao sy ny taranakao mandritra ny fotoana tsy voafetra ny habokan’i Namàna.” Ary niala teo anatrehany avy hatrany i Gehazy, ka indro izy fa boka ary lasa fotsy be. *', 'koa hiraikitra aminao sy ny taranakao mandritra ny fotoana tsy voafetra ny habokan’i namàna.” ary niala teo anatrehany avy hatrany i gehazy, ka indro izy fa boka ary lasa fotsy be. *'),
  ('6ab25a58f1e5fd09af2f355e', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.496Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.496Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 5, 22, 'Ary hoy i Gehazy: “Tsy misy maninona, fa nirahin’ny tompoko aho hilaza hoe: ‘Misy zatovo roa lahy zanaky ny mpaminany vao tonga atỳ amiko izao, ary avy any amin’ny faritra be tendrombohitr’i Efraima izy ireo. Koa mba omeo talenta * volafotsy iray sy akanjo indroa miova izy ireo, azafady.’”', 'ary hoy i gehazy: “tsy misy maninona, fa nirahin’ny tompoko aho hilaza hoe: ‘misy zatovo roa lahy zanaky ny mpaminany vao tonga atỳ amiko izao, ary avy any amin’ny faritra be tendrombohitr’i efraima izy ireo. koa mba omeo talenta * volafotsy iray sy akanjo indroa miova izy ireo, azafady.’”'),
  ('6ab25a58f1e5fd09af2f3559', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.496Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.496Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 5, 17, 'Farany, dia hoy i Namàna: “Raha izany àry, dia aoka mba homena tany zakan’ny ramole roa ny mpanomponao. Tsy hanolotra fanatitra dorana na sorona ho an’ny andriamani-kafa intsony mantsy ny mpanomponao, fa ho an’i Jehovah ihany.', 'farany, dia hoy i namàna: “raha izany àry, dia aoka mba homena tany zakan’ny ramole roa ny mpanomponao. tsy hanolotra fanatitra dorana na sorona ho an’ny andriamani-kafa intsony mantsy ny mpanomponao, fa ho an’i jehovah ihany.'),
  ('6ab25a58f1e5fd09af2f3558', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.496Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.496Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 5, 16, 'Hoy anefa i Elisa: “Raha mbola velona koa i Jehovah izay tompoiko, dia tsy handray an’io aho.” Ary niangavy azy fatratra i Namàna mba handraisany izany, fa tsy nety mihitsy izy.', 'hoy anefa i elisa: “raha mbola velona koa i jehovah izay tompoiko, dia tsy handray an’io aho.” ary niangavy azy fatratra i namàna mba handraisany izany, fa tsy nety mihitsy izy.'),
  ('6ab25a58f1e5fd09af2f3554', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.496Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.496Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 5, 12, 'Fa angaha i Abana sy Farpara, reniranon’i Damaskosy, tsy tsara noho ny rano rehetran’ny Israely? Tsy afaka mandro any angaha aho ka hadio?” Dia nihodina izy ka lasa nandeha sady romotry ny hatezerana.', 'fa angaha i abana sy farpara, reniranon’i damaskosy, tsy tsara noho ny rano rehetran’ny israely? tsy afaka mandro any angaha aho ka hadio?” dia nihodina izy ka lasa nandeha sady romotry ny hatezerana.'),
  ('6ab25a58f1e5fd09af2f3560', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.496Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.496Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 5, 24, 'Raha vao tonga tao Ofela i Gehazy, dia nalainy teny an-tanan’ireo izany ka napetrany tao an-trano. Ary nalefany handeha ireo, ka lasa.', 'raha vao tonga tao ofela i gehazy, dia nalainy teny an-tanan’ireo izany ka napetrany tao an-trano. ary nalefany handeha ireo, ka lasa.'),
  ('6ab25a58f1e5fd09af2f3556', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.496Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.496Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 5, 14, 'Dia lasa nidina i Namàna ka nisitrika impito tao Jordana, araka ny tenin’ilay lehilahin’Andriamanitra. Ary lasa tahaka ny nofon-jazalahikely indray ny nofony, ka nadio izy.', 'dia lasa nidina i namàna ka nisitrika impito tao jordana, araka ny tenin’ilay lehilahin’andriamanitra. ary lasa tahaka ny nofon-jazalahikely indray ny nofony, ka nadio izy.'),
  ('6ab25a58f1e5fd09af2f354e', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.496Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.496Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 5, 6, 'Ary nentiny tany amin’ny mpanjakan’ny Israely ilay taratasy izay nilaza hoe: “Amin’ny fotoana ahatongavan’ity taratasy ity any aminao, dia ho efa nirahiko ho any aminao i Namàna mpanompoko mba hositraninao amin’ny habokany.”', 'ary nentiny tany amin’ny mpanjakan’ny israely ilay taratasy izay nilaza hoe: “amin’ny fotoana ahatongavan’ity taratasy ity any aminao, dia ho efa nirahiko ho any aminao i namàna mpanompoko mba hositraninao amin’ny habokany.”'),
  ('6ab25a58f1e5fd09af2f3562', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.496Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.496Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 5, 26, 'Dia hoy i Elisa taminy: “Tsy fantatro angaha izay nitranga, rehefa nihodina ralehilahy ka nidina avy teny amin’ny kalesiny mba hitsena anao? Angaha moa izao fotoana andraisana volafotsy, na akanjo, na sahan’oliva, na tanimboaloboka, na ondry, na omby, na mpanompolahy, na mpanompovavy?', 'dia hoy i elisa taminy: “tsy fantatro angaha izay nitranga, rehefa nihodina ralehilahy ka nidina avy teny amin’ny kalesiny mba hitsena anao? angaha moa izao fotoana andraisana volafotsy, na akanjo, na sahan’oliva, na tanimboaloboka, na ondry, na omby, na mpanompolahy, na mpanompovavy?'),
  ('6ab25a58f1e5fd09af2f3550', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.496Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.496Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 5, 8, 'Raha vao ren’i Elisa lehilahin’Andriamanitra fa nandrovitra ny akanjony ny mpanjakan’ny Israely, dia nandefa iraka tany amin’ny mpanjaka izy, nanao hoe: “Nahoana ianao no nandrovitra ny akanjonao? Mba alefaso atỳ amiko izy, dia ho fantany fa misy mpaminany tokoa eto amin’ny Israely.”', 'raha vao ren’i elisa lehilahin’andriamanitra fa nandrovitra ny akanjony ny mpanjakan’ny israely, dia nandefa iraka tany amin’ny mpanjaka izy, nanao hoe: “nahoana ianao no nandrovitra ny akanjonao? mba alefaso atỳ amiko izy, dia ho fantany fa misy mpaminany tokoa eto amin’ny israely.”'),
  ('6ab25a58f1e5fd09af2f3557', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.496Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.496Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 5, 15, 'Koa niverina tany amin’ilay lehilahin’Andriamanitra izy mbamin’izay rehetra tao an-tobiny, ka nijoro teo anatrehan’i Elisa, ary nanao hoe: “Fantatro tokoa izao fa tsy misy Andriamanitra na aiza na aiza eto an-tany, afa-tsy eto amin’ny Israely ihany. Koa mba raiso, azafady, ny fanomezana ho fisaorana avy amin’ny mpanomponao.”', 'koa niverina tany amin’ilay lehilahin’andriamanitra izy mbamin’izay rehetra tao an-tobiny, ka nijoro teo anatrehan’i elisa, ary nanao hoe: “fantatro tokoa izao fa tsy misy andriamanitra na aiza na aiza eto an-tany, afa-tsy eto amin’ny israely ihany. koa mba raiso, azafady, ny fanomezana ho fisaorana avy amin’ny mpanomponao.”'),
  ('6ab25a58f1e5fd09af2f355f', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.496Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.496Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 5, 23, 'Dia hoy i Namàna: “Talenta roa alaina.” Ary niangavy azy fatratra i Namàna. Farany dia nataony tao anaty kitapo roa ny talenta volafotsy roa nifatotra tsara, sy ny akanjo indroa miova. Dia nomeny ny mpanompony roa lahy izany mba hoentin’ireo teo alohan’i Gehazy.', 'dia hoy i namàna: “talenta roa alaina.” ary niangavy azy fatratra i namàna. farany dia nataony tao anaty kitapo roa ny talenta volafotsy roa nifatotra tsara, sy ny akanjo indroa miova. dia nomeny ny mpanompony roa lahy izany mba hoentin’ireo teo alohan’i gehazy.'),
  ('6ab25a58f1e5fd09af2f355a', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.496Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.496Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 5, 18, 'I Jehovah anie hamela ny heloky ny mpanomponao rehefa miditra ao an-tranon’i Rimona ny tompoko mba hiankohoka ao, ka mitehina amin’ny tanako, ary voatery miankohoka ao an-tranon’i Rimona koa aho! Eny, i Jehovah anie hamela ny heloky ny mpanomponao rehefa miankohoka ao an-tranon’i Rimona aho!”', 'i jehovah anie hamela ny heloky ny mpanomponao rehefa miditra ao an-tranon’i rimona ny tompoko mba hiankohoka ao, ka mitehina amin’ny tanako, ary voatery miankohoka ao an-tranon’i rimona koa aho! eny, i jehovah anie hamela ny heloky ny mpanomponao rehefa miankohoka ao an-tranon’i rimona aho!”'),
  ('6ab25a58f1e5fd09af2f3553', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.496Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.496Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 5, 11, 'Dia tezitra i Namàna, ka sady lasa izy no niteny hoe: “Nieritreritra aho hoe: ‘Hivoaka hankatỳ amiko mihitsy izy, ka hitsangana hiantso ny anaran’i Jehovah Andriamaniny, ary hanevaheva ny tanany eo ambonin’ny faritra marary ka hahasitrana ny habokana.’', 'dia tezitra i namàna, ka sady lasa izy no niteny hoe: “nieritreritra aho hoe: ‘hivoaka hankatỳ amiko mihitsy izy, ka hitsangana hiantso ny anaran’i jehovah andriamaniny, ary hanevaheva ny tanany eo ambonin’ny faritra marary ka hahasitrana ny habokana.’'),
  ('6ab25a58f1e5fd09af2f3551', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.496Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.496Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 5, 9, 'Dia tonga i Namàna, niaraka tamin’ny soavaliny sy ny kalesin’adiny, ka nijanona teo amin’ny fidirana amin’ny tranon’i Elisa.', 'dia tonga i namàna, niaraka tamin’ny soavaliny sy ny kalesin’adiny, ka nijanona teo amin’ny fidirana amin’ny tranon’i elisa.'),
  ('6ab25a58f1e5fd09af2f355c', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.496Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.496Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 5, 20, 'Tamin’izay i Gehazy mpanompon’i Elisa lehilahin’Andriamanitra no niteny anakampo hoe: “Navelan’ny tompoko handeha fotsiny i Namàna Syrianina, ka tsy noraisiny izay zavatra nentiny. Raha mbola velona koa i Jehovah, dia hihazakazaka hanenjika azy aho ka haka zavatra avy aminy.”', 'tamin’izay i gehazy mpanompon’i elisa lehilahin’andriamanitra no niteny anakampo hoe: “navelan’ny tompoko handeha fotsiny i namàna syrianina, ka tsy noraisiny izay zavatra nentiny. raha mbola velona koa i jehovah, dia hihazakazaka hanenjika azy aho ka haka zavatra avy aminy.”'),
  ('6ab25a58da662aeffc6f2831', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.947Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.947Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 6, 32, 'Nipetraka tao an-tranony i Elisa, ary niaraka taminy koa ny anti-panahy, rehefa naniraka olona ho any amin’i Elisa ny mpanjaka. Fa raha mbola tsy tonga tany aminy ilay iraka, dia hoy izy tamin’ny anti-panahy: “Hitanareo ve fa nandefa iraka hanapaka ny lohako iny zanaky ny mpamono olona iny? Tandremo tsara fa raha vao tonga ilay iraka, dia akatòny ny varavarana ka atoseho amin’ny varavarana izy. Ary tsy izany efa rentsika ao aoriany ao izany ve ny figodongodon’ny tongotry ny tompony?”', 'nipetraka tao an-tranony i elisa, ary niaraka taminy koa ny anti-panahy, rehefa naniraka olona ho any amin’i elisa ny mpanjaka. fa raha mbola tsy tonga tany aminy ilay iraka, dia hoy izy tamin’ny anti-panahy: “hitanareo ve fa nandefa iraka hanapaka ny lohako iny zanaky ny mpamono olona iny? tandremo tsara fa raha vao tonga ilay iraka, dia akatòny ny varavarana ka atoseho amin’ny varavarana izy. ary tsy izany efa rentsika ao aoriany ao izany ve ny figodongodon’ny tongotry ny tompony?”'),
  ('6ab25a58da662aeffc6f2821', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.947Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.947Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 6, 16, 'Hoy anefa izy: “Aza matahotra, fa ny momba antsika dia betsaka noho ny momba azy.”', 'hoy anefa izy: “aza matahotra, fa ny momba antsika dia betsaka noho ny momba azy.”'),
  ('6ab25a58da662aeffc6f2824', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.947Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.947Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 6, 19, 'Ary hoy i Elisa tamin’ireo: “Tsy ity ilay lalana, ary tsy ity ilay tanàna. Manaraha ahy, fa hoentiko any amin’ilay lehilahy tadiavinareo ianareo.” Nentiny tany Samaria anefa izy ireo.', 'ary hoy i elisa tamin’ireo: “tsy ity ilay lalana, ary tsy ity ilay tanàna. manaraha ahy, fa hoentiko any amin’ilay lehilahy tadiavinareo ianareo.” nentiny tany samaria anefa izy ireo.'),
  ('6ab25a58da662aeffc6f281e', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.947Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.947Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 6, 13, 'Ary hoy ny mpanjaka: “Mandehana jereo izay misy azy mba hanirahako olona haka azy.” Tatỳ aoriana, dia nisy nilaza taminy hoe: “Any Dotana izy.”', 'ary hoy ny mpanjaka: “mandehana jereo izay misy azy mba hanirahako olona haka azy.” tatỳ aoriana, dia nisy nilaza taminy hoe: “any dotana izy.”'),
  ('6ab25a58da662aeffc6f2819', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.947Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.947Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 6, 8, 'Ary nanjary niady tamin’ny Israely ny mpanjakan’i Syria, ka nikaon-doha niaraka tamin’ny mpanompony. Hoy izy: “Any Ananona no hitobianareo miaraka amiko.”', 'ary nanjary niady tamin’ny israely ny mpanjakan’i syria, ka nikaon-doha niaraka tamin’ny mpanompony. hoy izy: “any ananona no hitobianareo miaraka amiko.”'),
  ('6ab25a58da662aeffc6f2827', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.947Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.947Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 6, 22, 'Hoy anefa izy: “Aza mamely azy. Izay nobaboinao tamin’ny sabatrao sy ny tsipìkanao ve dia hovonoinao? Rosoy sakafo izy ireo hohaniny sy rano hosotroiny, ary aoka izy hiverina any amin’ny tompony.”', 'hoy anefa izy: “aza mamely azy. izay nobaboinao tamin’ny sabatrao sy ny tsipìkanao ve dia hovonoinao? rosoy sakafo izy ireo hohaniny sy rano hosotroiny, ary aoka izy hiverina any amin’ny tompony.”'),
  ('6ab25a58da662aeffc6f2817', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.947Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.947Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 6, 6, 'Ary hoy ilay lehilahin’Andriamanitra: “Taiza ilay izy no nilatsaka?” Dia natorony azy ilay toerana. Nanapaka tapa-kazo avy hatrany i Elisa, ka natsipiny tao. Dia natsinkafony ilay lelam-pamaky.', 'ary hoy ilay lehilahin’andriamanitra: “taiza ilay izy no nilatsaka?” dia natorony azy ilay toerana. nanapaka tapa-kazo avy hatrany i elisa, ka natsipiny tao. dia natsinkafony ilay lelam-pamaky.'),
  ('6ab25a58da662aeffc6f2814', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.947Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.947Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 6, 3, 'Ary nisy anankiray nanao hoe: “Andao re mba hiaraka amin’ny mpanomponao e!” Dia hoy izy: “Handeha àry aho.”', 'ary nisy anankiray nanao hoe: “andao re mba hiaraka amin’ny mpanomponao e!” dia hoy izy: “handeha àry aho.”'),
  ('6ab25a58da662aeffc6f282a', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.947Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.947Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 6, 25, 'Dia nisy mosary mafy tao Samaria. Nataon’izy ireo fahirano izy io, ka lasa farantsa volafotsy valopolo ny vidin’ny lohan’ampondra iray, ary farantsa volafotsy dimy ny taim-boromailala ampahefatry ny kaba. *', 'dia nisy mosary mafy tao samaria. nataon’izy ireo fahirano izy io, ka lasa farantsa volafotsy valopolo ny vidin’ny lohan’ampondra iray, ary farantsa volafotsy dimy ny taim-boromailala ampahefatry ny kaba. *'),
  ('6ab25a58da662aeffc6f2826', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.947Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.947Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 6, 21, 'Dia hoy ny mpanjakan’ny Israely tamin’i Elisa raha vao nahita an’ireo: “Hasiako ho faty ve izy ireo? Hasiako ho faty ve izy ireo, ry raiko ô?”', 'dia hoy ny mpanjakan’ny israely tamin’i elisa raha vao nahita an’ireo: “hasiako ho faty ve izy ireo? hasiako ho faty ve izy ireo, ry raiko ô?”'),
  ('6ab25a58da662aeffc6f281d', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.947Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.947Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 6, 12, 'Dia hoy ny mpanompony anankiray: “Tsy misy manao an’izany, ry mpanjaka tompoko ô! Fa i Elisa mpaminany any Israely no milaza amin’ny mpanjakan’ny Israely izay zavatra lazainao ao amin’ny efitra fatorianao.”', 'dia hoy ny mpanompony anankiray: “tsy misy manao an’izany, ry mpanjaka tompoko ô! fa i elisa mpaminany any israely no milaza amin’ny mpanjakan’ny israely izay zavatra lazainao ao amin’ny efitra fatorianao.”'),
  ('6ab25a58da662aeffc6f281c', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.947Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.947Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 6, 11, 'Koa romotry ny hatezerana ny fon’ny mpanjakan’i Syria, ary niantso ny mpanompony izy ka nanao hoe: “Tsy holazainareo amiko ve hoe iza amintsika no momba ny mpanjakan’ny Israely?”', 'koa romotry ny hatezerana ny fon’ny mpanjakan’i syria, ary niantso ny mpanompony izy ka nanao hoe: “tsy holazainareo amiko ve hoe iza amintsika no momba ny mpanjakan’ny israely?”'),
  ('6ab25a58da662aeffc6f2829', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.947Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.947Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 6, 24, 'Ary novorin’i Beni-hadada mpanjakan’i Syria ny olona rehetra tao an-tobiny, ka niakatra hanao fahirano an’i Samaria izy ireo.', 'ary novorin’i beni-hadada mpanjakan’i syria ny olona rehetra tao an-tobiny, ka niakatra hanao fahirano an’i samaria izy ireo.'),
  ('6ab25a58da662aeffc6f2822', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.947Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.947Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 6, 17, 'Ary nivavaka i Elisa hoe: “Jehovah ô, ampahirato re ny masony mba hahitany e!” Avy hatrany dia nampahiratin’i Jehovah ny mason’ilay mpanompo, ka nahita izy. Ary indreo feno soavaly sy kalesy afo ny faritra be tendrombohitra manodidina an’i Elisa.', 'ary nivavaka i elisa hoe: “jehovah ô, ampahirato re ny masony mba hahitany e!” avy hatrany dia nampahiratin’i jehovah ny mason’ilay mpanompo, ka nahita izy. ary indreo feno soavaly sy kalesy afo ny faritra be tendrombohitra manodidina an’i elisa.'),
  ('6ab25a58da662aeffc6f282b', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.947Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.947Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 6, 26, 'Rehefa nandalo teo ambonin’ny manda ny mpanjakan’ny Israely, dia nisy vehivavy anankiray nitaraina taminy hoe: “Vonjeo aho, ry mpanjaka tompoko ô!”', 'rehefa nandalo teo ambonin’ny manda ny mpanjakan’ny israely, dia nisy vehivavy anankiray nitaraina taminy hoe: “vonjeo aho, ry mpanjaka tompoko ô!”'),
  ('6ab25a58da662aeffc6f281a', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.947Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.947Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 6, 9, 'Dia naniraka olona ilay lehilahin’Andriamanitra hiteny tamin’ny mpanjakan’ny Israely hoe: “Tandremo sao mandalo any amin’izany toerana izany, fa any no idinan’ny Syrianina.”', 'dia naniraka olona ilay lehilahin’andriamanitra hiteny tamin’ny mpanjakan’ny israely hoe: “tandremo sao mandalo any amin’izany toerana izany, fa any no idinan’ny syrianina.”'),
  ('6ab25a58da662aeffc6f282d', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.947Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.947Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 6, 28, 'Hoy koa izy: “Fa misy inona?” Dia hoy ravehivavy: “Niteny tamiko ity vehivavy ity hoe: ‘Omeo ny zanakao hohanintsika anio, ary ny zanako kosa no hohanintsika rahampitso.’', 'hoy koa izy: “fa misy inona?” dia hoy ravehivavy: “niteny tamiko ity vehivavy ity hoe: ‘omeo ny zanakao hohanintsika anio, ary ny zanako kosa no hohanintsika rahampitso.’'),
  ('6ab25a58da662aeffc6f2818', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.947Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.947Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 6, 7, 'Ary hoy izy: “Alaivo amin’izay.” Dia natsotran-dralehilahy ny tanany, ka nalainy ilay izy.', 'ary hoy izy: “alaivo amin’izay.” dia natsotran-dralehilahy ny tanany, ka nalainy ilay izy.'),
  ('6ab25a58da662aeffc6f2813', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.947Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.947Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 6, 2, 'Koa aoka re izahay handeha hatrany amin’ny Reniranon’i Jordana e, ka samy haka vatan-kazo iray any, ary hanao toeram-ponenana ho anay any.” Dia hoy i Elisa: “Mandehana àry.”', 'koa aoka re izahay handeha hatrany amin’ny reniranon’i jordana e, ka samy haka vatan-kazo iray any, ary hanao toeram-ponenana ho anay any.” dia hoy i elisa: “mandehana àry.”'),
  ('6ab25a58da662aeffc6f282e', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.947Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.947Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 6, 29, 'Dia nandrahoinay ny zanako ka nohaninay. Ary hoy izaho taminy ny ampitso: ‘Omeo ny zanakao hohanintsika.’ Kanjo nafeniny ny zanany.”', 'dia nandrahoinay ny zanako ka nohaninay. ary hoy izaho taminy ny ampitso: ‘omeo ny zanakao hohanintsika.’ kanjo nafeniny ny zanany.”'),
  ('6ab25a58da662aeffc6f282c', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.947Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.947Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 6, 27, 'Dia hoy izy: “Ahoana no hamonjeko anao raha tsy mamonjy anao i Jehovah? Heverinao angaha fa afaka manome anao voa na divay na menaka aho?”', 'dia hoy izy: “ahoana no hamonjeko anao raha tsy mamonjy anao i jehovah? heverinao angaha fa afaka manome anao voa na divay na menaka aho?”'),
  ('6ab25a58da662aeffc6f2820', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.947Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.947Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 6, 15, 'Rehefa nifoha maraina ny mpanompon’ilay lehilahin’Andriamanitra ka nitsangana nankany ivelany, dia nahita tafika nanodidina ny tanàna niaraka tamin’ny soavaly sy kalesin’ady. Avy hatrany dia hoy ilay mpanompo: “Indrisy, tompoko ô! Inona no hataontsika?”', 'rehefa nifoha maraina ny mpanompon’ilay lehilahin’andriamanitra ka nitsangana nankany ivelany, dia nahita tafika nanodidina ny tanàna niaraka tamin’ny soavaly sy kalesin’ady. avy hatrany dia hoy ilay mpanompo: “indrisy, tompoko ô! inona no hataontsika?”'),
  ('6ab25a58da662aeffc6f281b', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.947Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.947Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 6, 10, 'Koa nandefa iraka nankany amin’ilay toerana nolazain’ilay lehilahin’Andriamanitra ny mpanjakan’ny Israely. Nampitandrina azy tokoa i Elisa, ka tsy nankany izy. Tsy indray mandeha na indroa no nitrangan’izany.', 'koa nandefa iraka nankany amin’ilay toerana nolazain’ilay lehilahin’andriamanitra ny mpanjakan’ny israely. nampitandrina azy tokoa i elisa, ka tsy nankany izy. tsy indray mandeha na indroa no nitrangan’izany.'),
  ('6ab25a58da662aeffc6f2815', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.947Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.947Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 6, 4, 'Koa niaraka tamin’ireo izy. Rehefa tonga tany Jordana izy ireo, dia nikapa hazo.', 'koa niaraka tamin’ireo izy. rehefa tonga tany jordana izy ireo, dia nikapa hazo.'),
  ('6ab25a58da662aeffc6f2812', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.947Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.947Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 6, 1, 'Ary hoy ireo zanaky ny mpaminany tamin’i Elisa: “Kely loatra ny toerana onenanay eto anatrehanao ka tsy antonona anay.', 'ary hoy ireo zanaky ny mpaminany tamin’i elisa: “kely loatra ny toerana onenanay eto anatrehanao ka tsy antonona anay.'),
  ('6ab25a58da662aeffc6f2816', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.947Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.947Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 6, 5, 'Rehefa nikapa ny hazony anefa ny anankiray, dia latsaka tao anaty rano ny lelam-pamaky. Koa nitaraina izy hoe: “Loza, tompoko ô, fa nindramina iny!”', 'rehefa nikapa ny hazony anefa ny anankiray, dia latsaka tao anaty rano ny lelam-pamaky. koa nitaraina izy hoe: “loza, tompoko ô, fa nindramina iny!”'),
  ('6ab25a58da662aeffc6f2832', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.947Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.947Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 6, 33, 'Ary raha mbola niresaka tamin’izy ireo i Elisa, dia nidina nankao aminy ilay iraka. Dia hoy ny mpanjaka: “Loza avy amin’i Jehovah izao. Koa nahoana aho no tokony mbola hiandry an’i Jehovah ihany?”', 'ary raha mbola niresaka tamin’izy ireo i elisa, dia nidina nankao aminy ilay iraka. dia hoy ny mpanjaka: “loza avy amin’i jehovah izao. koa nahoana aho no tokony mbola hiandry an’i jehovah ihany?”'),
  ('6ab25a58da662aeffc6f2825', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.947Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.947Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 6, 20, 'Raha vao tonga tany Samaria ireo, dia hoy i Elisa: “Jehovah ô, ampahirato ny mason’ireto mba hahitany.” Koa nampahiratin’i Jehovah avy hatrany ny masony, ka hitan’izy ireo fa teo afovoan’i Samaria izy ireo.', 'raha vao tonga tany samaria ireo, dia hoy i elisa: “jehovah ô, ampahirato ny mason’ireto mba hahitany.” koa nampahiratin’i jehovah avy hatrany ny masony, ka hitan’izy ireo fa teo afovoan’i samaria izy ireo.'),
  ('6ab25a58da662aeffc6f2830', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.947Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.947Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 6, 31, 'Dia hoy izy: “Hofaizin’Andriamanitra anie aho, * ary mihoatra noho izany aza, raha mbola ho tavela eo ambonin’i Elisa zanak’i Safata ihany ny lohany anio!”', 'dia hoy izy: “hofaizin’andriamanitra anie aho, * ary mihoatra noho izany aza, raha mbola ho tavela eo ambonin’i elisa zanak’i safata ihany ny lohany anio!”'),
  ('6ab25a58da662aeffc6f281f', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.947Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.947Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 6, 14, 'Koa avy hatrany dia nisy soavaly sy kalesin’ady ary tafika lehibe nalefany nankany. Tonga tamin’ny alina izy ireo, ka nohodidininy ny tanàna.', 'koa avy hatrany dia nisy soavaly sy kalesin’ady ary tafika lehibe nalefany nankany. tonga tamin’ny alina izy ireo, ka nohodidininy ny tanàna.'),
  ('6ab25a58da662aeffc6f282f', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.947Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.947Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 6, 30, 'Dia nandrovitra ny akanjony ny mpanjaka raha vao nandre ny tenin-dravehivavy. Rehefa nandalo teo ambonin’ny manda izy, dia hitan’ny olona fa lamba gony no nataony nanolo-koditra.', 'dia nandrovitra ny akanjony ny mpanjaka raha vao nandre ny tenin-dravehivavy. rehefa nandalo teo ambonin’ny manda izy, dia hitan’ny olona fa lamba gony no nataony nanolo-koditra.'),
  ('6ab25a58da662aeffc6f2828', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.947Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.947Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 6, 23, 'Dia nanao fanasambe ho an’ireo izy, ary nihinana sy nisotro ireo. Avy eo dia nalefany izy ireo, ka niverina tany amin’ny tompony. Koa tsy nankany amin’ny tanin’ny Israely intsony ny Syrianina mpandroba, na indray mandeha aza.', 'dia nanao fanasambe ho an’ireo izy, ary nihinana sy nisotro ireo. avy eo dia nalefany izy ireo, ka niverina tany amin’ny tompony. koa tsy nankany amin’ny tanin’ny israely intsony ny syrianina mpandroba, na indray mandeha aza.'),
  ('6ab25a58da662aeffc6f2823', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.947Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:12.947Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 6, 18, 'Rehefa nidina ho eny amin’i Elisa ny Syrianina, dia nivavaka tamin’i Jehovah izy hoe: “Mba ataovy jamba re io firenena io e!” Dia nataony jamba ireo, araka ny tenin’i Elisa.', 'rehefa nidina ho eny amin’i elisa ny syrianina, dia nivavaka tamin’i jehovah izy hoe: “mba ataovy jamba re io firenena io e!” dia nataony jamba ireo, araka ny tenin’i elisa.'),
  ('6ab25a595c0fe955f15b6c0b', '2026-09-22T10:37:13.480Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:13.480Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 7, 18, 'Dia nitranga tokoa izay efa nolazain’ilay lehilahin’Andriamanitra tamin’ny mpanjaka hoe: “Ho sekely iray ny vidin’ny vary orza indroan’ny seha, ary ho sekely iray koa ny vidin’ny lafarinina tsara toto eran’ny seha, eo am-bavahadin’i Samaria, rahampitso amin’ny ora toy izao.”', 'dia nitranga tokoa izay efa nolazain’ilay lehilahin’andriamanitra tamin’ny mpanjaka hoe: “ho sekely iray ny vidin’ny vary orza indroan’ny seha, ary ho sekely iray koa ny vidin’ny lafarinina tsara toto eran’ny seha, eo am-bavahadin’i samaria, rahampitso amin’ny ora toy izao.”'),
  ('6ab25a595c0fe955f15b6c06', '2026-09-22T10:37:13.480Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:13.480Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 7, 13, 'Ary hoy ny mpanompony anankiray: “Mifidiana olona haka soavaly dimy amin’izay sisa tavela ato an-tanàna. Fa toy ny Israelita rehetra sisa tavela ato ihany izy ireo, eny, toy ny rehetra efa ho faty, ka andao hirahina, dia ho hita eo.”', 'ary hoy ny mpanompony anankiray: “mifidiana olona haka soavaly dimy amin’izay sisa tavela ato an-tanàna. fa toy ny israelita rehetra sisa tavela ato ihany izy ireo, eny, toy ny rehetra efa ho faty, ka andao hirahina, dia ho hita eo.”'),
  ('6ab25a595c0fe955f15b6c09', '2026-09-22T10:37:13.480Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:13.480Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 7, 16, 'Dia nivoaka ny tanàna ny olona ka nandroba ny tobin’ny Syrianina. Koa nanjary sekely iray monja ny vidin’ny lafarinina tsara toto eran’ny seha, ary sekely iray koa ny vidin’ny vary orza indroan’ny seha, araka ny tenin’i Jehovah.', 'dia nivoaka ny tanàna ny olona ka nandroba ny tobin’ny syrianina. koa nanjary sekely iray monja ny vidin’ny lafarinina tsara toto eran’ny seha, ary sekely iray koa ny vidin’ny vary orza indroan’ny seha, araka ny tenin’i jehovah.'),
  ('6ab25a595c0fe955f15b6c05', '2026-09-22T10:37:13.480Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:13.480Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 7, 12, 'Niarina avy hatrany ny mpanjaka raha mbola alina ny andro, ka niteny tamin’ny mpanompony hoe: “Hampahafantariko anareo izao ataon’ny Syrianina amintsika izao: Fantany tsara fa noana isika, ka nivoaka ny toby izy ireo mba hiafina any an-tsaha ary nanao hoe: ‘Hivoaka ny tanàna ry zareo ka hataontsika sambo-belona. Dia hidirantsika ny tanàna.’”', 'niarina avy hatrany ny mpanjaka raha mbola alina ny andro, ka niteny tamin’ny mpanompony hoe: “hampahafantariko anareo izao ataon’ny syrianina amintsika izao: fantany tsara fa noana isika, ka nivoaka ny toby izy ireo mba hiafina any an-tsaha ary nanao hoe: ‘hivoaka ny tanàna ry zareo ka hataontsika sambo-belona. dia hidirantsika ny tanàna.’”'),
  ('6ab25a595c0fe955f15b6c04', '2026-09-22T10:37:13.480Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:13.480Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 7, 11, 'Dia niantsoantso avy hatrany ny mpiandry vavahady, ka nilaza izany tamin’izay tao an-tranon’ny mpanjaka.', 'dia niantsoantso avy hatrany ny mpiandry vavahady, ka nilaza izany tamin’izay tao an-tranon’ny mpanjaka.'),
  ('6ab25a595c0fe955f15b6bff', '2026-09-22T10:37:13.480Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:13.480Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 7, 6, 'Efa nataon’i Jehovah nandre feon’ny kalesin’ady sy feon-tsoavaly ary feon’ny tafika lehibe mantsy ny olona tao an-tobin’ny Syrianina, ka nifampiresaka hoe: “Nokaramain’ny mpanjakan’ny Israely hamely antsika ireo mpanjakan’ny Hetita sy ireo mpanjakan’i Ejipta!”', 'efa nataon’i jehovah nandre feon’ny kalesin’ady sy feon-tsoavaly ary feon’ny tafika lehibe mantsy ny olona tao an-tobin’ny syrianina, ka nifampiresaka hoe: “nokaramain’ny mpanjakan’ny israely hamely antsika ireo mpanjakan’ny hetita sy ireo mpanjakan’i ejipta!”'),
  ('6ab25a595c0fe955f15b6c08', '2026-09-22T10:37:13.480Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:13.480Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 7, 15, 'Dia lasa izy ireo nanaraka ny Syrianina hatrany amin’ny Reniranon’i Jordana. Ary hitany tokoa fa nameno ny lalana ny akanjo sy fitaovana narian’ny Syrianina, tamin’izy ireo nikoropaka nandositra. Dia niverina nilaza izany tamin’ny mpanjaka ireo iraka.', 'dia lasa izy ireo nanaraka ny syrianina hatrany amin’ny reniranon’i jordana. ary hitany tokoa fa nameno ny lalana ny akanjo sy fitaovana narian’ny syrianina, tamin’izy ireo nikoropaka nandositra. dia niverina nilaza izany tamin’ny mpanjaka ireo iraka.'),
  ('6ab25a595c0fe955f15b6bfb', '2026-09-22T10:37:13.480Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:13.480Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 7, 2, 'Dia niteny tamin’ilay lehilahin’Andriamanitra ny manamboninahitra lefitra nitehenan’ny mpanjaka, nanao hoe: “Izany ve dia ho tanteraka, na dia hanao vavahadin-drano eny amin’ny lanitra aza i Jehovah?” Ary hoy i Elisa: “Ho hitan’ny masonao izany, nefa tsy hihinana amin’izany ianao.”', 'dia niteny tamin’ilay lehilahin’andriamanitra ny manamboninahitra lefitra nitehenan’ny mpanjaka, nanao hoe: “izany ve dia ho tanteraka, na dia hanao vavahadin-drano eny amin’ny lanitra aza i jehovah?” ary hoy i elisa: “ho hitan’ny masonao izany, nefa tsy hihinana amin’izany ianao.”'),
  ('6ab25a595c0fe955f15b6c07', '2026-09-22T10:37:13.480Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:13.480Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 7, 14, 'Dia naka kalesy roa niaraka tamin’ny soavaly izy ireo, ka nirahin’ny mpanjaka hanara-dia an’ireo miaramila syrianina, ary nilazany hoe: “Mandehana, jereo.”', 'dia naka kalesy roa niaraka tamin’ny soavaly izy ireo, ka nirahin’ny mpanjaka hanara-dia an’ireo miaramila syrianina, ary nilazany hoe: “mandehana, jereo.”'),
  ('6ab25a595c0fe955f15b6bfe', '2026-09-22T10:37:13.480Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:13.480Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 7, 5, 'Dia nankany an-tobin’ny Syrianina izy ireo tamin’ny takariva maizimaizina. Ary tonga hatrany an-tsisin’ny tobin’ny Syrianina izy ireo, nefa tsy nisy olona mihitsy tao.', 'dia nankany an-tobin’ny syrianina izy ireo tamin’ny takariva maizimaizina. ary tonga hatrany an-tsisin’ny tobin’ny syrianina izy ireo, nefa tsy nisy olona mihitsy tao.'),
  ('6ab25a595c0fe955f15b6c0a', '2026-09-22T10:37:13.480Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:13.480Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 7, 17, 'Ary notendren’ny mpanjaka hiandraikitra ny vavahady ilay manamboninahitra lefitra nitehenany. Voahitsakitsaky ny olona teo am-bavahady anefa izy, ka maty. Izany no efa nolazain’ilay lehilahin’Andriamanitra, rehefa nidina tany aminy ny mpanjaka.', 'ary notendren’ny mpanjaka hiandraikitra ny vavahady ilay manamboninahitra lefitra nitehenany. voahitsakitsaky ny olona teo am-bavahady anefa izy, ka maty. izany no efa nolazain’ilay lehilahin’andriamanitra, rehefa nidina tany aminy ny mpanjaka.'),
  ('6ab25a595c0fe955f15b6bfa', '2026-09-22T10:37:13.480Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:13.480Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 7, 1, 'Dia hoy i Elisa: “Henoinareo ny tenin’i Jehovah. Izao no nolazain’i Jehovah: ‘Rahampitso, tokotokony ho amin’ny ora toy izao, dia ho sekely iray ny vidin’ny lafarinina tsara toto eran’ny seha, * ary ho sekely iray koa ny vidin’ny vary orza indroan’ny seha, eo am-bavahadin’i Samaria.”', 'dia hoy i elisa: “henoinareo ny tenin’i jehovah. izao no nolazain’i jehovah: ‘rahampitso, tokotokony ho amin’ny ora toy izao, dia ho sekely iray ny vidin’ny lafarinina tsara toto eran’ny seha, * ary ho sekely iray koa ny vidin’ny vary orza indroan’ny seha, eo am-bavahadin’i samaria.”'),
  ('6ab25a595c0fe955f15b6c0d', '2026-09-22T10:37:13.480Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:13.480Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 7, 20, 'Koa izany tokoa no nanjo azy, rehefa voahitsakitsaky ny olona teo am-bavahady izy, ka maty.', 'koa izany tokoa no nanjo azy, rehefa voahitsakitsaky ny olona teo am-bavahady izy, ka maty.'),
  ('6ab25a595c0fe955f15b6c0c', '2026-09-22T10:37:13.480Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:13.480Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 7, 19, 'Niteny tamin’ilay lehilahin’Andriamanitra anefa ilay manamboninahitra lefitra hoe: “Izany ve dia ho tanteraka, na dia hanao vavahadin-drano eny amin’ny lanitra aza i Jehovah?” Ary hoy i Elisa: “Ho hitan’ny masonao izany, nefa tsy hihinana amin’izany ianao.”', 'niteny tamin’ilay lehilahin’andriamanitra anefa ilay manamboninahitra lefitra hoe: “izany ve dia ho tanteraka, na dia hanao vavahadin-drano eny amin’ny lanitra aza i jehovah?” ary hoy i elisa: “ho hitan’ny masonao izany, nefa tsy hihinana amin’izany ianao.”'),
  ('6ab25a595c0fe955f15b6c03', '2026-09-22T10:37:13.480Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:13.480Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 7, 10, 'Koa nankany izy ireo, ary nantsoiny ny mpiandry vavahadin’ny tanàna ka nilazany hoe: “Nankao an-tobin’ny Syrianina izahay, ary tsy nisy olona na feon’olona tao, fa soavaly sy ampondra mifatotra ary tranolay nilaozana teo fotsiny.”', 'koa nankany izy ireo, ary nantsoiny ny mpiandry vavahadin’ny tanàna ka nilazany hoe: “nankao an-tobin’ny syrianina izahay, ary tsy nisy olona na feon’olona tao, fa soavaly sy ampondra mifatotra ary tranolay nilaozana teo fotsiny.”'),
  ('6ab25a595c0fe955f15b6c00', '2026-09-22T10:37:13.480Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:13.480Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 7, 7, 'Koa lasa nandositra avy hatrany izy ireo tamin’ilay takariva maizimaizina iny, ka nilaozany ny tranolainy sy ny soavaliny ary ny ampondrany, dia nilaozany fotsiny teo ny tobiny. Eny, lasa nandositra izy ireo mba hamonjy ny ainy. *', 'koa lasa nandositra avy hatrany izy ireo tamin’ilay takariva maizimaizina iny, ka nilaozany ny tranolainy sy ny soavaliny ary ny ampondrany, dia nilaozany fotsiny teo ny tobiny. eny, lasa nandositra izy ireo mba hamonjy ny ainy. *'),
  ('6ab25a595c0fe955f15b6bfc', '2026-09-22T10:37:13.480Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:13.480Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 7, 3, 'Ary nisy boka efa-dahy, sendra teo amin’ny fidirana amin’ny vavahady. Dia nifampiresaka izy ireo hoe: “Nahoana moa isika no hipetraka eto mandra-pahafatintsika?', 'ary nisy boka efa-dahy, sendra teo amin’ny fidirana amin’ny vavahady. dia nifampiresaka izy ireo hoe: “nahoana moa isika no hipetraka eto mandra-pahafatintsika?'),
  ('6ab25a595c0fe955f15b6bfd', '2026-09-22T10:37:13.480Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:13.480Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 7, 4, 'Raha manapa-kevitra isika hoe: ‘Andao hiditra ao an-tanàna’, dia ho faty ao isika satria misy mosary ao. Raha mipetraka eto kosa isika, dia ho faty ihany koa. Koa andao hiditra ao an-tobin’ny Syrianina, ka raha tsimbinin’izy ireo ny aintsika, dia ho velona isika. Fa raha vonoiny ho faty isika, dia ho faty.”', 'raha manapa-kevitra isika hoe: ‘andao hiditra ao an-tanàna’, dia ho faty ao isika satria misy mosary ao. raha mipetraka eto kosa isika, dia ho faty ihany koa. koa andao hiditra ao an-tobin’ny syrianina, ka raha tsimbinin’izy ireo ny aintsika, dia ho velona isika. fa raha vonoiny ho faty isika, dia ho faty.”'),
  ('6ab25a595c0fe955f15b6c02', '2026-09-22T10:37:13.480Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:13.480Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 7, 9, 'Farany, dia nifampiresaka izy ireo hoe: “Tsy mety izao ataontsika izao. Tokony holazaintsika amin’ny olona izao vaovao tsara izao! Hahita loza isika raha misalasala ka miandry mandra-pahazavan’ny andro. Koa andao hankany an-tanàna, mba hilaza an’izao any an-tranon’ny mpanjaka.”', 'farany, dia nifampiresaka izy ireo hoe: “tsy mety izao ataontsika izao. tokony holazaintsika amin’ny olona izao vaovao tsara izao! hahita loza isika raha misalasala ka miandry mandra-pahazavan’ny andro. koa andao hankany an-tanàna, mba hilaza an’izao any an-tranon’ny mpanjaka.”'),
  ('6ab25a595c0fe955f15b6c01', '2026-09-22T10:37:13.480Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:13.480Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 7, 8, 'Koa rehefa tonga hatrany an-tsisin’ny toby ireo boka, dia nankao amin’ny tranolay iray ka nihinana sy nisotro, ary naka volafotsy sy volamena ary akanjo tao, dia lasa nanafina an’ireny. Ary niverina indray izy ireo, dia nankao amin’ny tranolay hafa, ka naka zavatra tao, ary lasa nanafina an’ireny.', 'koa rehefa tonga hatrany an-tsisin’ny toby ireo boka, dia nankao amin’ny tranolay iray ka nihinana sy nisotro, ary naka volafotsy sy volamena ary akanjo tao, dia lasa nanafina an’ireny. ary niverina indray izy ireo, dia nankao amin’ny tranolay hafa, ka naka zavatra tao, ary lasa nanafina an’ireny.'),
  ('6ab25a5ac6777f8da321a6f5', '2026-09-22T10:37:14.023Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:14.023Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 8, 27, 'Ary nanao hoatran’izay nataon’ny ankohonan’i Ahaba izy, sady nanao izay ratsy teo imason’i Jehovah foana, toy ny nataon’ny ankohonan’i Ahaba. Havan’ny ankohonan’i Ahaba mantsy izy.', 'ary nanao hoatran’izay nataon’ny ankohonan’i ahaba izy, sady nanao izay ratsy teo imason’i jehovah foana, toy ny nataon’ny ankohonan’i ahaba. havan’ny ankohonan’i ahaba mantsy izy.'),
  ('6ab25a5ac6777f8da321a6f4', '2026-09-22T10:37:14.023Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:14.023Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 8, 26, 'Roa amby roapolo taona i Ahazia tamin’izy nanomboka nanjaka, ary herintaona no nanjakany tany Jerosalema. Ny anaran-dreniny dia Atalia, zafikelin’i Omry mpanjakan’ny Israely.', 'roa amby roapolo taona i ahazia tamin’izy nanomboka nanjaka, ary herintaona no nanjakany tany jerosalema. ny anaran-dreniny dia atalia, zafikelin’i omry mpanjakan’ny israely.'),
  ('6ab25a5ac6777f8da321a6e3', '2026-09-22T10:37:14.023Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:14.023Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 8, 9, 'Koa lasa nitsena an’i Elisa i Hazaela sady nitondra fanomezana nentin’ny rameva efapolo, dia ny karazan-java-tsoa rehetra nisy tany Damaskosy. Dia tonga izy ka nitsangana teo anatrehany, ary nanao hoe: “I Beni-hadada zanakao, mpanjakan’i Syria, no naniraka ahy ho atỳ aminao hanontany hoe: ‘Ho sitrana amin’izao aretina izao ve aho?’”', 'koa lasa nitsena an’i elisa i hazaela sady nitondra fanomezana nentin’ny rameva efapolo, dia ny karazan-java-tsoa rehetra nisy tany damaskosy. dia tonga izy ka nitsangana teo anatrehany, ary nanao hoe: “i beni-hadada zanakao, mpanjakan’i syria, no naniraka ahy ho atỳ aminao hanontany hoe: ‘ho sitrana amin’izao aretina izao ve aho?’”'),
  ('6ab25a5ac6777f8da321a6e1', '2026-09-22T10:37:14.023Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:14.023Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 8, 7, 'Dia nankany Damaskosy i Elisa. Ary narary i Beni-hadada mpanjakan’i Syria, ka nisy nilaza taminy hoe: “Tonga atỳ ilay lehilahin’Andriamanitra.”', 'dia nankany damaskosy i elisa. ary narary i beni-hadada mpanjakan’i syria, ka nisy nilaza taminy hoe: “tonga atỳ ilay lehilahin’andriamanitra.”'),
  ('6ab25a5ac6777f8da321a6ed', '2026-09-22T10:37:14.023Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:14.023Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 8, 19, 'Tsy tian’i Jehovah haringana anefa ny Joda, noho ny amin’i Davida mpanompony. Efa nampanantena azy mantsy izy hoe hanome jiro foana ho azy sy ny taranany.', 'tsy tian’i jehovah haringana anefa ny joda, noho ny amin’i davida mpanompony. efa nampanantena azy mantsy izy hoe hanome jiro foana ho azy sy ny taranany.'),
  ('6ab25a5ac6777f8da321a6eb', '2026-09-22T10:37:14.023Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:14.023Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 8, 17, 'Roa amby telopolo taona izy tamin’izy lasa mpanjaka, ary valo taona no nanjakany tany Jerosalema.', 'roa amby telopolo taona izy tamin’izy lasa mpanjaka, ary valo taona no nanjakany tany jerosalema.'),
  ('6ab25a5ac6777f8da321a6dd', '2026-09-22T10:37:14.023Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:14.023Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 8, 3, 'Rehefa tapitra ny fito taona, dia nody avy tany amin’ny tanin’ny Filistinina ravehivavy. Ary nandeha nitaraina tamin’ny mpanjaka izy mba hamerenana ny tranony sy ny taniny.', 'rehefa tapitra ny fito taona, dia nody avy tany amin’ny tanin’ny filistinina ravehivavy. ary nandeha nitaraina tamin’ny mpanjaka izy mba hamerenana ny tranony sy ny taniny.'),
  ('6ab25a5ac6777f8da321a6f3', '2026-09-22T10:37:14.023Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:14.023Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 8, 25, 'Ary tamin’ny taona faharoa ambin’ny folo nanjakan’i Jorama zanak’i Ahaba mpanjakan’ny Israely, no lasa mpanjaka i Ahazia zanak’i Jorama mpanjakan’ny Joda.', 'ary tamin’ny taona faharoa ambin’ny folo nanjakan’i jorama zanak’i ahaba mpanjakan’ny israely, no lasa mpanjaka i ahazia zanak’i jorama mpanjakan’ny joda.'),
  ('6ab25a5ac6777f8da321a6f0', '2026-09-22T10:37:14.023Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:14.023Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 8, 22, 'Mbola nikomy tsy ho eo ambany fahefan’ny Joda anefa i Edoma mandraka androany. Tamin’izany andro izany koa ny tanànan’i Libna no nanomboka nikomy.', 'mbola nikomy tsy ho eo ambany fahefan’ny joda anefa i edoma mandraka androany. tamin’izany andro izany koa ny tanànan’i libna no nanomboka nikomy.'),
  ('6ab25a5ac6777f8da321a6ea', '2026-09-22T10:37:14.023Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:14.023Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 8, 16, 'Tamin’ny taona fahadimy nanjakan’i Jorama zanak’i Ahaba mpanjakan’ny Israely, fony i Josafata no mpanjakan’ny Joda, dia lasa mpanjaka koa i Jorama zanak’i Josafata mpanjakan’ny Joda.', 'tamin’ny taona fahadimy nanjakan’i jorama zanak’i ahaba mpanjakan’ny israely, fony i josafata no mpanjakan’ny joda, dia lasa mpanjaka koa i jorama zanak’i josafata mpanjakan’ny joda.'),
  ('6ab25a5ac6777f8da321a6e6', '2026-09-22T10:37:14.023Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:14.023Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 8, 12, 'Koa hoy i Hazaela: “Nahoana ny tompoko no mitomany?” Dia hoy izy: “Satria fantatro tsara ny ratsy hataonao amin’ny zanak’Israely: Ny tanànany voaro mafy hodoranao, ny lehilahy voafantina eo aminy hovonoinao amin’ny sabatra, ny zanany hotorotoroinao, ary ny vehivavy bevohoka eo aminy hotatahinao ny kibony.”', 'koa hoy i hazaela: “nahoana ny tompoko no mitomany?” dia hoy izy: “satria fantatro tsara ny ratsy hataonao amin’ny zanak’israely: ny tanànany voaro mafy hodoranao, ny lehilahy voafantina eo aminy hovonoinao amin’ny sabatra, ny zanany hotorotoroinao, ary ny vehivavy bevohoka eo aminy hotatahinao ny kibony.”'),
  ('6ab25a5ac6777f8da321a6df', '2026-09-22T10:37:14.023Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:14.023Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 8, 5, 'Raha mbola teo am-pitantarana tamin’ny mpanjaka momba ny nameloman’i Elisa ny maty i Gehazy, dia iny fa tonga ilay vehivavy renin’ilay zaza novelomina indray, mba hitaraina amin’ny mpanjaka mba hamerenana ny tranony sy ny taniny. Avy hatrany dia hoy i Gehazy: “Io ilay vehivavy sy ilay zanany novelomin’i Elisa, ry mpanjaka tompoko ô!”', 'raha mbola teo am-pitantarana tamin’ny mpanjaka momba ny nameloman’i elisa ny maty i gehazy, dia iny fa tonga ilay vehivavy renin’ilay zaza novelomina indray, mba hitaraina amin’ny mpanjaka mba hamerenana ny tranony sy ny taniny. avy hatrany dia hoy i gehazy: “io ilay vehivavy sy ilay zanany novelomin’i elisa, ry mpanjaka tompoko ô!”'),
  ('6ab25a5ac6777f8da321a6f1', '2026-09-22T10:37:14.023Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:14.023Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 8, 23, 'Ary ny sisa amin’ny tantaran’i Jorama, mbamin’izay rehetra nataony, tsy efa voasoratra ao amin’ny boky mirakitra ny tantara tamin’ny andron’ireo mpanjakan’ny Joda ve izany?', 'ary ny sisa amin’ny tantaran’i jorama, mbamin’izay rehetra nataony, tsy efa voasoratra ao amin’ny boky mirakitra ny tantara tamin’ny andron’ireo mpanjakan’ny joda ve izany?'),
  ('6ab25a5ac6777f8da321a6e2', '2026-09-22T10:37:14.023Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:14.023Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 8, 8, 'Dia hoy ny mpanjaka tamin’i Hazaela: “Mitondrà fanomezana, ka mandehana mitsena an’ilay lehilahin’Andriamanitra. Ary manontania an’i Jehovah amin’ny alalany, ka ataovy hoe: ‘Ho sitrana amin’izao aretina izao ve aho?’”', 'dia hoy ny mpanjaka tamin’i hazaela: “mitondrà fanomezana, ka mandehana mitsena an’ilay lehilahin’andriamanitra. ary manontania an’i jehovah amin’ny alalany, ka ataovy hoe: ‘ho sitrana amin’izao aretina izao ve aho?’”'),
  ('6ab25a5ac6777f8da321a6ef', '2026-09-22T10:37:14.023Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:14.023Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 8, 21, 'Koa nankany Zaira i Jorama mbamin’ny kalesy rehetra. Ary nifoha izy tamin’ny alina, ka novonoiny ho faty ny Edomita, izay nanodidina azy sy nanodidina an’ireo lehiben’ny kalesy. Ary nandositra tany amin’ny tranolainy avy ny olona.', 'koa nankany zaira i jorama mbamin’ny kalesy rehetra. ary nifoha izy tamin’ny alina, ka novonoiny ho faty ny edomita, izay nanodidina azy sy nanodidina an’ireo lehiben’ny kalesy. ary nandositra tany amin’ny tranolainy avy ny olona.'),
  ('6ab25a5ac6777f8da321a6db', '2026-09-22T10:37:14.023Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:14.023Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 8, 1, 'Ary hoy i Elisa tamin’ilay vehivavy, renin’ilay zaza novelominy indray: “Mandehana ianao sy ny ankohonanao mivahiny any amin’izay azonao ivahiniana. Fa efa niantso mosary i Jehovah, ary ho tonga eto amin’ity tany ity izany ka haharitra fito taona.”', 'ary hoy i elisa tamin’ilay vehivavy, renin’ilay zaza novelominy indray: “mandehana ianao sy ny ankohonanao mivahiny any amin’izay azonao ivahiniana. fa efa niantso mosary i jehovah, ary ho tonga eto amin’ity tany ity izany ka haharitra fito taona.”'),
  ('6ab25a5ac6777f8da321a6f7', '2026-09-22T10:37:14.023Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:14.023Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 8, 29, 'Koa niverina tany Jezirela i Jorama Mpanjaka, mba hotsaboina noho ny ratra nataon’ny Syrianina taminy tany Rama, tamin’izy niady tamin’i Hazaela mpanjakan’i Syria. Ary nidina tany Jezirela i Ahazia zanak’i Jorama mpanjakan’ny Joda mba hamangy an’i Jorama zanak’i Ahaba, noho izy narary.', 'koa niverina tany jezirela i jorama mpanjaka, mba hotsaboina noho ny ratra nataon’ny syrianina taminy tany rama, tamin’izy niady tamin’i hazaela mpanjakan’i syria. ary nidina tany jezirela i ahazia zanak’i jorama mpanjakan’ny joda mba hamangy an’i jorama zanak’i ahaba, noho izy narary.'),
  ('6ab25a5ac6777f8da321a6f2', '2026-09-22T10:37:14.023Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:14.023Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 8, 24, 'Farany dia nodimandry any amin’ny razany i Jorama, ka nalevina any amin’ny razany, tao amin’ny Tanànan’i Davida. Ary i Ahazia zanany no nanjaka nandimby azy.', 'farany dia nodimandry any amin’ny razany i jorama, ka nalevina any amin’ny razany, tao amin’ny tanànan’i davida. ary i ahazia zanany no nanjaka nandimby azy.'),
  ('6ab25a5ac6777f8da321a6e9', '2026-09-22T10:37:14.023Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:14.023Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 8, 15, 'Ary ny ampitson’iny, dia nalain’i Hazaela ny lambam-pandriana ka natsobony tao anaty rano ary nosaronany tamin’iny ny tarehin’i Beni-hadada, ka maty izy. Ary i Hazaela no nanjaka nandimby azy.', 'ary ny ampitson’iny, dia nalain’i hazaela ny lambam-pandriana ka natsobony tao anaty rano ary nosaronany tamin’iny ny tarehin’i beni-hadada, ka maty izy. ary i hazaela no nanjaka nandimby azy.'),
  ('6ab25a5ac6777f8da321a6dc', '2026-09-22T10:37:14.023Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:14.023Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 8, 2, 'Dia nanao araka ny tenin’ilay lehilahin’Andriamanitra ravehivavy, ka lasa nivahiny fito taona tany amin’ny tanin’ny Filistinina izy sy ny ankohonany.', 'dia nanao araka ny tenin’ilay lehilahin’andriamanitra ravehivavy, ka lasa nivahiny fito taona tany amin’ny tanin’ny filistinina izy sy ny ankohonany.'),
  ('6ab25a5ac6777f8da321a6ec', '2026-09-22T10:37:14.023Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:14.023Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 8, 18, 'Nanao hoatran’izay nataon’ireo mpanjakan’ny Israely izy, dia tahaka ny nataon’ny ankohonan’i Ahaba, satria ny zanakavavin’i Ahaba no vadiny. Nanao izay ratsy teo imason’i Jehovah foana izy.', 'nanao hoatran’izay nataon’ireo mpanjakan’ny israely izy, dia tahaka ny nataon’ny ankohonan’i ahaba, satria ny zanakavavin’i ahaba no vadiny. nanao izay ratsy teo imason’i jehovah foana izy.'),
  ('6ab25a5ac6777f8da321a6e5', '2026-09-22T10:37:14.023Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:14.023Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 8, 11, 'Ary nibanjina an’i Hazaela i Elisa sady nandinika azy naharitra, ka sadaikatra izy. Dia nitomany ilay lehilahin’Andriamanitra.', 'ary nibanjina an’i hazaela i elisa sady nandinika azy naharitra, ka sadaikatra izy. dia nitomany ilay lehilahin’andriamanitra.'),
  ('6ab25a5ac6777f8da321a6f6', '2026-09-22T10:37:14.023Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:14.023Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 8, 28, 'Koa niaraka tamin’i Jorama zanak’i Ahaba izy, mba hiady tamin’i Hazaela mpanjakan’i Syria tany Ramota-gileada. Voan’ny Syrianina anefa i Jorama.', 'koa niaraka tamin’i jorama zanak’i ahaba izy, mba hiady tamin’i hazaela mpanjakan’i syria tany ramota-gileada. voan’ny syrianina anefa i jorama.'),
  ('6ab25a5ac6777f8da321a6de', '2026-09-22T10:37:14.023Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:14.023Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 8, 4, 'Niresaka tamin’i Gehazy mpanompon’ilay lehilahin’Andriamanitra ny mpanjaka tamin’izay. Hoy izy: “Mba tantarao amiko hoe, azafady, ny zavatra lehibe rehetra nataon’i Elisa.”', 'niresaka tamin’i gehazy mpanompon’ilay lehilahin’andriamanitra ny mpanjaka tamin’izay. hoy izy: “mba tantarao amiko hoe, azafady, ny zavatra lehibe rehetra nataon’i elisa.”'),
  ('6ab25a5ac6777f8da321a6e8', '2026-09-22T10:37:14.023Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:14.023Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 8, 14, 'Dia niala teo amin’i Elisa izy ka nankany amin’ny tompony. Ary hoy ny tompony taminy: “Inona no nolazain’i Elisa taminao?” Dia hoy ny navaliny: “Nilaza tamiko izy hoe: ‘Ho sitrana tokoa ianao.’”', 'dia niala teo amin’i elisa izy ka nankany amin’ny tompony. ary hoy ny tompony taminy: “inona no nolazain’i elisa taminao?” dia hoy ny navaliny: “nilaza tamiko izy hoe: ‘ho sitrana tokoa ianao.’”'),
  ('6ab25a5ac6777f8da321a6e4', '2026-09-22T10:37:14.023Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:14.023Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 8, 10, 'Dia hoy i Elisa taminy: “Mandehana, lazao aminy hoe: ‘Ho sitrana tokoa ianao.’ Efa nasehon’i Jehovah ahy anefa fa ho faty tokoa izy.”', 'dia hoy i elisa taminy: “mandehana, lazao aminy hoe: ‘ho sitrana tokoa ianao.’ efa nasehon’i jehovah ahy anefa fa ho faty tokoa izy.”'),
  ('6ab25a5ac6777f8da321a6e0', '2026-09-22T10:37:14.023Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:14.023Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 8, 6, 'Dia nanontanian’ny mpanjaka ravehivavy, ka nitantara taminy. Ary nanome azy tandapa anankiray ny mpanjaka, sady niteny hoe: “Avereno aminy daholo izay azy sy izay vokatra rehetra avy tamin’ny taniny, nanomboka tamin’ny andro nialany teto ka hatramin’izao.”', 'dia nanontanian’ny mpanjaka ravehivavy, ka nitantara taminy. ary nanome azy tandapa anankiray ny mpanjaka, sady niteny hoe: “avereno aminy daholo izay azy sy izay vokatra rehetra avy tamin’ny taniny, nanomboka tamin’ny andro nialany teto ka hatramin’izao.”'),
  ('6ab25a5ac6777f8da321a6ee', '2026-09-22T10:37:14.023Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:14.023Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 8, 20, 'Tamin’ny andron’i Jorama no nikomian’i Edoma tsy ho eo ambany fahefan’ny Joda, sy nananganany mpanjaka hitondra ny fireneny.', 'tamin’ny andron’i jorama no nikomian’i edoma tsy ho eo ambany fahefan’ny joda, sy nananganany mpanjaka hitondra ny fireneny.'),
  ('6ab25a5ac6777f8da321a6e7', '2026-09-22T10:37:14.023Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:14.023Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 8, 13, 'Hoy anefa i Hazaela: “Zinona moa izaho mpanomponao, izay toy ny alika ihany, no hahavita izany zavatra lehibe izany?” Dia hoy i Elisa: “Nasehon’i Jehovah tamiko fa ho lasa mpanjakan’i Syria ianao.”', 'hoy anefa i hazaela: “zinona moa izaho mpanomponao, izay toy ny alika ihany, no hahavita izany zavatra lehibe izany?” dia hoy i elisa: “nasehon’i jehovah tamiko fa ho lasa mpanjakan’i syria ianao.”'),
  ('6ab25a5be6f422360a773895', '2026-09-22T10:37:15.074Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:15.074Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 9, 34, 'Dia niditra tao an-trano i Jeho ka nihinana sy nisotro, ary niteny hoe: “Mba karakarao ilay voaozona iny, ary aleveno izy fa zanakavavin’ny mpanjaka.”', 'dia niditra tao an-trano i jeho ka nihinana sy nisotro, ary niteny hoe: “mba karakarao ilay voaozona iny, ary aleveno izy fa zanakavavin’ny mpanjaka.”'),
  ('6ab25a5be6f422360a77387e', '2026-09-22T10:37:15.074Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:15.074Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 9, 11, 'Ary nankeo amin’ireo mpanompon’ny tompony i Jeho. Dia hoy izy ireo taminy: “Fa misy inona? Inona no nitadiavan’iny adala iny anao?” Ary hoy izy: “Efa hainareo tsara iny lehilahy iny sy ny resany.”', 'ary nankeo amin’ireo mpanompon’ny tompony i jeho. dia hoy izy ireo taminy: “fa misy inona? inona no nitadiavan’iny adala iny anao?” ary hoy izy: “efa hainareo tsara iny lehilahy iny sy ny resany.”'),
  ('6ab25a5be6f422360a773892', '2026-09-22T10:37:15.074Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:15.074Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 9, 31, 'Ary niditra avy teny am-bavahady i Jeho. Dia hoy i Jezebela: “Inona moa no nanjo an’i Zimry, ilay namono ny tompony?”', 'ary niditra avy teny am-bavahady i jeho. dia hoy i jezebela: “inona moa no nanjo an’i zimry, ilay namono ny tompony?”'),
  ('6ab25a5be6f422360a773890', '2026-09-22T10:37:15.074Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:15.074Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 9, 29, 'Tamin’ny taona fahiraika ambin’ny folo nanjakan’i Jorama zanak’i Ahaba no lasa mpanjakan’ny Joda i Ahazia.', 'tamin’ny taona fahiraika ambin’ny folo nanjakan’i jorama zanak’i ahaba no lasa mpanjakan’ny joda i ahazia.'),
  ('6ab25a5be6f422360a77387b', '2026-09-22T10:37:15.074Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:15.074Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 9, 8, 'Dia aringano ny ankohonan’i Ahaba rehetra. Koa haringako tsy ho eo amin’i Ahaba ny lahy rehetra sy ny tsy misy mpiaro ary ny tsy misy ilana azy rehetra eo amin’ny Israely.', 'dia aringano ny ankohonan’i ahaba rehetra. koa haringako tsy ho eo amin’i ahaba ny lahy rehetra sy ny tsy misy mpiaro ary ny tsy misy ilana azy rehetra eo amin’ny israely.'),
  ('6ab25a5be6f422360a773876', '2026-09-22T10:37:15.074Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:15.074Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 9, 3, 'Dia raiso ilay tavoara fitoera-menaka, ka araraho eo amin’ny lohany ny menaka, ary milazà hoe: ‘Izao no nolazain’i Jehovah: “Hosorako ho mpanjakan’ny Israely ianao.”’ Dia sokafy ny varavarana, ka mandosira fa aza miandry.”', 'dia raiso ilay tavoara fitoera-menaka, ka araraho eo amin’ny lohany ny menaka, ary milazà hoe: ‘izao no nolazain’i jehovah: “hosorako ho mpanjakan’ny israely ianao.”’ dia sokafy ny varavarana, ka mandosira fa aza miandry.”'),
  ('6ab25a5be6f422360a773874', '2026-09-22T10:37:15.074Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:15.074Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 9, 1, 'Ary niantso ny iray tamin’ireo zanaky ny mpaminany i Elisa mpaminany, ka nilaza taminy hoe: “Misikìna, * ary ento ity tavoara kely fitoera-menaka ity, ka mandehana any Ramota-gileada.', 'ary niantso ny iray tamin’ireo zanaky ny mpaminany i elisa mpaminany, ka nilaza taminy hoe: “misikìna, * ary ento ity tavoara kely fitoera-menaka ity, ka mandehana any ramota-gileada.'),
  ('6ab25a5be6f422360a77387f', '2026-09-22T10:37:15.074Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:15.074Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 9, 12, 'Hoy anefa ireo: “Tsy marina izany! Mba lazao anay izay marina!” Dia hoy izy: “Izao sy izao no noresahiny tamiko: ‘Izao no nolazain’i Jehovah: “Hosorako ho mpanjakan’ny Israely ianao.”’”', 'hoy anefa ireo: “tsy marina izany! mba lazao anay izay marina!” dia hoy izy: “izao sy izao no noresahiny tamiko: ‘izao no nolazain’i jehovah: “hosorako ho mpanjakan’ny israely ianao.”’”'),
  ('6ab25a5be6f422360a773887', '2026-09-22T10:37:15.074Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:15.074Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 9, 20, 'Dia hoy ilay mpitily: “Tonga teny amin-dry zareo ilay iraka, nefa tsy niverina. Ary ny fitondran’ilay olona kalesy dia tahaka ny fitondran’i Jeho zafikelin’i Nimsy, satria miriotra mafy hoatran’ny adala izy.”', 'dia hoy ilay mpitily: “tonga teny amin-dry zareo ilay iraka, nefa tsy niverina. ary ny fitondran’ilay olona kalesy dia tahaka ny fitondran’i jeho zafikelin’i nimsy, satria miriotra mafy hoatran’ny adala izy.”'),
  ('6ab25a5be6f422360a773884', '2026-09-22T10:37:15.074Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:15.074Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 9, 17, 'Ary nijoro teny ambony tilikambo tany Jezirela ny mpitily, ka hitany nanatona i Jeho sy ny andian’olona niaraka taminy. Dia hoy izy: “Misy andian’olona hitako.” Ary hoy i Jorama: “Mandefasa mpitaingin-tsoavaly hitsena azy, ka hanontany hoe: ‘Fihavanana ve?’”', 'ary nijoro teny ambony tilikambo tany jezirela ny mpitily, ka hitany nanatona i jeho sy ny andian’olona niaraka taminy. dia hoy izy: “misy andian’olona hitako.” ary hoy i jorama: “mandefasa mpitaingin-tsoavaly hitsena azy, ka hanontany hoe: ‘fihavanana ve?’”'),
  ('6ab25a5be6f422360a773891', '2026-09-22T10:37:15.074Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:15.074Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 9, 30, 'Tonga tany Jezirela i Jeho tamin’ny farany, ka ren’i Jezebela izany. Dia nanao manjamaso mainty izy, sady nandravaka ny lohany, ka nitazana teo am-baravarankely.', 'tonga tany jezirela i jeho tamin’ny farany, ka ren’i jezebela izany. dia nanao manjamaso mainty izy, sady nandravaka ny lohany, ka nitazana teo am-baravarankely.'),
  ('6ab25a5be6f422360a773879', '2026-09-22T10:37:15.074Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:15.074Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 9, 6, 'Koa nitsangana i Jeho ka niditra tao an-trano. Ary nandraraka ny menaka teo amin’ny lohany ilay mpanompo, ka niteny hoe: “Izao no nolazain’i Jehovah Andriamanitry ny Israely: ‘Hosorako ho mpanjakan’ny vahoakan’i Jehovah ianao, eny, ho mpanjakan’ny Israely.', 'koa nitsangana i jeho ka niditra tao an-trano. ary nandraraka ny menaka teo amin’ny lohany ilay mpanompo, ka niteny hoe: “izao no nolazain’i jehovah andriamanitry ny israely: ‘hosorako ho mpanjakan’ny vahoakan’i jehovah ianao, eny, ho mpanjakan’ny israely.'),
  ('6ab25a5be6f422360a773896', '2026-09-22T10:37:15.074Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:15.074Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 9, 35, 'Rehefa handeha handevina azy anefa izy ireo, dia tsy nahita afa-tsy ny karandohany sy ny tongony ary ny felatanany.', 'rehefa handeha handevina azy anefa izy ireo, dia tsy nahita afa-tsy ny karandohany sy ny tongony ary ny felatanany.'),
  ('6ab25a5be6f422360a77388b', '2026-09-22T10:37:15.074Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:15.074Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 9, 24, 'Ary nandray tsipìka i Jeho, dia nitifitra an’i Jorama ka nahavoa azy teo anelanelan’ny sorony. Dia niboroaka avy teo amin’ny fony ilay zana-tsipìka, ka nianjera tao amin’ny kalesiny izy.', 'ary nandray tsipìka i jeho, dia nitifitra an’i jorama ka nahavoa azy teo anelanelan’ny sorony. dia niboroaka avy teo amin’ny fony ilay zana-tsipìka, ka nianjera tao amin’ny kalesiny izy.'),
  ('6ab25a5be6f422360a773885', '2026-09-22T10:37:15.074Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:15.074Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 9, 18, 'Koa nisy mpitaingin-tsoavaly lasa nitsena azy, ka nanontany hoe: “‘Fihavanana ve?’, hoy ny mpanjaka.” Hoy anefa i Jeho: “Ahoanao inona moa izay ‘fihavanana’? Mihodìna, ka mankanesa atsy aoriako!” Dia hoy ilay mpitily: “Tonga teny amin-dry zareo ilay iraka, nefa tsy niverina.”', 'koa nisy mpitaingin-tsoavaly lasa nitsena azy, ka nanontany hoe: “‘fihavanana ve?’, hoy ny mpanjaka.” hoy anefa i jeho: “ahoanao inona moa izay ‘fihavanana’? mihodìna, ka mankanesa atsy aoriako!” dia hoy ilay mpitily: “tonga teny amin-dry zareo ilay iraka, nefa tsy niverina.”'),
  ('6ab25a5be6f422360a773881', '2026-09-22T10:37:15.074Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:15.074Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 9, 14, 'Ary nanao tetika hanoherana an’i Jorama i Jeho zanak’i Josafata zanak’i Nimsy. Niambina tany Ramota-gileada i Jorama sy ny Israely rehetra tamin’izay, noho ny amin’i Hazaela mpanjakan’i Syria.', 'ary nanao tetika hanoherana an’i jorama i jeho zanak’i josafata zanak’i nimsy. niambina tany ramota-gileada i jorama sy ny israely rehetra tamin’izay, noho ny amin’i hazaela mpanjakan’i syria.'),
  ('6ab25a5be6f422360a77387d', '2026-09-22T10:37:15.074Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:15.074Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 9, 10, 'Ary hohanin’ny alika eo amin’ilay sombin-tany any Jezirela i Jezebela, ka tsy hisy handevina.’” Dia nanokatra ny varavarana izy, ka lasa nandositra.', 'ary hohanin’ny alika eo amin’ilay sombin-tany any jezirela i jezebela, ka tsy hisy handevina.’” dia nanokatra ny varavarana izy, ka lasa nandositra.'),
  ('6ab25a5be6f422360a773893', '2026-09-22T10:37:15.074Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:15.074Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 9, 32, 'Ary niandrandra nijery tany amin’ilay varavarankely i Jeho, ary nilaza hoe: “Iza no momba ahy? Iza?” Avy hatrany dia nisy tandapa roa na telo niondrika nijery azy.', 'ary niandrandra nijery tany amin’ilay varavarankely i jeho, ary nilaza hoe: “iza no momba ahy? iza?” avy hatrany dia nisy tandapa roa na telo niondrika nijery azy.'),
  ('6ab25a5be6f422360a77388e', '2026-09-22T10:37:15.074Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:15.074Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 9, 27, 'Ary nahita izany i Ahazia mpanjakan’ny Joda, ka nandositra nanaraka ny lalana teo akaikin’ny zaridaina lehibe iray. Taorian’izay, dia nenjehin’i Jeho izy, ary hoy i Jeho: “Iny koa! Asio koa iny!” Dia nasian’izy ireo tao anaty kalesiny izy, teny an-dalana hiakatra tany Gora, any akaikin’i Ibleama. Mbola nandositra hatrany Megido ihany anefa izy, ka maty tany.', 'ary nahita izany i ahazia mpanjakan’ny joda, ka nandositra nanaraka ny lalana teo akaikin’ny zaridaina lehibe iray. taorian’izay, dia nenjehin’i jeho izy, ary hoy i jeho: “iny koa! asio koa iny!” dia nasian’izy ireo tao anaty kalesiny izy, teny an-dalana hiakatra tany gora, any akaikin’i ibleama. mbola nandositra hatrany megido ihany anefa izy, ka maty tany.'),
  ('6ab25a5be6f422360a77388d', '2026-09-22T10:37:15.074Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:15.074Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 9, 26, '‘“Hitako ny ran’i Nabota sy ny ran’ny zanany lahy omaly”, hoy i Jehovah, “ka eto amin’ity sombin-tany ity no hampiharako aminao ny famaliana”, hoy i Jehovah.’ Koa batao izy, ka atsipazo eo amin’ilay sombin-tany, araka ny tenin’i Jehovah.”', '‘“hitako ny ran’i nabota sy ny ran’ny zanany lahy omaly”, hoy i jehovah, “ka eto amin’ity sombin-tany ity no hampiharako aminao ny famaliana”, hoy i jehovah.’ koa batao izy, ka atsipazo eo amin’ilay sombin-tany, araka ny tenin’i jehovah.”'),
  ('6ab25a5be6f422360a77388a', '2026-09-22T10:37:15.074Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:15.074Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 9, 23, 'Avy hatrany i Jorama dia nanodina ny kalesiny mba handositra, sady niteny tamin’i Ahazia hoe: “Voafitaka isika, ry Ahazia!”', 'avy hatrany i jorama dia nanodina ny kalesiny mba handositra, sady niteny tamin’i ahazia hoe: “voafitaka isika, ry ahazia!”'),
  ('6ab25a5be6f422360a773886', '2026-09-22T10:37:15.074Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:15.074Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 9, 19, 'Koa nandefa mpitaingin-tsoavaly hafa indray i Jorama. Hoy izy io, rehefa tonga teo amin’izy ireo: “‘Fihavanana ve?’, hoy ny mpanjaka.” Hoy anefa i Jeho: “Ahoanao inona moa izay ‘fihavanana’? Mihodìna, ka mankanesa atsy aoriako!”', 'koa nandefa mpitaingin-tsoavaly hafa indray i jorama. hoy izy io, rehefa tonga teo amin’izy ireo: “‘fihavanana ve?’, hoy ny mpanjaka.” hoy anefa i jeho: “ahoanao inona moa izay ‘fihavanana’? mihodìna, ka mankanesa atsy aoriako!”'),
  ('6ab25a5be6f422360a773889', '2026-09-22T10:37:15.074Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:15.074Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 9, 22, 'Raha vao nahita an’i Jeho i Jorama, dia nilaza hoe: “Fihavanana ve, ry Jeho?” Hoy anefa izy: “Ahoana no hisian’ny fihavanana raha mbola mijangajanga sy fatra-pilalao ody i Jezebela reninao?”', 'raha vao nahita an’i jeho i jorama, dia nilaza hoe: “fihavanana ve, ry jeho?” hoy anefa izy: “ahoana no hisian’ny fihavanana raha mbola mijangajanga sy fatra-pilalao ody i jezebela reninao?”'),
  ('6ab25a5be6f422360a77387a', '2026-09-22T10:37:15.074Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:15.074Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 9, 7, 'Ary vonoy ho faty ny ankohonan’i Ahaba tomponao, fa hovaliako ny ran’ireo mpaminany mpanompoko sy ny ran’ny mpanompon’i Jehovah rehetra nalatsak’i Jezebela.', 'ary vonoy ho faty ny ankohonan’i ahaba tomponao, fa hovaliako ny ran’ireo mpaminany mpanompoko sy ny ran’ny mpanompon’i jehovah rehetra nalatsak’i jezebela.'),
  ('6ab25a5be6f422360a773888', '2026-09-22T10:37:15.074Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:15.074Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 9, 21, 'Koa hoy i Jorama: “Omano ny kalesin’ady!” Dia natao izany, ka lasa i Jorama mpanjakan’ny Israely sy Ahazia mpanjakan’ny Joda, samy nandeha tamin’ny kalesiny avy. Rehefa teny an-dalana hitsena an’i Jeho izy ireo, dia nifanena taminy teo amin’ny sombin-tanin’i Nabota Jezirelita.', 'koa hoy i jorama: “omano ny kalesin’ady!” dia natao izany, ka lasa i jorama mpanjakan’ny israely sy ahazia mpanjakan’ny joda, samy nandeha tamin’ny kalesiny avy. rehefa teny an-dalana hitsena an’i jeho izy ireo, dia nifanena taminy teo amin’ny sombin-tanin’i nabota jezirelita.'),
  ('6ab25a5be6f422360a773883', '2026-09-22T10:37:15.074Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:15.074Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 9, 16, 'Ary nitaingina ny kalesiny i Jeho ka nankany Jezirela. Tany i Jorama tamin’izay, ary teo am-pandriana izy noho ny ratrany. Ary nidina mba hamangy azy i Ahazia mpanjakan’ny Joda.', 'ary nitaingina ny kalesiny i jeho ka nankany jezirela. tany i jorama tamin’izay, ary teo am-pandriana izy noho ny ratrany. ary nidina mba hamangy azy i ahazia mpanjakan’ny joda.'),
  ('6ab25a5be6f422360a773882', '2026-09-22T10:37:15.074Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:15.074Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 9, 15, 'Tatỳ aoriana dia niverina tany Jezirela i Jorama Mpanjaka, mba hotsaboina noho ny ratra nataon’ny Syrianina taminy, tamin’izy niady tamin’i Hazaela mpanjakan’i Syria. Ary hoy i Jeho: “Raha manaiky ianareo, dia aza avela hisy olona hiala avy eto an-tanàna, mba hanao tatitra any Jezirela.”', 'tatỳ aoriana dia niverina tany jezirela i jorama mpanjaka, mba hotsaboina noho ny ratra nataon’ny syrianina taminy, tamin’izy niady tamin’i hazaela mpanjakan’i syria. ary hoy i jeho: “raha manaiky ianareo, dia aza avela hisy olona hiala avy eto an-tanàna, mba hanao tatitra any jezirela.”'),
  ('6ab25a5be6f422360a773880', '2026-09-22T10:37:15.074Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:15.074Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 9, 13, 'Dia samy nanala ny fitafiany haingana izy ireo ka nametraka izany teo ambanin’i Jeho, teo amin’ireo zanatohatra. Ary nitsoka anjombona izy ireo, ka nilaza hoe: “Lasa mpanjaka i Jeho!”', 'dia samy nanala ny fitafiany haingana izy ireo ka nametraka izany teo ambanin’i jeho, teo amin’ireo zanatohatra. ary nitsoka anjombona izy ireo, ka nilaza hoe: “lasa mpanjaka i jeho!”'),
  ('6ab25a5be6f422360a773894', '2026-09-22T10:37:15.074Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:15.074Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 9, 33, 'Ary hoy i Jeho: “Azerao izy!” Dia nazeran’izy ireo i Jezebela, ka nipitipitika tamin’ny rindrina sy tamin’ny soavaly ny rany. Ary nohitsahin’i Jeho izy.', 'ary hoy i jeho: “azerao izy!” dia nazeran’izy ireo i jezebela, ka nipitipitika tamin’ny rindrina sy tamin’ny soavaly ny rany. ary nohitsahin’i jeho izy.'),
  ('6ab25a5be6f422360a77388f', '2026-09-22T10:37:15.074Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:15.074Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 9, 28, 'Dia nentin’ny mpanompony tamin’ny kalesy ho any Jerosalema izy, ka naleviny any amin’ny razany tao am-pasany, tao amin’ny Tanànan’i Davida.', 'dia nentin’ny mpanompony tamin’ny kalesy ho any jerosalema izy, ka naleviny any amin’ny razany tao am-pasany, tao amin’ny tanànan’i davida.'),
  ('6ab25a5be6f422360a77387c', '2026-09-22T10:37:15.074Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:15.074Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 9, 9, 'Ary ny ankohonan’i Ahaba dia hataoko toy ny ankohonan’i Jeroboama zanak’i Nebata, sy ny ankohonan’i Basa zanak’i Ahia.', 'ary ny ankohonan’i ahaba dia hataoko toy ny ankohonan’i jeroboama zanak’i nebata, sy ny ankohonan’i basa zanak’i ahia.'),
  ('6ab25a5be6f422360a773878', '2026-09-22T10:37:15.074Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:15.074Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 9, 5, 'Rehefa tonga tany izy, dia hitany nipetrapetraka ireo lehiben’ny tafika. Ary hoy izy: “Misy teny holazaiko aminao, sefo ô!” Dia hoy i Jeho: “Amin’iza aminay ireto?” Ary hoy izy: “Aminao, sefo ô!”', 'rehefa tonga tany izy, dia hitany nipetrapetraka ireo lehiben’ny tafika. ary hoy izy: “misy teny holazaiko aminao, sefo ô!” dia hoy i jeho: “amin’iza aminay ireto?” ary hoy izy: “aminao, sefo ô!”'),
  ('6ab25a5be6f422360a77388c', '2026-09-22T10:37:15.074Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:15.074Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 9, 25, 'Ary hoy i Jeho tamin’i Bidkara, manamboninahitra lefiny: “Batao izy, ary atsipazo eo amin’ny sombin-tanin’i Nabota Jezirelita. Tadidio fa tamin’izaho sy ianao samy nitaingina kalesy iny, fony isika nanaraka an’i Ahaba rainy, dia nilaza izao fanamelohana azy izao i Jehovah:', 'ary hoy i jeho tamin’i bidkara, manamboninahitra lefiny: “batao izy, ary atsipazo eo amin’ny sombin-tanin’i nabota jezirelita. tadidio fa tamin’izaho sy ianao samy nitaingina kalesy iny, fony isika nanaraka an’i ahaba rainy, dia nilaza izao fanamelohana azy izao i jehovah:'),
  ('6ab25a5be6f422360a773875', '2026-09-22T10:37:15.074Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:15.074Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 9, 2, 'Rehefa tonga any ianao, dia tadiavo i Jeho zanak’i Josafata zanak’i Nimsy. Ary midira, ka antsoy avy eo amin’ireo rahalahiny izy, ary ento ho ao amin’ny efitra anatiny indrindra.', 'rehefa tonga any ianao, dia tadiavo i jeho zanak’i josafata zanak’i nimsy. ary midira, ka antsoy avy eo amin’ireo rahalahiny izy, ary ento ho ao amin’ny efitra anatiny indrindra.'),
  ('6ab25a5be6f422360a773877', '2026-09-22T10:37:15.074Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:15.074Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 9, 4, 'Koa nankany Ramota-gileada ny mpanompon’ilay mpaminany.', 'koa nankany ramota-gileada ny mpanompon’ilay mpaminany.'),
  ('6ab25a5be6f422360a773898', '2026-09-22T10:37:15.075Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:15.075Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 9, 37, 'Ary ho zezika eny an-tsaha, ao amin’ilay sombin-tany eto Jezirela ny fatin’i Jezebela, mba tsy hisy ho afaka hilaza hoe: “I Jezebela io.”’”', 'ary ho zezika eny an-tsaha, ao amin’ilay sombin-tany eto jezirela ny fatin’i jezebela, mba tsy hisy ho afaka hilaza hoe: “i jezebela io.”’”'),
  ('6ab25a5be6f422360a773897', '2026-09-22T10:37:15.075Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:15.075Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 9, 36, 'Rehefa niverina nilaza izany tamin’i Jeho izy ireo, dia hoy izy: “Izao no teny nolazain’i Jehovah tamin’ny alalan’i Elia Tisbita mpanompony: ‘Ao amin’ilay sombin-tany eto Jezirela no hihinanan’ny alika ny nofon’i Jezebela.', 'rehefa niverina nilaza izany tamin’i jeho izy ireo, dia hoy izy: “izao no teny nolazain’i jehovah tamin’ny alalan’i elia tisbita mpanompony: ‘ao amin’ilay sombin-tany eto jezirela no hihinanan’ny alika ny nofon’i jezebela.'),
  ('6ab25a5bba2620b3e0ddaa9a', '2026-09-22T10:37:15.811Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:15.811Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 10, 32, 'Nanomboka nampisaratsaraka ny Israely i Jehovah, tamin’izany andro izany. Ary namely azy ireo foana i Hazaela, tany amin’ny faritra rehetran’ny Israely,', 'nanomboka nampisaratsaraka ny israely i jehovah, tamin’izany andro izany. ary namely azy ireo foana i hazaela, tany amin’ny faritra rehetran’ny israely,'),
  ('6ab25a5bba2620b3e0ddaa99', '2026-09-22T10:37:15.811Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:15.811Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 10, 31, 'Tsy nanaraka tsara ny lalàn’i Jehovah Andriamanitry ny Israely tamin’ny fony manontolo anefa i Jeho. Tsy niala tamin’ny fahotan’i Jeroboama, izay nampanotany ny Israely, mantsy izy.', 'tsy nanaraka tsara ny lalàn’i jehovah andriamanitry ny israely tamin’ny fony manontolo anefa i jeho. tsy niala tamin’ny fahotan’i jeroboama, izay nampanotany ny israely, mantsy izy.'),
  ('6ab25a5bba2620b3e0ddaa89', '2026-09-22T10:37:15.811Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:15.811Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 10, 15, 'Rehefa niala teo izy, dia nifanena tamin’i Jonadaba zanak’i Rekaba, izay tamy hitsena azy. Dia niarahaba an’i Jonadaba izy, ka niteny taminy hoe: “Mahitsy amiko ve ny fonao, tahaka ny foko amin’ny fonao?” Ary hoy i Jonadaba: “Eny!” “Atolory ahy àry ny tananao.” Dia natolony azy ny tanany. Ary nosintonin’i Jeho hiakatra tao amin’ny kalesiny niaraka taminy izy.', 'rehefa niala teo izy, dia nifanena tamin’i jonadaba zanak’i rekaba, izay tamy hitsena azy. dia niarahaba an’i jonadaba izy, ka niteny taminy hoe: “mahitsy amiko ve ny fonao, tahaka ny foko amin’ny fonao?” ary hoy i jonadaba: “eny!” “atolory ahy àry ny tananao.” dia natolony azy ny tanany. ary nosintonin’i jeho hiakatra tao amin’ny kalesiny niaraka taminy izy.'),
  ('6ab25a5bba2620b3e0ddaa88', '2026-09-22T10:37:15.811Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:15.811Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 10, 14, 'Koa niteny avy hatrany i Jeho hoe: “Ataovy sambo-belona ireo!” Dia nataony sambo-belona izy roa amby efapolo lahy, ka novonoiny teo amin’ny lavaka fanangonan-drano teo amin’ilay trano fanetezana ondry, ary tsy nasiany niangana na iray aza.', 'koa niteny avy hatrany i jeho hoe: “ataovy sambo-belona ireo!” dia nataony sambo-belona izy roa amby efapolo lahy, ka novonoiny teo amin’ny lavaka fanangonan-drano teo amin’ilay trano fanetezana ondry, ary tsy nasiany niangana na iray aza.'),
  ('6ab25a5bba2620b3e0ddaa7f', '2026-09-22T10:37:15.811Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:15.811Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 10, 5, 'Dia nandefa iraka ho any amin’i Jeho ny mpiandraikitra ny trano, sy ny mpiandraikitra ny tanàna, sy ny anti-panahy rehetra, ary ny mpikarakara rehetra, ka nanao hoe: “Mpanomponao izahay, ka hataonay izay rehetra lazainao aminay. Tsy hanendry na iza na iza ho mpanjaka izahay, fa ataovy izay hitanao fa mety.”', 'dia nandefa iraka ho any amin’i jeho ny mpiandraikitra ny trano, sy ny mpiandraikitra ny tanàna, sy ny anti-panahy rehetra, ary ny mpikarakara rehetra, ka nanao hoe: “mpanomponao izahay, ka hataonay izay rehetra lazainao aminay. tsy hanendry na iza na iza ho mpanjaka izahay, fa ataovy izay hitanao fa mety.”'),
  ('6ab25a5bba2620b3e0ddaa95', '2026-09-22T10:37:15.811Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:15.811Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 10, 27, 'Noravany koa ny tsangambato masin’i Bala. Ary narodany ny tranon’i Bala ka nataony kabine mandraka androany.', 'noravany koa ny tsangambato masin’i bala. ary narodany ny tranon’i bala ka nataony kabine mandraka androany.'),
  ('6ab25a5bba2620b3e0ddaa96', '2026-09-22T10:37:15.811Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:15.811Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 10, 28, 'Toy izany no namongoran’i Jeho an’i Bala tsy ho eo amin’ny Israely.', 'toy izany no namongoran’i jeho an’i bala tsy ho eo amin’ny israely.'),
  ('6ab25a5bba2620b3e0ddaa83', '2026-09-22T10:37:15.811Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:15.811Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 10, 9, 'Ary nankeny ivelany izy nony maraina, ka nijoro teo anatrehan’ny olona rehetra ary nilaza hoe: “Olo-marina ianareo, fa izaho kosa no nanao tetika hamelezana ny tompoko sy namono azy ho faty. Iza anefa no namono an’ireto rehetra ireto?', 'ary nankeny ivelany izy nony maraina, ka nijoro teo anatrehan’ny olona rehetra ary nilaza hoe: “olo-marina ianareo, fa izaho kosa no nanao tetika hamelezana ny tompoko sy namono azy ho faty. iza anefa no namono an’ireto rehetra ireto?'),
  ('6ab25a5bba2620b3e0ddaa8b', '2026-09-22T10:37:15.811Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:15.811Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 10, 17, 'Tonga tany Samaria i Jeho tamin’ny farany. Dia novonoiny ny sisa rehetra tamin’ny ankohonan’i Ahaba tany Samaria, mandra-pandringany azy tanteraka, araka ny tenin’i Jehovah tamin’i Elia.', 'tonga tany samaria i jeho tamin’ny farany. dia novonoiny ny sisa rehetra tamin’ny ankohonan’i ahaba tany samaria, mandra-pandringany azy tanteraka, araka ny tenin’i jehovah tamin’i elia.'),
  ('6ab25a5bba2620b3e0ddaa7c', '2026-09-22T10:37:15.811Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:15.811Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 10, 2, '“Eo aminareo ny zanakalahin’ny tomponareo sy ny kalesin’ady sy ny soavaly sy ny tanàna voaro mafy ary ny fiadiana. Koa raha vao tonga any aminareo ity taratasy ity,', '“eo aminareo ny zanakalahin’ny tomponareo sy ny kalesin’ady sy ny soavaly sy ny tanàna voaro mafy ary ny fiadiana. koa raha vao tonga any aminareo ity taratasy ity,'),
  ('6ab25a5bba2620b3e0ddaa9b', '2026-09-22T10:37:15.811Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:15.811Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 10, 33, 'dia ny faritra nanomboka teo amin’ny Reniranon’i Jordana tandrifin’ny fiposahan’ny masoandro, nanerana an’i Gileada, sy ny tanin’ny Gadita sy ny Robenita ary ny Manasita, sy ny faritra nanomboka tany Aroera, any akaikin’ny lohasaha falehan-driakan’i Arnona, izany hoe i Gileada sy Basana.', 'dia ny faritra nanomboka teo amin’ny reniranon’i jordana tandrifin’ny fiposahan’ny masoandro, nanerana an’i gileada, sy ny tanin’ny gadita sy ny robenita ary ny manasita, sy ny faritra nanomboka tany aroera, any akaikin’ny lohasaha falehan-driakan’i arnona, izany hoe i gileada sy basana.'),
  ('6ab25a5bba2620b3e0ddaa85', '2026-09-22T10:37:15.811Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:15.811Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 10, 11, 'Dia novonoin’i Jeho koa ny sisa rehetra tamin’ny ankohonan’i Ahaba tao Jezirela, mbamin’ny olo-manan-kajany rehetra sy ny namany ary ny mpisorony, ka tsy nasiany niangana na iray aza.', 'dia novonoin’i jeho koa ny sisa rehetra tamin’ny ankohonan’i ahaba tao jezirela, mbamin’ny olo-manan-kajany rehetra sy ny namany ary ny mpisorony, ka tsy nasiany niangana na iray aza.'),
  ('6ab25a5bba2620b3e0ddaa82', '2026-09-22T10:37:15.811Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:15.811Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 10, 8, 'Dia nankao amin’i Jeho ny iraka ka nilaza hoe: “Nentin-dry zareo ao ny lohan’ireo zanaky ny mpanjaka.” Koa hoy izy: “Ataovy antontany roa eo amin’ny fidirana amin’ny vavahady izany, mandra-paharainan’ny andro.”', 'dia nankao amin’i jeho ny iraka ka nilaza hoe: “nentin-dry zareo ao ny lohan’ireo zanaky ny mpanjaka.” koa hoy izy: “ataovy antontany roa eo amin’ny fidirana amin’ny vavahady izany, mandra-paharainan’ny andro.”'),
  ('6ab25a5bba2620b3e0ddaa80', '2026-09-22T10:37:15.811Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:15.811Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 10, 6, 'Dia nanoratra taratasy ho azy ireo indray i Jeho, nanao hoe: “Raha ahy ianareo, ary ny teniko no ankatoavinareo, dia tapaho ny lohan’ireo zanakalahin’ny tomponareo, ary tongava atỳ amiko atỳ Jezirela, rahampitso toy izao.” Niaraka tamin’ireo olo-manan-kaja teo an-tanàna izay nitaiza azy mantsy izy fitopolo lahy zanaky ny mpanjaka.', 'dia nanoratra taratasy ho azy ireo indray i jeho, nanao hoe: “raha ahy ianareo, ary ny teniko no ankatoavinareo, dia tapaho ny lohan’ireo zanakalahin’ny tomponareo, ary tongava atỳ amiko atỳ jezirela, rahampitso toy izao.” niaraka tamin’ireo olo-manan-kaja teo an-tanàna izay nitaiza azy mantsy izy fitopolo lahy zanaky ny mpanjaka.'),
  ('6ab25a5bba2620b3e0ddaa92', '2026-09-22T10:37:15.811Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:15.811Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 10, 24, 'Farany dia niditra izy ireo mba hanao sorona sy fanatitra dorana. Ary nisy valopolo lahy napetrak’i Jeho mba hiandry tany ivelany, ka nilazany hoe: “Raha misy tafatsoaka ireo lehilahy natolotro eo an-tananareo ireo, dia ny ain’ny iray aminareo no ho solon’ny ainy.”', 'farany dia niditra izy ireo mba hanao sorona sy fanatitra dorana. ary nisy valopolo lahy napetrak’i jeho mba hiandry tany ivelany, ka nilazany hoe: “raha misy tafatsoaka ireo lehilahy natolotro eo an-tananareo ireo, dia ny ain’ny iray aminareo no ho solon’ny ainy.”'),
  ('6ab25a5bba2620b3e0ddaa84', '2026-09-22T10:37:15.811Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:15.811Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 10, 10, 'Fantaro àry fa tsy hisy ho raraka an-tany ny tenin’i Jehovah izay nolazain’i Jehovah hanamelohana ny ankohonan’i Ahaba, fa i Jehovah mihitsy no efa nanatanteraka izay nolazainy tamin’ny alalan’i Elia mpanompony.”', 'fantaro àry fa tsy hisy ho raraka an-tany ny tenin’i jehovah izay nolazain’i jehovah hanamelohana ny ankohonan’i ahaba, fa i jehovah mihitsy no efa nanatanteraka izay nolazainy tamin’ny alalan’i elia mpanompony.”'),
  ('6ab25a5bba2620b3e0ddaa94', '2026-09-22T10:37:15.811Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:15.811Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 10, 26, 'Avy eo dia navoakan’izy ireo ny tsato-kazo masina tao an-tranon’i Bala, ka nodorany tsirairay.', 'avy eo dia navoakan’izy ireo ny tsato-kazo masina tao an-tranon’i bala, ka nodorany tsirairay.'),
  ('6ab25a5bba2620b3e0ddaa7d', '2026-09-22T10:37:15.811Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:15.811Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 10, 3, 'dia jereo izay tsara sy mendrika indrindra amin’ny zanakalahin’ny tomponareo, ka apetraho eo amin’ny seza fiandrianan-drainy. Dia miadia ho an’ny ankohonan’ny tomponareo.”', 'dia jereo izay tsara sy mendrika indrindra amin’ny zanakalahin’ny tomponareo, ka apetraho eo amin’ny seza fiandrianan-drainy. dia miadia ho an’ny ankohonan’ny tomponareo.”'),
  ('6ab25a5bba2620b3e0ddaa7b', '2026-09-22T10:37:15.811Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:15.811Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 10, 1, 'Ary nanan-janakalahy fitopolo tany Samaria i Ahaba. Nanoratra taratasy àry i Jeho, ka nandefa izany tany Samaria, ho an’ireo andrianan’i Jezirela sy ny anti-panahy ary ny mpikarakara ny zanak’i Ahaba, nanao hoe:', 'ary nanan-janakalahy fitopolo tany samaria i ahaba. nanoratra taratasy àry i jeho, ka nandefa izany tany samaria, ho an’ireo andrianan’i jezirela sy ny anti-panahy ary ny mpikarakara ny zanak’i ahaba, nanao hoe:'),
  ('6ab25a5bba2620b3e0ddaa8c', '2026-09-22T10:37:15.811Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:15.811Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 10, 18, 'Novorin’i Jeho koa ny olona rehetra, ka hoy izy: “Kely ihany no nanompoan’i Ahaba an’i Bala, fa i Jeho kosa hanompo azy fatratra.', 'novorin’i jeho koa ny olona rehetra, ka hoy izy: “kely ihany no nanompoan’i ahaba an’i bala, fa i jeho kosa hanompo azy fatratra.'),
  ('6ab25a5bba2620b3e0ddaa87', '2026-09-22T10:37:15.811Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:15.811Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 10, 13, 'Ary nifanena tamin’ireo rahalahin’i Ahazia mpanjakan’ny Joda i Jeho, ka nanontany hoe: “Iza moa ianareo?” Dia hoy ireo: “Rahalahin’i Ahazia izahay, ary handeha hanontany hoe manahoana ireo zanaky ny mpanjaka sy ny zanaky ny andriambavy.”', 'ary nifanena tamin’ireo rahalahin’i ahazia mpanjakan’ny joda i jeho, ka nanontany hoe: “iza moa ianareo?” dia hoy ireo: “rahalahin’i ahazia izahay, ary handeha hanontany hoe manahoana ireo zanaky ny mpanjaka sy ny zanaky ny andriambavy.”'),
  ('6ab25a5bba2620b3e0ddaa7e', '2026-09-22T10:37:15.811Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:15.811Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 10, 4, 'Koa natahotra be izy ireo, ka niteny hoe: “Mpanjaka roa aza tsy nahatohitra azy, ka ataontsika ahoana no hahatohitra azy?”', 'koa natahotra be izy ireo, ka niteny hoe: “mpanjaka roa aza tsy nahatohitra azy, ka ataontsika ahoana no hahatohitra azy?”'),
  ('6ab25a5bba2620b3e0ddaa9c', '2026-09-22T10:37:15.811Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:15.811Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 10, 34, 'Ary ny sisa amin’ny tantaran’i Jeho, mbamin’izay rehetra nataony sy ny heriny rehetra, tsy efa voasoratra ao amin’ny boky mirakitra ny tantara tamin’ny andron’ireo mpanjakan’ny Israely ve izany?', 'ary ny sisa amin’ny tantaran’i jeho, mbamin’izay rehetra nataony sy ny heriny rehetra, tsy efa voasoratra ao amin’ny boky mirakitra ny tantara tamin’ny andron’ireo mpanjakan’ny israely ve izany?'),
  ('6ab25a5bba2620b3e0ddaa8e', '2026-09-22T10:37:15.811Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:15.811Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 10, 20, 'Hoy koa i Jeho: “Ambarao fa hisy fivoriambe manetriketrika ho an’i Bala!” Dia nambaran’izy ireo izany.', 'hoy koa i jeho: “ambarao fa hisy fivoriambe manetriketrika ho an’i bala!” dia nambaran’izy ireo izany.'),
  ('6ab25a5bba2620b3e0ddaa93', '2026-09-22T10:37:15.811Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:15.811Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 10, 25, 'Raha vao avy nanolotra ny fanatitra dorana i Jeho, dia niteny tamin’ireo mpihazakazaka sy manamboninahitra lefitra hoe: “Midira, ka vonoy ireo! Aza avela hisy ho tafavoaka na iray aza.” Dia namono azy ireo tamin’ny lelan-tsabatra ny mpihazakazaka sy ny manamboninahitra lefitra, ka nanipy ny fatiny tany ivelany. Ary nandeha hatrany amin’ny tanàna nisy ny tranon’i Bala izy ireo.', 'raha vao avy nanolotra ny fanatitra dorana i jeho, dia niteny tamin’ireo mpihazakazaka sy manamboninahitra lefitra hoe: “midira, ka vonoy ireo! aza avela hisy ho tafavoaka na iray aza.” dia namono azy ireo tamin’ny lelan-tsabatra ny mpihazakazaka sy ny manamboninahitra lefitra, ka nanipy ny fatiny tany ivelany. ary nandeha hatrany amin’ny tanàna nisy ny tranon’i bala izy ireo.'),
  ('6ab25a5bba2620b3e0ddaa86', '2026-09-22T10:37:15.811Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:15.811Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 10, 12, 'Dia niainga nankany Samaria izy. Nisy trano fanetezana ondry teny an-dalana.', 'dia niainga nankany samaria izy. nisy trano fanetezana ondry teny an-dalana.'),
  ('6ab25a5bba2620b3e0ddaa91', '2026-09-22T10:37:15.811Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:15.811Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 10, 23, 'Dia nankao an-tranon’i Bala i Jeho, niaraka tamin’i Jonadaba zanak’i Rekaba. Ary hoy izy tamin’ireo mpivavaka tamin’i Bala: “Jereo tsara ka hamarino sao misy mpivavaka amin’i Jehovah tafaraka aminareo ato, fa mpivavaka amin’i Bala ihany no tokony ho ato.”', 'dia nankao an-tranon’i bala i jeho, niaraka tamin’i jonadaba zanak’i rekaba. ary hoy izy tamin’ireo mpivavaka tamin’i bala: “jereo tsara ka hamarino sao misy mpivavaka amin’i jehovah tafaraka aminareo ato, fa mpivavaka amin’i bala ihany no tokony ho ato.”'),
  ('6ab25a5bba2620b3e0ddaa8a', '2026-09-22T10:37:15.811Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:15.811Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 10, 16, 'Dia hoy i Jeho: “Andao hiaraka amiko, ary jereo fa tsy leferiko mihitsy ny fandrafiana an’i Jehovah.” Ary nentina tao amin’ny kalesin’adin’i Jeho izy.', 'dia hoy i jeho: “andao hiaraka amiko, ary jereo fa tsy leferiko mihitsy ny fandrafiana an’i jehovah.” ary nentina tao amin’ny kalesin’adin’i jeho izy.'),
  ('6ab25a5bba2620b3e0ddaa81', '2026-09-22T10:37:15.811Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:15.811Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 10, 7, 'Ary raha vao tonga tany amin’izy ireo ilay taratasy, dia nalain’izy ireo izy fitopolo lahy zanaky ny mpanjaka, ka novonoiny. Dia nataony tao anaty sobika ny lohan’izy ireo, ka nalefany tany amin’i Jeho tany Jezirela.', 'ary raha vao tonga tany amin’izy ireo ilay taratasy, dia nalain’izy ireo izy fitopolo lahy zanaky ny mpanjaka, ka novonoiny. dia nataony tao anaty sobika ny lohan’izy ireo, ka nalefany tany amin’i jeho tany jezirela.'),
  ('6ab25a5bba2620b3e0ddaa98', '2026-09-22T10:37:15.811Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:15.811Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 10, 30, 'Koa hoy i Jehovah tamin’i Jeho: “Tsara ny nataonao satria nanao izay mahitsy teo imasoko ianao, sady araka izay rehetra tao am-poko no nataonao tamin’ny ankohonan’i Ahaba. Noho izany, dia hisy zanakao lahy handimby anao eo amin’ny seza fiandrianan’ny Israely, hatrany amin’ny zafiafinao.”', 'koa hoy i jehovah tamin’i jeho: “tsara ny nataonao satria nanao izay mahitsy teo imasoko ianao, sady araka izay rehetra tao am-poko no nataonao tamin’ny ankohonan’i ahaba. noho izany, dia hisy zanakao lahy handimby anao eo amin’ny seza fiandrianan’ny israely, hatrany amin’ny zafiafinao.”'),
  ('6ab25a5bba2620b3e0ddaa97', '2026-09-22T10:37:15.811Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:15.811Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 10, 29, 'Tsy mba nialan’i Jeho anefa ny fahotan’i Jeroboama zanak’i Nebata, dia ireo fahotana nampanotan’i Jeroboama ny Israely, izany hoe ny fivavahana tamin’ilay zanak’omby volamena tany Betela sy ilay tany Dana.', 'tsy mba nialan’i jeho anefa ny fahotan’i jeroboama zanak’i nebata, dia ireo fahotana nampanotan’i jeroboama ny israely, izany hoe ny fivavahana tamin’ilay zanak’omby volamena tany betela sy ilay tany dana.'),
  ('6ab25a5bba2620b3e0ddaa90', '2026-09-22T10:37:15.811Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:15.811Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 10, 22, 'Dia hoy izy tamin’ny mpiandraikitra ny fitoeran’akanjo: “Amoahy akanjo ny mpivavaka amin’i Bala rehetra.” Koa namoaka akanjo ho azy ireo izy.', 'dia hoy izy tamin’ny mpiandraikitra ny fitoeran’akanjo: “amoahy akanjo ny mpivavaka amin’i bala rehetra.” koa namoaka akanjo ho azy ireo izy.'),
  ('6ab25a5bba2620b3e0ddaa8f', '2026-09-22T10:37:15.811Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:15.811Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 10, 21, 'Ary nandefa iraka hitety ny Israely rehetra i Jeho, ka tonga daholo ny mpivavaka tamin’i Bala. Tsy nisy tsy tonga na iray aza. Ary tonga tsikelikely tao an-tranon’i Bala izy ireo, ka feno hipoka ilay trano.', 'ary nandefa iraka hitety ny israely rehetra i jeho, ka tonga daholo ny mpivavaka tamin’i bala. tsy nisy tsy tonga na iray aza. ary tonga tsikelikely tao an-tranon’i bala izy ireo, ka feno hipoka ilay trano.'),
  ('6ab25a5bba2620b3e0ddaa8d', '2026-09-22T10:37:15.811Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:15.811Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 10, 19, 'Koa antsoy ho eto amiko daholo ny mpaminanin’i Bala sy ny mpivavaka aminy ary ny mpisorony rehetra. Aza avela hisy tsy ho tonga na iray aza, fa hanao sorona lehibe ho an’i Bala aho. Hovonoina ho faty izay tsy tonga.” Hafetsena anefa no nanaovan’i Jeho izany, satria te handringana ny mpivavaka tamin’i Bala izy.', 'koa antsoy ho eto amiko daholo ny mpaminanin’i bala sy ny mpivavaka aminy ary ny mpisorony rehetra. aza avela hisy tsy ho tonga na iray aza, fa hanao sorona lehibe ho an’i bala aho. hovonoina ho faty izay tsy tonga.” hafetsena anefa no nanaovan’i jeho izany, satria te handringana ny mpivavaka tamin’i bala izy.'),
  ('6ab25a5bba2620b3e0ddaa9d', '2026-09-22T10:37:15.812Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:15.812Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 10, 35, 'Farany, dia nodimandry any amin’ny razany i Jeho, ka nalevina tany Samaria. Ary i Joahaza zanany no nanjaka nandimby azy.', 'farany, dia nodimandry any amin’ny razany i jeho, ka nalevina tany samaria. ary i joahaza zanany no nanjaka nandimby azy.'),
  ('6ab25a5bba2620b3e0ddaa9e', '2026-09-22T10:37:15.812Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:15.812Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 10, 36, 'Ary ny andro nanjakan’i Jeho teo amin’ny Israely dia valo amby roapolo taona, tany Samaria.', 'ary ny andro nanjakan’i jeho teo amin’ny israely dia valo amby roapolo taona, tany samaria.'),
  ('6ab25a5cf5e9bcd52dd63b3f', '2026-09-22T10:37:16.286Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:16.286Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 11, 17, 'Avy eo dia nasain’i Joiada nanao fifanekena tamin’i Jehovah ny mpanjaka sy ny vahoaka, mba hanaporofoan’izy ireo fa olon’i Jehovah izy ireo. Nasainy nanao fifanekena tamin’ny mpanjaka koa ny vahoaka.', 'avy eo dia nasain’i joiada nanao fifanekena tamin’i jehovah ny mpanjaka sy ny vahoaka, mba hanaporofoan’izy ireo fa olon’i jehovah izy ireo. nasainy nanao fifanekena tamin’ny mpanjaka koa ny vahoaka.'),
  ('6ab25a5cf5e9bcd52dd63b37', '2026-09-22T10:37:16.286Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:16.286Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 11, 9, 'Dia nanao araka izay rehetra nandidian’i Joiada mpisorona ireo lehiben’ny zato, ka samy naka an’izay olom-peheziny, dia izay niditra tamin’ny andro sabata sy izay nivoaka tamin’ny andro sabata. Dia nankao amin’i Joiada mpisorona izy ireo.', 'dia nanao araka izay rehetra nandidian’i joiada mpisorona ireo lehiben’ny zato, ka samy naka an’izay olom-peheziny, dia izay niditra tamin’ny andro sabata sy izay nivoaka tamin’ny andro sabata. dia nankao amin’i joiada mpisorona izy ireo.'),
  ('6ab25a5cf5e9bcd52dd63b35', '2026-09-22T10:37:16.286Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:16.286Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 11, 7, 'Ny antokony roa aminareo izay tokony hivoaka amin’ny andro sabata no hiambina tsara ny tranon’i Jehovah, mba hiarovana ny mpanjaka.', 'ny antokony roa aminareo izay tokony hivoaka amin’ny andro sabata no hiambina tsara ny tranon’i jehovah, mba hiarovana ny mpanjaka.'),
  ('6ab25a5cf5e9bcd52dd63b34', '2026-09-22T10:37:16.286Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:16.286Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 11, 6, 'ary ny ampahatelony ho eo amin’ny Vavahadin’ny Fototra, ary ny ampahatelony ambiny ho eo amin’ny vavahady ao ambadik’ireo mpihazakazaka. Ary hifandimby hiambina tsara ny tranon’ny mpanjaka ianareo.', 'ary ny ampahatelony ho eo amin’ny vavahadin’ny fototra, ary ny ampahatelony ambiny ho eo amin’ny vavahady ao ambadik’ireo mpihazakazaka. ary hifandimby hiambina tsara ny tranon’ny mpanjaka ianareo.'),
  ('6ab25a5cf5e9bcd52dd63b39', '2026-09-22T10:37:16.286Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:16.286Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 11, 11, 'Ary nijoro ny mpihazakazaka ka samy nitana ny fiadiany avy, nanomboka teo amin’ny lafiny ankavanan’ny trano ka hatreny amin’ny lafiny ankavian’ny trano, sy teo akaikin’ny alitara ary teo akaikin’ny trano. Ary nisy koa nanodidina ny mpanjaka.', 'ary nijoro ny mpihazakazaka ka samy nitana ny fiadiany avy, nanomboka teo amin’ny lafiny ankavanan’ny trano ka hatreny amin’ny lafiny ankavian’ny trano, sy teo akaikin’ny alitara ary teo akaikin’ny trano. ary nisy koa nanodidina ny mpanjaka.'),
  ('6ab25a5cf5e9bcd52dd63b2f', '2026-09-22T10:37:16.286Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:16.286Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 11, 1, 'Rehefa hitan’i Atalia renin’i Ahazia fa maty ilay zanany, dia naripany avokoa ny tarana-mpanjaka.', 'rehefa hitan’i atalia renin’i ahazia fa maty ilay zanany, dia naripany avokoa ny tarana-mpanjaka.'),
  ('6ab25a5cf5e9bcd52dd63b3e', '2026-09-22T10:37:16.286Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:16.286Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 11, 16, 'Koa nosamborin’izy ireo ravehivavy. Dia novonoiny ho faty izy, raha vao tongany teo amin’ny lalana fidiran-tsoavaly teo amin’ny tranon’ny mpanjaka.', 'koa nosamborin’izy ireo ravehivavy. dia novonoiny ho faty izy, raha vao tongany teo amin’ny lalana fidiran-tsoavaly teo amin’ny tranon’ny mpanjaka.'),
  ('6ab25a5cf5e9bcd52dd63b3d', '2026-09-22T10:37:16.286Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:16.286Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 11, 15, 'Nobaikoin’i Joiada mpisorona anefa ny lehiben’ny zato voatendry hitari-tafika, hoe: “Avoahy eny ivelan’ny filaharana izy. Ary izay rehetra manaraka azy, dia vonoy amin’ny sabatra!” Efa nilaza mantsy ilay mpisorona hoe: “Aza vonoina ao an-tranon’i Jehovah izy.”', 'nobaikoin’i joiada mpisorona anefa ny lehiben’ny zato voatendry hitari-tafika, hoe: “avoahy eny ivelan’ny filaharana izy. ary izay rehetra manaraka azy, dia vonoy amin’ny sabatra!” efa nilaza mantsy ilay mpisorona hoe: “aza vonoina ao an-tranon’i jehovah izy.”'),
  ('6ab25a5cf5e9bcd52dd63b31', '2026-09-22T10:37:16.286Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:16.286Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 11, 3, 'Nafenina tao an-tranon’i Jehovah enin-taona izy, niaraka tamin’ilay vehivavy, raha mbola nanjaka nanerana ilay tany i Atalia.', 'nafenina tao an-tranon’i jehovah enin-taona izy, niaraka tamin’ilay vehivavy, raha mbola nanjaka nanerana ilay tany i atalia.'),
  ('6ab25a5cf5e9bcd52dd63b41', '2026-09-22T10:37:16.286Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:16.286Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 11, 19, 'Ary nentiny niaraka taminy ireo lehiben’ny zato sy ny Karianina mpiaro ny mpanjaka sy ny mpihazakazaka ary ny vahoaka manontolo, mba hitondra ny mpanjaka hidina avy tao an-tranon’i Jehovah. Dia teo amin’ny vavahadin’ny mpihazakazaka no lalan’izy ireo hankany an-tranon’ny mpanjaka. Ary nipetraka teo amin’ny seza fiandrianan’ny mpanjaka i Joasy.', 'ary nentiny niaraka taminy ireo lehiben’ny zato sy ny karianina mpiaro ny mpanjaka sy ny mpihazakazaka ary ny vahoaka manontolo, mba hitondra ny mpanjaka hidina avy tao an-tranon’i jehovah. dia teo amin’ny vavahadin’ny mpihazakazaka no lalan’izy ireo hankany an-tranon’ny mpanjaka. ary nipetraka teo amin’ny seza fiandrianan’ny mpanjaka i joasy.'),
  ('6ab25a5cf5e9bcd52dd63b40', '2026-09-22T10:37:16.286Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:16.286Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 11, 18, 'Taorian’izay, dia nankany amin’ny tranon’i Bala ny vahoaka manontolo, ka narodany ny alitarany. Dia nopotehin’izy ireo tanteraka ny sariny. Novonoin’izy ireo teo anoloan’ny alitara koa i Matana mpisoron’i Bala. Ary nanendry mpiandraikitra hikarakara ny tranon’i Jehovah ny mpisorona.', 'taorian’izay, dia nankany amin’ny tranon’i bala ny vahoaka manontolo, ka narodany ny alitarany. dia nopotehin’izy ireo tanteraka ny sariny. novonoin’izy ireo teo anoloan’ny alitara koa i matana mpisoron’i bala. ary nanendry mpiandraikitra hikarakara ny tranon’i jehovah ny mpisorona.'),
  ('6ab25a5cf5e9bcd52dd63b43', '2026-09-22T10:37:16.286Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:16.286Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 11, 21, 'Fito taona i Joasy tamin’izy nanomboka nanjaka.', 'fito taona i joasy tamin’izy nanomboka nanjaka.'),
  ('6ab25a5cf5e9bcd52dd63b33', '2026-09-22T10:37:16.286Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:16.286Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 11, 5, 'Dia nomeny baiko ireo hoe: “Izao no hataonareo: Ny ampahatelony aminareo izay miditra amin’ny andro sabata, dia hiambina tsara ny tranon’ny mpanjaka,', 'dia nomeny baiko ireo hoe: “izao no hataonareo: ny ampahatelony aminareo izay miditra amin’ny andro sabata, dia hiambina tsara ny tranon’ny mpanjaka,'),
  ('6ab25a5cf5e9bcd52dd63b42', '2026-09-22T10:37:16.286Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:16.286Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 11, 20, 'Dia nifaly ny vahoaka manontolo, ary nandry feizay ny tanàna. Ary i Atalia efa novonoina tamin’ny sabatra teo akaikin’ny tranon’ny mpanjaka.', 'dia nifaly ny vahoaka manontolo, ary nandry feizay ny tanàna. ary i atalia efa novonoina tamin’ny sabatra teo akaikin’ny tranon’ny mpanjaka.'),
  ('6ab25a5cf5e9bcd52dd63b3c', '2026-09-22T10:37:16.286Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:16.286Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 11, 14, 'Dia hitan’i Atalia ny mpanjaka nitsangana teo akaikin’ny andry, araka ny fomba fanao. Teo akaikin’ny mpanjaka koa ireo lehibe sy ny mpitsoka trompetra. Hitany koa ny vahoaka manontolo nifaly sy nitsoka trompetra. Dia norovitin’i Atalia avy hatrany ny akanjony, sady niantso mafy izy hoe: “Fikomiana! Fikomiana!”', 'dia hitan’i atalia ny mpanjaka nitsangana teo akaikin’ny andry, araka ny fomba fanao. teo akaikin’ny mpanjaka koa ireo lehibe sy ny mpitsoka trompetra. hitany koa ny vahoaka manontolo nifaly sy nitsoka trompetra. dia norovitin’i atalia avy hatrany ny akanjony, sady niantso mafy izy hoe: “fikomiana! fikomiana!”'),
  ('6ab25a5cf5e9bcd52dd63b3b', '2026-09-22T10:37:16.286Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:16.286Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 11, 13, 'Rehefa ren’i Atalia ny firodorodon’ny olona nihazakazaka, dia nankany amin’ny vahoaka tany an-tranon’i Jehovah avy hatrany izy.', 'rehefa ren’i atalia ny firodorodon’ny olona nihazakazaka, dia nankany amin’ny vahoaka tany an-tranon’i jehovah avy hatrany izy.'),
  ('6ab25a5cf5e9bcd52dd63b38', '2026-09-22T10:37:16.286Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:16.286Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 11, 10, 'Dia nomen’ilay mpisorona an’ireo lehiben’ny zato ny lefon’i Davida Mpanjaka sy ny ampingany boribory, izay tao an-tranon’i Jehovah.', 'dia nomen’ilay mpisorona an’ireo lehiben’ny zato ny lefon’i davida mpanjaka sy ny ampingany boribory, izay tao an-tranon’i jehovah.'),
  ('6ab25a5cf5e9bcd52dd63b30', '2026-09-22T10:37:16.286Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:16.286Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 11, 2, 'Nalain’i Joseba, zanakavavin’i Jorama Mpanjaka sady anabavin’i Ahazia, anefa i Joasy zanak’i Ahazia, ka nangalariny avy teo amin’ireo zanaky ny mpanjaka efa hovonoina. Dia nataony tao amin’ny efitra anatiny nisy ny fandriana i Joasy sy ilay vehivavy mpampinono azy. Koa nafenina tsy ho hitan’i Atalia i Joasy, ka tsy novonoina.', 'nalain’i joseba, zanakavavin’i jorama mpanjaka sady anabavin’i ahazia, anefa i joasy zanak’i ahazia, ka nangalariny avy teo amin’ireo zanaky ny mpanjaka efa hovonoina. dia nataony tao amin’ny efitra anatiny nisy ny fandriana i joasy sy ilay vehivavy mpampinono azy. koa nafenina tsy ho hitan’i atalia i joasy, ka tsy novonoina.'),
  ('6ab25a5cf5e9bcd52dd63b3a', '2026-09-22T10:37:16.286Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:16.286Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 11, 12, 'Avy eo dia navoakany ilay zanaky ny mpanjaka, ka nataony teo ambony lohany ny diadema sy ny horonam-boky misy ny Lalàna, ary nataony mpanjaka izy. Koa nanosotra azy ho mpanjaka izy ireo. Dia nitehaka izy ireo, sady nilaza hoe: “Ho ela velona anie ny mpanjaka!”', 'avy eo dia navoakany ilay zanaky ny mpanjaka, ka nataony teo ambony lohany ny diadema sy ny horonam-boky misy ny lalàna, ary nataony mpanjaka izy. koa nanosotra azy ho mpanjaka izy ireo. dia nitehaka izy ireo, sady nilaza hoe: “ho ela velona anie ny mpanjaka!”'),
  ('6ab25a5cf5e9bcd52dd63b36', '2026-09-22T10:37:16.286Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:16.286Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 11, 8, 'Koa hodidino ny mpanjaka, ka samia mitana ny fiadiany avy. Ary hovonoina ho faty izay rehetra mitsofotsofoka eo amin’ireo laharana. Araho foana ny mpanjaka, na mivoaka na miditra.”', 'koa hodidino ny mpanjaka, ka samia mitana ny fiadiany avy. ary hovonoina ho faty izay rehetra mitsofotsofoka eo amin’ireo laharana. araho foana ny mpanjaka, na mivoaka na miditra.”'),
  ('6ab25a5cf5e9bcd52dd63b32', '2026-09-22T10:37:16.286Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:16.286Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 11, 4, 'Ary tamin’ny taona fahafito dia nampanalain’i Joiada ny lehiben’ny zato tamin’ny Karianina mpiaro ny mpanjaka sy ny lehiben’ny mpihazakazaka, ka nentiny nankany aminy tao an-tranon’i Jehovah. Dia nanao fifanekena tamin’izy ireo izy, ary nampianiana azy ireo tao an-tranon’i Jehovah. Avy eo dia nasehony azy ireo ilay zanaky ny mpanjaka.', 'ary tamin’ny taona fahafito dia nampanalain’i joiada ny lehiben’ny zato tamin’ny karianina mpiaro ny mpanjaka sy ny lehiben’ny mpihazakazaka, ka nentiny nankany aminy tao an-tranon’i jehovah. dia nanao fifanekena tamin’izy ireo izy, ary nampianiana azy ireo tao an-tranon’i jehovah. avy eo dia nasehony azy ireo ilay zanaky ny mpanjaka.'),
  ('6ab25a5c6655ac38b30e1c8f', '2026-09-22T10:37:16.890Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:16.890Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 12, 18, 'Ary nalain’i Joasy mpanjakan’ny Joda ny fanatitra masina rehetra, izay nohamasinin’ireo razambeny mpanjakan’ny Joda, dia i Josafata sy Jorama ary Ahazia. Nalainy koa ny fanatitra masina natolony, sy ny volamena rehetra tao amin’ny zava-tsarobidy notehirizina tao an-tranon’i Jehovah sy tao an-tranon’ny mpanjaka, ka nalefany tany amin’i Hazaela mpanjakan’i Syria. Koa lasa i Hazaela fa tsy namely an’i Jerosalema.', 'ary nalain’i joasy mpanjakan’ny joda ny fanatitra masina rehetra, izay nohamasinin’ireo razambeny mpanjakan’ny joda, dia i josafata sy jorama ary ahazia. nalainy koa ny fanatitra masina natolony, sy ny volamena rehetra tao amin’ny zava-tsarobidy notehirizina tao an-tranon’i jehovah sy tao an-tranon’ny mpanjaka, ka nalefany tany amin’i hazaela mpanjakan’i syria. koa lasa i hazaela fa tsy namely an’i jerosalema.'),
  ('6ab25a5c6655ac38b30e1c90', '2026-09-22T10:37:16.890Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:16.890Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 12, 19, 'Ary ny sisa amin’ny tantaran’i Joasy, mbamin’izay rehetra nataony, tsy efa voasoratra ao amin’ny boky mirakitra ny tantara tamin’ny andron’ireo mpanjakan’ny Joda ve izany?', 'ary ny sisa amin’ny tantaran’i joasy, mbamin’izay rehetra nataony, tsy efa voasoratra ao amin’ny boky mirakitra ny tantara tamin’ny andron’ireo mpanjakan’ny joda ve izany?'),
  ('6ab25a5c6655ac38b30e1c87', '2026-09-22T10:37:16.890Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:16.890Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 12, 10, 'Raha vao hitan’izy ireo fa nisy vola be tao amin’ilay vata, dia niakatra ny mpitan-tsoratry ny mpanjaka sy ny mpisoronabe, ka namatotra sy nanisa ny vola hita tao an-tranon’i Jehovah.', 'raha vao hitan’izy ireo fa nisy vola be tao amin’ilay vata, dia niakatra ny mpitan-tsoratry ny mpanjaka sy ny mpisoronabe, ka namatotra sy nanisa ny vola hita tao an-tranon’i jehovah.'),
  ('6ab25a5c6655ac38b30e1c82', '2026-09-22T10:37:16.890Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:16.890Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 12, 5, 'dia halain’ny mpisorona. Samy haka izany amin’ny olom-pantany ny mpisorona tsirairay. Dia hanamboatra an’izay triatra amin’ilay trano izy ireo.”', 'dia halain’ny mpisorona. samy haka izany amin’ny olom-pantany ny mpisorona tsirairay. dia hanamboatra an’izay triatra amin’ilay trano izy ireo.”'),
  ('6ab25a5c6655ac38b30e1c8d', '2026-09-22T10:37:16.890Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:16.890Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 12, 16, 'Tsy nentina tao an-tranon’i Jehovah kosa ny vola ho an’ny fanatitra noho ny heloka, sy ny vola ho an’ny fanatitra noho ny ota. Dia lasa fananan’ny mpisorona izany.', 'tsy nentina tao an-tranon’i jehovah kosa ny vola ho an’ny fanatitra noho ny heloka, sy ny vola ho an’ny fanatitra noho ny ota. dia lasa fananan’ny mpisorona izany.'),
  ('6ab25a5c6655ac38b30e1c8c', '2026-09-22T10:37:16.890Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:16.890Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 12, 15, 'Ary tsy natao ampamoaka ireo lehilahy notolorana an’ilay vola homena ny mpanao ny asa, satria mendri-pitokisana izy ireo tamin’ny asany.', 'ary tsy natao ampamoaka ireo lehilahy notolorana an’ilay vola homena ny mpanao ny asa, satria mendri-pitokisana izy ireo tamin’ny asany.'),
  ('6ab25a5c6655ac38b30e1c86', '2026-09-22T10:37:16.890Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:16.890Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 12, 9, 'Koa naka vata kely i Joiada mpisorona, ka nolavahany ny sarony. Dia napetrany teo anilan’ny alitara ilay vata, izany hoe teo ankavanana rehefa niditra tao an-tranon’i Jehovah. Ary tao no napetraky ny mpisorona mpiandry varavarana ny vola rehetra nentina tao an-tranon’i Jehovah.', 'koa naka vata kely i joiada mpisorona, ka nolavahany ny sarony. dia napetrany teo anilan’ny alitara ilay vata, izany hoe teo ankavanana rehefa niditra tao an-tranon’i jehovah. ary tao no napetraky ny mpisorona mpiandry varavarana ny vola rehetra nentina tao an-tranon’i jehovah.'),
  ('6ab25a5c6655ac38b30e1c7f', '2026-09-22T10:37:16.890Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:16.890Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 12, 2, 'Ary nanao izay mahitsy teo imason’i Jehovah foana i Joasy, tamin’ny andro rehetra nampianaran’i Joiada mpisorona azy.', 'ary nanao izay mahitsy teo imason’i jehovah foana i joasy, tamin’ny andro rehetra nampianaran’i joiada mpisorona azy.'),
  ('6ab25a5c6655ac38b30e1c89', '2026-09-22T10:37:16.890Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:16.890Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 12, 12, 'sy ho an’ny mpandatsa-biriky sy ny mpipai-bato. Nomena koa izany mba hividianana hazo sy vato voapaika hanamboarana ny triatra amin’ny tranon’i Jehovah, sy hampiasaina amin’ny lany rehetra amin’ny fanamboarana ilay trano.', 'sy ho an’ny mpandatsa-biriky sy ny mpipai-bato. nomena koa izany mba hividianana hazo sy vato voapaika hanamboarana ny triatra amin’ny tranon’i jehovah, sy hampiasaina amin’ny lany rehetra amin’ny fanamboarana ilay trano.'),
  ('6ab25a5c6655ac38b30e1c7e', '2026-09-22T10:37:16.890Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:16.890Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 12, 1, 'Tamin’ny taona fahafito nanjakan’i Jeho, no lasa mpanjaka i Joasy, ary efapolo taona no nanjakany tany Jerosalema. Ary ny anaran-dreniny dia Zibia, avy any Beri-sheba.', 'tamin’ny taona fahafito nanjakan’i jeho, no lasa mpanjaka i joasy, ary efapolo taona no nanjakany tany jerosalema. ary ny anaran-dreniny dia zibia, avy any beri-sheba.'),
  ('6ab25a5c6655ac38b30e1c8e', '2026-09-22T10:37:16.890Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:16.890Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 12, 17, 'Dia niakatra hamely an’i Gata sy hamabo azy i Hazaela mpanjakan’i Syria. Avy eo dia tapa-kevitra * hiakatra hamely an’i Jerosalema izy.', 'dia niakatra hamely an’i gata sy hamabo azy i hazaela mpanjakan’i syria. avy eo dia tapa-kevitra * hiakatra hamely an’i jerosalema izy.'),
  ('6ab25a5c6655ac38b30e1c8b', '2026-09-22T10:37:16.890Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:16.890Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 12, 14, 'Nomena ny mpanao ny asa mantsy ny vola, ka nanamboaran’izy ireo ny tranon’i Jehovah.', 'nomena ny mpanao ny asa mantsy ny vola, ka nanamboaran’izy ireo ny tranon’i jehovah.'),
  ('6ab25a5c6655ac38b30e1c83', '2026-09-22T10:37:16.890Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:16.890Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 12, 6, 'Tamin’ny taona fahatelo amby roapolo nanjakan’i Joasy Mpanjaka anefa, dia mbola tsy namboarin’ireo mpisorona ihany ny triatra tamin’ilay trano.', 'tamin’ny taona fahatelo amby roapolo nanjakan’i joasy mpanjaka anefa, dia mbola tsy namboarin’ireo mpisorona ihany ny triatra tamin’ilay trano.'),
  ('6ab25a5c6655ac38b30e1c8a', '2026-09-22T10:37:16.890Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:16.890Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 12, 13, 'Ary ny tranon’i Jehovah dia tsy nanaovana koveta volafotsy, na famonoan-jiro, na vilia baolina, na trompetra, na zavatra vita tamin’ny volamena na volafotsy, avy tamin’ny vola nentina tao an-tranon’i Jehovah.', 'ary ny tranon’i jehovah dia tsy nanaovana koveta volafotsy, na famonoan-jiro, na vilia baolina, na trompetra, na zavatra vita tamin’ny volamena na volafotsy, avy tamin’ny vola nentina tao an-tranon’i jehovah.'),
  ('6ab25a5c6655ac38b30e1c92', '2026-09-22T10:37:16.890Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:16.890Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 12, 21, 'I Jozakara zanak’i Simata sy Jozabada zanak’i Somera, mpanompony no namono azy ka maty izy. Koa nalevina any amin’ny razany tao amin’ny Tanànan’i Davida izy. Ary i Amazia zanany no nanjaka nandimby azy.', 'i jozakara zanak’i simata sy jozabada zanak’i somera, mpanompony no namono azy ka maty izy. koa nalevina any amin’ny razany tao amin’ny tanànan’i davida izy. ary i amazia zanany no nanjaka nandimby azy.'),
  ('6ab25a5c6655ac38b30e1c88', '2026-09-22T10:37:16.890Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:16.890Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 12, 11, 'Ary ny vola voaisa dia natolony ny mpanao ny asa, izay notendrena ho ao an-tranon’i Jehovah. Ireo indray nanome izany ho an’ny mpandrafitra sy ny mpanorina, izay niasa tao an-tranon’i Jehovah,', 'ary ny vola voaisa dia natolony ny mpanao ny asa, izay notendrena ho ao an-tranon’i jehovah. ireo indray nanome izany ho an’ny mpandrafitra sy ny mpanorina, izay niasa tao an-tranon’i jehovah,'),
  ('6ab25a5c6655ac38b30e1c84', '2026-09-22T10:37:16.890Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:16.890Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 12, 7, 'Nantsoin’i Joasy Mpanjaka àry i Joiada mpisorona sy ireo mpisorona hafa, ka nanontaniany hoe: “Nahoana no tsy amboarinareo ny triatra amin’ny trano? Aza maka vola amin’ny olom-pantatrareo intsony, fa omeo hanamboarana ny triatra amin’ny trano kosa ny vola efa voangona.”', 'nantsoin’i joasy mpanjaka àry i joiada mpisorona sy ireo mpisorona hafa, ka nanontaniany hoe: “nahoana no tsy amboarinareo ny triatra amin’ny trano? aza maka vola amin’ny olom-pantatrareo intsony, fa omeo hanamboarana ny triatra amin’ny trano kosa ny vola efa voangona.”'),
  ('6ab25a5c6655ac38b30e1c91', '2026-09-22T10:37:16.890Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:16.890Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 12, 20, 'Niray tetika hamono an’i Joasy anefa ny mpanompony, ka namono azy tao amin’ilay trano teo amin’ny Dongon-tany, izay tany amin’ny lalana midina ho any Sila.', 'niray tetika hamono an’i joasy anefa ny mpanompony, ka namono azy tao amin’ilay trano teo amin’ny dongon-tany, izay tany amin’ny lalana midina ho any sila.'),
  ('6ab25a5c6655ac38b30e1c85', '2026-09-22T10:37:16.890Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:16.890Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 12, 8, 'Dia nanaiky tsy haka vola amin’ny olona intsony sy tsy hanamboatra ny triatra amin’ny trano ny mpisorona.', 'dia nanaiky tsy haka vola amin’ny olona intsony sy tsy hanamboatra ny triatra amin’ny trano ny mpisorona.'),
  ('6ab25a5c6655ac38b30e1c81', '2026-09-22T10:37:16.890Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:16.890Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 12, 4, 'Ary hoy i Joasy tamin’ny mpisorona: “Ny vola rehetra ho an’ny fanatitra masina ka entina ao an-tranon’i Jehovah, izany hoe ny vola tsy maintsy aloan’ny tsirairay, sy ny vola omen’ny olona * nanao voady, ary ny vola rehetra entin’ny tsirairay an-tsitrapo ao an-tranon’i Jehovah,', 'ary hoy i joasy tamin’ny mpisorona: “ny vola rehetra ho an’ny fanatitra masina ka entina ao an-tranon’i jehovah, izany hoe ny vola tsy maintsy aloan’ny tsirairay, sy ny vola omen’ny olona * nanao voady, ary ny vola rehetra entin’ny tsirairay an-tsitrapo ao an-tranon’i jehovah,'),
  ('6ab25a5c6655ac38b30e1c80', '2026-09-22T10:37:16.890Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:16.890Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 12, 3, 'Mbola tsy nesorina anefa ny toerana avo, ary mbola nanao sorona sy nanolotra setroka ho sorona teny ihany ny olona.', 'mbola tsy nesorina anefa ny toerana avo, ary mbola nanao sorona sy nanolotra setroka ho sorona teny ihany ny olona.'),
  ('6ab25a6007b03f636da7288c', '2026-09-22T10:37:20.894Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:20.894Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 13, 17, 'Hoy izy avy eo: “Sokafy ny varavarankely atsinanana.” Dia nosokafany izany. Ary hoy i Elisa: “Mitifira!” Dia nitifitra izy. Hoy indray i Elisa: “Zana-tsipìkan’ny famonjen’i Jehovah, dia ny zana-tsipìkan’ny famonjena hamelezana an’i Syria! Ary hamely an’i Syria ianao ao Afeka, mandra-pandringanao azy.”', 'hoy izy avy eo: “sokafy ny varavarankely atsinanana.” dia nosokafany izany. ary hoy i elisa: “mitifira!” dia nitifitra izy. hoy indray i elisa: “zana-tsipìkan’ny famonjen’i jehovah, dia ny zana-tsipìkan’ny famonjena hamelezana an’i syria! ary hamely an’i syria ianao ao afeka, mandra-pandringanao azy.”'),
  ('6ab25a6007b03f636da7288a', '2026-09-22T10:37:20.894Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:20.894Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 13, 15, 'Ary hoy i Elisa taminy: “Makà tsipìka sy zana-tsipìka.” Dia naka tsipìka sy zana-tsipìka izy.', 'ary hoy i elisa taminy: “makà tsipìka sy zana-tsipìka.” dia naka tsipìka sy zana-tsipìka izy.'),
  ('6ab25a6007b03f636da7288b', '2026-09-22T10:37:20.894Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:20.894Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 13, 16, 'Ary hoy i Elisa tamin’ny mpanjakan’ny Israely: “Ataovy eo amin’ny tsipìka ny tananao.” Dia nataony teo ny tanany, ary ny tanan’i Elisa kosa nataony teo amin’ny tanan’ny mpanjaka.', 'ary hoy i elisa tamin’ny mpanjakan’ny israely: “ataovy eo amin’ny tsipìka ny tananao.” dia nataony teo ny tanany, ary ny tanan’i elisa kosa nataony teo amin’ny tanan’ny mpanjaka.'),
  ('6ab25a6007b03f636da7287e', '2026-09-22T10:37:20.894Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:20.894Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 13, 3, 'Koa nirehitra tamin’ny Israely ny fahatezeran’i Jehovah, ka natolony teo an-tanan’i Hazaela mpanjakan’i Syria sy Beni-hadada zanak’i Hazaela izy ireo, tamin’ny andro rehetra niainan’izy ireo.', 'koa nirehitra tamin’ny israely ny fahatezeran’i jehovah, ka natolony teo an-tanan’i hazaela mpanjakan’i syria sy beni-hadada zanak’i hazaela izy ireo, tamin’ny andro rehetra niainan’izy ireo.'),
  ('6ab25a6007b03f636da72891', '2026-09-22T10:37:20.894Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:20.894Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 13, 22, 'Ary nampahorin’i Hazaela mpanjakan’i Syria ny Israely, tamin’ny andro rehetra nanjakan’i Joahaza.', 'ary nampahorin’i hazaela mpanjakan’i syria ny israely, tamin’ny andro rehetra nanjakan’i joahaza.'),
  ('6ab25a6007b03f636da72885', '2026-09-22T10:37:20.894Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:20.894Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 13, 10, 'Tamin’ny taona fahafito amby telopolo nanjakan’i Joasy mpanjakan’ny Joda, no lasa mpanjakan’ny Israely tany Samaria i Joasy zanak’i Joahaza. Ary enina ambin’ny folo taona no nanjakany.', 'tamin’ny taona fahafito amby telopolo nanjakan’i joasy mpanjakan’ny joda, no lasa mpanjakan’ny israely tany samaria i joasy zanak’i joahaza. ary enina ambin’ny folo taona no nanjakany.'),
  ('6ab25a6007b03f636da72892', '2026-09-22T10:37:20.894Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:20.894Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 13, 23, 'Tsara fanahy tamin’izy ireo sy niantra azy anefa i Jehovah ka nitsinjo azy, noho ny fifanekena nataony tamin’i Abrahama sy Isaka ary Jakoba. Tsy tiany ho ringana izy ireo, ka tsy nariany tanteraka tsy ho eo anatrehany hatramin’izao.', 'tsara fanahy tamin’izy ireo sy niantra azy anefa i jehovah ka nitsinjo azy, noho ny fifanekena nataony tamin’i abrahama sy isaka ary jakoba. tsy tiany ho ringana izy ireo, ka tsy nariany tanteraka tsy ho eo anatrehany hatramin’izao.'),
  ('6ab25a6007b03f636da7287c', '2026-09-22T10:37:20.894Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:20.894Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 13, 1, 'Tamin’ny taona fahatelo amby roapolo nanjakan’i Joasy zanak’i Ahazia mpanjakan’ny Joda, no lasa mpanjakan’ny Israely tany Samaria i Joahaza zanak’i Jeho. Ary fito ambin’ny folo taona no nanjakany.', 'tamin’ny taona fahatelo amby roapolo nanjakan’i joasy zanak’i ahazia mpanjakan’ny joda, no lasa mpanjakan’ny israely tany samaria i joahaza zanak’i jeho. ary fito ambin’ny folo taona no nanjakany.'),
  ('6ab25a6007b03f636da72887', '2026-09-22T10:37:20.894Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:20.894Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 13, 12, 'Ary ny sisa amin’ny tantaran’i Joasy, mbamin’izay rehetra nataony sy ny heriny ary ny niadiany tamin’i Amazia mpanjakan’ny Joda, tsy efa voasoratra ao amin’ny boky mirakitra ny tantara tamin’ny andron’ireo mpanjakan’ny Israely ve izany?', 'ary ny sisa amin’ny tantaran’i joasy, mbamin’izay rehetra nataony sy ny heriny ary ny niadiany tamin’i amazia mpanjakan’ny joda, tsy efa voasoratra ao amin’ny boky mirakitra ny tantara tamin’ny andron’ireo mpanjakan’ny israely ve izany?'),
  ('6ab25a6007b03f636da72888', '2026-09-22T10:37:20.894Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:20.894Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 13, 13, 'Farany dia nodimandry any amin’ny razany i Joasy, ary i Jeroboama no nipetraka teo amin’ny seza fiandrianany. Dia nalevina tany Samaria, tany amin’ireo mpanjakan’ny Israely, i Joasy.', 'farany dia nodimandry any amin’ny razany i joasy, ary i jeroboama no nipetraka teo amin’ny seza fiandrianany. dia nalevina tany samaria, tany amin’ireo mpanjakan’ny israely, i joasy.'),
  ('6ab25a6007b03f636da72882', '2026-09-22T10:37:20.894Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:20.894Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 13, 7, 'Ary tsy nisy afa-tsy mpitaingin-tsoavaly dimampolo sy kalesy folo ary lehilahy iray alina mandeha an-tongotra sisa no tao amin’ny tafik’i Joahaza, satria naringan’ny mpanjakan’i Syria ireny, ka nohosihoseny toy ny vovoka eny am-pamoloana.', 'ary tsy nisy afa-tsy mpitaingin-tsoavaly dimampolo sy kalesy folo ary lehilahy iray alina mandeha an-tongotra sisa no tao amin’ny tafik’i joahaza, satria naringan’ny mpanjakan’i syria ireny, ka nohosihoseny toy ny vovoka eny am-pamoloana.'),
  ('6ab25a6007b03f636da7287d', '2026-09-22T10:37:20.894Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:20.894Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 13, 2, 'Nanao izay ratsy teo imason’i Jehovah foana i Joahaza, ka tsy niala tamin’ny fahotan’i Jeroboama zanak’i Nebata, izay nampanotany ny Israely. Tsy niala tamin’izany izy.', 'nanao izay ratsy teo imason’i jehovah foana i joahaza, ka tsy niala tamin’ny fahotan’i jeroboama zanak’i nebata, izay nampanotany ny israely. tsy niala tamin’izany izy.'),
  ('6ab25a6007b03f636da72893', '2026-09-22T10:37:20.894Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:20.894Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 13, 24, 'Farany dia maty i Hazaela mpanjakan’i Syria, ary i Beni-hadada zanany no nanjaka nandimby azy.', 'farany dia maty i hazaela mpanjakan’i syria, ary i beni-hadada zanany no nanjaka nandimby azy.'),
  ('6ab25a6007b03f636da72884', '2026-09-22T10:37:20.894Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:20.894Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 13, 9, 'Farany dia nodimandry any amin’ny razany i Joahaza, ka nalevina tany Samaria. Ary i Joasy zanany no nanjaka nandimby azy.', 'farany dia nodimandry any amin’ny razany i joahaza, ka nalevina tany samaria. ary i joasy zanany no nanjaka nandimby azy.'),
  ('6ab25a6007b03f636da72881', '2026-09-22T10:37:20.894Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:20.894Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 13, 6, 'Tsy niala tamin’ny fahotan’ny ankohonan’i Jeroboama, izay nampanotany ny Israely, anefa izy ireo, fa nanao izany foana. Ary na ilay tsato-kazo masina aza mbola nijoro tany Samaria ihany.', 'tsy niala tamin’ny fahotan’ny ankohonan’i jeroboama, izay nampanotany ny israely, anefa izy ireo, fa nanao izany foana. ary na ilay tsato-kazo masina aza mbola nijoro tany samaria ihany.'),
  ('6ab25a6007b03f636da72889', '2026-09-22T10:37:20.894Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:20.894Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 13, 14, 'Ary i Elisa dia nararin’ny aretina hahafaty azy. Koa nidina tany aminy i Joasy mpanjakan’ny Israely, ka nihohoka nitomany teo amin’ny tarehiny, sady nilaza hoe: “Ry raiko ô, ry raiko ô, ny kalesin’adin’ny Israely mbamin’ny mpitaingin-tsoavaliny!”', 'ary i elisa dia nararin’ny aretina hahafaty azy. koa nidina tany aminy i joasy mpanjakan’ny israely, ka nihohoka nitomany teo amin’ny tarehiny, sady nilaza hoe: “ry raiko ô, ry raiko ô, ny kalesin’adin’ny israely mbamin’ny mpitaingin-tsoavaliny!”'),
  ('6ab25a6007b03f636da72886', '2026-09-22T10:37:20.894Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:20.894Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 13, 11, 'Ary nanao izay ratsy teo imason’i Jehovah foana izy, ka tsy niala tamin’ny fahotana rehetra nataon’i Jeroboama zanak’i Nebata, izay nampanotany ny Israely, fa nanao izany foana.', 'ary nanao izay ratsy teo imason’i jehovah foana izy, ka tsy niala tamin’ny fahotana rehetra nataon’i jeroboama zanak’i nebata, izay nampanotany ny israely, fa nanao izany foana.'),
  ('6ab25a6007b03f636da72883', '2026-09-22T10:37:20.894Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:20.894Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 13, 8, 'Ary ny sisa amin’ny tantaran’i Joahaza, mbamin’izay rehetra nataony sy ny heriny, tsy efa voasoratra ao amin’ny boky mirakitra ny tantara tamin’ny andron’ireo mpanjakan’ny Israely ve izany?', 'ary ny sisa amin’ny tantaran’i joahaza, mbamin’izay rehetra nataony sy ny heriny, tsy efa voasoratra ao amin’ny boky mirakitra ny tantara tamin’ny andron’ireo mpanjakan’ny israely ve izany?'),
  ('6ab25a6007b03f636da72894', '2026-09-22T10:37:20.894Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:20.894Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 13, 25, 'Ary nalain’i Joasy zanak’i Joahaza indray ireo tanàna teo am-pelatanan’i Beni-hadada zanak’i Hazaela. Tamin’ny ady mantsy no nahazoan’i Beni-hadada an’ireo tanàna ireo teo am-pelatanan’i Joahaza rain’i Joasy. Koa namely azy intelo i Joasy, ka azony indray ireo tanànan’ny Israely.', 'ary nalain’i joasy zanak’i joahaza indray ireo tanàna teo am-pelatanan’i beni-hadada zanak’i hazaela. tamin’ny ady mantsy no nahazoan’i beni-hadada an’ireo tanàna ireo teo am-pelatanan’i joahaza rain’i joasy. koa namely azy intelo i joasy, ka azony indray ireo tanànan’ny israely.'),
  ('6ab25a6007b03f636da7288f', '2026-09-22T10:37:20.894Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:20.894Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 13, 20, 'Ary maty i Elisa ka nalevina. Ary nisy Moabita mpandroba tonga teo amin’ilay tany, isaky ny fiandohan’ny taona.', 'ary maty i elisa ka nalevina. ary nisy moabita mpandroba tonga teo amin’ilay tany, isaky ny fiandohan’ny taona.'),
  ('6ab25a6007b03f636da7288e', '2026-09-22T10:37:20.894Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:20.894Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 13, 19, 'Koa tezitra taminy ilay lehilahin’Andriamanitra, ka niteny hoe: “Tokony ho nikapoka indimy na inenina ianao! Amin’izay mantsy dia hamely an’i Syria ianao, ka handringana azy. Fa izao kosa dia intelo ihany ianao no hamely azy.”', 'koa tezitra taminy ilay lehilahin’andriamanitra, ka niteny hoe: “tokony ho nikapoka indimy na inenina ianao! amin’izay mantsy dia hamely an’i syria ianao, ka handringana azy. fa izao kosa dia intelo ihany ianao no hamely azy.”'),
  ('6ab25a6007b03f636da72880', '2026-09-22T10:37:20.894Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:20.894Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 13, 5, 'Koa nomen’i Jehovah mpamonjy ny Israely, ka tsy teo ambany fahefan’i Syria intsony. Ary afaka nonina tao an-tranony toy ny teo aloha ny zanak’Israely.', 'koa nomen’i jehovah mpamonjy ny israely, ka tsy teo ambany fahefan’i syria intsony. ary afaka nonina tao an-tranony toy ny teo aloha ny zanak’israely.'),
  ('6ab25a6007b03f636da7287f', '2026-09-22T10:37:20.894Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:20.894Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 13, 4, 'Tatỳ aoriana, dia nampitony an’i Jehovah i Joahaza. Dia nihaino azy i Jehovah, satria hitany ny fahorian’ny Israely, noho ny fampahorian’ny mpanjakan’i Syria azy ireo.', 'tatỳ aoriana, dia nampitony an’i jehovah i joahaza. dia nihaino azy i jehovah, satria hitany ny fahorian’ny israely, noho ny fampahorian’ny mpanjakan’i syria azy ireo.'),
  ('6ab25a6007b03f636da72890', '2026-09-22T10:37:20.894Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:20.894Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 13, 21, 'Indray andro, dia nisy olona nandevina lehilahy iray, ka sendra nahatazana an’ireo mpandroba. Koa natsipiny avy hatrany tao amin’ny toerana nandevenana an’i Elisa ilay faty, dia lasa izy ireo. Rehefa nikasika ny taolan’i Elisa anefa ilay faty, dia velona avy hatrany ka nijoro tamin’ny tongony.', 'indray andro, dia nisy olona nandevina lehilahy iray, ka sendra nahatazana an’ireo mpandroba. koa natsipiny avy hatrany tao amin’ny toerana nandevenana an’i elisa ilay faty, dia lasa izy ireo. rehefa nikasika ny taolan’i elisa anefa ilay faty, dia velona avy hatrany ka nijoro tamin’ny tongony.'),
  ('6ab25a6007b03f636da7288d', '2026-09-22T10:37:20.894Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:20.894Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 13, 18, 'Hoy indray i Elisa: “Raiso ny zana-tsipìka.” Dia noraisiny izany. Ary hoy i Elisa tamin’ny mpanjakan’ny Israely: “Kapohy ny tany.” Ary nikapoka intelo izy, dia nijanona.', 'hoy indray i elisa: “raiso ny zana-tsipìka.” dia noraisiny izany. ary hoy i elisa tamin’ny mpanjakan’ny israely: “kapohy ny tany.” ary nikapoka intelo izy, dia nijanona.'),
  ('6ab25a625e55d2008a98f279', '2026-09-22T10:37:22.395Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:22.395Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 14, 12, 'Dia resy teo anoloan’ny Israely ny Joda, ka samy nandositra nankany amin’ny tranolainy avy.', 'dia resy teo anoloan’ny israely ny joda, ka samy nandositra nankany amin’ny tranolainy avy.'),
  ('6ab25a625e55d2008a98f275', '2026-09-22T10:37:22.395Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:22.395Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 14, 8, 'Dia nandefa iraka ho any amin’i Joasy zanak’i Joahaza, zanak’i Jeho mpanjakan’ny Israely, i Amazia nanao hoe: “Tongava, andao isika hifanandrina.”', 'dia nandefa iraka ho any amin’i joasy zanak’i joahaza, zanak’i jeho mpanjakan’ny israely, i amazia nanao hoe: “tongava, andao isika hifanandrina.”'),
  ('6ab25a625e55d2008a98f272', '2026-09-22T10:37:22.395Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:22.395Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 14, 5, 'Ary raha vao mafy orina ny fanjakana nentiny, dia novonoiny ho faty ireo mpanompony izay namono ny mpanjaka rainy.', 'ary raha vao mafy orina ny fanjakana nentiny, dia novonoiny ho faty ireo mpanompony izay namono ny mpanjaka rainy.'),
  ('6ab25a625e55d2008a98f274', '2026-09-22T10:37:22.395Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:22.395Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 14, 7, 'Ary nahafaty lehilahy edomita iray alina teo amin’ny Lohasahan-tsira i Amazia. Azony tamin’ny ady koa ny tanànan’i Sela, ka natao hoe Joktela ny anaran’izy io mandraka androany.', 'ary nahafaty lehilahy edomita iray alina teo amin’ny lohasahan-tsira i amazia. azony tamin’ny ady koa ny tanànan’i sela, ka natao hoe joktela ny anaran’izy io mandraka androany.'),
  ('6ab25a625e55d2008a98f26e', '2026-09-22T10:37:22.395Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:22.395Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 14, 1, 'Tamin’ny taona faharoa nanjakan’i Joasy zanak’i Joahaza mpanjakan’ny Israely, no lasa mpanjaka i Amazia zanak’i Joasy mpanjakan’ny Joda.', 'tamin’ny taona faharoa nanjakan’i joasy zanak’i joahaza mpanjakan’ny israely, no lasa mpanjaka i amazia zanak’i joasy mpanjakan’ny joda.');
INSERT INTO "bible_verses" ("id", "created_date", "updated_date", "created_by_id", "created_by", "translation", "book", "bookOrder", "chapter", "verse", "text", "normalizedText") VALUES
  ('6ab25a625e55d2008a98f277', '2026-09-22T10:37:22.395Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:22.395Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 14, 10, 'Marina fa nandresy an’i Edoma ianao, ka nasesiky ny fonao hanandra-tena. Mifalia anefa amin’ny voninahitrao, ary mitoera ihany ao an-tranonao. Aza mila ady, fa ho resy ianao sy ny Joda miaraka aminao satria atody miady amam-bato ianareo.”', 'marina fa nandresy an’i edoma ianao, ka nasesiky ny fonao hanandra-tena. mifalia anefa amin’ny voninahitrao, ary mitoera ihany ao an-tranonao. aza mila ady, fa ho resy ianao sy ny joda miaraka aminao satria atody miady amam-bato ianareo.”'),
  ('6ab25a625e55d2008a98f278', '2026-09-22T10:37:22.395Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:22.395Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 14, 11, 'Tsy nanaiky anefa i Amazia. Niakatra àry i Joasy mpanjakan’ny Israely, ka nifanandrina tany Beti-semesy any Joda izy ireo, dia izy sy Amazia mpanjakan’ny Joda.', 'tsy nanaiky anefa i amazia. niakatra àry i joasy mpanjakan’ny israely, ka nifanandrina tany beti-semesy any joda izy ireo, dia izy sy amazia mpanjakan’ny joda.'),
  ('6ab25a625e55d2008a98f271', '2026-09-22T10:37:22.395Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:22.395Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 14, 4, 'Mbola tsy nesorina anefa ny toerana avo, ary mbola nanao sorona sy nanolotra setroka ho sorona teny ihany ny olona.', 'mbola tsy nesorina anefa ny toerana avo, ary mbola nanao sorona sy nanolotra setroka ho sorona teny ihany ny olona.'),
  ('6ab25a625e55d2008a98f26f', '2026-09-22T10:37:22.395Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:22.395Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 14, 2, 'Dimy amby roapolo taona izy, tamin’izy nanomboka nanjaka, ary sivy amby roapolo taona no nanjakany tany Jerosalema. Ary ny anaran-dreniny dia Joadina avy any Jerosalema.', 'dimy amby roapolo taona izy, tamin’izy nanomboka nanjaka, ary sivy amby roapolo taona no nanjakany tany jerosalema. ary ny anaran-dreniny dia joadina avy any jerosalema.'),
  ('6ab25a625e55d2008a98f276', '2026-09-22T10:37:22.395Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:22.395Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 14, 9, 'Dia naniraka olona nankany amin’i Amazia mpanjakan’ny Joda i Joasy mpanjakan’ny Israely, hilaza hoe: “Nandefa iraka ho any amin’ny hazo sedera tany Libanona ny tsilo tany Libanona, nanao hoe: ‘Omeo ho vadin’ny zanako lahy ny zanakao vavy.’ Nandalo anefa ny bibidia iray tany Libanona, ka nanosihosy an’ilay tsilo.', 'dia naniraka olona nankany amin’i amazia mpanjakan’ny joda i joasy mpanjakan’ny israely, hilaza hoe: “nandefa iraka ho any amin’ny hazo sedera tany libanona ny tsilo tany libanona, nanao hoe: ‘omeo ho vadin’ny zanako lahy ny zanakao vavy.’ nandalo anefa ny bibidia iray tany libanona, ka nanosihosy an’ilay tsilo.'),
  ('6ab25a625e55d2008a98f270', '2026-09-22T10:37:22.395Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:22.395Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 14, 3, 'Nanao izay mahitsy teo imason’i Jehovah foana izy, saingy tsy toy ny nataon’i Davida razambeny. Toy izay rehetra nataon’i Joasy rainy no nataony.', 'nanao izay mahitsy teo imason’i jehovah foana izy, saingy tsy toy ny nataon’i davida razambeny. toy izay rehetra nataon’i joasy rainy no nataony.'),
  ('6ab25a625e55d2008a98f27a', '2026-09-22T10:37:22.395Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:22.395Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 14, 13, 'Ary i Amazia mpanjakan’ny Joda zanak’i Joasy zanak’i Ahazia, no nosamborin’i Joasy mpanjakan’ny Israely tany Beti-semesy. Dia nankany Jerosalema izy ireo. Ary nanagorobahan’i Joasy efajato hakiho * ny mandan’i Jerosalema, nanomboka teo amin’ny Vavahadin’i Efraima ka hatreo amin’ny Vavahady An-jorony.', 'ary i amazia mpanjakan’ny joda zanak’i joasy zanak’i ahazia, no nosamborin’i joasy mpanjakan’ny israely tany beti-semesy. dia nankany jerosalema izy ireo. ary nanagorobahan’i joasy efajato hakiho * ny mandan’i jerosalema, nanomboka teo amin’ny vavahadin’i efraima ka hatreo amin’ny vavahady an-jorony.'),
  ('6ab25a625e55d2008a98f273', '2026-09-22T10:37:22.395Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:22.395Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 14, 6, 'Tsy novonoiny anefa ny zanak’ireo mpamono, araka ny voasoratra ao amin’ny boky misy ny lalàn’i Mosesy, izay misy izao didin’i Jehovah izao: “Ny ray tsy tokony hovonoina ho faty noho ny ataon’ny zanaka, ary ny zanaka tsy tokony hovonoina ho faty noho ny ataon’ny ray. Noho ny fahotany ihany no tokony hamonoana ny tsirairay.”', 'tsy novonoiny anefa ny zanak’ireo mpamono, araka ny voasoratra ao amin’ny boky misy ny lalàn’i mosesy, izay misy izao didin’i jehovah izao: “ny ray tsy tokony hovonoina ho faty noho ny ataon’ny zanaka, ary ny zanaka tsy tokony hovonoina ho faty noho ny ataon’ny ray. noho ny fahotany ihany no tokony hamonoana ny tsirairay.”'),
  ('6ab25a625e55d2008a98f285', '2026-09-22T10:37:22.396Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:22.396Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 14, 24, 'Ary nanao izay ratsy teo imason’i Jehovah foana izy, ka tsy niala tamin’ny fahotana rehetra nataon’i Jeroboama zanak’i Nebata, izay nampanotany ny Israely.', 'ary nanao izay ratsy teo imason’i jehovah foana izy, ka tsy niala tamin’ny fahotana rehetra nataon’i jeroboama zanak’i nebata, izay nampanotany ny israely.'),
  ('6ab25a625e55d2008a98f284', '2026-09-22T10:37:22.396Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:22.396Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 14, 23, 'Tamin’ny taona fahadimy ambin’ny folo nanjakan’i Amazia zanak’i Joasy mpanjakan’ny Joda, no lasa mpanjaka tany Samaria i Jeroboama zanak’i Joasy mpanjakan’ny Israely. Ary iraika amby efapolo taona no nanjakany.', 'tamin’ny taona fahadimy ambin’ny folo nanjakan’i amazia zanak’i joasy mpanjakan’ny joda, no lasa mpanjaka tany samaria i jeroboama zanak’i joasy mpanjakan’ny israely. ary iraika amby efapolo taona no nanjakany.'),
  ('6ab25a625e55d2008a98f283', '2026-09-22T10:37:22.396Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:22.396Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 14, 22, 'Izy no nanorina an’i Elata ka nampody azy tamin’ny Joda, rehefa nodimandry any amin’ny razany ny mpanjaka.', 'izy no nanorina an’i elata ka nampody azy tamin’ny joda, rehefa nodimandry any amin’ny razany ny mpanjaka.'),
  ('6ab25a625e55d2008a98f282', '2026-09-22T10:37:22.396Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:22.396Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 14, 21, 'Dia nalain’ny mponin’i Joda rehetra i Azaria, izay enina ambin’ny folo taona, ka nataony mpanjaka handimby an’i Amazia rainy.', 'dia nalain’ny mponin’i joda rehetra i azaria, izay enina ambin’ny folo taona, ka nataony mpanjaka handimby an’i amazia rainy.'),
  ('6ab25a625e55d2008a98f288', '2026-09-22T10:37:22.396Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:22.396Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 14, 27, 'Efa nampanantena anefa i Jehovah fa tsy hanafoana ny anaran’ny Israely tsy ho etỳ ambanin’ny lanitra. Koa novonjeny tamin’ny alalan’i Jeroboama zanak’i Joasy izy ireo.', 'efa nampanantena anefa i jehovah fa tsy hanafoana ny anaran’ny israely tsy ho etỳ ambanin’ny lanitra. koa novonjeny tamin’ny alalan’i jeroboama zanak’i joasy izy ireo.'),
  ('6ab25a625e55d2008a98f27f', '2026-09-22T10:37:22.396Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:22.396Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 14, 18, 'Ary ny sisa amin’ny tantaran’i Amazia, tsy efa voasoratra ao amin’ny boky mirakitra ny tantara tamin’ny andron’ireo mpanjakan’ny Joda ve izany?', 'ary ny sisa amin’ny tantaran’i amazia, tsy efa voasoratra ao amin’ny boky mirakitra ny tantara tamin’ny andron’ireo mpanjakan’ny joda ve izany?'),
  ('6ab25a625e55d2008a98f27b', '2026-09-22T10:37:22.396Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:22.396Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 14, 14, 'Dia nalainy avokoa ny volamena sy ny volafotsy ary ny fitaovana tao an-tranon’i Jehovah, sy ny zava-tsarobidy notehirizina tao an-tranon’ny mpanjaka. Nisy koa olona nalainy ho takalon’aina. Dia niverina tany Samaria izy.', 'dia nalainy avokoa ny volamena sy ny volafotsy ary ny fitaovana tao an-tranon’i jehovah, sy ny zava-tsarobidy notehirizina tao an-tranon’ny mpanjaka. nisy koa olona nalainy ho takalon’aina. dia niverina tany samaria izy.'),
  ('6ab25a625e55d2008a98f280', '2026-09-22T10:37:22.396Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:22.396Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 14, 19, 'Tatỳ aoriana, dia nisy niray tetika hanohitra azy tany Jerosalema, ka nandositra tany Lakisy izy. Nisy nirahina hanenjika azy tany anefa ka namono azy tany.', 'tatỳ aoriana, dia nisy niray tetika hanohitra azy tany jerosalema, ka nandositra tany lakisy izy. nisy nirahina hanenjika azy tany anefa ka namono azy tany.'),
  ('6ab25a625e55d2008a98f27c', '2026-09-22T10:37:22.396Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:22.396Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 14, 15, 'Ary ny sisa amin’ny tantaran’i Joasy, dia izay nataony sy ny heriny, ary ny niadiany tamin’i Amazia mpanjakan’ny Joda, tsy efa voasoratra ao amin’ny boky mirakitra ny tantara tamin’ny andron’ireo mpanjakan’ny Israely ve izany?', 'ary ny sisa amin’ny tantaran’i joasy, dia izay nataony sy ny heriny, ary ny niadiany tamin’i amazia mpanjakan’ny joda, tsy efa voasoratra ao amin’ny boky mirakitra ny tantara tamin’ny andron’ireo mpanjakan’ny israely ve izany?'),
  ('6ab25a625e55d2008a98f28a', '2026-09-22T10:37:22.396Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:22.396Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 14, 29, 'Farany dia nodimandry any amin’ny razany, any amin’ireo mpanjakan’ny Israely, i Jeroboama. Ary i Zakaria zanany no nanjaka nandimby azy.', 'farany dia nodimandry any amin’ny razany, any amin’ireo mpanjakan’ny israely, i jeroboama. ary i zakaria zanany no nanjaka nandimby azy.'),
  ('6ab25a625e55d2008a98f287', '2026-09-22T10:37:22.396Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:22.396Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 14, 26, 'Fa hitan’i Jehovah ny fahoriana tena mangidy nanjo ny Israely. Ary na ny tsy misy mpiaro sy ny tsy misy ilana azy aza, dia tsy nisy teo amin’ny Israely. Tsy nisy mpamonjy koa ny Israely.', 'fa hitan’i jehovah ny fahoriana tena mangidy nanjo ny israely. ary na ny tsy misy mpiaro sy ny tsy misy ilana azy aza, dia tsy nisy teo amin’ny israely. tsy nisy mpamonjy koa ny israely.'),
  ('6ab25a625e55d2008a98f286', '2026-09-22T10:37:22.396Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:22.396Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 14, 25, 'Izy no namerina tamin’ny Israely ny sisin-taniny, hatreo amin’ny sisin’ny faritr’i Hamata ka hatrany amin’ny ranomasin’i Araba. Izany dia araka ny tenin’i Jehovah Andriamanitry ny Israely, tamin’ny alalan’i Jona mpanompony, zanak’i Amitahy, dia ilay mpaminany avy any Gata-hefera.', 'izy no namerina tamin’ny israely ny sisin-taniny, hatreo amin’ny sisin’ny faritr’i hamata ka hatrany amin’ny ranomasin’i araba. izany dia araka ny tenin’i jehovah andriamanitry ny israely, tamin’ny alalan’i jona mpanompony, zanak’i amitahy, dia ilay mpaminany avy any gata-hefera.'),
  ('6ab25a625e55d2008a98f27d', '2026-09-22T10:37:22.396Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:22.396Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 14, 16, 'Farany dia nodimandry any amin’ny razany i Joasy, ka nalevina tany Samaria niaraka tamin’ireo mpanjakan’ny Israely. Ary i Jeroboama zanany no nanjaka nandimby azy.', 'farany dia nodimandry any amin’ny razany i joasy, ka nalevina tany samaria niaraka tamin’ireo mpanjakan’ny israely. ary i jeroboama zanany no nanjaka nandimby azy.'),
  ('6ab25a625e55d2008a98f289', '2026-09-22T10:37:22.396Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:22.396Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 14, 28, 'Ary tsy efa voasoratra ao amin’ny boky mirakitra ny tantara tamin’ny andron’ireo mpanjakan’ny Israely ve ny sisa amin’ny tantaran’i Jeroboama, mbamin’izay rehetra nataony sy ny heriny, sy ny niadiany ary ny nampodiany an’i Damaskosy sy Hamata tamin’ny Joda sy Israely?', 'ary tsy efa voasoratra ao amin’ny boky mirakitra ny tantara tamin’ny andron’ireo mpanjakan’ny israely ve ny sisa amin’ny tantaran’i jeroboama, mbamin’izay rehetra nataony sy ny heriny, sy ny niadiany ary ny nampodiany an’i damaskosy sy hamata tamin’ny joda sy israely?'),
  ('6ab25a625e55d2008a98f281', '2026-09-22T10:37:22.396Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:22.396Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 14, 20, 'Ary nentina tamin’ny soavaly ny fatiny ka nalevina any amin’ny razany tany Jerosalema, tao amin’ny Tanànan’i Davida.', 'ary nentina tamin’ny soavaly ny fatiny ka nalevina any amin’ny razany tany jerosalema, tao amin’ny tanànan’i davida.'),
  ('6ab25a625e55d2008a98f27e', '2026-09-22T10:37:22.396Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:22.396Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 14, 17, 'Mbola velona dimy ambin’ny folo taona i Amazia zanak’i Joasy mpanjakan’ny Joda, taorian’ny nahafatesan’i Joasy zanak’i Joahaza mpanjakan’ny Israely.', 'mbola velona dimy ambin’ny folo taona i amazia zanak’i joasy mpanjakan’ny joda, taorian’ny nahafatesan’i joasy zanak’i joahaza mpanjakan’ny israely.'),
  ('6ab25a63f664b270cdb90561', '2026-09-22T10:37:23.502Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:23.502Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 15, 5, 'Farany, dia namely ny mpanjaka i Jehovah. Koa boka mandra-pahafatiny izy, ka nipetraka tao an-tranony, fa tsy afaka namita ny andraikiny. Ary i Jotama zanaky ny mpanjaka no niandraikitra ny trano, ka nitsara ny vahoaka.', 'farany, dia namely ny mpanjaka i jehovah. koa boka mandra-pahafatiny izy, ka nipetraka tao an-tranony, fa tsy afaka namita ny andraikiny. ary i jotama zanaky ny mpanjaka no niandraikitra ny trano, ka nitsara ny vahoaka.'),
  ('6ab25a63f664b270cdb90563', '2026-09-22T10:37:23.502Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:23.502Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 15, 7, 'Farany, dia nodimandry any amin’ny razany i Azaria, ka nalevina any amin’ny razany, tao amin’ny Tanànan’i Davida. Ary i Jotama zanany no nanjaka nandimby azy.', 'farany, dia nodimandry any amin’ny razany i azaria, ka nalevina any amin’ny razany, tao amin’ny tanànan’i davida. ary i jotama zanany no nanjaka nandimby azy.'),
  ('6ab25a63f664b270cdb90564', '2026-09-22T10:37:23.502Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:23.502Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 15, 8, 'Tamin’ny taona fahavalo amby telopolo nanjakan’i Azaria mpanjakan’ny Joda, no lasa mpanjakan’ny Israely i Zakaria zanak’i Jeroboama. Ary enim-bolana no nanjakan’i Zakaria tany Samaria.', 'tamin’ny taona fahavalo amby telopolo nanjakan’i azaria mpanjakan’ny joda, no lasa mpanjakan’ny israely i zakaria zanak’i jeroboama. ary enim-bolana no nanjakan’i zakaria tany samaria.'),
  ('6ab25a63f664b270cdb90567', '2026-09-22T10:37:23.502Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:23.503Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 15, 11, 'Ary ny sisa amin’ny tantaran’i Zakaria, dia efa voasoratra ao amin’ny boky mirakitra ny tantara tamin’ny andron’ireo mpanjakan’ny Israely.', 'ary ny sisa amin’ny tantaran’i zakaria, dia efa voasoratra ao amin’ny boky mirakitra ny tantara tamin’ny andron’ireo mpanjakan’ny israely.'),
  ('6ab25a63f664b270cdb90565', '2026-09-22T10:37:23.502Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:23.502Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 15, 9, 'Ary nanao izay ratsy teo imason’i Jehovah foana izy, toy ny nataon’ny razany, ka tsy niala tamin’ny fahotan’i Jeroboama zanak’i Nebata, izay nampanotany ny Israely.', 'ary nanao izay ratsy teo imason’i jehovah foana izy, toy ny nataon’ny razany, ka tsy niala tamin’ny fahotan’i jeroboama zanak’i nebata, izay nampanotany ny israely.'),
  ('6ab25a63f664b270cdb90560', '2026-09-22T10:37:23.502Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:23.502Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 15, 4, 'Mbola tsy nesorina anefa ny toerana avo, ary mbola nanao sorona sy nanolotra setroka ho sorona teny ihany ny olona.', 'mbola tsy nesorina anefa ny toerana avo, ary mbola nanao sorona sy nanolotra setroka ho sorona teny ihany ny olona.'),
  ('6ab25a63f664b270cdb90566', '2026-09-22T10:37:23.502Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:23.502Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 15, 10, 'Ary nanao tetika i Saloma zanak’i Jabesy ka namely azy tany Ibleama, dia namono azy ho faty, ary nanjaka nandimby azy.', 'ary nanao tetika i saloma zanak’i jabesy ka namely azy tany ibleama, dia namono azy ho faty, ary nanjaka nandimby azy.'),
  ('6ab25a63f664b270cdb90562', '2026-09-22T10:37:23.502Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:23.502Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 15, 6, 'Ary ny sisa amin’ny tantaran’i Azaria, mbamin’izay rehetra nataony, tsy efa voasoratra ao amin’ny boky mirakitra ny tantara tamin’ny andron’ireo mpanjakan’ny Joda ve izany?', 'ary ny sisa amin’ny tantaran’i azaria, mbamin’izay rehetra nataony, tsy efa voasoratra ao amin’ny boky mirakitra ny tantara tamin’ny andron’ireo mpanjakan’ny joda ve izany?'),
  ('6ab25a63f664b270cdb9055f', '2026-09-22T10:37:23.502Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:23.502Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 15, 3, 'Ary nanao izay mahitsy teo imason’i Jehovah izy, toy izay rehetra nataon’i Amazia rainy.', 'ary nanao izay mahitsy teo imason’i jehovah izy, toy izay rehetra nataon’i amazia rainy.'),
  ('6ab25a63f664b270cdb9055e', '2026-09-22T10:37:23.502Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:23.502Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 15, 2, 'Enina ambin’ny folo taona i Azaria, tamin’izy nanomboka nanjaka, ary roa amby dimampolo taona no nanjakany tany Jerosalema. Ny anaran-dreniny dia Jekolia avy any Jerosalema.', 'enina ambin’ny folo taona i azaria, tamin’izy nanomboka nanjaka, ary roa amby dimampolo taona no nanjakany tany jerosalema. ny anaran-dreniny dia jekolia avy any jerosalema.'),
  ('6ab25a63f664b270cdb9055d', '2026-09-22T10:37:23.502Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:23.502Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 15, 1, 'Tamin’ny taona fahafito amby roapolo nanjakan’i Jeroboama mpanjakan’ny Israely, no lasa mpanjaka i Azaria zanak’i Amazia mpanjakan’ny Joda.', 'tamin’ny taona fahafito amby roapolo nanjakan’i jeroboama mpanjakan’ny israely, no lasa mpanjaka i azaria zanak’i amazia mpanjakan’ny joda.'),
  ('6ab25a63f664b270cdb9056b', '2026-09-22T10:37:23.503Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:23.503Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 15, 15, 'Ary ny sisa amin’ny tantaran’i Saloma sy ny teti-dratsiny, dia efa voasoratra ao amin’ny boky mirakitra ny tantara tamin’ny andron’ireo mpanjakan’ny Israely.', 'ary ny sisa amin’ny tantaran’i saloma sy ny teti-dratsiny, dia efa voasoratra ao amin’ny boky mirakitra ny tantara tamin’ny andron’ireo mpanjakan’ny israely.'),
  ('6ab25a63f664b270cdb90581', '2026-09-22T10:37:23.503Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:23.503Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 15, 37, 'Tamin’izany andro izany i Jehovah no nanomboka nandefa an’i Rezina mpanjakan’i Syria sy Peka zanak’i Remalia, mba hamely ny Joda.', 'tamin’izany andro izany i jehovah no nanomboka nandefa an’i rezina mpanjakan’i syria sy peka zanak’i remalia, mba hamely ny joda.'),
  ('6ab25a63f664b270cdb9057d', '2026-09-22T10:37:23.503Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:23.503Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 15, 33, 'Dimy amby roapolo taona i Jotama tamin’izy nanomboka nanjaka, ary enina ambin’ny folo taona no nanjakany tany Jerosalema. Ny anaran-dreniny dia Jerosa zanak’i Zadoka.', 'dimy amby roapolo taona i jotama tamin’izy nanomboka nanjaka, ary enina ambin’ny folo taona no nanjakany tany jerosalema. ny anaran-dreniny dia jerosa zanak’i zadoka.'),
  ('6ab25a63f664b270cdb90574', '2026-09-22T10:37:23.503Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:23.503Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 15, 24, 'Ary nanao izay ratsy teo imason’i Jehovah foana izy, ka tsy niala tamin’ny fahotan’i Jeroboama zanak’i Nebata, izay nampanotany ny Israely.', 'ary nanao izay ratsy teo imason’i jehovah foana izy, ka tsy niala tamin’ny fahotan’i jeroboama zanak’i nebata, izay nampanotany ny israely.'),
  ('6ab25a63f664b270cdb90571', '2026-09-22T10:37:23.503Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:23.503Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 15, 21, 'Ary ny sisa amin’ny tantaran’i Menahema, mbamin’izay rehetra nataony, tsy efa voasoratra ao amin’ny boky mirakitra ny tantara tamin’ny andron’ireo mpanjakan’ny Israely ve izany?', 'ary ny sisa amin’ny tantaran’i menahema, mbamin’izay rehetra nataony, tsy efa voasoratra ao amin’ny boky mirakitra ny tantara tamin’ny andron’ireo mpanjakan’ny israely ve izany?'),
  ('6ab25a63f664b270cdb90580', '2026-09-22T10:37:23.503Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:23.503Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 15, 36, 'Ary ny sisa amin’ny tantaran’i Jotama, dia izay nataony, tsy efa voasoratra ao amin’ny boky mirakitra ny tantara tamin’ny andron’ireo mpanjakan’ny Joda ve izany?', 'ary ny sisa amin’ny tantaran’i jotama, dia izay nataony, tsy efa voasoratra ao amin’ny boky mirakitra ny tantara tamin’ny andron’ireo mpanjakan’ny joda ve izany?'),
  ('6ab25a63f664b270cdb9057b', '2026-09-22T10:37:23.503Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:23.503Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 15, 31, 'Ary ny sisa amin’ny tantaran’i Peka, mbamin’izay rehetra nataony, dia efa voasoratra ao amin’ny boky mirakitra ny tantara tamin’ny andron’ireo mpanjakan’ny Israely.', 'ary ny sisa amin’ny tantaran’i peka, mbamin’izay rehetra nataony, dia efa voasoratra ao amin’ny boky mirakitra ny tantara tamin’ny andron’ireo mpanjakan’ny israely.'),
  ('6ab25a63f664b270cdb90579', '2026-09-22T10:37:23.503Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:23.503Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 15, 29, 'Tamin’ny andron’i Peka mpanjakan’ny Israely i Tiglato-pilesera mpanjakan’i Asyria no tonga naka ny tanin’i Naftaly manontolo, dia i Iona sy Abela-beti-maka sy Janoha sy Kedesy sy Hazora sy Gileada ary Galilia. Ary nataony sesitany tany Asyria ny mponin’ireo.', 'tamin’ny andron’i peka mpanjakan’ny israely i tiglato-pilesera mpanjakan’i asyria no tonga naka ny tanin’i naftaly manontolo, dia i iona sy abela-beti-maka sy janoha sy kedesy sy hazora sy gileada ary galilia. ary nataony sesitany tany asyria ny mponin’ireo.'),
  ('6ab25a63f664b270cdb90578', '2026-09-22T10:37:23.503Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:23.503Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 15, 28, 'Ary nanao izay ratsy teo imason’i Jehovah foana izy, ka tsy niala tamin’ny fahotan’i Jeroboama zanak’i Nebata, izay nampanotany ny Israely.', 'ary nanao izay ratsy teo imason’i jehovah foana izy, ka tsy niala tamin’ny fahotan’i jeroboama zanak’i nebata, izay nampanotany ny israely.'),
  ('6ab25a63f664b270cdb9056f', '2026-09-22T10:37:23.503Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:23.503Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 15, 19, 'Ary tonga teo amin’ilay tany i Pola mpanjakan’i Asyria. Dia nomen’i Menahema talenta volafotsy arivo i Pola, mba hanampian’i Pola azy hanamafy orina ny fahefany teo amin’ny fanjakany.', 'ary tonga teo amin’ilay tany i pola mpanjakan’i asyria. dia nomen’i menahema talenta volafotsy arivo i pola, mba hanampian’i pola azy hanamafy orina ny fahefany teo amin’ny fanjakany.'),
  ('6ab25a63f664b270cdb90577', '2026-09-22T10:37:23.503Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:23.503Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 15, 27, 'Tamin’ny taona faharoa amby dimampolo nanjakan’i Azaria mpanjakan’ny Joda, no lasa mpanjakan’ny Israely tany Samaria i Peka zanak’i Remalia. Ary roapolo taona no nanjakan’i Peka.', 'tamin’ny taona faharoa amby dimampolo nanjakan’i azaria mpanjakan’ny joda, no lasa mpanjakan’ny israely tany samaria i peka zanak’i remalia. ary roapolo taona no nanjakan’i peka.'),
  ('6ab25a63f664b270cdb9056a', '2026-09-22T10:37:23.503Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:23.503Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 15, 14, 'I Menahema zanak’i Gady kosa niakatra avy any Tirza, ka tonga tany Samaria. Dia namely an’i Saloma zanak’i Jabesy tany Samaria izy, ka namono azy ho faty. Ary izy no nanjaka nandimby azy.', 'i menahema zanak’i gady kosa niakatra avy any tirza, ka tonga tany samaria. dia namely an’i saloma zanak’i jabesy tany samaria izy, ka namono azy ho faty. ary izy no nanjaka nandimby azy.'),
  ('6ab25a63f664b270cdb90570', '2026-09-22T10:37:23.503Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:23.503Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 15, 20, 'Dia navoakan’i Menahema ny volafotsy nasainy naloan’ny Israely, mba homena ny mpanjakan’i Asyria. Nasainy nandoa sekely volafotsy dimampolo avy mantsy ny lehilahy matanjaka sy mahery fo rehetra. Dia lasa ny mpanjakan’i Asyria, fa tsy nijanona teo amin’ilay tany.', 'dia navoakan’i menahema ny volafotsy nasainy naloan’ny israely, mba homena ny mpanjakan’i asyria. nasainy nandoa sekely volafotsy dimampolo avy mantsy ny lehilahy matanjaka sy mahery fo rehetra. dia lasa ny mpanjakan’i asyria, fa tsy nijanona teo amin’ilay tany.'),
  ('6ab25a63f664b270cdb9056c', '2026-09-22T10:37:23.503Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:23.503Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 15, 16, 'Tamin’izay i Menahema no tonga avy any Tirza, mba hamely ny tanànan’i Tifsa sy izay rehetra tao aminy ary ny faritaniny. Tsy nanokatra vavahady mantsy ny mponina tao, ka nasiany. Ary notatahiny ny kibon’ny vehivavy bevohoka rehetra tao.', 'tamin’izay i menahema no tonga avy any tirza, mba hamely ny tanànan’i tifsa sy izay rehetra tao aminy ary ny faritaniny. tsy nanokatra vavahady mantsy ny mponina tao, ka nasiany. ary notatahiny ny kibon’ny vehivavy bevohoka rehetra tao.'),
  ('6ab25a63f664b270cdb90569', '2026-09-22T10:37:23.503Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:23.503Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 15, 13, 'Ary lasa mpanjaka i Saloma zanak’i Jabesy, tamin’ny taona fahasivy amby telopolo nanjakan’i Ozia mpanjakan’ny Joda. Ary iray volana feno no nanjakany tany Samaria.', 'ary lasa mpanjaka i saloma zanak’i jabesy, tamin’ny taona fahasivy amby telopolo nanjakan’i ozia mpanjakan’ny joda. ary iray volana feno no nanjakany tany samaria.'),
  ('6ab25a63f664b270cdb90573', '2026-09-22T10:37:23.503Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:23.503Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 15, 23, 'Tamin’ny taona fahadimampolo nanjakan’i Azaria mpanjakan’ny Joda, no lasa mpanjakan’ny Israely i Pekahia zanak’i Menahema. Ary roa taona no nanjakan’i Pekahia tany Samaria.', 'tamin’ny taona fahadimampolo nanjakan’i azaria mpanjakan’ny joda, no lasa mpanjakan’ny israely i pekahia zanak’i menahema. ary roa taona no nanjakan’i pekahia tany samaria.'),
  ('6ab25a63f664b270cdb90572', '2026-09-22T10:37:23.503Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:23.503Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 15, 22, 'Farany, dia nodimandry any amin’ny razany i Menahema, ary i Pekahia zanany no nanjaka nandimby azy.', 'farany, dia nodimandry any amin’ny razany i menahema, ary i pekahia zanany no nanjaka nandimby azy.'),
  ('6ab25a63f664b270cdb9056d', '2026-09-22T10:37:23.503Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:23.503Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 15, 17, 'Tamin’ny taona fahasivy amby telopolo nanjakan’i Azaria mpanjakan’ny Joda, no lasa mpanjakan’ny Israely i Menahema zanak’i Gady. Ary folo taona no nanjakan’i Menahema tany Samaria.', 'tamin’ny taona fahasivy amby telopolo nanjakan’i azaria mpanjakan’ny joda, no lasa mpanjakan’ny israely i menahema zanak’i gady. ary folo taona no nanjakan’i menahema tany samaria.'),
  ('6ab25a63f664b270cdb9056e', '2026-09-22T10:37:23.503Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:23.503Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 15, 18, 'Ary nanao izay ratsy teo imason’i Jehovah foana izy tamin’ny andro rehetra niainany, ka tsy niala tamin’ny fahotana rehetra nataon’i Jeroboama zanak’i Nebata, izay nampanotany ny Israely.', 'ary nanao izay ratsy teo imason’i jehovah foana izy tamin’ny andro rehetra niainany, ka tsy niala tamin’ny fahotana rehetra nataon’i jeroboama zanak’i nebata, izay nampanotany ny israely.'),
  ('6ab25a63f664b270cdb90582', '2026-09-22T10:37:23.503Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:23.503Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 15, 38, 'Farany, dia nodimandry any amin’ny razany i Jotama, ka nalevina any amin’ny razany, tao amin’ny Tanànan’i Davida razambeny. Ary i Ahaza zanany no nanjaka nandimby azy.', 'farany, dia nodimandry any amin’ny razany i jotama, ka nalevina any amin’ny razany, tao amin’ny tanànan’i davida razambeny. ary i ahaza zanany no nanjaka nandimby azy.'),
  ('6ab25a63f664b270cdb90568', '2026-09-22T10:37:23.503Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:23.503Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 15, 12, 'Izany ilay nolazain’i Jehovah tamin’i Jeho hoe: “Hisy zanakao lahy handimby anao eo amin’ny seza fiandrianan’ny Israely, hatrany amin’ny zafiafinao.” Dia tanteraka tokoa izany.', 'izany ilay nolazain’i jehovah tamin’i jeho hoe: “hisy zanakao lahy handimby anao eo amin’ny seza fiandrianan’ny israely, hatrany amin’ny zafiafinao.” dia tanteraka tokoa izany.'),
  ('6ab25a63f664b270cdb9057a', '2026-09-22T10:37:23.503Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:23.503Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 15, 30, 'Farany, dia nikomy tamin’i Peka zanak’i Remalia i Hosea zanak’i Elaha, ary namely azy ka nahafaty azy. Ary izy no nanjaka nandimby azy, tamin’ny taona faharoapolo nanjakan’i Jotama zanak’i Ozia.', 'farany, dia nikomy tamin’i peka zanak’i remalia i hosea zanak’i elaha, ary namely azy ka nahafaty azy. ary izy no nanjaka nandimby azy, tamin’ny taona faharoapolo nanjakan’i jotama zanak’i ozia.'),
  ('6ab25a63f664b270cdb90575', '2026-09-22T10:37:23.503Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:23.503Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 15, 25, 'Ary nikomy taminy i Peka zanak’i Remalia manamboninahitra lefiny. Dia novonoin’i Peka tao amin’ny tilikambo fonenana teo amin’ny tranon’ny mpanjaka izy sy Argoba ary Aria, tany Samaria. Nisy dimampolo lahy taranak’i Gileada, niaraka tamin’i Peka. Dia namono azy i Peka, ka nanjaka nandimby azy.', 'ary nikomy taminy i peka zanak’i remalia manamboninahitra lefiny. dia novonoin’i peka tao amin’ny tilikambo fonenana teo amin’ny tranon’ny mpanjaka izy sy argoba ary aria, tany samaria. nisy dimampolo lahy taranak’i gileada, niaraka tamin’i peka. dia namono azy i peka, ka nanjaka nandimby azy.'),
  ('6ab25a63f664b270cdb9057f', '2026-09-22T10:37:23.503Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:23.503Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 15, 35, 'Mbola tsy nesorina anefa ny toerana avo, ary mbola nanao sorona sy nanolotra setroka ho sorona teny ihany ny olona. Izy no nanorina ny vavahady ambony tamin’ny tranon’i Jehovah.', 'mbola tsy nesorina anefa ny toerana avo, ary mbola nanao sorona sy nanolotra setroka ho sorona teny ihany ny olona. izy no nanorina ny vavahady ambony tamin’ny tranon’i jehovah.'),
  ('6ab25a63f664b270cdb9057e', '2026-09-22T10:37:23.503Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:23.503Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 15, 34, 'Ary nanao izay mahitsy teo imason’i Jehovah foana izy, toy izay rehetra nataon’i Ozia rainy.', 'ary nanao izay mahitsy teo imason’i jehovah foana izy, toy izay rehetra nataon’i ozia rainy.'),
  ('6ab25a63f664b270cdb9057c', '2026-09-22T10:37:23.503Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:23.503Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 15, 32, 'Tamin’ny taona faharoa nanjakan’i Peka zanak’i Remalia mpanjakan’ny Israely, no lasa mpanjaka i Jotama zanak’i Ozia mpanjakan’ny Joda.', 'tamin’ny taona faharoa nanjakan’i peka zanak’i remalia mpanjakan’ny israely, no lasa mpanjaka i jotama zanak’i ozia mpanjakan’ny joda.'),
  ('6ab25a63f664b270cdb90576', '2026-09-22T10:37:23.503Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:23.503Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 15, 26, 'Ary ny sisa amin’ny tantaran’i Pekahia, mbamin’izay rehetra nataony, dia efa voasoratra ao amin’ny boky mirakitra ny tantara tamin’ny andron’ireo mpanjakan’ny Israely.', 'ary ny sisa amin’ny tantaran’i pekahia, mbamin’izay rehetra nataony, dia efa voasoratra ao amin’ny boky mirakitra ny tantara tamin’ny andron’ireo mpanjakan’ny israely.'),
  ('6ab25a641101a7f157639b96', '2026-09-22T10:37:24.748Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:24.748Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 16, 4, 'Ary nanao sorona sy nanolotra setroka ho sorona foana izy, teny amin’ny toerana avo sy ny havoana ary teny ambanin’ny hazo midoroboka rehetra.', 'ary nanao sorona sy nanolotra setroka ho sorona foana izy, teny amin’ny toerana avo sy ny havoana ary teny ambanin’ny hazo midoroboka rehetra.'),
  ('6ab25a641101a7f157639b93', '2026-09-22T10:37:24.748Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:24.748Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 16, 1, 'Tamin’ny taona fahafito ambin’ny folo nanjakan’i Peka zanak’i Remalia, no lasa mpanjaka i Ahaza zanak’i Jotama mpanjakan’ny Joda.', 'tamin’ny taona fahafito ambin’ny folo nanjakan’i peka zanak’i remalia, no lasa mpanjaka i ahaza zanak’i jotama mpanjakan’ny joda.'),
  ('6ab25a641101a7f157639b94', '2026-09-22T10:37:24.748Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:24.748Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 16, 2, 'Roapolo taona i Ahaza tamin’izy nanomboka nanjaka, ary enina ambin’ny folo taona no nanjakany tany Jerosalema. Ary tsy nanao izay mahitsy teo imason’i Jehovah Andriamaniny izy, tsy mba toa an’i Davida razambeny.', 'roapolo taona i ahaza tamin’izy nanomboka nanjaka, ary enina ambin’ny folo taona no nanjakany tany jerosalema. ary tsy nanao izay mahitsy teo imason’i jehovah andriamaniny izy, tsy mba toa an’i davida razambeny.'),
  ('6ab25a641101a7f157639b97', '2026-09-22T10:37:24.748Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:24.748Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 16, 5, 'Tamin’izay i Rezina mpanjakan’i Syria sy Peka zanak’i Remalia mpanjakan’ny Israely, no niakatra hiady tamin’i Jerosalema sy hanao fahirano an’i Ahaza, nefa tsy naharesy.', 'tamin’izay i rezina mpanjakan’i syria sy peka zanak’i remalia mpanjakan’ny israely, no niakatra hiady tamin’i jerosalema sy hanao fahirano an’i ahaza, nefa tsy naharesy.'),
  ('6ab25a641101a7f157639b95', '2026-09-22T10:37:24.748Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:24.748Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 16, 3, 'Nanao hoatran’izay nataon’ireo mpanjakan’ny Israely kosa izy, ka nandoro * ny zanany tao anaty afo. Zava-maharikoriko fanaon’ireo firenena noroahin’i Jehovah noho ny amin’ny zanak’Israely, izany nataony izany.', 'nanao hoatran’izay nataon’ireo mpanjakan’ny israely kosa izy, ka nandoro * ny zanany tao anaty afo. zava-maharikoriko fanaon’ireo firenena noroahin’i jehovah noho ny amin’ny zanak’israely, izany nataony izany.'),
  ('6ab25a641101a7f157639b99', '2026-09-22T10:37:24.749Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:24.749Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 16, 7, 'Nandefa iraka ho any amin’i Tiglato-pilesera mpanjakan’i Asyria àry i Ahaza, nanao hoe: “Mpanomponao aho sady zanakao. Koa miakara hamonjy ahy eo am-pelatanan’ny mpanjakan’i Syria sy ny mpanjakan’ny Israely, fa mitsangana hamely ahy ry zareo.”', 'nandefa iraka ho any amin’i tiglato-pilesera mpanjakan’i asyria àry i ahaza, nanao hoe: “mpanomponao aho sady zanakao. koa miakara hamonjy ahy eo am-pelatanan’ny mpanjakan’i syria sy ny mpanjakan’ny israely, fa mitsangana hamely ahy ry zareo.”'),
  ('6ab25a641101a7f157639ba5', '2026-09-22T10:37:24.749Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:24.749Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 16, 19, 'Ary ny sisa amin’ny tantaran’i Ahaza, dia izay nataony, tsy efa voasoratra ao amin’ny boky mirakitra ny tantara tamin’ny andron’ireo mpanjakan’ny Joda ve izany?', 'ary ny sisa amin’ny tantaran’i ahaza, dia izay nataony, tsy efa voasoratra ao amin’ny boky mirakitra ny tantara tamin’ny andron’ireo mpanjakan’ny joda ve izany?'),
  ('6ab25a641101a7f157639ba4', '2026-09-22T10:37:24.749Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:24.749Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 16, 18, 'Ary noho ny amin’ny mpanjakan’i Asyria, dia nesorin’i Ahaza tsy ho ao an-tranon’i Jehovah ny faritra mitafo fampiasa amin’ny sabata, izay efa tao amin’ilay trano, sy ny varavarana ivelany fidiran’ny mpanjaka.', 'ary noho ny amin’ny mpanjakan’i asyria, dia nesorin’i ahaza tsy ho ao an-tranon’i jehovah ny faritra mitafo fampiasa amin’ny sabata, izay efa tao amin’ilay trano, sy ny varavarana ivelany fidiran’ny mpanjaka.'),
  ('6ab25a641101a7f157639b9a', '2026-09-22T10:37:24.749Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:24.749Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 16, 8, 'Ary nalain’i Ahaza ny volafotsy sy ny volamena tao an-tranon’i Jehovah sy tao amin’ireo zava-tsarobidy notehirizina tao an-tranon’ny mpanjaka, ka nalefany hatao tsolotra ho an’ny mpanjakan’i Asyria.', 'ary nalain’i ahaza ny volafotsy sy ny volamena tao an-tranon’i jehovah sy tao amin’ireo zava-tsarobidy notehirizina tao an-tranon’ny mpanjaka, ka nalefany hatao tsolotra ho an’ny mpanjakan’i asyria.'),
  ('6ab25a641101a7f157639b9b', '2026-09-22T10:37:24.749Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:24.749Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 16, 9, 'Dia nihaino ny teniny ny mpanjakan’i Asyria ka niakatra tany Damaskosy ary namabo azy. Ary nataony sesitany tany Kira ny vahoaka tao, fa i Rezina kosa novonoiny ho faty.', 'dia nihaino ny teniny ny mpanjakan’i asyria ka niakatra tany damaskosy ary namabo azy. ary nataony sesitany tany kira ny vahoaka tao, fa i rezina kosa novonoiny ho faty.'),
  ('6ab25a641101a7f157639b9f', '2026-09-22T10:37:24.749Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:24.749Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 16, 13, 'Ary nodorany mba hidona-tsetroka ny fanatitra dorana sy ny fanatitra varimbazaha natolony. Nandraraka fanatitra zava-pisotro koa izy, ary nafafiny teo ambonin’ilay alitara ny ran’ny sorona iombonana natolony.', 'ary nodorany mba hidona-tsetroka ny fanatitra dorana sy ny fanatitra varimbazaha natolony. nandraraka fanatitra zava-pisotro koa izy, ary nafafiny teo ambonin’ilay alitara ny ran’ny sorona iombonana natolony.'),
  ('6ab25a641101a7f157639ba1', '2026-09-22T10:37:24.749Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:24.749Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 16, 15, 'Ary nandidy an’i Oria mpisorona i Ahaza Mpanjaka hoe: “Eo ambonin’ilay alitara lehibe no dory mba hidona-tsetroka ny fanatitra dorana amin’ny maraina, sy ny fanatitra varimbazaha amin’ny takariva, mbamin’ny fanatitra dorana sy ny fanatitra varimbazaha avy amin’ny mpanjaka, ary ny fanatitra dorana sy ny fanatitra varimbazaha sy ny fanatitra zava-pisotro avy amin’ny vahoaka manontolo. Ary afafazo eo ambonin’io alitara io ny ra rehetra avy amin’ny fanatitra dorana sy avy amin’ny sorona. Fa mbola hodinihiko izay hatao amin’ilay alitara varahina.”', 'ary nandidy an’i oria mpisorona i ahaza mpanjaka hoe: “eo ambonin’ilay alitara lehibe no dory mba hidona-tsetroka ny fanatitra dorana amin’ny maraina, sy ny fanatitra varimbazaha amin’ny takariva, mbamin’ny fanatitra dorana sy ny fanatitra varimbazaha avy amin’ny mpanjaka, ary ny fanatitra dorana sy ny fanatitra varimbazaha sy ny fanatitra zava-pisotro avy amin’ny vahoaka manontolo. ary afafazo eo ambonin’io alitara io ny ra rehetra avy amin’ny fanatitra dorana sy avy amin’ny sorona. fa mbola hodinihiko izay hatao amin’ilay alitara varahina.”'),
  ('6ab25a641101a7f157639b9c', '2026-09-22T10:37:24.749Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:24.749Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 16, 10, 'Ary nandeha nitsena an’i Tiglato-pilesera mpanjakan’i Asyria tany Damaskosy i Ahaza Mpanjaka. Dia hitany ilay alitara tany Damaskosy. Koa nalefany tany amin’i Oria mpisorona ny drafitr’ilay alitara sy ny modely nanaovana azy manontolo.', 'ary nandeha nitsena an’i tiglato-pilesera mpanjakan’i asyria tany damaskosy i ahaza mpanjaka. dia hitany ilay alitara tany damaskosy. koa nalefany tany amin’i oria mpisorona ny drafitr’ilay alitara sy ny modely nanaovana azy manontolo.'),
  ('6ab25a641101a7f157639ba3', '2026-09-22T10:37:24.749Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:24.749Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 16, 17, 'Nopotipotehin’i Ahaza Mpanjaka koa ireo takela-barahina tamin’ireo kalesin’ny tempoly, ary nesoriny ny koveta teny ambonin’ireo kalesy. Ilay fitoeran-drano lehibe nantsoina hoe ranomasina varahina kosa nampidininy avy teo amin’ireo omby varahina, ka napetrany teo amin’ny tokotany vato.', 'nopotipotehin’i ahaza mpanjaka koa ireo takela-barahina tamin’ireo kalesin’ny tempoly, ary nesoriny ny koveta teny ambonin’ireo kalesy. ilay fitoeran-drano lehibe nantsoina hoe ranomasina varahina kosa nampidininy avy teo amin’ireo omby varahina, ka napetrany teo amin’ny tokotany vato.'),
  ('6ab25a641101a7f157639ba0', '2026-09-22T10:37:24.749Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:24.749Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 16, 14, 'Dia nafindrany nankeo avaratry ny alitarany ilay alitara varahina teo anatrehan’i Jehovah, izay teo anoloan’ilay trano, izany hoe teo anelanelan’ny alitarany sy ny tranon’i Jehovah.', 'dia nafindrany nankeo avaratry ny alitarany ilay alitara varahina teo anatrehan’i jehovah, izay teo anoloan’ilay trano, izany hoe teo anelanelan’ny alitarany sy ny tranon’i jehovah.'),
  ('6ab25a641101a7f157639b9d', '2026-09-22T10:37:24.749Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:24.749Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 16, 11, 'Ary nanorina alitara i Oria mpisorona, araka ny toromarika rehetra nalefan’i Ahaza Mpanjaka avy tany Damaskosy. Dia nataon’i Oria izany, mandra-pahatongan’i Ahaza Mpanjaka avy tany Damaskosy.', 'ary nanorina alitara i oria mpisorona, araka ny toromarika rehetra nalefan’i ahaza mpanjaka avy tany damaskosy. dia nataon’i oria izany, mandra-pahatongan’i ahaza mpanjaka avy tany damaskosy.'),
  ('6ab25a641101a7f157639b98', '2026-09-22T10:37:24.749Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:24.749Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 16, 6, 'Tamin’izay koa i Rezina mpanjakan’i Syria no nampody an’i Elata tamin’i Edoma. Dia nesoriny tany Elata ny Jiosy. Koa niditra tany Elata ny Edomita, ka monina any mandraka androany.', 'tamin’izay koa i rezina mpanjakan’i syria no nampody an’i elata tamin’i edoma. dia nesoriny tany elata ny jiosy. koa niditra tany elata ny edomita, ka monina any mandraka androany.'),
  ('6ab25a641101a7f157639ba6', '2026-09-22T10:37:24.749Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:24.749Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 16, 20, 'Farany, dia nodimandry any amin’ny razany i Ahaza, ka nalevina any amin’ny razany, tao amin’ny Tanànan’i Davida. Ary i Hezekia zanany no nanjaka nandimby azy.', 'farany, dia nodimandry any amin’ny razany i ahaza, ka nalevina any amin’ny razany, tao amin’ny tanànan’i davida. ary i hezekia zanany no nanjaka nandimby azy.'),
  ('6ab25a641101a7f157639ba2', '2026-09-22T10:37:24.749Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:24.749Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 16, 16, 'Dia nanao araka izay rehetra nandidian’i Ahaza Mpanjaka i Oria mpisorona.', 'dia nanao araka izay rehetra nandidian’i ahaza mpanjaka i oria mpisorona.'),
  ('6ab25a641101a7f157639b9e', '2026-09-22T10:37:24.749Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:24.749Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 16, 12, 'Rehefa tonga avy tany ny mpanjaka, dia hitany ilay alitara. Ary nankeo izy ka nanolotra fanatitra teo amboniny.', 'rehefa tonga avy tany ny mpanjaka, dia hitany ilay alitara. ary nankeo izy ka nanolotra fanatitra teo amboniny.'),
  ('6ab25a656bb6e173081216a6', '2026-09-22T10:37:25.165Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:25.165Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 17, 1, 'Tamin’ny taona faharoa ambin’ny folo nanjakan’i Ahaza mpanjakan’ny Joda, no lasa mpanjakan’ny Israely tany Samaria i Hosea zanak’i Elaha. Sivy taona no nanjakan’i Hosea,', 'tamin’ny taona faharoa ambin’ny folo nanjakan’i ahaza mpanjakan’ny joda, no lasa mpanjakan’ny israely tany samaria i hosea zanak’i elaha. sivy taona no nanjakan’i hosea,'),
  ('6ab25a656bb6e173081216cb', '2026-09-22T10:37:25.166Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:25.166Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 17, 38, 'Ary aza hadinoina ny fifanekena nataoko taminareo. Aza matahotra andriamani-kafa.', 'ary aza hadinoina ny fifanekena nataoko taminareo. aza matahotra andriamani-kafa.'),
  ('6ab25a656bb6e173081216ca', '2026-09-22T10:37:25.166Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:25.166Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 17, 37, 'Ny fitsipika sy ny didim-pitsarana ary ny lalàna mbamin’ny didy nosoratany ho anareo no tokony hotandremanareo tsara foana. Aza matahotra andriamani-kafa.', 'ny fitsipika sy ny didim-pitsarana ary ny lalàna mbamin’ny didy nosoratany ho anareo no tokony hotandremanareo tsara foana. aza matahotra andriamani-kafa.'),
  ('6ab25a656bb6e173081216c5', '2026-09-22T10:37:25.166Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:25.166Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 17, 32, 'Nanjary natahotra an’i Jehovah izy ireo, ary nanendry mpisoron’ny toerana avo avy tamin’ny sarambabem-bahoaka, ka ireny no niasa ho azy ireo tao amin’ireo trano teny amin’ny toerana avo.', 'nanjary natahotra an’i jehovah izy ireo, ary nanendry mpisoron’ny toerana avo avy tamin’ny sarambabem-bahoaka, ka ireny no niasa ho azy ireo tao amin’ireo trano teny amin’ny toerana avo.'),
  ('6ab25a656bb6e173081216ad', '2026-09-22T10:37:25.166Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:25.166Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 17, 8, 'Ary ny lalàn’ireo firenena noroahin’i Jehovah tsy ho eo anatrehan’ny zanak’Israely, sy ny lalàna noforonin’ny mpanjakan’ny Israely no notandreman’izy ireo.', 'ary ny lalàn’ireo firenena noroahin’i jehovah tsy ho eo anatrehan’ny zanak’israely, sy ny lalàna noforonin’ny mpanjakan’ny israely no notandreman’izy ireo.'),
  ('6ab25a656bb6e173081216c9', '2026-09-22T10:37:25.166Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:25.166Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 17, 36, 'Fa i Jehovah izay nitondra anareo niakatra avy tany Ejipta tamin-kery lehibe sy sandry nahinjitra no tokony hatahoranareo, ary eo anatrehany no tokony hiankohofanareo, ary ho azy no tokony hanaovanareo sorona.', 'fa i jehovah izay nitondra anareo niakatra avy tany ejipta tamin-kery lehibe sy sandry nahinjitra no tokony hatahoranareo, ary eo anatrehany no tokony hiankohofanareo, ary ho azy no tokony hanaovanareo sorona.'),
  ('6ab25a656bb6e173081216c6', '2026-09-22T10:37:25.166Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:25.166Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 17, 33, 'I Jehovah no nanjary natahoran’izy ireo, nefa ny andriamaniny ihany no nivavahany, araka ny fivavahan’ireo firenena niaviany talohan’ny sesitany.', 'i jehovah no nanjary natahoran’izy ireo, nefa ny andriamaniny ihany no nivavahany, araka ny fivavahan’ireo firenena niaviany talohan’ny sesitany.'),
  ('6ab25a656bb6e173081216b7', '2026-09-22T10:37:25.166Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:25.166Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 17, 18, 'Koa tezitra mafy tamin’ny Israely i Jehovah, ka nesoriny tsy ho eo imasony izy ireo. Tsy navelany hisy hiangana, afa-tsy ny fokon’i Joda.', 'koa tezitra mafy tamin’ny israely i jehovah, ka nesoriny tsy ho eo imasony izy ireo. tsy navelany hisy hiangana, afa-tsy ny fokon’i joda.'),
  ('6ab25a656bb6e173081216b3', '2026-09-22T10:37:25.166Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:25.166Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 17, 14, 'Tsy nihaino anefa izy ireo fa nanamafy hatoka foana, toy ny nataon’ny razany izay tsy naneho finoana an’i Jehovah Andriamaniny.', 'tsy nihaino anefa izy ireo fa nanamafy hatoka foana, toy ny nataon’ny razany izay tsy naneho finoana an’i jehovah andriamaniny.'),
  ('6ab25a656bb6e173081216b0', '2026-09-22T10:37:25.166Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:25.166Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 17, 11, 'Ary teny amin’ny toerana avo rehetra no nanoloran’izy ireo setroka ho sorona, toy ny nataon’ireo firenena nalefan’i Jehovah sesitany noho ny amin’izy ireo. Nanao ratsy foana izy ireo mba hampahatezitra an’i Jehovah.', 'ary teny amin’ny toerana avo rehetra no nanoloran’izy ireo setroka ho sorona, toy ny nataon’ireo firenena nalefan’i jehovah sesitany noho ny amin’izy ireo. nanao ratsy foana izy ireo mba hampahatezitra an’i jehovah.'),
  ('6ab25a656bb6e173081216af', '2026-09-22T10:37:25.166Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:25.166Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 17, 10, 'ary nanangana tsangambato masina sy tsato-kazo masina, teny amin’ny havoana avo rehetra sy teny ambanin’ny hazo midoroboka rehetra.', 'ary nanangana tsangambato masina sy tsato-kazo masina, teny amin’ny havoana avo rehetra sy teny ambanin’ny hazo midoroboka rehetra.'),
  ('6ab25a656bb6e173081216cc', '2026-09-22T10:37:25.166Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:25.166Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 17, 39, 'I Jehovah Andriamanitrareo kosa no tokony hatahoranareo, fa izy no hamonjy anareo eo an-tanan’ny fahavalonareo rehetra.”', 'i jehovah andriamanitrareo kosa no tokony hatahoranareo, fa izy no hamonjy anareo eo an-tanan’ny fahavalonareo rehetra.”'),
  ('6ab25a656bb6e173081216bd', '2026-09-22T10:37:25.166Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:25.166Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 17, 24, 'Tatỳ aoriana, dia nitondra olona avy any Babylona sy Kota sy Ava sy Hamata ary Sefarvaima ny mpanjakan’i Asyria. Ary napetrany hisolo ny zanak’Israely tao amin’ireo tanànan’i Samaria ireo olona ireo. Dia naka an’i Samaria ho fananany izy ireo, ka nonina tao amin’ireo tanàna tao.', 'tatỳ aoriana, dia nitondra olona avy any babylona sy kota sy ava sy hamata ary sefarvaima ny mpanjakan’i asyria. ary napetrany hisolo ny zanak’israely tao amin’ireo tanànan’i samaria ireo olona ireo. dia naka an’i samaria ho fananany izy ireo, ka nonina tao amin’ireo tanàna tao.'),
  ('6ab25a656bb6e173081216ab', '2026-09-22T10:37:25.166Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:25.166Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 17, 6, 'Tamin’ny taona fahasivy nanjakan’i Hosea, dia nobaboin’ny mpanjakan’i Asyria i Samaria. Ary nataony sesitany tany Asyria ny Israely, ka napetrany tany Hala sy tany Habora izay eo amin’ny reniranon’i Gozana, ary tany amin’ireo tanànan’ny Medianina.', 'tamin’ny taona fahasivy nanjakan’i hosea, dia nobaboin’ny mpanjakan’i asyria i samaria. ary nataony sesitany tany asyria ny israely, ka napetrany tany hala sy tany habora izay eo amin’ny reniranon’i gozana, ary tany amin’ireo tanànan’ny medianina.'),
  ('6ab25a656bb6e173081216b8', '2026-09-22T10:37:25.166Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:25.166Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 17, 19, 'Na ny Joda aza anefa tsy nitandrina ny didin’i Jehovah Andriamaniny, fa ny lalàna noforonin’ny Israely no notandremany.', 'na ny joda aza anefa tsy nitandrina ny didin’i jehovah andriamaniny, fa ny lalàna noforonin’ny israely no notandremany.'),
  ('6ab25a656bb6e173081216b4', '2026-09-22T10:37:25.166Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:25.166Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 17, 15, 'Nolaviny foana ny fitsipik’Andriamanitra sy ny fifanekena nataony tamin’ny razany, ary ny fampahatsiahivana nolazainy tamin’izy ireo mba hampitandremana azy. Ary nanaraka sampy tsy misy ilana azy izy ireo tahaka an’ireo firenena nanodidina azy, ka lasa tsy nisy ilana azy koa. Efa nandidy azy anefa i Jehovah mba tsy hanao toy ireny firenena ireny.', 'nolaviny foana ny fitsipik’andriamanitra sy ny fifanekena nataony tamin’ny razany, ary ny fampahatsiahivana nolazainy tamin’izy ireo mba hampitandremana azy. ary nanaraka sampy tsy misy ilana azy izy ireo tahaka an’ireo firenena nanodidina azy, ka lasa tsy nisy ilana azy koa. efa nandidy azy anefa i jehovah mba tsy hanao toy ireny firenena ireny.'),
  ('6ab25a656bb6e173081216b1', '2026-09-22T10:37:25.166Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:25.166Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 17, 12, 'Nanompo sampy maharikoriko koa izy ireo, nefa i Jehovah efa niteny hoe: “Aza manao izany zavatra izany.”', 'nanompo sampy maharikoriko koa izy ireo, nefa i jehovah efa niteny hoe: “aza manao izany zavatra izany.”'),
  ('6ab25a656bb6e173081216a8', '2026-09-22T10:37:25.166Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:25.166Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 17, 3, 'Niakatra hanafika azy i Salmanesera mpanjakan’i Asyria. Koa lasa mpanompon’i Salmanesera i Hosea, ka nandoa hetra taminy.', 'niakatra hanafika azy i salmanesera mpanjakan’i asyria. koa lasa mpanompon’i salmanesera i hosea, ka nandoa hetra taminy.'),
  ('6ab25a656bb6e173081216ce', '2026-09-22T10:37:25.166Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:25.166Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 17, 41, 'Ary lasa natahotra an’i Jehovah ireny firenena ireny, nefa ny sary sokitra nataony ihany no notompoiny. Ary ny zanany sy ny zafikeliny kosa, dia toy ny nataon’ny razany ihany no nataony mandraka androany.', 'ary lasa natahotra an’i jehovah ireny firenena ireny, nefa ny sary sokitra nataony ihany no notompoiny. ary ny zanany sy ny zafikeliny kosa, dia toy ny nataon’ny razany ihany no nataony mandraka androany.'),
  ('6ab25a656bb6e173081216ba', '2026-09-22T10:37:25.166Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:25.166Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 17, 21, 'Ary efa nendahany niala tamin’ny taranak’i Davida ny Israely. Koa nataon’izy ireo mpanjaka i Jeroboama zanak’i Nebata. Nampiala ny Israely tsy hanaraka an’i Jehovah anefa i Jeroboama, ka nahatonga ny Israely hanao fahotana lehibe.', 'ary efa nendahany niala tamin’ny taranak’i davida ny israely. koa nataon’izy ireo mpanjaka i jeroboama zanak’i nebata. nampiala ny israely tsy hanaraka an’i jehovah anefa i jeroboama, ka nahatonga ny israely hanao fahotana lehibe.'),
  ('6ab25a656bb6e173081216b9', '2026-09-22T10:37:25.166Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:25.166Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 17, 20, 'Koa nolavin’i Jehovah ny taranak’Israely manontolo, ka nampahoriny foana sady natolony teo an-tanan’ny mpandroba, ary tamin’ny farany dia nariany tanteraka tsy ho eo anatrehany.', 'koa nolavin’i jehovah ny taranak’israely manontolo, ka nampahoriny foana sady natolony teo an-tanan’ny mpandroba, ary tamin’ny farany dia nariany tanteraka tsy ho eo anatrehany.'),
  ('6ab25a656bb6e173081216ac', '2026-09-22T10:37:25.166Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:25.166Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 17, 7, 'Izany no nitranga noho ny nanotan’ny zanak’Israely tamin’i Jehovah Andriamaniny, izay nitondra azy niakatra avy tany Ejipta avy teo an-tanan’i Farao mpanjakan’i Ejipta. Natahotra andriamani-kafa koa izy ireo.', 'izany no nitranga noho ny nanotan’ny zanak’israely tamin’i jehovah andriamaniny, izay nitondra azy niakatra avy tany ejipta avy teo an-tanan’i farao mpanjakan’i ejipta. natahotra andriamani-kafa koa izy ireo.'),
  ('6ab25a656bb6e173081216c2', '2026-09-22T10:37:25.166Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:25.166Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 17, 29, 'Samy nanao ny andriamaniny avy anefa ny firenena tsirairay, ka nametraka izany tao amin’ireo trano teny amin’ny toerana avo nataon’ny Samaritanina. Eny, samy nanao ny azy ny firenena tsirairay, tao amin’ny tanàna nipetrahany.', 'samy nanao ny andriamaniny avy anefa ny firenena tsirairay, ka nametraka izany tao amin’ireo trano teny amin’ny toerana avo nataon’ny samaritanina. eny, samy nanao ny azy ny firenena tsirairay, tao amin’ny tanàna nipetrahany.'),
  ('6ab25a656bb6e173081216bf', '2026-09-22T10:37:25.166Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:25.166Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 17, 26, 'Koa nandefa hafatra tany amin’ny mpanjakan’i Asyria izy ireo, nanao hoe: “Ireo firenena nataonao sesitany sy napetrakao ao amin’ireo tanànan’i Samaria, dia tsy mahalala ny fivavahana amin’ny Andriamanitr’ilay tany, ka andefasany liona. Ary vonoin’ny liona izy ireo satria tsy misy mahalala ny fivavahana amin’ny Andriamanitr’ilay tany.”', 'koa nandefa hafatra tany amin’ny mpanjakan’i asyria izy ireo, nanao hoe: “ireo firenena nataonao sesitany sy napetrakao ao amin’ireo tanànan’i samaria, dia tsy mahalala ny fivavahana amin’ny andriamanitr’ilay tany, ka andefasany liona. ary vonoin’ny liona izy ireo satria tsy misy mahalala ny fivavahana amin’ny andriamanitr’ilay tany.”'),
  ('6ab25a656bb6e173081216a7', '2026-09-22T10:37:25.166Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:25.166Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 17, 2, 'ary nanao izay ratsy teo imason’i Jehovah foana izy, saingy tsy toy ireo mpanjakan’ny Israely talohany.', 'ary nanao izay ratsy teo imason’i jehovah foana izy, saingy tsy toy ireo mpanjakan’ny israely talohany.'),
  ('6ab25a656bb6e173081216c4', '2026-09-22T10:37:25.166Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:25.166Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 17, 31, 'Ny Avita indray nanao an’i Nibaza sy Tartaka. Ny Sefarvita kosa nandoro ny zanany tao anaty afo ho an’i Adrameleka sy Anameleka andriamanitr’i Sefarvaima.', 'ny avita indray nanao an’i nibaza sy tartaka. ny sefarvita kosa nandoro ny zanany tao anaty afo ho an’i adrameleka sy anameleka andriamanitr’i sefarvaima.'),
  ('6ab25a656bb6e173081216bb', '2026-09-22T10:37:25.166Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:25.166Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 17, 22, 'Ary tsy niala tamin’ny fahotana rehetra nataon’i Jeroboama ny zanak’Israely. Eny, tsy niala tamin’izany izy ireo,', 'ary tsy niala tamin’ny fahotana rehetra nataon’i jeroboama ny zanak’israely. eny, tsy niala tamin’izany izy ireo,'),
  ('6ab25a656bb6e173081216b5', '2026-09-22T10:37:25.166Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:25.166Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 17, 16, 'Ary niala tamin’ny didy rehetra nomen’i Jehovah Andriamaniny izy ireo, ka nanao sarivongana zanak’omby roa tamin’ny metaly. Nanao tsato-kazo masina koa izy ireo, sady niankohoka tamin’izay rehetra eny amin’ny lanitra, ary nanompo an’i Bala.', 'ary niala tamin’ny didy rehetra nomen’i jehovah andriamaniny izy ireo, ka nanao sarivongana zanak’omby roa tamin’ny metaly. nanao tsato-kazo masina koa izy ireo, sady niankohoka tamin’izay rehetra eny amin’ny lanitra, ary nanompo an’i bala.'),
  ('6ab25a656bb6e173081216a9', '2026-09-22T10:37:25.166Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:25.166Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 17, 4, 'Hitan’ny mpanjakan’i Asyria anefa fa nisy tetika nokotrehin’i Hosea. Nandefa iraka ho any amin’i So mpanjakan’i Ejipta mantsy i Hosea, sady tsy niakatra nitondra hetra ho any amin’ny mpanjakan’i Asyria intsony toy ny tamin’ireo taona teo aloha. Koa nogadrain’ny mpanjakan’i Asyria izy, ka nofatorany tao am-ponja.', 'hitan’ny mpanjakan’i asyria anefa fa nisy tetika nokotrehin’i hosea. nandefa iraka ho any amin’i so mpanjakan’i ejipta mantsy i hosea, sady tsy niakatra nitondra hetra ho any amin’ny mpanjakan’i asyria intsony toy ny tamin’ireo taona teo aloha. koa nogadrain’ny mpanjakan’i asyria izy, ka nofatorany tao am-ponja.'),
  ('6ab25a656bb6e173081216c7', '2026-09-22T10:37:25.166Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:25.166Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 17, 34, 'Araka ny fivavahany taloha ihany no nataon’izy ireo mandraka androany. Tsy nisy natahotra an’i Jehovah, na nitandrina ny fitsipiny sy ny didim-pitsarany, mbamin’ny lalàna sy ny didy nomen’i Jehovah ny taranak’ilay Jakoba novany anarana hoe Israely,', 'araka ny fivavahany taloha ihany no nataon’izy ireo mandraka androany. tsy nisy natahotra an’i jehovah, na nitandrina ny fitsipiny sy ny didim-pitsarany, mbamin’ny lalàna sy ny didy nomen’i jehovah ny taranak’ilay jakoba novany anarana hoe israely,'),
  ('6ab25a656bb6e173081216be', '2026-09-22T10:37:25.166Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:25.166Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 17, 25, 'Ary tsy natahotra an’i Jehovah izy ireo, raha vao nanomboka nonina tao, ka nandefasan’i Jehovah liona. Dia namono olona teo amin’izy ireo ny liona.', 'ary tsy natahotra an’i jehovah izy ireo, raha vao nanomboka nonina tao, ka nandefasan’i jehovah liona. dia namono olona teo amin’izy ireo ny liona.'),
  ('6ab25a656bb6e173081216b6', '2026-09-22T10:37:25.166Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:25.166Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 17, 17, 'Ary nandoro * ny zanany lahy sy ny zanany vavy tao anaty afo izy ireo, sady nanao sikidy sy nitady fambara, ary tsy nanan-tsaina afa-tsy ny hanao izay ratsy teo imason’i Jehovah, mba hampahatezitra azy.', 'ary nandoro * ny zanany lahy sy ny zanany vavy tao anaty afo izy ireo, sady nanao sikidy sy nitady fambara, ary tsy nanan-tsaina afa-tsy ny hanao izay ratsy teo imason’i jehovah, mba hampahatezitra azy.'),
  ('6ab25a656bb6e173081216c3', '2026-09-22T10:37:25.166Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:25.166Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 17, 30, 'Ny olona avy any Babylona dia nanao an’i Sokota-benota, ny avy any Kota nanao an’i Nergala, ary ny avy any Hamata kosa nanao an’i Asima.', 'ny olona avy any babylona dia nanao an’i sokota-benota, ny avy any kota nanao an’i nergala, ary ny avy any hamata kosa nanao an’i asima.'),
  ('6ab25a656bb6e173081216b2', '2026-09-22T10:37:25.166Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:25.166Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 17, 13, 'I Jehovah anefa efa nampitandrina foana ny Israely sy ny Joda, tamin’ny alalan’ny mpaminaniny rehetra sy ny mpahita rehetra, nanao hoe: “Mialà amin’ny lalan-dratsinareo ary tandremo ny didiko sy ny fitsipiko, araka ny lalàna rehetra izay nandidiako ny razanareo sy nalefako tany aminareo tamin’ny alalan’ny mpaminany mpanompoko.”', 'i jehovah anefa efa nampitandrina foana ny israely sy ny joda, tamin’ny alalan’ny mpaminaniny rehetra sy ny mpahita rehetra, nanao hoe: “mialà amin’ny lalan-dratsinareo ary tandremo ny didiko sy ny fitsipiko, araka ny lalàna rehetra izay nandidiako ny razanareo sy nalefako tany aminareo tamin’ny alalan’ny mpaminany mpanompoko.”'),
  ('6ab25a656bb6e173081216cd', '2026-09-22T10:37:25.166Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:25.166Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 17, 40, 'Tsy nankatò anefa izy ireo, fa araka ny fivavahany taloha ihany no nataony.', 'tsy nankatò anefa izy ireo, fa araka ny fivavahany taloha ihany no nataony.'),
  ('6ab25a656bb6e173081216c8', '2026-09-22T10:37:25.166Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:25.166Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 17, 35, 'tamin’i Jehovah nanao fifanekena tamin’ny taranak’Israely, ka nandidy azy hoe: “Aza matahotra andriamani-kafa, na miankohoka eo anatrehany, na manompo azy na manao sorona ho azy.', 'tamin’i jehovah nanao fifanekena tamin’ny taranak’israely, ka nandidy azy hoe: “aza matahotra andriamani-kafa, na miankohoka eo anatrehany, na manompo azy na manao sorona ho azy.'),
  ('6ab25a656bb6e173081216c1', '2026-09-22T10:37:25.166Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:25.166Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 17, 28, 'Koa tonga ny iray tamin’ny mpisorona izay nipetraka tany Samaria talohan’ny nanaovana azy sesitany. Ary nipetraka tao Betela izy ka nampianatra ny fomba hatahorana an’i Jehovah.', 'koa tonga ny iray tamin’ny mpisorona izay nipetraka tany samaria talohan’ny nanaovana azy sesitany. ary nipetraka tao betela izy ka nampianatra ny fomba hatahorana an’i jehovah.'),
  ('6ab25a656bb6e173081216c0', '2026-09-22T10:37:25.166Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:25.166Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 17, 27, 'Dia namoaka didy ny mpanjakan’i Asyria, hoe: “Asaivo mankany ny iray amin’ny mpisorona, izay nipetraka tany talohan’ny nanaovana azy sesitany. Asaivo mipetraka any izy mba hampianatra azy ireo ny fivavahana amin’ny Andriamanitr’ilay tany.”', 'dia namoaka didy ny mpanjakan’i asyria, hoe: “asaivo mankany ny iray amin’ny mpisorona, izay nipetraka tany talohan’ny nanaovana azy sesitany. asaivo mipetraka any izy mba hampianatra azy ireo ny fivavahana amin’ny andriamanitr’ilay tany.”'),
  ('6ab25a656bb6e173081216bc', '2026-09-22T10:37:25.166Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:25.166Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 17, 23, 'mandra-panaisotr’i Jehovah ny Israely tsy ho eo imasony, araka izay nolazainy tamin’ny alalan’ny mpaminany mpanompony rehetra. Nesorina tamin’ny taniny àry ny Israely ka natao sesitany any Asyria, ary mbola any mandraka androany.', 'mandra-panaisotr’i jehovah ny israely tsy ho eo imasony, araka izay nolazainy tamin’ny alalan’ny mpaminany mpanompony rehetra. nesorina tamin’ny taniny àry ny israely ka natao sesitany any asyria, ary mbola any mandraka androany.'),
  ('6ab25a656bb6e173081216ae', '2026-09-22T10:37:25.166Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:25.166Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 17, 9, 'Koa nanao zavatra tsy tsara teo imason’i Jehovah Andriamaniny ny zanak’Israely, sady nanorina toerana avo tany amin’ny tanànany rehetra, nanomboka teo amin’ny tilikambon’ny mpitily ka hatrany amin’ny tanàna voaro mafy,', 'koa nanao zavatra tsy tsara teo imason’i jehovah andriamaniny ny zanak’israely, sady nanorina toerana avo tany amin’ny tanànany rehetra, nanomboka teo amin’ny tilikambon’ny mpitily ka hatrany amin’ny tanàna voaro mafy,'),
  ('6ab25a656bb6e173081216aa', '2026-09-22T10:37:25.166Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:25.166Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 17, 5, 'Ary niakatra hamely an’ilay tany manontolo ny mpanjakan’i Asyria. Niakatra tany Samaria koa izy, ka nanao fahirano azy telo taona.', 'ary niakatra hamely an’ilay tany manontolo ny mpanjakan’i asyria. niakatra tany samaria koa izy, ka nanao fahirano azy telo taona.'),
  ('6ab25a6678064c9f4bb32a53', '2026-09-22T10:37:26.032Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:26.032Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 18, 31, 'Aza mihaino an’i Hezekia, fa izao no nolazain’ny mpanjakan’i Asyria: “Meteza hitolo-batana amiko, ka mivoaha hankatỳ amiko, dia samy hihinana ny voalobony sy ny aviaviny avy ianareo, ary samy hisotro ny rano avy amin’ny lavaka fanangonan-dranony,', 'aza mihaino an’i hezekia, fa izao no nolazain’ny mpanjakan’i asyria: “meteza hitolo-batana amiko, ka mivoaha hankatỳ amiko, dia samy hihinana ny voalobony sy ny aviaviny avy ianareo, ary samy hisotro ny rano avy amin’ny lavaka fanangonan-dranony,'),
  ('6ab25a6678064c9f4bb32a3d', '2026-09-22T10:37:26.032Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:26.032Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 18, 9, 'Ary tamin’ny taona fahefatra nanjakan’i Hezekia Mpanjaka, izany hoe ny taona fahafito nanjakan’i Hosea zanak’i Elaha mpanjakan’ny Israely, no niakatra hamely an’i Samaria i Salmanesera mpanjakan’i Asyria ka nanao fahirano azy.', 'ary tamin’ny taona fahefatra nanjakan’i hezekia mpanjaka, izany hoe ny taona fahafito nanjakan’i hosea zanak’i elaha mpanjakan’ny israely, no niakatra hamely an’i samaria i salmanesera mpanjakan’i asyria ka nanao fahirano azy.'),
  ('6ab25a6678064c9f4bb32a3c', '2026-09-22T10:37:26.032Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:26.032Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 18, 8, 'Izy no namely ny Filistinina hatrany Gaza sy ny faritaniny, nanomboka teo amin’ny tilikambon’ny mpitily ka hatrany amin’ny tanàna voaro mafy.', 'izy no namely ny filistinina hatrany gaza sy ny faritaniny, nanomboka teo amin’ny tilikambon’ny mpitily ka hatrany amin’ny tanàna voaro mafy.'),
  ('6ab25a6678064c9f4bb32a52', '2026-09-22T10:37:26.032Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:26.032Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 18, 30, 'Ary aza manaiky hotarihin’i Hezekia hitoky amin’i Jehovah, ka hilazany hoe: “Tena hamonjy antsika tokoa i Jehovah, ary tsy hatolotra eo an-tanan’ny mpanjakan’i Asyria ity tanàna ity.”', 'ary aza manaiky hotarihin’i hezekia hitoky amin’i jehovah, ka hilazany hoe: “tena hamonjy antsika tokoa i jehovah, ary tsy hatolotra eo an-tanan’ny mpanjakan’i asyria ity tanàna ity.”'),
  ('6ab25a6678064c9f4bb32a3f', '2026-09-22T10:37:26.032Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:26.032Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 18, 11, 'Dia nataon’ny mpanjakan’i Asyria sesitany tany Asyria ny Israely, ka napetrany tany Hala sy tany Habora izay eo amin’ny reniranon’i Gozana, ary tany amin’ireo tanànan’ny Medianina.', 'dia nataon’ny mpanjakan’i asyria sesitany tany asyria ny israely, ka napetrany tany hala sy tany habora izay eo amin’ny reniranon’i gozana, ary tany amin’ireo tanànan’ny medianina.'),
  ('6ab25a6678064c9f4bb32a57', '2026-09-22T10:37:26.032Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:26.032Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 18, 35, 'Iza tamin’ny andriamanitra rehetran’ireo tany ireo no nahavonjy ny taniny teo an-tanako? Koa ahoana no hahafahan’i Jehovah hamonjy an’i Jerosalema eo an-tanako?”’”', 'iza tamin’ny andriamanitra rehetran’ireo tany ireo no nahavonjy ny taniny teo an-tanako? koa ahoana no hahafahan’i jehovah hamonjy an’i jerosalema eo an-tanako?”’”'),
  ('6ab25a6678064c9f4bb32a3a', '2026-09-22T10:37:26.032Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:26.032Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 18, 6, 'Nifikitra tamin’i Jehovah foana izy, ary nanaraka azy foana. Notandremany foana ireo didy nomen’i Jehovah an’i Mosesy,', 'nifikitra tamin’i jehovah foana izy, ary nanaraka azy foana. notandremany foana ireo didy nomen’i jehovah an’i mosesy,'),
  ('6ab25a6678064c9f4bb32a38', '2026-09-22T10:37:26.032Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:26.032Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 18, 4, 'Izy no nanala ny toerana avo sy namotipotika ny tsangambato masina sy nikapa ny tsato-kazo masina ary nanorotoro an’ilay bibilava varahina nataon’i Mosesy. Mbola nanolotra setroka ho sorona ho an’io bibilava varahina io mantsy ny zanak’Israely hatramin’izany andro izany, ka nantsoina hoe sampy bibilava varahina ilay izy.', 'izy no nanala ny toerana avo sy namotipotika ny tsangambato masina sy nikapa ny tsato-kazo masina ary nanorotoro an’ilay bibilava varahina nataon’i mosesy. mbola nanolotra setroka ho sorona ho an’io bibilava varahina io mantsy ny zanak’israely hatramin’izany andro izany, ka nantsoina hoe sampy bibilava varahina ilay izy.'),
  ('6ab25a6678064c9f4bb32a51', '2026-09-22T10:37:26.032Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:26.032Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 18, 29, 'Izao no nolazain’ny mpanjaka: ‘Aza manaiky hofitahin’i Hezekia ianareo, fa tsy mahavonjy anareo eo an-tanako izy.', 'izao no nolazain’ny mpanjaka: ‘aza manaiky hofitahin’i hezekia ianareo, fa tsy mahavonjy anareo eo an-tanako izy.'),
  ('6ab25a6678064c9f4bb32a3b', '2026-09-22T10:37:26.032Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:26.032Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 18, 7, 'ary nomba azy i Jehovah. Malina foana izy tamin’izay rehetra nataony. Ary nikomy tamin’ny mpanjakan’i Asyria izy, ka tsy nanompo azy.', 'ary nomba azy i jehovah. malina foana izy tamin’izay rehetra nataony. ary nikomy tamin’ny mpanjakan’i asyria izy, ka tsy nanompo azy.'),
  ('6ab25a6678064c9f4bb32a35', '2026-09-22T10:37:26.032Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:26.032Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 18, 1, 'Tamin’ny taona fahatelo nanjakan’i Hosea zanak’i Elaha mpanjakan’ny Israely, no lasa mpanjaka i Hezekia zanak’i Ahaza mpanjakan’ny Joda.', 'tamin’ny taona fahatelo nanjakan’i hosea zanak’i elaha mpanjakan’ny israely, no lasa mpanjaka i hezekia zanak’i ahaza mpanjakan’ny joda.'),
  ('6ab25a6678064c9f4bb32a59', '2026-09-22T10:37:26.032Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:26.032Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 18, 37, 'Fa nankao amin’i Hezekia kosa i Eliakima zanak’i Hilkia, mpiandraikitra ny ankohonan’ny mpanjaka, sy Sebna mpitan-tsoratra, ary Joa zanak’i Asafa, mpanoratra ny raharaham-panjakana. Ary samy efa nandrovitra ny akanjony avy izy ireo. Dia nolazain’izy ireo tamin’i Hezekia ny tenin’i Rabsake.', 'fa nankao amin’i hezekia kosa i eliakima zanak’i hilkia, mpiandraikitra ny ankohonan’ny mpanjaka, sy sebna mpitan-tsoratra, ary joa zanak’i asafa, mpanoratra ny raharaham-panjakana. ary samy efa nandrovitra ny akanjony avy izy ireo. dia nolazain’izy ireo tamin’i hezekia ny tenin’i rabsake.'),
  ('6ab25a6678064c9f4bb32a56', '2026-09-22T10:37:26.032Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:26.032Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 18, 34, 'Aiza izao ireo andriamanitr’i Hamata sy Arpada? Aiza koa ireo andriamanitr’i Sefarvaima sy Hena ary Iva? Nahavonjy an’i Samaria teo an-tanako angaha ireny?', 'aiza izao ireo andriamanitr’i hamata sy arpada? aiza koa ireo andriamanitr’i sefarvaima sy hena ary iva? nahavonjy an’i samaria teo an-tanako angaha ireny?'),
  ('6ab25a6678064c9f4bb32a54', '2026-09-22T10:37:26.032Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:26.032Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 18, 32, 'mandra-pahatongako hitondra anareo ho any amin’ny tany izay tahaka ny taninareo, dia tany misy varimbazaha sy divay vaovao, tany misy mofo sy tanimboaloboka, tany misy hazo oliva fakana menaka ary tany misy tantely. Dia ho velona ianareo fa tsy ho faty. Ary aza mihaino an’i Hezekia, fa mamitaka anareo izy raha milaza hoe: ‘I Jehovah no hamonjy antsika.’', 'mandra-pahatongako hitondra anareo ho any amin’ny tany izay tahaka ny taninareo, dia tany misy varimbazaha sy divay vaovao, tany misy mofo sy tanimboaloboka, tany misy hazo oliva fakana menaka ary tany misy tantely. dia ho velona ianareo fa tsy ho faty. ary aza mihaino an’i hezekia, fa mamitaka anareo izy raha milaza hoe: ‘i jehovah no hamonjy antsika.’'),
  ('6ab25a6678064c9f4bb32a4a', '2026-09-22T10:37:26.032Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:26.032Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 18, 22, 'Raha hoy kosa ianareo hoe: ‘I Jehovah Andriamanitray no itokisanay!’ Fa angaha moa tsy izy no tompon’ireo toerana avo sy alitara nesorin’i Hezekia, izay nilaza tamin’ny Joda sy Jerosalema hoe: ‘Eto anoloan’ity alitara eto Jerosalema ity no hiankohofanareo’?”’', 'raha hoy kosa ianareo hoe: ‘i jehovah andriamanitray no itokisanay!’ fa angaha moa tsy izy no tompon’ireo toerana avo sy alitara nesorin’i hezekia, izay nilaza tamin’ny joda sy jerosalema hoe: ‘eto anoloan’ity alitara eto jerosalema ity no hiankohofanareo’?”’'),
  ('6ab25a6678064c9f4bb32a48', '2026-09-22T10:37:26.032Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:26.032Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 18, 20, 'Nilaza ianao hoe: ‘Ananako daholo na ny saina na ny hery hoenti-miady.’ Rediredy fotsiny izany teninao izany. Fa iza no mba itokisanao no mikomy amiko ianao?', 'nilaza ianao hoe: ‘ananako daholo na ny saina na ny hery hoenti-miady.’ rediredy fotsiny izany teninao izany. fa iza no mba itokisanao no mikomy amiko ianao?'),
  ('6ab25a6678064c9f4bb32a58', '2026-09-22T10:37:26.032Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:26.032Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 18, 36, 'Nangina anefa ny olona, ka tsy namaly azy na indraim-bava aza, satria efa nodidian’ny mpanjaka hoe: “Aza mamaly azy.”', 'nangina anefa ny olona, ka tsy namaly azy na indraim-bava aza, satria efa nodidian’ny mpanjaka hoe: “aza mamaly azy.”'),
  ('6ab25a6678064c9f4bb32a45', '2026-09-22T10:37:26.032Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:26.032Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 18, 17, 'Ary nirahin’ny mpanjakan’i Asyria avy tao Lakisy i Tartana sy Rabsarisa ary Rabsake mbamin’ny miaramila be dia be, mba hiakatra ho any amin’i Hezekia Mpanjaka any Jerosalema. Koa niakatra izy ireo ka tonga tany Jerosalema. Dia nijanona teo akaikin’ny lakandranon’ny dobo ambony izy ireo, teo amin’ny lalambe mankany amin’ny sahan’ny mpanasa lamba.', 'ary nirahin’ny mpanjakan’i asyria avy tao lakisy i tartana sy rabsarisa ary rabsake mbamin’ny miaramila be dia be, mba hiakatra ho any amin’i hezekia mpanjaka any jerosalema. koa niakatra izy ireo ka tonga tany jerosalema. dia nijanona teo akaikin’ny lakandranon’ny dobo ambony izy ireo, teo amin’ny lalambe mankany amin’ny sahan’ny mpanasa lamba.'),
  ('6ab25a6678064c9f4bb32a44', '2026-09-22T10:37:26.032Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:26.032Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 18, 16, 'Tamin’izany andro izany, dia nendahan’i Hezekia mpanjakan’ny Joda ny varavaran’ny tempolin’i Jehovah sy ny tolàna izay efa nopetahany takela-bolamena, ka nomeny ho an’ny mpanjakan’i Asyria.', 'tamin’izany andro izany, dia nendahan’i hezekia mpanjakan’ny joda ny varavaran’ny tempolin’i jehovah sy ny tolàna izay efa nopetahany takela-bolamena, ka nomeny ho an’ny mpanjakan’i asyria.'),
  ('6ab25a6678064c9f4bb32a4b', '2026-09-22T10:37:26.032Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:26.032Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 18, 23, 'Koa aoka ianao hifanamby amin’ny tompoko, dia ny mpanjakan’i Asyria: Homeko soavaly roa arivo ianao, dia ho hita eo raha manana olona afaka hitaingina azy.', 'koa aoka ianao hifanamby amin’ny tompoko, dia ny mpanjakan’i asyria: homeko soavaly roa arivo ianao, dia ho hita eo raha manana olona afaka hitaingina azy.'),
  ('6ab25a6678064c9f4bb32a37', '2026-09-22T10:37:26.032Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:26.032Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 18, 3, 'Ary nanao izay mahitsy teo imason’i Jehovah foana i Hezekia, toy izay rehetra nataon’i Davida razambeny.', 'ary nanao izay mahitsy teo imason’i jehovah foana i hezekia, toy izay rehetra nataon’i davida razambeny.'),
  ('6ab25a6678064c9f4bb32a55', '2026-09-22T10:37:26.032Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:26.032Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 18, 33, 'Fa angaha ny andriamanitr’ireo firenena nahavonjy ny taniny teo an-tanan’ny mpanjakan’i Asyria?', 'fa angaha ny andriamanitr’ireo firenena nahavonjy ny taniny teo an-tanan’ny mpanjakan’i asyria?'),
  ('6ab25a6678064c9f4bb32a3e', '2026-09-22T10:37:26.032Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:26.032Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 18, 10, 'Ary namabo an’ilay tanàna izy ireo rehefa hifarana ny telo taona naharetan’ny fahirano. Koa voababo i Samaria tamin’ny taona fahenina nanjakan’i Hezekia, izany hoe ny taona fahasivy nanjakan’i Hosea mpanjakan’ny Israely.', 'ary namabo an’ilay tanàna izy ireo rehefa hifarana ny telo taona naharetan’ny fahirano. koa voababo i samaria tamin’ny taona fahenina nanjakan’i hezekia, izany hoe ny taona fahasivy nanjakan’i hosea mpanjakan’ny israely.'),
  ('6ab25a6678064c9f4bb32a41', '2026-09-22T10:37:26.032Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:26.032Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 18, 13, 'Ary tamin’ny taona fahefatra ambin’ny folo nanjakan’i Hezekia Mpanjaka, dia niakatra hamely an’ireo tanàna voaro mafy rehetra tany Joda i Sankeriba mpanjakan’i Asyria, ka naka an’ireny.', 'ary tamin’ny taona fahefatra ambin’ny folo nanjakan’i hezekia mpanjaka, dia niakatra hamely an’ireo tanàna voaro mafy rehetra tany joda i sankeriba mpanjakan’i asyria, ka naka an’ireny.'),
  ('6ab25a6678064c9f4bb32a50', '2026-09-22T10:37:26.032Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:26.032Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 18, 28, 'Ary nijoro teo ihany i Rabsake, ka niteny mafy tamin’ny fitenin’ny Jiosy, nanao hoe: “Henoy ny tenin’ny mpanjakan’i Asyria, ilay mpanjaka lehibe!', 'ary nijoro teo ihany i rabsake, ka niteny mafy tamin’ny fitenin’ny jiosy, nanao hoe: “henoy ny tenin’ny mpanjakan’i asyria, ilay mpanjaka lehibe!'),
  ('6ab25a6678064c9f4bb32a46', '2026-09-22T10:37:26.032Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:26.032Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 18, 18, 'Dia nantsoin’izy ireo ny mpanjaka. Kanjo i Eliakima zanak’i Hilkia, mpiandraikitra ny ankohonan’ny mpanjaka, sy Sebna mpitan-tsoratra, ary Joa zanak’i Asafa mpanoratra ny raharaham-panjakana, no nivoaka ho eo amin’izy ireo.', 'dia nantsoin’izy ireo ny mpanjaka. kanjo i eliakima zanak’i hilkia, mpiandraikitra ny ankohonan’ny mpanjaka, sy sebna mpitan-tsoratra, ary joa zanak’i asafa mpanoratra ny raharaham-panjakana, no nivoaka ho eo amin’izy ireo.'),
  ('6ab25a6678064c9f4bb32a43', '2026-09-22T10:37:26.032Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:26.032Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 18, 15, 'Dia nomen’i Hezekia azy ny volafotsy rehetra tao an-tranon’i Jehovah, mbamin’ny zava-tsarobidy notehirizina tao an-tranon’ny mpanjaka.', 'dia nomen’i hezekia azy ny volafotsy rehetra tao an-tranon’i jehovah, mbamin’ny zava-tsarobidy notehirizina tao an-tranon’ny mpanjaka.'),
  ('6ab25a6678064c9f4bb32a42', '2026-09-22T10:37:26.032Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:26.032Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 18, 14, 'Koa nandefa iraka nankany amin’ny mpanjakan’i Asyria tany Lakisy i Hezekia mpanjakan’ny Joda, nanao hoe: “Efa nanota aho! Mandehana miverina fa aza mamely ahy. Ary homeko anao izay angatahinao amiko.” Koa nasain’ny mpanjakan’i Asyria nanome talenta volafotsy telonjato sy talenta volamena telopolo i Hezekia mpanjakan’ny Joda.', 'koa nandefa iraka nankany amin’ny mpanjakan’i asyria tany lakisy i hezekia mpanjakan’ny joda, nanao hoe: “efa nanota aho! mandehana miverina fa aza mamely ahy. ary homeko anao izay angatahinao amiko.” koa nasain’ny mpanjakan’i asyria nanome talenta volafotsy telonjato sy talenta volamena telopolo i hezekia mpanjakan’ny joda.'),
  ('6ab25a6678064c9f4bb32a4c', '2026-09-22T10:37:26.032Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:26.032Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 18, 24, 'Hataonao ahoana no hampandositra governora anankiray, na dia izay anisan’ny kely indrindra amin’ny mpanompon’ny tompoko aza, nefa ianao aza mila mitoky amin’i Ejipta mba hahazoana kalesy sy mpitaingin-tsoavaly?', 'hataonao ahoana no hampandositra governora anankiray, na dia izay anisan’ny kely indrindra amin’ny mpanompon’ny tompoko aza, nefa ianao aza mila mitoky amin’i ejipta mba hahazoana kalesy sy mpitaingin-tsoavaly?'),
  ('6ab25a6678064c9f4bb32a49', '2026-09-22T10:37:26.032Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:26.032Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 18, 21, 'I Ejipta no mba itokisanao hanampy anao. Bararata torotoro anefa izy, ka raha itehenana dia hanindrona sy handoaka tanana. Toy izany i Farao mpanjakan’i Ejipta ho an’izay rehetra mitoky aminy.', 'i ejipta no mba itokisanao hanampy anao. bararata torotoro anefa izy, ka raha itehenana dia hanindrona sy handoaka tanana. toy izany i farao mpanjakan’i ejipta ho an’izay rehetra mitoky aminy.'),
  ('6ab25a6678064c9f4bb32a4d', '2026-09-22T10:37:26.032Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:26.032Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 18, 25, 'Ary angaha moa izaho tsy nahazo alalana avy tamin’i Jehovah matoa miakatra hanafika sy handrava an’ity toerana ity? I Jehovah mihitsy no niteny tamiko hoe: ‘Miakara hanafika an’io tany io, ary ravao izy.’”', 'ary angaha moa izaho tsy nahazo alalana avy tamin’i jehovah matoa miakatra hanafika sy handrava an’ity toerana ity? i jehovah mihitsy no niteny tamiko hoe: ‘miakara hanafika an’io tany io, ary ravao izy.’”'),
  ('6ab25a6678064c9f4bb32a4f', '2026-09-22T10:37:26.032Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:26.032Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 18, 27, 'Hoy anefa i Rabsake tamin’izy ireo: “Angaha moa izaho nirahin’ny tompoko hilaza izany teny izany aminao sy amin’ny tomponao, fa tsy amin’ny olona mipetraka etsy ambony manda, mba hihinanany ny tsy fihinany * sy hisotroany ny tsy fisotrony * miaraka aminareo?”', 'hoy anefa i rabsake tamin’izy ireo: “angaha moa izaho nirahin’ny tompoko hilaza izany teny izany aminao sy amin’ny tomponao, fa tsy amin’ny olona mipetraka etsy ambony manda, mba hihinanany ny tsy fihinany * sy hisotroany ny tsy fisotrony * miaraka aminareo?”'),
  ('6ab25a6678064c9f4bb32a47', '2026-09-22T10:37:26.032Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:26.032Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 18, 19, 'Koa hoy i Rabsake tamin’izy ireo: “Mba ilazao i Hezekia hoe: ‘Izao no nolazain’ny mpanjaka lehibe, dia ny mpanjakan’i Asyria: “Fa inona koa izao itokisanao izao?', 'koa hoy i rabsake tamin’izy ireo: “mba ilazao i hezekia hoe: ‘izao no nolazain’ny mpanjaka lehibe, dia ny mpanjakan’i asyria: “fa inona koa izao itokisanao izao?'),
  ('6ab25a6678064c9f4bb32a39', '2026-09-22T10:37:26.032Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:26.032Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 18, 5, 'I Jehovah Andriamanitry ny Israely no nitokisan’i Hezekia. Ary tsy nisy tahaka azy ny mpanjakan’ny Joda rehetra, na ny taoriany na ny talohany.', 'i jehovah andriamanitry ny israely no nitokisan’i hezekia. ary tsy nisy tahaka azy ny mpanjakan’ny joda rehetra, na ny taoriany na ny talohany.'),
  ('6ab25a6678064c9f4bb32a36', '2026-09-22T10:37:26.032Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:26.032Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 18, 2, 'Dimy amby roapolo taona i Hezekia tamin’izy nanomboka nanjaka, ary sivy amby roapolo taona no nanjakany tany Jerosalema. Ny anaran-dreniny dia Abia, zanak’i Zakaria.', 'dimy amby roapolo taona i hezekia tamin’izy nanomboka nanjaka, ary sivy amby roapolo taona no nanjakany tany jerosalema. ny anaran-dreniny dia abia, zanak’i zakaria.'),
  ('6ab25a6678064c9f4bb32a4e', '2026-09-22T10:37:26.032Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:26.032Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 18, 26, 'Dia hoy i Eliakima zanak’i Hilkia, sy Sebna ary Joa tamin’i Rabsake: “Fiteny syrianina re, azafady, no iteneno amin’ny mpanomponao, fa azonay ihany izany e! Aza manao fitenin’ny Jiosy aminay fa ren’ny olona etsy ambony manda.”', 'dia hoy i eliakima zanak’i hilkia, sy sebna ary joa tamin’i rabsake: “fiteny syrianina re, azafady, no iteneno amin’ny mpanomponao, fa azonay ihany izany e! aza manao fitenin’ny jiosy aminay fa ren’ny olona etsy ambony manda.”'),
  ('6ab25a6678064c9f4bb32a40', '2026-09-22T10:37:26.032Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:26.032Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 18, 12, 'Tsy nihaino ny feon’i Jehovah Andriamaniny mantsy izy ireo, fa nivadika tamin’ny fifanekena nataony, eny, nivadika tamin’izay rehetra nandidian’i Mosesy mpanompon’i Jehovah. Tsy nihaino izy ireo sady tsy nankatò.', 'tsy nihaino ny feon’i jehovah andriamaniny mantsy izy ireo, fa nivadika tamin’ny fifanekena nataony, eny, nivadika tamin’izay rehetra nandidian’i mosesy mpanompon’i jehovah. tsy nihaino izy ireo sady tsy nankatò.'),
  ('6ab25a66868ba88e38e6d28b', '2026-09-22T10:37:26.545Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:26.545Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 19, 20, 'Ary naniraka olona nankany amin’i Hezekia i Isaia zanak’i Amoza, hanao hoe: “Izao no nolazain’i Jehovah Andriamanitry ny Israely: ‘Efa reko ilay vavakao tamiko momba an’i Sankeriba mpanjakan’i Asyria.', 'ary naniraka olona nankany amin’i hezekia i isaia zanak’i amoza, hanao hoe: “izao no nolazain’i jehovah andriamanitry ny israely: ‘efa reko ilay vavakao tamiko momba an’i sankeriba mpanjakan’i asyria.'),
  ('6ab25a66868ba88e38e6d292', '2026-09-22T10:37:26.545Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:26.545Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 19, 27, 'Fantatro tsara izay ataonao, na mipetraka ianao, na miditra, na mivoaka. Fantatro tsara koa ny hatezeranao amiko,', 'fantatro tsara izay ataonao, na mipetraka ianao, na miditra, na mivoaka. fantatro tsara koa ny hatezeranao amiko,'),
  ('6ab25a66868ba88e38e6d283', '2026-09-22T10:37:26.545Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:26.545Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 19, 12, 'Rehefa naringan’ny razako i Gozana sy Harana sy Rezefa ary ny zanak’i Edena tao Tela-asara, angaha nisy nahavonjy an’ireny firenena ireny ny andriamaniny?', 'rehefa naringan’ny razako i gozana sy harana sy rezefa ary ny zanak’i edena tao tela-asara, angaha nisy nahavonjy an’ireny firenena ireny ny andriamaniny?'),
  ('6ab25a66868ba88e38e6d27c', '2026-09-22T10:37:26.545Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:26.545Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 19, 5, 'Koa nankao amin’i Isaia ireo mpanompon’i Hezekia Mpanjaka.', 'koa nankao amin’i isaia ireo mpanompon’i hezekia mpanjaka.'),
  ('6ab25a66868ba88e38e6d291', '2026-09-22T10:37:26.545Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:26.545Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 19, 26, 'Hiraviravy tanana ny mponina ao, Ka hihorohoro sy ho menatra. Ho tahaka ny zavamaniry eny an-tsaha sy ny ahi-maitso marefo izy, Ary ho tahaka ny ahitra eny amin’ny tafo, izay mainan’ny rivotra mafana avy any atsinanana.', 'hiraviravy tanana ny mponina ao, ka hihorohoro sy ho menatra. ho tahaka ny zavamaniry eny an-tsaha sy ny ahi-maitso marefo izy, ary ho tahaka ny ahitra eny amin’ny tafo, izay mainan’ny rivotra mafana avy any atsinanana.'),
  ('6ab25a66868ba88e38e6d28f', '2026-09-22T10:37:26.545Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:26.545Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 19, 24, 'Handavaka aho ka hisotro rano avy any an-tany hafa, Ary ny faladiako no handritako ny lakandrano rehetran’i Neily any Ejipta.’', 'handavaka aho ka hisotro rano avy any an-tany hafa, ary ny faladiako no handritako ny lakandrano rehetran’i neily any ejipta.’'),
  ('6ab25a66868ba88e38e6d287', '2026-09-22T10:37:26.545Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:26.545Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 19, 16, 'Aoka ianao hanongilan-tsofina ka hihaino, Jehovah ô! Ahirato ny masonao, Jehovah ô, ka mijere, ary henoy ny teny nampitondrain’i Sankeriba mba hihantsiana an’ilay Andriamanitra velona.', 'aoka ianao hanongilan-tsofina ka hihaino, jehovah ô! ahirato ny masonao, jehovah ô, ka mijere, ary henoy ny teny nampitondrain’i sankeriba mba hihantsiana an’ilay andriamanitra velona.'),
  ('6ab25a66868ba88e38e6d284', '2026-09-22T10:37:26.545Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:26.545Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 19, 13, 'Aiza izao ny mpanjakan’i Hamata sy ny mpanjakan’i Arpada, ary ny mpanjakan’ny tanànan’i Sefarvaima sy Hena ary Iva?’”', 'aiza izao ny mpanjakan’i hamata sy ny mpanjakan’i arpada, ary ny mpanjakan’ny tanànan’i sefarvaima sy hena ary iva?’”'),
  ('6ab25a66868ba88e38e6d27f', '2026-09-22T10:37:26.545Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:26.545Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 19, 8, 'Ary ren’i Rabsake fa efa niala tany Lakisy ny mpanjakan’i Asyria. Koa niverina tany amin’ny mpanjaka izy ka nahita azy niady tamin’i Libna.', 'ary ren’i rabsake fa efa niala tany lakisy ny mpanjakan’i asyria. koa niverina tany amin’ny mpanjaka izy ka nahita azy niady tamin’i libna.'),
  ('6ab25a66868ba88e38e6d289', '2026-09-22T10:37:26.545Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:26.545Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 19, 18, 'Ary nodoran’izy ireo ny andriamanitr’ireny, satria tsy andriamanitra fa vato aman-kazo, izay asa tanan’olona ihany, ka naringany.', 'ary nodoran’izy ireo ny andriamanitr’ireny, satria tsy andriamanitra fa vato aman-kazo, izay asa tanan’olona ihany, ka naringany.'),
  ('6ab25a66868ba88e38e6d288', '2026-09-22T10:37:26.545Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:26.545Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 19, 17, 'Jehovah ô, marina tokoa fa efa noravan’ireo mpanjakan’i Asyria ireo firenena sy ny taniny.', 'jehovah ô, marina tokoa fa efa noravan’ireo mpanjakan’i asyria ireo firenena sy ny taniny.'),
  ('6ab25a66868ba88e38e6d280', '2026-09-22T10:37:26.545Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:26.545Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 19, 9, 'Ary nisy nilaza tamin’ny mpanjaka fa nivoaka hiady aminy i Tiraka mpanjakan’i Etiopia. Dia nandefa iraka nankany amin’i Hezekia indray izy, nanao hoe:', 'ary nisy nilaza tamin’ny mpanjaka fa nivoaka hiady aminy i tiraka mpanjakan’i etiopia. dia nandefa iraka nankany amin’i hezekia indray izy, nanao hoe:'),
  ('6ab25a66868ba88e38e6d282', '2026-09-22T10:37:26.545Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:26.545Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 19, 11, 'Efa renao ny nataon’ireo mpanjakan’i Asyria tamin’ny tany rehetra, dia ny nandravany azy. Koa ianao indray ve no ho voavonjy?', 'efa renao ny nataon’ireo mpanjakan’i asyria tamin’ny tany rehetra, dia ny nandravany azy. koa ianao indray ve no ho voavonjy?'),
  ('6ab25a66868ba88e38e6d281', '2026-09-22T10:37:26.545Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:26.545Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 19, 10, '“Izao no holazainareo amin’i Hezekia mpanjakan’ny Joda: ‘Aza manaiky ho voafitak’ilay Andriamanitra itokisanao, izay manao hoe: “Tsy hatolotra eo an-tanan’ny mpanjakan’i Asyria i Jerosalema.”', '“izao no holazainareo amin’i hezekia mpanjakan’ny joda: ‘aza manaiky ho voafitak’ilay andriamanitra itokisanao, izay manao hoe: “tsy hatolotra eo an-tanan’ny mpanjakan’i asyria i jerosalema.”'),
  ('6ab25a66868ba88e38e6d27a', '2026-09-22T10:37:26.545Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:26.545Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 19, 3, 'Dia hoy ireo tamin’i Isaia: “Izao no nolazain’i Hezekia: ‘Andro fahoriana sy fanaovana teny henjana ary famingavingana ity andro ity, satria efa ho latsaka ny zaza, fa ny hery hiterahana azy no tsy misy.', 'dia hoy ireo tamin’i isaia: “izao no nolazain’i hezekia: ‘andro fahoriana sy fanaovana teny henjana ary famingavingana ity andro ity, satria efa ho latsaka ny zaza, fa ny hery hiterahana azy no tsy misy.'),
  ('6ab25a66868ba88e38e6d285', '2026-09-22T10:37:26.545Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:26.545Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 19, 14, 'Ary noraisin’i Hezekia teny an-tanan’ireo iraka ny taratasy ka novakiny. Dia niakatra tao an-tranon’i Jehovah izy, ka namelatra izany teo anatrehan’i Jehovah.', 'ary noraisin’i hezekia teny an-tanan’ireo iraka ny taratasy ka novakiny. dia niakatra tao an-tranon’i jehovah izy, ka namelatra izany teo anatrehan’i jehovah.'),
  ('6ab25a66868ba88e38e6d27d', '2026-09-22T10:37:26.545Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:26.545Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 19, 6, 'Ary hoy i Isaia tamin’ireo: “Lazao amin’ny tomponareo hoe: ‘Izao no nolazain’i Jehovah: “Aza matahotra noho ny teny renao, dia izay nanevatevan’ny mpanompon’ny mpanjakan’i Asyria ahy.', 'ary hoy i isaia tamin’ireo: “lazao amin’ny tomponareo hoe: ‘izao no nolazain’i jehovah: “aza matahotra noho ny teny renao, dia izay nanevatevan’ny mpanompon’ny mpanjakan’i asyria ahy.'),
  ('6ab25a66868ba88e38e6d290', '2026-09-22T10:37:26.545Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:26.545Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 19, 25, 'Angaha tsy renao fa izany no fanapahan-kevitro efa hatry ny ela be? Efa hatramin’ny taloha aho no nikasa hanao izany. Koa ankehitriny dia hotanterahiko izany. Ary ianao no hahatonga ny tanàna voaro mafy ho lasa aolo, toy ny tanàna lasa korontam-bato miavosa.', 'angaha tsy renao fa izany no fanapahan-kevitro efa hatry ny ela be? efa hatramin’ny taloha aho no nikasa hanao izany. koa ankehitriny dia hotanterahiko izany. ary ianao no hahatonga ny tanàna voaro mafy ho lasa aolo, toy ny tanàna lasa korontam-bato miavosa.'),
  ('6ab25a66868ba88e38e6d28e', '2026-09-22T10:37:26.545Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:26.545Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 19, 23, 'Ny iraka nalefanao no nampiasainao hihantsiana an’i Jehovah, ka hoy ianao: ‘Ny kalesin’adiko maro be no hiakarako Eny amin’ny tendrombohitra avo indrindra, Any amin’ny faritra lavitra indrindra ao Libanona. Ary hokapaiko ny hazo sedera avo sy ny hazo zenevrie tsara indrindra any. Dia hiditra ao amin’ny toeram-ponenana faran’izay lavitra any aho, any amin’ny alany mahavokatra.', 'ny iraka nalefanao no nampiasainao hihantsiana an’i jehovah, ka hoy ianao: ‘ny kalesin’adiko maro be no hiakarako eny amin’ny tendrombohitra avo indrindra, any amin’ny faritra lavitra indrindra ao libanona. ary hokapaiko ny hazo sedera avo sy ny hazo zenevrie tsara indrindra any. dia hiditra ao amin’ny toeram-ponenana faran’izay lavitra any aho, any amin’ny alany mahavokatra.'),
  ('6ab25a66868ba88e38e6d28c', '2026-09-22T10:37:26.545Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:26.545Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 19, 21, 'Koa izao no teny fanamelohan’i Jehovah azy: “Manao tsinontsinona anao i Ziona zanakavavy virjiny, sady maneso anao. Mihivingivin-doha ao andamosinao i Jerosalema zanakavavy.', 'koa izao no teny fanamelohan’i jehovah azy: “manao tsinontsinona anao i ziona zanakavavy virjiny, sady maneso anao. mihivingivin-doha ao andamosinao i jerosalema zanakavavy.'),
  ('6ab25a66868ba88e38e6d27b', '2026-09-22T10:37:26.545Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:26.545Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 19, 4, 'Angamba i Jehovah Andriamanitrao handre ny teny rehetra nataon’i Rabsake, izay nirahin’ny mpanjakan’i Asyria tompony hihantsy an’ilay Andriamanitra velona. Koa rehefa mandre izany teny izany i Jehovah Andriamanitrao, dia hanao ampamoaka azy. Ary aoka ianao hanandratra vavaka ho an’izay sisa mbola eto.’”', 'angamba i jehovah andriamanitrao handre ny teny rehetra nataon’i rabsake, izay nirahin’ny mpanjakan’i asyria tompony hihantsy an’ilay andriamanitra velona. koa rehefa mandre izany teny izany i jehovah andriamanitrao, dia hanao ampamoaka azy. ary aoka ianao hanandratra vavaka ho an’izay sisa mbola eto.’”'),
  ('6ab25a66868ba88e38e6d28a', '2026-09-22T10:37:26.545Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:26.545Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 19, 19, 'Koa ankehitriny, Jehovah Andriamanitray ô, vonjeo eo an-tanany izahay, mba ho fantatry ny fanjakana rehetra eto an-tany fa ianao irery ihany no Andriamanitra, Jehovah ô!”', 'koa ankehitriny, jehovah andriamanitray ô, vonjeo eo an-tanany izahay, mba ho fantatry ny fanjakana rehetra eto an-tany fa ianao irery ihany no andriamanitra, jehovah ô!”'),
  ('6ab25a66868ba88e38e6d294', '2026-09-22T10:37:26.545Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:26.545Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 19, 29, '“‘Ary izao no ho famantarana ho anao: Amin’ity taona ity dia ny vokatra avy amin’ny voa latsaka tamin’ny tany no hohanin’ny olona, ary mbola ho toy izany koa amin’ny herintaona. Amin’ny taona fahatelo kosa dia mamafaza voa ka mijinjà, ary manaova tanimboaloboka, dia hano izay vokatra avy aminy.', '“‘ary izao no ho famantarana ho anao: amin’ity taona ity dia ny vokatra avy amin’ny voa latsaka tamin’ny tany no hohanin’ny olona, ary mbola ho toy izany koa amin’ny herintaona. amin’ny taona fahatelo kosa dia mamafaza voa ka mijinjà, ary manaova tanimboaloboka, dia hano izay vokatra avy aminy.'),
  ('6ab25a66868ba88e38e6d28d', '2026-09-22T10:37:26.545Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:26.545Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 19, 22, 'Mihantsy an’iza ianao, ary manevateva an’iza? Mampiaka-peo amin’iza ianao, Ary mampiandranandrana ny masonao amin’iza? Tsy amin’iza fa amin’Ilay Masin’ny Israely!', 'mihantsy an’iza ianao, ary manevateva an’iza? mampiaka-peo amin’iza ianao, ary mampiandranandrana ny masonao amin’iza? tsy amin’iza fa amin’ilay masin’ny israely!'),
  ('6ab25a66868ba88e38e6d286', '2026-09-22T10:37:26.545Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:26.545Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 19, 15, 'Ary nivavaka teo anatrehan’i Jehovah i Hezekia hoe: “Ry Jehovah Andriamanitry ny Israely, izay mipetraka eo amin’ny kerobima! Ianao irery no tena Andriamanitry ny fanjakana rehetra eto an-tany. Ianao no nanao ny lanitra sy ny tany.', 'ary nivavaka teo anatrehan’i jehovah i hezekia hoe: “ry jehovah andriamanitry ny israely, izay mipetraka eo amin’ny kerobima! ianao irery no tena andriamanitry ny fanjakana rehetra eto an-tany. ianao no nanao ny lanitra sy ny tany.'),
  ('6ab25a66868ba88e38e6d279', '2026-09-22T10:37:26.545Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:26.545Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 19, 2, 'Dia nirahiny ho any amin’i Isaia mpaminany zanak’i Amoza, i Eliakima mpiandraikitra ny ankohonan’ny mpanjaka, sy Sebna mpitan-tsoratra, ary ny anti-panahy mpisorona. Ary nitafy lamba gony daholo ireo.', 'dia nirahiny ho any amin’i isaia mpaminany zanak’i amoza, i eliakima mpiandraikitra ny ankohonan’ny mpanjaka, sy sebna mpitan-tsoratra, ary ny anti-panahy mpisorona. ary nitafy lamba gony daholo ireo.'),
  ('6ab25a66868ba88e38e6d295', '2026-09-22T10:37:26.545Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:26.545Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 19, 30, 'Ary izay tafavoaka velona amin’ny taranak’i Joda, eny, izay sisa miangana, dia hamaka lalina sy hamokatra.', 'ary izay tafavoaka velona amin’ny taranak’i joda, eny, izay sisa miangana, dia hamaka lalina sy hamokatra.'),
  ('6ab25a66868ba88e38e6d293', '2026-09-22T10:37:26.545Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:26.545Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 19, 28, 'Satria efa tonga atỳ am-poto-tsofiko ny fahatezeranao amiko sy ny fieronao. Koa hasiako faraingo ny oronao, ary hasiako lamboridy eo amin’ny vavanao, Ka hotaritiko hiverina any amin’ny lalana niavianao ianao.”', 'satria efa tonga atỳ am-poto-tsofiko ny fahatezeranao amiko sy ny fieronao. koa hasiako faraingo ny oronao, ary hasiako lamboridy eo amin’ny vavanao, ka hotaritiko hiverina any amin’ny lalana niavianao ianao.”'),
  ('6ab25a66868ba88e38e6d27e', '2026-09-22T10:37:26.545Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:26.545Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 19, 7, 'Fa hanome saina azy aho mba hodiany any amin’ny taniny, rehefa mahazo tatitra izy. Ary hataoko izay hahalavon-tsabatra azy any.”’”', 'fa hanome saina azy aho mba hodiany any amin’ny taniny, rehefa mahazo tatitra izy. ary hataoko izay hahalavon-tsabatra azy any.”’”'),
  ('6ab25a66868ba88e38e6d278', '2026-09-22T10:37:26.545Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:26.545Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 19, 1, 'Rehefa ren’i Hezekia Mpanjaka izany, dia norovitiny avy hatrany ny akanjony. Ary nitafy lamba gony izy, ka nankao an-tranon’i Jehovah.', 'rehefa ren’i hezekia mpanjaka izany, dia norovitiny avy hatrany ny akanjony. ary nitafy lamba gony izy, ka nankao an-tranon’i jehovah.'),
  ('6ab25a66868ba88e38e6d29a', '2026-09-22T10:37:26.546Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:26.546Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 19, 35, 'Ny alin’iny dia nivoaka ilay anjelin’i Jehovah, ka nandripaka dimy arivo sy valo alina sy iray hetsy tao an-tobin’ny Asyrianina. Ary nony nifoha maraina ny olona, dia indreo fa efa maty daholo ny Asyrianina.', 'ny alin’iny dia nivoaka ilay anjelin’i jehovah, ka nandripaka dimy arivo sy valo alina sy iray hetsy tao an-tobin’ny asyrianina. ary nony nifoha maraina ny olona, dia indreo fa efa maty daholo ny asyrianina.'),
  ('6ab25a66868ba88e38e6d296', '2026-09-22T10:37:26.546Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:26.546Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 19, 31, 'Fa hisy sisa hivoaka avy ao Jerosalema, ary hisy ho tafavoaka velona avy any amin’ny Tendrombohitra Ziona. Ny hafanam-pon’i Jehovah Tompon’ny tafika no hanatanteraka izany.', 'fa hisy sisa hivoaka avy ao jerosalema, ary hisy ho tafavoaka velona avy any amin’ny tendrombohitra ziona. ny hafanam-pon’i jehovah tompon’ny tafika no hanatanteraka izany.'),
  ('6ab25a66868ba88e38e6d29b', '2026-09-22T10:37:26.546Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:26.546Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 19, 36, 'Koa niala teo i Sankeriba mpanjakan’i Asyria, ka lasa niverina tany Ninive ary nipetraka tany.', 'koa niala teo i sankeriba mpanjakan’i asyria, ka lasa niverina tany ninive ary nipetraka tany.'),
  ('6ab25a66868ba88e38e6d298', '2026-09-22T10:37:26.546Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:26.546Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 19, 33, 'Ny lalana niaviany ihany no hiverenany, fa tsy ho tafiditra ato amin’ity tanàna ity izy, hoy i Jehovah.', 'ny lalana niaviany ihany no hiverenany, fa tsy ho tafiditra ato amin’ity tanàna ity izy, hoy i jehovah.'),
  ('6ab25a66868ba88e38e6d299', '2026-09-22T10:37:26.546Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:26.546Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 19, 34, 'Fa hiaro an’ity tanàna ity aho, ka hamonjy azy noho ny amiko sy noho ny amin’i Davida mpanompoko.”’”', 'fa hiaro an’ity tanàna ity aho, ka hamonjy azy noho ny amiko sy noho ny amin’i davida mpanompoko.”’”'),
  ('6ab25a66868ba88e38e6d29c', '2026-09-22T10:37:26.546Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:26.546Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 19, 37, 'Ary raha mbola niankohoka tao an-tranon’i Nisroka andriamaniny izy, dia namono azy tamin’ny sabatra i Adrameleka sy Sarezera zanany lahy, ka nandositra tany Ararata. Ary i Esara-hadona zanany no nanjaka nandimby azy.', 'ary raha mbola niankohoka tao an-tranon’i nisroka andriamaniny izy, dia namono azy tamin’ny sabatra i adrameleka sy sarezera zanany lahy, ka nandositra tany ararata. ary i esara-hadona zanany no nanjaka nandimby azy.'),
  ('6ab25a66868ba88e38e6d297', '2026-09-22T10:37:26.546Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:26.546Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 19, 32, '“‘Noho izany, dia hoy i Jehovah momba ny mpanjakan’i Asyria: “Tsy ho tafiditra ato amin’ity tanàna ity izy, na handefa zana-tsipìka ato, na hiady amin’ity tanàna ity miaraka amin’ny ampinga, na hanangana tovon-tany * hanaovana fahirano azy.', '“‘noho izany, dia hoy i jehovah momba ny mpanjakan’i asyria: “tsy ho tafiditra ato amin’ity tanàna ity izy, na handefa zana-tsipìka ato, na hiady amin’ity tanàna ity miaraka amin’ny ampinga, na hanangana tovon-tany * hanaovana fahirano azy.'),
  ('6ab25a6747a30fae0914c66a', '2026-09-22T10:37:27.296Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:27.296Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 20, 1, 'Tamin’izany andro izany, dia narary efa ho faty i Hezekia. Koa nankao aminy i Isaia mpaminany zanak’i Amoza, ka niteny hoe: “Izao no nolazain’i Jehovah: ‘Mamelà hafatra amin’ny ankohonanao, satria ho faty ianao fa tsy ho velona.’”', 'tamin’izany andro izany, dia narary efa ho faty i hezekia. koa nankao aminy i isaia mpaminany zanak’i amoza, ka niteny hoe: “izao no nolazain’i jehovah: ‘mamelà hafatra amin’ny ankohonanao, satria ho faty ianao fa tsy ho velona.’”'),
  ('6ab25a6747a30fae0914c66b', '2026-09-22T10:37:27.296Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:27.296Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 20, 2, 'Dia nitodika tany amin’ny rindrina i Hezekia ka nivavaka tamin’i Jehovah, nanao hoe:', 'dia nitodika tany amin’ny rindrina i hezekia ka nivavaka tamin’i jehovah, nanao hoe:'),
  ('6ab25a6747a30fae0914c679', '2026-09-22T10:37:27.297Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:27.297Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 20, 16, 'Dia hoy i Isaia tamin’i Hezekia: “Henoy ny tenin’i Jehovah:', 'dia hoy i isaia tamin’i hezekia: “henoy ny tenin’i jehovah:'),
  ('6ab25a6747a30fae0914c670', '2026-09-22T10:37:27.297Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:27.297Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 20, 7, 'Ary hoy i Isaia: “Makà mofo vita amin’ny aviavy maina noporetina.” Koa nalaina izany, ka natao teo amin’ilay fery. Dia nihasitrana i Hezekia.', 'ary hoy i isaia: “makà mofo vita amin’ny aviavy maina noporetina.” koa nalaina izany, ka natao teo amin’ilay fery. dia nihasitrana i hezekia.'),
  ('6ab25a6747a30fae0914c676', '2026-09-22T10:37:27.297Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:27.297Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 20, 13, 'Ary nihaino azy ireo i Hezekia, ka nasehony azy ny zava-drehetra tao amin’ny fitehirizan-karenany, dia ny volafotsy sy ny volamena sy ny menaka balsama sy ny menaka sarobidy ary ny fitaovam-piadiany, mbamin’izay rehetra tao amin’ny fitehirizan-karenany. Tsy nisy tsy nasehon’i Hezekia azy ny tao an-tranony sy ny tao amin’ny fanjakany manontolo.', 'ary nihaino azy ireo i hezekia, ka nasehony azy ny zava-drehetra tao amin’ny fitehirizan-karenany, dia ny volafotsy sy ny volamena sy ny menaka balsama sy ny menaka sarobidy ary ny fitaovam-piadiany, mbamin’izay rehetra tao amin’ny fitehirizan-karenany. tsy nisy tsy nasehon’i hezekia azy ny tao an-tranony sy ny tao amin’ny fanjakany manontolo.'),
  ('6ab25a6747a30fae0914c672', '2026-09-22T10:37:27.297Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:27.297Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 20, 9, 'Dia hoy i Isaia: “Izao no famantarana avy amin’i Jehovah hahalalanao fa hotanterahin’i Jehovah ny teniny: Hiroso zanatohatra folo ve ny aloka, sa hihemotra zanatohatra folo?”', 'dia hoy i isaia: “izao no famantarana avy amin’i jehovah hahalalanao fa hotanterahin’i jehovah ny teniny: hiroso zanatohatra folo ve ny aloka, sa hihemotra zanatohatra folo?”'),
  ('6ab25a6747a30fae0914c675', '2026-09-22T10:37:27.297Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:27.297Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 20, 12, 'Tamin’izany andro izany, dia nandefa taratasy sy fanomezana ho an’i Hezekia i Berodaka-baladana mpanjakan’i Babylona, zanak’i Baladana, satria reny fa narary i Hezekia.', 'tamin’izany andro izany, dia nandefa taratasy sy fanomezana ho an’i hezekia i berodaka-baladana mpanjakan’i babylona, zanak’i baladana, satria reny fa narary i hezekia.'),
  ('6ab25a6747a30fae0914c671', '2026-09-22T10:37:27.297Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:27.297Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 20, 8, 'Tamin’izay fotoana izay ihany, dia hoy i Hezekia tamin’i Isaia: “Inona no famantarana fa hositranin’i Jehovah aho, ka hiakatra any an-tranon’i Jehovah rahafakampitso?”', 'tamin’izay fotoana izay ihany, dia hoy i hezekia tamin’i isaia: “inona no famantarana fa hositranin’i jehovah aho, ka hiakatra any an-tranon’i jehovah rahafakampitso?”'),
  ('6ab25a6747a30fae0914c66e', '2026-09-22T10:37:27.297Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:27.297Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 20, 5, '“Miverena ka lazao amin’i Hezekia mpitarika ny oloko hoe: ‘Izao no nolazain’i Jehovah, Andriamanitr’i Davida razambenao: “Efa reko ny vavakao, ary efa hitako ny ranomasonao. Koa hanasitrana anao aho. Ary rahafakampitso dia hiakatra any an-tranon’i Jehovah ianao.', '“miverena ka lazao amin’i hezekia mpitarika ny oloko hoe: ‘izao no nolazain’i jehovah, andriamanitr’i davida razambenao: “efa reko ny vavakao, ary efa hitako ny ranomasonao. koa hanasitrana anao aho. ary rahafakampitso dia hiakatra any an-tranon’i jehovah ianao.'),
  ('6ab25a6747a30fae0914c67e', '2026-09-22T10:37:27.297Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:27.297Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 20, 21, 'Farany, dia nodimandry any amin’ny razany i Hezekia, ary i Manase zanany no nanjaka nandimby azy.', 'farany, dia nodimandry any amin’ny razany i hezekia, ary i manase zanany no nanjaka nandimby azy.'),
  ('6ab25a6747a30fae0914c67c', '2026-09-22T10:37:27.297Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:27.297Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 20, 19, 'Dia hoy i Hezekia tamin’i Isaia: “Mety izany tenin’i Jehovah nolazainao izany.” Ary hoy koa izy: “Tsy ho tsara tokoa ve raha mbola hisy fiadanana sy fahamarinana foana amin’ny androko?”', 'dia hoy i hezekia tamin’i isaia: “mety izany tenin’i jehovah nolazainao izany.” ary hoy koa izy: “tsy ho tsara tokoa ve raha mbola hisy fiadanana sy fahamarinana foana amin’ny androko?”'),
  ('6ab25a6747a30fae0914c678', '2026-09-22T10:37:27.297Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:27.297Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 20, 15, 'Ary hoy i Isaia: “Inona no hitany tato an-tranonao?” Dia hoy i Hezekia: “Izay rehetra ato an-tranoko dia hitany daholo. Tsy nisy tsy nasehoko azy ny tao amin’ny fitehirizan-karenako.”', 'ary hoy i isaia: “inona no hitany tato an-tranonao?” dia hoy i hezekia: “izay rehetra ato an-tranoko dia hitany daholo. tsy nisy tsy nasehoko azy ny tao amin’ny fitehirizan-karenako.”'),
  ('6ab25a6747a30fae0914c66d', '2026-09-22T10:37:27.297Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:27.297Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 20, 4, 'Ary raha mbola tsy tafavoaka teny amin’ny tokotany afovoany i Isaia, dia tonga taminy ny tenin’i Jehovah, nanao hoe:', 'ary raha mbola tsy tafavoaka teny amin’ny tokotany afovoany i isaia, dia tonga taminy ny tenin’i jehovah, nanao hoe:'),
  ('6ab25a6747a30fae0914c677', '2026-09-22T10:37:27.297Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:27.297Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 20, 14, 'Avy eo dia nankao amin’i Hezekia Mpanjaka i Isaia mpaminany, ka niteny taminy hoe: “Inona no nolazain’ireny olona ireny? Ary avy aiza, hono, ry zareo no nankatỳ?” Dia hoy i Hezekia: “Avy any an-tany lavitra, avy any Babylona, izy ireny.”', 'avy eo dia nankao amin’i hezekia mpanjaka i isaia mpaminany, ka niteny taminy hoe: “inona no nolazain’ireny olona ireny? ary avy aiza, hono, ry zareo no nankatỳ?” dia hoy i hezekia: “avy any an-tany lavitra, avy any babylona, izy ireny.”'),
  ('6ab25a6747a30fae0914c67a', '2026-09-22T10:37:27.297Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:27.297Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 20, 17, '‘“Ho avy ny andro hitondrana an’izay rehetra ato an-tranonao sy izay rehetra notehirizin’ny razanao mandraka androany, ho any Babylona. Tsy hisy na inona na inona ho tavela”, hoy i Jehovah.', '‘“ho avy ny andro hitondrana an’izay rehetra ato an-tranonao sy izay rehetra notehirizin’ny razanao mandraka androany, ho any babylona. tsy hisy na inona na inona ho tavela”, hoy i jehovah.'),
  ('6ab25a6747a30fae0914c66f', '2026-09-22T10:37:27.297Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:27.297Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 20, 6, 'Dia hampiako dimy ambin’ny folo taona ny andronao. Ary hovonjeko eo am-pelatanan’ny mpanjakan’i Asyria ianao sy ity tanàna ity, ka harovako ity tanàna ity noho ny amiko sy noho ny amin’i Davida mpanompoko.”’”', 'dia hampiako dimy ambin’ny folo taona ny andronao. ary hovonjeko eo am-pelatanan’ny mpanjakan’i asyria ianao sy ity tanàna ity, ka harovako ity tanàna ity noho ny amiko sy noho ny amin’i davida mpanompoko.”’”'),
  ('6ab25a6747a30fae0914c66c', '2026-09-22T10:37:27.297Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:27.297Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 20, 3, '“Mitalaho aminao aho, Jehovah ô! Mba tsarovy re ny nandehanako teo anatrehanao tamim-pahitsiana * sy tamin’ny foko manontolo, ary ny nanaovako izay tsara teo imasonao e!” Dia nitomany be izy.', '“mitalaho aminao aho, jehovah ô! mba tsarovy re ny nandehanako teo anatrehanao tamim-pahitsiana * sy tamin’ny foko manontolo, ary ny nanaovako izay tsara teo imasonao e!” dia nitomany be izy.'),
  ('6ab25a6747a30fae0914c67b', '2026-09-22T10:37:27.297Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:27.297Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 20, 18, '“Hoentina koa ny sasany amin’ny zanakao lahy izay haterakao, ka ho lasa tandapa any an-dapan’ny mpanjakan’i Babylona.”’”', '“hoentina koa ny sasany amin’ny zanakao lahy izay haterakao, ka ho lasa tandapa any an-dapan’ny mpanjakan’i babylona.”’”'),
  ('6ab25a6747a30fae0914c67d', '2026-09-22T10:37:27.297Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:27.297Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 20, 20, 'Ary ny sisa amin’ny tantaran’i Hezekia, mbamin’ny heriny rehetra sy ny nanaovany an’ilay dobo sy ilay lakandrano ka nitarihany rano nankao an-tanàna, tsy efa voasoratra ao amin’ny boky mirakitra ny tantara tamin’ny andron’ireo mpanjakan’ny Joda ve izany?', 'ary ny sisa amin’ny tantaran’i hezekia, mbamin’ny heriny rehetra sy ny nanaovany an’ilay dobo sy ilay lakandrano ka nitarihany rano nankao an-tanàna, tsy efa voasoratra ao amin’ny boky mirakitra ny tantara tamin’ny andron’ireo mpanjakan’ny joda ve izany?'),
  ('6ab25a6747a30fae0914c674', '2026-09-22T10:37:27.297Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:27.297Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 20, 11, 'Koa niantso an’i Jehovah i Isaia mpaminany. Ary nataony nihemotra zanatohatra folo ny aloka izay efa nidina teo amin’ny zanatohatr’i Ahaza.', 'koa niantso an’i jehovah i isaia mpaminany. ary nataony nihemotra zanatohatra folo ny aloka izay efa nidina teo amin’ny zanatohatr’i ahaza.'),
  ('6ab25a6747a30fae0914c673', '2026-09-22T10:37:27.297Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:27.297Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 20, 10, 'Dia hoy i Hezekia: “Mora ny hirosoan’ny aloka zanatohatra folo, noho ny hihemorany zanatohatra folo.”', 'dia hoy i hezekia: “mora ny hirosoan’ny aloka zanatohatra folo, noho ny hihemorany zanatohatra folo.”'),
  ('6ab25a683754caff1aaa255b', '2026-09-22T10:37:28.243Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:28.243Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 21, 26, 'Dia nalevin’izy ireo tao amin’ny fasany, tao amin’ny zaridainan’i Oza, izy. Ary i Josia zanany no nanjaka nandimby azy.', 'dia nalevin’izy ireo tao amin’ny fasany, tao amin’ny zaridainan’i oza, izy. ary i josia zanany no nanjaka nandimby azy.'),
  ('6ab25a683754caff1aaa2544', '2026-09-22T10:37:28.243Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:28.243Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 21, 3, 'Koa naoriny indray ireo toerana avo efa noravan’i Hezekia rainy. Ary nanorina alitara ho an’i Bala sy nanao tsato-kazo masina izy, toy ny nataon’i Ahaba mpanjakan’ny Israely. Dia niankohoka teo anatrehan’izay rehetra eny amin’ny lanitra izy, ka nanompo an’ireny.', 'koa naoriny indray ireo toerana avo efa noravan’i hezekia rainy. ary nanorina alitara ho an’i bala sy nanao tsato-kazo masina izy, toy ny nataon’i ahaba mpanjakan’ny israely. dia niankohoka teo anatrehan’izay rehetra eny amin’ny lanitra izy, ka nanompo an’ireny.'),
  ('6ab25a683754caff1aaa2543', '2026-09-22T10:37:28.243Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:28.243Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 21, 2, 'Ary nanao izay ratsy teo imason’i Jehovah izy. Zava-maharikoriko fanaon’ireo firenena noroahin’i Jehovah tsy ho eo anatrehan’ny zanak’Israely, no nataony.', 'ary nanao izay ratsy teo imason’i jehovah izy. zava-maharikoriko fanaon’ireo firenena noroahin’i jehovah tsy ho eo anatrehan’ny zanak’israely, no nataony.'),
  ('6ab25a683754caff1aaa254c', '2026-09-22T10:37:28.243Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:28.243Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 21, 11, '“Koa satria nahavita ireo zava-maharikoriko ireo i Manase mpanjakan’ny Joda, ka nanao ratsy mihoatra noho izay rehetra nataon’ny Amorita talohany, sady nampanota ny Joda tamin’ny alalan’ireo sampiny maharikoriko,', '“koa satria nahavita ireo zava-maharikoriko ireo i manase mpanjakan’ny joda, ka nanao ratsy mihoatra noho izay rehetra nataon’ny amorita talohany, sady nampanota ny joda tamin’ny alalan’ireo sampiny maharikoriko,'),
  ('6ab25a683754caff1aaa2549', '2026-09-22T10:37:28.243Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:28.243Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 21, 8, 'Ary ny tongotry ny Israely dia tsy havelako intsony hirenireny hiala eo amin’ny tany nomeko ny razany, raha tandreman’izy ireo tsara izay rehetra nandidiako azy, dia ny lalàna rehetra nandidian’i Mosesy mpanompoko azy.”', 'ary ny tongotry ny israely dia tsy havelako intsony hirenireny hiala eo amin’ny tany nomeko ny razany, raha tandreman’izy ireo tsara izay rehetra nandidiako azy, dia ny lalàna rehetra nandidian’i mosesy mpanompoko azy.”'),
  ('6ab25a683754caff1aaa254f', '2026-09-22T10:37:28.243Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:28.243Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 21, 14, 'Ary hafoiko ny sisa amin’ny lovako ka hatolotro eo an-tanan’ny fahavalony. Dia hobaboin’ny fahavalony rehetra sy horobainy izy ireo,', 'ary hafoiko ny sisa amin’ny lovako ka hatolotro eo an-tanan’ny fahavalony. dia hobaboin’ny fahavalony rehetra sy horobainy izy ireo,'),
  ('6ab25a683754caff1aaa2546', '2026-09-22T10:37:28.243Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:28.243Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 21, 5, 'Ary nanorina alitara ho an’izay rehetra eny amin’ny lanitra izy, teo amin’ny tokotany roa ivelan’ny tranon’i Jehovah.', 'ary nanorina alitara ho an’izay rehetra eny amin’ny lanitra izy, teo amin’ny tokotany roa ivelan’ny tranon’i jehovah.'),
  ('6ab25a683754caff1aaa2542', '2026-09-22T10:37:28.243Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:28.243Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 21, 1, 'Roa ambin’ny folo taona i Manase tamin’izy nanomboka nanjaka, ary dimy amby dimampolo taona no nanjakany tany Jerosalema. Ny anaran-dreniny dia Hefziba.', 'roa ambin’ny folo taona i manase tamin’izy nanomboka nanjaka, ary dimy amby dimampolo taona no nanjakany tany jerosalema. ny anaran-dreniny dia hefziba.'),
  ('6ab25a683754caff1aaa254b', '2026-09-22T10:37:28.243Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:28.243Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 21, 10, 'Ary hoy foana i Jehovah tamin’ny alalan’ny mpaminany mpanompony:', 'ary hoy foana i jehovah tamin’ny alalan’ny mpaminany mpanompony:'),
  ('6ab25a683754caff1aaa2548', '2026-09-22T10:37:28.243Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:28.243Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 21, 7, 'Ary ilay tsato-kazo masina natao sokitra, dia napetrany tao amin’ilay trano izay nolazain’i Jehovah tamin’i Davida sy Solomona zanany hoe: “Ato amin’ity trano ity sy eto Jerosalema, izay nofidiko teo amin’ny foko rehetran’ny Israely, no hametrahako ny anarako mandritra ny fotoana tsy voafetra.', 'ary ilay tsato-kazo masina natao sokitra, dia napetrany tao amin’ilay trano izay nolazain’i jehovah tamin’i davida sy solomona zanany hoe: “ato amin’ity trano ity sy eto jerosalema, izay nofidiko teo amin’ny foko rehetran’ny israely, no hametrahako ny anarako mandritra ny fotoana tsy voafetra.'),
  ('6ab25a683754caff1aaa2545', '2026-09-22T10:37:28.243Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:28.243Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 21, 4, 'Nanorina alitara tao an-tranon’i Jehovah izy, nefa efa nilaza momba io trano io i Jehovah hoe: “Ao Jerosalema no hametrahako ny anarako.”', 'nanorina alitara tao an-tranon’i jehovah izy, nefa efa nilaza momba io trano io i jehovah hoe: “ao jerosalema no hametrahako ny anarako.”'),
  ('6ab25a683754caff1aaa2550', '2026-09-22T10:37:28.243Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:28.243Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 21, 15, 'satria nanao izay ratsy teo imasoko, sady nampahatezitra ahy foana, hatramin’ny andro nivoahan’ny razany avy tany Ejipta ka mandraka androany.’”', 'satria nanao izay ratsy teo imasoko, sady nampahatezitra ahy foana, hatramin’ny andro nivoahan’ny razany avy tany ejipta ka mandraka androany.’”'),
  ('6ab25a683754caff1aaa2554', '2026-09-22T10:37:28.243Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:28.243Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 21, 19, 'Roa amby roapolo taona i Amona tamin’izy nanomboka nanjaka, ary roa taona no nanjakany tany Jerosalema. Ny anaran-dreniny dia Mesolemeta, zanak’i Haroza avy any Jotba.', 'roa amby roapolo taona i amona tamin’izy nanomboka nanjaka, ary roa taona no nanjakany tany jerosalema. ny anaran-dreniny dia mesolemeta, zanak’i haroza avy any jotba.'),
  ('6ab25a683754caff1aaa2559', '2026-09-22T10:37:28.243Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:28.243Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 21, 24, 'Novonoin’ny vahoaka anefa izay rehetra niray tetika namono an’i Amona Mpanjaka, ary i Josia zanany no nataon’izy ireo mpanjaka nandimby azy.', 'novonoin’ny vahoaka anefa izay rehetra niray tetika namono an’i amona mpanjaka, ary i josia zanany no nataon’izy ireo mpanjaka nandimby azy.'),
  ('6ab25a683754caff1aaa2556', '2026-09-22T10:37:28.243Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:28.243Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 21, 21, 'Nanao hoatran’izay rehetra nataon-drainy foana izy, sady nanompo an’ireo sampy maharikoriko notompoin-drainy, ary niankohoka teo anatrehan’ireny.', 'nanao hoatran’izay rehetra nataon-drainy foana izy, sady nanompo an’ireo sampy maharikoriko notompoin-drainy, ary niankohoka teo anatrehan’ireny.'),
  ('6ab25a683754caff1aaa2547', '2026-09-22T10:37:28.243Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:28.243Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 21, 6, 'Ary nandoro * ny zanany tao anaty afo izy, sady nampiasa herin’ny maizina sy nitady fambara ary nampiasa mpamoha angatra sy mpilaza ny hoavy. Nanao izay ratsy teo imason’i Jehovah izy mba hampahatezitra azy, ary be tokoa ny ratsy vitany.', 'ary nandoro * ny zanany tao anaty afo izy, sady nampiasa herin’ny maizina sy nitady fambara ary nampiasa mpamoha angatra sy mpilaza ny hoavy. nanao izay ratsy teo imason’i jehovah izy mba hampahatezitra azy, ary be tokoa ny ratsy vitany.'),
  ('6ab25a683754caff1aaa2558', '2026-09-22T10:37:28.243Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:28.243Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 21, 23, 'Tatỳ aoriana, dia niray tetika hamely ny mpanjaka ny mpanompony, ka namono azy ho faty tao an-tranony ihany.', 'tatỳ aoriana, dia niray tetika hamely ny mpanjaka ny mpanompony, ka namono azy ho faty tao an-tranony ihany.'),
  ('6ab25a683754caff1aaa2552', '2026-09-22T10:37:28.243Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:28.243Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 21, 17, 'Ary ny sisa amin’ny tantaran’i Manase mbamin’izay rehetra nataony sy ny fahotany, tsy efa voasoratra ao amin’ny boky mirakitra ny tantara tamin’ny andron’ireo mpanjakan’ny Joda ve izany?', 'ary ny sisa amin’ny tantaran’i manase mbamin’izay rehetra nataony sy ny fahotany, tsy efa voasoratra ao amin’ny boky mirakitra ny tantara tamin’ny andron’ireo mpanjakan’ny joda ve izany?'),
  ('6ab25a683754caff1aaa254e', '2026-09-22T10:37:28.243Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:28.243Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 21, 13, 'Ary hohenjaniko eo amin’i Jerosalema ny tady fandrefesana nampiasaina tamin’i Samaria, sy ny filamatra * nampiasaina tamin’ny taranak’i Ahaba. Dia hodioviko i Jerosalema, toy ny manadio vilia baolina izay diovina ka ahohoka.', 'ary hohenjaniko eo amin’i jerosalema ny tady fandrefesana nampiasaina tamin’i samaria, sy ny filamatra * nampiasaina tamin’ny taranak’i ahaba. dia hodioviko i jerosalema, toy ny manadio vilia baolina izay diovina ka ahohoka.'),
  ('6ab25a683754caff1aaa254a', '2026-09-22T10:37:28.243Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:28.243Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 21, 9, 'Tsy nihaino anefa izy ireo, fa notaomin’i Manase foana hanao ratsy mihoatra noho izay nataon’ireo firenena naringan’i Jehovah tsy ho eo anatrehan’ny zanak’Israely.', 'tsy nihaino anefa izy ireo, fa notaomin’i manase foana hanao ratsy mihoatra noho izay nataon’ireo firenena naringan’i jehovah tsy ho eo anatrehan’ny zanak’israely.'),
  ('6ab25a683754caff1aaa255a', '2026-09-22T10:37:28.243Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:28.243Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 21, 25, 'Ary ny sisa amin’ny tantaran’i Amona, dia izay nataony, tsy efa voasoratra ao amin’ny boky mirakitra ny tantara tamin’ny andron’ireo mpanjakan’ny Joda ve izany?', 'ary ny sisa amin’ny tantaran’i amona, dia izay nataony, tsy efa voasoratra ao amin’ny boky mirakitra ny tantara tamin’ny andron’ireo mpanjakan’ny joda ve izany?'),
  ('6ab25a683754caff1aaa2555', '2026-09-22T10:37:28.243Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:28.243Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 21, 20, 'Ary nanao izay ratsy teo imason’i Jehovah foana i Amona, toy ny nataon’i Manase rainy.', 'ary nanao izay ratsy teo imason’i jehovah foana i amona, toy ny nataon’i manase rainy.'),
  ('6ab25a683754caff1aaa2553', '2026-09-22T10:37:28.243Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:28.243Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 21, 18, 'Farany, dia nodimandry any amin’ny razany i Manase, ka nalevina tao amin’ny zaridainan’ny tranony, tao amin’ny zaridainan’i Oza. Ary i Amona zanany no nanjaka nandimby azy.', 'farany, dia nodimandry any amin’ny razany i manase, ka nalevina tao amin’ny zaridainan’ny tranony, tao amin’ny zaridainan’i oza. ary i amona zanany no nanjaka nandimby azy.'),
  ('6ab25a683754caff1aaa254d', '2026-09-22T10:37:28.243Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:28.243Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 21, 12, 'dia izao no nolazain’i Jehovah Andriamanitry ny Israely: ‘Hahatonga loza amin’i Jerosalema sy Joda aho, ka hangorintsina ny sofin’izay mandre izany.', 'dia izao no nolazain’i jehovah andriamanitry ny israely: ‘hahatonga loza amin’i jerosalema sy joda aho, ka hangorintsina ny sofin’izay mandre izany.'),
  ('6ab25a683754caff1aaa2557', '2026-09-22T10:37:28.243Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:28.243Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 21, 22, 'Koa nahafoy an’i Jehovah Andriamanitry ny razany izy, ka tsy nandeha tamin’ny lalan’i Jehovah.', 'koa nahafoy an’i jehovah andriamanitry ny razany izy, ka tsy nandeha tamin’ny lalan’i jehovah.'),
  ('6ab25a683754caff1aaa2551', '2026-09-22T10:37:28.243Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:28.243Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 21, 16, 'Ary be dia be ny ran’olona tsy manan-tsiny nalatsak’i Manase, ka nofenoiny ra i Jerosalema. Izany dia ankoatra ny fahotana izay nataony sy nampanotany ny Joda, ka nahatonga ny Joda hanao izay ratsy teo imason’i Jehovah.', 'ary be dia be ny ran’olona tsy manan-tsiny nalatsak’i manase, ka nofenoiny ra i jerosalema. izany dia ankoatra ny fahotana izay nataony sy nampanotany ny joda, ka nahatonga ny joda hanao izay ratsy teo imason’i jehovah.'),
  ('6ab25a68bebb1ae30b794713', '2026-09-22T10:37:28.733Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:28.733Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 22, 6, 'dia ny mpanao asa tanana sy ny mpanao trano ary ny mpandatsa-biriky, ary homena koa mba hividianana hazo sy vato voapaika hanamboarana ny trano.', 'dia ny mpanao asa tanana sy ny mpanao trano ary ny mpandatsa-biriky, ary homena koa mba hividianana hazo sy vato voapaika hanamboarana ny trano.'),
  ('6ab25a68bebb1ae30b79470f', '2026-09-22T10:37:28.733Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:28.733Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 22, 2, 'Ary nanao izay mahitsy teo imason’i Jehovah izy, sady nanao hoatran’izay rehetra nataon’i Davida razambeny. Nanaraka an-tsakany sy an-davany ny didin’Andriamanitra izy.', 'ary nanao izay mahitsy teo imason’i jehovah izy, sady nanao hoatran’izay rehetra nataon’i davida razambeny. nanaraka an-tsakany sy an-davany ny didin’andriamanitra izy.'),
  ('6ab25a68bebb1ae30b79471b', '2026-09-22T10:37:28.733Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:28.733Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 22, 14, 'Koa lasa i Hilkia mpisorona sy Ahikama sy Akbora sy Safana ary Asaia, ka nankany amin’i Holda mpaminanivavy, vadin’i Saloma mpikarakara ny fitafiana, zanak’i Tikva zanak’i Harasa. Nipetraka tao amin’ny tanàna vaovao tao Jerosalema ravehivavy. Ary niresaka taminy izy ireo.', 'koa lasa i hilkia mpisorona sy ahikama sy akbora sy safana ary asaia, ka nankany amin’i holda mpaminanivavy, vadin’i saloma mpikarakara ny fitafiana, zanak’i tikva zanak’i harasa. nipetraka tao amin’ny tanàna vaovao tao jerosalema ravehivavy. ary niresaka taminy izy ireo.'),
  ('6ab25a68bebb1ae30b794715', '2026-09-22T10:37:28.733Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:28.733Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 22, 8, 'Tatỳ aoriana, dia hoy i Hilkia mpisoronabe tamin’i Safana mpitan-tsoratra: “Hitako tao an-tranon’i Jehovah ny boky misy ny lalàna.” Dia nomeny an’i Safana ilay boky, ka novakin’i Safana.', 'tatỳ aoriana, dia hoy i hilkia mpisoronabe tamin’i safana mpitan-tsoratra: “hitako tao an-tranon’i jehovah ny boky misy ny lalàna.” dia nomeny an’i safana ilay boky, ka novakin’i safana.'),
  ('6ab25a68bebb1ae30b794711', '2026-09-22T10:37:28.733Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:28.733Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 22, 4, '“Miakara any amin’i Hilkia mpisoronabe, ary asaivo angoniny ny vola nentin’ny olona tao an-tranon’i Jehovah, dia ny vola voangon’ny mpiandry varavarana.', '“miakara any amin’i hilkia mpisoronabe, ary asaivo angoniny ny vola nentin’ny olona tao an-tranon’i jehovah, dia ny vola voangon’ny mpiandry varavarana.'),
  ('6ab25a68bebb1ae30b794721', '2026-09-22T10:37:28.733Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:28.733Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 22, 20, '“Koa hangoniko any amin’ny razanao ianao, ary amin’ny fotoana mampandry feizay ny tany no hahafatesanao, ka tsy ho hitan’ny masonao ny loza rehetra hamelezako ity toerana ity.”’” Dia nentin’izy ireo tany amin’ny mpanjaka izany valin-teny izany.', '“koa hangoniko any amin’ny razanao ianao, ary amin’ny fotoana mampandry feizay ny tany no hahafatesanao, ka tsy ho hitan’ny masonao ny loza rehetra hamelezako ity toerana ity.”’” dia nentin’izy ireo tany amin’ny mpanjaka izany valin-teny izany.');
INSERT INTO "bible_verses" ("id", "created_date", "updated_date", "created_by_id", "created_by", "translation", "book", "bookOrder", "chapter", "verse", "text", "normalizedText") VALUES
  ('6ab25a68bebb1ae30b79471f', '2026-09-22T10:37:28.733Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:28.733Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 22, 18, 'Izao koa lazaina amin’ny mpanjakan’ny Joda, izay naniraka anareo hanontany an’i Jehovah: ‘Izao no nolazain’i Jehovah Andriamanitry ny Israely momba ireo teny izay renao:', 'izao koa lazaina amin’ny mpanjakan’ny joda, izay naniraka anareo hanontany an’i jehovah: ‘izao no nolazain’i jehovah andriamanitry ny israely momba ireo teny izay renao:'),
  ('6ab25a68bebb1ae30b79471c', '2026-09-22T10:37:28.733Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:28.733Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 22, 15, 'Dia hoy i Holda: “Izao no nolazain’i Jehovah Andriamanitry ny Israely: ‘Lazao amin’ilay lehilahy naniraka anareo ho atỳ amiko hoe:', 'dia hoy i holda: “izao no nolazain’i jehovah andriamanitry ny israely: ‘lazao amin’ilay lehilahy naniraka anareo ho atỳ amiko hoe:'),
  ('6ab25a68bebb1ae30b79471a', '2026-09-22T10:37:28.733Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:28.733Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 22, 13, '“Mandehana manontany an’i Jehovah, ho ahy sy ho an’ny vahoaka ary ny Joda rehetra, momba ireo teny ao amin’io boky vao hita io. Fa lehibe ny fahatezeran’i Jehovah hihatra amintsika, satria tsy nihaino ny teny voalaza ao amin’io boky io ny razantsika, ka tsy nanaraka izay rehetra voasoratra momba antsika.”', '“mandehana manontany an’i jehovah, ho ahy sy ho an’ny vahoaka ary ny joda rehetra, momba ireo teny ao amin’io boky vao hita io. fa lehibe ny fahatezeran’i jehovah hihatra amintsika, satria tsy nihaino ny teny voalaza ao amin’io boky io ny razantsika, ka tsy nanaraka izay rehetra voasoratra momba antsika.”'),
  ('6ab25a68bebb1ae30b794710', '2026-09-22T10:37:28.733Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:28.733Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 22, 3, 'Ary tamin’ny taona fahavalo ambin’ny folo nanjakan’i Josia Mpanjaka, dia nirahiny ho any an-tranon’i Jehovah i Safana mpitan-tsoratra, zanak’i Azalia zanak’i Mesolama, ka nilazany hoe:', 'ary tamin’ny taona fahavalo ambin’ny folo nanjakan’i josia mpanjaka, dia nirahiny ho any an-tranon’i jehovah i safana mpitan-tsoratra, zanak’i azalia zanak’i mesolama, ka nilazany hoe:'),
  ('6ab25a68bebb1ae30b794719', '2026-09-22T10:37:28.733Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:28.733Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 22, 12, 'Dia nodidian’ny mpanjaka i Hilkia mpisorona, sy Ahikama zanak’i Safana, sy Akbora zanak’i Mikaia, sy Safana mpitan-tsoratra, ary Asaia mpanompon’ny mpanjaka, nanao hoe:', 'dia nodidian’ny mpanjaka i hilkia mpisorona, sy ahikama zanak’i safana, sy akbora zanak’i mikaia, sy safana mpitan-tsoratra, ary asaia mpanompon’ny mpanjaka, nanao hoe:'),
  ('6ab25a68bebb1ae30b794717', '2026-09-22T10:37:28.733Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:28.733Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 22, 10, 'Hoy koa i Safana mpitan-tsoratra tamin’ny mpanjaka: “Misy boky nomen’i Hilkia mpisorona ahy.” Dia novakin’i Safana teo anatrehan’ny mpanjaka izany.', 'hoy koa i safana mpitan-tsoratra tamin’ny mpanjaka: “misy boky nomen’i hilkia mpisorona ahy.” dia novakin’i safana teo anatrehan’ny mpanjaka izany.'),
  ('6ab25a68bebb1ae30b794716', '2026-09-22T10:37:28.733Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:28.733Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 22, 9, 'Ary nankao amin’ny mpanjaka i Safana mpitan-tsoratra, ka niteny taminy hoe: “Efa nararaky ny mpanomponao ny vola azo tao an-tranon’Andriamanitra, ka natolony teo an-tanan’ireo voatendry hanao ny asa ao an-tranon’i Jehovah.”', 'ary nankao amin’ny mpanjaka i safana mpitan-tsoratra, ka niteny taminy hoe: “efa nararaky ny mpanomponao ny vola azo tao an-tranon’andriamanitra, ka natolony teo an-tanan’ireo voatendry hanao ny asa ao an-tranon’i jehovah.”'),
  ('6ab25a68bebb1ae30b794718', '2026-09-22T10:37:28.733Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:28.733Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 22, 11, 'Raha vao nandre izay voalaza tao amin’ilay boky misy ny lalàna ny mpanjaka, dia nandrovitra ny akanjony avy hatrany.', 'raha vao nandre izay voalaza tao amin’ilay boky misy ny lalàna ny mpanjaka, dia nandrovitra ny akanjony avy hatrany.'),
  ('6ab25a68bebb1ae30b794712', '2026-09-22T10:37:28.733Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:28.733Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 22, 5, 'Asaivo atolony eo an-tanan’ireo voatendry hanao ny asa ao an-tranon’i Jehovah izany. Ireo indray no hanome izany mba hanamboarana ny triatra amin’ny trano. Homena an’ireo miasa ao an-tranon’i Jehovah izany,', 'asaivo atolony eo an-tanan’ireo voatendry hanao ny asa ao an-tranon’i jehovah izany. ireo indray no hanome izany mba hanamboarana ny triatra amin’ny trano. homena an’ireo miasa ao an-tranon’i jehovah izany,'),
  ('6ab25a68bebb1ae30b79471d', '2026-09-22T10:37:28.733Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:28.733Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 22, 16, '“Izao no nolazain’i Jehovah: ‘Hahatonga loza amin’ity toerana ity sy ny mponina eo aminy aho, araka ny teny rehetra ao amin’ilay boky novakin’ny mpanjakan’ny Joda.', '“izao no nolazain’i jehovah: ‘hahatonga loza amin’ity toerana ity sy ny mponina eo aminy aho, araka ny teny rehetra ao amin’ilay boky novakin’ny mpanjakan’ny joda.'),
  ('6ab25a68bebb1ae30b79471e', '2026-09-22T10:37:28.733Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:28.733Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 22, 17, 'Nahafoy ahy mantsy izy ireo ka nanolotra setroka ho sorona ho an’andriamani-kafa, mba hampahatezitra ahy amin’ny asan’ny tanany rehetra. Ary nirehitra tamin’ity toerana ity ny fahatezerako ka tsy hovonoina.’”’', 'nahafoy ahy mantsy izy ireo ka nanolotra setroka ho sorona ho an’andriamani-kafa, mba hampahatezitra ahy amin’ny asan’ny tanany rehetra. ary nirehitra tamin’ity toerana ity ny fahatezerako ka tsy hovonoina.’”’'),
  ('6ab25a68bebb1ae30b79470e', '2026-09-22T10:37:28.733Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:28.733Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 22, 1, 'Valo taona i Josia tamin’izy nanomboka nanjaka, ary iraika amby telopolo taona no nanjakany tany Jerosalema. Ny anaran-dreniny dia Jedida zanak’i Adaia avy any Bozkata.', 'valo taona i josia tamin’izy nanomboka nanjaka, ary iraika amby telopolo taona no nanjakany tany jerosalema. ny anaran-dreniny dia jedida zanak’i adaia avy any bozkata.'),
  ('6ab25a68bebb1ae30b794720', '2026-09-22T10:37:28.733Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:28.733Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 22, 19, '“Koa satria mora nanaiky ny fonao ka nanetry tena ianao noho ny amin’i Jehovah, rehefa nandre izay nolazaiko hamelezana ity toerana ity sy ny mponina eo aminy, mba hahatonga azy ity higagan’ny olona sy ho voaozona, ary nandrovitra ny akanjonao koa ianao ka nitomany teo anatrehako, dia nihaino anao aho”, hoy i Jehovah.', '“koa satria mora nanaiky ny fonao ka nanetry tena ianao noho ny amin’i jehovah, rehefa nandre izay nolazaiko hamelezana ity toerana ity sy ny mponina eo aminy, mba hahatonga azy ity higagan’ny olona sy ho voaozona, ary nandrovitra ny akanjonao koa ianao ka nitomany teo anatrehako, dia nihaino anao aho”, hoy i jehovah.'),
  ('6ab25a68bebb1ae30b794714', '2026-09-22T10:37:28.733Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:28.733Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 22, 7, 'Tsy tokony hanontaniana an’ireo notolorana an’ilay vola anefa ny kaontim-bola, satria mendri-pitokisana izy ireo amin’ny asany.”', 'tsy tokony hanontaniana an’ireo notolorana an’ilay vola anefa ny kaontim-bola, satria mendri-pitokisana izy ireo amin’ny asany.”'),
  ('6ab25a69b001a748958a872c', '2026-09-22T10:37:29.875Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:29.875Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 23, 23, 'Fa tamin’ny taona fahavalo ambin’ny folo nanjakan’i Josia Mpanjaka no nankalazana izany Paska izany ho an’i Jehovah, tany Jerosalema.', 'fa tamin’ny taona fahavalo ambin’ny folo nanjakan’i josia mpanjaka no nankalazana izany paska izany ho an’i jehovah, tany jerosalema.'),
  ('6ab25a69b001a748958a8726', '2026-09-22T10:37:29.875Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:29.875Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 23, 17, 'Ary hoy i Josia: “Inona itsy tsangambatom-pasana hitako itsy?” Dia hoy ny olona tao an-tanàna: “Io no fasan’ilay lehilahin’Andriamanitra avy any Joda, izay nanambara izao zavatra nataonao tamin’ilay alitara teto Betela izao.”', 'ary hoy i josia: “inona itsy tsangambatom-pasana hitako itsy?” dia hoy ny olona tao an-tanàna: “io no fasan’ilay lehilahin’andriamanitra avy any joda, izay nanambara izao zavatra nataonao tamin’ilay alitara teto betela izao.”'),
  ('6ab25a69b001a748958a8722', '2026-09-22T10:37:29.875Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:29.875Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 23, 13, 'Ary nozimbazimbain’ny mpanjaka ireo toerana avo tandrifin’i Jerosalema, mba tsy ho mendrika hatao toeram-pivavahana intsony. Teo ankavanan’ny Tendrombohitry ny Faharavana no nisy ireo toerana avo ireo, ary i Solomona mpanjakan’ny Israely no nanorina azy ho an’i Astarta, ilay zava-maharikoriko notompoin’ny Sidonianina, sy ho an’i Kemosy, ilay zava-maharikoriko notompoin’ny Moabita, ary ho an’i Milkoma, ilay zava-maharikoriko notompoin’ny taranak’i Amona.', 'ary nozimbazimbain’ny mpanjaka ireo toerana avo tandrifin’i jerosalema, mba tsy ho mendrika hatao toeram-pivavahana intsony. teo ankavanan’ny tendrombohitry ny faharavana no nisy ireo toerana avo ireo, ary i solomona mpanjakan’ny israely no nanorina azy ho an’i astarta, ilay zava-maharikoriko notompoin’ny sidonianina, sy ho an’i kemosy, ilay zava-maharikoriko notompoin’ny moabita, ary ho an’i milkoma, ilay zava-maharikoriko notompoin’ny taranak’i amona.'),
  ('6ab25a69b001a748958a8731', '2026-09-22T10:37:29.875Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:29.875Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 23, 28, 'Ary ny sisa amin’ny tantaran’i Josia, mbamin’izay rehetra nataony, tsy efa voasoratra ao amin’ny boky mirakitra ny tantara tamin’ny andron’ireo mpanjakan’ny Joda ve izany?', 'ary ny sisa amin’ny tantaran’i josia, mbamin’izay rehetra nataony, tsy efa voasoratra ao amin’ny boky mirakitra ny tantara tamin’ny andron’ireo mpanjakan’ny joda ve izany?'),
  ('6ab25a69b001a748958a8734', '2026-09-22T10:37:29.875Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:29.875Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 23, 31, 'Telo amby roapolo taona i Joahaza tamin’izy nanomboka nanjaka, ary telo volana no nanjakany tany Jerosalema. Ny anaran-dreniny dia Hamotala, zanak’i Jeremia avy any Libna.', 'telo amby roapolo taona i joahaza tamin’izy nanomboka nanjaka, ary telo volana no nanjakany tany jerosalema. ny anaran-dreniny dia hamotala, zanak’i jeremia avy any libna.'),
  ('6ab25a69b001a748958a8733', '2026-09-22T10:37:29.875Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:29.875Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 23, 30, 'Koa nataon’ny mpanompony tao anaty kalesy ny fatiny, ka nentiny niala tao Megido ho any Jerosalema, dia naleviny tao amin’ny fasany. Ary nalain’ny vahoaka i Joahaza zanak’i Josia, ka nohosorany ary nataony mpanjaka handimby an-drainy.', 'koa nataon’ny mpanompony tao anaty kalesy ny fatiny, ka nentiny niala tao megido ho any jerosalema, dia naleviny tao amin’ny fasany. ary nalain’ny vahoaka i joahaza zanak’i josia, ka nohosorany ary nataony mpanjaka handimby an-drainy.'),
  ('6ab25a69b001a748958a8730', '2026-09-22T10:37:29.875Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:29.875Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 23, 27, 'Ary hoy i Jehovah: “Hesoriko tsy ho eo imasoko koa ny Joda, toy ny nanesorako ny Israely. Ary holaviko ity tanànan’i Jerosalema nofidiko ity, sy ilay trano izay nolazaiko hoe: ‘Hitoetra ao ny anarako.’”', 'ary hoy i jehovah: “hesoriko tsy ho eo imasoko koa ny joda, toy ny nanesorako ny israely. ary holaviko ity tanànan’i jerosalema nofidiko ity, sy ilay trano izay nolazaiko hoe: ‘hitoetra ao ny anarako.’”'),
  ('6ab25a69b001a748958a872d', '2026-09-22T10:37:29.875Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:29.875Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 23, 24, 'Ary ny mpamoha angatra sy ny mpilaza ny hoavy, mbamin’ny terafima * sy ny sampy maharikoriko ary ny zava-maharikoriko rehetra hita tany Joda sy Jerosalema, dia nesorin’i Josia koa, mba hanatanterahany izay voalazan’ny lalàna voasoratra ao amin’ilay boky hitan’i Hilkia mpisorona tao an-tranon’i Jehovah.', 'ary ny mpamoha angatra sy ny mpilaza ny hoavy, mbamin’ny terafima * sy ny sampy maharikoriko ary ny zava-maharikoriko rehetra hita tany joda sy jerosalema, dia nesorin’i josia koa, mba hanatanterahany izay voalazan’ny lalàna voasoratra ao amin’ilay boky hitan’i hilkia mpisorona tao an-tranon’i jehovah.'),
  ('6ab25a69b001a748958a871d', '2026-09-22T10:37:29.875Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:29.875Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 23, 8, 'Ary nampanalain’i Josia ny mpisorona rehetra tany amin’ny tanànan’i Joda. Tiany hozimbazimbaina mantsy ny toerana avo nanoloran’ny mpisorona setroka ho sorona, mba tsy ho mendrika hatao toeram-pivavahana intsony, hatrany Geba ka hatrany Beri-sheba. Noravany koa ny toerana avo teny amin’ireo vavahady teo amin’ny fidirana amin’ny vavahadin’i Josoa lehiben’ny tanàna. Eo ankavia no misy an’io vavahadin’i Josoa io, raha miditra eo am-bavahadin’ny tanàna ny olona.', 'ary nampanalain’i josia ny mpisorona rehetra tany amin’ny tanànan’i joda. tiany hozimbazimbaina mantsy ny toerana avo nanoloran’ny mpisorona setroka ho sorona, mba tsy ho mendrika hatao toeram-pivavahana intsony, hatrany geba ka hatrany beri-sheba. noravany koa ny toerana avo teny amin’ireo vavahady teo amin’ny fidirana amin’ny vavahadin’i josoa lehiben’ny tanàna. eo ankavia no misy an’io vavahadin’i josoa io, raha miditra eo am-bavahadin’ny tanàna ny olona.'),
  ('6ab25a69b001a748958a8735', '2026-09-22T10:37:29.875Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:29.875Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 23, 32, 'Ary nanao izay ratsy teo imason’i Jehovah izy, toy izay rehetra nataon’ny razany.', 'ary nanao izay ratsy teo imason’i jehovah izy, toy izay rehetra nataon’ny razany.'),
  ('6ab25a69b001a748958a872e', '2026-09-22T10:37:29.875Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:29.875Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 23, 25, 'Ary tsy nisy mpanjaka tahaka azy talohany, izay niverina tamin’i Jehovah tamin’ny fony manontolo sy ny tenany manontolo ary ny heriny manontolo, araka ny lalàn’i Mosesy rehetra. Ary tsy nisy tahaka azy intsony koa taoriany.', 'ary tsy nisy mpanjaka tahaka azy talohany, izay niverina tamin’i jehovah tamin’ny fony manontolo sy ny tenany manontolo ary ny heriny manontolo, araka ny lalàn’i mosesy rehetra. ary tsy nisy tahaka azy intsony koa taoriany.'),
  ('6ab25a69b001a748958a8720', '2026-09-22T10:37:29.875Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:29.875Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 23, 11, 'Ary ny soavaly natokan’ireo mpanjakan’ny Joda ho an’ny masoandro, dia tsy navelany intsony hiditra tao an-tranon’i Jehovah ka handalo teo amin’ny efitra fisakafoana izay an’i Natana-meleka tandapa, dia ilay efitra teo amin’ny lala-mitafo. Nodoran’i Josia koa ireo kalesin’ny masoandro.', 'ary ny soavaly natokan’ireo mpanjakan’ny joda ho an’ny masoandro, dia tsy navelany intsony hiditra tao an-tranon’i jehovah ka handalo teo amin’ny efitra fisakafoana izay an’i natana-meleka tandapa, dia ilay efitra teo amin’ny lala-mitafo. nodoran’i josia koa ireo kalesin’ny masoandro.'),
  ('6ab25a69b001a748958a8725', '2026-09-22T10:37:29.875Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:29.875Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 23, 16, 'Rehefa nitodika i Josia, dia hitany ny toeram-pandevenana teny an-tendrombohitra. Koa nampanalainy ny taolam-paty tao amin’ireny, ka nodorany teo ambonin’ilay alitara, mba hanazimbazimbany azy io ho tsy mendrika hatao toeram-pivavahana intsony, araka ny tenin’i Jehovah nambaran’ilay lehilahin’Andriamanitra, izay nanambara izany.', 'rehefa nitodika i josia, dia hitany ny toeram-pandevenana teny an-tendrombohitra. koa nampanalainy ny taolam-paty tao amin’ireny, ka nodorany teo ambonin’ilay alitara, mba hanazimbazimbany azy io ho tsy mendrika hatao toeram-pivavahana intsony, araka ny tenin’i jehovah nambaran’ilay lehilahin’andriamanitra, izay nanambara izany.'),
  ('6ab25a69b001a748958a871e', '2026-09-22T10:37:29.875Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:29.875Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 23, 9, 'Tsy niakatra ho any amin’ny alitaran’i Jehovah tany Jerosalema ny mpisoron’ny toerana avo, nefa nihinana mofo tsy misy lalivay niaraka tamin’ny rahalahiny ihany.', 'tsy niakatra ho any amin’ny alitaran’i jehovah tany jerosalema ny mpisoron’ny toerana avo, nefa nihinana mofo tsy misy lalivay niaraka tamin’ny rahalahiny ihany.'),
  ('6ab25a69b001a748958a871c', '2026-09-22T10:37:29.875Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:29.875Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 23, 7, 'Noravany koa ny tranon’ireo lehilahy mpivaro-tenan’ny tempoly, tao an-tranon’i Jehovah. Tao amin’ireny trano ireny ireo vehivavy no nanenona tranolay masina fitoeran’ny tsato-kazo masina.', 'noravany koa ny tranon’ireo lehilahy mpivaro-tenan’ny tempoly, tao an-tranon’i jehovah. tao amin’ireny trano ireny ireo vehivavy no nanenona tranolay masina fitoeran’ny tsato-kazo masina.'),
  ('6ab25a69b001a748958a871b', '2026-09-22T10:37:29.875Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:29.875Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 23, 6, 'Navoakany avy tao an-tranon’i Jehovah koa ny tsato-kazo masina ka nentiny teny amin’ny sisin’i Jerosalema, teny amin’ny lohasaha falehan-driakan’i Kidrona. Dia nodorany teny izany ka notorotoroiny ho vovoka, ary nafafiny teny amin’ny fasam-bahoaka ny vovony.', 'navoakany avy tao an-tranon’i jehovah koa ny tsato-kazo masina ka nentiny teny amin’ny sisin’i jerosalema, teny amin’ny lohasaha falehan-driakan’i kidrona. dia nodorany teny izany ka notorotoroiny ho vovoka, ary nafafiny teny amin’ny fasam-bahoaka ny vovony.'),
  ('6ab25a69b001a748958a8716', '2026-09-22T10:37:29.875Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:29.875Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 23, 1, 'Ary naniraka olona ny mpanjaka mba hamory ny anti-panahy rehetran’ny Joda sy Jerosalema hankeo aminy.', 'ary naniraka olona ny mpanjaka mba hamory ny anti-panahy rehetran’ny joda sy jerosalema hankeo aminy.'),
  ('6ab25a69b001a748958a872b', '2026-09-22T10:37:29.875Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:29.875Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 23, 22, 'Mbola tsy nisy Paska nankalazaina toy izany tamin’ny andron’ireo mpitsara izay nitsara ny Israely, na tamin’ny andro rehetra nanjakan’ireo mpanjakan’ny Israely sy mpanjakan’ny Joda.', 'mbola tsy nisy paska nankalazaina toy izany tamin’ny andron’ireo mpitsara izay nitsara ny israely, na tamin’ny andro rehetra nanjakan’ireo mpanjakan’ny israely sy mpanjakan’ny joda.'),
  ('6ab25a69b001a748958a872a', '2026-09-22T10:37:29.875Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:29.875Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 23, 21, 'Ary nandidy ny olona rehetra ny mpanjaka hoe: “Mankalazà Paska ho an’i Jehovah Andriamanitrareo, araka izay voasoratra ato amin’ity bokin’ny fifanekena ity.”', 'ary nandidy ny olona rehetra ny mpanjaka hoe: “mankalazà paska ho an’i jehovah andriamanitrareo, araka izay voasoratra ato amin’ity bokin’ny fifanekena ity.”'),
  ('6ab25a69b001a748958a8737', '2026-09-22T10:37:29.875Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:29.875Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 23, 34, 'Ary nataon’i Farao Neko ho mpanjaka handimby an’i Josia rainy i Eliakima zanak’i Josia Mpanjaka, ka novany hoe Joiakima ny anarany. Fa i Joahaza kosa nalainy ka nentiny tany Ejipta, ary maty tany.', 'ary nataon’i farao neko ho mpanjaka handimby an’i josia rainy i eliakima zanak’i josia mpanjaka, ka novany hoe joiakima ny anarany. fa i joahaza kosa nalainy ka nentiny tany ejipta, ary maty tany.'),
  ('6ab25a69b001a748958a8729', '2026-09-22T10:37:29.875Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:29.875Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 23, 20, 'Ary nataony sorona teo ambonin’ireo alitara ny mpisorona rehetra teo, izay mpisoron’ny toerana avo. Nandoro taolam-paty teo ambonin’ireo alitara ireo koa izy. Dia niverina nankany Jerosalema izy avy eo.', 'ary nataony sorona teo ambonin’ireo alitara ny mpisorona rehetra teo, izay mpisoron’ny toerana avo. nandoro taolam-paty teo ambonin’ireo alitara ireo koa izy. dia niverina nankany jerosalema izy avy eo.'),
  ('6ab25a69b001a748958a8728', '2026-09-22T10:37:29.875Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:29.875Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 23, 19, 'Ary ny trano rehetra teny amin’ny toerana avo tany amin’ireo tanànan’i Samaria, eny, ny trano naorin’ireo mpanjakan’ny Israely mba hampahatezitra an’Andriamanitra, dia nesorin’i Josia koa, ka nataony araka izay rehetra efa nataony tany Betela.', 'ary ny trano rehetra teny amin’ny toerana avo tany amin’ireo tanànan’i samaria, eny, ny trano naorin’ireo mpanjakan’ny israely mba hampahatezitra an’andriamanitra, dia nesorin’i josia koa, ka nataony araka izay rehetra efa nataony tany betela.'),
  ('6ab25a69b001a748958a8732', '2026-09-22T10:37:29.875Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:29.875Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 23, 29, 'Tamin’ny andron’i Josia Mpanjaka no niakaran’i Farao Neko mpanjakan’i Ejipta ho any amin’ny mpanjakan’i Asyria, tany amoron’ny reniranon’i Eofrata. Ary nandeha hifanandrina tamin’i Farao i Josia, kanjo novonoin’i Farao ho faty tao Megido izy raha vao hitany.', 'tamin’ny andron’i josia mpanjaka no niakaran’i farao neko mpanjakan’i ejipta ho any amin’ny mpanjakan’i asyria, tany amoron’ny reniranon’i eofrata. ary nandeha hifanandrina tamin’i farao i josia, kanjo novonoin’i farao ho faty tao megido izy raha vao hitany.'),
  ('6ab25a69b001a748958a871f', '2026-09-22T10:37:29.875Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:29.875Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 23, 10, 'Ary nozimbazimbain’i Josia i Tofeta, izay eo amin’ny lohasahan’ny taranak’i Hinoma, mba tsy ho mendrika hatao toeram-pivavahana intsony, ka tsy hisy handoro * ny zanany lahy na ny zanany vavy ao anaty afo ho an’i Moleka intsony eo.', 'ary nozimbazimbain’i josia i tofeta, izay eo amin’ny lohasahan’ny taranak’i hinoma, mba tsy ho mendrika hatao toeram-pivavahana intsony, ka tsy hisy handoro * ny zanany lahy na ny zanany vavy ao anaty afo ho an’i moleka intsony eo.'),
  ('6ab25a69b001a748958a8736', '2026-09-22T10:37:29.875Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:29.875Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 23, 33, 'Dia nafatotr’i Farao Neko tao Ribla any Hamata izy, mba tsy hanjaka tany Jerosalema. Ary nampandoavin’i Farao sazy ilay tany, dia talenta volafotsy zato sy talenta volamena iray.', 'dia nafatotr’i farao neko tao ribla any hamata izy, mba tsy hanjaka tany jerosalema. ary nampandoavin’i farao sazy ilay tany, dia talenta volafotsy zato sy talenta volamena iray.'),
  ('6ab25a69b001a748958a8724', '2026-09-22T10:37:29.875Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:29.875Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 23, 15, 'Ary narodany ilay alitara tao Betela sy ilay toerana avo nataon’i Jeroboama zanak’i Nebata, izay nampanota ny Israely. Eny, narodany ny alitara sy ny toerana avo. Ary nodorany ilay toerana avo ka notorotoroiny ho vovoka. Nodorany koa ny tsato-kazo masina.', 'ary narodany ilay alitara tao betela sy ilay toerana avo nataon’i jeroboama zanak’i nebata, izay nampanota ny israely. eny, narodany ny alitara sy ny toerana avo. ary nodorany ilay toerana avo ka notorotoroiny ho vovoka. nodorany koa ny tsato-kazo masina.'),
  ('6ab25a69b001a748958a8723', '2026-09-22T10:37:29.875Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:29.875Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 23, 14, 'Nopotipotehin’i Josia koa ny tsangambato masina, ary nokapainy ny tsato-kazo masina, ka nofenoiny taolam-paty ny toerana nisy an’ireny.', 'nopotipotehin’i josia koa ny tsangambato masina, ary nokapainy ny tsato-kazo masina, ka nofenoiny taolam-paty ny toerana nisy an’ireny.'),
  ('6ab25a69b001a748958a872f', '2026-09-22T10:37:29.875Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:29.875Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 23, 26, 'Tsy nitony mihitsy anefa ny fahatezeran’i Jehovah, fa mbola nirehitra mafy foana tamin’ny Joda noho ny zava-drehetra mahatezitra izay nampahatezeran’i Manase azy.', 'tsy nitony mihitsy anefa ny fahatezeran’i jehovah, fa mbola nirehitra mafy foana tamin’ny joda noho ny zava-drehetra mahatezitra izay nampahatezeran’i manase azy.'),
  ('6ab25a69b001a748958a8727', '2026-09-22T10:37:29.875Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:29.875Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 23, 18, 'Koa hoy izy: “Avelao izy. Aza avela hisy hikitikitika ny taolambalony.” Dia tsy nokitihin’izy ireo ny taolambalony sy ny an’ilay mpaminany avy any Samaria.', 'koa hoy izy: “avelao izy. aza avela hisy hikitikitika ny taolambalony.” dia tsy nokitihin’izy ireo ny taolambalony sy ny an’ilay mpaminany avy any samaria.'),
  ('6ab25a69b001a748958a871a', '2026-09-22T10:37:29.875Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:29.875Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 23, 5, 'Ary nesoriny tamin’ny asany ireo mpisoron’ny andriamani-kafa, izay notendren’ireo mpanjakan’ny Joda hanolotra setroka ho sorona teny amin’ny toerana avo, tany amin’ireo tanànan’i Joda sy ny manodidina an’i Jerosalema. Nesoriny koa ireo nanolotra setroka ho sorona ho an’i Bala, sy ho an’ny masoandro sy ny volana sy ireo antokon-kintana fijerena tononandro, ary ho an’izay rehetra eny amin’ny lanitra.', 'ary nesoriny tamin’ny asany ireo mpisoron’ny andriamani-kafa, izay notendren’ireo mpanjakan’ny joda hanolotra setroka ho sorona teny amin’ny toerana avo, tany amin’ireo tanànan’i joda sy ny manodidina an’i jerosalema. nesoriny koa ireo nanolotra setroka ho sorona ho an’i bala, sy ho an’ny masoandro sy ny volana sy ireo antokon-kintana fijerena tononandro, ary ho an’izay rehetra eny amin’ny lanitra.'),
  ('6ab25a69b001a748958a8718', '2026-09-22T10:37:29.875Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:29.875Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 23, 3, 'Dia nijoro teo akaikin’ny andry ny mpanjaka ka nanao fifanekena teo anatrehan’i Jehovah, fa hanaraka an’i Jehovah sady hitandrina ny didiny sy ny fampahatsiahivany ary ny lalàny amin’ny fony manontolo sy ny tenany manontolo, ary hanatanteraka izay voalazan’ilay fifanekena voasoratra tao amin’ilay boky. Dia nanaiky hiditra tamin’ilay fifanekena ny olona rehetra.', 'dia nijoro teo akaikin’ny andry ny mpanjaka ka nanao fifanekena teo anatrehan’i jehovah, fa hanaraka an’i jehovah sady hitandrina ny didiny sy ny fampahatsiahivany ary ny lalàny amin’ny fony manontolo sy ny tenany manontolo, ary hanatanteraka izay voalazan’ilay fifanekena voasoratra tao amin’ilay boky. dia nanaiky hiditra tamin’ilay fifanekena ny olona rehetra.'),
  ('6ab25a69b001a748958a8721', '2026-09-22T10:37:29.875Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:29.875Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 23, 12, 'Ary ny alitara nataon’ireo mpanjakan’ny Joda teo an-tampon’ilay efitra tany an-tampon-tranon’i Ahaza, sy ny alitara nataon’i Manase teo amin’ny tokotany roa teo ivelan’ny tranon’i Jehovah, dia narodan’ny mpanjaka ka notorotoroiny teo. Dia nafafiny teny amin’ny lohasaha falehan-driakan’i Kidrona ny vovony.', 'ary ny alitara nataon’ireo mpanjakan’ny joda teo an-tampon’ilay efitra tany an-tampon-tranon’i ahaza, sy ny alitara nataon’i manase teo amin’ny tokotany roa teo ivelan’ny tranon’i jehovah, dia narodan’ny mpanjaka ka notorotoroiny teo. dia nafafiny teny amin’ny lohasaha falehan-driakan’i kidrona ny vovony.'),
  ('6ab25a69b001a748958a8719', '2026-09-22T10:37:29.875Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:29.875Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 23, 4, 'Ary nodidian’ny mpanjaka i Hilkia mpisoronabe sy ny mpisorona hafa ary ny mpiandry varavarana, mba hamoaka avy tao an-tempolin’i Jehovah ny fitaovana rehetra natao ho an’i Bala sy ho an’ny tsato-kazo masina ary ho an’izay rehetra eny amin’ny lanitra. Dia nodorany teny ivelan’i Jerosalema ireny, teny amin’ny lohasaha mikitohatohatr’i Kidrona, ary nentiny tany Betela ny vovony.', 'ary nodidian’ny mpanjaka i hilkia mpisoronabe sy ny mpisorona hafa ary ny mpiandry varavarana, mba hamoaka avy tao an-tempolin’i jehovah ny fitaovana rehetra natao ho an’i bala sy ho an’ny tsato-kazo masina ary ho an’izay rehetra eny amin’ny lanitra. dia nodorany teny ivelan’i jerosalema ireny, teny amin’ny lohasaha mikitohatohatr’i kidrona, ary nentiny tany betela ny vovony.'),
  ('6ab25a69b001a748958a8717', '2026-09-22T10:37:29.875Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:29.875Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 23, 2, 'Dia niakatra nankao an-tranon’i Jehovah ny mpanjaka sy ny mponina rehetran’i Joda sy Jerosalema, sy ny mpisorona sy ny mpaminany ary ny olona rehetra, na kely na lehibe. Novakin’ny mpanjaka tamin’izy ireo ny teny rehetra tao amin’ilay bokin’ny fifanekena hita tao an-tranon’i Jehovah.', 'dia niakatra nankao an-tranon’i jehovah ny mpanjaka sy ny mponina rehetran’i joda sy jerosalema, sy ny mpisorona sy ny mpaminany ary ny olona rehetra, na kely na lehibe. novakin’ny mpanjaka tamin’izy ireo ny teny rehetra tao amin’ilay bokin’ny fifanekena hita tao an-tranon’i jehovah.'),
  ('6ab25a69b001a748958a8739', '2026-09-22T10:37:29.876Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:29.876Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 23, 36, 'Dimy amby roapolo taona i Joiakima tamin’izy nanomboka nanjaka, ary iraika ambin’ny folo taona no nanjakany tany Jerosalema. Ny anaran-dreniny dia Zebida, zanak’i Pedaia avy any Romaha.', 'dimy amby roapolo taona i joiakima tamin’izy nanomboka nanjaka, ary iraika ambin’ny folo taona no nanjakany tany jerosalema. ny anaran-dreniny dia zebida, zanak’i pedaia avy any romaha.'),
  ('6ab25a69b001a748958a8738', '2026-09-22T10:37:29.876Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:29.876Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 23, 35, 'Ary nomen’i Joiakima an’i Farao ny volafotsy sy ny volamena. Nampandoaviny hetra anefa ny taniny, mba hanomezana ny volafotsy notakin’i Farao. Arakaraka ny hetra tokony haloan’ny tsirairay no nitakiany ny volafotsy sy ny volamena tamin’ny vahoaka, mba homena an’i Farao Neko.', 'ary nomen’i joiakima an’i farao ny volafotsy sy ny volamena. nampandoaviny hetra anefa ny taniny, mba hanomezana ny volafotsy notakin’i farao. arakaraka ny hetra tokony haloan’ny tsirairay no nitakiany ny volafotsy sy ny volamena tamin’ny vahoaka, mba homena an’i farao neko.'),
  ('6ab25a69b001a748958a873a', '2026-09-22T10:37:29.876Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:29.876Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 23, 37, 'Ary nanao izay ratsy teo imason’i Jehovah foana izy, toy izay rehetra nataon’ny razany.', 'ary nanao izay ratsy teo imason’i jehovah foana izy, toy izay rehetra nataon’ny razany.'),
  ('6ab25a6afb768d6e6c84a538', '2026-09-22T10:37:30.304Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:30.304Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 24, 15, 'Nataony sesitany tany Babylona àry i Joiakina. Ary nentiny avy any Jerosalema koa ny renin’ny mpanjaka sy ireo vadin’ny mpanjaka ary ny tandapany, mbamin’ny olona ambony teo amin’ilay tany, mba hatao sesitany tany Babylona.', 'nataony sesitany tany babylona àry i joiakina. ary nentiny avy any jerosalema koa ny renin’ny mpanjaka sy ireo vadin’ny mpanjaka ary ny tandapany, mbamin’ny olona ambony teo amin’ilay tany, mba hatao sesitany tany babylona.'),
  ('6ab25a6afb768d6e6c84a52b', '2026-09-22T10:37:30.304Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:30.304Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 24, 2, 'Ary nalefan’i Jehovah hamely azy ny mpandroba avy tamin’ny Kaldeanina sy ny Syrianina sy ny Moabita ary ny taranak’i Amona. Nalefany ireny mba hamely ny Joda sy handrava azy foana, araka ny tenin’i Jehovah nolazainy tamin’ny alalan’ireo mpaminany mpanompony.', 'ary nalefan’i jehovah hamely azy ny mpandroba avy tamin’ny kaldeanina sy ny syrianina sy ny moabita ary ny taranak’i amona. nalefany ireny mba hamely ny joda sy handrava azy foana, araka ny tenin’i jehovah nolazainy tamin’ny alalan’ireo mpaminany mpanompony.'),
  ('6ab25a6afb768d6e6c84a53c', '2026-09-22T10:37:30.304Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:30.304Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 24, 19, 'Nanao izay ratsy teo imason’i Jehovah foana izy, sahala amin’izay rehetra nataon’i Joiakima.', 'nanao izay ratsy teo imason’i jehovah foana izy, sahala amin’izay rehetra nataon’i joiakima.'),
  ('6ab25a6afb768d6e6c84a531', '2026-09-22T10:37:30.304Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:30.304Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 24, 8, 'Valo ambin’ny folo taona i Joiakina tamin’izy nanomboka nanjaka, ary telo volana no nanjakany tany Jerosalema. Ny anaran-dreniny dia Nehosta, zanak’i Elnatana avy any Jerosalema.', 'valo ambin’ny folo taona i joiakina tamin’izy nanomboka nanjaka, ary telo volana no nanjakany tany jerosalema. ny anaran-dreniny dia nehosta, zanak’i elnatana avy any jerosalema.'),
  ('6ab25a6afb768d6e6c84a539', '2026-09-22T10:37:30.304Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:30.304Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 24, 16, 'Ary nentin’ny mpanjakan’i Babylona natao sesitany tany Babylona avokoa ny lehilahy matanjaka mpiady rehetra, dia ny lehilahy mahery fo niisa fito arivo, sy lehilahy arivo mpanao asa tanana sy mpanorina manda fiarovana.', 'ary nentin’ny mpanjakan’i babylona natao sesitany tany babylona avokoa ny lehilahy matanjaka mpiady rehetra, dia ny lehilahy mahery fo niisa fito arivo, sy lehilahy arivo mpanao asa tanana sy mpanorina manda fiarovana.'),
  ('6ab25a6afb768d6e6c84a53d', '2026-09-22T10:37:30.304Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:30.304Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 24, 20, 'Nahatezitra an’i Jehovah ny zava-nisy tany Jerosalema sy Joda, ka nesoriny tsy ho eo imasony ny olona tany. Ary nikomy tamin’ny mpanjakan’i Babylona i Zedekia.', 'nahatezitra an’i jehovah ny zava-nisy tany jerosalema sy joda, ka nesoriny tsy ho eo imasony ny olona tany. ary nikomy tamin’ny mpanjakan’i babylona i zedekia.'),
  ('6ab25a6afb768d6e6c84a535', '2026-09-22T10:37:30.304Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:30.304Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 24, 12, 'Farany, dia nivoaka ho any amin’ny mpanjakan’i Babylona i Joiakina mpanjakan’ny Joda, sy ny reniny sy ny mpanompony sy ny andrianany ary ny tandapany. Ary tamin’ny taona fahavalo nanjakan’ny mpanjakan’i Babylona, dia nalainy ho babo i Joiakina.', 'farany, dia nivoaka ho any amin’ny mpanjakan’i babylona i joiakina mpanjakan’ny joda, sy ny reniny sy ny mpanompony sy ny andrianany ary ny tandapany. ary tamin’ny taona fahavalo nanjakan’ny mpanjakan’i babylona, dia nalainy ho babo i joiakina.'),
  ('6ab25a6afb768d6e6c84a530', '2026-09-22T10:37:30.304Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:30.304Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 24, 7, 'Ary tsy nivoaka avy ao amin’ny taniny intsony ny mpanjakan’i Ejipta, satria nalain’ny mpanjakan’i Babylona ny tany rehetran’ny mpanjakan’i Ejipta, nanomboka teo amin’ny lohasaha falehan-driakan’i Ejipta ka hatrany amin’ny reniranon’i Eofrata.', 'ary tsy nivoaka avy ao amin’ny taniny intsony ny mpanjakan’i ejipta, satria nalain’ny mpanjakan’i babylona ny tany rehetran’ny mpanjakan’i ejipta, nanomboka teo amin’ny lohasaha falehan-driakan’i ejipta ka hatrany amin’ny reniranon’i eofrata.'),
  ('6ab25a6afb768d6e6c84a52e', '2026-09-22T10:37:30.304Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:30.304Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 24, 5, 'Ary ny sisa amin’ny tantaran’i Joiakima, mbamin’izay rehetra nataony, tsy efa voasoratra ao amin’ny boky mirakitra ny tantara tamin’ny andron’ireo mpanjakan’ny Joda ve izany?', 'ary ny sisa amin’ny tantaran’i joiakima, mbamin’izay rehetra nataony, tsy efa voasoratra ao amin’ny boky mirakitra ny tantara tamin’ny andron’ireo mpanjakan’ny joda ve izany?'),
  ('6ab25a6afb768d6e6c84a52c', '2026-09-22T10:37:30.304Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:30.304Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 24, 3, 'Noho ny baikon’i Jehovah tokana ihany no nahatonga izany tamin’ny Joda, mba hanesorana azy tsy ho eo imasony, noho ny fahotan’i Manase, dia ny ratsy rehetra nataony,', 'noho ny baikon’i jehovah tokana ihany no nahatonga izany tamin’ny joda, mba hanesorana azy tsy ho eo imasony, noho ny fahotan’i manase, dia ny ratsy rehetra nataony,'),
  ('6ab25a6afb768d6e6c84a532', '2026-09-22T10:37:30.304Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:30.304Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 24, 9, 'Nanao izay ratsy teo imason’i Jehovah foana izy, toy izay rehetra nataon-drainy.', 'nanao izay ratsy teo imason’i jehovah foana izy, toy izay rehetra nataon-drainy.'),
  ('6ab25a6afb768d6e6c84a52f', '2026-09-22T10:37:30.304Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:30.304Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 24, 6, 'Farany, dia nodimandry any amin’ny razany i Joiakima, ary i Joiakina zanany no nanjaka nandimby azy.', 'farany, dia nodimandry any amin’ny razany i joiakima, ary i joiakina zanany no nanjaka nandimby azy.'),
  ('6ab25a6afb768d6e6c84a537', '2026-09-22T10:37:30.304Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:30.304Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 24, 14, 'Ary nataony sesitany i Jerosalema manontolo sy ny andriana rehetra ary ny lehilahy matanjaka sy mahery fo rehetra mbamin’ny mpanao asa tanana rehetra sy ny mpanorina manda fiarovana rehetra. Iray alina ny isan’izy rehetra. Tsy nisy navelany afa-tsy ny vahoaka ambany saranga.', 'ary nataony sesitany i jerosalema manontolo sy ny andriana rehetra ary ny lehilahy matanjaka sy mahery fo rehetra mbamin’ny mpanao asa tanana rehetra sy ny mpanorina manda fiarovana rehetra. iray alina ny isan’izy rehetra. tsy nisy navelany afa-tsy ny vahoaka ambany saranga.'),
  ('6ab25a6afb768d6e6c84a52a', '2026-09-22T10:37:30.304Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:30.304Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 24, 1, 'Tamin’ny andron’i Joiakima no niakaran’i Nebokadnezara mpanjakan’i Babylona hanafika ilay tany. Koa lasa mpanompon’i Nebokadnezara nandritra ny telo taona i Joiakima. Nikomy taminy anefa izy.', 'tamin’ny andron’i joiakima no niakaran’i nebokadnezara mpanjakan’i babylona hanafika ilay tany. koa lasa mpanompon’i nebokadnezara nandritra ny telo taona i joiakima. nikomy taminy anefa izy.'),
  ('6ab25a6afb768d6e6c84a53a', '2026-09-22T10:37:30.304Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:30.304Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 24, 17, 'Nataon’ny mpanjakan’i Babylona ho mpanjaka handimby an’i Joiakina i Matania dadatoan’i Joiakina, ary novany hoe Zedekia ny anarany.', 'nataon’ny mpanjakan’i babylona ho mpanjaka handimby an’i joiakina i matania dadatoan’i joiakina, ary novany hoe zedekia ny anarany.'),
  ('6ab25a6afb768d6e6c84a52d', '2026-09-22T10:37:30.304Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:30.304Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 24, 4, 'sy noho ny ran’olona tsy manan-tsiny nalatsany, ka nataony feno ran’olona tsy manan-tsiny i Jerosalema. Koa tsy nety namela heloka i Jehovah.', 'sy noho ny ran’olona tsy manan-tsiny nalatsany, ka nataony feno ran’olona tsy manan-tsiny i jerosalema. koa tsy nety namela heloka i jehovah.'),
  ('6ab25a6afb768d6e6c84a536', '2026-09-22T10:37:30.304Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:30.304Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 24, 13, 'Dia navoakan’i Nebokadnezara ny zava-tsarobidy rehetra notehirizina tao an-tranon’i Jehovah, sy ny zava-tsarobidy notehirizina tao an-tranon’ny mpanjaka. Ary nopotipotehiny ny fitaovana volamena rehetra nataon’i Solomona mpanjakan’ny Israely tao amin’ny tempolin’i Jehovah, araka izay nolazain’i Jehovah.', 'dia navoakan’i nebokadnezara ny zava-tsarobidy rehetra notehirizina tao an-tranon’i jehovah, sy ny zava-tsarobidy notehirizina tao an-tranon’ny mpanjaka. ary nopotipotehiny ny fitaovana volamena rehetra nataon’i solomona mpanjakan’ny israely tao amin’ny tempolin’i jehovah, araka izay nolazain’i jehovah.'),
  ('6ab25a6afb768d6e6c84a533', '2026-09-22T10:37:30.304Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:30.304Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 24, 10, 'Nandritra izany fotoana izany, dia niakatra tany Jerosalema ny mpanompon’i Nebokadnezara mpanjakan’i Babylona. Ary natao fahirano ilay tanàna.', 'nandritra izany fotoana izany, dia niakatra tany jerosalema ny mpanompon’i nebokadnezara mpanjakan’i babylona. ary natao fahirano ilay tanàna.'),
  ('6ab25a6afb768d6e6c84a534', '2026-09-22T10:37:30.304Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:30.304Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 24, 11, 'Raha mbola nanao fahirano azy io ny mpanompony, dia tonga hanafika an’ilay tanàna i Nebokadnezara mpanjakan’i Babylona.', 'raha mbola nanao fahirano azy io ny mpanompony, dia tonga hanafika an’ilay tanàna i nebokadnezara mpanjakan’i babylona.'),
  ('6ab25a6afb768d6e6c84a53b', '2026-09-22T10:37:30.304Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:30.304Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 24, 18, 'Iraika amby roapolo taona i Zedekia tamin’izy nanomboka nanjaka, ary iraika ambin’ny folo taona no nanjakany tany Jerosalema. Ny anaran-dreniny dia Hamotala, zanak’i Jeremia avy any Libna.', 'iraika amby roapolo taona i zedekia tamin’izy nanomboka nanjaka, ary iraika ambin’ny folo taona no nanjakany tany jerosalema. ny anaran-dreniny dia hamotala, zanak’i jeremia avy any libna.'),
  ('6ab25a6a92b3747d4cfed469', '2026-09-22T10:37:30.790Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:30.790Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 25, 20, 'Nalain’i Nebozaradana, lehiben’ny mpiaro ny mpanjaka, ireo ka nentiny tany amin’ny mpanjakan’i Babylona tao Ribla.', 'nalain’i nebozaradana, lehiben’ny mpiaro ny mpanjaka, ireo ka nentiny tany amin’ny mpanjakan’i babylona tao ribla.'),
  ('6ab25a6a92b3747d4cfed462', '2026-09-22T10:37:30.790Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:30.790Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 25, 13, 'Nopotipotehin’ny Kaldeanina ireo andry varahina teo amin’ny tranon’i Jehovah sy ireo kalesy ary ny ranomasina varahina izay tao an-tranon’i Jehovah, ka nentin’izy ireo tany Babylona ny varahina tamin’ireny.', 'nopotipotehin’ny kaldeanina ireo andry varahina teo amin’ny tranon’i jehovah sy ireo kalesy ary ny ranomasina varahina izay tao an-tranon’i jehovah, ka nentin’izy ireo tany babylona ny varahina tamin’ireny.'),
  ('6ab25a6a92b3747d4cfed46e', '2026-09-22T10:37:30.790Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:30.790Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 25, 25, 'Tamin’ny volana fahafito, dia tonga i Ismaela zanak’i Netania zanak’i Elisama tarana-mpanjaka, ary nisy folo lahy niaraka taminy. Ary namely an’i Gedalia izy ireo, ka maty i Gedalia sy ny Jiosy ary ny Kaldeanina niaraka taminy tany Mizpa.', 'tamin’ny volana fahafito, dia tonga i ismaela zanak’i netania zanak’i elisama tarana-mpanjaka, ary nisy folo lahy niaraka taminy. ary namely an’i gedalia izy ireo, ka maty i gedalia sy ny jiosy ary ny kaldeanina niaraka taminy tany mizpa.'),
  ('6ab25a6a92b3747d4cfed46d', '2026-09-22T10:37:30.790Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:30.790Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 25, 24, 'Dia nianiana tamin’izy ireo sy ny miaramilany i Gedalia, ary nanao hoe: “Aza matahotra ny ho mpanompon’ny Kaldeanina. Mitoera eto amin’ity tany ity ary manompoa ny mpanjakan’i Babylona, dia hahita soa ianareo.”', 'dia nianiana tamin’izy ireo sy ny miaramilany i gedalia, ary nanao hoe: “aza matahotra ny ho mpanompon’ny kaldeanina. mitoera eto amin’ity tany ity ary manompoa ny mpanjakan’i babylona, dia hahita soa ianareo.”'),
  ('6ab25a6a92b3747d4cfed45d', '2026-09-22T10:37:30.790Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:30.790Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 25, 8, 'Ary tamin’ny andro fahafiton’ny volana fahadimy, izany hoe tamin’ny taona fahasivy ambin’ny folo nanjakan’i Nebokadnezara mpanjakan’i Babylona, dia tonga tao Jerosalema i Nebozaradana lehiben’ny mpiaro ny mpanjakan’i Babylona, sady mpanompony.', 'ary tamin’ny andro fahafiton’ny volana fahadimy, izany hoe tamin’ny taona fahasivy ambin’ny folo nanjakan’i nebokadnezara mpanjakan’i babylona, dia tonga tao jerosalema i nebozaradana lehiben’ny mpiaro ny mpanjakan’i babylona, sady mpanompony.'),
  ('6ab25a6a92b3747d4cfed468', '2026-09-22T10:37:30.790Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:30.790Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 25, 19, 'Ireto kosa no nalainy avy tao an-tanàna: Tandapa iray nifehy ny lehilahy mpiady; lehilahy dimy anisan’ireo afaka nankeo anatrehan’ny mpanjaka ka hita tao an-tanàna; ny mpitan-tsoratry ny lehiben’ny tafika, izany hoe ilay mpanangona vahoaka; ary enimpolo lahy teo amin’ny vahoaka ka hita tao an-tanàna.', 'ireto kosa no nalainy avy tao an-tanàna: tandapa iray nifehy ny lehilahy mpiady; lehilahy dimy anisan’ireo afaka nankeo anatrehan’ny mpanjaka ka hita tao an-tanàna; ny mpitan-tsoratry ny lehiben’ny tafika, izany hoe ilay mpanangona vahoaka; ary enimpolo lahy teo amin’ny vahoaka ka hita tao an-tanàna.'),
  ('6ab25a6a92b3747d4cfed472', '2026-09-22T10:37:30.790Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:30.790Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 25, 29, 'Koa nesorin’i Joiakina ny fitafiana nanaovany tao am-ponja, ary nihinan-kanina teo anatrehan’ny mpanjaka mandrakariva izy, nandritra ny androm-piainany.', 'koa nesorin’i joiakina ny fitafiana nanaovany tao am-ponja, ary nihinan-kanina teo anatrehan’ny mpanjaka mandrakariva izy, nandritra ny androm-piainany.'),
  ('6ab25a6a92b3747d4cfed470', '2026-09-22T10:37:30.790Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:30.790Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 25, 27, 'Ary tamin’ny taona fahafito amby telopolo nanaovana sesitany an’i Joiakina mpanjakan’ny Joda, tamin’ny andro fahafito amby roapolon’ny volana faharoa ambin’ny folo, tamin’ny taona naha lasa mpanjaka an’i Evila-merodaka mpanjakan’i Babylona, dia nahazo sitraka taminy * i Joiakina mpanjakan’ny Joda, ka navoakany avy tao am-ponja.', 'ary tamin’ny taona fahafito amby telopolo nanaovana sesitany an’i joiakina mpanjakan’ny joda, tamin’ny andro fahafito amby roapolon’ny volana faharoa ambin’ny folo, tamin’ny taona naha lasa mpanjaka an’i evila-merodaka mpanjakan’i babylona, dia nahazo sitraka taminy * i joiakina mpanjakan’ny joda, ka navoakany avy tao am-ponja.'),
  ('6ab25a6a92b3747d4cfed46b', '2026-09-22T10:37:30.790Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:30.790Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 25, 22, 'Ary i Gedalia zanak’i Ahikama zanak’i Safana no notendren’i Nebokadnezara mpanjakan’i Babylona hiandraikitra ny vahoaka sisa navelany tany Joda.', 'ary i gedalia zanak’i ahikama zanak’i safana no notendren’i nebokadnezara mpanjakan’i babylona hiandraikitra ny vahoaka sisa navelany tany joda.'),
  ('6ab25a6a92b3747d4cfed46a', '2026-09-22T10:37:30.790Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:30.790Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 25, 21, 'Dia namely an’ireo ny mpanjakan’i Babylona, ka namono azy ho faty tao Ribla, tany Hamata. Koa nesorina tamin’ny taniny ny Joda ka natao sesitany.', 'dia namely an’ireo ny mpanjakan’i babylona, ka namono azy ho faty tao ribla, tany hamata. koa nesorina tamin’ny taniny ny joda ka natao sesitany.'),
  ('6ab25a6a92b3747d4cfed460', '2026-09-22T10:37:30.790Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:30.790Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 25, 11, 'Ary ny vahoaka sisa tao an-tanàna, sy ireo nitsoaka mba hitolo-batana tamin’ny mpanjakan’i Babylona, ary ny olona sisa tavela, dia nentin’i Nebozaradana lehiben’ny mpiaro ny mpanjaka, ka nataony sesitany.', 'ary ny vahoaka sisa tao an-tanàna, sy ireo nitsoaka mba hitolo-batana tamin’ny mpanjakan’i babylona, ary ny olona sisa tavela, dia nentin’i nebozaradana lehiben’ny mpiaro ny mpanjaka, ka nataony sesitany.'),
  ('6ab25a6a92b3747d4cfed45c', '2026-09-22T10:37:30.790Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:30.790Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 25, 7, 'Ary ny zanakalahin’i Zedekia dia novonoin’izy ireo teo imasony, ary ny mason’i Zedekia kosa nopotsiriny. Dia nofatorany tamin’ny gadra varahina izy, ka nentiny tany Babylona.', 'ary ny zanakalahin’i zedekia dia novonoin’izy ireo teo imasony, ary ny mason’i zedekia kosa nopotsiriny. dia nofatorany tamin’ny gadra varahina izy, ka nentiny tany babylona.'),
  ('6ab25a6a92b3747d4cfed471', '2026-09-22T10:37:30.790Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:30.790Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 25, 28, 'Dia nilaza zava-tsoa taminy i Evila-merodaka, ary nataony ambony noho ny seza fiandrianan’ireo mpanjaka niaraka taminy tany Babylona ny seza fiandrianan’i Joiakina.', 'dia nilaza zava-tsoa taminy i evila-merodaka, ary nataony ambony noho ny seza fiandrianan’ireo mpanjaka niaraka taminy tany babylona ny seza fiandrianan’i joiakina.'),
  ('6ab25a6a92b3747d4cfed467', '2026-09-22T10:37:30.790Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:30.790Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 25, 18, 'Dia nalain’i Nebozaradana, lehiben’ny mpiaro ny mpanjaka, i Seraia lehiben’ny mpisorona, sy Zefania mpisorona lefitra. Naka olona telo mpiandry varavarana koa izy.', 'dia nalain’i nebozaradana, lehiben’ny mpiaro ny mpanjaka, i seraia lehiben’ny mpisorona, sy zefania mpisorona lefitra. naka olona telo mpiandry varavarana koa izy.'),
  ('6ab25a6a92b3747d4cfed465', '2026-09-22T10:37:30.790Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:30.790Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 25, 16, 'Efa tsy hay lazaina intsony ny lanjan’ny varahina tamin’ny fitaovana rehetra, izany hoe tamin’ny andry roa sy ilay ranomasina ary ireo kalesy izay nataon’i Solomona ho an’ny tranon’i Jehovah.', 'efa tsy hay lazaina intsony ny lanjan’ny varahina tamin’ny fitaovana rehetra, izany hoe tamin’ny andry roa sy ilay ranomasina ary ireo kalesy izay nataon’i solomona ho an’ny tranon’i jehovah.'),
  ('6ab25a6a92b3747d4cfed45e', '2026-09-22T10:37:30.790Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:30.790Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 25, 9, 'Dia nodoran’i Nebozaradana ny tranon’i Jehovah sy ny tranon’ny mpanjaka ary ny trano rehetra tao Jerosalema. Nodorany koa ny tranon’ny olona ambony rehetra.', 'dia nodoran’i nebozaradana ny tranon’i jehovah sy ny tranon’ny mpanjaka ary ny trano rehetra tao jerosalema. nodorany koa ny tranon’ny olona ambony rehetra.'),
  ('6ab25a6a92b3747d4cfed45a', '2026-09-22T10:37:30.790Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:30.790Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 25, 5, 'Nisy andia-miaramila kaldeanina nanenjika azy anefa, ka nahatratra azy teny amin’ny lemaka karakaina any Jeriko. Koa niparitaka sy nandao azy ny miaramilany rehetra.', 'nisy andia-miaramila kaldeanina nanenjika azy anefa, ka nahatratra azy teny amin’ny lemaka karakaina any jeriko. koa niparitaka sy nandao azy ny miaramilany rehetra.'),
  ('6ab25a6a92b3747d4cfed46c', '2026-09-22T10:37:30.790Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:30.790Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 25, 23, 'Raha vao ren’ny lehiben’ny tafika rehetra sy ny miaramilany fa nanendry an’i Gedalia ny mpanjakan’i Babylona, dia nankany amin’i Gedalia tany Mizpa izy ireo, izany hoe i Ismaela zanak’i Netania, sy Johanana zanak’i Karea, sy Seraia zanak’i Tanometa Netofatita, ary Jazania zanak’ilay Makatita, niaraka tamin’ny miaramilany avy.', 'raha vao ren’ny lehiben’ny tafika rehetra sy ny miaramilany fa nanendry an’i gedalia ny mpanjakan’i babylona, dia nankany amin’i gedalia tany mizpa izy ireo, izany hoe i ismaela zanak’i netania, sy johanana zanak’i karea, sy seraia zanak’i tanometa netofatita, ary jazania zanak’ilay makatita, niaraka tamin’ny miaramilany avy.'),
  ('6ab25a6a92b3747d4cfed466', '2026-09-22T10:37:30.790Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:30.790Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 25, 17, 'Valo ambin’ny folo hakiho ny haavon’ny andry tsirairay. Varahina ny loha andry teo amboniny, ary telo hakiho ny haavon’ny loha andry. Ary varahina daholo ny harato nifampidipiditra sy ny ampongabendanitra nanodidina ny loha andry. Nisy toy izany koa teo ambonin’ny harato nifampidipiditra, teo amin’ilay andry faharoa.', 'valo ambin’ny folo hakiho ny haavon’ny andry tsirairay. varahina ny loha andry teo amboniny, ary telo hakiho ny haavon’ny loha andry. ary varahina daholo ny harato nifampidipiditra sy ny ampongabendanitra nanodidina ny loha andry. nisy toy izany koa teo ambonin’ny harato nifampidipiditra, teo amin’ilay andry faharoa.'),
  ('6ab25a6a92b3747d4cfed46f', '2026-09-22T10:37:30.790Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:30.790Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 25, 26, 'Dia niainga ny olona rehetra, na kely na lehibe, mbamin’ireo lehiben’ny tafika, ka nankany Ejipta, noho izy ireo natahotra ny Kaldeanina.', 'dia niainga ny olona rehetra, na kely na lehibe, mbamin’ireo lehiben’ny tafika, ka nankany ejipta, noho izy ireo natahotra ny kaldeanina.'),
  ('6ab25a6a92b3747d4cfed461', '2026-09-22T10:37:30.790Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:30.790Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 25, 12, 'Navelany hijanona tao amin’ilay tany kosa ny sasany tamin’ireo olona ambany saranga, mba hikarakara tanimboaloboka. Ary nampanaovina asa an-terivozona koa izy ireny.', 'navelany hijanona tao amin’ilay tany kosa ny sasany tamin’ireo olona ambany saranga, mba hikarakara tanimboaloboka. ary nampanaovina asa an-terivozona koa izy ireny.'),
  ('6ab25a6a92b3747d4cfed45f', '2026-09-22T10:37:30.790Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:30.790Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 25, 10, 'Ary ny manda nanodidina an’i Jerosalema dia narodan’ny tafika manontolon’ny Kaldeanina, izay niaraka tamin’ilay lehiben’ny mpiaro ny mpanjaka.', 'ary ny manda nanodidina an’i jerosalema dia narodan’ny tafika manontolon’ny kaldeanina, izay niaraka tamin’ilay lehiben’ny mpiaro ny mpanjaka.'),
  ('6ab25a6a92b3747d4cfed457', '2026-09-22T10:37:30.790Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:30.790Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 25, 2, 'Koa natao fahirano ilay tanàna, hatramin’ny taona fahiraika ambin’ny folo nanjakan’i Zedekia Mpanjaka.', 'koa natao fahirano ilay tanàna, hatramin’ny taona fahiraika ambin’ny folo nanjakan’i zedekia mpanjaka.'),
  ('6ab25a6a92b3747d4cfed456', '2026-09-22T10:37:30.790Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:30.790Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 25, 1, 'Ary tamin’ny andro fahafolon’ny volana fahafolo tamin’ny taona fahasivy nanjakan’i Zedekia, dia tonga hamely an’i Jerosalema i Nebokadnezara mpanjakan’i Babylona sy ny tafiny manontolo. Dia nitoby hanafika an’i Jerosalema izy ireo, ka nanao manda nanodidina mba hanaovana fahirano azy.', 'ary tamin’ny andro fahafolon’ny volana fahafolo tamin’ny taona fahasivy nanjakan’i zedekia, dia tonga hamely an’i jerosalema i nebokadnezara mpanjakan’i babylona sy ny tafiny manontolo. dia nitoby hanafika an’i jerosalema izy ireo, ka nanao manda nanodidina mba hanaovana fahirano azy.'),
  ('6ab25a6a92b3747d4cfed473', '2026-09-22T10:37:30.790Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:30.790Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 25, 30, 'Ary nomena anjara sakafo tsy tapaka avy tamin’ny mpanjaka izy, araka izay tokony ho azy isan’andro, nandritra ny androm-piainany.', 'ary nomena anjara sakafo tsy tapaka avy tamin’ny mpanjaka izy, araka izay tokony ho azy isan’andro, nandritra ny androm-piainany.'),
  ('6ab25a6a92b3747d4cfed458', '2026-09-22T10:37:30.790Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:30.790Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 25, 3, 'Ary mafy ny mosary tao an-tanàna tamin’ny andro fahasivin’ny volana fahefatra, ka tsy nisy sakafo hohanin’ny vahoaka.', 'ary mafy ny mosary tao an-tanàna tamin’ny andro fahasivin’ny volana fahefatra, ka tsy nisy sakafo hohanin’ny vahoaka.'),
  ('6ab25a6a92b3747d4cfed464', '2026-09-22T10:37:30.790Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:30.790Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 25, 15, 'Nalain’i Nebozaradana, lehiben’ny mpiaro ny mpanjaka, koa ny fitondrana afo sy ny vilia baolina, izay tena volamena sy tena volafotsy daholo.', 'nalain’i nebozaradana, lehiben’ny mpiaro ny mpanjaka, koa ny fitondrana afo sy ny vilia baolina, izay tena volamena sy tena volafotsy daholo.'),
  ('6ab25a6a92b3747d4cfed463', '2026-09-22T10:37:30.790Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:30.790Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 25, 14, 'Dia nalainy ny fitoeran-davenona sy ny lapelina sy ny famonoan-jiro sy ny kaopy ary ny fitaovana varahina rehetra izay nampiasaina tamin’ny fanompoana.', 'dia nalainy ny fitoeran-davenona sy ny lapelina sy ny famonoan-jiro sy ny kaopy ary ny fitaovana varahina rehetra izay nampiasaina tamin’ny fanompoana.'),
  ('6ab25a6a92b3747d4cfed45b', '2026-09-22T10:37:30.790Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:30.790Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 25, 6, 'Dia nosamborin’ny Kaldeanina ny mpanjaka, ka nentiny niakatra tany amin’ny mpanjakan’i Babylona tao Ribla, mba hisy didim-pitsarana havoaka momba azy.', 'dia nosamborin’ny kaldeanina ny mpanjaka, ka nentiny niakatra tany amin’ny mpanjakan’i babylona tao ribla, mba hisy didim-pitsarana havoaka momba azy.'),
  ('6ab25a6a92b3747d4cfed459', '2026-09-22T10:37:30.790Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:30.790Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Mpanjaka', 12, 25, 4, 'Ary voagorobaka ny mandan’ny tanàna. Koa nandositra ny lehilahy mpiady rehetra raha mbola alina ny andro, ka nanaraka ny lalana mankany amin’ilay vavahady teo anelanelan’ny manda roa sosona, izay teo akaikin’ny zaridainan’ny mpanjaka. Efa nanodidina ny tanàna ny Kaldeanina tamin’izay. Dia nandeha tamin’ny lalana mankany Araba ny mpanjaka.', 'ary voagorobaka ny mandan’ny tanàna. koa nandositra ny lehilahy mpiady rehetra raha mbola alina ny andro, ka nanaraka ny lalana mankany amin’ilay vavahady teo anelanelan’ny manda roa sosona, izay teo akaikin’ny zaridainan’ny mpanjaka. efa nanodidina ny tanàna ny kaldeanina tamin’izay. dia nandeha tamin’ny lalana mankany araba ny mpanjaka.'),
