  ('6ab25a6d06246d0525e65eb2', '2026-09-22T10:37:33.283Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:33.283Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Tantara', 13, 4, 17, 'Ary ny zanakalahin’i Ezra dia i Jatera sy Mareda sy Efera ary Jalona. Ary niteraka an’i Miriama sy Samay ary Jisba rain’i Estemoa ravehivavy.', 'ary ny zanakalahin’i ezra dia i jatera sy mareda sy efera ary jalona. ary niteraka an’i miriama sy samay ary jisba rain’i estemoa ravehivavy.'),
  ('6ab25a6d06246d0525e65eb0', '2026-09-22T10:37:33.283Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:33.283Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Tantara', 13, 4, 15, 'Ary ny zanakalahin’i Kaleba zanak’i Jefone, dia i Iro sy Elaha ary Nama. Ary ny zanak’i Elaha dia i Kenaza.', 'ary ny zanakalahin’i kaleba zanak’i jefone, dia i iro sy elaha ary nama. ary ny zanak’i elaha dia i kenaza.'),
  ('6ab25a6d06246d0525e65eaf', '2026-09-22T10:37:33.283Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:33.283Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Tantara', 13, 4, 14, 'Ary i Meonotahy niteraka an’i Ofra. Ary i Seraia niteraka an’i Joaba rain’i Ge-harasima. Fa lasa mpanao asa tanana izy ireo.', 'ary i meonotahy niteraka an’i ofra. ary i seraia niteraka an’i joaba rain’i ge-harasima. fa lasa mpanao asa tanana izy ireo.'),
  ('6ab25a6d06246d0525e65ea9', '2026-09-22T10:37:33.283Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:33.283Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Tantara', 13, 4, 8, 'Ary i Koza niteraka an’i Anoba sy Zobeba ary ireo fianakavian’i Aharela zanak’i Haroma.', 'ary i koza niteraka an’i anoba sy zobeba ary ireo fianakavian’i aharela zanak’i haroma.'),
  ('6ab25a6d06246d0525e65ea3', '2026-09-22T10:37:33.283Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:33.283Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Tantara', 13, 4, 2, 'Ary i Reaia zanak’i Sobala niteraka an’i Jahata, ary i Jahata niteraka an’i Ahomay sy Lahada. Avy tamin’ireo no niavian’ny fianakavian’ny Zoraita.', 'ary i reaia zanak’i sobala niteraka an’i jahata, ary i jahata niteraka an’i ahomay sy lahada. avy tamin’ireo no niavian’ny fianakavian’ny zoraita.'),
  ('6ab25a6d06246d0525e65eb4', '2026-09-22T10:37:33.283Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:33.283Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Tantara', 13, 4, 19, 'Ary ny vadin’i Hodia dia anabavin’i Nahama, ka ireto avy ny zanakalahiny: Ny rain’i Keila Garmita sy Estemoa Makatita.', 'ary ny vadin’i hodia dia anabavin’i nahama, ka ireto avy ny zanakalahiny: ny rain’i keila garmita sy estemoa makatita.'),
  ('6ab25a6d06246d0525e65ec9', '2026-09-22T10:37:33.283Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:33.283Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Tantara', 13, 4, 40, 'Dia nahita tanimbilona lonaka tsara izy ireo, ary nalalaka be ilay tany sady nandry feizay. Fa ny taranak’i Hama no nonina tao taloha.', 'dia nahita tanimbilona lonaka tsara izy ireo, ary nalalaka be ilay tany sady nandry feizay. fa ny taranak’i hama no nonina tao taloha.'),
  ('6ab25a6d06246d0525e65ebd', '2026-09-22T10:37:33.283Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:33.283Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Tantara', 13, 4, 28, 'Ary izy ireo nonina tao Beri-sheba sy Molada sy Hazara-soala', 'ary izy ireo nonina tao beri-sheba sy molada sy hazara-soala'),
  ('6ab25a6d06246d0525e65eb6', '2026-09-22T10:37:33.283Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:33.283Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Tantara', 13, 4, 21, 'Ary ny zanakalahin’i Sela zanak’i Joda, dia i Era rain’i Leka sy Lada rain’i Maresa, sy ireo fianakavian’ny mpanenona lamba tena tsara avy amin’ny ankohonan’i Asbea,', 'ary ny zanakalahin’i sela zanak’i joda, dia i era rain’i leka sy lada rain’i maresa, sy ireo fianakavian’ny mpanenona lamba tena tsara avy amin’ny ankohonan’i asbea,'),
  ('6ab25a6d06246d0525e65eb3', '2026-09-22T10:37:33.283Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:33.283Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Tantara', 13, 4, 18, 'Ary ilay vadiny jiosy dia niteraka an’i Jareda rain’i Gedora, sy Hebera rain’i Soko, ary Jakotiela rain’i Zanoa. Ireo no zanakalahin’i Bitia zanakavavin’i Farao. Nalain’i Mareda ho vadiny i Bitia.', 'ary ilay vadiny jiosy dia niteraka an’i jareda rain’i gedora, sy hebera rain’i soko, ary jakotiela rain’i zanoa. ireo no zanakalahin’i bitia zanakavavin’i farao. nalain’i mareda ho vadiny i bitia.'),
  ('6ab25a6d06246d0525e65ead', '2026-09-22T10:37:33.283Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:33.283Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Tantara', 13, 4, 12, 'Ary i Estona niteraka an’i Beti-rafa sy Pasea ary Tehina rain’i Ira-nahasa. Ireo no olona tao Reka.', 'ary i estona niteraka an’i beti-rafa sy pasea ary tehina rain’i ira-nahasa. ireo no olona tao reka.'),
  ('6ab25a6d06246d0525e65eaa', '2026-09-22T10:37:33.283Z', '2026-09-22T10:37:33.283Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Tantara', 13, 4, 9, 'Ary i Jabeza nahazo voninahitra kokoa noho ny rahalahiny. Ary ny reniny no nanome azy ny anarana hoe Jabeza, fa hoy izy: “Narary aho niteraka azy.”', 'ary i jabeza nahazo voninahitra kokoa noho ny rahalahiny. ary ny reniny no nanome azy ny anarana hoe jabeza, fa hoy izy: “narary aho niteraka azy.”'),
