  ('6ab25a9dd1ed0d1ad582e92d', '2026-09-22T10:38:21.555Z', '2026-09-22T10:38:21.555Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ezra', 15, 8, 22, 'Fa nahamenatra ahy ny hangataka miaramila sy mpitaingin-tsoavaly tamin’ny mpanjaka, mba hiaro anay tamin’ny fahavalo teny an-dalana. Efa nilaza tamin’ny mpanjaka mantsy izahay hoe: “Ny tanan’ilay Andriamanitray manampy an’izay rehetra mitady azy, fa ny heriny sy ny hatezerany kosa ampihariny amin’izay rehetra mahafoy azy.”', 'fa nahamenatra ahy ny hangataka miaramila sy mpitaingin-tsoavaly tamin’ny mpanjaka, mba hiaro anay tamin’ny fahavalo teny an-dalana. efa nilaza tamin’ny mpanjaka mantsy izahay hoe: “ny tanan’ilay andriamanitray manampy an’izay rehetra mitady azy, fa ny heriny sy ny hatezerany kosa ampihariny amin’izay rehetra mahafoy azy.”'),
  ('6ab25a9dd1ed0d1ad582e926', '2026-09-22T10:38:21.555Z', '2026-09-22T10:38:21.555Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ezra', 15, 8, 15, 'Novoriko teo amin’ilay renirano mankany Ahava izy ireo, dia nitoby telo andro teo izahay. Rehefa nandinika tsara ny vahoaka sy ny mpisorona anefa aho, dia tsy nahita Levita na iray aza.', 'novoriko teo amin’ilay renirano mankany ahava izy ireo, dia nitoby telo andro teo izahay. rehefa nandinika tsara ny vahoaka sy ny mpisorona anefa aho, dia tsy nahita levita na iray aza.'),
  ('6ab25a9dd1ed0d1ad582e922', '2026-09-22T10:38:21.555Z', '2026-09-22T10:38:21.555Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ezra', 15, 8, 11, 'Zakaria zanak’i Bebay, avy amin’ny taranak’i Bebay, ary nisy 28 lahy niaraka taminy;', 'zakaria zanak’i bebay, avy amin’ny taranak’i bebay, ary nisy 28 lahy niaraka taminy;'),
  ('6ab25a9dd1ed0d1ad582e921', '2026-09-22T10:38:21.555Z', '2026-09-22T10:38:21.555Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ezra', 15, 8, 10, 'Selomita zanak’i Josifia, avy amin’ny taranak’i Bany, ary nisy 160 lahy niaraka taminy;', 'selomita zanak’i josifia, avy amin’ny taranak’i bany, ary nisy 160 lahy niaraka taminy;'),
  ('6ab25a9dd1ed0d1ad582e924', '2026-09-22T10:38:21.555Z', '2026-09-22T10:38:21.555Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ezra', 15, 8, 13, 'Elifeleta sy Jeiela ary Semaia no anaran’ireo avy amin’ny taranak’i Adonikama, ka ireo no farany amin’io taranaka io, ary nisy 60 lahy niaraka tamin’izy ireo;', 'elifeleta sy jeiela ary semaia no anaran’ireo avy amin’ny taranak’i adonikama, ka ireo no farany amin’io taranaka io, ary nisy 60 lahy niaraka tamin’izy ireo;'),
  ('6ab25a9dd1ed0d1ad582e92e', '2026-09-22T10:38:21.555Z', '2026-09-22T10:38:21.555Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ezra', 15, 8, 23, 'Dia nifady hanina sy nangataka momba an’izany tamin’Andriamanitray izahay, ka nohenoiny ny fitalahoanay.', 'dia nifady hanina sy nangataka momba an’izany tamin’andriamanitray izahay, ka nohenoiny ny fitalahoanay.'),
  ('6ab25a9dd1ed0d1ad582e91e', '2026-09-22T10:38:21.555Z', '2026-09-22T10:38:21.555Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ezra', 15, 8, 7, 'Jesaia zanak’i Atalia, avy amin’ny taranak’i Elama, ary nisy 70 lahy niaraka taminy;', 'jesaia zanak’i atalia, avy amin’ny taranak’i elama, ary nisy 70 lahy niaraka taminy;'),
  ('6ab25a9dd1ed0d1ad582e938', '2026-09-22T10:38:21.556Z', '2026-09-22T10:38:21.556Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ezra', 15, 8, 33, 'Ary tamin’ny andro fahefatra, dia nolanjainay tao an-tranon’Andriamanitray ny volafotsy sy ny volamena ary ny fitaovana, ka natolotray an’i Meremota mpisorona zanak’i Oria, sy Eleazara zanak’i Finehasa, ary ny Levita niaraka tamin’izy ireo, dia i Jozabada zanak’i Jesoa sy Noadia zanak’i Binoy.', 'ary tamin’ny andro fahefatra, dia nolanjainay tao an-tranon’andriamanitray ny volafotsy sy ny volamena ary ny fitaovana, ka natolotray an’i meremota mpisorona zanak’i oria, sy eleazara zanak’i finehasa, ary ny levita niaraka tamin’izy ireo, dia i jozabada zanak’i jesoa sy noadia zanak’i binoy.'),
  ('6ab25a9dd1ed0d1ad582e937', '2026-09-22T10:38:21.556Z', '2026-09-22T10:38:21.556Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ezra', 15, 8, 32, 'Dia tonga tany Jerosalema izahay ary nijanona telo andro tao.', 'dia tonga tany jerosalema izahay ary nijanona telo andro tao.'),
  ('6ab25a9dd1ed0d1ad582e939', '2026-09-22T10:38:21.556Z', '2026-09-22T10:38:21.556Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ezra', 15, 8, 34, 'Nisaina sy nolanjaina ny zava-drehetra, ary nosoratana daholo ny lanjany.', 'nisaina sy nolanjaina ny zava-drehetra, ary nosoratana daholo ny lanjany.'),
  ('6ab25a9dd1ed0d1ad582e936', '2026-09-22T10:38:21.556Z', '2026-09-22T10:38:21.556Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ezra', 15, 8, 31, 'Ary niala teo amin’ny reniranon’i Ahava izahay tamin’ny andro faha-12 amin’ny volana voalohany, mba hankany Jerosalema. Nanampy anay ny tanan’Andriamanitray, ka namonjy anay tamin’ny fahavalo sy tamin’izay niafina mba hanafika anay teny an-dalana.', 'ary niala teo amin’ny reniranon’i ahava izahay tamin’ny andro faha-12 amin’ny volana voalohany, mba hankany jerosalema. nanampy anay ny tanan’andriamanitray, ka namonjy anay tamin’ny fahavalo sy tamin’izay niafina mba hanafika anay teny an-dalana.'),
  ('6ab25a9dd1ed0d1ad582e934', '2026-09-22T10:38:21.556Z', '2026-09-22T10:38:21.556Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ezra', 15, 8, 29, 'Arovy tsara ireo mandra-pandanjanareo azy ao amin’ ny efitra ao an-tranon’i Jehovah, eo imason’ny lehiben’ny mpisorona sy ny Levita ary ny andrianan’ny fianakaviamben’ny Israely any Jerosalema.”', 'arovy tsara ireo mandra-pandanjanareo azy ao amin’ ny efitra ao an-tranon’i jehovah, eo imason’ny lehiben’ny mpisorona sy ny levita ary ny andrianan’ny fianakaviamben’ny israely any jerosalema.”'),
  ('6ab25a9dd1ed0d1ad582e93a', '2026-09-22T10:38:21.556Z', '2026-09-22T10:38:21.556Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ezra', 15, 8, 35, 'Ary nanolotra an’ireto sorona dorana ireto ho an’ny Andriamanitry ny Israely ny olona babo taloha sy natao sesitany: Ombilahy 12 ho an’ny Israely rehetra, ondrilahy 96, ondrilahy kely 77, ary osilahy 12 ho fanatitra noho ny ota. Fanatitra dorana ho an’i Jehovah daholo ireo.', 'ary nanolotra an’ireto sorona dorana ireto ho an’ny andriamanitry ny israely ny olona babo taloha sy natao sesitany: ombilahy 12 ho an’ny israely rehetra, ondrilahy 96, ondrilahy kely 77, ary osilahy 12 ho fanatitra noho ny ota. fanatitra dorana ho an’i jehovah daholo ireo.'),
  ('6ab25a9dd1ed0d1ad582e933', '2026-09-22T10:38:21.556Z', '2026-09-22T10:38:21.556Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ezra', 15, 8, 28, 'Dia hoy aho tamin’izy ireo: “Masina amin’i Jehovah ianareo, ary masina ireo fitaovana ireo. Fanatitra an-tsitrapo ho an’i Jehovah Andriamanitry ny razambenareo koa ireo volafotsy sy volamena ireo.', 'dia hoy aho tamin’izy ireo: “masina amin’i jehovah ianareo, ary masina ireo fitaovana ireo. fanatitra an-tsitrapo ho an’i jehovah andriamanitry ny razambenareo koa ireo volafotsy sy volamena ireo.'),
  ('6ab25a9dd1ed0d1ad582e930', '2026-09-22T10:38:21.556Z', '2026-09-22T10:38:21.556Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ezra', 15, 8, 25, 'Nolanjaiko dia nomeko azy ireo ny volafotsy sy ny volamena ary ny fitaovana, izany hoe ny fanomezana nomen’ny mpanjaka sy ny mpanolo-tsainy sy ny andrianany ary ny Israelita rehetra teo ho an’ny tranon’ny Andriamanitray.', 'nolanjaiko dia nomeko azy ireo ny volafotsy sy ny volamena ary ny fitaovana, izany hoe ny fanomezana nomen’ny mpanjaka sy ny mpanolo-tsainy sy ny andrianany ary ny israelita rehetra teo ho an’ny tranon’ny andriamanitray.'),
  ('6ab25a9dd1ed0d1ad582e935', '2026-09-22T10:38:21.556Z', '2026-09-22T10:38:21.556Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ezra', 15, 8, 30, 'Dia nalain’ny mpisorona sy ny Levita ireo volafotsy sy volamena ary fitaovana voalanja ireo, mba hoentina any Jerosalema any an-tranon’ny Andriamanitray.', 'dia nalain’ny mpisorona sy ny levita ireo volafotsy sy volamena ary fitaovana voalanja ireo, mba hoentina any jerosalema any an-tranon’ny andriamanitray.'),
  ('6ab25a9dd1ed0d1ad582e931', '2026-09-22T10:38:21.556Z', '2026-09-22T10:38:21.556Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ezra', 15, 8, 26, 'Ireto no nomeko azy ireo, rehefa avy nolanjaiko: Volafotsy 650 talenta, fitaovana volafotsy 100 izay nitentina 2 talenta, volamena 100 talenta,', 'ireto no nomeko azy ireo, rehefa avy nolanjaiko: volafotsy 650 talenta, fitaovana volafotsy 100 izay nitentina 2 talenta, volamena 100 talenta,'),
  ('6ab25a9dd1ed0d1ad582e92f', '2026-09-22T10:38:21.556Z', '2026-09-22T10:38:21.556Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ezra', 15, 8, 24, 'Natokako ny 12 lahy tamin’ny lehiben’ny mpisorona, dia i Serebia sy Hasabia ary ny folo tamin’ny rahalahin’izy ireo.', 'natokako ny 12 lahy tamin’ny lehiben’ny mpisorona, dia i serebia sy hasabia ary ny folo tamin’ny rahalahin’izy ireo.'),
  ('6ab25a9dd1ed0d1ad582e932', '2026-09-22T10:38:21.556Z', '2026-09-22T10:38:21.556Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ezra', 15, 8, 27, 'vilia baolina kely volamena 20 izay nitentina 1 000 darìka, ary fitaovana 2 vita amin’ny varahina tena tsara, izay mena mamirapiratra sady sarobidy hoatran’ny volamena.', 'vilia baolina kely volamena 20 izay nitentina 1 000 darìka, ary fitaovana 2 vita amin’ny varahina tena tsara, izay mena mamirapiratra sady sarobidy hoatran’ny volamena.'),
  ('6ab25a9dd1ed0d1ad582e93b', '2026-09-22T10:38:21.556Z', '2026-09-22T10:38:21.556Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ezra', 15, 8, 36, 'Dia nomenay an’ireo lehibem-paritany notendren’ny mpanjaka, sy ny governora atỳ amin’ny faritra Ampitan’ny Renirano ny didin’ny mpanjaka, ka nanampy ny vahoaka izy ireo sady nanome an’izay nilaina ho an’ny tranon’ilay tena Andriamanitra.', 'dia nomenay an’ireo lehibem-paritany notendren’ny mpanjaka, sy ny governora atỳ amin’ny faritra ampitan’ny renirano ny didin’ny mpanjaka, ka nanampy ny vahoaka izy ireo sady nanome an’izay nilaina ho an’ny tranon’ilay tena andriamanitra.'),
  ('6ab25a9e0b781b9775a96bf6', '2026-09-22T10:38:22.481Z', '2026-09-22T10:38:22.481Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ezra', 15, 10, 22, 'Ny avy tamin’ny taranak’i Pasora dia i Elioenay, Mahaseia, Ismaela, Netanela, Jozabada, ary Elasa.', 'ny avy tamin’ny taranak’i pasora dia i elioenay, mahaseia, ismaela, netanela, jozabada, ary elasa.'),
  ('6ab25a9e0b781b9775a96bef', '2026-09-22T10:38:22.481Z', '2026-09-22T10:38:22.481Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ezra', 15, 10, 15, 'Tsy nanaiky an’izany anefa i Jonatana zanak’i Asahela sy Jahaza zanak’i Tikva, ary nanampy azy ireo koa i Mesolama sy Sabetahy izay samy Levita.', 'tsy nanaiky an’izany anefa i jonatana zanak’i asahela sy jahaza zanak’i tikva, ary nanampy azy ireo koa i mesolama sy sabetahy izay samy levita.'),
  ('6ab25a9e0b781b9775a96bfe', '2026-09-22T10:38:22.481Z', '2026-09-22T10:38:22.481Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ezra', 15, 10, 30, 'Ny avy tamin’ny taranak’i Pahata-moaba dia i Adna, Kelala, Benaia, Mahaseia, Matania, Bezalila, Binoy, ary Manase.', 'ny avy tamin’ny taranak’i pahata-moaba dia i adna, kelala, benaia, mahaseia, matania, bezalila, binoy, ary manase.'),
  ('6ab25a9e0b781b9775a96bf9', '2026-09-22T10:38:22.481Z', '2026-09-22T10:38:22.481Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ezra', 15, 10, 25, 'Ny avy tamin’ny Israely, avy tamin’ny taranak’i Parosy, dia i Ramia, Jizia, Malkia, Miamina, Eleazara, Malkia, ary Benaia.', 'ny avy tamin’ny israely, avy tamin’ny taranak’i parosy, dia i ramia, jizia, malkia, miamina, eleazara, malkia, ary benaia.'),
  ('6ab25a9e0b781b9775a96bf8', '2026-09-22T10:38:22.481Z', '2026-09-22T10:38:22.481Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ezra', 15, 10, 24, 'Ary ny avy tamin’ireo mpihira dia i Eliasiba, ary ny avy tamin’ireo mpiandry vavahady dia i Saloma sy Talema ary Ory.', 'ary ny avy tamin’ireo mpihira dia i eliasiba, ary ny avy tamin’ireo mpiandry vavahady dia i saloma sy talema ary ory.'),
  ('6ab25a9e0b781b9775a96bf0', '2026-09-22T10:38:22.481Z', '2026-09-22T10:38:22.481Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ezra', 15, 10, 16, 'Ny olona avy natao sesitany kosa nanatanteraka an’izay efa nifanarahana. Tamin’ny andro voalohan’ny volana fahafolo àry, dia nivory nitokana i Ezra mpisorona sy ny lohan’ireo fianakaviambe, dia izay rehetra voatonona anarana, mba handinika an’ilay raharaha.', 'ny olona avy natao sesitany kosa nanatanteraka an’izay efa nifanarahana. tamin’ny andro voalohan’ny volana fahafolo àry, dia nivory nitokana i ezra mpisorona sy ny lohan’ireo fianakaviambe, dia izay rehetra voatonona anarana, mba handinika an’ilay raharaha.'),
