  ('6ab25ac0544094e199944e37', '2026-09-22T10:38:56.842Z', '2026-09-22T10:38:56.842Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Joba', 18, 31, 10, 'Dia aoka ny vadiko hanodina vato fikosoham-bary ho an’ny lehilahy hafa, Ary aoka hisy lehilahy hafa hanao firaisana aminy.', 'dia aoka ny vadiko hanodina vato fikosoham-bary ho an’ny lehilahy hafa, ary aoka hisy lehilahy hafa hanao firaisana aminy.'),
  ('6ab25ac0544094e199944e45', '2026-09-22T10:38:56.842Z', '2026-09-22T10:38:56.842Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Joba', 18, 31, 24, 'Raha nitoky tamin’ny volamena aho, Na niteny tamin’ny volamena tena tsara hoe: ‘Ianao no ianteherako!’', 'raha nitoky tamin’ny volamena aho, na niteny tamin’ny volamena tena tsara hoe: ‘ianao no ianteherako!’'),
  ('6ab25ac0544094e199944e41', '2026-09-22T10:38:56.842Z', '2026-09-22T10:38:56.842Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Joba', 18, 31, 20, 'Raha tsy nitso-drano ahy izy Rehefa nanafana ny tenany tamin’ny volon’ondriko;', 'raha tsy nitso-drano ahy izy rehefa nanafana ny tenany tamin’ny volon’ondriko;'),
  ('6ab25ac0544094e199944e35', '2026-09-22T10:38:56.842Z', '2026-09-22T10:38:56.842Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Joba', 18, 31, 8, 'Dia aoka aho hamafy, nefa olon-kafa no hihinana, Ary aoka hisy hanongotra izay amboleko.', 'dia aoka aho hamafy, nefa olon-kafa no hihinana, ary aoka hisy hanongotra izay amboleko.'),
  ('6ab25ac0544094e199944e4f', '2026-09-22T10:38:56.842Z', '2026-09-22T10:38:56.842Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Joba', 18, 31, 34, 'Efa mba natahotra an’izay mety hataon’ny vahoaka ve aho, Na nihorohoro noho ny fanesoan’ny mpiara-monina Ka nangina sy tsy sahy nivoaka ny trano?', 'efa mba natahotra an’izay mety hataon’ny vahoaka ve aho, na nihorohoro noho ny fanesoan’ny mpiara-monina ka nangina sy tsy sahy nivoaka ny trano?'),
  ('6ab25ac0544094e199944e4a', '2026-09-22T10:38:56.842Z', '2026-09-22T10:38:56.842Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Joba', 18, 31, 29, 'Efa mba nibitaka ve aho rehefa ringana ny fahavaloko, Na nifaly tamin’ny fahavoazany?', 'efa mba nibitaka ve aho rehefa ringana ny fahavaloko, na nifaly tamin’ny fahavoazany?'),
  ('6ab25ac0544094e199944e3d', '2026-09-22T10:38:56.842Z', '2026-09-22T10:38:56.842Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Joba', 18, 31, 16, 'Raha tsy nety nanome an’izay mba nirin’ny mahantra aho, Na navelako hipitrapitra ny mason’ny mpitondratena;', 'raha tsy nety nanome an’izay mba nirin’ny mahantra aho, na navelako hipitrapitra ny mason’ny mpitondratena;'),
  ('6ab25ac0544094e199944e31', '2026-09-22T10:38:56.842Z', '2026-09-22T10:38:56.842Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Joba', 18, 31, 4, 'Tsy mahita ny lalako angaha Andriamanitra, Ary tsy manisa ny diako rehetra angaha izy?', 'tsy mahita ny lalako angaha andriamanitra, ary tsy manisa ny diako rehetra angaha izy?'),
  ('6ab25ac0544094e199944e4e', '2026-09-22T10:38:56.842Z', '2026-09-22T10:38:56.842Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Joba', 18, 31, 33, 'Efa mba nanarontsarona ny fandikan-dalàna nataoko ve aho, toy ny fanaon’olona, Ka nanafina ny fahadisoako tao anaty paosin’akanjoko?', 'efa mba nanarontsarona ny fandikan-dalàna nataoko ve aho, toy ny fanaon’olona, ka nanafina ny fahadisoako tao anaty paosin’akanjoko?'),
  ('6ab25ac0544094e199944e43', '2026-09-22T10:38:56.842Z', '2026-09-22T10:38:56.842Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Joba', 18, 31, 22, 'Dia aoka ny sandriko hiala amin’ny soroko, Ary aoka ny tanako ho tapaka eo amin’ny kiho.', 'dia aoka ny sandriko hiala amin’ny soroko, ary aoka ny tanako ho tapaka eo amin’ny kiho.'),
  ('6ab25ac0544094e199944e42', '2026-09-22T10:38:56.842Z', '2026-09-22T10:38:56.842Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Joba', 18, 31, 21, 'Raha nambanako totohondry ny kamboty Rehefa nila fanampiana tamiko teo am-bavahadin’ny tanàna,', 'raha nambanako totohondry ny kamboty rehefa nila fanampiana tamiko teo am-bavahadin’ny tanàna,'),
  ('6ab25ac0544094e199944e48', '2026-09-22T10:38:56.842Z', '2026-09-22T10:38:56.842Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Joba', 18, 31, 27, 'Ka voasarika mangingina ny foko, Ary nanoroka ny tanako ny vavako ka nivavaka tamin’ireny aho;', 'ka voasarika mangingina ny foko, ary nanoroka ny tanako ny vavako ka nivavaka tamin’ireny aho;'),
  ('6ab25ac0544094e199944e38', '2026-09-22T10:38:56.842Z', '2026-09-22T10:38:56.842Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Joba', 18, 31, 11, 'Fa fitondran-tena mahamenatra izany, Ary fahadisoana tokony hahazoana sazy avy amin’ny mpitsara.', 'fa fitondran-tena mahamenatra izany, ary fahadisoana tokony hahazoana sazy avy amin’ny mpitsara.'),
  ('6ab25ac0544094e199944e34', '2026-09-22T10:38:56.842Z', '2026-09-22T10:38:56.842Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Joba', 18, 31, 7, 'Raha mivily any amin’ny tsy izy ny diako, Na manaraka izay tian’ny masoko ny foko, Na voaloto ny tanako,', 'raha mivily any amin’ny tsy izy ny diako, na manaraka izay tian’ny masoko ny foko, na voaloto ny tanako,'),
  ('6ab25ac0544094e199944e47', '2026-09-22T10:38:56.842Z', '2026-09-22T10:38:56.842Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Joba', 18, 31, 26, 'Raha nahita ny masoandro mamirapiratra aho, Na ny volana kanto mamakivaky ny lanitra;', 'raha nahita ny masoandro mamirapiratra aho, na ny volana kanto mamakivaky ny lanitra;'),
  ('6ab25ac0544094e199944e46', '2026-09-22T10:38:56.842Z', '2026-09-22T10:38:56.842Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Joba', 18, 31, 25, 'Raha nifaly tamin’ny harem-be nananako aho, Satria nahazo fananana be dia be;', 'raha nifaly tamin’ny harem-be nananako aho, satria nahazo fananana be dia be;'),
  ('6ab25ac0544094e199944e36', '2026-09-22T10:38:56.842Z', '2026-09-22T10:38:56.842Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Joba', 18, 31, 9, 'Raha voasarika ho amin’ny vehivavy hafa ny foko, Ka mamitsaka miandry eo am-baravaran’ny namako aho,', 'raha voasarika ho amin’ny vehivavy hafa ny foko, ka mamitsaka miandry eo am-baravaran’ny namako aho,'),
  ('6ab25ac0544094e199944e53', '2026-09-22T10:38:56.842Z', '2026-09-22T10:38:56.842Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Joba', 18, 31, 38, 'Raha nitaraina momba ahy ny taniko, Ary niara-nitomany ny vava asa teo aminy;', 'raha nitaraina momba ahy ny taniko, ary niara-nitomany ny vava asa teo aminy;'),
  ('6ab25ac0544094e199944e4c', '2026-09-22T10:38:56.842Z', '2026-09-22T10:38:56.842Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Joba', 18, 31, 31, 'Tsy niteny ve ny olona tao an-tranolaiko hoe: ‘Iza no mahita olona tsy voky tamin’ny sakafo nomeny?’', 'tsy niteny ve ny olona tao an-tranolaiko hoe: ‘iza no mahita olona tsy voky tamin’ny sakafo nomeny?’'),
  ('6ab25ac0544094e199944e49', '2026-09-22T10:38:56.842Z', '2026-09-22T10:38:56.842Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Joba', 18, 31, 28, 'Dia fahadisoana tokony hahazoana sazy avy amin’ny mpitsara izany, Satria ho nanda an’ilay tena Andriamanitra any ambony aho.', 'dia fahadisoana tokony hahazoana sazy avy amin’ny mpitsara izany, satria ho nanda an’ilay tena andriamanitra any ambony aho.'),
  ('6ab25ac0544094e199944e33', '2026-09-22T10:38:56.842Z', '2026-09-22T10:38:56.842Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Joba', 18, 31, 6, 'Aleo Andriamanitra handanja ahy amin’ny mizana marina, Dia ho hitany fa tsy mivadika aho.', 'aleo andriamanitra handanja ahy amin’ny mizana marina, dia ho hitany fa tsy mivadika aho.'),
  ('6ab25ac0544094e199944e3b', '2026-09-22T10:38:56.842Z', '2026-09-22T10:38:56.842Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Joba', 18, 31, 14, 'Dia inona no hataoko rehefa mitsara ahy Andriamanitra? Inona no havaliko azy rehefa manao ampamoaka izy?', 'dia inona no hataoko rehefa mitsara ahy andriamanitra? inona no havaliko azy rehefa manao ampamoaka izy?'),
  ('6ab25ac0544094e199944e40', '2026-09-22T10:38:56.842Z', '2026-09-22T10:38:56.842Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Joba', 18, 31, 19, 'Raha toa aho nahita olona efa ho faty noho izy tsy nanana akanjo, Na nahita mahantra tsy nanan-damba hirakofana;', 'raha toa aho nahita olona efa ho faty noho izy tsy nanana akanjo, na nahita mahantra tsy nanan-damba hirakofana;'),
  ('6ab25ac0544094e199944e3f', '2026-09-22T10:38:56.842Z', '2026-09-22T10:38:56.842Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Joba', 18, 31, 18, '—Efa hatramin’izaho mbola tanora mantsy no niara-lehibe tamiko ny kamboty ka toy ny rainy aho, Ary efa hatramin’ny mbola kely aho no mpitari-dalana ho an’ny mpitondratena. —', '—efa hatramin’izaho mbola tanora mantsy no niara-lehibe tamiko ny kamboty ka toy ny rainy aho, ary efa hatramin’ny mbola kely aho no mpitari-dalana ho an’ny mpitondratena. —'),
  ('6ab25ac0544094e199944e54', '2026-09-22T10:38:56.842Z', '2026-09-22T10:38:56.842Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Joba', 18, 31, 39, 'Raha nohaniko ny vokatra teo aminy nefa tsy nandoa vola aho, Na raha nanao izay hahakivy ny tompony aho;', 'raha nohaniko ny vokatra teo aminy nefa tsy nandoa vola aho, na raha nanao izay hahakivy ny tompony aho;'),
  ('6ab25ac0544094e199944e52', '2026-09-22T10:38:56.842Z', '2026-09-22T10:38:56.842Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Joba', 18, 31, 37, 'Ho notateriko tamin’Andriamanitra ny diako tsirairay; Ho natoky tena hoatran’ny andriana aho rehefa nanatona azy.', 'ho notateriko tamin’andriamanitra ny diako tsirairay; ho natoky tena hoatran’ny andriana aho rehefa nanatona azy.'),
  ('6ab25ac0544094e199944e50', '2026-09-22T10:38:56.842Z', '2026-09-22T10:38:56.842Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Joba', 18, 31, 35, 'Raha mba misy mihaino mantsy aho! Ho nosoniaviko tamin’ny anarako izay nolazaiko. Aoka ilay Mahery Indrindra hamaly ahy! Raha mba nosoratan’ny mpiampanga ahy mantsy ny fiampangana ahy!', 'raha mba misy mihaino mantsy aho! ho nosoniaviko tamin’ny anarako izay nolazaiko. aoka ilay mahery indrindra hamaly ahy! raha mba nosoratan’ny mpiampanga ahy mantsy ny fiampangana ahy!');
INSERT INTO "bible_verses" ("id", "created_date", "updated_date", "created_by_id", "created_by", "translation", "book", "bookOrder", "chapter", "verse", "text", "normalizedText") VALUES
  ('6ab25ac0544094e199944e44', '2026-09-22T10:38:56.842Z', '2026-09-22T10:38:56.842Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Joba', 18, 31, 23, 'Fa natahotra ny hiharan’ny loza avy amin’Andriamanitra aho, Ary tsy nahajoro teo anoloan’ny voninahiny.', 'fa natahotra ny hiharan’ny loza avy amin’andriamanitra aho, ary tsy nahajoro teo anoloan’ny voninahiny.'),
  ('6ab25ac0544094e199944e3a', '2026-09-22T10:38:56.842Z', '2026-09-22T10:38:56.842Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Joba', 18, 31, 13, 'Raha tsy nomeko rariny ny mpanompolahiko sy ny mpanompovaviko Rehefa nitaraina noho ny nataoko,', 'raha tsy nomeko rariny ny mpanompolahiko sy ny mpanompovaviko rehefa nitaraina noho ny nataoko,'),
  ('6ab25ac0544094e199944e4b', '2026-09-22T10:38:56.842Z', '2026-09-22T10:38:56.842Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Joba', 18, 31, 30, 'Tsy mba namela ny vavako hanota aho, Ka hoe hanozona azy sy haniry ny hahafatesany.', 'tsy mba namela ny vavako hanota aho, ka hoe hanozona azy sy haniry ny hahafatesany.'),
  ('6ab25ac0544094e199944e3e', '2026-09-22T10:38:56.842Z', '2026-09-22T10:38:56.842Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Joba', 18, 31, 17, 'Raha nohaniko irery ny anjara sakafoko, Fa tsy nozaraiko tamin’ny kamboty;', 'raha nohaniko irery ny anjara sakafoko, fa tsy nozaraiko tamin’ny kamboty;'),
  ('6ab25ac0544094e199944e32', '2026-09-22T10:38:56.842Z', '2026-09-22T10:38:56.842Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Joba', 18, 31, 5, 'Efa nanao ny tsy marina angaha aho? Maika handeha hamitaka ve ny tongotro?', 'efa nanao ny tsy marina angaha aho? maika handeha hamitaka ve ny tongotro?'),
  ('6ab25ac0544094e199944e55', '2026-09-22T10:38:56.842Z', '2026-09-22T10:38:56.842Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Joba', 18, 31, 40, 'Dia aoka ho tsilo no haniry eo fa tsy varimbazaha, Ary ahidratsy maimbo fa tsy vary orza.” Tapitra eto ny tenin’i Joba.', 'dia aoka ho tsilo no haniry eo fa tsy varimbazaha, ary ahidratsy maimbo fa tsy vary orza.” tapitra eto ny tenin’i joba.'),
  ('6ab25ac0544094e199944e51', '2026-09-22T10:38:56.842Z', '2026-09-22T10:38:56.842Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Joba', 18, 31, 36, 'Dia ho nolanjaiko teo an-tsoroko izany, Ary ho nafatotro teo amin’ny lohako toy ny satroboninahitra.', 'dia ho nolanjaiko teo an-tsoroko izany, ary ho nafatotro teo amin’ny lohako toy ny satroboninahitra.'),
  ('6ab25ac0544094e199944e39', '2026-09-22T10:38:56.842Z', '2026-09-22T10:38:56.842Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Joba', 18, 31, 12, 'Ho afo mandoro sy mamotika tanteraka izany, Ka ho levona hatramin’ny fakany ny zavatra rehetra novokariko.', 'ho afo mandoro sy mamotika tanteraka izany, ka ho levona hatramin’ny fakany ny zavatra rehetra novokariko.'),
  ('6ab25ac20d9dc095923c86f5', '2026-09-22T10:38:58.438Z', '2026-09-22T10:38:58.438Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Joba', 18, 34, 18, 'Hilaza amin’ny mpanjaka ve ianao hoe: ‘Tsy misy ilana anao!’, Na amin’ny olona ambony hoe: ‘Ratsy fanahy ianao’?', 'hilaza amin’ny mpanjaka ve ianao hoe: ‘tsy misy ilana anao!’, na amin’ny olona ambony hoe: ‘ratsy fanahy ianao’?'),
  ('6ab25ac20d9dc095923c86ff', '2026-09-22T10:38:58.438Z', '2026-09-22T10:38:58.438Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Joba', 18, 34, 28, 'Ataon’izy ireny izay hampitaraina ny mahantra, Ka henony ny fitarainan’ny tsy misy mpiaro.', 'ataon’izy ireny izay hampitaraina ny mahantra, ka henony ny fitarainan’ny tsy misy mpiaro.'),
  ('6ab25ac20d9dc095923c86ef', '2026-09-22T10:38:58.438Z', '2026-09-22T10:38:58.438Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Joba', 18, 34, 12, 'Tsy mba manao ratsy mihitsy Andriamanitra; Tsy mba mamadika ny rariny ilay Mahery Indrindra.', 'tsy mba manao ratsy mihitsy andriamanitra; tsy mba mamadika ny rariny ilay mahery indrindra.'),
  ('6ab25ac20d9dc095923c86ee', '2026-09-22T10:38:58.438Z', '2026-09-22T10:38:58.438Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Joba', 18, 34, 11, 'Fa hovaliany araka izay ataony ny olona, Ary havelany hizaka ny vokatry ny fitondran-tenany.', 'fa hovaliany araka izay ataony ny olona, ary havelany hizaka ny vokatry ny fitondran-tenany.'),
  ('6ab25ac20d9dc095923c86e6', '2026-09-22T10:38:58.438Z', '2026-09-22T10:38:58.438Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Joba', 18, 34, 3, 'Fa ny sofina no mamantatra teny, Toy ny lela mamantatra tsiron-kanina.', 'fa ny sofina no mamantatra teny, toy ny lela mamantatra tsiron-kanina.'),
  ('6ab25ac20d9dc095923c8702', '2026-09-22T10:38:58.438Z', '2026-09-22T10:38:58.438Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Joba', 18, 34, 31, 'Fa hisy hilaza amin’Andriamanitra ve hoe: ‘Voasazy aho, nefa tsy nanao ratsy;', 'fa hisy hilaza amin’andriamanitra ve hoe: ‘voasazy aho, nefa tsy nanao ratsy;'),
  ('6ab25ac20d9dc095923c8701', '2026-09-22T10:38:58.438Z', '2026-09-22T10:38:58.438Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Joba', 18, 34, 30, 'Amin’izay dia tsy hanjaka ny olona tsy matahotra an’Andriamanitra Sady tsy ho afaka hamandrika olona.', 'amin’izay dia tsy hanjaka ny olona tsy matahotra an’andriamanitra sady tsy ho afaka hamandrika olona.'),
  ('6ab25ac20d9dc095923c86f8', '2026-09-22T10:38:58.438Z', '2026-09-22T10:38:58.438Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Joba', 18, 34, 21, 'Fa mijery an’izay alehan’ny olona Andriamanitra, Ary mahita ny diany rehetra.', 'fa mijery an’izay alehan’ny olona andriamanitra, ary mahita ny diany rehetra.'),
  ('6ab25ac20d9dc095923c86ec', '2026-09-22T10:38:58.438Z', '2026-09-22T10:38:58.438Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Joba', 18, 34, 9, 'Izao mantsy no nolazainy: ‘Tsy mahasoa ny olona Ny miezaka mampifaly an’Andriamanitra.’', 'izao mantsy no nolazainy: ‘tsy mahasoa ny olona ny miezaka mampifaly an’andriamanitra.’'),
