  ('6ab25ac874de4880330561b8', '2026-09-22T10:39:04.102Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:04.102Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Joba', 18, 40, 19, 'Anisan’ny voalohany amin’ny asan’Andriamanitra izy; Ny Mpanao azy ihany no mahavita manatona azy mba hamely azy amin’ny sabatra.', 'anisan’ny voalohany amin’ny asan’andriamanitra izy; ny mpanao azy ihany no mahavita manatona azy mba hamely azy amin’ny sabatra.'),
  ('6ab25ac874de4880330561bc', '2026-09-22T10:39:04.102Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:04.102Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Joba', 18, 40, 23, 'Tsy matahotra izy, na dia mahery be aza ny renirano. Matoky tena izy, na dia mitosaka mankeo am-bavany aza ny Reniranon’i Jordana.', 'tsy matahotra izy, na dia mahery be aza ny renirano. matoky tena izy, na dia mitosaka mankeo am-bavany aza ny reniranon’i jordana.'),
  ('6ab25ac874de4880330561af', '2026-09-22T10:39:04.102Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:04.102Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Joba', 18, 40, 10, 'Aoka ianao, azafady, hiravaka voninahitra sy fahalehibeazana; Mitafia haja amam-boninahitra.', 'aoka ianao, azafady, hiravaka voninahitra sy fahalehibeazana; mitafia haja amam-boninahitra.'),
  ('6ab25ac874de4880330561a6', '2026-09-22T10:39:04.102Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:04.102Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Joba', 18, 40, 1, 'Mbola namaly an’i Joba ihany i Jehovah hoe:', 'mbola namaly an’i joba ihany i jehovah hoe:'),
  ('6ab25ac874de4880330561a9', '2026-09-22T10:39:04.102Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:04.102Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Joba', 18, 40, 4, '“Tsinontsinona aho, Ka inona no azoko avaly anao? Tampenako ny vavako.', '“tsinontsinona aho, ka inona no azoko avaly anao? tampenako ny vavako.'),
  ('6ab25ac874de4880330561b4', '2026-09-22T10:39:04.102Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:04.102Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Joba', 18, 40, 15, 'Jereo ny Behemota, fa samy nataoko na izy na ianao. Mihinana ahitra hoatran’ny omby izy.', 'jereo ny behemota, fa samy nataoko na izy na ianao. mihinana ahitra hoatran’ny omby izy.'),
  ('6ab25ac874de4880330561b6', '2026-09-22T10:39:04.102Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:04.102Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Joba', 18, 40, 17, 'Henjaniny ny rambony ka hoatran’ny hazo sedera; Mifampidipiditra ny hoza-peny.', 'henjaniny ny rambony ka hoatran’ny hazo sedera; mifampidipiditra ny hoza-peny.'),
  ('6ab25ac874de4880330561b5', '2026-09-22T10:39:04.102Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:04.102Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Joba', 18, 40, 16, 'Jereo fa matanjaka be ny tehezany Ary mafy be ny hoza-kibony!', 'jereo fa matanjaka be ny tehezany ary mafy be ny hoza-kibony!'),
  ('6ab25ac874de4880330561bd', '2026-09-22T10:39:04.102Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:04.102Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Joba', 18, 40, 24, 'Misy mahasambotra azy ve raha mbola mailomailo izy, Sa misy mahavita mandoaka ny orony amin’ny faraingo?', 'misy mahasambotra azy ve raha mbola mailomailo izy, sa misy mahavita mandoaka ny orony amin’ny faraingo?'),
  ('6ab25ac874de4880330561b3', '2026-09-22T10:39:04.102Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:04.102Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Joba', 18, 40, 14, 'Dia izaho mihitsy no hiaiky amin’izay Hoe mahavonjy anao ny tananao havanana.', 'dia izaho mihitsy no hiaiky amin’izay hoe mahavonjy anao ny tananao havanana.'),
  ('6ab25ac874de4880330561a8', '2026-09-22T10:39:04.102Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:04.102Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Joba', 18, 40, 3, 'Dia namaly an’i Jehovah i Joba hoe:', 'dia namaly an’i jehovah i joba hoe:'),
  ('6ab25ac874de4880330561b1', '2026-09-22T10:39:04.102Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:04.102Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Joba', 18, 40, 12, 'Jereo izay manambony tena ka ataovy izay hahafa-baraka azy, Ary hitsakitsaho eo amin’izay misy azy ny ratsy fanahy.', 'jereo izay manambony tena ka ataovy izay hahafa-baraka azy, ary hitsakitsaho eo amin’izay misy azy ny ratsy fanahy.'),
  ('6ab25ac874de4880330561ac', '2026-09-22T10:39:04.102Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:04.102Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Joba', 18, 40, 7, '“Miomàna, azafady, ary misehoa ho lehilahy; Hanontany anao aho, ka valio:', '“miomàna, azafady, ary misehoa ho lehilahy; hanontany anao aho, ka valio:'),
  ('6ab25ac874de4880330561bb', '2026-09-22T10:39:04.102Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:04.102Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Joba', 18, 40, 22, 'Manalokaloka azy ny kirihitra feno tsilo, Ary manodidina azy ny hazo aravaha eny amin’ny lohasaha.', 'manalokaloka azy ny kirihitra feno tsilo, ary manodidina azy ny hazo aravaha eny amin’ny lohasaha.'),
  ('6ab25ac874de4880330561ba', '2026-09-22T10:39:04.102Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:04.102Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Joba', 18, 40, 21, 'Matory eny ambany kirihitra feno tsilo izy, Eny ambany alokaloky ny bararata eny amin’ny honahona.', 'matory eny ambany kirihitra feno tsilo izy, eny ambany alokaloky ny bararata eny amin’ny honahona.'),
  ('6ab25ac874de4880330561ae', '2026-09-22T10:39:04.102Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:04.102Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Joba', 18, 40, 9, 'Matanjaka toy ny sandrin’ilay tena Andriamanitra ve ny anao, Sa mahavita mampikotrokotroka ny feonao ho tahaka ny azy ianao?', 'matanjaka toy ny sandrin’ilay tena andriamanitra ve ny anao, sa mahavita mampikotrokotroka ny feonao ho tahaka ny azy ianao?'),
  ('6ab25ac874de4880330561ad', '2026-09-22T10:39:04.102Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:04.102Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Joba', 18, 40, 8, 'Hisalasala ve ianao hoe manao ny rariny tokoa aho? Homelohinao ve aho mba hahamarina anao?', 'hisalasala ve ianao hoe manao ny rariny tokoa aho? homelohinao ve aho mba hahamarina anao?'),
  ('6ab25ac874de4880330561aa', '2026-09-22T10:39:04.102Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:04.102Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Joba', 18, 40, 5, 'Efa niteny indray mandeha aho, nefa tsy hamaly intsony, Indroa mihitsy aza, nefa tsy hiteny intsony.”', 'efa niteny indray mandeha aho, nefa tsy hamaly intsony, indroa mihitsy aza, nefa tsy hiteny intsony.”'),
  ('6ab25ac874de4880330561b0', '2026-09-22T10:39:04.102Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:04.102Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Joba', 18, 40, 11, 'Avoahy daholo ny fahatezeranao; Jereo izay rehetra manambony tena ka ataovy lasa ambany.', 'avoahy daholo ny fahatezeranao; jereo izay rehetra manambony tena ka ataovy lasa ambany.'),
  ('6ab25ac874de4880330561b7', '2026-09-22T10:39:04.102Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:04.102Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Joba', 18, 40, 18, 'Toy ny fantsona varahina ny taolany, Ary toy ny bara vy ny rantsambatany.', 'toy ny fantsona varahina ny taolany, ary toy ny bara vy ny rantsambatany.'),
  ('6ab25ac90c11b051ac532fd6', '2026-09-22T10:39:05.231Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:05.231Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Joba', 18, 41, 20, 'Mamoaka setroka ny vavorony, Toy ny fatana mirehitra asiana harefo.', 'mamoaka setroka ny vavorony, toy ny fatana mirehitra asiana harefo.'),
  ('6ab25ac90c11b051ac532fd7', '2026-09-22T10:39:05.231Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:05.231Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Joba', 18, 41, 21, 'Mampiredareda vainafo ny fofonainy, Ary misy lelafo mivoaka avy amin’ny vavany.', 'mampiredareda vainafo ny fofonainy, ary misy lelafo mivoaka avy amin’ny vavany.'),
  ('6ab25ac90c11b051ac532fd4', '2026-09-22T10:39:05.231Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:05.231Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Joba', 18, 41, 18, 'Mampitselatra hazavana izy isaky ny mievina, Ary ny masony dia toy ny taratry ny maraina vao mangiran-dratsy.', 'mampitselatra hazavana izy isaky ny mievina, ary ny masony dia toy ny taratry ny maraina vao mangiran-dratsy.'),
  ('6ab25ac90c11b051ac532fcb', '2026-09-22T10:39:05.231Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:05.231Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Joba', 18, 41, 9, 'Ho diso fanantenana izay mitady hamolaka azy. Vao mahita azy fotsiny ianao dia efa tsy mahahetsika.', 'ho diso fanantenana izay mitady hamolaka azy. vao mahita azy fotsiny ianao dia efa tsy mahahetsika.'),
  ('6ab25ac90c11b051ac532fc5', '2026-09-22T10:39:05.231Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:05.231Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Joba', 18, 41, 3, 'Hitalaholaho imbetsaka aminao ve izy, Sa hanao teny malefaka aminao?', 'hitalaholaho imbetsaka aminao ve izy, sa hanao teny malefaka aminao?'),
  ('6ab25ac90c11b051ac532fd3', '2026-09-22T10:39:05.231Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:05.231Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Joba', 18, 41, 17, 'Mifampipetaka tsara ireny; Ary mifamikitra ka tsy voasaraka.', 'mifampipetaka tsara ireny; ary mifamikitra ka tsy voasaraka.'),
  ('6ab25ac90c11b051ac532fcf', '2026-09-22T10:39:05.231Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:05.231Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Joba', 18, 41, 13, 'Iza no mahavita manala ny fitafiany ivelany? Iza no ho sahy hiditra eo anelanelan’ny valanoranony?', 'iza no mahavita manala ny fitafiany ivelany? iza no ho sahy hiditra eo anelanelan’ny valanoranony?'),
  ('6ab25ac90c11b051ac532fc7', '2026-09-22T10:39:05.231Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:05.231Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Joba', 18, 41, 5, 'Hilalao azy tahaka ny filalao vorona ve ianao, Sa hamatotra azy holalaovin’ny zanakao vavikely?', 'hilalao azy tahaka ny filalao vorona ve ianao, sa hamatotra azy holalaovin’ny zanakao vavikely?'),
  ('6ab25ac90c11b051ac532fd1', '2026-09-22T10:39:05.231Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:05.231Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Joba', 18, 41, 15, 'Misy kirany mitandahatra ny lamosiny, Ary miraikitra mafy toy ny nasiana tombo-kase izy ireny.', 'misy kirany mitandahatra ny lamosiny, ary miraikitra mafy toy ny nasiana tombo-kase izy ireny.'),
  ('6ab25ac90c11b051ac532fc9', '2026-09-22T10:39:05.231Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:05.231Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Joba', 18, 41, 7, 'Ho vitanao ve ny hanatsatoka vy maranitra be dia be eny amin’ny hodiny, Na ny hanatrobaka ny lohany amin’ny lefona fihazana trondro?', 'ho vitanao ve ny hanatsatoka vy maranitra be dia be eny amin’ny hodiny, na ny hanatrobaka ny lohany amin’ny lefona fihazana trondro?'),
  ('6ab25ac90c11b051ac532fd2', '2026-09-22T10:39:05.231Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:05.231Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Joba', 18, 41, 16, 'Mifanetinety tsara ireny, Ka tsy tafiditry ny rivotra eny anelanelany.', 'mifanetinety tsara ireny, ka tsy tafiditry ny rivotra eny anelanelany.'),
  ('6ab25ac90c11b051ac532fcd', '2026-09-22T10:39:05.231Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:05.231Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Joba', 18, 41, 11, 'Iza no nanome ahy, ka tokony homeko valisoa koa avy eo? Fa ahy daholo izay rehetra eny ambanin’ny lanitra.', 'iza no nanome ahy, ka tokony homeko valisoa koa avy eo? fa ahy daholo izay rehetra eny ambanin’ny lanitra.'),
  ('6ab25ac90c11b051ac532fc6', '2026-09-22T10:39:05.231Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:05.231Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Joba', 18, 41, 4, 'Hanao fifanekena aminao ve izy, Mba hataonao mpanompo mandrakizay?', 'hanao fifanekena aminao ve izy, mba hataonao mpanompo mandrakizay?'),
  ('6ab25ac90c11b051ac532fc4', '2026-09-22T10:39:05.231Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:05.231Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Joba', 18, 41, 2, 'Mahavita manisy tady eo amin’ny vavorony ve ianao, Na managorobaka ny valanoranony amin’ny faraingo?', 'mahavita manisy tady eo amin’ny vavorony ve ianao, na managorobaka ny valanoranony amin’ny faraingo?'),
  ('6ab25ac90c11b051ac532fd5', '2026-09-22T10:39:05.231Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:05.231Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Joba', 18, 41, 19, 'Misy tselatra mivoaka avy amin’ny vavany, Misy tselatr’afo mipitipitika.', 'misy tselatra mivoaka avy amin’ny vavany, misy tselatr’afo mipitipitika.'),
  ('6ab25ac90c11b051ac532fd0', '2026-09-22T10:39:05.231Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:05.231Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Joba', 18, 41, 14, 'Iza no mahasokatra ny vavany? Mampihoron-koditra ny nifiny.', 'iza no mahasokatra ny vavany? mampihoron-koditra ny nifiny.'),
  ('6ab25ac90c11b051ac532fce', '2026-09-22T10:39:05.231Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:05.231Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Joba', 18, 41, 12, 'Tsy hangina aho fa hiresaka momba ny rantsambatany, Sy ny heriny ary ny hakanton’ny firafitry ny vatany.', 'tsy hangina aho fa hiresaka momba ny rantsambatany, sy ny heriny ary ny hakanton’ny firafitry ny vatany.'),
  ('6ab25ac90c11b051ac532fcc', '2026-09-22T10:39:05.231Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:05.231Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Joba', 18, 41, 10, 'Tsy misy sahy mila ady aminy. Koa iza no hahavita hanohitra ahy?', 'tsy misy sahy mila ady aminy. koa iza no hahavita hanohitra ahy?'),
  ('6ab25ac90c11b051ac532fca', '2026-09-22T10:39:05.231Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:05.231Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Joba', 18, 41, 8, 'Kasiho amin’ny tananao ange izy e! Dia hotsaroanao tsara ilay ady nataonao taminy, ka tsy hamerina intsony ianao!', 'kasiho amin’ny tananao ange izy e! dia hotsaroanao tsara ilay ady nataonao taminy, ka tsy hamerina intsony ianao!'),
  ('6ab25ac90c11b051ac532fd8', '2026-09-22T10:39:05.231Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:05.231Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Joba', 18, 41, 22, 'Matanjaka be ny vozony, Ary mihazakazaka eo anoloany ny horohoro.', 'matanjaka be ny vozony, ary mihazakazaka eo anoloany ny horohoro.'),
  ('6ab25ac90c11b051ac532fc8', '2026-09-22T10:39:05.231Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:05.231Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Joba', 18, 41, 6, 'Hanakalo azy amin-javatra hafa ve ny mpivarotra? Hifampizara azy amin’ny mpivarotra hafa ve izy ireo?', 'hanakalo azy amin-javatra hafa ve ny mpivarotra? hifampizara azy amin’ny mpivarotra hafa ve izy ireo?'),
  ('6ab25ac90c11b051ac532fc3', '2026-09-22T10:39:05.231Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:05.231Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Joba', 18, 41, 1, '“Mahasambotra Leviatana amin’ny lelam-pintana ve ianao, Sa mahafatotra ny lelany amin’ny tady?', '“mahasambotra leviatana amin’ny lelam-pintana ve ianao, sa mahafatotra ny lelany amin’ny tady?'),
  ('6ab25ac90c11b051ac532fe4', '2026-09-22T10:39:05.232Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:05.232Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Joba', 18, 41, 34, 'Ivandravandrany daholo izay mirehareha. Izy no mpanjakan’ny bibidia matanjaka rehetra.”', 'ivandravandrany daholo izay mirehareha. izy no mpanjakan’ny bibidia matanjaka rehetra.”'),
  ('6ab25ac90c11b051ac532fdc', '2026-09-22T10:39:05.232Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:05.232Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Joba', 18, 41, 26, 'Tsy maharesy azy izay sabatra mahavoa azy, Ary toy izany koa na ny lefona, na ny zana-tsipìka kely, na ny lohan-jana-tsipìka.', 'tsy maharesy azy izay sabatra mahavoa azy, ary toy izany koa na ny lefona, na ny zana-tsipìka kely, na ny lohan-jana-tsipìka.'),
