  ('6ab25ac90c11b051ac532fe1', '2026-09-22T10:39:05.232Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:05.232Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Joba', 18, 41, 31, 'Ataony mangotrakotraka toy ny ao am-bilany ny rano lalina, Ary ny ranomasina dia ataony mandroadroatra toy ny ao anaty vilany fanaovana menaka fanosorana.', 'ataony mangotrakotraka toy ny ao am-bilany ny rano lalina, ary ny ranomasina dia ataony mandroadroatra toy ny ao anaty vilany fanaovana menaka fanosorana.'),
  ('6ab25ac90c11b051ac532fdb', '2026-09-22T10:39:05.232Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:05.232Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Joba', 18, 41, 25, 'Rehefa mitsangana izy, dia mihorohoro na dia ny mahery aza; Mampahatahotra ilay izy mihetsiketsika be iny!', 'rehefa mitsangana izy, dia mihorohoro na dia ny mahery aza; mampahatahotra ilay izy mihetsiketsika be iny!'),
  ('6ab25ac90c11b051ac532fd9', '2026-09-22T10:39:05.232Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:05.232Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Joba', 18, 41, 23, 'Mifampiraikitra tsara ny nofony mivalombalona; Mafy be toy ny metaly narendrika izay nararaka teo aminy izany, ka tsy azo endahina.', 'mifampiraikitra tsara ny nofony mivalombalona; mafy be toy ny metaly narendrika izay nararaka teo aminy izany, ka tsy azo endahina.'),
  ('6ab25ac90c11b051ac532fe3', '2026-09-22T10:39:05.232Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:05.232Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Joba', 18, 41, 33, 'Tsy misy toa azy eny ambonin’ny tany, Fa noforonina tsy hanan-tahotra izy.', 'tsy misy toa azy eny ambonin’ny tany, fa noforonina tsy hanan-tahotra izy.'),
  ('6ab25ac90c11b051ac532fda', '2026-09-22T10:39:05.232Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:05.232Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Joba', 18, 41, 24, 'Mafy toy ny vato ny fony, Eny, mafy toy ny vato ambany amin’ny vato fikosoham-bary.', 'mafy toy ny vato ny fony, eny, mafy toy ny vato ambany amin’ny vato fikosoham-bary.'),
  ('6ab25ac90c11b051ac532fe2', '2026-09-22T10:39:05.232Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:05.232Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Joba', 18, 41, 32, 'Mamela soritra mamirapiratra izy rehefa mandalo, Ka hoatran’ny hoe misy volo fotsy ny rano lalina.', 'mamela soritra mamirapiratra izy rehefa mandalo, ka hoatran’ny hoe misy volo fotsy ny rano lalina.'),
  ('6ab25ac90c11b051ac532fdd', '2026-09-22T10:39:05.232Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:05.232Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Joba', 18, 41, 27, 'Aminy dia toy ny mololo ny vy, Ary toy ny hazo lo ny varahina.', 'aminy dia toy ny mololo ny vy, ary toy ny hazo lo ny varahina.'),
  ('6ab25ac90c11b051ac532fde', '2026-09-22T10:39:05.232Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:05.232Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Joba', 18, 41, 28, 'Tsy mampandositra azy ny zana-tsipìka. Lasa toy ny mololo ny vatom-pilotra mahavoa azy.', 'tsy mampandositra azy ny zana-tsipìka. lasa toy ny mololo ny vatom-pilotra mahavoa azy.'),
  ('6ab25ac90c11b051ac532fdf', '2026-09-22T10:39:05.232Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:05.232Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Joba', 18, 41, 29, 'Aminy dia toy ny mololo ny kibay, Ary ihomehezany fotsiny ny feon’ny lefom-pohy ahetsiketsika.', 'aminy dia toy ny mololo ny kibay, ary ihomehezany fotsiny ny feon’ny lefom-pohy ahetsiketsika.'),
  ('6ab25ac9060b40bd7d88c1da', '2026-09-22T10:39:05.664Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:05.664Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Joba', 18, 42, 4, 'Nilaza koa ianao hoe: ‘Mihainoa, azafady, fa hiteny aho. Hanontany anao aho, ka valio.’', 'nilaza koa ianao hoe: ‘mihainoa, azafady, fa hiteny aho. hanontany anao aho, ka valio.’'),
  ('6ab25ac9060b40bd7d88c1d9', '2026-09-22T10:39:05.664Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:05.664Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Joba', 18, 42, 3, 'Niteny ianao hoe: ‘Iza moa izao manamaizina ny fikasako izao, nefa tsy mahafantatra na inona na inona akory?’ Koa niteny aho, nefa tsy takatry ny saiko akory Ireo zavatra mahagaga ahy loatra, izay tsy fantatro.', 'niteny ianao hoe: ‘iza moa izao manamaizina ny fikasako izao, nefa tsy mahafantatra na inona na inona akory?’ koa niteny aho, nefa tsy takatry ny saiko akory ireo zavatra mahagaga ahy loatra, izay tsy fantatro.'),
  ('6ab25ac9060b40bd7d88c1de', '2026-09-22T10:39:05.664Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:05.664Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Joba', 18, 42, 8, 'Koa makà ombilahy fito sy ondrilahy fito, ka mankanesa any amin’i Joba mpanompoko, ary manolora fanatitra dorana noho ny fahotanareo. Dia hivavaka ho anareo i Joba mpanompoko. Hohenoiko tokoa ilay fangatahany hoe mba tsy hovaliako araka ny hadalanareo ianareo. Tsy nilaza ny marina momba ahy mantsy ianareo, tsy mba hoatran’i Joba mpanompoko.”', 'koa makà ombilahy fito sy ondrilahy fito, ka mankanesa any amin’i joba mpanompoko, ary manolora fanatitra dorana noho ny fahotanareo. dia hivavaka ho anareo i joba mpanompoko. hohenoiko tokoa ilay fangatahany hoe mba tsy hovaliako araka ny hadalanareo ianareo. tsy nilaza ny marina momba ahy mantsy ianareo, tsy mba hoatran’i joba mpanompoko.”'),
  ('6ab25ac9060b40bd7d88c1db', '2026-09-22T10:39:05.664Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:05.664Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Joba', 18, 42, 5, 'Efa naheno momba anao aho, Fa izao kosa dia ny masoko mihitsy no mahita anao.', 'efa naheno momba anao aho, fa izao kosa dia ny masoko mihitsy no mahita anao.'),
  ('6ab25ac9060b40bd7d88c1d8', '2026-09-22T10:39:05.664Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:05.664Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Joba', 18, 42, 2, '“Fantatro izao fa mahay manao ny zava-drehetra ianao, Ary tsy misy tsy vitanao izay rehetra eritreretinao hatao.', '“fantatro izao fa mahay manao ny zava-drehetra ianao, ary tsy misy tsy vitanao izay rehetra eritreretinao hatao.'),
  ('6ab25ac9060b40bd7d88c1dd', '2026-09-22T10:39:05.664Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:05.664Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Joba', 18, 42, 7, 'Rehefa tapitra ny tenin’i Jehovah tamin’i Joba, dia hoy i Jehovah tamin’i Elifaza Temanita: “Tezitra be aminao sy ny namanao roa lahy aho, satria tsy nilaza ny marina momba ahy ianareo, tsy mba hoatran’i Joba mpanompoko.', 'rehefa tapitra ny tenin’i jehovah tamin’i joba, dia hoy i jehovah tamin’i elifaza temanita: “tezitra be aminao sy ny namanao roa lahy aho, satria tsy nilaza ny marina momba ahy ianareo, tsy mba hoatran’i joba mpanompoko.'),
  ('6ab25ac9060b40bd7d88c1d7', '2026-09-22T10:39:05.664Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:05.664Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Joba', 18, 42, 1, 'Dia namaly an’i Jehovah i Joba hoe:', 'dia namaly an’i jehovah i joba hoe:'),
  ('6ab25ac9060b40bd7d88c1dc', '2026-09-22T10:39:05.664Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:05.664Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Joba', 18, 42, 6, 'Noho izany dia tsoahako ny teniko, Ary mibebaka eto amin’ny vovoka sy ny lavenona aho.”', 'noho izany dia tsoahako ny teniko, ary mibebaka eto amin’ny vovoka sy ny lavenona aho.”'),
  ('6ab25ac9060b40bd7d88c1df', '2026-09-22T10:39:05.665Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:05.665Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Joba', 18, 42, 9, 'Koa lasa i Elifaza Temanita sy Bildada Sohita ary Zofara Namatita nanao an’izay nasain’i Jehovah nataon’izy ireo. Dia nohenoin’i Jehovah ny vavak’i Joba.', 'koa lasa i elifaza temanita sy bildada sohita ary zofara namatita nanao an’izay nasain’i jehovah nataon’izy ireo. dia nohenoin’i jehovah ny vavak’i joba.'),
  ('6ab25ac9060b40bd7d88c1e7', '2026-09-22T10:39:05.665Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:05.665Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Joba', 18, 42, 17, 'Dia maty i Joba rehefa ela niainana sy afa-po.', 'dia maty i joba rehefa ela niainana sy afa-po.'),
  ('6ab25ac9060b40bd7d88c1e6', '2026-09-22T10:39:05.665Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:05.665Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Joba', 18, 42, 16, 'Taorian’izany, dia mbola velona 140 taona i Joba ka nahita ny zanany sy ny zafikeliny, hatramin’ny taranaka fahefatra.', 'taorian’izany, dia mbola velona 140 taona i joba ka nahita ny zanany sy ny zafikeliny, hatramin’ny taranaka fahefatra.'),
  ('6ab25ac9060b40bd7d88c1e3', '2026-09-22T10:39:05.665Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:05.665Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Joba', 18, 42, 13, 'Ary lasa nanana zanakalahy fito sy zanakavavy telo hafa koa izy.', 'ary lasa nanana zanakalahy fito sy zanakavavy telo hafa koa izy.'),
  ('6ab25ac9060b40bd7d88c1e0', '2026-09-22T10:39:05.665Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:05.665Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Joba', 18, 42, 10, 'Nofaranan’i Jehovah ny fahorian’i Joba ary nataony lasa nanan-karena indray izy, rehefa avy nivavaka ho an’ireo namany. Nomen’i Jehovah avo roa heny noho izay nananany taloha izy.', 'nofaranan’i jehovah ny fahorian’i joba ary nataony lasa nanan-karena indray izy, rehefa avy nivavaka ho an’ireo namany. nomen’i jehovah avo roa heny noho izay nananany taloha izy.'),
  ('6ab25ac9060b40bd7d88c1e5', '2026-09-22T10:39:05.665Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:05.665Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Joba', 18, 42, 15, 'Tsy nisy vehivavy tsara tarehy hoatran’ny zanakavavin’i Joba tao amin’ilay tany manontolo. Ary nomen-drainy lova niaraka tamin’ny anadahiny izy ireo.', 'tsy nisy vehivavy tsara tarehy hoatran’ny zanakavavin’i joba tao amin’ilay tany manontolo. ary nomen-drainy lova niaraka tamin’ny anadahiny izy ireo.'),
  ('6ab25ac9060b40bd7d88c1e1', '2026-09-22T10:39:05.665Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:05.665Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Joba', 18, 42, 11, 'Ary tonga namangy azy daholo ny rahalahiny sy ny anabaviny ary ny namany taloha, dia niara-nisakafo taminy tao an-tranony. Dia niara-niory taminy sy nampionona azy izy ireo, noho ny loza rehetra navelan’i Jehovah hanjo azy. Ary samy nanome azy kesita sy kavina volamena izy ireo.', 'ary tonga namangy azy daholo ny rahalahiny sy ny anabaviny ary ny namany taloha, dia niara-nisakafo taminy tao an-tranony. dia niara-niory taminy sy nampionona azy izy ireo, noho ny loza rehetra navelan’i jehovah hanjo azy. ary samy nanome azy kesita sy kavina volamena izy ireo.'),
  ('6ab25ac9060b40bd7d88c1e2', '2026-09-22T10:39:05.665Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:05.665Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Joba', 18, 42, 12, 'Koa notahin’i Jehovah ireo taona faramparany niainan’i Joba, mihoatra noho ny tamin’ny voalohany. Dia nanjary nanana ondry 14 000, sy rameva 6 000, sy omby 2 000 ary ampondravavy 1 000 izy.', 'koa notahin’i jehovah ireo taona faramparany niainan’i joba, mihoatra noho ny tamin’ny voalohany. dia nanjary nanana ondry 14 000, sy rameva 6 000, sy omby 2 000 ary ampondravavy 1 000 izy.'),
  ('6ab25ac9060b40bd7d88c1e4', '2026-09-22T10:39:05.665Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:05.665Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Joba', 18, 42, 14, 'Dia nataony hoe Jemima ny anaran’ny zanany vavy voalohany, Kezia ny faharoa, ary Kerena-hapoka ny fahatelo.', 'dia nataony hoe jemima ny anaran’ny zanany vavy voalohany, kezia ny faharoa, ary kerena-hapoka ny fahatelo.'),
  ('6ab25acaab2aaf36bf73e2b2', '2026-09-22T10:39:06.245Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:06.245Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 1, 1, 'Sambatra ny olona tsy manaraka ny torohevitry ny ratsy fanahy, Sy tsy mijoro eny amin’ny lalan’ny mpanota, Ary tsy mipetraka eny amin’izay ipetrahan’ny mpanesoeso.', 'sambatra ny olona tsy manaraka ny torohevitry ny ratsy fanahy, sy tsy mijoro eny amin’ny lalan’ny mpanota, ary tsy mipetraka eny amin’izay ipetrahan’ny mpanesoeso.'),
  ('6ab25acaab2aaf36bf73e2b3', '2026-09-22T10:39:06.245Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:06.245Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 1, 2, 'Fa ny lalàn’i Jehovah no mahafinaritra azy, Ary ny lalàny no vakiny sy saintsaininy andro aman’alina.', 'fa ny lalàn’i jehovah no mahafinaritra azy, ary ny lalàny no vakiny sy saintsaininy andro aman’alina.'),
  ('6ab25acaab2aaf36bf73e2b7', '2026-09-22T10:39:06.246Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:06.246Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 1, 6, 'Fantatr’i Jehovah mantsy ny lalan’ny olo-marina, Fa ny lalan’ny ratsy fanahy kosa ho foana.', 'fantatr’i jehovah mantsy ny lalan’ny olo-marina, fa ny lalan’ny ratsy fanahy kosa ho foana.'),
  ('6ab25acaab2aaf36bf73e2b5', '2026-09-22T10:39:06.246Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:06.246Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 1, 4, 'Tsy mba toy izany kosa ny ratsy fanahy; Toy ny akofa entin’ny rivotra izy ireo.', 'tsy mba toy izany kosa ny ratsy fanahy; toy ny akofa entin’ny rivotra izy ireo.'),
  ('6ab25acaab2aaf36bf73e2b6', '2026-09-22T10:39:06.246Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:06.246Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 1, 5, 'Izany no mahatonga ny ratsy fanahy tsy hahajoro eo anatrehan’ny fitsarana, Sy mahatonga ny mpanota tsy hahajoro eo anivon’ny olo-marina.', 'izany no mahatonga ny ratsy fanahy tsy hahajoro eo anatrehan’ny fitsarana, sy mahatonga ny mpanota tsy hahajoro eo anivon’ny olo-marina.'),
  ('6ab25acaab2aaf36bf73e2b4', '2026-09-22T10:39:06.246Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:06.246Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 1, 3, 'Ho toy ny hazo nambolena eo amoron’ny rano mikoriana izy, Dia hazo mamoa amin’ny fotoanany, Sady tsy mba malazo ny raviny. Ary hety tsara daholo izay ataony.', 'ho toy ny hazo nambolena eo amoron’ny rano mikoriana izy, dia hazo mamoa amin’ny fotoanany, sady tsy mba malazo ny raviny. ary hety tsara daholo izay ataony.'),
  ('6ab25aca80a64e68f28502cf', '2026-09-22T10:39:06.816Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:06.816Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 2, 11, 'Manompoa an’i Jehovah sady matahora azy, Ary mifalia, nefa koa mangovita.', 'manompoa an’i jehovah sady matahora azy, ary mifalia, nefa koa mangovita.'),
  ('6ab25aca80a64e68f28502ce', '2026-09-22T10:39:06.816Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:06.816Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 2, 10, 'Koa asehoy hoe misaina tsara ianareo, ry mpanjaka; Maneke fanitsiana, ry mpitsara eto an-tany!', 'koa asehoy hoe misaina tsara ianareo, ry mpanjaka; maneke fanitsiana, ry mpitsara eto an-tany!'),
  ('6ab25aca80a64e68f28502c9', '2026-09-22T10:39:06.816Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:06.816Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 2, 5, 'Ho tezitra be izy amin’izay rehefa hiteny amin’izy ireo, Ary hampihorohoro azy ireo amin-katezerana mafy,', 'ho tezitra be izy amin’izay rehefa hiteny amin’izy ireo, ary hampihorohoro azy ireo amin-katezerana mafy,'),
  ('6ab25aca80a64e68f28502c7', '2026-09-22T10:39:06.816Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:06.816Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 2, 3, 'Hoy izy ireo: “Andao hotapahintsika ny fatotra nataony, Ary hariantsika ny tady namatorany antsika!”', 'hoy izy ireo: “andao hotapahintsika ny fatotra nataony, ary hariantsika ny tady namatorany antsika!”'),
  ('6ab25aca80a64e68f28502c6', '2026-09-22T10:39:06.816Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:06.816Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 2, 2, 'Mitsangana ireo mpanjakan’ny tany Ary mivondrona ny manam-pahefana ambony, Mba hanohitra an’i Jehovah sy ilay voahosotra notendreny.', 'mitsangana ireo mpanjakan’ny tany ary mivondrona ny manam-pahefana ambony, mba hanohitra an’i jehovah sy ilay voahosotra notendreny.'),
  ('6ab25aca80a64e68f28502c8', '2026-09-22T10:39:06.816Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:06.816Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 2, 4, 'Hihomehy fotsiny anefa Ilay mipetraka eo amin’ny seza fiandrianana any an-danitra; Haneso azy ireo i Jehovah.', 'hihomehy fotsiny anefa ilay mipetraka eo amin’ny seza fiandrianana any an-danitra; haneso azy ireo i jehovah.'),
  ('6ab25aca80a64e68f28502cc', '2026-09-22T10:39:06.816Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:06.816Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 2, 8, 'Angataho amiko ireo firenena, dia homeko ho lovanao, Ary ny tany manontolo, fa homeko ho fanananao.', 'angataho amiko ireo firenena, dia homeko ho lovanao, ary ny tany manontolo, fa homeko ho fanananao.'),
  ('6ab25aca80a64e68f28502cd', '2026-09-22T10:39:06.816Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:06.816Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 2, 9, 'Hopotehinao amin’ny tehina vy ireny, Ary hotorotoroinao toy ny vilany tanimanga.”', 'hopotehinao amin’ny tehina vy ireny, ary hotorotoroinao toy ny vilany tanimanga.”'),
  ('6ab25aca80a64e68f28502cb', '2026-09-22T10:39:06.816Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:06.816Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 2, 7, 'Hanambara ny didin’i Jehovah aho. Hoy izy tamiko: “Zanako ianao; Androany aho no lasa rainao.', 'hanambara ny didin’i jehovah aho. hoy izy tamiko: “zanako ianao; androany aho no lasa rainao.'),
  ('6ab25aca80a64e68f28502ca', '2026-09-22T10:39:06.816Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:06.816Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 2, 6, 'Ka hilaza hoe: “Izaho mihitsy no efa nametraka ny mpanjakako Ao Ziona, tendrombohitro masina.”', 'ka hilaza hoe: “izaho mihitsy no efa nametraka ny mpanjakako ao ziona, tendrombohitro masina.”'),
  ('6ab25aca80a64e68f28502c5', '2026-09-22T10:39:06.816Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:06.816Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 2, 1, 'Nahoana no mikorontana ireo firenena, Ary mingonongonona miteny zavatra tsy misy dikany ny vahoaka?', 'nahoana no mikorontana ireo firenena, ary mingonongonona miteny zavatra tsy misy dikany ny vahoaka?'),
  ('6ab25aca80a64e68f28502d0', '2026-09-22T10:39:06.816Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:06.816Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 2, 12, 'Omeo voninahitra ilay zanaka sao ho tezitra Andriamanitra Ka ho ringana ianareo, Fa vetivety dia mirehitra ny fahatezerany. Sambatra izay rehetra mialoka aminy.', 'omeo voninahitra ilay zanaka sao ho tezitra andriamanitra ka ho ringana ianareo, fa vetivety dia mirehitra ny fahatezerany. sambatra izay rehetra mialoka aminy.'),
  ('6ab25acb73f8cdfd7d34e094', '2026-09-22T10:39:07.230Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:07.230Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 3, 6, 'Tsy atahorako ny olona an’alinaliny, Izay milahatra manodidina ahy mba hamely ahy.', 'tsy atahorako ny olona an’alinaliny, izay milahatra manodidina ahy mba hamely ahy.'),
  ('6ab25acb73f8cdfd7d34e092', '2026-09-22T10:39:07.230Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:07.230Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 3, 4, 'Hiantso mafy an’i Jehovah aho, Dia hamaly ahy avy any an-tendrombohiny masina izy. ( Sela )', 'hiantso mafy an’i jehovah aho, dia hamaly ahy avy any an-tendrombohiny masina izy. ( sela )'),
  ('6ab25acb73f8cdfd7d34e096', '2026-09-22T10:39:07.230Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:07.230Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 3, 8, 'Avy amin’i Jehovah ny famonjena. Mitahy ny vahoakanao ianao. ( Sela )', 'avy amin’i jehovah ny famonjena. mitahy ny vahoakanao ianao. ( sela )'),
  ('6ab25acb73f8cdfd7d34e08f', '2026-09-22T10:39:07.230Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:07.230Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 3, 1, 'Jehovah ô, nahoana no lasa be dia be toy izao ny fahavaloko? Nahoana no maro be no mitsangana hanohitra ahy?', 'jehovah ô, nahoana no lasa be dia be toy izao ny fahavaloko? nahoana no maro be no mitsangana hanohitra ahy?'),
  ('6ab25acb73f8cdfd7d34e091', '2026-09-22T10:39:07.230Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:07.230Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 3, 3, 'Ianao anefa no ampinga manodidina ahy, Jehovah ô, Ianao no voninahitro, ary Ianao no mampitraka ny lohako.', 'ianao anefa no ampinga manodidina ahy, jehovah ô, ianao no voninahitro, ary ianao no mampitraka ny lohako.'),
  ('6ab25acb73f8cdfd7d34e090', '2026-09-22T10:39:07.230Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:07.230Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 3, 2, 'Betsaka no milaza momba ahy hoe: “Tsy hovonjen’Andriamanitra izy.” ( Sela )', 'betsaka no milaza momba ahy hoe: “tsy hovonjen’andriamanitra izy.” ( sela )'),
  ('6ab25acb73f8cdfd7d34e095', '2026-09-22T10:39:07.230Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:07.230Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 3, 7, 'Mitsangàna, Jehovah ô! Vonjeo aho, ry Andriamanitro ô! Fa hamely an’ireo fahavaloko rehetra eo amin’ny valanoranony ianao; Hotapatapahinao ny nifin’ny ratsy fanahy.', 'mitsangàna, jehovah ô! vonjeo aho, ry andriamanitro ô! fa hamely an’ireo fahavaloko rehetra eo amin’ny valanoranony ianao; hotapatapahinao ny nifin’ny ratsy fanahy.'),
  ('6ab25acb73f8cdfd7d34e093', '2026-09-22T10:39:07.230Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:07.230Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 3, 5, 'Hitsotsotra aho ka hatory, Ary hifoha sady tsy hanana ahiahy, Satria manohana ahy foana i Jehovah.', 'hitsotsotra aho ka hatory, ary hifoha sady tsy hanana ahiahy, satria manohana ahy foana i jehovah.'),
  ('6ab25acb0be5f7a8e3d60d57', '2026-09-22T10:39:07.738Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:07.738Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 4, 2, 'Ry zanak’olombelona, mandra-pahoviana ianareo no tsy hanome voninahitra ahy fa hanala baraka ahy? Mandra-pahoviana ianareo no ho tia zavatra tsy misy dikany sy hamoron-dainga? ( Sela )', 'ry zanak’olombelona, mandra-pahoviana ianareo no tsy hanome voninahitra ahy fa hanala baraka ahy? mandra-pahoviana ianareo no ho tia zavatra tsy misy dikany sy hamoron-dainga? ( sela )'),
  ('6ab25acb0be5f7a8e3d60d58', '2026-09-22T10:39:07.738Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:07.738Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 4, 3, 'Fantaro fa miavaka ny fomba hitondran’i Jehovah ny olona tsy mivadika aminy; Hihaino i Jehovah rehefa miantso azy aho.', 'fantaro fa miavaka ny fomba hitondran’i jehovah ny olona tsy mivadika aminy; hihaino i jehovah rehefa miantso azy aho.'),
  ('6ab25acb0be5f7a8e3d60d56', '2026-09-22T10:39:07.738Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:07.738Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 4, 1, 'Ry Andriamanitro tia rariny ô, valio aho rehefa miantso anao. Ataovy mahita lalan-kivoahana amin’ny fahoriako aho. Iantrao aho, ka henoy ny vavaka ataoko.', 'ry andriamanitro tia rariny ô, valio aho rehefa miantso anao. ataovy mahita lalan-kivoahana amin’ny fahoriako aho. iantrao aho, ka henoy ny vavaka ataoko.'),
  ('6ab25acb0be5f7a8e3d60d5c', '2026-09-22T10:39:07.739Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:07.739Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 4, 7, 'Ataonao izay hahatonga ny foko ho faly kokoa Noho ny an’ireo nahavokatra varimbazaha be dia be sy divay vaovao betsaka.', 'ataonao izay hahatonga ny foko ho faly kokoa noho ny an’ireo nahavokatra varimbazaha be dia be sy divay vaovao betsaka.'),
  ('6ab25acb0be5f7a8e3d60d5b', '2026-09-22T10:39:07.739Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:07.739Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 4, 6, 'Maro no miteny hoe: “Iza no hanome zavatra tsara ho antsika?” Aoka ny hazavanao hamirapiratra aminay, Jehovah ô!', 'maro no miteny hoe: “iza no hanome zavatra tsara ho antsika?” aoka ny hazavanao hamirapiratra aminay, jehovah ô!'),
  ('6ab25acb0be5f7a8e3d60d5d', '2026-09-22T10:39:07.739Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:07.739Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 4, 8, 'Hitsotsotra sy hatory amim-piadanana aho, Satria ianao irery ihany, Jehovah ô, no mahatonga ahy hiadana sy hilamin-tsaina.', 'hitsotsotra sy hatory amim-piadanana aho, satria ianao irery ihany, jehovah ô, no mahatonga ahy hiadana sy hilamin-tsaina.'),
  ('6ab25acb0be5f7a8e3d60d59', '2026-09-22T10:39:07.739Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:07.739Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 4, 4, 'Tezera fa aza manota. Tazòny ao am-ponareo ihany ny teninareo, eo am-pandriana. Ary aoka ianareo hangina. ( Sela )', 'tezera fa aza manota. tazòny ao am-ponareo ihany ny teninareo, eo am-pandriana. ary aoka ianareo hangina. ( sela )'),
  ('6ab25acb0be5f7a8e3d60d5a', '2026-09-22T10:39:07.739Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:07.739Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 4, 5, 'Manaova sorona araka ny fahamarinana, Ary matokia an’i Jehovah.', 'manaova sorona araka ny fahamarinana, ary matokia an’i jehovah.'),
  ('6ab25ace5b58bf3a985df795', '2026-09-22T10:39:10.381Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:10.381Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 6, 7, 'Reraky ny alahelo ny masoko Sady manjavozavo, noho ny ataon’izay rehetra mampijaly ahy.', 'reraky ny alahelo ny masoko sady manjavozavo, noho ny ataon’izay rehetra mampijaly ahy.');
INSERT INTO "bible_verses" ("id", "created_date", "updated_date", "created_by_id", "created_by", "translation", "book", "bookOrder", "chapter", "verse", "text", "normalizedText") VALUES
  ('6ab25ace5b58bf3a985df797', '2026-09-22T10:39:10.381Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:10.381Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 6, 9, 'Ho ren’i Jehovah ny fitalahoako famindram-po; Hohenoin’i Jehovah ny vavaka ataoko.', 'ho ren’i jehovah ny fitalahoako famindram-po; hohenoin’i jehovah ny vavaka ataoko.'),
  ('6ab25ace5b58bf3a985df798', '2026-09-22T10:39:10.381Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:10.381Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 6, 10, 'Ho menatra be sy ho very hevitra ny fahavaloko rehetra; Handositra izy ireo ka ho afa-baraka tampoka.', 'ho menatra be sy ho very hevitra ny fahavaloko rehetra; handositra izy ireo ka ho afa-baraka tampoka.'),
  ('6ab25ace5b58bf3a985df791', '2026-09-22T10:39:10.381Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:10.381Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 6, 3, 'Mikorontan-tsaina be aho, Ka manontany anao hoe: Jehovah ô, mandra-pahoviana no hitohy izao?', 'mikorontan-tsaina be aho, ka manontany anao hoe: jehovah ô, mandra-pahoviana no hitohy izao?'),
  ('6ab25ace5b58bf3a985df790', '2026-09-22T10:39:10.381Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:10.381Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 6, 2, 'Iantrao aho, Jehovah ô, fa mihareraka. Sitrano aho, Jehovah ô, fa mangozohozo ny taolako.', 'iantrao aho, jehovah ô, fa mihareraka. sitrano aho, jehovah ô, fa mangozohozo ny taolako.'),
  ('6ab25ace5b58bf3a985df78f', '2026-09-22T10:39:10.381Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:10.381Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 6, 1, 'Jehovah ô, aza tezitra rehefa mananatra ahy ianao, Ary aza misafoaka rehefa manitsy ahy.', 'jehovah ô, aza tezitra rehefa mananatra ahy ianao, ary aza misafoaka rehefa manitsy ahy.'),
  ('6ab25ace5b58bf3a985df796', '2026-09-22T10:39:10.381Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:10.381Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 6, 8, 'Mialà eto amiko ianareo rehetra manao ratsy, Fa ho ren’i Jehovah ny fitomaniako.', 'mialà eto amiko ianareo rehetra manao ratsy, fa ho ren’i jehovah ny fitomaniako.'),
  ('6ab25ace5b58bf3a985df792', '2026-09-22T10:39:10.381Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:10.381Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 6, 4, 'Miverena ka afaho aho, Jehovah ô! Vonjeo aho fa be fitiavana sy tsy mivadika ianao.', 'miverena ka afaho aho, jehovah ô! vonjeo aho fa be fitiavana sy tsy mivadika ianao.'),
  ('6ab25ace5b58bf3a985df794', '2026-09-22T10:39:10.381Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:10.381Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 6, 6, 'Sasatry ny misento aho; Vonton’ny ranomasoko ny fandrianako mandritra ny alina; Kotsan’ny ranomasoko ny farafarako.', 'sasatry ny misento aho; vonton’ny ranomasoko ny fandrianako mandritra ny alina; kotsan’ny ranomasoko ny farafarako.'),
  ('6ab25ace5b58bf3a985df793', '2026-09-22T10:39:10.381Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:10.381Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 6, 5, 'Tsy afaka miresaka momba anao mantsy ny maty. Iza ao amin’ny Fasana no hidera anao?', 'tsy afaka miresaka momba anao mantsy ny maty. iza ao amin’ny fasana no hidera anao?'),
  ('6ab25aceaef2f056bc5a2e90', '2026-09-22T10:39:10.817Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:10.817Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 7, 11, 'Mpitsara manao ny rariny Andriamanitra, Ary manambara ny didim-pitsarany isan’andro izy.', 'mpitsara manao ny rariny andriamanitra, ary manambara ny didim-pitsarany isan’andro izy.'),
  ('6ab25aceaef2f056bc5a2e93', '2026-09-22T10:39:10.817Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:10.817Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 7, 14, 'Jereo ilay bevohoka faharatsiana; Fahoriana no miforona ao an-kibony, ka lainga no aterany.', 'jereo ilay bevohoka faharatsiana; fahoriana no miforona ao an-kibony, ka lainga no aterany.'),
  ('6ab25aceaef2f056bc5a2e96', '2026-09-22T10:39:10.817Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:10.817Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 7, 17, 'Hidera an’i Jehovah aho fa manao ny rariny izy; Hihira fiderana aho ho an’ny anaran’i Jehovah, ilay Avo Indrindra.', 'hidera an’i jehovah aho fa manao ny rariny izy; hihira fiderana aho ho an’ny anaran’i jehovah, ilay avo indrindra.'),
  ('6ab25aceaef2f056bc5a2e94', '2026-09-22T10:39:10.817Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:10.817Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 7, 15, 'Mihady lavaka izy ary ataony lalina be ilay izy, Nefa izy ihany no ho latsaka ao.', 'mihady lavaka izy ary ataony lalina be ilay izy, nefa izy ihany no ho latsaka ao.'),
  ('6ab25aceaef2f056bc5a2e88', '2026-09-22T10:39:10.817Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:10.817Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 7, 3, 'Jehovah Andriamanitro ô, raha izaho no diso, Na nanao ny tsy rariny,', 'jehovah andriamanitro ô, raha izaho no diso, na nanao ny tsy rariny,'),
  ('6ab25aceaef2f056bc5a2e86', '2026-09-22T10:39:10.817Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:10.817Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 7, 1, 'Jehovah Andriamanitro ô, ianao no ialofako. Vonjeo aho tsy ho azon’izay rehetra manenjika ahy ka afaho.', 'jehovah andriamanitro ô, ianao no ialofako. vonjeo aho tsy ho azon’izay rehetra manenjika ahy ka afaho.'),
  ('6ab25aceaef2f056bc5a2e8a', '2026-09-22T10:39:10.817Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:10.817Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 7, 5, 'Dia aoka hanenjika ahy ny fahavalo ka hahatratra ahy; Aoka hohitsakitsahiny eo amin’ny tany aho, Ary hohosihoseny eo amin’ny vovoka ny voninahitro. ( Sela )', 'dia aoka hanenjika ahy ny fahavalo ka hahatratra ahy; aoka hohitsakitsahiny eo amin’ny tany aho, ary hohosihoseny eo amin’ny vovoka ny voninahitro. ( sela )'),
