  ('6ab25aceaef2f056bc5a2e91', '2026-09-22T10:39:10.817Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:10.817Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 7, 12, 'Rehefa misy olona tsy mibebaka, dia mandranitra ny sabany izy; Mamoritra sy manomana ny tsipìkany izy.', 'rehefa misy olona tsy mibebaka, dia mandranitra ny sabany izy; mamoritra sy manomana ny tsipìkany izy.'),
  ('6ab25aceaef2f056bc5a2e8b', '2026-09-22T10:39:10.817Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:10.817Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 7, 6, 'Mitsangàna, Jehovah ô, ary asehoy hoe tezitra ianao! Mijoroa hanohitra ny fisafoakan’ny fahavaloko; Mifohaza hamonjy ahy, ary asaivo ampiharina ny rariny.', 'mitsangàna, jehovah ô, ary asehoy hoe tezitra ianao! mijoroa hanohitra ny fisafoakan’ny fahavaloko; mifohaza hamonjy ahy, ary asaivo ampiharina ny rariny.'),
  ('6ab25aceaef2f056bc5a2e8f', '2026-09-22T10:39:10.817Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:10.817Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 7, 10, 'Andriamanitra no ampingako, dia ilay Mpamonjy ny mahitsy fo.', 'andriamanitra no ampingako, dia ilay mpamonjy ny mahitsy fo.'),
