  ('6ab25acf1f41de91124ce987', '2026-09-22T10:39:11.733Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:11.733Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 9, 20, 'Ataovy raiki-tahotra izy ireo, Jehovah ô! Aoka ho fantatr’ireo firenena fa olombelona mety maty ihany izy ireo. ( Sela )', 'ataovy raiki-tahotra izy ireo, jehovah ô! aoka ho fantatr’ireo firenena fa olombelona mety maty ihany izy ireo. ( sela )'),
  ('6ab25ad0e504f1647021a276', '2026-09-22T10:39:12.247Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:12.247Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 10, 10, 'Torotoro sy voahosihosy izay azony; Lasa eo ambany fifehezany ireo marefo.', 'torotoro sy voahosihosy izay azony; lasa eo ambany fifehezany ireo marefo.'),
  ('6ab25ad0e504f1647021a272', '2026-09-22T10:39:12.247Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:12.247Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 10, 6, 'Hoy izy any am-pony any: “Tsy mba hangozohozo aho. Tsy hisy loza hanjo ahy mihitsy, Hatrany amin’ny taranako fara aman-dimby.” פ [ Pe ]', 'hoy izy any am-pony any: “tsy mba hangozohozo aho. tsy hisy loza hanjo ahy mihitsy, hatrany amin’ny taranako fara aman-dimby.” פ [ pe ]'),
  ('6ab25ad0e504f1647021a279', '2026-09-22T10:39:12.247Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:12.247Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 10, 13, 'Nahoana no maniratsira an’Andriamanitra ny ratsy fanahy? Hoy izy any am-pony any: “Tsy hanao ampamoaka ahy ianao.” ר [ Resa ]', 'nahoana no maniratsira an’andriamanitra ny ratsy fanahy? hoy izy any am-pony any: “tsy hanao ampamoaka ahy ianao.” ר [ resa ]'),
  ('6ab25ad0e504f1647021a275', '2026-09-22T10:39:12.247Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:12.247Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 10, 9, 'Mamitsaka ao amin’ny toeram-piafenany izy, toy ny liona ao amin’ny fonenany. Mamitsaka hisambotra an’ilay tsy misy mpiaro izy. Azony ilay tsy misy mpiaro rehefa sintoniny hikombona ny haratony.', 'mamitsaka ao amin’ny toeram-piafenany izy, toy ny liona ao amin’ny fonenany. mamitsaka hisambotra an’ilay tsy misy mpiaro izy. azony ilay tsy misy mpiaro rehefa sintoniny hikombona ny haratony.'),
  ('6ab25ad0e504f1647021a277', '2026-09-22T10:39:12.247Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:12.247Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 10, 11, 'Hoy izy any am-pony any: “Efa nanadino Andriamanitra. Efa nihodina tsy nijery izy. Tsy mahita mihitsy izy.” ק [ Kôfa ]', 'hoy izy any am-pony any: “efa nanadino andriamanitra. efa nihodina tsy nijery izy. tsy mahita mihitsy izy.” ק [ kôfa ]'),
  ('6ab25ad0e504f1647021a26d', '2026-09-22T10:39:12.247Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:12.247Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 10, 1, 'Nahoana ianao no mijoro eny lavitra eny, Jehovah ô? Nahoana no miafina ianao amin’ny fotoam-pahoriana?', 'nahoana ianao no mijoro eny lavitra eny, jehovah ô? nahoana no miafina ianao amin’ny fotoam-pahoriana?'),
  ('6ab25ad0e504f1647021a278', '2026-09-22T10:39:12.247Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:12.247Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 10, 12, 'Mitsangàna, Jehovah ô! Ingao ny tananao, Andriamanitra ô! Aza hadinoina ireo tsy misy mpiaro.', 'mitsangàna, jehovah ô! ingao ny tananao, andriamanitra ô! aza hadinoina ireo tsy misy mpiaro.'),
  ('6ab25ad0e504f1647021a274', '2026-09-22T10:39:12.247Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:12.247Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 10, 8, 'Miafina mba hanafika eny akaikin’ny tanàna kely izy; Avy ao amin’ny toeram-piafenany izy no mamono ny tsy manan-tsiny. ע [ Aina ] Mitilitily an’izay olona azony asiana izy.', 'miafina mba hanafika eny akaikin’ny tanàna kely izy; avy ao amin’ny toeram-piafenany izy no mamono ny tsy manan-tsiny. ע [ aina ] mitilitily an’izay olona azony asiana izy.'),
  ('6ab25ad0e504f1647021a273', '2026-09-22T10:39:12.247Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:12.247Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 10, 7, 'Feno ozona sy lainga ary fandrahonana ao am-bavany; Fampahoriana sy fampijaliana no ao ambany lelany.', 'feno ozona sy lainga ary fandrahonana ao am-bavany; fampahoriana sy fampijaliana no ao ambany lelany.'),
  ('6ab25ad0e504f1647021a271', '2026-09-22T10:39:12.247Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:12.247Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 10, 5, 'Mahomby foana izay ataony, Nefa tsy takatry ny sainy ny didim-pitsaranao. Esoesoiny daholo ny fahavalony.', 'mahomby foana izay ataony, nefa tsy takatry ny sainy ny didim-pitsaranao. esoesoiny daholo ny fahavalony.'),
  ('6ab25ad0e504f1647021a270', '2026-09-22T10:39:12.247Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:12.247Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 10, 4, 'Miavonavona ny ratsy fanahy ka tsy mba manadihady; Izao ihany no ao an-tsainy: “Tsy misy izany Andriamanitra izany.”', 'miavonavona ny ratsy fanahy ka tsy mba manadihady; izao ihany no ao an-tsainy: “tsy misy izany andriamanitra izany.”'),
  ('6ab25ad0e504f1647021a26f', '2026-09-22T10:39:12.247Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:12.247Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 10, 3, 'Fa mirehareha momba ny faniriany feno fitiavan-tena ny ratsy fanahy, Ary mitso-drano an’ilay tsy mety afa-po; נ [ Nona ] Maniratsira an’i Jehovah izy.', 'fa mirehareha momba ny faniriany feno fitiavan-tena ny ratsy fanahy, ary mitso-drano an’ilay tsy mety afa-po; נ [ nona ] maniratsira an’i jehovah izy.'),
  ('6ab25ad0e504f1647021a26e', '2026-09-22T10:39:12.247Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:12.247Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 10, 2, 'Manambony tena ny ratsy fanahy ka enjehiny ny tsy misy mpiaro. Ho voafandriky ny tetika nataony anefa izy.', 'manambony tena ny ratsy fanahy ka enjehiny ny tsy misy mpiaro. ho voafandriky ny tetika nataony anefa izy.'),
  ('6ab25ad0e504f1647021a27e', '2026-09-22T10:39:12.248Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:12.248Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 10, 18, 'Hanome rariny ho an’ny kamboty ray sy izay ampijalina ianao, Mba tsy hampatahotra azy ireo intsony ny olombelona mety maty, dia ny olona etỳ an-tany.', 'hanome rariny ho an’ny kamboty ray sy izay ampijalina ianao, mba tsy hampatahotra azy ireo intsony ny olombelona mety maty, dia ny olona etỳ an-tany.'),
  ('6ab25ad0e504f1647021a27a', '2026-09-22T10:39:12.248Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:12.248Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 10, 14, 'Tena hitanao anefa ny zava-tsarotra sy ny fahoriana. Jerenao izany ka raisinao an-tanana. Ianao no ianteheran’ny marefo; Ianao no mpanampy ny kamboty ray. ש [ Shina ]', 'tena hitanao anefa ny zava-tsarotra sy ny fahoriana. jerenao izany ka raisinao an-tanana. ianao no ianteheran’ny marefo; ianao no mpanampy ny kamboty ray. ש [ shina ]'),
  ('6ab25ad0e504f1647021a27c', '2026-09-22T10:39:12.248Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:12.248Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 10, 16, 'Mpanjaka mandrakizay mandrakizay i Jehovah. Ripaka tsy misy eto an-tany ireo firenena. ת [ Tao ]', 'mpanjaka mandrakizay mandrakizay i jehovah. ripaka tsy misy eto an-tany ireo firenena. ת [ tao ]'),
  ('6ab25ad0e504f1647021a27d', '2026-09-22T10:39:12.248Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:12.248Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 10, 17, 'Fa hohenoinao kosa, Jehovah ô, ny fitalahoan’ny mpandefitra. Hanatanjaka ny fony ianao sady hihaino tsara azy.', 'fa hohenoinao kosa, jehovah ô, ny fitalahoan’ny mpandefitra. hanatanjaka ny fony ianao sady hihaino tsara azy.'),
  ('6ab25ad0e504f1647021a27b', '2026-09-22T10:39:12.248Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:12.248Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 10, 15, 'Tapaho ny sandrin’ny ratsy fanahy sy ny olon-dratsy. Amin’izay rehefa mikaroka ny faharatsiany ianao, Dia tsy hahita an’izany intsony.', 'tapaho ny sandrin’ny ratsy fanahy sy ny olon-dratsy. amin’izay rehefa mikaroka ny faharatsiany ianao, dia tsy hahita an’izany intsony.'),
