  ('6ab25ad125ffafdc14797d7b', '2026-09-22T10:39:13.463Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:13.463Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 13, 2, 'Mandra-pahoviana aho no hitebiteby, Ka halahelo isan’andro ny foko? Mandra-pahoviana ny fahavaloko no handresy ahy?', 'mandra-pahoviana aho no hitebiteby, ka halahelo isan’andro ny foko? mandra-pahoviana ny fahavaloko no handresy ahy?'),
  ('6ab25ad125ffafdc14797d7e', '2026-09-22T10:39:13.463Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:13.463Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 13, 5, 'Fa izaho matoky hoe be fitiavana sy tsy mivadika ianao; Hifaly ny foko noho ny asa famonjena ataonao.', 'fa izaho matoky hoe be fitiavana sy tsy mivadika ianao; hifaly ny foko noho ny asa famonjena ataonao.'),
  ('6ab25ad125ffafdc14797d7f', '2026-09-22T10:39:13.463Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:13.463Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 13, 6, 'Hihira ho an’i Jehovah aho, fa be dia be ny valisoa nomeny ahy.', 'hihira ho an’i jehovah aho, fa be dia be ny valisoa nomeny ahy.'),
  ('6ab25ad125ffafdc14797d7a', '2026-09-22T10:39:13.463Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:13.463Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 13, 1, 'Jehovah ô, mandra-pahoviana ianao no hanadino ahy? Ho mandrakizay ve? Mandra-pahoviana ianao no hihodina tsy hijery ahy?', 'jehovah ô, mandra-pahoviana ianao no hanadino ahy? ho mandrakizay ve? mandra-pahoviana ianao no hihodina tsy hijery ahy?'),
  ('6ab25ad29f36550ec66d5ac7', '2026-09-22T10:39:14.699Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:14.699Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 16, 8, 'Ataoko eo anatrehako foana i Jehovah. Tsy hangozohozo mihitsy aho satria izy eo ankavanako.', 'ataoko eo anatrehako foana i jehovah. tsy hangozohozo mihitsy aho satria izy eo ankavanako.'),
  ('6ab25ad29f36550ec66d5ac3', '2026-09-22T10:39:14.699Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:14.699Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 16, 4, 'Mampitombo ny fahoriany izay maimaika hanompo andriamani-kafa. Tsy handraraka ra atao fanatitra zava-pisotro ho an’ireny mihitsy aho, Ary tsy hanonona ny anarany ny molotro.', 'mampitombo ny fahoriany izay maimaika hanompo andriamani-kafa. tsy handraraka ra atao fanatitra zava-pisotro ho an’ireny mihitsy aho, ary tsy hanonona ny anarany ny molotro.'),
  ('6ab25ad29f36550ec66d5ac0', '2026-09-22T10:39:14.699Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:14.699Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 16, 1, 'Arovy aho, Andriamanitra ô, fa ianao no ialofako.', 'arovy aho, andriamanitra ô, fa ianao no ialofako.'),
  ('6ab25ad29f36550ec66d5ac6', '2026-09-22T10:39:14.699Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:14.699Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 16, 7, 'Hoderaiko i Jehovah, izay manome torohevitra ahy. Na dia mandritra ny alina aza, dia manitsy ahy ny eritreritro lalina indrindra.', 'hoderaiko i jehovah, izay manome torohevitra ahy. na dia mandritra ny alina aza, dia manitsy ahy ny eritreritro lalina indrindra.'),
  ('6ab25ad29f36550ec66d5ac8', '2026-09-22T10:39:14.699Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:14.699Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 16, 9, 'Koa faly ny foko; ravoravo ny tenako manontolo. Ary tsy manana ahiahy aho.', 'koa faly ny foko; ravoravo ny tenako manontolo. ary tsy manana ahiahy aho.'),
  ('6ab25ad29f36550ec66d5ac2', '2026-09-22T10:39:14.699Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:14.699Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 16, 3, 'Ary ny olona masina etỳ an-tany, Izany hoe ireo mendrika ny homena voninahitra, no tena mahafinaritra ahy.”', 'ary ny olona masina etỳ an-tany, izany hoe ireo mendrika ny homena voninahitra, no tena mahafinaritra ahy.”'),
  ('6ab25ad29f36550ec66d5ac9', '2026-09-22T10:39:14.699Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:14.699Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 16, 10, 'Fa tsy ho foinao hijanona ao amin’ny Fasana aho. Tsy havelanao hahita ny lavaka ilay mpanomponao tsy mivadika.', 'fa tsy ho foinao hijanona ao amin’ny fasana aho. tsy havelanao hahita ny lavaka ilay mpanomponao tsy mivadika.'),
  ('6ab25ad29f36550ec66d5aca', '2026-09-22T10:39:14.699Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:14.699Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 16, 11, 'Ampahafantarinao ahy ny lalan’ny fiainana. Mahafaly be ny eo anatrehanao; Mahasambatra mandrakizay ny eo ankavananao.', 'ampahafantarinao ahy ny lalan’ny fiainana. mahafaly be ny eo anatrehanao; mahasambatra mandrakizay ny eo ankavananao.'),
  ('6ab25ad29f36550ec66d5ac1', '2026-09-22T10:39:14.699Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:14.699Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 16, 2, 'Hoy aho tamin’i Jehovah: “Ianao no Jehovah. Avy aminao ny zavatra tsara rehetra ananako.', 'hoy aho tamin’i jehovah: “ianao no jehovah. avy aminao ny zavatra tsara rehetra ananako.'),
  ('6ab25ad29f36550ec66d5ac4', '2026-09-22T10:39:14.699Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:14.699Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 16, 5, 'I Jehovah no anjara nomena ahy sy kaopy ahazoako fitahiana. Narovanao ny lovako.', 'i jehovah no anjara nomena ahy sy kaopy ahazoako fitahiana. narovanao ny lovako.'),
  ('6ab25ad29f36550ec66d5ac5', '2026-09-22T10:39:14.699Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:14.699Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 16, 6, 'Toerana mahafinaritra no voafaritra ho ahy. Afa-po amin’ny lovako aho.', 'toerana mahafinaritra no voafaritra ho ahy. afa-po amin’ny lovako aho.'),
  ('6ab25ad306847f1768c12f83', '2026-09-22T10:39:15.282Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:15.282Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 17, 5, 'Avelao hanaraka foana ny lalanao ny diako, Amin’izay dia tsy ho tafintohina ny tongotro.', 'avelao hanaraka foana ny lalanao ny diako, amin’izay dia tsy ho tafintohina ny tongotro.'),
  ('6ab25ad306847f1768c12f81', '2026-09-22T10:39:15.282Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:15.282Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 17, 3, 'Ianao efa nandinika ny foko sy nanara-maso ahy nandritra ny alina; Nanadio ahy ianao; Ho hitanao fa tsy nitetika ny hanao ratsy aho, Ary tsy nandika lalàna aho tamin’izay nolazaiko.', 'ianao efa nandinika ny foko sy nanara-maso ahy nandritra ny alina; nanadio ahy ianao; ho hitanao fa tsy nitetika ny hanao ratsy aho, ary tsy nandika lalàna aho tamin’izay nolazaiko.'),
  ('6ab25ad306847f1768c12f7f', '2026-09-22T10:39:15.282Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:15.282Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 17, 1, 'Mba henoy aho fa mangataka ny rariny, Jehovah ô! Mba henoy aho fa miantso vonjy; Henoy ny vavaka ataoko amim-pahatsorana.', 'mba henoy aho fa mangataka ny rariny, jehovah ô! mba henoy aho fa miantso vonjy; henoy ny vavaka ataoko amim-pahatsorana.'),
  ('6ab25ad306847f1768c12f80', '2026-09-22T10:39:15.282Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:15.282Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 17, 2, 'Enga anie ianao hanome rariny ahy, Ary ho hitan’ny masonao anie fa manao izay mahitsy aho!', 'enga anie ianao hanome rariny ahy, ary ho hitan’ny masonao anie fa manao izay mahitsy aho!'),
  ('6ab25ad306847f1768c12f86', '2026-09-22T10:39:15.282Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:15.282Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 17, 8, 'Arovy toy ny anakandriamasonao aho. Afeno eo ambany aloky ny elatrao aho.', 'arovy toy ny anakandriamasonao aho. afeno eo ambany aloky ny elatrao aho.'),
  ('6ab25ad306847f1768c12f85', '2026-09-22T10:39:15.282Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:15.282Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 17, 7, 'Asehoy amin’ny fomba miavaka hoe be fitiavana sy tsy mivadika ianao, Ry Mpamonjy an’izay mialoka eo amin’ny tananao ankavanana Mba tsy ho azon’izay mikomy aminao.', 'asehoy amin’ny fomba miavaka hoe be fitiavana sy tsy mivadika ianao, ry mpamonjy an’izay mialoka eo amin’ny tananao ankavanana mba tsy ho azon’izay mikomy aminao.'),
  ('6ab25ad306847f1768c12f8c', '2026-09-22T10:39:15.282Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:15.282Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 17, 14, 'Vonjeo amin’ny tananao aho, Jehovah ô, Mba tsy ho azon’ny olon’izao tontolo izao, izay tsy manana anjara afa-tsy amin’izao fiainana izao, Dia ireo mahazo zava-tsoa maro avy aminao Ary mamela lova ho an’ireo zanany be dia be.', 'vonjeo amin’ny tananao aho, jehovah ô, mba tsy ho azon’ny olon’izao tontolo izao, izay tsy manana anjara afa-tsy amin’izao fiainana izao, dia ireo mahazo zava-tsoa maro avy aminao ary mamela lova ho an’ireo zanany be dia be.'),
  ('6ab25ad306847f1768c12f87', '2026-09-22T10:39:15.282Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:15.282Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 17, 9, 'Arovy aho mba tsy ho azon’izay ratsy fanahy mamely ahy, Dia ireo fahavaloko mety maty izay manodidina ahy.', 'arovy aho mba tsy ho azon’izay ratsy fanahy mamely ahy, dia ireo fahavaloko mety maty izay manodidina ahy.'),
  ('6ab25ad306847f1768c12f89', '2026-09-22T10:39:15.282Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:15.282Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 17, 11, 'Manodidina anay izy ireo izao, Miandry kendry tohina handavoana anay.', 'manodidina anay izy ireo izao, miandry kendry tohina handavoana anay.'),
  ('6ab25ad306847f1768c12f88', '2026-09-22T10:39:15.282Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:15.282Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 17, 10, 'Lasa tsy mihontsina intsony izy ireo; Teny feno fireharehana no avoakan’ny vavany.', 'lasa tsy mihontsina intsony izy ireo; teny feno fireharehana no avoakan’ny vavany.'),
  ('6ab25ad306847f1768c12f84', '2026-09-22T10:39:15.282Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:15.282Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 17, 6, 'Miantso anao aho satria hamaly ahy ianao, Andriamanitra ô! Aoka ianao hanongilan-tsofina hihaino ny teniko.', 'miantso anao aho satria hamaly ahy ianao, andriamanitra ô! aoka ianao hanongilan-tsofina hihaino ny teniko.'),
  ('6ab25ad306847f1768c12f82', '2026-09-22T10:39:15.282Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:15.282Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 17, 4, 'Na inona na inona ataon’ny olona, Dia ny teninao no arahiko, ka tsy manahaka ny fanaon’ny jiolahy aho.', 'na inona na inona ataon’ny olona, dia ny teninao no arahiko, ka tsy manahaka ny fanaon’ny jiolahy aho.'),
  ('6ab25ad306847f1768c12f8a', '2026-09-22T10:39:15.282Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:15.282Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 17, 12, 'Toy ny liona efa te hamiravira mafy ny rembiny izy, Toy ny liona tanora mamitsaka mba hamely.', 'toy ny liona efa te hamiravira mafy ny rembiny izy, toy ny liona tanora mamitsaka mba hamely.'),
  ('6ab25ad306847f1768c12f8d', '2026-09-22T10:39:15.282Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:15.282Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 17, 15, 'Fa izaho kosa manao ny marina, ka hahita ny tarehinao; Afa-po aho rehefa mifoha eo anatrehanao.', 'fa izaho kosa manao ny marina, ka hahita ny tarehinao; afa-po aho rehefa mifoha eo anatrehanao.'),
  ('6ab25ad306847f1768c12f8b', '2026-09-22T10:39:15.282Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:15.282Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 17, 13, 'Mitsangàna, Jehovah ô, mba hifanandrina aminy sy handresy azy; Vonjeo amin’ny sabatrao aho mba tsy ho azon’ny ratsy fanahy;', 'mitsangàna, jehovah ô, mba hifanandrina aminy sy handresy azy; vonjeo amin’ny sabatrao aho mba tsy ho azon’ny ratsy fanahy;'),
  ('6ab25ad3caf3134781bdab17', '2026-09-22T10:39:15.744Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:15.744Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 18, 43, 'Hamonjy ahy amin’ny fanakianana ataon’ny vahoaka ianao, Ary hanendry ahy ho filohan’ireo firenena. Vahoaka mbola tsy fantatro no hanompo ahy.', 'hamonjy ahy amin’ny fanakianana ataon’ny vahoaka ianao, ary hanendry ahy ho filohan’ireo firenena. vahoaka mbola tsy fantatro no hanompo ahy.'),
  ('6ab25ad3caf3134781bdab10', '2026-09-22T10:39:15.744Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:15.744Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 18, 36, 'Ataonao malalaka tsara ny lalana hodiaviko; Tsy hibolisatra ny tongotro.', 'ataonao malalaka tsara ny lalana hodiaviko; tsy hibolisatra ny tongotro.'),
  ('6ab25ad3caf3134781bdab06', '2026-09-22T10:39:15.744Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:15.744Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 18, 26, 'Ny olona madio no isehoanao hoe madio, Fa ny olona fetsifetsy kosa no isehoanao hoe kinga saina.', 'ny olona madio no isehoanao hoe madio, fa ny olona fetsifetsy kosa no isehoanao hoe kinga saina.'),
  ('6ab25ad3caf3134781bdab00', '2026-09-22T10:39:15.744Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:15.744Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 18, 20, 'Mamaly soa ahy i Jehovah satria manao ny marina aho; Mamaly soa ahy izy satria tsy manan-tsiny aho.', 'mamaly soa ahy i jehovah satria manao ny marina aho; mamaly soa ahy izy satria tsy manan-tsiny aho.'),
  ('6ab25ad3caf3134781bdaaf5', '2026-09-22T10:39:15.744Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:15.744Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 18, 9, 'Natongilany ny lanitra rehefa nidina izy, Ary haizim-pito no teo ambany tongony.', 'natongilany ny lanitra rehefa nidina izy, ary haizim-pito no teo ambany tongony.'),
  ('6ab25ad3caf3134781bdaaf3', '2026-09-22T10:39:15.744Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:15.744Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 18, 7, 'Dia nihozongozona sy nihetsiketsika ny tany; Nihovotrovotra ny fototry ny tendrombohitra Sady nihozongozona satria nisy nampahatezitra azy.', 'dia nihozongozona sy nihetsiketsika ny tany; nihovotrovotra ny fototry ny tendrombohitra sady nihozongozona satria nisy nampahatezitra azy.'),
  ('6ab25ad3caf3134781bdaaed', '2026-09-22T10:39:15.744Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:15.744Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 18, 1, 'Miraiki-po aminao aho, Jehovah ô! Ianao no heriko.', 'miraiki-po aminao aho, jehovah ô! ianao no heriko.'),
  ('6ab25ad3caf3134781bdab08', '2026-09-22T10:39:15.744Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:15.744Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 18, 28, 'Fa ianao no mampirehitra ny jiroko, Jehovah ô, Ilay Andriamanitro manazava ny haizina misy ahy!', 'fa ianao no mampirehitra ny jiroko, jehovah ô, ilay andriamanitro manazava ny haizina misy ahy!'),
  ('6ab25ad3caf3134781bdaafa', '2026-09-22T10:39:15.744Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:15.744Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 18, 14, 'Nandefa ny zana-tsipìkany izy ka niparitaka ny fahavalony; Nandefa tselatra izy ka nataony nisahotaka ireny.', 'nandefa ny zana-tsipìkany izy ka niparitaka ny fahavalony; nandefa tselatra izy ka nataony nisahotaka ireny.'),
  ('6ab25ad3caf3134781bdaaf4', '2026-09-22T10:39:15.744Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:15.744Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 18, 8, 'Nisy setroka niakatra avy teo am-bavorony, Ary nisy afo nandevona avy tamin’ny vavany; Nisy vainafo niredareda avy taminy.', 'nisy setroka niakatra avy teo am-bavorony, ary nisy afo nandevona avy tamin’ny vavany; nisy vainafo niredareda avy taminy.'),
  ('6ab25ad3caf3134781bdaaf0', '2026-09-22T10:39:15.744Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:15.744Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 18, 4, 'Namatotra ahy toy ny tady ny fahafatesana; Nampihorohoro ahy ireo olona tsy misy ilana azy, izay toy ny ranotrambo nanafotra ahy.', 'namatotra ahy toy ny tady ny fahafatesana; nampihorohoro ahy ireo olona tsy misy ilana azy, izay toy ny ranotrambo nanafotra ahy.'),
  ('6ab25ad3caf3134781bdaaee', '2026-09-22T10:39:15.744Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:15.744Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 18, 2, 'I Jehovah no harambatoko sy manda fiarovana ho ahy ary Mpamonjy ahy. Ilay Andriamanitro no vatolampiko. Ao aminy aho no mialoka, Izy no ampingako sy tandroka famonjena ahy, fialofana azoko antoka.', 'i jehovah no harambatoko sy manda fiarovana ho ahy ary mpamonjy ahy. ilay andriamanitro no vatolampiko. ao aminy aho no mialoka, izy no ampingako sy tandroka famonjena ahy, fialofana azoko antoka.'),
  ('6ab25ad3caf3134781bdab1b', '2026-09-22T10:39:15.744Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:15.744Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 18, 47, 'Mamaly ny ratsy atao amiko ilay tena Andriamanitra; Ataony lasa manaiky ahy ireo firenena.', 'mamaly ny ratsy atao amiko ilay tena andriamanitra; ataony lasa manaiky ahy ireo firenena.'),
  ('6ab25ad3caf3134781bdab11', '2026-09-22T10:39:15.744Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:15.744Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 18, 37, 'Henjehiko ny fahavaloko ka ho tratrako; Tsy hiverina aho raha tsy efa ringana tanteraka izy ireny.', 'henjehiko ny fahavaloko ka ho tratrako; tsy hiverina aho raha tsy efa ringana tanteraka izy ireny.'),
  ('6ab25ad3caf3134781bdab01', '2026-09-22T10:39:15.744Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:15.744Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 18, 21, 'Fa narahiko foana ny lalan’i Jehovah, Ary tsy nanao ratsy aho ka hoe niala tamin’ny Andriamanitro.', 'fa narahiko foana ny lalan’i jehovah, ary tsy nanao ratsy aho ka hoe niala tamin’ny andriamanitro.'),
  ('6ab25ad3caf3134781bdaaf9', '2026-09-22T10:39:15.744Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:15.744Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 18, 13, 'Dia nandefa kotroka tany an-danitra i Jehovah; Nataon’ilay Avo Indrindra izay handrenesana ny feony Niaraka tamin’ny havandra sy vainafo miredareda.', 'dia nandefa kotroka tany an-danitra i jehovah; nataon’ilay avo indrindra izay handrenesana ny feony niaraka tamin’ny havandra sy vainafo miredareda.'),
  ('6ab25ad3caf3134781bdab04', '2026-09-22T10:39:15.744Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:15.744Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 18, 24, 'Enga anie i Jehovah hamaly soa ahy satria manao ny marina aho, Sady tsy manan-tsiny eo anatrehany!', 'enga anie i jehovah hamaly soa ahy satria manao ny marina aho, sady tsy manan-tsiny eo anatrehany!'),
  ('6ab25ad3caf3134781bdab03', '2026-09-22T10:39:15.744Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:15.744Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 18, 23, 'Tsy hisy tsiny eo anatrehany aho, Sady hitandrina mba tsy hanao fahadisoana.', 'tsy hisy tsiny eo anatrehany aho, sady hitandrina mba tsy hanao fahadisoana.'),
  ('6ab25ad3caf3134781bdaaf1', '2026-09-22T10:39:15.744Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:15.744Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 18, 5, 'Nangeja ahy toy ny tady ny Fasana; Ary nivelatra teo anoloako ny fandriky ny fahafatesana.', 'nangeja ahy toy ny tady ny fasana; ary nivelatra teo anoloako ny fandriky ny fahafatesana.'),
  ('6ab25ad3caf3134781bdab16', '2026-09-22T10:39:15.744Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:15.744Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 18, 42, 'Hataoko torotoro toy ny vovoka entin’ny rivotra izy ireny, Ary hariako hoatran’ny fotaka eny an-dalana.', 'hataoko torotoro toy ny vovoka entin’ny rivotra izy ireny, ary hariako hoatran’ny fotaka eny an-dalana.'),
  ('6ab25ad3caf3134781bdab0c', '2026-09-22T10:39:15.744Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:15.744Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 18, 32, 'Ilay tena Andriamanitra no mampitafy hery ahy, Ary hataony izay hahalavorary ny lalako.', 'ilay tena andriamanitra no mampitafy hery ahy, ary hataony izay hahalavorary ny lalako.'),
  ('6ab25ad3caf3134781bdaafb', '2026-09-22T10:39:15.744Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:15.744Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 18, 15, 'Lasa hita ny fanambanin’ny renirano; Niharihary ny fototry ny tany satria niteny mafy azy ianao, Jehovah ô, Sady nitsoka azy tamin’ny fofonain’ny vavoronao.', 'lasa hita ny fanambanin’ny renirano; niharihary ny fototry ny tany satria niteny mafy azy ianao, jehovah ô, sady nitsoka azy tamin’ny fofonain’ny vavoronao.'),
  ('6ab25ad3caf3134781bdab1c', '2026-09-22T10:39:15.744Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:15.744Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 18, 48, 'Mamonjy ahy amin’ny fahavaloko tezitra be izy; Manainga ahy ho lasa ambonin’ireo manafika ahy ianao, Ary mamonjy ahy amin’ny olona mahery setra.', 'mamonjy ahy amin’ny fahavaloko tezitra be izy; manainga ahy ho lasa ambonin’ireo manafika ahy ianao, ary mamonjy ahy amin’ny olona mahery setra.'),
  ('6ab25ad3caf3134781bdab13', '2026-09-22T10:39:15.744Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:15.744Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 18, 39, 'Homenao hery hoenti-miady aho; Hataonao lavo eo ambaniko ny fahavaloko.', 'homenao hery hoenti-miady aho; hataonao lavo eo ambaniko ny fahavaloko.'),
  ('6ab25ad3caf3134781bdab0f', '2026-09-22T10:39:15.744Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:15.744Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 18, 35, 'Omenao ahy ny ampinga famonjenao, Manohana ahy ny tananao ankavanana, Ary lasa misandratra aho noho ianao manetry tena.', 'omenao ahy ny ampinga famonjenao, manohana ahy ny tananao ankavanana, ary lasa misandratra aho noho ianao manetry tena.'),
  ('6ab25ad3caf3134781bdab07', '2026-09-22T10:39:15.744Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:15.744Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 18, 27, 'Mamonjy an’ireo olona ambany ianao, Fa aetrinao kosa ny mpirehareha.', 'mamonjy an’ireo olona ambany ianao, fa aetrinao kosa ny mpirehareha.'),
  ('6ab25ad3caf3134781bdaaf7', '2026-09-22T10:39:15.744Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:15.744Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 18, 11, 'Dia nataony nanarona azy ny haizina. Nataony nanodidina azy toy ny tranolay Ny rahona mainty sy matevina.', 'dia nataony nanarona azy ny haizina. nataony nanodidina azy toy ny tranolay ny rahona mainty sy matevina.'),
  ('6ab25ad3caf3134781bdaaff', '2026-09-22T10:39:15.744Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:15.744Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 18, 19, 'Nitondra ahy nankeo amin’ny toerana tsy mampidi-doza izy; Namonjy ahy izy satria nankasitraka ahy.', 'nitondra ahy nankeo amin’ny toerana tsy mampidi-doza izy; namonjy ahy izy satria nankasitraka ahy.'),
  ('6ab25ad3caf3134781bdab18', '2026-09-22T10:39:15.744Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:15.744Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 18, 44, 'Hankatò ahy izy ireo raha vao mandre ny momba ahy fotsiny; Hanatona ahy ny olona avy amin’ny firenen-kafa sady hatahotra.', 'hankatò ahy izy ireo raha vao mandre ny momba ahy fotsiny; hanatona ahy ny olona avy amin’ny firenen-kafa sady hatahotra.'),
  ('6ab25ad3caf3134781bdab19', '2026-09-22T10:39:15.744Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:15.744Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 18, 45, 'Tsy hanana herim-po intsony ny olona avy amin’ny firenen-kafa; Hangovitra izy ireo mivoaka avy ao amin’ny toerany voaro mafy.', 'tsy hanana herim-po intsony ny olona avy amin’ny firenen-kafa; hangovitra izy ireo mivoaka avy ao amin’ny toerany voaro mafy.'),
  ('6ab25ad3caf3134781bdab12', '2026-09-22T10:39:15.744Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:15.744Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 18, 38, 'Hotorotoroiko izy ireny, ka tsy ho tafatsangana intsony; Ho lavo eo ambany tongotro izy ireny.', 'hotorotoroiko izy ireny, ka tsy ho tafatsangana intsony; ho lavo eo ambany tongotro izy ireny.'),
  ('6ab25ad3caf3134781bdab0e', '2026-09-22T10:39:15.744Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:15.744Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 18, 34, 'Mampiofana ahy hiady izy; Mahavita mamoritra tsipìka varahina ny sandriko.', 'mampiofana ahy hiady izy; mahavita mamoritra tsipìka varahina ny sandriko.'),
  ('6ab25ad3caf3134781bdaafd', '2026-09-22T10:39:15.744Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:15.744Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 18, 17, 'Namonjy ahy tamin’ny fahavalo mahery izy, Dia tamin’ireo nankahala ahy, izay nahery kokoa noho izaho.', 'namonjy ahy tamin’ny fahavalo mahery izy, dia tamin’ireo nankahala ahy, izay nahery kokoa noho izaho.'),
  ('6ab25ad3caf3134781bdaafc', '2026-09-22T10:39:15.744Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:15.744Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 18, 16, 'Avy any amin’ny avo izy no nanatsotra ny tanany; Nitazona ahy izy ary nisintona ahy avy tao anaty rano lalina.', 'avy any amin’ny avo izy no nanatsotra ny tanany; nitazona ahy izy ary nisintona ahy avy tao anaty rano lalina.'),
  ('6ab25ad3caf3134781bdaaef', '2026-09-22T10:39:15.744Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:15.744Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 18, 3, 'I Jehovah, ilay mendrika hoderaina, no antsoiko, Ka ho voavonjy amin’ny fahavaloko aho.', 'i jehovah, ilay mendrika hoderaina, no antsoiko, ka ho voavonjy amin’ny fahavaloko aho.'),
  ('6ab25ad3caf3134781bdab1e', '2026-09-22T10:39:15.744Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:15.744Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 18, 50, 'Manao asa famonjena lehibe ho an’ny mpanjaka voatendriny izy; Tiany ny voahosotra notendreny sady tsy mivadika aminy izy, Dia amin’i Davida sy ny taranany mandrakizay.', 'manao asa famonjena lehibe ho an’ny mpanjaka voatendriny izy; tiany ny voahosotra notendreny sady tsy mivadika aminy izy, dia amin’i davida sy ny taranany mandrakizay.'),
  ('6ab25ad3caf3134781bdab1a', '2026-09-22T10:39:15.744Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:15.744Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 18, 46, 'Velona i Jehovah! Hoderaina anie ilay Vatolampiko! Hasandratra anie ilay Andriamanitra mpamonjy ahy!', 'velona i jehovah! hoderaina anie ilay vatolampiko! hasandratra anie ilay andriamanitra mpamonjy ahy!'),
  ('6ab25ad3caf3134781bdab14', '2026-09-22T10:39:15.744Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:15.744Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 18, 40, 'Hataonao mandositra eo anatrehako ny fahavaloko, Ary haringako izay mankahala ahy.', 'hataonao mandositra eo anatrehako ny fahavaloko, ary haringako izay mankahala ahy.'),
  ('6ab25ad3caf3134781bdab09', '2026-09-22T10:39:15.744Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:15.744Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 18, 29, 'Manampy ahy ianao, dia vitako ny miady amin’ny mpandroba; Noho ny herin’Andriamanitra, dia vitako ny mianika manda.', 'manampy ahy ianao, dia vitako ny miady amin’ny mpandroba; noho ny herin’andriamanitra, dia vitako ny mianika manda.'),
  ('6ab25ad3caf3134781bdaaf2', '2026-09-22T10:39:15.744Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:15.744Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 18, 6, 'Tao anatin’ny sarotra aho no niantso an’i Jehovah; Tamin’ilay Andriamanitro foana aho no niantso vonjy. Henony tao amin’ny tempoliny ny feoko, Ary ren’ny sofiny ny antso vonjy nataoko.', 'tao anatin’ny sarotra aho no niantso an’i jehovah; tamin’ilay andriamanitro foana aho no niantso vonjy. henony tao amin’ny tempoliny ny feoko, ary ren’ny sofiny ny antso vonjy nataoko.'),
  ('6ab25ad3caf3134781bdab1d', '2026-09-22T10:39:15.744Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:15.744Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 18, 49, 'Izany no mahatonga ahy hanome voninahitra anao eo amin’ireo firenena, Jehovah ô, Sy hanao hira fiderana ho an’ny anaranao.', 'izany no mahatonga ahy hanome voninahitra anao eo amin’ireo firenena, jehovah ô, sy hanao hira fiderana ho an’ny anaranao.'),
  ('6ab25ad3caf3134781bdab02', '2026-09-22T10:39:15.744Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:15.744Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 18, 22, 'Eo anatrehako ny didim-pitsarany rehetra; Tsy mba hanao tsinontsinona ny fitsipiny aho.', 'eo anatrehako ny didim-pitsarany rehetra; tsy mba hanao tsinontsinona ny fitsipiny aho.'),
  ('6ab25ad3caf3134781bdaaf8', '2026-09-22T10:39:15.744Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:15.744Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 18, 12, 'Nisy hazavana namirapiratra teo anatrehany Ka nampirotsaka havandra sy vainafo miredareda avy teny amin’ny rahona.', 'nisy hazavana namirapiratra teo anatrehany ka nampirotsaka havandra sy vainafo miredareda avy teny amin’ny rahona.'),
  ('6ab25ad3caf3134781bdab0d', '2026-09-22T10:39:15.744Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:15.744Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 18, 33, 'Ataony toy ny an’ny serfa ny tongotro; Ampijoroany eo amin’ny toerana avo aho.', 'ataony toy ny an’ny serfa ny tongotro; ampijoroany eo amin’ny toerana avo aho.'),
  ('6ab25ad3caf3134781bdab0a', '2026-09-22T10:39:15.744Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:15.744Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 18, 30, 'Tonga lafatra ny lalan’ilay tena Andriamanitra; Madio ny tenin’i Jehovah. Ampingan’izay rehetra mialoka aminy izy.', 'tonga lafatra ny lalan’ilay tena andriamanitra; madio ny tenin’i jehovah. ampingan’izay rehetra mialoka aminy izy.'),
  ('6ab25ad3caf3134781bdab05', '2026-09-22T10:39:15.744Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:15.744Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 18, 25, 'Ny olona tsy mivadika no tsy ivadihanao, Ary tsy misy tsiny ianao rehefa mifandray amin’ny olona tsy misy tsiny;', 'ny olona tsy mivadika no tsy ivadihanao, ary tsy misy tsiny ianao rehefa mifandray amin’ny olona tsy misy tsiny;'),
  ('6ab25ad3caf3134781bdaaf6', '2026-09-22T10:39:15.744Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:15.744Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 18, 10, 'Nitaingina kerobima izy dia nanidina. Teny ambony elatry ny anjely izy no nisidina haingana nanketỳ ambany.', 'nitaingina kerobima izy dia nanidina. teny ambony elatry ny anjely izy no nisidina haingana nanketỳ ambany.'),
  ('6ab25ad3caf3134781bdab15', '2026-09-22T10:39:15.744Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:15.744Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 18, 41, 'Miantso vonjy izy ireny, nefa tsy misy mamonjy; Miantso an’i Jehovah mihitsy aza izy ireny, nefa tsy valiany.', 'miantso vonjy izy ireny, nefa tsy misy mamonjy; miantso an’i jehovah mihitsy aza izy ireny, nefa tsy valiany.'),
  ('6ab25ad3caf3134781bdab0b', '2026-09-22T10:39:15.744Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:15.744Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 18, 31, 'Fa iza no Andriamanitra ankoatra an’i Jehovah? Ary iza no vatolampy ankoatra an’ilay Andriamanitsika?', 'fa iza no andriamanitra ankoatra an’i jehovah? ary iza no vatolampy ankoatra an’ilay andriamanitsika?'),
  ('6ab25ad3caf3134781bdaafe', '2026-09-22T10:39:15.744Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:15.744Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 18, 18, 'Nanohitra ahy izy ireny tamin’ny andro nahitako loza, Nefa nanampy ahy i Jehovah.', 'nanohitra ahy izy ireny tamin’ny andro nahitako loza, nefa nanampy ahy i jehovah.'),
  ('6ab25ad4fc0a3c48716e0719', '2026-09-22T10:39:16.208Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:16.208Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 19, 9, 'Madio ny fahatahorana an’i Jehovah, maharitra mandrakizay. Marina ny didim-pitsaran’i Jehovah, ara-drariny daholo.', 'madio ny fahatahorana an’i jehovah, maharitra mandrakizay. marina ny didim-pitsaran’i jehovah, ara-drariny daholo.'),
  ('6ab25ad4fc0a3c48716e0717', '2026-09-22T10:39:16.208Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:16.208Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 19, 7, 'Tonga lafatra ny lalàn’i Jehovah, manome hery indray. Azo atokisana ny fampahatsiahivan’i Jehovah, mampahahendry an’izay tsy dia nahita fiainana.', 'tonga lafatra ny lalàn’i jehovah, manome hery indray. azo atokisana ny fampahatsiahivan’i jehovah, mampahahendry an’izay tsy dia nahita fiainana.'),
  ('6ab25ad4fc0a3c48716e0711', '2026-09-22T10:39:16.208Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:16.208Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 19, 1, 'Ny lanitra manambara ny voninahitr’Andriamanitra; Ny habakabaka milaza ny asan’ny tanany.', 'ny lanitra manambara ny voninahitr’andriamanitra; ny habakabaka milaza ny asan’ny tanany.'),
  ('6ab25ad4fc0a3c48716e071e', '2026-09-22T10:39:16.208Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:16.208Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 19, 14, 'Enga anie ny teny aloaky ny vavako sy izay saintsainiko ato am-poko Ka hahafaly anao, Jehovah ô, ry Vatolampiko sy Mpanavotra ahy!', 'enga anie ny teny aloaky ny vavako sy izay saintsainiko ato am-poko ka hahafaly anao, jehovah ô, ry vatolampiko sy mpanavotra ahy!'),
  ('6ab25ad4fc0a3c48716e0714', '2026-09-22T10:39:16.208Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:16.208Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 19, 4, 'Efa nivoaka eran-tany anefa ny tenin’izy ireo, Ary tonga hatrany amin’ny faran’ny tany misy mponina ny hafatra nentiny. Nanangana tranolay ho an’ny masoandro, eny amin’ny lanitra, Andriamanitra;', 'efa nivoaka eran-tany anefa ny tenin’izy ireo, ary tonga hatrany amin’ny faran’ny tany misy mponina ny hafatra nentiny. nanangana tranolay ho an’ny masoandro, eny amin’ny lanitra, andriamanitra;'),
  ('6ab25ad4fc0a3c48716e0715', '2026-09-22T10:39:16.208Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:16.208Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 19, 5, 'Toy ny mpampaka-bady mivoaka avy ao amin’ny efitranon’ny mpampakatra ny masoandro, Ary mifaly toy ny lehilahy matanjaka mihazakazaka eny amin’ny lalany.', 'toy ny mpampaka-bady mivoaka avy ao amin’ny efitranon’ny mpampakatra ny masoandro, ary mifaly toy ny lehilahy matanjaka mihazakazaka eny amin’ny lalany.'),
  ('6ab25ad4fc0a3c48716e0713', '2026-09-22T10:39:16.208Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:16.208Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 19, 3, 'Tsy miteny tsy mivolana izy ireo; Tsy re ny feony.', 'tsy miteny tsy mivolana izy ireo; tsy re ny feony.'),
  ('6ab25ad4fc0a3c48716e0712', '2026-09-22T10:39:16.208Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:16.208Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 19, 2, 'Miboiboika teny fiderana izy ireo isan’andro, Ary mampita fahalalana isak’alina.', 'miboiboika teny fiderana izy ireo isan’andro, ary mampita fahalalana isak’alina.'),
  ('6ab25ad4fc0a3c48716e071b', '2026-09-22T10:39:16.208Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:16.208Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 19, 11, 'Fampitandremana ho an’ny mpanomponao ireny, Ary lehibe ny valisoa azon’izay manaraka an’ireny.', 'fampitandremana ho an’ny mpanomponao ireny, ary lehibe ny valisoa azon’izay manaraka an’ireny.'),
  ('6ab25ad4fc0a3c48716e071a', '2026-09-22T10:39:16.208Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:16.208Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 19, 10, 'Irina noho ny volamena ireny, Irina noho ny volamena tena tsara be dia be, Ary mamy noho ny tantely, dia ny tantely mitete avy amin’ny toho-tantely.', 'irina noho ny volamena ireny, irina noho ny volamena tena tsara be dia be, ary mamy noho ny tantely, dia ny tantely mitete avy amin’ny toho-tantely.'),
  ('6ab25ad4fc0a3c48716e071c', '2026-09-22T10:39:16.208Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:16.208Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 19, 12, 'Iza no mahatsapa hoe nanao fahadisoana? Mamelà ahy amin’izay fahotana tsy fantatro akory.', 'iza no mahatsapa hoe nanao fahadisoana? mamelà ahy amin’izay fahotana tsy fantatro akory.'),
  ('6ab25ad4fc0a3c48716e0718', '2026-09-22T10:39:16.208Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:16.208Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 19, 8, 'Marina ny fitsipik’i Jehovah, mahafaly ny fo; Madio ny didin’i Jehovah, mampahiratra ny maso.', 'marina ny fitsipik’i jehovah, mahafaly ny fo; madio ny didin’i jehovah, mampahiratra ny maso.'),
  ('6ab25ad4fc0a3c48716e0716', '2026-09-22T10:39:16.208Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:16.208Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 19, 6, 'Mipoitra avy any amin’ny faravodilanitra iray izy, Ary mihodidina mankany amin’ny faravodilanitra iray; Tsy misy tsy azon’ny hafanany.', 'mipoitra avy any amin’ny faravodilanitra iray izy, ary mihodidina mankany amin’ny faravodilanitra iray; tsy misy tsy azon’ny hafanany.'),
  ('6ab25ad4fc0a3c48716e071d', '2026-09-22T10:39:16.208Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:16.208Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 19, 13, 'Ary aza avela ho sahisahy hanao an’izay tsy tokony hatao ny mpanomponao; Aza avela hanjaka ao amiko izany toe-tsaina izany. Amin’izay dia tsy hanan-tsiny aho, Ary tsy ho meloka ho nanao fahotana lehibe.', 'ary aza avela ho sahisahy hanao an’izay tsy tokony hatao ny mpanomponao; aza avela hanjaka ao amiko izany toe-tsaina izany. amin’izay dia tsy hanan-tsiny aho, ary tsy ho meloka ho nanao fahotana lehibe.'),
  ('6ab25ad50d0a6495b7b63b6d', '2026-09-22T10:39:17.104Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:17.104Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 21, 13, 'Mitsangàna, Jehovah ô, ary asehoy ny tanjakao! Hihira fiderana ho anao izahay noho ny herinao.', 'mitsangàna, jehovah ô, ary asehoy ny tanjakao! hihira fiderana ho anao izahay noho ny herinao.'),
  ('6ab25ad50d0a6495b7b63b68', '2026-09-22T10:39:17.104Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:17.104Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 21, 8, 'Ho azon’ny tananao ny fahavalonao rehetra; Ho azon’ny tananao ankavanana ireo mankahala anao.', 'ho azon’ny tananao ny fahavalonao rehetra; ho azon’ny tananao ankavanana ireo mankahala anao.'),
  ('6ab25ad50d0a6495b7b63b6a', '2026-09-22T10:39:17.104Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:17.104Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 21, 10, 'Haringanao tsy ho etỳ an-tany ny zanany, Ary hofoananao tsy ho eo amin’ny zanak’olombelona ny taranany.', 'haringanao tsy ho etỳ an-tany ny zanany, ary hofoananao tsy ho eo amin’ny zanak’olombelona ny taranany.'),
  ('6ab25ad50d0a6495b7b63b62', '2026-09-22T10:39:17.104Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:17.104Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 21, 2, 'Nomenao azy izay nirin’ny fony, Ary tsy nolavinao izay nangatahin’ny molony. ( Sela )', 'nomenao azy izay nirin’ny fony, ary tsy nolavinao izay nangatahin’ny molony. ( sela )'),
  ('6ab25ad50d0a6495b7b63b6b', '2026-09-22T10:39:17.104Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:17.104Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 21, 11, 'Fa nitady hanisy ratsy anao izy ireny; Manao tetika izy ireny, nefa tsy hahomby izany.', 'fa nitady hanisy ratsy anao izy ireny; manao tetika izy ireny, nefa tsy hahomby izany.'),
  ('6ab25ad50d0a6495b7b63b66', '2026-09-22T10:39:17.104Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:17.104Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 21, 6, 'Ataonao izay hahazoany fitahiana mandrakizay; Ataonao izay hahatsapany fifaliana eo anatrehanao.', 'ataonao izay hahazoany fitahiana mandrakizay; ataonao izay hahatsapany fifaliana eo anatrehanao.'),
  ('6ab25ad50d0a6495b7b63b6c', '2026-09-22T10:39:17.104Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:17.104Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 21, 12, 'Fa hampandositra azy ireny ianao, Rehefa mikendry azy amin’ny tsipìkanao.', 'fa hampandositra azy ireny ianao, rehefa mikendry azy amin’ny tsipìkanao.'),
  ('6ab25ad50d0a6495b7b63b69', '2026-09-22T10:39:17.104Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:17.104Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 21, 9, 'Hataonao toy ny lafaoro mirehitra izy ireny amin’ny fotoana voatondro, rehefa hamely azy ireny ianao. Tezitra i Jehovah ka haringany izy ireny, ary ho levon’ny afo.', 'hataonao toy ny lafaoro mirehitra izy ireny amin’ny fotoana voatondro, rehefa hamely azy ireny ianao. tezitra i jehovah ka haringany izy ireny, ary ho levon’ny afo.'),
  ('6ab25ad50d0a6495b7b63b64', '2026-09-22T10:39:17.104Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:17.104Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 21, 4, 'Ny ho velona no nangatahiny taminao, dia nomenao azy izany; Nataonao ela velona izy, eny, velona mandrakizay mandrakizay.', 'ny ho velona no nangatahiny taminao, dia nomenao azy izany; nataonao ela velona izy, eny, velona mandrakizay mandrakizay.'),
  ('6ab25ad50d0a6495b7b63b63', '2026-09-22T10:39:17.104Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:17.104Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 21, 3, 'Notsenainao izy ka nomenao fitahiana be dia be; Nasianao satroboninahitra volamena tena tsara teo amin’ny lohany.', 'notsenainao izy ka nomenao fitahiana be dia be; nasianao satroboninahitra volamena tena tsara teo amin’ny lohany.'),
  ('6ab25ad50d0a6495b7b63b65', '2026-09-22T10:39:17.104Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:17.104Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 21, 5, 'Mahazo voninahitra be izy noho ny asa famonjenao. Omenao haja amam-boninahitra izy.', 'mahazo voninahitra be izy noho ny asa famonjenao. omenao haja amam-boninahitra izy.'),
  ('6ab25ad50d0a6495b7b63b61', '2026-09-22T10:39:17.104Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:17.104Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 21, 1, 'Jehovah ô, faly ny mpanjaka satria nasehonao fa mahery ianao; Faly erỳ izy noho ny asa famonjenao!', 'jehovah ô, faly ny mpanjaka satria nasehonao fa mahery ianao; faly erỳ izy noho ny asa famonjenao!'),
  ('6ab25ad50d0a6495b7b63b67', '2026-09-22T10:39:17.104Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:17.104Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 21, 7, 'Fa matoky an’i Jehovah ny mpanjaka; Tsy hangozohozo mihitsy izy satria be fitiavana sy tsy mivadika ilay Avo Indrindra.', 'fa matoky an’i jehovah ny mpanjaka; tsy hangozohozo mihitsy izy satria be fitiavana sy tsy mivadika ilay avo indrindra.'),
  ('6ab25ad84d71333ecbd0dfbf', '2026-09-22T10:39:20.004Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:20.004Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 23, 5, 'Manomana latabatra ho ahy eo anoloan’ny fahavaloko ianao. Mahatsiaro ho velombelona aho rehefa hosoranao menaka ny lohako; Feno mitafotafo ny kaopiko.', 'manomana latabatra ho ahy eo anoloan’ny fahavaloko ianao. mahatsiaro ho velombelona aho rehefa hosoranao menaka ny lohako; feno mitafotafo ny kaopiko.'),
  ('6ab25ad84d71333ecbd0dfbd', '2026-09-22T10:39:20.004Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:20.004Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 23, 3, 'Mamelombelona ahy izy. Mitarika ahy amin’ny lalan’ny fahamarinana izy, noho ny anarany.', 'mamelombelona ahy izy. mitarika ahy amin’ny lalan’ny fahamarinana izy, noho ny anarany.'),
  ('6ab25ad84d71333ecbd0dfbb', '2026-09-22T10:39:20.004Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:20.004Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 23, 1, 'I Jehovah no Mpiandry ahy. Tsy ho ory na inona na inona aho.', 'i jehovah no mpiandry ahy. tsy ho ory na inona na inona aho.'),
  ('6ab25ad84d71333ecbd0dfbe', '2026-09-22T10:39:20.004Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:20.004Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 23, 4, 'Na dia mamakivaky lohasaha maizim-pito aza aho, Dia tsy misy loza atahorako, Satria ianao no eo anilako. Manome toky ahy ny tsorakazonao sy ny tehinao.', 'na dia mamakivaky lohasaha maizim-pito aza aho, dia tsy misy loza atahorako, satria ianao no eo anilako. manome toky ahy ny tsorakazonao sy ny tehinao.'),
  ('6ab25ad84d71333ecbd0dfc0', '2026-09-22T10:39:20.004Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:20.004Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 23, 6, 'Ho tsara toetra amiko tokoa ianao sady ho tia ahy sy tsy hivadika amiko, mandritra ny androm-piainako. Dia hipetraka ao an-tranon’i Jehovah aho, amin’ny andro rehetra ahavelomako.', 'ho tsara toetra amiko tokoa ianao sady ho tia ahy sy tsy hivadika amiko, mandritra ny androm-piainako. dia hipetraka ao an-tranon’i jehovah aho, amin’ny andro rehetra ahavelomako.'),
  ('6ab25ad84d71333ecbd0dfbc', '2026-09-22T10:39:20.004Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:20.004Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 23, 2, 'Asainy mitsotsotra eny amin’ny toerana feno ahi-maitso aho, Ary mitarika ahy ho eny amin’ny toeram-pialan-tsasatra azon-drano tsara izy.', 'asainy mitsotsotra eny amin’ny toerana feno ahi-maitso aho, ary mitarika ahy ho eny amin’ny toeram-pialan-tsasatra azon-drano tsara izy.'),
  ('6ab25ad8bf1654e727853895', '2026-09-22T10:39:20.456Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:20.456Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 24, 10, 'Iza izany Mpanjaka be voninahitra izany? I Jehovah Tompon’ny tafika! Izy ilay Mpanjaka be voninahitra! ( Sela )', 'iza izany mpanjaka be voninahitra izany? i jehovah tompon’ny tafika! izy ilay mpanjaka be voninahitra! ( sela )'),
  ('6ab25ad8bf1654e727853893', '2026-09-22T10:39:20.456Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:20.456Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 24, 8, 'Iza izany Mpanjaka be voninahitra izany? I Jehovah, ilay matanjaka sy mahery! I Jehovah, ilay mpiady mahery!', 'iza izany mpanjaka be voninahitra izany? i jehovah, ilay matanjaka sy mahery! i jehovah, ilay mpiady mahery!'),
  ('6ab25ad8bf1654e72785388e', '2026-09-22T10:39:20.456Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:20.456Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 24, 3, 'Iza no afaka miakatra mankany an-tendrombohitr’i Jehovah? Ary iza no afaka mijoro ao amin’ny toerany masina?', 'iza no afaka miakatra mankany an-tendrombohitr’i jehovah? ary iza no afaka mijoro ao amin’ny toerany masina?'),
  ('6ab25ad8bf1654e727853891', '2026-09-22T10:39:20.456Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:20.456Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 24, 6, 'Hoatr’izany ny taranak’izay mitady Azy, Dia ny taranak’izay mitady sitraka aminao, ry Andriamanitr’i Jakoba ô! ( Sela )', 'hoatr’izany ny taranak’izay mitady azy, dia ny taranak’izay mitady sitraka aminao, ry andriamanitr’i jakoba ô! ( sela )'),
  ('6ab25ad8bf1654e727853890', '2026-09-22T10:39:20.456Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:20.456Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 24, 5, 'Handray fitahiana avy amin’i Jehovah izy, Ary hanaiky azy ho marina ilay Andriamanitry ny famonjena azy.', 'handray fitahiana avy amin’i jehovah izy, ary hanaiky azy ho marina ilay andriamanitry ny famonjena azy.'),
  ('6ab25ad8bf1654e727853892', '2026-09-22T10:39:20.456Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:20.456Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 24, 7, 'Ry vavahady ô, ataovy avo be ny tamponareo; Misokafa, ry varavarana efa nisy hatry ny ela, Mba hidiran’ilay Mpanjaka be voninahitra!', 'ry vavahady ô, ataovy avo be ny tamponareo; misokafa, ry varavarana efa nisy hatry ny ela, mba hidiran’ilay mpanjaka be voninahitra!'),
