  ('6ab25ad9ee81adb6df3d67f1', '2026-09-22T10:39:21.528Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:21.528Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 25, 19, 'Jereo fa be dia be ny fahavaloko, Ary tsy tia maizina ahy izy ireo. ש [ Shina ]', 'jereo fa be dia be ny fahavaloko, ary tsy tia maizina ahy izy ireo. ש [ shina ]'),
  ('6ab25ad9ee81adb6df3d67ed', '2026-09-22T10:39:21.528Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:21.528Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 25, 15, 'Mibanjina an’i Jehovah foana ny masoko, Satria izy no hanafaka ny tongotro amin’ny harato. פ [ Pe ]', 'mibanjina an’i jehovah foana ny masoko, satria izy no hanafaka ny tongotro amin’ny harato. פ [ pe ]'),
  ('6ab25ad9ee81adb6df3d67ea', '2026-09-22T10:39:21.528Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:21.528Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 25, 12, 'Iza no olona matahotra an’i Jehovah? Hatorony azy izay lalana tokony hofidiny. נ [ Nona ]', 'iza no olona matahotra an’i jehovah? hatorony azy izay lalana tokony hofidiny. נ [ nona ]'),
  ('6ab25ad9ee81adb6df3d67f2', '2026-09-22T10:39:21.528Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:21.528Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 25, 20, 'Arovy ny aiko ka vonjeo aho. Aza avela ho menatra aho, fa ianao no ialofako. ת [ Tao ]', 'arovy ny aiko ka vonjeo aho. aza avela ho menatra aho, fa ianao no ialofako. ת [ tao ]'),
