  ('6ab25ad9ee81adb6df3d67e7', '2026-09-22T10:39:21.528Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:21.528Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 25, 9, 'Hitarika ny mpandefitra hanao ny marina izy, Ary hampianariny ny lalany ny mpandefitra. כ [ Kafa ]', 'hitarika ny mpandefitra hanao ny marina izy, ary hampianariny ny lalany ny mpandefitra. כ [ kafa ]'),
  ('6ab25ad9ee81adb6df3d67df', '2026-09-22T10:39:21.528Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:21.528Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 25, 1, 'Ianao, Jehovah ô, no ianteherako! [ Beta ]', 'ianao, jehovah ô, no ianteherako! [ beta ]'),
  ('6ab25ad9ee81adb6df3d67f0', '2026-09-22T10:39:21.528Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:21.528Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 25, 18, 'Jereo ny fahoriako sy ny olana mahazo ahy, Ary mamelà ny fahotako rehetra.', 'jereo ny fahoriako sy ny olana mahazo ahy, ary mamelà ny fahotako rehetra.'),
  ('6ab25ad9ee81adb6df3d67e5', '2026-09-22T10:39:21.528Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:21.528Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 25, 7, 'Hadinoy ny fahotana vitako tamin’izaho mbola tanora sy ny fandikan-dalàna nataoko. Tsarovy aho, noho ianao be fitiavana sy tsy mivadika Sy noho ianao tsara toetra, Jehovah ô! ט [ Teta ]', 'hadinoy ny fahotana vitako tamin’izaho mbola tanora sy ny fandikan-dalàna nataoko. tsarovy aho, noho ianao be fitiavana sy tsy mivadika sy noho ianao tsara toetra, jehovah ô! ט [ teta ]'),
  ('6ab25ad9ee81adb6df3d67e1', '2026-09-22T10:39:21.528Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:21.528Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 25, 3, 'Azo antoka fa tsy hisy ho menatra izay manantena anao, Fa ho menatra kosa ireo mamitaka tsy amin’antony. ד [ Daleta ]', 'azo antoka fa tsy hisy ho menatra izay manantena anao, fa ho menatra kosa ireo mamitaka tsy amin’antony. ד [ daleta ]'),
  ('6ab25ad9ee81adb6df3d67f3', '2026-09-22T10:39:21.528Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:21.528Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 25, 21, 'Ho voaro anie aho satria tsy mivadika sady manao izay mahitsy. Ianao mantsy no antenaiko.', 'ho voaro anie aho satria tsy mivadika sady manao izay mahitsy. ianao mantsy no antenaiko.'),
  ('6ab25ad9ee81adb6df3d67ef', '2026-09-22T10:39:21.528Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:21.528Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 25, 17, 'Mihamaro ny fahorian’ny foko; Afaho amin’ny fijaliako aho. ר [ Resa ]', 'mihamaro ny fahorian’ny foko; afaho amin’ny fijaliako aho. ר [ resa ]'),
  ('6ab25ad9ee81adb6df3d67e4', '2026-09-22T10:39:21.528Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:21.528Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 25, 6, 'Jehovah ô, tadidio hoe mamindra fo ianao sady be fitiavana sy tsy mivadika, Ary naneho an’ireo toetra ireo foana ianao hatramin’izay. ח [ Heta ]', 'jehovah ô, tadidio hoe mamindra fo ianao sady be fitiavana sy tsy mivadika, ary naneho an’ireo toetra ireo foana ianao hatramin’izay. ח [ heta ]'),
  ('6ab25ad9ee81adb6df3d67e0', '2026-09-22T10:39:21.528Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:21.528Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 25, 2, 'Andriamanitro ô, ianao no itokisako; Aza avela ho menatra aho. Aza avela ho faly amin’ny fahavoazako ny fahavaloko. ג [ Gimela ]', 'andriamanitro ô, ianao no itokisako; aza avela ho menatra aho. aza avela ho faly amin’ny fahavoazako ny fahavaloko. ג [ gimela ]'),
  ('6ab25ad9ee81adb6df3d67eb', '2026-09-22T10:39:21.528Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:21.528Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 25, 13, 'Hahita soa izy, Ary ho lasa fananan’ny taranany ny tany. ס [ Sameka ]', 'hahita soa izy, ary ho lasa fananan’ny taranany ny tany. ס [ sameka ]'),
  ('6ab25ad9ee81adb6df3d67e2', '2026-09-22T10:39:21.528Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:21.528Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 25, 4, 'Ampahafantaro ahy ny lalanao, Jehovah ô! Ampianaro ahy ny lalanao. ה [ He ]', 'ampahafantaro ahy ny lalanao, jehovah ô! ampianaro ahy ny lalanao. ה [ he ]'),
  ('6ab25ad9ee81adb6df3d67e3', '2026-09-22T10:39:21.528Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:21.528Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 25, 5, 'Ataovy izay handehanako amin’ny fahamarinanao ary ampianaro aho, Fa ianao no Andriamanitra mpamonjy ahy. ו [ Vao ] Ianao no antenaiko tontolo andro. ז [ Zaina ]', 'ataovy izay handehanako amin’ny fahamarinanao ary ampianaro aho, fa ianao no andriamanitra mpamonjy ahy. ו [ vao ] ianao no antenaiko tontolo andro. ז [ zaina ]'),
  ('6ab25ada2c2a3de2816a3205', '2026-09-22T10:39:22.565Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:22.565Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 26, 9, 'Aza aringana miaraka amin’ny mpanota aho, Ary aza aripaka miaraka amin’ny olona mahery setra,', 'aza aringana miaraka amin’ny mpanota aho, ary aza aripaka miaraka amin’ny olona mahery setra,'),
  ('6ab25ada2c2a3de2816a3201', '2026-09-22T10:39:22.565Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:22.565Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 26, 5, 'Halako ny andian’olona mpanao ratsy, Ary tsy manaiky hifanerasera amin’ny ratsy fanahy aho.', 'halako ny andian’olona mpanao ratsy, ary tsy manaiky hifanerasera amin’ny ratsy fanahy aho.'),
  ('6ab25ada2c2a3de2816a3208', '2026-09-22T10:39:22.565Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:22.565Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 26, 12, 'Mijoro eo amin’ny toerana tsy mikitoantoana ny tongotro; Eo anivon’ny fiangonana lehibe no hiderako an’i Jehovah.', 'mijoro eo amin’ny toerana tsy mikitoantoana ny tongotro; eo anivon’ny fiangonana lehibe no hiderako an’i jehovah.'),
  ('6ab25ada2c2a3de2816a3204', '2026-09-22T10:39:22.565Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:22.565Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 26, 8, 'Jehovah ô, tiako ny trano ipetrahanao, Dia ilay toerana misy ny voninahitrao.', 'jehovah ô, tiako ny trano ipetrahanao, dia ilay toerana misy ny voninahitrao.'),
  ('6ab25ada2c2a3de2816a31fd', '2026-09-22T10:39:22.565Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:22.565Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 26, 1, 'Tsarao aho, Jehovah ô, fa tsy mivadika; I Jehovah no itokisako, ary tsy miovaova ny fatokisako azy.', 'tsarao aho, jehovah ô, fa tsy mivadika; i jehovah no itokisako, ary tsy miovaova ny fatokisako azy.'),
  ('6ab25ada2c2a3de2816a3202', '2026-09-22T10:39:22.565Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:22.565Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 26, 6, 'Hanasa tanana aho fa tsy manan-tsiny, Ary handeha manodidina ny alitaranao aho, Jehovah ô,', 'hanasa tanana aho fa tsy manan-tsiny, ary handeha manodidina ny alitaranao aho, jehovah ô,'),
  ('6ab25ada2c2a3de2816a31ff', '2026-09-22T10:39:22.565Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:22.565Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 26, 3, 'Fa toy ny hoe eo alohako eo foana ny fitiavanao sy ny tsy fivadihanao, Ary mandeha amin’ny fahamarinanao aho.', 'fa toy ny hoe eo alohako eo foana ny fitiavanao sy ny tsy fivadihanao, ary mandeha amin’ny fahamarinanao aho.'),
  ('6ab25ada2c2a3de2816a31fe', '2026-09-22T10:39:22.565Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:22.565Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 26, 2, 'Diniho aho, Jehovah ô, ka sedrao; Diovy ny eritreritro lalina indrindra sy ny foko.', 'diniho aho, jehovah ô, ka sedrao; diovy ny eritreritro lalina indrindra sy ny foko.'),
  ('6ab25ada2c2a3de2816a3200', '2026-09-22T10:39:22.565Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:22.565Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 26, 4, 'Tsy mifanerasera amin’ny olona mamitaka aho, Ary tsy miaraka amin’ireo manafina ny tena maha izy azy.', 'tsy mifanerasera amin’ny olona mamitaka aho, ary tsy miaraka amin’ireo manafina ny tena maha izy azy.'),
  ('6ab25ada2c2a3de2816a3203', '2026-09-22T10:39:22.565Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:22.565Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 26, 7, 'Mba handrenesana ny fisaorako anao Sy hanambarako ny zavatra mahatalanjona rehetra nataonao.', 'mba handrenesana ny fisaorako anao sy hanambarako ny zavatra mahatalanjona rehetra nataonao.'),
  ('6ab25ada2c2a3de2816a3207', '2026-09-22T10:39:22.565Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:22.565Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 26, 11, 'Fa izaho kosa tsy mba hivadika mihitsy. Afaho aho, ka iantrao.', 'fa izaho kosa tsy mba hivadika mihitsy. afaho aho, ka iantrao.'),
  ('6ab25ada2c2a3de2816a3206', '2026-09-22T10:39:22.565Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:22.565Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 26, 10, 'Izay mampiasa ny tanany mba hanaovana zavatra mahamenatra, Sady feno kolikoly ny tanany ankavanana.', 'izay mampiasa ny tanany mba hanaovana zavatra mahamenatra, sady feno kolikoly ny tanany ankavanana.'),
  ('6ab25adbb181e87752eddc68', '2026-09-22T10:39:23.689Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:23.689Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 27, 3, 'Na misy tafika manangana toby hamelezana ahy aza, Dia tsy mba hatahotra ny foko. Na misy miady amiko aza, Dia mbola hatoky an’Andriamanitra ihany aho.', 'na misy tafika manangana toby hamelezana ahy aza, dia tsy mba hatahotra ny foko. na misy miady amiko aza, dia mbola hatoky an’andriamanitra ihany aho.'),
  ('6ab25adbb181e87752eddc71', '2026-09-22T10:39:23.689Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:23.689Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 27, 12, 'Aza atolotra eo an-tanan’ny fahavaloko aho, Fa misy vavolombelona mandainga mitsangana hiampanga ahy, Ary mandrahona ny hamely ahy izy ireo.', 'aza atolotra eo an-tanan’ny fahavaloko aho, fa misy vavolombelona mandainga mitsangana hiampanga ahy, ary mandrahona ny hamely ahy izy ireo.'),
  ('6ab25adbb181e87752eddc6b', '2026-09-22T10:39:23.689Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:23.689Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 27, 6, 'Misandratra ambonin’ireo fahavaloko manodidina ahy aho izao; Hihorakoraka sady ho faly aho rehefa manao sorona ao amin’ny tranolain’Andriamanitra; Hihira fiderana ho an’i Jehovah aho.', 'misandratra ambonin’ireo fahavaloko manodidina ahy aho izao; hihorakoraka sady ho faly aho rehefa manao sorona ao amin’ny tranolain’andriamanitra; hihira fiderana ho an’i jehovah aho.'),
  ('6ab25adbb181e87752eddc66', '2026-09-22T10:39:23.689Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:23.689Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 27, 1, 'I Jehovah no mpanazava sy mpamonjy ahy, Koa iza no hatahorako? I Jehovah no manda miaro ny aiko, Koa iza no haharaiki-tahotra ahy?', 'i jehovah no mpanazava sy mpamonjy ahy, koa iza no hatahorako? i jehovah no manda miaro ny aiko, koa iza no haharaiki-tahotra ahy?'),
  ('6ab25adbb181e87752eddc6f', '2026-09-22T10:39:23.689Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:23.689Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 27, 10, 'Na mahafoy ahy aza ny raiko sy ny reniko, I Jehovah kosa handray ahy.', 'na mahafoy ahy aza ny raiko sy ny reniko, i jehovah kosa handray ahy.'),
  ('6ab25adbb181e87752eddc67', '2026-09-22T10:39:23.689Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:23.689Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 27, 2, 'Rehefa nanafika ahy mba hihinana ny nofoko ny mpanao ratsy, Izay fahavaloko sy mpanohitra ahy, dia izy ireo ihany no tafintohina ka lavo.', 'rehefa nanafika ahy mba hihinana ny nofoko ny mpanao ratsy, izay fahavaloko sy mpanohitra ahy, dia izy ireo ihany no tafintohina ka lavo.'),
  ('6ab25adbb181e87752eddc6d', '2026-09-22T10:39:23.689Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:23.689Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 27, 8, 'Tsaroako ato am-poko ilay didinao hoe: “Mitadiava ahy ianareo.” Ianao tokoa no hotadiaviko, Jehovah ô!', 'tsaroako ato am-poko ilay didinao hoe: “mitadiava ahy ianareo.” ianao tokoa no hotadiaviko, jehovah ô!'),
  ('6ab25adbb181e87752eddc6c', '2026-09-22T10:39:23.689Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:23.689Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 27, 7, 'Jehovah ô, henoy aho rehefa mitaraina; Iantrao aho ka valio.', 'jehovah ô, henoy aho rehefa mitaraina; iantrao aho ka valio.'),
  ('6ab25adbb181e87752eddc72', '2026-09-22T10:39:23.689Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:23.689Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 27, 13, 'Taiza no ho niafarako raha tsy nino aho Hoe hahita ny hatsaran-toetran’i Jehovah eo amin’ny tanin’ny velona?', 'taiza no ho niafarako raha tsy nino aho hoe hahita ny hatsaran-toetran’i jehovah eo amin’ny tanin’ny velona?'),
  ('6ab25adbb181e87752eddc6a', '2026-09-22T10:39:23.689Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:23.689Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 27, 5, 'Fa hanafina ahy ao amin’ny trano fialofany izy amin’ny andro hiavian’ny loza, Ary hanafina ahy ao amin’ny toerana miafina, ao amin’ny tranolainy. Eny ambony vatolampy avo be no hametrahany ahy.', 'fa hanafina ahy ao amin’ny trano fialofany izy amin’ny andro hiavian’ny loza, ary hanafina ahy ao amin’ny toerana miafina, ao amin’ny tranolainy. eny ambony vatolampy avo be no hametrahany ahy.'),
  ('6ab25adbb181e87752eddc73', '2026-09-22T10:39:23.689Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:23.689Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 27, 14, 'Aoka ianao hanantena an’i Jehovah; Manàna herim-po ary hatanjaho ny fonao. Eny, aoka ianao hanantena an’i Jehovah.', 'aoka ianao hanantena an’i jehovah; manàna herim-po ary hatanjaho ny fonao. eny, aoka ianao hanantena an’i jehovah.'),
  ('6ab25adbb181e87752eddc6e', '2026-09-22T10:39:23.689Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:23.689Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 27, 9, 'Aza mihodina tsy hijery ahy. Aza roahina ao anatin’ny hatezerana ny mpanomponao. Ianao no mpanampy ahy; Aza mahafoy na mandao ahy, ry Andriamanitra mpamonjy ahy!', 'aza mihodina tsy hijery ahy. aza roahina ao anatin’ny hatezerana ny mpanomponao. ianao no mpanampy ahy; aza mahafoy na mandao ahy, ry andriamanitra mpamonjy ahy!'),
  ('6ab25adbb181e87752eddc70', '2026-09-22T10:39:23.689Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:23.689Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 27, 11, 'Ampianaro ny lalanao aho, Jehovah ô, Ary tariho amin’ny lala-mahitsy aho mba tsy ho azon’ny fahavaloko.', 'ampianaro ny lalanao aho, jehovah ô, ary tariho amin’ny lala-mahitsy aho mba tsy ho azon’ny fahavaloko.'),
  ('6ab25adbb181e87752eddc69', '2026-09-22T10:39:23.689Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:23.689Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 27, 4, 'Zavatra iray monja no angatahiko amin’i Jehovah, —Izay ihany no hotadiaviko— Dia ny hipetraka ao an-tranon’i Jehovah mandritra ny androm-piainako. Amin’izay aho dia handinika ny hatsaran’i Jehovah Ary hahafinaritra ahy ny hijery ny tempoliny.', 'zavatra iray monja no angatahiko amin’i jehovah, —izay ihany no hotadiaviko— dia ny hipetraka ao an-tranon’i jehovah mandritra ny androm-piainako. amin’izay aho dia handinika ny hatsaran’i jehovah ary hahafinaritra ahy ny hijery ny tempoliny.'),
  ('6ab25adc3f15466d907df03b', '2026-09-22T10:39:24.766Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:24.766Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 28, 1, 'Ianao foana no antsoiko, Jehovah ô, ry Vatolampiko! Aza manampin-tsofina tsy hihaino ahy. Raha mangina tsy mamaly ahy ianao, Dia ho lasa tahaka an’ireo midina any an-davaka aho.', 'ianao foana no antsoiko, jehovah ô, ry vatolampiko! aza manampin-tsofina tsy hihaino ahy. raha mangina tsy mamaly ahy ianao, dia ho lasa tahaka an’ireo midina any an-davaka aho.'),
  ('6ab25adc3f15466d907df03c', '2026-09-22T10:39:24.766Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:24.766Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 28, 2, 'Henoy ny fitalahoako rehefa miantso vonjy aminao aho, Ka mivavaka manandrify ny efitra anatiny indrindra amin’ny toeranao masina.', 'henoy ny fitalahoako rehefa miantso vonjy aminao aho, ka mivavaka manandrify ny efitra anatiny indrindra amin’ny toeranao masina.'),
  ('6ab25adc3f15466d907df03d', '2026-09-22T10:39:24.766Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:24.766Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 28, 3, 'Aza taritaritina miaraka amin’ny ratsy fanahy aho, miaraka amin’ireo zatra manao ratsy, Dia ireo miresaka fihavanana amin’ny namany nefa ratsy ny ao am-pony.', 'aza taritaritina miaraka amin’ny ratsy fanahy aho, miaraka amin’ireo zatra manao ratsy, dia ireo miresaka fihavanana amin’ny namany nefa ratsy ny ao am-pony.'),
  ('6ab25adc3f15466d907df03e', '2026-09-22T10:39:24.766Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:24.766Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 28, 4, 'Valio araka izay nataony izy ireny, Araka ny ratsy fanaony. Valio araka ny asan’ny tanany izy ireny, Araka izay nataony.', 'valio araka izay nataony izy ireny, araka ny ratsy fanaony. valio araka ny asan’ny tanany izy ireny, araka izay nataony.');
INSERT INTO "bible_verses" ("id", "created_date", "updated_date", "created_by_id", "created_by", "translation", "book", "bookOrder", "chapter", "verse", "text", "normalizedText") VALUES
  ('6ab25adc3f15466d907df03f', '2026-09-22T10:39:24.766Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:24.766Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 28, 5, 'Fa tsy raharahian’izy ireny izay ataon’i Jehovah Sy ny asan’ny tanany. Hopotehin’Andriamanitra ny fiainan’izy ireny ary hataony tsy tafarina intsony izy ireny.', 'fa tsy raharahian’izy ireny izay ataon’i jehovah sy ny asan’ny tanany. hopotehin’andriamanitra ny fiainan’izy ireny ary hataony tsy tafarina intsony izy ireny.'),
  ('6ab25adc3f15466d907df040', '2026-09-22T10:39:24.766Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:24.766Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 28, 6, 'Hoderaina anie i Jehovah Fa nohenoiny ny fitalahoako fanampiana!', 'hoderaina anie i jehovah fa nohenoiny ny fitalahoako fanampiana!'),
  ('6ab25adc3f15466d907df041', '2026-09-22T10:39:24.766Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:24.766Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 28, 7, 'I Jehovah no heriko sy ampingako; Izy no itokian’ny foko. Nanampy ahy izy, ka faly ny foko. Hidera azy amin’ny hirako àry aho.', 'i jehovah no heriko sy ampingako; izy no itokian’ny foko. nanampy ahy izy, ka faly ny foko. hidera azy amin’ny hirako àry aho.'),
  ('6ab25adc3f15466d907df042', '2026-09-22T10:39:24.766Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:24.766Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 28, 8, 'I Jehovah no herin’ny vahoakany; Izy no manda fiarovana, izay mitondra famonjena lehibe ho an’ny voahosotra notendreny.', 'i jehovah no herin’ny vahoakany; izy no manda fiarovana, izay mitondra famonjena lehibe ho an’ny voahosotra notendreny.'),
  ('6ab25adc3f15466d907df043', '2026-09-22T10:39:24.766Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:24.766Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 28, 9, 'Vonjeo ny vahoakanao, ary tahio ny lovanao. Aoka ianao ho mpiandry azy ireo ka hitondra azy eny an-tsandrinao mandrakizay.', 'vonjeo ny vahoakanao, ary tahio ny lovanao. aoka ianao ho mpiandry azy ireo ka hitondra azy eny an-tsandrinao mandrakizay.'),
  ('6ab25add5e886599da31398c', '2026-09-22T10:39:25.233Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:25.233Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 29, 11, 'Hanome hery ny vahoakany i Jehovah. Hitahy ny vahoakany i Jehovah ka hanome azy fiadanana.', 'hanome hery ny vahoakany i jehovah. hitahy ny vahoakany i jehovah ka hanome azy fiadanana.'),
  ('6ab25add5e886599da313987', '2026-09-22T10:39:25.233Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:25.233Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 29, 6, 'Ataony mitsambikimbikina toy ny zanak’omby i Libàna, Ary toy ny zanak’ombidia i Siriona.', 'ataony mitsambikimbikina toy ny zanak’omby i libàna, ary toy ny zanak’ombidia i siriona.'),
  ('6ab25add5e886599da31398b', '2026-09-22T10:39:25.233Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:25.233Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 29, 10, 'Mipetraka eo amin’ny seza fiandrianany eo ambonin’ny rano be i Jehovah; Mipetraka eo amin’ny seza fiandrianany i Jehovah; Mpanjaka mandrakizay izy.', 'mipetraka eo amin’ny seza fiandrianany eo ambonin’ny rano be i jehovah; mipetraka eo amin’ny seza fiandrianany i jehovah; mpanjaka mandrakizay izy.'),
  ('6ab25add5e886599da31398a', '2026-09-22T10:39:25.233Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:25.233Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 29, 9, 'Mahatonga ny serfa ho tora-kovitra sy ho teraka ny feon’i Jehovah, Sady mampihintsan-dravina an’ireo ala. Ary izao no lazain’izay rehetra ao amin’ny tempoliny: “Voninahitra!”', 'mahatonga ny serfa ho tora-kovitra sy ho teraka ny feon’i jehovah, sady mampihintsan-dravina an’ireo ala. ary izao no lazain’izay rehetra ao amin’ny tempoliny: “voninahitra!”'),
  ('6ab25add5e886599da313989', '2026-09-22T10:39:25.233Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:25.233Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 29, 8, 'Mahatonga ny tany efitra ho tora-kovitra ny feon’i Jehovah; Ataon’i Jehovah tora-kovitra ny tany efitr’i Kadesy.', 'mahatonga ny tany efitra ho tora-kovitra ny feon’i jehovah; ataon’i jehovah tora-kovitra ny tany efitr’i kadesy.'),
  ('6ab25add5e886599da313983', '2026-09-22T10:39:25.233Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:25.233Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 29, 2, 'Omeo voninahitra i Jehovah fa mendrika an’izany ny anarany. Manaova fitafiana masina dia miankohofa eo anatrehan’i Jehovah.', 'omeo voninahitra i jehovah fa mendrika an’izany ny anarany. manaova fitafiana masina dia miankohofa eo anatrehan’i jehovah.'),
  ('6ab25add5e886599da313984', '2026-09-22T10:39:25.233Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:25.233Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 29, 3, 'Heno eny ambonin’ny rano ny feon’i Jehovah; Mikotrokotroka ny feon’ilay Andriamanitra be voninahitra. Eny ambonin’ny rano be i Jehovah.', 'heno eny ambonin’ny rano ny feon’i jehovah; mikotrokotroka ny feon’ilay andriamanitra be voninahitra. eny ambonin’ny rano be i jehovah.'),
  ('6ab25add5e886599da313986', '2026-09-22T10:39:25.233Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:25.233Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 29, 5, 'Manapatapaka sedera ny feon’i Jehovah; Ataon’i Jehovah potipotika ny sederan’i Libàna.', 'manapatapaka sedera ny feon’i jehovah; ataon’i jehovah potipotika ny sederan’i libàna.'),
  ('6ab25add5e886599da313982', '2026-09-22T10:39:25.233Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:25.233Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 29, 1, 'Omeo an’i Jehovah izay tokony homena azy, ry zanaky ny mahery! Omeo an’i Jehovah izay tokony homena azy, satria be voninahitra sady matanjaka izy.', 'omeo an’i jehovah izay tokony homena azy, ry zanaky ny mahery! omeo an’i jehovah izay tokony homena azy, satria be voninahitra sady matanjaka izy.'),
  ('6ab25add5e886599da313985', '2026-09-22T10:39:25.233Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:25.233Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 29, 4, 'Mahery ny feon’i Jehovah; Be voninahitra ny feon’i Jehovah.', 'mahery ny feon’i jehovah; be voninahitra ny feon’i jehovah.'),
  ('6ab25add5e886599da313988', '2026-09-22T10:39:25.233Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:25.233Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 29, 7, 'Mampisy tselatra ny feon’i Jehovah;', 'mampisy tselatra ny feon’i jehovah;'),
  ('6ab25adda3eed5f2058b44c3', '2026-09-22T10:39:25.690Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:25.690Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 30, 7, 'Jehovah ô, nataonao mafy orina toy ny tendrombohitra aho, tamin’izaho mbola nankasitrahanao. Rehefa nihodina tsy nijery ahy anefa ianao, dia nihorohoro aho.', 'jehovah ô, nataonao mafy orina toy ny tendrombohitra aho, tamin’izaho mbola nankasitrahanao. rehefa nihodina tsy nijery ahy anefa ianao, dia nihorohoro aho.'),
  ('6ab25adda3eed5f2058b44c0', '2026-09-22T10:39:25.690Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:25.690Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 30, 4, 'Manaova hira fiderana ho an’i Jehovah, ry olona tsy mivadika aminy! Isaory ny anarany masina;', 'manaova hira fiderana ho an’i jehovah, ry olona tsy mivadika aminy! isaory ny anarany masina;'),
  ('6ab25adda3eed5f2058b44c8', '2026-09-22T10:39:25.690Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:25.690Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 30, 12, 'Mba hahafahako hihira fiderana ho anao, fa tsy hangina fotsiny. Jehovah Andriamanitro ô, hidera anao mandrakizay aho.', 'mba hahafahako hihira fiderana ho anao, fa tsy hangina fotsiny. jehovah andriamanitro ô, hidera anao mandrakizay aho.'),
  ('6ab25adda3eed5f2058b44bd', '2026-09-22T10:39:25.690Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:25.690Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 30, 1, 'Hanandratra anao aho, Jehovah ô, fa nisintona ahy hiakatra ianao; Tsy navelanao hifaly amin’ny fahavoazako ny fahavaloko.', 'hanandratra anao aho, jehovah ô, fa nisintona ahy hiakatra ianao; tsy navelanao hifaly amin’ny fahavoazako ny fahavaloko.'),
  ('6ab25adda3eed5f2058b44c6', '2026-09-22T10:39:25.690Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:25.690Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 30, 10, 'Mihainoa, Jehovah ô, ary iantrao aho. Jehovah ô, ampio aho.', 'mihainoa, jehovah ô, ary iantrao aho. jehovah ô, ampio aho.'),
  ('6ab25adda3eed5f2058b44c5', '2026-09-22T10:39:25.690Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:25.690Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 30, 9, 'Inona moa no soa azo raha maty aho ka midina any an-davaka? Ny vovoka angaha hidera anao, na hilaza momba ny tsy fivadihanao?', 'inona moa no soa azo raha maty aho ka midina any an-davaka? ny vovoka angaha hidera anao, na hilaza momba ny tsy fivadihanao?'),
  ('6ab25adda3eed5f2058b44c4', '2026-09-22T10:39:25.690Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:25.690Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 30, 8, 'Ianao foana no nantsoiko, Jehovah ô! I Jehovah foana no nitalahoako famindram-po.', 'ianao foana no nantsoiko, jehovah ô! i jehovah foana no nitalahoako famindram-po.'),
  ('6ab25adda3eed5f2058b44c1', '2026-09-22T10:39:25.690Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:25.690Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 30, 5, 'Vetivety ihany mantsy izy no tezitra, Fa mandritra ny androm-piainana kosa izy no mankasitraka. Mety ho tonga ny fitomaniana amin’ny hariva, fa misy fihobiana kosa rehefa maraina.', 'vetivety ihany mantsy izy no tezitra, fa mandritra ny androm-piainana kosa izy no mankasitraka. mety ho tonga ny fitomaniana amin’ny hariva, fa misy fihobiana kosa rehefa maraina.'),
  ('6ab25adda3eed5f2058b44be', '2026-09-22T10:39:25.690Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:25.690Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 30, 2, 'Jehovah Andriamanitro ô, niantso vonjy taminao aho ka nositraninao.', 'jehovah andriamanitro ô, niantso vonjy taminao aho ka nositraninao.'),
  ('6ab25adda3eed5f2058b44c2', '2026-09-22T10:39:25.690Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:25.690Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 30, 6, 'Hoy aho tamin’ny mbola nilamina ny fiainako: “Tsy ho azo hozongozonina mihitsy aho.”', 'hoy aho tamin’ny mbola nilamina ny fiainako: “tsy ho azo hozongozonina mihitsy aho.”'),
  ('6ab25adda3eed5f2058b44c7', '2026-09-22T10:39:25.690Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:25.690Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 30, 11, 'Novanao ho fandihizana ny fisaonako; Nesorinao ny akanjo gony nanaovako, dia nampitafianao fifaliana aho,', 'novanao ho fandihizana ny fisaonako; nesorinao ny akanjo gony nanaovako, dia nampitafianao fifaliana aho,'),
  ('6ab25adda3eed5f2058b44bf', '2026-09-22T10:39:25.690Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:25.690Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 30, 3, 'Jehovah ô, nosintoninao niakatra avy tany amin’ny Fasana aho. Tsy navelanao ho faty aho; tsy navelanao hilentika tany anaty lavaka aho.', 'jehovah ô, nosintoninao niakatra avy tany amin’ny fasana aho. tsy navelanao ho faty aho; tsy navelanao hilentika tany anaty lavaka aho.'),
  ('6ab25ade3c4518682852ac91', '2026-09-22T10:39:26.427Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:26.427Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 31, 22, 'Izaho kosa natahotra be sady nikoropaka ka niteny hoe: “Ho ringana tsy ho eo anatrehanao aho.” Renao anefa ny fitalahoako rehefa niantso vonjy taminao aho.', 'izaho kosa natahotra be sady nikoropaka ka niteny hoe: “ho ringana tsy ho eo anatrehanao aho.” renao anefa ny fitalahoako rehefa niantso vonjy taminao aho.'),
  ('6ab25ade3c4518682852ac92', '2026-09-22T10:39:26.427Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:26.427Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 31, 23, 'Aoka ho tia an’i Jehovah ianareo rehetra tsy mivadika aminy! Arovan’i Jehovah ny olona mendri-pitokisana, Fa saziny mafy dia mafy kosa izay mirehareha.', 'aoka ho tia an’i jehovah ianareo rehetra tsy mivadika aminy! arovan’i jehovah ny olona mendri-pitokisana, fa saziny mafy dia mafy kosa izay mirehareha.'),
  ('6ab25ade3c4518682852ac8e', '2026-09-22T10:39:26.427Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:26.427Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 31, 19, 'Lehibe tokoa ny hatsaran-toetranao! Tehirizinao ho an’ireo matahotra anao izany, Sady asehonao amin’ireo mialoka aminao, eo anatrehan’ny olona rehetra.', 'lehibe tokoa ny hatsaran-toetranao! tehirizinao ho an’ireo matahotra anao izany, sady asehonao amin’ireo mialoka aminao, eo anatrehan’ny olona rehetra.'),
  ('6ab25ade3c4518682852ac88', '2026-09-22T10:39:26.427Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:26.427Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 31, 13, 'Maheno fanaratsiana etsy sy eroa aho; Manjaka hatraiza hatraiza ny horohoro. Rehefa mivondrona hanohitra ahy izy ireo, Dia mitetika ny hanapitra ny aiko.', 'maheno fanaratsiana etsy sy eroa aho; manjaka hatraiza hatraiza ny horohoro. rehefa mivondrona hanohitra ahy izy ireo, dia mitetika ny hanapitra ny aiko.'),
  ('6ab25ade3c4518682852ac8d', '2026-09-22T10:39:26.427Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:26.427Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 31, 18, 'Aoka tsy hahateny ny molotra mandainga, Dia ny molotra miteny an’avona hanohitra ny olo-marina, ka mirehareha sy manambany azy.', 'aoka tsy hahateny ny molotra mandainga, dia ny molotra miteny an’avona hanohitra ny olo-marina, ka mirehareha sy manambany azy.'),
  ('6ab25ade3c4518682852ac89', '2026-09-22T10:39:26.427Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:26.427Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 31, 14, 'Fa izaho kosa matoky anao, Jehovah ô! Hoy aho: “Ianao no Andriamanitro.”', 'fa izaho kosa matoky anao, jehovah ô! hoy aho: “ianao no andriamanitro.”'),
  ('6ab25ade3c4518682852ac8f', '2026-09-22T10:39:26.427Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:26.427Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 31, 20, 'Hafeninao ao amin’ny toerana miafina eo anatrehanao izy ireo, Mba tsy ho voan’ny teti-dratsy ataon’ny olona; Hanafina azy ireo ao amin’ny trano fialofanao ianao, Mba tsy hotafihin’ny olona ratsy saina izy ireo.', 'hafeninao ao amin’ny toerana miafina eo anatrehanao izy ireo, mba tsy ho voan’ny teti-dratsy ataon’ny olona; hanafina azy ireo ao amin’ny trano fialofanao ianao, mba tsy hotafihin’ny olona ratsy saina izy ireo.'),
  ('6ab25ade3c4518682852ac8a', '2026-09-22T10:39:26.427Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:26.427Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 31, 15, 'Eo an-tananao ny aiko. Vonjeo aho tsy ho azon’ny fahavaloko sy ny mpanenjika ahy.', 'eo an-tananao ny aiko. vonjeo aho tsy ho azon’ny fahavaloko sy ny mpanenjika ahy.'),
  ('6ab25ade3c4518682852ac82', '2026-09-22T10:39:26.427Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:26.427Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 31, 7, 'Ho faly be aho noho ianao be fitiavana sy tsy mivadika, Satria hitanao ny fijaliako; Fantatrao ny fahoriana mafy manjo ahy.', 'ho faly be aho noho ianao be fitiavana sy tsy mivadika, satria hitanao ny fijaliako; fantatrao ny fahoriana mafy manjo ahy.'),
  ('6ab25ade3c4518682852ac7e', '2026-09-22T10:39:26.427Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:26.427Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 31, 3, 'Fa ianao no harambatoko sy manda fiarovana ho ahy; Hitari-dalana sy hitondra ahy ianao, noho ny anaranao.', 'fa ianao no harambatoko sy manda fiarovana ho ahy; hitari-dalana sy hitondra ahy ianao, noho ny anaranao.'),
  ('6ab25ade3c4518682852ac87', '2026-09-22T10:39:26.427Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:26.427Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 31, 12, 'Tsy ao am-pon’izy ireo intsony aho sady efa hadinony, toy ny hoe efa maty; Hoatran’ny vilany vaky aho.', 'tsy ao am-pon’izy ireo intsony aho sady efa hadinony, toy ny hoe efa maty; hoatran’ny vilany vaky aho.'),
  ('6ab25ade3c4518682852ac7d', '2026-09-22T10:39:26.427Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:26.427Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 31, 2, 'Aoka ianao hanongilan-tsofina hihaino ahy. Tongava haingana hanafaka ahy. Aoka ianao ho fiarovana mafy ho ahy eny an-tendrombohitra, Ho toerana voaro mafy mba hahavoavonjy ahy.', 'aoka ianao hanongilan-tsofina hihaino ahy. tongava haingana hanafaka ahy. aoka ianao ho fiarovana mafy ho ahy eny an-tendrombohitra, ho toerana voaro mafy mba hahavoavonjy ahy.'),
  ('6ab25ade3c4518682852ac90', '2026-09-22T10:39:26.427Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:26.427Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 31, 21, 'Hoderaina anie i Jehovah, Fa nasehony tamin’ny fomba miavaka hoe tia ahy sy tsy nivadika tamiko izy, tao amin’ny tanàna natao fahirano.', 'hoderaina anie i jehovah, fa nasehony tamin’ny fomba miavaka hoe tia ahy sy tsy nivadika tamiko izy, tao amin’ny tanàna natao fahirano.'),
  ('6ab25ade3c4518682852ac81', '2026-09-22T10:39:26.427Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:26.427Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 31, 6, 'Halako ireo mivavaka amin’ny sampy tsy misy dikany sy tsy misy ilana azy, Fa izaho kosa hitoky amin’i Jehovah.', 'halako ireo mivavaka amin’ny sampy tsy misy dikany sy tsy misy ilana azy, fa izaho kosa hitoky amin’i jehovah.'),
  ('6ab25ade3c4518682852ac7f', '2026-09-22T10:39:26.427Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:26.427Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 31, 4, 'Hafahanao avy ao anaty harato namandrihana ahy an-tsokosoko aho, Fa ianao no fiarovana mafy ho ahy.', 'hafahanao avy ao anaty harato namandrihana ahy an-tsokosoko aho, fa ianao no fiarovana mafy ho ahy.'),
  ('6ab25ade3c4518682852ac7c', '2026-09-22T10:39:26.427Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:26.427Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 31, 1, 'Ianao no ialofako, Jehovah ô! Enga anie aho tsy ho menatra mihitsy! Vonjeo aho satria manao ny rariny ianao.', 'ianao no ialofako, jehovah ô! enga anie aho tsy ho menatra mihitsy! vonjeo aho satria manao ny rariny ianao.'),
  ('6ab25ade3c4518682852ac80', '2026-09-22T10:39:26.427Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:26.427Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 31, 5, 'Ankiniko aminao ny aiko. Nanavotra ahy ianao, ry Jehovah Andriamanitry ny fahamarinana ô!', 'ankiniko aminao ny aiko. nanavotra ahy ianao, ry jehovah andriamanitry ny fahamarinana ô!'),
  ('6ab25ade3c4518682852ac8b', '2026-09-22T10:39:26.427Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:26.427Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 31, 16, 'Aoka ianao ho miramirana amin’ny mpanomponao. Vonjeo aho satria be fitiavana sy tsy mivadika ianao.', 'aoka ianao ho miramirana amin’ny mpanomponao. vonjeo aho satria be fitiavana sy tsy mivadika ianao.'),
  ('6ab25ade3c4518682852ac8c', '2026-09-22T10:39:26.427Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:26.427Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 31, 17, 'Jehovah ô, enga anie tsy ho menatra aho rehefa miantso anao! Enga anie ny ratsy fanahy hatao afa-baraka, Ary hatao tsy mahateny intsony ao amin’ny Fasana!', 'jehovah ô, enga anie tsy ho menatra aho rehefa miantso anao! enga anie ny ratsy fanahy hatao afa-baraka, ary hatao tsy mahateny intsony ao amin’ny fasana!'),
  ('6ab25ade3c4518682852ac83', '2026-09-22T10:39:26.427Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:26.427Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 31, 8, 'Tsy nanolotra ahy teo an-tanan’ny fahavalo ianao, Fa mampijoro ahy eo amin’ny toerana tsy mampidi-doza.', 'tsy nanolotra ahy teo an-tanan’ny fahavalo ianao, fa mampijoro ahy eo amin’ny toerana tsy mampidi-doza.'),
  ('6ab25ade3c4518682852ac93', '2026-09-22T10:39:26.427Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:26.427Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 31, 24, 'Manàna herim-po ary enga anie hatanjaka ny fonareo, Dia ianareo rehetra izay miandry an’i Jehovah.', 'manàna herim-po ary enga anie hatanjaka ny fonareo, dia ianareo rehetra izay miandry an’i jehovah.'),
  ('6ab25ade3c4518682852ac86', '2026-09-22T10:39:26.427Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:26.427Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 31, 11, 'Manao tsinontsinona ahy daholo ny fahavaloko, Indrindra fa ny mpiara-monina amiko. Ary atahoran’ny olom-pantatro aho; Andosiran’izy ireo aho rehefa hitany eny ivelany eny.', 'manao tsinontsinona ahy daholo ny fahavaloko, indrindra fa ny mpiara-monina amiko. ary atahoran’ny olom-pantatro aho; andosiran’izy ireo aho rehefa hitany eny ivelany eny.'),
  ('6ab25ade3c4518682852ac85', '2026-09-22T10:39:26.427Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:26.427Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 31, 10, 'Lany tamin’ny alahelo ny fiainako, Ary lany tamin’ny fitarainana ny taona iainako. Mihena ny heriko noho ny fahadisoako; Mihamalemy ny taolako.', 'lany tamin’ny alahelo ny fiainako, ary lany tamin’ny fitarainana ny taona iainako. mihena ny heriko noho ny fahadisoako; mihamalemy ny taolako.'),
  ('6ab25ade3c4518682852ac84', '2026-09-22T10:39:26.427Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:26.427Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 31, 9, 'Jehovah ô, iantrao aho fa mijaly. Reraky ny fahoriana ny masoko sy ny vatako manontolo.', 'jehovah ô, iantrao aho fa mijaly. reraky ny fahoriana ny masoko sy ny vatako manontolo.'),
  ('6ab25ade787a4f7605804ec5', '2026-09-22T10:39:26.890Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:26.890Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 32, 6, 'Izany no mahatonga an’izay rehetra tsy mivadika hivavaka aminao, Dieny mbola hita ianao. Amin’izay dia tsy hahatratra azy na dia ny tondra-drano aza.', 'izany no mahatonga an’izay rehetra tsy mivadika hivavaka aminao, dieny mbola hita ianao. amin’izay dia tsy hahatratra azy na dia ny tondra-drano aza.'),
  ('6ab25ade787a4f7605804ec2', '2026-09-22T10:39:26.890Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:26.890Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 32, 3, 'Rehefa tsy nety niteny aho, dia nihalany ny heriko satria nitaraindraina tontolo andro aho.', 'rehefa tsy nety niteny aho, dia nihalany ny heriko satria nitaraindraina tontolo andro aho.'),
  ('6ab25ade787a4f7605804ec9', '2026-09-22T10:39:26.890Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:26.890Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 32, 10, 'Be ny fijalian’ny ratsy fanahy; Fa manodidina an’izay matoky an’i Jehovah kosa ny fitiavany sy ny tsy fivadihany.', 'be ny fijalian’ny ratsy fanahy; fa manodidina an’izay matoky an’i jehovah kosa ny fitiavany sy ny tsy fivadihany.'),
  ('6ab25ade787a4f7605804ec1', '2026-09-22T10:39:26.890Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:26.890Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 32, 2, 'Sambatra ny olona izay tsy lazain’i Jehovah hoe meloka, Dia ny olona tsy mieritreritra ny hamitaka.', 'sambatra ny olona izay tsy lazain’i jehovah hoe meloka, dia ny olona tsy mieritreritra ny hamitaka.'),
  ('6ab25ade787a4f7605804ec8', '2026-09-22T10:39:26.890Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:26.890Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 32, 9, 'Aza manao hoatran’ny soavaly na ny ramole tsisy saina. Tsy maintsy tazonina amin’ny lamboridy na tady izy mba tsy hitrifana, Amin’izay izy vao hanatona anao.”', 'aza manao hoatran’ny soavaly na ny ramole tsisy saina. tsy maintsy tazonina amin’ny lamboridy na tady izy mba tsy hitrifana, amin’izay izy vao hanatona anao.”'),
  ('6ab25ade787a4f7605804ec6', '2026-09-22T10:39:26.890Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:26.890Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 32, 7, 'Toeram-piafenana ho ahy ianao; Hiaro ahy tsy hijaly ianao. Hataonao manodidina ahy ny horakora-pifalian’ireo nafahanao. ( Sela )', 'toeram-piafenana ho ahy ianao; hiaro ahy tsy hijaly ianao. hataonao manodidina ahy ny horakora-pifalian’ireo nafahanao. ( sela )'),
  ('6ab25ade787a4f7605804eca', '2026-09-22T10:39:26.890Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:26.890Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 32, 11, 'Mifalia amin’i Jehovah ianareo olo-marina, ary miravoravoa; Mihobia ianareo rehetra mahitsy fo.', 'mifalia amin’i jehovah ianareo olo-marina, ary miravoravoa; mihobia ianareo rehetra mahitsy fo.'),
  ('6ab25ade787a4f7605804ec7', '2026-09-22T10:39:26.890Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:26.890Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 32, 8, '“Hataoko izay hahatonga anao ho lalin-tsaina, ary hatoroko anao ny lalana tokony halehanao. Hanoro hevitra anao aho ary hitsinjo anao ny masoko.', '“hataoko izay hahatonga anao ho lalin-tsaina, ary hatoroko anao ny lalana tokony halehanao. hanoro hevitra anao aho ary hitsinjo anao ny masoko.'),
  ('6ab25ade787a4f7605804ec4', '2026-09-22T10:39:26.890Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:26.890Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 32, 5, 'Niaiky ny fahotako teo anatrehanao aho tamin’ny farany; Tsy mba nosarontsaronako ny fahadisoako. Hoy aho: “Hiaiky ny heloko eo anatrehan’i Jehovah aho.” Dia namela ny fahadisoako sy ny fahotako ianao. ( Sela )', 'niaiky ny fahotako teo anatrehanao aho tamin’ny farany; tsy mba nosarontsaronako ny fahadisoako. hoy aho: “hiaiky ny heloko eo anatrehan’i jehovah aho.” dia namela ny fahadisoako sy ny fahotako ianao. ( sela )'),
  ('6ab25ade787a4f7605804ec0', '2026-09-22T10:39:26.890Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:26.890Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 32, 1, 'Sambatra izay voavela ny helony ary voasarona ny fahotany.', 'sambatra izay voavela ny helony ary voasarona ny fahotany.'),
  ('6ab25ade787a4f7605804ec3', '2026-09-22T10:39:26.890Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:26.890Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 32, 4, 'Fa navesatra tamiko ny tananao, na andro na alina. Ritra ny heriko, toy ny rano azon’ny hafanana migaingaina. ( Sela )', 'fa navesatra tamiko ny tananao, na andro na alina. ritra ny heriko, toy ny rano azon’ny hafanana migaingaina. ( sela )'),
  ('6ab25adf43f9452daf18c688', '2026-09-22T10:39:27.398Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:27.398Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 33, 4, 'Fa marina ny tenin’i Jehovah, Ary mendri-pitokisana izy amin’izay rehetra ataony.', 'fa marina ny tenin’i jehovah, ary mendri-pitokisana izy amin’izay rehetra ataony.'),
  ('6ab25adf43f9452daf18c68f', '2026-09-22T10:39:27.398Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:27.398Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 33, 11, 'Ny fikasan’i Jehovah kosa maharitra mandrakizay; Tsy miova ny hevitra ao am-pony, na dia hatramin’ny taranaka fara aman-dimby aza.', 'ny fikasan’i jehovah kosa maharitra mandrakizay; tsy miova ny hevitra ao am-pony, na dia hatramin’ny taranaka fara aman-dimby aza.'),
  ('6ab25adf43f9452daf18c68b', '2026-09-22T10:39:27.398Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:27.398Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 33, 7, 'Angoniny ny rano ao amin’ny ranomasina, ka toy ny hoe misy tohodrano; Ataony ao anaty trano fitehirizana ny rano manonja be.', 'angoniny ny rano ao amin’ny ranomasina, ka toy ny hoe misy tohodrano; ataony ao anaty trano fitehirizana ny rano manonja be.'),
  ('6ab25adf43f9452daf18c689', '2026-09-22T10:39:27.398Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:27.398Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 33, 5, 'Tia rariny sy hitsiny izy. Manenika ny tany ny fitiavan’i Jehovah.', 'tia rariny sy hitsiny izy. manenika ny tany ny fitiavan’i jehovah.'),
  ('6ab25adf43f9452daf18c685', '2026-09-22T10:39:27.398Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:27.398Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 33, 1, 'Mihobia ianareo olo-marina, noho ny zavatra nataon’i Jehovah. Mety raha midera azy ny olona manao izay mahitsy.', 'mihobia ianareo olo-marina, noho ny zavatra nataon’i jehovah. mety raha midera azy ny olona manao izay mahitsy.'),
  ('6ab25adf43f9452daf18c68c', '2026-09-22T10:39:27.398Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:27.398Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 33, 8, 'Aoka ny tany manontolo hatahotra an’i Jehovah. Aoka ny mponina eo amin’ny tany lonaka hanaja azy.', 'aoka ny tany manontolo hatahotra an’i jehovah. aoka ny mponina eo amin’ny tany lonaka hanaja azy.'),
  ('6ab25adf43f9452daf18c68d', '2026-09-22T10:39:27.398Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:27.398Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 33, 9, 'Fa niteny izy, dia nisy izany; Namoaka didy izy, dia lasa mafy orina izany.', 'fa niteny izy, dia nisy izany; namoaka didy izy, dia lasa mafy orina izany.'),
  ('6ab25adf43f9452daf18c690', '2026-09-22T10:39:27.398Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:27.398Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 33, 12, 'Sambatra ny firenena manana an’i Jehovah ho Andriamaniny, Dia ny vahoaka nofidiny ho fananany.', 'sambatra ny firenena manana an’i jehovah ho andriamaniny, dia ny vahoaka nofidiny ho fananany.'),
  ('6ab25adf43f9452daf18c691', '2026-09-22T10:39:27.398Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:27.398Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 33, 13, 'Mitazana avy any an-danitra i Jehovah; Hitany daholo ny zanak’olombelona.', 'mitazana avy any an-danitra i jehovah; hitany daholo ny zanak’olombelona.'),
  ('6ab25adf43f9452daf18c686', '2026-09-22T10:39:27.398Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:27.398Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 33, 2, 'Misaora an’i Jehovah amin’ny harpa; Manaova hira fiderana ho azy amin’ny zavamaneno misy tadiny folo.', 'misaora an’i jehovah amin’ny harpa; manaova hira fiderana ho azy amin’ny zavamaneno misy tadiny folo.'),
  ('6ab25adf43f9452daf18c687', '2026-09-22T10:39:27.398Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:27.398Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 33, 3, 'Mihirà hira vaovao ho azy; Tendreo tsara ny zavamaneno misy tadiny, ary mihobia.', 'mihirà hira vaovao ho azy; tendreo tsara ny zavamaneno misy tadiny, ary mihobia.'),
  ('6ab25adf43f9452daf18c68e', '2026-09-22T10:39:27.398Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:27.398Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 33, 10, 'Ataon’i Jehovah tsy mahomby ny tetik’ireo firenena; Ataony tsy tanteraka ny fikasan’ny vahoaka.', 'ataon’i jehovah tsy mahomby ny tetik’ireo firenena; ataony tsy tanteraka ny fikasan’ny vahoaka.'),
  ('6ab25adf43f9452daf18c68a', '2026-09-22T10:39:27.398Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:27.398Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 33, 6, 'Ny tenin’i Jehovah no nampisy ny lanitra, Ary ny fofonain’ny vavany no nampisy ny zava-drehetra eny.', 'ny tenin’i jehovah no nampisy ny lanitra, ary ny fofonain’ny vavany no nampisy ny zava-drehetra eny.'),
  ('6ab25adf43f9452daf18c698', '2026-09-22T10:39:27.400Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:27.400Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 33, 20, 'Miandry an’i Jehovah isika. Izy no mpanampy antsika sy ampingantsika.', 'miandry an’i jehovah isika. izy no mpanampy antsika sy ampingantsika.'),
  ('6ab25adf43f9452daf18c696', '2026-09-22T10:39:27.400Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:27.400Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 33, 18, 'Ny mason’i Jehovah mitsinjo an’izay matahotra azy, Dia ireo miandry ny hanehoany fitiavana sy tsy fivadihana,', 'ny mason’i jehovah mitsinjo an’izay matahotra azy, dia ireo miandry ny hanehoany fitiavana sy tsy fivadihana,'),
