  ('6ab25adf43f9452daf18c695', '2026-09-22T10:39:27.400Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:27.400Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 33, 17, 'Tsy azo antenaina hahazoana famonjena ny soavaly, Sady tsy azo antoka hoe hahafahana hitsoaka na dia matanjaka be aza.', 'tsy azo antenaina hahazoana famonjena ny soavaly, sady tsy azo antoka hoe hahafahana hitsoaka na dia matanjaka be aza.'),
