  ('6ab25adf43f9452daf18c694', '2026-09-22T10:39:27.400Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:27.400Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 33, 16, 'Tsy misy mpanjaka voavonjin’ny tafika lehibe ananany; Ny lehilahy matanjaka tsy voavonjin’ny hery lehibe ananany.', 'tsy misy mpanjaka voavonjin’ny tafika lehibe ananany; ny lehilahy matanjaka tsy voavonjin’ny hery lehibe ananany.'),
