  ('6ab25adf01a2fef3f9c36363', '2026-09-22T10:39:27.930Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:27.930Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 34, 3, 'Andao hiara-mankalaza an’i Jehovah amiko; Andao isika hiara-manandratra ny anarany. ד [ Daleta ]', 'andao hiara-mankalaza an’i jehovah amiko; andao isika hiara-manandratra ny anarany. ד [ daleta ]'),
  ('6ab25adf01a2fef3f9c36372', '2026-09-22T10:39:27.930Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:27.930Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 34, 18, 'Akaiky an’izay torotoro fo i Jehovah, Ary mamonjy an’izay kivy. ר [ Resa ]', 'akaiky an’izay torotoro fo i jehovah, ary mamonjy an’izay kivy. ר [ resa ]'),
  ('6ab25adf01a2fef3f9c36369', '2026-09-22T10:39:27.930Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:27.930Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 34, 9, 'Matahora an’i Jehovah, ianareo olony masina rehetra, Fa tsy ory na inona na inona izay matahotra azy. כ [ Kafa ]', 'matahora an’i jehovah, ianareo olony masina rehetra, fa tsy ory na inona na inona izay matahotra azy. כ [ kafa ]'),
  ('6ab25adf01a2fef3f9c36370', '2026-09-22T10:39:27.930Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:27.930Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 34, 16, 'Manohitra an’izay manao ratsy kosa i Jehovah, Mba ho voafafa tsy hisy eto an-tany ny fahatsiarovana azy rehetra. צ [ Tsade ]', 'manohitra an’izay manao ratsy kosa i jehovah, mba ho voafafa tsy hisy eto an-tany ny fahatsiarovana azy rehetra. צ [ tsade ]'),
  ('6ab25adf01a2fef3f9c3636a', '2026-09-22T10:39:27.930Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:27.930Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 34, 10, 'Na ny liona tanora matanjaka aza mety ho noana ihany, Fa izay mitady an’i Jehovah kosa tsy mba ho ory zava-tsoa. ל [ Lameda ]', 'na ny liona tanora matanjaka aza mety ho noana ihany, fa izay mitady an’i jehovah kosa tsy mba ho ory zava-tsoa. ל [ lameda ]'),
  ('6ab25ae0c660b23da9bca40c', '2026-09-22T10:39:28.413Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:28.413Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 35, 27, 'Aoka kosa hihoby ireo faly mahita ahy manao ny marina; Enga anie izy ireo hilaza foana hoe: “Hankalazaina anie i Jehovah, izay faly erỳ rehefa miadana ny mpanompony!”', 'aoka kosa hihoby ireo faly mahita ahy manao ny marina; enga anie izy ireo hilaza foana hoe: “hankalazaina anie i jehovah, izay faly erỳ rehefa miadana ny mpanompony!”'),
  ('6ab25ae0c660b23da9bca402', '2026-09-22T10:39:28.413Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:28.413Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 35, 17, 'Jehovah ô, mandra-pahoviana ianao no hitazam-potsiny? Vonjeo amin’ny fanafihan’izy ireo aho, Mba tsy ho azon’ny liona tanora ny aiko sarobidy.', 'jehovah ô, mandra-pahoviana ianao no hitazam-potsiny? vonjeo amin’ny fanafihan’izy ireo aho, mba tsy ho azon’ny liona tanora ny aiko sarobidy.'),
  ('6ab25ae0c660b23da9bca3fc', '2026-09-22T10:39:28.413Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:28.413Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 35, 11, 'Misy vavolombelona ratsy saina tonga hiampanga ahy, Ka manontany zavatra tsy fantatro.', 'misy vavolombelona ratsy saina tonga hiampanga ahy, ka manontany zavatra tsy fantatro.'),
  ('6ab25ae0c660b23da9bca407', '2026-09-22T10:39:28.413Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:28.413Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 35, 22, 'Hitanao izany Jehovah ô, ka aza mangina fotsiny. Jehovah ô, aza mijanona lavitra ahy.', 'hitanao izany jehovah ô, ka aza mangina fotsiny. jehovah ô, aza mijanona lavitra ahy.'),
  ('6ab25ae0c660b23da9bca400', '2026-09-22T10:39:28.413Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:28.413Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 35, 15, 'Rehefa tafintohina anefa aho, dia nifaly sy nivondrona izy ireo; Nivondrona izy ireo ka niafina mba hamely ahy tampoka; Namiravira ahy izy ireo, ary tsy nety nangina.', 'rehefa tafintohina anefa aho, dia nifaly sy nivondrona izy ireo; nivondrona izy ireo ka niafina mba hamely ahy tampoka; namiravira ahy izy ireo, ary tsy nety nangina.'),
  ('6ab25ae0c660b23da9bca3fa', '2026-09-22T10:39:28.413Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:28.413Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 35, 9, 'Fa izaho kosa hifaly noho ny zavatra ataon’i Jehovah; Ho ravoravo aho noho ny asa famonjeny.', 'fa izaho kosa hifaly noho ny zavatra ataon’i jehovah; ho ravoravo aho noho ny asa famonjeny.'),
  ('6ab25ae0c660b23da9bca40d', '2026-09-22T10:39:28.413Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:28.413Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 35, 28, 'Dia hitantara ny fahamarinanao ny lelako, Sady hidera anao tontolo andro.', 'dia hitantara ny fahamarinanao ny lelako, sady hidera anao tontolo andro.'),
  ('6ab25ae0c660b23da9bca408', '2026-09-22T10:39:28.413Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:28.413Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 35, 23, 'Mifohaza ka miarena mba hiaro ahy; Jehovah Andriamanitro ô, arovy aho amin’ilay adiko eny amin’ny fitsarana.', 'mifohaza ka miarena mba hiaro ahy; jehovah andriamanitro ô, arovy aho amin’ilay adiko eny amin’ny fitsarana.'),
  ('6ab25ae0c660b23da9bca406', '2026-09-22T10:39:28.413Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:28.413Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 35, 21, 'Sokafan’izy ireo be ny vavany mba hiampangana ahy, Ka hoy izy ireo: “Tsara ho azy izay! Ny masonay mihitsy no nahita.”', 'sokafan’izy ireo be ny vavany mba hiampangana ahy, ka hoy izy ireo: “tsara ho azy izay! ny masonay mihitsy no nahita.”'),
  ('6ab25ae0c660b23da9bca3f5', '2026-09-22T10:39:28.413Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:28.413Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 35, 4, 'Enga anie ho menatra sy haetry ireo mifofo ny aiko! Enga anie hiverin-dalana sy ho afa-baraka ireo mitetika ny hamotika ahy!', 'enga anie ho menatra sy haetry ireo mifofo ny aiko! enga anie hiverin-dalana sy ho afa-baraka ireo mitetika ny hamotika ahy!'),
  ('6ab25ae0c660b23da9bca405', '2026-09-22T10:39:28.413Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:28.413Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 35, 20, 'Tsy milaza teny mampihavana mantsy izy ireo, Fa manao tetika mamitaka mba hamelezana an’ireo tia fihavanana eto an-tany.', 'tsy milaza teny mampihavana mantsy izy ireo, fa manao tetika mamitaka mba hamelezana an’ireo tia fihavanana eto an-tany.'),
