  ('6ab25ae0c660b23da9bca401', '2026-09-22T10:39:28.413Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:28.413Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 35, 16, 'Maneso sy manambanimbany ahy ireo tsy matahotra an’Andriamanitra; Mihidy vazana izy ireo satria tezitra amiko.', 'maneso sy manambanimbany ahy ireo tsy matahotra an’andriamanitra; mihidy vazana izy ireo satria tezitra amiko.'),
  ('6ab25ae0c660b23da9bca3f9', '2026-09-22T10:39:28.413Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:28.413Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 35, 8, 'Enga anie hisy loza hanjo azy tampoka! Enga anie ka izy ihany no ho voafandrik’ilay harato nafeniny! Enga anie izy ho latsaka ao ka ho ringana!', 'enga anie hisy loza hanjo azy tampoka! enga anie ka izy ihany no ho voafandrik’ilay harato nafeniny! enga anie izy ho latsaka ao ka ho ringana!'),
  ('6ab25ae0c660b23da9bca3f2', '2026-09-22T10:39:28.413Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:28.413Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 35, 1, 'Jehovah ô, arovy amin’ireo manohitra ahy aho; Miadia amin’ireo miady amiko.', 'jehovah ô, arovy amin’ireo manohitra ahy aho; miadia amin’ireo miady amiko.'),
  ('6ab25ae0c660b23da9bca3ff', '2026-09-22T10:39:28.413Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:28.413Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 35, 14, 'Dia toy ireny nisaona namana na rahalahy ireny ny fandehako; Nalahelo be aho ka nitanondrika, toy ny olona misaona an-dreniny.', 'dia toy ireny nisaona namana na rahalahy ireny ny fandehako; nalahelo be aho ka nitanondrika, toy ny olona misaona an-dreniny.'),
  ('6ab25ae0c660b23da9bca40b', '2026-09-22T10:39:28.413Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:28.413Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 35, 26, 'Aoka ho menatra sy ho afa-baraka daholo izy ireo, Dia ireo faly amin’ny fahavoazako. Aoka hitafy henatra sy fahafaham-baraka ireo manambony tena ka manambanimbany ahy.', 'aoka ho menatra sy ho afa-baraka daholo izy ireo, dia ireo faly amin’ny fahavoazako. aoka hitafy henatra sy fahafaham-baraka ireo manambony tena ka manambanimbany ahy.'),
  ('6ab25ae0c660b23da9bca404', '2026-09-22T10:39:28.413Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:28.413Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 35, 19, 'Aza avela ho faly amin’ny fahavoazako ireo manohitra ahy tsy amin’antony; Aza avela hifanao pimaso ireo ratsy saina mankahala ahy tsy amin’antony.', 'aza avela ho faly amin’ny fahavoazako ireo manohitra ahy tsy amin’antony; aza avela hifanao pimaso ireo ratsy saina mankahala ahy tsy amin’antony.'),
  ('6ab25ae0c660b23da9bca3fe', '2026-09-22T10:39:28.413Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:28.413Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 35, 13, 'Rehefa narary anefa izy ireo, dia niakanjo gony aho; Nampijaly tena aho ka nifady hanina. Ary rehefa tsy nivaly ny vavaka nataoko,', 'rehefa narary anefa izy ireo, dia niakanjo gony aho; nampijaly tena aho ka nifady hanina. ary rehefa tsy nivaly ny vavaka nataoko,'),
  ('6ab25ae0c660b23da9bca3f4', '2026-09-22T10:39:28.413Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:28.413Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 35, 3, 'Ingao ny lefonao sy ny famaky fitondranao miady, dia asio ny mpanenjika ahy. Ilazao aho hoe: “Izaho no mpamonjy anao!”', 'ingao ny lefonao sy ny famaky fitondranao miady, dia asio ny mpanenjika ahy. ilazao aho hoe: “izaho no mpamonjy anao!”'),
  ('6ab25ae0c660b23da9bca3fd', '2026-09-22T10:39:28.413Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:28.413Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 35, 12, 'Mamaly ratsy ny soa nataoko izy ireo, Ka hoatran’ny hoe nidonam-pahoriana aho.', 'mamaly ratsy ny soa nataoko izy ireo, ka hoatran’ny hoe nidonam-pahoriana aho.'),
