  ('6ab25ae0c660b23da9bca409', '2026-09-22T10:39:28.413Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:28.413Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 35, 24, 'Tsarao araka izay hitanao fa rariny aho, Jehovah Andriamanitro ô! Aza avela ho faly amin’ny fahavoazako izy ireo.', 'tsarao araka izay hitanao fa rariny aho, jehovah andriamanitro ô! aza avela ho faly amin’ny fahavoazako izy ireo.'),
  ('6ab25ae0c660b23da9bca40a', '2026-09-22T10:39:28.413Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:28.413Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 35, 25, 'Enga anie izy ireo tsy hieritreritra mihitsy hoe: “Tsara ho azy izay! Izay mihitsy no efa nandrasanay.” Enga anie izy ireo tsy hilaza mihitsy hoe: “Nataonay teli-moka izy.”', 'enga anie izy ireo tsy hieritreritra mihitsy hoe: “tsara ho azy izay! izay mihitsy no efa nandrasanay.” enga anie izy ireo tsy hilaza mihitsy hoe: “nataonay teli-moka izy.”'),
  ('6ab25ae0c660b23da9bca3fb', '2026-09-22T10:39:28.413Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:28.413Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 35, 10, 'Hilaza ny taolako rehetra hoe: “Jehovah ô, iza no hoatr’anao? Vonjenao ny tsy misy mpiaro mba tsy ho azon’ny mahery noho izy; Vonjenao ny tsy misy mpiaro sy ny mahantra mba tsy ho azon’ireo mandroba azy.”', 'hilaza ny taolako rehetra hoe: “jehovah ô, iza no hoatr’anao? vonjenao ny tsy misy mpiaro mba tsy ho azon’ny mahery noho izy; vonjenao ny tsy misy mpiaro sy ny mahantra mba tsy ho azon’ireo mandroba azy.”'),
  ('6ab25ae0c660b23da9bca3f7', '2026-09-22T10:39:28.413Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:28.413Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 35, 6, 'Ho maizina sy halama anie ny lalany Rehefa manenjika azy ny anjelin’i Jehovah!', 'ho maizina sy halama anie ny lalany rehefa manenjika azy ny anjelin’i jehovah!'),
