  ('6ab25ae32fa5a4baf5c21c41', '2026-09-22T10:39:31.839Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:31.839Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 42, 9, 'Hoy aho amin’Andriamanitra, ilay harambatoko: “Nahoana ianao no manadino ahy? Nahoana aho no tsy maintsy mandehandeha amin’alahelo noho izaho ampijalin’ny fahavaloko?”', 'hoy aho amin’andriamanitra, ilay harambatoko: “nahoana ianao no manadino ahy? nahoana aho no tsy maintsy mandehandeha amin’alahelo noho izaho ampijalin’ny fahavaloko?”'),
  ('6ab25ae32fa5a4baf5c21c3d', '2026-09-22T10:39:31.839Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:31.839Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 42, 5, 'Nahoana re aho no dia mamoy fo e? Nahoana aho no mikorontan-tsaina? Hiandry an’Andriamanitra aho, Satria mbola hidera azy, fa izy no Mpamonjy Lehibe nanavotra ahy.', 'nahoana re aho no dia mamoy fo e? nahoana aho no mikorontan-tsaina? hiandry an’andriamanitra aho, satria mbola hidera azy, fa izy no mpamonjy lehibe nanavotra ahy.'),
  ('6ab25ae32fa5a4baf5c21c3c', '2026-09-22T10:39:31.839Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:31.839Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 42, 4, 'Mahatsiaro ny lasa aho, ka avoakako daholo ny ato am-poko. Niara-dia tamin’ny maro mantsy aho taloha; Fanaoko ny nandeha moramora teo alohan’ny vahoaka, nankany an-tranon’Andriamanitra. Nihorakoraka sy falifaly ary nisaotra an’Andriamanitra izahay. Vahoaka be nanao fety izahay, tamin’izany.', 'mahatsiaro ny lasa aho, ka avoakako daholo ny ato am-poko. niara-dia tamin’ny maro mantsy aho taloha; fanaoko ny nandeha moramora teo alohan’ny vahoaka, nankany an-tranon’andriamanitra. nihorakoraka sy falifaly ary nisaotra an’andriamanitra izahay. vahoaka be nanao fety izahay, tamin’izany.'),
  ('6ab25ae32fa5a4baf5c21c3a', '2026-09-22T10:39:31.839Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:31.839Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 42, 2, 'Mangetaheta mafy an’Andriamanitra aho, dia ilay Andriamanitra velona. Mba rahoviana re aho no hiseho eo anatrehan’Andriamanitra e?', 'mangetaheta mafy an’andriamanitra aho, dia ilay andriamanitra velona. mba rahoviana re aho no hiseho eo anatrehan’andriamanitra e?'),
