  ('6ab25ae40ab698cff019e079', '2026-09-22T10:39:32.402Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:32.402Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 43, 3, 'Alefaso ny hazavanao sy ny fahamarinanao. Hitarika ahy anie ireny; Enga anie ireny hitondra ahy ho any amin’ny tendrombohitrao masina sy ny tranolainao be voninahitra!', 'alefaso ny hazavanao sy ny fahamarinanao. hitarika ahy anie ireny; enga anie ireny hitondra ahy ho any amin’ny tendrombohitrao masina sy ny tranolainao be voninahitra!'),
  ('6ab25ae40ab698cff019e078', '2026-09-22T10:39:32.402Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:32.402Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 43, 2, 'Fa ianao no Andriamanitro, fiarovana mafy ho ahy. Nahoana ianao no manary ahy? Nahoana aho no tsy maintsy mandehandeha amin’alahelo noho izaho ampijalin’ny fahavalo?', 'fa ianao no andriamanitro, fiarovana mafy ho ahy. nahoana ianao no manary ahy? nahoana aho no tsy maintsy mandehandeha amin’alahelo noho izaho ampijalin’ny fahavalo?'),
  ('6ab25ae40ab698cff019e077', '2026-09-22T10:39:32.402Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:32.402Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 43, 1, 'Tsarao aho, Andriamanitra ô! Arovy aho amin’ilay adiko eny amin’ny fitsarana, izay ifanaovako amin’ny firenena mpivadika. Afaho amin’ny olona mpamitaka sy manao ny tsy marina aho.', 'tsarao aho, andriamanitra ô! arovy aho amin’ilay adiko eny amin’ny fitsarana, izay ifanaovako amin’ny firenena mpivadika. afaho amin’ny olona mpamitaka sy manao ny tsy marina aho.'),
  ('6ab25ae40ab698cff019e07a', '2026-09-22T10:39:32.402Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:32.402Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 43, 4, 'Dia hankeo amin’ny alitaran’Andriamanitra aho, Dia any amin’Andriamanitra, ilay manome fifaliana be ho ahy. Ary hidera anao amin’ny harpa aho Andriamanitra ô, eny, ry Andriamanitro.', 'dia hankeo amin’ny alitaran’andriamanitra aho, dia any amin’andriamanitra, ilay manome fifaliana be ho ahy. ary hidera anao amin’ny harpa aho andriamanitra ô, eny, ry andriamanitro.'),
  ('6ab25ae4921adf6b0c93a522', '2026-09-22T10:39:32.847Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:32.847Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 44, 1, 'Andriamanitra ô, ny sofinay no nandre, Ny razambenay no nitantara taminay Ny zavatra nataonao tamin’ny androny, Tamin’ny andro fahiny.', 'andriamanitra ô, ny sofinay no nandre, ny razambenay no nitantara taminay ny zavatra nataonao tamin’ny androny, tamin’ny andro fahiny.'),
  ('6ab25ae4921adf6b0c93a524', '2026-09-22T10:39:32.847Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:32.847Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 44, 3, 'Tsy ny sabany no nahazoany an’ilay tany, Ary tsy ny sandriny no nahatonga azy ireo handresy, Fa ny tananao ankavanana sy ny sandrinao ary ny fahazavan’ny tarehinao, Satria tianao izy ireo.', 'tsy ny sabany no nahazoany an’ilay tany, ary tsy ny sandriny no nahatonga azy ireo handresy, fa ny tananao ankavanana sy ny sandrinao ary ny fahazavan’ny tarehinao, satria tianao izy ireo.'),
  ('6ab25ae4921adf6b0c93a523', '2026-09-22T10:39:32.847Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:32.847Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 44, 2, 'Noroahinao tamin’ny tananao ireo firenena, Ary napetrakao teo amin’izay nisy azy ireny ny razambenay. Notorotoroinao ireo firenena ka noroahinao.', 'noroahinao tamin’ny tananao ireo firenena, ary napetrakao teo amin’izay nisy azy ireny ny razambenay. notorotoroinao ireo firenena ka noroahinao.'),
