  ('6ab25ae4921adf6b0c93a530', '2026-09-22T10:39:32.848Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:32.848Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 44, 15, 'Mahatsiaro ho afa-baraka aho tontolo andro, Sady menatra be,', 'mahatsiaro ho afa-baraka aho tontolo andro, sady menatra be,'),
  ('6ab25ae4921adf6b0c93a535', '2026-09-22T10:39:32.848Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:32.848Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 44, 20, 'Raha nanadino ny anaran’Andriamanitray izahay, Na namelatra ny tananay mba hivavaka tamin’andriamani-kafa,', 'raha nanadino ny anaran’andriamanitray izahay, na namelatra ny tananay mba hivavaka tamin’andriamani-kafa,'),
  ('6ab25ae4921adf6b0c93a526', '2026-09-22T10:39:32.848Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:32.848Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 44, 5, 'Noho ny herinao, dia ho vitanay ny hampihemotra ny fahavalonay. Amin’ny anaranao no hanosihosenay an’izay manohitra anay.', 'noho ny herinao, dia ho vitanay ny hampihemotra ny fahavalonay. amin’ny anaranao no hanosihosenay an’izay manohitra anay.'),
  ('6ab25ae4921adf6b0c93a52d', '2026-09-22T10:39:32.848Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:32.848Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 44, 12, 'Ataonao varo-boba ny vahoakanao, Ka tsy maka tombony amin’ilay izy ianao na kely aza.', 'ataonao varo-boba ny vahoakanao, ka tsy maka tombony amin’ilay izy ianao na kely aza.'),
  ('6ab25ae4921adf6b0c93a528', '2026-09-22T10:39:32.848Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:32.848Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 44, 7, 'Fa ianao no namonjy anay tamin’ny fahavalonay, Sy nampahamenatra an’ireo mankahala anay.', 'fa ianao no namonjy anay tamin’ny fahavalonay, sy nampahamenatra an’ireo mankahala anay.'),
  ('6ab25ae4921adf6b0c93a539', '2026-09-22T10:39:32.848Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:32.848Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 44, 24, 'Nahoana ianao no mihodina tsy hijery anay? Nahoana ianao no manadino ny fijalianay sy ny fahorianay?', 'nahoana ianao no mihodina tsy hijery anay? nahoana ianao no manadino ny fijalianay sy ny fahorianay?'),
  ('6ab25ae4921adf6b0c93a537', '2026-09-22T10:39:32.848Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:32.848Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 44, 22, 'Hoatran’ny hoe vonoina ho faty izahay isan’andro noho ny aminao; Toy ny ondry hovonoina no fiheverana anay.', 'hoatran’ny hoe vonoina ho faty izahay isan’andro noho ny aminao; toy ny ondry hovonoina no fiheverana anay.'),
  ('6ab25ae4921adf6b0c93a527', '2026-09-22T10:39:32.848Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:32.848Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 44, 6, 'Fa tsy mba miantehitra amin’ny tsipìkako aho, Ary tsy afaka mamonjy ahy ny sabatro.', 'fa tsy mba miantehitra amin’ny tsipìkako aho, ary tsy afaka mamonjy ahy ny sabatro.'),
  ('6ab25ae4921adf6b0c93a529', '2026-09-22T10:39:32.848Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:32.848Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 44, 8, 'Andriamanitra ô, ianao no hoderainay tontolo andro, Ary hisaoranay mandrakizay ny anaranao. ( Sela )', 'andriamanitra ô, ianao no hoderainay tontolo andro, ary hisaoranay mandrakizay ny anaranao. ( sela )'),
  ('6ab25ae4921adf6b0c93a538', '2026-09-22T10:39:32.848Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:32.848Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 44, 23, 'Miarena! Nahoana ianao no mbola matory ihany, Jehovah ô? Mifohaza! Aza ariana mandrakizay izahay.', 'miarena! nahoana ianao no mbola matory ihany, jehovah ô? mifohaza! aza ariana mandrakizay izahay.'),
  ('6ab25ae4921adf6b0c93a52a', '2026-09-22T10:39:32.848Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:32.848Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 44, 9, 'Izao anefa ianao nanary anay, ary nanala baraka anay, Sady tsy miaraka amin’ny tafikay.', 'izao anefa ianao nanary anay, ary nanala baraka anay, sady tsy miaraka amin’ny tafikay.'),
  ('6ab25ae5198a5d78fd057c69', '2026-09-22T10:39:33.517Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:33.517Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 45, 17, 'Hampahafantatra ny anaranao amin’ny taranaka fara aman-dimby aho, Ka hidera anao mandrakizay mandrakizay ireo firenena.', 'hampahafantatra ny anaranao amin’ny taranaka fara aman-dimby aho, ka hidera anao mandrakizay mandrakizay ireo firenena.'),
  ('6ab25ae5198a5d78fd057c59', '2026-09-22T10:39:33.517Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:33.517Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 45, 1, 'Mientanentana be ny foko noho ny vaovao mahafinaritra henoko. Hoy aho: “Momba ny mpanjaka ny hira ataoko.” Enga anie ny lelako ho toy ny penina eny an-tanan’ny mpanao dika soratra tena mahay!', 'mientanentana be ny foko noho ny vaovao mahafinaritra henoko. hoy aho: “momba ny mpanjaka ny hira ataoko.” enga anie ny lelako ho toy ny penina eny an-tanan’ny mpanao dika soratra tena mahay!'),
  ('6ab25ae5198a5d78fd057c65', '2026-09-22T10:39:33.517Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:33.517Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 45, 13, 'Tena be voninahitra ilay zanakavavin’ny mpanjaka, ao an-dapa. Voaravaka volamena ny akanjony.', 'tena be voninahitra ilay zanakavavin’ny mpanjaka, ao an-dapa. voaravaka volamena ny akanjony.'),
  ('6ab25ae5198a5d78fd057c68', '2026-09-22T10:39:33.517Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:33.517Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 45, 16, 'Hisolo toerana an’ireo razambenao ny zanakao. Hotendrenao ho andriana manerana ny tany izy ireo.', 'hisolo toerana an’ireo razambenao ny zanakao. hotendrenao ho andriana manerana ny tany izy ireo.'),
  ('6ab25ae5198a5d78fd057c64', '2026-09-22T10:39:33.517Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:33.517Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 45, 12, 'Ho tonga ny zanakavavin’i Tyro sady hitondra fanomezana; Hila sitraka aminao ireo lehilahy mpanankarena indrindra.', 'ho tonga ny zanakavavin’i tyro sady hitondra fanomezana; hila sitraka aminao ireo lehilahy mpanankarena indrindra.'),
  ('6ab25ae5198a5d78fd057c60', '2026-09-22T10:39:33.517Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:33.517Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 45, 8, 'Manitra miora sy aloesy ary kasia ny akanjonao rehetra; Mampifaly anao ny feon’ny zavamaneno avy ao amin’ny lapa mirenty voaravaka ivoara.', 'manitra miora sy aloesy ary kasia ny akanjonao rehetra; mampifaly anao ny feon’ny zavamaneno avy ao amin’ny lapa mirenty voaravaka ivoara.'),
  ('6ab25ae5198a5d78fd057c5d', '2026-09-22T10:39:33.517Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:33.517Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 45, 5, 'Firenena maro no lavo eo anatrehanao, satria maranitra ny zana-tsipìkanao; Mitsatoka eo amin’ny fon’ny fahavalon’ny mpanjaka ireny.', 'firenena maro no lavo eo anatrehanao, satria maranitra ny zana-tsipìkanao; mitsatoka eo amin’ny fon’ny fahavalon’ny mpanjaka ireny.'),
  ('6ab25ae5198a5d78fd057c5c', '2026-09-22T10:39:33.517Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:33.517Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 45, 4, 'Asehoy hoe be voninahitra ianao, ary mandrosoa mba handresy! Taingeno ny soavalinao ary miadia mba hisian’ny fahamarinana sy ny fanetren-tena ary ny fahitsiana, Ary ny tananao ankavanana hahavita zavatra mahagaga.', 'asehoy hoe be voninahitra ianao, ary mandrosoa mba handresy! taingeno ny soavalinao ary miadia mba hisian’ny fahamarinana sy ny fanetren-tena ary ny fahitsiana, ary ny tananao ankavanana hahavita zavatra mahagaga.'),
  ('6ab25ae5198a5d78fd057c66', '2026-09-22T10:39:33.517Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:33.517Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 45, 14, 'Hoentina eo amin’ny mpanjaka izy ka hanao akanjo tsara tenona. Entina eo anatrehanao ireo virjiny namany manotrona azy.', 'hoentina eo amin’ny mpanjaka izy ka hanao akanjo tsara tenona. entina eo anatrehanao ireo virjiny namany manotrona azy.'),
  ('6ab25ae5198a5d78fd057c61', '2026-09-22T10:39:33.517Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:33.517Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 45, 9, 'Anisan’ny vehivavy ao an-dapanao ny zanakavavin’ireo mpanjaka. Mijoro eo ankavananao ny vadin’ny mpanjaka, sady miravaka volamena avy any Ofira.', 'anisan’ny vehivavy ao an-dapanao ny zanakavavin’ireo mpanjaka. mijoro eo ankavananao ny vadin’ny mpanjaka, sady miravaka volamena avy any ofira.'),
  ('6ab25ae5198a5d78fd057c67', '2026-09-22T10:39:33.517Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:33.517Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 45, 15, 'Ao anatin’ny fifaliana sy firavoravoana no hitondrana azy ireo; Hiditra ao an-dapan’ny mpanjaka izy ireo.', 'ao anatin’ny fifaliana sy firavoravoana no hitondrana azy ireo; hiditra ao an-dapan’ny mpanjaka izy ireo.'),
  ('6ab25ae5198a5d78fd057c5f', '2026-09-22T10:39:33.517Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:33.517Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 45, 7, 'Tianao ny fahamarinana, fa halanao kosa ny faharatsiana. Izany no nahatonga an’Andriamanitra, ilay Andriamanitrao, hanosotra anao menaka mahafalifaly mihoatra noho ireo namanao.', 'tianao ny fahamarinana, fa halanao kosa ny faharatsiana. izany no nahatonga an’andriamanitra, ilay andriamanitrao, hanosotra anao menaka mahafalifaly mihoatra noho ireo namanao.'),
  ('6ab25ae5198a5d78fd057c5b', '2026-09-22T10:39:33.517Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:33.517Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 45, 3, 'Ataovy eo amin’ny andilanao ny sabatrao, ry ilay mahery ô! Misikìna haja amam-boninahitra.', 'ataovy eo amin’ny andilanao ny sabatrao, ry ilay mahery ô! misikìna haja amam-boninahitra.'),
  ('6ab25ae5198a5d78fd057c5a', '2026-09-22T10:39:33.517Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:33.517Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 45, 2, 'Ianao no tsara tarehy indrindra amin’ny zanak’olombelona, Ary mahafinaritra erỳ ny teny avy amin’ny molotrao! Izany no antony itahian’Andriamanitra anao mandrakizay.', 'ianao no tsara tarehy indrindra amin’ny zanak’olombelona, ary mahafinaritra erỳ ny teny avy amin’ny molotrao! izany no antony itahian’andriamanitra anao mandrakizay.'),
  ('6ab25ae5198a5d78fd057c63', '2026-09-22T10:39:33.517Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:33.517Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 45, 11, 'Tsy ho andrin’ny mpanjaka ny hahita ny hatsaran-tarehinao, Fa izy no tomponao, Koa miondreha eo anatrehany.', 'tsy ho andrin’ny mpanjaka ny hahita ny hatsaran-tarehinao, fa izy no tomponao, koa miondreha eo anatrehany.'),
  ('6ab25ae5198a5d78fd057c62', '2026-09-22T10:39:33.517Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:33.517Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 45, 10, 'Henoy tsara, ry zanakavavy ô, ka aoka ianao hanongilan-tsofina; Hadinoy ny firenenao sy ny ankohonan-drainao.', 'henoy tsara, ry zanakavavy ô, ka aoka ianao hanongilan-tsofina; hadinoy ny firenenao sy ny ankohonan-drainao.'),
  ('6ab25ae5198a5d78fd057c5e', '2026-09-22T10:39:33.517Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:33.517Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 45, 6, 'Andriamanitra no seza fiandriananao mandrakizay mandrakizay; Ny tehin’ny fanjakanao dia tehina mampanjaka ny rariny.', 'andriamanitra no seza fiandriananao mandrakizay mandrakizay; ny tehin’ny fanjakanao dia tehina mampanjaka ny rariny.'),
  ('6ab25ae52e0af685080d4f14', '2026-09-22T10:39:33.980Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:33.980Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 46, 9, 'Ataony tsy misy ady intsony eran-tany. Tapatapahiny ny tsipìka, ary potipotehiny ny lefona; Dorany ny kalesy fitondran’ny miaramila miady.', 'ataony tsy misy ady intsony eran-tany. tapatapahiny ny tsipìka, ary potipotehiny ny lefona; dorany ny kalesy fitondran’ny miaramila miady.'),
  ('6ab25ae52e0af685080d4f0e', '2026-09-22T10:39:33.980Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:33.980Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 46, 3, 'Na midoboka mafy sy mandroatra aza ny ranomasina, Ary na mihovotrovotra aza ny tendrombohitra noho ny ranomasina misamboaravoara. ( Sela )', 'na midoboka mafy sy mandroatra aza ny ranomasina, ary na mihovotrovotra aza ny tendrombohitra noho ny ranomasina misamboaravoara. ( sela )'),
  ('6ab25ae52e0af685080d4f0d', '2026-09-22T10:39:33.980Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:33.980Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 46, 2, 'Koa tsy hatahotra isika, na miova aza ny tany, Na mianjera any amin’ny ranomasina lalina aza ny tendrombohitra,', 'koa tsy hatahotra isika, na miova aza ny tany, na mianjera any amin’ny ranomasina lalina aza ny tendrombohitra,');
INSERT INTO "bible_verses" ("id", "created_date", "updated_date", "created_by_id", "created_by", "translation", "book", "bookOrder", "chapter", "verse", "text", "normalizedText") VALUES
  ('6ab25ae52e0af685080d4f16', '2026-09-22T10:39:33.980Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:33.980Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 46, 11, 'Momba antsika i Jehovah Tompon’ny tafika; Fialofana azo antoka ho antsika ilay Andriamanitr’i Jakoba. ( Sela )', 'momba antsika i jehovah tompon’ny tafika; fialofana azo antoka ho antsika ilay andriamanitr’i jakoba. ( sela )'),
  ('6ab25ae52e0af685080d4f13', '2026-09-22T10:39:33.980Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:33.980Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 46, 8, 'Avia hijery ny asan’i Jehovah, Dia ny zava-mahagaga ataony eto an-tany.', 'avia hijery ny asan’i jehovah, dia ny zava-mahagaga ataony eto an-tany.'),
  ('6ab25ae52e0af685080d4f12', '2026-09-22T10:39:33.980Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:33.980Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 46, 7, 'Momba antsika i Jehovah Tompon’ny tafika. Fialofana azo antoka ho antsika ilay Andriamanitr’i Jakoba. ( Sela )', 'momba antsika i jehovah tompon’ny tafika. fialofana azo antoka ho antsika ilay andriamanitr’i jakoba. ( sela )'),
  ('6ab25ae52e0af685080d4f11', '2026-09-22T10:39:33.980Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:33.980Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 46, 6, 'Nitabataba be ireo firenena, ary naongana ireo fanjakana; Nampiaka-peo Izy, ka nitsonika ny tany.', 'nitabataba be ireo firenena, ary naongana ireo fanjakana; nampiaka-peo izy, ka nitsonika ny tany.'),
  ('6ab25ae52e0af685080d4f0c', '2026-09-22T10:39:33.980Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:33.980Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 46, 1, 'Fialofana sy hery ho antsika Andriamanitra. Vonona hanampy foana izy amin’ny fotoan-tsarotra.', 'fialofana sy hery ho antsika andriamanitra. vonona hanampy foana izy amin’ny fotoan-tsarotra.'),
  ('6ab25ae52e0af685080d4f15', '2026-09-22T10:39:33.980Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:33.980Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 46, 10, '“Ekeo hoe resy ianareo, ary fantaro fa izaho no Andriamanitra. Hisandratra eo amin’ireo firenena aho, Ary hisandratra eran-tany.”', '“ekeo hoe resy ianareo, ary fantaro fa izaho no andriamanitra. hisandratra eo amin’ireo firenena aho, ary hisandratra eran-tany.”'),
  ('6ab25ae52e0af685080d4f0f', '2026-09-22T10:39:33.980Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:33.980Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 46, 4, 'Misy renirano misy sampany maro mampifaly ny tanànan’Andriamanitra, Dia ilay tranolay be voninahitra sy masina, izay an’ny Avo Indrindra.', 'misy renirano misy sampany maro mampifaly ny tanànan’andriamanitra, dia ilay tranolay be voninahitra sy masina, izay an’ny avo indrindra.'),
  ('6ab25ae52e0af685080d4f10', '2026-09-22T10:39:33.980Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:33.980Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 46, 5, 'Ao amin’ilay tanàna Andriamanitra, ka tsy azo ravana izy io. Hamonjy azy io Andriamanitra raha vao mangiran-dratsy ny andro.', 'ao amin’ilay tanàna andriamanitra, ka tsy azo ravana izy io. hamonjy azy io andriamanitra raha vao mangiran-dratsy ny andro.'),
  ('6ab25ae69636ae61915773de', '2026-09-22T10:39:34.598Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:34.598Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 47, 1, 'Mitehafa ianareo, ry firenena rehetra. Manaova horakora-pandresena ho an’Andriamanitra sady mihobia.', 'mitehafa ianareo, ry firenena rehetra. manaova horakora-pandresena ho an’andriamanitra sady mihobia.'),
  ('6ab25ae69636ae61915773e4', '2026-09-22T10:39:34.599Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:34.599Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 47, 7, 'Fa Mpanjakan’ny tany manontolo Andriamanitra; Manaova hira fiderana, ary aoka ho hita hoe olona misaina ianareo.', 'fa mpanjakan’ny tany manontolo andriamanitra; manaova hira fiderana, ary aoka ho hita hoe olona misaina ianareo.'),
  ('6ab25ae69636ae61915773e2', '2026-09-22T10:39:34.599Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:34.599Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 47, 5, 'Miakatra any amin’ny toerany Andriamanitra raha mbola mihorakoraka sy faly ny olona; Miakatra any amin’ny toerany i Jehovah ary arahina feon’anjombona izany.', 'miakatra any amin’ny toerany andriamanitra raha mbola mihorakoraka sy faly ny olona; miakatra any amin’ny toerany i jehovah ary arahina feon’anjombona izany.'),
  ('6ab25ae69636ae61915773e0', '2026-09-22T10:39:34.599Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:34.599Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 47, 3, 'Ataony manaiky antsika ny vahoaka; Ataony ao ambany tongotsika ireo firenena.', 'ataony manaiky antsika ny vahoaka; ataony ao ambany tongotsika ireo firenena.'),
  ('6ab25ae69636ae61915773e3', '2026-09-22T10:39:34.599Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:34.599Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 47, 6, 'Manaova hira fiderana ho an’Andriamanitra. Manaova hira fiderana. Manaova hira fiderana ho an’ny Mpanjakantsika. Manaova hira fiderana.', 'manaova hira fiderana ho an’andriamanitra. manaova hira fiderana. manaova hira fiderana ho an’ny mpanjakantsika. manaova hira fiderana.'),
  ('6ab25ae69636ae61915773e6', '2026-09-22T10:39:34.599Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:34.599Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 47, 9, 'Mivondrona ny mpitarika vahoaka, Miaraka amin’ny vahoakan’ilay Andriamanitr’i Abrahama. Fa an’Andriamanitra ireo mpitondra ny tany. Misandratra avo dia avo Izy.', 'mivondrona ny mpitarika vahoaka, miaraka amin’ny vahoakan’ilay andriamanitr’i abrahama. fa an’andriamanitra ireo mpitondra ny tany. misandratra avo dia avo izy.'),
  ('6ab25ae69636ae61915773df', '2026-09-22T10:39:34.599Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:34.599Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 47, 2, 'Fa mendrika hatahorana i Jehovah, ilay Avo Indrindra; Izy ilay Mpanjaka lehibe manerana ny tany manontolo.', 'fa mendrika hatahorana i jehovah, ilay avo indrindra; izy ilay mpanjaka lehibe manerana ny tany manontolo.'),
  ('6ab25ae69636ae61915773e5', '2026-09-22T10:39:34.599Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:34.599Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 47, 8, 'Lasa Mpanjaka eo amin’ireo firenena Andriamanitra. Mipetraka eo amin’ny seza fiandrianany masina Andriamanitra.', 'lasa mpanjaka eo amin’ireo firenena andriamanitra. mipetraka eo amin’ny seza fiandrianany masina andriamanitra.'),
  ('6ab25ae69636ae61915773e1', '2026-09-22T10:39:34.599Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:34.599Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 47, 4, 'Mifidy lova ho antsika izy, Dia ilay lova reharehan’i Jakoba, izay olona tiany. ( Sela )', 'mifidy lova ho antsika izy, dia ilay lova reharehan’i jakoba, izay olona tiany. ( sela )'),
  ('6ab25ae84c412654a219fc5b', '2026-09-22T10:39:36.761Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:36.761Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 48, 12, 'Mandehana mihodidina an’i Ziona; mandehana manodidina azy; Isao ny tilikambony.', 'mandehana mihodidina an’i ziona; mandehana manodidina azy; isao ny tilikambony.'),
  ('6ab25ae84c412654a219fc5d', '2026-09-22T10:39:36.761Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:36.761Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 48, 14, 'Fa io Andriamanitra io no Andriamanitsika mandrakizay mandrakizay. Hitari-dalana antsika mandrakizay izy.', 'fa io andriamanitra io no andriamanitsika mandrakizay mandrakizay. hitari-dalana antsika mandrakizay izy.'),
  ('6ab25ae84c412654a219fc52', '2026-09-22T10:39:36.761Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:36.761Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 48, 3, 'Tao amin’ireo tilikambony voaro mafy No nampahafantaran’Andriamanitra fa fialofana azo antoka izy.', 'tao amin’ireo tilikambony voaro mafy no nampahafantaran’andriamanitra fa fialofana azo antoka izy.'),
  ('6ab25ae84c412654a219fc57', '2026-09-22T10:39:36.761Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:36.761Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 48, 8, 'Ny zavatra henontsika mihitsy izao no hitan’ny masontsika, Ao amin’ny tanànan’i Jehovah Tompon’ny tafika, dia ny tanànan’Andriamanitsika. Hampiorina mafy azy io mandrakizay Andriamanitra. ( Sela )', 'ny zavatra henontsika mihitsy izao no hitan’ny masontsika, ao amin’ny tanànan’i jehovah tompon’ny tafika, dia ny tanànan’andriamanitsika. hampiorina mafy azy io mandrakizay andriamanitra. ( sela )'),
  ('6ab25ae84c412654a219fc54', '2026-09-22T10:39:36.761Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:36.761Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 48, 5, 'Rehefa nahita an’ilay tanàna izy ireo, dia gaga be. Nihorohoro izy ireo ka nikoropaka nandositra.', 'rehefa nahita an’ilay tanàna izy ireo, dia gaga be. nihorohoro izy ireo ka nikoropaka nandositra.'),
  ('6ab25ae84c412654a219fc5c', '2026-09-22T10:39:36.761Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:36.761Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 48, 13, 'Diniho tsara ny dongon-tany miaro azy. Jereo tsara ny tilikambo voaro mafy eo aminy, Mba hisy hotantarainareo amin’ny taranaka any aoriana.', 'diniho tsara ny dongon-tany miaro azy. jereo tsara ny tilikambo voaro mafy eo aminy, mba hisy hotantarainareo amin’ny taranaka any aoriana.'),
  ('6ab25ae84c412654a219fc55', '2026-09-22T10:39:36.761Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:36.761Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 48, 6, 'Tora-kovitra izy ireo tany, Nijalijaly toy ny vehivavy efa ho teraka.', 'tora-kovitra izy ireo tany, nijalijaly toy ny vehivavy efa ho teraka.'),
  ('6ab25ae84c412654a219fc5a', '2026-09-22T10:39:36.761Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:36.761Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 48, 11, 'Enga anie hifaly ny Tendrombohitra Ziona! Enga anie ireo tanànan’i Joda hiravoravo noho ny didim-pitsaranao!', 'enga anie hifaly ny tendrombohitra ziona! enga anie ireo tanànan’i joda hiravoravo noho ny didim-pitsaranao!'),
  ('6ab25ae84c412654a219fc59', '2026-09-22T10:39:36.761Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:36.761Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 48, 10, 'Toy ny anaranao, Andriamanitra ô, ny fiderana anao. Tonga hatrany amin’ny faran’ny tany izany. Feno fahamarinana ny tananao ankavanana.', 'toy ny anaranao, andriamanitra ô, ny fiderana anao. tonga hatrany amin’ny faran’ny tany izany. feno fahamarinana ny tananao ankavanana.'),
  ('6ab25ae84c412654a219fc51', '2026-09-22T10:39:36.761Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:36.761Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 48, 2, 'Avo be sady tsara tarehy erỳ ilay fifalian’ny tany manontolo, Dia ny Tendrombohitra Ziona any amin’ny farany avaratra, Any amin’ny tanànan’ilay Mpanjaka Be Voninahitra.', 'avo be sady tsara tarehy erỳ ilay fifalian’ny tany manontolo, dia ny tendrombohitra ziona any amin’ny farany avaratra, any amin’ny tanànan’ilay mpanjaka be voninahitra.'),
  ('6ab25ae84c412654a219fc50', '2026-09-22T10:39:36.761Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:36.761Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 48, 1, 'Tena miavaka i Jehovah, ka izy no mendrika hoderaina indrindra Ao amin’ny tanànan’Andriamanitsika, ao amin’ny tendrombohiny masina.', 'tena miavaka i jehovah, ka izy no mendrika hoderaina indrindra ao amin’ny tanànan’andriamanitsika, ao amin’ny tendrombohiny masina.'),
  ('6ab25ae84c412654a219fc56', '2026-09-22T10:39:36.761Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:36.761Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 48, 7, 'Nopotehinao tamin’ny rivotra avy any atsinanana ny sambon’i Tarsisy ka rendrika.', 'nopotehinao tamin’ny rivotra avy any atsinanana ny sambon’i tarsisy ka rendrika.'),
  ('6ab25ae84c412654a219fc53', '2026-09-22T10:39:36.761Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:36.761Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 48, 4, 'Fa nivondrona ireo mpanjaka; Niara-nandroso izy ireo.', 'fa nivondrona ireo mpanjaka; niara-nandroso izy ireo.'),
  ('6ab25ae84c412654a219fc58', '2026-09-22T10:39:36.761Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:36.761Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 48, 9, 'Andriamanitra ô, misaintsaina ny fitiavanao sy ny tsy fivadihanao izahay, Ao amin’ny tempolinao.', 'andriamanitra ô, misaintsaina ny fitiavanao sy ny tsy fivadihanao izahay, ao amin’ny tempolinao.'),
  ('6ab25af679acba131f3f8a42', '2026-09-22T10:39:50.669Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:50.669Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 72, 1, 'Andriamanitra ô, omeo ny mpanjaka ny didim-pitsaranao, Ary ampahafantaro ny zanaky ny mpanjaka ny fitiavanao ny rariny.', 'andriamanitra ô, omeo ny mpanjaka ny didim-pitsaranao, ary ampahafantaro ny zanaky ny mpanjaka ny fitiavanao ny rariny.'),
  ('6ab25af679acba131f3f8a4a', '2026-09-22T10:39:50.669Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:50.669Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 72, 9, 'Hiankohoka eo anatrehany ny mponina any an-tany efitra, Ary hilelaka vovoka ny fahavalony.', 'hiankohoka eo anatrehany ny mponina any an-tany efitra, ary hilelaka vovoka ny fahavalony.'),
  ('6ab25af679acba131f3f8a45', '2026-09-22T10:39:50.669Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:50.669Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 72, 4, 'Aoka izy hiaro ny madinika eo amin’ny vahoaka, Sy hamonjy ny zanaky ny mahantra, Ary hanorotoro ny mpanambaka.', 'aoka izy hiaro ny madinika eo amin’ny vahoaka, sy hamonjy ny zanaky ny mahantra, ary hanorotoro ny mpanambaka.'),
  ('6ab25af679acba131f3f8a50', '2026-09-22T10:39:50.669Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:50.669Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 72, 15, 'Ho ela velona anie izy, ka homena volamena avy any Sheba. Enga anie ka hisy hivavaka ho azy foana, Ary hotahina tontolo andro anie izy!', 'ho ela velona anie izy, ka homena volamena avy any sheba. enga anie ka hisy hivavaka ho azy foana, ary hotahina tontolo andro anie izy!'),
  ('6ab25af679acba131f3f8a4f', '2026-09-22T10:39:50.669Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:50.669Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 72, 14, 'Hanafaka azy ireo amin’ny fampahoriana sy ny herisetra izy, Ary ho sarobidy eo imasony ny ran’izy ireo.', 'hanafaka azy ireo amin’ny fampahoriana sy ny herisetra izy, ary ho sarobidy eo imasony ny ran’izy ireo.'),
  ('6ab25af679acba131f3f8a4c', '2026-09-22T10:39:50.669Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:50.669Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 72, 11, 'Hiankohoka eo anatrehany ny mpanjaka rehetra, Ary hanompo azy ny firenena rehetra.', 'hiankohoka eo anatrehany ny mpanjaka rehetra, ary hanompo azy ny firenena rehetra.'),
  ('6ab25af679acba131f3f8a54', '2026-09-22T10:39:50.669Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:50.669Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 72, 19, 'Hoderaina mandrakizay anie ny anarany be voninahitra, Ary enga anie ny voninahiny hameno ny tany manontolo! Amena! Amena!', 'hoderaina mandrakizay anie ny anarany be voninahitra, ary enga anie ny voninahiny hameno ny tany manontolo! amena! amena!'),
  ('6ab25af679acba131f3f8a52', '2026-09-22T10:39:50.669Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:50.669Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 72, 17, 'Haharitra mandrakizay anie ny anarany, Ary hihamalaza anie izany raha mbola misy koa ny masoandro! Enga anie ny olona hahazo fitahiana amin’ny alalany, Ary ny firenena rehetra hilaza hoe: “Sambatra izy!”', 'haharitra mandrakizay anie ny anarany, ary hihamalaza anie izany raha mbola misy koa ny masoandro! enga anie ny olona hahazo fitahiana amin’ny alalany, ary ny firenena rehetra hilaza hoe: “sambatra izy!”'),
  ('6ab25af679acba131f3f8a4d', '2026-09-22T10:39:50.669Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:50.669Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 72, 12, 'Fa hovonjeny ny mahantra miantso vonjy, Sy ny madinika, ary izay rehetra tsy mba misy manampy.', 'fa hovonjeny ny mahantra miantso vonjy, sy ny madinika, ary izay rehetra tsy mba misy manampy.'),
  ('6ab25af679acba131f3f8a44', '2026-09-22T10:39:50.669Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:50.669Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 72, 3, 'Hitondra fiadanana ho an’ny olona anie ny tendrombohitra, Ary hitondra fahamarinana ny havoana!', 'hitondra fiadanana ho an’ny olona anie ny tendrombohitra, ary hitondra fahamarinana ny havoana!'),
  ('6ab25af679acba131f3f8a51', '2026-09-22T10:39:50.669Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:50.669Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 72, 16, 'Hahavokatra be ny tany; Ho be dia be ny vokatra, na dia eny an-tampon-tendrombohitra aza. Hamokatra toy ny any Libàna ny taniny, Ary hiroborobo toy ny zavamaniry amin’ny tany ny olona ao an-tanàna.', 'hahavokatra be ny tany; ho be dia be ny vokatra, na dia eny an-tampon-tendrombohitra aza. hamokatra toy ny any libàna ny taniny, ary hiroborobo toy ny zavamaniry amin’ny tany ny olona ao an-tanàna.'),
  ('6ab25af679acba131f3f8a4e', '2026-09-22T10:39:50.669Z', '2026-09-22T10:39:50.669Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 72, 13, 'Hiantra ny madinika sy ny mahantra izy, Ary hamonjy ny ain’ny mahantra.', 'hiantra ny madinika sy ny mahantra izy, ary hamonjy ny ain’ny mahantra.'),
