  ('6ab25b0143f9452daf18c6ba', '2026-09-22T10:40:01.195Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:01.195Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 83, 10, 'Naringana tany En-dora izy ireo, Ka lasa zezika ho an’ny tany.', 'naringana tany en-dora izy ireo, ka lasa zezika ho an’ny tany.'),
  ('6ab25b0143f9452daf18c6bf', '2026-09-22T10:40:01.195Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:01.195Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 83, 15, 'Ho toy izany anie no hanenjehanao azy amin’ny rivo-mahery, Sy hampihorohoroanao azy amin’ny tafio-drivotra avy aminao!', 'ho toy izany anie no hanenjehanao azy amin’ny rivo-mahery, sy hampihorohoroanao azy amin’ny tafio-drivotra avy aminao!'),
  ('6ab25b0143f9452daf18c6bb', '2026-09-22T10:40:01.195Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:01.195Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 83, 11, 'Ataovy toy ny nanaovanao an’i Oreba sy Zeba ny olona ambony eo aminy, Ary ataovy toy ny nanaovanao an’i Zebaha sy Zalmona ny andrianany.', 'ataovy toy ny nanaovanao an’i oreba sy zeba ny olona ambony eo aminy, ary ataovy toy ny nanaovanao an’i zebaha sy zalmona ny andrianany.'),
  ('6ab25b0143f9452daf18c6b9', '2026-09-22T10:40:01.195Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:01.195Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 83, 9, 'Ataovy toy ny nanaovanao ny Midianina izy ireo, Toy ny nanaovanao an’i Sisera sy Jabina teo amin’ny reniranon’i Kisona.', 'ataovy toy ny nanaovanao ny midianina izy ireo, toy ny nanaovanao an’i sisera sy jabina teo amin’ny reniranon’i kisona.'),
  ('6ab25b0143f9452daf18c6b8', '2026-09-22T10:40:01.195Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:01.195Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 83, 8, 'Miaraka amin’izy ireo koa i Asyria; Manampy an’ireo taranak’i Lota izy rehetra. ( Sela )', 'miaraka amin’izy ireo koa i asyria; manampy an’ireo taranak’i lota izy rehetra. ( sela )'),
  ('6ab25b0143f9452daf18c6c1', '2026-09-22T10:40:01.195Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:01.195Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 83, 17, 'Ho menatra sy hihorohoro mandrakizay anie izy ireo, Ary ho afa-baraka sy ho ringana;', 'ho menatra sy hihorohoro mandrakizay anie izy ireo, ary ho afa-baraka sy ho ringana;'),
  ('6ab25b0143f9452daf18c6c0', '2026-09-22T10:40:01.195Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:01.195Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 83, 16, 'Ataovy afa-baraka tanteraka izy ireo, Mba hitadiavany ny anaranao, Jehovah ô!', 'ataovy afa-baraka tanteraka izy ireo, mba hitadiavany ny anaranao, jehovah ô!'),
  ('6ab25b0143f9452daf18c6be', '2026-09-22T10:40:01.195Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:01.195Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 83, 14, 'Toy ny afo mandoro ala, Toy ny lelafo mandrehitra tendrombohitra,', 'toy ny afo mandoro ala, toy ny lelafo mandrehitra tendrombohitra,'),
  ('6ab25b0143f9452daf18c6bd', '2026-09-22T10:40:01.195Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:01.195Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 83, 13, 'Ataovy hoatran’ny tsilo avadibadiky ny tadio izy ireo, ry Andriamanitro ô, Hoatran’ny mololo entin’ny rivotra.', 'ataovy hoatran’ny tsilo avadibadiky ny tadio izy ireo, ry andriamanitro ô, hoatran’ny mololo entin’ny rivotra.'),
  ('6ab25b0143f9452daf18c6bc', '2026-09-22T10:40:01.195Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:01.195Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 83, 12, 'Nilaza mantsy izy ireo hoe: “Andao halaintsika ilay tany ipetrahan’Andriamanitra.”', 'nilaza mantsy izy ireo hoe: “andao halaintsika ilay tany ipetrahan’andriamanitra.”'),
  ('6ab25b0143f9452daf18c6c2', '2026-09-22T10:40:01.195Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:01.195Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 83, 18, 'Enga anie ho fantatry ny olona fa ianao irery ihany, ilay manana anarana hoe Jehovah, No Avo Indrindra manerana ny tany manontolo!', 'enga anie ho fantatry ny olona fa ianao irery ihany, ilay manana anarana hoe jehovah, no avo indrindra manerana ny tany manontolo!'),
  ('6ab25b01cf322f25ce76eeef', '2026-09-22T10:40:01.689Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:01.689Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 84, 4, 'Sambatra ny olona mipetraka ao an-tranonao! Midera anao foana izy ireo. ( Sela )', 'sambatra ny olona mipetraka ao an-tranonao! midera anao foana izy ireo. ( sela )'),
  ('6ab25b01cf322f25ce76eef7', '2026-09-22T10:40:01.689Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:01.689Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 84, 12, 'Ry Jehovah Tompon’ny tafika ô, Sambatra izay olona matoky anao.', 'ry jehovah tompon’ny tafika ô, sambatra izay olona matoky anao.'),
  ('6ab25b01cf322f25ce76eef4', '2026-09-22T10:40:01.689Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:01.689Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 84, 9, 'Ry Andriamanitray sy ampinganay ô, mba jereo Sy tsinjovy ilay voahosotrao.', 'ry andriamanitray sy ampinganay ô, mba jereo sy tsinjovy ilay voahosotrao.'),
  ('6ab25b01cf322f25ce76eef0', '2026-09-22T10:40:01.689Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:01.689Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 84, 5, 'Sambatra ny olona mahazo hery avy aminao, Izay te handeha amin’ny lalana mankany an-tranonao.', 'sambatra ny olona mahazo hery avy aminao, izay te handeha amin’ny lalana mankany an-tranonao.'),
  ('6ab25b01cf322f25ce76eef6', '2026-09-22T10:40:01.689Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:01.689Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 84, 11, 'Fa masoandro sy ampinga i Jehovah Andriamanitra; Mankasitraka sy manome voninahitra izy. I Jehovah dia tsy hiahotra ny hanome zava-tsoa Ho an’ireo tsy mivadika.', 'fa masoandro sy ampinga i jehovah andriamanitra; mankasitraka sy manome voninahitra izy. i jehovah dia tsy hiahotra ny hanome zava-tsoa ho an’ireo tsy mivadika.'),
  ('6ab25b01cf322f25ce76eef1', '2026-09-22T10:40:01.689Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:01.689Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 84, 6, 'Rehefa mamakivaky ny Lohasaha Bakà izy ireo, Dia ovany ho toerana misy loharano izany; Ary toy ny akanjo manarona azy ny fitahiana entin’ny orana voalohandohany.', 'rehefa mamakivaky ny lohasaha bakà izy ireo, dia ovany ho toerana misy loharano izany; ary toy ny akanjo manarona azy ny fitahiana entin’ny orana voalohandohany.'),
  ('6ab25b01cf322f25ce76eef3', '2026-09-22T10:40:01.689Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:01.689Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 84, 8, 'Henoy ny vavaka ataoko, Jehovah Andriamanitry ny tafika ô! Mihainoa, ry Andriamanitr’i Jakoba ô! ( Sela )', 'henoy ny vavaka ataoko, jehovah andriamanitry ny tafika ô! mihainoa, ry andriamanitr’i jakoba ô! ( sela )'),
  ('6ab25b01cf322f25ce76eeee', '2026-09-22T10:40:01.689Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:01.689Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 84, 3, 'Na ny vorona aza mahita trano any, Ary ny sidintsidina mahita akany Hikarakarany ny zanany Eny akaikin’ny alitaranao be voninahitra, ry Jehovah Tompon’ny tafika ô, Ry Mpanjakako sy Andriamanitro!', 'na ny vorona aza mahita trano any, ary ny sidintsidina mahita akany hikarakarany ny zanany eny akaikin’ny alitaranao be voninahitra, ry jehovah tompon’ny tafika ô, ry mpanjakako sy andriamanitro!'),
  ('6ab25b01cf322f25ce76eeed', '2026-09-22T10:40:01.689Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:01.689Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 84, 2, 'Manimanina daholo ny hatrany anatiko lalina any, Eny, tena tsy andriko mihitsy Ny ho any an-tokotanin’ny tranolain’i Jehovah. Mihoby an’ilay Andriamanitra velona ny foko sy ny tenako manontolo.', 'manimanina daholo ny hatrany anatiko lalina any, eny, tena tsy andriko mihitsy ny ho any an-tokotanin’ny tranolain’i jehovah. mihoby an’ilay andriamanitra velona ny foko sy ny tenako manontolo.'),
  ('6ab25b01cf322f25ce76eef5', '2026-09-22T10:40:01.689Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:01.689Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 84, 10, 'Fa ny indray andro eo an-tokotaninao dia tsara noho ny arivo andro any an-toeran-kafa! Aleoko mijoro eo an-tokonam-baravaran’ny tranon’ny Andriamanitro, Toy izay hipetraka ao amin’ny tranolain’ny ratsy fanahy.', 'fa ny indray andro eo an-tokotaninao dia tsara noho ny arivo andro any an-toeran-kafa! aleoko mijoro eo an-tokonam-baravaran’ny tranon’ny andriamanitro, toy izay hipetraka ao amin’ny tranolain’ny ratsy fanahy.'),
  ('6ab25b01cf322f25ce76eeec', '2026-09-22T10:40:01.689Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:01.689Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 84, 1, 'Tsara erỳ ny tranolainao be voninahitra, Jehovah Tompon’ny tafika ô!', 'tsara erỳ ny tranolainao be voninahitra, jehovah tompon’ny tafika ô!'),
  ('6ab25b01cf322f25ce76eef2', '2026-09-22T10:40:01.689Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:01.689Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 84, 7, 'Handeha izy ireo sady hihamatanjaka; Samy miseho eo anatrehan’Andriamanitra ao Ziona izy ireo.', 'handeha izy ireo sady hihamatanjaka; samy miseho eo anatrehan’andriamanitra ao ziona izy ireo.'),
  ('6ab25b027b345be5e0958ba8', '2026-09-22T10:40:02.339Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:02.339Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 85, 11, 'Hitsimoka avy amin’ny tany ny tsy fivadihana, Ary hitazana avy any an-danitra ny fahamarinana.', 'hitsimoka avy amin’ny tany ny tsy fivadihana, ary hitazana avy any an-danitra ny fahamarinana.'),
  ('6ab25b027b345be5e0958ba7', '2026-09-22T10:40:02.339Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:02.339Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 85, 10, 'Hihaona ny fitiavana sy ny tsy fivadihana; Hifanoroka ny fahamarinana sy ny fiadanana.', 'hihaona ny fitiavana sy ny tsy fivadihana; hifanoroka ny fahamarinana sy ny fiadanana.'),
  ('6ab25b027b345be5e0958ba0', '2026-09-22T10:40:02.339Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:02.339Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 85, 3, 'Tsy navoakanao daholo ny hatezeranao, Ary tsy nisafoaka intsony ianao.', 'tsy navoakanao daholo ny hatezeranao, ary tsy nisafoaka intsony ianao.'),
  ('6ab25b027b345be5e0958b9f', '2026-09-22T10:40:02.339Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:02.339Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 85, 2, 'Efa namela ny fahadisoan’ny vahoakanao ianao; Navelanao daholo ny fahotany. ( Sela )', 'efa namela ny fahadisoan’ny vahoakanao ianao; navelanao daholo ny fahotany. ( sela )');
INSERT INTO "bible_verses" ("id", "created_date", "updated_date", "created_by_id", "created_by", "translation", "book", "bookOrder", "chapter", "verse", "text", "normalizedText") VALUES
  ('6ab25b027b345be5e0958ba4', '2026-09-22T10:40:02.339Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:02.339Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 85, 7, 'Asehoy hoe tia anay sy tsy mivadika aminay ianao, Jehovah ô, Ary vonjeo izahay!', 'asehoy hoe tia anay sy tsy mivadika aminay ianao, jehovah ô, ary vonjeo izahay!'),
  ('6ab25b027b345be5e0958ba2', '2026-09-22T10:40:02.339Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:02.339Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 85, 5, 'Hisafoaka aminay mandrakizay ve ianao? Mbola ho tezitra foana ve ianao hatrany amin’ny taranaka fara aman-dimby?', 'hisafoaka aminay mandrakizay ve ianao? mbola ho tezitra foana ve ianao hatrany amin’ny taranaka fara aman-dimby?'),
  ('6ab25b027b345be5e0958ba6', '2026-09-22T10:40:02.339Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:02.339Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 85, 9, 'Akaiky an’izay matahotra an’Andriamanitra tokoa ny famonjeny, Mba ho afaka hijanona eto amin’ny taninay ny voninahiny.', 'akaiky an’izay matahotra an’andriamanitra tokoa ny famonjeny, mba ho afaka hijanona eto amin’ny taninay ny voninahiny.'),
  ('6ab25b027b345be5e0958b9e', '2026-09-22T10:40:02.339Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:02.339Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 85, 1, 'Niantra ny taninao ianao, Jehovah ô! Nampodinao ireo taranak’i Jakoba azo babo.', 'niantra ny taninao ianao, jehovah ô! nampodinao ireo taranak’i jakoba azo babo.'),
  ('6ab25b027b345be5e0958ba1', '2026-09-22T10:40:02.339Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:02.339Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 85, 4, 'Ataovy lasa hoatran’ny taloha indray izahay, ry Andriamanitra mpamonjy anay ô, Ary aza sosotra aminay intsony.', 'ataovy lasa hoatran’ny taloha indray izahay, ry andriamanitra mpamonjy anay ô, ary aza sosotra aminay intsony.'),
  ('6ab25b027b345be5e0958ba9', '2026-09-22T10:40:02.339Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:02.339Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 85, 12, 'Tena hanome zava-tsoa i Jehovah, Ary hahavokatra ny taninay.', 'tena hanome zava-tsoa i jehovah, ary hahavokatra ny taninay.'),
  ('6ab25b027b345be5e0958ba5', '2026-09-22T10:40:02.339Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:02.339Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 85, 8, 'Hohenoiko izay lazain’i Jehovah, ilay tena Andriamanitra, Satria izy hiresaka fihavanana amin’ny vahoakany, dia amin’ireo tsy mivadika aminy. Aoka anefa izy ireo tsy hatoky tena loatra indray.', 'hohenoiko izay lazain’i jehovah, ilay tena andriamanitra, satria izy hiresaka fihavanana amin’ny vahoakany, dia amin’ireo tsy mivadika aminy. aoka anefa izy ireo tsy hatoky tena loatra indray.'),
  ('6ab25b027b345be5e0958ba3', '2026-09-22T10:40:02.339Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:02.339Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 85, 6, 'Tsy hovelombelominao indray ve izahay Mba ho afaka hifaly aminao ny vahoakanao?', 'tsy hovelombelominao indray ve izahay mba ho afaka hifaly aminao ny vahoakanao?'),
  ('6ab25b027b345be5e0958baa', '2026-09-22T10:40:02.340Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:02.340Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 85, 13, 'Handeha eo alohan’Andriamanitra ny rariny, Ka hanomana ny lalana handehanany.', 'handeha eo alohan’andriamanitra ny rariny, ka hanomana ny lalana handehanany.'),
  ('6ab25b043754caff1aaa2629', '2026-09-22T10:40:04.229Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:04.229Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 89, 50, 'Tsarovy ny latsa natao tamin’ny mpanomponao, Jehovah ô, Dia ny latsa nozakaiko avy tamin’ny firenena rehetra;', 'tsarovy ny latsa natao tamin’ny mpanomponao, jehovah ô, dia ny latsa nozakaiko avy tamin’ny firenena rehetra;'),
  ('6ab25b043754caff1aaa2628', '2026-09-22T10:40:04.229Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:04.229Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 89, 49, 'Jehovah ô, aiza ireny fitiavana sy tsy fivadihana nasehonao taloha ireny, Izay nianiananao tamin’i Davida noho ianao mendri-pitokisana?', 'jehovah ô, aiza ireny fitiavana sy tsy fivadihana nasehonao taloha ireny, izay nianiananao tamin’i davida noho ianao mendri-pitokisana?'),
  ('6ab25b043754caff1aaa261f', '2026-09-22T10:40:04.229Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:04.229Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 89, 40, 'Narodanao daholo ny mandany vita amin’ny vato; Noravanao ny toerany voaro mafy.', 'narodanao daholo ny mandany vita amin’ny vato; noravanao ny toerany voaro mafy.'),
  ('6ab25b043754caff1aaa261c', '2026-09-22T10:40:04.229Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:04.229Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 89, 37, 'Ho mafy orina mandrakizay toy ny volana izy io, Tahaka ny vavolombelona mendri-pitokisana eny amin’ny lanitra.” ( Sela )', 'ho mafy orina mandrakizay toy ny volana izy io, tahaka ny vavolombelona mendri-pitokisana eny amin’ny lanitra.” ( sela )'),
  ('6ab25b043754caff1aaa2607', '2026-09-22T10:40:04.229Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:04.229Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 89, 16, 'Mifaly amin’ny anaranao izy ireo tontolo andro, Ary noho ny fahamarinanao dia misandratra izy ireo.', 'mifaly amin’ny anaranao izy ireo tontolo andro, ary noho ny fahamarinanao dia misandratra izy ireo.'),
  ('6ab25b043754caff1aaa2614', '2026-09-22T10:40:04.229Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:04.229Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 89, 29, 'Hataoko maharitra mandrakizay ny taranany, Ary haharitra toy ny lanitra ny seza fiandrianany.', 'hataoko maharitra mandrakizay ny taranany, ary haharitra toy ny lanitra ny seza fiandrianany.'),
