  ('6ab25b0d701c5f96e92d1e05', '2026-09-22T10:40:13.844Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:13.844Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 99, 9, 'Asandrato i Jehovah Andriamanitsika, Ary miankohofa eo anoloan’ny tendrombohiny masina, Fa masina i Jehovah Andriamanitsika.', 'asandrato i jehovah andriamanitsika, ary miankohofa eo anoloan’ny tendrombohiny masina, fa masina i jehovah andriamanitsika.'),
  ('6ab25b0d701c5f96e92d1dff', '2026-09-22T10:40:13.844Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:13.844Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 99, 3, 'Aoka izy ireo hidera ny anaranao be voninahitra, Fa mendrika hatahorana sy masina izy io.', 'aoka izy ireo hidera ny anaranao be voninahitra, fa mendrika hatahorana sy masina izy io.'),
  ('6ab25b0d701c5f96e92d1dfd', '2026-09-22T10:40:13.844Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:13.844Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 99, 1, 'Lasa Mpanjaka i Jehovah. Aoka hangovitra ireo firenena. Mipetraka eo amin’ny seza fiandrianana eo ambonin’ny kerobima izy. Aoka hihovotrovotra ny tany.', 'lasa mpanjaka i jehovah. aoka hangovitra ireo firenena. mipetraka eo amin’ny seza fiandrianana eo ambonin’ny kerobima izy. aoka hihovotrovotra ny tany.'),
  ('6ab25b0eaad7914df54f0125', '2026-09-22T10:40:14.456Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:14.456Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 100, 1, 'Manaova horakora-pandresena ho an’i Jehovah, ry tany manontolo.', 'manaova horakora-pandresena ho an’i jehovah, ry tany manontolo.'),
  ('6ab25b0eaad7914df54f0128', '2026-09-22T10:40:14.456Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:14.456Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 100, 4, 'Midira eo am-bavahadiny mba hisaotra azy, Ary eo an-tokotaniny mba hidera azy. Misaora azy; derao ny anarany.', 'midira eo am-bavahadiny mba hisaotra azy, ary eo an-tokotaniny mba hidera azy. misaora azy; derao ny anarany.'),
  ('6ab25b0eaad7914df54f0127', '2026-09-22T10:40:14.456Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:14.456Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 100, 3, 'Fantaro fa i Jehovah no Andriamanitra. Izy no nanao antsika, ary azy isika. Vahoakany isika sady ondry ao an-kijanany.', 'fantaro fa i jehovah no andriamanitra. izy no nanao antsika, ary azy isika. vahoakany isika sady ondry ao an-kijanany.'),
  ('6ab25b0eaad7914df54f0129', '2026-09-22T10:40:14.456Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:14.456Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 100, 5, 'Fa tsara i Jehovah; Be fitiavana izy sady tsy mivadika mandrakizay, Ary asehony amin’ny taranaka fara aman-dimby hoe mendri-pitokisana izy.', 'fa tsara i jehovah; be fitiavana izy sady tsy mivadika mandrakizay, ary asehony amin’ny taranaka fara aman-dimby hoe mendri-pitokisana izy.'),
  ('6ab25b0eaad7914df54f0126', '2026-09-22T10:40:14.456Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:14.456Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 100, 2, 'Manompoa an’i Jehovah sady mifalia. Mankanesa eo anatrehany sady mihobia.', 'manompoa an’i jehovah sady mifalia. mankanesa eo anatrehany sady mihobia.'),
  ('6ab25b0e9f36550ec66d5b02', '2026-09-22T10:40:14.886Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:14.886Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 101, 2, 'Ho malina sy tsy hisy tsiny aho amin’izay hataoko. Rahoviana ianao no hitsinjo ahy? Handeha amin’ny fahitsian’ny foko aho ao an-tranoko.', 'ho malina sy tsy hisy tsiny aho amin’izay hataoko. rahoviana ianao no hitsinjo ahy? handeha amin’ny fahitsian’ny foko aho ao an-tranoko.'),
  ('6ab25b0e9f36550ec66d5b08', '2026-09-22T10:40:14.886Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:14.886Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 101, 8, 'Isa-maraina, dia hataoko tsy afa-miteny intsony ny ratsy fanahy rehetra eto an-tany, Mba horinganina tsy ho ao an-tanànan’i Jehovah ny mpanao ratsy rehetra.', 'isa-maraina, dia hataoko tsy afa-miteny intsony ny ratsy fanahy rehetra eto an-tany, mba horinganina tsy ho ao an-tanànan’i jehovah ny mpanao ratsy rehetra.'),
  ('6ab25b0e9f36550ec66d5b07', '2026-09-22T10:40:14.886Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:14.886Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 101, 7, 'Tsy hisy mpamitaka hipetraka ao an-tranoko, Ary tsy hisy mpandainga hijoro eo anatrehako.', 'tsy hisy mpamitaka hipetraka ao an-tranoko, ary tsy hisy mpandainga hijoro eo anatrehako.'),
  ('6ab25b0e9f36550ec66d5b03', '2026-09-22T10:40:14.886Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:14.886Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 101, 3, 'Tsy hanisy zavatra tsy misy dikany ho eo anoloan’ny masoko aho. Halako ny zavatra ataon’ireo miala amin’ny lala-mahitsy; Tsy hifandray amin’ireny mihitsy aho.', 'tsy hanisy zavatra tsy misy dikany ho eo anoloan’ny masoko aho. halako ny zavatra ataon’ireo miala amin’ny lala-mahitsy; tsy hifandray amin’ireny mihitsy aho.'),
  ('6ab25b0e9f36550ec66d5b01', '2026-09-22T10:40:14.886Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:14.886Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 101, 1, 'Hihira momba ny fitiavana sy ny tsy fivadihana ary ny rariny aho. Ho anao, Jehovah ô, no hihirako hira fiderana!', 'hihira momba ny fitiavana sy ny tsy fivadihana ary ny rariny aho. ho anao, jehovah ô, no hihirako hira fiderana!'),
  ('6ab25b0e9f36550ec66d5b06', '2026-09-22T10:40:14.886Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:14.886Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 101, 6, 'Hankasitraka an’ireo olona tsy mivadika eto an-tany aho, Mba hahafahan’izy ireo hiara-monina amiko. Izay mandeha tsy misy tsiny no ho lasa mpanompoko.', 'hankasitraka an’ireo olona tsy mivadika eto an-tany aho, mba hahafahan’izy ireo hiara-monina amiko. izay mandeha tsy misy tsiny no ho lasa mpanompoko.'),
  ('6ab25b0e9f36550ec66d5b04', '2026-09-22T10:40:14.886Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:14.886Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 101, 4, 'Halaviriko ny fo fetsifetsy; Tsy hankasitraka zavatra ratsy aho.', 'halaviriko ny fo fetsifetsy; tsy hankasitraka zavatra ratsy aho.'),
  ('6ab25b0e9f36550ec66d5b05', '2026-09-22T10:40:14.886Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:14.886Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 101, 5, 'Hataoko tsy mahateny intsony Izay olona manendrikendrika ny namany any ambadimbadika any. Tsy holeferiko Ny olona manana maso mianjonanjona sy fo mirehareha.', 'hataoko tsy mahateny intsony izay olona manendrikendrika ny namany any ambadimbadika any. tsy holeferiko ny olona manana maso mianjonanjona sy fo mirehareha.'),
