  ('6ab25b0ff022d17275ee5880', '2026-09-22T10:40:15.926Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:15.926Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 103, 4, 'Manavotra ny ainao tsy ho lasa any an-davaka izy, Ary ataony toy ny satroboninahitra eny aminao ny fitiavany sy ny tsy fivadihany ary ny famindram-pony.', 'manavotra ny ainao tsy ho lasa any an-davaka izy, ary ataony toy ny satroboninahitra eny aminao ny fitiavany sy ny tsy fivadihany ary ny famindram-pony.'),
  ('6ab25b0ff022d17275ee588c', '2026-09-22T10:40:15.926Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:15.926Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 103, 16, 'Vao tsofin’ny rivotra anefa izy dia tsy eo intsony, Hoatran’ny hoe tsy teo mihitsy.', 'vao tsofin’ny rivotra anefa izy dia tsy eo intsony, hoatran’ny hoe tsy teo mihitsy.'),
  ('6ab25b10dea09f98320a4a81', '2026-09-22T10:40:16.992Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:16.992Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 104, 28, 'Angoniny izay omenao azy. Rehefa manokatra ny tananao ianao, dia voky zava-tsoa izy ireo.', 'angoniny izay omenao azy. rehefa manokatra ny tananao ianao, dia voky zava-tsoa izy ireo.'),
  ('6ab25b10dea09f98320a4a77', '2026-09-22T10:40:16.992Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:16.992Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 104, 18, 'Ho an’ny osidia ny tendrombohitra avo, Ary fialofan’ny bitrom-bato ny harambato.', 'ho an’ny osidia ny tendrombohitra avo, ary fialofan’ny bitrom-bato ny harambato.'),
  ('6ab25b10dea09f98320a4a74', '2026-09-22T10:40:16.992Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:16.992Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 104, 15, 'Divay mampifaly ny fon’ny olona, Sy menaka mahamandimandina ny tarehy, Ary mofo manome hery ny olona mety maty.', 'divay mampifaly ny fon’ny olona, sy menaka mahamandimandina ny tarehy, ary mofo manome hery ny olona mety maty.'),
  ('6ab25b10dea09f98320a4a72', '2026-09-22T10:40:16.992Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:16.992Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 104, 13, 'Avy eny amin’ny efitranony ambony rihana Andriamanitra no manondraka an’ireo tendrombohitra. Afa-po amin’ny vokatry ny asanao ny tany.', 'avy eny amin’ny efitranony ambony rihana andriamanitra no manondraka an’ireo tendrombohitra. afa-po amin’ny vokatry ny asanao ny tany.'),
  ('6ab25b10dea09f98320a4a86', '2026-09-22T10:40:16.992Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:16.992Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 104, 33, 'Hihira ho an’i Jehovah aho mandritra ny androm-piainako; Hihira fiderana ho an’ny Andriamanitro aho raha mbola velona koa.', 'hihira ho an’i jehovah aho mandritra ny androm-piainako; hihira fiderana ho an’ny andriamanitro aho raha mbola velona koa.'),
  ('6ab25b10dea09f98320a4a83', '2026-09-22T10:40:16.992Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:16.992Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 104, 30, 'Raha irahinao ny fanahinao dia voaforona izy ireo, Ary havaozinao ny tany.', 'raha irahinao ny fanahinao dia voaforona izy ireo, ary havaozinao ny tany.'),
  ('6ab25b10dea09f98320a4a84', '2026-09-22T10:40:16.992Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:16.992Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 104, 31, 'Haharitra mandrakizay ny voninahitr’i Jehovah. Hifaly amin’ny asany i Jehovah.', 'haharitra mandrakizay ny voninahitr’i jehovah. hifaly amin’ny asany i jehovah.'),
  ('6ab25b10dea09f98320a4a82', '2026-09-22T10:40:16.992Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:16.992Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 104, 29, 'Rehefa mihodina tsy hijery azy kosa ianao, dia very hevitra izy ireo. Ary raha esorinao ny hery mamelona azy, dia maty izy ireo ka miverina ho vovoka.', 'rehefa mihodina tsy hijery azy kosa ianao, dia very hevitra izy ireo. ary raha esorinao ny hery mamelona azy, dia maty izy ireo ka miverina ho vovoka.'),
  ('6ab25b10dea09f98320a4a7d', '2026-09-22T10:40:16.992Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:16.992Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 104, 24, 'Maro be tokoa ny zava-bitanao, Jehovah ô! Naneho fahendrena ianao rehefa nanao azy rehetra. Feno zavatra nataonao ny tany.', 'maro be tokoa ny zava-bitanao, jehovah ô! naneho fahendrena ianao rehefa nanao azy rehetra. feno zavatra nataonao ny tany.'),
  ('6ab25b10dea09f98320a4a70', '2026-09-22T10:40:16.992Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:16.992Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 104, 11, 'Manome rano fisotro ho an’ny bibidia rehetra ireny, Ka afaka hetaheta ny ampondradia.', 'manome rano fisotro ho an’ny bibidia rehetra ireny, ka afaka hetaheta ny ampondradia.'),
  ('6ab25b10dea09f98320a4a7a', '2026-09-22T10:40:16.992Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:16.992Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 104, 21, 'Mierona ny liona tanora rehefa mihaza, Ka mitady sakafo avy amin’Andriamanitra.', 'mierona ny liona tanora rehefa mihaza, ka mitady sakafo avy amin’andriamanitra.'),
  ('6ab25b10dea09f98320a4a6d', '2026-09-22T10:40:16.992Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:16.992Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 104, 8, 'Tany amin’ny toerana nataonao ho azy. Nisondrotra ny tendrombohitra, ary niletsy ny lohasaha.', 'tany amin’ny toerana nataonao ho azy. nisondrotra ny tendrombohitra, ary niletsy ny lohasaha.'),
  ('6ab25b10dea09f98320a4a6e', '2026-09-22T10:40:16.992Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:16.992Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 104, 9, 'Nasianao fetra ny rano mba tsy hihoatra, Ka tsy hanarona ny tany intsony izany.', 'nasianao fetra ny rano mba tsy hihoatra, ka tsy hanarona ny tany intsony izany.'),
  ('6ab25b10dea09f98320a4a6c', '2026-09-22T10:40:16.992Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:16.992Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 104, 7, 'Noteneninao mafy ny rano ka nandositra; Naheno ny feon’ny kotroka nalefanao ireny, ka nirifatra nitsoaka', 'noteneninao mafy ny rano ka nandositra; naheno ny feon’ny kotroka nalefanao ireny, ka nirifatra nitsoaka'),
  ('6ab25b10dea09f98320a4a88', '2026-09-22T10:40:16.992Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:16.992Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 104, 35, 'Hanjavona tsy hisy etỳ an-tany ny mpanota, Ary tsy hisy intsony ny ratsy fanahy. Te hidera an’i Jehovah aho! Derao i Jah!', 'hanjavona tsy hisy etỳ an-tany ny mpanota, ary tsy hisy intsony ny ratsy fanahy. te hidera an’i jehovah aho! derao i jah!'),
  ('6ab25b10dea09f98320a4a87', '2026-09-22T10:40:16.992Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:16.992Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 104, 34, 'Hahafaly azy anie ny eritreritro! Hifaly amin’i Jehovah aho.', 'hahafaly azy anie ny eritreritro! hifaly amin’i jehovah aho.'),
  ('6ab25b10dea09f98320a4a7e', '2026-09-22T10:40:16.992Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:16.992Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 104, 25, 'Tena lehibe sy midadasika koa ny ranomasina, Izay ahitana zavamananaina kely sy lehibe tsy hita isa sady mifanaretsaka.', 'tena lehibe sy midadasika koa ny ranomasina, izay ahitana zavamananaina kely sy lehibe tsy hita isa sady mifanaretsaka.'),
  ('6ab25b10dea09f98320a4a7c', '2026-09-22T10:40:16.992Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:16.992Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 104, 23, 'Ny olona kosa mivoaka hanao ny asany, Ary miasa mafy mandra-paharivan’ny andro.', 'ny olona kosa mivoaka hanao ny asany, ary miasa mafy mandra-paharivan’ny andro.'),
  ('6ab25b10dea09f98320a4a7b', '2026-09-22T10:40:16.992Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:16.992Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 104, 22, 'Rehefa miposaka ny masoandro, Dia mody ireny ka matory ao anatin’ny lavaka fisitrihany.', 'rehefa miposaka ny masoandro, dia mody ireny ka matory ao anatin’ny lavaka fisitrihany.'),
  ('6ab25b10dea09f98320a4a79', '2026-09-22T10:40:16.992Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:16.992Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 104, 20, 'Mahatonga haizina ianao, dia alina ny andro, Ary amin’izay no mivezivezy ny bibidia rehetra any an’ala.', 'mahatonga haizina ianao, dia alina ny andro, ary amin’izay no mivezivezy ny bibidia rehetra any an’ala.'),
  ('6ab25b10dea09f98320a4a73', '2026-09-22T10:40:16.992Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:16.992Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 104, 14, 'Mampaniry ahitra ho an’ny biby fiompy izy, Sy zavamaniry ho an’ny olombelona, Mba hahatonga ny tany hamokatra sakafo:', 'mampaniry ahitra ho an’ny biby fiompy izy, sy zavamaniry ho an’ny olombelona, mba hahatonga ny tany hamokatra sakafo:'),
  ('6ab25b10dea09f98320a4a71', '2026-09-22T10:40:16.992Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:16.992Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 104, 12, 'Eny amin’ny hazo eny amoron’ireny no ipetrahan’ny vorona; Misiotsioka ao anaty ravinkazo mandrobona izy ireo.', 'eny amin’ny hazo eny amoron’ireny no ipetrahan’ny vorona; misiotsioka ao anaty ravinkazo mandrobona izy ireo.'),
  ('6ab25b10dea09f98320a4a69', '2026-09-22T10:40:16.992Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:16.992Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 104, 4, 'Ataony mahery ny anjeliny, Ary ataony afo mandevona ny mpanompony.', 'ataony mahery ny anjeliny, ary ataony afo mandevona ny mpanompony.'),
  ('6ab25b10dea09f98320a4a75', '2026-09-22T10:40:16.992Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:16.992Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 104, 16, 'Azon-drano tsara ireo hazon’i Jehovah, Dia ny sederan’i Libàna, izay namboleny', 'azon-drano tsara ireo hazon’i jehovah, dia ny sederan’i libàna, izay namboleny'),
  ('6ab25b10dea09f98320a4a6b', '2026-09-22T10:40:16.992Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:16.992Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 104, 6, 'Nampitafianao azy toy ny akanjo ny rano lalina. Nandifotra tendrombohitra ny rano.', 'nampitafianao azy toy ny akanjo ny rano lalina. nandifotra tendrombohitra ny rano.'),
  ('6ab25b10dea09f98320a4a85', '2026-09-22T10:40:16.992Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:16.992Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 104, 32, 'Jereny ny tany, dia mihovotrovotra; Kasihiny ny tendrombohitra, dia midona-tsetroka.', 'jereny ny tany, dia mihovotrovotra; kasihiny ny tendrombohitra, dia midona-tsetroka.'),
  ('6ab25b10dea09f98320a4a76', '2026-09-22T10:40:16.992Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:16.992Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 104, 17, 'Sy ametrahan’ny vorona ny akaniny. Eny amin’ny hazo zenevrie ny tranon’ny vanobe.', 'sy ametrahan’ny vorona ny akaniny. eny amin’ny hazo zenevrie ny tranon’ny vanobe.'),
  ('6ab25b10dea09f98320a4a6f', '2026-09-22T10:40:16.992Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:16.992Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 104, 10, 'Asiany loharano eny amin’ny lohasaha; Mikoriana eny anelanelan’ny tendrombohitra ireny.', 'asiany loharano eny amin’ny lohasaha; mikoriana eny anelanelan’ny tendrombohitra ireny.'),
  ('6ab25b10dea09f98320a4a68', '2026-09-22T10:40:16.992Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:16.992Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 104, 3, 'Apetrany eny amin’ny rano eny amin’ny habakabaka ny vatan-kazo anaovany ny efitranony ambony rihana. Ataony toy ny kalesiny ny rahona, Ary mandeha amin’ny elatry ny rivotra izy.', 'apetrany eny amin’ny rano eny amin’ny habakabaka ny vatan-kazo anaovany ny efitranony ambony rihana. ataony toy ny kalesiny ny rahona, ary mandeha amin’ny elatry ny rivotra izy.');
INSERT INTO "bible_verses" ("id", "created_date", "updated_date", "created_by_id", "created_by", "translation", "book", "bookOrder", "chapter", "verse", "text", "normalizedText") VALUES
  ('6ab25b10dea09f98320a4a80', '2026-09-22T10:40:16.992Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:16.992Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 104, 27, 'Miantehitra aminao ireo rehetra ireo Mba hanome azy ny sakafony amin’ny fotoanany.', 'miantehitra aminao ireo rehetra ireo mba hanome azy ny sakafony amin’ny fotoanany.'),
  ('6ab25b10dea09f98320a4a78', '2026-09-22T10:40:16.992Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:16.992Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 104, 19, 'Nanao ny volana izy mba hamaritana fotoana; Fantatry ny masoandro tsara ny fotoana filentehany.', 'nanao ny volana izy mba hamaritana fotoana; fantatry ny masoandro tsara ny fotoana filentehany.'),
  ('6ab25b10dea09f98320a4a6a', '2026-09-22T10:40:16.992Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:16.992Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 104, 5, 'Nataony mafy orina teo ambonin’ny fototra iorenany ny tany, Ka tsy hihetsika eo amin’ny toerany mandrakizay mandrakizay.', 'nataony mafy orina teo ambonin’ny fototra iorenany ny tany, ka tsy hihetsika eo amin’ny toerany mandrakizay mandrakizay.'),
  ('6ab25b10dea09f98320a4a7f', '2026-09-22T10:40:16.992Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:16.992Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 104, 26, 'Any no mivezivezy ny sambo, Ary any koa ny Leviatana, izay nataonao hilalao any.', 'any no mivezivezy ny sambo, ary any koa ny leviatana, izay nataonao hilalao any.'),
  ('6ab25b10dea09f98320a4a67', '2026-09-22T10:40:16.992Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:16.992Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 104, 2, 'Toy ny akanjo andrakofanao ny tenanao ny hazavana; Ary henjaninao toy ny tranolay ny lanitra.', 'toy ny akanjo andrakofanao ny tenanao ny hazavana; ary henjaninao toy ny tranolay ny lanitra.'),
  ('6ab25b10dea09f98320a4a66', '2026-09-22T10:40:16.992Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:16.992Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 104, 1, 'Te hidera an’i Jehovah aho! Tena miavaka tokoa ianao, Jehovah Andriamanitro ô! Mitafy haja amam-boninahitra ianao.', 'te hidera an’i jehovah aho! tena miavaka tokoa ianao, jehovah andriamanitro ô! mitafy haja amam-boninahitra ianao.'),
  ('6ab25b122c8953aca77e7c5c', '2026-09-22T10:40:18.191Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:18.191Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 105, 36, 'Dia naripak’Andriamanitra ny lahimatoa rehetra tao amin’ny tanin’izy ireo, Izany hoe ireo naterany voalohany.', 'dia naripak’andriamanitra ny lahimatoa rehetra tao amin’ny tanin’izy ireo, izany hoe ireo naterany voalohany.'),
  ('6ab25b122c8953aca77e7c59', '2026-09-22T10:40:18.191Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:18.191Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 105, 33, 'Naripany ny voaloboka sy ny aviavin’izy ireo, Ary notapatapahiny ny hazo tao amin’ny tanin’izy ireo.', 'naripany ny voaloboka sy ny aviavin’izy ireo, ary notapatapahiny ny hazo tao amin’ny tanin’izy ireo.'),
  ('6ab25b122c8953aca77e7c47', '2026-09-22T10:40:18.191Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:18.191Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 105, 15, 'Ka niteny hoe: “Aza mikasika an’ireo voahosotro, Ary aza manisy ratsy an’ireo mpaminaniko.”', 'ka niteny hoe: “aza mikasika an’ireo voahosotro, ary aza manisy ratsy an’ireo mpaminaniko.”'),
  ('6ab25b122c8953aca77e7c3a', '2026-09-22T10:40:18.191Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:18.191Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 105, 2, 'Mihirà ho azy, manaova hira fiderana ho azy, Saintsaino ny zavatra mahatalanjona rehetra nataony.', 'mihirà ho azy, manaova hira fiderana ho azy, saintsaino ny zavatra mahatalanjona rehetra nataony.'),
  ('6ab25b122c8953aca77e7c55', '2026-09-22T10:40:18.191Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:18.191Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 105, 29, 'Novan’Andriamanitra ho ra ny rano tany Ejipta, Ka maty ny trondro tany.', 'novan’andriamanitra ho ra ny rano tany ejipta, ka maty ny trondro tany.'),
  ('6ab25b122c8953aca77e7c4f', '2026-09-22T10:40:18.191Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:18.191Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 105, 23, 'Dia nankany Ejipta i Israely; Lasa vahiny nipetraka tany amin’ny tanin’i Hama i Jakoba.', 'dia nankany ejipta i israely; lasa vahiny nipetraka tany amin’ny tanin’i hama i jakoba.'),
