  ('6ab25b14c8915bc83e344354', '2026-09-22T10:40:20.151Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:20.151Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 107, 38, 'Tahiny izy ireo ka lasa maro be; Tsy avelany hihavitsy ny biby fiompiny.', 'tahiny izy ireo ka lasa maro be; tsy avelany hihavitsy ny biby fiompiny.'),
  ('6ab25b14c8915bc83e344357', '2026-09-22T10:40:20.151Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:20.151Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 107, 41, 'Fa arovany kosa ny mahantra mba tsy hisy hampijaly, Ary ataony lasa be dia be toy ny andiana biby fiompy ny fianakavian’izy ireo.', 'fa arovany kosa ny mahantra mba tsy hisy hampijaly, ary ataony lasa be dia be toy ny andiana biby fiompy ny fianakavian’izy ireo.'),
  ('6ab25b14c8915bc83e344355', '2026-09-22T10:40:20.151Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:20.151Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 107, 39, 'Mihavitsy indray anefa izy ireo ary afa-baraka, Noho ny fampahoriana sy ny loza ary ny alahelo.', 'mihavitsy indray anefa izy ireo ary afa-baraka, noho ny fampahoriana sy ny loza ary ny alahelo.'),
  ('6ab25b1443ea7ba2ab22b19b', '2026-09-22T10:40:20.724Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:20.724Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 108, 5, 'Misandrata any ambonin’ny lanitra, Andriamanitra ô! Enga anie ny voninahitrao hanerana ny tany manontolo!', 'misandrata any ambonin’ny lanitra, andriamanitra ô! enga anie ny voninahitrao hanerana ny tany manontolo!'),
  ('6ab25b1443ea7ba2ab22b1a0', '2026-09-22T10:40:20.724Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:20.724Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 108, 10, 'Iza no hitondra ahy any amin’ilay tanàna voaro mafy? Iza no hitarika ahy hatrany Edoma?', 'iza no hitondra ahy any amin’ilay tanàna voaro mafy? iza no hitarika ahy hatrany edoma?'),
  ('6ab25b1443ea7ba2ab22b1a2', '2026-09-22T10:40:20.724Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:20.724Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 108, 12, 'Ampio izahay rehefa misy fahoriana mahazo anay, Fa tsy misy dikany ny famonjena avy amin’ny olombelona.', 'ampio izahay rehefa misy fahoriana mahazo anay, fa tsy misy dikany ny famonjena avy amin’ny olombelona.'),
  ('6ab25b1443ea7ba2ab22b19f', '2026-09-22T10:40:20.724Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:20.724Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 108, 9, 'I Moaba no koveta isasako. Any Edoma no hanipazako ny kapako. Hihorakoraka sady ho faly aho rehefa resiko i Filistia.”', 'i moaba no koveta isasako. any edoma no hanipazako ny kapako. hihorakoraka sady ho faly aho rehefa resiko i filistia.”'),
  ('6ab25b1443ea7ba2ab22b19e', '2026-09-22T10:40:20.724Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:20.724Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 108, 8, 'Ahy i Gileada, ary ahy koa i Manase; I Efraima no fiarovan-dohako, Ary i Joda no ataoko tehim-pahefana.', 'ahy i gileada, ary ahy koa i manase; i efraima no fiarovan-dohako, ary i joda no ataoko tehim-pahefana.'),
  ('6ab25b1443ea7ba2ab22b198', '2026-09-22T10:40:20.724Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:20.724Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 108, 2, 'Mifohaza, ry zavamaneno fitendry ô! Ianao koa, ry harpa ô! Hofohaziko ny maraina mangiran-dratsy.', 'mifohaza, ry zavamaneno fitendry ô! ianao koa, ry harpa ô! hofohaziko ny maraina mangiran-dratsy.'),
  ('6ab25b1443ea7ba2ab22b19d', '2026-09-22T10:40:20.724Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:20.724Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 108, 7, 'Efa niteny ilay Andriamanitra masina hoe: “Ho faly aho hanome an’i Sekema ho lovan’ny vahoakako, Ary horefesiko ny Lohasahan’i Sokota.', 'efa niteny ilay andriamanitra masina hoe: “ho faly aho hanome an’i sekema ho lovan’ny vahoakako, ary horefesiko ny lohasahan’i sokota.'),
  ('6ab25b1443ea7ba2ab22b19c', '2026-09-22T10:40:20.724Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:20.724Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 108, 6, 'Vonjeo amin’ny tananao ankavanana izahay ka valio aho, Mba ho avotra ireo tianao.', 'vonjeo amin’ny tananao ankavanana izahay ka valio aho, mba ho avotra ireo tianao.'),
  ('6ab25b1443ea7ba2ab22b197', '2026-09-22T10:40:20.724Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:20.724Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 108, 1, 'Tsy miovaova mihitsy ny foko, Andriamanitra ô! Hihira sy hitendry mozika ho anao amin’ny foko manontolo aho.', 'tsy miovaova mihitsy ny foko, andriamanitra ô! hihira sy hitendry mozika ho anao amin’ny foko manontolo aho.'),
  ('6ab25b1443ea7ba2ab22b1a3', '2026-09-22T10:40:20.724Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:20.724Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 108, 13, 'Hahazo hery avy amin’Andriamanitra izahay, Ary hanosihosy an’ireo fahavalonay izy.', 'hahazo hery avy amin’andriamanitra izahay, ary hanosihosy an’ireo fahavalonay izy.'),
  ('6ab25b1443ea7ba2ab22b1a1', '2026-09-22T10:40:20.724Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:20.724Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 108, 11, 'Tsy ianao ve, Andriamanitra ô, ilay nanary anay, Ilay Andriamanitray nefa tsy miaraka amin’ny tafikay intsony?', 'tsy ianao ve, andriamanitra ô, ilay nanary anay, ilay andriamanitray nefa tsy miaraka amin’ny tafikay intsony?'),
  ('6ab25b1443ea7ba2ab22b19a', '2026-09-22T10:40:20.724Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:20.724Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 108, 4, 'Fa tena lehibe ny fitiavanao ka tonga hatreny amin’ny lanitra, Ary ny tsy fivadihanao mipaka hatreny amin’ny rahona.', 'fa tena lehibe ny fitiavanao ka tonga hatreny amin’ny lanitra, ary ny tsy fivadihanao mipaka hatreny amin’ny rahona.'),
  ('6ab25b1443ea7ba2ab22b199', '2026-09-22T10:40:20.724Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:20.724Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 108, 3, 'Hidera anao eo amin’ny vahoaka aho, Jehovah ô, Ary hihira fiderana ho anao eo amin’ireo firenena.', 'hidera anao eo amin’ny vahoaka aho, jehovah ô, ary hihira fiderana ho anao eo amin’ireo firenena.'),
  ('6ab25b163e697d81deb687ee', '2026-09-22T10:40:22.032Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:22.032Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 109, 6, 'Manendre ratsy fanahy hanam-pahefana aminy; Hisy mpanohitra anie hitsangana eo ankavanany!', 'manendre ratsy fanahy hanam-pahefana aminy; hisy mpanohitra anie hitsangana eo ankavanany!'),
  ('6ab25b163e697d81deb68805', '2026-09-22T10:40:22.032Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:22.032Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 109, 29, 'Aoka hitafy fahafaham-baraka ireo manohitra ahy; Enga anie handrakotra azy ireo toy ny akanjo lava ny henatr’izy ireo!', 'aoka hitafy fahafaham-baraka ireo manohitra ahy; enga anie handrakotra azy ireo toy ny akanjo lava ny henatr’izy ireo!'),
  ('6ab25b163e697d81deb68800', '2026-09-22T10:40:22.032Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:22.032Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 109, 24, 'Mangozohozo ny lohaliko noho izaho mifady hanina; Mihamahia aho, ary mihakely hery.', 'mangozohozo ny lohaliko noho izaho mifady hanina; mihamahia aho, ary mihakely hery.'),
  ('6ab25b163e697d81deb687fc', '2026-09-22T10:40:22.032Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:22.032Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 109, 20, 'Izany no avalin’i Jehovah an’ilay manohitra ahy Sy avaliny an’ireo manaratsy ahy.', 'izany no avalin’i jehovah an’ilay manohitra ahy sy avaliny an’ireo manaratsy ahy.'),
  ('6ab25b163e697d81deb687f9', '2026-09-22T10:40:22.032Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:22.032Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 109, 17, 'Tia nanozona izy, ka voaozona; Tsy te hitso-drano izy, ka tsy nahazo tsodrano.', 'tia nanozona izy, ka voaozona; tsy te hitso-drano izy, ka tsy nahazo tsodrano.'),
  ('6ab25b163e697d81deb687fb', '2026-09-22T10:40:22.032Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:22.032Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 109, 19, 'Ho toy ny akanjo mandrakotra ny vatany anie ny ozona nataony, Ary ho toy ny fehikibo anaovany foana!', 'ho toy ny akanjo mandrakotra ny vatany anie ny ozona nataony, ary ho toy ny fehikibo anaovany foana!'),
  ('6ab25b163e697d81deb687f8', '2026-09-22T10:40:22.032Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:22.032Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 109, 16, 'Tsy mba nahatsiaro haneho hatsaram-panahy mantsy izy io, Fa nenjehiny foana ny olona mijaly sy ny mahantra ary ny torotoro fo, Mba hamonoany azy ho faty.', 'tsy mba nahatsiaro haneho hatsaram-panahy mantsy izy io, fa nenjehiny foana ny olona mijaly sy ny mahantra ary ny torotoro fo, mba hamonoany azy ho faty.'),
  ('6ab25b163e697d81deb687f4', '2026-09-22T10:40:22.032Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:22.032Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 109, 12, 'Enga anie ka tsy hisy olona ho tsara fanahy aminy, Ary tsy hisy hiantra an’ireo zanany kamboty ray!', 'enga anie ka tsy hisy olona ho tsara fanahy aminy, ary tsy hisy hiantra an’ireo zanany kamboty ray!'),
  ('6ab25b163e697d81deb687ea', '2026-09-22T10:40:22.032Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:22.032Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 109, 2, 'Fa manoka-bava hamelezana ahy ny ratsy fanahy sy ny mpamitaka. Milaza lainga momba ahy izy ireo;', 'fa manoka-bava hamelezana ahy ny ratsy fanahy sy ny mpamitaka. milaza lainga momba ahy izy ireo;'),
  ('6ab25b163e697d81deb68804', '2026-09-22T10:40:22.032Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:22.032Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 109, 28, 'Aoka izy ireo hanozona, fa ianao kosa hitso-drano. Enga anie izy ireo ho menatra rehefa mitsangana hanohitra ahy, Fa ny mpanomponao kosa hifaly.', 'aoka izy ireo hanozona, fa ianao kosa hitso-drano. enga anie izy ireo ho menatra rehefa mitsangana hanohitra ahy, fa ny mpanomponao kosa hifaly.'),
  ('6ab25b163e697d81deb687fd', '2026-09-22T10:40:22.032Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:22.032Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 109, 21, 'Fa ianao kosa ry Jehovah Tompo Fara Tampony ô, Ampio aho noho ny anaranao. Vonjeo aho, fa tsara ny fitiavanao sy ny tsy fivadihanao.', 'fa ianao kosa ry jehovah tompo fara tampony ô, ampio aho noho ny anaranao. vonjeo aho, fa tsara ny fitiavanao sy ny tsy fivadihanao.'),
  ('6ab25b163e697d81deb687f7', '2026-09-22T10:40:22.032Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:22.032Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 109, 15, 'Ho ao an-tsain’i Jehovah foana anie izay nataon’izy ireo, Ary hofoanany tsy ho eto an-tany ny fahatsiarovana azy ireo!', 'ho ao an-tsain’i jehovah foana anie izay nataon’izy ireo, ary hofoanany tsy ho eto an-tany ny fahatsiarovana azy ireo!'),
  ('6ab25b163e697d81deb687f1', '2026-09-22T10:40:22.032Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:22.032Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 109, 9, 'Aoka ho kamboty ray ny zanany, Ary ho mpitondratena ny vadiny.', 'aoka ho kamboty ray ny zanany, ary ho mpitondratena ny vadiny.'),
  ('6ab25b163e697d81deb687ef', '2026-09-22T10:40:22.032Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:22.032Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 109, 7, 'Enga anie izy ho hita fa meloka rehefa tsaraina; Enga anie hoheverina ho fahotana na dia ny vavaka ataony aza!', 'enga anie izy ho hita fa meloka rehefa tsaraina; enga anie hoheverina ho fahotana na dia ny vavaka ataony aza!'),
  ('6ab25b163e697d81deb687eb', '2026-09-22T10:40:22.032Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:22.032Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 109, 3, 'Tototry ny teny feno fankahalana ataon’ny manodidina aho, Ary miady amiko tsy amin’antony izy ireo.', 'tototry ny teny feno fankahalana ataon’ny manodidina aho, ary miady amiko tsy amin’antony izy ireo.'),
  ('6ab25b163e697d81deb687f0', '2026-09-22T10:40:22.032Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:22.032Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 109, 8, 'Aoka ho vitsy andro izy; Aoka ho lasan’olon-kafa ny andraikitra notanany.', 'aoka ho vitsy andro izy; aoka ho lasan’olon-kafa ny andraikitra notanany.'),
  ('6ab25b163e697d81deb687ed', '2026-09-22T10:40:22.032Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:22.032Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 109, 5, 'Mamaly ratsy ny soa nataoko izy ireo, Ary fankahalana no avaliny ny fitiavako azy.', 'mamaly ratsy ny soa nataoko izy ireo, ary fankahalana no avaliny ny fitiavako azy.'),
  ('6ab25b163e697d81deb687e9', '2026-09-22T10:40:22.032Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:22.032Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 109, 1, 'Ry Andriamanitra ô! Ianao no deraiko. Aza mangina fotsiny.', 'ry andriamanitra ô! ianao no deraiko. aza mangina fotsiny.'),
  ('6ab25b163e697d81deb68801', '2026-09-22T10:40:22.032Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:22.032Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 109, 25, 'Lasa esoesoin’izy ireo aho. Mihivingivin-doha izy ireo rehefa mahita ahy.', 'lasa esoesoin’izy ireo aho. mihivingivin-doha izy ireo rehefa mahita ahy.'),
  ('6ab25b163e697d81deb687f6', '2026-09-22T10:40:22.032Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:22.032Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 109, 14, 'Enga anie hotadidin’i Jehovah ny fahadisoan’ireo razambeny, Ary tsy hokosehina ny fahotan-dreniny!', 'enga anie hotadidin’i jehovah ny fahadisoan’ireo razambeny, ary tsy hokosehina ny fahotan-dreniny!'),
  ('6ab25b163e697d81deb687f5', '2026-09-22T10:40:22.032Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:22.032Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 109, 13, 'Aoka haringana ny taranany; Hofafana anie ny anaran’izy ireo ka tsy ho tsaroan’ny taranaka mandimby azy!', 'aoka haringana ny taranany; hofafana anie ny anaran’izy ireo ka tsy ho tsaroan’ny taranaka mandimby azy!'),
  ('6ab25b163e697d81deb68806', '2026-09-22T10:40:22.032Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:22.032Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 109, 30, 'Hafana fo hidera an’i Jehovah ny vavako; Hidera azy eo anoloan’ny olona be dia be aho.', 'hafana fo hidera an’i jehovah ny vavako; hidera azy eo anoloan’ny olona be dia be aho.'),
  ('6ab25b163e697d81deb687f2', '2026-09-22T10:40:22.032Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:22.032Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 109, 10, 'Enga anie ho lasa mpangataka mirenireny ny zanany, Ka hitady hanina lavitry ny tranony efa ravarava.', 'enga anie ho lasa mpangataka mirenireny ny zanany, ka hitady hanina lavitry ny tranony efa ravarava.'),
