  ('6ab25b19cb39f33709cab2a0', '2026-09-22T10:40:25.412Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:25.412Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 113, 6, 'Miondrika izy mba hijery ny any an-danitra sy ny etỳ an-tany,', 'miondrika izy mba hijery ny any an-danitra sy ny etỳ an-tany,'),
  ('6ab25b19cb39f33709cab2a3', '2026-09-22T10:40:25.412Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:25.412Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 113, 9, 'Omeny trano ny vehivavy tsy niteraka, Ka ataony lasa reny falifaly manana zanaka maro. Derao i Jah!', 'omeny trano ny vehivavy tsy niteraka, ka ataony lasa reny falifaly manana zanaka maro. derao i jah!'),
  ('6ab25b192cbc0f7c32a55087', '2026-09-22T10:40:25.982Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:25.982Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 114, 6, 'Maninona ianareo, ry tendrombohitra, no nitsambikimbikina toy ny ondrilahy, Ary ianareo, ry havoana, no nitsambikimbikina hoatran’ny zanak’ondry?', 'maninona ianareo, ry tendrombohitra, no nitsambikimbikina toy ny ondrilahy, ary ianareo, ry havoana, no nitsambikimbikina hoatran’ny zanak’ondry?'),
  ('6ab25b192cbc0f7c32a55084', '2026-09-22T10:40:25.982Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:25.982Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 114, 3, 'Nahita an’izany ny ranomasina ka nandositra; Niverin-dalana ny Reniranon’i Jordana.', 'nahita an’izany ny ranomasina ka nandositra; niverin-dalana ny reniranon’i jordana.'),
  ('6ab25b192cbc0f7c32a55083', '2026-09-22T10:40:25.982Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:25.982Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 114, 2, 'Dia lasa toerany masina i Joda, Ary lasa faritra anjakany i Israely.', 'dia lasa toerany masina i joda, ary lasa faritra anjakany i israely.'),
  ('6ab25b192cbc0f7c32a55086', '2026-09-22T10:40:25.982Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:25.982Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 114, 5, 'Fa inona no nampandositra anao, ry ranomasina? Ary nahoana ianao no niverin-dalana, ry Jordana?', 'fa inona no nampandositra anao, ry ranomasina? ary nahoana ianao no niverin-dalana, ry jordana?'),
  ('6ab25b192cbc0f7c32a55085', '2026-09-22T10:40:25.982Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:25.982Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 114, 4, 'Nitsambikimbikina toy ny ondrilahy ny tendrombohitra, Ary ny havoana nitsambikimbikina hoatran’ny zanak’ondry.', 'nitsambikimbikina toy ny ondrilahy ny tendrombohitra, ary ny havoana nitsambikimbikina hoatran’ny zanak’ondry.'),
  ('6ab25b192cbc0f7c32a55089', '2026-09-22T10:40:25.982Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:25.982Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 114, 8, 'Izay manova ny vatolampy ho farihy anirian’ny bararata, Ary ny vatoafo ho loharano.', 'izay manova ny vatolampy ho farihy anirian’ny bararata, ary ny vatoafo ho loharano.'),
  ('6ab25b192cbc0f7c32a55082', '2026-09-22T10:40:25.982Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:25.982Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 114, 1, 'Rehefa nivoaka avy tany Ejipta ny Israely, Ary nandao firenena mampiasa teny vahiny ny taranak’i Jakoba,', 'rehefa nivoaka avy tany ejipta ny israely, ary nandao firenena mampiasa teny vahiny ny taranak’i jakoba,'),
  ('6ab25b192cbc0f7c32a55088', '2026-09-22T10:40:25.982Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:25.982Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 114, 7, 'Mangovita, ry tany, noho ny amin’ny Tompo, Noho ny amin’Andriamanitr’i Jakoba,', 'mangovita, ry tany, noho ny amin’ny tompo, noho ny amin’andriamanitr’i jakoba,'),
  ('6ab25b1a30f2f5bf2058503c', '2026-09-22T10:40:26.437Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:26.437Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 115, 13, 'Hotahiny izay rehetra matahotra an’i Jehovah, Na ny kely na ny lehibe.', 'hotahiny izay rehetra matahotra an’i jehovah, na ny kely na ny lehibe.'),
  ('6ab25b1a30f2f5bf20585031', '2026-09-22T10:40:26.437Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:26.437Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 115, 2, 'Nahoana ireo firenena no dia hilaza hoe: “Aiza izay mba Andriamanitr’ireo?”', 'nahoana ireo firenena no dia hilaza hoe: “aiza izay mba andriamanitr’ireo?”'),
  ('6ab25b1a30f2f5bf2058503e', '2026-09-22T10:40:26.437Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:26.437Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 115, 15, 'Hitahy anareo anie i Jehovah, Ilay Mpanao ny lanitra sy ny tany.', 'hitahy anareo anie i jehovah, ilay mpanao ny lanitra sy ny tany.'),
  ('6ab25b1a30f2f5bf20585038', '2026-09-22T10:40:26.437Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:26.437Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 115, 9, 'Matokia an’i Jehovah, ry Israely ô! —Izy no mpanampy sy ampingan’izy ireo.', 'matokia an’i jehovah, ry israely ô! —izy no mpanampy sy ampingan’izy ireo.'),
  ('6ab25b1a30f2f5bf20585037', '2026-09-22T10:40:26.437Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:26.437Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 115, 8, 'Ho lasa hoatr’ireny ny olona manao azy, Sy izay rehetra matoky azy.', 'ho lasa hoatr’ireny ny olona manao azy, sy izay rehetra matoky azy.'),
  ('6ab25b1a30f2f5bf20585040', '2026-09-22T10:40:26.437Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:26.437Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 115, 17, 'Tsy midera an’i Jah ny maty, Dia izay midina any amin’ny fahafatesana.', 'tsy midera an’i jah ny maty, dia izay midina any amin’ny fahafatesana.'),
  ('6ab25b1a30f2f5bf20585033', '2026-09-22T10:40:26.437Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:26.437Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 115, 4, 'Volafotsy sy volamena ny sampin’izy ireo, Sady asa tanan’olombelona.', 'volafotsy sy volamena ny sampin’izy ireo, sady asa tanan’olombelona.'),
  ('6ab25b1a30f2f5bf20585032', '2026-09-22T10:40:26.437Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:26.437Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 115, 3, 'Any an-danitra ny Andriamanitray, Ary ataony izay rehetra tiany.', 'any an-danitra ny andriamanitray, ary ataony izay rehetra tiany.'),
  ('6ab25b1a30f2f5bf2058503f', '2026-09-22T10:40:26.437Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:26.437Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 115, 16, 'Ny lanitra dia an’i Jehovah, Fa ny tany kosa nomeny ho an’ny zanak’olombelona.', 'ny lanitra dia an’i jehovah, fa ny tany kosa nomeny ho an’ny zanak’olombelona.'),
  ('6ab25b1a30f2f5bf20585030', '2026-09-22T10:40:26.437Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:26.437Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 115, 1, 'Aza izahay, Jehovah ô, aza izahay Fa ny anaranao no omena voninahitra Satria be fitiavana sy tsy mivadika ianao ary mendri-pitokisana.', 'aza izahay, jehovah ô, aza izahay fa ny anaranao no omena voninahitra satria be fitiavana sy tsy mivadika ianao ary mendri-pitokisana.'),
  ('6ab25b1a30f2f5bf20585034', '2026-09-22T10:40:26.437Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:26.437Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 115, 5, 'Manam-bava ireny sampy ireny, fa tsy miteny; Mana-maso, fa tsy mahita;', 'manam-bava ireny sampy ireny, fa tsy miteny; mana-maso, fa tsy mahita;'),
  ('6ab25b1a30f2f5bf20585041', '2026-09-22T10:40:26.437Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:26.437Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 115, 18, 'Fa isika kosa hidera an’i Jah Manomboka izao ka ho mandrakizay. Derao i Jah!', 'fa isika kosa hidera an’i jah manomboka izao ka ho mandrakizay. derao i jah!'),
  ('6ab25b1a30f2f5bf20585036', '2026-09-22T10:40:26.437Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:26.437Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 115, 7, 'Manan-tanana, fa tsy mahatsapa; Manan-tongotra, fa tsy mandeha; Ary tsy mahavoaka feo ny tendany.', 'manan-tanana, fa tsy mahatsapa; manan-tongotra, fa tsy mandeha; ary tsy mahavoaka feo ny tendany.'),
  ('6ab25b1a30f2f5bf2058503d', '2026-09-22T10:40:26.437Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:26.437Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 115, 14, 'Hataon’i Jehovah mitombo isa ianareo, Dia ianareo sy ny zanakareo.', 'hataon’i jehovah mitombo isa ianareo, dia ianareo sy ny zanakareo.'),
  ('6ab25b1a30f2f5bf2058503b', '2026-09-22T10:40:26.437Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:26.437Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 115, 12, 'Mahatsiaro antsika i Jehovah, ka hitahy antsika; Hotahiny ny taranak’Israely; Hotahiny ny taranak’i Arona.', 'mahatsiaro antsika i jehovah, ka hitahy antsika; hotahiny ny taranak’israely; hotahiny ny taranak’i arona.'),
  ('6ab25b1a30f2f5bf2058503a', '2026-09-22T10:40:26.437Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:26.437Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 115, 11, 'Ianareo izay matahotra an’i Jehovah, matokia an’i Jehovah. —Izy no mpanampy sy ampingan’izy ireo.', 'ianareo izay matahotra an’i jehovah, matokia an’i jehovah. —izy no mpanampy sy ampingan’izy ireo.'),
  ('6ab25b1a30f2f5bf20585039', '2026-09-22T10:40:26.437Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:26.437Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 115, 10, 'Matokia an’i Jehovah, ry taranak’i Arona ô! —Izy no mpanampy sy ampingan’izy ireo.', 'matokia an’i jehovah, ry taranak’i arona ô! —izy no mpanampy sy ampingan’izy ireo.'),
  ('6ab25b1a30f2f5bf20585035', '2026-09-22T10:40:26.437Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:26.437Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 115, 6, 'Manan-tsofina, fa tsy maheno; Manana orona, fa tsy mandre fofona;', 'manan-tsofina, fa tsy maheno; manana orona, fa tsy mandre fofona;'),
  ('6ab25b1ae6023cbc17174554', '2026-09-22T10:40:26.920Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:26.920Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 116, 1, 'Tiako i Jehovah, Satria mihaino ny feoko izy, dia ny fitalahoako fanampiana.', 'tiako i jehovah, satria mihaino ny feoko izy, dia ny fitalahoako fanampiana.'),
  ('6ab25b1ae6023cbc17174555', '2026-09-22T10:40:26.920Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:26.920Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 116, 2, 'Fa manongilan-tsofina mihaino ahy izy, Ka hiantso azy aho raha mbola velona koa.', 'fa manongilan-tsofina mihaino ahy izy, ka hiantso azy aho raha mbola velona koa.');
INSERT INTO "bible_verses" ("id", "created_date", "updated_date", "created_by_id", "created_by", "translation", "book", "bookOrder", "chapter", "verse", "text", "normalizedText") VALUES
  ('6ab25b1ae6023cbc17174556', '2026-09-22T10:40:26.920Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:26.920Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 116, 3, 'Namatotra ahy toy ny tady ny fahafatesana; Nangeja ahy ny Fasana. Tototry ny fahoriana sy ny alahelo aho.', 'namatotra ahy toy ny tady ny fahafatesana; nangeja ahy ny fasana. tototry ny fahoriana sy ny alahelo aho.'),
  ('6ab25b1ae6023cbc17174557', '2026-09-22T10:40:26.920Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:26.920Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 116, 4, 'Niantso ny anaran’i Jehovah anefa aho, ka niteny hoe: “Jehovah ô, vonjeo aho!”', 'niantso ny anaran’i jehovah anefa aho, ka niteny hoe: “jehovah ô, vonjeo aho!”'),
  ('6ab25b1ae6023cbc17174558', '2026-09-22T10:40:26.920Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:26.920Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 116, 5, 'Mangoraka sy manao ny rariny i Jehovah; Mamindra fo ny Andriamanitsika.', 'mangoraka sy manao ny rariny i jehovah; mamindra fo ny andriamanitsika.'),
  ('6ab25b1ae6023cbc17174559', '2026-09-22T10:40:26.920Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:26.920Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 116, 6, 'Miaro an’ireo mbola tsy dia nahita fiainana i Jehovah. Kivy be aho, ka novonjeny.', 'miaro an’ireo mbola tsy dia nahita fiainana i jehovah. kivy be aho, ka novonjeny.'),
  ('6ab25b1ae6023cbc1717455a', '2026-09-22T10:40:26.920Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:26.920Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 116, 7, 'Hilamin-tsaina indray aho, Fa tsara fanahy amiko i Jehovah.', 'hilamin-tsaina indray aho, fa tsara fanahy amiko i jehovah.'),
  ('6ab25b1ae6023cbc1717455b', '2026-09-22T10:40:26.920Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:26.920Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 116, 8, 'Novonjenao tsy ho faty aho, Nosakananao tsy hirotsaka ny ranomasoko, ary tsy ho tafintohina ny tongotro.', 'novonjenao tsy ho faty aho, nosakananao tsy hirotsaka ny ranomasoko, ary tsy ho tafintohina ny tongotro.'),
  ('6ab25b1ae6023cbc1717455c', '2026-09-22T10:40:26.920Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:26.920Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 116, 9, 'Handeha eo anatrehan’i Jehovah aho, eo amin’ny tanin’ny velona.', 'handeha eo anatrehan’i jehovah aho, eo amin’ny tanin’ny velona.'),
  ('6ab25b1ae6023cbc1717455d', '2026-09-22T10:40:26.920Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:26.920Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 116, 10, 'Nino aho ka niteny; Nijaly be mihitsy aho.', 'nino aho ka niteny; nijaly be mihitsy aho.'),
  ('6ab25b1ae6023cbc1717455e', '2026-09-22T10:40:26.920Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:26.920Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 116, 11, 'Natahotra be aho ka niteny hoe: “Mpandainga daholo ny olona rehetra.”', 'natahotra be aho ka niteny hoe: “mpandainga daholo ny olona rehetra.”'),
  ('6ab25b1ae6023cbc1717455f', '2026-09-22T10:40:26.920Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:26.920Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 116, 12, 'Inona no havaliko an’i Jehovah Noho ny soa rehetra nataony tamiko?', 'inona no havaliko an’i jehovah noho ny soa rehetra nataony tamiko?'),
  ('6ab25b1ae6023cbc17174560', '2026-09-22T10:40:26.920Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:26.920Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 116, 13, 'Horaisiko ny kaopin’ny famonjena, Ary hiantso ny anaran’i Jehovah aho.', 'horaisiko ny kaopin’ny famonjena, ary hiantso ny anaran’i jehovah aho.'),
  ('6ab25b1ae6023cbc17174561', '2026-09-22T10:40:26.920Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:26.920Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 116, 14, 'Hanefa ny voadiko amin’i Jehovah aho, Eo anatrehan’ny vahoakany rehetra.', 'hanefa ny voadiko amin’i jehovah aho, eo anatrehan’ny vahoakany rehetra.'),
  ('6ab25b1ae6023cbc17174562', '2026-09-22T10:40:26.920Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:26.920Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 116, 15, 'Tena mafy amin’i Jehovah Ny fahafatesan’ireo olona tsy mivadika aminy.', 'tena mafy amin’i jehovah ny fahafatesan’ireo olona tsy mivadika aminy.'),
  ('6ab25b1ae6023cbc17174563', '2026-09-22T10:40:26.920Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:26.920Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 116, 16, 'Jehovah ô, mitalaho aminao aho Fa mpanomponao! Mpanomponao aho sady zanaky ny mpanompovavinao. Novahanao ny fatorako.', 'jehovah ô, mitalaho aminao aho fa mpanomponao! mpanomponao aho sady zanaky ny mpanompovavinao. novahanao ny fatorako.'),
  ('6ab25b1ae6023cbc17174564', '2026-09-22T10:40:26.920Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:26.920Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Salamo', 19, 116, 17, 'Hanolotra sorona fisaorana ho anao aho; Hiantso ny anaran’i Jehovah aho.', 'hanolotra sorona fisaorana ho anao aho; hiantso ny anaran’i jehovah aho.'),
