  ('6ab25b39e972f772ef7879b9', '2026-09-22T10:40:57.636Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:57.636Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 4, 1, 'Henoy, anaka, ny anatry ny ray. Mihainoa tsara, dia hahira-tsaina ianareo,', 'henoy, anaka, ny anatry ny ray. mihainoa tsara, dia hahira-tsaina ianareo,'),
  ('6ab25b39e972f772ef7879bc', '2026-09-22T10:40:57.636Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:57.636Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 4, 4, 'Nampianarin’ny raiko aho hoe: “Ataovy ao am-ponao foana ny teniko. Araho foana ny didiko, dia ho ela velona ianao.', 'nampianarin’ny raiko aho hoe: “ataovy ao am-ponao foana ny teniko. araho foana ny didiko, dia ho ela velona ianao.'),
  ('6ab25b39e972f772ef7879bf', '2026-09-22T10:40:57.636Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:57.636Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 4, 7, 'Ny fahendrena no zava-dehibe indrindra, ka miezaha hanana fahendrena. Ary ankoatra an’izay efa azonao rehetra, dia miezaha ho lasa mahira-tsaina.', 'ny fahendrena no zava-dehibe indrindra, ka miezaha hanana fahendrena. ary ankoatra an’izay efa azonao rehetra, dia miezaha ho lasa mahira-tsaina.'),
  ('6ab25b39e972f772ef7879c0', '2026-09-22T10:40:57.636Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:57.637Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 4, 8, 'Hevero ho sarobidy be ny fahendrena, dia hataony misandratra ianao. Homeny voninahitra ianao satria tena tia azy.', 'hevero ho sarobidy be ny fahendrena, dia hataony misandratra ianao. homeny voninahitra ianao satria tena tia azy.'),
  ('6ab25b39e972f772ef7879bd', '2026-09-22T10:40:57.636Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:57.636Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 4, 5, 'Miezaha hanana fahendrena sy ho lasa mahira-tsaina. Aza hadinoina ary aza ialana ny teniko.', 'miezaha hanana fahendrena sy ho lasa mahira-tsaina. aza hadinoina ary aza ialana ny teniko.'),
  ('6ab25b39e972f772ef7879bb', '2026-09-22T10:40:57.636Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:57.636Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 4, 3, 'Tena zanaka hendry aho tamin’ny raiko, Ary izaho ilay tena tian’ny reniko.', 'tena zanaka hendry aho tamin’ny raiko, ary izaho ilay tena tian’ny reniko.'),
  ('6ab25b39e972f772ef7879ba', '2026-09-22T10:40:57.636Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:57.636Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 4, 2, 'Fa homeko torohevitra tsara ianareo, Ka aza lavina ny fampianarako.', 'fa homeko torohevitra tsara ianareo, ka aza lavina ny fampianarako.'),
  ('6ab25b39e972f772ef7879ce', '2026-09-22T10:40:57.637Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:57.637Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 4, 22, 'Fa ho velona izay mahita an’izany, Ary ho salama tsara ny vatany manontolo.', 'fa ho velona izay mahita an’izany, ary ho salama tsara ny vatany manontolo.'),
  ('6ab25b39e972f772ef7879cd', '2026-09-22T10:40:57.637Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:57.637Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 4, 21, 'Afantohy amin’izany foana ny masonao, Dia ataovy ao am-ponao foana izany.', 'afantohy amin’izany foana ny masonao, dia ataovy ao am-ponao foana izany.'),
  ('6ab25b39e972f772ef7879cf', '2026-09-22T10:40:57.637Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:57.637Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 4, 23, 'Arovy ny fonao, mihoatra noho izay rehetra tokony harovana, Fa avy ao aminy ny loharanon’aina.', 'arovy ny fonao, mihoatra noho izay rehetra tokony harovana, fa avy ao aminy ny loharanon’aina.'),
  ('6ab25b39e972f772ef7879c2', '2026-09-22T10:40:57.637Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:57.637Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 4, 10, 'Mihainoa, anaka, ary ekeo ny teniko, Dia hihamaro ny taona hiainanao.', 'mihainoa, anaka, ary ekeo ny teniko, dia hihamaro ny taona hiainanao.'),
  ('6ab25b39e972f772ef7879c6', '2026-09-22T10:40:57.637Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:57.637Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 4, 14, 'Aza mankany amin’ny lalan’ny ratsy fanahy, Ary aza mandeha eny amin’ny lalan’ny olon-dratsy.', 'aza mankany amin’ny lalan’ny ratsy fanahy, ary aza mandeha eny amin’ny lalan’ny olon-dratsy.'),
  ('6ab25b39e972f772ef7879c4', '2026-09-22T10:40:57.637Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:57.637Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 4, 12, 'Rehefa mandeha ianao, dia tsy hisy hanembantsembana, Ary raha mihazakazaka ianao, dia tsy ho tafintohina.', 'rehefa mandeha ianao, dia tsy hisy hanembantsembana, ary raha mihazakazaka ianao, dia tsy ho tafintohina.'),
  ('6ab25b39e972f772ef7879d2', '2026-09-22T10:40:57.637Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:57.637Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 4, 26, 'Ataovy tsy misy mikitoantoana izay andehanan’ny tongotrao, Dia ho azo antoka tsara ny lalanao rehetra.', 'ataovy tsy misy mikitoantoana izay andehanan’ny tongotrao, dia ho azo antoka tsara ny lalanao rehetra.'),
  ('6ab25b39e972f772ef7879ca', '2026-09-22T10:40:57.637Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:57.637Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 4, 18, 'Ny lalan’ny marina kosa toy ny hazavan’ny maraina, Izay mihamazava tsikelikely mandra-pahatoandron’ny andro.', 'ny lalan’ny marina kosa toy ny hazavan’ny maraina, izay mihamazava tsikelikely mandra-pahatoandron’ny andro.'),
  ('6ab25b39e972f772ef7879c5', '2026-09-22T10:40:57.637Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:57.637Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 4, 13, 'Tazòny mafy ny anatra omena anao ka aza avotsotra. Arovy izy fa ainao.', 'tazòny mafy ny anatra omena anao ka aza avotsotra. arovy izy fa ainao.'),
  ('6ab25b39e972f772ef7879cb', '2026-09-22T10:40:57.637Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:57.637Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 4, 19, 'Mitovy amin’ny haizim-pito ny lalan’ny ratsy fanahy. Tsy fantany akory izay mahatafintohina azy.', 'mitovy amin’ny haizim-pito ny lalan’ny ratsy fanahy. tsy fantany akory izay mahatafintohina azy.'),
  ('6ab25b39e972f772ef7879d0', '2026-09-22T10:40:57.637Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:57.637Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 4, 24, 'Ataovy fady anao ny mandainga, Ary ataovy lavitra anao ny milaza teny mamitaka.', 'ataovy fady anao ny mandainga, ary ataovy lavitra anao ny milaza teny mamitaka.'),
  ('6ab25b39e972f772ef7879c3', '2026-09-22T10:40:57.637Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:57.637Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 4, 11, 'Hatoroko anao ny lalan’ny fahendrena. Hotarihiko handeha eo amin’ny lalan’ny fahitsiana ianao.', 'hatoroko anao ny lalan’ny fahendrena. hotarihiko handeha eo amin’ny lalan’ny fahitsiana ianao.'),
  ('6ab25b39e972f772ef7879c8', '2026-09-22T10:40:57.637Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:57.637Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 4, 16, 'Fa tsy matory izy ireny raha tsy avy manao ratsy, Ary tsy mahita tory raha tsy avy mamingana olona.', 'fa tsy matory izy ireny raha tsy avy manao ratsy, ary tsy mahita tory raha tsy avy mamingana olona.'),
  ('6ab25b39e972f772ef7879c7', '2026-09-22T10:40:57.637Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:57.637Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 4, 15, 'Halaviro ny lalany fa aza arahina. Mivilia ary aza mandalo eny.', 'halaviro ny lalany fa aza arahina. mivilia ary aza mandalo eny.'),
  ('6ab25b39e972f772ef7879cc', '2026-09-22T10:40:57.637Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:57.637Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 4, 20, 'Henoy, anaka, ny teniko. Henoy tsara izay lazaiko.', 'henoy, anaka, ny teniko. henoy tsara izay lazaiko.'),
  ('6ab25b39e972f772ef7879d1', '2026-09-22T10:40:57.637Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:57.637Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 4, 25, 'Ataovy mijery tsara ny any aloha ny masonao, Eny, afantohy any aloha ny masonao.', 'ataovy mijery tsara ny any aloha ny masonao, eny, afantohy any aloha ny masonao.'),
  ('6ab25b39e972f772ef7879d3', '2026-09-22T10:40:57.637Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:57.637Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 4, 27, 'Aza mivily miankavanana na miankavia. Aza avela ho any amin’ny ratsy ny tongotrao.', 'aza mivily miankavanana na miankavia. aza avela ho any amin’ny ratsy ny tongotrao.'),
  ('6ab25b39e972f772ef7879c9', '2026-09-22T10:40:57.637Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:57.637Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 4, 17, 'Amin’ireny, dia hoatran’ny mihinana mofo ny manao ratsy, Ary hoatran’ny misotro divay ny mampiasa herisetra.', 'amin’ireny, dia hoatran’ny mihinana mofo ny manao ratsy, ary hoatran’ny misotro divay ny mampiasa herisetra.'),
  ('6ab25b39e972f772ef7879c1', '2026-09-22T10:40:57.637Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:57.637Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 4, 9, 'Hasiany fehiloha tsara tarehy ny lohanao, Ary horavahany satroboninahitra tsara tarehy ianao.”', 'hasiany fehiloha tsara tarehy ny lohanao, ary horavahany satroboninahitra tsara tarehy ianao.”'),
  ('6ab25b3a1585ae37a2e33567', '2026-09-22T10:40:58.910Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:58.910Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 5, 1, 'Henoy, anaka, ny tenim-pahendrena lazaiko. Henoy tsara fa ampianariko anao ny atao hoe mahay mandinika,', 'henoy, anaka, ny tenim-pahendrena lazaiko. henoy tsara fa ampianariko anao ny atao hoe mahay mandinika,'),
  ('6ab25b3a1585ae37a2e33576', '2026-09-22T10:40:58.911Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:58.911Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 5, 16, 'Ny loharanonao ve dia avelanao hiparitaka eny ivelany, Ary ny ranonao avelanao hikoriana eny amin’ny tany malalaky ny tanàna?', 'ny loharanonao ve dia avelanao hiparitaka eny ivelany, ary ny ranonao avelanao hikoriana eny amin’ny tany malalaky ny tanàna?'),
  ('6ab25b3a1585ae37a2e3356b', '2026-09-22T10:40:58.911Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:58.911Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 5, 5, 'Midina mankany amin’ny fahafatesana ny tongony, Ary mamantana any amin’ny Fasana ny diany.', 'midina mankany amin’ny fahafatesana ny tongony, ary mamantana any amin’ny fasana ny diany.'),
  ('6ab25b3a1585ae37a2e3357b', '2026-09-22T10:40:58.911Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:58.911Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 5, 21, 'Fa hitan’i Jehovah izay ataon’ny olona, Ary dinihiny tsara daholo ny lalany rehetra.', 'fa hitan’i jehovah izay ataon’ny olona, ary dinihiny tsara daholo ny lalany rehetra.'),
  ('6ab25b3a1585ae37a2e3356a', '2026-09-22T10:40:58.911Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:58.911Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 5, 4, 'Mangidy be toy ny vahona anefa ilay vehivavy amin’ny farany, Ary maranitra hoatran’ny sabatra roa lela.', 'mangidy be toy ny vahona anefa ilay vehivavy amin’ny farany, ary maranitra hoatran’ny sabatra roa lela.'),
  ('6ab25b3a1585ae37a2e33575', '2026-09-22T10:40:58.911Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:58.911Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 5, 15, 'Misotroa rano avy ao amin’ny lavaka fanangonanao rano, Ary misotroa rano velona avy ao amin’ny lavadranonao.', 'misotroa rano avy ao amin’ny lavaka fanangonanao rano, ary misotroa rano velona avy ao amin’ny lavadranonao.'),
  ('6ab25b3a1585ae37a2e3356c', '2026-09-22T10:40:58.911Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:58.911Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 5, 6, 'Tsy mba miraharaha ny lalan’ny fiainana izy. Mirenireny eny izy, nefa tsy fantany hoe ho aiza.', 'tsy mba miraharaha ny lalan’ny fiainana izy. mirenireny eny izy, nefa tsy fantany hoe ho aiza.'),
  ('6ab25b3a1585ae37a2e3356f', '2026-09-22T10:40:58.911Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:58.911Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 5, 9, 'Sao homenao olona ny hajanao, Ary hijinja ny vokany ianao, ka hijaly mandritra ny taona maro.', 'sao homenao olona ny hajanao, ary hijinja ny vokany ianao, ka hijaly mandritra ny taona maro.'),
  ('6ab25b3a1585ae37a2e33571', '2026-09-22T10:40:58.911Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:58.911Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 5, 11, 'Sao hitaraindraina ianao rehefa ho faty, Sy rehefa ho levona ny nofonao sy ny vatanao.', 'sao hitaraindraina ianao rehefa ho faty, sy rehefa ho levona ny nofonao sy ny vatanao.'),
  ('6ab25b3a1585ae37a2e33573', '2026-09-22T10:40:58.911Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:58.911Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 5, 13, 'Tsy mba nohenoiko ny tenin’ny mpanoro hevitra ahy, Ary tsy noraharahiako izay nolazain’ny mpampianatra ahy.', 'tsy mba nohenoiko ny tenin’ny mpanoro hevitra ahy, ary tsy noraharahiako izay nolazain’ny mpampianatra ahy.'),
  ('6ab25b3a1585ae37a2e3356e', '2026-09-22T10:40:58.911Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:58.911Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 5, 8, 'Ialao lavitra be ny vehivavy toy izany, Ary aza manakaiky ny fidirana mankao an-tranony,', 'ialao lavitra be ny vehivavy toy izany, ary aza manakaiky ny fidirana mankao an-tranony,'),
  ('6ab25b3a1585ae37a2e3356d', '2026-09-22T10:40:58.911Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:58.911Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 5, 7, 'Henoy àry aho, anaka, Ary aza hadinoina izay teneniko.', 'henoy àry aho, anaka, ary aza hadinoina izay teneniko.'),
  ('6ab25b3a1585ae37a2e3357c', '2026-09-22T10:40:58.911Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:58.911Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 5, 22, 'Voafandriky ny ratsy nataony ihany ny ratsy fanahy, Ary ho voafatotry ny fahotany ihany izy.', 'voafandriky ny ratsy nataony ihany ny ratsy fanahy, ary ho voafatotry ny fahotany ihany izy.'),
  ('6ab25b3a1585ae37a2e33572', '2026-09-22T10:40:58.911Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:58.911Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 5, 12, 'Dia hilaza ianao amin’izay hoe: “Fa naninona re aho no nankahala anatra e? Naninona re ny foko no tsy niraharaha fananarana e?', 'dia hilaza ianao amin’izay hoe: “fa naninona re aho no nankahala anatra e? naninona re ny foko no tsy niraharaha fananarana e?'),
  ('6ab25b3a1585ae37a2e33569', '2026-09-22T10:40:58.911Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:58.911Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 5, 3, 'Fa mamy hoatran’ny tantely ny tenin’ny vehivavy maditra, Ary malefaka noho ny menaka ny vavany.', 'fa mamy hoatran’ny tantely ny tenin’ny vehivavy maditra, ary malefaka noho ny menaka ny vavany.'),
  ('6ab25b3a1585ae37a2e33568', '2026-09-22T10:40:58.911Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:58.911Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 5, 2, 'Amin’izay ianao hahay hisaina tsara foana, Ka hifanaraka amin’ny fahalalana foana ny zavatra lazainao.', 'amin’izay ianao hahay hisaina tsara foana, ka hifanaraka amin’ny fahalalana foana ny zavatra lazainao.'),
  ('6ab25b3a1585ae37a2e3357a', '2026-09-22T10:40:58.911Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:58.911Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 5, 20, 'Fa nahoana ianao, anaka, no ho babon’ny vehivavy maditra, Na hamihina ny tratran’ny vehivavy ratsy fitondran-tena?', 'fa nahoana ianao, anaka, no ho babon’ny vehivavy maditra, na hamihina ny tratran’ny vehivavy ratsy fitondran-tena?'),
  ('6ab25b3a1585ae37a2e33578', '2026-09-22T10:40:58.911Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:58.911Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 5, 18, 'Enga anie hotahina ny loharanonao! Ary enga anie ianao hifaly amin’ny vadin’ny fahatanoranao!', 'enga anie hotahina ny loharanonao! ary enga anie ianao hifaly amin’ny vadin’ny fahatanoranao!'),
  ('6ab25b3a1585ae37a2e33577', '2026-09-22T10:40:58.911Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:58.911Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 5, 17, 'Aleo ho anao irery izany, Fa tsy ho an’ny vahiny eo aminao.', 'aleo ho anao irery izany, fa tsy ho an’ny vahiny eo aminao.'),
