  ('6ab25b3b22643ce19bb51e9f', '2026-09-22T10:40:59.887Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:59.887Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 6, 3, 'Dia efa eo am-pelatanan’ilay olona ianao, anaka, Ka izao atao raha te ho afaka ianao: Mandehana manetry tena eo anatrehany, dia iangavio mafy izy.', 'dia efa eo am-pelatanan’ilay olona ianao, anaka, ka izao atao raha te ho afaka ianao: mandehana manetry tena eo anatrehany, dia iangavio mafy izy.'),
  ('6ab25b3b22643ce19bb51ea1', '2026-09-22T10:40:59.887Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:59.887Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 6, 5, 'Afaho ny tenanao, hoatran’ny gazela mandositra avy eny an-tanan’ny mpihaza, Sy toy ny vorona mandositra avy eny an-tanan’ny mpamandri-borona.', 'afaho ny tenanao, hoatran’ny gazela mandositra avy eny an-tanan’ny mpihaza, sy toy ny vorona mandositra avy eny an-tanan’ny mpamandri-borona.'),
  ('6ab25b3b22643ce19bb51ea2', '2026-09-22T10:40:59.887Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:59.887Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 6, 6, 'Mandehana any amin’ny vitsika, ry ilay kamo, Ary diniho ny fanaony ka mba hendre.', 'mandehana any amin’ny vitsika, ry ilay kamo, ary diniho ny fanaony ka mba hendre.'),
  ('6ab25b3b22643ce19bb51eaa', '2026-09-22T10:40:59.887Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:59.887Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 6, 14, 'Zava-dratsy ihany no ao am-pony, Dia mitetika ny hanao ratsy foana izy, sady tsy manao afa-tsy ny mampiady olona.', 'zava-dratsy ihany no ao am-pony, dia mitetika ny hanao ratsy foana izy, sady tsy manao afa-tsy ny mampiady olona.'),
  ('6ab25b3b22643ce19bb51ea6', '2026-09-22T10:40:59.887Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:59.887Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 6, 10, 'Raha mbola hatory kely ihany ianao, mbola ho rendremana kely ihany, Ary mbola haka aina kely ihany,', 'raha mbola hatory kely ihany ianao, mbola ho rendremana kely ihany, ary mbola haka aina kely ihany,'),
  ('6ab25b3b22643ce19bb51ea3', '2026-09-22T10:40:59.887Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:59.887Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 6, 7, 'Na dia tsy manana mpitondra na mpiadidy na mpitarika aza izy,', 'na dia tsy manana mpitondra na mpiadidy na mpitarika aza izy,'),
  ('6ab25b3b22643ce19bb51eab', '2026-09-22T10:40:59.887Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:59.887Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 6, 15, 'Koa hamely azy tampoka ny loza. Ho torotoro ao anatin’ny indray mipy maso izy ka tsy ho sitrana intsony.', 'koa hamely azy tampoka ny loza. ho torotoro ao anatin’ny indray mipy maso izy ka tsy ho sitrana intsony.'),
  ('6ab25b3b22643ce19bb51ea7', '2026-09-22T10:40:59.887Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:59.887Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 6, 11, 'Dia ho avy tampoka hoatran’ny mpangalatra ny fahantranao, Ary ho tonga tampoka hoatran’ny lehilahy mitondra fiadiana ny fahasahirananao.', 'dia ho avy tampoka hoatran’ny mpangalatra ny fahantranao, ary ho tonga tampoka hoatran’ny lehilahy mitondra fiadiana ny fahasahirananao.'),
