  ('6ab25b3b22643ce19bb51eb0', '2026-09-22T10:40:59.888Z', '2026-09-22T10:40:59.888Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 6, 20, 'Araho, anaka, ny didin’ny rainao, Ary aza lavina ny tenin’ny reninao.', 'araho, anaka, ny didin’ny rainao, ary aza lavina ny tenin’ny reninao.'),
  ('6ab25b3eeed05aa1f4a1aec6', '2026-09-22T10:41:02.098Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:02.098Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 9, 16, '“Tongava atỳ izay mbola tsy dia nahita fiainana!” Hoy koa izy amin’ny tsy ampy saina:', '“tongava atỳ izay mbola tsy dia nahita fiainana!” hoy koa izy amin’ny tsy ampy saina:'),
  ('6ab25b3eeed05aa1f4a1aec3', '2026-09-22T10:41:02.098Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:02.098Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 9, 13, 'Petsam-bava ny vehivavy tsisy saina, Dondrona izy sady tsy mahay na inona na inona mihitsy.', 'petsam-bava ny vehivavy tsisy saina, dondrona izy sady tsy mahay na inona na inona mihitsy.'),
  ('6ab25b3eeed05aa1f4a1aebe', '2026-09-22T10:41:02.098Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:02.098Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 9, 8, 'Aza mananatra ny mpanesoeso sao ho halany ianao. Ny hendry kosa no anaro dia ho tiany ianao.', 'aza mananatra ny mpanesoeso sao ho halany ianao. ny hendry kosa no anaro dia ho tiany ianao.'),
  ('6ab25b3eeed05aa1f4a1aebc', '2026-09-22T10:41:02.098Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:02.098Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 9, 6, 'Ialao ny tsy fahamatorana dia ho velona ianao, Ary avelao hitarika anao ny fahiratan-tsaina.”', 'ialao ny tsy fahamatorana dia ho velona ianao, ary avelao hitarika anao ny fahiratan-tsaina.”'),
  ('6ab25b3eeed05aa1f4a1aec4', '2026-09-22T10:41:02.098Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:02.098Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 9, 14, 'Mipetraka eo ambony seza eo am-baravaran’ny tranony izy, Eny amin’ny toerana avoavo ao an-tanànany,', 'mipetraka eo ambony seza eo am-baravaran’ny tranony izy, eny amin’ny toerana avoavo ao an-tanànany,'),
  ('6ab25b3eeed05aa1f4a1aeba', '2026-09-22T10:41:02.098Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:02.098Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 9, 4, '“Tongava atỳ izay mbola tsy dia nahita fiainana!” Hoy koa izy amin’ny tsy ampy saina:', '“tongava atỳ izay mbola tsy dia nahita fiainana!” hoy koa izy amin’ny tsy ampy saina:'),
  ('6ab25b3eeed05aa1f4a1aec8', '2026-09-22T10:41:02.098Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:02.098Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 9, 18, 'Tsy fantatr’izy ireny anefa hoe ny maty, izay tsy mahavita na inona na inona, no any, Ary any amin’ny Fasana ny olona nasain’ilay vehivavy.', 'tsy fantatr’izy ireny anefa hoe ny maty, izay tsy mahavita na inona na inona, no any, ary any amin’ny fasana ny olona nasain’ilay vehivavy.'),
  ('6ab25b3eeed05aa1f4a1aec0', '2026-09-22T10:41:02.098Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:02.098Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 9, 10, 'Ny fahatahorana an’i Jehovah no fiandohan’ny fahendrena, Ary izay mahalala an’Ilay Masina Indrindra no mahira-tsaina.', 'ny fahatahorana an’i jehovah no fiandohan’ny fahendrena, ary izay mahalala an’ilay masina indrindra no mahira-tsaina.'),
  ('6ab25b3eeed05aa1f4a1aeb9', '2026-09-22T10:41:02.098Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:02.098Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 9, 3, 'Dia nirahiny ny ankizivavy mpanompony, Mba hiantsoantso eny amin’ny toerana avoavo ao an-tanàna hoe:', 'dia nirahiny ny ankizivavy mpanompony, mba hiantsoantso eny amin’ny toerana avoavo ao an-tanàna hoe:'),
  ('6ab25b3eeed05aa1f4a1aec5', '2026-09-22T10:41:02.098Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:02.098Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 9, 15, 'Sady miantsoantso an’izay mandalo, Dia izay mandeha eny an-dalana, hoe:', 'sady miantsoantso an’izay mandalo, dia izay mandeha eny an-dalana, hoe:'),
  ('6ab25b3eeed05aa1f4a1aebd', '2026-09-22T10:41:02.098Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:02.098Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 9, 7, 'Manala baraka ny tenany izay manitsy ny mpanesoeso. Ary hahita loza izay mananatra ny ratsy fanahy.', 'manala baraka ny tenany izay manitsy ny mpanesoeso. ary hahita loza izay mananatra ny ratsy fanahy.'),
  ('6ab25b3eeed05aa1f4a1aebb', '2026-09-22T10:41:02.098Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:02.098Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 9, 5, '“Avia hihinana ny mofo nokarakaraiko, Sy hisotro ny divay efa nasiako fangarony.', '“avia hihinana ny mofo nokarakaraiko, sy hisotro ny divay efa nasiako fangarony.'),
  ('6ab25b3eeed05aa1f4a1aec2', '2026-09-22T10:41:02.098Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:02.098Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 9, 12, 'Raha lasa hendry ianao, dia ianao ihany no handray soa amin’izany, Fa raha manesoeso ianao, dia ianao ihany no hizaka ny vokany.', 'raha lasa hendry ianao, dia ianao ihany no handray soa amin’izany, fa raha manesoeso ianao, dia ianao ihany no hizaka ny vokany.'),
  ('6ab25b3eeed05aa1f4a1aec1', '2026-09-22T10:41:02.098Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:02.098Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 9, 11, 'Izaho no manalava ny androm-piainanao, Sy mampitombo ny taona iainanao.', 'izaho no manalava ny androm-piainanao, sy mampitombo ny taona iainanao.'),
  ('6ab25b3eeed05aa1f4a1aeb7', '2026-09-22T10:41:02.098Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:02.098Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 9, 1, 'Nanorina ny tranony ny tena fahendrena, Ary nanangana ny andry fito amin’ilay trano.', 'nanorina ny tranony ny tena fahendrena, ary nanangana ny andry fito amin’ilay trano.'),
  ('6ab25b3eeed05aa1f4a1aec7', '2026-09-22T10:41:02.098Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:02.098Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 9, 17, '“Mamy ny rano nangalarina, Ary tsara ny mofo hanina miafina.”', '“mamy ny rano nangalarina, ary tsara ny mofo hanina miafina.”'),
  ('6ab25b3eeed05aa1f4a1aebf', '2026-09-22T10:41:02.098Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:02.098Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 9, 9, 'Toroy hevitra ny hendry, dia vao mainka izy ho hendry. Ampianaro ny olo-marina, dia hitombo ny zavatra fantany.', 'toroy hevitra ny hendry, dia vao mainka izy ho hendry. ampianaro ny olo-marina, dia hitombo ny zavatra fantany.'),
  ('6ab25b3eeed05aa1f4a1aeb8', '2026-09-22T10:41:02.098Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:02.098Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 9, 2, 'Nokarakarainy tsara ny hena, Dia nasiany fangarony ny divainy, Ary nataony vonona ny latabatra.', 'nokarakarainy tsara ny hena, dia nasiany fangarony ny divainy, ary nataony vonona ny latabatra.'),
  ('6ab25b3fce012678f7f55dae', '2026-09-22T10:41:03.246Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:03.246Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 10, 24, 'Ny zavatra atahoran’ny ratsy fanahy mihitsy no hanjo azy, Fa ho tanteraka kosa ny fanirian’ny olo-marina.', 'ny zavatra atahoran’ny ratsy fanahy mihitsy no hanjo azy, fa ho tanteraka kosa ny fanirian’ny olo-marina.'),
  ('6ab25b3fce012678f7f55d9a', '2026-09-22T10:41:03.246Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:03.246Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 10, 4, 'Ny tanan’ny kamo mampahantra, Fa ny tanan’ny mazoto kosa mampanan-karena.', 'ny tanan’ny kamo mampahantra, fa ny tanan’ny mazoto kosa mampanan-karena.'),
  ('6ab25b3fce012678f7f55daa', '2026-09-22T10:41:03.246Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:03.246Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 10, 20, 'Hoatran’ny volafotsy faran’izay tsara ny lelan’ny marina, Fa tsy dia misy vidiny kosa ny fon’ny ratsy fanahy.', 'hoatran’ny volafotsy faran’izay tsara ny lelan’ny marina, fa tsy dia misy vidiny kosa ny fon’ny ratsy fanahy.'),
  ('6ab25b3fce012678f7f55da5', '2026-09-22T10:41:03.246Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:03.246Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 10, 15, 'Ny harenan’ny mpanankarena no miaro azy, toy ny tanàna misy manda, Fa ny fahantran’ny sahirana kosa no mahavoa azy.', 'ny harenan’ny mpanankarena no miaro azy, toy ny tanàna misy manda, fa ny fahantran’ny sahirana kosa no mahavoa azy.'),
  ('6ab25b3fce012678f7f55da4', '2026-09-22T10:41:03.246Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:03.246Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 10, 14, 'Mitahiry fahalalana ny hendry, Fa ny vavan’ny adala kosa mahatonga azy ho ringana.', 'mitahiry fahalalana ny hendry, fa ny vavan’ny adala kosa mahatonga azy ho ringana.'),
  ('6ab25b3fce012678f7f55d9b', '2026-09-22T10:41:03.246Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:03.246Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 10, 5, 'Manangom-bokatra mandritra ny fahavaratra ny zanaka hendry, Fa matory mandritra ny fijinjana ny zanaka manala baraka.', 'manangom-bokatra mandritra ny fahavaratra ny zanaka hendry, fa matory mandritra ny fijinjana ny zanaka manala baraka.'),
  ('6ab25b3fce012678f7f55d99', '2026-09-22T10:41:03.246Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:03.246Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 10, 3, 'Tsy havelan’i Jehovah ho noana ny olo-marina, Fa holaviny kosa izay irin’ny ratsy fanahy.', 'tsy havelan’i jehovah ho noana ny olo-marina, fa holaviny kosa izay irin’ny ratsy fanahy.'),
  ('6ab25b3fce012678f7f55da7', '2026-09-22T10:41:03.246Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:03.246Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 10, 17, 'Mitarika olona hanaraka ny lalan’ny fiainana ny olona mihaino anatra, Fa izay tsy miraharaha anatra kosa mitarika olona hanaraka lalan-diso.', 'mitarika olona hanaraka ny lalan’ny fiainana ny olona mihaino anatra, fa izay tsy miraharaha anatra kosa mitarika olona hanaraka lalan-diso.'),
  ('6ab25b3fce012678f7f55da3', '2026-09-22T10:41:03.246Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:03.246Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 10, 13, 'Milaza tenim-pahendrena ny molotry ny olona mahay mandinika, Fa natao ho an’ny lamosin’ny tsy ampy saina kosa ny tsorakazo.', 'milaza tenim-pahendrena ny molotry ny olona mahay mandinika, fa natao ho an’ny lamosin’ny tsy ampy saina kosa ny tsorakazo.'),
  ('6ab25b3fce012678f7f55d98', '2026-09-22T10:41:03.246Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:03.246Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 10, 2, 'Tsy mahasoa ny harena azo tamin’ny tsy marina, Fa hiaro ny olona tsy ho faty kosa ny fanaovana ny marina.', 'tsy mahasoa ny harena azo tamin’ny tsy marina, fa hiaro ny olona tsy ho faty kosa ny fanaovana ny marina.'),
  ('6ab25b3fce012678f7f55da1', '2026-09-22T10:41:03.246Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:03.246Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 10, 11, 'Loharanon’aina ny vavan’ny olo-marina, Fa herisetra kosa no ao ambadiky ny tenin’ny ratsy fanahy.', 'loharanon’aina ny vavan’ny olo-marina, fa herisetra kosa no ao ambadiky ny tenin’ny ratsy fanahy.'),
  ('6ab25b3fce012678f7f55dac', '2026-09-22T10:41:03.246Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:03.246Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 10, 22, 'Ny fitahian’i Jehovah no mampanan-karena, Ary tsy ampiany fijaliana izany.', 'ny fitahian’i jehovah no mampanan-karena, ary tsy ampiany fijaliana izany.'),
  ('6ab25b3fce012678f7f55db4', '2026-09-22T10:41:03.246Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:03.246Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 10, 30, 'Tsy ho lavo mihitsy ny olo-marina, Fa ny ratsy fanahy kosa tsy hisy eto an-tany intsony.', 'tsy ho lavo mihitsy ny olo-marina, fa ny ratsy fanahy kosa tsy hisy eto an-tany intsony.'),
  ('6ab25b3fce012678f7f55db0', '2026-09-22T10:41:03.246Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:03.246Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 10, 26, 'Toy ny vinaingitra amin’ny nify sy toy ny setroka amin’ny maso, Dia hoatr’izany koa ny kamo amin’ny olona maniraka azy.', 'toy ny vinaingitra amin’ny nify sy toy ny setroka amin’ny maso, dia hoatr’izany koa ny kamo amin’ny olona maniraka azy.'),
  ('6ab25b3fce012678f7f55da9', '2026-09-22T10:41:03.246Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:03.246Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 10, 19, 'Izay be resaka loatra dia tsy maintsy hanota amin’izay lazainy, Fa malina kosa ny olona mahafehy ny vavany.', 'izay be resaka loatra dia tsy maintsy hanota amin’izay lazainy, fa malina kosa ny olona mahafehy ny vavany.'),
  ('6ab25b3fce012678f7f55d9c', '2026-09-22T10:41:03.246Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:03.246Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 10, 6, 'Hotahina ny olo-marina, Fa herisetra kosa no ao ambadiky ny tenin’ny ratsy fanahy.', 'hotahina ny olo-marina, fa herisetra kosa no ao ambadiky ny tenin’ny ratsy fanahy.'),
  ('6ab25b3fce012678f7f55db2', '2026-09-22T10:41:03.246Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:03.246Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 10, 28, 'Mahafalifaly ny fanantenan’ny olo-marina, Fa tsy ho tanteraka mihitsy ny zavatra antenain’ny ratsy fanahy.', 'mahafalifaly ny fanantenan’ny olo-marina, fa tsy ho tanteraka mihitsy ny zavatra antenain’ny ratsy fanahy.'),
  ('6ab25b3fce012678f7f55d9e', '2026-09-22T10:41:03.246Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:03.246Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 10, 8, 'Hanaiky torohevitra ny olona manana fo hendry, Fa ho voahitsakitsaka kosa izay miteniteny foana.', 'hanaiky torohevitra ny olona manana fo hendry, fa ho voahitsakitsaka kosa izay miteniteny foana.'),
  ('6ab25b3fce012678f7f55d9d', '2026-09-22T10:41:03.246Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:03.246Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 10, 7, 'Hotsaroana foana ny olo-marina ka hotahina, Fa ho hadino ny anaran’ny ratsy fanahy.', 'hotsaroana foana ny olo-marina ka hotahina, fa ho hadino ny anaran’ny ratsy fanahy.'),
  ('6ab25b3fce012678f7f55da0', '2026-09-22T10:41:03.246Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:03.246Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 10, 10, 'Mandratra fo ny olona mipy maso nefa te hamitaka, Ary ho voahitsakitsaka izay miteniteny foana.', 'mandratra fo ny olona mipy maso nefa te hamitaka, ary ho voahitsakitsaka izay miteniteny foana.'),
  ('6ab25b3fce012678f7f55da6', '2026-09-22T10:41:03.246Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:03.246Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 10, 16, 'Hahazoana fiainana ny zavatra ataon’ny olo-marina, Fa fahotana kosa no vokatry ny ataon’ny ratsy fanahy.', 'hahazoana fiainana ny zavatra ataon’ny olo-marina, fa fahotana kosa no vokatry ny ataon’ny ratsy fanahy.'),
  ('6ab25b3fce012678f7f55da8', '2026-09-22T10:41:03.246Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:03.246Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 10, 18, 'Mandainga izay mody tsy mankahala, Ary tsisy saina izay manely tsaho.', 'mandainga izay mody tsy mankahala, ary tsisy saina izay manely tsaho.'),
  ('6ab25b3fce012678f7f55daf', '2026-09-22T10:41:03.246Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:03.246Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 10, 25, 'Rehefa mandalo ny tafio-drivotra, dia tsy hisy intsony ny ratsy fanahy, Fa ny olo-marina kosa ho mafy orina mandrakizay.', 'rehefa mandalo ny tafio-drivotra, dia tsy hisy intsony ny ratsy fanahy, fa ny olo-marina kosa ho mafy orina mandrakizay.'),
  ('6ab25b3fce012678f7f55dad', '2026-09-22T10:41:03.246Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:03.246Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 10, 23, 'Amin’ny tsisy saina, dia toy ny kilalao ny fitondran-tena mahamenatra, Fa natao ho an’ny olona mahay mandinika kosa ny fahendrena.', 'amin’ny tsisy saina, dia toy ny kilalao ny fitondran-tena mahamenatra, fa natao ho an’ny olona mahay mandinika kosa ny fahendrena.'),
  ('6ab25b3fce012678f7f55db1', '2026-09-22T10:41:03.246Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:03.246Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 10, 27, 'Ny tahotra an’i Jehovah no mahela velona, Fa hohafohezina kosa ny taona iainan’ny ratsy fanahy.', 'ny tahotra an’i jehovah no mahela velona, fa hohafohezina kosa ny taona iainan’ny ratsy fanahy.'),
  ('6ab25b3fce012678f7f55da2', '2026-09-22T10:41:03.246Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:03.246Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 10, 12, 'Ny fankahalana no mampiady olona, Fa ny fitiavana indray manarona ny fahadisoana rehetra.', 'ny fankahalana no mampiady olona, fa ny fitiavana indray manarona ny fahadisoana rehetra.'),
  ('6ab25b3fce012678f7f55d9f', '2026-09-22T10:41:03.246Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:03.246Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 10, 9, 'Hilamin-tsaina ny olona tsy mivadika, Fa ny mpamitaka ho tratra eny ihany.', 'hilamin-tsaina ny olona tsy mivadika, fa ny mpamitaka ho tratra eny ihany.'),
  ('6ab25b3fce012678f7f55d97', '2026-09-22T10:41:03.246Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:03.246Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 10, 1, 'Ohabolan’i Solomona. Ny zanaka hendry mampifaly ny rainy, Fa ny zanaka adala mampalahelo ny reniny.', 'ohabolan’i solomona. ny zanaka hendry mampifaly ny rainy, fa ny zanaka adala mampalahelo ny reniny.'),
  ('6ab25b3fce012678f7f55db3', '2026-09-22T10:41:03.246Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:03.246Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 10, 29, 'Manda fiarovana ho an’ny tsy misy tsiny ny lalan’i Jehovah, Fa fandringanana kosa izy io ho an’ny ratsy fanahy.', 'manda fiarovana ho an’ny tsy misy tsiny ny lalan’i jehovah, fa fandringanana kosa izy io ho an’ny ratsy fanahy.'),
  ('6ab25b3fce012678f7f55dab', '2026-09-22T10:41:03.246Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:03.246Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 10, 21, 'Mitari-dalana olona maro ny tenin’ny olo-marina, Fa matin’ny hadalany ihany ny tsisy saina.', 'mitari-dalana olona maro ny tenin’ny olo-marina, fa matin’ny hadalany ihany ny tsisy saina.'),
  ('6ab25b3fce012678f7f55db5', '2026-09-22T10:41:03.247Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:03.247Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 10, 31, 'Milaza fahendrena ny vavan’ny olo-marina, Fa hotapahina kosa ny lelan’ny mpandainga.', 'milaza fahendrena ny vavan’ny olo-marina, fa hotapahina kosa ny lelan’ny mpandainga.'),
  ('6ab25b3fce012678f7f55db6', '2026-09-22T10:41:03.247Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:03.247Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 10, 32, 'Milaza teny mahafinaritra ny molotry ny olo-marina, Fa lainga no eo am-bavan’ny ratsy fanahy.', 'milaza teny mahafinaritra ny molotry ny olo-marina, fa lainga no eo am-bavan’ny ratsy fanahy.'),
  ('6ab25b405c152dc73f06da46', '2026-09-22T10:41:04.386Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:04.386Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 11, 21, 'Matokia fa tsy maintsy ho voasazy ny olon-dratsy, Fa ho afa-mandositra kosa ny zanaky ny olo-marina.', 'matokia fa tsy maintsy ho voasazy ny olon-dratsy, fa ho afa-mandositra kosa ny zanaky ny olo-marina.'),
  ('6ab25b405c152dc73f06da3a', '2026-09-22T10:41:04.386Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:04.386Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 11, 9, 'Mitondra loza ho an’ny namany ny tenin’ny mpivadi-pinoana, Fa ny olo-marina kosa vonjena satria manana fahalalana.', 'mitondra loza ho an’ny namany ny tenin’ny mpivadi-pinoana, fa ny olo-marina kosa vonjena satria manana fahalalana.'),
  ('6ab25b405c152dc73f06da42', '2026-09-22T10:41:04.386Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:04.386Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 11, 17, 'Manao soa amin’ny tenany ny olona tsara fanahy, Fa mampidi-kizo ny tenany kosa ny olona tia mampijaly.', 'manao soa amin’ny tenany ny olona tsara fanahy, fa mampidi-kizo ny tenany kosa ny olona tia mampijaly.'),
  ('6ab25b405c152dc73f06da3d', '2026-09-22T10:41:04.386Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:04.386Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 11, 12, 'Manambanimbany ny namany ny olona tsy ampy saina, Fa mangina kosa ny olona mahay mandinika tsara.', 'manambanimbany ny namany ny olona tsy ampy saina, fa mangina kosa ny olona mahay mandinika tsara.'),
  ('6ab25b405c152dc73f06da36', '2026-09-22T10:41:04.386Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:04.386Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 11, 5, 'Ny fahamarinan’ny tsy misy tsiny no mahatonga azy hanaraka lala-mahitsy, Fa ny ratsy fanahy kosa ho lavo satria manao ratsy.', 'ny fahamarinan’ny tsy misy tsiny no mahatonga azy hanaraka lala-mahitsy, fa ny ratsy fanahy kosa ho lavo satria manao ratsy.');
INSERT INTO "bible_verses" ("id", "created_date", "updated_date", "created_by_id", "created_by", "translation", "book", "bookOrder", "chapter", "verse", "text", "normalizedText") VALUES
  ('6ab25b405c152dc73f06da4c', '2026-09-22T10:41:04.386Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:04.386Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 11, 27, 'Izay mazoto manao soa dia ankasitrahan’ny olona, Fa izay mitetika ny hanao ratsy kosa tsy maintsy hiharan’izay ratsy noeritreretiny ihany.', 'izay mazoto manao soa dia ankasitrahan’ny olona, fa izay mitetika ny hanao ratsy kosa tsy maintsy hiharan’izay ratsy noeritreretiny ihany.'),
  ('6ab25b405c152dc73f06da43', '2026-09-22T10:41:04.386Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:04.386Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 11, 18, 'Tsy tena karama no azon’ny ratsy fanahy, Fa tena valisoa kosa no azon’izay mamafy fahamarinana.', 'tsy tena karama no azon’ny ratsy fanahy, fa tena valisoa kosa no azon’izay mamafy fahamarinana.'),
  ('6ab25b405c152dc73f06da3c', '2026-09-22T10:41:04.386Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:04.386Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 11, 11, 'Lasa mandroso ny tanàna noho ny tsodranon’ny olo-mahitsy, Fa rava kosa ilay izy noho ny tenin’ny ratsy fanahy.', 'lasa mandroso ny tanàna noho ny tsodranon’ny olo-mahitsy, fa rava kosa ilay izy noho ny tenin’ny ratsy fanahy.'),
  ('6ab25b405c152dc73f06da33', '2026-09-22T10:41:04.386Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:04.386Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 11, 2, 'Ho afa-baraka izay lasa manambony tena, Fa izay manetry tena no hendry.', 'ho afa-baraka izay lasa manambony tena, fa izay manetry tena no hendry.'),
  ('6ab25b405c152dc73f06da32', '2026-09-22T10:41:04.386Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:04.386Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 11, 1, 'Maharikoriko an’i Jehovah ny mizana mandainga, Fa mahafaly azy kosa ny vatomizana marina.', 'maharikoriko an’i jehovah ny mizana mandainga, fa mahafaly azy kosa ny vatomizana marina.'),
  ('6ab25b405c152dc73f06da3f', '2026-09-22T10:41:04.386Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:04.386Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 11, 14, 'Hijaly ny vahoaka raha tsy mahazo tari-dalana tsara, Fa hahomby kosa izay ataony raha maro ny mpanolo-tsaina.', 'hijaly ny vahoaka raha tsy mahazo tari-dalana tsara, fa hahomby kosa izay ataony raha maro ny mpanolo-tsaina.'),
  ('6ab25b405c152dc73f06da48', '2026-09-22T10:41:04.386Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:04.386Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 11, 23, 'Mitondra soa ny fanirian’ny olo-marina, Fa mampahatezitra kosa ny zavatra antenain’ny ratsy fanahy.', 'mitondra soa ny fanirian’ny olo-marina, fa mampahatezitra kosa ny zavatra antenain’ny ratsy fanahy.'),
  ('6ab25b405c152dc73f06da44', '2026-09-22T10:41:04.386Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:04.386Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 11, 19, 'Hahazo fiainana ny olona miezaka manao ny marina, Fa ho faty izay tsy mieritreritra afa-tsy ny hanao ratsy.', 'hahazo fiainana ny olona miezaka manao ny marina, fa ho faty izay tsy mieritreritra afa-tsy ny hanao ratsy.'),
  ('6ab25b405c152dc73f06da45', '2026-09-22T10:41:04.386Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:04.386Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 11, 20, 'Maharikoriko an’i Jehovah ny olona fetsifetsy, Fa mahafinaritra azy kosa izay mandeha tsy misy tsiny.', 'maharikoriko an’i jehovah ny olona fetsifetsy, fa mahafinaritra azy kosa izay mandeha tsy misy tsiny.'),
  ('6ab25b405c152dc73f06da4b', '2026-09-22T10:41:04.386Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:04.386Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 11, 26, 'Hozonin’ny olona izay tsy mety mivarotra vokatra, Fa homeny tsodrano kosa izay manaiky hivarotra vokatra.', 'hozonin’ny olona izay tsy mety mivarotra vokatra, fa homeny tsodrano kosa izay manaiky hivarotra vokatra.'),
  ('6ab25b405c152dc73f06da4a', '2026-09-22T10:41:04.386Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:04.386Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 11, 25, 'Handeha tsara ny fiainan’izay tia manome, Ary izay manome rano dia homena rano koa.', 'handeha tsara ny fiainan’izay tia manome, ary izay manome rano dia homena rano koa.'),
  ('6ab25b405c152dc73f06da4d', '2026-09-22T10:41:04.386Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:04.386Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 11, 28, 'Ho lavo izay matoky ny harenany, Fa handrobona toy ny hazo midoroboka kosa ny olo-marina.', 'ho lavo izay matoky ny harenany, fa handrobona toy ny hazo midoroboka kosa ny olo-marina.'),
  ('6ab25b405c152dc73f06da47', '2026-09-22T10:41:04.386Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:04.386Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 11, 22, 'Hoatran’ny kavim-bolamena eo amin’ny oron-kisoa Ny vehivavy tsara tarehy nefa tsy misaina.', 'hoatran’ny kavim-bolamena eo amin’ny oron-kisoa ny vehivavy tsara tarehy nefa tsy misaina.'),
  ('6ab25b405c152dc73f06da40', '2026-09-22T10:41:04.386Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:04.386Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 11, 15, 'Tsy maintsy hahita loza izay miantoka olona mindram-bola raha tsy fantany akory ilay olona, Fa hilamin-tsaina kosa izay tsy mety mifandray tanana mba hiantoka olona.', 'tsy maintsy hahita loza izay miantoka olona mindram-bola raha tsy fantany akory ilay olona, fa hilamin-tsaina kosa izay tsy mety mifandray tanana mba hiantoka olona.'),
  ('6ab25b405c152dc73f06da35', '2026-09-22T10:41:04.386Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:04.386Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 11, 4, 'Tsy hisy hilana azy ny harena amin’ny andro fahatezerana, Fa ny fahamarinana kosa no hamonjy ny olona tsy ho faty.', 'tsy hisy hilana azy ny harena amin’ny andro fahatezerana, fa ny fahamarinana kosa no hamonjy ny olona tsy ho faty.'),
  ('6ab25b405c152dc73f06da49', '2026-09-22T10:41:04.386Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:04.386Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 11, 24, 'Misy tia manome nefa vao mainka mihamanana, Fa misy tsy mahafoy manome zavatra tokony homena, nefa lasa mihamahantra.', 'misy tia manome nefa vao mainka mihamanana, fa misy tsy mahafoy manome zavatra tokony homena, nefa lasa mihamahantra.'),
  ('6ab25b405c152dc73f06da41', '2026-09-22T10:41:04.386Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:04.386Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 11, 16, 'Mahazo voninahitra ny vehivavy mahafinaritra, Fa mandroba harena ny olona tsy misy antra.', 'mahazo voninahitra ny vehivavy mahafinaritra, fa mandroba harena ny olona tsy misy antra.'),
  ('6ab25b405c152dc73f06da37', '2026-09-22T10:41:04.386Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:04.386Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 11, 6, 'Ny fahamarinan’ny olo-mahitsy no hamonjy azy, Fa ho voafandriky ny faniriany kosa ny mpivadika.', 'ny fahamarinan’ny olo-mahitsy no hamonjy azy, fa ho voafandriky ny faniriany kosa ny mpivadika.'),
  ('6ab25b405c152dc73f06da4e', '2026-09-22T10:41:04.386Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:04.386Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 11, 29, 'Hisambo-drivotra izay mampidi-kizo ny ankohonany, Ary ho mpanompon’izay manana fo hendry ny tsisy saina.', 'hisambo-drivotra izay mampidi-kizo ny ankohonany, ary ho mpanompon’izay manana fo hendry ny tsisy saina.'),
  ('6ab25b405c152dc73f06da3b', '2026-09-22T10:41:04.386Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:04.386Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 11, 10, 'Faly ny ao an-tanàna noho ny toetra tsaran’ny olo-marina, Ary mihoby ny olona rehefa maty ny ratsy fanahy.', 'faly ny ao an-tanàna noho ny toetra tsaran’ny olo-marina, ary mihoby ny olona rehefa maty ny ratsy fanahy.'),
  ('6ab25b405c152dc73f06da38', '2026-09-22T10:41:04.386Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:04.386Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 11, 7, 'Foana ny fanantenan’ny ratsy fanahy rehefa maty izy, Ary foana koa ny zavatra nantenainy hoe ho vitany amin’ny heriny.', 'foana ny fanantenan’ny ratsy fanahy rehefa maty izy, ary foana koa ny zavatra nantenainy hoe ho vitany amin’ny heriny.'),
  ('6ab25b405c152dc73f06da50', '2026-09-22T10:41:04.386Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:04.386Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 11, 31, 'Raha ny olo-marina eto an-tany aza mahazo ny valin’ny nataony, Koa mainka fa ny ratsy fanahy sy ny mpanota!', 'raha ny olo-marina eto an-tany aza mahazo ny valin’ny nataony, koa mainka fa ny ratsy fanahy sy ny mpanota!'),
  ('6ab25b405c152dc73f06da3e', '2026-09-22T10:41:04.386Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:04.386Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 11, 13, 'Mandehandeha mamoaka tsiambaratelo ny mpanendrikendrika, Fa mitana tsiambaratelo kosa ny olona mendri-pitokisana.', 'mandehandeha mamoaka tsiambaratelo ny mpanendrikendrika, fa mitana tsiambaratelo kosa ny olona mendri-pitokisana.'),
  ('6ab25b405c152dc73f06da39', '2026-09-22T10:41:04.386Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:04.386Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 11, 8, 'Vonjena amin’ny fahoriana ny olo-marina, Ka ny ratsy fanahy indray no iharan’izany.', 'vonjena amin’ny fahoriana ny olo-marina, ka ny ratsy fanahy indray no iharan’izany.'),
  ('6ab25b405c152dc73f06da34', '2026-09-22T10:41:04.386Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:04.386Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 11, 3, 'Manao izay mahitsy foana ny olona tsy mivadika, Fa haringana kosa ny mpivadika satria zatra mametsifetsy.', 'manao izay mahitsy foana ny olona tsy mivadika, fa haringana kosa ny mpivadika satria zatra mametsifetsy.'),
  ('6ab25b405c152dc73f06da4f', '2026-09-22T10:41:04.386Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:04.386Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 11, 30, 'Toy ny hazon’aina ny vokatry ny ataon’ny olo-marina, Ary hendry izay maharesy lahatra olona.', 'toy ny hazon’aina ny vokatry ny ataon’ny olo-marina, ary hendry izay maharesy lahatra olona.'),
  ('6ab25b40b73bbf1f186602fb', '2026-09-22T10:41:04.930Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:04.930Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 12, 1, 'Tia fahalalana izay tia anatra, Fa tsy misaina kosa izay mankahala fananarana.', 'tia fahalalana izay tia anatra, fa tsy misaina kosa izay mankahala fananarana.'),
  ('6ab25b40b73bbf1f186602fc', '2026-09-22T10:41:04.930Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:04.930Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 12, 2, 'Ankasitrahan’i Jehovah ny olona tsara toetra, Fa melohiny kosa izay mitetika ny hanao ratsy.', 'ankasitrahan’i jehovah ny olona tsara toetra, fa melohiny kosa izay mitetika ny hanao ratsy.'),
  ('6ab25b40b73bbf1f1866030d', '2026-09-22T10:41:04.931Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:04.931Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 12, 19, 'Haharitra mandrakizay ny molotra milaza ny marina, Fa hiserana fotsiny ny lela zatra mandainga.', 'haharitra mandrakizay ny molotra milaza ny marina, fa hiserana fotsiny ny lela zatra mandainga.'),
  ('6ab25b40b73bbf1f18660307', '2026-09-22T10:41:04.931Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:04.931Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 12, 13, 'Manota amin’izay lazainy ny olon-dratsy ka voafandriky ny teniny ihany, Fa ny olo-marina kosa afaka amin’ny fijaliana.', 'manota amin’izay lazainy ny olon-dratsy ka voafandriky ny teniny ihany, fa ny olo-marina kosa afaka amin’ny fijaliana.'),
  ('6ab25b40b73bbf1f1866030b', '2026-09-22T10:41:04.931Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:04.931Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 12, 17, 'Hilaza ny marina ny vavolombelona azo itokisana, Fa mamitaka kosa ny vavolombelona mandainga.', 'hilaza ny marina ny vavolombelona azo itokisana, fa mamitaka kosa ny vavolombelona mandainga.'),
  ('6ab25b40b73bbf1f18660309', '2026-09-22T10:41:04.931Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:04.931Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 12, 15, 'Amin’ny adala dia mety ny ataony, Fa ny hendry kosa manaiky torohevitra.', 'amin’ny adala dia mety ny ataony, fa ny hendry kosa manaiky torohevitra.'),
  ('6ab25b40b73bbf1f18660300', '2026-09-22T10:41:04.931Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:04.931Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 12, 6, 'Mitovy amin’ny fandrika mahafaty ny tenin’ny ratsy fanahy, Fa ny tenin’ny olo-marina kosa mamonjy azy.', 'mitovy amin’ny fandrika mahafaty ny tenin’ny ratsy fanahy, fa ny tenin’ny olo-marina kosa mamonjy azy.'),
  ('6ab25b40b73bbf1f18660316', '2026-09-22T10:41:04.931Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:04.931Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 12, 28, 'Mitarika mankany amin’ny fiainana ny lalan’ny fahamarinana, Ary tsy mba misy fahafatesana ny lalana alehany.', 'mitarika mankany amin’ny fiainana ny lalan’ny fahamarinana, ary tsy mba misy fahafatesana ny lalana alehany.'),
  ('6ab25b40b73bbf1f18660311', '2026-09-22T10:41:04.931Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:04.931Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 12, 23, 'Tsy miresadresaka an’izay zavatra fantany ny olona malina, Fa mamoaka ny hadalana rehetra ao am-pony kosa ny tsisy saina.', 'tsy miresadresaka an’izay zavatra fantany ny olona malina, fa mamoaka ny hadalana rehetra ao am-pony kosa ny tsisy saina.'),
  ('6ab25b40b73bbf1f186602ff', '2026-09-22T10:41:04.931Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:04.931Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 12, 5, 'Ara-drariny ny hevitry ny olo-marina, Fa mamitaka kosa ny tari-dalana omen’ny ratsy fanahy.', 'ara-drariny ny hevitry ny olo-marina, fa mamitaka kosa ny tari-dalana omen’ny ratsy fanahy.'),
  ('6ab25b40b73bbf1f18660315', '2026-09-22T10:41:04.931Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:04.931Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 12, 27, 'Tsy mety mandeha mihaza ny kamo, Fa harena sarobidy ho an’ny olona kosa ny fahazotoana.', 'tsy mety mandeha mihaza ny kamo, fa harena sarobidy ho an’ny olona kosa ny fahazotoana.'),
  ('6ab25b40b73bbf1f18660308', '2026-09-22T10:41:04.931Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:04.931Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 12, 14, 'Mandray soa be dia be avy amin’izay lazainy ny olona, Ary hahazo valisoa izy noho ny asan’ny tanany.', 'mandray soa be dia be avy amin’izay lazainy ny olona, ary hahazo valisoa izy noho ny asan’ny tanany.'),
  ('6ab25b40b73bbf1f18660305', '2026-09-22T10:41:04.931Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:04.931Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 12, 11, 'Ho voky hanina izay miasa ny taniny, Fa tsy ampy saina izay mikatsaka zava-poana.', 'ho voky hanina izay miasa ny taniny, fa tsy ampy saina izay mikatsaka zava-poana.'),
  ('6ab25b40b73bbf1f18660310', '2026-09-22T10:41:04.931Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:04.931Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 12, 22, 'Maharikoriko an’i Jehovah ny molotra mandainga, Fa mahafinaritra azy kosa ny olona tsy mivadika.', 'maharikoriko an’i jehovah ny molotra mandainga, fa mahafinaritra azy kosa ny olona tsy mivadika.'),
  ('6ab25b40b73bbf1f1866030e', '2026-09-22T10:41:04.931Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:04.931Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 12, 20, 'Fitaka no ao am-pon’izay mitetika ny hanao ratsy, Fa falifaly kosa ny olona miezaka ny hampisy fihavanana.', 'fitaka no ao am-pon’izay mitetika ny hanao ratsy, fa falifaly kosa ny olona miezaka ny hampisy fihavanana.'),
  ('6ab25b40b73bbf1f1866030a', '2026-09-22T10:41:04.931Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:04.931Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 12, 16, 'Ny adala no tonga dia mampiseho hoe sosotra, Fa ny olona malina kosa tsy miraharaha esoeso.', 'ny adala no tonga dia mampiseho hoe sosotra, fa ny olona malina kosa tsy miraharaha esoeso.'),
  ('6ab25b40b73bbf1f1866030f', '2026-09-22T10:41:04.931Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:04.931Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 12, 21, 'Tsy mba haninona mihitsy ny olo-marina, Fa ho tototry ny loza kosa ny ratsy fanahy.', 'tsy mba haninona mihitsy ny olo-marina, fa ho tototry ny loza kosa ny ratsy fanahy.'),
  ('6ab25b40b73bbf1f18660306', '2026-09-22T10:41:04.931Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:04.931Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 12, 12, 'Ny ratsy fanahy mitsiriritra ny zavatra azon’ny olon-dratsy, Fa ny olo-marina kosa toy ny hazo mamaka tsara ka mamokatra.', 'ny ratsy fanahy mitsiriritra ny zavatra azon’ny olon-dratsy, fa ny olo-marina kosa toy ny hazo mamaka tsara ka mamokatra.'),
  ('6ab25b40b73bbf1f18660303', '2026-09-22T10:41:04.931Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:04.931Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 12, 9, 'Aleo tsotsotra nefa manana mpanompo iray, Toy izay miseho ho ambony nefa tsy manan-kohanina.', 'aleo tsotsotra nefa manana mpanompo iray, toy izay miseho ho ambony nefa tsy manan-kohanina.'),
  ('6ab25b40b73bbf1f186602fe', '2026-09-22T10:41:04.931Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:04.931Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 12, 4, 'Satroboninahitry ny vadiny ny vehivavy tsara toetra, Fa ny vehivavy manao zavatra manala baraka kosa toy ny lo mikiky ny taolan’ny vadiny.', 'satroboninahitry ny vadiny ny vehivavy tsara toetra, fa ny vehivavy manao zavatra manala baraka kosa toy ny lo mikiky ny taolan’ny vadiny.'),
  ('6ab25b40b73bbf1f18660314', '2026-09-22T10:41:04.931Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:04.931Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 12, 26, 'Ny olo-marina mitady an’izay kijana tsara indrindra, Fa ny ratsy fanahy kosa lasa diso lalana noho ny ataony ihany.', 'ny olo-marina mitady an’izay kijana tsara indrindra, fa ny ratsy fanahy kosa lasa diso lalana noho ny ataony ihany.'),
  ('6ab25b40b73bbf1f18660313', '2026-09-22T10:41:04.931Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:04.931Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 12, 25, 'Ny tebiteby ao am-pon’ny olona no mahakivy azy, Fa ny teny mampahery kosa no mahafalifaly azy.', 'ny tebiteby ao am-pon’ny olona no mahakivy azy, fa ny teny mampahery kosa no mahafalifaly azy.'),
  ('6ab25b40b73bbf1f18660312', '2026-09-22T10:41:04.931Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:04.931Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 12, 24, 'Hanam-pahefana ny olona mazoto, Fa hampanaovina asa an-terivozona kosa ny kamo.', 'hanam-pahefana ny olona mazoto, fa hampanaovina asa an-terivozona kosa ny kamo.'),
  ('6ab25b40b73bbf1f18660302', '2026-09-22T10:41:04.931Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:04.931Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 12, 8, 'Hoderaina ny olona mitandrina tsara an’izay lazain’ny vavany, Fa hatao tsinontsinona kosa ny olona fetsifetsy.', 'hoderaina ny olona mitandrina tsara an’izay lazain’ny vavany, fa hatao tsinontsinona kosa ny olona fetsifetsy.'),
  ('6ab25b40b73bbf1f18660301', '2026-09-22T10:41:04.931Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:04.931Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 12, 7, 'Tsy hisy intsony ny ratsy fanahy rehefa ringana, Fa ho eo foana kosa ny ankohonan’ny olo-marina.', 'tsy hisy intsony ny ratsy fanahy rehefa ringana, fa ho eo foana kosa ny ankohonan’ny olo-marina.'),
  ('6ab25b40b73bbf1f186602fd', '2026-09-22T10:41:04.931Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:04.931Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 12, 3, 'Tsy hilamina ny fiainan’izay olona manao ratsy, Fa ny olo-marina kosa hoatran’ny hazo tsy mety voaongotra mihitsy.', 'tsy hilamina ny fiainan’izay olona manao ratsy, fa ny olo-marina kosa hoatran’ny hazo tsy mety voaongotra mihitsy.'),
  ('6ab25b40b73bbf1f1866030c', '2026-09-22T10:41:04.931Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:04.931Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 12, 18, 'Manindrona hoatran’ny sabatra ny teny tsy voahevitra, Fa manasitrana kosa ny tenin’ny hendry.', 'manindrona hoatran’ny sabatra ny teny tsy voahevitra, fa manasitrana kosa ny tenin’ny hendry.'),
  ('6ab25b40b73bbf1f18660304', '2026-09-22T10:41:04.931Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:04.931Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 12, 10, 'Mikarakara ny biby fiompiny ny olo-marina, Fa tia mampijaly kosa ny ratsy fanahy, na dia mihevitra aza izy hoe mamindra fo.', 'mikarakara ny biby fiompiny ny olo-marina, fa tia mampijaly kosa ny ratsy fanahy, na dia mihevitra aza izy hoe mamindra fo.'),
  ('6ab25b44966622dcf40dd991', '2026-09-22T10:41:08.029Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:08.029Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 16, 4, 'Nataon’i Jehovah hanatanterahana ny fikasany ny zava-drehetra, Ka na ny ratsy fanahy aza haringana, amin’ny andro hahitana loza.', 'nataon’i jehovah hanatanterahana ny fikasany ny zava-drehetra, ka na ny ratsy fanahy aza haringana, amin’ny andro hahitana loza.'),
  ('6ab25b44966622dcf40dd995', '2026-09-22T10:41:08.029Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:08.029Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 16, 8, 'Aleo kely azo tamin’ny marina, Toy izay be dia be azo tamin’ny tsy rariny.', 'aleo kely azo tamin’ny marina, toy izay be dia be azo tamin’ny tsy rariny.'),
  ('6ab25b44966622dcf40dd99a', '2026-09-22T10:41:08.029Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:08.029Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 16, 13, 'Mahafinaritra ny mpanjaka ny olona milaza ny marina, Ary tiany ny olona mitsotra ny marina.', 'mahafinaritra ny mpanjaka ny olona milaza ny marina, ary tiany ny olona mitsotra ny marina.'),
  ('6ab25b44966622dcf40dd993', '2026-09-22T10:41:08.029Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:08.029Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 16, 6, 'Ny fitiavana sy tsy fivadihana no andrakofana fahadisoana, Ary izay matahotra an’i Jehovah dia miala amin’ny ratsy.', 'ny fitiavana sy tsy fivadihana no andrakofana fahadisoana, ary izay matahotra an’i jehovah dia miala amin’ny ratsy.'),
  ('6ab25b44966622dcf40dd99d', '2026-09-22T10:41:08.029Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:08.029Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 16, 16, 'Aleo mahazo fahendrena toy izay mahazo volamena, Ary aleo lasa mahira-tsaina toy izay mahazo volafotsy.', 'aleo mahazo fahendrena toy izay mahazo volamena, ary aleo lasa mahira-tsaina toy izay mahazo volafotsy.'),
  ('6ab25b44966622dcf40dd99c', '2026-09-22T10:41:08.029Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:08.029Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 16, 15, 'Ho sambatra izay ankasitrahan’ny mpanjaka, Satria hoatran’ny rahona mitondra orana amin’ny lohataona ny fankasitrahany.', 'ho sambatra izay ankasitrahan’ny mpanjaka, satria hoatran’ny rahona mitondra orana amin’ny lohataona ny fankasitrahany.'),
  ('6ab25b44966622dcf40dd999', '2026-09-22T10:41:08.029Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:08.029Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 16, 12, 'Maharikoriko ny mpanjaka ny fanao ratsy, Satria ny fahamarinana no manamafy orina ny seza fiandrianany.', 'maharikoriko ny mpanjaka ny fanao ratsy, satria ny fahamarinana no manamafy orina ny seza fiandrianany.'),
  ('6ab25b44966622dcf40dd98e', '2026-09-22T10:41:08.029Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:08.029Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 16, 1, 'Omanin’ny olona ao am-pony ny teny holazainy, Fa avy amin’i Jehovah kosa ny valin-teny omeny.', 'omanin’ny olona ao am-pony ny teny holazainy, fa avy amin’i jehovah kosa ny valin-teny omeny.'),
  ('6ab25b44966622dcf40dd99e', '2026-09-22T10:41:08.029Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:08.029Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 16, 17, 'Halavirin’ny olo-marina ny ratsy, Ary izay mitandrina tsara an’izay ataony dia miaro ny ainy.', 'halavirin’ny olo-marina ny ratsy, ary izay mitandrina tsara an’izay ataony dia miaro ny ainy.'),
  ('6ab25b44966622dcf40dd996', '2026-09-22T10:41:08.029Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:08.029Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 16, 9, 'Mety ho efa mandamina tsara an’izay hataony ny olona, ao am-pony ao, Nefa i Jehovah no mitarika ny diany.', 'mety ho efa mandamina tsara an’izay hataony ny olona, ao am-pony ao, nefa i jehovah no mitarika ny diany.'),
  ('6ab25b44966622dcf40dd98f', '2026-09-22T10:41:08.029Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:08.029Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 16, 2, 'Heverin’ny olona hoe mety daholo izay ataony, Fa i Jehovah kosa mandinika ny antony anaovany an’izany.', 'heverin’ny olona hoe mety daholo izay ataony, fa i jehovah kosa mandinika ny antony anaovany an’izany.'),
  ('6ab25b44966622dcf40dd99b', '2026-09-22T10:41:08.029Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:08.029Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 16, 14, 'Toy ny olona nirahina hamono olona ho faty ny hatezeran’ny mpanjaka, Fa ny hendry kosa mahay mampitony an’izany.', 'toy ny olona nirahina hamono olona ho faty ny hatezeran’ny mpanjaka, fa ny hendry kosa mahay mampitony an’izany.'),
  ('6ab25b44966622dcf40dd997', '2026-09-22T10:41:08.029Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:08.029Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 16, 10, 'Didim-pitsarana avy amin’Andriamanitra no tokony holazain’ny mpanjaka, Ary tsy tokony hamadika ny rariny mihitsy izy.', 'didim-pitsarana avy amin’andriamanitra no tokony holazain’ny mpanjaka, ary tsy tokony hamadika ny rariny mihitsy izy.'),
  ('6ab25b44966622dcf40dd9a0', '2026-09-22T10:41:08.029Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:08.029Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 16, 19, 'Aleo manetry tena miaraka amin’ny mpandefitra, Toy izay mifampizara harena amin’ny olona manambony tena.', 'aleo manetry tena miaraka amin’ny mpandefitra, toy izay mifampizara harena amin’ny olona manambony tena.'),
  ('6ab25b44966622dcf40dd998', '2026-09-22T10:41:08.029Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:08.029Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 16, 11, 'Avy amin’i Jehovah ny fandanjana marina sy ny mizana marina. Avy aminy daholo koa ny vatomizana ao anaty kitapo.', 'avy amin’i jehovah ny fandanjana marina sy ny mizana marina. avy aminy daholo koa ny vatomizana ao anaty kitapo.'),
  ('6ab25b44966622dcf40dd990', '2026-09-22T10:41:08.029Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:08.029Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 16, 3, 'Ankino amin’i Jehovah daholo izay ataonao, Dia hahomby izay kasainao hatao.', 'ankino amin’i jehovah daholo izay ataonao, dia hahomby izay kasainao hatao.'),
  ('6ab25b44966622dcf40dd99f', '2026-09-22T10:41:08.029Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:08.029Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 16, 18, 'Ho lavo izay mirehareha, Ary hianjera izay manambony tena.', 'ho lavo izay mirehareha, ary hianjera izay manambony tena.'),
  ('6ab25b44966622dcf40dd994', '2026-09-22T10:41:08.029Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:08.029Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 16, 7, 'Rehefa mahafinaritra an’i Jehovah ny ataon’ny olona, Dia ataony mihavana aminy na dia ny fahavalony aza.', 'rehefa mahafinaritra an’i jehovah ny ataon’ny olona, dia ataony mihavana aminy na dia ny fahavalony aza.'),
  ('6ab25b44966622dcf40dd9a1', '2026-09-22T10:41:08.029Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:08.029Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 16, 20, 'Hahomby ny olona mandinika tsara an’izay ataony, Ary sambatra izay matoky an’i Jehovah.', 'hahomby ny olona mandinika tsara an’izay ataony, ary sambatra izay matoky an’i jehovah.'),
  ('6ab25b44966622dcf40dd992', '2026-09-22T10:41:08.029Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:08.029Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 16, 5, 'Maharikoriko an’i Jehovah izay rehetra manana fo mirehareha. Matokia fa tsy maintsy ho voasazy ny olona hoatr’izany.', 'maharikoriko an’i jehovah izay rehetra manana fo mirehareha. matokia fa tsy maintsy ho voasazy ny olona hoatr’izany.'),
  ('6ab25b44966622dcf40dd9ae', '2026-09-22T10:41:08.030Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:08.030Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 16, 33, 'Eo am-pofoana no anaovana antsapaka, Fa an’i Jehovah kosa ny fanapahan-kevitra rehetra amin’izany.', 'eo am-pofoana no anaovana antsapaka, fa an’i jehovah kosa ny fanapahan-kevitra rehetra amin’izany.'),
  ('6ab25b44966622dcf40dd9a9', '2026-09-22T10:41:08.030Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:08.030Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 16, 28, 'Mampisy ady fotsiny ny mpanakorontana, Ary mampisaraka ny mpinamana be ny mpanendrikendrika.', 'mampisy ady fotsiny ny mpanakorontana, ary mampisaraka ny mpinamana be ny mpanendrikendrika.'),
  ('6ab25b44966622dcf40dd9a2', '2026-09-22T10:41:08.030Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:08.030Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 16, 21, 'Izay manana fo hendry no hatao hoe mahira-tsaina, Ary izay manao teny mahafinaritra no maharesy lahatra olona.', 'izay manana fo hendry no hatao hoe mahira-tsaina, ary izay manao teny mahafinaritra no maharesy lahatra olona.'),
  ('6ab25b44966622dcf40dd9a7', '2026-09-22T10:41:08.030Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:08.030Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 16, 26, 'Mikely aina miasa mafy ny mpiasa satria te hihinan-kanina. Miasa mafy mantsy izy satria noana.', 'mikely aina miasa mafy ny mpiasa satria te hihinan-kanina. miasa mafy mantsy izy satria noana.'),
  ('6ab25b44966622dcf40dd9a5', '2026-09-22T10:41:08.030Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:08.030Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 16, 24, 'Toho-tantely ny teny mahafinaritra, Ka sady mamy no manasitrana ny taolana.', 'toho-tantely ny teny mahafinaritra, ka sady mamy no manasitrana ny taolana.'),
  ('6ab25b44966622dcf40dd9ad', '2026-09-22T10:41:08.030Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:08.030Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 16, 32, 'Aleo olona tsy mora tezitra toy izay lehilahy matanjaka, Ary aleo olona mahafehy tena toy izay olona mahazo tanàna ho babo.', 'aleo olona tsy mora tezitra toy izay lehilahy matanjaka, ary aleo olona mahafehy tena toy izay olona mahazo tanàna ho babo.'),
  ('6ab25b44966622dcf40dd9a4', '2026-09-22T10:41:08.030Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:08.030Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 16, 23, 'Ny fon’ny hendry mahatonga azy hifidy tsara an’izay hoteneniny, Ka maharesy lahatra olona ny zavatra lazainy.', 'ny fon’ny hendry mahatonga azy hifidy tsara an’izay hoteneniny, ka maharesy lahatra olona ny zavatra lazainy.'),
  ('6ab25b44966622dcf40dd9a8', '2026-09-22T10:41:08.030Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:08.030Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 16, 27, 'Zava-dratsy no fongarin’ny olona tsy misy ilana azy, Ary toy ny afo mandoro ny teniny.', 'zava-dratsy no fongarin’ny olona tsy misy ilana azy, ary toy ny afo mandoro ny teniny.'),
  ('6ab25b44966622dcf40dd9ab', '2026-09-22T10:41:08.030Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:08.030Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 16, 30, 'Mipy maso izy rehefa mitetika hanao ratsy, Dia manaiki-molotra rehefa manatanteraka ny sain-dratsiny.', 'mipy maso izy rehefa mitetika hanao ratsy, dia manaiki-molotra rehefa manatanteraka ny sain-dratsiny.'),
  ('6ab25b44966622dcf40dd9aa', '2026-09-22T10:41:08.030Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:08.030Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 16, 29, 'Mitaona ny namany hanao ratsy ny olona tia herisetra, Sady mitarika azy any amin’ny lalan-diso.', 'mitaona ny namany hanao ratsy ny olona tia herisetra, sady mitarika azy any amin’ny lalan-diso.'),
  ('6ab25b44966622dcf40dd9a6', '2026-09-22T10:41:08.030Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:08.030Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 16, 25, 'Misy lalana eritreretin’ny olona hoe mety, Nefa any amin’ny fahafatesana no hiafarany.', 'misy lalana eritreretin’ny olona hoe mety, nefa any amin’ny fahafatesana no hiafarany.'),
  ('6ab25b44966622dcf40dd9ac', '2026-09-22T10:41:08.030Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:08.030Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 16, 31, 'Satroboninahitra tsara tarehy ny volofotsy, Raha ao amin’ny lalan’ny fahamarinana no ahazoana azy.', 'satroboninahitra tsara tarehy ny volofotsy, raha ao amin’ny lalan’ny fahamarinana no ahazoana azy.'),
  ('6ab25b44966622dcf40dd9a3', '2026-09-22T10:41:08.030Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:08.030Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 16, 22, 'Raha lalin-tsaina ny olona, dia loharanon’aina ho azy izany, Fa ny tsisy saina kosa faizin’ny hadalany ihany.', 'raha lalin-tsaina ny olona, dia loharanon’aina ho azy izany, fa ny tsisy saina kosa faizin’ny hadalany ihany.'),
  ('6ab25b45bc41d1a30efec409', '2026-09-22T10:41:09.156Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:09.156Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 17, 4, 'Mihaino fosafosa ny ratsy fanahy, Ary mihaino fanaratsiana ny mpamitaka.', 'mihaino fosafosa ny ratsy fanahy, ary mihaino fanaratsiana ny mpamitaka.'),
  ('6ab25b45bc41d1a30efec407', '2026-09-22T10:41:09.156Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:09.156Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 17, 2, 'Ny mpanompo lalin-tsaina no hifehy ny zanaka manala baraka. Hahazo anjara lova koa izy, hoatran’ny zanaky ny tompony ihany.', 'ny mpanompo lalin-tsaina no hifehy ny zanaka manala baraka. hahazo anjara lova koa izy, hoatran’ny zanaky ny tompony ihany.'),
  ('6ab25b45bc41d1a30efec420', '2026-09-22T10:41:09.156Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:09.156Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 17, 27, 'Mahafehy ny vavany ny olona manam-pahalalana, Ary ho tony foana ny olona mahay mandinika.', 'mahafehy ny vavany ny olona manam-pahalalana, ary ho tony foana ny olona mahay mandinika.'),
  ('6ab25b45bc41d1a30efec418', '2026-09-22T10:41:09.156Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:09.156Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 17, 19, 'Tia manao fahadisoana izay tia ady, Ary mitady loza izay manangana vavahady avo.', 'tia manao fahadisoana izay tia ady, ary mitady loza izay manangana vavahady avo.'),
  ('6ab25b45bc41d1a30efec40b', '2026-09-22T10:41:09.156Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:09.156Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 17, 6, 'Satroboninahitry ny be taona ny zafikeliny, Ary voninahitry ny zanakalahy ny rainy.', 'satroboninahitry ny be taona ny zafikeliny, ary voninahitry ny zanakalahy ny rainy.'),
  ('6ab25b45bc41d1a30efec421', '2026-09-22T10:41:09.156Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:09.156Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 17, 28, 'Na ny adala aza rehefa mangina, dia hoheverina hoe hendry, Ary hoheverina hoe mahay mandinika izay manakombona ny vavany.', 'na ny adala aza rehefa mangina, dia hoheverina hoe hendry, ary hoheverina hoe mahay mandinika izay manakombona ny vavany.'),
  ('6ab25b45bc41d1a30efec419', '2026-09-22T10:41:09.156Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:09.156Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 17, 20, 'Tsy hahomby izay manana fo fetsifetsy, Ary hahita loza izay mamitapitaka.', 'tsy hahomby izay manana fo fetsifetsy, ary hahita loza izay mamitapitaka.'),
  ('6ab25b45bc41d1a30efec41c', '2026-09-22T10:41:09.156Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:09.156Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 17, 23, 'Mandray kolikoly mangingina ny ratsy fanahy Mba hamadihana ny rariny.', 'mandray kolikoly mangingina ny ratsy fanahy mba hamadihana ny rariny.'),
  ('6ab25b45bc41d1a30efec41a', '2026-09-22T10:41:09.156Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:09.156Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 17, 21, 'Halahelo ny ray miteraka zaza tsisy saina, Ary tsy ho faly mihitsy ny rain’ny zaza tsy ampy saina.', 'halahelo ny ray miteraka zaza tsisy saina, ary tsy ho faly mihitsy ny rain’ny zaza tsy ampy saina.'),
  ('6ab25b45bc41d1a30efec40a', '2026-09-22T10:41:09.156Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:09.156Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 17, 5, 'Izay manesoeso ny mahantra dia manao tsinontsinona ny Mpanao azy, Ary izay faly amin’ny fahavoazan’ny hafa dia tsy maintsy ho voasazy.', 'izay manesoeso ny mahantra dia manao tsinontsinona ny mpanao azy, ary izay faly amin’ny fahavoazan’ny hafa dia tsy maintsy ho voasazy.'),
  ('6ab25b45bc41d1a30efec417', '2026-09-22T10:41:09.156Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:09.156Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 17, 18, 'Mifandray tanana amin’ny olona ny tsy ampy saina, Ka manaiky eo imason’ny namany hoe hiantoka olona mindram-bola.', 'mifandray tanana amin’ny olona ny tsy ampy saina, ka manaiky eo imason’ny namany hoe hiantoka olona mindram-bola.'),
  ('6ab25b45bc41d1a30efec40e', '2026-09-22T10:41:09.156Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:09.156Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 17, 9, 'Izay mamela fahadisoana dia mitady fitiavana, Fa izay mbola miresadresaka an’ilay fahadisoana kosa mampisaraka ny mpinamana be.', 'izay mamela fahadisoana dia mitady fitiavana, fa izay mbola miresadresaka an’ilay fahadisoana kosa mampisaraka ny mpinamana be.'),
  ('6ab25b45bc41d1a30efec41d', '2026-09-22T10:41:09.156Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:09.156Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 17, 24, 'Mifantoka amin’ny fahendrena foana ny mason’ny mahira-tsaina, Fa ny mason’ny tsisy saina kosa mandehandeha hatrany amin’ny faran’ny tany.', 'mifantoka amin’ny fahendrena foana ny mason’ny mahira-tsaina, fa ny mason’ny tsisy saina kosa mandehandeha hatrany amin’ny faran’ny tany.'),
  ('6ab25b45bc41d1a30efec41f', '2026-09-22T10:41:09.156Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:09.156Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 17, 26, 'Tsy tsara ny manasazy olo-marina, Ary tsy mety ny mamely olona manan-kaja amin’ny karavasy.', 'tsy tsara ny manasazy olo-marina, ary tsy mety ny mamely olona manan-kaja amin’ny karavasy.'),
  ('6ab25b45bc41d1a30efec41e', '2026-09-22T10:41:09.156Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:09.156Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 17, 25, 'Manao izay hampalahelo ny rainy ny zanaka tsisy saina, Sady mankarary ny fon’ny reny niteraka azy.', 'manao izay hampalahelo ny rainy ny zanaka tsisy saina, sady mankarary ny fon’ny reny niteraka azy.'),
  ('6ab25b45bc41d1a30efec413', '2026-09-22T10:41:09.156Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:09.156Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 17, 14, 'Hoatran’ny mamaky fefiloha izay mila ady, Koa mialà dieny mbola tsy raikitra ny fifamaliana.', 'hoatran’ny mamaky fefiloha izay mila ady, koa mialà dieny mbola tsy raikitra ny fifamaliana.'),
  ('6ab25b45bc41d1a30efec40f', '2026-09-22T10:41:09.156Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:09.156Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 17, 10, 'Ny teny henjana atao indray mandeha amin’ny mahira-tsaina dia mandaitra kokoa Noho ny kapoka injato amin’ny tsisy saina.', 'ny teny henjana atao indray mandeha amin’ny mahira-tsaina dia mandaitra kokoa noho ny kapoka injato amin’ny tsisy saina.'),
  ('6ab25b45bc41d1a30efec40d', '2026-09-22T10:41:09.156Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:09.156Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 17, 8, 'Amin’ny tompony, dia toy ny vatosoa ny fanomezana, Ka na aiza na aiza alehany, dia lasa mety daholo izay ataony.', 'amin’ny tompony, dia toy ny vatosoa ny fanomezana, ka na aiza na aiza alehany, dia lasa mety daholo izay ataony.'),
  ('6ab25b45bc41d1a30efec414', '2026-09-22T10:41:09.156Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:09.156Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 17, 15, 'Samy maharikoriko an’i Jehovah, Na izay manafaka madiodio ny ratsy fanahy, na izay manameloka ny olo-marina.', 'samy maharikoriko an’i jehovah, na izay manafaka madiodio ny ratsy fanahy, na izay manameloka ny olo-marina.'),
  ('6ab25b45bc41d1a30efec416', '2026-09-22T10:41:09.156Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:09.156Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 17, 17, 'Tia amin’ny fotoana rehetra ny tena namana, Sady tena rahalahy natao hanampy amin’ny fotoan-tsarotra.', 'tia amin’ny fotoana rehetra ny tena namana, sady tena rahalahy natao hanampy amin’ny fotoan-tsarotra.'),
  ('6ab25b45bc41d1a30efec415', '2026-09-22T10:41:09.156Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:09.156Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 17, 16, 'Inona moa ny soa azon’ny tsisy saina raha afaka mahazo fahendrena izy, Nefa izy aza tsy te hahazo an’izany akory?', 'inona moa ny soa azon’ny tsisy saina raha afaka mahazo fahendrena izy, nefa izy aza tsy te hahazo an’izany akory?'),
  ('6ab25b45bc41d1a30efec412', '2026-09-22T10:41:09.156Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:09.156Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 17, 13, 'Izay mamaly ratsy ny soa natao taminy, Dia tsy hialan’ny ratsy koa ny ao an-tranony.', 'izay mamaly ratsy ny soa natao taminy, dia tsy hialan’ny ratsy koa ny ao an-tranony.'),
  ('6ab25b45bc41d1a30efec410', '2026-09-22T10:41:09.156Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:09.156Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 17, 11, 'Tsy mitady afa-tsy ny hikomy ny olon-dratsy, Nefa hisy olona tsy misy antra hirahina hanasazy azy.', 'tsy mitady afa-tsy ny hikomy ny olon-dratsy, nefa hisy olona tsy misy antra hirahina hanasazy azy.'),
  ('6ab25b45bc41d1a30efec40c', '2026-09-22T10:41:09.156Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:09.156Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 17, 7, 'Tsy mendrika ny hilaza ny marina ny tsisy saina, Ary vao mainka tsy mendrika ny handainga ny mpitondra.', 'tsy mendrika ny hilaza ny marina ny tsisy saina, ary vao mainka tsy mendrika ny handainga ny mpitondra.'),
  ('6ab25b45bc41d1a30efec41b', '2026-09-22T10:41:09.156Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:09.156Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 17, 22, 'Fanafody tena mandaitra ny fo falifaly, Fa mandany hery kosa ny hakiviana.', 'fanafody tena mandaitra ny fo falifaly, fa mandany hery kosa ny hakiviana.'),
  ('6ab25b45bc41d1a30efec411', '2026-09-22T10:41:09.156Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:09.156Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 17, 12, 'Aleo mifanena amin’ny orsa very zanaka, Toy izay mifanena amin’ny olona tsisy saina mampiseho ny hadalany.', 'aleo mifanena amin’ny orsa very zanaka, toy izay mifanena amin’ny olona tsisy saina mampiseho ny hadalany.'),
  ('6ab25b45bc41d1a30efec408', '2026-09-22T10:41:09.156Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:09.156Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 17, 3, 'Natao ho an’ny volafotsy ny vilany fanadiovana metaly, ary ho an’ny volamena ny fatana fandrendrehana, Fa i Jehovah kosa no mpandinika ny fo.', 'natao ho an’ny volafotsy ny vilany fanadiovana metaly, ary ho an’ny volamena ny fatana fandrendrehana, fa i jehovah kosa no mpandinika ny fo.'),
  ('6ab25b45bc41d1a30efec406', '2026-09-22T10:41:09.156Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:09.156Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 17, 1, 'Aleo sombi-mofo maina hohanina ao amin’izay misy fihavanana, Toy izay trano misy fety be nefa misy fifamaliana.', 'aleo sombi-mofo maina hohanina ao amin’izay misy fihavanana, toy izay trano misy fety be nefa misy fifamaliana.'),
  ('6ab25b45aea30dfe1e649e48', '2026-09-22T10:41:09.585Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:09.585Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 18, 8, 'Ny tenin’ny mpanendrikendrika dia hoatran’ny sakafo matsiro, Ka tonga dia midina any an-kibo.', 'ny tenin’ny mpanendrikendrika dia hoatran’ny sakafo matsiro, ka tonga dia midina any an-kibo.'),
  ('6ab25b45aea30dfe1e649e46', '2026-09-22T10:41:09.585Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:09.585Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 18, 6, 'Mahatonga fifamaliana ny tenin’ny tsisy saina, Ary ny vavany no mahatonga azy ho voakapoka.', 'mahatonga fifamaliana ny tenin’ny tsisy saina, ary ny vavany no mahatonga azy ho voakapoka.'),
  ('6ab25b45aea30dfe1e649e45', '2026-09-22T10:41:09.585Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:09.585Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 18, 5, 'Tsy tsara raha ny ratsy fanahy indray no iangarana, Na hoe ny olo-marina indray no tsy omena rariny.', 'tsy tsara raha ny ratsy fanahy indray no iangarana, na hoe ny olo-marina indray no tsy omena rariny.'),
  ('6ab25b45aea30dfe1e649e47', '2026-09-22T10:41:09.585Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:09.585Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 18, 7, 'Ny tenin’ny tsisy saina no mampidi-kizo azy. Fandrika ho an’ny ainy koa ny zavatra lazainy.', 'ny tenin’ny tsisy saina no mampidi-kizo azy. fandrika ho an’ny ainy koa ny zavatra lazainy.'),
  ('6ab25b45aea30dfe1e649e44', '2026-09-22T10:41:09.585Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:09.585Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 18, 4, 'Rano lalina ny teny lazain’ny vavan’ny olona, Ary rano miboiboika ny loharanom-pahendrena.', 'rano lalina ny teny lazain’ny vavan’ny olona, ary rano miboiboika ny loharanom-pahendrena.'),
  ('6ab25b45aea30dfe1e649e51', '2026-09-22T10:41:09.585Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:09.585Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 18, 17, 'Hoatran’ny hoe izay miteny voalohany no marina, Mandra-pahatongan’ny ankilany, izay manadihady tsara azy.', 'hoatran’ny hoe izay miteny voalohany no marina, mandra-pahatongan’ny ankilany, izay manadihady tsara azy.'),
  ('6ab25b45aea30dfe1e649e4d', '2026-09-22T10:41:09.585Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:09.585Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 18, 13, 'Izay mamaly nefa mbola tsy nihaino akory, Dia tsisy saina sady ho afa-baraka.', 'izay mamaly nefa mbola tsy nihaino akory, dia tsisy saina sady ho afa-baraka.'),
  ('6ab25b45aea30dfe1e649e54', '2026-09-22T10:41:09.585Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:09.585Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 18, 20, 'Ho vokin’ny teniny ny kibon’ny olona, Ary ho vokin’ny teny avoakan’ny molony izy.', 'ho vokin’ny teniny ny kibon’ny olona, ary ho vokin’ny teny avoakan’ny molony izy.'),
  ('6ab25b45aea30dfe1e649e50', '2026-09-22T10:41:09.585Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:09.585Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 18, 16, 'Ny fanomezana ataon’ny olona dia manokatra lalana ho azy, Ka mahatonga azy ho afaka hankeo anatrehan’ny olona ambony.', 'ny fanomezana ataon’ny olona dia manokatra lalana ho azy, ka mahatonga azy ho afaka hankeo anatrehan’ny olona ambony.'),
  ('6ab25b45aea30dfe1e649e57', '2026-09-22T10:41:09.585Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:09.585Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 18, 23, 'Mitalaho ny mahantra rehefa miteny, Fa mitrerona azy kosa ny mpanankarena.', 'mitalaho ny mahantra rehefa miteny, fa mitrerona azy kosa ny mpanankarena.'),
  ('6ab25b45aea30dfe1e649e55', '2026-09-22T10:41:09.585Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:09.585Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 18, 21, 'Samy vitan’ny lela na ny mamono na ny mamelona. Izay tia mampiasa azy dia hijinja ny vokany.', 'samy vitan’ny lela na ny mamono na ny mamelona. izay tia mampiasa azy dia hijinja ny vokany.'),
  ('6ab25b45aea30dfe1e649e4b', '2026-09-22T10:41:09.585Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:09.585Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 18, 11, 'Amin’ny mpanankarena dia toy ny tanàna voaro mafy ny harenany. Heveriny hoe manda fiarovana izany.', 'amin’ny mpanankarena dia toy ny tanàna voaro mafy ny harenany. heveriny hoe manda fiarovana izany.'),
  ('6ab25b45aea30dfe1e649e52', '2026-09-22T10:41:09.585Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:09.585Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 18, 18, 'Mampitsahatra fifandirana ny antsapaka, Sady mamaha olana eo amin’ny mpifahavalo samy matanjaka.', 'mampitsahatra fifandirana ny antsapaka, sady mamaha olana eo amin’ny mpifahavalo samy matanjaka.'),
  ('6ab25b45aea30dfe1e649e53', '2026-09-22T10:41:09.585Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:09.585Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 18, 19, 'Sarotra kokoa noho ny mandresy tanàna voaro mafy ny mampitony rahalahy tezitra, Ary mampisaraka olona ny fifandirana, toy ny bara vy hidim-bavahadin’ny tanàna misy manda.', 'sarotra kokoa noho ny mandresy tanàna voaro mafy ny mampitony rahalahy tezitra, ary mampisaraka olona ny fifandirana, toy ny bara vy hidim-bavahadin’ny tanàna misy manda.'),
  ('6ab25b45aea30dfe1e649e41', '2026-09-22T10:41:09.585Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:09.585Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 18, 1, 'Izay mitokantokana dia tsy mitady afa-tsy izay tiany fotsiny, Ka laviny daholo rehefa mety ho fahendrena.', 'izay mitokantokana dia tsy mitady afa-tsy izay tiany fotsiny, ka laviny daholo rehefa mety ho fahendrena.'),
  ('6ab25b45aea30dfe1e649e58', '2026-09-22T10:41:09.585Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:09.585Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 18, 24, 'Misy mpinamana vonona hifamotika, Fa misy kosa namana mifikitra noho ny rahalahy aza.', 'misy mpinamana vonona hifamotika, fa misy kosa namana mifikitra noho ny rahalahy aza.'),
  ('6ab25b45aea30dfe1e649e56', '2026-09-22T10:41:09.585Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:09.585Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 18, 22, 'Izay mahita vady tsara dia mahazo zava-tsoa, Sady ankasitrahan’i Jehovah.', 'izay mahita vady tsara dia mahazo zava-tsoa, sady ankasitrahan’i jehovah.'),
  ('6ab25b45aea30dfe1e649e4a', '2026-09-22T10:41:09.585Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:09.585Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 18, 10, 'Ny anaran’i Jehovah dia tilikambo mafy. Mihazakazaka mankao ny olo-marina ka voaro.', 'ny anaran’i jehovah dia tilikambo mafy. mihazakazaka mankao ny olo-marina ka voaro.'),
  ('6ab25b45aea30dfe1e649e43', '2026-09-22T10:41:09.585Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:09.585Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 18, 3, 'Rehefa tonga ny ratsy fanahy, dia misy koa ny fanaovana tsinontsinona, Ary miaraka amin’ny fahafaham-baraka ny henatra.', 'rehefa tonga ny ratsy fanahy, dia misy koa ny fanaovana tsinontsinona, ary miaraka amin’ny fahafaham-baraka ny henatra.'),
  ('6ab25b45aea30dfe1e649e4f', '2026-09-22T10:41:09.585Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:09.585Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 18, 15, 'Miezaka hahazo fahalalana ny fon’ny mahira-tsaina, Ary te hihaino fahalalana ny sofin’ny hendry.', 'miezaka hahazo fahalalana ny fon’ny mahira-tsaina, ary te hihaino fahalalana ny sofin’ny hendry.'),
  ('6ab25b45aea30dfe1e649e4e', '2026-09-22T10:41:09.585Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:09.585Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 18, 14, 'Zakan’ny olona matanja-tsaina ny aretiny, Fa iza kosa no mahazaka ny hakiviana?', 'zakan’ny olona matanja-tsaina ny aretiny, fa iza kosa no mahazaka ny hakiviana?'),
  ('6ab25b45aea30dfe1e649e4c', '2026-09-22T10:41:09.585Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:09.585Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 18, 12, 'Ho lavo izay manambony tena, Ary hahazo voninahitra izay manetry tena.', 'ho lavo izay manambony tena, ary hahazo voninahitra izay manetry tena.'),
  ('6ab25b45aea30dfe1e649e49', '2026-09-22T10:41:09.585Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:09.585Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 18, 9, 'Izay kamo miasa, Dia rahalahin’ny mpandrava.', 'izay kamo miasa, dia rahalahin’ny mpandrava.'),
  ('6ab25b45aea30dfe1e649e42', '2026-09-22T10:41:09.585Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:09.585Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 18, 2, 'Tsy tian’ny tsisy saina ny ho lasa mahira-tsaina, Fa aleony mamoaka ny ao am-pony.', 'tsy tian’ny tsisy saina ny ho lasa mahira-tsaina, fa aleony mamoaka ny ao am-pony.'),
  ('6ab25b46a51a6f4b67af2153', '2026-09-22T10:41:10.122Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:10.122Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 19, 3, 'Ny hadalan’ny olona ihany no manimba ny fiainany, Ka amin’i Jehovah no tezitra ny fony.', 'ny hadalan’ny olona ihany no manimba ny fiainany, ka amin’i jehovah no tezitra ny fony.'),
  ('6ab25b46a51a6f4b67af2159', '2026-09-22T10:41:10.122Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:10.122Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 19, 9, 'Tsy maintsy ho voasazy ny vavolombelona mandainga, Ary ho ringana ny olona efa tranon-dainga.', 'tsy maintsy ho voasazy ny vavolombelona mandainga, ary ho ringana ny olona efa tranon-dainga.'),
  ('6ab25b46a51a6f4b67af2158', '2026-09-22T10:41:10.122Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:10.122Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 19, 8, 'Tia ny tenany izay miezaka hisaina tsara, Ary hahomby izay mihevitra hoe sarobidy ny fahaiza-mandinika.', 'tia ny tenany izay miezaka hisaina tsara, ary hahomby izay mihevitra hoe sarobidy ny fahaiza-mandinika.'),
  ('6ab25b46a51a6f4b67af2154', '2026-09-22T10:41:10.122Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:10.122Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 19, 4, 'Ny harena no mahatonga ny olona ho be namana, Fa ny mahantra kosa, na ny namany aza handao azy.', 'ny harena no mahatonga ny olona ho be namana, fa ny mahantra kosa, na ny namany aza handao azy.'),
  ('6ab25b46a51a6f4b67af215f', '2026-09-22T10:41:10.122Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:10.122Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 19, 15, 'Mahatonga torimaso lalina ny hakamoana, Ary ho noana ny olona malaina.', 'mahatonga torimaso lalina ny hakamoana, ary ho noana ny olona malaina.'),
  ('6ab25b46a51a6f4b67af2161', '2026-09-22T10:41:10.122Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:10.122Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 19, 17, 'Izay miantra ny mahantra dia mampisambotra an’i Jehovah, Ka Izy no hamaly ny soa nataony.', 'izay miantra ny mahantra dia mampisambotra an’i jehovah, ka izy no hamaly ny soa nataony.'),
  ('6ab25b46a51a6f4b67af215d', '2026-09-22T10:41:10.122Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:10.122Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 19, 13, 'Mitondra fahoriana ho an’ny rainy ny zanaka tsisy saina, Ary toy ny tafo mitete tsy an-kijanona ny vehivavy tia ady.', 'mitondra fahoriana ho an’ny rainy ny zanaka tsisy saina, ary toy ny tafo mitete tsy an-kijanona ny vehivavy tia ady.'),
  ('6ab25b46a51a6f4b67af215b', '2026-09-22T10:41:10.122Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:10.122Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 19, 11, 'Mahatsindry fo ny olona lalin-tsaina, Ary voninahitra ho azy ny mamela fahadisoana.', 'mahatsindry fo ny olona lalin-tsaina, ary voninahitra ho azy ny mamela fahadisoana.'),
  ('6ab25b46a51a6f4b67af2156', '2026-09-22T10:41:10.122Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:10.122Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 19, 6, 'Maro no mila sitraka amin’ny olona ambony, Ary naman’izay tia manao fanomezana ny olona rehetra.', 'maro no mila sitraka amin’ny olona ambony, ary naman’izay tia manao fanomezana ny olona rehetra.'),
  ('6ab25b46a51a6f4b67af215c', '2026-09-22T10:41:10.122Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:10.122Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 19, 12, 'Hoatran’ny liona mierona ny mpanjaka rehefa tezitra be, Fa toy ny ando eo amin’ny ahitra kosa ny fankasitrahany.', 'hoatran’ny liona mierona ny mpanjaka rehefa tezitra be, fa toy ny ando eo amin’ny ahitra kosa ny fankasitrahany.'),
  ('6ab25b46a51a6f4b67af2157', '2026-09-22T10:41:10.122Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:10.122Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 19, 7, 'Na ny rahalahin’ny mahantra aza mankahala azy daholo, Koa mainka moa fa ny namany! Mba mitalaho sy mangataka amin’ireny izy, saingy tsy misy mihaino azy.', 'na ny rahalahin’ny mahantra aza mankahala azy daholo, koa mainka moa fa ny namany! mba mitalaho sy mangataka amin’ireny izy, saingy tsy misy mihaino azy.'),
  ('6ab25b46a51a6f4b67af215e', '2026-09-22T10:41:10.122Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:10.122Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 19, 14, 'Trano sy harena no lova avy amin’ny ray, Fa vady malina kosa no fanomezana avy amin’i Jehovah.', 'trano sy harena no lova avy amin’ny ray, fa vady malina kosa no fanomezana avy amin’i jehovah.'),
  ('6ab25b46a51a6f4b67af215a', '2026-09-22T10:41:10.122Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:10.122Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 19, 10, 'Tsy mendrika ny hanana fiainana mirenty ny tsisy saina, Ary vao mainka tsy mendrika ny hibaiko andriana ny mpanompo!', 'tsy mendrika ny hanana fiainana mirenty ny tsisy saina, ary vao mainka tsy mendrika ny hibaiko andriana ny mpanompo!'),
  ('6ab25b46a51a6f4b67af2155', '2026-09-22T10:41:10.122Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:10.122Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 19, 5, 'Tsy maintsy ho voasazy ny vavolombelona mandainga, Ary tsy ho afa-maina ny olona efa tranon-dainga.', 'tsy maintsy ho voasazy ny vavolombelona mandainga, ary tsy ho afa-maina ny olona efa tranon-dainga.'),
  ('6ab25b46a51a6f4b67af2152', '2026-09-22T10:41:10.122Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:10.122Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 19, 2, 'Tsy tsara raha tsy manam-pahalalana ny olona, Ary manota izay maimaika loatra.', 'tsy tsara raha tsy manam-pahalalana ny olona, ary manota izay maimaika loatra.'),
  ('6ab25b46a51a6f4b67af2160', '2026-09-22T10:41:10.122Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:10.122Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 19, 16, 'Izay mankatò ny didy dia miaro ny ainy, Fa ho faty kosa ny olona tsy mba miraharaha izay ataony.', 'izay mankatò ny didy dia miaro ny ainy, fa ho faty kosa ny olona tsy mba miraharaha izay ataony.'),
  ('6ab25b46a51a6f4b67af2151', '2026-09-22T10:41:10.122Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:10.122Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 19, 1, 'Aleo mahantra nefa tsy mivadika, Toy izay tsisy saina sady mpandaingalainga.', 'aleo mahantra nefa tsy mivadika, toy izay tsisy saina sady mpandaingalainga.'),
  ('6ab25b46a51a6f4b67af216c', '2026-09-22T10:41:10.123Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:10.123Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 19, 28, 'Manao tsinontsinona ny rariny ny vavolombelona tsy misy ilana azy. Ary amin’ny ratsy fanahy, dia mahafinaritra hoatran’ny misakafo ny manao ratsy.', 'manao tsinontsinona ny rariny ny vavolombelona tsy misy ilana azy. ary amin’ny ratsy fanahy, dia mahafinaritra hoatran’ny misakafo ny manao ratsy.'),
  ('6ab25b46a51a6f4b67af216b', '2026-09-22T10:41:10.123Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:10.123Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 19, 27, 'Raha tsy mihaino anatra intsony ianao, anaka, Dia hiala amin’ny lalan’ny fahalalana.', 'raha tsy mihaino anatra intsony ianao, anaka, dia hiala amin’ny lalan’ny fahalalana.'),
  ('6ab25b46a51a6f4b67af2165', '2026-09-22T10:41:10.123Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:10.123Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 19, 21, 'Maro ny zavatra kasain’ny olona hatao, Fa ny fikasan’i Jehovah ihany no ho tanteraka.', 'maro ny zavatra kasain’ny olona hatao, fa ny fikasan’i jehovah ihany no ho tanteraka.'),
  ('6ab25b46a51a6f4b67af216d', '2026-09-22T10:41:10.123Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:10.123Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 19, 29, 'Didim-pitsarana no miandry ny mpanesoeso, Ary hokapohina ny lamosin’ny tsisy saina.', 'didim-pitsarana no miandry ny mpanesoeso, ary hokapohina ny lamosin’ny tsisy saina.'),
  ('6ab25b46a51a6f4b67af2162', '2026-09-22T10:41:10.123Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:10.123Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 19, 18, 'Faizo ny zanakao dieny mbola misy fanantenana, Ary tandremo sao ho lasa tompon’andraikitra amin’ny fahafatesany ianao.', 'faizo ny zanakao dieny mbola misy fanantenana, ary tandremo sao ho lasa tompon’andraikitra amin’ny fahafatesany ianao.'),
  ('6ab25b46a51a6f4b67af2167', '2026-09-22T10:41:10.123Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:10.123Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 19, 23, 'Mitarika mankany amin’ny fiainana ny fahatahorana an’i Jehovah. Hatory tsara izay matahotra Azy, fa tsy ho tratran’ny loza.', 'mitarika mankany amin’ny fiainana ny fahatahorana an’i jehovah. hatory tsara izay matahotra azy, fa tsy ho tratran’ny loza.'),
  ('6ab25b46a51a6f4b67af2163', '2026-09-22T10:41:10.123Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:10.123Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 19, 19, 'Handoa sazy izay mora tezitra. Raha arovanao izy, dia ho voatery hiaro azy foana ianao.', 'handoa sazy izay mora tezitra. raha arovanao izy, dia ho voatery hiaro azy foana ianao.'),
  ('6ab25b46a51a6f4b67af2169', '2026-09-22T10:41:10.123Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:10.123Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 19, 25, 'Kapohy ny mpanesoeso mba ho malina izay mbola tsy dia nahita fiainana. Ary anaro ny mahira-tsaina mba hitombo ny fahalalany.', 'kapohy ny mpanesoeso mba ho malina izay mbola tsy dia nahita fiainana. ary anaro ny mahira-tsaina mba hitombo ny fahalalany.'),
  ('6ab25b46a51a6f4b67af2164', '2026-09-22T10:41:10.123Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:10.123Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 19, 20, 'Henoy ny torohevitra ary raiso ny anatra, Mba ho hendry ianao amin’ny hoavy.', 'henoy ny torohevitra ary raiso ny anatra, mba ho hendry ianao amin’ny hoavy.'),
  ('6ab25b46a51a6f4b67af2168', '2026-09-22T10:41:10.123Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:10.123Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 19, 24, 'Mangarona ny ao anaty vilia baolina ny kamo, Nefa na ny hampakatra an’ilay tanany ho ao am-bavany aza mahakamo azy.', 'mangarona ny ao anaty vilia baolina ny kamo, nefa na ny hampakatra an’ilay tanany ho ao am-bavany aza mahakamo azy.'),
  ('6ab25b46a51a6f4b67af216a', '2026-09-22T10:41:10.123Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:10.123Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 19, 26, 'Izay mampijaly ny rainy sy mandroaka ny reniny, Dia zanaka mahamenatra sy manala baraka.', 'izay mampijaly ny rainy sy mandroaka ny reniny, dia zanaka mahamenatra sy manala baraka.'),
  ('6ab25b46a51a6f4b67af2166', '2026-09-22T10:41:10.123Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:10.123Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 19, 22, 'Tian’ny olona izay be fitiavana sy tsy mivadika, Ary aleo lasa mahantra toy izay lasa mpandainga.', 'tian’ny olona izay be fitiavana sy tsy mivadika, ary aleo lasa mahantra toy izay lasa mpandainga.'),
  ('6ab25b46e88d2fc62099173d', '2026-09-22T10:41:10.655Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:10.655Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 20, 2, 'Atahorana hoatran’ny liona mierona ny mpanjaka, Ka mety hamoy ny ainy izay mampahatezitra azy.', 'atahorana hoatran’ny liona mierona ny mpanjaka, ka mety hamoy ny ainy izay mampahatezitra azy.'),
  ('6ab25b46e88d2fc62099173c', '2026-09-22T10:41:10.655Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:10.655Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 20, 1, 'Tsy manaja tena izay mamon’ny divay, ary tsy mahafehy tena izay mamon’ny toaka. Tsy hendry izay voavilin’ireny satria manaonao foana.', 'tsy manaja tena izay mamon’ny divay, ary tsy mahafehy tena izay mamon’ny toaka. tsy hendry izay voavilin’ireny satria manaonao foana.'),
  ('6ab25b46e88d2fc620991753', '2026-09-22T10:41:10.656Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:10.656Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 20, 24, 'I Jehovah no mitarika ny dian’ny olona; Fa ahoana moa no ahafantaran’ny olona an’izay lalana tokony halehany?', 'i jehovah no mitarika ny dian’ny olona; fa ahoana moa no ahafantaran’ny olona an’izay lalana tokony halehany?'),
  ('6ab25b46e88d2fc620991749', '2026-09-22T10:41:10.656Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:10.656Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 20, 14, '“Tsisy ilana an’io! Tsisy ilana an’io!”, hoy ny mpividy. Dia lasa izy avy eo sady mirehareha.', '“tsisy ilana an’io! tsisy ilana an’io!”, hoy ny mpividy. dia lasa izy avy eo sady mirehareha.'),
  ('6ab25b46e88d2fc620991751', '2026-09-22T10:41:10.656Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:10.656Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 20, 22, 'Aza miteny hoe: “Handeha hamaly faty aho!” Aoka ianao hanantena an’i Jehovah, dia hamonjy anao izy.', 'aza miteny hoe: “handeha hamaly faty aho!” aoka ianao hanantena an’i jehovah, dia hamonjy anao izy.'),
  ('6ab25b46e88d2fc620991744', '2026-09-22T10:41:10.656Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:10.656Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 20, 9, 'Iza no afaka milaza hoe: “Efa nanadio ny foko aho, Ka madio tsy misy ota”?', 'iza no afaka milaza hoe: “efa nanadio ny foko aho, ka madio tsy misy ota”?'),
  ('6ab25b46e88d2fc620991752', '2026-09-22T10:41:10.656Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:10.656Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 20, 23, 'Maharikoriko an’i Jehovah ny vatomizana mandainga, Ary tsy tsara ny mizana mamitaka.', 'maharikoriko an’i jehovah ny vatomizana mandainga, ary tsy tsara ny mizana mamitaka.'),
  ('6ab25b46e88d2fc620991750', '2026-09-22T10:41:10.656Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:10.656Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 20, 21, 'Raha fitiavan-karena no nahazoana lova tamin’ny voalohany, Dia tsy hahazoana fitahiana izany amin’ny farany.', 'raha fitiavan-karena no nahazoana lova tamin’ny voalohany, dia tsy hahazoana fitahiana izany amin’ny farany.'),
  ('6ab25b46e88d2fc62099174c', '2026-09-22T10:41:10.656Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:10.656Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 20, 17, 'Matsiro amin’ny olona ny sakafo azo tamin’ny fitaka, Nefa avy eo ho feno vatokely ao am-bavany.', 'matsiro amin’ny olona ny sakafo azo tamin’ny fitaka, nefa avy eo ho feno vatokely ao am-bavany.'),
  ('6ab25b46e88d2fc620991747', '2026-09-22T10:41:10.656Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:10.656Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 20, 12, 'Na ny sofina mandre na ny maso mahita, Dia samy nataon’i Jehovah.', 'na ny sofina mandre na ny maso mahita, dia samy nataon’i jehovah.'),
  ('6ab25b46e88d2fc620991743', '2026-09-22T10:41:10.656Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:10.656Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 20, 8, 'Rehefa mipetraka eo amin’ny seza fiandrianana ny mpanjaka mba hitsara, Dia hain’ny masony ny manavaka ny ratsy rehetra.', 'rehefa mipetraka eo amin’ny seza fiandrianana ny mpanjaka mba hitsara, dia hain’ny masony ny manavaka ny ratsy rehetra.'),
  ('6ab25b46e88d2fc620991757', '2026-09-22T10:41:10.656Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:10.656Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 20, 28, 'Voaro ny mpanjaka raha be fitiavana sy tsy mivadika ary mitana ny teniny. Maharitra eo amin’ny seza fiandrianany izy raha be fitiavana sy tsy mivadika.', 'voaro ny mpanjaka raha be fitiavana sy tsy mivadika ary mitana ny teniny. maharitra eo amin’ny seza fiandrianany izy raha be fitiavana sy tsy mivadika.'),
  ('6ab25b46e88d2fc62099173f', '2026-09-22T10:41:10.656Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:10.656Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 20, 4, 'Tsy miasa tany ny kamo amin’ny ririnina, Ka hangataka izy amin’ny fotoam-pijinjana rehefa tsy manana na inona na inona.', 'tsy miasa tany ny kamo amin’ny ririnina, ka hangataka izy amin’ny fotoam-pijinjana rehefa tsy manana na inona na inona.'),
  ('6ab25b46e88d2fc620991759', '2026-09-22T10:41:10.656Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:10.656Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 20, 30, 'Ny ratra sy ny mangana no manala ny toetra ratsy rehetra, Ary ny kapoka no manadio ny hatrany anatin’ny fo.', 'ny ratra sy ny mangana no manala ny toetra ratsy rehetra, ary ny kapoka no manadio ny hatrany anatin’ny fo.'),
  ('6ab25b46e88d2fc620991754', '2026-09-22T10:41:10.656Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:10.656Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 20, 25, 'Fandrika ho an’ny olona ny maimaika hanao voady hoe: “Masina!”, Ka efa atỳ aoriana izy vao mandinika an’ilay voady nataony.', 'fandrika ho an’ny olona ny maimaika hanao voady hoe: “masina!”, ka efa atỳ aoriana izy vao mandinika an’ilay voady nataony.'),
  ('6ab25b46e88d2fc620991741', '2026-09-22T10:41:10.656Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:10.656Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 20, 6, 'Be dia be no milaza hoe tia sy tsy mivadika, Saingy sarotra ny mahita olona azo itokisana.', 'be dia be no milaza hoe tia sy tsy mivadika, saingy sarotra ny mahita olona azo itokisana.'),
  ('6ab25b46e88d2fc620991748', '2026-09-22T10:41:10.656Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:10.656Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 20, 13, 'Aza tia torimaso, sao ianao ho lasa mahantra. Sokafy ny masonao, dia ho voky sakafo ianao.', 'aza tia torimaso, sao ianao ho lasa mahantra. sokafy ny masonao, dia ho voky sakafo ianao.'),
  ('6ab25b46e88d2fc620991742', '2026-09-22T10:41:10.656Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:10.656Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 20, 7, 'Tsy mivadika ny olo-marina, Ary sambatra izay zanany mandimby azy.', 'tsy mivadika ny olo-marina, ary sambatra izay zanany mandimby azy.'),
  ('6ab25b46e88d2fc620991756', '2026-09-22T10:41:10.656Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:10.656Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 20, 27, 'Ny fofonain’ny olona no jiron’i Jehovah Hitsilovana ny hatrany anatin’ny fony.', 'ny fofonain’ny olona no jiron’i jehovah hitsilovana ny hatrany anatin’ny fony.'),
  ('6ab25b46e88d2fc62099174b', '2026-09-22T10:41:10.656Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:10.656Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 20, 16, 'Raha niantoka olona tsy fantany ny olona iray, dia alaivo ny akanjony. Raha niantoka vehivavy hafa firenena izy, dia alaivo ny antoka nomeny.', 'raha niantoka olona tsy fantany ny olona iray, dia alaivo ny akanjony. raha niantoka vehivavy hafa firenena izy, dia alaivo ny antoka nomeny.'),
  ('6ab25b46e88d2fc620991740', '2026-09-22T10:41:10.656Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:10.656Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 20, 5, 'Toy ny rano lalina ny hevitra ao am-pon’ny olona, Fa mahay manovo an’izany izay mahay mandinika.', 'toy ny rano lalina ny hevitra ao am-pon’ny olona, fa mahay manovo an’izany izay mahay mandinika.'),
