  ('6ab25b46e88d2fc62099174d', '2026-09-22T10:41:10.656Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:10.656Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 20, 18, 'Hahomby izay kasaina hatao raha maka hevitra amin’olona, Ary tari-dalana tsara no ilainao rehefa handeha hiady.', 'hahomby izay kasaina hatao raha maka hevitra amin’olona, ary tari-dalana tsara no ilainao rehefa handeha hiady.'),
  ('6ab25b46e88d2fc62099174a', '2026-09-22T10:41:10.656Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:10.656Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 20, 15, 'Mety hanana volamena sy haran-dranomasina be dia be ny olona, Fa ny molotra mampita fahalalana anefa no tena sarobidy.', 'mety hanana volamena sy haran-dranomasina be dia be ny olona, fa ny molotra mampita fahalalana anefa no tena sarobidy.'),
  ('6ab25b46e88d2fc620991746', '2026-09-22T10:41:10.656Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:10.656Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 20, 11, 'Na ny ankizikely aza dia hita amin’ny ataony Raha madio sy mety ny fanaony.', 'na ny ankizikely aza dia hita amin’ny ataony raha madio sy mety ny fanaony.'),
  ('6ab25b46e88d2fc620991745', '2026-09-22T10:41:10.656Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:10.656Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 20, 10, 'Samy maharikoriko an’i Jehovah, Na ny vatomizana mandainga na ny famarana tsy marina.', 'samy maharikoriko an’i jehovah, na ny vatomizana mandainga na ny famarana tsy marina.'),
  ('6ab25b46e88d2fc62099173e', '2026-09-22T10:41:10.656Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:10.656Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 20, 3, 'Voninahitra ho an’ny olona ny mifehy tena tsy hifamaly, Fa ny tsisy saina rehetra kosa miditra amin’ilay fifamaliana.', 'voninahitra ho an’ny olona ny mifehy tena tsy hifamaly, fa ny tsisy saina rehetra kosa miditra amin’ilay fifamaliana.'),
  ('6ab25b46e88d2fc620991755', '2026-09-22T10:41:10.656Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:10.656Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 20, 26, 'Avahan’ny mpanjaka hendry ny ratsy fanahy, Ka hosihoseny amin’ny kodiaram-by.', 'avahan’ny mpanjaka hendry ny ratsy fanahy, ka hosihoseny amin’ny kodiaram-by.'),
  ('6ab25b46e88d2fc62099174e', '2026-09-22T10:41:10.656Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:10.656Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 20, 19, 'Mandehandeha mamoaka tsiambaratelo ny mpanendrikendrika. Aza miarakaraka amin’ny olona tia fosafosa.', 'mandehandeha mamoaka tsiambaratelo ny mpanendrikendrika. aza miarakaraka amin’ny olona tia fosafosa.'),
  ('6ab25b46e88d2fc62099174f', '2026-09-22T10:41:10.656Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:10.656Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 20, 20, 'Izay manozona ny rainy sy ny reniny, Dia ho faty ny jirony rehefa tonga ny alina.', 'izay manozona ny rainy sy ny reniny, dia ho faty ny jirony rehefa tonga ny alina.'),
  ('6ab25b47658f00c6a944a974', '2026-09-22T10:41:11.586Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:11.586Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 21, 21, 'Izay miezaka hanao ny marina foana sy ho be fitiavana ary tsy hivadika, Dia hahazo fiainana sy fahamarinana ary voninahitra.', 'izay miezaka hanao ny marina foana sy ho be fitiavana ary tsy hivadika, dia hahazo fiainana sy fahamarinana ary voninahitra.'),
  ('6ab25b47658f00c6a944a972', '2026-09-22T10:41:11.586Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:11.586Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 21, 19, 'Aleo mipetraka any an-tany efitra, Toy izay miray trano amin’ny vehivavy tia ady sady kizitina.', 'aleo mipetraka any an-tany efitra, toy izay miray trano amin’ny vehivavy tia ady sady kizitina.'),
  ('6ab25b47658f00c6a944a976', '2026-09-22T10:41:11.586Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:11.586Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 21, 23, 'Miaro ny tenany tsy hidi-kizo Ny olona mitandrina an’izay lazain’ny vavany.', 'miaro ny tenany tsy hidi-kizo ny olona mitandrina an’izay lazain’ny vavany.'),
  ('6ab25b47658f00c6a944a967', '2026-09-22T10:41:11.586Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:11.586Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 21, 8, 'Miolakolaka ny lalan’ny olo-meloka, Fa manao izay mahitsy kosa ny olona tsy manan-tsiny.', 'miolakolaka ny lalan’ny olo-meloka, fa manao izay mahitsy kosa ny olona tsy manan-tsiny.'),
  ('6ab25b47658f00c6a944a966', '2026-09-22T10:41:11.586Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:11.586Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 21, 7, 'Ny herisetra ataon’ny ratsy fanahy no haharingana azy, Satria tsy mety manao ny rariny izy.', 'ny herisetra ataon’ny ratsy fanahy no haharingana azy, satria tsy mety manao ny rariny izy.'),
  ('6ab25b47658f00c6a944a96f', '2026-09-22T10:41:11.586Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:11.586Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 21, 16, 'Izay miala amin’ny lalan’ny fahiratan-tsaina, Dia hiala sasatra miaraka amin’ireo maty tsy mahavita na inona na inona.', 'izay miala amin’ny lalan’ny fahiratan-tsaina, dia hiala sasatra miaraka amin’ireo maty tsy mahavita na inona na inona.'),
  ('6ab25b47658f00c6a944a961', '2026-09-22T10:41:11.586Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:11.586Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 21, 2, 'Heverin’ny olona hoe mety daholo izay ataony, Fa i Jehovah kosa mandinika ny fo.', 'heverin’ny olona hoe mety daholo izay ataony, fa i jehovah kosa mandinika ny fo.'),
  ('6ab25b47658f00c6a944a977', '2026-09-22T10:41:11.586Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:11.586Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 21, 24, 'Olona mirehareha sy sahisahy ratsy ary mizahozaho No iantsoana an’izay tsy mba mandinika fa sahisahy loatra.', 'olona mirehareha sy sahisahy ratsy ary mizahozaho no iantsoana an’izay tsy mba mandinika fa sahisahy loatra.'),
  ('6ab25b47658f00c6a944a964', '2026-09-22T10:41:11.586Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:11.586Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 21, 5, 'Mandamina mialoha an’izay hataony ny mazoto, ka mahomby, Fa hahantra kosa izay rehetra maimaika.', 'mandamina mialoha an’izay hataony ny mazoto, ka mahomby, fa hahantra kosa izay rehetra maimaika.'),
  ('6ab25b47658f00c6a944a965', '2026-09-22T10:41:11.586Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:11.586Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 21, 6, 'Ny harena azo amin’ny lainga, Dia toy ny zavona miserana sy fandrika mahafaty.', 'ny harena azo amin’ny lainga, dia toy ny zavona miserana sy fandrika mahafaty.'),
  ('6ab25b47658f00c6a944a960', '2026-09-22T10:41:11.586Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:11.586Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 21, 1, 'Hoatran’ny renirano eo an-tanan’i Jehovah ny fon’ny mpanjaka, Ka aviliny hankany amin’izay tiany.', 'hoatran’ny renirano eo an-tanan’i jehovah ny fon’ny mpanjaka, ka aviliny hankany amin’izay tiany.'),
  ('6ab25b47658f00c6a944a971', '2026-09-22T10:41:11.586Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:11.586Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 21, 18, 'Ny ratsy fanahy no omena hanavotana ny olo-marina, Ary ny mpivadika no hatao solon’ny olo-marina.', 'ny ratsy fanahy no omena hanavotana ny olo-marina, ary ny mpivadika no hatao solon’ny olo-marina.'),
  ('6ab25b47658f00c6a944a962', '2026-09-22T10:41:11.586Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:11.586Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 21, 3, 'Ny manao ny rariny sy ny hitsiny, No tian’i Jehovah kokoa noho ny manao sorona.', 'ny manao ny rariny sy ny hitsiny, no tian’i jehovah kokoa noho ny manao sorona.'),
  ('6ab25b47658f00c6a944a96e', '2026-09-22T10:41:11.586Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:11.586Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 21, 15, 'Mahafaly ny olo-marina ny manao ny rariny, Fa maharikoriko an’izay zatra manao ratsy kosa izany.', 'mahafaly ny olo-marina ny manao ny rariny, fa maharikoriko an’izay zatra manao ratsy kosa izany.'),
  ('6ab25b47658f00c6a944a96d', '2026-09-22T10:41:11.586Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:11.586Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 21, 14, 'Mampitony hatezerana ny fanomezana omena mangingina, Ary mampitony an’izay tezitra be ny kolikoly atao ao amin’ny miafina.', 'mampitony hatezerana ny fanomezana omena mangingina, ary mampitony an’izay tezitra be ny kolikoly atao ao amin’ny miafina.'),
  ('6ab25b47658f00c6a944a96b', '2026-09-22T10:41:11.586Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:11.586Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 21, 12, 'Dinihin’Ilay Marina ny ankohonan’ny ratsy fanahy, Ka ataony mahita loza.', 'dinihin’ilay marina ny ankohonan’ny ratsy fanahy, ka ataony mahita loza.'),
  ('6ab25b47658f00c6a944a978', '2026-09-22T10:41:11.586Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:11.586Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 21, 25, 'Ny zavatra irin’ny kamo no hahafaty azy, Satria tsy mety miasa izy.', 'ny zavatra irin’ny kamo no hahafaty azy, satria tsy mety miasa izy.'),
  ('6ab25b47658f00c6a944a975', '2026-09-22T10:41:11.586Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:11.586Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 21, 22, 'Vitan’ny hendry ny mananika ny tanànan’ny olona matanjaka, Sy mamotika ny fiarovana mafy itokisan’izy ireny.', 'vitan’ny hendry ny mananika ny tanànan’ny olona matanjaka, sy mamotika ny fiarovana mafy itokisan’izy ireny.'),
  ('6ab25b47658f00c6a944a970', '2026-09-22T10:41:11.586Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:11.586Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 21, 17, 'Hahantra izay tia miala voly, Ary tsy hanan-karena izay tia divay sy menaka.', 'hahantra izay tia miala voly, ary tsy hanan-karena izay tia divay sy menaka.'),
  ('6ab25b47658f00c6a944a968', '2026-09-22T10:41:11.586Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:11.586Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 21, 9, 'Aleo mipetraka eny an-joron’ny tafontrano, Toy izay miray trano amin’ny vehivavy tia ady.', 'aleo mipetraka eny an-joron’ny tafontrano, toy izay miray trano amin’ny vehivavy tia ady.'),
  ('6ab25b47658f00c6a944a963', '2026-09-22T10:41:11.586Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:11.586Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 21, 4, 'Ny maso mianjonanjona sy ny fo mirehareha no jiro manazava ny ratsy fanahy, Ary fahotana daholo izany.', 'ny maso mianjonanjona sy ny fo mirehareha no jiro manazava ny ratsy fanahy, ary fahotana daholo izany.'),
  ('6ab25b47658f00c6a944a96c', '2026-09-22T10:41:11.586Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:11.586Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 21, 13, 'Izay manampin-tsofina tsy hihaino ny fitarainan’ny mahantra, Dia tsy hohenoina koa rehefa miantso.', 'izay manampin-tsofina tsy hihaino ny fitarainan’ny mahantra, dia tsy hohenoina koa rehefa miantso.'),
  ('6ab25b47658f00c6a944a969', '2026-09-22T10:41:11.586Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:11.586Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 21, 10, 'Ny ratsy foana no tian’ny ratsy fanahy, Ary tsy mba mangoraka ny namany izy.', 'ny ratsy foana no tian’ny ratsy fanahy, ary tsy mba mangoraka ny namany izy.'),
  ('6ab25b47658f00c6a944a973', '2026-09-22T10:41:11.586Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:11.586Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 21, 20, 'Harena sarobidy sy menaka no hita ao an-tranon’ny hendry, Fa ny adala kosa mandanilany ny fananany.', 'harena sarobidy sy menaka no hita ao an-tranon’ny hendry, fa ny adala kosa mandanilany ny fananany.'),
  ('6ab25b47658f00c6a944a96a', '2026-09-22T10:41:11.586Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:11.586Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 21, 11, 'Ho hendry kokoa izay mbola tsy dia nahita fiainana, rehefa sazina ny mpanesoeso, Ary hahazo fahalalana ny hendry rehefa lasa lalin-tsaina.', 'ho hendry kokoa izay mbola tsy dia nahita fiainana, rehefa sazina ny mpanesoeso, ary hahazo fahalalana ny hendry rehefa lasa lalin-tsaina.'),
  ('6ab25b47658f00c6a944a979', '2026-09-22T10:41:11.587Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:11.587Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 21, 26, 'Mitsiriritra foana izy tontolo andro, Fa ny olo-marina kosa manome foana sady tsy kahihitra.', 'mitsiriritra foana izy tontolo andro, fa ny olo-marina kosa manome foana sady tsy kahihitra.'),
  ('6ab25b47658f00c6a944a97a', '2026-09-22T10:41:11.587Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:11.587Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 21, 27, 'Efa maharikoriko ny sorona ataon’ny ratsy fanahy, Mainka moa raha hoe mitetika hanao ratsy izy rehefa manolotra an’izany!', 'efa maharikoriko ny sorona ataon’ny ratsy fanahy, mainka moa raha hoe mitetika hanao ratsy izy rehefa manolotra an’izany!'),
  ('6ab25b47658f00c6a944a97e', '2026-09-22T10:41:11.587Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:11.587Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 21, 31, 'Voaomana hampiasaina amin’ny andron’ny ady ny soavaly, Fa avy amin’i Jehovah kosa ny famonjena.', 'voaomana hampiasaina amin’ny andron’ny ady ny soavaly, fa avy amin’i jehovah kosa ny famonjena.'),
  ('6ab25b47658f00c6a944a97b', '2026-09-22T10:41:11.587Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:11.587Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 21, 28, 'Ho faty ny vavolombelona mandainga, Fa izay mihaino kosa no hahomby rehefa mijoro ho vavolombelona.', 'ho faty ny vavolombelona mandainga, fa izay mihaino kosa no hahomby rehefa mijoro ho vavolombelona.'),
  ('6ab25b47658f00c6a944a97c', '2026-09-22T10:41:11.587Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:11.587Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 21, 29, 'Sahisahy ratsy ny ratsy fanahy, Fa ny olona manao izay mahitsy kosa no mandeha amin’ny lalana azo antoka.', 'sahisahy ratsy ny ratsy fanahy, fa ny olona manao izay mahitsy kosa no mandeha amin’ny lalana azo antoka.'),
  ('6ab25b47658f00c6a944a97d', '2026-09-22T10:41:11.587Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:11.587Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 21, 30, 'Tsy misy fahendrena na fahaiza-mandinika na torohevitra mahatohitra an’i Jehovah.', 'tsy misy fahendrena na fahaiza-mandinika na torohevitra mahatohitra an’i jehovah.'),
  ('6ab25b4df6b2c3f9e954a4dc', '2026-09-22T10:41:17.082Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:17.082Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 23, 5, 'Raha avelanao hitopy any amin’ny harena ny masonao, dia tsy ho hitanao akory izany. Fa haniry elatra izany ka hanidina eny amin’ny lanitra toy ny voromahery.', 'raha avelanao hitopy any amin’ny harena ny masonao, dia tsy ho hitanao akory izany. fa haniry elatra izany ka hanidina eny amin’ny lanitra toy ny voromahery.'),
  ('6ab25b4df6b2c3f9e954a4d9', '2026-09-22T10:41:17.082Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:17.082Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 23, 2, 'Ka mahaiza mifehy tena, Raha mazoto homana be ianao.', 'ka mahaiza mifehy tena, raha mazoto homana be ianao.'),
  ('6ab25b4df6b2c3f9e954a4dd', '2026-09-22T10:41:17.082Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:17.082Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 23, 6, 'Aza mihinana ny sakafo aroson’ny kahihitra. Aza mitsiriritra ny sakafo matsiro arosony.', 'aza mihinana ny sakafo aroson’ny kahihitra. aza mitsiriritra ny sakafo matsiro arosony.'),
  ('6ab25b4df6b2c3f9e954a4d8', '2026-09-22T10:41:17.082Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:17.082Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 23, 1, 'Raha mipetraka mba hiara-misakafo amin’ny mpanjaka ianao, Dia mitandrema tsara,', 'raha mipetraka mba hiara-misakafo amin’ny mpanjaka ianao, dia mitandrema tsara,'),
  ('6ab25b4df6b2c3f9e954a4db', '2026-09-22T10:41:17.082Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:17.082Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 23, 4, 'Aza mandrera-tena mikatsaka harena. Ajanòny izany dia asehoy hoe mahira-tsaina ianao.', 'aza mandrera-tena mikatsaka harena. ajanòny izany dia asehoy hoe mahira-tsaina ianao.'),
  ('6ab25b4df6b2c3f9e954a4da', '2026-09-22T10:41:17.082Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:17.082Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 23, 3, 'Aza mitsiriritra ny sakafo matsiro arosony, Satria sakafo misy fitaka izany.', 'aza mitsiriritra ny sakafo matsiro arosony, satria sakafo misy fitaka izany.'),
  ('6ab25b4df6b2c3f9e954a4f8', '2026-09-22T10:41:17.083Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:17.083Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 23, 33, 'Hahita zavatra hafahafa ny masonao, Ary hirediredy ianao noho ny eritreri-dratsy mitsiry ao am-ponao.', 'hahita zavatra hafahafa ny masonao, ary hirediredy ianao noho ny eritreri-dratsy mitsiry ao am-ponao.'),
  ('6ab25b4df6b2c3f9e954a4eb', '2026-09-22T10:41:17.083Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:17.083Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 23, 20, 'Aza manaiky ho anisan’izay mpiboboka divay be, Na ho anisan’izay mpihinan-kena tafahoatra.', 'aza manaiky ho anisan’izay mpiboboka divay be, na ho anisan’izay mpihinan-kena tafahoatra.'),
  ('6ab25b4df6b2c3f9e954a4e4', '2026-09-22T10:41:17.083Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:17.083Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 23, 13, 'Aza misalasala manafay zanaka, Fa tsy hoe ho faty izy akory raha kapohinao amin’ny tsorakazo.', 'aza misalasala manafay zanaka, fa tsy hoe ho faty izy akory raha kapohinao amin’ny tsorakazo.'),
  ('6ab25b4df6b2c3f9e954a4fa', '2026-09-22T10:41:17.083Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:17.083Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 23, 35, 'Dia hoy ianao: “Nokapohiny aho, nefa tsy naheno naharary. Noveleziny aho, nefa tsy tadidiko akory. Rahoviana àry aho no hifoha? Fa mila misotro indray aho.”', 'dia hoy ianao: “nokapohiny aho, nefa tsy naheno naharary. noveleziny aho, nefa tsy tadidiko akory. rahoviana àry aho no hifoha? fa mila misotro indray aho.”'),
  ('6ab25b4df6b2c3f9e954a4f4', '2026-09-22T10:41:17.083Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:17.083Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 23, 29, 'Iza no miferinaina? Iza no tsy mahazo aina? Iza no tia miady? Iza no be taraina? Iza no maradratra tsy amin’antony? Ary iza no mena maso?', 'iza no miferinaina? iza no tsy mahazo aina? iza no tia miady? iza no be taraina? iza no maradratra tsy amin’antony? ary iza no mena maso?'),
  ('6ab25b4df6b2c3f9e954a4e1', '2026-09-22T10:41:17.083Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:17.083Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 23, 10, 'Aza akisaka ny marika mamaritra ny tanin’olona, izay napetraka taloha ela be, Ary aza mitsofotsofoka ao amin’ny tanin’ny kamboty ray.', 'aza akisaka ny marika mamaritra ny tanin’olona, izay napetraka taloha ela be, ary aza mitsofotsofoka ao amin’ny tanin’ny kamboty ray.'),
  ('6ab25b4df6b2c3f9e954a4ea', '2026-09-22T10:41:17.083Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:17.083Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 23, 19, 'Mihainoa, anaka, ka hendre, Ary avilio hanaraka ny lalana tsara ny fonao.', 'mihainoa, anaka, ka hendre, ary avilio hanaraka ny lalana tsara ny fonao.'),
  ('6ab25b4df6b2c3f9e954a4f7', '2026-09-22T10:41:17.083Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:17.083Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 23, 32, 'Fa hanaikitra hoatran’ny menarana izy amin’ny farany, Ary hamoaka poizina hoatran’ny bibilava.', 'fa hanaikitra hoatran’ny menarana izy amin’ny farany, ary hamoaka poizina hoatran’ny bibilava.'),
  ('6ab25b4df6b2c3f9e954a4ef', '2026-09-22T10:41:17.083Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:17.083Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 23, 24, 'Tena ho faly ny rain’ny olo-marina, Ary izay ray manan-janaka hendry ho ravoravo aminy.', 'tena ho faly ny rain’ny olo-marina, ary izay ray manan-janaka hendry ho ravoravo aminy.'),
  ('6ab25b4df6b2c3f9e954a4de', '2026-09-22T10:41:17.083Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:17.083Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 23, 7, 'Efa kajikajiny tsara mantsy ny habetsahan’ny laninao. Hoy izy aminao: “Mihinàna, dia misotroa e!”, nefa tsy vokatry ny fony akory izany.', 'efa kajikajiny tsara mantsy ny habetsahan’ny laninao. hoy izy aminao: “mihinàna, dia misotroa e!”, nefa tsy vokatry ny fony akory izany.'),
  ('6ab25b4df6b2c3f9e954a4f0', '2026-09-22T10:41:17.083Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:17.083Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 23, 25, 'Ho ravoravo ny rainao sy ny reninao, Ary ho faly ny reninao niteraka anao.', 'ho ravoravo ny rainao sy ny reninao, ary ho faly ny reninao niteraka anao.'),
  ('6ab25b4df6b2c3f9e954a4ed', '2026-09-22T10:41:17.083Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:17.083Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 23, 22, 'Henoy ny rainao niteraka anao, Ary aza atao tsinontsinona ny reninao satria hoe efa antitra izy.', 'henoy ny rainao niteraka anao, ary aza atao tsinontsinona ny reninao satria hoe efa antitra izy.'),
  ('6ab25b4df6b2c3f9e954a4e5', '2026-09-22T10:41:17.083Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:17.083Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 23, 14, 'Kapohy amin’ny tsorakazo izy, Amin’izay ho voavonjy tsy ho any amin’ny Fasana.', 'kapohy amin’ny tsorakazo izy, amin’izay ho voavonjy tsy ho any amin’ny fasana.'),
  ('6ab25b4df6b2c3f9e954a4f2', '2026-09-22T10:41:17.083Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:17.083Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 23, 27, 'Fa hoatran’ny lavaka lalina ny mpivaro-tena, Ary toy ny lavadrano tery ny vehivavy ratsy fitondran-tena.', 'fa hoatran’ny lavaka lalina ny mpivaro-tena, ary toy ny lavadrano tery ny vehivavy ratsy fitondran-tena.'),
  ('6ab25b4df6b2c3f9e954a4f1', '2026-09-22T10:41:17.083Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:17.083Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 23, 26, 'Omeo ahy ny fonao, anaka, Ary enga anie ny masonao ho finaritra mandinika ny lalako!', 'omeo ahy ny fonao, anaka, ary enga anie ny masonao ho finaritra mandinika ny lalako!');
INSERT INTO "bible_verses" ("id", "created_date", "updated_date", "created_by_id", "created_by", "translation", "book", "bookOrder", "chapter", "verse", "text", "normalizedText") VALUES
  ('6ab25b4df6b2c3f9e954a4e3', '2026-09-22T10:41:17.083Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:17.083Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 23, 12, 'Sokafy ny fonao hanaiky anatra, Ary ny sofinao hihaino fahalalana.', 'sokafy ny fonao hanaiky anatra, ary ny sofinao hihaino fahalalana.'),
  ('6ab25b4df6b2c3f9e954a4df', '2026-09-22T10:41:17.083Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:17.083Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 23, 8, 'Dia haloan’ny vavanao izay sombiny kely efa laninao, Ary ho very maina ny teny fiderana nataonao.', 'dia haloan’ny vavanao izay sombiny kely efa laninao, ary ho very maina ny teny fiderana nataonao.'),
  ('6ab25b4df6b2c3f9e954a4f3', '2026-09-22T10:41:17.083Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:17.083Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 23, 28, 'Miafina toy ny jiolahy izy, Ary noho ny ataony dia mihabetsaka ny lehilahy mpivadika.', 'miafina toy ny jiolahy izy, ary noho ny ataony dia mihabetsaka ny lehilahy mpivadika.'),
  ('6ab25b4df6b2c3f9e954a4ee', '2026-09-22T10:41:17.083Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:17.083Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 23, 23, 'Vidio ny fahamarinana ka aza amidy mihitsy, Dia vidio koa ny fahendrena sy ny anatra ary ny fahiratan-tsaina.', 'vidio ny fahamarinana ka aza amidy mihitsy, dia vidio koa ny fahendrena sy ny anatra ary ny fahiratan-tsaina.'),
  ('6ab25b4df6b2c3f9e954a4e6', '2026-09-22T10:41:17.083Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:17.083Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 23, 15, 'Raha manana fo hendry ianao, anaka, Dia ho faly ny foko.', 'raha manana fo hendry ianao, anaka, dia ho faly ny foko.'),
  ('6ab25b4df6b2c3f9e954a4f6', '2026-09-22T10:41:17.083Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:17.083Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 23, 31, 'Aza mijery ny hamenan’ny divay, Sy ilay izy mamirapiratra ao anaty kaopy, sady mora atelina.', 'aza mijery ny hamenan’ny divay, sy ilay izy mamirapiratra ao anaty kaopy, sady mora atelina.'),
  ('6ab25b4df6b2c3f9e954a4f5', '2026-09-22T10:41:17.083Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:17.083Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 23, 30, 'Tsy iza fa izay tsy mety miala eo am-pototry ny divay, Sy izay mitady divay misy fangarony.', 'tsy iza fa izay tsy mety miala eo am-pototry ny divay, sy izay mitady divay misy fangarony.'),
  ('6ab25b4df6b2c3f9e954a4f9', '2026-09-22T10:41:17.083Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:17.083Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 23, 34, 'Ho toy ny olona matory eo afovoan-dranomasina ianao, Ary ho toy ny olona matory eny an-tendron’ny andrin-tsambo.', 'ho toy ny olona matory eo afovoan-dranomasina ianao, ary ho toy ny olona matory eny an-tendron’ny andrin-tsambo.'),
  ('6ab25b4df6b2c3f9e954a4ec', '2026-09-22T10:41:17.083Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:17.083Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 23, 21, 'Fa hahantra ny mamo lava sy ny tendan-kanina, Ary hitafy voro-damba izay tia torimaso.', 'fa hahantra ny mamo lava sy ny tendan-kanina, ary hitafy voro-damba izay tia torimaso.'),
  ('6ab25b4df6b2c3f9e954a4e7', '2026-09-22T10:41:17.083Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:17.083Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 23, 16, 'Ho faly ny any anatiko lalina any, Raha milaza ny marina ianao.', 'ho faly ny any anatiko lalina any, raha milaza ny marina ianao.'),
  ('6ab25b4df6b2c3f9e954a4e0', '2026-09-22T10:41:17.083Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:17.083Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 23, 9, 'Aza atao henon’ny tsisy saina ny teninao, Fa hataony tsinontsinona ny tenim-pahendrena lazainao.', 'aza atao henon’ny tsisy saina ny teninao, fa hataony tsinontsinona ny tenim-pahendrena lazainao.'),
  ('6ab25b4df6b2c3f9e954a4e9', '2026-09-22T10:41:17.083Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:17.083Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 23, 18, 'Dia ho tsara ny hoavinao, Ary tsy ho foana ny fanantenanao.', 'dia ho tsara ny hoavinao, ary tsy ho foana ny fanantenanao.'),
  ('6ab25b4df6b2c3f9e954a4e8', '2026-09-22T10:41:17.083Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:17.083Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 23, 17, 'Aza avela hitsiriritra ny mpanota ny fonao, Fa matahora foana an’i Jehovah,', 'aza avela hitsiriritra ny mpanota ny fonao, fa matahora foana an’i jehovah,'),
  ('6ab25b4df6b2c3f9e954a4e2', '2026-09-22T10:41:17.083Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:17.083Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 23, 11, 'Fa mahery ilay Mpiaro azy, Ary Izy no hiady aminao eny amin’ny fitsarana mba hiarovana azy.', 'fa mahery ilay mpiaro azy, ary izy no hiady aminao eny amin’ny fitsarana mba hiarovana azy.'),
  ('6ab25b4e054bd4f8a5a60253', '2026-09-22T10:41:18.100Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:18.100Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 24, 19, 'Aza tezitra noho ny ataon’ny olon-dratsy, Ary aza mitsiriritra ny ratsy fanahy.', 'aza tezitra noho ny ataon’ny olon-dratsy, ary aza mitsiriritra ny ratsy fanahy.'),
  ('6ab25b4e054bd4f8a5a6025c', '2026-09-22T10:41:18.100Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:18.100Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 24, 28, 'Aza mijoro ho vavolombelona hiampanga olona tsy amin’antony. Aza mamitaka olona amin’izay lazain’ny vavanao.', 'aza mijoro ho vavolombelona hiampanga olona tsy amin’antony. aza mamitaka olona amin’izay lazain’ny vavanao.'),
  ('6ab25b4e054bd4f8a5a60247', '2026-09-22T10:41:18.100Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:18.100Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 24, 7, 'Tsy ho takatry ny tsisy saina ny tena fahendrena, Ary tsy hahita hotenenina izy eo am-bavahadin’ny tanàna.', 'tsy ho takatry ny tsisy saina ny tena fahendrena, ary tsy hahita hotenenina izy eo am-bavahadin’ny tanàna.'),
  ('6ab25b4e054bd4f8a5a60256', '2026-09-22T10:41:18.100Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:18.100Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 24, 22, 'Fa ho tonga tampoka ny loza hanjo azy. Ka iza no mahalala an’izay loza hamelezan’izy ireo an’ireny?', 'fa ho tonga tampoka ny loza hanjo azy. ka iza no mahalala an’izay loza hamelezan’izy ireo an’ireny?'),
  ('6ab25b4e054bd4f8a5a60251', '2026-09-22T10:41:18.100Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:18.100Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 24, 17, 'Aza mifaly raha lavo ny fahavalonao, Ary aza avela ho falifaly ny fonao raha tafintohina izy,', 'aza mifaly raha lavo ny fahavalonao, ary aza avela ho falifaly ny fonao raha tafintohina izy,'),
  ('6ab25b4e054bd4f8a5a60249', '2026-09-22T10:41:18.100Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:18.100Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 24, 9, 'Fahotana ny teti-dratsin’ny adala, Ary tsy tian’ny olona ny mpanesoeso.', 'fahotana ny teti-dratsin’ny adala, ary tsy tian’ny olona ny mpanesoeso.'),
  ('6ab25b4e054bd4f8a5a6025b', '2026-09-22T10:41:18.100Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:18.100Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 24, 27, 'Karakarao ny asanao eny ivelany, ary ataovy vonona daholo ny eny an-tsaha. Avy eo dia aoreno ny tranonao.', 'karakarao ny asanao eny ivelany, ary ataovy vonona daholo ny eny an-tsaha. avy eo dia aoreno ny tranonao.'),
  ('6ab25b4e054bd4f8a5a6024d', '2026-09-22T10:41:18.100Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:18.100Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 24, 13, 'Mihinàna tantely, anaka, fa tsara izany. Mamy ny tantely avy amin’ny toho-tantely.', 'mihinàna tantely, anaka, fa tsara izany. mamy ny tantely avy amin’ny toho-tantely.'),
  ('6ab25b4e054bd4f8a5a6024a', '2026-09-22T10:41:18.100Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:18.100Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 24, 10, 'Raha kivy ianao rehefa ao anatin’ny sarotra, Dia ho kely ny herinao.', 'raha kivy ianao rehefa ao anatin’ny sarotra, dia ho kely ny herinao.'),
  ('6ab25b4e054bd4f8a5a60243', '2026-09-22T10:41:18.100Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:18.100Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 24, 3, 'Fahendrena no ilain’izay hanorina trano, Ary fahaiza-mandinika no ilaina mba hahamafy orina azy.', 'fahendrena no ilain’izay hanorina trano, ary fahaiza-mandinika no ilaina mba hahamafy orina azy.'),
  ('6ab25b4e054bd4f8a5a60254', '2026-09-22T10:41:18.100Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:18.100Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 24, 20, 'Fa tsy ho tsara ny hoavin’ny olon-dratsy, Ary ho faty ny jiron’ny ratsy fanahy.', 'fa tsy ho tsara ny hoavin’ny olon-dratsy, ary ho faty ny jiron’ny ratsy fanahy.'),
  ('6ab25b4e054bd4f8a5a6024e', '2026-09-22T10:41:18.100Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:18.100Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 24, 14, 'Fantaro koa fa mahasoa anao ny fahendrena. Raha mahazo an’izany ianao, dia ho tsara ny hoavinao, Ary tsy ho foana ny fanantenanao.', 'fantaro koa fa mahasoa anao ny fahendrena. raha mahazo an’izany ianao, dia ho tsara ny hoavinao, ary tsy ho foana ny fanantenanao.'),
  ('6ab25b4e054bd4f8a5a60252', '2026-09-22T10:41:18.100Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:18.100Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 24, 18, 'Sao ho hitan’i Jehovah izany ka tsy ho faly Izy, Ary tsy ho tezitra amin’ilay fahavalonao intsony.', 'sao ho hitan’i jehovah izany ka tsy ho faly izy, ary tsy ho tezitra amin’ilay fahavalonao intsony.'),
  ('6ab25b4e054bd4f8a5a60250', '2026-09-22T10:41:18.100Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:18.100Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 24, 16, 'Mety ho lavo impito ny olo-marina, nefa ho tafarina ihany, Fa ny ratsy fanahy kosa ho tafintohina noho ny loza.', 'mety ho lavo impito ny olo-marina, nefa ho tafarina ihany, fa ny ratsy fanahy kosa ho tafintohina noho ny loza.'),
  ('6ab25b4e054bd4f8a5a6024b', '2026-09-22T10:41:18.100Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:18.100Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 24, 11, 'Vonjeo izay entina hovonoina, Ary avoty izay mangozohozo efa haringana.', 'vonjeo izay entina hovonoina, ary avoty izay mangozohozo efa haringana.'),
  ('6ab25b4e054bd4f8a5a60245', '2026-09-22T10:41:18.100Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:18.100Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 24, 5, 'Mahery ny lehilahy hendry, Ary vao mainka mahery ny olona manam-pahalalana.', 'mahery ny lehilahy hendry, ary vao mainka mahery ny olona manam-pahalalana.'),
  ('6ab25b4e054bd4f8a5a60244', '2026-09-22T10:41:18.100Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:18.100Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 24, 4, 'Fahalalana no mahatonga an’ireo efitranony Ho feno harena sarobidy sy mahafinaritra isan-karazany.', 'fahalalana no mahatonga an’ireo efitranony ho feno harena sarobidy sy mahafinaritra isan-karazany.'),
  ('6ab25b4e054bd4f8a5a60241', '2026-09-22T10:41:18.100Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:18.100Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 24, 1, 'Aza mitsiriritra ny olon-dratsy, Ary aza maniry mafy hiaraka aminy.', 'aza mitsiriritra ny olon-dratsy, ary aza maniry mafy hiaraka aminy.'),
  ('6ab25b4e054bd4f8a5a6025a', '2026-09-22T10:41:18.100Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:18.100Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 24, 26, 'Hohajain’ny olona izay mitsotra ny marina.', 'hohajain’ny olona izay mitsotra ny marina.'),
  ('6ab25b4e054bd4f8a5a60259', '2026-09-22T10:41:18.100Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:18.100Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 24, 25, 'Fa handeha tsara kosa ny fiainan’ireo mananatra ny ratsy fanahy, Ary hotahina izy ireo ka hahazo zava-tsoa.', 'fa handeha tsara kosa ny fiainan’ireo mananatra ny ratsy fanahy, ary hotahina izy ireo ka hahazo zava-tsoa.'),
  ('6ab25b4e054bd4f8a5a60257', '2026-09-22T10:41:18.100Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:18.100Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 24, 23, 'Miteny koa ny hendry hoe: Tsy tsara ny miangatra rehefa mitsara.', 'miteny koa ny hendry hoe: tsy tsara ny miangatra rehefa mitsara.'),
  ('6ab25b4e054bd4f8a5a60248', '2026-09-22T10:41:18.100Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:18.100Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 24, 8, 'Izay mitetika ny hanao ratsy Dia hantsoina hoe mpamorona teti-dratsy raindahiny.', 'izay mitetika ny hanao ratsy dia hantsoina hoe mpamorona teti-dratsy raindahiny.'),
