  ('6ab25b50e43d53b89556d55d', '2026-09-22T10:41:20.147Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:20.147Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 27, 19, 'Azo itarafana ny tarehy ny rano, Dia hoatr’izany koa fa azo itarafana ny fo ny fon’olon-kafa.', 'azo itarafana ny tarehy ny rano, dia hoatr’izany koa fa azo itarafana ny fo ny fon’olon-kafa.'),
  ('6ab25b50e43d53b89556d558', '2026-09-22T10:41:20.147Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:20.147Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 27, 14, 'Izay mirary soa ny namany vao maraina nefa miteny mafy be, Dia hoatran’ny hoe manozona azy ihany.', 'izay mirary soa ny namany vao maraina nefa miteny mafy be, dia hoatran’ny hoe manozona azy ihany.'),
  ('6ab25b50e43d53b89556d555', '2026-09-22T10:41:20.147Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:20.147Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 27, 11, 'Hendre, anaka, ary ampifalio ny foko, Mba hamaliako an’ilay manaratsy ahy.', 'hendre, anaka, ary ampifalio ny foko, mba hamaliako an’ilay manaratsy ahy.'),
  ('6ab25b50e43d53b89556d55c', '2026-09-22T10:41:20.147Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:20.147Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 27, 18, 'Izay mikarakara ny aviaviny no hihinana ny voany, Ary izay mikarakara ny tompony no homena voninahitra.', 'izay mikarakara ny aviaviny no hihinana ny voany, ary izay mikarakara ny tompony no homena voninahitra.'),
  ('6ab25b50e43d53b89556d564', '2026-09-22T10:41:20.147Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:20.147Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 27, 26, 'Ahazoanao akanjo ny vantotr’ondrilahy, Ary ahafahanao mividy tany ny osilahy.', 'ahazoanao akanjo ny vantotr’ondrilahy, ary ahafahanao mividy tany ny osilahy.'),
  ('6ab25b50e43d53b89556d563', '2026-09-22T10:41:20.147Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:20.147Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 27, 25, 'Malazo ny ahi-maitso, dia misy ahitra vaovao mitsimoka, Ary angonina hohanin’ny biby fiompy ny zavamaniry eny an-tendrombohitra.', 'malazo ny ahi-maitso, dia misy ahitra vaovao mitsimoka, ary angonina hohanin’ny biby fiompy ny zavamaniry eny an-tendrombohitra.'),
  ('6ab25b50e43d53b89556d552', '2026-09-22T10:41:20.147Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:20.147Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 27, 8, 'Hoatran’ny vorona mandao ny akaniny Ny olona mandao ny tranony.', 'hoatran’ny vorona mandao ny akaniny ny olona mandao ny tranony.'),
  ('6ab25b50e43d53b89556d550', '2026-09-22T10:41:20.147Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:20.147Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 27, 6, 'Ny ratra ataon’ny namana no ahitana hoe tsy mivadika izy, Fa be dia be kosa ny oroky ny fahavalo.', 'ny ratra ataon’ny namana no ahitana hoe tsy mivadika izy, fa be dia be kosa ny oroky ny fahavalo.'),
  ('6ab25b50e43d53b89556d54b', '2026-09-22T10:41:20.147Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:20.147Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 27, 1, 'Aza mirehareha ny amin’ny ampitso, Fa tsy fantatrao izay havoaky ny andro tsirairay.', 'aza mirehareha ny amin’ny ampitso, fa tsy fantatrao izay havoaky ny andro tsirairay.'),
  ('6ab25b50e43d53b89556d565', '2026-09-22T10:41:20.147Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:20.147Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 27, 27, 'Hanana rononon’osy ampy hataonao sakafo ianao, Sady ho ampy ho an’ny ankohonanao no ampy hiveloman’ny mpanompovavinao.', 'hanana rononon’osy ampy hataonao sakafo ianao, sady ho ampy ho an’ny ankohonanao no ampy hiveloman’ny mpanompovavinao.'),
  ('6ab25b50e43d53b89556d55f', '2026-09-22T10:41:20.147Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:20.147Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 27, 21, 'Natao ho an’ny volafotsy ny vilany fanadiovana metaly, ary ho an’ny volamena ny fatana fandrendrehana, Dia hoatr’izany koa fa natao hitsapana ny olona ny teny fiderana azy.', 'natao ho an’ny volafotsy ny vilany fanadiovana metaly, ary ho an’ny volamena ny fatana fandrendrehana, dia hoatr’izany koa fa natao hitsapana ny olona ny teny fiderana azy.'),
  ('6ab25b50e43d53b89556d54d', '2026-09-22T10:41:20.147Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:20.147Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 27, 3, 'Samy mavesatra na ny vato na ny fasika, Fa ny hatezerana vokatry ny ataon’ny adala mbola mavesatra kokoa.', 'samy mavesatra na ny vato na ny fasika, fa ny hatezerana vokatry ny ataon’ny adala mbola mavesatra kokoa.'),
  ('6ab25b50e43d53b89556d55b', '2026-09-22T10:41:20.147Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:20.147Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 27, 17, 'Ny vy no mandranitra ny vy, Ary toy ny mandranitra ny namany koa ny olona rehefa manampy azy.', 'ny vy no mandranitra ny vy, ary toy ny mandranitra ny namany koa ny olona rehefa manampy azy.'),
  ('6ab25b50e43d53b89556d553', '2026-09-22T10:41:20.147Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:20.147Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 27, 9, 'Mahatonga ny fo ho falifaly ny menaka sy ny emboka manitra, Dia hoatr’izany koa ny namana mahafinaritra, izay manoro hevitra amim-pahatsorana.', 'mahatonga ny fo ho falifaly ny menaka sy ny emboka manitra, dia hoatr’izany koa ny namana mahafinaritra, izay manoro hevitra amim-pahatsorana.'),
  ('6ab25b50dbacdbce6d33c9cc', '2026-09-22T10:41:20.586Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:20.586Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 28, 9, 'Izay tsy mety mihaino ny lalàna, Na ny vavaka ataony aza maharikoriko.', 'izay tsy mety mihaino ny lalàna, na ny vavaka ataony aza maharikoriko.'),
  ('6ab25b50dbacdbce6d33c9cb', '2026-09-22T10:41:20.586Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:20.586Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 28, 8, 'Izay maka zanabola sy tombony tafahoatra mba hampitomboana ny harenany, Dia manangona an’izany ho an’izay miantra ny mahantra.', 'izay maka zanabola sy tombony tafahoatra mba hampitomboana ny harenany, dia manangona an’izany ho an’izay miantra ny mahantra.'),
  ('6ab25b50dbacdbce6d33c9cd', '2026-09-22T10:41:20.586Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:20.586Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 28, 10, 'Izay mamitaka olo-marina mba hitaomana azy hanao ratsy, dia ho latsaka ao amin’ny lavaka nataony ihany. Fa ny tsy misy tsiny kosa handova zava-tsoa.', 'izay mamitaka olo-marina mba hitaomana azy hanao ratsy, dia ho latsaka ao amin’ny lavaka nataony ihany. fa ny tsy misy tsiny kosa handova zava-tsoa.'),
  ('6ab25b50dbacdbce6d33c9ca', '2026-09-22T10:41:20.586Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:20.586Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 28, 7, 'Mankatò lalàna ny zanaka mahira-tsaina, Fa manala baraka ny rainy kosa izay minamana amin’ny tendan-kanina.', 'mankatò lalàna ny zanaka mahira-tsaina, fa manala baraka ny rainy kosa izay minamana amin’ny tendan-kanina.'),
  ('6ab25b50dbacdbce6d33c9d1', '2026-09-22T10:41:20.586Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:20.586Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 28, 14, 'Sambatra izay olona miambina foana, Fa izay manamafy fo kosa hahita loza.', 'sambatra izay olona miambina foana, fa izay manamafy fo kosa hahita loza.'),
  ('6ab25b50dbacdbce6d33c9c8', '2026-09-22T10:41:20.586Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:20.586Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 28, 5, 'Tsy mahalala ny dikan’ny hoe rariny ny ratsy fanahy, Fa mahalala ny zava-drehetra kosa izay mitady an’i Jehovah.', 'tsy mahalala ny dikan’ny hoe rariny ny ratsy fanahy, fa mahalala ny zava-drehetra kosa izay mitady an’i jehovah.'),
  ('6ab25b50dbacdbce6d33c9c7', '2026-09-22T10:41:20.586Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:20.586Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 28, 4, 'Midera ny ratsy fanahy ny olona mandika lalàna, Fa tezitra amin’ireny kosa izay mankatò lalàna.', 'midera ny ratsy fanahy ny olona mandika lalàna, fa tezitra amin’ireny kosa izay mankatò lalàna.'),
  ('6ab25b50dbacdbce6d33c9c5', '2026-09-22T10:41:20.586Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:20.586Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 28, 2, 'Misolosolo foana ny mpitondra, rehefa misy mandika lalàna eo amin’ilay tany, Fa raha ampian’ny olona mahay mandinika sy manam-pahalalana kosa ny mpitondra, dia haharitra ny fitondrany.', 'misolosolo foana ny mpitondra, rehefa misy mandika lalàna eo amin’ilay tany, fa raha ampian’ny olona mahay mandinika sy manam-pahalalana kosa ny mpitondra, dia haharitra ny fitondrany.'),
  ('6ab25b50dbacdbce6d33c9cf', '2026-09-22T10:41:20.586Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:20.586Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 28, 12, 'Rehefa mandresy ny olo-marina, dia voninahitra lehibe izany, Fa rehefa mahazo fahefana kosa ny ratsy fanahy, dia misitrika ny vahoaka.', 'rehefa mandresy ny olo-marina, dia voninahitra lehibe izany, fa rehefa mahazo fahefana kosa ny ratsy fanahy, dia misitrika ny vahoaka.'),
  ('6ab25b50dbacdbce6d33c9ce', '2026-09-22T10:41:20.586Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:20.586Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 28, 11, 'Mihevi-tena ho hendry ny mpanankarena. Mahalala ny tena marina momba azy anefa ny mahantra mahay mandinika.', 'mihevi-tena ho hendry ny mpanankarena. mahalala ny tena marina momba azy anefa ny mahantra mahay mandinika.'),
  ('6ab25b50dbacdbce6d33c9d0', '2026-09-22T10:41:20.586Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:20.586Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 28, 13, 'Izay nandika lalàna ka manarontsarona ny nataony dia tsy hahomby, Fa izay miaiky heloka sy miala amin’izany kosa no hamindrana fo.', 'izay nandika lalàna ka manarontsarona ny nataony dia tsy hahomby, fa izay miaiky heloka sy miala amin’izany kosa no hamindrana fo.'),
  ('6ab25b50dbacdbce6d33c9c9', '2026-09-22T10:41:20.586Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:20.586Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 28, 6, 'Aleo mahantra nefa tsy mivadika, Toy izay mpanankarena nefa fetsy ratsy.', 'aleo mahantra nefa tsy mivadika, toy izay mpanankarena nefa fetsy ratsy.'),
  ('6ab25b50dbacdbce6d33c9c4', '2026-09-22T10:41:20.586Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:20.586Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 28, 1, 'Mandositra ny ratsy fanahy na dia tsy misy manenjika aza, Fa feno toky hoatran’ny liona kosa ny olo-marina.', 'mandositra ny ratsy fanahy na dia tsy misy manenjika aza, fa feno toky hoatran’ny liona kosa ny olo-marina.'),
  ('6ab25b50dbacdbce6d33c9c6', '2026-09-22T10:41:20.586Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:20.586Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 28, 3, 'Izay lehilahy mahantra nefa manambaka ny madinika, Dia toy ny ranonorana mifaoka ny vokatra rehetra.', 'izay lehilahy mahantra nefa manambaka ny madinika, dia toy ny ranonorana mifaoka ny vokatra rehetra.'),
  ('6ab25b50dbacdbce6d33c9dd', '2026-09-22T10:41:20.587Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:20.587Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 28, 26, 'Tsisy saina izay matoky ny fony, Fa ho voaro kosa izay manao zavatra amim-pahendrena.', 'tsisy saina izay matoky ny fony, fa ho voaro kosa izay manao zavatra amim-pahendrena.'),
  ('6ab25b50dbacdbce6d33c9d4', '2026-09-22T10:41:20.587Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:20.587Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 28, 17, 'Handositra hatrany am-pasana izay mivesatra trosan-dra fa namono olona. Aza misy manampy azy.', 'handositra hatrany am-pasana izay mivesatra trosan-dra fa namono olona. aza misy manampy azy.'),
  ('6ab25b50dbacdbce6d33c9d3', '2026-09-22T10:41:20.587Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:20.587Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 28, 16, 'Manampatra fahefana ny mpitarika tsy mahay mandinika, Fa ho ela velona kosa izay tsy tia tombony azo amin’ny tsy marina.', 'manampatra fahefana ny mpitarika tsy mahay mandinika, fa ho ela velona kosa izay tsy tia tombony azo amin’ny tsy marina.'),
  ('6ab25b50dbacdbce6d33c9dc', '2026-09-22T10:41:20.587Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:20.587Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 28, 25, 'Mampisy ady ny olona tsy mety afa-po, Nefa hilamina tsara ny fiainan’izay miantehitra amin’i Jehovah.', 'mampisy ady ny olona tsy mety afa-po, nefa hilamina tsara ny fiainan’izay miantehitra amin’i jehovah.'),
  ('6ab25b50dbacdbce6d33c9d8', '2026-09-22T10:41:20.587Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:20.587Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 28, 21, 'Tsy tsara ny miangatra, Nefa mety hanaonao foana ny olona iray mba hahazoana sombi-mofo.', 'tsy tsara ny miangatra, nefa mety hanaonao foana ny olona iray mba hahazoana sombi-mofo.'),
  ('6ab25b50dbacdbce6d33c9db', '2026-09-22T10:41:20.587Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:20.587Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 28, 24, 'Izay mandroba ny rainy sy ny reniny nefa miteny hoe: “Tsy maninona izany!”, Dia naman’ny mpangalatra ihany.', 'izay mandroba ny rainy sy ny reniny nefa miteny hoe: “tsy maninona izany!”, dia naman’ny mpangalatra ihany.'),
  ('6ab25b50dbacdbce6d33c9d9', '2026-09-22T10:41:20.587Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:20.587Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 28, 22, 'Maimay te hanan-karena ny olona mitsiriritra, Nefa tsy fantany fa hahantra izy amin’ny farany.', 'maimay te hanan-karena ny olona mitsiriritra, nefa tsy fantany fa hahantra izy amin’ny farany.'),
  ('6ab25b50dbacdbce6d33c9df', '2026-09-22T10:41:20.587Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:20.587Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 28, 28, 'Miafina ny olona rehefa mahazo fahefana ny ratsy fanahy, Fa mihabetsaka kosa ny olo-marina rehefa ringana ireny.', 'miafina ny olona rehefa mahazo fahefana ny ratsy fanahy, fa mihabetsaka kosa ny olo-marina rehefa ringana ireny.'),
  ('6ab25b50dbacdbce6d33c9d5', '2026-09-22T10:41:20.587Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:20.587Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 28, 18, 'Hovonjena izay mandeha tsy misy tsiny, Fa ho lavo tampoka kosa izay fetsifetsy.', 'hovonjena izay mandeha tsy misy tsiny, fa ho lavo tampoka kosa izay fetsifetsy.'),
  ('6ab25b50dbacdbce6d33c9d7', '2026-09-22T10:41:20.587Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:20.587Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 28, 20, 'Hahazo fitahiana be dia be ny olona mendri-pitokisana, Fa hanan-tsiny kosa izay te hanan-karena haingana.', 'hahazo fitahiana be dia be ny olona mendri-pitokisana, fa hanan-tsiny kosa izay te hanan-karena haingana.'),
  ('6ab25b50dbacdbce6d33c9d2', '2026-09-22T10:41:20.587Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:20.587Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 28, 15, 'Ny mpitondra ratsy fanahy, izay manjaka amin’ny vahoaka tsy misy mpiaro, Dia hoatran’ny liona mierona sy orsa mihazakazaka hanafika.', 'ny mpitondra ratsy fanahy, izay manjaka amin’ny vahoaka tsy misy mpiaro, dia hoatran’ny liona mierona sy orsa mihazakazaka hanafika.'),
  ('6ab25b50dbacdbce6d33c9de', '2026-09-22T10:41:20.587Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:20.587Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 28, 27, 'Tsy hisy hahory an’izay manome ho an’ny mahantra, Fa ho voaozona imbetsaka kosa izay manakimpy ny masony tsy hijery an’ireny.', 'tsy hisy hahory an’izay manome ho an’ny mahantra, fa ho voaozona imbetsaka kosa izay manakimpy ny masony tsy hijery an’ireny.'),
  ('6ab25b50dbacdbce6d33c9da', '2026-09-22T10:41:20.587Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:20.587Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 28, 23, 'Izay mananatra no ho tian’ny olona kokoa Noho izay mandokadoka.', 'izay mananatra no ho tian’ny olona kokoa noho izay mandokadoka.'),
  ('6ab25b50dbacdbce6d33c9d6', '2026-09-22T10:41:20.587Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:20.587Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 28, 19, 'Hahazo sakafo be dia be izay miasa ny taniny, Fa hahantra fadiranovana kosa izay mikatsaka zava-poana.', 'hahazo sakafo be dia be izay miasa ny taniny, fa hahantra fadiranovana kosa izay mikatsaka zava-poana.'),
  ('6ab25b535b67cb11b72f1819', '2026-09-22T10:41:23.324Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:23.324Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 29, 7, 'Manaja ny zon’ny mahantra ny olo-marina, Fa tsy miraharaha an’izany kosa ny ratsy fanahy.', 'manaja ny zon’ny mahantra ny olo-marina, fa tsy miraharaha an’izany kosa ny ratsy fanahy.'),
  ('6ab25b535b67cb11b72f1816', '2026-09-22T10:41:23.324Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:23.324Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 29, 4, 'Lasa milamina ny tany rehefa manao ny rariny ny mpanjaka, Fa mandrava azy kosa ny olona tia kolikoly.', 'lasa milamina ny tany rehefa manao ny rariny ny mpanjaka, fa mandrava azy kosa ny olona tia kolikoly.'),
  ('6ab25b535b67cb11b72f181e', '2026-09-22T10:41:23.324Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:23.324Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 29, 12, 'Raha mihaino lainga ny mpitondra, Dia ho ratsy fanahy daholo ny mpanompony.', 'raha mihaino lainga ny mpitondra, dia ho ratsy fanahy daholo ny mpanompony.'),
  ('6ab25b535b67cb11b72f1814', '2026-09-22T10:41:23.324Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:23.324Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 29, 2, 'Faly ny vahoaka rehefa be dia be ny olo-marina, Fa mitaraina kosa izy ireo rehefa ny ratsy fanahy no mitondra.', 'faly ny vahoaka rehefa be dia be ny olo-marina, fa mitaraina kosa izy ireo rehefa ny ratsy fanahy no mitondra.'),
  ('6ab25b535b67cb11b72f1822', '2026-09-22T10:41:23.324Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:23.324Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 29, 16, 'Mitombo ny fandikan-dalàna rehefa mihabetsaka ny ratsy fanahy, Nefa ho hitan’ny olo-marina fa ratsy ny hiafaran’ireny.', 'mitombo ny fandikan-dalàna rehefa mihabetsaka ny ratsy fanahy, nefa ho hitan’ny olo-marina fa ratsy ny hiafaran’ireny.'),
  ('6ab25b535b67cb11b72f181a', '2026-09-22T10:41:23.324Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:23.324Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 29, 8, 'Mampikorontana ny iray tanàna ny mpirehareha, Fa mampitony hatezerana kosa ny hendry.', 'mampikorontana ny iray tanàna ny mpirehareha, fa mampitony hatezerana kosa ny hendry.'),
  ('6ab25b535b67cb11b72f1829', '2026-09-22T10:41:23.324Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:23.324Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 29, 23, 'Hietry izay manambony tena, Fa hahazo voninahitra kosa izay manetry tena.', 'hietry izay manambony tena, fa hahazo voninahitra kosa izay manetry tena.'),
  ('6ab25b535b67cb11b72f181b', '2026-09-22T10:41:23.324Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:23.324Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 29, 9, 'Raha miady amin’ny adala eny amin’ny fitsarana ny hendry, Dia tsy hisy zava-banona satria hitabataba sy hanesoeso fotsiny ilay adala.', 'raha miady amin’ny adala eny amin’ny fitsarana ny hendry, dia tsy hisy zava-banona satria hitabataba sy hanesoeso fotsiny ilay adala.'),
  ('6ab25b535b67cb11b72f182c', '2026-09-22T10:41:23.324Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:23.324Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 29, 26, 'Maro no mangataka hiresaka amin’ny mpitondra, Nefa amin’i Jehovah ihany ny olona no mahazo rariny.', 'maro no mangataka hiresaka amin’ny mpitondra, nefa amin’i jehovah ihany ny olona no mahazo rariny.'),
  ('6ab25b535b67cb11b72f1826', '2026-09-22T10:41:23.324Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:23.324Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 29, 20, 'Mahita olona faingam-bava ve ianao? Ny tsisy saina aza mbola misy antenaina noho izy.', 'mahita olona faingam-bava ve ianao? ny tsisy saina aza mbola misy antenaina noho izy.'),
  ('6ab25b535b67cb11b72f1813', '2026-09-22T10:41:23.324Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:23.324Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 29, 1, 'Izay efa nanarina imbetsaka nefa mbola mafy loha ihany, Dia ho torotoro tampoka ka tsy ho sitrana intsony.', 'izay efa nanarina imbetsaka nefa mbola mafy loha ihany, dia ho torotoro tampoka ka tsy ho sitrana intsony.'),
  ('6ab25b535b67cb11b72f182d', '2026-09-22T10:41:23.324Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:23.324Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 29, 27, 'Izay manao ny tsy rariny dia maharikoriko ny olo-marina, Fa ny olo-marina koa maharikoriko ny ratsy fanahy.', 'izay manao ny tsy rariny dia maharikoriko ny olo-marina, fa ny olo-marina koa maharikoriko ny ratsy fanahy.'),
  ('6ab25b535b67cb11b72f181d', '2026-09-22T10:41:23.324Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:23.324Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 29, 11, 'Avoakan’ny adala daholo ny hatezerany, Fa mahatsindry fo kosa ny hendry.', 'avoakan’ny adala daholo ny hatezerany, fa mahatsindry fo kosa ny hendry.'),
  ('6ab25b535b67cb11b72f1825', '2026-09-22T10:41:23.324Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:23.324Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 29, 19, 'Tsy hanaiky hahitsy ny mpanompo raha tenenina fotsiny, Satria na azony tsara aza izany, dia tsy ankatoaviny.', 'tsy hanaiky hahitsy ny mpanompo raha tenenina fotsiny, satria na azony tsara aza izany, dia tsy ankatoaviny.'),
  ('6ab25b535b67cb11b72f1824', '2026-09-22T10:41:23.324Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:23.324Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 29, 18, 'Samy manao izay tiany fotsiny ny olona rehefa tsy misy fahitana, Fa sambatra kosa izay manaraka ny lalàna.', 'samy manao izay tiany fotsiny ny olona rehefa tsy misy fahitana, fa sambatra kosa izay manaraka ny lalàna.'),
  ('6ab25b535b67cb11b72f1820', '2026-09-22T10:41:23.324Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:23.324Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 29, 14, 'Raha mitsara ny mahantra ara-drariny ny mpanjaka, Dia ho mafy orina foana ny seza fiandrianany.', 'raha mitsara ny mahantra ara-drariny ny mpanjaka, dia ho mafy orina foana ny seza fiandrianany.'),
  ('6ab25b535b67cb11b72f182b', '2026-09-22T10:41:23.324Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:23.324Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 29, 25, 'Fandrika ny tahotra olona, Fa izay matoky an’i Jehovah kosa no ho voaro.', 'fandrika ny tahotra olona, fa izay matoky an’i jehovah kosa no ho voaro.'),
  ('6ab25b535b67cb11b72f1823', '2026-09-22T10:41:23.324Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:23.324Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 29, 17, 'Faizo ny zanakao, dia hampilamin-tsaina anao izy, Sady tena hahafinaritra anao.', 'faizo ny zanakao, dia hampilamin-tsaina anao izy, sady tena hahafinaritra anao.'),
  ('6ab25b535b67cb11b72f181c', '2026-09-22T10:41:23.324Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:23.324Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 29, 10, 'Mankahala an’izay tsy manan-tsiny ny mpandatsa-dra, Ka te hamono an’ireo olo-marina.', 'mankahala an’izay tsy manan-tsiny ny mpandatsa-dra, ka te hamono an’ireo olo-marina.'),
  ('6ab25b535b67cb11b72f1818', '2026-09-22T10:41:23.324Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:23.324Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 29, 6, 'Mamandrika ny tenany ny olon-dratsy rehefa mandika lalàna, Fa mifaly sy mihoby kosa ny olo-marina.', 'mamandrika ny tenany ny olon-dratsy rehefa mandika lalàna, fa mifaly sy mihoby kosa ny olo-marina.'),
  ('6ab25b535b67cb11b72f1815', '2026-09-22T10:41:23.324Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:23.324Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 29, 3, 'Mampifaly ny rainy ny olona tia fahendrena, Fa mandanilany ny harenany kosa izay miaraka amin’ny mpivaro-tena.', 'mampifaly ny rainy ny olona tia fahendrena, fa mandanilany ny harenany kosa izay miaraka amin’ny mpivaro-tena.'),
  ('6ab25b535b67cb11b72f182a', '2026-09-22T10:41:23.324Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:23.324Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 29, 24, 'Mankahala ny tenany izay miray tsikombakomba amin’ny mpangalatra. Mety hasaina hijoro ho vavolombelona izy, saingy tsy miteny na inona na inona.', 'mankahala ny tenany izay miray tsikombakomba amin’ny mpangalatra. mety hasaina hijoro ho vavolombelona izy, saingy tsy miteny na inona na inona.'),
  ('6ab25b535b67cb11b72f1827', '2026-09-22T10:41:23.324Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:23.324Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 29, 21, 'Raha nampihantaina hatramin’ny mbola kely ny mpanompo, Dia tsy hahay hankasitraka izy rehefa any aoriana any.', 'raha nampihantaina hatramin’ny mbola kely ny mpanompo, dia tsy hahay hankasitraka izy rehefa any aoriana any.'),
  ('6ab25b535b67cb11b72f1817', '2026-09-22T10:41:23.324Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:23.324Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 29, 5, 'Izay mandokadoka ny namany, Dia mamelatra harato hamandrihana ny tongotr’ilay namany.', 'izay mandokadoka ny namany, dia mamelatra harato hamandrihana ny tongotr’ilay namany.'),
  ('6ab25b535b67cb11b72f1828', '2026-09-22T10:41:23.324Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:23.324Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 29, 22, 'Mampisy ady izay mora tezitra, Ary manao fahadisoana be dia be izay mora misafoaka.', 'mampisy ady izay mora tezitra, ary manao fahadisoana be dia be izay mora misafoaka.'),
  ('6ab25b535b67cb11b72f1821', '2026-09-22T10:41:23.324Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:23.324Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 29, 15, 'Ny tsorakazo sy ny anatra no mampahahendry, Fa ny zaza avela hanaram-po kosa mahamenatra ny reniny.', 'ny tsorakazo sy ny anatra no mampahahendry, fa ny zaza avela hanaram-po kosa mahamenatra ny reniny.'),
  ('6ab25b535b67cb11b72f181f', '2026-09-22T10:41:23.324Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:23.324Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 29, 13, 'Izao no mampitovy ny mahantra sy ny mpampijaly: I Jehovah no manome hazavana ho an’ny mason’izy ireo.', 'izao no mampitovy ny mahantra sy ny mpampijaly: i jehovah no manome hazavana ho an’ny mason’izy ireo.'),
  ('6ab25b54a6894fe08fd1a251', '2026-09-22T10:41:24.477Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:24.477Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 30, 33, 'Fa ahazoana dibera ny ronono rehefa ahontsankontsana, Ary mandeha ra ny orona rehefa potserina, Dia hoatr’izany koa fa raikitra ny ady raha atao izay hampahatezitra ny olona.', 'fa ahazoana dibera ny ronono rehefa ahontsankontsana, ary mandeha ra ny orona rehefa potserina, dia hoatr’izany koa fa raikitra ny ady raha atao izay hampahatezitra ny olona.'),
  ('6ab25b54a6894fe08fd1a242', '2026-09-22T10:41:24.477Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:24.477Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 30, 18, 'Ireto misy zavatra telo tsy takatry ny saiko, Eny, zavatra efatra tsy azoko:', 'ireto misy zavatra telo tsy takatry ny saiko, eny, zavatra efatra tsy azoko:'),
  ('6ab25b54a6894fe08fd1a23e', '2026-09-22T10:41:24.477Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:24.477Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 30, 14, 'Misy taranaka manana nify hoatran’ny sabatra, Sy vazana toy ny antsin-kena. Arapany ny madinika eto an-tany, Sy ny mahantra eo amin’ny olombelona.', 'misy taranaka manana nify hoatran’ny sabatra, sy vazana toy ny antsin-kena. arapany ny madinika eto an-tany, sy ny mahantra eo amin’ny olombelona.'),
  ('6ab25b54a6894fe08fd1a250', '2026-09-22T10:41:24.477Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:24.477Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 30, 32, 'Raha nanao hadalana ianao satria nanambony tena, Na nitetika ny hanao an’izany, Dia tampeno amin’ny tananao ny vavanao.', 'raha nanao hadalana ianao satria nanambony tena, na nitetika ny hanao an’izany, dia tampeno amin’ny tananao ny vavanao.'),
  ('6ab25b54a6894fe08fd1a246', '2026-09-22T10:41:24.477Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:24.477Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 30, 22, 'Rehefa ny mpanompo no lasa mpanjaka, Ary ny adala no lasa voky be,', 'rehefa ny mpanompo no lasa mpanjaka, ary ny adala no lasa voky be,'),
  ('6ab25b54a6894fe08fd1a244', '2026-09-22T10:41:24.477Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:24.477Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 30, 20, 'Izao no fanaon’ny vehivavy mpanitsakitsa-bady: Mihinana izy dia mamafa vava, Ary miteny izy avy eo hoe: “Tsy nanao ratsy mihitsy aho!”', 'izao no fanaon’ny vehivavy mpanitsakitsa-bady: mihinana izy dia mamafa vava, ary miteny izy avy eo hoe: “tsy nanao ratsy mihitsy aho!”'),
  ('6ab25b54a6894fe08fd1a23f', '2026-09-22T10:41:24.477Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:24.477Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 30, 15, 'Ny dinta dia manan-janakavavy roa, izay miantsoantso hoe: “Omeo! Omeo!” Ireto misy zavatra telo tsy mety voky, Eny, zavatra efatra tsy miteny mihitsy hoe: “Aoka izay!”:', 'ny dinta dia manan-janakavavy roa, izay miantsoantso hoe: “omeo! omeo!” ireto misy zavatra telo tsy mety voky, eny, zavatra efatra tsy miteny mihitsy hoe: “aoka izay!”:'),
  ('6ab25b54a6894fe08fd1a23a', '2026-09-22T10:41:24.477Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:24.477Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 30, 10, 'Aza endrikendrehina any amin’ny tompony ny mpanompo, Sao izy hanozona anao, ka ho hita fa meloka ianao.', 'aza endrikendrehina any amin’ny tompony ny mpanompo, sao izy hanozona anao, ka ho hita fa meloka ianao.'),
  ('6ab25b54a6894fe08fd1a239', '2026-09-22T10:41:24.477Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:24.477Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 30, 9, 'Sao ho voky aho ka handa anao, dia hiteny hoe: “Fa iza koa izay Jehovah?”, Na sao ho lasa mahantra aho ka hangalatra, dia hanala baraka ny anaran’Andriamanitro.', 'sao ho voky aho ka handa anao, dia hiteny hoe: “fa iza koa izay jehovah?”, na sao ho lasa mahantra aho ka hangalatra, dia hanala baraka ny anaran’andriamanitro.'),
  ('6ab25b54a6894fe08fd1a233', '2026-09-22T10:41:24.477Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:24.477Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 30, 3, 'Tsy mba nianatra ny atao hoe fahendrena aho, Ary tsy manana ny fahalalana ananan’Ilay Masina Indrindra.', 'tsy mba nianatra ny atao hoe fahendrena aho, ary tsy manana ny fahalalana ananan’ilay masina indrindra.'),
  ('6ab25b54a6894fe08fd1a249', '2026-09-22T10:41:24.477Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:24.477Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 30, 25, 'Ny vitsika dia zavaboary tsy matanjaka, Nefa manangona ny sakafony rehefa fahavaratra.', 'ny vitsika dia zavaboary tsy matanjaka, nefa manangona ny sakafony rehefa fahavaratra.'),
  ('6ab25b54a6894fe08fd1a24a', '2026-09-22T10:41:24.477Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:24.477Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 30, 26, 'Ny bitrom-bato dia zavaboary tsy mahery, Nefa manao ny tranony eny ambony vatolampy.', 'ny bitrom-bato dia zavaboary tsy mahery, nefa manao ny tranony eny ambony vatolampy.'),
  ('6ab25b54a6894fe08fd1a241', '2026-09-22T10:41:24.477Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:24.477Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 30, 17, 'Ny mason’izay manesoeso ray sy tsy mankatò reny Dia hotsaingohin’ny goaika mpankeny amin’ny lohasaha, Sady ho lanin’ny zana-boromahery.', 'ny mason’izay manesoeso ray sy tsy mankatò reny dia hotsaingohin’ny goaika mpankeny amin’ny lohasaha, sady ho lanin’ny zana-boromahery.'),
  ('6ab25b54a6894fe08fd1a237', '2026-09-22T10:41:24.477Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:24.477Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 30, 7, 'Andriamanitra ô, zavatra roa no angatahiko aminao, Ka aza lavina dieny mbola tsy maty aho:', 'andriamanitra ô, zavatra roa no angatahiko aminao, ka aza lavina dieny mbola tsy maty aho:'),
  ('6ab25b54a6894fe08fd1a235', '2026-09-22T10:41:24.477Z', '2026-09-22T10:41:24.477Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Ohabolana', 20, 30, 5, 'Madio toy ny metaly voadio daholo ny teny nolazain’Andriamanitra. Ampingan’izay mialoka aminy Izy.', 'madio toy ny metaly voadio daholo ny teny nolazain’andriamanitra. ampingan’izay mialoka aminy izy.'),
