  ('6ab25c17786b8026b5fb2c84', '2026-09-22T10:44:39.180Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:39.180Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 6, 17, 'Fa ianao kosa rehefa mifady hanina, dia hosory menaka ny lohanao ary sasao ny tarehinao,', 'fa ianao kosa rehefa mifady hanina, dia hosory menaka ny lohanao ary sasao ny tarehinao,'),
  ('6ab25c17786b8026b5fb2c87', '2026-09-22T10:44:39.180Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:39.180Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 6, 20, 'Manangòna kosa harena ho anareo any an-danitra, izay tsy misy bibikely na harafesina manimba, sady tsy misy mpangalatra mamaky trano na mangalatra.', 'manangòna kosa harena ho anareo any an-danitra, izay tsy misy bibikely na harafesina manimba, sady tsy misy mpangalatra mamaky trano na mangalatra.'),
  ('6ab25c17786b8026b5fb2c86', '2026-09-22T10:44:39.180Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:39.180Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 6, 19, '“Aza manangona harena ho anareo intsony etỳ an-tany, izay misy bibikely sy harafesina manimba, sady misy mpangalatra mamaky trano sy mangalatra.', '“aza manangona harena ho anareo intsony etỳ an-tany, izay misy bibikely sy harafesina manimba, sady misy mpangalatra mamaky trano sy mangalatra.'),
  ('6ab25c17786b8026b5fb2c82', '2026-09-22T10:44:39.180Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:39.180Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 6, 15, 'Fa raha tsy mamela ny heloky ny olona kosa ianareo, dia tsy hamela ny helokareo koa ny Rainareo.', 'fa raha tsy mamela ny heloky ny olona kosa ianareo, dia tsy hamela ny helokareo koa ny rainareo.'),
  ('6ab25c17786b8026b5fb2c7f', '2026-09-22T10:44:39.180Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:39.180Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 6, 12, 'ary mamelà ny helokay, tahaka ny namelanay izay meloka taminay.', 'ary mamelà ny helokay, tahaka ny namelanay izay meloka taminay.'),
  ('6ab25c17786b8026b5fb2c8e', '2026-09-22T10:44:39.180Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:39.180Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 6, 27, 'Iza aminareo no mahay manalava ny androm-piainany, na dia kely aza, rehefa manahy?', 'iza aminareo no mahay manalava ny androm-piainany, na dia kely aza, rehefa manahy?'),
  ('6ab25c17786b8026b5fb2c74', '2026-09-22T10:44:39.180Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:39.180Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 6, 1, '“Tandremo sao hoe ny mba ho hitan’ny olona fotsiny no antony anaovanareo ny marina eo imasony. Raha izany mantsy, dia tsy hahazo valisoa avy amin’ilay Rainareo any an-danitra ianareo.', '“tandremo sao hoe ny mba ho hitan’ny olona fotsiny no antony anaovanareo ny marina eo imasony. raha izany mantsy, dia tsy hahazo valisoa avy amin’ilay rainareo any an-danitra ianareo.'),
  ('6ab25c18ee65eaa44602e5a1', '2026-09-22T10:44:40.396Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:40.396Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 8, 24, 'Ary lasa nisy rivo-mahery teo amin’ilay ranomasina, ka saron’ny onja tsikelikely ilay sambokely. Natory anefa i Jesosy tamin’izay.', 'ary lasa nisy rivo-mahery teo amin’ilay ranomasina, ka saron’ny onja tsikelikely ilay sambokely. natory anefa i jesosy tamin’izay.'),
  ('6ab25c18ee65eaa44602e59e', '2026-09-22T10:44:40.396Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:40.396Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 8, 21, 'Nisy mpianatra hafa koa niteny taminy hoe: “Tompo ô, avelao aho aloha handeha handevina ny dadako.”', 'nisy mpianatra hafa koa niteny taminy hoe: “tompo ô, avelao aho aloha handeha handevina ny dadako.”'),
  ('6ab25c18ee65eaa44602e597', '2026-09-22T10:44:40.396Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:40.396Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 8, 14, 'Rehefa niditra tao an-tranon’i Petera i Jesosy, dia hitany nandamaka teo am-pandriana ny rafozambavin’i Petera fa nanavy.', 'rehefa niditra tao an-tranon’i petera i jesosy, dia hitany nandamaka teo am-pandriana ny rafozambavin’i petera fa nanavy.'),
  ('6ab25c18ee65eaa44602e58c', '2026-09-22T10:44:40.396Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:40.396Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 8, 3, 'Koa nanatsotra ny tanany i Jesosy ka nikasika azy, sady niteny hoe: “Tiako izany ka! Madiova ianao.” Tonga dia sitrana ny habokany ka nadio izy.', 'koa nanatsotra ny tanany i jesosy ka nikasika azy, sady niteny hoe: “tiako izany ka! madiova ianao.” tonga dia sitrana ny habokany ka nadio izy.'),
  ('6ab25c18ee65eaa44602e5ab', '2026-09-22T10:44:40.396Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:40.396Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 8, 34, 'Dia nivoaka hitsena an’i Jesosy daholo ny iray tanàna. Rehefa hitan’izy ireo i Jesosy, dia niangaviany hiala tao amin’ilay faritra.', 'dia nivoaka hitsena an’i jesosy daholo ny iray tanàna. rehefa hitan’izy ireo i jesosy, dia niangaviany hiala tao amin’ilay faritra.'),
  ('6ab25c18ee65eaa44602e5a0', '2026-09-22T10:44:40.396Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:40.396Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 8, 23, 'Dia niakatra tao an-tsambokely i Jesosy, ary nanaraka azy ny mpianany.', 'dia niakatra tao an-tsambokely i jesosy, ary nanaraka azy ny mpianany.'),
  ('6ab25c18ee65eaa44602e592', '2026-09-22T10:44:40.396Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:40.396Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 8, 9, 'Izaho koa mantsy eo ambany fahefan’olona, sady manana miaramila eo ambany fahefako. Dia raha miteny amin’ny miaramila anankiray aho hoe: ‘Mandehana!’, dia lasa izy, ary amin’ny anankiray kosa hoe: ‘Avia!’, dia tonga izy, ary amin’ny mpanompoko hoe: ‘Ataovy ity!’, dia ataony izany.”', 'izaho koa mantsy eo ambany fahefan’olona, sady manana miaramila eo ambany fahefako. dia raha miteny amin’ny miaramila anankiray aho hoe: ‘mandehana!’, dia lasa izy, ary amin’ny anankiray kosa hoe: ‘avia!’, dia tonga izy, ary amin’ny mpanompoko hoe: ‘ataovy ity!’, dia ataony izany.”'),
  ('6ab25c18ee65eaa44602e590', '2026-09-22T10:44:40.396Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:40.396Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 8, 7, 'Dia hoy izy taminy: “Hositraniko izy rehefa tonga any aho.”', 'dia hoy izy taminy: “hositraniko izy rehefa tonga any aho.”'),
  ('6ab25c18ee65eaa44602e5a9', '2026-09-22T10:44:40.396Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:40.396Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 8, 32, 'Ary hoy izy tamin’ireo: “Mandehana!” Nivoaka àry izy ireo ka lasa niditra tao amin’ireo kisoa ireo. Dia ireny fa nirifatra nankeny amin’ny hantsana ilay andiany manontolo, dia nivarina tany an-dranomasina ka maty an-drano.', 'ary hoy izy tamin’ireo: “mandehana!” nivoaka àry izy ireo ka lasa niditra tao amin’ireo kisoa ireo. dia ireny fa nirifatra nankeny amin’ny hantsana ilay andiany manontolo, dia nivarina tany an-dranomasina ka maty an-drano.'),
  ('6ab25c18ee65eaa44602e5a8', '2026-09-22T10:44:40.396Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:40.396Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 8, 31, 'Niangavy azy àry ireo demonia hoe: “Raha avoakanao izahay, dia mba alefaso ho ao amin’irỳ andian-kisoa irỳ.”', 'niangavy azy àry ireo demonia hoe: “raha avoakanao izahay, dia mba alefaso ho ao amin’irỳ andian-kisoa irỳ.”'),
  ('6ab25c18ee65eaa44602e5a5', '2026-09-22T10:44:40.396Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:40.396Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 8, 28, 'Rehefa tonga teny ampita tao amin’ny faritra nisy ny Gadareanina izy, dia nifanena tamin’ny lehilahy roa nisy demonia. Nivoaka avy teny am-pasana izy roa lahy ireo, ary faran’izay nahery setra ka tsy nisy sahy nandalo tamin’izany lalana izany.', 'rehefa tonga teny ampita tao amin’ny faritra nisy ny gadareanina izy, dia nifanena tamin’ny lehilahy roa nisy demonia. nivoaka avy teny am-pasana izy roa lahy ireo, ary faran’izay nahery setra ka tsy nisy sahy nandalo tamin’izany lalana izany.'),
  ('6ab25c18ee65eaa44602e596', '2026-09-22T10:44:40.396Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:40.396Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 8, 13, 'Dia hoy i Jesosy tamin’ilay manamboninahitra: “Mandehana àry! Enga anie ho tanteraka izay nangatahinao, satria manam-pinoana ianao!” Dia sitrana tamin’izay ora izay ilay mpanompo.', 'dia hoy i jesosy tamin’ilay manamboninahitra: “mandehana àry! enga anie ho tanteraka izay nangatahinao, satria manam-pinoana ianao!” dia sitrana tamin’izay ora izay ilay mpanompo.'),
  ('6ab25c18ee65eaa44602e5a4', '2026-09-22T10:44:40.396Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:40.396Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 8, 27, 'Koa gaga izy ireo ka niteny hoe: “Iza marina àry izy ity e? Fa na ny rivotra sy ny ranomasina aza mankatò azy.”', 'koa gaga izy ireo ka niteny hoe: “iza marina àry izy ity e? fa na ny rivotra sy ny ranomasina aza mankatò azy.”'),
  ('6ab25c18ee65eaa44602e58f', '2026-09-22T10:44:40.396Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:40.396Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 8, 6, 'hoe: “Azafady, tompoko! Mandamaka ao an-trano ao ny mpanompoko fa malemy. Mijaly be mihitsy izy.”', 'hoe: “azafady, tompoko! mandamaka ao an-trano ao ny mpanompoko fa malemy. mijaly be mihitsy izy.”'),
  ('6ab25c18ee65eaa44602e5a7', '2026-09-22T10:44:40.396Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:40.396Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 8, 30, 'Ary nisy kisoa be dia be nandrasana, teny lavidavitra teny.', 'ary nisy kisoa be dia be nandrasana, teny lavidavitra teny.'),
  ('6ab25c18ee65eaa44602e59a', '2026-09-22T10:44:40.396Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:40.396Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 8, 17, 'Tanteraka àry izay nasaina nolazain’i Isaia mpaminany hoe: “Naka ny aretinay izy ary nitondra ny fanaintainanay.”', 'tanteraka àry izay nasaina nolazain’i isaia mpaminany hoe: “naka ny aretinay izy ary nitondra ny fanaintainanay.”'),
  ('6ab25c18ee65eaa44602e599', '2026-09-22T10:44:40.396Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:40.396Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 8, 16, 'Rehefa hariva ny andro, dia be dia be ny olona nisy demonia nentina teo amin’i Jesosy. Niteny fotsiny izy dia nivoaka ny fanahy ratsy. Nositraniny daholo koa izay rehetra narary.', 'rehefa hariva ny andro, dia be dia be ny olona nisy demonia nentina teo amin’i jesosy. niteny fotsiny izy dia nivoaka ny fanahy ratsy. nositraniny daholo koa izay rehetra narary.'),
  ('6ab25c18ee65eaa44602e5a6', '2026-09-22T10:44:40.396Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:40.396Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 8, 29, 'Dia niantsoantso mafy izy ireo hoe: “Fa inona koa no anelingelenanao anay atỳ, ry Zanak’Andriamanitra? Tonga atỳ ve ianao mba hampijaly anay alohan’ny fotoana?”', 'dia niantsoantso mafy izy ireo hoe: “fa inona koa no anelingelenanao anay atỳ, ry zanak’andriamanitra? tonga atỳ ve ianao mba hampijaly anay alohan’ny fotoana?”'),
  ('6ab25c18ee65eaa44602e595', '2026-09-22T10:44:40.396Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:40.396Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 8, 12, 'Fa ny zanak’ilay Fanjakana kosa hatsipy any amin’ny haizina any ivelany. Any izy ireo no hitomany sy hihidy vazana.”', 'fa ny zanak’ilay fanjakana kosa hatsipy any amin’ny haizina any ivelany. any izy ireo no hitomany sy hihidy vazana.”'),
  ('6ab25c18ee65eaa44602e58a', '2026-09-22T10:44:40.396Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:40.396Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 8, 1, 'Rehefa nidina avy teo amin’ilay tendrombohitra izy, dia nisy vahoaka be nanaraka azy.', 'rehefa nidina avy teo amin’ilay tendrombohitra izy, dia nisy vahoaka be nanaraka azy.'),
  ('6ab25c18ee65eaa44602e593', '2026-09-22T10:44:40.396Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:40.396Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 8, 10, 'Ary gaga i Jesosy rehefa naheno an’izany, ka niteny tamin’ireo olona nanaraka azy hoe: “Lazaiko marina aminareo fa mbola tsy nahita olona nanana finoana lehibe hoatr’izany aho teo amin’ny Israely.', 'ary gaga i jesosy rehefa naheno an’izany, ka niteny tamin’ireo olona nanaraka azy hoe: “lazaiko marina aminareo fa mbola tsy nahita olona nanana finoana lehibe hoatr’izany aho teo amin’ny israely.'),
  ('6ab25c18ee65eaa44602e598', '2026-09-22T10:44:40.396Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:40.396Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 8, 15, 'Nokasihin’i Jesosy àry ny tanan’ilay ramatoa, dia afaka ny fanaviany. Dia niarina izy ka nikarakara sakafo ho an’i Jesosy.', 'nokasihin’i jesosy àry ny tanan’ilay ramatoa, dia afaka ny fanaviany. dia niarina izy ka nikarakara sakafo ho an’i jesosy.'),
  ('6ab25c18ee65eaa44602e591', '2026-09-22T10:44:40.396Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:40.396Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 8, 8, 'Hoy anefa ilay manamboninahitra: “Tsy mendrika ny handray anao ao an-tranoko aho, tompoko, fa mitenena fotsiny dia ho sitrana ny mpanompoko.', 'hoy anefa ilay manamboninahitra: “tsy mendrika ny handray anao ao an-tranoko aho, tompoko, fa mitenena fotsiny dia ho sitrana ny mpanompoko.'),
