  ('6ab25c189b020126accd2c69', '2026-09-22T10:44:40.878Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:40.878Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 9, 37, 'Dia hoy izy tamin’ny mpianany: “Tena be ny vokatra fa ny mpiasa no vitsy.', 'dia hoy izy tamin’ny mpianany: “tena be ny vokatra fa ny mpiasa no vitsy.'),
  ('6ab25c189b020126accd2c63', '2026-09-22T10:44:40.878Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:40.878Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 9, 31, 'Notantarain’izy ireo eran’ilay faritra anefa ny momba azy, rehefa tafavoaka an’ilay trano izy ireo.', 'notantarain’izy ireo eran’ilay faritra anefa ny momba azy, rehefa tafavoaka an’ilay trano izy ireo.'),
  ('6ab25c189b020126accd2c5c', '2026-09-22T10:44:40.878Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:40.878Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 9, 24, 'ka hoy izy: “Mandehana ianareo mivoaka! Tsy maty io ankizivavy io fa matory.” Dia nihomehezan’ireo izy.', 'ka hoy izy: “mandehana ianareo mivoaka! tsy maty io ankizivavy io fa matory.” dia nihomehezan’ireo izy.'),
  ('6ab25c189b020126accd2c59', '2026-09-22T10:44:40.878Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:40.878Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 9, 21, 'Fa hoy izy anakampo: “Raha mikasika ny akanjony ivelany fotsiny aho, dia ho sitrana.”', 'fa hoy izy anakampo: “raha mikasika ny akanjony ivelany fotsiny aho, dia ho sitrana.”'),
  ('6ab25c189b020126accd2c4e', '2026-09-22T10:44:40.878Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:40.878Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 9, 10, 'Taorian’izay, rehefa nisakafo tao an-trano izy, dia nisy mpamory hetra sy mpanota be dia be tonga nisakafo niaraka tamin’i Jesosy sy ny mpianany.', 'taorian’izay, rehefa nisakafo tao an-trano izy, dia nisy mpamory hetra sy mpanota be dia be tonga nisakafo niaraka tamin’i jesosy sy ny mpianany.'),
  ('6ab25c189b020126accd2c4b', '2026-09-22T10:44:40.878Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:40.878Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 9, 7, 'Dia nitsangana ilay lehilahy ka lasa nody.', 'dia nitsangana ilay lehilahy ka lasa nody.'),
  ('6ab25c189b020126accd2c52', '2026-09-22T10:44:40.878Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:40.878Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 9, 14, 'Nankeo aminy ny mpianatr’i Jaona avy eo, dia nanontany hoe: “Fa maninona izahay sy ny Fariseo no mifady hanina matetika, nefa ny mpianatrao tsy mba mifady?”', 'nankeo aminy ny mpianatr’i jaona avy eo, dia nanontany hoe: “fa maninona izahay sy ny fariseo no mifady hanina matetika, nefa ny mpianatrao tsy mba mifady?”'),
  ('6ab25c189b020126accd2c45', '2026-09-22T10:44:40.878Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:40.878Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 9, 1, 'Koa niakatra tao an-tsambokely izy ka nankeny ampita, dia nankao amin’ilay tanàna nipetrahany.', 'koa niakatra tao an-tsambokely izy ka nankeny ampita, dia nankao amin’ilay tanàna nipetrahany.'),
  ('6ab25c189b020126accd2c64', '2026-09-22T10:44:40.878Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:40.878Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 9, 32, 'Rehefa lasa izy ireo, dia iny fa nentin’ny olona ny lehilahy iray moana nisy demonia.', 'rehefa lasa izy ireo, dia iny fa nentin’ny olona ny lehilahy iray moana nisy demonia.'),
  ('6ab25c189b020126accd2c51', '2026-09-22T10:44:40.878Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:40.878Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 9, 13, 'Mandehana àry fantaro ny dikan’ny hoe: ‘Aleoko olona mamindra fo, toy izay olona manao sorona.’ Fa tsy tonga hiantso ny olo-marina aho, fa ny mpanota.”', 'mandehana àry fantaro ny dikan’ny hoe: ‘aleoko olona mamindra fo, toy izay olona manao sorona.’ fa tsy tonga hiantso ny olo-marina aho, fa ny mpanota.”'),
  ('6ab25c189b020126accd2c47', '2026-09-22T10:44:40.878Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:40.878Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 9, 3, 'Dia niteny anakampo ny mpanora-dalàna sasany hoe: “Manevateva an’Andriamanitra ilehity.”', 'dia niteny anakampo ny mpanora-dalàna sasany hoe: “manevateva an’andriamanitra ilehity.”'),
  ('6ab25c189b020126accd2c49', '2026-09-22T10:44:40.878Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:40.878Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 9, 5, 'Fa inona, ohatra, no mora kokoa: Ny miteny hoe: ‘Voavela ny helokao’, sa hoe: ‘Mitsangàna dia mandehana’?', 'fa inona, ohatra, no mora kokoa: ny miteny hoe: ‘voavela ny helokao’, sa hoe: ‘mitsangàna dia mandehana’?'),
  ('6ab25c189b020126accd2c6a', '2026-09-22T10:44:40.878Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:40.878Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 9, 38, 'Iangavio àry ny Tompon’ny vokatra haniraka mpiasa hijinja ny vokatra.”', 'iangavio àry ny tompon’ny vokatra haniraka mpiasa hijinja ny vokatra.”'),
  ('6ab25c189b020126accd2c65', '2026-09-22T10:44:40.878Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:40.878Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 9, 33, 'Dia niteny ilay moana rehefa navoaka ilay demonia. Gaga ny vahoaka ka niteny hoe: “Mbola tsy nisy hoatr’izao mihitsy teto amin’ny Israely.”', 'dia niteny ilay moana rehefa navoaka ilay demonia. gaga ny vahoaka ka niteny hoe: “mbola tsy nisy hoatr’izao mihitsy teto amin’ny israely.”'),
  ('6ab25c189b020126accd2c54', '2026-09-22T10:44:40.878Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:40.878Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 9, 16, 'Tsy misy olona manampina akanjo tonta amin’ny tapa-damba vaovao. Hisintona be mantsy ilay tapa-damba, dia handrirotra an’ilay akanjo ka vao mainka hitatra ny rovitra.', 'tsy misy olona manampina akanjo tonta amin’ny tapa-damba vaovao. hisintona be mantsy ilay tapa-damba, dia handrirotra an’ilay akanjo ka vao mainka hitatra ny rovitra.'),
  ('6ab25c189b020126accd2c53', '2026-09-22T10:44:40.878Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:40.878Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 9, 15, 'Dia hoy i Jesosy: “Tsy misy antony tokony hampalahelo ny naman’ny mpampakatra, raha mbola miaraka aminy eo ny mpampakatra. Indray andro any anefa, dia tsy hiaraka aminy intsony ny mpampakatra, ka amin’izay ry zareo vao hifady hanina.', 'dia hoy i jesosy: “tsy misy antony tokony hampalahelo ny naman’ny mpampakatra, raha mbola miaraka aminy eo ny mpampakatra. indray andro any anefa, dia tsy hiaraka aminy intsony ny mpampakatra, ka amin’izay ry zareo vao hifady hanina.'),
  ('6ab25c189b020126accd2c62', '2026-09-22T10:44:40.878Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:40.878Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 9, 30, 'Dia lasa nahita ny mason’izy ireo. Noraran’i Jesosy mafy anefa izy ireo hoe: “Tandremo sao misy mahafantatra an’izao!”', 'dia lasa nahita ny mason’izy ireo. noraran’i jesosy mafy anefa izy ireo hoe: “tandremo sao misy mahafantatra an’izao!”');
INSERT INTO "bible_verses" ("id", "created_date", "updated_date", "created_by_id", "created_by", "translation", "book", "bookOrder", "chapter", "verse", "text", "normalizedText") VALUES
  ('6ab25c189b020126accd2c55', '2026-09-22T10:44:40.878Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:40.878Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 9, 17, 'Ary tsy misy olona manisy divay vaovao ao anaty siny hoditra efa tonta. Raha izany mantsy, dia ho vaky ilay siny hoditra ka ho raraka ny divay ary ho simba ny siny. Fa atao ao anaty siny hoditra vaovao ny divay vaovao, ka samy tsy simba na ny siny na ny divay.”', 'ary tsy misy olona manisy divay vaovao ao anaty siny hoditra efa tonta. raha izany mantsy, dia ho vaky ilay siny hoditra ka ho raraka ny divay ary ho simba ny siny. fa atao ao anaty siny hoditra vaovao ny divay vaovao, ka samy tsy simba na ny siny na ny divay.”'),
  ('6ab25c189b020126accd2c50', '2026-09-22T10:44:40.878Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:40.878Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 9, 12, 'Henon’i Jesosy izany ka hoy izy: “Tsy ny olona salama no mila dokotera, fa ny marary.', 'henon’i jesosy izany ka hoy izy: “tsy ny olona salama no mila dokotera, fa ny marary.'),
  ('6ab25c189b020126accd2c68', '2026-09-22T10:44:40.878Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:40.878Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 9, 36, 'Rehefa nahita ny vahoaka izy, dia nangoraka an’ireo, satria hitany fa nampijalina izy ireo sady tsy nisy niraharaha hoatran’ny ondry tsy misy mpiandry.', 'rehefa nahita ny vahoaka izy, dia nangoraka an’ireo, satria hitany fa nampijalina izy ireo sady tsy nisy niraharaha hoatran’ny ondry tsy misy mpiandry.'),
  ('6ab25c189b020126accd2c67', '2026-09-22T10:44:40.878Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:40.878Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 9, 35, 'Ary lasa i Jesosy nitety ny tanàna rehetra, na kely na lehibe, ka nampianatra tany amin’ny synagoga sy nitory ny vaovao tsaran’ilay Fanjakana. Nositraniny koa ny karazan’aretina rehetra.', 'ary lasa i jesosy nitety ny tanàna rehetra, na kely na lehibe, ka nampianatra tany amin’ny synagoga sy nitory ny vaovao tsaran’ilay fanjakana. nositraniny koa ny karazan’aretina rehetra.'),
  ('6ab25c189b020126accd2c4d', '2026-09-22T10:44:40.878Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:40.878Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 9, 9, 'Rehefa niala teo i Jesosy, dia nahita lehilahy antsoina hoe Matio, nipetraka teo amin’ny birao famorian-ketra. Ary hoy izy taminy: “Andao hanara-dia ahy.” Dia nitsangana i Matio ka nanaraka azy.', 'rehefa niala teo i jesosy, dia nahita lehilahy antsoina hoe matio, nipetraka teo amin’ny birao famorian-ketra. ary hoy izy taminy: “andao hanara-dia ahy.” dia nitsangana i matio ka nanaraka azy.'),
  ('6ab25c189b020126accd2c48', '2026-09-22T10:44:40.878Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:40.878Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 9, 4, 'Fantatr’i Jesosy ny eritreritr’izy ireo, ka hoy izy: “Nahoana ianareo no ratsy saina hoatr’izany?', 'fantatr’i jesosy ny eritreritr’izy ireo, ka hoy izy: “nahoana ianareo no ratsy saina hoatr’izany?'),
  ('6ab25c189b020126accd2c46', '2026-09-22T10:44:40.878Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:40.878Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 9, 2, 'Ary iny fa nentin’ny olona teo aminy ny lehilahy iray malemy teo am-pandriana. Rehefa hitan’i Jesosy fa nanam-pinoana izy ireo, dia hoy izy tamin’ilay malemy: “Mahereza, anaka! Voavela ny helokao.”', 'ary iny fa nentin’ny olona teo aminy ny lehilahy iray malemy teo am-pandriana. rehefa hitan’i jesosy fa nanam-pinoana izy ireo, dia hoy izy tamin’ilay malemy: “mahereza, anaka! voavela ny helokao.”'),
  ('6ab25c189b020126accd2c5f', '2026-09-22T10:44:40.878Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:40.878Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 9, 27, 'Rehefa niala teo i Jesosy, dia nisy jamba roa lahy nanaraka azy sady niantsoantso mafy hoe: “Mba iantrao izahay, ry Zanak’i Davida ô!”', 'rehefa niala teo i jesosy, dia nisy jamba roa lahy nanaraka azy sady niantsoantso mafy hoe: “mba iantrao izahay, ry zanak’i davida ô!”'),
  ('6ab25c189b020126accd2c58', '2026-09-22T10:44:40.878Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:40.878Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 9, 20, 'Ary nisy vehivavy nijaly be, fa nandeha ra nandritra ny 12 taona. Nanatona an’i Jesosy avy tao aoriana izy, ka nikasika ny mikiramborambo amin’ny morontongotry ny akanjony ivelany.', 'ary nisy vehivavy nijaly be, fa nandeha ra nandritra ny 12 taona. nanatona an’i jesosy avy tao aoriana izy, ka nikasika ny mikiramborambo amin’ny morontongotry ny akanjony ivelany.'),
  ('6ab25c189b020126accd2c56', '2026-09-22T10:44:40.878Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:40.878Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 9, 18, 'Tamin’izy niteny an’izany, dia nisy mpitantana ny synagoga nanatona ka niankohoka teo anatrehany, sady niteny hoe: “Efa maty angamba izay ny zanako vavy. Andao re ho any aminay e, dia ametraho tanana izy mba ho velona!”', 'tamin’izy niteny an’izany, dia nisy mpitantana ny synagoga nanatona ka niankohoka teo anatrehany, sady niteny hoe: “efa maty angamba izay ny zanako vavy. andao re ho any aminay e, dia ametraho tanana izy mba ho velona!”'),
  ('6ab25c189b020126accd2c4f', '2026-09-22T10:44:40.878Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:40.878Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 9, 11, 'Hoy anefa ny Fariseo tamin’ny mpianany, rehefa nahita an’izany: “Fa maninona ny mpampianatra anareo no miara-misakafo amin’ny mpamory hetra sy ny mpanota?”', 'hoy anefa ny fariseo tamin’ny mpianany, rehefa nahita an’izany: “fa maninona ny mpampianatra anareo no miara-misakafo amin’ny mpamory hetra sy ny mpanota?”'),
  ('6ab25c189b020126accd2c66', '2026-09-22T10:44:40.878Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:40.878Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 9, 34, 'Hoy anefa ny Fariseo: “Ny lehiben’ny demonia no ahavitany mamoaka demonia.”', 'hoy anefa ny fariseo: “ny lehiben’ny demonia no ahavitany mamoaka demonia.”'),
  ('6ab25c189b020126accd2c5b', '2026-09-22T10:44:40.878Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:40.878Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 9, 23, 'Rehefa tonga tao an-tranon’ilay mpitantana ny synagoga i Jesosy, dia nahita olona nitsoka sodina sy vahoaka nitabataba,', 'rehefa tonga tao an-tranon’ilay mpitantana ny synagoga i jesosy, dia nahita olona nitsoka sodina sy vahoaka nitabataba,'),
  ('6ab25c189b020126accd2c4c', '2026-09-22T10:44:40.878Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:40.878Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 9, 8, 'Gaga be ny vahoaka rehefa nahita an’izany ka nanome voninahitra an’Andriamanitra, izay nanome an’izany fahefana izany ho an’ny olona.', 'gaga be ny vahoaka rehefa nahita an’izany ka nanome voninahitra an’andriamanitra, izay nanome an’izany fahefana izany ho an’ny olona.'),
  ('6ab25c189b020126accd2c60', '2026-09-22T10:44:40.878Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:40.878Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 9, 28, 'Nankeo aminy ireo jamba ireo rehefa tafiditra tao an-trano izy, ka nanontanian’i Jesosy hoe: “Mino ve ianareo fa mahavita an’izany aho?” Hoy izy ireo: “Eny, Tompoko.”', 'nankeo aminy ireo jamba ireo rehefa tafiditra tao an-trano izy, ka nanontanian’i jesosy hoe: “mino ve ianareo fa mahavita an’izany aho?” hoy izy ireo: “eny, tompoko.”'),
  ('6ab25c189b020126accd2c5e', '2026-09-22T10:44:40.878Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:40.878Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 9, 26, 'Ary niely eran’ilay faritra ny resaka momba an’izany.', 'ary niely eran’ilay faritra ny resaka momba an’izany.'),
  ('6ab25c189b020126accd2c57', '2026-09-22T10:44:40.878Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:40.878Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 9, 19, 'Dia nitsangana i Jesosy, ary nanaraka an’ilay lehilahy izy sy ny mpianany.', 'dia nitsangana i jesosy, ary nanaraka an’ilay lehilahy izy sy ny mpianany.'),
  ('6ab25c192ae8559326c04f97', '2026-09-22T10:44:41.397Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:41.397Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 10, 34, 'Aza mieritreritra hoe tonga hitondra fihavanana eto an-tany aho. Tsy tonga hitondra fihavanana aho fa hitondra sabatra.', 'aza mieritreritra hoe tonga hitondra fihavanana eto an-tany aho. tsy tonga hitondra fihavanana aho fa hitondra sabatra.'),
  ('6ab25c192ae8559326c04f8f', '2026-09-22T10:44:41.397Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:41.397Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 10, 26, 'Aza matahotra an’ireny àry, fa tsy misy zavatra afenina ka hoe tsy haseho, ary tsy misy zava-miafina ka hoe tsy ho fantatra.', 'aza matahotra an’ireny àry, fa tsy misy zavatra afenina ka hoe tsy haseho, ary tsy misy zava-miafina ka hoe tsy ho fantatra.'),
  ('6ab25c192ae8559326c04f8a', '2026-09-22T10:44:41.397Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:41.397Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 10, 21, 'Ary hanolotra ny rahalahiny hovonoina ho faty ny olona. Ny ray koa hanolotra ny zanany, ary ny zanaka hanohitra ny ray aman-dreniny ka hampamono azy ho faty.', 'ary hanolotra ny rahalahiny hovonoina ho faty ny olona. ny ray koa hanolotra ny zanany, ary ny zanaka hanohitra ny ray aman-dreniny ka hampamono azy ho faty.'),
  ('6ab25c192ae8559326c04f9d', '2026-09-22T10:44:41.397Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:41.397Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 10, 40, '“Izay mandray anareo dia mandray ahy, ary izay mandray ahy dia mandray an’Ilay naniraka ahy koa.', '“izay mandray anareo dia mandray ahy, ary izay mandray ahy dia mandray an’ilay naniraka ahy koa.'),
