  ('6ab25c192ae8559326c04f7e', '2026-09-22T10:44:41.397Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:41.397Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 10, 9, 'Aza mitondra volamena na volafotsy na varahina ao anaty fehikibo fasianareo vola,', 'aza mitondra volamena na volafotsy na varahina ao anaty fehikibo fasianareo vola,'),
  ('6ab25c192ae8559326c04f9f', '2026-09-22T10:44:41.397Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:41.397Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 10, 42, 'Ary izay manome rano mangatsiaka na dia eran’ny kaopy fotsiny aza, mba hosotroin’ny iray amin’ireto madinika ireto satria hoe mpianatro ilay olona, dia lazaiko marina aminareo fa tena hahazo valisoa izy.”', 'ary izay manome rano mangatsiaka na dia eran’ny kaopy fotsiny aza, mba hosotroin’ny iray amin’ireto madinika ireto satria hoe mpianatro ilay olona, dia lazaiko marina aminareo fa tena hahazo valisoa izy.”'),
  ('6ab25c192ae8559326c04f99', '2026-09-22T10:44:41.397Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:41.397Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 10, 36, 'Ary ny ankohonan’ny olona ihany no ho fahavalony.', 'ary ny ankohonan’ny olona ihany no ho fahavalony.'),
  ('6ab25c192ae8559326c04f92', '2026-09-22T10:44:41.397Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:41.397Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 10, 29, 'Vola madinika kely anankiray no ivarotana fody roa, sa tsy izany? Na ny iray amin’ireny aza anefa no latsaka amin’ny tany, dia fantatry ny Rainareo izany.', 'vola madinika kely anankiray no ivarotana fody roa, sa tsy izany? na ny iray amin’ireny aza anefa no latsaka amin’ny tany, dia fantatry ny rainareo izany.'),
  ('6ab25c192ae8559326c04f98', '2026-09-22T10:44:41.397Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:41.397Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 10, 35, 'Fa tonga aho hampisaraka ny zanakalahy sy ny rainy, ny zanakavavy sy ny reniny, ary ny vinantovavy sy ny rafozambaviny.', 'fa tonga aho hampisaraka ny zanakalahy sy ny rainy, ny zanakavavy sy ny reniny, ary ny vinantovavy sy ny rafozambaviny.'),
  ('6ab25c192ae8559326c04f8e', '2026-09-22T10:44:41.397Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:41.397Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 10, 25, 'Efa ampy raha lasa hoatran’ny mpampianatra azy ilay mpianatra, ary raha lasa hoatran’ny tompony ilay mpanompo. Raha ny tompon-trano aza antsoin’ny olona hoe Belzeboba, mainka moa fa ny ankohonan’ilay tompon-trano?', 'efa ampy raha lasa hoatran’ny mpampianatra azy ilay mpianatra, ary raha lasa hoatran’ny tompony ilay mpanompo. raha ny tompon-trano aza antsoin’ny olona hoe belzeboba, mainka moa fa ny ankohonan’ilay tompon-trano?'),
  ('6ab25c192ae8559326c04f7f', '2026-09-22T10:44:41.397Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:41.397Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 10, 10, 'ary aza mitondra kitapom-batsy any amin’izay halehanareo, na akanjo roa, na kapa na tehina. Mendrika hahazo sakafo mantsy ny mpiasa.', 'ary aza mitondra kitapom-batsy any amin’izay halehanareo, na akanjo roa, na kapa na tehina. mendrika hahazo sakafo mantsy ny mpiasa.'),
