  ('6ab25c192ae8559326c04f87', '2026-09-22T10:44:41.397Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:41.397Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 10, 18, 'Hoentina eo anatrehan’ny governora sy ny mpanjaka ianareo noho ny amiko, mba ho vavolombeloko eo anatrehan’izy ireo sy ireo firenena.', 'hoentina eo anatrehan’ny governora sy ny mpanjaka ianareo noho ny amiko, mba ho vavolombeloko eo anatrehan’izy ireo sy ireo firenena.'),
  ('6ab25c192ae8559326c04f81', '2026-09-22T10:44:41.397Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:41.397Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 10, 12, 'Rehefa miditra ao amin’ny trano anankiray ianareo, dia arahabao izay ao.', 'rehefa miditra ao amin’ny trano anankiray ianareo, dia arahabao izay ao.'),
  ('6ab25c192ae8559326c04f7b', '2026-09-22T10:44:41.397Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:41.397Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 10, 6, 'Any amin’ny ondry very eo amin’ny taranak’Israely ihany mandeha.', 'any amin’ny ondry very eo amin’ny taranak’israely ihany mandeha.'),
  ('6ab25c192ae8559326c04f7a', '2026-09-22T10:44:41.397Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:41.397Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 10, 5, 'Nirahin’i Jesosy izy 12 lahy, ka nomeny toromarika hoe: “Aza mankany amin’ny firenen-kafa, ary aza miditra ao amin’ny tanànan’ny Samaritanina mihitsy.', 'nirahin’i jesosy izy 12 lahy, ka nomeny toromarika hoe: “aza mankany amin’ny firenen-kafa, ary aza miditra ao amin’ny tanànan’ny samaritanina mihitsy.'),
  ('6ab25c192ae8559326c04f79', '2026-09-22T10:44:41.397Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:41.397Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 10, 4, 'Simona Kananeanina; ary Jodasy Iskariota, ilay namadika an’i Jesosy tatỳ aoriana.', 'simona kananeanina; ary jodasy iskariota, ilay namadika an’i jesosy tatỳ aoriana.'),
  ('6ab25c192ae8559326c04f77', '2026-09-22T10:44:41.397Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:41.397Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 10, 2, 'Ireto avy ny anaran’ny apostoly 12: Voalohany, i Simona, antsoina koa hoe Petera, sy Andrea rahalahiny; Jakoba zanak’i Zebedio sy Jaona rahalahiny;', 'ireto avy ny anaran’ny apostoly 12: voalohany, i simona, antsoina koa hoe petera, sy andrea rahalahiny; jakoba zanak’i zebedio sy jaona rahalahiny;'),
  ('6ab25c192ae8559326c04f9b', '2026-09-22T10:44:41.397Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:41.397Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 10, 38, 'Ary izay tsy manaiky hitondra ny hazo fijaliany ka tsy manaraka ahy, dia tsy mendrika ahy.', 'ary izay tsy manaiky hitondra ny hazo fijaliany ka tsy manaraka ahy, dia tsy mendrika ahy.'),
  ('6ab25c192ae8559326c04f8c', '2026-09-22T10:44:41.397Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:41.397Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 10, 23, 'Rehefa enjehiny ao amin’ny tanàna iray ianareo, dia mandosira any amin’ny tanàna hafa. Fa lazaiko marina aminareo fa tsy ho voatetinareo daholo ny tanànan’ny Israely, mandra-pahatongan’ny Zanak’olona.', 'rehefa enjehiny ao amin’ny tanàna iray ianareo, dia mandosira any amin’ny tanàna hafa. fa lazaiko marina aminareo fa tsy ho voatetinareo daholo ny tanànan’ny israely, mandra-pahatongan’ny zanak’olona.'),
  ('6ab25c192ae8559326c04f89', '2026-09-22T10:44:41.397Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:41.397Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 10, 20, 'Tsy hoe ianareo fotsiny mantsy no miteny, fa ny fanahin’ny Rainareo no miteny amin’ny alalanareo.', 'tsy hoe ianareo fotsiny mantsy no miteny, fa ny fanahin’ny rainareo no miteny amin’ny alalanareo.'),
  ('6ab25c192ae8559326c04f95', '2026-09-22T10:44:41.397Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:41.397Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 10, 32, '“Izay manaiky eo imason’ny olona hoe mpianatro, dia hekeko eo anatrehan’ny Raiko any an-danitra.', '“izay manaiky eo imason’ny olona hoe mpianatro, dia hekeko eo anatrehan’ny raiko any an-danitra.'),
  ('6ab25c192ae8559326c04f94', '2026-09-22T10:44:41.397Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:41.397Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 10, 31, 'Aza matahotra àry fa mbola sarobidy lavitra noho ny fody be dia be ianareo.', 'aza matahotra àry fa mbola sarobidy lavitra noho ny fody be dia be ianareo.'),
  ('6ab25c192ae8559326c04f7c', '2026-09-22T10:44:41.397Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:41.397Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 10, 7, 'Rehefa mandeha ianareo, dia izao torina: ‘Efa manakaiky ny Fanjakan’ny lanitra.’', 'rehefa mandeha ianareo, dia izao torina: ‘efa manakaiky ny fanjakan’ny lanitra.’'),
  ('6ab25c192ae8559326c04f9a', '2026-09-22T10:44:41.397Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:41.397Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 10, 37, 'Izay tia ny rainy na ny reniny mihoatra noho ny fitiavana ahy dia tsy mendrika ahy, ary izay tia ny zanany lahy na ny zanany vavy mihoatra noho ny fitiavana ahy dia tsy mendrika ahy.', 'izay tia ny rainy na ny reniny mihoatra noho ny fitiavana ahy dia tsy mendrika ahy, ary izay tia ny zanany lahy na ny zanany vavy mihoatra noho ny fitiavana ahy dia tsy mendrika ahy.'),
  ('6ab25c192ae8559326c04f85', '2026-09-22T10:44:41.397Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:41.397Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 10, 16, '“Maniraka anareo aho izao, hoatran’ny maniraka ondry ho eo afovoan’ny amboadia. Asehoy àry hoe malina hoatran’ny bibilava ianareo, nefa tsy manan-tsiny hoatran’ny voromailala.', '“maniraka anareo aho izao, hoatran’ny maniraka ondry ho eo afovoan’ny amboadia. asehoy àry hoe malina hoatran’ny bibilava ianareo, nefa tsy manan-tsiny hoatran’ny voromailala.'),
  ('6ab25c192ae8559326c04f83', '2026-09-22T10:44:41.397Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:41.397Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 10, 14, 'Na aiza na aiza misy olona tsy mandray anareo na tsy mihaino ny teninareo, dia ahintsano ny vovoka amin’ny tongotrareo rehefa miala ao amin’ilay trano na ilay tanàna ianareo.', 'na aiza na aiza misy olona tsy mandray anareo na tsy mihaino ny teninareo, dia ahintsano ny vovoka amin’ny tongotrareo rehefa miala ao amin’ilay trano na ilay tanàna ianareo.'),
  ('6ab25c192ae8559326c04f82', '2026-09-22T10:44:41.397Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:41.397Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 10, 13, 'Raha mendrika ny olona ao, dia hahazo an’ilay fiadanana irinareo ho azony ry zareo! Fa raha tsy mendrika kosa ry zareo, dia hiverina aminareo ihany ilay fiadanana nirinareo ho azony.', 'raha mendrika ny olona ao, dia hahazo an’ilay fiadanana irinareo ho azony ry zareo! fa raha tsy mendrika kosa ry zareo, dia hiverina aminareo ihany ilay fiadanana nirinareo ho azony.'),
  ('6ab25c192ae8559326c04f8d', '2026-09-22T10:44:41.397Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:41.397Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 10, 24, '“Tsy ambony noho ny mpampianatra azy ny mpianatra, ary tsy ambony noho ny tompony ny mpanompo.', '“tsy ambony noho ny mpampianatra azy ny mpianatra, ary tsy ambony noho ny tompony ny mpanompo.'),
  ('6ab25c192ae8559326c04f84', '2026-09-22T10:44:41.397Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:41.397Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 10, 15, 'Lazaiko marina aminareo fa ho mora kokoa ny hanjo an’i Sodoma sy Gomora amin’ny Andro Fitsarana, noho ny hanjo an’izany tanàna izany.', 'lazaiko marina aminareo fa ho mora kokoa ny hanjo an’i sodoma sy gomora amin’ny andro fitsarana, noho ny hanjo an’izany tanàna izany.'),
  ('6ab25c192ae8559326c04f76', '2026-09-22T10:44:41.397Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:41.397Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 10, 1, 'Koa nasainy nankeo aminy ny mpianany 12 lahy. Dia nomeny fahefana izy ireo mba hamoaka fanahy maloto sy hanasitrana ny karazan’aretina rehetra.', 'koa nasainy nankeo aminy ny mpianany 12 lahy. dia nomeny fahefana izy ireo mba hamoaka fanahy maloto sy hanasitrana ny karazan’aretina rehetra.'),
  ('6ab25c192ae8559326c04f96', '2026-09-22T10:44:41.397Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:41.397Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 10, 33, 'Fa izay tsy manaiky eo imason’ny olona hoe mpianatro, dia tsy hekeko eo anatrehan’ny Raiko any an-danitra.', 'fa izay tsy manaiky eo imason’ny olona hoe mpianatro, dia tsy hekeko eo anatrehan’ny raiko any an-danitra.'),
  ('6ab25c192ae8559326c04f93', '2026-09-22T10:44:41.397Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:41.397Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 10, 30, 'Fa na ny volon-dohanareo aza dia voaisa daholo.', 'fa na ny volon-dohanareo aza dia voaisa daholo.'),
  ('6ab25c192ae8559326c04f88', '2026-09-22T10:44:41.397Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:41.397Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 10, 19, 'Rehefa entiny any anefa ianareo, dia aza manahy momba an’izay holazainareo na ny fomba hilazanareo azy, fa amin’izay ora izay no hatoro anareo izay tokony holazainareo.', 'rehefa entiny any anefa ianareo, dia aza manahy momba an’izay holazainareo na ny fomba hilazanareo azy, fa amin’izay ora izay no hatoro anareo izay tokony holazainareo.'),
  ('6ab25c192ae8559326c04f7d', '2026-09-22T10:44:41.397Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:41.397Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 10, 8, 'Sitrano ny marary, atsangano ny maty, diovy ny boka, avoahy ny demonia. Nahazo maimaim-poana ianareo, ka manomeza maimaim-poana.', 'sitrano ny marary, atsangano ny maty, diovy ny boka, avoahy ny demonia. nahazo maimaim-poana ianareo, ka manomeza maimaim-poana.'),
  ('6ab25c192ae8559326c04f9e', '2026-09-22T10:44:41.397Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:41.397Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 10, 41, 'Izay mandray mpaminany satria hoe mpaminany ilay olona, dia hahazo ny valisoan’ny mpaminany. Izay mandray olo-marina satria hoe olo-marina ilay olona, dia hahazo ny valisoan’ny olo-marina.', 'izay mandray mpaminany satria hoe mpaminany ilay olona, dia hahazo ny valisoan’ny mpaminany. izay mandray olo-marina satria hoe olo-marina ilay olona, dia hahazo ny valisoan’ny olo-marina.'),
  ('6ab25c192ae8559326c04f91', '2026-09-22T10:44:41.397Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:41.397Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 10, 28, 'Ary aza matahotra an’izay mahavita mamono anareo ho faty, nefa tsy mahasakana anareo tsy hahazo ny fiainana. Matahora kosa an’ilay mahavita mandringana anareo ao amin’ny Gehena.', 'ary aza matahotra an’izay mahavita mamono anareo ho faty, nefa tsy mahasakana anareo tsy hahazo ny fiainana. matahora kosa an’ilay mahavita mandringana anareo ao amin’ny gehena.'),
  ('6ab25c192ae8559326c04f8b', '2026-09-22T10:44:41.397Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:41.397Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 10, 22, 'Ary ho halan’ny olona rehetra ianareo noho ny anarako. Izay miaritra hatramin’ny farany anefa no hovonjena.', 'ary ho halan’ny olona rehetra ianareo noho ny anarako. izay miaritra hatramin’ny farany anefa no hovonjena.'),
  ('6ab25c192ae8559326c04f80', '2026-09-22T10:44:41.397Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:41.397Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 10, 11, '“Any amin’izay tanàna lehibe na tanàna kely hidiranareo, dia tadiavo izay mendrika ao. Dia mijanòna ao mandra-pialanareo ao.', '“any amin’izay tanàna lehibe na tanàna kely hidiranareo, dia tadiavo izay mendrika ao. dia mijanòna ao mandra-pialanareo ao.'),
  ('6ab25c192ae8559326c04f9c', '2026-09-22T10:44:41.397Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:41.397Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 10, 39, 'Izay mamonjy ny ainy no hamoy an’izany, ary izay mamoy ny ainy noho ny amiko kosa no hamonjy an’izany.', 'izay mamonjy ny ainy no hamoy an’izany, ary izay mamoy ny ainy noho ny amiko kosa no hamonjy an’izany.'),
  ('6ab25c192ae8559326c04f90', '2026-09-22T10:44:41.397Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:41.397Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 10, 27, 'Izay lazaiko aminareo ao amin’ny maizina dia teneno ao amin’ny mazava, ary izay bitsibitsihina aminareo dia torio eny an-tampon-trano.', 'izay lazaiko aminareo ao amin’ny maizina dia teneno ao amin’ny mazava, ary izay bitsibitsihina aminareo dia torio eny an-tampon-trano.'),
  ('6ab25c19011f08e36e2f9fb5', '2026-09-22T10:44:41.943Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:41.943Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 11, 18, 'Hoatr’izany koa fa tonga i Jaona, nifady hanina sady tsy nisotro divay, nefa lazain’ny olona hoe: ‘Misy demonia izy.’', 'hoatr’izany koa fa tonga i jaona, nifady hanina sady tsy nisotro divay, nefa lazain’ny olona hoe: ‘misy demonia izy.’'),
  ('6ab25c19011f08e36e2f9fa7', '2026-09-22T10:44:41.943Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:41.943Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 11, 4, 'Dia hoy i Jesosy: “Mandehana tantarao amin’i Jaona izao henonareo sy hitanareo izao:', 'dia hoy i jesosy: “mandehana tantarao amin’i jaona izao henonareo sy hitanareo izao:'),
  ('6ab25c19011f08e36e2f9fc1', '2026-09-22T10:44:41.943Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:41.943Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 11, 30, 'Fa mora entina ny ziogako, ary maivana ny entako.”', 'fa mora entina ny ziogako, ary maivana ny entako.”'),
  ('6ab25c19011f08e36e2f9fbd', '2026-09-22T10:44:41.943Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:41.943Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 11, 26, 'Izany mihitsy mantsy no sitraponao, Ray ô!', 'izany mihitsy mantsy no sitraponao, ray ô!'),
  ('6ab25c19011f08e36e2f9fbb', '2026-09-22T10:44:41.943Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:41.943Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 11, 24, 'Lazaiko aminao fa ho mora kokoa ny hanjo an’i Sodoma amin’ny Andro Fitsarana, noho ny hanjo anao.”', 'lazaiko aminao fa ho mora kokoa ny hanjo an’i sodoma amin’ny andro fitsarana, noho ny hanjo anao.”'),
  ('6ab25c19011f08e36e2f9fb4', '2026-09-22T10:44:41.943Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:41.943Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 11, 17, '‘Efa nitsoka sodina izahay, nefa ianareo tsy mba nandihy. Efa nanao hira fisaonana izahay, nefa ianareo tsy mba nikapo-tratra noho ny alahelo.’', '‘efa nitsoka sodina izahay, nefa ianareo tsy mba nandihy. efa nanao hira fisaonana izahay, nefa ianareo tsy mba nikapo-tratra noho ny alahelo.’'),
  ('6ab25c19011f08e36e2f9fbe', '2026-09-22T10:44:41.943Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:41.943Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 11, 27, 'Efa nomen’ny Raiko ahy daholo ny zava-drehetra. Tsy misy tena mahafantatra tsara ny Zanaka afa-tsy ny Ray, ary tsy misy tena mahafantatra tsara ny Ray afa-tsy ny Zanaka sy izay tian’ny Zanaka hampahafantarina ny momba ny Ray.', 'efa nomen’ny raiko ahy daholo ny zava-drehetra. tsy misy tena mahafantatra tsara ny zanaka afa-tsy ny ray, ary tsy misy tena mahafantatra tsara ny ray afa-tsy ny zanaka sy izay tian’ny zanaka hampahafantarina ny momba ny ray.'),
  ('6ab25c19011f08e36e2f9fb7', '2026-09-22T10:44:41.943Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:41.943Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 11, 20, 'Ary nomeny tsiny ireo tanàna nanaovany ny ankamaroan’ny fahagagana nataony, satria tsy mba nibebaka ny olona tao amin’ireny.', 'ary nomeny tsiny ireo tanàna nanaovany ny ankamaroan’ny fahagagana nataony, satria tsy mba nibebaka ny olona tao amin’ireny.'),
  ('6ab25c19011f08e36e2f9fb2', '2026-09-22T10:44:41.943Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:41.943Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 11, 15, 'Izay manan-tsofina hihainoana, aoka izy hihaino.', 'izay manan-tsofina hihainoana, aoka izy hihaino.'),
  ('6ab25c19011f08e36e2f9faa', '2026-09-22T10:44:41.943Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:41.943Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 11, 7, 'Rehefa lasa ny mpianatr’i Jaona, dia niresaka momba an’i Jaona tamin’ny vahoaka i Jesosy. Hoy izy: “Nivoaka hijery inona tany an-tany efitra ianareo? Bararata ahetsiketsiky ny rivotra ve?', 'rehefa lasa ny mpianatr’i jaona, dia niresaka momba an’i jaona tamin’ny vahoaka i jesosy. hoy izy: “nivoaka hijery inona tany an-tany efitra ianareo? bararata ahetsiketsiky ny rivotra ve?'),
  ('6ab25c19011f08e36e2f9fa6', '2026-09-22T10:44:41.943Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:41.943Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 11, 3, 'hanontany azy hoe: “Ianao ve Ilay ho avy, sa olon-kafa no tokony handrasanay?”', 'hanontany azy hoe: “ianao ve ilay ho avy, sa olon-kafa no tokony handrasanay?”'),
  ('6ab25c19011f08e36e2f9fb6', '2026-09-22T10:44:41.943Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:41.943Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 11, 19, 'Tonga kosa ny Zanak’olona, mihinana sy misotro, nefa hoy ihany ny olona: ‘Jereo! Olona tendan-kanina sy mpiboboka divay io, sady naman’ny mpamory hetra sy ny mpanota.’ Izay ataon’ny olona anefa no ahitana raha hendry izy na tsia.”', 'tonga kosa ny zanak’olona, mihinana sy misotro, nefa hoy ihany ny olona: ‘jereo! olona tendan-kanina sy mpiboboka divay io, sady naman’ny mpamory hetra sy ny mpanota.’ izay ataon’ny olona anefa no ahitana raha hendry izy na tsia.”'),
  ('6ab25c19011f08e36e2f9fbc', '2026-09-22T10:44:41.943Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:41.943Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 11, 25, 'Tamin’izay fotoana izay, dia hoy i Jesosy: “Ry Ray, Tompon’ny lanitra sy ny tany ô, midera anao eto imason’ny olona rehetra aho, satria efa nafeninao tamin’ ny hendry sy ny mahira-tsaina ireny zavatra ireny, fa nampahafantarinao tamin’ny ankizikely kosa.', 'tamin’izay fotoana izay, dia hoy i jesosy: “ry ray, tompon’ny lanitra sy ny tany ô, midera anao eto imason’ny olona rehetra aho, satria efa nafeninao tamin’ ny hendry sy ny mahira-tsaina ireny zavatra ireny, fa nampahafantarinao tamin’ny ankizikely kosa.'),
  ('6ab25c19011f08e36e2f9fb0', '2026-09-22T10:44:41.943Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:41.943Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 11, 13, 'Fa samy naminany daholo na ny Mpaminany na ny Lalàna, mandra-pahatongan’i Jaona.', 'fa samy naminany daholo na ny mpaminany na ny lalàna, mandra-pahatongan’i jaona.'),
  ('6ab25c19011f08e36e2f9fa9', '2026-09-22T10:44:41.943Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:41.943Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 11, 6, 'Sambatra izay tsy tafintohina noho ny amiko.”', 'sambatra izay tsy tafintohina noho ny amiko.”'),
  ('6ab25c19011f08e36e2f9faf', '2026-09-22T10:44:41.943Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:41.943Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 11, 12, 'Nanomboka tamin’ny andron’i Jaona Mpanao Batisa ka hatramin’izao, dia misisika mafy hiditra ao amin’ny Fanjakan’ny lanitra ny olona, ary izay misisika mafy no tafiditra.', 'nanomboka tamin’ny andron’i jaona mpanao batisa ka hatramin’izao, dia misisika mafy hiditra ao amin’ny fanjakan’ny lanitra ny olona, ary izay misisika mafy no tafiditra.'),
  ('6ab25c19011f08e36e2f9fae', '2026-09-22T10:44:41.943Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:41.943Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 11, 11, 'Lazaiko marina aminareo fa amin’izay nateraky ny vehivavy, dia mbola tsy nisy lehibe noho i Jaona Mpanao Batisa. Mbola lehibe noho izy anefa izay kely indrindra ao amin’ny Fanjakan’ny lanitra.', 'lazaiko marina aminareo fa amin’izay nateraky ny vehivavy, dia mbola tsy nisy lehibe noho i jaona mpanao batisa. mbola lehibe noho izy anefa izay kely indrindra ao amin’ny fanjakan’ny lanitra.'),
  ('6ab25c19011f08e36e2f9fad', '2026-09-22T10:44:41.943Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:41.943Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 11, 10, 'Fa izao no voasoratra momba azy: ‘Halefako mialoha anao ilay olona irahiko, izay hanomana ny lalana halehanao.’', 'fa izao no voasoratra momba azy: ‘halefako mialoha anao ilay olona irahiko, izay hanomana ny lalana halehanao.’'),
  ('6ab25c19011f08e36e2f9fb8', '2026-09-22T10:44:41.943Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:41.943Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 11, 21, 'Hoy izy: “Hahita loza ianao, ry Korazina! Hahita loza ianao, ry Betsaida! Raha tany Tyro sy Sidona mantsy no nanaovana an’ireny fahagagana natao tao aminareo ireny, dia ho efa ela ry zareo no nibebaka ka nanao akanjo gony sy nihosina lavenona.', 'hoy izy: “hahita loza ianao, ry korazina! hahita loza ianao, ry betsaida! raha tany tyro sy sidona mantsy no nanaovana an’ireny fahagagana natao tao aminareo ireny, dia ho efa ela ry zareo no nibebaka ka nanao akanjo gony sy nihosina lavenona.'),
  ('6ab25c19011f08e36e2f9fac', '2026-09-22T10:44:41.943Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:41.943Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 11, 9, 'Inona marina àry no antony nivoahanareo e? Hijery mpaminany ve? Tsoriko aminareo fa lehibe lavitra noho ny mpaminany izy.', 'inona marina àry no antony nivoahanareo e? hijery mpaminany ve? tsoriko aminareo fa lehibe lavitra noho ny mpaminany izy.'),
  ('6ab25c19011f08e36e2f9fab', '2026-09-22T10:44:41.943Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:41.943Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 11, 8, 'Sa nivoaka hijery inona ianareo? Olona manao akanjo vita amin’ny ravin-damba malefaka ve? Any an-tranon’ny mpanjaka no misy manao akanjo hoatr’izany.', 'sa nivoaka hijery inona ianareo? olona manao akanjo vita amin’ny ravin-damba malefaka ve? any an-tranon’ny mpanjaka no misy manao akanjo hoatr’izany.'),
  ('6ab25c19011f08e36e2f9fb9', '2026-09-22T10:44:41.943Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:41.943Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 11, 22, 'Lazaiko aminareo fa ho mora kokoa ny hanjo an’i Tyro sy Sidona amin’ny Andro Fitsarana, noho ny hanjo anareo.', 'lazaiko aminareo fa ho mora kokoa ny hanjo an’i tyro sy sidona amin’ny andro fitsarana, noho ny hanjo anareo.'),
