  ('6ab25c1a6612a20540e68a29', '2026-09-22T10:44:42.429Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:42.429Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 12, 8, 'Fa ny Zanak’olona no Tompon’ny Sabata.”', 'fa ny zanak’olona no tompon’ny sabata.”'),
  ('6ab25c1a6612a20540e68a27', '2026-09-22T10:44:42.429Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:42.429Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 12, 6, 'Lazaiko aminareo anefa fa misy lehibe noho ny tempoly eto.', 'lazaiko aminareo anefa fa misy lehibe noho ny tempoly eto.'),
  ('6ab25c1a6612a20540e68a25', '2026-09-22T10:44:42.429Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:42.429Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 12, 4, 'Niditra tao an-tranon’Andriamanitra izy, dia nihinana ny mofo atolotra ry zareo. Tsy nisy nahazo nihinana an’izany anefa na izy na ny olona niaraka taminy, afa-tsy ny mpisorona ihany.', 'niditra tao an-tranon’andriamanitra izy, dia nihinana ny mofo atolotra ry zareo. tsy nisy nahazo nihinana an’izany anefa na izy na ny olona niaraka taminy, afa-tsy ny mpisorona ihany.'),
  ('6ab25c1bcb3e975f3cce96bd', '2026-09-22T10:44:43.127Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:43.127Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 13, 51, '“Azonareo ve ny dikan’izany rehetra izany?” Dia hoy ireo: “Ie.”', '“azonareo ve ny dikan’izany rehetra izany?” dia hoy ireo: “ie.”'),
  ('6ab25c1bcb3e975f3cce96b7', '2026-09-22T10:44:43.127Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:43.127Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 13, 45, '“Ny Fanjakan’ny lanitra koa dia hoatran’ny mpivaro-mandeha mitady perla faran’izay tsara.', '“ny fanjakan’ny lanitra koa dia hoatran’ny mpivaro-mandeha mitady perla faran’izay tsara.'),
  ('6ab25c1bcb3e975f3cce96b6', '2026-09-22T10:44:43.127Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:43.127Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 13, 44, '“Ny Fanjakan’ny lanitra dia hoatran’ny harena nafenina tany an-tsaha, izay hitan’olona ka nafeniny indray. Faly be izy ka lasa nivarotra an’izay nananany rehetra, dia nividy an’ilay saha.', '“ny fanjakan’ny lanitra dia hoatran’ny harena nafenina tany an-tsaha, izay hitan’olona ka nafeniny indray. faly be izy ka lasa nivarotra an’izay nananany rehetra, dia nividy an’ilay saha.'),
  ('6ab25c1bcb3e975f3cce96a9', '2026-09-22T10:44:43.127Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:43.127Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 13, 31, 'Nanao fanoharana hafa taminy koa izy hoe: “Ny Fanjakan’ny lanitra dia hoatran’ny voan-tsinapy nalain’olona ka namboleny tany an-tsahany.', 'nanao fanoharana hafa taminy koa izy hoe: “ny fanjakan’ny lanitra dia hoatran’ny voan-tsinapy nalain’olona ka namboleny tany an-tsahany.'),
  ('6ab25c1bcb3e975f3cce969b', '2026-09-22T10:44:43.127Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:43.127Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 13, 17, 'Lazaiko marina aminareo fa be dia be ny mpaminany sy ny olo-marina te hahita an’izay hitanareo fa tsy nahita, ary te haheno an’izay henonareo fa tsy naheno.', 'lazaiko marina aminareo fa be dia be ny mpaminany sy ny olo-marina te hahita an’izay hitanareo fa tsy nahita, ary te haheno an’izay henonareo fa tsy naheno.'),
  ('6ab25c1bcb3e975f3cce968e', '2026-09-22T10:44:43.127Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:43.127Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 13, 4, 'Tamin’izy namafy, dia latsaka teny amoron-dalana ny voa sasany, ka tonga ny vorona nihinana an’ireny.', 'tamin’izy namafy, dia latsaka teny amoron-dalana ny voa sasany, ka tonga ny vorona nihinana an’ireny.'),
  ('6ab25c1bcb3e975f3cce96b8', '2026-09-22T10:44:43.127Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:43.127Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 13, 46, 'Rehefa nahita perla iray sarobidy izy, dia tonga dia nandeha nivarotra an’izay nananany rehetra ka nividy an’ilay perla.', 'rehefa nahita perla iray sarobidy izy, dia tonga dia nandeha nivarotra an’izay nananany rehetra ka nividy an’ilay perla.'),
  ('6ab25c1bcb3e975f3cce969d', '2026-09-22T10:44:43.127Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:43.127Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 13, 19, 'Rehefa misy olona mandre ny teny momba an’ilay Fanjakana nefa tsy mahazo ny dikan’ilay izy, dia tonga ilay ratsy ka manala an’izay nafafy tao am-pony. Izany ilay voa nafafy teny amoron-dalana.', 'rehefa misy olona mandre ny teny momba an’ilay fanjakana nefa tsy mahazo ny dikan’ilay izy, dia tonga ilay ratsy ka manala an’izay nafafy tao am-pony. izany ilay voa nafafy teny amoron-dalana.'),
  ('6ab25c1bcb3e975f3cce9699', '2026-09-22T10:44:43.127Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:43.127Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 13, 15, 'Fa efa lasa donto ny fon’ity vahoaka ity, ary efa naheno ny sofiny fa tsy rototra izy, ary efa nakimpiny ny masony, amin’izay ny masony tsy hahita mihitsy, ary ny sofiny tsy haheno mihitsy. Amin’izay koa ny fony tsy hahazo ny dikan’izany, dia tsy hiverina amiko izy ka tsy hositraniko.’', 'fa efa lasa donto ny fon’ity vahoaka ity, ary efa naheno ny sofiny fa tsy rototra izy, ary efa nakimpiny ny masony, amin’izay ny masony tsy hahita mihitsy, ary ny sofiny tsy haheno mihitsy. amin’izay koa ny fony tsy hahazo ny dikan’izany, dia tsy hiverina amiko izy ka tsy hositraniko.’'),
