  ('6ab25c1bcb3e975f3cce96a0', '2026-09-22T10:44:43.127Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:43.127Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 13, 22, 'Ary ilay nafafy teny amin’ny tsilo dia izay mandre ny teny, saingy tototry ny fanahiana eto amin’izao tontolo izao sy ny famitahan’ny harena ny teny ka tsy mamoa.', 'ary ilay nafafy teny amin’ny tsilo dia izay mandre ny teny, saingy tototry ny fanahiana eto amin’izao tontolo izao sy ny famitahan’ny harena ny teny ka tsy mamoa.'),
  ('6ab25c1bcb3e975f3cce968b', '2026-09-22T10:44:43.127Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:43.127Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 13, 1, 'Niala tao an-trano i Jesosy tamin’io andro io, dia nipetraka teo amoron-dranomasina.', 'niala tao an-trano i jesosy tamin’io andro io, dia nipetraka teo amoron-dranomasina.'),
  ('6ab25c1bcb3e975f3cce96c1', '2026-09-22T10:44:43.127Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:43.127Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 13, 55, 'Angaha tsy io ilay zanaky ny mpandrafitra? Angaha tsy Maria no anaran’ny reniny, dia i Jakoba sy Josefa sy Simona ary Jodasy no rahalahiny?', 'angaha tsy io ilay zanaky ny mpandrafitra? angaha tsy maria no anaran’ny reniny, dia i jakoba sy josefa sy simona ary jodasy no rahalahiny?'),
  ('6ab25c1bcb3e975f3cce968d', '2026-09-22T10:44:43.127Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:43.127Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 13, 3, 'Ary nampianatra azy ireo zavatra be dia be izy ka nanao fanoharana hoe: “Nisy mpamafy nivoaka mba hamafy.', 'ary nampianatra azy ireo zavatra be dia be izy ka nanao fanoharana hoe: “nisy mpamafy nivoaka mba hamafy.'),
  ('6ab25c1bcb3e975f3cce96c3', '2026-09-22T10:44:43.127Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:43.127Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 13, 57, 'Dia tsy nety nino azy izy ireo. Hoy anefa i Jesosy: “Ao amin’ny faritra niaviany sy ao an-tranony ihany ny mpaminany no tsy mba hajaina.”', 'dia tsy nety nino azy izy ireo. hoy anefa i jesosy: “ao amin’ny faritra niaviany sy ao an-tranony ihany ny mpaminany no tsy mba hajaina.”'),
  ('6ab25c1bcb3e975f3cce96bc', '2026-09-22T10:44:43.127Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:43.127Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 13, 50, 'Dia hatsipiny any anaty lafaoro mirehitra ireny. Any ireny no hitomany sy hihidy vazana.', 'dia hatsipiny any anaty lafaoro mirehitra ireny. any ireny no hitomany sy hihidy vazana.'),
  ('6ab25c1bcb3e975f3cce96b5', '2026-09-22T10:44:43.127Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:43.127Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 13, 43, 'Amin’izany fotoana izany kosa dia hamirapiratra hoatran’ny masoandro ao amin’ny Fanjakan’ny Rainy ny olo-marina. Izay manan-tsofina hihainoana, aoka izy hihaino.', 'amin’izany fotoana izany kosa dia hamirapiratra hoatran’ny masoandro ao amin’ny fanjakan’ny rainy ny olo-marina. izay manan-tsofina hihainoana, aoka izy hihaino.'),
  ('6ab25c1bcb3e975f3cce96ae', '2026-09-22T10:44:43.127Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:43.127Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 13, 36, 'Rehefa avy nandrava ny vahoaka izy, dia niditra tao an-trano. Ary nanatona azy ny mpianany ka niteny hoe: “Mba hazavao aminay ny dikan’ilay fanoharana momba ny tsimparifary teny an-tanimbary.”', 'rehefa avy nandrava ny vahoaka izy, dia niditra tao an-trano. ary nanatona azy ny mpianany ka niteny hoe: “mba hazavao aminay ny dikan’ilay fanoharana momba ny tsimparifary teny an-tanimbary.”'),
  ('6ab25c1bcb3e975f3cce96a5', '2026-09-22T10:44:43.127Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:43.127Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 13, 27, 'Tonga àry ny mpanompon’ilay lehilahy ka niteny taminy hoe: ‘Angaha moa tsy voa tsara no nafafinao teny an-tanimbarinao, tompoko? Dia maninona no lasa misy tsimparifary koa?’', 'tonga àry ny mpanompon’ilay lehilahy ka niteny taminy hoe: ‘angaha moa tsy voa tsara no nafafinao teny an-tanimbarinao, tompoko? dia maninona no lasa misy tsimparifary koa?’'),
  ('6ab25c1bcb3e975f3cce96a2', '2026-09-22T10:44:43.127Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:43.127Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 13, 24, 'Nanao fanoharana hafa koa izy hoe: “Ny Fanjakan’ny lanitra dia azo oharina amin’ny lehilahy iray namafy voa tsara teny an-tanimbariny.', 'nanao fanoharana hafa koa izy hoe: “ny fanjakan’ny lanitra dia azo oharina amin’ny lehilahy iray namafy voa tsara teny an-tanimbariny.'),
  ('6ab25c1bcb3e975f3cce96ba', '2026-09-22T10:44:43.127Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:43.127Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 13, 48, 'Rehefa feno ilay harato, dia notaritin’ny mpanarato nankeo amin’ny torapasika. Dia nipetraka ry zareo ka izay trondro tsara dia nangoniny tao anaty fitoerany, fa izay ratsy kosa nariany.', 'rehefa feno ilay harato, dia notaritin’ny mpanarato nankeo amin’ny torapasika. dia nipetraka ry zareo ka izay trondro tsara dia nangoniny tao anaty fitoerany, fa izay ratsy kosa nariany.'),
  ('6ab25c1bcb3e975f3cce96a1', '2026-09-22T10:44:43.127Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:43.127Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 13, 23, 'Ary ilay nafafy teny amin’ny tany tsara, dia izay mandre ny teny ka mahazo ny dikan’ilay izy, ary tena mamoa sy mamokatra, ka misy mamoa avo 100 heny, misy 60 heny, ary misy 30 heny.”', 'ary ilay nafafy teny amin’ny tany tsara, dia izay mandre ny teny ka mahazo ny dikan’ilay izy, ary tena mamoa sy mamokatra, ka misy mamoa avo 100 heny, misy 60 heny, ary misy 30 heny.”'),
  ('6ab25c1bcb3e975f3cce969e', '2026-09-22T10:44:43.127Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:43.127Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 13, 20, 'Ilay nafafy teny amin’ny toerana be vato indray, dia izay mandre ny teny ka tonga dia faly erỳ manaiky an’ilay izy.', 'ilay nafafy teny amin’ny toerana be vato indray, dia izay mandre ny teny ka tonga dia faly erỳ manaiky an’ilay izy.'),
  ('6ab25c1bcb3e975f3cce96ac', '2026-09-22T10:44:43.127Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:43.127Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 13, 34, 'Nanao fanoharana foana i Jesosy rehefa niresaka an’izany rehetra izany tamin’ny vahoaka. Tsy niteny tamin’izy ireo tokoa izy raha tsy tamin’ny fanoharana,', 'nanao fanoharana foana i jesosy rehefa niresaka an’izany rehetra izany tamin’ny vahoaka. tsy niteny tamin’izy ireo tokoa izy raha tsy tamin’ny fanoharana,'),
  ('6ab25c1bcb3e975f3cce96aa', '2026-09-22T10:44:43.127Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:43.127Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 13, 32, 'Io voa io no kely indrindra amin’ny voa rehetra. Rehefa maniry anefa izy, dia izy no anana lehibe indrindra ka lasa hazo. Dia tonga ny voro-manidina ka manao akany eny amin’ny sampany.”', 'io voa io no kely indrindra amin’ny voa rehetra. rehefa maniry anefa izy, dia izy no anana lehibe indrindra ka lasa hazo. dia tonga ny voro-manidina ka manao akany eny amin’ny sampany.”'),
  ('6ab25c1bcb3e975f3cce969f', '2026-09-22T10:44:43.127Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:43.127Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 13, 21, 'Tsy mamaka ao am-pony anefa ny teny, fa maniry vetivety fotsiny. Koa rehefa tratran’ny zava-tsarotra na fanenjehana izy noho izy nanaiky ny teny, dia mihemotra avy hatrany.', 'tsy mamaka ao am-pony anefa ny teny, fa maniry vetivety fotsiny. koa rehefa tratran’ny zava-tsarotra na fanenjehana izy noho izy nanaiky ny teny, dia mihemotra avy hatrany.'),
  ('6ab25c1bcb3e975f3cce9694', '2026-09-22T10:44:43.127Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:43.127Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 13, 10, 'Koa nanatona azy ny mpianany ka niteny taminy hoe: “Fa maninona ianao no manao fanoharana rehefa mampianatra an-dry zareo?”', 'koa nanatona azy ny mpianany ka niteny taminy hoe: “fa maninona ianao no manao fanoharana rehefa mampianatra an-dry zareo?”'),
  ('6ab25c1bcb3e975f3cce9691', '2026-09-22T10:44:43.127Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:43.127Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 13, 7, 'Ny voa sasany indray latsaka teny amin’ny tsilo. Ary naniry ny tsilo ka nandrakotra an’ireny.', 'ny voa sasany indray latsaka teny amin’ny tsilo. ary naniry ny tsilo ka nandrakotra an’ireny.'),
  ('6ab25c1bcb3e975f3cce968c', '2026-09-22T10:44:43.127Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:43.127Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 13, 2, 'Ary nisy vahoaka be nitangorona teo aminy. Niakatra tao an-tsambokely àry izy dia nipetraka, fa ny vahoaka rehetra kosa nitsangana teo amin’ny torapasika.', 'ary nisy vahoaka be nitangorona teo aminy. niakatra tao an-tsambokely àry izy dia nipetraka, fa ny vahoaka rehetra kosa nitsangana teo amin’ny torapasika.'),
