  ('6ab25c1ce686caccc67fbab2', '2026-09-22T10:44:44.051Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:44.051Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 15, 22, 'Ary iny fa nanatona azy ny vehivavy fenisianina iray avy ao amin’ilay faritra, sady niantsoantso mafy hoe: “Mba iantrao aho, ry Tompo Zanak’i Davida ô! Mijaly be ny zanako vavy fa misy demonia.”', 'ary iny fa nanatona azy ny vehivavy fenisianina iray avy ao amin’ilay faritra, sady niantsoantso mafy hoe: “mba iantrao aho, ry tompo zanak’i davida ô! mijaly be ny zanako vavy fa misy demonia.”'),
  ('6ab25c1ce686caccc67fbaa5', '2026-09-22T10:44:44.051Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:44.051Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 15, 9, 'Reraka fotsiny izy ireo manompo ahy, satria didin’olombelona no ampianariny.’”', 'reraka fotsiny izy ireo manompo ahy, satria didin’olombelona no ampianariny.’”'),
  ('6ab25c1ce686caccc67fba9e', '2026-09-22T10:44:44.051Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:44.051Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 15, 2, '“Fa maninona ny mpianatrao no tsy manaraka ny fomban-drazana? Tsy mba manasa tanana, ohatra, ry zareo rehefa hisakafo.”', '“fa maninona ny mpianatrao no tsy manaraka ny fomban-drazana? tsy mba manasa tanana, ohatra, ry zareo rehefa hisakafo.”'),
