  ('6ab25c1ce686caccc67fbabc', '2026-09-22T10:44:44.052Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:44.052Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 15, 32, 'Ary nantsoin’i Jesosy nankeo aminy ny mpianany, ka hoy izy: “Mampalahelo ahy ireto vahoaka ireto, fa efa telo andro izao ry zareo no nijanona teto amiko, sady tsy manan-kohanina. Tsy tiako anefa raha hoe noana izy no asaina mandeha, sao ho reraka eny an-dalana.”', 'ary nantsoin’i jesosy nankeo aminy ny mpianany, ka hoy izy: “mampalahelo ahy ireto vahoaka ireto, fa efa telo andro izao ry zareo no nijanona teto amiko, sady tsy manan-kohanina. tsy tiako anefa raha hoe noana izy no asaina mandeha, sao ho reraka eny an-dalana.”'),
  ('6ab25c1ce686caccc67fbab9', '2026-09-22T10:44:44.052Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:44.052Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 15, 29, 'Niala teo i Jesosy avy eo, ka tonga tany akaikin’ny Ranomasin’i Galilia. Niakatra teny an-tendrombohitra izy, dia nipetrapetraka teo.', 'niala teo i jesosy avy eo, ka tonga tany akaikin’ny ranomasin’i galilia. niakatra teny an-tendrombohitra izy, dia nipetrapetraka teo.'),
  ('6ab25c1ce686caccc67fbab6', '2026-09-22T10:44:44.052Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:44.052Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 15, 26, 'Ary hoy izy: “Tsy mety raha alaina ny mofon-jaza ka atsipy ho an’ny alikakely.”', 'ary hoy izy: “tsy mety raha alaina ny mofon-jaza ka atsipy ho an’ny alikakely.”'),
