  ('6ab25c1ce686caccc67fbab3', '2026-09-22T10:44:44.052Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:44.052Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 15, 23, 'Tsy namaly an’ilay vehivavy mihitsy anefa izy. Nanatona azy àry ny mpianany ka niteny taminy hoe: “Asaivo mandeha any izy fa miantsoantso foana ao aorianantsika ao.”', 'tsy namaly an’ilay vehivavy mihitsy anefa izy. nanatona azy àry ny mpianany ka niteny taminy hoe: “asaivo mandeha any izy fa miantsoantso foana ao aorianantsika ao.”'),
