  ('6ab25c1c7c1a1213950a9564', '2026-09-22T10:44:44.554Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:44.554Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 16, 13, 'Rehefa tonga tao amin’ny faritr’i Kaisaria-Filipo i Jesosy, dia nanontany an’ireo mpianany hoe: “Iza, hono, ny Zanak’olona raha ny filazan’ny olona?”', 'rehefa tonga tao amin’ny faritr’i kaisaria-filipo i jesosy, dia nanontany an’ireo mpianany hoe: “iza, hono, ny zanak’olona raha ny filazan’ny olona?”'),
  ('6ab25c1c7c1a1213950a9563', '2026-09-22T10:44:44.554Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:44.554Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 16, 12, 'Dia takatr’izy ireo fa ny tiany holazaina dia hoe tokony hitandrina amin’ny fampianaran’ny Fariseo sy ny Sadoseo izy ireo, fa tsy amin’ny lalivain’ny mofo.', 'dia takatr’izy ireo fa ny tiany holazaina dia hoe tokony hitandrina amin’ny fampianaran’ny fariseo sy ny sadoseo izy ireo, fa tsy amin’ny lalivain’ny mofo.'),
  ('6ab25c1c7c1a1213950a955e', '2026-09-22T10:44:44.554Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:44.554Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 16, 7, 'Koa niady hevitra izy ireo hoe: “Angamba ilay isika tsy nitondra mofo no itenenany an’izany.”', 'koa niady hevitra izy ireo hoe: “angamba ilay isika tsy nitondra mofo no itenenany an’izany.”'),
  ('6ab25c1c7c1a1213950a955d', '2026-09-22T10:44:44.554Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:44.554Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 16, 6, 'Dia hoy i Jesosy taminy: “Mbà mailo ary mitandrema amin’ny lalivain’ny Fariseo sy ny Sadoseo.”', 'dia hoy i jesosy taminy: “mbà mailo ary mitandrema amin’ny lalivain’ny fariseo sy ny sadoseo.”'),
  ('6ab25c1c7c1a1213950a955b', '2026-09-22T10:44:44.554Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:44.554Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 16, 4, 'Mitady famantarana foana ny taranaka ratsy fanahy sy mpanitsakitsa-bady, nefa tsy hisy famantarana homena azy, afa-tsy ilay famantarana ny amin’i Jona.” Ary nilaozany ireo ka lasa izy nandeha.', 'mitady famantarana foana ny taranaka ratsy fanahy sy mpanitsakitsa-bady, nefa tsy hisy famantarana homena azy, afa-tsy ilay famantarana ny amin’i jona.” ary nilaozany ireo ka lasa izy nandeha.'),
  ('6ab25c1c7c1a1213950a955a', '2026-09-22T10:44:44.554Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:44.554Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 16, 3, 'Rehefa maraina indray, dia hoy ianareo: ‘Hangatsiaka androany dia ho avy ny orana, fa mena ny lanitra nefa manjombona.’ Hainareo fantarina avy amin’ny endriky ny lanitra ny toetrandro, saingy tsy hainareo fantarina ny dikan’ny zava-mitranga amin’izao.', 'rehefa maraina indray, dia hoy ianareo: ‘hangatsiaka androany dia ho avy ny orana, fa mena ny lanitra nefa manjombona.’ hainareo fantarina avy amin’ny endriky ny lanitra ny toetrandro, saingy tsy hainareo fantarina ny dikan’ny zava-mitranga amin’izao.'),
  ('6ab25c1c7c1a1213950a956c', '2026-09-22T10:44:44.554Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:44.554Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 16, 21, 'Nanomboka teo dia nanazava tamin’ny mpianany i Jesosy hoe tsy maintsy mankany Jerosalema izy, dia hampijalijalin’ny anti-panahy sy ny lehiben’ny mpisorona ary ny mpanora-dalàna, ka hovonoina ho faty ary hatsangana amin’ny andro fahatelo.', 'nanomboka teo dia nanazava tamin’ny mpianany i jesosy hoe tsy maintsy mankany jerosalema izy, dia hampijalijalin’ny anti-panahy sy ny lehiben’ny mpisorona ary ny mpanora-dalàna, ka hovonoina ho faty ary hatsangana amin’ny andro fahatelo.'),
  ('6ab25c1c7c1a1213950a9561', '2026-09-22T10:44:44.554Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:44.554Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 16, 10, 'Sa tsy tadidinareo ilay mofo fito ho an’ny olona 4 000, nefa firy sobika lehibe no voangonareo?', 'sa tsy tadidinareo ilay mofo fito ho an’ny olona 4 000, nefa firy sobika lehibe no voangonareo?'),
  ('6ab25c1c7c1a1213950a9569', '2026-09-22T10:44:44.554Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:44.554Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 16, 18, 'Izao koa no lazaiko aminao: Ianao no Petera, ary eto ambonin’ity vatolampy ity no haoriko ny fiangonako, ka tsy haharesy azy ny vavahadin’ny Fasana.', 'izao koa no lazaiko aminao: ianao no petera, ary eto ambonin’ity vatolampy ity no haoriko ny fiangonako, ka tsy haharesy azy ny vavahadin’ny fasana.'),
  ('6ab25c1c7c1a1213950a9567', '2026-09-22T10:44:44.554Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:44.554Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 16, 16, 'Dia namaly i Simona Petera hoe: “Ianao no Kristy, Zanak’ilay Andriamanitra velona.”', 'dia namaly i simona petera hoe: “ianao no kristy, zanak’ilay andriamanitra velona.”'),
  ('6ab25c1c7c1a1213950a9565', '2026-09-22T10:44:44.554Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:44.554Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 16, 14, 'Dia hoy ireo: “Misy milaza hoe Jaona Mpanao Batisa, misy indray miteny hoe Elia, ary misy koa miteny hoe Jeremia na ny iray amin’ny mpaminany.”', 'dia hoy ireo: “misy milaza hoe jaona mpanao batisa, misy indray miteny hoe elia, ary misy koa miteny hoe jeremia na ny iray amin’ny mpaminany.”'),
  ('6ab25c1c7c1a1213950a9566', '2026-09-22T10:44:44.554Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:44.554Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 16, 15, 'Ary hoy izy taminy: “Fa ianareo kosa milaza hoe iza aho?”', 'ary hoy izy taminy: “fa ianareo kosa milaza hoe iza aho?”');
INSERT INTO "bible_verses" ("id", "created_date", "updated_date", "created_by_id", "created_by", "translation", "book", "bookOrder", "chapter", "verse", "text", "normalizedText") VALUES
  ('6ab25c1c7c1a1213950a9562', '2026-09-22T10:44:44.554Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:44.554Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 16, 11, 'Fa maninona no tsy takatrareo fa tsy mofo no noresahiko taminareo? Fa mitandrema amin’ny lalivain’ny Fariseo sy ny Sadoseo.”', 'fa maninona no tsy takatrareo fa tsy mofo no noresahiko taminareo? fa mitandrema amin’ny lalivain’ny fariseo sy ny sadoseo.”'),
  ('6ab25c1c7c1a1213950a956b', '2026-09-22T10:44:44.554Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:44.554Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 16, 20, 'Norarany mafy ny mpianatra avy eo mba tsy hiteny na amin’iza na amin’iza hoe izy no Kristy.', 'norarany mafy ny mpianatra avy eo mba tsy hiteny na amin’iza na amin’iza hoe izy no kristy.'),
  ('6ab25c1c7c1a1213950a956a', '2026-09-22T10:44:44.554Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:44.554Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 16, 19, 'Homeko anao ny lakilen’ny Fanjakan’ny lanitra, ka izay hofatoranao eto an-tany dia efa voafatotra any an-danitra, ary izay hovahanao eto an-tany dia efa voavaha any an-danitra.”', 'homeko anao ny lakilen’ny fanjakan’ny lanitra, ka izay hofatoranao eto an-tany dia efa voafatotra any an-danitra, ary izay hovahanao eto an-tany dia efa voavaha any an-danitra.”'),
  ('6ab25c1c7c1a1213950a955c', '2026-09-22T10:44:44.554Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:44.554Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 16, 5, 'Nankeny ampitan’ny rano ny mpianatra avy eo, ary nanadino nitondra mofo.', 'nankeny ampitan’ny rano ny mpianatra avy eo, ary nanadino nitondra mofo.'),
  ('6ab25c1c7c1a1213950a9559', '2026-09-22T10:44:44.554Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:44.554Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 16, 2, 'Dia hoy izy tamin’izy ireo: “Rehefa hariva ny andro, dia hoy ianareo: ‘Ho tsara ny andro rahampitso, satria mena ny lanitra.’', 'dia hoy izy tamin’izy ireo: “rehefa hariva ny andro, dia hoy ianareo: ‘ho tsara ny andro rahampitso, satria mena ny lanitra.’'),
  ('6ab25c1c7c1a1213950a9568', '2026-09-22T10:44:44.554Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:44.554Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 16, 17, 'Ary hoy i Jesosy taminy: “Sambatra ianao, ry Simona zanak’i Jona, satria tsy olombelona no nampahafantatra an’izany anao, fa ilay Raiko any an-danitra.', 'ary hoy i jesosy taminy: “sambatra ianao, ry simona zanak’i jona, satria tsy olombelona no nampahafantatra an’izany anao, fa ilay raiko any an-danitra.'),
  ('6ab25c1c7c1a1213950a9560', '2026-09-22T10:44:44.554Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:44.554Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 16, 9, 'Angaha mbola tsy azonareo ihany, sa tsy tadidinareo ilay mofo dimy ho an’ny olona 5 000, nefa firy harona no voangonareo?', 'angaha mbola tsy azonareo ihany, sa tsy tadidinareo ilay mofo dimy ho an’ny olona 5 000, nefa firy harona no voangonareo?'),
  ('6ab25c1c7c1a1213950a956f', '2026-09-22T10:44:44.555Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:44.555Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 16, 24, 'Hoy i Jesosy tamin’ny mpianany avy eo: “Raha misy te hanaraka ahy, dia tsy maintsy mandà ny tenany izy ka mitondra ny hazo fijaliany ary manaraka ahy foana.', 'hoy i jesosy tamin’ny mpianany avy eo: “raha misy te hanaraka ahy, dia tsy maintsy mandà ny tenany izy ka mitondra ny hazo fijaliany ary manaraka ahy foana.'),
  ('6ab25c1c7c1a1213950a956d', '2026-09-22T10:44:44.555Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:44.555Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 16, 22, 'Dia nentin’i Petera nihataka kely izy ka noteneniny mafy hoe: “Mba jereo ihany izay hahasoa anao, Tompo ô! Tsy hanjo anao mihitsy izany.”', 'dia nentin’i petera nihataka kely izy ka noteneniny mafy hoe: “mba jereo ihany izay hahasoa anao, tompo ô! tsy hanjo anao mihitsy izany.”'),
  ('6ab25c1c7c1a1213950a956e', '2026-09-22T10:44:44.555Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:44.555Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 16, 23, 'Nihodina anefa izy ka niteny tamin’i Petera hoe: “Mankanesa ato aorianako, ry Satana! Vato mahatafintohina eto anoloako ianao, satria tsy fomba fisainan’Andriamanitra ny anao, fa fomba fisainan’olombelona.”', 'nihodina anefa izy ka niteny tamin’i petera hoe: “mankanesa ato aorianako, ry satana! vato mahatafintohina eto anoloako ianao, satria tsy fomba fisainan’andriamanitra ny anao, fa fomba fisainan’olombelona.”'),
  ('6ab25c1c7c1a1213950a9573', '2026-09-22T10:44:44.555Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:44.555Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 16, 28, 'Lazaiko marina aminareo fa misy amin’izay mijoro eto tsy ho faty mihitsy, raha tsy efa hitany ny Zanak’olona tonga ao amin’ny Fanjakany.”', 'lazaiko marina aminareo fa misy amin’izay mijoro eto tsy ho faty mihitsy, raha tsy efa hitany ny zanak’olona tonga ao amin’ny fanjakany.”'),
  ('6ab25c1c7c1a1213950a9572', '2026-09-22T10:44:44.555Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:44.555Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 16, 27, 'Fa ho avy amin’ny voninahitry ny Rainy ny Zanak’olona, miaraka amin’ny anjeliny, ka hamaly ny tsirairay araka izay nataony.', 'fa ho avy amin’ny voninahitry ny rainy ny zanak’olona, miaraka amin’ny anjeliny, ka hamaly ny tsirairay araka izay nataony.'),
  ('6ab25c1c7c1a1213950a9570', '2026-09-22T10:44:44.555Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:44.555Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 16, 25, 'Fa izay te hamonjy ny ainy no hamoy an’izany, ary izay mamoy ny ainy noho ny amiko kosa no hamonjy an’izany.', 'fa izay te hamonjy ny ainy no hamoy an’izany, ary izay mamoy ny ainy noho ny amiko kosa no hamonjy an’izany.'),
  ('6ab25c1c7c1a1213950a9571', '2026-09-22T10:44:44.555Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:44.555Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 16, 26, 'Ary inona tokoa moa no soa ho azon’ny olona raha azony izao tontolo izao nefa afoiny ny ainy? Sa inona no homen’ny olona ho takalon’ny ainy?', 'ary inona tokoa moa no soa ho azon’ny olona raha azony izao tontolo izao nefa afoiny ny ainy? sa inona no homen’ny olona ho takalon’ny ainy?'),
  ('6ab25c1d9adecf33fd592e9c', '2026-09-22T10:44:45.051Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:45.051Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 17, 23, 'Hovonoiny ho faty izy, ary hatsangana amin’ny andro fahatelo.” Dia nalahelo be izy ireo.', 'hovonoiny ho faty izy, ary hatsangana amin’ny andro fahatelo.” dia nalahelo be izy ireo.'),
  ('6ab25c1d9adecf33fd592e99', '2026-09-22T10:44:45.051Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:45.051Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 17, 20, 'Dia hoy izy tamin’ireo: “Satria ianareo kely finoana! Lazaiko marina aminareo fa raha manana finoana ianareo, na faran’izay kely hoatran’ny voan-tsinapy aza, ka hiteny amin’irỳ tendrombohitra irỳ hoe: ‘Mifindrà erỳ’, dia hifindra ilay izy. Ary tsy hisy tsy ho vitanareo.”', 'dia hoy izy tamin’ireo: “satria ianareo kely finoana! lazaiko marina aminareo fa raha manana finoana ianareo, na faran’izay kely hoatran’ny voan-tsinapy aza, ka hiteny amin’irỳ tendrombohitra irỳ hoe: ‘mifindrà erỳ’, dia hifindra ilay izy. ary tsy hisy tsy ho vitanareo.”'),
  ('6ab25c1d9adecf33fd592e8e', '2026-09-22T10:44:45.051Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:45.051Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 17, 9, 'Tamin’izy ireo nidina an’ilay tendrombohitra, dia hoy i Jesosy: “Aza tenenina amin’iza na iza iny fahitana iny, raha tsy efa atsangana amin’ny maty ny Zanak’olona.”', 'tamin’izy ireo nidina an’ilay tendrombohitra, dia hoy i jesosy: “aza tenenina amin’iza na iza iny fahitana iny, raha tsy efa atsangana amin’ny maty ny zanak’olona.”'),
  ('6ab25c1d9adecf33fd592e8d', '2026-09-22T10:44:45.051Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:45.051Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 17, 8, 'Dia nitraka izy ireo, ary tsy nahita afa-tsy i Jesosy irery.', 'dia nitraka izy ireo, ary tsy nahita afa-tsy i jesosy irery.'),
  ('6ab25c1d9adecf33fd592e8a', '2026-09-22T10:44:45.051Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:45.051Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 17, 5, 'Raha mbola niteny izy, dia iny fa nisy rahona namirapiratra nanaloka azy ireo. Ary nisy feo niteny avy tao amin’ilay rahona hoe: “Io no Zanako malalako, ilay ankasitrahako. Henoy izy.”', 'raha mbola niteny izy, dia iny fa nisy rahona namirapiratra nanaloka azy ireo. ary nisy feo niteny avy tao amin’ilay rahona hoe: “io no zanako malalako, ilay ankasitrahako. henoy izy.”'),
  ('6ab25c1d9adecf33fd592e94', '2026-09-22T10:44:45.051Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:45.051Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 17, 15, '“Tompo ô, mba iantrao ny zanako lahy fa voan’ny androbe, dia marary izy izao. Matetika izy no mianjera ao anaty afo, ary matetika ao anaty rano.', '“tompo ô, mba iantrao ny zanako lahy fa voan’ny androbe, dia marary izy izao. matetika izy no mianjera ao anaty afo, ary matetika ao anaty rano.'),
  ('6ab25c1d9adecf33fd592e9f', '2026-09-22T10:44:45.051Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:45.051Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 17, 26, 'Ary hoy izy: “Avy amin’ny olon-kafa.” Dia hoy i Jesosy: “Tsy mila mandoa hetra àry ny zanaka!', 'ary hoy izy: “avy amin’ny olon-kafa.” dia hoy i jesosy: “tsy mila mandoa hetra àry ny zanaka!'),
  ('6ab25c1d9adecf33fd592e97', '2026-09-22T10:44:45.051Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:45.051Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 17, 18, 'Notenenin’i Jesosy mafy avy eo ilay demonia ka nivoaka tamin’ilay ankizilahy. Dia sitrana tamin’izay ora izay ilay ankizilahy.', 'notenenin’i jesosy mafy avy eo ilay demonia ka nivoaka tamin’ilay ankizilahy. dia sitrana tamin’izay ora izay ilay ankizilahy.'),
  ('6ab25c1d9adecf33fd592e88', '2026-09-22T10:44:45.051Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:45.051Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 17, 3, 'Ary ireo fa niseho tamin’izy ireo koa i Mosesy sy Elia, niresaka tamin’i Jesosy.', 'ary ireo fa niseho tamin’izy ireo koa i mosesy sy elia, niresaka tamin’i jesosy.'),
  ('6ab25c1d9adecf33fd592e9a', '2026-09-22T10:44:45.051Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:45.051Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 17, 21, '* ——', '* ——'),
  ('6ab25c1d9adecf33fd592e96', '2026-09-22T10:44:45.051Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:45.051Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 17, 17, 'Ary hoy i Jesosy: “Ry taranaka tsy manam-pinoana sy ratsy fanahy, mandra-pahoviana aho no tsy maintsy mbola hijanona eto aminareo? Mandra-pahoviana aho no tsy maintsy handefitra aminareo? Ento atỳ amiko izy.”', 'ary hoy i jesosy: “ry taranaka tsy manam-pinoana sy ratsy fanahy, mandra-pahoviana aho no tsy maintsy mbola hijanona eto aminareo? mandra-pahoviana aho no tsy maintsy handefitra aminareo? ento atỳ amiko izy.”'),
