  ('6ab25c1d9adecf33fd592e89', '2026-09-22T10:44:45.051Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:45.051Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 17, 4, 'Dia hoy i Petera tamin’i Jesosy: “Tompo ô, faly be izahay fa eto. Raha tianao, dia hanangana tranolay telo eto aho, ka ny iray ho anao, ny iray ho an’i Mosesy, ary ny iray ho an’i Elia.”', 'dia hoy i petera tamin’i jesosy: “tompo ô, faly be izahay fa eto. raha tianao, dia hanangana tranolay telo eto aho, ka ny iray ho anao, ny iray ho an’i mosesy, ary ny iray ho an’i elia.”'),
  ('6ab25c1d9adecf33fd592e86', '2026-09-22T10:44:45.051Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:45.051Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 17, 1, 'Enina andro taorian’izay, dia nentin’i Jesosy niaraka taminy i Petera sy Jakoba ary Jaona rahalahiny, ka nentiny nitokana teny amin’ny tendrombohitra avo iray.', 'enina andro taorian’izay, dia nentin’i jesosy niaraka taminy i petera sy jakoba ary jaona rahalahiny, ka nentiny nitokana teny amin’ny tendrombohitra avo iray.'),
  ('6ab25c1d9adecf33fd592e9d', '2026-09-22T10:44:45.051Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:45.051Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 17, 24, 'Rehefa tonga tao Kapernaomy izy ireo, dia nanatona an’i Petera ny lehilahy namory ny hetra roa drakma, ka nanontany hoe: “Angaha tsy mandoa hetra ny mpampianatra anareo?”', 'rehefa tonga tao kapernaomy izy ireo, dia nanatona an’i petera ny lehilahy namory ny hetra roa drakma, ka nanontany hoe: “angaha tsy mandoa hetra ny mpampianatra anareo?”'),
  ('6ab25c1d9adecf33fd592e98', '2026-09-22T10:44:45.051Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:45.051Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 17, 19, 'Ary nanatona an’i Jesosy mitokana ny mpianany ka nanontany hoe: “Fa maninona no tsy vitanay ny namoaka an’iny?”', 'ary nanatona an’i jesosy mitokana ny mpianany ka nanontany hoe: “fa maninona no tsy vitanay ny namoaka an’iny?”'),
  ('6ab25c1d9adecf33fd592e90', '2026-09-22T10:44:45.051Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:45.051Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 17, 11, 'Dia namaly izy hoe: “Tena ho avy i Elia, ary haveriny amin’ny laoniny ny zava-drehetra.', 'dia namaly izy hoe: “tena ho avy i elia, ary haveriny amin’ny laoniny ny zava-drehetra.'),
  ('6ab25c1d9adecf33fd592e87', '2026-09-22T10:44:45.051Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:45.051Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 17, 2, 'Ary niova tarehy teo anatrehan’ireo izy. Dia namirapiratra hoatran’ny masoandro ny tarehiny, ary lasa nanjelanjelatra toy ny hazavana ny akanjony ivelany.', 'ary niova tarehy teo anatrehan’ireo izy. dia namirapiratra hoatran’ny masoandro ny tarehiny, ary lasa nanjelanjelatra toy ny hazavana ny akanjony ivelany.'),
  ('6ab25c1d9adecf33fd592e9e', '2026-09-22T10:44:45.051Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:45.051Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 17, 25, 'Dia hoy izy: “Mandoa izy ka!” Rehefa niditra tao an-trano anefa i Petera, dia notsenain’i Jesosy tamin’ny fanontaniana hoe: “Ahoana ny hevitrao, ry Simona? Avy amin’iza no ahazoan’ny mpanjaka eto an-tany haba na hetra isan-dahy? Avy amin’ny zanany sa avy amin’ny olon-kafa?”', 'dia hoy izy: “mandoa izy ka!” rehefa niditra tao an-trano anefa i petera, dia notsenain’i jesosy tamin’ny fanontaniana hoe: “ahoana ny hevitrao, ry simona? avy amin’iza no ahazoan’ny mpanjaka eto an-tany haba na hetra isan-dahy? avy amin’ny zanany sa avy amin’ny olon-kafa?”'),
  ('6ab25c1d9adecf33fd592e9b', '2026-09-22T10:44:45.051Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:45.051Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 17, 22, 'Rehefa tafavory tao Galilia izy ireo, dia hoy i Jesosy: “Efa hisy hamadika ny Zanak’olona dia hatolotra eo am-pelatanan’ny olona.', 'rehefa tafavory tao galilia izy ireo, dia hoy i jesosy: “efa hisy hamadika ny zanak’olona dia hatolotra eo am-pelatanan’ny olona.'),
  ('6ab25c1d9adecf33fd592e8b', '2026-09-22T10:44:45.051Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:45.051Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 17, 6, 'Dia natahotra be ny mpianatra rehefa naheno an’izany, ka niankohoka tamin’ny tany.', 'dia natahotra be ny mpianatra rehefa naheno an’izany, ka niankohoka tamin’ny tany.'),
  ('6ab25c1d9adecf33fd592ea0', '2026-09-22T10:44:45.051Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:45.051Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 17, 27, 'Mba tsy hahatonga antsika hanafintohina an-dry zareo anefa, dia mandehana any an-dranomasina ary manipaza lelam-pintana, ka raiso izay trondro azonao voalohany. Rehefa sokafanao ny vavany, dia hahita sekely volafotsy iray ianao. Alaivo ilay izy dia omeo azy, ho hetrantsika sy ianao.”', 'mba tsy hahatonga antsika hanafintohina an-dry zareo anefa, dia mandehana any an-dranomasina ary manipaza lelam-pintana, ka raiso izay trondro azonao voalohany. rehefa sokafanao ny vavany, dia hahita sekely volafotsy iray ianao. alaivo ilay izy dia omeo azy, ho hetrantsika sy ianao.”'),
  ('6ab25c1d9adecf33fd592e8c', '2026-09-22T10:44:45.051Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:45.051Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 17, 7, 'Ary nanatona i Jesosy ka nikasika azy ireo, sady niteny hoe: “Mitsangàna fa aza matahotra.”', 'ary nanatona i jesosy ka nikasika azy ireo, sady niteny hoe: “mitsangàna fa aza matahotra.”'),
  ('6ab25c1d9adecf33fd592e92', '2026-09-22T10:44:45.051Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:45.051Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 17, 13, 'Dia takatry ny mpianatra fa i Jaona Mpanao Batisa no tiany horesahina.', 'dia takatry ny mpianatra fa i jaona mpanao batisa no tiany horesahina.'),
  ('6ab25c1d9adecf33fd592e95', '2026-09-22T10:44:45.051Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:45.051Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 17, 16, 'Nentiko tatỳ amin’ny mpianatrao izy, saingy tsy vitan’izy ireo ny nanasitrana azy.”', 'nentiko tatỳ amin’ny mpianatrao izy, saingy tsy vitan’izy ireo ny nanasitrana azy.”'),
  ('6ab25c1d9adecf33fd592e93', '2026-09-22T10:44:45.051Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:45.051Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 17, 14, 'Rehefa nankeo amin’ny vahoaka izy ireo, dia nisy lehilahy nanatona azy ka nandohalika teo anatrehany sady niteny hoe:', 'rehefa nankeo amin’ny vahoaka izy ireo, dia nisy lehilahy nanatona azy ka nandohalika teo anatrehany sady niteny hoe:'),
  ('6ab25c1d9adecf33fd592e91', '2026-09-22T10:44:45.051Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:45.051Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 17, 12, 'Lazaiko aminareo anefa fa efa tonga i Elia, saingy tsy fantatry ny olona izy dia nataony taminy izay rehetra tiany hanaovana azy. Hijalijaly hoatr’izany koa ny Zanak’olona, eo am-pelatanan’izy ireo.”', 'lazaiko aminareo anefa fa efa tonga i elia, saingy tsy fantatry ny olona izy dia nataony taminy izay rehetra tiany hanaovana azy. hijalijaly hoatr’izany koa ny zanak’olona, eo am-pelatanan’izy ireo.”'),
  ('6ab25c1d8f29dbdda53c3ed7', '2026-09-22T10:44:45.570Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:45.570Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 18, 21, 'Nanatona azy i Petera avy eo ka nanontany hoe: “Tompo ô, raha manota amiko impiry ny rahalahiko no havelako ny helony? Hatramin’ny impito ve?”', 'nanatona azy i petera avy eo ka nanontany hoe: “tompo ô, raha manota amiko impiry ny rahalahiko no havelako ny helony? hatramin’ny impito ve?”'),
  ('6ab25c1d8f29dbdda53c3ed4', '2026-09-22T10:44:45.570Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:45.570Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 18, 18, '“Lazaiko marina aminareo fa izay zavatra rehetra hofatoranareo eto an-tany dia efa voafatotra any an-danitra, ary izay rehetra hovahanareo eto an-tany dia efa voavaha any an-danitra.', '“lazaiko marina aminareo fa izay zavatra rehetra hofatoranareo eto an-tany dia efa voafatotra any an-danitra, ary izay rehetra hovahanareo eto an-tany dia efa voavaha any an-danitra.'),
  ('6ab25c1d8f29dbdda53c3eca', '2026-09-22T10:44:45.570Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:45.570Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 18, 8, 'Raha mahatonga anao hanota àry ny tananao na ny tongotrao, dia tapaho ka ario lavitra anao. Fa aleo ianao tapa-tanana na tapa-tongotra nefa mahazo fiainana, toy izay manana tanana roa na tongotra roa nefa hatsipy any amin’ny afo maharitra mandrakizay.', 'raha mahatonga anao hanota àry ny tananao na ny tongotrao, dia tapaho ka ario lavitra anao. fa aleo ianao tapa-tanana na tapa-tongotra nefa mahazo fiainana, toy izay manana tanana roa na tongotra roa nefa hatsipy any amin’ny afo maharitra mandrakizay.'),
  ('6ab25c1d8f29dbdda53c3ec7', '2026-09-22T10:44:45.570Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:45.570Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 18, 5, 'Ary izay mandray zaza hoatran’ity amin’ny anarako, dia mandray ahy.', 'ary izay mandray zaza hoatran’ity amin’ny anarako, dia mandray ahy.'),
  ('6ab25c1d8f29dbdda53c3ed8', '2026-09-22T10:44:45.570Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:45.570Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 18, 22, 'Dia hoy i Jesosy taminy: “Tsy hilaza aminao aho hoe hatramin’ny im-7, fa hatramin’ny im-77.', 'dia hoy i jesosy taminy: “tsy hilaza aminao aho hoe hatramin’ny im-7, fa hatramin’ny im-77.'),
  ('6ab25c1d8f29dbdda53c3ed6', '2026-09-22T10:44:45.570Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:45.570Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 18, 20, 'Fa na aiza na aiza ivorian’ny olona roa na telo amin’ny anarako, dia eo afovoany aho.”', 'fa na aiza na aiza ivorian’ny olona roa na telo amin’ny anarako, dia eo afovoany aho.”'),
  ('6ab25c1d8f29dbdda53c3ed3', '2026-09-22T10:44:45.570Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:45.570Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 18, 17, 'Raha tsy mihaino an’ireo izy, dia miresaha amin’ny fiangonana. Raha mbola tsy mihaino ny fiangonana koa izy, dia ataovy toy ny olon’izao tontolo izao sy toy ny mpamory hetra.', 'raha tsy mihaino an’ireo izy, dia miresaha amin’ny fiangonana. raha mbola tsy mihaino ny fiangonana koa izy, dia ataovy toy ny olon’izao tontolo izao sy toy ny mpamory hetra.'),
  ('6ab25c1d8f29dbdda53c3ec9', '2026-09-22T10:44:45.570Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:45.570Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 18, 7, '“Hahita loza izao tontolo izao, noho izy mametraka vato mahatafintohina! Marina fa tsy maintsy misy ny vato mahatafintohina, kanefa hahita loza izay mametraka an’izany!', '“hahita loza izao tontolo izao, noho izy mametraka vato mahatafintohina! marina fa tsy maintsy misy ny vato mahatafintohina, kanefa hahita loza izay mametraka an’izany!'),
  ('6ab25c1d8f29dbdda53c3ec8', '2026-09-22T10:44:45.570Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:45.570Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 18, 6, 'Fa na iza na iza mametraka vato mahatafintohina eo anoloan’ny iray amin’ireny madinika mino ahy ireny, dia tsara raha asiana vato lehibe fikosoham-bary ny vozony, ka alentika any an-dranomasina lalina izy.', 'fa na iza na iza mametraka vato mahatafintohina eo anoloan’ny iray amin’ireny madinika mino ahy ireny, dia tsara raha asiana vato lehibe fikosoham-bary ny vozony, ka alentika any an-dranomasina lalina izy.'),
  ('6ab25c1d8f29dbdda53c3ec4', '2026-09-22T10:44:45.570Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:45.570Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 18, 2, 'Dia niantso zaza anankiray hankeo aminy i Jesosy, ka nasainy nitsangana teo afovoany ilay zaza,', 'dia niantso zaza anankiray hankeo aminy i jesosy, ka nasainy nitsangana teo afovoany ilay zaza,'),
  ('6ab25c1d8f29dbdda53c3ed2', '2026-09-22T10:44:45.570Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:45.570Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 18, 16, 'Raha tsy mihaino kosa izy, dia mitondrà olona iray na roa miaraka aminao, mba ho azo antoka ny zava-drehetra, noho ny tenin’ny vavolombelona roa na telo.', 'raha tsy mihaino kosa izy, dia mitondrà olona iray na roa miaraka aminao, mba ho azo antoka ny zava-drehetra, noho ny tenin’ny vavolombelona roa na telo.'),
  ('6ab25c1d8f29dbdda53c3ec5', '2026-09-22T10:44:45.570Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:45.570Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 18, 3, 'sady hoy izy: “Lazaiko marina aminareo fa raha tsy miova tanteraka ianareo ka lasa toy ny zaza, dia tsy hiditra ao amin’ny Fanjakan’ny lanitra mihitsy.', 'sady hoy izy: “lazaiko marina aminareo fa raha tsy miova tanteraka ianareo ka lasa toy ny zaza, dia tsy hiditra ao amin’ny fanjakan’ny lanitra mihitsy.'),
  ('6ab25c1d8f29dbdda53c3ed1', '2026-09-22T10:44:45.570Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:45.570Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 18, 15, '“Raha manota ny rahalahinao, dia mankanesa any aminy, ka rehefa mitokana ianareo, dia ampahafantaro azy ny fahadisoany. Raha mihaino anao izy, dia efa nahatafarina ny rahalahinao ianao.', '“raha manota ny rahalahinao, dia mankanesa any aminy, ka rehefa mitokana ianareo, dia ampahafantaro azy ny fahadisoany. raha mihaino anao izy, dia efa nahatafarina ny rahalahinao ianao.'),
  ('6ab25c1d8f29dbdda53c3ed0', '2026-09-22T10:44:45.570Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:45.570Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 18, 14, 'Hoatr’izany koa fa tsy tian’ilay Raiko any an-danitra hisy ho very, na dia ny iray amin’ireny madinika ireny aza.', 'hoatr’izany koa fa tsy tian’ilay raiko any an-danitra hisy ho very, na dia ny iray amin’ireny madinika ireny aza.'),
  ('6ab25c1d8f29dbdda53c3ecc', '2026-09-22T10:44:45.570Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:45.570Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 18, 10, 'Tandremo sao manao tsinontsinona ny iray amin’ireny madinika ireny ianareo. Fa lazaiko aminareo fa ny anjelin’izy ireo any an-danitra dia miaraka foana amin’ilay Raiko any an-danitra.', 'tandremo sao manao tsinontsinona ny iray amin’ireny madinika ireny ianareo. fa lazaiko aminareo fa ny anjelin’izy ireo any an-danitra dia miaraka foana amin’ilay raiko any an-danitra.'),
  ('6ab25c1d8f29dbdda53c3ecb', '2026-09-22T10:44:45.570Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:45.570Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 18, 9, 'Raha mahatonga anao hanota koa ny masonao, dia esory ka ario lavitra anao. Fa aleo ianao toka-maso nefa miditra any amin’ny fiainana, toy izay manana maso roa nefa hatsipy any amin’ny Gehena mirehitra.', 'raha mahatonga anao hanota koa ny masonao, dia esory ka ario lavitra anao. fa aleo ianao toka-maso nefa miditra any amin’ny fiainana, toy izay manana maso roa nefa hatsipy any amin’ny gehena mirehitra.'),
