  ('6ab25c1e178e55ab1e9beba0', '2026-09-22T10:44:46.493Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:46.493Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 20, 18, '“Miakatra ho any Jerosalema isika izao. Ary hatolotra amin’ny lehiben’ny mpisorona sy ny mpanora-dalàna ny Zanak’olona. Dia homelohin’izy ireo ho faty izy,', '“miakatra ho any jerosalema isika izao. ary hatolotra amin’ny lehiben’ny mpisorona sy ny mpanora-dalàna ny zanak’olona. dia homelohin’izy ireo ho faty izy,'),
  ('6ab25c1e178e55ab1e9beba6', '2026-09-22T10:44:46.493Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:46.493Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 20, 24, 'Ary tezitra tamin’izy mirahalahy izy folo lahy rehefa naheno an’izany.', 'ary tezitra tamin’izy mirahalahy izy folo lahy rehefa naheno an’izany.'),
  ('6ab25c1e178e55ab1e9bebac', '2026-09-22T10:44:46.493Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:46.493Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 20, 30, 'Nisy jamba roa lahy nipetraka teo amoron-dalana, ka rehefa henon’izy ireo fa nandalo i Jesosy, dia niantsoantso izy ireo hoe: “Ry Tompo Zanak’i Davida ô, mba iantrao izahay!”', 'nisy jamba roa lahy nipetraka teo amoron-dalana, ka rehefa henon’izy ireo fa nandalo i jesosy, dia niantsoantso izy ireo hoe: “ry tompo zanak’i davida ô, mba iantrao izahay!”'),
  ('6ab25c1e178e55ab1e9beba7', '2026-09-22T10:44:46.493Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:46.493Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 20, 25, 'Nantsoin’i Jesosy hankeo aminy anefa izy ireo, dia noteneniny hoe: “Fantatrareo fa manjakazaka amin’ny firenena entiny ny mpitondra, ary manampatra fahefana ireo lehibe.', 'nantsoin’i jesosy hankeo aminy anefa izy ireo, dia noteneniny hoe: “fantatrareo fa manjakazaka amin’ny firenena entiny ny mpitondra, ary manampatra fahefana ireo lehibe.'),
  ('6ab25c1e178e55ab1e9beba1', '2026-09-22T10:44:46.493Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:46.493Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 20, 19, 'ary hatolony amin’ny hafa firenena mba hihomehezany sy hokaravasiny ary hovonoiny eo amin’ny tsato-kazo. Dia hatsangana izy amin’ny andro fahatelo.”', 'ary hatolony amin’ny hafa firenena mba hihomehezany sy hokaravasiny ary hovonoiny eo amin’ny tsato-kazo. dia hatsangana izy amin’ny andro fahatelo.”'),
  ('6ab25c1e178e55ab1e9beba4', '2026-09-22T10:44:46.493Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:46.493Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 20, 22, 'Dia hoy i Jesosy: “Tsy azonareo an-tsaina mihitsy izany angatahinareo izany. Vitanareo ve ny hisotro amin’ilay kaopy isotroako?” Dia hoy ireo: “Vitanay izany ka!”', 'dia hoy i jesosy: “tsy azonareo an-tsaina mihitsy izany angatahinareo izany. vitanareo ve ny hisotro amin’ilay kaopy isotroako?” dia hoy ireo: “vitanay izany ka!”'),
  ('6ab25c1e178e55ab1e9bebad', '2026-09-22T10:44:46.493Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:46.493Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 20, 31, 'Ary nibedy azy roa lahy ny vahoaka sady niteny azy mba hangina, nefa vao mainka izy ireo niantsoantso mafy hoe: “Ry Tompo Zanak’i Davida ô, mba iantrao izahay!”', 'ary nibedy azy roa lahy ny vahoaka sady niteny azy mba hangina, nefa vao mainka izy ireo niantsoantso mafy hoe: “ry tompo zanak’i davida ô, mba iantrao izahay!”'),
  ('6ab25c1e178e55ab1e9beba2', '2026-09-22T10:44:46.493Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:46.493Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 20, 20, 'Ary nanatona azy ny renin’izy roa lahy zanak’i Zebedio, niaraka tamin’izy mirahalahy. Dia niankohoka ilay ramatoa satria te hangataka zavatra taminy.', 'ary nanatona azy ny renin’izy roa lahy zanak’i zebedio, niaraka tamin’izy mirahalahy. dia niankohoka ilay ramatoa satria te hangataka zavatra taminy.'),
  ('6ab25c1e178e55ab1e9bebaf', '2026-09-22T10:44:46.493Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:46.493Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 20, 33, 'Dia hoy ireo taminy: “Tompo ô, mba ataovy mahita ny masonay!”', 'dia hoy ireo taminy: “tompo ô, mba ataovy mahita ny masonay!”'),
  ('6ab25c1e178e55ab1e9beba5', '2026-09-22T10:44:46.493Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:46.493Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 20, 23, 'Ary hoy izy tamin’ireo: “Hisotro amin’ny kaopiko tokoa ianareo. Tsy anjarako anefa ny manendry an’izay hipetraka eo ankavanako sy eo ankaviako, fa izay nofidin’ny Raiko ihany no hahazo an’izany toerana izany.”', 'ary hoy izy tamin’ireo: “hisotro amin’ny kaopiko tokoa ianareo. tsy anjarako anefa ny manendry an’izay hipetraka eo ankavanako sy eo ankaviako, fa izay nofidin’ny raiko ihany no hahazo an’izany toerana izany.”'),
  ('6ab25c1e178e55ab1e9beba3', '2026-09-22T10:44:46.493Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:46.493Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 20, 21, 'Ary hoy i Jesosy: “Fa inona no tadiavinao?” Dia hoy ilay ramatoa: “Rehefa ao amin’ny Fanjakanao ianao, dia aleo re mba hipetraka eo akaikinao ireto zanako ireto e! Dia ny iray eo ankavananao, ary ny iray eo ankavianao.”', 'ary hoy i jesosy: “fa inona no tadiavinao?” dia hoy ilay ramatoa: “rehefa ao amin’ny fanjakanao ianao, dia aleo re mba hipetraka eo akaikinao ireto zanako ireto e! dia ny iray eo ankavananao, ary ny iray eo ankavianao.”'),
  ('6ab25c1e178e55ab1e9bebab', '2026-09-22T10:44:46.493Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:46.493Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 20, 29, 'Rehefa nivoaka avy tao Jeriko izy ireo, dia nisy vahoaka be nanaraka azy.', 'rehefa nivoaka avy tao jeriko izy ireo, dia nisy vahoaka be nanaraka azy.'),
  ('6ab25c1e178e55ab1e9beba9', '2026-09-22T10:44:46.493Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:46.493Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 20, 27, 'ary izay te ho voalohany aminareo dia tsy maintsy manompo anareo.', 'ary izay te ho voalohany aminareo dia tsy maintsy manompo anareo.'),
  ('6ab25c1fa042bf657140b139', '2026-09-22T10:44:47.014Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:47.014Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 21, 22, 'Ary ho azonareo daholo izay angatahinareo amin’ny vavaka, raha manam-pinoana ianareo.”', 'ary ho azonareo daholo izay angatahinareo amin’ny vavaka, raha manam-pinoana ianareo.”'),
  ('6ab25c1fa042bf657140b136', '2026-09-22T10:44:47.014Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:47.014Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 21, 19, 'Nahita aviavy teo amoron-dalana izy ka nankeo, nefa tsy nahita afa-tsy raviny fotsiny. Ary hoy izy tamin’ilay hazo: “Enga anie tsy hamoa intsony ianao mandrakizay!” Dia tonga dia nalazo ilay hazo.', 'nahita aviavy teo amoron-dalana izy ka nankeo, nefa tsy nahita afa-tsy raviny fotsiny. ary hoy izy tamin’ilay hazo: “enga anie tsy hamoa intsony ianao mandrakizay!” dia tonga dia nalazo ilay hazo.'),
  ('6ab25c1fa042bf657140b14e', '2026-09-22T10:44:47.014Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:47.014Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 21, 43, 'Izao àry no lazaiko aminareo: Hesorina aminareo ny Fanjakan’Andriamanitra, ka homena an’izay firenena mamokatra voa mendrika an’ilay Fanjakana.', 'izao àry no lazaiko aminareo: hesorina aminareo ny fanjakan’andriamanitra, ka homena an’izay firenena mamokatra voa mendrika an’ilay fanjakana.'),
  ('6ab25c1fa042bf657140b143', '2026-09-22T10:44:47.014Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:47.014Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 21, 32, 'Fa tonga teo aminareo i Jaona ka nampianatra ny lalan’ny fahamarinana, kanefa tsy nino azy ianareo. Ny mpamory hetra sy ny mpivaro-tena kosa nino azy. Ary na dia efa nahita an’izany aza ianareo, dia mbola tsy nanenina ihany, sady tsy nino azy.', 'fa tonga teo aminareo i jaona ka nampianatra ny lalan’ny fahamarinana, kanefa tsy nino azy ianareo. ny mpamory hetra sy ny mpivaro-tena kosa nino azy. ary na dia efa nahita an’izany aza ianareo, dia mbola tsy nanenina ihany, sady tsy nino azy.'),
  ('6ab25c1fa042bf657140b13b', '2026-09-22T10:44:47.014Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:47.014Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 21, 24, 'Dia hoy i Jesosy: “Izaho koa mba hanontany zavatra iray aminareo. Raha valianareo ilay izy, dia holazaiko aminareo koa hoe avy aiza ny fahefana anaovako an’izao:', 'dia hoy i jesosy: “izaho koa mba hanontany zavatra iray aminareo. raha valianareo ilay izy, dia holazaiko aminareo koa hoe avy aiza ny fahefana anaovako an’izao:'),
  ('6ab25c1fa042bf657140b12f', '2026-09-22T10:44:47.014Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:47.014Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 21, 12, 'Ary niditra tao amin’ny tempoly i Jesosy ka noroahiny daholo izay nivarotra sy nividy tao. Nazerany koa ny latabatry ny mpanakalo vola sy ny fipetrahan’ny mpivarotra voromailala.', 'ary niditra tao amin’ny tempoly i jesosy ka noroahiny daholo izay nivarotra sy nividy tao. nazerany koa ny latabatry ny mpanakalo vola sy ny fipetrahan’ny mpivarotra voromailala.'),
  ('6ab25c1fa042bf657140b126', '2026-09-22T10:44:47.014Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:47.014Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 21, 3, 'Ary raha misy manontany anareo, dia teneno hoe: ‘Misy ilan’ny Tompo azy.’ Dia tonga dia halefany ireo.”', 'ary raha misy manontany anareo, dia teneno hoe: ‘misy ilan’ny tompo azy.’ dia tonga dia halefany ireo.”'),
  ('6ab25c1fa042bf657140b14b', '2026-09-22T10:44:47.014Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:47.014Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 21, 40, 'Rehefa tonga àry ilay tompon’ny tanimboaloboka, dia hataony ahoana ireo mpamboly ireo?”', 'rehefa tonga àry ilay tompon’ny tanimboaloboka, dia hataony ahoana ireo mpamboly ireo?”'),
  ('6ab25c1fa042bf657140b14a', '2026-09-22T10:44:47.014Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:47.014Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 21, 39, 'Koa nosamborin’ireo izy ka notaritaritiny teny ivelan’ny tanimboaloboka, dia novonoiny ho faty.', 'koa nosamborin’ireo izy ka notaritaritiny teny ivelan’ny tanimboaloboka, dia novonoiny ho faty.'),
  ('6ab25c1fa042bf657140b144', '2026-09-22T10:44:47.014Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:47.014Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 21, 33, '“Henoy indray izao fanoharana izao: Nanana tany ny lehilahy iray ka nanao tanimboaloboka, ary nofefeny ny manodidina. Dia nihady lavaka famiazam-boaloboka teo izy ary nanangana tilikambo. Nampanofainy tamin’ny mpamboly ilay izy avy eo, dia lasa nankany an-tany hafa izy.', '“henoy indray izao fanoharana izao: nanana tany ny lehilahy iray ka nanao tanimboaloboka, ary nofefeny ny manodidina. dia nihady lavaka famiazam-boaloboka teo izy ary nanangana tilikambo. nampanofainy tamin’ny mpamboly ilay izy avy eo, dia lasa nankany an-tany hafa izy.'),
  ('6ab25c1fa042bf657140b142', '2026-09-22T10:44:47.014Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:47.014Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 21, 31, 'Iza amin’izy mirahalahy àry no nanao ny sitrapon’ny rainy?” Dia hoy ireo: “Ilay voalohany.” Ary hoy i Jesosy taminy: “Lazaiko marina aminareo fa ny mpamory hetra sy ny mpivaro-tena no hiditra alohanareo any amin’ny Fanjakan’Andriamanitra.', 'iza amin’izy mirahalahy àry no nanao ny sitrapon’ny rainy?” dia hoy ireo: “ilay voalohany.” ary hoy i jesosy taminy: “lazaiko marina aminareo fa ny mpamory hetra sy ny mpivaro-tena no hiditra alohanareo any amin’ny fanjakan’andriamanitra.'),
  ('6ab25c1fa042bf657140b132', '2026-09-22T10:44:47.014Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:47.014Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 21, 15, 'Ary tezitra ny lehiben’ny mpisorona sy ny mpanora-dalàna, rehefa nahita ny zava-mahagaga nataony sy ny ankizilahy niantsoantso mafy tao amin’ny tempoly hoe: “Mba vonjeo re ny Zanak’i Davida e!”', 'ary tezitra ny lehiben’ny mpisorona sy ny mpanora-dalàna, rehefa nahita ny zava-mahagaga nataony sy ny ankizilahy niantsoantso mafy tao amin’ny tempoly hoe: “mba vonjeo re ny zanak’i davida e!”'),
  ('6ab25c1fa042bf657140b128', '2026-09-22T10:44:47.014Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:47.014Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 21, 5, '“Teneno i Ziona zanakavavy hoe: ‘Iny tonga atỳ aminao iny ny mpanjakanao. Malemy fanahy izy, ary mitaingina ampondra, dia zanak’ampondra, izay zanaky ny biby mpitondra entana.’”', '“teneno i ziona zanakavavy hoe: ‘iny tonga atỳ aminao iny ny mpanjakanao. malemy fanahy izy, ary mitaingina ampondra, dia zanak’ampondra, izay zanaky ny biby mpitondra entana.’”'),
  ('6ab25c1fa042bf657140b125', '2026-09-22T10:44:47.014Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:47.014Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 21, 2, 'Hoy izy: “Mandehana ao amin’irỳ tanàna kely irỳ. Tonga dia hahita ampondra mifatotra miaraka amin’ny zanany ianareo ao. Vahao ireo dia ento atỳ amiko.', 'hoy izy: “mandehana ao amin’irỳ tanàna kely irỳ. tonga dia hahita ampondra mifatotra miaraka amin’ny zanany ianareo ao. vahao ireo dia ento atỳ amiko.'),
  ('6ab25c1fa042bf657140b12a', '2026-09-22T10:44:47.014Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:47.014Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 21, 7, 'Nentin’izy roa lahy ilay ampondra sy ny zanany, ka napetrany teo ambonin’ireo ny akanjon’izy ireo ivelany, dia nitaingina teo i Jesosy.', 'nentin’izy roa lahy ilay ampondra sy ny zanany, ka napetrany teo ambonin’ireo ny akanjon’izy ireo ivelany, dia nitaingina teo i jesosy.'),
  ('6ab25c1fa042bf657140b149', '2026-09-22T10:44:47.014Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:47.014Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 21, 38, 'Rehefa nahita an’ilay zanany anefa ny mpamboly, dia nifampiresaka hoe: ‘Iny ny mpandova! Andao izy hovonointsika, dia amin’izay lasantsika ny lovany!’', 'rehefa nahita an’ilay zanany anefa ny mpamboly, dia nifampiresaka hoe: ‘iny ny mpandova! andao izy hovonointsika, dia amin’izay lasantsika ny lovany!’'),
  ('6ab25c1fa042bf657140b129', '2026-09-22T10:44:47.014Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:47.014Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 21, 6, 'Dia lasa ireo mpianatra ireo nanao an’izay nasain’i Jesosy nataony.', 'dia lasa ireo mpianatra ireo nanao an’izay nasain’i jesosy nataony.'),
  ('6ab25c1fa042bf657140b14d', '2026-09-22T10:44:47.014Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:47.014Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 21, 42, 'Ary hoy i Jesosy taminy: “Angaha mbola tsy novakinareo tao amin’ny Soratra Masina mihitsy ilay hoe: ‘Ny vato tsy tian’ny mpanao trano no lasa vato fehizoro lehibe indrindra. Avy amin’i Jehovah izany sady mahavariana antsika’?', 'ary hoy i jesosy taminy: “angaha mbola tsy novakinareo tao amin’ny soratra masina mihitsy ilay hoe: ‘ny vato tsy tian’ny mpanao trano no lasa vato fehizoro lehibe indrindra. avy amin’i jehovah izany sady mahavariana antsika’?'),
  ('6ab25c1fa042bf657140b13e', '2026-09-22T10:44:47.014Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:47.014Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 21, 27, 'Hoy àry izy ireo tamin’i Jesosy: “Tsy fantatray.” Dia hoy i Jesosy: “Izaho koa tsy hiteny aminareo hoe fahefana avy aiza no anaovako an’izao.', 'hoy àry izy ireo tamin’i jesosy: “tsy fantatray.” dia hoy i jesosy: “izaho koa tsy hiteny aminareo hoe fahefana avy aiza no anaovako an’izao.'),
  ('6ab25c1fa042bf657140b13d', '2026-09-22T10:44:47.014Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:47.014Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 21, 26, 'Raha miteny anefa isika hoe: ‘Avy amin’ny olona’, dia ny vahoaka indray no atahorantsika, satria mihevitra daholo ry zareo hoe mpaminany i Jaona.”', 'raha miteny anefa isika hoe: ‘avy amin’ny olona’, dia ny vahoaka indray no atahorantsika, satria mihevitra daholo ry zareo hoe mpaminany i jaona.”'),
  ('6ab25c1fa042bf657140b138', '2026-09-22T10:44:47.014Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:47.014Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 21, 21, 'Dia namaly azy ireo i Jesosy hoe: “Lazaiko marina aminareo fa raha manam-pinoana ianareo ka tsy misalasala, dia ho vitanareo izay nataoko tamin’ilay aviavy. Raha miteny amin’ity tendrombohitra ity koa aza ianareo hoe: ‘Mialà eto dia mianjerà any an-dranomasina’, dia hitranga tokoa izany.', 'dia namaly azy ireo i jesosy hoe: “lazaiko marina aminareo fa raha manam-pinoana ianareo ka tsy misalasala, dia ho vitanareo izay nataoko tamin’ilay aviavy. raha miteny amin’ity tendrombohitra ity koa aza ianareo hoe: ‘mialà eto dia mianjerà any an-dranomasina’, dia hitranga tokoa izany.'),
  ('6ab25c1fa042bf657140b12b', '2026-09-22T10:44:47.014Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:47.014Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 21, 8, 'Ny ankamaroan’ny vahoaka kosa namelatra ny akanjony ivelany teo amin’ny lalana. Nisy indray nanapaka sampan-kazo dia namelatra an’izany teo amin’ny lalana.', 'ny ankamaroan’ny vahoaka kosa namelatra ny akanjony ivelany teo amin’ny lalana. nisy indray nanapaka sampan-kazo dia namelatra an’izany teo amin’ny lalana.'),
