  ('6ab25c1fa042bf657140b13f', '2026-09-22T10:44:47.014Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:47.014Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 21, 28, '“Ahoana ny hevitrareo? Nisy lehilahy nanan-janaka roa lahy. Nankeo amin’ilay voalohany izy ka niteny hoe: ‘Mandehana, anaka, miasa any an-tanimboaloboka androany.’', '“ahoana ny hevitrareo? nisy lehilahy nanan-janaka roa lahy. nankeo amin’ilay voalohany izy ka niteny hoe: ‘mandehana, anaka, miasa any an-tanimboaloboka androany.’'),
