  ('6ab25c2263ca2f0681d1adc0', '2026-09-22T10:44:50.330Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:50.330Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 23, 5, 'Izay rehetra ataony dia ataony mba hisehosehoana amin’ny olona fotsiny. Halehibeaziny, ohatra, ny azy ilay boaty misy andininy ao amin’ny Soratra Masina, izay ataony eny aminy mba ho ody fiaro. Ary ataony lava kokoa ny mikiramborambo amin’ny morontongotr’akanjony.', 'izay rehetra ataony dia ataony mba hisehosehoana amin’ny olona fotsiny. halehibeaziny, ohatra, ny azy ilay boaty misy andininy ao amin’ny soratra masina, izay ataony eny aminy mba ho ody fiaro. ary ataony lava kokoa ny mikiramborambo amin’ny morontongotr’akanjony.'),
  ('6ab25c2263ca2f0681d1ade1', '2026-09-22T10:44:50.330Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:50.330Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 23, 38, 'Dia avela ho anareo eo ny tranonareo!', 'dia avela ho anareo eo ny tranonareo!'),
  ('6ab25c2263ca2f0681d1addd', '2026-09-22T10:44:50.330Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:50.330Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 23, 34, 'Noho izany, dia maniraka mpaminany sy olon-kendry ary mpampianatra ampahibemaso ho any aminareo aho. Ny sasany hovonoinareo ho faty sy hofantsihanareo amin’ny hazo fijaliana, ary ny sasany hokaravasinareo ao amin’ny synagoganareo sy henjehinareo isan-tanàna.', 'noho izany, dia maniraka mpaminany sy olon-kendry ary mpampianatra ampahibemaso ho any aminareo aho. ny sasany hovonoinareo ho faty sy hofantsihanareo amin’ny hazo fijaliana, ary ny sasany hokaravasinareo ao amin’ny synagoganareo sy henjehinareo isan-tanàna.'),
  ('6ab25c2263ca2f0681d1adda', '2026-09-22T10:44:50.330Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:50.330Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 23, 31, 'Koa ianareo ihany no miampanga ny tenanareo ho zanak’ireo namono ny mpaminany.', 'koa ianareo ihany no miampanga ny tenanareo ho zanak’ireo namono ny mpaminany.'),
  ('6ab25c2263ca2f0681d1adca', '2026-09-22T10:44:50.330Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:50.330Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 23, 15, '“Hahita loza ianareo mpanora-dalàna sy Fariseo mpihatsaravelatsihy, satria mitety ranomasina sy mitety tany ianareo mba hitaomana olona iray hiova finoana! Ary rehefa miova finoana izy, dia ataonareo mendrika ny ho any amin’ny Gehena mihoatra noho ianareo.', '“hahita loza ianareo mpanora-dalàna sy fariseo mpihatsaravelatsihy, satria mitety ranomasina sy mitety tany ianareo mba hitaomana olona iray hiova finoana! ary rehefa miova finoana izy, dia ataonareo mendrika ny ho any amin’ny gehena mihoatra noho ianareo.'),
  ('6ab25c276196bb6315bb2a7c', '2026-09-22T10:44:55.543Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:55.543Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 28, 1, 'Taorian’ny Sabata, tamin’ny andro voalohany amin’ny herinandro, rehefa nihanazava ny andro, dia tonga hijery ny fasana i Maria Magdalena sy ilay Maria anankiray.', 'taorian’ny sabata, tamin’ny andro voalohany amin’ny herinandro, rehefa nihanazava ny andro, dia tonga hijery ny fasana i maria magdalena sy ilay maria anankiray.'),
  ('6ab25c276196bb6315bb2a7d', '2026-09-22T10:44:55.543Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:55.543Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 28, 2, 'Ary nisy horohoron-tany mafy, satria nisy anjelin’i Jehovah nidina avy any an-danitra tonga nanakodia ny vato dia nipetraka teo ambonin’ilay izy.', 'ary nisy horohoron-tany mafy, satria nisy anjelin’i jehovah nidina avy any an-danitra tonga nanakodia ny vato dia nipetraka teo ambonin’ilay izy.'),
  ('6ab25c276196bb6315bb2a7e', '2026-09-22T10:44:55.543Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:55.543Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 28, 3, 'Nanjelanjelatra hoatran’ny tselatra ilay anjely, ary fotsy mangatsakatsaka ny akanjony.', 'nanjelanjelatra hoatran’ny tselatra ilay anjely, ary fotsy mangatsakatsaka ny akanjony.'),
  ('6ab25c276196bb6315bb2a7f', '2026-09-22T10:44:55.543Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:55.543Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 28, 4, 'Natahotra azy ny mpiambina ka nangovitra be, sady tsy nahahetsika toy ny maty.', 'natahotra azy ny mpiambina ka nangovitra be, sady tsy nahahetsika toy ny maty.'),
  ('6ab25c276196bb6315bb2a80', '2026-09-22T10:44:55.543Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:55.543Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 28, 5, 'Ary hoy ilay anjely tamin’izy roa vavy: “Aza matahotra. Fantatro fa mitady an’i Jesosy, ilay novonoina teo amin’ny tsato-kazo, ianareo.', 'ary hoy ilay anjely tamin’izy roa vavy: “aza matahotra. fantatro fa mitady an’i jesosy, ilay novonoina teo amin’ny tsato-kazo, ianareo.'),
  ('6ab25c276196bb6315bb2a81', '2026-09-22T10:44:55.543Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:55.543Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 28, 6, 'Tsy ato izy fa efa natsangana, araka ny efa nolazainy. Avia, jereo ilay toerana nisy ny fatiny.', 'tsy ato izy fa efa natsangana, araka ny efa nolazainy. avia, jereo ilay toerana nisy ny fatiny.'),
  ('6ab25c276196bb6315bb2a82', '2026-09-22T10:44:55.543Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:55.543Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 28, 7, 'Mandehana haingana teneno ny mpianany hoe: ‘Efa natsangana tamin’ny maty izy. Hialoha anareo any Galilia izy, dia any no hahitanareo azy.’ Hiteny an’izany aminareo no nahatongavako eto.”', 'mandehana haingana teneno ny mpianany hoe: ‘efa natsangana tamin’ny maty izy. hialoha anareo any galilia izy, dia any no hahitanareo azy.’ hiteny an’izany aminareo no nahatongavako eto.”'),
  ('6ab25c276196bb6315bb2a83', '2026-09-22T10:44:55.543Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:55.543Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 28, 8, 'Niala haingana teo am-pasana àry izy roa vavy, sady natahotra no faly be, ary nihazakazaka mba hilaza an’izany tamin’ny mpianatr’i Jesosy.', 'niala haingana teo am-pasana àry izy roa vavy, sady natahotra no faly be, ary nihazakazaka mba hilaza an’izany tamin’ny mpianatr’i jesosy.'),
  ('6ab25c276196bb6315bb2a84', '2026-09-22T10:44:55.543Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:55.543Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 28, 9, 'Ary iny i Jesosy fa nifanena tamin’izy ireo sady niteny hoe: “Manahoana ianareo!” Dia nanatona izy ireo, ka nitazona azy tamin’ny tongony sady niankohoka teo anatrehany.', 'ary iny i jesosy fa nifanena tamin’izy ireo sady niteny hoe: “manahoana ianareo!” dia nanatona izy ireo, ka nitazona azy tamin’ny tongony sady niankohoka teo anatrehany.');
INSERT INTO "bible_verses" ("id", "created_date", "updated_date", "created_by_id", "created_by", "translation", "book", "bookOrder", "chapter", "verse", "text", "normalizedText") VALUES
  ('6ab25c276196bb6315bb2a85', '2026-09-22T10:44:55.543Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:55.543Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 28, 10, 'Hoy i Jesosy taminy: “Aza matahotra! Mandehana milaza amin’ny rahalahiko mba ho any Galilia, fa any no hahitany ahy.”', 'hoy i jesosy taminy: “aza matahotra! mandehana milaza amin’ny rahalahiko mba ho any galilia, fa any no hahitany ahy.”'),
  ('6ab25c276196bb6315bb2a86', '2026-09-22T10:44:55.543Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:55.543Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 28, 11, 'Tamin’izy ireo mbola teny an-dalana, dia nankany an-tanàna ny mpiambina sasany nilaza tamin’ny lehiben’ny mpisorona ny zava-nitranga rehetra.', 'tamin’izy ireo mbola teny an-dalana, dia nankany an-tanàna ny mpiambina sasany nilaza tamin’ny lehiben’ny mpisorona ny zava-nitranga rehetra.'),
  ('6ab25c276196bb6315bb2a87', '2026-09-22T10:44:55.543Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:55.543Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 28, 12, 'Dia niara-nivory sy niara-nidinika ny lehiben’ny mpisorona sy ny anti-panahy, ary avy eo nomeny vola be ireo miaramila ireo,', 'dia niara-nivory sy niara-nidinika ny lehiben’ny mpisorona sy ny anti-panahy, ary avy eo nomeny vola be ireo miaramila ireo,'),
  ('6ab25c276196bb6315bb2a88', '2026-09-22T10:44:55.543Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:55.543Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 28, 13, 'ka noteneniny hoe: “Lazao hoe: ‘Tonga tamin’ny alina ny mpianany nangalatra azy tamin’izahay mbola natory.’', 'ka noteneniny hoe: “lazao hoe: ‘tonga tamin’ny alina ny mpianany nangalatra azy tamin’izahay mbola natory.’'),
  ('6ab25c276196bb6315bb2a89', '2026-09-22T10:44:55.543Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:55.543Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 28, 14, 'Ary raha tonga any am-poto-tsofin’ny governora izany, dia hohazavainay aminy ilay izy, ka tsy misy tokony hatahoranareo.”', 'ary raha tonga any am-poto-tsofin’ny governora izany, dia hohazavainay aminy ilay izy, ka tsy misy tokony hatahoranareo.”'),
  ('6ab25c276196bb6315bb2a8a', '2026-09-22T10:44:55.543Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:55.543Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 28, 15, 'Noraisin’ny miaramila àry ireo vola ireo, dia nanao araka izay nolazaina taminy izy ireo. Ary niely teo amin’ny Jiosy izany resaka izany hatramin’izao.', 'noraisin’ny miaramila àry ireo vola ireo, dia nanao araka izay nolazaina taminy izy ireo. ary niely teo amin’ny jiosy izany resaka izany hatramin’izao.'),
  ('6ab25c276196bb6315bb2a8b', '2026-09-22T10:44:55.543Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:55.543Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 28, 16, 'Ny mpianatra 11 lahy kosa nankany Galilia, dia nankeny amin’ilay tendrombohitra notenenin’i Jesosy hoe hihaonan’izy ireo.', 'ny mpianatra 11 lahy kosa nankany galilia, dia nankeny amin’ilay tendrombohitra notenenin’i jesosy hoe hihaonan’izy ireo.'),
  ('6ab25c276196bb6315bb2a8c', '2026-09-22T10:44:55.543Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:55.543Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 28, 17, 'Dia niankohoka izy ireo rehefa nahita azy, fa ny sasany kosa nisalasala raha izy tokoa io.', 'dia niankohoka izy ireo rehefa nahita azy, fa ny sasany kosa nisalasala raha izy tokoa io.'),
  ('6ab25c276196bb6315bb2a8d', '2026-09-22T10:44:55.543Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:55.543Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 28, 18, 'Ary nanatona i Jesosy ka niteny taminy hoe: “Efa nomena ahy ny fahefana rehetra any an-danitra sy etỳ an-tany.', 'ary nanatona i jesosy ka niteny taminy hoe: “efa nomena ahy ny fahefana rehetra any an-danitra sy etỳ an-tany.'),
  ('6ab25c276196bb6315bb2a8e', '2026-09-22T10:44:55.543Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:55.543Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 28, 19, 'Mandehana àry, ampianaro ny olona any amin’ny firenena rehetra mba ho lasa mpanara-dia ahy. Ataovy batisa amin’ny anaran’ny Ray sy amin’ny anaran’ny Zanaka ary amin’ny anaran’ny fanahy masina izy ireo,', 'mandehana àry, ampianaro ny olona any amin’ny firenena rehetra mba ho lasa mpanara-dia ahy. ataovy batisa amin’ny anaran’ny ray sy amin’ny anaran’ny zanaka ary amin’ny anaran’ny fanahy masina izy ireo,'),
  ('6ab25c276196bb6315bb2a8f', '2026-09-22T10:44:55.543Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:55.543Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Matio', 40, 28, 20, 'sady ampianaro hankatò an’izay rehetra nandidiako anareo. Ary hiaraka aminareo foana aho isan’andro, mandra-pahatongan’ny faran’izao tontolo izao.”', 'sady ampianaro hankatò an’izay rehetra nandidiako anareo. ary hiaraka aminareo foana aho isan’andro, mandra-pahatongan’ny faran’izao tontolo izao.”'),
  ('6ab25c2946723a70a5e92c58', '2026-09-22T10:44:57.449Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:57.449Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 3, 27, 'Fa raha misy te hiditra ao an-tranon’ny lehilahy matanjaka iray mba hangalatra ny fananany, dia tsy maintsy fatorany aloha ilay lehilahy, vao afaka mandroba ny ao an-tranony izy.', 'fa raha misy te hiditra ao an-tranon’ny lehilahy matanjaka iray mba hangalatra ny fananany, dia tsy maintsy fatorany aloha ilay lehilahy, vao afaka mandroba ny ao an-tranony izy.'),
  ('6ab25c2946723a70a5e92c47', '2026-09-22T10:44:57.449Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:57.449Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 3, 10, 'Nanasitrana olona be dia be mantsy izy, ka nitangorona teo aminy daholo izay narary mafy mba hikasika azy.', 'nanasitrana olona be dia be mantsy izy, ka nitangorona teo aminy daholo izay narary mafy mba hikasika azy.'),
  ('6ab25c2946723a70a5e92c57', '2026-09-22T10:44:57.449Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:57.449Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 3, 26, 'Koa raha miady an-trano i Satana ka lasa voazarazara, dia tsy haharitra izy fa ho vita hatreo ny aminy.', 'koa raha miady an-trano i satana ka lasa voazarazara, dia tsy haharitra izy fa ho vita hatreo ny aminy.'),
  ('6ab25c2946723a70a5e92c46', '2026-09-22T10:44:57.449Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:57.449Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 3, 9, 'Dia noteneniny ny mpianany mba hanomana sambokely ho azony iakarana raha sendra mifanesika eo aminy ny vahoaka.', 'dia noteneniny ny mpianany mba hanomana sambokely ho azony iakarana raha sendra mifanesika eo aminy ny vahoaka.'),
  ('6ab25c2946723a70a5e92c45', '2026-09-22T10:44:57.449Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:57.449Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 3, 8, 'Nisy koa aza olona avy any Jerosalema sy Idomea sy avy any ampitan’i Reniranon’i Jordana sy ny manodidina an’i Tyro sy Sidona. Vahoaka be mihitsy izy ireo no tonga teo aminy, rehefa naheno ny zavatra be dia be nataony.', 'nisy koa aza olona avy any jerosalema sy idomea sy avy any ampitan’i reniranon’i jordana sy ny manodidina an’i tyro sy sidona. vahoaka be mihitsy izy ireo no tonga teo aminy, rehefa naheno ny zavatra be dia be nataony.'),
  ('6ab25c2946723a70a5e92c3e', '2026-09-22T10:44:57.449Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:57.449Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 3, 1, 'Niditra tao amin’ny synagoga indray izy, ary nisy lehilahy maty tanana tao.', 'niditra tao amin’ny synagoga indray izy, ary nisy lehilahy maty tanana tao.'),
  ('6ab25c2946723a70a5e92c55', '2026-09-22T10:44:57.449Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:57.449Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 3, 24, 'Raha misy fanjakana miady an-trano, dia tsy haharitra izany fanjakana izany.', 'raha misy fanjakana miady an-trano, dia tsy haharitra izany fanjakana izany.'),
  ('6ab25c2946723a70a5e92c4e', '2026-09-22T10:44:57.449Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:57.449Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 3, 17, 'Jakoba zanak’i Zebedio sy Jaona rahalahiny—nantsoiny koa hoe Boanerjesy, midika hoe “Zanaky ny Kotroka”, izy roa lahy ireo—,', 'jakoba zanak’i zebedio sy jaona rahalahiny—nantsoiny koa hoe boanerjesy, midika hoe “zanaky ny kotroka”, izy roa lahy ireo—,'),
  ('6ab25c2946723a70a5e92c52', '2026-09-22T10:44:57.449Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:57.449Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 3, 21, 'Rehefa naheno an’izay nitranga ny havany, dia tonga hisambotra azy. Hoy mantsy izy ireo: “Lasa adala izy.”', 'rehefa naheno an’izay nitranga ny havany, dia tonga hisambotra azy. hoy mantsy izy ireo: “lasa adala izy.”'),
  ('6ab25c2946723a70a5e92c4a', '2026-09-22T10:44:57.449Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:57.449Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 3, 13, 'Ary niakatra teny an-tendrombohitra izy, ka niantso an’izay nofidiny, dia nankeo aminy ireo.', 'ary niakatra teny an-tendrombohitra izy, ka niantso an’izay nofidiny, dia nankeo aminy ireo.'),
  ('6ab25c2946723a70a5e92c4f', '2026-09-22T10:44:57.449Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:57.449Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 3, 18, 'Andrea, Filipo, Bartolomeo, Matio, Tomasy, Jakoba zanak’i Alfeo, Tadeo, Simona Kananeanina,', 'andrea, filipo, bartolomeo, matio, tomasy, jakoba zanak’i alfeo, tadeo, simona kananeanina,'),
  ('6ab25c2946723a70a5e92c4c', '2026-09-22T10:44:57.449Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:57.449Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 3, 15, 'ary homeny fahefana hamoaka demonia.', 'ary homeny fahefana hamoaka demonia.'),
  ('6ab25c2946723a70a5e92c4b', '2026-09-22T10:44:57.449Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:57.449Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 3, 14, 'Dia nifidy 12 lahy izy, sady niantso azy ireo hoe apostoly. Izy ireo no hiaraka aminy sy hirahiny hitory,', 'dia nifidy 12 lahy izy, sady niantso azy ireo hoe apostoly. izy ireo no hiaraka aminy sy hirahiny hitory,'),
  ('6ab25c2946723a70a5e92c54', '2026-09-22T10:44:57.449Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:57.449Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 3, 23, 'Dia nantsoin’i Jesosy hankeo aminy izy ireo, ka nanao fanoharana tamin’izy ireo izy hoe: “Ahoana no ahafahan’i Satana mamoaka an’i Satana?', 'dia nantsoin’i jesosy hankeo aminy izy ireo, ka nanao fanoharana tamin’izy ireo izy hoe: “ahoana no ahafahan’i satana mamoaka an’i satana?'),
  ('6ab25c2946723a70a5e92c3f', '2026-09-22T10:44:57.449Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:57.449Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 3, 2, 'Nijery azy tsara àry ny olona raha hanasitrana an’ilay lehilahy izy na tsia, mba hiampangany azy. Sabata mantsy tamin’izay.', 'nijery azy tsara àry ny olona raha hanasitrana an’ilay lehilahy izy na tsia, mba hiampangany azy. sabata mantsy tamin’izay.'),
  ('6ab25c2946723a70a5e92c48', '2026-09-22T10:44:57.449Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:57.449Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 3, 11, 'Ary na ny fanahy maloto aza isaky ny nahita azy, dia niankohoka teo anatrehany sady niantsoantso mafy hoe: “Ianao no Zanak’Andriamanitra!”', 'ary na ny fanahy maloto aza isaky ny nahita azy, dia niankohoka teo anatrehany sady niantsoantso mafy hoe: “ianao no zanak’andriamanitra!”'),
  ('6ab25c2946723a70a5e92c43', '2026-09-22T10:44:57.449Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:57.449Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 3, 6, 'Nivoaka ny Fariseo tamin’izay, ka tonga dia nikaon-doha niaraka tamin’ny mpanohana an’i Heroda satria te hamono an’i Jesosy.', 'nivoaka ny fariseo tamin’izay, ka tonga dia nikaon-doha niaraka tamin’ny mpanohana an’i heroda satria te hamono an’i jesosy.'),
  ('6ab25c2946723a70a5e92c40', '2026-09-22T10:44:57.449Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:57.449Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 3, 3, 'Ary hoy izy tamin’ilay lehilahy maty tanana: “Mitsangàna dia mankanesa etsy afovoany etsy.”', 'ary hoy izy tamin’ilay lehilahy maty tanana: “mitsangàna dia mankanesa etsy afovoany etsy.”'),
