  ('6ab25c2be653dd1f00300974', '2026-09-22T10:44:59.671Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:59.671Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 8, 19, 'tamin’izaho nanapaka mofo dimy ho an’ny lehilahy 5 000? Nahafeno harona firy ny sombintsombiny voangonareo?” Dia hoy ireo taminy: “Roa ambin’ny folo.”', 'tamin’izaho nanapaka mofo dimy ho an’ny lehilahy 5 000? nahafeno harona firy ny sombintsombiny voangonareo?” dia hoy ireo taminy: “roa ambin’ny folo.”'),
