  ('6ab25c2be653dd1f0030097d', '2026-09-22T10:44:59.671Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:59.671Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 8, 28, 'Dia hoy ireo taminy: “Jaona Mpanao Batisa. Misy koa anefa milaza hoe Elia, dia misy miteny hoe ny iray amin’ny mpaminany.”', 'dia hoy ireo taminy: “jaona mpanao batisa. misy koa anefa milaza hoe elia, dia misy miteny hoe ny iray amin’ny mpaminany.”'),
  ('6ab25c2be653dd1f0030096d', '2026-09-22T10:44:59.671Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:59.671Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 8, 12, 'Koa nisento lalina i Jesosy ka niteny hoe: “Maninona ity taranaka ity no mitady famantarana? Lazaiko marina aminareo fa tsy hisy famantarana homena an’ity taranaka ity.”', 'koa nisento lalina i jesosy ka niteny hoe: “maninona ity taranaka ity no mitady famantarana? lazaiko marina aminareo fa tsy hisy famantarana homena an’ity taranaka ity.”'),
