  ('6ab25c2be653dd1f00300972', '2026-09-22T10:44:59.671Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:59.671Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 8, 17, 'Tsikaritr’i Jesosy izany, ka hoy izy tamin’ireo: “Maninona no mampiady hevitra anareo ilay ianareo tsy nitondra mofo? Mbola tsy takatrareo sy tsy azonareo ihany ve? Mbola donto ve ny fonareo ka tsy azonareo ny dikan’izany?', 'tsikaritr’i jesosy izany, ka hoy izy tamin’ireo: “maninona no mampiady hevitra anareo ilay ianareo tsy nitondra mofo? mbola tsy takatrareo sy tsy azonareo ihany ve? mbola donto ve ny fonareo ka tsy azonareo ny dikan’izany?'),
  ('6ab25c2be653dd1f0030096b', '2026-09-22T10:44:59.671Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:59.671Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 8, 10, 'Ary tonga dia nankao anaty sambokely izy sy ny mpianany, ka tonga tany amin’ny faritr’i Dalmanota.', 'ary tonga dia nankao anaty sambokely izy sy ny mpianany, ka tonga tany amin’ny faritr’i dalmanota.'),
  ('6ab25c2be653dd1f00300963', '2026-09-22T10:44:59.671Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:59.671Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 8, 2, '“Mampalahelo ahy ireto vahoaka ireto, fa efa telo andro izao ry zareo no nijanona teto amiko, sady tsy manan-kohanina.', '“mampalahelo ahy ireto vahoaka ireto, fa efa telo andro izao ry zareo no nijanona teto amiko, sady tsy manan-kohanina.'),
  ('6ab25c2be653dd1f0030097b', '2026-09-22T10:44:59.671Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:59.671Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 8, 26, 'Koa nalefan’i Jesosy nody izy sady noteneniny hoe: “Aza mankao amin’io tanàna io aloha.”', 'koa nalefan’i jesosy nody izy sady noteneniny hoe: “aza mankao amin’io tanàna io aloha.”'),
  ('6ab25c2be653dd1f00300962', '2026-09-22T10:44:59.671Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:59.671Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 8, 1, 'Tamin’izany andro izany, dia nisy vahoaka be indray teo, ary tsy nanana zavatra hohanina izy ireo. Nasain’i Jesosy nankeo aminy àry ny mpianany, dia noteneniny hoe:', 'tamin’izany andro izany, dia nisy vahoaka be indray teo, ary tsy nanana zavatra hohanina izy ireo. nasain’i jesosy nankeo aminy àry ny mpianany, dia noteneniny hoe:'),
  ('6ab25c2be653dd1f00300976', '2026-09-22T10:44:59.671Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:59.671Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 8, 21, 'Ary hoy izy tamin’izy ireo: “Mbola tsy azonareo ihany ve ny dikan’izany?”', 'ary hoy izy tamin’izy ireo: “mbola tsy azonareo ihany ve ny dikan’izany?”'),
  ('6ab25c2be653dd1f0030096a', '2026-09-22T10:44:59.671Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:59.671Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 8, 9, 'Lehilahy 4 000 teo ho eo no nihinana tamin’izay. Noravany ny olona avy eo.', 'lehilahy 4 000 teo ho eo no nihinana tamin’izay. noravany ny olona avy eo.'),
  ('6ab25c2be653dd1f00300965', '2026-09-22T10:44:59.671Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:59.671Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 8, 4, 'Hoy anefa ny mpianany: “Aiza atỳ amin’ity toerana mitokana ity no hahitana mofo hahavoky an’ireo olona ireo?”', 'hoy anefa ny mpianany: “aiza atỳ amin’ity toerana mitokana ity no hahitana mofo hahavoky an’ireo olona ireo?”'),
  ('6ab25c2be653dd1f00300986', '2026-09-22T10:44:59.671Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:59.671Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 8, 37, 'Ary inona tokoa moa no homen’ny olona ho takalon’ny ainy?', 'ary inona tokoa moa no homen’ny olona ho takalon’ny ainy?'),
  ('6ab25c2be653dd1f00300980', '2026-09-22T10:44:59.671Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:59.671Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 8, 31, 'Nanomboka nampianatra azy ireo koa izy hoe tsy maintsy hampijalijalina ny Zanak’olona, ka holavin’ny anti-panahy sy ny lehiben’ny mpisorona ary ny mpanora-dalàna, dia hovonoina ho faty, ary hitsangana rehefa afaka telo andro.', 'nanomboka nampianatra azy ireo koa izy hoe tsy maintsy hampijalijalina ny zanak’olona, ka holavin’ny anti-panahy sy ny lehiben’ny mpisorona ary ny mpanora-dalàna, dia hovonoina ho faty, ary hitsangana rehefa afaka telo andro.'),
  ('6ab25c2be653dd1f00300971', '2026-09-22T10:44:59.671Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:59.671Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 8, 16, 'Nanomboka niady hevitra àry izy ireo satria tsy nitondra mofo.', 'nanomboka niady hevitra àry izy ireo satria tsy nitondra mofo.'),
  ('6ab25c2be653dd1f00300968', '2026-09-22T10:44:59.671Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:59.671Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 8, 7, 'Nanana trondro madinika vitsivitsy koa izy ireo. Rehefa avy nisaotra an’Andriamanitra izy, dia nasainy naroso koa izany.', 'nanana trondro madinika vitsivitsy koa izy ireo. rehefa avy nisaotra an’andriamanitra izy, dia nasainy naroso koa izany.'),
  ('6ab25c2be653dd1f00300985', '2026-09-22T10:44:59.671Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:59.671Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 8, 36, 'Inona tokoa moa no soa ho azon’ny olona raha azony izao tontolo izao nefa afoiny ny ainy?', 'inona tokoa moa no soa ho azon’ny olona raha azony izao tontolo izao nefa afoiny ny ainy?'),
  ('6ab25c2be653dd1f00300967', '2026-09-22T10:44:59.671Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:59.671Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 8, 6, 'Ary nasainy naka toerana teo amin’ny tany ny vahoaka. Noraisiny ny mofo fito avy eo ka nisaotra an’Andriamanitra izy. Dia notapahiny ny mofo ka nozarainy tamin’ny mpianany mba harosony, ary izy ireo indray nandroso an’ilay izy tamin’ny vahoaka.', 'ary nasainy naka toerana teo amin’ny tany ny vahoaka. noraisiny ny mofo fito avy eo ka nisaotra an’andriamanitra izy. dia notapahiny ny mofo ka nozarainy tamin’ny mpianany mba harosony, ary izy ireo indray nandroso an’ilay izy tamin’ny vahoaka.'),
  ('6ab25c2be653dd1f0030096f', '2026-09-22T10:44:59.671Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:59.671Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 8, 14, 'Nanadino nitondra mofo anefa ny mpianatra, ka tsy nanana afa-tsy mofo iray izy ireo tao amin’ilay sambokely.', 'nanadino nitondra mofo anefa ny mpianatra, ka tsy nanana afa-tsy mofo iray izy ireo tao amin’ilay sambokely.'),
  ('6ab25c2be653dd1f00300969', '2026-09-22T10:44:59.671Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:59.671Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 8, 8, 'Dia nihinana ny olona ka voky, ary nangonin’ny mpianatra ny sombintsombiny sisa tsy lany ka nahafeno sobika lehibe fito.', 'dia nihinana ny olona ka voky, ary nangonin’ny mpianatra ny sombintsombiny sisa tsy lany ka nahafeno sobika lehibe fito.'),
  ('6ab25c2be653dd1f00300964', '2026-09-22T10:44:59.671Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:59.671Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 8, 3, 'Raha noana ry zareo no alefako mody, dia ho reraka eny an-dalana. Ny sasany koa avy lavitra.”', 'raha noana ry zareo no alefako mody, dia ho reraka eny an-dalana. ny sasany koa avy lavitra.”'),
  ('6ab25c2be653dd1f00300987', '2026-09-22T10:44:59.671Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:59.671Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 8, 38, 'Fa na iza na iza menatra noho ny amiko sy ny teniko, eto amin’ity taranaka mpanitsakitsa-bady sy mpanota ity, dia ho menatra noho ny aminy koa ny Zanak’olona, rehefa ho avy amin’ny voninahitry ny Rainy miaraka amin’ny anjely masina.”', 'fa na iza na iza menatra noho ny amiko sy ny teniko, eto amin’ity taranaka mpanitsakitsa-bady sy mpanota ity, dia ho menatra noho ny aminy koa ny zanak’olona, rehefa ho avy amin’ny voninahitry ny rainy miaraka amin’ny anjely masina.”'),
  ('6ab25c2be653dd1f00300979', '2026-09-22T10:44:59.671Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:59.671Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 8, 24, 'Ary nitraka ilay lehilahy sady niteny hoe: “Mahita olona aho, nefa hoatran’ny hazo mandehandeha no fahitako azy.”', 'ary nitraka ilay lehilahy sady niteny hoe: “mahita olona aho, nefa hoatran’ny hazo mandehandeha no fahitako azy.”'),
  ('6ab25c2be653dd1f0030096e', '2026-09-22T10:44:59.671Z', '2026-09-22T10:44:59.671Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 8, 13, 'Ary nilaozany ireo ka nankao anaty sambokely indray izy, dia nankeny ampita.', 'ary nilaozany ireo ka nankao anaty sambokely indray izy, dia nankeny ampita.'),
  ('6ab25c2d195d8955218b0bbe', '2026-09-22T10:45:01.101Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:01.101Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 10, 13, 'Ary nisy zaza nentin’ny olona teo amin’i Jesosy mba hokasihiny, nefa nobedesin’ny mpianatra ireny.', 'ary nisy zaza nentin’ny olona teo amin’i jesosy mba hokasihiny, nefa nobedesin’ny mpianatra ireny.'),
  ('6ab25c2d195d8955218b0bc4', '2026-09-22T10:45:01.101Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:01.101Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 10, 19, 'Fantatrao ny didy hoe: ‘Aza mamono olona, aza manitsakitsa-bady, aza mangalatra, aza mijoro ho vavolombelona mandainga, aza manambaka, ary hajao ny rainao sy ny reninao.’”', 'fantatrao ny didy hoe: ‘aza mamono olona, aza manitsakitsa-bady, aza mangalatra, aza mijoro ho vavolombelona mandainga, aza manambaka, ary hajao ny rainao sy ny reninao.’”'),
  ('6ab25c2d195d8955218b0bb7', '2026-09-22T10:45:01.101Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:01.101Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 10, 6, 'Fa tany am-piandohan’ny famoronana, dia ‘nanao azy ho lahy sy vavy Izy.', 'fa tany am-piandohan’ny famoronana, dia ‘nanao azy ho lahy sy vavy izy.'),
  ('6ab25c2d195d8955218b0bbc', '2026-09-22T10:45:01.101Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:01.101Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 10, 11, 'Dia hoy izy tamin’ireo: “Izay lehilahy misaraka amin’ny vadiny ka manambady olon-kafa, dia manitsakitsa-bady.', 'dia hoy izy tamin’ireo: “izay lehilahy misaraka amin’ny vadiny ka manambady olon-kafa, dia manitsakitsa-bady.'),
  ('6ab25c2d195d8955218b0bba', '2026-09-22T10:45:01.101Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:01.101Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 10, 9, 'Aoka àry izay nampiraisin’Andriamanitra zioga, tsy hosarahin’olona.”', 'aoka àry izay nampiraisin’andriamanitra zioga, tsy hosarahin’olona.”'),
  ('6ab25c2d195d8955218b0bc2', '2026-09-22T10:45:01.101Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:01.101Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 10, 17, 'Rehefa niala teo izy, dia nisy lehilahy nihazakazaka nanatona azy ka nandohalika teo anatrehany sady nanontany hoe: “Mpampianatra Tsara ô, inona no tsy maintsy ataoko mba handovako fiainana mandrakizay?”', 'rehefa niala teo izy, dia nisy lehilahy nihazakazaka nanatona azy ka nandohalika teo anatrehany sady nanontany hoe: “mpampianatra tsara ô, inona no tsy maintsy ataoko mba handovako fiainana mandrakizay?”'),
  ('6ab25c2d195d8955218b0bc0', '2026-09-22T10:45:01.101Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:01.101Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 10, 15, 'Lazaiko marina aminareo fa tsy maintsy mandray ny Fanjakan’Andriamanitra hoatran’ny zaza ianareo, fa raha tsy izany dia tsy ho tafiditra ao mihitsy.”', 'lazaiko marina aminareo fa tsy maintsy mandray ny fanjakan’andriamanitra hoatran’ny zaza ianareo, fa raha tsy izany dia tsy ho tafiditra ao mihitsy.”'),
  ('6ab25c2d195d8955218b0bc5', '2026-09-22T10:45:01.101Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:01.101Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 10, 20, 'Hoy ilay lehilahy taminy: “Mpampianatra ô, efa narahiko daholo izany hatramin’izaho mbola kely.”', 'hoy ilay lehilahy taminy: “mpampianatra ô, efa narahiko daholo izany hatramin’izaho mbola kely.”'),
  ('6ab25c2d195d8955218b0bb9', '2026-09-22T10:45:01.101Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:01.101Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 10, 8, 'ary ho nofo iray ihany izy roa.’ Koa tsy roa intsony izy, fa nofo iray ihany.', 'ary ho nofo iray ihany izy roa.’ koa tsy roa intsony izy, fa nofo iray ihany.'),
  ('6ab25c2d195d8955218b0bb3', '2026-09-22T10:45:01.101Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:01.101Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 10, 2, 'Ary nisy Fariseo nanatona azy satria te hitsapa azy. Dia nanontany izy ireo raha azon’ny lehilahy atao ny misaraka amin’ny vadiny.', 'ary nisy fariseo nanatona azy satria te hitsapa azy. dia nanontany izy ireo raha azon’ny lehilahy atao ny misaraka amin’ny vadiny.'),
  ('6ab25c2d195d8955218b0bbd', '2026-09-22T10:45:01.101Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:01.101Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 10, 12, 'Ary raha manambady olon-kafa ny vehivavy nisaraka tamin’ny vadiny, dia manitsakitsa-bady.”', 'ary raha manambady olon-kafa ny vehivavy nisaraka tamin’ny vadiny, dia manitsakitsa-bady.”'),
  ('6ab25c2d195d8955218b0bb6', '2026-09-22T10:45:01.101Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:01.101Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 10, 5, 'Hoy anefa i Jesosy tamin’ireo: “Noho ianareo mafy loha no nahatonga azy hanoratra an’izany didy izany ho anareo.', 'hoy anefa i jesosy tamin’ireo: “noho ianareo mafy loha no nahatonga azy hanoratra an’izany didy izany ho anareo.'),
  ('6ab25c2d195d8955218b0bb2', '2026-09-22T10:45:01.101Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:01.101Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 10, 1, 'Ary niala teo izy ka nankany amin’ny sisin-tanin’i Jodia, rehefa avy niampita ny Reniranon’i Jordana. Ary nisy vahoaka nitangorona indray teo aminy. Dia nampianariny izy ireo, araka ny efa fanaony.', 'ary niala teo izy ka nankany amin’ny sisin-tanin’i jodia, rehefa avy niampita ny reniranon’i jordana. ary nisy vahoaka nitangorona indray teo aminy. dia nampianariny izy ireo, araka ny efa fanaony.'),
  ('6ab25c2d195d8955218b0bb8', '2026-09-22T10:45:01.101Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:01.101Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 10, 7, 'Noho izany, dia handao ny rainy sy ny reniny ny lehilahy,', 'noho izany, dia handao ny rainy sy ny reniny ny lehilahy,'),
