  ('6ab25c2d195d8955218b0bbb', '2026-09-22T10:45:01.101Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:01.101Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 10, 10, 'Rehefa tao an-trano indray izy ireo, dia nanontanian’ny mpianany momba an’izany izy.', 'rehefa tao an-trano indray izy ireo, dia nanontanian’ny mpianany momba an’izany izy.'),
  ('6ab25c2d195d8955218b0bc1', '2026-09-22T10:45:01.101Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:01.101Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 10, 16, 'Ary nitrotro an’ireo zaza ireo izy ka nitso-drano azy, sady nametra-tanana taminy.', 'ary nitrotro an’ireo zaza ireo izy ka nitso-drano azy, sady nametra-tanana taminy.'),
  ('6ab25c2d195d8955218b0bbf', '2026-09-22T10:45:01.101Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:01.101Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 10, 14, 'Dia tezitra i Jesosy rehefa nahita an’izany, ka niteny tamin’ireo hoe: “Avelao ny zaza hanatona ahy fa aza sakanana, fa an’izay hoatr’azy ny Fanjakan’Andriamanitra.', 'dia tezitra i jesosy rehefa nahita an’izany, ka niteny tamin’ireo hoe: “avelao ny zaza hanatona ahy fa aza sakanana, fa an’izay hoatr’azy ny fanjakan’andriamanitra.'),
  ('6ab25c2d195d8955218b0bb5', '2026-09-22T10:45:01.101Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:01.101Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 10, 4, 'Dia hoy ireo: “Navelan’i Mosesy hanoratra taratasy fisaraham-panambadiana ny lehilahy rehefa misaraka amin’ny vadiny.”', 'dia hoy ireo: “navelan’i mosesy hanoratra taratasy fisaraham-panambadiana ny lehilahy rehefa misaraka amin’ny vadiny.”'),
  ('6ab25c2d195d8955218b0bc3', '2026-09-22T10:45:01.101Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:01.101Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 10, 18, 'Dia hoy i Jesosy: “Maninona aho no antsoinao hoe tsara? Tsy misy tsara afa-tsy iray ihany, dia Andriamanitra.', 'dia hoy i jesosy: “maninona aho no antsoinao hoe tsara? tsy misy tsara afa-tsy iray ihany, dia andriamanitra.'),
  ('6ab25c2d195d8955218b0be4', '2026-09-22T10:45:01.102Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:01.102Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 10, 51, 'Ary hoy i Jesosy taminy: “Inona no tianao hataoko aminao?” Dia hoy ilay jamba: “Rabôny ô, mba ataovy mahita indray aho.”', 'ary hoy i jesosy taminy: “inona no tianao hataoko aminao?” dia hoy ilay jamba: “rabôny ô, mba ataovy mahita indray aho.”'),
  ('6ab25c2d195d8955218b0bca', '2026-09-22T10:45:01.102Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:01.102Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 10, 25, 'Mora kokoa ny hidiran’ny rameva ao amin’ny vodifanjaitra, noho ny hidiran’ny mpanankarena ao amin’ny Fanjakan’Andriamanitra.”', 'mora kokoa ny hidiran’ny rameva ao amin’ny vodifanjaitra, noho ny hidiran’ny mpanankarena ao amin’ny fanjakan’andriamanitra.”'),
  ('6ab25c2d195d8955218b0bd5', '2026-09-22T10:45:01.102Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:01.102Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 10, 36, 'Ary hoy izy tamin’ireo: “Inona no tianareo hataoko aminareo?”', 'ary hoy izy tamin’ireo: “inona no tianareo hataoko aminareo?”'),
  ('6ab25c2d195d8955218b0bd4', '2026-09-22T10:45:01.102Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:01.102Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 10, 35, 'Ary nanatona azy i Jakoba sy Jaona zanak’i Zebedio, ka niteny taminy hoe: “Mpampianatra ô, mba tianay hataonao aminay izay angatahinay aminao.”', 'ary nanatona azy i jakoba sy jaona zanak’i zebedio, ka niteny taminy hoe: “mpampianatra ô, mba tianay hataonao aminay izay angatahinay aminao.”'),
  ('6ab25c2d195d8955218b0bcd', '2026-09-22T10:45:01.102Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:01.102Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 10, 28, 'Ary hoy i Petera taminy: “Efa nahafoy ny zava-drehetra izahay dia nanaraka anao.”', 'ary hoy i petera taminy: “efa nahafoy ny zava-drehetra izahay dia nanaraka anao.”'),
  ('6ab25c2d195d8955218b0bc8', '2026-09-22T10:45:01.102Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:01.102Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 10, 23, 'Ary nijery ny manodidina azy i Jesosy, ka hoy izy tamin’ny mpianany: “Tena ho sarotra amin’ny mpanam-bola ny hiditra ao amin’ny Fanjakan’Andriamanitra!”', 'ary nijery ny manodidina azy i jesosy, ka hoy izy tamin’ny mpianany: “tena ho sarotra amin’ny mpanam-bola ny hiditra ao amin’ny fanjakan’andriamanitra!”'),
  ('6ab25c2d195d8955218b0bc7', '2026-09-22T10:45:01.102Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:01.102Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 10, 22, 'Nanjombona ilay lehilahy rehefa naheno an’izany valin-teny izany, ka lasa sady nalahelo. Be dia be mantsy ny fananany.', 'nanjombona ilay lehilahy rehefa naheno an’izany valin-teny izany, ka lasa sady nalahelo. be dia be mantsy ny fananany.'),
  ('6ab25c2d195d8955218b0bcc', '2026-09-22T10:45:01.102Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:01.102Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 10, 27, 'Nibanjina azy ireo i Jesosy ka niteny hoe: “Tsy hain’olombelona izany, fa hain’Andriamanitra. Hain’Andriamanitra mantsy ny zava-drehetra.”', 'nibanjina azy ireo i jesosy ka niteny hoe: “tsy hain’olombelona izany, fa hain’andriamanitra. hain’andriamanitra mantsy ny zava-drehetra.”'),
  ('6ab25c2d195d8955218b0be5', '2026-09-22T10:45:01.102Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:01.102Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 10, 52, 'Ary hoy i Jesosy: “Mandehana, ny finoanao no nahasitrana anao.” Tonga dia nahita ilay lehilahy, ka nanomboka nanaraka azy teny an-dalana.', 'ary hoy i jesosy: “mandehana, ny finoanao no nahasitrana anao.” tonga dia nahita ilay lehilahy, ka nanomboka nanaraka azy teny an-dalana.'),
  ('6ab25c2d195d8955218b0bcb', '2026-09-22T10:45:01.102Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:01.102Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 10, 26, 'Vao mainka gaga izy ireo ka niteny taminy hoe: “Dia mety hisy ho voavonjy ve raha izany?”', 'vao mainka gaga izy ireo ka niteny taminy hoe: “dia mety hisy ho voavonjy ve raha izany?”'),
  ('6ab25c2d195d8955218b0bc6', '2026-09-22T10:45:01.102Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:01.102Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 10, 21, 'Nijery azy i Jesosy dia tia azy, ka hoy izy taminy: “Izao zavatra iray izao sisa no mbola tsy nataonao: Mandehana amidio ny fanananao ka omeo ho an’ny mahantra, dia hanana harena any an-danitra ianao. Ary andao hanara-dia ahy.”', 'nijery azy i jesosy dia tia azy, ka hoy izy taminy: “izao zavatra iray izao sisa no mbola tsy nataonao: mandehana amidio ny fanananao ka omeo ho an’ny mahantra, dia hanana harena any an-danitra ianao. ary andao hanara-dia ahy.”'),
  ('6ab25c2d195d8955218b0bcf', '2026-09-22T10:45:01.102Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:01.102Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 10, 30, 'ka tsy hahazo avo 100 heny amin’izao andro izao, dia trano, rahalahy, anabavy, reny, zanaka, saha, sy fanenjehana, ary fiainana mandrakizay ao amin’ilay tontolo ho avy.', 'ka tsy hahazo avo 100 heny amin’izao andro izao, dia trano, rahalahy, anabavy, reny, zanaka, saha, sy fanenjehana, ary fiainana mandrakizay ao amin’ilay tontolo ho avy.'),
  ('6ab25c2d195d8955218b0be3', '2026-09-22T10:45:01.102Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:01.102Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 10, 50, 'Koa nesoriny ny akanjony ivelany, dia nitsangana haingana izy ka nankeo amin’i Jesosy.', 'koa nesoriny ny akanjony ivelany, dia nitsangana haingana izy ka nankeo amin’i jesosy.'),
  ('6ab25c2d195d8955218b0bde', '2026-09-22T10:45:01.102Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:01.102Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 10, 45, 'Fa na ny Zanak’olona aza tsy tonga mba hotompoina fa mba hanompo, ka hanome ny ainy ho vidim-panavotana ho takalon’ny olona maro.”', 'fa na ny zanak’olona aza tsy tonga mba hotompoina fa mba hanompo, ka hanome ny ainy ho vidim-panavotana ho takalon’ny olona maro.”'),
  ('6ab25c2d195d8955218b0bce', '2026-09-22T10:45:01.102Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:01.102Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 10, 29, 'Dia hoy i Jesosy: “Lazaiko marina aminareo fa tsy misy olona efa nahafoy trano, na rahalahy, na anabavy, na reny, na ray, na zanaka, na saha, noho ny amiko sy ny vaovao tsara,', 'dia hoy i jesosy: “lazaiko marina aminareo fa tsy misy olona efa nahafoy trano, na rahalahy, na anabavy, na reny, na ray, na zanaka, na saha, noho ny amiko sy ny vaovao tsara,'),
  ('6ab25c2d195d8955218b0be0', '2026-09-22T10:45:01.102Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:01.102Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 10, 47, 'Rehefa henony fa i Jesosy avy any Nazareta ilay nandalo teo, dia nanomboka niantsoantso mafy izy hoe: “Ry Jesosy Zanak’i Davida ô, mba iantrao aho!”', 'rehefa henony fa i jesosy avy any nazareta ilay nandalo teo, dia nanomboka niantsoantso mafy izy hoe: “ry jesosy zanak’i davida ô, mba iantrao aho!”'),
  ('6ab25c2d195d8955218b0bdf', '2026-09-22T10:45:01.102Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:01.102Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 10, 46, 'Tonga tao Jeriko izy ireo avy eo. Ary rehefa nivoaka an’i Jeriko izy sy ny mpianany ary ny olon-kafa be dia be, dia io fa nipetraka teo amoron-dalana i Bartimeo, jamba mpangataka, zanak’i Timeo.', 'tonga tao jeriko izy ireo avy eo. ary rehefa nivoaka an’i jeriko izy sy ny mpianany ary ny olon-kafa be dia be, dia io fa nipetraka teo amoron-dalana i bartimeo, jamba mpangataka, zanak’i timeo.'),
  ('6ab25c2d195d8955218b0bdb', '2026-09-22T10:45:01.102Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:01.102Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 10, 42, 'Nantsoin’i Jesosy hankeo aminy anefa izy ireo, dia noteneniny hoe: “Fantatrareo fa manjakazaka amin’ny firenena entiny ireo ekena ho mpitondra, ary manampatra fahefana ireo lehibe.', 'nantsoin’i jesosy hankeo aminy anefa izy ireo, dia noteneniny hoe: “fantatrareo fa manjakazaka amin’ny firenena entiny ireo ekena ho mpitondra, ary manampatra fahefana ireo lehibe.'),
  ('6ab25c2d195d8955218b0bd6', '2026-09-22T10:45:01.102Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:01.102Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 10, 37, 'Dia hoy ireo: “Mba avelao izahay hipetraka eo akaikinao rehefa mahazo voninahitra ianao, ka ny iray eo ankavananao, ary ny iray eo ankavianao.”', 'dia hoy ireo: “mba avelao izahay hipetraka eo akaikinao rehefa mahazo voninahitra ianao, ka ny iray eo ankavananao, ary ny iray eo ankavianao.”'),
  ('6ab25c2d195d8955218b0bd3', '2026-09-22T10:45:01.102Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:01.102Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 10, 34, 'ka hihomehezan’ireny sy hororany sy hokaravasiny ary hovonoiny ho faty. Hitsangana anefa izy rehefa afaka telo andro.”', 'ka hihomehezan’ireny sy hororany sy hokaravasiny ary hovonoiny ho faty. hitsangana anefa izy rehefa afaka telo andro.”'),
  ('6ab25c2d195d8955218b0bda', '2026-09-22T10:45:01.102Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:01.102Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 10, 41, 'Ary tezitra tamin’i Jakoba sy Jaona izy folo lahy rehefa naheno an’izany.', 'ary tezitra tamin’i jakoba sy jaona izy folo lahy rehefa naheno an’izany.'),
  ('6ab25c2d195d8955218b0bd8', '2026-09-22T10:45:01.102Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:01.102Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 10, 39, 'Dia hoy ireo: “Vitanay izany ka!” Ary hoy i Jesosy tamin’ireo: “Hisotro amin’ilay kaopy isotroako ianareo, ary hatao batisa amin’ilay batisa anaovana batisa ahy.', 'dia hoy ireo: “vitanay izany ka!” ary hoy i jesosy tamin’ireo: “hisotro amin’ilay kaopy isotroako ianareo, ary hatao batisa amin’ilay batisa anaovana batisa ahy.'),
  ('6ab25c2d195d8955218b0bd7', '2026-09-22T10:45:01.102Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:01.102Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 10, 38, 'Hoy anefa i Jesosy tamin’ireo: “Tsy azonareo an-tsaina mihitsy izany angatahinareo izany. Vitanareo ve ny hisotro amin’ilay kaopy isotroako, na ny hatao batisa amin’ilay batisa anaovana batisa ahy?”', 'hoy anefa i jesosy tamin’ireo: “tsy azonareo an-tsaina mihitsy izany angatahinareo izany. vitanareo ve ny hisotro amin’ilay kaopy isotroako, na ny hatao batisa amin’ilay batisa anaovana batisa ahy?”'),
  ('6ab25c2d195d8955218b0be1', '2026-09-22T10:45:01.102Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:01.102Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 10, 48, 'Ary nibedy azy ny olona maro sady niteny azy mba hangina, nefa vao mainka izy niantsoantso mafy hoe: “Ry Zanak’i Davida ô, mba iantrao aho!”', 'ary nibedy azy ny olona maro sady niteny azy mba hangina, nefa vao mainka izy niantsoantso mafy hoe: “ry zanak’i davida ô, mba iantrao aho!”'),
  ('6ab25c2d195d8955218b0bd0', '2026-09-22T10:45:01.102Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:01.102Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 10, 31, 'Maro amin’ireo voalohany anefa no ho farany, ary ny farany ho voalohany.”', 'maro amin’ireo voalohany anefa no ho farany, ary ny farany ho voalohany.”'),
  ('6ab25c2d195d8955218b0be2', '2026-09-22T10:45:01.102Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:01.102Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 10, 49, 'Nijanona àry i Jesosy, dia niteny hoe: “Antsoy ho eto amiko izy.” Dia nantsoin’ny olona ilay jamba, ka noteneniny hoe: “Mahereza! Mitsangàna, fa miantso anao izy.”', 'nijanona àry i jesosy, dia niteny hoe: “antsoy ho eto amiko izy.” dia nantsoin’ny olona ilay jamba, ka noteneniny hoe: “mahereza! mitsangàna, fa miantso anao izy.”'),
  ('6ab25c2d195d8955218b0bd1', '2026-09-22T10:45:01.102Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:01.102Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 10, 32, 'Ary niakatra ho any Jerosalema izy ireo. Dia nandeha teo alohan’ny mpianatra i Jesosy, ka gaga izy ireo. Ny olona nanaraka azy anefa natahotra. Ary nentiny nihataka kely indray izy 12 Lahy, ka niresahany an’izao zavatra efa hitranga aminy izao:', 'ary niakatra ho any jerosalema izy ireo. dia nandeha teo alohan’ny mpianatra i jesosy, ka gaga izy ireo. ny olona nanaraka azy anefa natahotra. ary nentiny nihataka kely indray izy 12 lahy, ka niresahany an’izao zavatra efa hitranga aminy izao:'),
  ('6ab25c2d195d8955218b0bdc', '2026-09-22T10:45:01.102Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:01.102Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 10, 43, 'Tsy tokony ho toy izany kosa eo aminareo. Fa izay te ho lehibe aminareo dia tsy maintsy ho mpanomponareo,', 'tsy tokony ho toy izany kosa eo aminareo. fa izay te ho lehibe aminareo dia tsy maintsy ho mpanomponareo,'),
  ('6ab25c2d195d8955218b0bc9', '2026-09-22T10:45:01.102Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:01.102Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 10, 24, 'Gaga anefa ny mpianatra tamin’izany teniny izany, ka hoy i Jesosy: “Tena sarotra, anaka, ny miditra ao amin’ny Fanjakan’Andriamanitra!', 'gaga anefa ny mpianatra tamin’izany teniny izany, ka hoy i jesosy: “tena sarotra, anaka, ny miditra ao amin’ny fanjakan’andriamanitra!'),
  ('6ab25c2d195d8955218b0bdd', '2026-09-22T10:45:01.102Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:01.102Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 10, 44, 'ary izay te ho voalohany aminareo dia tsy maintsy manompo ny rehetra.', 'ary izay te ho voalohany aminareo dia tsy maintsy manompo ny rehetra.'),
  ('6ab25c2d195d8955218b0bd9', '2026-09-22T10:45:01.102Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:01.102Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 10, 40, 'Tsy anjarako anefa ny manendry an’izay hipetraka eo ankavanako na eo ankaviako, fa izay voafidy ihany no hahazo an’izany toerana izany.”', 'tsy anjarako anefa ny manendry an’izay hipetraka eo ankavanako na eo ankaviako, fa izay voafidy ihany no hahazo an’izany toerana izany.”'),
  ('6ab25c2d195d8955218b0bd2', '2026-09-22T10:45:01.102Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:01.102Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 10, 33, '“Miakatra ho any Jerosalema isika izao. Ary hatolotra amin’ny lehiben’ny mpisorona sy ny mpanora-dalàna ny Zanak’olona. Dia homelohin’izy ireo ho faty izy, ary hatolony amin’ny hafa firenena,', '“miakatra ho any jerosalema isika izao. ary hatolotra amin’ny lehiben’ny mpisorona sy ny mpanora-dalàna ny zanak’olona. dia homelohin’izy ireo ho faty izy, ary hatolony amin’ny hafa firenena,'),
  ('6ab25c2ed5b40c92353b8635', '2026-09-22T10:45:02.218Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:02.218Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 12, 16, 'Dia nitondran’ireo izy. Ary hoy izy tamin’ireo: “Sarin’iza io, dia anaran’iza io?” Hoy ireo taminy: “An’i Kaisara.”', 'dia nitondran’ireo izy. ary hoy izy tamin’ireo: “sarin’iza io, dia anaran’iza io?” hoy ireo taminy: “an’i kaisara.”'),
  ('6ab25c2ed5b40c92353b8629', '2026-09-22T10:45:02.218Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:02.218Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 12, 4, 'Naniraka mpanompo hafa ho any amin’ireo mpamboly indray ilay lehilahy, nefa nokapohin’ireo teo amin’ny lohany ilay mpanompo sady nalany baraka.', 'naniraka mpanompo hafa ho any amin’ireo mpamboly indray ilay lehilahy, nefa nokapohin’ireo teo amin’ny lohany ilay mpanompo sady nalany baraka.'),
  ('6ab25c2ed5b40c92353b8627', '2026-09-22T10:45:02.218Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:02.218Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 12, 2, 'Rehefa tonga ny fotoam-piotazana, dia naniraka mpanompo ho any amin’ny mpamboly izy mba hanangona ny ampahany amin’ny vokatry ny tanimboaloboka avy tamin’izy ireo.', 'rehefa tonga ny fotoam-piotazana, dia naniraka mpanompo ho any amin’ny mpamboly izy mba hanangona ny ampahany amin’ny vokatry ny tanimboaloboka avy tamin’izy ireo.'),
  ('6ab25c2ed5b40c92353b863a', '2026-09-22T10:45:02.218Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:02.218Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 12, 21, 'Dia nampakatra an’ilay vehivavy ny faharoa, nefa maty tsy niteraka ihany koa, ary hoatr’izany koa ny fahatelo.', 'dia nampakatra an’ilay vehivavy ny faharoa, nefa maty tsy niteraka ihany koa, ary hoatr’izany koa ny fahatelo.'),
  ('6ab25c2ed5b40c92353b863d', '2026-09-22T10:45:02.218Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:02.218Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 12, 24, 'Hoy i Jesosy tamin’ireo: “Samy tsy hainareo na ny Soratra Masina na ny herin’Andriamanitra. Tsy izany ve no mahadiso hevitra anareo?', 'hoy i jesosy tamin’ireo: “samy tsy hainareo na ny soratra masina na ny herin’andriamanitra. tsy izany ve no mahadiso hevitra anareo?'),
  ('6ab25c2ed5b40c92353b862a', '2026-09-22T10:45:02.218Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:02.218Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 12, 5, 'Ary naniraka mpanompo hafa indray izy, saingy novonoin’ireo ho faty ilay mpanompo. Mbola naniraka olon-kafa be dia be koa izy, nefa ny sasany nokapohin’ireo, ary ny sasany novonoiny ho faty.', 'ary naniraka mpanompo hafa indray izy, saingy novonoin’ireo ho faty ilay mpanompo. mbola naniraka olon-kafa be dia be koa izy, nefa ny sasany nokapohin’ireo, ary ny sasany novonoiny ho faty.'),
  ('6ab25c2ed5b40c92353b862b', '2026-09-22T10:45:02.218Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:02.218Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 12, 6, 'Iray sisa no teo aminy, dia ny zanany tena tiany, ka io no nirahiny farany tany amin’ireo. Fa hoy izy: ‘Mba hohajain’ireny kosa ny zanako e!’', 'iray sisa no teo aminy, dia ny zanany tena tiany, ka io no nirahiny farany tany amin’ireo. fa hoy izy: ‘mba hohajain’ireny kosa ny zanako e!’'),
  ('6ab25c2ed5b40c92353b8633', '2026-09-22T10:45:02.218Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:02.218Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 12, 14, 'Rehefa tonga ireo dia niteny taminy hoe: “Mpampianatra ô, fantatray fa milaza ny marina foana ianao. Tsy mba mila sitraka amin’ny olona koa ianao satria tsy mijery tavan’olona, ary marina ny fampianaranao momba an’Andriamanitra. Azo atao ve sa tsia ny mandoa hetra amin’i Kaisara?', 'rehefa tonga ireo dia niteny taminy hoe: “mpampianatra ô, fantatray fa milaza ny marina foana ianao. tsy mba mila sitraka amin’ny olona koa ianao satria tsy mijery tavan’olona, ary marina ny fampianaranao momba an’andriamanitra. azo atao ve sa tsia ny mandoa hetra amin’i kaisara?'),
  ('6ab25c2ed5b40c92353b8634', '2026-09-22T10:45:02.218Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:02.218Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 12, 15, 'Tokony handoa ve izahay sa tsia?” Fantatr’i Jesosy anefa hoe nihatsaravelatsihy izy ireo, ka hoy izy taminy: “Maninona ianareo no mitsapa ahy? Itondray denaria iray aho hojereko.”', 'tokony handoa ve izahay sa tsia?” fantatr’i jesosy anefa hoe nihatsaravelatsihy izy ireo, ka hoy izy taminy: “maninona ianareo no mitsapa ahy? itondray denaria iray aho hojereko.”'),
  ('6ab25c2ed5b40c92353b8631', '2026-09-22T10:45:02.218Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:02.218Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 12, 12, 'Ary te hisambotra an’i Jesosy ny fahavalony, satria takany hoe izy ireo no tao an-tsain’i Jesosy tamin’ilay fanoharana. Natahotra ny vahoaka anefa izy ireo, ka lasa nandeha.', 'ary te hisambotra an’i jesosy ny fahavalony, satria takany hoe izy ireo no tao an-tsain’i jesosy tamin’ilay fanoharana. natahotra ny vahoaka anefa izy ireo, ka lasa nandeha.'),
  ('6ab25c2ed5b40c92353b862e', '2026-09-22T10:45:02.218Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:02.218Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 12, 9, 'Inona àry no hataon’ilay tompon’ny tanimboaloboka? Ho avy izy dia hovonoiny ho faty ireo mpamboly ireo, ary homeny olon-kafa ny tanimboaloboka.', 'inona àry no hataon’ilay tompon’ny tanimboaloboka? ho avy izy dia hovonoiny ho faty ireo mpamboly ireo, ary homeny olon-kafa ny tanimboaloboka.'),
  ('6ab25c2ed5b40c92353b8626', '2026-09-22T10:45:02.218Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:02.218Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 12, 1, 'Nanomboka nanao fanoharana tamin’ireo izy avy eo hoe: “Nanao tanimboaloboka ny lehilahy iray, ary nofefeny ny manodidina. Dia nihady lavaka famiazam-boaloboka izy ary nanangana tilikambo. Nampanofainy tamin’ny mpamboly ilay izy avy eo, dia lasa nankany an-tany hafa izy.', 'nanomboka nanao fanoharana tamin’ireo izy avy eo hoe: “nanao tanimboaloboka ny lehilahy iray, ary nofefeny ny manodidina. dia nihady lavaka famiazam-boaloboka izy ary nanangana tilikambo. nampanofainy tamin’ny mpamboly ilay izy avy eo, dia lasa nankany an-tany hafa izy.'),
  ('6ab25c2ed5b40c92353b8637', '2026-09-22T10:45:02.218Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:02.218Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 12, 18, 'Ary nanatona azy ny Sadoseo, izay milaza fa tsy misy fitsanganan’ny maty. Nanontanian’ireo izy hoe:', 'ary nanatona azy ny sadoseo, izay milaza fa tsy misy fitsanganan’ny maty. nanontanian’ireo izy hoe:'),
  ('6ab25c2ed5b40c92353b862d', '2026-09-22T10:45:02.218Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:02.218Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 12, 8, 'Koa nosamborin’ireo izy dia novonoiny ho faty, ka notaritaritiny tany ivelan’ny tanimboaloboka.', 'koa nosamborin’ireo izy dia novonoiny ho faty, ka notaritaritiny tany ivelan’ny tanimboaloboka.'),
  ('6ab25c2ed5b40c92353b862f', '2026-09-22T10:45:02.218Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:02.218Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 12, 10, 'Angaha mbola tsy novakinareo tao amin’ny Soratra Masina mihitsy ilay hoe: ‘Ny vato tsy tian’ny mpanao trano no lasa vato fehizoro lehibe indrindra.', 'angaha mbola tsy novakinareo tao amin’ny soratra masina mihitsy ilay hoe: ‘ny vato tsy tian’ny mpanao trano no lasa vato fehizoro lehibe indrindra.'),
  ('6ab25c2ed5b40c92353b863b', '2026-09-22T10:45:02.218Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:02.218Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 12, 22, 'Samy tsy niteraka izy fito mirahalahy. Maty koa ilay vehivavy tamin’ny farany.', 'samy tsy niteraka izy fito mirahalahy. maty koa ilay vehivavy tamin’ny farany.'),
  ('6ab25c2ed5b40c92353b8630', '2026-09-22T10:45:02.218Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:02.218Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 12, 11, 'Avy amin’i Jehovah izany sady mahavariana antsika’?”', 'avy amin’i jehovah izany sady mahavariana antsika’?”'),
  ('6ab25c2ed5b40c92353b863c', '2026-09-22T10:45:02.218Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:02.218Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 12, 23, 'Rehefa atsangana ny maty, ho vadin’iza ilay vehivavy? Efa samy nanambady azy daholo mantsy izy fito mirahalahy.”', 'rehefa atsangana ny maty, ho vadin’iza ilay vehivavy? efa samy nanambady azy daholo mantsy izy fito mirahalahy.”'),
  ('6ab25c2ed5b40c92353b8639', '2026-09-22T10:45:02.218Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:02.218Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 12, 20, 'Nisy fito mirahalahy àry. Nanambady ilay voalohany, nefa maty tsy niteraka.', 'nisy fito mirahalahy àry. nanambady ilay voalohany, nefa maty tsy niteraka.'),
  ('6ab25c2ed5b40c92353b8636', '2026-09-22T10:45:02.218Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:02.218Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 12, 17, 'Hoy àry i Jesosy: “Aloavy amin’i Kaisara izay an’i Kaisara, fa amin’Andriamanitra kosa izay an’Andriamanitra.” Dia talanjona tamin’ny teniny ireo.', 'hoy àry i jesosy: “aloavy amin’i kaisara izay an’i kaisara, fa amin’andriamanitra kosa izay an’andriamanitra.” dia talanjona tamin’ny teniny ireo.'),
  ('6ab25c2ed5b40c92353b8638', '2026-09-22T10:45:02.218Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:02.218Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 12, 19, '“Mpampianatra ô, nanoratra ho antsika i Mosesy hoe raha maty ny lehilahy anankiray ka namela vady nefa tsy niteraka, dia tokony hampakatra an’ilay vady navelany ny rahalahiny, ka hanome taranaka ho an’ilay rahalahiny efa maty.', '“mpampianatra ô, nanoratra ho antsika i mosesy hoe raha maty ny lehilahy anankiray ka namela vady nefa tsy niteraka, dia tokony hampakatra an’ilay vady navelany ny rahalahiny, ka hanome taranaka ho an’ilay rahalahiny efa maty.'),
  ('6ab25c2ed5b40c92353b8632', '2026-09-22T10:45:02.218Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:02.218Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 12, 13, 'Ary nirahin’ireo hankany amin’i Jesosy ny sasany tamin’ny Fariseo sy ny mpanohana an’i Heroda mba hamandrika azy amin’ny teniny.', 'ary nirahin’ireo hankany amin’i jesosy ny sasany tamin’ny fariseo sy ny mpanohana an’i heroda mba hamandrika azy amin’ny teniny.'),
  ('6ab25c2ed5b40c92353b862c', '2026-09-22T10:45:02.218Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:02.218Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 12, 7, 'Nifampiresaka anefa ireo mpamboly ireo hoe: ‘Iny ny mpandova! Andao izy hovonointsika, dia amin’izay ho lasantsika ny lova!’', 'nifampiresaka anefa ireo mpamboly ireo hoe: ‘iny ny mpandova! andao izy hovonointsika, dia amin’izay ho lasantsika ny lova!’'),
  ('6ab25c2ed5b40c92353b8628', '2026-09-22T10:45:02.218Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:02.218Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 12, 3, 'Nalain’izy ireo anefa ilay mpanompo dia nokapohiny, ka nalefany nody maina.', 'nalain’izy ireo anefa ilay mpanompo dia nokapohiny, ka nalefany nody maina.'),
  ('6ab25c2ed5b40c92353b8649', '2026-09-22T10:45:02.219Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:02.219Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 12, 36, 'I Davida aza nasain’ny fanahy masina niteny hoe: ‘Hoy i Jehovah tamin’ny Tompoko: “Mipetraha eto ankavanako mandra-panaoko ny fahavalonao ho eo ambany tongotrao.”’', 'i davida aza nasain’ny fanahy masina niteny hoe: ‘hoy i jehovah tamin’ny tompoko: “mipetraha eto ankavanako mandra-panaoko ny fahavalonao ho eo ambany tongotrao.”’'),
  ('6ab25c2ed5b40c92353b863f', '2026-09-22T10:45:02.219Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:02.219Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 12, 26, 'Raha ny amin’ny maty izay atsangana, angaha mbola tsy novakinareo ilay ao amin’ny bokin’ i Mosesy, ao amin’ny fitantarana momba an’ilay voarointsilo, fa nilaza taminy Andriamanitra hoe: ‘Izaho no Andriamanitr’i Abrahama sy Andriamanitr’i Isaka ary Andriamanitr’i Jakoba’?', 'raha ny amin’ny maty izay atsangana, angaha mbola tsy novakinareo ilay ao amin’ny bokin’ i mosesy, ao amin’ny fitantarana momba an’ilay voarointsilo, fa nilaza taminy andriamanitra hoe: ‘izaho no andriamanitr’i abrahama sy andriamanitr’i isaka ary andriamanitr’i jakoba’?'),
  ('6ab25c2ed5b40c92353b8650', '2026-09-22T10:45:02.219Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:02.219Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 12, 43, 'Koa niantso ny mpianany hankeo aminy i Jesosy, dia hoy izy: “Lazaiko marina aminareo fa io mpitondratena mahantra io no nandrotsaka betsaka noho ny hafa rehetra nandrotsaka vola tao amin’ny vata fandrotsaham-bola.', 'koa niantso ny mpianany hankeo aminy i jesosy, dia hoy izy: “lazaiko marina aminareo fa io mpitondratena mahantra io no nandrotsaka betsaka noho ny hafa rehetra nandrotsaka vola tao amin’ny vata fandrotsaham-bola.'),
  ('6ab25c2ed5b40c92353b864d', '2026-09-22T10:45:02.219Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:02.219Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 12, 40, 'Taperin’izy ireny ny fananan’ny mpitondratena, ary manao vavaka lava be izy ireny mba hisehosehoana fotsiny. Hahazo fanamelohana henjana kokoa izy ireny.”', 'taperin’izy ireny ny fananan’ny mpitondratena, ary manao vavaka lava be izy ireny mba hisehosehoana fotsiny. hahazo fanamelohana henjana kokoa izy ireny.”'),
  ('6ab25c2ed5b40c92353b8645', '2026-09-22T10:45:02.219Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:02.219Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 12, 32, 'Hoy ilay mpanora-dalàna taminy: “Izay mihitsy, ry Mpampianatra ô! Marina ilay teninao hoe: ‘Iray ihany Izy, ary tsy misy ankoatra azy.’', 'hoy ilay mpanora-dalàna taminy: “izay mihitsy, ry mpampianatra ô! marina ilay teninao hoe: ‘iray ihany izy, ary tsy misy ankoatra azy.’'),
  ('6ab25c2ed5b40c92353b864c', '2026-09-22T10:45:02.219Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:02.219Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 12, 39, 'sy ny hahazo toerana eny aloha ao amin’ny synagoga ary ny toerana mihaja indrindra any amin’ny sakafo hariva.', 'sy ny hahazo toerana eny aloha ao amin’ny synagoga ary ny toerana mihaja indrindra any amin’ny sakafo hariva.'),
  ('6ab25c2ed5b40c92353b864a', '2026-09-22T10:45:02.219Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:02.219Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 12, 37, 'Koa i Davida aza niantso azy hoe Tompo, dia ahoana no maha zanany azy?” Ary nahafaly ny vahoaka ny nihaino azy.', 'koa i davida aza niantso azy hoe tompo, dia ahoana no maha zanany azy?” ary nahafaly ny vahoaka ny nihaino azy.'),
  ('6ab25c2ed5b40c92353b8647', '2026-09-22T10:45:02.219Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:02.219Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 12, 34, 'Hitan’i Jesosy fa nahay namaly ilay lehilahy, ka hoy izy taminy: “Tsy lavitra ny Fanjakan’Andriamanitra ianao.” Tsy nisy sahy nanontany azy intsony taorian’izay.', 'hitan’i jesosy fa nahay namaly ilay lehilahy, ka hoy izy taminy: “tsy lavitra ny fanjakan’andriamanitra ianao.” tsy nisy sahy nanontany azy intsony taorian’izay.'),
  ('6ab25c2ed5b40c92353b8644', '2026-09-22T10:45:02.219Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:02.219Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 12, 31, 'Ny faharoa dia izao: ‘Tiavo ny namanao tahaka ny tenanao.’ Tsy misy didy lehibe noho ireo.”', 'ny faharoa dia izao: ‘tiavo ny namanao tahaka ny tenanao.’ tsy misy didy lehibe noho ireo.”'),
  ('6ab25c2ed5b40c92353b864b', '2026-09-22T10:45:02.219Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:02.219Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 12, 38, 'Hoy koa izy tamin’izy mbola nampianatra iny: “Mitandrema amin’ny mpanora-dalàna, izay tia mandehandeha manao akanjo lava. Tiany koa ny hoarahabaina eny an-tsena', 'hoy koa izy tamin’izy mbola nampianatra iny: “mitandrema amin’ny mpanora-dalàna, izay tia mandehandeha manao akanjo lava. tiany koa ny hoarahabaina eny an-tsena'),
  ('6ab25c2ed5b40c92353b8651', '2026-09-22T10:45:02.219Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:02.219Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 12, 44, 'Izy rehetra mantsy nandrotsaka avy tamin’izay sisa tsy laniny, fa io vehivavy io kosa na mahantra aza, dia nandrotsaka an’izay rehetra nananany, dia ny fivelomany rehetra.”', 'izy rehetra mantsy nandrotsaka avy tamin’izay sisa tsy laniny, fa io vehivavy io kosa na mahantra aza, dia nandrotsaka an’izay rehetra nananany, dia ny fivelomany rehetra.”'),
  ('6ab25c2ed5b40c92353b8641', '2026-09-22T10:45:02.219Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:02.219Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 12, 28, 'Nisy mpanora-dalàna iray nanatona ka naheno azy ireo niady hevitra. Fantany fa nahavaly tsara azy ireo i Jesosy, ka nanontaniany hoe: “Inona no voalohany amin’ny didy rehetra?”', 'nisy mpanora-dalàna iray nanatona ka naheno azy ireo niady hevitra. fantany fa nahavaly tsara azy ireo i jesosy, ka nanontaniany hoe: “inona no voalohany amin’ny didy rehetra?”'),
  ('6ab25c2ed5b40c92353b863e', '2026-09-22T10:45:02.219Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:02.219Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 12, 25, 'Fa rehefa atsangana ny maty, dia tsy hampaka-bady na havoaka hampakarina, fa hitovy amin’ny anjely any an-danitra.', 'fa rehefa atsangana ny maty, dia tsy hampaka-bady na havoaka hampakarina, fa hitovy amin’ny anjely any an-danitra.'),
  ('6ab25c2ed5b40c92353b8648', '2026-09-22T10:45:02.219Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:02.219Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 12, 35, 'Raha mbola nampianatra tao amin’ny tempoly anefa i Jesosy, dia niteny hoe: “Maninona no lazain’ny mpanora-dalàna fa zanak’i Davida i Kristy?', 'raha mbola nampianatra tao amin’ny tempoly anefa i jesosy, dia niteny hoe: “maninona no lazain’ny mpanora-dalàna fa zanak’i davida i kristy?'),
  ('6ab25c2ed5b40c92353b8643', '2026-09-22T10:45:02.219Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:02.219Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 12, 30, 'Ary tiavo i Jehovah Andriamanitrao amin’ny fonao manontolo sy ny tenanao manontolo sy ny sainao manontolo ary ny herinao manontolo.’', 'ary tiavo i jehovah andriamanitrao amin’ny fonao manontolo sy ny tenanao manontolo sy ny sainao manontolo ary ny herinao manontolo.’'),
  ('6ab25c2ed5b40c92353b864f', '2026-09-22T10:45:02.219Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:02.219Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 12, 42, 'Tonga kosa ny vehivavy mpitondratena mahantra iray, nandrotsaka vola madinika kely anankiroa zara raha nisy vidiny.', 'tonga kosa ny vehivavy mpitondratena mahantra iray, nandrotsaka vola madinika kely anankiroa zara raha nisy vidiny.'),
  ('6ab25c2ed5b40c92353b8642', '2026-09-22T10:45:02.219Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:02.219Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 12, 29, 'Dia namaly i Jesosy hoe: “Ny voalohany dia izao: ‘Henoy izao, ry Israely ô: I Jehovah Andriamanitsika dia Jehovah iray ihany.', 'dia namaly i jesosy hoe: “ny voalohany dia izao: ‘henoy izao, ry israely ô: i jehovah andriamanitsika dia jehovah iray ihany.'),
  ('6ab25c2ed5b40c92353b8640', '2026-09-22T10:45:02.219Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:02.219Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 12, 27, 'Tsy mba Andriamanitry ny maty izy, fa an’ny velona. Diso hevitra tanteraka ianareo.”', 'tsy mba andriamanitry ny maty izy, fa an’ny velona. diso hevitra tanteraka ianareo.”'),
  ('6ab25c2ed5b40c92353b864e', '2026-09-22T10:45:02.219Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:02.219Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 12, 41, 'Ary nipetraka tandrifin’ny vata fandrotsaham-bola izy, ka nodinihiny ny vahoaka nandrotsaka vola tao amin’ireo vata ireo. Ary betsaka ny mpanankarena nandrotsaka vola madinika be dia be.', 'ary nipetraka tandrifin’ny vata fandrotsaham-bola izy, ka nodinihiny ny vahoaka nandrotsaka vola tao amin’ireo vata ireo. ary betsaka ny mpanankarena nandrotsaka vola madinika be dia be.'),
  ('6ab25c2ed5b40c92353b8646', '2026-09-22T10:45:02.219Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:02.219Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 12, 33, 'Ary sarobidy lavitra noho ny fanatitra dorana sy ny sorona rehetra ny fitiavana azy amin’ny fo manontolo sy ny saina manontolo ary ny hery manontolo, sy ny fitiavana ny namana tahaka ny tena.”', 'ary sarobidy lavitra noho ny fanatitra dorana sy ny sorona rehetra ny fitiavana azy amin’ny fo manontolo sy ny saina manontolo ary ny hery manontolo, sy ny fitiavana ny namana tahaka ny tena.”'),
  ('6ab25c2f32e7ac8221aa4589', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.265Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.265Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 13, 1, 'Ary rehefa nivoaka ny tempoly izy, dia hoy ny iray tamin’ny mpianany: “Mpampianatra ô, jereo ange e! Tsara be ireo vato sy trano ireo e?”', 'ary rehefa nivoaka ny tempoly izy, dia hoy ny iray tamin’ny mpianany: “mpampianatra ô, jereo ange e! tsara be ireo vato sy trano ireo e?”'),
  ('6ab25c2f32e7ac8221aa458c', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.265Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.265Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 13, 4, '“Lazao aminay hoe rahoviana no hitranga izany, ary inona no ho famantarana rehefa hifarana izany rehetra izany?”', '“lazao aminay hoe rahoviana no hitranga izany, ary inona no ho famantarana rehefa hifarana izany rehetra izany?”'),
  ('6ab25c2f32e7ac8221aa4590', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.265Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.265Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 13, 8, '“Fa hisy firenena hiady amin’ny firenena, ary hisy fanjakana hiady amin’ny fanjakana. Hisy horohoron-tany any amin’ny toerana samihafa, ary hisy mosary koa. Izany no fiandohan’ny fahoriana.', '“fa hisy firenena hiady amin’ny firenena, ary hisy fanjakana hiady amin’ny fanjakana. hisy horohoron-tany any amin’ny toerana samihafa, ary hisy mosary koa. izany no fiandohan’ny fahoriana.'),
  ('6ab25c2f32e7ac8221aa458f', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.265Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.265Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 13, 7, 'Ary aza matahotra rehefa maheno ady ianareo sy rehefa misy milaza aminareo hoe misy ady any an-toeran-kafa. Tsy maintsy hitranga izany, nefa mbola tsy ho tonga ny farany.', 'ary aza matahotra rehefa maheno ady ianareo sy rehefa misy milaza aminareo hoe misy ady any an-toeran-kafa. tsy maintsy hitranga izany, nefa mbola tsy ho tonga ny farany.'),
  ('6ab25c2f32e7ac8221aa458e', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.265Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.265Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 13, 6, 'Fa maro no hisandoka ny anarako, dia hiteny hoe: ‘Izaho no izy’, ka be dia be no ho voafitany.', 'fa maro no hisandoka ny anarako, dia hiteny hoe: ‘izaho no izy’, ka be dia be no ho voafitany.'),
  ('6ab25c2f32e7ac8221aa458b', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.265Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.265Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 13, 3, 'Tamin’izy nipetrapetraka teo amin’ny Tendrombohitra Oliva sady nahatazana ny tempoly, dia nanontany azy mitokana i Petera sy Jakoba sy Jaona ary Andrea hoe:', 'tamin’izy nipetrapetraka teo amin’ny tendrombohitra oliva sady nahatazana ny tempoly, dia nanontany azy mitokana i petera sy jakoba sy jaona ary andrea hoe:'),
  ('6ab25c2f32e7ac8221aa4592', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.265Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.265Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 13, 10, 'Ankoatra izany, dia tsy maintsy hotorina any amin’ny firenena rehetra aloha ny vaovao tsara.', 'ankoatra izany, dia tsy maintsy hotorina any amin’ny firenena rehetra aloha ny vaovao tsara.'),
  ('6ab25c2f32e7ac8221aa458a', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.265Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.265Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 13, 2, 'Hoy anefa i Jesosy taminy: “Hitanao ve ireo trano be ireo? Tsy hisy vato havela hifanaingina mihitsy eo, fa harodana daholo.”', 'hoy anefa i jesosy taminy: “hitanao ve ireo trano be ireo? tsy hisy vato havela hifanaingina mihitsy eo, fa harodana daholo.”'),
  ('6ab25c2f32e7ac8221aa4591', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.265Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.265Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 13, 9, '“Ianareo kosa mitandrema, fa hanolotra anareo any amin’ny fitsarana ny olona. Hokapohina any amin’ny synagoga ianareo, ary hoentina any amin’ny governora sy ny mpanjaka noho ny amiko, mba ho vavolombeloko eo anatrehany.', '“ianareo kosa mitandrema, fa hanolotra anareo any amin’ny fitsarana ny olona. hokapohina any amin’ny synagoga ianareo, ary hoentina any amin’ny governora sy ny mpanjaka noho ny amiko, mba ho vavolombeloko eo anatrehany.'),
  ('6ab25c2f32e7ac8221aa458d', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.265Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.265Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 13, 5, 'Koa niteny taminy i Jesosy hoe: “Mitandrema sao hisy hamitaka anareo.', 'koa niteny taminy i jesosy hoe: “mitandrema sao hisy hamitaka anareo.'),
  ('6ab25c2f32e7ac8221aa45ac', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.266Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.266Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 13, 36, 'Dia amin’izay ianareo tsy ho hitany matory, rehefa tonga tampoka izy.', 'dia amin’izay ianareo tsy ho hitany matory, rehefa tonga tampoka izy.'),
  ('6ab25c2f32e7ac8221aa45a8', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.266Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.266Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 13, 32, '“Tsy misy mahalala an’izany andro na ora izany, na ny anjely any an-danitra, na ny Zanaka, afa-tsy ny Ray ihany.', '“tsy misy mahalala an’izany andro na ora izany, na ny anjely any an-danitra, na ny zanaka, afa-tsy ny ray ihany.'),
  ('6ab25c2f32e7ac8221aa45a5', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.266Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.266Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 13, 29, 'Hoatr’izany koa fa rehefa hitanareo hoe miseho izany zavatra izany, dia fantaro fa efa akaiky izy, efa eo am-baravarana.', 'hoatr’izany koa fa rehefa hitanareo hoe miseho izany zavatra izany, dia fantaro fa efa akaiky izy, efa eo am-baravarana.'),
  ('6ab25c2f32e7ac8221aa45a1', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.266Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.266Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 13, 25, 'ho latsaka avy any an-danitra ny kintana, ary hohozongozonina ny hery eny amin’ny lanitra.', 'ho latsaka avy any an-danitra ny kintana, ary hohozongozonina ny hery eny amin’ny lanitra.'),
  ('6ab25c2f32e7ac8221aa4596', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.266Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.266Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 13, 14, '“Rehefa hitanareo anefa fa mitsangana eo amin’izay tsy tokony hitsanganany ilay zava-maharikoriko mahatonga faharavana—aoka ny mpamaky handinika tsara—, dia mila mandositra any an-tendrombohitra izay any Jodia.', '“rehefa hitanareo anefa fa mitsangana eo amin’izay tsy tokony hitsanganany ilay zava-maharikoriko mahatonga faharavana—aoka ny mpamaky handinika tsara—, dia mila mandositra any an-tendrombohitra izay any jodia.'),
  ('6ab25c2f32e7ac8221aa45ad', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.266Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.266Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 13, 37, 'Izay lazaiko aminareo anefa dia lazaiko amin’ny rehetra hoe: Miambena foana.”', 'izay lazaiko aminareo anefa dia lazaiko amin’ny rehetra hoe: miambena foana.”'),
  ('6ab25c2f32e7ac8221aa459d', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.266Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.266Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 13, 21, '“Ary aza mino raha misy milaza aminareo hoe: ‘Atỳ Kristy!’, na hoe: ‘Arỳ izy!’', '“ary aza mino raha misy milaza aminareo hoe: ‘atỳ kristy!’, na hoe: ‘arỳ izy!’'),
  ('6ab25c2f32e7ac8221aa4594', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.266Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.266Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 13, 12, 'Ny rahalahy koa hanolotra ny rahalahiny hovonoina ho faty, ny ray hanolotra ny zanany, ary ny zanaka hanohitra ny ray aman-dreniny ka hampamono azy ho faty.', 'ny rahalahy koa hanolotra ny rahalahiny hovonoina ho faty, ny ray hanolotra ny zanany, ary ny zanaka hanohitra ny ray aman-dreniny ka hampamono azy ho faty.'),
  ('6ab25c2f32e7ac8221aa45a0', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.266Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.266Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 13, 24, '“Amin’izany andro izany, aorian’ilay fahoriana, dia ho maizina ny masoandro, tsy hanome hazavana ny volana,', '“amin’izany andro izany, aorian’ilay fahoriana, dia ho maizina ny masoandro, tsy hanome hazavana ny volana,'),
  ('6ab25c2f32e7ac8221aa4597', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.266Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.266Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 13, 15, 'Izay any an-tampon-trano koa tsy tokony hidina na hiditra ao an-tranony mba haka zavatra ao,', 'izay any an-tampon-trano koa tsy tokony hidina na hiditra ao an-tranony mba haka zavatra ao,'),
  ('6ab25c2f32e7ac8221aa4595', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.266Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.266Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 13, 13, 'Ary ho halan’ny olona rehetra ianareo noho ny anarako. Izay miaritra hatramin’ny farany anefa no hovonjena.', 'ary ho halan’ny olona rehetra ianareo noho ny anarako. izay miaritra hatramin’ny farany anefa no hovonjena.'),
  ('6ab25c2f32e7ac8221aa45a6', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.266Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.266Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 13, 30, 'Lazaiko marina aminareo fa tsy ho tapitra mihitsy ity taranaka ity, mandra-pisehon’izany rehetra izany.', 'lazaiko marina aminareo fa tsy ho tapitra mihitsy ity taranaka ity, mandra-pisehon’izany rehetra izany.'),
  ('6ab25c2f32e7ac8221aa45ab', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.266Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.266Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 13, 35, 'Miambena foana àry, fa tsy fantatrareo hoe rahoviana ny tompon-trano no ho avy, na amin’ny takariva, na amin’ny misasakalina, na amin’ny maneno akoho, na vao maraina be.', 'miambena foana àry, fa tsy fantatrareo hoe rahoviana ny tompon-trano no ho avy, na amin’ny takariva, na amin’ny misasakalina, na amin’ny maneno akoho, na vao maraina be.'),
  ('6ab25c2f32e7ac8221aa45a7', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.266Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.266Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 13, 31, 'Ny lanitra sy ny tany ho levona, fa ny teniko tsy mba ho levona mihitsy.', 'ny lanitra sy ny tany ho levona, fa ny teniko tsy mba ho levona mihitsy.'),
  ('6ab25c2f32e7ac8221aa45a3', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.266Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.266Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 13, 27, 'Dia hirahiny ny anjely ka hangonin’izy ireo avy any amin’ny vazan-tany efatra ny olom-boafidiny, hatrany amin’ny faran’ny tany ka hatrany amin’ny faravodilanitra.', 'dia hirahiny ny anjely ka hangonin’izy ireo avy any amin’ny vazan-tany efatra ny olom-boafidiny, hatrany amin’ny faran’ny tany ka hatrany amin’ny faravodilanitra.'),
  ('6ab25c2f32e7ac8221aa4593', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.266Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.266Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 13, 11, 'Rehefa entiny mba hatolotra an’ireo manam-pahefana ianareo, dia aza manahy ny amin’izay holazainareo. Hampahatsiahy anareo izay tokony holazaina amin’izany ora izany ny fanahy masina, satria tsy ianareo no miteny, fa ny fanahy masina.', 'rehefa entiny mba hatolotra an’ireo manam-pahefana ianareo, dia aza manahy ny amin’izay holazainareo. hampahatsiahy anareo izay tokony holazaina amin’izany ora izany ny fanahy masina, satria tsy ianareo no miteny, fa ny fanahy masina.'),
  ('6ab25c2f32e7ac8221aa45a2', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.266Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.266Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 13, 26, 'Dia avy eo ho hitan’ny olona ho avy ao amin’ny rahona ny Zanak’olona, sady ho avy amin-kery lehibe sy voninahitra.', 'dia avy eo ho hitan’ny olona ho avy ao amin’ny rahona ny zanak’olona, sady ho avy amin-kery lehibe sy voninahitra.'),
  ('6ab25c2f32e7ac8221aa45a4', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.266Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.266Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 13, 28, '“Makà lesona avy amin’ity fanoharana momba ny aviavy ity: Raha vao mitsimoka ny rantsany ka manomboka misy raviny, dia fantatrareo fa efa akaiky ny fahavaratra.', '“makà lesona avy amin’ity fanoharana momba ny aviavy ity: raha vao mitsimoka ny rantsany ka manomboka misy raviny, dia fantatrareo fa efa akaiky ny fahavaratra.'),
  ('6ab25c2f32e7ac8221aa459f', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.266Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.266Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 13, 23, 'Mitandrema àry ianareo. Efa nolazaiko taminareo mialoha ny zava-drehetra.', 'mitandrema àry ianareo. efa nolazaiko taminareo mialoha ny zava-drehetra.'),
  ('6ab25c2f32e7ac8221aa459c', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.266Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.266Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 13, 20, 'Raha tsy nohafohezin’i Jehovah mantsy izany andro izany, dia tsy hisy olona ho voavonjy. Noho ny olom-boafidiny anefa, dia nohafoheziny izany andro izany.', 'raha tsy nohafohezin’i jehovah mantsy izany andro izany, dia tsy hisy olona ho voavonjy. noho ny olom-boafidiny anefa, dia nohafoheziny izany andro izany.'),
  ('6ab25c2f32e7ac8221aa45aa', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.266Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.266Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 13, 34, 'Hoatran’ny lehilahy iray nandeha any an-tany hafa izany. Talohan’ny nandehanany, dia nomeny fahefana ny mpanompony sady nomeny asa tsirairay, ary ny mpiandry varavarana koa nasainy niambina foana.', 'hoatran’ny lehilahy iray nandeha any an-tany hafa izany. talohan’ny nandehanany, dia nomeny fahefana ny mpanompony sady nomeny asa tsirairay, ary ny mpiandry varavarana koa nasainy niambina foana.'),
  ('6ab25c2f32e7ac8221aa45a9', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.266Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.266Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 13, 33, 'Mitandrema foana sy miambena foana, fa tsy fantatrareo hoe rahoviana ny fotoana voatondro.', 'mitandrema foana sy miambena foana, fa tsy fantatrareo hoe rahoviana ny fotoana voatondro.'),
  ('6ab25c2f32e7ac8221aa459b', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.266Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.266Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 13, 19, 'Fa izany andro izany dia ho andro fahoriana izay mbola tsy nisy hoatr’izany hatramin’ny niandohan’ny zavatra noforonin’Andriamanitra ka hatramin’izany fotoana izany, sady tsy hisy intsony.', 'fa izany andro izany dia ho andro fahoriana izay mbola tsy nisy hoatr’izany hatramin’ny niandohan’ny zavatra noforonin’andriamanitra ka hatramin’izany fotoana izany, sady tsy hisy intsony.'),
  ('6ab25c2f32e7ac8221aa4599', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.266Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.266Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 13, 17, 'Loza no hanjo ny bevohoka sy ny mampinono, amin’izany andro izany!', 'loza no hanjo ny bevohoka sy ny mampinono, amin’izany andro izany!'),
  ('6ab25c2f32e7ac8221aa4598', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.266Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.266Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 13, 16, 'ary izay any an-tsaha tsy tokony hiverina any amin’izay efa nilaozany mba haka ny akanjony ivelany.', 'ary izay any an-tsaha tsy tokony hiverina any amin’izay efa nilaozany mba haka ny akanjony ivelany.'),
  ('6ab25c2f32e7ac8221aa459a', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.266Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.266Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 13, 18, 'Mivavaha foana mba tsy ho amin’ny ririnina izany no hitranga.', 'mivavaha foana mba tsy ho amin’ny ririnina izany no hitranga.'),
  ('6ab25c2f32e7ac8221aa459e', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.266Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.266Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 13, 22, 'Fa hisy Kristy sandoka sy mpaminany sandoka ho avy, ka hanao famantarana sy fahagagana, satria tiany havily lalana ny olom-boafidy, raha azony atao.', 'fa hisy kristy sandoka sy mpaminany sandoka ho avy, ka hanao famantarana sy fahagagana, satria tiany havily lalana ny olom-boafidy, raha azony atao.'),
  ('6ab25c2f7b6ea13ca1f950b2', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.804Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.804Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 14, 21, 'Fa handeha ny Zanak’olona, araka ny efa voasoratra momba azy, nefa hahita loza ilay olona hamadika ny Zanak’olona! Tsara kokoa ho an’ilay olona raha tsy teraka akory.”', 'fa handeha ny zanak’olona, araka ny efa voasoratra momba azy, nefa hahita loza ilay olona hamadika ny zanak’olona! tsara kokoa ho an’ilay olona raha tsy teraka akory.”'),
  ('6ab25c2f7b6ea13ca1f950c0', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.804Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.804Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 14, 35, 'Ary nandroso kelikely izy, dia niankohoka tamin’ny tany ka nanomboka nivavaka mba tsy hiatrika an’izany ora izany, raha azony natao.', 'ary nandroso kelikely izy, dia niankohoka tamin’ny tany ka nanomboka nivavaka mba tsy hiatrika an’izany ora izany, raha azony natao.'),
  ('6ab25c2f7b6ea13ca1f950b9', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.804Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.804Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 14, 28, 'Rehefa atsangana anefa aho, dia handeha hialoha anareo any Galilia.”', 'rehefa atsangana anefa aho, dia handeha hialoha anareo any galilia.”'),
  ('6ab25c2f7b6ea13ca1f950af', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.804Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.804Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 14, 18, 'Rehefa naka toerana hisakafo teo amin’ny latabatra izy ireo, dia hoy i Jesosy: “Lazaiko marina aminareo fa hamadika ahy ny iray aminareo, dia ilay miara-mihinana amiko.”', 'rehefa naka toerana hisakafo teo amin’ny latabatra izy ireo, dia hoy i jesosy: “lazaiko marina aminareo fa hamadika ahy ny iray aminareo, dia ilay miara-mihinana amiko.”'),
  ('6ab25c2f7b6ea13ca1f950c1', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.804Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.804Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 14, 36, 'Dia hoy izy: “Aba, Ray ô, hainao ny zava-drehetra. Esory amiko ity kaopy ity, nefa aleo tsy izay tiako no hatao, fa izay tianao.”', 'dia hoy izy: “aba, ray ô, hainao ny zava-drehetra. esory amiko ity kaopy ity, nefa aleo tsy izay tiako no hatao, fa izay tianao.”'),
  ('6ab25c2f7b6ea13ca1f950b7', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.804Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.804Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 14, 26, 'Farany, dia nankany amin’ny Tendrombohitra Oliva izy ireo, rehefa avy nihira fiderana.', 'farany, dia nankany amin’ny tendrombohitra oliva izy ireo, rehefa avy nihira fiderana.'),
  ('6ab25c2f7b6ea13ca1f950a5', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.804Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.804Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 14, 8, 'Nanao izay azony natao izy, ka nandraraka menaka manitra tamin’ny vatako mba hanomanana mialoha ny fandevenana ahy.', 'nanao izay azony natao izy, ka nandraraka menaka manitra tamin’ny vatako mba hanomanana mialoha ny fandevenana ahy.'),
  ('6ab25c2f7b6ea13ca1f950a2', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.804Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.804Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 14, 5, 'Azo namidy 300 denaria mahery izao iny menaka iny, dia nomena ny mahantra ny vola!” Dia sorena be tamin’ilay vehivavy izy ireo.', 'azo namidy 300 denaria mahery izao iny menaka iny, dia nomena ny mahantra ny vola!” dia sorena be tamin’ilay vehivavy izy ireo.'),
  ('6ab25c2f7b6ea13ca1f9509e', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.804Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.804Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 14, 1, 'Roa andro sisa tamin’izay dia ho tonga ny Paska sy ny Fetin’ny Mofo Tsy Misy Lalivay. Ary nitady fomba hamitahana sy hisamborana azy ny lehiben’ny mpisorona sy ny mpanora-dalàna, mba hamonoana azy ho faty.', 'roa andro sisa tamin’izay dia ho tonga ny paska sy ny fetin’ny mofo tsy misy lalivay. ary nitady fomba hamitahana sy hisamborana azy ny lehiben’ny mpisorona sy ny mpanora-dalàna, mba hamonoana azy ho faty.'),
  ('6ab25c2f7b6ea13ca1f950b5', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.804Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.804Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 14, 24, 'Dia hoy izy tamin’ireo: “Ity no rako, dia ‘ny ran’ny fifanekena’ izay halatsaka mba hahasoa olona maro.', 'dia hoy izy tamin’ireo: “ity no rako, dia ‘ny ran’ny fifanekena’ izay halatsaka mba hahasoa olona maro.'),
  ('6ab25c2f7b6ea13ca1f950b0', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.804Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.804Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 14, 19, 'Ary nalahelo izy ireo, ka samy nanontany azy hoe: “Izaho ve izany?”', 'ary nalahelo izy ireo, ka samy nanontany azy hoe: “izaho ve izany?”'),
  ('6ab25c2f7b6ea13ca1f950ad', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.804Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.804Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 14, 16, 'Lasa àry ireo mpianany ireo nankao an-tanàna, ka hitan’izy ireo daholo izay nolazainy taminy. Ary nokarakarain’ireo ny Paska.', 'lasa àry ireo mpianany ireo nankao an-tanàna, ka hitan’izy ireo daholo izay nolazainy taminy. ary nokarakarain’ireo ny paska.'),
  ('6ab25c2f7b6ea13ca1f950a7', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.804Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.804Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 14, 10, 'Ary lasa nankany amin’ny lehiben’ny mpisorona i Jodasy Iskariota, iray tamin’izy 12 Lahy, satria te hamadika an’i Jesosy ka hanolotra azy tamin’ireo.', 'ary lasa nankany amin’ny lehiben’ny mpisorona i jodasy iskariota, iray tamin’izy 12 lahy, satria te hamadika an’i jesosy ka hanolotra azy tamin’ireo.'),
  ('6ab25c2f7b6ea13ca1f950a0', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.804Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.804Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 14, 3, 'Tamin’izy nisakafo tao an-tranon’i Simona boka, tany Betania, dia tonga ny vehivavy anankiray. Nitondra tavoahangy vatosanga feno menaka manitra lafo vidy be izy io, ary narda tena izy ilay menaka. Novakin’ilay vehivavy ilay tavoahangy, dia nararany teo an-dohan’i Jesosy ilay menaka.', 'tamin’izy nisakafo tao an-tranon’i simona boka, tany betania, dia tonga ny vehivavy anankiray. nitondra tavoahangy vatosanga feno menaka manitra lafo vidy be izy io, ary narda tena izy ilay menaka. novakin’ilay vehivavy ilay tavoahangy, dia nararany teo an-dohan’i jesosy ilay menaka.'),
  ('6ab25c2f7b6ea13ca1f950a9', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.804Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.804Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 14, 12, 'Ary tonga ny andro voalohany hankalazana ny Fetin’ny Mofo Tsy Misy Lalivay, izay andro fanolorana ny biby atao sorona amin’ny Paska. Dia hoy ny mpianany taminy: “Aiza no tianao hikarakaranay ny sakafon’ny Paska?”', 'ary tonga ny andro voalohany hankalazana ny fetin’ny mofo tsy misy lalivay, izay andro fanolorana ny biby atao sorona amin’ny paska. dia hoy ny mpianany taminy: “aiza no tianao hikarakaranay ny sakafon’ny paska?”'),
  ('6ab25c2f7b6ea13ca1f950c3', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.804Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.804Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 14, 38, 'Miambena sy mivavaha foana mba tsy ho resin’ny fakam-panahy. Mazoto ihany ny saina, saingy ny nofo no malemy.”', 'miambena sy mivavaha foana mba tsy ho resin’ny fakam-panahy. mazoto ihany ny saina, saingy ny nofo no malemy.”'),
  ('6ab25c2f7b6ea13ca1f950bc', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.804Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.804Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 14, 31, 'Mbola nanizingizina ihany anefa i Petera hoe: “Na tsy maintsy hiara-maty aminao aza aho, dia tsy handa anao izany mihitsy!” Ary niteny hoatr’izany koa ny hafa rehetra.', 'mbola nanizingizina ihany anefa i petera hoe: “na tsy maintsy hiara-maty aminao aza aho, dia tsy handa anao izany mihitsy!” ary niteny hoatr’izany koa ny hafa rehetra.'),
  ('6ab25c2f7b6ea13ca1f950b4', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.804Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.804Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 14, 23, 'Nandray kaopy koa izy ka nisaotra an’Andriamanitra, dia nomeny azy ireo ilay kaopy, ka nisotro tamin’iny izy rehetra.', 'nandray kaopy koa izy ka nisaotra an’andriamanitra, dia nomeny azy ireo ilay kaopy, ka nisotro tamin’iny izy rehetra.'),
  ('6ab25c2f7b6ea13ca1f950b6', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.804Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.804Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 14, 25, 'Lazaiko marina aminareo fa tsy hisotro amin’ny vokatry ny voaloboka intsony aho, mandra-pahatongan’ny andro hisotroako divay vaovao ao amin’ny Fanjakan’Andriamanitra.”', 'lazaiko marina aminareo fa tsy hisotro amin’ny vokatry ny voaloboka intsony aho, mandra-pahatongan’ny andro hisotroako divay vaovao ao amin’ny fanjakan’andriamanitra.”'),
  ('6ab25c2f7b6ea13ca1f950ae', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.804Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.804Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 14, 17, 'Dia tonga i Jesosy sy ny 12 Lahy, ny harivan’iny.', 'dia tonga i jesosy sy ny 12 lahy, ny harivan’iny.'),
  ('6ab25c2f7b6ea13ca1f950c2', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.804Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.804Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 14, 37, 'Niverina teo amin’ny mpianany izy ka nahita azy ireo natory, dia hoy izy tamin’i Petera: “Simona! Matory angaha ianao? Tsy nahavita niari-tory adiny iray akory ve ianao?', 'niverina teo amin’ny mpianany izy ka nahita azy ireo natory, dia hoy izy tamin’i petera: “simona! matory angaha ianao? tsy nahavita niari-tory adiny iray akory ve ianao?'),
  ('6ab25c2f7b6ea13ca1f950ab', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.804Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.804Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 14, 14, 'ka ao amin’izay idirany dia ilazao ny tompon-trano hoe: ‘Niteny ny Mpampianatra hoe: “Aiza ny efitra fandraisam-bahiny azoko ihinanana ny Paska miaraka amin’ny mpianatro?”’', 'ka ao amin’izay idirany dia ilazao ny tompon-trano hoe: ‘niteny ny mpampianatra hoe: “aiza ny efitra fandraisam-bahiny azoko ihinanana ny paska miaraka amin’ny mpianatro?”’'),
  ('6ab25c2f7b6ea13ca1f950a8', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.804Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.804Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 14, 11, 'Ary faly izy ireo rehefa naheno an’izany, ka nampanantena fa hanome vola azy. Nanomboka nitady fotoana hamadihana an’i Jesosy àry i Jodasy.', 'ary faly izy ireo rehefa naheno an’izany, ka nampanantena fa hanome vola azy. nanomboka nitady fotoana hamadihana an’i jesosy àry i jodasy.'),
  ('6ab25c2f7b6ea13ca1f950a6', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.804Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.804Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 14, 9, 'Lazaiko marina aminareo fa na aiza na aiza hitoriana ny vaovao tsara eran’izao tontolo izao, dia holazaina koa ny nataon’io vehivavy io, ho fahatsiarovana azy.”', 'lazaiko marina aminareo fa na aiza na aiza hitoriana ny vaovao tsara eran’izao tontolo izao, dia holazaina koa ny nataon’io vehivavy io, ho fahatsiarovana azy.”'),
  ('6ab25c2f7b6ea13ca1f950a4', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.804Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.804Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 14, 7, 'Hisy mahantra foana mantsy eo aminareo, ka isaky ny te hanao soa amin’ireny ianareo, dia afaka manao an’izany, fa izaho kosa tsy ho eo aminareo foana.', 'hisy mahantra foana mantsy eo aminareo, ka isaky ny te hanao soa amin’ireny ianareo, dia afaka manao an’izany, fa izaho kosa tsy ho eo aminareo foana.'),
  ('6ab25c2f7b6ea13ca1f950a1', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.804Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.804Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 14, 4, 'Dia tezitra ny sasany ka nifampiresaka hoe: “Fa maninona no lanilanina fotsiny hoatr’izao iny menaka manitra iny?', 'dia tezitra ny sasany ka nifampiresaka hoe: “fa maninona no lanilanina fotsiny hoatr’izao iny menaka manitra iny?'),
  ('6ab25c2f7b6ea13ca1f950ba', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.804Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.804Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 14, 29, 'Ary hoy i Petera taminy: “Na hahafoy anao daholo aza izy rehetra, dia izaho tsy hahafoy anao izany.”', 'ary hoy i petera taminy: “na hahafoy anao daholo aza izy rehetra, dia izaho tsy hahafoy anao izany.”'),
  ('6ab25c2f7b6ea13ca1f9509f', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.804Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.804Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 14, 2, 'Hoy anefa izy ireo: “Aleo tsy amin’ny fety, sao hisahotaka ny vahoaka.”', 'hoy anefa izy ireo: “aleo tsy amin’ny fety, sao hisahotaka ny vahoaka.”'),
  ('6ab25c2f7b6ea13ca1f950be', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.804Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.804Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 14, 33, 'Nentiny niaraka taminy i Petera sy Jakoba ary Jaona. Dia nanomboka nalahelo be sy nitebiteby be izy.', 'nentiny niaraka taminy i petera sy jakoba ary jaona. dia nanomboka nalahelo be sy nitebiteby be izy.'),
  ('6ab25c2f7b6ea13ca1f950bd', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.804Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.804Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 14, 32, 'Ary tonga tao amin’ny toerana iray antsoina hoe Getsemane izy ireo. Dia hoy izy tamin’ny mpianany: “Mipetraha eto fa izaho handeha hivavaka.”', 'ary tonga tao amin’ny toerana iray antsoina hoe getsemane izy ireo. dia hoy izy tamin’ny mpianany: “mipetraha eto fa izaho handeha hivavaka.”'),
  ('6ab25c2f7b6ea13ca1f950b1', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.804Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.804Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 14, 20, 'Dia hoy izy tamin’ireo: “Iray aminareo 12 Lahy ilay izy, ilay miara-manatsoboka ny mofony amiko ao anaty vilia.', 'dia hoy izy tamin’ireo: “iray aminareo 12 lahy ilay izy, ilay miara-manatsoboka ny mofony amiko ao anaty vilia.'),
  ('6ab25c2f7b6ea13ca1f950ac', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.804Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.804Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 14, 15, 'Dia hasehony anareo ny efitra malalaka iray any ambony rihana, izay efa misy fanaka sady efa vonona. Karakarao ao ny sakafon’ny Paska ho antsika.”', 'dia hasehony anareo ny efitra malalaka iray any ambony rihana, izay efa misy fanaka sady efa vonona. karakarao ao ny sakafon’ny paska ho antsika.”'),
  ('6ab25c2f7b6ea13ca1f950b8', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.804Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.804Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 14, 27, 'Ary hoy i Jesosy: “Hahafoy ahy daholo ianareo, fa voasoratra hoe: ‘Hasiako ny mpiandry, dia hiparitaka ny ondry.’', 'ary hoy i jesosy: “hahafoy ahy daholo ianareo, fa voasoratra hoe: ‘hasiako ny mpiandry, dia hiparitaka ny ondry.’');
INSERT INTO "bible_verses" ("id", "created_date", "updated_date", "created_by_id", "created_by", "translation", "book", "bookOrder", "chapter", "verse", "text", "normalizedText") VALUES
  ('6ab25c2f7b6ea13ca1f950aa', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.804Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.804Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 14, 13, 'Koa naniraka roa lahy tamin’ny mpianany izy, nanao hoe: “Mankanesa any an-tanàna ianareo, dia hifanena amin’ny lehilahy iray mitondra siny tany feno rano. Araho izy,', 'koa naniraka roa lahy tamin’ny mpianany izy, nanao hoe: “mankanesa any an-tanàna ianareo, dia hifanena amin’ny lehilahy iray mitondra siny tany feno rano. araho izy,'),
  ('6ab25c2f7b6ea13ca1f950bf', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.804Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.804Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 14, 34, 'Hoy izy tamin’izy ireo: “Tena malahelo be aho izany, hoatran’ny efa ho faty. Mijanòna eto dia miareta tory.”', 'hoy izy tamin’izy ireo: “tena malahelo be aho izany, hoatran’ny efa ho faty. mijanòna eto dia miareta tory.”'),
  ('6ab25c2f7b6ea13ca1f950bb', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.804Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.804Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 14, 30, 'Dia hoy i Jesosy taminy: “Lazaiko marina aminao fa anio alina ihany, raha mbola tsy maneno indroa akory ny akoho, dia handa ahy intelo ianao.”', 'dia hoy i jesosy taminy: “lazaiko marina aminao fa anio alina ihany, raha mbola tsy maneno indroa akory ny akoho, dia handa ahy intelo ianao.”'),
  ('6ab25c2f7b6ea13ca1f950b3', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.804Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.804Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 14, 22, 'Raha mbola nihinana izy ireo, dia nandray mofo i Jesosy ka nivavaka. Dia notapahiny ilay mofo ka nomeny azy ireo, sady hoy izy: “Raiso, ity no vatako.”', 'raha mbola nihinana izy ireo, dia nandray mofo i jesosy ka nivavaka. dia notapahiny ilay mofo ka nomeny azy ireo, sady hoy izy: “raiso, ity no vatako.”'),
  ('6ab25c2f7b6ea13ca1f950a3', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.804Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.804Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 14, 6, 'Hoy anefa i Jesosy: “Avelao izy. Fa maninona no ataonareo an’izany izy? Tena tsara ny nataony tamiko.', 'hoy anefa i jesosy: “avelao izy. fa maninona no ataonareo an’izany izy? tena tsara ny nataony tamiko.'),
  ('6ab25c2f7b6ea13ca1f950d3', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.805Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.805Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 14, 54, 'Nanaraka teny lavidavitra teny anefa i Petera, hatrany an-tokotanin’ny mpisoronabe. Dia niara-nipetrapetraka tamin’ny mpiasa an-trano teo izy sady nitanina afo teo.', 'nanaraka teny lavidavitra teny anefa i petera, hatrany an-tokotanin’ny mpisoronabe. dia niara-nipetrapetraka tamin’ny mpiasa an-trano teo izy sady nitanina afo teo.'),
  ('6ab25c2f7b6ea13ca1f950d2', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.805Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.805Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 14, 53, 'Ary nentin’izy ireo nankany amin’ny mpisoronabe i Jesosy. Efa tafavory tany daholo ny lehiben’ny mpisorona sy ny anti-panahy ary ny mpanora-dalàna rehetra.', 'ary nentin’izy ireo nankany amin’ny mpisoronabe i jesosy. efa tafavory tany daholo ny lehiben’ny mpisorona sy ny anti-panahy ary ny mpanora-dalàna rehetra.'),
  ('6ab25c2f7b6ea13ca1f950d0', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.805Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.805Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 14, 51, 'Nanaraka azy akaiky anefa ny tovolahy iray tsy nanao afa-tsy akanjo rongony tena tsara. Ary nanandrana nisambotra azy ny olona,', 'nanaraka azy akaiky anefa ny tovolahy iray tsy nanao afa-tsy akanjo rongony tena tsara. ary nanandrana nisambotra azy ny olona,'),
  ('6ab25c2f7b6ea13ca1f950d8', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.805Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.805Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 14, 59, 'Na tamin’izany aza anefa, dia mbola nifanohitra ihany ny tenin’izy ireo.', 'na tamin’izany aza anefa, dia mbola nifanohitra ihany ny tenin’izy ireo.'),
  ('6ab25c2f7b6ea13ca1f950d5', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.805Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.805Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 14, 56, 'Be dia be ny vavolombelona mandainga niampanga azy, nefa nifanohitra ny tenin’izy ireo.', 'be dia be ny vavolombelona mandainga niampanga azy, nefa nifanohitra ny tenin’izy ireo.'),
  ('6ab25c2f7b6ea13ca1f950e5', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.805Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.805Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 14, 72, 'Teo no ho eo ihany dia nisy akoho naneno fanindroany. Dia tsaroan’i Petera ilay nolazain’i Jesosy taminy hoe: “Mbola tsy maneno indroa akory ny akoho, dia handa ahy intelo ianao.” Dia nalahelo be izy ka nanomboka nitomany.', 'teo no ho eo ihany dia nisy akoho naneno fanindroany. dia tsaroan’i petera ilay nolazain’i jesosy taminy hoe: “mbola tsy maneno indroa akory ny akoho, dia handa ahy intelo ianao.” dia nalahelo be izy ka nanomboka nitomany.'),
  ('6ab25c2f7b6ea13ca1f950e2', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.805Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.805Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 14, 69, 'Nahita azy teo ilay mpanompovavy, dia niteny indray tamin’ireo nijorojoro teo hoe: “Naman-dry zareo io.”', 'nahita azy teo ilay mpanompovavy, dia niteny indray tamin’ireo nijorojoro teo hoe: “naman-dry zareo io.”'),
  ('6ab25c2f7b6ea13ca1f950d1', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.805Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.805Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 14, 52, 'nefa navelany ny akanjony, dia nandositra nitanjaka izy.', 'nefa navelany ny akanjony, dia nandositra nitanjaka izy.'),
  ('6ab25c2f7b6ea13ca1f950ce', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.805Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.805Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 14, 49, 'Isan’andro aho niaraka taminareo, tamin’izaho nampianatra tao amin’ny tempoly, nefa tsy nosamborinareo. Mitranga anefa izao mba ho tanteraka ny Soratra Masina.”', 'isan’andro aho niaraka taminareo, tamin’izaho nampianatra tao amin’ny tempoly, nefa tsy nosamborinareo. mitranga anefa izao mba ho tanteraka ny soratra masina.”'),
  ('6ab25c2f7b6ea13ca1f950cc', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.805Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.805Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 14, 47, 'Nisy iray tamin’ireo nijoro teo anefa nanatsoaka ny sabany, dia nasiany tamin’iny ilay mpanompon’ny mpisoronabe, ka niala ny sofiny.', 'nisy iray tamin’ireo nijoro teo anefa nanatsoaka ny sabany, dia nasiany tamin’iny ilay mpanompon’ny mpisoronabe, ka niala ny sofiny.'),
  ('6ab25c2f7b6ea13ca1f950de', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.805Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.805Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 14, 65, 'Ary nisy nandrora azy sy nanarona ny tarehiny, dia nanisy totohondry azy sady niteny hoe: “Maminania!” Dia namely tehamaina azy ny mpampihatra didim-pitsarana ka nitondra azy.', 'ary nisy nandrora azy sy nanarona ny tarehiny, dia nanisy totohondry azy sady niteny hoe: “maminania!” dia namely tehamaina azy ny mpampihatra didim-pitsarana ka nitondra azy.'),
  ('6ab25c2f7b6ea13ca1f950e0', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.805Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.805Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 14, 67, 'Raha vao nahita an’i Petera nitanina afo izy, dia nijery azy tsara sady niteny hoe: “Ianao koa niaraka tamin’io Jesosy avy any Nazareta io.”', 'raha vao nahita an’i petera nitanina afo izy, dia nijery azy tsara sady niteny hoe: “ianao koa niaraka tamin’io jesosy avy any nazareta io.”'),
  ('6ab25c2f7b6ea13ca1f950ca', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.805Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.805Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 14, 45, 'Tonga dia nanitsy nankeo amin’i Jesosy izy ka niteny hoe: “Raby ô!”, sady nanoroka azy.', 'tonga dia nanitsy nankeo amin’i jesosy izy ka niteny hoe: “raby ô!”, sady nanoroka azy.'),
  ('6ab25c2f7b6ea13ca1f950c8', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.805Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.805Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 14, 43, 'Tsy tapitra akory anefa ny teniny, dia iny fa tonga i Jodasy, ilay anisan’ny 12 Lahy. Ary nisy vahoaka nitondra sabatra sy kibay niaraka taminy, nirahin’ny lehiben’ny mpisorona sy ny mpanora-dalàna ary ny anti-panahy.', 'tsy tapitra akory anefa ny teniny, dia iny fa tonga i jodasy, ilay anisan’ny 12 lahy. ary nisy vahoaka nitondra sabatra sy kibay niaraka taminy, nirahin’ny lehiben’ny mpisorona sy ny mpanora-dalàna ary ny anti-panahy.'),
  ('6ab25c2f7b6ea13ca1f950c7', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.805Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.805Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 14, 42, 'Mitsangàna dia andao isika handeha, fa efa akaiky ilay mpamadika ahy.”', 'mitsangàna dia andao isika handeha, fa efa akaiky ilay mpamadika ahy.”'),
  ('6ab25c2f7b6ea13ca1f950db', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.805Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.805Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 14, 62, 'Dia hoy i Jesosy: “Izaho no izy. Ary ho hitanareo ny Zanak’olona hipetraka eo ankavanan’Ilay Mahery sady ho avy miaraka amin’ny rahon’ny lanitra.”', 'dia hoy i jesosy: “izaho no izy. ary ho hitanareo ny zanak’olona hipetraka eo ankavanan’ilay mahery sady ho avy miaraka amin’ny rahon’ny lanitra.”'),
  ('6ab25c2f7b6ea13ca1f950da', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.805Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.805Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 14, 61, 'Mbola tsy niteny ihany anefa i Jesosy ary tsy namaly mihitsy. Ary nanontany azy indray ny mpisoronabe hoe: “Ianao ve no Kristy Zanak’Ilay Avo Indrindra?”', 'mbola tsy niteny ihany anefa i jesosy ary tsy namaly mihitsy. ary nanontany azy indray ny mpisoronabe hoe: “ianao ve no kristy zanak’ilay avo indrindra?”'),
  ('6ab25c2f7b6ea13ca1f950d6', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.805Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.805Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 14, 57, 'Nisy hafa koa nijoro ho vavolombelona mandainga ka niampanga azy hoe:', 'nisy hafa koa nijoro ho vavolombelona mandainga ka niampanga azy hoe:'),
  ('6ab25c2f7b6ea13ca1f950c5', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.805Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.805Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 14, 40, 'Dia niverina indray izy, ary mbola nahita azy ireo natory fa navesatra ny masony. Tsy hitan’izy ireo àry izay havaly azy.', 'dia niverina indray izy, ary mbola nahita azy ireo natory fa navesatra ny masony. tsy hitan’izy ireo àry izay havaly azy.'),
  ('6ab25c2f7b6ea13ca1f950df', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.805Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.805Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 14, 66, 'Raha mbola tao ambany tany an-tokotany i Petera, dia tonga ny iray tamin’ny mpanompovavin’ny mpisoronabe.', 'raha mbola tao ambany tany an-tokotany i petera, dia tonga ny iray tamin’ny mpanompovavin’ny mpisoronabe.'),
  ('6ab25c2f7b6ea13ca1f950e4', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.805Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.805Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 14, 71, 'Nanomboka niozona sy nianiana anefa izy hoe: “Tena tsy fantatro mihitsy ho’aho izany lehilahy resahinareo izany!”', 'nanomboka niozona sy nianiana anefa izy hoe: “tena tsy fantatro mihitsy ho’aho izany lehilahy resahinareo izany!”'),
  ('6ab25c2f7b6ea13ca1f950cf', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.805Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.805Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 14, 50, 'Ary nandao azy daholo ny mpianany ka lasa nitsoaka.', 'ary nandao azy daholo ny mpianany ka lasa nitsoaka.'),
  ('6ab25c2f7b6ea13ca1f950c9', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.805Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.805Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 14, 44, 'Ary efa nanome famantarana azy ireo ilay mpamadika hoe: “Izay horohako no izy ka sambory, ary ento dia ambeno tsara.”', 'ary efa nanome famantarana azy ireo ilay mpamadika hoe: “izay horohako no izy ka sambory, ary ento dia ambeno tsara.”'),
  ('6ab25c2f7b6ea13ca1f950dc', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.805Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.805Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 14, 63, 'Dia nandrovitra ny akanjony ny mpisoronabe sady niteny hoe: “Inona indray no mbola ilantsika vavolombelona?', 'dia nandrovitra ny akanjony ny mpisoronabe sady niteny hoe: “inona indray no mbola ilantsika vavolombelona?'),
  ('6ab25c2f7b6ea13ca1f950d9', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.805Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.805Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 14, 60, 'Dia nitsangana teo afovoany ny mpisoronabe ka nanontany an’i Jesosy hoe: “Toa tsy mamaly akory ianao? Ahoana izany fiampangan’ireo olona ireo anao izany?”', 'dia nitsangana teo afovoany ny mpisoronabe ka nanontany an’i jesosy hoe: “toa tsy mamaly akory ianao? ahoana izany fiampangan’ireo olona ireo anao izany?”'),
  ('6ab25c2f7b6ea13ca1f950cd', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.805Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.805Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 14, 48, 'Dia hoy i Jesosy tamin’ireo: “Tonga hisambotra ahy miaraka amin’ny sabatra sy kibay ve ianareo, hoatr’ireny hisambotra jiolahy ireny?', 'dia hoy i jesosy tamin’ireo: “tonga hisambotra ahy miaraka amin’ny sabatra sy kibay ve ianareo, hoatr’ireny hisambotra jiolahy ireny?'),
  ('6ab25c2f7b6ea13ca1f950c6', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.805Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.805Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 14, 41, 'Ary niverina fanintelony izy dia niteny tamin’ireo hoe: “Mbola matory sy miala sasatra ihany ve ianareo amin’izao fotoana izao? Aoka izay! Efa tonga ny ora! Jereo fa hisy hamadika ny Zanak’olona, ka hatolotra eo am-pelatanan’ny mpanota.', 'ary niverina fanintelony izy dia niteny tamin’ireo hoe: “mbola matory sy miala sasatra ihany ve ianareo amin’izao fotoana izao? aoka izay! efa tonga ny ora! jereo fa hisy hamadika ny zanak’olona, ka hatolotra eo am-pelatanan’ny mpanota.'),
  ('6ab25c2f7b6ea13ca1f950c4', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.805Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.805Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 14, 39, 'Dia lasa indray izy nivavaka, ka izay efa noteneniny teo aloha ihany no naveriny.', 'dia lasa indray izy nivavaka, ka izay efa noteneniny teo aloha ihany no naveriny.'),
  ('6ab25c2f7b6ea13ca1f950e1', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.805Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.805Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 14, 68, 'Nanda anefa i Petera hoe: “Tsy fantatro izy sady tsy azoko izany zavatra resahinao izany.” Dia lasa izy nivoaka nankeo akaikin’ny vavahady.', 'nanda anefa i petera hoe: “tsy fantatro izy sady tsy azoko izany zavatra resahinao izany.” dia lasa izy nivoaka nankeo akaikin’ny vavahady.'),
  ('6ab25c2f7b6ea13ca1f950d7', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.805Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.805Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 14, 58, '“Henonay izy niteny hoe: ‘Harodako ity tempoly nataon’ny tanan’olona ity, dia hanorina hafa tsy nataon’ny tanan’olona aho rehefa afaka telo andro.’”', '“henonay izy niteny hoe: ‘harodako ity tempoly nataon’ny tanan’olona ity, dia hanorina hafa tsy nataon’ny tanan’olona aho rehefa afaka telo andro.’”'),
  ('6ab25c2f7b6ea13ca1f950cb', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.805Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.805Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 14, 46, 'Dia nisambotra an’i Jesosy ny vahoaka, ka nitondra azy.', 'dia nisambotra an’i jesosy ny vahoaka, ka nitondra azy.'),
  ('6ab25c2f7b6ea13ca1f950e3', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.805Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.805Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 14, 70, 'Nanda indray anefa izy. Ary rehefa afaka kelikely, dia niteny tamin’i Petera indray ireo nijorojoro teo hoe: “Tena naman-dry zareo ianao, fa Galilianina.”', 'nanda indray anefa izy. ary rehefa afaka kelikely, dia niteny tamin’i petera indray ireo nijorojoro teo hoe: “tena naman-dry zareo ianao, fa galilianina.”'),
  ('6ab25c2f7b6ea13ca1f950dd', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.805Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.805Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 14, 64, 'Henonareo ilay izy nanevateva an’Andriamanitra teo. Ahoana ny hevitrareo?” Dia nanameloka azy izy rehetra ka nilaza fa mendrika ny ho faty izy.', 'henonareo ilay izy nanevateva an’andriamanitra teo. ahoana ny hevitrareo?” dia nanameloka azy izy rehetra ka nilaza fa mendrika ny ho faty izy.'),
  ('6ab25c2f7b6ea13ca1f950d4', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.805Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:03.805Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 14, 55, 'Ary nitady zavatra hiampangana an’i Jesosy ny lehiben’ny mpisorona sy izay rehetra anisan’ny Fitsarana Avo Jiosy, mba hamonoana azy ho faty, nefa tsy nahita.', 'ary nitady zavatra hiampangana an’i jesosy ny lehiben’ny mpisorona sy izay rehetra anisan’ny fitsarana avo jiosy, mba hamonoana azy ho faty, nefa tsy nahita.'),
  ('6ab25c30063b460a2f84448f', '2026-09-22T10:45:04.384Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:04.384Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 15, 1, 'Vao nazava ratsy ny andro, dia niara-nidinika ny lehiben’ny mpisorona sy ny anti-panahy ary ny mpanora-dalàna, izany hoe ny Fitsarana Avo Jiosy manontolo. Ary nofatoran’izy ireo i Jesosy, dia nentiny ka natolony an’i Pilato.', 'vao nazava ratsy ny andro, dia niara-nidinika ny lehiben’ny mpisorona sy ny anti-panahy ary ny mpanora-dalàna, izany hoe ny fitsarana avo jiosy manontolo. ary nofatoran’izy ireo i jesosy, dia nentiny ka natolony an’i pilato.'),
  ('6ab25c30063b460a2f8444b0', '2026-09-22T10:45:04.385Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:04.385Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 15, 34, 'Tamin’ny ora fahasivy, dia niantso mafy i Jesosy hoe: “Ely, Ely, lamà sabaktany?” Raha adika izany dia hoe: “Andriamanitro ô, Andriamanitro ô, nahoana ianao no nahafoy ahy?”', 'tamin’ny ora fahasivy, dia niantso mafy i jesosy hoe: “ely, ely, lamà sabaktany?” raha adika izany dia hoe: “andriamanitro ô, andriamanitro ô, nahoana ianao no nahafoy ahy?”'),
  ('6ab25c30063b460a2f84449b', '2026-09-22T10:45:04.385Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:04.385Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 15, 13, 'Dia niantsoantso mafy indray ireo hoe: “Fantsiho eo amin’ny tsato-kazo izy!”', 'dia niantsoantso mafy indray ireo hoe: “fantsiho eo amin’ny tsato-kazo izy!”'),
  ('6ab25c30063b460a2f8444bb', '2026-09-22T10:45:04.385Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:04.385Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 15, 45, 'Rehefa avy naka toky tamin’ilay manamboninahitra àry i Pilato, dia nekeny hoe homena an’i Josefa ilay faty.', 'rehefa avy naka toky tamin’ilay manamboninahitra àry i pilato, dia nekeny hoe homena an’i josefa ilay faty.'),
  ('6ab25c30063b460a2f8444ba', '2026-09-22T10:45:04.385Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:04.385Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 15, 44, 'Tian’i Pilato ho fantatra anefa raha efa maty sahady i Jesosy, ka nantsoiny ilay manamboninahitra dia nanontaniany.', 'tian’i pilato ho fantatra anefa raha efa maty sahady i jesosy, ka nantsoiny ilay manamboninahitra dia nanontaniany.'),
