  ('6ab25c30063b460a2f8444a9', '2026-09-22T10:45:04.385Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:04.385Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 15, 27, 'Nisy jiolahy roa koa nataon’izy ireo teo amin’ny tsato-kazo teo akaikiny, ka ny iray teo ankavanany, ary ny iray teo ankaviany.', 'nisy jiolahy roa koa nataon’izy ireo teo amin’ny tsato-kazo teo akaikiny, ka ny iray teo ankavanany, ary ny iray teo ankaviany.'),
  ('6ab25c30063b460a2f84449f', '2026-09-22T10:45:04.385Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:04.385Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 15, 17, 'Dia nampanaovin’ireo lamba volomparasy izy. Nandrandrana fehiloha tsilo koa izy ireo, dia nataony teo amin’ny lohany.', 'dia nampanaovin’ireo lamba volomparasy izy. nandrandrana fehiloha tsilo koa izy ireo, dia nataony teo amin’ny lohany.'),
  ('6ab25c30063b460a2f844493', '2026-09-22T10:45:04.385Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:04.385Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 15, 5, 'Tsy namaly intsony anefa i Jesosy, ka gaga i Pilato.', 'tsy namaly intsony anefa i jesosy, ka gaga i pilato.'),
  ('6ab25c30063b460a2f8444b2', '2026-09-22T10:45:04.385Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:04.385Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 15, 36, 'Dia nisy olona iray nihazakazaka ka nanatsoboka spaonjy tao anaty divay marikivy. Dia nataony teo amin’ny bararata iray ilay izy ka nomeny hosotroin’i Jesosy, sady hoy izy: “Avelao izy e! Aleo hojerentsika raha ho avy hampidina azy i Elia.”', 'dia nisy olona iray nihazakazaka ka nanatsoboka spaonjy tao anaty divay marikivy. dia nataony teo amin’ny bararata iray ilay izy ka nomeny hosotroin’i jesosy, sady hoy izy: “avelao izy e! aleo hojerentsika raha ho avy hampidina azy i elia.”'),
  ('6ab25c30063b460a2f84449a', '2026-09-22T10:45:04.385Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:04.385Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 15, 12, 'Hoy indray i Pilato: “Hataoko ahoana àry ilay antsoinareo hoe Mpanjakan’ny Jiosy?”', 'hoy indray i pilato: “hataoko ahoana àry ilay antsoinareo hoe mpanjakan’ny jiosy?”'),
  ('6ab25c30063b460a2f8444bd', '2026-09-22T10:45:04.385Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:04.385Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 15, 47, 'Fa i Maria Magdalena sy Maria renin’i Josesy kosa mbola nijery foana an’ilay toerana nametrahana ny fatin’i Jesosy.', 'fa i maria magdalena sy maria renin’i josesy kosa mbola nijery foana an’ilay toerana nametrahana ny fatin’i jesosy.'),
  ('6ab25c30063b460a2f8444bc', '2026-09-22T10:45:04.385Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:04.385Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 15, 46, 'Rehefa avy nividy lamba rongony tena tsara i Josefa, dia nampidininy ilay faty ka nofonosiny tamin’ilay lamba rongony tena tsara, dia napetrany tao amin’ny fasana iray nolavahana tao amin’ny vatolampy. Nanakodia vato teo am-baravaran’ilay fasana izy avy eo.', 'rehefa avy nividy lamba rongony tena tsara i josefa, dia nampidininy ilay faty ka nofonosiny tamin’ilay lamba rongony tena tsara, dia napetrany tao amin’ny fasana iray nolavahana tao amin’ny vatolampy. nanakodia vato teo am-baravaran’ilay fasana izy avy eo.'),
  ('6ab25c30063b460a2f8444a8', '2026-09-22T10:45:04.385Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:04.385Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 15, 26, 'Ary natao terỳ ambony ilay fiampangana azy hoe: “Ny Mpanjakan’ny Jiosy.”', 'ary natao terỳ ambony ilay fiampangana azy hoe: “ny mpanjakan’ny jiosy.”'),
  ('6ab25c30063b460a2f8444b3', '2026-09-22T10:45:04.385Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:04.385Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 15, 37, 'Niantsoantso mafy anefa i Jesosy dia tapitra ny ainy.', 'niantsoantso mafy anefa i jesosy dia tapitra ny ainy.'),
  ('6ab25c30063b460a2f8444ae', '2026-09-22T10:45:04.385Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:04.385Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 15, 32, 'Aleo hidina avy eny amin’ny hazo fijaliana i Kristy, ilay Mpanjakan’ny Israely, mba ho hitantsika dia amin’izay hino azy isika.” Na ireo teo amin’ny tsato-kazo teo akaikiny aza mba nandatsa azy koa.', 'aleo hidina avy eny amin’ny hazo fijaliana i kristy, ilay mpanjakan’ny israely, mba ho hitantsika dia amin’izay hino azy isika.” na ireo teo amin’ny tsato-kazo teo akaikiny aza mba nandatsa azy koa.'),
  ('6ab25c30063b460a2f8444a1', '2026-09-22T10:45:04.385Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:04.385Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 15, 19, 'Nokapohin’ireo tamin’ny bararata koa ny lohany, dia nororany izy. Ary nandohalika sy niankohoka teo anatrehany ireo.', 'nokapohin’ireo tamin’ny bararata koa ny lohany, dia nororany izy. ary nandohalika sy niankohoka teo anatrehany ireo.'),
  ('6ab25c30063b460a2f844499', '2026-09-22T10:45:04.385Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:04.385Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 15, 11, 'Nampirisihin’ny lehiben’ny mpisorona anefa ny vahoaka mba hoe i Barabasy fa tsy i Jesosy no hangatahin’izy ireo hafahan’i Pilato.', 'nampirisihin’ny lehiben’ny mpisorona anefa ny vahoaka mba hoe i barabasy fa tsy i jesosy no hangatahin’izy ireo hafahan’i pilato.'),
  ('6ab25c30063b460a2f8444af', '2026-09-22T10:45:04.385Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:04.385Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 15, 33, 'Ary nisy haizina nanarona an’ilay faritra manontolo, nanomboka tamin’ny ora fahenina ka hatramin’ny ora fahasivy.', 'ary nisy haizina nanarona an’ilay faritra manontolo, nanomboka tamin’ny ora fahenina ka hatramin’ny ora fahasivy.'),
  ('6ab25c30063b460a2f8444a7', '2026-09-22T10:45:04.385Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:04.385Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 15, 25, 'Ora fahatelo tamin’izay, ary nofantsihan’ireo teo amin’ny tsato-kazo izy.', 'ora fahatelo tamin’izay, ary nofantsihan’ireo teo amin’ny tsato-kazo izy.'),
  ('6ab25c30063b460a2f8444a6', '2026-09-22T10:45:04.385Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:04.385Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 15, 24, 'Dia nofantsihan’ireo teo amin’ny tsato-kazo izy, ary nozarain’izy ireo ny akanjony ivelany ka nanaovany antsapaka mba hahitana an’izay ho azon’izy tsirairay.', 'dia nofantsihan’ireo teo amin’ny tsato-kazo izy, ary nozarain’izy ireo ny akanjony ivelany ka nanaovany antsapaka mba hahitana an’izay ho azon’izy tsirairay.'),
  ('6ab25c30063b460a2f84449d', '2026-09-22T10:45:04.385Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:04.385Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 15, 15, 'Dia nafahan’i Pilato i Barabasy, satria te hampifaly ny vahoaka izy. Rehefa avy nasainy nokaravasina i Jesosy, dia natolony hovonoina teo amin’ny tsato-kazo.', 'dia nafahan’i pilato i barabasy, satria te hampifaly ny vahoaka izy. rehefa avy nasainy nokaravasina i jesosy, dia natolony hovonoina teo amin’ny tsato-kazo.'),
  ('6ab25c30063b460a2f844498', '2026-09-22T10:45:04.385Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:04.385Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 15, 10, 'Fantatr’i Pilato mantsy fa fialonana no nahatonga ny lehiben’ny mpisorona hanolotra an’i Jesosy.', 'fantatr’i pilato mantsy fa fialonana no nahatonga ny lehiben’ny mpisorona hanolotra an’i jesosy.'),
  ('6ab25c30063b460a2f844496', '2026-09-22T10:45:04.385Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:04.385Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 15, 8, 'Dia tonga ny vahoaka ka nanomboka nangataka tamin’i Pilato mba hanao araka izay efa fanaony amin’izy ireo.', 'dia tonga ny vahoaka ka nanomboka nangataka tamin’i pilato mba hanao araka izay efa fanaony amin’izy ireo.'),
  ('6ab25c30063b460a2f8444a3', '2026-09-22T10:45:04.385Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:04.385Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 15, 21, 'Noteren’ireo hitondra ny hazo fijalian’i Jesosy koa ny mpandalo iray avy tany ambanivohitra, dia i Simona avy any Kyrena, rain’i Aleksandra sy Rofosy.', 'noteren’ireo hitondra ny hazo fijalian’i jesosy koa ny mpandalo iray avy tany ambanivohitra, dia i simona avy any kyrena, rain’i aleksandra sy rofosy.'),
  ('6ab25c30063b460a2f84449c', '2026-09-22T10:45:04.385Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:04.385Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 15, 14, 'Hoy ihany anefa i Pilato tamin’ireo: “Fa maninona? Fa inona no ratsy nataony?” Vao mainka anefa izy ireo niantsoantso hoe: “Fantsiho eo amin’ny tsato-kazo izy!”', 'hoy ihany anefa i pilato tamin’ireo: “fa maninona? fa inona no ratsy nataony?” vao mainka anefa izy ireo niantsoantso hoe: “fantsiho eo amin’ny tsato-kazo izy!”'),
  ('6ab25c30063b460a2f8444ac', '2026-09-22T10:45:04.385Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:04.385Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 15, 30, 'Vonjeo ny tenanao e, dia midìna avy eny amin’ny hazo fijaliana eny.”', 'vonjeo ny tenanao e, dia midìna avy eny amin’ny hazo fijaliana eny.”'),
  ('6ab25c30063b460a2f8444ad', '2026-09-22T10:45:04.385Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:04.385Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 15, 31, 'Nanesoeso hoatr’izany koa ny lehiben’ny mpisorona sy ny mpanora-dalàna, dia nifampiresaka hoe: “Ny hafa novonjeny, nefa ny tenany tsy hainy vonjena!', 'nanesoeso hoatr’izany koa ny lehiben’ny mpisorona sy ny mpanora-dalàna, dia nifampiresaka hoe: “ny hafa novonjeny, nefa ny tenany tsy hainy vonjena!'),
  ('6ab25c30063b460a2f8444a5', '2026-09-22T10:45:04.385Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:04.385Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 15, 23, 'Nanandrana nanome azy divay nasiana miora mahadomelina ireo, fa tsy nety nisotro izy.', 'nanandrana nanome azy divay nasiana miora mahadomelina ireo, fa tsy nety nisotro izy.'),
  ('6ab25c30063b460a2f8444b9', '2026-09-22T10:45:04.385Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:04.385Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 15, 43, 'Dia tonga i Josefa avy any Arimatia. Lehilahy nanan-kaja anisan’ny Filan-kevitry ny Jiosy izy, ary niandry ny Fanjakan’Andriamanitra koa. Nisikina herim-po izy ka nankany amin’i Pilato, dia nangataka ny fatin’i Jesosy.', 'dia tonga i josefa avy any arimatia. lehilahy nanan-kaja anisan’ny filan-kevitry ny jiosy izy, ary niandry ny fanjakan’andriamanitra koa. nisikina herim-po izy ka nankany amin’i pilato, dia nangataka ny fatin’i jesosy.'),
  ('6ab25c30063b460a2f844497', '2026-09-22T10:45:04.385Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:04.385Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 15, 9, 'Hoy i Pilato tamin’izy ireo: “Sao dia mba tianareo hafahako ho anareo ilay Mpanjakan’ny Jiosy?”', 'hoy i pilato tamin’izy ireo: “sao dia mba tianareo hafahako ho anareo ilay mpanjakan’ny jiosy?”'),
  ('6ab25c30063b460a2f8444b7', '2026-09-22T10:45:04.385Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:04.385Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 15, 41, 'izay samy efa nanaraka an’i Jesosy sy nikarakara azy tamin’izy tany Galilia, ary ny vehivavy maro hafa efa niara-niakatra taminy tany Jerosalema.', 'izay samy efa nanaraka an’i jesosy sy nikarakara azy tamin’izy tany galilia, ary ny vehivavy maro hafa efa niara-niakatra taminy tany jerosalema.'),
