  ('6ab25c30063b460a2f844495', '2026-09-22T10:45:04.385Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:04.385Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 15, 7, 'Tamin’izay fotoana izay, dia nisy lehilahy antsoina hoe Barabasy, niara-nigadra tamin’ireo mpikomy tamin’ny fanjakana, izay nahafaty olona tamin’izy ireo nikomy.', 'tamin’izay fotoana izay, dia nisy lehilahy antsoina hoe barabasy, niara-nigadra tamin’ireo mpikomy tamin’ny fanjakana, izay nahafaty olona tamin’izy ireo nikomy.'),
  ('6ab25c30063b460a2f844492', '2026-09-22T10:45:04.385Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:04.385Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 15, 4, 'Nanontany azy indray i Pilato hoe: “Ary toa tsy mamaly ianao? Be dia be ange izany zavatra iampangany anao izany e!”', 'nanontany azy indray i pilato hoe: “ary toa tsy mamaly ianao? be dia be ange izany zavatra iampangany anao izany e!”'),
  ('6ab25c30063b460a2f8444b6', '2026-09-22T10:45:04.385Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:04.385Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 15, 40, 'Nisy vehivavy koa nitazana teny lavidavitra teny. Anisan’ireny i Maria Magdalena, sy Maria renin’i Jakoba kely sy Josesy, ary Salome,', 'nisy vehivavy koa nitazana teny lavidavitra teny. anisan’ireny i maria magdalena, sy maria renin’i jakoba kely sy josesy, ary salome,'),
  ('6ab25c30063b460a2f8444b5', '2026-09-22T10:45:04.385Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:04.385Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 15, 39, 'Rehefa nahita an’izany rehetra izany ilay manamboninahitra nijoro teo akaikin’i Jesosy, sady nahita hoe tapitra ny ain’i Jesosy, dia hoy izy: “Tena Zanak’Andriamanitra tokoa io lehilahy io.”', 'rehefa nahita an’izany rehetra izany ilay manamboninahitra nijoro teo akaikin’i jesosy, sady nahita hoe tapitra ny ain’i jesosy, dia hoy izy: “tena zanak’andriamanitra tokoa io lehilahy io.”'),
