  ('6ab25c31236472c122a1e9f8', '2026-09-22T10:45:05.146Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:05.146Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 16, 1, 'Rehefa tapitra ny Sabata, dia nividy zava-manitra i Maria Magdalena, sy Maria renin’i Jakoba, ary Salome, fa te ho any am-pasana izy ireo mba hanosotra an’izany amin’ny fatin’i Jesosy.', 'rehefa tapitra ny sabata, dia nividy zava-manitra i maria magdalena, sy maria renin’i jakoba, ary salome, fa te ho any am-pasana izy ireo mba hanosotra an’izany amin’ny fatin’i jesosy.'),
  ('6ab25c31236472c122a1e9f9', '2026-09-22T10:45:05.146Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:05.146Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 16, 2, 'Dia nankany am-pasana vao maraina be izy ireo, tamin’ny andro voalohany amin’ny herinandro, rehefa niposaka ny masoandro.', 'dia nankany am-pasana vao maraina be izy ireo, tamin’ny andro voalohany amin’ny herinandro, rehefa niposaka ny masoandro.'),
  ('6ab25c31236472c122a1e9fc', '2026-09-22T10:45:05.147Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:05.147Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 16, 5, 'Rehefa niditra tao am-pasana izy ireo, dia gaga nahita tovolahy nanao akanjo fotsy lava nipetraka teo ankavanana.', 'rehefa niditra tao am-pasana izy ireo, dia gaga nahita tovolahy nanao akanjo fotsy lava nipetraka teo ankavanana.'),
  ('6ab25c31236472c122a1e9fb', '2026-09-22T10:45:05.147Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:05.147Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 16, 4, 'Rehefa nitraka anefa izy ireo, dia hitany fa efa voakodia ilay vato, na dia ngezabe aza.', 'rehefa nitraka anefa izy ireo, dia hitany fa efa voakodia ilay vato, na dia ngezabe aza.'),
  ('6ab25c31236472c122a1e9fe', '2026-09-22T10:45:05.147Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:05.147Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 16, 7, 'Mandehana milaza amin’ny mpianany sy amin’i Petera hoe: ‘Hialoha anareo any Galilia izy, dia any no hahitanareo azy, araka ny efa nolazainy taminareo.’”', 'mandehana milaza amin’ny mpianany sy amin’i petera hoe: ‘hialoha anareo any galilia izy, dia any no hahitanareo azy, araka ny efa nolazainy taminareo.’”'),
  ('6ab25c31236472c122a1e9fa', '2026-09-22T10:45:05.147Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:05.147Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 16, 3, 'Dia nifampiresaka izy ireo hoe: “Iza re no hasaintsika hanakodia an’ilay vato hiala eo amin’ny varavaram-pasana e?”', 'dia nifampiresaka izy ireo hoe: “iza re no hasaintsika hanakodia an’ilay vato hiala eo amin’ny varavaram-pasana e?”'),
  ('6ab25c31236472c122a1e9ff', '2026-09-22T10:45:05.147Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:05.147Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 16, 8, 'Dia nivoaka tao amin’ilay fasana izy ireo ka nandositra, sady nangovitra no nihetsi-po be. Ary tsy niteny na inona na inona tamin’olona izy ireo, fa natahotra.', 'dia nivoaka tao amin’ilay fasana izy ireo ka nandositra, sady nangovitra no nihetsi-po be. ary tsy niteny na inona na inona tamin’olona izy ireo, fa natahotra.'),
  ('6ab25c31236472c122a1e9fd', '2026-09-22T10:45:05.147Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:05.147Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Marka', 41, 16, 6, 'Hoy ilay tovolahy tamin’ireo: “Aza gaga ianareo. Fantatro fa mitady an’i Jesosy avy any Nazareta, ilay novonoina teo amin’ny tsato-kazo, ianareo. Efa natsangana izy ka tsy ato. Jereo fa teto no nametrahana azy.', 'hoy ilay tovolahy tamin’ireo: “aza gaga ianareo. fantatro fa mitady an’i jesosy avy any nazareta, ilay novonoina teo amin’ny tsato-kazo, ianareo. efa natsangana izy ka tsy ato. jereo fa teto no nametrahana azy.'),
  ('6ab25c5d8dc022da358f2800', '2026-09-22T10:45:49.004Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:49.004Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 3, 8, 'Asehoy amin’ny ataonareo àry fa mibebaka ianareo. Aza mieritreritra hoe: ‘I Abrahama no rainay.’ Fa lazaiko aminareo fa hain’Andriamanitra ny manova an’iretsy vato iretsy ho lasa zanak’i Abrahama.', 'asehoy amin’ny ataonareo àry fa mibebaka ianareo. aza mieritreritra hoe: ‘i abrahama no rainay.’ fa lazaiko aminareo fa hain’andriamanitra ny manova an’iretsy vato iretsy ho lasa zanak’i abrahama.'),
  ('6ab25c5d8dc022da358f27ff', '2026-09-22T10:45:49.004Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:49.004Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 3, 7, 'Dia hoy izy tamin’ny vahoaka tonga mba hataony batisa: “Ry taranaky ny bibilava misy poizina, iza no nampitandrina anareo mba tsy hiharan’ny fahatezerana ho avy?', 'dia hoy izy tamin’ny vahoaka tonga mba hataony batisa: “ry taranaky ny bibilava misy poizina, iza no nampitandrina anareo mba tsy hiharan’ny fahatezerana ho avy?'),
  ('6ab25c5d8dc022da358f27fc', '2026-09-22T10:45:49.004Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:49.004Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 3, 4, 'araka ny voasoratra ao amin’ny boky misy ny tenin’i Isaia mpaminany hoe: “Izany fa misy miantsoantso any an-tany efitra hoe: ‘Omano ny lalana halehan’i Jehovah! Ataovy mahitsy ny lalany.', 'araka ny voasoratra ao amin’ny boky misy ny tenin’i isaia mpaminany hoe: “izany fa misy miantsoantso any an-tany efitra hoe: ‘omano ny lalana halehan’i jehovah! ataovy mahitsy ny lalany.'),
  ('6ab25c5d8dc022da358f27fb', '2026-09-22T10:45:49.004Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:49.004Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 3, 3, 'Lasa àry izy nankany amin’ny faritra rehetra manodidina ny Reniranon’i Jordana. Nitory izy hoe tokony hatao batisa ny olona mba hampisehoana fa efa nibebaka izy ireo, dia ho voavela ny helony,', 'lasa àry izy nankany amin’ny faritra rehetra manodidina ny reniranon’i jordana. nitory izy hoe tokony hatao batisa ny olona mba hampisehoana fa efa nibebaka izy ireo, dia ho voavela ny helony,'),
