  ('6ab25c5d8dc022da358f2808', '2026-09-22T10:45:49.004Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:49.004Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 3, 16, 'Hoy anefa ny navalin’i Jaona azy rehetra: “Izaho manao batisa anareo amin’ny rano, fa ho avy kosa ilay mahery noho izaho, ary tsy mendrika hamaha ny tadin-kapany akory aza aho. Izy no hanao batisa anareo amin’ny fanahy masina sy amin’ny afo.', 'hoy anefa ny navalin’i jaona azy rehetra: “izaho manao batisa anareo amin’ny rano, fa ho avy kosa ilay mahery noho izaho, ary tsy mendrika hamaha ny tadin-kapany akory aza aho. izy no hanao batisa anareo amin’ny fanahy masina sy amin’ny afo.'),
  ('6ab25c5d8dc022da358f2803', '2026-09-22T10:45:49.004Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:49.004Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 3, 11, 'Namaly izy hoe: “Izay manana akanjo anankiroa, dia aoka hanome ho an’izay tsy manana, ary izay manan-kohanina, dia aoka hizara ho an’izay tsy manana.”', 'namaly izy hoe: “izay manana akanjo anankiroa, dia aoka hanome ho an’izay tsy manana, ary izay manan-kohanina, dia aoka hizara ho an’izay tsy manana.”'),
