  ('6ab25c5ece59c2113b7c41a3', '2026-09-22T10:45:50.321Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:50.321Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 4, 4, 'Fa hoy ny navalin’i Jesosy azy: “Voasoratra hoe: ‘Tsy ny mofo ihany no ilain’ny olona mba hahavelona azy.’”', 'fa hoy ny navalin’i jesosy azy: “voasoratra hoe: ‘tsy ny mofo ihany no ilain’ny olona mba hahavelona azy.’”'),
  ('6ab25c5ece59c2113b7c41c8', '2026-09-22T10:45:50.321Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:50.321Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 4, 41, 'Nivoaka koa ny demonia tamin’ny olona maro, ka niantso mafy hoe: “Ianao no Zanak’Andriamanitra.” Noteneniny mafy anefa ireny ka tsy navelany hiteniteny, satria fantatr’ireny fa izy no Kristy.', 'nivoaka koa ny demonia tamin’ny olona maro, ka niantso mafy hoe: “ianao no zanak’andriamanitra.” noteneniny mafy anefa ireny ka tsy navelany hiteniteny, satria fantatr’ireny fa izy no kristy.'),
  ('6ab25c5ece59c2113b7c41c3', '2026-09-22T10:45:50.321Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:50.321Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 4, 36, 'Dia gaga izy rehetra ka nifampiresaka hoe: “Misy heriny be mihitsy ny teniny! Tena manana fahefana sy hery izy, fa na ny fanahy maloto aza baikoiny fotsiny dia mivoaka!”', 'dia gaga izy rehetra ka nifampiresaka hoe: “misy heriny be mihitsy ny teniny! tena manana fahefana sy hery izy, fa na ny fanahy maloto aza baikoiny fotsiny dia mivoaka!”'),
  ('6ab25c5ece59c2113b7c41b7', '2026-09-22T10:45:50.321Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:50.321Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 4, 24, 'Dia niteny koa izy hoe: “Lazaiko marina aminareo fa ao amin’ny faritra niaviany ihany ny mpaminany no tsy tian’ny olona.', 'dia niteny koa izy hoe: “lazaiko marina aminareo fa ao amin’ny faritra niaviany ihany ny mpaminany no tsy tian’ny olona.'),
  ('6ab25c5ece59c2113b7c41aa', '2026-09-22T10:45:50.321Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:50.321Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 4, 11, 'ary ‘hitondra anao eny an-tanany izy ireo, mba tsy hidona amin’ny vato ny tongotrao.’”', 'ary ‘hitondra anao eny an-tanany izy ireo, mba tsy hidona amin’ny vato ny tongotrao.’”'),
  ('6ab25c5ece59c2113b7c41a9', '2026-09-22T10:45:50.321Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:50.321Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 4, 10, 'fa voasoratra hoe: ‘Homeny baiko hanampy anao ny anjeliny mba hiaro anao’,', 'fa voasoratra hoe: ‘homeny baiko hanampy anao ny anjeliny mba hiaro anao’,'),
  ('6ab25c5ece59c2113b7c41a5', '2026-09-22T10:45:50.321Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:50.321Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 4, 6, 'Dia hoy ny Devoly: “Homeko anao izao fahefana rehetra izao sy ny voninahiny, fa efa natolotra ahy izany ka omeko an’izay tiako homena azy.', 'dia hoy ny devoly: “homeko anao izao fahefana rehetra izao sy ny voninahiny, fa efa natolotra ahy izany ka omeko an’izay tiako homena azy.'),
  ('6ab25c5ece59c2113b7c41c1', '2026-09-22T10:45:50.321Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:50.321Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 4, 34, '“Fa inona koa no anelingelenanao anay atỳ, ry Jesosy avy any Nazareta? Tonga atỳ ve ianao mba handringana anay? Fantatro tsara ange fa ianao Ilay Masin’Andriamanitra e!”', '“fa inona koa no anelingelenanao anay atỳ, ry jesosy avy any nazareta? tonga atỳ ve ianao mba handringana anay? fantatro tsara ange fa ianao ilay masin’andriamanitra e!”'),
  ('6ab25c5ece59c2113b7c41bb', '2026-09-22T10:45:50.321Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:50.321Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 4, 28, 'Tezitra be izay rehetra naheno an’izany tao amin’ny synagoga,', 'tezitra be izay rehetra naheno an’izany tao amin’ny synagoga,'),
  ('6ab25c5ece59c2113b7c41b9', '2026-09-22T10:45:50.321Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:50.321Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 4, 26, 'Tsy tany amin’ny anankiray tamin’ireny anefa i Elia no nirahina, fa tany amin’ny vehivavy mpitondratena iray tany Zarefata any Sidona ihany.', 'tsy tany amin’ny anankiray tamin’ireny anefa i elia no nirahina, fa tany amin’ny vehivavy mpitondratena iray tany zarefata any sidona ihany.'),
  ('6ab25c5ece59c2113b7c41a0', '2026-09-22T10:45:50.321Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:50.321Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 4, 1, 'Dia niala teo amin’ny Reniranon’i Jordana i Jesosy, sady feno fanahy masina. Ary nentin’ny fanahy masina nankany an-tany efitra izy, ka nivezivezy tany', 'dia niala teo amin’ny reniranon’i jordana i jesosy, sady feno fanahy masina. ary nentin’ny fanahy masina nankany an-tany efitra izy, ka nivezivezy tany'),
  ('6ab25c5ece59c2113b7c41c9', '2026-09-22T10:45:50.321Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:50.321Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 4, 42, 'Rehefa maraina ny andro, dia niala teo izy ka nankany amin’ny toerana mitokana. Nikaroka azy anefa ny vahoaka, dia tonga tany amin’izay nisy azy. Ary nitady hitazona azy izy ireo, mba tsy hialany teo aminy.', 'rehefa maraina ny andro, dia niala teo izy ka nankany amin’ny toerana mitokana. nikaroka azy anefa ny vahoaka, dia tonga tany amin’izay nisy azy. ary nitady hitazona azy izy ireo, mba tsy hialany teo aminy.'),
  ('6ab25c5ece59c2113b7c41c7', '2026-09-22T10:45:50.321Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:50.321Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 4, 40, 'Rehefa hilentika ny masoandro, dia nitondra ny marariny tany aminy izay rehetra nanana marary voan’ny aretina samihafa. Nametra-tanana tamin’ny tsirairay tamin’ireny izy, ka nositraniny izy ireny.', 'rehefa hilentika ny masoandro, dia nitondra ny marariny tany aminy izay rehetra nanana marary voan’ny aretina samihafa. nametra-tanana tamin’ny tsirairay tamin’ireny izy, ka nositraniny izy ireny.'),
  ('6ab25c5ece59c2113b7c41c0', '2026-09-22T10:45:50.321Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:50.321Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 4, 33, 'Ary nisy lehilahy nipetrahan’ny fanahy maloto, na demonia, tao amin’ny synagoga. Nikiakiaka mafy izy hoe:', 'ary nisy lehilahy nipetrahan’ny fanahy maloto, na demonia, tao amin’ny synagoga. nikiakiaka mafy izy hoe:'),
  ('6ab25c5ece59c2113b7c41b2', '2026-09-22T10:45:50.321Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:50.321Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 4, 19, 'ary mba hitory ny taona fanehoan’i Jehovah fankasitrahana.”', 'ary mba hitory ny taona fanehoan’i jehovah fankasitrahana.”'),
  ('6ab25c5ece59c2113b7c41c2', '2026-09-22T10:45:50.321Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:50.321Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 4, 35, 'Niteny mafy azy anefa i Jesosy hoe: “Mangìna, dia mivoaha aminy!” Koa nivoaka ilay demonia rehefa avy nampianjera an’ilay lehilahy teo afovoan’ny olona, nefa tsy nandratra azy.', 'niteny mafy azy anefa i jesosy hoe: “mangìna, dia mivoaha aminy!” koa nivoaka ilay demonia rehefa avy nampianjera an’ilay lehilahy teo afovoan’ny olona, nefa tsy nandratra azy.'),
  ('6ab25c5ece59c2113b7c41bd', '2026-09-22T10:45:50.321Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:50.321Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 4, 30, 'Namakivaky teo afovoan’izy ireo anefa izy ka lasa.', 'namakivaky teo afovoan’izy ireo anefa izy ka lasa.'),
  ('6ab25c5ece59c2113b7c41af', '2026-09-22T10:45:50.321Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:50.321Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 4, 16, 'Dia nankany Nazareta, tanàna nahalehibe azy, izy ary niditra tao amin’ny synagoga hoatran’ny fanaony rehefa andro sabata, ka nitsangana hamaky teny.', 'dia nankany nazareta, tanàna nahalehibe azy, izy ary niditra tao amin’ny synagoga hoatran’ny fanaony rehefa andro sabata, ka nitsangana hamaky teny.'),
  ('6ab25c5ece59c2113b7c41a7', '2026-09-22T10:45:50.321Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:50.321Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 4, 8, 'Fa hoy i Jesosy: “Voasoratra hoe: ‘I Jehovah Andriamanitrao no tsy maintsy iankohofanao, ary izy irery ihany no tsy maintsy tompoinao.’”', 'fa hoy i jesosy: “voasoratra hoe: ‘i jehovah andriamanitrao no tsy maintsy iankohofanao, ary izy irery ihany no tsy maintsy tompoinao.’”'),
  ('6ab25c5ece59c2113b7c41be', '2026-09-22T10:45:50.321Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:50.321Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 4, 31, 'Dia nidina tany Kapernaomy, tanàna any Galilia, izy. Ary nampianatra ny olona tamin’ny Sabata izy,', 'dia nidina tany kapernaomy, tanàna any galilia, izy. ary nampianatra ny olona tamin’ny sabata izy,'),
  ('6ab25c5ece59c2113b7c41ad', '2026-09-22T10:45:50.321Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:50.321Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 4, 14, 'Dia niverina tany Galilia i Jesosy, ary feno herin’ny fanahy izy. Ary tsara laza izy ka niely nanerana ny faritra rehetra manodidina ny lazany.', 'dia niverina tany galilia i jesosy, ary feno herin’ny fanahy izy. ary tsara laza izy ka niely nanerana ny faritra rehetra manodidina ny lazany.'),
  ('6ab25c5ece59c2113b7c41ba', '2026-09-22T10:45:50.321Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:50.321Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 4, 27, 'Nisy boka maro koa teo amin’ny Israely tamin’ny andron’i Elisa mpaminany. Tsy nisy nodiovina anefa izy ireny na iray aza, afa-tsy i Namàna Syrianina.”', 'nisy boka maro koa teo amin’ny israely tamin’ny andron’i elisa mpaminany. tsy nisy nodiovina anefa izy ireny na iray aza, afa-tsy i namàna syrianina.”'),
  ('6ab25c5ece59c2113b7c41b6', '2026-09-22T10:45:50.321Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:50.321Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 4, 23, 'Hoy i Jesosy: “Efa fantatro fa hampiharinareo amiko ilay fitenenana hoe: ‘Dokotera ô, sitrano aloha ny tenanao. Ataovy eto amin’ny faritra niavianao koa ny zavatra henonay hoe nataonao tany Kapernaomy.’”', 'hoy i jesosy: “efa fantatro fa hampiharinareo amiko ilay fitenenana hoe: ‘dokotera ô, sitrano aloha ny tenanao. ataovy eto amin’ny faritra niavianao koa ny zavatra henonay hoe nataonao tany kapernaomy.’”'),
  ('6ab25c5ece59c2113b7c41b3', '2026-09-22T10:45:50.321Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:50.321Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 4, 20, 'Nahorony ilay horonam-boky avy eo, dia naveriny tamin’ny mpikarakara ary nipetraka izy. Ary nijery tsara azy izay rehetra tao amin’ny synagoga.', 'nahorony ilay horonam-boky avy eo, dia naveriny tamin’ny mpikarakara ary nipetraka izy. ary nijery tsara azy izay rehetra tao amin’ny synagoga.'),
  ('6ab25c5ece59c2113b7c41b1', '2026-09-22T10:45:50.321Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:50.321Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 4, 18, '“Ny fanahin’i Jehovah no ato amiko, satria nanosotra ahy hilaza vaovao tsara amin’ny mahantra izy. Nirahiny aho mba hanambara hoe ho afaka ny babo ary hahiratra ny jamba. Nirahiny koa aho mba hanafaka sy handefa an’ireo ampahorina,', '“ny fanahin’i jehovah no ato amiko, satria nanosotra ahy hilaza vaovao tsara amin’ny mahantra izy. nirahiny aho mba hanambara hoe ho afaka ny babo ary hahiratra ny jamba. nirahiny koa aho mba hanafaka sy handefa an’ireo ampahorina,'),
  ('6ab25c5ece59c2113b7c41ae', '2026-09-22T10:45:50.321Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:50.321Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 4, 15, 'Nampianatra tao amin’ny synagogan’izy ireo izy, ka nomen’ny rehetra voninahitra.', 'nampianatra tao amin’ny synagogan’izy ireo izy, ka nomen’ny rehetra voninahitra.'),
  ('6ab25c5ece59c2113b7c41ac', '2026-09-22T10:45:50.321Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:50.321Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 4, 13, 'Rehefa avy naka fanahy azy tamin’izany fomba rehetra izany ny Devoly, dia niala teo aminy mandra-pahatongan’ny fotoana hafa mety indray.', 'rehefa avy naka fanahy azy tamin’izany fomba rehetra izany ny devoly, dia niala teo aminy mandra-pahatongan’ny fotoana hafa mety indray.'),
  ('6ab25c5ece59c2113b7c41a8', '2026-09-22T10:45:50.321Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:50.321Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 4, 9, 'Nitondra azy nankany Jerosalema ny Devoly avy eo, dia nametraka azy teo an-tampon’ny mandan’ny tempoly. Ary hoy izy taminy: “Raha zanak’Andriamanitra ianao, dia mianjerà any ambany any,', 'nitondra azy nankany jerosalema ny devoly avy eo, dia nametraka azy teo an-tampon’ny mandan’ny tempoly. ary hoy izy taminy: “raha zanak’andriamanitra ianao, dia mianjerà any ambany any,'),
  ('6ab25c5ece59c2113b7c41a1', '2026-09-22T10:45:50.321Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:50.321Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 4, 2, 'nandritra ny 40 andro. Dia naka fanahy azy ny Devoly. Tsy nihinan-kanina izy nandritra an’izany fotoana izany, ka noana rehefa tapitra ireo andro ireo.', 'nandritra ny 40 andro. dia naka fanahy azy ny devoly. tsy nihinan-kanina izy nandritra an’izany fotoana izany, ka noana rehefa tapitra ireo andro ireo.'),
  ('6ab25c5ece59c2113b7c41ab', '2026-09-22T10:45:50.321Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:50.321Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 4, 12, 'Fa hoy ny navalin’i Jesosy: “Voalaza hoe: ‘Aza mitsapa toetra an’i Jehovah Andriamanitrao.’”', 'fa hoy ny navalin’i jesosy: “voalaza hoe: ‘aza mitsapa toetra an’i jehovah andriamanitrao.’”'),
  ('6ab25c5ece59c2113b7c41a4', '2026-09-22T10:45:50.321Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:50.321Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 4, 5, 'Koa nentin’ny Devoly niakatra teny an-tendrombohitra izy, ka nasehony azy vetivety ny fanjakana rehetra eran-tany.', 'koa nentin’ny devoly niakatra teny an-tendrombohitra izy, ka nasehony azy vetivety ny fanjakana rehetra eran-tany.'),
  ('6ab25c5ece59c2113b7c41a2', '2026-09-22T10:45:50.321Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:50.321Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 4, 3, 'Koa niteny taminy ny Devoly hoe: “Raha zanak’Andriamanitra ianao, dia teneno io vato io mba ho lasa mofo.”', 'koa niteny taminy ny devoly hoe: “raha zanak’andriamanitra ianao, dia teneno io vato io mba ho lasa mofo.”'),
  ('6ab25c5ece59c2113b7c41c4', '2026-09-22T10:45:50.321Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:50.321Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 4, 37, 'Koa niely nanerana ny faritra manodidina ny vaovao momba azy.', 'koa niely nanerana ny faritra manodidina ny vaovao momba azy.'),
  ('6ab25c5ece59c2113b7c41b4', '2026-09-22T10:45:50.321Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:50.321Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 4, 21, 'Dia hoy izy: “Androany no tanteraka ilay andinin-teny vao henonareo teo.”', 'dia hoy izy: “androany no tanteraka ilay andinin-teny vao henonareo teo.”'),
  ('6ab25c5ece59c2113b7c41a6', '2026-09-22T10:45:50.321Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:50.321Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 4, 7, 'Koa raha miankohoka indray mandeha eto anatrehako ianao, dia ho anao daholo izany.”', 'koa raha miankohoka indray mandeha eto anatrehako ianao, dia ho anao daholo izany.”'),
  ('6ab25c5ece59c2113b7c41c5', '2026-09-22T10:45:50.321Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:50.321Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 4, 38, 'Rehefa avy niala tao amin’ny synagoga izy, dia nankao an-tranon’i Simona. Nanavy be ny rafozambavin’i Simona, ka nangataka an’i Jesosy izy ireo mba hanampy azy.', 'rehefa avy niala tao amin’ny synagoga izy, dia nankao an-tranon’i simona. nanavy be ny rafozambavin’i simona, ka nangataka an’i jesosy izy ireo mba hanampy azy.'),
  ('6ab25c5ece59c2113b7c41bc', '2026-09-22T10:45:50.321Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:50.321Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 4, 29, 'ka nitsangana ary nandroaka azy ho any ivelan’ny tanàna. Ary nentin’izy ireo tany an-tampon’ilay tendrombohitra niorenan’ny tanànan’izy ireo izy, mba hazera tany amin’ny tevana.', 'ka nitsangana ary nandroaka azy ho any ivelan’ny tanàna. ary nentin’izy ireo tany an-tampon’ilay tendrombohitra niorenan’ny tanànan’izy ireo izy, mba hazera tany amin’ny tevana.'),
  ('6ab25c5ece59c2113b7c41b0', '2026-09-22T10:45:50.321Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:50.321Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 4, 17, 'Koa natolotra azy ny horonam-bokin’i Isaia mpaminany, ary nosokafany ka notadiaviny izay nisy an’ilay soratra hoe:', 'koa natolotra azy ny horonam-bokin’i isaia mpaminany, ary nosokafany ka notadiaviny izay nisy an’ilay soratra hoe:'),
  ('6ab25c5ece59c2113b7c41bf', '2026-09-22T10:45:50.321Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:50.321Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 4, 32, 'ka gaga ny olona tamin’ny fomba fampianany, satria niteny toy ny olona manana fahefana izy.', 'ka gaga ny olona tamin’ny fomba fampianany, satria niteny toy ny olona manana fahefana izy.'),
  ('6ab25c5ece59c2113b7c41b8', '2026-09-22T10:45:50.321Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:50.321Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 4, 25, 'Lazaiko marina aminareo, ohatra, fa be dia be ny vehivavy mpitondratena teo amin’ny Israely tamin’ny andron’i Elia, rehefa nihantona telo taona sy tapany ny orana, ka nisy mosary mafy nanerana an’ilay tany.', 'lazaiko marina aminareo, ohatra, fa be dia be ny vehivavy mpitondratena teo amin’ny israely tamin’ny andron’i elia, rehefa nihantona telo taona sy tapany ny orana, ka nisy mosary mafy nanerana an’ilay tany.'),
  ('6ab25c5ece59c2113b7c41c6', '2026-09-22T10:45:50.321Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:50.321Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 4, 39, 'Koa nitsangana teo akaikin’ilay ramatoa izy, ary noteneniny mafy ilay fanaviana dia afaka. Tonga dia niarina ilay ramatoa ary nikarakara sakafo ho an’ireo.', 'koa nitsangana teo akaikin’ilay ramatoa izy, ary noteneniny mafy ilay fanaviana dia afaka. tonga dia niarina ilay ramatoa ary nikarakara sakafo ho an’ireo.'),
  ('6ab25c5ece59c2113b7c41b5', '2026-09-22T10:45:50.321Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:50.321Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 4, 22, 'Nidera azy daholo ny rehetra, ary gaga noho ny teny mahafinaritra nolazain’ny vavany, ka hoy izy ireo: “Tsy zanak’i Josefa ve io e?”', 'nidera azy daholo ny rehetra, ary gaga noho ny teny mahafinaritra nolazain’ny vavany, ka hoy izy ireo: “tsy zanak’i josefa ve io e?”'),
  ('6ab25c5ece59c2113b7c41cb', '2026-09-22T10:45:50.322Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:50.322Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 4, 44, 'Nanohy nitory tao amin’ireo synagoga tany Jodia àry izy.', 'nanohy nitory tao amin’ireo synagoga tany jodia àry izy.'),
  ('6ab25c5ece59c2113b7c41ca', '2026-09-22T10:45:50.322Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:50.322Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 4, 43, 'Hoy anefa izy: “Tsy maintsy mitory ny vaovao tsaran’ny Fanjakan’Andriamanitra any amin’ny tanàna hafa koa aho, fa izany no nanirahana ahy.”', 'hoy anefa izy: “tsy maintsy mitory ny vaovao tsaran’ny fanjakan’andriamanitra any amin’ny tanàna hafa koa aho, fa izany no nanirahana ahy.”'),
  ('6ab25c5fd91689b8908ecb16', '2026-09-22T10:45:51.077Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:51.077Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 5, 25, 'Dia nitsangana teo anatrehan’izy ireo ilay lehilahy, ka nibata an’ilay fandrianany ary lasa nody, sady nanome voninahitra an’Andriamanitra.', 'dia nitsangana teo anatrehan’izy ireo ilay lehilahy, ka nibata an’ilay fandrianany ary lasa nody, sady nanome voninahitra an’andriamanitra.'),
  ('6ab25c5fd91689b8908ecb09', '2026-09-22T10:45:51.077Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:51.077Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 5, 12, 'Indray mandeha koa, raha mbola tao amin’ny tanàna anankiray izy, dia io fa nisy lehilahy rakotry ny habokana tao. Niankohoka izy raha vao nahita an’i Jesosy, ka niangavy hoe: “Tompo ô, raha mba tianao mantsy ny hanadio ahy, dia ho vitanao izany.”', 'indray mandeha koa, raha mbola tao amin’ny tanàna anankiray izy, dia io fa nisy lehilahy rakotry ny habokana tao. niankohoka izy raha vao nahita an’i jesosy, ka niangavy hoe: “tompo ô, raha mba tianao mantsy ny hanadio ahy, dia ho vitanao izany.”'),
  ('6ab25c5fd91689b8908ecb07', '2026-09-22T10:45:51.077Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:51.077Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 5, 10, 'Gaga be koa i Jakoba sy Jaona, zanak’i Zebedio, izay niara-niasa tamin’i Simona. Hoy anefa i Jesosy tamin’i Simona: “Aza matahotra, fa manomboka izao dia olona velona no ho azonao.”', 'gaga be koa i jakoba sy jaona, zanak’i zebedio, izay niara-niasa tamin’i simona. hoy anefa i jesosy tamin’i simona: “aza matahotra, fa manomboka izao dia olona velona no ho azonao.”'),
  ('6ab25c5fd91689b8908ecb0e', '2026-09-22T10:45:51.077Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:51.077Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 5, 17, 'Indray andro, tamin’izy nampianatra, dia nisy Fariseo sy mpampianatra Lalàna koa nipetraka teo. Avy any amin’ny tanàna kely rehetra any Galilia sy Jodia izy ireo ary avy any Jerosalema. Ary nomen’i Jehovah hery hanasitranana i Jesosy.', 'indray andro, tamin’izy nampianatra, dia nisy fariseo sy mpampianatra lalàna koa nipetraka teo. avy any amin’ny tanàna kely rehetra any galilia sy jodia izy ireo ary avy any jerosalema. ary nomen’i jehovah hery hanasitranana i jesosy.'),
  ('6ab25c5fd91689b8908ecb14', '2026-09-22T10:45:51.077Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:51.077Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 5, 23, 'Fa inona no mora kokoa: Ny miteny hoe: ‘Voavela ny helokao’, sa hoe: ‘Mitsangàna dia mandehana’?', 'fa inona no mora kokoa: ny miteny hoe: ‘voavela ny helokao’, sa hoe: ‘mitsangàna dia mandehana’?'),
  ('6ab25c5fd91689b8908ecb11', '2026-09-22T10:45:51.077Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:51.077Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 5, 20, 'Rehefa hitan’i Jesosy fa nanam-pinoana izy ireo, dia hoy izy tamin’ilay lehilahy: “Voavela ny helokao.”', 'rehefa hitan’i jesosy fa nanam-pinoana izy ireo, dia hoy izy tamin’ilay lehilahy: “voavela ny helokao.”'),
  ('6ab25c5fd91689b8908ecb0c', '2026-09-22T10:45:51.077Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:51.077Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 5, 15, 'Na izany aza, dia vao mainka niely ny resaka momba azy, ka nisy vahoaka be nivory mba hihaino azy sy hositranina tamin’ny aretiny.', 'na izany aza, dia vao mainka niely ny resaka momba azy, ka nisy vahoaka be nivory mba hihaino azy sy hositranina tamin’ny aretiny.'),
  ('6ab25c5fd91689b8908ecb1c', '2026-09-22T10:45:51.077Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:51.077Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 5, 31, 'Dia namaly i Jesosy hoe: “Tsy ny salama no mila dokotera, fa ny marary.', 'dia namaly i jesosy hoe: “tsy ny salama no mila dokotera, fa ny marary.'),
  ('6ab25c5fd91689b8908ecb08', '2026-09-22T10:45:51.077Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:51.077Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 5, 11, 'Koa nentin’izy ireo niverina teny an-tanety ny sambokely ary nilaozany ny zava-drehetra, dia lasa izy ireo nanaraka azy.', 'koa nentin’izy ireo niverina teny an-tanety ny sambokely ary nilaozany ny zava-drehetra, dia lasa izy ireo nanaraka azy.'),
  ('6ab25c5fd91689b8908ecb04', '2026-09-22T10:45:51.077Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:51.077Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 5, 7, 'Nanao fihetsika àry izy ireo hiantsoana ny namany teny amin’ilay sambokely iray mba ho tonga hanampy azy. Dia tonga izy ireo ary nofenoiny ny sambokely roa, ka saika nilentika mihitsy.', 'nanao fihetsika àry izy ireo hiantsoana ny namany teny amin’ilay sambokely iray mba ho tonga hanampy azy. dia tonga izy ireo ary nofenoiny ny sambokely roa, ka saika nilentika mihitsy.'),
  ('6ab25c5fd91689b8908ecb1a', '2026-09-22T10:45:51.077Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:51.077Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 5, 29, 'Dia nanao fanasambe ho an’i Jesosy i Levy, tao an-tranony. Nisy mpamory hetra be dia be sy olon-kafa koa tao, nisakafo niaraka tamin’izy ireo.', 'dia nanao fanasambe ho an’i jesosy i levy, tao an-tranony. nisy mpamory hetra be dia be sy olon-kafa koa tao, nisakafo niaraka tamin’izy ireo.'),
  ('6ab25c5fd91689b8908ecaff', '2026-09-22T10:45:51.077Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:51.077Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 5, 2, 'Ary nahita sambokely roa niantsona teo amoron’ilay farihy izy. Tsy tao amin’ireo sambokely anefa ny mpanarato fa efa lasa nanasa ny haratony.', 'ary nahita sambokely roa niantsona teo amoron’ilay farihy izy. tsy tao amin’ireo sambokely anefa ny mpanarato fa efa lasa nanasa ny haratony.'),
  ('6ab25c5fd91689b8908ecb13', '2026-09-22T10:45:51.077Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:51.077Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 5, 22, 'Fantatr’i Jesosy anefa ny tao an-tsain’izy ireo, ka hoy izy: “Inona izany eritreretinareo ao am-ponareo izany?', 'fantatr’i jesosy anefa ny tao an-tsain’izy ireo, ka hoy izy: “inona izany eritreretinareo ao am-ponareo izany?'),
  ('6ab25c5fd91689b8908ecb15', '2026-09-22T10:45:51.077Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:51.077Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 5, 24, 'Mba hahafantaranareo anefa fa manana fahefana hamela heloka eto an-tany ny Zanak’olona...” Dia hoy izy tamin’ilay lehilahy malemy: “Izao no lazaiko aminao: Mitsangàna, batao ny fandriananao, ary mandehana mody.”', 'mba hahafantaranareo anefa fa manana fahefana hamela heloka eto an-tany ny zanak’olona...” dia hoy izy tamin’ilay lehilahy malemy: “izao no lazaiko aminao: mitsangàna, batao ny fandriananao, ary mandehana mody.”'),
  ('6ab25c5fd91689b8908ecb03', '2026-09-22T10:45:51.077Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:51.077Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 5, 6, 'Nahazo trondro be dia be izy ireo rehefa nanao an’izany, ka rovitra mihitsy ny haratony.', 'nahazo trondro be dia be izy ireo rehefa nanao an’izany, ka rovitra mihitsy ny haratony.'),
  ('6ab25c5fd91689b8908ecb01', '2026-09-22T10:45:51.077Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:51.077Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 5, 4, 'Rehefa tapitra ny teniny, dia hoy izy tamin’i Simona: “Mandrosondrosoa any amin’ny lalina, ary alatsaho ny haratonareo dia hahazo trondro ianareo!”', 'rehefa tapitra ny teniny, dia hoy izy tamin’i simona: “mandrosondrosoa any amin’ny lalina, ary alatsaho ny haratonareo dia hahazo trondro ianareo!”'),
  ('6ab25c5fd91689b8908ecb00', '2026-09-22T10:45:51.077Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:51.077Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 5, 3, 'Koa niakatra tao amin’ny iray tamin’ireo sambokely ireo i Jesosy. An’i Simona ilay izy, ary nangataka taminy izy mba hihataka kely amin’ny morony. Dia nipetraka izy, ary nampianatra ny vahoaka avy tao amin’ilay sambokely.', 'koa niakatra tao amin’ny iray tamin’ireo sambokely ireo i jesosy. an’i simona ilay izy, ary nangataka taminy izy mba hihataka kely amin’ny morony. dia nipetraka izy, ary nampianatra ny vahoaka avy tao amin’ilay sambokely.'),
  ('6ab25c5fd91689b8908ecb0d', '2026-09-22T10:45:51.077Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:51.077Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 5, 16, 'Matetika anefa izy no nankany amin’ny toerana mitokana mba hivavaka.', 'matetika anefa izy no nankany amin’ny toerana mitokana mba hivavaka.'),
  ('6ab25c5fd91689b8908ecb18', '2026-09-22T10:45:51.077Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:51.077Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 5, 27, 'Taorian’izay, dia nivoaka izy ka nahita mpamory hetra atao hoe Levy, nipetraka teo amin’ny birao famorian-ketra. Dia hoy izy taminy: “Andao hanara-dia ahy.”', 'taorian’izay, dia nivoaka izy ka nahita mpamory hetra atao hoe levy, nipetraka teo amin’ny birao famorian-ketra. dia hoy izy taminy: “andao hanara-dia ahy.”'),
  ('6ab25c5fd91689b8908ecb1b', '2026-09-22T10:45:51.077Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:51.077Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 5, 30, 'Dia nimenomenona tamin’ny mpianatr’i Jesosy ny Fariseo sy ny mpanora-dalàna teo amin’izy ireo hoe: “Fa maninona ianareo no miara-mihinana sy misotro amin’ny mpamory hetra sy ny mpanota?”', 'dia nimenomenona tamin’ny mpianatr’i jesosy ny fariseo sy ny mpanora-dalàna teo amin’izy ireo hoe: “fa maninona ianareo no miara-mihinana sy misotro amin’ny mpamory hetra sy ny mpanota?”'),
  ('6ab25c5fd91689b8908ecb19', '2026-09-22T10:45:51.077Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:51.077Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 5, 28, 'Ary nandao ny zava-drehetra i Levy ka nitsangana ary nanaraka azy.', 'ary nandao ny zava-drehetra i levy ka nitsangana ary nanaraka azy.'),
  ('6ab25c5fd91689b8908ecb17', '2026-09-22T10:45:51.077Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:51.077Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 5, 26, 'Ary gaga be ny rehetra dia nanome voninahitra an’Andriamanitra. Sady talanjona izy ireo no raiki-tahotra ka niteny hoe: “Tena niavaka ny zavatra hitantsika androany!”', 'ary gaga be ny rehetra dia nanome voninahitra an’andriamanitra. sady talanjona izy ireo no raiki-tahotra ka niteny hoe: “tena niavaka ny zavatra hitantsika androany!”'),
  ('6ab25c5fd91689b8908ecb10', '2026-09-22T10:45:51.077Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:51.077Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 5, 19, 'Tsy nahita fomba hampidirana azy anefa izy ireo satria vahoaka be no tao. Niakatra tany an-tampon-trano àry izy ireo, ary nanesorany ilay tafo tanimanga, dia nampidininy teo afovoan’ny olona teo anoloan’i Jesosy ilay lehilahy teo ambony fandriana.', 'tsy nahita fomba hampidirana azy anefa izy ireo satria vahoaka be no tao. niakatra tany an-tampon-trano àry izy ireo, ary nanesorany ilay tafo tanimanga, dia nampidininy teo afovoan’ny olona teo anoloan’i jesosy ilay lehilahy teo ambony fandriana.'),
  ('6ab25c5fd91689b8908ecb06', '2026-09-22T10:45:51.077Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:51.077Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 5, 9, 'Gaga be mantsy izy sy ireo niaraka taminy satria be dia be ny trondro azony.', 'gaga be mantsy izy sy ireo niaraka taminy satria be dia be ny trondro azony.'),
  ('6ab25c5fd91689b8908ecb0a', '2026-09-22T10:45:51.077Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:51.077Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 5, 13, 'Koa nanatsotra ny tanany i Jesosy ka nikasika azy, sady niteny hoe: “Tiako izany ka! Madiova ianao.” Tonga dia niala tamin’ilay lehilahy ilay habokana.', 'koa nanatsotra ny tanany i jesosy ka nikasika azy, sady niteny hoe: “tiako izany ka! madiova ianao.” tonga dia niala tamin’ilay lehilahy ilay habokana.'),
  ('6ab25c5fd91689b8908ecafe', '2026-09-22T10:45:51.077Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:51.077Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 5, 1, 'Nijoro teo amoron’ny farihin’i Genesareta i Jesosy indray mandeha, ary nifanesika teo aminy ny vahoaka mba hihaino ny tenin’Andriamanitra.', 'nijoro teo amoron’ny farihin’i genesareta i jesosy indray mandeha, ary nifanesika teo aminy ny vahoaka mba hihaino ny tenin’andriamanitra.'),
  ('6ab25c5fd91689b8908ecb12', '2026-09-22T10:45:51.077Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:51.077Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 5, 21, 'Koa nifampiresaka ny mpanora-dalàna sy ny Fariseo hoe: “Fa iza moa io no manevateva an’Andriamanitra? Fa angaha moa tsy Andriamanitra ihany no afaka mamela heloka?”', 'koa nifampiresaka ny mpanora-dalàna sy ny fariseo hoe: “fa iza moa io no manevateva an’andriamanitra? fa angaha moa tsy andriamanitra ihany no afaka mamela heloka?”'),
  ('6ab25c5fd91689b8908ecb0f', '2026-09-22T10:45:51.077Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:51.077Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 5, 18, 'Ary ireny fa nisy olona nitondra lehilahy iray malemy, nolanjainy teo ambony fandriana. Nitady fomba hampidirana azy sy hametrahana azy teo anoloan’i Jesosy izy ireo.', 'ary ireny fa nisy olona nitondra lehilahy iray malemy, nolanjainy teo ambony fandriana. nitady fomba hampidirana azy sy hametrahana azy teo anoloan’i jesosy izy ireo.'),
  ('6ab25c5fd91689b8908ecb0b', '2026-09-22T10:45:51.077Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:51.077Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 5, 14, 'Dia noraran’i Jesosy ilay lehilahy mba tsy hiteniteny amin’olona. Hoy izy: “Fa mandehana miseho any amin’ny mpisorona, ary satria nodiovina ianao dia manaova fanatitra, araka izay nasain’i Mosesy natao, mba ho hitan’izy ireo fa sitrana ianao.”', 'dia noraran’i jesosy ilay lehilahy mba tsy hiteniteny amin’olona. hoy izy: “fa mandehana miseho any amin’ny mpisorona, ary satria nodiovina ianao dia manaova fanatitra, araka izay nasain’i mosesy natao, mba ho hitan’izy ireo fa sitrana ianao.”'),
  ('6ab25c5fd91689b8908ecb05', '2026-09-22T10:45:51.077Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:51.077Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 5, 8, 'Rehefa nahita an’izany i Simona Petera, dia nandohalika teo anoloan’i Jesosy, ka niteny hoe: “Tompo ô, mandehana fa aza manakaiky ahy fa mpanota aho.”', 'rehefa nahita an’izany i simona petera, dia nandohalika teo anoloan’i jesosy, ka niteny hoe: “tompo ô, mandehana fa aza manakaiky ahy fa mpanota aho.”'),
  ('6ab25c5fd91689b8908ecb02', '2026-09-22T10:45:51.077Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:51.077Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 5, 5, 'Hoy anefa i Simona: “Mpampianatra ô, efa niasa mafy nandritra ny alina izahay, saingy tsy nahazo na inona na inona. Noho ny teninao anefa, dia halatsako ihany ny harato.”', 'hoy anefa i simona: “mpampianatra ô, efa niasa mafy nandritra ny alina izahay, saingy tsy nahazo na inona na inona. noho ny teninao anefa, dia halatsako ihany ny harato.”'),
  ('6ab25c5fd91689b8908ecb20', '2026-09-22T10:45:51.078Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:51.078Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 5, 35, 'Indray andro any anefa, dia tsy hiaraka aminy intsony ny mpampakatra, ka amin’izany andro izany ry zareo vao hifady hanina.”', 'indray andro any anefa, dia tsy hiaraka aminy intsony ny mpampakatra, ka amin’izany andro izany ry zareo vao hifady hanina.”'),
  ('6ab25c5fd91689b8908ecb1e', '2026-09-22T10:45:51.078Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:51.078Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 5, 33, 'Hoy izy ireo: “Mifady hanina matetika ny mpianatr’i Jaona sady mitalaho amim-bavaka. Manao hoatr’izany koa ny mpianatry ny Fariseo, fa ny anao kosa mihinana sy misotro.”', 'hoy izy ireo: “mifady hanina matetika ny mpianatr’i jaona sady mitalaho amim-bavaka. manao hoatr’izany koa ny mpianatry ny fariseo, fa ny anao kosa mihinana sy misotro.”'),
  ('6ab25c5fd91689b8908ecb22', '2026-09-22T10:45:51.078Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:51.078Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 5, 37, 'Ary tsy misy olona manisy divay vaovao ao anaty siny hoditra efa tonta. Raha izany mantsy, dia hamaky an’ilay siny hoditra ilay divay vaovao ka ho raraka ny divay, ary ho simba ny siny.', 'ary tsy misy olona manisy divay vaovao ao anaty siny hoditra efa tonta. raha izany mantsy, dia hamaky an’ilay siny hoditra ilay divay vaovao ka ho raraka ny divay, ary ho simba ny siny.'),
  ('6ab25c5fd91689b8908ecb1d', '2026-09-22T10:45:51.078Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:51.078Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 5, 32, 'Tsy tonga hiantso ny olo-marina aho, fa tonga hiantso ny mpanota mba hibebaka.”', 'tsy tonga hiantso ny olo-marina aho, fa tonga hiantso ny mpanota mba hibebaka.”'),
  ('6ab25c5fd91689b8908ecb24', '2026-09-22T10:45:51.078Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:51.078Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 5, 39, 'Ary tsy misy olona hangataka divay vaovao rehefa avy nisotro divay efa niotrika ela, fa hiteny izy hoe: ‘Ny ela no tsara.’”', 'ary tsy misy olona hangataka divay vaovao rehefa avy nisotro divay efa niotrika ela, fa hiteny izy hoe: ‘ny ela no tsara.’”'),
  ('6ab25c5fd91689b8908ecb1f', '2026-09-22T10:45:51.078Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:51.078Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 5, 34, 'Dia hoy i Jesosy: “Tsy azonareo terena hifady hanina ny naman’ny mpampakatra raha mbola miaraka aminy eo ny mpampakatra. Sa tsy izany?', 'dia hoy i jesosy: “tsy azonareo terena hifady hanina ny naman’ny mpampakatra raha mbola miaraka aminy eo ny mpampakatra. sa tsy izany?'),
  ('6ab25c5fd91689b8908ecb23', '2026-09-22T10:45:51.078Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:51.078Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 5, 38, 'Fa tsy maintsy hatao ao anaty siny hoditra vaovao ny divay vaovao.', 'fa tsy maintsy hatao ao anaty siny hoditra vaovao ny divay vaovao.'),
  ('6ab25c5fd91689b8908ecb21', '2026-09-22T10:45:51.078Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:51.078Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 5, 36, 'Nilaza fanoharana tamin’izy ireo koa izy hoe: “Tsy misy olona maka tapa-damba avy amin’ny akanjo vaovao, ka manampina akanjo tonta amin’izany. Raha izany mantsy, dia handrirotra an’ilay akanjo tonta ilay tapa-damba vaovao sady tsy hifanaraka aminy koa.', 'nilaza fanoharana tamin’izy ireo koa izy hoe: “tsy misy olona maka tapa-damba avy amin’ny akanjo vaovao, ka manampina akanjo tonta amin’izany. raha izany mantsy, dia handrirotra an’ilay akanjo tonta ilay tapa-damba vaovao sady tsy hifanaraka aminy koa.'),
  ('6ab25c5f1f5bdbd93d468549', '2026-09-22T10:45:51.570Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:51.570Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 6, 41, 'Koa maninona ianao no mijery ny sombin-kazo eo amin’ny mason’ny rahalahinao, nefa ny vatan-kazo eo amin’ny masonao aza tsy hitanao?', 'koa maninona ianao no mijery ny sombin-kazo eo amin’ny mason’ny rahalahinao, nefa ny vatan-kazo eo amin’ny masonao aza tsy hitanao?'),
  ('6ab25c5f1f5bdbd93d46853c', '2026-09-22T10:45:51.570Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:51.570Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 6, 28, 'irario soa foana izay manozona anareo, ary mivavaha foana ho an’izay manao tsinontsinona anareo.', 'irario soa foana izay manozona anareo, ary mivavaha foana ho an’izay manao tsinontsinona anareo.'),
  ('6ab25c5f1f5bdbd93d468542', '2026-09-22T10:45:51.570Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:51.570Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 6, 34, 'Raha izay antenainareo hamerina ny volanareo ihany no ampisamborinareo, mendrika ny hahazo dera ve ianareo amin’izany? Na ny samy mpanota aza mifampisambo-bola, satria manantena hoe ho tafaverina ny volany.', 'raha izay antenainareo hamerina ny volanareo ihany no ampisamborinareo, mendrika ny hahazo dera ve ianareo amin’izany? na ny samy mpanota aza mifampisambo-bola, satria manantena hoe ho tafaverina ny volany.'),
  ('6ab25c5f1f5bdbd93d46853e', '2026-09-22T10:45:51.570Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:51.570Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 6, 30, 'Izay rehetra mangataka aminao dia omeo, ary aza takina amin’izay naka azy ny fanananao.', 'izay rehetra mangataka aminao dia omeo, ary aza takina amin’izay naka azy ny fanananao.'),
  ('6ab25c5f1f5bdbd93d468528', '2026-09-22T10:45:51.570Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:51.570Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 6, 8, 'Fantatr’i Jesosy anefa ny eritreritr’izy ireo, ka hoy izy tamin’ilay lehilahy maty tanana: “Mitsangàna dia mijoroa etsy afovoany etsy.” Dia nitsangana izy ka nijoro teo.', 'fantatr’i jesosy anefa ny eritreritr’izy ireo, ka hoy izy tamin’ilay lehilahy maty tanana: “mitsangàna dia mijoroa etsy afovoany etsy.” dia nitsangana izy ka nijoro teo.'),
  ('6ab25c5f1f5bdbd93d468526', '2026-09-22T10:45:51.570Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:51.570Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 6, 6, 'Tamin’ny sabata hafa indray, dia niditra tao amin’ny synagoga izy ary nampianatra. Ary nisy lehilahy maty tanana ankavanana tao.', 'tamin’ny sabata hafa indray, dia niditra tao amin’ny synagoga izy ary nampianatra. ary nisy lehilahy maty tanana ankavanana tao.'),
  ('6ab25c5f1f5bdbd93d468524', '2026-09-22T10:45:51.570Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:51.570Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 6, 4, 'Niditra tao an-tranon’Andriamanitra izy ary nomena azy ny mofo atolotra, dia nohaniny izany ary nomeny koa ny olona niaraka taminy. Tsy nisy nahazo nihinana an’izany anefa, afa-tsy ny mpisorona ihany.”', 'niditra tao an-tranon’andriamanitra izy ary nomena azy ny mofo atolotra, dia nohaniny izany ary nomeny koa ny olona niaraka taminy. tsy nisy nahazo nihinana an’izany anefa, afa-tsy ny mpisorona ihany.”'),
  ('6ab25c5f1f5bdbd93d46854c', '2026-09-22T10:45:51.570Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:51.570Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 6, 44, 'Fa samy fantatra amin’ny voany avy ny hazo tsirairay. Tsy misy olona mioty aviavy amin’ny tsilo, ohatra, na mioty voaloboka amin’ny voarointsilo.', 'fa samy fantatra amin’ny voany avy ny hazo tsirairay. tsy misy olona mioty aviavy amin’ny tsilo, ohatra, na mioty voaloboka amin’ny voarointsilo.'),
  ('6ab25c5f1f5bdbd93d46854b', '2026-09-22T10:45:51.570Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:51.570Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 6, 43, '“Fa tsy misy hazo tsara mamoa voa ratsy, ary tsy misy hazo ratsy mamoa voa tsara.', '“fa tsy misy hazo tsara mamoa voa ratsy, ary tsy misy hazo ratsy mamoa voa tsara.'),
  ('6ab25c5f1f5bdbd93d468535', '2026-09-22T10:45:51.570Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:51.570Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 6, 21, '“Sambatra ianareo noana ankehitriny, fa hovokisana ianareo. “Sambatra ianareo mitomany ankehitriny, fa hihomehy ianareo.', '“sambatra ianareo noana ankehitriny, fa hovokisana ianareo. “sambatra ianareo mitomany ankehitriny, fa hihomehy ianareo.'),
  ('6ab25c5f1f5bdbd93d468551', '2026-09-22T10:45:51.570Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:51.570Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 6, 49, 'Fa izay maheno nefa tsy manao na inona na inona, dia hoatran’ny olona nanorina trano teo ambonin’ny tany nefa tsy nihady fototra. Namely mafy an’izany trano izany ilay renirano, ka tonga dia nirodana ilay izy ary rava tanteraka.”', 'fa izay maheno nefa tsy manao na inona na inona, dia hoatran’ny olona nanorina trano teo ambonin’ny tany nefa tsy nihady fototra. namely mafy an’izany trano izany ilay renirano, ka tonga dia nirodana ilay izy ary rava tanteraka.”'),
  ('6ab25c5f1f5bdbd93d46853d', '2026-09-22T10:45:51.570Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:51.570Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 6, 29, 'Raha misy mamely ny takolakao anankiray, dia atolory azy koa ny iray. Ary raha misy maka ny akanjonao ivelany, dia avelao halainy koa ny akanjo anatiny.', 'raha misy mamely ny takolakao anankiray, dia atolory azy koa ny iray. ary raha misy maka ny akanjonao ivelany, dia avelao halainy koa ny akanjo anatiny.'),
  ('6ab25c5f1f5bdbd93d468522', '2026-09-22T10:45:51.570Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:51.570Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 6, 2, 'Dia hoy ny Fariseo sasany: “Fa maninona ianareo no manao zavatra tsy azo atao amin’ny Sabata?”', 'dia hoy ny fariseo sasany: “fa maninona ianareo no manao zavatra tsy azo atao amin’ny sabata?”'),
  ('6ab25c5f1f5bdbd93d468540', '2026-09-22T10:45:51.570Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:51.570Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 6, 32, '“Raha izay tia anareo ihany no tianareo, mendrika ny hahazo dera ve ianareo amin’izany? Na ny mpanota aza mantsy mba tia an’izay tia azy koa.', '“raha izay tia anareo ihany no tianareo, mendrika ny hahazo dera ve ianareo amin’izany? na ny mpanota aza mantsy mba tia an’izay tia azy koa.'),
  ('6ab25c5f1f5bdbd93d468525', '2026-09-22T10:45:51.570Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:51.570Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 6, 5, 'Avy eo dia hoy izy tamin’ireo: “Ny Zanak’olona no Tompon’ny Sabata.”', 'avy eo dia hoy izy tamin’ireo: “ny zanak’olona no tompon’ny sabata.”'),
  ('6ab25c5f1f5bdbd93d468546', '2026-09-22T10:45:51.570Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:51.570Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 6, 38, 'Aoka ianareo ho zatra manome, dia mba homena koa ianareo. Fatra tsara sy nafatratra sady nahontsana ary mihoatra no hararaka eo am-pofoanareo. Fa araka izay famarana ampiasainareo no hamarana ho anareo.”', 'aoka ianareo ho zatra manome, dia mba homena koa ianareo. fatra tsara sy nafatratra sady nahontsana ary mihoatra no hararaka eo am-pofoanareo. fa araka izay famarana ampiasainareo no hamarana ho anareo.”'),
  ('6ab25c5f1f5bdbd93d468544', '2026-09-22T10:45:51.570Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:51.570Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 6, 36, 'Mamindrà fo foana, toy ny Rainareo izay mpamindra fo.', 'mamindrà fo foana, toy ny rainareo izay mpamindra fo.'),
  ('6ab25c5f1f5bdbd93d46854a', '2026-09-22T10:45:51.570Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:51.570Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 6, 42, 'Ahoana no itenenanao amin’ny rahalahinao hoe: ‘Aleo hesoriko ny sombin-kazo eo amin’ny masonao, ry rahalahy’, nefa ianao aza tsy mahita ny vatan-kazo eo amin’ny masonao? Ry mpihatsaravelatsihy! Esory aloha ny vatan-kazo eo amin’ny masonao, dia ho hitanao tsara hoe ahoana no hanesorana ny sombin-kazo eo amin’ny mason’ny rahalahinao.', 'ahoana no itenenanao amin’ny rahalahinao hoe: ‘aleo hesoriko ny sombin-kazo eo amin’ny masonao, ry rahalahy’, nefa ianao aza tsy mahita ny vatan-kazo eo amin’ny masonao? ry mpihatsaravelatsihy! esory aloha ny vatan-kazo eo amin’ny masonao, dia ho hitanao tsara hoe ahoana no hanesorana ny sombin-kazo eo amin’ny mason’ny rahalahinao.'),
  ('6ab25c5f1f5bdbd93d468541', '2026-09-22T10:45:51.570Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:51.570Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 6, 33, 'Ary raha izay manisy soa anareo ihany no asianareo soa, mendrika ny hahazo dera ve ianareo amin’izany? Na ny mpanota aza ange manao hoatr’izany koa e!', 'ary raha izay manisy soa anareo ihany no asianareo soa, mendrika ny hahazo dera ve ianareo amin’izany? na ny mpanota aza ange manao hoatr’izany koa e!'),
  ('6ab25c5f1f5bdbd93d46852d', '2026-09-22T10:45:51.570Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:51.570Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 6, 13, 'Ary niantso ny mpianany izy, rehefa maraina ny andro, ka nifidy 12 lahy tamin’izy ireo, izay nataony hoe apostoly:', 'ary niantso ny mpianany izy, rehefa maraina ny andro, ka nifidy 12 lahy tamin’izy ireo, izay nataony hoe apostoly:'),
  ('6ab25c5f1f5bdbd93d468527', '2026-09-22T10:45:51.570Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:51.570Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 6, 7, 'Nijery tsara an’i Jesosy ny mpanora-dalàna sy ny Fariseo raha hanasitrana azy izy na tsia, mba hahitana antony hiampangana azy. Sabata mantsy tamin’izay.', 'nijery tsara an’i jesosy ny mpanora-dalàna sy ny fariseo raha hanasitrana azy izy na tsia, mba hahitana antony hiampangana azy. sabata mantsy tamin’izay.'),
  ('6ab25c5f1f5bdbd93d46854e', '2026-09-22T10:45:51.570Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:51.570Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 6, 46, '“Koa nahoana ianareo no miantso ahy hoe: ‘Tompo ô! Tompo ô!’, nefa tsy manao an’izay lazaiko?', '“koa nahoana ianareo no miantso ahy hoe: ‘tompo ô! tompo ô!’, nefa tsy manao an’izay lazaiko?'),
  ('6ab25c5f1f5bdbd93d468545', '2026-09-22T10:45:51.570Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:51.570Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 6, 37, '“Aza mitsara intsony, dia tsy hotsaraina mihitsy ianareo. Ary aza manameloka intsony, dia tsy homelohina mihitsy ianareo. Mamelà ny hafa, dia mba havela koa ianareo.', '“aza mitsara intsony, dia tsy hotsaraina mihitsy ianareo. ary aza manameloka intsony, dia tsy homelohina mihitsy ianareo. mamelà ny hafa, dia mba havela koa ianareo.'),
  ('6ab25c5f1f5bdbd93d468536', '2026-09-22T10:45:51.570Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:51.570Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 6, 22, '“Sambatra ianareo raha halan’ny olona sy ailikiliny ary haratsiny ka lazainy hoe ratsy fanahy, noho ny amin’ny Zanak’olona.', '“sambatra ianareo raha halan’ny olona sy ailikiliny ary haratsiny ka lazainy hoe ratsy fanahy, noho ny amin’ny zanak’olona.'),
  ('6ab25c5f1f5bdbd93d468550', '2026-09-22T10:45:51.570Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:51.570Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 6, 48, 'Hoatran’ny lehilahy nanorina trano izy, ka nihady lalina vao nandatsaka fototra teo ambony vatolampy. Koa rehefa nisy tondra-drano, dia namely mafy an’izany trano izany ny renirano, saingy tsy nampihozongozona azy, satria tsara orina ilay izy.', 'hoatran’ny lehilahy nanorina trano izy, ka nihady lalina vao nandatsaka fototra teo ambony vatolampy. koa rehefa nisy tondra-drano, dia namely mafy an’izany trano izany ny renirano, saingy tsy nampihozongozona azy, satria tsara orina ilay izy.'),
  ('6ab25c5f1f5bdbd93d46853f', '2026-09-22T10:45:51.570Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:51.570Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 6, 31, '“Izay tianareo hataon’ny olona aminareo no ataovy aminy koa.', '“izay tianareo hataon’ny olona aminareo no ataovy aminy koa.'),
  ('6ab25c5f1f5bdbd93d468537', '2026-09-22T10:45:51.570Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:51.570Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 6, 23, 'Mifalia amin’izany andro izany, ary aoka ianareo hitsinjaky ny hafaliana, fa lehibe ny valisoanareo any an-danitra. Fa hoatr’izany koa no nataon’ny razambeny tamin’ny mpaminany.', 'mifalia amin’izany andro izany, ary aoka ianareo hitsinjaky ny hafaliana, fa lehibe ny valisoanareo any an-danitra. fa hoatr’izany koa no nataon’ny razambeny tamin’ny mpaminany.'),
  ('6ab25c5f1f5bdbd93d46852c', '2026-09-22T10:45:51.570Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:51.570Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 6, 12, 'Nankany an-tendrombohitra izy, indray andro izay, mba hivavaka. Dia nivavaka tamin’Andriamanitra nandritra ny alina manontolo izy.', 'nankany an-tendrombohitra izy, indray andro izay, mba hivavaka. dia nivavaka tamin’andriamanitra nandritra ny alina manontolo izy.'),
  ('6ab25c5f1f5bdbd93d468523', '2026-09-22T10:45:51.570Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:51.570Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 6, 3, 'Namaly anefa i Jesosy hoe: “Mbola tsy novakinareo mihitsy angaha ilay nataon’i Davida, rehefa noana izy sy ny olona niaraka taminy?', 'namaly anefa i jesosy hoe: “mbola tsy novakinareo mihitsy angaha ilay nataon’i davida, rehefa noana izy sy ny olona niaraka taminy?'),
  ('6ab25c5f1f5bdbd93d468548', '2026-09-22T10:45:51.570Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:51.570Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 6, 40, 'Ny mpianatra tsy ambony noho ny mpampianatra azy, fa izay rehetra mahazo fampianarana tonga lafatra dia hitovy amin’ny mpampianatra azy ihany.', 'ny mpianatra tsy ambony noho ny mpampianatra azy, fa izay rehetra mahazo fampianarana tonga lafatra dia hitovy amin’ny mpampianatra azy ihany.'),
  ('6ab25c5f1f5bdbd93d46853a', '2026-09-22T10:45:51.570Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:51.570Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 6, 26, '“Hahita loza ianareo raha milaza zavatra tsara momba anareo daholo ny olona, fa izany koa no nataon’ny razamben’izy ireo tamin’ny mpaminany sandoka.', '“hahita loza ianareo raha milaza zavatra tsara momba anareo daholo ny olona, fa izany koa no nataon’ny razamben’izy ireo tamin’ny mpaminany sandoka.'),
  ('6ab25c5f1f5bdbd93d468529', '2026-09-22T10:45:51.570Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:51.570Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 6, 9, 'Dia hoy i Jesosy tamin’izy ireo: “Manontany anareo aho: Inona no azo atao amin’ny Sabata: Ny manao soa sa ny manao ratsy? Ny mamonjy aina sa ny mamono olona?”', 'dia hoy i jesosy tamin’izy ireo: “manontany anareo aho: inona no azo atao amin’ny sabata: ny manao soa sa ny manao ratsy? ny mamonjy aina sa ny mamono olona?”'),
  ('6ab25c5f1f5bdbd93d468521', '2026-09-22T10:45:51.570Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:51.570Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 6, 1, 'Nandeha teny an-tanimbary i Jesosy sy ny mpianany, indray sabata izay. Nioty salohim-bary ny mpianany, ka nokosikosehin’izy ireo tamin’ny tanany izany dia nohaniny.', 'nandeha teny an-tanimbary i jesosy sy ny mpianany, indray sabata izay. nioty salohim-bary ny mpianany, ka nokosikosehin’izy ireo tamin’ny tanany izany dia nohaniny.'),
  ('6ab25c5f1f5bdbd93d46854f', '2026-09-22T10:45:51.570Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:51.570Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 6, 47, 'Hasehoko anareo hoe azo oharina amin’inona ny olona manatona ahy sy mihaino ny teniko ka mankatò:', 'hasehoko anareo hoe azo oharina amin’inona ny olona manatona ahy sy mihaino ny teniko ka mankatò:'),
  ('6ab25c5f1f5bdbd93d46854d', '2026-09-22T10:45:51.570Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:51.570Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 6, 45, 'Ny olona tsara dia mamoaka an’izay zavatra tsara tehiriziny ao am-pony, fa ny olona ratsy fanahy kosa mamoaka an’izay zavatra ratsy tehiriziny ao am-pony. Fa izay mameno ny fon’ny olona no lazain’ny vavany.', 'ny olona tsara dia mamoaka an’izay zavatra tsara tehiriziny ao am-pony, fa ny olona ratsy fanahy kosa mamoaka an’izay zavatra ratsy tehiriziny ao am-pony. fa izay mameno ny fon’ny olona no lazain’ny vavany.');
INSERT INTO "bible_verses" ("id", "created_date", "updated_date", "created_by_id", "created_by", "translation", "book", "bookOrder", "chapter", "verse", "text", "normalizedText") VALUES
  ('6ab25c5f1f5bdbd93d468538', '2026-09-22T10:45:51.570Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:51.570Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 6, 24, '“Fa hahita loza kosa ianareo manankarena, satria efa azonareo daholo izay mahafa-po anareo.', '“fa hahita loza kosa ianareo manankarena, satria efa azonareo daholo izay mahafa-po anareo.'),
  ('6ab25c5f1f5bdbd93d468531', '2026-09-22T10:45:51.570Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:51.570Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 6, 17, 'Ary niara-nidina tamin’ireo izy, ka nijanona teo amin’ny lemaka iray. Nisy mpianany maro be teo, sy vahoaka be avy any amin’ny faritra rehetra eran’i Jodia sy Jerosalema ary ny faritra amoron-tsirak’i Tyro sy Sidona. Tonga hihaino azy sy hositraniny tamin’ny aretiny izy ireo.', 'ary niara-nidina tamin’ireo izy, ka nijanona teo amin’ny lemaka iray. nisy mpianany maro be teo, sy vahoaka be avy any amin’ny faritra rehetra eran’i jodia sy jerosalema ary ny faritra amoron-tsirak’i tyro sy sidona. tonga hihaino azy sy hositraniny tamin’ny aretiny izy ireo.'),
  ('6ab25c5f1f5bdbd93d46852e', '2026-09-22T10:45:51.570Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:51.570Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 6, 14, 'I Simona, izay nantsoiny koa hoe Petera, Andrea rahalahiny, Jakoba, Jaona, Filipo, Bartolomeo,', 'i simona, izay nantsoiny koa hoe petera, andrea rahalahiny, jakoba, jaona, filipo, bartolomeo,'),
  ('6ab25c5f1f5bdbd93d468547', '2026-09-22T10:45:51.570Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:51.570Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 6, 39, 'Nilaza fanoharana tamin’izy ireo koa izy avy eo hoe: “Ny jamba angaha afaka mitarika jamba? Tsy ho latsaka any an-kady ve izy roa?', 'nilaza fanoharana tamin’izy ireo koa izy avy eo hoe: “ny jamba angaha afaka mitarika jamba? tsy ho latsaka any an-kady ve izy roa?'),
  ('6ab25c5f1f5bdbd93d468543', '2026-09-22T10:45:51.570Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:51.570Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 6, 35, 'Fa ianareo kosa, tiavo foana ny fahavalonareo, manaova soa hatrany, ary mampisambora nefa aza manantena valiny. Amin’izay dia ho lehibe ny valisoanareo ary ho zanaky ny Avo Indrindra ianareo, satria izy tsara fanahy amin’izay tsy mankasitraka sy amin’ny ratsy fanahy.', 'fa ianareo kosa, tiavo foana ny fahavalonareo, manaova soa hatrany, ary mampisambora nefa aza manantena valiny. amin’izay dia ho lehibe ny valisoanareo ary ho zanaky ny avo indrindra ianareo, satria izy tsara fanahy amin’izay tsy mankasitraka sy amin’ny ratsy fanahy.'),
  ('6ab25c5f1f5bdbd93d46853b', '2026-09-22T10:45:51.570Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:51.570Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 6, 27, '“Fa izao kosa no lazaiko aminareo mihaino ahy: Tiavo foana ny fahavalonareo, manaova soa foana amin’izay mankahala anareo,', '“fa izao kosa no lazaiko aminareo mihaino ahy: tiavo foana ny fahavalonareo, manaova soa foana amin’izay mankahala anareo,'),
  ('6ab25c5f1f5bdbd93d468533', '2026-09-22T10:45:51.570Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:51.570Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 6, 19, 'Ary nitady hikasika azy ny vahoaka rehetra, satria nisy hery niala taminy ka nahasitrana azy rehetra.', 'ary nitady hikasika azy ny vahoaka rehetra, satria nisy hery niala taminy ka nahasitrana azy rehetra.'),
  ('6ab25c5f1f5bdbd93d468530', '2026-09-22T10:45:51.570Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:51.570Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 6, 16, 'Jodasy zanak’i Jakoba, ary Jodasy Iskariota, ilay lasa mpamadika.', 'jodasy zanak’i jakoba, ary jodasy iskariota, ilay lasa mpamadika.'),
  ('6ab25c5f1f5bdbd93d46852f', '2026-09-22T10:45:51.570Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:51.570Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 6, 15, 'Matio, Tomasy, Jakoba zanak’i Alfeo, Simona izay atao hoe “ilay mafana fo”,', 'matio, tomasy, jakoba zanak’i alfeo, simona izay atao hoe “ilay mafana fo”,'),
  ('6ab25c5f1f5bdbd93d468532', '2026-09-22T10:45:51.570Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:51.570Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 6, 18, 'Na ireo nampijalin’ny fanahy maloto aza sitrana.', 'na ireo nampijalin’ny fanahy maloto aza sitrana.'),
  ('6ab25c5f1f5bdbd93d46852b', '2026-09-22T10:45:51.570Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:51.570Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 6, 11, 'Romotry ny hatezerana anefa izy ireo, ka niara-nikaon-doha hoe ahoana no hatao amin’i Jesosy.', 'romotry ny hatezerana anefa izy ireo, ka niara-nikaon-doha hoe ahoana no hatao amin’i jesosy.'),
  ('6ab25c5f1f5bdbd93d46852a', '2026-09-22T10:45:51.570Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:51.570Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 6, 10, 'Rehefa avy nijery an’ireo rehetra nanodidina azy teo izy, dia niteny tamin’ilay lehilahy hoe: “Atsory ny tananao.” Dia nataony izany ka sitrana ny tanany.', 'rehefa avy nijery an’ireo rehetra nanodidina azy teo izy, dia niteny tamin’ilay lehilahy hoe: “atsory ny tananao.” dia nataony izany ka sitrana ny tanany.'),
  ('6ab25c5f1f5bdbd93d468539', '2026-09-22T10:45:51.570Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:51.570Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 6, 25, '“Hahita loza ianareo izay voky ankehitriny, fa mbola ho noana ianareo. “Hahita loza ianareo izay mihomehy ankehitriny, fa halahelo sy hitomany ianareo.', '“hahita loza ianareo izay voky ankehitriny, fa mbola ho noana ianareo. “hahita loza ianareo izay mihomehy ankehitriny, fa halahelo sy hitomany ianareo.'),
  ('6ab25c5f1f5bdbd93d468534', '2026-09-22T10:45:51.570Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:51.570Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 6, 20, 'Dia nitraka nijery an’ireo mpianany izy, ka niteny hoe: “Sambatra ianareo mahantra, fa anareo ny Fanjakan’Andriamanitra.', 'dia nitraka nijery an’ireo mpianany izy, ka niteny hoe: “sambatra ianareo mahantra, fa anareo ny fanjakan’andriamanitra.'),
  ('6ab25c602dc834787fe890a4', '2026-09-22T10:45:52.807Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:52.807Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 7, 36, 'Ary nanasa azy foana hiara-misakafo aminy ny Fariseo iray. Koa niditra tao an-tranon’ilay Fariseo izy ary naka toerana teo amin’ny latabatra.', 'ary nanasa azy foana hiara-misakafo aminy ny fariseo iray. koa niditra tao an-tranon’ilay fariseo izy ary naka toerana teo amin’ny latabatra.'),
  ('6ab25c602dc834787fe89089', '2026-09-22T10:45:52.807Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:52.807Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 7, 9, 'Gaga i Jesosy rehefa naheno an’izany, ka nitodika tany amin’ny vahoaka nanaraka azy, ary niteny hoe: “Lazaiko aminareo fa mbola tsy nahita finoana lehibe hoatr’izany aho, na teo amin’ny Israely aza.”', 'gaga i jesosy rehefa naheno an’izany, ka nitodika tany amin’ny vahoaka nanaraka azy, ary niteny hoe: “lazaiko aminareo fa mbola tsy nahita finoana lehibe hoatr’izany aho, na teo amin’ny israely aza.”'),
  ('6ab25c602dc834787fe890ae', '2026-09-22T10:45:52.807Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:52.807Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 7, 46, 'Ianao tsy nandraraka menaka tamin’ny lohako, nefa io vehivavy io nandraraka menaka manitra tamin’ny tongotro.', 'ianao tsy nandraraka menaka tamin’ny lohako, nefa io vehivavy io nandraraka menaka manitra tamin’ny tongotro.'),
  ('6ab25c602dc834787fe890ac', '2026-09-22T10:45:52.807Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:52.807Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 7, 44, 'Dia nitodika tany amin’ilay vehivavy izy, sady niteny tamin’i Simona hoe: “Hitanao io vehivavy io? Niditra tato an-tranonao aho, nefa ianao tsy nanome rano ahy hanasana ny tongotro. Fa io vehivavy io kosa nahakotsa ny tongotro tamin’ny ranomasony, ary nanamaina an’izany tamin’ny volon-dohany.', 'dia nitodika tany amin’ilay vehivavy izy, sady niteny tamin’i simona hoe: “hitanao io vehivavy io? niditra tato an-tranonao aho, nefa ianao tsy nanome rano ahy hanasana ny tongotro. fa io vehivavy io kosa nahakotsa ny tongotro tamin’ny ranomasony, ary nanamaina an’izany tamin’ny volon-dohany.'),
  ('6ab25c602dc834787fe89091', '2026-09-22T10:45:52.807Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:52.807Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 7, 17, 'Dia niely eran’i Jodia sy ny faritra rehetra manodidina izany vaovao momba azy izany.', 'dia niely eran’i jodia sy ny faritra rehetra manodidina izany vaovao momba azy izany.'),
  ('6ab25c602dc834787fe890b2', '2026-09-22T10:45:52.807Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:52.807Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 7, 50, 'Hoy anefa izy tamin’ilay vehivavy: “Ny finoanao no namonjy anao. Mirary soa ho anao aho.”', 'hoy anefa izy tamin’ilay vehivavy: “ny finoanao no namonjy anao. mirary soa ho anao aho.”'),
  ('6ab25c602dc834787fe8909c', '2026-09-22T10:45:52.807Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:52.807Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 7, 28, 'Lazaiko aminareo fa amin’izay nateraky ny vehivavy, dia mbola tsy misy lehibe noho i Jaona. Mbola lehibe noho izy anefa izay kely indrindra ao amin’ny Fanjakan’Andriamanitra.”', 'lazaiko aminareo fa amin’izay nateraky ny vehivavy, dia mbola tsy misy lehibe noho i jaona. mbola lehibe noho izy anefa izay kely indrindra ao amin’ny fanjakan’andriamanitra.”'),
  ('6ab25c602dc834787fe89099', '2026-09-22T10:45:52.807Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:52.807Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 7, 25, 'Sa nivoaka hijery inona ianareo? Olona manao akanjo vita amin’ny ravin-damba malefaka ve? Any an-tranon’ny mpanjaka no misy manao akanjo tsara be sy manana an’izay rehetra mahafinaritra azy!', 'sa nivoaka hijery inona ianareo? olona manao akanjo vita amin’ny ravin-damba malefaka ve? any an-tranon’ny mpanjaka no misy manao akanjo tsara be sy manana an’izay rehetra mahafinaritra azy!'),
  ('6ab25c602dc834787fe89096', '2026-09-22T10:45:52.807Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:52.807Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 7, 22, 'Dia namaly azy roa lahy izy hoe: “Mandehana tantarao amin’i Jaona izao hitanareo sy henonareo izao: Lasa mahita ny jamba, mandeha ny malemy, voadio ny boka, mandre ny marenina, atsangana ny maty, ary itoriana ny vaovao tsara ny mahantra.', 'dia namaly azy roa lahy izy hoe: “mandehana tantarao amin’i jaona izao hitanareo sy henonareo izao: lasa mahita ny jamba, mandeha ny malemy, voadio ny boka, mandre ny marenina, atsangana ny maty, ary itoriana ny vaovao tsara ny mahantra.'),
  ('6ab25c602dc834787fe89086', '2026-09-22T10:45:52.807Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:52.807Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 7, 6, 'Nandeha niaraka tamin’izy ireo àry i Jesosy. Rehefa tsy lavitra an’ilay trano anefa izy, dia efa nisy naman’ilay manamboninahitra nirahiny hilaza taminy hoe: “Aza misahirana mankatỳ amiko, tompoko, fa tsy mendrika ny handray anao ao an-tranoko aho.', 'nandeha niaraka tamin’izy ireo àry i jesosy. rehefa tsy lavitra an’ilay trano anefa izy, dia efa nisy naman’ilay manamboninahitra nirahiny hilaza taminy hoe: “aza misahirana mankatỳ amiko, tompoko, fa tsy mendrika ny handray anao ao an-tranoko aho.'),
  ('6ab25c602dc834787fe890a3', '2026-09-22T10:45:52.807Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:52.807Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 7, 35, 'Izay vokatry ny ataon’ny olona anefa no ahitana raha hendry izy na tsia.”', 'izay vokatry ny ataon’ny olona anefa no ahitana raha hendry izy na tsia.”'),
  ('6ab25c602dc834787fe890a0', '2026-09-22T10:45:52.807Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:52.807Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 7, 32, 'Hoatran’ny ankizy mipetraka eny an-tsena, dia mifampiresaka hoe: ‘Efa nitsoka sodina izahay, nefa ianareo tsy mba nandihy. Efa nanao hira fisaonana izahay, nefa ianareo tsy mba nitomany.’', 'hoatran’ny ankizy mipetraka eny an-tsena, dia mifampiresaka hoe: ‘efa nitsoka sodina izahay, nefa ianareo tsy mba nandihy. efa nanao hira fisaonana izahay, nefa ianareo tsy mba nitomany.’'),
  ('6ab25c602dc834787fe89083', '2026-09-22T10:45:52.807Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:52.807Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 7, 3, 'Koa rehefa nandre ny momba an’i Jesosy ilay manamboninahitra, dia nisy anti-panahin’ny Jiosy nirahiny ho any amin’i Jesosy, mba hangataka azy ho avy ka hanasitrana an’ilay mpanompo.', 'koa rehefa nandre ny momba an’i jesosy ilay manamboninahitra, dia nisy anti-panahin’ny jiosy nirahiny ho any amin’i jesosy, mba hangataka azy ho avy ka hanasitrana an’ilay mpanompo.'),
  ('6ab25c602dc834787fe89093', '2026-09-22T10:45:52.807Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:52.807Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 7, 19, 'Koa niantso anankiroa tamin’ny mpianany i Jaona, dia naniraka azy tany amin’ny Tompo mba hanontany hoe: “Ianao ve Ilay ho avy, sa olon-kafa no tokony handrasanay?”', 'koa niantso anankiroa tamin’ny mpianany i jaona, dia naniraka azy tany amin’ny tompo mba hanontany hoe: “ianao ve ilay ho avy, sa olon-kafa no tokony handrasanay?”'),
  ('6ab25c602dc834787fe89088', '2026-09-22T10:45:52.807Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:52.807Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 7, 8, 'Izaho koa mantsy eo ambany fahefan’olona, sady manana miaramila eo ambany fahefako. Dia raha miteny amin’ny miaramila anankiray aho hoe: ‘Mandehana!’, dia lasa izy, ary amin’ny anankiray kosa hoe: ‘Avia!’, dia tonga izy, ary amin’ny mpanompoko hoe: ‘Ataovy ity!’ dia ataony izany.”', 'izaho koa mantsy eo ambany fahefan’olona, sady manana miaramila eo ambany fahefako. dia raha miteny amin’ny miaramila anankiray aho hoe: ‘mandehana!’, dia lasa izy, ary amin’ny anankiray kosa hoe: ‘avia!’, dia tonga izy, ary amin’ny mpanompoko hoe: ‘ataovy ity!’ dia ataony izany.”'),
  ('6ab25c602dc834787fe890a2', '2026-09-22T10:45:52.807Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:52.807Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 7, 34, 'Tonga kosa ny Zanak’olona, mihinana sy misotro, nefa mbola milaza ihany ianareo hoe: ‘Jereo! Olona tendan-kanina sy mpiboboka divay io, sady naman’ny mpamory hetra sy ny mpanota!’', 'tonga kosa ny zanak’olona, mihinana sy misotro, nefa mbola milaza ihany ianareo hoe: ‘jereo! olona tendan-kanina sy mpiboboka divay io, sady naman’ny mpamory hetra sy ny mpanota!’'),
  ('6ab25c602dc834787fe8909f', '2026-09-22T10:45:52.807Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:52.807Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 7, 31, '“Hohariko amin’iza àry ny olona amin’ity taranaka ity? Ary hoatran’iza izy ireo?', '“hohariko amin’iza àry ny olona amin’ity taranaka ity? ary hoatran’iza izy ireo?'),
  ('6ab25c602dc834787fe8909b', '2026-09-22T10:45:52.807Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:52.807Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 7, 27, 'Fa izao no voasoratra momba azy: ‘Halefako mialoha anao ilay olona irahiko, izay hanomana ny lalana halehanao.’', 'fa izao no voasoratra momba azy: ‘halefako mialoha anao ilay olona irahiko, izay hanomana ny lalana halehanao.’'),
  ('6ab25c602dc834787fe89094', '2026-09-22T10:45:52.807Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:52.807Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 7, 20, 'Rehefa tonga tany aminy izy ireo, dia niteny hoe: “Nirahin’i Jaona Mpanao Batisa izahay hanontany anao hoe: ‘Ianao ve Ilay ho avy, sa olon-kafa no tokony handrasanay?’”', 'rehefa tonga tany aminy izy ireo, dia niteny hoe: “nirahin’i jaona mpanao batisa izahay hanontany anao hoe: ‘ianao ve ilay ho avy, sa olon-kafa no tokony handrasanay?’”'),
  ('6ab25c602dc834787fe8908d', '2026-09-22T10:45:52.807Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:52.807Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 7, 13, 'Raha vao nahita azy ny Tompo, dia nangoraka azy ka niteny taminy hoe: “Aza mitomany intsony.”', 'raha vao nahita azy ny tompo, dia nangoraka azy ka niteny taminy hoe: “aza mitomany intsony.”'),
  ('6ab25c602dc834787fe890ad', '2026-09-22T10:45:52.807Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:52.807Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 7, 45, 'Ianao tsy nanoroka ahy, nefa io vehivavy io tsy nitsahatra nanoroka ny tongotro hatramin’ny nidirako tato.', 'ianao tsy nanoroka ahy, nefa io vehivavy io tsy nitsahatra nanoroka ny tongotro hatramin’ny nidirako tato.'),
  ('6ab25c602dc834787fe8909a', '2026-09-22T10:45:52.807Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:52.807Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 7, 26, 'Inona marina àry no nivoahanareo e? Hijery mpaminany ve? Tsoriko aminareo fa lehibe lavitra noho ny mpaminany izy.', 'inona marina àry no nivoahanareo e? hijery mpaminany ve? tsoriko aminareo fa lehibe lavitra noho ny mpaminany izy.'),
  ('6ab25c602dc834787fe89098', '2026-09-22T10:45:52.807Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:52.807Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 7, 24, 'Rehefa lasa ireo olona nirahin’i Jaona, dia niresaka momba an’i Jaona tamin’ny vahoaka i Jesosy. Hoy izy: “Nivoaka hijery inona tany an-tany efitra ianareo? Bararata ahetsiketsiky ny rivotra ve?', 'rehefa lasa ireo olona nirahin’i jaona, dia niresaka momba an’i jaona tamin’ny vahoaka i jesosy. hoy izy: “nivoaka hijery inona tany an-tany efitra ianareo? bararata ahetsiketsiky ny rivotra ve?'),
  ('6ab25c602dc834787fe89092', '2026-09-22T10:45:52.807Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:52.807Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 7, 18, 'Nitantara an’izany rehetra izany tamin’i Jaona ny mpianany.', 'nitantara an’izany rehetra izany tamin’i jaona ny mpianany.'),
  ('6ab25c602dc834787fe89085', '2026-09-22T10:45:52.807Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:52.807Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 7, 5, 'satria tiany ny firenentsika sady nanorina synagoga teto aminay izy.”', 'satria tiany ny firenentsika sady nanorina synagoga teto aminay izy.”'),
  ('6ab25c602dc834787fe890a9', '2026-09-22T10:45:52.807Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:52.807Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 7, 41, '“Nisy roa lahy nananan’olona trosa. Ny an’ny anankiray 500 denaria, fa ny an’ny anankiray kosa 50.', '“nisy roa lahy nananan’olona trosa. ny an’ny anankiray 500 denaria, fa ny an’ny anankiray kosa 50.'),
  ('6ab25c602dc834787fe890a8', '2026-09-22T10:45:52.807Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:52.807Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 7, 40, 'Izao anefa no navalin’i Jesosy azy: “Ry Simona, misy zavatra tiako holazaina aminao.” Dia hoy izy: “Lazao àry, Mpampianatra ô!”', 'izao anefa no navalin’i jesosy azy: “ry simona, misy zavatra tiako holazaina aminao.” dia hoy izy: “lazao àry, mpampianatra ô!”'),
  ('6ab25c602dc834787fe890a6', '2026-09-22T10:45:52.807Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:52.807Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 7, 38, 'Nankao aorianan’i Jesosy teo an-tongony izy ary nitomany, dia kotsan’ny ranomasony ny tongotr’i Jesosy, ka nohamaininy tamin’ny volon-dohany. Norohany koa ny tongotr’i Jesosy sady nandrarahany menaka manitra.', 'nankao aorianan’i jesosy teo an-tongony izy ary nitomany, dia kotsan’ny ranomasony ny tongotr’i jesosy, ka nohamaininy tamin’ny volon-dohany. norohany koa ny tongotr’i jesosy sady nandrarahany menaka manitra.'),
  ('6ab25c602dc834787fe8909d', '2026-09-22T10:45:52.807Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:52.807Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 7, 29, '—Rehefa naheno an’izany ny olona rehetra sy ny mpamory hetra, dia niaiky fa manao ny rariny Andriamanitra. Ny batisan’i Jaona mantsy no nanaovana batisa azy ireo.', '—rehefa naheno an’izany ny olona rehetra sy ny mpamory hetra, dia niaiky fa manao ny rariny andriamanitra. ny batisan’i jaona mantsy no nanaovana batisa azy ireo.'),
  ('6ab25c602dc834787fe89090', '2026-09-22T10:45:52.807Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:52.807Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 7, 16, 'Ary raiki-tahotra ny rehetra, dia nanome voninahitra an’Andriamanitra ka nilaza hoe: “Mpaminany lehibe no efa tonga eto amintsika”, sy hoe: “Nitsinjo ny vahoakany Andriamanitra.”', 'ary raiki-tahotra ny rehetra, dia nanome voninahitra an’andriamanitra ka nilaza hoe: “mpaminany lehibe no efa tonga eto amintsika”, sy hoe: “nitsinjo ny vahoakany andriamanitra.”'),
  ('6ab25c602dc834787fe890b1', '2026-09-22T10:45:52.807Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:52.807Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 7, 49, 'Ary nifampiresaka ireo nisakafo niaraka taminy teo amin’ny latabatra hoe: “Fa mba iza àry io no mamela heloka?”', 'ary nifampiresaka ireo nisakafo niaraka taminy teo amin’ny latabatra hoe: “fa mba iza àry io no mamela heloka?”'),
  ('6ab25c602dc834787fe890b0', '2026-09-22T10:45:52.807Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:52.807Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 7, 48, 'Dia hoy izy tamin’ilay vehivavy: “Voavela ny helokao.”', 'dia hoy izy tamin’ilay vehivavy: “voavela ny helokao.”'),
  ('6ab25c602dc834787fe890ab', '2026-09-22T10:45:52.807Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:52.807Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 7, 43, 'Namaly i Simona hoe: “Raha ny fahitako azy, dia ilay nananany trosa betsaka kokoa.” Dia hoy izy: “Marina ny anao.”', 'namaly i simona hoe: “raha ny fahitako azy, dia ilay nananany trosa betsaka kokoa.” dia hoy izy: “marina ny anao.”'),
  ('6ab25c602dc834787fe89087', '2026-09-22T10:45:52.807Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:52.807Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 7, 7, 'Na izaho aza tsy mieritreritra hoe mendrika hankeny aminao. Fa mitenena fotsiny, dia ho sitrana ny mpanompoko.', 'na izaho aza tsy mieritreritra hoe mendrika hankeny aminao. fa mitenena fotsiny, dia ho sitrana ny mpanompoko.'),
  ('6ab25c602dc834787fe89084', '2026-09-22T10:45:52.807Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:52.807Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 7, 4, 'Dia tonga tany amin’i Jesosy izy ireo ary niangavy mafy azy hoe: “Mendrika ny hanaovanao an’izany izy,', 'dia tonga tany amin’i jesosy izy ireo ary niangavy mafy azy hoe: “mendrika ny hanaovanao an’izany izy,'),
  ('6ab25c602dc834787fe890a1', '2026-09-22T10:45:52.807Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:52.807Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 7, 33, 'Hoatr’izany koa fa tonga i Jaona Mpanao Batisa, tsy nihinana mofo na nisotro divay, nefa nilaza ianareo hoe: ‘Misy demonia izy.’', 'hoatr’izany koa fa tonga i jaona mpanao batisa, tsy nihinana mofo na nisotro divay, nefa nilaza ianareo hoe: ‘misy demonia izy.’'),
  ('6ab25c602dc834787fe89097', '2026-09-22T10:45:52.807Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:52.807Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 7, 23, 'Sambatra izay tsy tafintohina noho ny amiko.”', 'sambatra izay tsy tafintohina noho ny amiko.”'),
  ('6ab25c602dc834787fe89095', '2026-09-22T10:45:52.807Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:52.807Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 7, 21, 'Tamin’izay fotoana izay i Jesosy dia nanasitrana olona maro tsy salama sy narary mafy ary nisy fanahy ratsy. Nampahiratra jamba be dia be koa izy.', 'tamin’izay fotoana izay i jesosy dia nanasitrana olona maro tsy salama sy narary mafy ary nisy fanahy ratsy. nampahiratra jamba be dia be koa izy.'),
  ('6ab25c602dc834787fe8908f', '2026-09-22T10:45:52.807Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:52.807Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 7, 15, 'Dia niarina ny maty ary nanomboka niteny, ka natolotr’i Jesosy an-dreniny.', 'dia niarina ny maty ary nanomboka niteny, ka natolotr’i jesosy an-dreniny.'),
  ('6ab25c602dc834787fe890aa', '2026-09-22T10:45:52.807Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:52.807Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 7, 42, 'Rehefa tsy nanana handoavana an’ilay trosa izy roa lahy, dia namela tanteraka ny trosan’izy ireo ilay olona. Iza amin’izy roa lahy àry no ho tia azy bebe kokoa?”', 'rehefa tsy nanana handoavana an’ilay trosa izy roa lahy, dia namela tanteraka ny trosan’izy ireo ilay olona. iza amin’izy roa lahy àry no ho tia azy bebe kokoa?”'),
  ('6ab25c602dc834787fe890a5', '2026-09-22T10:45:52.807Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:52.807Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 7, 37, 'Ary fantatry ny vehivavy iray nalaza ho mpanota tao amin’ilay tanàna fa nisakafo tao an-tranon’ilay Fariseo i Jesosy. Dia nitondra tavoahangy vatosanga nisy menaka manitra izy.', 'ary fantatry ny vehivavy iray nalaza ho mpanota tao amin’ilay tanàna fa nisakafo tao an-tranon’ilay fariseo i jesosy. dia nitondra tavoahangy vatosanga nisy menaka manitra izy.'),
  ('6ab25c602dc834787fe8908a', '2026-09-22T10:45:52.807Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:52.807Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 7, 10, 'Rehefa niverina tany an-tranon’ilay manamboninahitra ireo olona nirahiny ireo, dia nahita fa efa salama tsara ilay mpanompo.', 'rehefa niverina tany an-tranon’ilay manamboninahitra ireo olona nirahiny ireo, dia nahita fa efa salama tsara ilay mpanompo.'),
  ('6ab25c602dc834787fe8909e', '2026-09-22T10:45:52.807Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:52.807Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 7, 30, 'Fa ny Fariseo sy ireo nahay Lalàna kosa tsy niraharaha ny sitrapon’Andriamanitra momba azy ireo, satria tsy nanaiky hataon’i Jaona batisa.—', 'fa ny fariseo sy ireo nahay lalàna kosa tsy niraharaha ny sitrapon’andriamanitra momba azy ireo, satria tsy nanaiky hataon’i jaona batisa.—'),
  ('6ab25c602dc834787fe89082', '2026-09-22T10:45:52.807Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:52.807Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 7, 2, 'Ary nisy manamboninahitra iray nanana mpanompo tena tiany, nefa narary mafy efa ho faty ilay mpanompo.', 'ary nisy manamboninahitra iray nanana mpanompo tena tiany, nefa narary mafy efa ho faty ilay mpanompo.'),
  ('6ab25c602dc834787fe89081', '2026-09-22T10:45:52.807Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:52.807Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 7, 1, 'Niditra tao Kapernaomy i Jesosy, rehefa tapitra izay tokony holazainy tamin’ny vahoaka.', 'niditra tao kapernaomy i jesosy, rehefa tapitra izay tokony holazainy tamin’ny vahoaka.'),
  ('6ab25c602dc834787fe8908e', '2026-09-22T10:45:52.807Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:52.807Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 7, 14, 'Dia nanatona izy ary nikasika an’ilay filanjana faty, ka nijanona ny mpilanja. Hoy izy avy eo: “Ry tovolahy, izao no lazaiko aminao: Miarena!”', 'dia nanatona izy ary nikasika an’ilay filanjana faty, ka nijanona ny mpilanja. hoy izy avy eo: “ry tovolahy, izao no lazaiko aminao: miarena!”'),
  ('6ab25c602dc834787fe890af', '2026-09-22T10:45:52.807Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:52.807Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 7, 47, 'Noho izany, dia lazaiko aminao fa voavela ny helony, na dia betsaka aza, satria be fitiavana izy. Fa izay voavela tamin’ny kely, dia kely fitiavana.”', 'noho izany, dia lazaiko aminao fa voavela ny helony, na dia betsaka aza, satria be fitiavana izy. fa izay voavela tamin’ny kely, dia kely fitiavana.”'),
  ('6ab25c602dc834787fe890a7', '2026-09-22T10:45:52.807Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:52.807Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 7, 39, 'Rehefa nahita an’izany ilay Fariseo nanasa azy, dia nieritreritra hoe: “Raha tena mpaminany ity lehilahy ity, dia ho nahalala hoe iza io mikasika azy io, ary vehivavy hoatran’ny ahoana io. Tokony ho fantany hoe mpanota io.”', 'rehefa nahita an’izany ilay fariseo nanasa azy, dia nieritreritra hoe: “raha tena mpaminany ity lehilahy ity, dia ho nahalala hoe iza io mikasika azy io, ary vehivavy hoatran’ny ahoana io. tokony ho fantany hoe mpanota io.”'),
  ('6ab25c602dc834787fe8908c', '2026-09-22T10:45:52.807Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:52.807Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 7, 12, 'Rehefa nanakaiky ny vavahadin’ny tanàna izy, dia iny fa nisy faty nentina nivoaka. Zanaka lahitokan-dreniny izy io, sady ilay reniny rahateo efa maty vady. Ary nisy vahoaka be avy tao an-tanàna niaraka tamin’ilay vehivavy.', 'rehefa nanakaiky ny vavahadin’ny tanàna izy, dia iny fa nisy faty nentina nivoaka. zanaka lahitokan-dreniny izy io, sady ilay reniny rahateo efa maty vady. ary nisy vahoaka be avy tao an-tanàna niaraka tamin’ilay vehivavy.'),
  ('6ab25c602dc834787fe8908b', '2026-09-22T10:45:52.807Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:52.807Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 7, 11, 'Taoriana kelin’izay, dia nankany amin’ny tanàna atao hoe Naina i Jesosy, ary nisy vahoaka be niara-dia taminy, ankoatra ny mpianany.', 'taoriana kelin’izay, dia nankany amin’ny tanàna atao hoe naina i jesosy, ary nisy vahoaka be niara-dia taminy, ankoatra ny mpianany.'),
  ('6ab25c615e55d2008a98f882', '2026-09-22T10:45:53.934Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:53.934Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 8, 12, 'Ireo teny amoron-dalana dia izay mandre an’izany, saingy tonga ny Devoly manala an’ilay teny ao am-pony, sao hino izy ka ho voavonjy.', 'ireo teny amoron-dalana dia izay mandre an’izany, saingy tonga ny devoly manala an’ilay teny ao am-pony, sao hino izy ka ho voavonjy.'),
  ('6ab25c615e55d2008a98f87d', '2026-09-22T10:45:53.934Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:53.934Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 8, 7, 'Ny voa sasany indray latsaka teny amin’ny tsilo, ary niara-naniry taminy ny tsilo ka nandrakotra an’ireny.', 'ny voa sasany indray latsaka teny amin’ny tsilo, ary niara-naniry taminy ny tsilo ka nandrakotra an’ireny.'),
  ('6ab25c615e55d2008a98f87f', '2026-09-22T10:45:53.934Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:53.934Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 8, 9, 'Ary nanontany azy momba ny hevitr’ilay fanoharana ny mpianany.', 'ary nanontany azy momba ny hevitr’ilay fanoharana ny mpianany.'),
  ('6ab25c615e55d2008a98f880', '2026-09-22T10:45:53.934Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:53.934Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 8, 10, 'Dia hoy i Jesosy: “Ianareo no navela hahazo ny dikan’ny zava-miafina masina momba ny Fanjakan’Andriamanitra. Fa fanoharana kosa no atao amin’ny olon-kafa, mba hijery izy fa tsy hahita, ary haheno fa tsy hahazo ny dikan’ny zavatra henony.', 'dia hoy i jesosy: “ianareo no navela hahazo ny dikan’ny zava-miafina masina momba ny fanjakan’andriamanitra. fa fanoharana kosa no atao amin’ny olon-kafa, mba hijery izy fa tsy hahita, ary haheno fa tsy hahazo ny dikan’ny zavatra henony.'),
  ('6ab25c615e55d2008a98f87c', '2026-09-22T10:45:53.934Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:53.934Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 8, 6, 'Ny sasany latsaka teny ambony vatolampy ary nitsimoka, saingy nalazo avy eo satria tsy nisy mandomando.', 'ny sasany latsaka teny ambony vatolampy ary nitsimoka, saingy nalazo avy eo satria tsy nisy mandomando.'),
  ('6ab25c615e55d2008a98f877', '2026-09-22T10:45:53.934Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:53.934Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 8, 1, 'Taoriana kelin’izay, dia lasa nitety tanàna sy vohitra i Jesosy, nitory sy nanambara ny vaovao tsaran’ny Fanjakan’Andriamanitra. Ary niaraka taminy izy 12 Lahy,', 'taoriana kelin’izay, dia lasa nitety tanàna sy vohitra i jesosy, nitory sy nanambara ny vaovao tsaran’ny fanjakan’andriamanitra. ary niaraka taminy izy 12 lahy,'),
  ('6ab25c615e55d2008a98f881', '2026-09-22T10:45:53.934Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:53.934Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 8, 11, 'Izao no hevitr’iny fanoharana iny: Ny voa dia ny tenin’Andriamanitra.', 'izao no hevitr’iny fanoharana iny: ny voa dia ny tenin’andriamanitra.'),
  ('6ab25c615e55d2008a98f87a', '2026-09-22T10:45:53.934Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:53.934Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 8, 4, 'Rehefa nisy vahoaka be tafavory teo, niaraka tamin’ny olona nanatona azy avy tany amin’ny tanàna samihafa, dia nilaza an’izao fanoharana izao izy:', 'rehefa nisy vahoaka be tafavory teo, niaraka tamin’ny olona nanatona azy avy tany amin’ny tanàna samihafa, dia nilaza an’izao fanoharana izao izy:'),
  ('6ab25c615e55d2008a98f87e', '2026-09-22T10:45:53.934Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:53.934Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 8, 8, 'Ny voa hafa kosa latsaka teny amin’ny tany tsara, ary nitsimoka ka namokatra avo 100 heny.” Rehefa avy niteny an’izany izy, dia niteny mafy hoe: “Izay manan-tsofina hihainoana, aoka izy hihaino.”', 'ny voa hafa kosa latsaka teny amin’ny tany tsara, ary nitsimoka ka namokatra avo 100 heny.” rehefa avy niteny an’izany izy, dia niteny mafy hoe: “izay manan-tsofina hihainoana, aoka izy hihaino.”'),
  ('6ab25c615e55d2008a98f878', '2026-09-22T10:45:53.934Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:53.934Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 8, 2, 'sy ny vehivavy sasany efa nivoahan’ny fanahy ratsy sy efa nositranina tamin’ny aretiny, dia i Maria, ilay antsoina hoe Magdalena, izay efa nivoahan’ny demonia fito;', 'sy ny vehivavy sasany efa nivoahan’ny fanahy ratsy sy efa nositranina tamin’ny aretiny, dia i maria, ilay antsoina hoe magdalena, izay efa nivoahan’ny demonia fito;'),
  ('6ab25c615e55d2008a98f87b', '2026-09-22T10:45:53.934Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:53.934Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 8, 5, '“Nisy mpamafy nivoaka mba hamafy ny voany. Tamin’izy namafy, dia latsaka teny amoron-dalana ny voa sasany, ka voahitsakitsaka ary lanin’ny voro-manidina.', '“nisy mpamafy nivoaka mba hamafy ny voany. tamin’izy namafy, dia latsaka teny amoron-dalana ny voa sasany, ka voahitsakitsaka ary lanin’ny voro-manidina.'),
  ('6ab25c615e55d2008a98f879', '2026-09-22T10:45:53.934Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:53.934Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 8, 3, 'Johana vadin’i Koza, mpiandraikitra ny tao an-tranon’i Heroda; Sosana; ary vehivavy maro hafa, izay samy nampiasa ny fananany hikarakarana an’i Jesosy sy ny mpianany.', 'johana vadin’i koza, mpiandraikitra ny tao an-tranon’i heroda; sosana; ary vehivavy maro hafa, izay samy nampiasa ny fananany hikarakarana an’i jesosy sy ny mpianany.'),
  ('6ab25c615e55d2008a98f8a2', '2026-09-22T10:45:53.935Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:53.935Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 8, 44, 'Nanatona an’i Jesosy avy tao aoriana izy, ka nikasika ny mikiramborambo amin’ny morontongotry ny akanjony ivelany, dia nijanona avy hatrany ilay ra.', 'nanatona an’i jesosy avy tao aoriana izy, ka nikasika ny mikiramborambo amin’ny morontongotry ny akanjony ivelany, dia nijanona avy hatrany ilay ra.'),
  ('6ab25c615e55d2008a98f884', '2026-09-22T10:45:53.935Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:53.935Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 8, 14, 'Ary ireo latsaka teny amin’ny tsilo, dia izay mandre ny teny saingy lasa varimbariana noho ny fanahiana sy ny harena ary ny fahafinaretana eo amin’ny fiainana. Lasa tototra tanteraka àry ny teny, ka tsy mamoa voa tsara.', 'ary ireo latsaka teny amin’ny tsilo, dia izay mandre ny teny saingy lasa varimbariana noho ny fanahiana sy ny harena ary ny fahafinaretana eo amin’ny fiainana. lasa tototra tanteraka àry ny teny, ka tsy mamoa voa tsara.'),
  ('6ab25c615e55d2008a98f899', '2026-09-22T10:45:53.935Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:53.935Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 8, 35, 'Dia nivoaka ny olona mba hijery an’izay nitranga. Tonga teo amin’i Jesosy izy ireo ary nahita an’ilay lehilahy nivoahan’ny demonia. Efa niakanjo sady efa salama saina ilay lehilahy, ary nipetraka teo an-tongotr’i Jesosy. Koa natahotra ny olona.', 'dia nivoaka ny olona mba hijery an’izay nitranga. tonga teo amin’i jesosy izy ireo ary nahita an’ilay lehilahy nivoahan’ny demonia. efa niakanjo sady efa salama saina ilay lehilahy, ary nipetraka teo an-tongotr’i jesosy. koa natahotra ny olona.'),
  ('6ab25c615e55d2008a98f893', '2026-09-22T10:45:53.935Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:53.935Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 8, 29, '—Nandidy an’ilay fanahy maloto mantsy i Jesosy mba hivoaka tamin’ilay lehilahy. Efa nidiran’izy io imbetsaka ilay lehilahy, ary nofatorana matetika tamin’ny rojo vy sy gadra vy izy dia nambenana. Notapahiny anefa izay namatorana azy ary nentin’ilay demonia tany amin’ny toerana nitokana izy.—', '—nandidy an’ilay fanahy maloto mantsy i jesosy mba hivoaka tamin’ilay lehilahy. efa nidiran’izy io imbetsaka ilay lehilahy, ary nofatorana matetika tamin’ny rojo vy sy gadra vy izy dia nambenana. notapahiny anefa izay namatorana azy ary nentin’ilay demonia tany amin’ny toerana nitokana izy.—'),
  ('6ab25c615e55d2008a98f88f', '2026-09-22T10:45:53.935Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:53.935Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 8, 25, 'Ary hoy izy tamin’izy ireo: “Fa maninona ianareo no kely finoana?” Natahotra be anefa izy ireo sady gaga, ka nifampiresaka hoe: “Iza marina àry izy ity e? Fa na ny rivotra sy ny rano aza baikoiny, dia mankatò azy.”', 'ary hoy izy tamin’izy ireo: “fa maninona ianareo no kely finoana?” natahotra be anefa izy ireo sady gaga, ka nifampiresaka hoe: “iza marina àry izy ity e? fa na ny rivotra sy ny rano aza baikoiny, dia mankatò azy.”'),
  ('6ab25c615e55d2008a98f8a0', '2026-09-22T10:45:53.935Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:53.935Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 8, 42, 'Efa ho faty mantsy ny zanany vavitokana, izay 12 taona teo ho eo. Koa nandeha i Jesosy, ary nifanesika teo aminy ny vahoaka.', 'efa ho faty mantsy ny zanany vavitokana, izay 12 taona teo ho eo. koa nandeha i jesosy, ary nifanesika teo aminy ny vahoaka.'),
  ('6ab25c615e55d2008a98f89b', '2026-09-22T10:45:53.935Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:53.935Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 8, 37, 'Olona be dia be avy ao amin’ilay faritra nisy ny Gerasianina àry no nangataka an’i Jesosy mba hiala teo, satria natahotra be mihitsy izy ireo. Koa nankao amin’ilay sambokely izy, dia niala teo.', 'olona be dia be avy ao amin’ilay faritra nisy ny gerasianina àry no nangataka an’i jesosy mba hiala teo, satria natahotra be mihitsy izy ireo. koa nankao amin’ilay sambokely izy, dia niala teo.'),
  ('6ab25c615e55d2008a98f891', '2026-09-22T10:45:53.935Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:53.935Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 8, 27, 'Rehefa niala nankeny an-tanety i Jesosy, dia nisy lehilahy anankiray avy tao an-tanàna nifanena taminy. Nisy demonia izy io ary efa ela no tsy niakanjo. Tsy nipetraka tamin’ny trano koa izy, fa teny am-pasana.', 'rehefa niala nankeny an-tanety i jesosy, dia nisy lehilahy anankiray avy tao an-tanàna nifanena taminy. nisy demonia izy io ary efa ela no tsy niakanjo. tsy nipetraka tamin’ny trano koa izy, fa teny am-pasana.'),
  ('6ab25c615e55d2008a98f8ac', '2026-09-22T10:45:53.935Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:53.935Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 8, 54, 'Nandray ny tanany anefa i Jesosy, ka niantso hoe: “Ry zazavavy, miarena!”', 'nandray ny tanany anefa i jesosy, ka niantso hoe: “ry zazavavy, miarena!”'),
  ('6ab25c615e55d2008a98f89f', '2026-09-22T10:45:53.935Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:53.935Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 8, 41, 'Nanatona anefa ny lehilahy atao hoe Jairo, izay mpitantana ny synagoga, ka niankohoka teo an-tongotr’i Jesosy, ary niangavy azy mba hankany an-tranony.', 'nanatona anefa ny lehilahy atao hoe jairo, izay mpitantana ny synagoga, ka niankohoka teo an-tongotr’i jesosy, ary niangavy azy mba hankany an-tranony.'),
  ('6ab25c615e55d2008a98f890', '2026-09-22T10:45:53.935Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:53.935Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 8, 26, 'Dia tonga tany amin’ny faritra nisy ny Gerasianina, tandrifin’i Galilia, izy ireo.', 'dia tonga tany amin’ny faritra nisy ny gerasianina, tandrifin’i galilia, izy ireo.'),
  ('6ab25c615e55d2008a98f8ad', '2026-09-22T10:45:53.935Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:53.935Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 8, 55, 'Dia nody indray ny ainy, ka niarina avy hatrany izy ary nasain’i Jesosy nomena sakafo.', 'dia nody indray ny ainy, ka niarina avy hatrany izy ary nasain’i jesosy nomena sakafo.'),
  ('6ab25c615e55d2008a98f8a6', '2026-09-22T10:45:53.935Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:53.935Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 8, 48, 'Hoy anefa i Jesosy taminy: “Ny finoanao no nahasitrana anao, anaka. Mirary soa ho anao aho!”', 'hoy anefa i jesosy taminy: “ny finoanao no nahasitrana anao, anaka. mirary soa ho anao aho!”'),
  ('6ab25c615e55d2008a98f89c', '2026-09-22T10:45:53.935Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:53.935Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 8, 38, 'Niangavingavy azy anefa ilay lehilahy nivoahan’ny demonia hoe hanaraka azy. Fa nasain’i Jesosy nandeha izy sady noteneniny hoe:', 'niangavingavy azy anefa ilay lehilahy nivoahan’ny demonia hoe hanaraka azy. fa nasain’i jesosy nandeha izy sady noteneniny hoe:'),
  ('6ab25c615e55d2008a98f88b', '2026-09-22T10:45:53.935Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:53.935Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 8, 21, 'Dia hoy izy tamin’izy ireo: “Ireto olona mihaino sy mankatò ny tenin’Andriamanitra ireto no reniko sy rahalahiko.”', 'dia hoy izy tamin’izy ireo: “ireto olona mihaino sy mankatò ny tenin’andriamanitra ireto no reniko sy rahalahiko.”'),
  ('6ab25c615e55d2008a98f886', '2026-09-22T10:45:53.935Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:53.935Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 8, 16, '“Tsy misy olona mandrehitra jiro ka manarona azy amin-javatra, na mametraka azy ao ambany fandriana, fa ataony eo amin’ny fitoeran-jiro kosa izany mba hahita hazavana ny olona miditra ao amin’ilay efitra.', '“tsy misy olona mandrehitra jiro ka manarona azy amin-javatra, na mametraka azy ao ambany fandriana, fa ataony eo amin’ny fitoeran-jiro kosa izany mba hahita hazavana ny olona miditra ao amin’ilay efitra.'),
  ('6ab25c615e55d2008a98f883', '2026-09-22T10:45:53.935Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:53.935Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 8, 13, 'Ireo teny ambony vatolampy dia izay mandre ny teny, ary faly erỳ manaiky an’izany, saingy tsy misy fakany ireny voa ireny. Koa mino vetivety fotsiny izy, dia miala rehefa tojo fitsapana.', 'ireo teny ambony vatolampy dia izay mandre ny teny, ary faly erỳ manaiky an’izany, saingy tsy misy fakany ireny voa ireny. koa mino vetivety fotsiny izy, dia miala rehefa tojo fitsapana.'),
  ('6ab25c615e55d2008a98f89a', '2026-09-22T10:45:53.935Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:53.935Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 8, 36, 'Ary izay nahita an’izany dia nitantara tamin’izy ireo ny fomba nanasitranana an’ilay lehilahy nisy demonia.', 'ary izay nahita an’izany dia nitantara tamin’izy ireo ny fomba nanasitranana an’ilay lehilahy nisy demonia.'),
  ('6ab25c615e55d2008a98f898', '2026-09-22T10:45:53.935Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:53.935Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 8, 34, 'Rehefa nahita an’izay nitranga ireo mpiandry kisoa, dia nandositra ka nitantara an’izany tao an-tanàna sy tany ambanivohitra.', 'rehefa nahita an’izay nitranga ireo mpiandry kisoa, dia nandositra ka nitantara an’izany tao an-tanàna sy tany ambanivohitra.'),
  ('6ab25c615e55d2008a98f8a3', '2026-09-22T10:45:53.935Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:53.935Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 8, 45, 'Hoy àry i Jesosy: “Iza no nikasika ahy teo?” Nanda anefa ny rehetra, dia hoy i Petera: “Mpampianatra ô, vahoaka be ange no manodidina anao sady mifanesika aminao e!”', 'hoy àry i jesosy: “iza no nikasika ahy teo?” nanda anefa ny rehetra, dia hoy i petera: “mpampianatra ô, vahoaka be ange no manodidina anao sady mifanesika aminao e!”'),
  ('6ab25c615e55d2008a98f89e', '2026-09-22T10:45:53.935Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:53.935Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 8, 40, 'Nandray tsara an’i Jesosy ny vahoaka rehefa tafaverina izy, satria efa niandry azy ny rehetra.', 'nandray tsara an’i jesosy ny vahoaka rehefa tafaverina izy, satria efa niandry azy ny rehetra.'),
  ('6ab25c615e55d2008a98f889', '2026-09-22T10:45:53.935Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:53.935Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 8, 19, 'Ary nankany amin’i Jesosy ny reniny sy ny rahalahiny, saingy tsy afaka nankeny akaikiny satria be loatra ny vahoaka.', 'ary nankany amin’i jesosy ny reniny sy ny rahalahiny, saingy tsy afaka nankeny akaikiny satria be loatra ny vahoaka.'),
  ('6ab25c615e55d2008a98f8a7', '2026-09-22T10:45:53.935Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:53.935Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 8, 49, 'Tamin’izy mbola niteny iny, dia nisy olona tonga avy tany an-tranon’ilay mpitantana ny synagoga nilaza hoe: “Maty ny zanakao, fa aza manahirana ny Mpampianatra intsony.”', 'tamin’izy mbola niteny iny, dia nisy olona tonga avy tany an-tranon’ilay mpitantana ny synagoga nilaza hoe: “maty ny zanakao, fa aza manahirana ny mpampianatra intsony.”'),
  ('6ab25c615e55d2008a98f89d', '2026-09-22T10:45:53.935Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:53.935Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 8, 39, '“Mandehana mody any an-tranonao, ary tantarao amin’ny olona izay nataon’Andriamanitra taminao.” Dia lasa izy nitory eran’ilay tanàna ny zavatra nataon’i Jesosy taminy.', '“mandehana mody any an-tranonao, ary tantarao amin’ny olona izay nataon’andriamanitra taminao.” dia lasa izy nitory eran’ilay tanàna ny zavatra nataon’i jesosy taminy.'),
  ('6ab25c615e55d2008a98f896', '2026-09-22T10:45:53.935Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:53.935Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 8, 32, 'Ary nisy kisoa be dia be nandrasana teo amin’ilay tendrombohitra. Koa niangavy an’i Jesosy ireo demonia mba havelany hiditra tao amin’ireo kisoa ireo, dia nekeny izany.', 'ary nisy kisoa be dia be nandrasana teo amin’ilay tendrombohitra. koa niangavy an’i jesosy ireo demonia mba havelany hiditra tao amin’ireo kisoa ireo, dia nekeny izany.'),
  ('6ab25c615e55d2008a98f88a', '2026-09-22T10:45:53.935Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:53.935Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 8, 20, 'Koa nisy nilaza taminy hoe: “Mijoro ao ivelany ao ny reninao sy ny rahalahinao, fa te hahita anao.”', 'koa nisy nilaza taminy hoe: “mijoro ao ivelany ao ny reninao sy ny rahalahinao, fa te hahita anao.”'),
  ('6ab25c615e55d2008a98f888', '2026-09-22T10:45:53.935Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:53.935Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 8, 18, 'Koa tandremo ny fomba fihainoanareo, satria izay manana dia homena betsaka kokoa. Fa izay tsy manana kosa, na izay heveriny hoe ananany aza dia halaina aminy.”', 'koa tandremo ny fomba fihainoanareo, satria izay manana dia homena betsaka kokoa. fa izay tsy manana kosa, na izay heveriny hoe ananany aza dia halaina aminy.”'),
  ('6ab25c615e55d2008a98f895', '2026-09-22T10:45:53.935Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:53.935Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 8, 31, 'Niangavy azy foana ireo mba tsy hanome baiko azy ho any amin’ny lavaka mangitsokitsoka.', 'niangavy azy foana ireo mba tsy hanome baiko azy ho any amin’ny lavaka mangitsokitsoka.'),
  ('6ab25c615e55d2008a98f897', '2026-09-22T10:45:53.935Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:53.935Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 8, 33, 'Dia nivoaka tamin’ilay lehilahy ireo demonia, ka niditra tao amin’ireo kisoa. Ary nirifatra nankeny amin’ny hantsana ilay andian-kisoa, dia nivarina tany amin’ny farihy ka maty an-drano.', 'dia nivoaka tamin’ilay lehilahy ireo demonia, ka niditra tao amin’ireo kisoa. ary nirifatra nankeny amin’ny hantsana ilay andian-kisoa, dia nivarina tany amin’ny farihy ka maty an-drano.'),
  ('6ab25c615e55d2008a98f88e', '2026-09-22T10:45:53.935Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:53.935Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 8, 24, 'Koa nankeo amin’i Jesosy ny mpianany ary namoha azy, sady niteny hoe: “Mpampianatra ô, Mpampianatra ô! Ho faty isika!” Dia nitsangana izy ary noteneniny mafy ny rivotra sy ny rano nisamboaravoara, ka nitsahatra izany ary lasa tony ny andro.', 'koa nankeo amin’i jesosy ny mpianany ary namoha azy, sady niteny hoe: “mpampianatra ô, mpampianatra ô! ho faty isika!” dia nitsangana izy ary noteneniny mafy ny rivotra sy ny rano nisamboaravoara, ka nitsahatra izany ary lasa tony ny andro.'),
  ('6ab25c615e55d2008a98f88c', '2026-09-22T10:45:53.935Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:53.935Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 8, 22, 'Indray andro, dia nankao anaty sambokely izy sy ny mpianany, ary hoy izy tamin’izy ireo: “Andao ho eny ampitan’ny farihy.” Dia lasa izy ireo.', 'indray andro, dia nankao anaty sambokely izy sy ny mpianany, ary hoy izy tamin’izy ireo: “andao ho eny ampitan’ny farihy.” dia lasa izy ireo.'),
  ('6ab25c615e55d2008a98f887', '2026-09-22T10:45:53.935Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:53.935Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 8, 17, 'Fa tsy misy zavatra afenina ka hoe tsy haseho, na zavatra tsara afina ka hoe tsy ho fantatra mihitsy na tsy hiharihary.', 'fa tsy misy zavatra afenina ka hoe tsy haseho, na zavatra tsara afina ka hoe tsy ho fantatra mihitsy na tsy hiharihary.'),
  ('6ab25c615e55d2008a98f8aa', '2026-09-22T10:45:53.935Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:53.935Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 8, 52, 'Nitomany daholo ny olona sady nikapo-tratra satria nalahelo an’ilay ankizivavy. Koa niteny i Jesosy hoe: “Aza mitomany intsony! Tsy maty izy fa matory.”', 'nitomany daholo ny olona sady nikapo-tratra satria nalahelo an’ilay ankizivavy. koa niteny i jesosy hoe: “aza mitomany intsony! tsy maty izy fa matory.”'),
  ('6ab25c615e55d2008a98f8a5', '2026-09-22T10:45:53.935Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:53.935Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 8, 47, 'Hitan’ilay vehivavy fa nisy nahatsikaritra izy, ka nanatona izy sady nangovitra dia nandohalika teo anatrehany. Ary notantarainy teo imason’ny olona rehetra ny antony nikasihany azy sy ny fomba nahasitrana azy teo no ho eo.', 'hitan’ilay vehivavy fa nisy nahatsikaritra izy, ka nanatona izy sady nangovitra dia nandohalika teo anatrehany. ary notantarainy teo imason’ny olona rehetra ny antony nikasihany azy sy ny fomba nahasitrana azy teo no ho eo.'),
  ('6ab25c615e55d2008a98f8ab', '2026-09-22T10:45:53.935Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:53.935Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 8, 53, 'Dia nihomehezan’ireo izy, satria fantatr’izy ireo fa maty ilay ankizivavy.', 'dia nihomehezan’ireo izy, satria fantatr’izy ireo fa maty ilay ankizivavy.'),
  ('6ab25c615e55d2008a98f8a8', '2026-09-22T10:45:53.935Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:53.935Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 8, 50, 'Henon’i Jesosy izany, ka hoy izy: “Aza matahotra! Minoa fotsiny dia ho voavonjy izy.”', 'henon’i jesosy izany, ka hoy izy: “aza matahotra! minoa fotsiny dia ho voavonjy izy.”'),
  ('6ab25c615e55d2008a98f8a4', '2026-09-22T10:45:53.935Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:53.935Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 8, 46, 'Fa hoy i Jesosy: “Nisy olona nikasika ahy teo, satria tsapako fa nisy hery niala tamiko.”', 'fa hoy i jesosy: “nisy olona nikasika ahy teo, satria tsapako fa nisy hery niala tamiko.”'),
  ('6ab25c615e55d2008a98f894', '2026-09-22T10:45:53.935Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:53.935Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 8, 30, 'Nanontany azy i Jesosy hoe: “Iza no anaranao?” Dia hoy izy: “Andian-tafika”, satria demonia be dia be no niditra tao amin’ilay lehilahy.', 'nanontany azy i jesosy hoe: “iza no anaranao?” dia hoy izy: “andian-tafika”, satria demonia be dia be no niditra tao amin’ilay lehilahy.'),
  ('6ab25c615e55d2008a98f885', '2026-09-22T10:45:53.935Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:53.935Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 8, 15, 'Fa ireo teny amin’ny tany tsara kosa, dia izay mandre ny teny amin’ny fo tsara sy madio, ka mitahiry an’izany ao am-pony, ary mamoa sady miaritra.', 'fa ireo teny amin’ny tany tsara kosa, dia izay mandre ny teny amin’ny fo tsara sy madio, ka mitahiry an’izany ao am-pony, ary mamoa sady miaritra.'),
  ('6ab25c615e55d2008a98f88d', '2026-09-22T10:45:53.935Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:53.935Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 8, 23, 'Resin-tory anefa izy, tamin’izy ireo mbola teny ambonin’ilay sambokely. Ary nisy tafio-drivotra mahery nidina teo amin’ilay farihy, ka nihafeno rano ilay sambokely, ary notandindomin-doza izy ireo.', 'resin-tory anefa izy, tamin’izy ireo mbola teny ambonin’ilay sambokely. ary nisy tafio-drivotra mahery nidina teo amin’ilay farihy, ka nihafeno rano ilay sambokely, ary notandindomin-doza izy ireo.'),
  ('6ab25c615e55d2008a98f8a9', '2026-09-22T10:45:53.935Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:53.935Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 8, 51, 'Rehefa tonga teo amin’ilay trano i Jesosy, dia tsy nisy navelany hiditra afa-tsy i Petera sy Jaona sy Jakoba ary ny ray sy renin’ilay ankizivavy.', 'rehefa tonga teo amin’ilay trano i jesosy, dia tsy nisy navelany hiditra afa-tsy i petera sy jaona sy jakoba ary ny ray sy renin’ilay ankizivavy.'),
  ('6ab25c615e55d2008a98f8a1', '2026-09-22T10:45:53.935Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:53.935Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 8, 43, 'Ary nisy vehivavy iray nandeha ra efa nandritra ny 12 taona, nefa tsy nisy nahasitrana azy mihitsy.', 'ary nisy vehivavy iray nandeha ra efa nandritra ny 12 taona, nefa tsy nisy nahasitrana azy mihitsy.'),
  ('6ab25c615e55d2008a98f892', '2026-09-22T10:45:53.935Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:53.935Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 8, 28, 'Niantsoantso mafy izy raha vao nahatazana an’i Jesosy, ary nandohalika teo anatrehany ka niteny mafy hoe: “Fa inona koa no anelingelenanao ahy atỳ, ry Jesosy Zanak’ilay Andriamanitra Avo Indrindra ô? Miangavy anao aho, aza ampijalina re aho e!”', 'niantsoantso mafy izy raha vao nahatazana an’i jesosy, ary nandohalika teo anatrehany ka niteny mafy hoe: “fa inona koa no anelingelenanao ahy atỳ, ry jesosy zanak’ilay andriamanitra avo indrindra ô? miangavy anao aho, aza ampijalina re aho e!”'),
  ('6ab25c615e55d2008a98f8ae', '2026-09-22T10:45:53.935Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:53.935Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 8, 56, 'Ary faly loatra ny ray aman-dreniny, kanefa tsy navelan’i Jesosy hilazalaza tamin’iza na iza an’izay nitranga izy ireo.', 'ary faly loatra ny ray aman-dreniny, kanefa tsy navelan’i jesosy hilazalaza tamin’iza na iza an’izay nitranga izy ireo.'),
  ('6ab25c62a49560cb05b0ec2f', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.476Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.476Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 9, 41, 'Dia hoy i Jesosy: “Ry taranaka tsy manam-pinoana sy ratsy fanahy, mandra-pahoviana aho no tsy maintsy mbola hijanona eto aminareo sy handefitra aminareo? Ento atỳ ny zanakao.”', 'dia hoy i jesosy: “ry taranaka tsy manam-pinoana sy ratsy fanahy, mandra-pahoviana aho no tsy maintsy mbola hijanona eto aminareo sy handefitra aminareo? ento atỳ ny zanakao.”'),
  ('6ab25c62a49560cb05b0ec28', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.476Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.476Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 9, 34, 'Fa raha mbola niteny an’izany izy, dia nisy rahona nanaloka azy ireo, ary natahotra izy ireo rehefa voasaron’ilay rahona.', 'fa raha mbola niteny an’izany izy, dia nisy rahona nanaloka azy ireo, ary natahotra izy ireo rehefa voasaron’ilay rahona.'),
  ('6ab25c62a49560cb05b0ec15', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.476Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.476Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 9, 15, 'Dia nataon’ny mpianany izany, ka nasainy nipetraka ny olona rehetra.', 'dia nataon’ny mpianany izany, ka nasainy nipetraka ny olona rehetra.'),
  ('6ab25c62a49560cb05b0ec1f', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.476Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.476Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 9, 25, 'Inona tokoa moa no soa ho azon’ny olona raha azony izao tontolo izao nefa afoiny ny ainy, na potika ny fiainany?', 'inona tokoa moa no soa ho azon’ny olona raha azony izao tontolo izao nefa afoiny ny ainy, na potika ny fiainany?'),
  ('6ab25c62a49560cb05b0ec11', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.476Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.476Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 9, 11, 'Fantatry ny vahoaka anefa izany, ka nanaraka azy izy ireo. Dia nandray tsara azy ireo i Jesosy, ary niresaka taminy momba ny Fanjakan’Andriamanitra, sady nanasitrana an’izay nila nositranina.', 'fantatry ny vahoaka anefa izany, ka nanaraka azy izy ireo. dia nandray tsara azy ireo i jesosy, ary niresaka taminy momba ny fanjakan’andriamanitra, sady nanasitrana an’izay nila nositranina.'),
  ('6ab25c62a49560cb05b0ec32', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.476Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.476Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 9, 44, '“Henoy tsara sady tadidio izao teny izao: Efa hisy hamadika ny Zanak’olona dia hatolotra eo am-pelatanan’ny olona.”', '“henoy tsara sady tadidio izao teny izao: efa hisy hamadika ny zanak’olona dia hatolotra eo am-pelatanan’ny olona.”'),
  ('6ab25c62a49560cb05b0ec0a', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.476Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.476Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 9, 4, 'Fa na aiza na aiza trano hidiranareo, dia mijanòna ao ary avy ao indray miainga.', 'fa na aiza na aiza trano hidiranareo, dia mijanòna ao ary avy ao indray miainga.'),
  ('6ab25c62a49560cb05b0ec34', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.476Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.476Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 9, 46, 'Ary nifamaly ny mpianatra hoe iza tamin’izy ireo no lehibe indrindra.', 'ary nifamaly ny mpianatra hoe iza tamin’izy ireo no lehibe indrindra.'),
  ('6ab25c62a49560cb05b0ec2d', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.476Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.476Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 9, 39, 'Idiran’ny fanahy maloto izy dia miantsoantso tampoka, ary ataony mifanintontsintona sy mamoaka roatram-bava. Rehefa mangamangana mihitsy ny zanako vao ialany.', 'idiran’ny fanahy maloto izy dia miantsoantso tampoka, ary ataony mifanintontsintona sy mamoaka roatram-bava. rehefa mangamangana mihitsy ny zanako vao ialany.'),
  ('6ab25c62a49560cb05b0ec19', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.476Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.476Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 9, 19, 'Hoy ny navalin’izy ireo: “Jaona Mpanao Batisa. Misy koa anefa milaza hoe Elia, ary misy miteny hoe ny iray amin’ny mpaminany taloha efa nitsangana tamin’ny maty.”', 'hoy ny navalin’izy ireo: “jaona mpanao batisa. misy koa anefa milaza hoe elia, ary misy miteny hoe ny iray amin’ny mpaminany taloha efa nitsangana tamin’ny maty.”'),
  ('6ab25c62a49560cb05b0ec0d', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.476Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.476Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 9, 7, 'Henon’i Heroda lehibem-paritra ny zava-drehetra nitranga, ka tena very hevitra izy satria nisy nilaza fa efa natsangana tamin’ny maty i Jaona.', 'henon’i heroda lehibem-paritra ny zava-drehetra nitranga, ka tena very hevitra izy satria nisy nilaza fa efa natsangana tamin’ny maty i jaona.'),
  ('6ab25c62a49560cb05b0ec08', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.476Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.476Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 9, 2, 'Ary nirahiny hitory ny Fanjakan’Andriamanitra sy hanasitrana izy ireo,', 'ary nirahiny hitory ny fanjakan’andriamanitra sy hanasitrana izy ireo,'),
  ('6ab25c62a49560cb05b0ec3b', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.476Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.476Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 9, 53, 'Tsy noraisin’ny olona tao anefa i Jesosy, satria efa tapa-kevitra ny ho any Jerosalema izy.', 'tsy noraisin’ny olona tao anefa i jesosy, satria efa tapa-kevitra ny ho any jerosalema izy.'),
  ('6ab25c62a49560cb05b0ec39', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.476Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.476Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 9, 51, 'Rehefa nihananakaiky ny fotoana hakana an’i Jesosy hiakatra any an-danitra, dia tena tapa-kevitra ny ho any Jerosalema izy.', 'rehefa nihananakaiky ny fotoana hakana an’i jesosy hiakatra any an-danitra, dia tena tapa-kevitra ny ho any jerosalema izy.'),
  ('6ab25c62a49560cb05b0ec1e', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.476Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.476Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 9, 24, 'Fa izay te hamonjy ny ainy no hamoy an’izany, ary izay mamoy ny ainy noho ny amiko kosa no hamonjy an’izany.', 'fa izay te hamonjy ny ainy no hamoy an’izany, ary izay mamoy ny ainy noho ny amiko kosa no hamonjy an’izany.'),
  ('6ab25c62a49560cb05b0ec30', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.476Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.476Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 9, 42, 'Rehefa nanatona ilay ankizilahy dia natontan’ilay demonia tamin’ny tany, sady nataony nifanintontsintona be. Notenenin’i Jesosy mafy anefa ilay fanahy maloto, ka sitrana ilay ankizilahy ary nomen’i Jesosy an-drainy.', 'rehefa nanatona ilay ankizilahy dia natontan’ilay demonia tamin’ny tany, sady nataony nifanintontsintona be. notenenin’i jesosy mafy anefa ilay fanahy maloto, ka sitrana ilay ankizilahy ary nomen’i jesosy an-drainy.'),
  ('6ab25c62a49560cb05b0ec2b', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.476Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.476Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 9, 37, 'Nisy vahoaka be nitsena an’i Jesosy rehefa nidina avy tany an-tendrombohitra izy ireo, ny ampitson’iny.', 'nisy vahoaka be nitsena an’i jesosy rehefa nidina avy tany an-tendrombohitra izy ireo, ny ampitson’iny.'),
  ('6ab25c62a49560cb05b0ec26', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.476Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.476Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 9, 32, 'Efa resin-tory i Petera sy ireo niaraka taminy tamin’izay. Rehefa taitra tsara anefa izy ireo, dia hitany ny voninahitr’i Jesosy ary hitany koa ireo roa lahy niara-nijoro taminy.', 'efa resin-tory i petera sy ireo niaraka taminy tamin’izay. rehefa taitra tsara anefa izy ireo, dia hitany ny voninahitr’i jesosy ary hitany koa ireo roa lahy niara-nijoro taminy.'),
  ('6ab25c62a49560cb05b0ec10', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.476Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.476Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 9, 10, 'Rehefa niverina ny apostoly, dia nitantara tamin’i Jesosy an’izay rehetra nataon’izy ireo. Ary nentiny nitokana nankany amin’ny tanàna atao hoe Betsaida izy ireo.', 'rehefa niverina ny apostoly, dia nitantara tamin’i jesosy an’izay rehetra nataon’izy ireo. ary nentiny nitokana nankany amin’ny tanàna atao hoe betsaida izy ireo.'),
  ('6ab25c62a49560cb05b0ec0e', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.476Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.476Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 9, 8, 'Ny sasany anefa nilaza hoe i Elia no niseho, ary ny hafa indray niteny hoe ny anankiray tamin’ny mpaminany taloha no nitsangana tamin’ny maty.', 'ny sasany anefa nilaza hoe i elia no niseho, ary ny hafa indray niteny hoe ny anankiray tamin’ny mpaminany taloha no nitsangana tamin’ny maty.'),
  ('6ab25c62a49560cb05b0ec37', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.476Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.476Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 9, 49, 'Hoy i Jaona: “Mpampianatra ô, nisy olona hitanay namoaka demonia tamin’ny anaranao. Dia nanandrana nisakana azy izahay satria tsy namantsika izy.”', 'hoy i jaona: “mpampianatra ô, nisy olona hitanay namoaka demonia tamin’ny anaranao. dia nanandrana nisakana azy izahay satria tsy namantsika izy.”'),
  ('6ab25c62a49560cb05b0ec36', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.476Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.476Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 9, 48, 'dia hoy izy tamin’izy ireo: “Izay mandray an’ity zaza ity amin’ny anarako dia mandray ahy, ary izay mandray ahy dia mandray an’Ilay naniraka ahy. Fa izay mitondra tena toy ny kely indrindra aminareo rehetra dia izy no lehibe.”', 'dia hoy izy tamin’izy ireo: “izay mandray an’ity zaza ity amin’ny anarako dia mandray ahy, ary izay mandray ahy dia mandray an’ilay naniraka ahy. fa izay mitondra tena toy ny kely indrindra aminareo rehetra dia izy no lehibe.”'),
  ('6ab25c62a49560cb05b0ec35', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.476Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.476Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 9, 47, 'Fantatr’i Jesosy ny tao am-pon’izy ireo, ka nalainy ny zaza anankiray ary nasainy nitsangana teo akaikiny,', 'fantatr’i jesosy ny tao am-pon’izy ireo, ka nalainy ny zaza anankiray ary nasainy nitsangana teo akaikiny,'),
  ('6ab25c62a49560cb05b0ec1b', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.476Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.476Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 9, 21, 'Koa nofeperany mafy izy ireo mba tsy hilazalaza an’izany tamin’olona.', 'koa nofeperany mafy izy ireo mba tsy hilazalaza an’izany tamin’olona.'),
  ('6ab25c62a49560cb05b0ec0f', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.476Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.476Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 9, 9, 'Dia hoy i Heroda: “Raha i Jaona, dia efa notapahiko ny lohany. Koa iza indray àry izany reko manao an’izany zavatra izany?” Te hahita mafy an’i Jesosy àry izy.', 'dia hoy i heroda: “raha i jaona, dia efa notapahiko ny lohany. koa iza indray àry izany reko manao an’izany zavatra izany?” te hahita mafy an’i jesosy àry izy.'),
  ('6ab25c62a49560cb05b0ec07', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.476Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.476Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 9, 1, 'Dia nantsoin’i Jesosy izy 12 Lahy, ka nomeny hery sy fahefana hamoaka ny demonia rehetra sy hanasitrana aretina.', 'dia nantsoin’i jesosy izy 12 lahy, ka nomeny hery sy fahefana hamoaka ny demonia rehetra sy hanasitrana aretina.'),
  ('6ab25c62a49560cb05b0ec38', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.476Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.476Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 9, 50, 'Niteny taminy anefa i Jesosy hoe: “Aza mitady hisakana azy, fa izay tsy manohitra anareo dia manohana anareo.”', 'niteny taminy anefa i jesosy hoe: “aza mitady hisakana azy, fa izay tsy manohitra anareo dia manohana anareo.”'),
  ('6ab25c62a49560cb05b0ec29', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.476Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.476Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 9, 35, 'Dia nisy feo niteny avy tao amin’ilay rahona hoe: “Io no Zanako, ilay nofidiko. Henoy izy.”', 'dia nisy feo niteny avy tao amin’ilay rahona hoe: “io no zanako, ilay nofidiko. henoy izy.”'),
  ('6ab25c62a49560cb05b0ec24', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.476Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.476Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 9, 30, 'Ary ireo fa nisy roa lahy niresaka taminy, dia i Mosesy sy Elia.', 'ary ireo fa nisy roa lahy niresaka taminy, dia i mosesy sy elia.'),
  ('6ab25c62a49560cb05b0ec18', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.476Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.476Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 9, 18, 'Taorian’izay, tamin’izy nivavaka irery, dia tonga teo aminy ny mpianatra ka nanontaniany hoe: “Iza, hono, aho raha ny filazan’ny olona?”', 'taorian’izay, tamin’izy nivavaka irery, dia tonga teo aminy ny mpianatra ka nanontaniany hoe: “iza, hono, aho raha ny filazan’ny olona?”'),
  ('6ab25c62a49560cb05b0ec16', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.476Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.476Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 9, 16, 'Nalain’i Jesosy ny mofo dimy sy ny trondro roa, ary nitraka nijery ny lanitra izy dia nisaotra. Notapahiny izany avy eo, dia nomeny ny mpianatra mba haroso amin’ny vahoaka.', 'nalain’i jesosy ny mofo dimy sy ny trondro roa, ary nitraka nijery ny lanitra izy dia nisaotra. notapahiny izany avy eo, dia nomeny ny mpianatra mba haroso amin’ny vahoaka.'),
  ('6ab25c62a49560cb05b0ec3a', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.476Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.476Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 9, 52, 'Koa naniraka olona hialoha azy izy. Dia lasa izy ireo ka niditra tao amin’ny tanànan’ny Samaritanina, mba hanomana ny fahatongavany.', 'koa naniraka olona hialoha azy izy. dia lasa izy ireo ka niditra tao amin’ny tanànan’ny samaritanina, mba hanomana ny fahatongavany.'),
  ('6ab25c62a49560cb05b0ec2e', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.476Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.476Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 9, 40, 'Efa niangavy ny mpianatrao aho hamoaka an’ilay fanahy, saingy tsy vitan’izy ireo.”', 'efa niangavy ny mpianatrao aho hamoaka an’ilay fanahy, saingy tsy vitan’izy ireo.”'),
  ('6ab25c62a49560cb05b0ec21', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.476Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.476Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 9, 27, 'Fa lazaiko marina aminareo fa misy amin’izay mijoro eto tsy ho faty mihitsy, raha tsy efa hitany ny Fanjakan’Andriamanitra.”', 'fa lazaiko marina aminareo fa misy amin’izay mijoro eto tsy ho faty mihitsy, raha tsy efa hitany ny fanjakan’andriamanitra.”'),
  ('6ab25c62a49560cb05b0ec13', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.476Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.476Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 9, 13, 'Hoy anefa izy tamin’izy ireo: “Omeo zavatra hohanina ry zareo.” Dia hoy ireo: “Tsy manana afa-tsy mofo dimy sy trondro roa izahay, raha tsy hoe izahay angaha no handeha hividy sakafo ho an’ireo olona rehetra ireo.”', 'hoy anefa izy tamin’izy ireo: “omeo zavatra hohanina ry zareo.” dia hoy ireo: “tsy manana afa-tsy mofo dimy sy trondro roa izahay, raha tsy hoe izahay angaha no handeha hividy sakafo ho an’ireo olona rehetra ireo.”'),
  ('6ab25c62a49560cb05b0ec33', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.476Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.476Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 9, 45, 'Tsy azon’ireo anefa izay nolazainy. Nafenina azy ireo mantsy izany mba tsy ho takany, ary natahotra ny hanontany azy momba an’izany izy ireo.', 'tsy azon’ireo anefa izay nolazainy. nafenina azy ireo mantsy izany mba tsy ho takany, ary natahotra ny hanontany azy momba an’izany izy ireo.'),
  ('6ab25c62a49560cb05b0ec1d', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.476Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.476Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 9, 23, 'Dia hoy ihany izy tamin’ny rehetra: “Raha misy te hanaraka ahy, dia tsy maintsy mandà ny tenany izy ka mitondra ny hazo fijaliany isan’andro ary manaraka ahy foana.', 'dia hoy ihany izy tamin’ny rehetra: “raha misy te hanaraka ahy, dia tsy maintsy mandà ny tenany izy ka mitondra ny hazo fijaliany isan’andro ary manaraka ahy foana.'),
  ('6ab25c62a49560cb05b0ec1c', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.476Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.476Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 9, 22, 'Hoy koa izy: “Tsy maintsy hampijalijalina ny Zanak’olona ka holavin’ny anti-panahy sy ny lehiben’ny mpisorona ary ny mpanora-dalàna, dia hovonoina ho faty, ary hatsangana amin’ny andro fahatelo.”', 'hoy koa izy: “tsy maintsy hampijalijalina ny zanak’olona ka holavin’ny anti-panahy sy ny lehiben’ny mpisorona ary ny mpanora-dalàna, dia hovonoina ho faty, ary hatsangana amin’ny andro fahatelo.”'),
  ('6ab25c62a49560cb05b0ec17', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.476Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.476Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 9, 17, 'Dia nihinana ny rehetra ka voky. Ary nangonin’ny mpianatra ny sombintsombiny sisa tsy lany, ka nahafeno harona 12.', 'dia nihinana ny rehetra ka voky. ary nangonin’ny mpianatra ny sombintsombiny sisa tsy lany, ka nahafeno harona 12.'),
  ('6ab25c62a49560cb05b0ec2c', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.476Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.476Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 9, 38, 'Ary niantso mafy avy tao amin’ny vahoaka ny lehilahy iray hoe: “Mpampianatra ô, miangavy anao re aho mba hijery ny zanako e, fa zanako lahitokana izy!', 'ary niantso mafy avy tao amin’ny vahoaka ny lehilahy iray hoe: “mpampianatra ô, miangavy anao re aho mba hijery ny zanako e, fa zanako lahitokana izy!'),
  ('6ab25c62a49560cb05b0ec23', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.476Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.476Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 9, 29, 'Dia niova ny fahitana ny tarehin’i Jesosy raha mbola nivavaka izy, ary lasa fotsy nanjelanjelatra ny akanjony.', 'dia niova ny fahitana ny tarehin’i jesosy raha mbola nivavaka izy, ary lasa fotsy nanjelanjelatra ny akanjony.'),
  ('6ab25c62a49560cb05b0ec12', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.476Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.476Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 9, 12, 'Rehefa ho hariva ny andro, dia nanatona azy izy 12 Lahy, ka niteny hoe: “Ravao ny vahoaka mba handeha hitady toerana hatoriana sy sakafo eny amin’ny tanàna manodidina sy eny ambanivohitra, fa mitokana ity misy antsika ity.”', 'rehefa ho hariva ny andro, dia nanatona azy izy 12 lahy, ka niteny hoe: “ravao ny vahoaka mba handeha hitady toerana hatoriana sy sakafo eny amin’ny tanàna manodidina sy eny ambanivohitra, fa mitokana ity misy antsika ity.”'),
  ('6ab25c62a49560cb05b0ec2a', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.476Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.476Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 9, 36, 'Tamin’ny fotoana nandrenesana an’ilay feo, dia i Jesosy irery sisa no hita teo. Ary nangina izy ireo ka mbola tsy nolazalazainy tamin’ny olona aloha ny zavatra hitany.', 'tamin’ny fotoana nandrenesana an’ilay feo, dia i jesosy irery sisa no hita teo. ary nangina izy ireo ka mbola tsy nolazalazainy tamin’ny olona aloha ny zavatra hitany.'),
  ('6ab25c62a49560cb05b0ec27', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.476Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.476Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 9, 33, 'Rehefa handao an’i Jesosy izy roa lahy, dia hoy i Petera tamin’i Jesosy: “Mpampianatra ô, faly be izahay fa eto. Koa avelao izahay hanangana tranolay telo, ka ny iray ho anao, ny iray ho an’i Mosesy, ary ny iray ho an’i Elia.” Tsy fantany anefa izay nolazainy.', 'rehefa handao an’i jesosy izy roa lahy, dia hoy i petera tamin’i jesosy: “mpampianatra ô, faly be izahay fa eto. koa avelao izahay hanangana tranolay telo, ka ny iray ho anao, ny iray ho an’i mosesy, ary ny iray ho an’i elia.” tsy fantany anefa izay nolazainy.'),
  ('6ab25c62a49560cb05b0ec22', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.476Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.476Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 9, 28, 'Valo andro teo ho eo taorian’ny nilazany an’ireo teny ireo, dia nentiny niaraka taminy i Petera sy Jaona ary Jakoba, ka niakatra tany an-tendrombohitra izy mba hivavaka.', 'valo andro teo ho eo taorian’ny nilazany an’ireo teny ireo, dia nentiny niaraka taminy i petera sy jaona ary jakoba, ka niakatra tany an-tendrombohitra izy mba hivavaka.'),
  ('6ab25c62a49560cb05b0ec0c', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.476Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.476Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 9, 6, 'Dia lasa izy ireo nitety an’ilay faritra ka nandeha isan-tanàna, nitory ny vaovao tsara sy nanasitrana teny rehetra teny.', 'dia lasa izy ireo nitety an’ilay faritra ka nandeha isan-tanàna, nitory ny vaovao tsara sy nanasitrana teny rehetra teny.'),
  ('6ab25c62a49560cb05b0ec31', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.476Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.476Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 9, 43, 'Dia gaga be daholo ny olona noho ny hery lehiben’Andriamanitra. Raha mbola talanjona ny rehetra noho ny zava-drehetra nataon’i Jesosy, dia hoy izy tamin’ny mpianany:', 'dia gaga be daholo ny olona noho ny hery lehiben’andriamanitra. raha mbola talanjona ny rehetra noho ny zava-drehetra nataon’i jesosy, dia hoy izy tamin’ny mpianany:'),
  ('6ab25c62a49560cb05b0ec20', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.476Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.476Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 9, 26, 'Fa na iza na iza menatra noho ny amiko sy ny teniko, dia ho menatra noho ny amin’izany olona izany koa ny Zanak’olona, rehefa ho avy amin’ny voninahiny sy ny voninahitry ny Rainy ary ny an’ny anjely masina.', 'fa na iza na iza menatra noho ny amiko sy ny teniko, dia ho menatra noho ny amin’izany olona izany koa ny zanak’olona, rehefa ho avy amin’ny voninahiny sy ny voninahitry ny rainy ary ny an’ny anjely masina.'),
  ('6ab25c62a49560cb05b0ec14', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.476Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.476Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 9, 14, 'Lehilahy tokotokony ho 5 000 no teo tamin’izay. Hoy anefa izy tamin’ny mpianany: “Asaivo mipetraka mitsitokotoko ny olona, ka ataovy mitambatambatra 50 eo ho eo avy.”', 'lehilahy tokotokony ho 5 000 no teo tamin’izay. hoy anefa izy tamin’ny mpianany: “asaivo mipetraka mitsitokotoko ny olona, ka ataovy mitambatambatra 50 eo ho eo avy.”'),
  ('6ab25c62a49560cb05b0ec25', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.476Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.476Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 9, 31, 'Niseho tamim-boninahitra izy ireo, sady niresaka momba ny handehanan’i Jesosy, izay efa hitranga any Jerosalema.', 'niseho tamim-boninahitra izy ireo, sady niresaka momba ny handehanan’i jesosy, izay efa hitranga any jerosalema.'),
  ('6ab25c62a49560cb05b0ec1a', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.476Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.476Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 9, 20, 'Dia hoy izy tamin’izy ireo: “Fa ianareo kosa milaza hoe iza aho?” Dia namaly i Petera hoe: “Kristin’Andriamanitra.”', 'dia hoy izy tamin’izy ireo: “fa ianareo kosa milaza hoe iza aho?” dia namaly i petera hoe: “kristin’andriamanitra.”'),
  ('6ab25c62a49560cb05b0ec0b', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.476Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.476Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 9, 5, 'Ary na aiza na aiza misy olona tsy mandray anareo, dia ahintsano ny vovoka amin’ny tongotrareo rehefa miala ao amin’ilay tanàna ianareo, mba ho vavolombelona hiampanga azy.”', 'ary na aiza na aiza misy olona tsy mandray anareo, dia ahintsano ny vovoka amin’ny tongotrareo rehefa miala ao amin’ilay tanàna ianareo, mba ho vavolombelona hiampanga azy.”'),
  ('6ab25c62a49560cb05b0ec09', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.476Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.476Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 9, 3, 'ka hoy izy: “Aza mitondra na inona na inona rehefa mandeha ianareo, na tehina na kitapom-batsy na mofo na vola, ary aza mitondra akanjo anankiroa.', 'ka hoy izy: “aza mitondra na inona na inona rehefa mandeha ianareo, na tehina na kitapom-batsy na mofo na vola, ary aza mitondra akanjo anankiroa.'),
  ('6ab25c62a49560cb05b0ec43', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.477Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.477Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 9, 61, 'Mbola nisy olon-kafa koa niteny hoe: “Hanaraka anao ihany aho, Tompo ô, fa avelao aloha aho hanao veloma ny ao an-tranoko.”', 'mbola nisy olon-kafa koa niteny hoe: “hanaraka anao ihany aho, tompo ô, fa avelao aloha aho hanao veloma ny ao an-tranoko.”'),
  ('6ab25c62a49560cb05b0ec42', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.477Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.477Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 9, 60, 'Hoy anefa izy taminy: “Avelao ny maty handevina ny maty, fa ianao kosa mandehana torio hatraiza hatraiza ny Fanjakan’Andriamanitra.”', 'hoy anefa izy taminy: “avelao ny maty handevina ny maty, fa ianao kosa mandehana torio hatraiza hatraiza ny fanjakan’andriamanitra.”'),
  ('6ab25c62a49560cb05b0ec3f', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.477Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.477Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 9, 57, 'Rehefa teny an-dalana izy ireo, dia nisy olona niteny taminy hoe: “Hanaraka anao aho na aiza na aiza halehanao.”', 'rehefa teny an-dalana izy ireo, dia nisy olona niteny taminy hoe: “hanaraka anao aho na aiza na aiza halehanao.”'),
  ('6ab25c62a49560cb05b0ec44', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.477Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.477Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 9, 62, 'Dia hoy i Jesosy: “Tsy misy olona mitazona angadinomby ary mitodika any aoriana, ka mendrika ny hiditra ao amin’ny Fanjakan’Andriamanitra.”', 'dia hoy i jesosy: “tsy misy olona mitazona angadinomby ary mitodika any aoriana, ka mendrika ny hiditra ao amin’ny fanjakan’andriamanitra.”'),
  ('6ab25c62a49560cb05b0ec3e', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.477Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.477Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 9, 56, 'Dia lasa nankany amin’ny tanàna kely hafa izy sy ny mpianany.', 'dia lasa nankany amin’ny tanàna kely hafa izy sy ny mpianany.'),
  ('6ab25c62a49560cb05b0ec3d', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.477Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.477Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 9, 55, 'Nitodika anefa izy ka niteny mafy azy roa lahy.', 'nitodika anefa izy ka niteny mafy azy roa lahy.'),
  ('6ab25c62a49560cb05b0ec40', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.477Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.477Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 9, 58, 'Hoy anefa i Jesosy: “Manan-davaka hisitrihana ny amboadia, ary manana akany ny voro-manidina, fa ny Zanak’olona kosa tsy mba manana an’izay hametrahany ny lohany.”', 'hoy anefa i jesosy: “manan-davaka hisitrihana ny amboadia, ary manana akany ny voro-manidina, fa ny zanak’olona kosa tsy mba manana an’izay hametrahany ny lohany.”'),
  ('6ab25c62a49560cb05b0ec3c', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.477Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.477Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 9, 54, 'Rehefa nahita an’izany i Jakoba sy Jaona mpianatra, dia niteny hoe: “Tompo ô, tianao ve raha hiteny izahay mba hisy afo hilatsaka avy any an-danitra handringana an’ireo?”', 'rehefa nahita an’izany i jakoba sy jaona mpianatra, dia niteny hoe: “tompo ô, tianao ve raha hiteny izahay mba hisy afo hilatsaka avy any an-danitra handringana an’ireo?”'),
  ('6ab25c62a49560cb05b0ec41', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.477Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.477Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 9, 59, 'Ary hoy izy tamin’ny anankiray hafa: “Andao hanara-dia ahy.” Fa hoy ilay lehilahy: “Tompo ô, avelao aho aloha handeha handevina ny dadako.”', 'ary hoy izy tamin’ny anankiray hafa: “andao hanara-dia ahy.” fa hoy ilay lehilahy: “tompo ô, avelao aho aloha handeha handevina ny dadako.”'),
  ('6ab25c62fdc3b982fcaf579a', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.932Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.932Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 10, 33, 'Nisy Samaritanina iray kosa nandeha tamin’ilay lalana, dia tonga teo aminy, ary nangoraka rehefa nahita azy.', 'nisy samaritanina iray kosa nandeha tamin’ilay lalana, dia tonga teo aminy, ary nangoraka rehefa nahita azy.'),
  ('6ab25c62fdc3b982fcaf5786', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.932Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.932Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 10, 13, '“Hahita loza ianao, ry Korazina! Hahita loza ianao, ry Betsaida! Raha tany Tyro sy Sidona mantsy no nanaovana an’ireny fahagagana natao tao aminareo ireny, dia ho efa ela ry zareo no nibebaka ka nipetraka nanao akanjo gony sy nihosina lavenona.', '“hahita loza ianao, ry korazina! hahita loza ianao, ry betsaida! raha tany tyro sy sidona mantsy no nanaovana an’ireny fahagagana natao tao aminareo ireny, dia ho efa ela ry zareo no nibebaka ka nipetraka nanao akanjo gony sy nihosina lavenona.'),
  ('6ab25c62fdc3b982fcaf5785', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.932Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.932Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 10, 12, 'Lazaiko aminareo fa ho mora kokoa ny hanjo an’i Sodoma amin’izany andro izany, noho ny hanjo an’izany tanàna izany.', 'lazaiko aminareo fa ho mora kokoa ny hanjo an’i sodoma amin’izany andro izany, noho ny hanjo an’izany tanàna izany.'),
  ('6ab25c62fdc3b982fcaf5788', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.932Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.932Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 10, 15, 'Ary ianao, ry Kapernaomy, ianao ve dia hasandratra hatreny amin’ny lanitra? Hidina any amin’ny Fasana aza ianao!', 'ary ianao, ry kapernaomy, ianao ve dia hasandratra hatreny amin’ny lanitra? hidina any amin’ny fasana aza ianao!'),
  ('6ab25c62fdc3b982fcaf5782', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.932Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.932Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 10, 9, 'sitrano ny marary ao, ary lazao aminy hoe: ‘Efa manakaiky anareo ny Fanjakan’Andriamanitra.’', 'sitrano ny marary ao, ary lazao aminy hoe: ‘efa manakaiky anareo ny fanjakan’andriamanitra.’'),
  ('6ab25c62fdc3b982fcaf577e', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.932Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.932Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 10, 5, 'Ary ao amin’izay trano hidiranareo, dia mitenena aloha hoe: ‘Ho amin’ity trano ity anie ny fiadanana!’', 'ary ao amin’izay trano hidiranareo, dia mitenena aloha hoe: ‘ho amin’ity trano ity anie ny fiadanana!’'),
  ('6ab25c62fdc3b982fcaf57a1', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.932Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.932Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 10, 40, 'Fa i Marta kosa tsy nifantoka, satria nanao raharaha be dia be. Nanatona an’i Jesosy àry izy, dia niteny hoe: “Tompo ô, tsy mampaninona anao ve ny mahita ny rahavaviko mamela ahy irery hanao raharaha be hoatr’izao? Mba asaivo manampy ahy izy!”', 'fa i marta kosa tsy nifantoka, satria nanao raharaha be dia be. nanatona an’i jesosy àry izy, dia niteny hoe: “tompo ô, tsy mampaninona anao ve ny mahita ny rahavaviko mamela ahy irery hanao raharaha be hoatr’izao? mba asaivo manampy ahy izy!”'),
  ('6ab25c62fdc3b982fcaf5798', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.932Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.932Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 10, 31, 'Ary nisy mpisorona sendra nidina tamin’ilay lalana. Rehefa nahita azy anefa ilay mpisorona, dia niampita ary ny lalany ihany no nizorany.', 'ary nisy mpisorona sendra nidina tamin’ilay lalana. rehefa nahita azy anefa ilay mpisorona, dia niampita ary ny lalany ihany no nizorany.'),
  ('6ab25c62fdc3b982fcaf578e', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.932Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.932Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 10, 21, 'Tamin’izay ora izay indrindra, dia faly be i Jesosy sady feno fanahy masina ka niteny hoe: “Ry Ray, Tompon’ny lanitra sy ny tany ô, midera anao eto imason’ny olona rehetra aho, satria efa nafeninao tsara tamin’ny hendry sy ny mahira-tsaina ireny zavatra ireny, fa nampahafantarinao tamin’ny ankizikely kosa. Izany mihitsy mantsy no sitraponao, Ray ô!', 'tamin’izay ora izay indrindra, dia faly be i jesosy sady feno fanahy masina ka niteny hoe: “ry ray, tompon’ny lanitra sy ny tany ô, midera anao eto imason’ny olona rehetra aho, satria efa nafeninao tsara tamin’ny hendry sy ny mahira-tsaina ireny zavatra ireny, fa nampahafantarinao tamin’ny ankizikely kosa. izany mihitsy mantsy no sitraponao, ray ô!'),
  ('6ab25c62fdc3b982fcaf578a', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.932Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.932Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 10, 17, 'Faly ireo mpianatra 70 rehefa niverina, ka niteny hoe: “Tompo ô, na ny demonia aza manaiky anay rehefa mampiasa ny anaranao izahay.”', 'faly ireo mpianatra 70 rehefa niverina, ka niteny hoe: “tompo ô, na ny demonia aza manaiky anay rehefa mampiasa ny anaranao izahay.”'),
  ('6ab25c62fdc3b982fcaf579e', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.932Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.932Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 10, 37, 'Hoy izy: “Ilay niantra azy.” Dia hoy i Jesosy: “Mandehana àry, dia mba manaova hoatr’izany koa.”', 'hoy izy: “ilay niantra azy.” dia hoy i jesosy: “mandehana àry, dia mba manaova hoatr’izany koa.”'),
  ('6ab25c62fdc3b982fcaf5797', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.932Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.932Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 10, 30, 'Dia namaly i Jesosy hoe: “Nisy lehilahy iray nidina avy tany Jerosalema ho any Jeriko. Ary notafihin’ny jiolahy izy, ka nendahany sady novonovonoiny, dia nilaozany teo rehefa saika maty.', 'dia namaly i jesosy hoe: “nisy lehilahy iray nidina avy tany jerosalema ho any jeriko. ary notafihin’ny jiolahy izy, ka nendahany sady novonovonoiny, dia nilaozany teo rehefa saika maty.'),
  ('6ab25c62fdc3b982fcaf57a2', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.932Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.932Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 10, 41, 'Fa namaly azy ny Tompo hoe: “Marta a! Marta a! Be loatra ny zavatra mampiasa loha anao sady enjehinao daholo ity rehetra ity.', 'fa namaly azy ny tompo hoe: “marta a! marta a! be loatra ny zavatra mampiasa loha anao sady enjehinao daholo ity rehetra ity.'),
  ('6ab25c62fdc3b982fcaf579c', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.932Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.932Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 10, 35, 'Namoaka roa denaria izy ny ampitson’iny, dia nomeny an’ilay tompon’ny tranombahiny. Ary hoy izy: ‘Karakarao izy, ary raha mihoatra an’ireto ny laninao, na ohatrinona na ohatrinona, dia haloako rehefa miverina aho.’', 'namoaka roa denaria izy ny ampitson’iny, dia nomeny an’ilay tompon’ny tranombahiny. ary hoy izy: ‘karakarao izy, ary raha mihoatra an’ireto ny laninao, na ohatrinona na ohatrinona, dia haloako rehefa miverina aho.’'),
  ('6ab25c62fdc3b982fcaf57a0', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.932Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.932Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 10, 39, 'Nanana rahavavy atao hoe Maria koa izy. Nipetraka teo an-tongotry ny Tompo i Maria, ka nihaino an’izay nolazainy teo foana.', 'nanana rahavavy atao hoe maria koa izy. nipetraka teo an-tongotry ny tompo i maria, ka nihaino an’izay nolazainy teo foana.'),
  ('6ab25c62fdc3b982fcaf5793', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.932Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.932Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 10, 26, 'Dia hoy i Jesosy: “Inona no voasoratra ao amin’ny Lalàna? Ahoana no fahazoanao azy?”', 'dia hoy i jesosy: “inona no voasoratra ao amin’ny lalàna? ahoana no fahazoanao azy?”'),
  ('6ab25c62fdc3b982fcaf578c', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.932Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.932Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 10, 19, 'Efa nomeko fahefana hanitsaka bibilava sy maingoka ianareo, ka handresy ny hery rehetra ananan’ilay fahavalo, ary tsy hisy haninona anareo mihitsy.', 'efa nomeko fahefana hanitsaka bibilava sy maingoka ianareo, ka handresy ny hery rehetra ananan’ilay fahavalo, ary tsy hisy haninona anareo mihitsy.'),
  ('6ab25c62fdc3b982fcaf5784', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.932Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.932Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 10, 11, '‘Na ny vovoky ny tanànanareo izay manaraka ny tongotray aza, dia fafanay mba hiampanga anareo. Fantaro anefa fa manakaiky ny Fanjakan’Andriamanitra.’', '‘na ny vovoky ny tanànanareo izay manaraka ny tongotray aza, dia fafanay mba hiampanga anareo. fantaro anefa fa manakaiky ny fanjakan’andriamanitra.’'),
  ('6ab25c62fdc3b982fcaf577d', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.932Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.932Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 10, 4, 'Aza mitondra kitapom-bola na kitapom-batsy na kapa, ary aza miarahaba olona eny an-dalana.', 'aza mitondra kitapom-bola na kitapom-batsy na kapa, ary aza miarahaba olona eny an-dalana.'),
  ('6ab25c62fdc3b982fcaf577b', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.932Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.932Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 10, 2, 'Dia hoy izy tamin’izy ireo: “Tena be ny vokatra, fa ny mpiasa no vitsy. Iangavio àry ny Tompon’ny vokatra haniraka mpiasa hijinja ny vokatra.', 'dia hoy izy tamin’izy ireo: “tena be ny vokatra, fa ny mpiasa no vitsy. iangavio àry ny tompon’ny vokatra haniraka mpiasa hijinja ny vokatra.'),
  ('6ab25c62fdc3b982fcaf578f', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.932Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.932Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 10, 22, 'Efa nomen’ny Raiko ahy daholo ny zava-drehetra. Tsy misy mahafantatra ny Zanaka afa-tsy ny Ray, ary tsy misy mahafantatra ny Ray afa-tsy ny Zanaka sy izay tian’ny Zanaka hampahafantarina ny momba ny Ray.”', 'efa nomen’ny raiko ahy daholo ny zava-drehetra. tsy misy mahafantatra ny zanaka afa-tsy ny ray, ary tsy misy mahafantatra ny ray afa-tsy ny zanaka sy izay tian’ny zanaka hampahafantarina ny momba ny ray.”'),
  ('6ab25c62fdc3b982fcaf577f', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.932Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.932Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 10, 6, 'Raha misy zanaky ny fiadanana ao, dia hijanona ao aminy ny fiadananareo, fa raha tsy izany kosa, dia hiverina aminareo izany.', 'raha misy zanaky ny fiadanana ao, dia hijanona ao aminy ny fiadananareo, fa raha tsy izany kosa, dia hiverina aminareo izany.'),
  ('6ab25c62fdc3b982fcaf577a', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.932Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.932Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 10, 1, 'Nanendry mpianatra 70 koa ny Tompo taorian’izany, ka naniraka azy ireo tsiroaroa hialoha azy any amin’ny tanàna sy ny toerana rehetra izay mbola halehany.', 'nanendry mpianatra 70 koa ny tompo taorian’izany, ka naniraka azy ireo tsiroaroa hialoha azy any amin’ny tanàna sy ny toerana rehetra izay mbola halehany.'),
  ('6ab25c62fdc3b982fcaf5795', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.932Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.932Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 10, 28, 'Dia hoy i Jesosy: “Marina ny valin-teninao. Izany foana atao dia hahazo ny fiainana ianao.”', 'dia hoy i jesosy: “marina ny valin-teninao. izany foana atao dia hahazo ny fiainana ianao.”'),
  ('6ab25c62fdc3b982fcaf57a3', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.932Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.932Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 10, 42, 'Zavatra vitsivitsy ihany anefa no ilaina, na mety hoe iray monja aza. Fa i Maria no nifidy ny tsara kokoa, ka tsy halaina aminy izany.”', 'zavatra vitsivitsy ihany anefa no ilaina, na mety hoe iray monja aza. fa i maria no nifidy ny tsara kokoa, ka tsy halaina aminy izany.”'),
  ('6ab25c62fdc3b982fcaf5796', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.932Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.932Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 10, 29, 'Te hanaporofo anefa ilay lehilahy hoe olo-marina izy, ka hoy izy tamin’i Jesosy: “Fa iza marina moa no namako?”', 'te hanaporofo anefa ilay lehilahy hoe olo-marina izy, ka hoy izy tamin’i jesosy: “fa iza marina moa no namako?”'),
  ('6ab25c62fdc3b982fcaf5791', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.932Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.932Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 10, 24, 'Fa lazaiko aminareo fa be dia be ny mpaminany sy mpanjaka te hahita an’izay hitanareo fa tsy nahita, ary te haheno an’izay henonareo fa tsy naheno.”', 'fa lazaiko aminareo fa be dia be ny mpaminany sy mpanjaka te hahita an’izay hitanareo fa tsy nahita, ary te haheno an’izay henonareo fa tsy naheno.”'),
  ('6ab25c62fdc3b982fcaf578d', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.932Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.932Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 10, 20, 'Na izany aza, dia aza mifaly satria hoe lasa manaiky anareo ny fanahy, fa mifalia kosa satria voasoratra any an-danitra ny anaranareo.”', 'na izany aza, dia aza mifaly satria hoe lasa manaiky anareo ny fanahy, fa mifalia kosa satria voasoratra any an-danitra ny anaranareo.”'),
  ('6ab25c62fdc3b982fcaf5789', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.932Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.932Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 10, 16, '“Izay mihaino anareo, dia mihaino ahy. Ary izay tsy manaiky anareo, dia tsy manaiky ahy. Ary izay tsy manaiky ahy, dia tsy manaiky an’Ilay naniraka ahy.”', '“izay mihaino anareo, dia mihaino ahy. ary izay tsy manaiky anareo, dia tsy manaiky ahy. ary izay tsy manaiky ahy, dia tsy manaiky an’ilay naniraka ahy.”'),
  ('6ab25c62fdc3b982fcaf5781', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.932Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:54.932Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 10, 8, '“Ary any amin’izay tanàna hidiranareo, ka mandray anareo ny olona ao, dia hano izay arosony anareo,', '“ary any amin’izay tanàna hidiranareo, ka mandray anareo ny olona ao, dia hano izay arosony anareo,'),
