  ('6ab25c639e1e37e2a69ff87c', '2026-09-22T10:45:55.764Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:55.764Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 11, 26, 'Dia lasa izy maka fanahy fito hafa ratsy noho izy. Dia miditra izy ireo ka mijanona ao. Koa ratsy noho ny tamin’ny voalohany ny hiafaran’ilay olona.”', 'dia lasa izy maka fanahy fito hafa ratsy noho izy. dia miditra izy ireo ka mijanona ao. koa ratsy noho ny tamin’ny voalohany ny hiafaran’ilay olona.”'),
