  ('6ab25c639e1e37e2a69ff865', '2026-09-22T10:45:55.764Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:55.764Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 11, 3, 'Omeo anay isan’andro izay sakafo ilainay isan’andro.', 'omeo anay isan’andro izay sakafo ilainay isan’andro.'),
  ('6ab25c639e1e37e2a69ff895', '2026-09-22T10:45:55.764Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:55.764Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 11, 51, 'nanomboka tamin’ny ran’i Abela ka hatramin’ny ran’i Zakaria, izay novonoina teo anelanelan’ny alitara sy ny tranon’Andriamanitra.’ Lazaiko aminareo tokoa fa hatao tompon’ andraikitra amin’izany ity taranaka ity.', 'nanomboka tamin’ny ran’i abela ka hatramin’ny ran’i zakaria, izay novonoina teo anelanelan’ny alitara sy ny tranon’andriamanitra.’ lazaiko aminareo tokoa fa hatao tompon’ andraikitra amin’izany ity taranaka ity.'),
  ('6ab25c639e1e37e2a69ff88b', '2026-09-22T10:45:55.764Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:55.764Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 11, 41, 'Fa izay ao am-ponareo no omeo mba hiantrana ny mahantra, dia hadio ny zava-drehetra momba anareo.', 'fa izay ao am-ponareo no omeo mba hiantrana ny mahantra, dia hadio ny zava-drehetra momba anareo.'),
  ('6ab25c639e1e37e2a69ff883', '2026-09-22T10:45:55.764Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:55.764Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 11, 33, 'Rehefa mandrehitra jiro ny olona, dia tsy mametraka an’ilay izy any amin’ny takona na ao ambany sobika, fa eo amin’ny fitoeran-jiro, mba hahita hazavana ny olona miditra ao amin’ilay efitra.', 'rehefa mandrehitra jiro ny olona, dia tsy mametraka an’ilay izy any amin’ny takona na ao ambany sobika, fa eo amin’ny fitoeran-jiro, mba hahita hazavana ny olona miditra ao amin’ilay efitra.'),
  ('6ab25c639e1e37e2a69ff87f', '2026-09-22T10:45:55.764Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:55.764Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 11, 29, 'Ary nihamaro ny vahoaka nitangorona, ka nanomboka niteny izy hoe: “Taranaka ratsy fanahy ity taranaka ity. Mitady famantarana izy, nefa tsy hisy famantarana homena azy, afa-tsy ilay famantarana ny amin’i Jona.', 'ary nihamaro ny vahoaka nitangorona, ka nanomboka niteny izy hoe: “taranaka ratsy fanahy ity taranaka ity. mitady famantarana izy, nefa tsy hisy famantarana homena azy, afa-tsy ilay famantarana ny amin’i jona.'),
  ('6ab25c639e1e37e2a69ff87e', '2026-09-22T10:45:55.764Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:55.764Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 11, 28, 'Fa hoy izy: “Tsy izany mihitsy, fa izay mihaino ny tenin’Andriamanitra ka mankatò an’izany no sambatra!”', 'fa hoy izy: “tsy izany mihitsy, fa izay mihaino ny tenin’andriamanitra ka mankatò an’izany no sambatra!”'),
  ('6ab25c639e1e37e2a69ff871', '2026-09-22T10:45:55.764Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:55.764Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 11, 15, 'Hoy anefa ny olona sasany: “I Belzeboba lehiben’ny demonia no ahavitany mamoaka demonia.”', 'hoy anefa ny olona sasany: “i belzeboba lehiben’ny demonia no ahavitany mamoaka demonia.”'),
  ('6ab25c639e1e37e2a69ff86f', '2026-09-22T10:45:55.764Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:55.764Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 11, 13, 'Koa raha ianareo, na dia ratsy fanahy aza, mahalala manome zavatra tsara ho an’ny zanakareo, mainka fa ilay Ray any an-danitra! Tena hanome ny fanahy masina ho an’izay mangataka aminy izy.”', 'koa raha ianareo, na dia ratsy fanahy aza, mahalala manome zavatra tsara ho an’ny zanakareo, mainka fa ilay ray any an-danitra! tena hanome ny fanahy masina ho an’izay mangataka aminy izy.”'),
  ('6ab25c639e1e37e2a69ff867', '2026-09-22T10:45:55.764Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:55.764Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 11, 5, 'Hoy izy avy eo: “Andao hatao hoe mana-namana ny iray aminareo, ary mandeha mankany amin’ilay namany amin’ny misasakalina, dia miteny aminy hoe: ‘Mba ampisambory mofo telo aho,', 'hoy izy avy eo: “andao hatao hoe mana-namana ny iray aminareo, ary mandeha mankany amin’ilay namany amin’ny misasakalina, dia miteny aminy hoe: ‘mba ampisambory mofo telo aho,'),
  ('6ab25c639e1e37e2a69ff896', '2026-09-22T10:45:55.764Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:55.764Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 11, 52, '“Hahita loza ianareo mahay Lalàna, satria nalainareo ny lakilen’ny fahalalana. Ianareo tsy niditra, nefa izay handeha hiditra tadiavinareo hosakanana!”', '“hahita loza ianareo mahay lalàna, satria nalainareo ny lakilen’ny fahalalana. ianareo tsy niditra, nefa izay handeha hiditra tadiavinareo hosakanana!”'),
  ('6ab25c639e1e37e2a69ff88d', '2026-09-22T10:45:55.764Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:55.764Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 11, 43, 'Hahita loza ianareo Fariseo, satria tianareo ny toerana eny aloha ao amin’ny synagoga sy ny hoarahabaina eny an-tsena!', 'hahita loza ianareo fariseo, satria tianareo ny toerana eny aloha ao amin’ny synagoga sy ny hoarahabaina eny an-tsena!'),
  ('6ab25c639e1e37e2a69ff88c', '2026-09-22T10:45:55.764Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:55.764Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 11, 42, 'Fa hahita loza ianareo Fariseo, satria manome ny ampahafolon’ny solila sy ny rota ary ny zavamaniry mani-pofona hafa rehetra ianareo, nefa tsy raharahianareo ny rariny sy ny fitiavana an’Andriamanitra! Tsy maintsy omenareo ny ampahafolon’ireny, nefa tsy maintsy ataonareo koa ireo zavatra hafa ireo.', 'fa hahita loza ianareo fariseo, satria manome ny ampahafolon’ny solila sy ny rota ary ny zavamaniry mani-pofona hafa rehetra ianareo, nefa tsy raharahianareo ny rariny sy ny fitiavana an’andriamanitra! tsy maintsy omenareo ny ampahafolon’ireny, nefa tsy maintsy ataonareo koa ireo zavatra hafa ireo.'),
  ('6ab25c639e1e37e2a69ff880', '2026-09-22T10:45:55.764Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:55.764Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 11, 30, 'Lasa famantarana ho an’ny mponin’i Ninive mantsy i Jona, ka ho toy izany koa ny Zanak’olona ho an’ity taranaka ity.', 'lasa famantarana ho an’ny mponin’i ninive mantsy i jona, ka ho toy izany koa ny zanak’olona ho an’ity taranaka ity.'),
  ('6ab25c639e1e37e2a69ff86b', '2026-09-22T10:45:55.764Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:55.764Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 11, 9, 'Izao àry ny teniko aminareo: Mangataha foana, dia homena ianareo. Mitadiava foana, dia hahita ianareo. Dondòny foana, dia hovohana ianareo.', 'izao àry ny teniko aminareo: mangataha foana, dia homena ianareo. mitadiava foana, dia hahita ianareo. dondòny foana, dia hovohana ianareo.'),
  ('6ab25c639e1e37e2a69ff892', '2026-09-22T10:45:55.764Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:55.764Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 11, 48, 'Vavolombelona mahafantatra an’izay nataon’ny razambenareo tokoa ianareo, nefa mankasitraka an’izany. Ireny mantsy no namono ny mpaminany, fa ianareo kosa no manorina ny fasany.', 'vavolombelona mahafantatra an’izay nataon’ny razambenareo tokoa ianareo, nefa mankasitraka an’izany. ireny mantsy no namono ny mpaminany, fa ianareo kosa no manorina ny fasany.'),
  ('6ab25c639e1e37e2a69ff884', '2026-09-22T10:45:55.764Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:55.764Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 11, 34, 'Ny masonao no jiron’ny vatanao. Koa raha mifantoka tsara ny masonao, dia hazava tsara ny tenanao manontolo. Fa raha mitsiriritra kosa ny masonao, dia ho maizina ny tenanao.', 'ny masonao no jiron’ny vatanao. koa raha mifantoka tsara ny masonao, dia hazava tsara ny tenanao manontolo. fa raha mitsiriritra kosa ny masonao, dia ho maizina ny tenanao.'),
  ('6ab25c639e1e37e2a69ff86c', '2026-09-22T10:45:55.764Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:55.764Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 11, 10, 'Fa izay mangataka no mahazo, ary izay mitady no mahita, ary izay mandondòna no hovohana.', 'fa izay mangataka no mahazo, ary izay mitady no mahita, ary izay mandondòna no hovohana.'),
  ('6ab25c639e1e37e2a69ff88f', '2026-09-22T10:45:55.764Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:55.764Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 11, 45, 'Hoy ny navalin’ny olona iray anisan’ireo nahay Lalàna: “Mpampianatra ô, manala baraka anay koa izany teninao izany!”', 'hoy ny navalin’ny olona iray anisan’ireo nahay lalàna: “mpampianatra ô, manala baraka anay koa izany teninao izany!”'),
  ('6ab25c639e1e37e2a69ff887', '2026-09-22T10:45:55.764Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:55.764Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 11, 37, 'Nangataka azy mba hiara-misakafo aminy ny Fariseo iray, rehefa avy niteny an’izany izy. Dia niditra izy, ary naka toerana teo amin’ny latabatra.', 'nangataka azy mba hiara-misakafo aminy ny fariseo iray, rehefa avy niteny an’izany izy. dia niditra izy, ary naka toerana teo amin’ny latabatra.'),
  ('6ab25c639e1e37e2a69ff88a', '2026-09-22T10:45:55.764Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:55.764Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 11, 40, 'Ry tsy misaina, tsy izay nanao ny anatiny ihany ve no nanao ny ivelany?', 'ry tsy misaina, tsy izay nanao ny anatiny ihany ve no nanao ny ivelany?');
INSERT INTO "bible_verses" ("id", "created_date", "updated_date", "created_by_id", "created_by", "translation", "book", "bookOrder", "chapter", "verse", "text", "normalizedText") VALUES
  ('6ab25c639e1e37e2a69ff894', '2026-09-22T10:45:55.764Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:55.764Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 11, 50, 'mba ho ity taranaka ity no ho tompon’andraikitra amin’ny ran’ny mpaminany rehetra nalatsaka hatramin’ny nanorenana izao tontolo izao,', 'mba ho ity taranaka ity no ho tompon’andraikitra amin’ny ran’ny mpaminany rehetra nalatsaka hatramin’ny nanorenana izao tontolo izao,'),
  ('6ab25c639e1e37e2a69ff890', '2026-09-22T10:45:55.764Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:55.764Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 11, 46, 'Fa hoy i Jesosy: “Hahita loza koa ianareo mahay Lalàna, satria ampitondrainareo entana sarotra entina ny olona, nefa ianareo tsy mikasika an’izany na dia amin’ny rantsantananareo anankiray aza!', 'fa hoy i jesosy: “hahita loza koa ianareo mahay lalàna, satria ampitondrainareo entana sarotra entina ny olona, nefa ianareo tsy mikasika an’izany na dia amin’ny rantsantananareo anankiray aza!'),
  ('6ab25c639e1e37e2a69ff874', '2026-09-22T10:45:55.764Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:55.764Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 11, 18, 'Hoatr’izany koa fa raha miady an-trano i Satana, dia ahoana no haharetan’ny fanjakany? Milaza mantsy ianareo hoe i Belzeboba no ahavitako mamoaka demonia.', 'hoatr’izany koa fa raha miady an-trano i satana, dia ahoana no haharetan’ny fanjakany? milaza mantsy ianareo hoe i belzeboba no ahavitako mamoaka demonia.'),
  ('6ab25c639e1e37e2a69ff873', '2026-09-22T10:45:55.764Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:55.764Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 11, 17, 'Fantatr’i Jesosy ny tao an-tsain’izy ireo, ka hoy izy: “Hirodana izay fanjakana miady an-trano, ary ho rava izay fianakaviana miady an-trano.', 'fantatr’i jesosy ny tao an-tsain’izy ireo, ka hoy izy: “hirodana izay fanjakana miady an-trano, ary ho rava izay fianakaviana miady an-trano.'),
  ('6ab25c639e1e37e2a69ff868', '2026-09-22T10:45:55.764Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:55.764Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 11, 6, 'fa misy namako vao tonga avy nanao dia lavitra ao amiko, nefa tsy manana haroso azy aho.’', 'fa misy namako vao tonga avy nanao dia lavitra ao amiko, nefa tsy manana haroso azy aho.’'),
  ('6ab25c639e1e37e2a69ff882', '2026-09-22T10:45:55.764Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:55.764Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 11, 32, 'Hiaraka hitsangana amin’ity taranaka ity ny mponin’i Ninive amin’ny Andro Fitsarana ka hanameloka azy. Nibebaka mantsy izy ireo rehefa nitory taminy i Jona. Misy lehibe noho i Jona anefa eto.', 'hiaraka hitsangana amin’ity taranaka ity ny mponin’i ninive amin’ny andro fitsarana ka hanameloka azy. nibebaka mantsy izy ireo rehefa nitory taminy i jona. misy lehibe noho i jona anefa eto.'),
  ('6ab25c639e1e37e2a69ff879', '2026-09-22T10:45:55.764Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:55.764Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 11, 23, 'Izay tsy manohana ahy dia manohitra ahy, ary izay tsy miara-manangona amiko dia manaparitaka.', 'izay tsy manohana ahy dia manohitra ahy, ary izay tsy miara-manangona amiko dia manaparitaka.'),
  ('6ab25c639e1e37e2a69ff877', '2026-09-22T10:45:55.764Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:55.764Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 11, 21, 'Raha matanjaka sy mirongo fiadiana ny lehilahy iray miambina ny lapany, dia ho voaro ny fananany.', 'raha matanjaka sy mirongo fiadiana ny lehilahy iray miambina ny lapany, dia ho voaro ny fananany.'),
  ('6ab25c639e1e37e2a69ff86a', '2026-09-22T10:45:55.764Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:55.764Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 11, 8, 'Lazaiko aminareo fa na tsy hitsangana hanome zavatra azy aza izy, amin’ny maha mpinamana azy ireo, dia hitsangana ihany ka hanome an’izay ilainy, satria be fikirizana ilay namany.', 'lazaiko aminareo fa na tsy hitsangana hanome zavatra azy aza izy, amin’ny maha mpinamana azy ireo, dia hitsangana ihany ka hanome an’izay ilainy, satria be fikirizana ilay namany.'),
  ('6ab25c639e1e37e2a69ff863', '2026-09-22T10:45:55.764Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:55.764Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 11, 1, 'Nivavaka tao amin’ny toerana iray i Jesosy, indray mandeha. Ary rehefa avy nivavaka izy, dia hoy ny mpianany anankiray: “Tompo ô, mba ampianaro mivavaka izahay, hoatran’ny nampianaran’i Jaona ny mpianany.”', 'nivavaka tao amin’ny toerana iray i jesosy, indray mandeha. ary rehefa avy nivavaka izy, dia hoy ny mpianany anankiray: “tompo ô, mba ampianaro mivavaka izahay, hoatran’ny nampianaran’i jaona ny mpianany.”'),
  ('6ab25c639e1e37e2a69ff881', '2026-09-22T10:45:55.764Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:55.764Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 11, 31, 'Hiaraka hatsangana amin’ny olona anisan’ity taranaka ity ny mpanjakavavin’ny atsimo amin’ny Andro Fitsarana ka hanameloka an’ireo. Avy any amin’ny faran’ny tany mantsy izy no tonga mba hihaino ny fahendren’i Solomona. Misy lehibe noho i Solomona anefa eto.', 'hiaraka hatsangana amin’ny olona anisan’ity taranaka ity ny mpanjakavavin’ny atsimo amin’ny andro fitsarana ka hanameloka an’ireo. avy any amin’ny faran’ny tany mantsy izy no tonga mba hihaino ny fahendren’i solomona. misy lehibe noho i solomona anefa eto.'),
  ('6ab25c639e1e37e2a69ff87b', '2026-09-22T10:45:55.764Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:55.764Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 11, 25, 'Rehefa tonga izy, dia hitany fa efa voafafa madio sady voaravaka ilay trano.', 'rehefa tonga izy, dia hitany fa efa voafafa madio sady voaravaka ilay trano.'),
  ('6ab25c639e1e37e2a69ff875', '2026-09-22T10:45:55.764Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:55.764Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 11, 19, 'Raha amin’ny alalan’i Belzeboba no amoahako demonia, dia amin’ny alalan’iza àry no amoahan’ny zanakareo azy? Noho izany, dia ny zanakareo no hitsara anareo.', 'raha amin’ny alalan’i belzeboba no amoahako demonia, dia amin’ny alalan’iza àry no amoahan’ny zanakareo azy? noho izany, dia ny zanakareo no hitsara anareo.'),
  ('6ab25c639e1e37e2a69ff897', '2026-09-22T10:45:55.764Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:55.764Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 11, 53, 'Koa rehefa niala tao izy, dia nitambaran’ny mpanora-dalàna sy ny Fariseo, ary nototofan’izy ireo fanontaniana hafa be dia be.', 'koa rehefa niala tao izy, dia nitambaran’ny mpanora-dalàna sy ny fariseo, ary nototofan’izy ireo fanontaniana hafa be dia be.'),
  ('6ab25c639e1e37e2a69ff891', '2026-09-22T10:45:55.764Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:55.764Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 11, 47, '“Hahita loza ianareo, satria manorina ny fasan’ny mpaminany, nefa ny razambenareo no namono azy ireny!', '“hahita loza ianareo, satria manorina ny fasan’ny mpaminany, nefa ny razambenareo no namono azy ireny!'),
  ('6ab25c639e1e37e2a69ff885', '2026-09-22T10:45:55.764Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:55.764Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 11, 35, 'Mitandrema àry sao dia lasa haizina ny hazavana ao anatinao.', 'mitandrema àry sao dia lasa haizina ny hazavana ao anatinao.'),
  ('6ab25c639e1e37e2a69ff87a', '2026-09-22T10:45:55.764Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:55.764Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 11, 24, '“Rehefa mivoaka avy ao amin’ny olona iray ny fanahy maloto, dia mamakivaky toerana karakaina mba hitady toerana hialana sasatra. Ary rehefa tsy mahita izy, dia miteny hoe: ‘Andeha hiverina any amin’ilay trano nialako aho.’', '“rehefa mivoaka avy ao amin’ny olona iray ny fanahy maloto, dia mamakivaky toerana karakaina mba hitady toerana hialana sasatra. ary rehefa tsy mahita izy, dia miteny hoe: ‘andeha hiverina any amin’ilay trano nialako aho.’'),
  ('6ab25c639e1e37e2a69ff86e', '2026-09-22T10:45:55.764Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:55.764Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 11, 12, 'Na raha angatahan’ny zanany atody no hanome azy maingoka?', 'na raha angatahan’ny zanany atody no hanome azy maingoka?'),
  ('6ab25c639e1e37e2a69ff88e', '2026-09-22T10:45:55.764Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:55.764Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 11, 44, 'Hahita loza ianareo, satria hoatran’ny fasana tsy hita tsara ka hitsahin’ny olona nefa tsy fantany akory!”', 'hahita loza ianareo, satria hoatran’ny fasana tsy hita tsara ka hitsahin’ny olona nefa tsy fantany akory!”'),
  ('6ab25c639e1e37e2a69ff886', '2026-09-22T10:45:55.764Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:55.764Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 11, 36, 'Koa raha mazava ny tenanao manontolo ka tsy misy maizina mihitsy, dia hazava toy ny hoe tarafin’ny jiro ny tenanao manontolo.”', 'koa raha mazava ny tenanao manontolo ka tsy misy maizina mihitsy, dia hazava toy ny hoe tarafin’ny jiro ny tenanao manontolo.”'),
  ('6ab25c639e1e37e2a69ff878', '2026-09-22T10:45:55.764Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:55.764Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 11, 22, 'Raha tonga manafika azy anefa ny olona iray matanjaka noho izy ka mandresy azy, dia ho lasan’io daholo ny fitaovam-piadiana rehetra nitokisany, ka hozarazarain’io izay zavatra nalainy teny aminy.', 'raha tonga manafika azy anefa ny olona iray matanjaka noho izy ka mandresy azy, dia ho lasan’io daholo ny fitaovam-piadiana rehetra nitokisany, ka hozarazarain’io izay zavatra nalainy teny aminy.'),
  ('6ab25c639e1e37e2a69ff86d', '2026-09-22T10:45:55.764Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:55.764Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 11, 11, 'Fa ray iza eo aminareo moa raha angatahan’ny zanany trondro, no hanome azy bibilava fa tsy trondro?', 'fa ray iza eo aminareo moa raha angatahan’ny zanany trondro, no hanome azy bibilava fa tsy trondro?'),
  ('6ab25c639e1e37e2a69ff869', '2026-09-22T10:45:55.764Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:55.764Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 11, 7, 'Mamaly avy ao an-trano anefa ilay iray hoe: ‘Aza helingelenina intsony aho! Efa mihidy ny varavarana, sady efa miaraka amiko eto am-pandriana ny zanako kely, dia tsy afaka mitsangana manome zavatra anao aho.’', 'mamaly avy ao an-trano anefa ilay iray hoe: ‘aza helingelenina intsony aho! efa mihidy ny varavarana, sady efa miaraka amiko eto am-pandriana ny zanako kely, dia tsy afaka mitsangana manome zavatra anao aho.’'),
  ('6ab25c639e1e37e2a69ff893', '2026-09-22T10:45:55.764Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:55.764Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 11, 49, 'Izany koa no nahatonga an’ilay Andriamanitra hendry hilaza hoe: ‘Haniraka mpaminany sy apostoly any amin’izy ireo aho. Hisy amin’izy ireny hovonoiny sy henjehiny,', 'izany koa no nahatonga an’ilay andriamanitra hendry hilaza hoe: ‘haniraka mpaminany sy apostoly any amin’izy ireo aho. hisy amin’izy ireny hovonoiny sy henjehiny,'),
  ('6ab25c639e1e37e2a69ff889', '2026-09-22T10:45:55.764Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:55.764Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 11, 39, 'Fa hoy ny Tompo taminy: “Hoatran’ny kaopy sy vilia madio ivelany ianareo Fariseo, nefa ao anatinareo ianareo tsy mety afa-po sady ratsy fanahy.', 'fa hoy ny tompo taminy: “hoatran’ny kaopy sy vilia madio ivelany ianareo fariseo, nefa ao anatinareo ianareo tsy mety afa-po sady ratsy fanahy.'),
  ('6ab25c639e1e37e2a69ff888', '2026-09-22T10:45:55.764Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:55.764Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 11, 38, 'Gaga anefa ilay Fariseo rehefa nahita fa tsy nisasa izy talohan’ny sakafo.', 'gaga anefa ilay fariseo rehefa nahita fa tsy nisasa izy talohan’ny sakafo.'),
  ('6ab25c639e1e37e2a69ff876', '2026-09-22T10:45:55.764Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:55.764Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 11, 20, 'Fa raha ny rantsantanan’Andriamanitra kosa no amoahako demonia, dia efa tonga ny Fanjakan’Andriamanitra nefa tsy fantatrareo akory.', 'fa raha ny rantsantanan’andriamanitra kosa no amoahako demonia, dia efa tonga ny fanjakan’andriamanitra nefa tsy fantatrareo akory.'),
  ('6ab25c639e1e37e2a69ff864', '2026-09-22T10:45:55.764Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:55.764Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 11, 2, 'Koa niteny tamin’izy ireo izy hoe: “Izao àry lazaina rehefa mivavaka ianareo: ‘Ray ô, hohamasinina anie ny anaranao! Ho tonga anie ny Fanjakanao!', 'koa niteny tamin’izy ireo izy hoe: “izao àry lazaina rehefa mivavaka ianareo: ‘ray ô, hohamasinina anie ny anaranao! ho tonga anie ny fanjakanao!'),
  ('6ab25c643777ec846fff9ef7', '2026-09-22T10:45:56.443Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:56.443Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 12, 20, 'Fa hoy Andriamanitra taminy: ‘Ry tsy misaina, hisy hamono ianao anio alina, koa ho an’iza ireo zavatra nangoninao?’', 'fa hoy andriamanitra taminy: ‘ry tsy misaina, hisy hamono ianao anio alina, koa ho an’iza ireo zavatra nangoninao?’'),
  ('6ab25c643777ec846fff9eee', '2026-09-22T10:45:56.443Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:56.443Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 12, 11, 'Rehefa entin’ny olona eo anatrehan’ny vahoaka sy ny mpitondra fanjakana ary ny manam-pahefana ianareo, dia aza manahy momba an’izay holazainareo mba hiarovan-tena na ny fomba hilazanareo an’izany na izay hoteneninareo.', 'rehefa entin’ny olona eo anatrehan’ny vahoaka sy ny mpitondra fanjakana ary ny manam-pahefana ianareo, dia aza manahy momba an’izay holazainareo mba hiarovan-tena na ny fomba hilazanareo an’izany na izay hoteneninareo.'),
  ('6ab25c643777ec846fff9ee7', '2026-09-22T10:45:56.443Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:56.443Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 12, 4, 'Izao koa no lazaiko aminareo namako: Aza matahotra an’izay mahavita mamono anareo ho faty, nefa avy eo tsy mahavita manao mihoatra noho izany akory.', 'izao koa no lazaiko aminareo namako: aza matahotra an’izay mahavita mamono anareo ho faty, nefa avy eo tsy mahavita manao mihoatra noho izany akory.'),
  ('6ab25c643777ec846fff9ee6', '2026-09-22T10:45:56.443Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:56.443Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 12, 3, 'Ho re ao amin’ny mazava àry izay lazainareo ao amin’ny maizina, ary hotorina eny an-tampon-trano izay bitsibitsihinareo ao amin’ny efitranonareo.', 'ho re ao amin’ny mazava àry izay lazainareo ao amin’ny maizina, ary hotorina eny an-tampon-trano izay bitsibitsihinareo ao amin’ny efitranonareo.'),
  ('6ab25c643777ec846fff9ee4', '2026-09-22T10:45:56.443Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:56.443Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 12, 1, 'Nandritra an’izany fotoana izany, dia vahoaka an’arivony no tafangona ka nifanitsa-kitro. Dia nanomboka niteny tamin’ny mpianany aloha izy hoe: “Mitandrema amin’ny lalivain’ny Fariseo, izany hoe ny fihatsarambelatsihiny.', 'nandritra an’izany fotoana izany, dia vahoaka an’arivony no tafangona ka nifanitsa-kitro. dia nanomboka niteny tamin’ny mpianany aloha izy hoe: “mitandrema amin’ny lalivain’ny fariseo, izany hoe ny fihatsarambelatsihiny.'),
  ('6ab25c643777ec846fff9f0c', '2026-09-22T10:45:56.443Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:56.443Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 12, 41, 'Dia hoy i Petera: “Tompo ô, izahay ihany ve no ilazanao an’izany fanoharana izany sa ny rehetra koa?”', 'dia hoy i petera: “tompo ô, izahay ihany ve no ilazanao an’izany fanoharana izany sa ny rehetra koa?”'),
  ('6ab25c643777ec846fff9ef5', '2026-09-22T10:45:56.443Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:56.443Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 12, 18, 'Dia hoy izy: ‘Izao no hataoko: Horavako ireo trano fitehirizam-bokatro, ary hanorina hafa lehibe kokoa aho, ka ao no hitehirizako ny vokatro rehetra sy ny fananako rehetra.', 'dia hoy izy: ‘izao no hataoko: horavako ireo trano fitehirizam-bokatro, ary hanorina hafa lehibe kokoa aho, ka ao no hitehirizako ny vokatro rehetra sy ny fananako rehetra.'),
  ('6ab25c643777ec846fff9f0a', '2026-09-22T10:45:56.443Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:56.443Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 12, 39, 'Tadidio anefa izao: Raha fantatry ny tompon-trano hoe amin’ny firy no ho tonga ny mpangalatra, dia tsy ho navelany hovakina ny tranony.', 'tadidio anefa izao: raha fantatry ny tompon-trano hoe amin’ny firy no ho tonga ny mpangalatra, dia tsy ho navelany hovakina ny tranony.'),
  ('6ab25c643777ec846fff9f07', '2026-09-22T10:45:56.443Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:56.443Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 12, 36, 'Tokony ho toy ny mpanompo miandry ny tompony hiverina avy any amin’ny fampakaram-bady ianareo. Amin’izay rehefa tonga ilay tompony ka mandondòna, dia hosokafan’izy ireo avy hatrany ny varavarana.', 'tokony ho toy ny mpanompo miandry ny tompony hiverina avy any amin’ny fampakaram-bady ianareo. amin’izay rehefa tonga ilay tompony ka mandondòna, dia hosokafan’izy ireo avy hatrany ny varavarana.'),
  ('6ab25c643777ec846fff9ef8', '2026-09-22T10:45:56.443Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:56.443Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 12, 21, 'Izany no hanjo ny olona manangona harena ho an’ny tenany, nefa tsy mba manankarena eo imason’Andriamanitra.”', 'izany no hanjo ny olona manangona harena ho an’ny tenany, nefa tsy mba manankarena eo imason’andriamanitra.”'),
