  ('6ab25c643777ec846fff9f04', '2026-09-22T10:45:56.443Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:56.443Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 12, 33, 'Amidio ny fanananareo ka manomeza zavatra mba hiantrana ny mahantra. Ary fitoeram-bola tsy mety tonta no ataovy fitoeram-bolanareo, dia harena any an-danitra tsy mety lany, satria tsy tongan’ny mpangalatra any sady tsy misy bibikely manimba.', 'amidio ny fanananareo ka manomeza zavatra mba hiantrana ny mahantra. ary fitoeram-bola tsy mety tonta no ataovy fitoeram-bolanareo, dia harena any an-danitra tsy mety lany, satria tsy tongan’ny mpangalatra any sady tsy misy bibikely manimba.'),
  ('6ab25c643777ec846fff9f02', '2026-09-22T10:45:56.443Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:56.443Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 12, 31, 'Katsaho foana kosa ny Fanjakany, dia homena anareo koa izany zavatra izany.', 'katsaho foana kosa ny fanjakany, dia homena anareo koa izany zavatra izany.'),
  ('6ab25c643777ec846fff9efc', '2026-09-22T10:45:56.443Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:56.443Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 12, 25, 'Iza aminareo no mahay manalava ny androm-piainany, na dia kely aza, rehefa manahy?', 'iza aminareo no mahay manalava ny androm-piainany, na dia kely aza, rehefa manahy?'),
  ('6ab25c643777ec846fff9ef4', '2026-09-22T10:45:56.443Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:56.443Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 12, 17, 'Nieritreritra àry izy hoe: ‘Tsy misy toerana itehirizako ny vokatro intsony, ka inona re no hataoko e?’', 'nieritreritra àry izy hoe: ‘tsy misy toerana itehirizako ny vokatro intsony, ka inona re no hataoko e?’'),
