  ('6ab25c643777ec846fff9f03', '2026-09-22T10:45:56.443Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:56.443Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 12, 32, '“Aza matahotra, ry ondry vitsy, fa sitraky ny Rainareo ny hanome anareo ny Fanjakana.', '“aza matahotra, ry ondry vitsy, fa sitraky ny rainareo ny hanome anareo ny fanjakana.'),
  ('6ab25c643777ec846fff9f01', '2026-09-22T10:45:56.443Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:56.443Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 12, 30, 'Izany rehetra izany mantsy no tena tadiavin’ny olona eo amin’izao tontolo izao, nefa fantatry ny Rainareo fa ilainareo izany.', 'izany rehetra izany mantsy no tena tadiavin’ny olona eo amin’izao tontolo izao, nefa fantatry ny rainareo fa ilainareo izany.'),
  ('6ab25c643777ec846fff9eff', '2026-09-22T10:45:56.443Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:56.443Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 12, 28, 'Koa raha ny zavamaniry any an-tsaha aza ataon’Andriamanitra mitafy tsara tarehy hoatr’izany, nefa androany ihany ireny no misy, fa rahampitso dia hatsipy any anaty afo, tsy mainka ve ianareo, ry kely finoana!', 'koa raha ny zavamaniry any an-tsaha aza ataon’andriamanitra mitafy tsara tarehy hoatr’izany, nefa androany ihany ireny no misy, fa rahampitso dia hatsipy any anaty afo, tsy mainka ve ianareo, ry kely finoana!'),
  ('6ab25c643777ec846fff9f0b', '2026-09-22T10:45:56.443Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:56.443Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 12, 40, 'Tokony ho vonona foana koa ianareo, satria amin’ny ora tsy ampoizinareo no ho avy ny Zanak’olona.”', 'tokony ho vonona foana koa ianareo, satria amin’ny ora tsy ampoizinareo no ho avy ny zanak’olona.”'),
  ('6ab25c643777ec846fff9f09', '2026-09-22T10:45:56.443Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:56.443Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 12, 38, 'Na amin’ny fiambenana faharoa ny tompony no tonga, na amin’ny fiambenana fahatelo aza, ka mahita azy ireo vonona, dia sambatra ireo mpanompo ireo!', 'na amin’ny fiambenana faharoa ny tompony no tonga, na amin’ny fiambenana fahatelo aza, ka mahita azy ireo vonona, dia sambatra ireo mpanompo ireo!'),
  ('6ab25c643777ec846fff9f00', '2026-09-22T10:45:56.443Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:56.443Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 12, 29, 'Koa aza miady saina intsony hoe inona no hohaninareo na hosotroinareo, ary aza be fanahiana intsony.', 'koa aza miady saina intsony hoe inona no hohaninareo na hosotroinareo, ary aza be fanahiana intsony.'),
  ('6ab25c643777ec846fff9efb', '2026-09-22T10:45:56.443Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:56.443Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 12, 24, 'Diniho ange ny goaika e! Tsy mamafy na mijinja ireny, sady tsy manana sompitra na trano fitehirizam-bokatra, nefa manome sakafo azy Andriamanitra. Tsy sarobidy lavitra noho ny vorona ve ianareo?', 'diniho ange ny goaika e! tsy mamafy na mijinja ireny, sady tsy manana sompitra na trano fitehirizam-bokatra, nefa manome sakafo azy andriamanitra. tsy sarobidy lavitra noho ny vorona ve ianareo?'),
  ('6ab25c643777ec846fff9eeb', '2026-09-22T10:45:56.443Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:56.443Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 12, 8, '“Lazaiko aminareo hoe: Izay manaiky eo imason’ny olona hoe mpianatro, dia mba heken’ny Zanak’olona koa eo anatrehan’ny anjelin’Andriamanitra.', '“lazaiko aminareo hoe: izay manaiky eo imason’ny olona hoe mpianatro, dia mba heken’ny zanak’olona koa eo anatrehan’ny anjelin’andriamanitra.'),
  ('6ab25c643777ec846fff9f12', '2026-09-22T10:45:56.443Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:56.443Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 12, 47, 'Ary ho be dia be ny kapoka ho azon’izany mpanompo izany, satria fantany ny sitrapon’ny tompony nefa tsy niomana izy na nanao an’izay nasainy natao.', 'ary ho be dia be ny kapoka ho azon’izany mpanompo izany, satria fantany ny sitrapon’ny tompony nefa tsy niomana izy na nanao an’izay nasainy natao.'),
  ('6ab25c643777ec846fff9f10', '2026-09-22T10:45:56.443Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:56.443Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 12, 45, 'Fa raha miteny anakampo kosa ilay mpanompo hoe: ‘Mba ela koa izany tompoko izany vao tonga!’ ka manomboka mikapoka ny mpanompolahy sy mpanompovavy izy, ary mihinana sy misotro ka mamo,', 'fa raha miteny anakampo kosa ilay mpanompo hoe: ‘mba ela koa izany tompoko izany vao tonga!’ ka manomboka mikapoka ny mpanompolahy sy mpanompovavy izy, ary mihinana sy misotro ka mamo,'),
  ('6ab25c643777ec846fff9f0f', '2026-09-22T10:45:56.443Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:56.443Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 12, 44, 'Lazaiko aminareo marina tokoa fa hotendreny hiandraikitra ny fananany rehetra izy.', 'lazaiko aminareo marina tokoa fa hotendreny hiandraikitra ny fananany rehetra izy.'),
  ('6ab25c643777ec846fff9efd', '2026-09-22T10:45:56.443Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:56.443Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 12, 26, 'Koa raha izany zavatra kely izany aza tsy hainareo, maninona ianareo no manahy ny amin’ny zavatra hafa?', 'koa raha izany zavatra kely izany aza tsy hainareo, maninona ianareo no manahy ny amin’ny zavatra hafa?'),
  ('6ab25c643777ec846fff9efa', '2026-09-22T10:45:56.443Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:56.443Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 12, 23, 'Fa sarobidy noho ny sakafo ny aina, ary sarobidy noho ny fitafiana ny vatana.', 'fa sarobidy noho ny sakafo ny aina, ary sarobidy noho ny fitafiana ny vatana.'),
  ('6ab25c643777ec846fff9ee8', '2026-09-22T10:45:56.443Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:56.443Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 12, 5, 'Fa hatoroko anareo kosa izay tokony hatahoranareo: Matahora an’Ilay manana fahefana hanipy any amin’ny Gehena rehefa avy namono anareo ho faty. Averiko aminareo indray hoe matahora Azy.', 'fa hatoroko anareo kosa izay tokony hatahoranareo: matahora an’ilay manana fahefana hanipy any amin’ny gehena rehefa avy namono anareo ho faty. averiko aminareo indray hoe matahora azy.'),
  ('6ab25c643777ec846fff9ee5', '2026-09-22T10:45:56.443Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:56.443Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 12, 2, 'Fa tsy misy zavatra tsara afina ka hoe tsy haharihary, na zava-miafina ka hoe tsy ho fantatra.', 'fa tsy misy zavatra tsara afina ka hoe tsy haharihary, na zava-miafina ka hoe tsy ho fantatra.'),
  ('6ab25c643777ec846fff9ef2', '2026-09-22T10:45:56.443Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:56.443Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 12, 15, 'Ary hoy izy tamin’ny vahoaka: “Aoka ianareo ho mailo, ary mitandrema amin’izay rehetra mety hahatonga anareo ho tsy mety afa-po, satria na manan-javatra be dia be aza ny olona, dia tsy miankina amin’ny zavatra ananany ny ainy.”', 'ary hoy izy tamin’ny vahoaka: “aoka ianareo ho mailo, ary mitandrema amin’izay rehetra mety hahatonga anareo ho tsy mety afa-po, satria na manan-javatra be dia be aza ny olona, dia tsy miankina amin’ny zavatra ananany ny ainy.”'),
  ('6ab25c643777ec846fff9ee9', '2026-09-22T10:45:56.443Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:56.443Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 12, 6, 'Vola madinika kely anankiroa no ivarotana fody dimy, sa tsy izany? Na ny iray amin’ireny aza anefa tsy misy hadinon’Andriamanitra.', 'vola madinika kely anankiroa no ivarotana fody dimy, sa tsy izany? na ny iray amin’ireny aza anefa tsy misy hadinon’andriamanitra.'),
  ('6ab25c643777ec846fff9f11', '2026-09-22T10:45:56.443Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:56.443Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 12, 46, 'dia ho avy amin’ny andro tsy ampoiziny sy amin’ny ora tsy fantany ny tompony, ka hanasazy azy faran’izay mafy ary handefa azy hiaraka amin’ny olona tsy mendri-pitokisana.', 'dia ho avy amin’ny andro tsy ampoiziny sy amin’ny ora tsy fantany ny tompony, ka hanasazy azy faran’izay mafy ary handefa azy hiaraka amin’ny olona tsy mendri-pitokisana.'),
  ('6ab25c643777ec846fff9efe', '2026-09-22T10:45:56.443Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:56.443Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 12, 27, 'Diniho ange ny fanirin’ny voninkazo e! Tsy miasa mafy na manao kofehy ireny, nefa lazaiko aminareo fa na i Solomona tao amin’ny voninahiny rehetra aza tsy nitafy hoatran’ny iray amin’ireny.', 'diniho ange ny fanirin’ny voninkazo e! tsy miasa mafy na manao kofehy ireny, nefa lazaiko aminareo fa na i solomona tao amin’ny voninahiny rehetra aza tsy nitafy hoatran’ny iray amin’ireny.'),
  ('6ab25c643777ec846fff9eea', '2026-09-22T10:45:56.443Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:56.443Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 12, 7, 'Fa na ny volon-dohanareo aza dia voaisa daholo. Aza matahotra fa mbola sarobidy lavitra noho ny fody be dia be ianareo.', 'fa na ny volon-dohanareo aza dia voaisa daholo. aza matahotra fa mbola sarobidy lavitra noho ny fody be dia be ianareo.'),
  ('6ab25c643777ec846fff9f0d', '2026-09-22T10:45:56.443Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:56.443Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 12, 42, 'Hoy ny Tompo: “Iza tokoa moa ilay mpanompo mendri-pitokisana sy malina, izay hotendren’ny tompony hikarakara ny mpanompony hafa rehetra, mba hanome sakafo ampy ho azy ireo foana amin’ny fotoana mety?', 'hoy ny tompo: “iza tokoa moa ilay mpanompo mendri-pitokisana sy malina, izay hotendren’ny tompony hikarakara ny mpanompony hafa rehetra, mba hanome sakafo ampy ho azy ireo foana amin’ny fotoana mety?'),
  ('6ab25c643777ec846fff9f08', '2026-09-22T10:45:56.443Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:56.443Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 12, 37, 'Sambatra ireo mpanompo hitan’ny tompony hoe miambina rehefa tonga izy! Lazaiko marina aminareo fa hanao akanjo fitondra manao raharaha ilay tompony, ary asainy maka toerana eo amin’ny latabatra ireo mpanompo ireo, dia ho avy izy hikarakara an’ireo.', 'sambatra ireo mpanompo hitan’ny tompony hoe miambina rehefa tonga izy! lazaiko marina aminareo fa hanao akanjo fitondra manao raharaha ilay tompony, ary asainy maka toerana eo amin’ny latabatra ireo mpanompo ireo, dia ho avy izy hikarakara an’ireo.'),
  ('6ab25c643777ec846fff9ef6', '2026-09-22T10:45:56.443Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:56.443Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 12, 19, 'Dia hilaza amin’ny tenako aho hoe: “Ianao ange manana zavatra tsara be dia be efa notehirizinao e, sady ampy mandritra ny taona maro ireo! Koa mialà sasatra, mihinàna, misotroa, mifalia.”’', 'dia hilaza amin’ny tenako aho hoe: “ianao ange manana zavatra tsara be dia be efa notehirizinao e, sady ampy mandritra ny taona maro ireo! koa mialà sasatra, mihinàna, misotroa, mifalia.”’'),
  ('6ab25c643777ec846fff9f06', '2026-09-22T10:45:56.443Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:56.443Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 12, 35, '“Anaovy ny akanjo ary miomàna, dia areheto ny jironareo.', '“anaovy ny akanjo ary miomàna, dia areheto ny jironareo.'),
  ('6ab25c643777ec846fff9eef', '2026-09-22T10:45:56.443Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:56.443Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 12, 12, 'Fa ny fanahy masina no hampianatra anareo an’izay tokony holazainareo amin’izany ora izany.”', 'fa ny fanahy masina no hampianatra anareo an’izay tokony holazainareo amin’izany ora izany.”'),
  ('6ab25c643777ec846fff9f14', '2026-09-22T10:45:56.443Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:56.443Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 12, 49, '“Tonga handrehitra afo eto an-tany aho. Koa raha efa mirehitra ilay izy, inona indray moa no iriko mihoatra an’izany?', '“tonga handrehitra afo eto an-tany aho. koa raha efa mirehitra ilay izy, inona indray moa no iriko mihoatra an’izany?'),
  ('6ab25c643777ec846fff9f05', '2026-09-22T10:45:56.443Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:56.443Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 12, 34, 'Fa any amin’izay misy ny harenanareo, dia ho any koa ny fonareo.', 'fa any amin’izay misy ny harenanareo, dia ho any koa ny fonareo.'),
  ('6ab25c643777ec846fff9ef9', '2026-09-22T10:45:56.443Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:56.443Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 12, 22, 'Dia hoy izy tamin’ny mpianany: “Izany no mahatonga ahy hilaza aminareo hoe: Aza manahy intsony ny amin’ny ainareo, hoe inona no hohaninareo, na manahy momba ny vatanareo, hoe inona no hotafinareo.', 'dia hoy izy tamin’ny mpianany: “izany no mahatonga ahy hilaza aminareo hoe: aza manahy intsony ny amin’ny ainareo, hoe inona no hohaninareo, na manahy momba ny vatanareo, hoe inona no hotafinareo.'),
  ('6ab25c643777ec846fff9ef0', '2026-09-22T10:45:56.443Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:56.443Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 12, 13, 'Ary nisy olona teo amin’ny vahoaka niteny taminy hoe: “Mpampianatra ô, teneno ny rahalahiko mba hizara lova amiko.”', 'ary nisy olona teo amin’ny vahoaka niteny taminy hoe: “mpampianatra ô, teneno ny rahalahiko mba hizara lova amiko.”'),
  ('6ab25c643777ec846fff9f1c', '2026-09-22T10:45:56.444Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:56.444Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 12, 57, 'Nahoana ianareo no tsy mamantatra hoe inona no tokony hataonareo?', 'nahoana ianareo no tsy mamantatra hoe inona no tokony hataonareo?'),
  ('6ab25c643777ec846fff9f1e', '2026-09-22T10:45:56.444Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:56.444Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 12, 59, 'Lazaiko aminao fa tsy ho tafavoaka any mihitsy ianao, raha tsy efa voaloanao hatramin’ny vola madinika farany tokony haloanao.”', 'lazaiko aminao fa tsy ho tafavoaka any mihitsy ianao, raha tsy efa voaloanao hatramin’ny vola madinika farany tokony haloanao.”'),
  ('6ab25c643777ec846fff9f17', '2026-09-22T10:45:56.444Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:56.444Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 12, 52, 'Fa hisy olona dimy tsy hitovy saina ao amin’ny trano iray manomboka izao, ka ny telo hanohitra ny roa, ary ny roa hanohitra ny telo.', 'fa hisy olona dimy tsy hitovy saina ao amin’ny trano iray manomboka izao, ka ny telo hanohitra ny roa, ary ny roa hanohitra ny telo.'),
  ('6ab25c643777ec846fff9f1d', '2026-09-22T10:45:56.444Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:56.444Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 12, 58, 'Raha mankany amin’ny manam-pahefana miaraka amin’ilay mitory anao, ohatra, ianao, dia miezaha hifandamina aminy dieny mbola eny an-dalana ianareo. Amin’izay dia tsy hampiantso anao ho eo anatrehan’ny mpitsara izy, ary ny mpitsara tsy hanolotra anao amin’ny mpanatanteraka didim-pitsarana, ary io indray tsy handefa anao any am-ponja.', 'raha mankany amin’ny manam-pahefana miaraka amin’ilay mitory anao, ohatra, ianao, dia miezaha hifandamina aminy dieny mbola eny an-dalana ianareo. amin’izay dia tsy hampiantso anao ho eo anatrehan’ny mpitsara izy, ary ny mpitsara tsy hanolotra anao amin’ny mpanatanteraka didim-pitsarana, ary io indray tsy handefa anao any am-ponja.'),
  ('6ab25c643777ec846fff9f19', '2026-09-22T10:45:56.444Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:56.444Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 12, 54, 'Hoy koa izy tamin’ny vahoaka: “Rehefa mahita rahona miakatra avy eny andrefana ianareo, dia tonga dia miteny hoe: ‘Ho avy be ny orana.’ Dia izany tokoa no mitranga.', 'hoy koa izy tamin’ny vahoaka: “rehefa mahita rahona miakatra avy eny andrefana ianareo, dia tonga dia miteny hoe: ‘ho avy be ny orana.’ dia izany tokoa no mitranga.'),
  ('6ab25c643777ec846fff9f1b', '2026-09-22T10:45:56.444Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:56.444Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 12, 56, 'Ry mpihatsaravelatsihy! Hainareo ny mandinika ny toetoetry ny tany sy ny lanitra, koa maninona no tsy hainareo ny mandinika an’izay mitranga amin’izao fotoana izao?', 'ry mpihatsaravelatsihy! hainareo ny mandinika ny toetoetry ny tany sy ny lanitra, koa maninona no tsy hainareo ny mandinika an’izay mitranga amin’izao fotoana izao?'),
  ('6ab25c643777ec846fff9f18', '2026-09-22T10:45:56.444Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:56.444Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 12, 53, 'Tsy hitovy saina izy ireo, ka ny ray hanohitra ny zanany lahy ary ny zanakalahy hanohitra ny rainy, ny reny hanohitra ny zanany vavy ary ny zanakavavy hanohitra ny reniny, ny rafozambavy hanohitra ny vinantovaviny ary ny vinantovavy hanohitra ny rafozambaviny.”', 'tsy hitovy saina izy ireo, ka ny ray hanohitra ny zanany lahy ary ny zanakalahy hanohitra ny rainy, ny reny hanohitra ny zanany vavy ary ny zanakavavy hanohitra ny reniny, ny rafozambavy hanohitra ny vinantovaviny ary ny vinantovavy hanohitra ny rafozambaviny.”'),
  ('6ab25c643777ec846fff9f1a', '2026-09-22T10:45:56.444Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:56.444Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 12, 55, 'Ary rehefa hitanareo fa mitsoka avy any atsimo ny rivotra, dia milaza ianareo hoe: ‘Hafana be ny andro.’ Dia izany tokoa no mitranga.', 'ary rehefa hitanareo fa mitsoka avy any atsimo ny rivotra, dia milaza ianareo hoe: ‘hafana be ny andro.’ dia izany tokoa no mitranga.'),
  ('6ab25c643777ec846fff9f16', '2026-09-22T10:45:56.444Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:56.444Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 12, 51, 'Mieritreritra ve ianareo hoe tonga mba hampisy fihavanana eto an-tany aho? Tsy izany mihitsy! Lazaiko aminareo fa tonga kosa aho mba hampisy fisaratsarahana.', 'mieritreritra ve ianareo hoe tonga mba hampisy fihavanana eto an-tany aho? tsy izany mihitsy! lazaiko aminareo fa tonga kosa aho mba hampisy fisaratsarahana.'),
  ('6ab25c646ec61294697ef3b3', '2026-09-22T10:45:56.999Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:56.999Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 13, 7, 'Hoy àry izy tamin’ny mpikarakara tanimboaloboka: ‘Efa telo taona aho izao no tonga nitady voa tamin’ity aviavy ity, fa tsy nahita mihitsy. Kapao any io! Maninona io no avela hibahan-toerana fotsiny eo, dia lasa tsy azo ampiasaina ny tany?’', 'hoy àry izy tamin’ny mpikarakara tanimboaloboka: ‘efa telo taona aho izao no tonga nitady voa tamin’ity aviavy ity, fa tsy nahita mihitsy. kapao any io! maninona io no avela hibahan-toerana fotsiny eo, dia lasa tsy azo ampiasaina ny tany?’'),
  ('6ab25c646ec61294697ef3b2', '2026-09-22T10:45:56.999Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:56.999Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 13, 6, 'Nilaza an’izao fanoharana izao izy avy eo: “Nisy aviavy naniry tao amin’ny tanimboaloboky ny lehilahy iray. Dia tonga izy mba hitady voa tamin’ilay izy, fa tsy nahita mihitsy.', 'nilaza an’izao fanoharana izao izy avy eo: “nisy aviavy naniry tao amin’ny tanimboaloboky ny lehilahy iray. dia tonga izy mba hitady voa tamin’ilay izy, fa tsy nahita mihitsy.'),
  ('6ab25c646ec61294697ef3b1', '2026-09-22T10:45:56.999Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:56.999Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 13, 5, 'Tsoriko aminareo fa tsy izany. Ho ringana hoatr’azy ireo koa anefa ianareo rehetra raha tsy mibebaka.”', 'tsoriko aminareo fa tsy izany. ho ringana hoatr’azy ireo koa anefa ianareo rehetra raha tsy mibebaka.”'),
  ('6ab25c646ec61294697ef3b8', '2026-09-22T10:45:56.999Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:56.999Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 13, 12, 'Niantso azy i Jesosy rehefa nahita azy, ka niteny hoe: “Ravehivavy, afaka amin’ny aretinao ianao!”', 'niantso azy i jesosy rehefa nahita azy, ka niteny hoe: “ravehivavy, afaka amin’ny aretinao ianao!”'),
  ('6ab25c646ec61294697ef3af', '2026-09-22T10:45:56.999Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:56.999Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 13, 3, 'Tsoriko aminareo fa tsy izany. Ho ringana hoatr’azy ireo koa anefa ianareo rehetra raha tsy mibebaka.', 'tsoriko aminareo fa tsy izany. ho ringana hoatr’azy ireo koa anefa ianareo rehetra raha tsy mibebaka.'),
