  ('6ab25c646ec61294697ef3b0', '2026-09-22T10:45:56.999Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:56.999Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 13, 4, 'Ary ireo olona 18 maty nianjeran’ny tilikambo tao Siloama? Mieritreritra ve ianareo fa meloka kokoa noho ny mponina rehetra ao Jerosalema ireny?', 'ary ireo olona 18 maty nianjeran’ny tilikambo tao siloama? mieritreritra ve ianareo fa meloka kokoa noho ny mponina rehetra ao jerosalema ireny?'),
  ('6ab25c646ec61294697ef3b6', '2026-09-22T10:45:56.999Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:56.999Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 13, 10, 'Ary nampianatra tao amin’ny synagoga anankiray i Jesosy tamin’ny Sabata.', 'ary nampianatra tao amin’ny synagoga anankiray i jesosy tamin’ny sabata.'),
  ('6ab25c646ec61294697ef3b5', '2026-09-22T10:45:56.999Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:56.999Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 13, 9, 'Koa raha mamoa izy, dia tsara! Fa raha tsy mamoa kosa izy, dia hokapaina ihany.’”', 'koa raha mamoa izy, dia tsara! fa raha tsy mamoa kosa izy, dia hokapaina ihany.’”'),
  ('6ab25c646ec61294697ef3ad', '2026-09-22T10:45:56.999Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:56.999Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 13, 1, 'Tamin’izay, dia nisy tamin’ireo olona teo nitantara tamin’i Jesosy momba an’ireo Galilianina novonoin’i Pilato. Nafangarony tamin’ny sorona nataon’ireo Galilianina ireo ihany ny ran’izy ireo.', 'tamin’izay, dia nisy tamin’ireo olona teo nitantara tamin’i jesosy momba an’ireo galilianina novonoin’i pilato. nafangarony tamin’ny sorona nataon’ireo galilianina ireo ihany ny ran’izy ireo.'),
  ('6ab25c656ec61294697ef3ca', '2026-09-22T10:45:57.000Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:57.000Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 13, 30, 'Ary misy ny farany ho voalohany, ary misy ny voalohany ho farany.”', 'ary misy ny farany ho voalohany, ary misy ny voalohany ho farany.”'),
  ('6ab25c656ec61294697ef3c4', '2026-09-22T10:45:57.000Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:57.000Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 13, 24, '“Miezaha mafy hiditra amin’ny varavarana tery, fa lazaiko aminareo hoe be dia be no hitady hiditra nefa tsy ho afaka.', '“miezaha mafy hiditra amin’ny varavarana tery, fa lazaiko aminareo hoe be dia be no hitady hiditra nefa tsy ho afaka.'),
  ('6ab25c656ec61294697ef3c7', '2026-09-22T10:45:57.000Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:57.000Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 13, 27, 'Hilaza aminareo anefa izy hoe: ‘Tsy fantatro hoe avy aiza ianareo. Mialà eto amiko ianareo rehetra mpanao ny tsy marina!’', 'hilaza aminareo anefa izy hoe: ‘tsy fantatro hoe avy aiza ianareo. mialà eto amiko ianareo rehetra mpanao ny tsy marina!’'),
  ('6ab25c656ec61294697ef3c2', '2026-09-22T10:45:57.000Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:57.000Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 13, 22, 'Dia nandeha nitety tanàna sy vohitra izy, ka nampianatra sady nanohy ny diany ho any Jerosalema.', 'dia nandeha nitety tanàna sy vohitra izy, ka nampianatra sady nanohy ny diany ho any jerosalema.'),
  ('6ab25c656ec61294697ef3be', '2026-09-22T10:45:57.000Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:57.000Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 13, 18, 'Dia nilaza koa izy hoe: “Mitovy amin’inona ny Fanjakan’Andriamanitra, ary ohariko amin’inona izy io?', 'dia nilaza koa izy hoe: “mitovy amin’inona ny fanjakan’andriamanitra, ary ohariko amin’inona izy io?'),
  ('6ab25c656ec61294697ef3c0', '2026-09-22T10:45:57.000Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:57.000Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 13, 20, 'Ary hoy indray izy: “Ohariko amin’inona ny Fanjakan’Andriamanitra?', 'ary hoy indray izy: “ohariko amin’inona ny fanjakan’andriamanitra?'),
  ('6ab25c656ec61294697ef3bc', '2026-09-22T10:45:57.000Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:57.000Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 13, 16, 'Efa nafatotr’i Satana nandritra ny 18 taona be izao koa ity vehivavy zanak’i Abrahama ity. Koa tsy tokony hovahana ve izy mba tsy ho voafatotra hoatr’izany intsony amin’ny andro sabata?”', 'efa nafatotr’i satana nandritra ny 18 taona be izao koa ity vehivavy zanak’i abrahama ity. koa tsy tokony hovahana ve izy mba tsy ho voafatotra hoatr’izany intsony amin’ny andro sabata?”'),
  ('6ab25c656ec61294697ef3bb', '2026-09-22T10:45:57.000Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:57.000Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 13, 15, 'Namaly azy anefa ny Tompo hoe: “Ry mpihatsaravelatsihy, tsy samy mamaha ny ombiny na ny ampondrany avy ve ianareo amin’ny Sabata, dia mitondra azy hisotro rano?', 'namaly azy anefa ny tompo hoe: “ry mpihatsaravelatsihy, tsy samy mamaha ny ombiny na ny ampondrany avy ve ianareo amin’ny sabata, dia mitondra azy hisotro rano?'),
  ('6ab25c656ec61294697ef3cb', '2026-09-22T10:45:57.000Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:57.000Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 13, 31, 'Tamin’izay ora izay indrindra no nisy Fariseo nanatona an’i Jesosy, ka niteny taminy hoe: “Mandehana miala eto, fa mitady hamono anao i Heroda.”', 'tamin’izay ora izay indrindra no nisy fariseo nanatona an’i jesosy, ka niteny taminy hoe: “mandehana miala eto, fa mitady hamono anao i heroda.”'),
  ('6ab25c656ec61294697ef3c9', '2026-09-22T10:45:57.000Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:57.000Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 13, 29, 'Ary ho tonga avy any atsinanana sy andrefana ary avy any avaratra sy atsimo ny olona, ka haka toerana eo amin’ny latabatra ao amin’ny Fanjakan’Andriamanitra.', 'ary ho tonga avy any atsinanana sy andrefana ary avy any avaratra sy atsimo ny olona, ka haka toerana eo amin’ny latabatra ao amin’ny fanjakan’andriamanitra.'),
  ('6ab25c656ec61294697ef3c6', '2026-09-22T10:45:57.000Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:57.000Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 13, 26, 'Dia hanomboka hilaza ianareo hoe: ‘Nihinana sy nisotro niaraka taminao izahay, ary nampianatra teny an-dalambenay ianao.’', 'dia hanomboka hilaza ianareo hoe: ‘nihinana sy nisotro niaraka taminao izahay, ary nampianatra teny an-dalambenay ianao.’'),
  ('6ab25c656ec61294697ef3cf', '2026-09-22T10:45:57.000Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:57.000Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 13, 35, 'Dia avela ho anareo eo ny tranonareo! Lazaiko aminareo fa tsy hahita ahy intsony ianareo mandra-pilazanareo hoe: ‘Hotahina anie ilay tonga amin’ny anaran’i Jehovah!’”', 'dia avela ho anareo eo ny tranonareo! lazaiko aminareo fa tsy hahita ahy intsony ianareo mandra-pilazanareo hoe: ‘hotahina anie ilay tonga amin’ny anaran’i jehovah!’”'),
  ('6ab25c656ec61294697ef3c3', '2026-09-22T10:45:57.000Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:57.000Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 13, 23, 'Ary hoy ny lehilahy iray taminy: “Tompo ô, vitsy ve ny hovonjena?” Hoy i Jesosy tamin’izy ireo:', 'ary hoy ny lehilahy iray taminy: “tompo ô, vitsy ve ny hovonjena?” hoy i jesosy tamin’izy ireo:'),
  ('6ab25c656ec61294697ef3ba', '2026-09-22T10:45:57.000Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:57.000Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 13, 14, 'Tezitra anefa ny mpitantana an’ilay synagoga noho i Jesosy nanasitrana tamin’ny Sabata, ka hoy izy tamin’ny vahoaka: “Enina andro no natao hiasana, ka amin’ireo andro ireo ianareo no tokony ho tonga hositranina, fa tsy amin’ny andro sabata.”', 'tezitra anefa ny mpitantana an’ilay synagoga noho i jesosy nanasitrana tamin’ny sabata, ka hoy izy tamin’ny vahoaka: “enina andro no natao hiasana, ka amin’ireo andro ireo ianareo no tokony ho tonga hositranina, fa tsy amin’ny andro sabata.”'),
  ('6ab25c656ec61294697ef3c8', '2026-09-22T10:45:57.000Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:57.000Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 13, 28, 'Dia hitomany sy hihidy vazana ianareo, rehefa mahita an’i Abrahama sy Isaka sy Jakoba ary ny mpaminany rehetra ao amin’ny Fanjakan’Andriamanitra, fa ianareo kosa voaroaka eny ivelany.', 'dia hitomany sy hihidy vazana ianareo, rehefa mahita an’i abrahama sy isaka sy jakoba ary ny mpaminany rehetra ao amin’ny fanjakan’andriamanitra, fa ianareo kosa voaroaka eny ivelany.'),
  ('6ab25c656ec61294697ef3bd', '2026-09-22T10:45:57.000Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:57.000Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 13, 17, 'Ary menatra daholo ny mpanohitra azy rehefa nilaza an’izany izy. Fa faly kosa ny vahoaka manontolo noho ny zavatra mahagaga rehetra nataon’i Jesosy.', 'ary menatra daholo ny mpanohitra azy rehefa nilaza an’izany izy. fa faly kosa ny vahoaka manontolo noho ny zavatra mahagaga rehetra nataon’i jesosy.'),
  ('6ab25c656ec61294697ef3c1', '2026-09-22T10:45:57.000Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:57.000Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 13, 21, 'Hoatran’ny lalivay nalain’ny vehivavy iray izy io, ka nafangarony lafarinina intelon’ny famarana lehibe mandra-pitombon’ny koba manontolo.”', 'hoatran’ny lalivay nalain’ny vehivavy iray izy io, ka nafangarony lafarinina intelon’ny famarana lehibe mandra-pitombon’ny koba manontolo.”'),
  ('6ab25c656ec61294697ef3bf', '2026-09-22T10:45:57.000Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:57.000Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 13, 19, 'Hoatran’ny voan-tsinapy nalain’olona izy io, ka namboleny tao an-jaridainany, ary naniry ka lasa hazo. Dia nanao akany teny amin’ny sampany ny voro-manidina.”', 'hoatran’ny voan-tsinapy nalain’olona izy io, ka namboleny tao an-jaridainany, ary naniry ka lasa hazo. dia nanao akany teny amin’ny sampany ny voro-manidina.”'),
  ('6ab25c656ec61294697ef3cd', '2026-09-22T10:45:57.000Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:57.000Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 13, 33, 'Na izany aza, dia tsy maintsy mandeha aho anio sy rahampitso ary rahafakampitso, satria tsy mety raha hoe vonoina any ivelan’i Jerosalema ny mpaminany.', 'na izany aza, dia tsy maintsy mandeha aho anio sy rahampitso ary rahafakampitso, satria tsy mety raha hoe vonoina any ivelan’i jerosalema ny mpaminany.'),
  ('6ab25c656ec61294697ef3ce', '2026-09-22T10:45:57.000Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:57.000Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 13, 34, '“Ry Jerosalema, ry Jerosalema, ilay mpamono ny mpaminany sy mpitora-bato an’izay irahina ho any aminao! Impiry aho no te hanangona ny zanakao, hoatran’ny reniakoho manangona ny zanany ao ambany elany, nefa tsy nety ianareo.', '“ry jerosalema, ry jerosalema, ilay mpamono ny mpaminany sy mpitora-bato an’izay irahina ho any aminao! impiry aho no te hanangona ny zanakao, hoatran’ny reniakoho manangona ny zanany ao ambany elany, nefa tsy nety ianareo.'),
  ('6ab25c656ec61294697ef3cc', '2026-09-22T10:45:57.000Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:57.000Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 13, 32, 'Dia hoy izy tamin’ireo: “Mandehana lazao amin’iny amboadia fetsy iny hoe: ‘Mandroaka demonia sy manasitrana olona aho anio sy rahampitso, ary ho vita ny asako rahafakampitso.’', 'dia hoy izy tamin’ireo: “mandehana lazao amin’iny amboadia fetsy iny hoe: ‘mandroaka demonia sy manasitrana olona aho anio sy rahampitso, ary ho vita ny asako rahafakampitso.’'),
  ('6ab25c656ec61294697ef3c5', '2026-09-22T10:45:57.000Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:57.000Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 13, 25, 'Rehefa mitsangana mantsy ny tompon-trano ka manidy varavarana, dia ho tavela any ivelany ianareo ka handondòna ao am-baravarana sady hiteny hoe: ‘Tompo ô! Mba vohay izahay.’ Izao anefa no havaliny anareo: ‘Tsy fantatro hoe avy aiza ianareo.’', 'rehefa mitsangana mantsy ny tompon-trano ka manidy varavarana, dia ho tavela any ivelany ianareo ka handondòna ao am-baravarana sady hiteny hoe: ‘tompo ô! mba vohay izahay.’ izao anefa no havaliny anareo: ‘tsy fantatro hoe avy aiza ianareo.’'),
  ('6ab25c6514d8052f5a3f590c', '2026-09-22T10:45:57.483Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:57.483Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 14, 13, 'Fa ny mahantra sy ny kilemaina sy ny malemy tongotra ary ny jamba kosa no asao, rehefa misy fanasana ataonao.', 'fa ny mahantra sy ny kilemaina sy ny malemy tongotra ary ny jamba kosa no asao, rehefa misy fanasana ataonao.'),
  ('6ab25c6514d8052f5a3f590b', '2026-09-22T10:45:57.483Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:57.483Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 14, 12, 'Hoy koa izy tamin’ilay nanasa azy: “Rehefa manasa olona hisakafo antoandro na hisakafo hariva ianao, dia aza ny namanao na ny rahalahinao na ny havanao na ny mpiara-monina aminao manankarena no asaina. Mety hanasa anao koa mantsy ry zareo, ka ho voavaly izay nataonao.', 'hoy koa izy tamin’ilay nanasa azy: “rehefa manasa olona hisakafo antoandro na hisakafo hariva ianao, dia aza ny namanao na ny rahalahinao na ny havanao na ny mpiara-monina aminao manankarena no asaina. mety hanasa anao koa mantsy ry zareo, ka ho voavaly izay nataonao.'),
  ('6ab25c6514d8052f5a3f590a', '2026-09-22T10:45:57.483Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:57.483Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 14, 11, 'Fa izay manandra-tena no haetry, ary izay manetry tena no hasandratra.”', 'fa izay manandra-tena no haetry, ary izay manetry tena no hasandratra.”'),
  ('6ab25c6514d8052f5a3f5907', '2026-09-22T10:45:57.483Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:57.483Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 14, 8, '“Rehefa misy manasa anao hanatrika fanasambe amin’ny fampakaram-bady, dia aza maka ny toerana mihaja indrindra. Mety ho nanasa olona manan-kaja kokoa noho ianao mantsy izy.', '“rehefa misy manasa anao hanatrika fanasambe amin’ny fampakaram-bady, dia aza maka ny toerana mihaja indrindra. mety ho nanasa olona manan-kaja kokoa noho ianao mantsy izy.'),
  ('6ab25c6514d8052f5a3f5908', '2026-09-22T10:45:57.483Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:57.483Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 14, 9, 'Dia hankeo aminao ilay nanasa anareo, ka hiteny hoe: ‘Omeo an’ity olona ity ny toeranao.’ Dia ho menatra ianao hifindra any amin’ny toerana aoriana indrindra.', 'dia hankeo aminao ilay nanasa anareo, ka hiteny hoe: ‘omeo an’ity olona ity ny toeranao.’ dia ho menatra ianao hifindra any amin’ny toerana aoriana indrindra.'),
  ('6ab25c6514d8052f5a3f5902', '2026-09-22T10:45:57.483Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:57.483Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 14, 3, 'Nanontanian’i Jesosy àry ireo nahay Lalàna sy ny Fariseo hoe: “Azo atao sa tsia ny manasitrana amin’ny Sabata?”', 'nanontanian’i jesosy àry ireo nahay lalàna sy ny fariseo hoe: “azo atao sa tsia ny manasitrana amin’ny sabata?”'),
  ('6ab25c6514d8052f5a3f5900', '2026-09-22T10:45:57.483Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:57.483Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 14, 1, 'Nandeha nisakafo tao an-tranon’ny anankiray tamin’ny lehiben’ny Fariseo i Jesosy, indray Sabata, ary nijery azy tsara ny olona tao.', 'nandeha nisakafo tao an-tranon’ny anankiray tamin’ny lehiben’ny fariseo i jesosy, indray sabata, ary nijery azy tsara ny olona tao.'),
  ('6ab25c6514d8052f5a3f5901', '2026-09-22T10:45:57.483Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:57.483Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 14, 2, 'Ary io fa nisy lehilahy voan’ny aretina manirano teo anoloan’i Jesosy.', 'ary io fa nisy lehilahy voan’ny aretina manirano teo anoloan’i jesosy.'),
  ('6ab25c6514d8052f5a3f5904', '2026-09-22T10:45:57.483Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:57.483Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 14, 5, 'Hoy izy avy eo: “Raha latsaka ao anaty lavadrano ny zanakareo na ny ombinareo, dia iza aminareo no tsy hisintona azy hivoaka avy hatrany, na dia Sabata aza ny andro?”', 'hoy izy avy eo: “raha latsaka ao anaty lavadrano ny zanakareo na ny ombinareo, dia iza aminareo no tsy hisintona azy hivoaka avy hatrany, na dia sabata aza ny andro?”'),
  ('6ab25c6514d8052f5a3f5909', '2026-09-22T10:45:57.483Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:57.483Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 14, 10, 'Fa rehefa misy manasa anao kosa, dia mandehana maka ny toerana aoriana indrindra. Amin’izay rehefa tonga ilay nanasa anao, dia hiteny aminao hoe: ‘Tsy aleo ianao, ry namana, mandroso etsy aloha kokoa?’ Dia hahazo voninahitra eo imason’ireo rehetra niara-nasaina taminao ianao.', 'fa rehefa misy manasa anao kosa, dia mandehana maka ny toerana aoriana indrindra. amin’izay rehefa tonga ilay nanasa anao, dia hiteny aminao hoe: ‘tsy aleo ianao, ry namana, mandroso etsy aloha kokoa?’ dia hahazo voninahitra eo imason’ireo rehetra niara-nasaina taminao ianao.'),
  ('6ab25c6514d8052f5a3f5905', '2026-09-22T10:45:57.483Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:57.483Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 14, 6, 'Koa tsy nahita havaly izy ireo.', 'koa tsy nahita havaly izy ireo.'),
  ('6ab25c6514d8052f5a3f5903', '2026-09-22T10:45:57.483Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:57.483Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 14, 4, 'Tsy niteny tsy nivolana anefa izy ireo. Koa nataon’i Jesosy teo amin’ilay lehilahy ny tanany ary nositraniny izy, dia nasainy nandeha.', 'tsy niteny tsy nivolana anefa izy ireo. koa nataon’i jesosy teo amin’ilay lehilahy ny tanany ary nositraniny izy, dia nasainy nandeha.'),
  ('6ab25c6514d8052f5a3f5906', '2026-09-22T10:45:57.483Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:57.483Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 14, 7, 'Dia nilaza fanoharana tamin’ireo nasaina izy, rehefa tsikariny fa nifidy ny toerana mihaja indrindra izy ireo. Hoy izy:', 'dia nilaza fanoharana tamin’ireo nasaina izy, rehefa tsikariny fa nifidy ny toerana mihaja indrindra izy ireo. hoy izy:'),
  ('6ab25c6514d8052f5a3f5921', '2026-09-22T10:45:57.484Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:57.484Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 14, 34, '“Tsara tokoa ny sira, nefa raha ny sira indray no lasa matsatso, dia inona no hamerenana ny tsirony?', '“tsara tokoa ny sira, nefa raha ny sira indray no lasa matsatso, dia inona no hamerenana ny tsirony?'),
  ('6ab25c6514d8052f5a3f5916', '2026-09-22T10:45:57.484Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:57.484Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 14, 23, 'Dia hoy ilay tompony: ‘Mandehana mankeny amin’ny lalana any ivelan’ny tanàna, dia ataovy izay hahatongavan’ny olona mba ho feno ny tranoko.', 'dia hoy ilay tompony: ‘mandehana mankeny amin’ny lalana any ivelan’ny tanàna, dia ataovy izay hahatongavan’ny olona mba ho feno ny tranoko.'),
  ('6ab25c6514d8052f5a3f5922', '2026-09-22T10:45:57.484Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:57.484Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 14, 35, 'Tsy mety hatao amin’ny tany na amin’ny zezika ilay izy, ka arian’ny olona fotsiny. Izay manan-tsofina hihainoana, aoka izy hihaino.”', 'tsy mety hatao amin’ny tany na amin’ny zezika ilay izy, ka arian’ny olona fotsiny. izay manan-tsofina hihainoana, aoka izy hihaino.”'),
  ('6ab25c6514d8052f5a3f591c', '2026-09-22T10:45:57.484Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:57.484Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 14, 29, 'Raha tsy manao an’izany izy, dia mety hametraka ny fototra nefa tsy ho afaka hamita an’ilay tilikambo. Dia haneso azy izay rehetra mahita an’izany,', 'raha tsy manao an’izany izy, dia mety hametraka ny fototra nefa tsy ho afaka hamita an’ilay tilikambo. dia haneso azy izay rehetra mahita an’izany,'),
  ('6ab25c6514d8052f5a3f591a', '2026-09-22T10:45:57.484Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:57.484Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 14, 27, 'Izay tsy mitondra ny hazo fijaliany ka tsy manaraka ahy, dia tsy afaka ny ho mpianatro.', 'izay tsy mitondra ny hazo fijaliany ka tsy manaraka ahy, dia tsy afaka ny ho mpianatro.'),
  ('6ab25c6514d8052f5a3f5914', '2026-09-22T10:45:57.484Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:57.484Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 14, 21, 'Nankany amin’ilay tompony àry ilay mpanompo ka nitantara an’izany taminy. Dia tezitra ilay tompon-trano, ka hoy izy tamin’ilay mpanompony: ‘Mandehana haingana eny an-dalambe sy eny amin’ny lalankely eto an-tanàna, dia ento atỳ ny mahantra sy ny kilemaina sy ny jamba ary ny malemy tongotra.’', 'nankany amin’ilay tompony àry ilay mpanompo ka nitantara an’izany taminy. dia tezitra ilay tompon-trano, ka hoy izy tamin’ilay mpanompony: ‘mandehana haingana eny an-dalambe sy eny amin’ny lalankely eto an-tanàna, dia ento atỳ ny mahantra sy ny kilemaina sy ny jamba ary ny malemy tongotra.’'),
  ('6ab25c6514d8052f5a3f591f', '2026-09-22T10:45:57.484Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:57.484Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 14, 32, 'Raha tsy ho vitany ny hifanandrina aminy, dia haniraka ambasadaoro hanao raharaham-pihavanana izy, dieny mbola lavitra ilay iray.', 'raha tsy ho vitany ny hifanandrina aminy, dia haniraka ambasadaoro hanao raharaham-pihavanana izy, dieny mbola lavitra ilay iray.'),
  ('6ab25c6514d8052f5a3f5912', '2026-09-22T10:45:57.484Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:57.484Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 14, 19, 'Ny iray nilaza hoe: ‘Nividy omby folo aho, dia handeha handinika azy ireo. Mba ialao tsiny any re aho e!’', 'ny iray nilaza hoe: ‘nividy omby folo aho, dia handeha handinika azy ireo. mba ialao tsiny any re aho e!’'),
  ('6ab25c6514d8052f5a3f5920', '2026-09-22T10:45:57.484Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:57.484Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 14, 33, 'Toy izany koa fa tsy afaka ny ho mpianatro izay tsy mahafoy ny fananany rehetra.', 'toy izany koa fa tsy afaka ny ho mpianatro izay tsy mahafoy ny fananany rehetra.'),
  ('6ab25c6514d8052f5a3f590d', '2026-09-22T10:45:57.484Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:57.484Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 14, 14, 'Amin’izay dia ho sambatra ianao, satria tsy manan-kavaly anao ireo. Ary hovaliana ianao amin’ny fitsanganan’ny marina.”', 'amin’izay dia ho sambatra ianao, satria tsy manan-kavaly anao ireo. ary hovaliana ianao amin’ny fitsanganan’ny marina.”'),
  ('6ab25c6514d8052f5a3f5919', '2026-09-22T10:45:57.484Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:57.484Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 14, 26, '“Raha misy manatona ahy nefa tsy mankahala ny rainy sy ny reniny sy ny vadiny sy ny zanany sy ny rahalahiny sy ny anabaviny, ary na ny ainy mihitsy aza, dia tsy afaka ny ho mpianatro izy.', '“raha misy manatona ahy nefa tsy mankahala ny rainy sy ny reniny sy ny vadiny sy ny zanany sy ny rahalahiny sy ny anabaviny, ary na ny ainy mihitsy aza, dia tsy afaka ny ho mpianatro izy.'),
  ('6ab25c6514d8052f5a3f5911', '2026-09-22T10:45:57.484Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:57.484Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 14, 18, 'Samy nitady fialan-tsiny anefa izy rehetra. Ny voalohany niteny hoe: ‘Nividy saha aho, dia mila mandeha mijery an’ilay izy. Mba ialao tsiny any re aho e!’', 'samy nitady fialan-tsiny anefa izy rehetra. ny voalohany niteny hoe: ‘nividy saha aho, dia mila mandeha mijery an’ilay izy. mba ialao tsiny any re aho e!’'),
  ('6ab25c6514d8052f5a3f5910', '2026-09-22T10:45:57.484Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:57.484Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 14, 17, 'Naniraka ny mpanompony izy tamin’ny fotoanan’ny sakafo hariva mba hilaza tamin’ireo nasaina hoe: ‘Tongava fa efa vonona ny zava-drehetra.’', 'naniraka ny mpanompony izy tamin’ny fotoanan’ny sakafo hariva mba hilaza tamin’ireo nasaina hoe: ‘tongava fa efa vonona ny zava-drehetra.’'),
  ('6ab25c6514d8052f5a3f5915', '2026-09-22T10:45:57.484Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:57.484Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 14, 22, 'Rehefa tafaverina ilay mpanompo, dia hoy izy: ‘Vita izay nasainao natao, tompoko, nefa mbola misy toerana.’', 'rehefa tafaverina ilay mpanompo, dia hoy izy: ‘vita izay nasainao natao, tompoko, nefa mbola misy toerana.’'),
  ('6ab25c6514d8052f5a3f5913', '2026-09-22T10:45:57.484Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:57.484Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 14, 20, 'Nilaza koa ny anankiray hafa hoe: ‘Vao avy nampaka-bady aho, dia tsy afaka mankany.’', 'nilaza koa ny anankiray hafa hoe: ‘vao avy nampaka-bady aho, dia tsy afaka mankany.’'),
  ('6ab25c6514d8052f5a3f590f', '2026-09-22T10:45:57.484Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:57.484Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 14, 16, 'Dia hoy i Jesosy taminy: “Nisy lehilahy nanao fanasambe, dia nanasa olona be dia be.', 'dia hoy i jesosy taminy: “nisy lehilahy nanao fanasambe, dia nanasa olona be dia be.'),
  ('6ab25c6514d8052f5a3f5917', '2026-09-22T10:45:57.484Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:57.484Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 14, 24, 'Fa lazaiko aminareo fa tsy hisy amin’ireny nasaina ireny hanandrana ny sakafo hariva nomaniko.’”', 'fa lazaiko aminareo fa tsy hisy amin’ireny nasaina ireny hanandrana ny sakafo hariva nomaniko.’”'),
  ('6ab25c6514d8052f5a3f591d', '2026-09-22T10:45:57.484Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:57.484Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 14, 30, 'ka hiteny hoe: ‘Io olona io nanomboka nanorina tilikambo, nefa tsy nahavita an’ilay izy hatramin’ny farany akory.’', 'ka hiteny hoe: ‘io olona io nanomboka nanorina tilikambo, nefa tsy nahavita an’ilay izy hatramin’ny farany akory.’'),
  ('6ab25c6514d8052f5a3f591b', '2026-09-22T10:45:57.484Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:57.484Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 14, 28, 'Iza aminareo, ohatra, raha te hanorina tilikambo, no tsy mipetraka aloha manao kajy hoe ohatrinona no ho lany, mba hahitana raha manana ny ampy hamitana an’ilay izy na tsia?', 'iza aminareo, ohatra, raha te hanorina tilikambo, no tsy mipetraka aloha manao kajy hoe ohatrinona no ho lany, mba hahitana raha manana ny ampy hamitana an’ilay izy na tsia?'),
  ('6ab25c6514d8052f5a3f590e', '2026-09-22T10:45:57.484Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:57.484Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 14, 15, 'Naheno an’izany ny iray tamin’ireo nasaina, ka hoy izy tamin’i Jesosy: “Sambatra izay misakafo ao amin’ny Fanjakan’Andriamanitra.”', 'naheno an’izany ny iray tamin’ireo nasaina, ka hoy izy tamin’i jesosy: “sambatra izay misakafo ao amin’ny fanjakan’andriamanitra.”'),
