  ('6ab25c65b63604daeed9f899', '2026-09-22T10:45:57.931Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:57.931Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 15, 13, 'Rehefa afaka andro vitsivitsy, dia nangonin’ilay zandriny ny fananany rehetra, ary lasa nankany an-tany lavitra izy. Naditra be mihitsy izy tany, ka lanilany foana ny fananany.', 'rehefa afaka andro vitsivitsy, dia nangonin’ilay zandriny ny fananany rehetra, ary lasa nankany an-tany lavitra izy. naditra be mihitsy izy tany, ka lanilany foana ny fananany.'),
