  ('6ab25c65b63604daeed9f89b', '2026-09-22T10:45:57.931Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:57.931Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 15, 15, 'Lasa mihitsy aza izy nankany amin’ny tompon-tany anankiray tao amin’izany tany izany, ka nisisika hiasa tao aminy. Koa nirahin’izy io hiandry kisoa tany an-tsaha izy.', 'lasa mihitsy aza izy nankany amin’ny tompon-tany anankiray tao amin’izany tany izany, ka nisisika hiasa tao aminy. koa nirahin’izy io hiandry kisoa tany an-tsaha izy.'),
  ('6ab25c65b63604daeed9f89a', '2026-09-22T10:45:57.931Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:57.931Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 15, 14, 'Rehefa laniny daholo ny fananany, dia nisy mosary mafy nanerana an’ilay tany ka lasa nahantra izy.', 'rehefa laniny daholo ny fananany, dia nisy mosary mafy nanerana an’ilay tany ka lasa nahantra izy.'),
