  ('6ab25c65b63604daeed9f8a0', '2026-09-22T10:45:57.931Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:57.931Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 15, 20, 'Dia niainga izy ka nankany amin’ny rainy. Mbola lavitra anefa izy, dia efa tazan’ny rainy. Nangoraka azy ny rainy dia nihazakazaka ary namihina azy sady nanoroka azy tamim-pitiavana.', 'dia niainga izy ka nankany amin’ny rainy. mbola lavitra anefa izy, dia efa tazan’ny rainy. nangoraka azy ny rainy dia nihazakazaka ary namihina azy sady nanoroka azy tamim-pitiavana.'),
  ('6ab25c65b63604daeed9f8aa', '2026-09-22T10:45:57.931Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:57.931Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 15, 30, 'Fa raha vao tonga kosa io zanakao io, izay nandanilany ny fanananao tamin’ny mpivaro-tena, dia namonoanao an’ilay zanak’omby mifahy.’', 'fa raha vao tonga kosa io zanakao io, izay nandanilany ny fanananao tamin’ny mpivaro-tena, dia namonoanao an’ilay zanak’omby mifahy.’'),
  ('6ab25c65b63604daeed9f89e', '2026-09-22T10:45:57.931Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:57.931Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 15, 18, 'Handeha hiverina any amin’ny raiko aho, dia hiteny aminy hoe: “Dada a, efa nanota tamin’ny lanitra sy taminao aho.', 'handeha hiverina any amin’ny raiko aho, dia hiteny aminy hoe: “dada a, efa nanota tamin’ny lanitra sy taminao aho.'),
  ('6ab25c663986c88485444e92', '2026-09-22T10:45:58.418Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:58.418Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 16, 5, 'Dia nantsoiny tsirairay ireo olona nananan’ny tompony trosa, ka hoy izy tamin’ilay voalohany: ‘Inona no ananan’ny tompoko aminao?’', 'dia nantsoiny tsirairay ireo olona nananan’ny tompony trosa, ka hoy izy tamin’ilay voalohany: ‘inona no ananan’ny tompoko aminao?’'),
  ('6ab25c663986c88485444e8e', '2026-09-22T10:45:58.418Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:58.418Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 16, 1, 'Hoy koa i Jesosy tamin’ny mpianany: “Nisy lehilahy manankarena nanana mpanompo iray niandraikitra ny tao an-tranony. Ary nisy niampanga izy io hoe nandanilany ny fananan’ny tompony.', 'hoy koa i jesosy tamin’ny mpianany: “nisy lehilahy manankarena nanana mpanompo iray niandraikitra ny tao an-tranony. ary nisy niampanga izy io hoe nandanilany ny fananan’ny tompony.'),
  ('6ab25c663986c88485444e8f', '2026-09-22T10:45:58.418Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:58.418Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 16, 2, 'Koa niantso azy ilay tompony, dia niteny hoe: ‘Inona izany henoko momba anao izany? Omeo ahy ny tatitra momba ny asa nankinina taminao, fa tsy hiandraikitra ny ato an-tranoko intsony ianao.’', 'koa niantso azy ilay tompony, dia niteny hoe: ‘inona izany henoko momba anao izany? omeo ahy ny tatitra momba ny asa nankinina taminao, fa tsy hiandraikitra ny ato an-tranoko intsony ianao.’'),
  ('6ab25c663986c88485444e90', '2026-09-22T10:45:58.418Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:58.418Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 16, 3, 'Dia nieritreritra ilay mpanompo hoe: ‘Inona re no hataoko e? Hesorin’ny tompoko tsy ho mpiandraikitra ny fananany aho izao. Ny miasa tany anefa tsy vitako fa kely aina aho; ny mangataka koa mahamenatra ahy.', 'dia nieritreritra ilay mpanompo hoe: ‘inona re no hataoko e? hesorin’ny tompoko tsy ho mpiandraikitra ny fananany aho izao. ny miasa tany anefa tsy vitako fa kely aina aho; ny mangataka koa mahamenatra ahy.'),
  ('6ab25c663986c88485444e94', '2026-09-22T10:45:58.418Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:58.418Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 16, 7, 'Avy eo, dia hoy izy tamin’ny iray hafa: ‘Ary ianao, inona no ananany aminao?’ Dia namaly ilay olona hoe: ‘Varimbazaha injaton’ny kora.’ Koa niteny taminy izy hoe: ‘Alaivo ilay taratasy fifanekena nataonao, dia soraty hoe 80.’', 'avy eo, dia hoy izy tamin’ny iray hafa: ‘ary ianao, inona no ananany aminao?’ dia namaly ilay olona hoe: ‘varimbazaha injaton’ny kora.’ koa niteny taminy izy hoe: ‘alaivo ilay taratasy fifanekena nataonao, dia soraty hoe 80.’'),
  ('6ab25c663986c88485444e91', '2026-09-22T10:45:58.418Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:58.418Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 16, 4, 'Ah! Hitako ny hataoko mba hisy olona handray ahy ho ao an-tranony, rehefa voaroaka aho.’', 'ah! hitako ny hataoko mba hisy olona handray ahy ho ao an-tranony, rehefa voaroaka aho.’'),
  ('6ab25c663986c88485444e93', '2026-09-22T10:45:58.418Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:58.418Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 16, 6, 'Namaly izy hoe: ‘Menak’oliva injaton’ny bata.’ Dia hoy ilay mpanompo: ‘Alaivo ilay taratasy fifanekena nataonao, ary mipetraha dia soraty haingana hoe 50.’', 'namaly izy hoe: ‘menak’oliva injaton’ny bata.’ dia hoy ilay mpanompo: ‘alaivo ilay taratasy fifanekena nataonao, ary mipetraha dia soraty haingana hoe 50.’'),
  ('6ab25c663986c88485444ea2', '2026-09-22T10:45:58.419Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:58.419Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 16, 21, 'Mba te hihinana an’izay sakafo latsaka avy tamin’ny latabatr’ilay mpanankarena izy. Na ny alika aza tonga hilelaka ny feriny.', 'mba te hihinana an’izay sakafo latsaka avy tamin’ny latabatr’ilay mpanankarena izy. na ny alika aza tonga hilelaka ny feriny.'),
  ('6ab25c663986c88485444e9d', '2026-09-22T10:45:58.419Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:58.419Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 16, 16, '“Hatreo amin’i Jaona ihany ny Lalàna sy ny Mpaminany. Fa nanomboka teo dia ny Fanjakan’Andriamanitra no vaovao tsara torina amin’ny olona, ary misisika mafy ho ao ny karazan’olona rehetra.', '“hatreo amin’i jaona ihany ny lalàna sy ny mpaminany. fa nanomboka teo dia ny fanjakan’andriamanitra no vaovao tsara torina amin’ny olona, ary misisika mafy ho ao ny karazan’olona rehetra.'),
  ('6ab25c663986c88485444ea5', '2026-09-22T10:45:58.419Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:58.419Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 16, 24, 'Koa niantso izy hoe: ‘Abrahama raiko ô, mamindrà fo amiko! Mba iraho i Lazarosy hanatsoboka ny tendron’ny rantsantanany ao anaty rano mba hampangatsiatsiaka ny lelako, fa mijaly aho ato amin’ity afo miredareda ity.’', 'koa niantso izy hoe: ‘abrahama raiko ô, mamindrà fo amiko! mba iraho i lazarosy hanatsoboka ny tendron’ny rantsantanany ao anaty rano mba hampangatsiatsiaka ny lelako, fa mijaly aho ato amin’ity afo miredareda ity.’'),
  ('6ab25c663986c88485444e9b', '2026-09-22T10:45:58.419Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:58.419Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 16, 14, 'Nihaino an’izany rehetra izany ny Fariseo tia vola, ka naneso an’i Jesosy.', 'nihaino an’izany rehetra izany ny fariseo tia vola, ka naneso an’i jesosy.'),
  ('6ab25c663986c88485444e99', '2026-09-22T10:45:58.419Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:58.419Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 16, 12, 'Ary raha tsy asehonareo hoe mendri-pitokisana ianareo amin’izay ataonareo amin’ny zavatr’olona, iza no hanome zavatra ho anareo?', 'ary raha tsy asehonareo hoe mendri-pitokisana ianareo amin’izay ataonareo amin’ny zavatr’olona, iza no hanome zavatra ho anareo?'),
  ('6ab25c663986c88485444e9f', '2026-09-22T10:45:58.419Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:58.419Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 16, 18, '“Manitsakitsa-bady izay lehilahy misaraka amin’ny vadiny ka manambady olon-kafa. Ary izay manambady vehivavy nisarahan’ny vadiny, dia manitsakitsa-bady.', '“manitsakitsa-bady izay lehilahy misaraka amin’ny vadiny ka manambady olon-kafa. ary izay manambady vehivavy nisarahan’ny vadiny, dia manitsakitsa-bady.'),
  ('6ab25c663986c88485444e9a', '2026-09-22T10:45:58.419Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:58.419Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 16, 13, 'Tsy misy mpanompo mahavita manompo tompo roa, fa ny iray ho halany ary ny iray ho tiany, na ny iray hifikirany ary ny iray hataony tsinontsinona. Tsy mahavita manompo an’Andriamanitra sy ny Harena ianareo.”', 'tsy misy mpanompo mahavita manompo tompo roa, fa ny iray ho halany ary ny iray ho tiany, na ny iray hifikirany ary ny iray hataony tsinontsinona. tsy mahavita manompo an’andriamanitra sy ny harena ianareo.”'),
  ('6ab25c663986c88485444ea9', '2026-09-22T10:45:58.419Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:58.419Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 16, 28, 'Manana rahalahy dimy mantsy aho, ka iraho izy hanazava tsara amin-dry zareo, sao ho lasa atỳ amin’ity toeram-pijaliana ity koa ry zareo.’', 'manana rahalahy dimy mantsy aho, ka iraho izy hanazava tsara amin-dry zareo, sao ho lasa atỳ amin’ity toeram-pijaliana ity koa ry zareo.’'),
  ('6ab25c663986c88485444ea7', '2026-09-22T10:45:58.419Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:58.419Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 16, 26, 'Sady efa nasiana hantsana be koa ange hampisaraka anay aminareo e, mba tsy ho afaka hankany aminareo izay te hiala atỳ, ary tsy ho afaka hiampita mankatỳ aminay ny any.’', 'sady efa nasiana hantsana be koa ange hampisaraka anay aminareo e, mba tsy ho afaka hankany aminareo izay te hiala atỳ, ary tsy ho afaka hiampita mankatỳ aminay ny any.’'),
  ('6ab25c663986c88485444e9e', '2026-09-22T10:45:58.419Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:58.419Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 16, 17, 'Ho mora kokoa ny hahalevona ny lanitra sy ny tany, noho ny hoe tsy ho tanteraka ny tendron-tsoratra iray ao amin’ny Lalàna.', 'ho mora kokoa ny hahalevona ny lanitra sy ny tany, noho ny hoe tsy ho tanteraka ny tendron-tsoratra iray ao amin’ny lalàna.'),
  ('6ab25c663986c88485444ea3', '2026-09-22T10:45:58.419Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:58.419Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 16, 22, 'Tatỳ aoriana, dia maty ilay mpangataka, ary nentin’ny anjely ho eo akaikin’i Abrahama. “Maty koa ilay mpanankarena ka nalevina.', 'tatỳ aoriana, dia maty ilay mpangataka, ary nentin’ny anjely ho eo akaikin’i abrahama. “maty koa ilay mpanankarena ka nalevina.'),
  ('6ab25c663986c88485444e9c', '2026-09-22T10:45:58.419Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:58.419Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 16, 15, 'Koa niteny tamin’izy ireo i Jesosy hoe: “Ianareo milaza ny tenanareo ho marina eo anatrehan’ny olona, nefa fantatr’Andriamanitra ny fonareo. Fa izay heverin’ny olona ho ambony, dia maharikoriko eo imason’Andriamanitra.', 'koa niteny tamin’izy ireo i jesosy hoe: “ianareo milaza ny tenanareo ho marina eo anatrehan’ny olona, nefa fantatr’andriamanitra ny fonareo. fa izay heverin’ny olona ho ambony, dia maharikoriko eo imason’andriamanitra.'),
  ('6ab25c663986c88485444e98', '2026-09-22T10:45:58.419Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:58.419Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 16, 11, 'Koa raha tsy asehonareo hoe mendri-pitokisana ianareo rehefa mampiasa harena tsy marina, iza no hanankina aminareo ny tena harena?', 'koa raha tsy asehonareo hoe mendri-pitokisana ianareo rehefa mampiasa harena tsy marina, iza no hanankina aminareo ny tena harena?'),
  ('6ab25c663986c88485444e97', '2026-09-22T10:45:58.419Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:58.419Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 16, 10, 'Izay mendri-pitokisana amin’ny zavatra kely dia mendri-pitokisana koa amin’ny zavatra lehibe, ary izay tsy marina amin’ny zavatra kely dia tsy marina koa amin’ny zavatra lehibe.', 'izay mendri-pitokisana amin’ny zavatra kely dia mendri-pitokisana koa amin’ny zavatra lehibe, ary izay tsy marina amin’ny zavatra kely dia tsy marina koa amin’ny zavatra lehibe.'),
  ('6ab25c663986c88485444eab', '2026-09-22T10:45:58.419Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:58.419Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 16, 30, 'Dia hoy izy: ‘Tsy hihaino ry zareo, ry Abrahama ray ô! Fa raha misy avy amin’ny maty mankany aminy, dia hibebaka ry zareo.’', 'dia hoy izy: ‘tsy hihaino ry zareo, ry abrahama ray ô! fa raha misy avy amin’ny maty mankany aminy, dia hibebaka ry zareo.’'),
  ('6ab25c663986c88485444eaa', '2026-09-22T10:45:58.419Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:58.419Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 16, 29, 'Fa hoy i Abrahama: ‘Manana an’i Mosesy sy ny Mpaminany ry zareo. Aoka izy hihaino an’ireo.’', 'fa hoy i abrahama: ‘manana an’i mosesy sy ny mpaminany ry zareo. aoka izy hihaino an’ireo.’'),
  ('6ab25c663986c88485444ea8', '2026-09-22T10:45:58.419Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:58.419Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 16, 27, 'Dia hoy izy: ‘Raha izany no izy, dia mba mangataka aminao aho, ray ô, mba haniraka an’i Lazarosy ho any an-tranon’ny raiko.', 'dia hoy izy: ‘raha izany no izy, dia mba mangataka aminao aho, ray ô, mba haniraka an’i lazarosy ho any an-tranon’ny raiko.'),
  ('6ab25c663986c88485444ea6', '2026-09-22T10:45:58.419Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:58.419Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 16, 25, 'Fa hoy i Abrahama: ‘Tadidio, anaka, fa efa azonao daholo ny zava-tsoa rehetra nirinao, nandritra ny androm-piainanao. I Lazarosy kosa feno fahoriana ny fiainany. Izao anefa izy ampiononina atỳ, fa ianao kosa mijaly.', 'fa hoy i abrahama: ‘tadidio, anaka, fa efa azonao daholo ny zava-tsoa rehetra nirinao, nandritra ny androm-piainanao. i lazarosy kosa feno fahoriana ny fiainany. izao anefa izy ampiononina atỳ, fa ianao kosa mijaly.'),
  ('6ab25c663986c88485444e95', '2026-09-22T10:45:58.419Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:58.419Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 16, 8, 'Ary noderain’ny tompony ilay mpanompo, na dia nanao ny tsy marina aza, satria malina. Fa hita hoe malina kokoa noho ny zanaky ny mazava ny zanak’izao tontolo izao, rehefa mifampiraharaha amin’ny mpiara-belona aminy.', 'ary noderain’ny tompony ilay mpanompo, na dia nanao ny tsy marina aza, satria malina. fa hita hoe malina kokoa noho ny zanaky ny mazava ny zanak’izao tontolo izao, rehefa mifampiraharaha amin’ny mpiara-belona aminy.'),
  ('6ab25c663986c88485444eac', '2026-09-22T10:45:58.419Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:58.419Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 16, 31, 'Hoy anefa i Abrahama: ‘Raha tsy mihaino an’i Mosesy sy ny Mpaminany ry zareo, dia tsy ho resy lahatra na dia misy mitsangana amin’ny maty aza.’”', 'hoy anefa i abrahama: ‘raha tsy mihaino an’i mosesy sy ny mpaminany ry zareo, dia tsy ho resy lahatra na dia misy mitsangana amin’ny maty aza.’”'),
  ('6ab25c663986c88485444ea4', '2026-09-22T10:45:58.419Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:58.419Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 16, 23, 'Raha iny izy nijalijaly tao amin’ny Fasana iny, dia nitraka izy ka nahita an’i Abrahama terỳ lavitra terỳ, sy Lazarosy teo akaikiny.', 'raha iny izy nijalijaly tao amin’ny fasana iny, dia nitraka izy ka nahita an’i abrahama terỳ lavitra terỳ, sy lazarosy teo akaikiny.'),
  ('6ab25c663986c88485444ea0', '2026-09-22T10:45:58.419Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:58.419Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 16, 19, '“Nisy lehilahy iray mpanankarena nanao akanjo vita tamin’ny lamba volomparasy sy rongony. Nifalifaly foana izy isan’andro, sady nanaram-po nanao izay nahafinaritra azy.', '“nisy lehilahy iray mpanankarena nanao akanjo vita tamin’ny lamba volomparasy sy rongony. nifalifaly foana izy isan’andro, sady nanaram-po nanao izay nahafinaritra azy.'),
  ('6ab25c663986c88485444ea1', '2026-09-22T10:45:58.419Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:58.419Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 16, 20, 'Nisy mpangataka atao hoe Lazarosy kosa napetraka teo am-bavahadiny. Feno fery izy io.', 'nisy mpangataka atao hoe lazarosy kosa napetraka teo am-bavahadiny. feno fery izy io.'),
  ('6ab25c663986c88485444e96', '2026-09-22T10:45:58.419Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:58.419Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 16, 9, '“Izao koa no lazaiko aminareo: Ataovy izay hahazoana namana amin’ny alalan’ny harena tsy marina, mba horaisin’ireny namana ireny any amin’ny fonenana mandrakizay ianareo rehefa lany izany harena izany.', '“izao koa no lazaiko aminareo: ataovy izay hahazoana namana amin’ny alalan’ny harena tsy marina, mba horaisin’ireny namana ireny any amin’ny fonenana mandrakizay ianareo rehefa lany izany harena izany.'),
  ('6ab25c662fbbd3e2ab58fa1a', '2026-09-22T10:45:58.855Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:58.855Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 17, 1, 'Ary hoy i Jesosy tamin’ny mpianany: “Tsy maintsy hisy toe-javatra mahatafintohina, kanefa hahita loza izay olona mahatonga an’izany!', 'ary hoy i jesosy tamin’ny mpianany: “tsy maintsy hisy toe-javatra mahatafintohina, kanefa hahita loza izay olona mahatonga an’izany!'),
  ('6ab25c662fbbd3e2ab58fa1b', '2026-09-22T10:45:58.855Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:58.855Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 17, 2, 'Aleo aza hanantonana vato lehibe fikosoham-bary eo amin’ny vozon’izany olona izany, dia hatsipy any an-dranomasina izy, toy izay hanafintohina ny iray amin’ireny madinika ireny.', 'aleo aza hanantonana vato lehibe fikosoham-bary eo amin’ny vozon’izany olona izany, dia hatsipy any an-dranomasina izy, toy izay hanafintohina ny iray amin’ireny madinika ireny.'),
  ('6ab25c662fbbd3e2ab58fa1c', '2026-09-22T10:45:58.855Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:58.855Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 17, 3, 'Koa mitandrema ianareo. Teneno mafy ny rahalahinao raha manota, ka raha mibebaka izy dia mamelà azy.', 'koa mitandrema ianareo. teneno mafy ny rahalahinao raha manota, ka raha mibebaka izy dia mamelà azy.'),
  ('6ab25c662fbbd3e2ab58fa1d', '2026-09-22T10:45:58.855Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:58.855Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 17, 4, 'Fa na manota aminao impito aza izy ao anatin’ny indray andro, ka miverina impito eo aminao ary miteny hoe: ‘Mifona aho’, dia tsy maintsy mamela azy ianao.”', 'fa na manota aminao impito aza izy ao anatin’ny indray andro, ka miverina impito eo aminao ary miteny hoe: ‘mifona aho’, dia tsy maintsy mamela azy ianao.”'),
  ('6ab25c662fbbd3e2ab58fa1e', '2026-09-22T10:45:58.855Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:58.855Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 17, 5, 'Hoy ny apostoly tamin’ny Tompo: “Ampitomboy ny finoanay.”', 'hoy ny apostoly tamin’ny tompo: “ampitomboy ny finoanay.”'),
  ('6ab25c662fbbd3e2ab58fa1f', '2026-09-22T10:45:58.855Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:58.855Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 17, 6, 'Dia hoy ny Tompo: “Raha manana finoana ianareo, na faran’izay kely hoatran’ny voan-tsinapy aza, ary hiteny amin’itsy voaroihazo itsy hoe: ‘Miongota ary maniria any an-dranomasina!’, dia hankatò anareo izy.', 'dia hoy ny tompo: “raha manana finoana ianareo, na faran’izay kely hoatran’ny voan-tsinapy aza, ary hiteny amin’itsy voaroihazo itsy hoe: ‘miongota ary maniria any an-dranomasina!’, dia hankatò anareo izy.'),
  ('6ab25c662fbbd3e2ab58fa20', '2026-09-22T10:45:58.855Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:58.855Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 17, 7, '“Andao hatao hoe manana mpanompo miasa tany na miandry ondry ianareo. Rehefa mody avy any an-tsaha izy, dia iza aminareo no hilaza aminy hoe: ‘Avia, tonga dia mipetraha hisakafo eo amin’ny latabatra’?', '“andao hatao hoe manana mpanompo miasa tany na miandry ondry ianareo. rehefa mody avy any an-tsaha izy, dia iza aminareo no hilaza aminy hoe: ‘avia, tonga dia mipetraha hisakafo eo amin’ny latabatra’?'),
  ('6ab25c662fbbd3e2ab58fa21', '2026-09-22T10:45:58.855Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:58.855Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 17, 8, 'Tsy hiteny aminy kosa ve izy hoe: ‘Karakarao ny sakafo harivako, ary anaovy ny aron’akanjonao dia rosoy sakafo aho, ary rehefa avy mihinana sy misotro aho, dia mahazo mihinana sy misotro koa ianao’?', 'tsy hiteny aminy kosa ve izy hoe: ‘karakarao ny sakafo harivako, ary anaovy ny aron’akanjonao dia rosoy sakafo aho, ary rehefa avy mihinana sy misotro aho, dia mahazo mihinana sy misotro koa ianao’?'),
  ('6ab25c662fbbd3e2ab58fa22', '2026-09-22T10:45:58.855Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:58.855Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 17, 9, 'Tsy hankasitraka an’ilay mpanompo izy, satria izay nasainy natao fotsiny no nataon’izy io, sa tsy izany?', 'tsy hankasitraka an’ilay mpanompo izy, satria izay nasainy natao fotsiny no nataon’izy io, sa tsy izany?'),
  ('6ab25c662fbbd3e2ab58fa23', '2026-09-22T10:45:58.855Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:58.855Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 17, 10, 'Hoatr’izany koa fa rehefa vitanareo izay rehetra nasaina nataonareo, dia izao lazaina: ‘Izahay ange mpanompo fotsiny ihany e! Izay tokony ho nataonay ihany no nataonay.’”', 'hoatr’izany koa fa rehefa vitanareo izay rehetra nasaina nataonareo, dia izao lazaina: ‘izahay ange mpanompo fotsiny ihany e! izay tokony ho nataonay ihany no nataonay.’”'),
  ('6ab25c662fbbd3e2ab58fa24', '2026-09-22T10:45:58.855Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:58.855Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 17, 11, 'Nandalo teo anelanelan’i Samaria sy Galilia izy, rehefa nankany Jerosalema.', 'nandalo teo anelanelan’i samaria sy galilia izy, rehefa nankany jerosalema.'),
  ('6ab25c662fbbd3e2ab58fa25', '2026-09-22T10:45:58.855Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:58.855Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 17, 12, 'Rehefa niditra tao amin’ny tanàna kely iray izy, dia nisy boka folo lahy nifanena taminy. Nijoro teny lavidavitra teny izy ireo,', 'rehefa niditra tao amin’ny tanàna kely iray izy, dia nisy boka folo lahy nifanena taminy. nijoro teny lavidavitra teny izy ireo,'),
  ('6ab25c662fbbd3e2ab58fa26', '2026-09-22T10:45:58.855Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:58.855Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 17, 13, 'ary niantso mafy hoe: “Ry Jesosy Mpampianatra ô, mba iantrao izahay!”', 'ary niantso mafy hoe: “ry jesosy mpampianatra ô, mba iantrao izahay!”'),
  ('6ab25c662fbbd3e2ab58fa27', '2026-09-22T10:45:58.855Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:58.855Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 17, 14, 'Rehefa nahita azy ireo izy, dia niteny hoe: “Mandehana miseho any amin’ny mpisorona.” Dia lasa izy ireo, ka nadio raha mbola teny an-dalana.', 'rehefa nahita azy ireo izy, dia niteny hoe: “mandehana miseho any amin’ny mpisorona.” dia lasa izy ireo, ka nadio raha mbola teny an-dalana.'),
  ('6ab25c662fbbd3e2ab58fa28', '2026-09-22T10:45:58.855Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:58.855Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 17, 15, 'Rehefa hitan’ny anankiray fa sitrana izy, dia lasa izy niverina ka nanome voninahitra an’Andriamanitra tamin’ny feo avo.', 'rehefa hitan’ny anankiray fa sitrana izy, dia lasa izy niverina ka nanome voninahitra an’andriamanitra tamin’ny feo avo.'),
  ('6ab25c662fbbd3e2ab58fa29', '2026-09-22T10:45:58.855Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:58.855Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 17, 16, 'Dia niankohoka teo an-tongotr’i Jesosy izy, ka nisaotra azy. Samaritanina izy io.', 'dia niankohoka teo an-tongotr’i jesosy izy, ka nisaotra azy. samaritanina izy io.'),
  ('6ab25c662fbbd3e2ab58fa2a', '2026-09-22T10:45:58.855Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:58.855Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 17, 17, 'Koa niteny i Jesosy hoe: “Tsy efa voadio daholo moa izy folo? Fa aiza ny sivy?', 'koa niteny i jesosy hoe: “tsy efa voadio daholo moa izy folo? fa aiza ny sivy?'),
  ('6ab25c662fbbd3e2ab58fa2b', '2026-09-22T10:45:58.855Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:58.855Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 17, 18, 'Dia tsy mba nisy niverina hanome voninahitra an’Andriamanitra afa-tsy ity hafa firenena ity ve?”', 'dia tsy mba nisy niverina hanome voninahitra an’andriamanitra afa-tsy ity hafa firenena ity ve?”'),
  ('6ab25c662fbbd3e2ab58fa2c', '2026-09-22T10:45:58.855Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:58.855Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 17, 19, 'Hoy izy avy eo: “Mitsangàna dia mandehana. Ny finoanao no nahasitrana anao.”', 'hoy izy avy eo: “mitsangàna dia mandehana. ny finoanao no nahasitrana anao.”'),
  ('6ab25c662fbbd3e2ab58fa2d', '2026-09-22T10:45:58.855Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:58.855Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 17, 20, 'Ary nanontanian’ny Fariseo i Jesosy hoe rahoviana no ho tonga ny Fanjakan’Andriamanitra. Dia namaly izy hoe: “Tsy miharihary ny fahatongavan’ny Fanjakan’Andriamanitra,', 'ary nanontanian’ny fariseo i jesosy hoe rahoviana no ho tonga ny fanjakan’andriamanitra. dia namaly izy hoe: “tsy miharihary ny fahatongavan’ny fanjakan’andriamanitra,'),
  ('6ab25c662fbbd3e2ab58fa2e', '2026-09-22T10:45:58.855Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:58.855Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 17, 21, 'ary tsy hisy koa hilaza hoe: ‘Atỳ!’ na ‘Arỳ!’ Fa eo afovoanareo ny Fanjakan’Andriamanitra.”', 'ary tsy hisy koa hilaza hoe: ‘atỳ!’ na ‘arỳ!’ fa eo afovoanareo ny fanjakan’andriamanitra.”'),
  ('6ab25c662fbbd3e2ab58fa2f', '2026-09-22T10:45:58.855Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:58.855Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 17, 22, 'Hoy izy tamin’ny mpianany avy eo: “Ho avy ny andro hanirianareo hahita ny anankiray amin’ny andron’ny Zanak’olona, fa tsy hahita ianareo.', 'hoy izy tamin’ny mpianany avy eo: “ho avy ny andro hanirianareo hahita ny anankiray amin’ny andron’ny zanak’olona, fa tsy hahita ianareo.'),
  ('6ab25c662fbbd3e2ab58fa30', '2026-09-22T10:45:58.855Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:58.855Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 17, 23, 'Ary hilaza aminareo ny olona hoe: ‘Arỳ!’ na ‘Atỳ!’, nefa aza mandeha na manaraka azy.', 'ary hilaza aminareo ny olona hoe: ‘arỳ!’ na ‘atỳ!’, nefa aza mandeha na manaraka azy.'),
  ('6ab25c662fbbd3e2ab58fa31', '2026-09-22T10:45:58.855Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:58.855Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 17, 24, 'Fa toy ny tselatra manazava ny faritra iray amin’ny lanitra ka hatrany amin’ny faritra hafa amin’ny lanitra, dia ho toy izany koa ny Zanak’olona amin’ny androny.', 'fa toy ny tselatra manazava ny faritra iray amin’ny lanitra ka hatrany amin’ny faritra hafa amin’ny lanitra, dia ho toy izany koa ny zanak’olona amin’ny androny.'),
  ('6ab25c662fbbd3e2ab58fa32', '2026-09-22T10:45:58.855Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:58.855Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 17, 25, 'Tsy maintsy hampijalijalina anefa aloha izy, ary holavin’ity taranaka ity.', 'tsy maintsy hampijalijalina anefa aloha izy, ary holavin’ity taranaka ity.'),
  ('6ab25c662fbbd3e2ab58fa33', '2026-09-22T10:45:58.855Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:58.855Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 17, 26, 'Ary hoatran’izay nitranga tamin’ny andron’i Noa no hitranga koa amin’ny andron’ny Zanak’olona:', 'ary hoatran’izay nitranga tamin’ny andron’i noa no hitranga koa amin’ny andron’ny zanak’olona:'),
  ('6ab25c662fbbd3e2ab58fa34', '2026-09-22T10:45:58.855Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:58.855Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 17, 27, 'Nihinana ny olona, nisotro, nampaka-bady sy navoaka hampakarina, mandra-pahatongan’ilay andro nidiran’i Noa tao amin’ny sambofiara. Ary tonga ny Safodrano ka nandringana azy rehetra.', 'nihinana ny olona, nisotro, nampaka-bady sy navoaka hampakarina, mandra-pahatongan’ilay andro nidiran’i noa tao amin’ny sambofiara. ary tonga ny safodrano ka nandringana azy rehetra.'),
  ('6ab25c662fbbd3e2ab58fa35', '2026-09-22T10:45:58.855Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:58.855Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 17, 28, 'Dia hoatran’izay nitranga tamin’ny andron’i Lota koa: Nihinana ny olona, nisotro, nividy, nivarotra, namboly, ary nanorina trano.', 'dia hoatran’izay nitranga tamin’ny andron’i lota koa: nihinana ny olona, nisotro, nividy, nivarotra, namboly, ary nanorina trano.'),
  ('6ab25c662fbbd3e2ab58fa36', '2026-09-22T10:45:58.855Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:58.855Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 17, 29, 'Fa tamin’ny andro nivoahan’i Lota avy tao Sodoma, dia nilatsaka toy ny orana ny afo sy solifara avy tany an-danitra, ka nandringana azy rehetra.', 'fa tamin’ny andro nivoahan’i lota avy tao sodoma, dia nilatsaka toy ny orana ny afo sy solifara avy tany an-danitra, ka nandringana azy rehetra.'),
  ('6ab25c662fbbd3e2ab58fa37', '2026-09-22T10:45:58.855Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:58.855Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 17, 30, 'Dia ho toy izany koa amin’ny andro hampiharihariana ny Zanak’olona.', 'dia ho toy izany koa amin’ny andro hampiharihariana ny zanak’olona.');
INSERT INTO "bible_verses" ("id", "created_date", "updated_date", "created_by_id", "created_by", "translation", "book", "bookOrder", "chapter", "verse", "text", "normalizedText") VALUES
  ('6ab25c662fbbd3e2ab58fa38', '2026-09-22T10:45:58.855Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:58.855Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 17, 31, '“Amin’izany andro izany, dia tsy tokony hidina haka ny entany ao an-trano izay any an-tampon-trano, ary tsy tokony hiverina any amin’izay efa nilaozany koa izay any an-tsaha.', '“amin’izany andro izany, dia tsy tokony hidina haka ny entany ao an-trano izay any an-tampon-trano, ary tsy tokony hiverina any amin’izay efa nilaozany koa izay any an-tsaha.'),
  ('6ab25c662fbbd3e2ab58fa39', '2026-09-22T10:45:58.855Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:58.855Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 17, 32, 'Tsarovy ny vadin’i Lota.', 'tsarovy ny vadin’i lota.'),
  ('6ab25c662fbbd3e2ab58fa3a', '2026-09-22T10:45:58.855Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:58.855Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 17, 33, 'Izay miezaka hiaro ny ainy no hamoy an’izany, fa izay mamoy ny ainy kosa no hiaro an’izany.', 'izay miezaka hiaro ny ainy no hamoy an’izany, fa izay mamoy ny ainy kosa no hiaro an’izany.'),
  ('6ab25c662fbbd3e2ab58fa3b', '2026-09-22T10:45:58.855Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:58.855Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 17, 34, 'Lazaiko aminareo fa amin’izany alina izany, dia hisy olona roa iray fandriana: Ny iray hoentina fa ny iray havela.', 'lazaiko aminareo fa amin’izany alina izany, dia hisy olona roa iray fandriana: ny iray hoentina fa ny iray havela.'),
  ('6ab25c662fbbd3e2ab58fa3c', '2026-09-22T10:45:58.855Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:58.855Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 17, 35, 'Ary hisy roa vavy hanodina vato fikosoham-bary iray ihany: Ny iray hoentina fa ny iray havela.”', 'ary hisy roa vavy hanodina vato fikosoham-bary iray ihany: ny iray hoentina fa ny iray havela.”'),
  ('6ab25c662fbbd3e2ab58fa3d', '2026-09-22T10:45:58.855Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:58.855Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 17, 36, '* ——', '* ——'),
  ('6ab25c662fbbd3e2ab58fa3e', '2026-09-22T10:45:58.855Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:58.855Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 17, 37, 'Koa niteny taminy izy ireo hoe: “Aiza izany, Tompo ô?” Dia hoy izy: “Any amin’izay misy ny faty, dia any koa no hiangonan’ny voromahery.”', 'koa niteny taminy izy ireo hoe: “aiza izany, tompo ô?” dia hoy izy: “any amin’izay misy ny faty, dia any koa no hiangonan’ny voromahery.”'),
  ('6ab25c678ff118bc1e73ff3a', '2026-09-22T10:45:59.911Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:59.911Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 18, 6, 'Dia hoy ny Tompo: “Henoy izany tenin’ilay mpitsara izany! Izy aza olona tsy marina nefa miteny an’izany.', 'dia hoy ny tompo: “henoy izany tenin’ilay mpitsara izany! izy aza olona tsy marina nefa miteny an’izany.'),
  ('6ab25c678ff118bc1e73ff3c', '2026-09-22T10:45:59.911Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:59.911Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 18, 8, 'Lazaiko aminareo fa hataony haingana izay hanomezana rariny azy ireo. Rehefa tonga anefa ny Zanak’olona, tena hahita finoana hoatr’izany etỳ an-tany ve izy?”', 'lazaiko aminareo fa hataony haingana izay hanomezana rariny azy ireo. rehefa tonga anefa ny zanak’olona, tena hahita finoana hoatr’izany etỳ an-tany ve izy?”'),
  ('6ab25c678ff118bc1e73ff3b', '2026-09-22T10:45:59.911Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:59.911Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 18, 7, 'Tsy hataon’Andriamanitra mahazo rariny tokoa ve ny olom-boafidiny izay mitaraina aminy andro aman’alina, na dia hoe manam-paharetana amin’izy ireo aza izy?', 'tsy hataon’andriamanitra mahazo rariny tokoa ve ny olom-boafidiny izay mitaraina aminy andro aman’alina, na dia hoe manam-paharetana amin’izy ireo aza izy?'),
  ('6ab25c678ff118bc1e73ff3d', '2026-09-22T10:45:59.911Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:59.911Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 18, 9, 'Nilaza an’izao fanoharana izao koa izy tamin’ireo nihevi-tena ho marina sy nanao tsinontsinona ny hafa:', 'nilaza an’izao fanoharana izao koa izy tamin’ireo nihevi-tena ho marina sy nanao tsinontsinona ny hafa:'),
  ('6ab25c678ff118bc1e73ff36', '2026-09-22T10:45:59.911Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:59.911Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 18, 2, 'Hoy izy: “Nisy mpitsara tsy natahotra an’Andriamanitra sady tsy niraharaha na iza na iza, tao amin’ny tanàna iray.', 'hoy izy: “nisy mpitsara tsy natahotra an’andriamanitra sady tsy niraharaha na iza na iza, tao amin’ny tanàna iray.'),
  ('6ab25c678ff118bc1e73ff38', '2026-09-22T10:45:59.911Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:59.911Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 18, 4, 'Tsy nety aloha ilay mpitsara nandritra ny fotoana elaela. Tatỳ aoriana anefa, dia nieritreritra izy hoe: ‘Na dia tsy matahotra an’Andriamanitra sy tsy miraharaha na iza na iza aza aho,', 'tsy nety aloha ilay mpitsara nandritra ny fotoana elaela. tatỳ aoriana anefa, dia nieritreritra izy hoe: ‘na dia tsy matahotra an’andriamanitra sy tsy miraharaha na iza na iza aza aho,'),
  ('6ab25c678ff118bc1e73ff35', '2026-09-22T10:45:59.911Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:59.911Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 18, 1, 'Ary nilaza fanoharana tamin’izy ireo i Jesosy momba ny hoe ilaina foana ny mivavaka, ka tsy ho kivy mihitsy.', 'ary nilaza fanoharana tamin’izy ireo i jesosy momba ny hoe ilaina foana ny mivavaka, ka tsy ho kivy mihitsy.'),
  ('6ab25c678ff118bc1e73ff39', '2026-09-22T10:45:59.911Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:59.911Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 18, 5, 'dia homeko rariny ihany io vehivavy mpitondratena io fa manelingelina ahy tsy misy farany. Amin’izay izy dia tsy ho tonga lava hangataka eto amiko eto, ka hanorisory ahy.’”', 'dia homeko rariny ihany io vehivavy mpitondratena io fa manelingelina ahy tsy misy farany. amin’izay izy dia tsy ho tonga lava hangataka eto amiko eto, ka hanorisory ahy.’”'),
  ('6ab25c678ff118bc1e73ff37', '2026-09-22T10:45:59.911Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:59.911Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 18, 3, 'Ary nisy vehivavy mpitondratena koa tao. Nandeha tany aminy foana izy io, ka niteny taminy hoe: ‘Mba ataovy re izay hahazoako rariny amin’ilay miady amiko any amin’ny fitsarana e!’', 'ary nisy vehivavy mpitondratena koa tao. nandeha tany aminy foana izy io, ka niteny taminy hoe: ‘mba ataovy re izay hahazoako rariny amin’ilay miady amiko any amin’ny fitsarana e!’'),
  ('6ab25c678ff118bc1e73ff53', '2026-09-22T10:45:59.912Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:59.912Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 18, 31, 'Dia nentiny nihataka kely izy 12 Lahy, ka hoy izy: “Miakatra ho any Jerosalema isika izao. Ary ho tanteraka daholo izay rehetra nosoratan’ny mpaminany momba ny Zanak’olona.', 'dia nentiny nihataka kely izy 12 lahy, ka hoy izy: “miakatra ho any jerosalema isika izao. ary ho tanteraka daholo izay rehetra nosoratan’ny mpaminany momba ny zanak’olona.'),
  ('6ab25c678ff118bc1e73ff5a', '2026-09-22T10:45:59.912Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:59.912Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 18, 38, 'Dia niantso mafy ilay jamba hoe: “Mba iantrao aho, ry Jesosy Zanak’i Davida ô!”', 'dia niantso mafy ilay jamba hoe: “mba iantrao aho, ry jesosy zanak’i davida ô!”'),
  ('6ab25c678ff118bc1e73ff59', '2026-09-22T10:45:59.912Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:59.912Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 18, 37, 'Ary hoy ny olona: “Mandalo i Jesosy avy any Nazareta!”', 'ary hoy ny olona: “mandalo i jesosy avy any nazareta!”'),
  ('6ab25c678ff118bc1e73ff4d', '2026-09-22T10:45:59.912Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:59.912Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 18, 25, 'Mora kokoa ny hidiran’ny rameva ao amin’ny vodifanjaitra, noho ny hidiran’ny mpanankarena ao amin’ny Fanjakan’Andriamanitra.”', 'mora kokoa ny hidiran’ny rameva ao amin’ny vodifanjaitra, noho ny hidiran’ny mpanankarena ao amin’ny fanjakan’andriamanitra.”'),
  ('6ab25c678ff118bc1e73ff52', '2026-09-22T10:45:59.912Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:59.912Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 18, 30, 'ka tsy hahazo be lavitra amin’izao andro izao, ary fiainana mandrakizay ao amin’ilay tontolo ho avy.”', 'ka tsy hahazo be lavitra amin’izao andro izao, ary fiainana mandrakizay ao amin’ilay tontolo ho avy.”'),
  ('6ab25c678ff118bc1e73ff5d', '2026-09-22T10:45:59.912Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:59.912Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 18, 41, '“Inona no tianao hataoko aminao?” Hoy izy: “Tompo ô, mba ataovy mahita indray aho.”', '“inona no tianao hataoko aminao?” hoy izy: “tompo ô, mba ataovy mahita indray aho.”'),
  ('6ab25c678ff118bc1e73ff4a', '2026-09-22T10:45:59.912Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:59.912Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 18, 22, 'Hoy i Jesosy rehefa naheno an’izany: “Misy zavatra iray mbola tokony hataonao: Amidio daholo ny fanananao, ka zarao amin’ny mahantra ny vola azo amin’ilay izy, dia hanana harena any an-danitra ianao. Ary andao hanara-dia ahy.”', 'hoy i jesosy rehefa naheno an’izany: “misy zavatra iray mbola tokony hataonao: amidio daholo ny fanananao, ka zarao amin’ny mahantra ny vola azo amin’ilay izy, dia hanana harena any an-danitra ianao. ary andao hanara-dia ahy.”'),
  ('6ab25c678ff118bc1e73ff45', '2026-09-22T10:45:59.912Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:59.912Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 18, 17, 'Lazaiko marina aminareo fa tsy maintsy mandray ny Fanjakan’Andriamanitra hoatran’ny zaza ianareo, fa raha tsy izany dia tsy ho tafiditra ao mihitsy.”', 'lazaiko marina aminareo fa tsy maintsy mandray ny fanjakan’andriamanitra hoatran’ny zaza ianareo, fa raha tsy izany dia tsy ho tafiditra ao mihitsy.”'),
  ('6ab25c678ff118bc1e73ff41', '2026-09-22T10:45:59.912Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:59.912Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 18, 13, 'Nijoro lavidavitra kosa ilay mpamory hetra, ary tsy sahy nitraka nijery ny lanitra, fa nikapo-tratra foana ka niteny hoe: ‘Andriamanitra ô, mamindrà fo amiko mpanota.’', 'nijoro lavidavitra kosa ilay mpamory hetra, ary tsy sahy nitraka nijery ny lanitra, fa nikapo-tratra foana ka niteny hoe: ‘andriamanitra ô, mamindrà fo amiko mpanota.’'),
  ('6ab25c678ff118bc1e73ff43', '2026-09-22T10:45:59.912Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:59.912Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 18, 15, 'Nentin’ny olona teo amin’i Jesosy koa ny zanany kely mba hokasihiny, nefa nibedy azy ireny ny mpianatra rehefa nahita an’izany.', 'nentin’ny olona teo amin’i jesosy koa ny zanany kely mba hokasihiny, nefa nibedy azy ireny ny mpianatra rehefa nahita an’izany.'),
  ('6ab25c678ff118bc1e73ff5c', '2026-09-22T10:45:59.912Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:59.912Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 18, 40, 'Dia nijanona i Jesosy ka nasainy nentina teo aminy ilay lehilahy. Rehefa nanatona ilay lehilahy, dia nanontany azy i Jesosy hoe:', 'dia nijanona i jesosy ka nasainy nentina teo aminy ilay lehilahy. rehefa nanatona ilay lehilahy, dia nanontany azy i jesosy hoe:'),
  ('6ab25c678ff118bc1e73ff51', '2026-09-22T10:45:59.912Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:59.912Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 18, 29, 'Dia hoy i Jesosy tamin’izy ireo: “Lazaiko marina aminareo fa tsy misy olona efa nahafoy trano, na vady, na rahalahy, na ray aman-dreny, na zanaka noho ny Fanjakan’Andriamanitra,', 'dia hoy i jesosy tamin’izy ireo: “lazaiko marina aminareo fa tsy misy olona efa nahafoy trano, na vady, na rahalahy, na ray aman-dreny, na zanaka noho ny fanjakan’andriamanitra,'),
  ('6ab25c678ff118bc1e73ff49', '2026-09-22T10:45:59.912Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:59.912Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 18, 21, 'Dia hoy izy: “Efa narahiko daholo izany hatramin’izaho mbola kely.”', 'dia hoy izy: “efa narahiko daholo izany hatramin’izaho mbola kely.”'),
  ('6ab25c678ff118bc1e73ff3e', '2026-09-22T10:45:59.912Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:59.912Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 18, 10, '“Nisy roa lahy niakatra nankao amin’ny tempoly mba hivavaka. Ny anankiray Fariseo ary ny anankiray mpamory hetra.', '“nisy roa lahy niakatra nankao amin’ny tempoly mba hivavaka. ny anankiray fariseo ary ny anankiray mpamory hetra.'),
  ('6ab25c678ff118bc1e73ff4f', '2026-09-22T10:45:59.912Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:59.912Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 18, 27, 'Dia niteny izy hoe: “Ny zavatra tsy hain’olombelona dia hain’Andriamanitra.”', 'dia niteny izy hoe: “ny zavatra tsy hain’olombelona dia hain’andriamanitra.”'),
  ('6ab25c678ff118bc1e73ff50', '2026-09-22T10:45:59.912Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:59.912Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 18, 28, 'Hoy anefa i Petera: “Efa nahafoy ny fanananay izahay dia nanaraka anao.”', 'hoy anefa i petera: “efa nahafoy ny fanananay izahay dia nanaraka anao.”'),
  ('6ab25c678ff118bc1e73ff46', '2026-09-22T10:45:59.912Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:59.912Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 18, 18, 'Ary nisy mpitondra teo amin’ny Jiosy nanontany azy hoe: “Mpampianatra Tsara ô, inona no tsy maintsy ataoko mba handovako fiainana mandrakizay?”', 'ary nisy mpitondra teo amin’ny jiosy nanontany azy hoe: “mpampianatra tsara ô, inona no tsy maintsy ataoko mba handovako fiainana mandrakizay?”'),
  ('6ab25c678ff118bc1e73ff5b', '2026-09-22T10:45:59.912Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:59.912Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 18, 39, 'Ary nibedy azy ny olona teny aloha sady niteny azy mba hangina, nefa vao mainka izy niantsoantso mafy hoe: “Ry Zanak’i Davida ô, mba iantrao aho!”', 'ary nibedy azy ny olona teny aloha sady niteny azy mba hangina, nefa vao mainka izy niantsoantso mafy hoe: “ry zanak’i davida ô, mba iantrao aho!”'),
  ('6ab25c678ff118bc1e73ff42', '2026-09-22T10:45:59.912Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:59.912Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 18, 14, 'Lazaiko aminareo fa izany lehilahy izany no hita fa marina noho ilay Fariseo, rehefa nidina tany an-tranony. Fa izay manandra-tena no haetry, ary izay manetry tena no hasandratra.”', 'lazaiko aminareo fa izany lehilahy izany no hita fa marina noho ilay fariseo, rehefa nidina tany an-tranony. fa izay manandra-tena no haetry, ary izay manetry tena no hasandratra.”'),
  ('6ab25c678ff118bc1e73ff56', '2026-09-22T10:45:59.912Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:59.912Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 18, 34, 'Tsy nisy azon’izy ireo anefa ny hevitr’izany. Fa nafenina taminy ny hevitr’izany teny izany, ka tsy azon’izy ireo izay zavatra nolazainy.', 'tsy nisy azon’izy ireo anefa ny hevitr’izany. fa nafenina taminy ny hevitr’izany teny izany, ka tsy azon’izy ireo izay zavatra nolazainy.'),
  ('6ab25c678ff118bc1e73ff4e', '2026-09-22T10:45:59.912Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:59.912Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 18, 26, 'Ary hoy izay naheno an’izany: “Dia mety hisy ho voavonjy ve raha izany?”', 'ary hoy izay naheno an’izany: “dia mety hisy ho voavonjy ve raha izany?”'),
  ('6ab25c678ff118bc1e73ff47', '2026-09-22T10:45:59.912Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:59.912Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 18, 19, 'Dia hoy i Jesosy: “Maninona aho no antsoinao hoe tsara? Tsy misy tsara afa-tsy iray ihany, dia Andriamanitra.', 'dia hoy i jesosy: “maninona aho no antsoinao hoe tsara? tsy misy tsara afa-tsy iray ihany, dia andriamanitra.'),
  ('6ab25c678ff118bc1e73ff40', '2026-09-22T10:45:59.912Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:59.912Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 18, 12, 'Mifady hanina indroa isan-kerinandro aho, ary manome ny ampahafolon’ny zava-drehetra azoko.’', 'mifady hanina indroa isan-kerinandro aho, ary manome ny ampahafolon’ny zava-drehetra azoko.’'),
  ('6ab25c678ff118bc1e73ff57', '2026-09-22T10:45:59.912Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:59.912Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 18, 35, 'Rehefa nanakaiky an’i Jeriko i Jesosy, dia nisy lehilahy iray jamba nipetraka nangataka teo amoron-dalana.', 'rehefa nanakaiky an’i jeriko i jesosy, dia nisy lehilahy iray jamba nipetraka nangataka teo amoron-dalana.'),
  ('6ab25c678ff118bc1e73ff48', '2026-09-22T10:45:59.912Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:59.912Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 18, 20, 'Fantatrao ny didy hoe: ‘Aza manitsakitsa-bady, aza mamono olona, aza mangalatra, aza mijoro ho vavolombelona mandainga. Hajao ny rainao sy ny reninao.’”', 'fantatrao ny didy hoe: ‘aza manitsakitsa-bady, aza mamono olona, aza mangalatra, aza mijoro ho vavolombelona mandainga. hajao ny rainao sy ny reninao.’”'),
  ('6ab25c678ff118bc1e73ff5f', '2026-09-22T10:45:59.912Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:59.912Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 18, 43, 'Avy hatrany dia nahita ilay lehilahy, ka nanomboka nanaraka an’i Jesosy ary nanome voninahitra an’Andriamanitra. Dia nidera an’Andriamanitra koa ny olona rehetra nahita an’izany.', 'avy hatrany dia nahita ilay lehilahy, ka nanomboka nanaraka an’i jesosy ary nanome voninahitra an’andriamanitra. dia nidera an’andriamanitra koa ny olona rehetra nahita an’izany.'),
  ('6ab25c678ff118bc1e73ff5e', '2026-09-22T10:45:59.912Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:59.912Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 18, 42, 'Hoy àry i Jesosy: “Aoka ianao hahita indray! Ny finoanao no nahasitrana anao.”', 'hoy àry i jesosy: “aoka ianao hahita indray! ny finoanao no nahasitrana anao.”'),
  ('6ab25c678ff118bc1e73ff58', '2026-09-22T10:45:59.912Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:59.912Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 18, 36, 'Nandre vahoaka be nandalo ilay lehilahy, ka nanontany hoe inona no nitranga.', 'nandre vahoaka be nandalo ilay lehilahy, ka nanontany hoe inona no nitranga.'),
  ('6ab25c678ff118bc1e73ff54', '2026-09-22T10:45:59.912Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:59.912Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 18, 32, 'Hatolotra amin’ny hafa firenena, ohatra, izy ary hihomehezany sady halany baraka ary hororany.', 'hatolotra amin’ny hafa firenena, ohatra, izy ary hihomehezany sady halany baraka ary hororany.'),
  ('6ab25c678ff118bc1e73ff4c', '2026-09-22T10:45:59.912Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:59.912Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 18, 24, 'Nijery azy i Jesosy, ary niteny hoe: “Tena ho sarotra amin’ny mpanam-bola ny hiditra ao amin’ny Fanjakan’Andriamanitra!', 'nijery azy i jesosy, ary niteny hoe: “tena ho sarotra amin’ny mpanam-bola ny hiditra ao amin’ny fanjakan’andriamanitra!'),
  ('6ab25c678ff118bc1e73ff55', '2026-09-22T10:45:59.912Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:59.912Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 18, 33, 'Dia hokaravasiny ny Zanak’olona, ary avy eo dia hovonoiny ho faty. Hitsangana anefa izy amin’ny andro fahatelo.”', 'dia hokaravasiny ny zanak’olona, ary avy eo dia hovonoiny ho faty. hitsangana anefa izy amin’ny andro fahatelo.”'),
  ('6ab25c678ff118bc1e73ff4b', '2026-09-22T10:45:59.912Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:59.912Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 18, 23, 'Nalahelo be anefa izy rehefa naheno an’izany, satria nanan-karena be.', 'nalahelo be anefa izy rehefa naheno an’izany, satria nanan-karena be.'),
  ('6ab25c678ff118bc1e73ff44', '2026-09-22T10:45:59.912Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:59.912Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 18, 16, 'Nantsoin’i Jesosy hankeo aminy anefa ny zazakely, ka hoy izy: “Avelao ny zaza hanatona ahy fa aza sakanana, fa an’izay hoatr’azy ny Fanjakan’Andriamanitra.', 'nantsoin’i jesosy hankeo aminy anefa ny zazakely, ka hoy izy: “avelao ny zaza hanatona ahy fa aza sakanana, fa an’izay hoatr’azy ny fanjakan’andriamanitra.'),
  ('6ab25c678ff118bc1e73ff3f', '2026-09-22T10:45:59.912Z', '2026-09-22T10:45:59.912Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 18, 11, 'Dia nitsangana ilay Fariseo ka nivavaka anakampo hoe: ‘Andriamanitra ô, misaotra anao aho fa tsy mba hoatran’ny olon-kafa rehetra izay mpanao an-keriny, manao ny tsy marina, mpanitsakitsa-bady, na koa hoatran’itsy mpamory hetra itsy.', 'dia nitsangana ilay fariseo ka nivavaka anakampo hoe: ‘andriamanitra ô, misaotra anao aho fa tsy mba hoatran’ny olon-kafa rehetra izay mpanao an-keriny, manao ny tsy marina, mpanitsakitsa-bady, na koa hoatran’itsy mpamory hetra itsy.'),
  ('6ab25c68dcdab81f71480dd0', '2026-09-22T10:46:00.605Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:00.605Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 19, 31, 'Ary raha misy manontany anareo hoe: ‘Fa maninona io no vahanareo?’, dia teneno hoe: ‘Misy ilan’ny Tompo azy.’”', 'ary raha misy manontany anareo hoe: ‘fa maninona io no vahanareo?’, dia teneno hoe: ‘misy ilan’ny tompo azy.’”'),
  ('6ab25c68dcdab81f71480dca', '2026-09-22T10:46:00.605Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:00.605Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 19, 25, 'Hoy anefa izy ireo taminy: ‘Efa manana folo mina izy, tompoko!’', 'hoy anefa izy ireo taminy: ‘efa manana folo mina izy, tompoko!’'),
  ('6ab25c68dcdab81f71480dbd', '2026-09-22T10:46:00.605Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:00.605Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 19, 12, 'Niteny àry izy hoe: “Nisy andriana nankany an-tany lavitra mba handray fahefana hanjaka, dia hiverina.', 'niteny àry izy hoe: “nisy andriana nankany an-tany lavitra mba handray fahefana hanjaka, dia hiverina.'),
  ('6ab25c68dcdab81f71480dd6', '2026-09-22T10:46:00.605Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:00.605Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 19, 37, 'Nanomboka nifaly daholo ny mpianatra maro be, raha vao nanakaiky an’ilay lalana midina amin’ny Tendrombohitra Oliva izy. Ary nidera an’Andriamanitra tamin’ny feo avo izy ireo, noho ny fahagagana rehetra hitany,', 'nanomboka nifaly daholo ny mpianatra maro be, raha vao nanakaiky an’ilay lalana midina amin’ny tendrombohitra oliva izy. ary nidera an’andriamanitra tamin’ny feo avo izy ireo, noho ny fahagagana rehetra hitany,'),
  ('6ab25c68dcdab81f71480dd5', '2026-09-22T10:46:00.605Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:00.605Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 19, 36, 'Dia namelatra ny akanjony ivelany teo amin’ny lalana ny olona, arakaraka ny nandrosoan’i Jesosy.', 'dia namelatra ny akanjony ivelany teo amin’ny lalana ny olona, arakaraka ny nandrosoan’i jesosy.'),
  ('6ab25c68dcdab81f71480dcb', '2026-09-22T10:46:00.605Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:00.605Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 19, 26, 'Dia hoy izy: ‘Lazaiko aminareo fa izay manana dia homena bebe kokoa, fa izay tsy manana kosa, na izay ananany aza dia halaina aminy.', 'dia hoy izy: ‘lazaiko aminareo fa izay manana dia homena bebe kokoa, fa izay tsy manana kosa, na izay ananany aza dia halaina aminy.'),
  ('6ab25c68dcdab81f71480ddb', '2026-09-22T10:46:00.605Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:00.605Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 19, 42, 'sady niteny hoe: “Raha mba takatrao mantsy amin’ity andro ity hoe ahoana no hahazoana fiadanana! Afenina amin’ny masonao anefa izany ankehitriny.', 'sady niteny hoe: “raha mba takatrao mantsy amin’ity andro ity hoe ahoana no hahazoana fiadanana! afenina amin’ny masonao anefa izany ankehitriny.'),
  ('6ab25c68dcdab81f71480dc6', '2026-09-22T10:46:00.605Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:00.605Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 19, 21, 'Natahotra anao mantsy aho, satria olona sarotsarotiny ianao, sady maka an’izay tsy napetrakao no mijinja an’izay tsy nafafinao.’', 'natahotra anao mantsy aho, satria olona sarotsarotiny ianao, sady maka an’izay tsy napetrakao no mijinja an’izay tsy nafafinao.’'),
  ('6ab25c68dcdab81f71480dc0', '2026-09-22T10:46:00.605Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:00.605Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 19, 15, '“Ary niverina izy, tatỳ aoriana, rehefa avy nandray fahefana hanjaka. Dia nampanantsoiny ireo mpanompo nomeny vola, mba hahitany izay tombony azon’ ireo tamin’ny raharaham-barotra nataon’izy ireo.', '“ary niverina izy, tatỳ aoriana, rehefa avy nandray fahefana hanjaka. dia nampanantsoiny ireo mpanompo nomeny vola, mba hahitany izay tombony azon’ ireo tamin’ny raharaham-barotra nataon’izy ireo.'),
  ('6ab25c68dcdab81f71480db7', '2026-09-22T10:46:00.605Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:00.605Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 19, 6, 'Dia nidina haingana izy ka faly erỳ nandray azy tao an-tranony.', 'dia nidina haingana izy ka faly erỳ nandray azy tao an-tranony.'),
  ('6ab25c68dcdab81f71480ddd', '2026-09-22T10:46:00.605Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:00.605Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 19, 44, 'Hatontany amin’ny tany ianao sy ny zanakao ao aminao, ary tsy hisy vato havelany hifanaingina eo aminao, satria tsy takatrao ny fotoana nitsarana anao.”', 'hatontany amin’ny tany ianao sy ny zanakao ao aminao, ary tsy hisy vato havelany hifanaingina eo aminao, satria tsy takatrao ny fotoana nitsarana anao.”'),
  ('6ab25c68dcdab81f71480dc5', '2026-09-22T10:46:00.605Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:00.605Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 19, 20, 'Fa tonga kosa ny iray, ka niteny hoe: ‘Intỳ, tompoko, ilay mina nomenao. Notehiriziko tao anaty lamba izy ity.', 'fa tonga kosa ny iray, ka niteny hoe: ‘intỳ, tompoko, ilay mina nomenao. notehiriziko tao anaty lamba izy ity.'),
  ('6ab25c68dcdab81f71480db6', '2026-09-22T10:46:00.605Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:00.605Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 19, 5, 'Rehefa tonga teo i Jesosy, dia nitraka ka niteny hoe: “Zakaiosy, midìna haingana, fa tsy maintsy hivahiny ao an-tranonao aho anio.”', 'rehefa tonga teo i jesosy, dia nitraka ka niteny hoe: “zakaiosy, midìna haingana, fa tsy maintsy hivahiny ao an-tranonao aho anio.”'),
  ('6ab25c68dcdab81f71480dda', '2026-09-22T10:46:00.605Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:00.605Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 19, 41, 'Ary nahatazana an’ilay tanàna izy rehefa nanakaiky, ka nitomany mafy azy,', 'ary nahatazana an’ilay tanàna izy rehefa nanakaiky, ka nitomany mafy azy,'),
  ('6ab25c68dcdab81f71480de0', '2026-09-22T10:46:00.605Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:00.605Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 19, 47, 'Mbola nampianatra isan’andro tao amin’ny tempoly izy. Nitady hamono azy anefa ny lehiben’ny mpisorona sy ny mpanora-dalàna ary ny lehiben’ny vahoaka,', 'mbola nampianatra isan’andro tao amin’ny tempoly izy. nitady hamono azy anefa ny lehiben’ny mpisorona sy ny mpanora-dalàna ary ny lehiben’ny vahoaka,'),
  ('6ab25c68dcdab81f71480ddf', '2026-09-22T10:46:00.605Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:00.605Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 19, 46, 'ary niteny hoe: “Voasoratra hoe: ‘Ny tranoko dia ho trano fivavahana’, fa ianareo kosa manao azy ho lava-bato fiafenan’ny jiolahy.”', 'ary niteny hoe: “voasoratra hoe: ‘ny tranoko dia ho trano fivavahana’, fa ianareo kosa manao azy ho lava-bato fiafenan’ny jiolahy.”'),
  ('6ab25c68dcdab81f71480dde', '2026-09-22T10:46:00.605Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:00.605Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 19, 45, 'Dia niditra tao amin’ny tempoly izy, ka nanomboka nandroaka an’izay nivarotra tao,', 'dia niditra tao amin’ny tempoly izy, ka nanomboka nandroaka an’izay nivarotra tao,'),
  ('6ab25c68dcdab81f71480dd2', '2026-09-22T10:46:00.605Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:00.605Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 19, 33, 'Raha mbola namaha an’ilay zanak’ampondra anefa izy ireo, dia hoy ny tompony: “Fa maninona no vahanareo io zanak’ampondra io?”', 'raha mbola namaha an’ilay zanak’ampondra anefa izy ireo, dia hoy ny tompony: “fa maninona no vahanareo io zanak’ampondra io?”'),
