  ('6ab25c68dcdab81f71480dd1', '2026-09-22T10:46:00.605Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:00.605Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 19, 32, 'Dia lasa ireo mpianatra nirahiny, ka nahita an’izay nolazainy tamin’izy ireo.', 'dia lasa ireo mpianatra nirahiny, ka nahita an’izay nolazainy tamin’izy ireo.'),
  ('6ab25c68dcdab81f71480dcd', '2026-09-22T10:46:00.605Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:00.605Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 19, 28, 'Rehefa avy nilaza an’izany izy, dia nandeha nialoha hiakatra ho any Jerosalema.', 'rehefa avy nilaza an’izany izy, dia nandeha nialoha hiakatra ho any jerosalema.'),
  ('6ab25c68dcdab81f71480dba', '2026-09-22T10:46:00.605Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:00.605Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 19, 9, 'Dia hoy i Jesosy: “Androany no tonga ato amin’ity trano ity ny famonjena, satria zanak’i Abrahama koa izy.', 'dia hoy i jesosy: “androany no tonga ato amin’ity trano ity ny famonjena, satria zanak’i abrahama koa izy.'),
  ('6ab25c68dcdab81f71480dbe', '2026-09-22T10:46:00.605Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:00.605Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 19, 13, 'Dia niantso folo lahy tamin’ny mpanompony izy, ka nomeny folo mina izy ireo. Ary hoy izy: ‘Ampiasao hanaovana raharaham-barotra ireny mandra-pahatongako.’', 'dia niantso folo lahy tamin’ny mpanompony izy, ka nomeny folo mina izy ireo. ary hoy izy: ‘ampiasao hanaovana raharaham-barotra ireny mandra-pahatongako.’'),
  ('6ab25c68dcdab81f71480dbc', '2026-09-22T10:46:00.605Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:00.605Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 19, 11, 'Raha mbola nihaino an’izany ireo mpianatra, dia nilaza fanoharana hafa i Jesosy, satria efa akaiky an’i Jerosalema izy, sady noheverin’izy ireo hoe hiseho avy hatrany ny Fanjakan’Andriamanitra.', 'raha mbola nihaino an’izany ireo mpianatra, dia nilaza fanoharana hafa i jesosy, satria efa akaiky an’i jerosalema izy, sady noheverin’izy ireo hoe hiseho avy hatrany ny fanjakan’andriamanitra.'),
  ('6ab25c68dcdab81f71480dce', '2026-09-22T10:46:00.605Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:00.605Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 19, 29, 'Ary rehefa nanakaiky an’i Betifaga sy Betania, teo amin’ilay tendrombohitra atao hoe Tendrombohitra Oliva, izy, dia naniraka roa lahy tamin’ny mpianany.', 'ary rehefa nanakaiky an’i betifaga sy betania, teo amin’ilay tendrombohitra atao hoe tendrombohitra oliva, izy, dia naniraka roa lahy tamin’ny mpianany.'),
  ('6ab25c68dcdab81f71480db5', '2026-09-22T10:46:00.605Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:00.605Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 19, 4, 'Koa nihazakazaka mialoha izy ary nianika aviavidia mba hahita an’i Jesosy, satria efa handalo eo amin’ilay lalana i Jesosy.', 'koa nihazakazaka mialoha izy ary nianika aviavidia mba hahita an’i jesosy, satria efa handalo eo amin’ilay lalana i jesosy.'),
  ('6ab25c68dcdab81f71480db4', '2026-09-22T10:46:00.605Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:00.605Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 19, 3, 'Niezaka mafy hahita an’izany Jesosy izany izy, saingy tsy afaka satria be loatra ny olona nefa izy fohy kely.', 'niezaka mafy hahita an’izany jesosy izany izy, saingy tsy afaka satria be loatra ny olona nefa izy fohy kely.'),
  ('6ab25c68dcdab81f71480dd9', '2026-09-22T10:46:00.605Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:00.605Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 19, 40, 'Fa namaly i Jesosy hoe: “Lazaiko aminareo fa raha mangina ireo, dia ny vato no hiantsoantso.”', 'fa namaly i jesosy hoe: “lazaiko aminareo fa raha mangina ireo, dia ny vato no hiantsoantso.”'),
  ('6ab25c68dcdab81f71480dcf', '2026-09-22T10:46:00.605Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:00.605Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 19, 30, 'Dia hoy izy: “Mandehana ao amin’irỳ tanàna kely irỳ. Ary rehefa tafiditra ao ianareo, dia hahita zanak’ampondra mifatotra, mbola tsy nitaingenan’olona mihitsy. Vahao ilay izy dia ento atỳ.', 'dia hoy izy: “mandehana ao amin’irỳ tanàna kely irỳ. ary rehefa tafiditra ao ianareo, dia hahita zanak’ampondra mifatotra, mbola tsy nitaingenan’olona mihitsy. vahao ilay izy dia ento atỳ.'),
  ('6ab25c68dcdab81f71480dc1', '2026-09-22T10:46:00.605Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:00.605Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 19, 16, 'Tonga àry ny voalohany, ka niteny hoe: ‘Nahazoana tombony folo mina ilay iray mina nomenao, tompoko.’', 'tonga àry ny voalohany, ka niteny hoe: ‘nahazoana tombony folo mina ilay iray mina nomenao, tompoko.’'),
  ('6ab25c68dcdab81f71480dbb', '2026-09-22T10:46:00.605Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:00.605Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 19, 10, 'Fa tonga hitady sy hamonjy ny very ny Zanak’olona.”', 'fa tonga hitady sy hamonjy ny very ny zanak’olona.”'),
  ('6ab25c68dcdab81f71480db9', '2026-09-22T10:46:00.605Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:00.605Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 19, 8, 'Fa i Zakaiosy kosa nitsangana, ka niteny tamin’ny Tompo hoe: “Tompo ô, homeko ny mahantra ny antsasaky ny fananako, ary izay rehetra nalaiko an-keriny dia honerako avo efatra heny.”', 'fa i zakaiosy kosa nitsangana, ka niteny tamin’ny tompo hoe: “tompo ô, homeko ny mahantra ny antsasaky ny fananako, ary izay rehetra nalaiko an-keriny dia honerako avo efatra heny.”'),
  ('6ab25c68dcdab81f71480db3', '2026-09-22T10:46:00.605Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:00.605Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 19, 2, 'Nisy lehilahy atao hoe Zakaiosy tao. Lehiben’ny mpamory hetra izy sady nanan-karena.', 'nisy lehilahy atao hoe zakaiosy tao. lehiben’ny mpamory hetra izy sady nanan-karena.'),
  ('6ab25c68dcdab81f71480dc9', '2026-09-22T10:46:00.605Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:00.605Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 19, 24, '“Ary hoy izy tamin’ireo nijoro teo: ‘Alaivo ilay mina any aminy, dia omeo an’ilay manana folo mina.’', '“ary hoy izy tamin’ireo nijoro teo: ‘alaivo ilay mina any aminy, dia omeo an’ilay manana folo mina.’'),
  ('6ab25c68dcdab81f71480dc8', '2026-09-22T10:46:00.605Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:00.605Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 19, 23, 'Koa maninona no tsy napetrakao tany amin’ny banky ny volako? Amin’izay rehefa tonga aho dia ho nandray an’ilay izy miaraka amin’ny zanabola.’', 'koa maninona no tsy napetrakao tany amin’ny banky ny volako? amin’izay rehefa tonga aho dia ho nandray an’ilay izy miaraka amin’ny zanabola.’'),
  ('6ab25c68dcdab81f71480dc7', '2026-09-22T10:46:00.605Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:00.605Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 19, 22, 'Dia hoy izy taminy: ‘Ny teninao ihany no itsarako anao, ry mpanompo ratsy fanahy! Fantatrao fa olona sarotsarotiny aho, sady maka an’izay tsy napetrako no mijinja an’izay tsy nafafiko.', 'dia hoy izy taminy: ‘ny teninao ihany no itsarako anao, ry mpanompo ratsy fanahy! fantatrao fa olona sarotsarotiny aho, sady maka an’izay tsy napetrako no mijinja an’izay tsy nafafiko.'),
  ('6ab25c68dcdab81f71480dc2', '2026-09-22T10:46:00.605Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:00.605Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 19, 17, 'Dia hoy izy taminy: ‘Tsara izany, ry mpanompo tsara! Mendri-pitokisana tamin’ny zavatra tena kely ianao, ka omeko fahefana hifehy tanàna folo.’', 'dia hoy izy taminy: ‘tsara izany, ry mpanompo tsara! mendri-pitokisana tamin’ny zavatra tena kely ianao, ka omeko fahefana hifehy tanàna folo.’'),
  ('6ab25c68dcdab81f71480dbf', '2026-09-22T10:46:00.605Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:00.605Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 19, 14, 'Halan’ireo mpiray firenena taminy anefa izy. Koa rehefa lasa izy, dia naniraka ambasadaoro ireo hilaza hoe: ‘Tsy mila an’iny lehilahy iny ho mpanjakanay izahay.’', 'halan’ireo mpiray firenena taminy anefa izy. koa rehefa lasa izy, dia naniraka ambasadaoro ireo hilaza hoe: ‘tsy mila an’iny lehilahy iny ho mpanjakanay izahay.’'),
  ('6ab25c68dcdab81f71480dd8', '2026-09-22T10:46:00.605Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:00.605Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 19, 39, 'Hoy anefa ny Fariseo sasany, izay teo amin’ny vahoaka: “Mpampianatra ô, teneno ny mpianatrao.”', 'hoy anefa ny fariseo sasany, izay teo amin’ny vahoaka: “mpampianatra ô, teneno ny mpianatrao.”'),
  ('6ab25c68dcdab81f71480dd7', '2026-09-22T10:46:00.605Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:00.605Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 19, 38, 'ka niteny hoe: “Hotahina anie Ilay Mpanjaka tonga amin’ny anaran’i Jehovah! Fiadanana any an-danitra ary voninahitra any amin’ny avo indrindra!”', 'ka niteny hoe: “hotahina anie ilay mpanjaka tonga amin’ny anaran’i jehovah! fiadanana any an-danitra ary voninahitra any amin’ny avo indrindra!”'),
  ('6ab25c68dcdab81f71480dc3', '2026-09-22T10:46:00.605Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:00.605Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 19, 18, 'Tonga indray ny faharoa, ka nilaza hoe: ‘Nahazoana dimy mina ilay iray mina nomenao, tompoko.’', 'tonga indray ny faharoa, ka nilaza hoe: ‘nahazoana dimy mina ilay iray mina nomenao, tompoko.’'),
  ('6ab25c68dcdab81f71480db8', '2026-09-22T10:46:00.605Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:00.605Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 19, 7, 'Rehefa hitan’ny olona izany, dia nimenomenona izy rehetra hoe: “Lasa nivahiny ao an-tranon’ny lehilahy mpanota izy.”', 'rehefa hitan’ny olona izany, dia nimenomenona izy rehetra hoe: “lasa nivahiny ao an-tranon’ny lehilahy mpanota izy.”'),
  ('6ab25c68dcdab81f71480ddc', '2026-09-22T10:46:00.605Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:00.605Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 19, 43, 'Fa ho avy ny andro hananganan’ny fahavalonao fefy hazo maranitra manodidina anao, ka hohodidininy ianao ary hataony fahirano avy any amin’ny lafiny rehetra.', 'fa ho avy ny andro hananganan’ny fahavalonao fefy hazo maranitra manodidina anao, ka hohodidininy ianao ary hataony fahirano avy any amin’ny lafiny rehetra.'),
  ('6ab25c68dcdab81f71480dd4', '2026-09-22T10:46:00.605Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:00.605Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 19, 35, 'Ary nentin’izy roa lahy tany amin’i Jesosy ilay zanak’ampondra, dia napetrak’izy ireo teo ambonin’ilay izy ny akanjon’izy ireo ivelany, ka nasainy nitaingina teo i Jesosy.', 'ary nentin’izy roa lahy tany amin’i jesosy ilay zanak’ampondra, dia napetrak’izy ireo teo ambonin’ilay izy ny akanjon’izy ireo ivelany, ka nasainy nitaingina teo i jesosy.'),
  ('6ab25c68dcdab81f71480dc4', '2026-09-22T10:46:00.605Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:00.605Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 19, 19, 'Hoy koa izy tamin’io: ‘Asaiko hiandraikitra tanàna dimy koa ianao.’', 'hoy koa izy tamin’io: ‘asaiko hiandraikitra tanàna dimy koa ianao.’'),
  ('6ab25c68dcdab81f71480db2', '2026-09-22T10:46:00.605Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:00.605Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 19, 1, 'Dia niditra tao Jeriko izy, ka namakivaky an’ilay tanàna.', 'dia niditra tao jeriko izy, ka namakivaky an’ilay tanàna.'),
  ('6ab25c68dcdab81f71480dcc', '2026-09-22T10:46:00.605Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:00.605Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 19, 27, 'Ary ento atỳ koa ireo fahavaloko tsy nanaiky ahy ho mpanjaka ireo, ka vonoy ho faty eto anatrehako.’”', 'ary ento atỳ koa ireo fahavaloko tsy nanaiky ahy ho mpanjaka ireo, ka vonoy ho faty eto anatrehako.’”'),
  ('6ab25c68dcdab81f71480de1', '2026-09-22T10:46:00.606Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:00.606Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 19, 48, 'saingy tsy nahita fomba hanaovana an’izany, satria variana erỳ ny vahoaka rehetra nihaino azy.', 'saingy tsy nahita fomba hanaovana an’izany, satria variana erỳ ny vahoaka rehetra nihaino azy.'),
  ('6ab25c69ad85162343807800', '2026-09-22T10:46:01.157Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:01.157Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 20, 40, 'Ary tsy sahy nanontany azy intsony izy ireo.', 'ary tsy sahy nanontany azy intsony izy ireo.'),
  ('6ab25c69ad851623438077f7', '2026-09-22T10:46:01.157Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:01.157Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 20, 31, 'ka nampakatra an’ilay vehivavy ny fahatelo. Hoatr’izany daholo no nataon’izy fito. Samy maty tsy niteraka izy ireo.', 'ka nampakatra an’ilay vehivavy ny fahatelo. hoatr’izany daholo no nataon’izy fito. samy maty tsy niteraka izy ireo.'),
  ('6ab25c69ad851623438077f2', '2026-09-22T10:46:01.157Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:01.157Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 20, 26, 'Koa tsy afaka namandrika azy tamin’ny teniny teo anatrehan’ny olona izy ireo, fa kepoka tsy nahateny satria gaga tamin’ny valin-teniny.', 'koa tsy afaka namandrika azy tamin’ny teniny teo anatrehan’ny olona izy ireo, fa kepoka tsy nahateny satria gaga tamin’ny valin-teniny.'),
  ('6ab25c69ad85162343807801', '2026-09-22T10:46:01.157Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:01.157Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 20, 41, 'Fa nanontany azy ireo kosa i Jesosy hoe: “Maninona no lazain’ny olona fa zanak’i Davida i Kristy?', 'fa nanontany azy ireo kosa i jesosy hoe: “maninona no lazain’ny olona fa zanak’i davida i kristy?'),
  ('6ab25c69ad851623438077ea', '2026-09-22T10:46:01.157Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:01.157Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 20, 18, 'Ho potipotika izay rehetra mianjera eo amin’izany vato izany, ary ho torotoro izay ianjerany.”', 'ho potipotika izay rehetra mianjera eo amin’izany vato izany, ary ho torotoro izay ianjerany.”'),
  ('6ab25c69ad85162343807802', '2026-09-22T10:46:01.157Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:01.157Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 20, 42, 'I Davida mihitsy mantsy no milaza ao amin’ny bokin’ny Salamo hoe: ‘Hoy i Jehovah tamin’ny Tompoko: “Mipetraha eto ankavanako', 'i davida mihitsy mantsy no milaza ao amin’ny bokin’ny salamo hoe: ‘hoy i jehovah tamin’ny tompoko: “mipetraha eto ankavanako'),
  ('6ab25c69ad851623438077fd', '2026-09-22T10:46:01.157Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:01.157Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 20, 37, 'Fa na i Mosesy aza nampahafantatra hoe hatsangana ny maty, tao amin’ny fitantarana momba an’ilay voarointsilo, rehefa niantso an’i Jehovah hoe ‘Andriamanitr’i Abrahama sy Andriamanitr’i Isaka ary Andriamanitr’i Jakoba.’', 'fa na i mosesy aza nampahafantatra hoe hatsangana ny maty, tao amin’ny fitantarana momba an’ilay voarointsilo, rehefa niantso an’i jehovah hoe ‘andriamanitr’i abrahama sy andriamanitr’i isaka ary andriamanitr’i jakoba.’'),
  ('6ab25c69ad851623438077f8', '2026-09-22T10:46:01.157Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:01.157Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 20, 32, 'Maty koa ilay vehivavy tamin’ny farany.', 'maty koa ilay vehivavy tamin’ny farany.'),
  ('6ab25c69ad851623438077f3', '2026-09-22T10:46:01.157Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:01.157Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 20, 27, 'Nanatona azy anefa ny sasany tamin’ny Sadoseo, izay milaza fa tsy misy fitsanganan’ny maty. Nanontanian’izy ireo izy hoe:', 'nanatona azy anefa ny sasany tamin’ny sadoseo, izay milaza fa tsy misy fitsanganan’ny maty. nanontanian’izy ireo izy hoe:'),
  ('6ab25c69ad85162343807804', '2026-09-22T10:46:01.157Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:01.157Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 20, 44, 'I Davida aza niantso azy hoe ‘Tompo’, dia ahoana no maha zanany azy?”', 'i davida aza niantso azy hoe ‘tompo’, dia ahoana no maha zanany azy?”'),
  ('6ab25c69ad851623438077fa', '2026-09-22T10:46:01.157Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:01.157Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 20, 34, 'Hoy i Jesosy tamin’izy ireo: “Ny zanak’izao tontolo izao no mampaka-bady sy avoaka hampakarina.', 'hoy i jesosy tamin’izy ireo: “ny zanak’izao tontolo izao no mampaka-bady sy avoaka hampakarina.'),
  ('6ab25c69ad851623438077f9', '2026-09-22T10:46:01.157Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:01.157Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 20, 33, 'Koa rehefa atsangana ny maty, ho vadin’iza ilay vehivavy? Efa samy nanambady azy daholo mantsy izy fito mirahalahy.”', 'koa rehefa atsangana ny maty, ho vadin’iza ilay vehivavy? efa samy nanambady azy daholo mantsy izy fito mirahalahy.”'),
  ('6ab25c69ad851623438077e3', '2026-09-22T10:46:01.157Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:01.157Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 20, 11, 'Dia naniraka mpanompo hafa indray ilay lehilahy. Nokapohin’izy ireo koa izy io sady nalany baraka ary nalefany nody maina.', 'dia naniraka mpanompo hafa indray ilay lehilahy. nokapohin’izy ireo koa izy io sady nalany baraka ary nalefany nody maina.'),
  ('6ab25c69ad85162343807807', '2026-09-22T10:46:01.157Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:01.157Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 20, 47, 'Taperin’izy ireny ny fananan’ny mpitondratena, ary manao vavaka lava be izy ireny mba hisehosehoana fotsiny. Hahazo fanamelohana henjana kokoa izy ireny.”', 'taperin’izy ireny ny fananan’ny mpitondratena, ary manao vavaka lava be izy ireny mba hisehosehoana fotsiny. hahazo fanamelohana henjana kokoa izy ireny.”'),
  ('6ab25c69ad851623438077ef', '2026-09-22T10:46:01.157Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:01.157Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 20, 23, 'Takatr’i Jesosy anefa fa fetsy ratsy izy ireo, ka hoy izy taminy:', 'takatr’i jesosy anefa fa fetsy ratsy izy ireo, ka hoy izy taminy:'),
  ('6ab25c69ad851623438077db', '2026-09-22T10:46:01.157Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:01.157Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 20, 3, 'Dia namaly izy hoe: “Izaho koa mba hanontany anareo ka valio:', 'dia namaly izy hoe: “izaho koa mba hanontany anareo ka valio:'),
  ('6ab25c69ad851623438077e5', '2026-09-22T10:46:01.157Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:01.157Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 20, 13, 'Dia hoy ilay tompon’ny tanimboaloboka: ‘Inona re no hataoko e? Haniraka ny zanako malalako aho. Angamba mba hohajain’izy ireo izy.’', 'dia hoy ilay tompon’ny tanimboaloboka: ‘inona re no hataoko e? haniraka ny zanako malalako aho. angamba mba hohajain’izy ireo izy.’'),
  ('6ab25c69ad851623438077fe', '2026-09-22T10:46:01.157Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:01.157Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 20, 38, 'Tsy mba Andriamanitry ny maty izy, fa an’ny velona satria aminy dia velona daholo izy rehetra ireo.”', 'tsy mba andriamanitry ny maty izy, fa an’ny velona satria aminy dia velona daholo izy rehetra ireo.”'),
  ('6ab25c69ad851623438077f5', '2026-09-22T10:46:01.157Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:01.157Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 20, 29, 'Nisy fito mirahalahy àry. Nanambady ilay voalohany, nefa maty tsy niteraka.', 'nisy fito mirahalahy àry. nanambady ilay voalohany, nefa maty tsy niteraka.'),
  ('6ab25c69ad851623438077f0', '2026-09-22T10:46:01.157Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:01.157Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 20, 24, '“Ampisehoy denaria iray aho. Sarin’iza io eo io, dia anaran’iza io?” Hoy izy ireo: “An’i Kaisara.”', '“ampisehoy denaria iray aho. sarin’iza io eo io, dia anaran’iza io?” hoy izy ireo: “an’i kaisara.”'),
  ('6ab25c69ad851623438077da', '2026-09-22T10:46:01.157Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:01.157Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 20, 2, 'ka niteny taminy hoe: “Lazao aminay hoe fahefana avy aiza no anaovanao an’izao? Ary iza no nanome anao an’izany fahefana izany?”', 'ka niteny taminy hoe: “lazao aminay hoe fahefana avy aiza no anaovanao an’izao? ary iza no nanome anao an’izany fahefana izany?”'),
  ('6ab25c69ad851623438077fc', '2026-09-22T10:46:01.157Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:01.157Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 20, 36, 'Tsy mety maty intsony izy ireo fa hitovy amin’ny anjely, ary zanak’Andriamanitra izy ireo satria zanaky ny fitsanganana amin’ny maty.', 'tsy mety maty intsony izy ireo fa hitovy amin’ny anjely, ary zanak’andriamanitra izy ireo satria zanaky ny fitsanganana amin’ny maty.'),
  ('6ab25c69ad851623438077f1', '2026-09-22T10:46:01.157Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:01.157Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 20, 25, 'Dia hoy izy: “Noho izany àry, dia aloavy amin’i Kaisara izay an’i Kaisara, fa amin’Andriamanitra kosa izay an’Andriamanitra.”', 'dia hoy izy: “noho izany àry, dia aloavy amin’i kaisara izay an’i kaisara, fa amin’andriamanitra kosa izay an’andriamanitra.”'),
  ('6ab25c69ad851623438077eb', '2026-09-22T10:46:01.157Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:01.157Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 20, 19, 'Tamin’izay ora izay indrindra, dia nitady hisambotra azy ny mpanora-dalàna sy ny lehiben’ny mpisorona, satria takany fa izy ireo no tao an-tsain’i Jesosy tamin’io fanoharana io. Natahotra ny vahoaka anefa izy ireo.', 'tamin’izay ora izay indrindra, dia nitady hisambotra azy ny mpanora-dalàna sy ny lehiben’ny mpisorona, satria takany fa izy ireo no tao an-tsain’i jesosy tamin’io fanoharana io. natahotra ny vahoaka anefa izy ireo.'),
  ('6ab25c69ad851623438077e6', '2026-09-22T10:46:01.157Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:01.157Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 20, 14, 'Rehefa nahita azy ny mpamboly, dia nifampiresaka hoe: ‘Iny ny mpandova! Andao izy hovonointsika, dia amin’izay lasantsika ny lova!’', 'rehefa nahita azy ny mpamboly, dia nifampiresaka hoe: ‘iny ny mpandova! andao izy hovonointsika, dia amin’izay lasantsika ny lova!’'),
  ('6ab25c69ad851623438077dd', '2026-09-22T10:46:01.157Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:01.157Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 20, 5, 'Dia niara-nidinika izy ireo hoe: “Raha miteny izao isika hoe: ‘Avy any an-danitra’, dia hilaza izy hoe: ‘Koa naninona ianareo no tsy nino azy?’', 'dia niara-nidinika izy ireo hoe: “raha miteny izao isika hoe: ‘avy any an-danitra’, dia hilaza izy hoe: ‘koa naninona ianareo no tsy nino azy?’'),
  ('6ab25c69ad851623438077d9', '2026-09-22T10:46:01.157Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:01.157Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 20, 1, 'Indray andro, raha mbola nampianatra olona tao amin’ny tempoly i Jesosy, sady nitory ny vaovao tsara, dia nanatona azy ny lehiben’ny mpisorona sy ny mpanora-dalàna ary ny anti-panahy,', 'indray andro, raha mbola nampianatra olona tao amin’ny tempoly i jesosy, sady nitory ny vaovao tsara, dia nanatona azy ny lehiben’ny mpisorona sy ny mpanora-dalàna ary ny anti-panahy,'),
  ('6ab25c69ad85162343807806', '2026-09-22T10:46:01.157Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:01.157Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 20, 46, '“Mitandrema amin’ny mpanora-dalàna, izay tia mandehandeha manao akanjo lava. Tiany koa ny hoarahabaina eny an-tsena, ary hahazo ny toerana eny aloha ao amin’ny synagoga sy ny toerana mihaja indrindra any amin’ny sakafo hariva.', '“mitandrema amin’ny mpanora-dalàna, izay tia mandehandeha manao akanjo lava. tiany koa ny hoarahabaina eny an-tsena, ary hahazo ny toerana eny aloha ao amin’ny synagoga sy ny toerana mihaja indrindra any amin’ny sakafo hariva.'),
  ('6ab25c69ad851623438077ee', '2026-09-22T10:46:01.157Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:01.157Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 20, 22, 'Azonay atao ve sa tsia ny mandoa hetra amin’i Kaisara?”', 'azonay atao ve sa tsia ny mandoa hetra amin’i kaisara?”'),
  ('6ab25c69ad851623438077ed', '2026-09-22T10:46:01.157Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:01.157Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 20, 21, 'Ary nanontany an’i Jesosy izy ireo hoe: “Mpampianatra ô, fantatray fa marina ny teninao sy ny fampianaranao, ary tsy mijery tavan’olona ianao, fa marina ny fampianaranao momba an’Andriamanitra.', 'ary nanontany an’i jesosy izy ireo hoe: “mpampianatra ô, fantatray fa marina ny teninao sy ny fampianaranao, ary tsy mijery tavan’olona ianao, fa marina ny fampianaranao momba an’andriamanitra.'),
  ('6ab25c69ad851623438077e1', '2026-09-22T10:46:01.157Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:01.157Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 20, 9, 'Nilaza an’izao fanoharana izao tamin’ny vahoaka izy avy eo: “Nanao tanimboaloboka ny lehilahy iray, ary nampanofainy tamin’ny mpamboly ilay izy. Dia lasa nankany an-tany hafa izy ary naharitra ela be tany.', 'nilaza an’izao fanoharana izao tamin’ny vahoaka izy avy eo: “nanao tanimboaloboka ny lehilahy iray, ary nampanofainy tamin’ny mpamboly ilay izy. dia lasa nankany an-tany hafa izy ary naharitra ela be tany.'),
  ('6ab25c69ad851623438077de', '2026-09-22T10:46:01.157Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:01.157Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 20, 6, 'Raha miteny anefa isika hoe: ‘Avy amin’ny olona’, dia hitora-bato antsika ny vahoaka rehetra, satria resy lahatra ry zareo fa mpaminany i Jaona.”', 'raha miteny anefa isika hoe: ‘avy amin’ny olona’, dia hitora-bato antsika ny vahoaka rehetra, satria resy lahatra ry zareo fa mpaminany i jaona.”'),
  ('6ab25c69ad851623438077dc', '2026-09-22T10:46:01.157Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:01.157Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 20, 4, 'Avy any an-danitra sa avy amin’ny olona no nahazoan’i Jaona fahefana hanao batisa?”', 'avy any an-danitra sa avy amin’ny olona no nahazoan’i jaona fahefana hanao batisa?”'),
  ('6ab25c69ad851623438077e9', '2026-09-22T10:46:01.157Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:01.157Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 20, 17, 'Fa nijery tsara azy ireo i Jesosy sady niteny hoe: “Koa inona àry no dikan’ilay voasoratra hoe: ‘Ny vato tsy tian’ny mpanao trano no lasa vato fehizoro lehibe indrindra’?', 'fa nijery tsara azy ireo i jesosy sady niteny hoe: “koa inona àry no dikan’ilay voasoratra hoe: ‘ny vato tsy tian’ny mpanao trano no lasa vato fehizoro lehibe indrindra’?'),
  ('6ab25c69ad851623438077e8', '2026-09-22T10:46:01.157Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:01.157Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 20, 16, 'Ho avy izy dia hovonoiny ho faty ireo mpamboly ireo, ary homeny olon-kafa ny tanimboaloboka.” Dia hoy izy ireo rehefa naheno an’izany: “Enga anie mba tsy hisy izany!”', 'ho avy izy dia hovonoiny ho faty ireo mpamboly ireo, ary homeny olon-kafa ny tanimboaloboka.” dia hoy izy ireo rehefa naheno an’izany: “enga anie mba tsy hisy izany!”'),
  ('6ab25c69ad85162343807805', '2026-09-22T10:46:01.157Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:01.157Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 20, 45, 'Ary hoy izy tamin’ny mpianany, raha mbola nihaino azy ny vahoaka rehetra:', 'ary hoy izy tamin’ny mpianany, raha mbola nihaino azy ny vahoaka rehetra:'),
  ('6ab25c69ad85162343807803', '2026-09-22T10:46:01.157Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:01.157Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 20, 43, 'mandra-panaoko ny fahavalonao ho fitoeran-tongotrao.”’', 'mandra-panaoko ny fahavalonao ho fitoeran-tongotrao.”’'),
  ('6ab25c69ad851623438077fb', '2026-09-22T10:46:01.157Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:01.157Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 20, 35, 'Fa tsy hampaka-bady na havoaka hampakarina kosa izay hita hoe mendrika ny hiaina ao amin’ilay tontolo ho avy sy mendrika ny hatsangana amin’ny maty.', 'fa tsy hampaka-bady na havoaka hampakarina kosa izay hita hoe mendrika ny hiaina ao amin’ilay tontolo ho avy sy mendrika ny hatsangana amin’ny maty.'),
  ('6ab25c69ad851623438077f4', '2026-09-22T10:46:01.157Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:01.157Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 20, 28, '“Mpampianatra ô, nanoratra ho antsika i Mosesy hoe: ‘Raha maty ny lehilahy iray ka namela vady nefa tsy niteraka, dia tokony hampakatra an’ilay vady navelany ny rahalahiny, ka hanome taranaka ho an’ilay rahalahiny efa maty.’', '“mpampianatra ô, nanoratra ho antsika i mosesy hoe: ‘raha maty ny lehilahy iray ka namela vady nefa tsy niteraka, dia tokony hampakatra an’ilay vady navelany ny rahalahiny, ka hanome taranaka ho an’ilay rahalahiny efa maty.’'),
  ('6ab25c69ad851623438077e0', '2026-09-22T10:46:01.157Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:01.157Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 20, 8, 'Dia hoy i Jesosy: “Izaho koa tsy hiteny aminareo hoe fahefana avy aiza no anaovako an’izao.”', 'dia hoy i jesosy: “izaho koa tsy hiteny aminareo hoe fahefana avy aiza no anaovako an’izao.”'),
  ('6ab25c69ad851623438077f6', '2026-09-22T10:46:01.157Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:01.157Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 20, 30, 'Ary maty koa ny faharoa,', 'ary maty koa ny faharoa,'),
  ('6ab25c69ad851623438077e4', '2026-09-22T10:46:01.157Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:01.157Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 20, 12, 'Mbola naniraka mpanompo fahatelo izy, nefa nataon’izy ireo naratra sy noroahiny koa izy io.', 'mbola naniraka mpanompo fahatelo izy, nefa nataon’izy ireo naratra sy noroahiny koa izy io.'),
  ('6ab25c69ad851623438077ec', '2026-09-22T10:46:01.157Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:01.157Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 20, 20, 'Nanara-maso akaiky an’i Jesosy àry izy ireo, ary naniraka olona, izay nokaramainy mangingina hiseho ho olo-marina, mba hamandrika an’i Jesosy amin’ny teniny. Amin’izay izy ireo ho afaka hanolotra azy amin’ny mpitondra sy ny governora.', 'nanara-maso akaiky an’i jesosy àry izy ireo, ary naniraka olona, izay nokaramainy mangingina hiseho ho olo-marina, mba hamandrika an’i jesosy amin’ny teniny. amin’izay izy ireo ho afaka hanolotra azy amin’ny mpitondra sy ny governora.'),
  ('6ab25c69ad851623438077ff', '2026-09-22T10:46:01.157Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:01.157Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 20, 39, 'Hoy àry ny mpanora-dalàna sasany: “Mpampianatra ô, marina ny teninao.”', 'hoy àry ny mpanora-dalàna sasany: “mpampianatra ô, marina ny teninao.”'),
  ('6ab25c69ad851623438077e7', '2026-09-22T10:46:01.157Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:01.157Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 20, 15, 'Koa notaritaritin’izy ireo teny ivelan’ny tanimboaloboka izy, dia novonoiny ho faty. Inona àry no hataon’ilay tompon’ny tanimboaloboka amin’izy ireo?', 'koa notaritaritin’izy ireo teny ivelan’ny tanimboaloboka izy, dia novonoiny ho faty. inona àry no hataon’ilay tompon’ny tanimboaloboka amin’izy ireo?'),
  ('6ab25c69ad851623438077e2', '2026-09-22T10:46:01.157Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:01.157Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 20, 10, 'Rehefa tonga ny fotoam-piotazana, dia naniraka mpanompo ho any amin’ny mpamboly izy mba haka amin’ny vokatry ny tanimboaloboka. Nalefan’izy ireo nody maina anefa ilay mpanompo, rehefa avy nokapohiny.', 'rehefa tonga ny fotoam-piotazana, dia naniraka mpanompo ho any amin’ny mpamboly izy mba haka amin’ny vokatry ny tanimboaloboka. nalefan’izy ireo nody maina anefa ilay mpanompo, rehefa avy nokapohiny.'),
  ('6ab25c69ad851623438077df', '2026-09-22T10:46:01.157Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:01.157Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 20, 7, 'Koa namaly izy ireo hoe tsy fantany na avy aiza na avy aiza.', 'koa namaly izy ireo hoe tsy fantany na avy aiza na avy aiza.'),
  ('6ab25c6a50138c6cc87608c8', '2026-09-22T10:46:02.042Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:02.042Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 21, 38, 'Ary tonga vao maraina teo aminy, tao amin’ny tempoly, ny olona rehetra mba hihaino azy.', 'ary tonga vao maraina teo aminy, tao amin’ny tempoly, ny olona rehetra mba hihaino azy.'),
  ('6ab25c6a50138c6cc87608b5', '2026-09-22T10:46:02.042Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:02.042Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 21, 19, 'Raha miaritra ianareo dia ho voavonjinareo ny ainareo.', 'raha miaritra ianareo dia ho voavonjinareo ny ainareo.'),
  ('6ab25c6a50138c6cc87608aa', '2026-09-22T10:46:02.042Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:02.042Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 21, 8, 'Dia hoy izy: “Mitandrema sao ho voafitaka ianareo. Fa maro no hisandoka ny anarako, dia hiteny hoe: ‘Izaho no izy’, sy hoe: ‘Efa akaiky ny fotoana voatondro.’ Koa aza manaraka azy.', 'dia hoy izy: “mitandrema sao ho voafitaka ianareo. fa maro no hisandoka ny anarako, dia hiteny hoe: ‘izaho no izy’, sy hoe: ‘efa akaiky ny fotoana voatondro.’ koa aza manaraka azy.'),
  ('6ab25c6a50138c6cc87608bb', '2026-09-22T10:46:02.042Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:02.042Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 21, 25, '“Hisy famantarana koa eny amin’ny masoandro sy ny volana ary ny kintana. Ary etỳ ambonin’ny tany, dia hitebiteby sy ho very hevitra ireo firenena, noho ny fidoboky ny ranomasina sy ny fisamboaravoarany.', '“hisy famantarana koa eny amin’ny masoandro sy ny volana ary ny kintana. ary etỳ ambonin’ny tany, dia hitebiteby sy ho very hevitra ireo firenena, noho ny fidoboky ny ranomasina sy ny fisamboaravoarany.'),
  ('6ab25c6a50138c6cc87608a8', '2026-09-22T10:46:02.042Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:02.042Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 21, 6, 'Dia hoy i Jesosy: “Ho avy ny andro handrodanana an’ireo zavatra hitanareo amin’izao ireo, ka tsy hisy vato havela hifanaingina.”', 'dia hoy i jesosy: “ho avy ny andro handrodanana an’ireo zavatra hitanareo amin’izao ireo, ka tsy hisy vato havela hifanaingina.”'),
  ('6ab25c6a50138c6cc87608a5', '2026-09-22T10:46:02.042Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:02.042Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 21, 3, 'ka nilaza hoe: “Lazaiko marina aminareo fa io mpitondratena mahantra io no nandrotsaka betsaka kokoa noho izy rehetra.', 'ka nilaza hoe: “lazaiko marina aminareo fa io mpitondratena mahantra io no nandrotsaka betsaka kokoa noho izy rehetra.'),
  ('6ab25c6a50138c6cc87608b1', '2026-09-22T10:46:02.042Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:02.042Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 21, 15, 'satria izaho no hanoro anareo an’izay teny holazainareo sy hanome fahendrena anareo, ka tsy hahatohitra na hahavaly anareo ny fahavalonareo rehetra.', 'satria izaho no hanoro anareo an’izay teny holazainareo sy hanome fahendrena anareo, ka tsy hahatohitra na hahavaly anareo ny fahavalonareo rehetra.'),
  ('6ab25c6a50138c6cc87608ae', '2026-09-22T10:46:02.042Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:02.042Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 21, 12, '“Fa alohan’ny hitrangan’izany rehetra izany, dia hisambotra sy hanenjika anareo ny olona, ka hanolotra anareo any amin’ny synagoga sy any am-ponja. Hoentina eo anatrehan’ny mpanjaka sy ny governora ianareo, noho ny anarako.', '“fa alohan’ny hitrangan’izany rehetra izany, dia hisambotra sy hanenjika anareo ny olona, ka hanolotra anareo any amin’ny synagoga sy any am-ponja. hoentina eo anatrehan’ny mpanjaka sy ny governora ianareo, noho ny anarako.'),
  ('6ab25c6a50138c6cc87608a6', '2026-09-22T10:46:02.042Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:02.042Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 21, 4, 'Izy rehetra mantsy nandrotsaka fanomezana avy tamin’izay sisa tsy laniny, fa io vehivavy io kosa na mahantra aza, dia nandrotsaka ny fivelomany rehetra.”', 'izy rehetra mantsy nandrotsaka fanomezana avy tamin’izay sisa tsy laniny, fa io vehivavy io kosa na mahantra aza, dia nandrotsaka ny fivelomany rehetra.”'),
  ('6ab25c6a50138c6cc87608b7', '2026-09-22T10:46:02.042Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:02.042Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 21, 21, 'Dia mila mandositra any an-tendrombohitra izay any Jodia, ary izay ao Jerosalema mila miala ao, ary izay any ambanivohitra tsy tokony hiditra ao Jerosalema intsony.', 'dia mila mandositra any an-tendrombohitra izay any jodia, ary izay ao jerosalema mila miala ao, ary izay any ambanivohitra tsy tokony hiditra ao jerosalema intsony.'),
  ('6ab25c6a50138c6cc87608ad', '2026-09-22T10:46:02.042Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:02.042Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 21, 11, 'Hisy horohoron-tany lehibe, ary hisy mosary sy areti-mandringana any amin’ny toerana samihafa. Hisy zavatra mampahatahotra ho hitan’ny olona, ary hisy famantarana lehibe avy any an-danitra.', 'hisy horohoron-tany lehibe, ary hisy mosary sy areti-mandringana any amin’ny toerana samihafa. hisy zavatra mampahatahotra ho hitan’ny olona, ary hisy famantarana lehibe avy any an-danitra.'),
  ('6ab25c6a50138c6cc87608a3', '2026-09-22T10:46:02.042Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:02.042Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 21, 1, 'Ary nijery i Jesosy, ka nahita ny manankarena nandrotsaka ny fanomezany tao amin’ireo vata fandrotsaham-bola.', 'ary nijery i jesosy, ka nahita ny manankarena nandrotsaka ny fanomezany tao amin’ireo vata fandrotsaham-bola.'),
  ('6ab25c6a50138c6cc87608c2', '2026-09-22T10:46:02.042Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:02.042Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 21, 32, 'Lazaiko marina aminareo fa tsy ho tapitra mihitsy ity taranaka ity, mandra-pisehon’izany rehetra izany.', 'lazaiko marina aminareo fa tsy ho tapitra mihitsy ity taranaka ity, mandra-pisehon’izany rehetra izany.'),
  ('6ab25c6a50138c6cc87608c1', '2026-09-22T10:46:02.042Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:02.042Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 21, 31, 'Hoatr’izany koa fa rehefa hitanareo hoe miseho izany zavatra izany, dia fantaro fa efa akaiky ny Fanjakan’Andriamanitra.', 'hoatr’izany koa fa rehefa hitanareo hoe miseho izany zavatra izany, dia fantaro fa efa akaiky ny fanjakan’andriamanitra.'),
  ('6ab25c6a50138c6cc87608c7', '2026-09-22T10:46:02.042Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:02.042Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 21, 37, 'Dia nampianatra tao amin’ny tempoly izy ny antoandro, fa niala tao kosa izy ny alina, ka nijanona tany amin’ilay tendrombohitra atao hoe Tendrombohitra Oliva.', 'dia nampianatra tao amin’ny tempoly izy ny antoandro, fa niala tao kosa izy ny alina, ka nijanona tany amin’ilay tendrombohitra atao hoe tendrombohitra oliva.'),
  ('6ab25c6a50138c6cc87608c0', '2026-09-22T10:46:02.042Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:02.042Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 21, 30, 'Rehefa hitanareo mitsimoka izy ireny, dia fantatrareo fa efa akaiky ny fahavaratra.', 'rehefa hitanareo mitsimoka izy ireny, dia fantatrareo fa efa akaiky ny fahavaratra.'),
  ('6ab25c6a50138c6cc87608b2', '2026-09-22T10:46:02.042Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:02.042Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 21, 16, 'Na ny ray aman-dreninareo sy ny rahalahinareo sy ny havanareo ary ny namanareo koa aza hanolotra anareo amin’ny manam-pahefana, ka hisy aminareo hovonoina ho faty.', 'na ny ray aman-dreninareo sy ny rahalahinareo sy ny havanareo ary ny namanareo koa aza hanolotra anareo amin’ny manam-pahefana, ka hisy aminareo hovonoina ho faty.'),
