  ('6ab25c6a50138c6cc87608ac', '2026-09-22T10:46:02.042Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:02.042Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 21, 10, 'Dia hoy izy tamin’izy ireo: “Hisy firenena hiady amin’ny firenena, ary hisy fanjakana hiady amin’ny fanjakana.', 'dia hoy izy tamin’izy ireo: “hisy firenena hiady amin’ny firenena, ary hisy fanjakana hiady amin’ny fanjakana.'),
  ('6ab25c6a50138c6cc87608ba', '2026-09-22T10:46:02.042Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:02.042Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 21, 24, 'Ho fatin’ny sabatra izy ireo, ka hoentina ho babo any amin’ny firenena rehetra, ary hohitsahin’ny hafa firenena i Jerosalema mandra-pahatapitry ny fotoana voatondro ho an’ny hafa firenena.', 'ho fatin’ny sabatra izy ireo, ka hoentina ho babo any amin’ny firenena rehetra, ary hohitsahin’ny hafa firenena i jerosalema mandra-pahatapitry ny fotoana voatondro ho an’ny hafa firenena.'),
  ('6ab25c6a50138c6cc87608c3', '2026-09-22T10:46:02.042Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:02.042Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 21, 33, 'Ny lanitra sy ny tany ho levona, fa ny teniko tsy mba ho levona mihitsy.', 'ny lanitra sy ny tany ho levona, fa ny teniko tsy mba ho levona mihitsy.'),
  ('6ab25c6a50138c6cc87608a7', '2026-09-22T10:46:02.042Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:02.042Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 21, 5, 'Taorian’izay, dia nisy niresaka momba ny tempoly sy ny nandravahana azy tamin’ny vato tsara tarehy sy tamin’ny zavatra voatokana ho an’Andriamanitra.', 'taorian’izay, dia nisy niresaka momba ny tempoly sy ny nandravahana azy tamin’ny vato tsara tarehy sy tamin’ny zavatra voatokana ho an’andriamanitra.'),
  ('6ab25c6a50138c6cc87608a4', '2026-09-22T10:46:02.042Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:02.042Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 21, 2, 'Dia nahita vehivavy mpitondratena mahantra nandatsaka vola madinika kely anankiroa zara raha nisy vidiny izy,', 'dia nahita vehivavy mpitondratena mahantra nandatsaka vola madinika kely anankiroa zara raha nisy vidiny izy,'),
  ('6ab25c6a50138c6cc87608be', '2026-09-22T10:46:02.042Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:02.042Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 21, 28, 'Fa rehefa manomboka mitranga izany, dia mijoroa tsara ka mitrakà satria efa akaiky ny fanafahana anareo.”', 'fa rehefa manomboka mitranga izany, dia mijoroa tsara ka mitrakà satria efa akaiky ny fanafahana anareo.”'),
  ('6ab25c6a50138c6cc87608b9', '2026-09-22T10:46:02.042Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:02.042Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 21, 23, 'Loza no hanjo ny bevohoka sy ny mampinono, amin’izany andro izany! Fa hisy fahoriana mafy eo amin’ilay tany ary hiharan’ny fahatezerana ity firenena ity.', 'loza no hanjo ny bevohoka sy ny mampinono, amin’izany andro izany! fa hisy fahoriana mafy eo amin’ilay tany ary hiharan’ny fahatezerana ity firenena ity.'),
  ('6ab25c6a50138c6cc87608b3', '2026-09-22T10:46:02.042Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:02.042Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 21, 17, 'Ary ho halan’ny olona rehetra ianareo noho ny anarako.', 'ary ho halan’ny olona rehetra ianareo noho ny anarako.'),
  ('6ab25c6a50138c6cc87608ab', '2026-09-22T10:46:02.042Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:02.042Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 21, 9, 'Ary aza mihorohoro rehefa maheno ady sy korontana ianareo. Fa tsy maintsy hitranga aloha izany, nefa tsy ho tonga avy hatrany ny farany.”', 'ary aza mihorohoro rehefa maheno ady sy korontana ianareo. fa tsy maintsy hitranga aloha izany, nefa tsy ho tonga avy hatrany ny farany.”'),
  ('6ab25c6a50138c6cc87608a9', '2026-09-22T10:46:02.042Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:02.042Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 21, 7, 'Dia nanontany azy izy ireo hoe: “Mpampianatra ô, rahoviana marina no hitranga izany, ary inona no ho famantarana rehefa ho tonga izany?”', 'dia nanontany azy izy ireo hoe: “mpampianatra ô, rahoviana marina no hitranga izany, ary inona no ho famantarana rehefa ho tonga izany?”'),
  ('6ab25c6a50138c6cc87608b0', '2026-09-22T10:46:02.042Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:02.042Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 21, 14, 'Koa aoka ianareo ho tapa-kevitra ao am-ponareo hoe tsy hanomana mialoha an’izay fiarovan-tena holazainareo,', 'koa aoka ianareo ho tapa-kevitra ao am-ponareo hoe tsy hanomana mialoha an’izay fiarovan-tena holazainareo,'),
  ('6ab25c6a50138c6cc87608c6', '2026-09-22T10:46:02.042Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:02.042Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 21, 36, 'Koa miambena foana, ary mitalahoa foana mba ho afa-mandositra an’izany zava-drehetra tsy maintsy hitranga izany ianareo, ary ho afaka hitsangana eo anatrehan’ny Zanak’olona.”', 'koa miambena foana, ary mitalahoa foana mba ho afa-mandositra an’izany zava-drehetra tsy maintsy hitranga izany ianareo, ary ho afaka hitsangana eo anatrehan’ny zanak’olona.”'),
