  ('6ab25c6aa86ff60c5789aa8e', '2026-09-22T10:46:02.578Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:02.578Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 22, 65, 'Ary nilaza zavatra maro hafa izy ireo, mba hanevatevana azy.', 'ary nilaza zavatra maro hafa izy ireo, mba hanevatevana azy.'),
  ('6ab25c6aa86ff60c5789aa94', '2026-09-22T10:46:02.578Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:02.578Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 22, 71, 'Dia hoy ireo: “Inona indray no ilantsika porofo? Isika mihitsy no naheno ny vavany niteny an’izany.”', 'dia hoy ireo: “inona indray no ilantsika porofo? isika mihitsy no naheno ny vavany niteny an’izany.”'),
  ('6ab25c6aa86ff60c5789aa84', '2026-09-22T10:46:02.578Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:02.578Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 22, 55, 'Rehefa nandrehitra afo teo afovoan’ny tokotany izy ireo ka niara-nipetraka teo, dia nipetraka teo niaraka tamin’izy ireo koa i Petera.', 'rehefa nandrehitra afo teo afovoan’ny tokotany izy ireo ka niara-nipetraka teo, dia nipetraka teo niaraka tamin’izy ireo koa i petera.'),
  ('6ab25c6aa86ff60c5789aa89', '2026-09-22T10:46:02.578Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:02.578Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 22, 60, 'Hoy anefa i Petera: “Tena tsy fantatro izany lazainao izany.” Ary tonga dia nisy akoho naneno, raha iny izy mbola niteny iny.', 'hoy anefa i petera: “tena tsy fantatro izany lazainao izany.” ary tonga dia nisy akoho naneno, raha iny izy mbola niteny iny.'),
  ('6ab25c6aa86ff60c5789aa87', '2026-09-22T10:46:02.578Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:02.578Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 22, 58, 'Taoriana kelin’izay dia nisy olon-kafa indray nahita azy, ka niteny hoe: “Naman-dry zareo koa ianao.” Fa hoy i Petera: “Tsy naman-dry zareo aho.”', 'taoriana kelin’izay dia nisy olon-kafa indray nahita azy, ka niteny hoe: “naman-dry zareo koa ianao.” fa hoy i petera: “tsy naman-dry zareo aho.”'),
  ('6ab25c6aa86ff60c5789aa7c', '2026-09-22T10:46:02.578Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:02.578Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 22, 47, 'Tsy tapitra akory anefa ny teniny, dia ireny fa nisy vahoaka be tonga. Ary nitarika azy ireo ilay lehilahy atao hoe Jodasy, ilay anisan’ny 12 Lahy. Dia nanatona an’i Jesosy izy mba hanoroka azy.', 'tsy tapitra akory anefa ny teniny, dia ireny fa nisy vahoaka be tonga. ary nitarika azy ireo ilay lehilahy atao hoe jodasy, ilay anisan’ny 12 lahy. dia nanatona an’i jesosy izy mba hanoroka azy.'),
  ('6ab25c6aa86ff60c5789aa93', '2026-09-22T10:46:02.578Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:02.578Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 22, 70, 'Dia hoy izy rehetra: “Zanak’Andriamanitra ve izany ianao?” Hoy izy: “Voalazanareo fa izany aho.”', 'dia hoy izy rehetra: “zanak’andriamanitra ve izany ianao?” hoy izy: “voalazanareo fa izany aho.”'),
  ('6ab25c6aa86ff60c5789aa90', '2026-09-22T10:46:02.578Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:02.578Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 22, 67, '“Lazao aminay raha ianao no Kristy.” Fa hoy izy: “Na hoteneniko aminareo aza, dia tsy hino mihitsy ianareo.', '“lazao aminay raha ianao no kristy.” fa hoy izy: “na hoteneniko aminareo aza, dia tsy hino mihitsy ianareo.'),
  ('6ab25c6aa86ff60c5789aa92', '2026-09-22T10:46:02.578Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:02.578Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 22, 69, 'Fa manomboka izao, dia hipetraka eo ankavanan’ilay Andriamanitra mahery ny Zanak’olona.”', 'fa manomboka izao, dia hipetraka eo ankavanan’ilay andriamanitra mahery ny zanak’olona.”'),
  ('6ab25c6aa86ff60c5789aa88', '2026-09-22T10:46:02.578Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:02.578Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 22, 59, 'Adiny iray teo ho eo taorian’izay, dia nisy lehilahy iray hafa nanizingizina hoe: “Tena niaraka taminy mihitsy io lehilahy io, fa Galilianina!”', 'adiny iray teo ho eo taorian’izay, dia nisy lehilahy iray hafa nanizingizina hoe: “tena niaraka taminy mihitsy io lehilahy io, fa galilianina!”'),
  ('6ab25c6aa86ff60c5789aa83', '2026-09-22T10:46:02.578Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:02.578Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 22, 54, 'Dia nosamborin’izy ireo izy ka nentiny nankao an-tranon’ny mpisoronabe. Fa i Petera kosa nanaraka teny lavidavitra teny.', 'dia nosamborin’izy ireo izy ka nentiny nankao an-tranon’ny mpisoronabe. fa i petera kosa nanaraka teny lavidavitra teny.'),
  ('6ab25c6aa86ff60c5789aa81', '2026-09-22T10:46:02.578Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:02.578Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 22, 52, 'Dia hoy i Jesosy tamin’ny lehiben’ny mpisorona sy ny lehiben’ny mpiambina ny tempoly ary ny anti-panahy izay tonga teo hisambotra azy: “Tonga atỳ miaraka amin’ny sabatra sy kibay ve ianareo, hoatr’ireny hisambotra mpangalatra ireny?', 'dia hoy i jesosy tamin’ny lehiben’ny mpisorona sy ny lehiben’ny mpiambina ny tempoly ary ny anti-panahy izay tonga teo hisambotra azy: “tonga atỳ miaraka amin’ny sabatra sy kibay ve ianareo, hoatr’ireny hisambotra mpangalatra ireny?'),
  ('6ab25c6aa86ff60c5789aa7b', '2026-09-22T10:46:02.578Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:02.578Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 22, 46, 'Koa niteny tamin’izy ireo izy hoe: “Maninona ianareo no matory? Mitsangàna ary mivavaha foana, mba tsy ho resin’ny fakam-panahy.”', 'koa niteny tamin’izy ireo izy hoe: “maninona ianareo no matory? mitsangàna ary mivavaha foana, mba tsy ho resin’ny fakam-panahy.”'),
  ('6ab25c6aa86ff60c5789aa80', '2026-09-22T10:46:02.578Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:02.578Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 22, 51, 'Fa hoy i Jesosy: “Aoka izay!” Ary nokasihiny ny sofin’ilay mpanompo ka nositraniny.', 'fa hoy i jesosy: “aoka izay!” ary nokasihiny ny sofin’ilay mpanompo ka nositraniny.'),
  ('6ab25c6aa86ff60c5789aa86', '2026-09-22T10:46:02.578Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:02.578Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 22, 57, 'Nanda anefa izy hoe: “Tsy fantatro izy, ravehivavy!”', 'nanda anefa izy hoe: “tsy fantatro izy, ravehivavy!”'),
  ('6ab25c6aa86ff60c5789aa82', '2026-09-22T10:46:02.578Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:02.578Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 22, 53, 'Niaraka taminareo tao amin’ ny tempoly aho isan’andro, nefa tsy nisambotra ahy ianareo. Fa tonga izao ny fotoananareo sy ny fahefan’ny haizina.”', 'niaraka taminareo tao amin’ ny tempoly aho isan’andro, nefa tsy nisambotra ahy ianareo. fa tonga izao ny fotoananareo sy ny fahefan’ny haizina.”');
INSERT INTO "bible_verses" ("id", "created_date", "updated_date", "created_by_id", "created_by", "translation", "book", "bookOrder", "chapter", "verse", "text", "normalizedText") VALUES
  ('6ab25c6aa86ff60c5789aa7d', '2026-09-22T10:46:02.578Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:02.578Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 22, 48, 'Hoy anefa i Jesosy taminy: “Oroka ve no amadihanao ny Zanak’olona, ry Jodasy?”', 'hoy anefa i jesosy taminy: “oroka ve no amadihanao ny zanak’olona, ry jodasy?”'),
  ('6ab25c6aa86ff60c5789aa7f', '2026-09-22T10:46:02.578Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:02.578Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 22, 50, 'Ny iray tamin’izy ireo aza namely an’ilay mpanompon’ny mpisoronabe mihitsy, ka niala ny sofiny havanana.', 'ny iray tamin’izy ireo aza namely an’ilay mpanompon’ny mpisoronabe mihitsy, ka niala ny sofiny havanana.'),
  ('6ab25c6aa86ff60c5789aa8f', '2026-09-22T10:46:02.578Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:02.578Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 22, 66, 'Rehefa maraina ny andro, dia nivory ny anti-panahy rehetran’ny vahoaka, izany hoe ny lehiben’ny mpisorona sy ny mpanora-dalàna. Ary nentin’izy ireo tao amin’ny trano nisy ny Fitsarana Avo Jiosy izy, ka noteneniny hoe:', 'rehefa maraina ny andro, dia nivory ny anti-panahy rehetran’ny vahoaka, izany hoe ny lehiben’ny mpisorona sy ny mpanora-dalàna. ary nentin’izy ireo tao amin’ny trano nisy ny fitsarana avo jiosy izy, ka noteneniny hoe:'),
  ('6ab25c6aa86ff60c5789aa8d', '2026-09-22T10:46:02.578Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:02.578Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 22, 64, 'Dia nosaronan’izy ireo ny tarehiny, ka naverimberiny nanontaniana izy hoe: “Maminania! Iza ilay namely anao teo?”', 'dia nosaronan’izy ireo ny tarehiny, ka naverimberiny nanontaniana izy hoe: “maminania! iza ilay namely anao teo?”'),
  ('6ab25c6bdd04cc16acba68bd', '2026-09-22T10:46:03.880Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:03.880Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 23, 4, 'Dia hoy i Pilato tamin’ny lehiben’ny mpisorona sy ny vahoaka: “Tsy hitako izay helok’ity lehilahy ity.”', 'dia hoy i pilato tamin’ny lehiben’ny mpisorona sy ny vahoaka: “tsy hitako izay helok’ity lehilahy ity.”'),
  ('6ab25c6bdd04cc16acba68ba', '2026-09-22T10:46:03.880Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:03.880Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 23, 1, 'Dia nitsangana ny vahoaka rehetra, ka nitondra an’i Jesosy tany amin’i Pilato.', 'dia nitsangana ny vahoaka rehetra, ka nitondra an’i jesosy tany amin’i pilato.'),
  ('6ab25c6bdd04cc16acba68c1', '2026-09-22T10:46:03.880Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:03.880Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 23, 8, 'Faly be i Heroda nahita an’i Jesosy. Efa ela mantsy izy no te hahita an’i Jesosy, satria efa betsaka ny zavatra henony momba azy. Ary nanantena hahita azy hanao famantarana izy.', 'faly be i heroda nahita an’i jesosy. efa ela mantsy izy no te hahita an’i jesosy, satria efa betsaka ny zavatra henony momba azy. ary nanantena hahita azy hanao famantarana izy.'),
  ('6ab25c6bdd04cc16acba68c6', '2026-09-22T10:46:03.880Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:03.880Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 23, 13, 'Dia novorin’i Pilato ny lehiben’ny mpisorona sy ny mpitondra teo amin’ny Jiosy ary ny vahoaka,', 'dia novorin’i pilato ny lehiben’ny mpisorona sy ny mpitondra teo amin’ny jiosy ary ny vahoaka,'),
  ('6ab25c6bdd04cc16acba68bb', '2026-09-22T10:46:03.880Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:03.880Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 23, 2, 'Ary nanomboka niampanga azy izy ireo hoe: “Ity lehilahy ity hitanay nampirisika ny firenenay hikomy, sady nandrara ny olona tsy handoa hetra amin’i Kaisara, ary nilaza fa izy no Kristy mpanjaka.”', 'ary nanomboka niampanga azy izy ireo hoe: “ity lehilahy ity hitanay nampirisika ny firenenay hikomy, sady nandrara ny olona tsy handoa hetra amin’i kaisara, ary nilaza fa izy no kristy mpanjaka.”'),
  ('6ab25c6bdd04cc16acba68c2', '2026-09-22T10:46:03.880Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:03.880Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 23, 9, 'Nametraka fanontaniana be dia be taminy àry izy, nefa tsy namaly i Jesosy.', 'nametraka fanontaniana be dia be taminy àry izy, nefa tsy namaly i jesosy.'),
  ('6ab25c6bdd04cc16acba68c4', '2026-09-22T10:46:03.880Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:03.880Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 23, 11, 'Dia nanao tsinontsinona azy i Heroda sy ny miaramilany. Naneso azy koa i Heroda, ka nampanaoviny akanjo tsara tarehy izy ary avy eo naveriny tany amin’i Pilato.', 'dia nanao tsinontsinona azy i heroda sy ny miaramilany. naneso azy koa i heroda, ka nampanaoviny akanjo tsara tarehy izy ary avy eo naveriny tany amin’i pilato.'),
  ('6ab25c6bdd04cc16acba68c5', '2026-09-22T10:46:03.880Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:03.880Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 23, 12, 'Ary lasa mpinamana i Heroda sy Pilato tamin’izay andro izay, nefa mpifahavalo izy roa lahy taloha.', 'ary lasa mpinamana i heroda sy pilato tamin’izay andro izay, nefa mpifahavalo izy roa lahy taloha.'),
  ('6ab25c6bdd04cc16acba68c3', '2026-09-22T10:46:03.880Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:03.880Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 23, 10, 'Ny lehiben’ny mpisorona sy ny mpanora-dalàna kosa nitsangana matetika, sady niampanga mafy azy.', 'ny lehiben’ny mpisorona sy ny mpanora-dalàna kosa nitsangana matetika, sady niampanga mafy azy.'),
  ('6ab25c6bdd04cc16acba68bc', '2026-09-22T10:46:03.880Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:03.880Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 23, 3, 'Dia nanontany azy i Pilato hoe: “Ianao ve no Mpanjakan’ny Jiosy?” Hoy i Jesosy: “Voalazanao.”', 'dia nanontany azy i pilato hoe: “ianao ve no mpanjakan’ny jiosy?” hoy i jesosy: “voalazanao.”'),
  ('6ab25c6bdd04cc16acba68bf', '2026-09-22T10:46:03.880Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:03.880Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 23, 6, 'Nandre an’izany i Pilato, ka nanontany raha Galilianina izy.', 'nandre an’izany i pilato, ka nanontany raha galilianina izy.'),
  ('6ab25c6bdd04cc16acba68c0', '2026-09-22T10:46:03.880Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:03.880Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 23, 7, 'Rehefa avy nohamarininy fa avy any amin’ny faritra iadidian’i Heroda izy, dia nalefany tany aminy. I Heroda rahateo koa tany Jerosalema tamin’izay.', 'rehefa avy nohamarininy fa avy any amin’ny faritra iadidian’i heroda izy, dia nalefany tany aminy. i heroda rahateo koa tany jerosalema tamin’izay.'),
  ('6ab25c6bdd04cc16acba68be', '2026-09-22T10:46:03.880Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:03.880Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 23, 5, 'Fa vao mainka izy ireo nanizingizina hoe: “Mampirisika ny vahoaka hikomy izy rehefa nampianatra eran’i Jodia, nanomboka hatrany Galilia ka hatratỳ.”', 'fa vao mainka izy ireo nanizingizina hoe: “mampirisika ny vahoaka hikomy izy rehefa nampianatra eran’i jodia, nanomboka hatrany galilia ka hatratỳ.”'),
  ('6ab25c6bdd04cc16acba68db', '2026-09-22T10:46:03.881Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:03.881Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 23, 34, 'Fa hoy i Jesosy: “Ray ô, avelao ny helok’izy ireo, fa tsy fantany izay ataony.” Ary nanao antsapaka izy ireo mba hizarana ny akanjony.', 'fa hoy i jesosy: “ray ô, avelao ny helok’izy ireo, fa tsy fantany izay ataony.” ary nanao antsapaka izy ireo mba hizarana ny akanjony.'),
  ('6ab25c6bdd04cc16acba68f1', '2026-09-22T10:46:03.881Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:03.881Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 23, 56, 'Dia nody izy ireo mba hanomana zava-manitra sy menaka manitra. Mazava ho azy anefa fa niala sasatra izy ireo ny Sabata, satria izany no takin’ny Lalàna.', 'dia nody izy ireo mba hanomana zava-manitra sy menaka manitra. mazava ho azy anefa fa niala sasatra izy ireo ny sabata, satria izany no takin’ny lalàna.'),
  ('6ab25c6bdd04cc16acba68dc', '2026-09-22T10:46:03.881Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:03.881Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 23, 35, 'Dia nijanona nijery teo ny olona. Fa ireo mpitondra teo amin’ny Jiosy kosa nanaraby azy hoe: “Ny hafa novonjeny, koa asaivo mamonjy ny tenany izy raha izy no Kristin’Andriamanitra, ilay Voafidy.”', 'dia nijanona nijery teo ny olona. fa ireo mpitondra teo amin’ny jiosy kosa nanaraby azy hoe: “ny hafa novonjeny, koa asaivo mamonjy ny tenany izy raha izy no kristin’andriamanitra, ilay voafidy.”'),
  ('6ab25c6bdd04cc16acba68c7', '2026-09-22T10:46:03.881Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:03.881Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 23, 14, 'ka hoy izy: “Nentinareo teto amiko ity lehilahy ity, dia nolazainareo hoe mampirisika ny vahoaka hikomy. Izao anefa, nofotopotorako teo anatrehanareo izy, dia hitako hoe tsy misy mitombina ny zavatra iampanganareo azy.', 'ka hoy izy: “nentinareo teto amiko ity lehilahy ity, dia nolazainareo hoe mampirisika ny vahoaka hikomy. izao anefa, nofotopotorako teo anatrehanareo izy, dia hitako hoe tsy misy mitombina ny zavatra iampanganareo azy.'),
  ('6ab25c6bdd04cc16acba68da', '2026-09-22T10:46:03.881Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:03.881Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 23, 33, 'Dia tonga teo amin’ilay toerana atao hoe Ikarandoha izy ireo. Ary nofantsihan’ireo teo amin’ny tsato-kazo izy sy ireo olon-dratsy ireo, ka ny iray teo ankavanany, ary ny iray teo ankaviany.', 'dia tonga teo amin’ilay toerana atao hoe ikarandoha izy ireo. ary nofantsihan’ireo teo amin’ny tsato-kazo izy sy ireo olon-dratsy ireo, ka ny iray teo ankavanany, ary ny iray teo ankaviany.'),
  ('6ab25c6bdd04cc16acba68d7', '2026-09-22T10:46:03.881Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:03.881Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 23, 30, 'Dia hanomboka hilaza amin’ny tendrombohitra izy ireo hoe: ‘Mianjerà aminay!’, ary amin’ny havoana hoe: ‘Saròny izahay!’', 'dia hanomboka hilaza amin’ny tendrombohitra izy ireo hoe: ‘mianjerà aminay!’, ary amin’ny havoana hoe: ‘saròny izahay!’'),
  ('6ab25c6bdd04cc16acba68e5', '2026-09-22T10:46:03.881Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:03.881Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 23, 44, 'Ora fahenina teo ho eo tamin’izay, kanefa nisy haizina nanarona an’ilay faritra manontolo hatramin’ny ora fahasivy,', 'ora fahenina teo ho eo tamin’izay, kanefa nisy haizina nanarona an’ilay faritra manontolo hatramin’ny ora fahasivy,'),
  ('6ab25c6bdd04cc16acba68e9', '2026-09-22T10:46:03.881Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:03.881Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 23, 48, 'Rehefa nahita an’izany ny vahoaka rehetra tonga mba hijery an’izay nitranga, dia niverina nody izy ireo sady nikapo-tratra.', 'rehefa nahita an’izany ny vahoaka rehetra tonga mba hijery an’izay nitranga, dia niverina nody izy ireo sady nikapo-tratra.'),
  ('6ab25c6bdd04cc16acba68e8', '2026-09-22T10:46:03.881Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:03.881Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 23, 47, 'Nahita an’izay nitranga ilay manamboninahitra ka nanome voninahitra an’Andriamanitra. Dia niteny izy hoe: “Tena olo-marina io lehilahy io.”', 'nahita an’izay nitranga ilay manamboninahitra ka nanome voninahitra an’andriamanitra. dia niteny izy hoe: “tena olo-marina io lehilahy io.”'),
  ('6ab25c6bdd04cc16acba68e7', '2026-09-22T10:46:03.881Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:03.881Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 23, 46, 'Dia niantsoantso mafy i Jesosy hoe: “Ray ô, ankiniko aminao ny aiko.” Dia tapitra ny ainy, rehefa avy nilaza an’izany izy.', 'dia niantsoantso mafy i jesosy hoe: “ray ô, ankiniko aminao ny aiko.” dia tapitra ny ainy, rehefa avy nilaza an’izany izy.'),
  ('6ab25c6bdd04cc16acba68ca', '2026-09-22T10:46:03.881Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:03.881Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 23, 17, '* ——', '* ——'),
  ('6ab25c6bdd04cc16acba68ec', '2026-09-22T10:46:03.881Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:03.881Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 23, 51, '—Tsy nanaiky hanohana ny tetika sy ny zava-dratsy nataon’ilay Filan-kevitra izy.—Avy any Arimatia tanànan’ny Jodianina izy, ary niandry ny Fanjakan’Andriamanitra.', '—tsy nanaiky hanohana ny tetika sy ny zava-dratsy nataon’ilay filan-kevitra izy.—avy any arimatia tanànan’ny jodianina izy, ary niandry ny fanjakan’andriamanitra.'),
  ('6ab25c6bdd04cc16acba68dd', '2026-09-22T10:46:03.881Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:03.881Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 23, 36, 'Na ny miaramila aza naneso azy, ka nanatona ary nanome azy divay marikivy,', 'na ny miaramila aza naneso azy, ka nanatona ary nanome azy divay marikivy,'),
  ('6ab25c6bdd04cc16acba68d3', '2026-09-22T10:46:03.881Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:03.881Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 23, 26, 'Rehefa nitondra an’i Jesosy izy ireo, dia nosakanany i Simona avy any Kyrena, izay avy tany ambanivohitra. Dia nampitondrain’izy ireo an’i Simona ny hazo fijaliana ary nasainy nandeha tao aorianan’i Jesosy izy.', 'rehefa nitondra an’i jesosy izy ireo, dia nosakanany i simona avy any kyrena, izay avy tany ambanivohitra. dia nampitondrain’izy ireo an’i simona ny hazo fijaliana ary nasainy nandeha tao aorianan’i jesosy izy.'),
  ('6ab25c6bdd04cc16acba68d0', '2026-09-22T10:46:03.881Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:03.881Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 23, 23, 'Rehefa naheno an’izany anefa izy ireo, dia vao mainka nisisika sady niantsoantso mafy nitaky ny hamonoana azy. Ary nihorakoraka be izy ireo ka nilefitra izy.', 'rehefa naheno an’izany anefa izy ireo, dia vao mainka nisisika sady niantsoantso mafy nitaky ny hamonoana azy. ary nihorakoraka be izy ireo ka nilefitra izy.'),
  ('6ab25c6bdd04cc16acba68e2', '2026-09-22T10:46:03.881Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:03.881Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 23, 41, 'Rariny isika raha voaheloka, satria mendrika handray ny valin’ny nataontsika, fa izy kosa tsy mba nanao zavatra tsy nety.”', 'rariny isika raha voaheloka, satria mendrika handray ny valin’ny nataontsika, fa izy kosa tsy mba nanao zavatra tsy nety.”'),
  ('6ab25c6bdd04cc16acba68df', '2026-09-22T10:46:03.881Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:03.881Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 23, 38, 'Nisy an’izao soratra izao koa teo amboniny: “Ity no Mpanjakan’ny Jiosy.”', 'nisy an’izao soratra izao koa teo amboniny: “ity no mpanjakan’ny jiosy.”'),
  ('6ab25c6bdd04cc16acba68cc', '2026-09-22T10:46:03.881Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:03.881Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 23, 19, '—Nogadraina io Barabasy io satria nitaona olona hikomy tao an-tanàna sady namono olona.—', '—nogadraina io barabasy io satria nitaona olona hikomy tao an-tanàna sady namono olona.—'),
  ('6ab25c6bdd04cc16acba68eb', '2026-09-22T10:46:03.881Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:03.881Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 23, 50, 'Ary nisy lehilahy iray atao hoe Josefa, izay anisan’ny Filan-kevitry ny Jiosy. Lehilahy tsara toetra izy sady olo-marina.', 'ary nisy lehilahy iray atao hoe josefa, izay anisan’ny filan-kevitry ny jiosy. lehilahy tsara toetra izy sady olo-marina.'),
  ('6ab25c6bdd04cc16acba68de', '2026-09-22T10:46:03.881Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:03.881Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 23, 37, 'sady niteny hoe: “Raha Mpanjakan’ny Jiosy ianao, dia vonjeo ny tenanao.”', 'sady niteny hoe: “raha mpanjakan’ny jiosy ianao, dia vonjeo ny tenanao.”'),
  ('6ab25c6bdd04cc16acba68d8', '2026-09-22T10:46:03.881Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:03.881Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 23, 31, 'Raha izany no ataon’izy ireo amin’izao hazo mbola mando izao, dia inona no hitranga rehefa maina ny hazo?”', 'raha izany no ataon’izy ireo amin’izao hazo mbola mando izao, dia inona no hitranga rehefa maina ny hazo?”'),
  ('6ab25c6bdd04cc16acba68d6', '2026-09-22T10:46:03.881Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:03.881Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 23, 29, 'Ho avy mantsy ny andro hilazan’ny olona hoe: ‘Sambatra ny vehivavy momba, sy ny kibo tsy niteraka ary ny nono mbola tsy nisy zaza ninono!’', 'ho avy mantsy ny andro hilazan’ny olona hoe: ‘sambatra ny vehivavy momba, sy ny kibo tsy niteraka ary ny nono mbola tsy nisy zaza ninono!’'),
  ('6ab25c6bdd04cc16acba68ea', '2026-09-22T10:46:03.881Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:03.881Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 23, 49, 'Ary nijoro teny lavitra teny ny olom-pantany rehetra. Teo koa ireo vehivavy nanaraka azy avy tany Galilia ka nahita an’izany.', 'ary nijoro teny lavitra teny ny olom-pantany rehetra. teo koa ireo vehivavy nanaraka azy avy tany galilia ka nahita an’izany.'),
  ('6ab25c6bdd04cc16acba68e4', '2026-09-22T10:46:03.881Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:03.881Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 23, 43, 'Dia hoy i Jesosy taminy: “Lazaiko marina aminao anio fa hiaraka amiko any amin’ny Paradisa ianao.”', 'dia hoy i jesosy taminy: “lazaiko marina aminao anio fa hiaraka amiko any amin’ny paradisa ianao.”'),
  ('6ab25c6bdd04cc16acba68e3', '2026-09-22T10:46:03.881Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:03.881Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 23, 42, 'Hoy izy avy eo: “Jesosy ô, tsarovy aho rehefa tonga any amin’ny Fanjakanao ianao.”', 'hoy izy avy eo: “jesosy ô, tsarovy aho rehefa tonga any amin’ny fanjakanao ianao.”'),
  ('6ab25c6bdd04cc16acba68d1', '2026-09-22T10:46:03.881Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:03.881Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 23, 24, 'Dia nanapa-kevitra i Pilato hoe hotanterahina izay notakin’izy ireo.', 'dia nanapa-kevitra i pilato hoe hotanterahina izay notakin’izy ireo.'),
  ('6ab25c6bdd04cc16acba68ce', '2026-09-22T10:46:03.881Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:03.881Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 23, 21, 'Dia niantsoantso mafy izy ireo hoe: “Fantsiho eo amin’ny tsato-kazo izy! Fantsiho eo amin’ny tsato-kazo izy!”', 'dia niantsoantso mafy izy ireo hoe: “fantsiho eo amin’ny tsato-kazo izy! fantsiho eo amin’ny tsato-kazo izy!”'),
  ('6ab25c6bdd04cc16acba68cf', '2026-09-22T10:46:03.881Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:03.881Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 23, 22, 'Hoy i Pilato fanintelony: “Fa maninona? Fa inona no ratsy nataon’io lehilahy io? Tsy hitako mihitsy izay tokony hamonoana azy ho faty. Koa hosaziko izy dia halefako.”', 'hoy i pilato fanintelony: “fa maninona? fa inona no ratsy nataon’io lehilahy io? tsy hitako mihitsy izay tokony hamonoana azy ho faty. koa hosaziko izy dia halefako.”'),
  ('6ab25c6bdd04cc16acba68cd', '2026-09-22T10:46:03.881Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:03.881Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 23, 20, 'Dia niteny tamin’izy ireo indray i Pilato satria te handefa an’i Jesosy.', 'dia niteny tamin’izy ireo indray i pilato satria te handefa an’i jesosy.'),
  ('6ab25c6bdd04cc16acba68c9', '2026-09-22T10:46:03.881Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:03.881Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 23, 16, 'Koa hosaziko izy dia halefako.”', 'koa hosaziko izy dia halefako.”'),
  ('6ab25c6bdd04cc16acba68e6', '2026-09-22T10:46:03.881Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:03.881Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 23, 45, 'satria tsy nazava ny masoandro. Ary triatra nizara roa teo afovoany ilay ridao tao amin’ny toerana masina.', 'satria tsy nazava ny masoandro. ary triatra nizara roa teo afovoany ilay ridao tao amin’ny toerana masina.'),
  ('6ab25c6bdd04cc16acba68d9', '2026-09-22T10:46:03.881Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:03.881Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 23, 32, 'Nisy olon-dratsy roa lahy koa nentina hovonoina niaraka taminy.', 'nisy olon-dratsy roa lahy koa nentina hovonoina niaraka taminy.'),
  ('6ab25c6bdd04cc16acba68d5', '2026-09-22T10:46:03.881Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:03.881Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 23, 28, 'Fa nitodika tany amin’ireo vehivavy ireo i Jesosy, ka niteny hoe: “Aza mitomany ahy intsony, ry zanakavavin’i Jerosalema, fa ny tenanareo sy ny zanakareo kosa itomaniana.', 'fa nitodika tany amin’ireo vehivavy ireo i jesosy, ka niteny hoe: “aza mitomany ahy intsony, ry zanakavavin’i jerosalema, fa ny tenanareo sy ny zanakareo kosa itomaniana.'),
  ('6ab25c6bdd04cc16acba68ee', '2026-09-22T10:46:03.881Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:03.881Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 23, 53, 'Ary nampidininy ilay faty ka nofonosiny lamba rongony tena tsara, dia napetrany tao amin’ny fasana iray nolavahana tao amin’ny vatolampy, izay mbola tsy nandevenana mihitsy.', 'ary nampidininy ilay faty ka nofonosiny lamba rongony tena tsara, dia napetrany tao amin’ny fasana iray nolavahana tao amin’ny vatolampy, izay mbola tsy nandevenana mihitsy.'),
  ('6ab25c6bdd04cc16acba68ed', '2026-09-22T10:46:03.881Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:03.881Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 23, 52, 'Nankany amin’i Pilato izy, dia nangataka ny fatin’i Jesosy.', 'nankany amin’i pilato izy, dia nangataka ny fatin’i jesosy.'),
  ('6ab25c6bdd04cc16acba68ef', '2026-09-22T10:46:03.881Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:03.881Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 23, 54, 'Andro Fiomanana tamin’izay, ary efa hanomboka ny Sabata.', 'andro fiomanana tamin’izay, ary efa hanomboka ny sabata.'),
  ('6ab25c6bdd04cc16acba68d4', '2026-09-22T10:46:03.881Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:03.881Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 23, 27, 'Ary nisy vahoaka be nanaraka an’i Jesosy, anisan’izany ireo vehivavy nikapo-tratra noho ny alahelo sady nidradradradra nitomany azy.', 'ary nisy vahoaka be nanaraka an’i jesosy, anisan’izany ireo vehivavy nikapo-tratra noho ny alahelo sady nidradradradra nitomany azy.'),
  ('6ab25c6bdd04cc16acba68c8', '2026-09-22T10:46:03.881Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:03.881Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 23, 15, 'Na i Heroda koa aza tsy nahita hoe meloka izy, matoa izy naveriny tatỳ amintsika. Tsy nanao na inona na inona tokony hamonoana azy ho faty izy.', 'na i heroda koa aza tsy nahita hoe meloka izy, matoa izy naveriny tatỳ amintsika. tsy nanao na inona na inona tokony hamonoana azy ho faty izy.'),
  ('6ab25c6bdd04cc16acba68f0', '2026-09-22T10:46:03.881Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:03.881Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 23, 55, 'Ary nanaraka teny koa ireo vehivavy izay niaraka taminy avy tany Galilia, ka nijery ny fasana sy ny fomba nametrahana ny fatin’i Jesosy.', 'ary nanaraka teny koa ireo vehivavy izay niaraka taminy avy tany galilia, ka nijery ny fasana sy ny fomba nametrahana ny fatin’i jesosy.'),
  ('6ab25c6bdd04cc16acba68e0', '2026-09-22T10:46:03.881Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:03.881Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 23, 39, 'Dia nanomboka nanevateva azy ny iray tamin’ireo olon-dratsy nihantona teo hoe: “Ka tsy Kristy moa ianao? Vonjeo ny tenanao dia vonjeo koa izahay!”', 'dia nanomboka nanevateva azy ny iray tamin’ireo olon-dratsy nihantona teo hoe: “ka tsy kristy moa ianao? vonjeo ny tenanao dia vonjeo koa izahay!”'),
  ('6ab25c6bdd04cc16acba68e1', '2026-09-22T10:46:03.881Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:03.881Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 23, 40, 'Fa niteny mafy an’io ilay anankiray hoe: “Mbola tsy matahotra an’Andriamanitra ihany ve ianao, nefa ianao koa aza efa voaheloka hoatr’azy?', 'fa niteny mafy an’io ilay anankiray hoe: “mbola tsy matahotra an’andriamanitra ihany ve ianao, nefa ianao koa aza efa voaheloka hoatr’azy?'),
  ('6ab25c6bdd04cc16acba68d2', '2026-09-22T10:46:03.881Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:03.881Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 23, 25, 'Koa nafahany ilay lehilahy notakin’izy ireo, dia ilay nogadraina satria nitaona olona hikomy sady namono olona. I Jesosy kosa natolony azy ireo mba hataony araka izay itiavany azy.', 'koa nafahany ilay lehilahy notakin’izy ireo, dia ilay nogadraina satria nitaona olona hikomy sady namono olona. i jesosy kosa natolony azy ireo mba hataony araka izay itiavany azy.'),
  ('6ab25c6bdd04cc16acba68cb', '2026-09-22T10:46:03.881Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:03.881Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 23, 18, 'Fa ny vahoaka rehetra kosa niantsoantso hoe: “Vonoy io lehilahy io, fa i Barabasy no afaho ho anay!”', 'fa ny vahoaka rehetra kosa niantsoantso hoe: “vonoy io lehilahy io, fa i barabasy no afaho ho anay!”'),
  ('6ab25c6cfb2e9b996551dabb', '2026-09-22T10:46:04.380Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:04.380Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 24, 43, 'Dia noraisiny ilay izy ary nohaniny teo imason’izy ireo.', 'dia noraisiny ilay izy ary nohaniny teo imason’izy ireo.'),
  ('6ab25c6cfb2e9b996551da9c', '2026-09-22T10:46:04.380Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:04.380Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 24, 12, 'Fa nitsangana kosa i Petera, ka lasa nihazakazaka nankany am-pasana. Ary niondrika nijery izy, nefa tsy nahita afa-tsy ireo lamba rongony namonosana an’ilay faty. Koa niala teo izy, sady lasa saina hoe inona no nitranga.', 'fa nitsangana kosa i petera, ka lasa nihazakazaka nankany am-pasana. ary niondrika nijery izy, nefa tsy nahita afa-tsy ireo lamba rongony namonosana an’ilay faty. koa niala teo izy, sady lasa saina hoe inona no nitranga.'),
  ('6ab25c6cfb2e9b996551da97', '2026-09-22T10:46:04.380Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:04.380Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 24, 7, 'Nilaza izy tamin’izay fa tsy maintsy hatolotra amin’ny mpanota ny Zanak’olona, dia hovonoina eo amin’ny tsato-kazo ary hitsangana amin’ny maty amin’ny andro fahatelo.”', 'nilaza izy tamin’izay fa tsy maintsy hatolotra amin’ny mpanota ny zanak’olona, dia hovonoina eo amin’ny tsato-kazo ary hitsangana amin’ny maty amin’ny andro fahatelo.”'),
  ('6ab25c6cfb2e9b996551da92', '2026-09-22T10:46:04.380Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:04.380Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 24, 2, 'Hitan’izy ireo anefa fa efa voakodia niala teo amin’ny fasana ny vato.', 'hitan’izy ireo anefa fa efa voakodia niala teo amin’ny fasana ny vato.'),
  ('6ab25c6cfb2e9b996551dac5', '2026-09-22T10:46:04.380Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:04.380Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 24, 53, 'Ary tao amin’ny tempoly foana izy ireo, nidera an’Andriamanitra.', 'ary tao amin’ny tempoly foana izy ireo, nidera an’andriamanitra.'),
  ('6ab25c6cfb2e9b996551dab2', '2026-09-22T10:46:04.380Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:04.380Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 24, 34, 'izay niteny hoe: “Tena marina tokoa fa efa natsangana tamin’ny maty ny Tompo, ary efa niseho tamin’i Simona izy!”', 'izay niteny hoe: “tena marina tokoa fa efa natsangana tamin’ny maty ny tompo, ary efa niseho tamin’i simona izy!”'),
  ('6ab25c6cfb2e9b996551dabf', '2026-09-22T10:46:04.380Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:04.380Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 24, 47, 'ary amin’ny anarany no hitoriana any amin’ny firenena rehetra ny fibebahana hahazoana famelan-keloka. Ary atomboka eto Jerosalema izany.', 'ary amin’ny anarany no hitoriana any amin’ny firenena rehetra ny fibebahana hahazoana famelan-keloka. ary atomboka eto jerosalema izany.'),
  ('6ab25c6cfb2e9b996551dabd', '2026-09-22T10:46:04.380Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:04.380Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 24, 45, 'Dia nosokafany tanteraka ny sain’izy ireo mba ho azon’izy ireo tsara ny hevitry ny Soratra Masina,', 'dia nosokafany tanteraka ny sain’izy ireo mba ho azon’izy ireo tsara ny hevitry ny soratra masina,'),
  ('6ab25c6cfb2e9b996551dabc', '2026-09-22T10:46:04.380Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:04.380Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 24, 44, 'Hoy izy avy eo: “Efa niteny taminareo aho, tamin’izaho mbola teo aminareo, fa tsy maintsy ho tanteraka izay rehetra nosoratana momba ahy ao amin’ny Lalàn’i Mosesy sy ao amin’ny Mpaminany ary ny Salamo.”', 'hoy izy avy eo: “efa niteny taminareo aho, tamin’izaho mbola teo aminareo, fa tsy maintsy ho tanteraka izay rehetra nosoratana momba ahy ao amin’ny lalàn’i mosesy sy ao amin’ny mpaminany ary ny salamo.”'),
  ('6ab25c6cfb2e9b996551dab9', '2026-09-22T10:46:04.380Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:04.380Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 24, 41, 'Mbola tsy nino ihany anefa izy ireo satria faly loatra sady gaga be, ka hoy izy: “Misy zavatra azo hanina ve ato aminareo?”', 'mbola tsy nino ihany anefa izy ireo satria faly loatra sady gaga be, ka hoy izy: “misy zavatra azo hanina ve ato aminareo?”'),
  ('6ab25c6cfb2e9b996551dab7', '2026-09-22T10:46:04.380Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:04.380Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 24, 39, 'Jereo ny tanako sy ny tongotro, fa izaho ihany ity. Kasiho aho dia jereo, fa ny anjely tsy manana nofo sy taolana hoatran’izao ahitanareo ahy izao.”', 'jereo ny tanako sy ny tongotro, fa izaho ihany ity. kasiho aho dia jereo, fa ny anjely tsy manana nofo sy taolana hoatran’izao ahitanareo ahy izao.”'),
  ('6ab25c6cfb2e9b996551da9a', '2026-09-22T10:46:04.380Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:04.380Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 24, 10, 'Tsy iza ireo vehivavy ireo fa i Maria Magdalena sy Johana ary Maria renin’i Jakoba. Ary ny vehivavy hafa niaraka tamin’izy ireo dia niresaka an’izany koa tamin’ny apostoly.', 'tsy iza ireo vehivavy ireo fa i maria magdalena sy johana ary maria renin’i jakoba. ary ny vehivavy hafa niaraka tamin’izy ireo dia niresaka an’izany koa tamin’ny apostoly.'),
  ('6ab25c6cfb2e9b996551dac1', '2026-09-22T10:46:04.380Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:04.380Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 24, 49, 'Ary halefako aminareo ilay nampanantenain’ny Raiko. Mijanòna anefa eto an-tanàna mandra-pahatongan’ny fotoana hahazoanareo hery avy any amin’ny avo.”', 'ary halefako aminareo ilay nampanantenain’ny raiko. mijanòna anefa eto an-tanàna mandra-pahatongan’ny fotoana hahazoanareo hery avy any amin’ny avo.”'),
  ('6ab25c6cfb2e9b996551dab6', '2026-09-22T10:46:04.380Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:04.380Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 24, 38, 'Hoy àry izy: “Fa maninona ianareo no mitebiteby? Ary maninona no misalasala ianareo ao am-ponareo?', 'hoy àry izy: “fa maninona ianareo no mitebiteby? ary maninona no misalasala ianareo ao am-ponareo?'),
  ('6ab25c6cfb2e9b996551dab1', '2026-09-22T10:46:04.380Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:04.380Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 24, 33, 'Ary tamin’izay ora izay ihany dia nitsangana izy roa lahy, ka niverina tany Jerosalema, ary nahita an’izy 11 Lahy sy ireo nivory niaraka taminy,', 'ary tamin’izay ora izay ihany dia nitsangana izy roa lahy, ka niverina tany jerosalema, ary nahita an’izy 11 lahy sy ireo nivory niaraka taminy,'),
