  ('6ab25c6cfb2e9b996551dab3', '2026-09-22T10:46:04.380Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:04.380Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 24, 35, 'Dia notantarain’izy roa lahy koa ny zava-nitranga teny an-dalana sy ny nahafantaran’izy ireo azy tamin’izy nanapaka ny mofo.', 'dia notantarain’izy roa lahy koa ny zava-nitranga teny an-dalana sy ny nahafantaran’izy ireo azy tamin’izy nanapaka ny mofo.'),
  ('6ab25c6cfb2e9b996551da9d', '2026-09-22T10:46:04.380Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:04.380Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 24, 13, 'Ary tamin’izay andro izay indrindra, dia nisy mpianatra roa lahy nankany amin’ny tanàna kely atao hoe Emaosy, any amin’ny 11 kilaometatra eo ho eo avy ao Jerosalema.', 'ary tamin’izay andro izay indrindra, dia nisy mpianatra roa lahy nankany amin’ny tanàna kely atao hoe emaosy, any amin’ny 11 kilaometatra eo ho eo avy ao jerosalema.'),
  ('6ab25c6cfb2e9b996551da9b', '2026-09-22T10:46:04.380Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:04.380Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 24, 11, 'Noheverin’izy ireny fa niteniteny foana anefa ireo vehivavy ireo, ka tsy ninoany.', 'noheverin’izy ireny fa niteniteny foana anefa ireo vehivavy ireo, ka tsy ninoany.'),
