  ('6ab25c6cfb2e9b996551dac0', '2026-09-22T10:46:04.380Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:04.380Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 24, 48, 'Ianareo no ho vavolombelon’izany.', 'ianareo no ho vavolombelon’izany.'),
  ('6ab25c6cfb2e9b996551daa8', '2026-09-22T10:46:04.380Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:04.380Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 24, 24, 'Lasa nankany am-pasana àry ny sasany taminay, dia nitovy tamin’ny zavatra nolazain’ireo vehivavy mihitsy no hitany. Tsy nahita an’i Jesosy anefa ry zareo.”', 'lasa nankany am-pasana àry ny sasany taminay, dia nitovy tamin’ny zavatra nolazain’ireo vehivavy mihitsy no hitany. tsy nahita an’i jesosy anefa ry zareo.”'),
  ('6ab25c6cfb2e9b996551dac2', '2026-09-22T10:46:04.380Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:04.380Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 24, 50, 'Dia nentiny nivoaka an’ilay tanàna izy ireo, ka tonga hatrany Betania. Ary nampiakatra ny tanany izy, dia notsofiny rano izy ireo.', 'dia nentiny nivoaka an’ilay tanàna izy ireo, ka tonga hatrany betania. ary nampiakatra ny tanany izy, dia notsofiny rano izy ireo.'),
  ('6ab25c6cfb2e9b996551dab8', '2026-09-22T10:46:04.380Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:04.380Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 24, 40, 'Sady niteny an’izany izy no nampiseho tamin’izy ireo ny tanany sy ny tongony.', 'sady niteny an’izany izy no nampiseho tamin’izy ireo ny tanany sy ny tongony.'),
  ('6ab25c6cfb2e9b996551daaa', '2026-09-22T10:46:04.380Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:04.380Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 24, 26, 'Tsy tokony ho niaritra an’izany rehetra izany ve i Kristy mba homem-boninahitra?”', 'tsy tokony ho niaritra an’izany rehetra izany ve i kristy mba homem-boninahitra?”'),
  ('6ab25c6cfb2e9b996551daa3', '2026-09-22T10:46:04.380Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:04.380Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 24, 19, 'Dia nanontany izy hoe: “Zavatra inona?” Hoy izy ireo: “Ny momba an’i Jesosy avy any Nazareta! Mpaminany niavaka teo anatrehan’Andriamanitra sy ny olona rehetra izy, tamin’ny zavatra nataony sy nolazainy.', 'dia nanontany izy hoe: “zavatra inona?” hoy izy ireo: “ny momba an’i jesosy avy any nazareta! mpaminany niavaka teo anatrehan’andriamanitra sy ny olona rehetra izy, tamin’ny zavatra nataony sy nolazainy.'),
  ('6ab25c6cfb2e9b996551dab0', '2026-09-22T10:46:04.380Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:04.380Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 24, 32, 'Koa nifampiresaka izy roa lahy hoe: “Tsy hoatran’ny hoe nisy afo niredareda ve tao am-pontsika tamin’izy niresaka tamintsika teny an-dalana, dia nanazava tsara ny Soratra Masina tamintsika?”', 'koa nifampiresaka izy roa lahy hoe: “tsy hoatran’ny hoe nisy afo niredareda ve tao am-pontsika tamin’izy niresaka tamintsika teny an-dalana, dia nanazava tsara ny soratra masina tamintsika?”'),
  ('6ab25c6cfb2e9b996551daa7', '2026-09-22T10:46:04.380Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:04.380Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 24, 23, 'ka rehefa tsy hitany ilay faty, dia niverina ry zareo ary nilaza fa nahita anjely niteny hoe velona izy.', 'ka rehefa tsy hitany ilay faty, dia niverina ry zareo ary nilaza fa nahita anjely niteny hoe velona izy.'),
  ('6ab25c6cfb2e9b996551daa5', '2026-09-22T10:46:04.380Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:04.380Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 24, 21, 'Izahay anefa nanantena hoe izy no hanafaka ny Israely. Sady androany koa no andro fahatelo taorian’ny nitrangan’izany.', 'izahay anefa nanantena hoe izy no hanafaka ny israely. sady androany koa no andro fahatelo taorian’ny nitrangan’izany.'),
  ('6ab25c6cfb2e9b996551da99', '2026-09-22T10:46:04.380Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:04.380Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 24, 9, 'ary niala teo amin’ilay fasana izy ireo ka niverina, dia nitantara an’izany rehetra izany tamin’ny 11 Lahy sy ny hafa rehetra.', 'ary niala teo amin’ilay fasana izy ireo ka niverina, dia nitantara an’izany rehetra izany tamin’ny 11 lahy sy ny hafa rehetra.'),
  ('6ab25c6cfb2e9b996551da94', '2026-09-22T10:46:04.380Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:04.380Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Lioka', 42, 24, 4, 'Raha mbola very hevitra teo izy ireo, dia ireo fa nisy lehilahy anankiroa nanao akanjo mamirapiratra, nijoro teo akaikiny.', 'raha mbola very hevitra teo izy ireo, dia ireo fa nisy lehilahy anankiroa nanao akanjo mamirapiratra, nijoro teo akaikiny.'),
  ('6ab25c6dba2620b3e0ddb0dd', '2026-09-22T10:46:05.160Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:05.160Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 1, 33, 'Izaho aza tsy nahalala azy akory, fa Ilay naniraka ahy hanao batisa amin’ny rano no nilaza tamiko hoe: ‘Izay olona hitanao idinan’ny fanahy sy ijanonany, dia izy ilay manao batisa amin’ny fanahy masina.’', 'izaho aza tsy nahalala azy akory, fa ilay naniraka ahy hanao batisa amin’ny rano no nilaza tamiko hoe: ‘izay olona hitanao idinan’ny fanahy sy ijanonany, dia izy ilay manao batisa amin’ny fanahy masina.’'),
  ('6ab25c6dba2620b3e0ddb0d9', '2026-09-22T10:46:05.160Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:05.160Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 1, 29, 'Ny ampitson’iny, dia hitany nanatona azy i Jesosy, ka hoy izy: “Iny ilay Zanak’ondrin’Andriamanitra izay manala ny fahotan’izao tontolo izao!', 'ny ampitson’iny, dia hitany nanatona azy i jesosy, ka hoy izy: “iny ilay zanak’ondrin’andriamanitra izay manala ny fahotan’izao tontolo izao!'),
  ('6ab25c6dba2620b3e0ddb0d3', '2026-09-22T10:46:05.160Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:05.160Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 1, 23, 'Dia hoy izy: “Izaho ilay miantsoantso any an-tany efitra hoe: ‘Ataovy mahitsy ny lalana halehan’i Jehovah’, araka ny nolazain’i Isaia mpaminany.”', 'dia hoy izy: “izaho ilay miantsoantso any an-tany efitra hoe: ‘ataovy mahitsy ny lalana halehan’i jehovah’, araka ny nolazain’i isaia mpaminany.”'),
  ('6ab25c6dba2620b3e0ddb0c8', '2026-09-22T10:46:05.160Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:05.160Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 1, 12, 'Izay rehetra tena nandray azy kosa nomeny alalana ho lasa zanak’Andriamanitra, satria nino ny anarany.', 'izay rehetra tena nandray azy kosa nomeny alalana ho lasa zanak’andriamanitra, satria nino ny anarany.'),
  ('6ab25c6dba2620b3e0ddb0e9', '2026-09-22T10:46:05.160Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:05.160Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 1, 45, 'Nahita an’i Natanaela i Filipo, ka hoy izy: “Efa hitanay ilay olona noresahin’i Mosesy ao amin’ny Lalàna sy noresahin’ny Mpaminany, dia i Jesosy zanak’i Josefa, avy any Nazareta.”', 'nahita an’i natanaela i filipo, ka hoy izy: “efa hitanay ilay olona noresahin’i mosesy ao amin’ny lalàna sy noresahin’ny mpaminany, dia i jesosy zanak’i josefa, avy any nazareta.”'),
  ('6ab25c6dba2620b3e0ddb0de', '2026-09-22T10:46:05.160Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:05.160Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 1, 34, 'Efa hitako izany, ka manaporofo aho fa izy no Zanak’Andriamanitra.”', 'efa hitako izany, ka manaporofo aho fa izy no zanak’andriamanitra.”'),
  ('6ab25c6dba2620b3e0ddb0bf', '2026-09-22T10:46:05.160Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:05.160Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 1, 3, 'Izy no nampiasaina hampisy ny zava-drehetra, ary na zavatra iray aza tsy ho nisy raha tsy tamin’ny alalany. Ny zavatra nisy', 'izy no nampiasaina hampisy ny zava-drehetra, ary na zavatra iray aza tsy ho nisy raha tsy tamin’ny alalany. ny zavatra nisy'),
  ('6ab25c6dba2620b3e0ddb0e8', '2026-09-22T10:46:05.160Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:05.160Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 1, 44, 'Avy any Betsaida, tanànan’i Andrea sy Petera, no fiavian’i Filipo.', 'avy any betsaida, tanànan’i andrea sy petera, no fiavian’i filipo.'),
  ('6ab25c6dba2620b3e0ddb0df', '2026-09-22T10:46:05.160Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:05.160Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 1, 35, 'Ny ampitson’iny indray, tamin’i Jaona mbola nijoro niaraka tamin’ny mpianany roa lahy,', 'ny ampitson’iny indray, tamin’i jaona mbola nijoro niaraka tamin’ny mpianany roa lahy,'),
  ('6ab25c6dba2620b3e0ddb0db', '2026-09-22T10:46:05.160Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:05.160Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 1, 31, 'Izaho aza tsy nahalala azy akory, fa mba hampisehoana azy amin’ny Israely no antony anaovako batisa amin’ny rano.”', 'izaho aza tsy nahalala azy akory, fa mba hampisehoana azy amin’ny israely no antony anaovako batisa amin’ny rano.”'),
  ('6ab25c6dba2620b3e0ddb0e6', '2026-09-22T10:46:05.160Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:05.160Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 1, 42, 'Dia nentiny tany amin’i Jesosy izy. Nijery azy i Jesosy sady niteny hoe: “Ry Simona zanak’i Jaona, manomboka izao ianao dia hantsoina hoe Kefasy”—raha adika izany dia hoe “Petera.”—', 'dia nentiny tany amin’i jesosy izy. nijery azy i jesosy sady niteny hoe: “ry simona zanak’i jaona, manomboka izao ianao dia hantsoina hoe kefasy”—raha adika izany dia hoe “petera.”—'),
  ('6ab25c6dba2620b3e0ddb0d2', '2026-09-22T10:46:05.160Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:05.160Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 1, 22, 'Hoy izy ireo: “Iza àry ianao e? Teneno anay mba hisy holazainay any amin’izay naniraka anay. Lazao anay ny momba anao.”', 'hoy izy ireo: “iza àry ianao e? teneno anay mba hisy holazainay any amin’izay naniraka anay. lazao anay ny momba anao.”'),
  ('6ab25c6dba2620b3e0ddb0be', '2026-09-22T10:46:05.160Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:05.160Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 1, 2, 'Niaraka tamin’Andriamanitra izy tany am-piandohana.', 'niaraka tamin’andriamanitra izy tany am-piandohana.'),
  ('6ab25c6dba2620b3e0ddb0e3', '2026-09-22T10:46:05.160Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:05.160Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 1, 39, 'Hoy izy: “Avia dia ho hitanareo.” Dia nandeha izy roa lahy ka nahita an’izay nipetrahany, ary nipetraka tao aminy tamin’iny andro iny. Tamin’ny ora fahafolo teo ho eo tamin’izay.', 'hoy izy: “avia dia ho hitanareo.” dia nandeha izy roa lahy ka nahita an’izay nipetrahany, ary nipetraka tao aminy tamin’iny andro iny. tamin’ny ora fahafolo teo ho eo tamin’izay.'),
  ('6ab25c6dba2620b3e0ddb0d8', '2026-09-22T10:46:05.160Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:05.160Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 1, 28, 'Tany Betania izany no nitranga, teny ampitan’ny Reniranon’i Jordana, izay nanaovan’i Jaona batisa.', 'tany betania izany no nitranga, teny ampitan’ny reniranon’i jordana, izay nanaovan’i jaona batisa.'),
  ('6ab25c6dba2620b3e0ddb0c6', '2026-09-22T10:46:05.160Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:05.160Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 1, 10, 'Teo amin’izao tontolo izao izy, ary izy no nampiasaina mba hampisy an’izao tontolo izao. Tsy nahalala azy anefa izao tontolo izao.', 'teo amin’izao tontolo izao izy, ary izy no nampiasaina mba hampisy an’izao tontolo izao. tsy nahalala azy anefa izao tontolo izao.'),
  ('6ab25c6dba2620b3e0ddb0c0', '2026-09-22T10:46:05.160Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:05.160Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 1, 4, 'tamin’ny alalany dia ny fiainana, ary ny fiainana no hazavana ho an’ny olona.', 'tamin’ny alalany dia ny fiainana, ary ny fiainana no hazavana ho an’ny olona.'),
