  ('6ab25c6dba2620b3e0ddb0eb', '2026-09-22T10:46:05.160Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:05.160Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 1, 47, 'Ary hitan’i Jesosy nanatona azy i Natanaela, ka hoy izy momba azy: “Izany ka tena Israelita, sady olona tsy misy fitaka!”', 'ary hitan’i jesosy nanatona azy i natanaela, ka hoy izy momba azy: “izany ka tena israelita, sady olona tsy misy fitaka!”'),
  ('6ab25c6dba2620b3e0ddb0e4', '2026-09-22T10:46:05.160Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:05.160Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 1, 40, 'I Andrea, rahalahin’i Simona Petera, ny iray tamin’ireo roa lahy naheno ny tenin’i Jaona ka nanaraka an’i Jesosy.', 'i andrea, rahalahin’i simona petera, ny iray tamin’ireo roa lahy naheno ny tenin’i jaona ka nanaraka an’i jesosy.'),
  ('6ab25c6dba2620b3e0ddb0d5', '2026-09-22T10:46:05.160Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:05.160Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 1, 25, 'ka nanontany azy hoe: “Koa maninona ianao no manao batisa raha tsy ianao no Kristy, na Elia, na Ilay Mpaminany?”', 'ka nanontany azy hoe: “koa maninona ianao no manao batisa raha tsy ianao no kristy, na elia, na ilay mpaminany?”'),
  ('6ab25c6dba2620b3e0ddb0cc', '2026-09-22T10:46:05.160Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:05.160Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 1, 16, 'Feno hatsaram-panahy miavaka izy, ka nanehoana hatsaram-panahy miavaka foana koa isika.', 'feno hatsaram-panahy miavaka izy, ka nanehoana hatsaram-panahy miavaka foana koa isika.'),
  ('6ab25c6dba2620b3e0ddb0c9', '2026-09-22T10:46:05.160Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:05.160Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 1, 13, 'Ary nateraka izy ireo, nefa tsy nateraky ny nofo sy ra, na nateraka noho ny sitrapon’ny ray olombelona, fa naterak’Andriamanitra.', 'ary nateraka izy ireo, nefa tsy nateraky ny nofo sy ra, na nateraka noho ny sitrapon’ny ray olombelona, fa naterak’andriamanitra.'),
  ('6ab25c6dba2620b3e0ddb0c4', '2026-09-22T10:46:05.160Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:05.160Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 1, 8, 'Tsy i Jaona ilay hazavana, fa nirahina ho vavolombelona hanambara an’ilay hazavana fotsiny izy.', 'tsy i jaona ilay hazavana, fa nirahina ho vavolombelona hanambara an’ilay hazavana fotsiny izy.'),
  ('6ab25c6dba2620b3e0ddb0c2', '2026-09-22T10:46:05.160Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:05.160Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 1, 6, 'Ary nisy lehilahy iray nirahina ho solontenan’Andriamanitra. Jaona no anarany.', 'ary nisy lehilahy iray nirahina ho solontenan’andriamanitra. jaona no anarany.'),
  ('6ab25c6dba2620b3e0ddb0cb', '2026-09-22T10:46:05.160Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:05.160Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 1, 15, '—Nanome porofo momba azy i Jaona, dia niantsoantso hoe: “Izy ilay nolazaiko hoe: Lasa eo alohako ilay ho avy ao aorianako, satria efa nisy talohako izy.’”—', '—nanome porofo momba azy i jaona, dia niantsoantso hoe: “izy ilay nolazaiko hoe: lasa eo alohako ilay ho avy ao aorianako, satria efa nisy talohako izy.’”—'),
  ('6ab25c6dba2620b3e0ddb0ca', '2026-09-22T10:46:05.160Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:05.160Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 1, 14, 'Lasa nofo aman-dra àry ny Teny, ary nonina tetỳ aminay. Hitanay ny voninahiny, dia voninahitra tahaka ny an’ny zanaka lahitokan’ny ray. Tena nankasitrahan’Andriamanitra izy ary nampianatra ny fahamarinana.', 'lasa nofo aman-dra àry ny teny, ary nonina tetỳ aminay. hitanay ny voninahiny, dia voninahitra tahaka ny an’ny zanaka lahitokan’ny ray. tena nankasitrahan’andriamanitra izy ary nampianatra ny fahamarinana.'),
  ('6ab25c6dba2620b3e0ddb0bd', '2026-09-22T10:46:05.160Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:05.160Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 1, 1, 'Efa tany am-piandohana ny Teny. Niaraka tamin’Andriamanitra ny Teny, ary ny Teny dia andriamanitra.', 'efa tany am-piandohana ny teny. niaraka tamin’andriamanitra ny teny, ary ny teny dia andriamanitra.'),
  ('6ab25c6dba2620b3e0ddb0e5', '2026-09-22T10:46:05.160Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:05.160Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 1, 41, 'Tonga dia nankany amin’i Simona rahalahiny i Andrea, dia niteny taminy hoe: “Efa hitanay ny Mesia!”—raha adika izany dia hoe “Kristy.”—', 'tonga dia nankany amin’i simona rahalahiny i andrea, dia niteny taminy hoe: “efa hitanay ny mesia!”—raha adika izany dia hoe “kristy.”—'),
  ('6ab25c6dba2620b3e0ddb0d7', '2026-09-22T10:46:05.160Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:05.160Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 1, 27, 'Izy ilay ho avy ao aorianako, ary tsy mendrika hamaha ny tadin-kapany akory aza aho.”', 'izy ilay ho avy ao aorianako, ary tsy mendrika hamaha ny tadin-kapany akory aza aho.”'),
  ('6ab25c6dba2620b3e0ddb0d6', '2026-09-22T10:46:05.160Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:05.160Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 1, 26, 'Dia hoy i Jaona: “Izaho manao batisa amin’ny rano. Fa efa eo aminareo kosa ny olona iray tsy fantatrareo.', 'dia hoy i jaona: “izaho manao batisa amin’ny rano. fa efa eo aminareo kosa ny olona iray tsy fantatrareo.'),
  ('6ab25c6dba2620b3e0ddb0d4', '2026-09-22T10:46:05.160Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:05.160Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 1, 24, 'Nirahin’ny Fariseo izy ireo,', 'nirahin’ny fariseo izy ireo,'),
  ('6ab25c6dba2620b3e0ddb0ea', '2026-09-22T10:46:05.160Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:05.160Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 1, 46, 'Hoy anefa i Natanaela: “Angaha moa mba misy zavatra tsara avy any Nazareta?” Hoy i Filipo: “Avia ange jereo e!”', 'hoy anefa i natanaela: “angaha moa mba misy zavatra tsara avy any nazareta?” hoy i filipo: “avia ange jereo e!”'),
  ('6ab25c6dba2620b3e0ddb0d1', '2026-09-22T10:46:05.160Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:05.160Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 1, 21, 'Dia nanontany azy izy ireo hoe: “Iza àry e? I Elia ve?” Ary hoy izy: “Tsy izy aho.” “Sa ianao ilay Mpaminany?” Dia hoy izy: “Tsy izy aho!”', 'dia nanontany azy izy ireo hoe: “iza àry e? i elia ve?” ary hoy izy: “tsy izy aho.” “sa ianao ilay mpaminany?” dia hoy izy: “tsy izy aho!”'),
  ('6ab25c6dba2620b3e0ddb0cf', '2026-09-22T10:46:05.160Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:05.160Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 1, 19, 'Izao no fanambarana nataon’i Jaona, rehefa nisy mpisorona sy Levita avy any Jerosalema nirahin’ny Jiosy hanontany azy hoe: “Iza moa ianao?”', 'izao no fanambarana nataon’i jaona, rehefa nisy mpisorona sy levita avy any jerosalema nirahin’ny jiosy hanontany azy hoe: “iza moa ianao?”'),
  ('6ab25c6dba2620b3e0ddb0cd', '2026-09-22T10:46:05.160Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:05.160Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 1, 17, 'Nomena tamin’ny alalan’i Mosesy ny Lalàna, fa tamin’ny alalan’i Jesosy Kristy kosa no nanehoana ny hatsaram-panahy miavaka sy ny fahamarinana.', 'nomena tamin’ny alalan’i mosesy ny lalàna, fa tamin’ny alalan’i jesosy kristy kosa no nanehoana ny hatsaram-panahy miavaka sy ny fahamarinana.'),
  ('6ab25c6dba2620b3e0ddb0ec', '2026-09-22T10:46:05.160Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:05.160Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 1, 48, 'Dia hoy i Natanaela: “Ahoana no ahafantaranao ahy?” Namaly azy i Jesosy hoe: “Efa hitako ianao talohan’ny niantsoan’i Filipo anao, tamin’ianao teo ambany aviavy.”', 'dia hoy i natanaela: “ahoana no ahafantaranao ahy?” namaly azy i jesosy hoe: “efa hitako ianao talohan’ny niantsoan’i filipo anao, tamin’ianao teo ambany aviavy.”'),
  ('6ab25c6dba2620b3e0ddb0da', '2026-09-22T10:46:05.160Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:05.160Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 1, 30, 'Izy ilay nolazaiko hoe: ‘Misy olona ho avy ao aorianako, nefa lasa eo alohako izy, satria efa nisy talohako.’', 'izy ilay nolazaiko hoe: ‘misy olona ho avy ao aorianako, nefa lasa eo alohako izy, satria efa nisy talohako.’'),
  ('6ab25c6dba2620b3e0ddb0ee', '2026-09-22T10:46:05.161Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:05.161Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 1, 50, 'Dia hoy i Jesosy: “Lasa mino ve ianao satria niteny aho hoe hitako teo ambany aviavy ianao? Mbola hahita zavatra lehibe noho izany aza ianao.”', 'dia hoy i jesosy: “lasa mino ve ianao satria niteny aho hoe hitako teo ambany aviavy ianao? mbola hahita zavatra lehibe noho izany aza ianao.”'),
  ('6ab25c6dba2620b3e0ddb0ef', '2026-09-22T10:46:05.161Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:05.161Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 1, 51, 'Hoy koa izy: “Lazaiko marimarina aminareo fa hahita ny lanitra misokatra ianareo, dia hahita ny anjelin’Andriamanitra miakatra sy midina mankatỳ amin’ny Zanak’olona.”', 'hoy koa izy: “lazaiko marimarina aminareo fa hahita ny lanitra misokatra ianareo, dia hahita ny anjelin’andriamanitra miakatra sy midina mankatỳ amin’ny zanak’olona.”'),
  ('6ab25c6d594268bf85265f59', '2026-09-22T10:46:05.748Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:05.748Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 2, 6, 'Ary nisy sinibe vato enina fitoeran-drano teo. Nilaina mantsy izany araka ny lalàna momba ny fidiovana narahin’ny Jiosy. Indroa na intelon’ny siny no nahafeno ny sinibe tsirairay.', 'ary nisy sinibe vato enina fitoeran-drano teo. nilaina mantsy izany araka ny lalàna momba ny fidiovana narahin’ny jiosy. indroa na intelon’ny siny no nahafeno ny sinibe tsirairay.'),
  ('6ab25c6d594268bf85265f6c', '2026-09-22T10:46:05.748Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:05.748Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 2, 25, 'Izy koa tsy nila na iza na iza hilaza aminy an’izay tao an-tsain’ny olona, fa efa fantany ny tao am-pon’ny olona.', 'izy koa tsy nila na iza na iza hilaza aminy an’izay tao an-tsain’ny olona, fa efa fantany ny tao am-pon’ny olona.'),
  ('6ab25c6d594268bf85265f66', '2026-09-22T10:46:05.748Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:05.748Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 2, 19, 'Dia namaly i Jesosy hoe: “Ravao ity tempoly ity, dia hatsangako ao anatin’ny telo andro.”', 'dia namaly i jesosy hoe: “ravao ity tempoly ity, dia hatsangako ao anatin’ny telo andro.”'),
  ('6ab25c6d594268bf85265f67', '2026-09-22T10:46:05.748Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:05.748Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 2, 20, 'Hoy ny Jiosy: “Efa 46 taona ange ity tempoly ity vao vita e! Dia ianao ve dia hahatsangana azy ao anatin’ny telo andro?”', 'hoy ny jiosy: “efa 46 taona ange ity tempoly ity vao vita e! dia ianao ve dia hahatsangana azy ao anatin’ny telo andro?”'),
  ('6ab25c6d594268bf85265f5c', '2026-09-22T10:46:05.748Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:05.748Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 2, 9, 'Ary nanandrana an’ilay rano niova ho divay ilay mpiandraikitra, nefa tsy fantany hoe avy aiza ilay izy—fa ireo mpanompo nanovo ny rano no nahafantatra.—Dia nantsoin’ilay mpiandraikitra ilay mpampakatra,', 'ary nanandrana an’ilay rano niova ho divay ilay mpiandraikitra, nefa tsy fantany hoe avy aiza ilay izy—fa ireo mpanompo nanovo ny rano no nahafantatra.—dia nantsoin’ilay mpiandraikitra ilay mpampakatra,'),
  ('6ab25c6d594268bf85265f6b', '2026-09-22T10:46:05.748Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:05.748Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 2, 24, 'Tsy natoky an’ireny anefa i Jesosy, satria fantany daholo izy rehetra.', 'tsy natoky an’ireny anefa i jesosy, satria fantany daholo izy rehetra.'),
  ('6ab25c6d594268bf85265f68', '2026-09-22T10:46:05.748Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:05.748Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 2, 21, 'Ny vatany anefa no tiany holazaina tamin’ilay hoe tempoly.', 'ny vatany anefa no tiany holazaina tamin’ilay hoe tempoly.'),
  ('6ab25c6d594268bf85265f5d', '2026-09-22T10:46:05.748Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:05.748Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 2, 10, 'ka hoy izy taminy: “Ny an’ny olona rehetra, ny divay tsara aloha no aroso, ary rehefa mamo ny olona vao aroso ny ratsiratsy. Ny anao indray ny divay tsara no notehirizinao hatramin’izao.”', 'ka hoy izy taminy: “ny an’ny olona rehetra, ny divay tsara aloha no aroso, ary rehefa mamo ny olona vao aroso ny ratsiratsy. ny anao indray ny divay tsara no notehirizinao hatramin’izao.”'),
  ('6ab25c6d594268bf85265f58', '2026-09-22T10:46:05.748Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:05.748Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 2, 5, 'Hoy ny reniny tamin’ireo mpanompo: “Ataovy daholo izay teneniny anareo.”', 'hoy ny reniny tamin’ireo mpanompo: “ataovy daholo izay teneniny anareo.”'),
  ('6ab25c6d594268bf85265f6a', '2026-09-22T10:46:05.748Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:05.748Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 2, 23, 'Be dia be no lasa nino ny anarany rehefa nahita ny famantarana nataony, tamin’izy tany Jerosalema tamin’ny fetin’ny Paska.', 'be dia be no lasa nino ny anarany rehefa nahita ny famantarana nataony, tamin’izy tany jerosalema tamin’ny fetin’ny paska.'),
  ('6ab25c6d594268bf85265f69', '2026-09-22T10:46:05.748Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:05.748Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 2, 22, 'Rehefa natsangana tamin’ny maty izy, dia tadidin’ny mpianany fa efa nilaza an’izany matetika izy. Lasa nino an’izay voalazan’ny Soratra Masina sy izay efa notenenin’i Jesosy àry izy ireo.', 'rehefa natsangana tamin’ny maty izy, dia tadidin’ny mpianany fa efa nilaza an’izany matetika izy. lasa nino an’izay voalazan’ny soratra masina sy izay efa notenenin’i jesosy àry izy ireo.'),
  ('6ab25c6d594268bf85265f5e', '2026-09-22T10:46:05.748Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:05.748Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 2, 11, 'Tany Kana, any Galilia, i Jesosy no nanao fahagagana voalohany. Ary nasehony ny voninahiny ka nino azy ny mpianany.', 'tany kana, any galilia, i jesosy no nanao fahagagana voalohany. ary nasehony ny voninahiny ka nino azy ny mpianany.'),
