  ('6ab25c6ef6e404983bb03599', '2026-09-22T10:46:06.200Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:06.200Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 3, 19, 'Izao no antony anamelohana ny olona: Tonga teo amin’izao tontolo izao ny mazava, saingy naleon’ny olona ny haizina toy izay ny mazava, satria ratsy ny ataony.', 'izao no antony anamelohana ny olona: tonga teo amin’izao tontolo izao ny mazava, saingy naleon’ny olona ny haizina toy izay ny mazava, satria ratsy ny ataony.'),
  ('6ab25c6ef6e404983bb03590', '2026-09-22T10:46:06.200Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:06.200Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 3, 10, 'Dia hoy i Jesosy: “Mpampianatra eo amin’ny Israely ve ianao, dia tsy mahafantatra an’izany?', 'dia hoy i jesosy: “mpampianatra eo amin’ny israely ve ianao, dia tsy mahafantatra an’izany?'),
  ('6ab25c6ef6e404983bb0359c', '2026-09-22T10:46:06.200Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:06.200Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 3, 22, 'Taorian’izany dia nankany ambanivohitr’i Jodia i Jesosy sy ny mpianany. Nijanona elaela tany niaraka tamin’ny mpianany izy, sady nanao batisa.', 'taorian’izany dia nankany ambanivohitr’i jodia i jesosy sy ny mpianany. nijanona elaela tany niaraka tamin’ny mpianany izy, sady nanao batisa.'),
  ('6ab25c6ef6e404983bb03598', '2026-09-22T10:46:06.200Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:06.200Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 3, 18, 'Tsy homelohina izay maneho finoana ny Zanaka. Efa voaheloka sahady kosa izay tsy maneho finoana azy, satria tsy naneho finoana ny anaran’ilay Zanaka Lahitokan’Andriamanitra.', 'tsy homelohina izay maneho finoana ny zanaka. efa voaheloka sahady kosa izay tsy maneho finoana azy, satria tsy naneho finoana ny anaran’ilay zanaka lahitokan’andriamanitra.'),
  ('6ab25c6ef6e404983bb03596', '2026-09-22T10:46:06.200Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:06.200Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 3, 16, '“Fa tena tia an’izao tontolo izao Andriamanitra ka nanome an’ilay Zanany lahitokana, mba tsy ho ringana izay rehetra maneho finoana azy, fa hahazo fiainana mandrakizay.', '“fa tena tia an’izao tontolo izao andriamanitra ka nanome an’ilay zanany lahitokana, mba tsy ho ringana izay rehetra maneho finoana azy, fa hahazo fiainana mandrakizay.'),
  ('6ab25c6ef6e404983bb0358f', '2026-09-22T10:46:06.200Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:06.200Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 3, 9, 'Ary hoy i Nikodemosy: “Ahoana no hampety an’izany?”', 'ary hoy i nikodemosy: “ahoana no hampety an’izany?”'),
  ('6ab25c6ef6e404983bb035a9', '2026-09-22T10:46:06.200Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:06.200Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 3, 35, 'Tian’ny Ray ny Zanaka ka nomeny teo am-pelatanany ny zava-drehetra.', 'tian’ny ray ny zanaka ka nomeny teo am-pelatanany ny zava-drehetra.'),
  ('6ab25c6ef6e404983bb035a0', '2026-09-22T10:46:06.200Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:06.200Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 3, 26, 'Tonga teo amin’i Jaona àry izy ireo, ka niteny hoe: “Raby ô, hitanao moa ilay lehilahy noresahinao taminay iny, ilay niaraka taminao teny ampitan’ny Reniranon’i Jordana? Manao batisa izy izao, dia mankany aminy daholo ny olona.”', 'tonga teo amin’i jaona àry izy ireo, ka niteny hoe: “raby ô, hitanao moa ilay lehilahy noresahinao taminay iny, ilay niaraka taminao teny ampitan’ny reniranon’i jordana? manao batisa izy izao, dia mankany aminy daholo ny olona.”'),
  ('6ab25c6ef6e404983bb0359e', '2026-09-22T10:46:06.200Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:06.200Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 3, 24, 'Mbola tsy nogadraina mantsy i Jaona tamin’izay.', 'mbola tsy nogadraina mantsy i jaona tamin’izay.'),
  ('6ab25c6ef6e404983bb0358d', '2026-09-22T10:46:06.200Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:06.200Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 3, 7, 'Aza gaga raha nilaza taminao aho hoe: Tsy maintsy hateraka indray ianareo.', 'aza gaga raha nilaza taminao aho hoe: tsy maintsy hateraka indray ianareo.'),
  ('6ab25c6ef6e404983bb035aa', '2026-09-22T10:46:06.200Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:06.200Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 3, 36, 'Izay maneho finoana ny Zanaka dia hahazo fiainana mandrakizay. Izay tsy mankatò ny Zanaka kosa tsy hahazo fiainana, fa ho tezitra aminy foana Andriamanitra.', 'izay maneho finoana ny zanaka dia hahazo fiainana mandrakizay. izay tsy mankatò ny zanaka kosa tsy hahazo fiainana, fa ho tezitra aminy foana andriamanitra.'),
  ('6ab25c6ef6e404983bb035a8', '2026-09-22T10:46:06.200Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:06.200Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 3, 34, 'Fa ilay nirahin’Andriamanitra no milaza ny tenin’Andriamanitra. Tsy mba kahihitra mantsy Izy rehefa manome ny fanahiny.', 'fa ilay nirahin’andriamanitra no milaza ny tenin’andriamanitra. tsy mba kahihitra mantsy izy rehefa manome ny fanahiny.'),
  ('6ab25c6ef6e404983bb0359b', '2026-09-22T10:46:06.200Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:06.200Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 3, 21, 'Izay manao ny marina kosa manatona ny mazava mba haseho izay ataony, ka ho hita fa mifanaraka amin’ny sitrapon’Andriamanitra izany.”', 'izay manao ny marina kosa manatona ny mazava mba haseho izay ataony, ka ho hita fa mifanaraka amin’ny sitrapon’andriamanitra izany.”'),
  ('6ab25c6ef6e404983bb0358e', '2026-09-22T10:46:06.200Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:06.200Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 3, 8, 'Mitsoka any amin’izay tiany ny rivotra, ary henonao ny feony, nefa tsy fantatrao hoe avy aiza ilay izy, na ho aiza. Dia hoatr’izany koa izay rehetra ateraky ny fanahy.”', 'mitsoka any amin’izay tiany ny rivotra, ary henonao ny feony, nefa tsy fantatrao hoe avy aiza ilay izy, na ho aiza. dia hoatr’izany koa izay rehetra ateraky ny fanahy.”'),
  ('6ab25c6ef6e404983bb0359f', '2026-09-22T10:46:06.200Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:06.200Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 3, 25, 'Ary niady hevitra tamin’ny Jiosy anankiray momba ny fidiovana ny mpianatr’i Jaona.', 'ary niady hevitra tamin’ny jiosy anankiray momba ny fidiovana ny mpianatr’i jaona.'),
  ('6ab25c70c87fa35db6bbcee2', '2026-09-22T10:46:08.477Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:08.477Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 4, 23, 'Na izany aza, ho avy ny fotoana, ary efa izao izany, ka ny tena mpivavaka hivavaka amin’ny Ray araka ny fanahy sy ny fahamarinana. Fa olona hoatr’izany mihitsy no tadiavin’ny Ray mba hivavaka aminy.', 'na izany aza, ho avy ny fotoana, ary efa izao izany, ka ny tena mpivavaka hivavaka amin’ny ray araka ny fanahy sy ny fahamarinana. fa olona hoatr’izany mihitsy no tadiavin’ny ray mba hivavaka aminy.'),
  ('6ab25c70c87fa35db6bbcee9', '2026-09-22T10:46:08.477Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:08.477Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 4, 30, 'Dia niala tao an-tanàna ireo ka nankany amin’i Jesosy.', 'dia niala tao an-tanàna ireo ka nankany amin’i jesosy.'),
  ('6ab25c70c87fa35db6bbcee1', '2026-09-22T10:46:08.477Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:08.477Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 4, 22, 'Mivavaka amin’izay tsy fantatrareo ianareo, fa izahay kosa mivavaka amin’izay fantatray, satria avy amin’ny Jiosy ny famonjena.', 'mivavaka amin’izay tsy fantatrareo ianareo, fa izahay kosa mivavaka amin’izay fantatray, satria avy amin’ny jiosy ny famonjena.'),
  ('6ab25c70c87fa35db6bbced5', '2026-09-22T10:46:08.477Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:08.477Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 4, 10, 'Dia hoy i Jesosy: “Raha mba fantatrao mantsy ilay fanomezana maimaim-poana avy amin’Andriamanitra, sy ilay miteny aminao hoe: ‘Mba omeo rano aho hosotroiko’, dia ianao no ho nangataka taminy, ka ho nomeny rano velona.”', 'dia hoy i jesosy: “raha mba fantatrao mantsy ilay fanomezana maimaim-poana avy amin’andriamanitra, sy ilay miteny aminao hoe: ‘mba omeo rano aho hosotroiko’, dia ianao no ho nangataka taminy, ka ho nomeny rano velona.”'),
  ('6ab25c70c87fa35db6bbcecc', '2026-09-22T10:46:08.477Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:08.477Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 4, 1, 'Fantatry ny Tompo fa henon’ny Fariseo hoe betsaka kokoa noho ny mpianatra azon’i Jaona ny azon’i Jesosy sy nataony batisa.—', 'fantatry ny tompo fa henon’ny fariseo hoe betsaka kokoa noho ny mpianatra azon’i jaona ny azon’i jesosy sy nataony batisa.—'),
  ('6ab25c70c87fa35db6bbceeb', '2026-09-22T10:46:08.477Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:08.477Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 4, 32, 'Hoy anefa izy: “Izaho manana sakafo tsy fantatrareo.”', 'hoy anefa izy: “izaho manana sakafo tsy fantatrareo.”'),
  ('6ab25c70c87fa35db6bbceea', '2026-09-22T10:46:08.477Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:08.477Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 4, 31, 'Nandritra an’izay fotoana izay, dia nampirisihin’ny mpianany izy hoe: “Mihinàna, Raby ô!”', 'nandritra an’izay fotoana izay, dia nampirisihin’ny mpianany izy hoe: “mihinàna, raby ô!”'),
  ('6ab25c70c87fa35db6bbcee0', '2026-09-22T10:46:08.477Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:08.477Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 4, 21, 'Hoy i Jesosy: “Ravehivavy, minoa ahy ianao fa ho avy ny fotoana ka tsy ho eto amin’ity tendrombohitra ity na any Jerosalema no hivavahanareo amin’ny Ray.', 'hoy i jesosy: “ravehivavy, minoa ahy ianao fa ho avy ny fotoana ka tsy ho eto amin’ity tendrombohitra ity na any jerosalema no hivavahanareo amin’ny ray.'),
  ('6ab25c70c87fa35db6bbced3', '2026-09-22T10:46:08.477Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:08.477Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 4, 8, '—Fa lasa nividy sakafo tany an-tanàna ny mpianany.—', '—fa lasa nividy sakafo tany an-tanàna ny mpianany.—'),
  ('6ab25c70c87fa35db6bbcedc', '2026-09-22T10:46:08.477Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:08.477Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 4, 17, '“Tsy manambady aho”, hoy ilay vehivavy. Dia hoy i Jesosy: “Marina ny teninao hoe tsy manambady ianao.', '“tsy manambady aho”, hoy ilay vehivavy. dia hoy i jesosy: “marina ny teninao hoe tsy manambady ianao.'),
  ('6ab25c70c87fa35db6bbceda', '2026-09-22T10:46:08.477Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:08.477Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 4, 15, 'Hoy àry ilay vehivavy: “Mba omeo an’izany rano izany aho, tompoko, amin’izay tsy hangetaheta na hiverimberina hantsaka eto intsony.”', 'hoy àry ilay vehivavy: “mba omeo an’izany rano izany aho, tompoko, amin’izay tsy hangetaheta na hiverimberina hantsaka eto intsony.”'),
  ('6ab25c70c87fa35db6bbced7', '2026-09-22T10:46:08.477Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:08.477Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 4, 12, 'Ianao angaha lehibe noho i Jakoba razambenay? Izy no nanome anay an’ity lavadrano ity, sady izy sy ny zanany ary ny biby fiompiny no nisotro teto?”', 'ianao angaha lehibe noho i jakoba razambenay? izy no nanome anay an’ity lavadrano ity, sady izy sy ny zanany ary ny biby fiompiny no nisotro teto?”'),
  ('6ab25c70c87fa35db6bbcee8', '2026-09-22T10:46:08.477Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:08.477Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 4, 29, '“Avia ange ianareo e! Misy lehilahy izay arỳ, dia nolazainy tamiko daholo izay zavatra nataoko. Izy angamba no Kristy!”', '“avia ange ianareo e! misy lehilahy izay arỳ, dia nolazainy tamiko daholo izay zavatra nataoko. izy angamba no kristy!”'),
  ('6ab25c70c87fa35db6bbcee5', '2026-09-22T10:46:08.477Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:08.477Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 4, 26, 'Dia hoy i Jesosy: “Izaho izay miresaka aminao izao no izy.”', 'dia hoy i jesosy: “izaho izay miresaka aminao izao no izy.”'),
  ('6ab25c70c87fa35db6bbced0', '2026-09-22T10:46:08.477Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:08.477Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 4, 5, 'ary tonga tao amin’ny tanàna samaritanina atao hoe Sykara, teo akaikin’ilay tany nomen’i Jakoba an’i Josefa zanany.', 'ary tonga tao amin’ny tanàna samaritanina atao hoe sykara, teo akaikin’ilay tany nomen’i jakoba an’i josefa zanany.'),
  ('6ab25c70c87fa35db6bbcedf', '2026-09-22T10:46:08.477Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:08.477Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 4, 20, 'Nivavaka teto amin’ity tendrombohitra ity ny razambenay, nefa ianareo milaza fa any Jerosalema ny olona no tokony hivavaka.”', 'nivavaka teto amin’ity tendrombohitra ity ny razambenay, nefa ianareo milaza fa any jerosalema ny olona no tokony hivavaka.”'),
  ('6ab25c70c87fa35db6bbced9', '2026-09-22T10:46:08.477Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:08.477Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 4, 14, 'fa izay misotro ny rano homeko azy kosa tsy hangetaheta intsony mihitsy. Fa ho loharano miboiboika ao anatiny ilay rano homeko azy, ka hanome azy fiainana mandrakizay.”', 'fa izay misotro ny rano homeko azy kosa tsy hangetaheta intsony mihitsy. fa ho loharano miboiboika ao anatiny ilay rano homeko azy, ka hanome azy fiainana mandrakizay.”'),
  ('6ab25c70c87fa35db6bbcecf', '2026-09-22T10:46:08.477Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:08.477Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 4, 4, 'Tsy maintsy nandalo tao Samaria anefa izy,', 'tsy maintsy nandalo tao samaria anefa izy,'),
  ('6ab25c70c87fa35db6bbcee7', '2026-09-22T10:46:08.477Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:08.477Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 4, 28, 'Navelan’ilay vehivavy àry ny sininy, dia lasa izy nankany an-tanàna ka niteny tamin’ny olona tao hoe:', 'navelan’ilay vehivavy àry ny sininy, dia lasa izy nankany an-tanàna ka niteny tamin’ny olona tao hoe:'),
  ('6ab25c70c87fa35db6bbcee3', '2026-09-22T10:46:08.477Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:08.477Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 4, 24, 'Andriamanitra dia Fanahy, ka izay mivavaka aminy tsy maintsy mivavaka araka ny fanahy sy ny fahamarinana.”', 'andriamanitra dia fanahy, ka izay mivavaka aminy tsy maintsy mivavaka araka ny fanahy sy ny fahamarinana.”'),
  ('6ab25c70c87fa35db6bbced8', '2026-09-22T10:46:08.477Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:08.477Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 4, 13, 'Dia namaly i Jesosy hoe: “Izay misotro an’ity rano ity dia mbola hangetaheta indray,', 'dia namaly i jesosy hoe: “izay misotro an’ity rano ity dia mbola hangetaheta indray,'),
  ('6ab25c70c87fa35db6bbcedd', '2026-09-22T10:46:08.477Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:08.477Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 4, 18, 'Fa efa nanana vady dimy ianao, ary tsy vadinao ilay lehilahy miara-mipetraka aminao izao. Koa marina ny teninao.”', 'fa efa nanana vady dimy ianao, ary tsy vadinao ilay lehilahy miara-mipetraka aminao izao. koa marina ny teninao.”'),
  ('6ab25c70c87fa35db6bbced4', '2026-09-22T10:46:08.477Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:08.477Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 4, 9, 'Dia hoy ilay vehivavy samaritanina: “Jiosy ve ianao dia mangataka rano amiko, nefa izaho vehivavy samaritanina?”—Tsy mifandray amin’ny Samaritanina mantsy ny Jiosy.—', 'dia hoy ilay vehivavy samaritanina: “jiosy ve ianao dia mangataka rano amiko, nefa izaho vehivavy samaritanina?”—tsy mifandray amin’ny samaritanina mantsy ny jiosy.—'),
  ('6ab25c70c87fa35db6bbced2', '2026-09-22T10:46:08.477Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:08.477Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 4, 7, 'Nisy vehivavy samaritanina iray tonga hantsaka. Hoy i Jesosy taminy: “Mba omeo rano aho hosotroiko.”', 'nisy vehivavy samaritanina iray tonga hantsaka. hoy i jesosy taminy: “mba omeo rano aho hosotroiko.”'),
  ('6ab25c70c87fa35db6bbcece', '2026-09-22T10:46:08.477Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:08.477Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 4, 3, 'Koa rehefa fantany izany dia niala tany Jodia izy, ka nankany Galilia indray.', 'koa rehefa fantany izany dia niala tany jodia izy, ka nankany galilia indray.');
INSERT INTO "bible_verses" ("id", "created_date", "updated_date", "created_by_id", "created_by", "translation", "book", "bookOrder", "chapter", "verse", "text", "normalizedText") VALUES
  ('6ab25c70c87fa35db6bbcee6', '2026-09-22T10:46:08.477Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:08.477Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 4, 27, 'Tamin’izay no tonga ny mpianany ka gaga, satria niresaka tamin’ny vehivavy izy. Tsy nisy niteny taminy anefa hoe: “Fa misy zavatra ilainao angaha?”, na hoe: “Fa maninona ianao no miresaka aminy?”', 'tamin’izay no tonga ny mpianany ka gaga, satria niresaka tamin’ny vehivavy izy. tsy nisy niteny taminy anefa hoe: “fa misy zavatra ilainao angaha?”, na hoe: “fa maninona ianao no miresaka aminy?”'),
  ('6ab25c70c87fa35db6bbcede', '2026-09-22T10:46:08.477Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:08.477Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 4, 19, 'Dia hoy ilay vehivavy: “Tena mpaminany ianao, tompoko.', 'dia hoy ilay vehivavy: “tena mpaminany ianao, tompoko.'),
  ('6ab25c70c87fa35db6bbcedb', '2026-09-22T10:46:08.477Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:08.477Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 4, 16, 'Dia hoy izy: “Mandehana antsoy mankatỳ ny vadinao.”', 'dia hoy izy: “mandehana antsoy mankatỳ ny vadinao.”'),
  ('6ab25c70c87fa35db6bbced1', '2026-09-22T10:46:08.477Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:08.477Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 4, 6, 'Tao, raha ny marina, no nisy ny lavadranon’i Jakoba. Reraky ny dia i Jesosy, ka nipetraka teo amin’ilay lavadrano. Tamin’ny ora fahenina teo ho eo tamin’izay.', 'tao, raha ny marina, no nisy ny lavadranon’i jakoba. reraky ny dia i jesosy, ka nipetraka teo amin’ilay lavadrano. tamin’ny ora fahenina teo ho eo tamin’izay.'),
  ('6ab25c70c87fa35db6bbcee4', '2026-09-22T10:46:08.477Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:08.477Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 4, 25, 'Hoy ilay vehivavy: “Fantatro fa ho avy ny Mesia, ilay atao hoe Kristy, ary rehefa tonga izy, dia holazainy amintsika tsara daholo ny zava-drehetra.”', 'hoy ilay vehivavy: “fantatro fa ho avy ny mesia, ilay atao hoe kristy, ary rehefa tonga izy, dia holazainy amintsika tsara daholo ny zava-drehetra.”'),
  ('6ab25c70c87fa35db6bbced6', '2026-09-22T10:46:08.477Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:08.477Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 4, 11, 'Hoy ilay vehivavy: “Ianao aza, tompoko, tsy manana fanovozana akory sady lalina ny lavadrano, koa ahoana no anananao an’izany rano velona izany?', 'hoy ilay vehivavy: “ianao aza, tompoko, tsy manana fanovozana akory sady lalina ny lavadrano, koa ahoana no anananao an’izany rano velona izany?'),
  ('6ab25c70c87fa35db6bbcecd', '2026-09-22T10:46:08.477Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:08.477Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 4, 2, 'Tsy i Jesosy anefa no nanao batisa fa ny mpianany.—', 'tsy i jesosy anefa no nanao batisa fa ny mpianany.—'),
  ('6ab25c70c87fa35db6bbcef3', '2026-09-22T10:46:08.478Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:08.478Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 4, 40, 'Rehefa tonga teo aminy àry ny Samaritanina, dia nangataka azy mba hijanona teo amin’izy ireo, ka nijanona tao roa andro izy.', 'rehefa tonga teo aminy àry ny samaritanina, dia nangataka azy mba hijanona teo amin’izy ireo, ka nijanona tao roa andro izy.'),
  ('6ab25c70c87fa35db6bbcef8', '2026-09-22T10:46:08.478Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:08.478Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 4, 45, 'Rehefa tonga tany Galilia àry izy, dia nandray azy ny Galilianina, satria efa hitan’izy ireo daholo ny zavatra nataony tany Jerosalema tamin’ny andro fety. Efa tany amin’ilay fety koa mantsy izy ireo.', 'rehefa tonga tany galilia àry izy, dia nandray azy ny galilianina, satria efa hitan’izy ireo daholo ny zavatra nataony tany jerosalema tamin’ny andro fety. efa tany amin’ilay fety koa mantsy izy ireo.'),
  ('6ab25c70c87fa35db6bbcef4', '2026-09-22T10:46:08.478Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:08.478Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 4, 41, 'Vokatr’izany, dia nisy olon-kafa be dia be koa nino noho ny tenin’i Jesosy.', 'vokatr’izany, dia nisy olon-kafa be dia be koa nino noho ny tenin’i jesosy.'),
  ('6ab25c70c87fa35db6bbcf00', '2026-09-22T10:46:08.478Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:08.478Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 4, 53, 'Dia fantatr’ilay rainy fa tamin’izay ora izay mihitsy i Jesosy no niteny taminy hoe: “Velona ny zanakao.” Lasa mpino àry izy sy ny ankohonany manontolo.', 'dia fantatr’ilay rainy fa tamin’izay ora izay mihitsy i jesosy no niteny taminy hoe: “velona ny zanakao.” lasa mpino àry izy sy ny ankohonany manontolo.'),
  ('6ab25c70c87fa35db6bbcef7', '2026-09-22T10:46:08.478Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:08.478Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 4, 44, '—Izy mihitsy anefa no nilaza fa tsy mba hajaina ny mpaminany raha ao amin’ny taniny.—', '—izy mihitsy anefa no nilaza fa tsy mba hajaina ny mpaminany raha ao amin’ny taniny.—'),
  ('6ab25c70c87fa35db6bbceee', '2026-09-22T10:46:08.478Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:08.478Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 4, 35, 'Milaza ianareo hoe mbola misy efa-bolana vao ho tonga ny fijinjana, sa tsy izany? Izaho kosa milaza aminareo hoe: Jereo ange ny saha e, fa efa masaka hojinjaina ny vokatra. Efa', 'milaza ianareo hoe mbola misy efa-bolana vao ho tonga ny fijinjana, sa tsy izany? izaho kosa milaza aminareo hoe: jereo ange ny saha e, fa efa masaka hojinjaina ny vokatra. efa'),
  ('6ab25c70c87fa35db6bbceff', '2026-09-22T10:46:08.478Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:08.478Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 4, 52, 'Nanontaniany àry izy ireo hoe tamin’ny firy ilay zanany no nihatsara. Dia hoy izy ireo: “Omaly tamin’ny ora fahafito izy no tsy nanavy intsony.”', 'nanontaniany àry izy ireo hoe tamin’ny firy ilay zanany no nihatsara. dia hoy izy ireo: “omaly tamin’ny ora fahafito izy no tsy nanavy intsony.”'),
  ('6ab25c70c87fa35db6bbcefc', '2026-09-22T10:46:08.478Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:08.478Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 4, 49, 'Dia hoy ilay tandapa: “Mba andao re, Tompo ô, dieny mbola tsy maty ny zanako.”', 'dia hoy ilay tandapa: “mba andao re, tompo ô, dieny mbola tsy maty ny zanako.”'),
  ('6ab25c70c87fa35db6bbcef0', '2026-09-22T10:46:08.478Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:08.478Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 4, 37, 'Marina àry ilay fitenenana hoe: Ny iray mpamafy, fa ny iray mpijinja.', 'marina àry ilay fitenenana hoe: ny iray mpamafy, fa ny iray mpijinja.'),
  ('6ab25c70c87fa35db6bbcefb', '2026-09-22T10:46:08.478Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:08.478Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 4, 48, 'Hoy anefa i Jesosy: “Tsy hino mihitsy ve izany ianareo, raha tsy mahita famantarana sy fahagagana?”', 'hoy anefa i jesosy: “tsy hino mihitsy ve izany ianareo, raha tsy mahita famantarana sy fahagagana?”'),
  ('6ab25c70c87fa35db6bbceec', '2026-09-22T10:46:08.478Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:08.478Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 4, 33, 'Nifanontany àry ny mpianatra hoe: “Fa angaha nisy nitondra zavatra hohaniny teo?”', 'nifanontany àry ny mpianatra hoe: “fa angaha nisy nitondra zavatra hohaniny teo?”'),
  ('6ab25c70c87fa35db6bbcefa', '2026-09-22T10:46:08.478Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:08.478Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 4, 47, 'Henon’io lehilahy io fa niala tany Jodia i Jesosy ary tonga tany Galilia. Dia nandeha tany amin’i Jesosy izy, ka niangavy azy hidina any Kapernaomy mba hanasitrana an’ilay zanany efa ho faty.', 'henon’io lehilahy io fa niala tany jodia i jesosy ary tonga tany galilia. dia nandeha tany amin’i jesosy izy, ka niangavy azy hidina any kapernaomy mba hanasitrana an’ilay zanany efa ho faty.'),
  ('6ab25c70c87fa35db6bbcef5', '2026-09-22T10:46:08.478Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:08.478Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 4, 42, 'Ary hoy izy ireo tamin’ilay vehivavy: “Tsy noho ny teninao intsony fotsiny izao no mahatonga anay hino. Izahay mihitsy mantsy no naheno, ka fantatray fa io lehilahy io tokoa no mpamonjy an’izao tontolo izao.”', 'ary hoy izy ireo tamin’ilay vehivavy: “tsy noho ny teninao intsony fotsiny izao no mahatonga anay hino. izahay mihitsy mantsy no naheno, ka fantatray fa io lehilahy io tokoa no mpamonjy an’izao tontolo izao.”'),
  ('6ab25c70c87fa35db6bbceef', '2026-09-22T10:46:08.478Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:08.478Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 4, 36, 'mahazo karama sahady ny mpijinja sady efa manangona vokatra ho amin’ny fiainana mandrakizay, mba hiara-mifaly ny mpamafy sy ny mpijinja.', 'mahazo karama sahady ny mpijinja sady efa manangona vokatra ho amin’ny fiainana mandrakizay, mba hiara-mifaly ny mpamafy sy ny mpijinja.'),
  ('6ab25c70c87fa35db6bbcef6', '2026-09-22T10:46:08.478Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:08.478Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 4, 43, 'Niala tao i Jesosy, rehefa afaka roa andro, ka nankany Galilia.', 'niala tao i jesosy, rehefa afaka roa andro, ka nankany galilia.'),
  ('6ab25c70c87fa35db6bbcef1', '2026-09-22T10:46:08.478Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:08.478Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 4, 38, 'Naniraka anareo hijinja izay tsy nisasaranareo aho. Olon-kafa no nisasatra, nefa ianareo koa mba nahazo tamin’izay nisasarany.”', 'naniraka anareo hijinja izay tsy nisasaranareo aho. olon-kafa no nisasatra, nefa ianareo koa mba nahazo tamin’izay nisasarany.”'),
  ('6ab25c70c87fa35db6bbcefd', '2026-09-22T10:46:08.478Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:08.478Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 4, 50, 'Hoy i Jesosy: “Mandehana fa velona ny zanakao.” Nino ny tenin’i Jesosy ilay lehilahy ka lasa nandeha.', 'hoy i jesosy: “mandehana fa velona ny zanakao.” nino ny tenin’i jesosy ilay lehilahy ka lasa nandeha.'),
  ('6ab25c70c87fa35db6bbcf01', '2026-09-22T10:46:08.478Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:08.478Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 4, 54, 'Izany no famantarana faharoa nataon’i Jesosy tamin’izy niala tany Jodia ka tonga tany Galilia.', 'izany no famantarana faharoa nataon’i jesosy tamin’izy niala tany jodia ka tonga tany galilia.'),
  ('6ab25c70c87fa35db6bbcefe', '2026-09-22T10:46:08.478Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:08.478Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 4, 51, 'Tamin’izy mbola teny an-dalana niverina hody iny, dia nitsena azy ny mpanompony ka niteny taminy hoe velona ilay zanany.', 'tamin’izy mbola teny an-dalana niverina hody iny, dia nitsena azy ny mpanompony ka niteny taminy hoe velona ilay zanany.'),
  ('6ab25c70c87fa35db6bbcef9', '2026-09-22T10:46:08.478Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:08.478Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 4, 46, 'Tonga tany Kana any Galilia indray izy avy eo, tany amin’ilay nanovany rano ho divay. Ary nisy tandapa nanana zanakalahy narary tany Kapernaomy.', 'tonga tany kana any galilia indray izy avy eo, tany amin’ilay nanovany rano ho divay. ary nisy tandapa nanana zanakalahy narary tany kapernaomy.'),
  ('6ab25c70c87fa35db6bbcef2', '2026-09-22T10:46:08.478Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:08.478Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 4, 39, 'Be dia be ny Samaritanina avy ao amin’io tanàna io no lasa nino an’i Jesosy, noho ilay vehivavy nijoro ho vavolombelona ka niteny hoe: “Nolazainy tamiko daholo izay zavatra nataoko.”', 'be dia be ny samaritanina avy ao amin’io tanàna io no lasa nino an’i jesosy, noho ilay vehivavy nijoro ho vavolombelona ka niteny hoe: “nolazainy tamiko daholo izay zavatra nataoko.”'),
  ('6ab25c70c87fa35db6bbceed', '2026-09-22T10:46:08.478Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:08.478Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 4, 34, 'Hoy i Jesosy: “Ny sakafoko dia ny manao ny sitrapon’Ilay naniraka ahy sy ny mahavita ny asany.', 'hoy i jesosy: “ny sakafoko dia ny manao ny sitrapon’ilay naniraka ahy sy ny mahavita ny asany.'),
  ('6ab25c71f95a03c9a59b7e63', '2026-09-22T10:46:09.009Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:09.009Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 5, 36, 'Manana porofo lehibe noho ny porofo omen’i Jaona anefa aho, satria ny asa nanendren’ny Raiko ahy mihitsy izao no ataoko. Ary izany asa ataoko izany no manaporofo fa nirahin’ny Ray aho.', 'manana porofo lehibe noho ny porofo omen’i jaona anefa aho, satria ny asa nanendren’ny raiko ahy mihitsy izao no ataoko. ary izany asa ataoko izany no manaporofo fa nirahin’ny ray aho.'),
  ('6ab25c71f95a03c9a59b7e5d', '2026-09-22T10:46:09.009Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:09.009Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 5, 30, 'Tsy afaka manao izay tiako aho, na inona izany na inona. Araka izay henoko ihany no itsarako, ary ara-drariny ny fitsarako, satria tsy ny sitrapoko no tiako hatao, fa ny sitrapon’Ilay naniraka ahy.', 'tsy afaka manao izay tiako aho, na inona izany na inona. araka izay henoko ihany no itsarako, ary ara-drariny ny fitsarako, satria tsy ny sitrapoko no tiako hatao, fa ny sitrapon’ilay naniraka ahy.'),
  ('6ab25c71f95a03c9a59b7e53', '2026-09-22T10:46:09.009Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:09.009Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 5, 20, 'Tia an’ilay Zanaka mantsy ny Ray, dia asehony an’io Zanany io daholo ny zavatra ataony. Mbola hisy asa lehibe noho ireo aza hasehony azy, mba ho gaga ianareo.', 'tia an’ilay zanaka mantsy ny ray, dia asehony an’io zanany io daholo ny zavatra ataony. mbola hisy asa lehibe noho ireo aza hasehony azy, mba ho gaga ianareo.'),
  ('6ab25c71f95a03c9a59b7e41', '2026-09-22T10:46:09.009Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:09.009Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 5, 2, 'Nisy dobo iray tany Jerosalema, teo akaikin’ny Vavahadin’ondry, ary Betizata no niantsoana azy amin’ny teny hebreo. Nisy lala-mitafo dimy izy io.', 'nisy dobo iray tany jerosalema, teo akaikin’ny vavahadin’ondry, ary betizata no niantsoana azy amin’ny teny hebreo. nisy lala-mitafo dimy izy io.'),
  ('6ab25c71f95a03c9a59b7e62', '2026-09-22T10:46:09.009Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:09.009Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 5, 35, 'Jiro nirehitra sy namirapiratra izany lehilahy izany, ary vetivety ihany ianareo no naniry hifalifaly tao amin’ny fahazavany.', 'jiro nirehitra sy namirapiratra izany lehilahy izany, ary vetivety ihany ianareo no naniry hifalifaly tao amin’ny fahazavany.'),
  ('6ab25c71f95a03c9a59b7e47', '2026-09-22T10:46:09.009Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:09.009Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 5, 8, 'Hoy i Jesosy: “Mitsangàna! Batao ny fandriananao dia mandehana.”', 'hoy i jesosy: “mitsangàna! batao ny fandriananao dia mandehana.”'),
  ('6ab25c71f95a03c9a59b7e4d', '2026-09-22T10:46:09.009Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:09.009Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 5, 14, 'Nahita azy tao amin’ny tempoly i Jesosy taorian’izay, ka niteny taminy hoe: “Efa sitrana ianao izao, ka aza manota intsony sao hisy zavatra ratsy noho iny hahazo anao.”', 'nahita azy tao amin’ny tempoly i jesosy taorian’izay, ka niteny taminy hoe: “efa sitrana ianao izao, ka aza manota intsony sao hisy zavatra ratsy noho iny hahazo anao.”'),
  ('6ab25c71f95a03c9a59b7e6a', '2026-09-22T10:46:09.009Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:09.009Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 5, 43, 'Tonga tamin’ny anaran’ny Raiko mantsy aho, nefa tsy noraisinareo. Raha misy olona tonga amin’ny anaran’ny tenany anefa, dia horaisinareo.', 'tonga tamin’ny anaran’ny raiko mantsy aho, nefa tsy noraisinareo. raha misy olona tonga amin’ny anaran’ny tenany anefa, dia horaisinareo.'),
  ('6ab25c71f95a03c9a59b7e61', '2026-09-22T10:46:09.009Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:09.009Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 5, 34, 'Tsy miantehitra amin’ny tenin’olona anefa aho, fa milaza an’izany rehetra izany mba ho voavonjy ianareo.', 'tsy miantehitra amin’ny tenin’olona anefa aho, fa milaza an’izany rehetra izany mba ho voavonjy ianareo.'),
