  ('6ab25c71f95a03c9a59b7e4c', '2026-09-22T10:46:09.009Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:09.009Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 5, 13, 'Tsy nahalala an’i Jesosy anefa ilay lehilahy sitrana, satria efa lasa tany anaty vahoaka tany i Jesosy.', 'tsy nahalala an’i jesosy anefa ilay lehilahy sitrana, satria efa lasa tany anaty vahoaka tany i jesosy.'),
  ('6ab25c71f95a03c9a59b7e49', '2026-09-22T10:46:09.009Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:09.009Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 5, 10, 'Hoy àry ny Jiosy tamin’ilay lehilahy sitrana: “Sabata androany, ka tsy azo atao izao mitondra fandriana izao.”', 'hoy àry ny jiosy tamin’ilay lehilahy sitrana: “sabata androany, ka tsy azo atao izao mitondra fandriana izao.”'),
  ('6ab25c71f95a03c9a59b7e6b', '2026-09-22T10:46:09.009Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:09.009Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 5, 44, 'Ahoana moa no hinoanareo, nefa ianareo aza mandray voninahitra avy aminareo samy ianareo ihany, fa tsy mba mitady ny voninahitra avy amin’ilay Andriamanitra tokana?', 'ahoana moa no hinoanareo, nefa ianareo aza mandray voninahitra avy aminareo samy ianareo ihany, fa tsy mba mitady ny voninahitra avy amin’ilay andriamanitra tokana?'),
  ('6ab25c71f95a03c9a59b7e4f', '2026-09-22T10:46:09.009Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:09.009Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 5, 16, 'Izany àry no nahatonga ny Jiosy hanenjika an’i Jesosy. Nanao an’ireo zavatra ireo tamin’ny Sabata mantsy izy.', 'izany àry no nahatonga ny jiosy hanenjika an’i jesosy. nanao an’ireo zavatra ireo tamin’ny sabata mantsy izy.'),
  ('6ab25c71f95a03c9a59b7e5b', '2026-09-22T10:46:09.009Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:09.009Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 5, 28, 'Aza gaga amin’izany fa ho avy ny fotoana handrenesan’izay rehetra any am-pasana ny feony,', 'aza gaga amin’izany fa ho avy ny fotoana handrenesan’izay rehetra any am-pasana ny feony,'),
  ('6ab25c71f95a03c9a59b7e52', '2026-09-22T10:46:09.009Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:09.009Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 5, 19, 'Dia hoy i Jesosy tamin’izy ireo: “Lazaiko marimarina aminareo fa tsy manao na inona na inona araka izay tiany fotsiny ny Zanaka, fa izay hitany ataon’ny Ray ihany no ataony. Fa izay rehetra ataon’ny Ray dia izany koa no ataon’ny Zanaka, sady ataony mitovy amin’izay anaovan’ny Ray azy.', 'dia hoy i jesosy tamin’izy ireo: “lazaiko marimarina aminareo fa tsy manao na inona na inona araka izay tiany fotsiny ny zanaka, fa izay hitany ataon’ny ray ihany no ataony. fa izay rehetra ataon’ny ray dia izany koa no ataon’ny zanaka, sady ataony mitovy amin’izay anaovan’ny ray azy.'),
  ('6ab25c71f95a03c9a59b7e51', '2026-09-22T10:46:09.009Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:09.009Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 5, 18, 'Ary vao mainka nitady hamono azy ny Jiosy. Nihevitra mantsy izy ireo fa tsy nitandrina ny Sabata izy sady niantso an’Andriamanitra hoe Rainy, ka nanao ny tenany ho mitovy amin’Andriamanitra.', 'ary vao mainka nitady hamono azy ny jiosy. nihevitra mantsy izy ireo fa tsy nitandrina ny sabata izy sady niantso an’andriamanitra hoe rainy, ka nanao ny tenany ho mitovy amin’andriamanitra.'),
  ('6ab25c71f95a03c9a59b7e5c', '2026-09-22T10:46:09.009Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:09.009Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 5, 29, 'dia hivoaka izy ireo. Izay nanao ny tsara dia hatsangana mba hahazo fiainana, fa izay zatra nanao ratsy kosa hatsangana mba hotsaraina.', 'dia hivoaka izy ireo. izay nanao ny tsara dia hatsangana mba hahazo fiainana, fa izay zatra nanao ratsy kosa hatsangana mba hotsaraina.'),
  ('6ab25c71f95a03c9a59b7e45', '2026-09-22T10:46:09.009Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:09.009Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 5, 6, 'Nahita azy nitsotra teo i Jesosy, ary fantany hoe efa ela izy no narary, ka hoy izy taminy: “Te ho sitrana ve ianao?”', 'nahita azy nitsotra teo i jesosy, ary fantany hoe efa ela izy no narary, ka hoy izy taminy: “te ho sitrana ve ianao?”'),
  ('6ab25c71f95a03c9a59b7e42', '2026-09-22T10:46:09.009Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:09.009Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 5, 3, 'Be olona marary, jamba, malemy tongotra, ary kilemaina tao amin’ireo lala-mitafo ireo.', 'be olona marary, jamba, malemy tongotra, ary kilemaina tao amin’ireo lala-mitafo ireo.'),
  ('6ab25c71f95a03c9a59b7e6d', '2026-09-22T10:46:09.009Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:09.009Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 5, 46, 'Raha nino an’i Mosesy ianareo, dia ho nino ahy, satria nanoratra momba ahy i Mosesy.', 'raha nino an’i mosesy ianareo, dia ho nino ahy, satria nanoratra momba ahy i mosesy.'),
  ('6ab25c71f95a03c9a59b7e66', '2026-09-22T10:46:09.009Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:09.009Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 5, 39, '“Mikaroka ao amin’ny Soratra Masina ianareo, satria mieritreritra hoe amin’ny alalan’izy io no hahazoanareo fiainana mandrakizay, ary izy io mihitsy no manome porofo momba ahy.', '“mikaroka ao amin’ny soratra masina ianareo, satria mieritreritra hoe amin’ny alalan’izy io no hahazoanareo fiainana mandrakizay, ary izy io mihitsy no manome porofo momba ahy.'),
  ('6ab25c71f95a03c9a59b7e56', '2026-09-22T10:46:09.009Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:09.009Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 5, 23, 'Amin’izay dia hanome voninahitra ny Zanaka ny olona rehetra, toy ny anomezan’izy ireo voninahitra ny Ray. Izay tsy manome voninahitra ny Zanaka, dia tsy manome voninahitra an’ilay Ray naniraka azy.', 'amin’izay dia hanome voninahitra ny zanaka ny olona rehetra, toy ny anomezan’izy ireo voninahitra ny ray. izay tsy manome voninahitra ny zanaka, dia tsy manome voninahitra an’ilay ray naniraka azy.'),
  ('6ab25c71f95a03c9a59b7e46', '2026-09-22T10:46:09.009Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:09.009Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 5, 7, 'Dia namaly ilay marary hoe: “Tsy mba misy olona manampy ahy hankao anaty dobo, tompoko, rehefa mihetsika ny rano. Rehefa handeha hankao iny anefa aho, dia misy misongona ka izy no tafidina alohako.”', 'dia namaly ilay marary hoe: “tsy mba misy olona manampy ahy hankao anaty dobo, tompoko, rehefa mihetsika ny rano. rehefa handeha hankao iny anefa aho, dia misy misongona ka izy no tafidina alohako.”'),
