  ('6ab25c72fdf83f9f79a059d9', '2026-09-22T10:46:10.719Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:10.719Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 7, 31, 'Na izany aza, dia nino azy ny ankamaroan’ny vahoaka. Hoy izy ireo: “Rehefa tonga i Kristy, izy ve dia hahavita famantarana betsaka noho ny vitan’io lehilahy io?”', 'na izany aza, dia nino azy ny ankamaroan’ny vahoaka. hoy izy ireo: “rehefa tonga i kristy, izy ve dia hahavita famantarana betsaka noho ny vitan’io lehilahy io?”'),
  ('6ab25c72fdf83f9f79a059d3', '2026-09-22T10:46:10.719Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:10.719Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 7, 25, 'Dia hoy ny mponina sasany tao Jerosalema: “Tsy io angaha ilay tadiavin-dry zareo hovonoina?', 'dia hoy ny mponina sasany tao jerosalema: “tsy io angaha ilay tadiavin-dry zareo hovonoina?'),
  ('6ab25c72fdf83f9f79a059e3', '2026-09-22T10:46:10.719Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:10.719Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 7, 41, 'Hoy koa ny hafa: “Io no Kristy!” Hoy anefa ny sasany: “Angaha moa i Kristy avy any Galilia?', 'hoy koa ny hafa: “io no kristy!” hoy anefa ny sasany: “angaha moa i kristy avy any galilia?'),
