  ('6ab25c72fdf83f9f79a059d5', '2026-09-22T10:46:10.719Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:10.719Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 7, 27, 'Isika kosa anefa mahafantatra hoe avy aiza io lehilahy io. Rehefa tonga anefa i Kristy, dia tsy misy mahalala an’izay fiaviany.”', 'isika kosa anefa mahafantatra hoe avy aiza io lehilahy io. rehefa tonga anefa i kristy, dia tsy misy mahalala an’izay fiaviany.”'),
  ('6ab25c72fdf83f9f79a059e1', '2026-09-22T10:46:10.719Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:10.719Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 7, 39, 'Ilay fanahy efa horaisin’ireo mino azy anefa no noresahiny tamin’izany. Fa mbola tsy nisy olona nomena ny fanahy, satria i Jesosy aza mbola tsy nomem-boninahitra.', 'ilay fanahy efa horaisin’ireo mino azy anefa no noresahiny tamin’izany. fa mbola tsy nisy olona nomena ny fanahy, satria i jesosy aza mbola tsy nomem-boninahitra.'),
  ('6ab25c72fdf83f9f79a059ee', '2026-09-22T10:46:10.719Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:10.719Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 7, 52, 'Dia hoy izy ireo: “Angaha koa ianao avy any Galilia? Diniho tsara dia ho hitanao fa tsy misy mpaminany avy any Galilia.”', 'dia hoy izy ireo: “angaha koa ianao avy any galilia? diniho tsara dia ho hitanao fa tsy misy mpaminany avy any galilia.”'),
  ('6ab25c72fdf83f9f79a059df', '2026-09-22T10:46:10.719Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:10.719Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 7, 37, 'Tamin’ilay andro farany, izay andro lehibe indrindra amin’ilay fety, dia nitsangana i Jesosy ka niteny mafy be, nanao hoe: “Izay mangetaheta dia manatòna ahy fa homeko rano izy hosotroiny.', 'tamin’ilay andro farany, izay andro lehibe indrindra amin’ilay fety, dia nitsangana i jesosy ka niteny mafy be, nanao hoe: “izay mangetaheta dia manatòna ahy fa homeko rano izy hosotroiny.'),
  ('6ab25c72fdf83f9f79a059da', '2026-09-22T10:46:10.719Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:10.719Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 7, 32, 'Ary henon’ny Fariseo fa nitakoritsika momba an’i Jesosy ny vahoaka, ka naniraka mpiambina hisambotra an’i Jesosy ny lehiben’ny mpisorona sy ny Fariseo.', 'ary henon’ny fariseo fa nitakoritsika momba an’i jesosy ny vahoaka, ka naniraka mpiambina hisambotra an’i jesosy ny lehiben’ny mpisorona sy ny fariseo.'),
