  ('6ab25c72fdf83f9f79a059e6', '2026-09-22T10:46:10.719Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:10.719Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 7, 44, 'Ny sasany anefa te hisambotra azy, saingy tsy nisy nahavita.', 'ny sasany anefa te hisambotra azy, saingy tsy nisy nahavita.'),
  ('6ab25c72fdf83f9f79a059ed', '2026-09-22T10:46:10.719Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:10.719Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 7, 51, '“Angaha moa ny lalàntsika manameloka olona, raha tsy efa heno aloha izay lazainy ka fantatra izay ataony?”', '“angaha moa ny lalàntsika manameloka olona, raha tsy efa heno aloha izay lazainy ka fantatra izay ataony?”'),
  ('6ab25c72fdf83f9f79a059ea', '2026-09-22T10:46:10.719Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:10.719Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 7, 48, 'Fa angaha misy mino azy ny mpitondra eto amintsika na ny Fariseo?', 'fa angaha misy mino azy ny mpitondra eto amintsika na ny fariseo?'),
  ('6ab25c72fdf83f9f79a059e9', '2026-09-22T10:46:10.719Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:10.719Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 7, 47, 'Dia hoy ny Fariseo: “Ianareo koa angaha voafitaka?', 'dia hoy ny fariseo: “ianareo koa angaha voafitaka?'),
  ('6ab25c72fdf83f9f79a059e0', '2026-09-22T10:46:10.719Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:10.719Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 7, 38, 'Izay mino ahy, dia ‘hisy rano velona hikoriana avy ao anatiny lalina ao’, araka ny voalazan’ny Soratra Masina.”', 'izay mino ahy, dia ‘hisy rano velona hikoriana avy ao anatiny lalina ao’, araka ny voalazan’ny soratra masina.”'),
  ('6ab25c72fdf83f9f79a059d4', '2026-09-22T10:46:10.719Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:10.719Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 7, 26, 'Jereo anefa fa miteny eto imasom-bahoaka izy, nefa tsy miteny na inona na inona aminy akory ry zareo. Sao dia efa tena fantatry ny mpitondra eto amintsika àry hoe izy no Kristy?', 'jereo anefa fa miteny eto imasom-bahoaka izy, nefa tsy miteny na inona na inona aminy akory ry zareo. sao dia efa tena fantatry ny mpitondra eto amintsika àry hoe izy no kristy?'),
  ('6ab25c72fdf83f9f79a059d2', '2026-09-22T10:46:10.719Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:10.719Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 7, 24, 'Aza mitsara ivelany intsony, fa mba mitsarà araka ny rariny.”', 'aza mitsara ivelany intsony, fa mba mitsarà araka ny rariny.”'),
  ('6ab25c72fdf83f9f79a059de', '2026-09-22T10:46:10.719Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:10.719Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 7, 36, 'Fa inona no tiany holazaina amin’ny hoe: ‘Hitady ahy ianareo fa tsy hahita ahy, ary izay misy ahy tsy azonareo aleha’?”', 'fa inona no tiany holazaina amin’ny hoe: ‘hitady ahy ianareo fa tsy hahita ahy, ary izay misy ahy tsy azonareo aleha’?”'),
  ('6ab25c72fdf83f9f79a059d6', '2026-09-22T10:46:10.719Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:10.719Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 7, 28, 'Ary nampianatra tao amin’ny tempoly i Jesosy, dia niteny mafy be, nanao hoe: “Fantatrareo aho, ary fantatrareo koa hoe avy aiza aho. Tsy hoe sitrapoko fotsiny no nahatongavako tetỳ, fa tena misy Ilay naniraka ahy, saingy tsy fantatrareo izy.', 'ary nampianatra tao amin’ny tempoly i jesosy, dia niteny mafy be, nanao hoe: “fantatrareo aho, ary fantatrareo koa hoe avy aiza aho. tsy hoe sitrapoko fotsiny no nahatongavako tetỳ, fa tena misy ilay naniraka ahy, saingy tsy fantatrareo izy.'),
  ('6ab25c755e886599da316df5', '2026-09-22T10:46:13.431Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:13.431Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 9, 5, 'Izaho no fahazavan’izao tontolo izao raha mbola eo amin’izao tontolo izao aho.”', 'izaho no fahazavan’izao tontolo izao raha mbola eo amin’izao tontolo izao aho.”'),
  ('6ab25c755e886599da316df2', '2026-09-22T10:46:13.431Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:13.431Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 9, 2, 'Dia nanontany azy ny mpianany hoe: “Raby ô, fa iza no nanota, io lehilahy io sa ny ray aman-dreniny, no teraka jamba izy?”', 'dia nanontany azy ny mpianany hoe: “raby ô, fa iza no nanota, io lehilahy io sa ny ray aman-dreniny, no teraka jamba izy?”'),
  ('6ab25c755e886599da316df3', '2026-09-22T10:46:13.431Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:13.431Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 9, 3, 'Dia hoy i Jesosy: “Tsy io lehilahy io na ny ray aman-dreniny no nanota, fa mitranga izao mba ho hitan’ny olona ny asan’Andriamanitra, amin’izao mahazo azy izao.', 'dia hoy i jesosy: “tsy io lehilahy io na ny ray aman-dreniny no nanota, fa mitranga izao mba ho hitan’ny olona ny asan’andriamanitra, amin’izao mahazo azy izao.'),
  ('6ab25c755e886599da316df6', '2026-09-22T10:46:13.431Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:13.431Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 9, 6, 'Rehefa avy niteny an’izany izy, dia nandrora tamin’ny tany ka nanao feta tanimanga tamin’ny rorany. Dia nohosorany an’ilay izy ny mason’ilay lehilahy,', 'rehefa avy niteny an’izany izy, dia nandrora tamin’ny tany ka nanao feta tanimanga tamin’ny rorany. dia nohosorany an’ilay izy ny mason’ilay lehilahy,'),
  ('6ab25c755e886599da316df4', '2026-09-22T10:46:13.431Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:13.431Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 9, 4, 'Tsy maintsy manao ny asan’Ilay naniraka ahy isika, dieny mbola antoandro. Fa efa ho avy ny alina ka tsy hisy olona ho afaka hiasa.', 'tsy maintsy manao ny asan’ilay naniraka ahy isika, dieny mbola antoandro. fa efa ho avy ny alina ka tsy hisy olona ho afaka hiasa.'),
  ('6ab25c755e886599da316df1', '2026-09-22T10:46:13.431Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:13.431Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 9, 1, 'Tamin’izy nandalo, dia nahita lehilahy jamba hatrany an-kibon-dreniny.', 'tamin’izy nandalo, dia nahita lehilahy jamba hatrany an-kibon-dreniny.'),
  ('6ab25c755e886599da316df9', '2026-09-22T10:46:13.432Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:13.432Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 9, 9, 'Hoy ny sasany: “Izy tokoa io.” Fa hoy ny sasany: “Tsy izy izany io, fa olona mitovy aminy.” Hoy foana anefa ilay lehilahy: “Izaho iny ka!”', 'hoy ny sasany: “izy tokoa io.” fa hoy ny sasany: “tsy izy izany io, fa olona mitovy aminy.” hoy foana anefa ilay lehilahy: “izaho iny ka!”'),
  ('6ab25c755e886599da316e19', '2026-09-22T10:46:13.432Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:13.432Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 9, 41, 'Dia hoy i Jesosy: “Tsy ho meloka ho nanota ianareo, raha jamba. Milaza anefa ianareo hoe: ‘Mahita izahay’, dia tsy afaka ny fahotanareo.”', 'dia hoy i jesosy: “tsy ho meloka ho nanota ianareo, raha jamba. milaza anefa ianareo hoe: ‘mahita izahay’, dia tsy afaka ny fahotanareo.”'),
  ('6ab25c755e886599da316e0b', '2026-09-22T10:46:13.432Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:13.432Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 9, 27, 'Dia namaly izy hoe: “Efa noteneniko anareo izany, fa tsy nihaino ianareo. Koa maninona ianareo no te hihaino an’ilay izy indray? Angaha koa ianareo te ho lasa mpianany?”', 'dia namaly izy hoe: “efa noteneniko anareo izany, fa tsy nihaino ianareo. koa maninona ianareo no te hihaino an’ilay izy indray? angaha koa ianareo te ho lasa mpianany?”'),
  ('6ab25c755e886599da316e06', '2026-09-22T10:46:13.432Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:13.432Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 9, 22, 'Niteny an’izany ny ray aman-dreniny satria natahotra ny Jiosy izy ireo. Efa nifanaraka mantsy ny Jiosy fa izay manaiky an’i Jesosy ho Kristy, dia tokony horoahina hiala amin’ny synagoga.', 'niteny an’izany ny ray aman-dreniny satria natahotra ny jiosy izy ireo. efa nifanaraka mantsy ny jiosy fa izay manaiky an’i jesosy ho kristy, dia tokony horoahina hiala amin’ny synagoga.'),
  ('6ab25c755e886599da316dfb', '2026-09-22T10:46:13.432Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:13.432Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 9, 11, 'Dia namaly izy hoe: “Nanao feta tanimanga ilay lehilahy atao hoe Jesosy, dia nohosorany an’ilay izy ny masoko, sady hoy izy: ‘Mandehana misasa any Siloama.’ Dia nandeha nisasa aho, dia nahita.”', 'dia namaly izy hoe: “nanao feta tanimanga ilay lehilahy atao hoe jesosy, dia nohosorany an’ilay izy ny masoko, sady hoy izy: ‘mandehana misasa any siloama.’ dia nandeha nisasa aho, dia nahita.”'),
  ('6ab25c755e886599da316e10', '2026-09-22T10:46:13.432Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:13.432Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 9, 32, 'Mbola tsy nisy naheno mihitsy hatramin’izay hoe nisy olona nanasitrana ny mason’ny jamba hatrany an-kibon-dreniny.', 'mbola tsy nisy naheno mihitsy hatramin’izay hoe nisy olona nanasitrana ny mason’ny jamba hatrany an-kibon-dreniny.'),
  ('6ab25c755e886599da316e0f', '2026-09-22T10:46:13.432Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:13.432Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 9, 31, 'Fantatsika fa tsy mihaino ny mpanota Andriamanitra, fa izay matahotra azy sy manao ny sitrapony kosa no henoiny.', 'fantatsika fa tsy mihaino ny mpanota andriamanitra, fa izay matahotra azy sy manao ny sitrapony kosa no henoiny.'),
  ('6ab25c755e886599da316e03', '2026-09-22T10:46:13.432Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:13.432Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 9, 19, 'ka nanontaniany hoe: “Zanakareo ve io, ilay lazainareo hoe teraka jamba? Koa ahoana izy izao no lasa mahita?”', 'ka nanontaniany hoe: “zanakareo ve io, ilay lazainareo hoe teraka jamba? koa ahoana izy izao no lasa mahita?”'),
  ('6ab25c755e886599da316e16', '2026-09-22T10:46:13.432Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:13.432Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 9, 38, 'Hoy ilay lehilahy: “Tena mino azy aho, Tompo ô!” Dia niankohoka teo anatrehany izy.', 'hoy ilay lehilahy: “tena mino azy aho, tompo ô!” dia niankohoka teo anatrehany izy.'),
