  ('6ab25c755e886599da316e0c', '2026-09-22T10:46:13.432Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:13.432Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 9, 28, 'Dia nanambanimbany an’ilay lehilahy izy ireo hoe: “Ialahy no mpianany, fa izahay mpianatr’i Mosesy.', 'dia nanambanimbany an’ilay lehilahy izy ireo hoe: “ialahy no mpianany, fa izahay mpianatr’i mosesy.'),
  ('6ab25c755e886599da316e08', '2026-09-22T10:46:13.432Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:13.432Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 9, 24, 'Dia nantsoin’izy ireo fanindroany ilay jamba taloha, ka noteneniny hoe: “Omeo voninahitra Andriamanitra, ka lazao ny marina. Fantatray fa mpanota izany lehilahy izany.”', 'dia nantsoin’izy ireo fanindroany ilay jamba taloha, ka noteneniny hoe: “omeo voninahitra andriamanitra, ka lazao ny marina. fantatray fa mpanota izany lehilahy izany.”'),
  ('6ab25c755e886599da316e00', '2026-09-22T10:46:13.432Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:13.432Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 9, 16, 'Hoy ny Fariseo sasany avy eo: “Tsy nirahin’Andriamanitra izany lehilahy izany, satria tsy mitandrina ny Sabata.” Hoy kosa ny sasany: “Olona mpanota ve dia hahavita fahagagana hoatr’izany?” Tsy nitovy hevitra àry izy ireo.', 'hoy ny fariseo sasany avy eo: “tsy nirahin’andriamanitra izany lehilahy izany, satria tsy mitandrina ny sabata.” hoy kosa ny sasany: “olona mpanota ve dia hahavita fahagagana hoatr’izany?” tsy nitovy hevitra àry izy ireo.'),
  ('6ab25c755e886599da316dfa', '2026-09-22T10:46:13.432Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:13.432Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 9, 10, 'Hoy àry ireo taminy: “Fa ahoana no nahatonga ny masonao hahita?”', 'hoy àry ireo taminy: “fa ahoana no nahatonga ny masonao hahita?”'),
  ('6ab25c755e886599da316dfc', '2026-09-22T10:46:13.432Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:13.432Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 9, 12, 'Ary hoy ireo: “Aiza izany lehilahy izany?” Dia hoy izy: “Tsy haiko.”', 'ary hoy ireo: “aiza izany lehilahy izany?” dia hoy izy: “tsy haiko.”'),
  ('6ab25c755e886599da316df7', '2026-09-22T10:46:13.432Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:13.432Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 9, 7, 'ka hoy izy: “Mandehana misasa any amin’ny dobon’i Siloama”—izay adika hoe “Nalefa.”—Dia nandeha nisasa izy, ka lasa nahita rehefa niverina.', 'ka hoy izy: “mandehana misasa any amin’ny dobon’i siloama”—izay adika hoe “nalefa.”—dia nandeha nisasa izy, ka lasa nahita rehefa niverina.'),
