  ('6ab25c755e886599da316e15', '2026-09-22T10:46:13.432Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:13.432Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 9, 37, 'Hoy i Jesosy: “Efa hitanao izy, ary izy ilay miresaka aminao izao.”', 'hoy i jesosy: “efa hitanao izy, ary izy ilay miresaka aminao izao.”'),
  ('6ab25c755e886599da316dff', '2026-09-22T10:46:13.432Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:13.432Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 9, 15, 'Nanontanian’ny Fariseo àry ilay lehilahy hoe ahoana no nahatonga azy hahita. Dia hoy izy: “Nasiany feta tanimanga ny masoko, dia nosasako dia nahita aho.”', 'nanontanian’ny fariseo àry ilay lehilahy hoe ahoana no nahatonga azy hahita. dia hoy izy: “nasiany feta tanimanga ny masoko, dia nosasako dia nahita aho.”'),
  ('6ab25c755e886599da316e18', '2026-09-22T10:46:13.432Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:13.432Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 9, 40, 'Nisy Fariseo naheno an’izany teo, ka niteny hoe: “Izahay koa ve izany jamba?”', 'nisy fariseo naheno an’izany teo, ka niteny hoe: “izahay koa ve izany jamba?”'),
  ('6ab25c755e886599da316e01', '2026-09-22T10:46:13.432Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:13.432Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 9, 17, 'Hoy indray izy ireo tamin’ilay jamba: “Ary ahoana ny hevitrao momba azy? Ny masonao mantsy no nositraniny.” Dia hoy ilay lehilahy: “Mpaminany izy.”', 'hoy indray izy ireo tamin’ilay jamba: “ary ahoana ny hevitrao momba azy? ny masonao mantsy no nositraniny.” dia hoy ilay lehilahy: “mpaminany izy.”'),
  ('6ab25c755e886599da316e17', '2026-09-22T10:46:13.432Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:13.432Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 9, 39, 'Hoy i Jesosy avy eo: “Tonga eto amin’izao tontolo izao aho mba ho azo tsaraina ny olona. Amin’izay ny jamba lasa mahita, fa ny mahita kosa lasa jamba.”', 'hoy i jesosy avy eo: “tonga eto amin’izao tontolo izao aho mba ho azo tsaraina ny olona. amin’izay ny jamba lasa mahita, fa ny mahita kosa lasa jamba.”'),
  ('6ab25c755e886599da316e0d', '2026-09-22T10:46:13.432Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:13.432Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 9, 29, 'Fantatray fa niteny tamin’i Mosesy Andriamanitra, fa raha izany lehilahy izany, tsy fantatray izay niaviany.”', 'fantatray fa niteny tamin’i mosesy andriamanitra, fa raha izany lehilahy izany, tsy fantatray izay niaviany.”'),
  ('6ab25c755e886599da316df8', '2026-09-22T10:46:13.432Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:13.432Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 9, 8, 'Dia hoy ny mpiara-monina taminy sy ny olona efa nahita azy nangataka: “Tsy io ve ilay lehilahy nipetraka nangataka iny?”', 'dia hoy ny mpiara-monina taminy sy ny olona efa nahita azy nangataka: “tsy io ve ilay lehilahy nipetraka nangataka iny?”'),
  ('6ab25c755e886599da316e11', '2026-09-22T10:46:13.432Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:13.432Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 9, 33, 'Raha tsy nirahin’Andriamanitra àry izany lehilahy izany, dia tsy hahavita na inona na inona.”', 'raha tsy nirahin’andriamanitra àry izany lehilahy izany, dia tsy hahavita na inona na inona.”'),
  ('6ab25c755e886599da316e04', '2026-09-22T10:46:13.432Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:13.432Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 9, 20, 'Hoy ny ray aman-dreniny: “Zanakay io ka! Teraka jamba izy,', 'hoy ny ray aman-dreniny: “zanakay io ka! teraka jamba izy,'),
  ('6ab25c755e886599da316dfe', '2026-09-22T10:46:13.432Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:13.432Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 9, 14, 'Sabata ny andro, tamin’i Jesosy nanao an’ilay feta sy nanasitrana ny mason’ilay lehilahy.', 'sabata ny andro, tamin’i jesosy nanao an’ilay feta sy nanasitrana ny mason’ilay lehilahy.'),
  ('6ab25c755e886599da316e12', '2026-09-22T10:46:13.432Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:13.432Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 9, 34, 'Dia hoy ireo: “Tena teraka tao anatin’ny ota ialahy! Koa ialahy indray ve no mampianatra anay?” Dia noroahiny izy!', 'dia hoy ireo: “tena teraka tao anatin’ny ota ialahy! koa ialahy indray ve no mampianatra anay?” dia noroahiny izy!'),
  ('6ab25c755e886599da316e14', '2026-09-22T10:46:13.432Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:13.432Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 9, 36, 'Dia hoy ilay lehilahy: “Fa iza izany, tompoko, mba hinoako azy?”', 'dia hoy ilay lehilahy: “fa iza izany, tompoko, mba hinoako azy?”'),
  ('6ab25c7504268271ece2cb26', '2026-09-22T10:46:13.885Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:13.885Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 10, 8, 'Mpangalatra sy mpandroba daholo izay naka ny toerako, fa tsy nihaino azy ny ondry.', 'mpangalatra sy mpandroba daholo izay naka ny toerako, fa tsy nihaino azy ny ondry.'),
  ('6ab25c7504268271ece2cb28', '2026-09-22T10:46:13.885Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:13.885Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 10, 10, 'Tsy tonga ny mpangalatra raha tsy hangalatra sy hamono ary handringana. Fa izaho kosa tonga mba hahazoany fiainana, dia ho ela velona izy.', 'tsy tonga ny mpangalatra raha tsy hangalatra sy hamono ary handringana. fa izaho kosa tonga mba hahazoany fiainana, dia ho ela velona izy.'),
  ('6ab25c7504268271ece2cb23', '2026-09-22T10:46:13.885Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:13.885Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 10, 5, 'Tsy hanaraka olona tsy fantany mihitsy ireo, fa handositra azy kosa satria tsy fantany ny feony.”', 'tsy hanaraka olona tsy fantany mihitsy ireo, fa handositra azy kosa satria tsy fantany ny feony.”'),
  ('6ab25c7504268271ece2cb22', '2026-09-22T10:46:13.885Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:13.885Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 10, 4, 'Rehefa tafavoakany daholo ny ondriny, dia mandeha eo alohan’ireo izy. Ary manaraka azy ny ondry satria mahafantatra ny feony.', 'rehefa tafavoakany daholo ny ondriny, dia mandeha eo alohan’ireo izy. ary manaraka azy ny ondry satria mahafantatra ny feony.'),
  ('6ab25c7504268271ece2cb25', '2026-09-22T10:46:13.885Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:13.885Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 10, 7, 'Hoy indray i Jesosy: “Lazaiko marimarina aminareo fa izaho no vavahady idiran’ny ondry.', 'hoy indray i jesosy: “lazaiko marimarina aminareo fa izaho no vavahady idiran’ny ondry.'),
  ('6ab25c7504268271ece2cb24', '2026-09-22T10:46:13.885Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:13.885Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 10, 6, 'Nilaza an’izany fanoharana izany taminy i Jesosy, nefa tsy azon’izy ireo izay tian’i Jesosy holazaina.', 'nilaza an’izany fanoharana izany taminy i jesosy, nefa tsy azon’izy ireo izay tian’i jesosy holazaina.'),
  ('6ab25c7504268271ece2cb1f', '2026-09-22T10:46:13.885Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:13.885Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 10, 1, '“Lazaiko marimarina aminareo fa izay tsy miditra eo amin’ny vavahadin’ny valan’ondry, fa mianika any an-toeran-kafa, dia mpangalatra sy mpandroba.', '“lazaiko marimarina aminareo fa izay tsy miditra eo amin’ny vavahadin’ny valan’ondry, fa mianika any an-toeran-kafa, dia mpangalatra sy mpandroba.'),
  ('6ab25c7504268271ece2cb21', '2026-09-22T10:46:13.885Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:13.885Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 10, 3, 'Vohain’ny mpiandry vavahady izy, ary mihaino ny feony ny ondry. Dia antsoiny amin’ny anarany avy ny ondriny, ka tarihiny hivoaka.', 'vohain’ny mpiandry vavahady izy, ary mihaino ny feony ny ondry. dia antsoiny amin’ny anarany avy ny ondriny, ka tarihiny hivoaka.'),
  ('6ab25c7504268271ece2cb27', '2026-09-22T10:46:13.885Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:13.885Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 10, 9, 'Izaho no vavahady. Izay miditra eto amiko dia ho voavonjy, ary hiditra sy hivoaka izy sady hahita tanimbilona.', 'izaho no vavahady. izay miditra eto amiko dia ho voavonjy, ary hiditra sy hivoaka izy sady hahita tanimbilona.'),
  ('6ab25c7504268271ece2cb20', '2026-09-22T10:46:13.885Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:13.885Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 10, 2, 'Ilay miditra eo amin’ny vavahady kosa no mpiandry ondry.', 'ilay miditra eo amin’ny vavahady kosa no mpiandry ondry.');
INSERT INTO "bible_verses" ("id", "created_date", "updated_date", "created_by_id", "created_by", "translation", "book", "bookOrder", "chapter", "verse", "text", "normalizedText") VALUES
  ('6ab25c7504268271ece2cb48', '2026-09-22T10:46:13.886Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:13.886Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 10, 42, 'Ary betsaka ny olona nino an’i Jesosy tany.', 'ary betsaka ny olona nino an’i jesosy tany.'),
  ('6ab25c7504268271ece2cb47', '2026-09-22T10:46:13.886Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:13.886Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 10, 41, 'Be dia be ny olona tonga teo aminy, ary niteny hoe: “Tsy mba nanao famantarana i Jaona na iray aza. Marina daholo anefa izay nolazainy momba an’io lehilahy io.”', 'be dia be ny olona tonga teo aminy, ary niteny hoe: “tsy mba nanao famantarana i jaona na iray aza. marina daholo anefa izay nolazainy momba an’io lehilahy io.”'),
  ('6ab25c7504268271ece2cb40', '2026-09-22T10:46:13.886Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:13.886Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 10, 34, 'Dia hoy i Jesosy: “Angaha tsy voasoratra ao amin’ny Lalànareo ilay hoe: ‘Niteny aho hoe “andriamanitra ianareo”’?', 'dia hoy i jesosy: “angaha tsy voasoratra ao amin’ny lalànareo ilay hoe: ‘niteny aho hoe “andriamanitra ianareo”’?'),
  ('6ab25c7504268271ece2cb42', '2026-09-22T10:46:13.886Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:13.886Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 10, 36, 'dia maninona aho, izay nohamasinin’ny Ray sy nirahiny ho amin’izao tontolo izao, no lazainareo fa manevateva an’Andriamanitra satria niteny hoe: ‘Zanak’Andriamanitra aho’?', 'dia maninona aho, izay nohamasinin’ny ray sy nirahiny ho amin’izao tontolo izao, no lazainareo fa manevateva an’andriamanitra satria niteny hoe: ‘zanak’andriamanitra aho’?'),
  ('6ab25c7504268271ece2cb2e', '2026-09-22T10:46:13.886Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:13.886Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 10, 16, '“Manana ondry hafa tsy ato amin’ity vala ity aho. Ireny koa tsy maintsy hoentiko, dia hihaino ny feoko. Ho lasa andiany iray izy ireo sady ho iray ihany ny mpiandry azy.', '“manana ondry hafa tsy ato amin’ity vala ity aho. ireny koa tsy maintsy hoentiko, dia hihaino ny feoko. ho lasa andiany iray izy ireo sady ho iray ihany ny mpiandry azy.'),
  ('6ab25c7504268271ece2cb46', '2026-09-22T10:46:13.886Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:13.886Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 10, 40, 'Nankany ampitan’ny Reniranon’i Jordana indray izy, mba ho any amin’ilay toerana nanaovan’i Jaona batisa tamin’ny voalohany, ka nijanona tany.', 'nankany ampitan’ny reniranon’i jordana indray izy, mba ho any amin’ilay toerana nanaovan’i jaona batisa tamin’ny voalohany, ka nijanona tany.'),
  ('6ab25c7504268271ece2cb37', '2026-09-22T10:46:13.886Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:13.886Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 10, 25, 'Dia hoy i Jesosy: “Efa nolazaiko taminareo, fa ianareo no tsy mino. Ny asa ataoko amin’ny anaran’ny Raiko no porofo manamarina ahy.', 'dia hoy i jesosy: “efa nolazaiko taminareo, fa ianareo no tsy mino. ny asa ataoko amin’ny anaran’ny raiko no porofo manamarina ahy.'),
  ('6ab25c7504268271ece2cb36', '2026-09-22T10:46:13.886Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:13.886Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 10, 24, 'Dia nitangorona teo aminy ny Jiosy, ka niteny hoe: “Rahoviana ihany ianao vao hilaza ny marina aminay e? Tsory aminay raha ianao no Kristy.”', 'dia nitangorona teo aminy ny jiosy, ka niteny hoe: “rahoviana ihany ianao vao hilaza ny marina aminay e? tsory aminay raha ianao no kristy.”'),
  ('6ab25c7504268271ece2cb2f', '2026-09-22T10:46:13.886Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:13.886Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 10, 17, 'Tia ahy ny Ray satria mahafoy ny aiko aho mba hahazoako azy io indray.', 'tia ahy ny ray satria mahafoy ny aiko aho mba hahazoako azy io indray.'),
  ('6ab25c7504268271ece2cb39', '2026-09-22T10:46:13.886Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:13.886Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 10, 27, 'Ny ondriko mantsy mihaino ny feoko, ary fantatro izy dia manaraka ahy.', 'ny ondriko mantsy mihaino ny feoko, ary fantatro izy dia manaraka ahy.'),
  ('6ab25c7504268271ece2cb35', '2026-09-22T10:46:13.886Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:13.886Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 10, 23, 'ary nandeha tao amin’ny tempoly i Jesosy, tao amin’ny lala-mitafon’i Solomona.', 'ary nandeha tao amin’ny tempoly i jesosy, tao amin’ny lala-mitafon’i solomona.'),
  ('6ab25c7504268271ece2cb29', '2026-09-22T10:46:13.886Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:13.886Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 10, 11, 'Izaho no mpiandry tena tsara. Mahafoy ny ainy ho an’ny ondry ny mpiandry tena tsara.', 'izaho no mpiandry tena tsara. mahafoy ny ainy ho an’ny ondry ny mpiandry tena tsara.'),
  ('6ab25c7504268271ece2cb41', '2026-09-22T10:46:13.886Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:13.886Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 10, 35, 'Raha nantsoin’Andriamanitra hoe ‘andriamanitra’ ny olona nomelohin’ny teniny, nefa tsy azo foanana ny Soratra Masina,', 'raha nantsoin’andriamanitra hoe ‘andriamanitra’ ny olona nomelohin’ny teniny, nefa tsy azo foanana ny soratra masina,'),
  ('6ab25c7504268271ece2cb3a', '2026-09-22T10:46:13.886Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:13.886Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 10, 28, 'Omeko fiainana mandrakizay izy, ary tsy ho ringana mihitsy sady tsy hisy handrombaka azy etỳ an-tanako.', 'omeko fiainana mandrakizay izy, ary tsy ho ringana mihitsy sady tsy hisy handrombaka azy etỳ an-tanako.'),
  ('6ab25c7504268271ece2cb38', '2026-09-22T10:46:13.886Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:13.886Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 10, 26, 'Tsy mino anefa ianareo, satria tsy ondriko.', 'tsy mino anefa ianareo, satria tsy ondriko.'),
  ('6ab25c7504268271ece2cb31', '2026-09-22T10:46:13.886Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:13.886Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 10, 19, 'Dia tsy nitovy hevitra indray ny Jiosy noho izany teny izany.', 'dia tsy nitovy hevitra indray ny jiosy noho izany teny izany.'),
  ('6ab25c7504268271ece2cb45', '2026-09-22T10:46:13.886Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:13.886Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 10, 39, 'Dia nitady hisambotra azy indray ireo, nefa nandositra izy ka tsy azony.', 'dia nitady hisambotra azy indray ireo, nefa nandositra izy ka tsy azony.'),
  ('6ab25c7504268271ece2cb3d', '2026-09-22T10:46:13.886Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:13.886Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 10, 31, 'Dia naka vato hitorahana azy indray ny Jiosy.', 'dia naka vato hitorahana azy indray ny jiosy.'),
  ('6ab25c7504268271ece2cb34', '2026-09-22T10:46:13.886Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:13.886Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 10, 22, 'Ary tonga ny Fetin’ny Fitokanana tany Jerosalema. Ririnina tamin’izay,', 'ary tonga ny fetin’ny fitokanana tany jerosalema. ririnina tamin’izay,'),
  ('6ab25c7504268271ece2cb2c', '2026-09-22T10:46:13.886Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:13.886Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 10, 14, 'Izaho no mpiandry tena tsara. Fantatro ny ondriko, ary ny ondriko koa mahafantatra ahy,', 'izaho no mpiandry tena tsara. fantatro ny ondriko, ary ny ondriko koa mahafantatra ahy,'),
  ('6ab25c7504268271ece2cb2b', '2026-09-22T10:46:13.886Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:13.886Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 10, 13, 'Mandositra ilay mpikarama satria izy mpikarama, ka tsy raharahiany ny ondry.', 'mandositra ilay mpikarama satria izy mpikarama, ka tsy raharahiany ny ondry.'),
  ('6ab25c7504268271ece2cb43', '2026-09-22T10:46:13.886Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:13.886Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 10, 37, 'Raha tsy manao ny asan’ny Raiko aho, dia aza mino ahy.', 'raha tsy manao ny asan’ny raiko aho, dia aza mino ahy.'),
  ('6ab25c7504268271ece2cb3c', '2026-09-22T10:46:13.886Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:13.886Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 10, 30, 'Ary izaho sy ny Ray dia iray ihany.”', 'ary izaho sy ny ray dia iray ihany.”'),
  ('6ab25c7504268271ece2cb44', '2026-09-22T10:46:13.886Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:13.886Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 10, 38, 'Fa raha manao an’izany kosa aho, na tsy mino ahy aza ianareo, dia mba minoa noho ny asa ataoko. Amin’izay ho fantatrareo sady ho hainareo foana fa ny Ray dia tafaray amiko, ary izaho tafaray amin’ny Ray.”', 'fa raha manao an’izany kosa aho, na tsy mino ahy aza ianareo, dia mba minoa noho ny asa ataoko. amin’izay ho fantatrareo sady ho hainareo foana fa ny ray dia tafaray amiko, ary izaho tafaray amin’ny ray.”'),
  ('6ab25c7504268271ece2cb30', '2026-09-22T10:46:13.886Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:13.886Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 10, 18, 'Tsy misy manala ny aiko amiko, fa izaho no mahafoy azy io an-tsitrapo. Manana fahefana hamoy ny aiko aho, ary manana fahefana hahazo azy io indray. Izany no didy azoko tamin’ny Raiko.”', 'tsy misy manala ny aiko amiko, fa izaho no mahafoy azy io an-tsitrapo. manana fahefana hamoy ny aiko aho, ary manana fahefana hahazo azy io indray. izany no didy azoko tamin’ny raiko.”'),
  ('6ab25c7504268271ece2cb3f', '2026-09-22T10:46:13.886Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:13.886Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 10, 33, 'Dia hoy ny Jiosy: “Tsy ny asa tsara no hitorahanay vato anao, fa noho ianao manevateva an’Andriamanitra. Olona ihany mantsy ianao nefa mihevi-tena ho andriamanitra.”', 'dia hoy ny jiosy: “tsy ny asa tsara no hitorahanay vato anao, fa noho ianao manevateva an’andriamanitra. olona ihany mantsy ianao nefa mihevi-tena ho andriamanitra.”'),
  ('6ab25c7504268271ece2cb3e', '2026-09-22T10:46:13.886Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:13.886Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 10, 32, 'Ary hoy i Jesosy: “Be dia be ny asa tsara nasain’ny Raiko natao ka nasehoko anareo. Dia iza amin’ireny no hitorahanareo vato ahy?”', 'ary hoy i jesosy: “be dia be ny asa tsara nasain’ny raiko natao ka nasehoko anareo. dia iza amin’ireny no hitorahanareo vato ahy?”'),
  ('6ab25c7504268271ece2cb3b', '2026-09-22T10:46:13.886Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:13.886Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 10, 29, 'Izay nomen’ny Raiko ahy dia sarobidy noho ny zavatra hafa rehetra, ary tsy misy mahavita mandrombaka azy eny an-tanan’ny Ray.', 'izay nomen’ny raiko ahy dia sarobidy noho ny zavatra hafa rehetra, ary tsy misy mahavita mandrombaka azy eny an-tanan’ny ray.'),
  ('6ab25c7504268271ece2cb32', '2026-09-22T10:46:13.886Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:13.886Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 10, 20, 'Betsaka no niteny hoe: “Misy demonia izy sady adala. Koa maninona ianareo no mbola mihaino azy?”', 'betsaka no niteny hoe: “misy demonia izy sady adala. koa maninona ianareo no mbola mihaino azy?”'),
  ('6ab25c7504268271ece2cb2d', '2026-09-22T10:46:13.886Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:13.886Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 10, 15, 'hoatran’ny ahafantaran’ny Ray ahy sy ahafantarako ny Ray. Ary foiko ho an’ny ondry ny aiko.', 'hoatran’ny ahafantaran’ny ray ahy sy ahafantarako ny ray. ary foiko ho an’ny ondry ny aiko.'),
  ('6ab25c7504268271ece2cb2a', '2026-09-22T10:46:13.886Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:13.886Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 10, 12, 'Ny mpikarama indray rehefa mahita amboadia manatona, dia ilaozany ny ondry ka mandositra izy, satria tsy mpiandry izy sady tsy tompon’ny ondry. Dia rambasan’ny amboadia ny ondry ka miparitaka.', 'ny mpikarama indray rehefa mahita amboadia manatona, dia ilaozany ny ondry ka mandositra izy, satria tsy mpiandry izy sady tsy tompon’ny ondry. dia rambasan’ny amboadia ny ondry ka miparitaka.'),
  ('6ab25c7504268271ece2cb33', '2026-09-22T10:46:13.886Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:13.886Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 10, 21, 'Fa hoy ny sasany: “Tsy tenin’olona misy demonia izany. Angaha ny demonia mahavita manasitrana ny mason’ny jamba?”', 'fa hoy ny sasany: “tsy tenin’olona misy demonia izany. angaha ny demonia mahavita manasitrana ny mason’ny jamba?”'),
  ('6ab25c769295ce152355a202', '2026-09-22T10:46:14.506Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:14.506Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 11, 9, 'Dia hoy i Jesosy: “Angaha moa tsy adiny 12 no mazava ny andro? Raha mandeha amin’ny antoandro ny olona, dia tsy ho tafintohina mihitsy, satria hitany ny fahazavan’izao tontolo izao.', 'dia hoy i jesosy: “angaha moa tsy adiny 12 no mazava ny andro? raha mandeha amin’ny antoandro ny olona, dia tsy ho tafintohina mihitsy, satria hitany ny fahazavan’izao tontolo izao.'),
  ('6ab25c769295ce152355a1fa', '2026-09-22T10:46:14.506Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:14.506Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 11, 1, 'Narary ny lehilahy iray antsoina hoe Lazarosy. Tao Betania izy no nipetraka, tao amin’ilay tanàna nisy an’i Maria sy Marta anabaviny.', 'narary ny lehilahy iray antsoina hoe lazarosy. tao betania izy no nipetraka, tao amin’ilay tanàna nisy an’i maria sy marta anabaviny.'),
  ('6ab25c769295ce152355a1fc', '2026-09-22T10:46:14.506Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:14.506Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 11, 3, 'Nandefa hafatra tany amin’i Jesosy àry ireo anabavin’i Lazarosy ireo hoe: “Tompo ô, marary ilay namanao tsy foinao.”', 'nandefa hafatra tany amin’i jesosy àry ireo anabavin’i lazarosy ireo hoe: “tompo ô, marary ilay namanao tsy foinao.”'),
  ('6ab25c769295ce152355a1fb', '2026-09-22T10:46:14.506Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:14.506Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 11, 2, 'Io Maria io ilay nandraraka menaka manitra tamin’ny Tompo sy nanamaina ny tongony tamin’ny volony. Ary anadahiny i Lazarosy, ilay narary.', 'io maria io ilay nandraraka menaka manitra tamin’ny tompo sy nanamaina ny tongony tamin’ny volony. ary anadahiny i lazarosy, ilay narary.'),
  ('6ab25c769295ce152355a209', '2026-09-22T10:46:14.506Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:14.506Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 11, 16, 'Niteny tamin’ny mpianatra hafa àry i Tomasy, ilay atao hoe Ikambana, hoe: “Andao koa isika handeha, mba hiara-maty aminy.”', 'niteny tamin’ny mpianatra hafa àry i tomasy, ilay atao hoe ikambana, hoe: “andao koa isika handeha, mba hiara-maty aminy.”'),
  ('6ab25c769295ce152355a201', '2026-09-22T10:46:14.506Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:14.506Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 11, 8, 'Hoy anefa izy ireo: “Raby ô, vao haingana ange ny Jodianina no nitady hitora-bato anao e! Dia hankany indray ve ianao?”', 'hoy anefa izy ireo: “raby ô, vao haingana ange ny jodianina no nitady hitora-bato anao e! dia hankany indray ve ianao?”'),
  ('6ab25c769295ce152355a200', '2026-09-22T10:46:14.506Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:14.506Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 11, 7, 'Taorian’izay, dia hoy izy tamin’ny mpianany: “Andao indray ho any Jodia.”', 'taorian’izay, dia hoy izy tamin’ny mpianany: “andao indray ho any jodia.”'),
  ('6ab25c769295ce152355a1fe', '2026-09-22T10:46:14.506Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:14.506Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 11, 5, 'Tian’i Jesosy i Marta sy ny rahavaviny ary Lazarosy.', 'tian’i jesosy i marta sy ny rahavaviny ary lazarosy.'),
  ('6ab25c769295ce152355a204', '2026-09-22T10:46:14.506Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:14.506Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 11, 11, 'Hoy izy rehefa avy niteny an’izany: “Matory i Lazarosy namantsika, fa handeha ho any aho hamoha azy.”', 'hoy izy rehefa avy niteny an’izany: “matory i lazarosy namantsika, fa handeha ho any aho hamoha azy.”'),
  ('6ab25c769295ce152355a203', '2026-09-22T10:46:14.506Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:14.506Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 11, 10, 'Fa raha mandeha amin’ny alina kosa izy, dia ho tafintohina, satria tsy ao anatiny ny fahazavana.”', 'fa raha mandeha amin’ny alina kosa izy, dia ho tafintohina, satria tsy ao anatiny ny fahazavana.”'),
  ('6ab25c769295ce152355a205', '2026-09-22T10:46:14.506Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:14.506Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 11, 12, 'Dia hoy ny mpianany: “Tompo ô, raha matory izy dia ho sitrana.”', 'dia hoy ny mpianany: “tompo ô, raha matory izy dia ho sitrana.”'),
  ('6ab25c769295ce152355a206', '2026-09-22T10:46:14.506Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:14.506Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 11, 13, 'Te hilaza anefa i Jesosy hoe maty i Lazarosy, nefa noheverin’izy ireo fa maka aina izy dia matory.', 'te hilaza anefa i jesosy hoe maty i lazarosy, nefa noheverin’izy ireo fa maka aina izy dia matory.'),
  ('6ab25c769295ce152355a20a', '2026-09-22T10:46:14.506Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:14.507Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 11, 17, 'Rehefa tonga i Jesosy, dia efa efatra andro i Lazarosy no tao am-pasana.', 'rehefa tonga i jesosy, dia efa efatra andro i lazarosy no tao am-pasana.'),
  ('6ab25c769295ce152355a1fd', '2026-09-22T10:46:14.506Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:14.506Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 11, 4, 'Hoy anefa i Jesosy rehefa naheno an’izany: “Tsy ny hahafaty azy no anton’io aretina io, fa ny hanomezam-boninahitra an’Andriamanitra, mba hahazo voninahitra koa ny Zanak’Andriamanitra.”', 'hoy anefa i jesosy rehefa naheno an’izany: “tsy ny hahafaty azy no anton’io aretina io, fa ny hanomezam-boninahitra an’andriamanitra, mba hahazo voninahitra koa ny zanak’andriamanitra.”'),
  ('6ab25c769295ce152355a208', '2026-09-22T10:46:14.506Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:14.506Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 11, 15, 'Soa ihany aho fa tsy tany, fa mahasoa anareo izany, amin’izay ianareo mino. Fa andao isika ho any aminy.”', 'soa ihany aho fa tsy tany, fa mahasoa anareo izany, amin’izay ianareo mino. fa andao isika ho any aminy.”'),
  ('6ab25c769295ce152355a1ff', '2026-09-22T10:46:14.506Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:14.506Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 11, 6, 'Mbola nijanona roa andro tany amin’izay nisy azy ihany anefa izy rehefa naheno hoe narary i Lazarosy.', 'mbola nijanona roa andro tany amin’izay nisy azy ihany anefa izy rehefa naheno hoe narary i lazarosy.'),
  ('6ab25c769295ce152355a207', '2026-09-22T10:46:14.506Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:14.506Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 11, 14, 'Notsorin’i Jesosy avy eo hoe: “Maty i Lazarosy.', 'notsorin’i jesosy avy eo hoe: “maty i lazarosy.'),
  ('6ab25c769295ce152355a230', '2026-09-22T10:46:14.507Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:14.507Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 11, 55, 'Efa akaiky ny Paskan’ny Jiosy tamin’izay, ka betsaka ny olona avy any ambanivohitra no niakatra ho any Jerosalema talohan’ny Paska, mba hanadio ny tenany araka ny takin’ny Lalàna.', 'efa akaiky ny paskan’ny jiosy tamin’izay, ka betsaka ny olona avy any ambanivohitra no niakatra ho any jerosalema talohan’ny paska, mba hanadio ny tenany araka ny takin’ny lalàna.'),
  ('6ab25c769295ce152355a216', '2026-09-22T10:46:14.507Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:14.507Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 11, 29, 'Vao naheno an’izany i Maria, dia nitsangana haingana ka lasa nankany amin’i Jesosy.', 'vao naheno an’izany i maria, dia nitsangana haingana ka lasa nankany amin’i jesosy.'),
  ('6ab25c769295ce152355a210', '2026-09-22T10:46:14.507Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:14.507Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 11, 23, 'Hoy i Jesosy: “Ao fa hitsangana ny anadahinao.”', 'hoy i jesosy: “ao fa hitsangana ny anadahinao.”'),
  ('6ab25c769295ce152355a22f', '2026-09-22T10:46:14.507Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:14.507Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 11, 54, 'Tsy nisehoseho teo amin’ny Jiosy intsony àry i Jesosy rehefa nandeha. Niala teo kosa izy dia nankany amin’ny faritra akaikin’ny tany efitra, tao amin’ny tanàna atao hoe Efraima. Ary nijanona tao niaraka tamin’ny mpianany izy.', 'tsy nisehoseho teo amin’ny jiosy intsony àry i jesosy rehefa nandeha. niala teo kosa izy dia nankany amin’ny faritra akaikin’ny tany efitra, tao amin’ny tanàna atao hoe efraima. ary nijanona tao niaraka tamin’ny mpianany izy.'),
  ('6ab25c769295ce152355a228', '2026-09-22T10:46:14.507Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:14.507Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 11, 47, 'Dia novorin’ny lehiben’ny mpisorona sy ny Fariseo ireo anisan’ny Fitsarana Avo Jiosy, ka hoy izy ireo: “Inona no hataontsika, fa be dia be ny famantarana ataon’iny lehilahy iny?', 'dia novorin’ny lehiben’ny mpisorona sy ny fariseo ireo anisan’ny fitsarana avo jiosy, ka hoy izy ireo: “inona no hataontsika, fa be dia be ny famantarana ataon’iny lehilahy iny?'),
  ('6ab25c769295ce152355a220', '2026-09-22T10:46:14.507Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:14.507Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 11, 39, 'Ary hoy i Jesosy: “Esory io vato io.” Hoy anefa i Marta, anabavin’ny maty: “Tompo ô, tsy maintsy maimbo izy izao, satria efa efatra andro izay.”', 'ary hoy i jesosy: “esory io vato io.” hoy anefa i marta, anabavin’ny maty: “tompo ô, tsy maintsy maimbo izy izao, satria efa efatra andro izay.”'),
  ('6ab25c769295ce152355a21f', '2026-09-22T10:46:14.507Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:14.507Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 11, 38, 'Nisento lalina indray i Jesosy, dia nankeo amin’ny fasana. Lava-bato notampenana vato ilay izy.', 'nisento lalina indray i jesosy, dia nankeo amin’ny fasana. lava-bato notampenana vato ilay izy.'),
  ('6ab25c769295ce152355a226', '2026-09-22T10:46:14.507Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:14.507Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 11, 45, 'Lasa nino an’i Jesosy àry ny ankamaroan’ireo Jiosy tonga tao amin’i Maria sy nahita an’izay nataon’i Jesosy.', 'lasa nino an’i jesosy àry ny ankamaroan’ireo jiosy tonga tao amin’i maria sy nahita an’izay nataon’i jesosy.'),
  ('6ab25c769295ce152355a22b', '2026-09-22T10:46:14.507Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:14.507Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 11, 50, 'Tsy noeritreretinareo ve fa mahasoa anareo raha olona iray no maty ho an’ny vahoaka, toy izay ny firenena iray manontolo no ho rava?”', 'tsy noeritreretinareo ve fa mahasoa anareo raha olona iray no maty ho an’ny vahoaka, toy izay ny firenena iray manontolo no ho rava?”'),
  ('6ab25c769295ce152355a21d', '2026-09-22T10:46:14.507Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:14.507Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 11, 36, 'Hoy àry ny Jiosy: “Tena tiany marina izy izany.”', 'hoy àry ny jiosy: “tena tiany marina izy izany.”'),
  ('6ab25c769295ce152355a218', '2026-09-22T10:46:14.507Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:14.507Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 11, 31, 'Rehefa nahita an’i Maria nitsangana sy lasa nandeha àry ireo Jiosy nampionona azy tao an-tranony, dia nanaraka azy koa. Nihevitra mantsy izy ireo fa handeha hitomany tany am-pasana izy.', 'rehefa nahita an’i maria nitsangana sy lasa nandeha àry ireo jiosy nampionona azy tao an-tranony, dia nanaraka azy koa. nihevitra mantsy izy ireo fa handeha hitomany tany am-pasana izy.'),
