  ('6ab25c769295ce152355a22e', '2026-09-22T10:46:14.507Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:14.507Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 11, 53, 'Nanomboka tamin’izay andro izay àry, dia niray tetika hamono an’i Jesosy ireo.', 'nanomboka tamin’izay andro izay àry, dia niray tetika hamono an’i jesosy ireo.'),
  ('6ab25c769295ce152355a222', '2026-09-22T10:46:14.507Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:14.507Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 11, 41, 'Dia nesorin’izy ireo ilay vato. Nitraka nijery ny lanitra i Jesosy avy eo, ka hoy izy: “Misaotra anao aho, Ray ô, fa efa nihaino ahy ianao.', 'dia nesorin’izy ireo ilay vato. nitraka nijery ny lanitra i jesosy avy eo, ka hoy izy: “misaotra anao aho, ray ô, fa efa nihaino ahy ianao.'),
  ('6ab25c769295ce152355a21a', '2026-09-22T10:46:14.507Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:14.507Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 11, 33, 'Rehefa nahita an’i Maria sy ireo Jiosy niaraka taminy nigogogogo nitomany i Jesosy, dia nisento lalina sady nalahelo be.', 'rehefa nahita an’i maria sy ireo jiosy niaraka taminy nigogogogo nitomany i jesosy, dia nisento lalina sady nalahelo be.'),
  ('6ab25c769295ce152355a227', '2026-09-22T10:46:14.507Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:14.507Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 11, 46, 'Ny sasany kosa nankany amin’ny Fariseo ka nitantara an’izay nataon’i Jesosy.', 'ny sasany kosa nankany amin’ny fariseo ka nitantara an’izay nataon’i jesosy.'),
  ('6ab25c769295ce152355a225', '2026-09-22T10:46:14.507Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:14.507Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 11, 44, 'Dia nivoaka ilay lehilahy efa maty, ary mbola nisy fehim-paty ny tongony aman-tanany, sady nifono lamba ny tarehiny. Dia hoy i Jesosy tamin’ny olona: “Vahao izy, dia avelao handeha.”', 'dia nivoaka ilay lehilahy efa maty, ary mbola nisy fehim-paty ny tongony aman-tanany, sady nifono lamba ny tarehiny. dia hoy i jesosy tamin’ny olona: “vahao izy, dia avelao handeha.”'),
  ('6ab25c769295ce152355a231', '2026-09-22T10:46:14.507Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:14.507Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 11, 56, 'Nitady an’i Jesosy izy ireo. Ary tamin’izy ireo mbola nijorojoro tao amin’ny tempoly, dia nifanontany hoe: “Ahoana ny hevitrareo? Tsy ho tonga amin’ny fety mihitsy ve izy?”', 'nitady an’i jesosy izy ireo. ary tamin’izy ireo mbola nijorojoro tao amin’ny tempoly, dia nifanontany hoe: “ahoana ny hevitrareo? tsy ho tonga amin’ny fety mihitsy ve izy?”'),
  ('6ab25c769295ce152355a213', '2026-09-22T10:46:14.507Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:14.507Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 11, 26, 'Ary izay rehetra velona ka maneho finoana ahy dia tsy ho faty mihitsy. Mino an’izany ve ianao?”', 'ary izay rehetra velona ka maneho finoana ahy dia tsy ho faty mihitsy. mino an’izany ve ianao?”'),
  ('6ab25c769295ce152355a20f', '2026-09-22T10:46:14.507Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:14.507Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 11, 22, 'Na izao dia izao aza anefa, dia fantatro fa homen’Andriamanitra anao daholo izay angatahinao.”', 'na izao dia izao aza anefa, dia fantatro fa homen’andriamanitra anao daholo izay angatahinao.”'),
  ('6ab25c769295ce152355a20d', '2026-09-22T10:46:14.507Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:14.507Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 11, 20, 'Rehefa henon’i Marta hoe tamy any i Jesosy, dia lasa nitsena azy izy. I Maria kosa mbola nipetraka tao an-trano ihany.', 'rehefa henon’i marta hoe tamy any i jesosy, dia lasa nitsena azy izy. i maria kosa mbola nipetraka tao an-trano ihany.'),
  ('6ab25c77330b89700ce94ee7', '2026-09-22T10:46:15.589Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:15.589Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 12, 42, 'Betsaka koa anefa ny mpitondra teo amin’ny Jiosy no nino azy, saingy tsy sahy nanaiky hoe mpianany izy ireo noho ny Fariseo, sao ho voaroaka hiala amin’ny synagoga.', 'betsaka koa anefa ny mpitondra teo amin’ny jiosy no nino azy, saingy tsy sahy nanaiky hoe mpianany izy ireo noho ny fariseo, sao ho voaroaka hiala amin’ny synagoga.'),
  ('6ab25c77330b89700ce94ec6', '2026-09-22T10:46:15.589Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:15.589Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 12, 9, 'Ary lasa fantatry ny Jiosy maro be fa tao Betania izy. Tonga àry ireo, tsy hoe mba hahita an’i Jesosy fotsiny, fa mba hahita an’i Lazarosy koa, ilay natsangany tamin’ny maty.', 'ary lasa fantatry ny jiosy maro be fa tao betania izy. tonga àry ireo, tsy hoe mba hahita an’i jesosy fotsiny, fa mba hahita an’i lazarosy koa, ilay natsangany tamin’ny maty.'),
  ('6ab25c77330b89700ce94eee', '2026-09-22T10:46:15.589Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:15.589Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 12, 49, 'Tsy ny hevitro mantsy no nolazaiko, fa ny Ray izay naniraka ahy no nandidy ahy momba izay holazaiko sy hoteneniko.', 'tsy ny hevitro mantsy no nolazaiko, fa ny ray izay naniraka ahy no nandidy ahy momba izay holazaiko sy hoteneniko.'),
  ('6ab25c77330b89700ce94edf', '2026-09-22T10:46:15.589Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:15.589Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 12, 34, 'Dia hoy ny vahoaka: “Henonay tao amin’ny Lalàna fa ho velona mandrakizay i Kristy. Koa ahoana no ilazanao hoe tsy maintsy asandratra ny Zanak’olona? Fa iza izany Zanak’olona izany?”', 'dia hoy ny vahoaka: “henonay tao amin’ny lalàna fa ho velona mandrakizay i kristy. koa ahoana no ilazanao hoe tsy maintsy asandratra ny zanak’olona? fa iza izany zanak’olona izany?”'),
  ('6ab25c77330b89700ce94ed4', '2026-09-22T10:46:15.589Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:15.589Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 12, 23, 'Hoy anefa i Jesosy tamin’izy ireo: “Tonga ny fotoana hanomezam-boninahitra ny Zanak’olona.', 'hoy anefa i jesosy tamin’izy ireo: “tonga ny fotoana hanomezam-boninahitra ny zanak’olona.'),
  ('6ab25c77330b89700ce94ecb', '2026-09-22T10:46:15.589Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:15.589Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 12, 14, 'Ary nahita zanak’ampondra i Jesosy ka nitaingenany, araka ny voasoratra hoe:', 'ary nahita zanak’ampondra i jesosy ka nitaingenany, araka ny voasoratra hoe:'),
  ('6ab25c77330b89700ce94ec3', '2026-09-22T10:46:15.589Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:15.589Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 12, 6, 'Tsy noho izy miahy ny mahantra anefa no nilazany an’izany, fa noho izy mpangalatra. Izy mantsy no nitana ny boatim-bola, dia nangalariny foana ny tao anatiny.', 'tsy noho izy miahy ny mahantra anefa no nilazany an’izany, fa noho izy mpangalatra. izy mantsy no nitana ny boatim-bola, dia nangalariny foana ny tao anatiny.'),
  ('6ab25c77330b89700ce94ebf', '2026-09-22T10:46:15.589Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:15.589Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 12, 2, 'Koa nisy nanasa tamin’ny sakafo hariva i Jesosy tao. I Marta no nandroso sakafo, fa i Lazarosy kosa anisan’ireo nisakafo niaraka tamin’i Jesosy.', 'koa nisy nanasa tamin’ny sakafo hariva i jesosy tao. i marta no nandroso sakafo, fa i lazarosy kosa anisan’ireo nisakafo niaraka tamin’i jesosy.'),
  ('6ab25c77330b89700ce94ed9', '2026-09-22T10:46:15.589Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:15.589Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 12, 28, 'Ray ô, omeo voninahitra ny anaranao.” Dia nisy feo avy any an-danitra niteny hoe: “Efa nanome voninahitra azy aho, ary mbola hanome voninahitra azy indray.”', 'ray ô, omeo voninahitra ny anaranao.” dia nisy feo avy any an-danitra niteny hoe: “efa nanome voninahitra azy aho, ary mbola hanome voninahitra azy indray.”'),
  ('6ab25c77330b89700ce94ed5', '2026-09-22T10:46:15.589Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:15.589Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 12, 24, 'Lazaiko marimarina aminareo fa raha tsy latsaka amin’ny tany ny voa anankiray ka maty, dia mijanona ho voa anankiray ihany. Fa raha maty kosa ilay izy, dia mamokatra be dia be.', 'lazaiko marimarina aminareo fa raha tsy latsaka amin’ny tany ny voa anankiray ka maty, dia mijanona ho voa anankiray ihany. fa raha maty kosa ilay izy, dia mamokatra be dia be.'),
  ('6ab25c77330b89700ce94eed', '2026-09-22T10:46:15.589Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:15.589Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 12, 48, 'Izay tsy miraharaha ahy ka tsy mandray ny teniko, dia hisy hitsara azy. Ny teny nolazaiko no hitsara azy amin’ny andro farany.', 'izay tsy miraharaha ahy ka tsy mandray ny teniko, dia hisy hitsara azy. ny teny nolazaiko no hitsara azy amin’ny andro farany.'),
  ('6ab25c77330b89700ce94eca', '2026-09-22T10:46:15.589Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:15.589Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 12, 13, 'Dia naka sampana palmie ireo, ka nandeha nitsena azy sady niantsoantso hoe: “Mba vonjeo re e! Hotahina anie ilay tonga amin’ny anaran’i Jehovah, dia ilay Mpanjakan’ny Israely!”', 'dia naka sampana palmie ireo, ka nandeha nitsena azy sady niantsoantso hoe: “mba vonjeo re e! hotahina anie ilay tonga amin’ny anaran’i jehovah, dia ilay mpanjakan’ny israely!”'),
  ('6ab25c77330b89700ce94ee1', '2026-09-22T10:46:15.589Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:15.589Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 12, 36, 'Minoa ny mazava dieny mbola eo aminareo ny mazava, mba ho tonga zanaky ny mazava ianareo.” Niteny an’izany i Jesosy, dia lasa ka niafina an’ireo.', 'minoa ny mazava dieny mbola eo aminareo ny mazava, mba ho tonga zanaky ny mazava ianareo.” niteny an’izany i jesosy, dia lasa ka niafina an’ireo.'),
