  ('6ab25c77330b89700ce94ed2', '2026-09-22T10:46:15.589Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:15.589Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 12, 21, 'Dia nanatona an’i Filipo avy any Betsaida any Galilia izy ireo, ka niangavy hoe: “Mba te hahita an’i Jesosy izahay, tompoko.”', 'dia nanatona an’i filipo avy any betsaida any galilia izy ireo, ka niangavy hoe: “mba te hahita an’i jesosy izahay, tompoko.”'),
  ('6ab25c77330b89700ce94ec2', '2026-09-22T10:46:15.589Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:15.589Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 12, 5, '“Fa maninona no tsy namidy 300 denaria iny menaka manitra iny, dia nomena ny mahantra ny vola?”', '“fa maninona no tsy namidy 300 denaria iny menaka manitra iny, dia nomena ny mahantra ny vola?”'),
  ('6ab25c77330b89700ce94ee3', '2026-09-22T10:46:15.589Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:15.589Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 12, 38, 'mba ho tanteraka ny tenin’i Isaia mpaminany hoe: “Jehovah ô, iza no mba nino ny zavatra henony taminay? Ary iza no nampisehoan’i Jehovah ny sandriny?”', 'mba ho tanteraka ny tenin’i isaia mpaminany hoe: “jehovah ô, iza no mba nino ny zavatra henony taminay? ary iza no nampisehoan’i jehovah ny sandriny?”'),
  ('6ab25c77330b89700ce94ecd', '2026-09-22T10:46:15.589Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:15.589Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 12, 16, 'Tsy azon’ny mpianany izany tamin’ny voalohany, fa rehefa nomem-boninahitra i Jesosy vao tadidin’izy ireo hoe izany zavatra izany no voasoratra momba azy, ary izany no nitranga taminy.', 'tsy azon’ny mpianany izany tamin’ny voalohany, fa rehefa nomem-boninahitra i jesosy vao tadidin’izy ireo hoe izany zavatra izany no voasoratra momba azy, ary izany no nitranga taminy.'),
  ('6ab25c77330b89700ce94ec0', '2026-09-22T10:46:15.589Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:15.589Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 12, 3, 'Ary naka menaka manitra nilanja iray livatra i Maria. Narda tena izy ilay menaka sady lafo vidy be. Dia nararany teo amin’ny tongotr’i Jesosy ilay izy, ary nohamaininy tamin’ny volony ny tongotr’i Jesosy. Lasa manitra be eran’ny trano, noho ny fofon’ilay menaka.', 'ary naka menaka manitra nilanja iray livatra i maria. narda tena izy ilay menaka sady lafo vidy be. dia nararany teo amin’ny tongotr’i jesosy ilay izy, ary nohamaininy tamin’ny volony ny tongotr’i jesosy. lasa manitra be eran’ny trano, noho ny fofon’ilay menaka.'),
  ('6ab25c787e1a751f7cbdebbe', '2026-09-22T10:46:16.623Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:16.623Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 13, 28, 'Tsy nisy nahafantatra ny antony nilazany an’izany anefa ireo nisakafo teo.', 'tsy nisy nahafantatra ny antony nilazany an’izany anefa ireo nisakafo teo.'),
  ('6ab25c787e1a751f7cbdebb8', '2026-09-22T10:46:16.623Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:16.623Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 13, 22, 'Dia nifampijery ny mpianatra, ka sahiran-tsaina nieritreritra hoe iza no noresahiny.', 'dia nifampijery ny mpianatra, ka sahiran-tsaina nieritreritra hoe iza no noresahiny.'),
  ('6ab25c787e1a751f7cbdebad', '2026-09-22T10:46:16.623Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:16.623Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 13, 11, 'Fantany mantsy ilay hamadika azy, ka izany no nilazany hoe: “Tsy ianareo rehetra no madio.”', 'fantany mantsy ilay hamadika azy, ka izany no nilazany hoe: “tsy ianareo rehetra no madio.”'),
  ('6ab25c787e1a751f7cbdeba3', '2026-09-22T10:46:16.623Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:16.623Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 13, 1, 'Fantatr’i Jesosy talohan’ny fetin’ny Paska fa tonga ny fotoana hialany eo amin’izao tontolo izao sy handehanany ho any amin’ny Ray. Ary satria efa tia ny mpianany eo amin’izao tontolo izao izy, dia tiany hatramin’ny farany izy ireo.', 'fantatr’i jesosy talohan’ny fetin’ny paska fa tonga ny fotoana hialany eo amin’izao tontolo izao sy handehanany ho any amin’ny ray. ary satria efa tia ny mpianany eo amin’izao tontolo izao izy, dia tiany hatramin’ny farany izy ireo.'),
  ('6ab25c787e1a751f7cbdebba', '2026-09-22T10:46:16.623Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:16.623Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 13, 24, 'Koa nanaovan’i Simona Petera fihetsika tamin’ny lohany izy ka noteneniny hoe: “Fa iza, hono, izany resahiny izany?”', 'koa nanaovan’i simona petera fihetsika tamin’ny lohany izy ka noteneniny hoe: “fa iza, hono, izany resahiny izany?”'),
  ('6ab25c787e1a751f7cbdebb9', '2026-09-22T10:46:16.623Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:16.623Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 13, 23, 'Ary efa teo akaikin’i Jesosy ny mpianany anankiray tamin’izay, dia ilay mpianatra tiany.', 'ary efa teo akaikin’i jesosy ny mpianany anankiray tamin’izay, dia ilay mpianatra tiany.'),
  ('6ab25c787e1a751f7cbdeba5', '2026-09-22T10:46:16.623Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:16.623Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 13, 3, 'Efa fantatr’i Jesosy koa fa efa nomen’ny Ray ho eo an-tanany ny zava-drehetra, sady avy tany amin’Andriamanitra izy ka hankany amin’Andriamanitra.', 'efa fantatr’i jesosy koa fa efa nomen’ny ray ho eo an-tanany ny zava-drehetra, sady avy tany amin’andriamanitra izy ka hankany amin’andriamanitra.'),
  ('6ab25c787e1a751f7cbdebbc', '2026-09-22T10:46:16.623Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:16.623Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 13, 26, 'Dia namaly i Jesosy hoe: “Ilay homeko ny sombi-mofo atsoboko ao anaty vilia.” Natsobony tao anaty vilia àry ilay mofo, dia nalainy ka nomeny an’i Jodasy zanak’i Simona Iskariota.', 'dia namaly i jesosy hoe: “ilay homeko ny sombi-mofo atsoboko ao anaty vilia.” natsobony tao anaty vilia àry ilay mofo, dia nalainy ka nomeny an’i jodasy zanak’i simona iskariota.'),
  ('6ab25c787e1a751f7cbdebaa', '2026-09-22T10:46:16.623Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:16.623Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 13, 8, 'Hoy i Petera: “Tsy ianao mihitsy kosa no hanasa ny tongotro e!” Hoy anefa i Jesosy: “Raha tsy sasako ianao, dia tsy ho afaka hiaraka amiko.”', 'hoy i petera: “tsy ianao mihitsy kosa no hanasa ny tongotro e!” hoy anefa i jesosy: “raha tsy sasako ianao, dia tsy ho afaka hiaraka amiko.”'),
  ('6ab25c787e1a751f7cbdeba7', '2026-09-22T10:46:16.623Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:16.623Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 13, 5, 'Avy eo dia nasiany rano tao anaty koveta. Dia nanomboka nanasa ny tongotry ny mpianatra izy, ka nohamaininy tamin’ilay servieta nisikinany ny tongotr’ireo.', 'avy eo dia nasiany rano tao anaty koveta. dia nanomboka nanasa ny tongotry ny mpianatra izy, ka nohamaininy tamin’ilay servieta nisikinany ny tongotr’ireo.'),
  ('6ab25c787e1a751f7cbdeba6', '2026-09-22T10:46:16.623Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:16.623Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 13, 4, 'Koa raha mbola nisakafo izy ireo, dia nitsangana izy, ka napetrany ny akanjony ivelany. Dia naka servieta izy, ka nisikinany.', 'koa raha mbola nisakafo izy ireo, dia nitsangana izy, ka napetrany ny akanjony ivelany. dia naka servieta izy, ka nisikinany.'),
  ('6ab25c787e1a751f7cbdebc5', '2026-09-22T10:46:16.623Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:16.623Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 13, 35, 'Raha mifankatia ianareo, dia izany no hahafantaran’ny olona rehetra fa mpianatro ianareo.”', 'raha mifankatia ianareo, dia izany no hahafantaran’ny olona rehetra fa mpianatro ianareo.”'),
  ('6ab25c787e1a751f7cbdebaf', '2026-09-22T10:46:16.623Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:16.623Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 13, 13, 'Ianareo miantso ahy hoe ‘Mpampianatra’ sy ‘Tompo’, ary marina izany satria izany tokoa aho.', 'ianareo miantso ahy hoe ‘mpampianatra’ sy ‘tompo’, ary marina izany satria izany tokoa aho.'),
  ('6ab25c787e1a751f7cbdebc3', '2026-09-22T10:46:16.623Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:16.623Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 13, 33, 'Kely sisa no iarahako aminareo, ry zanako malalako. Hitady ahy ianareo, ary izay nolazaiko tamin’ny Jiosy ihany no lazaiko aminareo koa izao, hoe: ‘Izay alehako dia tsy azonareo aleha.’', 'kely sisa no iarahako aminareo, ry zanako malalako. hitady ahy ianareo, ary izay nolazaiko tamin’ny jiosy ihany no lazaiko aminareo koa izao, hoe: ‘izay alehako dia tsy azonareo aleha.’'),
  ('6ab25c787e1a751f7cbdebc0', '2026-09-22T10:46:16.623Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:16.623Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 13, 30, 'Tonga dia nivoaka àry izy rehefa nahazo an’ilay sombi-mofo. Efa alina ny andro tamin’izay.', 'tonga dia nivoaka àry izy rehefa nahazo an’ilay sombi-mofo. efa alina ny andro tamin’izay.'),
  ('6ab25c787e1a751f7cbdebbb', '2026-09-22T10:46:16.623Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:16.623Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 13, 25, 'Niankina teo an-tratran’i Jesosy àry ilay mpianatra tiany, ka nanontany hoe: “Fa iza izany, Tompo ô?”', 'niankina teo an-tratran’i jesosy àry ilay mpianatra tiany, ka nanontany hoe: “fa iza izany, tompo ô?”'),
  ('6ab25c787e1a751f7cbdebb5', '2026-09-22T10:46:16.623Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:16.623Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 13, 19, 'Ilazako mialoha ianareo, manomboka izao, amin’izay rehefa tena mitranga izany, dia hino ianareo hoe izaho no izy.', 'ilazako mialoha ianareo, manomboka izao, amin’izay rehefa tena mitranga izany, dia hino ianareo hoe izaho no izy.'),
  ('6ab25c787e1a751f7cbdebb7', '2026-09-22T10:46:16.623Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:16.623Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 13, 21, 'Nitebiteby be i Jesosy rehefa avy nilaza an’izany, ka notsoriny hoe: “Lazaiko marimarina aminareo fa hamadika ahy ny iray aminareo.”', 'nitebiteby be i jesosy rehefa avy nilaza an’izany, ka notsoriny hoe: “lazaiko marimarina aminareo fa hamadika ahy ny iray aminareo.”'),
  ('6ab25c787e1a751f7cbdebb2', '2026-09-22T10:46:16.623Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:16.623Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 13, 16, 'Lazaiko marimarina aminareo fa ny mpanompo tsy lehibe noho ny tompony, ary izay irahina tsy lehibe noho ilay naniraka azy.', 'lazaiko marimarina aminareo fa ny mpanompo tsy lehibe noho ny tompony, ary izay irahina tsy lehibe noho ilay naniraka azy.'),
  ('6ab25c787e1a751f7cbdebb1', '2026-09-22T10:46:16.623Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:16.623Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 13, 15, 'Fa modely no nomeko anareo, mba hanaovanareo hoatran’ny nataoko taminareo koa.', 'fa modely no nomeko anareo, mba hanaovanareo hoatran’ny nataoko taminareo koa.'),
  ('6ab25c787e1a751f7cbdebc2', '2026-09-22T10:46:16.623Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:16.623Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 13, 32, 'Ary Andriamanitra mihitsy no hanome voninahitra azy, ary hanome voninahitra azy avy hatrany.', 'ary andriamanitra mihitsy no hanome voninahitra azy, ary hanome voninahitra azy avy hatrany.'),
  ('6ab25c787e1a751f7cbdebc1', '2026-09-22T10:46:16.623Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:16.623Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 13, 31, 'Rehefa lasa i Jodasy, dia hoy i Jesosy: “Omem-boninahitra ny Zanak’olona izao, ary amin’ny alalany no anomezam-boninahitra an’Andriamanitra.', 'rehefa lasa i jodasy, dia hoy i jesosy: “omem-boninahitra ny zanak’olona izao, ary amin’ny alalany no anomezam-boninahitra an’andriamanitra.'),
  ('6ab25c787e1a751f7cbdebb3', '2026-09-22T10:46:16.623Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:16.623Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 13, 17, 'Raha fantatrareo izany, dia sambatra ianareo raha manao an’izany.', 'raha fantatrareo izany, dia sambatra ianareo raha manao an’izany.'),
  ('6ab25c787e1a751f7cbdeba9', '2026-09-22T10:46:16.623Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:16.623Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 13, 7, 'Namaly azy i Jesosy hoe: “Amin’izao aloha tsy azonao izay ataoko, fa mbola ho azonao ihany any aoriana any.”', 'namaly azy i jesosy hoe: “amin’izao aloha tsy azonao izay ataoko, fa mbola ho azonao ihany any aoriana any.”'),
  ('6ab25c787e1a751f7cbdeba8', '2026-09-22T10:46:16.623Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:16.623Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 13, 6, 'Tonga teo amin’i Simona Petera izy avy eo. Hoy anefa i Petera: “Tompo ô, ianao ve no hanasa ny tongotro?”', 'tonga teo amin’i simona petera izy avy eo. hoy anefa i petera: “tompo ô, ianao ve no hanasa ny tongotro?”'),
  ('6ab25c787e1a751f7cbdebbd', '2026-09-22T10:46:16.623Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:16.623Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 13, 27, 'Rehefa nalain’i Jodasy ilay mofo, dia niditra tao aminy i Satana. Dia hoy i Jesosy taminy: “Ataovy haingana izay ataonao.”', 'rehefa nalain’i jodasy ilay mofo, dia niditra tao aminy i satana. dia hoy i jesosy taminy: “ataovy haingana izay ataonao.”'),
  ('6ab25c787e1a751f7cbdebb6', '2026-09-22T10:46:16.623Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:16.623Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 13, 20, 'Lazaiko marimarina aminareo fa izay mandray an’izay irahiko dia mandray ahy, ary izay mandray ahy dia mandray an’Ilay naniraka ahy koa.”', 'lazaiko marimarina aminareo fa izay mandray an’izay irahiko dia mandray ahy, ary izay mandray ahy dia mandray an’ilay naniraka ahy koa.”'),
  ('6ab25c787e1a751f7cbdebc4', '2026-09-22T10:46:16.623Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:16.623Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 13, 34, 'Izao no didy vaovao omeko anareo: Mifankatiava ianareo, ka hoatran’ny nitiavako anareo no tokony mba hifankatiavanareo koa.', 'izao no didy vaovao omeko anareo: mifankatiava ianareo, ka hoatran’ny nitiavako anareo no tokony mba hifankatiavanareo koa.'),
  ('6ab25c787e1a751f7cbdebab', '2026-09-22T10:46:16.623Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:16.623Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 13, 9, 'Dia hoy i Simona Petera: “Tompo ô, tsy ny tongotro ihany àry sasana, fa ny tanako sy ny lohako koa e!”', 'dia hoy i simona petera: “tompo ô, tsy ny tongotro ihany àry sasana, fa ny tanako sy ny lohako koa e!”'),
  ('6ab25c787e1a751f7cbdebc8', '2026-09-22T10:46:16.623Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:16.623Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 13, 38, 'Dia hoy i Jesosy: “Tena hahafoy ny ainao ho ahy tokoa ve ianao? Lazaiko marimarina aminao fa mbola tsy maneno akory ny akoho, dia efa handa ahy intelo ianao.”', 'dia hoy i jesosy: “tena hahafoy ny ainao ho ahy tokoa ve ianao? lazaiko marimarina aminao fa mbola tsy maneno akory ny akoho, dia efa handa ahy intelo ianao.”'),
  ('6ab25c787e1a751f7cbdeba4', '2026-09-22T10:46:16.623Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:16.623Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 13, 2, 'Mbola nisakafo hariva izy ireo tamin’izay. Ary efa nataon’ny Devoly tao am-pon’i Jodasy Iskariota, zanak’i Simona, ny faniriana hamadika azy.', 'mbola nisakafo hariva izy ireo tamin’izay. ary efa nataon’ny devoly tao am-pon’i jodasy iskariota, zanak’i simona, ny faniriana hamadika azy.'),
  ('6ab25c787e1a751f7cbdebb4', '2026-09-22T10:46:16.623Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:16.623Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 13, 18, 'Tsy ianareo rehetra no resahiko amin’izany, fa fantatro izay nofidiko. Tsy maintsy mitranga anefa izany mba ho tanteraka ny Soratra Masina hoe: ‘Ilay niara-nihinana mofo tamiko no nanainga ny voditongony hamely ahy.’', 'tsy ianareo rehetra no resahiko amin’izany, fa fantatro izay nofidiko. tsy maintsy mitranga anefa izany mba ho tanteraka ny soratra masina hoe: ‘ilay niara-nihinana mofo tamiko no nanainga ny voditongony hamely ahy.’'),
  ('6ab25c787e1a751f7cbdebae', '2026-09-22T10:46:16.623Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:16.623Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 13, 12, 'Rehefa voasasany ny tongotr’izy ireo, dia nanaovany ny akanjony ivelany. Dia naka toerana teo amin’ny latabatra indray izy, ka niteny hoe: “Azonareo ve ilay nataoko taminareo teo?', 'rehefa voasasany ny tongotr’izy ireo, dia nanaovany ny akanjony ivelany. dia naka toerana teo amin’ny latabatra indray izy, ka niteny hoe: “azonareo ve ilay nataoko taminareo teo?'),
  ('6ab25c787e1a751f7cbdebbf', '2026-09-22T10:46:16.623Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:16.623Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 13, 29, 'Nisy aza nieritreritra hoe satria i Jodasy no nitazona ny boatim-bola, dia nilaza taminy i Jesosy hoe: “Vidio izay ilaintsika amin’ny fety”, na hoe tokony hanao fanomezana ho an’ny mahantra izy.', 'nisy aza nieritreritra hoe satria i jodasy no nitazona ny boatim-bola, dia nilaza taminy i jesosy hoe: “vidio izay ilaintsika amin’ny fety”, na hoe tokony hanao fanomezana ho an’ny mahantra izy.'),
  ('6ab25c787e1a751f7cbdebb0', '2026-09-22T10:46:16.623Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:16.623Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 13, 14, 'Koa raha izaho Tompo sy Mpampianatra aza nanasa ny tongotrareo, dia ianareo koa mba tokony hifanasa tongotra.', 'koa raha izaho tompo sy mpampianatra aza nanasa ny tongotrareo, dia ianareo koa mba tokony hifanasa tongotra.'),
  ('6ab25c787e1a751f7cbdebc7', '2026-09-22T10:46:16.623Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:16.623Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 13, 37, 'Ary hoy i Petera: “Tompo ô, fa maninona aho izao no tsy afaka manaraka anao? Na ny aiko aza ange hafoiko ho anao e!”', 'ary hoy i petera: “tompo ô, fa maninona aho izao no tsy afaka manaraka anao? na ny aiko aza ange hafoiko ho anao e!”'),
  ('6ab25c787e1a751f7cbdebc6', '2026-09-22T10:46:16.623Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:16.623Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 13, 36, 'Hoy i Simona Petera: “Fa ho aiza ianao, Tompo ô?” Dia hoy i Jesosy: “Tsy afaka manaraka ahy any amin’izay alehako ianao izao, nefa hanaraka ahy ihany any aoriana any.”', 'hoy i simona petera: “fa ho aiza ianao, tompo ô?” dia hoy i jesosy: “tsy afaka manaraka ahy any amin’izay alehako ianao izao, nefa hanaraka ahy ihany any aoriana any.”'),
  ('6ab25c787e1a751f7cbdebac', '2026-09-22T10:46:16.623Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:16.623Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 13, 10, 'Ary hoy i Jesosy: “Izay efa avy nandro dia efa madio tanteraka, ka ny tongony ihany sisa no mila sasana. Efa madio ianareo, saingy tsy ianareo rehetra.”', 'ary hoy i jesosy: “izay efa avy nandro dia efa madio tanteraka, ka ny tongony ihany sisa no mila sasana. efa madio ianareo, saingy tsy ianareo rehetra.”'),
  ('6ab25c7915154a731426a4b3', '2026-09-22T10:46:17.130Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:17.130Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 14, 7, 'Raha efa nahalala ahy ianareo, dia ho efa nahalala ny Raiko koa. Fantatrareo izy manomboka izao, sady efa hitanareo.”', 'raha efa nahalala ahy ianareo, dia ho efa nahalala ny raiko koa. fantatrareo izy manomboka izao, sady efa hitanareo.”'),
  ('6ab25c7915154a731426a4b2', '2026-09-22T10:46:17.130Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:17.130Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 14, 6, 'Hoy i Jesosy: “Izaho no lalana sy fahamarinana ary fiainana. Tsy misy olona mankany amin’ny Ray afa-tsy amin’ny alalako.', 'hoy i jesosy: “izaho no lalana sy fahamarinana ary fiainana. tsy misy olona mankany amin’ny ray afa-tsy amin’ny alalako.'),
  ('6ab25c7915154a731426a4b5', '2026-09-22T10:46:17.130Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:17.130Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 14, 9, 'Dia hoy i Jesosy: “Efa izay ela izay aho no niaraka taminareo, dia mbola tsy mahafantatra ahy ihany ve ianao, ry Filipo? Izay nahita ahy dia nahita ny Ray koa. Koa maninona ianao no miteny hoe: ‘Asehoy anay ny Ray’?', 'dia hoy i jesosy: “efa izay ela izay aho no niaraka taminareo, dia mbola tsy mahafantatra ahy ihany ve ianao, ry filipo? izay nahita ahy dia nahita ny ray koa. koa maninona ianao no miteny hoe: ‘asehoy anay ny ray’?'),
  ('6ab25c7915154a731426a4ad', '2026-09-22T10:46:17.130Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:17.130Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 14, 1, '“Aza avela hitebiteby ny fonareo. Minoa an’Andriamanitra, dia minoa ahy koa.', '“aza avela hitebiteby ny fonareo. minoa an’andriamanitra, dia minoa ahy koa.'),
  ('6ab25c7915154a731426a4b0', '2026-09-22T10:46:17.130Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:17.130Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 14, 4, 'Ary fantatrareo ny lalana mankany amin’izay alehako.”', 'ary fantatrareo ny lalana mankany amin’izay alehako.”'),
  ('6ab25c7915154a731426a4ae', '2026-09-22T10:46:17.130Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:17.130Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 14, 2, 'Ao an-tranon’ny Raiko misy fonenana be dia be. Tsy ho niteny an’izany taminareo aho raha tsy nisy izany. Handeha hanomana toerana ho anareo mantsy aho.', 'ao an-tranon’ny raiko misy fonenana be dia be. tsy ho niteny an’izany taminareo aho raha tsy nisy izany. handeha hanomana toerana ho anareo mantsy aho.'),
  ('6ab25c7915154a731426a4b1', '2026-09-22T10:46:17.130Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:17.130Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 14, 5, 'Dia hoy i Tomasy: “Tompo ô, tsy fantatray ange izay alehanao e! Koa ahoana no ahafantaranay ny lalana mankany?”', 'dia hoy i tomasy: “tompo ô, tsy fantatray ange izay alehanao e! koa ahoana no ahafantaranay ny lalana mankany?”'),
  ('6ab25c7915154a731426a4b4', '2026-09-22T10:46:17.130Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:17.130Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 14, 8, 'Hoy i Filipo: “Tompo ô, asehoy anay ny Ray dia efa ampy anay izany.”', 'hoy i filipo: “tompo ô, asehoy anay ny ray dia efa ampy anay izany.”'),
  ('6ab25c7915154a731426a4af', '2026-09-22T10:46:17.130Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:17.130Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 14, 3, 'Ary rehefa lasa aho dia hanomana toerana ho anareo, ary ho avy indray ka handray anareo any amiko. Amin’izay dia izay misy ahy no hisy anareo koa.', 'ary rehefa lasa aho dia hanomana toerana ho anareo, ary ho avy indray ka handray anareo any amiko. amin’izay dia izay misy ahy no hisy anareo koa.'),
  ('6ab25c7915154a731426a4c7', '2026-09-22T10:46:17.131Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:17.131Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 14, 27, 'Fiadanana no avelako ho anareo. Omeko anareo ny fiadanako. Hafa mihitsy anefa ny fomba anomezako azy, fa tsy hoatran’ny an’izao tontolo izao. Aza avela hitebiteby na hatahotra àry ny fonareo.', 'fiadanana no avelako ho anareo. omeko anareo ny fiadanako. hafa mihitsy anefa ny fomba anomezako azy, fa tsy hoatran’ny an’izao tontolo izao. aza avela hitebiteby na hatahotra àry ny fonareo.'),
  ('6ab25c7915154a731426a4b8', '2026-09-22T10:46:17.131Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:17.131Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 14, 12, 'Lazaiko marimarina aminareo fa izay maneho finoana ahy, dia hanao ny asa ataoko koa. Hanao asa lehibe noho izany aza izy, satria izaho hankany amin’ny Ray.', 'lazaiko marimarina aminareo fa izay maneho finoana ahy, dia hanao ny asa ataoko koa. hanao asa lehibe noho izany aza izy, satria izaho hankany amin’ny ray.'),
  ('6ab25c7915154a731426a4c6', '2026-09-22T10:46:17.131Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:17.131Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 14, 26, 'Ilay mpanampy, izany hoe ny fanahy masina, izay hirahin’ny Ray amin’ny anarako, anefa no hampianatra anareo ny zava-drehetra, sady hampahatsiahy anareo an’izay rehetra nolazaiko taminareo.', 'ilay mpanampy, izany hoe ny fanahy masina, izay hirahin’ny ray amin’ny anarako, anefa no hampianatra anareo ny zava-drehetra, sady hampahatsiahy anareo an’izay rehetra nolazaiko taminareo.'),
  ('6ab25c7915154a731426a4cb', '2026-09-22T10:46:17.131Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:17.131Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 14, 31, 'Fa mba hahafantaran’izao tontolo izao fa tiako ny Ray, dia izay nasain’ny Ray nataoko mihitsy no ataoko. Mitsangàna dia andao isika hiala eto.', 'fa mba hahafantaran’izao tontolo izao fa tiako ny ray, dia izay nasain’ny ray nataoko mihitsy no ataoko. mitsangàna dia andao isika hiala eto.'),
  ('6ab25c7915154a731426a4c9', '2026-09-22T10:46:17.131Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:17.131Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 14, 29, 'Efa nolazaiko taminareo mialoha izany, amin’izay ianareo mino rehefa tena mitranga izany.', 'efa nolazaiko taminareo mialoha izany, amin’izay ianareo mino rehefa tena mitranga izany.'),
  ('6ab25c7915154a731426a4ba', '2026-09-22T10:46:17.131Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:17.131Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 14, 14, 'Raha mangataka zavatra amin’ny anarako ianareo, na inona izany na inona, dia hataoko.', 'raha mangataka zavatra amin’ny anarako ianareo, na inona izany na inona, dia hataoko.'),
  ('6ab25c7915154a731426a4be', '2026-09-22T10:46:17.131Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:17.131Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 14, 18, 'Tsy hamela anareo ho irery aho, fa hiverina atỳ aminareo.', 'tsy hamela anareo ho irery aho, fa hiverina atỳ aminareo.'),
  ('6ab25c7915154a731426a4b6', '2026-09-22T10:46:17.131Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:17.131Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 14, 10, 'Tsy mino angaha ianao hoe izaho tafaray amin’ny Ray, ary ny Ray tafaray amiko? Tsy ny hevitro fotsiny no lazaiko aminareo, fa ny Ray izay tafaray foana amiko no manao ny asany.', 'tsy mino angaha ianao hoe izaho tafaray amin’ny ray, ary ny ray tafaray amiko? tsy ny hevitro fotsiny no lazaiko aminareo, fa ny ray izay tafaray foana amiko no manao ny asany.'),
  ('6ab25c7915154a731426a4ca', '2026-09-22T10:46:17.131Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:17.131Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 14, 30, 'Tsy hiteny betsaka aminareo intsony aho, fa efa ho avy ilay mpitondra an’izao tontolo izao. Tsy manana fahefana amiko anefa izy.', 'tsy hiteny betsaka aminareo intsony aho, fa efa ho avy ilay mpitondra an’izao tontolo izao. tsy manana fahefana amiko anefa izy.'),
  ('6ab25c7915154a731426a4bf', '2026-09-22T10:46:17.131Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:17.131Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 14, 19, 'Kely sisa dia tsy hahita ahy intsony izao tontolo izao, fa ianareo no hahita ahy, satria velona aho dia ho velona ianareo.', 'kely sisa dia tsy hahita ahy intsony izao tontolo izao, fa ianareo no hahita ahy, satria velona aho dia ho velona ianareo.'),
  ('6ab25c7915154a731426a4c8', '2026-09-22T10:46:17.131Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:17.131Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 14, 28, 'Efa henonareo ilay teniko taminareo hoe: ‘Handeha aho, dia hiverina atỳ aminareo indray.’ Raha tia ahy ianareo, dia ho faly hoe handeha ho any amin’ny Ray aho, satria ny Ray dia lehibe noho izaho.', 'efa henonareo ilay teniko taminareo hoe: ‘handeha aho, dia hiverina atỳ aminareo indray.’ raha tia ahy ianareo, dia ho faly hoe handeha ho any amin’ny ray aho, satria ny ray dia lehibe noho izaho.'),
  ('6ab25c7915154a731426a4c3', '2026-09-22T10:46:17.131Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:17.131Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 14, 23, 'Dia namaly i Jesosy hoe: “Raha misy tia ahy, dia hankatò ny teniko izy, ka ho tian’ny Raiko. Dia hankany aminy izahay ary hiara-mipetraka aminy.', 'dia namaly i jesosy hoe: “raha misy tia ahy, dia hankatò ny teniko izy, ka ho tian’ny raiko. dia hankany aminy izahay ary hiara-mipetraka aminy.'),
  ('6ab25c7915154a731426a4b9', '2026-09-22T10:46:17.131Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:17.131Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 14, 13, 'Ary izay rehetra angatahinareo amin’ny anarako, dia hataoko mba hanomezam-boninahitra ny Ray amin’ny alalan’ny Zanaka.', 'ary izay rehetra angatahinareo amin’ny anarako, dia hataoko mba hanomezam-boninahitra ny ray amin’ny alalan’ny zanaka.'),
  ('6ab25c7915154a731426a4bc', '2026-09-22T10:46:17.131Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:17.131Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 14, 16, 'Ary hangataka amin’ny Ray aho, ka homeny mpanampy hafa ianareo, mba ho eo aminareo mandrakizay,', 'ary hangataka amin’ny ray aho, ka homeny mpanampy hafa ianareo, mba ho eo aminareo mandrakizay,'),
  ('6ab25c7915154a731426a4b7', '2026-09-22T10:46:17.131Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:17.131Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 14, 11, 'Minoa ny teniko hoe izaho tafaray amin’ny Ray ary ny Ray tafaray amiko. Raha tsy izany, dia minoa na dia noho ny asa ataoko fotsiny aza.', 'minoa ny teniko hoe izaho tafaray amin’ny ray ary ny ray tafaray amiko. raha tsy izany, dia minoa na dia noho ny asa ataoko fotsiny aza.'),
  ('6ab25c7915154a731426a4c1', '2026-09-22T10:46:17.131Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:17.131Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 14, 21, 'Izay manaiky ny didiko ka mankatò an’izany, dia izy no tia ahy. Ary izay tia ahy dia ho tian’ny Raiko. Ho tia azy aho, ka hataoko izay hahafantarany tsara ahy.”', 'izay manaiky ny didiko ka mankatò an’izany, dia izy no tia ahy. ary izay tia ahy dia ho tian’ny raiko. ho tia azy aho, ka hataoko izay hahafantarany tsara ahy.”'),
  ('6ab25c7915154a731426a4c0', '2026-09-22T10:46:17.131Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:17.131Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 14, 20, 'Amin’izay andro izay dia ho fantatrareo fa izaho tafaray amin’ny Raiko, dia ianareo tafaray amiko, ary izaho tafaray aminareo.', 'amin’izay andro izay dia ho fantatrareo fa izaho tafaray amin’ny raiko, dia ianareo tafaray amiko, ary izaho tafaray aminareo.'),
  ('6ab25c7915154a731426a4c4', '2026-09-22T10:46:17.131Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:17.131Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 14, 24, 'Izay tsy tia ahy dia tsy mba mankatò ny teniko. Tsy ahy ny teny renareo, fa an’ilay Ray naniraka ahy.', 'izay tsy tia ahy dia tsy mba mankatò ny teniko. tsy ahy ny teny renareo, fa an’ilay ray naniraka ahy.'),
  ('6ab25c7915154a731426a4bb', '2026-09-22T10:46:17.131Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:17.131Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 14, 15, '“Raha tia ahy ianareo, dia hankatò ny didiko.', '“raha tia ahy ianareo, dia hankatò ny didiko.'),
  ('6ab25c7915154a731426a4c5', '2026-09-22T10:46:17.131Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:17.131Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 14, 25, '“Lazaiko aminareo izany, dieny mbola eto aminareo aho.', '“lazaiko aminareo izany, dieny mbola eto aminareo aho.'),
  ('6ab25c7915154a731426a4c2', '2026-09-22T10:46:17.131Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:17.131Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 14, 22, 'Hoy i Jodasy—tsy ilay Iskariota—: “Tompo ô, fa maninona no hoe izahay no hataonao mahafantatra tsara anao, fa tsy izao tontolo izao?”', 'hoy i jodasy—tsy ilay iskariota—: “tompo ô, fa maninona no hoe izahay no hataonao mahafantatra tsara anao, fa tsy izao tontolo izao?”'),
  ('6ab25c7915154a731426a4bd', '2026-09-22T10:46:17.131Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:17.131Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 14, 17, 'dia ny fanahin’ny fahamarinana. Tsy afaka mahazo azy io izao tontolo izao, satria tsy hitany na fantany izy io. Ianareo no mahalala azy io, satria eo aminareo foana izy io sady ao anatinareo.', 'dia ny fanahin’ny fahamarinana. tsy afaka mahazo azy io izao tontolo izao, satria tsy hitany na fantany izy io. ianareo no mahalala azy io, satria eo aminareo foana izy io sady ao anatinareo.'),
  ('6ab25c7947edc5d699613055', '2026-09-22T10:46:17.576Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:17.576Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 15, 19, 'Raha anisan’izao tontolo izao ianareo, dia ho tian’izao tontolo izao satria azy. Fa satria tsy anisan’izao tontolo izao ianareo, fa efa nofidiko avy teo amin’izao tontolo izao, dia halan’izao tontolo izao ianareo.', 'raha anisan’izao tontolo izao ianareo, dia ho tian’izao tontolo izao satria azy. fa satria tsy anisan’izao tontolo izao ianareo, fa efa nofidiko avy teo amin’izao tontolo izao, dia halan’izao tontolo izao ianareo.'),
  ('6ab25c7947edc5d699613046', '2026-09-22T10:46:17.576Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:17.576Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 15, 4, 'Miezaha ho tafaray amiko foana, dia ho tafaray aminareo foana koa aho. Tsy afaka mamoa irery ny sampam-boaloboka raha tsy mikambana amin’ny voaloboka. Tsy afaka mamoa koa ianareo raha tsy tafaray amiko foana.', 'miezaha ho tafaray amiko foana, dia ho tafaray aminareo foana koa aho. tsy afaka mamoa irery ny sampam-boaloboka raha tsy mikambana amin’ny voaloboka. tsy afaka mamoa koa ianareo raha tsy tafaray amiko foana.'),
  ('6ab25c7947edc5d69961304b', '2026-09-22T10:46:17.576Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:17.576Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 15, 9, 'Mitovy amin’ny itiavan’ny Ray ahy no itiavako anareo. Koa ataovy foana izay hitiavako anareo.', 'mitovy amin’ny itiavan’ny ray ahy no itiavako anareo. koa ataovy foana izay hitiavako anareo.'),
  ('6ab25c7947edc5d699613057', '2026-09-22T10:46:17.576Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:17.576Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 15, 21, 'Noho ny anarako anefa no hanaovany an’izany rehetra izany aminareo, satria tsy fantany Ilay naniraka ahy.', 'noho ny anarako anefa no hanaovany an’izany rehetra izany aminareo, satria tsy fantany ilay naniraka ahy.'),
  ('6ab25c7947edc5d699613054', '2026-09-22T10:46:17.576Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:17.576Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 15, 18, 'Raha halan’izao tontolo izao ianareo, dia fantaro fa izaho efa halany talohanareo.', 'raha halan’izao tontolo izao ianareo, dia fantaro fa izaho efa halany talohanareo.'),
  ('6ab25c7947edc5d699613052', '2026-09-22T10:46:17.576Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:17.576Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 15, 16, 'Tsy ianareo no nifidy ahy, fa izaho no nifidy anareo. Notendreko hamokatra foana ianareo, sady hamokatra voa maharitra eo foana. Amin’izay dia homen’ny Ray anareo izay rehetra angatahinareo aminy amin’ny anarako.', 'tsy ianareo no nifidy ahy, fa izaho no nifidy anareo. notendreko hamokatra foana ianareo, sady hamokatra voa maharitra eo foana. amin’izay dia homen’ny ray anareo izay rehetra angatahinareo aminy amin’ny anarako.'),
  ('6ab25c7947edc5d69961305b', '2026-09-22T10:46:17.576Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:17.576Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 15, 25, 'Mitranga anefa izany mba ho tanteraka ilay voasoratra ao amin’ny Lalàna hoe: ‘Nankahala ahy tsy amin’antony izy ireo.’', 'mitranga anefa izany mba ho tanteraka ilay voasoratra ao amin’ny lalàna hoe: ‘nankahala ahy tsy amin’antony izy ireo.’'),
  ('6ab25c7947edc5d69961304e', '2026-09-22T10:46:17.576Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:17.576Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 15, 12, 'Izao no didiko: “Mifankatiava ianareo, hoatran’ny nitiavako anareo.', 'izao no didiko: “mifankatiava ianareo, hoatran’ny nitiavako anareo.'),
  ('6ab25c7947edc5d699613047', '2026-09-22T10:46:17.576Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:17.576Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 15, 5, 'Izaho no voaloboka dia ianareo no sampany. Izay tafaray amiko foana ary izaho tafaray aminy, dia izy no mamoa be. Fa tsy afaka manao na inona na inona mihitsy ianareo raha misaraka amiko.', 'izaho no voaloboka dia ianareo no sampany. izay tafaray amiko foana ary izaho tafaray aminy, dia izy no mamoa be. fa tsy afaka manao na inona na inona mihitsy ianareo raha misaraka amiko.'),
  ('6ab25c7947edc5d699613051', '2026-09-22T10:46:17.576Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:17.576Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 15, 15, 'Tsy antsoiko hoe mpanompo intsony ianareo, satria ny mpanompo tsy mahalala izay ataon’ny tompony. Fa antsoiko hoe namana kosa ianareo, satria ampahafantariko anareo daholo izay henoko tamin’ny Raiko.', 'tsy antsoiko hoe mpanompo intsony ianareo, satria ny mpanompo tsy mahalala izay ataon’ny tompony. fa antsoiko hoe namana kosa ianareo, satria ampahafantariko anareo daholo izay henoko tamin’ny raiko.'),
  ('6ab25c7947edc5d699613048', '2026-09-22T10:46:17.576Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:17.576Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 15, 6, 'Raha misy miala amiko, dia lasa hoatran’ny sampany ariana eny ivelany izy ka malazo. Ary angonin’ny olona ireny, dia atsipiny ao anaty afo ka may.', 'raha misy miala amiko, dia lasa hoatran’ny sampany ariana eny ivelany izy ka malazo. ary angonin’ny olona ireny, dia atsipiny ao anaty afo ka may.'),
  ('6ab25c7947edc5d69961305a', '2026-09-22T10:46:17.576Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:17.576Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 15, 24, 'Tsy ho meloka izy, raha tsy nataoko teo aminy ireny fahagagana mbola tsy nisy nanao ireny. Izao anefa izy sady nahita ahy no mbola mankahala ahy sy ny Raiko koa.', 'tsy ho meloka izy, raha tsy nataoko teo aminy ireny fahagagana mbola tsy nisy nanao ireny. izao anefa izy sady nahita ahy no mbola mankahala ahy sy ny raiko koa.'),
  ('6ab25c7947edc5d699613059', '2026-09-22T10:46:17.576Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:17.576Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 15, 23, 'Izay mankahala ahy dia mankahala ny Raiko.', 'izay mankahala ahy dia mankahala ny raiko.'),
  ('6ab25c7947edc5d69961305d', '2026-09-22T10:46:17.576Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:17.576Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 15, 27, 'Dia ianareo indray avy eo no hanome porofo momba ahy, satria ianareo efa niaraka tamiko hatramin’ny voalohany.', 'dia ianareo indray avy eo no hanome porofo momba ahy, satria ianareo efa niaraka tamiko hatramin’ny voalohany.'),
  ('6ab25c7947edc5d69961304d', '2026-09-22T10:46:17.576Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:17.576Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 15, 11, '“Lazaiko aminareo izany mba ho faly hoatr’ahy ianareo, sady mba ho feno izany fifalianareo izany.', '“lazaiko aminareo izany mba ho faly hoatr’ahy ianareo, sady mba ho feno izany fifalianareo izany.'),
  ('6ab25c7947edc5d69961304c', '2026-09-22T10:46:17.576Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:17.576Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 15, 10, 'Raha mankatò ny didiko ianareo, dia hataonareo foana izay hitiavako anareo. Izaho koa mantsy mankatò ny didin’ny Ray sady ataoko foana izay hitiavany ahy.', 'raha mankatò ny didiko ianareo, dia hataonareo foana izay hitiavako anareo. izaho koa mantsy mankatò ny didin’ny ray sady ataoko foana izay hitiavany ahy.'),
  ('6ab25c7947edc5d699613043', '2026-09-22T10:46:17.576Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:17.576Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 15, 1, '“Izaho no tena voaloboka, ary ny Raiko no mpamboly.', '“izaho no tena voaloboka, ary ny raiko no mpamboly.'),
  ('6ab25c7947edc5d69961304a', '2026-09-22T10:46:17.576Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:17.576Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 15, 8, 'Mahazo voninahitra ny Raiko rehefa mamoa be foana ianareo sady asehonareo hoe mpianatro ianareo.', 'mahazo voninahitra ny raiko rehefa mamoa be foana ianareo sady asehonareo hoe mpianatro ianareo.'),
  ('6ab25c7947edc5d699613049', '2026-09-22T10:46:17.576Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:17.576Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 15, 7, 'Angataho izay tianareo fa homena anareo izany, raha tafaray amiko foana ianareo sady ao am-ponareo foana ny teniko.', 'angataho izay tianareo fa homena anareo izany, raha tafaray amiko foana ianareo sady ao am-ponareo foana ny teniko.'),
  ('6ab25c7947edc5d699613044', '2026-09-22T10:46:17.576Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:17.576Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 15, 2, 'Esoriny daholo izay sampany rehetra tsy mamoa eo amiko. Fa izay mamoa kosa rantsanany mba hadio, amin’izay misy voany betsaka kokoa.', 'esoriny daholo izay sampany rehetra tsy mamoa eo amiko. fa izay mamoa kosa rantsanany mba hadio, amin’izay misy voany betsaka kokoa.'),
  ('6ab25c7947edc5d699613050', '2026-09-22T10:46:17.576Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:17.576Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 15, 14, 'Ho namako ianareo raha mankatò ny didy omeko anareo.', 'ho namako ianareo raha mankatò ny didy omeko anareo.'),
  ('6ab25c7947edc5d69961304f', '2026-09-22T10:46:17.576Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:17.576Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 15, 13, 'Tsy misy manana fitiavana lehibe noho izao, dia ny mahafoy ny ainy ho an’ny namany.', 'tsy misy manana fitiavana lehibe noho izao, dia ny mahafoy ny ainy ho an’ny namany.'),
  ('6ab25c7947edc5d699613053', '2026-09-22T10:46:17.576Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:17.576Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 15, 17, '“Ireo no didy omeko anareo, amin’izay ianareo mifankatia.', '“ireo no didy omeko anareo, amin’izay ianareo mifankatia.'),
  ('6ab25c7947edc5d69961305c', '2026-09-22T10:46:17.576Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:17.576Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 15, 26, 'Ho tonga ilay mpanampy hirahiko ho any aminareo avy any amin’ny Ray, dia ny fanahin’ny fahamarinana. Rehefa tonga io mpanampy avy any amin’ny Ray io, dia hanome porofo momba ahy.', 'ho tonga ilay mpanampy hirahiko ho any aminareo avy any amin’ny ray, dia ny fanahin’ny fahamarinana. rehefa tonga io mpanampy avy any amin’ny ray io, dia hanome porofo momba ahy.'),
  ('6ab25c7947edc5d699613058', '2026-09-22T10:46:17.576Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:17.576Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 15, 22, 'Raha ohatra ka tsy tonga aho sady tsy niteny taminy, dia tsy ho meloka izy. Izao anefa izy tsy manana fialan-tsiny amin’ny fahotany.', 'raha ohatra ka tsy tonga aho sady tsy niteny taminy, dia tsy ho meloka izy. izao anefa izy tsy manana fialan-tsiny amin’ny fahotany.'),
  ('6ab25c7947edc5d699613045', '2026-09-22T10:46:17.576Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:17.576Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 15, 3, 'Efa madio ianareo, noho ny teny nolazaiko taminareo.', 'efa madio ianareo, noho ny teny nolazaiko taminareo.'),
  ('6ab25c7947edc5d699613056', '2026-09-22T10:46:17.576Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:17.576Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 15, 20, 'Tadidio ilay teniko taminareo hoe: Tsy lehibe noho ny tompony ny mpanompo. Raha nanenjika ahy izy, dia hanenjika anareo koa. Ary raha nankatò ny teniko izy, dia hankatò ny teninareo koa.', 'tadidio ilay teniko taminareo hoe: tsy lehibe noho ny tompony ny mpanompo. raha nanenjika ahy izy, dia hanenjika anareo koa. ary raha nankatò ny teniko izy, dia hankatò ny teninareo koa.'),
  ('6ab25c7a1e09198ff0f888c4', '2026-09-22T10:46:18.335Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:18.335Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 16, 1, '“Nilaza an’izany taminareo aho, mba tsy ho levona ny finoanareo.', '“nilaza an’izany taminareo aho, mba tsy ho levona ny finoanareo.'),
  ('6ab25c7a1e09198ff0f888c5', '2026-09-22T10:46:18.335Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:18.335Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 16, 2, 'Horoahin’ny olona hiala amin’ny synagoga ianareo. Mbola ho avy aza ny fotoana hiheveran’izay mamono anareo hoe manao fanompoana masina ho an’Andriamanitra izy rehefa manao an’izany.', 'horoahin’ny olona hiala amin’ny synagoga ianareo. mbola ho avy aza ny fotoana hiheveran’izay mamono anareo hoe manao fanompoana masina ho an’andriamanitra izy rehefa manao an’izany.'),
  ('6ab25c7a1e09198ff0f888c6', '2026-09-22T10:46:18.335Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:18.335Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 16, 3, 'Hanao an’izany izy, satria mbola tsy fantany na izaho na ny Ray.', 'hanao an’izany izy, satria mbola tsy fantany na izaho na ny ray.'),
  ('6ab25c7a1e09198ff0f888c7', '2026-09-22T10:46:18.335Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:18.335Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 16, 4, 'Noteneniko anareo anefa izany, amin’izay rehefa tonga ny fotoana itrangan’izany, dia ho tadidinareo hoe efa niteny an’izany taminareo aho. “Tsy noteneniko anareo izany tamin’ny voalohany, satria mbola teo aminareo aho.', 'noteneniko anareo anefa izany, amin’izay rehefa tonga ny fotoana itrangan’izany, dia ho tadidinareo hoe efa niteny an’izany taminareo aho. “tsy noteneniko anareo izany tamin’ny voalohany, satria mbola teo aminareo aho.'),
  ('6ab25c7a1e09198ff0f888c8', '2026-09-22T10:46:18.335Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:18.335Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 16, 5, 'Handeha ho any amin’Ilay naniraka ahy aho izao, nefa tsy misy manontany ahy ianareo hoe: ‘Ho aiza ianao?’', 'handeha ho any amin’ilay naniraka ahy aho izao, nefa tsy misy manontany ahy ianareo hoe: ‘ho aiza ianao?’'),
  ('6ab25c7a1e09198ff0f888c9', '2026-09-22T10:46:18.335Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:18.335Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 16, 6, 'Malahelo be mantsy ny fonareo satria niteny anareo an’izany aho.', 'malahelo be mantsy ny fonareo satria niteny anareo an’izany aho.'),
  ('6ab25c7a1e09198ff0f888ca', '2026-09-22T10:46:18.335Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:18.335Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 16, 7, 'Lazaiko aminareo anefa fa tena mahasoa anareo ny handehanako, satria raha tsy mandeha aho, dia tsy ho tonga atỳ aminareo ilay mpanampy. Raha mandeha anefa aho, dia hirahiko ho atỳ aminareo izy.', 'lazaiko aminareo anefa fa tena mahasoa anareo ny handehanako, satria raha tsy mandeha aho, dia tsy ho tonga atỳ aminareo ilay mpanampy. raha mandeha anefa aho, dia hirahiko ho atỳ aminareo izy.'),
  ('6ab25c7a1e09198ff0f888cb', '2026-09-22T10:46:18.335Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:18.335Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 16, 8, 'Ary rehefa tonga izy, dia hanome porofo mampiaiky an’izao tontolo izao momba ny fahotana, sy momba ny fahamarinana, ary momba ny fitsarana.', 'ary rehefa tonga izy, dia hanome porofo mampiaiky an’izao tontolo izao momba ny fahotana, sy momba ny fahamarinana, ary momba ny fitsarana.'),
  ('6ab25c7a1e09198ff0f888cc', '2026-09-22T10:46:18.335Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:18.335Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 16, 9, 'Voalohany, porofo momba ny fahotana, satria tsy mino ahy izy ireo.', 'voalohany, porofo momba ny fahotana, satria tsy mino ahy izy ireo.'),
  ('6ab25c7a1e09198ff0f888cd', '2026-09-22T10:46:18.335Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:18.335Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 16, 10, 'Avy eo, porofo momba ny fahamarinana, satria ho any amin’ny Ray aho ka tsy ho hitanareo intsony.', 'avy eo, porofo momba ny fahamarinana, satria ho any amin’ny ray aho ka tsy ho hitanareo intsony.'),
  ('6ab25c7a1e09198ff0f888ce', '2026-09-22T10:46:18.335Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:18.335Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 16, 11, 'Ary farany, porofo momba ny fitsarana, satria efa voatsara ilay mpitondra an’izao tontolo izao.', 'ary farany, porofo momba ny fitsarana, satria efa voatsara ilay mpitondra an’izao tontolo izao.'),
  ('6ab25c7a1e09198ff0f888cf', '2026-09-22T10:46:18.335Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:18.335Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 16, 12, '“Mbola betsaka ny zavatra tokony holazaiko aminareo, saingy tsy zakanareo izany izao.', '“mbola betsaka ny zavatra tokony holazaiko aminareo, saingy tsy zakanareo izany izao.'),
  ('6ab25c7a1e09198ff0f888d0', '2026-09-22T10:46:18.335Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:18.335Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 16, 13, 'Rehefa tonga anefa izy, izany hoe ny fanahin’ny fahamarinana, dia hitari-dalana anareo mba ho azonareo tsara ny fahamarinana rehetra. Tsy ny heviny fotsiny mantsy no hoteneniny, fa izay henony no holazainy, dia hohazavainy aminareo ny zavatra mbola ho avy.', 'rehefa tonga anefa izy, izany hoe ny fanahin’ny fahamarinana, dia hitari-dalana anareo mba ho azonareo tsara ny fahamarinana rehetra. tsy ny heviny fotsiny mantsy no hoteneniny, fa izay henony no holazainy, dia hohazavainy aminareo ny zavatra mbola ho avy.'),
  ('6ab25c7a1e09198ff0f888d1', '2026-09-22T10:46:18.335Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:18.335Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 16, 14, 'Hanome voninahitra ahy izy, satria hohazavainy aminareo izay azony avy amiko.', 'hanome voninahitra ahy izy, satria hohazavainy aminareo izay azony avy amiko.'),
  ('6ab25c7a1e09198ff0f888d2', '2026-09-22T10:46:18.335Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:18.335Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 16, 15, 'Izay rehetra an’ny Ray dia ahy. Izany no nahatonga ahy hiteny hoe hohazavainy aminareo izay azony avy amiko.', 'izay rehetra an’ny ray dia ahy. izany no nahatonga ahy hiteny hoe hohazavainy aminareo izay azony avy amiko.');
INSERT INTO "bible_verses" ("id", "created_date", "updated_date", "created_by_id", "created_by", "translation", "book", "bookOrder", "chapter", "verse", "text", "normalizedText") VALUES
  ('6ab25c7a1e09198ff0f888d3', '2026-09-22T10:46:18.335Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:18.335Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 16, 16, 'Rehefa afaka kelikely dia tsy hahita ahy intsony ianareo, fa rehefa afaka kelikely indray dia hahita ahy ianareo.”', 'rehefa afaka kelikely dia tsy hahita ahy intsony ianareo, fa rehefa afaka kelikely indray dia hahita ahy ianareo.”'),
  ('6ab25c7a1e09198ff0f888d4', '2026-09-22T10:46:18.335Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:18.335Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 16, 17, 'Dia nifampiresaka ny mpianany sasany hoe: “Fa inona no tiany hotenenina amin’ilay hoe: ‘Rehefa afaka kelikely dia tsy hahita ahy ianareo, fa rehefa afaka kelikely indray dia hahita ahy ianareo’, sy ilay hoe: ‘Satria ho any amin’ny Ray aho’?”', 'dia nifampiresaka ny mpianany sasany hoe: “fa inona no tiany hotenenina amin’ilay hoe: ‘rehefa afaka kelikely dia tsy hahita ahy ianareo, fa rehefa afaka kelikely indray dia hahita ahy ianareo’, sy ilay hoe: ‘satria ho any amin’ny ray aho’?”'),
  ('6ab25c7a1e09198ff0f888d5', '2026-09-22T10:46:18.335Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:18.335Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 16, 18, 'Ary hoy ireo: “Fa inona àry no tiany hotenenina amin’ilay hoe: ‘Rehefa afaka kelikely’? Tsy azontsika ny tiany holazaina.”', 'ary hoy ireo: “fa inona àry no tiany hotenenina amin’ilay hoe: ‘rehefa afaka kelikely’? tsy azontsika ny tiany holazaina.”'),
  ('6ab25c7a1e09198ff0f888d6', '2026-09-22T10:46:18.335Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:18.335Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 16, 19, 'Fantatr’i Jesosy fa te hanontany azy izy ireo, ka hoy izy: “Lasa mifanontany ve ianareo, satria niteny aho hoe: ‘Rehefa afaka kelikely dia tsy hahita ahy ianareo, fa rehefa afaka kelikely indray dia hahita ahy ianareo’?', 'fantatr’i jesosy fa te hanontany azy izy ireo, ka hoy izy: “lasa mifanontany ve ianareo, satria niteny aho hoe: ‘rehefa afaka kelikely dia tsy hahita ahy ianareo, fa rehefa afaka kelikely indray dia hahita ahy ianareo’?'),
  ('6ab25c7a1e09198ff0f888d7', '2026-09-22T10:46:18.335Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:18.335Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 16, 20, 'Lazaiko marimarina aminareo fa hitomany sy hidradradradra ianareo, fa izao tontolo izao kosa hifaly. Halahelo ianareo, nefa hivadika ho fifaliana ny alahelonareo.', 'lazaiko marimarina aminareo fa hitomany sy hidradradradra ianareo, fa izao tontolo izao kosa hifaly. halahelo ianareo, nefa hivadika ho fifaliana ny alahelonareo.'),
  ('6ab25c7a1e09198ff0f888d8', '2026-09-22T10:46:18.335Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:18.335Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 16, 21, 'Ory ny vehivavy rehefa tonga ny fotoana iterahany. Tsy tadidiny intsony anefa ny fahoriany rehefa teraka izy. Faly mantsy izy fa misy olona teraka eo amin’izao tontolo izao.', 'ory ny vehivavy rehefa tonga ny fotoana iterahany. tsy tadidiny intsony anefa ny fahoriany rehefa teraka izy. faly mantsy izy fa misy olona teraka eo amin’izao tontolo izao.'),
  ('6ab25c7a1e09198ff0f888d9', '2026-09-22T10:46:18.335Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:18.335Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 16, 22, 'Malahelo koa ianareo izao. Hahita anareo indray anefa aho, dia ho faly ny fonareo. Dia tsy hisy hanala an’izany fifalianareo izany.', 'malahelo koa ianareo izao. hahita anareo indray anefa aho, dia ho faly ny fonareo. dia tsy hisy hanala an’izany fifalianareo izany.'),
  ('6ab25c7a1e09198ff0f888da', '2026-09-22T10:46:18.335Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:18.335Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 16, 23, 'Tsy hanontany ahy intsony mihitsy ianareo amin’izay andro izay. Lazaiko marimarina aminareo fa na inona na inona angatahinareo amin’ny Ray, dia homeny anareo amin’ny anarako izany.', 'tsy hanontany ahy intsony mihitsy ianareo amin’izay andro izay. lazaiko marimarina aminareo fa na inona na inona angatahinareo amin’ny ray, dia homeny anareo amin’ny anarako izany.'),
  ('6ab25c7a1e09198ff0f888db', '2026-09-22T10:46:18.335Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:18.335Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 16, 24, 'Mbola tsy nangataka na inona na inona tamin’ny anarako ianareo, hatramin’izao. Mangataha dia hahazo ianareo, mba ho feno ny fifalianareo.', 'mbola tsy nangataka na inona na inona tamin’ny anarako ianareo, hatramin’izao. mangataha dia hahazo ianareo, mba ho feno ny fifalianareo.'),
  ('6ab25c7a1e09198ff0f888dc', '2026-09-22T10:46:18.335Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:18.335Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 16, 25, '“Nanao fanoharana aho rehefa nilaza an’izany taminareo. Tonga anefa ny fotoana tsy hanaovako fanoharana aminareo intsony, fa hotsoriko aminareo ny momba ny Ray.', '“nanao fanoharana aho rehefa nilaza an’izany taminareo. tonga anefa ny fotoana tsy hanaovako fanoharana aminareo intsony, fa hotsoriko aminareo ny momba ny ray.'),
  ('6ab25c7a1e09198ff0f888dd', '2026-09-22T10:46:18.335Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:18.335Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 16, 26, 'Hangataka amin’ny anarako ianareo amin’izay andro izay. Tsy midika anefa izany teniko izany hoe izaho no hangataka amin’ny Ray ho anareo.', 'hangataka amin’ny anarako ianareo amin’izay andro izay. tsy midika anefa izany teniko izany hoe izaho no hangataka amin’ny ray ho anareo.'),
  ('6ab25c7a1e09198ff0f888de', '2026-09-22T10:46:18.335Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:18.335Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 16, 27, 'Tia anareo mantsy ny Ray, satria ianareo efa tia ahy ka nino fa avy tamin’ny Ray aho sady solontenan’Andriamanitra.', 'tia anareo mantsy ny ray, satria ianareo efa tia ahy ka nino fa avy tamin’ny ray aho sady solontenan’andriamanitra.'),
  ('6ab25c7a1e09198ff0f888df', '2026-09-22T10:46:18.335Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:18.335Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 16, 28, 'Solontenan’ny Ray aho, ary tonga eto amin’izao tontolo izao. Hiala eto amin’izao tontolo izao anefa aho izao, dia ho any amin’ny Ray.”', 'solontenan’ny ray aho, ary tonga eto amin’izao tontolo izao. hiala eto amin’izao tontolo izao anefa aho izao, dia ho any amin’ny ray.”'),
  ('6ab25c7a1e09198ff0f888e0', '2026-09-22T10:46:18.335Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:18.335Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 16, 29, 'Hoy ny mpianany: “Izay fa miteny tsotra fotsiny ianao fa tsy manao fanoharana.', 'hoy ny mpianany: “izay fa miteny tsotra fotsiny ianao fa tsy manao fanoharana.'),
  ('6ab25c7a1e09198ff0f888e1', '2026-09-22T10:46:18.335Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:18.335Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 16, 30, 'Fantatray izao fa hainao daholo ny zava-drehetra, ary tsy mila anontaniana akory ianao. Dia lasa mino izahay fa avy any amin’Andriamanitra ianao.”', 'fantatray izao fa hainao daholo ny zava-drehetra, ary tsy mila anontaniana akory ianao. dia lasa mino izahay fa avy any amin’andriamanitra ianao.”'),
  ('6ab25c7a1e09198ff0f888e2', '2026-09-22T10:46:18.335Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:18.335Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 16, 31, 'Dia hoy i Jesosy: “Tena mino ve ianareo izao?', 'dia hoy i jesosy: “tena mino ve ianareo izao?'),
  ('6ab25c7a1e09198ff0f888e3', '2026-09-22T10:46:18.335Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:18.335Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 16, 32, 'Ho avy ny fotoana, ary efa kely sisa dia ho tonga ny fotoana handosiranareo tsirairay any amin’izay halehanareo, dia havelanareo ho irery aho. Tsy irery anefa aho satria eo ny Raiko.', 'ho avy ny fotoana, ary efa kely sisa dia ho tonga ny fotoana handosiranareo tsirairay any amin’izay halehanareo, dia havelanareo ho irery aho. tsy irery anefa aho satria eo ny raiko.'),
  ('6ab25c7a1e09198ff0f888e4', '2026-09-22T10:46:18.335Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:18.335Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 16, 33, 'Nilaza an’izany taminareo aho mba ho amin’ny alalako no hahazoanareo fiadanana. Eo amin’izao tontolo izao no hahitanareo fahoriana, nefa manàna herim-po! Izaho efa naharesy an’izao tontolo izao.”', 'nilaza an’izany taminareo aho mba ho amin’ny alalako no hahazoanareo fiadanana. eo amin’izao tontolo izao no hahitanareo fahoriana, nefa manàna herim-po! izaho efa naharesy an’izao tontolo izao.”'),
  ('6ab25c7ac36bc15e098ac214', '2026-09-22T10:46:18.939Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:18.939Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 17, 19, 'Ary ho azy ireo no anamasinako ny tenako, amin’izay koa izy ireo hohamasinina amin’ny alalan’ny fahamarinana.', 'ary ho azy ireo no anamasinako ny tenako, amin’izay koa izy ireo hohamasinina amin’ny alalan’ny fahamarinana.'),
  ('6ab25c7ac36bc15e098ac211', '2026-09-22T10:46:18.939Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:18.939Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 17, 16, 'Tsy anisan’izao tontolo izao izy, hoatr’ahy tsy anisan’izao tontolo izao.', 'tsy anisan’izao tontolo izao izy, hoatr’ahy tsy anisan’izao tontolo izao.'),
  ('6ab25c7ac36bc15e098ac216', '2026-09-22T10:46:18.939Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:18.939Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 17, 21, 'mba ho iray izy rehetra, hoatr’anao Ray tafaray amiko ary izaho tafaray aminao, dia ho tafaray amintsika koa izy ireo, amin’izay dia hino izao tontolo izao hoe ianao no naniraka ahy.', 'mba ho iray izy rehetra, hoatr’anao ray tafaray amiko ary izaho tafaray aminao, dia ho tafaray amintsika koa izy ireo, amin’izay dia hino izao tontolo izao hoe ianao no naniraka ahy.'),
  ('6ab25c7ac36bc15e098ac20c', '2026-09-22T10:46:18.939Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:18.939Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 17, 11, '“Tsy ho eto amin’izao tontolo izao intsony aho, satria ho any aminao, fa izy ireo no eto. Ray Masina ô, arovy izy ireo noho ilay anaranao nomenao ahy, mba ho iray koa izy ireo, hoatr’antsika ihany.', '“tsy ho eto amin’izao tontolo izao intsony aho, satria ho any aminao, fa izy ireo no eto. ray masina ô, arovy izy ireo noho ilay anaranao nomenao ahy, mba ho iray koa izy ireo, hoatr’antsika ihany.'),
  ('6ab25c7ac36bc15e098ac210', '2026-09-22T10:46:18.939Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:18.939Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 17, 15, '“Tsy mangataka aminao mba hanala azy ireo eo amin’izao tontolo izao aho, fa mba hiaro azy amin’ilay ratsy.', '“tsy mangataka aminao mba hanala azy ireo eo amin’izao tontolo izao aho, fa mba hiaro azy amin’ilay ratsy.'),
  ('6ab25c7ac36bc15e098ac209', '2026-09-22T10:46:18.939Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:18.939Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 17, 8, 'Efa noteneniko azy mantsy izay nolazainao tamiko. Dia nekeny izany, ka lasa fantany tsara fa solontenanao aho. Nino koa izy ireo hoe ianao no naniraka ahy.', 'efa noteneniko azy mantsy izay nolazainao tamiko. dia nekeny izany, ka lasa fantany tsara fa solontenanao aho. nino koa izy ireo hoe ianao no naniraka ahy.'),
  ('6ab25c7ac36bc15e098ac205', '2026-09-22T10:46:18.939Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:18.939Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 17, 4, 'Efa nanome voninahitra anao aho teto an-tany, satria vitako ny asa nasainao nataoko.', 'efa nanome voninahitra anao aho teto an-tany, satria vitako ny asa nasainao nataoko.'),
  ('6ab25c7ac36bc15e098ac204', '2026-09-22T10:46:18.939Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:18.939Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 17, 3, 'Raha te hahazo fiainana mandrakizay izy ireo, dia mila mianatra mba hahafantatra anao, ilay hany tena Andriamanitra, sy Jesosy Kristy, ilay nirahinao.', 'raha te hahazo fiainana mandrakizay izy ireo, dia mila mianatra mba hahafantatra anao, ilay hany tena andriamanitra, sy jesosy kristy, ilay nirahinao.'),
  ('6ab25c7ac36bc15e098ac202', '2026-09-22T10:46:18.939Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:18.939Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 17, 1, 'Nitraka nijery ny lanitra i Jesosy rehefa avy nilaza an’izany, dia hoy izy: “Ray ô, tonga ny fotoana. Omeo voninahitra ny zanakao mba hanomezany voninahitra anao.', 'nitraka nijery ny lanitra i jesosy rehefa avy nilaza an’izany, dia hoy izy: “ray ô, tonga ny fotoana. omeo voninahitra ny zanakao mba hanomezany voninahitra anao.'),
  ('6ab25c7ac36bc15e098ac20d', '2026-09-22T10:46:18.939Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:18.939Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 17, 12, 'Tamin’izaho mbola teo amin’izy ireo, dia niaro azy aho noho ilay anaranao nomenao ahy. Narovako izy ireo, ka tsy nisy ringana na iray aza, afa-tsy ilay zanaky ny fandringanana, mba ho tanteraka ny Soratra Masina.', 'tamin’izaho mbola teo amin’izy ireo, dia niaro azy aho noho ilay anaranao nomenao ahy. narovako izy ireo, ka tsy nisy ringana na iray aza, afa-tsy ilay zanaky ny fandringanana, mba ho tanteraka ny soratra masina.'),
  ('6ab25c7ac36bc15e098ac215', '2026-09-22T10:46:18.939Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:18.939Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 17, 20, '“Tsy mangataka ho an’ireto ihany anefa aho, fa ho an’izay mino ahy koa noho ny tenin’izy ireo,', '“tsy mangataka ho an’ireto ihany anefa aho, fa ho an’izay mino ahy koa noho ny tenin’izy ireo,'),
  ('6ab25c7ac36bc15e098ac20a', '2026-09-22T10:46:18.939Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:18.939Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 17, 9, 'Mangataka aminao ho azy ireo aho. Tsy mangataka ho an’izao tontolo izao aho fa ho an’ireo nomenao ahy, satria anao izy ireo.', 'mangataka aminao ho azy ireo aho. tsy mangataka ho an’izao tontolo izao aho fa ho an’ireo nomenao ahy, satria anao izy ireo.'),
  ('6ab25c7ac36bc15e098ac213', '2026-09-22T10:46:18.939Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:18.939Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 17, 18, 'Nirahinao ho amin’izao tontolo izao aho, dia hoatr’izany koa fa nirahiko ho amin’izao tontolo izao izy ireo.', 'nirahinao ho amin’izao tontolo izao aho, dia hoatr’izany koa fa nirahiko ho amin’izao tontolo izao izy ireo.'),
  ('6ab25c7ac36bc15e098ac20e', '2026-09-22T10:46:18.939Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:18.939Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 17, 13, 'Ho any aminao anefa aho izao, ary lazaiko eto amin’izao tontolo izao ireny zavatra ireny, mba ho tena tsapan’izy ireo ao am-pony ny fifaliako.', 'ho any aminao anefa aho izao, ary lazaiko eto amin’izao tontolo izao ireny zavatra ireny, mba ho tena tsapan’izy ireo ao am-pony ny fifaliako.'),
  ('6ab25c7ac36bc15e098ac21b', '2026-09-22T10:46:18.939Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:18.939Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 17, 26, 'Efa nampahafantariko azy ny anaranao ary mbola hampahafantariko ihany, mba ho hoatran’ny nitiavanao ahy no hitiavan’izy ireo ny hafa, ary mba ho tafaray amin’izy ireo koa aho.”', 'efa nampahafantariko azy ny anaranao ary mbola hampahafantariko ihany, mba ho hoatran’ny nitiavanao ahy no hitiavan’izy ireo ny hafa, ary mba ho tafaray amin’izy ireo koa aho.”'),
  ('6ab25c7ac36bc15e098ac21a', '2026-09-22T10:46:18.939Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:18.939Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 17, 25, 'Ray ô, manao ny rariny ianao. Tena tsy mahafantatra anao izao tontolo izao, fa izaho efa mahafantatra anao, ary ireto koa efa mahalala fa ianao no naniraka ahy.', 'ray ô, manao ny rariny ianao. tena tsy mahafantatra anao izao tontolo izao, fa izaho efa mahafantatra anao, ary ireto koa efa mahalala fa ianao no naniraka ahy.'),
  ('6ab25c7ac36bc15e098ac20b', '2026-09-22T10:46:18.939Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:18.939Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 17, 10, 'Anao daholo koa izay ananako ary ahy izay anananao, ary efa nomem-boninahitra teo amin’izy ireo aho.', 'anao daholo koa izay ananako ary ahy izay anananao, ary efa nomem-boninahitra teo amin’izy ireo aho.'),
  ('6ab25c7ac36bc15e098ac208', '2026-09-22T10:46:18.939Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:18.939Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 17, 7, 'Efa fantany izao fa avy taminao ny zava-drehetra nomenao ahy.', 'efa fantany izao fa avy taminao ny zava-drehetra nomenao ahy.'),
  ('6ab25c7ac36bc15e098ac206', '2026-09-22T10:46:18.939Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:18.939Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 17, 5, 'Ray ô, mba omeo voninahitra eo akaikinao àry aho izao, dia ilay voninahitra nananako teo akaikinao, tamin’ny mbola tsy nisy izao tontolo izao.', 'ray ô, mba omeo voninahitra eo akaikinao àry aho izao, dia ilay voninahitra nananako teo akaikinao, tamin’ny mbola tsy nisy izao tontolo izao.'),
  ('6ab25c7ac36bc15e098ac212', '2026-09-22T10:46:18.939Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:18.939Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 17, 17, 'Mba hamasino amin’ny alalan’ny fahamarinana izy ireo, fa ny teninao no fahamarinana.', 'mba hamasino amin’ny alalan’ny fahamarinana izy ireo, fa ny teninao no fahamarinana.'),
  ('6ab25c7ac36bc15e098ac207', '2026-09-22T10:46:18.939Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:18.939Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 17, 6, '“Efa nampahafantariko an’ireo olona nomenao ahy teo amin’izao tontolo izao ny anaranao. Anao izy ireo, dia nomenao ahy, ary efa narahiny ny teninao.', '“efa nampahafantariko an’ireo olona nomenao ahy teo amin’izao tontolo izao ny anaranao. anao izy ireo, dia nomenao ahy, ary efa narahiny ny teninao.'),
  ('6ab25c7ac36bc15e098ac218', '2026-09-22T10:46:18.939Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:18.939Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 17, 23, 'Izaho tafaray aminy ary ianao tafaray amiko, mba ho iray tanteraka izy ireo, ka ho fantatr’izao tontolo izao fa ianao no naniraka ahy sady efa tia azy tahaka ny nitiavanao ahy.', 'izaho tafaray aminy ary ianao tafaray amiko, mba ho iray tanteraka izy ireo, ka ho fantatr’izao tontolo izao fa ianao no naniraka ahy sady efa tia azy tahaka ny nitiavanao ahy.'),
  ('6ab25c7ac36bc15e098ac217', '2026-09-22T10:46:18.939Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:18.939Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 17, 22, 'Nomeko azy ireo ilay voninahitra nomenao ahy, mba ho iray hoatr’antsika koa izy ireo.', 'nomeko azy ireo ilay voninahitra nomenao ahy, mba ho iray hoatr’antsika koa izy ireo.'),
  ('6ab25c7ac36bc15e098ac219', '2026-09-22T10:46:18.939Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:18.939Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 17, 24, 'Ray ô, tiako raha mba miaraka amiko any amin’izay misy ahy ireo nomenao ahy ireo, mba ho hitany ilay voninahitro nomenao ahy, satria ianao efa tia ahy talohan’ny nanorenana an’izao tontolo izao.', 'ray ô, tiako raha mba miaraka amiko any amin’izay misy ahy ireo nomenao ahy ireo, mba ho hitany ilay voninahitro nomenao ahy, satria ianao efa tia ahy talohan’ny nanorenana an’izao tontolo izao.'),
  ('6ab25c7ac36bc15e098ac20f', '2026-09-22T10:46:18.939Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:18.939Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 17, 14, 'Efa nomeko azy ny teninao. Halan’izao tontolo izao anefa izy, satria tsy anisan’izao tontolo izao, hoatr’ahy tsy anisan’izao tontolo izao.', 'efa nomeko azy ny teninao. halan’izao tontolo izao anefa izy, satria tsy anisan’izao tontolo izao, hoatr’ahy tsy anisan’izao tontolo izao.'),
  ('6ab25c7ac36bc15e098ac203', '2026-09-22T10:46:18.939Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:18.939Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 17, 2, 'Fa efa nomenao fahefana amin’ny olona rehetra izy, mba ho afaka hanome fiainana mandrakizay ho an’izay rehetra nomenao azy.', 'fa efa nomenao fahefana amin’ny olona rehetra izy, mba ho afaka hanome fiainana mandrakizay ho an’izay rehetra nomenao azy.'),
  ('6ab25c7c77d31f4d2e2afb97', '2026-09-22T10:46:20.065Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:20.065Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 18, 19, 'Dia nanontany an’i Jesosy momba ny mpianany sy ny fampianarany ny lehiben’ny mpisorona.', 'dia nanontany an’i jesosy momba ny mpianany sy ny fampianarany ny lehiben’ny mpisorona.'),
  ('6ab25c7c77d31f4d2e2afb87', '2026-09-22T10:46:20.065Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:20.065Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 18, 3, 'Nitondra andia-miaramila sy mpiambina avy tamin’ny lehiben’ny mpisorona sy ny Fariseo àry i Jodasy, ka tonga tao nitondra fanilo sy jiro ary fiadiana.', 'nitondra andia-miaramila sy mpiambina avy tamin’ny lehiben’ny mpisorona sy ny fariseo àry i jodasy, ka tonga tao nitondra fanilo sy jiro ary fiadiana.'),
  ('6ab25c7c77d31f4d2e2afb85', '2026-09-22T10:46:20.065Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:20.065Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 18, 1, 'Rehefa avy nilaza an’izany i Jesosy, dia lasa nandeha niampita ny Lohasahan’i Kidrona, niaraka tamin’ny mpianany. Dia nankao amin’ny zaridaina iray tany izy sy ny mpianany.', 'rehefa avy nilaza an’izany i jesosy, dia lasa nandeha niampita ny lohasahan’i kidrona, niaraka tamin’ny mpianany. dia nankao amin’ny zaridaina iray tany izy sy ny mpianany.'),
  ('6ab25c7c77d31f4d2e2afb93', '2026-09-22T10:46:20.065Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:20.065Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 18, 15, 'Nanaraka an’i Jesosy i Simona Petera sy ny mpianatra iray fantatry ny mpisoronabe. Dia niditra tao an-tokotanin’ny mpisoronabe niaraka tamin’i Jesosy ilay mpianatra,', 'nanaraka an’i jesosy i simona petera sy ny mpianatra iray fantatry ny mpisoronabe. dia niditra tao an-tokotanin’ny mpisoronabe niaraka tamin’i jesosy ilay mpianatra,'),
  ('6ab25c7c77d31f4d2e2afb89', '2026-09-22T10:46:20.065Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:20.065Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 18, 5, 'Hoy ireo taminy: “I Jesosy avy any Nazareta.” Dia hoy izy: “Izaho no izy.” Teo koa i Jodasy, ilay namadika azy, nitsangana niaraka tamin’izy ireo teo.', 'hoy ireo taminy: “i jesosy avy any nazareta.” dia hoy izy: “izaho no izy.” teo koa i jodasy, ilay namadika azy, nitsangana niaraka tamin’izy ireo teo.'),
  ('6ab25c7c77d31f4d2e2afb8d', '2026-09-22T10:46:20.065Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:20.065Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 18, 9, 'Nitranga izany mba ho tanteraka ilay teniny hoe: “Tsy navelako hisy ho very izay nomenao ahy, na iray aza.”', 'nitranga izany mba ho tanteraka ilay teniny hoe: “tsy navelako hisy ho very izay nomenao ahy, na iray aza.”'),
  ('6ab25c7c77d31f4d2e2afb91', '2026-09-22T10:46:20.065Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:20.065Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 18, 13, 'Nentiny tany amin’i Anasy aloha izy, satria i Anasy no rafozandahin’i Kaiafa, ilay mpisoronabe tamin’izany taona izany.', 'nentiny tany amin’i anasy aloha izy, satria i anasy no rafozandahin’i kaiafa, ilay mpisoronabe tamin’izany taona izany.'),
  ('6ab25c7c77d31f4d2e2afb86', '2026-09-22T10:46:20.065Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:20.065Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 18, 2, 'Nahafantatra an’io toerana io koa i Jodasy, ilay namadika azy, satria mpankao matetika i Jesosy sy ny mpianany.', 'nahafantatra an’io toerana io koa i jodasy, ilay namadika azy, satria mpankao matetika i jesosy sy ny mpianany.'),
  ('6ab25c7c77d31f4d2e2afb99', '2026-09-22T10:46:20.065Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:20.065Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 18, 21, 'Dia maninona ianao no manontany ahy? Ireny olona nihaino ny teniko ireny anontaniana, fa ireny no mahafantatra an’izay nolazaiko.”', 'dia maninona ianao no manontany ahy? ireny olona nihaino ny teniko ireny anontaniana, fa ireny no mahafantatra an’izay nolazaiko.”'),
  ('6ab25c7c77d31f4d2e2afb95', '2026-09-22T10:46:20.065Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:20.065Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 18, 17, 'Ary hoy ilay mpanompovavy mpiandry vavahady, tamin’i Petera: “Tsy mpianatr’io lehilahy io koa ve ianao?” Hoy i Petera: “Tsy mpianany aho ka!”', 'ary hoy ilay mpanompovavy mpiandry vavahady, tamin’i petera: “tsy mpianatr’io lehilahy io koa ve ianao?” hoy i petera: “tsy mpianany aho ka!”'),
  ('6ab25c7c77d31f4d2e2afb8c', '2026-09-22T10:46:20.065Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:20.065Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 18, 8, 'Ary hoy i Jesosy: “Efa hoe izaho no izy! Koa raha izaho no tadiavinareo, dia avelao ireto handeha.”', 'ary hoy i jesosy: “efa hoe izaho no izy! koa raha izaho no tadiavinareo, dia avelao ireto handeha.”'),
  ('6ab25c7c77d31f4d2e2afb90', '2026-09-22T10:46:20.065Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:20.065Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 18, 12, 'Dia nisambotra an’i Jesosy ilay andia-miaramila sy ny mpitari-tafika ary ny mpiambina teo amin’ny Jiosy, ka namatotra azy.', 'dia nisambotra an’i jesosy ilay andia-miaramila sy ny mpitari-tafika ary ny mpiambina teo amin’ny jiosy, ka namatotra azy.'),
  ('6ab25c7c77d31f4d2e2afb88', '2026-09-22T10:46:20.065Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:20.065Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 18, 4, 'Fantatr’i Jesosy hoe inona daholo ny zavatra hanjo azy, ka nanatona izy ary nanontany hoe: “Iza no tadiavinareo?”', 'fantatr’i jesosy hoe inona daholo ny zavatra hanjo azy, ka nanatona izy ary nanontany hoe: “iza no tadiavinareo?”'),
  ('6ab25c7c77d31f4d2e2afb96', '2026-09-22T10:46:20.065Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:20.065Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 18, 18, 'Nijoro nanodidina ny afon-tsaribao nampirehetiny teo ny mpanompo sy ny mpiambina, satria nangatsiaka ny andro. Nitanina afo izy ireo, dia mba nijoro nitanina afo teo koa i Petera.', 'nijoro nanodidina ny afon-tsaribao nampirehetiny teo ny mpanompo sy ny mpiambina, satria nangatsiaka ny andro. nitanina afo izy ireo, dia mba nijoro nitanina afo teo koa i petera.'),
  ('6ab25c7c77d31f4d2e2afb8f', '2026-09-22T10:46:20.065Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:20.065Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 18, 11, 'Hoy anefa i Jesosy tamin’i Petera: “Ampidiro ao amin’ny tranony ny sabatrao. Izaho ve dia tsy hisotro amin’ny kaopy nomen’ny Raiko ahy?”', 'hoy anefa i jesosy tamin’i petera: “ampidiro ao amin’ny tranony ny sabatrao. izaho ve dia tsy hisotro amin’ny kaopy nomen’ny raiko ahy?”'),
  ('6ab25c7c77d31f4d2e2afb94', '2026-09-22T10:46:20.065Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:20.065Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 18, 16, 'fa i Petera kosa nijanona tao ivelany, teo am-bavahady. Nivoaka àry ilay mpianatra fantatry ny mpisoronabe, dia niresaka tamin’ny mpiandry vavahady ka nampiditra an’i Petera.', 'fa i petera kosa nijanona tao ivelany, teo am-bavahady. nivoaka àry ilay mpianatra fantatry ny mpisoronabe, dia niresaka tamin’ny mpiandry vavahady ka nampiditra an’i petera.'),
  ('6ab25c7c77d31f4d2e2afb8e', '2026-09-22T10:46:20.065Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:20.065Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 18, 10, 'Ary nanana sabatra i Simona Petera. Dia notsoahany ilay izy, ka nasiany ny mpanompon’ny mpisoronabe dia tapaka ny sofiny havanana. Malko no anaran’io mpanompo io.', 'ary nanana sabatra i simona petera. dia notsoahany ilay izy, ka nasiany ny mpanompon’ny mpisoronabe dia tapaka ny sofiny havanana. malko no anaran’io mpanompo io.'),
  ('6ab25c7c77d31f4d2e2afb8a', '2026-09-22T10:46:20.065Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:20.065Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 18, 6, 'Rehefa nilaza anefa i Jesosy hoe: “Izaho no izy”, dia nihemotra izy ireo ka nianjera tamin’ny tany.', 'rehefa nilaza anefa i jesosy hoe: “izaho no izy”, dia nihemotra izy ireo ka nianjera tamin’ny tany.'),
  ('6ab25c7c77d31f4d2e2afb8b', '2026-09-22T10:46:20.065Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:20.065Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 18, 7, 'Nanontany indray àry izy hoe: “Fa iza ho’aho no tadiavinareo?” Dia hoy ireo: “I Jesosy avy any Nazareta.”', 'nanontany indray àry izy hoe: “fa iza ho’aho no tadiavinareo?” dia hoy ireo: “i jesosy avy any nazareta.”'),
  ('6ab25c7c77d31f4d2e2afb98', '2026-09-22T10:46:20.065Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:20.065Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 18, 20, 'Ary hoy i Jesosy: “Niteny teny imason’ny olona rehetra aho. Nampianatra tao amin’ny synagoga sy ny tempoly foana koa aho, dia tany amin’izay nivorian’ny Jiosy rehetra. Tsy niafinafina mihitsy aho rehefa niteny.', 'ary hoy i jesosy: “niteny teny imason’ny olona rehetra aho. nampianatra tao amin’ny synagoga sy ny tempoly foana koa aho, dia tany amin’izay nivorian’ny jiosy rehetra. tsy niafinafina mihitsy aho rehefa niteny.'),
  ('6ab25c7c77d31f4d2e2afb92', '2026-09-22T10:46:20.065Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:20.065Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 18, 14, 'Io Kaiafa io ilay nanoro hevitra ny Jiosy hoe mahasoa azy ireo raha olona iray no maty ho an’ny vahoaka.', 'io kaiafa io ilay nanoro hevitra ny jiosy hoe mahasoa azy ireo raha olona iray no maty ho an’ny vahoaka.'),
  ('6ab25c7c77d31f4d2e2afba8', '2026-09-22T10:46:20.066Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:20.066Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 18, 36, 'Hoy i Jesosy: “Tsy anisan’izao tontolo izao ny Fanjakako. Raha anisan’izao tontolo izao ny Fanjakako, dia ho niady ny mpanara-dia ahy mba tsy ho natolotra tamin’ny Jiosy aho. Tsy avy amin’izao tontolo izao anefa ny Fanjakako.”', 'hoy i jesosy: “tsy anisan’izao tontolo izao ny fanjakako. raha anisan’izao tontolo izao ny fanjakako, dia ho niady ny mpanara-dia ahy mba tsy ho natolotra tamin’ny jiosy aho. tsy avy amin’izao tontolo izao anefa ny fanjakako.”'),
