  ('6ab25c7c538a74eff0e5d87f', '2026-09-22T10:46:20.571Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:20.571Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 19, 30, 'Rehefa avy nanandrana an’ilay divay i Jesosy, dia hoy izy: “Vita!” Ary nanondrika ny lohany izy dia tapitra ny ainy.', 'rehefa avy nanandrana an’ilay divay i jesosy, dia hoy izy: “vita!” ary nanondrika ny lohany izy dia tapitra ny ainy.'),
  ('6ab25c7c538a74eff0e5d87b', '2026-09-22T10:46:20.571Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:20.571Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 19, 26, 'Rehefa hitan’i Jesosy nijoro teo àry ny reniny sy ilay mpianatra tiany, dia hoy izy tamin-dreniny: “Ravehivavy, io ny zanakao!”', 'rehefa hitan’i jesosy nijoro teo àry ny reniny sy ilay mpianatra tiany, dia hoy izy tamin-dreniny: “ravehivavy, io ny zanakao!”'),
  ('6ab25c7c538a74eff0e5d873', '2026-09-22T10:46:20.571Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:20.571Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 19, 18, 'Teo i Jesosy no nofantsihan’izy ireo teo amin’ny tsato-kazo, niaraka tamin’ny lehilahy anankiroa, ka ny iray teo ankavanany ary ny iray teo ankaviany, fa izy no teo afovoany.', 'teo i jesosy no nofantsihan’izy ireo teo amin’ny tsato-kazo, niaraka tamin’ny lehilahy anankiroa, ka ny iray teo ankavanany ary ny iray teo ankaviany, fa izy no teo afovoany.'),
  ('6ab25c7c538a74eff0e5d889', '2026-09-22T10:46:20.571Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:20.571Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 19, 40, 'Nalain’izy roa lahy àry ny fatin’i Jesosy, dia nofonosiny lamba rongony niaraka tamin’ny zava-manitra, araka ny fanaon’ny Jiosy rehefa mandevina.', 'nalain’izy roa lahy àry ny fatin’i jesosy, dia nofonosiny lamba rongony niaraka tamin’ny zava-manitra, araka ny fanaon’ny jiosy rehefa mandevina.'),
  ('6ab25c7c538a74eff0e5d87d', '2026-09-22T10:46:20.571Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:20.571Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 19, 28, 'Taorian’izay, dia fantatr’i Jesosy fa efa vitany daholo hatreto ny zavatra nasain’ny Rainy nataony. Dia hoy izy: “Mangetaheta aho.” Nilaza an’izany izy mba ho tanteraka ny Soratra Masina.', 'taorian’izay, dia fantatr’i jesosy fa efa vitany daholo hatreto ny zavatra nasain’ny rainy nataony. dia hoy izy: “mangetaheta aho.” nilaza an’izany izy mba ho tanteraka ny soratra masina.'),
  ('6ab25c7c538a74eff0e5d885', '2026-09-22T10:46:20.571Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:20.571Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 19, 36, 'Nitranga izany mba ho tanteraka ny Soratra Masina hoe: “Tsy hisy ho tapaka ny taolany.”', 'nitranga izany mba ho tanteraka ny soratra masina hoe: “tsy hisy ho tapaka ny taolany.”'),
  ('6ab25c7c538a74eff0e5d884', '2026-09-22T10:46:20.571Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:20.571Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 19, 35, 'Ary vavolombelon’izany ilay nahita maso, sady marina ny teniny. Fantany koa fa marina izay lazainy, ary milaza an’izany izy mba hinoanareo koa.', 'ary vavolombelon’izany ilay nahita maso, sady marina ny teniny. fantany koa fa marina izay lazainy, ary milaza an’izany izy mba hinoanareo koa.'),
  ('6ab25c7c538a74eff0e5d871', '2026-09-22T10:46:20.571Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:20.571Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 19, 16, 'Dia natolony azy ireo izy mba hovonoina teo amin’ny tsato-kazo. Nentin’ireo àry i Jesosy.', 'dia natolony azy ireo izy mba hovonoina teo amin’ny tsato-kazo. nentin’ireo àry i jesosy.'),
  ('6ab25c7c538a74eff0e5d86e', '2026-09-22T10:46:20.571Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:20.571Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 19, 13, 'Nentin’i Pilato nivoaka i Jesosy, rehefa henony izany. Nipetraka teo amin’ny toeram-pitsarana izy, teo amin’ny toerana antsoina hoe Tokotany Vato, izay atao amin’ny teny hebreo hoe Gabata.', 'nentin’i pilato nivoaka i jesosy, rehefa henony izany. nipetraka teo amin’ny toeram-pitsarana izy, teo amin’ny toerana antsoina hoe tokotany vato, izay atao amin’ny teny hebreo hoe gabata.'),
  ('6ab25c7c538a74eff0e5d877', '2026-09-22T10:46:20.571Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:20.571Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 19, 22, 'Hoy anefa i Pilato: “Izay voasoratro dia voasoratro.”', 'hoy anefa i pilato: “izay voasoratro dia voasoratro.”'),
  ('6ab25c7c538a74eff0e5d88a', '2026-09-22T10:46:20.571Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:20.571Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 19, 41, 'Nisy zaridaina teo amin’ilay toerana namonoana azy, ary nisy fasana vaovao mbola tsy nandevenana mihitsy tao amin’ilay zaridaina.', 'nisy zaridaina teo amin’ilay toerana namonoana azy, ary nisy fasana vaovao mbola tsy nandevenana mihitsy tao amin’ilay zaridaina.'),
  ('6ab25c7c538a74eff0e5d870', '2026-09-22T10:46:20.571Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:20.571Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 19, 15, 'Niantsoantso mafy anefa ireo hoe: “Vonoy io! Vonoy any io! Fantsiho eo amin’ny tsato-kazo!” Hoy anefa i Pilato: “Dia hovonoiko ve izany ny mpanjakanareo?” Ary namaly ny lehiben’ny mpisorona hoe: “Tsy manana mpanjaka afa-tsy i Kaisara izahay.”', 'niantsoantso mafy anefa ireo hoe: “vonoy io! vonoy any io! fantsiho eo amin’ny tsato-kazo!” hoy anefa i pilato: “dia hovonoiko ve izany ny mpanjakanareo?” ary namaly ny lehiben’ny mpisorona hoe: “tsy manana mpanjaka afa-tsy i kaisara izahay.”'),
  ('6ab25c7c538a74eff0e5d888', '2026-09-22T10:46:20.571Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:20.571Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 19, 39, 'Tonga koa i Nikodemosy, nitondra miora sy aloesy nafangaro, izay nilanja 100 livatra teo ho eo. Izy ilay lehilahy tonga alina tao amin’i Jesosy tamin’ny voalohany.', 'tonga koa i nikodemosy, nitondra miora sy aloesy nafangaro, izay nilanja 100 livatra teo ho eo. izy ilay lehilahy tonga alina tao amin’i jesosy tamin’ny voalohany.'),
  ('6ab25c7c538a74eff0e5d878', '2026-09-22T10:46:20.571Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:20.571Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 19, 23, 'Rehefa voafantsiky ny miaramila teo amin’ny tsato-kazo i Jesosy, dia nalain’izy ireo ny akanjony ivelany, ary nozarainy efatra ka samy nahazo ny miaramila tsirairay. Nalain’ireo koa ny akanjony anatiny. Tsy nisy zaitra anefa io akanjo io, fa tenona iray ihany hatrany ambony ka hatrany ambany.', 'rehefa voafantsiky ny miaramila teo amin’ny tsato-kazo i jesosy, dia nalain’izy ireo ny akanjony ivelany, ary nozarainy efatra ka samy nahazo ny miaramila tsirairay. nalain’ireo koa ny akanjony anatiny. tsy nisy zaitra anefa io akanjo io, fa tenona iray ihany hatrany ambony ka hatrany ambany.'),
  ('6ab25c7c538a74eff0e5d875', '2026-09-22T10:46:20.571Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:20.571Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 19, 20, 'Be dia be ny Jiosy namaky an’ilay soratra, satria teo akaikin’ny tanàna ilay toerana namantsihana an’i Jesosy teo amin’ny tsato-kazo. Nosoratana tamin’ny teny hebreo sy latinina ary grika koa ilay izy.', 'be dia be ny jiosy namaky an’ilay soratra, satria teo akaikin’ny tanàna ilay toerana namantsihana an’i jesosy teo amin’ny tsato-kazo. nosoratana tamin’ny teny hebreo sy latinina ary grika koa ilay izy.'),
  ('6ab25c7c538a74eff0e5d879', '2026-09-22T10:46:20.571Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:20.571Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 19, 24, 'Nifampiresaka àry izy ireo hoe: “Aleo tsy horovitintsika ity, fa andao isika hanao antsapaka dia ho hitantsika hoe iza no hahazo azy.” Nitranga izany mba ho tanteraka ny Soratra Masina hoe: “Nifampizaran’izy ireo ny fitafiako, ary nanaovany antsapaka ny akanjoko.” Dia izany tokoa no nataon’ny miaramila.', 'nifampiresaka àry izy ireo hoe: “aleo tsy horovitintsika ity, fa andao isika hanao antsapaka dia ho hitantsika hoe iza no hahazo azy.” nitranga izany mba ho tanteraka ny soratra masina hoe: “nifampizaran’izy ireo ny fitafiako, ary nanaovany antsapaka ny akanjoko.” dia izany tokoa no nataon’ny miaramila.'),
  ('6ab25c7c538a74eff0e5d872', '2026-09-22T10:46:20.571Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:20.571Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 19, 17, 'Dia nitondra an’ilay hazo fijaliana izy, ka nankany amin’ilay toerana atao hoe Ikarandoha, na hoe Golgota amin’ny teny hebreo.', 'dia nitondra an’ilay hazo fijaliana izy, ka nankany amin’ilay toerana atao hoe ikarandoha, na hoe golgota amin’ny teny hebreo.'),
  ('6ab25c7c538a74eff0e5d88b', '2026-09-22T10:46:20.571Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:20.571Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 19, 42, 'Andro Fiomanan’ny Jiosy tamin’izay, sady teo akaiky teo ilay fasana, ka naleviny tao i Jesosy.', 'andro fiomanan’ny jiosy tamin’izay, sady teo akaiky teo ilay fasana, ka naleviny tao i jesosy.'),
  ('6ab25c7c538a74eff0e5d887', '2026-09-22T10:46:20.571Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:20.571Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 19, 38, 'Taorian’izany, dia nangataka tamin’i Pilato i Josefa avy any Arimatia, raha azony esorina ny fatin’i Jesosy. Mpianatr’i Jesosy io Josefa io, saingy tsy niteniteny izy noho ny fahatahorany ny Jiosy. Navelan’i Pilato hanao an’izany i Josefa, ka tonga nanala an’ilay faty.', 'taorian’izany, dia nangataka tamin’i pilato i josefa avy any arimatia, raha azony esorina ny fatin’i jesosy. mpianatr’i jesosy io josefa io, saingy tsy niteniteny izy noho ny fahatahorany ny jiosy. navelan’i pilato hanao an’izany i josefa, ka tonga nanala an’ilay faty.'),
  ('6ab25c7c538a74eff0e5d882', '2026-09-22T10:46:20.571Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:20.571Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 19, 33, 'Rehefa tonga teo amin’i Jesosy anefa izy ireo, dia hitany fa efa maty izy ka tsy notapahiny ny ranjony.', 'rehefa tonga teo amin’i jesosy anefa izy ireo, dia hitany fa efa maty izy ka tsy notapahiny ny ranjony.'),
  ('6ab25c7c538a74eff0e5d881', '2026-09-22T10:46:20.571Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:20.571Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 19, 32, 'Tonga àry ny miaramila ka notapahiny ny ranjon’ilay voalohany sy ny ranjon’ilay anankiray natao teo amin’ny tsato-kazo, teo akaikin’i Jesosy.', 'tonga àry ny miaramila ka notapahiny ny ranjon’ilay voalohany sy ny ranjon’ilay anankiray natao teo amin’ny tsato-kazo, teo akaikin’i jesosy.'),
  ('6ab25c7c538a74eff0e5d87a', '2026-09-22T10:46:20.571Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:20.571Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 19, 25, 'Nitsangana teo akaikin’ny hazo fijalian’i Jesosy ny reniny sy ny rahavavin-dreniny, ary Maria vadin’i Klopa sy Maria Magdalena.', 'nitsangana teo akaikin’ny hazo fijalian’i jesosy ny reniny sy ny rahavavin-dreniny, ary maria vadin’i klopa sy maria magdalena.'),
  ('6ab25c7c538a74eff0e5d874', '2026-09-22T10:46:20.571Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:20.571Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 19, 19, 'Nisy soratra nataon’i Pilato koa napetany teo amin’ilay hazo fijaliana, hoe: “Jesosy avy any Nazareta, Mpanjakan’ny Jiosy.”', 'nisy soratra nataon’i pilato koa napetany teo amin’ilay hazo fijaliana, hoe: “jesosy avy any nazareta, mpanjakan’ny jiosy.”'),
  ('6ab25c7c538a74eff0e5d886', '2026-09-22T10:46:20.571Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:20.571Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 19, 37, 'Eo koa ilay andininy milaza hoe: “Hijery an’ilay olona nolefoniny izy ireo.”', 'eo koa ilay andininy milaza hoe: “hijery an’ilay olona nolefoniny izy ireo.”'),
  ('6ab25c7c538a74eff0e5d880', '2026-09-22T10:46:20.571Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:20.571Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 19, 31, 'Andro Fiomanana tamin’izay, ka nangataka tamin’i Pilato ny Jiosy mba hasaina hotapahina ny ranjon’ireo natao teo amin’ny hazo fijaliana, dia hesorina ny faty. Amin’izay tsy hisy ho tavela eo amin’ny hazo fijaliana ireo faty ireo amin’ny andro sabata—fa Sabata lehibe io.—', 'andro fiomanana tamin’izay, ka nangataka tamin’i pilato ny jiosy mba hasaina hotapahina ny ranjon’ireo natao teo amin’ny hazo fijaliana, dia hesorina ny faty. amin’izay tsy hisy ho tavela eo amin’ny hazo fijaliana ireo faty ireo amin’ny andro sabata—fa sabata lehibe io.—'),
  ('6ab25c7c538a74eff0e5d86f', '2026-09-22T10:46:20.571Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:20.571Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 19, 14, 'Andro Fiomanana ho amin’ny Paska tamin’izay, tamin’ny ora fahenina teo ho eo. Ary hoy i Pilato tamin’ny Jiosy: “Io ny mpanjakanareo!”', 'andro fiomanana ho amin’ny paska tamin’izay, tamin’ny ora fahenina teo ho eo. ary hoy i pilato tamin’ny jiosy: “io ny mpanjakanareo!”'),
  ('6ab25c7c538a74eff0e5d883', '2026-09-22T10:46:20.571Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:20.571Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 19, 34, 'Mbola nolefonin’ny iray tamin’ireo miaramila ihany anefa ny takibany, ka tonga dia nisy ra sy rano nivoaka.', 'mbola nolefonin’ny iray tamin’ireo miaramila ihany anefa ny takibany, ka tonga dia nisy ra sy rano nivoaka.'),
  ('6ab25c7c538a74eff0e5d876', '2026-09-22T10:46:20.571Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:20.571Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 19, 21, 'Hoy anefa ny lehiben’ny mpisoron’ny Jiosy tamin’i Pilato: “Aza atao hoe ‘Mpanjakan’ny Jiosy’, fa ovao an’ilay nolazainy hoe ‘Mpanjakan’ny Jiosy aho.’”', 'hoy anefa ny lehiben’ny mpisoron’ny jiosy tamin’i pilato: “aza atao hoe ‘mpanjakan’ny jiosy’, fa ovao an’ilay nolazainy hoe ‘mpanjakan’ny jiosy aho.’”'),
  ('6ab25c7d7cfd635da0065ed3', '2026-09-22T10:46:21.347Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:21.347Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 20, 11, 'Mbola nijoro nitomany teo ivelan’ilay fasana anefa i Maria. Sady nitomany izy no niondrika nijery tao am-pasana,', 'mbola nijoro nitomany teo ivelan’ilay fasana anefa i maria. sady nitomany izy no niondrika nijery tao am-pasana,'),
  ('6ab25c7d7cfd635da0065ecf', '2026-09-22T10:46:21.347Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:21.347Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 20, 7, 'Tsy teo akaikin’ilay fehim-paty ilay lamba natao teo amin’ny lohan’i Jesosy, fa nivalona nitokana.', 'tsy teo akaikin’ilay fehim-paty ilay lamba natao teo amin’ny lohan’i jesosy, fa nivalona nitokana.'),
  ('6ab25c7d7cfd635da0065ed9', '2026-09-22T10:46:21.347Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:21.347Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 20, 17, 'Dia hoy i Jesosy: “Aza tazonina intsony aho, fa mbola tsy niakatra tany amin’ny Ray. Fa mandehana any amin’ny rahalahiko dia teneno ry zareo hoe: ‘Handeha ho any amin’ny Raiko sy ny Rainareo aho, dia ho any amin’ilay Andriamanitro sady Andriamanitrareo.’”', 'dia hoy i jesosy: “aza tazonina intsony aho, fa mbola tsy niakatra tany amin’ny ray. fa mandehana any amin’ny rahalahiko dia teneno ry zareo hoe: ‘handeha ho any amin’ny raiko sy ny rainareo aho, dia ho any amin’ilay andriamanitro sady andriamanitrareo.’”'),
  ('6ab25c7d7cfd635da0065ed7', '2026-09-22T10:46:21.347Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:21.347Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 20, 15, 'Hoy i Jesosy: “Fa maninona ianao no mitomany, ravehivavy? Fa iza no tadiavinao?” Noheverin’i Maria fa mpanao zaridaina izy, ka hoy izy: “Raha ianao, tompoko, no naka azy, dia mba lazao amiko izay nametrahanao azy mba hakako azy.”', 'hoy i jesosy: “fa maninona ianao no mitomany, ravehivavy? fa iza no tadiavinao?” noheverin’i maria fa mpanao zaridaina izy, ka hoy izy: “raha ianao, tompoko, no naka azy, dia mba lazao amiko izay nametrahanao azy mba hakako azy.”'),
  ('6ab25c7d7cfd635da0065eda', '2026-09-22T10:46:21.347Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:21.347Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 20, 18, 'Dia lasa nitondra an’izany vaovao izany tany amin’ny mpianatra i Maria Magdalena, ka hoy izy: “Nahita ny Tompo aho!” Notantarainy azy ireo koa ny zavatra notenenin’i Jesosy.', 'dia lasa nitondra an’izany vaovao izany tany amin’ny mpianatra i maria magdalena, ka hoy izy: “nahita ny tompo aho!” notantarainy azy ireo koa ny zavatra notenenin’i jesosy.'),
  ('6ab25c7d7cfd635da0065ecb', '2026-09-22T10:46:21.347Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:21.347Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 20, 3, 'Dia nankany am-pasana i Petera sy ilay mpianatra.', 'dia nankany am-pasana i petera sy ilay mpianatra.'),
  ('6ab25c7d7cfd635da0065ed2', '2026-09-22T10:46:21.347Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:21.347Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 20, 10, 'Samy nandeha nody àry ireo mpianatra ireo.', 'samy nandeha nody àry ireo mpianatra ireo.'),
  ('6ab25c7d7cfd635da0065ed6', '2026-09-22T10:46:21.347Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:21.347Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 20, 14, 'Nitodika izy avy eo rehefa avy niteny an’izany, ka nahita an’i Jesosy nijoro teo, nefa tsy tonga saina izy hoe i Jesosy io.', 'nitodika izy avy eo rehefa avy niteny an’izany, ka nahita an’i jesosy nijoro teo, nefa tsy tonga saina izy hoe i jesosy io.'),
  ('6ab25c7d7cfd635da0065ec9', '2026-09-22T10:46:21.347Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:21.347Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 20, 1, 'Tamin’ny andro voalohany amin’ny herinandro, dia nankany am-pasana vao maraina be i Maria Magdalena, raha mbola maizimaizina ny andro. Dia hitany fa efa nisy nanala ilay vato teo amin’ny fasana.', 'tamin’ny andro voalohany amin’ny herinandro, dia nankany am-pasana vao maraina be i maria magdalena, raha mbola maizimaizina ny andro. dia hitany fa efa nisy nanala ilay vato teo amin’ny fasana.'),
  ('6ab25c7d7cfd635da0065ece', '2026-09-22T10:46:21.347Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:21.347Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 20, 6, 'Tonga koa i Simona Petera, nanaraka azy, dia niditra tao am-pasana. Nahita an’ilay lamba rongony nipetraka teo koa izy.', 'tonga koa i simona petera, nanaraka azy, dia niditra tao am-pasana. nahita an’ilay lamba rongony nipetraka teo koa izy.'),
  ('6ab25c7d7cfd635da0065ed5', '2026-09-22T10:46:21.347Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:21.347Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 20, 13, 'Hoy izy ireo: “Fa maninona ianao no mitomany, ravehivavy?” Dia hoy izy: “Nisy naka tsinona ny Tompoko, dia tsy fantatro izay nametrahany azy.”', 'hoy izy ireo: “fa maninona ianao no mitomany, ravehivavy?” dia hoy izy: “nisy naka tsinona ny tompoko, dia tsy fantatro izay nametrahany azy.”'),
  ('6ab25c7d7cfd635da0065ed0', '2026-09-22T10:46:21.347Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:21.347Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 20, 8, 'Niditra koa avy eo ilay mpianatra anankiray tonga voalohany teo am-pasana, dia nahita ka nino an’izay nolazaina taminy.', 'niditra koa avy eo ilay mpianatra anankiray tonga voalohany teo am-pasana, dia nahita ka nino an’izay nolazaina taminy.'),
  ('6ab25c7d7cfd635da0065eca', '2026-09-22T10:46:21.347Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:21.347Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 20, 2, 'Lasa àry izy nihazakazaka nankany amin’i Simona Petera sy ilay mpianatra anankiray tian’i Jesosy, ka niteny hoe: “Nisy naka tao am-pasana ny Tompo, dia tsy fantatray izay nametrahany azy.”', 'lasa àry izy nihazakazaka nankany amin’i simona petera sy ilay mpianatra anankiray tian’i jesosy, ka niteny hoe: “nisy naka tao am-pasana ny tompo, dia tsy fantatray izay nametrahany azy.”'),
  ('6ab25c7d7cfd635da0065ed4', '2026-09-22T10:46:21.347Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:21.347Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 20, 12, 'ka nahita anjely roa niakanjo fotsy nipetraka teo amin’ilay nametrahana ny fatin’i Jesosy: Ny iray teo an-doha, ary ny iray teo an-tongotra.', 'ka nahita anjely roa niakanjo fotsy nipetraka teo amin’ilay nametrahana ny fatin’i jesosy: ny iray teo an-doha, ary ny iray teo an-tongotra.'),
  ('6ab25c7d7cfd635da0065ecc', '2026-09-22T10:46:21.347Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:21.347Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 20, 4, 'Nihazakazaka izy roa lahy, nefa haingana kokoa noho i Petera ilay mpianatra, ka izy no tonga voalohany tany am-pasana.', 'nihazakazaka izy roa lahy, nefa haingana kokoa noho i petera ilay mpianatra, ka izy no tonga voalohany tany am-pasana.'),
  ('6ab25c7d7cfd635da0065edc', '2026-09-22T10:46:21.347Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:21.347Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 20, 20, 'Rehefa avy niteny an’izany izy, dia nasehony azy ireo ny tanany sy ny takibany. Dia faly ny mpianatra nahita ny Tompo.', 'rehefa avy niteny an’izany izy, dia nasehony azy ireo ny tanany sy ny takibany. dia faly ny mpianatra nahita ny tompo.'),
  ('6ab25c7d7cfd635da0065ed8', '2026-09-22T10:46:21.347Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:21.347Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 20, 16, 'Hoy i Jesosy: “Maria!” Dia nitodika i Maria ka niteny tamin’ny teny hebreo hoe: “Rabôny!”, izay midika hoe “Mpampianatra!”', 'hoy i jesosy: “maria!” dia nitodika i maria ka niteny tamin’ny teny hebreo hoe: “rabôny!”, izay midika hoe “mpampianatra!”'),
  ('6ab25c7d7cfd635da0065ecd', '2026-09-22T10:46:21.347Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:21.347Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 20, 5, 'Rehefa niondrika nijery iny izy, dia nahita ny lamba rongony nipetraka teo, nefa tsy niditra.', 'rehefa niondrika nijery iny izy, dia nahita ny lamba rongony nipetraka teo, nefa tsy niditra.'),
  ('6ab25c7d7cfd635da0065edb', '2026-09-22T10:46:21.347Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:21.347Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 20, 19, 'Rehefa hariva ny andro, tamin’io andro voalohany amin’ny herinandro io, dia tonga i Jesosy ka nitsangana teo afovoan’ny mpianatra. Nihidy tao an-trano izy ireo tamin’izay noho ny fahatahorany ny Jiosy. Dia hoy i Jesosy: “Fiadanana anie ho anareo!”', 'rehefa hariva ny andro, tamin’io andro voalohany amin’ny herinandro io, dia tonga i jesosy ka nitsangana teo afovoan’ny mpianatra. nihidy tao an-trano izy ireo tamin’izay noho ny fahatahorany ny jiosy. dia hoy i jesosy: “fiadanana anie ho anareo!”'),
  ('6ab25c7d7cfd635da0065ed1', '2026-09-22T10:46:21.347Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:21.347Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 20, 9, 'Mbola tsy azon’izy ireo anefa ilay nolazain’ny Soratra Masina hoe tsy maintsy hitsangana amin’ny maty izy.', 'mbola tsy azon’izy ireo anefa ilay nolazain’ny soratra masina hoe tsy maintsy hitsangana amin’ny maty izy.'),
  ('6ab25c7d7cfd635da0065ee4', '2026-09-22T10:46:21.348Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:21.348Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 20, 28, 'Dia hoy i Tomasy: “Tompoko sy Andriamanitro!”', 'dia hoy i tomasy: “tompoko sy andriamanitro!”'),
  ('6ab25c7d7cfd635da0065ede', '2026-09-22T10:46:21.348Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:21.348Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 20, 22, 'Nitsoka rivotra tamin’izy ireo izy rehefa avy nilaza an’izany, ka niteny hoe: “Raiso ny fanahy masina.', 'nitsoka rivotra tamin’izy ireo izy rehefa avy nilaza an’izany, ka niteny hoe: “raiso ny fanahy masina.'),
  ('6ab25c7d7cfd635da0065ee5', '2026-09-22T10:46:21.348Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:21.348Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 20, 29, 'Ary hoy i Jesosy: “Ilay ianao nahita ahy ve no mahatonga anao hino? Sambatra izay tsy nahita nefa mino.”', 'ary hoy i jesosy: “ilay ianao nahita ahy ve no mahatonga anao hino? sambatra izay tsy nahita nefa mino.”'),
  ('6ab25c7d7cfd635da0065ee6', '2026-09-22T10:46:21.348Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:21.348Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 20, 30, 'Mbola nanao famantarana be dia be teo anatrehan’ny mpianatra koa i Jesosy, nefa tsy voasoratra ato amin’ity horonam-boky ity izany.', 'mbola nanao famantarana be dia be teo anatrehan’ny mpianatra koa i jesosy, nefa tsy voasoratra ato amin’ity horonam-boky ity izany.'),
  ('6ab25c7d7cfd635da0065edd', '2026-09-22T10:46:21.348Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:21.348Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 20, 21, 'Hoy indray i Jesosy: “Fiadanana anie ho anareo! Naniraka ahy ny Ray, dia izaho koa maniraka anareo.”', 'hoy indray i jesosy: “fiadanana anie ho anareo! naniraka ahy ny ray, dia izaho koa maniraka anareo.”'),
  ('6ab25c7d7cfd635da0065ee1', '2026-09-22T10:46:21.348Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:21.348Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 20, 25, 'Hoy ny mpianatra taminy: “Nahita ny Tompo izahay!” Hoy anefa izy: “Tsy hino an’izany mihitsy aho raha tsy hitako ilay diam-pantsika eo amin’ny tanany, dia ataoko eo amin’ilay diam-pantsika ny rantsantanako, ary ataoko eo amin’ny takibany ny tanako.”', 'hoy ny mpianatra taminy: “nahita ny tompo izahay!” hoy anefa izy: “tsy hino an’izany mihitsy aho raha tsy hitako ilay diam-pantsika eo amin’ny tanany, dia ataoko eo amin’ilay diam-pantsika ny rantsantanako, ary ataoko eo amin’ny takibany ny tanako.”'),
  ('6ab25c7d7cfd635da0065edf', '2026-09-22T10:46:21.348Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:21.348Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 20, 23, 'Izay fahotana avelanareo dia ho voavela, fa izay tsy avelanareo kosa tsy ho voavela.”', 'izay fahotana avelanareo dia ho voavela, fa izay tsy avelanareo kosa tsy ho voavela.”'),
  ('6ab25c7d7cfd635da0065ee7', '2026-09-22T10:46:21.348Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:21.348Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 20, 31, 'Nosoratana anefa ireo mba hinoanareo fa i Jesosy no Kristy Zanak’Andriamanitra. Dia rehefa mino ianareo, dia hahazo fiainana amin’ny anarany.', 'nosoratana anefa ireo mba hinoanareo fa i jesosy no kristy zanak’andriamanitra. dia rehefa mino ianareo, dia hahazo fiainana amin’ny anarany.'),
  ('6ab25c7d7cfd635da0065ee3', '2026-09-22T10:46:21.348Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:21.348Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 20, 27, 'Hoy izy avy eo tamin’i Tomasy: “Ataovy eto ny rantsantananao, dia jereo ny tanako, ary ataovy eto amin’ny takibako ny tananao. Dia aza misalasala intsony fa mba minoa amin’izay.”', 'hoy izy avy eo tamin’i tomasy: “ataovy eto ny rantsantananao, dia jereo ny tanako, ary ataovy eto amin’ny takibako ny tananao. dia aza misalasala intsony fa mba minoa amin’izay.”'),
  ('6ab25c7d7cfd635da0065ee0', '2026-09-22T10:46:21.348Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:21.348Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 20, 24, 'Tsy niaraka tamin’ny mpianatra anefa i Tomasy tamin’i Jesosy tonga teo amin’izy ireo. Anisan’ny 12 Lahy io Tomasy io, ary antsoina koa hoe Ikambana.', 'tsy niaraka tamin’ny mpianatra anefa i tomasy tamin’i jesosy tonga teo amin’izy ireo. anisan’ny 12 lahy io tomasy io, ary antsoina koa hoe ikambana.'),
  ('6ab25c7d7cfd635da0065ee2', '2026-09-22T10:46:21.348Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:21.348Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 20, 26, 'Tao an-trano indray ny mpianany, valo andro taorian’izay, ary tao koa i Tomasy. Dia tonga i Jesosy, na dia nihidy aza ny varavarana, ka nitsangana teo afovoan’izy ireo sady niteny hoe: “Fiadanana anie ho anareo!”', 'tao an-trano indray ny mpianany, valo andro taorian’izay, ary tao koa i tomasy. dia tonga i jesosy, na dia nihidy aza ny varavarana, ka nitsangana teo afovoan’izy ireo sady niteny hoe: “fiadanana anie ho anareo!”'),
  ('6ab25c7d5c32c2cbed1abfe0', '2026-09-22T10:46:21.876Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:21.876Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 21, 18, 'Lazaiko marimarina aminao fa tamin’ianao mbola tanora kokoa, dia ianao ihany no nampiakanjo ny tenanao, ary nankany amin’izay tianao haleha ianao. Fa rehefa mihantitra ianao, dia hanatsotra ny tananao, ka olon-kafa no hampiakanjo anao sy hitondra anao any amin’izay tsy tianao haleha.”', 'lazaiko marimarina aminao fa tamin’ianao mbola tanora kokoa, dia ianao ihany no nampiakanjo ny tenanao, ary nankany amin’izay tianao haleha ianao. fa rehefa mihantitra ianao, dia hanatsotra ny tananao, ka olon-kafa no hampiakanjo anao sy hitondra anao any amin’izay tsy tianao haleha.”'),
  ('6ab25c7d5c32c2cbed1abfd2', '2026-09-22T10:46:21.876Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:21.876Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 21, 4, 'Raha vao maraina anefa ny andro, dia nijoro teo amin’ny torapasika i Jesosy, nefa tsy tonga saina ny mpianatra hoe i Jesosy io.', 'raha vao maraina anefa ny andro, dia nijoro teo amin’ny torapasika i jesosy, nefa tsy tonga saina ny mpianatra hoe i jesosy io.'),
  ('6ab25c7d5c32c2cbed1abfd8', '2026-09-22T10:46:21.876Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:21.876Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 21, 10, 'Hoy i Jesosy: “Itondray amin’ny trondro vao azonareo aho.”', 'hoy i jesosy: “itondray amin’ny trondro vao azonareo aho.”'),
  ('6ab25c7d5c32c2cbed1abfd4', '2026-09-22T10:46:21.876Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:21.876Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 21, 6, 'Hoy izy: “Atsipazo eo ankavanan’ny sambokely ny harato fa hahazo ianareo.” Dia natsipin’izy ireo ilay harato, ka tsy zakany nampiakarina satria be loatra ny trondro.', 'hoy izy: “atsipazo eo ankavanan’ny sambokely ny harato fa hahazo ianareo.” dia natsipin’izy ireo ilay harato, ka tsy zakany nampiakarina satria be loatra ny trondro.'),
  ('6ab25c7d5c32c2cbed1abfcf', '2026-09-22T10:46:21.876Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:21.876Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 21, 1, 'Taorian’izay, dia niseho tamin’ny mpianatra indray i Jesosy, teo amin’ny Ranomasin’i Tiberiasy. Hoatr’izao no fomba nisehoany:', 'taorian’izay, dia niseho tamin’ny mpianatra indray i jesosy, teo amin’ny ranomasin’i tiberiasy. hoatr’izao no fomba nisehoany:'),
  ('6ab25c7d5c32c2cbed1abfd0', '2026-09-22T10:46:21.876Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:21.876Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 21, 2, 'Niaraka i Simona Petera, sy Tomasy—ilay antsoina koa hoe Ikambana—, sy Natanaela avy any Kana, any Galilia, sy ireo zanakalahin’i Zebedio, ary ny mpianatra roa hafa.', 'niaraka i simona petera, sy tomasy—ilay antsoina koa hoe ikambana—, sy natanaela avy any kana, any galilia, sy ireo zanakalahin’i zebedio, ary ny mpianatra roa hafa.'),
  ('6ab25c7d5c32c2cbed1abfdc', '2026-09-22T10:46:21.876Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:21.876Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 21, 14, 'Tamin’io i Jesosy no niseho fanintelony tamin’ny mpianany, taorian’ny nananganana azy tamin’ny maty.', 'tamin’io i jesosy no niseho fanintelony tamin’ny mpianany, taorian’ny nananganana azy tamin’ny maty.'),
  ('6ab25c7d5c32c2cbed1abfd5', '2026-09-22T10:46:21.876Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:21.876Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 21, 7, 'Avy eo dia hoy ilay mpianatra tian’i Jesosy tamin’i Petera: “Ny Tompo io!” Vao henon’i Simona Petera fa ny Tompo io, dia nanaovany ny akanjony ivelany, satria tsy niakanjo izy. Dia nitsoraka tao anaty ranomasina izy.', 'avy eo dia hoy ilay mpianatra tian’i jesosy tamin’i petera: “ny tompo io!” vao henon’i simona petera fa ny tompo io, dia nanaovany ny akanjony ivelany, satria tsy niakanjo izy. dia nitsoraka tao anaty ranomasina izy.'),
  ('6ab25c7d5c32c2cbed1abfdd', '2026-09-22T10:46:21.876Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:21.876Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 21, 15, 'Rehefa avy nisakafo maraina izy ireo, dia hoy i Jesosy tamin’i Simona Petera: “Simona zanak’i Jaona a, tia ahy mihoatra noho ny itiavanao an’iretsy ve ianao?” Dia hoy izy: “Ie, fantatrao fa miraiki-po aminao aho, Tompo ô!” Hoy i Jesosy: “Fahano àry ny zanak’ondriko.”', 'rehefa avy nisakafo maraina izy ireo, dia hoy i jesosy tamin’i simona petera: “simona zanak’i jaona a, tia ahy mihoatra noho ny itiavanao an’iretsy ve ianao?” dia hoy izy: “ie, fantatrao fa miraiki-po aminao aho, tompo ô!” hoy i jesosy: “fahano àry ny zanak’ondriko.”'),
  ('6ab25c7d5c32c2cbed1abfe1', '2026-09-22T10:46:21.876Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:21.876Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 21, 19, 'Niteny an’izany izy mba hilazana ny fomba hahafatesan’i Petera ka hanomezany voninahitra an’Andriamanitra amin’izany. Rehefa avy nilaza an’izany izy, dia niteny tamin’i Petera hoe: “Manaraha ahy foana.”', 'niteny an’izany izy mba hilazana ny fomba hahafatesan’i petera ka hanomezany voninahitra an’andriamanitra amin’izany. rehefa avy nilaza an’izany izy, dia niteny tamin’i petera hoe: “manaraha ahy foana.”'),
  ('6ab25c7d5c32c2cbed1abfd9', '2026-09-22T10:46:21.876Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:21.876Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 21, 11, 'Nankao amin’ilay sambokely àry i Simona Petera, ka nitaritarika an’ilay harato nankeny an-tanety. Feno trondro vaventy 153 ilay izy. Tsy rovitra ilay harato na be dia be aza ny trondro tao.', 'nankao amin’ilay sambokely àry i simona petera, ka nitaritarika an’ilay harato nankeny an-tanety. feno trondro vaventy 153 ilay izy. tsy rovitra ilay harato na be dia be aza ny trondro tao.'),
  ('6ab25c7d5c32c2cbed1abfd7', '2026-09-22T10:46:21.876Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:21.876Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 21, 9, 'Rehefa niakatra teny an-tanety izy ireo, dia nahita afon-tsaribao nisy trondro teo amboniny, sy mofo.', 'rehefa niakatra teny an-tanety izy ireo, dia nahita afon-tsaribao nisy trondro teo amboniny, sy mofo.'),
  ('6ab25c7d5c32c2cbed1abfd6', '2026-09-22T10:46:21.876Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:21.876Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 21, 8, 'Ny mpianatra hafa kosa nandeha tamin’ilay sambokely, sady nisintona an’ilay harato feno trondro. Tsy lavitra ny tanety mantsy no nisy azy ireo, fa tany amin’ny 90 metatra teo ho eo fotsiny.', 'ny mpianatra hafa kosa nandeha tamin’ilay sambokely, sady nisintona an’ilay harato feno trondro. tsy lavitra ny tanety mantsy no nisy azy ireo, fa tany amin’ny 90 metatra teo ho eo fotsiny.'),
  ('6ab25c7d5c32c2cbed1abfde', '2026-09-22T10:46:21.876Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:21.876Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 21, 16, 'Hoy indray izy fanindroany: “Simona zanak’i Jaona, tia ahy ve ianao?” Dia hoy izy: “Ie, fantatrao fa miraiki-po aminao aho, Tompo ô!” Hoy i Jesosy: “Andraso àry ny ondrikeliko.”', 'hoy indray izy fanindroany: “simona zanak’i jaona, tia ahy ve ianao?” dia hoy izy: “ie, fantatrao fa miraiki-po aminao aho, tompo ô!” hoy i jesosy: “andraso àry ny ondrikeliko.”'),
  ('6ab25c7d5c32c2cbed1abfe2', '2026-09-22T10:46:21.876Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:21.876Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 21, 20, 'Nitodika i Petera avy eo, dia hitany nanaraka tao aoriana ilay mpianatra tian’i Jesosy, ilay niankina teo an-tratrany tamin’ilay sakafo hariva sady nanontany hoe: “Tompo ô, iza ilay hamadika anao?”', 'nitodika i petera avy eo, dia hitany nanaraka tao aoriana ilay mpianatra tian’i jesosy, ilay niankina teo an-tratrany tamin’ilay sakafo hariva sady nanontany hoe: “tompo ô, iza ilay hamadika anao?”'),
  ('6ab25c7d5c32c2cbed1abfe5', '2026-09-22T10:46:21.876Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:21.876Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 21, 23, 'Dia nandeha ny resaka teo amin’ny mpanara-dia an’i Jesosy hoe tsy ho faty, hono, ilay mpianatra. Tsy niteny anefa i Jesosy hoe tsy ho faty izy, fa hoe: “Mampaninona anao moa raha mbola tiako ho eo foana izy rehefa tonga aho?”', 'dia nandeha ny resaka teo amin’ny mpanara-dia an’i jesosy hoe tsy ho faty, hono, ilay mpianatra. tsy niteny anefa i jesosy hoe tsy ho faty izy, fa hoe: “mampaninona anao moa raha mbola tiako ho eo foana izy rehefa tonga aho?”'),
  ('6ab25c7d5c32c2cbed1abfdf', '2026-09-22T10:46:21.876Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:21.876Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 21, 17, 'Hoy izy fanintelony: “Simona zanak’i Jaona, miraiki-po amiko ve ianao?” Dia nalahelo i Petera noho izy nanontany fanintelony hoe: “Miraiki-po amiko ve ianao?” Hoy àry izy: “Tompo ô, mahalala ny zava-drehetra ianao. Fantatrao fa miraiki-po aminao aho.” Hoy i Jesosy: “Fahano àry ny ondrikeliko.', 'hoy izy fanintelony: “simona zanak’i jaona, miraiki-po amiko ve ianao?” dia nalahelo i petera noho izy nanontany fanintelony hoe: “miraiki-po amiko ve ianao?” hoy àry izy: “tompo ô, mahalala ny zava-drehetra ianao. fantatrao fa miraiki-po aminao aho.” hoy i jesosy: “fahano àry ny ondrikeliko.'),
  ('6ab25c7d5c32c2cbed1abfd3', '2026-09-22T10:46:21.876Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:21.876Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 21, 5, 'Ary hoy i Jesosy: “Manana zavatra azo hanina ve ianareo, anaka?” Dia namaly izy ireo hoe: “Tsy manana!”', 'ary hoy i jesosy: “manana zavatra azo hanina ve ianareo, anaka?” dia namaly izy ireo hoe: “tsy manana!”'),
  ('6ab25c7d5c32c2cbed1abfd1', '2026-09-22T10:46:21.876Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:21.876Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 21, 3, 'Hoy i Simona Petera: “Handeha hanarato aho.” “Izahay koa hiaraka aminao”, hoy ny sasany. Dia lasa izy ireo ka nankao anaty sambokely, nefa tsy nahazo na inona na inona tamin’iny alina iny.', 'hoy i simona petera: “handeha hanarato aho.” “izahay koa hiaraka aminao”, hoy ny sasany. dia lasa izy ireo ka nankao anaty sambokely, nefa tsy nahazo na inona na inona tamin’iny alina iny.'),
  ('6ab25c7d5c32c2cbed1abfdb', '2026-09-22T10:46:21.876Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:21.876Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 21, 13, 'Dia nalain’i Jesosy ny mofo ka nomeny azy ireo. Hoatr’izany koa ny trondro.', 'dia nalain’i jesosy ny mofo ka nomeny azy ireo. hoatr’izany koa ny trondro.'),
  ('6ab25c7d5c32c2cbed1abfe7', '2026-09-22T10:46:21.876Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:21.876Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 21, 25, 'Misy zavatra hafa be dia be koa nataon’i Jesosy, ary raha nosoratana tamin’ny an-tsipiriany daholo ireny, dia ataoko fa na izao tontolo izao aza tsy ho omby ny horonam-boky voasoratra.', 'misy zavatra hafa be dia be koa nataon’i jesosy, ary raha nosoratana tamin’ny an-tsipiriany daholo ireny, dia ataoko fa na izao tontolo izao aza tsy ho omby ny horonam-boky voasoratra.'),
  ('6ab25c7d5c32c2cbed1abfe4', '2026-09-22T10:46:21.876Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:21.876Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 21, 22, 'Dia hoy i Jesosy: “Mampaninona anao moa raha mbola tiako ho eo foana izy rehefa tonga aho? Fa manaraha ahy foana fotsiny ianao.”', 'dia hoy i jesosy: “mampaninona anao moa raha mbola tiako ho eo foana izy rehefa tonga aho? fa manaraha ahy foana fotsiny ianao.”'),
  ('6ab25c7d5c32c2cbed1abfe3', '2026-09-22T10:46:21.876Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:21.876Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 21, 21, 'Rehefa nahita an’ilay mpianatra àry i Petera, dia hoy izy tamin’i Jesosy: “Tompo ô, ary ahoana ny amin’itsy?”', 'rehefa nahita an’ilay mpianatra àry i petera, dia hoy izy tamin’i jesosy: “tompo ô, ary ahoana ny amin’itsy?”'),
  ('6ab25c7d5c32c2cbed1abfda', '2026-09-22T10:46:21.876Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:21.876Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 21, 12, 'Hoy i Jesosy: “Avia hisakafo maraina.” Tsy nisy sahy nanontany anefa izy ireo hoe: “Iza ianao?”, satria fantany hoe ny Tompo io.', 'hoy i jesosy: “avia hisakafo maraina.” tsy nisy sahy nanontany anefa izy ireo hoe: “iza ianao?”, satria fantany hoe ny tompo io.'),
  ('6ab25c7d5c32c2cbed1abfe6', '2026-09-22T10:46:21.876Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:21.876Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jaona', 43, 21, 24, 'Io ilay mpianatra mijoro ho vavolombelon’izany rehetra izany sady nanoratra an’izany. Ary fantatray fa marina ny teniny.', 'io ilay mpianatra mijoro ho vavolombelon’izany rehetra izany sady nanoratra an’izany. ary fantatray fa marina ny teniny.'),
  ('6ab25c7e32b83d3bc80458cd', '2026-09-22T10:46:22.682Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:22.682Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 1, 17, 'Niaraka taminay mantsy izy taloha ary voafidy handray anjara amin’izao fanompoana izao koa.', 'niaraka taminay mantsy izy taloha ary voafidy handray anjara amin’izao fanompoana izao koa.'),
  ('6ab25c7e32b83d3bc80458ca', '2026-09-22T10:46:22.682Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:22.682Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 1, 14, 'Dia niray saina izy rehetra ka tsy nitsahatra nivavaka. Nisy vehivavy vitsivitsy niaraka tamin’izy ireo, ary teo koa i Maria renin’i Jesosy sy ireo rahalahiny.', 'dia niray saina izy rehetra ka tsy nitsahatra nivavaka. nisy vehivavy vitsivitsy niaraka tamin’izy ireo, ary teo koa i maria renin’i jesosy sy ireo rahalahiny.'),
  ('6ab25c7e32b83d3bc80458c7', '2026-09-22T10:46:22.682Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:22.682Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 1, 11, 'ary niteny hoe: “Ry lehilahy galilianina, nahoana ianareo no mijoro eto mijery ny lanitra? Iny Jesosy izay efa teo aminareo sy nakarina ho any an-danitra iny, dia ho avy indray, ka hoatran’iny fomba nahitanareo azy niakatra tany an-danitra iny ihany no hiverenany.”', 'ary niteny hoe: “ry lehilahy galilianina, nahoana ianareo no mijoro eto mijery ny lanitra? iny jesosy izay efa teo aminareo sy nakarina ho any an-danitra iny, dia ho avy indray, ka hoatran’iny fomba nahitanareo azy niakatra tany an-danitra iny ihany no hiverenany.”'),
  ('6ab25c7e32b83d3bc80458cc', '2026-09-22T10:46:22.682Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:22.682Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 1, 16, '“Ry rahalahy, tsy maintsy tanteraka ny Soratra Masina, izany hoe ny faminaniana nolazain’ny fanahy masina tamin’ny alalan’i Davida momba an’i Jodasy, ilay nitarika an’ireo nisambotra an’i Jesosy.', '“ry rahalahy, tsy maintsy tanteraka ny soratra masina, izany hoe ny faminaniana nolazain’ny fanahy masina tamin’ny alalan’i davida momba an’i jodasy, ilay nitarika an’ireo nisambotra an’i jesosy.'),
  ('6ab25c7e32b83d3bc80458be', '2026-09-22T10:46:22.682Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:22.682Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 1, 2, 'ka mandra-pahatongan’ny andro nampiakarana azy ho any an-danitra. Nampiakarina izy rehefa avy nanome toromarika tamin’ny alalan’ny fanahy masina an’ireo apostoly nofidiny.', 'ka mandra-pahatongan’ny andro nampiakarana azy ho any an-danitra. nampiakarina izy rehefa avy nanome toromarika tamin’ny alalan’ny fanahy masina an’ireo apostoly nofidiny.'),
  ('6ab25c7e32b83d3bc80458d2', '2026-09-22T10:46:22.682Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:22.682Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 1, 22, 'nanomboka tamin’izy nataon’i Jaona batisa ka hatramin’ny andro nakana azy niakatra. Tokony ho lasa vavolombelona miaraka aminay izany lehilahy izany mba hilaza hoe nitsangana tamin’ny maty izy.”', 'nanomboka tamin’izy nataon’i jaona batisa ka hatramin’ny andro nakana azy niakatra. tokony ho lasa vavolombelona miaraka aminay izany lehilahy izany mba hilaza hoe nitsangana tamin’ny maty izy.”'),
  ('6ab25c7e32b83d3bc80458c9', '2026-09-22T10:46:22.682Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:22.682Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 1, 13, 'Rehefa tonga izy ireo, dia niakatra tao amin’ny efitra ambony rihana nipetrahany. Ireto avy izy ireo: I Petera sy Jaona ary Jakoba sy Andrea, Filipo sy Tomasy, Bartolomeo sy Matio, Jakoba zanak’i Alfeo, Simona ilay mafana fo, ary Jodasy zanak’i Jakoba.', 'rehefa tonga izy ireo, dia niakatra tao amin’ny efitra ambony rihana nipetrahany. ireto avy izy ireo: i petera sy jaona ary jakoba sy andrea, filipo sy tomasy, bartolomeo sy matio, jakoba zanak’i alfeo, simona ilay mafana fo, ary jodasy zanak’i jakoba.'),
  ('6ab25c7e32b83d3bc80458d5', '2026-09-22T10:46:22.682Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:22.682Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 1, 25, 'mba hanao an’izao fanompoana izao sy ho apostoly hisolo an’i Jodasy, izay niala mba hanao izay nety taminy fotsiny.”', 'mba hanao an’izao fanompoana izao sy ho apostoly hisolo an’i jodasy, izay niala mba hanao izay nety taminy fotsiny.”'),
  ('6ab25c7e32b83d3bc80458d4', '2026-09-22T10:46:22.682Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:22.682Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 1, 24, 'Dia nivavaka izy ireo hoe: “Jehovah ô, ianao no mahalala ny fon’ny olona rehetra, koa asehoy izay nofidinao amin’izy roa lahy ireto,', 'dia nivavaka izy ireo hoe: “jehovah ô, ianao no mahalala ny fon’ny olona rehetra, koa asehoy izay nofidinao amin’izy roa lahy ireto,'),
  ('6ab25c7e32b83d3bc80458d3', '2026-09-22T10:46:22.682Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:22.682Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 1, 23, 'Nanolotra roa lahy àry izy ireo. Tsy iza izany fa i Josefa, izay atao hoe Barsabasy na koa hoe Josto, sy Matia.', 'nanolotra roa lahy àry izy ireo. tsy iza izany fa i josefa, izay atao hoe barsabasy na koa hoe josto, sy matia.'),
  ('6ab25c7e32b83d3bc80458d1', '2026-09-22T10:46:22.682Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:22.682Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 1, 21, 'Mila atao solony àry ny lehilahy iray anisan’ireo niaraka taminay nandritra ny fotoana nanaovan’i Jesosy Tompo ny asany teo aminay,', 'mila atao solony àry ny lehilahy iray anisan’ireo niaraka taminay nandritra ny fotoana nanaovan’i jesosy tompo ny asany teo aminay,'),
  ('6ab25c7e32b83d3bc80458d0', '2026-09-22T10:46:22.682Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:22.682Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 1, 20, 'Voasoratra ao amin’ny bokin’ny Salamo mantsy hoe: ‘Aoka ho foana ny fonenany ka tsy hisy honina intsony’, ary ‘Aoka ho lasan’olon-kafa ny andraikitra notanany.’', 'voasoratra ao amin’ny bokin’ny salamo mantsy hoe: ‘aoka ho foana ny fonenany ka tsy hisy honina intsony’, ary ‘aoka ho lasan’olon-kafa ny andraikitra notanany.’'),
  ('6ab25c7e32b83d3bc80458cb', '2026-09-22T10:46:22.682Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:22.682Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 1, 15, 'Tamin’izany andro izany, dia nitsangana teo afovoan’ireo rahalahy i Petera—nisy 120 teo ho eo ny isan’ny olona tafavory tamin’izay—ka hoy izy:', 'tamin’izany andro izany, dia nitsangana teo afovoan’ireo rahalahy i petera—nisy 120 teo ho eo ny isan’ny olona tafavory tamin’izay—ka hoy izy:'),
  ('6ab25c7e32b83d3bc80458c6', '2026-09-22T10:46:22.682Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:22.682Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 1, 10, 'Raha mbola nibanjina ny lanitra teo izy ireo, tamin’ilay Jesosy lasa iny, dia nisy roa lahy niakanjo fotsy nijoro tampoka teo akaikin’izy ireo,', 'raha mbola nibanjina ny lanitra teo izy ireo, tamin’ilay jesosy lasa iny, dia nisy roa lahy niakanjo fotsy nijoro tampoka teo akaikin’izy ireo,'),
  ('6ab25c7e32b83d3bc80458c4', '2026-09-22T10:46:22.682Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:22.682Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 1, 8, 'Hahazo hery kosa ianareo rehefa tonga aminareo ny fanahy masina, ka ho vavolombeloko any Jerosalema sy eran’i Jodia sy Samaria ary any amin’ny faritra lavitra indrindra eto an-tany ianareo.”', 'hahazo hery kosa ianareo rehefa tonga aminareo ny fanahy masina, ka ho vavolombeloko any jerosalema sy eran’i jodia sy samaria ary any amin’ny faritra lavitra indrindra eto an-tany ianareo.”'),
  ('6ab25c7e32b83d3bc80458c0', '2026-09-22T10:46:22.682Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:22.682Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 1, 4, 'Tamin’izy nihaona tamin’izy ireo, dia nanafatrafatra hoe: “Aza miala eto Jerosalema, fa andraso foana ilay nampanantenain’ny Ray, araka ny efa noresahiko taminareo.', 'tamin’izy nihaona tamin’izy ireo, dia nanafatrafatra hoe: “aza miala eto jerosalema, fa andraso foana ilay nampanantenain’ny ray, araka ny efa noresahiko taminareo.'),
  ('6ab25c7e32b83d3bc80458c3', '2026-09-22T10:46:22.682Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:22.682Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 1, 7, 'Dia hoy izy: “Tsy anjaranareo ny mahafantatra ny fotoana na ny vanim-potoana, fa ny Ray irery ihany no manam-pahefana amin’izany.', 'dia hoy izy: “tsy anjaranareo ny mahafantatra ny fotoana na ny vanim-potoana, fa ny ray irery ihany no manam-pahefana amin’izany.'),
  ('6ab25c7e32b83d3bc80458c1', '2026-09-22T10:46:22.682Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:22.682Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 1, 5, 'I Jaona mantsy nanao batisa tamin’ny rano, fa ianareo kosa hatao batisa amin’ny fanahy masina, rehefa afaka andro vitsivitsy.”', 'i jaona mantsy nanao batisa tamin’ny rano, fa ianareo kosa hatao batisa amin’ny fanahy masina, rehefa afaka andro vitsivitsy.”'),
  ('6ab25c7e32b83d3bc80458bd', '2026-09-22T10:46:22.682Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:22.682Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 1, 1, 'Ilay fitantarana voalohany nosoratako, ry Teofilo, dia momba ny zava-drehetra nataon’i Jesosy sy nampianariny hatrany am-boalohany,', 'ilay fitantarana voalohany nosoratako, ry teofilo, dia momba ny zava-drehetra nataon’i jesosy sy nampianariny hatrany am-boalohany,'),
  ('6ab25c7e32b83d3bc80458c8', '2026-09-22T10:46:22.682Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:22.682Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 1, 12, 'Dia niverina tany Jerosalema izy ireo, rehefa avy teo amin’ilay tendrombohitra atao hoe Tendrombohitra Oliva. Tsy lavitra an’i Jerosalema izy io, satria lalana indray sabata fotsiny ny elanelany.', 'dia niverina tany jerosalema izy ireo, rehefa avy teo amin’ilay tendrombohitra atao hoe tendrombohitra oliva. tsy lavitra an’i jerosalema izy io, satria lalana indray sabata fotsiny ny elanelany.'),
  ('6ab25c7e32b83d3bc80458bf', '2026-09-22T10:46:22.682Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:22.682Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 1, 3, 'Rehefa avy nijaly izy, dia nasehony tamin’izy ireo hoe velona izy, ary porofo maro tsy azo lavina no nentiny nanehoana an’izany. Koa hitan’izy ireo nandritra ny 40 andro izy, ary niresaka momba ny Fanjakan’Andriamanitra.', 'rehefa avy nijaly izy, dia nasehony tamin’izy ireo hoe velona izy, ary porofo maro tsy azo lavina no nentiny nanehoana an’izany. koa hitan’izy ireo nandritra ny 40 andro izy, ary niresaka momba ny fanjakan’andriamanitra.'),
  ('6ab25c7e32b83d3bc80458c2', '2026-09-22T10:46:22.682Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:22.682Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 1, 6, 'Rehefa tafavory àry izy ireo, dia nanontany azy hoe: “Tompo ô, izao ve ianao no hamerina ny fanjakana amin’ny Israely?”', 'rehefa tafavory àry izy ireo, dia nanontany azy hoe: “tompo ô, izao ve ianao no hamerina ny fanjakana amin’ny israely?”'),
  ('6ab25c7e32b83d3bc80458d6', '2026-09-22T10:46:22.682Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:22.682Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 1, 26, 'Nanaovany antsapaka àry izy roa lahy, ka i Matia no voafidy hanampy isa an’ireo apostoly 11.', 'nanaovany antsapaka àry izy roa lahy, ka i matia no voafidy hanampy isa an’ireo apostoly 11.'),
  ('6ab25c7e32b83d3bc80458ce', '2026-09-22T10:46:22.682Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:22.682Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 1, 18, '—Izany lehilahy izany ilay nividy saha tamin’ny karama azony tamin’ny tsy fahamarinana. Ary nianjera izy ka ny lohany no lasa aloha. Dia nipoaka ny vatany, ka nipotsaka daholo ny tao anatiny.', '—izany lehilahy izany ilay nividy saha tamin’ny karama azony tamin’ny tsy fahamarinana. ary nianjera izy ka ny lohany no lasa aloha. dia nipoaka ny vatany, ka nipotsaka daholo ny tao anatiny.'),
  ('6ab25c7e32b83d3bc80458cf', '2026-09-22T10:46:22.682Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:22.682Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 1, 19, 'Fantatry ny mponina rehetra eto Jerosalema izany, ka natao hoe Akeldama, izany hoe “Sahan-dra”, ny anaran’io saha io amin’ny fitenin-dry zareo.—', 'fantatry ny mponina rehetra eto jerosalema izany, ka natao hoe akeldama, izany hoe “sahan-dra”, ny anaran’io saha io amin’ny fitenin-dry zareo.—'),
  ('6ab25c7e32b83d3bc80458c5', '2026-09-22T10:46:22.682Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:22.682Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 1, 9, 'Rehefa avy nilaza an’izany izy, dia nakarina teo imason’izy ireo. Ary nisy rahona nanarona azy, ka tsy hitan’izy ireo intsony izy.', 'rehefa avy nilaza an’izany izy, dia nakarina teo imason’izy ireo. ary nisy rahona nanarona azy, ka tsy hitan’izy ireo intsony izy.'),
  ('6ab25c7f5d23e2f6a2390059', '2026-09-22T10:46:23.356Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:23.356Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 2, 16, 'Fa izao kosa no nasaina nolazain’i Joela mpaminany:', 'fa izao kosa no nasaina nolazain’i joela mpaminany:'),
  ('6ab25c7f5d23e2f6a2390056', '2026-09-22T10:46:23.356Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:23.356Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 2, 13, 'Fa nisy kosa naneso hoe: “Mamon’ny divay mamy ireo.”', 'fa nisy kosa naneso hoe: “mamon’ny divay mamy ireo.”'),
  ('6ab25c7f5d23e2f6a2390051', '2026-09-22T10:46:23.356Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:23.356Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 2, 8, 'Koa nahoana isika no maheno an-dry zareo miteny amin’ny fitenin-drazantsika avy?', 'koa nahoana isika no maheno an-dry zareo miteny amin’ny fitenin-drazantsika avy?'),
  ('6ab25c7f5d23e2f6a239005d', '2026-09-22T10:46:23.356Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:23.356Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 2, 20, 'Ho maizina ny masoandro ary ho mena toy ny ra ny volana, alohan’ny hahatongavan’ny andron’i Jehovah, dia ilay andro lehibe sady miavaka.', 'ho maizina ny masoandro ary ho mena toy ny ra ny volana, alohan’ny hahatongavan’ny andron’i jehovah, dia ilay andro lehibe sady miavaka.'),
  ('6ab25c7f5d23e2f6a2390064', '2026-09-22T10:46:23.356Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:23.356Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 2, 27, 'satria tsy ho foinao hijanona ao amin’ny Fasana aho, sady tsy havelanao ho lo ilay mpanomponao tsy mivadika.', 'satria tsy ho foinao hijanona ao amin’ny fasana aho, sady tsy havelanao ho lo ilay mpanomponao tsy mivadika.'),
  ('6ab25c7f5d23e2f6a2390062', '2026-09-22T10:46:23.356Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:23.356Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 2, 25, 'Hoy mantsy i Davida momba azy: ‘Ataoko eo anatrehako foana i Jehovah. Tsy hangozohozo mihitsy aho satria izy eo ankavanako.', 'hoy mantsy i davida momba azy: ‘ataoko eo anatrehako foana i jehovah. tsy hangozohozo mihitsy aho satria izy eo ankavanako.'),
  ('6ab25c7f5d23e2f6a2390058', '2026-09-22T10:46:23.356Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:23.356Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 2, 15, 'Tsy mamo, araka ny eritreretinareo, ireo olona ireo satria vao ora fahatelo amin’ny andro izao.', 'tsy mamo, araka ny eritreretinareo, ireo olona ireo satria vao ora fahatelo amin’ny andro izao.'),
  ('6ab25c7f5d23e2f6a2390057', '2026-09-22T10:46:23.356Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:23.356Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 2, 14, 'Nitsangana anefa i Petera sy ny 11 Lahy. Dia niteny mafy tsara i Petera hoe: “Ry mponin’i Jodia sy ianareo rehetra mipetraka eto Jerosalema, fantaro izao ary henoy tsara ny teniko:', 'nitsangana anefa i petera sy ny 11 lahy. dia niteny mafy tsara i petera hoe: “ry mponin’i jodia sy ianareo rehetra mipetraka eto jerosalema, fantaro izao ary henoy tsara ny teniko:'),
  ('6ab25c7f5d23e2f6a2390052', '2026-09-22T10:46:23.356Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:23.356Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 2, 9, 'Isika anefa Partianina, Medianina, Elamita, mponin’i Mezopotamia sy Jodia ary Kapadokia, ary avy any Ponto sy ny faritanin’i Azia,', 'isika anefa partianina, medianina, elamita, mponin’i mezopotamia sy jodia ary kapadokia, ary avy any ponto sy ny faritanin’i azia,'),
  ('6ab25c7f5d23e2f6a239004f', '2026-09-22T10:46:23.356Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:23.356Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 2, 6, 'Rehefa nandre an’ilay feo ny vahoaka, dia nitangorona ary lasa saina, satria samy naheno an’ireo mpianatra niteny tamin’ny fiteniny avy izy ireo.', 'rehefa nandre an’ilay feo ny vahoaka, dia nitangorona ary lasa saina, satria samy naheno an’ireo mpianatra niteny tamin’ny fiteniny avy izy ireo.'),
  ('6ab25c7f5d23e2f6a2390065', '2026-09-22T10:46:23.356Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:23.356Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 2, 28, 'Nampahafantarinao ahy ny lalana mankany amin’ny fiainana, ary hataonao faly be eo anatrehanao aho.’', 'nampahafantarinao ahy ny lalana mankany amin’ny fiainana, ary hataonao faly be eo anatrehanao aho.’'),
  ('6ab25c7f5d23e2f6a2390050', '2026-09-22T10:46:23.356Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:23.356Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 2, 7, 'Dia gaga be izy ireo, ka niteny hoe: “Jereo ange e! Tsy Galilianina daholo ve ireo miteny ireo?', 'dia gaga be izy ireo, ka niteny hoe: “jereo ange e! tsy galilianina daholo ve ireo miteny ireo?'),
  ('6ab25c7f5d23e2f6a239005f', '2026-09-22T10:46:23.356Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:23.356Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 2, 22, '“Ry lehilahy israelita, henoy izao teny izao: Nasehon’Andriamanitra niharihary taminareo hoe nirahiny ilay lehilahy atao hoe Jesosy avy any Nazareta, satria tamin’ny alalany no nanaovan’Andriamanitra zavatra miavaka sy fahagagana ary famantarana, araka ny efa fantatrareo.', '“ry lehilahy israelita, henoy izao teny izao: nasehon’andriamanitra niharihary taminareo hoe nirahiny ilay lehilahy atao hoe jesosy avy any nazareta, satria tamin’ny alalany no nanaovan’andriamanitra zavatra miavaka sy fahagagana ary famantarana, araka ny efa fantatrareo.'),
  ('6ab25c7f5d23e2f6a239005e', '2026-09-22T10:46:23.356Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:23.356Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 2, 21, 'Ary izay rehetra miantso ny anaran’i Jehovah no hovonjena.”’', 'ary izay rehetra miantso ny anaran’i jehovah no hovonjena.”’'),
  ('6ab25c7f5d23e2f6a239005b', '2026-09-22T10:46:23.356Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:23.356Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 2, 18, 'Ary na ny mpanompolahiko sy ny mpanompovaviko aza, dia handatsahako ampahany amin’ny fanahiko amin’izany andro izany, ka haminany.', 'ary na ny mpanompolahiko sy ny mpanompovaviko aza, dia handatsahako ampahany amin’ny fanahiko amin’izany andro izany, ka haminany.'),
  ('6ab25c7f5d23e2f6a239004a', '2026-09-22T10:46:23.356Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:23.356Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 2, 1, 'Niaraka teo amin’ny toerana iray daholo izy rehetra, tamin’ny Fetin’ny Pentekosta.', 'niaraka teo amin’ny toerana iray daholo izy rehetra, tamin’ny fetin’ny pentekosta.'),
  ('6ab25c7f5d23e2f6a239004e', '2026-09-22T10:46:23.356Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:23.356Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 2, 5, 'Nisy Jiosy avy tamin’ny firenena rehetra ambanin’ny lanitra, nivahiny tao Jerosalema tamin’izay. Olona natahotra an’Andriamanitra izy ireo.', 'nisy jiosy avy tamin’ny firenena rehetra ambanin’ny lanitra, nivahiny tao jerosalema tamin’izay. olona natahotra an’andriamanitra izy ireo.'),
  ('6ab25c7f5d23e2f6a239004c', '2026-09-22T10:46:23.356Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:23.356Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 2, 3, 'Ary nisy lela maro hoatran’ny afo hitan’izy ireo, ary nizarazara ireny ka nisy iray avy nankeo ambonin’ny tsirairay taminy.', 'ary nisy lela maro hoatran’ny afo hitan’izy ireo, ary nizarazara ireny ka nisy iray avy nankeo ambonin’ny tsirairay taminy.'),
  ('6ab25c7f5d23e2f6a2390061', '2026-09-22T10:46:23.356Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:23.356Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 2, 24, 'kanefa natsangan’Andriamanitra tamin’ny maty. Nanafaka azy tamin’ny fanaintainan’ny fahafatesana Izy, satria tsy nahavita nangeja azy ny fahafatesana.', 'kanefa natsangan’andriamanitra tamin’ny maty. nanafaka azy tamin’ny fanaintainan’ny fahafatesana izy, satria tsy nahavita nangeja azy ny fahafatesana.'),
  ('6ab25c7f5d23e2f6a239005a', '2026-09-22T10:46:23.356Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:23.356Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 2, 17, '‘“Ary amin’ny andro farany”, hoy Andriamanitra, “dia handatsahako ampahany amin’ny fanahiko ny karazan’olona rehetra, ka ny zanakareo lahy sy ny zanakareo vavy haminany, ny tovolahy eo aminareo hahita fahitana, ary ny lehilahy zokiolona eo aminareo hanonofy.', '‘“ary amin’ny andro farany”, hoy andriamanitra, “dia handatsahako ampahany amin’ny fanahiko ny karazan’olona rehetra, ka ny zanakareo lahy sy ny zanakareo vavy haminany, ny tovolahy eo aminareo hahita fahitana, ary ny lehilahy zokiolona eo aminareo hanonofy.'),
  ('6ab25c7f5d23e2f6a2390054', '2026-09-22T10:46:23.356Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:23.356Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 2, 11, 'ary Kretanina sy Arabo. Rentsika anefa ry zareo miteny amin’ny fitenintsika avy, momba ny asa lehibe nataon’Andriamanitra.”', 'ary kretanina sy arabo. rentsika anefa ry zareo miteny amin’ny fitenintsika avy, momba ny asa lehibe nataon’andriamanitra.”'),
  ('6ab25c7f5d23e2f6a239004b', '2026-09-22T10:46:23.356Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:23.356Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 2, 2, 'Tampoka teo, dia nisy feo mafy tonga avy any an-danitra, toy ny rivo-mahery nifofofofo, ka heno eran’ilay trano, raha mbola teo am-pipetrahana izy ireo.', 'tampoka teo, dia nisy feo mafy tonga avy any an-danitra, toy ny rivo-mahery nifofofofo, ka heno eran’ilay trano, raha mbola teo am-pipetrahana izy ireo.'),
  ('6ab25c7f5d23e2f6a239005c', '2026-09-22T10:46:23.356Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:23.356Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 2, 19, 'Ary hanao fahagagana eny amin’ny lanitra ambony aho, sy famantarana eny amin’ny tany ambany—dia ra sy afo ary setroka matevina.', 'ary hanao fahagagana eny amin’ny lanitra ambony aho, sy famantarana eny amin’ny tany ambany—dia ra sy afo ary setroka matevina.'),
  ('6ab25c7f5d23e2f6a2390060', '2026-09-22T10:46:23.356Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:23.356Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 2, 23, 'Natolotra anareo iny lehilahy iny, satria efa sitrapon’Andriamanitra izany sady efa fantany mialoha. Nofantsihanareo teo amin’ny tsato-kazo izy, ary olona mpandika lalàna no nasainareo nanao an’izany. Novonoinareo izy,', 'natolotra anareo iny lehilahy iny, satria efa sitrapon’andriamanitra izany sady efa fantany mialoha. nofantsihanareo teo amin’ny tsato-kazo izy, ary olona mpandika lalàna no nasainareo nanao an’izany. novonoinareo izy,'),
  ('6ab25c7f5d23e2f6a2390053', '2026-09-22T10:46:23.356Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:23.356Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 2, 10, 'Frijia sy Pamfylia, Ejipta sy ny faritr’i Libya akaikin’i Kyrena, ary vahiny avy any Roma, na Jiosy izany na olona lasa nanaraka ny fivavahana jiosy,', 'frijia sy pamfylia, ejipta sy ny faritr’i libya akaikin’i kyrena, ary vahiny avy any roma, na jiosy izany na olona lasa nanaraka ny fivavahana jiosy,'),
  ('6ab25c7f5d23e2f6a2390066', '2026-09-22T10:46:23.356Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:23.356Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 2, 29, '“Ry rahalahy, mamelà ahy hiresaka amim-pahatsorana aminareo momba an’i Davida loham-pianakaviantsika, izay efa maty sady efa nalevina, ary eto amintsika ny fasany hatramin’izao.', '“ry rahalahy, mamelà ahy hiresaka amim-pahatsorana aminareo momba an’i davida loham-pianakaviantsika, izay efa maty sady efa nalevina, ary eto amintsika ny fasany hatramin’izao.'),
  ('6ab25c7f5d23e2f6a2390055', '2026-09-22T10:46:23.356Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:23.356Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 2, 12, 'Gaga be mihitsy izy rehetra sady sahiran-tsaina, ka nifampiresaka hoe: “Inona no dikan’izao?”', 'gaga be mihitsy izy rehetra sady sahiran-tsaina, ka nifampiresaka hoe: “inona no dikan’izao?”'),
  ('6ab25c7f5d23e2f6a2390063', '2026-09-22T10:46:23.356Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:23.356Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 2, 26, 'Noho izany, dia falifaly ny foko ary ravoravo ny lelako. Dia hanana fanantenana foana aho,', 'noho izany, dia falifaly ny foko ary ravoravo ny lelako. dia hanana fanantenana foana aho,'),
  ('6ab25c7f5d23e2f6a239004d', '2026-09-22T10:46:23.356Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:23.356Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 2, 4, 'Dia samy feno fanahy masina izy rehetra, ka niteny tamin’ny fiteny maro samihafa, araka izay nampitenenan’ny fanahy azy.', 'dia samy feno fanahy masina izy rehetra, ka niteny tamin’ny fiteny maro samihafa, araka izay nampitenenan’ny fanahy azy.'),
  ('6ab25c7f5d23e2f6a239006e', '2026-09-22T10:46:23.357Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:23.357Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 2, 37, 'Koa voatsindrona ny fon’izy ireo rehefa nandre an’izany, ka hoy izy ireo tamin’i Petera sy ny apostoly hafa: “Inona izany no tokony hataonay, ry rahalahy?”', 'koa voatsindrona ny fon’izy ireo rehefa nandre an’izany, ka hoy izy ireo tamin’i petera sy ny apostoly hafa: “inona izany no tokony hataonay, ry rahalahy?”'),
  ('6ab25c7f5d23e2f6a2390069', '2026-09-22T10:46:23.357Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:23.357Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 2, 32, 'Natsangan’Andriamanitra tamin’ny maty iny Jesosy iny, ary vavolombelon’izany izahay rehetra.', 'natsangan’andriamanitra tamin’ny maty iny jesosy iny, ary vavolombelon’izany izahay rehetra.'),
  ('6ab25c7f5d23e2f6a2390072', '2026-09-22T10:46:23.357Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:23.357Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 2, 41, 'Natao batisa àry izay olona nanaiky tsara ny tenin’i Petera, ka niampy 3 000 teo ho eo ny isan’izy ireo tamin’iny andro iny.', 'natao batisa àry izay olona nanaiky tsara ny tenin’i petera, ka niampy 3 000 teo ho eo ny isan’izy ireo tamin’iny andro iny.'),
  ('6ab25c7f5d23e2f6a239006f', '2026-09-22T10:46:23.357Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:23.357Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 2, 38, 'Dia hoy i Petera: “Mibebaha, ary aoka samy hatao batisa amin’ny anaran’i Jesosy Kristy ianareo tsirairay, mba hahazoanareo famelan-keloka. Ary hahazo an’ilay fanomezana maimaim-poana ianareo, dia ny fanahy masina.', 'dia hoy i petera: “mibebaha, ary aoka samy hatao batisa amin’ny anaran’i jesosy kristy ianareo tsirairay, mba hahazoanareo famelan-keloka. ary hahazo an’ilay fanomezana maimaim-poana ianareo, dia ny fanahy masina.'),
  ('6ab25c7f5d23e2f6a239006a', '2026-09-22T10:46:23.357Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:23.357Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 2, 33, 'Koa satria nasandratra ho eo ankavanan’Andriamanitra izy ary nahazo ny fanahy masina nampanantenain’ny Ray, dia izy no nampilatsaka an’izao hitanareo sy renareo izao.', 'koa satria nasandratra ho eo ankavanan’andriamanitra izy ary nahazo ny fanahy masina nampanantenain’ny ray, dia izy no nampilatsaka an’izao hitanareo sy renareo izao.'),
  ('6ab25c7f5d23e2f6a2390067', '2026-09-22T10:46:23.357Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:23.357Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 2, 30, 'Mpaminany izy, ary fantany fa nianiana taminy Andriamanitra hoe ny iray amin’ny taranany no hapetrak’Andriamanitra eo amin’ny seza fiandrianany. Noho izany, dia', 'mpaminany izy, ary fantany fa nianiana taminy andriamanitra hoe ny iray amin’ny taranany no hapetrak’andriamanitra eo amin’ny seza fiandrianany. noho izany, dia'),
  ('6ab25c7f5d23e2f6a2390075', '2026-09-22T10:46:23.357Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:23.357Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 2, 44, 'Ary niaraka daholo izay lasa mpino, ka nikambanany daholo ny zava-drehetra.', 'ary niaraka daholo izay lasa mpino, ka nikambanany daholo ny zava-drehetra.'),
  ('6ab25c7f5d23e2f6a2390073', '2026-09-22T10:46:23.357Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:23.357Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 2, 42, 'Nihaino tsara foana ny fampianaran’ny apostoly izy ireo, sady nifanerasera akaiky sy niara-nisakafo foana, ary tsy nitsahatra nivavaka.', 'nihaino tsara foana ny fampianaran’ny apostoly izy ireo, sady nifanerasera akaiky sy niara-nisakafo foana, ary tsy nitsahatra nivavaka.'),
  ('6ab25c7f5d23e2f6a239006b', '2026-09-22T10:46:23.357Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:23.357Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 2, 34, 'Fa tsy niakatra tany an-danitra i Davida, fa izy aza nilaza hoe: ‘Hoy i Jehovah tamin’ny Tompoko: “Mipetraha eto ankavanako', 'fa tsy niakatra tany an-danitra i davida, fa izy aza nilaza hoe: ‘hoy i jehovah tamin’ny tompoko: “mipetraha eto ankavanako'),
  ('6ab25c7f5d23e2f6a2390076', '2026-09-22T10:46:23.357Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:23.357Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 2, 45, 'Nivarotra ny taniny sy ny fananany izy ireo, ka ny vola azo dia nozarainy tamin’ny rehetra, araka izay nilain’ny tsirairay.', 'nivarotra ny taniny sy ny fananany izy ireo, ka ny vola azo dia nozarainy tamin’ny rehetra, araka izay nilain’ny tsirairay.'),
  ('6ab25c7f5d23e2f6a2390070', '2026-09-22T10:46:23.357Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:23.357Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 2, 39, 'Fa nampanantenaina an’izany ianareo sy ny zanakareo ary izay rehetra any lavitra any, izany hoe izay rehetra antsoin’i Jehovah Andriamanitsika hanatona azy.”', 'fa nampanantenaina an’izany ianareo sy ny zanakareo ary izay rehetra any lavitra any, izany hoe izay rehetra antsoin’i jehovah andriamanitsika hanatona azy.”'),
  ('6ab25c7f5d23e2f6a2390078', '2026-09-22T10:46:23.357Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:23.357Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 2, 47, 'ary nidera an’Andriamanitra sady nahazo sitraka tamin’ny vahoaka manontolo. Nandritra an’izany fotoana izany, dia nisy olona voavonjy nataon’i Jehovah nanampy isa azy ireo isan’andro.', 'ary nidera an’andriamanitra sady nahazo sitraka tamin’ny vahoaka manontolo. nandritra an’izany fotoana izany, dia nisy olona voavonjy nataon’i jehovah nanampy isa azy ireo isan’andro.'),
  ('6ab25c7f5d23e2f6a2390074', '2026-09-22T10:46:23.357Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:23.357Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 2, 43, 'Dia natahotra daholo ny olona, ary be dia be ny fahagagana sy famantarana nataon’ny apostoly.', 'dia natahotra daholo ny olona, ary be dia be ny fahagagana sy famantarana nataon’ny apostoly.');
INSERT INTO "bible_verses" ("id", "created_date", "updated_date", "created_by_id", "created_by", "translation", "book", "bookOrder", "chapter", "verse", "text", "normalizedText") VALUES
  ('6ab25c7f5d23e2f6a2390068', '2026-09-22T10:46:23.357Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:23.357Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 2, 31, 'fantatr’i Davida mialoha fa hitsangana amin’ny maty i Kristy ary efa niresaka momba an’izany izy. Noresahiny hoe tsy nafoy tao amin’ny Fasana i Jesosy sady tsy lo ny nofony.', 'fantatr’i davida mialoha fa hitsangana amin’ny maty i kristy ary efa niresaka momba an’izany izy. noresahiny hoe tsy nafoy tao amin’ny fasana i jesosy sady tsy lo ny nofony.'),
  ('6ab25c7f5d23e2f6a2390071', '2026-09-22T10:46:23.357Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:23.357Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 2, 40, 'Ary mbola niresaka zavatra maro i Petera ka nanome fanazavana feno, ary namerimberina nampirisika azy ireo hoe: “Misaraha amin’ity taranaka maditra ity mba ho voavonjy ianareo.”', 'ary mbola niresaka zavatra maro i petera ka nanome fanazavana feno, ary namerimberina nampirisika azy ireo hoe: “misaraha amin’ity taranaka maditra ity mba ho voavonjy ianareo.”'),
  ('6ab25c7f5d23e2f6a239006d', '2026-09-22T10:46:23.357Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:23.357Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 2, 36, 'Aoka àry ho fantatry ny taranak’Israely rehetra mazava tsara fa nataon’Andriamanitra ho Tompo sy Kristy iny Jesosy novonoinareo teo amin’ny tsato-kazo iny.”', 'aoka àry ho fantatry ny taranak’israely rehetra mazava tsara fa nataon’andriamanitra ho tompo sy kristy iny jesosy novonoinareo teo amin’ny tsato-kazo iny.”'),
  ('6ab25c7f5d23e2f6a239006c', '2026-09-22T10:46:23.357Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:23.357Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 2, 35, 'mandra-panaoko ny fahavalonao ho fitoeran-tongotrao.”’', 'mandra-panaoko ny fahavalonao ho fitoeran-tongotrao.”’'),
  ('6ab25c7f5d23e2f6a2390077', '2026-09-22T10:46:23.357Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:23.357Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 2, 46, 'Tao amin’ny tempoly foana izy ireo isan’andro sady niray saina. Nisakafo tany amin’ny trano samy hafa koa izy ireo, ka faly erỳ nizara ny sakafony sady nanao an’izany tamin’ny fo madio,', 'tao amin’ny tempoly foana izy ireo isan’andro sady niray saina. nisakafo tany amin’ny trano samy hafa koa izy ireo, ka faly erỳ nizara ny sakafony sady nanao an’izany tamin’ny fo madio,'),
  ('6ab25c7ff19bcd242783450d', '2026-09-22T10:46:23.884Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:23.884Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 3, 19, '“Koa mibebaha, ary miverena amin’Andriamanitra mba ho voafafa ny fahotanareo. Amin’izay dia hisy fotoana mamelombelona avy amin’i Jehovah,', '“koa mibebaha, ary miverena amin’andriamanitra mba ho voafafa ny fahotanareo. amin’izay dia hisy fotoana mamelombelona avy amin’i jehovah,'),
  ('6ab25c7ff19bcd2427834506', '2026-09-22T10:46:23.884Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:23.884Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 3, 12, 'Hitan’i Petera izany, ka hoy izy tamin’ilay vahoaka: “Ry Israelita, maninona ianareo no gaga be? Ary maninona ianareo no mandinika be anay, hoatran’ny hoe ny herinay na hoe noho izahay nahafoy tena ho an’Andriamanitra no nahavitanay nampandeha azy?', 'hitan’i petera izany, ka hoy izy tamin’ilay vahoaka: “ry israelita, maninona ianareo no gaga be? ary maninona ianareo no mandinika be anay, hoatran’ny hoe ny herinay na hoe noho izahay nahafoy tena ho an’andriamanitra no nahavitanay nampandeha azy?'),
  ('6ab25c7ff19bcd2427834502', '2026-09-22T10:46:23.884Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:23.884Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 3, 8, 'ka nitsambikina izy, ary nanomboka nandeha. Niditra tao amin’ny tempoly niaraka tamin’izy roa lahy izy, ka nandeha sady nitsambikimbikina ary nidera an’Andriamanitra.', 'ka nitsambikina izy, ary nanomboka nandeha. niditra tao amin’ny tempoly niaraka tamin’izy roa lahy izy, ka nandeha sady nitsambikimbikina ary nidera an’andriamanitra.'),
  ('6ab25c7ff19bcd2427834500', '2026-09-22T10:46:23.884Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:23.884Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 3, 6, 'Hoy anefa i Petera: “Tsy manana volafotsy na volamena aho, fa izay ananako no omeko anao. Amin’ny anaran’i Jesosy Kristy avy any Nazareta, mandehana!”', 'hoy anefa i petera: “tsy manana volafotsy na volamena aho, fa izay ananako no omeko anao. amin’ny anaran’i jesosy kristy avy any nazareta, mandehana!”'),
  ('6ab25c7ff19bcd242783450b', '2026-09-22T10:46:23.884Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:23.884Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 3, 17, 'Ary ankehitriny, ry rahalahy, fantatro fa noho ny tsy fahalalanareo no nanaovanareo an’ireny, ary hoatr’izany koa ny mpitondra anareo.', 'ary ankehitriny, ry rahalahy, fantatro fa noho ny tsy fahalalanareo no nanaovanareo an’ireny, ary hoatr’izany koa ny mpitondra anareo.'),
  ('6ab25c7ff19bcd2427834507', '2026-09-22T10:46:23.884Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:23.884Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 3, 13, 'Nanome voninahitra an’i Jesosy Mpanompony ny Andriamanitr’i Abrahama sy Isaka ary Jakoba, dia ilay Andriamanitry ny razambentsika. Ianareo anefa nanolotra an’i Jesosy hovonoina ka nanda azy teo anatrehan’i Pilato, na dia efa tapa-kevitra ny hanafaka azy aza izy.', 'nanome voninahitra an’i jesosy mpanompony ny andriamanitr’i abrahama sy isaka ary jakoba, dia ilay andriamanitry ny razambentsika. ianareo anefa nanolotra an’i jesosy hovonoina ka nanda azy teo anatrehan’i pilato, na dia efa tapa-kevitra ny hanafaka azy aza izy.'),
  ('6ab25c7ff19bcd2427834513', '2026-09-22T10:46:23.884Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:23.884Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 3, 25, 'Ianareo no zanaky ny mpaminany sy zanaky ny fifanekena nifanaovan’Andriamanitra tamin’ny razambenareo, tamin’izy nilaza tamin’i Abrahama hoe: ‘Hahazo fitahiana amin’ny alalan’ny taranakao ny firenena rehetra eny ambonin’ny tany.’', 'ianareo no zanaky ny mpaminany sy zanaky ny fifanekena nifanaovan’andriamanitra tamin’ny razambenareo, tamin’izy nilaza tamin’i abrahama hoe: ‘hahazo fitahiana amin’ny alalan’ny taranakao ny firenena rehetra eny ambonin’ny tany.’'),
  ('6ab25c7ff19bcd2427834512', '2026-09-22T10:46:23.884Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:23.884Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 3, 24, 'Ary nanambara mazava momba an’izao andro izao ny mpaminany rehetra, dia izay rehetra naminany nanomboka tamin’i Samoela sy ireo nandimby azy.', 'ary nanambara mazava momba an’izao andro izao ny mpaminany rehetra, dia izay rehetra naminany nanomboka tamin’i samoela sy ireo nandimby azy.'),
  ('6ab25c7ff19bcd24278344ff', '2026-09-22T10:46:23.884Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:23.884Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 3, 5, 'Nibanjina tsara azy roa lahy àry izy, satria nanantena hahazo zavatra taminy.', 'nibanjina tsara azy roa lahy àry izy, satria nanantena hahazo zavatra taminy.'),
  ('6ab25c7ff19bcd2427834514', '2026-09-22T10:46:23.884Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:23.884Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 3, 26, 'Rehefa avy nanendry an’ilay Mpanompony Andriamanitra, dia tany aminareo aloha izy no nirahiny mba hahazoanareo fitahiana, ka hanampy anareo tsirairay hiala amin’ny zava-dratsy nataonareo.”', 'rehefa avy nanendry an’ilay mpanompony andriamanitra, dia tany aminareo aloha izy no nirahiny mba hahazoanareo fitahiana, ka hanampy anareo tsirairay hiala amin’ny zava-dratsy nataonareo.”'),
  ('6ab25c7ff19bcd2427834510', '2026-09-22T10:46:23.884Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:23.884Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 3, 22, 'Niteny tokoa mantsy i Mosesy hoe: ‘Hanendry mpaminany ho anareo i Jehovah Andriamanitrareo, dia mpaminany hoatr’ahy, avy eo amin’ny rahalahinareo. Henoy izay rehetra lazainy aminareo.', 'niteny tokoa mantsy i mosesy hoe: ‘hanendry mpaminany ho anareo i jehovah andriamanitrareo, dia mpaminany hoatr’ahy, avy eo amin’ny rahalahinareo. henoy izay rehetra lazainy aminareo.'),
  ('6ab25c7ff19bcd24278344fd', '2026-09-22T10:46:23.884Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:23.884Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 3, 3, 'Vao nahita an’i Petera sy Jaona handeha hiditra tao amin’ny tempoly izy, dia nangata-bola tamin’izy ireo.', 'vao nahita an’i petera sy jaona handeha hiditra tao amin’ny tempoly izy, dia nangata-bola tamin’izy ireo.'),
  ('6ab25c7ff19bcd242783450c', '2026-09-22T10:46:23.884Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:23.884Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 3, 18, 'Izany anefa no fomba nanatanterahan’Andriamanitra an’izay efa nampilazainy ny mpaminany rehetra, dia ny hoe tsy maintsy hijaly ilay Kristy voatendriny.', 'izany anefa no fomba nanatanterahan’andriamanitra an’izay efa nampilazainy ny mpaminany rehetra, dia ny hoe tsy maintsy hijaly ilay kristy voatendriny.'),
  ('6ab25c7ff19bcd2427834509', '2026-09-22T10:46:23.884Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:23.884Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 3, 15, 'fa novonoinareo kosa ilay Mpitarika Lehibe Indrindra manome fiainana. Natsangan’Andriamanitra tamin’ny maty anefa izy, ary vavolombelon’izany izahay.', 'fa novonoinareo kosa ilay mpitarika lehibe indrindra manome fiainana. natsangan’andriamanitra tamin’ny maty anefa izy, ary vavolombelon’izany izahay.'),
  ('6ab25c7ff19bcd2427834503', '2026-09-22T10:46:23.884Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:23.884Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 3, 9, 'Ary hitan’ny vahoaka rehetra izy nandeha sy nidera an’Andriamanitra.', 'ary hitan’ny vahoaka rehetra izy nandeha sy nidera an’andriamanitra.'),
  ('6ab25c7ff19bcd24278344fc', '2026-09-22T10:46:23.884Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:23.884Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 3, 2, 'Ary nisy lehilahy nalemy tongotra hatrany an-kibon-dreniny nentin’olona teo amin’ny vavahadin’ny tempoly, ilay atao hoe Vavahady Kanto. Napetrak’izy ireo isan’andro teo izy, mba hangataka tamin’izay niditra tao amin’ny tempoly.', 'ary nisy lehilahy nalemy tongotra hatrany an-kibon-dreniny nentin’olona teo amin’ny vavahadin’ny tempoly, ilay atao hoe vavahady kanto. napetrak’izy ireo isan’andro teo izy, mba hangataka tamin’izay niditra tao amin’ny tempoly.'),
  ('6ab25c7ff19bcd24278344fb', '2026-09-22T10:46:23.884Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:23.884Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 3, 1, 'Niakatra nankao amin’ny tempoly i Petera sy Jaona tamin’ny ora fivavahana, dia ny ora fahasivy.', 'niakatra nankao amin’ny tempoly i petera sy jaona tamin’ny ora fivavahana, dia ny ora fahasivy.'),
  ('6ab25c7ff19bcd2427834504', '2026-09-22T10:46:23.884Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:23.884Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 3, 10, 'Fantatr’izy ireo avy eo fa izy ilay lehilahy nipetraka nangataka teo amin’ny Vavahady Kanto, teo amin’ny tempoly. Koa gaga be izy ireo, sady tsy nampino azy ireo izay nitranga tamin’ilay lehilahy.', 'fantatr’izy ireo avy eo fa izy ilay lehilahy nipetraka nangataka teo amin’ny vavahady kanto, teo amin’ny tempoly. koa gaga be izy ireo, sady tsy nampino azy ireo izay nitranga tamin’ilay lehilahy.'),
  ('6ab25c7ff19bcd2427834501', '2026-09-22T10:46:23.884Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:23.884Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 3, 7, 'Dia noraisiny tamin’ny tanany ankavanana izy ka natsangany. Tonga dia natanjaka ny tongotr’ilay lehilahy sy ny kitrokeliny,', 'dia noraisiny tamin’ny tanany ankavanana izy ka natsangany. tonga dia natanjaka ny tongotr’ilay lehilahy sy ny kitrokeliny,'),
  ('6ab25c7ff19bcd24278344fe', '2026-09-22T10:46:23.884Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:23.884Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 3, 4, 'Nijery tsara azy kosa i Petera sy Jaona, dia hoy i Petera: “Jereo izahay.”', 'nijery tsara azy kosa i petera sy jaona, dia hoy i petera: “jereo izahay.”'),
  ('6ab25c7ff19bcd242783450f', '2026-09-22T10:46:23.884Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:23.884Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 3, 21, 'Tsy maintsy miandry any an-danitra izy, mandra-pahatongan’ny fotoana hamerenana ny zava-drehetra amin’ny laoniny, dia ireo zavatra nasain’Andriamanitra nolazain’ny mpaminaniny masina taloha.', 'tsy maintsy miandry any an-danitra izy, mandra-pahatongan’ny fotoana hamerenana ny zava-drehetra amin’ny laoniny, dia ireo zavatra nasain’andriamanitra nolazain’ny mpaminaniny masina taloha.'),
  ('6ab25c7ff19bcd2427834511', '2026-09-22T10:46:23.884Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:23.884Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 3, 23, 'Koa izay rehetra tsy mihaino an’izany Mpaminany izany, dia haringana tanteraka tsy ho eo amin’ny vahoaka.’', 'koa izay rehetra tsy mihaino an’izany mpaminany izany, dia haringana tanteraka tsy ho eo amin’ny vahoaka.’'),
  ('6ab25c7ff19bcd2427834508', '2026-09-22T10:46:23.884Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:23.884Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 3, 14, 'Nolavinareo tokoa ilay masina sy marina. Mpamono olona no nangatahinareo hafahana ho anareo,', 'nolavinareo tokoa ilay masina sy marina. mpamono olona no nangatahinareo hafahana ho anareo,'),
  ('6ab25c7ff19bcd2427834505', '2026-09-22T10:46:23.884Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:23.884Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 3, 11, 'Raha mbola namikitra tamin’i Petera sy Jaona izy, dia tamy ny vahoaka rehetra nirohotra nankeo amin’izy telo lahy, teo amin’ilay atao hoe Lala-mitafon’i Solomona. Ary tena talanjona izy ireo.', 'raha mbola namikitra tamin’i petera sy jaona izy, dia tamy ny vahoaka rehetra nirohotra nankeo amin’izy telo lahy, teo amin’ilay atao hoe lala-mitafon’i solomona. ary tena talanjona izy ireo.'),
  ('6ab25c7ff19bcd242783450e', '2026-09-22T10:46:23.884Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:23.884Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 3, 20, 'ary hirahiny ilay Kristy voatendry ho anareo, dia i Jesosy.', 'ary hirahiny ilay kristy voatendry ho anareo, dia i jesosy.'),
  ('6ab25c7ff19bcd242783450a', '2026-09-22T10:46:23.884Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:23.884Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 3, 16, 'Tamin’ny alalan’ny anarany sy ny finoanay ny anarany no nampahatanjaka an’io lehilahy hitanareo sy fantatrareo io. Ny finoana an’i Jesosy no nahasitrana tanteraka an’io lehilahy io eto anatrehanareo rehetra.', 'tamin’ny alalan’ny anarany sy ny finoanay ny anarany no nampahatanjaka an’io lehilahy hitanareo sy fantatrareo io. ny finoana an’i jesosy no nahasitrana tanteraka an’io lehilahy io eto anatrehanareo rehetra.'),
  ('6ab25c81d9eb75ae22dbbe3a', '2026-09-22T10:46:25.117Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:25.117Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 4, 15, 'Koa nasain’izy ireo nivoaka avy tao amin’ny trano nisy ny Fitsarana Avo Jiosy ry zareo. Dia niara-nidinika izy ireo', 'koa nasain’izy ireo nivoaka avy tao amin’ny trano nisy ny fitsarana avo jiosy ry zareo. dia niara-nidinika izy ireo'),
  ('6ab25c81d9eb75ae22dbbe36', '2026-09-22T10:46:25.117Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:25.117Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 4, 11, 'Izy ‘ilay vato nataonareo mpanao trano ho tsy misy dikany, nefa lasa vato fehizoro lehibe indrindra.’', 'izy ‘ilay vato nataonareo mpanao trano ho tsy misy dikany, nefa lasa vato fehizoro lehibe indrindra.’'),
  ('6ab25c81d9eb75ae22dbbe35', '2026-09-22T10:46:25.117Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:25.117Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 4, 10, 'dia aoka ho fantatrareo rehetra sy ny vahoakan’Israely manontolo fa matoa io lehilahy io salama tsara manoloana anareo eto, dia noho ny anaran’ i Jesosy Kristy avy any Nazareta, ilay novonoinareo teo amin’ny tsato-kazo, nefa natsangan’Andriamanitra tamin’ny maty.', 'dia aoka ho fantatrareo rehetra sy ny vahoakan’israely manontolo fa matoa io lehilahy io salama tsara manoloana anareo eto, dia noho ny anaran’ i jesosy kristy avy any nazareta, ilay novonoinareo teo amin’ny tsato-kazo, nefa natsangan’andriamanitra tamin’ny maty.'),
  ('6ab25c81d9eb75ae22dbbe2d', '2026-09-22T10:46:25.117Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:25.117Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 4, 2, 'Sosotra izy ireo, satria nampianatra ny vahoaka ny apostoly sady nanambara tamin’ny olona rehetra hoe natsangana tamin’ny maty i Jesosy.', 'sosotra izy ireo, satria nampianatra ny vahoaka ny apostoly sady nanambara tamin’ny olona rehetra hoe natsangana tamin’ny maty i jesosy.'),
  ('6ab25c81d9eb75ae22dbbe39', '2026-09-22T10:46:25.117Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:25.117Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 4, 14, 'Tsy nanan-kavaly anefa izy ireo, satria hitany niara-nijoro tamin’izy roa lahy teo ilay lehilahy efa sitrana.', 'tsy nanan-kavaly anefa izy ireo, satria hitany niara-nijoro tamin’izy roa lahy teo ilay lehilahy efa sitrana.'),
  ('6ab25c81d9eb75ae22dbbe33', '2026-09-22T10:46:25.117Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:25.117Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 4, 8, 'Ary feno fanahy masina i Petera, ka namaly hoe: “Ry mpitondra vahoaka sy anti-panahy isany!', 'ary feno fanahy masina i petera, ka namaly hoe: “ry mpitondra vahoaka sy anti-panahy isany!'),
  ('6ab25c81d9eb75ae22dbbe37', '2026-09-22T10:46:25.117Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:25.117Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 4, 12, 'Ary tsy misy olon-kafa hahazoana famonjena, satria tsy misy anarana hafa hahazoantsika famonjena amin’izay anarana nomena ny olona etỳ ambanin’ny lanitra.”', 'ary tsy misy olon-kafa hahazoana famonjena, satria tsy misy anarana hafa hahazoantsika famonjena amin’izay anarana nomena ny olona etỳ ambanin’ny lanitra.”'),
  ('6ab25c81d9eb75ae22dbbe3d', '2026-09-22T10:46:25.117Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:25.117Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 4, 18, 'Dia nantsoiny izy roa lahy, ka norarany tsy hiteny na inona na inona na hampianatra amin’ny anaran’i Jesosy intsony.', 'dia nantsoiny izy roa lahy, ka norarany tsy hiteny na inona na inona na hampianatra amin’ny anaran’i jesosy intsony.'),
  ('6ab25c81d9eb75ae22dbbe34', '2026-09-22T10:46:25.117Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:25.117Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 4, 9, 'Raha fotopotorana izahay androany satria nanao soa olona kilemaina, ka tianareo ho fantatra hoe iza no nanasitrana azy,', 'raha fotopotorana izahay androany satria nanao soa olona kilemaina, ka tianareo ho fantatra hoe iza no nanasitrana azy,'),
  ('6ab25c81d9eb75ae22dbbe32', '2026-09-22T10:46:25.117Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:25.117Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 4, 7, 'Dia nataon’izy ireo teo afovoany i Petera sy Jaona, ka nanontaniany hoe: “Fahefana avy aiza, na tamin’ny anaran’iza no nanaovanareo an’izao?”', 'dia nataon’izy ireo teo afovoany i petera sy jaona, ka nanontaniany hoe: “fahefana avy aiza, na tamin’ny anaran’iza no nanaovanareo an’izao?”'),
  ('6ab25c81d9eb75ae22dbbe31', '2026-09-22T10:46:25.117Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:25.117Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 4, 6, 'Tao koa i Anasy lehiben’ny mpisorona, Kaiafa, Jaona, Aleksandra, ary izay rehetra havan’ilay lehiben’ny mpisorona.', 'tao koa i anasy lehiben’ny mpisorona, kaiafa, jaona, aleksandra, ary izay rehetra havan’ilay lehiben’ny mpisorona.'),
  ('6ab25c81d9eb75ae22dbbe3e', '2026-09-22T10:46:25.117Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:25.117Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 4, 19, 'Namaly anefa i Petera sy Jaona hoe: “Ianareo no aoka hitsara raha mety eo imason’Andriamanitra na tsia ny hoe hihaino anareo, fa tsy hihaino an’Andriamanitra.', 'namaly anefa i petera sy jaona hoe: “ianareo no aoka hitsara raha mety eo imason’andriamanitra na tsia ny hoe hihaino anareo, fa tsy hihaino an’andriamanitra.'),
  ('6ab25c81d9eb75ae22dbbe38', '2026-09-22T10:46:25.117Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:25.117Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 4, 13, 'Gaga izy ireo nahita ny fahasahian’i Petera sy Jaona, ary fantany fa tsy nahita fianarana izy roa lahy sady olon-tsotra. Dia fantany fa niaraka tamin’i Jesosy izy roa lahy.', 'gaga izy ireo nahita ny fahasahian’i petera sy jaona, ary fantany fa tsy nahita fianarana izy roa lahy sady olon-tsotra. dia fantany fa niaraka tamin’i jesosy izy roa lahy.'),
  ('6ab25c81d9eb75ae22dbbe2e', '2026-09-22T10:46:25.117Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:25.117Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 4, 3, 'Nosamborin’izy ireo àry izy roa lahy dia nataony am-ponja mandra-pahatongan’ny ampitso, satria efa hariva ny andro.', 'nosamborin’izy ireo àry izy roa lahy dia nataony am-ponja mandra-pahatongan’ny ampitso, satria efa hariva ny andro.'),
  ('6ab25c81d9eb75ae22dbbe3b', '2026-09-22T10:46:25.117Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:25.117Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 4, 16, 'hoe: “Hataontsika ahoana ireo lehilahy ireo? Fa nanao famantarana niavaka ry zareo, ary nahita an’izany ny mponina rehetra eto Jerosalema, ka tsy azontsika lavina.', 'hoe: “hataontsika ahoana ireo lehilahy ireo? fa nanao famantarana niavaka ry zareo, ary nahita an’izany ny mponina rehetra eto jerosalema, ka tsy azontsika lavina.'),
  ('6ab25c81d9eb75ae22dbbe30', '2026-09-22T10:46:25.117Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:25.117Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 4, 5, 'Ny ampitson’iny, dia nivory tao Jerosalema ny mpitondra sy ny anti-panahy ary ny mpanora-dalàna teo amin’izy ireo.', 'ny ampitson’iny, dia nivory tao jerosalema ny mpitondra sy ny anti-panahy ary ny mpanora-dalàna teo amin’izy ireo.'),
  ('6ab25c81d9eb75ae22dbbe2f', '2026-09-22T10:46:25.117Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:25.117Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 4, 4, 'Betsaka tamin’ireo nihaino an’ilay lahateny anefa no nino, ka lasa 5 000 teo ho eo ny isan’ny lehilahy.', 'betsaka tamin’ireo nihaino an’ilay lahateny anefa no nino, ka lasa 5 000 teo ho eo ny isan’ny lehilahy.'),
  ('6ab25c81d9eb75ae22dbbe3c', '2026-09-22T10:46:25.117Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:25.117Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 4, 17, 'Andao àry horahonantsika ry zareo, dia tsy havelantsika hiteny amin’izany anarana izany intsony na amin’iza na amin’iza, sao dia vao mainka hiely eo amin’ny vahoaka izany.”', 'andao àry horahonantsika ry zareo, dia tsy havelantsika hiteny amin’izany anarana izany intsony na amin’iza na amin’iza, sao dia vao mainka hiely eo amin’ny vahoaka izany.”'),
  ('6ab25c81d9eb75ae22dbbe2c', '2026-09-22T10:46:25.117Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:25.117Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 4, 1, 'Teo am-piresahana tamin’ny vahoaka izy roa lahy no tonga teo aminy ny mpisorona sy ny lehiben’ny mpiambina ny tempoly ary ny Sadoseo.', 'teo am-piresahana tamin’ny vahoaka izy roa lahy no tonga teo aminy ny mpisorona sy ny lehiben’ny mpiambina ny tempoly ary ny sadoseo.'),
  ('6ab25c81d9eb75ae22dbbe50', '2026-09-22T10:46:25.118Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:25.118Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 4, 37, 'dia nanana tany. Namidiny ilay tany, dia nentiny ny vola vidin’ilay izy ka napetrany teo an-tongotry ny apostoly.', 'dia nanana tany. namidiny ilay tany, dia nentiny ny vola vidin’ilay izy ka napetrany teo an-tongotry ny apostoly.'),
  ('6ab25c81d9eb75ae22dbbe4e', '2026-09-22T10:46:25.118Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:25.118Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 4, 35, 'ary nametraka an’izany teo an-tongotry ny apostoly. Dia nozaraina tamin’ny tsirairay arakaraka izay nilainy avy izany.', 'ary nametraka an’izany teo an-tongotry ny apostoly. dia nozaraina tamin’ny tsirairay arakaraka izay nilainy avy izany.'),
  ('6ab25c81d9eb75ae22dbbe48', '2026-09-22T10:46:25.118Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:25.118Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 4, 29, 'Koa henoy ny fandrahonany, Jehovah ô, ary ataovy izay hahatonga anay mpanomponao hanana fahasahiana be hitory ny teninao,', 'koa henoy ny fandrahonany, jehovah ô, ary ataovy izay hahatonga anay mpanomponao hanana fahasahiana be hitory ny teninao,'),
  ('6ab25c81d9eb75ae22dbbe46', '2026-09-22T10:46:25.118Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:25.118Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 4, 27, 'Fa nifamory teto amin’ity tanàna ity tokoa i Heroda sy Pontio Pilato niaraka tamin’ny hafa firenena sy ny vahoakan’Israely, mba hanohitra an’i Jesosy mpanomponao masina, ilay voahosotrao.', 'fa nifamory teto amin’ity tanàna ity tokoa i heroda sy pontio pilato niaraka tamin’ny hafa firenena sy ny vahoakan’israely, mba hanohitra an’i jesosy mpanomponao masina, ilay voahosotrao.'),
  ('6ab25c81d9eb75ae22dbbe45', '2026-09-22T10:46:25.118Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:25.118Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 4, 26, 'Nitsangana ireo mpanjakan’ny tany, ary nivondrona ny mpitondra mba hanohitra an’i Jehovah sy ilay voahosotra notendreny.’', 'nitsangana ireo mpanjakan’ny tany, ary nivondrona ny mpitondra mba hanohitra an’i jehovah sy ilay voahosotra notendreny.’'),
  ('6ab25c81d9eb75ae22dbbe42', '2026-09-22T10:46:25.118Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:25.118Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 4, 23, 'Dia nankany amin’ny mpiray finoana taminy izy roa lahy rehefa nafahana, ka notantarainy tamin’izy ireo izay nolazain’ny lehiben’ny mpisorona sy ny anti-panahy.', 'dia nankany amin’ny mpiray finoana taminy izy roa lahy rehefa nafahana, ka notantarainy tamin’izy ireo izay nolazain’ny lehiben’ny mpisorona sy ny anti-panahy.'),
  ('6ab25c81d9eb75ae22dbbe40', '2026-09-22T10:46:25.118Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:25.118Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 4, 21, 'Mbola nandrahona azy roa lahy indray izy ireo, dia nandefa azy avy eo. Tsy hitan’izy ireo mantsy izay tokony hanasaziana azy, ary natahorany koa ny vahoaka satria nanome voninahitra an’Andriamanitra izy rehetra noho izay nitranga.', 'mbola nandrahona azy roa lahy indray izy ireo, dia nandefa azy avy eo. tsy hitan’izy ireo mantsy izay tokony hanasaziana azy, ary natahorany koa ny vahoaka satria nanome voninahitra an’andriamanitra izy rehetra noho izay nitranga.'),
  ('6ab25c81d9eb75ae22dbbe49', '2026-09-22T10:46:25.118Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:25.118Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 4, 30, 'ary ianao hanatsotra ny tananao mba hanasitranana sy hanaovana famantarana sy fahagagana amin’ny anaran’i Jesosy mpanomponao masina.”', 'ary ianao hanatsotra ny tananao mba hanasitranana sy hanaovana famantarana sy fahagagana amin’ny anaran’i jesosy mpanomponao masina.”'),
  ('6ab25c81d9eb75ae22dbbe4f', '2026-09-22T10:46:25.118Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:25.118Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 4, 36, 'Ary i Josefa, ilay nantsoin’ny apostoly koa hoe Barnabasy—izany hoe “Zanaky ny Fampiononana”, raha adika—izay Levita teratany avy any Sipra,', 'ary i josefa, ilay nantsoin’ny apostoly koa hoe barnabasy—izany hoe “zanaky ny fampiononana”, raha adika—izay levita teratany avy any sipra,'),
  ('6ab25c81d9eb75ae22dbbe41', '2026-09-22T10:46:25.118Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:25.118Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 4, 22, 'Efa 40 taona mahery mantsy ilay lehilahy nositranina tamin’ny alalan’izany fahagagana izany.', 'efa 40 taona mahery mantsy ilay lehilahy nositranina tamin’ny alalan’izany fahagagana izany.'),
  ('6ab25c81d9eb75ae22dbbe4c', '2026-09-22T10:46:25.118Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:25.118Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 4, 33, 'Ary mbola nitory momba ny nananganana an’i Jesosy Tompo tamin’ny maty ny apostoly sady tena nandaitra ny fomba nanaovan’izy ireo an’izany. Ary nanehoana hatsaram-panahy miavaka be dia be izy rehetra.', 'ary mbola nitory momba ny nananganana an’i jesosy tompo tamin’ny maty ny apostoly sady tena nandaitra ny fomba nanaovan’izy ireo an’izany. ary nanehoana hatsaram-panahy miavaka be dia be izy rehetra.'),
  ('6ab25c81d9eb75ae22dbbe43', '2026-09-22T10:46:25.118Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:25.118Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 4, 24, 'Rehefa nandre an’izany izy ireo, dia niaraka nanandra-peo nivavaka tamin’Andriamanitra hoe: “Ry Tompo Fara Tampony ô, ianao no nanao ny lanitra sy ny tany sy ny ranomasina ary ny zava-drehetra ao amin’ireo.', 'rehefa nandre an’izany izy ireo, dia niaraka nanandra-peo nivavaka tamin’andriamanitra hoe: “ry tompo fara tampony ô, ianao no nanao ny lanitra sy ny tany sy ny ranomasina ary ny zava-drehetra ao amin’ireo.'),
  ('6ab25c81d9eb75ae22dbbe4d', '2026-09-22T10:46:25.118Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:25.118Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 4, 34, 'Tsy nisy nahantra teo amin’izy ireo, fa izay rehetra nanana tany na trano dia nivarotra an’izany ka nitondra ny vidin’izay lafo,', 'tsy nisy nahantra teo amin’izy ireo, fa izay rehetra nanana tany na trano dia nivarotra an’izany ka nitondra ny vidin’izay lafo,'),
  ('6ab25c81d9eb75ae22dbbe4a', '2026-09-22T10:46:25.118Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:25.118Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 4, 31, 'Rehefa avy nitalaho tamim-bavaka izy ireo, dia nihovotrovotra ilay toerana nivoriany, ary feno fanahy masina izy rehetra, ka sahy nitory ny tenin’Andriamanitra.', 'rehefa avy nitalaho tamim-bavaka izy ireo, dia nihovotrovotra ilay toerana nivoriany, ary feno fanahy masina izy rehetra, ka sahy nitory ny tenin’andriamanitra.'),
  ('6ab25c81d9eb75ae22dbbe4b', '2026-09-22T10:46:25.118Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:25.118Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 4, 32, 'Iray fo sy iray saina ny olona be dia be lasa mpino, ka tsy nisy nilaza hoe azy samirery ny fananany, fa nikambanan’izy ireo daholo ny zava-drehetra.', 'iray fo sy iray saina ny olona be dia be lasa mpino, ka tsy nisy nilaza hoe azy samirery ny fananany, fa nikambanan’izy ireo daholo ny zava-drehetra.'),
  ('6ab25c81d9eb75ae22dbbe47', '2026-09-22T10:46:25.118Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:25.118Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 4, 28, 'Nanao an’izany izy ireo mba ho tanteraka izay efa voalazanao mialoha, satria anananao ny hery ary efa izay no sitraponao.', 'nanao an’izany izy ireo mba ho tanteraka izay efa voalazanao mialoha, satria anananao ny hery ary efa izay no sitraponao.'),
  ('6ab25c81d9eb75ae22dbbe44', '2026-09-22T10:46:25.118Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:25.118Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 4, 25, 'Ianao koa no nampiteny an’i Davida razambenay mpanomponao tamin’ny alalan’ny fanahy masina hoe: ‘Nahoana no mikorontana ireo firenena ary misaintsaina zavatra tsy misy dikany ny vahoaka?', 'ianao koa no nampiteny an’i davida razambenay mpanomponao tamin’ny alalan’ny fanahy masina hoe: ‘nahoana no mikorontana ireo firenena ary misaintsaina zavatra tsy misy dikany ny vahoaka?'),
  ('6ab25c81d9eb75ae22dbbe3f', '2026-09-22T10:46:25.118Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:25.118Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 4, 20, 'Fa raha izahay kosa, dia tsy azonay atao ny tsy hiteny intsony momba an’izay efa hitanay sy henonay.”', 'fa raha izahay kosa, dia tsy azonay atao ny tsy hiteny intsony momba an’izay efa hitanay sy henonay.”'),
  ('6ab25c81162fef42625172db', '2026-09-22T10:46:25.728Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:25.728Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 5, 12, 'Mbola nanao famantarana sy fahagagana maro teo amin’ny vahoaka koa ny apostoly. Ary niara-nivory foana teo amin’ny Lala-mitafon’i Solomona izy rehetra.', 'mbola nanao famantarana sy fahagagana maro teo amin’ny vahoaka koa ny apostoly. ary niara-nivory foana teo amin’ny lala-mitafon’i solomona izy rehetra.'),
  ('6ab25c81162fef42625172d5', '2026-09-22T10:46:25.728Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:25.728Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 5, 6, 'Nitsangana ny tovolahy maromaro avy eo dia nofonosiny lamba ny faty, ka nentiny ary naleviny.', 'nitsangana ny tovolahy maromaro avy eo dia nofonosiny lamba ny faty, ka nentiny ary naleviny.'),
  ('6ab25c81162fef42625172d4', '2026-09-22T10:46:25.728Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:25.728Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 5, 5, 'Dia niankarapoka i Ananiasy rehefa naheno an’izany, ka maty. Ary nihorohoro izay rehetra naheno an’izany zava-nitranga izany.', 'dia niankarapoka i ananiasy rehefa naheno an’izany, ka maty. ary nihorohoro izay rehetra naheno an’izany zava-nitranga izany.'),
  ('6ab25c81162fef42625172d6', '2026-09-22T10:46:25.728Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:25.728Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 5, 7, 'Rehefa afaka adiny telo teo ho eo, dia tonga koa ny vadiny nefa tsy nahalala an’izay nitranga.', 'rehefa afaka adiny telo teo ho eo, dia tonga koa ny vadiny nefa tsy nahalala an’izay nitranga.'),
  ('6ab25c81162fef42625172d3', '2026-09-22T10:46:25.728Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:25.728Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 5, 4, 'Angaha moa tsy anao ihany ilay tany, tamin’ilay izy mbola tsy namidy? Ary rehefa namidy ilay izy, tsy anao ihany ve ny vola vidiny, ka azonao ampiasaina amin’izay itiavanao azy? Maninona ianao no nieritreritra hanao an’izao zavatra izao tao am-ponao tao? Tsy olona no nandainganao, fa Andriamanitra.”', 'angaha moa tsy anao ihany ilay tany, tamin’ilay izy mbola tsy namidy? ary rehefa namidy ilay izy, tsy anao ihany ve ny vola vidiny, ka azonao ampiasaina amin’izay itiavanao azy? maninona ianao no nieritreritra hanao an’izao zavatra izao tao am-ponao tao? tsy olona no nandainganao, fa andriamanitra.”'),
  ('6ab25c81162fef42625172dd', '2026-09-22T10:46:25.728Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:25.728Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 5, 14, 'Ankoatra izany, dia niampy foana ny isan’ireo nino ny Tompo, ary be dia be izy ireny, na lahy na vavy.', 'ankoatra izany, dia niampy foana ny isan’ireo nino ny tompo, ary be dia be izy ireny, na lahy na vavy.'),
  ('6ab25c81162fef42625172d9', '2026-09-22T10:46:25.728Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:25.728Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 5, 10, 'Tonga dia niankarapoka teo an-tongotr’i Petera izy, ka maty. Rehefa niditra ireo tovolahy, dia nahita azy efa maty, ka nitondra azy niala teo sy nandevina azy teo akaikin’ny vadiny.', 'tonga dia niankarapoka teo an-tongotr’i petera izy, ka maty. rehefa niditra ireo tovolahy, dia nahita azy efa maty, ka nitondra azy niala teo sy nandevina azy teo akaikin’ny vadiny.'),
  ('6ab25c81162fef42625172d8', '2026-09-22T10:46:25.728Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:25.728Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 5, 9, 'Hoy àry i Petera taminy: “Nahoana ianareo mivady no niray tsikombakomba hamitaka ny fanahin’i Jehovah? Efa eo am-baravarana izao ny tongotr’ireo nandevina ny vadinao, ary hitondra anao hivoaka koa ry zareo.”', 'hoy àry i petera taminy: “nahoana ianareo mivady no niray tsikombakomba hamitaka ny fanahin’i jehovah? efa eo am-baravarana izao ny tongotr’ireo nandevina ny vadinao, ary hitondra anao hivoaka koa ry zareo.”'),
  ('6ab25c81162fef42625172dc', '2026-09-22T10:46:25.728Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:25.728Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 5, 13, 'Marina fa tsy nisy olon-kafa sahy niandany tamin’izy ireo, kanefa niresaka zavatra tsara momba azy ireo ihany ny vahoaka.', 'marina fa tsy nisy olon-kafa sahy niandany tamin’izy ireo, kanefa niresaka zavatra tsara momba azy ireo ihany ny vahoaka.'),
  ('6ab25c81162fef42625172d1', '2026-09-22T10:46:25.728Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:25.728Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 5, 2, 'Nisy notazoniny mangingina anefa ny vidiny, ary fantatry ny vadiny izany. Ampahany ihany no nentiny ka napetrany teo an-tongotry ny apostoly.', 'nisy notazoniny mangingina anefa ny vidiny, ary fantatry ny vadiny izany. ampahany ihany no nentiny ka napetrany teo an-tongotry ny apostoly.'),
  ('6ab25c81162fef42625172de', '2026-09-22T10:46:25.728Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:25.728Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 5, 15, 'Nentin’ny olona teny an-dalambe mihitsy aza ny marary ka napetrany teny, teo ambony farafara kely na tsihy. Amin’izay mba azon’ny alok’i Petera ny sasany amin’izy ireo, fara faharatsiny, rehefa mandalo izy.', 'nentin’ny olona teny an-dalambe mihitsy aza ny marary ka napetrany teny, teo ambony farafara kely na tsihy. amin’izay mba azon’ny alok’i petera ny sasany amin’izy ireo, fara faharatsiny, rehefa mandalo izy.'),
  ('6ab25c81162fef42625172da', '2026-09-22T10:46:25.728Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:25.728Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 5, 11, 'Dia nihorohoro ny fiangonana manontolo sy izay rehetra nandre an’izany zava-nitranga izany.', 'dia nihorohoro ny fiangonana manontolo sy izay rehetra nandre an’izany zava-nitranga izany.'),
  ('6ab25c81162fef42625172d7', '2026-09-22T10:46:25.728Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:25.728Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 5, 8, 'Dia hoy i Petera taminy: “Hono ho’aho, izay ve no vidiny nivarotanareo an’ilay tany?” Ary hoy izy: “Ie, izay!”', 'dia hoy i petera taminy: “hono ho’aho, izay ve no vidiny nivarotanareo an’ilay tany?” ary hoy izy: “ie, izay!”'),
  ('6ab25c81162fef42625172d2', '2026-09-22T10:46:25.728Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:25.728Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 5, 3, 'Fa hoy i Petera: “Ry Ananiasy, nahoana ianao no nataon’i Satana sahy nandainga tamin’ny fanahy masina, ka notazoninao mangingina ny ampahany tamin’ny vidin’ilay tany?', 'fa hoy i petera: “ry ananiasy, nahoana ianao no nataon’i satana sahy nandainga tamin’ny fanahy masina, ka notazoninao mangingina ny ampahany tamin’ny vidin’ilay tany?'),
  ('6ab25c81162fef42625172d0', '2026-09-22T10:46:25.728Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:25.728Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 5, 1, 'Nivarotra ny taniny koa ny lehilahy atao hoe Ananiasy, sy Safira vadiny.', 'nivarotra ny taniny koa ny lehilahy atao hoe ananiasy, sy safira vadiny.'),
  ('6ab25c81162fef42625172e0', '2026-09-22T10:46:25.729Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:25.729Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 5, 17, 'Velom-pialonana anefa ny mpisoronabe sy ny mpomba azy rehetra, izay anisan’ny sektan’ny Sadoseo. Nitsangana àry izy ireo,', 'velom-pialonana anefa ny mpisoronabe sy ny mpomba azy rehetra, izay anisan’ny sektan’ny sadoseo. nitsangana àry izy ireo,'),
  ('6ab25c81162fef42625172df', '2026-09-22T10:46:25.729Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:25.729Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 5, 16, 'Nisy vahoaka be koa tonga foana avy tany amin’ireo tanàna manodidina an’i Jerosalema. Nitondra marary sy olona nampijalin’ny fanahy maloto izy ireo, ary sitrana daholo izy rehetra.', 'nisy vahoaka be koa tonga foana avy tany amin’ireo tanàna manodidina an’i jerosalema. nitondra marary sy olona nampijalin’ny fanahy maloto izy ireo, ary sitrana daholo izy rehetra.'),
  ('6ab25c81162fef42625172e1', '2026-09-22T10:46:25.731Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:25.731Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 5, 18, 'ka nosamboriny ny apostoly ary nataony tao amin’ny fonjam-panjakana.', 'ka nosamboriny ny apostoly ary nataony tao amin’ny fonjam-panjakana.'),
  ('6ab25c81162fef42625172f3', '2026-09-22T10:46:25.732Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:25.732Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 5, 36, 'Nisy fotoana, ohatra, nisy an’i Teodasy izay nihevitra ny tenany ho tsy misy hoatr’azy. Lehilahy 400 teo ho eo no lasa mpomba azy. Novonoina anefa izy, ary niparitaka daholo ny mpanara-dia azy ka tsy hita intsony.', 'nisy fotoana, ohatra, nisy an’i teodasy izay nihevitra ny tenany ho tsy misy hoatr’azy. lehilahy 400 teo ho eo no lasa mpomba azy. novonoina anefa izy, ary niparitaka daholo ny mpanara-dia azy ka tsy hita intsony.'),
  ('6ab25c81162fef42625172ee', '2026-09-22T10:46:25.732Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:25.732Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 5, 31, 'Nasandratr’Andriamanitra ho eo ankavanany anefa izy, ka lasa Mpitarika Lehibe Indrindra sy Mpamonjy, mba hahafahan’ny Israely hibebaka sy hahazo famelan-keloka.', 'nasandratr’andriamanitra ho eo ankavanany anefa izy, ka lasa mpitarika lehibe indrindra sy mpamonjy, mba hahafahan’ny israely hibebaka sy hahazo famelan-keloka.'),
  ('6ab25c81162fef42625172f5', '2026-09-22T10:46:25.732Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:25.732Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 5, 38, 'Koa eo anoloan’izao zava-mitranga izao, dia izao no teniko aminareo: Aza manelingelina an’ireo lehilahy ireo, fa avelao izy. Raha avy amin’olombelona mantsy io zavatra tian’izy ireo hatao io na io asa io, dia ho rava.', 'koa eo anoloan’izao zava-mitranga izao, dia izao no teniko aminareo: aza manelingelina an’ireo lehilahy ireo, fa avelao izy. raha avy amin’olombelona mantsy io zavatra tian’izy ireo hatao io na io asa io, dia ho rava.'),
  ('6ab25c81162fef42625172f1', '2026-09-22T10:46:25.732Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:25.732Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 5, 34, 'Nitsangana teo anatrehan’ny Fitsarana Avo Jiosy anefa ny Fariseo iray atao hoe Gamaliela. Mpampianatra ny Lalàna izy ary nohajain’ny vahoaka rehetra. Nasainy navoaka vetivety aloha ny apostoly.', 'nitsangana teo anatrehan’ny fitsarana avo jiosy anefa ny fariseo iray atao hoe gamaliela. mpampianatra ny lalàna izy ary nohajain’ny vahoaka rehetra. nasainy navoaka vetivety aloha ny apostoly.'),
  ('6ab25c81162fef42625172ea', '2026-09-22T10:46:25.732Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:25.732Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 5, 27, 'Koa nentiny ireo apostoly, ka nasainy nijoro teo anatrehan’ny Fitsarana Avo Jiosy. Dia namotopototra azy ireo ny mpisoronabe,', 'koa nentiny ireo apostoly, ka nasainy nijoro teo anatrehan’ny fitsarana avo jiosy. dia namotopototra azy ireo ny mpisoronabe,'),
  ('6ab25c81162fef42625172e7', '2026-09-22T10:46:25.732Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:25.732Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 5, 24, 'Rehefa naheno an’izany ny lehiben’ny mpiambina ny tempoly sy ireo lehiben’ny mpisorona, dia samy sahiran-tsaina hoe inona no ho vokatr’izany.', 'rehefa naheno an’izany ny lehiben’ny mpiambina ny tempoly sy ireo lehiben’ny mpisorona, dia samy sahiran-tsaina hoe inona no ho vokatr’izany.'),
  ('6ab25c81162fef42625172f9', '2026-09-22T10:46:25.732Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:25.732Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 5, 42, 'Ary tsy nitsahatra nampianatra sy nitory ny vaovao tsara momba an’i Kristy, izany hoe i Jesosy, izy ireo isan’andro. Nanao an’izany izy ireo, na tao amin’ny tempoly na isan-trano.', 'ary tsy nitsahatra nampianatra sy nitory ny vaovao tsara momba an’i kristy, izany hoe i jesosy, izy ireo isan’andro. nanao an’izany izy ireo, na tao amin’ny tempoly na isan-trano.'),
  ('6ab25c81162fef42625172e6', '2026-09-22T10:46:25.732Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:25.732Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 5, 23, 'Hoy izy ireo: “Hitanay nihidy mafy tsara ny fonja, ary nijoro teo am-baravarana ireo mpiambina, kanjo rehefa nosokafana ilay izy, dia tsy nahita olona tao izahay.”', 'hoy izy ireo: “hitanay nihidy mafy tsara ny fonja, ary nijoro teo am-baravarana ireo mpiambina, kanjo rehefa nosokafana ilay izy, dia tsy nahita olona tao izahay.”'),
  ('6ab25c81162fef42625172e2', '2026-09-22T10:46:25.732Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:25.732Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 5, 19, 'Nosokafan’ny anjelin’i Jehovah anefa ny varavaran’ny fonja ny alin’iny, ka navoakany izy ireo. Ary hoy ilay anjely tamin’izy ireo:', 'nosokafan’ny anjelin’i jehovah anefa ny varavaran’ny fonja ny alin’iny, ka navoakany izy ireo. ary hoy ilay anjely tamin’izy ireo:'),
  ('6ab25c81162fef42625172ec', '2026-09-22T10:46:25.732Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:25.732Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 5, 29, 'Fa namaly i Petera sy ny apostoly hafa hoe: “Andriamanitra no mpitondra anay ka izy no tsy maintsy ankatoavinay, fa tsy olona.', 'fa namaly i petera sy ny apostoly hafa hoe: “andriamanitra no mpitondra anay ka izy no tsy maintsy ankatoavinay, fa tsy olona.'),
  ('6ab25c81162fef42625172ef', '2026-09-22T10:46:25.732Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:25.732Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 5, 32, 'Vavolombelon’izany izahay, ary koa ny fanahy masina, izay omen’Andriamanitra an’izay manaiky azy ho mpitondra sy mankatò azy.”', 'vavolombelon’izany izahay, ary koa ny fanahy masina, izay omen’andriamanitra an’izay manaiky azy ho mpitondra sy mankatò azy.”'),
  ('6ab25c81162fef42625172f8', '2026-09-22T10:46:25.732Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:25.732Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 5, 41, 'Koa niala teo anatrehan’ny Fitsarana Avo Jiosy izy ireo, sady faly satria natao mendrika ny ho afa-baraka noho izany anarana izany.', 'koa niala teo anatrehan’ny fitsarana avo jiosy izy ireo, sady faly satria natao mendrika ny ho afa-baraka noho izany anarana izany.'),
  ('6ab25c81162fef42625172e5', '2026-09-22T10:46:25.732Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:25.732Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 5, 22, 'Rehefa tonga tany anefa ireo mpiambina, dia tsy nahita azy ireo tao am-ponja. Niverina àry izy ireo mba hilaza an’izay nitranga.', 'rehefa tonga tany anefa ireo mpiambina, dia tsy nahita azy ireo tao am-ponja. niverina àry izy ireo mba hilaza an’izay nitranga.'),
  ('6ab25c81162fef42625172f0', '2026-09-22T10:46:25.732Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:25.732Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 5, 33, 'Nisafoaka izy ireo rehefa nandre an’izany, ka te hamono azy ireo ho faty.', 'nisafoaka izy ireo rehefa nandre an’izany, ka te hamono azy ireo ho faty.'),
  ('6ab25c81162fef42625172eb', '2026-09-22T10:46:25.732Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:25.732Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 5, 28, 'ary niteny hoe: “Efa noraranay mafy ianareo hoe aza mampianatra intsony amin’izany anarana izany, nefa jereo fa nofenoinareo ny fampianaranareo i Jerosalema. Ary tapa-kevitra ianareo ny hanao anay ho tompon’andraikitra amin’ny fahafatesan’iny lehilahy iny.”', 'ary niteny hoe: “efa noraranay mafy ianareo hoe aza mampianatra intsony amin’izany anarana izany, nefa jereo fa nofenoinareo ny fampianaranareo i jerosalema. ary tapa-kevitra ianareo ny hanao anay ho tompon’andraikitra amin’ny fahafatesan’iny lehilahy iny.”'),
  ('6ab25c81162fef42625172f4', '2026-09-22T10:46:25.732Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:25.732Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 5, 37, 'Ary taorian’i Teodasy, dia nisy an’i Jodasy avy any Galilia, tamin’ny fotoanan’ny fanisam-bahoaka, ary nitaona olona hanaraka azy izy. Maty koa anefa izy, ka niparitaka daholo ny mpanara-dia azy.', 'ary taorian’i teodasy, dia nisy an’i jodasy avy any galilia, tamin’ny fotoanan’ny fanisam-bahoaka, ary nitaona olona hanaraka azy izy. maty koa anefa izy, ka niparitaka daholo ny mpanara-dia azy.'),
  ('6ab25c81162fef42625172e3', '2026-09-22T10:46:25.732Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:25.732Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 5, 20, '“Mandehana mijoro ao amin’ny tempoly, ary torio foana amin’ny olona ny teny rehetra momba an’izany fiainana izany.”', '“mandehana mijoro ao amin’ny tempoly, ary torio foana amin’ny olona ny teny rehetra momba an’izany fiainana izany.”'),
  ('6ab25c81162fef42625172ed', '2026-09-22T10:46:25.732Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:25.732Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 5, 30, 'Efa natsangan’ilay Andriamanitry ny razambentsika tamin’ny maty i Jesosy, izay novonoinareo ka nahantonareo teo amin’ny tsato-kazo.', 'efa natsangan’ilay andriamanitry ny razambentsika tamin’ny maty i jesosy, izay novonoinareo ka nahantonareo teo amin’ny tsato-kazo.'),
  ('6ab25c81162fef42625172f6', '2026-09-22T10:46:25.732Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:25.732Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 5, 39, 'Fa raha avy amin’Andriamanitra kosa io, dia tsy ho vitanareo ny handrava azy. Sao dia ho lasa mpiady amin’Andriamanitra ianareo.”', 'fa raha avy amin’andriamanitra kosa io, dia tsy ho vitanareo ny handrava azy. sao dia ho lasa mpiady amin’andriamanitra ianareo.”'),
  ('6ab25c81162fef42625172e9', '2026-09-22T10:46:25.732Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:25.732Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 5, 26, 'Dia nandeha naka an’ireo apostoly ny lehiben’ny mpiambina sy ireo olona teo ambany fahefany. Tsy nampiasa herisetra anefa izy ireo, satria natahotra sao hotorahan’ny vahoaka vato.', 'dia nandeha naka an’ireo apostoly ny lehiben’ny mpiambina sy ireo olona teo ambany fahefany. tsy nampiasa herisetra anefa izy ireo, satria natahotra sao hotorahan’ny vahoaka vato.'),
  ('6ab25c81162fef42625172f7', '2026-09-22T10:46:25.732Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:25.732Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 5, 40, 'Narahin’izy ireo àry ny torohevitr’i Gamaliela, ka nampanantsoiny ny apostoly. Ary nokaravasiny sy norarany tsy hiteny amin’ny anaran’i Jesosy intsony izy ireo, dia navelany handeha.', 'narahin’izy ireo àry ny torohevitr’i gamaliela, ka nampanantsoiny ny apostoly. ary nokaravasiny sy norarany tsy hiteny amin’ny anaran’i jesosy intsony izy ireo, dia navelany handeha.'),
  ('6ab25c81162fef42625172f2', '2026-09-22T10:46:25.732Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:25.732Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 5, 35, 'Dia hoy izy: “Ry lehilahy israelita, tandremo tsara izay eritreretinareo hatao amin’ireo lehilahy ireo.', 'dia hoy izy: “ry lehilahy israelita, tandremo tsara izay eritreretinareo hatao amin’ireo lehilahy ireo.'),
  ('6ab25c81162fef42625172e4', '2026-09-22T10:46:25.732Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:25.732Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 5, 21, 'Rehefa naheno an’izany ny apostoly, dia niditra vao mangiran-dratsy tao amin’ny tempoly, ka nampianatra. Ary tonga ny mpisoronabe sy izay niaraka taminy, ka novorin’izy ireo ny Fitsarana Avo Jiosy sy ny anti-panahy rehetra teo amin’ny zanak’Israely. Dia naniraka olona haka an’ireo apostoly tany am-ponja izy ireo, mba hoentina eo anatrehany.', 'rehefa naheno an’izany ny apostoly, dia niditra vao mangiran-dratsy tao amin’ny tempoly, ka nampianatra. ary tonga ny mpisoronabe sy izay niaraka taminy, ka novorin’izy ireo ny fitsarana avo jiosy sy ny anti-panahy rehetra teo amin’ny zanak’israely. dia naniraka olona haka an’ireo apostoly tany am-ponja izy ireo, mba hoentina eo anatrehany.'),
  ('6ab25c81162fef42625172e8', '2026-09-22T10:46:25.732Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:25.732Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 5, 25, 'Nisy olona tonga nilaza tamin’izy ireo anefa hoe: “Ao amin’ny tempoly ireo lehilahy nogadrainareo! Mijoro sy mampianatra ao ry zareo!”', 'nisy olona tonga nilaza tamin’izy ireo anefa hoe: “ao amin’ny tempoly ireo lehilahy nogadrainareo! mijoro sy mampianatra ao ry zareo!”'),
  ('6ab25c8270e1c5785942dd1c', '2026-09-22T10:46:26.224Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:26.224Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 6, 14, 'Henonay izy, ohatra, nilaza fa handrodana an’ity toerana ity, hono, ilay Jesosy avy any Nazareta iny, dia hanova ny fomba amam-panao nampitain’i Mosesy tamintsika.”', 'henonay izy, ohatra, nilaza fa handrodana an’ity toerana ity, hono, ilay jesosy avy any nazareta iny, dia hanova ny fomba amam-panao nampitain’i mosesy tamintsika.”'),
  ('6ab25c8270e1c5785942dd0f', '2026-09-22T10:46:26.224Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:26.224Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 6, 1, 'Tamin’izany andro izany, rehefa nihabetsaka ny mpianatra, dia nanjary nimenomenona tamin’ny Jiosy miteny hebreo ny Jiosy miteny grika, satria tsy mba nisy nikarakara ny mpitondratena teo aminy rehefa nozaraina ny sakafo isan’andro.', 'tamin’izany andro izany, rehefa nihabetsaka ny mpianatra, dia nanjary nimenomenona tamin’ny jiosy miteny hebreo ny jiosy miteny grika, satria tsy mba nisy nikarakara ny mpitondratena teo aminy rehefa nozaraina ny sakafo isan’andro.'),
  ('6ab25c8270e1c5785942dd1b', '2026-09-22T10:46:26.224Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:26.224Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 6, 13, 'Ary nitondra vavolombelona mandainga izy ireo mba hilaza hoe: “Io lehilahy io tsy mitsahatra manaratsy an’ity toerana masina ity sy ny Lalàna.', 'ary nitondra vavolombelona mandainga izy ireo mba hilaza hoe: “io lehilahy io tsy mitsahatra manaratsy an’ity toerana masina ity sy ny lalàna.'),
  ('6ab25c8270e1c5785942dd16', '2026-09-22T10:46:26.224Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:26.224Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 6, 8, 'Ary tena nankasitrahan’Andriamanitra i Stefana sady nomeny hery be, ka nahavita fahagagana sy famantarana lehibe teo amin’ny vahoaka.', 'ary tena nankasitrahan’andriamanitra i stefana sady nomeny hery be, ka nahavita fahagagana sy famantarana lehibe teo amin’ny vahoaka.'),
  ('6ab25c8270e1c5785942dd15', '2026-09-22T10:46:26.224Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:26.224Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 6, 7, 'Tsy nitsahatra niely àry ny tenin’Andriamanitra, ka nihamaro be ny isan’ny mpianatra tany Jerosalema. Be dia be koa ny mpisorona lasa nanaiky ny finoana.', 'tsy nitsahatra niely àry ny tenin’andriamanitra, ka nihamaro be ny isan’ny mpianatra tany jerosalema. be dia be koa ny mpisorona lasa nanaiky ny finoana.'),
  ('6ab25c8270e1c5785942dd11', '2026-09-22T10:46:26.224Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:26.224Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 6, 3, 'Noho izany, ry rahalahy, dia mifidiana fito lahy tsara laza eo aminareo, izay sady feno fanahy masina no manam-pahendrena, mba hotendrena hanao an’izany zavatra tsy maintsy atao izany.', 'noho izany, ry rahalahy, dia mifidiana fito lahy tsara laza eo aminareo, izay sady feno fanahy masina no manam-pahendrena, mba hotendrena hanao an’izany zavatra tsy maintsy atao izany.'),
  ('6ab25c8270e1c5785942dd10', '2026-09-22T10:46:26.224Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:26.224Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 6, 2, 'Koa nampiantso an’ireo mpianatra rehetra ny 12 Lahy, ka niteny hoe: “Tsy mety raha avelanay ny tenin’Andriamanitra mba hahafahanay hizara sakafo eny an-databatra.', 'koa nampiantso an’ireo mpianatra rehetra ny 12 lahy, ka niteny hoe: “tsy mety raha avelanay ny tenin’andriamanitra mba hahafahanay hizara sakafo eny an-databatra.'),
  ('6ab25c8270e1c5785942dd12', '2026-09-22T10:46:26.224Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:26.224Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 6, 4, 'Fa izahay kosa hifantoka amin’ny vavaka sy ny fanompoana, dia ny fampianarana ny tenin’Andriamanitra.”', 'fa izahay kosa hifantoka amin’ny vavaka sy ny fanompoana, dia ny fampianarana ny tenin’andriamanitra.”'),
  ('6ab25c8270e1c5785942dd1a', '2026-09-22T10:46:26.224Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:26.224Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 6, 12, 'Dia nataon’izy ireo izay hampikorontana ny vahoaka sy ny anti-panahy ary ny mpanora-dalàna, ka tonga tampoka teo amin’i Stefana ireo. Nosamborin’izy ireo izy, dia nentiny tany amin’ny Fitsarana Avo Jiosy.', 'dia nataon’izy ireo izay hampikorontana ny vahoaka sy ny anti-panahy ary ny mpanora-dalàna, ka tonga tampoka teo amin’i stefana ireo. nosamborin’izy ireo izy, dia nentiny tany amin’ny fitsarana avo jiosy.'),
  ('6ab25c8270e1c5785942dd1d', '2026-09-22T10:46:26.224Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:26.224Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 6, 15, 'Ary nibanjina an’i Stefana daholo izay nipetraka teo amin’ilay Fitsarana Avo, ka nahita fa hoatran’ny tarehin’anjely ny tarehiny.', 'ary nibanjina an’i stefana daholo izay nipetraka teo amin’ilay fitsarana avo, ka nahita fa hoatran’ny tarehin’anjely ny tarehiny.'),
  ('6ab25c8270e1c5785942dd18', '2026-09-22T10:46:26.224Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:26.224Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 6, 10, 'Tsy nahatohitra azy anefa izy ireo, satria hita tamin’ny teniny hoe hendry izy sady nampian’ny fanahy masina.', 'tsy nahatohitra azy anefa izy ireo, satria hita tamin’ny teniny hoe hendry izy sady nampian’ny fanahy masina.'),
  ('6ab25c8270e1c5785942dd13', '2026-09-22T10:46:26.224Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:26.224Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 6, 5, 'Nahafaly ny rehetra ny tenin’izy ireo, ka nofidin’izy ireo i Stefana, lehilahy tena nanam-pinoana sy feno fanahy masina, sy Filipo, Prokoro, Nikanora, Timona, Parmena, ary Nikoleo avy any Antiokia, ilay lasa nanaraka ny fivavahana jiosy.', 'nahafaly ny rehetra ny tenin’izy ireo, ka nofidin’izy ireo i stefana, lehilahy tena nanam-pinoana sy feno fanahy masina, sy filipo, prokoro, nikanora, timona, parmena, ary nikoleo avy any antiokia, ilay lasa nanaraka ny fivavahana jiosy.'),
  ('6ab25c8270e1c5785942dd19', '2026-09-22T10:46:26.224Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:26.224Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 6, 11, 'Dia nandresy lahatra olona tany ambadimbadika tany izy ireo mba hilaza hoe: “Henonay nanevateva an’i Mosesy sy Andriamanitra izy.”', 'dia nandresy lahatra olona tany ambadimbadika tany izy ireo mba hilaza hoe: “henonay nanevateva an’i mosesy sy andriamanitra izy.”'),
  ('6ab25c8270e1c5785942dd17', '2026-09-22T10:46:26.224Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:26.224Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 6, 9, 'Nisy lehilahy tonga hiady hevitra tamin’i Stefana anefa. Avy tamin’ilay antsoina hoe Synagogan’ireo Nomena Fahafahana ny sasany, ary Kyrenianina sy Aleksandrianina ny sasany. Nisy koa avy any Kilikia sy Azia.', 'nisy lehilahy tonga hiady hevitra tamin’i stefana anefa. avy tamin’ilay antsoina hoe synagogan’ireo nomena fahafahana ny sasany, ary kyrenianina sy aleksandrianina ny sasany. nisy koa avy any kilikia sy azia.'),
  ('6ab25c8270e1c5785942dd14', '2026-09-22T10:46:26.224Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:26.224Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 6, 6, 'Dia nentiny tany amin’ny apostoly izy ireo. Ary rehefa avy nivavaka ny apostoly, dia nametra-tanana tamin’izy ireo.', 'dia nentiny tany amin’ny apostoly izy ireo. ary rehefa avy nivavaka ny apostoly, dia nametra-tanana tamin’izy ireo.'),
  ('6ab25c8233c15b05fa801f73', '2026-09-22T10:46:26.868Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:26.868Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 7, 7, '‘Dia hotsaraiko ilay firenena hanandevo azy ireo’, hoy Andriamanitra, ‘ary aorian’izany dia hiala any izy ireo, ka hanao fanompoana masina ho ahy eto amin’ity toerana ity.’', '‘dia hotsaraiko ilay firenena hanandevo azy ireo’, hoy andriamanitra, ‘ary aorian’izany dia hiala any izy ireo, ka hanao fanompoana masina ho ahy eto amin’ity toerana ity.’'),
  ('6ab25c8233c15b05fa801f72', '2026-09-22T10:46:26.868Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:26.868Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 7, 6, 'Nilaza tamin’i Abrahama koa Andriamanitra fa ho vahiny any an-tanin’olona ny taranany. Ary hataon’ny mponina any andevo izy ireo, ka hampijaliny 400 taona.', 'nilaza tamin’i abrahama koa andriamanitra fa ho vahiny any an-tanin’olona ny taranany. ary hataon’ny mponina any andevo izy ireo, ka hampijaliny 400 taona.'),
  ('6ab25c8233c15b05fa801f6f', '2026-09-22T10:46:26.868Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:26.868Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 7, 3, 'Ary niteny taminy Andriamanitra hoe: ‘Mialà amin’ny taninao sy ny havanao, ka mankanesa any amin’ny tany hasehoko anao.’', 'ary niteny taminy andriamanitra hoe: ‘mialà amin’ny taninao sy ny havanao, ka mankanesa any amin’ny tany hasehoko anao.’'),
  ('6ab25c8233c15b05fa801f76', '2026-09-22T10:46:26.868Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:26.868Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 7, 10, 'ka namonjy azy tamin’ny fahoriany rehetra. Ary nataon’Andriamanitra izay hahazoany sitraka tamin’i Farao mpanjakan’i Ejipta, sy izay hananany fahendrena teo anatrehan’io mpanjaka io. Dia notendren’i Farao hiandraikitra an’i Ejipta sy ny tao an-tranony rehetra izy.', 'ka namonjy azy tamin’ny fahoriany rehetra. ary nataon’andriamanitra izay hahazoany sitraka tamin’i farao mpanjakan’i ejipta, sy izay hananany fahendrena teo anatrehan’io mpanjaka io. dia notendren’i farao hiandraikitra an’i ejipta sy ny tao an-tranony rehetra izy.'),
  ('6ab25c8233c15b05fa801f74', '2026-09-22T10:46:26.868Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:26.868Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 7, 8, '“Nanao fifanekena momba ny famorana tamin’i Abrahama koa izy. Dia niteraka an’i Isaka i Abrahama ary namora azy tamin’ny andro fahavalo. I Isaka indray niteraka an’i Jakoba, ary Jakoba niteraka azy 12 lahy loham-pianakaviantsika.', '“nanao fifanekena momba ny famorana tamin’i abrahama koa izy. dia niteraka an’i isaka i abrahama ary namora azy tamin’ny andro fahavalo. i isaka indray niteraka an’i jakoba, ary jakoba niteraka azy 12 lahy loham-pianakaviantsika.'),
  ('6ab25c8233c15b05fa801f75', '2026-09-22T10:46:26.868Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:26.868Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 7, 9, 'Dia nialona an’i Josefa ireo loham-pianakaviantsika ka nivarotra azy, dia nentina tany Ejipta izy. Nanampy azy anefa Andriamanitra,', 'dia nialona an’i josefa ireo loham-pianakaviantsika ka nivarotra azy, dia nentina tany ejipta izy. nanampy azy anefa andriamanitra,'),
  ('6ab25c8233c15b05fa801f6e', '2026-09-22T10:46:26.868Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:26.868Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 7, 2, 'Dia namaly i Stefana hoe: “Ry rahalahy sy ianareo raiamandreny, henoy aho. Niseho tamin’i Abrahama razambentsika ilay Andriamanitry ny voninahitra, tamin’izy tany Mezopotamia, talohan’ny nipetrahany tany Harana.', 'dia namaly i stefana hoe: “ry rahalahy sy ianareo raiamandreny, henoy aho. niseho tamin’i abrahama razambentsika ilay andriamanitry ny voninahitra, tamin’izy tany mezopotamia, talohan’ny nipetrahany tany harana.'),
  ('6ab25c8233c15b05fa801f77', '2026-09-22T10:46:26.868Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:26.868Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 7, 11, 'Nisy mosary anefa eran’i Ejipta sy Kanana, ka tena mafy ny fahoriana nanjo ny olona tany. Ary tsy nahita na inona na inona hohanina ny razambentsika.', 'nisy mosary anefa eran’i ejipta sy kanana, ka tena mafy ny fahoriana nanjo ny olona tany. ary tsy nahita na inona na inona hohanina ny razambentsika.'),
  ('6ab25c8233c15b05fa801f71', '2026-09-22T10:46:26.868Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:26.868Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 7, 5, 'Tsy nanome azy lova teto anefa Andriamanitra, na dia tany eram-paladia aza. Nampanantena anefa Izy fa hanome an’ity tany ity ho azy sy ho an’ny taranany, na dia mbola tsy nanan-janaka aza izy tamin’izay.', 'tsy nanome azy lova teto anefa andriamanitra, na dia tany eram-paladia aza. nampanantena anefa izy fa hanome an’ity tany ity ho azy sy ho an’ny taranany, na dia mbola tsy nanan-janaka aza izy tamin’izay.'),
  ('6ab25c8233c15b05fa801f70', '2026-09-22T10:46:26.868Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:26.868Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 7, 4, 'Dia niala tao amin’ny tanin’ny Kaldeanina izy, ka nipetraka tany Harana. Ary rehefa maty ny rainy, dia nasain’Andriamanitra nifindra nankatỳ amin’ity tany onenanareo amin’izao ity izy.', 'dia niala tao amin’ny tanin’ny kaldeanina izy, ka nipetraka tany harana. ary rehefa maty ny rainy, dia nasain’andriamanitra nifindra nankatỳ amin’ity tany onenanareo amin’izao ity izy.'),
  ('6ab25c8233c15b05fa801f6d', '2026-09-22T10:46:26.868Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:26.868Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 7, 1, 'Fa hoy ny mpisoronabe: “Marina ve izany?”', 'fa hoy ny mpisoronabe: “marina ve izany?”'),
  ('6ab25c8233c15b05fa801f99', '2026-09-22T10:46:26.869Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:26.869Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 7, 45, 'Ary nolovan’ny razambentsika ilay tranolay, ka nampidiriny tao amin’ny tanin’ireo firenena noroahin’Andriamanitra hiala teo anatrehan’ny razambentsika. Nampiditra azy io tany izy ireo, niaraka tamin’i Josoa, ka tao foana ilay izy mandra-pahatongan’ny andron’i Davida.', 'ary nolovan’ny razambentsika ilay tranolay, ka nampidiriny tao amin’ny tanin’ireo firenena noroahin’andriamanitra hiala teo anatrehan’ny razambentsika. nampiditra azy io tany izy ireo, niaraka tamin’i josoa, ka tao foana ilay izy mandra-pahatongan’ny andron’i davida.'),
  ('6ab25c8233c15b05fa801f8b', '2026-09-22T10:46:26.869Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:26.869Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 7, 31, 'Gaga i Mosesy rehefa nahita an’izany. Rehefa nanatona mba handinika akaiky an’izany anefa izy, dia henony i Jehovah niteny hoe:', 'gaga i mosesy rehefa nahita an’izany. rehefa nanatona mba handinika akaiky an’izany anefa izy, dia henony i jehovah niteny hoe:'),
  ('6ab25c8233c15b05fa801f84', '2026-09-22T10:46:26.869Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:26.869Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 7, 24, 'Raha vao hitany hoe nampiharana ny tsy rariny ny iray tamin’izy ireo, dia niaro an’ilay nampijalina izy ary namaly faty ka namono ho faty an’ilay Ejipsianina.', 'raha vao hitany hoe nampiharana ny tsy rariny ny iray tamin’izy ireo, dia niaro an’ilay nampijalina izy ary namaly faty ka namono ho faty an’ilay ejipsianina.'),
  ('6ab25c8233c15b05fa801f7a', '2026-09-22T10:46:26.869Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:26.869Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 7, 14, 'Koa nasain’i Josefa nalaina avy tany amin’izany toerana izany i Jakoba rainy sy ny havany rehetra, ka nisy 75 izy ireo tamin’ny fitambarany.', 'koa nasain’i josefa nalaina avy tany amin’izany toerana izany i jakoba rainy sy ny havany rehetra, ka nisy 75 izy ireo tamin’ny fitambarany.'),
  ('6ab25c8233c15b05fa801f8c', '2026-09-22T10:46:26.869Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:26.869Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 7, 32, '‘Izaho no Andriamanitry ny razambenao, ilay Andriamanitr’i Abrahama sy Isaka ary Jakoba.’ Dia tora-kovitra i Mosesy, ka tsy sahy nandinika akaiky kokoa.', '‘izaho no andriamanitry ny razambenao, ilay andriamanitr’i abrahama sy isaka ary jakoba.’ dia tora-kovitra i mosesy, ka tsy sahy nandinika akaiky kokoa.'),
  ('6ab25c8233c15b05fa801f89', '2026-09-22T10:46:26.869Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:26.869Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 7, 29, 'Dia nandositra i Mosesy rehefa naheno an’izany, ka lasa vahiny nipetraka tany Midianina, ary niteraka roa lahy izy tany.', 'dia nandositra i mosesy rehefa naheno an’izany, ka lasa vahiny nipetraka tany midianina, ary niteraka roa lahy izy tany.'),
  ('6ab25c8233c15b05fa801f81', '2026-09-22T10:46:26.869Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:26.869Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 7, 21, 'Rehefa nariana anefa izy, dia nalain’ny zanakavavin’i Farao ary notezainy toy ny zanany naterany.', 'rehefa nariana anefa izy, dia nalain’ny zanakavavin’i farao ary notezainy toy ny zanany naterany.'),
  ('6ab25c8233c15b05fa801f98', '2026-09-22T10:46:26.869Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:26.869Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 7, 44, '“Nanana ny tranolain’ny vavolombelona ny razambentsika tany an-tany efitra. Nasain’Andriamanitra nanao azy io mantsy i Mosesy, araka ny modely nasehony taminy.', '“nanana ny tranolain’ny vavolombelona ny razambentsika tany an-tany efitra. nasain’andriamanitra nanao azy io mantsy i mosesy, araka ny modely nasehony taminy.'),
  ('6ab25c8233c15b05fa801f92', '2026-09-22T10:46:26.869Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:26.869Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 7, 38, 'Izy ilay teo amin’ ny fiangonana tany an-tany efitra niaraka tamin’ilay anjely niresaka taminy tany amin’ny Tendrombohitra Sinay, sy niaraka tamin’ny razambentsika. Ary izy no nandray ny teny masina sady velona, mba homena antsika.', 'izy ilay teo amin’ ny fiangonana tany an-tany efitra niaraka tamin’ilay anjely niresaka taminy tany amin’ny tendrombohitra sinay, sy niaraka tamin’ny razambentsika. ary izy no nandray ny teny masina sady velona, mba homena antsika.'),
  ('6ab25c8233c15b05fa801f7e', '2026-09-22T10:46:26.869Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:26.869Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 7, 18, 'Mpanjaka hafa no nitondra tany Ejipta avy eo, ary tsy nahalala an’i Josefa izy io.', 'mpanjaka hafa no nitondra tany ejipta avy eo, ary tsy nahalala an’i josefa izy io.'),
  ('6ab25c8233c15b05fa801fa3', '2026-09-22T10:46:26.869Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:26.869Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 7, 55, 'Feno fanahy masina kosa i Stefana, ka nibanjina ny lanitra dia nahita ny voninahitr’Andriamanitra sady nahita an’i Jesosy nijoro teo ankavanan’Andriamanitra.', 'feno fanahy masina kosa i stefana, ka nibanjina ny lanitra dia nahita ny voninahitr’andriamanitra sady nahita an’i jesosy nijoro teo ankavanan’andriamanitra.'),
  ('6ab25c8233c15b05fa801f9b', '2026-09-22T10:46:26.869Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:26.869Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 7, 47, 'I Solomona anefa no nanorina trano ho Azy.', 'i solomona anefa no nanorina trano ho azy.'),
  ('6ab25c8233c15b05fa801f97', '2026-09-22T10:46:26.869Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:26.869Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 7, 43, 'Tsy izaho, fa ny tranolain’i Moloka sy ilay kintana andriamanitra atao hoe Refana izay nentinareo, dia ireo sarivongana nataonareo hivavahana. Koa hataoko sesitany lavitra an’i Babylona ianareo.’', 'tsy izaho, fa ny tranolain’i moloka sy ilay kintana andriamanitra atao hoe refana izay nentinareo, dia ireo sarivongana nataonareo hivavahana. koa hataoko sesitany lavitra an’i babylona ianareo.’'),
  ('6ab25c8233c15b05fa801f9f', '2026-09-22T10:46:26.869Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:26.869Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 7, 51, '“Ry olona mafy loha, sady tsy voafora fo sy sofina! Manohitra ny fanahy masina foana ianareo. Ary toy ny nataon’ny razambenareo ihany no ataonareo.', '“ry olona mafy loha, sady tsy voafora fo sy sofina! manohitra ny fanahy masina foana ianareo. ary toy ny nataon’ny razambenareo ihany no ataonareo.'),
  ('6ab25c8233c15b05fa801f9e', '2026-09-22T10:46:26.869Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:26.869Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 7, 50, 'Tsy ny tanako ve no nanao an’ireny zavatra rehetra ireny?’', 'tsy ny tanako ve no nanao an’ireny zavatra rehetra ireny?’'),
  ('6ab25c8233c15b05fa801f9c', '2026-09-22T10:46:26.869Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:26.869Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 7, 48, 'Tsy mipetraka ao amin’ny trano nataon-tanana anefa ilay Avo Indrindra, araka ny nolazain’ny mpaminany hoe:', 'tsy mipetraka ao amin’ny trano nataon-tanana anefa ilay avo indrindra, araka ny nolazain’ny mpaminany hoe:'),
  ('6ab25c8233c15b05fa801f90', '2026-09-22T10:46:26.869Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:26.869Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 7, 36, 'Izany lehilahy izany no nitondra azy ireo niala tany Ejipta, sady nanao fahagagana sy famantarana maro tany, sy teo amin’ny Ranomasina Mena, ary tany an-tany efitra nandritra ny 40 taona.', 'izany lehilahy izany no nitondra azy ireo niala tany ejipta, sady nanao fahagagana sy famantarana maro tany, sy teo amin’ny ranomasina mena, ary tany an-tany efitra nandritra ny 40 taona.'),
  ('6ab25c8233c15b05fa801f8a', '2026-09-22T10:46:26.869Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:26.869Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 7, 30, '“Rehefa afaka 40 taona, dia nisy anjely niseho taminy tao anaty lelafo teo amin’ny voarointsilo nirehitra, tany amin’ilay tany efitra akaikin’ny Tendrombohitra Sinay.', '“rehefa afaka 40 taona, dia nisy anjely niseho taminy tao anaty lelafo teo amin’ny voarointsilo nirehitra, tany amin’ilay tany efitra akaikin’ny tendrombohitra sinay.'),
  ('6ab25c8233c15b05fa801f9d', '2026-09-22T10:46:26.869Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:26.869Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 7, 49, '‘Ny lanitra no seza fiandrianako, ary ny tany no fitoeran-tongotro. Koa trano hoatran’ny ahoana no hataonareo ho ahy?, hoy i Jehovah. Ary toerana hoatran’ny ahoana no azoko ialana sasatra?', '‘ny lanitra no seza fiandrianako, ary ny tany no fitoeran-tongotro. koa trano hoatran’ny ahoana no hataonareo ho ahy?, hoy i jehovah. ary toerana hoatran’ny ahoana no azoko ialana sasatra?'),
  ('6ab25c8233c15b05fa801f88', '2026-09-22T10:46:26.869Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:26.869Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 7, 28, 'Tadiavin’ialahy hovonoina hoatran’ny namonoan’ialahy an’ilay Ejipsianina omaly koa angaha aho?’', 'tadiavin’ialahy hovonoina hoatran’ny namonoan’ialahy an’ilay ejipsianina omaly koa angaha aho?’'),
  ('6ab25c8233c15b05fa801f83', '2026-09-22T10:46:26.869Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:26.869Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 7, 23, '“Rehefa feno 40 taona izy, dia nanapa-kevitra hitsidika ny rahalahiny, izany hoe ny zanak’Israely.', '“rehefa feno 40 taona izy, dia nanapa-kevitra hitsidika ny rahalahiny, izany hoe ny zanak’israely.'),
  ('6ab25c8233c15b05fa801f82', '2026-09-22T10:46:26.869Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:26.869Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 7, 22, 'Koa nampianarina ny fahendrena rehetra nananan’ny Ejipsianina i Mosesy, ary tena nisy lanjany ny zavatra nolazainy sady nahavita zavatra niavaka izy.', 'koa nampianarina ny fahendrena rehetra nananan’ny ejipsianina i mosesy, ary tena nisy lanjany ny zavatra nolazainy sady nahavita zavatra niavaka izy.'),
  ('6ab25c8233c15b05fa801fa1', '2026-09-22T10:46:26.869Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:26.869Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 7, 53, 'dia ianareo izay nandray ny Lalàna nampitain’ny anjely, nefa tsy nankatò an’izany.”', 'dia ianareo izay nandray ny lalàna nampitain’ny anjely, nefa tsy nankatò an’izany.”'),
  ('6ab25c8233c15b05fa801f96', '2026-09-22T10:46:26.869Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:26.869Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 7, 42, 'Koa niala tamin’izy ireo Andriamanitra, dia namela azy ireo hanao fanompoana masina ho an’ireo zavatra eny amin’ny lanitra, araka ny voasoratra ao amin’ny bokin’ny Mpaminany hoe: ‘Izaho angaha moa no nanoloranareo fanatitra sy sorona nandritra ny 40 taona tany an-tany efitra, ry taranak’Israely?', 'koa niala tamin’izy ireo andriamanitra, dia namela azy ireo hanao fanompoana masina ho an’ireo zavatra eny amin’ny lanitra, araka ny voasoratra ao amin’ny bokin’ny mpaminany hoe: ‘izaho angaha moa no nanoloranareo fanatitra sy sorona nandritra ny 40 taona tany an-tany efitra, ry taranak’israely?'),
  ('6ab25c8233c15b05fa801f94', '2026-09-22T10:46:26.869Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:26.869Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 7, 40, 'ka niteny tamin’i Arona hoe: ‘Manamboara andriamanitra ho antsika hitarika antsika. Fa tsy fantatra mihitsy izay nanjo an’ilay Mosesy nitondra antsika niala tany Ejipta iny.’', 'ka niteny tamin’i arona hoe: ‘manamboara andriamanitra ho antsika hitarika antsika. fa tsy fantatra mihitsy izay nanjo an’ilay mosesy nitondra antsika niala tany ejipta iny.’'),
  ('6ab25c8233c15b05fa801f8f', '2026-09-22T10:46:26.869Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:26.869Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 7, 35, 'Izany Mosesy izany ilay nolavin’izy ireo sy nataony hoe: ‘Iza no nanendry an’ialahy ho mpitondra sy mpitsara anay?’ Izy ihany anefa no nirahin’Andriamanitra ho mpitondra sady mpanafaka, ary tamin’ny alalan’ilay anjely niseho taminy tao amin’ny voarointsilo no nanaovany an’izany.', 'izany mosesy izany ilay nolavin’izy ireo sy nataony hoe: ‘iza no nanendry an’ialahy ho mpitondra sy mpitsara anay?’ izy ihany anefa no nirahin’andriamanitra ho mpitondra sady mpanafaka, ary tamin’ny alalan’ilay anjely niseho taminy tao amin’ny voarointsilo no nanaovany an’izany.'),
  ('6ab25c8233c15b05fa801f7b', '2026-09-22T10:46:26.869Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:26.869Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 7, 15, 'Nidina nankany Ejipta àry i Jakoba, dia tany izy no maty, ary tany koa no maty ny razambentsika.', 'nidina nankany ejipta àry i jakoba, dia tany izy no maty, ary tany koa no maty ny razambentsika.'),
  ('6ab25c8233c15b05fa801fa8', '2026-09-22T10:46:26.869Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:26.869Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 7, 60, 'Dia nandohalika izy ka niantso mafy hoe: “Jehovah ô, aza atao ho helony izao!” Rehefa avy nilaza an’izany izy, dia nodimandry.', 'dia nandohalika izy ka niantso mafy hoe: “jehovah ô, aza atao ho helony izao!” rehefa avy nilaza an’izany izy, dia nodimandry.'),
  ('6ab25c8233c15b05fa801f8e', '2026-09-22T10:46:26.869Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:26.869Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 7, 34, 'Efa hitako tokoa ny fampijaliana ny vahoakako any Ejipta, ary efa henoko ny fitarainany ka nidina hamonjy azy ireo aho. Koa izao àry: Hirahiko ho any Ejipta ianao.’', 'efa hitako tokoa ny fampijaliana ny vahoakako any ejipta, ary efa henoko ny fitarainany ka nidina hamonjy azy ireo aho. koa izao àry: hirahiko ho any ejipta ianao.’'),
  ('6ab25c8233c15b05fa801f8d', '2026-09-22T10:46:26.869Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:26.869Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 7, 33, 'Ary hoy i Jehovah: ‘Esory ny kapanao, fa tany masina io ijoroanao io.', 'ary hoy i jehovah: ‘esory ny kapanao, fa tany masina io ijoroanao io.'),
  ('6ab25c8233c15b05fa801fa7', '2026-09-22T10:46:26.869Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:26.869Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 7, 59, 'Rehefa nitora-bato an’i Stefana izy ireo, dia nitalaho i Stefana hoe: “Jesosy Tompo ô, raiso ny aiko.”', 'rehefa nitora-bato an’i stefana izy ireo, dia nitalaho i stefana hoe: “jesosy tompo ô, raiso ny aiko.”'),
  ('6ab25c8233c15b05fa801fa0', '2026-09-22T10:46:26.869Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:26.869Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 7, 52, 'Iza moa no mpaminany tsy nenjehin’ny razambenareo? Novonoiny mihitsy aza ireo nanambara mialoha fa ho avy ilay marina. Ary ianareo indray izao no lasa mpamadika sy mpamono azy,', 'iza moa no mpaminany tsy nenjehin’ny razambenareo? novonoiny mihitsy aza ireo nanambara mialoha fa ho avy ilay marina. ary ianareo indray izao no lasa mpamadika sy mpamono azy,'),
  ('6ab25c8233c15b05fa801f93', '2026-09-22T10:46:26.869Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:26.869Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 7, 39, 'Tsy nety nankatò azy anefa ny razambentsika fa nanilikilika azy, ary te hiverina tany Ejipta izy ireo tao am-pony,', 'tsy nety nankatò azy anefa ny razambentsika fa nanilikilika azy, ary te hiverina tany ejipta izy ireo tao am-pony,'),
  ('6ab25c8233c15b05fa801f80', '2026-09-22T10:46:26.869Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:26.869Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 7, 20, 'Tamin’izay no teraka i Mosesy, izay tena nahafatifaty be mihitsy, ary nokarakaraina tao an-tranon-drainy izy nandritra ny telo volana.', 'tamin’izay no teraka i mosesy, izay tena nahafatifaty be mihitsy, ary nokarakaraina tao an-tranon-drainy izy nandritra ny telo volana.'),
  ('6ab25c8233c15b05fa801f86', '2026-09-22T10:46:26.869Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:26.869Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 7, 26, 'Ary nankany amin’izy ireo izy ny ampitson’iny, ka nahita roa lahy niady. Dia nanandrana nampihavana azy roa lahy izy, ka niteny hoe: ‘Ô ry izy roa lahy a, mpirahalahy ange ianareo e! Koa maninona ianareo no miady hoatr’izao?’', 'ary nankany amin’izy ireo izy ny ampitson’iny, ka nahita roa lahy niady. dia nanandrana nampihavana azy roa lahy izy, ka niteny hoe: ‘ô ry izy roa lahy a, mpirahalahy ange ianareo e! koa maninona ianareo no miady hoatr’izao?’'),
  ('6ab25c8233c15b05fa801f7c', '2026-09-22T10:46:26.869Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:26.869Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 7, 16, 'Dia nentina tany Sekema izy ireo, ary nalevina tao amin’ilay fasana novidin’i Abrahama sekely volafotsy tamin’ny zanakalahin’i Hamora, tany Sekema.', 'dia nentina tany sekema izy ireo, ary nalevina tao amin’ilay fasana novidin’i abrahama sekely volafotsy tamin’ny zanakalahin’i hamora, tany sekema.'),
  ('6ab25c8233c15b05fa801f87', '2026-09-22T10:46:26.869Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:26.869Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 7, 27, 'Fa natosik’ilay namely an’ilay namany izy, sady noteneniny hoe: ‘Iza no nanendry an’ialahy ho mpitondra sy mpitsara anay?', 'fa natosik’ilay namely an’ilay namany izy, sady noteneniny hoe: ‘iza no nanendry an’ialahy ho mpitondra sy mpitsara anay?'),
  ('6ab25c8233c15b05fa801fa5', '2026-09-22T10:46:26.869Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:26.869Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 7, 57, 'Koa niantsoantso faran’izay mafy ny olona sady nanampin-tsofina, ka indray nirohotra nankeo aminy.', 'koa niantsoantso faran’izay mafy ny olona sady nanampin-tsofina, ka indray nirohotra nankeo aminy.'),
  ('6ab25c8233c15b05fa801fa2', '2026-09-22T10:46:26.869Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:26.869Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 7, 54, 'Ary nisafoaka izy ireo rehefa nandre an’izany, ka nihidy vazana taminy.', 'ary nisafoaka izy ireo rehefa nandre an’izany, ka nihidy vazana taminy.'),
  ('6ab25c8233c15b05fa801f95', '2026-09-22T10:46:26.869Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:26.869Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 7, 41, 'Nanamboatra zanak’omby àry izy ireo tamin’izany andro izany, ka nanao sorona ho an’io sampy io sady nifalifaly nankalaza ny asan’ny tanany.', 'nanamboatra zanak’omby àry izy ireo tamin’izany andro izany, ka nanao sorona ho an’io sampy io sady nifalifaly nankalaza ny asan’ny tanany.'),
  ('6ab25c8233c15b05fa801f91', '2026-09-22T10:46:26.869Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:26.869Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 7, 37, '“Izany Mosesy izany ilay nilaza tamin’ny zanak’Israely hoe: ‘Hanendry mpaminany ho anareo Andriamanitra, dia mpaminany hoatr’ahy, avy eo amin’ny rahalahinareo.’', '“izany mosesy izany ilay nilaza tamin’ny zanak’israely hoe: ‘hanendry mpaminany ho anareo andriamanitra, dia mpaminany hoatr’ahy, avy eo amin’ny rahalahinareo.’'),
  ('6ab25c8233c15b05fa801f7f', '2026-09-22T10:46:26.869Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:26.869Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 7, 19, 'Nampiasa hafetsen-dratsy izy hamelezana ny razambentsika, ka notereny hanary ny zanany vao teraka izy ireo, mba tsy ho velona ireny.', 'nampiasa hafetsen-dratsy izy hamelezana ny razambentsika, ka notereny hanary ny zanany vao teraka izy ireo, mba tsy ho velona ireny.'),
  ('6ab25c8233c15b05fa801f7d', '2026-09-22T10:46:26.869Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:26.869Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 7, 17, '“Rehefa nanakaiky ny fotoana hahatanterahan’ilay fampanantenana nolazain’Andriamanitra tamin’i Abrahama, dia nitombo sy nihamaro ny olona tany Ejipta.', '“rehefa nanakaiky ny fotoana hahatanterahan’ilay fampanantenana nolazain’andriamanitra tamin’i abrahama, dia nitombo sy nihamaro ny olona tany ejipta.'),
  ('6ab25c8233c15b05fa801fa6', '2026-09-22T10:46:26.869Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:26.869Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 7, 58, 'Dia nandroaka azy tany ivelan’ny tanàna izy ireo, ka nitora-bato azy. Ary nametraka ny akanjony ivelany teo an-tongotry ny tovolahy atao hoe Saoly ireo vavolombelona niampanga azy.', 'dia nandroaka azy tany ivelan’ny tanàna izy ireo, ka nitora-bato azy. ary nametraka ny akanjony ivelany teo an-tongotry ny tovolahy atao hoe saoly ireo vavolombelona niampanga azy.'),
  ('6ab25c8233c15b05fa801f85', '2026-09-22T10:46:26.869Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:26.869Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 7, 25, 'Nieritreritra izy fa ho takatry ny rahalahiny hoe izy no nampiasain’Andriamanitra hamonjy azy ireo, kanjo tsy takatr’izy ireo izany.', 'nieritreritra izy fa ho takatry ny rahalahiny hoe izy no nampiasain’andriamanitra hamonjy azy ireo, kanjo tsy takatr’izy ireo izany.'),
  ('6ab25c8233c15b05fa801f78', '2026-09-22T10:46:26.869Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:26.869Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 7, 12, 'Henon’i Jakoba anefa fa nisy sakafo tany Ejipta, ka naniraka ny razambentsika ho any izy tamin’ny voalohany.', 'henon’i jakoba anefa fa nisy sakafo tany ejipta, ka naniraka ny razambentsika ho any izy tamin’ny voalohany.'),
  ('6ab25c8233c15b05fa801fa4', '2026-09-22T10:46:26.869Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:26.869Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 7, 56, 'Dia hoy izy: “Io fa hitako misokatra ny lanitra, ary ny Zanak’olona mijoro eo ankavanan’Andriamanitra.”', 'dia hoy izy: “io fa hitako misokatra ny lanitra, ary ny zanak’olona mijoro eo ankavanan’andriamanitra.”'),
  ('6ab25c8233c15b05fa801f9a', '2026-09-22T10:46:26.869Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:26.869Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 7, 46, 'Ary nahazo sitraka teo imason’Andriamanitra i Davida, ka nangataka mba homena voninahitra hanorina fonenana ho an’ilay Andriamanitr’i Jakoba.', 'ary nahazo sitraka teo imason’andriamanitra i davida, ka nangataka mba homena voninahitra hanorina fonenana ho an’ilay andriamanitr’i jakoba.'),
  ('6ab25c8233c15b05fa801f79', '2026-09-22T10:46:26.869Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:26.869Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 7, 13, 'Rehefa nankany fanindroany izy ireo, dia nampahafantatra ny tenany tamin’ny rahalahiny i Josefa, ary lasa fantatr’i Farao ny fianakavian’i Josefa.', 'rehefa nankany fanindroany izy ireo, dia nampahafantatra ny tenany tamin’ny rahalahiny i josefa, ary lasa fantatr’i farao ny fianakavian’i josefa.'),
  ('6ab25c854858ee1a8fd73d19', '2026-09-22T10:46:29.602Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:29.602Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 8, 39, 'Rehefa niakatra avy tao anaty rano izy roa lahy, dia nentin’ny fanahin’i Jehovah niala teo haingana i Filipo, ka tsy hitan’ilay tandapa intsony. Dia nanohy ny diany ilay tandapa sady faly.', 'rehefa niakatra avy tao anaty rano izy roa lahy, dia nentin’ny fanahin’i jehovah niala teo haingana i filipo, ka tsy hitan’ilay tandapa intsony. dia nanohy ny diany ilay tandapa sady faly.'),
  ('6ab25c854858ee1a8fd73d0c', '2026-09-22T10:46:29.602Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:29.602Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 8, 26, 'Ary nisy anjelin’i Jehovah niteny tamin’i Filipo hoe: “Mitsangàna, dia mandehana mianatsimo any amin’ilay lalana midina avy any Jerosalema mankany Gaza.”—Lalana any an-tany efitra izany.—', 'ary nisy anjelin’i jehovah niteny tamin’i filipo hoe: “mitsangàna, dia mandehana mianatsimo any amin’ilay lalana midina avy any jerosalema mankany gaza.”—lalana any an-tany efitra izany.—'),
  ('6ab25c854858ee1a8fd73d0b', '2026-09-22T10:46:29.602Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:29.602Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 8, 25, 'Rehefa avy namita tsara ny fitoriany i Petera sy Jaona, sady nilaza ny tenin’i Jehovah, dia niverina nankany Jerosalema. Nitory ny vaovao tsara izy roa lahy rehefa nandalo teny amin’ny tanàna kely maro nisy Samaritanina.', 'rehefa avy namita tsara ny fitoriany i petera sy jaona, sady nilaza ny tenin’i jehovah, dia niverina nankany jerosalema. nitory ny vaovao tsara izy roa lahy rehefa nandalo teny amin’ny tanàna kely maro nisy samaritanina.'),
  ('6ab25c854858ee1a8fd73d01', '2026-09-22T10:46:29.602Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:29.602Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 8, 15, 'Dia nidina tany izy roa lahy ka nivavaka ho azy ireo mba hahazoany ny fanahy masina.', 'dia nidina tany izy roa lahy ka nivavaka ho azy ireo mba hahazoany ny fanahy masina.'),
  ('6ab25c854858ee1a8fd73d16', '2026-09-22T10:46:29.602Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:29.602Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 8, 36, 'Raha mbola teny an-dalana izy ireo, dia tonga teo amin’ny toerana nisy rano, ka hoy ilay tandapa: “Io misy rano, ka inona no misakana ahy tsy hatao batisa?”', 'raha mbola teny an-dalana izy ireo, dia tonga teo amin’ny toerana nisy rano, ka hoy ilay tandapa: “io misy rano, ka inona no misakana ahy tsy hatao batisa?”'),
  ('6ab25c854858ee1a8fd73d0a', '2026-09-22T10:46:29.602Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:29.602Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 8, 24, 'Dia namaly azy ireo i Simona hoe: “Mba mitalahoa amin’i Jehovah, mba tsy hisy hanjo ahy izany voalazanareo izany.”', 'dia namaly azy ireo i simona hoe: “mba mitalahoa amin’i jehovah, mba tsy hisy hanjo ahy izany voalazanareo izany.”'),
  ('6ab25c854858ee1a8fd73d03', '2026-09-22T10:46:29.602Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:29.602Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 8, 17, 'Dia nametra-tanana tamin’ireo izy roa lahy, ka nahazo ny fanahy masina izy ireo.', 'dia nametra-tanana tamin’ireo izy roa lahy, ka nahazo ny fanahy masina izy ireo.'),
  ('6ab25c854858ee1a8fd73d0f', '2026-09-22T10:46:29.602Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:29.602Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 8, 29, 'Niteny tamin’i Filipo àry ny fanahy hoe: “Mandehana manatona an’iny kalesy iny!”', 'niteny tamin’i filipo àry ny fanahy hoe: “mandehana manatona an’iny kalesy iny!”'),
  ('6ab25c854858ee1a8fd73cfd', '2026-09-22T10:46:29.602Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:29.602Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 8, 11, 'Koa nihaino tsara azy izy ireo, satria efa ela no nampiaiky azy ireo ny fahaizany nampiasa herin’ny maizina.', 'koa nihaino tsara azy izy ireo, satria efa ela no nampiaiky azy ireo ny fahaizany nampiasa herin’ny maizina.'),
  ('6ab25c854858ee1a8fd73cf7', '2026-09-22T10:46:29.602Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:29.602Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 8, 5, 'Dia nidina tany amin’ny tanànan’i Samaria i Filipo, ka nitory momba an’i Kristy tany.', 'dia nidina tany amin’ny tanànan’i samaria i filipo, ka nitory momba an’i kristy tany.'),
  ('6ab25c854858ee1a8fd73cf4', '2026-09-22T10:46:29.602Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:29.602Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 8, 2, 'Nisy lehilahy natahotra an’Andriamanitra anefa nitondra an’i Stefana ka nandevina azy. Ary nitomany be izy ireo fa nalahelo azy.', 'nisy lehilahy natahotra an’andriamanitra anefa nitondra an’i stefana ka nandevina azy. ary nitomany be izy ireo fa nalahelo azy.'),
  ('6ab25c854858ee1a8fd73d02', '2026-09-22T10:46:29.602Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:29.602Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 8, 16, 'Mbola tsy nisy nilatsahan’ny fanahy mantsy izy ireo, fa natao batisa tamin’ny anaran’i Jesosy Tompo fotsiny.', 'mbola tsy nisy nilatsahan’ny fanahy mantsy izy ireo, fa natao batisa tamin’ny anaran’i jesosy tompo fotsiny.'),
  ('6ab25c854858ee1a8fd73cff', '2026-09-22T10:46:29.602Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:29.602Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 8, 13, 'I Simona koa aza nino ka natao batisa, ary niaraka tamin’i Filipo foana izy taorian’izay. Dia gaga izy nahita ny famantarana sy ny fahagagana lehibe nitranga.', 'i simona koa aza nino ka natao batisa, ary niaraka tamin’i filipo foana izy taorian’izay. dia gaga izy nahita ny famantarana sy ny fahagagana lehibe nitranga.'),
  ('6ab25c854858ee1a8fd73cfe', '2026-09-22T10:46:29.602Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:29.602Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 8, 12, 'Nino an’i Filipo anefa izy ireo, tamin’izy nitory ny vaovao tsara momba ny Fanjakan’Andriamanitra sy momba ny anaran’i Jesosy Kristy. Dia natao batisa izy ireo, na lahy na vavy.', 'nino an’i filipo anefa izy ireo, tamin’izy nitory ny vaovao tsara momba ny fanjakan’andriamanitra sy momba ny anaran’i jesosy kristy. dia natao batisa izy ireo, na lahy na vavy.'),
  ('6ab25c854858ee1a8fd73cfc', '2026-09-22T10:46:29.602Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:29.602Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 8, 10, 'Nihaino tsara azy izy rehetra, hatramin’ny kely indrindra ka hatramin’ny lehibe indrindra. Nilaza àry izy ireo hoe: “Io lehilahy io no Herin’Andriamanitra, dia ilay antsoina hoe Hery Lehibe.”', 'nihaino tsara azy izy rehetra, hatramin’ny kely indrindra ka hatramin’ny lehibe indrindra. nilaza àry izy ireo hoe: “io lehilahy io no herin’andriamanitra, dia ilay antsoina hoe hery lehibe.”'),
  ('6ab25c854858ee1a8fd73cf9', '2026-09-22T10:46:29.602Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:29.602Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 8, 7, 'Maro tamin’izy ireo mantsy no nisy fanahy maloto, ary niantsoantso mafy ireny fanahy ireny rehefa nivoaka tamin’izy ireo. Betsaka koa ny malemy sy ny kilemaina sitrana.', 'maro tamin’izy ireo mantsy no nisy fanahy maloto, ary niantsoantso mafy ireny fanahy ireny rehefa nivoaka tamin’izy ireo. betsaka koa ny malemy sy ny kilemaina sitrana.'),
  ('6ab25c854858ee1a8fd73d18', '2026-09-22T10:46:29.602Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:29.602Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 8, 38, 'Dia nasainy najanona ilay kalesy. Ary nidina tao anaty rano i Filipo sy ilay tandapa, ka nataon’i Filipo batisa izy.', 'dia nasainy najanona ilay kalesy. ary nidina tao anaty rano i filipo sy ilay tandapa, ka nataon’i filipo batisa izy.'),
  ('6ab25c854858ee1a8fd73d17', '2026-09-22T10:46:29.602Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:29.602Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 8, 37, '* ——', '* ——'),
  ('6ab25c854858ee1a8fd73d08', '2026-09-22T10:46:29.602Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:29.602Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 8, 22, 'Koa mibebaha ka mialà amin’izao faharatsianao izao, dia mitalahoa amin’i Jehovah sao mba hamela ny helokao izy noho ny fikasan-dratsy tao am-ponao.', 'koa mibebaha ka mialà amin’izao faharatsianao izao, dia mitalahoa amin’i jehovah sao mba hamela ny helokao izy noho ny fikasan-dratsy tao am-ponao.'),
  ('6ab25c854858ee1a8fd73cfb', '2026-09-22T10:46:29.602Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:29.602Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 8, 9, 'Ary nisy lehilahy atao hoe Simona tao amin’ilay tanàna. Mpampiasa herin’ny maizina izy, ka nampiaiky ny mponina tao Samaria sady nidera tena hoe tsy misy hoatr’azy.', 'ary nisy lehilahy atao hoe simona tao amin’ilay tanàna. mpampiasa herin’ny maizina izy, ka nampiaiky ny mponina tao samaria sady nidera tena hoe tsy misy hoatr’azy.'),
  ('6ab25c854858ee1a8fd73d11', '2026-09-22T10:46:29.602Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:29.602Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 8, 31, 'Dia hoy izy: “Ahoana moa no hahazoako azy raha tsy misy manoro ahy?” Koa nangataka an’i Filipo izy mba hiakatra dia hipetraka teo akaikiny.', 'dia hoy izy: “ahoana moa no hahazoako azy raha tsy misy manoro ahy?” koa nangataka an’i filipo izy mba hiakatra dia hipetraka teo akaikiny.'),
  ('6ab25c854858ee1a8fd73d1a', '2026-09-22T10:46:29.602Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:29.602Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 8, 40, 'I Filipo kosa tonga tany Asdoda, ary namakivaky an’ilay faritra. Tsy nitsahatra nitory ny vaovao tsara tany amin’ny tanàna rehetra izy, mandra-pahatongany tany Kaisaria.', 'i filipo kosa tonga tany asdoda, ary namakivaky an’ilay faritra. tsy nitsahatra nitory ny vaovao tsara tany amin’ny tanàna rehetra izy, mandra-pahatongany tany kaisaria.'),
  ('6ab25c854858ee1a8fd73d15', '2026-09-22T10:46:29.602Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:29.602Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 8, 35, 'Ary niteny indray i Filipo, ka nitory taminy ny vaovao tsara momba an’i Jesosy, ary izany andinin-teny izany no nanombohany azy.', 'ary niteny indray i filipo, ka nitory taminy ny vaovao tsara momba an’i jesosy, ary izany andinin-teny izany no nanombohany azy.'),
  ('6ab25c854858ee1a8fd73cf3', '2026-09-22T10:46:29.602Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:29.602Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 8, 1, 'Ary nankasitraka ny namonoana an’i Stefana i Saoly. Tamin’izany andro izany, dia nenjehina mafy ny fiangonana tany Jerosalema, ka niparitaka nanerana ny faritr’i Jodia sy Samaria izy rehetra, afa-tsy ny apostoly.', 'ary nankasitraka ny namonoana an’i stefana i saoly. tamin’izany andro izany, dia nenjehina mafy ny fiangonana tany jerosalema, ka niparitaka nanerana ny faritr’i jodia sy samaria izy rehetra, afa-tsy ny apostoly.'),
  ('6ab25c854858ee1a8fd73cf8', '2026-09-22T10:46:29.602Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:29.602Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 8, 6, 'Nihaino tsara an’izay nolazain’i Filipo daholo ny vahoaka, ka sady nihaino azy izy ireo no nijery ny famantarana nataony.', 'nihaino tsara an’izay nolazain’i filipo daholo ny vahoaka, ka sady nihaino azy izy ireo no nijery ny famantarana nataony.'),
  ('6ab25c854858ee1a8fd73d12', '2026-09-22T10:46:29.602Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:29.602Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 8, 32, 'Ary izao ilay andinin-tenin’ny Soratra Masina novakiny: “Hoatran’ny ondry nentina hovonoina izy, ary hoatran’ny zanak’ondry mangina eo anatrehan’ny mpanety azy, ka tsy miteny mihitsy.', 'ary izao ilay andinin-tenin’ny soratra masina novakiny: “hoatran’ny ondry nentina hovonoina izy, ary hoatran’ny zanak’ondry mangina eo anatrehan’ny mpanety azy, ka tsy miteny mihitsy.'),
  ('6ab25c854858ee1a8fd73d09', '2026-09-22T10:46:29.602Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:29.602Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 8, 23, 'Hitako mantsy fa hoatran’ny poizina mangidy ianao ary andevon’ny tsy fahamarinana.”', 'hitako mantsy fa hoatran’ny poizina mangidy ianao ary andevon’ny tsy fahamarinana.”'),
  ('6ab25c854858ee1a8fd73cf6', '2026-09-22T10:46:29.602Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:29.602Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 8, 4, 'Fa izay niparitaka kosa dia namakivaky an’ilay faritra, ka nitory ny vaovao tsaran’ny tenin’Andriamanitra.', 'fa izay niparitaka kosa dia namakivaky an’ilay faritra, ka nitory ny vaovao tsaran’ny tenin’andriamanitra.'),
  ('6ab25c854858ee1a8fd73d06', '2026-09-22T10:46:29.602Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:29.602Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 8, 20, 'Hoy anefa i Petera: “Ho ripaka miaraka aminao anie ny volafotsinao! Heverinao fa azo vidim-bola angaha ny fanomezana maimaim-poana avy amin’Andriamanitra?', 'hoy anefa i petera: “ho ripaka miaraka aminao anie ny volafotsinao! heverinao fa azo vidim-bola angaha ny fanomezana maimaim-poana avy amin’andriamanitra?'),
  ('6ab25c854858ee1a8fd73d13', '2026-09-22T10:46:29.602Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:29.602Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 8, 33, 'Tsy mba nomena rariny izy nandritra ny fotoana nanalana baraka azy. Ary iza no hilaza ny tsipiriany momba ny taranaka nipoirany? Fa ny ainy aza nesorina tsy ho amin’ny tany.”', 'tsy mba nomena rariny izy nandritra ny fotoana nanalana baraka azy. ary iza no hilaza ny tsipiriany momba ny taranaka nipoirany? fa ny ainy aza nesorina tsy ho amin’ny tany.”'),
  ('6ab25c854858ee1a8fd73d10', '2026-09-22T10:46:29.602Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:29.602Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 8, 30, 'Dia nihazakazaka teo akaikin’ilay kalesy i Filipo ka naheno azy namaky mafy ny bokin’i Isaia mpaminany. Ary hoy izy: “Azonao tsara ve izay vakinao?”', 'dia nihazakazaka teo akaikin’ilay kalesy i filipo ka naheno azy namaky mafy ny bokin’i isaia mpaminany. ary hoy izy: “azonao tsara ve izay vakinao?”'),
  ('6ab25c854858ee1a8fd73d0d', '2026-09-22T10:46:29.602Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:29.602Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 8, 27, 'Dia nitsangana i Filipo ka lasa ary nahita tandapa etiopianina. Manam-pahefana teo ambany fifehezan’i Kandasy mpanjakavavin’ny Etiopianina izy io, ary niandraikitra ny harenany rehetra. Nankany Jerosalema izy mba hivavaka,', 'dia nitsangana i filipo ka lasa ary nahita tandapa etiopianina. manam-pahefana teo ambany fifehezan’i kandasy mpanjakavavin’ny etiopianina izy io, ary niandraikitra ny harenany rehetra. nankany jerosalema izy mba hivavaka,'),
  ('6ab25c854858ee1a8fd73d0e', '2026-09-22T10:46:29.602Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:29.602Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 8, 28, 'ary teny an-dalana hody izy tamin’izay. Nipetraka tao amin’ny kalesiny izy sady namaky mafy ny bokin’i Isaia mpaminany.', 'ary teny an-dalana hody izy tamin’izay. nipetraka tao amin’ny kalesiny izy sady namaky mafy ny bokin’i isaia mpaminany.'),
  ('6ab25c854858ee1a8fd73cfa', '2026-09-22T10:46:29.602Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:29.602Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 8, 8, 'Faly be àry ny olona tao amin’io tanàna io.', 'faly be àry ny olona tao amin’io tanàna io.'),
  ('6ab25c854858ee1a8fd73d07', '2026-09-22T10:46:29.602Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:29.602Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 8, 21, 'Tsy manana anjara amin’izany mihitsy ianao, satria tsy tsotra eo anatrehan’Andriamanitra ny fonao.', 'tsy manana anjara amin’izany mihitsy ianao, satria tsy tsotra eo anatrehan’andriamanitra ny fonao.'),
  ('6ab25c854858ee1a8fd73d14', '2026-09-22T10:46:29.602Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:29.602Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 8, 34, 'Dia hoy ilay tandapa tamin’i Filipo: “Hono ho’aho, iza no tian’ilay mpaminany horesahina amin’izany? Izy ihany ve sa olon-kafa?”', 'dia hoy ilay tandapa tamin’i filipo: “hono ho’aho, iza no tian’ilay mpaminany horesahina amin’izany? izy ihany ve sa olon-kafa?”'),
  ('6ab25c854858ee1a8fd73d05', '2026-09-22T10:46:29.602Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:29.602Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 8, 19, 'sady hoy izy: “Mba omeo an’izany fahefana izany koa aho. Amin’izay dia hahazo fanahy masina izay hametrahako tanana.”', 'sady hoy izy: “mba omeo an’izany fahefana izany koa aho. amin’izay dia hahazo fanahy masina izay hametrahako tanana.”'),
  ('6ab25c854858ee1a8fd73d04', '2026-09-22T10:46:29.602Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:29.602Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 8, 18, 'Rehefa hitan’i Simona fa nahazo fanahy masina izay nametrahan’ny apostoly tanana, dia notolorany vola izy roa lahy,', 'rehefa hitan’i simona fa nahazo fanahy masina izay nametrahan’ny apostoly tanana, dia notolorany vola izy roa lahy,'),
  ('6ab25c854858ee1a8fd73d00', '2026-09-22T10:46:29.602Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:29.602Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 8, 14, 'Henon’ny apostoly tany Jerosalema fa nanaiky ny tenin’Andriamanitra ny tany Samaria, ka nirahiny hankany i Petera sy Jaona.', 'henon’ny apostoly tany jerosalema fa nanaiky ny tenin’andriamanitra ny tany samaria, ka nirahiny hankany i petera sy jaona.'),
  ('6ab25c854858ee1a8fd73cf5', '2026-09-22T10:46:29.602Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:29.602Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Asan''ny Apostoly', 44, 8, 3, 'I Saoly kosa nandravarava ny fiangonana. Nasesiny ny tranon’ireo mpino ka nidirany an-keriny, dia notaritaritiny hivoaka izy ireo na lahy na vavy, ary nataony am-ponja.', 'i saoly kosa nandravarava ny fiangonana. nasesiny ny tranon’ireo mpino ka nidirany an-keriny, dia notaritaritiny hivoaka izy ireo na lahy na vavy, ary nataony am-ponja.'),
  ('6ab25c9a7e48e043a7520121', '2026-09-22T10:46:50.947Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:50.947Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 8, 31, 'Inona àry no holazaintsika amin’izany? Raha manohana antsika Andriamanitra, dia iza no hahavita hanohitra antsika?', 'inona àry no holazaintsika amin’izany? raha manohana antsika andriamanitra, dia iza no hahavita hanohitra antsika?'),
  ('6ab25c9a7e48e043a752011a', '2026-09-22T10:46:50.947Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:50.947Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 8, 24, 'Rehefa novonjen’Andriamanitra isika, dia lasa nanana an’izany fanantenana izany. Ny fanantenana zavatra efa hita anefa dia tsy fanantenana, fa ahoana no mbola anantenan’ny olona zavatra efa hitany?', 'rehefa novonjen’andriamanitra isika, dia lasa nanana an’izany fanantenana izany. ny fanantenana zavatra efa hita anefa dia tsy fanantenana, fa ahoana no mbola anantenan’ny olona zavatra efa hitany?'),
  ('6ab25c9a7e48e043a7520125', '2026-09-22T10:46:50.947Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:50.947Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 8, 35, 'Inona no hampisaraka antsika amin’i Kristy ka hahatonga azy tsy ho tia antsika intsony? Fahoriana ve, sa zava-tsarotra, sa fanenjehana, sa hanoanana, sa fitanjahana, sa loza, sa sabatra?', 'inona no hampisaraka antsika amin’i kristy ka hahatonga azy tsy ho tia antsika intsony? fahoriana ve, sa zava-tsarotra, sa fanenjehana, sa hanoanana, sa fitanjahana, sa loza, sa sabatra?'),
  ('6ab25c9a7e48e043a7520113', '2026-09-22T10:46:50.947Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:50.947Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 8, 17, 'Raha zanaka àry isika, dia mpandova koa. Mpandova an’Andriamanitra tokoa isika, nefa koa mpiara-mandova amin’i Kristy. Raha miara-mijaly aminy isika, dia homem-boninahitra miaraka aminy koa.', 'raha zanaka àry isika, dia mpandova koa. mpandova an’andriamanitra tokoa isika, nefa koa mpiara-mandova amin’i kristy. raha miara-mijaly aminy isika, dia homem-boninahitra miaraka aminy koa.'),
  ('6ab25c9a7e48e043a7520110', '2026-09-22T10:46:50.947Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:50.947Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 8, 14, 'Fa izay rehetra tarihin’ny fanahin’Andriamanitra no tena zanak’Andriamanitra.', 'fa izay rehetra tarihin’ny fanahin’andriamanitra no tena zanak’andriamanitra.'),
  ('6ab25c9a7e48e043a7520105', '2026-09-22T10:46:50.947Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:50.947Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 8, 3, 'Satria tsy lavorary ny olona, dia izany no nahatonga ny Lalàna halemy, ka nisy zavatra tsy vitany. Izay tsy vitany anefa no nataon’Andriamanitra rehefa nirahiny ny Zanany ka nataony nitovy tamin’ny nofo mpanota, mba hanafoanana ny ota. Izany no nataony mba hanamelohana ny ota ao amin’ny nofo.', 'satria tsy lavorary ny olona, dia izany no nahatonga ny lalàna halemy, ka nisy zavatra tsy vitany. izay tsy vitany anefa no nataon’andriamanitra rehefa nirahiny ny zanany ka nataony nitovy tamin’ny nofo mpanota, mba hanafoanana ny ota. izany no nataony mba hanamelohana ny ota ao amin’ny nofo.'),
  ('6ab25c9a7e48e043a7520118', '2026-09-22T10:46:50.947Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:50.947Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 8, 22, 'Fantatsika mantsy fa mbola miara-mitaraina sy miara-mijaly foana ny zavaboary rehetra hatramin’izao.', 'fantatsika mantsy fa mbola miara-mitaraina sy miara-mijaly foana ny zavaboary rehetra hatramin’izao.'),
  ('6ab25c9a7e48e043a7520111', '2026-09-22T10:46:50.947Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:50.947Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 8, 15, 'Ilay fanahin’Andriamanitra miasa ao anatinareo dia tsy mahatonga anareo ho lasa andevo na hatahotra indray, fa mahatonga anareo hatsangana ho zanaka kosa. Noho io fanahy io àry, dia afaka miantso mafy isika hoe: “Aba, Ray ô!”', 'ilay fanahin’andriamanitra miasa ao anatinareo dia tsy mahatonga anareo ho lasa andevo na hatahotra indray, fa mahatonga anareo hatsangana ho zanaka kosa. noho io fanahy io àry, dia afaka miantso mafy isika hoe: “aba, ray ô!”'),
  ('6ab25c9a7e48e043a7520104', '2026-09-22T10:46:50.947Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:50.947Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 8, 2, 'Efa nanafaka anao tamin’ny lalàn’ny ota sy fahafatesana mantsy ny lalàn’ny fanahy. Io fanahy io no manome fiainana ho an’izay tafaray amin’i Kristy Jesosy.', 'efa nanafaka anao tamin’ny lalàn’ny ota sy fahafatesana mantsy ny lalàn’ny fanahy. io fanahy io no manome fiainana ho an’izay tafaray amin’i kristy jesosy.'),
  ('6ab25c9a7e48e043a7520123', '2026-09-22T10:46:50.947Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:50.947Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 8, 33, 'Iza no hiampanga an’izay voafidin’Andriamanitra? Fa Andriamanitra no manambara azy ireo hoe marina.', 'iza no hiampanga an’izay voafidin’andriamanitra? fa andriamanitra no manambara azy ireo hoe marina.'),
  ('6ab25c9a7e48e043a7520116', '2026-09-22T10:46:50.947Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:50.947Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 8, 20, 'Fa navela hanana fiainana tsy misy dikany ny zavaboary, nefa tsy noho ny sitrapony fa noho ny sitrapon’ilay namela an’izany hitranga. Mbola nisy an’izao fanantenana izao anefa:', 'fa navela hanana fiainana tsy misy dikany ny zavaboary, nefa tsy noho ny sitrapony fa noho ny sitrapon’ilay namela an’izany hitranga. mbola nisy an’izao fanantenana izao anefa:'),
  ('6ab25c9a7e48e043a7520126', '2026-09-22T10:46:50.947Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:50.947Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 8, 36, 'Araka ny voasoratra hoe: “Hoatran’ny hoe vonoina ho faty izahay isan’andro noho ny aminao; toy ny ondry hovonoina no fiheverana anay.”', 'araka ny voasoratra hoe: “hoatran’ny hoe vonoina ho faty izahay isan’andro noho ny aminao; toy ny ondry hovonoina no fiheverana anay.”'),
  ('6ab25c9a7e48e043a7520119', '2026-09-22T10:46:50.947Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:50.947Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 8, 23, 'Tsy izany ihany, fa mitaraina ao anatintsika ao koa isika na dia manana an’ilay voaloham-bokatra aza, dia ny fanahy. Miandry mafy koa isika mba hatsangan’Andriamanitra ho zanany, izany hoe mba hafahany amin’ny alalan’ny vidim-panavotana ny vatantsika.', 'tsy izany ihany, fa mitaraina ao anatintsika ao koa isika na dia manana an’ilay voaloham-bokatra aza, dia ny fanahy. miandry mafy koa isika mba hatsangan’andriamanitra ho zanany, izany hoe mba hafahany amin’ny alalan’ny vidim-panavotana ny vatantsika.'),
  ('6ab25c9a7e48e043a7520103', '2026-09-22T10:46:50.947Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:50.947Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 8, 1, 'Tsy melohina àry izay tafaray amin’i Kristy Jesosy.', 'tsy melohina àry izay tafaray amin’i kristy jesosy.'),
  ('6ab25c9a7e48e043a7520108', '2026-09-22T10:46:50.947Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:50.947Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 8, 6, 'Izay mampifantoka ny sainy amin’ny nofo dia fahafatesana no hiafarany, fa izay mampifantoka ny sainy amin’ny fanahy kosa hahazo fiainana sy fiadanana.', 'izay mampifantoka ny sainy amin’ny nofo dia fahafatesana no hiafarany, fa izay mampifantoka ny sainy amin’ny fanahy kosa hahazo fiainana sy fiadanana.'),
  ('6ab25c9a7e48e043a7520122', '2026-09-22T10:46:50.947Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:50.947Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 8, 32, 'Ny Zanany aza tsy narovany fa nomeny mba hamonjena antsika rehetra. Dia tsy homeny antsika koa ve ny zavatra hafa rehetra ankoatra an’io Zanany io, noho Izy tsara fanahy?', 'ny zanany aza tsy narovany fa nomeny mba hamonjena antsika rehetra. dia tsy homeny antsika koa ve ny zavatra hafa rehetra ankoatra an’io zanany io, noho izy tsara fanahy?'),
  ('6ab25c9a7e48e043a752011f', '2026-09-22T10:46:50.947Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:50.947Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 8, 29, 'Efa hatramin’ny voalohany izy no nahafantatra an’izay hofidiny. Dia notendreny mialoha hanahaka an’ilay Zanany izy ireo, amin’izay io Zanany io no lasa lahimatoa amin’ny rahalahy maro.', 'efa hatramin’ny voalohany izy no nahafantatra an’izay hofidiny. dia notendreny mialoha hanahaka an’ilay zanany izy ireo, amin’izay io zanany io no lasa lahimatoa amin’ny rahalahy maro.'),
  ('6ab25c9a7e48e043a7520107', '2026-09-22T10:46:50.947Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:50.947Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 8, 5, 'Fa ny olona manatanteraka ny fanirian’ny nofo dia mampifantoka ny sainy amin’ny zavatry ny nofo, fa ny olona manaiky hotarihin’ny fanahy kosa mampifantoka ny sainy amin’ny zavatry ny fanahy.', 'fa ny olona manatanteraka ny fanirian’ny nofo dia mampifantoka ny sainy amin’ny zavatry ny nofo, fa ny olona manaiky hotarihin’ny fanahy kosa mampifantoka ny sainy amin’ny zavatry ny fanahy.'),
  ('6ab25c9a7e48e043a752011b', '2026-09-22T10:46:50.947Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:50.947Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 8, 25, 'Fa raha zavatra mbola tsy hitantsika no antenaintsika, dia miandry mafy an’ilay izy foana isika sady miaritra.', 'fa raha zavatra mbola tsy hitantsika no antenaintsika, dia miandry mafy an’ilay izy foana isika sady miaritra.'),
  ('6ab25c9a7e48e043a7520117', '2026-09-22T10:46:50.947Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:50.947Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 8, 21, 'Hafahana koa ny zavaboary ka tsy ho andevon’ny fahalòvana intsony, fa hahazo an’ilay fahafahana miavaka ananan’ny zanak’Andriamanitra.', 'hafahana koa ny zavaboary ka tsy ho andevon’ny fahalòvana intsony, fa hahazo an’ilay fahafahana miavaka ananan’ny zanak’andriamanitra.'),
  ('6ab25c9a7e48e043a752010b', '2026-09-22T10:46:50.947Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:50.947Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 8, 9, 'Tsy manatanteraka ny fanirian’ny nofo anefa ianareo, fa manaiky hiasan’ny fanahy, raha tena ao anatinareo ny fanahin’Andriamanitra. Fa raha misy tsy manana ny fanahin’i Kristy, dia tsy an’i Kristy izy.', 'tsy manatanteraka ny fanirian’ny nofo anefa ianareo, fa manaiky hiasan’ny fanahy, raha tena ao anatinareo ny fanahin’andriamanitra. fa raha misy tsy manana ny fanahin’i kristy, dia tsy an’i kristy izy.'),
  ('6ab25c9a7e48e043a7520128', '2026-09-22T10:46:50.947Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:50.947Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 8, 38, 'Fa matoky aho fa na fahafatesana, na fiainana, na anjely, na fanjakana, na zavatra amin’izao fotoana izao, na zavatra ho avy, na hery,', 'fa matoky aho fa na fahafatesana, na fiainana, na anjely, na fanjakana, na zavatra amin’izao fotoana izao, na zavatra ho avy, na hery,'),
  ('6ab25c9a7e48e043a752011c', '2026-09-22T10:46:50.947Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:50.947Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 8, 26, 'Hoatr’izany koa fa manampy antsika ny fanahy, rehefa malemy isika. Izao mantsy no olana: Mila mivavaka isika saingy tsy haintsika hoe inona no tokony hangatahina. Ny fanahy mihitsy anefa no miangavy ho antsika rehefa mitaraindraina ao am-pontsika ao isika.', 'hoatr’izany koa fa manampy antsika ny fanahy, rehefa malemy isika. izao mantsy no olana: mila mivavaka isika saingy tsy haintsika hoe inona no tokony hangatahina. ny fanahy mihitsy anefa no miangavy ho antsika rehefa mitaraindraina ao am-pontsika ao isika.'),
  ('6ab25c9a7e48e043a752010a', '2026-09-22T10:46:50.947Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:50.947Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 8, 8, 'Tsy mahavita mampifaly an’Andriamanitra àry ny olona manatanteraka ny fanirian’ny nofo.', 'tsy mahavita mampifaly an’andriamanitra àry ny olona manatanteraka ny fanirian’ny nofo.'),
  ('6ab25c9a7e48e043a7520109', '2026-09-22T10:46:50.947Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:50.947Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 8, 7, 'Fahavalon’Andriamanitra mantsy izay mampifantoka ny sainy amin’ny nofo. Fa sady tsy mankatò ny lalàn’Andriamanitra ny nofo, no tsy mahavita an’izany koa.', 'fahavalon’andriamanitra mantsy izay mampifantoka ny sainy amin’ny nofo. fa sady tsy mankatò ny lalàn’andriamanitra ny nofo, no tsy mahavita an’izany koa.');
INSERT INTO "bible_verses" ("id", "created_date", "updated_date", "created_by_id", "created_by", "translation", "book", "bookOrder", "chapter", "verse", "text", "normalizedText") VALUES
  ('6ab25c9a7e48e043a7520129', '2026-09-22T10:46:50.947Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:50.947Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 8, 39, 'na ny ambony, na ny ambany, na zavaboary hafa, dia tsy hisy hahavita hampisaraka antsika amin’Andriamanitra ka hahatonga azy tsy ho tia antsika intsony. Asehony amin’ny alalan’i Kristy Jesosy Tompontsika izany fitiavany izany.', 'na ny ambony, na ny ambany, na zavaboary hafa, dia tsy hisy hahavita hampisaraka antsika amin’andriamanitra ka hahatonga azy tsy ho tia antsika intsony. asehony amin’ny alalan’i kristy jesosy tompontsika izany fitiavany izany.'),
  ('6ab25c9a7e48e043a752011e', '2026-09-22T10:46:50.947Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:50.947Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 8, 28, 'Fantatsika fa ny zava-drehetra ataon’Andriamanitra dia ataony miara-miasa mba hahasoa an’izay tia azy, izany hoe izay nantsoiny mifanaraka amin’ny fikasany.', 'fantatsika fa ny zava-drehetra ataon’andriamanitra dia ataony miara-miasa mba hahasoa an’izay tia azy, izany hoe izay nantsoiny mifanaraka amin’ny fikasany.'),
  ('6ab25c9a7e48e043a752011d', '2026-09-22T10:46:50.947Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:50.947Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 8, 27, 'Fa fantatr’ilay mpandinika ny fo izay tian’ny fanahy holazaina, satria mifanaraka amin’ny sitrapon’Andriamanitra ilay fiangaviany ho an’ny olona masina.', 'fa fantatr’ilay mpandinika ny fo izay tian’ny fanahy holazaina, satria mifanaraka amin’ny sitrapon’andriamanitra ilay fiangaviany ho an’ny olona masina.'),
  ('6ab25c9a7e48e043a7520115', '2026-09-22T10:46:50.947Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:50.947Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 8, 19, 'Efa tena tsy andrin’ny zavaboary mantsy izay hampiharihariana ny zanak’Andriamanitra.', 'efa tena tsy andrin’ny zavaboary mantsy izay hampiharihariana ny zanak’andriamanitra.'),
  ('6ab25c9a7e48e043a7520114', '2026-09-22T10:46:50.947Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:50.947Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 8, 18, 'Fa amiko dia tsy misy dikany ny fijaliana iaretantsika amin’izao fotoana izao, raha oharina amin’ilay voninahitra efa haharihary amin’ny alalantsika.', 'fa amiko dia tsy misy dikany ny fijaliana iaretantsika amin’izao fotoana izao, raha oharina amin’ilay voninahitra efa haharihary amin’ny alalantsika.'),
  ('6ab25c9a7e48e043a7520112', '2026-09-22T10:46:50.947Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:50.947Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 8, 16, 'Ny fanahin’Andriamanitra sy ny saintsika no miara-manaporofo fa zanak’Andriamanitra isika.', 'ny fanahin’andriamanitra sy ny saintsika no miara-manaporofo fa zanak’andriamanitra isika.'),
  ('6ab25c9a7e48e043a7520106', '2026-09-22T10:46:50.947Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:50.947Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 8, 4, 'Dia ho afaka hanao an’izay zavatra tsara takin’ny Lalàna isika amin’izay, ka tsy hanatanteraka ny fanirian’ny nofo, fa hanaiky hotarihin’ny fanahy.', 'dia ho afaka hanao an’izay zavatra tsara takin’ny lalàna isika amin’izay, ka tsy hanatanteraka ny fanirian’ny nofo, fa hanaiky hotarihin’ny fanahy.'),
  ('6ab25c9a7e48e043a7520127', '2026-09-22T10:46:50.947Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:50.947Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 8, 37, 'Mivoaka ho mpandresy tanteraka anefa isika amin’izany rehetra izany, satria manampy antsika ilay tia antsika.', 'mivoaka ho mpandresy tanteraka anefa isika amin’izany rehetra izany, satria manampy antsika ilay tia antsika.'),
  ('6ab25c9a7e48e043a752010e', '2026-09-22T10:46:50.947Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:50.947Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 8, 12, 'Tsy tokony havelantsika hifehy antsika àry ny fanirian’ny nofo, ry rahalahy, ary tsy tokony hotanterahintsika.', 'tsy tokony havelantsika hifehy antsika àry ny fanirian’ny nofo, ry rahalahy, ary tsy tokony hotanterahintsika.'),
  ('6ab25c9a7e48e043a752010c', '2026-09-22T10:46:50.947Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:50.947Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 8, 10, 'Raha tafaray amin’i Kristy ianareo, na dia maty aza ny vatanareo satria mpanota, dia ny fanahy no hanome fiainana anareo satria olo-marina ianareo.', 'raha tafaray amin’i kristy ianareo, na dia maty aza ny vatanareo satria mpanota, dia ny fanahy no hanome fiainana anareo satria olo-marina ianareo.'),
  ('6ab25c9a7e48e043a7520124', '2026-09-22T10:46:50.947Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:50.947Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 8, 34, 'Iza àry no hanameloka azy ireo? Tsy misy, satria i Kristy Jesosy ilay efa maty sady izy koa ilay efa natsangana tamin’ny maty sy eo ankavanan’Andriamanitra, ary ilay miangavy ho antsika.', 'iza àry no hanameloka azy ireo? tsy misy, satria i kristy jesosy ilay efa maty sady izy koa ilay efa natsangana tamin’ny maty sy eo ankavanan’andriamanitra, ary ilay miangavy ho antsika.'),
  ('6ab25c9a7e48e043a7520120', '2026-09-22T10:46:50.947Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:50.947Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 8, 30, 'Ankoatra izany, dia izay efa notendreny mialoha no nantsoiny, ary izay nantsoiny no nambarany hoe marina. Izay nambarany hoe marina kosa no nomeny voninahitra.', 'ankoatra izany, dia izay efa notendreny mialoha no nantsoiny, ary izay nantsoiny no nambarany hoe marina. izay nambarany hoe marina kosa no nomeny voninahitra.'),
  ('6ab25c9a7e48e043a752010f', '2026-09-22T10:46:50.947Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:50.947Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 8, 13, 'Tsy maintsy ho faty mantsy ianareo raha manatanteraka ny fanirian’ny nofo. Fa ho velona kosa ianareo raha vonoinareo amin’ny alalan’ny fanahy masina ny fanao ratsin’ny nofo.', 'tsy maintsy ho faty mantsy ianareo raha manatanteraka ny fanirian’ny nofo. fa ho velona kosa ianareo raha vonoinareo amin’ny alalan’ny fanahy masina ny fanao ratsin’ny nofo.'),
  ('6ab25c9a7e48e043a752010d', '2026-09-22T10:46:50.947Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:50.947Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 8, 11, 'Raha ao anatinareo ny fanahin’ilay nanangana an’i Jesosy tamin’ny maty, dia hamelona ny vatanareo mety maty koa ilay nanangana an’i Kristy Jesosy tamin’ny maty. Amin’ny alalan’ilay fanahiny ao anatinareo no hanaovany an’izany.', 'raha ao anatinareo ny fanahin’ilay nanangana an’i jesosy tamin’ny maty, dia hamelona ny vatanareo mety maty koa ilay nanangana an’i kristy jesosy tamin’ny maty. amin’ny alalan’ilay fanahiny ao anatinareo no hanaovany an’izany.'),
  ('6ab25c9bff4387290cf6b7f1', '2026-09-22T10:46:51.475Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:51.475Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 9, 31, 'Ny Israely kosa, na dia niezaka nanaraka ny lalàn’ny fahamarinana aza, dia tsy nahavita nankatò an’izany lalàna izany.', 'ny israely kosa, na dia niezaka nanaraka ny lalàn’ny fahamarinana aza, dia tsy nahavita nankatò an’izany lalàna izany.'),
  ('6ab25c9bff4387290cf6b7d8', '2026-09-22T10:46:51.475Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:51.475Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 9, 6, 'Tsy hoe tsy tanteraka anefa ny tenin’Andriamanitra. Fa tsy izay rehetra taranak’Israely no tena “Israely.”', 'tsy hoe tsy tanteraka anefa ny tenin’andriamanitra. fa tsy izay rehetra taranak’israely no tena “israely.”'),
  ('6ab25c9bff4387290cf6b7d9', '2026-09-22T10:46:51.475Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:51.475Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 9, 7, 'Ary tsy hoe zanaka daholo izy ireo satria hoe taranak’i Abrahama. Voasoratra anefa hoe: “Ho avy amin’i Isaka ilay hantsoina hoe taranakao.”', 'ary tsy hoe zanaka daholo izy ireo satria hoe taranak’i abrahama. voasoratra anefa hoe: “ho avy amin’i isaka ilay hantsoina hoe taranakao.”'),
  ('6ab25c9bff4387290cf6b7e9', '2026-09-22T10:46:51.475Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:51.475Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 9, 23, 'Ahoana raha nanao an’izany izy satria te hampahafantatra ny voninahiny lehibe amin’ny kaopin’ny famindram-po, izay nomaniny mialoha mba homena voninahitra,', 'ahoana raha nanao an’izany izy satria te hampahafantatra ny voninahiny lehibe amin’ny kaopin’ny famindram-po, izay nomaniny mialoha mba homena voninahitra,'),
  ('6ab25c9bff4387290cf6b7dd', '2026-09-22T10:46:51.475Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:51.475Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 9, 11, 'Fa tamin’ny mbola tsy teraka ireo kambana ireo ary mbola tsy nanao izay tsara na ratsy, dia efa nilaza mialoha Andriamanitra hoe iza no hofidiny. Izay tiany mantsy no fidiny, fa tsy hoe miankina amin’izay ataon’ny olona.', 'fa tamin’ny mbola tsy teraka ireo kambana ireo ary mbola tsy nanao izay tsara na ratsy, dia efa nilaza mialoha andriamanitra hoe iza no hofidiny. izay tiany mantsy no fidiny, fa tsy hoe miankina amin’izay ataon’ny olona.'),
  ('6ab25c9bff4387290cf6b7e0', '2026-09-22T10:46:51.475Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:51.475Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 9, 14, 'Inona àry no holazaintsika? Manao ny tsy rariny ve Andriamanitra? Sanatria izany!', 'inona àry no holazaintsika? manao ny tsy rariny ve andriamanitra? sanatria izany!'),
  ('6ab25c9bff4387290cf6b7d7', '2026-09-22T10:46:51.475Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:51.475Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 9, 5, 'Izy ireo koa no taranak’ireo razambe nipoiran’i Kristy, raha araka ny nofo. Hoderaina mandrakizay anie Andriamanitra, izay ambonin’ny rehetra! Amena.', 'izy ireo koa no taranak’ireo razambe nipoiran’i kristy, raha araka ny nofo. hoderaina mandrakizay anie andriamanitra, izay ambonin’ny rehetra! amena.'),
  ('6ab25c9bff4387290cf6b7f3', '2026-09-22T10:46:51.475Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:51.475Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 9, 33, 'araka ny voasoratra hoe: “Mametraka vato mahatafintohina sy vatolampy mampianjera ao Ziona aho, nefa tsy ho diso fanantenana izay mino azy io.”', 'araka ny voasoratra hoe: “mametraka vato mahatafintohina sy vatolampy mampianjera ao ziona aho, nefa tsy ho diso fanantenana izay mino azy io.”'),
  ('6ab25c9bff4387290cf6b7da', '2026-09-22T10:46:51.475Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:51.475Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 9, 8, 'Izany hoe, tsy ny zanaka araka ny nofo no tena zanak’Andriamanitra, fa ny zanaky ny fampanantenana no ekena hoe taranaka.', 'izany hoe, tsy ny zanaka araka ny nofo no tena zanak’andriamanitra, fa ny zanaky ny fampanantenana no ekena hoe taranaka.'),
  ('6ab25c9bff4387290cf6b7e3', '2026-09-22T10:46:51.475Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:51.475Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 9, 17, 'Fa hoy ny Soratra Masina momba an’i Farao: “Izao no tena antony namelako anao ho velona: Mba hampisehoana aminao ny heriko sy mba hanambarana ny anarako eran-tany.”', 'fa hoy ny soratra masina momba an’i farao: “izao no tena antony namelako anao ho velona: mba hampisehoana aminao ny heriko sy mba hanambarana ny anarako eran-tany.”'),
  ('6ab25c9bff4387290cf6b7ee', '2026-09-22T10:46:51.475Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:51.475Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 9, 28, 'Fa hanao ampamoaka an’izay velona eto an-tany i Jehovah, ka hamita tanteraka an’izany haingana.”', 'fa hanao ampamoaka an’izay velona eto an-tany i jehovah, ka hamita tanteraka an’izany haingana.”'),
  ('6ab25c9bff4387290cf6b7e1', '2026-09-22T10:46:51.475Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:51.475Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 9, 15, 'Hoy mantsy izy tamin’i Mosesy: “Hamindra fo amin’izay tiako hamindrana fo aho, ary hangoraka an’izay tiako hangorahana.”', 'hoy mantsy izy tamin’i mosesy: “hamindra fo amin’izay tiako hamindrana fo aho, ary hangoraka an’izay tiako hangorahana.”'),
  ('6ab25c9bff4387290cf6b7d3', '2026-09-22T10:46:51.475Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:51.475Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 9, 1, 'Milaza ny marina aho satria mpanara-dia an’i Kristy. Tsy mandainga aho, ary tarihin’ny fanahy masina ny feon’ny fieritreretako ka vavolombelona manamarina', 'milaza ny marina aho satria mpanara-dia an’i kristy. tsy mandainga aho, ary tarihin’ny fanahy masina ny feon’ny fieritreretako ka vavolombelona manamarina'),
  ('6ab25c9bff4387290cf6b7f2', '2026-09-22T10:46:51.475Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:51.475Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 9, 32, 'Fa nahoana? Satria rehefa niezaka ny ho lasa olo-marina izy ireo, dia nihevitra hoe ny zavatra ataony no mahatonga azy ho olo-marina, fa tsy ny finoana. Tafintohina izy ireo noho ilay “vato mahatafintohina”,', 'fa nahoana? satria rehefa niezaka ny ho lasa olo-marina izy ireo, dia nihevitra hoe ny zavatra ataony no mahatonga azy ho olo-marina, fa tsy ny finoana. tafintohina izy ireo noho ilay “vato mahatafintohina”,'),
  ('6ab25c9bff4387290cf6b7e7', '2026-09-22T10:46:51.475Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:51.475Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 9, 21, 'Angaha ny mpanefy tanimanga tsy manana fahefana amin’ny tanimanga, ka vongan-tanimanga iray ihany no anaovany kaopy fampiasa rehefa misy fanasana sy kaopy fampiasa andavanandro?', 'angaha ny mpanefy tanimanga tsy manana fahefana amin’ny tanimanga, ka vongan-tanimanga iray ihany no anaovany kaopy fampiasa rehefa misy fanasana sy kaopy fampiasa andavanandro?'),
  ('6ab25c9bff4387290cf6b7d5', '2026-09-22T10:46:51.475Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:51.475Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 9, 3, 'Fa naleoko aza hoe izaho mihitsy no tafasaraka amin’i Kristy ka ho voaozona, raha izany no hahasoa ny rahalahiko, izay havako araka ny nofo,', 'fa naleoko aza hoe izaho mihitsy no tafasaraka amin’i kristy ka ho voaozona, raha izany no hahasoa ny rahalahiko, izay havako araka ny nofo,'),
  ('6ab25c9bff4387290cf6b7ed', '2026-09-22T10:46:51.475Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:51.475Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 9, 27, 'Tsy izay ihany fa niantsoantso hoatr’izao momba ny Israely i Isaia: “Na betsaka hoatran’ny fasika any an-dranomasina aza ny zanak’Israely, dia ny sisa amin’izy ireo ihany no hovonjena.', 'tsy izay ihany fa niantsoantso hoatr’izao momba ny israely i isaia: “na betsaka hoatran’ny fasika any an-dranomasina aza ny zanak’israely, dia ny sisa amin’izy ireo ihany no hovonjena.'),
  ('6ab25c9bff4387290cf6b7ea', '2026-09-22T10:46:51.475Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:51.475Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 9, 24, 'izany hoe isika izay nantsoiny, tsy avy tamin’ny Jiosy ihany, fa avy tamin’ny firenen-kafa koa?', 'izany hoe isika izay nantsoiny, tsy avy tamin’ny jiosy ihany, fa avy tamin’ny firenen-kafa koa?'),
  ('6ab25c9bff4387290cf6b7df', '2026-09-22T10:46:51.475Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:51.475Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 9, 13, 'araka ny voasoratra hoe: “I Jakoba no tiako, fa i Esao kosa halako.”', 'araka ny voasoratra hoe: “i jakoba no tiako, fa i esao kosa halako.”'),
  ('6ab25c9bff4387290cf6b7ef', '2026-09-22T10:46:51.475Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:51.475Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 9, 29, 'Izao koa no nolazain’i Isaia mialoha: “Raha tsy i Jehovah Tompon’ny tafika no namela taranaka ho antsika, dia ho efa lasa hoatran’i Sodoma isika, ary ho efa lasa hoatran’i Gomora.”', 'izao koa no nolazain’i isaia mialoha: “raha tsy i jehovah tompon’ny tafika no namela taranaka ho antsika, dia ho efa lasa hoatran’i sodoma isika, ary ho efa lasa hoatran’i gomora.”'),
  ('6ab25c9bff4387290cf6b7ec', '2026-09-22T10:46:51.475Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:51.475Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 9, 26, 'Ary any amin’ilay toerana nilazako tamin’izy ireo hoe: ‘Tsy vahoakako ianareo’, no hilazako aminy hoe: ‘Zanak’ilay Andriamanitra velona ianareo.’”', 'ary any amin’ilay toerana nilazako tamin’izy ireo hoe: ‘tsy vahoakako ianareo’, no hilazako aminy hoe: ‘zanak’ilay andriamanitra velona ianareo.’”'),
  ('6ab25c9bff4387290cf6b7de', '2026-09-22T10:46:51.475Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:51.475Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 9, 12, 'Dia nolazaina tamin’i Rebeka tamin’izay, hoe: “Ny zokiny hanompo ny zandriny”,', 'dia nolazaina tamin’i rebeka tamin’izay, hoe: “ny zokiny hanompo ny zandriny”,'),
  ('6ab25c9bff4387290cf6b7eb', '2026-09-22T10:46:51.475Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:51.475Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 9, 25, 'Izany koa no nolazainy ao amin’ny bokin’i Hosea hoe: “Izay tsy vahoakako no hantsoiko hoe ‘vahoakako’, ary ilay tsy tiana no hantsoiko hoe ‘malala.’', 'izany koa no nolazainy ao amin’ny bokin’i hosea hoe: “izay tsy vahoakako no hantsoiko hoe ‘vahoakako’, ary ilay tsy tiana no hantsoiko hoe ‘malala.’'),
  ('6ab25c9bff4387290cf6b7e2', '2026-09-22T10:46:51.475Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:51.475Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 9, 16, 'Tsy miankina amin’izay irin’ny olona sy ny ezaka ataony àry izany, fa miankina amin’Andriamanitra, izay mamindra fo.', 'tsy miankina amin’izay irin’ny olona sy ny ezaka ataony àry izany, fa miankina amin’andriamanitra, izay mamindra fo.'),
  ('6ab25c9bff4387290cf6b7f0', '2026-09-22T10:46:51.475Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:51.475Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 9, 30, 'Inona àry no holazaintsika? Na dia tsy niezaka ny ho lasa olo-marina aza ny hafa firenena, dia lasa olo-marina ihany, izany hoe lasa olo-marina noho ny finoana.', 'inona àry no holazaintsika? na dia tsy niezaka ny ho lasa olo-marina aza ny hafa firenena, dia lasa olo-marina ihany, izany hoe lasa olo-marina noho ny finoana.'),
  ('6ab25c9bff4387290cf6b7e6', '2026-09-22T10:46:51.475Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:51.475Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 9, 20, 'Fa ianao moa no iza no hamalivaly an’Andriamanitra? Ny zavatra novolavolaina ve no hiteny amin’ilay namolavola azy hoe: “Fa maninona aho no nataonao hoatr’izao?”', 'fa ianao moa no iza no hamalivaly an’andriamanitra? ny zavatra novolavolaina ve no hiteny amin’ilay namolavola azy hoe: “fa maninona aho no nataonao hoatr’izao?”'),
  ('6ab25c9bff4387290cf6b7e4', '2026-09-22T10:46:51.475Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:51.475Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 9, 18, 'Izay tiany hamindrana fo àry no amindrany fo, fa avelany ho mafy loha kosa izay tiany ho mafy loha.', 'izay tiany hamindrana fo àry no amindrany fo, fa avelany ho mafy loha kosa izay tiany ho mafy loha.'),
  ('6ab25c9bff4387290cf6b7dc', '2026-09-22T10:46:51.475Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:51.475Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 9, 10, 'Tsy tamin’izay ihany anefa Andriamanitra no nampanantena, fa nanao an’izany koa izy tamin’i Rebeka niteraka kambana tamin’ny lehilahy iray, izay tsy iza fa i Isaka razambentsika.', 'tsy tamin’izay ihany anefa andriamanitra no nampanantena, fa nanao an’izany koa izy tamin’i rebeka niteraka kambana tamin’ny lehilahy iray, izay tsy iza fa i isaka razambentsika.'),
  ('6ab25c9bff4387290cf6b7e8', '2026-09-22T10:46:51.475Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:51.475Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 9, 22, 'Dia ahoana àry raha te hanampatra ny hatezerany sy hampahafantatra ny heriny Andriamanitra, nefa nandefitra sady nanam-paharetana be tamin’ny kaopin’ny fahatezerana izay mendrika haringana?', 'dia ahoana àry raha te hanampatra ny hatezerany sy hampahafantatra ny heriny andriamanitra, nefa nandefitra sady nanam-paharetana be tamin’ny kaopin’ny fahatezerana izay mendrika haringana?'),
  ('6ab25c9bff4387290cf6b7e5', '2026-09-22T10:46:51.475Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:51.475Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 9, 19, 'Hiteny amiko àry ianao hoe: “Dia maninona izy no mbola manome tsiny ihany? Fa iza no mahavita manohitra ny sitrapony?”', 'hiteny amiko àry ianao hoe: “dia maninona izy no mbola manome tsiny ihany? fa iza no mahavita manohitra ny sitrapony?”'),
  ('6ab25c9bff4387290cf6b7db', '2026-09-22T10:46:51.475Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:51.475Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 9, 9, 'Izao mantsy ilay fampanantenana: “Hiverina atỳ aminao aho, amin’ny herintaona hoatr’izao, ka hanan-janakalahy i Saraha.”', 'izao mantsy ilay fampanantenana: “hiverina atỳ aminao aho, amin’ny herintaona hoatr’izao, ka hanan-janakalahy i saraha.”'),
  ('6ab25c9bff4387290cf6b7d6', '2026-09-22T10:46:51.475Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:51.475Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 9, 4, 'dia ny Israelita. Izy ireo no natsangana ho zanaka, nomena voninahitra, nanaovana ny fifanekena, ary nomena ny Lalàna sy ny fanompoana masina ary ny fampanantenana.', 'dia ny israelita. izy ireo no natsangana ho zanaka, nomena voninahitra, nanaovana ny fifanekena, ary nomena ny lalàna sy ny fanompoana masina ary ny fampanantenana.'),
  ('6ab25c9bff4387290cf6b7d4', '2026-09-22T10:46:51.475Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:51.475Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 9, 2, 'fa malahelo be aho sady mitebiteby foana ato am-poko ato.', 'fa malahelo be aho sady mitebiteby foana ato am-poko ato.'),
  ('6ab25c9bb9435b67b7bfe854', '2026-09-22T10:46:51.928Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:51.928Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 10, 14, 'Hataon’izy ireo ahoana anefa ny hiantso ny anarany raha izy aza tsy inoany? Ary hataony ahoana ny hino an’izay olona mbola tsy henony? Ary hataony ahoana ny haheno, raha tsy misy mitory aminy?', 'hataon’izy ireo ahoana anefa ny hiantso ny anarany raha izy aza tsy inoany? ary hataony ahoana ny hino an’izay olona mbola tsy henony? ary hataony ahoana ny haheno, raha tsy misy mitory aminy?'),
  ('6ab25c9bb9435b67b7bfe84b', '2026-09-22T10:46:51.928Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:51.928Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 10, 5, 'Izao mantsy no nosoratan’i Mosesy momba ny atao hoe olo-marina raha araka ny Lalàna: “Izay olona mankatò an’ireny no ho velona amin’ny alalan’ireny.”', 'izao mantsy no nosoratan’i mosesy momba ny atao hoe olo-marina raha araka ny lalàna: “izay olona mankatò an’ireny no ho velona amin’ny alalan’ireny.”'),
  ('6ab25c9bb9435b67b7bfe859', '2026-09-22T10:46:51.928Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:51.928Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 10, 19, 'Hoy anefa aho: Sao dia tsy nahafantatra ny Israely? Voalohany, dia hoy i Mosesy: “Hataoko izay hahatonga anareo hialona an’izay tsy firenena akory, ary hataoko izay hampahatezitra be anareo amin’ny firenena adaladala.”', 'hoy anefa aho: sao dia tsy nahafantatra ny israely? voalohany, dia hoy i mosesy: “hataoko izay hahatonga anareo hialona an’izay tsy firenena akory, ary hataoko izay hampahatezitra be anareo amin’ny firenena adaladala.”'),
  ('6ab25c9bb9435b67b7bfe84c', '2026-09-22T10:46:51.928Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:51.928Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 10, 6, 'Izao kosa no voalaza momba ny olo-marina noho ny finoana: “Aza miteny anakampo hoe: ‘Iza no hiakatra any an-danitra?’, izany hoe mba hampidina an’i Kristy,', 'izao kosa no voalaza momba ny olo-marina noho ny finoana: “aza miteny anakampo hoe: ‘iza no hiakatra any an-danitra?’, izany hoe mba hampidina an’i kristy,'),
  ('6ab25c9bb9435b67b7bfe847', '2026-09-22T10:46:51.928Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:51.928Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 10, 1, 'Ry rahalahy, ny tena irin’ny foko sady italahoako amin’Andriamanitra dia ny mba hahavoavonjy azy ireo.', 'ry rahalahy, ny tena irin’ny foko sady italahoako amin’andriamanitra dia ny mba hahavoavonjy azy ireo.'),
  ('6ab25c9bb9435b67b7bfe85a', '2026-09-22T10:46:51.928Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:51.928Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 10, 20, 'Ary tena sahy i Isaia nilaza hoe: “Hitan’izay tsy nitady ahy aho, ary lasa fantatr’izay tsy niantso ahy.”', 'ary tena sahy i isaia nilaza hoe: “hitan’izay tsy nitady ahy aho, ary lasa fantatr’izay tsy niantso ahy.”'),
  ('6ab25c9bb9435b67b7bfe85b', '2026-09-22T10:46:51.928Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:51.928Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 10, 21, 'Hoy kosa izy momba ny Israely: “Tontolo andro no namelarako ny tanako tamin’ny vahoaka tsy mankatò sady mafy loha.”', 'hoy kosa izy momba ny israely: “tontolo andro no namelarako ny tanako tamin’ny vahoaka tsy mankatò sady mafy loha.”'),
  ('6ab25c9bb9435b67b7bfe84a', '2026-09-22T10:46:51.928Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:51.928Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 10, 4, 'Fa i Kristy no faran’ny Lalàna, mba hambara hoe olo-marina izay rehetra maneho finoana.', 'fa i kristy no faran’ny lalàna, mba hambara hoe olo-marina izay rehetra maneho finoana.'),
  ('6ab25c9bb9435b67b7bfe856', '2026-09-22T10:46:51.928Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:51.928Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 10, 16, 'Na izany aza, dia tsy izy rehetra no nanaiky ny vaovao tsara. Hoy mantsy i Isaia: “Jehovah ô, iza no mba nino ny zavatra henony taminay?”', 'na izany aza, dia tsy izy rehetra no nanaiky ny vaovao tsara. hoy mantsy i isaia: “jehovah ô, iza no mba nino ny zavatra henony taminay?”'),
  ('6ab25c9bb9435b67b7bfe851', '2026-09-22T10:46:51.928Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:51.928Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 10, 11, 'Hoy mantsy ny Soratra Masina: “Tsy hisy ho diso fanantenana izay mino azy.”', 'hoy mantsy ny soratra masina: “tsy hisy ho diso fanantenana izay mino azy.”'),
  ('6ab25c9bb9435b67b7bfe855', '2026-09-22T10:46:51.928Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:51.928Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 10, 15, 'Ary hataony ahoana ny hitory raha tsy nirahina? Araka ny voasoratra hoe: “Tsara tarehy erỳ ny tongotr’izay mitory ny vaovao tsara!”', 'ary hataony ahoana ny hitory raha tsy nirahina? araka ny voasoratra hoe: “tsara tarehy erỳ ny tongotr’izay mitory ny vaovao tsara!”'),
  ('6ab25c9bb9435b67b7bfe84f', '2026-09-22T10:46:51.928Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:51.928Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 10, 9, 'Fa raha milaza eo imason’olona ianao hoe i Jesosy no Tompo, ary mino ao am-ponao fa Andriamanitra efa nanangana azy tamin’ny maty, dia hovonjena ianao.', 'fa raha milaza eo imason’olona ianao hoe i jesosy no tompo, ary mino ao am-ponao fa andriamanitra efa nanangana azy tamin’ny maty, dia hovonjena ianao.'),
  ('6ab25c9bb9435b67b7bfe857', '2026-09-22T10:46:51.928Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:51.928Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 10, 17, 'Ny finoana àry dia avy amin’ny zavatra re, ary izay re kosa dia avy amin’ny teny momba an’i Kristy.', 'ny finoana àry dia avy amin’ny zavatra re, ary izay re kosa dia avy amin’ny teny momba an’i kristy.'),
  ('6ab25c9bb9435b67b7bfe853', '2026-09-22T10:46:51.928Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:51.928Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 10, 13, 'Fa “izay rehetra miantso ny anaran’i Jehovah no hovonjena.”', 'fa “izay rehetra miantso ny anaran’i jehovah no hovonjena.”'),
  ('6ab25c9bb9435b67b7bfe852', '2026-09-22T10:46:51.928Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:51.928Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 10, 12, 'Fa tsy misy maha samy hafa ny Jiosy sy ny Grika. Iray ihany ilay Tompo ambonin’izy rehetra, sady manome be dia be ho an’izay rehetra miantso azy.', 'fa tsy misy maha samy hafa ny jiosy sy ny grika. iray ihany ilay tompo ambonin’izy rehetra, sady manome be dia be ho an’izay rehetra miantso azy.'),
  ('6ab25c9bb9435b67b7bfe84d', '2026-09-22T10:46:51.928Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:51.928Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 10, 7, 'na hoe: ‘Iza no hidina any amin’ny lavaka mangitsokitsoka?’, izany hoe mba hampiakatra an’i Kristy avy any amin’ny maty.”', 'na hoe: ‘iza no hidina any amin’ny lavaka mangitsokitsoka?’, izany hoe mba hampiakatra an’i kristy avy any amin’ny maty.”'),
  ('6ab25c9bb9435b67b7bfe858', '2026-09-22T10:46:51.928Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:51.928Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 10, 18, 'Hoy anefa aho: Sao dia tsy naheno izy ireo? Raha ny marina, dia “efa nivoaka eran-tany ny tenin’izy ireo, ary tonga hatrany amin’ny faran’ny tany misy mponina ny hafatra nentiny.”', 'hoy anefa aho: sao dia tsy naheno izy ireo? raha ny marina, dia “efa nivoaka eran-tany ny tenin’izy ireo, ary tonga hatrany amin’ny faran’ny tany misy mponina ny hafatra nentiny.”'),
  ('6ab25c9bb9435b67b7bfe850', '2026-09-22T10:46:51.928Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:51.928Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 10, 10, 'Izay maneho finoana vokatry ny fo mantsy no ho lasa olo-marina, ary izay miresaka amin’ny olona ny zavatra inoany no ho voavonjy.', 'izay maneho finoana vokatry ny fo mantsy no ho lasa olo-marina, ary izay miresaka amin’ny olona ny zavatra inoany no ho voavonjy.'),
  ('6ab25c9bb9435b67b7bfe84e', '2026-09-22T10:46:51.928Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:51.928Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 10, 8, 'Inona anefa no lazain’ny Soratra Masina? “Eo akaikinao, izany hoe eo am-bavanao sy ao am-ponao ny teny”, dia ny “tenin’ny” finoana izay torinay.', 'inona anefa no lazain’ny soratra masina? “eo akaikinao, izany hoe eo am-bavanao sy ao am-ponao ny teny”, dia ny “tenin’ny” finoana izay torinay.'),
  ('6ab25c9bb9435b67b7bfe848', '2026-09-22T10:46:51.928Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:51.928Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 10, 2, 'Fa mijoro ho vavolombelona aho hoe mafana fo ho an’Andriamanitra izy ireo, saingy tsy tena mahalala azy tsara.', 'fa mijoro ho vavolombelona aho hoe mafana fo ho an’andriamanitra izy ireo, saingy tsy tena mahalala azy tsara.'),
  ('6ab25c9bb9435b67b7bfe849', '2026-09-22T10:46:51.928Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:51.928Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 10, 3, 'Tsy nahalala an’izay marina eo imason’Andriamanitra izy, fa nanao ny tenany ho olo-marina, araka izay heveriny fa mety fotsiny. Tsy nanaiky an’izay marina eo imason’Andriamanitra àry izy.', 'tsy nahalala an’izay marina eo imason’andriamanitra izy, fa nanao ny tenany ho olo-marina, araka izay heveriny fa mety fotsiny. tsy nanaiky an’izay marina eo imason’andriamanitra àry izy.'),
  ('6ab25c9d9cb0a62359598ff2', '2026-09-22T10:46:53.600Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:53.600Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 11, 30, 'Fa tsy nankatò an’Andriamanitra ianareo taloha, nefa namindrana fo ankehitriny noho izy ireo tsy nankatò.', 'fa tsy nankatò an’andriamanitra ianareo taloha, nefa namindrana fo ankehitriny noho izy ireo tsy nankatò.'),
  ('6ab25c9d9cb0a62359598fe0', '2026-09-22T10:46:53.600Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:53.600Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 11, 12, 'Raha midika ho fitahiana ho an’izao tontolo izao àry ny fahadisoan’izy ireo, ary fitahiana ho an’ny hafa firenena ilay hoe nihena ny isan’izy ireo, tsy vao mainka ve hisy fitahiana bebe kokoa rehefa feno ny isan’izy ireo?', 'raha midika ho fitahiana ho an’izao tontolo izao àry ny fahadisoan’izy ireo, ary fitahiana ho an’ny hafa firenena ilay hoe nihena ny isan’izy ireo, tsy vao mainka ve hisy fitahiana bebe kokoa rehefa feno ny isan’izy ireo?'),
  ('6ab25c9d9cb0a62359598fdf', '2026-09-22T10:46:53.600Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:53.600Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 11, 11, 'Hoy àry aho: Sao tafintohina izy ireo ka tsy ho tafarina intsony? Sanatria izany! Ny fahadisoana nataon’izy ireo anefa no nahatonga ny hafa firenena hovonjena, dia lasa nialona izy ireo.', 'hoy àry aho: sao tafintohina izy ireo ka tsy ho tafarina intsony? sanatria izany! ny fahadisoana nataon’izy ireo anefa no nahatonga ny hafa firenena hovonjena, dia lasa nialona izy ireo.'),
  ('6ab25c9d9cb0a62359598fde', '2026-09-22T10:46:53.600Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:53.600Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 11, 10, 'Aoka ho jamba ny masony ka tsy hahita, ary ataovy mivokoka foana izy.”', 'aoka ho jamba ny masony ka tsy hahita, ary ataovy mivokoka foana izy.”'),
  ('6ab25c9d9cb0a62359598fdc', '2026-09-22T10:46:53.600Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:53.600Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 11, 8, 'araka ny voasoratra hoe: “Efa nataon’Andriamanitra renoky ny torimaso lalina izy ireo hatramin’izao, ary nomeny maso tsy mahita sy sofina tsy maheno.”', 'araka ny voasoratra hoe: “efa nataon’andriamanitra renoky ny torimaso lalina izy ireo hatramin’izao, ary nomeny maso tsy mahita sy sofina tsy maheno.”'),
  ('6ab25c9d9cb0a62359598fdb', '2026-09-22T10:46:53.600Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:53.600Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 11, 7, 'Ahoana àry? Tsy azon’ny Israely izay tena notadiaviny mafy, fa ireo voafidy no nahazo an’izany. Ny hafa kosa lasa tsy rototra,', 'ahoana àry? tsy azon’ny israely izay tena notadiaviny mafy, fa ireo voafidy no nahazo an’izany. ny hafa kosa lasa tsy rototra,'),
  ('6ab25c9d9cb0a62359598fed', '2026-09-22T10:46:53.600Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:53.600Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 11, 25, 'Fa tiako ho fantatrareo izao zava-miafina masina izao, ry rahalahy, mba tsy hihevi-tena ho hendry ianareo: Tsy rototra ny Israelita sasany, raha tsy efa feno ny isan’ny hafa firenena nampidirina,', 'fa tiako ho fantatrareo izao zava-miafina masina izao, ry rahalahy, mba tsy hihevi-tena ho hendry ianareo: tsy rototra ny israelita sasany, raha tsy efa feno ny isan’ny hafa firenena nampidirina,'),
  ('6ab25c9d9cb0a62359598fd8', '2026-09-22T10:46:53.600Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:53.600Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 11, 4, 'Inona anefa no nolazain’Andriamanitra taminy? “Misy olona 7 000 tsy nandohalika tamin’i Bala navelako ho ahy.”', 'inona anefa no nolazain’andriamanitra taminy? “misy olona 7 000 tsy nandohalika tamin’i bala navelako ho ahy.”'),
  ('6ab25c9d9cb0a62359598ff5', '2026-09-22T10:46:53.600Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:53.600Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 11, 33, 'Tsy misy fetrany ny harenan’Andriamanitra sy ny fahendreny ary ny fahalalany! Tena tsy takatry ny saina ny didim-pitsarany ary tsy hay fantarina ny zavatra ataony!', 'tsy misy fetrany ny harenan’andriamanitra sy ny fahendreny ary ny fahalalany! tena tsy takatry ny saina ny didim-pitsarany ary tsy hay fantarina ny zavatra ataony!'),
  ('6ab25c9d9cb0a62359598ff1', '2026-09-22T10:46:53.600Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:53.600Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 11, 29, 'Tsy hanenenan’Andriamanitra mantsy ny fanomezana sy ny fiantsoana nataony.', 'tsy hanenenan’andriamanitra mantsy ny fanomezana sy ny fiantsoana nataony.'),
  ('6ab25c9d9cb0a62359598fd7', '2026-09-22T10:46:53.600Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:53.600Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 11, 3, 'Hoy izy: “Jehovah ô, novonoin’izy ireo ho faty ny mpaminaninao, narodany ny alitaranao, dia izaho irery sisa, nefa mbola mitady hamono ahy koa ry zareo izao.”', 'hoy izy: “jehovah ô, novonoin’izy ireo ho faty ny mpaminaninao, narodany ny alitaranao, dia izaho irery sisa, nefa mbola mitady hamono ahy koa ry zareo izao.”'),
  ('6ab25c9d9cb0a62359598fd5', '2026-09-22T10:46:53.600Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:53.600Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 11, 1, 'Hoy àry aho: Nialan’Andriamanitra angaha ny vahoakany? Sanatria izany! Fa izaho koa mba Israelita, taranak’i Abrahama, ary avy amin’ny fokon’i Benjamina.', 'hoy àry aho: nialan’andriamanitra angaha ny vahoakany? sanatria izany! fa izaho koa mba israelita, taranak’i abrahama, ary avy amin’ny fokon’i benjamina.'),
  ('6ab25c9d9cb0a62359598ff3', '2026-09-22T10:46:53.600Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:53.600Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 11, 31, 'Dia hoatr’izany koa fa tsy nankatò izy ireo izao, ka amindrana fo ianareo, mba hamindrana fo koa izy ireo.', 'dia hoatr’izany koa fa tsy nankatò izy ireo izao, ka amindrana fo ianareo, mba hamindrana fo koa izy ireo.'),
  ('6ab25c9d9cb0a62359598ff0', '2026-09-22T10:46:53.600Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:53.600Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 11, 28, 'Marina fa fahavalon’Andriamanitra izy ireo satria tsy nanaiky ny vaovao tsara, ka nandray soa tamin’izany ianareo. Nisy nofidiny ho namany anefa izy ireo, noho ilay fampanantenana nataony tamin’ny razamben’izy ireo.', 'marina fa fahavalon’andriamanitra izy ireo satria tsy nanaiky ny vaovao tsara, ka nandray soa tamin’izany ianareo. nisy nofidiny ho namany anefa izy ireo, noho ilay fampanantenana nataony tamin’ny razamben’izy ireo.'),
  ('6ab25c9d9cb0a62359598fef', '2026-09-22T10:46:53.600Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:53.600Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 11, 27, 'Ary hanao fifanekena amin’izy ireo aho, rehefa avelako ny fahotany.”', 'ary hanao fifanekena amin’izy ireo aho, rehefa avelako ny fahotany.”'),
  ('6ab25c9d9cb0a62359598fe8', '2026-09-22T10:46:53.600Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:53.600Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 11, 20, 'Marina izany! Noho izy ireo tsy nino no nanapahana azy, fa noho ianao mino kosa no ahafahanao mijoro. Aza manambony tena àry fa mitandrema.', 'marina izany! noho izy ireo tsy nino no nanapahana azy, fa noho ianao mino kosa no ahafahanao mijoro. aza manambony tena àry fa mitandrema.'),
  ('6ab25c9d9cb0a62359598fdd', '2026-09-22T10:46:53.600Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:53.600Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 11, 9, 'Hoy koa i Davida: “Aoka ho lasa fandrika sy vela-pandrika sy vato mahatafintohina ary famaizana ho azy ireo ny latabany.', 'hoy koa i davida: “aoka ho lasa fandrika sy vela-pandrika sy vato mahatafintohina ary famaizana ho azy ireo ny latabany.'),
  ('6ab25c9d9cb0a62359598ff6', '2026-09-22T10:46:53.600Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:53.600Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 11, 34, 'Fa “iza no lasa nahafantatra ny ao an-tsain’i Jehovah, ary iza no lasa mpanoro hevitra azy?”', 'fa “iza no lasa nahafantatra ny ao an-tsain’i jehovah, ary iza no lasa mpanoro hevitra azy?”'),
  ('6ab25c9d9cb0a62359598fe1', '2026-09-22T10:46:53.600Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:53.600Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 11, 13, 'Ianareo hafa firenena indray izao no iresahako. Koa satria apostoly ho an’ny hafa firenena aho, dia omeko voninahitra ny fanompoako,', 'ianareo hafa firenena indray izao no iresahako. koa satria apostoly ho an’ny hafa firenena aho, dia omeko voninahitra ny fanompoako,'),
  ('6ab25c9d9cb0a62359598fe6', '2026-09-22T10:46:53.600Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:53.600Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 11, 18, 'dia aza mirehareha amin’ireo sampany efa tapaka. Raha mirehareha aminy ianao, dia tadidio fa tsy ianao no mitondra ny fakany, fa ny fakany no mitondra anao.', 'dia aza mirehareha amin’ireo sampany efa tapaka. raha mirehareha aminy ianao, dia tadidio fa tsy ianao no mitondra ny fakany, fa ny fakany no mitondra anao.'),
  ('6ab25c9d9cb0a62359598ff8', '2026-09-22T10:46:53.600Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:53.600Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 11, 36, 'Fa avy aminy ny zava-drehetra, ary izy no nampisy an’ireny sady ho azy daholo ireny. Ho azy anie ny voninahitra mandrakizay! Amena.', 'fa avy aminy ny zava-drehetra, ary izy no nampisy an’ireny sady ho azy daholo ireny. ho azy anie ny voninahitra mandrakizay! amena.'),
  ('6ab25c9d9cb0a62359598ff7', '2026-09-22T10:46:53.600Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:53.600Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 11, 35, 'Na, “iza no nanome azy aloha, ka tsy maintsy valiany koa avy eo?”', 'na, “iza no nanome azy aloha, ka tsy maintsy valiany koa avy eo?”'),
  ('6ab25c9d9cb0a62359598ff4', '2026-09-22T10:46:53.600Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:53.600Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 11, 32, 'Fa nataon’Andriamanitra hoatran’ny gadra daholo izy rehetra satria tsy nankatò, amin’izay izy hamindra fo amin’izy rehetra.', 'fa nataon’andriamanitra hoatran’ny gadra daholo izy rehetra satria tsy nankatò, amin’izay izy hamindra fo amin’izy rehetra.'),
  ('6ab25c9d9cb0a62359598fec', '2026-09-22T10:46:53.600Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:53.600Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 11, 24, 'Notapahina tamin’ny olivadia ianao ka natao grefy tamin’ilay oliva nambolena, na dia tsy izany aza no fanao. Koa raha ianao aza natao hoatr’izany, mainka fa ireo tena sampany ireo! Azony atao grefy amin’ilay oliva nisy azy indray izy ireo.', 'notapahina tamin’ny olivadia ianao ka natao grefy tamin’ilay oliva nambolena, na dia tsy izany aza no fanao. koa raha ianao aza natao hoatr’izany, mainka fa ireo tena sampany ireo! azony atao grefy amin’ilay oliva nisy azy indray izy ireo.'),
  ('6ab25c9d9cb0a62359598fea', '2026-09-22T10:46:53.600Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:53.600Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 11, 22, 'Jereo àry fa sady tsara fanahy Andriamanitra no hentitra. Hentitra izy amin’ny sampany tapaka, fa tsara fanahy aminao kosa, raha mbola miezaka ny ho mendrika ny hanehoany hatsaram-panahy ianao. Raha tsy izany, dia hokapaina koa ianao.', 'jereo àry fa sady tsara fanahy andriamanitra no hentitra. hentitra izy amin’ny sampany tapaka, fa tsara fanahy aminao kosa, raha mbola miezaka ny ho mendrika ny hanehoany hatsaram-panahy ianao. raha tsy izany, dia hokapaina koa ianao.'),
  ('6ab25c9d9cb0a62359598fe2', '2026-09-22T10:46:53.600Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:53.600Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 11, 14, 'sao mba hampialona ny fireneko izany, ka ho afaka hamonjy ny sasany aminy aho.', 'sao mba hampialona ny fireneko izany, ka ho afaka hamonjy ny sasany aminy aho.'),
  ('6ab25c9d9cb0a62359598fd9', '2026-09-22T10:46:53.600Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:53.600Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 11, 5, 'Hoatr’izany koa fa mbola misy sisa tavela ihany amin’izao, ary voafidy izy ireo noho ny hatsaram-panahy miavaka.', 'hoatr’izany koa fa mbola misy sisa tavela ihany amin’izao, ary voafidy izy ireo noho ny hatsaram-panahy miavaka.'),
  ('6ab25c9d9cb0a62359598fe5', '2026-09-22T10:46:53.600Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:53.600Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 11, 17, 'Izao anefa: Notapahina ny sampany sasany, ary ianao indray no natao grefy teo amin’ ny sampany sisa tavela, na dia olivadia aza ianao, ka mba nahazo tamin’ny ranon’ny fakan’ilay oliva koa. Raha izany àry,', 'izao anefa: notapahina ny sampany sasany, ary ianao indray no natao grefy teo amin’ ny sampany sisa tavela, na dia olivadia aza ianao, ka mba nahazo tamin’ny ranon’ny fakan’ilay oliva koa. raha izany àry,'),
  ('6ab25c9d9cb0a62359598fe3', '2026-09-22T10:46:53.600Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:53.600Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 11, 15, 'Narian’Andriamanitra izy ireo, ka lasa afaka mihavana amin’Andriamanitra izao tontolo izao. Raha raisin’Andriamanitra indray àry izy ireo, tsy midika ve izany hoe efa maty izy ireo fa velona indray?', 'narian’andriamanitra izy ireo, ka lasa afaka mihavana amin’andriamanitra izao tontolo izao. raha raisin’andriamanitra indray àry izy ireo, tsy midika ve izany hoe efa maty izy ireo fa velona indray?'),
  ('6ab25c9d9cb0a62359598fee', '2026-09-22T10:46:53.600Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:53.600Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 11, 26, 'ary izany no fomba hamonjena ny Israely rehetra, araka ny voasoratra hoe: “Hivoaka avy ao Ziona ny mpanafaka ka hampiala an’i Jakoba amin’ny zava-dratsy fanaony.', 'ary izany no fomba hamonjena ny israely rehetra, araka ny voasoratra hoe: “hivoaka avy ao ziona ny mpanafaka ka hampiala an’i jakoba amin’ny zava-dratsy fanaony.'),
  ('6ab25c9d9cb0a62359598fd6', '2026-09-22T10:46:53.600Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:53.600Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 11, 2, 'Tsy hoe nialan’Andriamanitra ny vahoakany, izay nofidiny voalohany. Angaha tsy fantatrareo izay nolazain’ny Soratra Masina momba an’i Elia, tamin’izy nitaraina tamin’Andriamanitra momba ny Israelita?', 'tsy hoe nialan’andriamanitra ny vahoakany, izay nofidiny voalohany. angaha tsy fantatrareo izay nolazain’ny soratra masina momba an’i elia, tamin’izy nitaraina tamin’andriamanitra momba ny israelita?'),
  ('6ab25c9d9cb0a62359598feb', '2026-09-22T10:46:53.600Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:53.600Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 11, 23, 'Ary hatao grefy koa izy ireo raha lasa mino, satria hain’Andriamanitra ny manao grefy azy indray.', 'ary hatao grefy koa izy ireo raha lasa mino, satria hain’andriamanitra ny manao grefy azy indray.'),
  ('6ab25c9d9cb0a62359598fe4', '2026-09-22T10:46:53.600Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:53.600Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 11, 16, 'Izao koa: Raha masina ny ampahany amin’ny koba atao voaloham-bokatra, dia masina koa ilay koba manontolo. Ary raha masina ny fakan’ny hazo, dia masina koa ny sampany.', 'izao koa: raha masina ny ampahany amin’ny koba atao voaloham-bokatra, dia masina koa ilay koba manontolo. ary raha masina ny fakan’ny hazo, dia masina koa ny sampany.'),
  ('6ab25c9d9cb0a62359598fe7', '2026-09-22T10:46:53.600Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:53.600Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 11, 19, 'Hilaza àry ianao hoe: “Nisy sampany notapahina dia amin’izay aho azo natao grefy teo.”', 'hilaza àry ianao hoe: “nisy sampany notapahina dia amin’izay aho azo natao grefy teo.”'),
  ('6ab25c9d9cb0a62359598fda', '2026-09-22T10:46:53.600Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:53.600Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 11, 6, 'Midika àry izany hoe noho ny hatsaram-panahiny miavaka no nifidianany azy ireo, fa tsy noho izay nataon’izy ireo. Raha tsy izany, dia tsy ho hatsaram-panahy miavaka intsony ilay hatsaram-panahy.', 'midika àry izany hoe noho ny hatsaram-panahiny miavaka no nifidianany azy ireo, fa tsy noho izay nataon’izy ireo. raha tsy izany, dia tsy ho hatsaram-panahy miavaka intsony ilay hatsaram-panahy.'),
  ('6ab25c9d9cb0a62359598fe9', '2026-09-22T10:46:53.600Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:53.600Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 11, 21, 'Fa raha ny tena sampany aza tsy navelan’Andriamanitra hijanona teo, dia tsy havelany hijanona eo koa ianao.', 'fa raha ny tena sampany aza tsy navelan’andriamanitra hijanona teo, dia tsy havelany hijanona eo koa ianao.'),
  ('6ab25c9e2e0311ad30be737d', '2026-09-22T10:46:54.705Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:54.705Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 12, 2, 'Ary aza manaiky hovolavolain’izao tontolo izao intsony. Fa miovà kosa ka havaozy ny sainareo mba hamantaranareo tsara ny sitrapon’Andriamanitra, izay tsara sy tena mety ary tonga lafatra.', 'ary aza manaiky hovolavolain’izao tontolo izao intsony. fa miovà kosa ka havaozy ny sainareo mba hamantaranareo tsara ny sitrapon’andriamanitra, izay tsara sy tena mety ary tonga lafatra.'),
  ('6ab25c9e2e0311ad30be738a', '2026-09-22T10:46:54.705Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:54.705Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 12, 15, 'Miaraha mifaly amin’izay mifaly, ary miaraha mitomany amin’izay mitomany.', 'miaraha mifaly amin’izay mifaly, ary miaraha mitomany amin’izay mitomany.'),
  ('6ab25c9e2e0311ad30be7385', '2026-09-22T10:46:54.705Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:54.705Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 12, 10, 'Mifankatiava hoatran’ny mpirahalahy, ary ataovy izay hampiraiki-po anareo samy ianareo. Mifanomeza voninahitra, ka aoka ianareo no ho voalohany hanome voninahitra ny hafa.', 'mifankatiava hoatran’ny mpirahalahy, ary ataovy izay hampiraiki-po anareo samy ianareo. mifanomeza voninahitra, ka aoka ianareo no ho voalohany hanome voninahitra ny hafa.'),
  ('6ab25c9e2e0311ad30be7387', '2026-09-22T10:46:54.705Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:54.705Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 12, 12, 'Mifalia amin’ny fanantenana. Miareta fahoriana. Mahareta amin’ny vavaka.', 'mifalia amin’ny fanantenana. miareta fahoriana. mahareta amin’ny vavaka.'),
  ('6ab25c9e2e0311ad30be7381', '2026-09-22T10:46:54.705Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:54.705Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 12, 6, 'Manana fahaizana samihafa isika, arakaraka ny hatsaram-panahy miavaka naseho tamintsika. Raha fahaizana maminany ilay izy, dia tokony haminany arakaraka ny finoana ananantsika isika.', 'manana fahaizana samihafa isika, arakaraka ny hatsaram-panahy miavaka naseho tamintsika. raha fahaizana maminany ilay izy, dia tokony haminany arakaraka ny finoana ananantsika isika.'),
  ('6ab25c9e2e0311ad30be7386', '2026-09-22T10:46:54.705Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:54.705Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 12, 11, 'Mazotoa miasa fa aza kamokamo. Aoka ianareo harehitry ny fanahy. Manompoa an’i Jehovah.', 'mazotoa miasa fa aza kamokamo. aoka ianareo harehitry ny fanahy. manompoa an’i jehovah.'),
  ('6ab25c9e2e0311ad30be738b', '2026-09-22T10:46:54.705Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:54.705Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 12, 16, 'Ataovy hoatran’ny tenanareo ihany ny olon-kafa. Aza manambony tena, fa miezaha hanetry tena. Aza mihevi-tena ho hendry.', 'ataovy hoatran’ny tenanareo ihany ny olon-kafa. aza manambony tena, fa miezaha hanetry tena. aza mihevi-tena ho hendry.'),
  ('6ab25c9e2e0311ad30be7389', '2026-09-22T10:46:54.705Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:54.705Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 12, 14, 'Miezaha foana hirary soa an’izay manenjika anareo. Miezaha hirary soa fa aza manozona.', 'miezaha foana hirary soa an’izay manenjika anareo. miezaha hirary soa fa aza manozona.'),
  ('6ab25c9e2e0311ad30be737f', '2026-09-22T10:46:54.705Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:54.705Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 12, 4, 'Fa misy rantsambatana maro ny vatantsika, nefa tsy mitovy ny asan’izy rehetra.', 'fa misy rantsambatana maro ny vatantsika, nefa tsy mitovy ny asan’izy rehetra.'),
  ('6ab25c9e2e0311ad30be7384', '2026-09-22T10:46:54.705Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:54.705Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 12, 9, 'Aza asiana fihatsarambelatsihy ny fitiavanareo. Ankahalao ny ratsy, ary mifikira amin’ny tsara.', 'aza asiana fihatsarambelatsihy ny fitiavanareo. ankahalao ny ratsy, ary mifikira amin’ny tsara.'),
  ('6ab25c9e2e0311ad30be7383', '2026-09-22T10:46:54.705Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:54.705Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 12, 8, 'Izay mampahery, dia tokony hampahery. Izay mizara, dia tokony halala-tanana. Izay mitarika, dia tokony hazoto hanao an’izany. Ary izay mamindra fo, dia tokony hanao an’izany amim-pifaliana.', 'izay mampahery, dia tokony hampahery. izay mizara, dia tokony halala-tanana. izay mitarika, dia tokony hazoto hanao an’izany. ary izay mamindra fo, dia tokony hanao an’izany amim-pifaliana.'),
  ('6ab25c9e2e0311ad30be7380', '2026-09-22T10:46:54.705Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:54.705Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 12, 5, 'Hoatr’izany koa fa vatana iray tafaray amin’i Kristy isika na be dia be aza, ary rantsambatana mifampiankina isika tsirairay.', 'hoatr’izany koa fa vatana iray tafaray amin’i kristy isika na be dia be aza, ary rantsambatana mifampiankina isika tsirairay.'),
  ('6ab25c9e2e0311ad30be737e', '2026-09-22T10:46:54.705Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:54.705Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 12, 3, 'Fa noho ny hatsaram-panahy miavaka naseho tamiko, dia izao no lazaiko aminareo tsirairay avy: Aza mihevi-tena mihoatra noho izay tokony ho izy. Asehoy kosa fa misaina tsara ianareo, araka ny finoana nomen’Andriamanitra anareo tsirairay.', 'fa noho ny hatsaram-panahy miavaka naseho tamiko, dia izao no lazaiko aminareo tsirairay avy: aza mihevi-tena mihoatra noho izay tokony ho izy. asehoy kosa fa misaina tsara ianareo, araka ny finoana nomen’andriamanitra anareo tsirairay.'),
  ('6ab25c9e2e0311ad30be737c', '2026-09-22T10:46:54.705Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:54.705Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 12, 1, 'Noho izany, ry rahalahy, dia miangavy anareo aho, noho ny fangoraham-pon’Andriamanitra, mba hatolotrareo ho sorona velona sy masina ary ankasitrahan’Andriamanitra ny tenanareo. Manao fanompoana masina ianareo amin’izany sady mampiasa tsara ny sainareo.', 'noho izany, ry rahalahy, dia miangavy anareo aho, noho ny fangoraham-pon’andriamanitra, mba hatolotrareo ho sorona velona sy masina ary ankasitrahan’andriamanitra ny tenanareo. manao fanompoana masina ianareo amin’izany sady mampiasa tsara ny sainareo.'),
  ('6ab25c9e2e0311ad30be7388', '2026-09-22T10:46:54.705Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:54.705Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 12, 13, 'Mba anomezo amin’izay anananareo ny olona masina, araka izay ilainy. Miezaha ho tia mandray vahiny.', 'mba anomezo amin’izay anananareo ny olona masina, araka izay ilainy. miezaha ho tia mandray vahiny.'),
  ('6ab25c9e2e0311ad30be7382', '2026-09-22T10:46:54.705Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:54.705Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 12, 7, 'Raha fanompoana kosa no nomena antsika, dia tokony hanompo foana isika. Ary izay mampianatra, dia tokony hampianatra foana.', 'raha fanompoana kosa no nomena antsika, dia tokony hanompo foana isika. ary izay mampianatra, dia tokony hampianatra foana.'),
  ('6ab25c9e2e0311ad30be738e', '2026-09-22T10:46:54.706Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:54.706Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 12, 19, 'Aza mamaly faty, ry malala, fa avelao Andriamanitra no hampiseho ny hatezerany. Fa voasoratra hoe: “‘Ahy ny famaliana, ary izaho no hamaly’, hoy i Jehovah.”', 'aza mamaly faty, ry malala, fa avelao andriamanitra no hampiseho ny hatezerany. fa voasoratra hoe: “‘ahy ny famaliana, ary izaho no hamaly’, hoy i jehovah.”'),
  ('6ab25c9e2e0311ad30be738d', '2026-09-22T10:46:54.706Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:54.706Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 12, 18, 'Raha azo atao, ka mbola miankina aminareo koa, dia mihavàna amin’ny olona rehetra.', 'raha azo atao, ka mbola miankina aminareo koa, dia mihavàna amin’ny olona rehetra.'),
  ('6ab25c9e2e0311ad30be7390', '2026-09-22T10:46:54.706Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:54.706Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 12, 21, 'Aza manaiky ho resin’ny ratsy, fa reseo amin’ny tsara foana ny ratsy.', 'aza manaiky ho resin’ny ratsy, fa reseo amin’ny tsara foana ny ratsy.'),
  ('6ab25c9e2e0311ad30be738f', '2026-09-22T10:46:54.706Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:54.706Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 12, 20, 'Fa “raha noana ny fahavalonao, dia omeo sakafo, ary raha mangetaheta izy, dia omeo zavatra hosotroiny. Fa hampivangongo vainafo eo ambony lohany ianao raha manao an’izany.”', 'fa “raha noana ny fahavalonao, dia omeo sakafo, ary raha mangetaheta izy, dia omeo zavatra hosotroiny. fa hampivangongo vainafo eo ambony lohany ianao raha manao an’izany.”'),
  ('6ab25c9e2e0311ad30be738c', '2026-09-22T10:46:54.706Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:54.706Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 12, 17, 'Aza mamaly ratsy ny ratsy, na amin’iza na amin’iza. Mba eritrereto hoe inona no zavatra heverin’ny olona rehetra hoe tsara.', 'aza mamaly ratsy ny ratsy, na amin’iza na amin’iza. mba eritrereto hoe inona no zavatra heverin’ny olona rehetra hoe tsara.'),
  ('6ab25c9f7d6bac8ef664f075', '2026-09-22T10:46:55.130Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:55.130Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 13, 12, 'Efa ho lasa ny alina, ka efa ho maraina ny andro. Andao àry isika hiala amin’ny zava-dratsy fanaon’olona ao amin’ny maizina, ka hampiasa ny fitaovam-piadian’ny mazava.', 'efa ho lasa ny alina, ka efa ho maraina ny andro. andao àry isika hiala amin’ny zava-dratsy fanaon’olona ao amin’ny maizina, ka hampiasa ny fitaovam-piadian’ny mazava.'),
  ('6ab25c9f7d6bac8ef664f06f', '2026-09-22T10:46:55.130Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:55.130Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 13, 6, 'Izany koa no antony andoavanareo hetra. Fa mpanompon’Andriamanitra miasa ho an’ny vahoaka izy ireo, ary izany foana no asany.', 'izany koa no antony andoavanareo hetra. fa mpanompon’andriamanitra miasa ho an’ny vahoaka izy ireo, ary izany foana no asany.'),
  ('6ab25c9f7d6bac8ef664f06d', '2026-09-22T10:46:55.130Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:55.130Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 13, 4, 'Fa mpanompon’Andriamanitra izy ary mitondra soa ho anao. Raha manao ratsy anefa ianao dia matahora, fa misy antony matoa izy mitondra sabatra. Mpanompon’Andriamanitra mantsy izy, ary nomena fahefana hanasazy an’izay manao ratsy.', 'fa mpanompon’andriamanitra izy ary mitondra soa ho anao. raha manao ratsy anefa ianao dia matahora, fa misy antony matoa izy mitondra sabatra. mpanompon’andriamanitra mantsy izy, ary nomena fahefana hanasazy an’izay manao ratsy.'),
  ('6ab25c9f7d6bac8ef664f06c', '2026-09-22T10:46:55.130Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:55.130Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 13, 3, 'Fa tsy atahoran’izay manao ny tsara ny mpitondra, fa atahoran’izay manao ratsy. Tianao ve raha hoe tsy matahotra ny manam-pahefana ianao? Izay tsara foana àry atao dia hoderainy ianao.', 'fa tsy atahoran’izay manao ny tsara ny mpitondra, fa atahoran’izay manao ratsy. tianao ve raha hoe tsy matahotra ny manam-pahefana ianao? izay tsara foana àry atao dia hoderainy ianao.'),
  ('6ab25c9f7d6bac8ef664f073', '2026-09-22T10:46:55.130Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:55.130Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 13, 10, 'Tsy mba manisy ratsy ny namany izay manam-pitiavana. Izay tia olona àry no manatanteraka ny lalàna.', 'tsy mba manisy ratsy ny namany izay manam-pitiavana. izay tia olona àry no manatanteraka ny lalàna.'),
  ('6ab25c9f7d6bac8ef664f06a', '2026-09-22T10:46:55.130Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:55.130Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 13, 1, 'Aoka ny olona rehetra rehetra samy hanaiky ny manam-pahefana, fa avy amin’Andriamanitra daholo ny fahefana rehetra. Andriamanitra mantsy no namela ny manam-pahefana ho eo amin’ny toerany avy.', 'aoka ny olona rehetra rehetra samy hanaiky ny manam-pahefana, fa avy amin’andriamanitra daholo ny fahefana rehetra. andriamanitra mantsy no namela ny manam-pahefana ho eo amin’ny toerany avy.'),
  ('6ab25c9f7d6bac8ef664f072', '2026-09-22T10:46:55.130Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:55.130Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 13, 9, 'Fa ny lalàna hoe: “Aza manitsakitsa-bady, aza mamono olona, aza mangalatra, ary aza mitsiriritra” sy ny didy hafa rehetra, dia efa voafintina amin’ilay didy hoe: “Tiavo ny namanao tahaka ny tenanao.”', 'fa ny lalàna hoe: “aza manitsakitsa-bady, aza mamono olona, aza mangalatra, ary aza mitsiriritra” sy ny didy hafa rehetra, dia efa voafintina amin’ilay didy hoe: “tiavo ny namanao tahaka ny tenanao.”'),
  ('6ab25c9f7d6bac8ef664f06e', '2026-09-22T10:46:55.130Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:55.130Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 13, 5, 'Tena misy antony tsy maintsy anekenareo fahefana àry, tsy hoe noho izany sazy izany ihany, fa noho ny feon’ny fieritreretanareo koa.', 'tena misy antony tsy maintsy anekenareo fahefana àry, tsy hoe noho izany sazy izany ihany, fa noho ny feon’ny fieritreretanareo koa.'),
  ('6ab25c9f7d6bac8ef664f070', '2026-09-22T10:46:55.130Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:55.130Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 13, 7, 'Aloavy amin’izy rehetra àry izay tokony haloa aminy: Ny hetra ho an’izay mitaky hetra, ny haba ho an’izay mitaky haba, ny tahotra ho an’izay tokony hatahorana, ary ny haja ho an’izay tokony hohajaina.', 'aloavy amin’izy rehetra àry izay tokony haloa aminy: ny hetra ho an’izay mitaky hetra, ny haba ho an’izay mitaky haba, ny tahotra ho an’izay tokony hatahorana, ary ny haja ho an’izay tokony hohajaina.'),
  ('6ab25c9f7d6bac8ef664f077', '2026-09-22T10:46:55.130Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:55.130Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 13, 14, 'Tafio kosa ny toetran’i Jesosy Kristy Tompo, ary aza manao tetika hanomezana fahafaham-po ny fanirian’ny nofo.', 'tafio kosa ny toetran’i jesosy kristy tompo, ary aza manao tetika hanomezana fahafaham-po ny fanirian’ny nofo.'),
  ('6ab25c9f7d6bac8ef664f071', '2026-09-22T10:46:55.130Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:55.130Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 13, 8, 'Aza avela hisy trosan’olona mihitsy any aminareo, afa-tsy ny fifankatiavanareo ihany. Izay tia ny namany mantsy dia manatanteraka ny lalàna.', 'aza avela hisy trosan’olona mihitsy any aminareo, afa-tsy ny fifankatiavanareo ihany. izay tia ny namany mantsy dia manatanteraka ny lalàna.'),
  ('6ab25c9f7d6bac8ef664f074', '2026-09-22T10:46:55.130Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:55.130Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 13, 11, 'Ataovy izany nolazaiko taminareo izany, satria fantatrareo izao fotoana misy antsika izao. Efa izao mantsy ny ora tokony hifohazanareo amin’ny torimaso. Efa akaiky noho ny tamin’isika lasa mpino ny famonjena antsika amin’izao.', 'ataovy izany nolazaiko taminareo izany, satria fantatrareo izao fotoana misy antsika izao. efa izao mantsy ny ora tokony hifohazanareo amin’ny torimaso. efa akaiky noho ny tamin’isika lasa mpino ny famonjena antsika amin’izao.'),
  ('6ab25c9f7d6bac8ef664f06b', '2026-09-22T10:46:55.130Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:55.130Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 13, 2, 'Izay manohitra ny fahefana àry dia manohitra ny lamina napetrak’Andriamanitra. Ary izay manohitra an’izany lamina izany dia homelohina, ka ny nataony ihany no mahatonga azy homelohina.', 'izay manohitra ny fahefana àry dia manohitra ny lamina napetrak’andriamanitra. ary izay manohitra an’izany lamina izany dia homelohina, ka ny nataony ihany no mahatonga azy homelohina.'),
  ('6ab25c9f7d6bac8ef664f076', '2026-09-22T10:46:55.130Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:55.130Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 13, 13, 'Aoka isika hitondra tena tsara hoatran’ny amin’ny andro mazava, ka tsy hanao fety tsy voafehy, tsy ho mamo, tsy hijangajanga, tsy hitondra tena hoatran’ny olona tsy misy henatra, tsy hifamaly amin’olona, ary tsy hialona.', 'aoka isika hitondra tena tsara hoatran’ny amin’ny andro mazava, ka tsy hanao fety tsy voafehy, tsy ho mamo, tsy hijangajanga, tsy hitondra tena hoatran’ny olona tsy misy henatra, tsy hifamaly amin’olona, ary tsy hialona.'),
  ('6ab25c9ff8850a4d94d8e26c', '2026-09-22T10:46:55.627Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:55.627Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 14, 12, 'Koa samy hataon’Andriamanitra ampamoaka isika tsirairay.', 'koa samy hataon’andriamanitra ampamoaka isika tsirairay.'),
  ('6ab25c9ff8850a4d94d8e269', '2026-09-22T10:46:55.627Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:55.627Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 14, 9, 'Fa maty i Kristy dia avy eo velona indray mba ho Tompon’ny maty sy ny velona.', 'fa maty i kristy dia avy eo velona indray mba ho tompon’ny maty sy ny velona.'),
  ('6ab25c9ff8850a4d94d8e261', '2026-09-22T10:46:55.627Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:55.627Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 14, 1, 'Raiso tsara izay malemy finoana, ary aza tsaratsaraina izy raha tsy mitovy hevitra aminao.', 'raiso tsara izay malemy finoana, ary aza tsaratsaraina izy raha tsy mitovy hevitra aminao.'),
  ('6ab25c9ff8850a4d94d8e26d', '2026-09-22T10:46:55.627Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:55.627Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 14, 13, 'Tsy tokony hifampitsaratsara intsony àry isika, fa tokony ho tapa-kevitra hoe tsy hametraka vato mahatafintohina na zavatra hafa manakantsakana eo alohan’ny rahalahy.', 'tsy tokony hifampitsaratsara intsony àry isika, fa tokony ho tapa-kevitra hoe tsy hametraka vato mahatafintohina na zavatra hafa manakantsakana eo alohan’ny rahalahy.'),
  ('6ab25c9ff8850a4d94d8e26b', '2026-09-22T10:46:55.627Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:55.627Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 14, 11, 'Fa voasoratra hoe: “‘Raha mbola velona koa aho’, hoy i Jehovah, ‘dia tsy maintsy handohalika eo anatrehako ny olona rehetra, ary hanaiky ahy ho Andriamanitra eo imason’ny olona.’”', 'fa voasoratra hoe: “‘raha mbola velona koa aho’, hoy i jehovah, ‘dia tsy maintsy handohalika eo anatrehako ny olona rehetra, ary hanaiky ahy ho andriamanitra eo imason’ny olona.’”'),
  ('6ab25c9ff8850a4d94d8e274', '2026-09-22T10:46:55.627Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:55.627Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 14, 20, 'Aza ravana amin’izay sakafo intsony ny asan’Andriamanitra. Marina fa madio ny zava-drehetra, nefa tsy mety ny ataon’ny olona iray raha mihinana izy nefa manafintohina ny hafa izany.', 'aza ravana amin’izay sakafo intsony ny asan’andriamanitra. marina fa madio ny zava-drehetra, nefa tsy mety ny ataon’ny olona iray raha mihinana izy nefa manafintohina ny hafa izany.'),
  ('6ab25c9ff8850a4d94d8e266', '2026-09-22T10:46:55.627Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:55.627Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 14, 6, 'Izay mitandrina andro anankiray dia mitandrina an’izany ho voninahitr’i Jehovah. Ary izay mihinana dia mihinana ho voninahitr’i Jehovah, satria misaotra an’Andriamanitra izy. Ary izay tsy mihinana dia ho voninahitr’i Jehovah koa no tsy hihinanany, nefa misaotra an’Andriamanitra ihany izy.', 'izay mitandrina andro anankiray dia mitandrina an’izany ho voninahitr’i jehovah. ary izay mihinana dia mihinana ho voninahitr’i jehovah, satria misaotra an’andriamanitra izy. ary izay tsy mihinana dia ho voninahitr’i jehovah koa no tsy hihinanany, nefa misaotra an’andriamanitra ihany izy.'),
  ('6ab25c9ff8850a4d94d8e276', '2026-09-22T10:46:55.627Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:55.627Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 14, 22, 'Izay zavatra inoanao, dia aleo ho anao sy Andriamanitra ihany. Sambatra izay olona tsy manamelo-tena amin’izay ataony.', 'izay zavatra inoanao, dia aleo ho anao sy andriamanitra ihany. sambatra izay olona tsy manamelo-tena amin’izay ataony.'),
  ('6ab25c9ff8850a4d94d8e277', '2026-09-22T10:46:55.627Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:55.627Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 14, 23, 'Fa raha misalasala izy nefa mihinana, dia efa voaheloka sahady, satria tsy amin’ny finoana no anaovany an’izany. Fahotana mantsy izay zavatra rehetra tsy atao amin’ny finoana.', 'fa raha misalasala izy nefa mihinana, dia efa voaheloka sahady, satria tsy amin’ny finoana no anaovany an’izany. fahotana mantsy izay zavatra rehetra tsy atao amin’ny finoana.'),
  ('6ab25c9ff8850a4d94d8e273', '2026-09-22T10:46:55.627Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:55.627Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 14, 19, 'Andao àry isika hiezaka hampisy fihavanana sy hifampahery.', 'andao àry isika hiezaka hampisy fihavanana sy hifampahery.'),
  ('6ab25c9ff8850a4d94d8e275', '2026-09-22T10:46:55.627Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:55.627Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 14, 21, 'Aleo tsy mihinan-kena na misotro divay na manao zavatra hafa mety hanafintohina ny rahalahinao.', 'aleo tsy mihinan-kena na misotro divay na manao zavatra hafa mety hanafintohina ny rahalahinao.'),
  ('6ab25c9ff8850a4d94d8e271', '2026-09-22T10:46:55.627Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:55.627Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 14, 17, 'Fa ny Fanjakan’Andriamanitra dia tsy midika hoe fihinanana na fisotroana, fa midika kosa hoe fahamarinana sy fihavanana ary fifaliana amin’ny alalan’ny fanahy masina.', 'fa ny fanjakan’andriamanitra dia tsy midika hoe fihinanana na fisotroana, fa midika kosa hoe fahamarinana sy fihavanana ary fifaliana amin’ny alalan’ny fanahy masina.'),
  ('6ab25c9ff8850a4d94d8e270', '2026-09-22T10:46:55.627Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:55.627Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 14, 16, 'Aza avela hisy hanaratsy ny tsara ataonareo àry.', 'aza avela hisy hanaratsy ny tsara ataonareo àry.'),
  ('6ab25c9ff8850a4d94d8e267', '2026-09-22T10:46:55.627Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:55.627Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 14, 7, 'Tsy misy amintsika hoe velona ho an’ny tenany fotsiny, ary tsy misy hoe maty ho an’ny tenany fotsiny koa.', 'tsy misy amintsika hoe velona ho an’ny tenany fotsiny, ary tsy misy hoe maty ho an’ny tenany fotsiny koa.'),
  ('6ab25c9ff8850a4d94d8e265', '2026-09-22T10:46:55.627Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:55.627Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 14, 5, 'Ny iray mihevitra hoe miavaka amin’ny andro hafa ny andro anankiray, fa ny iray kosa mihevitra hoe mitovy daholo ny andro rehetra. Aleo ny tsirairay samy ho resy lahatra amin’izay fanapahan-keviny.', 'ny iray mihevitra hoe miavaka amin’ny andro hafa ny andro anankiray, fa ny iray kosa mihevitra hoe mitovy daholo ny andro rehetra. aleo ny tsirairay samy ho resy lahatra amin’izay fanapahan-keviny.'),
  ('6ab25c9ff8850a4d94d8e263', '2026-09-22T10:46:55.627Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:55.627Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 14, 3, 'Tsy tokony hanambanimbany an’izay tsy mihinana ny olona mihinana, ary tsy tokony hitsaratsara an’izay mihinana ny olona tsy mihinana. Efa noraisin’Andriamanitra tsara mantsy izy.', 'tsy tokony hanambanimbany an’izay tsy mihinana ny olona mihinana, ary tsy tokony hitsaratsara an’izay mihinana ny olona tsy mihinana. efa noraisin’andriamanitra tsara mantsy izy.'),
  ('6ab25c9ff8850a4d94d8e268', '2026-09-22T10:46:55.627Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:55.627Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 14, 8, 'Fa raha velona isika, dia velona ho an’i Jehovah, ary raha maty isika, dia maty ho an’i Jehovah. Koa na velona isika na maty, dia an’i Jehovah.', 'fa raha velona isika, dia velona ho an’i jehovah, ary raha maty isika, dia maty ho an’i jehovah. koa na velona isika na maty, dia an’i jehovah.'),
  ('6ab25c9ff8850a4d94d8e272', '2026-09-22T10:46:55.627Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:55.627Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 14, 18, 'Fa izay manompo an’i Kristy sady manana an’ireo toetra ireo no ankasitrahan’Andriamanitra sady ankasitrahan’ny olona.', 'fa izay manompo an’i kristy sady manana an’ireo toetra ireo no ankasitrahan’andriamanitra sady ankasitrahan’ny olona.'),
  ('6ab25c9ff8850a4d94d8e26f', '2026-09-22T10:46:55.627Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:55.627Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 14, 15, 'Fa raha ny sakafo haninao no mampahatezitra ny rahalahinao, dia tsy misy fitiavana intsony ny zavatra ataonao. Aza ny sakafo haninao no animbanao ny finoany, fa efa maty hamonjy azy i Kristy.', 'fa raha ny sakafo haninao no mampahatezitra ny rahalahinao, dia tsy misy fitiavana intsony ny zavatra ataonao. aza ny sakafo haninao no animbanao ny finoany, fa efa maty hamonjy azy i kristy.'),
  ('6ab25c9ff8850a4d94d8e26a', '2026-09-22T10:46:55.627Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:55.627Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 14, 10, 'Fa maninona ianao no mitsaratsara ny rahalahinao? Ary maninona koa ianao no manambanimbany ny rahalahinao? Mbola samy hotsaraina eo anatrehan’Andriamanitra mantsy isika rehetra.', 'fa maninona ianao no mitsaratsara ny rahalahinao? ary maninona koa ianao no manambanimbany ny rahalahinao? mbola samy hotsaraina eo anatrehan’andriamanitra mantsy isika rehetra.'),
  ('6ab25c9ff8850a4d94d8e26e', '2026-09-22T10:46:55.627Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:55.627Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 14, 14, 'Noho izaho mpanara-dia an’i Jesosy Tompo, dia mahafantatra sady resy lahatra hoe tsy misy zavatra lasa maloto ho azy amin’izao izany. Rehefa heverin’ny olona hoe maloto ihany ny zavatra iray, vao maloto aminy ilay izy.', 'noho izaho mpanara-dia an’i jesosy tompo, dia mahafantatra sady resy lahatra hoe tsy misy zavatra lasa maloto ho azy amin’izao izany. rehefa heverin’ny olona hoe maloto ihany ny zavatra iray, vao maloto aminy ilay izy.'),
  ('6ab25c9ff8850a4d94d8e264', '2026-09-22T10:46:55.627Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:55.627Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 14, 4, 'Fa iza moa ianao no hitsaratsara ny mpiasan’olon-kafa? Ny mpampiasa azy ihany no afaka mitsara raha mety na tsy mety ny ataony. Hahazo sitraka amin’i Jehovah izy, satria ampiany.', 'fa iza moa ianao no hitsaratsara ny mpiasan’olon-kafa? ny mpampiasa azy ihany no afaka mitsara raha mety na tsy mety ny ataony. hahazo sitraka amin’i jehovah izy, satria ampiany.'),
  ('6ab25c9ff8850a4d94d8e262', '2026-09-22T10:46:55.627Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:55.627Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 14, 2, 'Ny anankiray manana finoana matanjaka dia mihinana ny zava-drehetra, fa ilay malemy kosa tsy mihinana afa-tsy legioma.', 'ny anankiray manana finoana matanjaka dia mihinana ny zava-drehetra, fa ilay malemy kosa tsy mihinana afa-tsy legioma.'),
  ('6ab25ca0594268bf85265fa2', '2026-09-22T10:46:56.314Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:56.314Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 15, 28, 'Koa rehefa avy manatitra an’izany fanomezana izany aho ka azoko antoka hoe voarain’ny olona masina ilay izy, dia ho any Espaina aho, dia amin’izay aho no handalo kely any aminareo.', 'koa rehefa avy manatitra an’izany fanomezana izany aho ka azoko antoka hoe voarain’ny olona masina ilay izy, dia ho any espaina aho, dia amin’izay aho no handalo kely any aminareo.'),
  ('6ab25ca0594268bf85265f9a', '2026-09-22T10:46:56.314Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:56.314Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 15, 20, 'Tamin’izany dia niezaka mafy aho mba tsy hitory ny vaovao tsara any amin’izay efa nampahafantarana ny anaran’i Kristy. Amin’izay aho tsy hanorina eo ambonin’ny fototra nataon’olon-kafa.', 'tamin’izany dia niezaka mafy aho mba tsy hitory ny vaovao tsara any amin’izay efa nampahafantarana ny anaran’i kristy. amin’izay aho tsy hanorina eo ambonin’ny fototra nataon’olon-kafa.'),
  ('6ab25ca0594268bf85265fa6', '2026-09-22T10:46:56.314Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:56.314Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 15, 32, 'Dia ho falifaly aho rehefa tonga any aminareo ka samy ho velombelona daholo isika, raha sitrapon’Andriamanitra.', 'dia ho falifaly aho rehefa tonga any aminareo ka samy ho velombelona daholo isika, raha sitrapon’andriamanitra.'),
  ('6ab25ca0594268bf85265f98', '2026-09-22T10:46:56.314Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:56.314Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 15, 18, 'Tsy hiresaka zavatra hafa aho, afa-tsy izay nataon’i Kristy tamin’ny alalako, mba hahatonga ny hafa firenena hankatò azy noho izay nolazaiko sy nataoko,', 'tsy hiresaka zavatra hafa aho, afa-tsy izay nataon’i kristy tamin’ny alalako, mba hahatonga ny hafa firenena hankatò azy noho izay nolazaiko sy nataoko,'),
  ('6ab25ca0594268bf85265f89', '2026-09-22T10:46:56.314Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:56.314Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 15, 3, 'Na i Kristy aza mantsy tsy nampifaly ny tenany, fa voasoratra hoe: “Mihatra amiko ny latsa ataon’ireo mandatsa anao.”', 'na i kristy aza mantsy tsy nampifaly ny tenany, fa voasoratra hoe: “mihatra amiko ny latsa ataon’ireo mandatsa anao.”'),
  ('6ab25ca0594268bf85265f88', '2026-09-22T10:46:56.314Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:56.314Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 15, 2, 'Tokony samy hampifaly ny namany isika mba hahasoa azy sy hampahery azy.', 'tokony samy hampifaly ny namany isika mba hahasoa azy sy hampahery azy.'),
  ('6ab25ca0594268bf85265fa7', '2026-09-22T10:46:56.314Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:56.314Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 15, 33, 'Enga anie hanohana anareo ilay Andriamanitry ny fiadanana! Amena.', 'enga anie hanohana anareo ilay andriamanitry ny fiadanana! amena.'),
  ('6ab25ca0594268bf85265f93', '2026-09-22T10:46:56.314Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:56.314Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 15, 13, 'Ilay Andriamanitra manome fanantenana anie hameno fifaliana sy fiadanana ny fonareo, satria matoky azy ianareo! Amin’izay dia vao mainka ho azo antoka ny fanantenanareo noho ny herin’ny fanahy masina.', 'ilay andriamanitra manome fanantenana anie hameno fifaliana sy fiadanana ny fonareo, satria matoky azy ianareo! amin’izay dia vao mainka ho azo antoka ny fanantenanareo noho ny herin’ny fanahy masina.'),
  ('6ab25ca0594268bf85265f9e', '2026-09-22T10:46:56.314Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:56.314Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 15, 24, 'Rehefa ho any Espaina àry aho, dia manantena ny hahita anareo sy haterinareo lavidavitra, rehefa mba avy miaraka kely aminareo.', 'rehefa ho any espaina àry aho, dia manantena ny hahita anareo sy haterinareo lavidavitra, rehefa mba avy miaraka kely aminareo.'),
  ('6ab25ca0594268bf85265f8b', '2026-09-22T10:46:56.314Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:56.314Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 15, 5, 'Hanome anareo toe-tsaina mitovy amin’ny an’i Kristy Jesosy anie ilay Andriamanitra manampy anareo hiaritra sy mampionona anareo!', 'hanome anareo toe-tsaina mitovy amin’ny an’i kristy jesosy anie ilay andriamanitra manampy anareo hiaritra sy mampionona anareo!'),
  ('6ab25ca0594268bf85265f9d', '2026-09-22T10:46:56.314Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:56.314Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 15, 23, 'Tsy manana faritany tsy voatory intsony anefa aho izao any amin’ireo faritra ireo. Efa nandritra ny taona maromaro koa aho no te ho any aminareo mafy.', 'tsy manana faritany tsy voatory intsony anefa aho izao any amin’ireo faritra ireo. efa nandritra ny taona maromaro koa aho no te ho any aminareo mafy.'),
  ('6ab25ca0594268bf85265f97', '2026-09-22T10:46:56.314Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:56.314Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 15, 17, 'Faly àry aho satria mpianatr’i Kristy Jesosy sady manao ny asan’Andriamanitra.', 'faly àry aho satria mpianatr’i kristy jesosy sady manao ny asan’andriamanitra.'),
  ('6ab25ca0594268bf85265f92', '2026-09-22T10:46:56.314Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:56.314Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 15, 12, 'Hoy koa i Isaia: “Hisy fakan’i Jese hitsangana ka hitondra firenena, ary izy no hantenain’ireny firenena ireny.”', 'hoy koa i isaia: “hisy fakan’i jese hitsangana ka hitondra firenena, ary izy no hantenain’ireny firenena ireny.”'),
  ('6ab25ca0594268bf85265f8f', '2026-09-22T10:46:56.314Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:56.314Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 15, 9, 'Amin’izay koa hanome voninahitra an’Andriamanitra ny hafa firenena noho izy mamindra fo. Fa voasoratra hoe: “Izany no mahatonga ahy hanaiky anao eo imason’ny olona sy eo amin’ireo firenena, sady hanao hira fiderana ho an’ny anaranao.”', 'amin’izay koa hanome voninahitra an’andriamanitra ny hafa firenena noho izy mamindra fo. fa voasoratra hoe: “izany no mahatonga ahy hanaiky anao eo imason’ny olona sy eo amin’ireo firenena, sady hanao hira fiderana ho an’ny anaranao.”'),
  ('6ab25ca0594268bf85265f8a', '2026-09-22T10:46:56.314Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:56.314Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 15, 4, 'Fa izay rehetra voasoratra taloha dia nosoratana mba hampianarana antsika. Amin’izay isika dia hanana fanantenana, satria manampy antsika hiaritra sady manome fampiononana antsika ny Soratra Masina.', 'fa izay rehetra voasoratra taloha dia nosoratana mba hampianarana antsika. amin’izay isika dia hanana fanantenana, satria manampy antsika hiaritra sady manome fampiononana antsika ny soratra masina.'),
  ('6ab25ca0594268bf85265f87', '2026-09-22T10:46:56.314Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:56.314Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 15, 1, 'Isika matanjaka anefa dia tokony hizaka ny fahalemen’izay tsy matanjaka, fa tsy hampifaly ny tenantsika.', 'isika matanjaka anefa dia tokony hizaka ny fahalemen’izay tsy matanjaka, fa tsy hampifaly ny tenantsika.'),
  ('6ab25ca0594268bf85265f95', '2026-09-22T10:46:56.314Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:56.314Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 15, 15, 'Manoratra aminareo mivantana kokoa momba ny zavatra sasany anefa aho, mba hampahatsiahivana anareo indray. Naneho hatsaram-panahy miavaka tamiko mantsy Andriamanitra,', 'manoratra aminareo mivantana kokoa momba ny zavatra sasany anefa aho, mba hampahatsiahivana anareo indray. naneho hatsaram-panahy miavaka tamiko mantsy andriamanitra,'),
  ('6ab25ca0594268bf85265f94', '2026-09-22T10:46:56.314Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:56.314Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 15, 14, 'Matoky tanteraka aho izao, ry rahalahiko, hoe vonona hanao zavatra tsara ianareo sady mahafantatra zavatra be dia be. Matoky tanteraka koa aho fa afaka mifananatra ianareo.', 'matoky tanteraka aho izao, ry rahalahiko, hoe vonona hanao zavatra tsara ianareo sady mahafantatra zavatra be dia be. matoky tanteraka koa aho fa afaka mifananatra ianareo.'),
  ('6ab25ca0594268bf85265f90', '2026-09-22T10:46:56.314Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:56.314Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 15, 10, 'Hoy indray Izy: “Mifalia miaraka amin’ny vahoakan’Andriamanitra ianareo hafa firenena!”', 'hoy indray izy: “mifalia miaraka amin’ny vahoakan’andriamanitra ianareo hafa firenena!”'),
  ('6ab25ca0594268bf85265fa1', '2026-09-22T10:46:56.314Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:56.314Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 15, 27, 'Marina fa nahafinaritra azy ireo ny nanao an’izany, nefa koa tena trosa tokony haloany amin’izy ireo izany. Raha nahazo tamin’ny harena ara-panahin’ny olona masina mantsy ny hafa firenena, dia mba adidiny kosa ny mikarakara azy ireo ka manome an’izay zavatra ilainy andavanandro.', 'marina fa nahafinaritra azy ireo ny nanao an’izany, nefa koa tena trosa tokony haloany amin’izy ireo izany. raha nahazo tamin’ny harena ara-panahin’ny olona masina mantsy ny hafa firenena, dia mba adidiny kosa ny mikarakara azy ireo ka manome an’izay zavatra ilainy andavanandro.'),
  ('6ab25ca0594268bf85265f96', '2026-09-22T10:46:56.314Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:56.314Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 15, 16, 'ka nifidy ahy ho mpanompon’i Kristy Jesosy mba hitory ny vaovao tsaran’Andriamanitra amin’ny hafa firenena. Manao an’izany asa masina izany aho, mba ho lasa fanatitra ankasitrahana ny hafa firenena, sady hohamasinina amin’ny alalan’ny fanahy masina.', 'ka nifidy ahy ho mpanompon’i kristy jesosy mba hitory ny vaovao tsaran’andriamanitra amin’ny hafa firenena. manao an’izany asa masina izany aho, mba ho lasa fanatitra ankasitrahana ny hafa firenena, sady hohamasinina amin’ny alalan’ny fanahy masina.'),
  ('6ab25ca0594268bf85265f9b', '2026-09-22T10:46:56.314Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:56.314Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 15, 21, 'Fa voasoratra hoe: “Izay mbola tsy nitantarana momba azy no hahita azy, ary izay mbola tsy naheno no hahafantatra.”', 'fa voasoratra hoe: “izay mbola tsy nitantarana momba azy no hahita azy, ary izay mbola tsy naheno no hahafantatra.”'),
  ('6ab25ca0594268bf85265fa5', '2026-09-22T10:46:56.314Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:56.314Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 15, 31, 'Amin’izay aho mba hovonjena amin’ireo tsy mpino any Jodia, ary mba hankasitrahan’ny olona masina any Jerosalema ilay fanompoana ataoko ho azy ireo.', 'amin’izay aho mba hovonjena amin’ireo tsy mpino any jodia, ary mba hankasitrahan’ny olona masina any jerosalema ilay fanompoana ataoko ho azy ireo.'),
  ('6ab25ca0594268bf85265fa3', '2026-09-22T10:46:56.314Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:56.314Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 15, 29, 'Fantatro koa fa rehefa tonga any aminareo aho, dia hitondra fitahiana be dia be avy amin’i Kristy ho anareo.', 'fantatro koa fa rehefa tonga any aminareo aho, dia hitondra fitahiana be dia be avy amin’i kristy ho anareo.'),
  ('6ab25ca0594268bf85265f8d', '2026-09-22T10:46:56.314Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:56.314Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 15, 7, 'Nandray tsara anareo i Kristy, dia mba raiso tsara koa ny hafa. Rehefa manao an’izany ianareo samy ianareo, dia hahazo voninahitra Andriamanitra.', 'nandray tsara anareo i kristy, dia mba raiso tsara koa ny hafa. rehefa manao an’izany ianareo samy ianareo, dia hahazo voninahitra andriamanitra.'),
  ('6ab25ca0594268bf85265f8c', '2026-09-22T10:46:56.314Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:56.314Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 15, 6, 'Hiray saina ianareo amin’izay, ka hiray feo hanome voninahitra an’ilay Andriamanitra Rain’i Jesosy Kristy Tompontsika.', 'hiray saina ianareo amin’izay, ka hiray feo hanome voninahitra an’ilay andriamanitra rain’i jesosy kristy tompontsika.'),
  ('6ab25ca0594268bf85265f99', '2026-09-22T10:46:56.314Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:56.314Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 15, 19, 'sy noho ny herin’ny famantarana sy ny zava-mahagaga ary ny herin’ny fanahin’Andriamanitra. Vitako tsara àry ny nitory ny vaovao tsara momba an’i Kristy, nanomboka tany Jerosalema sy ny manodidina ka hatrany Ilyrikiona.', 'sy noho ny herin’ny famantarana sy ny zava-mahagaga ary ny herin’ny fanahin’andriamanitra. vitako tsara àry ny nitory ny vaovao tsara momba an’i kristy, nanomboka tany jerosalema sy ny manodidina ka hatrany ilyrikiona.'),
  ('6ab25ca0594268bf85265fa4', '2026-09-22T10:46:56.314Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:56.314Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 15, 30, 'Ry rahalahy, satria isika mino an’i Jesosy Kristy Tompontsika sady mifankatia noho ny herin’Andriamanitra, dia mampirisika anareo aho mba hiezaka mafy hivavaka amin’Andriamanitra ho ahy, hoatran’ny efa ataoko.', 'ry rahalahy, satria isika mino an’i jesosy kristy tompontsika sady mifankatia noho ny herin’andriamanitra, dia mampirisika anareo aho mba hiezaka mafy hivavaka amin’andriamanitra ho ahy, hoatran’ny efa ataoko.'),
  ('6ab25ca0594268bf85265f9f', '2026-09-22T10:46:56.314Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:56.314Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 15, 25, 'Efa ho any Jerosalema anefa aho izao mba hanompo ny olona masina.', 'efa ho any jerosalema anefa aho izao mba hanompo ny olona masina.'),
  ('6ab25ca0594268bf85265f9c', '2026-09-22T10:46:56.314Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:56.314Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 15, 22, 'Izany koa no nahatonga ahy ho voasakana imbetsaka, ka tsy tonga tany aminareo.', 'izany koa no nahatonga ahy ho voasakana imbetsaka, ka tsy tonga tany aminareo.'),
  ('6ab25ca0594268bf85265f91', '2026-09-22T10:46:56.314Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:56.314Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 15, 11, 'Dia izao koa: “Derao i Jehovah, ry firenena rehetra, ary hidera azy anie ny vahoaka rehetra!”', 'dia izao koa: “derao i jehovah, ry firenena rehetra, ary hidera azy anie ny vahoaka rehetra!”'),
  ('6ab25ca0594268bf85265f8e', '2026-09-22T10:46:56.314Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:56.314Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 15, 8, 'Ary lazaiko aminareo fa lasa mpanompon’izay voafora i Kristy mba hampisehoana hoe milaza ny marina Andriamanitra, ary mba hanaporofoana hoe azo atokisana ilay fampanantenana nataony tamin’ny razamben’izy ireo.', 'ary lazaiko aminareo fa lasa mpanompon’izay voafora i kristy mba hampisehoana hoe milaza ny marina andriamanitra, ary mba hanaporofoana hoe azo atokisana ilay fampanantenana nataony tamin’ny razamben’izy ireo.'),
  ('6ab25ca0594268bf85265fa0', '2026-09-22T10:46:56.314Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:56.314Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 15, 26, 'Fa nahafinaritra an’ireo rahalahy any Makedonia sy atỳ Akaia ny nanome ny fananany, mba hanampiana an’izay mahantra amin’ny olona masina any Jerosalema.', 'fa nahafinaritra an’ireo rahalahy any makedonia sy atỳ akaia ny nanome ny fananany, mba hanampiana an’izay mahantra amin’ny olona masina any jerosalema.'),
  ('6ab25ca0092c9c51506d7833', '2026-09-22T10:46:56.879Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:56.879Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 16, 24, '* ——', '* ——'),
  ('6ab25ca0092c9c51506d7820', '2026-09-22T10:46:56.879Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:56.879Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 16, 5, 'Mampamangy any amin’ilay fiangonana mivory ao an-tranon’izy mivady. Mampamangy any amin’i Epaineto malalako, ilay voaloham-bokatra tany Azia ho an’i Kristy.', 'mampamangy any amin’ilay fiangonana mivory ao an-tranon’izy mivady. mampamangy any amin’i epaineto malalako, ilay voaloham-bokatra tany azia ho an’i kristy.'),
  ('6ab25ca0092c9c51506d781d', '2026-09-22T10:46:56.879Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:56.879Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 16, 2, 'Mba raiso tsara izy araka izay mendrika handraisana ny olona masina, satria mpiray finoana aminareo ao amin’ny Tompo izy. Mba ampio koa izy amin’izay zavatra ilainy. Mpiaro olona maro mantsy izy, sady mpiaro ahy koa.', 'mba raiso tsara izy araka izay mendrika handraisana ny olona masina, satria mpiray finoana aminareo ao amin’ny tompo izy. mba ampio koa izy amin’izay zavatra ilainy. mpiaro olona maro mantsy izy, sady mpiaro ahy koa.'),
  ('6ab25ca0092c9c51506d782d', '2026-09-22T10:46:56.879Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:56.879Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 16, 18, 'Fa tsy mpanompon’i Kristy Tompontsika ny olona hoatr’ireny, fa mpanompon’ny kibony ihany. Manao teny malefaka sy mandokadoka olona izy ireny mba hamitahana an’izay olona tsotra be.', 'fa tsy mpanompon’i kristy tompontsika ny olona hoatr’ireny, fa mpanompon’ny kibony ihany. manao teny malefaka sy mandokadoka olona izy ireny mba hamitahana an’izay olona tsotra be.'),
  ('6ab25ca0092c9c51506d7826', '2026-09-22T10:46:56.879Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:56.879Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 16, 11, 'Mampamangy any amin’i Herodiona havako. Mampamangy any amin’ny ankohonan’i Narsisy izay ao amin’ny Tompo.', 'mampamangy any amin’i herodiona havako. mampamangy any amin’ny ankohonan’i narsisy izay ao amin’ny tompo.'),
  ('6ab25ca0092c9c51506d782e', '2026-09-22T10:46:56.879Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:56.879Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 16, 19, 'Efa tsikaritry ny rehetra fa mankatò ianareo, ka mahafaly ahy ianareo. Tiako anefa ianareo raha kinga saina amin’ny zavatra tsara, fa bado kosa amin’ny zavatra ratsy.', 'efa tsikaritry ny rehetra fa mankatò ianareo, ka mahafaly ahy ianareo. tiako anefa ianareo raha kinga saina amin’ny zavatra tsara, fa bado kosa amin’ny zavatra ratsy.'),
  ('6ab25ca0092c9c51506d7822', '2026-09-22T10:46:56.879Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:56.879Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 16, 7, 'Mampamangy any amin’i Androniko sy Jonia, havako sy niara-nigadra tamiko. Fantatry ny apostoly tsara izy ireo sady efa tafaray amin’i Kristy talohako.', 'mampamangy any amin’i androniko sy jonia, havako sy niara-nigadra tamiko. fantatry ny apostoly tsara izy ireo sady efa tafaray amin’i kristy talohako.'),
  ('6ab25ca0092c9c51506d781e', '2026-09-22T10:46:56.879Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:56.879Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 16, 3, 'Mampamangy any amin’i Priska sy Akoila, mpiara-miasa amiko amin’ny asan’i Kristy Jesosy.', 'mampamangy any amin’i priska sy akoila, mpiara-miasa amiko amin’ny asan’i kristy jesosy.'),
  ('6ab25ca0092c9c51506d7824', '2026-09-22T10:46:56.879Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:56.879Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 16, 9, 'Mampamangy any amin’i Orbano, mpiara-miasa amintsika amin’ny asan’i Kristy, sy Staky malalako.', 'mampamangy any amin’i orbano, mpiara-miasa amintsika amin’ny asan’i kristy, sy staky malalako.'),
  ('6ab25ca0092c9c51506d782c', '2026-09-22T10:46:56.879Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:56.879Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 16, 17, 'Mampirisika anareo aho, ry rahalahy, mba hanara-maso an’izay mampisy fisaratsarahana sy mahatonga ny hafa hiala amin’ny finoana. Mifanohitra amin’ny fampianarana efa henonareo mantsy izany ataony izany, ka halaviro izy ireny.', 'mampirisika anareo aho, ry rahalahy, mba hanara-maso an’izay mampisy fisaratsarahana sy mahatonga ny hafa hiala amin’ny finoana. mifanohitra amin’ny fampianarana efa henonareo mantsy izany ataony izany, ka halaviro izy ireny.'),
  ('6ab25ca0092c9c51506d7827', '2026-09-22T10:46:56.879Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:56.879Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 16, 12, 'Mampamangy any amin’i Tryfena sy Tryfosa, vehivavy miasa mafy ao amin’ny Tompo. Mampamangy any amin’i Persy anabavy malalantsika, fa niasa mafy tao amin’ny Tompo izy.', 'mampamangy any amin’i tryfena sy tryfosa, vehivavy miasa mafy ao amin’ny tompo. mampamangy any amin’i persy anabavy malalantsika, fa niasa mafy tao amin’ny tompo izy.'),
  ('6ab25ca0092c9c51506d782b', '2026-09-22T10:46:56.879Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:56.879Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 16, 16, 'Mifampiarahabà amin’ny oroka masina. Manao mampamangy anareo daholo ny fiangonan’i Kristy.', 'mifampiarahabà amin’ny oroka masina. manao mampamangy anareo daholo ny fiangonan’i kristy.'),
  ('6ab25ca0092c9c51506d7832', '2026-09-22T10:46:56.879Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:56.879Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 16, 23, 'Mampamangy, hono, ianareo, hoy i Gaio, mpampiantrano ahy sy mpampiantrano ny fiangonana manontolo. Mampamangy, hono, ianareo, hoy i Erasto, mpitahiry ny volan’ny tanàna, sy Koarto rahalahiny.', 'mampamangy, hono, ianareo, hoy i gaio, mpampiantrano ahy sy mpampiantrano ny fiangonana manontolo. mampamangy, hono, ianareo, hoy i erasto, mpitahiry ny volan’ny tanàna, sy koarto rahalahiny.'),
  ('6ab25ca0092c9c51506d7829', '2026-09-22T10:46:56.879Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:56.879Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 16, 14, 'Mampamangy any amin’i Asynkrito, Flegona, Hermesy, Patroba, sy Herma, ary ny rahalahy miaraka amin’izy ireo.', 'mampamangy any amin’i asynkrito, flegona, hermesy, patroba, sy herma, ary ny rahalahy miaraka amin’izy ireo.'),
  ('6ab25ca0092c9c51506d7823', '2026-09-22T10:46:56.879Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:56.879Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 16, 8, 'Mampamangy any amin’i Ampliato, malalako ao amin’ny Tompo.', 'mampamangy any amin’i ampliato, malalako ao amin’ny tompo.'),
  ('6ab25ca0092c9c51506d782f', '2026-09-22T10:46:56.879Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:56.879Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 16, 20, 'Ary tsy ho ela ilay Andriamanitry ny fiadanana dia hanorotoro an’i Satana eo ambany tongotrareo. Enga anie ianareo hanehoan’i Jesosy Tompontsika hatsaram-panahy miavaka!', 'ary tsy ho ela ilay andriamanitry ny fiadanana dia hanorotoro an’i satana eo ambany tongotrareo. enga anie ianareo hanehoan’i jesosy tompontsika hatsaram-panahy miavaka!'),
  ('6ab25ca0092c9c51506d7821', '2026-09-22T10:46:56.879Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:56.879Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 16, 6, 'Mampamangy any amin’i Maria, ilay niasa mafy ho anareo.', 'mampamangy any amin’i maria, ilay niasa mafy ho anareo.'),
  ('6ab25ca0092c9c51506d781f', '2026-09-22T10:46:56.879Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:56.879Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 16, 4, 'Nanao vivery ny ainy hamonjena ahy mantsy izy mivady ireo. Tsy izaho ihany no misaotra azy, fa ny fiangonana rehetra any amin’ny hafa firenena koa.', 'nanao vivery ny ainy hamonjena ahy mantsy izy mivady ireo. tsy izaho ihany no misaotra azy, fa ny fiangonana rehetra any amin’ny hafa firenena koa.'),
  ('6ab25ca0092c9c51506d7835', '2026-09-22T10:46:56.879Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:56.879Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 16, 26, 'Efa naseho io zava-miafina io izao, sady efa nampahafantarina tany amin’ny firenena rehetra, tamin’ny alalan’ny faminaniana ao amin’ny Soratra Masina. Mifanaraka amin’ny didin’ilay Andriamanitra mandrakizay izany, satria tiany hino sy hankatò azy ny olona.', 'efa naseho io zava-miafina io izao, sady efa nampahafantarina tany amin’ny firenena rehetra, tamin’ny alalan’ny faminaniana ao amin’ny soratra masina. mifanaraka amin’ny didin’ilay andriamanitra mandrakizay izany, satria tiany hino sy hankatò azy ny olona.'),
  ('6ab25ca0092c9c51506d7825', '2026-09-22T10:46:56.879Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:56.879Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 16, 10, 'Mampamangy any amin’i Apela, ilay ankasitrahan’i Kristy. Mampamangy any amin’ny ankohonan’i Aristobolo.', 'mampamangy any amin’i apela, ilay ankasitrahan’i kristy. mampamangy any amin’ny ankohonan’i aristobolo.'),
  ('6ab25ca0092c9c51506d7836', '2026-09-22T10:46:56.879Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:56.879Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 16, 27, 'Homena an’Andriamanitra, ilay hany manam-pahendrena, anie ny voninahitra mandrakizay amin’ny alalan’i Jesosy Kristy! Amena.', 'homena an’andriamanitra, ilay hany manam-pahendrena, anie ny voninahitra mandrakizay amin’ny alalan’i jesosy kristy! amena.'),
  ('6ab25ca0092c9c51506d7831', '2026-09-22T10:46:56.879Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:56.879Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 16, 22, 'Izaho, Tertio, izay nanao an-tsoratra an’ity taratasy ity, dia manao mampamangy anareo ao amin’ny Tompo.', 'izaho, tertio, izay nanao an-tsoratra an’ity taratasy ity, dia manao mampamangy anareo ao amin’ny tompo.'),
  ('6ab25ca0092c9c51506d7834', '2026-09-22T10:46:56.879Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:56.879Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 16, 25, 'Hita amin’ny vaovao tsara toriko sy ny hafatra momba an’i Jesosy Kristy fa afaka manampy anareo ho mafy orina Andriamanitra. Izany vaovao tsara izany dia mifanaraka amin’ilay zava-miafina masina izay nafenina hatry ny ela be, fa efa naharihary izao.', 'hita amin’ny vaovao tsara toriko sy ny hafatra momba an’i jesosy kristy fa afaka manampy anareo ho mafy orina andriamanitra. izany vaovao tsara izany dia mifanaraka amin’ilay zava-miafina masina izay nafenina hatry ny ela be, fa efa naharihary izao.'),
  ('6ab25ca0092c9c51506d7828', '2026-09-22T10:46:56.879Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:56.879Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 16, 13, 'Mampamangy any amin’i Rofosy, ilay voafidin’ny Tompo, sy any amin’ny reniny sady reniko.', 'mampamangy any amin’i rofosy, ilay voafidin’ny tompo, sy any amin’ny reniny sady reniko.'),
  ('6ab25ca0092c9c51506d7830', '2026-09-22T10:46:56.879Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:56.879Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 16, 21, 'Mampamangy, hono, ianareo, hoy i Timoty, mpiara-miasa amiko, sy Losio sy Jasona ary Sosipatro, izay samy havako.', 'mampamangy, hono, ianareo, hoy i timoty, mpiara-miasa amiko, sy losio sy jasona ary sosipatro, izay samy havako.'),
  ('6ab25ca0092c9c51506d782a', '2026-09-22T10:46:56.879Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:56.879Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 16, 15, 'Mampamangy any amin’i Filologo sy Jolia, Nerea sy ny anabaviny, sy Olympa, ary ny olona masina rehetra miaraka amin’izy ireo.', 'mampamangy any amin’i filologo sy jolia, nerea sy ny anabaviny, sy olympa, ary ny olona masina rehetra miaraka amin’izy ireo.'),
  ('6ab25ca0092c9c51506d781c', '2026-09-22T10:46:56.879Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:56.879Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Romanina', 45, 16, 1, 'Ampahafantariko anareo i Foiby anabavintsika, mpanompo ao amin’ny fiangonana any Kenkrea.', 'ampahafantariko anareo i foiby anabavintsika, mpanompo ao amin’ny fiangonana any kenkrea.'),
  ('6ab25ca27898efd0744691cb', '2026-09-22T10:46:58.125Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:58.125Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 1, 22, 'Fa mangataka famantarana ny Jiosy, ary mitady fahendrena ny Grika.', 'fa mangataka famantarana ny jiosy, ary mitady fahendrena ny grika.'),
  ('6ab25ca27898efd0744691cc', '2026-09-22T10:46:58.125Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:58.125Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 1, 23, 'Isika kosa mitory an’i Kristy novonoina teo amin’ny tsato-kazo, izay zavatra manafintohina an’ireo Jiosy ary hadalana amin’ny hafa firenena.', 'isika kosa mitory an’i kristy novonoina teo amin’ny tsato-kazo, izay zavatra manafintohina an’ireo jiosy ary hadalana amin’ny hafa firenena.'),
  ('6ab25ca27898efd0744691c3', '2026-09-22T10:46:58.125Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:58.125Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 1, 14, 'Misaotra an’Andriamanitra aho fa tsy nisy nataoko batisa ianareo, afa-tsy i Krispo sy Gaio,', 'misaotra an’andriamanitra aho fa tsy nisy nataoko batisa ianareo, afa-tsy i krispo sy gaio,'),
  ('6ab25ca27898efd0744691bd', '2026-09-22T10:46:58.125Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:58.125Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 1, 8, 'Hanampy anareo ho mafy orina hatramin’ny farany koa Andriamanitra, mba tsy hisy antony hiampangana anareo amin’ny andron’i Jesosy Kristy Tompontsika.', 'hanampy anareo ho mafy orina hatramin’ny farany koa andriamanitra, mba tsy hisy antony hiampangana anareo amin’ny andron’i jesosy kristy tompontsika.'),
  ('6ab25ca27898efd0744691b9', '2026-09-22T10:46:58.125Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:58.125Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 1, 4, 'Misaotra an’ilay Andriamanitro foana aho noho ny aminareo, satria nanehoany hatsaram-panahy miavaka tamin’ny alalan’i Kristy Jesosy ianareo.', 'misaotra an’ilay andriamanitro foana aho noho ny aminareo, satria nanehoany hatsaram-panahy miavaka tamin’ny alalan’i kristy jesosy ianareo.'),
  ('6ab25ca27898efd0744691c9', '2026-09-22T10:46:58.125Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:58.125Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 1, 20, 'Aiza àry ny olon-kendry? Aiza ny mpanora-dalàna? Aiza ny mpiady hevitra eto amin’izao tontolo izao? Tsy novan’Andriamanitra ho hadalana ve ny fahendren’izao tontolo izao?', 'aiza àry ny olon-kendry? aiza ny mpanora-dalàna? aiza ny mpiady hevitra eto amin’izao tontolo izao? tsy novan’andriamanitra ho hadalana ve ny fahendren’izao tontolo izao?'),
  ('6ab25ca27898efd0744691c5', '2026-09-22T10:46:58.125Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:58.125Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 1, 16, 'Eny e! Nataoko batisa koa ny ankohonan’i Stefanasy. Tsy tadidiko raha mbola nisy hafa nataoko batisa koa na tsia.', 'eny e! nataoko batisa koa ny ankohonan’i stefanasy. tsy tadidiko raha mbola nisy hafa nataoko batisa koa na tsia.'),
  ('6ab25ca27898efd0744691c2', '2026-09-22T10:46:58.125Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:58.125Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 1, 13, 'Fa angaha voazarazara i Kristy? I Paoly angaha no novonoina teo amin’ny tsato-kazo ho anareo? Sa natao batisa tamin’ny anaran’i Paoly ianareo?', 'fa angaha voazarazara i kristy? i paoly angaha no novonoina teo amin’ny tsato-kazo ho anareo? sa natao batisa tamin’ny anaran’i paoly ianareo?'),
  ('6ab25ca27898efd0744691ba', '2026-09-22T10:46:58.125Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:58.125Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 1, 5, 'Noho ianareo tafaray amin’i Kristy mantsy, dia lasa manan-karena amin’ny zava-drehetra ianareo, anisan’izany ny hoe lasa mahay mitory sy manana fahalalana feno ianareo,', 'noho ianareo tafaray amin’i kristy mantsy, dia lasa manan-karena amin’ny zava-drehetra ianareo, anisan’izany ny hoe lasa mahay mitory sy manana fahalalana feno ianareo,'),
  ('6ab25ca27898efd0744691b6', '2026-09-22T10:46:58.125Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:58.125Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 1, 1, 'Avy amin’i Paoly, ilay voantso ho apostolin’i Kristy Jesosy noho ny sitrapon’Andriamanitra, sy Sostena rahalahintsika.', 'avy amin’i paoly, ilay voantso ho apostolin’i kristy jesosy noho ny sitrapon’andriamanitra, sy sostena rahalahintsika.'),
  ('6ab25ca27898efd0744691ce', '2026-09-22T10:46:58.125Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:58.125Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 1, 25, 'Izay toa hadalana avy amin’Andriamanitra mantsy dia mbola hendry noho ny olona, ary izay toa fahalemena avy amin’Andriamanitra dia mbola mahery noho ny olona.', 'izay toa hadalana avy amin’andriamanitra mantsy dia mbola hendry noho ny olona, ary izay toa fahalemena avy amin’andriamanitra dia mbola mahery noho ny olona.'),
  ('6ab25ca27898efd0744691c7', '2026-09-22T10:46:58.125Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:58.125Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 1, 18, 'Fa amin’ireo ho ringana, dia hadalana ny fampianarana momba ny hazo fijaliana, fa amintsika izay hovonjena kosa, dia herin’Andriamanitra izany.', 'fa amin’ireo ho ringana, dia hadalana ny fampianarana momba ny hazo fijaliana, fa amintsika izay hovonjena kosa, dia herin’andriamanitra izany.'),
  ('6ab25ca27898efd0744691c1', '2026-09-22T10:46:58.125Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:58.125Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 1, 12, 'Izao no tiako holazaina: Misy milaza hoe “Izaho an’i Paoly”, na hoe “Izaho an’i Apolosy”, ary ny hafa indray miteny hoe “Izaho an’i Kefasy”, na “Izaho an’i Kristy.”', 'izao no tiako holazaina: misy milaza hoe “izaho an’i paoly”, na hoe “izaho an’i apolosy”, ary ny hafa indray miteny hoe “izaho an’i kefasy”, na “izaho an’i kristy.”'),
  ('6ab25ca27898efd0744691bc', '2026-09-22T10:46:58.125Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:58.125Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 1, 7, 'Noho izany, dia tsy misy mihitsy fanomezana tsy anananareo, amin’izao ianareo miandry mafy izao hoe rahoviana no haharihary i Jesosy Kristy Tompontsika.', 'noho izany, dia tsy misy mihitsy fanomezana tsy anananareo, amin’izao ianareo miandry mafy izao hoe rahoviana no haharihary i jesosy kristy tompontsika.'),
  ('6ab25ca27898efd0744691b8', '2026-09-22T10:46:58.125Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:58.125Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 1, 3, 'Enga anie ilay Andriamanitra Raintsika sy Jesosy Kristy Tompo mba haneho hatsaram-panahy miavaka aminareo sady hanome anareo fiadanana!', 'enga anie ilay andriamanitra raintsika sy jesosy kristy tompo mba haneho hatsaram-panahy miavaka aminareo sady hanome anareo fiadanana!'),
  ('6ab25ca27898efd0744691cd', '2026-09-22T10:46:58.125Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:58.125Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 1, 24, 'Amin’izay voantso kosa anefa, na Jiosy na Grika, dia amin’ny alalan’i Kristy no isehoan’ny herin’Andriamanitra sy ny fahendren’Andriamanitra.', 'amin’izay voantso kosa anefa, na jiosy na grika, dia amin’ny alalan’i kristy no isehoan’ny herin’andriamanitra sy ny fahendren’andriamanitra.'),
  ('6ab25ca27898efd0744691c8', '2026-09-22T10:46:58.125Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:58.125Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 1, 19, 'Fa voasoratra hoe: “Hofoanako ny fahendren’ny olon-kendry, ary holaviko ny fahiratan-tsain’ny mahira-tsaina.”', 'fa voasoratra hoe: “hofoanako ny fahendren’ny olon-kendry, ary holaviko ny fahiratan-tsain’ny mahira-tsaina.”'),
  ('6ab25ca27898efd0744691ca', '2026-09-22T10:46:58.125Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:58.125Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 1, 21, 'Fa tsy mahalala an’Andriamanitra izao tontolo izao satria mihevi-tena ho manam-pahendrena. Nasehon’Andriamanitra anefa ny fahendreny, ka hitany hoe mety raha amin’ny alalan’ilay hafatra torinay, izay eritreretin’ny olona hoe hadalana, no hamonjena an’izay mino.', 'fa tsy mahalala an’andriamanitra izao tontolo izao satria mihevi-tena ho manam-pahendrena. nasehon’andriamanitra anefa ny fahendreny, ka hitany hoe mety raha amin’ny alalan’ilay hafatra torinay, izay eritreretin’ny olona hoe hadalana, no hamonjena an’izay mino.'),
  ('6ab25ca27898efd0744691c0', '2026-09-22T10:46:58.125Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:58.125Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 1, 11, 'Nisy olona avy amin’ny ankohonan’i Kloa mantsy, ry rahalahiko, niresaka momba anareo tamiko hoe misy aminareo, hono, tsy mifanaraka.', 'nisy olona avy amin’ny ankohonan’i kloa mantsy, ry rahalahiko, niresaka momba anareo tamiko hoe misy aminareo, hono, tsy mifanaraka.'),
  ('6ab25ca27898efd0744691c6', '2026-09-22T10:46:58.125Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:58.125Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 1, 17, 'Fa tsy naniraka ahy hanao batisa i Kristy, fa hitory ny vaovao tsara. Tsy nampiseho fahendren’olombelona anefa aho rehefa nitory, sao lasa tsy hisy hilana azy ny hazo fijalian’i Kristy.', 'fa tsy naniraka ahy hanao batisa i kristy, fa hitory ny vaovao tsara. tsy nampiseho fahendren’olombelona anefa aho rehefa nitory, sao lasa tsy hisy hilana azy ny hazo fijalian’i kristy.'),
  ('6ab25ca27898efd0744691bf', '2026-09-22T10:46:58.125Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:58.125Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 1, 10, 'Mampirisika anareo aho, ry rahalahy, amin’ny anaran’i Jesosy Kristy Tompontsika, mba hifanara-kevitra ianareo amin’izay lazainareo. Aza avela hisy fisaratsarahana eo aminareo, fa miezaha kosa hiray hina tsara ka hiray saina sy hiray hevitra.', 'mampirisika anareo aho, ry rahalahy, amin’ny anaran’i jesosy kristy tompontsika, mba hifanara-kevitra ianareo amin’izay lazainareo. aza avela hisy fisaratsarahana eo aminareo, fa miezaha kosa hiray hina tsara ka hiray saina sy hiray hevitra.'),
  ('6ab25ca27898efd0744691c4', '2026-09-22T10:46:58.125Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:58.125Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 1, 15, 'mba tsy hisy hilaza hoe natao batisa tamin’ny anarako ianareo.', 'mba tsy hisy hilaza hoe natao batisa tamin’ny anarako ianareo.'),
  ('6ab25ca27898efd0744691be', '2026-09-22T10:46:58.125Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:58.125Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 1, 9, 'Tsy mivadika amin’ny teniny Andriamanitra, izay niantso anareo mba hifandray akaiky amin’ny Zanany, dia i Jesosy Kristy Tompontsika.', 'tsy mivadika amin’ny teniny andriamanitra, izay niantso anareo mba hifandray akaiky amin’ny zanany, dia i jesosy kristy tompontsika.'),
  ('6ab25ca27898efd0744691bb', '2026-09-22T10:46:58.125Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:58.125Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 1, 6, 'satria natao mafy orina teo aminareo ny fitoriana momba an’i Kristy.', 'satria natao mafy orina teo aminareo ny fitoriana momba an’i kristy.'),
  ('6ab25ca27898efd0744691b7', '2026-09-22T10:46:58.125Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:58.125Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 1, 2, 'Ho an’ny fiangonan’Andriamanitra any Korinto, dia ianareo izay nohamasinina tao amin’i Kristy Jesosy sady voantso ho olona masina, ary ho an’izay rehetra miantso ny anaran’i Jesosy Kristy Tompontsika, na aiza na aiza, izay Tompon’izy ireo sady Tompontsika koa,', 'ho an’ny fiangonan’andriamanitra any korinto, dia ianareo izay nohamasinina tao amin’i kristy jesosy sady voantso ho olona masina, ary ho an’izay rehetra miantso ny anaran’i jesosy kristy tompontsika, na aiza na aiza, izay tompon’izy ireo sady tompontsika koa,'),
  ('6ab25ca27898efd0744691d4', '2026-09-22T10:46:58.126Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:58.126Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 1, 31, 'mba ho araka ilay voasoratra hoe: “Izay mirehareha, dia i Jehovah no tokony hataony rehareha.”', 'mba ho araka ilay voasoratra hoe: “izay mirehareha, dia i jehovah no tokony hataony rehareha.”'),
  ('6ab25ca27898efd0744691d2', '2026-09-22T10:46:58.126Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:58.126Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 1, 29, 'amin’izay dia tsy hisy olona hirehareha eo imason’Andriamanitra.', 'amin’izay dia tsy hisy olona hirehareha eo imason’andriamanitra.'),
  ('6ab25ca27898efd0744691d3', '2026-09-22T10:46:58.126Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:58.126Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 1, 30, 'Fa izy no nahatonga anareo ho tafaray amin’i Kristy Jesosy, izay nampahafantatra antsika ny fahendren’Andriamanitra sy ny fahamarinany, sady nahatonga antsika ho masina, ary nanafaka antsika tamin’ny alalan’ny vidim-panavotana,', 'fa izy no nahatonga anareo ho tafaray amin’i kristy jesosy, izay nampahafantatra antsika ny fahendren’andriamanitra sy ny fahamarinany, sady nahatonga antsika ho masina, ary nanafaka antsika tamin’ny alalan’ny vidim-panavotana,');
INSERT INTO "bible_verses" ("id", "created_date", "updated_date", "created_by_id", "created_by", "translation", "book", "bookOrder", "chapter", "verse", "text", "normalizedText") VALUES
  ('6ab25ca27898efd0744691d1', '2026-09-22T10:46:58.126Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:58.126Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 1, 28, 'Ary nifidy ny zavatra tsy misy dikany amin’izao tontolo izao sy ny zavatra atao tsinontsinona Andriamanitra, dia izay zavatra tsy misy, mba hanafoanany an’izay misy,', 'ary nifidy ny zavatra tsy misy dikany amin’izao tontolo izao sy ny zavatra atao tsinontsinona andriamanitra, dia izay zavatra tsy misy, mba hanafoanany an’izay misy,'),
  ('6ab25ca27898efd0744691cf', '2026-09-22T10:46:58.126Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:58.126Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 1, 26, 'Ary hitanareo, ry rahalahy, fa rehefa niantso anareo izy, dia tsy betsaka taminareo no hendry araka ny nofo, tsy betsaka no mahery, ary tsy betsaka no avo razana.', 'ary hitanareo, ry rahalahy, fa rehefa niantso anareo izy, dia tsy betsaka taminareo no hendry araka ny nofo, tsy betsaka no mahery, ary tsy betsaka no avo razana.'),
  ('6ab25ca27898efd0744691d0', '2026-09-22T10:46:58.126Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:58.126Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 1, 27, 'Nifidy ny zavatra adala amin’izao tontolo izao kosa Andriamanitra mba hampahamenatra ny olon-kendry. Ary nifidy ny zavatra malemy amin’izao tontolo izao Andriamanitra mba hampahamenatra ny zavatra mahery.', 'nifidy ny zavatra adala amin’izao tontolo izao kosa andriamanitra mba hampahamenatra ny olon-kendry. ary nifidy ny zavatra malemy amin’izao tontolo izao andriamanitra mba hampahamenatra ny zavatra mahery.'),
  ('6ab25ca2416d2ab934a4bbfc', '2026-09-22T10:46:58.590Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:58.590Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 2, 1, 'Koa rehefa tonga tany aminareo aho, ry rahalahy, dia tsy nampiasa teny mipoapoaka be na niseho ho be fahendrena rehefa nitory taminareo ny zava-miafina masin’Andriamanitra.', 'koa rehefa tonga tany aminareo aho, ry rahalahy, dia tsy nampiasa teny mipoapoaka be na niseho ho be fahendrena rehefa nitory taminareo ny zava-miafina masin’andriamanitra.'),
  ('6ab25ca2416d2ab934a4bc02', '2026-09-22T10:46:58.591Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:58.591Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 2, 7, 'Ny resahintsika kosa, dia ny momba ny fahendren’Andriamanitra ao amin’ny zava-miafina masina, izany hoe ilay fahendrena nafenina. Efa nomanin’Andriamanitra mialoha izy io, talohan’ny nisian’ny tontolon’ny olombelona, mba hahazoantsika voninahitra.', 'ny resahintsika kosa, dia ny momba ny fahendren’andriamanitra ao amin’ny zava-miafina masina, izany hoe ilay fahendrena nafenina. efa nomanin’andriamanitra mialoha izy io, talohan’ny nisian’ny tontolon’ny olombelona, mba hahazoantsika voninahitra.'),
  ('6ab25ca2416d2ab934a4bbfe', '2026-09-22T10:46:58.591Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:58.591Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 2, 3, 'Nalemy sy natahotra ary nangovitra be aho tamin’izaho tonga tany aminareo.', 'nalemy sy natahotra ary nangovitra be aho tamin’izaho tonga tany aminareo.'),
  ('6ab25ca2416d2ab934a4bc0b', '2026-09-22T10:46:58.591Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:58.591Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 2, 16, 'Fa “iza no lasa mahafantatra ny sain’i Jehovah, ka afaka mampianatra azy?” Isika kosa anefa manana ny sain’i Kristy.', 'fa “iza no lasa mahafantatra ny sain’i jehovah, ka afaka mampianatra azy?” isika kosa anefa manana ny sain’i kristy.'),
  ('6ab25ca2416d2ab934a4bc05', '2026-09-22T10:46:58.591Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:58.591Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 2, 10, 'Fa tamintsika no nampihariharian’Andriamanitra an’izany tamin’ny alalan’ny fanahiny. Ny fanahy mantsy mikaroka ao anatin’ny zava-drehetra, na dia ny zava-dalin’Andriamanitra aza.', 'fa tamintsika no nampihariharian’andriamanitra an’izany tamin’ny alalan’ny fanahiny. ny fanahy mantsy mikaroka ao anatin’ny zava-drehetra, na dia ny zava-dalin’andriamanitra aza.'),
  ('6ab25ca2416d2ab934a4bc01', '2026-09-22T10:46:58.591Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:58.591Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 2, 6, 'Ary miresaka momba ny fahendrena amin’izay matotra isika, saingy tsy ny fahendrena eto amin’izao tontolo izao na ny an’ny mpitondrany izay tsy hisy intsony.', 'ary miresaka momba ny fahendrena amin’izay matotra isika, saingy tsy ny fahendrena eto amin’izao tontolo izao na ny an’ny mpitondrany izay tsy hisy intsony.'),
  ('6ab25ca2416d2ab934a4bc09', '2026-09-22T10:46:58.591Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:58.591Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 2, 14, 'Ny olona araka ny nofo anefa dia tsy manaiky an’izay zavatra avy amin’ny fanahin’Andriamanitra, satria hadalana izany aminy. Ary tsy afaka ny hahafantatra an’izany izy, satria ilaina ny fanahin’Andriamanitra rehefa mandinika an’izany.', 'ny olona araka ny nofo anefa dia tsy manaiky an’izay zavatra avy amin’ny fanahin’andriamanitra, satria hadalana izany aminy. ary tsy afaka ny hahafantatra an’izany izy, satria ilaina ny fanahin’andriamanitra rehefa mandinika an’izany.'),
  ('6ab25ca2416d2ab934a4bc00', '2026-09-22T10:46:58.591Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:58.591Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 2, 5, 'Amin’izay dia tsy ny fahendren’olombelona no hahatonga anareo hanam-pinoana, fa ny herin’Andriamanitra.', 'amin’izay dia tsy ny fahendren’olombelona no hahatonga anareo hanam-pinoana, fa ny herin’andriamanitra.'),
  ('6ab25ca2416d2ab934a4bc08', '2026-09-22T10:46:58.591Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:58.591Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 2, 13, 'Miresaka an’izany zavatra izany koa isika, nefa tsy mampiasa teny ampianarin’olon-kendry, fa mampiasa teny ampianarin’ny fanahy. Teny araka ny fanahy mantsy no anazavantsika zavatra araka ny fanahy.', 'miresaka an’izany zavatra izany koa isika, nefa tsy mampiasa teny ampianarin’olon-kendry, fa mampiasa teny ampianarin’ny fanahy. teny araka ny fanahy mantsy no anazavantsika zavatra araka ny fanahy.'),
  ('6ab25ca2416d2ab934a4bc03', '2026-09-22T10:46:58.591Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:58.591Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 2, 8, 'Tsy nisy nahafantatra an’izany fahendrena izany ny mpitondra teto amin’izao tontolo izao. Raha fantatr’izy ireo mantsy izany, dia tsy ho novonoiny ny Tompo be voninahitra.', 'tsy nisy nahafantatra an’izany fahendrena izany ny mpitondra teto amin’izao tontolo izao. raha fantatr’izy ireo mantsy izany, dia tsy ho novonoiny ny tompo be voninahitra.'),
  ('6ab25ca2416d2ab934a4bbfd', '2026-09-22T10:46:58.591Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:58.591Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 2, 2, 'Fa rehefa tany aminareo aho, dia tapa-kevitra ny tsy hiresaka zavatra hafa mihitsy, afa-tsy ny momba an’i Jesosy Kristy sy ny namonoana azy teo amin’ny tsato-kazo.', 'fa rehefa tany aminareo aho, dia tapa-kevitra ny tsy hiresaka zavatra hafa mihitsy, afa-tsy ny momba an’i jesosy kristy sy ny namonoana azy teo amin’ny tsato-kazo.'),
  ('6ab25ca2416d2ab934a4bc06', '2026-09-22T10:46:58.591Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:58.591Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 2, 11, 'Fa iza no mahafantatra ny mombamomba ny olona afa-tsy ny tenany ihany? Hoatr’izany koa fa tsy misy mahafantatra ny mombamomba an’Andriamanitra, afa-tsy ny fanahin’Andriamanitra ihany.', 'fa iza no mahafantatra ny mombamomba ny olona afa-tsy ny tenany ihany? hoatr’izany koa fa tsy misy mahafantatra ny mombamomba an’andriamanitra, afa-tsy ny fanahin’andriamanitra ihany.'),
  ('6ab25ca2416d2ab934a4bc0a', '2026-09-22T10:46:58.591Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:58.591Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 2, 15, 'Ny olona araka ny fanahy kosa mandinika ny zava-drehetra, nefa tsy misy olona mandinika azy.', 'ny olona araka ny fanahy kosa mandinika ny zava-drehetra, nefa tsy misy olona mandinika azy.'),
  ('6ab25ca2416d2ab934a4bbff', '2026-09-22T10:46:58.591Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:58.591Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 2, 4, 'Ary rehefa niresaka sy nitory taminareo aho, dia tsy nampiasa tenim-pahendrena maharesy lahatra, fa nampiseho kosa hoe mahery ny fanahy masina.', 'ary rehefa niresaka sy nitory taminareo aho, dia tsy nampiasa tenim-pahendrena maharesy lahatra, fa nampiseho kosa hoe mahery ny fanahy masina.'),
  ('6ab25ca2416d2ab934a4bc07', '2026-09-22T10:46:58.591Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:58.591Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 2, 12, 'Isika tsy nandray ny toe-tsain’izao tontolo izao, fa ny fanahy avy amin’Andriamanitra, mba hahafantarantsika ny zavatra nomen’Andriamanitra antsika noho izy tsara fanahy.', 'isika tsy nandray ny toe-tsain’izao tontolo izao, fa ny fanahy avy amin’andriamanitra, mba hahafantarantsika ny zavatra nomen’andriamanitra antsika noho izy tsara fanahy.'),
  ('6ab25ca2416d2ab934a4bc04', '2026-09-22T10:46:58.591Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:58.591Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 2, 9, 'Fa araka ny voasoratra hoe: “Mbola tsy hitan’ny maso na henon’ny sofina, na nitsiry tao am-pon’ny olona ny zavatra nomanin’Andriamanitra ho an’izay tia azy.”', 'fa araka ny voasoratra hoe: “mbola tsy hitan’ny maso na henon’ny sofina, na nitsiry tao am-pon’ny olona ny zavatra nomanin’andriamanitra ho an’izay tia azy.”'),
  ('6ab25ca3bd0c4f40bd79b941', '2026-09-22T10:46:59.042Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:59.042Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 3, 23, 'Ianareo kosa an’i Kristy, ary i Kristy an’Andriamanitra.', 'ianareo kosa an’i kristy, ary i kristy an’andriamanitra.'),
  ('6ab25ca3bd0c4f40bd79b932', '2026-09-22T10:46:59.042Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:59.042Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 3, 8, 'Ary iray ihany ilay mamboly sy ilay manondraka, nefa samy hahazo ny valisoany avy izy, arakaraka ny asa mafy nataony.', 'ary iray ihany ilay mamboly sy ilay manondraka, nefa samy hahazo ny valisoany avy izy, arakaraka ny asa mafy nataony.'),
  ('6ab25ca3bd0c4f40bd79b930', '2026-09-22T10:46:59.042Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:59.042Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 3, 6, 'Izaho namboly, i Apolosy nanondraka, fa Andriamanitra kosa no tsy nitsahatra nampitombo.', 'izaho namboly, i apolosy nanondraka, fa andriamanitra kosa no tsy nitsahatra nampitombo.'),
  ('6ab25ca3bd0c4f40bd79b936', '2026-09-22T10:46:59.042Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:59.042Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 3, 12, 'Raha misy manorina amin’ny volamena, volafotsy, vatosoa, hazo, bozaka, na mololo eo ambonin’ilay fototra,', 'raha misy manorina amin’ny volamena, volafotsy, vatosoa, hazo, bozaka, na mololo eo ambonin’ilay fototra,'),
  ('6ab25ca3bd0c4f40bd79b92d', '2026-09-22T10:46:59.042Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:59.042Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 3, 3, 'fa mbola araka ny nofo ihany. Tsy olona araka ny nofo ve ianareo sady manao hoatran’ny ataon’ny olona eo amin’izao tontolo izao, raha mbola mifampialona sy mifamaly?', 'fa mbola araka ny nofo ihany. tsy olona araka ny nofo ve ianareo sady manao hoatran’ny ataon’ny olona eo amin’izao tontolo izao, raha mbola mifampialona sy mifamaly?'),
  ('6ab25ca3bd0c4f40bd79b92c', '2026-09-22T10:46:59.042Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:59.042Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 3, 2, 'Ronono no nomeko ho sakafonareo, fa tsy ventin-kanina, satria mbola tsy natanjaka tsara ianareo. Mbola tsy matanjaka tsara ihany anefa ianareo izao,', 'ronono no nomeko ho sakafonareo, fa tsy ventin-kanina, satria mbola tsy natanjaka tsara ianareo. mbola tsy matanjaka tsara ihany anefa ianareo izao,'),
  ('6ab25ca3bd0c4f40bd79b93c', '2026-09-22T10:46:59.042Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:59.042Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 3, 18, 'Aoka tsy hisy hamita-tena: Raha misy aminareo mihevi-tena ho hendry eto amin’izao tontolo izao, dia aoka izy ho adala, mba ho lasa hendry.', 'aoka tsy hisy hamita-tena: raha misy aminareo mihevi-tena ho hendry eto amin’izao tontolo izao, dia aoka izy ho adala, mba ho lasa hendry.'),
  ('6ab25ca3bd0c4f40bd79b92b', '2026-09-22T10:46:59.042Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:59.042Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 3, 1, 'Koa tsy afaka niresaka taminareo toy ny miresaka amin’ny olona araka ny fanahy aho, ry rahalahy, fa toy ny miresaka amin’ny olona araka ny nofo, toy ny miresaka amin’ny zaza ao amin’i Kristy.', 'koa tsy afaka niresaka taminareo toy ny miresaka amin’ny olona araka ny fanahy aho, ry rahalahy, fa toy ny miresaka amin’ny olona araka ny nofo, toy ny miresaka amin’ny zaza ao amin’i kristy.'),
  ('6ab25ca3bd0c4f40bd79b93d', '2026-09-22T10:46:59.042Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:59.042Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 3, 19, 'Amin’Andriamanitra mantsy dia hadalana ny fahendren’izao tontolo izao, fa voasoratra hoe: “Ny hafetsen’ny hendry ihany no amandrihany azy.”', 'amin’andriamanitra mantsy dia hadalana ny fahendren’izao tontolo izao, fa voasoratra hoe: “ny hafetsen’ny hendry ihany no amandrihany azy.”'),
  ('6ab25ca3bd0c4f40bd79b935', '2026-09-22T10:46:59.042Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:59.042Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 3, 11, 'Fa tsy misy afaka mametraka fototra hafa ankoatra an’izay efa napetraka, dia i Jesosy Kristy.', 'fa tsy misy afaka mametraka fototra hafa ankoatra an’izay efa napetraka, dia i jesosy kristy.'),
  ('6ab25ca3bd0c4f40bd79b931', '2026-09-22T10:46:59.042Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:59.042Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 3, 7, 'Tsy ilay mamboly na ilay manondraka àry no mendrika homena voninahitra, fa Andriamanitra izay mampitombo.', 'tsy ilay mamboly na ilay manondraka àry no mendrika homena voninahitra, fa andriamanitra izay mampitombo.'),
  ('6ab25ca3bd0c4f40bd79b937', '2026-09-22T10:46:59.042Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:59.042Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 3, 13, 'dia ho hita hoe hoatran’ny ahoana ny asan’ny tsirairay, rehefa tonga ny andro fisedrana. Fa hampiharihary an’izany ny afo, ka hampiseho hoe hoatran’ny ahoana ny asa nataon’ny tsirairay.', 'dia ho hita hoe hoatran’ny ahoana ny asan’ny tsirairay, rehefa tonga ny andro fisedrana. fa hampiharihary an’izany ny afo, ka hampiseho hoe hoatran’ny ahoana ny asa nataon’ny tsirairay.'),
  ('6ab25ca3bd0c4f40bd79b938', '2026-09-22T10:46:59.042Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:59.042Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 3, 14, 'Raha mbola eo ihany ny asa naorin’ny olona teo ambonin’ilay fototra, dia hahazo valisoa izy.', 'raha mbola eo ihany ny asa naorin’ny olona teo ambonin’ilay fototra, dia hahazo valisoa izy.'),
  ('6ab25ca3bd0c4f40bd79b934', '2026-09-22T10:46:59.042Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:59.042Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 3, 10, 'Noho ny hatsaram-panahy miavaka nasehon’Andriamanitra tamiko, dia nametraka fototra aho, hoatran’ny ataon’ny mpanao trano tena mahay, fa olon-kafa kosa no manorina eo ambonin’ilay fototra. Tokony hitandrina tsara foana anefa ny tsirairay hoe hoatran’ny ahoana ny zavatra aoriny eo ambonin’izany fototra izany.', 'noho ny hatsaram-panahy miavaka nasehon’andriamanitra tamiko, dia nametraka fototra aho, hoatran’ny ataon’ny mpanao trano tena mahay, fa olon-kafa kosa no manorina eo ambonin’ilay fototra. tokony hitandrina tsara foana anefa ny tsirairay hoe hoatran’ny ahoana ny zavatra aoriny eo ambonin’izany fototra izany.'),
  ('6ab25ca3bd0c4f40bd79b93a', '2026-09-22T10:46:59.042Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:59.042Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 3, 16, 'Tsy fantatrareo angaha fa ianareo no tempolin’Andriamanitra, ary ao anatinareo ny fanahin’Andriamanitra?', 'tsy fantatrareo angaha fa ianareo no tempolin’andriamanitra, ary ao anatinareo ny fanahin’andriamanitra?'),
  ('6ab25ca3bd0c4f40bd79b93f', '2026-09-22T10:46:59.042Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:59.042Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 3, 21, 'Aoka àry tsy hisy hanao olona ho reharehany, fa anareo daholo ny zava-drehetra:', 'aoka àry tsy hisy hanao olona ho reharehany, fa anareo daholo ny zava-drehetra:'),
  ('6ab25ca3bd0c4f40bd79b933', '2026-09-22T10:46:59.042Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:59.042Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 3, 9, 'Fa mpiara-miasa amin’Andriamanitra izahay, ary saha volen’Andriamanitra sy trano aorin’Andriamanitra ianareo.', 'fa mpiara-miasa amin’andriamanitra izahay, ary saha volen’andriamanitra sy trano aorin’andriamanitra ianareo.'),
  ('6ab25ca3bd0c4f40bd79b92f', '2026-09-22T10:46:59.042Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:59.042Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 3, 5, 'Koa inona àry i Apolosy? Ary inona i Paoly? Mpanompo fotsiny ihany izay nahatonga anareo ho mpino ireo, araka ny fanompoana nomen’ny Tompo azy ireo tsirairay avy.', 'koa inona àry i apolosy? ary inona i paoly? mpanompo fotsiny ihany izay nahatonga anareo ho mpino ireo, araka ny fanompoana nomen’ny tompo azy ireo tsirairay avy.'),
  ('6ab25ca3bd0c4f40bd79b92e', '2026-09-22T10:46:59.042Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:59.042Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 3, 4, 'Fa raha milaza ny iray hoe: “Izaho an’i Paoly”, ary ny iray kosa hoe: “Izaho an’i Apolosy”, tsy toy ny ataon’ny olon-kafa rehetra ihany ve no ataonareo?', 'fa raha milaza ny iray hoe: “izaho an’i paoly”, ary ny iray kosa hoe: “izaho an’i apolosy”, tsy toy ny ataon’ny olon-kafa rehetra ihany ve no ataonareo?'),
  ('6ab25ca3bd0c4f40bd79b93e', '2026-09-22T10:46:59.042Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:59.042Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 3, 20, 'Ary koa hoe: “Fantatr’i Jehovah fa tsy misy dikany ny hevitry ny olon-kendry.”', 'ary koa hoe: “fantatr’i jehovah fa tsy misy dikany ny hevitry ny olon-kendry.”'),
  ('6ab25ca3bd0c4f40bd79b939', '2026-09-22T10:46:59.042Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:59.042Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 3, 15, 'Fa raha may kosa ny asany, dia ho matiantoka izy. Hovonjena ihany anefa izy, saingy toy ny hoe hovonjena avy ao anaty afo.', 'fa raha may kosa ny asany, dia ho matiantoka izy. hovonjena ihany anefa izy, saingy toy ny hoe hovonjena avy ao anaty afo.'),
  ('6ab25ca3bd0c4f40bd79b940', '2026-09-22T10:46:59.042Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:59.042Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 3, 22, 'Na i Paoly izany, na i Apolosy, na i Kefasy, na izao tontolo izao, na fiainana, na fahafatesana, na zavatra ankehitriny, na zavatra ho avy. Anareo daholo ny zava-drehetra.', 'na i paoly izany, na i apolosy, na i kefasy, na izao tontolo izao, na fiainana, na fahafatesana, na zavatra ankehitriny, na zavatra ho avy. anareo daholo ny zava-drehetra.'),
  ('6ab25ca3bd0c4f40bd79b93b', '2026-09-22T10:46:59.042Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:59.042Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 3, 17, 'Raha misy olona mandrava ny tempolin’Andriamanitra, dia haringan’Andriamanitra izy. Fa masina ny tempolin’Andriamanitra, ary ianareo izany tempoly izany.', 'raha misy olona mandrava ny tempolin’andriamanitra, dia haringan’andriamanitra izy. fa masina ny tempolin’andriamanitra, ary ianareo izany tempoly izany.'),
  ('6ab25ca3e7db24c81311b3b6', '2026-09-22T10:46:59.527Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:59.527Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 4, 7, 'Fa inona no tsy mampitovy anao amin’ny olon-kafa? Inona tokoa moa no anananao ka hoe tsy nomena anao? Koa raha nomena anao ilay izy, maninona ianao no mirehareha hoatran’ny hoe tsy nisy nanome?', 'fa inona no tsy mampitovy anao amin’ny olon-kafa? inona tokoa moa no anananao ka hoe tsy nomena anao? koa raha nomena anao ilay izy, maninona ianao no mirehareha hoatran’ny hoe tsy nisy nanome?'),
  ('6ab25ca3e7db24c81311b3b2', '2026-09-22T10:46:59.527Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:59.527Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 4, 3, 'Raha izaho, dia tsy mampaninona ahy na ianareo na ny fitsaran’olombelona no handinika ny momba ahy. Na izaho aza mantsy tsy manao an’izany amin’ny tenako.', 'raha izaho, dia tsy mampaninona ahy na ianareo na ny fitsaran’olombelona no handinika ny momba ahy. na izaho aza mantsy tsy manao an’izany amin’ny tenako.'),
  ('6ab25ca3e7db24c81311b3b1', '2026-09-22T10:46:59.527Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:59.527Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 4, 2, 'Noho izany, dia takina amin’ny mpanompo ny ho mendri-pitokisana.', 'noho izany, dia takina amin’ny mpanompo ny ho mendri-pitokisana.'),
  ('6ab25ca3e7db24c81311b3b8', '2026-09-22T10:46:59.527Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:59.527Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 4, 9, 'Fa amiko, dia hoatran’ny hoe izahay apostoly no nataon’Andriamanitra niakatra an-tsehatra farany, toy ny olona voaheloka ho faty. Naseho teny ambony sehatra mantsy izahay mba hojeren’izao tontolo izao sy ny anjely ary ny olona.', 'fa amiko, dia hoatran’ny hoe izahay apostoly no nataon’andriamanitra niakatra an-tsehatra farany, toy ny olona voaheloka ho faty. naseho teny ambony sehatra mantsy izahay mba hojeren’izao tontolo izao sy ny anjely ary ny olona.'),
  ('6ab25ca3e7db24c81311b3b0', '2026-09-22T10:46:59.527Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:59.527Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 4, 1, 'Tokony hihevitra anay ho mpanompon’i Kristy sy ho mpanompo miandraikitra ny zava-miafina masin’Andriamanitra ny olona.', 'tokony hihevitra anay ho mpanompon’i kristy sy ho mpanompo miandraikitra ny zava-miafina masin’andriamanitra ny olona.'),
  ('6ab25ca3e7db24c81311b3b7', '2026-09-22T10:46:59.527Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:59.527Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 4, 8, 'Efa afa-po sahady angaha ianareo? Ary efa manankarena sahady? Efa nanomboka nanjaka irery tsy nisy anay angaha ianareo? Tena tiako raha mba efa nanomboka nanjaka ianareo, amin’izay koa izahay mba afaka miara-manjaka aminareo!', 'efa afa-po sahady angaha ianareo? ary efa manankarena sahady? efa nanomboka nanjaka irery tsy nisy anay angaha ianareo? tena tiako raha mba efa nanomboka nanjaka ianareo, amin’izay koa izahay mba afaka miara-manjaka aminareo!'),
  ('6ab25ca3e7db24c81311b3b4', '2026-09-22T10:46:59.527Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:59.527Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 4, 5, 'Koa aza mitsara na inona na inona alohan’ny fotoana voatondro, mandra-piavin’ny Tompo. Izy no hampiseho eo amin’ny mazava ny zava-miafina ao anaty haizina sy hampahafantatra ny fikasan’ny fo. Amin’izay dia samy hahazo dera avy amin’Andriamanitra ny tsirairay.', 'koa aza mitsara na inona na inona alohan’ny fotoana voatondro, mandra-piavin’ny tompo. izy no hampiseho eo amin’ny mazava ny zava-miafina ao anaty haizina sy hampahafantatra ny fikasan’ny fo. amin’izay dia samy hahazo dera avy amin’andriamanitra ny tsirairay.'),
  ('6ab25ca3e7db24c81311b3b3', '2026-09-22T10:46:59.527Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:59.527Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 4, 4, 'Fa tsy hitako izay fahadisoako, nefa tsy midika akory izany hoe marina aho. I Jehovah no mandinika ny momba ahy.', 'fa tsy hitako izay fahadisoako, nefa tsy midika akory izany hoe marina aho. i jehovah no mandinika ny momba ahy.'),
  ('6ab25ca3e7db24c81311b3b5', '2026-09-22T10:46:59.527Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:59.527Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 4, 6, 'Noraisiko ho ohatra izaho sy Apolosy, ry rahalahy, rehefa nilaza an’izany zavatra izany aho mba hahasoa anareo, ka hianaranareo an’ilay fitsipika hoe: “Aza mihoatra an’izay voasoratra.” Amin’izay dia tsy hirehareha ianareo, ka hihevitra ny iray ho tsara kokoa noho ny iray.', 'noraisiko ho ohatra izaho sy apolosy, ry rahalahy, rehefa nilaza an’izany zavatra izany aho mba hahasoa anareo, ka hianaranareo an’ilay fitsipika hoe: “aza mihoatra an’izay voasoratra.” amin’izay dia tsy hirehareha ianareo, ka hihevitra ny iray ho tsara kokoa noho ny iray.'),
  ('6ab25ca3e7db24c81311b3c4', '2026-09-22T10:46:59.528Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:59.528Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 4, 21, 'Fa inona no tianareo: Hitondra tsorakazo aho rehefa tonga any aminareo, sa ho be fitiavana sy halemy fanahy?', 'fa inona no tianareo: hitondra tsorakazo aho rehefa tonga any aminareo, sa ho be fitiavana sy halemy fanahy?'),
  ('6ab25ca3e7db24c81311b3c2', '2026-09-22T10:46:59.528Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:59.528Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 4, 19, 'Ho avy tsy ho ela any aminareo anefa aho, raha sitrapon’i Jehovah. Ary tsy izay tenenin’ireo mirehareha no tiako hofantarina, fa ny heriny.', 'ho avy tsy ho ela any aminareo anefa aho, raha sitrapon’i jehovah. ary tsy izay tenenin’ireo mirehareha no tiako hofantarina, fa ny heriny.'),
  ('6ab25ca3e7db24c81311b3bf', '2026-09-22T10:46:59.528Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:59.528Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 4, 16, 'Koa mampirisika anareo aho mba hanahaka ahy.', 'koa mampirisika anareo aho mba hanahaka ahy.'),
  ('6ab25ca3e7db24c81311b3be', '2026-09-22T10:46:59.528Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:59.528Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 4, 15, 'Fa na manana mpitaiza 10 000 ao amin’i Kristy aza ianareo, dia azo antoka fa tsy be dia be ny rainareo. Lasa rainareo ao amin’i Kristy Jesosy mantsy aho, satria nitory ny vaovao tsara taminareo.', 'fa na manana mpitaiza 10 000 ao amin’i kristy aza ianareo, dia azo antoka fa tsy be dia be ny rainareo. lasa rainareo ao amin’i kristy jesosy mantsy aho, satria nitory ny vaovao tsara taminareo.'),
  ('6ab25ca3e7db24c81311b3bd', '2026-09-22T10:46:59.528Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:59.528Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 4, 14, 'Tsy ny hampahamenatra anareo anefa no anoratako an’izany, fa ny hananatra anareo hoatran’ny zanako malalako.', 'tsy ny hampahamenatra anareo anefa no anoratako an’izany, fa ny hananatra anareo hoatran’ny zanako malalako.'),
  ('6ab25ca3e7db24c81311b3ba', '2026-09-22T10:46:59.528Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:59.528Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 4, 11, 'Hatramin’izao ora izao, dia mbola noana izahay, mangetaheta, zara raha mitafy, kapohina, tsy manan-kialofana,', 'hatramin’izao ora izao, dia mbola noana izahay, mangetaheta, zara raha mitafy, kapohina, tsy manan-kialofana,'),
  ('6ab25ca3e7db24c81311b3b9', '2026-09-22T10:46:59.528Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:59.528Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 4, 10, 'Izahay moa adala noho ny amin’i Kristy, fa ianareo kosa malina ao amin’i Kristy! Izahay malemy, fa ianareo kosa matanjaka! Ianareo omem-boninahitra, fa izahay kosa alam-baraka!', 'izahay moa adala noho ny amin’i kristy, fa ianareo kosa malina ao amin’i kristy! izahay malemy, fa ianareo kosa matanjaka! ianareo omem-boninahitra, fa izahay kosa alam-baraka!'),
  ('6ab25ca3e7db24c81311b3c3', '2026-09-22T10:46:59.528Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:59.528Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 4, 20, 'Tsy izay lazain’ny olona mantsy no manaporofo hoe manaiky ny Fanjakan’Andriamanitra izy, fa ny herin’ny fanahin’Andriamanitra eo aminy.', 'tsy izay lazain’ny olona mantsy no manaporofo hoe manaiky ny fanjakan’andriamanitra izy, fa ny herin’ny fanahin’andriamanitra eo aminy.'),
  ('6ab25ca3e7db24c81311b3c0', '2026-09-22T10:46:59.528Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:59.528Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 4, 17, 'Izany no antony anirahako an’i Timoty any aminareo, satria zanako malalako sy mendri-pitokisana ao amin’ny Tompo izy. Hampahatsiahiviny anareo ny fomba fiasako amin’ny fanompoana ampanaovin’i Kristy Jesosy ahy, izany hoe ilay fomba fiasa ampianariko any amin’ny fiangonana rehetra, na aiza na aiza.', 'izany no antony anirahako an’i timoty any aminareo, satria zanako malalako sy mendri-pitokisana ao amin’ny tompo izy. hampahatsiahiviny anareo ny fomba fiasako amin’ny fanompoana ampanaovin’i kristy jesosy ahy, izany hoe ilay fomba fiasa ampianariko any amin’ny fiangonana rehetra, na aiza na aiza.'),
  ('6ab25ca3e7db24c81311b3bc', '2026-09-22T10:46:59.528Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:59.528Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 4, 13, 'ary rehefa misy manendrikendrika dia mamaly amim-pahalemem-panahy. Lasa toy ny fakon’izao tontolo izao sy faikan’ny zava-drehetra izahay hatramin’izao.', 'ary rehefa misy manendrikendrika dia mamaly amim-pahalemem-panahy. lasa toy ny fakon’izao tontolo izao sy faikan’ny zava-drehetra izahay hatramin’izao.'),
  ('6ab25ca3e7db24c81311b3c1', '2026-09-22T10:46:59.528Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:59.528Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 4, 18, 'Mirehareha ny sasany, satria heverin’izy ireo fa tsy ho tonga any aminareo aho.', 'mirehareha ny sasany, satria heverin’izy ireo fa tsy ho tonga any aminareo aho.'),
  ('6ab25ca3e7db24c81311b3bb', '2026-09-22T10:46:59.528Z', '2026-09-22T10:46:59.528Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 4, 12, 'ary miasa mafy amin’ny tananay. Rehefa misy manambanimbany anay dia mirary soa izahay, rehefa enjehina izahay dia miaritra foana,', 'ary miasa mafy amin’ny tananay. rehefa misy manambanimbany anay dia mirary soa izahay, rehefa enjehina izahay dia miaritra foana,'),
  ('6ab25ca4dcc5ffaaec6ed410', '2026-09-22T10:47:00.138Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:00.138Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 5, 13, 'fa Andriamanitra kosa no mitsara ny any ivelany? “Esory tsy ho eo aminareo ilay mpanao ratsy.”', 'fa andriamanitra kosa no mitsara ny any ivelany? “esory tsy ho eo aminareo ilay mpanao ratsy.”'),
  ('6ab25ca4dcc5ffaaec6ed40d', '2026-09-22T10:47:00.138Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:00.138Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 5, 10, 'Tsy te hilaza anefa aho hoe aza mifanerasera mihitsy amin’ny mpijangajanga eto amin’izao tontolo izao, na amin’ny olona tsy mety afa-po na mpanao an-keriny na mpanompo sampy. Raha izany mantsy, dia tena tsy maintsy miala eo amin’izao tontolo izao ianareo.', 'tsy te hilaza anefa aho hoe aza mifanerasera mihitsy amin’ny mpijangajanga eto amin’izao tontolo izao, na amin’ny olona tsy mety afa-po na mpanao an-keriny na mpanompo sampy. raha izany mantsy, dia tena tsy maintsy miala eo amin’izao tontolo izao ianareo.'),
  ('6ab25ca4dcc5ffaaec6ed40c', '2026-09-22T10:47:00.138Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:00.138Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 5, 9, 'Nanoratra taminareo aho mba tsy hifaneraseranareo intsony amin’ny mpijangajanga.', 'nanoratra taminareo aho mba tsy hifaneraseranareo intsony amin’ny mpijangajanga.'),
  ('6ab25ca4dcc5ffaaec6ed409', '2026-09-22T10:47:00.138Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:00.138Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 5, 6, 'Tsy misy antony ireharehanareo. Tsy fantatrareo angaha fa lalivay kely fotsiny dia efa mampitombo ny koba manontolo?', 'tsy misy antony ireharehanareo. tsy fantatrareo angaha fa lalivay kely fotsiny dia efa mampitombo ny koba manontolo?'),
  ('6ab25ca4dcc5ffaaec6ed404', '2026-09-22T10:47:00.138Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:00.138Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 5, 1, 'Misy fijangajangana, hono, eo aminareo, ary fijangajangana tsy fahita na dia eo amin’ny hafa firenena aza. Henoko hoe misy lehilahy manao tokantranomaso amin’ny vadin-drainy.', 'misy fijangajangana, hono, eo aminareo, ary fijangajangana tsy fahita na dia eo amin’ny hafa firenena aza. henoko hoe misy lehilahy manao tokantranomaso amin’ny vadin-drainy.'),
  ('6ab25ca4dcc5ffaaec6ed406', '2026-09-22T10:47:00.138Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:00.138Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 5, 3, 'Na tsy any aminareo aza aho, dia any aminareo ny saiko, ary efa nitsara an’ilay lehilahy nanao an’izany aho, hoatran’ny hoe any mihitsy.', 'na tsy any aminareo aza aho, dia any aminareo ny saiko, ary efa nitsara an’ilay lehilahy nanao an’izany aho, hoatran’ny hoe any mihitsy.'),
  ('6ab25ca4dcc5ffaaec6ed408', '2026-09-22T10:47:00.138Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:00.138Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 5, 5, 'dia atolory ho an’i Satana ilay lehilahy mba handringanana ny nofo. Amin’izay dia ho voaro ny toe-tsain’ny fiangonana, mandritra ny andron’ny Tompo.', 'dia atolory ho an’i satana ilay lehilahy mba handringanana ny nofo. amin’izay dia ho voaro ny toe-tsain’ny fiangonana, mandritra ny andron’ny tompo.'),
  ('6ab25ca4dcc5ffaaec6ed40b', '2026-09-22T10:47:00.138Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:00.138Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 5, 8, 'Koa andao isika hankalaza an’ilay fety, ka tsy hampiasa lalivay efa ela, dia ny faharatsiana sy ny haratsiam-panahy, fa hampiasa mofo tsy misy lalivay kosa, dia ny fahatsoram-po sy ny fahamarinana.', 'koa andao isika hankalaza an’ilay fety, ka tsy hampiasa lalivay efa ela, dia ny faharatsiana sy ny haratsiam-panahy, fa hampiasa mofo tsy misy lalivay kosa, dia ny fahatsoram-po sy ny fahamarinana.'),
  ('6ab25ca4dcc5ffaaec6ed40e', '2026-09-22T10:47:00.138Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:00.138Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 5, 11, 'Fa manoratra aminareo kosa aho izao mba tsy hifaneraseranareo intsony amin’izay antsoina hoe rahalahy nefa mpijangajanga, na manana faniriana tsy mety afa-po, na mpanompo sampy, na mpanevateva, na mamo lava, na mpanao an-keriny. Aza atao na dia ny miara-misakafo amin’ny olona hoatr’izany aza.', 'fa manoratra aminareo kosa aho izao mba tsy hifaneraseranareo intsony amin’izay antsoina hoe rahalahy nefa mpijangajanga, na manana faniriana tsy mety afa-po, na mpanompo sampy, na mpanevateva, na mamo lava, na mpanao an-keriny. aza atao na dia ny miara-misakafo amin’ny olona hoatr’izany aza.'),
  ('6ab25ca4dcc5ffaaec6ed405', '2026-09-22T10:47:00.138Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:00.138Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 5, 2, 'Izany ve dia mampirehareha anareo? Tsy tokony halahelo kosa ve ianareo, ka hanala an’ilay lehilahy nanao an’izany zavatra izany tsy ho eo aminareo?', 'izany ve dia mampirehareha anareo? tsy tokony halahelo kosa ve ianareo, ka hanala an’ilay lehilahy nanao an’izany zavatra izany tsy ho eo aminareo?'),
  ('6ab25ca4dcc5ffaaec6ed40a', '2026-09-22T10:47:00.138Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:00.138Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 5, 7, 'Esory ny lalivay efa ela, mba ho koba vaovao ianareo, satria tsy tokony hisy lalivay ianareo. Fa efa natao sorona tokoa i Kristy, ilay zanak’ondrin’ny Paska.', 'esory ny lalivay efa ela, mba ho koba vaovao ianareo, satria tsy tokony hisy lalivay ianareo. fa efa natao sorona tokoa i kristy, ilay zanak’ondrin’ny paska.'),
  ('6ab25ca4dcc5ffaaec6ed407', '2026-09-22T10:47:00.138Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:00.138Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 5, 4, 'Rehefa miara-mivory amin’ny anaran’i Jesosy Tompontsika ianareo ary fantatrareo fa any aminareo ny saiko sy ny herin’i Jesosy Tompontsika,', 'rehefa miara-mivory amin’ny anaran’i jesosy tompontsika ianareo ary fantatrareo fa any aminareo ny saiko sy ny herin’i jesosy tompontsika,'),
  ('6ab25ca4dcc5ffaaec6ed40f', '2026-09-22T10:47:00.138Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:00.138Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 5, 12, 'Fa inona no idirako amin’izay fitsarana ny any ivelany? Tsy ianareo ve no mitsara ny ato anatiny,', 'fa inona no idirako amin’izay fitsarana ny any ivelany? tsy ianareo ve no mitsara ny ato anatiny,'),
  ('6ab25ca5538a74eff0e5d8ac', '2026-09-22T10:47:01.326Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:01.326Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 6, 4, 'Koa raha misy raharaha momba an’izao fiainana izao tokony hotsaraina, dia lehilahy ataon’ny fiangonana tsinontsinona ve no fidinareo ho mpitsara?', 'koa raha misy raharaha momba an’izao fiainana izao tokony hotsaraina, dia lehilahy ataon’ny fiangonana tsinontsinona ve no fidinareo ho mpitsara?'),
  ('6ab25ca5538a74eff0e5d8ad', '2026-09-22T10:47:01.326Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:01.326Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 6, 5, 'Ny hampahamenatra anareo no ilazako an’izany. Tsy misy lehilahy hendry ve eo aminareo, na iray aza, afaka mitsara ny adin’ireo rahalahiny?', 'ny hampahamenatra anareo no ilazako an’izany. tsy misy lehilahy hendry ve eo aminareo, na iray aza, afaka mitsara ny adin’ireo rahalahiny?'),
  ('6ab25ca5538a74eff0e5d8af', '2026-09-22T10:47:01.326Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:01.326Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 6, 7, 'Raha ny marina, dia efa resy sahady ianareo rehefa mifampitory. Tsy aleo ve manaiky hiharan’ny tsy rariny? Tsy aleo ve manaiky hambakaina?', 'raha ny marina, dia efa resy sahady ianareo rehefa mifampitory. tsy aleo ve manaiky hiharan’ny tsy rariny? tsy aleo ve manaiky hambakaina?'),
  ('6ab25ca5538a74eff0e5d8aa', '2026-09-22T10:47:01.326Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:01.326Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 6, 2, 'Sa tsy fantatrareo fa hitsara an’izao tontolo izao ny olona masina? Koa raha izao tontolo izao aza hotsarainareo, tsy ho hainareo koa ve ny hitsara raharaha tena madinika?', 'sa tsy fantatrareo fa hitsara an’izao tontolo izao ny olona masina? koa raha izao tontolo izao aza hotsarainareo, tsy ho hainareo koa ve ny hitsara raharaha tena madinika?'),
  ('6ab25ca5538a74eff0e5d8ab', '2026-09-22T10:47:01.326Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:01.326Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 6, 3, 'Tsy fantatrareo angaha fa hitsara anjely isika? Koa nahoana isika no tsy hitsara raharaha momba an’izao fiainana izao?', 'tsy fantatrareo angaha fa hitsara anjely isika? koa nahoana isika no tsy hitsara raharaha momba an’izao fiainana izao?'),
  ('6ab25ca5538a74eff0e5d8ae', '2026-09-22T10:47:01.326Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:01.326Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 6, 6, 'Mifampitory any amin’ny fitsarana anefa ireo rahalahy, sady amin’izay indray eo anatrehan’ny tsy mpino!', 'mifampitory any amin’ny fitsarana anefa ireo rahalahy, sady amin’izay indray eo anatrehan’ny tsy mpino!'),
  ('6ab25ca5538a74eff0e5d8a9', '2026-09-22T10:47:01.326Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:01.326Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 6, 1, 'Raha misy aminareo tsy mifanaraka, dia ho sahin’ilay iray ve ny hitory an’ilay iray any amin’ny fitsarana, eo anatrehan’ny olona tsy marina, fa tsy eo anatrehan’ny olona masina?', 'raha misy aminareo tsy mifanaraka, dia ho sahin’ilay iray ve ny hitory an’ilay iray any amin’ny fitsarana, eo anatrehan’ny olona tsy marina, fa tsy eo anatrehan’ny olona masina?'),
  ('6ab25ca5538a74eff0e5d8b0', '2026-09-22T10:47:01.327Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:01.327Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 6, 8, 'Ianareo indray anefa no manao ny tsy rariny sy manambaka, sady amin’izay indray ny rahalahinareo ihany no anaovanareo an’izany!', 'ianareo indray anefa no manao ny tsy rariny sy manambaka, sady amin’izay indray ny rahalahinareo ihany no anaovanareo an’izany!'),
  ('6ab25ca5538a74eff0e5d8b5', '2026-09-22T10:47:01.327Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:01.327Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 6, 13, 'Ny sakafo dia natao ho an’ny kibo, ary ny kibo ho an’ny sakafo, nefa samy hofoanan’Andriamanitra izy roa ireo. Ary ny vatana dia tsy natao ho an’ny fijangajangana, fa ho an’ny Tompo, ary ny Tompo ho an’ny vatana.', 'ny sakafo dia natao ho an’ny kibo, ary ny kibo ho an’ny sakafo, nefa samy hofoanan’andriamanitra izy roa ireo. ary ny vatana dia tsy natao ho an’ny fijangajangana, fa ho an’ny tompo, ary ny tompo ho an’ny vatana.'),
  ('6ab25ca5538a74eff0e5d8b6', '2026-09-22T10:47:01.327Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:01.327Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 6, 14, 'Efa natsangan’Andriamanitra anefa ny Tompo ary hanangana antsika amin’ny maty koa izy, amin’ny alalan’ny heriny.', 'efa natsangan’andriamanitra anefa ny tompo ary hanangana antsika amin’ny maty koa izy, amin’ny alalan’ny heriny.'),
  ('6ab25ca5538a74eff0e5d8b7', '2026-09-22T10:47:01.327Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:01.327Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 6, 15, 'Tsy fantatrareo angaha fa rantsambatan’i Kristy ny vatanareo? Koa ny rantsambatan’i Kristy ve no halaiko dia hakambako amin’ny mpivaro-tena? Sanatria izany!', 'tsy fantatrareo angaha fa rantsambatan’i kristy ny vatanareo? koa ny rantsambatan’i kristy ve no halaiko dia hakambako amin’ny mpivaro-tena? sanatria izany!'),
  ('6ab25ca5538a74eff0e5d8b1', '2026-09-22T10:47:01.327Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:01.327Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 6, 9, 'Sa tsy fantatrareo fa tsy handova ny Fanjakan’Andriamanitra ny olona tsy marina? Aza manaiky ho voafitaka ianareo. Fa ny mpijangajanga, ny mpanompo sampy, ny mpanitsakitsa-bady, ny lehilahy manaiky hanaovan’ny lehilahy firaisana, ny lehilahy miray amin’ny lehilahy,', 'sa tsy fantatrareo fa tsy handova ny fanjakan’andriamanitra ny olona tsy marina? aza manaiky ho voafitaka ianareo. fa ny mpijangajanga, ny mpanompo sampy, ny mpanitsakitsa-bady, ny lehilahy manaiky hanaovan’ny lehilahy firaisana, ny lehilahy miray amin’ny lehilahy,'),
  ('6ab25ca5538a74eff0e5d8b9', '2026-09-22T10:47:01.327Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:01.327Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 6, 17, 'Fa izay tafaray amin’ny Tompo kosa dia iray saina aminy.', 'fa izay tafaray amin’ny tompo kosa dia iray saina aminy.'),
  ('6ab25ca5538a74eff0e5d8b3', '2026-09-22T10:47:01.327Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:01.327Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 6, 11, 'Efa hoatr’izany ihany ny sasany taminareo taloha, nefa efa voasasa madio tsara ianareo, efa nohamasinina, ary efa nambara hoe olo-marina tamin’ny anaran’i Jesosy Kristy Tompo sy tamin’ny fanahin’ny Andriamanitsika.', 'efa hoatr’izany ihany ny sasany taminareo taloha, nefa efa voasasa madio tsara ianareo, efa nohamasinina, ary efa nambara hoe olo-marina tamin’ny anaran’i jesosy kristy tompo sy tamin’ny fanahin’ny andriamanitsika.'),
  ('6ab25ca5538a74eff0e5d8b2', '2026-09-22T10:47:01.327Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:01.327Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 6, 10, 'ny mpangalatra, ny olona manana faniriana tsy mety afa-po, ny mamo lava, ny mpanevateva, ary ny mpanao an-keriny, dia tsy handova ny Fanjakan’Andriamanitra.', 'ny mpangalatra, ny olona manana faniriana tsy mety afa-po, ny mamo lava, ny mpanevateva, ary ny mpanao an-keriny, dia tsy handova ny fanjakan’andriamanitra.'),
  ('6ab25ca5538a74eff0e5d8b4', '2026-09-22T10:47:01.327Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:01.327Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 6, 12, 'Azoko atao ny zava-drehetra, nefa tsy ny zava-drehetra no mahasoa. Azoko atao ny zava-drehetra, nefa tsy havelako hisy na inona na inona hifehy ahy.', 'azoko atao ny zava-drehetra, nefa tsy ny zava-drehetra no mahasoa. azoko atao ny zava-drehetra, nefa tsy havelako hisy na inona na inona hifehy ahy.'),
  ('6ab25ca5538a74eff0e5d8bc', '2026-09-22T10:47:01.327Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:01.327Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 6, 20, 'fa efa voavidy ianareo. Koa ampiasao hanomezam-boninahitra an’Andriamanitra ny vatanareo.', 'fa efa voavidy ianareo. koa ampiasao hanomezam-boninahitra an’andriamanitra ny vatanareo.'),
  ('6ab25ca5538a74eff0e5d8b8', '2026-09-22T10:47:01.327Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:01.327Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 6, 16, 'Tsy fantatrareo angaha fa izay miray amin’ny mpivaro-tena dia vatana iray aminy? Niteny mantsy Andriamanitra hoe: “Ho nofo iray ihany izy roa.”', 'tsy fantatrareo angaha fa izay miray amin’ny mpivaro-tena dia vatana iray aminy? niteny mantsy andriamanitra hoe: “ho nofo iray ihany izy roa.”'),
  ('6ab25ca5538a74eff0e5d8ba', '2026-09-22T10:47:01.327Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:01.327Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 6, 18, 'Andosiro ny fijangajangana! Izay fahotana hafa rehetra ataon’ny olona dia eny ivelan’ny vatany, fa ny mpijangajanga kosa manota amin’ny vatany ihany.', 'andosiro ny fijangajangana! izay fahotana hafa rehetra ataon’ny olona dia eny ivelan’ny vatany, fa ny mpijangajanga kosa manota amin’ny vatany ihany.'),
  ('6ab25ca5538a74eff0e5d8bb', '2026-09-22T10:47:01.327Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:01.327Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 6, 19, 'Tsy fantatrareo angaha fa ny vatanareo no tempolin’ilay fanahy masina ao anatinareo sy azonareo avy amin’Andriamanitra? Ary tsy anareo intsony koa ny tenanareo,', 'tsy fantatrareo angaha fa ny vatanareo no tempolin’ilay fanahy masina ao anatinareo sy azonareo avy amin’andriamanitra? ary tsy anareo intsony koa ny tenanareo,'),
  ('6ab25ca6dd2968a56dc5a609', '2026-09-22T10:47:02.464Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:02.464Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 7, 25, 'Ny amin’ny virjiny kosa, dia tsy nahazo didy avy amin’ny Tompo aho. Manome ny hevitro anefa aho, satria nanehoan’ny Tompo famindram-po ka mendri-pitokisana.', 'ny amin’ny virjiny kosa, dia tsy nahazo didy avy amin’ny tompo aho. manome ny hevitro anefa aho, satria nanehoan’ny tompo famindram-po ka mendri-pitokisana.'),
  ('6ab25ca6dd2968a56dc5a603', '2026-09-22T10:47:02.464Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:02.464Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 7, 19, 'Tsy misy dikany ny hoe voafora ary tsy misy dikany ny hoe tsy voafora, fa ny mankatò ny didin’Andriamanitra no tena zava-dehibe.', 'tsy misy dikany ny hoe voafora ary tsy misy dikany ny hoe tsy voafora, fa ny mankatò ny didin’andriamanitra no tena zava-dehibe.'),
  ('6ab25ca6dd2968a56dc5a5f2', '2026-09-22T10:47:02.464Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:02.464Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 7, 2, 'Miely be anefa ny fijangajangana, ka tokony samy hanana ny vadiny ny lehilahy tsirairay, ary samy hanana ny vadiny ny vehivavy tsirairay.', 'miely be anefa ny fijangajangana, ka tokony samy hanana ny vadiny ny lehilahy tsirairay, ary samy hanana ny vadiny ny vehivavy tsirairay.'),
  ('6ab25ca6dd2968a56dc5a613', '2026-09-22T10:47:02.464Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:02.464Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 7, 35, 'Ny hahasoa anareo no itenenako an’izany, fa tsy hoe te hifehifehy anareo aho akory. Te hampirisika anareo kosa aho mba hanaovanareo an’izay mendrika sy hanompoanareo foana ny Tompo nefa tsy ho voahelingelina.', 'ny hahasoa anareo no itenenako an’izany, fa tsy hoe te hifehifehy anareo aho akory. te hampirisika anareo kosa aho mba hanaovanareo an’izay mendrika sy hanompoanareo foana ny tompo nefa tsy ho voahelingelina.'),
  ('6ab25ca6dd2968a56dc5a607', '2026-09-22T10:47:02.464Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:02.464Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 7, 23, 'Voavidy ianareo, ka aza manaiky ho lasa mpanompon’olona intsony.', 'voavidy ianareo, ka aza manaiky ho lasa mpanompon’olona intsony.'),
  ('6ab25ca6dd2968a56dc5a602', '2026-09-22T10:47:02.464Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:02.464Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 7, 18, 'Misy efa voafora ve tamin’izy nantsoina? Aoka izy tsy hanafoana ny famorana natao taminy. Misy tsy voafora ve tamin’izy nantsoina? Aoka izy tsy hoforana.', 'misy efa voafora ve tamin’izy nantsoina? aoka izy tsy hanafoana ny famorana natao taminy. misy tsy voafora ve tamin’izy nantsoina? aoka izy tsy hoforana.'),
  ('6ab25ca6dd2968a56dc5a5f6', '2026-09-22T10:47:02.464Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:02.464Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 7, 6, 'Tsy didy anefa izany lazaiko izany, fa soso-kevitra ihany.', 'tsy didy anefa izany lazaiko izany, fa soso-kevitra ihany.'),
  ('6ab25ca6dd2968a56dc5a608', '2026-09-22T10:47:02.464Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:02.464Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 7, 24, 'Ry rahalahy, na hoatran’ny ahoana na hoatran’ny ahoana ny tsirairay tamin’izy nantsoina, dia aoka izy hijanona hoatr’izany foana eo anatrehan’Andriamanitra.', 'ry rahalahy, na hoatran’ny ahoana na hoatran’ny ahoana ny tsirairay tamin’izy nantsoina, dia aoka izy hijanona hoatr’izany foana eo anatrehan’andriamanitra.'),
  ('6ab25ca6dd2968a56dc5a600', '2026-09-22T10:47:02.464Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:02.464Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 7, 16, 'Fa ahoana moa no ahafantaranao, ravehivavy, raha ho voavonjinao ny vadinao na tsia? Ary ahoana moa no ahafantaranao, ralehilahy, raha ho voavonjinao ny vadinao na tsia?', 'fa ahoana moa no ahafantaranao, ravehivavy, raha ho voavonjinao ny vadinao na tsia? ary ahoana moa no ahafantaranao, ralehilahy, raha ho voavonjinao ny vadinao na tsia?'),
  ('6ab25ca6dd2968a56dc5a5fb', '2026-09-22T10:47:02.464Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:02.464Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 7, 11, 'Raha mandao ny vadiny anefa izy, dia tsy tokony hanambady na tokony hody amin’ny vadiny. Ary ny lehilahy tsy tokony handao ny vadiny.', 'raha mandao ny vadiny anefa izy, dia tsy tokony hanambady na tokony hody amin’ny vadiny. ary ny lehilahy tsy tokony handao ny vadiny.'),
  ('6ab25ca6dd2968a56dc5a5f1', '2026-09-22T10:47:02.464Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:02.464Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 7, 1, 'Izao no valin’ny fanontaniana nosoratanareo tamiko: Tsara kokoa raha tsy mikasika vehivavy ny lehilahy.', 'izao no valin’ny fanontaniana nosoratanareo tamiko: tsara kokoa raha tsy mikasika vehivavy ny lehilahy.'),
  ('6ab25ca6dd2968a56dc5a5f3', '2026-09-22T10:47:02.464Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:02.464Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 7, 3, 'Tokony hanao ny adidiny amin’ny vadiny ny lehilahy, ary tokony hanao hoatr’izany amin’ny vadiny koa ny vehivavy.', 'tokony hanao ny adidiny amin’ny vadiny ny lehilahy, ary tokony hanao hoatr’izany amin’ny vadiny koa ny vehivavy.'),
  ('6ab25ca6dd2968a56dc5a617', '2026-09-22T10:47:02.464Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:02.464Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 7, 39, 'Voafatotry ny fanambadiana ny vehivavy raha mbola velona ny vadiny. Fa raha maty kosa ny vadiny, dia afaka manambady izay tiany izy, nefa ao amin’ny Tompo ihany.', 'voafatotry ny fanambadiana ny vehivavy raha mbola velona ny vadiny. fa raha maty kosa ny vadiny, dia afaka manambady izay tiany izy, nefa ao amin’ny tompo ihany.'),
  ('6ab25ca6dd2968a56dc5a616', '2026-09-22T10:47:02.464Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:02.464Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 7, 38, 'Noho izany, dia tsara ny manambady, saingy tsara kokoa ny tsy manambady.', 'noho izany, dia tsara ny manambady, saingy tsara kokoa ny tsy manambady.'),
  ('6ab25ca6dd2968a56dc5a60f', '2026-09-22T10:47:02.464Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:02.464Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 7, 31, 'ary izay mampiasa an’izao tontolo izao, ho toy ny tsy variana mampiasa azy io tanteraka, fa miovaova ny sehatr’izao tontolo izao.', 'ary izay mampiasa an’izao tontolo izao, ho toy ny tsy variana mampiasa azy io tanteraka, fa miovaova ny sehatr’izao tontolo izao.'),
  ('6ab25ca6dd2968a56dc5a60b', '2026-09-22T10:47:02.464Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:02.464Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 7, 27, 'Lehilahy efa manambady ve ianao? Aza mitady hirika hisarahana. Lehilahy tsy manambady ve ianao? Aza mitady vady intsony.', 'lehilahy efa manambady ve ianao? aza mitady hirika hisarahana. lehilahy tsy manambady ve ianao? aza mitady vady intsony.'),
  ('6ab25ca6dd2968a56dc5a610', '2026-09-22T10:47:02.464Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:02.464Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 7, 32, 'Tena tiako raha tsy manahy mihitsy ianareo. Ny lehilahy tsy manambady dia manahy ny amin’izay an’ny Tompo, hoe ahoana no hahazoany sitraka amin’ny Tompo.', 'tena tiako raha tsy manahy mihitsy ianareo. ny lehilahy tsy manambady dia manahy ny amin’izay an’ny tompo, hoe ahoana no hahazoany sitraka amin’ny tompo.'),
  ('6ab25ca6dd2968a56dc5a60c', '2026-09-22T10:47:02.464Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:02.464Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 7, 28, 'Na hanambady aza anefa ianao, dia tsy manota. Ary raha misy virjiny manambady, dia tsy manota izy. Hanam-pahoriana amin’ny nofony anefa ireo manambady, ka tsy tiako hanjo anareo izany.', 'na hanambady aza anefa ianao, dia tsy manota. ary raha misy virjiny manambady, dia tsy manota izy. hanam-pahoriana amin’ny nofony anefa ireo manambady, ka tsy tiako hanjo anareo izany.'),
  ('6ab25ca6dd2968a56dc5a5fc', '2026-09-22T10:47:02.464Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:02.464Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 7, 12, 'Izao kosa no lazaiko amin’ny hafa, izaho anefa fa tsy ny Tompo: Raha misy rahalahy manambady tsy mpino, ary mbola manaiky hijanona miaraka aminy ihany ny vadiny, dia aoka tsy handao azy izy.', 'izao kosa no lazaiko amin’ny hafa, izaho anefa fa tsy ny tompo: raha misy rahalahy manambady tsy mpino, ary mbola manaiky hijanona miaraka aminy ihany ny vadiny, dia aoka tsy handao azy izy.'),
  ('6ab25ca6dd2968a56dc5a60a', '2026-09-22T10:47:02.464Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:02.464Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 7, 26, 'Raha ny hevitro àry, dia tsara raha mijanona hoatran’izy amin’izao ihany ny olona tsirairay, satria ao anatin’ny fotoan-tsarotra isika izao.', 'raha ny hevitro àry, dia tsara raha mijanona hoatran’izy amin’izao ihany ny olona tsirairay, satria ao anatin’ny fotoan-tsarotra isika izao.'),
  ('6ab25ca6dd2968a56dc5a605', '2026-09-22T10:47:02.464Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:02.464Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 7, 21, 'Mpanompon’olona ve ianao no nantsoina? Aza manahy ny amin’izany. Raha azonao atao anefa ny ho lasa olona afaka, dia hararaoty izany.', 'mpanompon’olona ve ianao no nantsoina? aza manahy ny amin’izany. raha azonao atao anefa ny ho lasa olona afaka, dia hararaoty izany.'),
  ('6ab25ca6dd2968a56dc5a604', '2026-09-22T10:47:02.464Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:02.464Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 7, 20, 'Na hoatran’ny ahoana na hoatran’ny ahoana ny tsirairay tamin’izy nantsoina, dia aoka izy hijanona hoatr’izany foana.', 'na hoatran’ny ahoana na hoatran’ny ahoana ny tsirairay tamin’izy nantsoina, dia aoka izy hijanona hoatr’izany foana.'),
  ('6ab25ca6dd2968a56dc5a601', '2026-09-22T10:47:02.464Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:02.464Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 7, 17, 'Na izany aza anefa, dia samia mandeha araka izay efa niantsoan’Andriamanitra azy avy, arakaraka izay anjara nomen’i Jehovah azy. Ary izany toromarika izany no omeko ny fiangonana rehetra.', 'na izany aza anefa, dia samia mandeha araka izay efa niantsoan’andriamanitra azy avy, arakaraka izay anjara nomen’i jehovah azy. ary izany toromarika izany no omeko ny fiangonana rehetra.'),
  ('6ab25ca6dd2968a56dc5a5fe', '2026-09-22T10:47:02.464Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:02.464Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 7, 14, 'Fa hamasinina noho ny amin’ny vadiny ny lehilahy tsy mpino, ary hamasinina noho ny amin’ilay rahalahy ny vadiny tsy mpino. Raha tsy izany, dia tsy madio ny zanakareo, nefa masina izy ireo izao.', 'fa hamasinina noho ny amin’ny vadiny ny lehilahy tsy mpino, ary hamasinina noho ny amin’ilay rahalahy ny vadiny tsy mpino. raha tsy izany, dia tsy madio ny zanakareo, nefa masina izy ireo izao.'),
  ('6ab25ca6dd2968a56dc5a611', '2026-09-22T10:47:02.464Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:02.464Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 7, 33, 'Fa ny lehilahy manambady kosa manahy ny amin’ny zavatra eo amin’izao tontolo izao, hoe ahoana no hahazoany sitraka amin’ny vadiny,', 'fa ny lehilahy manambady kosa manahy ny amin’ny zavatra eo amin’izao tontolo izao, hoe ahoana no hahazoany sitraka amin’ny vadiny,'),
  ('6ab25ca6dd2968a56dc5a5f5', '2026-09-22T10:47:02.464Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:02.464Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 7, 5, 'Aza misy mandà tsy hanao ny adidiny amin’ny vadiny, raha tsy hoe efa nifanaraka angaha ianareo hoe tsy hanao an’izany mandritra ny fotoana kelikely, mba hanokananareo fotoana hivavahana. Dia hiaraka indray ianareo avy eo, sao tsy hahafehy tena ka haka fanahy anareo foana i Satana.', 'aza misy mandà tsy hanao ny adidiny amin’ny vadiny, raha tsy hoe efa nifanaraka angaha ianareo hoe tsy hanao an’izany mandritra ny fotoana kelikely, mba hanokananareo fotoana hivavahana. dia hiaraka indray ianareo avy eo, sao tsy hahafehy tena ka haka fanahy anareo foana i satana.'),
  ('6ab25ca6dd2968a56dc5a60e', '2026-09-22T10:47:02.464Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:02.464Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 7, 30, 'izay mitomany ho toy ny tsy mitomany, izay mifaly ho toy ny tsy mifaly, izay mividy ho toy ny tsy manana,', 'izay mitomany ho toy ny tsy mitomany, izay mifaly ho toy ny tsy mifaly, izay mividy ho toy ny tsy manana,'),
  ('6ab25ca6dd2968a56dc5a5fa', '2026-09-22T10:47:02.464Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:02.464Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 7, 10, 'Manoro hevitra ny manambady aho, nefa tsy izaho fa ny Tompo, hoe tsy tokony handao ny vadiny ny vehivavy.', 'manoro hevitra ny manambady aho, nefa tsy izaho fa ny tompo, hoe tsy tokony handao ny vadiny ny vehivavy.'),
  ('6ab25ca6dd2968a56dc5a5f7', '2026-09-22T10:47:02.464Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:02.464Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 7, 7, 'Fa tiako raha mitovy amiko ny olona rehetra. Samy nahazo fanomezana avy amin’Andriamanitra anefa ny tsirairay, ka ny iray hoatr’izao, ary ny iray kosa hoatr’izao.', 'fa tiako raha mitovy amiko ny olona rehetra. samy nahazo fanomezana avy amin’andriamanitra anefa ny tsirairay, ka ny iray hoatr’izao, ary ny iray kosa hoatr’izao.'),
  ('6ab25ca6dd2968a56dc5a60d', '2026-09-22T10:47:02.464Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:02.464Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 7, 29, 'Izao koa no lazaiko, ry rahalahy: Efa kely sisa ny fotoana tavela. Manomboka izao, dia aoka izay manambady ho toy ny tsy manana,', 'izao koa no lazaiko, ry rahalahy: efa kely sisa ny fotoana tavela. manomboka izao, dia aoka izay manambady ho toy ny tsy manana,'),
  ('6ab25ca6dd2968a56dc5a5ff', '2026-09-22T10:47:02.464Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:02.464Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 7, 15, 'Fa raha ilay tsy mpino kosa no te hiala, dia avelao izy hiala. Raha izany no mitranga, dia tsy voatery hisisika hiaraka aminy ilay rahalahy na anabavy vadiny, fa Andriamanitra efa niantso anareo mba hanome anareo fiadanana.', 'fa raha ilay tsy mpino kosa no te hiala, dia avelao izy hiala. raha izany no mitranga, dia tsy voatery hisisika hiaraka aminy ilay rahalahy na anabavy vadiny, fa andriamanitra efa niantso anareo mba hanome anareo fiadanana.'),
  ('6ab25ca6dd2968a56dc5a5f4', '2026-09-22T10:47:02.464Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:02.464Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 7, 4, 'Tsy manana fahefana amin’ny vatany ny vehivavy, fa ny vadiny no manana an’izany fahefana izany. Toy izany koa fa tsy manana fahefana amin’ny vatany ny lehilahy, fa ny vadiny no manana an’izany fahefana izany.', 'tsy manana fahefana amin’ny vatany ny vehivavy, fa ny vadiny no manana an’izany fahefana izany. toy izany koa fa tsy manana fahefana amin’ny vatany ny lehilahy, fa ny vadiny no manana an’izany fahefana izany.'),
  ('6ab25ca6dd2968a56dc5a612', '2026-09-22T10:47:02.464Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:02.464Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 7, 34, 'ka voazarazara izy. Ankoatra izany, ny vehivavy tsy manambady sy ny virjiny dia manahy ny amin’izay an’ny Tompo, mba ho masina ny tenany sy ny sainy. Ny vehivavy manambady kosa manahy ny amin’ny zavatra eo amin’izao tontolo izao, hoe ahoana no hahazoany sitraka amin’ny vadiny.', 'ka voazarazara izy. ankoatra izany, ny vehivavy tsy manambady sy ny virjiny dia manahy ny amin’izay an’ny tompo, mba ho masina ny tenany sy ny sainy. ny vehivavy manambady kosa manahy ny amin’ny zavatra eo amin’izao tontolo izao, hoe ahoana no hahazoany sitraka amin’ny vadiny.'),
  ('6ab25ca6dd2968a56dc5a606', '2026-09-22T10:47:02.464Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:02.464Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 7, 22, 'Fa izay nantsoina ho ao amin’ny Tompo tamin’izy mpanompon’olona, dia efa nafahana sady an’ny Tompo. Toy izany koa fa izay nantsoina tamin’izy olona afaka, dia mpanompon’i Kristy.', 'fa izay nantsoina ho ao amin’ny tompo tamin’izy mpanompon’olona, dia efa nafahana sady an’ny tompo. toy izany koa fa izay nantsoina tamin’izy olona afaka, dia mpanompon’i kristy.'),
  ('6ab25ca6dd2968a56dc5a5f9', '2026-09-22T10:47:02.464Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:02.464Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 7, 9, 'Raha tsy mahafehy tena anefa izy ireo, dia afaka manambady, fa aleo manambady toy izay ho resin’ny filan’ny nofo.', 'raha tsy mahafehy tena anefa izy ireo, dia afaka manambady, fa aleo manambady toy izay ho resin’ny filan’ny nofo.'),
  ('6ab25ca6dd2968a56dc5a5f8', '2026-09-22T10:47:02.464Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:02.464Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 7, 8, 'Izao no lazaiko amin’ireo tsy manambady sy ireo vehivavy maty vady: Tsara kokoa raha mijanona hoatr’ahy izy ireo.', 'izao no lazaiko amin’ireo tsy manambady sy ireo vehivavy maty vady: tsara kokoa raha mijanona hoatr’ahy izy ireo.'),
  ('6ab25ca6dd2968a56dc5a618', '2026-09-22T10:47:02.464Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:02.464Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 7, 40, 'Sambatra kokoa anefa izy, araka ny hevitro, raha mijanona amin’izao. Matoky aho fa izaho koa manana ny fanahin’Andriamanitra.', 'sambatra kokoa anefa izy, araka ny hevitro, raha mijanona amin’izao. matoky aho fa izaho koa manana ny fanahin’andriamanitra.'),
  ('6ab25ca6dd2968a56dc5a5fd', '2026-09-22T10:47:02.464Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:02.464Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 7, 13, 'Ary raha misy vehivavy manambady tsy mpino, ka mbola manaiky hijanona miaraka aminy ihany ny vadiny, dia aoka tsy handao azy izy.', 'ary raha misy vehivavy manambady tsy mpino, ka mbola manaiky hijanona miaraka aminy ihany ny vadiny, dia aoka tsy handao azy izy.'),
  ('6ab25ca6dd2968a56dc5a614', '2026-09-22T10:47:02.464Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:02.464Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 7, 36, 'Raha misy anefa mieritreritra hoe hanaonao foana izy raha tsy manambady, ary raha efa tsy ao anatin’ilay fotoana fivelaran’ny fahatanorana intsony izy, dia aleo izy hanao izay tiany. Tsy manota izy. Aleo izy ireo hanambady.', 'raha misy anefa mieritreritra hoe hanaonao foana izy raha tsy manambady, ary raha efa tsy ao anatin’ilay fotoana fivelaran’ny fahatanorana intsony izy, dia aleo izy hanao izay tiany. tsy manota izy. aleo izy ireo hanambady.'),
  ('6ab25ca6dd2968a56dc5a615', '2026-09-22T10:47:02.464Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:02.464Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 7, 37, 'Raha misy kosa tapa-kevitra ao am-pony ary tsy misy zavatra manery azy, fa mahafehy ny faniriany izy ary manapa-kevitra ao am-pony hoe tsy hanambady mihitsy, dia tsara ny ataony.', 'raha misy kosa tapa-kevitra ao am-pony ary tsy misy zavatra manery azy, fa mahafehy ny faniriany izy ary manapa-kevitra ao am-pony hoe tsy hanambady mihitsy, dia tsara ny ataony.'),
  ('6ab25ca7e9fe7ae7b8f8b33c', '2026-09-22T10:47:03.662Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:03.662Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 8, 11, 'Ny fahalalanao àry no hanimba an’ilay malemy, dia ny rahalahinao izay namoizan’i Kristy ny ainy.', 'ny fahalalanao àry no hanimba an’ilay malemy, dia ny rahalahinao izay namoizan’i kristy ny ainy.'),
  ('6ab25ca7e9fe7ae7b8f8b33e', '2026-09-22T10:47:03.662Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:03.662Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 8, 13, 'Koa raha ny sakafo no manafintohina ny rahalahiko, dia tsy hihinan-kena intsony mihitsy aho, sao ho tafintohina ny rahalahiko.', 'koa raha ny sakafo no manafintohina ny rahalahiko, dia tsy hihinan-kena intsony mihitsy aho, sao ho tafintohina ny rahalahiko.'),
  ('6ab25ca7e9fe7ae7b8f8b339', '2026-09-22T10:47:03.662Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:03.662Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 8, 8, 'Tsy hanampy antsika ho akaiky kokoa an’Andriamanitra anefa ny sakafo. Tsy matiantoka isika raha tsy mihinana, ary tsy mahazo tombony raha mihinana.', 'tsy hanampy antsika ho akaiky kokoa an’andriamanitra anefa ny sakafo. tsy matiantoka isika raha tsy mihinana, ary tsy mahazo tombony raha mihinana.'),
  ('6ab25ca7e9fe7ae7b8f8b333', '2026-09-22T10:47:03.662Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:03.662Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 8, 2, 'Raha misy mihevitra hoe mahafantatra zavatra iray, dia mbola tsy mahafantatra an’izany araka ny tokony hahafantarany azy izy.', 'raha misy mihevitra hoe mahafantatra zavatra iray, dia mbola tsy mahafantatra an’izany araka ny tokony hahafantarany azy izy.'),
  ('6ab25ca7e9fe7ae7b8f8b338', '2026-09-22T10:47:03.662Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:03.662Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 8, 7, 'Tsy ny rehetra anefa no manana an’izany fahalalana izany. Fa ny sasany, izay nanompo sampy taloha, dia mbola mieritreritra hoe zavatra natao sorona ho an’ny sampy ihany no haniny rehefa mihinan-kanina izy. Koa voaloto ny feon’ny fieritreretany satria malemy.', 'tsy ny rehetra anefa no manana an’izany fahalalana izany. fa ny sasany, izay nanompo sampy taloha, dia mbola mieritreritra hoe zavatra natao sorona ho an’ny sampy ihany no haniny rehefa mihinan-kanina izy. koa voaloto ny feon’ny fieritreretany satria malemy.'),
  ('6ab25ca7e9fe7ae7b8f8b334', '2026-09-22T10:47:03.662Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:03.662Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 8, 3, 'Fa raha misy kosa tia an’Andriamanitra, dia fantatr’Andriamanitra izy.', 'fa raha misy kosa tia an’andriamanitra, dia fantatr’andriamanitra izy.'),
  ('6ab25ca7e9fe7ae7b8f8b332', '2026-09-22T10:47:03.662Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:03.662Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 8, 1, 'Raha ny amin’ny sakafo atolotra ho an’ny sampy, dia fantatsika fa manana fahalalana momba an’izany isika rehetra. Ny fahalalana anefa mampirehareha, fa ny fitiavana kosa mampahery.', 'raha ny amin’ny sakafo atolotra ho an’ny sampy, dia fantatsika fa manana fahalalana momba an’izany isika rehetra. ny fahalalana anefa mampirehareha, fa ny fitiavana kosa mampahery.'),
  ('6ab25ca7e9fe7ae7b8f8b337', '2026-09-22T10:47:03.662Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:03.662Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 8, 6, 'amintsika kosa dia tsy misy afa-tsy Andriamanitra tokana ihany, dia ny Ray, izay niavian’ny zava-drehetra, ary ho azy isika. Ary tokana ihany ny Tompo, dia i Jesosy Kristy. Izy no nampiasaina mba hampisy ny zava-drehetra sy hampisy antsika koa.', 'amintsika kosa dia tsy misy afa-tsy andriamanitra tokana ihany, dia ny ray, izay niavian’ny zava-drehetra, ary ho azy isika. ary tokana ihany ny tompo, dia i jesosy kristy. izy no nampiasaina mba hampisy ny zava-drehetra sy hampisy antsika koa.'),
  ('6ab25ca7e9fe7ae7b8f8b335', '2026-09-22T10:47:03.662Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:03.662Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 8, 4, 'Ny amin’ny fihinanana sakafo atolotra ho an’ny sampy, dia fantatsika fa tena tsinontsinona ny sampy, ary tsy misy Andriamanitra afa-tsy iray ihany.', 'ny amin’ny fihinanana sakafo atolotra ho an’ny sampy, dia fantatsika fa tena tsinontsinona ny sampy, ary tsy misy andriamanitra afa-tsy iray ihany.'),
  ('6ab25ca7e9fe7ae7b8f8b33d', '2026-09-22T10:47:03.662Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:03.662Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 8, 12, 'Manota amin’i Kristy ianareo, rehefa manota toy izany amin’ny rahalahinareo ka mandratra ny feon’ny fieritreretany mbola malemy.', 'manota amin’i kristy ianareo, rehefa manota toy izany amin’ny rahalahinareo ka mandratra ny feon’ny fieritreretany mbola malemy.'),
  ('6ab25ca7e9fe7ae7b8f8b33b', '2026-09-22T10:47:03.662Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:03.662Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 8, 10, 'Fa raha ianao izay manam-pahalalana no misy mahita misakafo ao amin’ny tempolin’ny sampy, moa ve ny feon’ny fieritreretan’ilay malemy tsy hampirisika azy ho sahy hihinana sakafo atolotra ho an’ny sampy?', 'fa raha ianao izay manam-pahalalana no misy mahita misakafo ao amin’ny tempolin’ny sampy, moa ve ny feon’ny fieritreretan’ilay malemy tsy hampirisika azy ho sahy hihinana sakafo atolotra ho an’ny sampy?'),
  ('6ab25ca7e9fe7ae7b8f8b336', '2026-09-22T10:47:03.662Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:03.662Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 8, 5, 'Fa na misy aza ireo antsoina hoe andriamanitra, na any an-danitra na eto an-tany, ary marina tokoa fa misy “andriamanitra” maro sy “tompo” maro,', 'fa na misy aza ireo antsoina hoe andriamanitra, na any an-danitra na eto an-tany, ary marina tokoa fa misy “andriamanitra” maro sy “tompo” maro,'),
  ('6ab25ca7e9fe7ae7b8f8b33a', '2026-09-22T10:47:03.662Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:03.662Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 8, 9, 'Marina fa manana zo hisafidy ianareo. Tandremo foana anefa sao ho lasa vato mahatafintohina ho an’ny malemy izany.', 'marina fa manana zo hisafidy ianareo. tandremo foana anefa sao ho lasa vato mahatafintohina ho an’ny malemy izany.'),
  ('6ab25caaa3eea8d5710f009a', '2026-09-22T10:47:06.013Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:06.013Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 9, 21, 'Tamin’izay tsy manana lalàna, dia lasa hoatran’izay tsy manana lalàna aho, na dia manana ny lalàn’Andriamanitra sy eo ambanin’ny lalàn’i Kristy aza, mba hahazoako an’izay tsy manana lalàna.', 'tamin’izay tsy manana lalàna, dia lasa hoatran’izay tsy manana lalàna aho, na dia manana ny lalàn’andriamanitra sy eo ambanin’ny lalàn’i kristy aza, mba hahazoako an’izay tsy manana lalàna.'),
  ('6ab25caaa3eea8d5710f008e', '2026-09-22T10:47:06.013Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:06.013Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 9, 9, 'Fa izao no voasoratra ao amin’ny Lalàn’i Mosesy: “Aza asiana fehivava ny omby miasa eny am-pamoloana.” Ny omby ve no ahin’Andriamanitra?', 'fa izao no voasoratra ao amin’ny lalàn’i mosesy: “aza asiana fehivava ny omby miasa eny am-pamoloana.” ny omby ve no ahin’andriamanitra?'),
  ('6ab25caaa3eea8d5710f0097', '2026-09-22T10:47:06.013Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:06.013Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 9, 18, 'Inona àry no valisoa azoko? Rehefa mitory ny vaovao tsara aho, dia afaka manome an’izany maimaim-poana. Tsy hanararaotra ny fahefako aho amin’izay rehefa mitory ny vaovao tsara.', 'inona àry no valisoa azoko? rehefa mitory ny vaovao tsara aho, dia afaka manome an’izany maimaim-poana. tsy hanararaotra ny fahefako aho amin’izay rehefa mitory ny vaovao tsara.'),
  ('6ab25caaa3eea8d5710f0096', '2026-09-22T10:47:06.013Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:06.013Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 9, 17, 'Raha an-tsitrapo no anaovako an’izany, dia manana valisoa aho. Na tsy an-tsitrapo aza anefa no anaovako an’izany, dia mbola manana asa nampiandraiketina ahy ihany aho.', 'raha an-tsitrapo no anaovako an’izany, dia manana valisoa aho. na tsy an-tsitrapo aza anefa no anaovako an’izany, dia mbola manana asa nampiandraiketina ahy ihany aho.'),
  ('6ab25caaa3eea8d5710f0095', '2026-09-22T10:47:06.013Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:06.013Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 9, 16, 'Koa raha mitory ny vaovao tsara aho, dia tsy misy antony ireharehako, fa tsy maintsy manao an’izany aho. Tena hahita loza aho raha tsy mitory ny vaovao tsara!', 'koa raha mitory ny vaovao tsara aho, dia tsy misy antony ireharehako, fa tsy maintsy manao an’izany aho. tena hahita loza aho raha tsy mitory ny vaovao tsara!'),
  ('6ab25caaa3eea8d5710f00a0', '2026-09-22T10:47:06.013Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:06.013Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 9, 27, 'fa asiako mafy ny vatako ka andevoziko, sao izaho indray no tsy hankasitrahana kanefa efa nitory tamin’ny hafa.', 'fa asiako mafy ny vatako ka andevoziko, sao izaho indray no tsy hankasitrahana kanefa efa nitory tamin’ny hafa.'),
  ('6ab25caaa3eea8d5710f0093', '2026-09-22T10:47:06.013Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:06.013Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 9, 14, 'Toy izany koa fa nanome didy ny Tompo hoe tokony hivelona amin’ny vaovao tsara izay mitory ny vaovao tsara.', 'toy izany koa fa nanome didy ny tompo hoe tokony hivelona amin’ny vaovao tsara izay mitory ny vaovao tsara.'),
  ('6ab25caaa3eea8d5710f009b', '2026-09-22T10:47:06.013Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:06.013Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 9, 22, 'Tamin’ny malemy, dia lasa malemy aho, mba hahazoako ny malemy. Lasa zava-drehetra tamin’ny karazan’olona rehetra aho, mba hisy hovonjeko na amin’ny fomba ahoana na amin’ny fomba ahoana.', 'tamin’ny malemy, dia lasa malemy aho, mba hahazoako ny malemy. lasa zava-drehetra tamin’ny karazan’olona rehetra aho, mba hisy hovonjeko na amin’ny fomba ahoana na amin’ny fomba ahoana.'),
  ('6ab25caaa3eea8d5710f0099', '2026-09-22T10:47:06.013Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:06.013Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 9, 20, 'Tamin’ny Jiosy dia nanao hoatran’ny Jiosy aho, mba hahazoako ny Jiosy. Tamin’izay teo ambanin’ny lalàna, dia lasa hoatran’izay teo ambanin’ny lalàna aho, na dia tsy eo ambanin’ny lalàna aza, mba hahazoako an’izay eo ambanin’ny lalàna.', 'tamin’ny jiosy dia nanao hoatran’ny jiosy aho, mba hahazoako ny jiosy. tamin’izay teo ambanin’ny lalàna, dia lasa hoatran’izay teo ambanin’ny lalàna aho, na dia tsy eo ambanin’ny lalàna aza, mba hahazoako an’izay eo ambanin’ny lalàna.'),
  ('6ab25caaa3eea8d5710f0088', '2026-09-22T10:47:06.013Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:06.013Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 9, 3, 'Izao àry no fiarovan-tenako amin’ireo manakiana ahy:', 'izao àry no fiarovan-tenako amin’ireo manakiana ahy:'),
  ('6ab25caaa3eea8d5710f0091', '2026-09-22T10:47:06.013Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:06.013Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 9, 12, 'Raha ny hafa aza manan-jo hitaky an’izany aminareo, tsy mainka ve fa izahay? Tsy mampiasa an’izany zo izany anefa izahay, fa miaritra ny zava-drehetra mba tsy hanakantsakananay ny fielezan’ny vaovao tsara momba an’i Kristy.', 'raha ny hafa aza manan-jo hitaky an’izany aminareo, tsy mainka ve fa izahay? tsy mampiasa an’izany zo izany anefa izahay, fa miaritra ny zava-drehetra mba tsy hanakantsakananay ny fielezan’ny vaovao tsara momba an’i kristy.'),
  ('6ab25caaa3eea8d5710f0086', '2026-09-22T10:47:06.013Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:06.013Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 9, 1, 'Tsy olona afaka ve aho? Tsy apostoly ve aho? Tsy efa nahita an’i Jesosy Tompontsika ve aho? Tsy ianareo ve no vokatry ny asako ao amin’ny Tompo?', 'tsy olona afaka ve aho? tsy apostoly ve aho? tsy efa nahita an’i jesosy tompontsika ve aho? tsy ianareo ve no vokatry ny asako ao amin’ny tompo?'),
  ('6ab25caaa3eea8d5710f0094', '2026-09-22T10:47:06.013Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:06.013Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 9, 15, 'Tsy nisy nampiasaiko anefa izany zo izany. Ary tsy hoe nanoratra an’ireo zavatra ireo aho mba hanaovana an’izany amiko, fa aleoko aza maty toy izay... Fa tsy misy olona havelako hanafoana ny antony ireharehako!', 'tsy nisy nampiasaiko anefa izany zo izany. ary tsy hoe nanoratra an’ireo zavatra ireo aho mba hanaovana an’izany amiko, fa aleoko aza maty toy izay... fa tsy misy olona havelako hanafoana ny antony ireharehako!'),
  ('6ab25caaa3eea8d5710f008d', '2026-09-22T10:47:06.013Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:06.013Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 9, 8, 'Hevitr’olona fotsiny ve izany lazaiko izany? Tsy izany koa angaha moa no lazain’ny Lalàna?', 'hevitr’olona fotsiny ve izany lazaiko izany? tsy izany koa angaha moa no lazain’ny lalàna?'),
  ('6ab25caaa3eea8d5710f009f', '2026-09-22T10:47:06.013Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:06.013Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 9, 26, 'Koa rehefa mihazakazaka aho, dia tsy mihazakazaka befahatany fotsiny. Ary tsy toy ny mamely rivotra aho rehefa mamely totohondry,', 'koa rehefa mihazakazaka aho, dia tsy mihazakazaka befahatany fotsiny. ary tsy toy ny mamely rivotra aho rehefa mamely totohondry,'),
  ('6ab25caaa3eea8d5710f008b', '2026-09-22T10:47:06.013Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:06.013Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 9, 6, 'Sa izaho sy Barnabasy ihany no tsy mba manan-jo hijanona tsy hanao asa fivelomana?', 'sa izaho sy barnabasy ihany no tsy mba manan-jo hijanona tsy hanao asa fivelomana?'),
  ('6ab25caaa3eea8d5710f0098', '2026-09-22T10:47:06.013Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:06.013Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 9, 19, 'Fa na dia afaka adidy amin’ny olona rehetra aza aho, dia efa nataoko ho mpanompon’ny rehetra ny tenako, mba hahazoako olona be dia be araka izay azo atao.', 'fa na dia afaka adidy amin’ny olona rehetra aza aho, dia efa nataoko ho mpanompon’ny rehetra ny tenako, mba hahazoako olona be dia be araka izay azo atao.'),
  ('6ab25caaa3eea8d5710f0090', '2026-09-22T10:47:06.013Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:06.013Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 9, 11, 'Raha namafy zavatra ara-panahy teo aminareo izahay, dia manararaotra be ve izahay raha mba mijinja fanampiana avy aminareo?', 'raha namafy zavatra ara-panahy teo aminareo izahay, dia manararaotra be ve izahay raha mba mijinja fanampiana avy aminareo?'),
  ('6ab25caaa3eea8d5710f008a', '2026-09-22T10:47:06.013Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:06.013Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 9, 5, 'Angaha izahay tsy manan-jo hanambady vehivavy mpino sy hitondra azy hiaraka aminay, hoatran’ny ataon’ny apostoly hafa rehetra sy ny rahalahin’ny Tompo ary Kefasy?', 'angaha izahay tsy manan-jo hanambady vehivavy mpino sy hitondra azy hiaraka aminay, hoatran’ny ataon’ny apostoly hafa rehetra sy ny rahalahin’ny tompo ary kefasy?'),
  ('6ab25caaa3eea8d5710f0089', '2026-09-22T10:47:06.013Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:06.013Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 9, 4, 'Angaha izahay tsy manan-jo hihinana sy hisotro?', 'angaha izahay tsy manan-jo hihinana sy hisotro?'),
  ('6ab25caaa3eea8d5710f009e', '2026-09-22T10:47:06.013Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:06.013Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 9, 25, 'Mifehy tena amin’ny zava-drehetra koa izay rehetra mandray anjara amin’ny fifaninanana. Mazava ho azy fa manao an’izany izy ireo mba hahazoana satroboninahitra mety simba, fa isika kosa manao an’izany mba hahazoana ny tsy mety simba.', 'mifehy tena amin’ny zava-drehetra koa izay rehetra mandray anjara amin’ny fifaninanana. mazava ho azy fa manao an’izany izy ireo mba hahazoana satroboninahitra mety simba, fa isika kosa manao an’izany mba hahazoana ny tsy mety simba.'),
  ('6ab25caaa3eea8d5710f009d', '2026-09-22T10:47:06.013Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:06.013Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 9, 24, 'Tsy fantatrareo ve fa mihazakazaka daholo ny mpihazakazaka rehetra manao fifaninanana, nefa iray ihany no mahazo ny loka? Mihazakazaha koa mba hahazoanareo loka.', 'tsy fantatrareo ve fa mihazakazaka daholo ny mpihazakazaka rehetra manao fifaninanana, nefa iray ihany no mahazo ny loka? mihazakazaha koa mba hahazoanareo loka.'),
  ('6ab25caaa3eea8d5710f009c', '2026-09-22T10:47:06.013Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:06.013Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 9, 23, 'Fa ataoko noho ny vaovao tsara ny zava-drehetra, mba hitoriako azy io amin’ny hafa.', 'fa ataoko noho ny vaovao tsara ny zava-drehetra, mba hitoriako azy io amin’ny hafa.'),
  ('6ab25caaa3eea8d5710f0087', '2026-09-22T10:47:06.013Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:06.013Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 9, 2, 'Na dia tsy apostoly ho an’ny olon-kafa aza aho, dia tena azo antoka fa apostoly ho anareo! Fa ianareo no tombo-kase manamarina hoe apostoly aho, ao amin’ny Tompo.', 'na dia tsy apostoly ho an’ny olon-kafa aza aho, dia tena azo antoka fa apostoly ho anareo! fa ianareo no tombo-kase manamarina hoe apostoly aho, ao amin’ny tompo.'),
  ('6ab25caaa3eea8d5710f0092', '2026-09-22T10:47:06.013Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:06.013Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 9, 13, 'Tsy fantatrareo ve fa izay manao asa masina ao amin’ny tempoly dia mihinana an’izay zavatra ao, ary izay manompo tsy tapaka eo amin’ny alitara dia mahazo anjara avy amin’ny alitara?', 'tsy fantatrareo ve fa izay manao asa masina ao amin’ny tempoly dia mihinana an’izay zavatra ao, ary izay manompo tsy tapaka eo amin’ny alitara dia mahazo anjara avy amin’ny alitara?'),
  ('6ab25caaa3eea8d5710f008f', '2026-09-22T10:47:06.013Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:06.013Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 9, 10, 'Sa noho isika mihitsy no nilazany an’izany? Tena noho isika no nanoratana an’izany, satria izay miasa tany sy izay miasa eny am-pamoloana dia tokony hanao an’izany sady hanantena hahazo anjara.', 'sa noho isika mihitsy no nilazany an’izany? tena noho isika no nanoratana an’izany, satria izay miasa tany sy izay miasa eny am-pamoloana dia tokony hanao an’izany sady hanantena hahazo anjara.'),
  ('6ab25caaa3eea8d5710f008c', '2026-09-22T10:47:06.013Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:06.013Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 9, 7, 'Aiza no hisy miaramila mianto-tena? Iza no mamboly voaloboka ka tsy mihinana ny voany? Na iza no miandry andian’ondry ka tsy misotro amin’ny rononony?', 'aiza no hisy miaramila mianto-tena? iza no mamboly voaloboka ka tsy mihinana ny voany? na iza no miandry andian’ondry ka tsy misotro amin’ny rononony?'),
  ('6ab25cabb05da20ba3841446', '2026-09-22T10:47:07.215Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:07.215Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 10, 1, 'Tiako ho fantatrareo, ry rahalahy, fa nandeha teo ambanin’ny rahona daholo ny razambentsika, ary namakivaky ny ranomasina izy rehetra.', 'tiako ho fantatrareo, ry rahalahy, fa nandeha teo ambanin’ny rahona daholo ny razambentsika, ary namakivaky ny ranomasina izy rehetra.'),
  ('6ab25cabb05da20ba3841466', '2026-09-22T10:47:07.215Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:07.215Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 10, 33, 'fa manaova hoatr’ahy. Miezaka aho hanao izay hahafaly ny rehetra amin’ny zava-drehetra, ka tsy mitady izay hahasoa ahy fa izay hahasoa ny maro, mba ho voavonjy izy ireny.', 'fa manaova hoatr’ahy. miezaka aho hanao izay hahafaly ny rehetra amin’ny zava-drehetra, ka tsy mitady izay hahasoa ahy fa izay hahasoa ny maro, mba ho voavonjy izy ireny.'),
  ('6ab25cabb05da20ba384145c', '2026-09-22T10:47:07.215Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:07.215Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 10, 23, 'Azo atao ny zava-drehetra, nefa tsy ny zava-drehetra no mahasoa. Azo atao ny zava-drehetra, nefa tsy ny zava-drehetra no mampahery.', 'azo atao ny zava-drehetra, nefa tsy ny zava-drehetra no mahasoa. azo atao ny zava-drehetra, nefa tsy ny zava-drehetra no mampahery.'),
  ('6ab25cabb05da20ba3841456', '2026-09-22T10:47:07.215Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:07.215Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 10, 17, 'Koa satria tsy misy afa-tsy mofo iray ihany, dia vatana iray isika, na maro aza. Samy mihinana amin’io mofo iray io mantsy isika rehetra.', 'koa satria tsy misy afa-tsy mofo iray ihany, dia vatana iray isika, na maro aza. samy mihinana amin’io mofo iray io mantsy isika rehetra.'),
  ('6ab25cabb05da20ba384145a', '2026-09-22T10:47:07.215Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:07.215Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 10, 21, 'Tsy azonareo atao ny misotro amin’ny kaopin’i Jehovah sady misotro amin’ny kaopin’ny demonia. Tsy azonareo atao ny mihinana amin’ny “latabatr’i Jehovah” sady mihinana amin’ny latabatry ny demonia.', 'tsy azonareo atao ny misotro amin’ny kaopin’i jehovah sady misotro amin’ny kaopin’ny demonia. tsy azonareo atao ny mihinana amin’ny “latabatr’i jehovah” sady mihinana amin’ny latabatry ny demonia.'),
  ('6ab25cabb05da20ba3841454', '2026-09-22T10:47:07.215Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:07.215Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 10, 15, 'Miresaka aminareo hoatran’ny miresaka amin’ny olona manam-pahendrena aho, ka ianareo mihitsy no aoka hitsara an’izay lazaiko.', 'miresaka aminareo hoatran’ny miresaka amin’ny olona manam-pahendrena aho, ka ianareo mihitsy no aoka hitsara an’izay lazaiko.'),
  ('6ab25cabb05da20ba3841460', '2026-09-22T10:47:07.215Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:07.215Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 10, 27, 'Raha misy tsy mpino manasa anareo ka te ho any ianareo, dia hano izay rehetra aroso eo anoloanareo, fa aza manontany sao hampikorontana ny feon’ny fieritreretanareo izany.', 'raha misy tsy mpino manasa anareo ka te ho any ianareo, dia hano izay rehetra aroso eo anoloanareo, fa aza manontany sao hampikorontana ny feon’ny fieritreretanareo izany.'),
  ('6ab25cabb05da20ba3841448', '2026-09-22T10:47:07.215Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:07.215Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 10, 3, 'Nihinana sakafo ara-panahy mitovy koa izy rehetra,', 'nihinana sakafo ara-panahy mitovy koa izy rehetra,'),
  ('6ab25cabb05da20ba384145b', '2026-09-22T10:47:07.215Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:07.215Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 10, 22, 'Sa “manao izay hahasaro-piaro an’i Jehovah isika”? Mahery noho izy angaha isika?', 'sa “manao izay hahasaro-piaro an’i jehovah isika”? mahery noho izy angaha isika?'),
  ('6ab25cabb05da20ba3841461', '2026-09-22T10:47:07.215Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:07.215Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 10, 28, 'Fa raha misy kosa miteny aminareo hoe: “Zavatra avy natao sorona ity”, dia aza mihinana noho ilay olona nilaza taminareo an’izany sy noho ny feon’ny fieritreretana.', 'fa raha misy kosa miteny aminareo hoe: “zavatra avy natao sorona ity”, dia aza mihinana noho ilay olona nilaza taminareo an’izany sy noho ny feon’ny fieritreretana.'),
  ('6ab25cabb05da20ba3841451', '2026-09-22T10:47:07.215Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:07.215Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 10, 12, 'Koa izay mihevi-tena ho efa mijoro dia aoka izy hitandrina sao ho lavo.', 'koa izay mihevi-tena ho efa mijoro dia aoka izy hitandrina sao ho lavo.'),
  ('6ab25cabb05da20ba384144f', '2026-09-22T10:47:07.215Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:07.215Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 10, 10, 'Aza mimenomenona toy ny sasany tamin’ireny izay nimenomenona, ka matin’ny mpandringana.', 'aza mimenomenona toy ny sasany tamin’ireny izay nimenomenona, ka matin’ny mpandringana.'),
  ('6ab25cabb05da20ba384144c', '2026-09-22T10:47:07.215Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:07.215Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 10, 7, 'Mitandrema ianareo sao ho lasa mpanompo sampy, hoatran’ny sasany taminy, araka ny voasoratra hoe: “Nipetraka hihinana sy hisotro ny vahoaka. Taorian’izay dia nitsangana izy ireo mba hanao fety.”', 'mitandrema ianareo sao ho lasa mpanompo sampy, hoatran’ny sasany taminy, araka ny voasoratra hoe: “nipetraka hihinana sy hisotro ny vahoaka. taorian’izay dia nitsangana izy ireo mba hanao fety.”'),
  ('6ab25cabb05da20ba384144a', '2026-09-22T10:47:07.215Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:07.215Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 10, 5, 'Na izany aza, dia tsy nankasitrahan’Andriamanitra ny ankamaroany, fa ripaka tany an-tany efitra.', 'na izany aza, dia tsy nankasitrahan’andriamanitra ny ankamaroany, fa ripaka tany an-tany efitra.'),
  ('6ab25cabb05da20ba3841447', '2026-09-22T10:47:07.215Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:07.215Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 10, 2, 'Ary natao batisa tamin’ny rahona sy ny ranomasina izy ireo, tamin’izy ireo nanaraka an’i Mosesy.', 'ary natao batisa tamin’ny rahona sy ny ranomasina izy ireo, tamin’izy ireo nanaraka an’i mosesy.'),
  ('6ab25cabb05da20ba3841464', '2026-09-22T10:47:07.215Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:07.215Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 10, 31, 'Koa na mihinana na misotro ianareo, na inona na inona ataonareo, dia ataovy mba hanomezam-boninahitra an’Andriamanitra ny zava-drehetra.', 'koa na mihinana na misotro ianareo, na inona na inona ataonareo, dia ataovy mba hanomezam-boninahitra an’andriamanitra ny zava-drehetra.'),
  ('6ab25cabb05da20ba3841459', '2026-09-22T10:47:07.215Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:07.215Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 10, 20, 'Tsy izany, fa ny tiako holazaina dia hoe izay atolotry ny hafa firenena ho sorona dia ataony sorona ho an’ny demonia, fa tsy ho an’Andriamanitra. Koa tsy tiako hanan-javatra iombonana amin’ny demonia ianareo.', 'tsy izany, fa ny tiako holazaina dia hoe izay atolotry ny hafa firenena ho sorona dia ataony sorona ho an’ny demonia, fa tsy ho an’andriamanitra. koa tsy tiako hanan-javatra iombonana amin’ny demonia ianareo.'),
  ('6ab25cabb05da20ba3841455', '2026-09-22T10:47:07.215Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:07.215Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 10, 16, 'Tsy mandray soa amin’ny ran’i Kristy koa ve isika, rehefa misotro amin’ilay kaopin’ny fisaorana izay isaorantsika? Ary tsy mandray soa amin’ny vatan’i Kristy koa ve isika, rehefa mihinana ny mofo tapahintsika?', 'tsy mandray soa amin’ny ran’i kristy koa ve isika, rehefa misotro amin’ilay kaopin’ny fisaorana izay isaorantsika? ary tsy mandray soa amin’ny vatan’i kristy koa ve isika, rehefa mihinana ny mofo tapahintsika?'),
  ('6ab25cabb05da20ba384144d', '2026-09-22T10:47:07.215Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:07.215Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 10, 8, 'Ary aoka isika tsy hijangajanga, toy ny nijangajangan’ny sasany tamin’ireny, ka 23 000 taminy no maty tao anatin’ny iray andro.', 'ary aoka isika tsy hijangajanga, toy ny nijangajangan’ny sasany tamin’ireny, ka 23 000 taminy no maty tao anatin’ny iray andro.'),
  ('6ab25cabb05da20ba3841463', '2026-09-22T10:47:07.215Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:07.215Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 10, 30, 'Raha mihinana aho sady misaotra an’Andriamanitra noho ilay zavatra haniko, dia nahoana moa aho no tokony homena tsiny amin’ilay sakafo anaovako fisaorana?', 'raha mihinana aho sady misaotra an’andriamanitra noho ilay zavatra haniko, dia nahoana moa aho no tokony homena tsiny amin’ilay sakafo anaovako fisaorana?'),
  ('6ab25cabb05da20ba3841449', '2026-09-22T10:47:07.215Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:07.215Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 10, 4, 'sady nisotro zava-pisotro ara-panahy mitovy daholo. Fa nisotro tamin’ilay vatolampy ara-panahy nanaraka azy izy ireo, ary i Kristy izany vatolampy izany.', 'sady nisotro zava-pisotro ara-panahy mitovy daholo. fa nisotro tamin’ilay vatolampy ara-panahy nanaraka azy izy ireo, ary i kristy izany vatolampy izany.'),
  ('6ab25cabb05da20ba3841462', '2026-09-22T10:47:07.215Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:07.215Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 10, 29, 'Tsy ny feon’ny fieritreretanao anefa no tiako holazaina, fa ny an’ilay olona. Fa nahoana ny fahafahako no tokony hotsarain’ny feon’ny fieritreretan’olon-kafa?', 'tsy ny feon’ny fieritreretanao anefa no tiako holazaina, fa ny an’ilay olona. fa nahoana ny fahafahako no tokony hotsarain’ny feon’ny fieritreretan’olon-kafa?'),
  ('6ab25cabb05da20ba3841450', '2026-09-22T10:47:07.215Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:07.215Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 10, 11, 'Nanjo azy ireny izany mba ho anatra, ary nosoratana mba hampitandremana antsika, dia isika izay velona amin’ny fotoana ahatongavan’ny faran’izao tontolo izao.', 'nanjo azy ireny izany mba ho anatra, ary nosoratana mba hampitandremana antsika, dia isika izay velona amin’ny fotoana ahatongavan’ny faran’izao tontolo izao.'),
  ('6ab25cabb05da20ba3841465', '2026-09-22T10:47:07.215Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:07.215Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 10, 32, 'Aza manao izay hahatafintohina ny Jiosy na ny Grika na ny fiangonan’Andriamanitra,', 'aza manao izay hahatafintohina ny jiosy na ny grika na ny fiangonan’andriamanitra,'),
  ('6ab25cabb05da20ba384145f', '2026-09-22T10:47:07.215Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:07.215Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 10, 26, 'Fa “an’i Jehovah ny tany sy izay rehetra eo aminy.”', 'fa “an’i jehovah ny tany sy izay rehetra eo aminy.”'),
  ('6ab25cabb05da20ba384145d', '2026-09-22T10:47:07.215Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:07.215Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 10, 24, 'Aoka ny tsirairay hitady foana an’izay hahasoa ny hafa, fa tsy izay hahasoa ny tenany.', 'aoka ny tsirairay hitady foana an’izay hahasoa ny hafa, fa tsy izay hahasoa ny tenany.'),
  ('6ab25cabb05da20ba384145e', '2026-09-22T10:47:07.215Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:07.215Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 10, 25, 'Hano izay hena amidy eny an-tsena, fa aza manontany noho ny feon’ny fieritreretanareo.', 'hano izay hena amidy eny an-tsena, fa aza manontany noho ny feon’ny fieritreretanareo.'),
  ('6ab25cabb05da20ba3841457', '2026-09-22T10:47:07.215Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:07.215Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 10, 18, 'Jereo ny Israely araka ny nofo: Tsy hoatran’ny hoe miara-misakafo amin’Andriamanitra ve izay mihinana sorona avy eo amin’ny alitara?', 'jereo ny israely araka ny nofo: tsy hoatran’ny hoe miara-misakafo amin’andriamanitra ve izay mihinana sorona avy eo amin’ny alitara?'),
  ('6ab25cabb05da20ba384144b', '2026-09-22T10:47:07.215Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:07.215Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 10, 6, 'Anatra ho antsika izany, mba tsy haniriantsika zava-dratsy, hoatr’azy ireo naniry an’izany.', 'anatra ho antsika izany, mba tsy haniriantsika zava-dratsy, hoatr’azy ireo naniry an’izany.'),
  ('6ab25cabb05da20ba3841458', '2026-09-22T10:47:07.215Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:07.215Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 10, 19, 'Te hilaza ve aho hoe misy dikany izay sorona atao ho an’ny sampy, na hoe misy dikany ny sampy?', 'te hilaza ve aho hoe misy dikany izay sorona atao ho an’ny sampy, na hoe misy dikany ny sampy?'),
  ('6ab25cabb05da20ba384144e', '2026-09-22T10:47:07.215Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:07.215Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 10, 9, 'Ary aoka isika tsy hitsapa toetra an’i Jehovah, hoatran’ny sasany tamin’ireny izay nitsapa toetra azy, ka matin’ny bibilava.', 'ary aoka isika tsy hitsapa toetra an’i jehovah, hoatran’ny sasany tamin’ireny izay nitsapa toetra azy, ka matin’ny bibilava.'),
  ('6ab25cabb05da20ba3841453', '2026-09-22T10:47:07.215Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:07.215Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 10, 14, 'Koa andosiro ny fanompoan-tsampy, ry malala.', 'koa andosiro ny fanompoan-tsampy, ry malala.'),
  ('6ab25cabb05da20ba3841452', '2026-09-22T10:47:07.215Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:07.215Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 10, 13, 'Tsy misy fakam-panahy mahazo anareo, afa-tsy izay mpahazo ny olona. Tsy mivadika amin’ny teniny anefa Andriamanitra, ka tsy hamela anareo halaim-panahy mihoatra noho izay zakanareo. Fa rehefa misy fakam-panahy dia hasiany lalan-kivoahana koa, mba hahazakanareo an’izany.', 'tsy misy fakam-panahy mahazo anareo, afa-tsy izay mpahazo ny olona. tsy mivadika amin’ny teniny anefa andriamanitra, ka tsy hamela anareo halaim-panahy mihoatra noho izay zakanareo. fa rehefa misy fakam-panahy dia hasiany lalan-kivoahana koa, mba hahazakanareo an’izany.'),
  ('6ab25cacfdbe941181d6aba3', '2026-09-22T10:47:08.530Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:08.530Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 11, 34, 'Raha misy noana, dia aoka izy hihinana any an-tranony, mba tsy homelohina ianareo rehefa mivory. Fa ny raharaha sisa kosa halamiko rehefa tonga any aho.', 'raha misy noana, dia aoka izy hihinana any an-tranony, mba tsy homelohina ianareo rehefa mivory. fa ny raharaha sisa kosa halamiko rehefa tonga any aho.'),
  ('6ab25cacfdbe941181d6ab99', '2026-09-22T10:47:08.530Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:08.530Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 11, 24, 'Ary rehefa avy nisaotra an’Andriamanitra izy, dia notapahiny ilay mofo ary hoy izy: “Ity no vatako izay omena ho anareo. Ataovy foana izao ho fahatsiarovana ahy.”', 'ary rehefa avy nisaotra an’andriamanitra izy, dia notapahiny ilay mofo ary hoy izy: “ity no vatako izay omena ho anareo. ataovy foana izao ho fahatsiarovana ahy.”'),
  ('6ab25cacfdbe941181d6ab96', '2026-09-22T10:47:08.530Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:08.530Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 11, 21, 'Fa rehefa mihinana an’izany ianareo, dia efa avy nisakafo hariva ny sasany. Misy noana àry aminareo ary misy mamo.', 'fa rehefa mihinana an’izany ianareo, dia efa avy nisakafo hariva ny sasany. misy noana àry aminareo ary misy mamo.'),
  ('6ab25cacfdbe941181d6ab94', '2026-09-22T10:47:08.530Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:08.530Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 11, 19, 'Fa tsy maintsy hisy hanangana antokom-pinoana eo aminareo, mba hiharihary hoe iza aminareo no ankasitrahana.', 'fa tsy maintsy hisy hanangana antokom-pinoana eo aminareo, mba hiharihary hoe iza aminareo no ankasitrahana.'),
  ('6ab25cacfdbe941181d6ab8a', '2026-09-22T10:47:08.530Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:08.530Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 11, 9, 'Ankoatra izany, dia tsy noforonina ho an’ny vehivavy ny lehilahy, fa ny vehivavy no noforonina ho an’ny lehilahy.', 'ankoatra izany, dia tsy noforonina ho an’ny vehivavy ny lehilahy, fa ny vehivavy no noforonina ho an’ny lehilahy.'),
  ('6ab25cacfdbe941181d6aba1', '2026-09-22T10:47:08.530Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:08.530Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 11, 32, 'Rehefa tsaraina anefa isika, dia faizin’i Jehovah mba tsy homelohina miaraka amin’izao tontolo izao.', 'rehefa tsaraina anefa isika, dia faizin’i jehovah mba tsy homelohina miaraka amin’izao tontolo izao.'),
  ('6ab25cacfdbe941181d6ab9b', '2026-09-22T10:47:08.530Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:08.530Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 11, 26, 'Fa isaky ny mihinana an’izany mofo izany sy misotro amin’izany kaopy izany ianareo, dia manambara foana ny fahafatesan’ny Tompo, mandra-piaviny.', 'fa isaky ny mihinana an’izany mofo izany sy misotro amin’izany kaopy izany ianareo, dia manambara foana ny fahafatesan’ny tompo, mandra-piaviny.'),
  ('6ab25cacfdbe941181d6ab95', '2026-09-22T10:47:08.530Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:08.530Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 11, 20, 'Rehefa mivory ao amin’ny toerana iray ianareo, dia tsy ny hihinana ny Sakafo Harivan’ny Tompo no tena ahatongavanareo.', 'rehefa mivory ao amin’ny toerana iray ianareo, dia tsy ny hihinana ny sakafo harivan’ny tompo no tena ahatongavanareo.'),
  ('6ab25cacfdbe941181d6ab8f', '2026-09-22T10:47:08.530Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:08.530Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 11, 14, 'Tsy efa voajanahary mihitsy ve ny hoe henatra ho an’ny lehilahy ny lava volo,', 'tsy efa voajanahary mihitsy ve ny hoe henatra ho an’ny lehilahy ny lava volo,'),
  ('6ab25cacfdbe941181d6ab85', '2026-09-22T10:47:08.530Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:08.530Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 11, 4, 'Izay lehilahy mivavaka na maminany ka misaron-doha, dia manao izay hahamenatra an’ilay lohany.', 'izay lehilahy mivavaka na maminany ka misaron-doha, dia manao izay hahamenatra an’ilay lohany.'),
  ('6ab25cacfdbe941181d6ab84', '2026-09-22T10:47:08.530Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:08.530Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 11, 3, 'Tiako ho fantatrareo anefa fa i Kristy no lohan’ny lehilahy rehetra, ny lehilahy no lohan’ny vehivavy, ary Andriamanitra kosa no lohan’i Kristy.', 'tiako ho fantatrareo anefa fa i kristy no lohan’ny lehilahy rehetra, ny lehilahy no lohan’ny vehivavy, ary andriamanitra kosa no lohan’i kristy.'),
  ('6ab25cacfdbe941181d6ab98', '2026-09-22T10:47:08.530Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:08.530Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 11, 23, 'Fa izao no noraisiko tamin’ny Tompo ka nampitaiko taminareo koa: Nandray mofo i Jesosy Tompo tamin’iny alina hamadihana azy iny.', 'fa izao no noraisiko tamin’ny tompo ka nampitaiko taminareo koa: nandray mofo i jesosy tompo tamin’iny alina hamadihana azy iny.'),
  ('6ab25cacfdbe941181d6ab89', '2026-09-22T10:47:08.530Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:08.530Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 11, 8, 'Tsy ny lehilahy mantsy no avy tamin’ny vehivavy, fa ny vehivavy no avy tamin’ny lehilahy.', 'tsy ny lehilahy mantsy no avy tamin’ny vehivavy, fa ny vehivavy no avy tamin’ny lehilahy.'),
  ('6ab25cacfdbe941181d6ab92', '2026-09-22T10:47:08.530Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:08.530Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 11, 17, 'Tsy midera anareo anefa aho raha manome toromarika anareo, satria tsy mitondra soa ho anareo ny fivorianareo, fa vao mainka aza manimba anareo.', 'tsy midera anareo anefa aho raha manome toromarika anareo, satria tsy mitondra soa ho anareo ny fivorianareo, fa vao mainka aza manimba anareo.'),
  ('6ab25cacfdbe941181d6ab87', '2026-09-22T10:47:08.530Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:08.530Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 11, 6, 'Fa raha tsy misaron-doha ny vehivavy, dia tokony hotapahina fohy kely ny volony. Raha mahamenatra azy anefa ny hoe hotapahina fohy kely ny volony na hokakasana, dia tokony hisaron-doha izy.', 'fa raha tsy misaron-doha ny vehivavy, dia tokony hotapahina fohy kely ny volony. raha mahamenatra azy anefa ny hoe hotapahina fohy kely ny volony na hokakasana, dia tokony hisaron-doha izy.'),
  ('6ab25cacfdbe941181d6ab9e', '2026-09-22T10:47:08.530Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:08.530Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 11, 29, 'Fa izay mihinana sy misotro nefa tsy mamantatra tsara ny vatan’ny Tompo, dia mihinana sy misotro fanamelohana ho an’ny tenany.', 'fa izay mihinana sy misotro nefa tsy mamantatra tsara ny vatan’ny tompo, dia mihinana sy misotro fanamelohana ho an’ny tenany.'),
  ('6ab25cacfdbe941181d6aba2', '2026-09-22T10:47:08.530Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:08.530Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 11, 33, 'Koa rehefa mivory mba hihinana an’izany ianareo, ry rahalahiko, dia aoka hifampiandry.', 'koa rehefa mivory mba hihinana an’izany ianareo, ry rahalahiko, dia aoka hifampiandry.'),
  ('6ab25cacfdbe941181d6ab90', '2026-09-22T10:47:08.530Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:08.530Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 11, 15, 'fa voninahitra ho an’ny vehivavy kosa ny lava volo? Ny volony mantsy no nomena azy hanaronany ny lohany.', 'fa voninahitra ho an’ny vehivavy kosa ny lava volo? ny volony mantsy no nomena azy hanaronany ny lohany.'),
  ('6ab25cacfdbe941181d6ab88', '2026-09-22T10:47:08.530Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:08.530Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 11, 7, 'Fa tsy tokony hisaron-doha ny lehilahy satria endrika sy voninahitr’Andriamanitra izy, fa ny vehivavy kosa voninahitry ny lehilahy.', 'fa tsy tokony hisaron-doha ny lehilahy satria endrika sy voninahitr’andriamanitra izy, fa ny vehivavy kosa voninahitry ny lehilahy.'),
  ('6ab25cacfdbe941181d6ab86', '2026-09-22T10:47:08.530Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:08.530Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 11, 5, 'Fa izay vehivavy mivavaka na maminany ka tsy misaron-doha kosa, dia manao izay hahamenatra an’ilay lohany, satria hoatran’ny vehivavy nokakasana mihitsy izy.', 'fa izay vehivavy mivavaka na maminany ka tsy misaron-doha kosa, dia manao izay hahamenatra an’ilay lohany, satria hoatran’ny vehivavy nokakasana mihitsy izy.'),
  ('6ab25cacfdbe941181d6ab82', '2026-09-22T10:47:08.530Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:08.530Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 11, 1, 'Manahafa ahy, hoatran’ny anahafako an’i Kristy.', 'manahafa ahy, hoatran’ny anahafako an’i kristy.'),
  ('6ab25cacfdbe941181d6ab97', '2026-09-22T10:47:08.530Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:08.530Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 11, 22, 'Tsy manana trano ihinanana sy isotroana angaha ianareo? Sa ataonareo tsinontsinona ny fiangonan’Andriamanitra, ka ataonareo izay hahamenatra an’ireo tsy mba manana na inona na inona? Inona re no holazaiko aminareo e? Tokony hidera anareo ve aho? Tsy hidera anareo amin’izany aho.', 'tsy manana trano ihinanana sy isotroana angaha ianareo? sa ataonareo tsinontsinona ny fiangonan’andriamanitra, ka ataonareo izay hahamenatra an’ireo tsy mba manana na inona na inona? inona re no holazaiko aminareo e? tokony hidera anareo ve aho? tsy hidera anareo amin’izany aho.'),
  ('6ab25cacfdbe941181d6ab93', '2026-09-22T10:47:08.530Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:08.530Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 11, 18, 'Voalohany aloha, dia henoko fa misy fisaratsarahana eo aminareo rehefa mivory ny fiangonanareo, ary mino aho hoe marina ihany izany.', 'voalohany aloha, dia henoko fa misy fisaratsarahana eo aminareo rehefa mivory ny fiangonanareo, ary mino aho hoe marina ihany izany.'),
  ('6ab25cacfdbe941181d6ab91', '2026-09-22T10:47:08.530Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:08.530Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 11, 16, 'Raha misy anefa tsy manaiky an’izany fa te hanaraka fanao hafa, dia tsy manana fanao hafa na izahay na ny fiangonan’Andriamanitra.', 'raha misy anefa tsy manaiky an’izany fa te hanaraka fanao hafa, dia tsy manana fanao hafa na izahay na ny fiangonan’andriamanitra.'),
  ('6ab25cacfdbe941181d6ab8b', '2026-09-22T10:47:08.530Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:08.530Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 11, 10, 'Izany no mahatonga ny vehivavy hanao saron-doha, izany hoe hanao mariky ny fanajana fahefana, noho ny amin’ny anjely.', 'izany no mahatonga ny vehivavy hanao saron-doha, izany hoe hanao mariky ny fanajana fahefana, noho ny amin’ny anjely.'),
  ('6ab25cacfdbe941181d6aba0', '2026-09-22T10:47:08.530Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:08.530Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 11, 31, 'Fa tsy hotsaraina isika raha mamantatra tsara ny tenantsika.', 'fa tsy hotsaraina isika raha mamantatra tsara ny tenantsika.'),
  ('6ab25cacfdbe941181d6ab9c', '2026-09-22T10:47:08.530Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:08.530Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 11, 27, 'Koa na iza na iza mihinana ny mofo na misotro amin’ny kaopin’ny Tompo, nefa tsy mendrika an’izany akory, dia manao tsinontsinona ny vatan’ny Tompo sy ny rany.', 'koa na iza na iza mihinana ny mofo na misotro amin’ny kaopin’ny tompo, nefa tsy mendrika an’izany akory, dia manao tsinontsinona ny vatan’ny tompo sy ny rany.'),
  ('6ab25cacfdbe941181d6ab8e', '2026-09-22T10:47:08.530Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:08.530Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 11, 13, 'Ianareo mihitsy no aoka hitsara: Mety ve raha mivavaka amin’Andriamanitra ny vehivavy ka tsy misaron-doha?', 'ianareo mihitsy no aoka hitsara: mety ve raha mivavaka amin’andriamanitra ny vehivavy ka tsy misaron-doha?'),
  ('6ab25cacfdbe941181d6ab83', '2026-09-22T10:47:08.530Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:08.530Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 11, 2, 'Midera anareo aho, satria tsaroanareo aho amin’ny zava-drehetra sady arahinareo tsara ny fampianarana nampitaiko taminareo.', 'midera anareo aho, satria tsaroanareo aho amin’ny zava-drehetra sady arahinareo tsara ny fampianarana nampitaiko taminareo.'),
  ('6ab25cacfdbe941181d6ab9d', '2026-09-22T10:47:08.530Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:08.530Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 11, 28, 'Aoka handini-tena tsara aloha ny tsirairay mba hahitany raha mendrika izy na tsia, izay izy vao hihinana amin’ny mofo sy hisotro amin’ny kaopy.', 'aoka handini-tena tsara aloha ny tsirairay mba hahitany raha mendrika izy na tsia, izay izy vao hihinana amin’ny mofo sy hisotro amin’ny kaopy.'),
  ('6ab25cacfdbe941181d6ab9a', '2026-09-22T10:47:08.530Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:08.530Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 11, 25, 'Toy izany koa no nataony tamin’ny kaopy, rehefa avy nihinana ny sakafo hariva izy ireo. Dia hoy izy: “Ity kaopy ity no fifanekena vaovao miorina amin’ny rako. Ataovy foana izao ho fahatsiarovana ahy, isaky ny misotro amin’izy ity ianareo.”', 'toy izany koa no nataony tamin’ny kaopy, rehefa avy nihinana ny sakafo hariva izy ireo. dia hoy izy: “ity kaopy ity no fifanekena vaovao miorina amin’ny rako. ataovy foana izao ho fahatsiarovana ahy, isaky ny misotro amin’izy ity ianareo.”'),
  ('6ab25cacfdbe941181d6ab8d', '2026-09-22T10:47:08.530Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:08.530Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 11, 12, 'Hoatran’ny niavian’ny vehivavy avy tamin’ny lehilahy mantsy no niavian’ny lehilahy koa avy tamin’ny vehivavy. Fa avy amin’Andriamanitra kosa ny zava-drehetra.', 'hoatran’ny niavian’ny vehivavy avy tamin’ny lehilahy mantsy no niavian’ny lehilahy koa avy tamin’ny vehivavy. fa avy amin’andriamanitra kosa ny zava-drehetra.'),
  ('6ab25cacfdbe941181d6ab8c', '2026-09-22T10:47:08.530Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:08.530Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 11, 11, 'Eo amin’ireo mpianatry ny Tompo anefa, dia tsy misy ny vehivavy raha tsy eo ny lehilahy, ary tsy misy ny lehilahy raha tsy eo ny vehivavy.', 'eo amin’ireo mpianatry ny tompo anefa, dia tsy misy ny vehivavy raha tsy eo ny lehilahy, ary tsy misy ny lehilahy raha tsy eo ny vehivavy.'),
  ('6ab25cacfdbe941181d6ab9f', '2026-09-22T10:47:08.530Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:08.530Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 11, 30, 'Izany no mahatonga ny maro aminareo ho osa sy harary, ary betsaka koa no efa maty.', 'izany no mahatonga ny maro aminareo ho osa sy harary, ary betsaka koa no efa maty.'),
  ('6ab25cad6d7d3e7bf35a45da', '2026-09-22T10:47:09.832Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:09.832Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 12, 1, 'Tiako ho fantatrareo tsara, ry rahalahy, ny momba an’ireo fanomezana avy amin’ny fanahy.', 'tiako ho fantatrareo tsara, ry rahalahy, ny momba an’ireo fanomezana avy amin’ny fanahy.'),
  ('6ab25cad6d7d3e7bf35a45db', '2026-09-22T10:47:09.832Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:09.832Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 12, 2, 'Fantatrareo fa tamin’ianareo mbola olon’izao tontolo izao, dia voatarika hanompo an’ireo sampy moana ianareo, ka nandeha tany amin’izay nitondrana anareo.', 'fantatrareo fa tamin’ianareo mbola olon’izao tontolo izao, dia voatarika hanompo an’ireo sampy moana ianareo, ka nandeha tany amin’izay nitondrana anareo.'),
  ('6ab25cad6d7d3e7bf35a45dc', '2026-09-22T10:47:09.832Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:09.832Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 12, 3, 'Ampahafantariko anareo fa tsy misy olona tarihin’ny fanahin’Andriamanitra ka milaza hoe: “Voaozona i Jesosy!” Ary tsy misy afaka milaza hoe: “I Jesosy no Tompo!”, raha tsy tarihin’ny fanahy masina.', 'ampahafantariko anareo fa tsy misy olona tarihin’ny fanahin’andriamanitra ka milaza hoe: “voaozona i jesosy!” ary tsy misy afaka milaza hoe: “i jesosy no tompo!”, raha tsy tarihin’ny fanahy masina.'),
  ('6ab25cad6d7d3e7bf35a45dd', '2026-09-22T10:47:09.832Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:09.832Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 12, 4, 'Misy fanomezana maro samihafa, nefa iray ihany ny fanahy.', 'misy fanomezana maro samihafa, nefa iray ihany ny fanahy.'),
  ('6ab25cad6d7d3e7bf35a45de', '2026-09-22T10:47:09.832Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:09.832Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 12, 5, 'Ary misy fanompoana maro samihafa, nefa iray ihany ny Tompo.', 'ary misy fanompoana maro samihafa, nefa iray ihany ny tompo.'),
  ('6ab25cad6d7d3e7bf35a45df', '2026-09-22T10:47:09.832Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:09.832Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 12, 6, 'Misy asa maro samihafa, nefa iray ihany ny Andriamanitra manatontosa azy rehetra amin’ny alalan’ny olona rehetra.', 'misy asa maro samihafa, nefa iray ihany ny andriamanitra manatontosa azy rehetra amin’ny alalan’ny olona rehetra.'),
  ('6ab25cad6d7d3e7bf35a45e0', '2026-09-22T10:47:09.832Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:09.832Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 12, 7, 'Miharihary eo amin’ny tsirairay ny fomba fiasan’ny fanahy mba handraisan-tsoa.', 'miharihary eo amin’ny tsirairay ny fomba fiasan’ny fanahy mba handraisan-tsoa.');
INSERT INTO "bible_verses" ("id", "created_date", "updated_date", "created_by_id", "created_by", "translation", "book", "bookOrder", "chapter", "verse", "text", "normalizedText") VALUES
  ('6ab25cad6d7d3e7bf35a45e1', '2026-09-22T10:47:09.832Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:09.832Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 12, 8, 'Fa ny iray nomena tenim-pahendrena tamin’ny alalan’ny fanahy, ary ny iray tenim-pahalalana tamin’ny alalan’io fanahy io ihany.', 'fa ny iray nomena tenim-pahendrena tamin’ny alalan’ny fanahy, ary ny iray tenim-pahalalana tamin’ny alalan’io fanahy io ihany.'),
  ('6ab25cad6d7d3e7bf35a45e2', '2026-09-22T10:47:09.832Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:09.832Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 12, 9, 'Ny iray nahazo finoana tamin’ny alalan’io fanahy io, ary ny iray kosa nampian’io fanahy io hahay hanasitrana,', 'ny iray nahazo finoana tamin’ny alalan’io fanahy io, ary ny iray kosa nampian’io fanahy io hahay hanasitrana,'),
  ('6ab25cad6d7d3e7bf35a45e3', '2026-09-22T10:47:09.832Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:09.832Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 12, 10, 'ny iray hanao fahagagana, ny iray hahay haminany, ny iray hahay hamantatra ny fanambarana avy amin’ny fanahy, ny iray hiteny amin’ny fiteny samihafa, ary ny iray kosa handika teny.', 'ny iray hanao fahagagana, ny iray hahay haminany, ny iray hahay hamantatra ny fanambarana avy amin’ny fanahy, ny iray hiteny amin’ny fiteny samihafa, ary ny iray kosa handika teny.'),
  ('6ab25cad6d7d3e7bf35a45e4', '2026-09-22T10:47:09.832Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:09.832Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 12, 11, 'Fanahy iray ihany anefa no manao an’izany asa rehetra izany, ka mizara an’izany amin’ny tsirairay avy, araka izay tiany.', 'fanahy iray ihany anefa no manao an’izany asa rehetra izany, ka mizara an’izany amin’ny tsirairay avy, araka izay tiany.'),
  ('6ab25cad6d7d3e7bf35a45e5', '2026-09-22T10:47:09.832Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:09.832Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 12, 12, 'Fa iray ny vatana nefa misy rantsany maro, ary na maro aza izany rantsambatana rehetra izany, dia vatana iray ihany. Dia hoatr’izany koa i Kristy.', 'fa iray ny vatana nefa misy rantsany maro, ary na maro aza izany rantsambatana rehetra izany, dia vatana iray ihany. dia hoatr’izany koa i kristy.'),
  ('6ab25cad6d7d3e7bf35a45e6', '2026-09-22T10:47:09.832Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:09.832Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 12, 13, 'Fa fanahy iray ihany no nanaovana batisa antsika rehetra mba ho vatana iray ihany isika, na Jiosy na Grika, na mpanompo na olona afaka. Ary nampisotroina fanahy iray ihany isika rehetra.', 'fa fanahy iray ihany no nanaovana batisa antsika rehetra mba ho vatana iray ihany isika, na jiosy na grika, na mpanompo na olona afaka. ary nampisotroina fanahy iray ihany isika rehetra.'),
  ('6ab25cad6d7d3e7bf35a45e7', '2026-09-22T10:47:09.832Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:09.832Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 12, 14, 'Fa tsy rantsambatana iray fotsiny ny vatana, fa rantsambatana maro.', 'fa tsy rantsambatana iray fotsiny ny vatana, fa rantsambatana maro.'),
  ('6ab25cad6d7d3e7bf35a45e8', '2026-09-22T10:47:09.832Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:09.832Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 12, 15, 'Raha hoy ny tongotra hoe: “Tsy anisan’ny vatana aho satria tsy tanana”, dia tsy izany akory no tsy maha anisan’ny vatana azy.', 'raha hoy ny tongotra hoe: “tsy anisan’ny vatana aho satria tsy tanana”, dia tsy izany akory no tsy maha anisan’ny vatana azy.'),
  ('6ab25cad6d7d3e7bf35a45e9', '2026-09-22T10:47:09.832Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:09.832Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 12, 16, 'Ary raha miteny ny sofina hoe: “Tsy anisan’ny vatana aho satria tsy maso”, dia tsy izany akory no tsy maha anisan’ny vatana azy.', 'ary raha miteny ny sofina hoe: “tsy anisan’ny vatana aho satria tsy maso”, dia tsy izany akory no tsy maha anisan’ny vatana azy.'),
  ('6ab25cad6d7d3e7bf35a45ea', '2026-09-22T10:47:09.832Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:09.832Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 12, 17, 'Raha maso iray ny vatana manontolo, dia ahoana no handrenesany? Raha sofina izy manontolo, dia inona no amantarany fofona?', 'raha maso iray ny vatana manontolo, dia ahoana no handrenesany? raha sofina izy manontolo, dia inona no amantarany fofona?'),
  ('6ab25cad6d7d3e7bf35a45eb', '2026-09-22T10:47:09.832Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:09.832Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 12, 18, 'Fa nataon’Andriamanitra eo amin’ny toerany avy ny rantsana tsirairay ao amin’ny vatana, araka izay nitiavany azy.', 'fa nataon’andriamanitra eo amin’ny toerany avy ny rantsana tsirairay ao amin’ny vatana, araka izay nitiavany azy.'),
  ('6ab25cad6d7d3e7bf35a45ec', '2026-09-22T10:47:09.832Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:09.832Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 12, 19, 'Raha rantsambatana iray ihany izy rehetra, dia aiza ny vatana?', 'raha rantsambatana iray ihany izy rehetra, dia aiza ny vatana?'),
  ('6ab25cad6d7d3e7bf35a45ed', '2026-09-22T10:47:09.832Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:09.832Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 12, 20, 'Rantsana maro anefa izy ireo, saingy vatana iray ihany.', 'rantsana maro anefa izy ireo, saingy vatana iray ihany.'),
  ('6ab25cad6d7d3e7bf35a45ee', '2026-09-22T10:47:09.832Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:09.832Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 12, 21, 'Ny maso tsy afaka miteny amin’ny tanana hoe: “Tsy mila anao aho.” Ary ny loha tsy afaka milaza amin’ny tongotra hoe: “Tsy mila anareo aho.”', 'ny maso tsy afaka miteny amin’ny tanana hoe: “tsy mila anao aho.” ary ny loha tsy afaka milaza amin’ny tongotra hoe: “tsy mila anareo aho.”'),
  ('6ab25cad6d7d3e7bf35a45ef', '2026-09-22T10:47:09.832Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:09.832Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 12, 22, 'Fa vao mainka aza ilaina ny rantsambatana izay toa malemy kokoa.', 'fa vao mainka aza ilaina ny rantsambatana izay toa malemy kokoa.'),
  ('6ab25cad6d7d3e7bf35a45f0', '2026-09-22T10:47:09.832Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:09.832Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 12, 23, 'Ary izay faritra amin’ny vatana heverintsika ho tsy dia mendri-kaja, dia omentsika voninahitra bebe kokoa. Hajaintsika kokoa àry ny faritra tsy dia manintona eo amin’ny vatantsika.', 'ary izay faritra amin’ny vatana heverintsika ho tsy dia mendri-kaja, dia omentsika voninahitra bebe kokoa. hajaintsika kokoa àry ny faritra tsy dia manintona eo amin’ny vatantsika.'),
  ('6ab25cad6d7d3e7bf35a45f1', '2026-09-22T10:47:09.832Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:09.832Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 12, 24, 'Fa tsy mila na inona na inona kosa ny faritra efa mendri-kaja amin’ny vatantsika. Rehefa natambatr’Andriamanitra anefa ny vatana, dia nomeny voninahitra bebe kokoa ny faritra tsy nanana voninahitra,', 'fa tsy mila na inona na inona kosa ny faritra efa mendri-kaja amin’ny vatantsika. rehefa natambatr’andriamanitra anefa ny vatana, dia nomeny voninahitra bebe kokoa ny faritra tsy nanana voninahitra,'),
  ('6ab25cad6d7d3e7bf35a45f2', '2026-09-22T10:47:09.832Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:09.832Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 12, 25, 'mba tsy hisy fisaratsarahana eo amin’ny vatana, fa mba hifampiahy ireo rantsany.', 'mba tsy hisy fisaratsarahana eo amin’ny vatana, fa mba hifampiahy ireo rantsany.'),
  ('6ab25cad6d7d3e7bf35a45f3', '2026-09-22T10:47:09.832Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:09.832Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 12, 26, 'Raha mijaly ny rantsambatana iray, dia miara-mijaly aminy ny rantsambatana rehetra, ary raha misy rantsambatana omem-boninahitra, dia miara-mifaly aminy ny rantsambatana rehetra.', 'raha mijaly ny rantsambatana iray, dia miara-mijaly aminy ny rantsambatana rehetra, ary raha misy rantsambatana omem-boninahitra, dia miara-mifaly aminy ny rantsambatana rehetra.'),
  ('6ab25cad6d7d3e7bf35a45f4', '2026-09-22T10:47:09.832Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:09.832Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 12, 27, 'Vatan’i Kristy ianareo, ary rantsambatana ny tsirairay aminareo.', 'vatan’i kristy ianareo, ary rantsambatana ny tsirairay aminareo.'),
  ('6ab25cad6d7d3e7bf35a45f5', '2026-09-22T10:47:09.832Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:09.832Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 12, 28, 'Ary izao avy no nanendren’Andriamanitra ny tsirairay eo anivon’ny fiangonana: Voalohany, apostoly; faharoa, mpaminany; fahatelo, mpampianatra; avy eo, ireo manao fahagagana, ireo mahay manasitrana, ireo manampy olona, ireo mahay mitarika, ary ireo mahay fiteny samihafa.', 'ary izao avy no nanendren’andriamanitra ny tsirairay eo anivon’ny fiangonana: voalohany, apostoly; faharoa, mpaminany; fahatelo, mpampianatra; avy eo, ireo manao fahagagana, ireo mahay manasitrana, ireo manampy olona, ireo mahay mitarika, ary ireo mahay fiteny samihafa.'),
  ('6ab25cad6d7d3e7bf35a45f6', '2026-09-22T10:47:09.832Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:09.832Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 12, 29, 'Fa angaha izy rehetra no apostoly? Angaha izy rehetra no mpaminany? Angaha izy rehetra no mpampianatra? Angaha izy rehetra no mpanao fahagagana?', 'fa angaha izy rehetra no apostoly? angaha izy rehetra no mpaminany? angaha izy rehetra no mpampianatra? angaha izy rehetra no mpanao fahagagana?'),
  ('6ab25cad6d7d3e7bf35a45f7', '2026-09-22T10:47:09.832Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:09.832Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 12, 30, 'Angaha izy rehetra no mahay manasitrana? Angaha izy rehetra no miteny amin’ny fiteny samihafa? Angaha izy rehetra no mpandika teny?', 'angaha izy rehetra no mahay manasitrana? angaha izy rehetra no miteny amin’ny fiteny samihafa? angaha izy rehetra no mpandika teny?'),
  ('6ab25cad6d7d3e7bf35a45f8', '2026-09-22T10:47:09.832Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:09.832Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 12, 31, 'Miezaha mafy foana anefa hahazo an’ireo fanomezana lehibe kokoa. Zavatra tsara lavitra noho ireo kosa no hasehoko anareo.', 'miezaha mafy foana anefa hahazo an’ireo fanomezana lehibe kokoa. zavatra tsara lavitra noho ireo kosa no hasehoko anareo.'),
  ('6ab25caeb1d645406ba03dc9', '2026-09-22T10:47:10.300Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:10.300Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 13, 13, 'Mbola ho eo foana kosa ireto telo ireto: Finoana sy fanantenana ary fitiavana. Ny fitiavana anefa no lehibe indrindra amin’ireo.', 'mbola ho eo foana kosa ireto telo ireto: finoana sy fanantenana ary fitiavana. ny fitiavana anefa no lehibe indrindra amin’ireo.'),
  ('6ab25caeb1d645406ba03dbe', '2026-09-22T10:47:10.300Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:10.300Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 13, 2, 'Ary raha mahay maminany aho sady mahazo tsara ny zava-miafina masina rehetra sy manana ny fahalalana rehetra, ary manana ny finoana rehetra ka mahafindra tendrombohitra, nefa tsy manam-pitiavana, dia tsinontsinona aho.', 'ary raha mahay maminany aho sady mahazo tsara ny zava-miafina masina rehetra sy manana ny fahalalana rehetra, ary manana ny finoana rehetra ka mahafindra tendrombohitra, nefa tsy manam-pitiavana, dia tsinontsinona aho.'),
  ('6ab25caeb1d645406ba03dbd', '2026-09-22T10:47:10.300Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:10.300Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 13, 1, 'Raha miteny amin’ny fitenin’olona sy fitenin’anjely aho nefa tsy manam-pitiavana, dia lasa hoatran’ny takela-barahina maneno na kipantsona mikarantsana.', 'raha miteny amin’ny fitenin’olona sy fitenin’anjely aho nefa tsy manam-pitiavana, dia lasa hoatran’ny takela-barahina maneno na kipantsona mikarantsana.'),
  ('6ab25caeb1d645406ba03dc5', '2026-09-22T10:47:10.300Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:10.300Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 13, 9, 'Fa ampahany ihany ny fahalalantsika, ary ampahany ihany ny faminaniana ambarantsika.', 'fa ampahany ihany ny fahalalantsika, ary ampahany ihany ny faminaniana ambarantsika.'),
  ('6ab25caeb1d645406ba03dc1', '2026-09-22T10:47:10.300Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:10.300Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 13, 5, 'tsy manao zavatra tsy mendrika, tsy mitady izay hahasoa ny tenany, tsy mora tezitra, tsy mitana lolompo,', 'tsy manao zavatra tsy mendrika, tsy mitady izay hahasoa ny tenany, tsy mora tezitra, tsy mitana lolompo,'),
  ('6ab25caeb1d645406ba03dc0', '2026-09-22T10:47:10.300Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:10.300Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 13, 4, 'Ny fitiavana manam-paharetana sy tsara fanahy. Ny fitiavana tsy mialona, tsy mirehareha, tsy mieboebo,', 'ny fitiavana manam-paharetana sy tsara fanahy. ny fitiavana tsy mialona, tsy mirehareha, tsy mieboebo,'),
  ('6ab25caeb1d645406ba03dc7', '2026-09-22T10:47:10.300Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:10.300Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 13, 11, 'Tamin’izaho mbola zaza, dia niteny toy ny zaza, nieritreritra toy ny zaza, ary nisaina toy ny zaza. Fa amin’izao izaho efa olon-dehibe izao, dia nesoriko ny toetran-jaza.', 'tamin’izaho mbola zaza, dia niteny toy ny zaza, nieritreritra toy ny zaza, ary nisaina toy ny zaza. fa amin’izao izaho efa olon-dehibe izao, dia nesoriko ny toetran-jaza.'),
  ('6ab25caeb1d645406ba03dc4', '2026-09-22T10:47:10.300Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:10.300Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 13, 8, 'Tsy ho levona mandrakizay ny fitiavana. Fa na misy aza ny fahaiza-maminany, dia hofoanana izany, ary na misy aza ny fitenenana amin’ny fiteny samihafa, dia hitsahatra izany, ary na misy aza ny fahalalana, dia hofoanana izany.', 'tsy ho levona mandrakizay ny fitiavana. fa na misy aza ny fahaiza-maminany, dia hofoanana izany, ary na misy aza ny fitenenana amin’ny fiteny samihafa, dia hitsahatra izany, ary na misy aza ny fahalalana, dia hofoanana izany.'),
  ('6ab25caeb1d645406ba03dbf', '2026-09-22T10:47:10.300Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:10.300Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 13, 3, 'Ary raha manome ny fananako rehetra aho mba hahazoan’ny hafa sakafo, ary manao sorona ny tenako mba hisy hireharehako, nefa tsy manam-pitiavana, dia tsy mahasoa ahy mihitsy izany.', 'ary raha manome ny fananako rehetra aho mba hahazoan’ny hafa sakafo, ary manao sorona ny tenako mba hisy hireharehako, nefa tsy manam-pitiavana, dia tsy mahasoa ahy mihitsy izany.'),
  ('6ab25caeb1d645406ba03dc2', '2026-09-22T10:47:10.300Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:10.300Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 13, 6, 'tsy mifaly noho ny tsy fahamarinana fa mifaly noho ny fahamarinana kosa,', 'tsy mifaly noho ny tsy fahamarinana fa mifaly noho ny fahamarinana kosa,'),
  ('6ab25caeb1d645406ba03dc6', '2026-09-22T10:47:10.300Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:10.300Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 13, 10, 'Rehefa feno anefa izany, dia hofoanana ilay ampahany.', 'rehefa feno anefa izany, dia hofoanana ilay ampahany.'),
  ('6ab25caeb1d645406ba03dc3', '2026-09-22T10:47:10.300Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:10.300Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 13, 7, 'mandefitra ny zava-drehetra, mino ny zava-drehetra, manantena ny zava-drehetra, ary miaritra ny zava-drehetra.', 'mandefitra ny zava-drehetra, mino ny zava-drehetra, manantena ny zava-drehetra, ary miaritra ny zava-drehetra.'),
  ('6ab25caeb1d645406ba03dc8', '2026-09-22T10:47:10.300Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:10.300Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 13, 12, 'Manjavozavo izao ny zavatra hitantsika, hoatran’ny hoe mijery amin’ny fitaratra metaly, fa amin’izany kosa dia hazava tsara, hoatran’ny hoe mifanatrika. Ampahany ihany ny fahalalako amin’izao, fa amin’izany kosa aho dia hanana fahalalana marina tsara hoatran’ny ahafantarana ahy tsara.', 'manjavozavo izao ny zavatra hitantsika, hoatran’ny hoe mijery amin’ny fitaratra metaly, fa amin’izany kosa dia hazava tsara, hoatran’ny hoe mifanatrika. ampahany ihany ny fahalalako amin’izao, fa amin’izany kosa aho dia hanana fahalalana marina tsara hoatran’ny ahafantarana ahy tsara.'),
  ('6ab25cb0ef27ba1d1fbcddc5', '2026-09-22T10:47:12.345Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:12.345Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 14, 16, 'Fa raha mampiasa ny fanomezan’ny fanahy ianao rehefa midera an’Andriamanitra, dia ahoana no hilazan’ny olon-tsotra eo aminareo hoe “Amena” rehefa manao fisaorana ianao, nefa izy aza tsy mahazo an’izay lazainao akory?', 'fa raha mampiasa ny fanomezan’ny fanahy ianao rehefa midera an’andriamanitra, dia ahoana no hilazan’ny olon-tsotra eo aminareo hoe “amena” rehefa manao fisaorana ianao, nefa izy aza tsy mahazo an’izay lazainao akory?'),
  ('6ab25cb0ef27ba1d1fbcddbb', '2026-09-22T10:47:12.345Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:12.345Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 14, 6, 'Raha izao aho, ry rahalahy, no tonga any aminareo ka miteny amin’ny fiteny samihafa, dia hahasoa anareo ve izany? Hahasoa anareo izany raha mampiharihary zavatra tsy fantatrareo aho, na mampita fahalalana na faminaniana na fampianarana aminareo.', 'raha izao aho, ry rahalahy, no tonga any aminareo ka miteny amin’ny fiteny samihafa, dia hahasoa anareo ve izany? hahasoa anareo izany raha mampiharihary zavatra tsy fantatrareo aho, na mampita fahalalana na faminaniana na fampianarana aminareo.'),
  ('6ab25cb0ef27ba1d1fbcdddd', '2026-09-22T10:47:12.345Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:12.345Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 14, 40, 'Ataovy amin’ny fomba mendrika sy milamina tsara anefa ny zava-drehetra.', 'ataovy amin’ny fomba mendrika sy milamina tsara anefa ny zava-drehetra.'),
  ('6ab25cb0ef27ba1d1fbcddca', '2026-09-22T10:47:12.345Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:12.345Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 14, 21, 'Izao no voasoratra ao amin’ny Lalàna: “‘Hiteny amin’ity vahoaka ity amin’ny fitenin’ny hafa firenena sy ny fitenin’ny vahiny aho. Mbola tsy hety hihaino ahy ihany anefa izy ireo’, hoy i Jehovah.”', 'izao no voasoratra ao amin’ny lalàna: “‘hiteny amin’ity vahoaka ity amin’ny fitenin’ny hafa firenena sy ny fitenin’ny vahiny aho. mbola tsy hety hihaino ahy ihany anefa izy ireo’, hoy i jehovah.”'),
  ('6ab25cb0ef27ba1d1fbcddc0', '2026-09-22T10:47:12.345Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:12.345Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 14, 11, 'Fa raha tsy azoko ilay fiteny, dia ho vahiny amin’ilay miteny aho, ary ilay miteny koa ho vahiny amiko.', 'fa raha tsy azoko ilay fiteny, dia ho vahiny amin’ilay miteny aho, ary ilay miteny koa ho vahiny amiko.'),
  ('6ab25cb0ef27ba1d1fbcddb9', '2026-09-22T10:47:12.345Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:12.345Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 14, 4, 'Izay miteny amin’ny fiteny samihafa dia mampahery ny tenany, fa izay maminany kosa mampahery ny fiangonana.', 'izay miteny amin’ny fiteny samihafa dia mampahery ny tenany, fa izay maminany kosa mampahery ny fiangonana.'),
  ('6ab25cb0ef27ba1d1fbcddd8', '2026-09-22T10:47:12.345Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:12.345Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 14, 35, 'Raha misy zavatra tiany ho fantatra, dia hanontany ny vadiny izy rehefa any an-trano, fa mahamenatra raha miteny eo anivon’ny fiangonana ny vehivavy.', 'raha misy zavatra tiany ho fantatra, dia hanontany ny vadiny izy rehefa any an-trano, fa mahamenatra raha miteny eo anivon’ny fiangonana ny vehivavy.'),
  ('6ab25cb0ef27ba1d1fbcddd5', '2026-09-22T10:47:12.345Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:12.345Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 14, 32, 'Ary tokony ho hain’ny mpaminany ny mifehy ny fanomezan’ny fanahy.', 'ary tokony ho hain’ny mpaminany ny mifehy ny fanomezan’ny fanahy.'),
  ('6ab25cb0ef27ba1d1fbcddcc', '2026-09-22T10:47:12.345Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:12.345Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 14, 23, 'Koa raha mivory eo amin’ny toerana iray ny fiangonana manontolo ka samy miteny amin’ny fiteny samihafa daholo, ary miditra ny olon-tsotra na ny tsy mpino, tsy holazainy fa adala ve ianareo?', 'koa raha mivory eo amin’ny toerana iray ny fiangonana manontolo ka samy miteny amin’ny fiteny samihafa daholo, ary miditra ny olon-tsotra na ny tsy mpino, tsy holazainy fa adala ve ianareo?'),
  ('6ab25cb0ef27ba1d1fbcddda', '2026-09-22T10:47:12.345Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:12.345Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 14, 37, 'Raha misy aminareo mieritreritra fa mpaminany izy na hoe manana ny fanomezan’ny fanahy, dia tokony hanaiky izy hoe didin’ny Tompo izay soratako aminareo.', 'raha misy aminareo mieritreritra fa mpaminany izy na hoe manana ny fanomezan’ny fanahy, dia tokony hanaiky izy hoe didin’ny tompo izay soratako aminareo.'),
  ('6ab25cb0ef27ba1d1fbcddd7', '2026-09-22T10:47:12.345Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:12.345Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 14, 34, 'dia hangina ny vehivavy rehefa eo anivon’ny fiangonana, fa tsy mahazo miteny. Aoka kosa izy ireo hanaiky, fa izany koa no lazain’ny Lalàna.', 'dia hangina ny vehivavy rehefa eo anivon’ny fiangonana, fa tsy mahazo miteny. aoka kosa izy ireo hanaiky, fa izany koa no lazain’ny lalàna.'),
  ('6ab25cb0ef27ba1d1fbcddcf', '2026-09-22T10:47:12.345Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:12.345Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 14, 26, 'Inona àry no tokony hatao, ry rahalahy? Rehefa mivory ianareo, dia misy mihira fiderana, misy mampianatra, misy milaza ny zavatra naharihary taminy, misy miteny amin’ny fiteny samihafa, ary misy mandika teny. Ataovy mba hampaherezana ny zava-drehetra.', 'inona àry no tokony hatao, ry rahalahy? rehefa mivory ianareo, dia misy mihira fiderana, misy mampianatra, misy milaza ny zavatra naharihary taminy, misy miteny amin’ny fiteny samihafa, ary misy mandika teny. ataovy mba hampaherezana ny zava-drehetra.'),
  ('6ab25cb0ef27ba1d1fbcddce', '2026-09-22T10:47:12.345Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:12.345Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 14, 25, 'Dia hiharihary izay miafina ao am-pony ka hiankohoka izy ary hivavaka amin’Andriamanitra, sady hilaza hoe: “Tena eo aminareo Andriamanitra!”', 'dia hiharihary izay miafina ao am-pony ka hiankohoka izy ary hivavaka amin’andriamanitra, sady hilaza hoe: “tena eo aminareo andriamanitra!”'),
  ('6ab25cb0ef27ba1d1fbcddbf', '2026-09-22T10:47:12.345Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:12.345Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 14, 10, 'Mety hisy fiteny maro samihafa eo amin’izao tontolo izao, ary samy misy heviny daholo izy ireny.', 'mety hisy fiteny maro samihafa eo amin’izao tontolo izao, ary samy misy heviny daholo izy ireny.'),
  ('6ab25cb0ef27ba1d1fbcddc8', '2026-09-22T10:47:12.345Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:12.345Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 14, 19, 'Aleoko anefa milaza teny dimy azon’ny saiko mba hampianarako ny hafa rehefa eo anivon’ny fiangonana, toy izay hilaza teny iray alina amin’ny fiteny samihafa.', 'aleoko anefa milaza teny dimy azon’ny saiko mba hampianarako ny hafa rehefa eo anivon’ny fiangonana, toy izay hilaza teny iray alina amin’ny fiteny samihafa.'),
  ('6ab25cb0ef27ba1d1fbcddc7', '2026-09-22T10:47:12.345Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:12.345Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 14, 18, 'Misaotra an’Andriamanitra aho fa miteny fiteny samihafa betsaka kokoa noho ianareo rehetra.', 'misaotra an’andriamanitra aho fa miteny fiteny samihafa betsaka kokoa noho ianareo rehetra.'),
  ('6ab25cb0ef27ba1d1fbcddba', '2026-09-22T10:47:12.345Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:12.345Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 14, 5, 'Tiako hiteny amin’ny fiteny samihafa ianareo rehetra, nefa aleoko ihany ianareo maminany. Fa tsara kokoa ny maminany noho ny miteny amin’ny fiteny samihafa, raha tsy hoe adikany angaha izay lazainy, mba hahazoan’ny fiangonana fampaherezana.', 'tiako hiteny amin’ny fiteny samihafa ianareo rehetra, nefa aleoko ihany ianareo maminany. fa tsara kokoa ny maminany noho ny miteny amin’ny fiteny samihafa, raha tsy hoe adikany angaha izay lazainy, mba hahazoan’ny fiangonana fampaherezana.'),
  ('6ab25cb0ef27ba1d1fbcddd9', '2026-09-22T10:47:12.345Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:12.345Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 14, 36, 'Avy taminareo angaha no nivoahan’ny tenin’Andriamanitra? Sa ianareo ihany no nomena azy io?', 'avy taminareo angaha no nivoahan’ny tenin’andriamanitra? sa ianareo ihany no nomena azy io?'),
  ('6ab25cb0ef27ba1d1fbcddc1', '2026-09-22T10:47:12.345Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:12.345Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 14, 12, 'Dia hoatr’izany koa ianareo: Satria te hahazo mafy ny fanomezan’ny fanahy ianareo, dia miezaha hanana be dia be amin’izany mba hampaherezana ny fiangonana.', 'dia hoatr’izany koa ianareo: satria te hahazo mafy ny fanomezan’ny fanahy ianareo, dia miezaha hanana be dia be amin’izany mba hampaherezana ny fiangonana.'),
  ('6ab25cb0ef27ba1d1fbcdddb', '2026-09-22T10:47:12.345Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:12.345Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 14, 38, 'Fa raha misy tsy miraharaha an’izany, dia tsy horaharahiana koa izy.', 'fa raha misy tsy miraharaha an’izany, dia tsy horaharahiana koa izy.'),
  ('6ab25cb0ef27ba1d1fbcddd2', '2026-09-22T10:47:12.345Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:12.345Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 14, 29, 'Raha misy mpaminany, dia ho roa na telo no hiteny, fa ny hafa kosa hamantatra ny hevitr’izay lazainy.', 'raha misy mpaminany, dia ho roa na telo no hiteny, fa ny hafa kosa hamantatra ny hevitr’izay lazainy.'),
  ('6ab25cb0ef27ba1d1fbcddd1', '2026-09-22T10:47:12.345Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:12.345Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 14, 28, 'Raha tsy misy mpandika teny anefa, dia tokony hangina izy eo anivon’ny fiangonana ka hiteny amin’ny tenany ihany sy amin’Andriamanitra.', 'raha tsy misy mpandika teny anefa, dia tokony hangina izy eo anivon’ny fiangonana ka hiteny amin’ny tenany ihany sy amin’andriamanitra.'),
  ('6ab25cb0ef27ba1d1fbcddd0', '2026-09-22T10:47:12.345Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:12.345Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 14, 27, 'Ary raha misy miteny amin’ny fiteny samihafa, dia hoferana ho roa na telo izany, raha be indrindra. Ary hifandimby izy ireo, dia tsy maintsy hadika izay lazainy.', 'ary raha misy miteny amin’ny fiteny samihafa, dia hoferana ho roa na telo izany, raha be indrindra. ary hifandimby izy ireo, dia tsy maintsy hadika izay lazainy.'),
  ('6ab25cb0ef27ba1d1fbcddc9', '2026-09-22T10:47:12.345Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:12.345Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 14, 20, 'Ry rahalahy, aoka ianareo tsy ho zaza raha ny amin’ny fahiratan-tsaina. Aoka kosa ianareo ho zaza raha ny amin’ny faharatsiana, ary ho olon-dehibe raha ny amin’ny fahiratan-tsaina.', 'ry rahalahy, aoka ianareo tsy ho zaza raha ny amin’ny fahiratan-tsaina. aoka kosa ianareo ho zaza raha ny amin’ny faharatsiana, ary ho olon-dehibe raha ny amin’ny fahiratan-tsaina.'),
  ('6ab25cb0ef27ba1d1fbcddb7', '2026-09-22T10:47:12.345Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:12.345Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 14, 2, 'Fa izay miteny amin’ny fiteny samihafa dia tsy miteny amin’olona, fa amin’Andriamanitra. Tsy misy mahazo mantsy izay lazainy, na dia ny fanahy aza no mahatonga azy hilaza zava-miafina masina.', 'fa izay miteny amin’ny fiteny samihafa dia tsy miteny amin’olona, fa amin’andriamanitra. tsy misy mahazo mantsy izay lazainy, na dia ny fanahy aza no mahatonga azy hilaza zava-miafina masina.'),
  ('6ab25cb0ef27ba1d1fbcddd6', '2026-09-22T10:47:12.345Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:12.345Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 14, 33, 'Fa Andriamanitra tsy Andriamanitry ny fikorontanana, fa Andriamanitry ny filaminana. Toy ny any amin’ny fiangonan’ny olona masina rehetra,', 'fa andriamanitra tsy andriamanitry ny fikorontanana, fa andriamanitry ny filaminana. toy ny any amin’ny fiangonan’ny olona masina rehetra,'),
  ('6ab25cb0ef27ba1d1fbcddc3', '2026-09-22T10:47:12.345Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:12.345Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 14, 14, 'Raha mivavaka amin’ny fiteny hafa mantsy aho, dia ny fanomezan’ny fanahy izay noraisiko no mivavaka, fa ny saiko kosa tsy mahazo an’izay lazaiko.', 'raha mivavaka amin’ny fiteny hafa mantsy aho, dia ny fanomezan’ny fanahy izay noraisiko no mivavaka, fa ny saiko kosa tsy mahazo an’izay lazaiko.'),
  ('6ab25cb0ef27ba1d1fbcddb8', '2026-09-22T10:47:12.345Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:12.345Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 14, 3, 'Fa izay maminany kosa dia milaza teny mampahery sy manatanjaka ary mampionona ny olona.', 'fa izay maminany kosa dia milaza teny mampahery sy manatanjaka ary mampionona ny olona.'),
  ('6ab25cb0ef27ba1d1fbcdddc', '2026-09-22T10:47:12.345Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:12.345Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 14, 39, 'Koa miezaha mafy foana haminany, ry rahalahiko, nefa koa aza rarana ny hafa tsy hiteny amin’ny fiteny samihafa.', 'koa miezaha mafy foana haminany, ry rahalahiko, nefa koa aza rarana ny hafa tsy hiteny amin’ny fiteny samihafa.'),
  ('6ab25cb0ef27ba1d1fbcddcb', '2026-09-22T10:47:12.345Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:12.345Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 14, 22, 'Famantarana ho an’ny tsy mpino àry ny fitenenana amin’ny fiteny samihafa, fa tsy ho an’ny mpino, ary ho an’ny mpino kosa ny faminaniana, fa tsy ho an’ny tsy mpino.', 'famantarana ho an’ny tsy mpino àry ny fitenenana amin’ny fiteny samihafa, fa tsy ho an’ny mpino, ary ho an’ny mpino kosa ny faminaniana, fa tsy ho an’ny tsy mpino.'),
  ('6ab25cb0ef27ba1d1fbcddbe', '2026-09-22T10:47:12.345Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:12.345Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 14, 9, 'Hoatr’izany koa fa raha tsy mora azo ny teny lazainareo, dia ahoana no hahafantaran’ny olona an’izay lazainareo? Hiteny amin’ny rivotra fotsiny ianareo, raha ny marina.', 'hoatr’izany koa fa raha tsy mora azo ny teny lazainareo, dia ahoana no hahafantaran’ny olona an’izay lazainareo? hiteny amin’ny rivotra fotsiny ianareo, raha ny marina.'),
  ('6ab25cb0ef27ba1d1fbcddd4', '2026-09-22T10:47:12.345Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:12.345Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 14, 31, 'Fa samy afaka maminany ianareo rehetra, saingy mandeha tsirairay, mba handraisan’ny rehetra fampianarana sy hahazoan’ny rehetra fampaherezana.', 'fa samy afaka maminany ianareo rehetra, saingy mandeha tsirairay, mba handraisan’ny rehetra fampianarana sy hahazoan’ny rehetra fampaherezana.'),
  ('6ab25cb0ef27ba1d1fbcddc6', '2026-09-22T10:47:12.345Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:12.345Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 14, 17, 'Marina fa tsara ny fisaorana ataonao, saingy tsy mahazo fampaherezana ny hafa.', 'marina fa tsara ny fisaorana ataonao, saingy tsy mahazo fampaherezana ny hafa.'),
  ('6ab25cb0ef27ba1d1fbcddbd', '2026-09-22T10:47:12.345Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:12.345Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 14, 8, 'Raha tsy mazava tsara ny feo avoakan’ny trompetra, dia iza no hiomana hiady?', 'raha tsy mazava tsara ny feo avoakan’ny trompetra, dia iza no hiomana hiady?'),
  ('6ab25cb0ef27ba1d1fbcddb6', '2026-09-22T10:47:12.345Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:12.345Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 14, 1, 'Miezaha mafy foana hifankatia, nefa miezaha mafy koa hahazo ny fanomezana avy amin’ny fanahy, indrindra fa ny haminany.', 'miezaha mafy foana hifankatia, nefa miezaha mafy koa hahazo ny fanomezana avy amin’ny fanahy, indrindra fa ny haminany.'),
  ('6ab25cb0ef27ba1d1fbcddd3', '2026-09-22T10:47:12.345Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:12.345Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 14, 30, 'Raha misy amin’izay mipetraka eo anefa nampihariharian’Andriamanitra zavatra, dia hangina aloha ilay niteny.', 'raha misy amin’izay mipetraka eo anefa nampihariharian’andriamanitra zavatra, dia hangina aloha ilay niteny.'),
  ('6ab25cb0ef27ba1d1fbcddcd', '2026-09-22T10:47:12.345Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:12.345Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 14, 24, 'Fa raha samy maminany kosa ianareo rehetra ary misy tsy mpino na olon-tsotra miditra, dia hananatra azy sy handrisika azy handini-tena tsara ny zavatra rehetra henony.', 'fa raha samy maminany kosa ianareo rehetra ary misy tsy mpino na olon-tsotra miditra, dia hananatra azy sy handrisika azy handini-tena tsara ny zavatra rehetra henony.'),
  ('6ab25cb0ef27ba1d1fbcddc4', '2026-09-22T10:47:12.345Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:12.345Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 14, 15, 'Inona àry no tokony hatao? Hampiasa ny fanomezan’ny fanahy aho rehefa mivavaka, nefa koa hampiasa ny saiko mba ho azo izay lazaiko. Hampiasa ny fanomezan’ny fanahy aho rehefa mihira fiderana, nefa koa hampiasa ny saiko mba ho azo izay lazaiko.', 'inona àry no tokony hatao? hampiasa ny fanomezan’ny fanahy aho rehefa mivavaka, nefa koa hampiasa ny saiko mba ho azo izay lazaiko. hampiasa ny fanomezan’ny fanahy aho rehefa mihira fiderana, nefa koa hampiasa ny saiko mba ho azo izay lazaiko.'),
  ('6ab25cb0ef27ba1d1fbcddc2', '2026-09-22T10:47:12.345Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:12.345Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 14, 13, 'Aoka àry izay miteny amin’ny fiteny samihafa hivavaka mba hahay handika teny.', 'aoka àry izay miteny amin’ny fiteny samihafa hivavaka mba hahay handika teny.'),
  ('6ab25cb0ef27ba1d1fbcddbc', '2026-09-22T10:47:12.345Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:12.345Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 14, 7, 'Hoatr’izany koa ny zavamaneno, toy ny sodina na harpa. Raha tsy mamoaka feo samy hafa ireo, dia ahoana no hanavahana ny feon-kira avy amin’ilay sodina na avy amin’ilay harpa?', 'hoatr’izany koa ny zavamaneno, toy ny sodina na harpa. raha tsy mamoaka feo samy hafa ireo, dia ahoana no hanavahana ny feon-kira avy amin’ilay sodina na avy amin’ilay harpa?'),
  ('6ab25cb1c190d9f02e9e38e3', '2026-09-22T10:47:13.501Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:13.501Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 15, 2, 'Ho voavonjy koa ianareo noho izany vaovao tsara izany, raha mino foana an’ilay vaovao tsara notoriko taminareo. Fa raha tsy izany kosa, dia ho very maina fotsiny ny nahatonga anareo ho mpino.', 'ho voavonjy koa ianareo noho izany vaovao tsara izany, raha mino foana an’ilay vaovao tsara notoriko taminareo. fa raha tsy izany kosa, dia ho very maina fotsiny ny nahatonga anareo ho mpino.'),
  ('6ab25cb1c190d9f02e9e38e2', '2026-09-22T10:47:13.501Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:13.501Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 15, 1, 'Ampahatsiahiviko anareo, ry rahalahy, ny vaovao tsara notoriko taminareo, izay nekenareo koa sady ifikiranareo.', 'ampahatsiahiviko anareo, ry rahalahy, ny vaovao tsara notoriko taminareo, izay nekenareo koa sady ifikiranareo.'),
  ('6ab25cb1c190d9f02e9e38e4', '2026-09-22T10:47:13.501Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:13.501Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 15, 3, 'Fa anisan’ny zavatra voalohany nianarako koa ka nampitaiko taminareo ny hoe: Maty noho ny fahotantsika i Kristy, araka ny Soratra Masina,', 'fa anisan’ny zavatra voalohany nianarako koa ka nampitaiko taminareo ny hoe: maty noho ny fahotantsika i kristy, araka ny soratra masina,'),
  ('6ab25cb1c190d9f02e9e38e5', '2026-09-22T10:47:13.501Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:13.501Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 15, 4, 'ary nalevina izy dia natsangana tamin’ny maty tamin’ny andro fahatelo, araka ny Soratra Masina.', 'ary nalevina izy dia natsangana tamin’ny maty tamin’ny andro fahatelo, araka ny soratra masina.'),
  ('6ab25cb1c190d9f02e9e38e6', '2026-09-22T10:47:13.501Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:13.501Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 15, 5, 'Niseho tamin’i Kefasy izy, ary avy eo tamin’izy 12 Lahy.', 'niseho tamin’i kefasy izy, ary avy eo tamin’izy 12 lahy.'),
  ('6ab25cb1c190d9f02e9e391b', '2026-09-22T10:47:13.502Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:13.502Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 15, 58, 'Noho izany, ry rahalahy malalako, dia aza manaiky ho voahozongozona ary aza miovaova mihitsy. Miezaha ho be atao foana amin’ny asan’ny Tompo, satria fantatrareo fa tsy very maina ny asa mafy ataonareo ho an’ny Tompo.', 'noho izany, ry rahalahy malalako, dia aza manaiky ho voahozongozona ary aza miovaova mihitsy. miezaha ho be atao foana amin’ny asan’ny tompo, satria fantatrareo fa tsy very maina ny asa mafy ataonareo ho an’ny tompo.'),
  ('6ab25cb1c190d9f02e9e3912', '2026-09-22T10:47:13.502Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:13.502Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 15, 49, 'Hoatran’ny itovizantsika endrika amin’ilay natao tamin’ny vovoka no hitovizantsika endrika amin’ilay avy any an-danitra.', 'hoatran’ny itovizantsika endrika amin’ilay natao tamin’ny vovoka no hitovizantsika endrika amin’ilay avy any an-danitra.'),
  ('6ab25cb1c190d9f02e9e38fc', '2026-09-22T10:47:13.502Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:13.502Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 15, 27, 'Fa ‘nasain’Andriamanitra nanaiky azy ny zava-drehetra ka nataony eo ambany tongony.’ Rehefa voalaza anefa hoe: ‘Nasaina nanaiky azy ny zava-drehetra’, dia mazava ho azy fa tsy anisan’izany Ilay nahatonga ny zava-drehetra hanaiky azy.', 'fa ‘nasain’andriamanitra nanaiky azy ny zava-drehetra ka nataony eo ambany tongony.’ rehefa voalaza anefa hoe: ‘nasaina nanaiky azy ny zava-drehetra’, dia mazava ho azy fa tsy anisan’izany ilay nahatonga ny zava-drehetra hanaiky azy.'),
  ('6ab25cb1c190d9f02e9e38f9', '2026-09-22T10:47:13.502Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:13.502Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 15, 24, 'Ary amin’ny farany, dia hanolotra ny Fanjakana amin’Andriamanitra Rainy izy, rehefa avy nofoanany ny fitondrana sy ny fahefana ary ny hery rehetra.', 'ary amin’ny farany, dia hanolotra ny fanjakana amin’andriamanitra rainy izy, rehefa avy nofoanany ny fitondrana sy ny fahefana ary ny hery rehetra.'),
  ('6ab25cb1c190d9f02e9e38e8', '2026-09-22T10:47:13.502Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:13.502Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 15, 7, 'Dia niseho tamin’i Jakoba izy avy eo, ary tamin’ny apostoly rehetra taorian’izay.', 'dia niseho tamin’i jakoba izy avy eo, ary tamin’ny apostoly rehetra taorian’izay.'),
  ('6ab25cb1c190d9f02e9e3917', '2026-09-22T10:47:13.502Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:13.502Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 15, 54, 'Rehefa lasa tsy mety lo anefa ity mety lo ity ary lasa tsy mety maty ity mety maty ity, dia ho tanteraka ny teny voasoratra hoe: “Ho foana tsy hisy mandrakizay ny fahafatesana.”', 'rehefa lasa tsy mety lo anefa ity mety lo ity ary lasa tsy mety maty ity mety maty ity, dia ho tanteraka ny teny voasoratra hoe: “ho foana tsy hisy mandrakizay ny fahafatesana.”'),
  ('6ab25cb1c190d9f02e9e3914', '2026-09-22T10:47:13.502Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:13.502Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 15, 51, 'Zava-miafina masina izao lazaiko aminareo izao: Tsy hodimandry daholo isika rehetra, fa isika rehetra dia hovana', 'zava-miafina masina izao lazaiko aminareo izao: tsy hodimandry daholo isika rehetra, fa isika rehetra dia hovana'),
  ('6ab25cb1c190d9f02e9e38f2', '2026-09-22T10:47:13.502Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:13.502Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 15, 17, 'Ary raha tsy natsangana i Kristy, dia tsy misy dikany ny finoanareo, ary tsy afaka amin’ny fahotanareo ianareo.', 'ary raha tsy natsangana i kristy, dia tsy misy dikany ny finoanareo, ary tsy afaka amin’ny fahotanareo ianareo.'),
  ('6ab25cb1c190d9f02e9e3901', '2026-09-22T10:47:13.502Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:13.502Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 15, 32, 'Fa raha niady tamin’ny bibidia tany Efesosy hoatran’ny sasany aho, inona no soa azoko amin’izany? Raha tsy hatsangana ny maty, dia “andao isika hihinana sy hisotro, fa rahampitso dia ho faty.”', 'fa raha niady tamin’ny bibidia tany efesosy hoatran’ny sasany aho, inona no soa azoko amin’izany? raha tsy hatsangana ny maty, dia “andao isika hihinana sy hisotro, fa rahampitso dia ho faty.”'),
  ('6ab25cb1c190d9f02e9e3915', '2026-09-22T10:47:13.502Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:13.502Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 15, 52, 'ao anatin’ny fotoana fohy dia fohy, ao anatin’ny indray mipy maso, rehefa maneno ny trompetra farany. Fa haneno ny trompetra, dia hatsangana ny maty ka ho lasa tsy mety lo, ary hovana isika.', 'ao anatin’ny fotoana fohy dia fohy, ao anatin’ny indray mipy maso, rehefa maneno ny trompetra farany. fa haneno ny trompetra, dia hatsangana ny maty ka ho lasa tsy mety lo, ary hovana isika.'),
  ('6ab25cb1c190d9f02e9e3913', '2026-09-22T10:47:13.502Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:13.502Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 15, 50, 'Izao anefa no lazaiko, ry rahalahy: Tsy afaka mandova ny Fanjakan’Andriamanitra ny nofo aman-dra, ary izay mety lo tsy afaka mandova ny tsy mety lo.', 'izao anefa no lazaiko, ry rahalahy: tsy afaka mandova ny fanjakan’andriamanitra ny nofo aman-dra, ary izay mety lo tsy afaka mandova ny tsy mety lo.'),
  ('6ab25cb1c190d9f02e9e390e', '2026-09-22T10:47:13.502Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:13.502Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 15, 45, 'Fa izao no voasoratra: “Lasa zavamananaina i Adama, ilay lehilahy voalohany.” Ary i Adama farany kosa lasa fanahy ahazoana fiainana.', 'fa izao no voasoratra: “lasa zavamananaina i adama, ilay lehilahy voalohany.” ary i adama farany kosa lasa fanahy ahazoana fiainana.'),
  ('6ab25cb1c190d9f02e9e390c', '2026-09-22T10:47:13.502Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:13.502Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 15, 43, 'Alam-baraka izy rehefa afafy, fa be voninahitra rehefa atsangana. Malemy izy rehefa afafy, fa mahery rehefa atsangana.', 'alam-baraka izy rehefa afafy, fa be voninahitra rehefa atsangana. malemy izy rehefa afafy, fa mahery rehefa atsangana.'),
  ('6ab25cb1c190d9f02e9e390b', '2026-09-22T10:47:13.502Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:13.502Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 15, 42, 'Toy izany koa ny fitsanganan’ny maty. Vatana mety lo izy rehefa afafy, fa tsy mety lo kosa rehefa atsangana.', 'toy izany koa ny fitsanganan’ny maty. vatana mety lo izy rehefa afafy, fa tsy mety lo kosa rehefa atsangana.'),
  ('6ab25cb1c190d9f02e9e38f6', '2026-09-22T10:47:13.502Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:13.502Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 15, 21, 'Koa satria avy amin’ny olona iray ny fahafatesana, dia avy amin’ny olona iray koa ny fitsanganan’ny maty.', 'koa satria avy amin’ny olona iray ny fahafatesana, dia avy amin’ny olona iray koa ny fitsanganan’ny maty.'),
  ('6ab25cb1c190d9f02e9e3919', '2026-09-22T10:47:13.502Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:13.502Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 15, 56, 'Ny ota no fanindronana mahatonga ny fahafatesana, ary ny herin’ny ota dia avy amin’ny Lalàna.', 'ny ota no fanindronana mahatonga ny fahafatesana, ary ny herin’ny ota dia avy amin’ny lalàna.'),
  ('6ab25cb1c190d9f02e9e390a', '2026-09-22T10:47:13.502Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:13.502Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 15, 41, 'Hafa ny voninahitry ny masoandro, hafa ny an’ny volana, ary hafa ny an’ny kintana. Raha ny marina aza, dia samy manana ny voninahiny ny kintana.', 'hafa ny voninahitry ny masoandro, hafa ny an’ny volana, ary hafa ny an’ny kintana. raha ny marina aza, dia samy manana ny voninahiny ny kintana.'),
  ('6ab25cb1c190d9f02e9e3903', '2026-09-22T10:47:13.502Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:13.502Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 15, 34, 'Mbà tonga saina ka manaova ny marina, ary aza zatra manota. Tsy mahalala an’Andriamanitra mantsy ny sasany. Ny hampahamenatra anareo no ilazako an’izany.', 'mbà tonga saina ka manaova ny marina, ary aza zatra manota. tsy mahalala an’andriamanitra mantsy ny sasany. ny hampahamenatra anareo no ilazako an’izany.'),
  ('6ab25cb1c190d9f02e9e38ef', '2026-09-22T10:47:13.502Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:13.502Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 15, 14, 'Raha tsy natsangana anefa i Kristy, dia tena very maina ny fitoriantsika, ary very maina koa ny finoanareo.', 'raha tsy natsangana anefa i kristy, dia tena very maina ny fitoriantsika, ary very maina koa ny finoanareo.'),
  ('6ab25cb1c190d9f02e9e3908', '2026-09-22T10:47:13.502Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:13.502Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 15, 39, 'Tsy mitovy ny nofo rehetra, fa hafa ny an’ny olombelona, hafa ny nofon’ny omby, hafa ny nofon’ny vorona, ary hafa ny an’ny trondro.', 'tsy mitovy ny nofo rehetra, fa hafa ny an’ny olombelona, hafa ny nofon’ny omby, hafa ny nofon’ny vorona, ary hafa ny an’ny trondro.'),
  ('6ab25cb1c190d9f02e9e38f3', '2026-09-22T10:47:13.502Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:13.502Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 15, 18, 'Dia very koa izay nodimandry tao amin’i Kristy.', 'dia very koa izay nodimandry tao amin’i kristy.'),
  ('6ab25cb1c190d9f02e9e3916', '2026-09-22T10:47:13.502Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:13.502Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 15, 53, 'Fa tsy maintsy hitafy ny tsy mety lo ity mety lo ity, ary tsy maintsy hitafy ny tsy mety maty ity mety maty ity.', 'fa tsy maintsy hitafy ny tsy mety lo ity mety lo ity, ary tsy maintsy hitafy ny tsy mety maty ity mety maty ity.'),
  ('6ab25cb1c190d9f02e9e3911', '2026-09-22T10:47:13.502Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:13.502Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 15, 48, 'Toy ilay natao tamin’ny vovoka ireo natao tamin’ny vovoka, ary toy ilay avy any an-danitra ireo any an-danitra.', 'toy ilay natao tamin’ny vovoka ireo natao tamin’ny vovoka, ary toy ilay avy any an-danitra ireo any an-danitra.'),
  ('6ab25cb1c190d9f02e9e38ed', '2026-09-22T10:47:13.502Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:13.502Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 15, 12, 'Raha torina hoe efa natsangana tamin’ny maty i Kristy, dia ahoana no ilazan’ny sasany aminareo fa tsy misy fitsanganan’ny maty?', 'raha torina hoe efa natsangana tamin’ny maty i kristy, dia ahoana no ilazan’ny sasany aminareo fa tsy misy fitsanganan’ny maty?'),
  ('6ab25cb1c190d9f02e9e3918', '2026-09-22T10:47:13.502Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:13.502Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 15, 55, '“Ry fahafatesana ô, aiza koa ianao izay mandresy eo? Ry fahafatesana ô, aiza koa ianao izay manindrona eo?”', '“ry fahafatesana ô, aiza koa ianao izay mandresy eo? ry fahafatesana ô, aiza koa ianao izay manindrona eo?”'),
  ('6ab25cb1c190d9f02e9e3909', '2026-09-22T10:47:13.502Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:13.502Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 15, 40, 'Hafa ny vatan’izay any an-danitra ary hafa ny vatan’izay etỳ an-tany. Hafa ny voninahitry ny vatan’ny any an-danitra, ary hafa ny an’ny vatan’ny etỳ an-tany.', 'hafa ny vatan’izay any an-danitra ary hafa ny vatan’izay etỳ an-tany. hafa ny voninahitry ny vatan’ny any an-danitra, ary hafa ny an’ny vatan’ny etỳ an-tany.'),
  ('6ab25cb1c190d9f02e9e3905', '2026-09-22T10:47:13.502Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:13.502Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 15, 36, 'Ry tsy misaina, tsy hovelomina izay afafinao raha tsy maty aloha.', 'ry tsy misaina, tsy hovelomina izay afafinao raha tsy maty aloha.'),
  ('6ab25cb1c190d9f02e9e38f4', '2026-09-22T10:47:13.502Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:13.502Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 15, 19, 'Raha amin’izao fiainana izao ihany isika no manantena an’i Kristy, dia isika no mampalahelo indrindra amin’ny olona rehetra.', 'raha amin’izao fiainana izao ihany isika no manantena an’i kristy, dia isika no mampalahelo indrindra amin’ny olona rehetra.'),
  ('6ab25cb1c190d9f02e9e38ff', '2026-09-22T10:47:13.502Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:13.502Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 15, 30, 'Nahoana koa isika no manao vivery ny aintsika foana?', 'nahoana koa isika no manao vivery ny aintsika foana?'),
  ('6ab25cb1c190d9f02e9e38f5', '2026-09-22T10:47:13.502Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:13.502Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 15, 20, 'Efa natsangana tamin’ny maty anefa i Kristy, izay voaloham-bokatra amin’ireo nodimandry.', 'efa natsangana tamin’ny maty anefa i kristy, izay voaloham-bokatra amin’ireo nodimandry.'),
  ('6ab25cb1c190d9f02e9e38ee', '2026-09-22T10:47:13.502Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:13.502Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 15, 13, 'Raha tsy hatsangana ny maty, dia tsy ho natsangana i Kristy.', 'raha tsy hatsangana ny maty, dia tsy ho natsangana i kristy.'),
  ('6ab25cb1c190d9f02e9e3906', '2026-09-22T10:47:13.502Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:13.502Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 15, 37, 'Ary tsy ilay zavamaniry hipoitra no afafinao, fa voa fotsiny ihany, na voam-barimbazaha izany na voa hafa.', 'ary tsy ilay zavamaniry hipoitra no afafinao, fa voa fotsiny ihany, na voam-barimbazaha izany na voa hafa.'),
  ('6ab25cb1c190d9f02e9e3904', '2026-09-22T10:47:13.502Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:13.502Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 15, 35, 'Na izany aza, dia hisy hilaza hoe: “Ahoana no hananganana ny maty? Vatana hoatran’ny ahoana no hananany rehefa atsangana izy?”', 'na izany aza, dia hisy hilaza hoe: “ahoana no hananganana ny maty? vatana hoatran’ny ahoana no hananany rehefa atsangana izy?”'),
  ('6ab25cb1c190d9f02e9e3902', '2026-09-22T10:47:13.502Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:13.502Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 15, 33, 'Aza manaiky ho voafitaka ianareo. Manimba ny fahazarana mahasoa ny naman-dratsy.', 'aza manaiky ho voafitaka ianareo. manimba ny fahazarana mahasoa ny naman-dratsy.'),
  ('6ab25cb1c190d9f02e9e38f8', '2026-09-22T10:47:13.502Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:13.502Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 15, 23, 'Samy araka ny filaharany avy anefa: I Kristy no voaloham-bokatra, ary avy eo izay an’i Kristy, mandritra ny fanatrehany.', 'samy araka ny filaharany avy anefa: i kristy no voaloham-bokatra, ary avy eo izay an’i kristy, mandritra ny fanatrehany.'),
  ('6ab25cb1c190d9f02e9e38f7', '2026-09-22T10:47:13.502Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:13.502Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 15, 22, 'Fa toy ny ahafatesan’ny rehetra noho ny nataon’i Adama, no hamelomana ny rehetra kosa noho ny nataon’i Kristy.', 'fa toy ny ahafatesan’ny rehetra noho ny nataon’i adama, no hamelomana ny rehetra kosa noho ny nataon’i kristy.'),
  ('6ab25cb1c190d9f02e9e391a', '2026-09-22T10:47:13.502Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:13.502Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 15, 57, 'Fa isaorana Andriamanitra, satria manome antsika fandresena amin’ny alalan’i Jesosy Kristy Tompontsika!', 'fa isaorana andriamanitra, satria manome antsika fandresena amin’ny alalan’i jesosy kristy tompontsika!'),
  ('6ab25cb1c190d9f02e9e390f', '2026-09-22T10:47:13.502Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:13.502Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 15, 46, 'Tsy izay ara-panahy anefa no voalohany. Izay ara-nofo no voalohany, vao ny ara-panahy.', 'tsy izay ara-panahy anefa no voalohany. izay ara-nofo no voalohany, vao ny ara-panahy.'),
  ('6ab25cb1c190d9f02e9e38fa', '2026-09-22T10:47:13.502Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:13.502Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 15, 25, 'Fa tsy maintsy manjaka izy, mandra-panaon’Andriamanitra ny fahavalo rehetra ho eo ambany tongony.', 'fa tsy maintsy manjaka izy, mandra-panaon’andriamanitra ny fahavalo rehetra ho eo ambany tongony.'),
  ('6ab25cb1c190d9f02e9e38e9', '2026-09-22T10:47:13.502Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:13.502Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 15, 8, 'Ary farany indrindra, dia mba niseho tamiko koa izy, toy ny hoe niseho tamin’ny zaza teraka tsy tonga volana.', 'ary farany indrindra, dia mba niseho tamiko koa izy, toy ny hoe niseho tamin’ny zaza teraka tsy tonga volana.'),
  ('6ab25cb1c190d9f02e9e38e7', '2026-09-22T10:47:13.502Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:13.502Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 15, 6, 'Taorian’izany, dia niseho tamin’ny rahalahy maherin’ny 500 indray niaraka izy, ary mbola eto amintsika ny ankamaroany, fa ny sasany kosa efa nodimandry.', 'taorian’izany, dia niseho tamin’ny rahalahy maherin’ny 500 indray niaraka izy, ary mbola eto amintsika ny ankamaroany, fa ny sasany kosa efa nodimandry.'),
  ('6ab25cb1c190d9f02e9e390d', '2026-09-22T10:47:13.502Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:13.502Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 15, 44, 'Vatana ara-nofo izy rehefa afafy, fa vatana ara-panahy rehefa atsangana. Raha misy vatana ara-nofo, dia misy koa vatana ara-panahy.', 'vatana ara-nofo izy rehefa afafy, fa vatana ara-panahy rehefa atsangana. raha misy vatana ara-nofo, dia misy koa vatana ara-panahy.'),
  ('6ab25cb1c190d9f02e9e3907', '2026-09-22T10:47:13.502Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:13.502Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 15, 38, 'Omen’Andriamanitra vatana araka izay tiany anefa ilay voa, ary samy omeny vatana avy ny voa tsirairay.', 'omen’andriamanitra vatana araka izay tiany anefa ilay voa, ary samy omeny vatana avy ny voa tsirairay.'),
  ('6ab25cb1c190d9f02e9e3900', '2026-09-22T10:47:13.502Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:13.502Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 15, 31, 'Tandindomin-doza isan’andro ny aiko. Tena marina izany, ry rahalahiko, ary tena mirehareha ny aminareo koa aho ao amin’i Kristy Jesosy Tompontsika.', 'tandindomin-doza isan’andro ny aiko. tena marina izany, ry rahalahiko, ary tena mirehareha ny aminareo koa aho ao amin’i kristy jesosy tompontsika.'),
  ('6ab25cb1c190d9f02e9e38fd', '2026-09-22T10:47:13.502Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:13.502Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 15, 28, 'Fa rehefa nasaina nanaiky ny Zanaka ny zava-drehetra, dia ny Zanaka mihitsy koa no hanaiky an’Ilay nahatonga ny zava-drehetra hanaiky azy, mba ho Andriamanitra no zava-drehetra ho an’ny rehetra.', 'fa rehefa nasaina nanaiky ny zanaka ny zava-drehetra, dia ny zanaka mihitsy koa no hanaiky an’ilay nahatonga ny zava-drehetra hanaiky azy, mba ho andriamanitra no zava-drehetra ho an’ny rehetra.'),
  ('6ab25cb1c190d9f02e9e38fb', '2026-09-22T10:47:13.502Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:13.502Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 15, 26, 'Ary ny fahavalo farany hofoanana dia ny fahafatesana.', 'ary ny fahavalo farany hofoanana dia ny fahafatesana.'),
  ('6ab25cb1c190d9f02e9e38ec', '2026-09-22T10:47:13.502Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:13.502Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 15, 11, 'Koa izany no torinay, na izaho na izy ireo, ary izany no ninoanareo.', 'koa izany no torinay, na izaho na izy ireo, ary izany no ninoanareo.'),
  ('6ab25cb1c190d9f02e9e38eb', '2026-09-22T10:47:13.502Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:13.502Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 15, 10, 'Ny hatsaram-panahy miavaka nasehon’Andriamanitra anefa no nahatonga ahy ho hoatr’izao. Ary tsy very maina ny hatsaram-panahy miavaka nasehony tamiko, fa niasa mafy mihoatra noho izy rehetra aho. Tsy izaho anefa no tena niasa mafy, fa ilay hatsaram-panahy miavaka naseho tamiko.', 'ny hatsaram-panahy miavaka nasehon’andriamanitra anefa no nahatonga ahy ho hoatr’izao. ary tsy very maina ny hatsaram-panahy miavaka nasehony tamiko, fa niasa mafy mihoatra noho izy rehetra aho. tsy izaho anefa no tena niasa mafy, fa ilay hatsaram-panahy miavaka naseho tamiko.'),
  ('6ab25cb1c190d9f02e9e38ea', '2026-09-22T10:47:13.502Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:13.502Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 15, 9, 'Fa izaho no kely indrindra amin’ny apostoly, ary tsy mendrika ny hantsoina hoe apostoly aho, satria nanenjika ny fiangonan’Andriamanitra.', 'fa izaho no kely indrindra amin’ny apostoly, ary tsy mendrika ny hantsoina hoe apostoly aho, satria nanenjika ny fiangonan’andriamanitra.'),
  ('6ab25cb1c190d9f02e9e3910', '2026-09-22T10:47:13.502Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:13.502Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 15, 47, 'Ilay lehilahy voalohany dia avy amin’ny tany sady natao tamin’ny vovoka, fa ilay lehilahy faharoa kosa avy any an-danitra.', 'ilay lehilahy voalohany dia avy amin’ny tany sady natao tamin’ny vovoka, fa ilay lehilahy faharoa kosa avy any an-danitra.'),
  ('6ab25cb1c190d9f02e9e38fe', '2026-09-22T10:47:13.502Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:13.502Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 15, 29, 'Raha tsy izany, dia inona no soa ho azon’ireo atao batisa mba ho faty? Raha tsy hatsangana mihitsy ny maty, nahoana no atao batisa koa izy ireo mba ho faty?', 'raha tsy izany, dia inona no soa ho azon’ireo atao batisa mba ho faty? raha tsy hatsangana mihitsy ny maty, nahoana no atao batisa koa izy ireo mba ho faty?'),
  ('6ab25cb1c190d9f02e9e38f1', '2026-09-22T10:47:13.502Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:13.502Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 15, 16, 'Fa raha tsy hatsangana ny maty, na i Kristy aza tsy ho natsangana.', 'fa raha tsy hatsangana ny maty, na i kristy aza tsy ho natsangana.'),
  ('6ab25cb1c190d9f02e9e38f0', '2026-09-22T10:47:13.502Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:13.502Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 15, 15, 'Ho hita koa fa vavolombelona milaza lainga momba an’Andriamanitra isika, satria manambara fa nanangana an’i Kristy tamin’ny maty izy. Tsy ho natsangany anefa izy raha tsy hatsangana tokoa ny maty.', 'ho hita koa fa vavolombelona milaza lainga momba an’andriamanitra isika, satria manambara fa nanangana an’i kristy tamin’ny maty izy. tsy ho natsangany anefa izy raha tsy hatsangana tokoa ny maty.'),
  ('6ab25cb2fd9bc77c07fb8347', '2026-09-22T10:47:14.435Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:14.435Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 16, 4, 'Raha ilaina koa anefa ny handehanako any, dia hiaraka amiko izy ireo.', 'raha ilaina koa anefa ny handehanako any, dia hiaraka amiko izy ireo.'),
  ('6ab25cb2fd9bc77c07fb834c', '2026-09-22T10:47:14.435Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:14.435Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 16, 9, 'satria misy varavarana lehibe nosokafana mba hahafahako manao fanompoana. Be dia be anefa ny mpanohitra.', 'satria misy varavarana lehibe nosokafana mba hahafahako manao fanompoana. be dia be anefa ny mpanohitra.'),
  ('6ab25cb2fd9bc77c07fb834e', '2026-09-22T10:47:14.435Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:14.435Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 16, 11, 'Koa aoka tsy hisy hanao tsinontsinona azy. Atero lavidavitra izy, dia alefaso mandeha soa aman-tsara mba ho tonga atỳ amiko, fa miandry azy izaho sy ireo rahalahy.', 'koa aoka tsy hisy hanao tsinontsinona azy. atero lavidavitra izy, dia alefaso mandeha soa aman-tsara mba ho tonga atỳ amiko, fa miandry azy izaho sy ireo rahalahy.'),
  ('6ab25cb2fd9bc77c07fb834b', '2026-09-22T10:47:14.435Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:14.435Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 16, 8, 'Hijanona eto Efesosy kosa aho mandra-pahatongan’ny Fetin’ny Pentekosta,', 'hijanona eto efesosy kosa aho mandra-pahatongan’ny fetin’ny pentekosta,'),
  ('6ab25cb2fd9bc77c07fb8348', '2026-09-22T10:47:14.435Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:14.435Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 16, 5, 'Fa ho any aminareo aho rehefa avy mandalo an’i Makedonia, satria efa handalo an’i Makedonia aho izao.', 'fa ho any aminareo aho rehefa avy mandalo an’i makedonia, satria efa handalo an’i makedonia aho izao.'),
  ('6ab25cb2fd9bc77c07fb834a', '2026-09-22T10:47:14.435Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:14.435Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 16, 7, 'Fa tsy tiako raha mandalo fotsiny aho any aminareo, satria manantena ny hijanona elaela any aho, raha avelan’i Jehovah.', 'fa tsy tiako raha mandalo fotsiny aho any aminareo, satria manantena ny hijanona elaela any aho, raha avelan’i jehovah.'),
  ('6ab25cb2fd9bc77c07fb8345', '2026-09-22T10:47:14.435Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:14.435Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 16, 2, 'Tokony hanokana vola arakaraka izay anananareo avy ianareo, isaky ny andro voalohany amin’ny herinandro. Amin’izay dia tsy hisy fanangonam-bola intsony rehefa tonga aho.', 'tokony hanokana vola arakaraka izay anananareo avy ianareo, isaky ny andro voalohany amin’ny herinandro. amin’izay dia tsy hisy fanangonam-bola intsony rehefa tonga aho.'),
  ('6ab25cb2fd9bc77c07fb834d', '2026-09-22T10:47:14.435Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:14.435Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 16, 10, 'Raha tonga any aminareo i Timoty, dia ataovy izay hahatonga azy tsy hatahotahotra, satria manao ny asan’i Jehovah hoatr’ahy koa izy.', 'raha tonga any aminareo i timoty, dia ataovy izay hahatonga azy tsy hatahotahotra, satria manao ny asan’i jehovah hoatr’ahy koa izy.'),
  ('6ab25cb2fd9bc77c07fb8349', '2026-09-22T10:47:14.435Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:14.435Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 16, 6, 'Ary angamba hijanona kelikely any aminareo aho na hijanona any mandritra ny ririnina mihitsy aza, mba hanateranareo ahy lavidavitra any amin’izay halehako.', 'ary angamba hijanona kelikely any aminareo aho na hijanona any mandritra ny ririnina mihitsy aza, mba hanateranareo ahy lavidavitra any amin’izay halehako.'),
  ('6ab25cb2fd9bc77c07fb8346', '2026-09-22T10:47:14.435Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:14.435Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 16, 3, 'Fa rehefa tonga any aho, dia hirahiko hitondra ny fanomezanareo ho any Jerosalema izay olona nolazainareo tao amin’ny taratasinareo hoe ekenareo hitondra an’ilay izy.', 'fa rehefa tonga any aho, dia hirahiko hitondra ny fanomezanareo ho any jerosalema izay olona nolazainareo tao amin’ny taratasinareo hoe ekenareo hitondra an’ilay izy.'),
  ('6ab25cb2fd9bc77c07fb8344', '2026-09-22T10:47:14.435Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:14.435Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 16, 1, 'Mahakasika an’ilay fanangonam-bola ho an’ny olona masina, dia azonareo arahina ny toromarika nomeko ho an’ireo fiangonana any Galatia.', 'mahakasika an’ilay fanangonam-bola ho an’ny olona masina, dia azonareo arahina ny toromarika nomeko ho an’ireo fiangonana any galatia.'),
  ('6ab25cb2fd9bc77c07fb8352', '2026-09-22T10:47:14.436Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:14.436Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 16, 15, 'Fantatrareo fa ny ankohonan’i Stefanasy no voaloham-bokatra tany Akaia ary nahafoy tena nikarakara an’ireo olona masina izy ireo. Koa mampirisika anareo aho, ry rahalahy,', 'fantatrareo fa ny ankohonan’i stefanasy no voaloham-bokatra tany akaia ary nahafoy tena nikarakara an’ireo olona masina izy ireo. koa mampirisika anareo aho, ry rahalahy,'),
  ('6ab25cb2fd9bc77c07fb8351', '2026-09-22T10:47:14.436Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:14.436Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 16, 14, 'Ataovy amim-pitiavana izay rehetra ataonareo.', 'ataovy amim-pitiavana izay rehetra ataonareo.'),
  ('6ab25cb2fd9bc77c07fb8350', '2026-09-22T10:47:14.436Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:14.436Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 16, 13, 'Miambena foana, miorena tsara amin’ny finoana, ary miezaha ho be herim-po sy hatanjaka.', 'miambena foana, miorena tsara amin’ny finoana, ary miezaha ho be herim-po sy hatanjaka.'),
  ('6ab25cb2fd9bc77c07fb835a', '2026-09-22T10:47:14.436Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:14.436Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 16, 23, 'Enga anie ianareo hanehoan’i Jesosy Tompo hatsaram-panahy miavaka!', 'enga anie ianareo hanehoan’i jesosy tompo hatsaram-panahy miavaka!'),
  ('6ab25cb2fd9bc77c07fb8356', '2026-09-22T10:47:14.436Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:14.436Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 16, 19, 'Mampamangy, hono, ianareo, hoy ireo fiangonana atỳ Azia. Mampamangy indrindra, hono, ianareo ao amin’ny Tompo, hoy i Akoila sy Priska ary ny fiangonana mivory ao an-tranony.', 'mampamangy, hono, ianareo, hoy ireo fiangonana atỳ azia. mampamangy indrindra, hono, ianareo ao amin’ny tompo, hoy i akoila sy priska ary ny fiangonana mivory ao an-tranony.'),
  ('6ab25cb2fd9bc77c07fb834f', '2026-09-22T10:47:14.436Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:14.436Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 16, 12, 'Raha ny amin’i Apolosy rahalahintsika, dia niangavy mafy azy aho hiaraka amin’ireo rahalahy ho any aminareo. Tsy mieritreritra ny ho any anefa izy izao, fa ho tonga any ihany izy rehefa afaka.', 'raha ny amin’i apolosy rahalahintsika, dia niangavy mafy azy aho hiaraka amin’ireo rahalahy ho any aminareo. tsy mieritreritra ny ho any anefa izy izao, fa ho tonga any ihany izy rehefa afaka.'),
  ('6ab25cb2fd9bc77c07fb8359', '2026-09-22T10:47:14.436Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:14.436Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 16, 22, 'Raha misy tsy miraiki-po amin’ny Tompo, dia ho voaozona izy. Avia, ry Tomponay ô!', 'raha misy tsy miraiki-po amin’ny tompo, dia ho voaozona izy. avia, ry tomponay ô!'),
  ('6ab25cb2fd9bc77c07fb835b', '2026-09-22T10:47:14.436Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:14.436Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 16, 24, 'Tiako daholo ianareo rehetra izay tafaray amin’i Kristy Jesosy!', 'tiako daholo ianareo rehetra izay tafaray amin’i kristy jesosy!'),
  ('6ab25cb2fd9bc77c07fb8358', '2026-09-22T10:47:14.436Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:14.436Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 16, 21, 'Ity no veloma nosoratan’ny tanako, izaho Paoly.', 'ity no veloma nosoratan’ny tanako, izaho paoly.'),
  ('6ab25cb2fd9bc77c07fb8357', '2026-09-22T10:47:14.436Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:14.436Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 16, 20, 'Manao mampamangy anareo ny rahalahy rehetra. Mifampiarahabà amin’ny oroka masina.', 'manao mampamangy anareo ny rahalahy rehetra. mifampiarahabà amin’ny oroka masina.'),
  ('6ab25cb2fd9bc77c07fb8355', '2026-09-22T10:47:14.436Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:14.436Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 16, 18, 'Fa mamelombelona ahy sy mamelombelona anareo izy ireo. Koa ankasitraho ny olona toy ireny.', 'fa mamelombelona ahy sy mamelombelona anareo izy ireo. koa ankasitraho ny olona toy ireny.'),
  ('6ab25cb2fd9bc77c07fb8353', '2026-09-22T10:47:14.436Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:14.436Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 16, 16, 'mba hanaiky foana ny olona toy ireny sy izay rehetra miara-miasa sy miasa mafy!', 'mba hanaiky foana ny olona toy ireny sy izay rehetra miara-miasa sy miasa mafy!'),
  ('6ab25cb2fd9bc77c07fb8354', '2026-09-22T10:47:14.436Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:14.436Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Korintianina', 46, 16, 17, 'Faly anefa aho fa eto amiko i Stefanasy sy Fortonato ary Akaiko, satria manonitra ny tsy maha eto anareo izy ireo.', 'faly anefa aho fa eto amiko i stefanasy sy fortonato ary akaiko, satria manonitra ny tsy maha eto anareo izy ireo.'),
  ('6ab25cb3e5329ecabe28f550', '2026-09-22T10:47:15.399Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:15.399Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 1, 21, 'Andriamanitra anefa no manome antoka fa samy an’i Kristy na izahay na ianareo, ary Izy no nanosotra antsika.', 'andriamanitra anefa no manome antoka fa samy an’i kristy na izahay na ianareo, ary izy no nanosotra antsika.'),
  ('6ab25cb3e5329ecabe28f548', '2026-09-22T10:47:15.399Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:15.399Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 1, 13, 'Izay azonareo vakina sy takatrareo ihany mantsy no soratanay aminareo. Ary manantena aho fa ho takatrareo tsara foana izany,', 'izay azonareo vakina sy takatrareo ihany mantsy no soratanay aminareo. ary manantena aho fa ho takatrareo tsara foana izany,'),
  ('6ab25cb3e5329ecabe28f53e', '2026-09-22T10:47:15.399Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:15.399Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 1, 3, 'Hoderaina anie Andriamanitra Rain’i Jesosy Kristy Tompontsika, Rain’ny fangorahana sy Andriamanitry ny fampiononana rehetra!', 'hoderaina anie andriamanitra rain’i jesosy kristy tompontsika, rain’ny fangorahana sy andriamanitry ny fampiononana rehetra!'),
  ('6ab25cb3e5329ecabe28f53d', '2026-09-22T10:47:15.399Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:15.399Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 1, 2, 'Enga anie ilay Andriamanitra Raintsika sy Jesosy Kristy Tompo mba haneho hatsaram-panahy miavaka aminareo sady hanome fiadanana anareo!', 'enga anie ilay andriamanitra raintsika sy jesosy kristy tompo mba haneho hatsaram-panahy miavaka aminareo sady hanome fiadanana anareo!'),
  ('6ab25cb3e5329ecabe28f54b', '2026-09-22T10:47:15.399Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:15.399Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 1, 16, 'Fa saika hitsidika anareo aho tamin’izaho ho atỳ Makedonia sy rehefa hiverina avy atỳ Makedonia, dia mba haterinareo lavidavitra aho rehefa ho any Jodia.', 'fa saika hitsidika anareo aho tamin’izaho ho atỳ makedonia sy rehefa hiverina avy atỳ makedonia, dia mba haterinareo lavidavitra aho rehefa ho any jodia.'),
  ('6ab25cb3e5329ecabe28f545', '2026-09-22T10:47:15.399Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:15.399Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 1, 10, 'Nanafaka anay tamin’ilay loza saika nahafaty anay mantsy izy, ary mbola hanafaka anay koa. Ary manantena izahay fa mbola hanafaka anay foana izy.', 'nanafaka anay tamin’ilay loza saika nahafaty anay mantsy izy, ary mbola hanafaka anay koa. ary manantena izahay fa mbola hanafaka anay foana izy.'),
  ('6ab25cb3e5329ecabe28f543', '2026-09-22T10:47:15.399Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:15.399Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 1, 8, 'Tianay ho fantatrareo mantsy, ry rahalahy, ny zava-tsarotra natrehinay tany amin’ny faritanin’i Azia. Nizaka ny tsy eran’ny aina izahay, ka tsy nanampo ny ho velona intsony.', 'tianay ho fantatrareo mantsy, ry rahalahy, ny zava-tsarotra natrehinay tany amin’ny faritanin’i azia. nizaka ny tsy eran’ny aina izahay, ka tsy nanampo ny ho velona intsony.'),
  ('6ab25cb3e5329ecabe28f552', '2026-09-22T10:47:15.399Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:15.399Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 1, 23, 'Ary miantso an’Andriamanitra ho vavolombelona aho, fa te hitsimbina anareo aho matoa mbola tsy tonga any Korinto.', 'ary miantso an’andriamanitra ho vavolombelona aho, fa te hitsimbina anareo aho matoa mbola tsy tonga any korinto.'),
  ('6ab25cb3e5329ecabe28f54c', '2026-09-22T10:47:15.399Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:15.399Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 1, 17, 'Angaha izaho nivazivazy fotsiny tamin’izaho niteny hoe ho any aminareo? Sa ve manao izay tiako fotsiny aho rehefa misy zavatra eritreretiko hatao, dia miteny aho hoe: “Eny e, eny e”, nefa avy eo hoe “Tsia” indray?', 'angaha izaho nivazivazy fotsiny tamin’izaho niteny hoe ho any aminareo? sa ve manao izay tiako fotsiny aho rehefa misy zavatra eritreretiko hatao, dia miteny aho hoe: “eny e, eny e”, nefa avy eo hoe “tsia” indray?'),
  ('6ab25cb3e5329ecabe28f549', '2026-09-22T10:47:15.399Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:15.399Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 1, 14, 'hoatran’ny nahatakaran’ny sasany taminareo fa reharehanareo izahay. Ary ho reharehanay koa ianareo amin’ny andron’i Jesosy Tompontsika.', 'hoatran’ny nahatakaran’ny sasany taminareo fa reharehanareo izahay. ary ho reharehanay koa ianareo amin’ny andron’i jesosy tompontsika.'),
  ('6ab25cb3e5329ecabe28f546', '2026-09-22T10:47:15.399Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:15.399Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 1, 11, 'Afaka manampy anay koa ianareo rehefa mitalaho amim-bavaka ho anay. Amin’izay dia betsaka no ho afaka hisaotra an’Andriamanitra noho ny aminay, noho izahay nahazo fanampiana ho valin’ny vavaka nataon’ny maro.', 'afaka manampy anay koa ianareo rehefa mitalaho amim-bavaka ho anay. amin’izay dia betsaka no ho afaka hisaotra an’andriamanitra noho ny aminay, noho izahay nahazo fanampiana ho valin’ny vavaka nataon’ny maro.'),
  ('6ab25cb3e5329ecabe28f540', '2026-09-22T10:47:15.399Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:15.399Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 1, 5, 'Fa hoatran’ny iaretantsika fijaliana be noho ny amin’i Kristy, no ahazoantsika fampiononana be koa amin’ny alalan’i Kristy.', 'fa hoatran’ny iaretantsika fijaliana be noho ny amin’i kristy, no ahazoantsika fampiononana be koa amin’ny alalan’i kristy.'),
  ('6ab25cb3e5329ecabe28f53c', '2026-09-22T10:47:15.399Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:15.399Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 1, 1, 'Avy amin’i Paoly, apostolin’i Kristy Jesosy noho ny sitrapon’Andriamanitra, sy Timoty rahalahintsika. Ho an’ny fiangonan’Andriamanitra any Korinto, anisan’izany ny olona masina rehetra eran’i Akaia,', 'avy amin’i paoly, apostolin’i kristy jesosy noho ny sitrapon’andriamanitra, sy timoty rahalahintsika. ho an’ny fiangonan’andriamanitra any korinto, anisan’izany ny olona masina rehetra eran’i akaia,'),
  ('6ab25cb3e5329ecabe28f553', '2026-09-22T10:47:15.399Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:15.399Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 1, 24, 'Tsy tompon’ny finoanareo izahay fa mpiara-miasa kosa mba ho faly ianareo, satria ny finoanareo ihany no ijoroanareo.', 'tsy tompon’ny finoanareo izahay fa mpiara-miasa kosa mba ho faly ianareo, satria ny finoanareo ihany no ijoroanareo.'),
  ('6ab25cb3e5329ecabe28f551', '2026-09-22T10:47:15.399Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:15.399Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 1, 22, 'Nanisy tombo-kase antsika koa izy sady nanome antsika an’ilay antoka ny amin’izay ho avy, dia ny fanahy ao am-pontsika.', 'nanisy tombo-kase antsika koa izy sady nanome antsika an’ilay antoka ny amin’izay ho avy, dia ny fanahy ao am-pontsika.'),
  ('6ab25cb3e5329ecabe28f54e', '2026-09-22T10:47:15.399Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:15.399Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 1, 19, 'Tsy hoe “eny” mantsy dia avy eo “tsia” i Jesosy Kristy Zanak’Andriamanitra, ilay notorinay sy Silvano ary Timoty taminareo. Amin’i Kristy kosa, rehefa “eny” dia “eny.”', 'tsy hoe “eny” mantsy dia avy eo “tsia” i jesosy kristy zanak’andriamanitra, ilay notorinay sy silvano ary timoty taminareo. amin’i kristy kosa, rehefa “eny” dia “eny.”'),
  ('6ab25cb3e5329ecabe28f54f', '2026-09-22T10:47:15.399Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:15.399Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 1, 20, 'Fa na firy na firy ny fampanantenan’ Andriamanitra, dia lasa “eny” ireny amin’ny alalan’ny Zanany. Noho izany, dia amin’ny alalany koa no anaovanay “Amena” amin’Andriamanitra, mba hanomezanay voninahitra Azy.', 'fa na firy na firy ny fampanantenan’ andriamanitra, dia lasa “eny” ireny amin’ny alalan’ny zanany. noho izany, dia amin’ny alalany koa no anaovanay “amena” amin’andriamanitra, mba hanomezanay voninahitra azy.'),
  ('6ab25cb3e5329ecabe28f54d', '2026-09-22T10:47:15.399Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:15.399Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 1, 18, 'Azo itokisana anefa Andriamanitra ary hoatr’izany koa ny teninay taminareo, fa tsy hoe “eny” dia avy eo hoe “tsia.”', 'azo itokisana anefa andriamanitra ary hoatr’izany koa ny teninay taminareo, fa tsy hoe “eny” dia avy eo hoe “tsia.”'),
  ('6ab25cb3e5329ecabe28f544', '2026-09-22T10:47:15.399Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:15.399Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 1, 9, 'Hoatran’ny hoe voaheloka ho faty mihitsy izahay. Nitranga izany mba tsy hahatonga anay hatoky ny tenanay, fa hatoky an’Andriamanitra izay manangana ny maty.', 'hoatran’ny hoe voaheloka ho faty mihitsy izahay. nitranga izany mba tsy hahatonga anay hatoky ny tenanay, fa hatoky an’andriamanitra izay manangana ny maty.'),
  ('6ab25cb3e5329ecabe28f542', '2026-09-22T10:47:15.399Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:15.399Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 1, 7, 'Matoky tanteraka anareo izahay, satria fantatray fa hoatran’ny ijalianay no ijalianareo koa, ary hoatran’ny hampiononana anay no hampiononana anareo koa.', 'matoky tanteraka anareo izahay, satria fantatray fa hoatran’ny ijalianay no ijalianareo koa, ary hoatran’ny hampiononana anay no hampiononana anareo koa.'),
  ('6ab25cb3e5329ecabe28f54a', '2026-09-22T10:47:15.399Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:15.399Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 1, 15, 'Matoky an’izany aho ka nikasa ho any aminareo aloha, mba hifalianareo indray.', 'matoky an’izany aho ka nikasa ho any aminareo aloha, mba hifalianareo indray.'),
  ('6ab25cb3e5329ecabe28f547', '2026-09-22T10:47:15.399Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:15.399Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 1, 12, 'Fa izao no reharehanay: Madio ny feon’ny fieritreretanay milaza hoe masina sady feno fahatsorana avy amin’Andriamanitra ny fitondran-tenanay teo amin’izao tontolo izao, indrindra fa teo aminareo. Tsy niantehitra tamin’ny fahendren’izao tontolo izao izahay, fa tamin’ny hatsaram-panahy miavaka nasehon’Andriamanitra.', 'fa izao no reharehanay: madio ny feon’ny fieritreretanay milaza hoe masina sady feno fahatsorana avy amin’andriamanitra ny fitondran-tenanay teo amin’izao tontolo izao, indrindra fa teo aminareo. tsy niantehitra tamin’ny fahendren’izao tontolo izao izahay, fa tamin’ny hatsaram-panahy miavaka nasehon’andriamanitra.'),
  ('6ab25cb3e5329ecabe28f541', '2026-09-22T10:47:15.399Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:15.399Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 1, 6, 'Koa raha miatrika fahoriana izahay, dia ho fampiononana sy ho famonjena anareo izany. Ary raha ampiononina izahay, dia ho fampiononana anareo izany, ka izany fampiononana izany no hanampy anareo hiaritra fijaliana mitovy amin’izay mahazo anay koa.', 'koa raha miatrika fahoriana izahay, dia ho fampiononana sy ho famonjena anareo izany. ary raha ampiononina izahay, dia ho fampiononana anareo izany, ka izany fampiononana izany no hanampy anareo hiaritra fijaliana mitovy amin’izay mahazo anay koa.'),
  ('6ab25cb3e5329ecabe28f53f', '2026-09-22T10:47:15.399Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:15.399Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 1, 4, 'Mampionona antsika amin’ny fahoriana rehetra mahazo antsika izy. Ary noho isika ampiononin’Andriamanitra, dia lasa haintsika koa ny mampionona an’izay miatrika fahoriana isan-karazany.', 'mampionona antsika amin’ny fahoriana rehetra mahazo antsika izy. ary noho isika ampiononin’andriamanitra, dia lasa haintsika koa ny mampionona an’izay miatrika fahoriana isan-karazany.'),
  ('6ab25cb3c7693a3656004739', '2026-09-22T10:47:15.837Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:15.837Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 2, 14, 'Fa isaorana Andriamanitra, izay mitarika antsika foana eo amin’ny filaharan’ny mpandresy, miaraka amin’i Kristy! Isaorana koa Izy satria ataony mamerovero eny rehetra eny amin’ny alalantsika ny hanitry ny fahalalana azy!', 'fa isaorana andriamanitra, izay mitarika antsika foana eo amin’ny filaharan’ny mpandresy, miaraka amin’i kristy! isaorana koa izy satria ataony mamerovero eny rehetra eny amin’ny alalantsika ny hanitry ny fahalalana azy!'),
  ('6ab25cb3c7693a3656004738', '2026-09-22T10:47:15.837Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:15.837Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 2, 13, 'dia tsy nilamina ny saiko satria tsy hitako tany i Titosy rahalahiko. Koa nataoko veloma ry zareo, dia niainga ho atỳ Makedonia aho.', 'dia tsy nilamina ny saiko satria tsy hitako tany i titosy rahalahiko. koa nataoko veloma ry zareo, dia niainga ho atỳ makedonia aho.'),
  ('6ab25cb3c7693a3656004736', '2026-09-22T10:47:15.837Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:15.837Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 2, 11, 'mba tsy ho voafitak’i Satana ianareo, fa fantatsika ny teti-dratsiny.', 'mba tsy ho voafitak’i satana ianareo, fa fantatsika ny teti-dratsiny.'),
  ('6ab25cb3c7693a365600472f', '2026-09-22T10:47:15.837Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:15.837Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 2, 4, 'Fa nijaly sy nitebiteby be aho tao am-poko tao rehefa nanoratra taminareo tamin-dranomaso be. Tsy hoe mba hampalahelo anareo anefa, fa mba hahafantaranareo hoe tena tia anareo aho.', 'fa nijaly sy nitebiteby be aho tao am-poko tao rehefa nanoratra taminareo tamin-dranomaso be. tsy hoe mba hampalahelo anareo anefa, fa mba hahafantaranareo hoe tena tia anareo aho.'),
  ('6ab25cb3c7693a3656004733', '2026-09-22T10:47:15.837Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:15.837Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 2, 8, 'Mampirisika anareo àry aho mba hanome toky azy hoe tianareo izy.', 'mampirisika anareo àry aho mba hanome toky azy hoe tianareo izy.'),
  ('6ab25cb3c7693a3656004732', '2026-09-22T10:47:15.837Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:15.837Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 2, 7, 'Tokony ho vonona hamela ny helony kosa ianareo izao sady ho tsara fanahy rehefa manao an’izany, ka hampionona azy sao ho difotry ny alahelo be loatra izy.', 'tokony ho vonona hamela ny helony kosa ianareo izao sady ho tsara fanahy rehefa manao an’izany, ka hampionona azy sao ho difotry ny alahelo be loatra izy.'),
  ('6ab25cb3c7693a3656004730', '2026-09-22T10:47:15.837Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:15.837Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 2, 5, 'Raha nisy nanao izay hampalahelo ny hafa, dia tsy izaho no nampalaheloviny, fa saika ianareo rehetra mihitsy. Tsy te hampiasa teny henjana loatra anefa aho matoa milaza an’izany.', 'raha nisy nanao izay hampalahelo ny hafa, dia tsy izaho no nampalaheloviny, fa saika ianareo rehetra mihitsy. tsy te hampiasa teny henjana loatra anefa aho matoa milaza an’izany.'),
  ('6ab25cb3c7693a365600472c', '2026-09-22T10:47:15.837Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:15.837Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 2, 1, 'Fa efa tapa-kevitra aho ny tsy hampalahelo anareo rehefa mitsidika anareo indray.', 'fa efa tapa-kevitra aho ny tsy hampalahelo anareo rehefa mitsidika anareo indray.'),
  ('6ab25cb3c7693a365600472e', '2026-09-22T10:47:15.837Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:15.837Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 2, 3, 'Nanoratra an’izany aho mba tsy hampalahelo ahy ireo olona tokony hampifaly ahy, rehefa tonga aho. Matoky mantsy aho fa izay mahafaly ahy dia mahafaly anareo rehetra koa.', 'nanoratra an’izany aho mba tsy hampalahelo ahy ireo olona tokony hampifaly ahy, rehefa tonga aho. matoky mantsy aho fa izay mahafaly ahy dia mahafaly anareo rehetra koa.'),
  ('6ab25cb3c7693a365600473c', '2026-09-22T10:47:15.837Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:15.837Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 2, 17, 'Izahay, satria izahay tsy mivarotra ny tenin’Andriamanitra hoatran’ny ataon’ny olona maro. Miteny amim-pahatsorana kosa izahay eo anatrehan’Andriamanitra sy miaraka amin’i Kristy, toy ny olona nirahin’Andriamanitra.', 'izahay, satria izahay tsy mivarotra ny tenin’andriamanitra hoatran’ny ataon’ny olona maro. miteny amim-pahatsorana kosa izahay eo anatrehan’andriamanitra sy miaraka amin’i kristy, toy ny olona nirahin’andriamanitra.'),
  ('6ab25cb3c7693a3656004735', '2026-09-22T10:47:15.837Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:15.837Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 2, 10, 'Izay heloka avelanareo, dia mba avelako koa. Raha ny marina, izay heloka navelako—raha nisy navelako—dia navelako teo imason’i Kristy noho ny aminareo,', 'izay heloka avelanareo, dia mba avelako koa. raha ny marina, izay heloka navelako—raha nisy navelako—dia navelako teo imason’i kristy noho ny aminareo,'),
  ('6ab25cb3c7693a3656004731', '2026-09-22T10:47:15.837Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:15.837Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 2, 6, 'Ampy ho an’ilay olona izany fananarana mafy nataon’ny ankamaroanareo izany.', 'ampy ho an’ilay olona izany fananarana mafy nataon’ny ankamaroanareo izany.'),
  ('6ab25cb3c7693a365600473a', '2026-09-22T10:47:15.837Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:15.837Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 2, 15, 'Amin’Andriamanitra mantsy, dia toy ny hanitra mamerovero isika eo amin’ireo hovonjena sy ireo ho ringana, rehefa mitory momba an’i Kristy:', 'amin’andriamanitra mantsy, dia toy ny hanitra mamerovero isika eo amin’ireo hovonjena sy ireo ho ringana, rehefa mitory momba an’i kristy:'),
  ('6ab25cb3c7693a3656004734', '2026-09-22T10:47:15.837Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:15.837Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 2, 9, 'Nanoratra ho anareo koa aho mba hahitako raha mankatò amin’ny zava-drehetra ianareo na tsia.', 'nanoratra ho anareo koa aho mba hahitako raha mankatò amin’ny zava-drehetra ianareo na tsia.'),
  ('6ab25cb3c7693a365600473b', '2026-09-22T10:47:15.837Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:15.837Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 2, 16, 'Amin’ireo ho ringana, dia fofona fahafatesana mitarika ho amin’ny fahafatesana, ary amin’ireo hovonjena, dia hanitry ny fiainana mitarika ho amin’ny fiainana. Ary iza no mahafeno fepetra hanao an’izany?', 'amin’ireo ho ringana, dia fofona fahafatesana mitarika ho amin’ny fahafatesana, ary amin’ireo hovonjena, dia hanitry ny fiainana mitarika ho amin’ny fiainana. ary iza no mahafeno fepetra hanao an’izany?'),
  ('6ab25cb3c7693a3656004737', '2026-09-22T10:47:15.837Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:15.837Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 2, 12, 'Rehefa tonga tany Troasy hitory ny vaovao tsara momba an’i Kristy aho, ka nisy varavarana nosokafana ho ahy nahafahako nanao ny asan’ny Tompo,', 'rehefa tonga tany troasy hitory ny vaovao tsara momba an’i kristy aho, ka nisy varavarana nosokafana ho ahy nahafahako nanao ny asan’ny tompo,'),
  ('6ab25cb3c7693a365600472d', '2026-09-22T10:47:15.837Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:15.837Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 2, 2, 'Fa raha manao izay hampalahelo anareo aho, dia iza indray no hampifaly ahy, afa-tsy ilay nampalaheloviko ihany?', 'fa raha manao izay hampalahelo anareo aho, dia iza indray no hampifaly ahy, afa-tsy ilay nampalaheloviko ihany?'),
  ('6ab25cb41c7c52f362652804', '2026-09-22T10:47:16.274Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:16.274Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 3, 9, 'Raha be voninahitra ilay lalàna nitondra fanamelohana, dia vao mainka tokony ho be voninahitra kokoa ilay fanompoana manampy ny olona ho lasa olo-marina!', 'raha be voninahitra ilay lalàna nitondra fanamelohana, dia vao mainka tokony ho be voninahitra kokoa ilay fanompoana manampy ny olona ho lasa olo-marina!'),
  ('6ab25cb41c7c52f3626527fe', '2026-09-22T10:47:16.274Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:16.274Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 3, 3, 'Miharihary mantsy fa ianareo no taratasin’i Kristy nosoratanay mpanompon’Andriamanitra. Tsy nosoratana tamin’ny ranomainty anefa, fa tamin’ny fanahin’Andriamanitra velona, ary tsy teo amin’ny takela-bato, fa teo amin’ny takelaka nofo, dia ny fo.', 'miharihary mantsy fa ianareo no taratasin’i kristy nosoratanay mpanompon’andriamanitra. tsy nosoratana tamin’ny ranomainty anefa, fa tamin’ny fanahin’andriamanitra velona, ary tsy teo amin’ny takela-bato, fa teo amin’ny takelaka nofo, dia ny fo.'),
  ('6ab25cb41c7c52f362652800', '2026-09-22T10:47:16.274Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:16.274Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 3, 5, 'Izahay akory tsy mihambo hoe noho ny ezaka ataonay no mahatonga anay hahay an’ilay asa, fa Andriamanitra kosa no mahatonga anay hahay an’ilay izy.', 'izahay akory tsy mihambo hoe noho ny ezaka ataonay no mahatonga anay hahay an’ilay asa, fa andriamanitra kosa no mahatonga anay hahay an’ilay izy.'),
  ('6ab25cb41c7c52f36265280b', '2026-09-22T10:47:16.274Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:16.274Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 3, 16, 'Rehefa misy olona miverina amin’i Jehovah anefa, dia esorina ilay lamba manarona.', 'rehefa misy olona miverina amin’i jehovah anefa, dia esorina ilay lamba manarona.'),
  ('6ab25cb41c7c52f362652805', '2026-09-22T10:47:16.274Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:16.274Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 3, 10, 'Na ilay natao be voninahitra taloha aza lasa tsy manana voninahitra intsony, noho ilay voninahitra tsara kokoa.', 'na ilay natao be voninahitra taloha aza lasa tsy manana voninahitra intsony, noho ilay voninahitra tsara kokoa.'),
  ('6ab25cb41c7c52f3626527fc', '2026-09-22T10:47:16.274Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:16.274Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 3, 1, 'Mila mampahafantatra ny tenanay aminareo indray ve izahay? Sa ve izahay, hoatran’ny sasany, ka hoe mila manome anareo taratasy fampahafantarana ny momba anay, na mila an’izany avy aminareo?', 'mila mampahafantatra ny tenanay aminareo indray ve izahay? sa ve izahay, hoatran’ny sasany, ka hoe mila manome anareo taratasy fampahafantarana ny momba anay, na mila an’izany avy aminareo?'),
  ('6ab25cb41c7c52f362652809', '2026-09-22T10:47:16.274Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:16.274Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 3, 14, 'Donto anefa ny sain’izy ireo. Mbola tsy nesorina foana mantsy hatramin’izao ilay lamba manarona rehefa vakina ilay fifanekena taloha, satria amin’ny alalan’i Kristy ihany no anesorana azy io.', 'donto anefa ny sain’izy ireo. mbola tsy nesorina foana mantsy hatramin’izao ilay lamba manarona rehefa vakina ilay fifanekena taloha, satria amin’ny alalan’i kristy ihany no anesorana azy io.'),
  ('6ab25cb41c7c52f3626527fd', '2026-09-22T10:47:16.274Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:16.274Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 3, 2, 'Ianareo no taratasinay, voasoratra ato am-ponay ary fantatra sy vakin’ny olona rehetra.', 'ianareo no taratasinay, voasoratra ato am-ponay ary fantatra sy vakin’ny olona rehetra.'),
  ('6ab25cb41c7c52f36265280a', '2026-09-22T10:47:16.274Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:16.274Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 3, 15, 'Raha ny marina, dia misy lamba manarona ny fon’izy ireo hatramin’izao, isaky ny vakina izay nosoratan’i Mosesy.', 'raha ny marina, dia misy lamba manarona ny fon’izy ireo hatramin’izao, isaky ny vakina izay nosoratan’i mosesy.'),
  ('6ab25cb41c7c52f362652806', '2026-09-22T10:47:16.274Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:16.274Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 3, 11, 'Fa raha ilay tsy maintsy hofoanana aza nomena tamim-boninahitra, dia vao mainka tokony ho be voninahitra kokoa ilay maharitra!', 'fa raha ilay tsy maintsy hofoanana aza nomena tamim-boninahitra, dia vao mainka tokony ho be voninahitra kokoa ilay maharitra!'),
  ('6ab25cb41c7c52f362652802', '2026-09-22T10:47:16.274Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:16.274Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 3, 7, 'Nomena tamim-boninahitra lehibe ilay lalàna mitondra fahafatesana sy nosoratana teo amin’ny vato, ka tsy vitan’ny zanak’Israely ny nibanjina ny tarehin’i Mosesy noho ilay voninahitra nampamirapiratra ny tarehiny, dia ilay voninahitra tsy maintsy hofoanana.', 'nomena tamim-boninahitra lehibe ilay lalàna mitondra fahafatesana sy nosoratana teo amin’ny vato, ka tsy vitan’ny zanak’israely ny nibanjina ny tarehin’i mosesy noho ilay voninahitra nampamirapiratra ny tarehiny, dia ilay voninahitra tsy maintsy hofoanana.'),
  ('6ab25cb41c7c52f362652807', '2026-09-22T10:47:16.274Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:16.274Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 3, 12, 'Koa satria manana an’izany fanantenana izany isika, dia tena sahy miteny,', 'koa satria manana an’izany fanantenana izany isika, dia tena sahy miteny,'),
  ('6ab25cb41c7c52f362652801', '2026-09-22T10:47:16.274Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:16.274Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 3, 6, 'Izy no tena mahatonga anay hahay an’ilay asa ka ho lasa mpanompon’ny fifanekena vaovao, izany hoe tsy mpanompon’ny lalàna voasoratra, fa mpanompon’ny fanahy. Manameloka ho faty mantsy ilay lalàna voasoratra, fa mahavelona kosa ny fanahy.', 'izy no tena mahatonga anay hahay an’ilay asa ka ho lasa mpanompon’ny fifanekena vaovao, izany hoe tsy mpanompon’ny lalàna voasoratra, fa mpanompon’ny fanahy. manameloka ho faty mantsy ilay lalàna voasoratra, fa mahavelona kosa ny fanahy.'),
  ('6ab25cb41c7c52f36265280d', '2026-09-22T10:47:16.274Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:16.274Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 3, 18, 'Ary nesorintsika ny lamba manarona ny tarehintsika, ka toy ny fitaratra manome taratry ny voninahitr’i Jehovah isika. Ovana hitovy endrika aminy àry isika rehetra, ka manome taratra tsikelikely ny voninahiny, mifanaraka tanteraka amin’ilay fanovana ataon’i Jehovah, izay Fanahy.', 'ary nesorintsika ny lamba manarona ny tarehintsika, ka toy ny fitaratra manome taratry ny voninahitr’i jehovah isika. ovana hitovy endrika aminy àry isika rehetra, ka manome taratra tsikelikely ny voninahiny, mifanaraka tanteraka amin’ilay fanovana ataon’i jehovah, izay fanahy.'),
  ('6ab25cb41c7c52f362652803', '2026-09-22T10:47:16.274Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:16.274Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 3, 8, 'Koa raha izany, tsy vao mainka ve tokony homena amim-boninahitra lehibe kokoa ny fanahy?', 'koa raha izany, tsy vao mainka ve tokony homena amim-boninahitra lehibe kokoa ny fanahy?'),
  ('6ab25cb41c7c52f362652808', '2026-09-22T10:47:16.274Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:16.274Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 3, 13, 'ary tsy manao hoatran’ny nataon’i Mosesy tamin’izy nanarona lamba ny tarehiny, mba tsy hahafahan’ny zanak’Israely hibanjina an’izay hiafaran’ilay tsy maintsy hofoanana.', 'ary tsy manao hoatran’ny nataon’i mosesy tamin’izy nanarona lamba ny tarehiny, mba tsy hahafahan’ny zanak’israely hibanjina an’izay hiafaran’ilay tsy maintsy hofoanana.'),
  ('6ab25cb41c7c52f3626527ff', '2026-09-22T10:47:16.274Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:16.274Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 3, 4, 'Matoky an’izany izahay eo anatrehan’Andriamanitra, noho ny amin’i Kristy.', 'matoky an’izany izahay eo anatrehan’andriamanitra, noho ny amin’i kristy.'),
  ('6ab25cb41c7c52f36265280c', '2026-09-22T10:47:16.274Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:16.274Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 3, 17, 'I Jehovah no ilay Fanahy, ary any amin’izay misy ny fanahin’i Jehovah dia misy fahafahana.', 'i jehovah no ilay fanahy, ary any amin’izay misy ny fanahin’i jehovah dia misy fahafahana.'),
  ('6ab25cb473e52c42b6e2ba19', '2026-09-22T10:47:16.685Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:16.685Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 4, 1, 'Koa tsy kivy izahay satria manana an’izany fanompoana izany, noho izahay nanehoana famindram-po.', 'koa tsy kivy izahay satria manana an’izany fanompoana izany, noho izahay nanehoana famindram-po.'),
  ('6ab25cb473e52c42b6e2ba21', '2026-09-22T10:47:16.686Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:16.686Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 4, 9, 'Enjehina izahay, nefa tsy afoy. Azera izahay, nefa tsy maty.', 'enjehina izahay, nefa tsy afoy. azera izahay, nefa tsy maty.'),
  ('6ab25cb473e52c42b6e2ba2a', '2026-09-22T10:47:16.686Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:16.686Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 4, 18, 'Koa mampifantoka ny masontsika amin’ny zavatra tsy hita isika, fa tsy amin’ny hita. Mihelina mantsy ny zavatra hita, fa ny tsy hita kosa maharitra mandrakizay.', 'koa mampifantoka ny masontsika amin’ny zavatra tsy hita isika, fa tsy amin’ny hita. mihelina mantsy ny zavatra hita, fa ny tsy hita kosa maharitra mandrakizay.'),
  ('6ab25cb473e52c42b6e2ba27', '2026-09-22T10:47:16.686Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:16.686Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 4, 15, 'Fa noho ianareo no anaovana an’izany zavatra rehetra izany. Amin’izay dia vao mainka hitombo ny hatsaram-panahy miavaka izay efa be dia be, satria mihabetsaka ny olona manolotra fisaorana mba hanomezana voninahitra an’Andriamanitra.', 'fa noho ianareo no anaovana an’izany zavatra rehetra izany. amin’izay dia vao mainka hitombo ny hatsaram-panahy miavaka izay efa be dia be, satria mihabetsaka ny olona manolotra fisaorana mba hanomezana voninahitra an’andriamanitra.'),
  ('6ab25cb473e52c42b6e2ba20', '2026-09-22T10:47:16.686Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:16.686Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 4, 8, 'Voageja amin’ny lafiny rehetra izahay, nefa tsy hoe tery loatra ka tsy afa-mihetsika. Very hevitra izahay, nefa tsy hoe tsy misy lalan-kivoahana mihitsy.', 'voageja amin’ny lafiny rehetra izahay, nefa tsy hoe tery loatra ka tsy afa-mihetsika. very hevitra izahay, nefa tsy hoe tsy misy lalan-kivoahana mihitsy.'),
  ('6ab25cb473e52c42b6e2ba1e', '2026-09-22T10:47:16.686Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:16.686Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 4, 6, 'Fa Andriamanitra no niteny hoe: “Aoka ny hazavana hamirapiratra avy ao amin’ny haizina.” Ary nataony mamirapiratra ao am-ponay amin’ny alalan’ny tarehin’i Kristy ny hazavany, ka lasa mahalala an’Andriamanitra izahay, ary be voninahitra izany fahalalana izany.', 'fa andriamanitra no niteny hoe: “aoka ny hazavana hamirapiratra avy ao amin’ny haizina.” ary nataony mamirapiratra ao am-ponay amin’ny alalan’ny tarehin’i kristy ny hazavany, ka lasa mahalala an’andriamanitra izahay, ary be voninahitra izany fahalalana izany.'),
  ('6ab25cb473e52c42b6e2ba24', '2026-09-22T10:47:16.686Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:16.686Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 4, 12, 'Miasa ao aminay àry ny fahafatesana, fa miasa ao aminareo kosa ny fiainana.', 'miasa ao aminay àry ny fahafatesana, fa miasa ao aminareo kosa ny fiainana.'),
  ('6ab25cb473e52c42b6e2ba1f', '2026-09-22T10:47:16.686Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:16.686Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 4, 7, 'Manana an’izany harena izany ao anaty vilany tany anefa izahay, mba ho hita hoe nahazo hery mihoatra noho ny an’ny olombelona izahay, dia hery avy amin’Andriamanitra, fa tsy avy aminay.', 'manana an’izany harena izany ao anaty vilany tany anefa izahay, mba ho hita hoe nahazo hery mihoatra noho ny an’ny olombelona izahay, dia hery avy amin’andriamanitra, fa tsy avy aminay.'),
  ('6ab25cb473e52c42b6e2ba1c', '2026-09-22T10:47:16.686Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:16.686Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 4, 4, 'Nohajambain’ny andriamanitr’izao tontolo izao ny sain’ireny tsy mpino ireny, mba tsy hamirapiratra amin’izy ireny ny fahazavan’ny vaovao tsara be voninahitra, dia ilay vaovao tsara momba an’i Kristy, izay endrik’Andriamanitra.', 'nohajambain’ny andriamanitr’izao tontolo izao ny sain’ireny tsy mpino ireny, mba tsy hamirapiratra amin’izy ireny ny fahazavan’ny vaovao tsara be voninahitra, dia ilay vaovao tsara momba an’i kristy, izay endrik’andriamanitra.'),
  ('6ab25cb473e52c42b6e2ba28', '2026-09-22T10:47:16.686Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:16.686Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 4, 16, 'Tsy kivy àry isika, fa na mihaosa aza isika etỳ ivelany, dia azo antoka fa havaozina isan’andro kosa ny ao anatintsika ao.', 'tsy kivy àry isika, fa na mihaosa aza isika etỳ ivelany, dia azo antoka fa havaozina isan’andro kosa ny ao anatintsika ao.'),
  ('6ab25cb473e52c42b6e2ba26', '2026-09-22T10:47:16.686Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:16.686Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 4, 14, 'Fantatray mantsy fa Ilay nanangana an’i Jesosy dia hanangana anay koa mba hiaraka amin’i Jesosy, ary hampiseho anay eo anatrehany miaraka aminareo.', 'fantatray mantsy fa ilay nanangana an’i jesosy dia hanangana anay koa mba hiaraka amin’i jesosy, ary hampiseho anay eo anatrehany miaraka aminareo.'),
  ('6ab25cb473e52c42b6e2ba23', '2026-09-22T10:47:16.686Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:16.686Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 4, 11, 'Fa velona izahay nefa tandindomin-doza foana ny ainay noho izahay manara-dia an’i Jesosy. Amin’izay dia ho hita hoe hoatran’izay niainan’i Jesosy koa ny zavatra iainanay.', 'fa velona izahay nefa tandindomin-doza foana ny ainay noho izahay manara-dia an’i jesosy. amin’izay dia ho hita hoe hoatran’izay niainan’i jesosy koa ny zavatra iainanay.'),
  ('6ab25cb473e52c42b6e2ba22', '2026-09-22T10:47:16.686Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:16.686Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 4, 10, 'Miaritra ny mafy foana izahay ka atahorana hatramin’ny ainay, hoatran’ny nanjo an’i Jesosy. Amin’izay dia ho hita hoe hoatran’izay niainan’i Jesosy koa ny zavatra iainanay.', 'miaritra ny mafy foana izahay ka atahorana hatramin’ny ainay, hoatran’ny nanjo an’i jesosy. amin’izay dia ho hita hoe hoatran’izay niainan’i jesosy koa ny zavatra iainanay.'),
  ('6ab25cb473e52c42b6e2ba1d', '2026-09-22T10:47:16.686Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:16.686Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 4, 5, 'Tsy mitory momba anay mantsy izahay, fa mitory momba an’i Jesosy Kristy hoe izy no Tompo. Lazainay koa hoe mpanomponareo izahay, noho ny amin’i Jesosy.', 'tsy mitory momba anay mantsy izahay, fa mitory momba an’i jesosy kristy hoe izy no tompo. lazainay koa hoe mpanomponareo izahay, noho ny amin’i jesosy.'),
  ('6ab25cb473e52c42b6e2ba1a', '2026-09-22T10:47:16.686Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:16.686Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 4, 2, 'Fa nolavinay ny zavatra mahamenatra sy afenimpenina, ka tsy mamitaka izahay na manatsatso ny tenin’Andriamanitra. Mampiseho miharihary ny fahamarinana kosa izahay, ka ohatra tsara ho an’ny olona rehetra, eo imason’Andriamanitra.', 'fa nolavinay ny zavatra mahamenatra sy afenimpenina, ka tsy mamitaka izahay na manatsatso ny tenin’andriamanitra. mampiseho miharihary ny fahamarinana kosa izahay, ka ohatra tsara ho an’ny olona rehetra, eo imason’andriamanitra.'),
  ('6ab25cb473e52c42b6e2ba29', '2026-09-22T10:47:16.686Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:16.686Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 4, 17, 'Fa na vetivety sy maivana aza ny fahoriana iaretantsika, dia mitondra voninahitra ho antsika izany, dia voninahitra lehibe lavitra sy mandrakizay.', 'fa na vetivety sy maivana aza ny fahoriana iaretantsika, dia mitondra voninahitra ho antsika izany, dia voninahitra lehibe lavitra sy mandrakizay.'),
  ('6ab25cb473e52c42b6e2ba25', '2026-09-22T10:47:16.686Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:16.686Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 4, 13, 'Koa satria izahay manana an’ilay finoana mitovy amin’ilay voasoratra hoe: “Nino aho, ka niteny”, dia mino koa izahay ka miteny.', 'koa satria izahay manana an’ilay finoana mitovy amin’ilay voasoratra hoe: “nino aho, ka niteny”, dia mino koa izahay ka miteny.'),
  ('6ab25cb473e52c42b6e2ba1b', '2026-09-22T10:47:16.686Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:16.686Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 4, 3, 'Raha tsy mazava ny vaovao tsara torinay, toy ny hoe misy lamba manarona, dia amin’izay ho ringana izany no tsy mazava.', 'raha tsy mazava ny vaovao tsara torinay, toy ny hoe misy lamba manarona, dia amin’izay ho ringana izany no tsy mazava.'),
  ('6ab25cb591e932539471b1c2', '2026-09-22T10:47:17.153Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:17.153Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 5, 2, 'Mitaraindraina tokoa mantsy isika ato amin’ity trano ity, ary maniry mafy hahazo an’ilay trano avy any an-danitra, izay hanaovantsika hoatran’ny akanjo,', 'mitaraindraina tokoa mantsy isika ato amin’ity trano ity, ary maniry mafy hahazo an’ilay trano avy any an-danitra, izay hanaovantsika hoatran’ny akanjo,'),
  ('6ab25cb591e932539471b1c1', '2026-09-22T10:47:17.153Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:17.153Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 5, 1, 'Fa fantatsika fa raha horavana ny tranontsika eto an-tany, izany hoe ity vatana toy ny tranolay ity, dia homen’Andriamanitra trano tsy nataon-tanana sady maharitra mandrakizay any an-danitra isika.', 'fa fantatsika fa raha horavana ny tranontsika eto an-tany, izany hoe ity vatana toy ny tranolay ity, dia homen’andriamanitra trano tsy nataon-tanana sady maharitra mandrakizay any an-danitra isika.'),
  ('6ab25cb591e932539471b1c8', '2026-09-22T10:47:17.154Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:17.154Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 5, 8, 'Be herim-po anefa isika, ary aleontsika tsy ao amin’ity vatana ity fa hiara-mipetraka amin’ny Tompo.', 'be herim-po anefa isika, ary aleontsika tsy ao amin’ity vatana ity fa hiara-mipetraka amin’ny tompo.'),
  ('6ab25cb591e932539471b1c7', '2026-09-22T10:47:17.154Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:17.154Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 5, 7, 'Fa finoana no andehanantsika, fa tsy ny hitan’ny maso.', 'fa finoana no andehanantsika, fa tsy ny hitan’ny maso.'),
  ('6ab25cb591e932539471b1d4', '2026-09-22T10:47:17.154Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:17.154Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 5, 20, 'Ambasadaoro solon’i Kristy àry izahay, ka toy ny hoe miangavy amin’ny alalanay Andriamanitra. Solon’i Kristy izahay ka miangavy hoe: “Mba mihavàna amin’Andriamanitra re ianareo e!”', 'ambasadaoro solon’i kristy àry izahay, ka toy ny hoe miangavy amin’ny alalanay andriamanitra. solon’i kristy izahay ka miangavy hoe: “mba mihavàna amin’andriamanitra re ianareo e!”'),
  ('6ab25cb591e932539471b1d1', '2026-09-22T10:47:17.154Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:17.154Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 5, 17, 'Raha misy olona tafaray amin’i Kristy àry, dia zavaboary vaovao izy. Efa lasa ny zavatra taloha, ary ireo misy zava-baovao.', 'raha misy olona tafaray amin’i kristy àry, dia zavaboary vaovao izy. efa lasa ny zavatra taloha, ary ireo misy zava-baovao.'),
  ('6ab25cb591e932539471b1cc', '2026-09-22T10:47:17.154Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:17.154Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 5, 12, 'Tsy hoe midera tena aminareo indray izahay, fa mampirisika anareo kosa hirehareha ny aminay. Amin’izay ianareo dia ho afaka hamaly an’ireo mirehareha ny amin’izay miseho etỳ ivelany fa tsy ny amin’izay ao am-po.', 'tsy hoe midera tena aminareo indray izahay, fa mampirisika anareo kosa hirehareha ny aminay. amin’izay ianareo dia ho afaka hamaly an’ireo mirehareha ny amin’izay miseho etỳ ivelany fa tsy ny amin’izay ao am-po.'),
  ('6ab25cb591e932539471b1c9', '2026-09-22T10:47:17.154Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:17.154Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 5, 9, 'Ataontsika tanjona àry ny hahazo sitraka aminy, na miara-mipetraka aminy isika na tsy any aminy.', 'ataontsika tanjona àry ny hahazo sitraka aminy, na miara-mipetraka aminy isika na tsy any aminy.'),
  ('6ab25cb591e932539471b1cd', '2026-09-22T10:47:17.154Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:17.154Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 5, 13, 'Raha adala mantsy izahay dia ho an’Andriamanitra, ary raha misaina tsara izahay dia ho anareo.', 'raha adala mantsy izahay dia ho an’andriamanitra, ary raha misaina tsara izahay dia ho anareo.'),
  ('6ab25cb591e932539471b1d3', '2026-09-22T10:47:17.154Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:17.154Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 5, 19, 'dia ny hanambara fa nampiasain’Andriamanitra i Kristy mba hahatonga an’izao tontolo izao hihavana aminy, ka nodiany tsy hita ny fahadisoan’izy ireo. Ary nankininy taminay ny fitoriana ny hafatra momba ny fampihavanana.', 'dia ny hanambara fa nampiasain’andriamanitra i kristy mba hahatonga an’izao tontolo izao hihavana aminy, ka nodiany tsy hita ny fahadisoan’izy ireo. ary nankininy taminay ny fitoriana ny hafatra momba ny fampihavanana.'),
  ('6ab25cb591e932539471b1d2', '2026-09-22T10:47:17.154Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:17.154Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 5, 18, 'Ny zava-drehetra anefa dia avy amin’Andriamanitra, izay nampihavana anay taminy tamin’ny alalan’i Kristy. Ary nomeny fanompoana fampihavanana izahay,', 'ny zava-drehetra anefa dia avy amin’andriamanitra, izay nampihavana anay taminy tamin’ny alalan’i kristy. ary nomeny fanompoana fampihavanana izahay,'),
  ('6ab25cb591e932539471b1d0', '2026-09-22T10:47:17.154Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:17.154Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 5, 16, 'Koa tsy mijery olona araka ny fomba fijerin’olombelona intsony izahay manomboka izao. Na dia nijery an’i Kristy araka ny fomba fijerin’olombelona aza izahay taloha, dia tsy hoatr’izany intsony ny fahitanay azy amin’izao.', 'koa tsy mijery olona araka ny fomba fijerin’olombelona intsony izahay manomboka izao. na dia nijery an’i kristy araka ny fomba fijerin’olombelona aza izahay taloha, dia tsy hoatr’izany intsony ny fahitanay azy amin’izao.'),
  ('6ab25cb591e932539471b1cf', '2026-09-22T10:47:17.154Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:17.154Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 5, 15, 'Ary maty ho an’ny rehetra izy, mba tsy ho velona ho an’ny tenany intsony izay velona, fa ho an’ilay efa maty ho azy ireo sady efa natsangana.', 'ary maty ho an’ny rehetra izy, mba tsy ho velona ho an’ny tenany intsony izay velona, fa ho an’ilay efa maty ho azy ireo sady efa natsangana.'),
  ('6ab25cb591e932539471b1c6', '2026-09-22T10:47:17.154Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:17.154Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 5, 6, 'Be herim-po foana àry isika ary fantatsika fa raha mbola monina ato amin’ity vatana ity isika, dia mbola tsy any amin’ny Tompo.', 'be herim-po foana àry isika ary fantatsika fa raha mbola monina ato amin’ity vatana ity isika, dia mbola tsy any amin’ny tompo.');
INSERT INTO "bible_verses" ("id", "created_date", "updated_date", "created_by_id", "created_by", "translation", "book", "bookOrder", "chapter", "verse", "text", "normalizedText") VALUES
  ('6ab25cb591e932539471b1d5', '2026-09-22T10:47:17.154Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:17.154Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 5, 21, 'Ilay tsy mba nanota no nataony fanatitra noho ny ota hamonjena anay, mba ho lasa olo-marina eo anatrehan’Andriamanitra izahay, amin’ny alalany.', 'ilay tsy mba nanota no nataony fanatitra noho ny ota hamonjena anay, mba ho lasa olo-marina eo anatrehan’andriamanitra izahay, amin’ny alalany.'),
  ('6ab25cb591e932539471b1ce', '2026-09-22T10:47:17.154Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:17.154Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 5, 14, 'Fa ny fitiavan’i Kristy no manery anay, satria lasa fantatray hoe olona iray no maty ho an’ny rehetra. Efa maty mantsy izy rehetra, raha ny marina.', 'fa ny fitiavan’i kristy no manery anay, satria lasa fantatray hoe olona iray no maty ho an’ny rehetra. efa maty mantsy izy rehetra, raha ny marina.'),
  ('6ab25cb591e932539471b1c3', '2026-09-22T10:47:17.154Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:17.154Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 5, 3, 'mba tsy ho hita hoe mitanjaka isika rehefa tena manao an’ilay izy.', 'mba tsy ho hita hoe mitanjaka isika rehefa tena manao an’ilay izy.'),
  ('6ab25cb591e932539471b1cb', '2026-09-22T10:47:17.154Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:17.154Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 5, 11, 'Koa satria fantatray hoe tokony hatahotra ny Tompo izahay, dia resenay lahatra foana ny olona mba hino an’izay ampianarinay. Mahafantatra tsara anay anefa Andriamanitra, ary antenaiko fa nanampy anareo hahafantatra tsara anay koa ny feon’ny fieritreretanareo.', 'koa satria fantatray hoe tokony hatahotra ny tompo izahay, dia resenay lahatra foana ny olona mba hino an’izay ampianarinay. mahafantatra tsara anay anefa andriamanitra, ary antenaiko fa nanampy anareo hahafantatra tsara anay koa ny feon’ny fieritreretanareo.'),
  ('6ab25cb591e932539471b1ca', '2026-09-22T10:47:17.154Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:17.154Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 5, 10, 'Tsy maintsy hiseho eo anatrehan’ny toeram-pitsaran’i Kristy mantsy isika rehetra, mba hovaliana arakaraka izay nataony ny tsirairay, na tsara na ratsy ny nataony tamin’izy mbola tao amin’ilay vatana.', 'tsy maintsy hiseho eo anatrehan’ny toeram-pitsaran’i kristy mantsy isika rehetra, mba hovaliana arakaraka izay nataony ny tsirairay, na tsara na ratsy ny nataony tamin’izy mbola tao amin’ilay vatana.'),
  ('6ab25cb591e932539471b1c5', '2026-09-22T10:47:17.154Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:17.154Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 5, 5, 'Ary ilay nanomana antsika ho amin’izany dia Andriamanitra, izay nanome antsika ny fanahiny ho antoka ny amin’izay ho avy.', 'ary ilay nanomana antsika ho amin’izany dia andriamanitra, izay nanome antsika ny fanahiny ho antoka ny amin’izay ho avy.'),
  ('6ab25cb591e932539471b1c4', '2026-09-22T10:47:17.154Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:17.154Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 5, 4, 'Mitaraindraina tokoa isika ato amin’ity tranolay ity sady vesaran’ny tebiteby. Tsy hoe te hanala azy ity anefa isika, fa te hitafy an’ilay iray kosa. Amin’izay dia hatelin’ny fiainana ilay mety maty.', 'mitaraindraina tokoa isika ato amin’ity tranolay ity sady vesaran’ny tebiteby. tsy hoe te hanala azy ity anefa isika, fa te hitafy an’ilay iray kosa. amin’izay dia hatelin’ny fiainana ilay mety maty.'),
  ('6ab25cb50926551ecd3fef51', '2026-09-22T10:47:17.601Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:17.601Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 6, 13, 'Ho valin’izany àry, dia mba sokafy midanadana koa ny fonareo. Toy ny hoe miresaka amin’ny zanako aho miresaka aminareo.', 'ho valin’izany àry, dia mba sokafy midanadana koa ny fonareo. toy ny hoe miresaka amin’ny zanako aho miresaka aminareo.'),
  ('6ab25cb50926551ecd3fef4e', '2026-09-22T10:47:17.601Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:17.601Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 6, 10, 'toy ny malahelo nefa faly foana, toy ny mahantra nefa mampanan-karena olona maro, ary toy ny tsy manana na inona na inona nefa manana ny zava-drehetra.', 'toy ny malahelo nefa faly foana, toy ny mahantra nefa mampanan-karena olona maro, ary toy ny tsy manana na inona na inona nefa manana ny zava-drehetra.'),
  ('6ab25cb50926551ecd3fef4d', '2026-09-22T10:47:17.601Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:17.601Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 6, 9, 'toy ny tsy fantatra nefa fantatra tsara, toy ny hoe ho faty nefa hay velona ihany, toy ny voasazy nefa tsy vonoina ho faty,', 'toy ny tsy fantatra nefa fantatra tsara, toy ny hoe ho faty nefa hay velona ihany, toy ny voasazy nefa tsy vonoina ho faty,'),
  ('6ab25cb50926551ecd3fef52', '2026-09-22T10:47:17.601Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:17.601Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 6, 14, 'Aza manaiky hiray zioga amin’ny tsy mpino. Fa inona no ifandraisan’ny fahamarinana sy ny fandikan-dalàna? Ary inona no iombonan’ny mazava sy ny maizina?', 'aza manaiky hiray zioga amin’ny tsy mpino. fa inona no ifandraisan’ny fahamarinana sy ny fandikan-dalàna? ary inona no iombonan’ny mazava sy ny maizina?'),
  ('6ab25cb50926551ecd3fef4c', '2026-09-22T10:47:17.601Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:17.601Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 6, 8, 'omem-boninahitra sy alam-baraka, ary haratsina sy deraina. Heverina ho toy ny mpamitaka izahay nefa milaza ny marina,', 'omem-boninahitra sy alam-baraka, ary haratsina sy deraina. heverina ho toy ny mpamitaka izahay nefa milaza ny marina,'),
  ('6ab25cb50926551ecd3fef4b', '2026-09-22T10:47:17.601Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:17.601Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 6, 7, 'milaza ny marina, miantehitra amin’ny herin’Andriamanitra, mitazona an’ireo fitaovam-piadian’ny fahamarinana amin’ny tanana havia sy havanana,', 'milaza ny marina, miantehitra amin’ny herin’andriamanitra, mitazona an’ireo fitaovam-piadian’ny fahamarinana amin’ny tanana havia sy havanana,'),
  ('6ab25cb50926551ecd3fef45', '2026-09-22T10:47:17.601Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:17.601Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 6, 1, 'Miara-miasa aminy izahay, ka mampirisika anareo koa mba tsy hoe hanaiky ny hatsaram-panahy miavaka asehon’Andriamanitra nefa hanadino ny zava-kendren’izany.', 'miara-miasa aminy izahay, ka mampirisika anareo koa mba tsy hoe hanaiky ny hatsaram-panahy miavaka asehon’andriamanitra nefa hanadino ny zava-kendren’izany.'),
  ('6ab25cb50926551ecd3fef4f', '2026-09-22T10:47:17.601Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:17.601Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 6, 11, 'Miresaka amim-pahatsorana aminareo izahay, ry Korintianina, ary sokafanay midanadana ny fonay.', 'miresaka amim-pahatsorana aminareo izahay, ry korintianina, ary sokafanay midanadana ny fonay.'),
  ('6ab25cb50926551ecd3fef47', '2026-09-22T10:47:17.601Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:17.601Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 6, 3, 'Tsy manao izay hahatafintohina olona mihitsy izahay, mba tsy hisy hanakiana ny fanompoanay.', 'tsy manao izay hahatafintohina olona mihitsy izahay, mba tsy hisy hanakiana ny fanompoanay.'),
  ('6ab25cb50926551ecd3fef55', '2026-09-22T10:47:17.601Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:17.601Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 6, 17, '“‘Koa mivoaha avy ao aminy ianareo, ary misaraha aminy’, hoy i Jehovah, ‘ary aza mikasika intsony an’izay maloto’”, “‘dia handray anareo aho.’”', '“‘koa mivoaha avy ao aminy ianareo, ary misaraha aminy’, hoy i jehovah, ‘ary aza mikasika intsony an’izay maloto’”, “‘dia handray anareo aho.’”'),
  ('6ab25cb50926551ecd3fef49', '2026-09-22T10:47:17.601Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:17.601Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 6, 5, 'imbetsaka nokapohina sy natao am-ponja ary norotahan’ny olona, niasa mafy, tsy natory imbetsaka, ary nisy fotoana tsy nihinan-kanina.', 'imbetsaka nokapohina sy natao am-ponja ary norotahan’ny olona, niasa mafy, tsy natory imbetsaka, ary nisy fotoana tsy nihinan-kanina.'),
  ('6ab25cb50926551ecd3fef46', '2026-09-22T10:47:17.601Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:17.601Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 6, 2, 'Fa hoy izy: “Tamin’ny fotoana fanehoana fankasitrahana aho no nihaino anao, ary tamin’ny andro famonjena aho no nanampy anao.” Izao indrindra no fotoana fanehoana fankasitrahana! Izao no andro famonjena!', 'fa hoy izy: “tamin’ny fotoana fanehoana fankasitrahana aho no nihaino anao, ary tamin’ny andro famonjena aho no nanampy anao.” izao indrindra no fotoana fanehoana fankasitrahana! izao no andro famonjena!'),
  ('6ab25cb50926551ecd3fef48', '2026-09-22T10:47:17.601Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:17.601Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 6, 4, 'Amin’ny zava-drehetra anefa dia asehonay hoe mpanompon’Andriamanitra izahay, satria niaritra fitsapana be dia be, niaritra fahoriana sy tsy fisiana ary zava-tsarotra,', 'amin’ny zava-drehetra anefa dia asehonay hoe mpanompon’andriamanitra izahay, satria niaritra fitsapana be dia be, niaritra fahoriana sy tsy fisiana ary zava-tsarotra,'),
  ('6ab25cb50926551ecd3fef54', '2026-09-22T10:47:17.601Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:17.601Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 6, 16, 'Ary inona no ifandraisan’ny tempolin’Andriamanitra sy ny sampy? Tempolin’ilay Andriamanitra velona mantsy isika, araka ny voalazan’Andriamanitra hoe: “Honina eo amin’izy ireo aho sady ho eo aminy, dia ho Andriamaniny aho, ary izy ireo ho vahoakako.”', 'ary inona no ifandraisan’ny tempolin’andriamanitra sy ny sampy? tempolin’ilay andriamanitra velona mantsy isika, araka ny voalazan’andriamanitra hoe: “honina eo amin’izy ireo aho sady ho eo aminy, dia ho andriamaniny aho, ary izy ireo ho vahoakako.”'),
  ('6ab25cb50926551ecd3fef56', '2026-09-22T10:47:17.601Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:17.601Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 6, 18, '“‘Ary izaho ho Rainareo, ary ianareo ho zanako lahy sy zanako vavy’, hoy i Jehovah, ilay Mahery Indrindra.”', '“‘ary izaho ho rainareo, ary ianareo ho zanako lahy sy zanako vavy’, hoy i jehovah, ilay mahery indrindra.”'),
  ('6ab25cb50926551ecd3fef53', '2026-09-22T10:47:17.601Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:17.601Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 6, 15, 'Inona no ifanarahan’i Kristy sy Beliala? Inona no zavatra iombonan’ny mino amin’ny tsy mpino?', 'inona no ifanarahan’i kristy sy beliala? inona no zavatra iombonan’ny mino amin’ny tsy mpino?'),
  ('6ab25cb50926551ecd3fef50', '2026-09-22T10:47:17.601Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:17.601Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 6, 12, 'Tsy asianay fetra ny fitiavanay anareo, fa ianareo kosa manisy fetra ny fitiavanareo anay.', 'tsy asianay fetra ny fitiavanay anareo, fa ianareo kosa manisy fetra ny fitiavanareo anay.'),
  ('6ab25cb50926551ecd3fef4a', '2026-09-22T10:47:17.601Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:17.601Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 6, 6, 'Madio koa izahay, mampihatra an’izay fahalalana azonay, manam-paharetana, tsara fanahy, manaiky hotarihin’ny fanahy masina, maneho fitiavana tsy misy fihatsarambelatsihy,', 'madio koa izahay, mampihatra an’izay fahalalana azonay, manam-paharetana, tsara fanahy, manaiky hotarihin’ny fanahy masina, maneho fitiavana tsy misy fihatsarambelatsihy,'),
  ('6ab25cb6cb13d79a39810ee2', '2026-09-22T10:47:18.834Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:18.834Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 7, 5, 'Tsy mba nilamindamina mihitsy izahay, raha ny marina, rehefa tonga teto Makedonia, fa mbola nampahorina tamin’ny lafiny rehetra foana: Nisy ady teny ivelany ary tahotra tao anatiny.', 'tsy mba nilamindamina mihitsy izahay, raha ny marina, rehefa tonga teto makedonia, fa mbola nampahorina tamin’ny lafiny rehetra foana: nisy ady teny ivelany ary tahotra tao anatiny.'),
  ('6ab25cb6cb13d79a39810ee0', '2026-09-22T10:47:18.834Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:18.834Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 7, 3, 'Tsy ny hanamelohana anareo no ilazako an’izany. Efa nilaza aho mantsy teo aloha hoe ato am-ponay foana ianareo, na maty izahay na velona.', 'tsy ny hanamelohana anareo no ilazako an’izany. efa nilaza aho mantsy teo aloha hoe ato am-ponay foana ianareo, na maty izahay na velona.'),
  ('6ab25cb6cb13d79a39810ede', '2026-09-22T10:47:18.834Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:18.834Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 7, 1, 'Koa satria nahazo an’izany fampanantenana izany isika, ry malala, dia aoka isika hanadio ny tenantsika ho afaka amin’izay rehetra mandoto ny vatana sy ny saina, ka hiezaka mafy ho masina tanteraka sady hatahotra an’Andriamanitra.', 'koa satria nahazo an’izany fampanantenana izany isika, ry malala, dia aoka isika hanadio ny tenantsika ho afaka amin’izay rehetra mandoto ny vatana sy ny saina, ka hiezaka mafy ho masina tanteraka sady hatahotra an’andriamanitra.'),
  ('6ab25cb6cb13d79a39810ee1', '2026-09-22T10:47:18.834Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:18.834Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 7, 4, 'Tena miresaka aminareo amim-pahatsorana aho. Ary tena reharehako ianareo. Nahazo fampiononana lehibe aho, ary faly be na dia eo aza ny fahoriana rehetra manjo anay.', 'tena miresaka aminareo amim-pahatsorana aho. ary tena reharehako ianareo. nahazo fampiononana lehibe aho, ary faly be na dia eo aza ny fahoriana rehetra manjo anay.'),
  ('6ab25cb6cb13d79a39810edf', '2026-09-22T10:47:18.834Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:18.834Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 7, 2, 'Asio toerana ho anay ao am-ponareo. Tsy nanisy ratsy olona izahay, na nahatonga olona ho ratsy toetra, na nanararaotra olona.', 'asio toerana ho anay ao am-ponareo. tsy nanisy ratsy olona izahay, na nahatonga olona ho ratsy toetra, na nanararaotra olona.'),
  ('6ab25cb6cb13d79a39810eea', '2026-09-22T10:47:18.835Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:18.835Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 7, 13, 'Izany no nampionona anay. Ankoatra ny fampiononana azonay anefa, dia vao mainka faly be izahay satria faly i Titosy. Namelombelona azy mantsy ianareo rehetra.', 'izany no nampionona anay. ankoatra ny fampiononana azonay anefa, dia vao mainka faly be izahay satria faly i titosy. namelombelona azy mantsy ianareo rehetra.'),
  ('6ab25cb6cb13d79a39810ee6', '2026-09-22T10:47:18.835Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:18.835Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 7, 9, 'dia faly aho izao, satria tsy hoe nahatonga anareo halahelo fotsiny ilay izy, fa izany alahelo izany koa no nahatonga anareo hibebaka. Fa lasa nalahelo araka ny sitrapon’Andriamanitra ianareo, ka tsy nisy vokany ratsy taminareo ny zavatra nolazainay.', 'dia faly aho izao, satria tsy hoe nahatonga anareo halahelo fotsiny ilay izy, fa izany alahelo izany koa no nahatonga anareo hibebaka. fa lasa nalahelo araka ny sitrapon’andriamanitra ianareo, ka tsy nisy vokany ratsy taminareo ny zavatra nolazainay.'),
  ('6ab25cb6cb13d79a39810ee9', '2026-09-22T10:47:18.835Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:18.835Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 7, 12, 'Na dia nanoratra ho anareo aza aho, dia tsy ho an’ilay nanao ratsy na ho an’ilay nasian-dratsy no nanoratako, fa mba hiharihary kosa eo aminareo sy eo imason’Andriamanitra hoe mazoto mihaino anay ianareo.', 'na dia nanoratra ho anareo aza aho, dia tsy ho an’ilay nanao ratsy na ho an’ilay nasian-dratsy no nanoratako, fa mba hiharihary kosa eo aminareo sy eo imason’andriamanitra hoe mazoto mihaino anay ianareo.'),
  ('6ab25cb6cb13d79a39810eec', '2026-09-22T10:47:18.835Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:18.835Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 7, 15, 'Vao mainka koa izy miraiki-po aminareo rehefa mahatsiaro hoe mankatò daholo ianareo, ary nandray tsara sy tena nanaja azy.', 'vao mainka koa izy miraiki-po aminareo rehefa mahatsiaro hoe mankatò daholo ianareo, ary nandray tsara sy tena nanaja azy.'),
  ('6ab25cb6cb13d79a39810eed', '2026-09-22T10:47:18.835Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:18.835Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 7, 16, 'Ary faly aho fa afaka matoky anareo amin’ny lafiny rehetra.', 'ary faly aho fa afaka matoky anareo amin’ny lafiny rehetra.'),
  ('6ab25cb6cb13d79a39810eeb', '2026-09-22T10:47:18.835Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:18.835Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 7, 14, 'Fa tsy nisy nahamenatra ahy raha nirehareha momba anareo taminy aho. Marina ny zava-drehetra nolazainay taminareo, ary marina hoatr’izany koa ny zavatra nireharehanay tamin’i Titosy.', 'fa tsy nisy nahamenatra ahy raha nirehareha momba anareo taminy aho. marina ny zava-drehetra nolazainay taminareo, ary marina hoatr’izany koa ny zavatra nireharehanay tamin’i titosy.'),
  ('6ab25cb6cb13d79a39810ee5', '2026-09-22T10:47:18.835Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:18.835Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 7, 8, 'Fa tsy manenina aho na dia nampalahelo anareo aza ny taratasy nosoratako. Na dia nanenina aza aho tamin’ny voalohany,—rehefa hitako fa nampalahelo anareo ilay taratasy, na dia vetivety ihany aza—', 'fa tsy manenina aho na dia nampalahelo anareo aza ny taratasy nosoratako. na dia nanenina aza aho tamin’ny voalohany,—rehefa hitako fa nampalahelo anareo ilay taratasy, na dia vetivety ihany aza—'),
  ('6ab25cb6cb13d79a39810ee7', '2026-09-22T10:47:18.835Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:18.835Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 7, 10, 'Ny alahelo araka ny sitrapon’Andriamanitra mantsy mahatonga ny olona hibebaka sy ho voavonjy, ary tsy anenenana izany. Ny alahelon’izao tontolo izao kosa mahatonga fahafatesana.', 'ny alahelo araka ny sitrapon’andriamanitra mantsy mahatonga ny olona hibebaka sy ho voavonjy, ary tsy anenenana izany. ny alahelon’izao tontolo izao kosa mahatonga fahafatesana.'),
  ('6ab25cb6cb13d79a39810ee4', '2026-09-22T10:47:18.835Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:18.835Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 7, 7, 'Nahazo fampiononana izahay, tsy hoe tamin’izy teo ihany, fa rehefa nahazo fampiononana koa izy noho ianareo. Notantarainy taminay hoe te hahita mafy ahy ianareo, sady malahelo be, ary tena mitady izay hahasoa ahy, ka vao mainka faly aho.', 'nahazo fampiononana izahay, tsy hoe tamin’izy teo ihany, fa rehefa nahazo fampiononana koa izy noho ianareo. notantarainy taminay hoe te hahita mafy ahy ianareo, sady malahelo be, ary tena mitady izay hahasoa ahy, ka vao mainka faly aho.'),
  ('6ab25cb6cb13d79a39810ee8', '2026-09-22T10:47:18.835Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:18.835Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 7, 11, 'Tena niezaka be ianareo rehefa lasa nalahelo araka ny sitrapon’Andriamanitra, ka nasehonareo hoe afa-tsiny ianareo, sady tezitra noho ilay tsy nety natao, natahotra, te hiova mafy, nafana fo, ary nanitsy an’ilay zavatra tsy nety. Nasehonareo tamin’ny lafiny rehetra fa madio tamin’iny raharaha iny ianareo.', 'tena niezaka be ianareo rehefa lasa nalahelo araka ny sitrapon’andriamanitra, ka nasehonareo hoe afa-tsiny ianareo, sady tezitra noho ilay tsy nety natao, natahotra, te hiova mafy, nafana fo, ary nanitsy an’ilay zavatra tsy nety. nasehonareo tamin’ny lafiny rehetra fa madio tamin’iny raharaha iny ianareo.'),
  ('6ab25cb6cb13d79a39810ee3', '2026-09-22T10:47:18.835Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:18.835Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 7, 6, 'Nampionona anay anefa Andriamanitra, izay mampionona an’ireo kivy, rehefa nitsidika anay i Titosy.', 'nampionona anay anefa andriamanitra, izay mampionona an’ireo kivy, rehefa nitsidika anay i titosy.'),
  ('6ab25cb79273e1b0cfb3ae02', '2026-09-22T10:47:19.682Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:19.682Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 8, 10, 'Ary izao ny hevitro momba an’izany: Mahasoa anareo izany, satria efa herintaona lasa izay ianareo no nanomboka nanangona an’ilay fanomezana, sady tena naniry mafy hanao an’izany.', 'ary izao ny hevitro momba an’izany: mahasoa anareo izany, satria efa herintaona lasa izay ianareo no nanomboka nanangona an’ilay fanomezana, sady tena naniry mafy hanao an’izany.'),
  ('6ab25cb79273e1b0cfb3adfe', '2026-09-22T10:47:19.682Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:19.682Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 8, 6, 'Koa nampirisika an’i Titosy izahay mba hamita ny fanangonana an’izany fanomezana nomenareo tamim-pitiavana izany, satria izy no efa nanomboka an’izany teo aminareo.', 'koa nampirisika an’i titosy izahay mba hamita ny fanangonana an’izany fanomezana nomenareo tamim-pitiavana izany, satria izy no efa nanomboka an’izany teo aminareo.'),
  ('6ab25cb79273e1b0cfb3ae0f', '2026-09-22T10:47:19.682Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:19.682Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 8, 23, 'Raha misy mampisalasala anefa momba an’i Titosy, dia fantaro fa namako izy sady mpiara-miasa amiko mba hahasoa anareo. Ary raha misy mampisalasala momba an’ireo rahalahinay, dia fantaro fa apostolin’ny fiangonana izy ireo sady mitondra voninahitra ho an’i Kristy.', 'raha misy mampisalasala anefa momba an’i titosy, dia fantaro fa namako izy sady mpiara-miasa amiko mba hahasoa anareo. ary raha misy mampisalasala momba an’ireo rahalahinay, dia fantaro fa apostolin’ny fiangonana izy ireo sady mitondra voninahitra ho an’i kristy.'),
  ('6ab25cb79273e1b0cfb3ae0d', '2026-09-22T10:47:19.682Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:19.682Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 8, 21, 'Fa ‘manao ny marina amin’ny zava-drehetra izahay, tsy eo imason’i Jehovah ihany, fa eo imason’ny olona koa.’', 'fa ‘manao ny marina amin’ny zava-drehetra izahay, tsy eo imason’i jehovah ihany, fa eo imason’ny olona koa.’'),
  ('6ab25cb79273e1b0cfb3ae0c', '2026-09-22T10:47:19.682Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:19.682Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 8, 20, 'Amin’izay dia tsy hisy olona hanome tsiny anay ny amin’ny fomba hizaranay an’io fanomezana be dia be io.', 'amin’izay dia tsy hisy olona hanome tsiny anay ny amin’ny fomba hizaranay an’io fanomezana be dia be io.'),
  ('6ab25cb79273e1b0cfb3adfb', '2026-09-22T10:47:19.682Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:19.682Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 8, 3, 'Fa araka izay zakany no nataony, ary mihoatra noho izay zakany mihitsy aza. Vavolombelona aho fa tena marina izany.', 'fa araka izay zakany no nataony, ary mihoatra noho izay zakany mihitsy aza. vavolombelona aho fa tena marina izany.'),
  ('6ab25cb79273e1b0cfb3adfa', '2026-09-22T10:47:19.682Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:19.682Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 8, 2, 'Niaritra fitsapana faran’izay mafy tao anatin’ny fahoriana izy ireo. Vao mainka nalala-tanana be anefa izy ireo satria falifaly foana na dia nahantra be aza.', 'niaritra fitsapana faran’izay mafy tao anatin’ny fahoriana izy ireo. vao mainka nalala-tanana be anefa izy ireo satria falifaly foana na dia nahantra be aza.'),
  ('6ab25cb79273e1b0cfb3ae0b', '2026-09-22T10:47:19.682Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:19.682Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 8, 19, 'Ary tsy izany ihany, fa efa notendren’ireo fiangonana koa io rahalahy io mba hiaraka aminay hizara an’ilay fanomezana nomenareo tamim-pitiavana, ho voninahitry ny Tompo sy ho porofo hoe vonona hanampy izahay.', 'ary tsy izany ihany, fa efa notendren’ireo fiangonana koa io rahalahy io mba hiaraka aminay hizara an’ilay fanomezana nomenareo tamim-pitiavana, ho voninahitry ny tompo sy ho porofo hoe vonona hanampy izahay.'),
  ('6ab25cb79273e1b0cfb3adf9', '2026-09-22T10:47:19.682Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:19.682Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 8, 1, 'Ary tianay hampahafantarina anareo, ry rahalahy, ny momba ny hatsaram-panahy miavaka nasehon’Andriamanitra tamin’ireo fiangonana atỳ Makedonia.', 'ary tianay hampahafantarina anareo, ry rahalahy, ny momba ny hatsaram-panahy miavaka nasehon’andriamanitra tamin’ireo fiangonana atỳ makedonia.'),
  ('6ab25cb79273e1b0cfb3ae08', '2026-09-22T10:47:19.682Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:19.682Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 8, 16, 'Isaorana àry Andriamanitra fa fa nataony izay hahatonga an’i Titosy hazoto hikarakara anareo hoatran’ny ataonay ihany,', 'isaorana àry andriamanitra fa fa nataony izay hahatonga an’i titosy hazoto hikarakara anareo hoatran’ny ataonay ihany,'),
  ('6ab25cb79273e1b0cfb3ae04', '2026-09-22T10:47:19.682Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:19.682Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 8, 12, 'Fa raha vonona hanome ny olona iray, dia tena ankasitrahana izany raha araka izay ananany, fa tsy araka izay tsy ananany.', 'fa raha vonona hanome ny olona iray, dia tena ankasitrahana izany raha araka izay ananany, fa tsy araka izay tsy ananany.'),
  ('6ab25cb79273e1b0cfb3ae10', '2026-09-22T10:47:19.682Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:19.682Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 8, 24, 'Koa porofoy amin’izy ireo hoe tianareo izy ireo, ary asehoy an’ireo fiangonana hoe nahoana ianareo no reharehanay.', 'koa porofoy amin’izy ireo hoe tianareo izy ireo, ary asehoy an’ireo fiangonana hoe nahoana ianareo no reharehanay.'),
  ('6ab25cb79273e1b0cfb3ae0a', '2026-09-22T10:47:19.682Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:19.682Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 8, 18, 'Fa irahinay miaraka aminy koa ilay rahalahy izay deraina eran’ny fiangonana rehetra noho ny zavatra ataony ho an’ny vaovao tsara.', 'fa irahinay miaraka aminy koa ilay rahalahy izay deraina eran’ny fiangonana rehetra noho ny zavatra ataony ho an’ny vaovao tsara.'),
  ('6ab25cb79273e1b0cfb3ae00', '2026-09-22T10:47:19.682Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:19.682Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 8, 8, 'Tsy ny hibaikobaiko anareo anefa no itenenako an’izany, fa ny mba hahitanareo ny fahazotoan’ny hafa sy mba hahitana raha tena avy amin’ny fo ny fitiavanareo.', 'tsy ny hibaikobaiko anareo anefa no itenenako an’izany, fa ny mba hahitanareo ny fahazotoan’ny hafa sy mba hahitana raha tena avy amin’ny fo ny fitiavanareo.'),
  ('6ab25cb79273e1b0cfb3adff', '2026-09-22T10:47:19.682Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:19.682Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 8, 7, 'Toy ny anananareo be dia be amin’ny zava-drehetra anefa, na amin’ny finoana izany, na amin’ny teny, na amin’ny fahalalana, na amin’ny zotom-po rehetra asehonareo, na amin’ny fitiavanay anareo, dia enga anie ianareo hahavita be koa amin’izany fanomezana omenareo amim-pitiavana izany!', 'toy ny anananareo be dia be amin’ny zava-drehetra anefa, na amin’ny finoana izany, na amin’ny teny, na amin’ny fahalalana, na amin’ny zotom-po rehetra asehonareo, na amin’ny fitiavanay anareo, dia enga anie ianareo hahavita be koa amin’izany fanomezana omenareo amim-pitiavana izany!'),
  ('6ab25cb79273e1b0cfb3ae05', '2026-09-22T10:47:19.682Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:19.682Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 8, 13, 'Tsy tiako mantsy raha hoe lasa maivamaivana ny hafa, nefa ianareo lasa mitondra enta-mavesatra.', 'tsy tiako mantsy raha hoe lasa maivamaivana ny hafa, nefa ianareo lasa mitondra enta-mavesatra.'),
  ('6ab25cb79273e1b0cfb3ae03', '2026-09-22T10:47:19.682Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:19.682Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 8, 11, 'Vitao àry izay natombokareo, mba ho hoatran’ny fahavononanareo hanao an’ilay izy koa no hamitanareo azy tsara, araka izay anananareo.', 'vitao àry izay natombokareo, mba ho hoatran’ny fahavononanareo hanao an’ilay izy koa no hamitanareo azy tsara, araka izay anananareo.'),
  ('6ab25cb79273e1b0cfb3ae01', '2026-09-22T10:47:19.682Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:19.682Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 8, 9, 'Fantatrareo mantsy ny hatsaram-panahy miavaka nasehon’i Jesosy Kristy Tompontsika, fa na dia nanan-karena aza izy, dia lasa nahantra ho tombontsoanareo, mba hampanan-karena anareo ny fahantrany.', 'fantatrareo mantsy ny hatsaram-panahy miavaka nasehon’i jesosy kristy tompontsika, fa na dia nanan-karena aza izy, dia lasa nahantra ho tombontsoanareo, mba hampanan-karena anareo ny fahantrany.'),
  ('6ab25cb79273e1b0cfb3adfc', '2026-09-22T10:47:19.682Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:19.682Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 8, 4, 'Izy ireo mihitsy no niangavy mafy anay foana mba havela hanao fanomezana amim-pitiavana, ka handray anjara amin’ny fanompoana ho fanampiana an’ireo olona masina.', 'izy ireo mihitsy no niangavy mafy anay foana mba havela hanao fanomezana amim-pitiavana, ka handray anjara amin’ny fanompoana ho fanampiana an’ireo olona masina.'),
  ('6ab25cb79273e1b0cfb3ae09', '2026-09-22T10:47:19.682Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:19.682Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 8, 17, 'satria nanaiky hanao an’izay nangatahinay izy. Efa mazoto be hanampy rahateo anefa izy, ka an-tsitrapo no andehanany any aminareo.', 'satria nanaiky hanao an’izay nangatahinay izy. efa mazoto be hanampy rahateo anefa izy, ka an-tsitrapo no andehanany any aminareo.'),
  ('6ab25cb79273e1b0cfb3ae06', '2026-09-22T10:47:19.682Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:19.682Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 8, 14, 'Tiako kosa raha mba misy fitoviana eo aminareo ka hameno izay tsy ampy eo amin’izy ireo ny ambim-bavanareo. Amin’izay dia mba hameno ny tsy ampy eo aminareo koa ny ambim-bavan’izy ireo ka hisy fitoviana,', 'tiako kosa raha mba misy fitoviana eo aminareo ka hameno izay tsy ampy eo amin’izy ireo ny ambim-bavanareo. amin’izay dia mba hameno ny tsy ampy eo aminareo koa ny ambim-bavan’izy ireo ka hisy fitoviana,'),
  ('6ab25cb79273e1b0cfb3ae07', '2026-09-22T10:47:19.682Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:19.682Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 8, 15, 'araka ny voasoratra hoe: “Izay nanana be dia tsy nanana be loatra, ary izay nanana kely dia tsy nanana kely loatra.”', 'araka ny voasoratra hoe: “izay nanana be dia tsy nanana be loatra, ary izay nanana kely dia tsy nanana kely loatra.”'),
  ('6ab25cb79273e1b0cfb3adfd', '2026-09-22T10:47:19.682Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:19.682Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 8, 5, 'Ary tsy izay nantenainay fotsiny no nataony, fa izy ireo mihitsy aloha no nahafoy tena ho an’ny Tompo sy ho anay, noho ny sitrapon’Andriamanitra.', 'ary tsy izay nantenainay fotsiny no nataony, fa izy ireo mihitsy aloha no nahafoy tena ho an’ny tompo sy ho anay, noho ny sitrapon’andriamanitra.'),
  ('6ab25cb79273e1b0cfb3ae0e', '2026-09-22T10:47:19.682Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:19.682Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 8, 22, 'Irahinay miaraka amin’izy ireo koa ilay rahalahinay izay efa nozahanay toetra matetika ka hita fa mazoto amin’ny zavatra maro, ary vao mainka mazoto izy izao satria matoky be anareo.', 'irahinay miaraka amin’izy ireo koa ilay rahalahinay izay efa nozahanay toetra matetika ka hita fa mazoto amin’ny zavatra maro, ary vao mainka mazoto izy izao satria matoky be anareo.'),
  ('6ab25cb8dc61ca0e8dbcce00', '2026-09-22T10:47:20.206Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:20.207Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 9, 4, 'Sao mantsy hisy Makedonianina hiaraka amiko ka hahita fa hay ianareo tsy vonona akory, dia ho menatra izahay—mba tsy hilazana hoe ianareo—noho izahay natoky anareo.', 'sao mantsy hisy makedonianina hiaraka amiko ka hahita fa hay ianareo tsy vonona akory, dia ho menatra izahay—mba tsy hilazana hoe ianareo—noho izahay natoky anareo.'),
  ('6ab25cb8dc61ca0e8dbccdfe', '2026-09-22T10:47:20.206Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:20.206Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 9, 2, 'Fantatro mantsy fa vonona hanampy ianareo, ary izany no ireharehako amin’ny Makedonianina, dia ny hoe efa hatramin’ny herintaona i Akaia no vonona. Ary nandrisika ny ankamaroan’izy ireo ny hafanam-ponareo.', 'fantatro mantsy fa vonona hanampy ianareo, ary izany no ireharehako amin’ny makedonianina, dia ny hoe efa hatramin’ny herintaona i akaia no vonona. ary nandrisika ny ankamaroan’izy ireo ny hafanam-ponareo.'),
  ('6ab25cb8dc61ca0e8dbccdff', '2026-09-22T10:47:20.206Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:20.206Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 9, 3, 'Irahiko ihany anefa ireo rahalahy, mba tsy ho very maina ny nireharehanay momba anareo, ary mba ho vonona tokoa ianareo, araka ny efa nolazaiko.', 'irahiko ihany anefa ireo rahalahy, mba tsy ho very maina ny nireharehanay momba anareo, ary mba ho vonona tokoa ianareo, araka ny efa nolazaiko.'),
  ('6ab25cb8dc61ca0e8dbccdfd', '2026-09-22T10:47:20.206Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:20.206Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 9, 1, 'Tsy tena mila manoratra aminareo momba an’ilay fanompoana ny olona masina aho.', 'tsy tena mila manoratra aminareo momba an’ilay fanompoana ny olona masina aho.'),
  ('6ab25cb8dc61ca0e8dbcce06', '2026-09-22T10:47:20.207Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:20.207Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 9, 10, 'Ary Ilay manome voa betsaka ho an’ny mpamafy sy manome mofo be dia be hohanina, no hanome sy hampitombo ny voa hafafinareo ary hampitombo ny vokatry ny fahamarinanareo.—', 'ary ilay manome voa betsaka ho an’ny mpamafy sy manome mofo be dia be hohanina, no hanome sy hampitombo ny voa hafafinareo ary hampitombo ny vokatry ny fahamarinanareo.—'),
  ('6ab25cb8dc61ca0e8dbcce0a', '2026-09-22T10:47:20.207Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:20.207Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 9, 14, 'Hitalaho ho anareo izy ireo, ary hasehony hoe tiany ianareo satria nanehoan’Andriamanitra hatsaram-panahy faran’izay miavaka.', 'hitalaho ho anareo izy ireo, ary hasehony hoe tiany ianareo satria nanehoan’andriamanitra hatsaram-panahy faran’izay miavaka.'),
  ('6ab25cb8dc61ca0e8dbcce09', '2026-09-22T10:47:20.207Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:20.207Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 9, 13, 'Izany fanompoana izany no manaporofo hoe olona hoatran’ny ahoana ianareo. Koa hanome voninahitra an’Andriamanitra izy ireo, satria manaiky ny vaovao tsara momba an’i Kristy ianareo, araka ny ambaranareo ampahibemaso, sady malala-tanana amin’izy ireo sy amin’ny rehetra.', 'izany fanompoana izany no manaporofo hoe olona hoatran’ny ahoana ianareo. koa hanome voninahitra an’andriamanitra izy ireo, satria manaiky ny vaovao tsara momba an’i kristy ianareo, araka ny ambaranareo ampahibemaso, sady malala-tanana amin’izy ireo sy amin’ny rehetra.'),
  ('6ab25cb8dc61ca0e8dbcce07', '2026-09-22T10:47:20.207Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:20.207Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 9, 11, 'Atao manan-karena amin’ny zava-drehetra ianareo, mba halala-tanana amin’ny fomba isan-karazany, ka hisaotra an’Andriamanitra ny olona noho ny fanomezanareo izay hoentinay ho azy ireo.', 'atao manan-karena amin’ny zava-drehetra ianareo, mba halala-tanana amin’ny fomba isan-karazany, ka hisaotra an’andriamanitra ny olona noho ny fanomezanareo izay hoentinay ho azy ireo.'),
  ('6ab25cb8dc61ca0e8dbcce02', '2026-09-22T10:47:20.207Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:20.207Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 9, 6, 'Tadidio anefa izao: Izay kahihitra ka mamafy kely dia hijinja kely, fa izay malala-tanana ka mamafy be kosa dia hijinja be.', 'tadidio anefa izao: izay kahihitra ka mamafy kely dia hijinja kely, fa izay malala-tanana ka mamafy be kosa dia hijinja be.'),
  ('6ab25cb8dc61ca0e8dbcce08', '2026-09-22T10:47:20.207Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:20.207Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 9, 12, 'Tsy natao hanomezana an’izay ilain’ireo olona masina fotsiny mantsy izao fanompoana ho an’ny besinimaro izao, fa natao koa mba ho be dia be ny olona hisaotra an’Andriamanitra.', 'tsy natao hanomezana an’izay ilain’ireo olona masina fotsiny mantsy izao fanompoana ho an’ny besinimaro izao, fa natao koa mba ho be dia be ny olona hisaotra an’andriamanitra.'),
  ('6ab25cb8dc61ca0e8dbcce0b', '2026-09-22T10:47:20.207Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:20.207Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 9, 15, 'Isaorana Andriamanitra noho ny fanomezany maimaim-poana, izay tsara loatra ka tsy hita ny hilazana azy!', 'isaorana andriamanitra noho ny fanomezany maimaim-poana, izay tsara loatra ka tsy hita ny hilazana azy!'),
  ('6ab25cb8dc61ca0e8dbcce03', '2026-09-22T10:47:20.207Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:20.207Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 9, 7, 'Aoka ny tsirairay samy hanao araka izay fanapahan-keviny tao am-pony, tsy amin’alahelo na an-tery, fa ny mpanome amim-pifaliana no tian’Andriamanitra.', 'aoka ny tsirairay samy hanao araka izay fanapahan-keviny tao am-pony, tsy amin’alahelo na an-tery, fa ny mpanome amim-pifaliana no tian’andriamanitra.'),
  ('6ab25cb8dc61ca0e8dbcce05', '2026-09-22T10:47:20.207Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:20.207Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 9, 9, '—araka ny voasoratra hoe: “Mizara fanomezana be dia be izy; manome ho an’ny mahantra izy. Maharitra mandrakizay ny fahamarinany.”', '—araka ny voasoratra hoe: “mizara fanomezana be dia be izy; manome ho an’ny mahantra izy. maharitra mandrakizay ny fahamarinany.”'),
  ('6ab25cb8dc61ca0e8dbcce04', '2026-09-22T10:47:20.207Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:20.207Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 9, 8, 'Hain’Andriamanitra koa ny maneho hatsaram-panahy miavaka be dia be aminareo, mba hanana ny ampy foana ianareo amin’ny zava-drehetra. Amin’izay dia hanananareo be dia be izay ilaina mba hanaovana ny asa tsara rehetra,', 'hain’andriamanitra koa ny maneho hatsaram-panahy miavaka be dia be aminareo, mba hanana ny ampy foana ianareo amin’ny zava-drehetra. amin’izay dia hanananareo be dia be izay ilaina mba hanaovana ny asa tsara rehetra,'),
  ('6ab25cb8dc61ca0e8dbcce01', '2026-09-22T10:47:20.207Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:20.207Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 9, 5, 'Koa nieritreritra aho hoe nilaina ny nampirisika an’ireo rahalahy handeha mialoha any aminareo, ka hanomana an’ilay fanomezana be dia be nampanantenainareo. Amin’izay dia ho vonona ilay fanomezana ka ho hita hoe nalala-tanana ianareo nanome an’ilay izy, fa tsy noterena.', 'koa nieritreritra aho hoe nilaina ny nampirisika an’ireo rahalahy handeha mialoha any aminareo, ka hanomana an’ilay fanomezana be dia be nampanantenainareo. amin’izay dia ho vonona ilay fanomezana ka ho hita hoe nalala-tanana ianareo nanome an’ilay izy, fa tsy noterena.'),
  ('6ab25cb8ef259b52aba0e288', '2026-09-22T10:47:20.652Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:20.652Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 10, 18, 'Tsy izay midera tena mantsy no ankasitrahana, fa izay derain’i Jehovah.', 'tsy izay midera tena mantsy no ankasitrahana, fa izay derain’i jehovah.'),
  ('6ab25cb8ef259b52aba0e280', '2026-09-22T10:47:20.652Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:20.652Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 10, 10, 'Fa misy milaza hoe: “Mavesa-danja sady mafonja ny taratasy soratany, fa olona tsy dia manao ahoana kosa izy rehefa manatrika eo ary tsy misy dikany ny teniny.”', 'fa misy milaza hoe: “mavesa-danja sady mafonja ny taratasy soratany, fa olona tsy dia manao ahoana kosa izy rehefa manatrika eo ary tsy misy dikany ny teniny.”'),
  ('6ab25cb8ef259b52aba0e27f', '2026-09-22T10:47:20.652Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:20.652Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 10, 9, 'Tsy tiako mantsy raha hoatran’ny hoe mampihorohoro anareo aho amin’ny taratasiko.', 'tsy tiako mantsy raha hoatran’ny hoe mampihorohoro anareo aho amin’ny taratasiko.'),
  ('6ab25cb8ef259b52aba0e287', '2026-09-22T10:47:20.652Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:20.652Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 10, 17, '“Izay mirehareha kosa, dia i Jehovah no tokony hataony rehareha.”', '“izay mirehareha kosa, dia i jehovah no tokony hataony rehareha.”'),
  ('6ab25cb8ef259b52aba0e277', '2026-09-22T10:47:20.652Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:20.652Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 10, 1, 'Izaho, Paoly, dia miangavy anareo noho ny fahalemem-panahy sy ny hatsaram-panahin’i Kristy, na dia misy milaza aza hoe malemy aho rehefa mifanatrika aminareo, fa sahy miteny anareo kosa rehefa tsy eo.', 'izaho, paoly, dia miangavy anareo noho ny fahalemem-panahy sy ny hatsaram-panahin’i kristy, na dia misy milaza aza hoe malemy aho rehefa mifanatrika aminareo, fa sahy miteny anareo kosa rehefa tsy eo.'),
  ('6ab25cb8ef259b52aba0e281', '2026-09-22T10:47:20.652Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:20.652Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 10, 11, 'Tsara ho fantatr’izany olona izany fa izay voalazanay ao amin’ny taratasinay rehefa tsy eo izahay, no hataonay koa rehefa eo izahay.', 'tsara ho fantatr’izany olona izany fa izay voalazanay ao amin’ny taratasinay rehefa tsy eo izahay, no hataonay koa rehefa eo izahay.'),
  ('6ab25cb8ef259b52aba0e27d', '2026-09-22T10:47:20.652Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:20.652Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 10, 7, 'Mijery ivelany fotsiny ianareo. Raha misy matoky tena hoe an’i Kristy izy, dia aoka izy hisaintsaina an’izao indray: An’i Kristy koa izahay, hoatr’azy hoe an’i Kristy.', 'mijery ivelany fotsiny ianareo. raha misy matoky tena hoe an’i kristy izy, dia aoka izy hisaintsaina an’izao indray: an’i kristy koa izahay, hoatr’azy hoe an’i kristy.'),
  ('6ab25cb8ef259b52aba0e27a', '2026-09-22T10:47:20.652Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:20.652Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 10, 4, 'Tsy araka ny nofo mantsy ny fitaovam-piadianay, fa fitaovam-piadiana mahery kosa no nomen’Andriamanitra anay mba handravana zavatra efa mafy orina.', 'tsy araka ny nofo mantsy ny fitaovam-piadianay, fa fitaovam-piadiana mahery kosa no nomen’andriamanitra anay mba handravana zavatra efa mafy orina.'),
  ('6ab25cb8ef259b52aba0e279', '2026-09-22T10:47:20.652Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:20.652Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 10, 3, 'Fa na dia hoatran’ny olon-kafa rehetra ihany aza izahay, dia tsy mba miady toy ny fanaon’ny olona.', 'fa na dia hoatran’ny olon-kafa rehetra ihany aza izahay, dia tsy mba miady toy ny fanaon’ny olona.'),
  ('6ab25cb8ef259b52aba0e27c', '2026-09-22T10:47:20.652Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:20.652Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 10, 6, 'Vonona koa izahay hanasazy an’izay tsy mankatò, raha vao hita hoe mankatò tanteraka ianareo.', 'vonona koa izahay hanasazy an’izay tsy mankatò, raha vao hita hoe mankatò tanteraka ianareo.'),
  ('6ab25cb8ef259b52aba0e284', '2026-09-22T10:47:20.652Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:20.652Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 10, 14, 'Tsy mila mandeha any ivelan’ny faritany nanendrena anay izahay, raha ny marina. Raha izany mantsy, dia hoatran’ny hoe tsy anisan’ny faritaninay ianareo. Izahay anefa no voalohany tonga hatrany aminareo mba hitory ny vaovao tsara momba an’i Kristy.', 'tsy mila mandeha any ivelan’ny faritany nanendrena anay izahay, raha ny marina. raha izany mantsy, dia hoatran’ny hoe tsy anisan’ny faritaninay ianareo. izahay anefa no voalohany tonga hatrany aminareo mba hitory ny vaovao tsara momba an’i kristy.'),
  ('6ab25cb8ef259b52aba0e27e', '2026-09-22T10:47:20.652Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:20.652Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 10, 8, 'Fa na hirehareha be aza aho, noho ny fahefana nomen’ny Tompo anay hoe hampahery anareo fa tsy hanakivy anareo, dia tsy tokony hisy hampahamenatra ahy.', 'fa na hirehareha be aza aho, noho ny fahefana nomen’ny tompo anay hoe hampahery anareo fa tsy hanakivy anareo, dia tsy tokony hisy hampahamenatra ahy.'),
  ('6ab25cb8ef259b52aba0e285', '2026-09-22T10:47:20.652Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:20.652Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 10, 15, 'Tsy mirehareha any ivelan’ny faritra nanendrena anay izahay, izany hoe tsy mirehareha amin’ny asa mafy nataon’ny hafa. Manantena kosa izahay fa arakaraka ny itomboan’ ny finoanareo, dia hitombo ny asa ataonay ao amin’ny faritaninay. Amin’izay dia ho afaka hanao bebe kokoa izahay,', 'tsy mirehareha any ivelan’ny faritra nanendrena anay izahay, izany hoe tsy mirehareha amin’ny asa mafy nataon’ny hafa. manantena kosa izahay fa arakaraka ny itomboan’ ny finoanareo, dia hitombo ny asa ataonay ao amin’ny faritaninay. amin’izay dia ho afaka hanao bebe kokoa izahay,'),
  ('6ab25cb8ef259b52aba0e27b', '2026-09-22T10:47:20.652Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:20.652Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 10, 5, 'Ravanay ny fomba fisainana sy ny zavatra avo rehetra misakana ny olona tsy hahalala an’Andriamanitra, ary baboinay hankatò an’i Kristy ny hevitra rehetra.', 'ravanay ny fomba fisainana sy ny zavatra avo rehetra misakana ny olona tsy hahalala an’andriamanitra, ary baboinay hankatò an’i kristy ny hevitra rehetra.'),
  ('6ab25cb8ef259b52aba0e282', '2026-09-22T10:47:20.652Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:20.652Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 10, 12, 'Fa tsy mba sahinay ny hampitovy na hampitaha ny tenanay amin’ny olona midera tena. Tsy misaina mantsy izy ireny satria izay heveriny fa mety ihany no itsarany ny tenany, ary izy samy izy ihany no mifampitaha.', 'fa tsy mba sahinay ny hampitovy na hampitaha ny tenanay amin’ny olona midera tena. tsy misaina mantsy izy ireny satria izay heveriny fa mety ihany no itsarany ny tenany, ary izy samy izy ihany no mifampitaha.'),
  ('6ab25cb8ef259b52aba0e286', '2026-09-22T10:47:20.652Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:20.652Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 10, 16, 'ka hitory ny vaovao tsara any amin’ny tany hafa ankoatra ny anareo, mba tsy hireharehanay ny amin’izay efa nataon’ny hafa tany amin’ny faritaniny.', 'ka hitory ny vaovao tsara any amin’ny tany hafa ankoatra ny anareo, mba tsy hireharehanay ny amin’izay efa nataon’ny hafa tany amin’ny faritaniny.'),
  ('6ab25cb8ef259b52aba0e283', '2026-09-22T10:47:20.652Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:20.652Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 10, 13, 'Tsy hirehareha any ivelan’ny faritra nanendrena anay anefa izahay, fa ao anatin’ny faritry ny faritany nomen’Andriamanitra anay ihany, izay nataony tonga hatrany aminareo.', 'tsy hirehareha any ivelan’ny faritra nanendrena anay anefa izahay, fa ao anatin’ny faritry ny faritany nomen’andriamanitra anay ihany, izay nataony tonga hatrany aminareo.'),
  ('6ab25cb8ef259b52aba0e278', '2026-09-22T10:47:20.652Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:20.652Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 10, 2, 'Manantena aho fa rehefa tonga any aminareo, dia tsy voatery ho sahy handray fepetra henjana amin’ireo mieritreritra anay hoe manaraka fomba fisainan’olombelona fotsiny.', 'manantena aho fa rehefa tonga any aminareo, dia tsy voatery ho sahy handray fepetra henjana amin’ireo mieritreritra anay hoe manaraka fomba fisainan’olombelona fotsiny.'),
  ('6ab25cb9fa31264e244ad635', '2026-09-22T10:47:21.076Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:21.076Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 11, 17, 'Tsy manaraka ny modelin’ny Tompo aho raha milaza an’izao zavatra izao, fa miteny hoatran’ny olona adala matoky tena loatra sy mirehareha.', 'tsy manaraka ny modelin’ny tompo aho raha milaza an’izao zavatra izao, fa miteny hoatran’ny olona adala matoky tena loatra sy mirehareha.'),
  ('6ab25cb9fa31264e244ad630', '2026-09-22T10:47:21.076Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:21.076Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 11, 12, 'Izay ataoko izao anefa dia mbola hataoko ihany. Amin’izay dia ho tampina ny vavan’ireo mitady antony hanaporofoana hoe mitovy aminay izy ireo ka mirehareha amin’ny zava-bitany.', 'izay ataoko izao anefa dia mbola hataoko ihany. amin’izay dia ho tampina ny vavan’ireo mitady antony hanaporofoana hoe mitovy aminay izy ireo ka mirehareha amin’ny zava-bitany.'),
  ('6ab25cb9fa31264e244ad63b', '2026-09-22T10:47:21.076Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:21.076Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 11, 23, 'Mpanompon’i Kristy ve izy ireo? Mamaly hoatran’ny adala aho. Mpanompon’i Kristy aho ary miavaka kokoa noho izy ireo aza: Betsaka kokoa ny asa nataoko, natao am-ponja matetika kokoa aho, tsy voaisa intsony ny kapoka nahazo ahy, ary efa saika maty imbetsaka aho.', 'mpanompon’i kristy ve izy ireo? mamaly hoatran’ny adala aho. mpanompon’i kristy aho ary miavaka kokoa noho izy ireo aza: betsaka kokoa ny asa nataoko, natao am-ponja matetika kokoa aho, tsy voaisa intsony ny kapoka nahazo ahy, ary efa saika maty imbetsaka aho.'),
  ('6ab25cb9fa31264e244ad640', '2026-09-22T10:47:21.076Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:21.076Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 11, 28, 'Ankoatra an’ireo zavatra ivelany ireo, dia misy manavesatra ahy koa isan’andro: Manahy momba ny fiangonana rehetra aho.', 'ankoatra an’ireo zavatra ivelany ireo, dia misy manavesatra ahy koa isan’andro: manahy momba ny fiangonana rehetra aho.'),
  ('6ab25cb9fa31264e244ad642', '2026-09-22T10:47:21.076Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:21.076Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 11, 30, 'Raha tsy maintsy mirehareha aho, dia amin’izay zavatra ahitana ahy hoe malemy no hireharehako.', 'raha tsy maintsy mirehareha aho, dia amin’izay zavatra ahitana ahy hoe malemy no hireharehako.'),
  ('6ab25cb9fa31264e244ad63c', '2026-09-22T10:47:21.076Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:21.076Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 11, 24, 'Indimy aho no nokapohin’ny Jiosy in-40 latsaka iray avy,', 'indimy aho no nokapohin’ny jiosy in-40 latsaka iray avy,'),
  ('6ab25cb9fa31264e244ad636', '2026-09-22T10:47:21.076Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:21.076Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 11, 18, 'Koa satria maro no mirehareha araka ny nofo, dia mba hirehareha koa aho.', 'koa satria maro no mirehareha araka ny nofo, dia mba hirehareha koa aho.'),
  ('6ab25cb9fa31264e244ad62f', '2026-09-22T10:47:21.076Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:21.076Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 11, 11, 'Fa nahoana? Satria ve tsy tiako ianareo? Fantatr’Andriamanitra fa tia anareo aho.', 'fa nahoana? satria ve tsy tiako ianareo? fantatr’andriamanitra fa tia anareo aho.'),
  ('6ab25cb9fa31264e244ad62c', '2026-09-22T10:47:21.076Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:21.076Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 11, 8, 'Hoatran’ny hoe nandroba ny fiangonana hafa aho rehefa nandray fanampiana mba hanompoako anareo.', 'hoatran’ny hoe nandroba ny fiangonana hafa aho rehefa nandray fanampiana mba hanompoako anareo.'),
  ('6ab25cb9fa31264e244ad63e', '2026-09-22T10:47:21.076Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:21.076Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 11, 26, 'Nandeha lavitra matetika aho, saika nahita loza tamin’ny renirano, saika nahita loza tamin’ny jiolahy, saika nahita loza tamin’ny mpiray firenena amiko, saika nahita loza tamin’ny hafa firenena, saika nahita loza tao an-tanàna, saika nahita loza tany an-tany efitra, saika nahita loza tany an-dranomasina, ary saika nahita loza teo anivon’ny rahalahy sandoka.', 'nandeha lavitra matetika aho, saika nahita loza tamin’ny renirano, saika nahita loza tamin’ny jiolahy, saika nahita loza tamin’ny mpiray firenena amiko, saika nahita loza tamin’ny hafa firenena, saika nahita loza tao an-tanàna, saika nahita loza tany an-tany efitra, saika nahita loza tany an-dranomasina, ary saika nahita loza teo anivon’ny rahalahy sandoka.'),
  ('6ab25cb9fa31264e244ad63a', '2026-09-22T10:47:21.076Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:21.076Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 11, 22, 'Hebreo ve izy ireo? Izaho koa. Israelita ve izy ireo? Izaho koa. Taranak’i Abrahama ve izy ireo? Izaho koa.', 'hebreo ve izy ireo? izaho koa. israelita ve izy ireo? izaho koa. taranak’i abrahama ve izy ireo? izaho koa.'),
  ('6ab25cb9fa31264e244ad62a', '2026-09-22T10:47:21.076Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:21.076Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 11, 6, 'Na tsy mahay mandaha-teny aza anefa aho, dia tena manana fahalalana. Efa nasehonay anareo tsara izany tamin’ny lafiny rehetra sy tamin’ny zava-drehetra.', 'na tsy mahay mandaha-teny aza anefa aho, dia tena manana fahalalana. efa nasehonay anareo tsara izany tamin’ny lafiny rehetra sy tamin’ny zava-drehetra.'),
  ('6ab25cb9fa31264e244ad633', '2026-09-22T10:47:21.076Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:21.076Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 11, 15, 'Tsy mahagaga àry raha mody miseho foana ho mpanompon’ny fahamarinana koa ny mpanompony. Arakaraka izay ataon’izy ireo anefa no hiafarany.', 'tsy mahagaga àry raha mody miseho foana ho mpanompon’ny fahamarinana koa ny mpanompony. arakaraka izay ataon’izy ireo anefa no hiafarany.'),
  ('6ab25cb9fa31264e244ad641', '2026-09-22T10:47:21.076Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:21.076Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 11, 29, 'Iza no malemy ka tsy malemy aho? Iza no tafintohina ka tsy tezitra aho?', 'iza no malemy ka tsy malemy aho? iza no tafintohina ka tsy tezitra aho?'),
  ('6ab25cb9fa31264e244ad62e', '2026-09-22T10:47:21.076Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:21.076Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 11, 10, 'Raha mbola ato amiko ny fahamarinan’i Kristy, dia mbola hirehareha momba an’izany foana aho any amin’ireo faritr’i Akaia.', 'raha mbola ato amiko ny fahamarinan’i kristy, dia mbola hirehareha momba an’izany foana aho any amin’ireo faritr’i akaia.'),
  ('6ab25cb9fa31264e244ad62d', '2026-09-22T10:47:21.076Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:21.076Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 11, 9, 'Rehefa teo aminareo anefa aho ary tao anatin’ny tsy fisiana, dia tsy lasa enta-mavesatra na ho an’iza na ho an’iza, satria nanome izay nilaiko ireo rahalahy avy eto Makedonia sady nanome ahy be dia be. Tena niezaka aho mba tsy ho enta-mavesatra ho anareo tamin’ny lafiny rehetra, ary mbola hiezaka hanao an’izany foana aho.', 'rehefa teo aminareo anefa aho ary tao anatin’ny tsy fisiana, dia tsy lasa enta-mavesatra na ho an’iza na ho an’iza, satria nanome izay nilaiko ireo rahalahy avy eto makedonia sady nanome ahy be dia be. tena niezaka aho mba tsy ho enta-mavesatra ho anareo tamin’ny lafiny rehetra, ary mbola hiezaka hanao an’izany foana aho.'),
  ('6ab25cb9fa31264e244ad643', '2026-09-22T10:47:21.076Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:21.076Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 11, 31, 'Tsy mandainga aho, ary mahafantatra an’izany ilay Andriamanitra Rain’i Jesosy Tompo, Ilay tokony hoderaina mandrakizay.', 'tsy mandainga aho, ary mahafantatra an’izany ilay andriamanitra rain’i jesosy tompo, ilay tokony hoderaina mandrakizay.'),
  ('6ab25cb9fa31264e244ad638', '2026-09-22T10:47:21.076Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:21.076Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 11, 20, 'Mandefitra tokoa ianareo amin’izay manandevo anareo, na mandany ny fanananareo, na maka an-keriny an’izay anananareo, na manandra-tena ho ambony noho ianareo, na mamely ny tarehinareo.', 'mandefitra tokoa ianareo amin’izay manandevo anareo, na mandany ny fanananareo, na maka an-keriny an’izay anananareo, na manandra-tena ho ambony noho ianareo, na mamely ny tarehinareo.'),
  ('6ab25cb9fa31264e244ad63f', '2026-09-22T10:47:21.076Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:21.076Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 11, 27, 'Niasa mafy sy nikely aina aho, tsy nahita tory matetika, noana sy nangetaheta, tsy nihinan-kanina matetika, nangatsiaka ary tsy nanana akanjo.', 'niasa mafy sy nikely aina aho, tsy nahita tory matetika, noana sy nangetaheta, tsy nihinan-kanina matetika, nangatsiaka ary tsy nanana akanjo.'),
  ('6ab25cb9fa31264e244ad639', '2026-09-22T10:47:21.076Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:21.076Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 11, 21, 'Manala baraka anay izany teniko izany satria toy ny hoe malemy izahay aminareo. Izay sahin’ny olona atao anefa—miteny toy ny adala aho—dia mba sahiko koa.', 'manala baraka anay izany teniko izany satria toy ny hoe malemy izahay aminareo. izay sahin’ny olona atao anefa—miteny toy ny adala aho—dia mba sahiko koa.'),
  ('6ab25cb9fa31264e244ad637', '2026-09-22T10:47:21.076Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:21.076Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 11, 19, 'Faly erỳ ianareo mandefitra amin’ny olona adala, satria ianareo tena “misaina.”', 'faly erỳ ianareo mandefitra amin’ny olona adala, satria ianareo tena “misaina.”'),
  ('6ab25cb9fa31264e244ad634', '2026-09-22T10:47:21.076Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:21.076Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 11, 16, 'Averiko indray hoe: Aoka tsy hisy hihevitra ahy ho adala. Raha mihevitra ahy ho toy izany anefa ianareo, dia raiso ihany aho na adala aza, mba ho afaka hirehareha kely koa.', 'averiko indray hoe: aoka tsy hisy hihevitra ahy ho adala. raha mihevitra ahy ho toy izany anefa ianareo, dia raiso ihany aho na adala aza, mba ho afaka hirehareha kely koa.'),
  ('6ab25cb9fa31264e244ad631', '2026-09-22T10:47:21.076Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:21.076Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 11, 13, 'Fa apostoly sandoka ireny, mpiasa mamitaka, ka mody miseho ho apostolin’i Kristy.', 'fa apostoly sandoka ireny, mpiasa mamitaka, ka mody miseho ho apostolin’i kristy.'),
  ('6ab25cb9fa31264e244ad629', '2026-09-22T10:47:21.076Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:21.076Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 11, 5, 'Fa amiko dia tsy misy na inona na inona mampiseho hoe ambany aho, raha oharina amin’ireo apostolinareo tsara loatra ireo.', 'fa amiko dia tsy misy na inona na inona mampiseho hoe ambany aho, raha oharina amin’ireo apostolinareo tsara loatra ireo.'),
  ('6ab25cb9fa31264e244ad628', '2026-09-22T10:47:21.076Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:21.076Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 11, 4, 'Raha misy mantsy olona tonga mitory Jesosy hafa noho ilay efa notorinay, na misy mampirisika anareo hanana toe-tsaina hafa noho izay efa nanananareo, na misy mitory vaovao tsara hafa noho izay efa nekenareo, dia tsy mampaninona anareo ny mandefitra amin’izany olona izany.', 'raha misy mantsy olona tonga mitory jesosy hafa noho ilay efa notorinay, na misy mampirisika anareo hanana toe-tsaina hafa noho izay efa nanananareo, na misy mitory vaovao tsara hafa noho izay efa nekenareo, dia tsy mampaninona anareo ny mandefitra amin’izany olona izany.'),
  ('6ab25cb9fa31264e244ad62b', '2026-09-22T10:47:21.076Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:21.076Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 11, 7, 'Faly aho nitory maimaim-poana ny vaovao tsaran’Andriamanitra taminareo. Dia nanota ve aho raha nanetry tena hoatr’izany mba hisandratanareo?', 'faly aho nitory maimaim-poana ny vaovao tsaran’andriamanitra taminareo. dia nanota ve aho raha nanetry tena hoatr’izany mba hisandratanareo?'),
  ('6ab25cb9fa31264e244ad627', '2026-09-22T10:47:21.076Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:21.076Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 11, 3, 'Matahotra anefa aho sao ianareo ho voafitaka toa an’i Eva izay nofitahin’ny menarana tamin-kafetsena, ka ho simba ny sainareo, dia tsy ho ao aminareo intsony ilay fahatsorana sy fahadiovana mendrika an’i Kristy.', 'matahotra anefa aho sao ianareo ho voafitaka toa an’i eva izay nofitahin’ny menarana tamin-kafetsena, ka ho simba ny sainareo, dia tsy ho ao aminareo intsony ilay fahatsorana sy fahadiovana mendrika an’i kristy.'),
  ('6ab25cb9fa31264e244ad625', '2026-09-22T10:47:21.076Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:21.076Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 11, 1, 'Enga anie mba handefitra amiko ianareo amin’ny hadalana kely ataoko! Efa mandefitra amiko ihany ange ianareo, raha ny marina e!', 'enga anie mba handefitra amiko ianareo amin’ny hadalana kely ataoko! efa mandefitra amiko ihany ange ianareo, raha ny marina e!'),
  ('6ab25cb9fa31264e244ad63d', '2026-09-22T10:47:21.076Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:21.076Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 11, 25, 'intelo aho no nokapohina tamin’ny hazo, indray mandeha notoraham-bato, intelo vaky sambo, ary indray andro sy indray alina aho no tavela teny an-dranomasina.', 'intelo aho no nokapohina tamin’ny hazo, indray mandeha notoraham-bato, intelo vaky sambo, ary indray andro sy indray alina aho no tavela teny an-dranomasina.'),
  ('6ab25cb9fa31264e244ad632', '2026-09-22T10:47:21.076Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:21.076Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 11, 14, 'Ary tsy mahagaga izany fa i Satana aza mody miseho foana ho anjelin’ny mazava.', 'ary tsy mahagaga izany fa i satana aza mody miseho foana ho anjelin’ny mazava.'),
  ('6ab25cb9fa31264e244ad626', '2026-09-22T10:47:21.076Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:21.076Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 11, 2, 'Fa saro-piaro aminareo aho, hoatran’Andriamanitra saro-piaro aminareo. Izaho mihitsy mantsy no nanolotra anareo ho fofombadin’ny lehilahy iray. Te hanolotra anareo ho virjiny madio ho an’i Kristy aho.', 'fa saro-piaro aminareo aho, hoatran’andriamanitra saro-piaro aminareo. izaho mihitsy mantsy no nanolotra anareo ho fofombadin’ny lehilahy iray. te hanolotra anareo ho virjiny madio ho an’i kristy aho.'),
  ('6ab25cb9fa31264e244ad644', '2026-09-22T10:47:21.077Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:21.077Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 11, 32, 'Tany Damaskosy, dia nanome baiko hiambenana an’ilay tanàna ny governora notendren’i Areta Mpanjaka mba hisamborana ahy.', 'tany damaskosy, dia nanome baiko hiambenana an’ilay tanàna ny governora notendren’i areta mpanjaka mba hisamborana ahy.'),
  ('6ab25cb9fa31264e244ad645', '2026-09-22T10:47:21.077Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:21.077Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 11, 33, 'Nampidinina tamin’ny sobika avy teo am-baravarankelin’ny mandan’ilay tanàna anefa aho, ka afa-nandositra.', 'nampidinina tamin’ny sobika avy teo am-baravarankelin’ny mandan’ilay tanàna anefa aho, ka afa-nandositra.'),
  ('6ab25cb9cbfd4d1d1b12281d', '2026-09-22T10:47:21.847Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:21.847Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 12, 21, 'Angamba rehefa tonga indray aho, dia havelan’ilay Andriamanitro ho afa-baraka eo anatrehanareo. Dia tsy maintsy halahelo aho, noho ireo olona maro nanota teo aloha nefa tsy nibebaka tamin’ny fanaony, izany hoe ny fahalotoany sy ny fijangajangany ary ny fitondran-tenany tsy misy henatra.', 'angamba rehefa tonga indray aho, dia havelan’ilay andriamanitro ho afa-baraka eo anatrehanareo. dia tsy maintsy halahelo aho, noho ireo olona maro nanota teo aloha nefa tsy nibebaka tamin’ny fanaony, izany hoe ny fahalotoany sy ny fijangajangany ary ny fitondran-tenany tsy misy henatra.'),
  ('6ab25cb9cbfd4d1d1b12280f', '2026-09-22T10:47:21.847Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:21.847Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 12, 7, 'satria fotsiny hoe miavaka be ny zavatra naharihary tamiko. Mba tsy hahatonga ahy hanandra-tena be loatra, dia nasiana tsilo ao amin’ny nofo aho, izany hoe anjelin’i Satana, mba hamely ahy tsy an-kijanona, sao hanandra-tena be loatra aho.', 'satria fotsiny hoe miavaka be ny zavatra naharihary tamiko. mba tsy hahatonga ahy hanandra-tena be loatra, dia nasiana tsilo ao amin’ny nofo aho, izany hoe anjelin’i satana, mba hamely ahy tsy an-kijanona, sao hanandra-tena be loatra aho.'),
  ('6ab25cb9cbfd4d1d1b122814', '2026-09-22T10:47:21.847Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:21.847Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 12, 12, 'Efa naseho anareo tokoa ny porofo hoe apostoly aho: Niaritra be aho, ary nanao famantarana sy fahagagana ary zavatra miavaka.', 'efa naseho anareo tokoa ny porofo hoe apostoly aho: niaritra be aho, ary nanao famantarana sy fahagagana ary zavatra miavaka.'),
  ('6ab25cb9cbfd4d1d1b12280d', '2026-09-22T10:47:21.847Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:21.847Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 12, 5, 'Hirehareha ny amin’izany olona izany aho, fa tsy hirehareha ny amin’ny tenako, afa-tsy ny amin’ny fahalemeko ihany angaha.', 'hirehareha ny amin’izany olona izany aho, fa tsy hirehareha ny amin’ny tenako, afa-tsy ny amin’ny fahalemeko ihany angaha.'),
  ('6ab25cb9cbfd4d1d1b12280a', '2026-09-22T10:47:21.847Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:21.847Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 12, 2, 'Mahafantatra olona iray tafaray amin’i Kristy aho. Nentina ho any amin’ny lanitra fahatelo io olona io, 14 taona lasa izay.—Tsy fantatro na tao amin’ny vatana na tsy tao amin’ny vatana, fa Andriamanitra no mahalala.—', 'mahafantatra olona iray tafaray amin’i kristy aho. nentina ho any amin’ny lanitra fahatelo io olona io, 14 taona lasa izay.—tsy fantatro na tao amin’ny vatana na tsy tao amin’ny vatana, fa andriamanitra no mahalala.—'),
  ('6ab25cb9cbfd4d1d1b122809', '2026-09-22T10:47:21.847Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:21.847Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 12, 1, 'Tsy maintsy mirehareha aho. Hiresaka an’ireo fahitana mahagaga avy amin’ny Tompo sy ireo zavatra naharihariny tamiko indray aho izao, na dia tsy misy tombony azo amin’izany aza.', 'tsy maintsy mirehareha aho. hiresaka an’ireo fahitana mahagaga avy amin’ny tompo sy ireo zavatra naharihariny tamiko indray aho izao, na dia tsy misy tombony azo amin’izany aza.'),
  ('6ab25cb9cbfd4d1d1b12281b', '2026-09-22T10:47:21.847Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:21.847Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 12, 19, 'Nieritreritra ve ianareo hatramin’izay hoe miaro tena eo anatrehanareo izahay? Eo anatrehan’Andriamanitra no miteny izahay tafaray amin’i Kristy. Natao hampaherezana anareo anefa ny zava-drehetra ataonay, ry malala.', 'nieritreritra ve ianareo hatramin’izay hoe miaro tena eo anatrehanareo izahay? eo anatrehan’andriamanitra no miteny izahay tafaray amin’i kristy. natao hampaherezana anareo anefa ny zava-drehetra ataonay, ry malala.'),
  ('6ab25cb9cbfd4d1d1b12280c', '2026-09-22T10:47:21.847Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:21.847Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 12, 4, 'Nentina tany amin’ny paradisa izy, ka nandre teny tsy tokony holazaina amin’olona sady tsy azon’olona tenenina.', 'nentina tany amin’ny paradisa izy, ka nandre teny tsy tokony holazaina amin’olona sady tsy azon’olona tenenina.'),
  ('6ab25cb9cbfd4d1d1b12281c', '2026-09-22T10:47:21.847Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:21.847Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 12, 20, 'Fa matahotra aho sao rehefa tonga any aho dia tsy ho araka izay iriko ny zavatra ataonareo, ary tsy ho araka izay irinareo ny zavatra ataoko. Matahotra aho sao misy ady eo aminareo, na fialonana, fahatezerana tsy voafehy, fifamaliana, fanaratsiana, fifosana, fireharehana, na korontana.', 'fa matahotra aho sao rehefa tonga any aho dia tsy ho araka izay iriko ny zavatra ataonareo, ary tsy ho araka izay irinareo ny zavatra ataoko. matahotra aho sao misy ady eo aminareo, na fialonana, fahatezerana tsy voafehy, fifamaliana, fanaratsiana, fifosana, fireharehana, na korontana.'),
  ('6ab25cb9cbfd4d1d1b122815', '2026-09-22T10:47:21.847Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:21.847Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 12, 13, 'Fa mieritreritra ve ianareo hoe maty antoka raha oharina amin’ny fiangonana hafa, satria fotsiny hoe tsy lasa enta-mavesatra ho anareo aho? Mba mamelà ahy amin’izany fahadisoana izany.', 'fa mieritreritra ve ianareo hoe maty antoka raha oharina amin’ny fiangonana hafa, satria fotsiny hoe tsy lasa enta-mavesatra ho anareo aho? mba mamelà ahy amin’izany fahadisoana izany.'),
  ('6ab25cb9cbfd4d1d1b122811', '2026-09-22T10:47:21.847Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:21.847Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 12, 9, 'Nilaza tamiko anefa izy hoe: “Ampy ho anao ny hatsaram-panahy miavaka asehoko aminao, satria tonga lafatra ny fiasan’ny heriko eo aminao rehefa malemy ianao.” Vao mainka àry aho faly hirehareha amin’ny fahalemeko, mba hanarona ahy foana toy ny tranolay ny herin’i Kristy.', 'nilaza tamiko anefa izy hoe: “ampy ho anao ny hatsaram-panahy miavaka asehoko aminao, satria tonga lafatra ny fiasan’ny heriko eo aminao rehefa malemy ianao.” vao mainka àry aho faly hirehareha amin’ny fahalemeko, mba hanarona ahy foana toy ny tranolay ny herin’i kristy.'),
  ('6ab25cb9cbfd4d1d1b12280b', '2026-09-22T10:47:21.847Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:21.847Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 12, 3, 'Fantatro izany olona nentina tany amin’ny paradisa izany.—Tsy fantatro na tao amin’ny vatana na tsy tao amin’ny vatana, fa Andriamanitra no mahalala.—', 'fantatro izany olona nentina tany amin’ny paradisa izany.—tsy fantatro na tao amin’ny vatana na tsy tao amin’ny vatana, fa andriamanitra no mahalala.—'),
  ('6ab25cb9cbfd4d1d1b122812', '2026-09-22T10:47:21.847Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:21.847Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 12, 10, 'Koa mahafaly ahy ny hoe malemy, misy manambanimbany, ao anatin’ny tsy fisiana, misy manenjika sy miatrika zava-tsarotra, noho ny amin’i Kristy. Rehefa malemy mantsy aho, dia amin’izay aho no mahery.', 'koa mahafaly ahy ny hoe malemy, misy manambanimbany, ao anatin’ny tsy fisiana, misy manenjika sy miatrika zava-tsarotra, noho ny amin’i kristy. rehefa malemy mantsy aho, dia amin’izay aho no mahery.'),
  ('6ab25cb9cbfd4d1d1b12281a', '2026-09-22T10:47:21.847Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:21.847Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 12, 18, 'Nampirisika an’i Titosy hankany aminareo aho ary nirahiko hiaraka taminy ilay rahalahy iny. Nanararaotra anareo ve i Titosy? Tsy nanao an’izany mihitsy izy. Tsy hitanareo ve fa nitovy saina izahay? Tsy nitovy koa ve ny fomba fiasanay?', 'nampirisika an’i titosy hankany aminareo aho ary nirahiko hiaraka taminy ilay rahalahy iny. nanararaotra anareo ve i titosy? tsy nanao an’izany mihitsy izy. tsy hitanareo ve fa nitovy saina izahay? tsy nitovy koa ve ny fomba fiasanay?'),
  ('6ab25cb9cbfd4d1d1b122810', '2026-09-22T10:47:21.847Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:21.847Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 12, 8, 'Intelo aho no niangavy ny Tompo mba hanesorany an’izany amiko.', 'intelo aho no niangavy ny tompo mba hanesorany an’izany amiko.'),
  ('6ab25cb9cbfd4d1d1b122818', '2026-09-22T10:47:21.847Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:21.847Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 12, 16, 'Na izany aza anefa, dia tsy nampitondra enta-mavesatra anareo aho. Milaza anefa ianareo fa “fetsy” aho sady “tamin’ny fitaka” no nahazoako anareo.', 'na izany aza anefa, dia tsy nampitondra enta-mavesatra anareo aho. milaza anefa ianareo fa “fetsy” aho sady “tamin’ny fitaka” no nahazoako anareo.'),
  ('6ab25cb9cbfd4d1d1b122817', '2026-09-22T10:47:21.847Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:21.847Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 12, 15, 'Raha ny amiko, dia tena ho faly aho hanome izay rehetra ananako sy hanao sorona tanteraka ny fiainako ho anareo. Raha tena tia anareo hoatr’izany aho, dia tokony ho kely kokoa noho izany ve ny fitiavanareo ahy?', 'raha ny amiko, dia tena ho faly aho hanome izay rehetra ananako sy hanao sorona tanteraka ny fiainako ho anareo. raha tena tia anareo hoatr’izany aho, dia tokony ho kely kokoa noho izany ve ny fitiavanareo ahy?'),
  ('6ab25cb9cbfd4d1d1b122816', '2026-09-22T10:47:21.847Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:21.847Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 12, 14, 'Fanintelony aho izao no vonona hankany aminareo, ary tsy ho lasa enta-mavesatra aho. Fa tsy ny fanananareo no tadiaviko, fa ianareo. Tsy ny zanaka mantsy no tokony hihary ho an’ny ray aman-dreniny, fa ny ray aman-dreny no tokony hihary ho an’ny zanany.', 'fanintelony aho izao no vonona hankany aminareo, ary tsy ho lasa enta-mavesatra aho. fa tsy ny fanananareo no tadiaviko, fa ianareo. tsy ny zanaka mantsy no tokony hihary ho an’ny ray aman-dreniny, fa ny ray aman-dreny no tokony hihary ho an’ny zanany.'),
  ('6ab25cb9cbfd4d1d1b122813', '2026-09-22T10:47:21.847Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:21.847Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 12, 11, 'Nanjary nanao adaladala aho, noho ianareo nanery ahy, satria tokony ho nilaza zavatra tsara momba ahy ianareo. Fa tsy nisy na inona na inona nampiseho hoe ambany aho raha oharina amin’ireo apostolinareo tsara loatra ireo, na dia tsinontsinona aza aho.', 'nanjary nanao adaladala aho, noho ianareo nanery ahy, satria tokony ho nilaza zavatra tsara momba ahy ianareo. fa tsy nisy na inona na inona nampiseho hoe ambany aho raha oharina amin’ireo apostolinareo tsara loatra ireo, na dia tsinontsinona aza aho.'),
  ('6ab25cb9cbfd4d1d1b122819', '2026-09-22T10:47:21.847Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:21.847Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 12, 17, 'Izaho ve dia nanararaotra anareo tamin’izaho naniraka olona tany aminareo?', 'izaho ve dia nanararaotra anareo tamin’izaho naniraka olona tany aminareo?'),
  ('6ab25cb9cbfd4d1d1b12280e', '2026-09-22T10:47:21.847Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:21.847Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 12, 6, 'Fa na dia te hirehareha aza aho, dia tsy ho adala fa hilaza ny marina. Tsy hanao an’izany anefa aho, mba tsy hisy hieritreritra hoe nahavita mihoatra noho izay efa hitany nataoko aho na nahavita mihoatra noho izay henony hoe nolazaiko,', 'fa na dia te hirehareha aza aho, dia tsy ho adala fa hilaza ny marina. tsy hanao an’izany anefa aho, mba tsy hisy hieritreritra hoe nahavita mihoatra noho izay efa hitany nataoko aho na nahavita mihoatra noho izay henony hoe nolazaiko,'),
  ('6ab25cbae537156c44d7433d', '2026-09-22T10:47:22.847Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:22.847Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 13, 12, 'Mifampiarahabà amin’ny oroka masina.', 'mifampiarahabà amin’ny oroka masina.'),
  ('6ab25cbae537156c44d74332', '2026-09-22T10:47:22.847Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:22.847Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 13, 1, 'Fanintelony aho izao no ho any aminareo. “Tenin’ny vavolombelona roa na telo no ilaina vao azo antoka hoe mitombina ny zava-drehetra.”', 'fanintelony aho izao no ho any aminareo. “tenin’ny vavolombelona roa na telo no ilaina vao azo antoka hoe mitombina ny zava-drehetra.”'),
  ('6ab25cbae537156c44d7433a', '2026-09-22T10:47:22.847Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:22.847Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 13, 9, 'Tena faly izahay raha malemy, fa ianareo kosa mahery. Ary mivavaka izahay mba hanitsy an’izay tokony hahitsy ianareo.', 'tena faly izahay raha malemy, fa ianareo kosa mahery. ary mivavaka izahay mba hanitsy an’izay tokony hahitsy ianareo.'),
  ('6ab25cbae537156c44d7433c', '2026-09-22T10:47:22.847Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:22.847Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 13, 11, 'Farany, ry rahalahy, miezaha foana hifaly, hanitsy izay tokony hahitsy, handray fampiononana, hifanara-tsaina, ary hihavana tsara. Hitahy anareo anie ilay Andriamanitry ny fitiavana sy ny fiadanana!', 'farany, ry rahalahy, miezaha foana hifaly, hanitsy izay tokony hahitsy, handray fampiononana, hifanara-tsaina, ary hihavana tsara. hitahy anareo anie ilay andriamanitry ny fitiavana sy ny fiadanana!'),
  ('6ab25cbae537156c44d74337', '2026-09-22T10:47:22.847Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:22.847Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 13, 6, 'Tena manantena aho fa hekenareo hoe olona ankasitrahana izahay.', 'tena manantena aho fa hekenareo hoe olona ankasitrahana izahay.'),
  ('6ab25cbae537156c44d74334', '2026-09-22T10:47:22.847Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:22.847Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 13, 3, 'Mitady porofo mantsy ianareo hoe miteny amin’ny alalako tokoa ve i Kristy, izay tsy malemy rehefa manao zavatra eo aminareo fa mampiseho ny heriny eo aminareo kosa.', 'mitady porofo mantsy ianareo hoe miteny amin’ny alalako tokoa ve i kristy, izay tsy malemy rehefa manao zavatra eo aminareo fa mampiseho ny heriny eo aminareo kosa.'),
  ('6ab25cbae537156c44d74336', '2026-09-22T10:47:22.847Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:22.847Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 13, 5, 'Miezaha handini-tena foana mba hahitana raha ao amin’ny finoana ianareo na tsia, ary fantaro tsara foana hoe manao ahoana ny tenanareo. Sa ianareo tsy manaiky hoe tafaray aminareo i Jesosy Kristy? Tokony hekenareo izany, raha tsy hoe tsy ankasitrahana angaha ianareo.', 'miezaha handini-tena foana mba hahitana raha ao amin’ny finoana ianareo na tsia, ary fantaro tsara foana hoe manao ahoana ny tenanareo. sa ianareo tsy manaiky hoe tafaray aminareo i jesosy kristy? tokony hekenareo izany, raha tsy hoe tsy ankasitrahana angaha ianareo.'),
  ('6ab25cbae537156c44d7433e', '2026-09-22T10:47:22.847Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:22.847Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 13, 13, 'Mampamangy, hono, ianareo, hoy ny olona masina rehetra.', 'mampamangy, hono, ianareo, hoy ny olona masina rehetra.'),
  ('6ab25cbae537156c44d7433f', '2026-09-22T10:47:22.847Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:22.847Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 13, 14, 'Enga anie ianareo hanehoan’i Jesosy Kristy Tompo hatsaram-panahy miavaka sy hanehoan’Andriamanitra ny fitiavany, ary enga anie ianareo samy handray soa amin’ny fanahy masina!', 'enga anie ianareo hanehoan’i jesosy kristy tompo hatsaram-panahy miavaka sy hanehoan’andriamanitra ny fitiavany, ary enga anie ianareo samy handray soa amin’ny fanahy masina!'),
  ('6ab25cbae537156c44d7433b', '2026-09-22T10:47:22.847Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:22.847Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 13, 10, 'Izany no antony anoratako an’ireo zavatra ireo aminareo, dieny mbola tsy any aminareo aho. Amin’izay rehefa eo aho, dia tsy voatery ho hentitra be rehefa mampihatra ny fahefana nomen’ny Tompo ahy, ka hampahery fa tsy hanasazy.', 'izany no antony anoratako an’ireo zavatra ireo aminareo, dieny mbola tsy any aminareo aho. amin’izay rehefa eo aho, dia tsy voatery ho hentitra be rehefa mampihatra ny fahefana nomen’ny tompo ahy, ka hampahery fa tsy hanasazy.'),
  ('6ab25cbae537156c44d74339', '2026-09-22T10:47:22.847Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:22.847Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 13, 8, 'Fa tsy mahavita na inona na inona hanoherana ny fahamarinana izahay, fa ny hampandrosoana ny fahamarinana ihany.', 'fa tsy mahavita na inona na inona hanoherana ny fahamarinana izahay, fa ny hampandrosoana ny fahamarinana ihany.'),
  ('6ab25cbae537156c44d74338', '2026-09-22T10:47:22.847Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:22.847Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 13, 7, 'Mivavaka amin’Andriamanitra izahay mba tsy hanao ratsy ianareo. Tsy hoe te hahazo sitraka amin’olona akory izahay amin’izany, fa tianay hanao ny tsara kosa ianareo, na dia hoatran’ny hoe tsy ankasitrahana aza izahay.', 'mivavaka amin’andriamanitra izahay mba tsy hanao ratsy ianareo. tsy hoe te hahazo sitraka amin’olona akory izahay amin’izany, fa tianay hanao ny tsara kosa ianareo, na dia hoatran’ny hoe tsy ankasitrahana aza izahay.'),
  ('6ab25cbae537156c44d74335', '2026-09-22T10:47:22.847Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:22.847Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 13, 4, 'Fa novonoina teo amin’ny tsato-kazo tokoa izy tamin’izy nalemy, nefa velona kosa izy izao noho ny herin’Andriamanitra. Marina koa fa malemy hoatr’azy izahay, nefa ho velona hiaraka aminy izahay noho ny herin’Andriamanitra miasa aminareo.', 'fa novonoina teo amin’ny tsato-kazo tokoa izy tamin’izy nalemy, nefa velona kosa izy izao noho ny herin’andriamanitra. marina koa fa malemy hoatr’azy izahay, nefa ho velona hiaraka aminy izahay noho ny herin’andriamanitra miasa aminareo.'),
  ('6ab25cbae537156c44d74333', '2026-09-22T10:47:22.847Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:22.847Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Korintianina', 47, 13, 2, 'Na dia tsy any aminareo aza aho izao, dia ataovy toy ny hoe tonga any aminareo fanindroany. Ary efa ampitandremako mialoha ireo nanota teo aloha sy ny olon-kafa rehetra fa tsy hitsitsitsitsy an-dry zareo aho, raha tonga any indray.', 'na dia tsy any aminareo aza aho izao, dia ataovy toy ny hoe tonga any aminareo fanindroany. ary efa ampitandremako mialoha ireo nanota teo aloha sy ny olon-kafa rehetra fa tsy hitsitsitsitsy an-dry zareo aho, raha tonga any indray.'),
  ('6ab25cbb4c791aadc5bdef72', '2026-09-22T10:47:23.323Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:23.323Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Galatianina', 48, 1, 23, 'Ny zavatra henon’izy ireo matetika fotsiny dia hoe: “Ilay mpanenjika antsika taloha iny ange izao efa mitory ny vaovao tsara momba an’ilay finoana notadiaviny horavana taloha e!”', 'ny zavatra henon’izy ireo matetika fotsiny dia hoe: “ilay mpanenjika antsika taloha iny ange izao efa mitory ny vaovao tsara momba an’ilay finoana notadiaviny horavana taloha e!”'),
  ('6ab25cbb4c791aadc5bdef62', '2026-09-22T10:47:23.323Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:23.323Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Galatianina', 48, 1, 7, 'Tsy hoe misy vaovao tsara hafa anefa, fa misy olona manakorontana anareo sady te hamadika an’ilay vaovao tsara momba an’i Kristy.', 'tsy hoe misy vaovao tsara hafa anefa, fa misy olona manakorontana anareo sady te hamadika an’ilay vaovao tsara momba an’i kristy.'),
  ('6ab25cbb4c791aadc5bdef73', '2026-09-22T10:47:23.323Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:23.323Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Galatianina', 48, 1, 24, 'Dia nanome voninahitra an’Andriamanitra izy ireo rehefa fantany izay nitranga tamiko.', 'dia nanome voninahitra an’andriamanitra izy ireo rehefa fantany izay nitranga tamiko.'),
  ('6ab25cbb4c791aadc5bdef6b', '2026-09-22T10:47:23.323Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:23.323Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Galatianina', 48, 1, 16, 'ny hampiasana ahy mba hampahafantatra ny momba an’ilay Zanany, izany hoe mba hitory ny vaovao tsara momba azy any amin’ny hafa firenena, dia tsy tonga dia nanontany olona aho.', 'ny hampiasana ahy mba hampahafantatra ny momba an’ilay zanany, izany hoe mba hitory ny vaovao tsara momba azy any amin’ny hafa firenena, dia tsy tonga dia nanontany olona aho.'),
  ('6ab25cbb4c791aadc5bdef68', '2026-09-22T10:47:23.323Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:23.323Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Galatianina', 48, 1, 13, 'Mazava ho azy fa efa henonareo ny nataoko tamin’izaho mbola nanaraka ny Fivavahan’ny Jiosy. Fa tena nanenjika mafy ny fiangonan’Andriamanitra aho sady nandravarava azy.', 'mazava ho azy fa efa henonareo ny nataoko tamin’izaho mbola nanaraka ny fivavahan’ny jiosy. fa tena nanenjika mafy ny fiangonan’andriamanitra aho sady nandravarava azy.'),
  ('6ab25cbb4c791aadc5bdef64', '2026-09-22T10:47:23.323Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:23.323Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Galatianina', 48, 1, 9, 'Araka ny efa nolazainay teo, dia mbola averiko indray hoe: Izay mitory vaovao tsara aminareo ankoatra an’ilay efa noraisinareo, dia enga anie izy ho voaozona!', 'araka ny efa nolazainay teo, dia mbola averiko indray hoe: izay mitory vaovao tsara aminareo ankoatra an’ilay efa noraisinareo, dia enga anie izy ho voaozona!'),
  ('6ab25cbb4c791aadc5bdef60', '2026-09-22T10:47:23.323Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:23.323Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Galatianina', 48, 1, 5, 'Ho an’Andriamanitra anie ny voninahitra mandrakizay mandrakizay! Amena.', 'ho an’andriamanitra anie ny voninahitra mandrakizay mandrakizay! amena.'),
  ('6ab25cbb4c791aadc5bdef5f', '2026-09-22T10:47:23.323Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:23.323Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Galatianina', 48, 1, 4, 'Nahafoy ny ainy noho ny fahotantsika izy mba hamonjeny antsika amin’izao tontolo ratsy izao, satria izany no sitrapon’ilay Andriamanitra Raintsika.', 'nahafoy ny ainy noho ny fahotantsika izy mba hamonjeny antsika amin’izao tontolo ratsy izao, satria izany no sitrapon’ilay andriamanitra raintsika.'),
  ('6ab25cbb4c791aadc5bdef6c', '2026-09-22T10:47:23.323Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:23.323Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Galatianina', 48, 1, 17, 'Tsy niakatra tany Jerosalema tany amin’ireo apostoly talohako koa aho, fa nankany Arabia, dia avy eo niverina tany Damaskosy.', 'tsy niakatra tany jerosalema tany amin’ireo apostoly talohako koa aho, fa nankany arabia, dia avy eo niverina tany damaskosy.'),
  ('6ab25cbb4c791aadc5bdef65', '2026-09-22T10:47:23.323Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:23.323Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Galatianina', 48, 1, 10, 'Angaha moa amin’olona aho no mitady sitraka fa tsy amin’Andriamanitra? Sa izaho te hampifaly olona? Raha mbola ny hampifaly olona mantsy no tadiaviko, dia tsy mpanompon’i Kristy aho.', 'angaha moa amin’olona aho no mitady sitraka fa tsy amin’andriamanitra? sa izaho te hampifaly olona? raha mbola ny hampifaly olona mantsy no tadiaviko, dia tsy mpanompon’i kristy aho.'),
  ('6ab25cbb4c791aadc5bdef6f', '2026-09-22T10:47:23.323Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:23.323Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Galatianina', 48, 1, 20, 'Manome toky anareo eto anatrehan’Andriamanitra àry aho fa tsy lainga izao zavatra soratako aminareo izao.', 'manome toky anareo eto anatrehan’andriamanitra àry aho fa tsy lainga izao zavatra soratako aminareo izao.'),
  ('6ab25cbb4c791aadc5bdef66', '2026-09-22T10:47:23.323Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:23.323Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Galatianina', 48, 1, 11, 'Fa tiako ho fantatrareo, ry rahalahy, fa tsy avy tamin’olombelona ilay vaovao tsara notoriko taminareo.', 'fa tiako ho fantatrareo, ry rahalahy, fa tsy avy tamin’olombelona ilay vaovao tsara notoriko taminareo.'),
  ('6ab25cbb4c791aadc5bdef71', '2026-09-22T10:47:23.323Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:23.323Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Galatianina', 48, 1, 22, 'Mbola tsy nahita ahy mivantana anefa ny fiangonana tany Jodia, izay tafaray amin’i Kristy.', 'mbola tsy nahita ahy mivantana anefa ny fiangonana tany jodia, izay tafaray amin’i kristy.'),
  ('6ab25cbb4c791aadc5bdef6d', '2026-09-22T10:47:23.323Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:23.323Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Galatianina', 48, 1, 18, 'Telo taona tatỳ aoriana aho vao niakatra tany Jerosalema mba hitsidika an’i Kefasy, ka nijanona 15 andro tany aminy.', 'telo taona tatỳ aoriana aho vao niakatra tany jerosalema mba hitsidika an’i kefasy, ka nijanona 15 andro tany aminy.'),
  ('6ab25cbb4c791aadc5bdef5e', '2026-09-22T10:47:23.323Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:23.323Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Galatianina', 48, 1, 3, 'Enga anie ilay Andriamanitra Raintsika sy Jesosy Kristy Tompo mba haneho hatsaram-panahy miavaka aminareo sady hanome fiadanana anareo!', 'enga anie ilay andriamanitra raintsika sy jesosy kristy tompo mba haneho hatsaram-panahy miavaka aminareo sady hanome fiadanana anareo!'),
  ('6ab25cbb4c791aadc5bdef70', '2026-09-22T10:47:23.323Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:23.323Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Galatianina', 48, 1, 21, 'Nankany amin’ny faritr’i Syria sy Kilikia aho taorian’izay.', 'nankany amin’ny faritr’i syria sy kilikia aho taorian’izay.'),
  ('6ab25cbb4c791aadc5bdef61', '2026-09-22T10:47:23.323Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:23.323Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Galatianina', 48, 1, 6, 'Gaga aho hoe izao sahady ianareo dia efa miala amin’Ilay niantso anareo tamin’ny alalan’ny hatsaram-panahy miavaka nasehon’i Kristy, ka lasa manaraka vaovao tsara hafa.', 'gaga aho hoe izao sahady ianareo dia efa miala amin’ilay niantso anareo tamin’ny alalan’ny hatsaram-panahy miavaka nasehon’i kristy, ka lasa manaraka vaovao tsara hafa.'),
  ('6ab25cbb4c791aadc5bdef69', '2026-09-22T10:47:23.323Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:23.323Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Galatianina', 48, 1, 14, 'Tena mpanaraka ny Fivavahan’ny Jiosy hiringiriny aho, mihoatra noho ny ankamaroan’ny olona nitovy taona tamiko teo amin’ny fireneko. Nafana fo be nanaraka ny fampianarana nolovako avy tamin’ny razambeko mantsy aho.', 'tena mpanaraka ny fivavahan’ny jiosy hiringiriny aho, mihoatra noho ny ankamaroan’ny olona nitovy taona tamiko teo amin’ny fireneko. nafana fo be nanaraka ny fampianarana nolovako avy tamin’ny razambeko mantsy aho.'),
  ('6ab25cbb4c791aadc5bdef67', '2026-09-22T10:47:23.323Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:23.323Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Galatianina', 48, 1, 12, 'Tsy azoko tamin’olona mantsy ilay izy sady tsy nampianarina ahy, fa nampahafantarin’i Jesosy Kristy ahy.', 'tsy azoko tamin’olona mantsy ilay izy sady tsy nampianarina ahy, fa nampahafantarin’i jesosy kristy ahy.'),
  ('6ab25cbb4c791aadc5bdef5d', '2026-09-22T10:47:23.323Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:23.323Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Galatianina', 48, 1, 2, 'sy avy amin’ny rahalahy rehetra miaraka amiko. Ho an’ny fiangonana any Galatia,', 'sy avy amin’ny rahalahy rehetra miaraka amiko. ho an’ny fiangonana any galatia,'),
  ('6ab25cbb4c791aadc5bdef6a', '2026-09-22T10:47:23.323Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:23.323Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Galatianina', 48, 1, 15, 'Fa ilay Andriamanitra nahatonga ahy ho teraka no niantso ahy noho ny hatsaram-panahiny miavaka. Ary rehefa hitany fa mety', 'fa ilay andriamanitra nahatonga ahy ho teraka no niantso ahy noho ny hatsaram-panahiny miavaka. ary rehefa hitany fa mety'),
  ('6ab25cbb4c791aadc5bdef63', '2026-09-22T10:47:23.323Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:23.323Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Galatianina', 48, 1, 8, 'Na izahay anefa na anjely avy any an-danitra no mitory vaovao tsara aminareo ankoatra an’ilay vaovao tsara efa notorinay taminareo, dia enga anie ho voaozona!', 'na izahay anefa na anjely avy any an-danitra no mitory vaovao tsara aminareo ankoatra an’ilay vaovao tsara efa notorinay taminareo, dia enga anie ho voaozona!'),
  ('6ab25cbb4c791aadc5bdef6e', '2026-09-22T10:47:23.323Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:23.323Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Galatianina', 48, 1, 19, 'Tsy nahita apostoly hafa mihitsy anefa aho, fa i Jakoba rahalahin’ny Tompo ihany no hitako.', 'tsy nahita apostoly hafa mihitsy anefa aho, fa i jakoba rahalahin’ny tompo ihany no hitako.'),
  ('6ab25cbb4c791aadc5bdef5c', '2026-09-22T10:47:23.323Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:23.323Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Galatianina', 48, 1, 1, 'Avy amin’i Paoly, apostoly tsy notendren’olona, na notendrena tamin’ny alalan’olona, fa notendren’i Jesosy Kristy sy Andriamanitra Ray, ilay nanangana azy tamin’ny maty,', 'avy amin’i paoly, apostoly tsy notendren’olona, na notendrena tamin’ny alalan’olona, fa notendren’i jesosy kristy sy andriamanitra ray, ilay nanangana azy tamin’ny maty,'),
  ('6ab25cbc178e55ab1e9bec7e', '2026-09-22T10:47:24.032Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:24.032Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Galatianina', 48, 2, 9, 'ary rehefa fantatr’izy ireo fa nanehoana hatsaram-panahy miavaka aho, dia nanolotra ny tanany ankavanana taminay sy Barnabasy i Jakoba sy Kefasy ary Jaona, izay hoatran’ny hoe andrin’ny fiangonana. Nanao an’izany izy ireo mba ho marika fa mpiara-miasa daholo izahay. Amin’izay dia handeha any amin’ny hafa firenena izahay, fa izy ireo kosa any amin’ny voafora.', 'ary rehefa fantatr’izy ireo fa nanehoana hatsaram-panahy miavaka aho, dia nanolotra ny tanany ankavanana taminay sy barnabasy i jakoba sy kefasy ary jaona, izay hoatran’ny hoe andrin’ny fiangonana. nanao an’izany izy ireo mba ho marika fa mpiara-miasa daholo izahay. amin’izay dia handeha any amin’ny hafa firenena izahay, fa izy ireo kosa any amin’ny voafora.'),
  ('6ab25cbc178e55ab1e9bec7d', '2026-09-22T10:47:24.032Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:24.032Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Galatianina', 48, 2, 8, '—ilay nanome fahefana an’i Petera ho lasa apostolin’ny voafora mantsy no nanome fahefana ahy ho lasa apostolin’ny hafa firenena koa—', '—ilay nanome fahefana an’i petera ho lasa apostolin’ny voafora mantsy no nanome fahefana ahy ho lasa apostolin’ny hafa firenena koa—'),
  ('6ab25cbc178e55ab1e9bec7b', '2026-09-22T10:47:24.032Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:24.032Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Galatianina', 48, 2, 6, 'Fa raha ny amin’ireo rahalahy hoatran’ny hoe ambony ireo kosa,—tsy zava-dehibe amiko ny hoe hoatran’ny ahoana izy ireo taloha, satria tsy mijery tavan’olona Andriamanitra—dia tsy nampianatra ahy zava-baovao ireo rahalahy nohajaina be ireo.', 'fa raha ny amin’ireo rahalahy hoatran’ny hoe ambony ireo kosa,—tsy zava-dehibe amiko ny hoe hoatran’ny ahoana izy ireo taloha, satria tsy mijery tavan’olona andriamanitra—dia tsy nampianatra ahy zava-baovao ireo rahalahy nohajaina be ireo.'),
  ('6ab25cbc178e55ab1e9bec81', '2026-09-22T10:47:24.032Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:24.032Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Galatianina', 48, 2, 12, 'Niara-nisakafo tamin’ny hafa firenena mantsy izy tamin’ny mbola tsy tonga ny olona nirahin’i Jakoba. Rehefa tonga anefa izy ireny, dia tsy nanao an’izany intsony izy fa niala teo amin’izy ireo, noho izy natahotra ny voafora.', 'niara-nisakafo tamin’ny hafa firenena mantsy izy tamin’ny mbola tsy tonga ny olona nirahin’i jakoba. rehefa tonga anefa izy ireny, dia tsy nanao an’izany intsony izy fa niala teo amin’izy ireo, noho izy natahotra ny voafora.'),
  ('6ab25cbc178e55ab1e9bec86', '2026-09-22T10:47:24.032Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:24.032Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Galatianina', 48, 2, 17, 'Fa raha hita hoe mpanota koa isika, nefa isika efa miezaka mba ho azo ambara hoe olo-marina amin’ny alalan’i Kristy, dia midika ve izany hoe mpanompon’ny ota i Kristy? Sanatria izany!', 'fa raha hita hoe mpanota koa isika, nefa isika efa miezaka mba ho azo ambara hoe olo-marina amin’ny alalan’i kristy, dia midika ve izany hoe mpanompon’ny ota i kristy? sanatria izany!'),
  ('6ab25cbc178e55ab1e9bec76', '2026-09-22T10:47:24.032Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:24.032Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Galatianina', 48, 2, 1, 'Rehefa afaka 14 taona, dia niara-niakatra tamin’i Barnabasy tany Jerosalema indray aho, ary nentiko koa i Titosy.', 'rehefa afaka 14 taona, dia niara-niakatra tamin’i barnabasy tany jerosalema indray aho, ary nentiko koa i titosy.'),
  ('6ab25cbc178e55ab1e9bec78', '2026-09-22T10:47:24.032Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:24.032Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Galatianina', 48, 2, 3, 'Na i Titosy ilay niaraka tamiko aza, tsy noterena hoforana nefa Grika.', 'na i titosy ilay niaraka tamiko aza, tsy noterena hoforana nefa grika.'),
  ('6ab25cbc178e55ab1e9bec80', '2026-09-22T10:47:24.032Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:24.032Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Galatianina', 48, 2, 11, 'Rehefa tonga tany Antiokia anefa i Kefasy, dia noteneniko mivantana izy, satria tena hita fa diso.', 'rehefa tonga tany antiokia anefa i kefasy, dia noteneniko mivantana izy, satria tena hita fa diso.'),
  ('6ab25cbc178e55ab1e9bec7c', '2026-09-22T10:47:24.032Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:24.032Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Galatianina', 48, 2, 7, 'Rehefa hitan’izy ireo kosa fa efa nankinina tamiko ny fitoriana ny vaovao tsara tamin’ny tsy voafora, toy ny nanankinana tamin’i Petera ny fitoriana tamin’ny voafora,', 'rehefa hitan’izy ireo kosa fa efa nankinina tamiko ny fitoriana ny vaovao tsara tamin’ny tsy voafora, toy ny nanankinana tamin’i petera ny fitoriana tamin’ny voafora,'),
  ('6ab25cbc178e55ab1e9bec83', '2026-09-22T10:47:24.032Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:24.032Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Galatianina', 48, 2, 14, 'Rehefa hitako anefa hoe tsy nanao zavatra mifanaraka amin’ny fahamarinan’ny vaovao tsara izy ireo, dia hoy aho tamin’i Kefasy teo anatrehan’ny rehetra: “Raha ianao izay Jiosy aza manao hoatran’ny hafa firenena, fa tsy hoatran’ny Jiosy, dia maninona no terenao hanaraka ny fanaon’ny Jiosy ny hafa firenena?”', 'rehefa hitako anefa hoe tsy nanao zavatra mifanaraka amin’ny fahamarinan’ny vaovao tsara izy ireo, dia hoy aho tamin’i kefasy teo anatrehan’ny rehetra: “raha ianao izay jiosy aza manao hoatran’ny hafa firenena, fa tsy hoatran’ny jiosy, dia maninona no terenao hanaraka ny fanaon’ny jiosy ny hafa firenena?”'),
  ('6ab25cbc178e55ab1e9bec7a', '2026-09-22T10:47:24.032Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:24.032Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Galatianina', 48, 2, 5, 'Tsy nilefitra tamin’izy ireny na nanaiky azy izahay, na dia vetivety fotsiny aza, mba ho eo aminareo foana ny fahamarinana, izany hoe ny vaovao tsara.', 'tsy nilefitra tamin’izy ireny na nanaiky azy izahay, na dia vetivety fotsiny aza, mba ho eo aminareo foana ny fahamarinana, izany hoe ny vaovao tsara.'),
  ('6ab25cbc178e55ab1e9bec84', '2026-09-22T10:47:24.032Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:24.032Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Galatianina', 48, 2, 15, 'Jiosy tena Jiosy isika, fa tsy mpanota avy amin’ny hafa firenena,', 'jiosy tena jiosy isika, fa tsy mpanota avy amin’ny hafa firenena,'),
  ('6ab25cbc178e55ab1e9bec77', '2026-09-22T10:47:24.032Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:24.032Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Galatianina', 48, 2, 2, 'Niakatra tany aho satria nisy zavatra naharihary tamiko. Dia novelabelariko tamin’izy ireo ny vaovao tsara toriko amin’ny hafa firenena. Teo anatrehan’ireo rahalahy nohajaina be ihany anefa no nanaovako an’izany, mba ho azo antoka hoe tsy very maina ilay hazakazaka nataoko tamin’izany, na ilay efa nataoko taloha.', 'niakatra tany aho satria nisy zavatra naharihary tamiko. dia novelabelariko tamin’izy ireo ny vaovao tsara toriko amin’ny hafa firenena. teo anatrehan’ireo rahalahy nohajaina be ihany anefa no nanaovako an’izany, mba ho azo antoka hoe tsy very maina ilay hazakazaka nataoko tamin’izany, na ilay efa nataoko taloha.'),
  ('6ab25cbc178e55ab1e9bec85', '2026-09-22T10:47:24.032Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:24.032Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Galatianina', 48, 2, 16, 'ary fantatsika fa izay olona mino an’i Jesosy Kristy ihany no ambara hoe marina, fa tsy izay mankatò lalàna. Dia nino an’i Kristy Jesosy isika, mba hambara hoe marina satria mino an’i Kristy fa tsy hoe mankatò lalàna. Fa tsy hisy olona hambara hoe marina satria fotsiny hoe mankatò lalàna.', 'ary fantatsika fa izay olona mino an’i jesosy kristy ihany no ambara hoe marina, fa tsy izay mankatò lalàna. dia nino an’i kristy jesosy isika, mba hambara hoe marina satria mino an’i kristy fa tsy hoe mankatò lalàna. fa tsy hisy olona hambara hoe marina satria fotsiny hoe mankatò lalàna.'),
  ('6ab25cbc178e55ab1e9bec79', '2026-09-22T10:47:24.032Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:24.032Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Galatianina', 48, 2, 4, 'Nampisy olana anefa izany, satria nisy rahalahy sandoka nampidirina mangingina teo amintsika. Nitsofoka mangingina izy ireny mba hitsikilo antsika satria te hanakantsakana an’ilay fahafahana ananantsika noho isika mpianatr’i Kristy Jesosy. Tian’izy ireny handevozina tanteraka mantsy isika.', 'nampisy olana anefa izany, satria nisy rahalahy sandoka nampidirina mangingina teo amintsika. nitsofoka mangingina izy ireny mba hitsikilo antsika satria te hanakantsakana an’ilay fahafahana ananantsika noho isika mpianatr’i kristy jesosy. tian’izy ireny handevozina tanteraka mantsy isika.'),
  ('6ab25cbc178e55ab1e9bec87', '2026-09-22T10:47:24.032Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:24.032Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Galatianina', 48, 2, 18, 'Fa raha ny zavatra efa narodako no atsangako indray, dia asehoko amin’izany fa mpandika lalàna aho.', 'fa raha ny zavatra efa narodako no atsangako indray, dia asehoko amin’izany fa mpandika lalàna aho.'),
  ('6ab25cbc178e55ab1e9bec82', '2026-09-22T10:47:24.032Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:24.032Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Galatianina', 48, 2, 13, 'Dia lasa nihatsaravelatsihy niaraka taminy koa ny Jiosy hafa rehetra, ka na i Barnabasy aza mba voataonan’izy ireo hihatsaravelatsihy koa.', 'dia lasa nihatsaravelatsihy niaraka taminy koa ny jiosy hafa rehetra, ka na i barnabasy aza mba voataonan’izy ireo hihatsaravelatsihy koa.'),
  ('6ab25cbc178e55ab1e9bec7f', '2026-09-22T10:47:24.032Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:24.032Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Galatianina', 48, 2, 10, 'Fa notenenin’izy ireo fotsiny izahay hoe tsarovy foana ny mahantra. Ary izany mihitsy no efa iezahako mafy atao izao.', 'fa notenenin’izy ireo fotsiny izahay hoe tsarovy foana ny mahantra. ary izany mihitsy no efa iezahako mafy atao izao.'),
  ('6ab25cbc178e55ab1e9bec89', '2026-09-22T10:47:24.033Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:24.033Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Galatianina', 48, 2, 20, 'Voafantsika eo amin’ny tsato-kazo miaraka amin’i Kristy aho. Tsy izaho intsony no velona fa i Kristy no velona sy tafaray amiko. Fa amin’izao izaho mbola nofo aman-dra izao, dia miaina mifanaraka amin’ny finoako an’ilay Zanak’Andriamanitra aho, dia ilay tia ahy ka nanolotra ny tenany ho ahy.', 'voafantsika eo amin’ny tsato-kazo miaraka amin’i kristy aho. tsy izaho intsony no velona fa i kristy no velona sy tafaray amiko. fa amin’izao izaho mbola nofo aman-dra izao, dia miaina mifanaraka amin’ny finoako an’ilay zanak’andriamanitra aho, dia ilay tia ahy ka nanolotra ny tenany ho ahy.'),
  ('6ab25cbc178e55ab1e9bec8a', '2026-09-22T10:47:24.033Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:24.033Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Galatianina', 48, 2, 21, 'Ary tsy mandà ny hatsaram-panahy miavaka asehon’ Andriamanitra aho, fa raha ny lalàna no anambarana olona hoe marina, dia matimaty foana i Kristy.', 'ary tsy mandà ny hatsaram-panahy miavaka asehon’ andriamanitra aho, fa raha ny lalàna no anambarana olona hoe marina, dia matimaty foana i kristy.'),
  ('6ab25cbc178e55ab1e9bec88', '2026-09-22T10:47:24.033Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:24.033Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Galatianina', 48, 2, 19, 'Fa nankatò lalàna aho, ka efa maty raha ny amin’ny lalàna, dia amin’izay aho velona ho an’Andriamanitra.', 'fa nankatò lalàna aho, ka efa maty raha ny amin’ny lalàna, dia amin’izay aho velona ho an’andriamanitra.'),
  ('6ab25cbc520a731806598578', '2026-09-22T10:47:24.517Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:24.517Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Galatianina', 48, 3, 27, 'Nanahaka an’i Kristy daholo mantsy ianareo natao batisa tao amin’i Kristy.', 'nanahaka an’i kristy daholo mantsy ianareo natao batisa tao amin’i kristy.'),
  ('6ab25cbc520a731806598569', '2026-09-22T10:47:24.517Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:24.517Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Galatianina', 48, 3, 12, 'Ary tsy mitaky finoana ny Lalàna. Fa “izay olona mankatò an’ireny no ho velona amin’ny alalan’ireny.”', 'ary tsy mitaky finoana ny lalàna. fa “izay olona mankatò an’ireny no ho velona amin’ny alalan’ireny.”'),
  ('6ab25cbc520a731806598577', '2026-09-22T10:47:24.517Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:24.517Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Galatianina', 48, 3, 26, 'Raha ny tena izy, dia zanak’Andriamanitra daholo ianareo satria mino an’i Kristy Jesosy.', 'raha ny tena izy, dia zanak’andriamanitra daholo ianareo satria mino an’i kristy jesosy.'),
  ('6ab25cbc520a731806598575', '2026-09-22T10:47:24.517Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:24.517Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Galatianina', 48, 3, 24, 'Lasa mpitaiza antsika àry ny Lalàna ka nitarika antsika ho amin’i Kristy, mba ho azo ambara hoe marina isika satria mino.', 'lasa mpitaiza antsika àry ny lalàna ka nitarika antsika ho amin’i kristy, mba ho azo ambara hoe marina isika satria mino.'),
  ('6ab25cbc520a73180659857a', '2026-09-22T10:47:24.517Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:24.517Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Galatianina', 48, 3, 29, 'Raha an’i Kristy koa ianareo, dia tena taranak’i Abrahama, sady handova an’izay nampanantenaina azy.', 'raha an’i kristy koa ianareo, dia tena taranak’i abrahama, sady handova an’izay nampanantenaina azy.'),
  ('6ab25cbc520a731806598570', '2026-09-22T10:47:24.517Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:24.517Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Galatianina', 48, 3, 19, 'Inona àry no nilana ny Lalàna? Natao fanampiny izy io mba hampibaribary ny fandikan-dalàna, mandra-pahatongan’ilay taranaka nanaovana an’ilay fampanantenana. Ary nampitaina tamin’ny alalan’ny anjely ny Lalàna, ka natolotra teo an-tanan’ny mpanelanelana iray.', 'inona àry no nilana ny lalàna? natao fanampiny izy io mba hampibaribary ny fandikan-dalàna, mandra-pahatongan’ilay taranaka nanaovana an’ilay fampanantenana. ary nampitaina tamin’ny alalan’ny anjely ny lalàna, ka natolotra teo an-tanan’ny mpanelanelana iray.'),
  ('6ab25cbc520a731806598567', '2026-09-22T10:47:24.517Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:24.517Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Galatianina', 48, 3, 10, 'Voaozona izay rehetra miantehitra amin’ny lalàna fotsiny, satria voasoratra hoe: “Voaozona izay lasa tsy mankatò an’izay rehetra voasoratra ao amin’ny horonam-boky misy ny Lalàna.”', 'voaozona izay rehetra miantehitra amin’ny lalàna fotsiny, satria voasoratra hoe: “voaozona izay lasa tsy mankatò an’izay rehetra voasoratra ao amin’ny horonam-boky misy ny lalàna.”'),
  ('6ab25cbc520a731806598566', '2026-09-22T10:47:24.517Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:24.517Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Galatianina', 48, 3, 9, 'Ny olona manam-pinoana àry dia tahina hoatran’i Abrahama, izay nino.', 'ny olona manam-pinoana àry dia tahina hoatran’i abrahama, izay nino.'),
  ('6ab25cbc520a73180659856f', '2026-09-22T10:47:24.517Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:24.517Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Galatianina', 48, 3, 18, 'Raha noho ny fankatoavana lalàna no ahazoana ny lova, dia tsy noho ny fampanantenana intsony no ahazoana an’ilay izy. Tsara fanahy anefa Andriamanitra ka nomeny an’i Abrahama tamin’ny alalan’ny fampanantenana ilay lova.', 'raha noho ny fankatoavana lalàna no ahazoana ny lova, dia tsy noho ny fampanantenana intsony no ahazoana an’ilay izy. tsara fanahy anefa andriamanitra ka nomeny an’i abrahama tamin’ny alalan’ny fampanantenana ilay lova.'),
  ('6ab25cbc520a731806598565', '2026-09-22T10:47:24.517Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:24.517Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Galatianina', 48, 3, 8, 'Efa hitan’ny Soratra Masina mialoha fa hambaran’Andriamanitra hoe marina ny hafa firenena satria mino. Dia nolazain’ny Soratra Masina mialoha tamin’i Abrahama ilay vaovao tsara hoe: “Amin’ny alalanao no hitahiana ny firenena rehetra.”', 'efa hitan’ny soratra masina mialoha fa hambaran’andriamanitra hoe marina ny hafa firenena satria mino. dia nolazain’ny soratra masina mialoha tamin’i abrahama ilay vaovao tsara hoe: “amin’ny alalanao no hitahiana ny firenena rehetra.”'),
  ('6ab25cbc520a731806598571', '2026-09-22T10:47:24.517Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:24.517Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Galatianina', 48, 3, 20, 'Fa tsy ilaina ny mpanelanelana raha olona iray ihany no voakasika. Andriamanitra irery anefa no nanao an’ilay fampanantenana.', 'fa tsy ilaina ny mpanelanelana raha olona iray ihany no voakasika. andriamanitra irery anefa no nanao an’ilay fampanantenana.'),
  ('6ab25cbc520a73180659856b', '2026-09-22T10:47:24.517Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:24.517Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Galatianina', 48, 3, 14, 'Amin’izay mantsy ny fitahiana azon’i Abrahama dia ho azon’ny firenena hafa koa, amin’ny alalan’i Kristy Jesosy, mba hahazoantsika an’ilay fanahy nampanantenaina, noho isika mino.', 'amin’izay mantsy ny fitahiana azon’i abrahama dia ho azon’ny firenena hafa koa, amin’ny alalan’i kristy jesosy, mba hahazoantsika an’ilay fanahy nampanantenaina, noho isika mino.'),
  ('6ab25cbc520a731806598561', '2026-09-22T10:47:24.517Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:24.517Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Galatianina', 48, 3, 4, 'Dia ho very maina fotsiny ve ny niaretanareo fahoriana be dia be hoatr’ireny? Tsy ho very maina kosa angamba izany!', 'dia ho very maina fotsiny ve ny niaretanareo fahoriana be dia be hoatr’ireny? tsy ho very maina kosa angamba izany!'),
  ('6ab25cbc520a731806598579', '2026-09-22T10:47:24.517Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:24.517Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Galatianina', 48, 3, 28, 'Tsy misy intsony ny hoe Jiosy na Grika, na andevo na olona afaka, na lahy na vavy. Fa olona iray ihany ianareo rehetra sady tafaray amin’i Kristy Jesosy.', 'tsy misy intsony ny hoe jiosy na grika, na andevo na olona afaka, na lahy na vavy. fa olona iray ihany ianareo rehetra sady tafaray amin’i kristy jesosy.'),
  ('6ab25cbc520a73180659856e', '2026-09-22T10:47:24.517Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:24.517Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Galatianina', 48, 3, 17, 'Izao koa no teniko: Tsy hoe nanafoana an’ilay fifanekena nataon’Andriamanitra taloha ilay Lalàna nomeny 430 taona tatỳ aoriana, ka hoe foana koa ilay fampanantenana.', 'izao koa no teniko: tsy hoe nanafoana an’ilay fifanekena nataon’andriamanitra taloha ilay lalàna nomeny 430 taona tatỳ aoriana, ka hoe foana koa ilay fampanantenana.'),
  ('6ab25cbc520a731806598562', '2026-09-22T10:47:24.517Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:24.517Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Galatianina', 48, 3, 5, 'Izao àry: Ilay manome fanahy masina anareo sady manao fahagagana eo aminareo ve manao an’izany noho ianareo mankatò lalàna, sa noho ianareo mino an’izay henonareo?', 'izao àry: ilay manome fanahy masina anareo sady manao fahagagana eo aminareo ve manao an’izany noho ianareo mankatò lalàna, sa noho ianareo mino an’izay henonareo?'),
  ('6ab25cbc520a73180659856d', '2026-09-22T10:47:24.517Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:24.517Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Galatianina', 48, 3, 16, 'I Abrahama sy ny taranany no nilazana ny fampanantenana. Tsy nolazaina anefa hoe “ary ho an’ireo taranakao”, izany hoe ho an’olona be dia be, fa hoe “ary ho an’ny taranakao”, izany hoe ho an’olona tokana, dia i Kristy.', 'i abrahama sy ny taranany no nilazana ny fampanantenana. tsy nolazaina anefa hoe “ary ho an’ireo taranakao”, izany hoe ho an’olona be dia be, fa hoe “ary ho an’ny taranakao”, izany hoe ho an’olona tokana, dia i kristy.'),
  ('6ab25cbc520a731806598563', '2026-09-22T10:47:24.517Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:24.517Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Galatianina', 48, 3, 6, 'Eritrereto koa i Abrahama: “Naneho finoana an’i Jehovah izy, ka nekena hoe olo-marina.”', 'eritrereto koa i abrahama: “naneho finoana an’i jehovah izy, ka nekena hoe olo-marina.”'),
  ('6ab25cbc520a731806598560', '2026-09-22T10:47:24.517Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:24.517Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Galatianina', 48, 3, 3, 'Tena tsy misaina mihitsy ve ianareo e? Efa mba nanaiky hotarihin’ny fanahy ihany ve ianareo tamin’ny voalohany, nefa dia izao manaraka fisainan’olombelona izao no iafaranareo?', 'tena tsy misaina mihitsy ve ianareo e? efa mba nanaiky hotarihin’ny fanahy ihany ve ianareo tamin’ny voalohany, nefa dia izao manaraka fisainan’olombelona izao no iafaranareo?'),
  ('6ab25cbc520a731806598573', '2026-09-22T10:47:24.517Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:24.517Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Galatianina', 48, 3, 22, 'Nasehon’ny Soratra Masina anefa hoe fehezin’ny ota daholo ny zava-drehetra. Amin’izay ilay fampanantenana avy amin’ny finoana an’i Jesosy Kristy dia homena an’izay maneho finoana.', 'nasehon’ny soratra masina anefa hoe fehezin’ny ota daholo ny zava-drehetra. amin’izay ilay fampanantenana avy amin’ny finoana an’i jesosy kristy dia homena an’izay maneho finoana.'),
  ('6ab25cbc520a731806598572', '2026-09-22T10:47:24.517Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:24.517Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Galatianina', 48, 3, 21, 'Mifanohitra amin’ny fampanantenan’Andriamanitra àry ve ny Lalàna? Sanatria izany! Fa raha nisy lalàna nahavita nanome fiainana, dia ho efa lasa olo-marina ny olona noho ny lalàna.', 'mifanohitra amin’ny fampanantenan’andriamanitra àry ve ny lalàna? sanatria izany! fa raha nisy lalàna nahavita nanome fiainana, dia ho efa lasa olo-marina ny olona noho ny lalàna.'),
  ('6ab25cbc520a73180659855e', '2026-09-22T10:47:24.517Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:24.517Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Galatianina', 48, 3, 1, 'Ry Galatianina tsy misaina! Iza no namitaka anareo, nefa efa mba nohazavaina tsara taminareo ihany hoe nofantsihana teo amin’ny tsato-kazo i Jesosy Kristy?', 'ry galatianina tsy misaina! iza no namitaka anareo, nefa efa mba nohazavaina tsara taminareo ihany hoe nofantsihana teo amin’ny tsato-kazo i jesosy kristy?'),
  ('6ab25cbc520a731806598576', '2026-09-22T10:47:24.517Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:24.517Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Galatianina', 48, 3, 25, 'Efa tonga anefa izao ny finoana, ka tsy fehezin’ny mpitaiza intsony isika.', 'efa tonga anefa izao ny finoana, ka tsy fehezin’ny mpitaiza intsony isika.'),
  ('6ab25cbc520a73180659856c', '2026-09-22T10:47:24.517Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:24.517Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Galatianina', 48, 3, 15, 'Fanoharana fahita isan’andro no ampiasaiko, ry rahalahy: Raha vao manan-kery ny fifanekena, na dia olona iray ihany aza no nampanan-kery azy, dia tsy misy manafoana na manampy an’ilay izy.', 'fanoharana fahita isan’andro no ampiasaiko, ry rahalahy: raha vao manan-kery ny fifanekena, na dia olona iray ihany aza no nampanan-kery azy, dia tsy misy manafoana na manampy an’ilay izy.'),
  ('6ab25cbc520a73180659856a', '2026-09-22T10:47:24.517Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:24.517Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Galatianina', 48, 3, 13, 'Nividy antsika i Kristy, ka nanafaka antsika tamin’ny ozon’ny Lalàna rehefa nanaiky ho voaozona hisolo antsika. Fa voasoratra hoe: “Voaozona izay mihantona eo amin’ny tsato-kazo.”', 'nividy antsika i kristy, ka nanafaka antsika tamin’ny ozon’ny lalàna rehefa nanaiky ho voaozona hisolo antsika. fa voasoratra hoe: “voaozona izay mihantona eo amin’ny tsato-kazo.”'),
  ('6ab25cbc520a73180659855f', '2026-09-22T10:47:24.517Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:24.517Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Galatianina', 48, 3, 2, 'Izao ihany no tiako hanontaniana anareo: Noho ianareo nankatò lalàna ve no nahazoanareo ny fanahy masina, sa noho ianareo nino an’izay henonareo?', 'izao ihany no tiako hanontaniana anareo: noho ianareo nankatò lalàna ve no nahazoanareo ny fanahy masina, sa noho ianareo nino an’izay henonareo?'),
  ('6ab25cbc520a731806598574', '2026-09-22T10:47:24.517Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:24.517Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Galatianina', 48, 3, 23, 'Tamin’ny mbola tsy tonga anefa ny finoana, dia niambina antsika ny Lalàna ka lasa nofeheziny isika. Ary niandry an’ilay finoana izay efa haharihary isika.', 'tamin’ny mbola tsy tonga anefa ny finoana, dia niambina antsika ny lalàna ka lasa nofeheziny isika. ary niandry an’ilay finoana izay efa haharihary isika.'),
  ('6ab25cbc520a731806598568', '2026-09-22T10:47:24.517Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:24.517Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Galatianina', 48, 3, 11, 'Hita mazava koa fa tsy misy olona ambara hoe marina eo anatrehan’Andriamanitra noho izy mankatò lalàna, fa “ny olo-marina ho velona satria manam-pinoana.”', 'hita mazava koa fa tsy misy olona ambara hoe marina eo anatrehan’andriamanitra noho izy mankatò lalàna, fa “ny olo-marina ho velona satria manam-pinoana.”'),
  ('6ab25cbc520a731806598564', '2026-09-22T10:47:24.517Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:24.517Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Galatianina', 48, 3, 7, 'Efa fantatrareo tokoa fa izay manam-pinoana no zanak’i Abrahama.', 'efa fantatrareo tokoa fa izay manam-pinoana no zanak’i abrahama.'),
  ('6ab25cbd0f37a0418e30a143', '2026-09-22T10:47:25.044Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:25.044Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Galatianina', 48, 4, 3, 'Dia hoatr’izany koa isika: Tamin’isika mbola kely, dia nandevozin’ny fanaon’izao tontolo izao sy ny fisainany.', 'dia hoatr’izany koa isika: tamin’isika mbola kely, dia nandevozin’ny fanaon’izao tontolo izao sy ny fisainany.'),
  ('6ab25cbd0f37a0418e30a141', '2026-09-22T10:47:25.044Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:25.044Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Galatianina', 48, 4, 1, 'Izao no lazaiko: Raha mbola zaza ny mpandova, dia tsy misy maha samy hafa azy amin’ny mpanompo, na dia izy aza no tompon’ny zava-drehetra.', 'izao no lazaiko: raha mbola zaza ny mpandova, dia tsy misy maha samy hafa azy amin’ny mpanompo, na dia izy aza no tompon’ny zava-drehetra.'),
  ('6ab25cbd0f37a0418e30a142', '2026-09-22T10:47:25.044Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:25.044Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Galatianina', 48, 4, 2, 'Fa fehezin’ny mpikarakara azy sy ny mpanompo miandraikitra ny ao an-trano izy, mandra-pahatongan’ilay andro nofidin’ny rainy mialoha.', 'fa fehezin’ny mpikarakara azy sy ny mpanompo miandraikitra ny ao an-trano izy, mandra-pahatongan’ilay andro nofidin’ny rainy mialoha.'),
  ('6ab25cbd0f37a0418e30a144', '2026-09-22T10:47:25.044Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:25.044Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Galatianina', 48, 4, 4, 'Fa rehefa tapitra ilay fotoana, dia nirahin’Andriamanitra ny Zanany, izay natera-behivavy sady teo ambanin’ny lalàna,', 'fa rehefa tapitra ilay fotoana, dia nirahin’andriamanitra ny zanany, izay natera-behivavy sady teo ambanin’ny lalàna,'),
  ('6ab25cbd0f37a0418e30a145', '2026-09-22T10:47:25.044Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:25.045Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Galatianina', 48, 4, 5, 'mba hividy an’izay eo ambanin’ny lalàna ka hanafaka azy ireo. Dia amin’izay isika ho azo atsangana ho zanaka.', 'mba hividy an’izay eo ambanin’ny lalàna ka hanafaka azy ireo. dia amin’izay isika ho azo atsangana ho zanaka.'),
  ('6ab25cbd0f37a0418e30a15b', '2026-09-22T10:47:25.045Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:25.045Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Galatianina', 48, 4, 27, 'Fa voasoratra hoe: “Mifalia, ry vehivavy momba izay tsy niteraka! Mihobia, ry vehivavy tsy mba narary nihetsi-jaza! Fa ny zanaky ny vehivavy nilaozam-bady dia betsaka noho ny zanaky ny vehivavy manambady.”', 'fa voasoratra hoe: “mifalia, ry vehivavy momba izay tsy niteraka! mihobia, ry vehivavy tsy mba narary nihetsi-jaza! fa ny zanaky ny vehivavy nilaozam-bady dia betsaka noho ny zanaky ny vehivavy manambady.”'),
  ('6ab25cbd0f37a0418e30a150', '2026-09-22T10:47:25.045Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:25.045Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Galatianina', 48, 4, 16, 'Dia lasa fahavalonareo ve aho izao, satria milaza ny marina aminareo?', 'dia lasa fahavalonareo ve aho izao, satria milaza ny marina aminareo?'),
  ('6ab25cbd0f37a0418e30a146', '2026-09-22T10:47:25.045Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:25.045Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Galatianina', 48, 4, 6, 'Ary satria zanaka ianareo, dia nataon’Andriamanitra ao am-pontsika ny fanahin’ny Zanany, ary io fanahy io no miantsoantso hoe: “Aba, Ray ô!”', 'ary satria zanaka ianareo, dia nataon’andriamanitra ao am-pontsika ny fanahin’ny zanany, ary io fanahy io no miantsoantso hoe: “aba, ray ô!”'),
  ('6ab25cbd0f37a0418e30a152', '2026-09-22T10:47:25.045Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:25.045Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Galatianina', 48, 4, 18, 'Tsara foana anefa raha misy miezaka mafy mitaona anareo, raha ny hahasoa anareo no antony anaovany an’izany, ary tsy hoe rehefa eo aminareo ihany aho no manao an’izany izy.', 'tsara foana anefa raha misy miezaka mafy mitaona anareo, raha ny hahasoa anareo no antony anaovany an’izany, ary tsy hoe rehefa eo aminareo ihany aho no manao an’izany izy.'),
  ('6ab25cbd0f37a0418e30a14d', '2026-09-22T10:47:25.045Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:25.045Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Galatianina', 48, 4, 13, 'Fantatrareo anefa fa noho izaho narary no nahafahako nitory ny vaovao tsara taminareo tamin’ny voalohany.', 'fantatrareo anefa fa noho izaho narary no nahafahako nitory ny vaovao tsara taminareo tamin’ny voalohany.');
INSERT INTO "bible_verses" ("id", "created_date", "updated_date", "created_by_id", "created_by", "translation", "book", "bookOrder", "chapter", "verse", "text", "normalizedText") VALUES
  ('6ab25cbd0f37a0418e30a15d', '2026-09-22T10:47:25.045Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:25.045Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Galatianina', 48, 4, 29, 'Nanenjika an’ilay nateraky ny fanahy anefa ilay nateraka hoatran’ny zaza rehetra, tamin’izany fotoana izany, ary hoatr’izany koa amin’izao.', 'nanenjika an’ilay nateraky ny fanahy anefa ilay nateraka hoatran’ny zaza rehetra, tamin’izany fotoana izany, ary hoatr’izany koa amin’izao.'),
  ('6ab25cbd0f37a0418e30a15a', '2026-09-22T10:47:25.045Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:25.045Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Galatianina', 48, 4, 26, 'Vehivavy afaka kosa ilay Jerosalema any ambony, ary izy no renintsika.', 'vehivavy afaka kosa ilay jerosalema any ambony, ary izy no renintsika.'),
  ('6ab25cbd0f37a0418e30a157', '2026-09-22T10:47:25.045Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:25.045Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Galatianina', 48, 4, 23, 'Teraka hoatran’ireny zaza rehetra ireny anefa ilay nateraky ny mpanompovavy, fa teraka noho ny fampanantenana kosa ilay nateraky ny vehivavy afaka.', 'teraka hoatran’ireny zaza rehetra ireny anefa ilay nateraky ny mpanompovavy, fa teraka noho ny fampanantenana kosa ilay nateraky ny vehivavy afaka.'),
  ('6ab25cbd0f37a0418e30a14a', '2026-09-22T10:47:25.045Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:25.045Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Galatianina', 48, 4, 10, 'Aminareo dia misy andro sy volana sy vanim-potoana ary taona tena miavaka, dia ireny no ankalazainareo.', 'aminareo dia misy andro sy volana sy vanim-potoana ary taona tena miavaka, dia ireny no ankalazainareo.'),
  ('6ab25cbd0f37a0418e30a14c', '2026-09-22T10:47:25.045Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:25.045Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Galatianina', 48, 4, 12, 'Miangavy anareo aho, ry rahalahy, mba miovà hoatr’ahy, satria efa hoatr’anareo ihany aho taloha. Tsy nanisy ratsy ahy ianareo.', 'miangavy anareo aho, ry rahalahy, mba miovà hoatr’ahy, satria efa hoatr’anareo ihany aho taloha. tsy nanisy ratsy ahy ianareo.'),
  ('6ab25cbd0f37a0418e30a15e', '2026-09-22T10:47:25.045Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:25.045Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Galatianina', 48, 4, 30, 'Inona anefa no lazain’ny Soratra Masina? “Roahy any ilay mpanompovavy sy ny zanany! Fa tsy hiray lova amin’ny zanak’ilay vehivavy afaka mihitsy ny zanak’ilay mpanompovavy.”', 'inona anefa no lazain’ny soratra masina? “roahy any ilay mpanompovavy sy ny zanany! fa tsy hiray lova amin’ny zanak’ilay vehivavy afaka mihitsy ny zanak’ilay mpanompovavy.”'),
  ('6ab25cbd0f37a0418e30a14e', '2026-09-22T10:47:25.045Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:25.045Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Galatianina', 48, 4, 14, 'Na dia fitsapana ho anareo aza ilay tsy fahasalamako, dia tsy nataonareo tsinontsinona aho na naharikoriko anareo. Noraisinareo hoatran’ny anjelin’Andriamanitra sy hoatran’i Kristy Jesosy kosa aho.', 'na dia fitsapana ho anareo aza ilay tsy fahasalamako, dia tsy nataonareo tsinontsinona aho na naharikoriko anareo. noraisinareo hoatran’ny anjelin’andriamanitra sy hoatran’i kristy jesosy kosa aho.'),
  ('6ab25cbd0f37a0418e30a14f', '2026-09-22T10:47:25.045Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:25.045Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Galatianina', 48, 4, 15, 'Dia aiza anefa izao izany fifalianareo izany? Fa mijoro ho vavolombelona aho fa raha azonareo natao, na ny masonareo aza ho nesorinareo dia ho nomenareo ahy.', 'dia aiza anefa izao izany fifalianareo izany? fa mijoro ho vavolombelona aho fa raha azonareo natao, na ny masonareo aza ho nesorinareo dia ho nomenareo ahy.'),
  ('6ab25cbd0f37a0418e30a147', '2026-09-22T10:47:25.045Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:25.045Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Galatianina', 48, 4, 7, 'Tsy mpanompo intsony àry ianao fa zanaka, ary raha zanaka dia nataon’Andriamanitra ho mpandova koa.', 'tsy mpanompo intsony àry ianao fa zanaka, ary raha zanaka dia nataon’andriamanitra ho mpandova koa.'),
  ('6ab25cbd0f37a0418e30a15c', '2026-09-22T10:47:25.045Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:25.045Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Galatianina', 48, 4, 28, 'Zanaky ny fampanantenana hoatran’i Isaka ianareo, ry rahalahy.', 'zanaky ny fampanantenana hoatran’i isaka ianareo, ry rahalahy.'),
  ('6ab25cbd0f37a0418e30a14b', '2026-09-22T10:47:25.045Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:25.045Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Galatianina', 48, 4, 11, 'Matahotra aho sao very maina fotsiny ny nanampiako anareo.', 'matahotra aho sao very maina fotsiny ny nanampiako anareo.'),
  ('6ab25cbd0f37a0418e30a148', '2026-09-22T10:47:25.045Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:25.045Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Galatianina', 48, 4, 8, 'Tamin’ianareo tsy nahalala an’Andriamanitra anefa, dia nandevozin’izay tsy tena andriamanitra ianareo.', 'tamin’ianareo tsy nahalala an’andriamanitra anefa, dia nandevozin’izay tsy tena andriamanitra ianareo.'),
  ('6ab25cbd0f37a0418e30a154', '2026-09-22T10:47:25.045Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:25.045Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Galatianina', 48, 4, 20, 'Tiako raha mba miaraka aminareo aho izao, sady mba malemy fanahy kokoa rehefa miresaka aminareo. Manahiran-tsaina ahy ianareo.', 'tiako raha mba miaraka aminareo aho izao, sady mba malemy fanahy kokoa rehefa miresaka aminareo. manahiran-tsaina ahy ianareo.'),
  ('6ab25cbd0f37a0418e30a153', '2026-09-22T10:47:25.045Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:25.045Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Galatianina', 48, 4, 19, 'Toy ny hoe marary mihetsi-jaza hiteraka anareo indray aho, ry zanako malalako, ary ho toy izany foana mandra-panananareo ny toetran’i Kristy.', 'toy ny hoe marary mihetsi-jaza hiteraka anareo indray aho, ry zanako malalako, ary ho toy izany foana mandra-panananareo ny toetran’i kristy.'),
  ('6ab25cbd0f37a0418e30a151', '2026-09-22T10:47:25.045Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:25.045Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Galatianina', 48, 4, 17, 'Miezaka mafy mitaona anareo ry zareo, saingy tsy hoe mba hahasoa anareo akory. Fa tiany hosarahina amiko ianareo, dia amin’izay manaraka an-dry zareo.', 'miezaka mafy mitaona anareo ry zareo, saingy tsy hoe mba hahasoa anareo akory. fa tiany hosarahina amiko ianareo, dia amin’izay manaraka an-dry zareo.'),
  ('6ab25cbd0f37a0418e30a15f', '2026-09-22T10:47:25.045Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:25.045Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Galatianina', 48, 4, 31, 'Tsy zanaky ny mpanompovavy àry isika, ry rahalahy, fa zanaky ny vehivavy afaka.', 'tsy zanaky ny mpanompovavy àry isika, ry rahalahy, fa zanaky ny vehivavy afaka.'),
  ('6ab25cbd0f37a0418e30a158', '2026-09-22T10:47:25.045Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:25.045Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Galatianina', 48, 4, 24, 'Misy heviny an’ohatra izany, satria izy roa vavy dia fifanekena roa. Natao teo amin’ny Tendrombohitra Sinay ny anankiray, ary miteraka zanaka hatao andevo. I Hagara io fifanekena io.', 'misy heviny an’ohatra izany, satria izy roa vavy dia fifanekena roa. natao teo amin’ny tendrombohitra sinay ny anankiray, ary miteraka zanaka hatao andevo. i hagara io fifanekena io.'),
  ('6ab25cbd0f37a0418e30a159', '2026-09-22T10:47:25.045Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:25.045Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Galatianina', 48, 4, 25, 'Ary i Hagara dia i Sinay, tendrombohitra any Arabia. Ilay Jerosalema ankehitriny no i Hagara, satria andevo izy sy ny zanany.', 'ary i hagara dia i sinay, tendrombohitra any arabia. ilay jerosalema ankehitriny no i hagara, satria andevo izy sy ny zanany.'),
  ('6ab25cbd0f37a0418e30a149', '2026-09-22T10:47:25.045Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:25.045Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Galatianina', 48, 4, 9, 'Efa mahalala an’Andriamanitra kosa ianareo izao, na ny marina kokoa dia hoe efa fantany ianareo. Dia maninona ianareo no miverina indray any amin’ireo zavatra fototra tsy manan-kery sy tsy misy ilana azy, sady te handevozin’izany indray?', 'efa mahalala an’andriamanitra kosa ianareo izao, na ny marina kokoa dia hoe efa fantany ianareo. dia maninona ianareo no miverina indray any amin’ireo zavatra fototra tsy manan-kery sy tsy misy ilana azy, sady te handevozin’izany indray?'),
  ('6ab25cbd0f37a0418e30a156', '2026-09-22T10:47:25.045Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:25.045Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Galatianina', 48, 4, 22, 'Voasoratra ao, ohatra, hoe nanan-janaka roa lahy i Abrahama: Ny anankiray tamin’ny mpanompovavy, fa ny anankiray tamin’ny vehivavy afaka.', 'voasoratra ao, ohatra, hoe nanan-janaka roa lahy i abrahama: ny anankiray tamin’ny mpanompovavy, fa ny anankiray tamin’ny vehivavy afaka.'),
  ('6ab25cbd0f37a0418e30a155', '2026-09-22T10:47:25.045Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:25.045Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Galatianina', 48, 4, 21, 'Hono ho’aho, ianareo izay te ho eo ambanin’ny lalàna ireo, tsy fantatrareo angaha izay lazain’ny Lalàna?', 'hono ho’aho, ianareo izay te ho eo ambanin’ny lalàna ireo, tsy fantatrareo angaha izay lazain’ny lalàna?'),
  ('6ab25cbd7b362d1c568c3642', '2026-09-22T10:47:25.500Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:25.500Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Galatianina', 48, 5, 22, 'Fa ny vokatry ny fanahy kosa dia fitiavana, fifaliana, fiadanana, faharetana, hatsaram-panahy, hatsaran-toetra, finoana,', 'fa ny vokatry ny fanahy kosa dia fitiavana, fifaliana, fiadanana, faharetana, hatsaram-panahy, hatsaran-toetra, finoana,'),
  ('6ab25cbd7b362d1c568c3634', '2026-09-22T10:47:25.500Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:25.500Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Galatianina', 48, 5, 8, 'Tsy Ilay miantso anareo no nandresy lahatra anareo hanao hoatr’izany.', 'tsy ilay miantso anareo no nandresy lahatra anareo hanao hoatr’izany.'),
  ('6ab25cbd7b362d1c568c3631', '2026-09-22T10:47:25.500Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:25.500Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Galatianina', 48, 5, 5, 'Fa izahay kosa, dia ny fanahiny no mahatonga anay hiandry mafy sy hanantena ny hambara hoe olo-marina noho ny finoana.', 'fa izahay kosa, dia ny fanahiny no mahatonga anay hiandry mafy sy hanantena ny hambara hoe olo-marina noho ny finoana.'),
  ('6ab25cbd7b362d1c568c3643', '2026-09-22T10:47:25.500Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:25.500Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Galatianina', 48, 5, 23, 'fahalemem-panahy, ary fifehezan-tena. Tsy misy lalàna manohitra an’ireo.', 'fahalemem-panahy, ary fifehezan-tena. tsy misy lalàna manohitra an’ireo.'),
  ('6ab25cbd7b362d1c568c363f', '2026-09-22T10:47:25.500Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:25.500Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Galatianina', 48, 5, 19, 'Miharihary ny asan’ny nofo, dia fijangajangana, fahalotoana, fitondran-tena tsy misy henatra,', 'miharihary ny asan’ny nofo, dia fijangajangana, fahalotoana, fitondran-tena tsy misy henatra,'),
  ('6ab25cbd7b362d1c568c3636', '2026-09-22T10:47:25.500Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:25.500Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Galatianina', 48, 5, 10, 'Matoky aho fa hitovy hevitra amiko amin’izany ianareo izay tafaray amin’ny Tompo. Ilay manakorontana anareo anefa, na iza izy na iza, no hahazo ny fanamelohana mendrika azy.', 'matoky aho fa hitovy hevitra amiko amin’izany ianareo izay tafaray amin’ny tompo. ilay manakorontana anareo anefa, na iza izy na iza, no hahazo ny fanamelohana mendrika azy.'),
  ('6ab25cbd7b362d1c568c3635', '2026-09-22T10:47:25.500Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:25.500Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Galatianina', 48, 5, 9, 'Fa lalivay kely fotsiny dia mampitombo ny koba manontolo.', 'fa lalivay kely fotsiny dia mampitombo ny koba manontolo.'),
  ('6ab25cbd7b362d1c568c3644', '2026-09-22T10:47:25.500Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:25.500Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Galatianina', 48, 5, 24, 'Ary izao no nataon’izay mpianatr’i Kristy Jesosy: Nofantsihan’izy ireo teo amin’ny hazo fijaliana ny nofo, niaraka tamin’ny filan-dratsiny sy ny faniriany.', 'ary izao no nataon’izay mpianatr’i kristy jesosy: nofantsihan’izy ireo teo amin’ny hazo fijaliana ny nofo, niaraka tamin’ny filan-dratsiny sy ny faniriany.'),
  ('6ab25cbd7b362d1c568c3646', '2026-09-22T10:47:25.500Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:25.500Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Galatianina', 48, 5, 26, 'Tsy tokony hirehareha isika fa mahatonga antsika hifaninana sy hifampialona izany.', 'tsy tokony hirehareha isika fa mahatonga antsika hifaninana sy hifampialona izany.'),
  ('6ab25cbd7b362d1c568c363a', '2026-09-22T10:47:25.500Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:25.500Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Galatianina', 48, 5, 14, 'Fa ny Lalàna manontolo dia tanteraka ao amin’ilay didy anankiray hoe: “Tiavo ny namanao tahaka ny tenanao.”', 'fa ny lalàna manontolo dia tanteraka ao amin’ilay didy anankiray hoe: “tiavo ny namanao tahaka ny tenanao.”'),
  ('6ab25cbd7b362d1c568c3639', '2026-09-22T10:47:25.500Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:25.500Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Galatianina', 48, 5, 13, 'Efa nantsoina ho lasa olona afaka ianareo, ry rahalahy. Aza ampiasaina hanomezana fahafaham-po ny fanirian’ny nofo anefa izany fahafahana izany, fa aleo ny fitiavana no hahatonga anareo hifanompo.', 'efa nantsoina ho lasa olona afaka ianareo, ry rahalahy. aza ampiasaina hanomezana fahafaham-po ny fanirian’ny nofo anefa izany fahafahana izany, fa aleo ny fitiavana no hahatonga anareo hifanompo.'),
  ('6ab25cbd7b362d1c568c3641', '2026-09-22T10:47:25.500Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:25.500Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Galatianina', 48, 5, 21, 'fitsiriritana, fimamoana, fety tsy voafehy, ary zavatra hafa hoatran’ireo. Mampitandrina anareo mialoha aho, hoatran’ny efa nampitandremako anareo, fa tsy handova ny Fanjakan’Andriamanitra izay mpanao an’ireo zavatra ireo.', 'fitsiriritana, fimamoana, fety tsy voafehy, ary zavatra hafa hoatran’ireo. mampitandrina anareo mialoha aho, hoatran’ny efa nampitandremako anareo, fa tsy handova ny fanjakan’andriamanitra izay mpanao an’ireo zavatra ireo.'),
  ('6ab25cbd7b362d1c568c363c', '2026-09-22T10:47:25.500Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:25.500Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Galatianina', 48, 5, 16, 'Izao no lazaiko: Miezaha foana hanaiky hotarihin’ny fanahy, dia tsy hanatanteraka ny fanirian’ny nofo mihitsy ianareo.', 'izao no lazaiko: miezaha foana hanaiky hotarihin’ny fanahy, dia tsy hanatanteraka ny fanirian’ny nofo mihitsy ianareo.'),
  ('6ab25cbd7b362d1c568c3640', '2026-09-22T10:47:25.500Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:25.500Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Galatianina', 48, 5, 20, 'fanompoan-tsampy, filalaovana ody, fankahalana, ady, fialonana, fipoahan’ny fahatezerana, fifamaliana, fisaratsarahana, fananganana antokom-pinoana,', 'fanompoan-tsampy, filalaovana ody, fankahalana, ady, fialonana, fipoahan’ny fahatezerana, fifamaliana, fisaratsarahana, fananganana antokom-pinoana,'),
  ('6ab25cbd7b362d1c568c3645', '2026-09-22T10:47:25.500Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:25.500Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Galatianina', 48, 5, 25, 'Raha avelantsika hiasa amintsika ny fanahy masina, dia tokony hitondra tena tsara foana mifanaraka amin’ny fitarihan’ny fanahy isika.', 'raha avelantsika hiasa amintsika ny fanahy masina, dia tokony hitondra tena tsara foana mifanaraka amin’ny fitarihan’ny fanahy isika.'),
  ('6ab25cbd7b362d1c568c363b', '2026-09-22T10:47:25.500Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:25.500Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Galatianina', 48, 5, 15, 'Raha mbola mifandramatra sy miady foana anefa ianareo, dia mitandrema fa mety hifandringana.', 'raha mbola mifandramatra sy miady foana anefa ianareo, dia mitandrema fa mety hifandringana.'),
  ('6ab25cbd7b362d1c568c3630', '2026-09-22T10:47:25.500Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:25.500Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Galatianina', 48, 5, 4, 'Tafasaraka amin’i Kristy ianareo fa mankatò lalàna mba hambara hoe olo-marina. Tsy anehoan’ Andriamanitra hatsaram-panahy miavaka intsony ianareo noho ny ataonareo.', 'tafasaraka amin’i kristy ianareo fa mankatò lalàna mba hambara hoe olo-marina. tsy anehoan’ andriamanitra hatsaram-panahy miavaka intsony ianareo noho ny ataonareo.'),
  ('6ab25cbd7b362d1c568c362d', '2026-09-22T10:47:25.500Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:25.500Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Galatianina', 48, 5, 1, 'Fa nafahan’i Kristy isika mba hanana an’izany fahafahana izany. Koa miorena tsara, ary aza manaiky hasiana zioga fanandevozana indray.', 'fa nafahan’i kristy isika mba hanana an’izany fahafahana izany. koa miorena tsara, ary aza manaiky hasiana zioga fanandevozana indray.'),
  ('6ab25cbd7b362d1c568c363e', '2026-09-22T10:47:25.500Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:25.500Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Galatianina', 48, 5, 18, 'Raha tarihin’ny fanahy koa ianareo, dia tsy eo ambanin’ny lalàna.', 'raha tarihin’ny fanahy koa ianareo, dia tsy eo ambanin’ny lalàna.'),
  ('6ab25cbd7b362d1c568c3638', '2026-09-22T10:47:25.500Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:25.500Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Galatianina', 48, 5, 12, 'Enga anie ka ireo mitady hampivadika anareo ireo mihitsy no hovosirina!', 'enga anie ka ireo mitady hampivadika anareo ireo mihitsy no hovosirina!'),
  ('6ab25cbd7b362d1c568c362f', '2026-09-22T10:47:25.500Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:25.500Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Galatianina', 48, 5, 3, 'Izao indray no hamafisiko amin’izay hoforana: Tsy maintsy mankatò ny Lalàna manontolo izy.', 'izao indray no hamafisiko amin’izay hoforana: tsy maintsy mankatò ny lalàna manontolo izy.'),
  ('6ab25cbd7b362d1c568c363d', '2026-09-22T10:47:25.500Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:25.500Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Galatianina', 48, 5, 17, 'Ny nofo sy ny faniriany mantsy manohitra ny fanahy, ary ny fanahy kosa manohitra ny nofo. Ary mifanohitra izy roa ireo, amin’izay ianareo tsy ho afaka hanao an’izay tianareo hatao.', 'ny nofo sy ny faniriany mantsy manohitra ny fanahy, ary ny fanahy kosa manohitra ny nofo. ary mifanohitra izy roa ireo, amin’izay ianareo tsy ho afaka hanao an’izay tianareo hatao.'),
  ('6ab25cbd7b362d1c568c362e', '2026-09-22T10:47:25.500Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:25.500Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Galatianina', 48, 5, 2, 'Izaho Paoly no milaza aminareo fa raha forana ianareo, dia tsy hahasoa anareo i Kristy na kely akory aza.', 'izaho paoly no milaza aminareo fa raha forana ianareo, dia tsy hahasoa anareo i kristy na kely akory aza.'),
  ('6ab25cbd7b362d1c568c3637', '2026-09-22T10:47:25.500Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:25.500Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Galatianina', 48, 5, 11, 'Raha ny amiko kosa, ry rahalahy, raha mbola mitory momba ny famorana aho, dia nahoana aho no mbola enjehina ihany? Raha izany mantsy no toriko, dia efa tsy tokony hanafintohina olona intsony ny hazo fijaliana.', 'raha ny amiko kosa, ry rahalahy, raha mbola mitory momba ny famorana aho, dia nahoana aho no mbola enjehina ihany? raha izany mantsy no toriko, dia efa tsy tokony hanafintohina olona intsony ny hazo fijaliana.'),
  ('6ab25cbd7b362d1c568c3633', '2026-09-22T10:47:25.500Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:25.500Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Galatianina', 48, 5, 7, 'Efa nihazakazaka tsara ange ianareo e! Dia iza no nisakana anareo tsy hankatò ny fahamarinana intsony?', 'efa nihazakazaka tsara ange ianareo e! dia iza no nisakana anareo tsy hankatò ny fahamarinana intsony?'),
  ('6ab25cbd7b362d1c568c3632', '2026-09-22T10:47:25.500Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:25.500Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Galatianina', 48, 5, 6, 'Fa ho an’izay tafaray amin’i Kristy Jesosy, dia tsy ny hoe forana na tsy forana no zava-dehibe, fa ny hoe mino sady maneho fitiavana.', 'fa ho an’izay tafaray amin’i kristy jesosy, dia tsy ny hoe forana na tsy forana no zava-dehibe, fa ny hoe mino sady maneho fitiavana.'),
  ('6ab25cbe3f287ab0ed26af37', '2026-09-22T10:47:26.155Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:26.155Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Galatianina', 48, 6, 16, 'Enga anie hahazo fiadanana sy famindram-po izay rehetra manaraka tsara an’izany fitsipika izany, izany hoe ny Israelin’Andriamanitra!', 'enga anie hahazo fiadanana sy famindram-po izay rehetra manaraka tsara an’izany fitsipika izany, izany hoe ny israelin’andriamanitra!'),
  ('6ab25cbe3f287ab0ed26af39', '2026-09-22T10:47:26.155Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:26.155Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Galatianina', 48, 6, 18, 'Enga anie ianareo, ry rahalahy, hanehoan’i Jesosy Kristy Tompontsika hatsaram-panahy miavaka noho ianareo manana toe-tsaina tsara! Amena.', 'enga anie ianareo, ry rahalahy, hanehoan’i jesosy kristy tompontsika hatsaram-panahy miavaka noho ianareo manana toe-tsaina tsara! amena.'),
  ('6ab25cbe3f287ab0ed26af36', '2026-09-22T10:47:26.155Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:26.155Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Galatianina', 48, 6, 15, 'Fa tsy ny hoe voafora na tsy voafora no zava-dehibe, fa ny hoe zavaboary vaovao.', 'fa tsy ny hoe voafora na tsy voafora no zava-dehibe, fa ny hoe zavaboary vaovao.'),
  ('6ab25cbe3f287ab0ed26af29', '2026-09-22T10:47:26.155Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:26.155Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Galatianina', 48, 6, 2, 'Miezaha foana hifanampy rehefa misy zava-tsarotra manavesatra, fa manatanteraka ny lalàn’i Kristy ianareo rehefa manao an’izany.', 'miezaha foana hifanampy rehefa misy zava-tsarotra manavesatra, fa manatanteraka ny lalàn’i kristy ianareo rehefa manao an’izany.'),
  ('6ab25cbe3f287ab0ed26af34', '2026-09-22T10:47:26.155Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:26.155Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Galatianina', 48, 6, 13, 'Na ny olona voafora aza tsy mitandrina ny Lalàna akory, fa tiany hoforana fotsiny ianareo dia amin’izay izy ireo afaka mirehareha momba anareo.', 'na ny olona voafora aza tsy mitandrina ny lalàna akory, fa tiany hoforana fotsiny ianareo dia amin’izay izy ireo afaka mirehareha momba anareo.'),
  ('6ab25cbe3f287ab0ed26af35', '2026-09-22T10:47:26.155Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:26.155Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Galatianina', 48, 6, 14, 'Enga anie aho tsy hirehareha mihitsy, raha tsy hoe momba ny hazo fijalian’i Jesosy Kristy Tompontsika ihany angaha! Amiko, dia tamin’ny alalany no namonoana an’izao tontolo izao ho faty, fa amin’izao tontolo izao kosa, dia tamin’ny alalany no namonoana ahy ho faty.', 'enga anie aho tsy hirehareha mihitsy, raha tsy hoe momba ny hazo fijalian’i jesosy kristy tompontsika ihany angaha! amiko, dia tamin’ny alalany no namonoana an’izao tontolo izao ho faty, fa amin’izao tontolo izao kosa, dia tamin’ny alalany no namonoana ahy ho faty.'),
  ('6ab25cbe3f287ab0ed26af32', '2026-09-22T10:47:26.155Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:26.155Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Galatianina', 48, 6, 11, 'Jereo ange ny hangezan’ny soratra nosoratan’ny tanako ho anareo e!', 'jereo ange ny hangezan’ny soratra nosoratan’ny tanako ho anareo e!'),
  ('6ab25cbe3f287ab0ed26af2e', '2026-09-22T10:47:26.155Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:26.155Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Galatianina', 48, 6, 7, 'Aza manaiky ho voafitaka ianareo: Andriamanitra tsy azo vazivazina, fa izay afafin’ny olona ihany no hojinjainy.', 'aza manaiky ho voafitaka ianareo: andriamanitra tsy azo vazivazina, fa izay afafin’ny olona ihany no hojinjainy.'),
  ('6ab25cbe3f287ab0ed26af2c', '2026-09-22T10:47:26.155Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:26.155Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Galatianina', 48, 6, 5, 'Samy hitondra ny entany avy mantsy ny tsirairay.', 'samy hitondra ny entany avy mantsy ny tsirairay.'),
  ('6ab25cbe3f287ab0ed26af30', '2026-09-22T10:47:26.155Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:26.155Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Galatianina', 48, 6, 9, 'Aza mba reraka manao ny tsara mihitsy àry isika, satria hijinja ny vokatr’izany isika amin’ny fotoana mety, raha tsy kivy.', 'aza mba reraka manao ny tsara mihitsy àry isika, satria hijinja ny vokatr’izany isika amin’ny fotoana mety, raha tsy kivy.'),
  ('6ab25cbe3f287ab0ed26af2a', '2026-09-22T10:47:26.155Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:26.155Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Galatianina', 48, 6, 3, 'Fa raha misy mihevi-tena hoe ambony nefa tsinontsinona, dia mamita-tena izy.', 'fa raha misy mihevi-tena hoe ambony nefa tsinontsinona, dia mamita-tena izy.'),
  ('6ab25cbe3f287ab0ed26af38', '2026-09-22T10:47:26.155Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:26.155Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Galatianina', 48, 6, 17, 'Aza misy manahirana ahy intsony manomboka izao, satria efa mitondra marika eo amin’ny vatako aho manamarina hoe mpanompon’i Jesosy aho.', 'aza misy manahirana ahy intsony manomboka izao, satria efa mitondra marika eo amin’ny vatako aho manamarina hoe mpanompon’i jesosy aho.'),
  ('6ab25cbe3f287ab0ed26af2d', '2026-09-22T10:47:26.155Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:26.155Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Galatianina', 48, 6, 6, 'Izay ampianarina ny tenin’Andriamanitra koa, dia tokony mba hifampizara ny zavatra tsara rehetra amin’ilay mampianatra azy.', 'izay ampianarina ny tenin’andriamanitra koa, dia tokony mba hifampizara ny zavatra tsara rehetra amin’ilay mampianatra azy.'),
  ('6ab25cbe3f287ab0ed26af33', '2026-09-22T10:47:26.155Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:26.155Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Galatianina', 48, 6, 12, 'Izay rehetra te hiseho hoe tsara etỳ ivelany no miezaka manery anareo hoforana. Ny antony anaovany an’izany anefa dia satria fotsiny izy tsy te henjehina noho ny hazo fijalian’i Kristy.', 'izay rehetra te hiseho hoe tsara etỳ ivelany no miezaka manery anareo hoforana. ny antony anaovany an’izany anefa dia satria fotsiny izy tsy te henjehina noho ny hazo fijalian’i kristy.'),
  ('6ab25cbe3f287ab0ed26af2f', '2026-09-22T10:47:26.155Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:26.155Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Galatianina', 48, 6, 8, 'Izay mamafy ho an’ny nofony mantsy dia hijinja fahasimbana avy amin’ny fanirian-dratsin’ny nofony. Fa izay mamafy ho an’ny fanahy kosa dia hijinja fiainana mandrakizay avy amin’ny fanahy.', 'izay mamafy ho an’ny nofony mantsy dia hijinja fahasimbana avy amin’ny fanirian-dratsin’ny nofony. fa izay mamafy ho an’ny fanahy kosa dia hijinja fiainana mandrakizay avy amin’ny fanahy.'),
  ('6ab25cbe3f287ab0ed26af31', '2026-09-22T10:47:26.155Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:26.155Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Galatianina', 48, 6, 10, 'Koa raha mbola afaka manao soa ihany isika, dia tokony hanao soa amin’ny olona rehetra, indrindra fa amin’ny mpiray finoana amintsika.', 'koa raha mbola afaka manao soa ihany isika, dia tokony hanao soa amin’ny olona rehetra, indrindra fa amin’ny mpiray finoana amintsika.'),
  ('6ab25cbe3f287ab0ed26af28', '2026-09-22T10:47:26.155Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:26.155Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Galatianina', 48, 6, 1, 'Ry rahalahy, raha misy olona manao zavatra tsy mety nefa tsy fantany akory, dia ianareo izay matotra no tokony hiezaka hanitsy azy amim-pahalemem-panahy. Mitandrema tsara anefa sao halaim-panahy koa ianao.', 'ry rahalahy, raha misy olona manao zavatra tsy mety nefa tsy fantany akory, dia ianareo izay matotra no tokony hiezaka hanitsy azy amim-pahalemem-panahy. mitandrema tsara anefa sao halaim-panahy koa ianao.'),
  ('6ab25cbe3f287ab0ed26af2b', '2026-09-22T10:47:26.155Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:26.155Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Galatianina', 48, 6, 4, 'Aleo anefa ny tsirairay samy handinika an’izay ataony, amin’izay dia ny zavatra ataony no hahafaly azy. Fa tsy tokony hampitaha ny tenany amin’olon-kafa izy.', 'aleo anefa ny tsirairay samy handinika an’izay ataony, amin’izay dia ny zavatra ataony no hahafaly azy. fa tsy tokony hampitaha ny tenany amin’olon-kafa izy.'),
  ('6ab25cbedbacdbce6d33cc00', '2026-09-22T10:47:26.623Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:26.623Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Efesianina', 49, 1, 14, 'Io fanahy masina io no antoka mialoha fa hahazo an’ilay lova isika. Tian’Andriamanitra hafahana amin’ny alalan’ny vidim-panavotana mantsy ny vahoakany, mba hoderaina sy homena voninahitra Izy.', 'io fanahy masina io no antoka mialoha fa hahazo an’ilay lova isika. tian’andriamanitra hafahana amin’ny alalan’ny vidim-panavotana mantsy ny vahoakany, mba hoderaina sy homena voninahitra izy.'),
  ('6ab25cbedbacdbce6d33cbfd', '2026-09-22T10:47:26.623Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:26.623Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Efesianina', 49, 1, 11, 'Tafaray aminy izahay sady nofidina mba ho mpiara-mandova aminy. Izahay mantsy efa notendrena mialoha araka ny fikasan’Ilay manatanteraka ny zava-drehetra araka izay tiany sy mifanaraka amin’ny sitrapony.', 'tafaray aminy izahay sady nofidina mba ho mpiara-mandova aminy. izahay mantsy efa notendrena mialoha araka ny fikasan’ilay manatanteraka ny zava-drehetra araka izay tiany sy mifanaraka amin’ny sitrapony.'),
  ('6ab25cbedbacdbce6d33cc06', '2026-09-22T10:47:26.623Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:26.623Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Efesianina', 49, 1, 20, 'Io hery io no nananganany an’i Kristy tamin’ny maty sy nametrahany azy teo ankavanany any amin’ny faritry ny lanitra.', 'io hery io no nananganany an’i kristy tamin’ny maty sy nametrahany azy teo ankavanany any amin’ny faritry ny lanitra.'),
  ('6ab25cbedbacdbce6d33cbf9', '2026-09-22T10:47:26.623Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:26.623Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Efesianina', 49, 1, 7, 'Io Zanany io no nampiasaina mba hanafahana antsika amin’ny alalan’ny vidim-panavotana, ka nahazoantsika famelan-keloka noho ny rany. Tena lehibe mantsy ny hatsaram-panahy miavaka asehon’Andriamanitra.', 'io zanany io no nampiasaina mba hanafahana antsika amin’ny alalan’ny vidim-panavotana, ka nahazoantsika famelan-keloka noho ny rany. tena lehibe mantsy ny hatsaram-panahy miavaka asehon’andriamanitra.'),
  ('6ab25cbedbacdbce6d33cbff', '2026-09-22T10:47:26.623Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:26.623Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Efesianina', 49, 1, 13, 'Nanantena azy koa anefa ianareo rehefa avy naheno ny tenin’ny fahamarinana, dia ny vaovao tsara momba ny famonjena anareo. Ary rehefa nino ianareo, dia nasiana tombo-kase tamin’ilay fanahy masina nampanantenaina, ka i Kristy no nampiasain’Andriamanitra hanao an’izany.', 'nanantena azy koa anefa ianareo rehefa avy naheno ny tenin’ny fahamarinana, dia ny vaovao tsara momba ny famonjena anareo. ary rehefa nino ianareo, dia nasiana tombo-kase tamin’ilay fanahy masina nampanantenaina, ka i kristy no nampiasain’andriamanitra hanao an’izany.'),
  ('6ab25cbedbacdbce6d33cc02', '2026-09-22T10:47:26.623Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:26.623Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Efesianina', 49, 1, 16, 'dia tsy mitsahatra misaotra an’Andriamanitra aho noho ny aminareo. Mivavaka ho anareo foana koa aho', 'dia tsy mitsahatra misaotra an’andriamanitra aho noho ny aminareo. mivavaka ho anareo foana koa aho'),
  ('6ab25cbedbacdbce6d33cbf6', '2026-09-22T10:47:26.623Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:26.623Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Efesianina', 49, 1, 4, 'Nifidy antsika izy talohan’ny nanorenana an’izao tontolo izao, mba ho tafaray amin’i Kristy isika, ka ho be fitiavana sy masina ary tsy misy tsiny eo anatrehan’Andriamanitra.', 'nifidy antsika izy talohan’ny nanorenana an’izao tontolo izao, mba ho tafaray amin’i kristy isika, ka ho be fitiavana sy masina ary tsy misy tsiny eo anatrehan’andriamanitra.'),
  ('6ab25cbedbacdbce6d33cc01', '2026-09-22T10:47:26.623Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:26.623Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Efesianina', 49, 1, 15, 'Noho izany, rehefa henoko hoe lasa mino an’i Jesosy Tompo ianareo, sady maneho fitiavana amin’ny olona masina rehetra,', 'noho izany, rehefa henoko hoe lasa mino an’i jesosy tompo ianareo, sady maneho fitiavana amin’ny olona masina rehetra,'),
  ('6ab25cbedbacdbce6d33cbf8', '2026-09-22T10:47:26.623Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:26.623Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Efesianina', 49, 1, 6, 'Amin’izay dia hidera azy ny olona noho izy be voninahitra sy naneho hatsaram-panahy miavaka tamintsika, sady tsara fanahy rehefa naneho an’izany tamin’ny alalan’ilay malalany.', 'amin’izay dia hidera azy ny olona noho izy be voninahitra sy naneho hatsaram-panahy miavaka tamintsika, sady tsara fanahy rehefa naneho an’izany tamin’ny alalan’ilay malalany.'),
  ('6ab25cbedbacdbce6d33cbf7', '2026-09-22T10:47:26.623Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:26.623Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Efesianina', 49, 1, 5, 'Efa notendreny mialoha mantsy isika mba hatsangany ho zanany amin’ny alalan’i Jesosy Kristy, araka izay mahafinaritra azy sy araka ny sitrapony.', 'efa notendreny mialoha mantsy isika mba hatsangany ho zanany amin’ny alalan’i jesosy kristy, araka izay mahafinaritra azy sy araka ny sitrapony.'),
  ('6ab25cbedbacdbce6d33cc03', '2026-09-22T10:47:26.623Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:26.623Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Efesianina', 49, 1, 17, 'mba hanome anareo ny fanahiny ilay Andriamanitr’i Jesosy Kristy Tompontsika, ilay Rain’ny voninahitra. Dia amin’izay ianareo hanam-pahendrena sady hahazo ny dikan’izay zavatra aharihariny, ka hahafantatra tsara azy.', 'mba hanome anareo ny fanahiny ilay andriamanitr’i jesosy kristy tompontsika, ilay rain’ny voninahitra. dia amin’izay ianareo hanam-pahendrena sady hahazo ny dikan’izay zavatra aharihariny, ka hahafantatra tsara azy.'),
  ('6ab25cbedbacdbce6d33cbfa', '2026-09-22T10:47:26.623Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:26.623Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Efesianina', 49, 1, 8, 'Be dia be izany hatsaram-panahy miavaka nasehony tamintsika izany, sady nomeny ny fahendrena sy ny fahiratan-tsaina rehetra koa isika,', 'be dia be izany hatsaram-panahy miavaka nasehony tamintsika izany, sady nomeny ny fahendrena sy ny fahiratan-tsaina rehetra koa isika,'),
  ('6ab25cbedbacdbce6d33cbfe', '2026-09-22T10:47:26.623Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:26.623Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Efesianina', 49, 1, 12, 'Amin’izay dia hanome voninahitra sy hidera an’Andriamanitra izahay, fa izahay no voalohany nanantena an’i Kristy.', 'amin’izay dia hanome voninahitra sy hidera an’andriamanitra izahay, fa izahay no voalohany nanantena an’i kristy.'),
  ('6ab25cbedbacdbce6d33cc05', '2026-09-22T10:47:26.623Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:26.623Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Efesianina', 49, 1, 19, 'ary faran’izay lehibe ilay hery omeny antsika mpino. Hita hoe lehibe izany heriny izany rehefa ampiasainy.', 'ary faran’izay lehibe ilay hery omeny antsika mpino. hita hoe lehibe izany heriny izany rehefa ampiasainy.'),
  ('6ab25cbedbacdbce6d33cc08', '2026-09-22T10:47:26.623Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:26.623Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Efesianina', 49, 1, 22, 'Nasainy nanaiky an’i Kristy koa ny zava-drehetra ka nataony eo ambany tongony. Ary nataony lohan’ny zavatra rehetra izy ao amin’ny fiangonana,', 'nasainy nanaiky an’i kristy koa ny zava-drehetra ka nataony eo ambany tongony. ary nataony lohan’ny zavatra rehetra izy ao amin’ny fiangonana,'),
  ('6ab25cbedbacdbce6d33cbfc', '2026-09-22T10:47:26.623Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:26.623Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Efesianina', 49, 1, 10, 'dia ny hoe hanisy fitantanan-draharaha rehefa tapitra tanteraka ny fotoana voatondro. Amin’izay dia hangonina ho ao amin’i Kristy daholo ny zava-drehetra, izany hoe ny zavatra any an-danitra sy ny zavatra eto an-tany.', 'dia ny hoe hanisy fitantanan-draharaha rehefa tapitra tanteraka ny fotoana voatondro. amin’izay dia hangonina ho ao amin’i kristy daholo ny zava-drehetra, izany hoe ny zavatra any an-danitra sy ny zavatra eto an-tany.'),
  ('6ab25cbedbacdbce6d33cbf3', '2026-09-22T10:47:26.623Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:26.623Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Efesianina', 49, 1, 1, 'Avy amin’i Paoly, apostolin’i Kristy Jesosy noho ny sitrapon’Andriamanitra. Ho an’ny olona masina any Efesosy, izay tsy mivadika sady tafaray amin’i Kristy Jesosy,', 'avy amin’i paoly, apostolin’i kristy jesosy noho ny sitrapon’andriamanitra. ho an’ny olona masina any efesosy, izay tsy mivadika sady tafaray amin’i kristy jesosy,'),
  ('6ab25cbedbacdbce6d33cbf5', '2026-09-22T10:47:26.623Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:26.623Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Efesianina', 49, 1, 3, 'Hoderaina anie ilay Andriamanitra Rain’i Jesosy Kristy Tompontsika! Fa omeny fitahiana ara-panahy be dia be any amin’ny faritry ny lanitra isika, noho isika tafaray amin’i Kristy.', 'hoderaina anie ilay andriamanitra rain’i jesosy kristy tompontsika! fa omeny fitahiana ara-panahy be dia be any amin’ny faritry ny lanitra isika, noho isika tafaray amin’i kristy.'),
  ('6ab25cbedbacdbce6d33cc09', '2026-09-22T10:47:26.623Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:26.623Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Efesianina', 49, 1, 23, 'izany hoe ny vatany. Feno ny zava-drehetra momba azy ny fiangonana, ary izy no mameno ny zava-drehetra.', 'izany hoe ny vatany. feno ny zava-drehetra momba azy ny fiangonana, ary izy no mameno ny zava-drehetra.'),
  ('6ab25cbedbacdbce6d33cc07', '2026-09-22T10:47:26.623Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:26.623Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Efesianina', 49, 1, 21, 'Nasandrany izy ka nataony ambony lavitra noho izay fanjakana sy fahefana sy hery sy fitondrana ary anarana rehetra, tsy eto amin’izao tontolo izao ihany, fa any amin’ilay ho avy koa.', 'nasandrany izy ka nataony ambony lavitra noho izay fanjakana sy fahefana sy hery sy fitondrana ary anarana rehetra, tsy eto amin’izao tontolo izao ihany, fa any amin’ilay ho avy koa.'),
  ('6ab25cbedbacdbce6d33cbfb', '2026-09-22T10:47:26.623Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:26.623Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Efesianina', 49, 1, 9, 'rehefa nampahafantariny antsika ilay zava-miafina masina momba ny sitrapony. Mahafinaritra azy izany zava-miafina izany, sady mifanaraka amin’ilay fikasany,', 'rehefa nampahafantariny antsika ilay zava-miafina masina momba ny sitrapony. mahafinaritra azy izany zava-miafina izany, sady mifanaraka amin’ilay fikasany,'),
  ('6ab25cbedbacdbce6d33cbf4', '2026-09-22T10:47:26.623Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:26.623Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Efesianina', 49, 1, 2, 'Enga anie ilay Andriamanitra Raintsika sy Jesosy Kristy Tompo mba haneho hatsaram-panahy miavaka aminareo sady hanome fiadanana anareo!', 'enga anie ilay andriamanitra raintsika sy jesosy kristy tompo mba haneho hatsaram-panahy miavaka aminareo sady hanome fiadanana anareo!'),
  ('6ab25cbedbacdbce6d33cc04', '2026-09-22T10:47:26.623Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:26.623Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Efesianina', 49, 1, 18, 'Nataony mahiratra ny mason’ny fonareo, mba ho fantatrareo ilay fanantenana nomeny anareo tamin’izy niantso anareo. Amin’izay koa ho fantatrareo hoe be voninahitra ilay harena tehiriziny ho lovan’ny olona masina,', 'nataony mahiratra ny mason’ny fonareo, mba ho fantatrareo ilay fanantenana nomeny anareo tamin’izy niantso anareo. amin’izay koa ho fantatrareo hoe be voninahitra ilay harena tehiriziny ho lovan’ny olona masina,'),
  ('6ab25cbf2de747af4af49096', '2026-09-22T10:47:27.232Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:27.232Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Efesianina', 49, 2, 2, 'Hoatr’izany ianareo taloha, satria nanao ny fanaon’izao tontolo izao sady nanaraka an’ilay mpitondra mifehy ny rivotra. Io rivotra io dia ny toe-tsaina manjaka amin’izao ao amin’ny zanaky ny tsy fankatoavana.', 'hoatr’izany ianareo taloha, satria nanao ny fanaon’izao tontolo izao sady nanaraka an’ilay mpitondra mifehy ny rivotra. io rivotra io dia ny toe-tsaina manjaka amin’izao ao amin’ny zanaky ny tsy fankatoavana.'),
  ('6ab25cbf2de747af4af4909e', '2026-09-22T10:47:27.232Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:27.232Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Efesianina', 49, 2, 10, 'Asa tanan’Andriamanitra mantsy isika sady noforonina hanao asa tsara, noho isika tafaray amin’i Kristy Jesosy. Efa nomanin’Andriamanitra mialoha hoe hataontsika izany asa izany.', 'asa tanan’andriamanitra mantsy isika sady noforonina hanao asa tsara, noho isika tafaray amin’i kristy jesosy. efa nomanin’andriamanitra mialoha hoe hataontsika izany asa izany.'),
  ('6ab25cbf2de747af4af4909c', '2026-09-22T10:47:27.232Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:27.232Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Efesianina', 49, 2, 8, 'Izany hatsaram-panahy miavaka izany no namonjena anareo, noho ny finoanareo. Fanomezan’Andriamanitra anefa izany, fa tsy noho ny ezaka nataonareo.', 'izany hatsaram-panahy miavaka izany no namonjena anareo, noho ny finoanareo. fanomezan’andriamanitra anefa izany, fa tsy noho ny ezaka nataonareo.'),
  ('6ab25cbf2de747af4af4909f', '2026-09-22T10:47:27.232Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:27.232Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Efesianina', 49, 2, 11, 'Tadidio àry fa olon’izao tontolo izao ianareo taloha, hatramin’ny vao teraka. Niantso anareo hoe “tsy voafora” ireo antsoina hoe “voafora”, izay noforana teo amin’ny nofo sady noforan’ny tanan’olona.', 'tadidio àry fa olon’izao tontolo izao ianareo taloha, hatramin’ny vao teraka. niantso anareo hoe “tsy voafora” ireo antsoina hoe “voafora”, izay noforana teo amin’ny nofo sady noforan’ny tanan’olona.'),
  ('6ab25cbf2de747af4af4909b', '2026-09-22T10:47:27.232Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:27.232Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Efesianina', 49, 2, 7, 'mba hampisehoana hoe tsy misy fetra sady tena lehibe ny hatsaram-panahiny miavaka, ao amin’ilay tontolo ho avy. Hampiseho an’izany tokoa Izy amin’izay ka hanao zavatra tsara ho antsika tafaray amin’i Kristy Jesosy.', 'mba hampisehoana hoe tsy misy fetra sady tena lehibe ny hatsaram-panahiny miavaka, ao amin’ilay tontolo ho avy. hampiseho an’izany tokoa izy amin’izay ka hanao zavatra tsara ho antsika tafaray amin’i kristy jesosy.'),
  ('6ab25cbf2de747af4af490a0', '2026-09-22T10:47:27.232Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:27.233Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Efesianina', 49, 2, 12, 'Tsy nanana an’i Kristy ianareo tamin’izany fotoana izany, sady tsy nifandray tamin’ny firenen’Israely ary tsy tafiditra tamin’ireo fifanekena momba ny fampanantenana. Tsy nanana fanantenana koa ianareo sady tsy nanana an’Andriamanitra, teo amin’izao tontolo izao.', 'tsy nanana an’i kristy ianareo tamin’izany fotoana izany, sady tsy nifandray tamin’ny firenen’israely ary tsy tafiditra tamin’ireo fifanekena momba ny fampanantenana. tsy nanana fanantenana koa ianareo sady tsy nanana an’andriamanitra, teo amin’izao tontolo izao.'),
  ('6ab25cbf2de747af4af4909a', '2026-09-22T10:47:27.232Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:27.232Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Efesianina', 49, 2, 6, 'Niaraka novelominy sy nomeny toerana any amin’ny faritry ny lanitra koa isika, satria nataony tafaray amin’i Kristy Jesosy,', 'niaraka novelominy sy nomeny toerana any amin’ny faritry ny lanitra koa isika, satria nataony tafaray amin’i kristy jesosy,'),
  ('6ab25cbf2de747af4af49097', '2026-09-22T10:47:27.232Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:27.232Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Efesianina', 49, 2, 3, 'Nitondra tena hoatr’azy ireo isika rehetra taloha, ka nanome fahafaham-po ny fanirian’ny nofontsika, satria izay tian’ny nofontsika sy izay saim-pantatsika fotsiny no nataontsika. Ary efa zanaky ny fahatezerana hoatran’ny olona rehetra isika hatramin’ny vao teraka.', 'nitondra tena hoatr’azy ireo isika rehetra taloha, ka nanome fahafaham-po ny fanirian’ny nofontsika, satria izay tian’ny nofontsika sy izay saim-pantatsika fotsiny no nataontsika. ary efa zanaky ny fahatezerana hoatran’ny olona rehetra isika hatramin’ny vao teraka.'),
  ('6ab25cbf2de747af4af49095', '2026-09-22T10:47:27.232Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:27.232Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Efesianina', 49, 2, 1, 'Novelomin’Andriamanitra koa ianareo, na dia maty noho ny helokareo sy ny fahotanareo aza.', 'novelomin’andriamanitra koa ianareo, na dia maty noho ny helokareo sy ny fahotanareo aza.'),
  ('6ab25cbf2de747af4af49098', '2026-09-22T10:47:27.232Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:27.232Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Efesianina', 49, 2, 4, 'Tena mamindra fo anefa Andriamanitra, ary noho ny fitiavana lehibe nasehony tamintsika', 'tena mamindra fo anefa andriamanitra, ary noho ny fitiavana lehibe nasehony tamintsika'),
  ('6ab25cbf2de747af4af49099', '2026-09-22T10:47:27.232Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:27.232Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Efesianina', 49, 2, 5, 'dia novelominy niaraka tamin’i Kristy isika, na dia maty noho ny helotsika aza.—Hatsaram-panahy miavaka no namonjena anareo.—', 'dia novelominy niaraka tamin’i kristy isika, na dia maty noho ny helotsika aza.—hatsaram-panahy miavaka no namonjena anareo.—'),
  ('6ab25cbf2de747af4af4909d', '2026-09-22T10:47:27.232Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:27.232Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Efesianina', 49, 2, 9, 'Tsy vokatry ny ezaka nataonareo mihitsy izany, sao dia lasa misy manana antony hireharehana.', 'tsy vokatry ny ezaka nataonareo mihitsy izany, sao dia lasa misy manana antony hireharehana.'),
  ('6ab25cbf2de747af4af490a1', '2026-09-22T10:47:27.233Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:27.233Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Efesianina', 49, 2, 13, 'Lavitra an’Andriamanitra ianareo taloha, nefa efa lasa akaiky azy izao, satria tafaray amin’i Kristy Jesosy noho ny rany.', 'lavitra an’andriamanitra ianareo taloha, nefa efa lasa akaiky azy izao, satria tafaray amin’i kristy jesosy noho ny rany.'),
  ('6ab25cbf2de747af4af490aa', '2026-09-22T10:47:27.233Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:27.233Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Efesianina', 49, 2, 22, 'Tafaray aminy koa ianareo, dia miaraka aorin’Andriamanitra mba ho lasa toerana honenany amin’ny alalan’ny fanahiny.', 'tafaray aminy koa ianareo, dia miaraka aorin’andriamanitra mba ho lasa toerana honenany amin’ny alalan’ny fanahiny.'),
  ('6ab25cbf2de747af4af490a4', '2026-09-22T10:47:27.233Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:27.233Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Efesianina', 49, 2, 16, 'Tiany koa ny hampihavana tanteraka antsika amin’Andriamanitra, amin’ny alalan’ny hazo fijaliana. Dia ho lasa vatana iray ihany isika, satria efa nofoanany tamin’izy maty ilay zavatra nahatonga antsika ho mpifahavalo.', 'tiany koa ny hampihavana tanteraka antsika amin’andriamanitra, amin’ny alalan’ny hazo fijaliana. dia ho lasa vatana iray ihany isika, satria efa nofoanany tamin’izy maty ilay zavatra nahatonga antsika ho mpifahavalo.'),
  ('6ab25cbf2de747af4af490a7', '2026-09-22T10:47:27.233Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:27.233Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Efesianina', 49, 2, 19, 'Tsy vahiny na hafa firenena intsony àry ianareo, fa mpiray firenena amin’ny olona masina sady anisan’ny ankohonan’Andriamanitra.', 'tsy vahiny na hafa firenena intsony àry ianareo, fa mpiray firenena amin’ny olona masina sady anisan’ny ankohonan’andriamanitra.'),
  ('6ab25cbf2de747af4af490a2', '2026-09-22T10:47:27.233Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:27.233Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Efesianina', 49, 2, 14, 'Izy mantsy no nampihavana antsika. Izy ilay nampiray antsika roa tonta sy nandrava an’ilay rindrina nanasaraka antsika.', 'izy mantsy no nampihavana antsika. izy ilay nampiray antsika roa tonta sy nandrava an’ilay rindrina nanasaraka antsika.'),
  ('6ab25cbf2de747af4af490a8', '2026-09-22T10:47:27.233Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:27.233Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Efesianina', 49, 2, 20, 'Ary efa naorina teo ambony fototra, dia ny apostoly sy ny mpaminany, ianareo. I Kristy Jesosy kosa no vato fehizoro.', 'ary efa naorina teo ambony fototra, dia ny apostoly sy ny mpaminany, ianareo. i kristy jesosy kosa no vato fehizoro.'),
  ('6ab25cbf2de747af4af490a3', '2026-09-22T10:47:27.233Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:27.233Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Efesianina', 49, 2, 15, 'Ny nofony no nanafoanany an’ilay nahatonga antsika roa tonta ho mpifahavalo, dia ny Lalàna misy didy maro. Tiany ho lasa olom-baovao iray ihany sy hihavana mantsy isika roa tonta, izay samy tafaray aminy.', 'ny nofony no nanafoanany an’ilay nahatonga antsika roa tonta ho mpifahavalo, dia ny lalàna misy didy maro. tiany ho lasa olom-baovao iray ihany sy hihavana mantsy isika roa tonta, izay samy tafaray aminy.'),
  ('6ab25cbf2de747af4af490a6', '2026-09-22T10:47:27.233Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:27.233Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Efesianina', 49, 2, 18, 'Amin’ny alalany mantsy no ahafahantsika roa tonta manatona ny Ray, satria fanahy iray ihany no azontsika rehetra.', 'amin’ny alalany mantsy no ahafahantsika roa tonta manatona ny ray, satria fanahy iray ihany no azontsika rehetra.'),
  ('6ab25cbf2de747af4af490a9', '2026-09-22T10:47:27.233Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:27.233Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Efesianina', 49, 2, 21, 'Tafaray amin’i Kristy ilay trano manontolo, ary tafakambana tsara daholo ny zavatra anamboarana azy. Dia mihamiakatra ilay trano, ka lasa tempoly masina ho an’i Jehovah.', 'tafaray amin’i kristy ilay trano manontolo, ary tafakambana tsara daholo ny zavatra anamboarana azy. dia mihamiakatra ilay trano, ka lasa tempoly masina ho an’i jehovah.'),
  ('6ab25cbf2de747af4af490a5', '2026-09-22T10:47:27.233Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:27.233Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Efesianina', 49, 2, 17, 'Dia tonga izy ka nitory ny vaovao tsara momba ny fihavanana taminareo izay lavitra an’Andriamanitra, sy tamin’izay akaiky azy.', 'dia tonga izy ka nitory ny vaovao tsara momba ny fihavanana taminareo izay lavitra an’andriamanitra, sy tamin’izay akaiky azy.'),
  ('6ab25cc0ec93c3e5af052499', '2026-09-22T10:47:28.296Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:28.296Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Efesianina', 49, 3, 20, 'Afaka manao mihoatra noho izay rehetra angatahintsika na eritreretintsika Andriamanitra, ary mihoatra lavitra noho izany aza, noho ilay heriny miasa ao anatintsika. Ho azy anie ny voninahitra,', 'afaka manao mihoatra noho izay rehetra angatahintsika na eritreretintsika andriamanitra, ary mihoatra lavitra noho izany aza, noho ilay heriny miasa ao anatintsika. ho azy anie ny voninahitra,'),
  ('6ab25cc0ec93c3e5af052492', '2026-09-22T10:47:28.296Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:28.296Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Efesianina', 49, 3, 13, 'Miangavy anareo àry aho mba tsy ho kivy satria hoe miaritra fahoriana aho noho izaho manampy anareo. Voninahitra ho anareo mantsy ireny.', 'miangavy anareo àry aho mba tsy ho kivy satria hoe miaritra fahoriana aho noho izaho manampy anareo. voninahitra ho anareo mantsy ireny.'),
  ('6ab25cc0ec93c3e5af05248b', '2026-09-22T10:47:28.296Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:28.296Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Efesianina', 49, 3, 6, 'Izao ilay zava-miafina: Rehefa lasa tafaray amin’i Kristy Jesosy sy nanaiky ny vaovao tsara ny hafa firenena, dia tokony ho mpiray lova aminay sy anisan’ilay vatana iray ihany. Dia hahazo an’ilay zavatra nampanantenain’Andriamanitra anay koa izy ireo.', 'izao ilay zava-miafina: rehefa lasa tafaray amin’i kristy jesosy sy nanaiky ny vaovao tsara ny hafa firenena, dia tokony ho mpiray lova aminay sy anisan’ilay vatana iray ihany. dia hahazo an’ilay zavatra nampanantenain’andriamanitra anay koa izy ireo.'),
  ('6ab25cc0ec93c3e5af052493', '2026-09-22T10:47:28.296Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:28.296Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Efesianina', 49, 3, 14, 'Noho izany, dia mandohalika eo anatrehan’ny Ray aho.', 'noho izany, dia mandohalika eo anatrehan’ny ray aho.'),
  ('6ab25cc0ec93c3e5af052486', '2026-09-22T10:47:28.296Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:28.296Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Efesianina', 49, 3, 1, 'Noho izany, izaho Paoly, ilay migadra satria izaho an’i Kristy Jesosy sady manampy anareo hafa firenena...', 'noho izany, izaho paoly, ilay migadra satria izaho an’i kristy jesosy sady manampy anareo hafa firenena...'),
  ('6ab25cc0ec93c3e5af052490', '2026-09-22T10:47:28.296Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:28.296Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Efesianina', 49, 3, 11, 'Izany dia mifanaraka amin’ilay fikasany hatrizay hatrizay momba an’i Kristy, dia i Jesosy Tompontsika.', 'izany dia mifanaraka amin’ilay fikasany hatrizay hatrizay momba an’i kristy, dia i jesosy tompontsika.'),
  ('6ab25cc0ec93c3e5af05248c', '2026-09-22T10:47:28.296Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:28.296Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Efesianina', 49, 3, 7, 'Lasa mpanompo miandraikitra an’izany àry aho, noho ny hatsaram-panahy miavaka nasehon’Andriamanitra tamiko, ary fanomezana maimaim-poana izany. Nanehoany an’izany hatsaram-panahy izany aho tamin’izy nampiseho ny heriny tamiko.', 'lasa mpanompo miandraikitra an’izany àry aho, noho ny hatsaram-panahy miavaka nasehon’andriamanitra tamiko, ary fanomezana maimaim-poana izany. nanehoany an’izany hatsaram-panahy izany aho tamin’izy nampiseho ny heriny tamiko.'),
  ('6ab25cc0ec93c3e5af05248d', '2026-09-22T10:47:28.296Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:28.296Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Efesianina', 49, 3, 8, 'Izaho izay mbola kely noho ny kely indrindra amin’ny olona masina rehetra no nanehoana an’izany hatsaram-panahy miavaka izany. Noho izany, dia afaka nitory tamin’ny hafa firenena ny vaovao tsara momba ny harena tsy hita fetran’i Kristy aho,', 'izaho izay mbola kely noho ny kely indrindra amin’ny olona masina rehetra no nanehoana an’izany hatsaram-panahy miavaka izany. noho izany, dia afaka nitory tamin’ny hafa firenena ny vaovao tsara momba ny harena tsy hita fetran’i kristy aho,'),
  ('6ab25cc0ec93c3e5af052496', '2026-09-22T10:47:28.296Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:28.296Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Efesianina', 49, 3, 17, 'Mivavaka koa aho mba ho ao am-ponareo foana i Kristy, miaraka amin’ny fitiavanareo, satria ianareo mino azy. Dia enga anie ianareo mba hamaka tsara sy hiorina mafy eo amin’ny fototra!', 'mivavaka koa aho mba ho ao am-ponareo foana i kristy, miaraka amin’ny fitiavanareo, satria ianareo mino azy. dia enga anie ianareo mba hamaka tsara sy hiorina mafy eo amin’ny fototra!'),
  ('6ab25cc0ec93c3e5af052491', '2026-09-22T10:47:28.296Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:28.296Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Efesianina', 49, 3, 12, 'Izy no mahatonga antsika ho sahy miteny, sy ho afaka hanatona an’Andriamanitra amin-toky noho isika mino azy.', 'izy no mahatonga antsika ho sahy miteny, sy ho afaka hanatona an’andriamanitra amin-toky noho isika mino azy.'),
  ('6ab25cc0ec93c3e5af052487', '2026-09-22T10:47:28.296Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:28.296Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Efesianina', 49, 3, 2, 'Efa henonareo tokoa ilay andraikitra nankinina tamiko, dia ny hanampy anareo handray soa amin’ny hatsaram-panahy miavaka asehon’Andriamanitra.', 'efa henonareo tokoa ilay andraikitra nankinina tamiko, dia ny hanampy anareo handray soa amin’ny hatsaram-panahy miavaka asehon’andriamanitra.'),
  ('6ab25cc0ec93c3e5af052495', '2026-09-22T10:47:28.296Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:28.296Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Efesianina', 49, 3, 16, 'Mivavaka aho mba hampiasa ny hery avy amin’ny fanahiny Andriamanitra, mba hanatanjahana ny fonareo sy ny sainareo, satria tena manan-karena voninahitra izy.', 'mivavaka aho mba hampiasa ny hery avy amin’ny fanahiny andriamanitra, mba hanatanjahana ny fonareo sy ny sainareo, satria tena manan-karena voninahitra izy.'),
  ('6ab25cc0ec93c3e5af05248e', '2026-09-22T10:47:28.296Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:28.296Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Efesianina', 49, 3, 9, 'sady nanampy ny olona rehetra hahita an’izay ataon’Andriamanitra momba an’ilay zava-miafina masina. Efa hatramin’ny ela be io zava-miafina io no nafenin’ilay Andriamanitra namorona ny zava-drehetra.', 'sady nanampy ny olona rehetra hahita an’izay ataon’andriamanitra momba an’ilay zava-miafina masina. efa hatramin’ny ela be io zava-miafina io no nafenin’ilay andriamanitra namorona ny zava-drehetra.'),
  ('6ab25cc0ec93c3e5af052498', '2026-09-22T10:47:28.296Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:28.296Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Efesianina', 49, 3, 19, 'dia ho fantatrareo koa ny fitiavan’i Kristy izay mbola mihoatra noho ny fahalalana, mba ho feno ny toetra rehetra avy amin’Andriamanitra ianareo.', 'dia ho fantatrareo koa ny fitiavan’i kristy izay mbola mihoatra noho ny fahalalana, mba ho feno ny toetra rehetra avy amin’andriamanitra ianareo.'),
  ('6ab25cc0ec93c3e5af052489', '2026-09-22T10:47:28.296Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:28.296Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Efesianina', 49, 3, 4, 'Rehefa mamaky an’ity àry ianareo, dia ho azonareo hoe haiko tsara ilay zava-miafina masina momba an’i Kristy.', 'rehefa mamaky an’ity àry ianareo, dia ho azonareo hoe haiko tsara ilay zava-miafina masina momba an’i kristy.'),
  ('6ab25cc0ec93c3e5af05249a', '2026-09-22T10:47:28.296Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:28.296Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Efesianina', 49, 3, 21, 'eny, ho azy anie ilay voninahitra amin’ny alalan’ny fiangonana sy amin’ny alalan’i Kristy Jesosy, hatrany amin’ny taranaka rehetra mandrakizay mandrakizay! Amena.', 'eny, ho azy anie ilay voninahitra amin’ny alalan’ny fiangonana sy amin’ny alalan’i kristy jesosy, hatrany amin’ny taranaka rehetra mandrakizay mandrakizay! amena.'),
  ('6ab25cc0ec93c3e5af052497', '2026-09-22T10:47:28.296Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:28.296Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Efesianina', 49, 3, 18, 'Amin’izay dia ho azonareo tsara miaraka amin’ny olona masina rehetra ny fahamarinana, izany hoe ny sakany sy halavany sy haavony ary halaliny,', 'amin’izay dia ho azonareo tsara miaraka amin’ny olona masina rehetra ny fahamarinana, izany hoe ny sakany sy halavany sy haavony ary halaliny,'),
  ('6ab25cc0ec93c3e5af05248a', '2026-09-22T10:47:28.296Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:28.296Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Efesianina', 49, 3, 5, 'Tsy nampahafantarina an’io zava-miafina io ny taranaka tany aloha, nefa izao ilay izy naharihary tamin’ny apostoliny masina sy ny mpaminaniny, tamin’ny alalan’ny fanahy masina.', 'tsy nampahafantarina an’io zava-miafina io ny taranaka tany aloha, nefa izao ilay izy naharihary tamin’ny apostoliny masina sy ny mpaminaniny, tamin’ny alalan’ny fanahy masina.'),
  ('6ab25cc0ec93c3e5af052494', '2026-09-22T10:47:28.296Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:28.296Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Efesianina', 49, 3, 15, 'Izy mantsy no nampisy ny fianakaviana rehetra any an-danitra sy eto an-tany ka nahazoan’izy ireo anarana.', 'izy mantsy no nampisy ny fianakaviana rehetra any an-danitra sy eto an-tany ka nahazoan’izy ireo anarana.'),
  ('6ab25cc0ec93c3e5af052488', '2026-09-22T10:47:28.296Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:28.296Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Efesianina', 49, 3, 3, 'Nampahafantariny ahy sy naharihariny tamiko mantsy ilay zava-miafina masina, araka ilay efa nosoratako fohifohy taminareo.', 'nampahafantariny ahy sy naharihariny tamiko mantsy ilay zava-miafina masina, araka ilay efa nosoratako fohifohy taminareo.'),
  ('6ab25cc0ec93c3e5af05248f', '2026-09-22T10:47:28.296Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:28.296Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Efesianina', 49, 3, 10, 'Nanao an’izany Andriamanitra mba ho amin’izao no ampahafantarana ny fahendreny, izay miseho amin’ny fomba isan-karazany, amin’ny fanjakana sy ny manam-pahefana any amin’ny faritry ny lanitra, ary amin’ny alalan’ny fiangonana no ampahafantarana an’izany.', 'nanao an’izany andriamanitra mba ho amin’izao no ampahafantarana ny fahendreny, izay miseho amin’ny fomba isan-karazany, amin’ny fanjakana sy ny manam-pahefana any amin’ny faritry ny lanitra, ary amin’ny alalan’ny fiangonana no ampahafantarana an’izany.'),
  ('6ab25cc28e222bada99f6d15', '2026-09-22T10:47:30.294Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:30.294Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Efesianina', 49, 4, 8, 'Fa voasoratra hoe: “Nitondra olona maro ho babo izy rehefa niakatra tany amin’ny avo, ary lehilahy no nataony fanomezana.”', 'fa voasoratra hoe: “nitondra olona maro ho babo izy rehefa niakatra tany amin’ny avo, ary lehilahy no nataony fanomezana.”'),
  ('6ab25cc28e222bada99f6d0f', '2026-09-22T10:47:30.294Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:30.294Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Efesianina', 49, 4, 2, 'izany hoe hanetry tena sy halemy fanahy foana, hanam-paharetana, hifandefitra noho ny fitiavana,', 'izany hoe hanetry tena sy halemy fanahy foana, hanam-paharetana, hifandefitra noho ny fitiavana,'),
  ('6ab25cc28e222bada99f6d14', '2026-09-22T10:47:30.294Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:30.294Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Efesianina', 49, 4, 7, 'Nanehoana hatsaram-panahy miavaka isika tsirairay, arakaraka izay nomen’i Kristy, ary maimaim-poana izany fanomezana izany.', 'nanehoana hatsaram-panahy miavaka isika tsirairay, arakaraka izay nomen’i kristy, ary maimaim-poana izany fanomezana izany.'),
  ('6ab25cc28e222bada99f6d0e', '2026-09-22T10:47:30.294Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:30.294Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Efesianina', 49, 4, 1, 'Miangavy anareo àry aho, izaho ilay gadra noho ny amin’ny Tompo, mba hitondra tena tsara ianareo ka ho mendrika an’ilay fiantsoana anareo,', 'miangavy anareo àry aho, izaho ilay gadra noho ny amin’ny tompo, mba hitondra tena tsara ianareo ka ho mendrika an’ilay fiantsoana anareo,'),
  ('6ab25cc28e222bada99f6d17', '2026-09-22T10:47:30.294Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:30.294Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Efesianina', 49, 4, 10, 'Ilay nidina ihany no niakatra any lavitra any, any ambonin’ny lanitra rehetra, mba hahatonga ny zava-drehetra ho tanteraka.', 'ilay nidina ihany no niakatra any lavitra any, any ambonin’ny lanitra rehetra, mba hahatonga ny zava-drehetra ho tanteraka.'),
  ('6ab25cc28e222bada99f6d13', '2026-09-22T10:47:30.294Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:30.294Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Efesianina', 49, 4, 6, 'Iray ilay Andriamanitra sady Rain’ny olona rehetra, ary manana fahefana amin’izy rehetra. Mampiasa azy rehetra koa izy, ary miasa ao anatin’izy rehetra.', 'iray ilay andriamanitra sady rain’ny olona rehetra, ary manana fahefana amin’izy rehetra. mampiasa azy rehetra koa izy, ary miasa ao anatin’izy rehetra.'),
  ('6ab25cc28e222bada99f6d12', '2026-09-22T10:47:30.294Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:30.294Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Efesianina', 49, 4, 5, 'Iray ny Tompo, iray ny finoana, ary iray ny batisa.', 'iray ny tompo, iray ny finoana, ary iray ny batisa.'),
  ('6ab25cc28e222bada99f6d16', '2026-09-22T10:47:30.294Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:30.294Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Efesianina', 49, 4, 9, 'Fa inona no dikan’ilay hoe ‘niakatra izy’? Midika izany hoe nidina tetỳ amin’ny faritra ambany koa izy, izany hoe tetỳ an-tany.', 'fa inona no dikan’ilay hoe ‘niakatra izy’? midika izany hoe nidina tetỳ amin’ny faritra ambany koa izy, izany hoe tetỳ an-tany.'),
  ('6ab25cc28e222bada99f6d10', '2026-09-22T10:47:30.294Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:30.294Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Efesianina', 49, 4, 3, 'ary hiezaka mafy ho tafaray foana sady hihavana, satria efa nampiraisin’ny fanahy masina ianareo.', 'ary hiezaka mafy ho tafaray foana sady hihavana, satria efa nampiraisin’ny fanahy masina ianareo.'),
  ('6ab25cc28e222bada99f6d11', '2026-09-22T10:47:30.294Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:30.294Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Efesianina', 49, 4, 4, 'Iray ny vatana, ary iray ny fanahy masina, hoatran’ny niantsoana anareo ho amin’ny fanantenana iray ihany.', 'iray ny vatana, ary iray ny fanahy masina, hoatran’ny niantsoana anareo ho amin’ny fanantenana iray ihany.'),
  ('6ab25cc28e222bada99f6d29', '2026-09-22T10:47:30.295Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:30.295Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Efesianina', 49, 4, 28, 'Aoka ny mpangalatra tsy hangalatra intsony, fa tokony hiasa mafy kosa izy, ka hampiasa ny tanany hanaovana asa tsara, mba hanan-javatra hozaraina amin’izay sahirana.', 'aoka ny mpangalatra tsy hangalatra intsony, fa tokony hiasa mafy kosa izy, ka hampiasa ny tanany hanaovana asa tsara, mba hanan-javatra hozaraina amin’izay sahirana.'),
  ('6ab25cc28e222bada99f6d1b', '2026-09-22T10:47:30.295Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:30.295Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Efesianina', 49, 4, 14, 'Tsy tokony ho zaza intsony àry isika, ka hatopatopan’ny onja sy havezivezin’ny rivotr’izao karazana fampianarana rehetra izao, izany hoe ho voataonan’ny olona mamitaka sy fetsifetsy.', 'tsy tokony ho zaza intsony àry isika, ka hatopatopan’ny onja sy havezivezin’ny rivotr’izao karazana fampianarana rehetra izao, izany hoe ho voataonan’ny olona mamitaka sy fetsifetsy.'),
  ('6ab25cc28e222bada99f6d26', '2026-09-22T10:47:30.295Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:30.295Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Efesianina', 49, 4, 25, 'Satria àry efa narianareo ny lainga, dia samia milaza ny marina amin’ny namanareo avy ianareo tsirairay, fa rantsambatana mifampiankina isika.', 'satria àry efa narianareo ny lainga, dia samia milaza ny marina amin’ny namanareo avy ianareo tsirairay, fa rantsambatana mifampiankina isika.'),
  ('6ab25cc28e222bada99f6d25', '2026-09-22T10:47:30.295Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:30.295Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Efesianina', 49, 4, 24, 'ary tokony hitafy ny toetra vaovao izay noforonina mifanaraka amin’ny sitrapon’Andriamanitra, sady mifanaraka amin’izay atao hoe tena marina sy tsy mivadika.', 'ary tokony hitafy ny toetra vaovao izay noforonina mifanaraka amin’ny sitrapon’andriamanitra, sady mifanaraka amin’izay atao hoe tena marina sy tsy mivadika.'),
  ('6ab25cc28e222bada99f6d23', '2026-09-22T10:47:30.295Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:30.295Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Efesianina', 49, 4, 22, 'Nampianarina ianareo hoe tokony hanala ny toetranareo taloha, izay mifanaraka amin’ny fitondran-tenanareo taloha sady miharatsy foana noho ny fanirian-dratsy mamitaka.', 'nampianarina ianareo hoe tokony hanala ny toetranareo taloha, izay mifanaraka amin’ny fitondran-tenanareo taloha sady miharatsy foana noho ny fanirian-dratsy mamitaka.'),
  ('6ab25cc28e222bada99f6d24', '2026-09-22T10:47:30.295Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:30.295Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Efesianina', 49, 4, 23, 'Tokony hanavao ny toe-tsainareo foana koa ianareo,', 'tokony hanavao ny toe-tsainareo foana koa ianareo,'),
  ('6ab25cc28e222bada99f6d22', '2026-09-22T10:47:30.295Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:30.295Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Efesianina', 49, 4, 21, 'raha naheno azy tokoa ianareo, tamin’ianareo nampianarina mifanaraka amin’ny fahamarinana nampianarin’i Jesosy.', 'raha naheno azy tokoa ianareo, tamin’ianareo nampianarina mifanaraka amin’ny fahamarinana nampianarin’i jesosy.'),
  ('6ab25cc28e222bada99f6d21', '2026-09-22T10:47:30.295Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:30.295Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Efesianina', 49, 4, 20, 'Nianaranareo anefa hoe tsy mba hoatr’izany i Kristy,', 'nianaranareo anefa hoe tsy mba hoatr’izany i kristy,'),
  ('6ab25cc28e222bada99f6d1f', '2026-09-22T10:47:30.295Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:30.295Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Efesianina', 49, 4, 18, 'Maizin-tsaina izy ireo sady tsy hahazo an’ilay fiainana ampanantenain’Andriamanitra antsika, satria tsy mahalala an’Andriamanitra izy ireo ary tsy mihontsina ny fony.', 'maizin-tsaina izy ireo sady tsy hahazo an’ilay fiainana ampanantenain’andriamanitra antsika, satria tsy mahalala an’andriamanitra izy ireo ary tsy mihontsina ny fony.'),
  ('6ab25cc28e222bada99f6d1c', '2026-09-22T10:47:30.295Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:30.295Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Efesianina', 49, 4, 15, 'Milaza ny marina kosa isika, dia andao hitombo amin’ny lafiny rehetra noho ny fitiavana, ka hanahaka an’i Kristy, ilay lohan’ny vatana.', 'milaza ny marina kosa isika, dia andao hitombo amin’ny lafiny rehetra noho ny fitiavana, ka hanahaka an’i kristy, ilay lohan’ny vatana.'),
  ('6ab25cc28e222bada99f6d2c', '2026-09-22T10:47:30.295Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:30.295Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Efesianina', 49, 4, 31, 'Esory aminareo daholo rehefa mety ho lolompo, fahatezerana, fisafoahana, filelalelana, ary fanevatevana, sy ny toetra hafa rehetra mampalahelo ny hafa.', 'esory aminareo daholo rehefa mety ho lolompo, fahatezerana, fisafoahana, filelalelana, ary fanevatevana, sy ny toetra hafa rehetra mampalahelo ny hafa.'),
  ('6ab25cc28e222bada99f6d2a', '2026-09-22T10:47:30.295Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:30.295Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Efesianina', 49, 4, 29, 'Aza avela hisy teny ratsy hivoaka amin’ny vavanareo, fa izay tsara mba hampaherezana ihany, rehefa ilaina izany, mba hizarana zavatra mahasoa an’izay mihaino.', 'aza avela hisy teny ratsy hivoaka amin’ny vavanareo, fa izay tsara mba hampaherezana ihany, rehefa ilaina izany, mba hizarana zavatra mahasoa an’izay mihaino.'),
  ('6ab25cc28e222bada99f6d19', '2026-09-22T10:47:30.295Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:30.295Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Efesianina', 49, 4, 12, 'dia amin’izay izy ireo ho afaka hanitsy ny olona masina, hanao fanompoana, ary hanatanjaka ny vatan’i Kristy.', 'dia amin’izay izy ireo ho afaka hanitsy ny olona masina, hanao fanompoana, ary hanatanjaka ny vatan’i kristy.'),
  ('6ab25cc28e222bada99f6d27', '2026-09-22T10:47:30.295Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:30.295Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Efesianina', 49, 4, 26, 'Tezera fa aza manota. Aza avela ho tratran’ny masoandro milentika ny fahatezeranareo,', 'tezera fa aza manota. aza avela ho tratran’ny masoandro milentika ny fahatezeranareo,'),
  ('6ab25cc28e222bada99f6d1e', '2026-09-22T10:47:30.295Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:30.295Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Efesianina', 49, 4, 17, 'Izao àry no lazaiko sady ampirisihako anareo eo anatrehan’ny Tompo: Aza manao hoatran’izao tontolo izao intsony, fa tsy misy dikany ny fisainan’izy ireo.', 'izao àry no lazaiko sady ampirisihako anareo eo anatrehan’ny tompo: aza manao hoatran’izao tontolo izao intsony, fa tsy misy dikany ny fisainan’izy ireo.'),
  ('6ab25cc28e222bada99f6d1a', '2026-09-22T10:47:30.295Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:30.295Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Efesianina', 49, 4, 13, 'Hanao an’izany izy ireo mandra-pahatonga antsika rehetra hanana zavatra inoana mitovy, sy hanana fahalalana mitovy momba ny Zanak’Andriamanitra. Amin’izay isika ho lasa olon-dehibe, izany hoe ho lasa matotra tanteraka hoatran’i Kristy.', 'hanao an’izany izy ireo mandra-pahatonga antsika rehetra hanana zavatra inoana mitovy, sy hanana fahalalana mitovy momba ny zanak’andriamanitra. amin’izay isika ho lasa olon-dehibe, izany hoe ho lasa matotra tanteraka hoatran’i kristy.'),
  ('6ab25cc28e222bada99f6d1d', '2026-09-22T10:47:30.295Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:30.295Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Efesianina', 49, 4, 16, 'Izy no mahatonga ny vatana manontolo ho tafakambana tsara sy hiara-miasa satria mifanampy ny tonon-taolana rehetra mba hanome izay ilaina. Rehefa miasa tsara ny rantsambatana tsirairay, dia mitombo ny vatana ka mihamatanjaka noho ny fitiavana.', 'izy no mahatonga ny vatana manontolo ho tafakambana tsara sy hiara-miasa satria mifanampy ny tonon-taolana rehetra mba hanome izay ilaina. rehefa miasa tsara ny rantsambatana tsirairay, dia mitombo ny vatana ka mihamatanjaka noho ny fitiavana.'),
  ('6ab25cc28e222bada99f6d28', '2026-09-22T10:47:30.295Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:30.295Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Efesianina', 49, 4, 27, 'ary aza omena hirika ny Devoly.', 'ary aza omena hirika ny devoly.'),
  ('6ab25cc28e222bada99f6d20', '2026-09-22T10:47:30.295Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:30.295Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Efesianina', 49, 4, 19, 'Efa tsy mahalala menatra intsony izy ireo, ka manaram-po amin’ny fitondran-tena tsy misy henatra sy manao an’izao karazana fahalotoana rehetra izao, sady tsy mety afa-po fa mbola te hanao foana.', 'efa tsy mahalala menatra intsony izy ireo, ka manaram-po amin’ny fitondran-tena tsy misy henatra sy manao an’izao karazana fahalotoana rehetra izao, sady tsy mety afa-po fa mbola te hanao foana.'),
  ('6ab25cc28e222bada99f6d2d', '2026-09-22T10:47:30.295Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:30.295Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Efesianina', 49, 4, 32, 'Miezaha kosa ho tsara fanahy amin’ny namanareo avy, ka hangoraka sy hifamela heloka tanteraka, toy ny namelan’Andriamanitra tanteraka ny helokareo, tamin’ny alalan’i Kristy.', 'miezaha kosa ho tsara fanahy amin’ny namanareo avy, ka hangoraka sy hifamela heloka tanteraka, toy ny namelan’andriamanitra tanteraka ny helokareo, tamin’ny alalan’i kristy.'),
  ('6ab25cc28e222bada99f6d2b', '2026-09-22T10:47:30.295Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:30.295Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Efesianina', 49, 4, 30, 'Aza manao izay hampalahelo ny fanahy masin’Andriamanitra koa, fa nasiana tombo-kase tamin’io fanahy io ianareo mba hafahana amin’ny alalan’ny vidim-panavotana rehefa tonga ilay andro fanafahana.', 'aza manao izay hampalahelo ny fanahy masin’andriamanitra koa, fa nasiana tombo-kase tamin’io fanahy io ianareo mba hafahana amin’ny alalan’ny vidim-panavotana rehefa tonga ilay andro fanafahana.'),
  ('6ab25cc28e222bada99f6d18', '2026-09-22T10:47:30.295Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:30.295Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Efesianina', 49, 4, 11, 'Ny sasany notendreny ho apostoly, ny sasany ho mpaminany, ny sasany ho mpitory ny vaovao tsara, ary ny sasany ho mpiandry sy mpampianatra,', 'ny sasany notendreny ho apostoly, ny sasany ho mpaminany, ny sasany ho mpitory ny vaovao tsara, ary ny sasany ho mpiandry sy mpampianatra,'),
  ('6ab25cc34ec00b417473a042', '2026-09-22T10:47:31.348Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:31.348Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Efesianina', 49, 5, 32, 'Lehibe izany zava-miafina masina izany. Miresaka momba an’i Kristy sy ny fiangonana aho.', 'lehibe izany zava-miafina masina izany. miresaka momba an’i kristy sy ny fiangonana aho.'),
  ('6ab25cc34ec00b417473a02e', '2026-09-22T10:47:31.348Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:31.348Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Efesianina', 49, 5, 12, 'Fa mahamenatra na dia ny manonona an’izay ataon’ireny olona ireny ao amin’ny miafina aza.', 'fa mahamenatra na dia ny manonona an’izay ataon’ireny olona ireny ao amin’ny miafina aza.'),
  ('6ab25cc34ec00b417473a02b', '2026-09-22T10:47:31.348Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:31.348Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Efesianina', 49, 5, 9, 'Ny vokatry ny mazava mantsy dia izay rehetra atao hoe hatsaran-toetra sy fanaovana ny marina ary fahamarinana.', 'ny vokatry ny mazava mantsy dia izay rehetra atao hoe hatsaran-toetra sy fanaovana ny marina ary fahamarinana.'),
  ('6ab25cc34ec00b417473a03d', '2026-09-22T10:47:31.348Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:31.348Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Efesianina', 49, 5, 27, 'Amin’izay ny fiangonana dia ho tena tsara eo anatrehany, ka tsy hisy pentina na ketrona na zavatra hoatr’izany, fa ho masina sy tsy misy tsiny.', 'amin’izay ny fiangonana dia ho tena tsara eo anatrehany, ka tsy hisy pentina na ketrona na zavatra hoatr’izany, fa ho masina sy tsy misy tsiny.'),
  ('6ab25cc34ec00b417473a032', '2026-09-22T10:47:31.348Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:31.348Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Efesianina', 49, 5, 16, 'ka ampiasao tsara ny fotoananareo, fa ratsy izao andro izao.', 'ka ampiasao tsara ny fotoananareo, fa ratsy izao andro izao.'),
  ('6ab25cc34ec00b417473a02c', '2026-09-22T10:47:31.348Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:31.348Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Efesianina', 49, 5, 10, 'Fantaro tsara foana izay ankasitrahan’ny Tompo,', 'fantaro tsara foana izay ankasitrahan’ny tompo,'),
  ('6ab25cc34ec00b417473a028', '2026-09-22T10:47:31.348Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:31.348Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Efesianina', 49, 5, 6, 'Aza avela hisy hamitaka anareo amin’ny teny tsy misy dikany, satria ireo zavatra ireo no mahatonga an’Andriamanitra ho tezitra amin’ny zanaky ny tsy fankatoavana.', 'aza avela hisy hamitaka anareo amin’ny teny tsy misy dikany, satria ireo zavatra ireo no mahatonga an’andriamanitra ho tezitra amin’ny zanaky ny tsy fankatoavana.'),
  ('6ab25cc34ec00b417473a03c', '2026-09-22T10:47:31.348Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:31.348Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Efesianina', 49, 5, 26, 'mba hanamasinany azy, ka hanadiovany azy amin’ny rano fandroana, izany hoe ny teny.', 'mba hanamasinany azy, ka hanadiovany azy amin’ny rano fandroana, izany hoe ny teny.'),
  ('6ab25cc34ec00b417473a037', '2026-09-22T10:47:31.348Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:31.348Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Efesianina', 49, 5, 21, 'Samia manaiky ny namanareo avy ianareo, noho ianareo matahotra an’i Kristy.', 'samia manaiky ny namanareo avy ianareo, noho ianareo matahotra an’i kristy.'),
  ('6ab25cc34ec00b417473a043', '2026-09-22T10:47:31.348Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:31.348Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Efesianina', 49, 5, 33, 'Na izany aza, dia tsy maintsy tia ny vadiny tahaka ny tenany ny lehilahy tsirairay, fa ny vehivavy indray tokony hanaja lalina ny vadiny.', 'na izany aza, dia tsy maintsy tia ny vadiny tahaka ny tenany ny lehilahy tsirairay, fa ny vehivavy indray tokony hanaja lalina ny vadiny.'),
  ('6ab25cc34ec00b417473a026', '2026-09-22T10:47:31.348Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:31.348Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Efesianina', 49, 5, 4, 'Aza avela hotononina koa izay fitondran-tena mahamenatra na resaka adaladala na vazivazy vetaveta, satria samy tsy mendrika ireo. Aleo kosa misaotra an’Andriamanitra.', 'aza avela hotononina koa izay fitondran-tena mahamenatra na resaka adaladala na vazivazy vetaveta, satria samy tsy mendrika ireo. aleo kosa misaotra an’andriamanitra.'),
  ('6ab25cc34ec00b417473a025', '2026-09-22T10:47:31.348Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:31.348Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Efesianina', 49, 5, 3, 'Aza avela hotononina eo aminareo akory izay resaka momba ny fijangajangana sy izay rehetra mety ho fahalotoana na faniriana tsy mety afa-po, fa tsy mety amin’ny olona masina izany.', 'aza avela hotononina eo aminareo akory izay resaka momba ny fijangajangana sy izay rehetra mety ho fahalotoana na faniriana tsy mety afa-po, fa tsy mety amin’ny olona masina izany.'),
  ('6ab25cc34ec00b417473a039', '2026-09-22T10:47:31.348Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:31.348Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Efesianina', 49, 5, 23, 'satria ny lehilahy no lohan’ny vadiny, hoatran’i Kristy izay lohan’ny fiangonana, ary izy no mpamonjy an’io vatana io.', 'satria ny lehilahy no lohan’ny vadiny, hoatran’i kristy izay lohan’ny fiangonana, ary izy no mpamonjy an’io vatana io.'),
  ('6ab25cc34ec00b417473a023', '2026-09-22T10:47:31.348Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:31.348Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Efesianina', 49, 5, 1, 'Tahafo àry Andriamanitra, satria zanany malalany ianareo.', 'tahafo àry andriamanitra, satria zanany malalany ianareo.'),
  ('6ab25cc34ec00b417473a040', '2026-09-22T10:47:31.348Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:31.348Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Efesianina', 49, 5, 30, 'satria anisan’ny vatany isika.', 'satria anisan’ny vatany isika.'),
  ('6ab25cc34ec00b417473a038', '2026-09-22T10:47:31.348Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:31.348Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Efesianina', 49, 5, 22, 'Ianareo vehivavy, maneke ny vadinareo, toy ny anekena ny Tompo,', 'ianareo vehivavy, maneke ny vadinareo, toy ny anekena ny tompo,'),
  ('6ab25cc34ec00b417473a02d', '2026-09-22T10:47:31.348Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:31.348Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Efesianina', 49, 5, 11, 'ary aza atao intsony ny zavatra tsy misy dikany fanaon’ny olona ao amin’ny maizina. Asehoy kosa hoe ratsy ireny zavatra ireny.', 'ary aza atao intsony ny zavatra tsy misy dikany fanaon’ny olona ao amin’ny maizina. asehoy kosa hoe ratsy ireny zavatra ireny.'),
  ('6ab25cc34ec00b417473a030', '2026-09-22T10:47:31.348Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:31.348Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Efesianina', 49, 5, 14, 'Voalaza àry hoe: “Mifohaza ianao izay matory, ary mitsangàna amin’ny maty, dia hanazava anao i Kristy.”', 'voalaza àry hoe: “mifohaza ianao izay matory, ary mitsangàna amin’ny maty, dia hanazava anao i kristy.”'),
  ('6ab25cc34ec00b417473a03f', '2026-09-22T10:47:31.348Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:31.348Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Efesianina', 49, 5, 29, 'Tsy misy olona mankahala ny tenany mantsy, fa mamelona sy miahy azy kosa, hoatran’ny ataon’i Kristy amin’ny fiangonana,', 'tsy misy olona mankahala ny tenany mantsy, fa mamelona sy miahy azy kosa, hoatran’ny ataon’i kristy amin’ny fiangonana,'),
  ('6ab25cc34ec00b417473a03e', '2026-09-22T10:47:31.348Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:31.348Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Efesianina', 49, 5, 28, 'Hoatr’izany koa fa tokony ho tia ny vadiny ny lehilahy, hoatran’ny itiavany ny tenany. Izay tia ny vadiny dia tia ny tenany.', 'hoatr’izany koa fa tokony ho tia ny vadiny ny lehilahy, hoatran’ny itiavany ny tenany. izay tia ny vadiny dia tia ny tenany.'),
  ('6ab25cc34ec00b417473a03a', '2026-09-22T10:47:31.348Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:31.348Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Efesianina', 49, 5, 24, 'Hoatran’ny aneken’ny fiangonana an’i Kristy no tokony haneken’ny vehivavy ny vadiny amin’ny zavatra rehetra.', 'hoatran’ny aneken’ny fiangonana an’i kristy no tokony haneken’ny vehivavy ny vadiny amin’ny zavatra rehetra.'),
  ('6ab25cc34ec00b417473a031', '2026-09-22T10:47:31.348Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:31.348Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Efesianina', 49, 5, 15, 'Koa mitandrema tsara foana amin’izay ataonareo, mba ho hita hoe hendry ianareo fa tsy adala,', 'koa mitandrema tsara foana amin’izay ataonareo, mba ho hita hoe hendry ianareo fa tsy adala,'),
  ('6ab25cc34ec00b417473a02a', '2026-09-22T10:47:31.348Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:31.348Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Efesianina', 49, 5, 8, 'Tao amin’ny haizina mantsy ianareo teo aloha, fa efa ao amin’ny mazava kosa izao, noho ianareo tafaray amin’ny Tompo. Asehoy eo amin’ny fiainanareo foana fa zanaky ny mazava ianareo.', 'tao amin’ny haizina mantsy ianareo teo aloha, fa efa ao amin’ny mazava kosa izao, noho ianareo tafaray amin’ny tompo. asehoy eo amin’ny fiainanareo foana fa zanaky ny mazava ianareo.'),
  ('6ab25cc34ec00b417473a029', '2026-09-22T10:47:31.348Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:31.348Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Efesianina', 49, 5, 7, 'Aza manao hoatr’ireny àry.', 'aza manao hoatr’ireny àry.'),
  ('6ab25cc34ec00b417473a034', '2026-09-22T10:47:31.348Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:31.348Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Efesianina', 49, 5, 18, 'Ary aza mba mamon’ny divay, fa mahatonga anareo hanao hadalana izany. Aoka kosa ianareo ho feno fanahy masina foana.', 'ary aza mba mamon’ny divay, fa mahatonga anareo hanao hadalana izany. aoka kosa ianareo ho feno fanahy masina foana.'),
  ('6ab25cc34ec00b417473a033', '2026-09-22T10:47:31.348Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:31.348Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Efesianina', 49, 5, 17, 'Aza miadaladala intsony àry, fa fantaro foana izay sitrapon’i Jehovah.', 'aza miadaladala intsony àry, fa fantaro foana izay sitrapon’i jehovah.'),
  ('6ab25cc34ec00b417473a027', '2026-09-22T10:47:31.348Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:31.348Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Efesianina', 49, 5, 5, 'Fantatrareo mantsy, ary takatrareo tsara fa samy tsy manana lova ao amin’ny Fanjakan’i Kristy sy Andriamanitra, na ny mpijangajanga, na ny olona manaraka fanao maloto, na ny olona tsy mety afa-po, izany hoe mpanompo sampy.', 'fantatrareo mantsy, ary takatrareo tsara fa samy tsy manana lova ao amin’ny fanjakan’i kristy sy andriamanitra, na ny mpijangajanga, na ny olona manaraka fanao maloto, na ny olona tsy mety afa-po, izany hoe mpanompo sampy.'),
  ('6ab25cc34ec00b417473a03b', '2026-09-22T10:47:31.348Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:31.348Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Efesianina', 49, 5, 25, 'Ry lehilahy, tiavo foana ny vadinareo, tahaka ny nitiavan’i Kristy ny fiangonana sy ny nanolorany ny tenany hamonjy azy,', 'ry lehilahy, tiavo foana ny vadinareo, tahaka ny nitiavan’i kristy ny fiangonana sy ny nanolorany ny tenany hamonjy azy,'),
  ('6ab25cc34ec00b417473a02f', '2026-09-22T10:47:31.348Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:31.348Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Efesianina', 49, 5, 13, 'Asehon’ny hazavana ny zava-drehetra abaribary, fa lasa mazava daholo ny zava-drehetra aseho.', 'asehon’ny hazavana ny zava-drehetra abaribary, fa lasa mazava daholo ny zava-drehetra aseho.'),
  ('6ab25cc34ec00b417473a024', '2026-09-22T10:47:31.348Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:31.348Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Efesianina', 49, 5, 2, 'Dia miezaha foana haneho fitiavana, hoatran’ny nitiavan’i Kristy antsika sy nanolorany ny tenany mba hatao fanatitra sy sorona ho antsika, ho hanitra mamerovero ho an’Andriamanitra.', 'dia miezaha foana haneho fitiavana, hoatran’ny nitiavan’i kristy antsika sy nanolorany ny tenany mba hatao fanatitra sy sorona ho antsika, ho hanitra mamerovero ho an’andriamanitra.'),
  ('6ab25cc34ec00b417473a041', '2026-09-22T10:47:31.348Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:31.348Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Efesianina', 49, 5, 31, '“Noho izany, dia handao ny rainy sy ny reniny ny lehilahy ka hikambana amin’ny vadiny, ary ho nofo iray ihany izy roa.”', '“noho izany, dia handao ny rainy sy ny reniny ny lehilahy ka hikambana amin’ny vadiny, ary ho nofo iray ihany izy roa.”'),
  ('6ab25cc34ec00b417473a036', '2026-09-22T10:47:31.348Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:31.348Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Efesianina', 49, 5, 20, 'Misaora foana koa an’ilay Andriamanitra Raintsika noho ny zavatra rehetra, ary ataovy amin’ny anaran’i Jesosy Kristy Tompontsika izany.', 'misaora foana koa an’ilay andriamanitra raintsika noho ny zavatra rehetra, ary ataovy amin’ny anaran’i jesosy kristy tompontsika izany.'),
  ('6ab25cc34ec00b417473a035', '2026-09-22T10:47:31.348Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:31.348Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Efesianina', 49, 5, 19, 'Rehefa mifampiresaka koa ianareo, dia mifampahereza amin’ny salamo sy fiderana an’Andriamanitra ary hira masina, ary mihirà amin’ny fo ho an’i Jehovah, miaraka amin’ny mozika.', 'rehefa mifampiresaka koa ianareo, dia mifampahereza amin’ny salamo sy fiderana an’andriamanitra ary hira masina, ary mihirà amin’ny fo ho an’i jehovah, miaraka amin’ny mozika.'),
  ('6ab25cc493022759296a5e14', '2026-09-22T10:47:32.407Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:32.407Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Efesianina', 49, 6, 1, 'Ianareo zanaka, ankatoavy ny ray aman-dreninareo, araka izay sitrapon’ny Tompo, fa izany no mety.', 'ianareo zanaka, ankatoavy ny ray aman-dreninareo, araka izay sitrapon’ny tompo, fa izany no mety.'),
  ('6ab25cc493022759296a5e17', '2026-09-22T10:47:32.407Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:32.407Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Efesianina', 49, 6, 4, 'Ary ianareo ray, aza mampahatezitra ny zanakareo, fa tezao foana araka izay anatra omen’i Jehovah sy izay atorony izy.', 'ary ianareo ray, aza mampahatezitra ny zanakareo, fa tezao foana araka izay anatra omen’i jehovah sy izay atorony izy.'),
  ('6ab25cc493022759296a5e16', '2026-09-22T10:47:32.407Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:32.407Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Efesianina', 49, 6, 3, '“Amin’izay hahita soa sady ho ela velona eto ambonin’ny tany ianao.”', '“amin’izay hahita soa sady ho ela velona eto ambonin’ny tany ianao.”'),
  ('6ab25cc493022759296a5e1b', '2026-09-22T10:47:32.407Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:32.407Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Efesianina', 49, 6, 8, 'satria fantatrareo fa hovalian’i Jehovah soa izay zavatra tsara ataon’ny olona tsirairay, na andevo izy na olona afaka.', 'satria fantatrareo fa hovalian’i jehovah soa izay zavatra tsara ataon’ny olona tsirairay, na andevo izy na olona afaka.'),
  ('6ab25cc493022759296a5e15', '2026-09-22T10:47:32.407Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:32.407Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Efesianina', 49, 6, 2, '“Hajao ny rainao sy ny reninao.” Izany no didy voalohany misy an’izao fampanantenana izao:', '“hajao ny rainao sy ny reninao.” izany no didy voalohany misy an’izao fampanantenana izao:'),
  ('6ab25cc493022759296a5e18', '2026-09-22T10:47:32.407Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:32.407Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Efesianina', 49, 6, 5, 'Ianareo mpanompo, ankatoavy amin’ny fo ny tomponareo ka hajao sy atahory, hoatran’ny ataonareo amin’i Kristy.', 'ianareo mpanompo, ankatoavy amin’ny fo ny tomponareo ka hajao sy atahory, hoatran’ny ataonareo amin’i kristy.'),
  ('6ab25cc493022759296a5e1a', '2026-09-22T10:47:32.407Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:32.407Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Efesianina', 49, 6, 7, 'Manompoa amin’ny fo, toy ny hoe ho an’i Jehovah, fa tsy ho an’olona,', 'manompoa amin’ny fo, toy ny hoe ho an’i jehovah, fa tsy ho an’olona,'),
  ('6ab25cc493022759296a5e19', '2026-09-22T10:47:32.407Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:32.407Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Efesianina', 49, 6, 6, 'Tsy hoe rehefa misy manara-maso ihany ianareo vao tokony hanao an’izany, hoatran’ny hoe te hampifaly olona fotsiny, fa noho ianareo mpanompon’i Kristy sady manao ny sitrapon’Andriamanitra amin’ny fo manontolo.', 'tsy hoe rehefa misy manara-maso ihany ianareo vao tokony hanao an’izany, hoatran’ny hoe te hampifaly olona fotsiny, fa noho ianareo mpanompon’i kristy sady manao ny sitrapon’andriamanitra amin’ny fo manontolo.'),
  ('6ab25cc493022759296a5e2b', '2026-09-22T10:47:32.408Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:32.408Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Efesianina', 49, 6, 24, 'Enga anie hanehoana hatsaram-panahy miavaka daholo izay rehetra tena tia an’i Jesosy Kristy Tompontsika!', 'enga anie hanehoana hatsaram-panahy miavaka daholo izay rehetra tena tia an’i jesosy kristy tompontsika!'),
  ('6ab25cc493022759296a5e28', '2026-09-22T10:47:32.408Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:32.408Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Efesianina', 49, 6, 21, 'Hampahafantatra anareo ny zava-drehetra i Tykiko, rahalahy malala sy mpanompo mendri-pitokisana ao amin’ny Tompo, amin’izay ho fantatrareo koa ny momba ahy sy izay ataoko.', 'hampahafantatra anareo ny zava-drehetra i tykiko, rahalahy malala sy mpanompo mendri-pitokisana ao amin’ny tompo, amin’izay ho fantatrareo koa ny momba ahy sy izay ataoko.'),
  ('6ab25cc493022759296a5e25', '2026-09-22T10:47:32.408Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:32.408Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Efesianina', 49, 6, 18, 'Ary mivavaha foana na amin’ny fotoana inona na amin’ny fotoana inona, sady araho ny fitarihan’ny fanahy, ka manaova vavaka sy fitalahoana amin’ny endriny rehetra. Miambena àry sady manaova foana fitalahoana ho an’ny olona masina rehetra.', 'ary mivavaha foana na amin’ny fotoana inona na amin’ny fotoana inona, sady araho ny fitarihan’ny fanahy, ka manaova vavaka sy fitalahoana amin’ny endriny rehetra. miambena àry sady manaova foana fitalahoana ho an’ny olona masina rehetra.'),
  ('6ab25cc493022759296a5e20', '2026-09-22T10:47:32.408Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:32.408Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Efesianina', 49, 6, 13, 'Raiso daholo àry izay fiadiana omen’Andriamanitra, mba ho vitanareo ny hanohitra an’izay fanafihana anareo amin’ny andro anjakan’ny faharatsiana. Dia ho mafy orina ianareo rehefa vitanareo izany rehetra izany.', 'raiso daholo àry izay fiadiana omen’andriamanitra, mba ho vitanareo ny hanohitra an’izay fanafihana anareo amin’ny andro anjakan’ny faharatsiana. dia ho mafy orina ianareo rehefa vitanareo izany rehetra izany.'),
  ('6ab25cc493022759296a5e1e', '2026-09-22T10:47:32.408Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:32.408Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Efesianina', 49, 6, 11, 'Tafio daholo izay fiadiana omen’Andriamanitra anareo, mba ho mafy orina ianareo ka ho vitanareo ny hanohitra ny teti-dratsin’ny Devoly.', 'tafio daholo izay fiadiana omen’andriamanitra anareo, mba ho mafy orina ianareo ka ho vitanareo ny hanohitra ny teti-dratsin’ny devoly.'),
  ('6ab25cc493022759296a5e2a', '2026-09-22T10:47:32.408Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:32.408Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Efesianina', 49, 6, 23, 'Enga anie ilay Andriamanitra Ray sy Jesosy Kristy Tompo hanome fiadanana an’ireo rahalahy sy haneho fitiavana aminy ary hanome finoana azy!', 'enga anie ilay andriamanitra ray sy jesosy kristy tompo hanome fiadanana an’ireo rahalahy sy haneho fitiavana aminy ary hanome finoana azy!'),
  ('6ab25cc493022759296a5e1d', '2026-09-22T10:47:32.408Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:32.408Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Efesianina', 49, 6, 10, 'Farany, ataovy foana izay hahazoana hery avy amin’ny Tompo satria tena mahery izy.', 'farany, ataovy foana izay hahazoana hery avy amin’ny tompo satria tena mahery izy.'),
  ('6ab25cc493022759296a5e26', '2026-09-22T10:47:32.408Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:32.408Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Efesianina', 49, 6, 19, 'Mivavaha koa ho ahy mba hatoro ahy izay tokony hoteneniko rehefa miteny aho. Amin’izay aho ho sahy hiteny rehefa mampahafantatra an’ilay zava-miafina masina momba ny vaovao tsara.', 'mivavaha koa ho ahy mba hatoro ahy izay tokony hoteneniko rehefa miteny aho. amin’izay aho ho sahy hiteny rehefa mampahafantatra an’ilay zava-miafina masina momba ny vaovao tsara.'),
  ('6ab25cc493022759296a5e23', '2026-09-22T10:47:32.408Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:32.408Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Efesianina', 49, 6, 16, 'Ankoatra an’ireo rehetra ireo, dia raiso ny ampinga lehibe, dia ny finoana, fa io no hahafahanareo hamono ny zana-tsipìka mirehitra rehetra alefan’ilay ratsy.', 'ankoatra an’ireo rehetra ireo, dia raiso ny ampinga lehibe, dia ny finoana, fa io no hahafahanareo hamono ny zana-tsipìka mirehitra rehetra alefan’ilay ratsy.'),
  ('6ab25cc493022759296a5e22', '2026-09-22T10:47:32.408Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:32.408Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Efesianina', 49, 6, 15, 'Ary ataovy kiraro amin’ny tongotrareo ny fahavononana hitory ny vaovao tsaran’ny fihavanana.', 'ary ataovy kiraro amin’ny tongotrareo ny fahavononana hitory ny vaovao tsaran’ny fihavanana.'),
  ('6ab25cc493022759296a5e29', '2026-09-22T10:47:32.408Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:32.408Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Efesianina', 49, 6, 22, 'Izao no tena antony anirahako azy ho any aminareo: Mba ho fantatrareo hoe manao ahoana izahay, dia izy koa ho afaka hampionona ny fonareo.', 'izao no tena antony anirahako azy ho any aminareo: mba ho fantatrareo hoe manao ahoana izahay, dia izy koa ho afaka hampionona ny fonareo.'),
  ('6ab25cc493022759296a5e24', '2026-09-22T10:47:32.408Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:32.408Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Efesianina', 49, 6, 17, 'Anaovy koa ny fiarovan-doha, izany hoe ny famonjena, ary raiso ny sabatry ny fanahy, izany hoe ny tenin’Andriamanitra.', 'anaovy koa ny fiarovan-doha, izany hoe ny famonjena, ary raiso ny sabatry ny fanahy, izany hoe ny tenin’andriamanitra.'),
  ('6ab25cc493022759296a5e27', '2026-09-22T10:47:32.408Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:32.408Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Efesianina', 49, 6, 20, 'Fa izany vaovao tsara izany no mahatonga ahy ho ambasadaoro mifatotra rojo vy. Mivavaha koa ho ahy mba ho sahiko ny hiresaka momba an’izany, araka izay tokony hoteneniko.', 'fa izany vaovao tsara izany no mahatonga ahy ho ambasadaoro mifatotra rojo vy. mivavaha koa ho ahy mba ho sahiko ny hiresaka momba an’izany, araka izay tokony hoteneniko.'),
  ('6ab25cc493022759296a5e21', '2026-09-22T10:47:32.408Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:32.408Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Efesianina', 49, 6, 14, 'Koa miezaha ho mafy orina, ka ataovy fehikibo eo amin’ny andilanareo ny fahamarinana, ary ataovy fiarovan-tratra ny fanaovana ny marina.', 'koa miezaha ho mafy orina, ka ataovy fehikibo eo amin’ny andilanareo ny fahamarinana, ary ataovy fiarovan-tratra ny fanaovana ny marina.'),
  ('6ab25cc493022759296a5e1c', '2026-09-22T10:47:32.408Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:32.408Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Efesianina', 49, 6, 9, 'Ary ianareo tompo, ataovy hoatr’izany foana koa ny mpanomponareo ka aza mandrahona azy. Fantatrareo mantsy fa any an-danitra ilay Tompon’izy ireo sady Tomponareo, ary tsy mba mijery tavan’olona izy.', 'ary ianareo tompo, ataovy hoatr’izany foana koa ny mpanomponareo ka aza mandrahona azy. fantatrareo mantsy fa any an-danitra ilay tompon’izy ireo sady tomponareo, ary tsy mba mijery tavan’olona izy.'),
  ('6ab25cc493022759296a5e1f', '2026-09-22T10:47:32.408Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:32.408Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Efesianina', 49, 6, 12, 'Isika mantsy tsy miady amin’ny nofo aman-dra, fa amin’ny fanjakana sy manam-pahefana sy mpanjakan’izao tontolo anaty haizina izao, ary amin’ny fanahy ratsy eny amin’ny faritry ny lanitra.', 'isika mantsy tsy miady amin’ny nofo aman-dra, fa amin’ny fanjakana sy manam-pahefana sy mpanjakan’izao tontolo anaty haizina izao, ary amin’ny fanahy ratsy eny amin’ny faritry ny lanitra.'),
  ('6ab25cd6749bb2120a3a2e53', '2026-09-22T10:47:50.980Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:50.980Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Titosy', 56, 2, 13, 'Miandry an’ilay zavatra mahafaly antenaintsika koa isika, sady miandry ny fisehoana be voninahitr’ilay Andriamanitra tena miavaka sy Jesosy Kristy Mpamonjy antsika.', 'miandry an’ilay zavatra mahafaly antenaintsika koa isika, sady miandry ny fisehoana be voninahitr’ilay andriamanitra tena miavaka sy jesosy kristy mpamonjy antsika.'),
  ('6ab25cd6749bb2120a3a2e54', '2026-09-22T10:47:50.980Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:50.980Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Titosy', 56, 2, 14, 'Nanolotra ny tenany ho antsika izy mba hanafahana antsika amin’ny karazana fandikan-dalàna rehetra sy mba hanadiovana firenena iray ho fananany manokana, dia firenena mazoto manao asa tsara.', 'nanolotra ny tenany ho antsika izy mba hanafahana antsika amin’ny karazana fandikan-dalàna rehetra sy mba hanadiovana firenena iray ho fananany manokana, dia firenena mazoto manao asa tsara.'),
  ('6ab25cd6749bb2120a3a2e50', '2026-09-22T10:47:50.980Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:50.980Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Titosy', 56, 2, 10, 'tsy hangalatra, fa ho mendri-pitokisana tanteraka kosa. Amin’izay izy dia toy ny hoe mandravaka ny fampianaran’Andriamanitra Mpamonjy antsika, amin’ny lafiny rehetra.', 'tsy hangalatra, fa ho mendri-pitokisana tanteraka kosa. amin’izay izy dia toy ny hoe mandravaka ny fampianaran’andriamanitra mpamonjy antsika, amin’ny lafiny rehetra.'),
  ('6ab25cd6749bb2120a3a2e4f', '2026-09-22T10:47:50.980Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:50.980Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Titosy', 56, 2, 9, 'Ampirisiho ny mpanompo hanaiky ny tompony amin’ny zava-drehetra ka hiezaka hanao izay mahafaly azy, tsy hamalivaly,', 'ampirisiho ny mpanompo hanaiky ny tompony amin’ny zava-drehetra ka hiezaka hanao izay mahafaly azy, tsy hamalivaly,'),
  ('6ab25cd6749bb2120a3a2e4a', '2026-09-22T10:47:50.980Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:50.980Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Titosy', 56, 2, 4, 'mba hahafahany hanoro hevitra ny vehivavy tanora ho tia vady aman-janaka,', 'mba hahafahany hanoro hevitra ny vehivavy tanora ho tia vady aman-janaka,'),
  ('6ab25cd6749bb2120a3a2e4e', '2026-09-22T10:47:50.980Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:50.980Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Titosy', 56, 2, 8, 'ary mampiasà teny mahasoa izay tsy azo kianina. Amin’izay dia ho afa-baraka ny mpanohitra, ka tsy hahita zavatra hanaratsiana antsika.', 'ary mampiasà teny mahasoa izay tsy azo kianina. amin’izay dia ho afa-baraka ny mpanohitra, ka tsy hahita zavatra hanaratsiana antsika.'),
  ('6ab25cd6749bb2120a3a2e4c', '2026-09-22T10:47:50.980Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:50.980Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Titosy', 56, 2, 6, 'Ampirisiho foana koa ny lehilahy tanora hisaina tsara,', 'ampirisiho foana koa ny lehilahy tanora hisaina tsara,'),
  ('6ab25cd6749bb2120a3a2e48', '2026-09-22T10:47:50.980Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:50.980Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Titosy', 56, 2, 2, 'Ampirisiho ny lehilahy zokiolona hahay handanjalanja eo amin’izay zavatra fanaony, ho mato-tsaina, hisaina tsara, hanana finoana matanjaka, ho be fitiavana, ary hiaritra.', 'ampirisiho ny lehilahy zokiolona hahay handanjalanja eo amin’izay zavatra fanaony, ho mato-tsaina, hisaina tsara, hanana finoana matanjaka, ho be fitiavana, ary hiaritra.'),
  ('6ab25cd6749bb2120a3a2e55', '2026-09-22T10:47:50.980Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:50.980Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Titosy', 56, 2, 15, 'Miresaha foana momba an’ireo zavatra ireo, ka aza mitsahatra mandrisika sy mananatra, satria ianao efa nomena fahefana feno hanao an’izany. Aza avela hisy hanao tsinontsinona anao.', 'miresaha foana momba an’ireo zavatra ireo, ka aza mitsahatra mandrisika sy mananatra, satria ianao efa nomena fahefana feno hanao an’izany. aza avela hisy hanao tsinontsinona anao.'),
  ('6ab25cd6749bb2120a3a2e4b', '2026-09-22T10:47:50.980Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:50.980Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Titosy', 56, 2, 5, 'hisaina tsara, hadio fitondran-tena, hazoto hikarakara tokantrano, hanao izay tsara, hanaiky ny vadiny, mba tsy hitenenan-dratsy ny tenin’Andriamanitra.', 'hisaina tsara, hadio fitondran-tena, hazoto hikarakara tokantrano, hanao izay tsara, hanaiky ny vadiny, mba tsy hitenenan-dratsy ny tenin’andriamanitra.'),
  ('6ab25cd6749bb2120a3a2e49', '2026-09-22T10:47:50.980Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:50.980Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Titosy', 56, 2, 3, 'Ampirisiho koa ny vehivavy zokiolona hanana fitondran-tena mendrika ny olona masina, tsy ho mpanendrikendrika, tsy handevozin’ny divay be, fa ho mpampianatra zavatra tsara,', 'ampirisiho koa ny vehivavy zokiolona hanana fitondran-tena mendrika ny olona masina, tsy ho mpanendrikendrika, tsy handevozin’ny divay be, fa ho mpampianatra zavatra tsara,'),
  ('6ab25cd6749bb2120a3a2e52', '2026-09-22T10:47:50.980Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:50.980Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Titosy', 56, 2, 12, 'Mampiofana antsika izany hatsaram-panahy izany mba handa an’izay mifanohitra amin’ny sitrapon’Andriamanitra sy ny fanirian’izao tontolo izao. Mampiofana antsika koa izany mba hampiseho eo amin’ny fiainantsika hoe misaina tsara sy manao izay mahitsy isika ary mahafoy tena ho an’Andriamanitra, eto amin’izao tontolo izao.', 'mampiofana antsika izany hatsaram-panahy izany mba handa an’izay mifanohitra amin’ny sitrapon’andriamanitra sy ny fanirian’izao tontolo izao. mampiofana antsika koa izany mba hampiseho eo amin’ny fiainantsika hoe misaina tsara sy manao izay mahitsy isika ary mahafoy tena ho an’andriamanitra, eto amin’izao tontolo izao.'),
  ('6ab25cd6749bb2120a3a2e47', '2026-09-22T10:47:50.980Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:50.980Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Titosy', 56, 2, 1, 'Fa ianao kosa, miresaha foana zavatra mifanaraka amin’ny fampianarana mahasoa.', 'fa ianao kosa, miresaha foana zavatra mifanaraka amin’ny fampianarana mahasoa.'),
  ('6ab25cd6749bb2120a3a2e51', '2026-09-22T10:47:50.980Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:50.980Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Titosy', 56, 2, 11, 'Efa nasehon’Andriamanitra mantsy ny hatsaram-panahiny miavaka, ka afaka ny ho voavonjy ny karazan’olona rehetra.', 'efa nasehon’andriamanitra mantsy ny hatsaram-panahiny miavaka, ka afaka ny ho voavonjy ny karazan’olona rehetra.'),
  ('6ab25cd6749bb2120a3a2e4d', '2026-09-22T10:47:50.980Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:50.980Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Titosy', 56, 2, 7, 'ary asehoy hoe modely amin’ny asa tsara ianao amin’ny lafiny rehetra. Zavatra madio ampianarina ka miezaha ho mato-tsaina rehefa manao an’izany,', 'ary asehoy hoe modely amin’ny asa tsara ianao amin’ny lafiny rehetra. zavatra madio ampianarina ka miezaha ho mato-tsaina rehefa manao an’izany,'),
  ('6ab25cd71357e3f0af8dd199', '2026-09-22T10:47:51.847Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:51.847Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Titosy', 56, 3, 13, 'Ataovy ampy vatsy tsara i Zena, izay mahay Lalàna, sy Apolosy, mba tsy ho ory na inona na inona izy ireo amin’ny dia hataony.', 'ataovy ampy vatsy tsara i zena, izay mahay lalàna, sy apolosy, mba tsy ho ory na inona na inona izy ireo amin’ny dia hataony.'),
  ('6ab25cd71357e3f0af8dd194', '2026-09-22T10:47:51.847Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:51.847Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Titosy', 56, 3, 8, 'Azo atokisana ireo teny ireo. Ary tiako hohamafisinao foana izany zavatra izany, amin’izay ireo mino an’Andriamanitra dia hampifantoka ny sainy amin’ny fanaovana asa tsara foana. Tsara sady mahasoa ny olona mantsy izany zavatra izany.', 'azo atokisana ireo teny ireo. ary tiako hohamafisinao foana izany zavatra izany, amin’izay ireo mino an’andriamanitra dia hampifantoka ny sainy amin’ny fanaovana asa tsara foana. tsara sady mahasoa ny olona mantsy izany zavatra izany.'),
  ('6ab25cd71357e3f0af8dd19a', '2026-09-22T10:47:51.847Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:51.847Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Titosy', 56, 3, 14, 'Aoka koa anefa ny rahalahintsika hianatra hanao asa tsara foana mba ho afaka hanampy rehefa misy zavatra ilaina maika, sao tsy hahavokatra izy ireo.', 'aoka koa anefa ny rahalahintsika hianatra hanao asa tsara foana mba ho afaka hanampy rehefa misy zavatra ilaina maika, sao tsy hahavokatra izy ireo.'),
  ('6ab25cd71357e3f0af8dd195', '2026-09-22T10:47:51.847Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:51.847Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Titosy', 56, 3, 9, 'Aza midikiditra amin’ny adihevitra adaladala anefa, na ny resaka tetirazana, na ny fifamaliana, na ny ady momba ny Lalàna, fa sady tsy mahasoa izany no tsy misy dikany.', 'aza midikiditra amin’ny adihevitra adaladala anefa, na ny resaka tetirazana, na ny fifamaliana, na ny ady momba ny lalàna, fa sady tsy mahasoa izany no tsy misy dikany.'),
  ('6ab25cd71357e3f0af8dd192', '2026-09-22T10:47:51.847Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:51.847Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Titosy', 56, 3, 6, 'Nandatsahany be dia be tamin’io fanahy io isika, tamin’ny alalan’i Jesosy Kristy Mpamonjy antsika,', 'nandatsahany be dia be tamin’io fanahy io isika, tamin’ny alalan’i jesosy kristy mpamonjy antsika,'),
  ('6ab25cd71357e3f0af8dd196', '2026-09-22T10:47:51.847Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:51.847Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Titosy', 56, 3, 10, 'Halaviro ny olona manangana antokom-pinoana, rehefa avy nanarinao indray mandeha ary mbola nanarinao fanindroany,', 'halaviro ny olona manangana antokom-pinoana, rehefa avy nanarinao indray mandeha ary mbola nanarinao fanindroany,'),
  ('6ab25cd71357e3f0af8dd18d', '2026-09-22T10:47:51.847Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:51.847Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Titosy', 56, 3, 1, 'Ampahatsiahivo foana izy ireo mba hanaiky sy hankatò ny fanjakana sy ny manam-pahefana, ho vonona hanao ny asa tsara rehetra,', 'ampahatsiahivo foana izy ireo mba hanaiky sy hankatò ny fanjakana sy ny manam-pahefana, ho vonona hanao ny asa tsara rehetra,'),
  ('6ab25cd71357e3f0af8dd197', '2026-09-22T10:47:51.847Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:51.847Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Titosy', 56, 3, 11, 'satria fantatrao fa niala tamin’ny lalan’ny fahamarinana ny olona hoatr’izany ary manota sady manameloka ny tenany.', 'satria fantatrao fa niala tamin’ny lalan’ny fahamarinana ny olona hoatr’izany ary manota sady manameloka ny tenany.'),
  ('6ab25cd71357e3f0af8dd18e', '2026-09-22T10:47:51.847Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:51.847Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Titosy', 56, 3, 2, 'tsy hanaratsy olona, tsy ho mpila ady, fa hahay handanjalanja kosa sy halemy fanahy tanteraka amin’ny olona rehetra.', 'tsy hanaratsy olona, tsy ho mpila ady, fa hahay handanjalanja kosa sy halemy fanahy tanteraka amin’ny olona rehetra.'),
  ('6ab25cd71357e3f0af8dd19b', '2026-09-22T10:47:51.847Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:51.847Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Titosy', 56, 3, 15, 'Mampamangy, hono, ianao, hoy ny olona rehetra eto amiko. Mampamangy any amin’ireo miraiki-po aminay, dia ireo rahalahy ao amin’ny finoana. Enga anie ianareo rehetra hanehoana hatsaram-panahy miavaka!', 'mampamangy, hono, ianao, hoy ny olona rehetra eto amiko. mampamangy any amin’ireo miraiki-po aminay, dia ireo rahalahy ao amin’ny finoana. enga anie ianareo rehetra hanehoana hatsaram-panahy miavaka!'),
  ('6ab25cd71357e3f0af8dd198', '2026-09-22T10:47:51.847Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:51.847Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Titosy', 56, 3, 12, 'Rehefa irahiko ho any aminao i Artema na i Tykiko, dia ataovy izay rehetra azonao atao mba hahatongavana any amiko any Nikopolia, fa nanapa-kevitra ny hijanona any mandritra ny ririnina aho.', 'rehefa irahiko ho any aminao i artema na i tykiko, dia ataovy izay rehetra azonao atao mba hahatongavana any amiko any nikopolia, fa nanapa-kevitra ny hijanona any mandritra ny ririnina aho.'),
  ('6ab25cd71357e3f0af8dd193', '2026-09-22T10:47:51.847Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:51.847Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Titosy', 56, 3, 7, 'mba hahatonga antsika ho mpandova ka hanantena ny hiaina mandrakizay, rehefa avy nambara hoe olo-marina isika noho ny hatsaram-panahiny miavaka.', 'mba hahatonga antsika ho mpandova ka hanantena ny hiaina mandrakizay, rehefa avy nambara hoe olo-marina isika noho ny hatsaram-panahiny miavaka.'),
  ('6ab25cd71357e3f0af8dd190', '2026-09-22T10:47:51.847Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:51.847Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Titosy', 56, 3, 4, 'Rehefa naseho anefa ny hatsaram-panahin’Andriamanitra Mpamonjy antsika sy ny fitiavany ny olombelona,', 'rehefa naseho anefa ny hatsaram-panahin’andriamanitra mpamonjy antsika sy ny fitiavany ny olombelona,'),
  ('6ab25cd71357e3f0af8dd18f', '2026-09-22T10:47:51.847Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:51.847Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Titosy', 56, 3, 3, 'Fa isika koa aza taloha mba tsy nisaina, tsy nankatò, voafitaka, nandevozin’ny faniriana sy ny fahafinaretana maro samihafa, nanao ratsy foana sy nialona, naharikoriko, ary nifankahala.', 'fa isika koa aza taloha mba tsy nisaina, tsy nankatò, voafitaka, nandevozin’ny faniriana sy ny fahafinaretana maro samihafa, nanao ratsy foana sy nialona, naharikoriko, ary nifankahala.'),
  ('6ab25cd71357e3f0af8dd191', '2026-09-22T10:47:51.847Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:51.847Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Titosy', 56, 3, 5, 'dia namonjy antsika izy, tsy noho ny zavatra tsara nataontsika, fa noho ny famindram-pony. Namonjy antsika izy rehefa nanadio antsika ka nahatonga antsika ho velona, sy rehefa nampiasa ny fanahy masina izay nahatonga antsika ho olom-baovao.', 'dia namonjy antsika izy, tsy noho ny zavatra tsara nataontsika, fa noho ny famindram-pony. namonjy antsika izy rehefa nanadio antsika ka nahatonga antsika ho velona, sy rehefa nampiasa ny fanahy masina izay nahatonga antsika ho olom-baovao.');
INSERT INTO "bible_verses" ("id", "created_date", "updated_date", "created_by_id", "created_by", "translation", "book", "bookOrder", "chapter", "verse", "text", "normalizedText") VALUES
  ('6ab25cd8c84fcfe1e5df31a4', '2026-09-22T10:47:52.359Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:52.359Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Filemona', 57, 1, 23, 'Mampamangy, hono, ianao hoy i Epafra, izay miara-migadra amiko noho ny finoana an’i Kristy Jesosy.', 'mampamangy, hono, ianao hoy i epafra, izay miara-migadra amiko noho ny finoana an’i kristy jesosy.'),
  ('6ab25cd8c84fcfe1e5df3195', '2026-09-22T10:47:52.359Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:52.359Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Filemona', 57, 1, 8, 'Koa azoko atao tsara ny mandidy anao hanao an’izay tokony hataonao, noho izaho apostolin’i Kristy. Na izany aza anefa,', 'koa azoko atao tsara ny mandidy anao hanao an’izay tokony hataonao, noho izaho apostolin’i kristy. na izany aza anefa,'),
  ('6ab25cd8c84fcfe1e5df3197', '2026-09-22T10:47:52.359Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:52.359Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Filemona', 57, 1, 10, 'Miangavy ho an’i Onesimosy zanako aho, satria lasa hoatran’ny rainy aho amin’izao migadra izao.', 'miangavy ho an’i onesimosy zanako aho, satria lasa hoatran’ny rainy aho amin’izao migadra izao.'),
  ('6ab25cd8c84fcfe1e5df31a6', '2026-09-22T10:47:52.359Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:52.359Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Filemona', 57, 1, 25, 'Enga anie i Jesosy Kristy Tompo haneho hatsaram-panahy miavaka aminareo satria tsara ny toe-tsainareo!', 'enga anie i jesosy kristy tompo haneho hatsaram-panahy miavaka aminareo satria tsara ny toe-tsainareo!'),
  ('6ab25cd8c84fcfe1e5df319f', '2026-09-22T10:47:52.359Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:52.359Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Filemona', 57, 1, 18, 'Raha nisy tsy nety nataony taminao, dia ataovy hoatran’ny hoe izaho no nanao an’ilay izy. Raha anananao trosa koa izy, dia ataovy hoatran’ny hoe trosako izany.', 'raha nisy tsy nety nataony taminao, dia ataovy hoatran’ny hoe izaho no nanao an’ilay izy. raha anananao trosa koa izy, dia ataovy hoatran’ny hoe trosako izany.'),
  ('6ab25cd8c84fcfe1e5df319e', '2026-09-22T10:47:52.359Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:52.359Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Filemona', 57, 1, 17, 'Raha tena namanao àry aho, dia raiso tsara izy, hoatran’ny andraisanao ahy.', 'raha tena namanao àry aho, dia raiso tsara izy, hoatran’ny andraisanao ahy.'),
  ('6ab25cd8c84fcfe1e5df31a3', '2026-09-22T10:47:52.359Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:52.359Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Filemona', 57, 1, 22, 'Mba anomano toerana hipetrahako koa aho. Manantena mantsy aho hoe hafahana ka ho tonga any aminareo indray, satria mivavaka ho ahy ianareo.', 'mba anomano toerana hipetrahako koa aho. manantena mantsy aho hoe hafahana ka ho tonga any aminareo indray, satria mivavaka ho ahy ianareo.'),
  ('6ab25cd8c84fcfe1e5df319a', '2026-09-22T10:47:52.359Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:52.359Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Filemona', 57, 1, 13, 'Tiako hijanona atỳ amiko izy mba hisolo anao hikarakara ahy atỳ am-ponja, noho izaho migadra satria nitory ny vaovao tsara.', 'tiako hijanona atỳ amiko izy mba hisolo anao hikarakara ahy atỳ am-ponja, noho izaho migadra satria nitory ny vaovao tsara.'),
  ('6ab25cd8c84fcfe1e5df3192', '2026-09-22T10:47:52.359Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:52.359Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Filemona', 57, 1, 5, 'satria henoko hoe manam-pinoana ianao sady tia an’i Jesosy Tompo sy ny olona masina rehetra.', 'satria henoko hoe manam-pinoana ianao sady tia an’i jesosy tompo sy ny olona masina rehetra.'),
  ('6ab25cd8c84fcfe1e5df318e', '2026-09-22T10:47:52.359Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:52.359Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Filemona', 57, 1, 1, 'Avy amin’i Paoly, izay migadra noho ny finoana an’i Kristy Jesosy, sy avy amin’i Timoty rahalahintsika. Ho an’i Filemona malalanay sy mpiara-miasa aminay,', 'avy amin’i paoly, izay migadra noho ny finoana an’i kristy jesosy, sy avy amin’i timoty rahalahintsika. ho an’i filemona malalanay sy mpiara-miasa aminay,'),
  ('6ab25cd8c84fcfe1e5df3199', '2026-09-22T10:47:52.359Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:52.359Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Filemona', 57, 1, 12, 'Asaiko miverina any aminao izy, ilay tena tiako.', 'asaiko miverina any aminao izy, ilay tena tiako.'),
  ('6ab25cd8c84fcfe1e5df3190', '2026-09-22T10:47:52.359Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:52.359Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Filemona', 57, 1, 3, 'Enga anie ilay Andriamanitra Raintsika sy Jesosy Kristy Tompo mba haneho hatsaram-panahy miavaka aminareo sady hanome fiadanana anareo!', 'enga anie ilay andriamanitra raintsika sy jesosy kristy tompo mba haneho hatsaram-panahy miavaka aminareo sady hanome fiadanana anareo!'),
  ('6ab25cd8c84fcfe1e5df319c', '2026-09-22T10:47:52.359Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:52.359Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Filemona', 57, 1, 15, 'Izao angamba no tena nahatonga azy handositra vetivety: Mba hanananao azy indray mandrakizay.', 'izao angamba no tena nahatonga azy handositra vetivety: mba hanananao azy indray mandrakizay.'),
  ('6ab25cd8c84fcfe1e5df319d', '2026-09-22T10:47:52.359Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:52.359Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Filemona', 57, 1, 16, 'Ary tsy ho mpanompo intsony izy amin’izay fa ho tsara kokoa noho izany, satria efa lasa rahalahy malalantsika izy. Tena tiako izy ary mino aho fa ianao mbola ho tia azy kokoa noho izaho, satria mpanomponao sady rahalahinao ao amin’ny Tompo izy.', 'ary tsy ho mpanompo intsony izy amin’izay fa ho tsara kokoa noho izany, satria efa lasa rahalahy malalantsika izy. tena tiako izy ary mino aho fa ianao mbola ho tia azy kokoa noho izaho, satria mpanomponao sady rahalahinao ao amin’ny tompo izy.'),
  ('6ab25cd8c84fcfe1e5df3198', '2026-09-22T10:47:52.359Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:52.359Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Filemona', 57, 1, 11, 'Tsy nahasoa anao izy teo aloha, fa mahasoa ahy sy ianao kosa izy izao.', 'tsy nahasoa anao izy teo aloha, fa mahasoa ahy sy ianao kosa izy izao.'),
  ('6ab25cd8c84fcfe1e5df3191', '2026-09-22T10:47:52.359Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:52.359Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Filemona', 57, 1, 4, 'Misaotra an’Andriamanitra foana aho rehefa mahatsiaro anao amin’ny vavaka,', 'misaotra an’andriamanitra foana aho rehefa mahatsiaro anao amin’ny vavaka,'),
  ('6ab25cd8c84fcfe1e5df31a5', '2026-09-22T10:47:52.359Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:52.359Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Filemona', 57, 1, 24, 'Mampamangy koa hoy i Marka, Aristarko, Demasy, ary Lioka, izay samy mpiara-miasa amiko.', 'mampamangy koa hoy i marka, aristarko, demasy, ary lioka, izay samy mpiara-miasa amiko.'),
  ('6ab25cd8c84fcfe1e5df3193', '2026-09-22T10:47:52.359Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:52.359Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Filemona', 57, 1, 6, 'Mivavaka aho hoe enga anie ny finoanao sy ny an’ny mpiray finoana aminao ka hahatonga anao hiaiky hoe nahazo zavatra tsara be dia be tamin’ny alalan’i Kristy isika.', 'mivavaka aho hoe enga anie ny finoanao sy ny an’ny mpiray finoana aminao ka hahatonga anao hiaiky hoe nahazo zavatra tsara be dia be tamin’ny alalan’i kristy isika.'),
  ('6ab25cd8c84fcfe1e5df31a1', '2026-09-22T10:47:52.359Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:52.359Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Filemona', 57, 1, 20, 'Enga anie ianao, ry rahalahy, mba hanampy ahy amin’izany, satria samy mpanompon’ny Tompo isika! Enga anie ianao hamelombelona ny foko noho ianao mpanara-dia an’i Kristy!', 'enga anie ianao, ry rahalahy, mba hanampy ahy amin’izany, satria samy mpanompon’ny tompo isika! enga anie ianao hamelombelona ny foko noho ianao mpanara-dia an’i kristy!'),
  ('6ab25cd8c84fcfe1e5df318f', '2026-09-22T10:47:52.359Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:52.359Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Filemona', 57, 1, 2, 'sy Apia anabavinay, sy Arkipo miaramilan’i Kristy toa anay, ary ho an’ny fiangonana mivory ao an-tranonao,', 'sy apia anabavinay, sy arkipo miaramilan’i kristy toa anay, ary ho an’ny fiangonana mivory ao an-tranonao,'),
  ('6ab25cd8c84fcfe1e5df31a0', '2026-09-22T10:47:52.359Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:52.359Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Filemona', 57, 1, 19, 'Izaho Paoly mihitsy no manoratra an’ity: Izaho no hanonitra an’izany. Ianao koa aza mbola ananako trosa, ary ianao mihitsy izany trosa izany.', 'izaho paoly mihitsy no manoratra an’ity: izaho no hanonitra an’izany. ianao koa aza mbola ananako trosa, ary ianao mihitsy izany trosa izany.'),
  ('6ab25cd8c84fcfe1e5df3194', '2026-09-22T10:47:52.359Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:52.359Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Filemona', 57, 1, 7, 'Tena nahafaly sy nankahery ahy, ry rahalahy, ny naheno hoe be fitiavana ianao. Namelombelona ny fon’ny olona masina mantsy ianao.', 'tena nahafaly sy nankahery ahy, ry rahalahy, ny naheno hoe be fitiavana ianao. namelombelona ny fon’ny olona masina mantsy ianao.'),
  ('6ab25cd8c84fcfe1e5df31a2', '2026-09-22T10:47:52.359Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:52.359Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Filemona', 57, 1, 21, 'Matoky aho fa hanaiky ianao, ka izany no anoratako aminao. Fantatro mantsy fa hanao mihoatra noho izay lazaiko ianao.', 'matoky aho fa hanaiky ianao, ka izany no anoratako aminao. fantatro mantsy fa hanao mihoatra noho izay lazaiko ianao.'),
  ('6ab25cd8c84fcfe1e5df319b', '2026-09-22T10:47:52.359Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:52.359Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Filemona', 57, 1, 14, 'Tsy te hanao na inona na inona anefa aho raha tsy efa manaiky ianao, mba ho vokatry ny fo ny soa ataonao fa tsy an-tery.', 'tsy te hanao na inona na inona anefa aho raha tsy efa manaiky ianao, mba ho vokatry ny fo ny soa ataonao fa tsy an-tery.'),
  ('6ab25cd8c84fcfe1e5df3196', '2026-09-22T10:47:52.359Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:52.359Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Filemona', 57, 1, 9, 'dia aleoko miangavy anao satria be fitiavana ianao. Izaho Paoly mantsy efa antitra sady migadra noho ny finoana an’i Kristy Jesosy.', 'dia aleoko miangavy anao satria be fitiavana ianao. izaho paoly mantsy efa antitra sady migadra noho ny finoana an’i kristy jesosy.'),
  ('6ab25cda8cf834c4b69ae447', '2026-09-22T10:47:54.143Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:54.143Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 3, 6, 'Fa i Kristy kosa zanaka mendri-pitokisana miandraikitra ny tranon’Andriamanitra. Isika izany tranony izany, raha miezaka foana isika mba ho sahy hiteny sady hifikitra amin’ilay fanantenana ireharehantsika hatramin’ny farany.', 'fa i kristy kosa zanaka mendri-pitokisana miandraikitra ny tranon’andriamanitra. isika izany tranony izany, raha miezaka foana isika mba ho sahy hiteny sady hifikitra amin’ilay fanantenana ireharehantsika hatramin’ny farany.'),
  ('6ab25cda8cf834c4b69ae442', '2026-09-22T10:47:54.143Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:54.143Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 3, 1, 'Noho izany, ry rahalahy masina izay anisan’ny voantso ho any an-danitra, eritrereto ilay apostoly sady mpisoronabe ekentsika, dia i Jesosy.', 'noho izany, ry rahalahy masina izay anisan’ny voantso ho any an-danitra, eritrereto ilay apostoly sady mpisoronabe ekentsika, dia i jesosy.'),
  ('6ab25cda8cf834c4b69ae445', '2026-09-22T10:47:54.143Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:54.143Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 3, 4, 'Mazava ho azy fa nisy nanao ny trano rehetra, fa ilay nanao ny zava-drehetra kosa dia Andriamanitra.', 'mazava ho azy fa nisy nanao ny trano rehetra, fa ilay nanao ny zava-drehetra kosa dia andriamanitra.'),
  ('6ab25cda8cf834c4b69ae446', '2026-09-22T10:47:54.143Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:54.143Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 3, 5, 'Ary mpanompo mendri-pitokisana tao amin’ny tranon’Andriamanitra manontolo i Mosesy. Nifanitsy tamin’ny zavatra mbola holazaina atỳ aoriana koa ny fanompoany.', 'ary mpanompo mendri-pitokisana tao amin’ny tranon’andriamanitra manontolo i mosesy. nifanitsy tamin’ny zavatra mbola holazaina atỳ aoriana koa ny fanompoany.'),
  ('6ab25cda8cf834c4b69ae444', '2026-09-22T10:47:54.143Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:54.143Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 3, 3, 'Mendrika hahazo voninahitra lehibe noho ny an’i Mosesy mantsy izy, satria ny mpanao trano dia mendrika hohajaina kokoa noho ny trano nataony.', 'mendrika hahazo voninahitra lehibe noho ny an’i mosesy mantsy izy, satria ny mpanao trano dia mendrika hohajaina kokoa noho ny trano nataony.'),
  ('6ab25cda8cf834c4b69ae443', '2026-09-22T10:47:54.143Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:54.143Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 3, 2, 'Tsy nivadika tamin’Ilay nanendry azy izy, hoatran’i Mosesy rehefa nanompo tao amin’ny tranon’Andriamanitra manontolo.', 'tsy nivadika tamin’ilay nanendry azy izy, hoatran’i mosesy rehefa nanompo tao amin’ny tranon’andriamanitra manontolo.'),
  ('6ab25cda8cf834c4b69ae450', '2026-09-22T10:47:54.144Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:54.144Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 3, 15, 'Voalaza mantsy hoe: “Raha mihaino ny feony ianareo anio, dia aza manamafy ny fonareo toy ny tamin’ilay fotoana nampahatezitra be ahy.”', 'voalaza mantsy hoe: “raha mihaino ny feony ianareo anio, dia aza manamafy ny fonareo toy ny tamin’ilay fotoana nampahatezitra be ahy.”'),
  ('6ab25cda8cf834c4b69ae448', '2026-09-22T10:47:54.144Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:54.144Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 3, 7, 'Noho izany, dia hoy ny fanahy masina: “Raha mihaino ny feony ianareo anio,', 'noho izany, dia hoy ny fanahy masina: “raha mihaino ny feony ianareo anio,'),
  ('6ab25cda8cf834c4b69ae453', '2026-09-22T10:47:54.144Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:54.144Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 3, 18, 'Ary tamin’iza izy no nianiana hoe tsy hiditra amin’ny fitsaharany ireo? Tsy tamin’ireo tsy nankatò ve?', 'ary tamin’iza izy no nianiana hoe tsy hiditra amin’ny fitsaharany ireo? tsy tamin’ireo tsy nankatò ve?'),
  ('6ab25cda8cf834c4b69ae449', '2026-09-22T10:47:54.144Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:54.144Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 3, 8, 'dia aza manamafy ny fonareo hoatran’ny tamin’ilay fotoana nampahatezitra be ahy, tamin’ilay andro nitsapana ahy tany an-tany efitra.', 'dia aza manamafy ny fonareo hoatran’ny tamin’ilay fotoana nampahatezitra be ahy, tamin’ilay andro nitsapana ahy tany an-tany efitra.'),
  ('6ab25cda8cf834c4b69ae454', '2026-09-22T10:47:54.144Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:54.144Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 3, 19, 'Hitantsika àry fa tsy afaka niditra izy ireo satria tsy nino.', 'hitantsika àry fa tsy afaka niditra izy ireo satria tsy nino.'),
  ('6ab25cda8cf834c4b69ae44d', '2026-09-22T10:47:54.144Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:54.144Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 3, 12, 'Tandremo, ry rahalahy, sao misy aminareo lasa manana fo ratsy sady tsy mino, ka hiala amin’ilay Andriamanitra velona.', 'tandremo, ry rahalahy, sao misy aminareo lasa manana fo ratsy sady tsy mino, ka hiala amin’ilay andriamanitra velona.'),
  ('6ab25cda8cf834c4b69ae44c', '2026-09-22T10:47:54.144Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:54.144Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 3, 11, 'Tezitra àry aho sady nianiana hoe: ‘Tsy hiditra amin’ny fitsaharako ireo.’”', 'tezitra àry aho sady nianiana hoe: ‘tsy hiditra amin’ny fitsaharako ireo.’”'),
  ('6ab25cda8cf834c4b69ae44a', '2026-09-22T10:47:54.144Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:54.144Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 3, 9, 'Nitsapa toetra ahy mantsy ny razambenareo tamin’izay, na dia efa hitany aza ny asa nataoko nandritra ny 40 taona.', 'nitsapa toetra ahy mantsy ny razambenareo tamin’izay, na dia efa hitany aza ny asa nataoko nandritra ny 40 taona.'),
  ('6ab25cda8cf834c4b69ae452', '2026-09-22T10:47:54.144Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:54.144Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 3, 17, 'Iza koa no naharikoriko an’ Andriamanitra nandritra ny 40 taona? Tsy izay nanota ve ka niampatrampatra tany an-tany efitra ny fatiny?', 'iza koa no naharikoriko an’ andriamanitra nandritra ny 40 taona? tsy izay nanota ve ka niampatrampatra tany an-tany efitra ny fatiny?'),
  ('6ab25cda8cf834c4b69ae451', '2026-09-22T10:47:54.144Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:54.144Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 3, 16, 'Fa iza moa no naheno ny feon’Andriamanitra nefa mbola nampahatezitra be azy ihany? Tsy izay rehetra nentin’i Mosesy nivoaka avy tany Ejipta ve?', 'fa iza moa no naheno ny feon’andriamanitra nefa mbola nampahatezitra be azy ihany? tsy izay rehetra nentin’i mosesy nivoaka avy tany ejipta ve?'),
  ('6ab25cda8cf834c4b69ae44f', '2026-09-22T10:47:54.144Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:54.144Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 3, 14, 'Tsy hahazo an’izay efa azon’i Kristy mantsy isika, raha tsy tazonintsika mafy hatramin’ny farany ilay toky nananantsika tamin’ny voalohany.', 'tsy hahazo an’izay efa azon’i kristy mantsy isika, raha tsy tazonintsika mafy hatramin’ny farany ilay toky nananantsika tamin’ny voalohany.'),
  ('6ab25cda8cf834c4b69ae44b', '2026-09-22T10:47:54.144Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:54.144Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 3, 10, 'Noho izany, dia lasa rikoriko tamin’izany taranaka izany aho ka nilaza hoe: ‘Mafy loha foana ireo sady tsy manao afa-tsy izay tiany, ary tsy fantany ny lalako.’', 'noho izany, dia lasa rikoriko tamin’izany taranaka izany aho ka nilaza hoe: ‘mafy loha foana ireo sady tsy manao afa-tsy izay tiany, ary tsy fantany ny lalako.’'),
  ('6ab25cda8cf834c4b69ae44e', '2026-09-22T10:47:54.144Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:54.144Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 3, 13, 'Miezaha foana kosa hifampahery isan’andro, raha mbola eo koa ilay antsoina hoe “Anio”, sao hisy ho lasa mafy fo ianareo satria mahavita mamitaka anareo ny ota.', 'miezaha foana kosa hifampahery isan’andro, raha mbola eo koa ilay antsoina hoe “anio”, sao hisy ho lasa mafy fo ianareo satria mahavita mamitaka anareo ny ota.'),
  ('6ab25cdc09fd24e05f2c2cbe', '2026-09-22T10:47:56.337Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:56.337Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 4, 8, 'Fa raha tena nentin’i Josoa tany amin’ny toeram-pitsaharana izy ireo, dia tsy ho niresaka andro anankiray hafa Andriamanitra taorian’izany.', 'fa raha tena nentin’i josoa tany amin’ny toeram-pitsaharana izy ireo, dia tsy ho niresaka andro anankiray hafa andriamanitra taorian’izany.'),
  ('6ab25cdc09fd24e05f2c2cc3', '2026-09-22T10:47:56.337Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:56.337Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 4, 13, 'Ary tsy misy zavaboary miafina eo imasony, fa ny zavatra rehetra dia mihanjahanja sy mibaribary eo imason’ilay hanao ampamoaka antsika.', 'ary tsy misy zavaboary miafina eo imasony, fa ny zavatra rehetra dia mihanjahanja sy mibaribary eo imason’ilay hanao ampamoaka antsika.'),
  ('6ab25cdc09fd24e05f2c2cba', '2026-09-22T10:47:56.337Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:56.337Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 4, 4, 'Hoy mantsy izy momba ny andro fahafito, ao amin’ny andininy iray: “Ary nitsahatra tamin’ny asany rehetra Andriamanitra tamin’ny andro fahafito.”', 'hoy mantsy izy momba ny andro fahafito, ao amin’ny andininy iray: “ary nitsahatra tamin’ny asany rehetra andriamanitra tamin’ny andro fahafito.”'),
  ('6ab25cdc09fd24e05f2c2cbf', '2026-09-22T10:47:56.337Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:56.337Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 4, 9, 'Mbola misy sabata fitsaharana ho an’ny vahoakan’Andriamanitra àry.', 'mbola misy sabata fitsaharana ho an’ny vahoakan’andriamanitra àry.'),
  ('6ab25cdc09fd24e05f2c2cc4', '2026-09-22T10:47:56.337Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:56.337Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 4, 14, 'Ary manana mpisoronabe ambony isika. I Jesosy Zanak’Andriamanitra izany mpisoronabe izany, ary efa lasa nankany an-danitra izy. Andao àry horesahintsika amin’olona foana ny zavatra inoantsika momba azy.', 'ary manana mpisoronabe ambony isika. i jesosy zanak’andriamanitra izany mpisoronabe izany, ary efa lasa nankany an-danitra izy. andao àry horesahintsika amin’olona foana ny zavatra inoantsika momba azy.'),
  ('6ab25cdc09fd24e05f2c2cc2', '2026-09-22T10:47:56.337Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:56.337Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 4, 12, 'Fa velona sy mahery ny tenin’Andriamanitra, sady maranitra noho ny sabatra roa lela, ary manindrona ka mahavita manavaka an’izay miseho etỳ ivelany sy ny any am-po, sady mahavita manasaraka ny tonon-taolana sy ny tsoka, ka mahay mamantatra ny eritreritry ny fo sy ny fikasany.', 'fa velona sy mahery ny tenin’andriamanitra, sady maranitra noho ny sabatra roa lela, ary manindrona ka mahavita manavaka an’izay miseho etỳ ivelany sy ny any am-po, sady mahavita manasaraka ny tonon-taolana sy ny tsoka, ka mahay mamantatra ny eritreritry ny fo sy ny fikasany.'),
  ('6ab25cdc09fd24e05f2c2cb8', '2026-09-22T10:47:56.337Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:56.337Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 4, 2, 'Isika koa mantsy mba efa nitoriana ny vaovao tsara hoatr’azy ireo. Tsy nahasoa azy ireo akory anefa ny zavatra henony, satria tsy mba nanana finoana matanjaka hoatran’ireo olona nihaino izy ireo.', 'isika koa mantsy mba efa nitoriana ny vaovao tsara hoatr’azy ireo. tsy nahasoa azy ireo akory anefa ny zavatra henony, satria tsy mba nanana finoana matanjaka hoatran’ireo olona nihaino izy ireo.'),
  ('6ab25cdc09fd24e05f2c2cc6', '2026-09-22T10:47:56.337Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:56.337Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 4, 16, 'Andao àry isika hanatona ny seza fiandrianan’ilay Andriamanitra maneho hatsaram-panahy miavaka, sady ho sahy hiteny rehefa manao an’izany. Amin’izay isika hahazo famindram-po ary hanehoana hatsaram-panahy miavaka, mba hanampiana antsika amin’ny fotoana mety.', 'andao àry isika hanatona ny seza fiandrianan’ilay andriamanitra maneho hatsaram-panahy miavaka, sady ho sahy hiteny rehefa manao an’izany. amin’izay isika hahazo famindram-po ary hanehoana hatsaram-panahy miavaka, mba hanampiana antsika amin’ny fotoana mety.'),
  ('6ab25cdc09fd24e05f2c2cbb', '2026-09-22T10:47:56.337Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:56.337Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 4, 5, 'Hoy koa izy ao amin’ny andininy iray: “Tsy hiditra amin’ny fitsaharako ireo.”', 'hoy koa izy ao amin’ny andininy iray: “tsy hiditra amin’ny fitsaharako ireo.”'),
  ('6ab25cdc09fd24e05f2c2cbc', '2026-09-22T10:47:56.337Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:56.337Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 4, 6, 'Mbola azo atao ny miditra amin’izany fitsaharana izany, ary izay nitoriana ny vaovao tsara tamin’ny voalohany koa tsy niditra satria tsy nankatò.', 'mbola azo atao ny miditra amin’izany fitsaharana izany, ary izay nitoriana ny vaovao tsara tamin’ny voalohany koa tsy niditra satria tsy nankatò.'),
  ('6ab25cdc09fd24e05f2c2cc1', '2026-09-22T10:47:56.337Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:56.337Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 4, 11, 'Andao àry isika hanao izay rehetra azontsika atao mba hidirana amin’izany fitsaharana izany, sao hisy amintsika ho lasa tsy mankatò hoatr’azy ireo koa.', 'andao àry isika hanao izay rehetra azontsika atao mba hidirana amin’izany fitsaharana izany, sao hisy amintsika ho lasa tsy mankatò hoatr’azy ireo koa.'),
  ('6ab25cdc09fd24e05f2c2cb9', '2026-09-22T10:47:56.337Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:56.337Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 4, 3, 'Isika izay mino mantsy no tena miditra amin’ilay fitsaharana. Fa raha ny amin’izy ireo indray, dia efa nilaza izy hoe: “Tezitra àry aho sady nianiana hoe: ‘Tsy hiditra amin’ny fitsaharako ireo’”, na dia efa hatramin’ny nanorenana an’izao tontolo izao aza ny asany no vita.', 'isika izay mino mantsy no tena miditra amin’ilay fitsaharana. fa raha ny amin’izy ireo indray, dia efa nilaza izy hoe: “tezitra àry aho sady nianiana hoe: ‘tsy hiditra amin’ny fitsaharako ireo’”, na dia efa hatramin’ny nanorenana an’izao tontolo izao aza ny asany no vita.'),
  ('6ab25cdc09fd24e05f2c2cc5', '2026-09-22T10:47:56.337Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:56.337Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 4, 15, 'Fa ny antsika tsy hoe mpisoronabe tsy mba mahay mangoraka antsika amin’ny fahalementsika, fa mpisoronabe efa notsapaina tamin’ny zavatra rehetra hoatr’antsika koa, nefa tsy nanota.', 'fa ny antsika tsy hoe mpisoronabe tsy mba mahay mangoraka antsika amin’ny fahalementsika, fa mpisoronabe efa notsapaina tamin’ny zavatra rehetra hoatr’antsika koa, nefa tsy nanota.'),
  ('6ab25cdc09fd24e05f2c2cc0', '2026-09-22T10:47:56.337Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:56.337Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 4, 10, 'Fa izay olona niditra tamin’ny fitsaharan’Andriamanitra, dia nitsahatra tamin’ny asany koa, hoatran’ny nataon’Andriamanitra.', 'fa izay olona niditra tamin’ny fitsaharan’andriamanitra, dia nitsahatra tamin’ny asany koa, hoatran’ny nataon’andriamanitra.'),
  ('6ab25cdc09fd24e05f2c2cb7', '2026-09-22T10:47:56.337Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:56.337Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 4, 1, 'Mampanantena Andriamanitra hoe mbola hiditra amin’ny fitsaharany isika. Noho izany, dia andao isika hiambina sao hisy aminareo ho lasa tsy mendrika an’izany fampanantenana izany.', 'mampanantena andriamanitra hoe mbola hiditra amin’ny fitsaharany isika. noho izany, dia andao isika hiambina sao hisy aminareo ho lasa tsy mendrika an’izany fampanantenana izany.'),
  ('6ab25cdc09fd24e05f2c2cbd', '2026-09-22T10:47:56.337Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:56.337Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 4, 7, 'Noho izany àry, dia mbola nifidy andro iray izy ka nilaza tao amin’ny salamon’i Davida, ela be tatỳ aoriana, hoe: “Anio.” Efa voalaza tetsy aloha koa mantsy hoe: “Raha mihaino ny feony ianareo anio, dia aza manamafy ny fonareo.”', 'noho izany àry, dia mbola nifidy andro iray izy ka nilaza tao amin’ny salamon’i davida, ela be tatỳ aoriana, hoe: “anio.” efa voalaza tetsy aloha koa mantsy hoe: “raha mihaino ny feony ianareo anio, dia aza manamafy ny fonareo.”'),
  ('6ab25cdc4cc8679c16b9a58f', '2026-09-22T10:47:56.888Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:56.888Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 5, 8, 'Ary na dia zanaka aza izy, dia nianatra nankatò avy tamin’ny zavatra niaretany.', 'ary na dia zanaka aza izy, dia nianatra nankatò avy tamin’ny zavatra niaretany.'),
  ('6ab25cdc4cc8679c16b9a590', '2026-09-22T10:47:56.888Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:56.888Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 5, 9, 'Rehefa avy natao lavorary izy, dia izy no nahatonga an’izay rehetra mankatò azy ho voavonjy mandrakizay.', 'rehefa avy natao lavorary izy, dia izy no nahatonga an’izay rehetra mankatò azy ho voavonjy mandrakizay.'),
  ('6ab25cdc4cc8679c16b9a589', '2026-09-22T10:47:56.888Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:56.888Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 5, 2, 'Mahay mangoraka an’izay tsy mahalala na inona na inona sy manao fahadisoana izy. Izy koa mantsy mba miady amin’ny fahalemeny.', 'mahay mangoraka an’izay tsy mahalala na inona na inona sy manao fahadisoana izy. izy koa mantsy mba miady amin’ny fahalemeny.'),
  ('6ab25cdc4cc8679c16b9a588', '2026-09-22T10:47:56.888Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:56.888Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 5, 1, 'Alaina avy amin’ny olona ny mpisoronabe, ary tendrena hanompo an’Andriamanitra mba hahasoa ny olona. Amin’ izay izy ho afaka hanolotra fanomezana sy sorona noho ny ota.', 'alaina avy amin’ny olona ny mpisoronabe, ary tendrena hanompo an’andriamanitra mba hahasoa ny olona. amin’ izay izy ho afaka hanolotra fanomezana sy sorona noho ny ota.'),
  ('6ab25cdc4cc8679c16b9a58a', '2026-09-22T10:47:56.888Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:56.888Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 5, 3, 'Tsy maintsy manao fanatitra noho ny fahotana nataony koa àry izy, hoatran’ny ataony rehefa manao fanatitra noho ny fahotan’ny vahoaka.', 'tsy maintsy manao fanatitra noho ny fahotana nataony koa àry izy, hoatran’ny ataony rehefa manao fanatitra noho ny fahotan’ny vahoaka.'),
  ('6ab25cdc4cc8679c16b9a58b', '2026-09-22T10:47:56.888Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:56.888Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 5, 4, 'Tsy mahazo an’izany voninahitra izany ny olona, raha noho ny sitrapony fotsiny. Rehefa antsoin’Andriamanitra ihany izy vao mahazo an’izany, hoatran’ny niantsoany an’i Arona.', 'tsy mahazo an’izany voninahitra izany ny olona, raha noho ny sitrapony fotsiny. rehefa antsoin’andriamanitra ihany izy vao mahazo an’izany, hoatran’ny niantsoany an’i arona.'),
  ('6ab25cdc4cc8679c16b9a58d', '2026-09-22T10:47:56.888Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:56.888Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 5, 6, 'Milaza koa mantsy izy any amin’ny andininy hafa hoe: “Mpisorona mandrakizay ianao, hoatran’i Melkizedeka.”', 'milaza koa mantsy izy any amin’ny andininy hafa hoe: “mpisorona mandrakizay ianao, hoatran’i melkizedeka.”'),
  ('6ab25cdc4cc8679c16b9a58e', '2026-09-22T10:47:56.888Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:56.888Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 5, 7, 'Nitalaho sy niangavingavy tamin’Ilay nahay namonjy azy tsy ho faty i Kristy, sady nitaraindraina mafy sy nitomany be, tamin’izy teto an-tany. Dia nohenoina izy satria natahotra an’Andriamanitra.', 'nitalaho sy niangavingavy tamin’ilay nahay namonjy azy tsy ho faty i kristy, sady nitaraindraina mafy sy nitomany be, tamin’izy teto an-tany. dia nohenoina izy satria natahotra an’andriamanitra.'),
  ('6ab25cdc4cc8679c16b9a591', '2026-09-22T10:47:56.888Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:56.888Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 5, 10, 'Notendren’Andriamanitra ho mpisoronabe hoatran’i Melkizedeka mantsy izy.', 'notendren’andriamanitra ho mpisoronabe hoatran’i melkizedeka mantsy izy.'),
  ('6ab25cdc4cc8679c16b9a58c', '2026-09-22T10:47:56.888Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:56.888Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 5, 5, 'Dia hoatr’izany koa i Kristy. Tsy izy no nanome voninahitra ny tenany mba ho lasa mpisoronabe, fa Ilay niteny momba azy hoe: “Zanako ianao. Androany aho no lasa rainao.”', 'dia hoatr’izany koa i kristy. tsy izy no nanome voninahitra ny tenany mba ho lasa mpisoronabe, fa ilay niteny momba azy hoe: “zanako ianao. androany aho no lasa rainao.”'),
  ('6ab25cdc4cc8679c16b9a594', '2026-09-22T10:47:56.889Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:56.889Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 5, 13, 'Fa izay rehetra mivelona foana amin’ny ronono, dia tsy mahay tsara ny tenin’ny fahamarinana satria mbola zaza.', 'fa izay rehetra mivelona foana amin’ny ronono, dia tsy mahay tsara ny tenin’ny fahamarinana satria mbola zaza.'),
  ('6ab25cdc4cc8679c16b9a592', '2026-09-22T10:47:56.889Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:56.889Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 5, 11, 'Betsaka ny zavatra azonay lazaina momba azy, ary sarotra hazavaina izany, satria lasa tsy mazoto mihaino ianareo.', 'betsaka ny zavatra azonay lazaina momba azy, ary sarotra hazavaina izany, satria lasa tsy mazoto mihaino ianareo.'),
  ('6ab25cdc4cc8679c16b9a593', '2026-09-22T10:47:56.889Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:56.889Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 5, 12, 'Fa na dia tokony ho efa mpampianatra aza ianareo amin’izao, dia mbola mila olona hampianatra anareo hatramin’ny voalohany ny zavatra fototra nianaranareo avy amin’ny teny masin’Andriamanitra, ka lasa mila ronono indray ianareo fa tsy ventin-kanina.', 'fa na dia tokony ho efa mpampianatra aza ianareo amin’izao, dia mbola mila olona hampianatra anareo hatramin’ny voalohany ny zavatra fototra nianaranareo avy amin’ny teny masin’andriamanitra, ka lasa mila ronono indray ianareo fa tsy ventin-kanina.'),
  ('6ab25cdc4cc8679c16b9a595', '2026-09-22T10:47:56.889Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:56.889Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 5, 14, 'Fa ny ventin-kanina kosa dia ho an’ny olona matotra, izany hoe ho an’ny olona mampiasa tsara ny sainy ka manazatra azy io mba hahay hanavaka ny tsara sy ny ratsy.', 'fa ny ventin-kanina kosa dia ho an’ny olona matotra, izany hoe ho an’ny olona mampiasa tsara ny sainy ka manazatra azy io mba hahay hanavaka ny tsara sy ny ratsy.'),
  ('6ab25cdde1fce0d1b4dfcde6', '2026-09-22T10:47:57.351Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:57.351Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 6, 19, 'Izany fanantenana ananantsika izany no vatofantsiky ny aintsika. Sady azo antoka izy io no mafy orina, ary miditra ao ambadiky ny ridao.', 'izany fanantenana ananantsika izany no vatofantsiky ny aintsika. sady azo antoka izy io no mafy orina, ary miditra ao ambadiky ny ridao.'),
  ('6ab25cdde1fce0d1b4dfcde5', '2026-09-22T10:47:57.351Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:57.351Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 6, 18, 'Tsy miova mihitsy ireo zavatra roa ireo sady tsy hain’Andriamanitra andaingana, ka vao mainka izany mampirisika antsika hifikitra amin’ilay fanantenana natao teo anoloantsika, dia isika izay mialoka aminy.', 'tsy miova mihitsy ireo zavatra roa ireo sady tsy hain’andriamanitra andaingana, ka vao mainka izany mampirisika antsika hifikitra amin’ilay fanantenana natao teo anoloantsika, dia isika izay mialoka aminy.'),
  ('6ab25cdde1fce0d1b4dfcdde', '2026-09-22T10:47:57.351Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:57.351Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 6, 11, 'Ary irinay ianareo tsirairay mba hazoto hoatr’izany foana. Amin’izay ianareo dia hatoky hatramin’ny farany hoe ho tanteraka ilay zavatra antenainareo.', 'ary irinay ianareo tsirairay mba hazoto hoatr’izany foana. amin’izay ianareo dia hatoky hatramin’ny farany hoe ho tanteraka ilay zavatra antenainareo.'),
  ('6ab25cdde1fce0d1b4dfcddf', '2026-09-22T10:47:57.351Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:57.351Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 6, 12, 'Amin’izay koa ianareo tsy ho kamo, fa hanahaka an’ireo mandova ny fampanantenana noho izy ireo mino sy manam-paharetana.', 'amin’izay koa ianareo tsy ho kamo, fa hanahaka an’ireo mandova ny fampanantenana noho izy ireo mino sy manam-paharetana.'),
  ('6ab25cdde1fce0d1b4dfcddb', '2026-09-22T10:47:57.351Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:57.351Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 6, 8, 'Raha mamokatra tsilo sy ahidratsy kosa ny tany, dia tsy misy ilana azy intsony. Tsy ho ela ilay izy dia hozonina, ka hodorana amin’ny farany.', 'raha mamokatra tsilo sy ahidratsy kosa ny tany, dia tsy misy ilana azy intsony. tsy ho ela ilay izy dia hozonina, ka hodorana amin’ny farany.'),
  ('6ab25cdde1fce0d1b4dfcde2', '2026-09-22T10:47:57.351Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:57.351Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 6, 15, 'Nahazo an’izany fampanantenana izany àry i Abrahama, rehefa avy nampiseho faharetana.', 'nahazo an’izany fampanantenana izany àry i abrahama, rehefa avy nampiseho faharetana.'),
  ('6ab25cdde1fce0d1b4dfcde4', '2026-09-22T10:47:57.351Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:57.351Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 6, 17, 'Nanao hoatr’izany koa Andriamanitra rehefa nanapa-kevitra fa hampiseho mazava kokoa amin’ireo mpandova an’ilay fampanantenana fa tsy miova ny fikasany. Nanome antoka ny amin’izany àry izy ka nianiana.', 'nanao hoatr’izany koa andriamanitra rehefa nanapa-kevitra fa hampiseho mazava kokoa amin’ireo mpandova an’ilay fampanantenana fa tsy miova ny fikasany. nanome antoka ny amin’izany àry izy ka nianiana.'),
  ('6ab25cdde1fce0d1b4dfcdd9', '2026-09-22T10:47:57.351Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:57.351Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 6, 6, 'kanefa nihemotra, dia tsy azo ampiana intsony mba hibebaka. Fantsihan’izy ireny eo amin’ny tsato-kazo indray mantsy ny Zanak’Andriamanitra, sady alany baraka eo imason’ny olona.', 'kanefa nihemotra, dia tsy azo ampiana intsony mba hibebaka. fantsihan’izy ireny eo amin’ny tsato-kazo indray mantsy ny zanak’andriamanitra, sady alany baraka eo imason’ny olona.'),
  ('6ab25cdde1fce0d1b4dfcde7', '2026-09-22T10:47:57.351Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:57.351Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 6, 20, 'Ary mba hahasoa antsika dia niditra tao koa i Jesosy, mpialoha lalana antsika, izay lasa mpisoronabe mandrakizay hoatran’i Melkizedeka.', 'ary mba hahasoa antsika dia niditra tao koa i jesosy, mpialoha lalana antsika, izay lasa mpisoronabe mandrakizay hoatran’i melkizedeka.'),
  ('6ab25cdde1fce0d1b4dfcdda', '2026-09-22T10:47:57.351Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:57.351Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 6, 7, 'Rehefa avy matetika ny orana, dia mahazo fitahiana avy amin’Andriamanitra ny tany, satria rehefa lena ny tany dia mamokatra zavamaniry ilain’ny mpamboly.', 'rehefa avy matetika ny orana, dia mahazo fitahiana avy amin’andriamanitra ny tany, satria rehefa lena ny tany dia mamokatra zavamaniry ilain’ny mpamboly.'),
  ('6ab25cdde1fce0d1b4dfcdd8', '2026-09-22T10:47:57.351Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:57.351Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 6, 5, 'ary efa nandray ny teny tsara avy amin’Andriamanitra sy nahazo ny fitahiana hoentin’ilay tontolo ho avy,', 'ary efa nandray ny teny tsara avy amin’andriamanitra sy nahazo ny fitahiana hoentin’ilay tontolo ho avy,'),
  ('6ab25cdde1fce0d1b4dfcde1', '2026-09-22T10:47:57.351Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:57.351Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 6, 14, 'ka hoy izy: “Tena hotahiko ianao ka tena hataoko lasa be dia be.”', 'ka hoy izy: “tena hotahiko ianao ka tena hataoko lasa be dia be.”'),
  ('6ab25cdde1fce0d1b4dfcddd', '2026-09-22T10:47:57.351Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:57.351Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 6, 10, 'Tsy mba manao ny tsy rariny mantsy Andriamanitra, ka hanadino an’izay nataonareo sy ny fitiavana nasehonareo ho an’ny anarany, tamin’ianareo nikarakara ny olona masina sady mbola mikarakara azy ireo hatramin’izao.', 'tsy mba manao ny tsy rariny mantsy andriamanitra, ka hanadino an’izay nataonareo sy ny fitiavana nasehonareo ho an’ny anarany, tamin’ianareo nikarakara ny olona masina sady mbola mikarakara azy ireo hatramin’izao.'),
  ('6ab25cdde1fce0d1b4dfcddc', '2026-09-22T10:47:57.351Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:57.351Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 6, 9, 'Marina fa miteny hoatr’izany izahay, ry malala, nefa raha ny aminareo indray, dia matoky izahay fa manana tombony noho izy ireny ianareo, ka manao zavatra hahazoanareo famonjena.', 'marina fa miteny hoatr’izany izahay, ry malala, nefa raha ny aminareo indray, dia matoky izahay fa manana tombony noho izy ireny ianareo, ka manao zavatra hahazoanareo famonjena.'),
  ('6ab25cdde1fce0d1b4dfcdd7', '2026-09-22T10:47:57.351Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:57.351Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 6, 4, 'Fa izay olona efa nahazo hazavana indray mandeha, sady efa nahazo ny fanomezana maimaim-poana avy any an-danitra sy ny fanahy masina,', 'fa izay olona efa nahazo hazavana indray mandeha, sady efa nahazo ny fanomezana maimaim-poana avy any an-danitra sy ny fanahy masina,'),
  ('6ab25cdde1fce0d1b4dfcde0', '2026-09-22T10:47:57.351Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:57.351Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 6, 13, 'Fa nianiana tamin’ny tenany Andriamanitra tamin’izy nilaza ny fampanantenany tamin’i Abrahama. Tsy misy lehibe noho ny tenany azony nianianana mantsy,', 'fa nianiana tamin’ny tenany andriamanitra tamin’izy nilaza ny fampanantenany tamin’i abrahama. tsy misy lehibe noho ny tenany azony nianianana mantsy,'),
  ('6ab25cdde1fce0d1b4dfcdd5', '2026-09-22T10:47:57.351Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:57.351Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 6, 2, 'ny fampianarana momba ny batisa samihafa sy ny fametrahan-tanana, ny fitsanganana amin’ny maty, ary ny fitsarana mandrakizay.', 'ny fampianarana momba ny batisa samihafa sy ny fametrahan-tanana, ny fitsanganana amin’ny maty, ary ny fitsarana mandrakizay.'),
  ('6ab25cdde1fce0d1b4dfcde3', '2026-09-22T10:47:57.351Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:57.351Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 6, 16, 'Fa mianiana amin’izay lehibe noho izy ny olona. Dia mifarana daholo ny adihevitra rehefa avy mianiana izy ireo, satria ilay fianianana no antoka ara-dalàna manamarina ny tenin’izy ireo.', 'fa mianiana amin’izay lehibe noho izy ny olona. dia mifarana daholo ny adihevitra rehefa avy mianiana izy ireo, satria ilay fianianana no antoka ara-dalàna manamarina ny tenin’izy ireo.'),
  ('6ab25cdde1fce0d1b4dfcdd6', '2026-09-22T10:47:57.351Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:57.351Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 6, 3, 'Ary hanao an’izany isika, raha avelan’Andriamanitra.', 'ary hanao an’izany isika, raha avelan’andriamanitra.'),
  ('6ab25cdde1fce0d1b4dfcdd4', '2026-09-22T10:47:57.351Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:57.351Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 6, 1, 'Efa nilaozantsika ny fampianarana fototra momba an’i Kristy. Noho izany, dia andao isika hiezaka handroso haingana mba ho matotra, fa tsy hiverina amin’ny fampianarana fototra indray, toy ny fibebahana amin’ny asa maty, ny finoana an’Andriamanitra,', 'efa nilaozantsika ny fampianarana fototra momba an’i kristy. noho izany, dia andao isika hiezaka handroso haingana mba ho matotra, fa tsy hiverina amin’ny fampianarana fototra indray, toy ny fibebahana amin’ny asa maty, ny finoana an’andriamanitra,'),
  ('6ab25cde433aabd8b2d7c4c9', '2026-09-22T10:47:58.370Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:58.370Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 7, 8, 'Amin’ilay iray, dia olombelona mety maty no mahazo ampahafolon-karena. Fa amin’ilay iray kosa, dia ilay voaporofo hoe velona no mahazo an’ilay izy.', 'amin’ilay iray, dia olombelona mety maty no mahazo ampahafolon-karena. fa amin’ilay iray kosa, dia ilay voaporofo hoe velona no mahazo an’ilay izy.'),
  ('6ab25cde433aabd8b2d7c4d6', '2026-09-22T10:47:58.370Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:58.370Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 7, 21, '—tena nisy anefa olona lasa mpisorona na dia tsy nisy fianianana natao aza, fa ity iray ity kosa lasa mpisorona noho ny fianianan’Ilay nilaza taminy hoe: “Nianiana i Jehovah ary tsy hiova hevitra. Hoy Izy: ‘Mpisorona mandrakizay ianao’”—', '—tena nisy anefa olona lasa mpisorona na dia tsy nisy fianianana natao aza, fa ity iray ity kosa lasa mpisorona noho ny fianianan’ilay nilaza taminy hoe: “nianiana i jehovah ary tsy hiova hevitra. hoy izy: ‘mpisorona mandrakizay ianao’”—'),
  ('6ab25cde433aabd8b2d7c4c7', '2026-09-22T10:47:58.370Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:58.370Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 7, 6, 'Fa io lehilahy io kosa, izay tsy mba taranak’i Levy, dia nahazo ampahafolon-karena avy tamin’i Abrahama, ka nitso-drano an’ilay nanaovana fampanantenana.', 'fa io lehilahy io kosa, izay tsy mba taranak’i levy, dia nahazo ampahafolon-karena avy tamin’i abrahama, ka nitso-drano an’ilay nanaovana fampanantenana.'),
  ('6ab25cde433aabd8b2d7c4c4', '2026-09-22T10:47:58.370Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:58.370Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 7, 3, 'Tsy nanana ray sy reny izy, sady tsy nanana tetirazana. Tsy nisy fiandohana ny androm-piainany sady tsy nisy fiafarana. Natao hoatran’ny Zanak’Andriamanitra kosa izy, ka ho mpisorona mandrakizay.', 'tsy nanana ray sy reny izy, sady tsy nanana tetirazana. tsy nisy fiandohana ny androm-piainany sady tsy nisy fiafarana. natao hoatran’ny zanak’andriamanitra kosa izy, ka ho mpisorona mandrakizay.'),
  ('6ab25cde433aabd8b2d7c4ca', '2026-09-22T10:47:58.370Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:58.370Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 7, 9, 'Azo lazaina àry hoe na i Levy aza nandoa ny ampahafolon-karena tamin’ny alalan’i Abrahama, nefa i Levy no mandray ny ampahafolon-karena.', 'azo lazaina àry hoe na i levy aza nandoa ny ampahafolon-karena tamin’ny alalan’i abrahama, nefa i levy no mandray ny ampahafolon-karena.'),
  ('6ab25cde433aabd8b2d7c4d8', '2026-09-22T10:47:58.370Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:58.370Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 7, 23, 'Be dia be koa ny mpisorona tsy maintsy nifandimby, satria izay maty dia tsy afaka ny ho mpisorona intsony.', 'be dia be koa ny mpisorona tsy maintsy nifandimby, satria izay maty dia tsy afaka ny ho mpisorona intsony.'),
  ('6ab25cde433aabd8b2d7c4d1', '2026-09-22T10:47:58.370Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:58.370Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 7, 16, 'Tsy noho ny foko niaviany araka izay takin’ny Lalàna anefa no mahatonga azy ho mpisorona, fa noho ilay hery manome azy fiainana tsy mety levona.', 'tsy noho ny foko niaviany araka izay takin’ny lalàna anefa no mahatonga azy ho mpisorona, fa noho ilay hery manome azy fiainana tsy mety levona.'),
  ('6ab25cde433aabd8b2d7c4ce', '2026-09-22T10:47:58.370Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:58.370Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 7, 13, 'Fa avy amin’ny foko hafa ilay lehilahy resahina amin’izany, ary tsy nisy nanompo teo amin’ny alitara ny olona avy tamin’io foko io.', 'fa avy amin’ny foko hafa ilay lehilahy resahina amin’izany, ary tsy nisy nanompo teo amin’ny alitara ny olona avy tamin’io foko io.'),
  ('6ab25cde433aabd8b2d7c4cc', '2026-09-22T10:47:58.370Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:58.370Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 7, 11, 'Raha nahatonga ny olona ho lavorary àry ny fisoronan’ny Levita—satria anisan’ilay Lalàna nomena ny vahoaka izy io—dia inona indray no ilana hanendrena mpisorona hafa lazaina hoe hoatran’i Melkizedeka, fa tsy hoatran’i Arona?', 'raha nahatonga ny olona ho lavorary àry ny fisoronan’ny levita—satria anisan’ilay lalàna nomena ny vahoaka izy io—dia inona indray no ilana hanendrena mpisorona hafa lazaina hoe hoatran’i melkizedeka, fa tsy hoatran’i arona?'),
  ('6ab25cde433aabd8b2d7c4cb', '2026-09-22T10:47:58.370Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:58.370Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 7, 10, 'Mbola tsy teraka mantsy io taranak’i Abrahama io, tamin’i Melkizedeka nitsena an’ilay razambeny.', 'mbola tsy teraka mantsy io taranak’i abrahama io, tamin’i melkizedeka nitsena an’ilay razambeny.'),
  ('6ab25cde433aabd8b2d7c4c8', '2026-09-22T10:47:58.370Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:58.370Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 7, 7, 'Tsy azo lavina fa ilay mitso-drano no lehibe kokoa noho ilay mahazo tsodrano.', 'tsy azo lavina fa ilay mitso-drano no lehibe kokoa noho ilay mahazo tsodrano.'),
  ('6ab25cde433aabd8b2d7c4c6', '2026-09-22T10:47:58.370Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:58.370Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 7, 5, 'Marina fa raha ny Lalàna no jerena, dia izay anisan’ny taranak’i Levy voatendry ho mpisorona no asaina manangona ny ampahafolon-karena avy amin’ny olona, izany hoe avy amin’ireo rahalahiny, na dia taranak’i Abrahama koa aza izy ireny.', 'marina fa raha ny lalàna no jerena, dia izay anisan’ny taranak’i levy voatendry ho mpisorona no asaina manangona ny ampahafolon-karena avy amin’ny olona, izany hoe avy amin’ireo rahalahiny, na dia taranak’i abrahama koa aza izy ireny.'),
  ('6ab25cde433aabd8b2d7c4c3', '2026-09-22T10:47:58.370Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:58.370Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 7, 2, 'Ary nomen’i Abrahama ny ampahafolon’ny zava-drehetra azony izy. Voalohany, midika hoe “Mpanjakan’ny Fahamarinana” ny anarany, dia izy koa mpanjakan’i Salema, izany hoe “Mpanjakan’ny Fiadanana.”', 'ary nomen’i abrahama ny ampahafolon’ny zava-drehetra azony izy. voalohany, midika hoe “mpanjakan’ny fahamarinana” ny anarany, dia izy koa mpanjakan’i salema, izany hoe “mpanjakan’ny fiadanana.”'),
  ('6ab25cde433aabd8b2d7c4d9', '2026-09-22T10:47:58.370Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:58.370Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 7, 24, 'Izy kosa mpisorona velona mandrakizay, ka tsy misy mpandimby.', 'izy kosa mpisorona velona mandrakizay, ka tsy misy mpandimby.'),
  ('6ab25cde433aabd8b2d7c4cd', '2026-09-22T10:47:58.370Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:58.370Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 7, 12, 'Satria ovana ny fisoronana, dia tsy maintsy ovana koa ny Lalàna.', 'satria ovana ny fisoronana, dia tsy maintsy ovana koa ny lalàna.'),
  ('6ab25cde433aabd8b2d7c4c2', '2026-09-22T10:47:58.370Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:58.370Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 7, 1, 'Mpanjakan’i Salema sy mpisoron’ilay Andriamanitra Avo Indrindra io Melkizedeka io, ary nitsena an’i Abrahama tamin’izy niverina avy nandresy mpanjaka maro, ka nitso-drano azy.', 'mpanjakan’i salema sy mpisoron’ilay andriamanitra avo indrindra io melkizedeka io, ary nitsena an’i abrahama tamin’izy niverina avy nandresy mpanjaka maro, ka nitso-drano azy.'),
  ('6ab25cde433aabd8b2d7c4da', '2026-09-22T10:47:58.370Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:58.370Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 7, 25, 'Afaka mamonjy tanteraka an’izay manatona an’Andriamanitra amin’ny alalany koa àry izy, satria velona foana mba hiangavy ho an’ireo.', 'afaka mamonjy tanteraka an’izay manatona an’andriamanitra amin’ny alalany koa àry izy, satria velona foana mba hiangavy ho an’ireo.'),
  ('6ab25cde433aabd8b2d7c4d4', '2026-09-22T10:47:58.370Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:58.370Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 7, 19, 'Tsy nahatonga na inona na inona ho lavorary mantsy ny Lalàna. Ilay fanantenana tsara kokoa omen’Andriamanitra kosa no nahavita an’izany sy nahatonga antsika ho afaka hanatona azy.', 'tsy nahatonga na inona na inona ho lavorary mantsy ny lalàna. ilay fanantenana tsara kokoa omen’andriamanitra kosa no nahavita an’izany sy nahatonga antsika ho afaka hanatona azy.'),
  ('6ab25cde433aabd8b2d7c4d5', '2026-09-22T10:47:58.370Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:58.370Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 7, 20, 'Ary tsy ho notendrena izany mpisorona izany raha tsy nisy fianianana natao,', 'ary tsy ho notendrena izany mpisorona izany raha tsy nisy fianianana natao,'),
  ('6ab25cde433aabd8b2d7c4cf', '2026-09-22T10:47:58.370Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:58.370Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 7, 14, 'Mazava fa avy tamin’ny fokon’i Joda ny Tompontsika, nefa tsy nilaza mihitsy i Mosesy hoe nisy mpisorona avy tamin’io foko io.', 'mazava fa avy tamin’ny fokon’i joda ny tompontsika, nefa tsy nilaza mihitsy i mosesy hoe nisy mpisorona avy tamin’io foko io.'),
  ('6ab25cde433aabd8b2d7c4dc', '2026-09-22T10:47:58.370Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:58.370Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 7, 27, 'Tsy mila manao sorona isan’andro hoatran’ny nataon’ireny mpisoronabe ireny izy, ka hoe mila manao sorona noho ny otan’ny tenany aloha, dia avy eo noho ny otan’ny vahoaka. Nanao an’izany indray mandeha fotsiny mantsy izy rehefa nanolotra ny tenany.', 'tsy mila manao sorona isan’andro hoatran’ny nataon’ireny mpisoronabe ireny izy, ka hoe mila manao sorona noho ny otan’ny tenany aloha, dia avy eo noho ny otan’ny vahoaka. nanao an’izany indray mandeha fotsiny mantsy izy rehefa nanolotra ny tenany.'),
  ('6ab25cde433aabd8b2d7c4dd', '2026-09-22T10:47:58.370Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:58.370Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 7, 28, 'Lehilahy manana fahalemena no tendren’ny Lalàna ho mpisoronabe, fa Zanaka natao lavorary mandrakizay kosa no tendren’ilay fianianana natao taorian’ny Lalàna.', 'lehilahy manana fahalemena no tendren’ny lalàna ho mpisoronabe, fa zanaka natao lavorary mandrakizay kosa no tendren’ilay fianianana natao taorian’ny lalàna.'),
  ('6ab25cde433aabd8b2d7c4d3', '2026-09-22T10:47:58.370Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:58.370Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 7, 18, 'Nofoanana àry ilay didy teo aloha satria voafetra ihany ny zavatra vitany, ary tsy mandaitra ilay izy.', 'nofoanana àry ilay didy teo aloha satria voafetra ihany ny zavatra vitany, ary tsy mandaitra ilay izy.'),
  ('6ab25cde433aabd8b2d7c4d0', '2026-09-22T10:47:58.370Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:58.370Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 7, 15, 'Ary vao mainka mazava amintsika izany rehefa misy mpisorona iray hafa voatendry, dia mpisorona hoatran’i Melkizedeka.', 'ary vao mainka mazava amintsika izany rehefa misy mpisorona iray hafa voatendry, dia mpisorona hoatran’i melkizedeka.'),
  ('6ab25cde433aabd8b2d7c4db', '2026-09-22T10:47:58.370Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:58.370Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 7, 26, 'Fa mety amintsika ny mpisoronabe hoatr’izany, dia mpisoronabe tsy mivadika, tsy manan-tsiny, tsy misy loto, tafasaraka amin’ny mpanota, ary natao ambony noho ny lanitra.', 'fa mety amintsika ny mpisoronabe hoatr’izany, dia mpisoronabe tsy mivadika, tsy manan-tsiny, tsy misy loto, tafasaraka amin’ny mpanota, ary natao ambony noho ny lanitra.'),
  ('6ab25cde433aabd8b2d7c4d2', '2026-09-22T10:47:58.370Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:58.370Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 7, 17, 'Izao mantsy no voalaza, ho vavolombelona manamarina azy: “Mpisorona mandrakizay ianao, hoatran’i Melkizedeka.”', 'izao mantsy no voalaza, ho vavolombelona manamarina azy: “mpisorona mandrakizay ianao, hoatran’i melkizedeka.”'),
  ('6ab25cde433aabd8b2d7c4d7', '2026-09-22T10:47:58.370Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:58.370Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 7, 22, 'dia izany no nahatonga an’i Jesosy ho antoka ny amin’ny fifanekena tsara kokoa.', 'dia izany no nahatonga an’i jesosy ho antoka ny amin’ny fifanekena tsara kokoa.'),
  ('6ab25cde433aabd8b2d7c4c5', '2026-09-22T10:47:58.370Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:58.370Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 7, 4, 'Tena nanan-kaja io lehilahy io matoa i Abrahama, loham-pianakaviana, nanome azy ny ampahafolon’ny zavatra tsara indrindra azony babo.', 'tena nanan-kaja io lehilahy io matoa i abrahama, loham-pianakaviana, nanome azy ny ampahafolon’ny zavatra tsara indrindra azony babo.'),
  ('6ab25cdf2899e63f33e92fbc', '2026-09-22T10:47:59.557Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:59.557Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 8, 13, 'Matoa izy niteny hoe “fifanekena vaovao”, dia nataony lany andro ilay taloha. Ary efa ho levona ilay efa lany andro sy mihantitra.', 'matoa izy niteny hoe “fifanekena vaovao”, dia nataony lany andro ilay taloha. ary efa ho levona ilay efa lany andro sy mihantitra.'),
  ('6ab25cdf2899e63f33e92fbb', '2026-09-22T10:47:59.557Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:59.557Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 8, 12, 'Fa hamindrako fo izy ireo na dia nanao ratsy aza, ary tsy hotsaroako intsony ny fahotany.’”', 'fa hamindrako fo izy ireo na dia nanao ratsy aza, ary tsy hotsaroako intsony ny fahotany.’”'),
  ('6ab25cdf2899e63f33e92fb7', '2026-09-22T10:47:59.557Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:59.557Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 8, 8, 'Fa tena manome tsiny ny vahoaka Andriamanitra, rehefa miteny hoe: “‘Henoy izao!’, hoy i Jehovah. ‘Ho avy ny andro hanaovako fifanekena vaovao amin’ny taranak’Israely sy ny taranak’i Joda.', 'fa tena manome tsiny ny vahoaka andriamanitra, rehefa miteny hoe: “‘henoy izao!’, hoy i jehovah. ‘ho avy ny andro hanaovako fifanekena vaovao amin’ny taranak’israely sy ny taranak’i joda.'),
  ('6ab25cdf2899e63f33e92fb6', '2026-09-22T10:47:59.557Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:59.557Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 8, 7, 'Raha tsy nisy tsininy ilay fifanekena voalohany, dia tsy ho nisy nilana fifanekena faharoa.', 'raha tsy nisy tsininy ilay fifanekena voalohany, dia tsy ho nisy nilana fifanekena faharoa.'),
  ('6ab25cdf2899e63f33e92fb8', '2026-09-22T10:47:59.557Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:59.557Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 8, 9, 'Tsy ho hoatran’ilay fifanekena nataoko tamin’ny razambeny, tamin’ny andro nitantanako azy nivoaka avy tany Ejipta, anefa izany. Tsy nanaja an’iny fifanekena nataoko taminy iny mantsy izy ireo, ka tsy noraharahiako intsony’, hoy i Jehovah.”', 'tsy ho hoatran’ilay fifanekena nataoko tamin’ny razambeny, tamin’ny andro nitantanako azy nivoaka avy tany ejipta, anefa izany. tsy nanaja an’iny fifanekena nataoko taminy iny mantsy izy ireo, ka tsy noraharahiako intsony’, hoy i jehovah.”'),
  ('6ab25cdf2899e63f33e92fb1', '2026-09-22T10:47:59.557Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:59.557Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 8, 2, 'Mpanompo ao amin’ny toerana masina sy ny tena tranolay koa izy, ary i Jehovah, fa tsy olona, no nanorina an’io tranolay io.', 'mpanompo ao amin’ny toerana masina sy ny tena tranolay koa izy, ary i jehovah, fa tsy olona, no nanorina an’io tranolay io.'),
  ('6ab25cdf2899e63f33e92fba', '2026-09-22T10:47:59.557Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:59.557Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 8, 11, '“‘Samy tsy hampianatra ny mpiray firenena aminy sy ny rahalahiny intsony izy ireo hoe: “Fantaro i Jehovah!” Hahafantatra ahy mantsy izy rehetra, hatramin’ny kely indrindra ka hatramin’ny lehibe indrindra.', '“‘samy tsy hampianatra ny mpiray firenena aminy sy ny rahalahiny intsony izy ireo hoe: “fantaro i jehovah!” hahafantatra ahy mantsy izy rehetra, hatramin’ny kely indrindra ka hatramin’ny lehibe indrindra.'),
  ('6ab25cdf2899e63f33e92fb5', '2026-09-22T10:47:59.557Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:59.557Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 8, 6, 'Izao anefa i Jesosy nomena fanompoana tsara lavitra, satria izy koa no mpanelanelana amin’ny fifanekena tsara kokoa, izay efa natao ara-dalàna noho ny fampanantenana tsara kokoa.', 'izao anefa i jesosy nomena fanompoana tsara lavitra, satria izy koa no mpanelanelana amin’ny fifanekena tsara kokoa, izay efa natao ara-dalàna noho ny fampanantenana tsara kokoa.'),
  ('6ab25cdf2899e63f33e92fb3', '2026-09-22T10:47:59.557Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:59.557Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 8, 4, 'Tsy ho mpisorona izy raha etỳ an-tany, satria etỳ efa misy olona manolotra fanomezana araka ny Lalàna.', 'tsy ho mpisorona izy raha etỳ an-tany, satria etỳ efa misy olona manolotra fanomezana araka ny lalàna.'),
  ('6ab25cdf2899e63f33e92fb0', '2026-09-22T10:47:59.557Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:59.557Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 8, 1, 'Izao no hevi-dehibe amin’izany zavatra resahinay izany: Mpisoronabe hoatr’izany no ananantsika, ary mipetraka eo ankavanan’ilay Andriamanitra Lehibe any an-danitra izy.', 'izao no hevi-dehibe amin’izany zavatra resahinay izany: mpisoronabe hoatr’izany no ananantsika, ary mipetraka eo ankavanan’ilay andriamanitra lehibe any an-danitra izy.'),
  ('6ab25cdf2899e63f33e92fb4', '2026-09-22T10:47:59.557Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:59.557Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 8, 5, 'Manao fanompoana masina ireny olona ireny, ary taratra sy aloky ny zavatra any an-danitra ny fanompoana ataony. Hita tamin’ilay didy nomen’Andriamanitra an’i Mosesy izany, tamin’izy efa hanorina ny tranolay. Izao mantsy no didy nomeny: “Mitandrema tsara mba hifanaraka amin’ilay modely naseho anao tatỳ an-tendrombohitra no hanaovanao ny zava-drehetra.”', 'manao fanompoana masina ireny olona ireny, ary taratra sy aloky ny zavatra any an-danitra ny fanompoana ataony. hita tamin’ilay didy nomen’andriamanitra an’i mosesy izany, tamin’izy efa hanorina ny tranolay. izao mantsy no didy nomeny: “mitandrema tsara mba hifanaraka amin’ilay modely naseho anao tatỳ an-tendrombohitra no hanaovanao ny zava-drehetra.”'),
  ('6ab25cdf2899e63f33e92fb2', '2026-09-22T10:47:59.557Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:59.557Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 8, 3, 'Fa tendrena hanao fanomezana sy sorona ny mpisoronabe rehetra. Tsy maintsy manao sorona koa àry izy.', 'fa tendrena hanao fanomezana sy sorona ny mpisoronabe rehetra. tsy maintsy manao sorona koa àry izy.'),
  ('6ab25cdf2899e63f33e92fb9', '2026-09-22T10:47:59.557Z', '2026-09-22T10:47:59.557Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 8, 10, '“‘Fa izao no fifanekena hataoko amin’ny taranak’Israely, aorian’izany andro izany’, hoy i Jehovah: ‘Hataoko ao an-tsainy ny lalàko, sady hosoratako ao am-pony. Dia ho Andriamaniny aho, ary izy ireo ho vahoakako.', '“‘fa izao no fifanekena hataoko amin’ny taranak’israely, aorian’izany andro izany’, hoy i jehovah: ‘hataoko ao an-tsainy ny lalàko, sady hosoratako ao am-pony. dia ho andriamaniny aho, ary izy ireo ho vahoakako.'),
  ('6ab25ce097425f3d238833b9', '2026-09-22T10:48:00.094Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:00.094Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 9, 28, 'dia hoatr’izany koa fa natolotra indray mandeha fotsiny i Kristy mba hitondra ny fahotan’ny olona maro. Ary rehefa miseho fanindroany izy, dia tsy hoe hanala fahotana, fa hiseho amin’izay miandry azy mafy mba hamonjy azy ireo.', 'dia hoatr’izany koa fa natolotra indray mandeha fotsiny i kristy mba hitondra ny fahotan’ny olona maro. ary rehefa miseho fanindroany izy, dia tsy hoe hanala fahotana, fa hiseho amin’izay miandry azy mafy mba hamonjy azy ireo.'),
  ('6ab25ce097425f3d238833aa', '2026-09-22T10:48:00.094Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:00.094Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 9, 13, 'Fa raha ny ran’osilahy sy ny ran’ombilahy ary ny lavenon’ny vantotr’ombivavy nafafy teo amin’izay naloto aza manamasina sy manadio ny vatana,', 'fa raha ny ran’osilahy sy ny ran’ombilahy ary ny lavenon’ny vantotr’ombivavy nafafy teo amin’izay naloto aza manamasina sy manadio ny vatana,'),
  ('6ab25ce097425f3d238833a8', '2026-09-22T10:48:00.094Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:00.094Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 9, 11, 'Efa lasa mpisoronabe anefa i Kristy, ary mandray fitahiana avy amin’izany isika. Rehefa lasa mpisoronabe izy, dia niditra tao amin’ny tranolay lehibe kokoa sy lavorary kokoa ary tsy nataon’ny tanan’olona, izany hoe tsy anisan’ny zavatra eto an-tany.', 'efa lasa mpisoronabe anefa i kristy, ary mandray fitahiana avy amin’izany isika. rehefa lasa mpisoronabe izy, dia niditra tao amin’ny tranolay lehibe kokoa sy lavorary kokoa ary tsy nataon’ny tanan’olona, izany hoe tsy anisan’ny zavatra eto an-tany.'),
  ('6ab25ce097425f3d238833a7', '2026-09-22T10:48:00.094Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:00.094Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 9, 10, 'Zavatra momba ny sakafo sy ny zava-pisotro ary ny fombafomba fisasana samihafa fotsiny ireny. Zavatra notakin’ny lalàna momba ny vatana ireny, ary natao nanan-kery mandra-pahatongan’ny fotoana voatondro hanitsiana ny zava-drehetra.', 'zavatra momba ny sakafo sy ny zava-pisotro ary ny fombafomba fisasana samihafa fotsiny ireny. zavatra notakin’ny lalàna momba ny vatana ireny, ary natao nanan-kery mandra-pahatongan’ny fotoana voatondro hanitsiana ny zava-drehetra.'),
  ('6ab25ce097425f3d238833a0', '2026-09-22T10:48:00.094Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:00.094Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 9, 3, 'Tao ambadik’ilay ridao faharoa kosa no nisy an’ilay efitra nantsoina hoe Masina Indrindra.', 'tao ambadik’ilay ridao faharoa kosa no nisy an’ilay efitra nantsoina hoe masina indrindra.'),
  ('6ab25ce097425f3d238833b3', '2026-09-22T10:48:00.094Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:00.094Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 9, 22, 'Saika ny zava-drehetra no diovina amin’ny ra, araka ny Lalàna. Ary raha tsy misy ra alatsaka dia tsy misy famelan-keloka.', 'saika ny zava-drehetra no diovina amin’ny ra, araka ny lalàna. ary raha tsy misy ra alatsaka dia tsy misy famelan-keloka.'),
  ('6ab25ce097425f3d238833ae', '2026-09-22T10:48:00.094Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:00.094Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 9, 17, 'Fa ny fahafatesana no mampanan-kery ny fifanekena, satria tsy manan-kery mihitsy ilay izy raha mbola velona ilay olona nanao fifanekena.', 'fa ny fahafatesana no mampanan-kery ny fifanekena, satria tsy manan-kery mihitsy ilay izy raha mbola velona ilay olona nanao fifanekena.'),
  ('6ab25ce097425f3d238833b2', '2026-09-22T10:48:00.094Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:00.094Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 9, 21, 'Nofafazany ra koa ny tranolay sy ny fitaovana rehetra fanaovana fanompoana masina.', 'nofafazany ra koa ny tranolay sy ny fitaovana rehetra fanaovana fanompoana masina.'),
  ('6ab25ce097425f3d238833ab', '2026-09-22T10:48:00.094Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:00.094Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 9, 14, 'mainka fa ny ran’i Kristy! Natolony ho sorona tsy misy tsiny ho an’Andriamanitra mantsy ny tenany noho ny fiasan’ny fanahy masina mandrakizay. Ny rany koa no manadio ny feon’ny fieritreretantsika, ka tsy manao asa tsy misy dikany intsony isika. Amin’izay isika dia ho afaka hanao fanompoana masina ho an’ilay Andriamanitra velona.', 'mainka fa ny ran’i kristy! natolony ho sorona tsy misy tsiny ho an’andriamanitra mantsy ny tenany noho ny fiasan’ny fanahy masina mandrakizay. ny rany koa no manadio ny feon’ny fieritreretantsika, ka tsy manao asa tsy misy dikany intsony isika. amin’izay isika dia ho afaka hanao fanompoana masina ho an’ilay andriamanitra velona.'),
  ('6ab25ce097425f3d238833af', '2026-09-22T10:48:00.094Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:00.094Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 9, 18, 'Noho izany, na ilay fifanekena taloha aza tsy natao nanan-kery raha tsy nisy ra nalatsaka.', 'noho izany, na ilay fifanekena taloha aza tsy natao nanan-kery raha tsy nisy ra nalatsaka.'),
  ('6ab25ce097425f3d238833ad', '2026-09-22T10:48:00.094Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:00.094Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 9, 16, 'Rehefa misy fifanekena atao mantsy, dia tokony ho faty ilay olona nanao fifanekena.', 'rehefa misy fifanekena atao mantsy, dia tokony ho faty ilay olona nanao fifanekena.'),
  ('6ab25ce097425f3d238833a9', '2026-09-22T10:48:00.094Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:00.094Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 9, 12, 'Indray mandeha fotsiny izy no niditra tao amin’ny toerana masina, nefa tsy ran’osilahy sy ran’ny vantotr’ombilahy no nentiny, fa ny ran’ny tenany, ary tamin’ny alalany no nahazoantsika fanafahana mandrakizay.', 'indray mandeha fotsiny izy no niditra tao amin’ny toerana masina, nefa tsy ran’osilahy sy ran’ny vantotr’ombilahy no nentiny, fa ny ran’ny tenany, ary tamin’ny alalany no nahazoantsika fanafahana mandrakizay.'),
  ('6ab25ce097425f3d238833b7', '2026-09-22T10:48:00.094Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:00.094Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 9, 26, 'Raha izany mantsy, dia ho voatery nijaly matetika izy nanomboka tamin’ny nanorenana an’izao tontolo izao. Efa niseho indray mandeha fotsiny anefa izy mandritra ny fotoana ifaranan’izao tontolo izao, mba hanala tanteraka ny ota amin’ny alalan’ilay sorona nataony.', 'raha izany mantsy, dia ho voatery nijaly matetika izy nanomboka tamin’ny nanorenana an’izao tontolo izao. efa niseho indray mandeha fotsiny anefa izy mandritra ny fotoana ifaranan’izao tontolo izao, mba hanala tanteraka ny ota amin’ny alalan’ilay sorona nataony.'),
  ('6ab25ce097425f3d238833a6', '2026-09-22T10:48:00.094Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:00.094Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 9, 9, 'Fanoharana ilazana an’izao fotoana izao io tranolay io. Araka io fanoharana io, dia misy fanomezana sy sorona atolotra. Tsy mahatonga an’izay manao fanompoana masina hanana feon’ny fieritreretana madio tanteraka anefa ireny.', 'fanoharana ilazana an’izao fotoana izao io tranolay io. araka io fanoharana io, dia misy fanomezana sy sorona atolotra. tsy mahatonga an’izay manao fanompoana masina hanana feon’ny fieritreretana madio tanteraka anefa ireny.'),
  ('6ab25ce097425f3d238833a5', '2026-09-22T10:48:00.094Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:00.094Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 9, 8, 'Asehon’ny fanahy masina mazava amin’izany àry, fa mbola tsy naharihary ny lalana mankao amin’ny toerana masina raha mbola teo ilay tranolay voalohany.', 'asehon’ny fanahy masina mazava amin’izany àry, fa mbola tsy naharihary ny lalana mankao amin’ny toerana masina raha mbola teo ilay tranolay voalohany.'),
  ('6ab25ce097425f3d238833b1', '2026-09-22T10:48:00.094Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:00.094Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 9, 20, 'Hoy izy tamin’izay: “Ity no ran’ny fifanekena nataon’Andriamanitra taminareo, dia ilay fifanekena nasainy nohajainareo.”', 'hoy izy tamin’izay: “ity no ran’ny fifanekena nataon’andriamanitra taminareo, dia ilay fifanekena nasainy nohajainareo.”'),
  ('6ab25ce097425f3d238833b0', '2026-09-22T10:48:00.094Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:00.094Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 9, 19, 'Fa rehefa nolazain’i Mosesy tamin’ny olona rehetra ny didy tsirairay tao amin’ny Lalàna, dia nalainy ny ran’ny vantotr’ombilahy sy ny ran’osilahy ary ny rano, ka nafafiny teo amin’ny boky sy ny vahoaka rehetra, ary volonondry mena midorehitra sy hysopa no namafazany an’izany.', 'fa rehefa nolazain’i mosesy tamin’ny olona rehetra ny didy tsirairay tao amin’ny lalàna, dia nalainy ny ran’ny vantotr’ombilahy sy ny ran’osilahy ary ny rano, ka nafafiny teo amin’ny boky sy ny vahoaka rehetra, ary volonondry mena midorehitra sy hysopa no namafazany an’izany.'),
  ('6ab25ce097425f3d238833a1', '2026-09-22T10:48:00.094Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:00.094Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 9, 4, 'Tao no nisy ny fitaovana volamena fandoroana emboka manitra sy ny Vata misy ny fifanekena. Nopetahana takela-bolamena ilay Vata manontolo, ary tao amin’izy io ny siny volamena nisy ny mana, sy ilay tehin’i Arona nitsimoka, ary ny takela-baton’ny fifanekena.', 'tao no nisy ny fitaovana volamena fandoroana emboka manitra sy ny vata misy ny fifanekena. nopetahana takela-bolamena ilay vata manontolo, ary tao amin’izy io ny siny volamena nisy ny mana, sy ilay tehin’i arona nitsimoka, ary ny takela-baton’ny fifanekena.'),
  ('6ab25ce097425f3d2388339e', '2026-09-22T10:48:00.094Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:00.094Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 9, 1, 'Ary tao amin’ilay fifanekena taloha, dia nisy lalàna momba ny fanompoana masina, sady nisy toerana masina tetỳ an-tany.', 'ary tao amin’ilay fifanekena taloha, dia nisy lalàna momba ny fanompoana masina, sady nisy toerana masina tetỳ an-tany.'),
  ('6ab25ce097425f3d238833a3', '2026-09-22T10:48:00.094Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:00.094Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 9, 6, 'Rehefa voaorina hoatr’izany ireo zavatra ireo, dia miditra ao amin’ny efitra voalohany ao amin’ilay tranolay ny mpisorona mba hanao fanompoana masina, ary miditra ao isan’andro izy.', 'rehefa voaorina hoatr’izany ireo zavatra ireo, dia miditra ao amin’ny efitra voalohany ao amin’ilay tranolay ny mpisorona mba hanao fanompoana masina, ary miditra ao isan’andro izy.'),
  ('6ab25ce097425f3d238833b5', '2026-09-22T10:48:00.094Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:00.094Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 9, 24, 'I Kristy mantsy tsy niditra tao amin’ny toerana masina nataon’ny tanan’olona, izany hoe toerana masina sahala amin’ilay tena izy, fa niditra tany an-danitra mihitsy, mba hiseho eo anatrehan’Andriamanitra ho antsika amin’izao.', 'i kristy mantsy tsy niditra tao amin’ny toerana masina nataon’ny tanan’olona, izany hoe toerana masina sahala amin’ilay tena izy, fa niditra tany an-danitra mihitsy, mba hiseho eo anatrehan’andriamanitra ho antsika amin’izao.'),
  ('6ab25ce097425f3d238833a4', '2026-09-22T10:48:00.094Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:00.094Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 9, 7, 'Ny mpisoronabe irery anefa no miditra ao amin’ilay efitra faharoa, indray mandeha isan-taona. Ary tsy miditra ao izy raha tsy mitondra ra, izay atolony noho ny fahotany sy noho ny fahotana nataon’ny vahoaka vokatry ny tsy fahalalan’izy ireo.', 'ny mpisoronabe irery anefa no miditra ao amin’ilay efitra faharoa, indray mandeha isan-taona. ary tsy miditra ao izy raha tsy mitondra ra, izay atolony noho ny fahotany sy noho ny fahotana nataon’ny vahoaka vokatry ny tsy fahalalan’izy ireo.'),
  ('6ab25ce097425f3d2388339f', '2026-09-22T10:48:00.094Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:00.094Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 9, 2, 'Fa naorina ny efitra voalohany tao amin’ny tranolay, ka tao amin’io efitra io no nisy ny fitoeran-jiro sy ny latabatra ary ny mofo atolotra. Ary nantsoina hoe Toerana Masina io efitra io.', 'fa naorina ny efitra voalohany tao amin’ny tranolay, ka tao amin’io efitra io no nisy ny fitoeran-jiro sy ny latabatra ary ny mofo atolotra. ary nantsoina hoe toerana masina io efitra io.'),
  ('6ab25ce097425f3d238833ac', '2026-09-22T10:48:00.094Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:00.094Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 9, 15, 'Izany no mahatonga azy ho mpanelanelana amin’ny fifanekena vaovao. Amin’izay dia hahazo an’ilay fampanantenana momba ny lova mandrakizay ny olona voantso. Maty mantsy i Kristy ka ny vidim-panavotana no nanafahany azy ireo noho izy ireo nandika lalàna teo ambanin’ilay fifanekena taloha.', 'izany no mahatonga azy ho mpanelanelana amin’ny fifanekena vaovao. amin’izay dia hahazo an’ilay fampanantenana momba ny lova mandrakizay ny olona voantso. maty mantsy i kristy ka ny vidim-panavotana no nanafahany azy ireo noho izy ireo nandika lalàna teo ambanin’ilay fifanekena taloha.'),
  ('6ab25ce097425f3d238833b6', '2026-09-22T10:48:00.094Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:00.094Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 9, 25, 'Tsy hoe nanao an’izany izy mba hanao sorona ny tenany imbetsaka, tsy hoatran’ny mpisoronabe izay miditra isan-taona ao amin’ny toerana masina, sady mitondra ra nefa tsy ny ran’ny tenany.', 'tsy hoe nanao an’izany izy mba hanao sorona ny tenany imbetsaka, tsy hoatran’ny mpisoronabe izay miditra isan-taona ao amin’ny toerana masina, sady mitondra ra nefa tsy ny ran’ny tenany.'),
  ('6ab25ce097425f3d238833b4', '2026-09-22T10:48:00.094Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:00.094Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 9, 23, 'Tsy maintsy nodiovina hoatr’izany koa àry ny taratry ny zavatra any an-danitra. Mila sorona tsara lavitra noho izany anefa ny zavatra any an-danitra.', 'tsy maintsy nodiovina hoatr’izany koa àry ny taratry ny zavatra any an-danitra. mila sorona tsara lavitra noho izany anefa ny zavatra any an-danitra.'),
  ('6ab25ce097425f3d238833b8', '2026-09-22T10:48:00.094Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:00.094Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 9, 27, 'Maty indray mandeha fotsiny ny olona, ary hotsaraina aorian’izay,', 'maty indray mandeha fotsiny ny olona, ary hotsaraina aorian’izay,'),
  ('6ab25ce097425f3d238833a2', '2026-09-22T10:48:00.094Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:00.094Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 9, 5, 'Ary teo amboniny no nisy ny kerobima be voninahitra, izay nanaloka an’ilay sarony fampihavanana. Tsy izao anefa no fotoana tokony hiresahana an’izany rehetra izany amin’ny an-tsipiriany.', 'ary teo amboniny no nisy ny kerobima be voninahitra, izay nanaloka an’ilay sarony fampihavanana. tsy izao anefa no fotoana tokony hiresahana an’izany rehetra izany amin’ny an-tsipiriany.'),
  ('6ab25ce05d5e131925aa2cba', '2026-09-22T10:48:00.508Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:00.508Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 10, 9, 'Dia avy eo izy niteny hoe: “Intỳ aho tonga hanao ny sitraponao.” Esoriny ilay voalohany mba hametrahana an’ilay faharoa.', 'dia avy eo izy niteny hoe: “intỳ aho tonga hanao ny sitraponao.” esoriny ilay voalohany mba hametrahana an’ilay faharoa.'),
  ('6ab25ce05d5e131925aa2cc6', '2026-09-22T10:48:00.508Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:00.508Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 10, 21, 'Ary manana mpisoronabe miandraikitra ny ao an-tranon’Andriamanitra koa isika. Noho izany,', 'ary manana mpisoronabe miandraikitra ny ao an-tranon’andriamanitra koa isika. noho izany,'),
  ('6ab25ce05d5e131925aa2cc2', '2026-09-22T10:48:00.508Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:00.508Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 10, 17, 'Hoy koa ny fanahy masina avy eo: “Ary tsy hotsaroako intsony ny fahotany sy ny fandikan-dalàna nataony.”', 'hoy koa ny fanahy masina avy eo: “ary tsy hotsaroako intsony ny fahotany sy ny fandikan-dalàna nataony.”'),
  ('6ab25ce05d5e131925aa2cc0', '2026-09-22T10:48:00.508Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:00.508Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 10, 15, 'Vavolombelona manamarina an’izany amintsika koa ny fanahy masina, satria niteny izy io aloha hoe:', 'vavolombelona manamarina an’izany amintsika koa ny fanahy masina, satria niteny izy io aloha hoe:'),
  ('6ab25ce05d5e131925aa2cb3', '2026-09-22T10:48:00.508Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:00.508Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 10, 2, 'Raha nahavita an’izany ireny sorona ireny, dia tsy ho nilaina intsony ny nanao sorona. Tsy ho nahatsiaro ny tenany ho mpanota intsony mantsy izay manao fanompoana masina, satria efa nodiovina indray mandeha.', 'raha nahavita an’izany ireny sorona ireny, dia tsy ho nilaina intsony ny nanao sorona. tsy ho nahatsiaro ny tenany ho mpanota intsony mantsy izay manao fanompoana masina, satria efa nodiovina indray mandeha.'),
  ('6ab25ce05d5e131925aa2ccd', '2026-09-22T10:48:00.508Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:00.508Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 10, 28, 'Izay tsy niraharaha ny Lalàn’i Mosesy dia novonoina ho faty tsy nananana antra, noho ny tenin’ny vavolombelona roa na telo.', 'izay tsy niraharaha ny lalàn’i mosesy dia novonoina ho faty tsy nananana antra, noho ny tenin’ny vavolombelona roa na telo.'),
  ('6ab25ce05d5e131925aa2cc4', '2026-09-22T10:48:00.508Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:00.508Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 10, 19, 'Sahintsika àry, ry rahalahy, ny hiditra eo amin’ilay lalana mankao amin’ny toerana masina, noho ny ran’i Jesosy.', 'sahintsika àry, ry rahalahy, ny hiditra eo amin’ilay lalana mankao amin’ny toerana masina, noho ny ran’i jesosy.'),
  ('6ab25ce05d5e131925aa2cb6', '2026-09-22T10:48:00.508Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:00.508Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 10, 5, 'Rehefa tonga teto amin’izao tontolo izao àry i Kristy, dia niteny hoe: “‘Tsy tianao ny sorona sy ny fanatitra, fa nanomana vatana ho ahy ianao.', 'rehefa tonga teto amin’izao tontolo izao àry i kristy, dia niteny hoe: “‘tsy tianao ny sorona sy ny fanatitra, fa nanomana vatana ho ahy ianao.'),
  ('6ab25ce05d5e131925aa2cd7', '2026-09-22T10:48:00.508Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:00.508Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 10, 38, '“Ny olo-marina anefa ho velona satria manam-pinoana”, fa “raha mihemotra izy, dia tsy hankasitrahako.”', '“ny olo-marina anefa ho velona satria manam-pinoana”, fa “raha mihemotra izy, dia tsy hankasitrahako.”'),
  ('6ab25ce05d5e131925aa2cd3', '2026-09-22T10:48:00.508Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:00.508Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 10, 34, 'Fa nangoraka an’izay nigadra ianareo ary mbola faly foana na dia norobaina aza ny fanananareo. Fantatrareo mantsy fa manana lova tsara kokoa sy maharitra ianareo.', 'fa nangoraka an’izay nigadra ianareo ary mbola faly foana na dia norobaina aza ny fanananareo. fantatrareo mantsy fa manana lova tsara kokoa sy maharitra ianareo.'),
  ('6ab25ce05d5e131925aa2cd1', '2026-09-22T10:48:00.508Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:00.508Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 10, 32, 'Tadidio foana anefa ny andro taloha, tamin’ianareo niady mafy sy niaritra fijaliana, rehefa nomena hazavana.', 'tadidio foana anefa ny andro taloha, tamin’ianareo niady mafy sy niaritra fijaliana, rehefa nomena hazavana.'),
  ('6ab25ce05d5e131925aa2cd5', '2026-09-22T10:48:00.508Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:00.508Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 10, 36, 'Fa mila miaritra ianareo mba ho tanteraka aminareo ilay fampanantenana, rehefa vitanareo ny sitrapon’Andriamanitra.', 'fa mila miaritra ianareo mba ho tanteraka aminareo ilay fampanantenana, rehefa vitanareo ny sitrapon’andriamanitra.'),
  ('6ab25ce05d5e131925aa2cd4', '2026-09-22T10:48:00.508Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:00.508Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 10, 35, 'Tokony ho sahy hiteny foana àry ianareo, fa hahazoana valisoa be izany.', 'tokony ho sahy hiteny foana àry ianareo, fa hahazoana valisoa be izany.'),
  ('6ab25ce05d5e131925aa2ccc', '2026-09-22T10:48:00.508Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:00.508Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 10, 27, 'Miandry fanamelohana sisa isika sady matahotra, ary miandry fahatezerana mirehitra toy ny afo, izay handevona ny mpanohitra.', 'miandry fanamelohana sisa isika sady matahotra, ary miandry fahatezerana mirehitra toy ny afo, izay handevona ny mpanohitra.'),
  ('6ab25ce05d5e131925aa2cb8', '2026-09-22T10:48:00.508Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:00.508Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 10, 7, 'Dia hoy aho: ‘Intỳ aho tonga hanao ny sitraponao, Andriamanitra ô!—Voasoratra ao amin’ny horonam-boky ny momba ahy.—’”', 'dia hoy aho: ‘intỳ aho tonga hanao ny sitraponao, andriamanitra ô!—voasoratra ao amin’ny horonam-boky ny momba ahy.—’”'),
  ('6ab25ce05d5e131925aa2cd2', '2026-09-22T10:48:00.508Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:00.508Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 10, 33, 'Indraindray dia noharatsina sy nampahorina teny imasom-bahoaka ianareo, ary indraindray niara-ory tamin’ireo natao hoatr’izany.', 'indraindray dia noharatsina sy nampahorina teny imasom-bahoaka ianareo, ary indraindray niara-ory tamin’ireo natao hoatr’izany.'),
  ('6ab25ce05d5e131925aa2cce', '2026-09-22T10:48:00.508Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:00.508Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 10, 29, 'Araka ny hevitrareo àry, tsy vao mainka ve ho mafy kokoa ny sazy mendrika an’izay manitsaka ny Zanak’Andriamanitra, sy mihevitra fa tsy dia misy dikany ny ran’ilay fifanekena nanamasinana azy, ary manao tsinontsinona ny fanahin’ilay Andriamanitra maneho hatsaram-panahy miavaka?', 'araka ny hevitrareo àry, tsy vao mainka ve ho mafy kokoa ny sazy mendrika an’izay manitsaka ny zanak’andriamanitra, sy mihevitra fa tsy dia misy dikany ny ran’ilay fifanekena nanamasinana azy, ary manao tsinontsinona ny fanahin’ilay andriamanitra maneho hatsaram-panahy miavaka?'),
  ('6ab25ce05d5e131925aa2cc5', '2026-09-22T10:48:00.508Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:00.508Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 10, 20, 'Nosokafany ho antsika izany lalana izany, tamin’izy nandalo teo amin’ilay ridao, izany hoe ny nofony.', 'nosokafany ho antsika izany lalana izany, tamin’izy nandalo teo amin’ilay ridao, izany hoe ny nofony.'),
  ('6ab25ce05d5e131925aa2cc9', '2026-09-22T10:48:00.508Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:00.508Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 10, 24, 'Andao koa isika hifampiahy mba hifandrisika hampiseho fitiavana sy hanao asa tsara,', 'andao koa isika hifampiahy mba hifandrisika hampiseho fitiavana sy hanao asa tsara,'),
  ('6ab25ce05d5e131925aa2cbf', '2026-09-22T10:48:00.508Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:00.508Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 10, 14, 'Fa nataony lavorary mandrakizay izay olona nohamasinina, ka fanatitra anankiray natao sorona no nanaovany an’izany.', 'fa nataony lavorary mandrakizay izay olona nohamasinina, ka fanatitra anankiray natao sorona no nanaovany an’izany.'),
  ('6ab25ce05d5e131925aa2cbe', '2026-09-22T10:48:00.508Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:00.508Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 10, 13, 'Nanomboka tamin’izay, dia niandry izy mandra-panao ny fahavalony ho fitoeran-tongony.', 'nanomboka tamin’izay, dia niandry izy mandra-panao ny fahavalony ho fitoeran-tongony.'),
  ('6ab25ce05d5e131925aa2cbd', '2026-09-22T10:48:00.508Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:00.508Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 10, 12, 'Fa izy kosa nanao sorona anankiray noho ny ota, dia sorona indray mandeha fotsiny. Ary nipetraka teo ankavanan’Andriamanitra izy avy eo.', 'fa izy kosa nanao sorona anankiray noho ny ota, dia sorona indray mandeha fotsiny. ary nipetraka teo ankavanan’andriamanitra izy avy eo.'),
  ('6ab25ce05d5e131925aa2cb5', '2026-09-22T10:48:00.508Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:00.508Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 10, 4, 'satria tsy mahavita manala ny ota ny ran’ombilahy sy ny ran’osilahy.', 'satria tsy mahavita manala ny ota ny ran’ombilahy sy ny ran’osilahy.'),
  ('6ab25ce05d5e131925aa2cbc', '2026-09-22T10:48:00.508Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:00.508Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 10, 11, 'Samy nankeo amin’ny toerany koa ny mpisorona isan’andro, mba hanao fanompoana masina sy hanao sorona mitovy imbetsaka. Tsy mahavita manala tanteraka ny ota mihitsy anefa ireny sorona ireny.', 'samy nankeo amin’ny toerany koa ny mpisorona isan’andro, mba hanao fanompoana masina sy hanao sorona mitovy imbetsaka. tsy mahavita manala tanteraka ny ota mihitsy anefa ireny sorona ireny.'),
  ('6ab25ce05d5e131925aa2cb4', '2026-09-22T10:48:00.508Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:00.508Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 10, 3, 'Ireny sorona ireny kosa aza no mampahatsiahy ny olona isan-taona isan-taona hoe mpanota izy ireo,', 'ireny sorona ireny kosa aza no mampahatsiahy ny olona isan-taona isan-taona hoe mpanota izy ireo,'),
  ('6ab25ce05d5e131925aa2cd8', '2026-09-22T10:48:00.508Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:00.508Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 10, 39, 'Koa tsy anisan’izay mihemotra mba ho ringana isika, fa anisan’izay manam-pinoana mba ho voatsimbina ny aintsika.', 'koa tsy anisan’izay mihemotra mba ho ringana isika, fa anisan’izay manam-pinoana mba ho voatsimbina ny aintsika.'),
  ('6ab25ce05d5e131925aa2cd0', '2026-09-22T10:48:00.508Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:00.508Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 10, 31, 'Mampahatahotra izany ho azon’ny tanan’ilay Andriamanitra velona izany.', 'mampahatahotra izany ho azon’ny tanan’ilay andriamanitra velona izany.'),
  ('6ab25ce05d5e131925aa2cc3', '2026-09-22T10:48:00.508Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:00.508Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 10, 18, 'Ary rehefa voavela ireo fahotana ireo, dia tsy ilaina intsony ny fanatitra noho ny ota.', 'ary rehefa voavela ireo fahotana ireo, dia tsy ilaina intsony ny fanatitra noho ny ota.'),
  ('6ab25ce05d5e131925aa2cb7', '2026-09-22T10:48:00.508Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:00.508Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 10, 6, 'Tsy nankasitrahanao koa ny fanatitra dorana manontolo sy ny fanatitra noho ny ota.’', 'tsy nankasitrahanao koa ny fanatitra dorana manontolo sy ny fanatitra noho ny ota.’'),
  ('6ab25ce05d5e131925aa2ccf', '2026-09-22T10:48:00.508Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:00.508Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 10, 30, 'Fantatsika Ilay niteny hoe: “Ahy ny famaliana, ary izaho no hamaly”, sy hoe: “Hitsara ny vahoakany i Jehovah.”', 'fantatsika ilay niteny hoe: “ahy ny famaliana, ary izaho no hamaly”, sy hoe: “hitsara ny vahoakany i jehovah.”'),
  ('6ab25ce05d5e131925aa2cc8', '2026-09-22T10:48:00.508Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:00.508Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 10, 23, 'Ary andao hambarantsika foana amin’ny olona rehetra ny fanantenantsika, ka tsy hisalasala isika, satria tsy mba mivadika amin’ny teniny ilay nampanantena.', 'ary andao hambarantsika foana amin’ny olona rehetra ny fanantenantsika, ka tsy hisalasala isika, satria tsy mba mivadika amin’ny teniny ilay nampanantena.'),
  ('6ab25ce05d5e131925aa2cca', '2026-09-22T10:48:00.508Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:00.508Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 10, 25, 'ka tsy hahafoy ny fiarahantsika mivory, hoatran’ny sasany efa zatra tsy mivory, fa hifampahery kosa. Vao mainka tokony hanao an’izany isika, satria hitanareo fa mihamanakaiky ilay andro.', 'ka tsy hahafoy ny fiarahantsika mivory, hoatran’ny sasany efa zatra tsy mivory, fa hifampahery kosa. vao mainka tokony hanao an’izany isika, satria hitanareo fa mihamanakaiky ilay andro.'),
  ('6ab25ce05d5e131925aa2cc7', '2026-09-22T10:48:00.508Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:00.508Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 10, 22, 'dia andao isika hanatona an’Andriamanitra amin’ny fo madio sy amim-patokisana tanteraka, satria ny fontsika efa voadio ho afaka amin’ny feon’ny fieritreretana maloto, ary ny vatantsika efa voasasa tamin’ny rano madio.', 'dia andao isika hanatona an’andriamanitra amin’ny fo madio sy amim-patokisana tanteraka, satria ny fontsika efa voadio ho afaka amin’ny feon’ny fieritreretana maloto, ary ny vatantsika efa voasasa tamin’ny rano madio.'),
  ('6ab25ce05d5e131925aa2cc1', '2026-09-22T10:48:00.508Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:00.508Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 10, 16, '“‘Izao no fifanekena hataoko amin’izy ireo, aorian’izany andro izany’, hoy i Jehovah: ‘Hataoko ao am-pony ny lalàko, sady hosoratako ao an-tsainy.’”', '“‘izao no fifanekena hataoko amin’izy ireo, aorian’izany andro izany’, hoy i jehovah: ‘hataoko ao am-pony ny lalàko, sady hosoratako ao an-tsainy.’”'),
  ('6ab25ce05d5e131925aa2cb9', '2026-09-22T10:48:00.508Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:00.508Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 10, 8, 'Ary niteny izy aloha hoe: “Sady tsy tianao no tsy nankasitrahanao ny sorona sy ny fanatitra, sy ny fanatitra dorana manontolo, ary ny fanatitra noho ny ota.”—Natolotra araka ny Lalàna ireny sorona ireny.—', 'ary niteny izy aloha hoe: “sady tsy tianao no tsy nankasitrahanao ny sorona sy ny fanatitra, sy ny fanatitra dorana manontolo, ary ny fanatitra noho ny ota.”—natolotra araka ny lalàna ireny sorona ireny.—'),
  ('6ab25ce05d5e131925aa2cb2', '2026-09-22T10:48:00.508Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:00.508Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 10, 1, 'Aloky ny zavatra tsara ho avy fotsiny ny Lalàna, fa tsy ilay tena izy. Tsy mahatonga an’izay manatona an’Andriamanitra ho lavorary mihitsy àry ny Lalàna, na dia eo aza ny sorona mitovy atolotra foana isan-taona.', 'aloky ny zavatra tsara ho avy fotsiny ny lalàna, fa tsy ilay tena izy. tsy mahatonga an’izay manatona an’andriamanitra ho lavorary mihitsy àry ny lalàna, na dia eo aza ny sorona mitovy atolotra foana isan-taona.'),
  ('6ab25ce05d5e131925aa2cd6', '2026-09-22T10:48:00.508Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:00.508Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 10, 37, 'Fa “efa tena kely sisa” dia “ho tonga ilay ho avy, ary tsy ho ela.”', 'fa “efa tena kely sisa” dia “ho tonga ilay ho avy, ary tsy ho ela.”'),
  ('6ab25ce05d5e131925aa2ccb', '2026-09-22T10:48:00.508Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:00.508Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 10, 26, 'Fa raha manao fanahy iniana manota isika nefa efa mahalala tsara ny fahamarinana, dia tsy misy sorona noho ny ota intsony.', 'fa raha manao fanahy iniana manota isika nefa efa mahalala tsara ny fahamarinana, dia tsy misy sorona noho ny ota intsony.'),
  ('6ab25ce05d5e131925aa2cbb', '2026-09-22T10:48:00.508Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:00.508Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 10, 10, 'Noho izany ‘sitrapony’ izany, dia nohamasinina tamin’ny alalan’i Jesosy Kristy isika, rehefa nanolotra ny vatany indray mandeha fotsiny izy.', 'noho izany ‘sitrapony’ izany, dia nohamasinina tamin’ny alalan’i jesosy kristy isika, rehefa nanolotra ny vatany indray mandeha fotsiny izy.'),
  ('6ab25ce1bb07645cd96ce984', '2026-09-22T10:48:01.772Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:01.772Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 11, 26, 'Nihevitra mantsy izy hoe sarobidy noho ny harenan’i Ejipta ny latsa nozakain’ilay Voahosotra, satria niandry mafy ny hahazo an’ilay valisoa izy.', 'nihevitra mantsy izy hoe sarobidy noho ny harenan’i ejipta ny latsa nozakain’ilay voahosotra, satria niandry mafy ny hahazo an’ilay valisoa izy.'),
  ('6ab25ce1bb07645cd96ce972', '2026-09-22T10:48:01.772Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:01.772Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 11, 8, 'Finoana no nahatonga an’i Abrahama hankatò rehefa nantsoina izy. Nankatò izy ka nankany amin’ny toerana homena azy ho lovany. Ary nandeha izy, na dia tsy fantany aza hoe ho aiza.', 'finoana no nahatonga an’i abrahama hankatò rehefa nantsoina izy. nankatò izy ka nankany amin’ny toerana homena azy ho lovany. ary nandeha izy, na dia tsy fantany aza hoe ho aiza.'),
  ('6ab25ce1bb07645cd96ce96d', '2026-09-22T10:48:01.772Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:01.772Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 11, 3, 'Finoana no ahalalantsika hoe ny tenin’Andriamanitra no nandaminana an’izao tontolo izao, ka avy amin’ny zavatra tsy hita maso no nampisy ny zavatra hita maso.', 'finoana no ahalalantsika hoe ny tenin’andriamanitra no nandaminana an’izao tontolo izao, ka avy amin’ny zavatra tsy hita maso no nampisy ny zavatra hita maso.'),
  ('6ab25ce1bb07645cd96ce985', '2026-09-22T10:48:01.772Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:01.772Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 11, 27, 'Finoana, fa tsy tahotra ny hatezeran’ny mpanjaka, no nahatonga azy hiala tao Ejipta, satria tsy azo nohozongozonina mihitsy izy, toy ny nahita an’Ilay tsy hita.', 'finoana, fa tsy tahotra ny hatezeran’ny mpanjaka, no nahatonga azy hiala tao ejipta, satria tsy azo nohozongozonina mihitsy izy, toy ny nahita an’ilay tsy hita.'),
  ('6ab25ce1bb07645cd96ce97b', '2026-09-22T10:48:01.772Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:01.772Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 11, 17, 'Finoana no nahatonga an’i Abrahama ho hoatran’ny hoe efa nanao sorona an’i Isaka mihitsy, tamin’izy notsapaina.—Vonona hanao sorona ny zanany lahitokana ilay lehilahy izay faly erỳ nahazo ny fampanantenana.—Vonona hanao an’izany izy,', 'finoana no nahatonga an’i abrahama ho hoatran’ny hoe efa nanao sorona an’i isaka mihitsy, tamin’izy notsapaina.—vonona hanao sorona ny zanany lahitokana ilay lehilahy izay faly erỳ nahazo ny fampanantenana.—vonona hanao an’izany izy,'),
  ('6ab25ce1bb07645cd96ce981', '2026-09-22T10:48:01.772Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:01.772Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 11, 23, 'Finoana no nahatonga ny ray aman-drenin’i Mosesy hanafina azy telo volana, taorian’ny nahaterahany. Hitan’izy ireo mantsy fa zaza mahafatifaty izy, ary tsy natahotra ny didin’ny mpanjaka izy ireo.', 'finoana no nahatonga ny ray aman-drenin’i mosesy hanafina azy telo volana, taorian’ny nahaterahany. hitan’izy ireo mantsy fa zaza mahafatifaty izy, ary tsy natahotra ny didin’ny mpanjaka izy ireo.'),
  ('6ab25ce1bb07645cd96ce98d', '2026-09-22T10:48:01.772Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:01.772Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 11, 35, 'Ny vehivavy sasany kosa nandray ny havany natsangana tamin’ny maty. Ny olona hafa indray nampijalijalina satria tsy nanaiky hafahana tamin’ny alalan’ny vidim-panavotana, amin’izay izy ireo hahazo fitsanganana tsara kokoa.', 'ny vehivavy sasany kosa nandray ny havany natsangana tamin’ny maty. ny olona hafa indray nampijalijalina satria tsy nanaiky hafahana tamin’ny alalan’ny vidim-panavotana, amin’izay izy ireo hahazo fitsanganana tsara kokoa.'),
  ('6ab25ce1bb07645cd96ce980', '2026-09-22T10:48:01.772Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:01.772Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 11, 22, 'Finoana no nahatonga an’i Josefa, tamin’izy efa ho faty, hiresaka hoe hafahana ny zanak’Israely, ka nanafatrafatra momba ny taolambalony izy.', 'finoana no nahatonga an’i josefa, tamin’izy efa ho faty, hiresaka hoe hafahana ny zanak’israely, ka nanafatrafatra momba ny taolambalony izy.'),
  ('6ab25ce1bb07645cd96ce97a', '2026-09-22T10:48:01.772Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:01.772Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 11, 16, 'Fa toerana tsara kokoa no iriny ho azo, dia ilay any an-danitra. Tsy mahamenatra an’Andriamanitra àry ny hantsoina hoe Andriamaniny, satria izy efa nanomana tanàna ho azy ireo.', 'fa toerana tsara kokoa no iriny ho azo, dia ilay any an-danitra. tsy mahamenatra an’andriamanitra àry ny hantsoina hoe andriamaniny, satria izy efa nanomana tanàna ho azy ireo.'),
  ('6ab25ce1bb07645cd96ce976', '2026-09-22T10:48:01.772Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:01.772Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 11, 12, 'Noho izany, dia avy tamin’ny lehilahy anankiray, izay toy ny efa maty, no nahaterahan’ny olona be dia be hoatran’ny kintana eny amin’ny lanitra sady tsy voaisa hoatran’ny fasika eny amoron-dranomasina.', 'noho izany, dia avy tamin’ny lehilahy anankiray, izay toy ny efa maty, no nahaterahan’ny olona be dia be hoatran’ny kintana eny amin’ny lanitra sady tsy voaisa hoatran’ny fasika eny amoron-dranomasina.'),
  ('6ab25ce1bb07645cd96ce989', '2026-09-22T10:48:01.772Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:01.772Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 11, 31, 'Finoana no nahatonga an’i Rahaba mpivaro-tena tsy ho faty niaraka tamin’ny olona tsy nankatò, satria noraisiny tsara ireo mpitsikilo.', 'finoana no nahatonga an’i rahaba mpivaro-tena tsy ho faty niaraka tamin’ny olona tsy nankatò, satria noraisiny tsara ireo mpitsikilo.'),
  ('6ab25ce1bb07645cd96ce977', '2026-09-22T10:48:01.772Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:01.772Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 11, 13, 'Nanam-pinoana mandra-pahafatiny izy rehetra ireny, na dia tsy hitany aza ny fahatanterahan’ny fampanantenana. Tazan’izy ireo lavitra kosa izany ka nandrasany mafy, ary nilaza tamin’ny olona izy ireo hoe vahiny sy mpivahiny teo amin’ilay tany.', 'nanam-pinoana mandra-pahafatiny izy rehetra ireny, na dia tsy hitany aza ny fahatanterahan’ny fampanantenana. tazan’izy ireo lavitra kosa izany ka nandrasany mafy, ary nilaza tamin’ny olona izy ireo hoe vahiny sy mpivahiny teo amin’ilay tany.'),
  ('6ab25ce1bb07645cd96ce975', '2026-09-22T10:48:01.772Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:01.772Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 11, 11, 'Finoana koa no nahatonga an’i Saraha ho bevohoka, na dia efa nihoatra ny taona ahafahana miteraka aza izy. Nieritreritra mantsy izy hoe tsy mivadika amin’ny teniny Ilay nampanantena azy.', 'finoana koa no nahatonga an’i saraha ho bevohoka, na dia efa nihoatra ny taona ahafahana miteraka aza izy. nieritreritra mantsy izy hoe tsy mivadika amin’ny teniny ilay nampanantena azy.'),
  ('6ab25ce1bb07645cd96ce98c', '2026-09-22T10:48:01.772Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:01.772Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 11, 34, 'namono afo niredareda, afaka nandositra lelan-tsabatra, nalemy nefa lasa nahery, lasa nahery tany an’ady, ary nampandositra miaramila nanafika.', 'namono afo niredareda, afaka nandositra lelan-tsabatra, nalemy nefa lasa nahery, lasa nahery tany an’ady, ary nampandositra miaramila nanafika.'),
  ('6ab25ce1bb07645cd96ce987', '2026-09-22T10:48:01.772Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:01.772Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 11, 29, 'Finoana no nahavitan’izy ireo niampita ny Ranomasina Mena, hoatran’ny hoe nandeha teo amin’ny tany maina. Natelin’ny rano kosa ny Ejipsianina rehefa nanandrana nandeha teo.', 'finoana no nahavitan’izy ireo niampita ny ranomasina mena, hoatran’ny hoe nandeha teo amin’ny tany maina. natelin’ny rano kosa ny ejipsianina rehefa nanandrana nandeha teo.'),
  ('6ab25ce1bb07645cd96ce971', '2026-09-22T10:48:01.772Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:01.772Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 11, 7, 'Finoana no nahatonga an’i Noa hatahotra an’Andriamanitra sy hanamboatra sambofiara mba hamonjena ny ankohonany. Efa nampitandreman’Andriamanitra momba ny zavatra mbola tsy hitany izy talohan’izay. Finoana koa no nanamelohany an’izao tontolo izao, ka lasa mpandova ny fahamarinana izy satria nanam-pinoana.', 'finoana no nahatonga an’i noa hatahotra an’andriamanitra sy hanamboatra sambofiara mba hamonjena ny ankohonany. efa nampitandreman’andriamanitra momba ny zavatra mbola tsy hitany izy talohan’izay. finoana koa no nanamelohany an’izao tontolo izao, ka lasa mpandova ny fahamarinana izy satria nanam-pinoana.'),
  ('6ab25ce1bb07645cd96ce96e', '2026-09-22T10:48:01.772Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:01.772Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 11, 4, 'Finoana no nahatonga an’i Abela hanao sorona ho an’Andriamanitra, dia sorona nisy vidiny kokoa noho ny an’i Kaina. Noho ny finoany, dia nahazo porofo izy hoe olo-marina satria nankasitraka ny fanomezana nataony Andriamanitra. Ary na efa maty aza izy, dia mbola miteny ihany noho ny finoany.', 'finoana no nahatonga an’i abela hanao sorona ho an’andriamanitra, dia sorona nisy vidiny kokoa noho ny an’i kaina. noho ny finoany, dia nahazo porofo izy hoe olo-marina satria nankasitraka ny fanomezana nataony andriamanitra. ary na efa maty aza izy, dia mbola miteny ihany noho ny finoany.'),
  ('6ab25ce1bb07645cd96ce96b', '2026-09-22T10:48:01.772Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:01.772Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 11, 1, 'Ny finoana dia fatokisana tanteraka hoe hitranga ny zavatra antenaina, sady porofo manamarina ny zavatra tena misy nefa tsy hita maso.', 'ny finoana dia fatokisana tanteraka hoe hitranga ny zavatra antenaina, sady porofo manamarina ny zavatra tena misy nefa tsy hita maso.'),
  ('6ab25ce1bb07645cd96ce96f', '2026-09-22T10:48:01.772Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:01.772Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 11, 5, 'Finoana no nahatonga an’i Enoka hafindra toerana mba tsy hahita fahafatesana, ary tsy hita na taiza na taiza izy satria nafindran’Andriamanitra. Fa talohan’ny namindrana azy, dia nahazo porofo izy hoe nankasitrahan’Andriamanitra.', 'finoana no nahatonga an’i enoka hafindra toerana mba tsy hahita fahafatesana, ary tsy hita na taiza na taiza izy satria nafindran’andriamanitra. fa talohan’ny namindrana azy, dia nahazo porofo izy hoe nankasitrahan’andriamanitra.'),
  ('6ab25ce1bb07645cd96ce97c', '2026-09-22T10:48:01.772Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:01.772Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 11, 18, 'na dia efa nilazana aza hoe: “Ho avy amin’i Isaka ilay hantsoina hoe taranakao.”', 'na dia efa nilazana aza hoe: “ho avy amin’i isaka ilay hantsoina hoe taranakao.”'),
  ('6ab25ce1bb07645cd96ce978', '2026-09-22T10:48:01.772Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:01.772Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 11, 14, 'Fa izay milaza an’izany dia manaporofo fa miezaka mafy mitady toerana honenany izy.', 'fa izay milaza an’izany dia manaporofo fa miezaka mafy mitady toerana honenany izy.'),
  ('6ab25ce1bb07645cd96ce970', '2026-09-22T10:48:01.772Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:01.772Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 11, 6, 'Ary izay tsy manam-pinoana dia tsy afaka mampifaly an’Andriamanitra. Fa izay manatona azy dia tsy maintsy mino hoe misy izy sady mpamaly soa an’izay mitady mafy azy.', 'ary izay tsy manam-pinoana dia tsy afaka mampifaly an’andriamanitra. fa izay manatona azy dia tsy maintsy mino hoe misy izy sady mpamaly soa an’izay mitady mafy azy.'),
  ('6ab25ce1bb07645cd96ce98b', '2026-09-22T10:48:01.772Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:01.772Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 11, 33, 'Nanam-pinoana izy ireo ka nandresy fanjakana, nampanjaka ny fahamarinana, nahazo fampanantenana, nanakombona ny vavan’ny liona,', 'nanam-pinoana izy ireo ka nandresy fanjakana, nampanjaka ny fahamarinana, nahazo fampanantenana, nanakombona ny vavan’ny liona,'),
  ('6ab25ce1bb07645cd96ce98a', '2026-09-22T10:48:01.772Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:01.772Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 11, 32, 'Inona koa no holazaiko? Fa tsy ho ampy ny fotoana raha hotantaraiko daholo ny momba an’i Gideona, Baraka, Samsona, Jefta, Davida, Samoela, ary ny mpaminany hafa.', 'inona koa no holazaiko? fa tsy ho ampy ny fotoana raha hotantaraiko daholo ny momba an’i gideona, baraka, samsona, jefta, davida, samoela, ary ny mpaminany hafa.'),
  ('6ab25ce1bb07645cd96ce988', '2026-09-22T10:48:01.772Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:01.772Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 11, 30, 'Finoana no nampianjera ny mandan’i Jeriko rehefa avy nohodidinina nandritra ny fito andro.', 'finoana no nampianjera ny mandan’i jeriko rehefa avy nohodidinina nandritra ny fito andro.'),
  ('6ab25ce1bb07645cd96ce983', '2026-09-22T10:48:01.772Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:01.772Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 11, 25, 'Naleony nampijalina niaraka tamin’ny vahoakan’Andriamanitra, toy izay hifaly vetivety tamin’ny fahotana.', 'naleony nampijalina niaraka tamin’ny vahoakan’andriamanitra, toy izay hifaly vetivety tamin’ny fahotana.'),
  ('6ab25ce1bb07645cd96ce97e', '2026-09-22T10:48:01.772Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:01.772Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 11, 20, 'Finoana koa no nahatonga an’i Isaka hitso-drano an’i Jakoba sy Esao momba ny zavatra mbola ho avy.', 'finoana koa no nahatonga an’i isaka hitso-drano an’i jakoba sy esao momba ny zavatra mbola ho avy.'),
  ('6ab25ce1bb07645cd96ce98e', '2026-09-22T10:48:01.772Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:01.772Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 11, 36, 'Ny hafa kosa notsapaina ka nesoina sy nokaravasina, ary tsy izany ihany fa nofatorana rojo vy sy nogadraina koa.', 'ny hafa kosa notsapaina ka nesoina sy nokaravasina, ary tsy izany ihany fa nofatorana rojo vy sy nogadraina koa.'),
  ('6ab25ce1bb07645cd96ce97f', '2026-09-22T10:48:01.772Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:01.772Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 11, 21, 'Finoana no nahatonga an’i Jakoba hitso-drano azy roa lahy zanak’i Josefa, tamin’i Jakoba efa ho faty, ary niankohoka izy sady niankina tamin’ny tendron’ny tehiny.', 'finoana no nahatonga an’i jakoba hitso-drano azy roa lahy zanak’i josefa, tamin’i jakoba efa ho faty, ary niankohoka izy sady niankina tamin’ny tendron’ny tehiny.'),
  ('6ab25ce1bb07645cd96ce97d', '2026-09-22T10:48:01.772Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:01.772Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 11, 19, 'Fantany mantsy fa vitan’Andriamanitra na dia ny manangana an’i Isaka amin’ny maty aza. Ary naverina taminy indray io zanany io na dia toy ny hoe efa maty aza, ka lasa misy heviny an’ohatra izany.', 'fantany mantsy fa vitan’andriamanitra na dia ny manangana an’i isaka amin’ny maty aza. ary naverina taminy indray io zanany io na dia toy ny hoe efa maty aza, ka lasa misy heviny an’ohatra izany.'),
  ('6ab25ce1bb07645cd96ce973', '2026-09-22T10:48:01.772Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:01.772Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 11, 9, 'Finoana no nahatonga azy hivahiny tany amin’ilay tany nampanantenaina, ka hoatran’ny hoe tany an-tanin’olona izy. Nipetraka an-tranolay izy, niaraka tamin’i Isaka sy Jakoba, mpiara-mandova aminy an’ilay fampanantenana.', 'finoana no nahatonga azy hivahiny tany amin’ilay tany nampanantenaina, ka hoatran’ny hoe tany an-tanin’olona izy. nipetraka an-tranolay izy, niaraka tamin’i isaka sy jakoba, mpiara-mandova aminy an’ilay fampanantenana.'),
  ('6ab25ce1bb07645cd96ce98f', '2026-09-22T10:48:01.772Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:01.772Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 11, 37, 'Notoraham-bato izy ireo, notsapaina, notsofana hizara roa, novonoina tamin’ny sabatra, nirenireny nitafy hoditr’ondry sy hoditr’osy, sady tsy nanana na inona na inona sy niaritra fahoriana ary nampijalina.', 'notoraham-bato izy ireo, notsapaina, notsofana hizara roa, novonoina tamin’ny sabatra, nirenireny nitafy hoditr’ondry sy hoditr’osy, sady tsy nanana na inona na inona sy niaritra fahoriana ary nampijalina.'),
  ('6ab25ce1bb07645cd96ce986', '2026-09-22T10:48:01.772Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:01.772Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 11, 28, 'Finoana no nahatonga azy hankalaza ny Paska sy hanosotra ra teo amin’ny tolàm-baravarana, mba tsy hamely ny lahimatoa teo amin’ny Israelita ny mpandringana.', 'finoana no nahatonga azy hankalaza ny paska sy hanosotra ra teo amin’ny tolàm-baravarana, mba tsy hamely ny lahimatoa teo amin’ny israelita ny mpandringana.'),
  ('6ab25ce1bb07645cd96ce982', '2026-09-22T10:48:01.772Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:01.772Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 11, 24, 'Finoana no nahatonga an’i Mosesy tsy hanaiky hatao hoe zanaky ny zanakavavin’i Farao, rehefa nihalehibe izy.', 'finoana no nahatonga an’i mosesy tsy hanaiky hatao hoe zanaky ny zanakavavin’i farao, rehefa nihalehibe izy.'),
  ('6ab25ce1bb07645cd96ce974', '2026-09-22T10:48:01.772Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:01.772Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 11, 10, 'Niandry foana an’ilay tanàna manana fototra tena izy mantsy izy, ary Andriamanitra no mpamorona sy mpanangana an’ilay izy.', 'niandry foana an’ilay tanàna manana fototra tena izy mantsy izy, ary andriamanitra no mpamorona sy mpanangana an’ilay izy.'),
  ('6ab25ce1bb07645cd96ce990', '2026-09-22T10:48:01.772Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:01.772Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 11, 38, 'Ary tsy mendrika azy ireo izao tontolo izao. Nirenireny tany an-tany efitra izy ireo, teny an-tendrombohitra, tany anaty lava-bato, ary tany anaty lavaka any ambanin’ny tany.', 'ary tsy mendrika azy ireo izao tontolo izao. nirenireny tany an-tany efitra izy ireo, teny an-tendrombohitra, tany anaty lava-bato, ary tany anaty lavaka any ambanin’ny tany.'),
  ('6ab25ce1bb07645cd96ce979', '2026-09-22T10:48:01.772Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:01.772Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 11, 15, 'Raha nieritreritra foana ny toerana nialany anefa izy ireo, dia ho nahita hirika hiverenana.', 'raha nieritreritra foana ny toerana nialany anefa izy ireo, dia ho nahita hirika hiverenana.'),
  ('6ab25ce1bb07645cd96ce96c', '2026-09-22T10:48:01.772Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:01.772Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 11, 2, 'Fa noho ny finoana dia nasehon’Andriamanitra hoe nankasitrahany ny olona fahiny.', 'fa noho ny finoana dia nasehon’andriamanitra hoe nankasitrahany ny olona fahiny.'),
  ('6ab25ce1bb07645cd96ce992', '2026-09-22T10:48:01.773Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:01.773Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 11, 40, 'Andriamanitra mantsy efa nieritreritra ny hanome antsika zavatra tsara kokoa, mba tsy hatao lavorary izy ireo raha tsy eo isika.', 'andriamanitra mantsy efa nieritreritra ny hanome antsika zavatra tsara kokoa, mba tsy hatao lavorary izy ireo raha tsy eo isika.'),
  ('6ab25ce1bb07645cd96ce991', '2026-09-22T10:48:01.773Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:01.773Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 11, 39, 'Tsy nahita ny fahatanterahan’ilay fampanantenana anefa izy rehetra ireo, na dia nahazo porofo aza hoe nankasitrahana satria nanam-pinoana.', 'tsy nahita ny fahatanterahan’ilay fampanantenana anefa izy rehetra ireo, na dia nahazo porofo aza hoe nankasitrahana satria nanam-pinoana.'),
  ('6ab25ce2f17288fb4c6bcb4d', '2026-09-22T10:48:02.318Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:02.318Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 12, 1, 'Koa satria misy an’ireo vavolombelona be dia be toy ny rahona ireo manodidina antsika, dia andao koa isika hanala an’izay rehetra manavesatra antsika sy ny ota mora manakantsakana antsika, ary andao isika hanohy an’ilay hazakazaka asaina ataontsika ka haharitra amin’izany.', 'koa satria misy an’ireo vavolombelona be dia be toy ny rahona ireo manodidina antsika, dia andao koa isika hanala an’izay rehetra manavesatra antsika sy ny ota mora manakantsakana antsika, ary andao isika hanohy an’ilay hazakazaka asaina ataontsika ka haharitra amin’izany.'),
  ('6ab25ce2f17288fb4c6bcb4e', '2026-09-22T10:48:02.318Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:02.318Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 12, 2, 'Sady mihazakazaka isika no mibanjina tsara an’ilay Mpitarika Lehibe Indrindra sady Mpandavorary ny finoantsika, dia i Jesosy. Fa niaritra hazo fijaliana izy noho ilay fifaliana natao teo alohany, ka tsy nampaninona azy ny ho afa-baraka, ary nipetraka teo ankavanan’ny seza fiandrianan’Andriamanitra izy.', 'sady mihazakazaka isika no mibanjina tsara an’ilay mpitarika lehibe indrindra sady mpandavorary ny finoantsika, dia i jesosy. fa niaritra hazo fijaliana izy noho ilay fifaliana natao teo alohany, ka tsy nampaninona azy ny ho afa-baraka, ary nipetraka teo ankavanan’ny seza fiandrianan’andriamanitra izy.'),
  ('6ab25ce2f17288fb4c6bcb4f', '2026-09-22T10:48:02.318Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:02.318Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 12, 3, 'Diniho tsara àry ilay niaritra ny teny feno fankahalana nolazain’ny mpanota izay nanimba ny tenany. Amin’izay ianareo dia tsy ho reraka na ho kivy.', 'diniho tsara àry ilay niaritra ny teny feno fankahalana nolazain’ny mpanota izay nanimba ny tenany. amin’izay ianareo dia tsy ho reraka na ho kivy.'),
  ('6ab25ce2f17288fb4c6bcb50', '2026-09-22T10:48:02.318Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:02.318Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 12, 4, 'Miady mafy amin’izany ota izany ianareo, nefa mbola tsy tonga hatramin’ny fandatsahana ny ranareo.', 'miady mafy amin’izany ota izany ianareo, nefa mbola tsy tonga hatramin’ny fandatsahana ny ranareo.'),
  ('6ab25ce2f17288fb4c6bcb51', '2026-09-22T10:48:02.318Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:02.318Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 12, 5, 'Ary efa hadinonareo tanteraka ilay fiangaviana anareo hoatran’ny ataon’ny ray amin’ny zanany, hoe: “Aza atao tsinontsinona, anaka, ny famaizan’i Jehovah, ary aza kivy raha anariny ianao.', 'ary efa hadinonareo tanteraka ilay fiangaviana anareo hoatran’ny ataon’ny ray amin’ny zanany, hoe: “aza atao tsinontsinona, anaka, ny famaizan’i jehovah, ary aza kivy raha anariny ianao.'),
  ('6ab25ce2f17288fb4c6bcb52', '2026-09-22T10:48:02.318Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:02.318Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 12, 6, 'Fa izay tian’i Jehovah no faiziny. Saziny izay raisiny hoatran’ny zanaka.”', 'fa izay tian’i jehovah no faiziny. saziny izay raisiny hoatran’ny zanaka.”'),
  ('6ab25ce2f17288fb4c6bcb53', '2026-09-22T10:48:02.318Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:02.318Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 12, 7, 'Mila miaritra ianareo, fa anisan’ny famaizana anareo izany. Mitondra anareo hoatran’ny zanaka mantsy Andriamanitra. Fa iza moa no zanaka tsy faizin-drainy?', 'mila miaritra ianareo, fa anisan’ny famaizana anareo izany. mitondra anareo hoatran’ny zanaka mantsy andriamanitra. fa iza moa no zanaka tsy faizin-drainy?'),
  ('6ab25ce2f17288fb4c6bcb54', '2026-09-22T10:48:02.318Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:02.318Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 12, 8, 'Raha tsy faizina hoatr’izany ianareo rehetra, dia tena zazasary fa tsy zanaka.', 'raha tsy faizina hoatr’izany ianareo rehetra, dia tena zazasary fa tsy zanaka.');
INSERT INTO "bible_verses" ("id", "created_date", "updated_date", "created_by_id", "created_by", "translation", "book", "bookOrder", "chapter", "verse", "text", "normalizedText") VALUES
  ('6ab25ce2f17288fb4c6bcb55', '2026-09-22T10:48:02.318Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:02.318Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 12, 9, 'Ankoatra izany, dia nanafay antsika ny ray olombelona niteraka antsika, ary nohajaintsika. Tsy vao mainka àry ve isika tokony hanaiky an’ilay Ray mitarika ny fiainantsika amin’ny alalan’ny fanahy masina, dia amin’izay isika ho velona?', 'ankoatra izany, dia nanafay antsika ny ray olombelona niteraka antsika, ary nohajaintsika. tsy vao mainka àry ve isika tokony hanaiky an’ilay ray mitarika ny fiainantsika amin’ny alalan’ny fanahy masina, dia amin’izay isika ho velona?'),
  ('6ab25ce2f17288fb4c6bcb56', '2026-09-22T10:48:02.318Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:02.318Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 12, 10, 'Nanafay antsika vetivety ihany izy ireny, araka izay hitany fa mety, fa Izy kosa manao an’izany mba hahasoa antsika, dia amin’izay isika ho masina hoatr’azy koa.', 'nanafay antsika vetivety ihany izy ireny, araka izay hitany fa mety, fa izy kosa manao an’izany mba hahasoa antsika, dia amin’izay isika ho masina hoatr’azy koa.'),
  ('6ab25ce2f17288fb4c6bcb57', '2026-09-22T10:48:02.318Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:02.318Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 12, 11, 'Marina fa hoatran’ny hoe tsy mahafaly eo no ho eo ny famaizana, fa mampahory. Avy eo anefa dia misy vokany tsara izany famaizana izany, dia fiadanana sy fahamarinana ho an’izay nampiofanina tamin’ny alalan’izany.', 'marina fa hoatran’ny hoe tsy mahafaly eo no ho eo ny famaizana, fa mampahory. avy eo anefa dia misy vokany tsara izany famaizana izany, dia fiadanana sy fahamarinana ho an’izay nampiofanina tamin’ny alalan’izany.'),
  ('6ab25ce2f17288fb4c6bcb58', '2026-09-22T10:48:02.318Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:02.318Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 12, 12, 'Hatanjaho àry izay miraviravy tanana sy malemy lohalika.', 'hatanjaho àry izay miraviravy tanana sy malemy lohalika.'),
  ('6ab25ce2f17288fb4c6bcb59', '2026-09-22T10:48:02.318Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:02.318Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 12, 13, 'Ataovy mahitsy foana koa ny lalana halehan’ny tongotrareo, mba tsy hifandiso ny tonon-taolan’izay malemy tongotra, fa mba ho sitrana.', 'ataovy mahitsy foana koa ny lalana halehan’ny tongotrareo, mba tsy hifandiso ny tonon-taolan’izay malemy tongotra, fa mba ho sitrana.'),
  ('6ab25ce2f17288fb4c6bcb5a', '2026-09-22T10:48:02.318Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:02.318Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 12, 14, 'Ataovy izay hihavananareo amin’ny olona rehetra, ary miezaha ho masina foana. Tsy hahita ny Tompo mantsy izay tsy masina.', 'ataovy izay hihavananareo amin’ny olona rehetra, ary miezaha ho masina foana. tsy hahita ny tompo mantsy izay tsy masina.'),
  ('6ab25ce2f17288fb4c6bcb5b', '2026-09-22T10:48:02.318Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:02.318Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 12, 15, 'Mitandrema tsara ianareo rehetra, sao dia tsy hanehoan’Andriamanitra ny hatsaram-panahiny miavaka. Amin’izay koa tsy hisy faka feno poizina hipoitra eo aminareo ka hampisy olana sady hanapoizina olona be dia be.', 'mitandrema tsara ianareo rehetra, sao dia tsy hanehoan’andriamanitra ny hatsaram-panahiny miavaka. amin’izay koa tsy hisy faka feno poizina hipoitra eo aminareo ka hampisy olana sady hanapoizina olona be dia be.'),
  ('6ab25ce2f17288fb4c6bcb5c', '2026-09-22T10:48:02.318Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:02.318Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 12, 16, 'Tandremo koa sao hisy mpijangajanga aminareo, na olona tsy manaja zava-masina tahaka an’i Esao, izay nahafoy ny zon’ny lahimatoa ho takalon’ny sakafo indray mihinana.', 'tandremo koa sao hisy mpijangajanga aminareo, na olona tsy manaja zava-masina tahaka an’i esao, izay nahafoy ny zon’ny lahimatoa ho takalon’ny sakafo indray mihinana.'),
  ('6ab25ce2f17288fb4c6bcb5d', '2026-09-22T10:48:02.318Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:02.318Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 12, 17, 'Fantatrareo fa nolavina izy tatỳ aoriana, rehefa te hahazo an’ilay tsodrano. Fa na dia niezaka mafy nampiova hevitra ny rainy aza izy sady nitomany, dia tsy nisy vokany izany.', 'fantatrareo fa nolavina izy tatỳ aoriana, rehefa te hahazo an’ilay tsodrano. fa na dia niezaka mafy nampiova hevitra ny rainy aza izy sady nitomany, dia tsy nisy vokany izany.'),
  ('6ab25ce2f17288fb4c6bcb5e', '2026-09-22T10:48:02.318Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:02.318Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 12, 18, 'Ianareo mantsy tsy nanatona tendrombohitra azo tsapain-tanana sady nirehitra, na rahona mainty, na haizina mikitroka, na tafio-drivotra mahery,', 'ianareo mantsy tsy nanatona tendrombohitra azo tsapain-tanana sady nirehitra, na rahona mainty, na haizina mikitroka, na tafio-drivotra mahery,'),
  ('6ab25ce2f17288fb4c6bcb5f', '2026-09-22T10:48:02.318Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:02.318Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 12, 19, 'na feon’ny trompetra notsofina mafy be, na feo niteny tamin’ny vahoaka. Rehefa naheno an’izany feo izany ny vahoaka, dia nitalaho mba tsy hisy zavatra holazaina aminy intsony.', 'na feon’ny trompetra notsofina mafy be, na feo niteny tamin’ny vahoaka. rehefa naheno an’izany feo izany ny vahoaka, dia nitalaho mba tsy hisy zavatra holazaina aminy intsony.'),
  ('6ab25ce2f17288fb4c6bcb60', '2026-09-22T10:48:02.318Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:02.318Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 12, 20, 'Fa tsy zakan’izy ireo ilay didy hoe: “Na biby aza no mikasika an’ilay tendrombohitra, dia tsy maintsy hotoraham-bato.”', 'fa tsy zakan’izy ireo ilay didy hoe: “na biby aza no mikasika an’ilay tendrombohitra, dia tsy maintsy hotoraham-bato.”'),
  ('6ab25ce2f17288fb4c6bcb61', '2026-09-22T10:48:02.318Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:02.318Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 12, 21, 'Nampahatahotra loatra koa ilay zava-niseho tamin’izany, ka hoy i Mosesy: “Matahotra sy mangovitra aho!”', 'nampahatahotra loatra koa ilay zava-niseho tamin’izany, ka hoy i mosesy: “matahotra sy mangovitra aho!”'),
  ('6ab25ce2f17288fb4c6bcb62', '2026-09-22T10:48:02.318Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:02.318Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 12, 22, 'Fa ny hatoninareo kosa dia Tendrombohitra Ziona sy tanànan’ilay Andriamanitra velona, izany hoe i Jerosalema any an-danitra; sy anjely an’alinaliny', 'fa ny hatoninareo kosa dia tendrombohitra ziona sy tanànan’ilay andriamanitra velona, izany hoe i jerosalema any an-danitra; sy anjely an’alinaliny'),
  ('6ab25ce2f17288fb4c6bcb63', '2026-09-22T10:48:02.318Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:02.318Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 12, 23, 'miara-mivory; sy ny fiangonan’ny lahimatoa voasoratra any an-danitra; sy Andriamanitra, ilay Mpitsara ny olona rehetra; sy ny olo-marina manaraka ny fitarihan’ny fanahy masina ka efa natao lavorary;', 'miara-mivory; sy ny fiangonan’ny lahimatoa voasoratra any an-danitra; sy andriamanitra, ilay mpitsara ny olona rehetra; sy ny olo-marina manaraka ny fitarihan’ny fanahy masina ka efa natao lavorary;'),
  ('6ab25ce2f17288fb4c6bcb64', '2026-09-22T10:48:02.318Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:02.318Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 12, 24, 'sy Jesosy, ilay mpanelanelana amin’ny fifanekena vaovao; ary ny ra nafafy izay miteny tsara kokoa noho ny ran’i Abela.', 'sy jesosy, ilay mpanelanelana amin’ny fifanekena vaovao; ary ny ra nafafy izay miteny tsara kokoa noho ny ran’i abela.'),
  ('6ab25ce2f17288fb4c6bcb65', '2026-09-22T10:48:02.318Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:02.318Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 12, 25, 'Mitandrema ianareo sao tsy mety mihaino an’ilay miteny. Izay tsy nety nihaino an’ilay nilaza ny fampitandreman’Andriamanitra teto an-tany aza tsy afaka nandositra, koa mainka fa isika raha tsy mankatò an’ilay miteny avy any an-danitra isika!', 'mitandrema ianareo sao tsy mety mihaino an’ilay miteny. izay tsy nety nihaino an’ilay nilaza ny fampitandreman’andriamanitra teto an-tany aza tsy afaka nandositra, koa mainka fa isika raha tsy mankatò an’ilay miteny avy any an-danitra isika!'),
  ('6ab25ce2f17288fb4c6bcb66', '2026-09-22T10:48:02.318Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:02.318Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 12, 26, 'Nanozongozona ny tany ny feony tamin’izay, fa amin’izao kosa izy nampanantena hoe: “Mbola hohozongozoniko indray ny tany, nefa tsy ny tany ihany fa ny lanitra koa.”', 'nanozongozona ny tany ny feony tamin’izay, fa amin’izao kosa izy nampanantena hoe: “mbola hohozongozoniko indray ny tany, nefa tsy ny tany ihany fa ny lanitra koa.”'),
  ('6ab25ce2f17288fb4c6bcb67', '2026-09-22T10:48:02.318Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:02.318Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 12, 27, 'Ilay teny hoe “indray” dia midika fa hesorina izay zavatra hozongozonina, izany hoe ny zavatra natao, amin’izay mba ho eo foana ny zavatra tsy hozongozonina.', 'ilay teny hoe “indray” dia midika fa hesorina izay zavatra hozongozonina, izany hoe ny zavatra natao, amin’izay mba ho eo foana ny zavatra tsy hozongozonina.'),
  ('6ab25ce2f17288fb4c6bcb68', '2026-09-22T10:48:02.318Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:02.318Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 12, 28, 'Hahazo Fanjakana tsy azo hozongozonina isika, ka andao àry isika hiezaka hatrany mba hanehoana hatsaram-panahy miavaka foana. Izany hatsaram-panahy miavaka izany mantsy no ahafahantsika manao fanompoana masina azony ekena, sady matahotra sy manaja azy ihany isika amin’izany.', 'hahazo fanjakana tsy azo hozongozonina isika, ka andao àry isika hiezaka hatrany mba hanehoana hatsaram-panahy miavaka foana. izany hatsaram-panahy miavaka izany mantsy no ahafahantsika manao fanompoana masina azony ekena, sady matahotra sy manaja azy ihany isika amin’izany.'),
  ('6ab25ce2f17288fb4c6bcb69', '2026-09-22T10:48:02.318Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:02.318Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 12, 29, 'Fa afo mandevona ilay Andriamanitsika.', 'fa afo mandevona ilay andriamanitsika.'),
  ('6ab25ce2a02ce45c48a6499e', '2026-09-22T10:48:02.769Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:02.769Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 13, 16, 'Ankoatra izany, dia aza hadinoina ny manao soa sy ny mizara amin’ny hafa, fa tena mahafaly an’Andriamanitra ny sorona toy izany.', 'ankoatra izany, dia aza hadinoina ny manao soa sy ny mizara amin’ny hafa, fa tena mahafaly an’andriamanitra ny sorona toy izany.'),
  ('6ab25ce2a02ce45c48a64995', '2026-09-22T10:48:02.769Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:02.769Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 13, 7, 'Tsarovy ireo mitarika eo aminareo, dia ireo nilaza ny tenin’Andriamanitra taminareo. Ary rehefa mandinika ny soa entin’ny fitondran-tenany ianareo, dia tahafo ny finoany.', 'tsarovy ireo mitarika eo aminareo, dia ireo nilaza ny tenin’andriamanitra taminareo. ary rehefa mandinika ny soa entin’ny fitondran-tenany ianareo, dia tahafo ny finoany.'),
  ('6ab25ce2a02ce45c48a6499a', '2026-09-22T10:48:02.769Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:02.769Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 13, 12, 'Noho izany, dia nijaly tany ivelan’ny vavahadin’ny tanàna koa i Jesosy, mba hohamasininy amin’ny alalan’ny rany ny vahoaka.', 'noho izany, dia nijaly tany ivelan’ny vavahadin’ny tanàna koa i jesosy, mba hohamasininy amin’ny alalan’ny rany ny vahoaka.'),
  ('6ab25ce2a02ce45c48a64990', '2026-09-22T10:48:02.769Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:02.769Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 13, 2, 'Aza hadinoina ny mandray vahiny, fa izany no nahatonga ny sasany hampiantrano anjely nefa tsy fantany akory.', 'aza hadinoina ny mandray vahiny, fa izany no nahatonga ny sasany hampiantrano anjely nefa tsy fantany akory.'),
  ('6ab25ce2a02ce45c48a649a5', '2026-09-22T10:48:02.769Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:02.769Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 13, 23, 'Tiako ho fantatrareo fa efa nafahana i Timoty rahalahintsika. Ary raha vetivety izy dia tonga atỳ, dia hiaraka ho any aminareo izahay.', 'tiako ho fantatrareo fa efa nafahana i timoty rahalahintsika. ary raha vetivety izy dia tonga atỳ, dia hiaraka ho any aminareo izahay.'),
  ('6ab25ce2a02ce45c48a649a3', '2026-09-22T10:48:02.769Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:02.769Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 13, 21, 'hanome anareo ny zavatra tsara rehetra mba hanaovanareo ny sitrapony! I Jesosy Kristy no ampiasainy mba hahatonga antsika hanao an’izay mahafinaritra azy. Ho an’Andriamanitra anie ny voninahitra mandrakizay mandrakizay! Amena.', 'hanome anareo ny zavatra tsara rehetra mba hanaovanareo ny sitrapony! i jesosy kristy no ampiasainy mba hahatonga antsika hanao an’izay mahafinaritra azy. ho an’andriamanitra anie ny voninahitra mandrakizay mandrakizay! amena.'),
  ('6ab25ce2a02ce45c48a649a4', '2026-09-22T10:48:02.769Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:02.769Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 13, 22, 'Ary mampirisika anareo aho, ry rahalahy, mba haharitra hihaino an’izany teny mampahery izany. Fohy ihany mantsy ity taratasy nosoratako ho anareo ity.', 'ary mampirisika anareo aho, ry rahalahy, mba haharitra hihaino an’izany teny mampahery izany. fohy ihany mantsy ity taratasy nosoratako ho anareo ity.'),
  ('6ab25ce2a02ce45c48a649a2', '2026-09-22T10:48:02.769Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:02.769Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 13, 20, 'Nafahan’ilay Andriamanitry ny fiadanana avy tany amin’ny maty ilay mpiandry ondry lehibe, dia i Jesosy Tompontsika, izay nitondra ny ran’ny fifanekena mandrakizay. Enga anie ilay Andriamanitry ny fiadanana', 'nafahan’ilay andriamanitry ny fiadanana avy tany amin’ny maty ilay mpiandry ondry lehibe, dia i jesosy tompontsika, izay nitondra ny ran’ny fifanekena mandrakizay. enga anie ilay andriamanitry ny fiadanana'),
  ('6ab25ce2a02ce45c48a64996', '2026-09-22T10:48:02.769Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:02.769Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 13, 8, 'Tsy miova i Jesosy Kristy omaly sy anio ary mandrakizay.', 'tsy miova i jesosy kristy omaly sy anio ary mandrakizay.'),
  ('6ab25ce2a02ce45c48a6498f', '2026-09-22T10:48:02.769Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:02.769Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 13, 1, 'Mifankatiava foana hoatran’ny mpirahalahy.', 'mifankatiava foana hoatran’ny mpirahalahy.'),
  ('6ab25ce2a02ce45c48a64992', '2026-09-22T10:48:02.769Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:02.769Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 13, 4, 'Aoka ho mendri-kaja amin’ny olona rehetra ny fanambadiana, ary aza avela ho voaloto ny fandrianan’ny mpivady, fa homelohin’Andriamanitra ny mpijangajanga sy ny mpanitsakitsa-bady.', 'aoka ho mendri-kaja amin’ny olona rehetra ny fanambadiana, ary aza avela ho voaloto ny fandrianan’ny mpivady, fa homelohin’andriamanitra ny mpijangajanga sy ny mpanitsakitsa-bady.'),
  ('6ab25ce2a02ce45c48a64998', '2026-09-22T10:48:02.769Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:02.769Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 13, 10, 'Manana alitara isika, ary tsy manana fahefana hihinana eo izay manao fanompoana masina ao amin’ny tranolay.', 'manana alitara isika, ary tsy manana fahefana hihinana eo izay manao fanompoana masina ao amin’ny tranolay.'),
  ('6ab25ce2a02ce45c48a64997', '2026-09-22T10:48:02.769Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:02.769Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 13, 9, 'Aza manaiky ho voatariky ny fampianarana maro samihafa sy ny fampianarana hafahafa. Fa aleo ny hatsaram-panahy miavaka asehon’Andriamanitra no hanatanjaka ny fonareo, fa tsy ny lalàna momba ny sakafo. Tsy mandray soa akory mantsy izay mihevitra hoe ny sakafo no tena zava-dehibe.', 'aza manaiky ho voatariky ny fampianarana maro samihafa sy ny fampianarana hafahafa. fa aleo ny hatsaram-panahy miavaka asehon’andriamanitra no hanatanjaka ny fonareo, fa tsy ny lalàna momba ny sakafo. tsy mandray soa akory mantsy izay mihevitra hoe ny sakafo no tena zava-dehibe.'),
  ('6ab25ce2a02ce45c48a649a1', '2026-09-22T10:48:02.769Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:02.769Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 13, 19, 'Fa ny tena ampirisihako anareo dia hoe mivavaha mba ho tafaverina haingana kokoa any aminareo aho.', 'fa ny tena ampirisihako anareo dia hoe mivavaha mba ho tafaverina haingana kokoa any aminareo aho.'),
  ('6ab25ce2a02ce45c48a6499f', '2026-09-22T10:48:02.769Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:02.769Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 13, 17, 'Ankatoavy sy ekeo ireo mitarika eo aminareo. Miahy anareo foana mantsy izy ireny, toy ny olona mbola hatao ampamoaka. Amin’izay dia ho faly izy ireny rehefa manao an’izany fa tsy hisento, satria tsy hahasoa anareo izany.', 'ankatoavy sy ekeo ireo mitarika eo aminareo. miahy anareo foana mantsy izy ireny, toy ny olona mbola hatao ampamoaka. amin’izay dia ho faly izy ireny rehefa manao an’izany fa tsy hisento, satria tsy hahasoa anareo izany.'),
  ('6ab25ce2a02ce45c48a64994', '2026-09-22T10:48:02.769Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:02.769Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 13, 6, 'Dia ho be herim-po isika amin’izay, ka hilaza hoe: “I Jehovah no mpanampy ahy, ka tsy hatahotra aho. Inona moa no azon’ny olona atao amiko?”', 'dia ho be herim-po isika amin’izay, ka hilaza hoe: “i jehovah no mpanampy ahy, ka tsy hatahotra aho. inona moa no azon’ny olona atao amiko?”'),
  ('6ab25ce2a02ce45c48a64991', '2026-09-22T10:48:02.769Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:02.769Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 13, 3, 'Tsarovy izay migadra, toy ny hoe miara-migadra aminy ianareo. Tsarovy koa izay ampijalina, satria ianareo koa mba olombelona ihany.', 'tsarovy izay migadra, toy ny hoe miara-migadra aminy ianareo. tsarovy koa izay ampijalina, satria ianareo koa mba olombelona ihany.'),
  ('6ab25ce2a02ce45c48a649a7', '2026-09-22T10:48:02.769Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:02.769Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 13, 25, 'Enga anie ianareo rehetra mba hanehoana hatsaram-panahy miavaka!', 'enga anie ianareo rehetra mba hanehoana hatsaram-panahy miavaka!'),
  ('6ab25ce2a02ce45c48a649a6', '2026-09-22T10:48:02.769Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:02.769Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 13, 24, 'Mampamangy any amin’izay rehetra mitarika eo aminareo, sy any amin’ny olona masina rehetra. Mampamangy, hono, ianareo, hoy ry zareo atỳ Italia.', 'mampamangy any amin’izay rehetra mitarika eo aminareo, sy any amin’ny olona masina rehetra. mampamangy, hono, ianareo, hoy ry zareo atỳ italia.'),
  ('6ab25ce2a02ce45c48a649a0', '2026-09-22T10:48:02.769Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:02.769Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 13, 18, 'Mivavaha foana ho anay. Matoky mantsy izahay hoe madio ny eritreritray, satria te hanao ny marina amin’ny zava-drehetra izahay.', 'mivavaha foana ho anay. matoky mantsy izahay hoe madio ny eritreritray, satria te hanao ny marina amin’ny zava-drehetra izahay.'),
  ('6ab25ce2a02ce45c48a6499d', '2026-09-22T10:48:02.769Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:02.769Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 13, 15, 'Koa manaova foana sorona fiderana ho an’Andriamanitra amin’ny alalan’i Jesosy, izany hoe vokatry ny molotra, ka resaho amin’ny hafa ny momba ny anarany.', 'koa manaova foana sorona fiderana ho an’andriamanitra amin’ny alalan’i jesosy, izany hoe vokatry ny molotra, ka resaho amin’ny hafa ny momba ny anarany.'),
  ('6ab25ce2a02ce45c48a6499c', '2026-09-22T10:48:02.769Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:02.769Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 13, 14, 'Fa tsy manana tanàna maharitra eto isika, fa ilay ho avy no tena tadiavintsika.', 'fa tsy manana tanàna maharitra eto isika, fa ilay ho avy no tena tadiavintsika.'),
  ('6ab25ce2a02ce45c48a64999', '2026-09-22T10:48:02.769Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:02.769Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 13, 11, 'Fa rehefa avy nentin’ny mpisoronabe tao amin’ny toerana masina ny ran’ny biby mba hatao fanatitra noho ny ota, dia dorana any ivelan’ny toby ny fatiny.', 'fa rehefa avy nentin’ny mpisoronabe tao amin’ny toerana masina ny ran’ny biby mba hatao fanatitra noho ny ota, dia dorana any ivelan’ny toby ny fatiny.'),
  ('6ab25ce2a02ce45c48a64993', '2026-09-22T10:48:02.769Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:02.769Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 13, 5, 'Asehoy amin’ny fomba fiainanareo hoe tsy tia vola ianareo, ary miezaha hianina amin’izay efa eo. Fa hoy izy: “Tsy handao anao mihitsy aho, ary tsy hahafoy anao mihitsy.”', 'asehoy amin’ny fomba fiainanareo hoe tsy tia vola ianareo, ary miezaha hianina amin’izay efa eo. fa hoy izy: “tsy handao anao mihitsy aho, ary tsy hahafoy anao mihitsy.”'),
  ('6ab25ce2a02ce45c48a6499b', '2026-09-22T10:48:02.769Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:02.769Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Hebreo', 58, 13, 13, 'Andao àry isika ho any aminy any ivelan’ny toby, ka hitondra ny latsa nentiny.', 'andao àry isika ho any aminy any ivelan’ny toby, ka hitondra ny latsa nentiny.'),
  ('6ab25ce333ad3a264f6f18d3', '2026-09-22T10:48:03.496Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:03.496Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jakoba', 59, 1, 4, 'Avelao hamita ny asany anefa ny fiaretana, amin’izay ianareo ho lasa lavorary sy tsy hisy tsiny amin’ny lafiny rehetra, ka tsy hisy tsy ampy ao aminareo.', 'avelao hamita ny asany anefa ny fiaretana, amin’izay ianareo ho lasa lavorary sy tsy hisy tsiny amin’ny lafiny rehetra, ka tsy hisy tsy ampy ao aminareo.'),
  ('6ab25ce333ad3a264f6f18d2', '2026-09-22T10:48:03.496Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:03.496Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jakoba', 59, 1, 3, 'Fantatrareo mantsy fa lasa mahay miaritra ianareo rehefa vita sedra ny finoanareo.', 'fantatrareo mantsy fa lasa mahay miaritra ianareo rehefa vita sedra ny finoanareo.'),
  ('6ab25ce333ad3a264f6f18d5', '2026-09-22T10:48:03.496Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:03.496Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jakoba', 59, 1, 6, 'Aoka anefa izy hangataka amim-pinoana foana, ary tsy hisalasala mihitsy, fa izay misalasala dia hoatran’ny onjan-dranomasina entin’ny rivotra ka atopatopany.', 'aoka anefa izy hangataka amim-pinoana foana, ary tsy hisalasala mihitsy, fa izay misalasala dia hoatran’ny onjan-dranomasina entin’ny rivotra ka atopatopany.'),
  ('6ab25ce333ad3a264f6f18d8', '2026-09-22T10:48:03.496Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:03.496Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jakoba', 59, 1, 9, 'Aoka hifaly izay rahalahy mahantra satria misandratra,', 'aoka hifaly izay rahalahy mahantra satria misandratra,'),
  ('6ab25ce333ad3a264f6f18da', '2026-09-22T10:48:03.496Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:03.496Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jakoba', 59, 1, 11, 'Fa rehefa miposaka ny masoandro ka tena mandoro ny hafanany, dia malazo ny zavamaniry ka mihintsana ny voniny ary levona ny hatsaran-tarehiny. Halazo hoatr’izany koa izay mpanankarena variana mikatsaka harena.', 'fa rehefa miposaka ny masoandro ka tena mandoro ny hafanany, dia malazo ny zavamaniry ka mihintsana ny voniny ary levona ny hatsaran-tarehiny. halazo hoatr’izany koa izay mpanankarena variana mikatsaka harena.'),
  ('6ab25ce333ad3a264f6f18d4', '2026-09-22T10:48:03.496Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:03.496Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jakoba', 59, 1, 5, 'Koa raha misy aminareo tsy ampy fahendrena, dia aoka izy hangataka an’izany foana amin’Andriamanitra, satria malala-tanana amin’ny olona rehetra Andriamanitra sady tsy manome tsiny. Dia homena azy izany.', 'koa raha misy aminareo tsy ampy fahendrena, dia aoka izy hangataka an’izany foana amin’andriamanitra, satria malala-tanana amin’ny olona rehetra andriamanitra sady tsy manome tsiny. dia homena azy izany.'),
  ('6ab25ce333ad3a264f6f18d1', '2026-09-22T10:48:03.496Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:03.496Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jakoba', 59, 1, 2, 'Rehefa sendra fitsapana isan-karazany ianareo, ry rahalahiko, dia raiso ho fifaliana be izany.', 'rehefa sendra fitsapana isan-karazany ianareo, ry rahalahiko, dia raiso ho fifaliana be izany.'),
  ('6ab25ce333ad3a264f6f18d0', '2026-09-22T10:48:03.496Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:03.496Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jakoba', 59, 1, 1, 'Avy amin’i Jakoba, mpanompon’Andriamanitra sy mpanompon’i Jesosy Kristy Tompo. Ho an’ny foko 12 any am-pielezana, Miarahaba anareo!', 'avy amin’i jakoba, mpanompon’andriamanitra sy mpanompon’i jesosy kristy tompo. ho an’ny foko 12 any am-pielezana, miarahaba anareo!'),
  ('6ab25ce333ad3a264f6f18d9', '2026-09-22T10:48:03.496Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:03.496Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jakoba', 59, 1, 10, 'ary izay mpanankarena satria mietry. Ho levona hoatran’ny voninkazo eny an-tsaha mantsy ny mpanankarena.', 'ary izay mpanankarena satria mietry. ho levona hoatran’ny voninkazo eny an-tsaha mantsy ny mpanankarena.'),
  ('6ab25ce333ad3a264f6f18d7', '2026-09-22T10:48:03.496Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:03.496Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jakoba', 59, 1, 8, 'fa olona misalasala izy, ary miovaova amin’izay rehetra ataony.', 'fa olona misalasala izy, ary miovaova amin’izay rehetra ataony.'),
  ('6ab25ce333ad3a264f6f18d6', '2026-09-22T10:48:03.496Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:03.496Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jakoba', 59, 1, 7, 'Tsy tokony hanantena hahazo na inona na inona avy amin’i Jehovah ny olona hoatr’izany,', 'tsy tokony hanantena hahazo na inona na inona avy amin’i jehovah ny olona hoatr’izany,'),
  ('6ab25ce333ad3a264f6f18db', '2026-09-22T10:48:03.496Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:03.497Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jakoba', 59, 1, 12, 'Sambatra izay olona miaritra foana rehefa misy fitsapana, satria rehefa ankasitrahana izy, dia hahazo ny satroboninahitry ny fiainana, izay nampanantenain’i Jehovah an’izay tia Azy foana.', 'sambatra izay olona miaritra foana rehefa misy fitsapana, satria rehefa ankasitrahana izy, dia hahazo ny satroboninahitry ny fiainana, izay nampanantenain’i jehovah an’izay tia azy foana.'),
  ('6ab25ce333ad3a264f6f18e4', '2026-09-22T10:48:03.497Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:03.497Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jakoba', 59, 1, 21, 'Koa esory daholo ny fahalotoana rehetra sy izay faharatsiana sisa tavela ao aminareo. Dia ekeo amim-pahalemem-panahy ny teny ambolen’Andriamanitra ao am-ponareo, satria afaka mamonjy anareo izy io.', 'koa esory daholo ny fahalotoana rehetra sy izay faharatsiana sisa tavela ao aminareo. dia ekeo amim-pahalemem-panahy ny teny ambolen’andriamanitra ao am-ponareo, satria afaka mamonjy anareo izy io.'),
  ('6ab25ce333ad3a264f6f18e1', '2026-09-22T10:48:03.497Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:03.497Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jakoba', 59, 1, 18, 'Efa sitrapony ny niteraka antsika tamin’ny alalan’ny tenin’ny fahamarinana. Amin’izay isika dia ho anisan’ny voaloham-bokatra amin’ny zavaboariny.', 'efa sitrapony ny niteraka antsika tamin’ny alalan’ny tenin’ny fahamarinana. amin’izay isika dia ho anisan’ny voaloham-bokatra amin’ny zavaboariny.'),
  ('6ab25ce333ad3a264f6f18e5', '2026-09-22T10:48:03.497Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:03.497Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jakoba', 59, 1, 22, 'Tokony ho mpankatò ny teny ianareo, fa tsy ho mpihaino fotsiny, ka hamita-tena amin’ny hevi-diso.', 'tokony ho mpankatò ny teny ianareo, fa tsy ho mpihaino fotsiny, ka hamita-tena amin’ny hevi-diso.'),
  ('6ab25ce333ad3a264f6f18e0', '2026-09-22T10:48:03.497Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:03.497Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jakoba', 59, 1, 17, 'Avy any ambony ny fanomezana tsara rehetra sy ny fanomezana tonga lafatra rehetra, izany hoe midina avy any amin’ilay Rain’ny fahazavana eny amin’ny lanitra. Tsy miovaova hoatran’ny aloka mifindrafindra izy.', 'avy any ambony ny fanomezana tsara rehetra sy ny fanomezana tonga lafatra rehetra, izany hoe midina avy any amin’ilay rain’ny fahazavana eny amin’ny lanitra. tsy miovaova hoatran’ny aloka mifindrafindra izy.'),
  ('6ab25ce333ad3a264f6f18df', '2026-09-22T10:48:03.497Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:03.497Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jakoba', 59, 1, 16, 'Aza manaiky ho voafitaka ianareo, ry rahalahy malala.', 'aza manaiky ho voafitaka ianareo, ry rahalahy malala.'),
  ('6ab25ce333ad3a264f6f18e6', '2026-09-22T10:48:03.497Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:03.497Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jakoba', 59, 1, 23, 'Fa raha misy mpihaino ny teny fa tsy mpankatò, dia hoatran’ny olona mijery ny tarehiny eo amin’ny fitaratra izy.', 'fa raha misy mpihaino ny teny fa tsy mpankatò, dia hoatran’ny olona mijery ny tarehiny eo amin’ny fitaratra izy.'),
