  ('6ab25ce333ad3a264f6f18dd', '2026-09-22T10:48:03.497Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:03.497Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jakoba', 59, 1, 14, 'Tsapaina anefa ny tsirairay rehefa voasariky ny faniriany sy manaiky ho resin’izany.', 'tsapaina anefa ny tsirairay rehefa voasariky ny faniriany sy manaiky ho resin’izany.'),
  ('6ab25ce333ad3a264f6f18ea', '2026-09-22T10:48:03.497Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:03.497Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jakoba', 59, 1, 27, 'Izao no fivavahana madio sady tsy misy loto eo imason’ilay Andriamanitra Raintsika: Ny mikarakara ny kamboty sy ny vehivavy mpitondratena ao anatin’ny fahoriany, ary ny miaro tena foana tsy ho voapentimpentin’izao tontolo izao.', 'izao no fivavahana madio sady tsy misy loto eo imason’ilay andriamanitra raintsika: ny mikarakara ny kamboty sy ny vehivavy mpitondratena ao anatin’ny fahoriany, ary ny miaro tena foana tsy ho voapentimpentin’izao tontolo izao.'),
  ('6ab25ce333ad3a264f6f18e7', '2026-09-22T10:48:03.497Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:03.497Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jakoba', 59, 1, 24, 'Mijery ny endriny izy dia lasa, ary tonga dia hadinony hoe hoatran’ny ahoana izy.', 'mijery ny endriny izy dia lasa, ary tonga dia hadinony hoe hoatran’ny ahoana izy.'),
  ('6ab25ce333ad3a264f6f18dc', '2026-09-22T10:48:03.497Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:03.497Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jakoba', 59, 1, 13, 'Raha misy olona miatrika zava-tsarotra, dia tsy tokony hiteny izy hoe: “Fitsapana avy amin’Andriamanitra izao.” Sady tsy azo tsapaina amin’ny zava-dratsy mantsy Andriamanitra, no tsy mitsapa na iza na iza amin’ny zava-dratsy koa.', 'raha misy olona miatrika zava-tsarotra, dia tsy tokony hiteny izy hoe: “fitsapana avy amin’andriamanitra izao.” sady tsy azo tsapaina amin’ny zava-dratsy mantsy andriamanitra, no tsy mitsapa na iza na iza amin’ny zava-dratsy koa.'),
  ('6ab25ce333ad3a264f6f18e9', '2026-09-22T10:48:03.497Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:03.497Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jakoba', 59, 1, 26, 'Raha misy olona mieritreritra hoe mpivavaka amin’Andriamanitra nefa tsy mahafehy ny vavany, dia mamitaka ny fony izy, ary tsy misy dikany ny fivavahany.', 'raha misy olona mieritreritra hoe mpivavaka amin’andriamanitra nefa tsy mahafehy ny vavany, dia mamitaka ny fony izy, ary tsy misy dikany ny fivavahany.'),
  ('6ab25ce333ad3a264f6f18e8', '2026-09-22T10:48:03.497Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:03.497Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jakoba', 59, 1, 25, 'Fa izay mandinika tsara an’ilay lalàna tonga lafatra izay manafaka ny olona, ka manaraka an’izany foana, dia lasa mpankatò ny teny fa tsy mpihaino manadino. Ho sambatra izy rehefa mankatò.', 'fa izay mandinika tsara an’ilay lalàna tonga lafatra izay manafaka ny olona, ka manaraka an’izany foana, dia lasa mpankatò ny teny fa tsy mpihaino manadino. ho sambatra izy rehefa mankatò.'),
  ('6ab25ce333ad3a264f6f18e2', '2026-09-22T10:48:03.497Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:03.497Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jakoba', 59, 1, 19, 'Fantaro izao, ry rahalahy malala: Aoka ny olona rehetra ho vonona hihaino, sady tsy ho maimaika hiteny, ary tsy ho mora tezitra,', 'fantaro izao, ry rahalahy malala: aoka ny olona rehetra ho vonona hihaino, sady tsy ho maimaika hiteny, ary tsy ho mora tezitra,'),
