  ('6ab25ce4947cc7e38592e373', '2026-09-22T10:48:04.015Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:04.015Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jakoba', 59, 2, 5, 'Henoy izao, ry rahalahy malala: Tsy izay heverin’izao tontolo izao hoe mahantra ve no nofidin’Andriamanitra hanan-karena amin’ny finoana, sy ho mpandova an’ilay Fanjakana nampanantenainy an’izay tia azy?', 'henoy izao, ry rahalahy malala: tsy izay heverin’izao tontolo izao hoe mahantra ve no nofidin’andriamanitra hanan-karena amin’ny finoana, sy ho mpandova an’ilay fanjakana nampanantenainy an’izay tia azy?'),
  ('6ab25ce4947cc7e38592e372', '2026-09-22T10:48:04.015Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:04.015Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jakoba', 59, 2, 4, 'Raha izany, tsy efa manavakavaka ve ianareo sady lasa mpitsara miangatra?', 'raha izany, tsy efa manavakavaka ve ianareo sady lasa mpitsara miangatra?'),
