  ('6ab25ce4947cc7e38592e381', '2026-09-22T10:48:04.015Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:04.015Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jakoba', 59, 2, 19, 'Mino ve ianao fa misy Andriamanitra tokana? Tena tsara izany. Ny demonia koa anefa mba mino ka mangovitra.', 'mino ve ianao fa misy andriamanitra tokana? tena tsara izany. ny demonia koa anefa mba mino ka mangovitra.'),
  ('6ab25ce5e4756e7c395e3597', '2026-09-22T10:48:05.016Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:05.016Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jakoba', 59, 3, 3, 'Raha asiantsika lamboridy ny vavan’ny soavaly mba hahatonga azy hanaiky antsika, dia ny vatany manontolo koa no ho azontsika baikoina.', 'raha asiantsika lamboridy ny vavan’ny soavaly mba hahatonga azy hanaiky antsika, dia ny vatany manontolo koa no ho azontsika baikoina.'),
  ('6ab25ce5e4756e7c395e3596', '2026-09-22T10:48:05.016Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:05.016Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jakoba', 59, 3, 2, 'Fa manao fahadisoana imbetsaka isika rehetra. Raha misy tsy manao fahadisoana amin’izay lazainy, dia izy no olona lavorary, sady mahafehy ny tenany manontolo.', 'fa manao fahadisoana imbetsaka isika rehetra. raha misy tsy manao fahadisoana amin’izay lazainy, dia izy no olona lavorary, sady mahafehy ny tenany manontolo.'),
  ('6ab25ce5e4756e7c395e3598', '2026-09-22T10:48:05.016Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:05.016Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jakoba', 59, 3, 4, 'Jereo koa ange ny sambo e! Na ngezabe aza ireny sady atosiky ny rivotra mahery, dia familiana kely fotsiny no itondran’ny mpanamory azy ho any amin’izay tiany.', 'jereo koa ange ny sambo e! na ngezabe aza ireny sady atosiky ny rivotra mahery, dia familiana kely fotsiny no itondran’ny mpanamory azy ho any amin’izay tiany.'),
  ('6ab25ce5e4756e7c395e3595', '2026-09-22T10:48:05.016Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:05.016Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jakoba', 59, 3, 1, 'Ry rahalahiko, tsy tokony ho be dia be ianareo no ho lasa mpampianatra. Fantatrareo mantsy fa ho mafy kokoa ny hitsarana antsika mpampianatra.', 'ry rahalahiko, tsy tokony ho be dia be ianareo no ho lasa mpampianatra. fantatrareo mantsy fa ho mafy kokoa ny hitsarana antsika mpampianatra.'),
  ('6ab25ce5e4756e7c395e359a', '2026-09-22T10:48:05.017Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:05.017Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jakoba', 59, 3, 6, 'Afo koa ny lela. Amin’ny taova rehetra amin’ny vatantsika, dia ny lela no fototry ny faharatsiana rehetra. Mandoto ny vatana manontolo mantsy ny lela, nefa koa mandrehitra ny fiainana manontolo sady arehitry ny Gehena.', 'afo koa ny lela. amin’ny taova rehetra amin’ny vatantsika, dia ny lela no fototry ny faharatsiana rehetra. mandoto ny vatana manontolo mantsy ny lela, nefa koa mandrehitra ny fiainana manontolo sady arehitry ny gehena.'),
  ('6ab25ce5e4756e7c395e35a6', '2026-09-22T10:48:05.017Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:05.017Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jakoba', 59, 3, 18, 'Ankoatra izany, dia afafy ao anatin’ny fihavanana ny voan’ny fahamarinana mba hahasoa an’izay mpampihavana.', 'ankoatra izany, dia afafy ao anatin’ny fihavanana ny voan’ny fahamarinana mba hahasoa an’izay mpampihavana.'),
  ('6ab25ce5e4756e7c395e35a0', '2026-09-22T10:48:05.017Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:05.017Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jakoba', 59, 3, 12, 'Ry rahalahiko, aviavy ve dia hamoa oliva, ary voaloboka ve dia hamoa aviavy? Ny loharano masira koa tsy mety hamoaka rano mamy.', 'ry rahalahiko, aviavy ve dia hamoa oliva, ary voaloboka ve dia hamoa aviavy? ny loharano masira koa tsy mety hamoaka rano mamy.'),
  ('6ab25ce5e4756e7c395e359f', '2026-09-22T10:48:05.017Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:05.017Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jakoba', 59, 3, 11, 'Loharano iray ihany ve dia hampiboiboika rano mamy sy rano mangidy avy eo amin’ny vavany iray ihany?', 'loharano iray ihany ve dia hampiboiboika rano mamy sy rano mangidy avy eo amin’ny vavany iray ihany?'),
  ('6ab25ce5e4756e7c395e359c', '2026-09-22T10:48:05.017Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:05.017Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jakoba', 59, 3, 8, 'Tsy misy olombelona mahafolaka ny lela anefa. Tsy voafehy izy io sady manimba, ary feno poizina mahafaty.', 'tsy misy olombelona mahafolaka ny lela anefa. tsy voafehy izy io sady manimba, ary feno poizina mahafaty.'),
  ('6ab25ce5e4756e7c395e35a3', '2026-09-22T10:48:05.017Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:05.017Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jakoba', 59, 3, 15, 'Tsy mba fahendrena avy any ambony izany, fa fahendrena avy eto an-tany, sady araka ny nofo sy araka ny demonia.', 'tsy mba fahendrena avy any ambony izany, fa fahendrena avy eto an-tany, sady araka ny nofo sy araka ny demonia.'),
  ('6ab25ce5e4756e7c395e35a5', '2026-09-22T10:48:05.017Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:05.017Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jakoba', 59, 3, 17, 'Ny fahendrena avy any ambony kosa madio aloha, dia avy eo tia fihavanana, mahay mandanjalanja, vonona hankatò, be famindram-po sy manao ny tsara, tsy manavakavaka, ary tsy mihatsaravelatsihy.', 'ny fahendrena avy any ambony kosa madio aloha, dia avy eo tia fihavanana, mahay mandanjalanja, vonona hankatò, be famindram-po sy manao ny tsara, tsy manavakavaka, ary tsy mihatsaravelatsihy.'),
  ('6ab25ce5e4756e7c395e35a4', '2026-09-22T10:48:05.017Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:05.017Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jakoba', 59, 3, 16, 'Fa rehefa misy olona mialona sy tia ady, dia hisy korontana sy zava-dratsy isan-karazany koa.', 'fa rehefa misy olona mialona sy tia ady, dia hisy korontana sy zava-dratsy isan-karazany koa.'),
  ('6ab25ce5e4756e7c395e359e', '2026-09-22T10:48:05.017Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:05.017Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jakoba', 59, 3, 10, 'Vava iray ihany no iderana sy anozonana. Tsy mety raha izany no mitranga, ry rahalahiko.', 'vava iray ihany no iderana sy anozonana. tsy mety raha izany no mitranga, ry rahalahiko.'),
  ('6ab25ce5e4756e7c395e3599', '2026-09-22T10:48:05.017Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:05.017Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jakoba', 59, 3, 5, 'Hoatr’izany koa ny lela: Kely io taova io ao amin’ny vatana, nefa mirehareha be. Jereo ange ny afo e! Kely fotsiny dia efa mandoro ala be.', 'hoatr’izany koa ny lela: kely io taova io ao amin’ny vatana, nefa mirehareha be. jereo ange ny afo e! kely fotsiny dia efa mandoro ala be.'),
  ('6ab25ce5e4756e7c395e35a1', '2026-09-22T10:48:05.017Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:05.017Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jakoba', 59, 3, 13, 'Iza aminareo no hendry sy mahira-tsaina? Aoka izy ho tsara fitondran-tena, ka ho hita amin’ny ataony hoe malemy fanahy izy satria manam-pahendrena.', 'iza aminareo no hendry sy mahira-tsaina? aoka izy ho tsara fitondran-tena, ka ho hita amin’ny ataony hoe malemy fanahy izy satria manam-pahendrena.'),
  ('6ab25ce5e4756e7c395e35a2', '2026-09-22T10:48:05.017Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:05.017Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jakoba', 59, 3, 14, 'Raha be fialonana sy tia ady anefa ianareo ao am-ponareo, dia aza mirehareha na milaza zavatra mifanohitra amin’ny fahamarinana.', 'raha be fialonana sy tia ady anefa ianareo ao am-ponareo, dia aza mirehareha na milaza zavatra mifanohitra amin’ny fahamarinana.'),
  ('6ab25ce5e4756e7c395e359d', '2026-09-22T10:48:05.017Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:05.017Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jakoba', 59, 3, 9, 'Izy io no iderantsika an’i Jehovah Raintsika. Izy io koa anefa no anozonantsika ny olona, izay noforonina mba “hisy hitovizana amin’Andriamanitra.”', 'izy io no iderantsika an’i jehovah raintsika. izy io koa anefa no anozonantsika ny olona, izay noforonina mba “hisy hitovizana amin’andriamanitra.”'),
  ('6ab25ce5e4756e7c395e359b', '2026-09-22T10:48:05.017Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:05.017Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jakoba', 59, 3, 7, 'Azo folahina daholo ny karazana bibidia sy vorona sy biby mandady ary biby any an-dranomasina rehetra, ary efa voafolaky ny olombelona ireny.', 'azo folahina daholo ny karazana bibidia sy vorona sy biby mandady ary biby any an-dranomasina rehetra, ary efa voafolaky ny olombelona ireny.'),
  ('6ab25ce6fc569b100ad5c5f1', '2026-09-22T10:48:06.877Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:06.877Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jakoba', 59, 5, 17, 'Olona nanana fihetseham-po hoatran’ny antsika ihany i Elia. Nivavaka mafy anefa izy mba tsy hilatsaka ny orana, dia tsy nisy orana teo amin’ilay tany, nandritra ny telo taona sy tapany.', 'olona nanana fihetseham-po hoatran’ny antsika ihany i elia. nivavaka mafy anefa izy mba tsy hilatsaka ny orana, dia tsy nisy orana teo amin’ilay tany, nandritra ny telo taona sy tapany.'),
  ('6ab25ce6fc569b100ad5c5ee', '2026-09-22T10:48:06.877Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:06.877Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jakoba', 59, 5, 14, 'Misy marary ve aminareo? Aoka izy hiantso ny anti-panahin’ny fiangonana. Dia aoka ry zareo hivavaka ho azy sy hanosotra menaka azy amin’ny anaran’i Jehovah.', 'misy marary ve aminareo? aoka izy hiantso ny anti-panahin’ny fiangonana. dia aoka ry zareo hivavaka ho azy sy hanosotra menaka azy amin’ny anaran’i jehovah.'),
  ('6ab25ce6fc569b100ad5c5e7', '2026-09-22T10:48:06.877Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:06.877Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jakoba', 59, 5, 7, 'Manàna faharetana àry, ry rahalahy, mandra-pahatongan’ny fanatrehan’ny Tompo. Jereo ange ny mpamboly e! Maharitra miandry ny vokatra sarobidy avy amin’ny tany izy, mandra-pahatongan’ny orana voalohandohany sy ny orana faramparany.', 'manàna faharetana àry, ry rahalahy, mandra-pahatongan’ny fanatrehan’ny tompo. jereo ange ny mpamboly e! maharitra miandry ny vokatra sarobidy avy amin’ny tany izy, mandra-pahatongan’ny orana voalohandohany sy ny orana faramparany.'),
  ('6ab25ce6fc569b100ad5c5e1', '2026-09-22T10:48:06.877Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:06.877Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jakoba', 59, 5, 1, 'Ry mpanankarena, mitomania dia midradradradrà noho ny fahoriana efa hanjo anareo.', 'ry mpanankarena, mitomania dia midradradradrà noho ny fahoriana efa hanjo anareo.'),
  ('6ab25ce6fc569b100ad5c5f3', '2026-09-22T10:48:06.877Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:06.877Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jakoba', 59, 5, 19, 'Ry rahalahiko, raha misy aminareo voafitaka ka miala amin’ny fahamarinana, ary misy olon-kafa mampiverina azy,', 'ry rahalahiko, raha misy aminareo voafitaka ka miala amin’ny fahamarinana, ary misy olon-kafa mampiverina azy,'),
  ('6ab25ce6fc569b100ad5c5f2', '2026-09-22T10:48:06.877Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:06.877Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jakoba', 59, 5, 18, 'Nivavaka indray izy avy eo, dia nilatsaka ny orana, ka nahavokatra ilay tany.', 'nivavaka indray izy avy eo, dia nilatsaka ny orana, ka nahavokatra ilay tany.'),
  ('6ab25ce6fc569b100ad5c5e8', '2026-09-22T10:48:06.877Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:06.877Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jakoba', 59, 5, 8, 'Manàna faharetana koa ianareo, ary hatanjaho ny fonareo, satria efa akaiky ny fanatrehan’ny Tompo.', 'manàna faharetana koa ianareo, ary hatanjaho ny fonareo, satria efa akaiky ny fanatrehan’ny tompo.'),
  ('6ab25ce6fc569b100ad5c5e5', '2026-09-22T10:48:06.877Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:06.877Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jakoba', 59, 5, 5, 'Tena miadana ianareo, ary manaram-po manao izay tianareo eto an-tany. Ny fonareo dia hoatran’ny biby hatavezina mandra-pahatongan’ny andro hamonoana azy.', 'tena miadana ianareo, ary manaram-po manao izay tianareo eto an-tany. ny fonareo dia hoatran’ny biby hatavezina mandra-pahatongan’ny andro hamonoana azy.'),
  ('6ab25ce6fc569b100ad5c5e3', '2026-09-22T10:48:06.877Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:06.877Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jakoba', 59, 5, 3, 'Harafesenina tanteraka ny volamenanareo sy ny volafotsinareo, ary hiampanga anareo sy hihinana ny nofonareo ny harafesina aminy. Izay nangoninareo dia ho lasa hoatran’ny afo amin’ny andro farany.', 'harafesenina tanteraka ny volamenanareo sy ny volafotsinareo, ary hiampanga anareo sy hihinana ny nofonareo ny harafesina aminy. izay nangoninareo dia ho lasa hoatran’ny afo amin’ny andro farany.'),
  ('6ab25ce6fc569b100ad5c5f4', '2026-09-22T10:48:06.877Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:06.877Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jakoba', 59, 5, 20, 'dia fantaro fa izay mampiverina mpanota hiala amin’ny fahadisoany, dia hamonjy azy tsy ho faty sady hanarona fahotana be dia be.', 'dia fantaro fa izay mampiverina mpanota hiala amin’ny fahadisoany, dia hamonjy azy tsy ho faty sady hanarona fahotana be dia be.'),
  ('6ab25ce6fc569b100ad5c5eb', '2026-09-22T10:48:06.877Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:06.877Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jakoba', 59, 5, 11, 'Ekentsika hoe sambatra izay efa niaritra. Efa henonareo fa niaritra i Joba, ary efa fantatrareo fa nitahy azy i Jehovah. Hitanareo àry fa tena be fitiavana i Jehovah sady mamindra fo.', 'ekentsika hoe sambatra izay efa niaritra. efa henonareo fa niaritra i joba, ary efa fantatrareo fa nitahy azy i jehovah. hitanareo àry fa tena be fitiavana i jehovah sady mamindra fo.'),
  ('6ab25ce6fc569b100ad5c5ed', '2026-09-22T10:48:06.877Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:06.877Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jakoba', 59, 5, 13, 'Misy miaritra ny mafy ve aminareo? Aoka izy hivavaka foana. Misy falifaly ve? Aoka izy hihira fiderana.', 'misy miaritra ny mafy ve aminareo? aoka izy hivavaka foana. misy falifaly ve? aoka izy hihira fiderana.'),
  ('6ab25ce6fc569b100ad5c5e2', '2026-09-22T10:48:06.877Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:06.877Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jakoba', 59, 5, 2, 'Efa lo ny harenanareo, ary efa lanin’ny bibikely ny akanjonareo.', 'efa lo ny harenanareo, ary efa lanin’ny bibikely ny akanjonareo.'),
  ('6ab25ce6fc569b100ad5c5ea', '2026-09-22T10:48:06.877Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:06.877Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jakoba', 59, 5, 10, 'Ry rahalahy, ataovy modely ny mpaminany niteny tamin’ny anaran’i Jehovah, satria niaritra fampijaliana sy nanam-paharetana izy ireo.', 'ry rahalahy, ataovy modely ny mpaminany niteny tamin’ny anaran’i jehovah, satria niaritra fampijaliana sy nanam-paharetana izy ireo.'),
  ('6ab25ce6fc569b100ad5c5e6', '2026-09-22T10:48:06.877Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:06.877Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jakoba', 59, 5, 6, 'Melohinareo sy vonoinareo ho faty ny olo-marina. Angaha izy tsy manohitra anareo?', 'melohinareo sy vonoinareo ho faty ny olo-marina. angaha izy tsy manohitra anareo?'),
  ('6ab25ce6fc569b100ad5c5f0', '2026-09-22T10:48:06.877Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:06.877Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jakoba', 59, 5, 16, 'Aoka àry ianareo hifampiaiky heloka tsy an-kifonofono, ary mifampivavaha, mba ho sitrana ianareo. Fa misy vokany be ny fitalahoan’ny olo-marina.', 'aoka àry ianareo hifampiaiky heloka tsy an-kifonofono, ary mifampivavaha, mba ho sitrana ianareo. fa misy vokany be ny fitalahoan’ny olo-marina.'),
  ('6ab25ce6fc569b100ad5c5e9', '2026-09-22T10:48:06.877Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:06.877Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jakoba', 59, 5, 9, 'Aza mifampimenomenona ianareo, ry rahalahy, mba tsy homelohina. Io fa efa mijoro eo anoloan’ny varavarana ny Mpitsara!', 'aza mifampimenomenona ianareo, ry rahalahy, mba tsy homelohina. io fa efa mijoro eo anoloan’ny varavarana ny mpitsara!'),
  ('6ab25ce6fc569b100ad5c5ef', '2026-09-22T10:48:06.877Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:06.877Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jakoba', 59, 5, 15, 'Fa hanasitrana an’ilay marary ny vavaka atao amim-pinoana, ary hanarina azy i Jehovah. Raha nanota koa izy, dia havela ny helony.', 'fa hanasitrana an’ilay marary ny vavaka atao amim-pinoana, ary hanarina azy i jehovah. raha nanota koa izy, dia havela ny helony.'),
  ('6ab25ce6fc569b100ad5c5ec', '2026-09-22T10:48:06.877Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:06.877Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jakoba', 59, 5, 12, 'Ambonin’ny zava-drehetra, ry rahalahiko, dia aza mianiana intsony, na amin’ny lanitra izany, na amin’ny tany, na amin’ny zavatra hafa. Fa rehefa “Eny” ny teninareo dia eny, rehefa “Tsia” dia tsia, sao ianareo homelohina.', 'ambonin’ny zava-drehetra, ry rahalahiko, dia aza mianiana intsony, na amin’ny lanitra izany, na amin’ny tany, na amin’ny zavatra hafa. fa rehefa “eny” ny teninareo dia eny, rehefa “tsia” dia tsia, sao ianareo homelohina.'),
  ('6ab25ce6fc569b100ad5c5e4', '2026-09-22T10:48:06.877Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:06.877Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Jakoba', 59, 5, 4, 'Henoy ange e! Mitaraina foana ny mpiasa nijinja ny sahanareo, fa tsy naloanareo ny karamany. Efa tonga any am-poto-tsofin’i Jehovah Tompon’ny tafika ny antso vonjy ataon’ireo mpijinja ireo.', 'henoy ange e! mitaraina foana ny mpiasa nijinja ny sahanareo, fa tsy naloanareo ny karamany. efa tonga any am-poto-tsofin’i jehovah tompon’ny tafika ny antso vonjy ataon’ireo mpijinja ireo.'),
  ('6ab25ce70b4c78c8eb1122e8', '2026-09-22T10:48:07.585Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:07.585Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Petera', 60, 1, 3, 'Hoderaina anie Andriamanitra Rain’i Jesosy Kristy Tompontsika, satria be famindram-po izy ka naterany indray isika, dia lasa manana fanantenana velona noho izy nanangana an’i Jesosy Kristy tamin’ny maty.', 'hoderaina anie andriamanitra rain’i jesosy kristy tompontsika, satria be famindram-po izy ka naterany indray isika, dia lasa manana fanantenana velona noho izy nanangana an’i jesosy kristy tamin’ny maty.'),
  ('6ab25ce70b4c78c8eb1122e6', '2026-09-22T10:48:07.585Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:07.585Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Petera', 60, 1, 1, 'Avy amin’i Petera, apostolin’i Jesosy Kristy. Ho an’ny mpivahiny miparitaka any Ponto, Galatia, Kapadokia, Azia, ary Bitynia, dia ireo voafidy', 'avy amin’i petera, apostolin’i jesosy kristy. ho an’ny mpivahiny miparitaka any ponto, galatia, kapadokia, azia, ary bitynia, dia ireo voafidy'),
  ('6ab25ce70b4c78c8eb1122ea', '2026-09-22T10:48:07.585Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:07.585Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Petera', 60, 1, 5, 'dia ianareo izay arovan’ny herin’Andriamanitra noho ianareo manam-pinoana. Arovany toy izany ianareo mba hahazo famonjena, izay efa vonona haharihary amin’ny fotoana farany.', 'dia ianareo izay arovan’ny herin’andriamanitra noho ianareo manam-pinoana. arovany toy izany ianareo mba hahazo famonjena, izay efa vonona haharihary amin’ny fotoana farany.'),
  ('6ab25ce70b4c78c8eb1122eb', '2026-09-22T10:48:07.585Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:07.585Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Petera', 60, 1, 6, 'Faly be ianareo noho izany, na dia nalahelo aza ianareo satria tsy maintsy niaritra fitsapana samihafa vetivety.', 'faly be ianareo noho izany, na dia nalahelo aza ianareo satria tsy maintsy niaritra fitsapana samihafa vetivety.'),
  ('6ab25ce70b4c78c8eb1122e9', '2026-09-22T10:48:07.585Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:07.585Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Petera', 60, 1, 4, 'Naterany indray tokoa isika mba hanana lova tsy mety simba sy tsy misy loto ary maharitra. Voatahiry any an-danitra ho anareo izany,', 'naterany indray tokoa isika mba hanana lova tsy mety simba sy tsy misy loto ary maharitra. voatahiry any an-danitra ho anareo izany,'),
  ('6ab25ce70b4c78c8eb1122e7', '2026-09-22T10:48:07.585Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:07.585Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Petera', 60, 1, 2, 'araka ny efa fantatr’Andriamanitra Ray mialoha, sy nohamasinin’ny fanahy masina, mba hankatò sy mba hofafazana ny ran’i Jesosy Kristy, Enga anie ianareo hanehoana hatsaram-panahy miavaka sy hahazo fiadanana betsaka kokoa!', 'araka ny efa fantatr’andriamanitra ray mialoha, sy nohamasinin’ny fanahy masina, mba hankatò sy mba hofafazana ny ran’i jesosy kristy, enga anie ianareo hanehoana hatsaram-panahy miavaka sy hahazo fiadanana betsaka kokoa!'),
  ('6ab25ce70b4c78c8eb1122ec', '2026-09-22T10:48:07.585Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:07.585Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Petera', 60, 1, 7, 'Amin’izay dia hitondra dera sy voninahitra ary haja ho anareo ny finoanareo vita sedra, rehefa haharihary i Jesosy Kristy. Ny finoana vita sedra mantsy, dia sarobidy lavitra noho ny volamena, izay mety simba na dia efa nosedraina tamin’ny afo aza.', 'amin’izay dia hitondra dera sy voninahitra ary haja ho anareo ny finoanareo vita sedra, rehefa haharihary i jesosy kristy. ny finoana vita sedra mantsy, dia sarobidy lavitra noho ny volamena, izay mety simba na dia efa nosedraina tamin’ny afo aza.'),
  ('6ab25ce70b4c78c8eb1122ee', '2026-09-22T10:48:07.586Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:07.586Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Petera', 60, 1, 9, 'satria tratranareo ny tanjonareo, dia ny hahazo famonjena, noho ianareo manam-pinoana.', 'satria tratranareo ny tanjonareo, dia ny hahazo famonjena, noho ianareo manam-pinoana.'),
  ('6ab25ce70b4c78c8eb1122fa', '2026-09-22T10:48:07.586Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:07.586Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Petera', 60, 1, 21, 'Tamin’ny alalany no nahatonga anareo ho mpino an’Andriamanitra, dia ilay nanangana azy tamin’ny maty sy nanome voninahitra azy, mba hinoanareo sy hanantenanareo an’Andriamanitra.', 'tamin’ny alalany no nahatonga anareo ho mpino an’andriamanitra, dia ilay nanangana azy tamin’ny maty sy nanome voninahitra azy, mba hinoanareo sy hanantenanareo an’andriamanitra.'),
  ('6ab25ce70b4c78c8eb1122f9', '2026-09-22T10:48:07.586Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:07.586Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Petera', 60, 1, 20, 'Marina fa efa voafidy mialoha i Kristy, talohan’ny nanorenana an’izao tontolo izao. Naseho anefa izy tamin’izao fotoana farany izao, noho ny aminareo.', 'marina fa efa voafidy mialoha i kristy, talohan’ny nanorenana an’izao tontolo izao. naseho anefa izy tamin’izao fotoana farany izao, noho ny aminareo.'),
  ('6ab25ce70b4c78c8eb1122f6', '2026-09-22T10:48:07.586Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:07.586Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Petera', 60, 1, 17, 'Mpitsara tsy miangatra ny Ray ary mitsara ny tsirairay araka izay ataony. Koa raha izy no antsoinareo dia asehoy amin’ny ataonareo, mandritra ny fotoana maha mpivahiny anareo, hoe matahotra azy ianareo.', 'mpitsara tsy miangatra ny ray ary mitsara ny tsirairay araka izay ataony. koa raha izy no antsoinareo dia asehoy amin’ny ataonareo, mandritra ny fotoana maha mpivahiny anareo, hoe matahotra azy ianareo.'),
  ('6ab25ce70b4c78c8eb1122f3', '2026-09-22T10:48:07.586Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:07.586Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Petera', 60, 1, 14, 'Zanaka mankatò ianareo, ka aza manaiky intsony hovolavolain’ny faniriana nanananareo taloha tamin’ianareo mbola tsy nahalala an’Andriamanitra.', 'zanaka mankatò ianareo, ka aza manaiky intsony hovolavolain’ny faniriana nanananareo taloha tamin’ianareo mbola tsy nahalala an’andriamanitra.'),
  ('6ab25ce70b4c78c8eb1122fd', '2026-09-22T10:48:07.586Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:07.586Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Petera', 60, 1, 24, 'Fa “hoatran’ny ahitra ny olombelona rehetra, ary hoatran’ny voninkazo eny an-tsaha ny voninahiny rehetra. Malazo ny ahitra, ary mihintsana ny voniny,', 'fa “hoatran’ny ahitra ny olombelona rehetra, ary hoatran’ny voninkazo eny an-tsaha ny voninahiny rehetra. malazo ny ahitra, ary mihintsana ny voniny,'),
  ('6ab25ce70b4c78c8eb1122f2', '2026-09-22T10:48:07.586Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:07.586Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Petera', 60, 1, 13, 'Koa hatanjaho ny sainareo mba ho vonona hiatrika asa, ary aoka ianareo hisaina tsara foana. Aoka koa ianareo hanantena ny hatsaram-panahy miavaka haseho aminareo rehefa haharihary i Jesosy Kristy.', 'koa hatanjaho ny sainareo mba ho vonona hiatrika asa, ary aoka ianareo hisaina tsara foana. aoka koa ianareo hanantena ny hatsaram-panahy miavaka haseho aminareo rehefa haharihary i jesosy kristy.'),
  ('6ab25ce70b4c78c8eb1122f5', '2026-09-22T10:48:07.586Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:07.586Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Petera', 60, 1, 16, 'Fa voasoratra hoe: “Tsy maintsy masina ianareo, satria masina aho.”', 'fa voasoratra hoe: “tsy maintsy masina ianareo, satria masina aho.”'),
  ('6ab25ce70b4c78c8eb1122f4', '2026-09-22T10:48:07.586Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:07.586Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Petera', 60, 1, 15, 'Aoka kosa ianareo ho masina amin’ny fitondran-tenanareo rehetra, hoatran’Ilay Masina izay niantso anareo.', 'aoka kosa ianareo ho masina amin’ny fitondran-tenanareo rehetra, hoatran’ilay masina izay niantso anareo.'),
  ('6ab25ce70b4c78c8eb1122fe', '2026-09-22T10:48:07.586Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:07.586Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Petera', 60, 1, 25, 'fa ny tenin’i Jehovah kosa maharitra mandrakizay.” Ary izany “teny” izany ilay vaovao tsara nambara taminareo.', 'fa ny tenin’i jehovah kosa maharitra mandrakizay.” ary izany “teny” izany ilay vaovao tsara nambara taminareo.'),
  ('6ab25ce70b4c78c8eb1122ef', '2026-09-22T10:48:07.586Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:07.586Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Petera', 60, 1, 10, 'Namotopototra tsara sy nikaroka lalina momba an’izany famonjena izany ireo mpaminany, izay naminany momba ny hatsaram-panahy miavaka voatokana ho anareo.', 'namotopototra tsara sy nikaroka lalina momba an’izany famonjena izany ireo mpaminany, izay naminany momba ny hatsaram-panahy miavaka voatokana ho anareo.'),
  ('6ab25ce70b4c78c8eb1122fc', '2026-09-22T10:48:07.586Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:07.586Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Petera', 60, 1, 23, 'Nateraka indray mantsy ianareo, tsy tamin’ny alalan’ny voa mety lo, fa tamin’ny tsy mety lo, dia tamin’ny alalan’ny tenin’ilay Andriamanitra velona sady maharitra mandrakizay.', 'nateraka indray mantsy ianareo, tsy tamin’ny alalan’ny voa mety lo, fa tamin’ny tsy mety lo, dia tamin’ny alalan’ny tenin’ilay andriamanitra velona sady maharitra mandrakizay.'),
  ('6ab25ce70b4c78c8eb1122f8', '2026-09-22T10:48:07.586Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:07.586Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Petera', 60, 1, 19, 'fa tamin’ny ra sarobidy kosa, dia ny ran’i Kristy, izay toy ny ran’ny zanak’ondry tsy misy tsininy sy tsy misy pentina.', 'fa tamin’ny ra sarobidy kosa, dia ny ran’i kristy, izay toy ny ran’ny zanak’ondry tsy misy tsininy sy tsy misy pentina.'),
  ('6ab25ce70b4c78c8eb1122f1', '2026-09-22T10:48:07.586Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:07.586Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Petera', 60, 1, 12, 'Naharihary tamin’izy ireny hoe tsy ho an’ny tenany ny fanompoana nataony, fa ho anareo. Izay nosoratan’izy ireny no ambara aminareo izao. Ireo nitory ny vaovao tsara taminareo no nanambara an’izany, rehefa nahazo fanahy masina nalefa avy any an-danitra izy ireo. Ireny zavatra ireny indrindra no tena tian’ny anjely hodinihina tsara.', 'naharihary tamin’izy ireny hoe tsy ho an’ny tenany ny fanompoana nataony, fa ho anareo. izay nosoratan’izy ireny no ambara aminareo izao. ireo nitory ny vaovao tsara taminareo no nanambara an’izany, rehefa nahazo fanahy masina nalefa avy any an-danitra izy ireo. ireny zavatra ireny indrindra no tena tian’ny anjely hodinihina tsara.'),
  ('6ab25ce70b4c78c8eb1122f0', '2026-09-22T10:48:07.586Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:07.586Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Petera', 60, 1, 11, 'Nanadihady foana izy ireny hoe inona no hitranga ary rahoviana no ho tanteraka izay nolazain’ny fanahy masina momba an’i Kristy. Ny fanahy masina tao amin’izy ireny mantsy efa nanambara mialoha fa tsy maintsy hijaly i Kristy ary hahazo voninahitra aorian’izany.', 'nanadihady foana izy ireny hoe inona no hitranga ary rahoviana no ho tanteraka izay nolazain’ny fanahy masina momba an’i kristy. ny fanahy masina tao amin’izy ireny mantsy efa nanambara mialoha fa tsy maintsy hijaly i kristy ary hahazo voninahitra aorian’izany.'),
  ('6ab25ce70b4c78c8eb1122fb', '2026-09-22T10:48:07.586Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:07.586Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Petera', 60, 1, 22, 'Efa nanadio ny tenanareo ianareo rehefa nankatò ny fahamarinana, ka ny vokatr’izany, dia fitiavan-drahalahy tsy misy fihatsarambelatsihy. Koa mifankatiava lalina amin’ny fo.', 'efa nanadio ny tenanareo ianareo rehefa nankatò ny fahamarinana, ka ny vokatr’izany, dia fitiavan-drahalahy tsy misy fihatsarambelatsihy. koa mifankatiava lalina amin’ny fo.'),
  ('6ab25ce70b4c78c8eb1122ed', '2026-09-22T10:48:07.586Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:07.586Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Petera', 60, 1, 8, 'Na mbola tsy hitanareo mihitsy aza i Kristy, dia tia azy ianareo. Ary na tsy hitanareo aza izy izao, dia mino azy ianareo sady faly be sy ravoravo ka tsy hita izay hilazana ny hafalianareo,', 'na mbola tsy hitanareo mihitsy aza i kristy, dia tia azy ianareo. ary na tsy hitanareo aza izy izao, dia mino azy ianareo sady faly be sy ravoravo ka tsy hita izay hilazana ny hafalianareo,'),
  ('6ab25ce70b4c78c8eb1122f7', '2026-09-22T10:48:07.586Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:07.586Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Petera', 60, 1, 18, 'Fantatrareo mantsy fa tsy tamin’ny zavatra mety simba, toy ny volafotsy na volamena, no nanafahana anareo tamin’ny fomba fiaina tsy mahasoa nolovanareo tamin’ny razambenareo,', 'fantatrareo mantsy fa tsy tamin’ny zavatra mety simba, toy ny volafotsy na volamena, no nanafahana anareo tamin’ny fomba fiaina tsy mahasoa nolovanareo tamin’ny razambenareo,'),
  ('6ab25ce8494f4585158acc0f', '2026-09-22T10:48:08.724Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:08.724Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Petera', 60, 2, 21, 'Izany tokoa mantsy no niantsoana anareo, satria na i Kristy aza nijaly ho anareo, ka nanome modely ho anareo mba hanarahanareo akaiky ny diany.', 'izany tokoa mantsy no niantsoana anareo, satria na i kristy aza nijaly ho anareo, ka nanome modely ho anareo mba hanarahanareo akaiky ny diany.'),
  ('6ab25ce8494f4585158acc12', '2026-09-22T10:48:08.724Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:08.724Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Petera', 60, 2, 24, 'Izy no nitondra ny fahotantsika tao amin’ny vatany, teo amin’ny tsato-kazo, mba ho faty isika raha ny amin’ny ota, fa ho velona kosa mba hanao ny marina. Ary “ny ratrany no nahatonga anareo ho sitrana.”', 'izy no nitondra ny fahotantsika tao amin’ny vatany, teo amin’ny tsato-kazo, mba ho faty isika raha ny amin’ny ota, fa ho velona kosa mba hanao ny marina. ary “ny ratrany no nahatonga anareo ho sitrana.”'),
  ('6ab25ce8494f4585158acc0d', '2026-09-22T10:48:08.724Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:08.724Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Petera', 60, 2, 19, 'Ankasitrahan’Andriamanitra mantsy ny olona miaritra fahoriana sy mijaly tsy ara-drariny noho izy te hanana feon’ny fieritreretana madio eo anatrehany.', 'ankasitrahan’andriamanitra mantsy ny olona miaritra fahoriana sy mijaly tsy ara-drariny noho izy te hanana feon’ny fieritreretana madio eo anatrehany.'),
  ('6ab25ce8494f4585158acc0a', '2026-09-22T10:48:08.724Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:08.724Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Petera', 60, 2, 16, 'Olona afaka ianareo, nefa aza ampiasaina hanaronana ny ratsy izany fahafahanareo izany, fa ampiasao hanompoana an’Andriamanitra kosa.', 'olona afaka ianareo, nefa aza ampiasaina hanaronana ny ratsy izany fahafahanareo izany, fa ampiasao hanompoana an’andriamanitra kosa.'),
  ('6ab25ce8494f4585158acc10', '2026-09-22T10:48:08.724Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:08.724Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Petera', 60, 2, 22, 'Tsy nanota izy, ary tsy nisy fitaka teo am-bavany.', 'tsy nanota izy, ary tsy nisy fitaka teo am-bavany.'),
  ('6ab25ce8494f4585158acc07', '2026-09-22T10:48:08.724Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:08.724Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Petera', 60, 2, 13, 'Noho ny amin’ny Tompo, dia ekeo izay fahefana rehetra najoron’olombelona: Na mpanjaka izany, satria ambony izy,', 'noho ny amin’ny tompo, dia ekeo izay fahefana rehetra najoron’olombelona: na mpanjaka izany, satria ambony izy,'),
  ('6ab25ce8494f4585158acbfb', '2026-09-22T10:48:08.724Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:08.724Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Petera', 60, 2, 1, 'Esory àry ny faharatsiana rehetra, ny fitaka, ny fihatsarambelatsihy, ny fialonana, ary ny fanaratsiana rehetra.', 'esory àry ny faharatsiana rehetra, ny fitaka, ny fihatsarambelatsihy, ny fialonana, ary ny fanaratsiana rehetra.'),
  ('6ab25ce8494f4585158acc06', '2026-09-22T10:48:08.724Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:08.724Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Petera', 60, 2, 12, 'Miezaha foana ho tsara fitondran-tena eo amin’izao tontolo izao. Amin’izay izy ireo hahita ny asa tsara ataonareo, na dia manendrikendrika anareo ho mpanao ratsy aza, ka hanome voninahitra an’Andriamanitra amin’ny andro handinihany ny momba ny olombelona.', 'miezaha foana ho tsara fitondran-tena eo amin’izao tontolo izao. amin’izay izy ireo hahita ny asa tsara ataonareo, na dia manendrikendrika anareo ho mpanao ratsy aza, ka hanome voninahitra an’andriamanitra amin’ny andro handinihany ny momba ny olombelona.'),
  ('6ab25ce8494f4585158acc04', '2026-09-22T10:48:08.724Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:08.724Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Petera', 60, 2, 10, 'Tsy firenena mantsy ianareo taloha, fa firenen’Andriamanitra kosa ianareo izao. Tsy namindrana fo ianareo taloha, fa efa nahazo famindram-po kosa izao.', 'tsy firenena mantsy ianareo taloha, fa firenen’andriamanitra kosa ianareo izao. tsy namindrana fo ianareo taloha, fa efa nahazo famindram-po kosa izao.'),
  ('6ab25ce8494f4585158acbfe', '2026-09-22T10:48:08.724Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:08.724Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Petera', 60, 2, 4, 'Toy ny vato velona tsy tian’ny olona izy, nefa nofidin’Andriamanitra sy sarobidy aminy. Rehefa manatona azy ianareo,', 'toy ny vato velona tsy tian’ny olona izy, nefa nofidin’andriamanitra sy sarobidy aminy. rehefa manatona azy ianareo,'),
  ('6ab25ce8494f4585158acbfd', '2026-09-22T10:48:08.724Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:08.724Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Petera', 60, 2, 3, 'raha efa nandramanareo fa tsara fanahy ny Tompo.', 'raha efa nandramanareo fa tsara fanahy ny tompo.'),
  ('6ab25ce8494f4585158acc05', '2026-09-22T10:48:08.724Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:08.724Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Petera', 60, 2, 11, 'Ry malala, vahiny sy mpivahiny ianareo ka mampirisika anareo aho mba hanohitra foana ny fanirian’ny nofo, izay miady aminareo.', 'ry malala, vahiny sy mpivahiny ianareo ka mampirisika anareo aho mba hanohitra foana ny fanirian’ny nofo, izay miady aminareo.'),
  ('6ab25ce8494f4585158acc11', '2026-09-22T10:48:08.724Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:08.724Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Petera', 60, 2, 23, 'Tsy mba nanambanimbany izy rehefa nisy nanambanimbany. Tsy mba nandrahona izy rehefa nijaly, fa nanankina ny fiainany kosa tamin’Ilay mitsara araka ny rariny.', 'tsy mba nanambanimbany izy rehefa nisy nanambanimbany. tsy mba nandrahona izy rehefa nijaly, fa nanankina ny fiainany kosa tamin’ilay mitsara araka ny rariny.'),
  ('6ab25ce8494f4585158acc0c', '2026-09-22T10:48:08.724Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:08.724Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Petera', 60, 2, 18, 'Aoka ny mpanompo hanaiky ny tompony sady hatahotra azy araka ny tokony ho izy, tsy ny tompo tsara fanahy sy be fandeferana ihany fa ny sarotsarotiny koa.', 'aoka ny mpanompo hanaiky ny tompony sady hatahotra azy araka ny tokony ho izy, tsy ny tompo tsara fanahy sy be fandeferana ihany fa ny sarotsarotiny koa.'),
  ('6ab25ce8494f4585158acbfc', '2026-09-22T10:48:08.724Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:08.724Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Petera', 60, 2, 2, 'Toy ny zaza menavava, dia ataovy izay haniriana mafy ny ronono tsy misy fangarony, dia ny ronono ao amin’ny tenin’Andriamanitra, mba hitombo ianareo ka hahazo famonjena,', 'toy ny zaza menavava, dia ataovy izay haniriana mafy ny ronono tsy misy fangarony, dia ny ronono ao amin’ny tenin’andriamanitra, mba hitombo ianareo ka hahazo famonjena,'),
  ('6ab25ce8494f4585158acbff', '2026-09-22T10:48:08.724Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:08.724Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Petera', 60, 2, 5, 'izay vato velona koa, dia aorina ho trano ara-panahy mba ho mpisorona masina. Amin’izay dia hanolotra sorona ara-panahy ankasitrahan’Andriamanitra ianareo, amin’ny alalan’i Jesosy Kristy.', 'izay vato velona koa, dia aorina ho trano ara-panahy mba ho mpisorona masina. amin’izay dia hanolotra sorona ara-panahy ankasitrahan’andriamanitra ianareo, amin’ny alalan’i jesosy kristy.'),
  ('6ab25ce8494f4585158acc08', '2026-09-22T10:48:08.724Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:08.724Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Petera', 60, 2, 14, 'na governora, satria nirahin’ny mpanjaka hanasazy ny mpanao ratsy ireny fa hidera an’izay manao ny tsara kosa.', 'na governora, satria nirahin’ny mpanjaka hanasazy ny mpanao ratsy ireny fa hidera an’izay manao ny tsara kosa.'),
  ('6ab25ce8494f4585158acc02', '2026-09-22T10:48:08.724Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:08.724Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Petera', 60, 2, 8, 'sady nanjary “vato mahatafintohina sy vatolampy mampianjera.” Tafintohina izy ireny satria tsy mankatò ny teny. Izany indrindra no efa voatendry hoe hanjo azy ireny.', 'sady nanjary “vato mahatafintohina sy vatolampy mampianjera.” tafintohina izy ireny satria tsy mankatò ny teny. izany indrindra no efa voatendry hoe hanjo azy ireny.'),
  ('6ab25ce8494f4585158acc0e', '2026-09-22T10:48:08.724Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:08.724Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Petera', 60, 2, 20, 'Fa inona moa ny soa azonareo raha voakapoka ianareo satria nanota ka miaritra an’izany? Fa raha miaritra fijaliana kosa ianareo satria manao ny tsara, dia izany no ankasitrahan’Andriamanitra.', 'fa inona moa ny soa azonareo raha voakapoka ianareo satria nanota ka miaritra an’izany? fa raha miaritra fijaliana kosa ianareo satria manao ny tsara, dia izany no ankasitrahan’andriamanitra.'),
  ('6ab25ce8494f4585158acc0b', '2026-09-22T10:48:08.724Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:08.724Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Petera', 60, 2, 17, 'Hajao ny karazan’olona rehetra, tiavo ny rahalahy rehetra, matahora an’Andriamanitra, hajao ny mpanjaka.', 'hajao ny karazan’olona rehetra, tiavo ny rahalahy rehetra, matahora an’andriamanitra, hajao ny mpanjaka.'),
  ('6ab25ce8494f4585158acc03', '2026-09-22T10:48:08.724Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:08.724Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Petera', 60, 2, 9, 'Ianareo kosa dia “firazanana voafidy, mpanjaka sady mpisorona, firenena masina, vahoaka nataon’Andriamanitra ho fananany manokana, mba hanambara hatraiza hatraiza ny hatsaran’Ilay” niantso anareo hiala tamin’ny haizina ho amin’ny hazavany mahagaga.', 'ianareo kosa dia “firazanana voafidy, mpanjaka sady mpisorona, firenena masina, vahoaka nataon’andriamanitra ho fananany manokana, mba hanambara hatraiza hatraiza ny hatsaran’ilay” niantso anareo hiala tamin’ny haizina ho amin’ny hazavany mahagaga.'),
  ('6ab25ce8494f4585158acc00', '2026-09-22T10:48:08.724Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:08.724Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Petera', 60, 2, 6, 'Hoy mantsy ny Soratra Masina: “Mametraka vato voafidy ao Ziona aho, dia vato fehizoro sady vato fototra sarobidy. Tsy hisy ho diso fanantenana mihitsy izay rehetra maneho finoana azy io.”', 'hoy mantsy ny soratra masina: “mametraka vato voafidy ao ziona aho, dia vato fehizoro sady vato fototra sarobidy. tsy hisy ho diso fanantenana mihitsy izay rehetra maneho finoana azy io.”'),
  ('6ab25ce8494f4585158acc09', '2026-09-22T10:48:08.724Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:08.724Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Petera', 60, 2, 15, 'Fa ny sitrapon’Andriamanitra dia ny hanaovanareo an’izay tsara mba hampanginanareo ny vavan’ny olona tsy misaina, izay miteny zavatra tsy fantany.', 'fa ny sitrapon’andriamanitra dia ny hanaovanareo an’izay tsara mba hampanginanareo ny vavan’ny olona tsy misaina, izay miteny zavatra tsy fantany.'),
  ('6ab25ce8494f4585158acc01', '2026-09-22T10:48:08.724Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:08.724Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Petera', 60, 2, 7, 'Aminareo àry no sarobidy izy, satria mpino ianareo. Fa amin’ny tsy mpino kosa, dia “ny vato tsy tian’ny mpanao trano no lasa vato fehizoro lehibe indrindra”,', 'aminareo àry no sarobidy izy, satria mpino ianareo. fa amin’ny tsy mpino kosa, dia “ny vato tsy tian’ny mpanao trano no lasa vato fehizoro lehibe indrindra”,'),
  ('6ab25ce8494f4585158acc13', '2026-09-22T10:48:08.725Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:08.725Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Petera', 60, 2, 25, 'Hoatran’ny ondry nania mantsy ianareo, saingy efa niverina tamin’ilay mpiandry sy mpiandraikitra anareo ianareo izao.', 'hoatran’ny ondry nania mantsy ianareo, saingy efa niverina tamin’ilay mpiandry sy mpiandraikitra anareo ianareo izao.'),
  ('6ab25ce9a743649f7c01eb3b', '2026-09-22T10:48:09.837Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:09.837Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Petera', 60, 4, 5, 'Mbola hanao ampamoaka an’ireny olona ireny anefa ilay vonona hitsara ny velona sy ny maty.', 'mbola hanao ampamoaka an’ireny olona ireny anefa ilay vonona hitsara ny velona sy ny maty.'),
  ('6ab25ce9a743649f7c01eb43', '2026-09-22T10:48:09.837Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:09.837Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Petera', 60, 4, 13, 'Fa mifalia foana kosa arakaraka ny ijalianareo hoatran’i Kristy, mba hifalianareo sy hiravoravoanareo mandritra ny fampiharihariana ny voninahiny.', 'fa mifalia foana kosa arakaraka ny ijalianareo hoatran’i kristy, mba hifalianareo sy hiravoravoanareo mandritra ny fampiharihariana ny voninahiny.'),
  ('6ab25ce9a743649f7c01eb40', '2026-09-22T10:48:09.837Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:09.837Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Petera', 60, 4, 10, 'Ampiasao mba hifanompoana izay nomena anareo, arakaraka izay noraisinareo tsirairay avy. Ianareo mantsy no mpanompo tsara izay manampy ny hafa handray soa amin’ny hatsaram-panahy miavaka asehon’Andriamanitra amin’ny fomba maro samihafa.', 'ampiasao mba hifanompoana izay nomena anareo, arakaraka izay noraisinareo tsirairay avy. ianareo mantsy no mpanompo tsara izay manampy ny hafa handray soa amin’ny hatsaram-panahy miavaka asehon’andriamanitra amin’ny fomba maro samihafa.'),
  ('6ab25ce9a743649f7c01eb38', '2026-09-22T10:48:09.837Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:09.837Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Petera', 60, 4, 2, 'amin’izay izy dia tsy ho velona mba hanatanteraka ny fanirian’olombelona intsony, fa ho velona hanao ny sitrapon’Andriamanitra, amin’ny andro sisa hiainany ao amin’ny nofo.', 'amin’izay izy dia tsy ho velona mba hanatanteraka ny fanirian’olombelona intsony, fa ho velona hanao ny sitrapon’andriamanitra, amin’ny andro sisa hiainany ao amin’ny nofo.'),
  ('6ab25ce9a743649f7c01eb37', '2026-09-22T10:48:09.837Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:09.837Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Petera', 60, 4, 1, 'Nijaly tao amin’ny nofo i Kristy, ka ataovy koa izay hanananareo toe-tsaina toy ny azy. Efa tsy manao fahotana intsony mantsy ny olona nijaly tao amin’ny nofo,', 'nijaly tao amin’ny nofo i kristy, ka ataovy koa izay hanananareo toe-tsaina toy ny azy. efa tsy manao fahotana intsony mantsy ny olona nijaly tao amin’ny nofo,'),
  ('6ab25ce9a743649f7c01eb41', '2026-09-22T10:48:09.837Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:09.837Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Petera', 60, 4, 11, 'Raha misy miteny, dia aoka izy ho toy ny milaza hafatra avy amin’Andriamanitra. Raha misy manompo, dia aoka izy hanompo sady hiantehitra amin’ny hery omen’Andriamanitra. Amin’izay dia homem-boninahitra amin’ny zava-drehetra Andriamanitra, amin’ny alalan’i Jesosy Kristy. Azy mandrakizay mandrakizay ny voninahitra sy ny hery! Amena.', 'raha misy miteny, dia aoka izy ho toy ny milaza hafatra avy amin’andriamanitra. raha misy manompo, dia aoka izy hanompo sady hiantehitra amin’ny hery omen’andriamanitra. amin’izay dia homem-boninahitra amin’ny zava-drehetra andriamanitra, amin’ny alalan’i jesosy kristy. azy mandrakizay mandrakizay ny voninahitra sy ny hery! amena.'),
  ('6ab25ce9a743649f7c01eb3c', '2026-09-22T10:48:09.837Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:09.837Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Petera', 60, 4, 6, 'Raha ny marina, dia nitoriana ny vaovao tsara koa ny maty mba ho velona araka ny fanahy, araka ny fomba fihevitr’Andriamanitra, na dia tsaraina araka ny nofo, araka ny fomba fihevitr’olombelona aza.', 'raha ny marina, dia nitoriana ny vaovao tsara koa ny maty mba ho velona araka ny fanahy, araka ny fomba fihevitr’andriamanitra, na dia tsaraina araka ny nofo, araka ny fomba fihevitr’olombelona aza.'),
  ('6ab25ce9a743649f7c01eb39', '2026-09-22T10:48:09.837Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:09.837Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Petera', 60, 4, 3, 'Ampy izay ny fotoana nanaovanareo ny sitrapon’izao tontolo izao, tamin’ianareo nanana fitondran-tena tsy misy henatra, nanaram-po tamin’ny filan’ny nofo, nisotro tafahoatra, nanao fety tsy voafehy, nifaninana nisotro, ary nanao fanompoan-tsampy maharikoriko.', 'ampy izay ny fotoana nanaovanareo ny sitrapon’izao tontolo izao, tamin’ianareo nanana fitondran-tena tsy misy henatra, nanaram-po tamin’ny filan’ny nofo, nisotro tafahoatra, nanao fety tsy voafehy, nifaninana nisotro, ary nanao fanompoan-tsampy maharikoriko.'),
  ('6ab25ce9a743649f7c01eb47', '2026-09-22T10:48:09.837Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:09.837Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Petera', 60, 4, 17, 'Izao mantsy no fotoana voatondro hanombohan’ny fitsarana eo amin’ny ankohonan’ Andriamanitra. Koa raha manomboka amintsika izany, hanao ahoana no hiafaran’ireo tsy mankatò ny vaovao tsaran’Andriamanitra?', 'izao mantsy no fotoana voatondro hanombohan’ny fitsarana eo amin’ny ankohonan’ andriamanitra. koa raha manomboka amintsika izany, hanao ahoana no hiafaran’ireo tsy mankatò ny vaovao tsaran’andriamanitra?'),
  ('6ab25ce9a743649f7c01eb48', '2026-09-22T10:48:09.837Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:09.837Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Petera', 60, 4, 18, '“Raha ny olo-marina aza sarotra ny hahavoavonjy azy, dia inona no hanjo ny olona tsy matahotra an’Andriamanitra sy ny mpanota?”', '“raha ny olo-marina aza sarotra ny hahavoavonjy azy, dia inona no hanjo ny olona tsy matahotra an’andriamanitra sy ny mpanota?”'),
  ('6ab25ce9a743649f7c01eb49', '2026-09-22T10:48:09.837Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:09.837Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Petera', 60, 4, 19, 'Aoka àry ireo mijaly noho ny fanaovana ny sitrapon’Andriamanitra hiantehitra foana amin’ilay Mpamorona mendri-pitokisana, sady hanohy hanao ny tsara.', 'aoka àry ireo mijaly noho ny fanaovana ny sitrapon’andriamanitra hiantehitra foana amin’ilay mpamorona mendri-pitokisana, sady hanohy hanao ny tsara.'),
  ('6ab25ce9a743649f7c01eb45', '2026-09-22T10:48:09.837Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:09.837Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Petera', 60, 4, 15, 'Aoka anefa tsy hisy aminareo hijaly satria mpamono olona, na mpangalatra, na mpanao ratsy, na mpidikiditra amin’ny fiainan’olona.', 'aoka anefa tsy hisy aminareo hijaly satria mpamono olona, na mpangalatra, na mpanao ratsy, na mpidikiditra amin’ny fiainan’olona.'),
  ('6ab25ce9a743649f7c01eb46', '2026-09-22T10:48:09.837Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:09.837Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Petera', 60, 4, 16, 'Fa raha misy mijaly satria Kristianina, dia aoka tsy ho menatra izy, fa hankalaza foana an’Andriamanitra kosa sady hitondra an’izany anarana izany.', 'fa raha misy mijaly satria kristianina, dia aoka tsy ho menatra izy, fa hankalaza foana an’andriamanitra kosa sady hitondra an’izany anarana izany.'),
  ('6ab25ce9a743649f7c01eb3a', '2026-09-22T10:48:09.837Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:09.837Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Petera', 60, 4, 4, 'Gaga izy ireo fa tsy miara-mihazakazaka aminy intsony ianareo, izany hoe tsy miaraka aminy manaram-po amin’ny ratsy intsony, dia manevateva anareo izy.', 'gaga izy ireo fa tsy miara-mihazakazaka aminy intsony ianareo, izany hoe tsy miaraka aminy manaram-po amin’ny ratsy intsony, dia manevateva anareo izy.'),
  ('6ab25ce9a743649f7c01eb3f', '2026-09-22T10:48:09.837Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:09.837Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Petera', 60, 4, 9, 'Samia miezaka ho tia mandray vahiny ary aza mimenomenona rehefa manao an’izany.', 'samia miezaka ho tia mandray vahiny ary aza mimenomenona rehefa manao an’izany.'),
  ('6ab25ce9a743649f7c01eb3d', '2026-09-22T10:48:09.837Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:09.837Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Petera', 60, 4, 7, 'Efa manakaiky anefa ny faran’ny zava-drehetra. Aoka àry ianareo hisaina tsara sy ho mailo ka tsy hanao tsirambina ny vavaka.', 'efa manakaiky anefa ny faran’ny zava-drehetra. aoka àry ianareo hisaina tsara sy ho mailo ka tsy hanao tsirambina ny vavaka.'),
  ('6ab25ce9a743649f7c01eb44', '2026-09-22T10:48:09.837Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:09.837Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Petera', 60, 4, 14, 'Sambatra ianareo raha haratsiratsin’ny olona noho ny anaran’i Kristy, satria ianareo manana ny fanahin’ny voninahitra, dia ny fanahin’Andriamanitra.', 'sambatra ianareo raha haratsiratsin’ny olona noho ny anaran’i kristy, satria ianareo manana ny fanahin’ny voninahitra, dia ny fanahin’andriamanitra.'),
  ('6ab25ce9a743649f7c01eb42', '2026-09-22T10:48:09.837Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:09.837Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Petera', 60, 4, 12, 'Ry malala, aza gaga amin’ny fitsapana mivaivay mahazo anareo, toy ny hoe zavatra hafahafa no manjo anareo.', 'ry malala, aza gaga amin’ny fitsapana mivaivay mahazo anareo, toy ny hoe zavatra hafahafa no manjo anareo.'),
  ('6ab25ce9a743649f7c01eb3e', '2026-09-22T10:48:09.837Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:09.837Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Petera', 60, 4, 8, 'Ambonin’ny zavatra rehetra, dia mifankatiava lalina, satria manarona fahotana maro be ny fitiavana.', 'ambonin’ny zavatra rehetra, dia mifankatiava lalina, satria manarona fahotana maro be ny fitiavana.'),
  ('6ab25ceb18e809d800864b11', '2026-09-22T10:48:11.051Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:11.051Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Petera', 60, 5, 10, 'Rehefa avy nijaly vetivety anefa ianareo, dia hamita ny fampiofanana anareo ilay Andriamanitry ny hatsaram-panahy miavaka rehetra, izay niantso anareo ho amin’ny voninahiny mandrakizay, noho ianareo tafaray amin’i Kristy. Hanampy anareo ho mafy orina izy, sady hanatanjaka anareo, ary hataony mifototra tsara ianareo.', 'rehefa avy nijaly vetivety anefa ianareo, dia hamita ny fampiofanana anareo ilay andriamanitry ny hatsaram-panahy miavaka rehetra, izay niantso anareo ho amin’ny voninahiny mandrakizay, noho ianareo tafaray amin’i kristy. hanampy anareo ho mafy orina izy, sady hanatanjaka anareo, ary hataony mifototra tsara ianareo.'),
  ('6ab25ceb18e809d800864b10', '2026-09-22T10:48:11.051Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:11.051Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Petera', 60, 5, 9, 'Tohero anefa izy ka manàna finoana matanjaka, satria fantatrareo fa ampijalina toy izany koa ny rahalahinareo rehetra, eran’izao tontolo izao.', 'tohero anefa izy ka manàna finoana matanjaka, satria fantatrareo fa ampijalina toy izany koa ny rahalahinareo rehetra, eran’izao tontolo izao.'),
  ('6ab25ceb18e809d800864b0d', '2026-09-22T10:48:11.051Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:11.051Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Petera', 60, 5, 6, 'Koa manetre tena eo ambanin’ny tana-maherin’Andriamanitra, mba hanandratany anareo amin’ny fotoana voatondrony,', 'koa manetre tena eo ambanin’ny tana-maherin’andriamanitra, mba hanandratany anareo amin’ny fotoana voatondrony,'),
  ('6ab25ceb18e809d800864b0c', '2026-09-22T10:48:11.051Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:11.051Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Petera', 60, 5, 5, 'Ary ianareo tanora koa, maneke ny zokiolona. Fa ianareo rehetra kosa mitafia fanetren-tena rehefa mifandray ianareo samy ianareo, satria manohitra ny manambony tena Andriamanitra, fa maneho hatsaram-panahy miavaka amin’ny manetry tena.', 'ary ianareo tanora koa, maneke ny zokiolona. fa ianareo rehetra kosa mitafia fanetren-tena rehefa mifandray ianareo samy ianareo, satria manohitra ny manambony tena andriamanitra, fa maneho hatsaram-panahy miavaka amin’ny manetry tena.'),
  ('6ab25ceb18e809d800864b12', '2026-09-22T10:48:11.051Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:11.051Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Petera', 60, 5, 11, 'Ho azy mandrakizay anie ny hery! Amena.', 'ho azy mandrakizay anie ny hery! amena.'),
  ('6ab25ceb18e809d800864b0e', '2026-09-22T10:48:11.051Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:11.051Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Petera', 60, 5, 7, 'ary apetraho aminy daholo izay rehetra mampanahy anareo, satria miahy anareo izy.', 'ary apetraho aminy daholo izay rehetra mampanahy anareo, satria miahy anareo izy.'),
  ('6ab25ceb18e809d800864b0b', '2026-09-22T10:48:11.051Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:11.051Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Petera', 60, 5, 4, 'Dia hahazo satroboninahitra tsy mety malazo ianareo rehefa aseho ilay lehiben’ny mpiandry.', 'dia hahazo satroboninahitra tsy mety malazo ianareo rehefa aseho ilay lehiben’ny mpiandry.'),
  ('6ab25ceb18e809d800864b08', '2026-09-22T10:48:11.051Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:11.051Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Petera', 60, 5, 1, 'Koa satria izaho anti-panahy koa, sy vavolombelona nahita ny fijalian’i Kristy sady anisan’ny hahazo an’ilay voninahitra efa haharihary, dia miangavy an’ireo anti-panahy eo aminareo aho hoe:', 'koa satria izaho anti-panahy koa, sy vavolombelona nahita ny fijalian’i kristy sady anisan’ny hahazo an’ilay voninahitra efa haharihary, dia miangavy an’ireo anti-panahy eo aminareo aho hoe:'),
  ('6ab25ceb18e809d800864b0a', '2026-09-22T10:48:11.051Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:11.051Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Petera', 60, 5, 3, 'ary tsy ho mpanjakazaka amin’ny lovan’Andriamanitra, fa ho modely ho an’ny andian’ondry.', 'ary tsy ho mpanjakazaka amin’ny lovan’andriamanitra, fa ho modely ho an’ny andian’ondry.'),
  ('6ab25ceb18e809d800864b09', '2026-09-22T10:48:11.051Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:11.051Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Petera', 60, 5, 2, 'Andraso ny andian’ondrin’Andriamanitra eo ambany fiandraiketanareo, ka ataovy ny asan’ny mpiandraikitra. Tsy an-tery anefa no tokony hanaovana an’izany, fa an-tsitrapo eo anatrehan’Andriamanitra, tsy noho ny fitiavana tombony azo amin’ny tsy marina, fa noho ny fahazotoana,', 'andraso ny andian’ondrin’andriamanitra eo ambany fiandraiketanareo, ka ataovy ny asan’ny mpiandraikitra. tsy an-tery anefa no tokony hanaovana an’izany, fa an-tsitrapo eo anatrehan’andriamanitra, tsy noho ny fitiavana tombony azo amin’ny tsy marina, fa noho ny fahazotoana,'),
  ('6ab25ceb18e809d800864b0f', '2026-09-22T10:48:11.051Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:11.051Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Petera', 60, 5, 8, 'Aoka ianareo hisaina tsara foana sy hiambina! Ny Devoly fahavalonareo mantsy mandehandeha hoatran’ny liona mierona, mitady olona harapaka.', 'aoka ianareo hisaina tsara foana sy hiambina! ny devoly fahavalonareo mantsy mandehandeha hoatran’ny liona mierona, mitady olona harapaka.'),
  ('6ab25ceb18e809d800864b14', '2026-09-22T10:48:11.052Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:11.052Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Petera', 60, 5, 13, 'Mampamangy, hono, ianareo, hoy ilay eto Babylona, ilay voafidy hoatr’anareo. Mampamangy koa, hono, ianareo, hoy i Marka zanako.', 'mampamangy, hono, ianareo, hoy ilay eto babylona, ilay voafidy hoatr’anareo. mampamangy koa, hono, ianareo, hoy i marka zanako.'),
  ('6ab25ceb18e809d800864b13', '2026-09-22T10:48:11.052Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:11.052Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Petera', 60, 5, 12, 'Nanoratra teny vitsivitsy ho anareo aho, tamin’ny alalan’i Silvano, izay hitako hoe rahalahy mendri-pitokisana. Nanoratra aho mba hampaherezana anareo sy hanomezana toky anareo fa tena izy ilay hatsaram-panahy miavaka asehon’Andriamanitra aminareo. Aza miala amin’izany hatsaram-panahiny izany mihitsy.', 'nanoratra teny vitsivitsy ho anareo aho, tamin’ny alalan’i silvano, izay hitako hoe rahalahy mendri-pitokisana. nanoratra aho mba hampaherezana anareo sy hanomezana toky anareo fa tena izy ilay hatsaram-panahy miavaka asehon’andriamanitra aminareo. aza miala amin’izany hatsaram-panahiny izany mihitsy.'),
  ('6ab25ceb18e809d800864b15', '2026-09-22T10:48:11.052Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:11.052Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Petera', 60, 5, 14, 'Mifampiarahabà amin’ny oroka fanehoam-pitiavana. Enga anie hahazo fiadanana ianareo rehetra tafaray amin’i Kristy!', 'mifampiarahabà amin’ny oroka fanehoam-pitiavana. enga anie hahazo fiadanana ianareo rehetra tafaray amin’i kristy!'),
  ('6ab25cec2d1c7ef2a44eb50f', '2026-09-22T10:48:12.578Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:12.578Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Petera', 61, 3, 17, 'Koa satria fantatrareo mialoha izany, ry malala, dia mitandrema sao ho voataona hiaraka amin’ireny ianareo noho ny hevi-dison’ireo mpandika lalàna, ka ho lavo ianareo fa tsy hiorina tsara intsony.', 'koa satria fantatrareo mialoha izany, ry malala, dia mitandrema sao ho voataona hiaraka amin’ireny ianareo noho ny hevi-dison’ireo mpandika lalàna, ka ho lavo ianareo fa tsy hiorina tsara intsony.'),
  ('6ab25cec2d1c7ef2a44eb507', '2026-09-22T10:48:12.578Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:12.578Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Petera', 61, 3, 9, 'Tsy mba ela i Jehovah manatanteraka ny fampanantenany, araka ny fiheveran’ny sasany azy, fa manam-paharetana aminareo kosa izy, satria tsy tiany hisy ho ringana ny olona fa tiany hibebaka daholo.', 'tsy mba ela i jehovah manatanteraka ny fampanantenany, araka ny fiheveran’ny sasany azy, fa manam-paharetana aminareo kosa izy, satria tsy tiany hisy ho ringana ny olona fa tiany hibebaka daholo.'),
  ('6ab25cec2d1c7ef2a44eb506', '2026-09-22T10:48:12.578Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:12.578Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Petera', 61, 3, 8, 'Aza hadinoina anefa izao, ry malala: Ny iray andro amin’i Jehovah dia toy ny arivo taona, ary ny arivo taona toy ny iray andro.', 'aza hadinoina anefa izao, ry malala: ny iray andro amin’i jehovah dia toy ny arivo taona, ary ny arivo taona toy ny iray andro.'),
  ('6ab25cec2d1c7ef2a44eb505', '2026-09-22T10:48:12.578Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:12.578Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Petera', 61, 3, 7, 'Atokana mba haringana amin’ny afo amin’ny alalan’izany teny izany koa anefa ny lanitra sy ny tany misy amin’izao, ka tehirizina mandra-pahatongan’ny andro hitsarana sy handringanana an’ireo tsy matahotra an’Andriamanitra.', 'atokana mba haringana amin’ny afo amin’ny alalan’izany teny izany koa anefa ny lanitra sy ny tany misy amin’izao, ka tehirizina mandra-pahatongan’ny andro hitsarana sy handringanana an’ireo tsy matahotra an’andriamanitra.'),
  ('6ab25cec2d1c7ef2a44eb4ff', '2026-09-22T10:48:12.578Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:12.578Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Petera', 61, 3, 1, 'Ry malala, ity no taratasy faharoa soratako aminareo. Toy ny tao amin’ilay taratasiko voalohany, dia mampirisika anareo hisaina tsara aho ka mampahatsiahy anareo an’izay efa fantatrareo,', 'ry malala, ity no taratasy faharoa soratako aminareo. toy ny tao amin’ilay taratasiko voalohany, dia mampirisika anareo hisaina tsara aho ka mampahatsiahy anareo an’izay efa fantatrareo,'),
  ('6ab25cec2d1c7ef2a44eb508', '2026-09-22T10:48:12.578Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:12.578Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Petera', 61, 3, 10, 'Ho avy toy ny mpangalatra anefa ny andron’i Jehovah. Amin’izany andro izany dia handalo haingana ny lanitra, ka ho toy ny feon-javatra mirodorodo be ny fandalovany. Ho levona kosa ireo singan-javatra efa mahamay be, ary haharihary ny tany sy ny asa eo aminy.', 'ho avy toy ny mpangalatra anefa ny andron’i jehovah. amin’izany andro izany dia handalo haingana ny lanitra, ka ho toy ny feon-javatra mirodorodo be ny fandalovany. ho levona kosa ireo singan-javatra efa mahamay be, ary haharihary ny tany sy ny asa eo aminy.'),
  ('6ab25cec2d1c7ef2a44eb510', '2026-09-22T10:48:12.578Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:12.578Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Petera', 61, 3, 18, 'Ataovy foana kosa izay hahatonga anareo hanehoana hatsaram-panahy miavaka, sy izay hahalalanareo an’i Jesosy Kristy Tompontsika sy Mpamonjy antsika. Ho azy anie ny voninahitra ankehitriny sy ho mandrakizay! Amena!', 'ataovy foana kosa izay hahatonga anareo hanehoana hatsaram-panahy miavaka, sy izay hahalalanareo an’i jesosy kristy tompontsika sy mpamonjy antsika. ho azy anie ny voninahitra ankehitriny sy ho mandrakizay! amena!'),
  ('6ab25cec2d1c7ef2a44eb50c', '2026-09-22T10:48:12.578Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:12.578Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Petera', 61, 3, 14, 'Noho ianareo miandry an’izany zavatra izany, ry malala, dia ataovy izay rehetra azonareo atao mba ho hitan’Andriamanitra hoe tsy misy pentina sy tsy misy tsininy ary mihavana tsara aminy ianareo, amin’ny farany.', 'noho ianareo miandry an’izany zavatra izany, ry malala, dia ataovy izay rehetra azonareo atao mba ho hitan’andriamanitra hoe tsy misy pentina sy tsy misy tsininy ary mihavana tsara aminy ianareo, amin’ny farany.'),
  ('6ab25cec2d1c7ef2a44eb50a', '2026-09-22T10:48:12.578Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:12.578Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Petera', 61, 3, 12, 'sady hiandry sy hanao an-tsaina foana ny fahatongavan’ny andron’i Jehovah. Noho io andro io, dia ho levon’ny afo ny lanitra ary hitsonika noho ny hafanana mandoro ireo singan-javatra eo aminy.', 'sady hiandry sy hanao an-tsaina foana ny fahatongavan’ny andron’i jehovah. noho io andro io, dia ho levon’ny afo ny lanitra ary hitsonika noho ny hafanana mandoro ireo singan-javatra eo aminy.'),
  ('6ab25cec2d1c7ef2a44eb509', '2026-09-22T10:48:12.578Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:12.578Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Petera', 61, 3, 11, 'Koa satria ho levona toy izany ireo zavatra rehetra ireo, dia diniho hoe olona tokony hanao ahoana ianareo! Tokony hanana fitondran-tena masina sy hahafoy tena ho an’Andriamanitra ianareo,', 'koa satria ho levona toy izany ireo zavatra rehetra ireo, dia diniho hoe olona tokony hanao ahoana ianareo! tokony hanana fitondran-tena masina sy hahafoy tena ho an’andriamanitra ianareo,'),
  ('6ab25cec2d1c7ef2a44eb50b', '2026-09-22T10:48:12.578Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:12.578Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Petera', 61, 3, 13, 'Araka ny nampanantenainy anefa, dia hisy lanitra vaovao sy tany vaovao hanjakan’ny fahamarinana, ary izany no andrasantsika.', 'araka ny nampanantenainy anefa, dia hisy lanitra vaovao sy tany vaovao hanjakan’ny fahamarinana, ary izany no andrasantsika.'),
  ('6ab25cec2d1c7ef2a44eb504', '2026-09-22T10:48:12.578Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:12.578Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Petera', 61, 3, 6, 'Tamin’ny alalan’ireo no nandravana an’ilay tontolo nisy tamin’izany, rehefa safotry ny rano ny tany.', 'tamin’ny alalan’ireo no nandravana an’ilay tontolo nisy tamin’izany, rehefa safotry ny rano ny tany.'),
  ('6ab25cec2d1c7ef2a44eb503', '2026-09-22T10:48:12.578Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:12.578Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Petera', 61, 3, 5, 'Fa odian’izy ireo tsy hita hoe efa nisy hatry ny ela ny lanitra, ary nisy tany mafy tsara koa nipoitra avy tao anaty rano sady teo afovoan’ny rano, noho ny tenin’Andriamanitra.', 'fa odian’izy ireo tsy hita hoe efa nisy hatry ny ela ny lanitra, ary nisy tany mafy tsara koa nipoitra avy tao anaty rano sady teo afovoan’ny rano, noho ny tenin’andriamanitra.'),
  ('6ab25cec2d1c7ef2a44eb501', '2026-09-22T10:48:12.578Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:12.578Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Petera', 61, 3, 3, 'Fantaro aloha izao: Amin’ny andro farany, dia hisy mpaneso hanesoeso sady hanao izay tiany fotsiny,', 'fantaro aloha izao: amin’ny andro farany, dia hisy mpaneso hanesoeso sady hanao izay tiany fotsiny,'),
  ('6ab25cec2d1c7ef2a44eb50d', '2026-09-22T10:48:12.578Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:12.578Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Petera', 61, 3, 15, 'Ankoatra izany, dia hevero ho famonjena ny faharetan’ny Tompontsika. Nanoratra taminareo momba an’izany koa i Paoly rahalahy malalantsika, araka ny fahendrena nomena azy.', 'ankoatra izany, dia hevero ho famonjena ny faharetan’ny tompontsika. nanoratra taminareo momba an’izany koa i paoly rahalahy malalantsika, araka ny fahendrena nomena azy.'),
  ('6ab25cec2d1c7ef2a44eb50e', '2026-09-22T10:48:12.578Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:12.578Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Petera', 61, 3, 16, 'Niresaka momba an’izany zavatra izany izy tao amin’ny taratasy rehetra nosoratany. Sarotra azo anefa ny zavatra sasany ao amin’ireny, ka aolan’ny olona tsy mahatakatra na inona na inona sy tsy miorina tsara, hoatran’ny ataon’izy ireo amin’ny andininy hafa ao amin’ny Soratra Masina. Ho ringana izy ireo noho izany.', 'niresaka momba an’izany zavatra izany izy tao amin’ny taratasy rehetra nosoratany. sarotra azo anefa ny zavatra sasany ao amin’ireny, ka aolan’ny olona tsy mahatakatra na inona na inona sy tsy miorina tsara, hoatran’ny ataon’izy ireo amin’ny andininy hafa ao amin’ny soratra masina. ho ringana izy ireo noho izany.'),
  ('6ab25cec2d1c7ef2a44eb502', '2026-09-22T10:48:12.578Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:12.578Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Petera', 61, 3, 4, 'ka hilaza hoe: “Aiza akory izay fanatrehany eo? Fampanantenana poakaty fotsiny izany! Efa hatramin’ny andro nahafatesan’ny razambentsika no tsy niova ny zava-drehetra, fa mbola mitovy tanteraka amin’izay nisy hatramin’ny namoronana an’izao tontolo izao.”', 'ka hilaza hoe: “aiza akory izay fanatrehany eo? fampanantenana poakaty fotsiny izany! efa hatramin’ny andro nahafatesan’ny razambentsika no tsy niova ny zava-drehetra, fa mbola mitovy tanteraka amin’izay nisy hatramin’ny namoronana an’izao tontolo izao.”'),
  ('6ab25cec2d1c7ef2a44eb500', '2026-09-22T10:48:12.578Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:12.578Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Petera', 61, 3, 2, 'mba ho tadidinareo ny teny efa voalazan’ny mpaminany masina, sy ny didin’ny Tompo sady Mpamonjy izay nampitain’ny apostolinareo.', 'mba ho tadidinareo ny teny efa voalazan’ny mpaminany masina, sy ny didin’ny tompo sady mpamonjy izay nampitain’ny apostolinareo.'),
  ('6ab25cedee5fae932e65c8ba', '2026-09-22T10:48:13.941Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:13.941Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Jaona', 62, 3, 12, 'fa tsy hanao hoatran’i Kaina, izay avy tamin’ilay ratsy ka namono ny rahalahiny. Fa inona no antony namonoany azy? Satria ratsy ny nataony, fa marina kosa ny nataon’ny rahalahiny.', 'fa tsy hanao hoatran’i kaina, izay avy tamin’ilay ratsy ka namono ny rahalahiny. fa inona no antony namonoany azy? satria ratsy ny nataony, fa marina kosa ny nataon’ny rahalahiny.'),
  ('6ab25cedee5fae932e65c8c1', '2026-09-22T10:48:13.941Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:13.941Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Jaona', 62, 3, 19, 'Izany no hahafantarantsika hoe miandany amin’ny fahamarinana isika, ary izany no hanomezantsika toky ny fontsika hoe tiany isika,', 'izany no hahafantarantsika hoe miandany amin’ny fahamarinana isika, ary izany no hanomezantsika toky ny fontsika hoe tiany isika,'),
  ('6ab25cedee5fae932e65c8be', '2026-09-22T10:48:13.941Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:13.941Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Jaona', 62, 3, 16, 'Lasa fantatsika ny atao hoe fitiavana satria nahafoy ny ainy ho antsika izy. Dia tsy maintsy mahafoy ny aintsika ho an’ny rahalahintsika koa isika.', 'lasa fantatsika ny atao hoe fitiavana satria nahafoy ny ainy ho antsika izy. dia tsy maintsy mahafoy ny aintsika ho an’ny rahalahintsika koa isika.'),
  ('6ab25cedee5fae932e65c8b1', '2026-09-22T10:48:13.941Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:13.941Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Jaona', 62, 3, 3, 'Izay manantena azy, dia manadio ny tenany mba hadio hoatr’azy.', 'izay manantena azy, dia manadio ny tenany mba hadio hoatr’azy.'),
  ('6ab25cedee5fae932e65c8bf', '2026-09-22T10:48:13.941Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:13.941Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Jaona', 62, 3, 17, 'Fa raha misy mba manan-katao ihany amin’izao fiainana izao ka mahita hoe sahirana ny rahalahiny, nefa tsy mba mangoraka azy, dia ahoana no ilazany hoe tia an’Andriamanitra izy?', 'fa raha misy mba manan-katao ihany amin’izao fiainana izao ka mahita hoe sahirana ny rahalahiny, nefa tsy mba mangoraka azy, dia ahoana no ilazany hoe tia an’andriamanitra izy?'),
  ('6ab25cedee5fae932e65c8af', '2026-09-22T10:48:13.941Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:13.941Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Jaona', 62, 3, 1, 'Eritrereto ange ny fitiavana nasehon’ny Ray antsika e! Nantsoiny hoe zanany mihitsy isika, ary izany tokoa isika. Izany no antony tsy ahalalan’izao tontolo izao antsika, satria mbola tsy mahalala Azy izao tontolo izao.', 'eritrereto ange ny fitiavana nasehon’ny ray antsika e! nantsoiny hoe zanany mihitsy isika, ary izany tokoa isika. izany no antony tsy ahalalan’izao tontolo izao antsika, satria mbola tsy mahalala azy izao tontolo izao.'),
  ('6ab25cedee5fae932e65c8c3', '2026-09-22T10:48:13.941Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:13.941Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Jaona', 62, 3, 21, 'Ry malala, raha tsy manameloka antsika ny fontsika, dia ho sahy hiresaka amin’Andriamanitra isika.', 'ry malala, raha tsy manameloka antsika ny fontsika, dia ho sahy hiresaka amin’andriamanitra isika.'),
  ('6ab25cedee5fae932e65c8b8', '2026-09-22T10:48:13.941Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:13.941Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Jaona', 62, 3, 10, 'Izao no tena ahitana an’izay zanak’Andriamanitra sy izay zanaky ny Devoly: Izay rehetra tsy manao ny marina dia tsy avy amin’Andriamanitra. Hoatr’izany koa izay tsy tia ny rahalahiny.', 'izao no tena ahitana an’izay zanak’andriamanitra sy izay zanaky ny devoly: izay rehetra tsy manao ny marina dia tsy avy amin’andriamanitra. hoatr’izany koa izay tsy tia ny rahalahiny.'),
  ('6ab25cedee5fae932e65c8c2', '2026-09-22T10:48:13.941Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:13.941Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Jaona', 62, 3, 20, 'na dia manameloka antsika aza ny fontsika. Lehibe noho ny fontsika mantsy Andriamanitra sady mahalala ny zava-drehetra.', 'na dia manameloka antsika aza ny fontsika. lehibe noho ny fontsika mantsy andriamanitra sady mahalala ny zava-drehetra.'),
  ('6ab25cedee5fae932e65c8b4', '2026-09-22T10:48:13.941Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:13.941Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Jaona', 62, 3, 6, 'Tsy zatra manota izay tafaray aminy foana. Izay zatra manota kosa dia sady tsy nahita azy no mbola tsy nahalala azy.', 'tsy zatra manota izay tafaray aminy foana. izay zatra manota kosa dia sady tsy nahita azy no mbola tsy nahalala azy.'),
  ('6ab25cedee5fae932e65c8b3', '2026-09-22T10:48:13.941Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:13.941Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Jaona', 62, 3, 5, 'Fantatrareo koa fa naseho izy mba hanala ny fahotantsika, ary tsy misy ota ao aminy.', 'fantatrareo koa fa naseho izy mba hanala ny fahotantsika, ary tsy misy ota ao aminy.'),
  ('6ab25cedee5fae932e65c8c0', '2026-09-22T10:48:13.941Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:13.941Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Jaona', 62, 3, 18, 'Tsy tokony ho tia amin’ny teny na amin’ny lela fotsiny isika, ry zanako malalako, fa tokony ho tia amin’ny fo kosa, ary tokony hasehontsika amin’ny atao izany.', 'tsy tokony ho tia amin’ny teny na amin’ny lela fotsiny isika, ry zanako malalako, fa tokony ho tia amin’ny fo kosa, ary tokony hasehontsika amin’ny atao izany.');
INSERT INTO "bible_verses" ("id", "created_date", "updated_date", "created_by_id", "created_by", "translation", "book", "bookOrder", "chapter", "verse", "text", "normalizedText") VALUES
  ('6ab25cedee5fae932e65c8bc', '2026-09-22T10:48:13.941Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:13.941Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Jaona', 62, 3, 14, 'Fantatsika fa hoatran’ny hoe efa maty isika taloha, nefa velona indray izao, satria tiantsika ny rahalahintsika. Izay tsy tia kosa dia hoatran’ny hoe maty ihany.', 'fantatsika fa hoatran’ny hoe efa maty isika taloha, nefa velona indray izao, satria tiantsika ny rahalahintsika. izay tsy tia kosa dia hoatran’ny hoe maty ihany.'),
  ('6ab25cedee5fae932e65c8c6', '2026-09-22T10:48:13.941Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:13.941Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Jaona', 62, 3, 24, 'Tafaray aminy foana koa izay mankatò ny didiny, ary izy ho tafaray amin’izany olona izany. Ary ilay fanahy nomeny antsika no ahafantarantsika fa tafaray amintsika foana izy.', 'tafaray aminy foana koa izay mankatò ny didiny, ary izy ho tafaray amin’izany olona izany. ary ilay fanahy nomeny antsika no ahafantarantsika fa tafaray amintsika foana izy.'),
  ('6ab25cedee5fae932e65c8c5', '2026-09-22T10:48:13.941Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:13.941Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Jaona', 62, 3, 23, 'Izao tokoa ny didiny: Tokony hino ny anaran’i Jesosy Kristy Zanany isika sady hifankatia, araka ilay didy nomeny antsika.', 'izao tokoa ny didiny: tokony hino ny anaran’i jesosy kristy zanany isika sady hifankatia, araka ilay didy nomeny antsika.'),
  ('6ab25cedee5fae932e65c8b6', '2026-09-22T10:48:13.941Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:13.941Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Jaona', 62, 3, 8, 'Avy amin’ny Devoly kosa izay zatra manota, satria efa nanota hatrany am-piandohana ny Devoly. Izao àry ny antony nampisehoana ny Zanak’Andriamanitra: Ny handrava ny asan’ny Devoly.', 'avy amin’ny devoly kosa izay zatra manota, satria efa nanota hatrany am-piandohana ny devoly. izao àry ny antony nampisehoana ny zanak’andriamanitra: ny handrava ny asan’ny devoly.'),
  ('6ab25cedee5fae932e65c8bd', '2026-09-22T10:48:13.941Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:13.941Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Jaona', 62, 3, 15, 'Izay rehetra mankahala ny rahalahiny dia mpamono olona, ary fantatrareo fa tsy misy mpamono olona hahazo fiainana mandrakizay.', 'izay rehetra mankahala ny rahalahiny dia mpamono olona, ary fantatrareo fa tsy misy mpamono olona hahazo fiainana mandrakizay.'),
  ('6ab25cedee5fae932e65c8bb', '2026-09-22T10:48:13.941Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:13.941Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Jaona', 62, 3, 13, 'Aza gaga, ry rahalahy, raha halan’izao tontolo izao ianareo.', 'aza gaga, ry rahalahy, raha halan’izao tontolo izao ianareo.'),
  ('6ab25cedee5fae932e65c8b9', '2026-09-22T10:48:13.941Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:13.941Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Jaona', 62, 3, 11, 'Izao no hafatra efa henonareo hatrany am-piandohana: Tokony hifankatia isika,', 'izao no hafatra efa henonareo hatrany am-piandohana: tokony hifankatia isika,'),
  ('6ab25cedee5fae932e65c8c4', '2026-09-22T10:48:13.941Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:13.941Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Jaona', 62, 3, 22, 'Ary na inona na inona angatahintsika, dia azontsika avy aminy izany, satria mankatò ny didiny isika sady manao izay mahafinaritra azy.', 'ary na inona na inona angatahintsika, dia azontsika avy aminy izany, satria mankatò ny didiny isika sady manao izay mahafinaritra azy.'),
  ('6ab25cedee5fae932e65c8b7', '2026-09-22T10:48:13.941Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:13.941Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Jaona', 62, 3, 9, 'Tsy zatra manota izay rehetra naterak’Andriamanitra, satria ao amin’izany olona izany foana ny voa omen’Andriamanitra. Tsy ho zatra manota àry izy, satria naterak’Andriamanitra.', 'tsy zatra manota izay rehetra naterak’andriamanitra, satria ao amin’izany olona izany foana ny voa omen’andriamanitra. tsy ho zatra manota àry izy, satria naterak’andriamanitra.'),
  ('6ab25cedee5fae932e65c8b5', '2026-09-22T10:48:13.941Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:13.941Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Jaona', 62, 3, 7, 'Aza avela hisy hamitaka anareo, ry zanako malalako. Izay manao ny marina no olo-marina, satria marina koa i Jesosy.', 'aza avela hisy hamitaka anareo, ry zanako malalako. izay manao ny marina no olo-marina, satria marina koa i jesosy.'),
  ('6ab25cedee5fae932e65c8b2', '2026-09-22T10:48:13.941Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:13.941Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Jaona', 62, 3, 4, 'Izay rehetra zatra manota dia zatra mandika lalàna koa, ary mandika lalàna izay manota.', 'izay rehetra zatra manota dia zatra mandika lalàna koa, ary mandika lalàna izay manota.'),
  ('6ab25cedee5fae932e65c8b0', '2026-09-22T10:48:13.941Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:13.941Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Jaona', 62, 3, 2, 'Ry malala, zanak’Andriamanitra izao isika, nefa mbola tsy aseho hoe hanao ahoana isika. Ny fantatsika dia hoe ho lasa hoatr’azy isika rehefa aseho izy, satria ho hitantsika hoe hoatran’ny ahoana marina izy.', 'ry malala, zanak’andriamanitra izao isika, nefa mbola tsy aseho hoe hanao ahoana isika. ny fantatsika dia hoe ho lasa hoatr’azy isika rehefa aseho izy, satria ho hitantsika hoe hoatran’ny ahoana marina izy.'),
  ('6ab25cee3e4eef8b131b5151', '2026-09-22T10:48:14.957Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:14.957Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Jaona', 62, 5, 12, 'Izay manaiky ny Zanaka no hahazo an’io fiainana io, fa izay tsy manaiky ny Zanak’Andriamanitra kosa tsy hahazo an’io fiainana io.', 'izay manaiky ny zanaka no hahazo an’io fiainana io, fa izay tsy manaiky ny zanak’andriamanitra kosa tsy hahazo an’io fiainana io.'),
  ('6ab25cee3e4eef8b131b514f', '2026-09-22T10:48:14.957Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:14.957Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Jaona', 62, 5, 10, 'Izay mino ny Zanak’Andriamanitra dia manaiky ao am-pony ny teny nolazain’Andriamanitra taminy. Izay tsy mino an’Andriamanitra kosa dia manao an’Andriamanitra ho mpandainga, satria tsy mino an’izay nolazainy momba ny Zanany.', 'izay mino ny zanak’andriamanitra dia manaiky ao am-pony ny teny nolazain’andriamanitra taminy. izay tsy mino an’andriamanitra kosa dia manao an’andriamanitra ho mpandainga, satria tsy mino an’izay nolazainy momba ny zanany.'),
  ('6ab25cee3e4eef8b131b5158', '2026-09-22T10:48:14.957Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:14.957Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Jaona', 62, 5, 19, 'Fantatsika fa avy amin’Andriamanitra isika, fa izao tontolo izao manontolo kosa eo ambany fahefan’ilay ratsy.', 'fantatsika fa avy amin’andriamanitra isika, fa izao tontolo izao manontolo kosa eo ambany fahefan’ilay ratsy.'),
  ('6ab25cee3e4eef8b131b5149', '2026-09-22T10:48:14.957Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:14.957Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Jaona', 62, 5, 4, 'Mandresy an’izao tontolo izao mantsy izay rehetra naterak’Andriamanitra. Ary ny ahafahantsika mandresy an’izao tontolo izao dia ny finoantsika.', 'mandresy an’izao tontolo izao mantsy izay rehetra naterak’andriamanitra. ary ny ahafahantsika mandresy an’izao tontolo izao dia ny finoantsika.'),
