  ('6ab25cee3e4eef8b131b5150', '2026-09-22T10:48:14.957Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:14.957Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Jaona', 62, 5, 11, 'Izao ilay teny nolazain’Andriamanitra: Nanome antsika fiainana mandrakizay Izy, ary amin’ny alalan’ny Zanany no hahazoantsika an’izany fiainana izany.', 'izao ilay teny nolazain’andriamanitra: nanome antsika fiainana mandrakizay izy, ary amin’ny alalan’ny zanany no hahazoantsika an’izany fiainana izany.'),
  ('6ab25cee3e4eef8b131b515a', '2026-09-22T10:48:14.957Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:14.957Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Jaona', 62, 5, 21, 'Ry zanako malalako, mitandrema amin’ny sampy.', 'ry zanako malalako, mitandrema amin’ny sampy.'),
  ('6ab25cee3e4eef8b131b514a', '2026-09-22T10:48:14.957Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:14.957Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Jaona', 62, 5, 5, 'Iza moa no afaka mandresy an’izao tontolo izao? Izay mino hoe i Jesosy no Zanak’Andriamanitra.', 'iza moa no afaka mandresy an’izao tontolo izao? izay mino hoe i jesosy no zanak’andriamanitra.'),
  ('6ab25cee3e4eef8b131b5148', '2026-09-22T10:48:14.957Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:14.957Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Jaona', 62, 5, 3, 'Fa izao no atao hoe tia an’Andriamanitra: Mankatò ny didiny. Ary tsy mavesatra ny didiny.', 'fa izao no atao hoe tia an’andriamanitra: mankatò ny didiny. ary tsy mavesatra ny didiny.'),
  ('6ab25cee3e4eef8b131b514c', '2026-09-22T10:48:14.957Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:14.957Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Jaona', 62, 5, 7, 'Ireto telo ireto mantsy no vavolombelona:', 'ireto telo ireto mantsy no vavolombelona:'),
  ('6ab25cee3e4eef8b131b5156', '2026-09-22T10:48:14.957Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:14.957Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Jaona', 62, 5, 17, 'Ota daholo izay zavatra tsy marina ataon’ny olona, kanefa misy ota tsy mahafaty.', 'ota daholo izay zavatra tsy marina ataon’ny olona, kanefa misy ota tsy mahafaty.'),
  ('6ab25cee3e4eef8b131b514e', '2026-09-22T10:48:14.957Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:14.957Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Jaona', 62, 5, 9, 'Manaiky an’izay lazain’ny olona isika, nefa izay lazain’Andriamanitra no mbola ambony kokoa. Ny zavatra lazain’Andriamanitra mantsy dia izay nolazainy momba ny Zanany.', 'manaiky an’izay lazain’ny olona isika, nefa izay lazain’andriamanitra no mbola ambony kokoa. ny zavatra lazain’andriamanitra mantsy dia izay nolazainy momba ny zanany.'),
  ('6ab25cee3e4eef8b131b5155', '2026-09-22T10:48:14.957Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:14.957Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Jaona', 62, 5, 16, 'Izay mahita ny rahalahiny manao ota tsy mahafaty, dia tokony hangataka ho an’ilay rahalahiny. Ary homen’Andriamanitra fiainana ilay rahalahiny, dia izay tsy manao ota mahafaty. Misy ota mahafaty mantsy. Tsy mampirisika na iza na iza hivavaka momba an’izany ota izany aho.', 'izay mahita ny rahalahiny manao ota tsy mahafaty, dia tokony hangataka ho an’ilay rahalahiny. ary homen’andriamanitra fiainana ilay rahalahiny, dia izay tsy manao ota mahafaty. misy ota mahafaty mantsy. tsy mampirisika na iza na iza hivavaka momba an’izany ota izany aho.'),
  ('6ab25cee3e4eef8b131b514d', '2026-09-22T10:48:14.957Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:14.957Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Jaona', 62, 5, 8, 'Ny fanahy sy ny rano ary ny ra. Ary mifanaraka tsara izy telo ireo.', 'ny fanahy sy ny rano ary ny ra. ary mifanaraka tsara izy telo ireo.'),
  ('6ab25cee3e4eef8b131b5146', '2026-09-22T10:48:14.957Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:14.957Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Jaona', 62, 5, 1, 'Izay rehetra mino fa i Jesosy no Kristy, dia naterak’Andriamanitra. Ary izay rehetra tia an’ilay Ray dia tia an’izay naterany koa.', 'izay rehetra mino fa i jesosy no kristy, dia naterak’andriamanitra. ary izay rehetra tia an’ilay ray dia tia an’izay naterany koa.'),
  ('6ab25cee3e4eef8b131b5153', '2026-09-22T10:48:14.957Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:14.957Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Jaona', 62, 5, 14, 'Izao ny toky ananantsika momba an’Andriamanitra: Na inona na inona angatahintsika aminy ka mifanaraka amin’ny sitrapony, dia mihaino antsika izy.', 'izao ny toky ananantsika momba an’andriamanitra: na inona na inona angatahintsika aminy ka mifanaraka amin’ny sitrapony, dia mihaino antsika izy.'),
  ('6ab25cee3e4eef8b131b514b', '2026-09-22T10:48:14.957Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:14.957Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Jaona', 62, 5, 6, 'Tamin’ny alalan’ny rano sy ny ra no nahatongavan’i Jesosy Kristy. Tsy tamin’ny alalan’ny rano ihany, fa tamin’ny alalan’ny rano sy ny ra. Ary ny fanahy no mijoro ho vavolombelona, satria ny fahamarinana.', 'tamin’ny alalan’ny rano sy ny ra no nahatongavan’i jesosy kristy. tsy tamin’ny alalan’ny rano ihany, fa tamin’ny alalan’ny rano sy ny ra. ary ny fanahy no mijoro ho vavolombelona, satria ny fahamarinana.'),
  ('6ab25cee3e4eef8b131b5147', '2026-09-22T10:48:14.957Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:14.957Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Jaona', 62, 5, 2, 'Izao no ahafantarantsika hoe tia an’ireo zanak’Andriamanitra isika: Tia an’Andriamanitra isika, ary manaraka ny didiny.', 'izao no ahafantarantsika hoe tia an’ireo zanak’andriamanitra isika: tia an’andriamanitra isika, ary manaraka ny didiny.'),
  ('6ab25cee3e4eef8b131b5154', '2026-09-22T10:48:14.957Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:14.957Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Jaona', 62, 5, 15, 'Ary raha fantatsika fa mihaino antsika izy na inona na inona angatahintsika, dia fantatsika fa tena ho azontsika izay angatahintsika, satria nangatahintsika taminy.', 'ary raha fantatsika fa mihaino antsika izy na inona na inona angatahintsika, dia fantatsika fa tena ho azontsika izay angatahintsika, satria nangatahintsika taminy.'),
  ('6ab25cee3e4eef8b131b5159', '2026-09-22T10:48:14.957Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:14.957Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Jaona', 62, 5, 20, 'Fantatsika anefa fa efa tonga ny Zanak’Andriamanitra, ary nomeny fahiratan-tsaina isika mba hahalala an’ilay tena Andriamanitra. Ary amin’ny alalan’i Jesosy Kristy Zanany isika no tafaray amin’ilay tena izy, dia ilay tena Andriamanitra sady mpanome fiainana mandrakizay.', 'fantatsika anefa fa efa tonga ny zanak’andriamanitra, ary nomeny fahiratan-tsaina isika mba hahalala an’ilay tena andriamanitra. ary amin’ny alalan’i jesosy kristy zanany isika no tafaray amin’ilay tena izy, dia ilay tena andriamanitra sady mpanome fiainana mandrakizay.'),
  ('6ab25cee3e4eef8b131b5157', '2026-09-22T10:48:14.957Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:14.957Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '1 Jaona', 62, 5, 18, 'Fantatsika fa tsy zatra manota izay rehetra naterak’Andriamanitra. Miaro azy ilay naterak’Andriamanitra, ka tsy afaka mifehy azy ilay ratsy.', 'fantatsika fa tsy zatra manota izay rehetra naterak’andriamanitra. miaro azy ilay naterak’andriamanitra, ka tsy afaka mifehy azy ilay ratsy.'),
  ('6ab25ceff2a7cd96dd2e73ca', '2026-09-22T10:48:15.623Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:15.623Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Jaona', 63, 1, 7, 'Be dia be mantsy ny mpamitaka eto amin’izao tontolo izao, izany hoe ny olona tsy manaiky hoe nofo aman-dra i Jesosy Kristy tamin’izy tonga teto an-tany. Ireo no mpamitaka sy antikristy.', 'be dia be mantsy ny mpamitaka eto amin’izao tontolo izao, izany hoe ny olona tsy manaiky hoe nofo aman-dra i jesosy kristy tamin’izy tonga teto an-tany. ireo no mpamitaka sy antikristy.'),
  ('6ab25ceff2a7cd96dd2e73c7', '2026-09-22T10:48:15.623Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:15.623Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Jaona', 63, 1, 4, 'Tena faly be mihitsy aho nahafantatra fa manaraka ny fahamarinana ny zanakao sasany, araka ny didy azontsika tamin’ny Ray.', 'tena faly be mihitsy aho nahafantatra fa manaraka ny fahamarinana ny zanakao sasany, araka ny didy azontsika tamin’ny ray.'),
  ('6ab25ceff2a7cd96dd2e73c8', '2026-09-22T10:48:15.623Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:15.623Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Jaona', 63, 1, 5, 'Izao àry no angatahiko aminao, ry vehivavy voafidy: Andao isika rehetra hifankatia.—Tsy didy vaovao anefa izao soratako aminao izao, fa didy efa azontsika hatramin’ny voalohany.—', 'izao àry no angatahiko aminao, ry vehivavy voafidy: andao isika rehetra hifankatia.—tsy didy vaovao anefa izao soratako aminao izao, fa didy efa azontsika hatramin’ny voalohany.—'),
  ('6ab25ceff2a7cd96dd2e73cc', '2026-09-22T10:48:15.623Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:15.623Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Jaona', 63, 1, 9, 'Izay rehetra mihoa-pefy ka tsy manaraka an’izay nampianarin’i Kristy intsony, dia tsy manaiky an’Andriamanitra. Izay manaraka an’izany fampianarana izany foana kosa no manaiky ny Ray sy ny Zanaka.', 'izay rehetra mihoa-pefy ka tsy manaraka an’izay nampianarin’i kristy intsony, dia tsy manaiky an’andriamanitra. izay manaraka an’izany fampianarana izany foana kosa no manaiky ny ray sy ny zanaka.'),
  ('6ab25ceff2a7cd96dd2e73c6', '2026-09-22T10:48:15.623Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:15.623Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Jaona', 63, 1, 3, 'Haneho hatsaram-panahy miavaka sy hamindra fo amintsika ilay Andriamanitra Ray sy Jesosy Kristy Zanaky ny Ray, sady hanome fiadanana antsika. Hampianatra antsika ny fahamarinana koa izy ireo sady ho tia antsika.', 'haneho hatsaram-panahy miavaka sy hamindra fo amintsika ilay andriamanitra ray sy jesosy kristy zanaky ny ray, sady hanome fiadanana antsika. hampianatra antsika ny fahamarinana koa izy ireo sady ho tia antsika.'),
  ('6ab25ceff2a7cd96dd2e73c4', '2026-09-22T10:48:15.623Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:15.623Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Jaona', 63, 1, 1, 'Izaho, ilay zokiolona, no manoratra ho an’ilay vehivavy voafidy sy ny zanany. Tena tia anareo aho, ary tsy izaho ihany, fa izay rehetra efa mahalala ny fahamarinana koa.', 'izaho, ilay zokiolona, no manoratra ho an’ilay vehivavy voafidy sy ny zanany. tena tia anareo aho, ary tsy izaho ihany, fa izay rehetra efa mahalala ny fahamarinana koa.'),
  ('6ab25ceff2a7cd96dd2e73ce', '2026-09-22T10:48:15.623Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:15.623Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Jaona', 63, 1, 11, 'Lasa manohana ny ratsy ataony mantsy izay miarahaba azy.', 'lasa manohana ny ratsy ataony mantsy izay miarahaba azy.'),
  ('6ab25ceff2a7cd96dd2e73d0', '2026-09-22T10:48:15.623Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:15.623Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Jaona', 63, 1, 13, 'Mampamangy, hono, ianao, hoy ny zanak’ilay rahavavinao, dia ilay rahavavinao voafidy.', 'mampamangy, hono, ianao, hoy ny zanak’ilay rahavavinao, dia ilay rahavavinao voafidy.'),
  ('6ab25ceff2a7cd96dd2e73cb', '2026-09-22T10:48:15.623Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:15.623Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Jaona', 63, 1, 8, 'Tandremo sao lasa very maina ny vokatry ny ezaka nataonay, fa ataovy kosa izay hahazoanareo ny valisoa rehetra.', 'tandremo sao lasa very maina ny vokatry ny ezaka nataonay, fa ataovy kosa izay hahazoanareo ny valisoa rehetra.'),
  ('6ab25ceff2a7cd96dd2e73cf', '2026-09-22T10:48:15.623Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:15.623Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Jaona', 63, 1, 12, 'Be dia be ny zavatra tiako hosoratana aminareo. Tsy tiako hosoratana amin’ny taratasy sy ranomainty anefa izany, fa manantena aho hoe ho tonga any dia hiresaka mivantana aminareo, mba ho faly be mihitsy ianareo.', 'be dia be ny zavatra tiako hosoratana aminareo. tsy tiako hosoratana amin’ny taratasy sy ranomainty anefa izany, fa manantena aho hoe ho tonga any dia hiresaka mivantana aminareo, mba ho faly be mihitsy ianareo.'),
  ('6ab25ceff2a7cd96dd2e73c9', '2026-09-22T10:48:15.623Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:15.623Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Jaona', 63, 1, 6, 'Ny atao hoe tia dia mankatò ny didin’ny Ray foana. Izao ilay didy efa henonareo hatramin’ny voalohany: Tokony hifankatia foana ianareo.', 'ny atao hoe tia dia mankatò ny didin’ny ray foana. izao ilay didy efa henonareo hatramin’ny voalohany: tokony hifankatia foana ianareo.'),
  ('6ab25ceff2a7cd96dd2e73c5', '2026-09-22T10:48:15.623Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:15.623Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Jaona', 63, 1, 2, 'Tianay ianareo noho ilay fahamarinana efa ao am-pontsika ary mbola ho ao am-pontsika mandrakizay.', 'tianay ianareo noho ilay fahamarinana efa ao am-pontsika ary mbola ho ao am-pontsika mandrakizay.'),
  ('6ab25ceff2a7cd96dd2e73cd', '2026-09-22T10:48:15.623Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:15.623Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '2 Jaona', 63, 1, 10, 'Raha misy tonga eo aminareo ka tsy mampianatra an’izany fampianarana izany, dia aza mampiantrano na miarahaba azy akory.', 'raha misy tonga eo aminareo ka tsy mampianatra an’izany fampianarana izany, dia aza mampiantrano na miarahaba azy akory.'),
  ('6ab25cf0dc776a5e94891251', '2026-09-22T10:48:16.216Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:16.216Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '3 Jaona', 64, 1, 9, 'Nisy zavatra nosoratako ho an’ny fiangonana, saingy te ho lohany eo aminareo i Diotrefa, ka tsy mba nisy nohajainy na nekeny izay noteneninay.', 'nisy zavatra nosoratako ho an’ny fiangonana, saingy te ho lohany eo aminareo i diotrefa, ka tsy mba nisy nohajainy na nekeny izay noteneninay.'),
  ('6ab25cf0dc776a5e9489124c', '2026-09-22T10:48:16.216Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:16.216Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '3 Jaona', 64, 1, 4, 'Tsy misy mahafaly ahy noho ny maheno hoe tsy miala amin’ny fahamarinana mihitsy ny zanako.', 'tsy misy mahafaly ahy noho ny maheno hoe tsy miala amin’ny fahamarinana mihitsy ny zanako.'),
  ('6ab25cf0dc776a5e9489124f', '2026-09-22T10:48:16.216Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:16.216Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '3 Jaona', 64, 1, 7, 'Noho ny anaran’Andriamanitra mantsy no nandehanany, ary tsy naka zavatra avy tamin’ny olona eo amin’izao tontolo izao izy ireny, na inona izany na inona.', 'noho ny anaran’andriamanitra mantsy no nandehanany, ary tsy naka zavatra avy tamin’ny olona eo amin’izao tontolo izao izy ireny, na inona izany na inona.'),
  ('6ab25cf0dc776a5e94891255', '2026-09-22T10:48:16.216Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:16.216Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '3 Jaona', 64, 1, 13, 'Be dia be ny zavatra noeritreretiko hosoratana taminao, saingy tsy te hanoratra aminao amin’ny penina sy ny ranomainty intsony aho.', 'be dia be ny zavatra noeritreretiko hosoratana taminao, saingy tsy te hanoratra aminao amin’ny penina sy ny ranomainty intsony aho.'),
  ('6ab25cf0dc776a5e9489124b', '2026-09-22T10:48:16.216Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:16.216Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '3 Jaona', 64, 1, 3, 'Tena faly be aho mantsy rehefa nisy rahalahy tonga nitantara hoe mbola mifikitra amin’ny fahamarinana foana ianao, hoatran’ny efa nataonao hatramin’izay.', 'tena faly be aho mantsy rehefa nisy rahalahy tonga nitantara hoe mbola mifikitra amin’ny fahamarinana foana ianao, hoatran’ny efa nataonao hatramin’izay.'),
  ('6ab25cf0dc776a5e94891254', '2026-09-22T10:48:16.216Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:16.216Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '3 Jaona', 64, 1, 12, 'Tsara laza teo amin’ny mpiara-manompo rehetra i Demetrio sady mampihatra ny fahamarinana. Izahay koa vavolombelona manamarina an’izany, raha ny marina, ary fantatrao fa marina izay lazainay.', 'tsara laza teo amin’ny mpiara-manompo rehetra i demetrio sady mampihatra ny fahamarinana. izahay koa vavolombelona manamarina an’izany, raha ny marina, ary fantatrao fa marina izay lazainay.'),
  ('6ab25cf0dc776a5e94891250', '2026-09-22T10:48:16.216Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:16.216Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '3 Jaona', 64, 1, 8, 'Tsy maintsy mampiantrano sy mandray tsara azy ireny àry isika, mba ho mpiara-miasa aminy ao amin’ny fahamarinana.', 'tsy maintsy mampiantrano sy mandray tsara azy ireny àry isika, mba ho mpiara-miasa aminy ao amin’ny fahamarinana.'),
  ('6ab25cf0dc776a5e9489124e', '2026-09-22T10:48:16.216Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:16.216Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '3 Jaona', 64, 1, 6, 'Notantarain-dry zareo teo anatrehan’ny fiangonana ny fitiavana nasehonao. Mba karakarao tsara izy ireny rehefa handeha, ka ataovy araka izay itiavan’Andriamanitra azy izany.', 'notantarain-dry zareo teo anatrehan’ny fiangonana ny fitiavana nasehonao. mba karakarao tsara izy ireny rehefa handeha, ka ataovy araka izay itiavan’andriamanitra azy izany.'),
  ('6ab25cf0dc776a5e94891256', '2026-09-22T10:48:16.216Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:16.216Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '3 Jaona', 64, 1, 14, 'Manantena ny hahita anao tsy ho ela anefa aho, dia hiresaka mivantana isika. Enga anie ianao hahazo fiadanana! Mampamangy, hono, ianao, hoy ny namana atỳ. Mampamangy any amin’ny namana tsirairay any, araka ny anarany avy.', 'manantena ny hahita anao tsy ho ela anefa aho, dia hiresaka mivantana isika. enga anie ianao hahazo fiadanana! mampamangy, hono, ianao, hoy ny namana atỳ. mampamangy any amin’ny namana tsirairay any, araka ny anarany avy.'),
  ('6ab25cf0dc776a5e9489124d', '2026-09-22T10:48:16.216Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:16.216Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '3 Jaona', 64, 1, 5, 'Ry rahalahy malala, hita hoe tsy mivadika ianao amin’izay ataonao ho an’ireo rahalahy, na dia tsy fantatrao akory aza ry zareo.', 'ry rahalahy malala, hita hoe tsy mivadika ianao amin’izay ataonao ho an’ireo rahalahy, na dia tsy fantatrao akory aza ry zareo.'),
  ('6ab25cf0dc776a5e9489124a', '2026-09-22T10:48:16.216Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:16.216Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '3 Jaona', 64, 1, 2, 'Ry malala, mivavaka ho anao aho mba handeha tsara foana ny zava-drehetra, hoatran’ny amin’izao, ary mba ho salama tsara ianao.', 'ry malala, mivavaka ho anao aho mba handeha tsara foana ny zava-drehetra, hoatran’ny amin’izao, ary mba ho salama tsara ianao.'),
  ('6ab25cf0dc776a5e94891253', '2026-09-22T10:48:16.216Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:16.216Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '3 Jaona', 64, 1, 11, 'Ry rahalahy malala, aza ny ratsy no alain-tahaka fa ny tsara. Avy amin’Andriamanitra mantsy izay manao ny tsara. Tsy mahita an’Andriamanitra izay manao ratsy.', 'ry rahalahy malala, aza ny ratsy no alain-tahaka fa ny tsara. avy amin’andriamanitra mantsy izay manao ny tsara. tsy mahita an’andriamanitra izay manao ratsy.'),
  ('6ab25cf0dc776a5e94891252', '2026-09-22T10:48:16.216Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:16.216Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '3 Jaona', 64, 1, 10, 'Raha tonga any àry aho, dia hampahafantariko tsara ny zavatra mbola ataony. Manaratsy anay foana mantsy izy, ary tsy vitan’izay fa tsy mety mandray tsara an’ireo rahalahy sady tsy manaja azy ireo. Dia izay te handray azy ireo indray tadiaviny hosakanana sy horoahina tsy ho anisan’ny fiangonana.', 'raha tonga any àry aho, dia hampahafantariko tsara ny zavatra mbola ataony. manaratsy anay foana mantsy izy, ary tsy vitan’izay fa tsy mety mandray tsara an’ireo rahalahy sady tsy manaja azy ireo. dia izay te handray azy ireo indray tadiaviny hosakanana sy horoahina tsy ho anisan’ny fiangonana.'),
  ('6ab25cf0dc776a5e94891249', '2026-09-22T10:48:16.216Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:16.216Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', '3 Jaona', 64, 1, 1, 'Izaho, ilay zokiolona, no manoratra ho an’i Gaio, rahalahy malala tena tiako.', 'izaho, ilay zokiolona, no manoratra ho an’i gaio, rahalahy malala tena tiako.'),
  ('6ab25cf0ff3ebdc47f06dbb6', '2026-09-22T10:48:16.636Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:16.636Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Joda', 65, 1, 20, 'Hatanjaho kosa ny finoanareo masina, ry malala, dia avelao hiasa aminareo ny fanahy masina rehefa mivavaka ianareo,', 'hatanjaho kosa ny finoanareo masina, ry malala, dia avelao hiasa aminareo ny fanahy masina rehefa mivavaka ianareo,'),
  ('6ab25cf0ff3ebdc47f06dbb2', '2026-09-22T10:48:16.636Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:16.636Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Joda', 65, 1, 16, 'Mpimenomenona sady be taraina momba ny fiainany ireny olona ireny, ary manao izay danin’ny kibony fotsiny. Tena matin-kambo izy ireny ary tia mandokadoka olona mba hahazoana tombontsoa.', 'mpimenomenona sady be taraina momba ny fiainany ireny olona ireny, ary manao izay danin’ny kibony fotsiny. tena matin-kambo izy ireny ary tia mandokadoka olona mba hahazoana tombontsoa.'),
  ('6ab25cf0ff3ebdc47f06dbb3', '2026-09-22T10:48:16.636Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:16.636Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Joda', 65, 1, 17, 'Fa ianareo kosa, ry malala, tadidio ny teny efa nolazain’ny apostolin’i Jesosy Kristy Tompontsika.', 'fa ianareo kosa, ry malala, tadidio ny teny efa nolazain’ny apostolin’i jesosy kristy tompontsika.'),
  ('6ab25cf0ff3ebdc47f06dbb5', '2026-09-22T10:48:16.636Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:16.636Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Joda', 65, 1, 19, 'Ireny no mahatonga ny fiangonana tsy hiray saina. Olona araka ny nofo izy ireny, fa tsy manana ny fanahin’Andriamanitra.', 'ireny no mahatonga ny fiangonana tsy hiray saina. olona araka ny nofo izy ireny, fa tsy manana ny fanahin’andriamanitra.'),
  ('6ab25cf0ff3ebdc47f06dba8', '2026-09-22T10:48:16.636Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:16.636Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Joda', 65, 1, 6, 'Nofatorany mandrakizay ao amin’ny toerana maizim-be koa ny anjely sasany, mba hotsaraina amin’ilay andro lehibe. Niala tamin’ny andraikitra nampanaovina azy mantsy izy ireny, sady nandao ny toerana nipetrahany.', 'nofatorany mandrakizay ao amin’ny toerana maizim-be koa ny anjely sasany, mba hotsaraina amin’ilay andro lehibe. niala tamin’ny andraikitra nampanaovina azy mantsy izy ireny, sady nandao ny toerana nipetrahany.'),
  ('6ab25cf0ff3ebdc47f06dbba', '2026-09-22T10:48:16.636Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:16.636Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Joda', 65, 1, 24, 'Ilay Andriamanitsika be voninahitra dia afaka manampy anareo mba tsy hisy tsiny eo anatrehany, amin’izay ianareo ho faly be. Afaka manampy anareo tsy hanota koa izy.', 'ilay andriamanitsika be voninahitra dia afaka manampy anareo mba tsy hisy tsiny eo anatrehany, amin’izay ianareo ho faly be. afaka manampy anareo tsy hanota koa izy.'),
  ('6ab25cf0ff3ebdc47f06dbb1', '2026-09-22T10:48:16.636Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:16.636Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Joda', 65, 1, 15, 'mba hitsara ny olona rehetra sy hanasazy an’izay rehetra tsy matahotra an’Andriamanitra. Hosazin’Andriamanitra ireny mpanota ireny noho ny zava-dratsy rehetra nataony sy ny teny fanaratsiana rehetra nolazainy.”', 'mba hitsara ny olona rehetra sy hanasazy an’izay rehetra tsy matahotra an’andriamanitra. hosazin’andriamanitra ireny mpanota ireny noho ny zava-dratsy rehetra nataony sy ny teny fanaratsiana rehetra nolazainy.”'),
  ('6ab25cf0ff3ebdc47f06dbb9', '2026-09-22T10:48:16.636Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:16.636Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Joda', 65, 1, 23, 'Vonjeo izy ka sintony haingana avy ao anaty afo. Miezaha foana hamindra fo amin’ny olon-kafa nefa mitandrema ihany ka ankahalao ny fitondran-tena voapentin’ny ota.', 'vonjeo izy ka sintony haingana avy ao anaty afo. miezaha foana hamindra fo amin’ny olon-kafa nefa mitandrema ihany ka ankahalao ny fitondran-tena voapentin’ny ota.'),
  ('6ab25cf0ff3ebdc47f06dbae', '2026-09-22T10:48:16.636Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:16.636Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Joda', 65, 1, 12, 'Harambato voasaron’ny rano izy ireny, ao amin’ny fanasam-pifankatiavana ataonareo, rehefa miara-manao fety aminareo. Mpiandry ondry tsy mahalala afa-tsy ny tenany koa ireny, sady tsisy tahotra akory. Rahona tsy mitondra orana sady avezivezin’ny rivotra ireny, ary hazo tsy mamoa amin’ny fotoanany, izay maty tanteraka ka nongotana.', 'harambato voasaron’ny rano izy ireny, ao amin’ny fanasam-pifankatiavana ataonareo, rehefa miara-manao fety aminareo. mpiandry ondry tsy mahalala afa-tsy ny tenany koa ireny, sady tsisy tahotra akory. rahona tsy mitondra orana sady avezivezin’ny rivotra ireny, ary hazo tsy mamoa amin’ny fotoanany, izay maty tanteraka ka nongotana.'),
  ('6ab25cf0ff3ebdc47f06dba9', '2026-09-22T10:48:16.636Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:16.636Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Joda', 65, 1, 7, 'Nanao hoatran’ireny anjely ireny koa i Sodoma sy Gomora ary ny tanàna nanodidina azy. Nanaram-po tamin’ny fijangajangana tena mamoafady mantsy izy ireo, sady nanatanteraka ny fanirian’ny nofony mba hanao zavatra tsy fanao. Afo maharitra mandrakizay no saziny, ka lasa anatra ho antsika izy ireo.', 'nanao hoatran’ireny anjely ireny koa i sodoma sy gomora ary ny tanàna nanodidina azy. nanaram-po tamin’ny fijangajangana tena mamoafady mantsy izy ireo, sady nanatanteraka ny fanirian’ny nofony mba hanao zavatra tsy fanao. afo maharitra mandrakizay no saziny, ka lasa anatra ho antsika izy ireo.'),
  ('6ab25cf0ff3ebdc47f06dbb4', '2026-09-22T10:48:16.636Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:16.636Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Joda', 65, 1, 18, 'Nilaza taminareo foana mantsy izy ireo hoe: “Amin’ny andro farany, dia hisy mpaneso hanatanteraka ny faniriany hanao ratsy.”', 'nilaza taminareo foana mantsy izy ireo hoe: “amin’ny andro farany, dia hisy mpaneso hanatanteraka ny faniriany hanao ratsy.”'),
  ('6ab25cf0ff3ebdc47f06dbaf', '2026-09-22T10:48:16.636Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:16.636Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Joda', 65, 1, 13, 'Onjan-dranomasina misamboaravoara sady mamoaka loto izy ireny, ary tokony hahamenatra azy izany. Kintana mirenireny koa ireny, ary efa voatokana mandrakizay ho ao amin’ny toerana faran’izay maizina.', 'onjan-dranomasina misamboaravoara sady mamoaka loto izy ireny, ary tokony hahamenatra azy izany. kintana mirenireny koa ireny, ary efa voatokana mandrakizay ho ao amin’ny toerana faran’izay maizina.'),
  ('6ab25cf0ff3ebdc47f06dbac', '2026-09-22T10:48:16.636Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:16.636Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Joda', 65, 1, 10, 'Ireny olona ireny anefa manaratsy ny zava-drehetra tsy takatry ny sainy akory. Hoatran’ny biby tsy misaina izy ireny ka manao hoatran’ny fanaon’ny biby amin’ny zava-drehetra ataony, dia lasa manimba tena.', 'ireny olona ireny anefa manaratsy ny zava-drehetra tsy takatry ny sainy akory. hoatran’ny biby tsy misaina izy ireny ka manao hoatran’ny fanaon’ny biby amin’ny zava-drehetra ataony, dia lasa manimba tena.'),
  ('6ab25cf0ff3ebdc47f06dba3', '2026-09-22T10:48:16.636Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:16.636Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Joda', 65, 1, 1, 'Avy amin’i Joda, mpanompon’i Jesosy Kristy sady rahalahin’i Jakoba. Ho an’ireo nofidin’Andriamanitra Ray sady tiany, ary arovany ho an’i Jesosy Kristy,', 'avy amin’i joda, mpanompon’i jesosy kristy sady rahalahin’i jakoba. ho an’ireo nofidin’andriamanitra ray sady tiany, ary arovany ho an’i jesosy kristy,'),
  ('6ab25cf0ff3ebdc47f06dbb7', '2026-09-22T10:48:16.636Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:16.636Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Joda', 65, 1, 21, 'amin’izay ianareo ho tian’ Andriamanitra foana. Tokony hanantena foana koa ianareo hoe hamindra fo aminareo i Jesosy Kristy Tompontsika, ka ho afaka hiaina mandrakizay ianareo.', 'amin’izay ianareo ho tian’ andriamanitra foana. tokony hanantena foana koa ianareo hoe hamindra fo aminareo i jesosy kristy tompontsika, ka ho afaka hiaina mandrakizay ianareo.'),
  ('6ab25cf0ff3ebdc47f06dbb0', '2026-09-22T10:48:16.636Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:16.636Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Joda', 65, 1, 14, 'Naminany momba azy ireny koa i Enoka, ilay taranaka fahafito avy tamin’i Adama, rehefa nilaza hoe: “Efa tonga i Jehovah, miaraka amin’ny anjeliny masina an’alinaliny,', 'naminany momba azy ireny koa i enoka, ilay taranaka fahafito avy tamin’i adama, rehefa nilaza hoe: “efa tonga i jehovah, miaraka amin’ny anjeliny masina an’alinaliny,'),
  ('6ab25cf0ff3ebdc47f06dbaa', '2026-09-22T10:48:16.636Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:16.636Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Joda', 65, 1, 8, 'Na izany aza, dia mbola manonofinofy zava-dratsy ihany ireny olona ireny ka mandoto ny nofony. Tsy miraharaha an’izay manana fahefana koa izy ireny, ary manaratsy an’izay manana voninahitra.', 'na izany aza, dia mbola manonofinofy zava-dratsy ihany ireny olona ireny ka mandoto ny nofony. tsy miraharaha an’izay manana fahefana koa izy ireny, ary manaratsy an’izay manana voninahitra.'),
  ('6ab25cf0ff3ebdc47f06dbab', '2026-09-22T10:48:16.636Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:16.636Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Joda', 65, 1, 9, 'I Mikaela arkanjely anefa rehefa nifamaly tamin’ny Devoly momba ny fatin’i Mosesy, dia tsy sahy nanameloka azy na nanaratsy azy. Hoy mantsy izy: “Hiteny mafy anao anie i Jehovah!”', 'i mikaela arkanjely anefa rehefa nifamaly tamin’ny devoly momba ny fatin’i mosesy, dia tsy sahy nanameloka azy na nanaratsy azy. hoy mantsy izy: “hiteny mafy anao anie i jehovah!”'),
  ('6ab25cf0ff3ebdc47f06dba6', '2026-09-22T10:48:16.636Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:16.636Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Joda', 65, 1, 4, 'Izao mantsy: Nisy olona nitsofoka mangingina teo aminareo, ary efa noresahin’ny Soratra Masina hatramin’ny ela be fa mendrika ny hosazina izy ireo. Tsy matahotra an’Andriamanitra izy ireo. Mieritreritra mantsy izy ireo hoe tsy maninona na dia manana fitondran-tena tsy misy henatra aza satria hoe tsara fanahy be ilay Andriamanitsika. Mivadika amin’i Jesosy Kristy, ilay Tompo nividy antsika, koa izy ireo.', 'izao mantsy: nisy olona nitsofoka mangingina teo aminareo, ary efa noresahin’ny soratra masina hatramin’ny ela be fa mendrika ny hosazina izy ireo. tsy matahotra an’andriamanitra izy ireo. mieritreritra mantsy izy ireo hoe tsy maninona na dia manana fitondran-tena tsy misy henatra aza satria hoe tsara fanahy be ilay andriamanitsika. mivadika amin’i jesosy kristy, ilay tompo nividy antsika, koa izy ireo.'),
  ('6ab25cf0ff3ebdc47f06dba5', '2026-09-22T10:48:16.636Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:16.636Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Joda', 65, 1, 3, 'Ry malala, efa tena te hanoratra taminareo momba ny famonjena iombonantsika aho, nefa hitako hoe aleo manoratra mba hampirisihana anareo hiady mafy hiaro ny finoana, izay nomena indray mandeha fotsiny ho an’ny olona masina.', 'ry malala, efa tena te hanoratra taminareo momba ny famonjena iombonantsika aho, nefa hitako hoe aleo manoratra mba hampirisihana anareo hiady mafy hiaro ny finoana, izay nomena indray mandeha fotsiny ho an’ny olona masina.'),
  ('6ab25cf0ff3ebdc47f06dbb8', '2026-09-22T10:48:16.636Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:16.636Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Joda', 65, 1, 22, 'Ary miezaha foana hamindra fo amin’izay misalasala.', 'ary miezaha foana hamindra fo amin’izay misalasala.'),
  ('6ab25cf0ff3ebdc47f06dbbb', '2026-09-22T10:48:16.636Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:16.636Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Joda', 65, 1, 25, 'Ho an’ilay Andriamanitra tokana izay namonjy antsika tamin’ny alalan’i Jesosy Kristy Tompontsika anie ny voninahitra, ny fahalehibeazana, ny fanjakana, ary ny fahefana hatramin’ny taloha indrindra sy ankehitriny ary ho mandrakizay! Amena.', 'ho an’ilay andriamanitra tokana izay namonjy antsika tamin’ny alalan’i jesosy kristy tompontsika anie ny voninahitra, ny fahalehibeazana, ny fanjakana, ary ny fahefana hatramin’ny taloha indrindra sy ankehitriny ary ho mandrakizay! amena.'),
  ('6ab25cf0ff3ebdc47f06dbad', '2026-09-22T10:48:16.636Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:16.636Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Joda', 65, 1, 11, 'Voa mafy izy ireny fa nanao hoatran’i Kaina, sady maimay hanao zavatra tsy mety toy ny nataon’i Balama mba hahazoana valisoa. Nanakiana an’izay manana fahefana ireny, toy ny nataon’i Kora, ka ho ringana koa.', 'voa mafy izy ireny fa nanao hoatran’i kaina, sady maimay hanao zavatra tsy mety toy ny nataon’i balama mba hahazoana valisoa. nanakiana an’izay manana fahefana ireny, toy ny nataon’i kora, ka ho ringana koa.'),
  ('6ab25cf0ff3ebdc47f06dba7', '2026-09-22T10:48:16.636Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:16.636Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Joda', 65, 1, 5, 'Efa fantatrareo tsara daholo izany. Mbola te hampahatsiahy anareo anefa aho hoe na dia novonjen’i Jehovah avy tany Ejipta aza ny vahoakany, dia naringany ihany tatỳ aoriana izay tsy nino.', 'efa fantatrareo tsara daholo izany. mbola te hampahatsiahy anareo anefa aho hoe na dia novonjen’i jehovah avy tany ejipta aza ny vahoakany, dia naringany ihany tatỳ aoriana izay tsy nino.'),
  ('6ab25cf0ff3ebdc47f06dba4', '2026-09-22T10:48:16.636Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:16.636Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Joda', 65, 1, 2, 'Enga anie Andriamanitra hamindra fo aminareo ka ho tia sy hanome fiadanana anareo, ary enga anie ka hataony mihoatra noho ny hatramin’izay izany!', 'enga anie andriamanitra hamindra fo aminareo ka ho tia sy hanome fiadanana anareo, ary enga anie ka hataony mihoatra noho ny hatramin’izay izany!'),
  ('6ab25cf151528008efe56069', '2026-09-22T10:48:17.193Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:17.193Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 1, 18, 'sy ilay velona. Efa maty aho, nefa velona mandrakizay mandrakizay izao, sady manana ny lakilen’ny fahafatesana sy ny Fasana.', 'sy ilay velona. efa maty aho, nefa velona mandrakizay mandrakizay izao, sady manana ny lakilen’ny fahafatesana sy ny fasana.'),
  ('6ab25cf151528008efe56068', '2026-09-22T10:48:17.193Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:17.193Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 1, 17, 'Niankarapoka toy ny maty teo an-tongony aho, rehefa nahita azy. Dia nametraka ny tanany ankavanana tamiko izy sady niteny hoe: “Aza matahotra. Izaho ilay Voalohany sy Farany,', 'niankarapoka toy ny maty teo an-tongony aho, rehefa nahita azy. dia nametraka ny tanany ankavanana tamiko izy sady niteny hoe: “aza matahotra. izaho ilay voalohany sy farany,'),
  ('6ab25cf151528008efe56066', '2026-09-22T10:48:17.193Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:17.193Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 1, 15, 'toy ny varahina voadio mamirapiratra ao anaty lafaoro ny tongony, ary tahaka ny feon’ny rano be ny feony.', 'toy ny varahina voadio mamirapiratra ao anaty lafaoro ny tongony, ary tahaka ny feon’ny rano be ny feony.'),
  ('6ab25cf151528008efe56065', '2026-09-22T10:48:17.193Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:17.193Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 1, 14, 'Fotsy mangatsakatsaka hoatran’ny volonondry fotsy ny volon-dohany, hoatran’ny lelafo ny masony,', 'fotsy mangatsakatsaka hoatran’ny volonondry fotsy ny volon-dohany, hoatran’ny lelafo ny masony,'),
  ('6ab25cf151528008efe56067', '2026-09-22T10:48:17.193Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:17.193Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 1, 16, 'Nisy kintana fito teny an-tanany ankavanana, ary nisy sabatra lava be roa lela sady maranitra nivoaka avy tamin’ny vavany. Ny tarehiny koa hoatran’ny masoandro faran’izay mamirapiratra.', 'nisy kintana fito teny an-tanany ankavanana, ary nisy sabatra lava be roa lela sady maranitra nivoaka avy tamin’ny vavany. ny tarehiny koa hoatran’ny masoandro faran’izay mamirapiratra.'),
  ('6ab25cf151528008efe5605d', '2026-09-22T10:48:17.193Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:17.193Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 1, 6, 'ary nanao antsika ho fanjakana sy mpisorona ho an’ilay Andriamanitra Rainy, eny, ho azy mandrakizay anie ny voninahitra sy ny hery! Amena.', 'ary nanao antsika ho fanjakana sy mpisorona ho an’ilay andriamanitra rainy, eny, ho azy mandrakizay anie ny voninahitra sy ny hery! amena.'),
  ('6ab25cf151528008efe56064', '2026-09-22T10:48:17.193Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:17.193Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 1, 13, 'Teo afovoan’ireo fitoeran-jiro ireo dia nisy toy ny zanak’olona nanao akanjo lava hatreny amin’ny tongony, sady nanao fehikibo volamena nanodidina ny tratrany.', 'teo afovoan’ireo fitoeran-jiro ireo dia nisy toy ny zanak’olona nanao akanjo lava hatreny amin’ny tongony, sady nanao fehikibo volamena nanodidina ny tratrany.'),
  ('6ab25cf151528008efe56058', '2026-09-22T10:48:17.193Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:17.193Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 1, 1, 'Ny zavatra nahariharin’i Jesosy Kristy, sady nomen’Andriamanitra azy, mba hampisehoana amin’ny mpanompony ny zavatra hitranga tsy ho ela. Nirahiny ny anjeliny ka nasainy nampiseho an’ilay izy tamin’i Jaona mpanompony, tamin’ny alalan’ny famantarana.', 'ny zavatra nahariharin’i jesosy kristy, sady nomen’andriamanitra azy, mba hampisehoana amin’ny mpanompony ny zavatra hitranga tsy ho ela. nirahiny ny anjeliny ka nasainy nampiseho an’ilay izy tamin’i jaona mpanompony, tamin’ny alalan’ny famantarana.'),
  ('6ab25cf151528008efe5606a', '2026-09-22T10:48:17.193Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:17.193Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 1, 19, 'Soraty àry ny zavatra efa hitanao sy ny zava-mitranga amin’izao ary ny zavatra hitranga aorian’izany.', 'soraty àry ny zavatra efa hitanao sy ny zava-mitranga amin’izao ary ny zavatra hitranga aorian’izany.'),
  ('6ab25cf151528008efe56060', '2026-09-22T10:48:17.193Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:17.193Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 1, 9, 'Izaho Jaona rahalahinareo, dia miara-mizaka fahoriana aminareo sy miray fanjakana aminareo ary miara-miaritra aminareo, noho izaho mpanara-dia an’i Jesosy. Dia teto amin’ny nosy antsoina hoe Patmo aho, satria niresaka momba an’Andriamanitra sady vavolombelona momba an’i Jesosy.', 'izaho jaona rahalahinareo, dia miara-mizaka fahoriana aminareo sy miray fanjakana aminareo ary miara-miaritra aminareo, noho izaho mpanara-dia an’i jesosy. dia teto amin’ny nosy antsoina hoe patmo aho, satria niresaka momba an’andriamanitra sady vavolombelona momba an’i jesosy.'),
  ('6ab25cf151528008efe56063', '2026-09-22T10:48:17.193Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:17.193Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 1, 12, 'Dia nitodika hijery an’ilay niteny tamiko aho, ka rehefa nitodika aho, dia nahita fitoeran-jiro volamena fito.', 'dia nitodika hijery an’ilay niteny tamiko aho, ka rehefa nitodika aho, dia nahita fitoeran-jiro volamena fito.'),
  ('6ab25cf151528008efe56061', '2026-09-22T10:48:17.193Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:17.193Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 1, 10, 'Nentin’ny fanahy masina ho any amin’ny andron’ny Tompo aho, ary naheno feo mafy hoatran’ny an’ny trompetra avy tao andamosiko,', 'nentin’ny fanahy masina ho any amin’ny andron’ny tompo aho, ary naheno feo mafy hoatran’ny an’ny trompetra avy tao andamosiko,'),
  ('6ab25cf151528008efe5605b', '2026-09-22T10:48:17.193Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:17.193Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 1, 4, 'Izaho Jaona dia manoratra ho an’ny fiangonana fito any amin’ny faritanin’i Azia hoe: Ho aminareo anie ny hatsaram-panahy miavaka sy ny fiadanana avy amin’Ilay ankehitriny sy taloha ary ho avy, sy avy amin’ny fanahy fito eo anatrehan’ny seza fiandrianany,', 'izaho jaona dia manoratra ho an’ny fiangonana fito any amin’ny faritanin’i azia hoe: ho aminareo anie ny hatsaram-panahy miavaka sy ny fiadanana avy amin’ilay ankehitriny sy taloha ary ho avy, sy avy amin’ny fanahy fito eo anatrehan’ny seza fiandrianany,'),
  ('6ab25cf151528008efe56059', '2026-09-22T10:48:17.193Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:17.193Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 1, 2, 'I Jaona kosa vavolombelona nampita ny tenin’Andriamanitra sy ny porofo nomen’i Jesosy Kristy, izany hoe ny zava-drehetra hitany.', 'i jaona kosa vavolombelona nampita ny tenin’andriamanitra sy ny porofo nomen’i jesosy kristy, izany hoe ny zava-drehetra hitany.'),
  ('6ab25cf151528008efe5605f', '2026-09-22T10:48:17.193Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:17.193Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 1, 8, '“Izaho no Alfa sy Omega”, hoy i Jehovah Andriamanitra, “Ilay ankehitriny sy taloha ary ho avy, ilay Mahery Indrindra.”', '“izaho no alfa sy omega”, hoy i jehovah andriamanitra, “ilay ankehitriny sy taloha ary ho avy, ilay mahery indrindra.”'),
  ('6ab25cf151528008efe5605e', '2026-09-22T10:48:17.193Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:17.193Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 1, 7, 'Ho avy miaraka amin’ny rahona izy. Ary hahita maso azy ny olona rehetra, na dia ireo nandefona azy aza. Noho izy, dia hikapo-tratra noho ny alahelo ny foko rehetra eto an-tany. Eny, Amena.', 'ho avy miaraka amin’ny rahona izy. ary hahita maso azy ny olona rehetra, na dia ireo nandefona azy aza. noho izy, dia hikapo-tratra noho ny alahelo ny foko rehetra eto an-tany. eny, amena.'),
  ('6ab25cf151528008efe5605c', '2026-09-22T10:48:17.193Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:17.193Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 1, 5, 'ary avy amin’i Jesosy Kristy, “ilay Vavolombelona Mendri-pitokisana”, “ilay lahimatoa amin’ny maty”, ary “ilay Mpitondra ny mpanjakan’ny tany!” Ho an’ilay tia antsika sy nanafaka antsika tamin’ny fahotantsika, tamin’ny alalan’ny rany,', 'ary avy amin’i jesosy kristy, “ilay vavolombelona mendri-pitokisana”, “ilay lahimatoa amin’ny maty”, ary “ilay mpitondra ny mpanjakan’ny tany!” ho an’ilay tia antsika sy nanafaka antsika tamin’ny fahotantsika, tamin’ny alalan’ny rany,'),
  ('6ab25cf151528008efe5606b', '2026-09-22T10:48:17.193Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:17.193Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 1, 20, 'Ary izao ilay zava-miafina masina momba ny kintana fito efa hitanao teo an-tanako ankavanana sy ny fitoeran-jiro volamena fito: Ny kintana fito dia ny anjelin’ny fiangonana fito, ary ny fitoeran-jiro fito dia ny fiangonana fito.', 'ary izao ilay zava-miafina masina momba ny kintana fito efa hitanao teo an-tanako ankavanana sy ny fitoeran-jiro volamena fito: ny kintana fito dia ny anjelin’ny fiangonana fito, ary ny fitoeran-jiro fito dia ny fiangonana fito.'),
  ('6ab25cf151528008efe56062', '2026-09-22T10:48:17.193Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:17.193Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 1, 11, 'nilaza hoe: “Izay zavatra hitanao dia soraty eo amin’ny horonam-boky, ka alefaso any amin’ny fiangonana fito atsy Efesosy, Smyrna, Pergamosy, Tyatira, Sardisy, Filadelfia, ary Laodikia.”', 'nilaza hoe: “izay zavatra hitanao dia soraty eo amin’ny horonam-boky, ka alefaso any amin’ny fiangonana fito atsy efesosy, smyrna, pergamosy, tyatira, sardisy, filadelfia, ary laodikia.”'),
  ('6ab25cf151528008efe5605a', '2026-09-22T10:48:17.193Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:17.193Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 1, 3, 'Sambatra izay mamaky mafy sy mihaino ny teny ato amin’ity faminaniana ity ka manaraka an’izay voasoratra ato anatiny, fa efa akaiky ny fotoana voatondro.', 'sambatra izay mamaky mafy sy mihaino ny teny ato amin’ity faminaniana ity ka manaraka an’izay voasoratra ato anatiny, fa efa akaiky ny fotoana voatondro.'),
  ('6ab25cf258377110c13e7290', '2026-09-22T10:48:18.422Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:18.422Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 2, 6, 'Izao anefa no zavatra tsara ataonao: Ankahalainao izay ataon’ny sektan’i Nikoleo, ary halako koa izany.', 'izao anefa no zavatra tsara ataonao: ankahalainao izay ataon’ny sektan’i nikoleo, ary halako koa izany.'),
  ('6ab25cf258377110c13e72a7', '2026-09-22T10:48:18.422Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:18.422Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 2, 29, 'Izay manan-tsofina, aoka izy hihaino izay lazain’ny fanahy amin’ny fiangonana.’', 'izay manan-tsofina, aoka izy hihaino izay lazain’ny fanahy amin’ny fiangonana.’'),
  ('6ab25cf258377110c13e72a0', '2026-09-22T10:48:18.422Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:18.422Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 2, 22, 'Hataoko marary mafy eo am-pandriana izy, ary izay mijangajanga aminy dia hatsipiko ao amin’ny fahoriana lehibe, raha tsy hoe mibebaka angaha ry zareo ka tsy manao hoatran’ny ataon’ilay vehivavy intsony.', 'hataoko marary mafy eo am-pandriana izy, ary izay mijangajanga aminy dia hatsipiko ao amin’ny fahoriana lehibe, raha tsy hoe mibebaka angaha ry zareo ka tsy manao hoatran’ny ataon’ilay vehivavy intsony.'),
  ('6ab25cf258377110c13e7292', '2026-09-22T10:48:18.422Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:18.422Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 2, 8, '“Ary soraty ho an’ny anjelin’ny fiangonana atsy Smyrna hoe: Izao no lazain’ilay ‘Voalohany sy Farany’, izay efa maty nefa velona indray:', '“ary soraty ho an’ny anjelin’ny fiangonana atsy smyrna hoe: izao no lazain’ilay ‘voalohany sy farany’, izay efa maty nefa velona indray:'),
  ('6ab25cf258377110c13e729f', '2026-09-22T10:48:18.422Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:18.422Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 2, 21, 'Nomeko fotoana hibebahana izy, saingy tsy te hibebaka fa mbola mijangajanga ihany.', 'nomeko fotoana hibebahana izy, saingy tsy te hibebaka fa mbola mijangajanga ihany.'),
  ('6ab25cf258377110c13e729a', '2026-09-22T10:48:18.422Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:18.422Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 2, 16, 'Koa mibebaha, fa raha tsy izany, dia ho avy any aminao haingana aho ka hiady amin’izy ireo, ary hamely azy amin’ilay sabatra lava be avy amin’ny vavako.', 'koa mibebaha, fa raha tsy izany, dia ho avy any aminao haingana aho ka hiady amin’izy ireo, ary hamely azy amin’ilay sabatra lava be avy amin’ny vavako.'),
  ('6ab25cf258377110c13e7299', '2026-09-22T10:48:18.422Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:18.422Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 2, 15, 'Misy olona mifikitra amin’ny fampianaran’ny sektan’i Nikoleo koa ao aminao.', 'misy olona mifikitra amin’ny fampianaran’ny sektan’i nikoleo koa ao aminao.'),
  ('6ab25cf258377110c13e7298', '2026-09-22T10:48:18.422Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:18.422Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 2, 14, '“‘Ireto anefa misy zavatra vitsivitsy anomezako tsiny anao: Misy olona mifikitra amin’ny fampianaran’i Balama ao aminao. Nampianatra an’i Balaka hitaona ny zanak’Israely hanota i Balama, izany hoe hihinana zavatra natao sorona ho an’ny sampy sy hijangajanga.', '“‘ireto anefa misy zavatra vitsivitsy anomezako tsiny anao: misy olona mifikitra amin’ny fampianaran’i balama ao aminao. nampianatra an’i balaka hitaona ny zanak’israely hanota i balama, izany hoe hihinana zavatra natao sorona ho an’ny sampy sy hijangajanga.'),
  ('6ab25cf258377110c13e7294', '2026-09-22T10:48:18.422Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:18.422Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 2, 10, 'Aza matahotra na dia efa hiaritra fijaliana aza ianao. Fa hataon’ny Devoly foana izay hanagadrana ny sasany aminareo. Amin’izay dia hotsapaina tanteraka ianareo, ary hiaritra fahoriana mandritra ny folo andro. Aza mivadika anefa mandra-pahafatinao, dia homeko anao ny satroboninahitry ny fiainana.', 'aza matahotra na dia efa hiaritra fijaliana aza ianao. fa hataon’ny devoly foana izay hanagadrana ny sasany aminareo. amin’izay dia hotsapaina tanteraka ianareo, ary hiaritra fahoriana mandritra ny folo andro. aza mivadika anefa mandra-pahafatinao, dia homeko anao ny satroboninahitry ny fiainana.'),
  ('6ab25cf258377110c13e72a3', '2026-09-22T10:48:18.422Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:18.422Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 2, 25, 'Tazòny mafy anefa izay efa anananareo, mandra-piaviko.', 'tazòny mafy anefa izay efa anananareo, mandra-piaviko.'),
  ('6ab25cf258377110c13e729b', '2026-09-22T10:48:18.422Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:18.422Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 2, 17, '“‘Izay manan-tsofina, aoka izy hihaino izay lazain’ny fanahy amin’ny fiangonana hoe: Izay mandresy dia homeko amin’ny mana nafenina sady homeko vatokilonjy fotsy. Ary eo amin’ilay vatokilonjy dia misy anaram-baovao voasoratra, izay tsy misy mahafantatra afa-tsy ilay mahazo azy ihany.’', '“‘izay manan-tsofina, aoka izy hihaino izay lazain’ny fanahy amin’ny fiangonana hoe: izay mandresy dia homeko amin’ny mana nafenina sady homeko vatokilonjy fotsy. ary eo amin’ilay vatokilonjy dia misy anaram-baovao voasoratra, izay tsy misy mahafantatra afa-tsy ilay mahazo azy ihany.’'),
  ('6ab25cf258377110c13e728e', '2026-09-22T10:48:18.422Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:18.422Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 2, 4, 'Na izany aza, dia izao no anomezako tsiny anao: Navelanao hihena ilay fitiavanao voalohany.', 'na izany aza, dia izao no anomezako tsiny anao: navelanao hihena ilay fitiavanao voalohany.'),
  ('6ab25cf258377110c13e72a5', '2026-09-22T10:48:18.422Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:18.422Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 2, 27, 'Dia hiandry an’ireo firenena amin’ny tehina vy izy, ka hopotipotehiny toy ny vilany tanimanga ireny. Homeko fahefana izy, hoatran’ny nahazoako fahefana tamin’ny Raiko.', 'dia hiandry an’ireo firenena amin’ny tehina vy izy, ka hopotipotehiny toy ny vilany tanimanga ireny. homeko fahefana izy, hoatran’ny nahazoako fahefana tamin’ny raiko.'),
  ('6ab25cf258377110c13e7295', '2026-09-22T10:48:18.422Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:18.422Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 2, 11, 'Izay manan-tsofina, aoka izy hihaino izay lazain’ny fanahy amin’ny fiangonana hoe: Izay mandresy dia tsy ho azon’ny fahafatesana faharoa mihitsy.’', 'izay manan-tsofina, aoka izy hihaino izay lazain’ny fanahy amin’ny fiangonana hoe: izay mandresy dia tsy ho azon’ny fahafatesana faharoa mihitsy.’'),
  ('6ab25cf258377110c13e728f', '2026-09-22T10:48:18.422Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:18.422Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 2, 5, '“‘Koa tadidio izay nisy anao tamin’ianao mbola tsy lavo, dia mibebaha ka ataovy izay nataonao tamin’ny voalohany. Fa raha tsy izany, dia ho avy any aminao aho ka hesoriko hiala amin’ny toerany ny fitoeran-jironao, raha tsy hoe mibebaka angaha ianao.', '“‘koa tadidio izay nisy anao tamin’ianao mbola tsy lavo, dia mibebaha ka ataovy izay nataonao tamin’ny voalohany. fa raha tsy izany, dia ho avy any aminao aho ka hesoriko hiala amin’ny toerany ny fitoeran-jironao, raha tsy hoe mibebaka angaha ianao.'),
  ('6ab25cf258377110c13e72a1', '2026-09-22T10:48:18.422Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:18.422Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 2, 23, 'Ary hovonoiko amin’ny aretina mahafaty ny zanak’ilay vehivavy, dia ho fantatry ny fiangonana rehetra fa izaho no mandinika ny eritreritra lalina indrindra sy ny fo, sady hamaly anareo tsirairay araka izay ataonareo avy.', 'ary hovonoiko amin’ny aretina mahafaty ny zanak’ilay vehivavy, dia ho fantatry ny fiangonana rehetra fa izaho no mandinika ny eritreritra lalina indrindra sy ny fo, sady hamaly anareo tsirairay araka izay ataonareo avy.'),
  ('6ab25cf258377110c13e728b', '2026-09-22T10:48:18.422Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:18.422Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 2, 1, '“Soraty ho an’ny anjelin’ny fiangonana atsy Efesosy hoe: Izao no lazain’ilay mitazona ny kintana fito eny an-tanany ankavanana sy mandeha eo afovoan’ny fitoeran-jiro volamena fito:', '“soraty ho an’ny anjelin’ny fiangonana atsy efesosy hoe: izao no lazain’ilay mitazona ny kintana fito eny an-tanany ankavanana sy mandeha eo afovoan’ny fitoeran-jiro volamena fito:'),
  ('6ab25cf258377110c13e7291', '2026-09-22T10:48:18.422Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:18.422Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 2, 7, 'Izay manan-tsofina, aoka izy hihaino izay lazain’ny fanahy amin’ny fiangonana hoe: Izay mandresy dia havelako hihinana amin’ny hazon’aina ao amin’ny paradisan’Andriamanitra.’', 'izay manan-tsofina, aoka izy hihaino izay lazain’ny fanahy amin’ny fiangonana hoe: izay mandresy dia havelako hihinana amin’ny hazon’aina ao amin’ny paradisan’andriamanitra.’'),
  ('6ab25cf258377110c13e728d', '2026-09-22T10:48:18.422Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:18.422Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 2, 3, 'Miaritra koa ianao, sady be fikirizana foana noho ny anarako, nefa tsy kivy.', 'miaritra koa ianao, sady be fikirizana foana noho ny anarako, nefa tsy kivy.'),
  ('6ab25cf258377110c13e7297', '2026-09-22T10:48:18.422Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:18.422Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 2, 13, '‘Fantatro hoe aiza no misy anao, dia ao amin’izay misy ny seza fiandrianan’i Satana. Na izany aza, dia mifikitra amin’ny anarako foana ianao. Tsy nolavinao koa hoe mino ahy ianao, na dia tamin’ny andron’i Antipasy aza, dia ilay vavolombeloko tsy nivadika, izay novonoina tao an-tanànanareo, any amin’izay misy an’i Satana.', '‘fantatro hoe aiza no misy anao, dia ao amin’izay misy ny seza fiandrianan’i satana. na izany aza, dia mifikitra amin’ny anarako foana ianao. tsy nolavinao koa hoe mino ahy ianao, na dia tamin’ny andron’i antipasy aza, dia ilay vavolombeloko tsy nivadika, izay novonoina tao an-tanànanareo, any amin’izay misy an’i satana.'),
  ('6ab25cf258377110c13e72a4', '2026-09-22T10:48:18.422Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:18.422Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 2, 26, 'Ary izay mandresy sady manao ny asako hatramin’ny farany, dia homeko fahefana hitondra firenena.', 'ary izay mandresy sady manao ny asako hatramin’ny farany, dia homeko fahefana hitondra firenena.'),
  ('6ab25cf258377110c13e729e', '2026-09-22T10:48:18.422Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:18.422Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 2, 20, '“‘Na izany aza, dia izao no anomezako tsiny anao: Leferinao ilay vehivavy hoatran’i Jezebela. Mihambo ho mpaminanivavy izy sady mampianatra sy mamitaka ny mpanompoko hijangajanga sy hihinana zavatra atao sorona ho an’ny sampy.', '“‘na izany aza, dia izao no anomezako tsiny anao: leferinao ilay vehivavy hoatran’i jezebela. mihambo ho mpaminanivavy izy sady mampianatra sy mamitaka ny mpanompoko hijangajanga sy hihinana zavatra atao sorona ho an’ny sampy.'),
  ('6ab25cf258377110c13e729d', '2026-09-22T10:48:18.422Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:18.422Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 2, 19, '‘Fantatro izay ataonao sy ny fitiavanao sy ny finoanao sy ny fanompoanao ary ny fiaretanao. Fantatro koa fa betsaka kokoa noho ny nataonao tamin’ny voalohany ny nataonao tatỳ aoriana.', '‘fantatro izay ataonao sy ny fitiavanao sy ny finoanao sy ny fanompoanao ary ny fiaretanao. fantatro koa fa betsaka kokoa noho ny nataonao tamin’ny voalohany ny nataonao tatỳ aoriana.'),
  ('6ab25cf258377110c13e7296', '2026-09-22T10:48:18.422Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:18.422Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 2, 12, '“Ary soraty ho an’ny anjelin’ny fiangonana atsy Pergamosy hoe: Izao no lazain’ilay manana sabatra lava be roa lela sady maranitra:', '“ary soraty ho an’ny anjelin’ny fiangonana atsy pergamosy hoe: izao no lazain’ilay manana sabatra lava be roa lela sady maranitra:'),
  ('6ab25cf258377110c13e7293', '2026-09-22T10:48:18.422Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:18.422Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 2, 9, '‘Fantatro ny fahorianao sy ny fahantranao. Na izany aza, dia manankarena ianao. Fantatro koa fa manevateva anao ny olona mihambo ho Jiosy nefa tsy izy akory, fa anisan’ny synagogan’i Satana.', '‘fantatro ny fahorianao sy ny fahantranao. na izany aza, dia manankarena ianao. fantatro koa fa manevateva anao ny olona mihambo ho jiosy nefa tsy izy akory, fa anisan’ny synagogan’i satana.'),
  ('6ab25cf258377110c13e728c', '2026-09-22T10:48:18.422Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:18.422Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 2, 2, '‘Fantatro izay ataonao sy ny asa mafy ataonao ary ny fiaretanao, ary fantatro fa tsy milefitra ianao rehefa misy olon-dratsy. Notsapainao koa izay mihambo ho apostoly nefa tsy izy akory, ka hitanao fa mpandainga.', '‘fantatro izay ataonao sy ny asa mafy ataonao ary ny fiaretanao, ary fantatro fa tsy milefitra ianao rehefa misy olon-dratsy. notsapainao koa izay mihambo ho apostoly nefa tsy izy akory, ka hitanao fa mpandainga.'),
  ('6ab25cf258377110c13e72a2', '2026-09-22T10:48:18.422Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:18.422Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 2, 24, '“‘Izao anefa no lazaiko amin’ny sisa aminareo any Tyatira, dia izay rehetra tsy manaraka an’izany fampianarana izany, sady tsy mahafantatra an’ilay antsoin’ny olona hoe “zava-dalin’i Satana”: Tsy ampiako enta-mavesatra intsony ianareo.', '“‘izao anefa no lazaiko amin’ny sisa aminareo any tyatira, dia izay rehetra tsy manaraka an’izany fampianarana izany, sady tsy mahafantatra an’ilay antsoin’ny olona hoe “zava-dalin’i satana”: tsy ampiako enta-mavesatra intsony ianareo.'),
  ('6ab25cf258377110c13e729c', '2026-09-22T10:48:18.422Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:18.422Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 2, 18, '“Ary soraty ho an’ny anjelin’ny fiangonana atsy Tyatira hoe: Izao no lazain’ny Zanak’Andriamanitra, izay hoatran’ny lelafo ny masony, ary toy ny varahina voadio ny tongony:', '“ary soraty ho an’ny anjelin’ny fiangonana atsy tyatira hoe: izao no lazain’ny zanak’andriamanitra, izay hoatran’ny lelafo ny masony, ary toy ny varahina voadio ny tongony:'),
  ('6ab25cf258377110c13e72a6', '2026-09-22T10:48:18.422Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:18.422Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 2, 28, 'Ary homeko azy ny kintan’ny maraina.', 'ary homeko azy ny kintan’ny maraina.'),
  ('6ab25cf252e8110f9296b44f', '2026-09-22T10:48:18.941Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:18.941Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 3, 21, 'Izay mandresy dia havelako hiara-mipetraka amiko eo amin’ny seza fiandrianako, fa izaho koa efa nandresy ka miara-mipetraka amin’ny Raiko eo amin’ny seza fiandrianany.', 'izay mandresy dia havelako hiara-mipetraka amiko eo amin’ny seza fiandrianako, fa izaho koa efa nandresy ka miara-mipetraka amin’ny raiko eo amin’ny seza fiandrianany.'),
  ('6ab25cf252e8110f9296b43c', '2026-09-22T10:48:18.941Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:18.941Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 3, 2, 'Miambena ka ampaherezo izay sisa tavela efa ho faty, satria hitako fa tsy novitainao izay tian’Andriamanitra hataonao.', 'miambena ka ampaherezo izay sisa tavela efa ho faty, satria hitako fa tsy novitainao izay tian’andriamanitra hataonao.'),
  ('6ab25cf252e8110f9296b44a', '2026-09-22T10:48:18.941Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:18.941Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 3, 16, 'Satria matimaty ianao, sady tsy mafana no tsy mangatsiaka, dia haloan’ny vavako.', 'satria matimaty ianao, sady tsy mafana no tsy mangatsiaka, dia haloan’ny vavako.'),
  ('6ab25cf252e8110f9296b43f', '2026-09-22T10:48:18.941Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:18.941Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 3, 5, 'Hampanaovina akanjo fotsy àry izay mandresy. Dia tsy hovonoiko ao amin’ny bokin’ny fiainana mihitsy ny anarany, fa hekeko eo anatrehan’ny Raiko sy eo anatrehan’ny anjeliny hoe fantatro ny anarany.', 'hampanaovina akanjo fotsy àry izay mandresy. dia tsy hovonoiko ao amin’ny bokin’ny fiainana mihitsy ny anarany, fa hekeko eo anatrehan’ny raiko sy eo anatrehan’ny anjeliny hoe fantatro ny anarany.'),
  ('6ab25cf252e8110f9296b441', '2026-09-22T10:48:18.941Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:18.941Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 3, 7, '“Ary soraty ho an’ny anjelin’ny fiangonana atsy Filadelfia hoe: Izao no lazain’ilay masina, ilay marina, ilay manana ny lakilen’i Davida, ilay manokatra varavarana izay tsy misy afaka manidy ary manidy varavarana izay tsy misy afaka manokatra:', '“ary soraty ho an’ny anjelin’ny fiangonana atsy filadelfia hoe: izao no lazain’ilay masina, ilay marina, ilay manana ny lakilen’i davida, ilay manokatra varavarana izay tsy misy afaka manidy ary manidy varavarana izay tsy misy afaka manokatra:'),
  ('6ab25cf252e8110f9296b450', '2026-09-22T10:48:18.941Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:18.941Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 3, 22, 'Izay manan-tsofina, aoka izy hihaino izay lazain’ny fanahy amin’ny fiangonana.’”', 'izay manan-tsofina, aoka izy hihaino izay lazain’ny fanahy amin’ny fiangonana.’”'),
  ('6ab25cf252e8110f9296b447', '2026-09-22T10:48:18.941Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:18.941Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 3, 13, 'Izay manan-tsofina, aoka izy hihaino izay lazain’ny fanahy amin’ny fiangonana.’', 'izay manan-tsofina, aoka izy hihaino izay lazain’ny fanahy amin’ny fiangonana.’'),
  ('6ab25cf252e8110f9296b440', '2026-09-22T10:48:18.941Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:18.941Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 3, 6, 'Izay manan-tsofina, aoka izy hihaino izay lazain’ny fanahy amin’ny fiangonana.’', 'izay manan-tsofina, aoka izy hihaino izay lazain’ny fanahy amin’ny fiangonana.’'),
  ('6ab25cf252e8110f9296b448', '2026-09-22T10:48:18.941Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:18.941Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 3, 14, '“Ary soraty ho an’ny anjelin’ny fiangonana atsy Laodikia hoe: Izao no lazain’ny Amena, ilay vavolombelona mendri-pitokisana sy marina, ilay noforonin’Andriamanitra voalohany indrindra:', '“ary soraty ho an’ny anjelin’ny fiangonana atsy laodikia hoe: izao no lazain’ny amena, ilay vavolombelona mendri-pitokisana sy marina, ilay noforonin’andriamanitra voalohany indrindra:'),
  ('6ab25cf252e8110f9296b445', '2026-09-22T10:48:18.941Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:18.941Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 3, 11, 'Ho avy haingana aho. Tazòny mafy foana àry izay anananao, mba tsy hisy haka ny satroboninahitrao.', 'ho avy haingana aho. tazòny mafy foana àry izay anananao, mba tsy hisy haka ny satroboninahitrao.'),
  ('6ab25cf252e8110f9296b43d', '2026-09-22T10:48:18.941Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:18.941Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 3, 3, 'Koa tadidio tsara izay efa noraisinao sy efa henonao, ary ataovy foana izany ka mibebaha. Fa raha tsy mifoha ianao, dia ho avy toy ny mpangalatra aho, ary tsy ho fantatrao mihitsy izay ora hahatongavako eo aminao.', 'koa tadidio tsara izay efa noraisinao sy efa henonao, ary ataovy foana izany ka mibebaha. fa raha tsy mifoha ianao, dia ho avy toy ny mpangalatra aho, ary tsy ho fantatrao mihitsy izay ora hahatongavako eo aminao.'),
  ('6ab25cf252e8110f9296b44b', '2026-09-22T10:48:18.941Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:18.941Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 3, 17, 'Fa hoy ianao: “Manankarena aho ary efa nahazo harena ka tsy mila na inona na inona intsony.” Tsy fantatrao anefa fa ory sy mampalahelo sy mahantra sy jamba ary mitanjaka ianao.', 'fa hoy ianao: “manankarena aho ary efa nahazo harena ka tsy mila na inona na inona intsony.” tsy fantatrao anefa fa ory sy mampalahelo sy mahantra sy jamba ary mitanjaka ianao.'),
  ('6ab25cf252e8110f9296b44d', '2026-09-22T10:48:18.941Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:18.941Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 3, 19, '“‘Izay rehetra iraiketan’ny foko no anariko sy faiziko. Miezaha àry hafana fo, dia mibebaha.', '“‘izay rehetra iraiketan’ny foko no anariko sy faiziko. miezaha àry hafana fo, dia mibebaha.'),
  ('6ab25cf252e8110f9296b446', '2026-09-22T10:48:18.941Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:18.941Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 3, 12, '“‘Izay mandresy, dia hataoko andry ao amin’ny tempolin’ny Andriamanitro, ary tsy hiala ao intsony mihitsy izy. Dia hosoratako eo aminy ny anaran’ny Andriamanitro sy ny anaran’ny tanànan’ny Andriamanitro, dia i Jerosalema Vaovao izay midina avy any an-danitra avy any amin’ny Andriamanitro, ary hosoratako eo koa ilay anarako vaovao.', '“‘izay mandresy, dia hataoko andry ao amin’ny tempolin’ny andriamanitro, ary tsy hiala ao intsony mihitsy izy. dia hosoratako eo aminy ny anaran’ny andriamanitro sy ny anaran’ny tanànan’ny andriamanitro, dia i jerosalema vaovao izay midina avy any an-danitra avy any amin’ny andriamanitro, ary hosoratako eo koa ilay anarako vaovao.'),
  ('6ab25cf252e8110f9296b444', '2026-09-22T10:48:18.941Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:18.941Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 3, 10, 'Ary satria ianao nanaraka an’izay voalaza momba ny fiaretako, dia hiaro anao koa aho amin’ilay ora fitsapana. Ho tonga amin’ny tany manontolo izany ora izany, mba hitsapana an’izay mipetraka eny ambonin’ny tany.', 'ary satria ianao nanaraka an’izay voalaza momba ny fiaretako, dia hiaro anao koa aho amin’ilay ora fitsapana. ho tonga amin’ny tany manontolo izany ora izany, mba hitsapana an’izay mipetraka eny ambonin’ny tany.'),
  ('6ab25cf252e8110f9296b44e', '2026-09-22T10:48:18.941Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:18.941Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 3, 20, 'Efa mijoro eto am-baravarana aho izao, ary mandondòna. Raha misy olona maheno ny feoko ka manokatra ny varavarana, dia hiditra ao an-tranony aho ka hiara-misakafo hariva aminy, dia izy koa hiara-mihinana amiko.', 'efa mijoro eto am-baravarana aho izao, ary mandondòna. raha misy olona maheno ny feoko ka manokatra ny varavarana, dia hiditra ao an-tranony aho ka hiara-misakafo hariva aminy, dia izy koa hiara-mihinana amiko.'),
  ('6ab25cf252e8110f9296b44c', '2026-09-22T10:48:18.941Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:18.941Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 3, 18, 'Koa manoro hevitra anao aho mba hividy an’ireto atỳ amiko: Volamena voadio tamin’ny afo, amin’izay ianao manan-karena; sy akanjo ivelany fotsy, amin’izay ianao mitafy dia tsy hiseho ny fitanjahanao ka tsy ho menatra ianao; ary fanafody maso hikosehana ny masonao, amin’izay ianao mahita.', 'koa manoro hevitra anao aho mba hividy an’ireto atỳ amiko: volamena voadio tamin’ny afo, amin’izay ianao manan-karena; sy akanjo ivelany fotsy, amin’izay ianao mitafy dia tsy hiseho ny fitanjahanao ka tsy ho menatra ianao; ary fanafody maso hikosehana ny masonao, amin’izay ianao mahita.'),
  ('6ab25cf252e8110f9296b442', '2026-09-22T10:48:18.941Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:18.941Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 3, 8, '‘Fantatro izay ataonao, ary efa nasiako varavarana misokatra eo alohanao, izay tsy azon’iza na iza hidiana. Fantatro fa mba manana hery kely ihany ianao, sady efa nanaraka ny teniko ka tsy nivadika tamin’ny anarako.', '‘fantatro izay ataonao, ary efa nasiako varavarana misokatra eo alohanao, izay tsy azon’iza na iza hidiana. fantatro fa mba manana hery kely ihany ianao, sady efa nanaraka ny teniko ka tsy nivadika tamin’ny anarako.'),
  ('6ab25cf252e8110f9296b43b', '2026-09-22T10:48:18.941Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:18.941Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 3, 1, '“Ary soraty ho an’ny anjelin’ny fiangonana atsy Sardisy hoe: Izao no lazain’ilay manana ny fanahy fiton’Andriamanitra sy ny kintana fito: ‘Fantatro izay ataonao, fa malaza ho velona ianao, nefa maty.', '“ary soraty ho an’ny anjelin’ny fiangonana atsy sardisy hoe: izao no lazain’ilay manana ny fanahy fiton’andriamanitra sy ny kintana fito: ‘fantatro izay ataonao, fa malaza ho velona ianao, nefa maty.'),
  ('6ab25cf252e8110f9296b443', '2026-09-22T10:48:18.941Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:18.941Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 3, 9, 'Izao no hataoko amin’ny olona avy amin’ny synagogan’i Satana, izay mihambo ho Jiosy nefa tsy izy akory fa mandainga: Hataoko tonga miankohoka eo anoloan’ny tongotrao izy ireo, ary hampahafantariko azy fa efa tia anao aho.', 'izao no hataoko amin’ny olona avy amin’ny synagogan’i satana, izay mihambo ho jiosy nefa tsy izy akory fa mandainga: hataoko tonga miankohoka eo anoloan’ny tongotrao izy ireo, ary hampahafantariko azy fa efa tia anao aho.'),
  ('6ab25cf252e8110f9296b43e', '2026-09-22T10:48:18.941Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:18.941Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 3, 4, '“‘Misy olona vitsivitsy tsy nandoto ny akanjony anefa ao aminao, ao Sardisy. Hiara-mandeha amiko manao akanjo fotsy izy ireo, satria mendrika an’izany.', '“‘misy olona vitsivitsy tsy nandoto ny akanjony anefa ao aminao, ao sardisy. hiara-mandeha amiko manao akanjo fotsy izy ireo, satria mendrika an’izany.'),
  ('6ab25cf252e8110f9296b449', '2026-09-22T10:48:18.941Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:18.941Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 3, 15, '‘Fantatro izay ataonao, fa tsy mangatsiaka na mafana ianao. Aleoko aza ianao mangatsiaka na mafana!', '‘fantatro izay ataonao, fa tsy mangatsiaka na mafana ianao. aleoko aza ianao mangatsiaka na mafana!'),
  ('6ab25cf38ab89111f4caae75', '2026-09-22T10:48:19.421Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:19.421Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 4, 11, '“Mendrika ny homena voninahitra sy haja ary hery ianao, Jehovah Andriamanitray ô, satria namorona ny zava-drehetra ianao, ary noho ny sitraponao no nampisy sy namoronana an’ireny.”', '“mendrika ny homena voninahitra sy haja ary hery ianao, jehovah andriamanitray ô, satria namorona ny zava-drehetra ianao, ary noho ny sitraponao no nampisy sy namoronana an’ireny.”'),
  ('6ab25cf38ab89111f4caae74', '2026-09-22T10:48:19.421Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:19.421Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 4, 10, 'dia niankohoka teo anatrehan’Ilay nipetraka teo ambonin’ny seza fiandrianana ny anti-panahy 24, ka nivavaka tamin’Ilay velona mandrakizay mandrakizay, sady nanipy ny satroboninahiny teo anoloan’ny seza fiandrianana ary niteny hoe:', 'dia niankohoka teo anatrehan’ilay nipetraka teo ambonin’ny seza fiandrianana ny anti-panahy 24, ka nivavaka tamin’ilay velona mandrakizay mandrakizay, sady nanipy ny satroboninahiny teo anoloan’ny seza fiandrianana ary niteny hoe:'),
  ('6ab25cf38ab89111f4caae6f', '2026-09-22T10:48:19.421Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:19.421Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 4, 5, 'Nisy tselatra sy feo ary kotroka nivoaka avy teo amin’ilay seza fiandrianana, ary nisy jiro fito nirehitra teo anoloan’ilay seza fiandrianana. Ireo jiro ireo dia ny fanahy fiton’Andriamanitra.', 'nisy tselatra sy feo ary kotroka nivoaka avy teo amin’ilay seza fiandrianana, ary nisy jiro fito nirehitra teo anoloan’ilay seza fiandrianana. ireo jiro ireo dia ny fanahy fiton’andriamanitra.'),
  ('6ab25cf38ab89111f4caae73', '2026-09-22T10:48:19.421Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:19.421Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 4, 9, 'Ireo zavamananaina ireo dia nanome voninahitra sy haja ary fisaorana ho an’Ilay nipetraka teo ambonin’ny seza fiandrianana, Ilay velona mandrakizay mandrakizay. Isaky ny nanao an’izany izy ireo,', 'ireo zavamananaina ireo dia nanome voninahitra sy haja ary fisaorana ho an’ilay nipetraka teo ambonin’ny seza fiandrianana, ilay velona mandrakizay mandrakizay. isaky ny nanao an’izany izy ireo,'),
  ('6ab25cf38ab89111f4caae6c', '2026-09-22T10:48:19.421Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:19.421Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 4, 2, 'Tonga dia niasa tamiko ny fanahin’Andriamanitra, taorian’izay. Dia io fa nisy seza fiandrianana tany an-danitra, ary nisy nipetraka teo amboniny.', 'tonga dia niasa tamiko ny fanahin’andriamanitra, taorian’izay. dia io fa nisy seza fiandrianana tany an-danitra, ary nisy nipetraka teo amboniny.'),
  ('6ab25cf38ab89111f4caae70', '2026-09-22T10:48:19.421Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:19.421Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 4, 6, 'Ary nisy ranomasina mitovy amin’ny fitaratra sady hoatran’ny kristaly, teo anoloan’ilay seza fiandrianana. Teo afovoan’ilay seza fiandrianana sy nanodidina azy indray dia nisy zavamananaina efatra. Feno maso ny vatan’ireo zavamananaina ireo, na ny aloha na ny aoriana.', 'ary nisy ranomasina mitovy amin’ny fitaratra sady hoatran’ny kristaly, teo anoloan’ilay seza fiandrianana. teo afovoan’ilay seza fiandrianana sy nanodidina azy indray dia nisy zavamananaina efatra. feno maso ny vatan’ireo zavamananaina ireo, na ny aloha na ny aoriana.'),
  ('6ab25cf38ab89111f4caae6e', '2026-09-22T10:48:19.421Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:19.421Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 4, 4, 'Nisy seza fiandrianana 24 koa nanodidina an’ilay seza fiandrianana. Ary teo ambonin’ireo seza fiandrianana ireo dia hitako nisy anti-panahy 24 nipetraka, nanao akanjo fotsy sady nisatroka satroboninahitra volamena.', 'nisy seza fiandrianana 24 koa nanodidina an’ilay seza fiandrianana. ary teo ambonin’ireo seza fiandrianana ireo dia hitako nisy anti-panahy 24 nipetraka, nanao akanjo fotsy sady nisatroka satroboninahitra volamena.'),
  ('6ab25cf38ab89111f4caae72', '2026-09-22T10:48:19.421Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:19.421Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 4, 8, 'Samy nanana elatra enina avy ireo zavamananaina efatra ireo, ary feno maso ny teo ambony elany sy ny tao ambany elany. Niteny foana izy ireo, na andro na alina, hoe: “Masina, masina, masina i Jehovah Andriamanitra, ilay Mahery Indrindra, Ilay taloha sy ankehitriny ary ho avy.”', 'samy nanana elatra enina avy ireo zavamananaina efatra ireo, ary feno maso ny teo ambony elany sy ny tao ambany elany. niteny foana izy ireo, na andro na alina, hoe: “masina, masina, masina i jehovah andriamanitra, ilay mahery indrindra, ilay taloha sy ankehitriny ary ho avy.”'),
  ('6ab25cf38ab89111f4caae6d', '2026-09-22T10:48:19.421Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:19.421Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 4, 3, 'Hoatran’ny vato jaspa sy vatosoa sardoanina no fahitana an’Ilay nipetraka. Ary nanodidina an’ilay seza fiandrianana dia nisy avana hoatran’ny emeraoda.', 'hoatran’ny vato jaspa sy vatosoa sardoanina no fahitana an’ilay nipetraka. ary nanodidina an’ilay seza fiandrianana dia nisy avana hoatran’ny emeraoda.'),
  ('6ab25cf38ab89111f4caae6b', '2026-09-22T10:48:19.421Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:19.421Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 4, 1, 'Taorian’izany, dia nahita varavarana nisokatra tany an-danitra aho. Ary hoatran’ny feona trompetra ny feo voalohany henoko niresaka tamiko. Dia hoy izy: “Miakara atỳ, dia hasehoko anao izay zavatra hitranga.”', 'taorian’izany, dia nahita varavarana nisokatra tany an-danitra aho. ary hoatran’ny feona trompetra ny feo voalohany henoko niresaka tamiko. dia hoy izy: “miakara atỳ, dia hasehoko anao izay zavatra hitranga.”'),
  ('6ab25cf38ab89111f4caae71', '2026-09-22T10:48:19.421Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:19.421Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 4, 7, 'Hoatran’ny liona ilay zavamananaina voalohany, ary hoatran’ny vantotr’ombilahy ilay zavamananaina faharoa. Mitovy amin’ny tarehin’olona ny tarehin’ilay zavamananaina fahatelo, ary hoatran’ny voromahery manidina ilay zavamananaina fahefatra.', 'hoatran’ny liona ilay zavamananaina voalohany, ary hoatran’ny vantotr’ombilahy ilay zavamananaina faharoa. mitovy amin’ny tarehin’olona ny tarehin’ilay zavamananaina fahatelo, ary hoatran’ny voromahery manidina ilay zavamananaina fahefatra.'),
  ('6ab25cf40e8868910690c844', '2026-09-22T10:48:20.588Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:20.588Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 5, 2, 'Dia nahita anjely mahery aho niantsoantso mafy hoe: “Iza no mendrika hanokatra an’ilay horonam-boky ka hanala ny tombo-kaseny?”', 'dia nahita anjely mahery aho niantsoantso mafy hoe: “iza no mendrika hanokatra an’ilay horonam-boky ka hanala ny tombo-kaseny?”'),
  ('6ab25cf40e8868910690c847', '2026-09-22T10:48:20.588Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:20.588Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 5, 5, 'Hoy anefa ny iray tamin’ny anti-panahy tamiko: “Aza mitomany intsony. Efa nandresy mantsy ilay Liona avy amin’ny fokon’i Joda, ilay fakan’i Davida, ka ho afaka hanokatra an’ilay horonam-boky sy ny tombo-kaseny fito.”', 'hoy anefa ny iray tamin’ny anti-panahy tamiko: “aza mitomany intsony. efa nandresy mantsy ilay liona avy amin’ny fokon’i joda, ilay fakan’i davida, ka ho afaka hanokatra an’ilay horonam-boky sy ny tombo-kaseny fito.”'),
  ('6ab25cf40e8868910690c845', '2026-09-22T10:48:20.588Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:20.588Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 5, 3, 'Tsy nisy afaka nanokatra an’ilay horonam-boky na nijery ny tao anatiny anefa ny tany an-danitra, na ny teto an-tany, na ny tany ambanin’ny tany.', 'tsy nisy afaka nanokatra an’ilay horonam-boky na nijery ny tao anatiny anefa ny tany an-danitra, na ny teto an-tany, na ny tany ambanin’ny tany.'),
  ('6ab25cf40e8868910690c848', '2026-09-22T10:48:20.588Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:20.588Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 5, 6, 'Ary nahita zanak’ondry nijoro teo akaikin’ny seza fiandrianana aho, teo afovoan’ny zavamananaina efatra sy ny anti-panahy. Hoatran’ny efa novonoina ho faty ilay zanak’ondry. Nanana tandroka fito sy maso fito izy, ka ireo maso ireo dia ny fanahy fito nirahin’Andriamanitra maneran-tany.', 'ary nahita zanak’ondry nijoro teo akaikin’ny seza fiandrianana aho, teo afovoan’ny zavamananaina efatra sy ny anti-panahy. hoatran’ny efa novonoina ho faty ilay zanak’ondry. nanana tandroka fito sy maso fito izy, ka ireo maso ireo dia ny fanahy fito nirahin’andriamanitra maneran-tany.'),
  ('6ab25cf40e8868910690c850', '2026-09-22T10:48:20.588Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:20.588Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 5, 14, 'Dia niteny ireo zavamananaina efatra ireo hoe: “Amena!” Dia niankohoka sy nivavaka ny anti-panahy.', 'dia niteny ireo zavamananaina efatra ireo hoe: “amena!” dia niankohoka sy nivavaka ny anti-panahy.'),
  ('6ab25cf40e8868910690c84d', '2026-09-22T10:48:20.588Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:20.588Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 5, 11, 'Ary nijery aho dia nahita anjely be dia be nanodidina an’ilay seza fiandrianana sy ny zavamananaina ary ny anti-panahy, sady naheno ny feon’izy ireo. Alinalina sy arivoarivo ny isan’izy ireo.', 'ary nijery aho dia nahita anjely be dia be nanodidina an’ilay seza fiandrianana sy ny zavamananaina ary ny anti-panahy, sady naheno ny feon’izy ireo. alinalina sy arivoarivo ny isan’izy ireo.'),
  ('6ab25cf40e8868910690c843', '2026-09-22T10:48:20.588Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:20.588Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 5, 1, 'Ary nahita horonam-boky teny an-tanana ankavanan’Ilay nipetraka teo ambonin’ny seza fiandrianana aho. Nisy soratra ambadika sy ambadika ilay horonam-boky sady voahidy mafy tamin’ny tombo-kase fito.', 'ary nahita horonam-boky teny an-tanana ankavanan’ilay nipetraka teo ambonin’ny seza fiandrianana aho. nisy soratra ambadika sy ambadika ilay horonam-boky sady voahidy mafy tamin’ny tombo-kase fito.'),
  ('6ab25cf40e8868910690c849', '2026-09-22T10:48:20.588Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:20.588Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 5, 7, 'Tonga dia nandroso ilay zanak’ondry, ka nalainy ilay horonam-boky teny an-tanana ankavanan’Ilay nipetraka teo ambonin’ny seza fiandrianana.', 'tonga dia nandroso ilay zanak’ondry, ka nalainy ilay horonam-boky teny an-tanana ankavanan’ilay nipetraka teo ambonin’ny seza fiandrianana.'),
  ('6ab25cf40e8868910690c846', '2026-09-22T10:48:20.588Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:20.588Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 5, 4, 'Dia nitomany be aho satria tsy mba nisy mendrika hanokatra an’ilay horonam-boky na hijery ny tao anatiny.', 'dia nitomany be aho satria tsy mba nisy mendrika hanokatra an’ilay horonam-boky na hijery ny tao anatiny.'),
  ('6ab25cf40e8868910690c84a', '2026-09-22T10:48:20.588Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:20.588Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 5, 8, 'Rehefa noraisin’ny Zanak’ondry ilay horonam-boky, dia niankohoka teo anatrehany ny zavamananaina efatra sy ny anti-panahy 24. Samy nanana harpa sy vilia volamena feno emboka manitra ireo anti-panahy ireo.—Ilay emboka manitra dia ny vavaky ny olona masina.—', 'rehefa noraisin’ny zanak’ondry ilay horonam-boky, dia niankohoka teo anatrehany ny zavamananaina efatra sy ny anti-panahy 24. samy nanana harpa sy vilia volamena feno emboka manitra ireo anti-panahy ireo.—ilay emboka manitra dia ny vavaky ny olona masina.—'),
  ('6ab25cf40e8868910690c84f', '2026-09-22T10:48:20.588Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:20.588Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 5, 13, 'Ary ny zavaboary rehetra tany an-danitra sy teto an-tany sy tany ambanin’ny tany ary tany an-dranomasina, sy ny zava-drehetra tao amin’ireo, dia henoko niteny hoe: “Ho an’Ilay mipetraka eo ambonin’ny seza fiandrianana sy ho an’ny Zanak’ondry anie ny fisaorana sy ny haja sy ny voninahitra ary ny hery mandrakizay mandrakizay!”', 'ary ny zavaboary rehetra tany an-danitra sy teto an-tany sy tany ambanin’ny tany ary tany an-dranomasina, sy ny zava-drehetra tao amin’ireo, dia henoko niteny hoe: “ho an’ilay mipetraka eo ambonin’ny seza fiandrianana sy ho an’ny zanak’ondry anie ny fisaorana sy ny haja sy ny voninahitra ary ny hery mandrakizay mandrakizay!”'),
  ('6ab25cf40e8868910690c84b', '2026-09-22T10:48:20.588Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:20.588Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 5, 9, 'Dia nihira hira vaovao izy ireo hoe: “Mendrika handray an’ilay horonam-boky sy hamaha ny tombo-kaseny ianao. Efa novonoina ho faty mantsy ianao, ary ny ranao no nividiananao olona avy tamin’ny foko sy fiteny sy vahoaka ary firenena rehetra, mba ho an’Andriamanitra.', 'dia nihira hira vaovao izy ireo hoe: “mendrika handray an’ilay horonam-boky sy hamaha ny tombo-kaseny ianao. efa novonoina ho faty mantsy ianao, ary ny ranao no nividiananao olona avy tamin’ny foko sy fiteny sy vahoaka ary firenena rehetra, mba ho an’andriamanitra.'),
  ('6ab25cf40e8868910690c84c', '2026-09-22T10:48:20.588Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:20.588Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 5, 10, 'Ary nataonao fanjakana sy mpisorona ho an’ny Andriamanitsika koa ireo, ka ho mpanjaka hitondra ny tany.”', 'ary nataonao fanjakana sy mpisorona ho an’ny andriamanitsika koa ireo, ka ho mpanjaka hitondra ny tany.”'),
  ('6ab25cf40e8868910690c84e', '2026-09-22T10:48:20.588Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:20.588Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 5, 12, 'Niteny mafy izy ireo hoe: “Mendrika handray fahefana sy harena sy fahendrena sy hery sy haja sy voninahitra ary fisaorana ny Zanak’ondry, izay efa novonoina ho faty.”', 'niteny mafy izy ireo hoe: “mendrika handray fahefana sy harena sy fahendrena sy hery sy haja sy voninahitra ary fisaorana ny zanak’ondry, izay efa novonoina ho faty.”'),
  ('6ab25cf5924f71b0e7726c05', '2026-09-22T10:48:21.102Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:21.102Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 6, 17, 'Fa tonga ilay andro lehibe ampisehoan’izy ireo ny hatezerany, ka iza no mahavita miatrika an’izany?”', 'fa tonga ilay andro lehibe ampisehoan’izy ireo ny hatezerany, ka iza no mahavita miatrika an’izany?”'),
  ('6ab25cf5924f71b0e7726bfb', '2026-09-22T10:48:21.102Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:21.102Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 6, 7, 'Rehefa nosokafany ny tombo-kase fahefatra, dia henoko ny feon’ny zavamananaina fahefatra niteny hoe: “Avia!”', 'rehefa nosokafany ny tombo-kase fahefatra, dia henoko ny feon’ny zavamananaina fahefatra niteny hoe: “avia!”'),
  ('6ab25cf5924f71b0e7726bf8', '2026-09-22T10:48:21.102Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:21.102Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 6, 4, 'Nisy soavaly hafa koa nivoaka, dia soavaly mena hoatran’ny afo. Nomena sabatra lehibe ilay nitaingina azy, ka navela hanala ny fandriampahalemana eto an-tany, amin’izay hifandripaka ny olona.', 'nisy soavaly hafa koa nivoaka, dia soavaly mena hoatran’ny afo. nomena sabatra lehibe ilay nitaingina azy, ka navela hanala ny fandriampahalemana eto an-tany, amin’izay hifandripaka ny olona.'),
  ('6ab25cf5924f71b0e7726bfc', '2026-09-22T10:48:21.102Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:21.102Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 6, 8, 'Dia hitako fa iny nisy soavaly hatsatra. Nantsoina hoe Fahafatesana ilay nitaingina azy, ary nanaraka azy akaiky ny Fasana. Dia nomena fahefana tamin’ny ampahefatry ny tany ireny mba hamono olona amin’ny sabatra lava be sy ny mosary sy ny aretina mahafaty ary ny bibidia eto an-tany.', 'dia hitako fa iny nisy soavaly hatsatra. nantsoina hoe fahafatesana ilay nitaingina azy, ary nanaraka azy akaiky ny fasana. dia nomena fahefana tamin’ny ampahefatry ny tany ireny mba hamono olona amin’ny sabatra lava be sy ny mosary sy ny aretina mahafaty ary ny bibidia eto an-tany.'),
  ('6ab25cf5924f71b0e7726c04', '2026-09-22T10:48:21.102Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:21.102Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 6, 16, 'Ary niteny tsy an-kijanona tamin’ny tendrombohitra sy ny vatolampy izy ireo hoe: “Mianjerà aminay, dia afeno izahay mba tsy ho hitan’Ilay mipetraka eo ambonin’ny seza fiandrianana, ary mba tsy hiharan’ny fahatezeran’ny Zanak’ondry.', 'ary niteny tsy an-kijanona tamin’ny tendrombohitra sy ny vatolampy izy ireo hoe: “mianjerà aminay, dia afeno izahay mba tsy ho hitan’ilay mipetraka eo ambonin’ny seza fiandrianana, ary mba tsy hiharan’ny fahatezeran’ny zanak’ondry.'),
  ('6ab25cf5924f71b0e7726c01', '2026-09-22T10:48:21.102Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:21.102Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 6, 13, 'Dia niraraka tamin’ny tany ny kintana teny amin’ny lanitra, toy ny aviavy manta mihintsana avy eny ambony hazo rehefa hozongozonin’ny rivotra mifofofofo.', 'dia niraraka tamin’ny tany ny kintana teny amin’ny lanitra, toy ny aviavy manta mihintsana avy eny ambony hazo rehefa hozongozonin’ny rivotra mifofofofo.'),
  ('6ab25cf5924f71b0e7726bf7', '2026-09-22T10:48:21.102Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:21.102Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 6, 3, 'Rehefa nosokafany ny tombo-kase faharoa, dia henoko ny zavamananaina faharoa niteny hoe: “Avia!”', 'rehefa nosokafany ny tombo-kase faharoa, dia henoko ny zavamananaina faharoa niteny hoe: “avia!”'),
  ('6ab25cf5924f71b0e7726bf6', '2026-09-22T10:48:21.102Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:21.102Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 6, 2, 'Dia nahita soavaly fotsy aho. Nanana tsipìka ilay nitaingina azy, ary nomena satroboninahitra. Dia nivoaka mba handresy sy hamita ny fandreseny izy.', 'dia nahita soavaly fotsy aho. nanana tsipìka ilay nitaingina azy, ary nomena satroboninahitra. dia nivoaka mba handresy sy hamita ny fandreseny izy.'),
  ('6ab25cf5924f71b0e7726bf5', '2026-09-22T10:48:21.102Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:21.102Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 6, 1, 'Ary hitako ny Zanak’ondry nanokatra ny iray tamin’ny tombo-kase fito. Dia henoko ny iray tamin’ny zavamananaina efatra niteny hoe: “Avia!” Ary hoatran’ny kotroka ny feony.', 'ary hitako ny zanak’ondry nanokatra ny iray tamin’ny tombo-kase fito. dia henoko ny iray tamin’ny zavamananaina efatra niteny hoe: “avia!” ary hoatran’ny kotroka ny feony.'),
  ('6ab25cf5924f71b0e7726bf9', '2026-09-22T10:48:21.102Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:21.102Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 6, 5, 'Rehefa nosokafany ny tombo-kase fahatelo, dia henoko ny zavamananaina fahatelo niteny hoe: “Avia!” Dia hitako fa iny nisy soavaly mainty, ary nisy mizana teny an-tanan’ilay nitaingina azy.', 'rehefa nosokafany ny tombo-kase fahatelo, dia henoko ny zavamananaina fahatelo niteny hoe: “avia!” dia hitako fa iny nisy soavaly mainty, ary nisy mizana teny an-tanan’ilay nitaingina azy.'),
  ('6ab25cf5924f71b0e7726c00', '2026-09-22T10:48:21.102Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:21.102Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 6, 12, 'Ary hitako ny nanokafany ny tombo-kase fahenina. Dia nisy horohoron-tany lehibe ka lasa mainty hoatran’ny lamba gony vita amin’ny volom-biby ny masoandro, ary lasa mena hoatran’ny ra ny volana manontolo.', 'ary hitako ny nanokafany ny tombo-kase fahenina. dia nisy horohoron-tany lehibe ka lasa mainty hoatran’ny lamba gony vita amin’ny volom-biby ny masoandro, ary lasa mena hoatran’ny ra ny volana manontolo.'),
  ('6ab25cf5924f71b0e7726bff', '2026-09-22T10:48:21.102Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:21.102Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 6, 11, 'Samy nomena akanjo fotsy lava izy ireo, ka nasaina niandry kely aloha, mandra-pahafenon’ny isan’ny mpiara-manompo aminy sy ny rahalahiny, izay efa hovonoina hoatr’azy ireo koa.', 'samy nomena akanjo fotsy lava izy ireo, ka nasaina niandry kely aloha, mandra-pahafenon’ny isan’ny mpiara-manompo aminy sy ny rahalahiny, izay efa hovonoina hoatr’azy ireo koa.'),
  ('6ab25cf5924f71b0e7726c02', '2026-09-22T10:48:21.102Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:21.102Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 6, 14, 'Ary tsy teo intsony ny lanitra fa nahorona hoatran’ny horonam-boky. Nesorina tamin’ny toerany koa ny tendrombohitra sy ny nosy rehetra.', 'ary tsy teo intsony ny lanitra fa nahorona hoatran’ny horonam-boky. nesorina tamin’ny toerany koa ny tendrombohitra sy ny nosy rehetra.'),
  ('6ab25cf5924f71b0e7726bfd', '2026-09-22T10:48:21.102Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:21.102Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 6, 9, 'Rehefa nosokafany ny tombo-kase fahadimy, dia hitako teo ambany alitara ny ran’ny olona novonoina noho izy ireo nanaraka ny tenin’Andriamanitra sady nitory.', 'rehefa nosokafany ny tombo-kase fahadimy, dia hitako teo ambany alitara ny ran’ny olona novonoina noho izy ireo nanaraka ny tenin’andriamanitra sady nitory.'),
  ('6ab25cf5924f71b0e7726bfa', '2026-09-22T10:48:21.102Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:21.102Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 6, 6, 'Naheno hoatran’ny feo teo afovoan’ny zavamananaina efatra aho, niteny hoe: “Iray denaria no vidin’ny varimbazaha iray kilao, ary iray denaria ny vary orza telo kilao. Ary aza simbana ny menak’oliva sy ny divay.”', 'naheno hoatran’ny feo teo afovoan’ny zavamananaina efatra aho, niteny hoe: “iray denaria no vidin’ny varimbazaha iray kilao, ary iray denaria ny vary orza telo kilao. ary aza simbana ny menak’oliva sy ny divay.”'),
  ('6ab25cf5924f71b0e7726c03', '2026-09-22T10:48:21.102Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:21.102Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 6, 15, 'Dia niafina tany anaty lava-bato sy tany amin’ny vatolampy teny an-tendrombohitra ny mpanjakan’ny tany, ny manam-pahefana ambony, ny mpitari-tafika, ny mpanankarena, ny olona matanjaka, ny mpanompo rehetra, ary ny olona afaka rehetra.', 'dia niafina tany anaty lava-bato sy tany amin’ny vatolampy teny an-tendrombohitra ny mpanjakan’ny tany, ny manam-pahefana ambony, ny mpitari-tafika, ny mpanankarena, ny olona matanjaka, ny mpanompo rehetra, ary ny olona afaka rehetra.'),
  ('6ab25cf5924f71b0e7726bfe', '2026-09-22T10:48:21.102Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:21.102Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 6, 10, 'Dia niantsoantso mafy izy ireo hoe: “Ry Tompo Fara Tampony ô, ilay masina sy marina, rahoviana ihany ianao vao hitsara ny olona mipetraka eny ambonin’ny tany ka hamaly ny ranay nalatsak’izy ireny?”', 'dia niantsoantso mafy izy ireo hoe: “ry tompo fara tampony ô, ilay masina sy marina, rahoviana ihany ianao vao hitsara ny olona mipetraka eny ambonin’ny tany ka hamaly ny ranay nalatsak’izy ireny?”'),
  ('6ab25cf55327cbdf5a1df6db', '2026-09-22T10:48:21.550Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:21.550Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 7, 3, 'hoe: “Aza simbana ny tany na ny ranomasina na ny hazo, raha tsy efa avy nasianay tombo-kase ny handrin’ny mpanompon’Andriamanitsika.”', 'hoe: “aza simbana ny tany na ny ranomasina na ny hazo, raha tsy efa avy nasianay tombo-kase ny handrin’ny mpanompon’andriamanitsika.”'),
  ('6ab25cf55327cbdf5a1df6e1', '2026-09-22T10:48:21.550Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:21.550Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 7, 9, 'Taorian’izany, dia hitako fa ireo nisy vahoaka be tsy hita isa, avy tamin’ny firenena sy foko sy firazanana ary fiteny rehetra. Nitsangana teo anoloan’ny seza fiandrianana sy teo anatrehan’ny Zanak’ondry izy ireo sady nanao akanjo fotsy lava, ary nisy sampana palmie teny an-tanany.', 'taorian’izany, dia hitako fa ireo nisy vahoaka be tsy hita isa, avy tamin’ny firenena sy foko sy firazanana ary fiteny rehetra. nitsangana teo anoloan’ny seza fiandrianana sy teo anatrehan’ny zanak’ondry izy ireo sady nanao akanjo fotsy lava, ary nisy sampana palmie teny an-tanany.'),
  ('6ab25cf55327cbdf5a1df6dc', '2026-09-22T10:48:21.550Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:21.550Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 7, 4, 'Ary reko ny isan’ny olona voaisy tombo-kase, dia 144 000. Voaisy tombo-kase avy tamin’ny foko rehetra teo amin’ny zanak’Israely izy ireo. Ireto avy izany:', 'ary reko ny isan’ny olona voaisy tombo-kase, dia 144 000. voaisy tombo-kase avy tamin’ny foko rehetra teo amin’ny zanak’israely izy ireo. ireto avy izany:'),
  ('6ab25cf55327cbdf5a1df6e7', '2026-09-22T10:48:21.550Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:21.550Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 7, 15, 'Izany no mahatonga azy ireo hijoro eo anoloan’ny seza fiandrianan’Andriamanitra. Manao fanompoana masina ho an’Andriamanitra andro aman’alina ao amin’ny tempoliny izy ireo. Ary hamelatra ny tranolainy eo ambonin’izy ireo Ilay mipetraka eo ambonin’ny seza fiandrianana.', 'izany no mahatonga azy ireo hijoro eo anoloan’ny seza fiandrianan’andriamanitra. manao fanompoana masina ho an’andriamanitra andro aman’alina ao amin’ny tempoliny izy ireo. ary hamelatra ny tranolainy eo ambonin’izy ireo ilay mipetraka eo ambonin’ny seza fiandrianana.'),
  ('6ab25cf55327cbdf5a1df6e9', '2026-09-22T10:48:21.550Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:21.550Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 7, 17, 'Hiandry azy ireo hoatran’ny ataon’ny mpiandry ondry mantsy ilay Zanak’ondry eo akaikin’ny seza fiandrianana, dia hitarika azy ireo ho any amin’ny loharanon’ny ranon’aina. Ary hofafan’Andriamanitra ny ranomaso rehetra amin’ny mason’izy ireo.”', 'hiandry azy ireo hoatran’ny ataon’ny mpiandry ondry mantsy ilay zanak’ondry eo akaikin’ny seza fiandrianana, dia hitarika azy ireo ho any amin’ny loharanon’ny ranon’aina. ary hofafan’andriamanitra ny ranomaso rehetra amin’ny mason’izy ireo.”'),
  ('6ab25cf55327cbdf5a1df6e8', '2026-09-22T10:48:21.550Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:21.550Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 7, 16, 'Tsy mba ho noana na hangetaheta intsony ireo, ary tsy hamely azy ny masoandro na ny hafanana mandoro.', 'tsy mba ho noana na hangetaheta intsony ireo, ary tsy hamely azy ny masoandro na ny hafanana mandoro.'),
  ('6ab25cf55327cbdf5a1df6de', '2026-09-22T10:48:21.550Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:21.550Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 7, 6, 'ny avy tamin’ny fokon’i Asera, 12 000; ny avy tamin’ny fokon’i Naftaly, 12 000; ny avy tamin’ny fokon’i Manase, 12 000;', 'ny avy tamin’ny fokon’i asera, 12 000; ny avy tamin’ny fokon’i naftaly, 12 000; ny avy tamin’ny fokon’i manase, 12 000;'),
  ('6ab25cf55327cbdf5a1df6e2', '2026-09-22T10:48:21.550Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:21.550Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 7, 10, 'Dia niantsoantso mafy tsy an-kijanona izy ireo hoe: “Avy amin’ilay Andriamanitsika mipetraka eo ambonin’ny seza fiandrianana, sy avy amin’ny Zanak’ondry, no ahazoanay famonjena!”', 'dia niantsoantso mafy tsy an-kijanona izy ireo hoe: “avy amin’ilay andriamanitsika mipetraka eo ambonin’ny seza fiandrianana, sy avy amin’ny zanak’ondry, no ahazoanay famonjena!”'),
  ('6ab25cf55327cbdf5a1df6dd', '2026-09-22T10:48:21.550Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:21.550Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 7, 5, 'Ny avy tamin’ny fokon’i Joda dia 12 000 no voaisy tombo-kase; ny avy tamin’ny fokon’i Robena, 12 000; ny avy tamin’ny fokon’i Gada, 12 000;', 'ny avy tamin’ny fokon’i joda dia 12 000 no voaisy tombo-kase; ny avy tamin’ny fokon’i robena, 12 000; ny avy tamin’ny fokon’i gada, 12 000;'),
  ('6ab25cf55327cbdf5a1df6e6', '2026-09-22T10:48:21.550Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:21.550Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 7, 14, 'Tonga dia namaly azy aho hoe: “Ianao, tompoko, no mahalala.” Dia hoy izy tamiko: “Ireo no avy tamin’ny fahoriana lehibe, ary nosasany sy nofotsiany tamin’ny ran’ny Zanak’ondry ny akanjony.', 'tonga dia namaly azy aho hoe: “ianao, tompoko, no mahalala.” dia hoy izy tamiko: “ireo no avy tamin’ny fahoriana lehibe, ary nosasany sy nofotsiany tamin’ny ran’ny zanak’ondry ny akanjony.'),
  ('6ab25cf55327cbdf5a1df6e4', '2026-09-22T10:48:21.550Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:21.550Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 7, 12, 'hoe: “Amena! Ho an’Andriamanitsika mandrakizay mandrakizay anie ny dera, ny voninahitra, ny fahendrena, ny fisaorana, ny haja, ny hery, ary ny tanjaka! Amena.”', 'hoe: “amena! ho an’andriamanitsika mandrakizay mandrakizay anie ny dera, ny voninahitra, ny fahendrena, ny fisaorana, ny haja, ny hery, ary ny tanjaka! amena.”'),
  ('6ab25cf55327cbdf5a1df6df', '2026-09-22T10:48:21.550Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:21.550Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 7, 7, 'ny avy tamin’ny fokon’i Simeona, 12 000; ny avy tamin’ny fokon’i Levy, 12 000; ny avy tamin’ny fokon’i Isakara, 12 000;', 'ny avy tamin’ny fokon’i simeona, 12 000; ny avy tamin’ny fokon’i levy, 12 000; ny avy tamin’ny fokon’i isakara, 12 000;'),
  ('6ab25cf55327cbdf5a1df6e3', '2026-09-22T10:48:21.550Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:21.550Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 7, 11, 'Nijoro nanodidina ny seza fiandrianana sy ny anti-panahy ary ny zavamananaina efatra ny anjely rehetra, ka niankohoka teo anoloan’ny seza fiandrianana sady nivavaka tamin’Andriamanitra,', 'nijoro nanodidina ny seza fiandrianana sy ny anti-panahy ary ny zavamananaina efatra ny anjely rehetra, ka niankohoka teo anoloan’ny seza fiandrianana sady nivavaka tamin’andriamanitra,'),
  ('6ab25cf55327cbdf5a1df6da', '2026-09-22T10:48:21.550Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:21.550Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 7, 2, 'Nahita anjely anankiray niakatra avy any amin’ny fiposahan’ny masoandro koa aho. Nitazona ny tombo-kasen’ilay Andriamanitra velona izy, sady niantsoantso mafy ka niteny tamin’ireo anjely efatra nomena alalana hanimba ny tany sy ny ranomasina,', 'nahita anjely anankiray niakatra avy any amin’ny fiposahan’ny masoandro koa aho. nitazona ny tombo-kasen’ilay andriamanitra velona izy, sady niantsoantso mafy ka niteny tamin’ireo anjely efatra nomena alalana hanimba ny tany sy ny ranomasina,'),
  ('6ab25cf55327cbdf5a1df6e0', '2026-09-22T10:48:21.550Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:21.550Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 7, 8, 'ny avy tamin’ny fokon’i Zebolona, 12 000; ny avy tamin’ny fokon’i Josefa, 12 000; ary ny avy tamin’ny fokon’i Benjamina dia 12 000 no voaisy tombo-kase.', 'ny avy tamin’ny fokon’i zebolona, 12 000; ny avy tamin’ny fokon’i josefa, 12 000; ary ny avy tamin’ny fokon’i benjamina dia 12 000 no voaisy tombo-kase.'),
  ('6ab25cf55327cbdf5a1df6d9', '2026-09-22T10:48:21.550Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:21.550Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 7, 1, 'Taorian’izany, dia nahita anjely efatra nijoro teo amin’ny vazan-tany efatra aho. Nitazona mafy ny rivotra efatry ny tany izy ireo, mba tsy hisy rivotra hitsoka eny amin’ny tany na eny amin’ny ranomasina na eny amin’ny hazo.', 'taorian’izany, dia nahita anjely efatra nijoro teo amin’ny vazan-tany efatra aho. nitazona mafy ny rivotra efatry ny tany izy ireo, mba tsy hisy rivotra hitsoka eny amin’ny tany na eny amin’ny ranomasina na eny amin’ny hazo.'),
  ('6ab25cf55327cbdf5a1df6e5', '2026-09-22T10:48:21.550Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:21.550Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 7, 13, 'Dia hoy ny anti-panahy iray tamiko: “Fa iza ireo manao akanjo fotsy lava ireo, ary avy aiza izy ireo?”', 'dia hoy ny anti-panahy iray tamiko: “fa iza ireo manao akanjo fotsy lava ireo, ary avy aiza izy ireo?”'),
  ('6ab25cf5ae2127f1d3ddb6e5', '2026-09-22T10:48:21.984Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:21.984Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 8, 10, 'Nitsoka ny trompetrany ny anjely fahatelo. Dia nisy kintana lehibe nirehitra hoatran’ny jiro nilatsaka avy any an-danitra. Ary latsaka tamin’ny ampahatelon’ny renirano sy tamin’ny loharano ilay izy.', 'nitsoka ny trompetrany ny anjely fahatelo. dia nisy kintana lehibe nirehitra hoatran’ny jiro nilatsaka avy any an-danitra. ary latsaka tamin’ny ampahatelon’ny renirano sy tamin’ny loharano ilay izy.'),
  ('6ab25cf5ae2127f1d3ddb6e6', '2026-09-22T10:48:21.984Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:21.984Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 8, 11, 'Ny anaran’ilay kintana dia Zavamaniry Mangidy Be. Dia lasa nangidy be ny ampahatelon’ny rano, ka betsaka ny olona matin’ilay rano, satria efa natao nangidy ilay izy.', 'ny anaran’ilay kintana dia zavamaniry mangidy be. dia lasa nangidy be ny ampahatelon’ny rano, ka betsaka ny olona matin’ilay rano, satria efa natao nangidy ilay izy.'),
  ('6ab25cf5ae2127f1d3ddb6e4', '2026-09-22T10:48:21.984Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:21.984Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 8, 9, 'maty ny ampahatelon’ny zavamananaina tao an-dranomasina, ary rendrika ny ampahatelon’ny sambo.', 'maty ny ampahatelon’ny zavamananaina tao an-dranomasina, ary rendrika ny ampahatelon’ny sambo.'),
  ('6ab25cf5ae2127f1d3ddb6e3', '2026-09-22T10:48:21.984Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:21.984Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 8, 8, 'Nitsoka ny trompetrany ny anjely faharoa. Dia nisy zavatra hoatran’ny tendrombohitra lehibe nirehitra afo, natsipy mafy tany an-dranomasina. Dia lasa ra ny ampahatelon’ny ranomasina,', 'nitsoka ny trompetrany ny anjely faharoa. dia nisy zavatra hoatran’ny tendrombohitra lehibe nirehitra afo, natsipy mafy tany an-dranomasina. dia lasa ra ny ampahatelon’ny ranomasina,'),
  ('6ab25cf5ae2127f1d3ddb6df', '2026-09-22T10:48:21.984Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:21.984Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 8, 4, 'Dia niakatra avy teo an-tanan’ilay anjely ho eo anatrehan’Andriamanitra ny setroky ny emboka manitra, niaraka tamin’ny vavaky ny olona masina.', 'dia niakatra avy teo an-tanan’ilay anjely ho eo anatrehan’andriamanitra ny setroky ny emboka manitra, niaraka tamin’ny vavaky ny olona masina.'),
  ('6ab25cf5ae2127f1d3ddb6e8', '2026-09-22T10:48:21.984Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:21.984Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 8, 13, 'Ary nahita voromahery nanidina teny afovoan’ny lanitra aho, dia henoko izy niantsoantso mafy hoe: “Loza, loza, loza ho an’izay mipetraka eny ambonin’ny tany, satria efa hitsoka trompetra ny anjely telo ambiny!”', 'ary nahita voromahery nanidina teny afovoan’ny lanitra aho, dia henoko izy niantsoantso mafy hoe: “loza, loza, loza ho an’izay mipetraka eny ambonin’ny tany, satria efa hitsoka trompetra ny anjely telo ambiny!”'),
  ('6ab25cf5ae2127f1d3ddb6e2', '2026-09-22T10:48:21.984Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:21.984Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 8, 7, 'Nitsoka ny trompetrany ny anjely voalohany. Dia nisy havandra sy afo nifangaro ra, ary natsipy mafy tetỳ an-tany izany. Dia may ny ampahatelon’ny tany, may ny ampahatelon’ny hazo, ary may daholo koa ny ahi-maitso.', 'nitsoka ny trompetrany ny anjely voalohany. dia nisy havandra sy afo nifangaro ra, ary natsipy mafy tetỳ an-tany izany. dia may ny ampahatelon’ny tany, may ny ampahatelon’ny hazo, ary may daholo koa ny ahi-maitso.'),
  ('6ab25cf5ae2127f1d3ddb6e1', '2026-09-22T10:48:21.984Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:21.984Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 8, 6, 'Dia niomana hitsoka trompetra ny anjely fito nomena trompetra fito.', 'dia niomana hitsoka trompetra ny anjely fito nomena trompetra fito.'),
  ('6ab25cf5ae2127f1d3ddb6dc', '2026-09-22T10:48:21.984Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:21.984Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 8, 1, 'Rehefa nosokafany ny tombo-kase fahafito, dia nangina antsasak’adiny teo ho eo ny tany an-danitra.', 'rehefa nosokafany ny tombo-kase fahafito, dia nangina antsasak’adiny teo ho eo ny tany an-danitra.'),
  ('6ab25cf5ae2127f1d3ddb6e7', '2026-09-22T10:48:21.984Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:21.984Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 8, 12, 'Nitsoka ny trompetrany ny anjely fahefatra. Dia nokapohina ny ampahatelon’ny masoandro sy ny ampahatelon’ny volana ary ny ampahatelon’ny kintana, mba ho maizina ny ampahatelon’ireny ka tsy hazava ny ampahatelon’ny andro, ary ho toy izany koa ny alina.', 'nitsoka ny trompetrany ny anjely fahefatra. dia nokapohina ny ampahatelon’ny masoandro sy ny ampahatelon’ny volana ary ny ampahatelon’ny kintana, mba ho maizina ny ampahatelon’ireny ka tsy hazava ny ampahatelon’ny andro, ary ho toy izany koa ny alina.'),
  ('6ab25cf5ae2127f1d3ddb6e0', '2026-09-22T10:48:21.984Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:21.984Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 8, 5, 'Tonga dia noraisin’ilay anjely anefa ilay fitaovana fandoroana emboka manitra, ka nofenoiny afo avy teo amin’ny alitara. Dia natsipiny mafy tetỳ an-tany ilay afo, ka nisy kotroka sy feo sy tselatra ary horohoron-tany.', 'tonga dia noraisin’ilay anjely anefa ilay fitaovana fandoroana emboka manitra, ka nofenoiny afo avy teo amin’ny alitara. dia natsipiny mafy tetỳ an-tany ilay afo, ka nisy kotroka sy feo sy tselatra ary horohoron-tany.'),
  ('6ab25cf5ae2127f1d3ddb6de', '2026-09-22T10:48:21.984Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:21.984Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 8, 3, 'Ary nisy anjely anankiray koa tonga nijoro teo akaikin’ny alitara. Nanana fitaovana volamena fandoroana emboka manitra izy. Nomena emboka manitra be dia be izy mba hatolony teo ambonin’ilay alitara volamena teo anoloan’ny seza fiandrianana, niaraka tamin’ny vavaky ny olona masina rehetra.', 'ary nisy anjely anankiray koa tonga nijoro teo akaikin’ny alitara. nanana fitaovana volamena fandoroana emboka manitra izy. nomena emboka manitra be dia be izy mba hatolony teo ambonin’ilay alitara volamena teo anoloan’ny seza fiandrianana, niaraka tamin’ny vavaky ny olona masina rehetra.'),
  ('6ab25cf5ae2127f1d3ddb6dd', '2026-09-22T10:48:21.984Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:21.984Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 8, 2, 'Dia hitako ny anjely fito izay nijoro teo anatrehan’Andriamanitra, ary nomena trompetra fito izy ireo.', 'dia hitako ny anjely fito izay nijoro teo anatrehan’andriamanitra, ary nomena trompetra fito izy ireo.'),
  ('6ab25cf83c13eed7b215cd87', '2026-09-22T10:48:24.170Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:24.170Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 9, 11, 'Nanana mpanjaka izy ireo, dia ny anjelin’ny lavaka mangitsokitsoka: Abadona no anarany amin’ny teny hebreo, fa Apolyona kosa amin’ny teny grika.', 'nanana mpanjaka izy ireo, dia ny anjelin’ny lavaka mangitsokitsoka: abadona no anarany amin’ny teny hebreo, fa apolyona kosa amin’ny teny grika.'),
  ('6ab25cf83c13eed7b215cd83', '2026-09-22T10:48:24.170Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:24.170Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 9, 7, 'Ary nitovy tamin’ny soavaly voaomana ho any an’ady ireo valala ireo. Nisy hoatran’ny satroboninahitra volamena teo amin’ny lohany. Nitovy tamin’ny tarehin’olona ny tarehiny,', 'ary nitovy tamin’ny soavaly voaomana ho any an’ady ireo valala ireo. nisy hoatran’ny satroboninahitra volamena teo amin’ny lohany. nitovy tamin’ny tarehin’olona ny tarehiny,'),
  ('6ab25cf83c13eed7b215cd86', '2026-09-22T10:48:24.170Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:24.170Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 9, 10, 'Nanana rambo misy fanindronana hoatran’ny maingoka koa izy ireo. Ary tao amin’ny rambony no nisy ny hery nahafahany nampijaly olona nandritra ny dimy volana.', 'nanana rambo misy fanindronana hoatran’ny maingoka koa izy ireo. ary tao amin’ny rambony no nisy ny hery nahafahany nampijaly olona nandritra ny dimy volana.'),
  ('6ab25cf83c13eed7b215cd85', '2026-09-22T10:48:24.170Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:24.170Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 9, 9, 'ary nanana fiarovan-tratra tahaka ny fiarovan-tratra vy izy ireo. Ary ny feon’ny elany dia hoatran’ny feon’ny kalesy tarihin’ny soavaly maika ho any an’ady.', 'ary nanana fiarovan-tratra tahaka ny fiarovan-tratra vy izy ireo. ary ny feon’ny elany dia hoatran’ny feon’ny kalesy tarihin’ny soavaly maika ho any an’ady.'),
  ('6ab25cf83c13eed7b215cd84', '2026-09-22T10:48:24.170Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:24.170Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 9, 8, 'fa hoatran’ny volom-behivavy ny volony. Hoatran’ny nifin’ny liona ny nifiny,', 'fa hoatran’ny volom-behivavy ny volony. hoatran’ny nifin’ny liona ny nifiny,'),
  ('6ab25cf83c13eed7b215cd80', '2026-09-22T10:48:24.170Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:24.170Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 9, 4, 'Nilazana izy ireo hoe: “Aza simbana ny zavamaniry amin’ny tany na ny ahi-maitso na ny hazo, fa ny olona tsy manana ny tombo-kasen’Andriamanitra eo amin’ny handriny ihany asiana.”', 'nilazana izy ireo hoe: “aza simbana ny zavamaniry amin’ny tany na ny ahi-maitso na ny hazo, fa ny olona tsy manana ny tombo-kasen’andriamanitra eo amin’ny handriny ihany asiana.”'),
  ('6ab25cf83c13eed7b215cd82', '2026-09-22T10:48:24.170Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:24.170Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 9, 6, 'Dia hitady fahafatesana ny olona amin’izany andro izany fa tsy hahita mihitsy, ary tena te ho faty izy nefa mbola tsy maty ihany.', 'dia hitady fahafatesana ny olona amin’izany andro izany fa tsy hahita mihitsy, ary tena te ho faty izy nefa mbola tsy maty ihany.'),
  ('6ab25cf83c13eed7b215cd8d', '2026-09-22T10:48:24.170Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:24.170Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 9, 17, 'Ary toy izao no fahitako an’ireo soavaly tao amin’ilay fahitana sy ny mpitaingina azy: Nanana fiarovan-tratra mena hoatran’ny afo, sy manga, ary mavo hoatran’ny solifara ny mpitaingina azy. Ary ny lohan’ny soavaly dia tahaka ny lohan’ny liona, ary nisy afo sy setroka sy solifara nivoaka avy tamin’ny vavany.', 'ary toy izao no fahitako an’ireo soavaly tao amin’ilay fahitana sy ny mpitaingina azy: nanana fiarovan-tratra mena hoatran’ny afo, sy manga, ary mavo hoatran’ny solifara ny mpitaingina azy. ary ny lohan’ny soavaly dia tahaka ny lohan’ny liona, ary nisy afo sy setroka sy solifara nivoaka avy tamin’ny vavany.'),
  ('6ab25cf83c13eed7b215cd81', '2026-09-22T10:48:24.170Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:24.170Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 9, 5, 'Ary tsy navela hamono an’ireny olona ireny ho faty ireo valala ireo, fa mba hampijaly azy dimy volana kosa. Nijalijaly hoatran’ny olona voatsindron’ny maingoka ny olona nampijalin’ireo valala ireo.', 'ary tsy navela hamono an’ireny olona ireny ho faty ireo valala ireo, fa mba hampijaly azy dimy volana kosa. nijalijaly hoatran’ny olona voatsindron’ny maingoka ny olona nampijalin’ireo valala ireo.'),
  ('6ab25cf83c13eed7b215cd7f', '2026-09-22T10:48:24.170Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:24.170Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 9, 3, 'Ary nisy valala nivoaka avy tao amin’ilay setroka, dia nanketỳ an-tany. Nomena fahefana toy ny fahefan’ny maingoky ny tany ireo valala ireo.', 'ary nisy valala nivoaka avy tao amin’ilay setroka, dia nanketỳ an-tany. nomena fahefana toy ny fahefan’ny maingoky ny tany ireo valala ireo.'),
  ('6ab25cf83c13eed7b215cd90', '2026-09-22T10:48:24.170Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:24.170Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 9, 20, 'Tsy nibebaka tamin’izay nataony anefa ny olona sisa tsy matin’ireo loza ireo, fa mbola nivavaka foana tamin’ny demonia sy ny sampy volamena sy volafotsy sy varahina sy vato ary hazo. Tsy afaka mahita na mandre na mandeha anefa ireny sampy ireny.', 'tsy nibebaka tamin’izay nataony anefa ny olona sisa tsy matin’ireo loza ireo, fa mbola nivavaka foana tamin’ny demonia sy ny sampy volamena sy volafotsy sy varahina sy vato ary hazo. tsy afaka mahita na mandre na mandeha anefa ireny sampy ireny.'),
  ('6ab25cf83c13eed7b215cd8e', '2026-09-22T10:48:24.170Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:24.170Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 9, 18, 'Dia matin’ireto loza telo ireto ny ampahatelon’ny olona: Ny afo sy ny setroka ary ny solifara nivoaka avy tamin’ny vavan’ny soavaly.', 'dia matin’ireto loza telo ireto ny ampahatelon’ny olona: ny afo sy ny setroka ary ny solifara nivoaka avy tamin’ny vavan’ny soavaly.'),
  ('6ab25cf83c13eed7b215cd8c', '2026-09-22T10:48:24.170Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:24.170Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 9, 16, 'Ary 20 000 ampitomboina 10 000 ny isan’ny miaramila mpitaingin-tsoavaly. Henoko ny isany.', 'ary 20 000 ampitomboina 10 000 ny isan’ny miaramila mpitaingin-tsoavaly. henoko ny isany.'),
  ('6ab25cf83c13eed7b215cd89', '2026-09-22T10:48:24.170Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:24.170Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 9, 13, 'Nitsoka ny trompetrany ny anjely fahenina. Dia naheno feo avy teo amin’ny tandrok’ilay alitara volamena teo anatrehan’Andriamanitra aho.', 'nitsoka ny trompetrany ny anjely fahenina. dia naheno feo avy teo amin’ny tandrok’ilay alitara volamena teo anatrehan’andriamanitra aho.'),
  ('6ab25cf83c13eed7b215cd88', '2026-09-22T10:48:24.170Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:24.170Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 9, 12, 'Lasa ny loza iray. Misy loza roa hafa koa anefa ho avy aorian’izany.', 'lasa ny loza iray. misy loza roa hafa koa anefa ho avy aorian’izany.'),
  ('6ab25cf83c13eed7b215cd7e', '2026-09-22T10:48:24.170Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:24.170Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 9, 2, 'Nosokafany ilay lavaka mangitsokitsoka, dia nisy setroka hoatran’ny setroky ny lafaoro lehibe nivoaka avy tao. Dia lasa maizina ny masoandro sy ny rivotra noho ny setrok’ilay lavaka.', 'nosokafany ilay lavaka mangitsokitsoka, dia nisy setroka hoatran’ny setroky ny lafaoro lehibe nivoaka avy tao. dia lasa maizina ny masoandro sy ny rivotra noho ny setrok’ilay lavaka.'),
  ('6ab25cf83c13eed7b215cd8b', '2026-09-22T10:48:24.170Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:24.170Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 9, 15, 'Dia novahana ny anjely efatra efa voaomana ho amin’izany ora sy andro sy volana ary taona izany. Novahana izy ireo mba hamono ho faty ny ampahatelon’ny olona.', 'dia novahana ny anjely efatra efa voaomana ho amin’izany ora sy andro sy volana ary taona izany. novahana izy ireo mba hamono ho faty ny ampahatelon’ny olona.'),
  ('6ab25cf83c13eed7b215cd91', '2026-09-22T10:48:24.170Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:24.170Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 9, 21, 'Ary tsy nibebaka izy ireo fa mbola namono olona, sy nilalao ody, sy nijangajanga, ary nangalatra ihany.', 'ary tsy nibebaka izy ireo fa mbola namono olona, sy nilalao ody, sy nijangajanga, ary nangalatra ihany.'),
  ('6ab25cf83c13eed7b215cd8f', '2026-09-22T10:48:24.170Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:24.170Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 9, 19, 'Fa teo amin’ny vavany sy ny rambony no nisy ny heriny. Hoatran’ny bibilava mantsy ny rambony sady misy lohany, ary ny rambony no nampijaliany olona.', 'fa teo amin’ny vavany sy ny rambony no nisy ny heriny. hoatran’ny bibilava mantsy ny rambony sady misy lohany, ary ny rambony no nampijaliany olona.'),
  ('6ab25cf83c13eed7b215cd8a', '2026-09-22T10:48:24.170Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:24.170Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 9, 14, 'Hoy ilay feo tamin’ilay anjely fahenina nanana trompetra: “Mba vahao ny anjely efatra mifatotra eo amin’i Eofrata, ilay renirano lehibe.”', 'hoy ilay feo tamin’ilay anjely fahenina nanana trompetra: “mba vahao ny anjely efatra mifatotra eo amin’i eofrata, ilay renirano lehibe.”'),
  ('6ab25cf83c13eed7b215cd7d', '2026-09-22T10:48:24.170Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:24.170Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 9, 1, 'Nitsoka ny trompetrany ny anjely fahadimy. Dia nahita kintana avy any an-danitra nilatsaka tetỳ an-tany aho, ary nomena azy io ny lakilen’ny lavaka mangitsokitsoka.', 'nitsoka ny trompetrany ny anjely fahadimy. dia nahita kintana avy any an-danitra nilatsaka tetỳ an-tany aho, ary nomena azy io ny lakilen’ny lavaka mangitsokitsoka.'),
  ('6ab25cf89007933b50d27305', '2026-09-22T10:48:24.660Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:24.660Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 10, 9, 'Dia nankeny amin’ilay anjely aho ka nasaiko nomeny ahy ilay horonam-boky kely. Ary hoy izy tamiko: “Raiso ity, dia hano ka lanio. Hampangidy ny kibonao izy ity, fa ho mamy hoatran’ny tantely kosa ao am-bavanao.”', 'dia nankeny amin’ilay anjely aho ka nasaiko nomeny ahy ilay horonam-boky kely. ary hoy izy tamiko: “raiso ity, dia hano ka lanio. hampangidy ny kibonao izy ity, fa ho mamy hoatran’ny tantely kosa ao am-bavanao.”');
INSERT INTO "bible_verses" ("id", "created_date", "updated_date", "created_by_id", "created_by", "translation", "book", "bookOrder", "chapter", "verse", "text", "normalizedText") VALUES
  ('6ab25cf89007933b50d272ff', '2026-09-22T10:48:24.660Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:24.660Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 10, 3, 'ary niantsoantso mafy hoatran’ny liona mierona izy. Rehefa niantsoantso izy, dia henoko ny feon’ny kotroka fito.', 'ary niantsoantso mafy hoatran’ny liona mierona izy. rehefa niantsoantso izy, dia henoko ny feon’ny kotroka fito.'),
  ('6ab25cf89007933b50d27307', '2026-09-22T10:48:24.660Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:24.660Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 10, 11, 'Ary nisy nilaza tamiko hoe: “Tsy maintsy mbola maminany momba ny vahoaka sy firenena sy olona samy hafa fiteny ary mpanjaka maro ianao.”', 'ary nisy nilaza tamiko hoe: “tsy maintsy mbola maminany momba ny vahoaka sy firenena sy olona samy hafa fiteny ary mpanjaka maro ianao.”'),
  ('6ab25cf89007933b50d27303', '2026-09-22T10:48:24.660Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:24.660Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 10, 7, 'fa rehefa hitsoka trompetra iny ilay anjely fahafito, dia ho efa tanteraka hatramin’ny farany ilay zava-miafina masina. Ary io zava-miafina io dia ilay vaovao tsara nolazain’Andriamanitra tamin’ny mpaminany mpanompony.”', 'fa rehefa hitsoka trompetra iny ilay anjely fahafito, dia ho efa tanteraka hatramin’ny farany ilay zava-miafina masina. ary io zava-miafina io dia ilay vaovao tsara nolazain’andriamanitra tamin’ny mpaminany mpanompony.”'),
  ('6ab25cf89007933b50d27300', '2026-09-22T10:48:24.660Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:24.660Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 10, 4, 'Ary rehefa niteny ny kotroka fito, dia saika hanoratra aho, kanjo nisy feo avy any an-danitra henoko niteny hoe: “Asio tombo-kase ny zavatra nolazain’ny kotroka fito, fa aza soratana.”', 'ary rehefa niteny ny kotroka fito, dia saika hanoratra aho, kanjo nisy feo avy any an-danitra henoko niteny hoe: “asio tombo-kase ny zavatra nolazain’ny kotroka fito, fa aza soratana.”'),
  ('6ab25cf89007933b50d27306', '2026-09-22T10:48:24.660Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:24.660Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 10, 10, 'Dia noraisiko teny an-tanan’ilay anjely ilay horonam-boky kely ka nohaniko. Dia mamy hoatran’ny tantely ilay izy tao am-bavako, fa rehefa laniko kosa, dia lasa nangidy ny kiboko.', 'dia noraisiko teny an-tanan’ilay anjely ilay horonam-boky kely ka nohaniko. dia mamy hoatran’ny tantely ilay izy tao am-bavako, fa rehefa laniko kosa, dia lasa nangidy ny kiboko.'),
  ('6ab25cf89007933b50d27304', '2026-09-22T10:48:24.660Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:24.660Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 10, 8, 'Niteny tamiko indray ilay feo henoko avy any an-danitra hoe: “Mandehana raiso ilay horonam-boky mivelatra eny an-tanan’ilay anjely mijoro eo ambonin’ny ranomasina sy eo amin’ny tany.”', 'niteny tamiko indray ilay feo henoko avy any an-danitra hoe: “mandehana raiso ilay horonam-boky mivelatra eny an-tanan’ilay anjely mijoro eo ambonin’ny ranomasina sy eo amin’ny tany.”'),
  ('6ab25cf89007933b50d27301', '2026-09-22T10:48:24.660Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:24.660Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 10, 5, 'Ary nanangana ny tanany ankavanana nanondro ny lanitra ilay anjely hitako nijoro teo ambonin’ny ranomasina sy teo amin’ny tany.', 'ary nanangana ny tanany ankavanana nanondro ny lanitra ilay anjely hitako nijoro teo ambonin’ny ranomasina sy teo amin’ny tany.'),
  ('6ab25cf89007933b50d272fd', '2026-09-22T10:48:24.660Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:24.660Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 10, 1, 'Ary nahita anjely mahery hafa iray nidina avy any an-danitra aho. Nitafy rahona izy, sady nisy avana teo amin’ny lohany. Hoatran’ny masoandro ny tarehiny, tahaka ny andry afo ny tongony,', 'ary nahita anjely mahery hafa iray nidina avy any an-danitra aho. nitafy rahona izy, sady nisy avana teo amin’ny lohany. hoatran’ny masoandro ny tarehiny, tahaka ny andry afo ny tongony,'),
  ('6ab25cf89007933b50d27302', '2026-09-22T10:48:24.660Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:24.660Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 10, 6, 'Dia nianiana tamin’ny anaran’Ilay velona mandrakizay mandrakizay izy, izany hoe tamin’Ilay namorona ny lanitra sy ny zavatra eo aminy, sy ny tany sy ny zavatra eo aminy, ary ny ranomasina sy ny zavatra ao aminy, ka niteny hoe: “Tsy hiandry intsony Andriamanitra,', 'dia nianiana tamin’ny anaran’ilay velona mandrakizay mandrakizay izy, izany hoe tamin’ilay namorona ny lanitra sy ny zavatra eo aminy, sy ny tany sy ny zavatra eo aminy, ary ny ranomasina sy ny zavatra ao aminy, ka niteny hoe: “tsy hiandry intsony andriamanitra,'),
  ('6ab25cf89007933b50d272fe', '2026-09-22T10:48:24.660Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:24.660Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 10, 2, 'ary teny an-tanany nisy horonam-boky kely efa novelarina. Najorony teo ambonin’ny ranomasina ny tongony ankavanana, fa teo amin’ny tany kosa ny ankavia,', 'ary teny an-tanany nisy horonam-boky kely efa novelarina. najorony teo ambonin’ny ranomasina ny tongony ankavanana, fa teo amin’ny tany kosa ny ankavia,'),
  ('6ab25cf945a37f6debb76049', '2026-09-22T10:48:25.997Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:25.997Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 11, 13, 'Ary nisy horohoron-tany lehibe tamin’izay ora izay, ka rava ny ampahafolon’ny tanàna. Ary 7 000 ny olona matin’ilay horohoron-tany. Dia natahotra ny olona sisa ka nanome voninahitra an’ilay Andriamanitry ny lanitra.', 'ary nisy horohoron-tany lehibe tamin’izay ora izay, ka rava ny ampahafolon’ny tanàna. ary 7 000 ny olona matin’ilay horohoron-tany. dia natahotra ny olona sisa ka nanome voninahitra an’ilay andriamanitry ny lanitra.'),
  ('6ab25cf945a37f6debb7603e', '2026-09-22T10:48:25.997Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:25.997Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 11, 2, 'Fa ny tokotany eo ivelan’ny toerana masin’ny tempoly kosa avelao eo fa aza refesina, satria nomena ny hafa firenena izany. Dia hohitsakitsahin’ny hafa firenena mandritra ny 42 volana ny tanàna masina.', 'fa ny tokotany eo ivelan’ny toerana masin’ny tempoly kosa avelao eo fa aza refesina, satria nomena ny hafa firenena izany. dia hohitsakitsahin’ny hafa firenena mandritra ny 42 volana ny tanàna masina.'),
  ('6ab25cf945a37f6debb76048', '2026-09-22T10:48:25.997Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:25.997Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 11, 12, 'Ary naheno feo mafy avy any an-danitra izy ireo, niteny taminy hoe: “Miakara atỳ.” Dia niakatra tany an-danitra tao anaty rahona izy ireo, ka hitan’ny fahavalony.', 'ary naheno feo mafy avy any an-danitra izy ireo, niteny taminy hoe: “miakara atỳ.” dia niakatra tany an-danitra tao anaty rahona izy ireo, ka hitan’ny fahavalony.'),
  ('6ab25cf945a37f6debb76040', '2026-09-22T10:48:25.997Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:25.997Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 11, 4, 'Izy ireo no hazo oliva roa sy fitoeran-jiro roa, ary mijoro eo anatrehan’ny Tompon’ny tany izy ireo.', 'izy ireo no hazo oliva roa sy fitoeran-jiro roa, ary mijoro eo anatrehan’ny tompon’ny tany izy ireo.'),
  ('6ab25cf945a37f6debb76046', '2026-09-22T10:48:25.997Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:25.997Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 11, 10, 'Dia hifalifaly noho izay nanjo azy ireo ny mponina eto an-tany, ka hanao fety sy hifanolotra fanomezana, satria nampijaly ny mponina eto an-tany ireo mpaminany roa ireo.', 'dia hifalifaly noho izay nanjo azy ireo ny mponina eto an-tany, ka hanao fety sy hifanolotra fanomezana, satria nampijaly ny mponina eto an-tany ireo mpaminany roa ireo.'),
  ('6ab25cf945a37f6debb76044', '2026-09-22T10:48:25.997Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:25.997Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 11, 8, 'Ary hiampatrampatra eny an-dalamben’ilay tanàna lehibe ny fatin’izy ireo. Antsoina amin’ny heviny an’ohatra hoe Sodoma sy Ejipta io tanàna io, sady tao koa ny Tompon’izy ireo no novonoina teo amin’ny tsato-kazo.', 'ary hiampatrampatra eny an-dalamben’ilay tanàna lehibe ny fatin’izy ireo. antsoina amin’ny heviny an’ohatra hoe sodoma sy ejipta io tanàna io, sady tao koa ny tompon’izy ireo no novonoina teo amin’ny tsato-kazo.'),
  ('6ab25cf945a37f6debb76047', '2026-09-22T10:48:25.997Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:25.997Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 11, 11, 'Rehefa tapitra ny telo andro sy tapany, dia nisy aina avy tamin’Andriamanitra niditra tao anatin’izy ireo. Dia nijoro tamin’ny tongony izy ireo, ka natahotra be izay nahita azy.', 'rehefa tapitra ny telo andro sy tapany, dia nisy aina avy tamin’andriamanitra niditra tao anatin’izy ireo. dia nijoro tamin’ny tongony izy ireo, ka natahotra be izay nahita azy.'),
  ('6ab25cf945a37f6debb76043', '2026-09-22T10:48:25.997Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:25.997Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 11, 7, 'Rehefa vitan’izy ireo ny fitoriany, dia hiady aminy ilay bibidia niakatra avy tao amin’ny lavaka mangitsokitsoka, ka handresy sy hamono azy ho faty.', 'rehefa vitan’izy ireo ny fitoriany, dia hiady aminy ilay bibidia niakatra avy tao amin’ny lavaka mangitsokitsoka, ka handresy sy hamono azy ho faty.'),
  ('6ab25cf945a37f6debb76041', '2026-09-22T10:48:25.997Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:25.997Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 11, 5, 'Raha misy te hanisy ratsy azy ireo, dia misy afo mivoaka avy amin’ny vavany ka mandevona ny fahavalony. Raha misy te hanisy ratsy azy ireo, dia hoatr’izany no hamonoana azy.', 'raha misy te hanisy ratsy azy ireo, dia misy afo mivoaka avy amin’ny vavany ka mandevona ny fahavalony. raha misy te hanisy ratsy azy ireo, dia hoatr’izany no hamonoana azy.'),
  ('6ab25cf945a37f6debb76045', '2026-09-22T10:48:25.997Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:25.997Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 11, 9, 'Ary hijery ny fatin’izy ireo mandritra ny telo andro sy tapany ny olona avy amin’ny vahoaka sy foko sy olona samy hafa fiteny ary firenena. Tsy havelany hatao ao am-pasana koa ny fatin’izy ireo.', 'ary hijery ny fatin’izy ireo mandritra ny telo andro sy tapany ny olona avy amin’ny vahoaka sy foko sy olona samy hafa fiteny ary firenena. tsy havelany hatao ao am-pasana koa ny fatin’izy ireo.'),
  ('6ab25cf945a37f6debb7603f', '2026-09-22T10:48:25.997Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:25.997Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 11, 3, 'Ary hasaiko maminany 1 260 andro ny vavolombeloko roa, sady mitafy gony.”', 'ary hasaiko maminany 1 260 andro ny vavolombeloko roa, sady mitafy gony.”'),
  ('6ab25cf945a37f6debb76042', '2026-09-22T10:48:25.997Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:25.997Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 11, 6, 'Manana fahefana hanidy ny lanitra izy ireo, mba tsy hisy orana hilatsaka mandritra ny andro aminaniany. Manana fahefana hanova ny rano ho ra koa izy ireo, ary hamely ny tany amin’izao karazana loza rehetra izao isaky ny te hanao an’izany.', 'manana fahefana hanidy ny lanitra izy ireo, mba tsy hisy orana hilatsaka mandritra ny andro aminaniany. manana fahefana hanova ny rano ho ra koa izy ireo, ary hamely ny tany amin’izao karazana loza rehetra izao isaky ny te hanao an’izany.'),
  ('6ab25cf945a37f6debb7603d', '2026-09-22T10:48:25.997Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:25.997Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 11, 1, 'Ary nomena bararata hoatran’ny tehina aho, tamin’izy niteny hoe: “Mitsangàna ka refeso ny toerana masin’ny tempolin’Andriamanitra sy ny alitara ary izay mivavaka ao.', 'ary nomena bararata hoatran’ny tehina aho, tamin’izy niteny hoe: “mitsangàna ka refeso ny toerana masin’ny tempolin’andriamanitra sy ny alitara ary izay mivavaka ao.'),
  ('6ab25cf945a37f6debb7604e', '2026-09-22T10:48:25.998Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:25.998Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 11, 18, 'Tezitra anefa ireo firenena. Nampiseho ny hatezeranao koa ianao, ary tonga ny fotoana voatondro hitsarana ny maty sy hanomezana valisoa ny mpaminany mpanomponao sy ny olona masina ary izay matahotra ny anaranao, na ny kely na ny lehibe. Tonga koa ny fotoana handringanana an’izay manimba ny tany.”', 'tezitra anefa ireo firenena. nampiseho ny hatezeranao koa ianao, ary tonga ny fotoana voatondro hitsarana ny maty sy hanomezana valisoa ny mpaminany mpanomponao sy ny olona masina ary izay matahotra ny anaranao, na ny kely na ny lehibe. tonga koa ny fotoana handringanana an’izay manimba ny tany.”'),
  ('6ab25cf945a37f6debb7604c', '2026-09-22T10:48:25.998Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:25.998Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 11, 16, 'Ary niankohoka nivavaka tamin’Andriamanitra ny anti-panahy 24, izay nipetraka teo amin’ny seza fiandrianany teo anatrehan’Andriamanitra,', 'ary niankohoka nivavaka tamin’andriamanitra ny anti-panahy 24, izay nipetraka teo amin’ny seza fiandrianany teo anatrehan’andriamanitra,'),
  ('6ab25cf945a37f6debb7604d', '2026-09-22T10:48:25.998Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:25.998Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 11, 17, 'sady niteny hoe: “Misaotra anao izahay, Jehovah Andriamanitra ô, ilay Mahery Indrindra, Ilay ankehitriny sy taloha, satria nandray fahefana lehibe ianao ka efa nanomboka nanjaka.', 'sady niteny hoe: “misaotra anao izahay, jehovah andriamanitra ô, ilay mahery indrindra, ilay ankehitriny sy taloha, satria nandray fahefana lehibe ianao ka efa nanomboka nanjaka.'),
  ('6ab25cf945a37f6debb7604a', '2026-09-22T10:48:25.998Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:25.998Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 11, 14, 'Lasa ny loza faharoa. Izay fa tonga haingana ny loza fahatelo!', 'lasa ny loza faharoa. izay fa tonga haingana ny loza fahatelo!'),
  ('6ab25cf945a37f6debb7604b', '2026-09-22T10:48:25.998Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:25.998Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 11, 15, 'Nitsoka ny trompetrany ny anjely fahafito, dia nisy feo mafy tany an-danitra, nanao hoe: “Ny fanjakan’izao tontolo izao dia efa lasa Fanjakan’ny Tompontsika sy ilay Kristy voatendriny. Ary hanjaka mandrakizay mandrakizay Izy.”', 'nitsoka ny trompetrany ny anjely fahafito, dia nisy feo mafy tany an-danitra, nanao hoe: “ny fanjakan’izao tontolo izao dia efa lasa fanjakan’ny tompontsika sy ilay kristy voatendriny. ary hanjaka mandrakizay mandrakizay izy.”'),
  ('6ab25cf945a37f6debb7604f', '2026-09-22T10:48:25.998Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:25.998Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 11, 19, 'Ary nosokafana ny toerana masin’ny tempolin’Andriamanitra tany an-danitra, ka tazana tao ilay Vata misy ny fifanekena. Dia nisy tselatra sy feo sy kotroka sy horohoron-tany ary havandra vaventy.', 'ary nosokafana ny toerana masin’ny tempolin’andriamanitra tany an-danitra, ka tazana tao ilay vata misy ny fifanekena. dia nisy tselatra sy feo sy kotroka sy horohoron-tany ary havandra vaventy.'),
  ('6ab25cfad8c8f56eb1619f6d', '2026-09-22T10:48:26.443Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:26.443Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 12, 9, 'Koa natsipy mafy ilay dragona lehibe, ilay menarana tany am-boalohany, ilay antsoina hoe Devoly sy Satana, izay mamitaka ny tany manontolo. Natsipy mafy tetỳ an-tany izy, ary ny anjeliny koa niara-natsipy taminy.', 'koa natsipy mafy ilay dragona lehibe, ilay menarana tany am-boalohany, ilay antsoina hoe devoly sy satana, izay mamitaka ny tany manontolo. natsipy mafy tetỳ an-tany izy, ary ny anjeliny koa niara-natsipy taminy.'),
  ('6ab25cfad8c8f56eb1619f6a', '2026-09-22T10:48:26.443Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:26.443Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 12, 6, 'Ary nandositra nankany an-tany efitra ilay vehivavy. Nisy toerana efa nomanin’Andriamanitra ho azy tany, ka tany izy no nomena sakafo nandritra ny 1 260 andro.', 'ary nandositra nankany an-tany efitra ilay vehivavy. nisy toerana efa nomanin’andriamanitra ho azy tany, ka tany izy no nomena sakafo nandritra ny 1 260 andro.'),
  ('6ab25cfad8c8f56eb1619f66', '2026-09-22T10:48:26.443Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:26.443Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 12, 2, 'sady bevohoka izy. Ary nitaraindraina izy fa narary nihetsi-jaza efa ho teraka.', 'sady bevohoka izy. ary nitaraindraina izy fa narary nihetsi-jaza efa ho teraka.'),
  ('6ab25cfad8c8f56eb1619f68', '2026-09-22T10:48:26.443Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:26.443Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 12, 4, 'Ary nisarika ny ampahatelon’ny kintana teny amin’ny lanitra ny rambony, ka nanipy mafy an’izany tamin’ny tany. Tsy niala teo anatrehan’ilay vehivavy efa hiteraka ilay dragona, fa tiany harapaka ny zanany, raha vao teraka ilay vehivavy.', 'ary nisarika ny ampahatelon’ny kintana teny amin’ny lanitra ny rambony, ka nanipy mafy an’izany tamin’ny tany. tsy niala teo anatrehan’ilay vehivavy efa hiteraka ilay dragona, fa tiany harapaka ny zanany, raha vao teraka ilay vehivavy.'),
  ('6ab25cfad8c8f56eb1619f70', '2026-09-22T10:48:26.443Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:26.443Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 12, 12, 'Noho izany, dia mifalia ry lanitra sy ianareo izay mipetraka any! Loza ho an’ny tany sy ny ranomasina, fa nidina any aminareo ny Devoly sady tezitra mafy, satria fantany fa fohy ny fotoana ananany.”', 'noho izany, dia mifalia ry lanitra sy ianareo izay mipetraka any! loza ho an’ny tany sy ny ranomasina, fa nidina any aminareo ny devoly sady tezitra mafy, satria fantany fa fohy ny fotoana ananany.”'),
  ('6ab25cfad8c8f56eb1619f6b', '2026-09-22T10:48:26.443Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:26.443Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 12, 7, 'Ary nisy ady tany an-danitra: Niady tamin’ilay dragona i Mikaela sy ny anjeliny. Niady tamin’izy ireo koa ilay dragona sy ny anjeliny', 'ary nisy ady tany an-danitra: niady tamin’ilay dragona i mikaela sy ny anjeliny. niady tamin’izy ireo koa ilay dragona sy ny anjeliny'),
  ('6ab25cfad8c8f56eb1619f67', '2026-09-22T10:48:26.443Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:26.443Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 12, 3, 'Nisy famantarana hafa koa hita tany an-danitra. Io fa nisy dragona lehibe mena hoatran’ny afo. Nanana loha fito sy tandroka folo izy, ary nisy diadema fito teo amin’ireo lohany ireo.', 'nisy famantarana hafa koa hita tany an-danitra. io fa nisy dragona lehibe mena hoatran’ny afo. nanana loha fito sy tandroka folo izy, ary nisy diadema fito teo amin’ireo lohany ireo.'),
  ('6ab25cfad8c8f56eb1619f75', '2026-09-22T10:48:26.443Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:26.443Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 12, 17, 'Dia tezitra be tamin’ilay vehivavy ilay dragona, ka lasa nandeha niady tamin’ny sisa amin’ny taranany, izay nanaraka ny didin’Andriamanitra sy nasaina nitory momba an’i Jesosy.', 'dia tezitra be tamin’ilay vehivavy ilay dragona, ka lasa nandeha niady tamin’ny sisa amin’ny taranany, izay nanaraka ny didin’andriamanitra sy nasaina nitory momba an’i jesosy.'),
  ('6ab25cfad8c8f56eb1619f74', '2026-09-22T10:48:26.443Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:26.443Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 12, 16, 'Namonjy an’ilay vehivavy anefa ny tany, ka nisokatra ary nitelina an’ilay renirano naloan’ilay dragona.', 'namonjy an’ilay vehivavy anefa ny tany, ka nisokatra ary nitelina an’ilay renirano naloan’ilay dragona.'),
  ('6ab25cfad8c8f56eb1619f72', '2026-09-22T10:48:26.443Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:26.443Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 12, 14, 'Nomena elatra roa anefa ilay vehivavy, dia elatry ny voromahery lehibe, mba hanidinany mankany an-tany efitra ho any amin’ny toerany. Tany izy no nomena sakafo nandritra ny fe-potoana iray sy fe-potoana roa ary antsasaky ny fe-potoana, mba tsy ho hitan’ilay menarana.', 'nomena elatra roa anefa ilay vehivavy, dia elatry ny voromahery lehibe, mba hanidinany mankany an-tany efitra ho any amin’ny toerany. tany izy no nomena sakafo nandritra ny fe-potoana iray sy fe-potoana roa ary antsasaky ny fe-potoana, mba tsy ho hitan’ilay menarana.'),
  ('6ab25cfad8c8f56eb1619f6f', '2026-09-22T10:48:26.443Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:26.443Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 12, 11, 'Ary naharesy azy izy ireo noho ny ran’ny Zanak’ondry sy noho ny hafatra torin’izy ireo. Tsy natahotra ny hamoy ny ainy izy ireo na tsy maintsy ho faty aza.', 'ary naharesy azy izy ireo noho ny ran’ny zanak’ondry sy noho ny hafatra torin’izy ireo. tsy natahotra ny hamoy ny ainy izy ireo na tsy maintsy ho faty aza.'),
  ('6ab25cfad8c8f56eb1619f6c', '2026-09-22T10:48:26.443Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:26.443Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 12, 8, 'nefa tsy naharesy, sady tsy nisy toerana ho azy ireo intsony tany an-danitra.', 'nefa tsy naharesy, sady tsy nisy toerana ho azy ireo intsony tany an-danitra.'),
  ('6ab25cfad8c8f56eb1619f71', '2026-09-22T10:48:26.443Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:26.443Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 12, 13, 'Rehefa hitan’ilay dragona fa efa natsipy mafy tetỳ an-tany izy, dia nenjehiny ilay vehivavy niteraka an’ilay zazalahy.', 'rehefa hitan’ilay dragona fa efa natsipy mafy tetỳ an-tany izy, dia nenjehiny ilay vehivavy niteraka an’ilay zazalahy.'),
  ('6ab25cfad8c8f56eb1619f73', '2026-09-22T10:48:26.443Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:26.443Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 12, 15, 'Ary nandoa rano tao aorianan’ilay vehivavy ilay menarana, dia rano hoatran’ny renirano, amin’izay ho faty an-drano ilay vehivavy.', 'ary nandoa rano tao aorianan’ilay vehivavy ilay menarana, dia rano hoatran’ny renirano, amin’izay ho faty an-drano ilay vehivavy.'),
  ('6ab25cfad8c8f56eb1619f65', '2026-09-22T10:48:26.443Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:26.443Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 12, 1, 'Nisy famantarana lehibe hita tany an-danitra avy eo, dia vehivavy nitafy masoandro. Teo ambanin’ny tongony ny volana, ary nisy satroboninahitra kintana 12 teo amin’ny lohany,', 'nisy famantarana lehibe hita tany an-danitra avy eo, dia vehivavy nitafy masoandro. teo ambanin’ny tongony ny volana, ary nisy satroboninahitra kintana 12 teo amin’ny lohany,'),
  ('6ab25cfad8c8f56eb1619f69', '2026-09-22T10:48:26.443Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:26.443Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 12, 5, 'Ary tera-dahy ilay vehivavy, dia zazalahy hiandry ny firenena rehetra amin’ny tehina vy. Dia nosintonina haingana ilay zanany ka nentina nankany amin’Andriamanitra sy ny seza fiandrianany.', 'ary tera-dahy ilay vehivavy, dia zazalahy hiandry ny firenena rehetra amin’ny tehina vy. dia nosintonina haingana ilay zanany ka nentina nankany amin’andriamanitra sy ny seza fiandrianany.'),
  ('6ab25cfad8c8f56eb1619f6e', '2026-09-22T10:48:26.443Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:26.443Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 12, 10, 'Ary naheno feo mafy tany an-danitra aho, nilaza hoe: “Ankehitriny dia tonga ny famonjen’Andriamanitsika, sady efa nampiseho ny heriny izy. Efa niorina koa ny Fanjakany, ary efa nanomboka nampihatra ny fahefany ilay Kristy voatendriny. Efa natsipy mafy mantsy ilay mpiampanga ny rahalahintsika, dia ilay miampanga azy ireo andro aman’alina eo anatrehan’Andriamanitsika.', 'ary naheno feo mafy tany an-danitra aho, nilaza hoe: “ankehitriny dia tonga ny famonjen’andriamanitsika, sady efa nampiseho ny heriny izy. efa niorina koa ny fanjakany, ary efa nanomboka nampihatra ny fahefany ilay kristy voatendriny. efa natsipy mafy mantsy ilay mpiampanga ny rahalahintsika, dia ilay miampanga azy ireo andro aman’alina eo anatrehan’andriamanitsika.'),
  ('6ab25cfbaa2b929fb979a02a', '2026-09-22T10:48:27.583Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:27.583Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 13, 10, 'Raha misy tsy maintsy hoentina ho babo, dia tsy maintsy hoentina ho babo izy. Raha misy mamono olona amin’ny sabatra, dia tsy maintsy hovonoina amin’ny sabatra izy. Eo ny olona masina no mila miaritra sy manana finoana.', 'raha misy tsy maintsy hoentina ho babo, dia tsy maintsy hoentina ho babo izy. raha misy mamono olona amin’ny sabatra, dia tsy maintsy hovonoina amin’ny sabatra izy. eo ny olona masina no mila miaritra sy manana finoana.'),
  ('6ab25cfbaa2b929fb979a022', '2026-09-22T10:48:27.583Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:27.583Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 13, 2, 'Hoatran’ny leopara ilay bibidia hitako, saingy hoatran’ny tongotry ny orsa ny tongony, ary tahaka ny vavan’ny liona ny vavany. Ary nomen’ilay dragona hery sy seza fiandrianana ary fahefana lehibe ilay bibidia.', 'hoatran’ny leopara ilay bibidia hitako, saingy hoatran’ny tongotry ny orsa ny tongony, ary tahaka ny vavan’ny liona ny vavany. ary nomen’ilay dragona hery sy seza fiandrianana ary fahefana lehibe ilay bibidia.'),
  ('6ab25cfbaa2b929fb979a031', '2026-09-22T10:48:27.583Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:27.583Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 13, 17, 'Dia amin’izay tsy hisy ho afaka hividy na hivarotra, afa-tsy izay nanana an’ilay marika ihany, dia ny anaran’ilay bibidia na ny isa manondro ny anarany.', 'dia amin’izay tsy hisy ho afaka hividy na hivarotra, afa-tsy izay nanana an’ilay marika ihany, dia ny anaran’ilay bibidia na ny isa manondro ny anarany.'),
  ('6ab25cfbaa2b929fb979a027', '2026-09-22T10:48:27.583Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:27.583Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 13, 7, 'Ary navela hiady tamin’ny olona masina sy handresy azy ireo izy, sady nomena fahefana tamin’ny foko sy vahoaka sy olona samy hafa fiteny ary firenena rehetra.', 'ary navela hiady tamin’ny olona masina sy handresy azy ireo izy, sady nomena fahefana tamin’ny foko sy vahoaka sy olona samy hafa fiteny ary firenena rehetra.'),
  ('6ab25cfbaa2b929fb979a026', '2026-09-22T10:48:27.583Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:27.583Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 13, 6, 'Nanomboka niteny àry izy, ka nanevateva an’Andriamanitra. Dia notevatevainy ny anaran’Andriamanitra sy ny fonenany, ary na izay mipetraka any an-danitra aza.', 'nanomboka niteny àry izy, ka nanevateva an’andriamanitra. dia notevatevainy ny anaran’andriamanitra sy ny fonenany, ary na izay mipetraka any an-danitra aza.'),
  ('6ab25cfbaa2b929fb979a02b', '2026-09-22T10:48:27.583Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:27.583Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 13, 11, 'Nahita bibidia hafa iray niakatra avy tamin’ny tany aho avy eo. Nanana tandroka roa hoatran’ny an’ny zanak’ondry izy, saingy niteny toy ny dragona.', 'nahita bibidia hafa iray niakatra avy tamin’ny tany aho avy eo. nanana tandroka roa hoatran’ny an’ny zanak’ondry izy, saingy niteny toy ny dragona.'),
  ('6ab25cfbaa2b929fb979a028', '2026-09-22T10:48:27.583Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:27.583Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 13, 8, 'Dia hivavaka aminy daholo ny mponina eto an-tany. Efa hatramin’ny nanorenana an’izao tontolo izao ny anaran’izy ireo no tsy nisy voasoratra tao amin’ny horonam-bokin’ny fiainana. An’ilay Zanak’ondry efa novonoina ho faty io horonam-boky io.', 'dia hivavaka aminy daholo ny mponina eto an-tany. efa hatramin’ny nanorenana an’izao tontolo izao ny anaran’izy ireo no tsy nisy voasoratra tao amin’ny horonam-bokin’ny fiainana. an’ilay zanak’ondry efa novonoina ho faty io horonam-boky io.'),
  ('6ab25cfbaa2b929fb979a032', '2026-09-22T10:48:27.583Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:27.583Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 13, 18, 'Eto no ilana fahendrena: Tokony hanao kajy an’ilay isa manondro ny bibidia ny olona lalin-tsaina, fa isa nataon’olona izy io. Ary 666 ilay isa.', 'eto no ilana fahendrena: tokony hanao kajy an’ilay isa manondro ny bibidia ny olona lalin-tsaina, fa isa nataon’olona izy io. ary 666 ilay isa.'),
  ('6ab25cfbaa2b929fb979a030', '2026-09-22T10:48:27.583Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:27.583Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 13, 16, 'Ary notereny ny olona rehetra, na kely na lehibe, na manankarena na mahantra, na olona afaka na andevo, mba hasiana marika teo amin’ny tanany havanana na teo amin’ny handriny.', 'ary notereny ny olona rehetra, na kely na lehibe, na manankarena na mahantra, na olona afaka na andevo, mba hasiana marika teo amin’ny tanany havanana na teo amin’ny handriny.'),
  ('6ab25cfbaa2b929fb979a021', '2026-09-22T10:48:27.583Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:27.583Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 13, 1, 'Ary nijanona teo amin’ny fasika any an-dranomasina izy. Dia nahita bibidia niakatra avy tao amin’ny ranomasina aho. Nanana tandroka folo sy loha fito io bibidia io, ary nisy diadema folo teo amin’ireo tandrony ireo. Teo amin’ireo lohany kosa nisy anarana manevateva an’Andriamanitra.', 'ary nijanona teo amin’ny fasika any an-dranomasina izy. dia nahita bibidia niakatra avy tao amin’ny ranomasina aho. nanana tandroka folo sy loha fito io bibidia io, ary nisy diadema folo teo amin’ireo tandrony ireo. teo amin’ireo lohany kosa nisy anarana manevateva an’andriamanitra.'),
  ('6ab25cfbaa2b929fb979a024', '2026-09-22T10:48:27.583Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:27.583Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 13, 4, 'Ary nivavaka tamin’ilay dragona izy ireo, satria izy no nanome fahefana an’ilay bibidia. Nivavaka tamin’ilay bibidia koa izy ireo sady niteny hoe: “Iza no hoatran’ilay bibidia, ary iza no mahavita miady aminy?”', 'ary nivavaka tamin’ilay dragona izy ireo, satria izy no nanome fahefana an’ilay bibidia. nivavaka tamin’ilay bibidia koa izy ireo sady niteny hoe: “iza no hoatran’ilay bibidia, ary iza no mahavita miady aminy?”'),
  ('6ab25cfbaa2b929fb979a02e', '2026-09-22T10:48:27.583Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:27.583Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 13, 14, 'Ary nofitahiny ny mponina teto an-tany, ka ny famantarana navela hataony teo imason’ilay bibidia no namitahany azy ireo. Nilaza tamin’ny mponina teto an-tany koa izy mba hanao ny sarin’ilay bibidia, izay voan’ny sabatra nefa velona indray.', 'ary nofitahiny ny mponina teto an-tany, ka ny famantarana navela hataony teo imason’ilay bibidia no namitahany azy ireo. nilaza tamin’ny mponina teto an-tany koa izy mba hanao ny sarin’ilay bibidia, izay voan’ny sabatra nefa velona indray.'),
  ('6ab25cfbaa2b929fb979a023', '2026-09-22T10:48:27.583Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:27.583Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 13, 3, 'Hitako hoatran’ny hoe naratra mafy ny lohany iray. Na dia ratra mahafaty aza anefa ilay izy, dia sitrana ihany. Dia gaga be tamin’ilay bibidia ny tany manontolo ka nanaraka azy.', 'hitako hoatran’ny hoe naratra mafy ny lohany iray. na dia ratra mahafaty aza anefa ilay izy, dia sitrana ihany. dia gaga be tamin’ilay bibidia ny tany manontolo ka nanaraka azy.'),
  ('6ab25cfbaa2b929fb979a02d', '2026-09-22T10:48:27.583Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:27.583Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 13, 13, 'Nanao famantarana lehibe teo imason’ny olona koa izy, ka nandatsaka afo avy any an-danitra ho etỳ an-tany mihitsy aza.', 'nanao famantarana lehibe teo imason’ny olona koa izy, ka nandatsaka afo avy any an-danitra ho etỳ an-tany mihitsy aza.'),
  ('6ab25cfbaa2b929fb979a02f', '2026-09-22T10:48:27.583Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:27.583Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 13, 15, 'Ary navela hanome fofonaina ny sarin’ilay bibidia izy, mba hiteny ilay sary sady hanome baiko hoe hovonoina ho faty izay rehetra tsy mety mivavaka aminy.', 'ary navela hanome fofonaina ny sarin’ilay bibidia izy, mba hiteny ilay sary sady hanome baiko hoe hovonoina ho faty izay rehetra tsy mety mivavaka aminy.'),
  ('6ab25cfbaa2b929fb979a02c', '2026-09-22T10:48:27.583Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:27.583Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 13, 12, 'Ary nampiasainy daholo ny fahefana nananan’ilay bibidia voalohany, sady teo imason’izy io ihany. Dia notereny ny tany sy ny mponina eto an-tany mba hivavaka tamin’ilay bibidia voalohany, izay sitrana tamin’ilay ratra saika nahafaty azy.', 'ary nampiasainy daholo ny fahefana nananan’ilay bibidia voalohany, sady teo imason’izy io ihany. dia notereny ny tany sy ny mponina eto an-tany mba hivavaka tamin’ilay bibidia voalohany, izay sitrana tamin’ilay ratra saika nahafaty azy.'),
  ('6ab25cfbaa2b929fb979a029', '2026-09-22T10:48:27.583Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:27.583Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 13, 9, 'Izay manan-tsofina, aoka izy hihaino.', 'izay manan-tsofina, aoka izy hihaino.'),
  ('6ab25cfbaa2b929fb979a025', '2026-09-22T10:48:27.583Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:27.583Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 13, 5, 'Nomena fahefana hirehareha sy hanevateva an’Andriamanitra ilay bibidia, sady nomena fahefana hanao izay tiany nandritra ny 42 volana.', 'nomena fahefana hirehareha sy hanevateva an’andriamanitra ilay bibidia, sady nomena fahefana hanao izay tiany nandritra ny 42 volana.'),
  ('6ab25cfc65832c4767cd9421', '2026-09-22T10:48:28.622Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:28.622Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 14, 12, 'Eto no mila miaritra ny olona masina, dia izay mankatò ny didin’Andriamanitra sy mino an’i Jesosy foana.”', 'eto no mila miaritra ny olona masina, dia izay mankatò ny didin’andriamanitra sy mino an’i jesosy foana.”'),
  ('6ab25cfc65832c4767cd941f', '2026-09-22T10:48:28.622Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:28.622Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 14, 10, 'dia hisotro amin’ny divain’Andriamanitra koa izy, izany hoe ny fahatezeran’Andriamanitra. Araraka tsy mitampoka ao anatin’ny kaopin’ny fahatezeran’ Andriamanitra izany divay izany. Dia hampijalina amin’ny afo sy solifara eo imason’ny anjely masina sy ny Zanak’ondry izy.', 'dia hisotro amin’ny divain’andriamanitra koa izy, izany hoe ny fahatezeran’andriamanitra. araraka tsy mitampoka ao anatin’ny kaopin’ny fahatezeran’ andriamanitra izany divay izany. dia hampijalina amin’ny afo sy solifara eo imason’ny anjely masina sy ny zanak’ondry izy.'),
  ('6ab25cfc65832c4767cd9418', '2026-09-22T10:48:28.622Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:28.622Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 14, 3, 'Ary nihira toa hira vaovao izy ireo, teo anoloan’ny seza fiandrianana sy teo anatrehan’ny zavamananaina efatra sy ny anti-panahy. Tsy nisy nahay an’ilay hira, afa-tsy ny 144 000, izay novidina avy teto an-tany.', 'ary nihira toa hira vaovao izy ireo, teo anoloan’ny seza fiandrianana sy teo anatrehan’ny zavamananaina efatra sy ny anti-panahy. tsy nisy nahay an’ilay hira, afa-tsy ny 144 000, izay novidina avy teto an-tany.'),
  ('6ab25cfc65832c4767cd9429', '2026-09-22T10:48:28.622Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:28.622Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 14, 20, 'Nohitsakitsahina tany ivelan’ny tanàna ny voaloboka tao anatin’ilay famiazana, ka nisy ra nivoaka avy tao. Ary tafakatra hatreo amin’ny lamboridin-tsoavaly ny ra sady tonga hatrany amin’ny 1 600 stadio.', 'nohitsakitsahina tany ivelan’ny tanàna ny voaloboka tao anatin’ilay famiazana, ka nisy ra nivoaka avy tao. ary tafakatra hatreo amin’ny lamboridin-tsoavaly ny ra sady tonga hatrany amin’ny 1 600 stadio.'),
  ('6ab25cfc65832c4767cd9426', '2026-09-22T10:48:28.622Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:28.622Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 14, 17, 'Nisy anjely hafa koa nivoaka avy tao amin’ny toerana masin’ny tempoly any an-danitra, ary nanana antsy fijinjana maranitra koa izy.', 'nisy anjely hafa koa nivoaka avy tao amin’ny toerana masin’ny tempoly any an-danitra, ary nanana antsy fijinjana maranitra koa izy.'),
  ('6ab25cfc65832c4767cd9420', '2026-09-22T10:48:28.622Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:28.622Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 14, 11, 'Ary hiakatra mandrakizay mandrakizay ny setroky ny afo ampijaliana an’ireo. Tsy hitsahatra mihitsy na andro na alina ny fijalian’ireo mivavaka amin’ny bibidia sy ny sariny ary izay mandray an’ilay mariky ny anarany.', 'ary hiakatra mandrakizay mandrakizay ny setroky ny afo ampijaliana an’ireo. tsy hitsahatra mihitsy na andro na alina ny fijalian’ireo mivavaka amin’ny bibidia sy ny sariny ary izay mandray an’ilay mariky ny anarany.'),
  ('6ab25cfc65832c4767cd941d', '2026-09-22T10:48:28.622Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:28.622Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 14, 8, 'Dia tonga ny anjely faharoa avy eo, niteny hoe: “Nianjera, nianjera i Babylona Lehibe, ilay nampisotro divay ny firenena rehetra. Izany divay izany dia ny faniriany mafy hijangajanga!”', 'dia tonga ny anjely faharoa avy eo, niteny hoe: “nianjera, nianjera i babylona lehibe, ilay nampisotro divay ny firenena rehetra. izany divay izany dia ny faniriany mafy hijangajanga!”'),
  ('6ab25cfc65832c4767cd9428', '2026-09-22T10:48:28.622Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:28.622Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 14, 19, 'Dia nijinja ny tany tamin’ny antsy fijinjany ilay anjely sady nanangona ny voaloboky ny tany, ka nanipy an’ireny tao anaty famiazam-boaloboka lehibe, izany hoe ny fahatezeran’Andriamanitra.', 'dia nijinja ny tany tamin’ny antsy fijinjany ilay anjely sady nanangona ny voaloboky ny tany, ka nanipy an’ireny tao anaty famiazam-boaloboka lehibe, izany hoe ny fahatezeran’andriamanitra.'),
  ('6ab25cfc65832c4767cd9424', '2026-09-22T10:48:28.622Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:28.622Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 14, 15, 'Nisy anjely hafa koa nivoaka avy tao amin’ny toerana masin’ny tempoly, niantsoantso mafy sady niteny tamin’ilay nipetraka teo ambonin’ny rahona hoe: “Jinjao amin’ny antsy fijinjanao ny vokatra, satria efa tonga ny ora fijinjana, fa efa masaka tsara ny vokatry ny tany.”', 'nisy anjely hafa koa nivoaka avy tao amin’ny toerana masin’ny tempoly, niantsoantso mafy sady niteny tamin’ilay nipetraka teo ambonin’ny rahona hoe: “jinjao amin’ny antsy fijinjanao ny vokatra, satria efa tonga ny ora fijinjana, fa efa masaka tsara ny vokatry ny tany.”'),
  ('6ab25cfc65832c4767cd9425', '2026-09-22T10:48:28.622Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:28.622Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 14, 16, 'Dia nijinja ny tany tamin’ny antsy fijinjany ilay nipetraka teo ambonin’ny rahona, ka voajinja ny tany.', 'dia nijinja ny tany tamin’ny antsy fijinjany ilay nipetraka teo ambonin’ny rahona, ka voajinja ny tany.'),
  ('6ab25cfc65832c4767cd9419', '2026-09-22T10:48:28.622Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:28.622Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 14, 4, 'Izy ireo no tsy nandoto ny tenany tamin’ny vehivavy, fa virjiny izy ireo raha ny marina. Izy ireo no nanaraka foana ny Zanak’ondry na taiza na taiza nalehany. Novidina avy teo amin’ny olombelona ireo mba hatao voaloham-bokatra ho an’Andriamanitra sy ny Zanak’ondry.', 'izy ireo no tsy nandoto ny tenany tamin’ny vehivavy, fa virjiny izy ireo raha ny marina. izy ireo no nanaraka foana ny zanak’ondry na taiza na taiza nalehany. novidina avy teo amin’ny olombelona ireo mba hatao voaloham-bokatra ho an’andriamanitra sy ny zanak’ondry.'),
  ('6ab25cfc65832c4767cd9416', '2026-09-22T10:48:28.622Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:28.622Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 14, 1, 'Avy eo dia hitako ny Zanak’ondry nitsangana teo amin’ny Tendrombohitra Ziona. Nisy 144 000 niaraka taminy, ary nisoratra teo amin’ny handrin’izy ireo ny anaran’ny Zanak’ondry sy ny anaran’ny Rainy.', 'avy eo dia hitako ny zanak’ondry nitsangana teo amin’ny tendrombohitra ziona. nisy 144 000 niaraka taminy, ary nisoratra teo amin’ny handrin’izy ireo ny anaran’ny zanak’ondry sy ny anaran’ny rainy.'),
  ('6ab25cfc65832c4767cd941a', '2026-09-22T10:48:28.622Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:28.622Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 14, 5, 'Tsy mba namitaka izy ireo, sady tsy nisy tsiny.', 'tsy mba namitaka izy ireo, sady tsy nisy tsiny.'),
  ('6ab25cfc65832c4767cd9417', '2026-09-22T10:48:28.622Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:28.622Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 14, 2, 'Naheno feo avy any an-danitra aho, hoatran’ny feona rano be sy feona kotroka mafy. Ilay feo henoko dia mitovy amin’ny feon’ny mpihira izay mampiaraka ny hirany amin’ny harpa tendreny.', 'naheno feo avy any an-danitra aho, hoatran’ny feona rano be sy feona kotroka mafy. ilay feo henoko dia mitovy amin’ny feon’ny mpihira izay mampiaraka ny hirany amin’ny harpa tendreny.'),
  ('6ab25cfc65832c4767cd9422', '2026-09-22T10:48:28.622Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:28.622Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 14, 13, 'Ary naheno feo avy any an-danitra aho hoe: “Soraty izao: Sambatra izay maty ao amin’ny Tompo manomboka izao. Eny, hoy ny fanahy, aleo izy hitsahatra amin’ny asa mafy nataony, fa manaraka azy eny foana ny zavatra tsara nataony.”', 'ary naheno feo avy any an-danitra aho hoe: “soraty izao: sambatra izay maty ao amin’ny tompo manomboka izao. eny, hoy ny fanahy, aleo izy hitsahatra amin’ny asa mafy nataony, fa manaraka azy eny foana ny zavatra tsara nataony.”'),
  ('6ab25cfc65832c4767cd941b', '2026-09-22T10:48:28.622Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:28.622Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 14, 6, 'Nahita anjely anankiray nanidina teny afovoan’ny lanitra aho. Nitondra vaovao tsara izy, dia vaovao tsara mandrakizay hotorina amin’ny mponina eto an-tany, amin’ny firenena sy foko sy olona samy hafa fiteny ary vahoaka rehetra.', 'nahita anjely anankiray nanidina teny afovoan’ny lanitra aho. nitondra vaovao tsara izy, dia vaovao tsara mandrakizay hotorina amin’ny mponina eto an-tany, amin’ny firenena sy foko sy olona samy hafa fiteny ary vahoaka rehetra.'),
  ('6ab25cfc65832c4767cd9423', '2026-09-22T10:48:28.622Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:28.622Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 14, 14, 'Avy eo aho dia nahita rahona fotsy, ary nisy hoatran’ny zanak’olona nipetraka teo ambonin’ilay izy. Nanao satroboninahitra volamena izy teo amin’ny lohany, ary nisy antsy fijinjana maranitra teny an-tanany.', 'avy eo aho dia nahita rahona fotsy, ary nisy hoatran’ny zanak’olona nipetraka teo ambonin’ilay izy. nanao satroboninahitra volamena izy teo amin’ny lohany, ary nisy antsy fijinjana maranitra teny an-tanany.'),
  ('6ab25cfc65832c4767cd9427', '2026-09-22T10:48:28.622Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:28.622Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 14, 18, 'Mbola nisy anjely hafa koa nivoaka avy teo amin’ny alitara, ary nanana fahefana tamin’ny afo izy. Niantsoantso mafy izy sady niteny tamin’ilay nanana antsy fijinjana maranitra hoe: “Ampiasao ny antsy fijinjanao dia angony ny voaloboky ny tany, satria efa masaka ny voalobony.”', 'mbola nisy anjely hafa koa nivoaka avy teo amin’ny alitara, ary nanana fahefana tamin’ny afo izy. niantsoantso mafy izy sady niteny tamin’ilay nanana antsy fijinjana maranitra hoe: “ampiasao ny antsy fijinjanao dia angony ny voaloboky ny tany, satria efa masaka ny voalobony.”'),
  ('6ab25cfc65832c4767cd941e', '2026-09-22T10:48:28.622Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:28.622Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 14, 9, 'Tonga ny anjely fahatelo avy eo, niantsoantso mafy hoe: “Raha misy mivavaka amin’ny bibidia sy ny sariny ka mandray marika eo amin’ny handriny na eo amin’ny tanany,', 'tonga ny anjely fahatelo avy eo, niantsoantso mafy hoe: “raha misy mivavaka amin’ny bibidia sy ny sariny ka mandray marika eo amin’ny handriny na eo amin’ny tanany,'),
  ('6ab25cfc65832c4767cd941c', '2026-09-22T10:48:28.622Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:28.622Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 14, 7, 'Niteny mafy izy hoe: “Matahora an’Andriamanitra dia omeo voninahitra izy, satria tonga ny ora fitsarany. Dia mivavaha amin’Ilay nanao ny lanitra sy ny tany sy ny ranomasina ary ny loharano.”', 'niteny mafy izy hoe: “matahora an’andriamanitra dia omeo voninahitra izy, satria tonga ny ora fitsarany. dia mivavaha amin’ilay nanao ny lanitra sy ny tany sy ny ranomasina ary ny loharano.”'),
  ('6ab25cfd70e1c5785942dd79', '2026-09-22T10:48:29.612Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:29.612Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 15, 2, 'Dia nahita zavatra hoatran’ny ranomasina fitaratra mifangaro afo aho. Izay naharesy an’ilay bibidia sy ny sariny ary ny isa manondro ny anarany, dia nijoro teo akaikin’ilay ranomasina fitaratra, sady nitazona ny harpan’Andriamanitra.', 'dia nahita zavatra hoatran’ny ranomasina fitaratra mifangaro afo aho. izay naharesy an’ilay bibidia sy ny sariny ary ny isa manondro ny anarany, dia nijoro teo akaikin’ilay ranomasina fitaratra, sady nitazona ny harpan’andriamanitra.'),
  ('6ab25cfd70e1c5785942dd7e', '2026-09-22T10:48:29.612Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:29.612Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 15, 7, 'Nanome vilia an’ireo anjely fito ny iray tamin’ny zavamananaina efatra, dia vilia volamena fito feno ny fahatezeran’ilay Andriamanitra velona mandrakizay mandrakizay.', 'nanome vilia an’ireo anjely fito ny iray tamin’ny zavamananaina efatra, dia vilia volamena fito feno ny fahatezeran’ilay andriamanitra velona mandrakizay mandrakizay.'),
  ('6ab25cfd70e1c5785942dd78', '2026-09-22T10:48:29.612Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:29.612Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 15, 1, 'Ary nahita famantarana hafa lehibe sady mahagaga tany an-danitra aho: Anjely fito nanana loza fito. Ireo no loza farany, satria hampiharina hatramin’ny farany amin’ny alalan’ireo loza ireo ny fahatezeran’Andriamanitra.', 'ary nahita famantarana hafa lehibe sady mahagaga tany an-danitra aho: anjely fito nanana loza fito. ireo no loza farany, satria hampiharina hatramin’ny farany amin’ny alalan’ireo loza ireo ny fahatezeran’andriamanitra.'),
  ('6ab25cfd70e1c5785942dd7b', '2026-09-22T10:48:29.612Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:29.612Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 15, 4, 'Iza no tsy hatahotra anao, Jehovah ô, ary iza no tsy hanome voninahitra ny anaranao? Ianao irery ihany mantsy no tsy mivadika! Fa ho avy hivavaka eo anatrehanao ny firenena rehetra, satria efa naseho ny didim-pitsaranao ara-drariny.”', 'iza no tsy hatahotra anao, jehovah ô, ary iza no tsy hanome voninahitra ny anaranao? ianao irery ihany mantsy no tsy mivadika! fa ho avy hivavaka eo anatrehanao ny firenena rehetra, satria efa naseho ny didim-pitsaranao ara-drariny.”'),
  ('6ab25cfd70e1c5785942dd7a', '2026-09-22T10:48:29.612Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:29.612Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 15, 3, 'Nihira ny hiran’i Mosesy mpanompon’Andriamanitra sy ny hiran’ny Zanak’ondry izy ireo, hoe: “Lehibe sady mahagaga ny asanao, Jehovah Andriamanitra ô, ilay Mahery Indrindra. Ara-drariny sy azo atokisana ny zavatra ataonao, ry Mpanjakan’ny mandrakizay.', 'nihira ny hiran’i mosesy mpanompon’andriamanitra sy ny hiran’ny zanak’ondry izy ireo, hoe: “lehibe sady mahagaga ny asanao, jehovah andriamanitra ô, ilay mahery indrindra. ara-drariny sy azo atokisana ny zavatra ataonao, ry mpanjakan’ny mandrakizay.'),
  ('6ab25cfd70e1c5785942dd7d', '2026-09-22T10:48:29.612Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:29.612Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 15, 6, 'Ary nivoaka avy tao amin’ilay toerana masina ireo anjely fito nanana ny loza fito. Nanao akanjo rongony madio sy mamirapiratra izy ireo, sady nanao fehikibo volamena nanodidina ny tratrany.', 'ary nivoaka avy tao amin’ilay toerana masina ireo anjely fito nanana ny loza fito. nanao akanjo rongony madio sy mamirapiratra izy ireo, sady nanao fehikibo volamena nanodidina ny tratrany.'),
  ('6ab25cfd70e1c5785942dd7f', '2026-09-22T10:48:29.612Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:29.612Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 15, 8, 'Dia lasa feno setroka ilay toerana masina noho ny voninahitr’Andriamanitra sy ny heriny, ka tsy nisy afaka niditra tao amin’ilay toerana masina, mandra-pahatapitry ny loza fito nentin’ireo anjely fito ireo.', 'dia lasa feno setroka ilay toerana masina noho ny voninahitr’andriamanitra sy ny heriny, ka tsy nisy afaka niditra tao amin’ilay toerana masina, mandra-pahatapitry ny loza fito nentin’ireo anjely fito ireo.'),
  ('6ab25cfd70e1c5785942dd7c', '2026-09-22T10:48:29.612Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:29.612Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 15, 5, 'Taorian’izany, dia hitako fa nosokafana tany an-danitra ny toerana masin’ny tranolain’ny vavolombelona.', 'taorian’izany, dia hitako fa nosokafana tany an-danitra ny toerana masin’ny tranolain’ny vavolombelona.'),
  ('6ab25cfed53a6182b11c2787', '2026-09-22T10:48:30.058Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:30.058Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 16, 11, 'Nanevateva an’ilay Andriamanitry ny lanitra anefa izy ireo satria nanaintaina sy nisy fery. Ary tsy mba nibebaka tamin’izay nataony izy ireo.', 'nanevateva an’ilay andriamanitry ny lanitra anefa izy ireo satria nanaintaina sy nisy fery. ary tsy mba nibebaka tamin’izay nataony izy ireo.'),
  ('6ab25cfed53a6182b11c2780', '2026-09-22T10:48:30.058Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:30.058Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 16, 4, 'Ny fahatelo indray nandraraka ny tao am-biliany teny amin’ny renirano sy ny loharano, dia lasa ra ireo.', 'ny fahatelo indray nandraraka ny tao am-biliany teny amin’ny renirano sy ny loharano, dia lasa ra ireo.'),
  ('6ab25cfed53a6182b11c2789', '2026-09-22T10:48:30.058Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:30.058Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 16, 13, 'Ary hitako fa nisy fanambarana maloto telo hoatran’ny sahona, nivoaka avy tamin’ny vavan’ilay dragona sy ny vavan’ilay bibidia ary ny vavan’ilay mpaminany sandoka.', 'ary hitako fa nisy fanambarana maloto telo hoatran’ny sahona, nivoaka avy tamin’ny vavan’ilay dragona sy ny vavan’ilay bibidia ary ny vavan’ilay mpaminany sandoka.'),
  ('6ab25cfed53a6182b11c2785', '2026-09-22T10:48:30.058Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:30.058Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 16, 9, 'Dia main’ny hafanam-be ny olona. Nanevateva ny anaran’ilay Andriamanitra manana fahefana amin’ireny loza ireny anefa izy ireo, fa tsy nibebaka na nanome voninahitra azy.', 'dia main’ny hafanam-be ny olona. nanevateva ny anaran’ilay andriamanitra manana fahefana amin’ireny loza ireny anefa izy ireo, fa tsy nibebaka na nanome voninahitra azy.'),
  ('6ab25cfed53a6182b11c2782', '2026-09-22T10:48:30.058Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:30.058Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 16, 6, 'Nandatsaka ny ran’ny olona masina sy ny mpaminany mantsy izy ireo, ka nomenao ra hosotroiny. Mendrika an’izany izy ireo.”', 'nandatsaka ny ran’ny olona masina sy ny mpaminany mantsy izy ireo, ka nomenao ra hosotroiny. mendrika an’izany izy ireo.”'),
  ('6ab25cfed53a6182b11c277e', '2026-09-22T10:48:30.058Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:30.058Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 16, 2, 'Nandeha àry ny voalohany, dia nandraraka ny tao am-biliany teny ambonin’ny tany. Dia nisy fery nampanaintaina sady nanonitra be nampijalijaly an’izay olona nanana ny mariky ny bibidia sy nivavaka tamin’ny sariny.', 'nandeha àry ny voalohany, dia nandraraka ny tao am-biliany teny ambonin’ny tany. dia nisy fery nampanaintaina sady nanonitra be nampijalijaly an’izay olona nanana ny mariky ny bibidia sy nivavaka tamin’ny sariny.'),
  ('6ab25cfed53a6182b11c277d', '2026-09-22T10:48:30.058Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:30.058Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 16, 1, 'Ary naheno feo mafy avy tao amin’ny toerana masina aho, niteny tamin’ireo anjely fito hoe: “Mandehana araraho eny ambonin’ny tany ny ao anatin’ny vilia fito feno ny fahatezeran’Andriamanitra.”', 'ary naheno feo mafy avy tao amin’ny toerana masina aho, niteny tamin’ireo anjely fito hoe: “mandehana araraho eny ambonin’ny tany ny ao anatin’ny vilia fito feno ny fahatezeran’andriamanitra.”'),
  ('6ab25cfed53a6182b11c2786', '2026-09-22T10:48:30.058Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:30.058Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 16, 10, 'Ny fahadimy indray nandraraka ny tao am-biliany teo amin’ny seza fiandrianan’ilay bibidia, ka lasa maizina ny fanjakan’ilay bibidia. Dia nanomboka nanaiki-dela ny olona satria nanaintaina.', 'ny fahadimy indray nandraraka ny tao am-biliany teo amin’ny seza fiandrianan’ilay bibidia, ka lasa maizina ny fanjakan’ilay bibidia. dia nanomboka nanaiki-dela ny olona satria nanaintaina.'),
  ('6ab25cfed53a6182b11c2783', '2026-09-22T10:48:30.058Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:30.058Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 16, 7, 'Ary henoko ny alitara niteny hoe: “Eny, Jehovah Andriamanitra ô, ilay Mahery Indrindra, azo atokisana sy ara-drariny ny didim-pitsaranao.”', 'ary henoko ny alitara niteny hoe: “eny, jehovah andriamanitra ô, ilay mahery indrindra, azo atokisana sy ara-drariny ny didim-pitsaranao.”'),
  ('6ab25cfed53a6182b11c2788', '2026-09-22T10:48:30.058Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:30.058Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 16, 12, 'Ary ny fahenina kosa nandraraka ny tao am-biliany teo amin’i Eofrata, ilay renirano lehibe, dia ritra ny ranony. Nanao an’izany izy mba hanomanana ny lalan’ny mpanjaka avy any amin’ny fiposahan’ny masoandro.', 'ary ny fahenina kosa nandraraka ny tao am-biliany teo amin’i eofrata, ilay renirano lehibe, dia ritra ny ranony. nanao an’izany izy mba hanomanana ny lalan’ny mpanjaka avy any amin’ny fiposahan’ny masoandro.'),
  ('6ab25cfed53a6182b11c278a', '2026-09-22T10:48:30.058Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:30.058Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 16, 14, 'Raha ny marina, dia avy amin’ny demonia ireo fanambarana ireo, izay manao famantarana sady mivoaka ho any amin’ny mpanjakan’ny tany manontolo, mba hanangonana an’ireny ho amin’ilay adin’ny andro lehiben’ilay Andriamanitra Mahery Indrindra.', 'raha ny marina, dia avy amin’ny demonia ireo fanambarana ireo, izay manao famantarana sady mivoaka ho any amin’ny mpanjakan’ny tany manontolo, mba hanangonana an’ireny ho amin’ilay adin’ny andro lehiben’ilay andriamanitra mahery indrindra.'),
  ('6ab25cfed53a6182b11c2784', '2026-09-22T10:48:30.058Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:30.058Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 16, 8, 'Nandraraka ny tao am-biliany teny amin’ny masoandro avy eo ny fahefatra, dia navela handoro ny olona tamin’ny afo ny masoandro.', 'nandraraka ny tao am-biliany teny amin’ny masoandro avy eo ny fahefatra, dia navela handoro ny olona tamin’ny afo ny masoandro.'),
  ('6ab25cfed53a6182b11c277f', '2026-09-22T10:48:30.058Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:30.058Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 16, 3, 'Dia iny koa ny faharoa fa nandraraka ny tao am-biliany teny amin’ny ranomasina. Dia lasa ra hoatran’ny ran’olona maty ny ranomasina, ka maty daholo ny zavamananaina rehetra, dia izay zavatra tao amin’ny ranomasina.', 'dia iny koa ny faharoa fa nandraraka ny tao am-biliany teny amin’ny ranomasina. dia lasa ra hoatran’ny ran’olona maty ny ranomasina, ka maty daholo ny zavamananaina rehetra, dia izay zavatra tao amin’ny ranomasina.'),
  ('6ab25cfed53a6182b11c2781', '2026-09-22T10:48:30.058Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:30.058Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 16, 5, 'Dia henoko ilay anjelin’ny rano niteny hoe: “Manao ny rariny ianao, ry Ilay ankehitriny sy taloha, Ilay tsy mivadika, satria namoaka an’ireny didim-pitsarana ireny.', 'dia henoko ilay anjelin’ny rano niteny hoe: “manao ny rariny ianao, ry ilay ankehitriny sy taloha, ilay tsy mivadika, satria namoaka an’ireny didim-pitsarana ireny.'),
  ('6ab25cfed53a6182b11c278d', '2026-09-22T10:48:30.059Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:30.059Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 16, 17, 'Ny fahafito indray nandraraka ny tao am-biliany teny amin’ny rivotra, dia nisy feo mafy nivoaka avy tao amin’ilay toerana masina, avy teo amin’ny seza fiandrianana, nanao hoe: “Vita!”', 'ny fahafito indray nandraraka ny tao am-biliany teny amin’ny rivotra, dia nisy feo mafy nivoaka avy tao amin’ilay toerana masina, avy teo amin’ny seza fiandrianana, nanao hoe: “vita!”'),
  ('6ab25cfed53a6182b11c278f', '2026-09-22T10:48:30.059Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:30.059Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 16, 19, 'Dia nizara telo ilay tanàna lehibe, ary rava ny tanànan’ny firenena rehetra. Ary notsarovan’Andriamanitra i Babylona Lehibe, mba homeny an’ilay kaopy misy ny divainy, izany hoe ny fahatezerany mafy.', 'dia nizara telo ilay tanàna lehibe, ary rava ny tanànan’ny firenena rehetra. ary notsarovan’andriamanitra i babylona lehibe, mba homeny an’ilay kaopy misy ny divainy, izany hoe ny fahatezerany mafy.'),
  ('6ab25cfed53a6182b11c2791', '2026-09-22T10:48:30.059Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:30.059Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 16, 21, 'Avy eo dia nisy havandra vaventy avy any an-danitra nilatsaka tamin’ny olona, ka iray talenta teo ho eo ny lanjan’ny havandra tsirairay. Dia nanevateva an’Andriamanitra ny olona noho ny loza nentin’ny havandra, satria lehibe loatra ilay loza.', 'avy eo dia nisy havandra vaventy avy any an-danitra nilatsaka tamin’ny olona, ka iray talenta teo ho eo ny lanjan’ny havandra tsirairay. dia nanevateva an’andriamanitra ny olona noho ny loza nentin’ny havandra, satria lehibe loatra ilay loza.'),
  ('6ab25cfed53a6182b11c278b', '2026-09-22T10:48:30.059Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:30.059Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 16, 15, '“Ho avy toy ny mpangalatra aho. Sambatra izay miambina foana ka mbola eny aminy ihany ny akanjony ivelany. Amin’izay izy tsy handeha mitanjaka ka ho hitan’ny olona ny fitanjahany.”', '“ho avy toy ny mpangalatra aho. sambatra izay miambina foana ka mbola eny aminy ihany ny akanjony ivelany. amin’izay izy tsy handeha mitanjaka ka ho hitan’ny olona ny fitanjahany.”'),
  ('6ab25cfed53a6182b11c278e', '2026-09-22T10:48:30.059Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:30.059Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 16, 18, 'Avy eo dia nisy tselatra sy feo ary kotroka. Ary nisy horohoron-tany mafy be mbola tsy nisy hoatr’izany hatramin’izay nisian’ny olona teto an-tany. Tena faran’izay mahery sady mafy be ilay horohoron-tany.', 'avy eo dia nisy tselatra sy feo ary kotroka. ary nisy horohoron-tany mafy be mbola tsy nisy hoatr’izany hatramin’izay nisian’ny olona teto an-tany. tena faran’izay mahery sady mafy be ilay horohoron-tany.'),
  ('6ab25cfed53a6182b11c2790', '2026-09-22T10:48:30.059Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:30.059Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 16, 20, 'Nandositra koa ny nosy rehetra, ary nanjavona ny tendrombohitra.', 'nandositra koa ny nosy rehetra, ary nanjavona ny tendrombohitra.'),
  ('6ab25cfed53a6182b11c278c', '2026-09-22T10:48:30.059Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:30.059Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 16, 16, 'Ary nangonin’izany fanambarana izany ho any amin’ilay toerana antsoina amin’ny teny hebreo hoe Aramagedona ireny mpanjaka ireny.', 'ary nangonin’izany fanambarana izany ho any amin’ilay toerana antsoina amin’ny teny hebreo hoe aramagedona ireny mpanjaka ireny.'),
  ('6ab25cfed7aee82f32bce12b', '2026-09-22T10:48:30.578Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:30.578Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 17, 2, 'Nijangajanga taminy ny mpanjakan’ny tany, ary natao mamon’ny divain’ny fijangajangany ny mponina eny ambonin’ny tany.”', 'nijangajanga taminy ny mpanjakan’ny tany, ary natao mamon’ny divain’ny fijangajangany ny mponina eny ambonin’ny tany.”'),
  ('6ab25cfed7aee82f32bce12a', '2026-09-22T10:48:30.578Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:30.578Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 17, 1, 'Tonga ny iray tamin’ireo anjely fito nanana vilia fito, ka hoy izy tamiko: “Avia fa hasehoko anao ny fitsarana an’ilay mpivaro-tena lehibe mipetraka eo ambonin’ny rano maro.', 'tonga ny iray tamin’ireo anjely fito nanana vilia fito, ka hoy izy tamiko: “avia fa hasehoko anao ny fitsarana an’ilay mpivaro-tena lehibe mipetraka eo ambonin’ny rano maro.'),
  ('6ab25cfed7aee82f32bce12c', '2026-09-22T10:48:30.578Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:30.578Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 17, 3, 'Ary nentin’ilay anjely tamin’ny herin’ny fanahy nankany an-tany efitra aho, dia nahita vehivavy iray nitaingina bibidia mena midorehitra. Feno anarana manevateva an’Andriamanitra ilay bibidia, sady nanana loha fito sy tandroka folo.', 'ary nentin’ilay anjely tamin’ny herin’ny fanahy nankany an-tany efitra aho, dia nahita vehivavy iray nitaingina bibidia mena midorehitra. feno anarana manevateva an’andriamanitra ilay bibidia, sady nanana loha fito sy tandroka folo.'),
  ('6ab25cfed7aee82f32bce135', '2026-09-22T10:48:30.579Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:30.579Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 17, 12, '“Ny tandroka folo efa hitanao, dia mpanjaka folo mbola tsy nahazo fanjakana. Mahazo fahefana hanjaka adiny iray miaraka amin’ilay bibidia anefa izy ireo.', '“ny tandroka folo efa hitanao, dia mpanjaka folo mbola tsy nahazo fanjakana. mahazo fahefana hanjaka adiny iray miaraka amin’ilay bibidia anefa izy ireo.'),
  ('6ab25cfed7aee82f32bce12d', '2026-09-22T10:48:30.579Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:30.579Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 17, 4, 'Ary nanao akanjo volomparasy sy mena midorehitra ilay vehivavy sady niravaka volamena sy vatosoa ary perla. Teny an-tanany dia nisy kaopy volamena feno zava-maharikoriko, sady feno ny zava-maloton’ny fijangajangany.', 'ary nanao akanjo volomparasy sy mena midorehitra ilay vehivavy sady niravaka volamena sy vatosoa ary perla. teny an-tanany dia nisy kaopy volamena feno zava-maharikoriko, sady feno ny zava-maloton’ny fijangajangany.'),
  ('6ab25cfed7aee82f32bce133', '2026-09-22T10:48:30.579Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:30.579Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 17, 10, 'Ary misy mpanjaka fito: Efa lavo ny dimy, fa ny iray mbola eo, ary ny iray mbola tsy tonga. Rehefa tonga anefa izy, dia hijanona kelikely eo.', 'ary misy mpanjaka fito: efa lavo ny dimy, fa ny iray mbola eo, ary ny iray mbola tsy tonga. rehefa tonga anefa izy, dia hijanona kelikely eo.'),
  ('6ab25cfed7aee82f32bce131', '2026-09-22T10:48:30.579Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:30.579Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 17, 8, 'Efa teo ilay bibidia hitanao, fa tsy eo izao, nefa efa hiakatra avy ao amin’ny lavaka mangitsokitsoka, dia haringana avy eo. Dia ho gaga ny mponina eto an-tany rehefa mahita hoe efa teo ilay bibidia, fa tsy eo izy izao, nefa mbola ho eo. Efa hatramin’ny nanorenana an’izao tontolo izao ny anaran’ireo olona ireo no tsy voasoratra tao amin’ny horonam-bokin’ny fiainana.', 'efa teo ilay bibidia hitanao, fa tsy eo izao, nefa efa hiakatra avy ao amin’ny lavaka mangitsokitsoka, dia haringana avy eo. dia ho gaga ny mponina eto an-tany rehefa mahita hoe efa teo ilay bibidia, fa tsy eo izy izao, nefa mbola ho eo. efa hatramin’ny nanorenana an’izao tontolo izao ny anaran’ireo olona ireo no tsy voasoratra tao amin’ny horonam-bokin’ny fiainana.'),
  ('6ab25cfed7aee82f32bce134', '2026-09-22T10:48:30.579Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:30.579Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 17, 11, 'Ilay bibidia izay efa teo nefa tsy eo izao, dia mpanjaka ihany koa. Mpanjaka laharana fahavalo izy nefa avy tamin’ireo fito ihany, ary haringana avy eo.', 'ilay bibidia izay efa teo nefa tsy eo izao, dia mpanjaka ihany koa. mpanjaka laharana fahavalo izy nefa avy tamin’ireo fito ihany, ary haringana avy eo.'),
  ('6ab25cfed7aee82f32bce136', '2026-09-22T10:48:30.579Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:30.579Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 17, 13, 'Miray saina izy ireo, ka samy manome ny heriny sy ny fahefany ho an’ilay bibidia.', 'miray saina izy ireo, ka samy manome ny heriny sy ny fahefany ho an’ilay bibidia.'),
  ('6ab25cfed7aee82f32bce138', '2026-09-22T10:48:30.579Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:30.579Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 17, 15, 'Dia hoy izy tamiko: “Ny rano izay efa hitanao ipetrahan’ilay mpivaro-tena, dia olona sy vahoaka sy firenena ary olona samy hafa fiteny.', 'dia hoy izy tamiko: “ny rano izay efa hitanao ipetrahan’ilay mpivaro-tena, dia olona sy vahoaka sy firenena ary olona samy hafa fiteny.'),
  ('6ab25cfed7aee82f32bce137', '2026-09-22T10:48:30.579Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:30.579Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 17, 14, 'Ary hiady amin’ny Zanak’ondry ireo. Handresy an’ireo anefa ny Zanak’ondry satria Tompon’ny tompo sy Mpanjakan’ny mpanjaka. Handresy an’ireo koa izay miaraka aminy, dia izay voantso sy voafidy ary tsy mivadika.”', 'ary hiady amin’ny zanak’ondry ireo. handresy an’ireo anefa ny zanak’ondry satria tompon’ny tompo sy mpanjakan’ny mpanjaka. handresy an’ireo koa izay miaraka aminy, dia izay voantso sy voafidy ary tsy mivadika.”'),
  ('6ab25cfed7aee82f32bce13a', '2026-09-22T10:48:30.579Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:30.579Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 17, 17, 'Efa nataon’Andriamanitra tao am-pon’izy ireo mantsy ny hanatanteraka ny heviny, izany hoe ny hanatanteraka an’ilay hevitra tokana iombonan’izy ireo, dia ny hanome ny fanjakany ho an’ilay bibidia, mandra-pahatanteraky ny tenin’Andriamanitra.', 'efa nataon’andriamanitra tao am-pon’izy ireo mantsy ny hanatanteraka ny heviny, izany hoe ny hanatanteraka an’ilay hevitra tokana iombonan’izy ireo, dia ny hanome ny fanjakany ho an’ilay bibidia, mandra-pahatanteraky ny tenin’andriamanitra.'),
  ('6ab25cfed7aee82f32bce139', '2026-09-22T10:48:30.579Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:30.579Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 17, 16, 'Ary ny tandroka folo efa hitanao, sy ilay bibidia, dia hankahala an’ilay mpivaro-tena ka handroba an’izay ananany rehetra sy hampiboridana azy. Dia hohanin’izy ireo ny nofony, ary hodorany tanteraka amin’ny afo izy.', 'ary ny tandroka folo efa hitanao, sy ilay bibidia, dia hankahala an’ilay mpivaro-tena ka handroba an’izay ananany rehetra sy hampiboridana azy. dia hohanin’izy ireo ny nofony, ary hodorany tanteraka amin’ny afo izy.'),
  ('6ab25cfed7aee82f32bce12f', '2026-09-22T10:48:30.579Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:30.579Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 17, 6, 'Ary nahita aho fa mamon’ny ran’ny olona masina sy ny ran’ny vavolombelon’i Jesosy ilay vehivavy. Dia gaga be aho rehefa nahita azy.', 'ary nahita aho fa mamon’ny ran’ny olona masina sy ny ran’ny vavolombelon’i jesosy ilay vehivavy. dia gaga be aho rehefa nahita azy.'),
  ('6ab25cfed7aee82f32bce130', '2026-09-22T10:48:30.579Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:30.579Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 17, 7, 'Ary hoy ilay anjely tamiko: “Fa maninona ianao no gaga? Holazaiko anao ny zava-miafina momba an’ilay vehivavy sy ilay bibidia itaingenany, izay manana loha fito sy tandroka folo:', 'ary hoy ilay anjely tamiko: “fa maninona ianao no gaga? holazaiko anao ny zava-miafina momba an’ilay vehivavy sy ilay bibidia itaingenany, izay manana loha fito sy tandroka folo:'),
  ('6ab25cfed7aee82f32bce12e', '2026-09-22T10:48:30.579Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:30.579Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 17, 5, 'Ary nisy anarana mifono zava-miafina nisoratra teo amin’ny handriny: “Babylona Lehibe, ilay renin’ny mpivaro-tena sy ny zava-maharikoriko eto an-tany.”', 'ary nisy anarana mifono zava-miafina nisoratra teo amin’ny handriny: “babylona lehibe, ilay renin’ny mpivaro-tena sy ny zava-maharikoriko eto an-tany.”'),
  ('6ab25cfed7aee82f32bce13b', '2026-09-22T10:48:30.579Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:30.579Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 17, 18, 'Ary ilay vehivavy efa hitanao, dia ilay tanàna lehibe mifehy an’ireo mpanjakan’ny tany.”', 'ary ilay vehivavy efa hitanao, dia ilay tanàna lehibe mifehy an’ireo mpanjakan’ny tany.”'),
  ('6ab25cfed7aee82f32bce132', '2026-09-22T10:48:30.579Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:30.579Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 17, 9, '“Eto no ilana fahiratan-tsaina sy fahendrena: Ny loha fito dia tendrombohitra fito, ka eo an-tampony ilay vehivavy no mipetraka.', '“eto no ilana fahiratan-tsaina sy fahendrena: ny loha fito dia tendrombohitra fito, ka eo an-tampony ilay vehivavy no mipetraka.'),
  ('6ab25cff242701bd6ea4bebe', '2026-09-22T10:48:31.073Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:31.073Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 18, 24, 'Eny, tao amin’io tanàna io no nahitana ny ran’ny mpaminany sy ny olona masina ary izay rehetra naripaka teny ambonin’ny tany.”', 'eny, tao amin’io tanàna io no nahitana ny ran’ny mpaminany sy ny olona masina ary izay rehetra naripaka teny ambonin’ny tany.”'),
  ('6ab25cff242701bd6ea4beb0', '2026-09-22T10:48:31.073Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:31.073Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 18, 10, 'Ary hijoro lavidavitra izy ireo satria matahotra sao hiara-mijaly aminy, ka hiteny hoe: ‘Indrisy! Indrisy, ry Babylona, ilay tanàna lehibe sy matanjaka! Fa tao anatin’ny adiny iray fotsiny dia efa voasazy ianao!’', 'ary hijoro lavidavitra izy ireo satria matahotra sao hiara-mijaly aminy, ka hiteny hoe: ‘indrisy! indrisy, ry babylona, ilay tanàna lehibe sy matanjaka! fa tao anatin’ny adiny iray fotsiny dia efa voasazy ianao!’'),
  ('6ab25cff242701bd6ea4beb2', '2026-09-22T10:48:31.073Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:31.073Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 18, 12, 'izany hoe tahirim-bolamena, volafotsy, vatosoa, perla, lamba rongony tena tsara, lamba volomparasy, lamba landy, lamba mena midorehitra, zavatra rehetra vita amin’ny hazo mani-pofona, zavatra isan-karazany vita amin’ny ivoara sy hazo sarobidy sy varahina sy vy ary marbra,', 'izany hoe tahirim-bolamena, volafotsy, vatosoa, perla, lamba rongony tena tsara, lamba volomparasy, lamba landy, lamba mena midorehitra, zavatra rehetra vita amin’ny hazo mani-pofona, zavatra isan-karazany vita amin’ny ivoara sy hazo sarobidy sy varahina sy vy ary marbra,'),
  ('6ab25cff242701bd6ea4beb8', '2026-09-22T10:48:31.073Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:31.073Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 18, 18, 'Niantsoantso mafy izy ireo rehefa nijery ny setroky ny afo nandoroana azy, sady niteny hoe: ‘Iza no tanàna hoatran’ilay tanàna lehibe?’', 'niantsoantso mafy izy ireo rehefa nijery ny setroky ny afo nandoroana azy, sady niteny hoe: ‘iza no tanàna hoatran’ilay tanàna lehibe?’'),
  ('6ab25cff242701bd6ea4beb9', '2026-09-22T10:48:31.073Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:31.073Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 18, 19, 'Dia nanipy vovoka teo amin’ny lohany izy ireo sady niantsoantso mafy no nitomany sy nalahelo, ka niteny hoe: ‘Indrisy! Indrisy, fa tao anatin’ny adiny iray fotsiny dia nanjavona ilay tanàna lehibe! Ny harenany anefa no nahatonga an’izay nanan-tsambo teny an-dranomasina ho lasa mpanankarena.’', 'dia nanipy vovoka teo amin’ny lohany izy ireo sady niantsoantso mafy no nitomany sy nalahelo, ka niteny hoe: ‘indrisy! indrisy, fa tao anatin’ny adiny iray fotsiny dia nanjavona ilay tanàna lehibe! ny harenany anefa no nahatonga an’izay nanan-tsambo teny an-dranomasina ho lasa mpanankarena.’'),
  ('6ab25cff242701bd6ea4beaf', '2026-09-22T10:48:31.073Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:31.073Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 18, 9, '“Ary hitomany sy hikapo-tratra ny mpanjakan’ny tany fa malahelo azy. Efa nijangajanga taminy sy nanaram-po tamin’ny zavatra lafo vidy maro be nangonin’ilay vehivavy izy ireo, izany hoe ny zavatra lafo vidy izay tsy nahamenatra an’ilay vehivavy intsony ny nanangona azy. Hitomany tokoa izy ireo rehefa mahita an’ilay setroky ny afo andoroana azy.', '“ary hitomany sy hikapo-tratra ny mpanjakan’ny tany fa malahelo azy. efa nijangajanga taminy sy nanaram-po tamin’ny zavatra lafo vidy maro be nangonin’ilay vehivavy izy ireo, izany hoe ny zavatra lafo vidy izay tsy nahamenatra an’ilay vehivavy intsony ny nanangona azy. hitomany tokoa izy ireo rehefa mahita an’ilay setroky ny afo andoroana azy.'),
  ('6ab25cff242701bd6ea4beae', '2026-09-22T10:48:31.073Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:31.073Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 18, 8, 'Noho izany, dia ho tonga ao anatin’ny iray andro ihany ny loza hanjo azy, dia fahafatesana sy alahelo ary mosary. Dia hodorana tanteraka amin’ny afo izy, satria mahery i Jehovah Andriamanitra, ilay nitsara azy.', 'noho izany, dia ho tonga ao anatin’ny iray andro ihany ny loza hanjo azy, dia fahafatesana sy alahelo ary mosary. dia hodorana tanteraka amin’ny afo izy, satria mahery i jehovah andriamanitra, ilay nitsara azy.'),
  ('6ab25cff242701bd6ea4beb6', '2026-09-22T10:48:31.073Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:31.073Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 18, 16, 'sady hiteny hoe: ‘Indrisy! Indrisy, ry ilay tanàna lehibe nanao akanjo vita amin’ny lamba rongony tena tsara sy lamba volomparasy ary lamba mena midorehitra, sady niravaka volamena sy vatosoa ary perla be dia be!', 'sady hiteny hoe: ‘indrisy! indrisy, ry ilay tanàna lehibe nanao akanjo vita amin’ny lamba rongony tena tsara sy lamba volomparasy ary lamba mena midorehitra, sady niravaka volamena sy vatosoa ary perla be dia be!'),
  ('6ab25cff242701bd6ea4bebd', '2026-09-22T10:48:31.073Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:31.073Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 18, 23, 'Tsy hisy hamirapiratra ao aminao intsony ny hazavan’ny jiro, ary tsy hisy feon’ny mpampakatra na ny ampakarina ho heno intsony ao aminao. Ny mpivarotra teo aminao mantsy no manam-pahefana ambony teny ambonin’ny tany, ary voafitaky ny ody lalaovinao ny firenena rehetra.', 'tsy hisy hamirapiratra ao aminao intsony ny hazavan’ny jiro, ary tsy hisy feon’ny mpampakatra na ny ampakarina ho heno intsony ao aminao. ny mpivarotra teo aminao mantsy no manam-pahefana ambony teny ambonin’ny tany, ary voafitaky ny ody lalaovinao ny firenena rehetra.'),
  ('6ab25cff242701bd6ea4beb7', '2026-09-22T10:48:31.073Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:31.073Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 18, 17, 'Tao anatin’ny adiny iray fotsiny mantsy dia nanjavona izany harem-be izany.’ “Ary nijoro lavidavitra ny kapitenin-tsambo rehetra, sy izay mpandeha sambo rehetra, sy ny tantsambo, ary izay rehetra mivelona amin’ny ranomasina.', 'tao anatin’ny adiny iray fotsiny mantsy dia nanjavona izany harem-be izany.’ “ary nijoro lavidavitra ny kapitenin-tsambo rehetra, sy izay mpandeha sambo rehetra, sy ny tantsambo, ary izay rehetra mivelona amin’ny ranomasina.'),
  ('6ab25cff242701bd6ea4beb4', '2026-09-22T10:48:31.073Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:31.073Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 18, 14, 'Efa nesorina taminao ny zava-tsoa nirinao, ary efa tsy misy eo aminao intsony ny sakafo matsiro sy ny zavatra tena tsara, ka tsy ho hita intsony mihitsy.', 'efa nesorina taminao ny zava-tsoa nirinao, ary efa tsy misy eo aminao intsony ny sakafo matsiro sy ny zavatra tena tsara, ka tsy ho hita intsony mihitsy.'),
  ('6ab25cff242701bd6ea4bea7', '2026-09-22T10:48:31.073Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:31.073Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 18, 1, 'Nahita anjely hafa iray nidina avy any an-danitra aho, taorian’izay. Nanana fahefana lehibe izy, ary nanazava ny tany ny voninahiny.', 'nahita anjely hafa iray nidina avy any an-danitra aho, taorian’izay. nanana fahefana lehibe izy, ary nanazava ny tany ny voninahiny.'),
  ('6ab25cff242701bd6ea4beb5', '2026-09-22T10:48:31.073Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:31.073Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 18, 15, '“Hijoro lavidavitra ny mpivarotra izay nivarotra an’ireny, dia izay nahazo harena avy taminy. Matahotra mantsy izy ireo sao hiara-mijaly aminy. Hitomany sy halahelo izy ireo,', '“hijoro lavidavitra ny mpivarotra izay nivarotra an’ireny, dia izay nahazo harena avy taminy. matahotra mantsy izy ireo sao hiara-mijaly aminy. hitomany sy halahelo izy ireo,'),
  ('6ab25cff242701bd6ea4bebb', '2026-09-22T10:48:31.073Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:31.073Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 18, 21, 'Ary nanainga vato tahaka ny vato lehibe fikosoham-bary ny anjely anankiray, ka nanipy mafy an’izany tany an-dranomasina, sady niteny hoe: “Hatsipy haingana hoatr’izao i Babylona, ilay tanàna lehibe, dia tsy ho hita intsony.', 'ary nanainga vato tahaka ny vato lehibe fikosoham-bary ny anjely anankiray, ka nanipy mafy an’izany tany an-dranomasina, sady niteny hoe: “hatsipy haingana hoatr’izao i babylona, ilay tanàna lehibe, dia tsy ho hita intsony.'),
  ('6ab25cff242701bd6ea4beb1', '2026-09-22T10:48:31.073Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:31.073Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 18, 11, '“Hitomany sy halahelo azy koa ny mpivarotra eto an-tany, satria tsy hisy hividy intsony ny tahirin’entany rehetra,', '“hitomany sy halahelo azy koa ny mpivarotra eto an-tany, satria tsy hisy hividy intsony ny tahirin’entany rehetra,'),
  ('6ab25cff242701bd6ea4beac', '2026-09-22T10:48:31.073Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:31.073Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 18, 6, 'Valio araka izay nataony tamin’olona izy, ary ataovy avo roa heny noho izay nataony izany. Ao amin’ilay kaopy nanaovany zava-pisotro, dia anaovy zava-pisotro avo roa heny ka omeo azy.', 'valio araka izay nataony tamin’olona izy, ary ataovy avo roa heny noho izay nataony izany. ao amin’ilay kaopy nanaovany zava-pisotro, dia anaovy zava-pisotro avo roa heny ka omeo azy.'),
  ('6ab25cff242701bd6ea4bebc', '2026-09-22T10:48:31.073Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:31.073Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 18, 22, 'Ary tsy ho heno ao aminao intsony, ry Babylona, ny feon’ny mpihira mampiaraka ny hirany amin’ny harpa, sy ny feon’ny mpitendry zavamaneno sy ny mpitsoka sodina ary ny mpitsoka trompetra. Tsy hisy mpanao asa tanana ho hita intsony koa ao aminao, sady tsy ho heno ao aminao intsony ny feon’ny vato fikosoham-bary.', 'ary tsy ho heno ao aminao intsony, ry babylona, ny feon’ny mpihira mampiaraka ny hirany amin’ny harpa, sy ny feon’ny mpitendry zavamaneno sy ny mpitsoka sodina ary ny mpitsoka trompetra. tsy hisy mpanao asa tanana ho hita intsony koa ao aminao, sady tsy ho heno ao aminao intsony ny feon’ny vato fikosoham-bary.'),
  ('6ab25cff242701bd6ea4beb3', '2026-09-22T10:48:31.073Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:31.073Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 18, 13, 'kanelina, zava-manitra indianina, emboka manitra, menaka manitra, ditin-kazo manitra, divay, menak’oliva, lafarinina tsara toto, varimbazaha, omby aman’ondry, soavaly, kalesy, andevo, ary olon-kafa.', 'kanelina, zava-manitra indianina, emboka manitra, menaka manitra, ditin-kazo manitra, divay, menak’oliva, lafarinina tsara toto, varimbazaha, omby aman’ondry, soavaly, kalesy, andevo, ary olon-kafa.'),
  ('6ab25cff242701bd6ea4beab', '2026-09-22T10:48:31.073Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:31.073Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 18, 5, 'Fa efa nivangongo hatrany an-danitra ny fahotany, ary efa tadidin’Andriamanitra ny tsy rariny nataony.', 'fa efa nivangongo hatrany an-danitra ny fahotany, ary efa tadidin’andriamanitra ny tsy rariny nataony.'),
  ('6ab25cff242701bd6ea4bea8', '2026-09-22T10:48:31.073Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:31.073Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 18, 2, 'Ary niantsoantso mafy izy hoe: “Nianjera, nianjera i Babylona Lehibe, ka lasa fonenan’ny demonia! Lasa miafina ao koa ny fanahy maloto rehetra sy ny vorona maloto sady ankahalaina rehetra!', 'ary niantsoantso mafy izy hoe: “nianjera, nianjera i babylona lehibe, ka lasa fonenan’ny demonia! lasa miafina ao koa ny fanahy maloto rehetra sy ny vorona maloto sady ankahalaina rehetra!'),
  ('6ab25cff242701bd6ea4bead', '2026-09-22T10:48:31.073Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:31.073Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 18, 7, 'Nidera tena loatra izy sady nanaram-po tamin’ny zavatra lafo vidy maro be nangoniny, ary efa tsy nahamenatra azy intsony ny nanangona an’izany. Mba ataovy mijalijaly sy mitomany koa àry izy. Miteny anakampo foana mantsy izy hoe: ‘Mipetraka hoatran’ny mpanjakavavy aho sady tsy mpitondratena, dia tsy mba hitomany mihitsy.’', 'nidera tena loatra izy sady nanaram-po tamin’ny zavatra lafo vidy maro be nangoniny, ary efa tsy nahamenatra azy intsony ny nanangona an’izany. mba ataovy mijalijaly sy mitomany koa àry izy. miteny anakampo foana mantsy izy hoe: ‘mipetraka hoatran’ny mpanjakavavy aho sady tsy mpitondratena, dia tsy mba hitomany mihitsy.’'),
  ('6ab25cff242701bd6ea4bea9', '2026-09-22T10:48:31.073Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:31.073Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 18, 3, 'Fa ny divainy, izany hoe ny faniriany mafy hijangajanga, no nahamamo ny firenena rehetra sady nahatonga ny mpanjakan’ny tany hijangajanga taminy. Dia lasa nanan-karena ny mpivarotra teto an-tany noho ny zavatra lafo vidy maro be nangoniny, ary efa tsy nahamenatra azy intsony ny nanangona an’izany.”', 'fa ny divainy, izany hoe ny faniriany mafy hijangajanga, no nahamamo ny firenena rehetra sady nahatonga ny mpanjakan’ny tany hijangajanga taminy. dia lasa nanan-karena ny mpivarotra teto an-tany noho ny zavatra lafo vidy maro be nangoniny, ary efa tsy nahamenatra azy intsony ny nanangona an’izany.”'),
  ('6ab25cff242701bd6ea4beba', '2026-09-22T10:48:31.073Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:31.073Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 18, 20, '“Mifalia noho izay manjo azy, ry lanitra! Mifalia koa ianareo olona masina sy apostoly ary mpaminany, satria efa namoaka ny didim-pitsarana momba azy Andriamanitra noho izay nataony taminareo!”', '“mifalia noho izay manjo azy, ry lanitra! mifalia koa ianareo olona masina sy apostoly ary mpaminany, satria efa namoaka ny didim-pitsarana momba azy andriamanitra noho izay nataony taminareo!”'),
  ('6ab25cff242701bd6ea4beaa', '2026-09-22T10:48:31.073Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:31.073Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 18, 4, 'Ary naheno feo hafa avy any an-danitra aho hoe: “Mivoaha avy ao aminy, ianareo vahoakako, raha tsy tianareo ny hiray tsikombakomba aminy amin’izay fahotana nataony, ary raha tsy tianareo hahazo anareo ny loza hanjo azy.', 'ary naheno feo hafa avy any an-danitra aho hoe: “mivoaha avy ao aminy, ianareo vahoakako, raha tsy tianareo ny hiray tsikombakomba aminy amin’izay fahotana nataony, ary raha tsy tianareo hahazo anareo ny loza hanjo azy.'),
  ('6ab25cffd22a27947c5fc64f', '2026-09-22T10:48:31.571Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:31.571Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 19, 15, 'Ary nisy sabatra maranitra lava be nivoaka avy tamin’ny vavany mba hamelezany ny firenena. Dia hiandry azy ireo amin’ny tehina vy izy. Nohitsakitsahiny koa ny voaloboka tao anaty famiazana, dia ny fahatezerana lehiben’Andriamanitra, ilay Mahery Indrindra.', 'ary nisy sabatra maranitra lava be nivoaka avy tamin’ny vavany mba hamelezany ny firenena. dia hiandry azy ireo amin’ny tehina vy izy. nohitsakitsahiny koa ny voaloboka tao anaty famiazana, dia ny fahatezerana lehiben’andriamanitra, ilay mahery indrindra.'),
  ('6ab25cffd22a27947c5fc647', '2026-09-22T10:48:31.571Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:31.571Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 19, 7, 'Andao isika hifaly be mihitsy, dia hanome voninahitra azy, fa tonga ny fampakaram-badin’ny Zanak’ondry sady efa niomana ny vadiny.', 'andao isika hifaly be mihitsy, dia hanome voninahitra azy, fa tonga ny fampakaram-badin’ny zanak’ondry sady efa niomana ny vadiny.'),
  ('6ab25cffd22a27947c5fc645', '2026-09-22T10:48:31.571Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:31.571Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 19, 5, 'Nisy feo koa nivoaka avy teo amin’ny seza fiandrianana, niteny hoe: “Derao foana ilay Andriamanitsika, ry mpanompony rehetra matahotra azy, na kely na lehibe.”', 'nisy feo koa nivoaka avy teo amin’ny seza fiandrianana, niteny hoe: “derao foana ilay andriamanitsika, ry mpanompony rehetra matahotra azy, na kely na lehibe.”'),
  ('6ab25cffd22a27947c5fc655', '2026-09-22T10:48:31.571Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:31.571Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 19, 21, 'Fa ny sisa kosa novonoina tamin’ilay sabatra lava be nivoaka avy tamin’ny vavan’ilay mitaingin-tsoavaly. Dia voky ny nofon’izy ireny ny vorona rehetra.', 'fa ny sisa kosa novonoina tamin’ilay sabatra lava be nivoaka avy tamin’ny vavan’ilay mitaingin-tsoavaly. dia voky ny nofon’izy ireny ny vorona rehetra.'),
  ('6ab25cffd22a27947c5fc64b', '2026-09-22T10:48:31.571Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:31.571Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 19, 11, 'Ary nahita ny lanitra nisokatra aho, dia iny nisy soavaly fotsy. Antsoina hoe Mendri-pitokisana sy Marina ilay nitaingina azy, ary nitsara sy niady araka ny rariny foana izy.', 'ary nahita ny lanitra nisokatra aho, dia iny nisy soavaly fotsy. antsoina hoe mendri-pitokisana sy marina ilay nitaingina azy, ary nitsara sy niady araka ny rariny foana izy.'),
  ('6ab25cffd22a27947c5fc64d', '2026-09-22T10:48:31.571Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:31.571Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 19, 13, 'Nanao akanjo ivelany tasin’ny ra izy, ary Ny Tenin’Andriamanitra no anarana niantsoana azy.', 'nanao akanjo ivelany tasin’ny ra izy, ary ny tenin’andriamanitra no anarana niantsoana azy.'),
  ('6ab25cffd22a27947c5fc64c', '2026-09-22T10:48:31.571Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:31.571Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 19, 12, 'Lelafo ny masony, ary nisy diadema be dia be teo amin’ny lohany. Nanana anarana voasoratra izy, ary izy irery no mahalala an’ilay anarana.', 'lelafo ny masony, ary nisy diadema be dia be teo amin’ny lohany. nanana anarana voasoratra izy, ary izy irery no mahalala an’ilay anarana.'),
  ('6ab25cffd22a27947c5fc641', '2026-09-22T10:48:31.571Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:31.571Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 19, 1, 'Taorian’izany, dia naheno feo hoatran’ny feon’ny vahoaka be tany an-danitra aho, niantsoantso hoe: “Derao i Jah! An’ilay Andriamanitsika ny famonjena sy ny voninahitra ary ny hery,', 'taorian’izany, dia naheno feo hoatran’ny feon’ny vahoaka be tany an-danitra aho, niantsoantso hoe: “derao i jah! an’ilay andriamanitsika ny famonjena sy ny voninahitra ary ny hery,'),
  ('6ab25cffd22a27947c5fc654', '2026-09-22T10:48:31.571Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:31.571Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 19, 20, 'Dia nosamborina ilay bibidia sy ilay mpaminany sandoka, izay nanao famantarana teo anatrehan’ilay bibidia, dia famantarana namitahany an’izay nandray ny marik’ilay bibidia sy izay nivavaka tamin’ny sariny. Samy natsipy velona tao amin’ny farihy afo arehitry ny solifara izy ireo avy eo.', 'dia nosamborina ilay bibidia sy ilay mpaminany sandoka, izay nanao famantarana teo anatrehan’ilay bibidia, dia famantarana namitahany an’izay nandray ny marik’ilay bibidia sy izay nivavaka tamin’ny sariny. samy natsipy velona tao amin’ny farihy afo arehitry ny solifara izy ireo avy eo.'),
  ('6ab25cffd22a27947c5fc649', '2026-09-22T10:48:31.571Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:31.571Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 19, 9, 'Ary hoy ilay anjely tamiko: “Soraty izao: Sambatra izay asaina amin’ilay sakafo hariva amin’ny fampakaram-badin’ny Zanak’ondry.” Hoy koa izy tamiko: “Tena teny nolazain’Andriamanitra izany.”', 'ary hoy ilay anjely tamiko: “soraty izao: sambatra izay asaina amin’ilay sakafo hariva amin’ny fampakaram-badin’ny zanak’ondry.” hoy koa izy tamiko: “tena teny nolazain’andriamanitra izany.”'),
  ('6ab25cffd22a27947c5fc653', '2026-09-22T10:48:31.571Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:31.571Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 19, 19, 'Ary hitako ilay bibidia sy ireo mpanjakan’ny tany sy ny tafiny, nivondrona hiady tamin’ilay mitaingin-tsoavaly sy ny tafiny.', 'ary hitako ilay bibidia sy ireo mpanjakan’ny tany sy ny tafiny, nivondrona hiady tamin’ilay mitaingin-tsoavaly sy ny tafiny.'),
  ('6ab25cffd22a27947c5fc64a', '2026-09-22T10:48:31.571Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:31.571Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 19, 10, 'Tamin’izay dia niankohoka teo an-tongotr’ilay anjely aho mba hivavaka taminy. Hoy anefa izy tamiko: “Tandremo! Aza manao an’izao! Andriamanitra no ivavaho! Fa mpanompo ihany aho, hoatr’anao sy ny rahalahinao izay manao ny asa fitoriana momba an’i Jesosy. Ny fitoriana momba an’i Jesosy mantsy no antony nanoratana ny faminaniana.”', 'tamin’izay dia niankohoka teo an-tongotr’ilay anjely aho mba hivavaka taminy. hoy anefa izy tamiko: “tandremo! aza manao an’izao! andriamanitra no ivavaho! fa mpanompo ihany aho, hoatr’anao sy ny rahalahinao izay manao ny asa fitoriana momba an’i jesosy. ny fitoriana momba an’i jesosy mantsy no antony nanoratana ny faminaniana.”'),
  ('6ab25cffd22a27947c5fc644', '2026-09-22T10:48:31.571Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:31.571Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 19, 4, 'Ary ny anti-panahy 24 sy ny zavamananaina efatra dia niankohoka sy nivavaka tamin’Andriamanitra, izay nipetraka teo ambonin’ny seza fiandrianana. Dia niteny izy ireo hoe: “Amena! Derao i Jah!”', 'ary ny anti-panahy 24 sy ny zavamananaina efatra dia niankohoka sy nivavaka tamin’andriamanitra, izay nipetraka teo ambonin’ny seza fiandrianana. dia niteny izy ireo hoe: “amena! derao i jah!”'),
  ('6ab25cffd22a27947c5fc642', '2026-09-22T10:48:31.571Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:31.571Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 19, 2, 'satria azo atokisana sy ara-drariny ny fitsarany. Fa nampihatra didim-pitsarana tamin’ilay mpivaro-tena lehibe izy, dia tamin’ilay nanimba ny tany tamin’ny fijangajangany. Novaliany koa ny ran’ny mpanompony nalatsaky ny tanan’ilay vehivavy.”', 'satria azo atokisana sy ara-drariny ny fitsarany. fa nampihatra didim-pitsarana tamin’ilay mpivaro-tena lehibe izy, dia tamin’ilay nanimba ny tany tamin’ny fijangajangany. novaliany koa ny ran’ny mpanompony nalatsaky ny tanan’ilay vehivavy.”'),
  ('6ab25cffd22a27947c5fc652', '2026-09-22T10:48:31.571Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:31.571Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 19, 18, 'Amin’izay ianareo dia hihinana ny nofon’ny mpanjaka sy ny nofon’ny mpitari-tafika sy ny nofon’ny lehilahy matanjaka sy ny nofon’ny soavaly sy izay mitaingina azy ary ny nofon’ny olona rehetra, na olona afaka na andevo, na kely na lehibe.”', 'amin’izay ianareo dia hihinana ny nofon’ny mpanjaka sy ny nofon’ny mpitari-tafika sy ny nofon’ny lehilahy matanjaka sy ny nofon’ny soavaly sy izay mitaingina azy ary ny nofon’ny olona rehetra, na olona afaka na andevo, na kely na lehibe.”'),
  ('6ab25cffd22a27947c5fc64e', '2026-09-22T10:48:31.571Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:31.571Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 19, 14, 'Nanaraka azy koa ny tafika tany an-danitra, nitaingina soavaly fotsy sady nanao akanjo rongony fotsy sy madio ary tena tsara.', 'nanaraka azy koa ny tafika tany an-danitra, nitaingina soavaly fotsy sady nanao akanjo rongony fotsy sy madio ary tena tsara.'),
  ('6ab25cffd22a27947c5fc646', '2026-09-22T10:48:31.571Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:31.571Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 19, 6, 'Ary naheno feo aho, dia feo hoatran’ny feon’ny vahoaka be sy feon’ny rano be ary feon’ny kotroka mafy, niteny hoe: “Derao i Jah, satria efa nanomboka nanjaka i Jehovah Andriamanitsika, ilay Mahery Indrindra!', 'ary naheno feo aho, dia feo hoatran’ny feon’ny vahoaka be sy feon’ny rano be ary feon’ny kotroka mafy, niteny hoe: “derao i jah, satria efa nanomboka nanjaka i jehovah andriamanitsika, ilay mahery indrindra!'),
  ('6ab25cffd22a27947c5fc651', '2026-09-22T10:48:31.571Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:31.571Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 19, 17, 'Nahita anjely iray nijoro teo amin’ny masoandro koa aho. Niantsoantso mafy izy ka nilaza tamin’ny vorona rehetra nanidina teny afovoan’ny lanitra hoe: “Avia! Mitangoròna mba hihinana amin’ilay sakafo hariva lehibe nataon’Andriamanitra.', 'nahita anjely iray nijoro teo amin’ny masoandro koa aho. niantsoantso mafy izy ka nilaza tamin’ny vorona rehetra nanidina teny afovoan’ny lanitra hoe: “avia! mitangoròna mba hihinana amin’ilay sakafo hariva lehibe nataon’andriamanitra.'),
  ('6ab25cffd22a27947c5fc650', '2026-09-22T10:48:31.571Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:31.571Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 19, 16, 'Ary nisy anarana voasoratra teo amin’ny akanjony ivelany, teo amin’ny feny, hoe Mpanjakan’ny mpanjaka sy Tompon’ny tompo.', 'ary nisy anarana voasoratra teo amin’ny akanjony ivelany, teo amin’ny feny, hoe mpanjakan’ny mpanjaka sy tompon’ny tompo.'),
  ('6ab25cffd22a27947c5fc643', '2026-09-22T10:48:31.571Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:31.571Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 19, 3, 'Tonga dia niteny fanindroany ilay feo hoe: “Derao i Jah! Miakatra mandrakizay mandrakizay ny setroka avy amin’i Babylona.”', 'tonga dia niteny fanindroany ilay feo hoe: “derao i jah! miakatra mandrakizay mandrakizay ny setroka avy amin’i babylona.”'),
  ('6ab25cffd22a27947c5fc648', '2026-09-22T10:48:31.571Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:31.571Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 19, 8, 'Navela hanao akanjo rongony mamirapiratra sy madio ary tena tsara ilay vehivavy, satria ilay lamba rongony tena tsara dia ny zavatra ara-drariny nataon’ny olona masina.”', 'navela hanao akanjo rongony mamirapiratra sy madio ary tena tsara ilay vehivavy, satria ilay lamba rongony tena tsara dia ny zavatra ara-drariny nataon’ny olona masina.”'),
  ('6ab25d00251e1fd37e74da0d', '2026-09-22T10:48:32.754Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:32.754Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 20, 13, 'Ary namoaka ny maty tao aminy ny ranomasina. Namoaka ny maty tao aminy koa ny fahafatesana sy ny Fasana. Dia samy notsaraina arakaraka izay nataony izy ireny.', 'ary namoaka ny maty tao aminy ny ranomasina. namoaka ny maty tao aminy koa ny fahafatesana sy ny fasana. dia samy notsaraina arakaraka izay nataony izy ireny.'),
  ('6ab25d00251e1fd37e74da06', '2026-09-22T10:48:32.754Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:32.754Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 20, 6, 'Sambatra sy masina izay manana anjara amin’ny fitsanganana voalohany. Tsy hanam-pahefana amin’izy ireo ny fahafatesana faharoa. Ho mpisoron’Andriamanitra sy Kristy kosa izy ireo, ka hiara-manjaka aminy 1 000 taona.', 'sambatra sy masina izay manana anjara amin’ny fitsanganana voalohany. tsy hanam-pahefana amin’izy ireo ny fahafatesana faharoa. ho mpisoron’andriamanitra sy kristy kosa izy ireo, ka hiara-manjaka aminy 1 000 taona.'),
  ('6ab25d00251e1fd37e74da0a', '2026-09-22T10:48:32.754Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:32.754Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 20, 10, 'Ary ny Devoly izay namitaka azy ireo dia natsipy mafy tao amin’ny farihy afo sy solifara, dia tao amin’ilay efa nisy an’ilay bibidia sy ilay mpaminany sandoka. Dia hampijalijalina andro aman’alina mandrakizay mandrakizay ireo.', 'ary ny devoly izay namitaka azy ireo dia natsipy mafy tao amin’ny farihy afo sy solifara, dia tao amin’ilay efa nisy an’ilay bibidia sy ilay mpaminany sandoka. dia hampijalijalina andro aman’alina mandrakizay mandrakizay ireo.'),
  ('6ab25d00251e1fd37e74da0e', '2026-09-22T10:48:32.754Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:32.754Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 20, 14, 'Ary natsipy mafy tany amin’ny farihy afo ny fahafatesana sy ny Fasana. Ny farihy afo dia ny fahafatesana faharoa.', 'ary natsipy mafy tany amin’ny farihy afo ny fahafatesana sy ny fasana. ny farihy afo dia ny fahafatesana faharoa.'),
  ('6ab25d00251e1fd37e74da08', '2026-09-22T10:48:32.754Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:32.754Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 20, 8, 'ka hivoaka hamitaka an’ireo firenena any amin’ny vazan-tany efatra, dia i Goga sy Magoga, mba hanangona azy ireo ho amin’ny ady. Hoatran’ny fasika any an-dranomasina ny isan’izy ireo.', 'ka hivoaka hamitaka an’ireo firenena any amin’ny vazan-tany efatra, dia i goga sy magoga, mba hanangona azy ireo ho amin’ny ady. hoatran’ny fasika any an-dranomasina ny isan’izy ireo.'),
  ('6ab25d00251e1fd37e74da09', '2026-09-22T10:48:32.754Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:32.754Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 20, 9, 'Dia niparitaka manerana ny tany manontolo izy ireo, ka nanodidina ny tobin’ny olona masina sy ilay tanàna malala. Nisy afo nilatsaka avy any an-danitra anefa nandevona azy ireo.', 'dia niparitaka manerana ny tany manontolo izy ireo, ka nanodidina ny tobin’ny olona masina sy ilay tanàna malala. nisy afo nilatsaka avy any an-danitra anefa nandevona azy ireo.'),
  ('6ab25d00251e1fd37e74da0f', '2026-09-22T10:48:32.754Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:32.754Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 20, 15, 'Natsipy mafy tao amin’ny farihy afo koa izay tsy voasoratra anarana tao amin’ny bokin’ny fiainana.', 'natsipy mafy tao amin’ny farihy afo koa izay tsy voasoratra anarana tao amin’ny bokin’ny fiainana.'),
  ('6ab25d00251e1fd37e74da05', '2026-09-22T10:48:32.754Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:32.754Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 20, 5, '—Mbola tsy velona ny sisa tamin’ny maty mandra-pahatapitry ny 1 000 taona.—Izany no fitsanganana voalohany.', '—mbola tsy velona ny sisa tamin’ny maty mandra-pahatapitry ny 1 000 taona.—izany no fitsanganana voalohany.'),
  ('6ab25d00251e1fd37e74da01', '2026-09-22T10:48:32.754Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:32.754Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 20, 1, 'Ary nahita anjely nidina avy any an-danitra aho. Nitazona ny lakilen’ny lavaka mangitsokitsoka izy, sady nisy rojo vy lehibe teny an-tanany.', 'ary nahita anjely nidina avy any an-danitra aho. nitazona ny lakilen’ny lavaka mangitsokitsoka izy, sady nisy rojo vy lehibe teny an-tanany.'),
  ('6ab25d00251e1fd37e74da03', '2026-09-22T10:48:32.754Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:32.754Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 20, 3, 'ary natsipiny mafy tao amin’ilay lavaka mangitsokitsoka. Nohidian’ilay anjely sy nasiany tombo-kase ilay lavaka avy eo, amin’izay dia tsy hamitaka ny firenena intsony ilay dragona mandra-pahatapitry ny 1 000 taona. Aorian’izany dia hovahana vetivety izy.', 'ary natsipiny mafy tao amin’ilay lavaka mangitsokitsoka. nohidian’ilay anjely sy nasiany tombo-kase ilay lavaka avy eo, amin’izay dia tsy hamitaka ny firenena intsony ilay dragona mandra-pahatapitry ny 1 000 taona. aorian’izany dia hovahana vetivety izy.'),
  ('6ab25d00251e1fd37e74da0c', '2026-09-22T10:48:32.754Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:32.754Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 20, 12, 'Ary hitako ny maty, na ny lehibe na ny kely, nijoro teo anoloan’ny seza fiandrianana, dia nisy horonam-boky novelarina. Nisy horonam-boky iray koa anefa novelarina, dia ny horonam-bokin’ny fiainana. Dia notsaraina araka izay voasoratra tao amin’ireo horonam-boky ireo ny maty, arakaraka izay nataon’izy ireo.', 'ary hitako ny maty, na ny lehibe na ny kely, nijoro teo anoloan’ny seza fiandrianana, dia nisy horonam-boky novelarina. nisy horonam-boky iray koa anefa novelarina, dia ny horonam-bokin’ny fiainana. dia notsaraina araka izay voasoratra tao amin’ireo horonam-boky ireo ny maty, arakaraka izay nataon’izy ireo.'),
  ('6ab25d00251e1fd37e74da07', '2026-09-22T10:48:32.754Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:32.754Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 20, 7, 'Raha vao tapitra ny 1 000 taona, dia hovahana avy ao amin’ilay fonja nisy azy i Satana,', 'raha vao tapitra ny 1 000 taona, dia hovahana avy ao amin’ilay fonja nisy azy i satana,'),
  ('6ab25d00251e1fd37e74da04', '2026-09-22T10:48:32.754Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:32.754Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 20, 4, 'Nahita seza fiandrianana maro aho, ary nomena fahefana hitsara ireo nipetraka teo amboniny. Hitako izay novonoina satria nitory momba an’i Jesosy sy niresaka momba an’Andriamanitra. Tsy nivavaka tamin’ilay bibidia na tamin’ny sariny izy ireo, sady tsy nandray an’ilay marika teo amin’ny handriny sy teo amin’ny tanany. Ary velona izy ireo ka niara-nanjaka tamin’i Kristy 1 000 taona.', 'nahita seza fiandrianana maro aho, ary nomena fahefana hitsara ireo nipetraka teo amboniny. hitako izay novonoina satria nitory momba an’i jesosy sy niresaka momba an’andriamanitra. tsy nivavaka tamin’ilay bibidia na tamin’ny sariny izy ireo, sady tsy nandray an’ilay marika teo amin’ny handriny sy teo amin’ny tanany. ary velona izy ireo ka niara-nanjaka tamin’i kristy 1 000 taona.'),
  ('6ab25d00251e1fd37e74da02', '2026-09-22T10:48:32.754Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:32.754Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 20, 2, 'Dia nosamboriny ilay dragona, ilay menarana tany am-boalohany, dia ny Devoly sy Satana, ka nofatorany mba higadra 1 000 taona,', 'dia nosamboriny ilay dragona, ilay menarana tany am-boalohany, dia ny devoly sy satana, ka nofatorany mba higadra 1 000 taona,'),
  ('6ab25d00251e1fd37e74da0b', '2026-09-22T10:48:32.754Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:32.754Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 20, 11, 'Nahita seza fiandrianana fotsy lehibe aho, ary hitako koa Ilay nipetraka teo amboniny. Nandositra niala teo anatrehany ny tany sy ny lanitra, ka tsy hita intsony.', 'nahita seza fiandrianana fotsy lehibe aho, ary hitako koa ilay nipetraka teo amboniny. nandositra niala teo anatrehany ny tany sy ny lanitra, ka tsy hita intsony.'),
  ('6ab25d011c7378e14edb6963', '2026-09-22T10:48:33.274Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:33.274Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 21, 1, 'Ary nahita lanitra vaovao sy tany vaovao aho, fa efa lasa ny lanitra taloha sy ny tany taloha, sady tsy nisy ranomasina intsony.', 'ary nahita lanitra vaovao sy tany vaovao aho, fa efa lasa ny lanitra taloha sy ny tany taloha, sady tsy nisy ranomasina intsony.'),
  ('6ab25d011c7378e14edb6975', '2026-09-22T10:48:33.275Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:33.275Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 21, 19, 'Voaravaka vatosoa isan-karazany ny fototry ny mandan’ilay tanàna. Ny fototra voalohany dia jaspa, ny faharoa safira, ny fahatelo kalsedoanina, ny fahefatra emeraoda,', 'voaravaka vatosoa isan-karazany ny fototry ny mandan’ilay tanàna. ny fototra voalohany dia jaspa, ny faharoa safira, ny fahatelo kalsedoanina, ny fahefatra emeraoda,'),
  ('6ab25d011c7378e14edb6971', '2026-09-22T10:48:33.275Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:33.275Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 21, 15, 'Nitazona bararata volamena fandrefesana ilay niresaka tamiko tamin’izay, mba handrefesany an’ilay tanàna sy ny vavahadiny ary ny mandany.', 'nitazona bararata volamena fandrefesana ilay niresaka tamiko tamin’izay, mba handrefesany an’ilay tanàna sy ny vavahadiny ary ny mandany.'),
  ('6ab25d011c7378e14edb696f', '2026-09-22T10:48:33.275Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:33.275Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 21, 13, 'Nisy vavahady telo teo atsinanana, telo teo avaratra, telo teo atsimo, ary telo teo andrefana.', 'nisy vavahady telo teo atsinanana, telo teo avaratra, telo teo atsimo, ary telo teo andrefana.'),
  ('6ab25d011c7378e14edb696c', '2026-09-22T10:48:33.275Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:33.275Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 21, 10, 'Dia nentiny tamin’ny herin’ny fanahy nankeo amin’ny tendrombohitra ngezabe sady avo aho, dia nasehony ahy i Jerosalema, ilay tanàna masina, izay nidina avy any an-danitra avy tany amin’Andriamanitra.', 'dia nentiny tamin’ny herin’ny fanahy nankeo amin’ny tendrombohitra ngezabe sady avo aho, dia nasehony ahy i jerosalema, ilay tanàna masina, izay nidina avy any an-danitra avy tany amin’andriamanitra.'),
  ('6ab25d011c7378e14edb6976', '2026-09-22T10:48:33.275Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:33.275Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 21, 20, 'ny fahadimy sardoniksa, ny fahenina sardoanina, ny fahafito krizolita, ny fahavalo berila, ny fahasivy topaza, ny fahafolo krizoprazy, ny faha-11 hiasinta, ary ny faha-12 ametista.', 'ny fahadimy sardoniksa, ny fahenina sardoanina, ny fahafito krizolita, ny fahavalo berila, ny fahasivy topaza, ny fahafolo krizoprazy, ny faha-11 hiasinta, ary ny faha-12 ametista.'),
  ('6ab25d011c7378e14edb696a', '2026-09-22T10:48:33.275Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:33.275Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 21, 8, 'Fa ny kanosa, ny tsy manam-pinoana, ny olona maloto sady maharikoriko, ny mpamono olona, ny mpijangajanga, ny mpilalao ody, ny mpanompo sampy, ary ny mpandainga rehetra kosa, dia hatsipy ao amin’ny farihy mirehitra afo sy solifara. Izany dia ny fahafatesana faharoa.”', 'fa ny kanosa, ny tsy manam-pinoana, ny olona maloto sady maharikoriko, ny mpamono olona, ny mpijangajanga, ny mpilalao ody, ny mpanompo sampy, ary ny mpandainga rehetra kosa, dia hatsipy ao amin’ny farihy mirehitra afo sy solifara. izany dia ny fahafatesana faharoa.”'),
  ('6ab25d011c7378e14edb6968', '2026-09-22T10:48:33.275Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:33.275Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 21, 6, 'Hoy ihany izy tamiko: “Efa tanteraka izany! Izaho no Alfa sy Omega, ny fiandohana sy ny fiafarana. Izay mangetaheta dia homeko rano maimaim-poana avy amin’ny loharanon’ny ranon’aina.', 'hoy ihany izy tamiko: “efa tanteraka izany! izaho no alfa sy omega, ny fiandohana sy ny fiafarana. izay mangetaheta dia homeko rano maimaim-poana avy amin’ny loharanon’ny ranon’aina.'),
  ('6ab25d011c7378e14edb697d', '2026-09-22T10:48:33.275Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:33.275Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 21, 27, 'Tsy hiditra ao mihitsy kosa izay zavatra maloto sy izay olona manao zava-maharikoriko sy mamitaka. Fa izay voasoratra ao amin’ny horonam-bokin’ny fiainana, dia ny horonam-bokin’ny Zanak’ondry, ihany no hiditra ao.', 'tsy hiditra ao mihitsy kosa izay zavatra maloto sy izay olona manao zava-maharikoriko sy mamitaka. fa izay voasoratra ao amin’ny horonam-bokin’ny fiainana, dia ny horonam-bokin’ny zanak’ondry, ihany no hiditra ao.'),
  ('6ab25d011c7378e14edb6978', '2026-09-22T10:48:33.275Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:33.275Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 21, 22, 'Tsy nahita tempoly tao aho, fa i Jehovah Andriamanitra, ilay Mahery Indrindra, sy ny Zanak’ondry, no tempolin’ilay tanàna.', 'tsy nahita tempoly tao aho, fa i jehovah andriamanitra, ilay mahery indrindra, sy ny zanak’ondry, no tempolin’ilay tanàna.'),
  ('6ab25d011c7378e14edb6979', '2026-09-22T10:48:33.275Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:33.275Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 21, 23, 'Ary tsy nila ny masoandro na ny volana hanazava azy ilay tanàna, fa ny voninahitr’Andriamanitra no nanazava azy, ary ny Zanak’ondry no jirony.', 'ary tsy nila ny masoandro na ny volana hanazava azy ilay tanàna, fa ny voninahitr’andriamanitra no nanazava azy, ary ny zanak’ondry no jirony.'),
  ('6ab25d011c7378e14edb697a', '2026-09-22T10:48:33.275Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:33.275Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 21, 24, 'Hanazava ny lalana halehan’ireo firenena ny hazavan’ilay tanàna, ary hoentin’ny mpanjakan’ny tany ao ny voninahiny.', 'hanazava ny lalana halehan’ireo firenena ny hazavan’ilay tanàna, ary hoentin’ny mpanjakan’ny tany ao ny voninahiny.'),
  ('6ab25d011c7378e14edb6973', '2026-09-22T10:48:33.275Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:33.275Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 21, 17, 'Norefesiny koa ny mandany, ka 144 hakiho, araka ny fandrefesana fampiasan’ny olona sady fampiasan’ny anjely.', 'norefesiny koa ny mandany, ka 144 hakiho, araka ny fandrefesana fampiasan’ny olona sady fampiasan’ny anjely.'),
  ('6ab25d011c7378e14edb6966', '2026-09-22T10:48:33.275Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:33.275Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 21, 4, 'Dia hofafany ny ranomaso rehetra amin’ny mason’izy ireo, ary tsy hisy intsony ny fahafatesana, sady tsy hisy intsony ny alahelo na ny fitarainana na ny fanaintainana, fa efa lasa ny zavatra taloha.”', 'dia hofafany ny ranomaso rehetra amin’ny mason’izy ireo, ary tsy hisy intsony ny fahafatesana, sady tsy hisy intsony ny alahelo na ny fitarainana na ny fanaintainana, fa efa lasa ny zavatra taloha.”'),
  ('6ab25d011c7378e14edb6969', '2026-09-22T10:48:33.275Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:33.275Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 21, 7, 'Izay mandresy dia handova an’ireo zavatra ireo, ka ho Andriamaniny aho ary izy ho zanako.', 'izay mandresy dia handova an’ireo zavatra ireo, ka ho andriamaniny aho ary izy ho zanako.'),
  ('6ab25d011c7378e14edb6967', '2026-09-22T10:48:33.275Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:33.275Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 21, 5, 'Ary hoy Ilay nipetraka teo ambonin’ny seza fiandrianana: “Ataoko vaovao ny zava-drehetra.” Hoy koa izy: “Soraty fa azo antoka sady marina ireo teny ireo.”', 'ary hoy ilay nipetraka teo ambonin’ny seza fiandrianana: “ataoko vaovao ny zava-drehetra.” hoy koa izy: “soraty fa azo antoka sady marina ireo teny ireo.”'),
  ('6ab25d011c7378e14edb6964', '2026-09-22T10:48:33.275Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:33.275Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 21, 2, 'Hitako nidina avy any an-danitra avy any amin’Andriamanitra koa ilay tanàna masina, dia i Jerosalema Vaovao, ary efa voaomana hoatran’ny ampakarina mihaingo hihaona amin’ny vadiny.', 'hitako nidina avy any an-danitra avy any amin’andriamanitra koa ilay tanàna masina, dia i jerosalema vaovao, ary efa voaomana hoatran’ny ampakarina mihaingo hihaona amin’ny vadiny.'),
  ('6ab25d011c7378e14edb6970', '2026-09-22T10:48:33.275Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:33.275Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 21, 14, 'Nisy vato fototra 12 koa ny mandan’ilay tanàna, ary teo amin’ireo vato ireo ny anarana roa ambin’ny folon’ny apostoly 12, dia ny apostolin’ny Zanak’ondry.', 'nisy vato fototra 12 koa ny mandan’ilay tanàna, ary teo amin’ireo vato ireo ny anarana roa ambin’ny folon’ny apostoly 12, dia ny apostolin’ny zanak’ondry.'),
  ('6ab25d011c7378e14edb6977', '2026-09-22T10:48:33.275Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:33.275Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 21, 21, 'Perla 12 koa ny vavahadiny 12, ka perla iray no nanaovana ny vavahady tsirairay. Ary volamena tsy misy fangarony tahaka ny fitaratra tantera-pahazavana ny lalamben’ilay tanàna.', 'perla 12 koa ny vavahadiny 12, ka perla iray no nanaovana ny vavahady tsirairay. ary volamena tsy misy fangarony tahaka ny fitaratra tantera-pahazavana ny lalamben’ilay tanàna.'),
  ('6ab25d011c7378e14edb697c', '2026-09-22T10:48:33.275Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:33.275Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 21, 26, 'Ary hoentin’izy ireo ao ny voninahitry ny firenena sy ny hajany.', 'ary hoentin’izy ireo ao ny voninahitry ny firenena sy ny hajany.'),
  ('6ab25d011c7378e14edb6974', '2026-09-22T10:48:33.275Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:33.275Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 21, 18, 'Jaspa no nanaovana an’ilay manda, ary volamena tsy misy fangarony tahaka ny fitaratra madio ilay tanàna.', 'jaspa no nanaovana an’ilay manda, ary volamena tsy misy fangarony tahaka ny fitaratra madio ilay tanàna.'),
  ('6ab25d011c7378e14edb696e', '2026-09-22T10:48:33.275Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:33.275Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 21, 12, 'Nisy manda lehibe sady avo sy vavahady 12 izy io. Nisy anjely 12 teo amin’ireo vavahady ireo, ary nosoratana teo ny anaran’ny foko 12 teo amin’ny zanak’Israely.', 'nisy manda lehibe sady avo sy vavahady 12 izy io. nisy anjely 12 teo amin’ireo vavahady ireo, ary nosoratana teo ny anaran’ny foko 12 teo amin’ny zanak’israely.'),
  ('6ab25d011c7378e14edb696d', '2026-09-22T10:48:33.275Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:33.275Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 21, 11, 'Feno ny voninahitr’Andriamanitra izy io, ary hoatran’ny vatosoa faran’izay tsara ny famirapiratany, hoatran’ny vato jaspa mamirapiratra tahaka ny kristaly.', 'feno ny voninahitr’andriamanitra izy io, ary hoatran’ny vatosoa faran’izay tsara ny famirapiratany, hoatran’ny vato jaspa mamirapiratra tahaka ny kristaly.'),
  ('6ab25d011c7378e14edb696b', '2026-09-22T10:48:33.275Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:33.275Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 21, 9, 'Ary tonga ny iray tamin’ireo anjely fito nanana vilia fito feno ny loza fito farany, ka niteny tamiko hoe: “Avia fa hasehoko anao ny ampakarina, ilay vadin’ny Zanak’ondry.”', 'ary tonga ny iray tamin’ireo anjely fito nanana vilia fito feno ny loza fito farany, ka niteny tamiko hoe: “avia fa hasehoko anao ny ampakarina, ilay vadin’ny zanak’ondry.”'),
  ('6ab25d011c7378e14edb6965', '2026-09-22T10:48:33.275Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:33.275Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 21, 3, 'Tamin’izay dia naheno feo mafy avy teo amin’ny seza fiandrianana aho, nanao hoe: “Eo amin’ny olombelona ny tranolain’Andriamanitra, ka ho eo amin’izy ireo izy, dia ho vahoakany ireo. Ary Andriamanitra mihitsy no hiaraka aminy.', 'tamin’izay dia naheno feo mafy avy teo amin’ny seza fiandrianana aho, nanao hoe: “eo amin’ny olombelona ny tranolain’andriamanitra, ka ho eo amin’izy ireo izy, dia ho vahoakany ireo. ary andriamanitra mihitsy no hiaraka aminy.'),
  ('6ab25d011c7378e14edb697b', '2026-09-22T10:48:33.275Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:33.275Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 21, 25, 'Tsy hohidiana mihitsy ny vavahadiny mandritra ny andro, ary tsy hisy alina ao.', 'tsy hohidiana mihitsy ny vavahadiny mandritra ny andro, ary tsy hisy alina ao.'),
  ('6ab25d011c7378e14edb6972', '2026-09-22T10:48:33.275Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:33.275Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 21, 16, 'Efamira ilay tanàna, ka mitovy ny lavany sy ny sakany. Dia norefesiny tamin’ilay bararata ilay tanàna, ka 12 000 stadio, ary mitovy ny lavany sy ny sakany ary ny haavony.', 'efamira ilay tanàna, ka mitovy ny lavany sy ny sakany. dia norefesiny tamin’ilay bararata ilay tanàna, ka 12 000 stadio, ary mitovy ny lavany sy ny sakany ary ny haavony.'),
  ('6ab25d01de55a8c31d66d876', '2026-09-22T10:48:33.772Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:33.772Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 22, 9, 'Hoy anefa izy tamiko: “Tandremo! Aza manao an’izao! Fa mpanompo ihany aho, hoatr’anao sy ny mpaminany rahalahinao, ary hoatran’ireo manaraka ny teny ato amin’ity horonam-boky ity. Andriamanitra no ivavaho.”', 'hoy anefa izy tamiko: “tandremo! aza manao an’izao! fa mpanompo ihany aho, hoatr’anao sy ny mpaminany rahalahinao, ary hoatran’ireo manaraka ny teny ato amin’ity horonam-boky ity. andriamanitra no ivavaho.”'),
  ('6ab25d01de55a8c31d66d872', '2026-09-22T10:48:33.772Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:33.772Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 22, 5, 'Tsy hisy alina intsony koa, ka tsy hila ny hazavan’ny jiro na ny hazavan’ny masoandro izy ireo, satria hanazava azy i Jehovah Andriamanitra. Ary hanjaka mandrakizay mandrakizay izy ireo.', 'tsy hisy alina intsony koa, ka tsy hila ny hazavan’ny jiro na ny hazavan’ny masoandro izy ireo, satria hanazava azy i jehovah andriamanitra. ary hanjaka mandrakizay mandrakizay izy ireo.'),
  ('6ab25d01de55a8c31d66d86e', '2026-09-22T10:48:33.772Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:33.772Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 22, 1, 'Ary nampiseho ahy ny reniranon’ny ranon’aina izy. Madio mangalahala hoatran’ny vato kristaly izy io, sady nikoriana avy teo amin’ny seza fiandrianan’Andriamanitra sy ny Zanak’ondry,', 'ary nampiseho ahy ny reniranon’ny ranon’aina izy. madio mangalahala hoatran’ny vato kristaly izy io, sady nikoriana avy teo amin’ny seza fiandrianan’andriamanitra sy ny zanak’ondry,'),
  ('6ab25d01de55a8c31d66d877', '2026-09-22T10:48:33.772Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:33.772Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 22, 10, 'Hoy koa izy tamiko: “Aza asiana tombo-kase ny tenin’ny faminaniana ato amin’ity horonam-boky ity, fa efa akaiky ny fotoana voatondro.', 'hoy koa izy tamiko: “aza asiana tombo-kase ny tenin’ny faminaniana ato amin’ity horonam-boky ity, fa efa akaiky ny fotoana voatondro.'),
  ('6ab25d01de55a8c31d66d87c', '2026-09-22T10:48:33.772Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:33.772Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 22, 15, 'Any ivelany kosa ny alika, ny mpilalao ody, ny mpijangajanga, ny mpamono olona, ny mpanompo sampy, ary izay tia lainga sy mpandainga.’', 'any ivelany kosa ny alika, ny mpilalao ody, ny mpijangajanga, ny mpamono olona, ny mpanompo sampy, ary izay tia lainga sy mpandainga.’'),
  ('6ab25d01de55a8c31d66d87a', '2026-09-22T10:48:33.772Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:33.772Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 22, 13, 'Izaho no Alfa sy Omega, ny voalohany sy ny farany, ny fiandohana sy ny fiafarana.', 'izaho no alfa sy omega, ny voalohany sy ny farany, ny fiandohana sy ny fiafarana.'),
  ('6ab25d01de55a8c31d66d874', '2026-09-22T10:48:33.772Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:33.772Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 22, 7, 'Ho avy haingana aho. Sambatra izay manaraka ny tenin’ny faminaniana ato amin’ity horonam-boky ity.”', 'ho avy haingana aho. sambatra izay manaraka ny tenin’ny faminaniana ato amin’ity horonam-boky ity.”'),
  ('6ab25d01de55a8c31d66d878', '2026-09-22T10:48:33.772Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:33.772Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 22, 11, 'Izay manao ny tsy marina, dia aoka mbola hanao ny tsy marina ihany. Izay maloto, aoka mbola haloto ihany. Izay olo-marina kosa, aoka hanao ny marina ihany, ary izay masina, aoka mbola ho masina ihany.', 'izay manao ny tsy marina, dia aoka mbola hanao ny tsy marina ihany. izay maloto, aoka mbola haloto ihany. izay olo-marina kosa, aoka hanao ny marina ihany, ary izay masina, aoka mbola ho masina ihany.'),
  ('6ab25d01de55a8c31d66d882', '2026-09-22T10:48:33.772Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:33.772Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 22, 21, 'Enga anie ny olona masina hanehoan’i Jesosy Tompo hatsaram-panahy miavaka!', 'enga anie ny olona masina hanehoan’i jesosy tompo hatsaram-panahy miavaka!'),
  ('6ab25d01de55a8c31d66d87f', '2026-09-22T10:48:33.772Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:33.772Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 22, 18, '“Izao no lazaiko amin’izay rehetra maheno ny tenin’ny faminaniana ato amin’ity horonam-boky ity: Raha misy manampy zavatra amin’ireo, dia hampian’Andriamanitra ny loza hanjo azy, izany hoe ny loza voasoratra ato amin’ity horonam-boky ity.', '“izao no lazaiko amin’izay rehetra maheno ny tenin’ny faminaniana ato amin’ity horonam-boky ity: raha misy manampy zavatra amin’ireo, dia hampian’andriamanitra ny loza hanjo azy, izany hoe ny loza voasoratra ato amin’ity horonam-boky ity.'),
  ('6ab25d01de55a8c31d66d879', '2026-09-22T10:48:33.772Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:33.772Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 22, 12, '“‘Ho avy haingana aho, ary efa vonona aho hamaly ny tsirairay arakaraka izay ataony.', '“‘ho avy haingana aho, ary efa vonona aho hamaly ny tsirairay arakaraka izay ataony.'),
  ('6ab25d01de55a8c31d66d880', '2026-09-22T10:48:33.772Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:33.772Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 22, 19, 'Ary raha misy manala teny ato amin’ity horonam-bokin’ny faminaniana ity, dia hesorin’Andriamanitra ny anjarany amin’ny hazon’aina sy ny tanàna masina, izany hoe izay voasoratra ato amin’ity horonam-boky ity.', 'ary raha misy manala teny ato amin’ity horonam-bokin’ny faminaniana ity, dia hesorin’andriamanitra ny anjarany amin’ny hazon’aina sy ny tanàna masina, izany hoe izay voasoratra ato amin’ity horonam-boky ity.'),
  ('6ab25d01de55a8c31d66d873', '2026-09-22T10:48:33.772Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:33.772Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 22, 6, 'Hoy izy tamiko: “Azo antoka sady marina ireo teny ireo. Ary naniraka ny anjeliny i Jehovah, ilay Andriamanitra miteny amin’ny alalan’ny mpaminany, mba hampiseho amin’ny mpanompony ny zavatra hitranga tsy ho ela.', 'hoy izy tamiko: “azo antoka sady marina ireo teny ireo. ary naniraka ny anjeliny i jehovah, ilay andriamanitra miteny amin’ny alalan’ny mpaminany, mba hampiseho amin’ny mpanompony ny zavatra hitranga tsy ho ela.'),
  ('6ab25d01de55a8c31d66d87d', '2026-09-22T10:48:33.772Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:33.772Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 22, 16, '“‘Izaho Jesosy dia naniraka ny anjeliko hitory momba an’izany aminareo mba hahasoa ny fiangonana. Izaho no faka sy taranak’i Davida, ary izaho koa ilay kintan’ny maraina mamirapiratra.’”', '“‘izaho jesosy dia naniraka ny anjeliko hitory momba an’izany aminareo mba hahasoa ny fiangonana. izaho no faka sy taranak’i davida, ary izaho koa ilay kintan’ny maraina mamirapiratra.’”'),
  ('6ab25d01de55a8c31d66d86f', '2026-09-22T10:48:33.772Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:33.772Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 22, 2, 'teo afovoan’ny lalamben’ilay tanàna. Nisy hazon’aina teo amin’ny andaniny roa amin’ilay renirano, ary namoa in-12 izy ireo, izany hoe namoa isam-bolana. Ary natao hanasitranana ny firenena ny ravin’ireo hazo ireo.', 'teo afovoan’ny lalamben’ilay tanàna. nisy hazon’aina teo amin’ny andaniny roa amin’ilay renirano, ary namoa in-12 izy ireo, izany hoe namoa isam-bolana. ary natao hanasitranana ny firenena ny ravin’ireo hazo ireo.'),
  ('6ab25d01de55a8c31d66d881', '2026-09-22T10:48:33.772Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:33.772Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 22, 20, '“Hoy ilay mijoro ho vavolombelon’ireo zavatra ireo: ‘Eny, ho avy haingana aho.’” “Amena! Avia, Jesosy Tompo ô!”', '“hoy ilay mijoro ho vavolombelon’ireo zavatra ireo: ‘eny, ho avy haingana aho.’” “amena! avia, jesosy tompo ô!”'),
  ('6ab25d01de55a8c31d66d87e', '2026-09-22T10:48:33.772Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:33.772Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 22, 17, 'Miteny tsy an-kijanona ny fanahy sy ny ampakarina hoe: “Avia!” Ary izay maheno, aoka hilaza hoe: “Avia!” Dia aoka ho avy izay mangetaheta. Ary izay maniry, aoka hisotro maimaim-poana amin’ny ranon’aina.', 'miteny tsy an-kijanona ny fanahy sy ny ampakarina hoe: “avia!” ary izay maheno, aoka hilaza hoe: “avia!” dia aoka ho avy izay mangetaheta. ary izay maniry, aoka hisotro maimaim-poana amin’ny ranon’aina.'),
  ('6ab25d01de55a8c31d66d87b', '2026-09-22T10:48:33.772Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:33.772Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 22, 14, 'Sambatra izay manasa ny akanjony, mba ho afaka hankeo amin’ny hazon’aina sy ho afaka hiditra ao amin’ilay tanàna, avy eo amin’ny vavahadiny.', 'sambatra izay manasa ny akanjony, mba ho afaka hankeo amin’ny hazon’aina sy ho afaka hiditra ao amin’ilay tanàna, avy eo amin’ny vavahadiny.'),
  ('6ab25d01de55a8c31d66d875', '2026-09-22T10:48:33.772Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:33.772Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 22, 8, 'Izaho Jaona no naheno sy nahita an’ireo zavatra ireo. Rehefa naheno sy nahita aho, dia niankohoka hivavaka teo an-tongotr’ilay anjely nampiseho an’ireo tamiko.', 'izaho jaona no naheno sy nahita an’ireo zavatra ireo. rehefa naheno sy nahita aho, dia niankohoka hivavaka teo an-tongotr’ilay anjely nampiseho an’ireo tamiko.'),
  ('6ab25d01de55a8c31d66d871', '2026-09-22T10:48:33.772Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:33.772Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 22, 4, 'ka hahita ny tarehiny. Hosoratana eo amin’ny handrin’izy ireo koa ny anaran’Andriamanitra.', 'ka hahita ny tarehiny. hosoratana eo amin’ny handrin’izy ireo koa ny anaran’andriamanitra.'),
  ('6ab25d01de55a8c31d66d870', '2026-09-22T10:48:33.772Z', '2026-09-22T10:48:33.772Z', 'service_e1c00fac-7dab-4d04-875f-a062a5564d93', NULL, 'malagasy', 'Apokalypsy', 66, 22, 3, 'Ary tsy hisy ozona intsony. Fa ho ao amin’ilay tanàna kosa ny seza fiandrianan’Andriamanitra sy ny an’ny Zanak’ondry. Ary hanao fanompoana masina ho an’Andriamanitra ny mpanompony,', 'ary tsy hisy ozona intsony. fa ho ao amin’ilay tanàna kosa ny seza fiandrianan’andriamanitra sy ny an’ny zanak’ondry. ary hanao fanompoana masina ho an’andriamanitra ny mpanompony,');
